{"media_id": 3761369807166980327, "shortcode": "DQzEek5EUDn", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DQzEek5EUDn/", "taken_at": "2025-11-08T13:59:23", "caption": "老板，在公司呢！这样不好吧…完了，好像被老板拿捏了 #女老板 #大反差 #剧情", "owner_username": "nie4464079", "owner_id": "76841349975", "likes": 39999, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0001_DQzEek5EUDn\\DQzEek5EUDn_20251108_135923.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17960488241860951, "text": "我們三個有點曖昧了", "created_at": "2025-11-09T15:48:18", "owner": "rose_10.28", "likes": 550}, {"id": 18086578354788721, "text": "我买什么枕头，或是要用什么睡姿才能梦到这样的梦境🫠", "created_at": "2025-11-09T02:04:54", "owner": "yee.king.5477", "likes": 1094}, {"id": 17935256873981000, "text": "欸 起來了，在不出門要遲到了", "created_at": "2025-11-09T02:36:32", "owner": "twingo_2004", "likes": 371}, {"id": 17899513188316823, "text": "好了，哥布林跟我回山洞了", "created_at": "2025-11-09T12:35:36", "owner": "dinggo_fang", "likes": 111}, {"id": 18057831089540661, "text": "放心吧 老板要是去夜店 带男模走也不会跟你走的 😉", "created_at": "2025-11-10T05:52:57", "owner": "tyler50513", "likes": 118}, {"id": 18030949520753974, "text": "有点像河北彩花😍", "created_at": "2025-11-09T03:52:37", "owner": "yyang2605", "likes": 28}, {"id": 17989363460900224, "text": "😍❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-09T22:49:00", "owner": "kongsoon80", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17863210044524494, "text": "@2000.3.24 為什麼按❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-16T16:48:41", "owner": "ck9210_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074503520462495, "text": "銀幕前的你 你在笑什麼？", "created_at": "2025-11-09T08:45:08", "owner": "_04_12_4", "likes": 60}, {"id": 18098919976809579, "text": "各位愛卿近來如何？朕回來了", "created_at": "2025-11-10T09:02:35", "owner": "ares_wyh_8.11", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17843399637619082, "text": "抖音号是什么？", "created_at": "2025-11-20T14:51:25", "owner": "sebas.tyz", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18046594490428262, "text": "什麼牌子的枕頭夢得到", "created_at": "2025-11-10T07:20:01", "owner": "1zynxx", "likes": 21}, {"id": 18122913436510055, "text": "有夢最美", "created_at": "2025-11-09T05: