es": 0}, {"id": 18028005635746630, "text": "外面的世界很危险，哥布林快点回山洞吧😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T00:56:40", "owner": "shinlek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859546819478647, "text": "國產劇情還是太超標了😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T13:26:38", "owner": "yifu0759", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18534243781012691, "text": "上了就可以做董事长了😂", "created_at": "2025-11-14T12:36:14", "owner": "yao_chang89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18549009268046794, "text": "什枕能夢", "created_at": "2025-11-14T10:38:19", "owner": "wanzhi_91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115247314499464, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-13T01:47:41", "owner": "bryan.xd.chen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023906252781436, "text": "我是土狗我爱看", "created_at": "2025-11-12T13:58:09", "owner": "qiutiano.o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047613467404967, "text": "?", "created_at": "2025-11-12T02:31:54", "owner": "howard.li.2021", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021324593602574, "text": "習主席看了都要當場打飛機", "created_at": "2025-11-11T16:11:28", "owner": "zimingwen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082737869100983, "text": "老闆你最近變胖了😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-11T10:46:57", "owner": "sshenghuang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969130590972338, "text": "東北輕工業", "created_at": "2025-11-11T00:00:06", "owner": "m.bh.fung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320586427174287, "text": "臉頰忽大忽小", "created_at": "2025-11-10T12:14:22", "owner": "zong._.1230", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883681939288807, "text": "夢醒就好了\n老闆？長這樣輪不到你", "created_at": "2025-11-10T10:19:46", "owner": "timorayalven", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032151542720933, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-10T06:00:43", "owner": "wudishiduoduomojimo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055548899644195, "text": "羡慕嫉妒恨", "created_at": "2025-11-10T01:42:11", "owner": "koay_97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081820036841795, "text": "現在開始宣判", "created_at": "2025-11-10T00:24:32", "owner": "rhrh.69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539834929039827, "text": "枕頭哪裡買給個連結吧...🫠", "created_at": "2025-11-09T23:18:01", "owner": "kevir627", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920398780055129, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-09T21:20:01", "owner": "jnt_1717", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066576665383329, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-09T19:47:19", "owner": "paulomatheus552", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094645873836439, "text": "等你", "created_at": "2025-11-09T19:30:35", "owner": "justinpiau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540154972003422, "text": "又丑又骚", "created_at": "2025-11-09T13:16:59", "owner": "mr.z4072", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18373920406157180, "text": "😍😍😍😍😍❤️❤️❤️\n這工作這老闆真美啊", "created_at": "2025-11-09T10:09:12", "owner": "cch7955714", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094008916856918, "text": "Vr眼睛吗😂", "created_at": "2025-11-09T07:38:41", "owner": "19jimmy92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18350606893165226, "text": "夢裡什麼都有", "created_at": "2025-11-09T06:22:33", "owner": "qazwsxedc52545", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159604021392701, "text": "😍😍😍😍🔥🔥🔥🔥❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-09T00:10:12", "owner": "jt99755", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["女老板", "大反差", "剧情"]},
{"media_id": 3757673288332884242, "shortcode": "DQl7_JdDjkS", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DQl7_JdDjkS/", "taken_at": "2025-11-03T11:38:03", "caption": "Who’s the hottest? \n#chinese #threekingdoms #china #learnchinese #中文", "owner_username": "mayinbeijing", "owner_id": "207586204", "likes": 3564, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0002_DQl7_JdDjkS\\DQl7_JdDjkS_20251103_113803.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18083478331999959, "text": "姜文呢？", "created_at": "2025-11-03T16:56:39", "owner": "shakalakavroom", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18553011277043346, "text": "王嘉尔！ 同意！", "created_at": "2025-11-03T11:42:49", "owner": "__daniellejane", "likes": 51}, {"id": 18093468724870305, "text": "我还是喜欢脸", "created_at": "2025-11-03T13:16:31", "owner": "rrrrrrong5", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18092631970855838, "text": "You are so creative.  The historical heroes are brought to life by you. 👏", "created_at": "2025-11-03T14:56:58", "owner": "netinsta16", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18024786164769750, "text": "中国帅哥在外国也是帅哥。因为韩流gen z 女孩想法和你不一样。你这种老一辈女人观点已经过时了。国外也不是只有美国。众所周知美国是刻意打压亚洲男性的国家，好莱坞里面没一个正面角色 🤦‍♀️ 全球其他地方，东欧，中东，南美, 花美男的形象非常受欢迎", "created_at": "2025-11-05T06:39:05", "owner": "cara.josephine1", "likes": 91}, {"id": 18162076609385166, "text": "现在韩流是世界的", "created_at": "2025-11-03T12:34:19", "owner": "mariachi0576", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17997497414850190, "text": "活了这么久，第一次听见外国人普通话比我还标准的", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:52:35", "owner": "fuhuani_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999641406683233, "text": "审美确实每个人都不一样🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-04T01:17:32", "owner": "love_lovejoey", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18333016138228661, "text": "她说的这些都有一个共同点：脸好看😂", "created_at": "2025-11-07T18:54:36", "owner": "mortal23321", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18115384879493665, "text": "哇，中文真好，你老公一定是爱老婆型", "created_at": "2025-11-04T05:22:30", "owner": "xiezidechiqu8", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063110615137137, "text": "你老公刘备型+偶尔小小诸葛亮型", "created_at": "2025-11-03T15:54:35", "owner": "zhangchi6724", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17986680086880269, "text": "美国女的喜欢长的高的 6‘3 1米9这种", "created_at": "2025-11-04T10:43:38", "owner": "bohan1995", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18061119608171032, "text": "你中文说的也太好了吧，闭眼中国人的级别", "created_at": "2025-11-07T14:40:58", "owner": "roseiyou418", "likes": 30}, {"id": 18085596896478825, "text": "你这个中文说的比我还好😂", "created_at": "2025-11-06T00:12:30", "owner": "jixiaodida", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18089373875495563, "text": "普通话比我还biao zhun", "created_at": "2025-11-07T18:32:09", "owner": "xzeng0189", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18534033610021106, "text": "I thought you were Lebanese for some reason", "created_at": "2025-11-04T01:04:30", "owner": "zaza.renaud", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18153742810408597, "text": "等等 是谁在说话？", "created_at": "2025-11-09T20:15:41", "owner": "sukkkkkk17", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18101902015638981, "text": "What is the AI app you are using to change your speech from English to Chinese instantly?", "created_at": "2025-11-03T17:53:39", "owner": "finestrasulmare0", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18117609163552903, "text": "Your husband is the smart guy.. you fall in love daily with his mind.. you're never bored.. perhaps sometimes a bit lonely because he's deep in thought about work.. correct? Intelligence has its own aura.. one that stand the test of time. 🫶🏼🕊️🦋", "created_at": "2025-11-03T12:21:51", "owner": "respectblackdivinity", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17995958978838648, "text": "A guy like me", "created_at": "2025-11-04T02:22:20", "owner": "charles168x", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18128686492496950, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-06T17:41:29", "owner": "tonytong0219", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18548784928013846, "text": "不同意", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:53:59", "owner": "dacheng_guitar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063133358387257, "text": "All the girls are same in the world", "created_at": "2025-11-10T14:11:47", "owner": "aaairo_g", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18338714428235337, "text": "不是我说你啊老妹 你是不是有点太了解了？😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-03T12:26:06", "owner": "wujian1990", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17866330404475350, "text": "硬汉类型", "created_at": "2025-11-04T02:42:22", "owner": "robert904936", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18294217690259952, "text": "外国男人喜欢东方女人，看看外国的顶级富豪Meta媒体巨头皇室身边的女人是什么就知道了。无论是从外貌上还是从文化传统上外国的男人都更喜欢东方的女人，所以中国的女人出国后基本上是站在食物链顶端的外国的女人不喜欢中国的男人，因为外国的女人整体上喜欢力量型的男人，直接就是猛男，中国男人在这方面明显弱于外国男人", "created_at": "2025-11-08T10:23:06", "owner": "orangepeelverynice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895195636361448, "text": "😢😢😢很难在看到这样的美国女生了", "created_at": "2025-12-11T10:27:59", "owner": "qiong21333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850216891573941, "text": "中文好成这样……太惊讶了😢", "created_at": "2025-12-11T08:37:44", "owner": "felix_heli99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153947845416988, "text": "祖国人关羽可以吗", "created_at": "2025-12-10T19:27:46", "owner": "connor.sese", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087077723000668, "text": "可能会分年龄段", "created_at": "2025-12-09T07:35:19", "owner": "zimo1618", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075400997190939, "text": "你这说的不是外表吧😂，三国武将没有细狗全是彪形大汉", "created_at": "2025-12-08T21:56:34", "owner": "qq143153", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077462609519014, "text": "我温柔没肌肉的能行吗😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:38:32", "owner": "starbinsherry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106629250568885, "text": "Please forgive my abruptness. I want to ask if you would be willing to marry me and become a family with me. If you are willing, we can try to get to know each other. If not, I will not bother you anymore.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:05:40", "owner": "qq1461362", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974928723952356, "text": "我還以為是劉備、曹操、孫權", "created_at": "2025-12-06T14:44:00", "owner": "k.hayashi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547428961050727, "text": "我喜欢你❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-06T05:33:42", "owner": "wsl_onki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950796913054759, "text": "It’s very hard to find the other man looks like 胡歌", "created_at": "2025-12-06T04:28:35", "owner": "haxuzhao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877907773441675, "text": "Chinese is better than me.😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T23:26:48", "owner": "su520china", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078812132187901, "text": "我去，你的普通话比我还好~", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:11:42", "owner": "lrq2006626", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962404380861524, "text": "fnmgp", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:06:17", "owner": "gestineeg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096457288893424, "text": "算命的說我的老婆會是歐美人🤣,我是第三類吧我有很多想做的事情，也有很多創意我覺得我該去試試", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:07:10", "owner": "cv_01_14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075776828349188, "text": "Do foreign girls look down upon poor boys?", "created_at": "2025-12-01T18:12:28", "owner": "xiongxiong763", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110423872620114, "text": "你们知道的内娱明星还是太少了😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:41:25", "owner": "miaaa020219", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074455721247083, "text": "你的中文也太棒了吧", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:01:27", "owner": "zjy6088", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086021915064198, "text": "你中文这么好？！", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:31:14", "owner": "jetalyoung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098052799629021, "text": "放你的狗屁，不喜欢小奶狗喜欢你啊", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:46:16", "owner": "fz6114651", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864677773516045, "text": "It's the same with Chinese girls  All these male are loved by Chinese female", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:35:47", "owner": "neilcrystal520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842636026623258, "text": "I’m Chinese I want to find an American girlfriend", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:38:09", "owner": "wang_rui2005", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985454157756612, "text": "彭于晏是台灣人，望周知", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:51:46", "owner": "yousukejk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18231129877305298, "text": "那秦彻呢倒数第二种吗", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:07:10", "owner": "caoyuxiaoyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071484875593934, "text": "举的例子基本都是错的。。。。。", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:35:04", "owner": "jectchen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904640824287208, "text": "赵云呢 这可是十全十美啊", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:26:37", "owner": "zhaojiayi805", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085937186292938, "text": "🩵💙", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:08:26", "owner": "nakakakga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079650602172990, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:31:43", "owner": "liliangliang736", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854958994575326, "text": "刘能是不是找不到外国女生了", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:42:20", "owner": "kobe9289", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873604066451626, "text": "我去，最后一句是重点😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:19:23", "owner": "flying_cloud_horse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079529822227695, "text": "沈腾呢？😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:18:32", "owner": "flying_cloud_horse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087378028799345, "text": "我猜你还没有老公", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:45:45", "owner": "willemwenbin35", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121114684535893, "text": "中国女人现在基本都喜欢娘炮型的😂所以男人都开始变得和娘们一样", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:52:05", "owner": "0916qiang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867707182491741, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:57:31", "owner": "michael007ceo8888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087786835792965, "text": "高富帥類型", "created_at": "2025-11-24T08:11:57", "owner": "jasonlee1090", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029895323554084, "text": "哈哈哈，对那些三国人物没有感觉；男明星们嘛，性格不重要，共同点就是帅呀", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:19:49", "owner": "laprofesol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18207949837314554, "text": "我的天呐！说句题外话，你的中文太牛了👍🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:45:57", "owner": "chenzhao_mandarin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078736886137969, "text": "我覺得要先遇到美國女孩吧 有點困難", "created_at": "2025-11-23T13:24:59", "owner": "son_bo_7475", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916988068217874, "text": "说了一百圈，就是帅的像我一样呗。", "created_at": "2025-11-23T02:39:57", "owner": "waynechyi1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936075373116556, "text": "或许我是刘备型，但我想成为关羽😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T01:39:26", "owner": "barbojanes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899692648182938, "text": "What about a mix of intelligence and bad boy", "created_at": "2025-11-23T01:01:22", "owner": "will_learning_about_life", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18196842205324679, "text": "其實你說的小鮮肉在國內也並不是很受歡迎，受眾群體多為中學生和高中生，尤其是女生。", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:48:32", "owner": "c_elibate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083036192118834, "text": "确定你说的？", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:56:35", "owner": "jason280208", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120828085473031, "text": "那圆脸络腮胡穿白袜子的胖男人呢 喜欢吗😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T21:45:24", "owner": "emilejr92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057851369301730, "text": "我认识一个 他老婆是西班牙女人 特别强势有点像纳粹那种 他就是性格特别温和的才能相处", "created_at": "2025-11-21T21:42:36", "owner": "emilejr92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917172514213055, "text": "没一个类型符合，要求不低", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:59:00", "owner": "jasonliu6987", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889174237385043, "text": "結果還不是于晏🤭 怎麼不拿彥祖出來😂？", "created_at": "2025-11-21T14:49:30", "owner": "evanwong17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18382541011197643, "text": "好想找外国女孩儿啊", "created_at": "2025-11-21T14:07:42", "owner": "licoolzy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337777888227926, "text": "确实", "created_at": "2025-11-20T17:03:10", "owner": "ian.eledran", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073498871192038, "text": "陈道明是Dad级别的", "created_at": "2025-11-20T16:14:14", "owner": "lu66_66_66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071679683603430, "text": "我丢，你中文比我都好", "created_at": "2025-11-20T08:15:03", "owner": "happy19990202", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915105862218143, "text": "破马张飞型", "created_at": "2025-11-20T08:06:01", "owner": "xjgt2013", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103287400658853, "text": "刘备真不行❌太假了我感觉还不如阿满", "created_at": "2025-11-20T06:29:57", "owner": "liguoting2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142799527427859, "text": "劉備會丟小孩拋棄老婆喔😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T14:45:28", "owner": "hsiu8027", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047315216433233, "text": "👽吗", "created_at": "2025-11-19T14:14:25", "owner": "michaeljiang199x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117940387489519, "text": "有没有外国女孩子想交个朋友", "created_at": "2025-11-19T13:50:09", "owner": "zhanghuidong79", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104911288650852, "text": "How about 吕布", "created_at": "2025-11-19T03:33:16", "owner": "jimmypengxing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930015367117215, "text": "女生真复杂，男生就喜欢好看的", "created_at": "2025-11-19T02:02:48", "owner": "mikecmikecc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133356553486814, "text": "中文这么好", "created_at": "2025-11-18T12:55:35", "owner": "hotel.furniture", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985761123751266, "text": "你老公肯定是董卓类型", "created_at": "2025-11-18T00:01:01", "owner": "minibaobaopanda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928704058141370, "text": "都是被韩国娘炮带偏了，80后看见这些娘炮就恶心", "created_at": "2025-11-17T16:50:54", "owner": "lifei568888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894731716357037, "text": "bts那种属于什么？", "created_at": "2025-11-17T16:14:55", "owner": "garrisonshaw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146763118434181, "text": "审美和我差不多", "created_at": "2025-11-17T13:32:53", "owner": "zuo0415", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18413897872142767, "text": "那个正常的女生会喜欢娘炮？", "created_at": "2025-11-16T22:09:03", "owner": "kings_44944", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023933450592745, "text": "anything in common between guanyu and wang??", "created_at": "2025-11-16T17:05:22", "owner": "pandaho678", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982591314869300, "text": "你老公是混合型，都占", "created_at": "2025-11-16T16:28:01", "owner": "benelvin520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028920164773320, "text": "你老公给你舔过比吗", "created_at": "2025-11-16T13:34:13", "owner": "dajibacom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842847292615160, "text": "肌肉发达的壮汉", "created_at": "2025-11-16T11:15:35", "owner": "eleenikas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18194714437325400, "text": "Beards is a tough ask", "created_at": "2025-11-16T03:45:49", "owner": "cguan284", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081055988278688, "text": "那为什么很多女生喜欢kpop", "created_at": "2025-11-15T22:43:49", "owner": "inggjajk2739", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046536902453597, "text": "我明白了，美国人不喜欢赵云🙃", "created_at": "2025-11-15T17:58:43", "owner": "kai.liao.1671", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990370281855533, "text": "同意", "created_at": "2025-11-15T09:08:31", "owner": "h15554031212", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085948564816745, "text": "姐你举的这几个栗子没有那些特质 都是公认帅哥", "created_at": "2025-11-15T06:08:58", "owner": "lifeistowonder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058671593262719, "text": "脑子是没那么够用了，走身体强壮路线吧，内含什么的….哎…", "created_at": "2025-11-14T20:49:17", "owner": "hyj49863", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943075951081603, "text": "我丁真珍珠呢，纯野性美", "created_at": "2025-11-14T13:38:56", "owner": "miaowachongzi63", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065207159617986, "text": "你老公说我这种类型", "created_at": "2025-11-14T12:06:20", "owner": "g10.material.yuan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958004145875400, "text": "你普通话比我好", "created_at": "2025-11-14T10:25:08", "owner": "riosunday51", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856919041556918, "text": "前提是都不丑哈", "created_at": "2025-11-13T23:17:05", "owner": "hassan.fl76", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935356824986085, "text": "😂有没有喜欢董卓类型的", "created_at": "2025-11-13T13:02:14", "owner": "kin130921", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103922194634808, "text": "普通话比我说的还好", "created_at": "2025-11-12T13:14:30", "owner": "jiaogeshiyaohaoni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376168429159474, "text": "这中文太好了吧", "created_at": "2025-11-12T11:46:04", "owner": "sanlang67_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895838935347854, "text": "Cool", "created_at": "2025-11-11T21:35:49", "owner": "z.hhyczz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18348194761204657, "text": "这个中文太好了吧😮", "created_at": "2025-11-11T17:38:41", "owner": "liyiyirico", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982668951914294, "text": "中文比我還好", "created_at": "2025-11-11T15:46:46", "owner": "shingadelic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880003084422812, "text": "趙子龍一身是膽", "created_at": "2025-11-11T15:32:11", "owner": "hide_0l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071828648027431, "text": "我是哪一種", "created_at": "2025-11-11T12:52:05", "owner": "coach____leon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948397182917671, "text": "其实当时历史中的诸葛亮面冠如玉，丰神俊朗", "created_at": "2025-11-11T10:17:22", "owner": "treason192025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068793842609268, "text": "張飛：俺也一樣", "created_at": "2025-11-11T05:15:33", "owner": "lee_rili", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070487297347502, "text": "陈道明。。。", "created_at": "2025-11-11T02:35:29", "owner": "noctambuloh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012434930799016, "text": "你说这些不都是小奶狗吗 🥲", "created_at": "2025-11-11T01:09:22", "owner": "dreamy_lilan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073069048992782, "text": "我是董卓型", "created_at": "2025-11-10T23:45:05", "owner": "user_5784489007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956862942881205, "text": "💨", "created_at": "2025-11-10T15:19:41", "owner": "jwkckznf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001200647831861, "text": "经济加脸，就这么简单", "created_at": "2025-11-10T14:06:37", "owner": "mark____mendoza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860758978536353, "text": "不是三國型\n這是蜀國型", "created_at": "2025-11-10T10:01:22", "owner": "fallingstar0229", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087932398936438, "text": "劉備說： 曹操如果敢打我，我就！自刎歸天！", "created_at": "2025-11-10T06:23:04", "owner": "spicylowang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100109482667570, "text": "刘备，刘邦，女人如衣服👚", "created_at": "2025-11-10T02:53:22", "owner": "dingshan1994", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18210933490312555, "text": "王凱彭于晏", "created_at": "2025-11-10T02:24:11", "owner": "sujianzai_2026", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976095237941269, "text": "盲猜你老公是中国人😂", "created_at": "2025-11-10T00:04:27", "owner": "vivianxu2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18188150869341195, "text": "哇可惜了 我是曹操型", "created_at": "2025-11-09T18:42:04", "owner": "schrodinger_huang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975402189951739, "text": "比我说的都顺溜⊙∀⊙！", "created_at": "2025-11-09T13:51:27", "owner": "wangjun3320", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083369306015263, "text": "帥、溫柔、有才華、聰明，為什麼不選周瑜? 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-09T09:16:03", "owner": "lewis1123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049676204361269, "text": "有胡子 这个很重要", "created_at": "2025-11-09T06:18:37", "owner": "carrym1120", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134625679463792, "text": "有人喜欢我吗😭", "created_at": "2025-11-09T05:44:13", "owner": "2118996368bbk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160119364358216, "text": "彭于晏😍", "created_at": "2025-11-09T01:31:46", "owner": "2528734337wzr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883369099406955, "text": "王嘉爾盡然屬於關公區塊", "created_at": "2025-11-08T22:56:03", "owner": "timorayalven", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062503562629479, "text": "我呢", "created_at": "2025-11-08T22:12:37", "owner": "qiangzi1933", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939245179094618, "text": "總之！非常上頭‧‧‧", "created_at": "2025-11-08T18:48:22", "owner": "romanx_7651", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106267462615930, "text": "你也知道中国舆论的压力😂", "created_at": "2025-11-08T18:28:55", "owner": "longtang1862", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988905834888692, "text": "0口音的中文👏好厉害", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:27:08", "owner": "gongjin598", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966562974988991, "text": "我也喜欢😍", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:02:47", "owner": "shendhkm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18425642884106482, "text": "好了，我終於知道為什麼我爆火了😂", "created_at": "2025-11-08T14:14:34", "owner": "yokaitei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876862954431851, "text": "尺寸不对 咋喜欢😂", "created_at": "2025-11-08T13:28:32", "owner": "buffettjun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086496676785809, "text": "你说的这些都是小奶狗爱豆吧😅", "created_at": "2025-11-08T09:55:01", "owner": "not_nyx.xx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103472413565099, "text": "They are all taller than 6 foot 1 😒", "created_at": "2025-11-08T09:38:41", "owner": "colinhung6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18365544853080372, "text": "接触好几个国家的女孩，很多女孩喜欢王嘉尔", "created_at": "2025-11-08T09:16:39", "owner": "lx729906", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088365040928645, "text": "The 4th type is your husband??!", "created_at": "2025-11-08T07:29:22", "owner": "13katekate13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962905122995121, "text": "那美国男生都喜欢什么样的中国男生？😢", "created_at": "2025-11-08T04:02:24", "owner": "marcus_zhang77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861865588519072, "text": "你说的还不是一群奶狗😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-07T13:15:55", "owner": "liuxingyu91041", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068922002062639, "text": "李小龙类型的呢？", "created_at": "2025-11-07T12:34:12", "owner": "91share_ceo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545538850043012, "text": "你扯蛋方面很中国！", "created_at": "2025-11-07T11:23:52", "owner": "st.one6741", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097304356775843, "text": "All of these Asian celebrities you showed are the same. They are all exquisite idols.", "created_at": "2025-11-07T06:49:05", "owner": "imtruepeterli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057567059264900, "text": "都是娘炮", "created_at": "2025-11-07T01:35:48", "owner": "annimal2004", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025710743766499, "text": "不要把肖戰拉進來，不是他不帥，只是他不屬於這類型😂", "created_at": "2025-11-07T00:39:27", "owner": "tamk.az", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085551724781998, "text": "不吃香的精緻小奶狗有沒有例子", "created_at": "2025-11-06T23:24:23", "owner": "saruru_lin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976507602937215, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-06T22:21:33", "owner": "torres_hsu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100882900581660, "text": "大黑人", "created_at": "2025-11-06T20:45:31", "owner": "simonlin333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989248548896485, "text": "How come she knows that well about Chinese culture👏", "created_at": "2025-11-06T15:26:38", "owner": "guanzachary", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063181013618891, "text": "真相是基本不会找亚裔", "created_at": "2025-11-06T12:07:33", "owner": "johnliu994", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144170338433730, "text": "@1mkeiii_ 我寻思bjtxz都是奶的啊", "created_at": "2025-11-06T11:53:30", "owner": "amberrrrr_www", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923893969038127, "text": "在线找女友❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-06T08:35:46", "owner": "egometa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972601836955797, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-11-06T06:52:10", "owner": "zeno__b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049046855380258, "text": "曹操型在哪？", "created_at": "2025-11-06T05:29:34", "owner": "puuuu0706", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18509654812069616, "text": "关了画面我以为你是电视台主持人。。。这中文也太字正腔圆了😮", "created_at": "2025-11-06T04:36:35", "owner": "heqing.ma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952720701902019, "text": "Women like men who look like Chinese celebrities. Yeah, you are so intelligent", "created_at": "2025-11-06T02:17:14", "owner": "rockyrrr687", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092820019896248, "text": "王嘉尔同意😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-05T23:54:28", "owner": "ting.ting2335", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18415450099116493, "text": "精致小奶狗、亞洲人大多数都喜欢她娘爷们、不夠娘没看不上眼、頭前還要有一撮毛才行 !!!", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:52:59", "owner": "neff67899", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084651773065319, "text": "You're born in china, for sure.", "created_at": "2025-11-05T19:54:58", "owner": "aquafresca_off", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928436137144692, "text": "这个中文是母语级别的啊😮", "created_at": "2025-11-05T19:51:18", "owner": "bibi831218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894810895346940, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-05T19:11:46", "owner": "bo1lo4jau4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078821426142535, "text": "那趙雲呢？ Number one babysitter, 會不會是女生最愛的Daddy MVP 😉🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-05T19:00:28", "owner": "skyjutsu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18191652118327711, "text": "沒有女生喜歡我這種風格的男孩😢", "created_at": "2025-11-05T18:26:27", "owner": "georgelindemann2001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081064261876803, "text": "我是猴子型", "created_at": "2025-11-05T18:25:06", "owner": "how__when", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085991587981192, "text": "??????你是不是对三国有什么误解😂", "created_at": "2025-11-05T16:18:11", "owner": "vzszszs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923474896080392, "text": "你把我們人妻終結者，曹操曹丞相放哪啦，寧願愛你一個人也願負天下人", "created_at": "2025-11-05T15:34:22", "owner": "zimmerv7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938768947093571, "text": "吴彦祖", "created_at": "2025-11-05T15:21:13", "owner": "lil0651", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048662882355674, "text": "没有曹操型？", "created_at": "2025-11-05T13:40:40", "owner": "aiqi.ang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893771416353559, "text": "你老公是天蓬元帅😂🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-05T11:26:36", "owner": "wuyoufeng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081967352071357, "text": "刘备系：两耳垂肩，双臂过膝", "created_at": "2025-11-05T11:17:56", "owner": "bjshdqwy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970764324967997, "text": "？白敬亭不就是小奶狗", "created_at": "2025-11-05T11:08:30", "owner": "vampynicoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078981386124910, "text": "我猜你老公是最后一类智慧男", "created_at": "2025-11-05T11:07:10", "owner": "joiedemavie330", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085764575068072, "text": "很喜欢你的坦白", "created_at": "2025-11-05T11:03:51", "owner": "peipei9481", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024989984578974, "text": "小姐姐你分析等我太好了🥹我在北美我只能说我对刘备和关羽这两类型的男人上头👏🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-05T11:03:50", "owner": "joiedemavie330", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880158412413304, "text": "Your mandarin perfect…..", "created_at": "2025-11-05T10:11:45", "owner": "zhanglei859", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118391461552003, "text": "但还是要帅🫠", "created_at": "2025-11-05T09:52:17", "owner": "ming52124", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988725963906401, "text": "三国板帅哥😂 曹操必须是player type", "created_at": "2025-11-05T08:49:52", "owner": "weinowei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117646036527089, "text": "阿拉伯女生就阿拉伯女生，還美國女生", "created_at": "2025-11-05T08:22:58", "owner": "forrestpai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117855319477112, "text": "我", "created_at": "2025-11-05T07:13:17", "owner": "tonywu_5955", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111322075507464, "text": "赵子龙 按钮 ——————————>", "created_at": "2025-11-05T06:49:37", "owner": "antisocialsocialisclub", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18168329272331942, "text": "男にとって、金持ちであることはハンサムであることよりも大切だ。", "created_at": "2025-11-05T04:26:03", "owner": "xiaohuang5321", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18509691658069721, "text": "这个视频下怎么没有国女来贬低国男了😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-05T03:44:28", "owner": "maotaotaog", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045144506447495, "text": "我男的都喜欢这四种类型的 小奶狗在我们国内也就未成年女孩子喜欢罢了", "created_at": "2025-11-05T03:14:37", "owner": "pqc452", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999952497683666, "text": "这稿怎么感觉是中国人写的", "created_at": "2025-11-05T02:57:39", "owner": "qh_masterofnone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084852931949401, "text": "脸长得帅一切都不必多言", "created_at": "2025-11-05T02:30:54", "owner": "haop.leee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117799777537301, "text": "安志杰", "created_at": "2025-11-05T01:21:58", "owner": "vking395", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066097775611560, "text": "这些也是亚洲女子喜欢的类型啊，\n小奶狗只有Gay 喜欢", "created_at": "2025-11-05T01:07:09", "owner": "mr.try.st27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18379407994145488, "text": "你是真厉害啊，年轻版的谢霆锋都出来了", "created_at": "2025-11-04T20:49:53", "owner": "linzhiwei8023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060643739539696, "text": "刘备结了好多次婚，而且每次在危难之际都把老婆给弄没了😍", "created_at": "2025-11-04T20:30:02", "owner": "woomileswoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004618313818809, "text": "...", "created_at": "2025-11-04T19:42:17", "owner": "nikb674", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060612215535541, "text": "你喜欢什么样的中国男生，可以介绍给你认识", "created_at": "2025-11-04T19:34:34", "owner": "sha227200", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003395396669794, "text": "Wow, I know she’s describing archetypes, but that’s the equivalent of us describing that our type is Ana De Armas cosplaying as Wonder Woman waiting in our bedrooms. Very idealistic and unattainable. The characters in 3 kingdoms are literally mythological deities. Every girl wants the edge, charisma of billionaire Iron man who won’t cheat on them like Captain America", "created_at": "2025-11-04T19:08:51", "owner": "thestatusguo718", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077566073171150, "text": "我124都有", "created_at": "2025-11-04T17:18:10", "owner": "sam2020998", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045207389438100, "text": "刘备就是你只要受委屈了他就敢摔阿斗", "created_at": "2025-11-04T16:32:02", "owner": "crazy_dave_4321", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103050064634296, "text": "相对比较理性些 中国年轻女孩 很多基本都偏病态 基本受社交媒体影响较多 稍微成熟点女性 稍微好些 但也还不到哪里去 还得看个人 有脑子的 相对理性些的 会正常些", "created_at": "2025-11-04T14:32:30", "owner": "johnniev555", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070719761198134, "text": "全喜欢蜀系啊？", "created_at": "2025-11-04T14:16:15", "owner": "viveremucho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890153107363487, "text": "吴磊～我磊子哥也很不错～", "created_at": "2025-11-04T13:10:26", "owner": "kimmy__hi__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079624013121814, "text": "你跟我說胡歌不靠外表……….，😱😨", "created_at": "2025-11-04T12:20:03", "owner": "ryu160549", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044179931474099, "text": "How does she pronounce the words so well, I thought it was a native at first", "created_at": "2025-11-04T12:07:28", "owner": "stephen_fan01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941637757084885, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-11-04T08:48:32", "owner": "181nga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069551384369765, "text": "真的，她说得太快了，跟机器人一样！没有人说得这么快。你们觉得呢？还是她本来是\"normal\"，然后用什么软件把语速加快了？", "created_at": "2025-11-04T06:29:42", "owner": "finestrasulmare0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18191521723334525, "text": "你說的基本上都是所有女人喜歡男人的共同點，其實和美籍女人和美籍外的女人沒甚麼分別。美籍女性有拜金女，中國女也一樣。", "created_at": "2025-11-04T06:02:39", "owner": "jian_ren", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095769112691485, "text": "曹操😂", "created_at": "2025-11-04T04:40:27", "owner": "art.no.007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102512257655701, "text": "What? Wang Jia…？", "created_at": "2025-11-04T03:41:19", "owner": "_linxiong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092555371841976, "text": "how do you have a Shanghai accent and a Beijing accent at the same time 😢it’s hot tho 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-04T03:38:42", "owner": "gracegky04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963348555998642, "text": "居然结婚了！", "created_at": "2025-11-04T03:11:19", "owner": "guan0000_2018", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903600997277814, "text": "哇你中文好的第一句我以为ai", "created_at": "2025-11-04T02:24:21", "owner": "ilaria_ran", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085254089311247, "text": "张飞", "created_at": "2025-11-04T02:22:16", "owner": "karhwang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101438341640914, "text": "曾经短暂用过tender，匹配成功的不多，总结下来基本都是喜欢薄肌身材好的韩系的那种", "created_at": "2025-11-04T01:52:56", "owner": "yingzhanghhh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046560074416626, "text": "先不管她们喜欢什么样的，我tm就喜欢你这样的！❤️🔥😘", "created_at": "2025-11-04T01:50:05", "owner": "do.you.know.the_wei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898239325182506, "text": "damn，作为marvel里的Wong型，发现原来是宇宙错了", "created_at": "2025-11-04T00:57:57", "owner": "jacksong04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008138051799658, "text": "我不能够信这个, 这个不是外国女生, 她却评论外国女生的审美, 明明是个中国人，但却有着老外的外表", "created_at": "2025-11-04T00:18:11", "owner": "curtiscavalier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18186646909339737, "text": "曹操 not on your list?", "created_at": "2025-11-04T00:17:02", "owner": "calvinheng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971826492959071, "text": "诸葛亮-刘宇宁", "created_at": "2025-11-04T00:15:00", "owner": "ngomanlinda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919677100188920, "text": "这中文绝对比我的英文好..", "created_at": "2025-11-03T23:46:07", "owner": "enver_ezziz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854355724561348, "text": "喜欢娘炮总是少", "created_at": "2025-11-03T22:44:15", "owner": "ljim__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109476268585142, "text": "你这中文比大多数中国人好", "created_at": "2025-11-03T22:35:20", "owner": "yongjie_passenger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937532083089316, "text": "Deport", "created_at": "2025-11-03T19:28:15", "owner": "sodam_secret_number", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991630602850798, "text": "😂😍👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-03T18:56:52", "owner": "calla557", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157847971396604, "text": "Interesting 🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-03T18:17:37", "owner": "jason_tan1990", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063948617134416, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-03T17:10:56", "owner": "c.e.l.e.bracy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058915331449035, "text": "我还是觉得智慧型代表非我们撒撒莫属", "created_at": "2025-11-03T14:59:09", "owner": "eojjjhm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857318290552009, "text": "👍👍👍❤❤❤", "created_at": "2025-11-03T13:52:47", "owner": "gilbertlamm2020", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952448346901325, "text": "My husband is smart and funny, I think this combination suits me well. \nYour husband has to be smart too, can’t imagine such a clever woman with someone who isn’t mentally her level.", "created_at": "2025-11-03T13:19:49", "owner": "handwriting.notebooks", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17957198079008558, "text": "关羽+诸葛亮🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-03T13:02:59", "owner": "starfireastro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18363871342094857, "text": "feminist....?in usa?", "created_at": "2025-11-03T12:04:53", "owner": "tsz_tsz2222", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["chinese", "threekingdoms", "china", "learnchinese", "中文"]},
