8094863562886025, "text": "台灣有送嗎？價格多少錢，謝謝", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:34:11", "owner": "b0910510033", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17982134252926033, "text": "打印機幾多錢", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:27:18", "owner": "blp.mic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902693842299421, "text": "price?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T09:52:34", "owner": "_karlcheung_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18175860661362138, "text": "🙌🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-19T18:52:06", "owner": "dennipan", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18104949649657705, "text": "多少", "created_at": "2025-12-02T10:47:59", "owner": "fugahsu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121418641542044, "text": "$？", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:51:49", "owner": "houuuboy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878143834444801, "text": "How much is this?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:10:02", "owner": "kss_tang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051193514373336, "text": "怎麼聯絡", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:51:28", "owner": "guangjunfeng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047761679457775, "text": "多少一台", "created_at": "2025-12-06T11:16:34", "owner": "triple3dd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061157975222510, "text": "$", "created_at": "2025-11-23T09:13:58", "owner": "blazey.lin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056485172637971, "text": "我在洛杉矶，想订购几台", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:10:15", "owner": "eddie_ezze", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087225587055636, "text": "多少", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:29:09", "owner": "yuantc___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366478831095282, "text": "價格", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:16:52", "owner": "neochengo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926340229160446, "text": "多少啊", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:26:20", "owner": "ks8199km8199", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078756659267425, "text": "$$", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:04:10", "owner": "ddin0515", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955322145905258, "text": "How much?", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:10:36", "owner": "dalewoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137047210464896, "text": "比中國工人貴多了", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:56:01", "owner": "underscore", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072534500062173, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T14:47:56", "owner": "rosehuang820723", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18233229733307156, "text": "需要更多資訊🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-13T13:14:50", "owner": "caryfox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870122416473711, "text": "有人有實際操作的畫面嗎", "created_at": "2025-12-11T21:17:03", "owner": "kantkevin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894149728364243, "text": "多少錢 💰", "created_at": "2025-12-10T14:23:37", "owner": "ten_dollar_coin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088628650784861, "text": "這是宣傳 是失業宣告。他提到的職位 全要失業了😂😂😂 你們的高薪。沒。直接失業😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T23:20:11", "owner": "915forever", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065278379406956, "text": "考試時  還不印爆他", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:44:07", "owner": "cragelin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084295100106080, "text": "這也太厲害了", "created_at": "2025-12-04T12:51:20", "owner": "terry1214", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897103354201657, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:21:08", "owner": "veryhappybanana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905261080142158, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:15:54", "owner": "mmmmmmmmaymay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353108713166902, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:40:57", "owner": "oreotutu5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123336577509793, "text": "請問有幾種工能", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:36:13", "owner": "b0910510033", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["uvdtfprinter", "uvcrystalprinter", "impresorauv", "uvflatbedprinter", "uvdtftransfer", "phonecaseuvprinter", "phonecaseprint", "phonecaseprinting", "uvprinterprice", "impresorauvdtffunsun", "a1uvprinter", "uvdtfwraps", "customuvdtfcupwraptransfers", "impresorauvdtf", "uvdtfstick", "bottleuvprinter", "bottleprint", "bottleprinting", "uvprinetercost", "funsunprinter"]},
{"media_id": 3785701707096067319, "shortcode": "DSJg6UlDQz3", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DSJg6UlDQz3/", "taken_at": "2025-12-12T03:41:11", "caption": "一眼定crush挑战#一眼定crush挑战#挑战#老外真会玩#海外生活#海外知新", "owner_username": "iopponews", "owner_id": "71692397326", "likes": 3679, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0004_DSJg6UlDQz3\\DSJg6UlDQz3_20251212_034111.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": "18544925851024692", "text": "應該是比較熟悉的人", "created_at": "2025-12-13T04:11:52", "owner": "a88107s40230", "likes": 24}, {"id": "18197806819324586", "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-13T03:51:46", "owner": "bengbeng40382", "likes": 1}, {"id": "17903188326316555", "text": "看天空！看後腦燒！", "created_at": "2025-12-12T15:43:16", "owner": "eting_uwu9", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17902388541322845", "text": "有没有一种可能最讨厌的那位先🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-12T23:08:12", "owner": "happyloon1227", "likes": 2}, {"id": "18106393447730299", "text": "好我學會了，沒人能騙我了。啊幹本來就沒人會測試我啊。", "created_at": "2025-12-13T03:29:10", "owner": "e54901210", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18332828089210933", "text": "貓咪那個太酷", "created_at": "2025-12-12T04:44:29", "owner": "weiyi_1207", "likes": 12}, {"id": "17947312566066532", "text": "根据猫的情况来说.谁看我，我就是它主人了👌", "created_at": "2025-12-12T04:06:15", "owner": "babychingga", "likes": 49}, {"id": "18230333713306596", "text": "其實這麼說還不算正確，應該要說，誰是他內心最重視的人，這不侷限於愛情，測試同性時可以了解到誰是他最重視的朋友！親情就可以測試孩子最重視爸爸或媽媽，爸媽最重視哪個孩子", "created_at": "2025-12-12T13:37:11", "owner": "karldekaianna", "likes": 20}, {"id": "18023344916604226", "text": "哥们你找三个同性回头，也总得看一个吧", "created_at": "2025-12-12T04:26:29", "owner": "fkxq4521", "likes": 6}, {"id": "17856489537577089", "text": "@yuyongen8 @jianing_0526 @yixuanli2014 @chinyufei @huien0622 @", "created_at": "2025-12-12T16:14:49", "owner": "elise0903", "likes": 2}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["一眼定crush挑战", "挑战", "老外真会玩", "海外生活", "海外知新"]},
{"media_id": 3755255589031910976, "shortcode": "DQdWQ_hDB5A", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DQdWQ_hDB5A/", "taken_at": "2025-10-31T03:30:33", "caption": "讓你看看一場滿分的約會 #抽象 #大學生哪有不瘋的 #魔性", "owner_username": "aday08543", "owner_id": "75927164415", "likes": 24246, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0005_DQdWQ_hDB5A\\DQdWQ_hDB5A_20251031_033033.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17990761559853244, "text": "男生請保護好自己😱", "created_at": "2025-11-01T02:53:45", "owner": "au03kx48", "likes": 2062}, {"id": 18064190180429221, "text": "這結尾我是真沒有想到😍", "created_at": "2025-10-31T18:09:54", "owner": "ann0420_24y", "likes": 655}, {"id": 18073863821191062, "text": "mvp结算画面", "created_at": "2025-11-01T08:31:52", "owner": "jgreee_", "likes": 1333}, {"id": 17934446630981606, "text": "就跟你們講 遇到沒感覺的 酒神上身\n有感覺的 喝水都暈", "created_at": "2025-11-01T15:07:26", "owner": "jamestos10512", "likes": 243}, {"id": 18022565042592551, "text": "最後還是得跳一下", "created_at": "2025-11-01T04:21:36", "owner": "stanley_shen99", "likes": 131}, {"id": 18054867473305258, "text": "本來想說點什麼，但實在給的太多了😂", "created_at": "2025-11-01T19:09:04", "owner": "minjie.pan", "likes": 33}, {"id": 18076433579159362, "text": "竟然有女生版  也太讚了吧😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-01T09:36:39", "owner": "wei_zen1202", "likes": 49}, {"id": 18036976862739192, "text": "明知有舞… 不對！我根本想不到，怎麼避啊", "created_at": "2025-11-04T19:51:25", "owner": "lublan_1", "likes": 30}, {"id": 17864987985484810, "text": "看得我小腦萎縮🫠", "created_at": "2025-11-04T01:54:56", "owner": "z1379465", "likes": 20}, {"id": 18045706523431982, "text": "怎么出国了又刷到😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-01T13:24:55", "owner": "xiaoliwen48", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18383116159182815, "text": "四塊金+喝酒，這Buff加持，男生跑不掉了", "created_at": "2025-11-02T03:48:59", "owner": "audi_10253", "likes": 360}, {"id": 18072498020192948, "text": "👏👏😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-01T02:50:16", "owner": "shaosongpeng", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18066717872090652, "text": "我竟然看完了", "created_at": "2025-11-02T01:40:31", "owner": "hsu.1005", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18086812640309227, "text": "音樂好評", "created_at": "2025-11-05T19:35:37", "owner": "smooth.pro_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092131870875099, "text": "愛看多拍多發🥰🥰", "created_at": "2025-11-01T09:38:26", "owner": "wei_zen1202", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17909246010255910, "text": "這到底是什麼風格", "created_at": "2025-11-13T00:31:35", "owner": "kobe_bryant_2481_0424", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18291174241258669, "text": "為何覺得此視屏不當？\n\n❌1.此場景不符合現實\n❌2.有不當言論\n✅3.未提供小姐姐聯絡方式\n❌4.其他", "created_at": "2025-11-05T05:00:19", "owner": "_feng_1209_", "likes": 214}, {"id": 17971682987950550, "text": "計畫通行，先來場舞蹈", "created_at": "2025-11-07T08:09:02", "owner": "tw77946", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073030841006291, "text": "聲音好聽 但是這只是表面 其實抽得能讓人抽搐", "created_at": "2025-11-03T15:01:01", "owner": "nm8970011", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18075911240324176, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-01T06:40:27", "owner": "curtis._.z", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18093187015893172, "text": "😻", "created_at": "2025-11-01T14:13:04", "owner": "wejacetsao", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18538477720015578, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-01T09:28:29", "owner": "albzzent_chen", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18231054715306826, "text": "只有黃金很棒", "created_at": "2025-11-01T09:06:32", "owner": "apev785", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18144346390433166, "text": "怎麼沒有一個輪胎痕繼續講話", "created_at": "2025-11-05T09:08:26", "owner": "qpbdbdpqqdpbpbqd", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18008723123804893, "text": "感覺還是網路用太多了", "created_at": "2025-11-09T00:12:52", "owner": "nex_phase131", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18065867252526177, "text": "減速帶🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-01T10:19:28", "owner": "elonswinch0311", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18190731985330784, "text": "這個也太可怕了！！", "created_at": "2025-10-31T22:18:32", "owner": "ansonblack", "likes": 32}, {"id": 17996437931696567, "text": "原來才是獵人", "created_at": "2025-11-04T03:24:22", "owner": "chcdj_795", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18290364442273414, "text": "你看你又跳", "created_at": "2025-11-02T10:13:25", "owner": "mumuwu0314", "likes": 20}, {"id": 18080929562025305, "text": "我去…女演员没被压着吧", "created_at": "2025-11-13T03:37:51", "owner": "itser8848", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18031073000721082, "text": "午安小姐姐\n週末愉快", "created_at": "2025-11-01T03:31:24", "owner": "qiuxingqi", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17988945050731249, "text": "進女廁幹什麼了？一直抖？", "created_at": "2025-11-02T22:39:37", "owner": "raninuisamazing", "likes": 82}, {"id": 18077561813274152, "text": "4.33 复制打开抖音，看看【圆脸羊羊的作品】让你看看一场满分的约会 # 抽象 # 大学生哪有不... https://v.douyin.com/aCTN6s5dUKg/ C@U.Yz 12/25 JvF:/", "created_at": "2025-11-09T00:20:49", "owner": "nex_phase131", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063110237424204, "text": "一言不合就开跳", "created_at": "2025-11-03T05:47:27", "owner": "moran_0208", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047226566411445, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-07T03:11:47", "owner": "kemushi.dango", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068475692595285, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-01T08:53:50", "owner": "ycc0722", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18224604892305383, "text": "靠現在影片不夠尬沒流量", "created_at": "2025-11-04T02:55:46", "owner": "tong96821344", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18202050748316314, "text": "有姐姐想看撸的嘛", "created_at": "2025-11-12T08:48:23", "owner": "renshengshipianzhaoye", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17956335833882620, "text": "叫車那部分，什麼AA⋯那叫包養🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-01T12:59:43", "owner": "me0618lkk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17913490560087588, "text": "？", "created_at": "2025-11-01T12:06:57", "owner": "edwardlee.0522", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18093827842672035, "text": "最後又MVP結算啊", "created_at": "2025-11-01T15:19:08", "owner": "_____nasus30_____", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18128918140436073, "text": "太反差！好喜歡😍😍", "created_at": "2025-10-31T19:40:03", "owner": "rick_no_rich", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081443174515618, "text": "一言不合舞法天女懲罰你😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T13:40:55", "owner": "nichola.kwok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079402588945594, "text": "反轉🤔", "created_at": "2025-12-12T07:21:35", "owner": "l.e.o_0318", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106673191572367, "text": "確定是男生很猥瑣？", "created_at": "2025-12-0