irl type of post", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:59:09", "owner": "pooh_rin", "likes": 193}, {"id": 18113549671576220, "text": "Used product. 2nd hand product. No thanks", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:08:48", "owner": "stra8dad", "likes": 103}, {"id": 18086493007989740, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:22:15", "owner": "dynamik_koncepts", "likes": 383}, {"id": 17842404501621643, "text": "Bruh, this is just rich vs poor not race", "created_at": "2025-11-22T20:48:34", "owner": "zhengzhou130", "likes": 236}, {"id": 18075156331992431, "text": "These people in the comments are not passing the vibe checks😂😂😂 they're so jealous of you lol", "created_at": "2025-12-01T12:18:42", "owner": "yanzii04520", "likes": 62}, {"id": 18061424954233950, "text": "Weird way of saying you weren’t good enough for a ⚪️ millionaire and had to settle for a Chinese one", "created_at": "2025-11-23T14:05:45", "owner": "emperorshion", "likes": 28}, {"id": 18096297922680643, "text": "I wouldnt even bother responding to these comments.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:31:10", "owner": "sillyselkie", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18079914368174857, "text": "Good, love and stick to your own men.", "created_at": "2025-11-23T18:17:21", "owner": "onverstaanbareklompendrager314", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18065076146152635, "text": "So you settled for an asian guy after having fun with men you’re truly attracted to", "created_at": "2025-11-24T22:40:53", "owner": "the_real_blueshock", "likes": 68}, {"id": 18028449080750022, "text": "Only 🍚 man can afford life 👏💯 can‘t wait to find mine", "created_at": "2025-11-23T07:50:44", "owner": "johnny_sting_tattoos", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18107947567620511, "text": "I don’t see the necessity to hate one side, there are plenty of good and bad examples on both ends", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:52:09", "owner": "kayv._.man", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18108840544617614, "text": "Poor China boi. Used as 2nd option by China  girl. 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:07:45", "owner": "unfollow_kalen", "likes": 168}, {"id": 18064510670181438, "text": "The thing is to put it short, that white people normally crave experiences such as hiking, doing quirky activities etc together to improve couple bond. Conversely, different perception in asian men, who would love to enjoy their wealth with you. What would you prefer, for those unique experiences, or bathe in luxury. Surprisingly, the human psyche sometimes enjoys the latter option, when one encounters novel experiences, rather than being comfortable", "created_at": "2025-12-04T07:44:17", "owner": "gr8t.wall", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17855897718571686, "text": "Imagine taking shorty to Mykonos and Paris while Tyler cracked off $9.99 sushi. Shorty delete this, you're making your man look like @wassupakash", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:47:13", "owner": "gladstonelbaker", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18057444356300428, "text": "Blud haven't seen white girls. Missing out on the real fun.", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:55:39", "owner": "hassan_mehdi9", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18161249578401116, "text": "It’s fake propaganda sponsored by the ccp.  They literally have hundreds of “influencers” creating content in support of 🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:42:04", "owner": "echo6mike", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17868279594498066, "text": "All the angry white bois in the chat 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T14:55:27", "owner": "1645jjo", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17951537829044653, "text": "This post is prove that women will get hate no matter who they date 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T19:35:54", "owner": "popculturefollower_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17986834370906601, "text": "Cringe", "created_at": "2025-11-23T10:17:33", "owner": "imdomd", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18072067550049729, "text": "Oxfordstudy leftovers", "created_at": "2025-11-23T16:33:20", "owner": "hk3stars", "likes": 38}, {"id": 18048065135423769, "text": "Something I like about western women is they never make me always pay for the bill.", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:59:48", "