igger ahhh post", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:47:38", "owner": "sam_04l", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17929317822117522, "text": "Letsgooo I also love Chinese slave labor money", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:14:26", "owner": "terswiz", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17929807524150333, "text": "Street meat", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:34:18", "owner": "dxperx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942302938087818, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:08:49", "owner": "damned_90", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18086963426056557, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:41:34", "owner": "nori.i316", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18164491459351801, "text": "Sad", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:56:58", "owner": "name_ishenry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108799888620891, "text": "Milk men??", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:55:44", "owner": "breetsukiyomi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368009530091639, "text": "At first glance the caption, I thought you were dating exclusively milkmen lmao", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:45:29", "owner": "sean30m30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930295339011923, "text": "I love em a lil foreign 😋", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:05:05", "owner": "nakedmushroomman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891666040244046, "text": "True cuck", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:08:03", "owner": "bilal_talib67", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17867294703487488, "text": "All the broke men mad in the comments", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:48:37", "owner": "by.adiiti", "likes": 52}, {"id": 18080166257150874, "text": "And without any of those men youd be eating out the dumpster😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:59:48", "owner": "brichdaog1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072267407359947, "text": "It’s so sad when you depend from others instead be your polar stars.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:01:36", "owner": "anto94n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18414624838139357, "text": "Nobody should date milk men...", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:33:46", "owner": "luismhuang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899513560186029, "text": "But who even dates milkmen", "created_at": "2025-11-2