ũng đâu ít đứa thế ta =)))))))))))", "created_at": "2025-11-25T00:45:34", "owner": "shu.kk1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298892011282293, "text": "They got alot to make up for 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:25:28", "owner": "kaydenzaitz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157464553404097, "text": "@shangxintuoba", "created_at": "2025-11-24T22:01:48", "owner": "lucia_cyn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991984911889870, "text": "Poor man now exploring the cave made by white dicks", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:37:55", "owner": "shivam_stillstealslight", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17925441468039031, "text": "Hahahah", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:53:44", "owner": "datphuyung8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939519454097468, "text": "After the white boys F'ed you enough, now a Asian simp picked you up", "created_at": "2025-11-24T02:30:24", "owner": "nikkapubes", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18341594509231185, "text": "Nah spoiled product😂. Anyone who dates that, has no self respect.", "created_at": "2025-11-24T02:02:54", "owner": "bigbiggybigster", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063037175439486, "text": "Ohhh white, i though you mean the milk man", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:51:44", "owner": "muhfarelfausta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541115611025234, "text": "And the Chinese guy knows you sleeping around with white guys? You belong to the streets ig", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:48:54", "owner": "oyazer", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17954435454013685, "text": "Enjoy it while you can. Your value depreciates each passing year like my Benz. Men want a classic woman to settle down with.", "created_at": "2025-11-24T00:35:20", "owner": "legendarydrunk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060910388239012, "text": "Propaganda", "created_at": "2025-11-24T00:22:29", "owner": "hunqtrd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136130512462957, "text": "I am a woman. But if you want a man to pay for everything, then don't complain about being seen as an object, being seen as worthless when you get old, etc. 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T23:56:11", "owner": "kwrijth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104954599651037, "text": "Racist gold digger. Christ will send you to the deepest pits of hell", "created_at": "2025-11-23T23:51:07", "owner": "danielyangcookingaccount", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18323440441244000, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T23:50:09", "owner": "queszunmur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147095788386698, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T23:41:54", "owner": "shoualee12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113195827578361, "text": "she dated milk men", "created_at": "2025-11-23T23:32:33", "owner": "i767_rh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059226002265865, "text": "I’ll never understand hate for camping, being in nature, road trips or day trips- it’s exhilarating, fun and adventurous. Why not day trip one day and eat out at your fancy dinner the next? All in all, it’s preference I guess", "created_at": "2025-11-23T23:02:56", "owner": "boris._88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065142881579511, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T23:01:27", "owner": "miraiige", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897482245351032, "text": "Think there’s a disparity in the amount of money these men have too 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:15:38", "owner": "louie_hern", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18395588848130381, "text": "Damn a rich girl can’t be ran through and then have a beta rich man?", "created_at": "2025-11-23T21:00:48", "owner": "gutstheberserker_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077545961180673, "text": "Why would you date a milk man? Do milk men even exist?", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:39:41", "owner": "ye._.zd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075803828462495, "text": "This is racist", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:10:33", "owner": "julyshe_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18080904788146725, "text": "I mean when someone says she’s dating a Chinese man, but if she also claims that he doesn’t pay for dinner, housing, gifts and take her to see his parents and his parents didn’t give out red envelope with bride money, the he is NOT a Chinese man haha", "created_at": "2025-11-23T18:30:57", "owner": "aka.jimmy.d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18414558256189753, "text": "Good thing there's a billion to \"run thru\", you 😂😂 you can compete with McDonalds...over a billion served! Just say your an Escort that doesn't fuck 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:35:51", "owner": "wen.huang.100", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18320924689173400, "text": "@thatcracker.smd do u wanna be my boyfriend ching cheng", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:15:34", "owner": "fakenemtaofake", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164971075350273, "text": "How can I catch Chinese guys heart😭 it’s the hardest 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-23T15:44:40", "owner": "miripranori", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875271037444353, "text": "Chinese men x.  Rich men.", "created_at": "2025-11-23T13:25:23", "owner": "damedinero30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087249841791903, "text": "And cheat on him with white man 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T11:42:59", "owner": "_superpikachu_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18033286457525136, "text": "Lowkey could go for some b dubs", "created_at": "2025-11-23T10:49:36", "owner": "chihuahuadumbstick", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915580417232463, "text": "When’s the last time we had milk men delivering milk to homes? 🤔🧐……", "created_at": "2025-11-23T10:35:41", "owner": "doug3licious", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18386415265182005, "text": "bet your 🐱 is loose from all the white 🍆. your new man must be a cúck lmao", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:42:31", "owner": "luxkexy", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17893983861221760, "text": "F*cking wh*re, you're a w*orthl*ss p*ece of sh1t", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:36:52", "owner": "laszlo_187", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18403186495193050, "text": "He used to be gay?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T22:09:16", "owner": "optimalygg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543042076038157, "text": "Chinese men know how to celebrate.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T21:48:51", "owner": "ohmminus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543190573024585, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T21:04:54", "owner": "speakingofyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933352345107919, "text": "Yall she viet – her marriage or relationship won’t last that shit will crash and burn 😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T20:35:05", "owner": "clearblueskies1996", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18106126954653064, "text": "She got used up and ran through by every yt guy she can find and now found a poor Asian guy to settle down…my bro, you can do better than some cheap yt man’s wh0r3😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:57:27", "owner": "makeeveryonenoticeagain", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17872353408459510, "text": "F*** those milk people", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:47:43", "owner": "phteven_law", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18142812136396241, "text": "Asian women should really be more socially mindful when making content. The West for a couple centuries now has done a great deal to emasculate and disrespect Asian men (because Asian men have had growing and even rivaling Economic Power). I seen too many times where content is made that invites the disrespect towards Asian men. I know it's not intentional, but there needs to be more mindfulness of societal, historical and systemic context. I don’t doubt you love your man at all, but there are narratives out there that exist(outside of your relationship) that Asian women/women don’t look at Asian men as an option at worst and as back up plan at best.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:39:02", "owner": "bluewich99", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18212963242309829, "text": "HAHAHAHAHAHAHAHA", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:34:35", "owner": "charlene.gem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963416257005606, "text": "Real talk: you don't deserve a Chinese baller if you used to go for the colonizers. 🤮", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:05:26", "owner": "nomadic.stylez", "likes": 89}, {"id": 18087595366941227, "text": "Where do yall find those rich asians bruh", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:06:51", "owner": "fixontu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907608064254541, "text": "Sooo you went from fetishing whites to rich simpy Chinese guys. If the money wasnt there youd still be white worshipping", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:56:39", "owner": "jondomtravels", "likes": 862}, {"id": 17854981764526339, "text": "Only Chinese men are dumb enough to take others left overs. I'm glad it is working out for you though.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:41:49", "owner": "thomasxblack", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17976050483793334, "text": "Ngl Chinese men are rlly generous💯", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:39:22", "owner": "shinenlife_", "likes": 107}, {"id": 17927050704156354, "text": "Chinese men are too good for you. Go back to your white God. You worshipers dont deserve Asian men", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:14:16", "owner": "imalreadyknowin2021", "likes": 38}, {"id": 17864329329514418, "text": "Racist", "created_at": "2025-11-21T01:34:15", "owner": "arkhambrookz", "likes": 2}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["reels", "gege", "chineseman"]},
