{"media_id": 3741535011356164197, "shortcode": "DPsmkTykkBl", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DPsmkTykkBl/", "taken_at": "2025-10-12T05:09:51", "caption": "销冠到哪里都是销冠🤣🤣🤣\n\n#情感 #情感語錄 #情感文案 #情感分享 #情感共鳴 #感情語錄 #爱情语录 #陪伴 #幸福 #心情語錄 #抖音精选 #恋爱语录 #恋爱日常 #男朋友 #女朋友 #夫妻日常 #夫妻相处之道 #帅哥美女 #文案 #感情 #冷战 #冷战夫妻 #有效沟通 #十二星座 #星座分析\n\n感情咨询预约: 微信 weChat : MichaelOonly", "owner_username": "yuchenn_tarot", "owner_id": "53134990444", "likes": 48486, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0011_DPsmkTykkBl\\DPsmkTykkBl_20251012_050951.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18078761810016146, "text": "我是秦始皇", "created_at": "2025-10-12T15:14:44", "owner": "x6705", "likes": 3077}, {"id": 18086953390907856, "text": "影片最後男生有給第三個人一個ok的手勢，看起來是打配合的😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T10:26:32", "owner": "samocugh15", "likes": 1327}, {"id": 17867970195391227, "text": "說女生看似堅強、實則脆弱，然後纖細又善良，這真的適用多數女生，各位兄弟可以試試", "created_at": "2025-10-14T08:27:20", "owner": "wage.slave_charlies", "likes": 328}, {"id": 17960815100868134, "text": "以前我嗤之以鼻,現在我逐偵學習", "created_at": "2025-10-12T17:51:41", "owner": "yu99_07.18", "likes": 3756}, {"id": 18055231559264898, "text": "試過了 剛剛被發到thread上公審", "created_at": "2025-10-13T09:05:32", "owner": "jiro_12_08", "likes": 502}, {"id": 18095393113816441, "text": "我是齊天大聖", "created_at": "2025-10-20T05:21:03", "owner": "kindredyan233", "likes": 78}, {"id": 17984630294907607, "text": "從前的我嗤之以鼻 現在的我逐幀學習", "created_at": "2025-11-05T16:08:19", "owner": "xin_fa.717", "likes": 32}, {"id": 18050804819320317, "text": "看完了嗎\n看完了跟我回森林去", "created_at": "2025-10-12T11:17:33", "owner": "rayhuang1003", "likes": 250}, {"id": 18044245337680718, "text": "我還是趕快回去山洞不要再對手機傻笑了", "created_at": "2025-10-16T04:22:49", "owner": "samlee810423", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18078266426043934, "text": "哇靠原來平常我這麼油條～😍", "created_at": "2025-10-13T00:44:42", "owner": "johnny_1225_", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18102320107673333, "text": "這同步彷彿fuwamoco，baubau", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:42:28", "owner": "treepolooo", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17990404802713019, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T13:45:15", "owner": "sswweett59", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18061448372559770, "text": "我知道留言區很多秦始皇\n我是兵馬俑 真正的我跟皇上被封印在陝西\n現在只要1000塊 就可以幫我們解封\n我會跟皇上說你的壯舉\n讓他封你為太子", "created_at": "2025-12-03T07:46:26", "owner": "donglin0713", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18540467650009871, "text": "好聰明，希望以後用得到😆", "created_at": "2025-11-12T23:11:04", "owner": "mike.lxiang", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17862462756519942, "text": "@chris_uu__ 吃飯學習一下", "created_at": "2025-11-16T10:54:58", "owner": "ming_weil", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17950930748915463, "text": "我是後面的路燈", "created_at": "2025-12-07T14:50:15", "owner": "2011.__.1002", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095459644737972, "text": "情緒價值😂", "created_at": "2025-10-13T02:23:27", "owner": "zhucai_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18097568875673932, "text": "海王潛質啊哥們❤️❤️😍😍😢😢😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-13T09:27:24", "owner": "zhangdunwei5", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17855791107542132, "text": "我是北極熊🐻‍❄️", "created_at": "2025-10-19T14:37:06", "owner": "xavier.89_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18081002477515919, "text": "原来重点是赚钱😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:43:17", "owner": "wolong747", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18112934797576089, "text": "便條紙寫下來了 每天逐幀學習", "created_at": "2025-11-10T07:44:57", "owner": "j.r.shannn", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18072505315961066, "text": "奇怪？秦始皇呢！？", "created_at": "2025-10-12T14:34:31", "owner": "layne_chin_07151", "likes": 50}, {"id": 17918813109179679, "text": "😂好好笑", "created_at": "2025-10-12T09:51:03", "owner": "jason._.88888", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074676107157122, "text": "反覆觀看重點筆記😢", "created_at": "2025-10-13T21:30:41", "owner": "shan02_07", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18114030592486571, "text": "活該這錢就該你掙", "created_at": "2025-10-13T14:23:59", "owner": "one2024.zhou", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17860462302458629, "text": "好像大飛😂", "created_at": "2025-10-28T09:46:36", "owner": "wu_chinchou", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17894704527224331, "text": "他媽的我要趕路講一堆廢話", "created_at": "2025-12-02T05:24:45", "owner": "kaneshiro.0_0y.ichun", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18294660334282673, "text": "@kevin_51920 就你啊", "created_at": "2025-11-06T00:00:02", "owner": "nononohahahaha", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18077118202881093, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T06:30:01", "owner": "davy.chiu.3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18177347320348519, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T11:53:00", "owner": "mission945", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18106231003531229, "text": "学习", "created_at": "2025-10-26T10:42:12", "owner": "jinnnfuu", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18094655302756881, "text": "聽到200帳號都不加了 沒有對女人的渴望 只有對錢的執著 這就是 銷冠的本質！聽懂掌聲", "created_at": "2025-10-13T15:18:42", "owner": "joshlin_0719", "likes": 61}, {"id": 17891328063386457, "text": "學習📑", "created_at": "2025-12-11T06:31:29", "owner": "hank_58588", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18143966398448119, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-17T16:39:15", "owner": "wu.james.543", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086764864987798, "text": "一般熟人可以这样推销，陌生人不建议试哈", "created_at": "2025-11-12T10:17:04", "owner": "skiesfaith_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098837170662635, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T19:09:49", "owner": "ek9.hk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090821980879234, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T06:19:07", "owner": "chou_martin", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18116036479478267, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-31T06:44:39", "owner": "su.austin.630", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18307533379217249, "text": "@s789789s99ss 這套路哪裡搞", "created_at": "2025-10-15T15:11:54", "owner": "nothing520520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18408592048136533, "text": "dsp", "created_at": "2025-10-12T12:20:03", "owner": "ac07ianx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083253107025576, "text": "不是啊 為了讓0元😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T17:56:01", "owner": "dennipan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109751812528930, "text": "👌🏻", "created_at": "2025-12-12T08:50:36", "owner": "hzh.miller", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021873668610457, "text": "會說話真的很重要‼️", "created_at": "2025-12-12T02:09:49", "owner": "liang_0929_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991760058884530, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:55:25", "owner": "090869696969_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073208474340634, "text": "@abcjoshjosh 甲噓辦法丟這了 剩下靠自己🙂‍↕️", "created_at": "2025-12-09T09:04:26", "owner": "nl.hsc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108974848619957, "text": "眼里没有对异性的渴望，全是对金钱增长的最求😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T00:20:32", "owner": "xianler_2605", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083472899114382, "text": "@ding._0331, @nathanyang1217", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:11:34", "owner": "kaoryan1215", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947233347939905, "text": "學廢了，現在在警局，誰能來保一下", "created_at": "2025-12-07T14:43:41", "owner": "yhe._.0705", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18369035986086624, "text": "傾聽👂\n感覺🙌\n思考🤔", "created_at": "2025-12-07T08:35:09", "owner": "whitemagic0515", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118364686561267, "text": "满嘴吧鬼话连篇 但我每一字已经学起来了 ❤️ 谢谢 🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:50:08", "owner": "kklim90713", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065574932402071, "text": "‘三十六计’", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:51:52", "owner": "haoteow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122044957536232, "text": "蒐藏從未停止 學習從未開始", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:21:22", "owner": "po8_fox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890360923385771, "text": "挑撥離間 全都是套路😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:39:12", "owner": "little_5_0206", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888308284394199, "text": "@hiu216 你受", "created_at": "2025-12-06T05:07:16", "owner": "ray_wpchun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088359337813520, "text": "哥們連哄帶騙還包郵", "created_at": "2025-12-06T01:17:42", "owner": "0718._.qvq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861439204542090, "text": "秦。", "created_at": "2025-12-06T01:15:06", "owner": "yangen_0527", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083945987079631, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:36:47", "owner": "lewis_phan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096124288677266, "text": "狗來了都中兩條", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:38:36", "owner": "skk_1203", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075317381216968, "text": "我是玉皇大帝", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:14:54", "owner": "y.i.0716_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119739847547283, "text": "一桃杀二士", "created_at": "2025-12-03T09:00:22", "owner": "jeffrey_fif_pro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057339134319047, "text": "我是诸葛亮", "created_at": "2025-12-03T08:24:04", "owner": "yuan_poon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049074752407317, "text": "所以，玩/愛，兩回事", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:58:50", "owner": "ryansjack01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116105602569365, "text": "尋找秦始皇，已學會，正在做筆錄", "created_at": "2025-12-02T10:13:52", "owner": "okok8801", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082749794120441, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:52:41", "owner": "dyh211206", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981376953775405, "text": "我信你個鬼 你這糟老頭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:18:58", "owner": "faddy_llllkkkkkkkkkkkkkk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088069046001394, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:07:21", "owner": "liupinle7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062232893223003, "text": "他們是怎麼不笑場的😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:43:44", "owner": "angel987770128", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093295696918695, "text": "當那個男生抓那個女生手臂的時候 通常一巴掌就下去了", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:33:45", "owner": "ding_418", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098326135757255, "text": "男人的嘴 骗人的鬼", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:59:39", "owner": "sui_zai94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884391277408097, "text": "比周瑜還厲害的離間計", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:01:50", "owner": "little.hos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114347575604458, "text": "信他們演的；還是信我是秦始皇", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:12:55", "owner": "_justin_1226", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082668061878956, "text": "我\n到底\n看\n了\n些\n什麼", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:17:41", "owner": "remora1231", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106798597724089, "text": "以前的我嗤之以鼻，現在的我逐幀學習", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:02:49", "owner": "scorpius_81", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912620491253700, "text": "這錢活該他賺😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:15:50", "owner": "geez._.wth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016987934619763, "text": "😂😂各行都有詐騙😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:22:10", "owner": "teknodogg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885976696397611, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:00:30", "owner": "ykmtwm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092603917931146, "text": "逐幀學習", "created_at": "2025-11-24T08:12:53", "owner": "lift_1211", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912994294248481, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:50:35", "owner": "jimmy.teo85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024879098589098, "text": "在現實中，前面兩個還真不一定是認識的，但喊100比👌🏻，100%是套好的😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T07:41:50", "owner": "jiji_zn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933369151107995, "text": "搭個車而已怎麼曖昧起來了", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:42:25", "owner": "bowei2000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066170138576281, "text": "😂😂😂🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:17:11", "owner": "bigrich8888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970072356974062, "text": "什麼枕頭可以做到這種夢", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:02:35", "owner": "rsusgyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050600345375908, "text": "🇨🇳幹片", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:30:44", "owner": "bryan0207_ff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18409736590185620, "text": "ㄧ個字 騙👏👏👏😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T11:41:34", "owner": "egg5422", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047511068674754, "text": "臉變大了", "created_at": "2025-11-20T13:16:37", "owner": "wei_zen1202", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002499095828464, "text": "🫠🫠🫠", "created_at": "2025-11-20T02:42:02", "owner": "djdahi98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049253570676247, "text": "最後那個是女的補得漂亮😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T03:18:34", "owner": "lirenkai3839", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078104362908642, "text": "@zxc_85528 @zxc8552885 @yuxiang8012 @kabeesoul @kabeesoul @ec_428.rar @zzy.__.nk @ijohnhsu49 @asd0981426348 @love19920209", "created_at": "2025-11-18T11:38:06", "owner": "mars6171714", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073994684255335, "text": "我還工作幹什麼", "created_at": "2025-11-18T11:16:02", "owner": "ltcs._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112423927578228, "text": "。这张嘴能租一天么？", "created_at": "2025-11-18T08:27:56", "owner": "haoxiangfacai888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18191829601335373, "text": "分享更多这些片来紫社", "created_at": "2025-11-17T19:41:40", "owner": "minyoongi.613", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985035105755082, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T10:25:56", "owner": "yx_888_xx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027313007570611, "text": "我趙雲", "created_at": "2025-11-17T01:07:57", "owner": "mn_n134", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885781297400137, "text": "吾皇萬歲", "created_at": "2025-11-08T11:04:37", "owner": "pid40000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138807379456281, "text": "我信...我信😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-08T01:05:31", "owner": "amosyutaka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093034474885005, "text": "好一個保護慾", "created_at": "2025-11-07T15:23:00", "owner": "dc115555", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965650320993711, "text": "明白了，女人的钱包是这样陶出去的", "created_at": "2025-11-07T03:53:48", "owner": "kheng2051", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102519592676865, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-07T00:12:45", "owner": "waynechong_4224", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097091272771872, "text": "会说话，错都是对的。", "created_at": "2025-11-06T17:22:02", "owner": "leeroycew", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063307139426916, "text": "被你撩的这女的  下面都湿了", "created_at": "2025-11-06T08:09:33", "owner": "xulikun66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18200367268318103, "text": "秦始皇", "created_at": "2025-11-05T18:43:37", "owner": "liwei_is_liwei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126700804500802, "text": "難怪女生都喜歡渣男", "created_at": "2025-11-05T17:47:48", "owner": "pigpig19881218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110197669579621, "text": "三十六計", "created_at": "2025-11-04T23:13:00", "owner": "hide_0l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18315318565170659, "text": "最後一招 衝出一個直接10塊變200😂", "created_at": "2025-11-03T18:56:30", "owner": "altis_len", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029440475735994, "text": "口遁", "created_at": "2025-11-03T16:39:39", "owner": "chungsir2015", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062040353406930, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-03T15:42:54", "owner": "jerry.w_z4_c205", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084572662806844, "text": "36計那一計", "created_at": "2025-11-01T11:33:33", "owner": "c.sy___83", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062778080434656, "text": "来财🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-30T18:27:50", "owner": "king.freedom.m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070200551611023, "text": "你叉叉", "created_at": "2025-10-30T10:44:39", "owner": "victory_0930", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111636388567595, "text": "坐個車還要聽你廢話", "created_at": "2025-10-30T04:40:50", "owner": "a0913402748", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941745376076442, "text": "派出所門口照片已經貼上", "created_at": "2025-10-29T04:23:07", "owner": "david_ft_gu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125761360494213, "text": "逐幀學習", "created_at": "2025-10-23T04:36:51", "owner": "brookwest123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093747643839130, "text": "渣男？", "created_at": "2025-10-22T15:42:02", "owner": "a_kai777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18363560557159959, "text": "这就是第三十七计", "created_at": "2025-10-21T18:04:52", "owner": "ez.ezra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295311511265625, "text": "哥們，你這方法挺吃建模的啊", "created_at": "2025-10-16T14:21:19", "owner": "adiroyder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062545034420254, "text": "三查", "created_at": "2025-10-16T02:25:35", "owner": "chienwen77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853935715505594, "text": "話術與騙術！我選鍊金術", "created_at": "2025-10-15T15:03:12", "owner": "cow40005", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079147112046117, "text": "話術跟騙術🙄", "created_at": "2025-10-15T08:29:20", "owner": "shengren.lin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18428348191100539, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T16:03:15", "owner": "ksl.929", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18532421275040762, "text": "渣男語錄", "created_at": "2025-10-14T02:50:33", "owner": "jet_sr_1204", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987802056731358, "text": "我一拳～～～～～打～～～", "created_at": "2025-10-13T23:06:55", "owner": "orange_chinkyo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071884468964990, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-13T18:22:16", "owner": "xegx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052754126641002, "text": "那个bgm den den den 的", "created_at": "2025-10-13T13:35:24", "owner": "qiyeweil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877496509422099, "text": "@zch_079", "created_at": "2025-10-13T13:26:04", "owner": "tsaobowei0627", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058436546202610, "text": "手拿三十六计，但这用的是哪一计啊", "created_at": "2025-10-13T11:36:45", "owner": "ethanxie2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18424467790096155, "text": "為什麼學校不教這個", "created_at": "2025-10-13T09:41:56", "owner": "kirbillyt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063237983612157, "text": "Pua", "created_at": "2025-10-13T07:31:54", "owner": "jk_15313941", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107396350592580, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-13T06:40:02", "owner": "imalannnn_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18043215869692593, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-13T06:38:54", "owner": "a.qua____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129693205463116, "text": "騎北極熊的秦始王在哪", "created_at": "2025-10-13T06:05:47", "owner": "lchia.6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899817664293375, "text": "神經啊", "created_at": "2025-10-13T03:57:11", "owner": "icyy_is", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176637271359409, "text": "原視頻是誰啊？", "created_at": "2025-10-13T01:22:54", "owner": "jlee0102030", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972626703948544, "text": "套公式对吧", "created_at": "2025-10-12T22:12:53", "owner": "kelvin_cyh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944171508932265, "text": "天才", "created_at": "2025-10-12T22:10:15", "owner": "tycc._2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093012718829963, "text": "竟然是坤坤的配乐！", "created_at": "2025-10-12T20:48:06", "owner": "herrpaprika", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058676099565303, "text": "Laa😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T06:00:43", "owner": "ninglong03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052030643315850, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T05:57:14", "owner": "willianllian", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["情感", "情感語錄", "情感文案", "情感分享", "情感共鳴", "感情語錄", "爱情语录", "陪伴", "幸福", "心情語錄", "抖音精选", "恋爱语录", "恋爱日常", "男朋友", "女朋友", "夫妻日常", "夫妻相处之道", "帅哥美女", "文案", "感情", "冷战", "冷战夫妻", "有效沟通", "十二星座", "星座分析"]},
{"media_id": 3748130501488925457, "shortcode": "DQECNUpDdsR", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DQECNUpDdsR/", "taken_at": "2025-10-21T07:37:26", "caption": "“I finally solved one of China’s greatest mysteries…\nWhy do Chinese people never use their faces as profile pictures? 🤔\nMaybe it’s privacy. Maybe it’s style.\nOr maybe… they just want everyone to guess who’s behind the cat photo. 🐱\nEvery WeChat friend list is like a guessing game —\nYou never know who’s behind that cherry blossom photo! 🌸😂”\n\n#china #explore #fyp #funnyvideos #viral #funny #fypシ #tiktok #culture #profil", "owner_username": "sofiane_abdel", "owner_id": "1910452516", "likes": 39260, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0012_DQECNUpDdsR\\DQECNUpDdsR_20251021_073726.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18293899438285383, "text": "用自己的照片當頭像比較像詐騙😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-21T13:30:11", "owner": "sakanarourou", "likes": 20797}, {"id": 18050805296335000, "text": "用自己做头像那还怎么当键盘侠？", "created_at": "2025-10-23T15:48:04", "owner": "jacobdrakelee", "likes": 6879}, {"id": 18084266470979646, "text": "因为长得不是很方便", "created_at": "2025-10-31T05:47:21", "owner": "mr_squirrelllll", "likes": 5940}, {"id": 17963213046002291, "text": "因為我們沒有像外國人那樣  隨便拍隨便帥😢", "created_at": "2025-10-25T00:12:40", "owner": "leontan1011", "likes": 1600}, {"id": 17848909083581450, "text": "因为中国2000左右开始出现QQ的时候，社交是从陌生人开始的，不用自己真名与头像就是这样来的，以至于后来出现熟人社交的微信，也一直延续了", "created_at": "2025-10-23T07:21:59", "owner": "chongyang7", "likes": 2690}, {"id": 18128113111490747, "text": "因為這隻小鳥比我好看", "created_at": "2025-10-24T11:06:02", "owner": "judy09162004", "likes": 303}, {"id": 18041496968700043, "text": "这可能是中国社会人文里的不安全感吧！戒备心理？", "created_at": "2025-10-23T20:03:09", "owner": "weihan764", "likes": 869}, {"id": 17926965981155112, "text": "在以前的老QQ，你下线之后，那个头像会变成黑白的😂", "created_at": "2025-11-13T18:44:14", "owner": "yyds772024", "likes": 161}, {"id": 18061200878420869, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈 因为在中国很多卖保险的才用自己当头像", "created_at": "2025-10-21T16:14:41", "owner": "kittyliio84", "likes": 2029}, {"id": 18195437773327886, "text": "来国外上学以后越来越自信了 开始用自己的照片当头像了🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-23T00:49:04", "owner": "chy.olivia_29", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18298063381254291, "text": "日本人也不用自己照片当头像（亚洲专区文化）", "created_at": "2025-10-22T13:57:52", "owner": "kou_7417", "likes": 1521}, {"id": 18025932101752641, "text": "用自己当头像感觉好自恋", "created_at": "2025-10-22T04:27:09", "owner": "gigglek", "likes": 386}, {"id": 18070471226597268, "text": "不想被发现我在翻墙", "created_at": "2025-11-13T04:38:28", "owner": "hghj4988", "likes": 12}, {"id": 17902483296146053, "text": "在中國用自己的頭像就是給公安、維穩系統盯上的目標", "created_at": "2025-10-23T03:00:21", "owner": "itgalberty", "likes": 186}, {"id": 18327465247210396, "text": "用自己的照片感觉很自恋", "created_at": "2025-10-23T07:26:07", "owner": "zhao_zhaoyiwen", "likes": 14}, {"id": 17940831684083820, "text": "保護隱私😢", "created_at": "2025-10-24T09:04:38", "owner": "futuresheeptechnology", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18167845528327798, "text": "用自己當頭像會被同齡人笑死", "created_at": "2025-10-27T08:31:31", "owner": "hk_shadow_cyrus", "likes": 15}, {"id": 17940457569089888, "text": "谁会把头猪当自己头像😭", "created_at": "2025-11-17T05:09:26", "owner": "weather07621", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17941691148066324, "text": "我长得太丑了", "created_at": "2025-10-22T12:01:38", "owner": "s.seer_s.s", "likes": 1055}, {"id": 17983167293919837, "text": "我这个日本人不也喜欢动画头像吗😂", "created_at": "2025-11-13T09:06:03", "owner": "hiroyuki_.kobayashi", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18427613191110249, "text": "怎么全是中国人的评论", "created_at": "2025-11-07T02:57:07", "owner": "whosename48", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18075222767237436, "text": "因为我们喜欢攻击别人，不用自己的头像可以有效防止为自己的言行负责任", "created_at": "2025-11-12T18:08:55", "owner": "zhaolingfeng707", "likes": 17}, {"id": 18089627792291674, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:23:02", "owner": "hai19285", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076995392117892, "text": "用自己的头像，一般是比较年长的。或者是中介，或者是推销的，或者是很自恋的人，中国人都这样认为。", "created_at": "2025-10-23T19:48:04", "owner": "qwas3617989557", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18067031387578585, "text": "因为用自己的照片，如果你在网上跟别人争论，别人第一个攻击你的就是你的外貌😂", "created_at": "2025-10-26T19:52:50", "owner": "wzibin19", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17913351387218649, "text": "為了不毀壞別人的上網體驗", "created_at": "2025-11-02T14:45:56", "owner": "kyle._.0610", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17984300597919777, "text": "容易被开户🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-07T06:56:24", "owner": "yawenya11", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18074740808200370, "text": "如果我长的像彭于晏，蔡徐坤我想我会，但是我的样子会让你觉得我像强健犯😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T08:02:30", "owner": "kanyu5717", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18545183752056135, "text": "因为线上是虚拟社交来的嘛，要真人的可以奔现了", "created_at": "2025-12-13T04:42:44", "owner": "1881.es", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065348207562062, "text": "因为想用自己喜欢的😍", "created_at": "2025-12-12T11:44:27", "owner": "chengshulin3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17974494125959407, "text": "我个人觉得是因为即使微信是熟人社交软件但也避免不了加各种公众号，工作上的人，总之那些不是很熟的，且并不想让他们看到真实的自己，所以用各种卡通漫画风景类的头像，因为有很多被逼认识的人，不想给他们看。除非微信升级个可控制看头像的人的范围，仅谁谁谁可看的那种，就像朋友圈一样", "created_at": "2025-12-13T10:21:17", "owner": "g_x_xu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084349967116701, "text": "是自己崇拜的偶像 也可以是自己的信仰 但是感觉从小就没有把自己图片当图像的概念", "created_at": "2025-12-13T01:51:50", "owner": "wyv5470", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076141949209101, "text": "因为我是打工人", "created_at": "2025-12-12T03:18:28", "owner": "nathan_yyzi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18306545095271896, "text": "亚洲文化比较内敛，不喜欢露脸，主要还是长得不太方便", "created_at": "2025-12-06T04:52:21", "owner": "bao630617", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142449946437643, "text": "我第一次用ig看到除了中国人大多数人都是用自己的照片当头像，我非常震惊🤭🤭", "created_at": "2025-10-27T01:29:29", "owner": "v.v_biao", "likes": 95}, {"id": 17999359526838592, "text": "It is very weird…. I am in a huge chat room and no one uses their pics either… and when they do, it is filtered with bunny ears and other weird stuff. I also don’t get it…. 为什么？", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:27:58", "owner": "alilisalot", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17958520160865366, "text": "因為中國的治安很糟糕", "created_at": "2025-10-22T03:23:37", "owner": "willie820914", "likes": 124}, {"id": 18060264953279956, "text": "@moztrk3 his Chinese 👏", "created_at": "2025-12-12T15:00:18", "owner": "0033w2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18388399360178562, "text": "1,400,000,000人不是每个人都有高颜值。外国虽人少，但个个都是精品。 就是一种物以稀为贵的感觉。", "created_at": "2025-12-11T14:02:45", "owner": "turtle.6022677", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18020968214786779, "text": "保护自己的隐私同时彰显自己的个性，我就觉得这个小猫能表达我的社交态度", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:36:55", "owner": "yilianmmm", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17897726430343048, "text": "我覺得用自己相片很醜很丟臉，我沒那麼有自信，不想讓陌生人知道我長怎樣，而且我用動漫頭像比現生更容易交到朋友，所以我都用動漫角色當頭像還比較好看（但我不是中國人", "created_at": "2025-11-21T02:29:12", "owner": "li01_27", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18063242183181064, "text": "用自己做头像 别人会觉得你很自恋", "created_at": "2025-11-11T06:32:19", "owner": "catcat7970", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18127558372506344, "text": "我的头像多好看🥸", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:16:04", "owner": "wu_chihyuan10", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17847753501614940, "text": "用自己当头像总觉得攻击力不够🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:35:00", "owner": "m1345714397", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18543434410040992, "text": "你認識我會知道我是誰，不認識何必知道我是誰", "created_at": "2025-10-23T19:37:15", "owner": "wai_tsang", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18076716665242651, "text": "@d1yi_0420", "created_at": "2025-12-08T07:35:07", "owner": "chengcloria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083703967781858, "text": "隐私", "created_at": "2025-10-23T14:31:14", "owner": "eric_yingwaijeun", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18075221576210343, "text": "那我这个算什么？", "created_at": "2025-12-07T15:22:39", "owner": "pxhuang_0828", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17931338733110359, "text": "我在外国平台听外国人说中文🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-18T02:56:43", "owner": "gaoyifei85", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17973964439970037, "text": "If I look pretty...", "created_at": "2025-12-07T07:36:25", "owner": "xiejinglan83", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056279969326801, "text": "Yes，I am Bokuto.🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-05T15:56:50", "owner": "liyi31318", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18114460141571425, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-12-05T15:12:05", "owner": "tianming111123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050724314356327, "text": "中国人怕暴露自己的隐私", "created_at": "2025-11-11T07:22:32", "owner": "futureeyescarlights", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17864010978494101, "text": "比如我个人的原因是因为我长相不漂亮，所以不可以用自己的照片作为头像", "created_at": "2025-10-23T12:34:20", "owner": "dora_q_q", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18493244407072342, "text": "因為這個頭像比我的照片好😊", "created_at": "2025-12-03T13:41:55", "owner": "bellatseng_102415", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050844521339163, "text": "embarrassed", "created_at": "2025-10-24T14:51:59", "owner": "uno13_1_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18086163272069998, "text": "因为爱所以爱 头像不是拿来感慨", "created_at": "2025-12-03T06:26:40", "owner": "melissajenkins1986", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18029546123751815, "text": "主要是想保护隐私！感觉用自己的照片当头像很不安全", "created_at": "2025-12-03T06:18:58", "owner": "xiangsunaigai", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18116395831562744, "text": "因为我不自信", "created_at": "2025-12-03T05:45:53", "owner": "tzx1305", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17903964639295528, "text": "用自己照片穿正装像卖保险的.....", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:15:29", "owner": "alasmssji", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100427149789595, "text": "Because there will be some embarrassment.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T15:55:04", "owner": "dear_liu.love", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088739134772252, "text": "用自己照片当头像，不会有一种在裸奔的感觉吗", "created_at": "2025-12-02T15:46:16", "owner": "lucky0122_lars0421", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17926382313038800, "text": "因为用自己头像谁敢加你啊？", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:14:29", "owner": "meiqilin65", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18026825357581103, "text": "因为用自己的照片感觉很自恋😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:50:09", "owner": "baixue4876", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17966215901843514, "text": "因为我们比较注重隐私，不想让陌生人看到我们", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:52:49", "owner": "ig_jinipark", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18099948703702083, "text": "这是我的猫猫头", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:02:43", "owner": "louise26_zz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17927513181142295, "text": "因为这东西好看啊", "created_at": "2025-11-03T13:58:59", "owner": "giqi_ush", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18001619198665603, "text": "很简单，因为不好意思", "created_at": "2025-10-21T23:32:59", "owner": "later_album", "likes": 117}, {"id": 18086038498938105, "text": "而且名字都是奇奇怪怪點名字⋯還會三不五時更改⋯", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:06:46", "owner": "_yuna________", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18411477364188362, "text": "用自己照片那不什么什么销售或者保险的吗🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:58:15", "owner": "mikumo616", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17912431254249614, "text": "怕用自己的照片你们爱上我", "created_at": "2025-11-16T14:28:19", "owner": "changqing231", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18102027244728265, "text": "哈哈，太真实👏", "created_at": "2025-11-07T02:10:01", "owner": "mrs_jiang", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17869912083395225, "text": "用自己当头像都不用开了", "created_at": "2025-11-25T04:47:09", "owner": "leisiquankending", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18043219505438367, "text": "许多人都在抹黑中国，那么我就不惯着你们这些评论区里面，很多的恶意的人大多数都在说中国的这个不好，那个不好，好吧，你看一下我的头像怎么样呢？我就是使用自己的真实头像，不管是微信还是QQ，我都是这样子的。", "created_at": "2025-10-23T21:10:20", "owner": "alanchem2017", "likes": 46}, {"id": 18025326890587831, "text": "用自己的头像很尴尬,感觉很自恋", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:23:46", "owner": "yujinqiu601", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17925524319147449, "text": "最早的社交软件QQ下线后头像是灰色的，如果用自己的照片，在中国人看来不吉利，于是就不用真人", "created_at": "2025-10-27T05:32:22", "owner": "deliecthuina", "likes": 12}, {"id": 17873742264448999, "text": "用自己的头像会被朋友笑话🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-20T18:13:24", "owner": "lh34062", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932996680153409, "text": "用自己的照片当头像比较像诈骗😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:30:14", "owner": "djheyou", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076204496127135, "text": "中国只有买保险的和推销房地产的用自己的照片当头像", "created_at": "2025-10-24T05:59:11", "owner": "lesliehu576", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18406955992141788, "text": "你可以穿西裝手交叉 會看起來像個房仲", "created_at": "2025-10-27T03:13:40", "owner": "gtrealname35xd", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17918126310212488, "text": "西方总体比较性格外向，东方性格比较内敛", "created_at": "2025-11-22T20:15:59", "owner": "emily_video1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068508518366353, "text": "哈哈哈哈因为我们没有那么real🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:24:09", "owner": "haiya7573", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18125706268512621, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈因为有的中国人一言不合就会攻击你的长相 所以不用自己的头像别人就不知道你长什么样子 从而就不会攻击你", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:01:13", "owner": "fzdnx_01", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18502663879078067, "text": "我们比较含蓄😬", "created_at": "2025-11-18T14:56:37", "owner": "leijiqiong_leia", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18058396448636771, "text": "中国一般销售才会用自己的头像当照片", "created_at": "2025-11-21T06:56:49", "owner": "zjjin8309", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096668896775211, "text": "主要怕被盗用吧", "created_at": "2025-10-23T23:11:36", "owner": "bcwny2088", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18083524481490870, "text": "哈喽，买保险吗？", "created_at": "2025-10-26T06:51:57", "owner": "adamleesy2", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18179940481358240, "text": "新赛道，新方向，海外项目，有兴趣的可以滴滴", "created_at": "2025-11-20T12:36:11", "owner": "xiaokan173", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078911912134769, "text": "是在说我么？", "created_at": "2025-11-19T11:59:51", "owner": "hou_ppd", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17902457706298698, "text": "因为用自己的头像，别人才能看出你帅不帅，漂不漂亮，不帅不漂亮的话就不搭理你。", "created_at": "2025-11-18T22:27:31", "owner": "wol1696", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18130189225496153, "text": "因为我长得像答辩", "created_at": "2025-11-16T19:26:02", "owner": "reson_ance1", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17928592443137662, "text": "骂人容易被开户", "created_at": "2025-11-18T14:01:42", "owner": "lilw75670", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073249622205122, "text": "心理问题，见不得光的心理。。还是就是，公开让别人看到他照片，仿佛要了他的命似的。。。🔥🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-18T03:16:28", "owner": "thanwa.pan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18157671958359481, "text": "那為什麼你們要用自己的照片", "created_at": "2025-10-28T11:34:21", "owner": "lynn22923", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106341277728744, "text": "因为长得不方便 不自信🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-13T15:05:48", "owner": "aqiu6945", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18554974723061199, "text": "因为你用自己的脸别人会觉得你自恋老土", "created_at": "2025-12-13T15:05:44", "owner": "_un1c0rny.spam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18292495663278136, "text": "我用小狗当头像", "created_at": "2025-12-13T14:59:31", "owner": "sunkissed_chenpi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082487795148625, "text": "你的中文很不错", "created_at": "2025-12-13T14:19:19", "owner": "heyuxin8347", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069509654609603, "text": "因为丑😢", "created_at": "2025-12-13T14:15:36", "owner": "moralesandres80889", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961760775870163, "text": "难道只有90后喜欢用自己照片当头像吗？", "created_at": "2025-12-13T13:53:00", "owner": "5yichen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030582350558091, "text": "像上班的，比如买保险做号", "created_at": "2025-12-13T13:23:02", "owner": "sujiani11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973076985971443, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-13T12:32:30", "owner": "chcbm7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083567555033066, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-12-13T12:12:22", "owner": "danielmaya414966", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081921716164175, "text": "長的好看會被說是照騙，不好看又會被笑，有些好看，有些不好看，那還是會有鍵盤俠去噴", "created_at": "2025-12-13T12:01:09", "owner": "ob_0186", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17945351193077029, "text": "中国用自己照片当头像感觉容易被骗🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-13T11:32:20", "owner": "baily_yby_yuxin99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077649338192280, "text": "上面还要加个圣诞帽", "created_at": "2025-12-13T10:44:05", "owner": "wanderer4.18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066462119435490, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-13T10:19:46", "owner": "wgw412725", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083352593322343, "text": "我也是在用外网时才用自己的头像，WeChat随心情而定不停地换网图，哈哈哈哈。", "created_at": "2025-12-13T08:28:04", "owner": "cathy.li16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092254220505095, "text": "你好", "created_at": "2025-12-13T08:15:55", "owner": "1pearl546", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095742121856432, "text": "我想骂你🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-13T06:17:06", "owner": "tongxin7462", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848735245586054, "text": "因为互联网的精神。从你接入互联网开始，就没有用自己的照片。在大陆用自己的照片，那基本上都是要管你收钱的。", "created_at": "2025-12-13T03:43:35", "owner": "niububu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109979518559417, "text": "我们中国人的脾气就是这样", "created_at": "2025-12-13T02:43:54", "owner": "tianleyeya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18529692847065730, "text": "因为注重隐私", "created_at": "2025-12-13T02:32:15", "owner": "sawubona_u", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987360294871117, "text": "保护个人隐私", "created_at": "2025-12-13T02:16:51", "owner": "wakaoabs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081986126275954, "text": "好看，用自己喜欢的名人，事物，风景做头像会有好的心情，对自己长相满意也会用自己的照片做头像，中国人比较腼腆。", "created_at": "2025-12-13T01:25:02", "owner": "sixgod87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18512506381071394, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T00:05:11", "owner": "dropping.angrybird", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120477790541920, "text": "嘶，真是", "created_at": "2025-12-12T22:30:03", "owner": "hittip_1028", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081641768136885, "text": "不造啊🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-12T19:00:51", "owner": "st1349938", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061623374556328, "text": "因为外国人比较自信", "created_at": "2025-12-12T18:03:59", "owner": "lq912412754", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032800592541027, "text": "个人隐私吧，不方便当头像", "created_at": "2025-12-12T16:20:34", "owner": "dal11kyrie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087356807478766, "text": "用自己头像不能做键盘侠", "created_at": "2025-12-12T15:50:48", "owner": "ls2052631057", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121489624536178, "text": "@gloriapeng0514", "created_at": "2025-12-12T15:20:10", "owner": "gabriele24849", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927400477172877, "text": "我是自己的", "created_at": "2025-12-12T14:39:10", "owner": "uliya713_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087974018054839, "text": "每个国家的风格都不一样，各有不同。", "created_at": "2025-12-12T14:21:16", "owner": "yangali.805", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885382237410105, "text": "因为骗子多和容貌自卑", "created_at": "2025-12-12T13:59:49", "owner": "jdifijene", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904959367312610, "text": "不是，单纯我自己长得比较抱歉", "created_at": "2025-12-12T13:20:49", "owner": "zhang_cihua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066915191627495, "text": "在中国用你自己做头像你被攻击的时候会有很多犀利的语言更多的还是不好意思", "created_at": "2025-12-12T12:43:38", "owner": "yukong739", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075199634010649, "text": "微信都用网图，怕被人说自恋。", "created_at": "2025-12-12T11:03:01", "owner": "vivianyaman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050435111415863, "text": "谁规定要用自己的照片才是好的，见得多用不用真照片都能记得住，见得少又何必用真照片", "created_at": "2025-12-12T10:39:21", "owner": "wenduof", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067768742384466, "text": "因為在現實中不方便說的話和做的事情，可以在網上實現。\n比如我想讓別人叫我慕容狗蛋，但是我姓李🤣\n這是一種精神追求的寄託。", "created_at": "2025-12-12T09:54:24", "owner": "susanajk8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105331804579692, "text": "yes", "created_at": "2025-12-12T08:30:55", "owner": "wangbin5507", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18432344494129074, "text": "中国大陆禁止使用美国软件", "created_at": "2025-12-12T08:01:40", "owner": "garyliu112", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905921581311967, "text": "知道就好了👏", "created_at": "2025-12-12T07:13:18", "owner": "ww1639625", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18382670221144306, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-12T06:33:47", "owner": "tansongsong5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18307536574267625, "text": "我要是长得好看，所有平台都用自己头像了", "created_at": "2025-12-12T05:01:22", "owner": "bilnil36", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085838243098565, "text": "用自己当头像的只有销售😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T04:43:17", "owner": "zexiovo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145219576446146, "text": "因为用自己照片的看起来很好骗", "created_at": "2025-12-12T03:56:04", "owner": "yzzzzzz316", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102618745740321, "text": "用自己的要么中介，要么保险公司，要么一系列", "created_at": "2025-12-12T03:35:15", "owner": "zhang_chenyu552", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18552761362055617, "text": "因为生活中认识自己的人都已经知道自己长什么样，不认识的没必要让别人知道自己长什么样", "created_at": "2025-12-12T03:20:04", "owner": "lioncat802", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18168174118345554, "text": "因为我的建模长的不是很方便😢", "created_at": "2025-12-12T03:17:26", "owner": "fuyufeng31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881452267428382, "text": "哈哈哈，颜值不够，不好意思！", "created_at": "2025-12-12T02:45:46", "owner": "qinghua7692", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048587291447991, "text": "外國人也有很多用二次元啊", "created_at": "2025-12-12T02:24:20", "owner": "jpegvnot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981967023941552, "text": "因为长得丑", "created_at": "2025-12-12T01:35:08", "owner": "pain_fetish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988660608916963, "text": "because Chinese traditions", "created_at": "2025-12-12T01:10:00", "owner": "shipianyee041", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858005488511347, "text": "因为比较有容貌焦虑！", "created_at": "2025-12-12T00:52:20", "owner": "130hothorse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18549100660028146, "text": "其实也有，银行业务，卖保险的，房产中介都用自己本人当头像", "created_at": "2025-12-12T00:42:40", "owner": "vaguelynoble", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906760996141809, "text": "當然是建模原因啦", "created_at": "2025-12-12T00:24:52", "owner": "ice0.77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18427806769119450, "text": "在中国用真人头像容易开户…", "created_at": "2025-12-11T20:35:50", "owner": "gliang_feng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18371483866083559, "text": "容貌焦慮", "created_at": "2025-12-11T18:58:30", "owner": "magicdarker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087918128073137, "text": "because i'm ugly", "created_at": "2025-12-11T18:05:27", "owner": "dakezardbeijixiong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069885707095736, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-12-11T16:18:22", "owner": "forti_s77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18549664084005141, "text": "评论区笑不活了🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-11T15:31:57", "owner": "yuniny_aiu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073117652595416, "text": "哈哈我不行了是的没错", "created_at": "2025-12-11T14:35:45", "owner": "hey86058", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18571822411008127, "text": "用自己头像 还怎么做网络喷子 哈哈", "created_at": "2025-12-11T14:06:29", "owner": "devilmessager", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931368274013349, "text": "Like me😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T14:04:43", "owner": "rainyu626", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18245798095289719, "text": "已经习惯了", "created_at": "2025-12-11T13:23:27", "owner": "pengweibo5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898537594348069, "text": "因为丑", "created_at": "2025-12-11T10:05:32", "owner": "claire70013", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018386534620666, "text": "真的容易被开户，不利于吵架🤣不用头像都有机会被开户，用头像更容易被开户了🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-11T09:53:54", "owner": "guojiangzc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064518029444979, "text": "我微信用自己照片当头像 但是被人网暴的时候就很尴尬就换了", "created_at": "2025-12-11T07:58:23", "owner": "chenlan170", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931266154014856, "text": "因为拍不明白", "created_at": "2025-12-11T07:26:57", "owner": "humingxiang066", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028522127578967, "text": "我爸妈会用自己的照片做头像我的头像是我自己画的🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-11T07:06:52", "owner": "xiaosuococo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100964824755078, "text": "大部原因是因为尴尬", "created_at": "2025-12-11T06:56:57", "owner": "williamjonyjony", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030578042766210, "text": "因为自己长得不太方便🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-11T06:37:35", "owner": "matxyneyash", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110332642537391, "text": "用自己当头像会很奇怪，可能是想法不同，我觉得如果我顶着自己的脸上网，就失去了互联网大家都是过路人的意义😢", "created_at": "2025-12-11T04:17:13", "owner": "yatara2412", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071673206523888, "text": "国外也有很多人不用自己照片当头像啊，怎么就文化差异上了，如果你的工作有需要那你肯定要拿自己当头像，但是平时上上网有人会用自己照片吗，外网也很多年轻人不会用自己当头像啊，fb的中老年人还", "created_at": "2025-12-11T03:58:23", "owner": "zixuan_1129", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18330749971211494, "text": "你在哪，燕子", "created_at": "2025-12-11T03:35:47", "owner": "liyunzhang655", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096321058881671, "text": "评论区全是中国人", "created_at": "2025-12-11T03:24:44", "owner": "li6973161", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878074171349822, "text": "因为我们比较喜欢在正式工作或者场合需要的时候用自己的头像", "created_at": "2025-12-11T03:24:22", "owner": "li6973161", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066298739447354, "text": "因为是微信，不能全信", "created_at": "2025-12-11T01:12:56", "owner": "vd1387092", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883446784304594, "text": "因为我丑…", "created_at": "2025-12-11T00:54:21", "owner": "csh_aurora", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012961469642142, "text": "我一个外国人用自己的照片，他们就觉得我是个骗子😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T00:44:37", "owner": "8ij3_june", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104755519656662, "text": "我会用自己的头像啊", "created_at": "2025-12-10T23:30:45", "owner": "songyuncai008", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18332762800216000, "text": "因为互联网兴起社交软件是从MySpace和", "created_at": "2025-12-10T21:10:51", "owner": "fictional_jenn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136509592476614, "text": "@nianan730", "created_at": "2025-12-10T18:41:19", "owner": "schordinger1107", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087944668989704, "text": "因为长的不方便😏", "created_at": "2025-12-10T18:35:56", "owner": "dlhz_xlxy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102411595666682, "text": "因为不好看😢", "created_at": "2025-12-10T18:12:40", "owner": "he335309947", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077095289232271, "text": "because I'm not confident for myself😢", "created_at": "2025-12-10T18:08:11", "owner": "benbenjiang77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105732124679139, "text": "哈哈哈一点没错", "created_at": "2025-12-10T15:15:57", "owner": "penn_in_australia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18384313924150050, "text": "用自己的才像騙子", "created_at": "2025-12-10T15:00:43", "owner": "roseovorosie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960872139874517, "text": "您要保险吗", "created_at": "2025-12-10T14:28:12", "owner": "zhouguanyu1246", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18424546414113976, "text": "都可以的，不过把自己喜欢的动漫或者明星或者好看的风景当作头像，其实也算是个人爱好性格的展示，可选择更多，不只是自己的脸，而且确实不太自信，用好看的照片，别人会盯着照片研究这是不是本人，或者研究是不是美颜照片😮", "created_at": "2025-12-10T14:20:00", "owner": "wangyuanxiao0115", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114197497592144, "text": "我是做銷售的🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-10T14:04:56", "owner": "alexander625102", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995651694893505, "text": "为什么要用自己的照片？不会泄露隐私吗？而且头像有时候能显示成分，更能找到同好", "created_at": "2025-12-10T13:41:46", "owner": "hustu231", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027428363717113, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-12-10T13:13:20", "owner": "kang123456199", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089591363485010, "text": "我是中國人想找一位外國女友😭", "created_at": "2025-12-10T11:18:13", "owner": "quail.3185721", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084715741842840, "text": "Because that's our personality not just a profile", "created_at": "2025-12-10T08:24:50", "owner": "freelin9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095299651897001, "text": "its hard to find a photo that better than my cat", "created_at": "2025-12-10T06:50:03", "owner": "a2002330zzx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18162082567398742, "text": "社恐", "created_at": "2025-12-10T06:19:32", "owner": "jooo.ooooooooooooooooooooooooy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070599215371565, "text": "早期QQ下线头像会变灰不吉利", "created_at": "2025-12-10T06:13:29", "owner": "xiaozhon1906", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870898540477036, "text": "我的也是自己的", "created_at": "2025-12-10T05:56:37", "owner": "muzi97153", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953673763027918, "text": "我倒是很好奇为什么有些外国人实名上网😂不怕泄露信息吗", "created_at": "2025-12-10T05:37:02", "owner": "dragon.357234", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353083210164262, "text": "好像大部分用自己头像的都是销售", "created_at": "2025-12-10T04:46:57", "owner": "xnbe99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988789587912653, "text": "我用ins发现老外都是用真名，但我不想用，于是就写了个自己的姓氏🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-10T03:33:34", "owner": "the_felix_ji", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101140318806557, "text": "We are not confident 😢", "created_at": "2025-12-10T00:44:42", "owner": "6273.8y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109799041619556, "text": "谁说的🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-10T00:03:28", "owner": "bbnf67993", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989058441747055, "text": "因为中国人都很虚伪，不诚实", "created_at": "2025-12-09T23:27:07", "owner": "0810hjb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060456131252529, "text": "好像聽說每個人在網路上都會找一張適合自己外貌個性還是形象的圖來當自己的網圖", "created_at": "2025-12-09T18:17:17", "owner": "q18667mo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981138726945529, "text": "Shut up we dun use this shit", "created_at": "2025-12-09T17:58:00", "owner": "xxfeiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014894711801942, "text": "在中国一般用自己做头像都是中介做销售的。", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:55:01", "owner": "wzihaosb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850250548604730, "text": "含蓄和展现自己的喜好或偏爱，让他人给自己一个初步了解，而不是容貌。展现出来的比容貌展现出来的耿显真实", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:54:11", "owner": "aspecial12138", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091404623492522, "text": "我的头像就是我自己的照片", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:33:51", "owner": "carol.ine5092", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089626159939387, "text": "作为一名中国人我也不知道为什么", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:57:06", "owner": "jingzhihui8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003085328683060, "text": "中国人用自己的头像当照片主要有两种情况：1️⃣年龄大的人2️⃣销售、在企业任职的员工等统一要求", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:36:13", "owner": "xiaoxiaolong798", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18194901907332300, "text": "我就用自己的😂看我像不像骗子", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:04:16", "owner": "xurui0818", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136639807424762, "text": "习惯啦～老QQ黑白头像难看死了，不如风景照", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:24:22", "owner": "force_beryllium_zman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068242121625462, "text": "因为害怕用自己照片把全部人都攻略了", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:41:42", "owner": "nihao30607", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076307120196458, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:23:04", "owner": "zouqi174", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080182673164897, "text": "用自己的照片像中介", "created_at": "2025-12-09T06:57:13", "owner": "paoliu57", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075067502340367, "text": "怕被网暴", "created_at": "2025-12-09T06:34:27", "owner": "ycc023m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100651591774696, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T05:56:51", "owner": "binghongcha523", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089082799780866, "text": "因为觉得自己不好看", "created_at": "2025-12-09T05:26:18", "owner": "fangpinglin3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137212558464500, "text": "因为不够自信", "created_at": "2025-12-09T03:39:55", "owner": "jeyanccc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877670797355280, "text": "笑死我了😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T03:36:00", "owner": "maimai53761", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103480486663178, "text": "用自己的头像的，要么是推销的，要么是颜值高的", "created_at": "2025-12-09T02:17:25", "owner": "badsheldonv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084677081010324, "text": "因为中国人不够自信", "created_at": "2025-12-09T01:03:58", "owner": "pianpian191", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183738613356337, "text": "Chinese culture is more shy,", "created_at": "2025-12-08T22:26:11", "owner": "soryyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931910179011741, "text": "不用", "created_at": "2025-12-08T21:12:22", "owner": "lijie72378", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929094034160429, "text": "因为用自己头像很容易被恶搞，因为中国的法律很不健全。你拿他们没办法", "created_at": "2025-12-08T18:54:25", "owner": "w756895", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899048560345710, "text": "因为用自己很正式的图片感觉在做营销工作", "created_at": "2025-12-08T18:13:14", "owner": "bearzitai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926487433036077, "text": "因为杰哥太帅了", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:10:43", "owner": "haux_492", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984579243767111, "text": "这不是我的头像，是我的网络面具😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:00:06", "owner": "licheng.zuo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109848652617909, "text": "用自己头像的才是骗子", "created_at": "2025-12-08T14:48:13", "owner": "y2jbeatz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352667974203521, "text": "因为当你用自己的照片做头像，大家会觉得你很自恋😂当然，长得好看就无所谓了", "created_at": "2025-12-08T13:37:33", "owner": "kaming__van", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185964391356560, "text": "因为外国人他自信😑", "created_at": "2025-12-08T13:25:20", "owner": "yueyan211", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092524111914386, "text": "因为其他的好看", "created_at": "2025-12-08T12:22:38", "owner": "tianmanqingjie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903825064164027, "text": "在中国不能随便讲话", "created_at": "2025-12-08T11:28:01", "owner": "liufei7370", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055614551326519, "text": "不自信加社交不安全感🌝", "created_at": "2025-12-08T10:54:41", "owner": "karlsongao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161941579403460, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-08T09:53:25", "owner": "zhihaocn01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070347074579336, "text": "骂人的时候不太适合用自己的照片", "created_at": "2025-12-08T09:31:33", "owner": "runtu_and_luxun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856277059525305, "text": "现在AI生成这么厉害，更加不敢用自己的脸和声音了，怕被用来诈骗受害", "created_at": "2025-12-08T09:24:02", "owner": "mjo19810824", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111732202607147, "text": "河南骗子", "created_at": "2025-12-08T08:45:46", "owner": "1781101402a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052588205661723, "text": "因为他们害羞😳", "created_at": "2025-12-08T08:01:08", "owner": "liukeqiang250", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866197576513945, "text": "在中国，其实用自己照片的才像骗子🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-08T07:32:34", "owner": "rock78236", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945727666081023, "text": "Westerners pay more attention to privacy, and why they put their own photos as profile?", "created_at": "2025-12-08T07:12:28", "owner": "yi05.18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093350182917247, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T05:52:06", "owner": "lisa.70204", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061871726236345, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-08T05:51:57", "owner": "lisa.70204", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100425421616148, "text": "为什么你的认知会局限在用自己的照片当头像，就不是骗子了？为什么你的兼容性会停滞在社交账号的头像上？这难道不意味着，你处于深深的分裂之中吗？意识提升一下吧。", "created_at": "2025-12-08T03:59:42", "owner": "eagene_lee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067445468140857, "text": "可能长的不太方便，一般出片的才能用作我的头像", "created_at": "2025-12-08T03:21:22", "owner": "wang_yunjinn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844015612632689, "text": "😢普遍长的不方便", "created_at": "2025-12-08T03:07:37", "owner": "jiayi53159", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086426719994471, "text": "我是骗子？？？？？😮", "created_at": "2025-12-07T23:49:56", "owner": "xue.666.666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047755058692491, "text": "如果说长的好看的人用自己当头像。那不得被骚扰死", "created_at": "2025-12-07T19:39:59", "owner": "yangjiali623", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088146667800102, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T19:15:24", "owner": "xianerj16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954800628900706, "text": "關你撚事", "created_at": "2025-12-07T18:04:54", "owner": "williamng5305", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917860252213854, "text": "哈哈", "created_at": "2025-12-07T15:40:44", "owner": "anan_200011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18402158485192696, "text": "不只是中国，基本上华人都一样，刻在基因里的诈骗（本人马来西亚华裔", "created_at": "2025-12-07T15:01:01", "owner": "realjerrychew526", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031247135750981, "text": "哈哈，真的是", "created_at": "2025-12-07T12:40:14", "owner": "jiangxinxin960", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861481030549268, "text": "你听说过长像违规吗", "created_at": "2025-12-07T11:54:14", "owner": "meowgic24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070744601525835, "text": "騙子才是真的", "created_at": "2025-12-07T11:21:33", "owner": "chiaseeds95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855654853578571, "text": "因为不方便", "created_at": "2025-12-07T09:47:24", "owner": "hanshuangshuang77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080363327332728, "text": "因为长得很像彭于晏常让别人自卑所以不用。而且在我们中国用本人当头像的都是销售不是销售就是地产🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-07T09:36:35", "owner": "zixi753", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104017639734683, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-07T07:19:35", "owner": "elegantman.li", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066073607569260, "text": "我用的自己头像呀", "created_at": "2025-12-07T06:34:07", "owner": "judyzt0710", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18170622028378845, "text": "自己的图片做头像感觉每次和别人回信息就羞耻🌚", "created_at": "2025-12-07T06:31:35", "owner": "azrizz2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936899023105594, "text": "因为感觉像卖保险的", "created_at": "2025-12-07T05:55:43", "owner": "sanziro.ing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073745594582909, "text": "You're right.", "created_at": "2025-12-07T05:49:09", "owner": "dong.zhu11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069161879103821, "text": "因为长得不太方便", "created_at": "2025-12-07T05:25:00", "owner": "flora23456789", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848792857609500, "text": "用自己的照片，一般都会说自恋", "created_at": "2025-12-07T04:31:40", "owner": "lalisayusiger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076481210208909, "text": "当你的图片被人p成死图你就明白了🤔", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:21:07", "owner": "xiaobao41728", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087633718971297, "text": "用自己的照片像自恋鬼🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:17:01", "owner": "echo.2309", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353245852166067, "text": "对自己的长相不自信。。。", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:03:59", "owner": "sunssy_xiaoxi.swiftie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844625113628210, "text": "因为通常只有销售或中介用自己照片当头像", "created_at": "2025-12-07T00:10:39", "owner": "williamxuhenry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18197705128323318, "text": "我只會在學校的平台用自己的相片當頭貼因為顯得比較專業", "created_at": "2025-12-06T23:15:45", "owner": "ruoyutimyuan820", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908471671273028, "text": "因为丑", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:41:16", "owner": "jliuuulili", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075641870206031, "text": "网络太发达  所以基本不用自己的头像", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:35:50", "owner": "bkpp5202", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000903317828121, "text": "可能比较像卖保险的", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:01:58", "owner": "kftyeridsx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119455717555232, "text": "😁", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:04:03", "owner": "fjt._.ace", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148876822437917, "text": "我妈不让", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:54:29", "owner": "x34542368", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845860279600422, "text": "我们国家一般用本人头像的都是销售", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:16:38", "owner": "marnie66280", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110582230613462, "text": "不实在 不自信", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:03:34", "owner": "jingoooshan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540851470051772, "text": "年纪大了后就不用自己头像了", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:58:42", "owner": "kervan_ma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945146596072968, "text": "满族人统治的两百多年让这些汉人失去了自信", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:29:45", "owner": "jason_fyx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948041305065778, "text": "用自己头像的路过", "created_at": "2025-12-06T13:10:56", "owner": "zhaohan.wang.522", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18316746667222547, "text": "台灣用自己的照片做頭像都是騙", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:41:42", "owner": "cho_jay123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18401044951130404, "text": "在中国用自己的照片不是卖保险的就是中介", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:21:55", "owner": "xieryada", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18355316266161192, "text": "因為自己覺得自己長得醜😢", "created_at": "2025-12-06T11:46:55", "owner": "anmixiu06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154756963375199, "text": "这也不对呀，我用的就是自己的头像啊", "created_at": "2025-12-06T11:31:41", "owner": "w_sj110101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081258902137063, "text": "怕被骗", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:27:32", "owner": "mengmeng734", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121211923537513, "text": "现世宝", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:05:48", "owner": "longlongago915", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070974572580472, "text": "评论区跟我刷抖音似的怎么全是汉字🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-06T08:48:27", "owner": "yijiec610", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986002002926580, "text": "用自己的头像容易被骗", "created_at": "2025-12-06T07:50:57", "owner": "lingjiuyier912", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052462853345024, "text": "第一个就是长得不太方便 第二个是用自己照片更像诈骗🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-06T07:25:56", "owner": "emery0603", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111514906613208, "text": "一般用自己头像的都是销售", "created_at": "2025-12-06T04:14:30", "owner": "adu57452", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842193244642710, "text": "卖保险的🤣还有销售", "created_at": "2025-12-06T04:08:59", "owner": "xiaopan128", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943155859088691, "text": "为什么要用你自己的照片？有人问你吗？每个人都有选择自己头像的权利", "created_at": "2025-12-06T03:44:13", "owner": "sark2801", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884293645410592, "text": "有的话也是照骗", "created_at": "2025-12-06T02:51:42", "owner": "xling0914", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064312793573567, "text": "要是长得好看肯定用了。", "created_at": "2025-12-06T00:09:35", "owner": "xieyanfeng2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085767815058251, "text": "Because it’s not safe in China!", "created_at": "2025-12-05T23:46:34", "owner": "paul_xxyzc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078423170236736, "text": "有的人比较保护隐私，不想让陌生人看见我们的脸，头像这种东西自己怎么开心怎么来呗，小问题", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:59:04", "owner": "fairytt_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133294894489862, "text": "我只在脸书用自己照片，微信就算了", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:37:04", "owner": "qianrockqian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107124502638515, "text": "用自己的頭像，萬一太帥，被人盜用怎麼辦？", "created_at": "2025-12-05T20:33:13", "owner": "omegafishchip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913936288100402, "text": "抽象，卡通，悲伤，cp，动漫，可爱，花花草草，动物，大概就是这些了。", "created_at": "2025-12-05T16:59:19", "owner": "yangyu_favorite", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071662223072713, "text": "自己用自己照片太非主流😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T16:58:34", "owner": "z20200124", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135796969470976, "text": "因为用自己头像的，一看就是像那种销售😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T15:47:48", "owner": "zx19836739202", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18379905388196728, "text": "中国人都是骗子🥳", "created_at": "2025-12-05T15:29:09", "owner": "ssl181810", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18372205624155280, "text": "因为我长的很安全", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:10:54", "owner": "xieshipeng24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970256037823264, "text": "用自己頭像會被別人p圖，而且中國人對自己樣貌普遍會有些自卑", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:13:22", "owner": "jiangjiangjiang0211", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303565594264116, "text": "因为会被我的好兄弟做成emoji", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:54:07", "owner": "jiaozhifish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087066586989510, "text": "主要是没脸见人🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:42:13", "owner": "huangmiaozhi2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091882610495598, "text": "你说呢", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:56:24", "owner": "yangchangmei26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993620868892641, "text": "感觉用自己当头像很尴尬", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:23:33", "owner": "_kitttty.12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18335999602231529, "text": "用自己的头像好傻的样子🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:25:30", "owner": "amanda0909xjc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924402553189506, "text": "I think that's because people are more concerned about protecting their privacy and don't want to reveal what they look like.😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:46:15", "owner": "shawn12lee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087108406961757, "text": "哈哈哈因为不够自信", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:55:05", "owner": "xieyvxi10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916704931234969, "text": "@krien2walnut 快拿自己美照当头像，咱都出国了", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:37:22", "owner": "mr.changfen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052776071657988, "text": "我们都喜欢用自己喜欢的图片当头像", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:22:18", "owner": "lk_777771", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084086927031547, "text": "因为会被兄弟批成表情包😮", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:53:40", "owner": "ailis67971", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071140034613649, "text": "因为有些傻逼的同学会P图---王天赐.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:50:50", "owner": "duanyinqin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048137570438306, "text": "因为会被人说很自恋", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:24:44", "owner": "ymy513148", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18351186796207411, "text": "用了会被人说自恋", "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:41:35", "owner": "imunu932", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013833032801389, "text": "因为长得比较丑会影响观感😅", "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:23:29", "owner": "ecien_en", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079900318916896, "text": "那咋啦！", "created_at": "2025-12-04T11:18:23", "owner": "zwenshu1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918208765214118, "text": "1.因为可能自己不好看。2.照片放出来容易爆露身份信息。3.用别的照片也可能是自己喜欢的角色或者偶像，让别人更容易了解自己的爱好。还有一些其他原因因人而异吧", "created_at": "2025-12-04T11:09:37", "owner": "yang72416", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086643440066743, "text": "文化差异", "created_at": "2025-12-04T09:46:50", "owner": "ruc0517", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092917181504393, "text": "因为最早的社媒就是提供一些图片让你选择，所以养成了不用自己图片的习惯吧。", "created_at": "2025-12-04T08:50:48", "owner": "mo543427955", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045103292704983, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-04T08:10:05", "owner": "roger_tale", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329959285215965, "text": "这个真的是ins吗怎么全是中文", "created_at": "2025-12-04T08:04:46", "owner": "xiaoye6385", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079090106274757, "text": "哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-12-04T08:04:42", "owner": "xiaoye6385", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044257178703583, "text": "Because the long one is not particularly convenient, and then you may like the cartoon cute one.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T06:12:46", "owner": "anan.8315", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972737961976043, "text": "想用什么就用什么，因为有很多诈骗犯会提取你的面部", "created_at": "2025-12-04T05:42:23", "owner": "wang_xiu_wen_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17882201475424680, "text": "因为长得丑", "created_at": "2025-12-04T04:48:37", "owner": "en.bogeya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866077510434818, "text": "中国人戾气很大，素质很差，所以为了避免自己的评论惹祸上身，他们会选择隐蔽自己的信息", "created_at": "2025-12-04T04:43:50", "owner": "ahenuer6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948929470059416, "text": "他用自己照片当头像的，我会觉得他是卖保险的", "created_at": "2025-12-04T04:40:31", "owner": "xujing148", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060825668631343, "text": "喜欢用好看的照片当头像 如果用自己的话很没有安全感 感觉没什么隐私", "created_at": "2025-12-04T03:57:51", "owner": "yangsiqi147_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951563776053214, "text": "因为我长得丑你满意了吧，你个无情冷漠的人", "created_at": "2025-12-04T03:57:10", "owner": "anniiiiingg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546876373028176, "text": "我甚至用漫画改的自己，我知道自己长得都丑哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-12-04T03:41:57", "owner": "fishweremma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073081253209937, "text": "用自己的头像不会被别人拿走用ai做犯法的事吗", "created_at": "2025-12-04T03:15:42", "owner": "yueruuuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542693413053864, "text": "哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-12-04T02:58:50", "owner": "zhangyujia0109", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366580402093259, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-04T02:54:21", "owner": "fosonbuilding", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095320867881576, "text": "实名上网和现实社交有啥区别，我实名咋解放天性😮", "created_at": "2025-12-04T02:09:42", "owner": "jyu03500", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971047659970964, "text": "很尷尬唉", "created_at": "2025-12-04T00:33:21", "owner": "jiyan35903", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843877468628921, "text": "😂因为骗子太多，可以用你的头像干别的事情，那就不好了", "created_at": "2025-12-04T00:25:10", "owner": "lorenzomacchiaizzano777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984177156915096, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:55:54", "owner": "danny_hkno1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980952876780134, "text": "因為支那人醜啊😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:48:07", "owner": "w47282739", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980035896782313, "text": "主要是用这个头像的话很容易照到霸凌啊", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:14:26", "owner": "roboxethan090922k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957186967010872, "text": "I just use my own photo as my avatar.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:11:51", "owner": "zhangyi9532", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145987870434045, "text": "比較注重自己的隱私吧🤔畢竟自己的照片要是被人拿去P醜照多少會有點膈應", "created_at": "2025-12-03T17:44:14", "owner": "chanhonzi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331900243243492, "text": "我如果用自己的照片当头像会被认为我在放射某种信号，或者我没有安全感，似乎在被人围观，只有房产中介和销售、以及物业管家因为工作需要才用自己照片当头像。", "created_at": "2025-12-03T16:52:00", "owner": "gloria791030ping", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320982130168882, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈每個人性格不一樣吧", "created_at": "2025-12-03T15:24:09", "owner": "steven7579lee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18199226431323595, "text": "Using one's own photos can make people feel overconfident", "created_at": "2025-12-03T14:32:32", "owner": "sanitieta28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930880612134687, "text": "有的，政务微信是我自己的头像", "created_at": "2025-12-03T12:56:08", "owner": "yangmingshan85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098997046768406, "text": "Vào đọc bình luận thì đúng hầu hết các bạn người trung đều không dùng ảnh của mình làm avatar. 😮.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T11:54:59", "owner": "hi_minjun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18401814511123756, "text": "因为长的丑不好意思用自己照片做头像😢", "created_at": "2025-12-03T11:06:04", "owner": "xiaowu28457", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090217714980595, "text": "很羞耻^^显得我很自恋^^", "created_at": "2025-12-03T11:00:27", "owner": "whataboutbeibei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954111424043872, "text": "因为丑啊", "created_at": "2025-12-03T10:54:13", "owner": "color032", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962420358859701, "text": "保护隐私呀！我都想现在把我的头像给换了😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T10:50:54", "owner": "anglebless58", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110311117545225, "text": "哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-12-03T10:32:45", "owner": "leduo0904", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032754677737517, "text": "可能是因为隐私吧😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T10:25:16", "owner": "sales08apower", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087214076486818, "text": "用自己头像方便警察找的更快😆", "created_at": "2025-12-03T08:58:15", "owner": "mark_lee603", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089655289754155, "text": "因为美国的诈骗犯太多了，所以大家用自己的照片来博取信任表示自己没有恶意，就比如歪果人在打游戏的时候就不会用真人名字和头像了，", "created_at": "2025-12-03T07:57:48", "owner": "larappxa123456", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547817452020156, "text": "？", "created_at": "2025-12-03T04:50:09", "owner": "space888done", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010410884805348, "text": "因为我们中国人长得不够自信！", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:44:48", "owner": "loneiy69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994942338852833, "text": "因为怕丑", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:20:34", "owner": "luojun356", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865647157513670, "text": "我的头像是自己养的鹦鹉😍", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:11:57", "owner": "nicolemalone703", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949473043063486, "text": "为什么大部分繁体字的素质这么低？", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:42:28", "owner": "shang_james05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093013174923180, "text": "因为头像比我漂亮hhhh", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:06:20", "owner": "kunkun2597", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131099377491446, "text": "做人不能太自恋", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:04:27", "owner": "sunsunzhaoling", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18204441406317327, "text": "难道我的头像不酷吗😎", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:54:43", "owner": "kampferrrrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074307419522895, "text": "煞笔", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:36:49", "owner": "lzy520ttkx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979356210929689, "text": "因为我长得不帅，我有一点颜值焦虑😢", "created_at": "2025-12-02T15:48:08", "owner": "heyang2836", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087841720804326, "text": "看我這個頭像怎麼樣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T15:46:57", "owner": "jessk.1ng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18494344243077205, "text": "是的", "created_at": "2025-12-02T15:04:21", "owner": "cz1y2002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031935302542119, "text": "？", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:24:27", "owner": "yshi4359", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101672065706792, "text": "we regard it as privacy", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:57:58", "owner": "jraelix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955175553994884, "text": "😂我比较自恋", "created_at": "2025-12-02T11:00:53", "owner": "janice48000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114277069520112, "text": "因为我们比较害羞", "created_at": "2025-12-02T10:05:46", "owner": "swimmingcoachzhao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897743956345731, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T08:56:59", "owner": "honneymomo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045830366470791, "text": "拿自己頭像非常尷尬而且遇到討厭的人沒辦法講話", "created_at": "2025-12-02T08:55:14", "owner": "sina1126417", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123779518519028, "text": "那你觉得，商业一点，还是休闲一点？", "created_at": "2025-12-02T08:42:41", "owner": "aprillee0001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153966346417312, "text": "因为自己的头像容易看腻", "created_at": "2025-12-02T06:27:09", "owner": "aylin.su.yuyi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855477112526879, "text": "因为长得不是很方便", "created_at": "2025-12-02T05:43:06", "owner": "fanf.an525", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063876836545426, "text": "一般对自己容貌不怎么满意的人都不会用自己照片当头像的 比如我🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:46:40", "owner": "tonniccy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933214252122877, "text": "我长得像彭于晏一样肯定用自己头像。", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:43:45", "owner": "huizi_888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919649497067062, "text": "因为所以", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:39:10", "owner": "jiangyichen154", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864841372517229, "text": "因为没脸见人谢谢", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:15:58", "owner": "tomxu806", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099874840706263, "text": "因为国内不鼓励彰显个性 鼓励集体主义  个人离开集体只是没有灵魂的空壳 就像外表容貌一样", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:10:55", "owner": "bearviny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059170475279505, "text": "照片照骗呗，就跟以前的名片明骗。", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:12:52", "owner": "benjamin149997909", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087993167489800, "text": "因为只想用自己喜欢的或者好看的", "created_at": "2025-12-02T00:59:00", "owner": "rui42813", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076159133244421, "text": "自己頭像不好看😢", "created_at": "2025-12-01T20:32:48", "owner": "jadis_wong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081405614134875, "text": "因为言论审查，口是心非，不想让别人知道。", "created_at": "2025-12-01T18:15:02", "owner": "tom_cat_daily", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083842208043739, "text": "因为太尴尬了😅", "created_at": "2025-12-01T18:10:06", "owner": "bibab7877", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071070278367866, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T18:03:03", "owner": "cczqqq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081385310276052, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T18:02:58", "owner": "cczqqq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897356020200370, "text": "哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:55:15", "owner": "moss550w_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101445202673981, "text": "因为落后", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:07:59", "owner": "chenxi2926", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981153486779117, "text": "因为对自己没信心呐😢", "created_at": "2025-12-01T14:58:17", "owner": "geminifourth_asl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991244730731712, "text": "因为自己长的 拿不出手🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T14:41:55", "owner": "tereal464", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139657375454333, "text": "我长得美的话 我头像每天不重样", "created_at": "2025-12-01T14:08:10", "owner": "yikongbaibaide", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026085161786500, "text": "用自己的照片反而会被骗子骗💩", "created_at": "2025-12-01T12:29:06", "owner": "jo.vin_429", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353443954164105, "text": "没关系 出门也会入乡随俗的", "created_at": "2025-12-01T11:35:07", "owner": "sunnieshen_0802", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128327101448383, "text": "因为主播的建模不是那么的额，还有就是很害羞😢😢", "created_at": "2025-12-01T11:01:27", "owner": "bayuedeshizi999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066955298574835, "text": "日本人也不會用吧⋯⋯太尷尬了", "created_at": "2025-12-01T10:47:20", "owner": "zhezhitianmendong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065031746169372, "text": "I come from China and want to make friends with foreign friends. I just registered this software.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:30:22", "owner": "linghaomeng670", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924597583188725, "text": "中国人很在意自己在别人眼里的形象。而一般情况下对外貌并不自信，所以不怎么喜欢用自己的头像。当然，如果我是帅哥，我也会用自己的头像", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:22:51", "owner": "hudielixd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882505891419555, "text": "头像中的家猫在我怀里，也算是入镜了吧", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:07:23", "owner": "tylpcc1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078912695147932, "text": "我用ins才用自己的头像的怕自己跟不上外国人节奏😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T06:49:10", "owner": "xiongxiong763", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134044159471934, "text": "我就用自己的照片当自己的头像啊。😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T06:25:43", "owner": "yiyao3896", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858536575501626, "text": "隐私安全！", "created_at": "2025-12-01T05:41:37", "owner": "windf_ree88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855443392527048, "text": "用自己的头像感觉很别扭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T05:40:35", "owner": "zoe506678", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062148524213420, "text": "简言之 因为中国靠墙抵御了美国互联网企业统治市场并培育了类似腾讯新浪这样本土的巨型社交网络公司，这些公司没有经历类似MySpace Facebook Ins X等一系列平台兴替 而保持了用户习惯的延续……所以古早的avatar习惯一直延续至今 并未被selfie取代", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:58:12", "owner": "cop.v5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133685602483860, "text": "我就是用自己頭像啊", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:47:37", "owner": "piochan2026", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076884614225205, "text": "首先要有一張帥臉", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:47:30", "owner": "zhupinan46", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914204491249211, "text": "因为天线宝宝可爱呀", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:02:19", "owner": "mia647451", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111876919581341, "text": "在网络上身份是自己给的", "created_at": "2025-11-30T22:52:43", "owner": "phuongquachwyfpg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086876857817847, "text": "我想谈一个美国女朋友", "created_at": "2025-11-30T21:55:32", "owner": "xihuan6791", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994225887891100, "text": "我用的是自己的 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T21:25:31", "owner": "sullivan_fanyang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853515229587594, "text": "自己头像在中国是推销员吧", "created_at": "2025-11-30T21:08:32", "owner": "luchen2624", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984130020764820, "text": "现在在微信中用自己的照片，很像是机构卖课的，或者像是卖保险的，或者是企业微信，工作号之类的。", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:33:01", "owner": "caoliqing0707", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934634146109269, "text": "Yeah, this is really interesting.  From my wechat account, I used a photo from the animation.  And my friends use something like that too.  I don't know why, maybe using the real photo is a little bit funny（ Or a little bit shy） But I find a lot of people use their real photo on Instagram. （ When in Rome do as Romans do,  So I use my real photo too）", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:31:27", "owner": "caoliqing0707", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081869054147946, "text": "用自己的头像会被别人觉得是骗子😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:39:37", "owner": "xingjinyi0802", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123573208520664, "text": "因为网络是虚拟平台，难以辨别真假，所以还是会有些防范意识", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:26:38", "owner": "vvvvera_t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112724404585460, "text": "谁说的😒", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:32:25", "owner": "tomcruis666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849670876599936, "text": "头像本人", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:16:11", "owner": "seeeet1222", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955192003040017, "text": "用自己照片当头像，上个网十八代都要被开了🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:04:00", "owner": "tjcsjqwbz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099010753810363, "text": "你看我的头像像什么🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:41:40", "owner": "yangjun7387", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156608200405337, "text": "用自己的头像比较像做销售", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:34:51", "owner": "huangzijie300", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099968092697099, "text": "用自己的照片，别人会觉得你很装", "created_at": "2025-11-30T13:01:06", "owner": "wanghanmeng37", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085588823074963, "text": "That is because of privacy concerns from the Chinese", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:07:26", "owner": "andrewmaoz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144774658446923, "text": "😢😍", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:05:23", "owner": "yanyan379215", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083686355041476, "text": "喜欢呗", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:21:38", "owner": "huiyujuan2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890868709379676, "text": "因为这个更好看，用自己的好像销售", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:02:17", "owner": "lxxo_junyan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082570364511741, "text": "别人我不知道，反正我是不自信😢", "created_at": "2025-11-30T10:11:44", "owner": "yyjjwfn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930959860116098, "text": "我要是是刘亦菲、迪丽热巴那样的美女早就当了头像😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T09:21:26", "owner": "jzy918112", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109604155528837, "text": "哈哈哈～We use ours' faces here…But use others on Chinese media…Maybe culture difference?😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T09:11:18", "owner": "vera_inthesea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055269872330245, "text": "因为自己建模不好😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:58:48", "owner": "qjmr96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062019719228393, "text": "自己的照片不好看，不然就是不想放", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:56:35", "owner": "chipmunk.738701", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959191744007768, "text": "用自己头像，还怎么骗人呢，有些人就是现实唯唯诺诺网络重拳出击", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:27:00", "owner": "meilinnn_____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986493417913310, "text": "因为长得丑 我有个好友是富婆 加了她一年 朋友圈很多 但没见她发过一张自己照片 这种99%长得不好看", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:11:11", "owner": "no_sabes_nada_de_china", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007629233819730, "text": "长得不太方便🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:10:28", "owner": "markssie_0802", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066454964422280, "text": "用自己的照片当头像感觉很奇怪😳", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:14:41", "owner": "zd07271", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083449505016367, "text": "Just because I'm sorry.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:12:27", "owner": "w376207410", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957941613886118, "text": "I feel a little perverted and even embarrassed to use my own avatar.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:12:13", "owner": "w376207410", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051768920346189, "text": "在微信里工作号会用自己头像，主要是用来交接工作用，在其它的社交平台用自己的头像没多大意义。", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:48:36", "owner": "yuzhongmimi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18436251832103934, "text": "因为会被做成表情包😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:58:40", "owner": "ruilu1974", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086926759997238, "text": "骨子里的不安全感，不愿和陌生人分享太多", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:59:14", "owner": "jizhebao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989306223907540, "text": "用自己头像怕吓到别人没有神秘感", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:39:24", "owner": "celina984364", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082885340119649, "text": "因为自己丑", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:15:53", "owner": "zhangxinyue050206", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047809619431973, "text": "也未必", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:00:39", "owner": "yao.zijie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942246268087598, "text": "non of your business", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:13:39", "owner": "kathy_9559_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075134915214620, "text": "哟，简体字的各位，大家都是翻墙出来的啊", "created_at": "2025-11-29T19:04:15", "owner": "jiaqi_lin0915", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18149905177425055, "text": "有尴尬恐惧症", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:35:41", "owner": "jyucing_1023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900984178332577, "text": "中國是比較含蓄的文化", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:49:28", "owner": "runze_0621", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058421567286545, "text": "因为中国人有容貌焦虑觉得自己不好看", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:44:00", "owner": "xiaoyaochengzi_st", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048926177412733, "text": "如果用自己当图像的话，有些人觉得我自恋/", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:38:56", "owner": "kokichi.oma621", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049086533423951, "text": "一般不用", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:47:16", "owner": "ay25v50", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064286723425910, "text": "总结得很好很对🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:40:19", "owner": "judymeng7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925586638038585, "text": "Chinese culture and character are not good at expressing, education teaches you to endure, not to be very special.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:01:13", "owner": "dreamsmomi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18206370370315820, "text": "非让我说实话吗 因为我长得丑😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:15:57", "owner": "im_zhaizhai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099012004767438, "text": "因为不自信，和怕被骗", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:32:37", "owner": "qianjingling4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076339022224698, "text": "销售才用本人头像", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:58:11", "owner": "yezhi4038", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109058302617705, "text": "第一 对自己的照片没有自信 找不到觉得好看的\n第二 网络上的图片会更好看 能用更近 看上去会很不错\n第三 保持神秘感 防止在游戏或者其它软件上面做其他事情被侵犯肖像权", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:14:32", "owner": "shifanbushifan5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051805799370057, "text": "国人没有国外的人那么自信", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:59:55", "owner": "binbin4387", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113958247579062, "text": "用自己的照片当头像大部分都是年龄大的人", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:54:52", "owner": "x208096", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876037474442917, "text": "就是 我也发现了", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:00:20", "owner": "qixianxiaogege", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544108768022106, "text": "哪里没有你说下？", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:44:12", "owner": "why666666666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957325000010532, "text": "只有卖保险的，房产中介会用自己的头像。", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:55:13", "owner": "andrewasdai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134265367469575, "text": "If I am very handsome, I will use my photo😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:03:17", "owner": "huaxiaodongh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089259289935044, "text": "因为上网是为了冲浪而不是看脸", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:20:29", "owner": "junxi041002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546320071052682, "text": "因为国内国外的思想观不一样。", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:22:25", "owner": "lihoulin18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105859951634717, "text": "因为我们喜欢神秘感", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:34:55", "owner": "caiyali242", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079233944156252, "text": "duo ke ai a", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:09:46", "owner": "emi_7p", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911109202254015, "text": "因为会像推销😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:31:18", "owner": "chunxiao0319", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871840909463655, "text": "为什么外国人都用自己的照片当头像", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:49:12", "owner": "mogo168169", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112473709606065, "text": "我不卖房，不是中介，干嘛用自己照片", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:31:59", "owner": "yang_yangkr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095587174684792, "text": "Idk", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:08:28", "owner": "steven072180", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070739075595819, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:33:43", "owner": "reeseyaor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940618327094287, "text": "在中国用自己照片当头像会被笑死，只有中年人会用哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:25:34", "owner": "youzijiang940881", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18381029401194934, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:07:33", "owner": "weiwenxuan0917", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079779407156797, "text": "In order to protect their privacy.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:43:35", "owner": "21.91580128", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064402289176163, "text": "用自己当头像方便被别人开户。", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:41:18", "owner": "qiqizi6293", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109487296541820, "text": "感觉中老年人喜欢用自己的照片，年轻人喜欢用网络图片吧😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:18:55", "owner": "fle200612", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086775620060355, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:42:06", "owner": "zhuguoyu6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082920626026575, "text": "因为中国人不喜欢实名制上网，这会让他们很没有安全感", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:05:54", "owner": "piaojunshen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954380904898966, "text": "好看的怕被针对，不好看的不好意思发，“对比”“竞争”无处不在", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:06:44", "owner": "zedzzz123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947114236070614, "text": "想用啥用啥", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:55:02", "owner": "sakku.nn9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089227699943294, "text": "因为最开始，我们都用QQ进行聊天，当我们下线后，头像会变成黑白色，在我们的文化里，只有死者才用黑白头像，从那时候起，就形成了这种不用自己的脸当头像的文化或者说习惯", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:43:56", "owner": "wuxinglong67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058616603282179, "text": "我也用了自己的脸😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:32:39", "owner": "kiri_ouo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091377001937431, "text": "因为自己长得丑，拿不出手🤣😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:14:52", "owner": "zhangyifan5877", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876816331356732, "text": "用自己的照片像中介", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:59:34", "owner": "xinjoy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18150028813425654, "text": "不知道，我朋友很多也都不用自己照片", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:40:15", "owner": "kayzino9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108872599545489, "text": "因为用好看的头像代表自己想成为这样的人🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:38:43", "owner": "xiaotongtongxue3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992409987901598, "text": "因为头像也可以表达心情 我们喜欢用各种能表达当下情绪的图当头像 头像随心情变化随时更换😄😄😄", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:04:44", "owner": "wekiko23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048407645413841, "text": "因为建模不好😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:06:12", "owner": "dengfengyezaidengni0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088446793787010, "text": "我的脸太丑了，不上镜", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:35:30", "owner": "a3395727491", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078130877247077, "text": "因为颜值焦虑", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:27:46", "owner": "tom531461", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881261368424499, "text": "因为别人会感觉很自恋", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:03:29", "owner": "yangruihoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18290302846263413, "text": "因为用自己照片的基本上都是卖保险，办业务的🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:28:31", "owner": "luous.i", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100443508758563, "text": "你好老师我是AAAA建材王总或是AAA李工 🤝🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:16:19", "owner": "rainlvvvv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071593508344585, "text": "你看我是不是自己的照片🤣，但是微信是自己制作的代表一路孤独的图片😂。", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:51:54", "owner": "t136995191", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961814808864950, "text": "建模不太行", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:27:15", "owner": "so0_hgi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18328358410245489, "text": "因為這樣就不能光明正大的做壞事呀", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:08:32", "owner": "jacksmith_425", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087041860790736, "text": "我係用自己個照片啊", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:21:43", "owner": "joanne.ennn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903185134318343, "text": "我用的就是自己的啊🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:08:39", "owner": "wuhouhao1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865707511432793, "text": "因为有喜欢的照片啦", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:53:43", "owner": "kiki_sidemoment", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906929236274255, "text": "Some real estate agents and bank insurance salespeople use their own photos.😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:11:11", "owner": "anixinan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18399281035124388, "text": "Because it makes it easier for us to swear (not really).😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:09:38", "owner": "anixinan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021291785609185, "text": "科比没绷住", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:09:07", "owner": "kasslanar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096648376884552, "text": "因为猫猫可爱捏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:43:08", "owner": "z542521", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843876931620701, "text": "只敢露一半 这样就不像诈骗了🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:41:05", "owner": "lichade_911002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100397029687976, "text": "中国大部分是喜欢用一些喜欢的人或者感觉好看的当头像，尤其是我们这里的混的入头像基本烂大街了", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:02:02", "owner": "lenty573", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085926638069477, "text": "使用自己照片的中国人一般属是中介或者是工作需要，还有一些人使用自己的照片是因为对自己的样貌很自信", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:12:21", "owner": "hmh0412", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099598780774745, "text": "因为保护隐私", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:17:51", "owner": "abc295683224", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931061977134742, "text": "因为大家都用  我不用就很尴尬😢🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:04:39", "owner": "yasmin_su_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982853037926957, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:49:03", "owner": "romanticgalaxy1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079823156172748, "text": "因为尴尬", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:33:44", "owner": "aiyisiai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095399413879693, "text": "因為自卑", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:58:27", "owner": "listen_inli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542636620001217, "text": "用真人的頭像像是裝逼或者賣的😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:32:17", "owner": "zepansama", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109319695624121, "text": "怎么评论区全是中国人", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:41:05", "owner": "jial_e666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18538720195054432, "text": "AAA晓峰建材批发", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:57:24", "owner": "callmeainielle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18163796080389760, "text": "因为大家都不用自己用就很奇怪，在国外别人都用我不用就很奇怪，所以我用了，但确实不止中国，亚洲大部分人几乎都不用自己照片🙃", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:21:00", "owner": "evie.cii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867777451492536, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:17:32", "owner": "coke1906", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994317528714345, "text": "Because people are afraid of scammers.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:27:25", "owner": "flygangplus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107040532658406, "text": "我的头像是漩涡鸣人 有什么问题 \n已经7年了", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:34:56", "owner": "taiwanqingniao_sb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853577644580447, "text": "不够自信呗😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:39:18", "owner": "mgk30.00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068802458591795, "text": "这头像不比我自己好看？", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:42:54", "owner": "quartzcrystal0227", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100848760738758, "text": "怕被騙", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:41:05", "owner": "amm789.444", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067049567112584, "text": "文化差异啦，这么简单都不懂，西方文化觉得展示自己的头像让别人觉得很真实，东方文化觉得用图像符号代表自己而不是把私人信息暴露给骗子，都是为了安全，只是思考的模式不一样", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:36:02", "owner": "jasonyang612", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075337382207988, "text": "没有用脸的义务😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T13:57:36", "owner": "hehao9904", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933345880110503, "text": "单纯就是因为。社交恐惧症", "created_at": "2025-11-26T13:23:11", "owner": "shanghunqianchi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088941092499737, "text": "因为用自己的头像会让别人觉得很自恋哈哈哈哈哈哈哈🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-26T13:03:20", "owner": "xxbb_love", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064679363393842, "text": "長得不夠自信🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:23:47", "owner": "yaoyaoabc2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083756296848276, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:18:01", "owner": "lee_eddie_1987", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965822724843041, "text": "🩵💛", "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:41:23", "owner": "nakakakga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047612552676317, "text": "看心情吧", "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:25:02", "owner": "candy50174", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137553679464037, "text": "因為會被詐騙集團利用來騙你的朋友親人啊", "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:15:22", "owner": "justina_chin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083573747116831, "text": "用自己的头像一般都是卖保险的，哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:12:10", "owner": "nj2635057191", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072597224197098, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:49:47", "owner": "xijingping1953615", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071117417061917, "text": "不好意思拿出来丢人现眼…😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:17:47", "owner": "liyang12695", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302213878250810, "text": "长得不太方便咋整", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:25:11", "owner": "jiangjiangjiang160", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873887440377472, "text": "因为怕被骗！", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:59:40", "owner": "yoyo_shmily", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133362619427889, "text": "《網路男神》", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:18:31", "owner": "zzzqqyp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059536916275920, "text": "😂因为长的没有他们美女帅哥好看，还有就是不希望他们知道我是谁🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-26T04:42:05", "owner": "dismember_butterfly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069896792363461, "text": "Right", "created_at": "2025-11-26T04:26:06", "owner": "krislina66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957548712888310, "text": "没自信🤣🤣，", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:00:18", "owner": "zazas3977", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18518725129065921, "text": "这是真的", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:02:23", "owner": "melody52675", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850085965562330, "text": "哈哈哈🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:02:20", "owner": "melody52675", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079122328934639, "text": "比如说？", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:07:35", "owner": "zzzzksm9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090320921498781, "text": "我就是", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:37:54", "owner": "c3_ov25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076997330238552, "text": "因为要脸😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:43:04", "owner": "jensen38385", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924796303179357, "text": "不自信", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:19:59", "owner": "yu.yuyu4739", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077264891238521, "text": "亚洲人五官没欧美人深邃  也容易出现塌鼻梁和凸嘴的情况  很多人长得不是那么好看 所以不太方便放自己的照片当头像", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:53:54", "owner": "stefanie_jisui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18319752214174995, "text": "不想被发现我翻墙🌚🌚", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:53:19", "owner": "len12zz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882115870311151, "text": "我不想讓別人知道我在畫黃色男同漫畫，如果是貓畫的話，會顯得比較容易讓人寬恕……", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:24:15", "owner": "seimi10250419", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990501606889046, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:52:14", "owner": "chinsui_110", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094261813867912, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:18:19", "owner": "felicia_fu00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844819450606476, "text": "hahahaha.因为想用自己喜欢的图片做头像", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:36:02", "owner": "shisdhwui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101156653752883, "text": "ciao", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:30:49", "owner": "jingxiangsandesu296", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887214775394803, "text": "我像詐騙嗎？", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:06:46", "owner": "dorissss852", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852042196548478, "text": "因為可能覺得自己好醜", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:04:40", "owner": "mydrawingisbadfuck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108135079619621, "text": "很装", "created_at": "2025-11-25T06:39:59", "owner": "jessefkingneedcoffe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999467424691207, "text": "因为中国人比较含蓄内敛", "created_at": "2025-11-25T06:34:26", "owner": "aprilyang1003n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050921066348057, "text": "哈哈哈。哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:22:28", "owner": "01_buyfans", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001185062685112, "text": "敢用自己头像做好对线被喷脸的准备🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:19:17", "owner": "woixiaok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981726195926419, "text": "容貌焦虑 长得不太方便", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:25:14", "owner": "a_ming_1016", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843193045622336, "text": "正解", "created_at": "2025-11-25T00:08:17", "owner": "whailong866", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043840571484884, "text": "我这不是用自己的吗 中国人的头像是在表达自己的心情和心态", "created_at": "2025-11-24T22:47:03", "owner": "jhdgg233", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088077310985370, "text": "我用😢", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:04:19", "owner": "nan0828loey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059933006557163, "text": "个人性格有关吧，没那么绝对", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:30:34", "owner": "zxs.112233", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066284087126650, "text": "在中国用自己头像的才是骗子", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:54:11", "owner": "youzi.10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983973567919623, "text": "因为本人没那么好看", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:50:04", "owner": "joker717510", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18274272214304025, "text": "發現全班都是大明星🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:47:08", "owner": "liu_wei5888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542089036047574, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:55:20", "owner": "occultism69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158724634397013, "text": "I love speaking Chinese.", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:16:25", "owner": "coke912778", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025072601771543, "text": "因為海瑟音好看", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:40:40", "owner": "jeff000419", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000704630831900, "text": "我国内的软件不用自己头像，国外的软件就用自己的头像", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:36:44", "owner": "potatojrt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18398107768122281, "text": "因為我們想保持低調和神秘感", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:48:49", "owner": "tiger991120", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125721811509035, "text": "就像中國餐廳 很多食品和圖片不一樣哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:44:28", "owner": "gugur4110", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099308941693122, "text": "爱用啥用啥", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:01:43", "owner": "tinngerya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089179444758395, "text": "想象一下穿西装的男/女头像加你vx", "created_at": "2025-11-24T08:32:55", "owner": "maxis_5g_fiber", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084005411078606, "text": "保护隐私吧，在中国大部分用真人头像的都是一些推销工作的", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:15:02", "owner": "zxtfather6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868667818472945, "text": "喷子太多", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:00:58", "owner": "nini.tian7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171362653328908, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:45:14", "owner": "miaaa_missma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060546008544820, "text": "会觉得不好看尴尬", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:26:07", "owner": "yunmian1121", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104818798646963, "text": "来个女朋友再说，说这些有的没的🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:35:23", "owner": "chenzhaogeng8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18196937158326004, "text": "农场热成像 速来", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:02:29", "owner": "fulan.kelin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105982783712866, "text": "因为中国人骗子一堆😁", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:17:05", "owner": "kummingchang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072922409255257, "text": "因为实力不允许😩", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:44:14", "owner": "xiaoyang0001219", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084629825008009, "text": "哈哈哈是的", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:30:25", "owner": "lp20190731", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18174034051365805, "text": "想用就用了", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:25:31", "owner": "yaozuo399", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125008525512465, "text": "因为用自己照片觉得自己会被剽窃信息 怕有人拿着头像去骗人", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:25:13", "owner": "dadapeng3701", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086653069988180, "text": "因为爱", "created_at": "2025-11-24T02:30:07", "owner": "teng.yu06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106576411715526, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-24T00:22:08", "owner": "yiyangmax", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876435010355162, "text": "我的头像呢😮", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:36:56", "owner": "cheer42363", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925645810038910, "text": "我不是🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:33:14", "owner": "baihao813", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18549419878049489, "text": "中国人骗子太多，不是骗子的人用真头像又怕被骗", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:31:49", "owner": "guanjian8311", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894113974225952, "text": "全是骗子", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:29:57", "owner": "guanjian8311", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18188007136341635, "text": "因为感觉有点羞耻", "created_at": "2025-11-23T19:42:41", "owner": "cutebee1014", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998304297832858, "text": "觉得没隐私", "created_at": "2025-11-23T18:14:34", "owner": "wh.at5343", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072317003047547, "text": "哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:01:54", "owner": "z1479371", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085258055008019, "text": "因为长相会把小孩吓哭所以不用自己的照片", "created_at": "2025-11-23T15:32:05", "owner": "bukeliyu666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095468782894872, "text": "🤣容易被人肉", "created_at": "2025-11-23T13:48:09", "owner": "youareapitifulperson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18431864518104306, "text": "我是觉得哪个头像好用我就用哪个🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-23T12:27:04", "owner": "xiaoqiong158", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078866165235197, "text": "因為長的不好看", "created_at": "2025-11-23T10:27:39", "owner": "cia09_23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045077843691957, "text": "用自己的照片很像卖保险的 销售", "created_at": "2025-11-23T09:19:14", "owner": "huh12_05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082827830011218, "text": "因为我长得不太方便", "created_at": "2025-11-23T09:08:40", "owner": "liyamike0405", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183727963343700, "text": "因为长得不上镜", "created_at": "2025-11-23T09:03:58", "owner": "1204jje", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985625718864941, "text": "好好好", "created_at": "2025-11-23T08:31:51", "owner": "z.z_line", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066093044383189, "text": "用自己頭像太帥了怕別人說我自戀😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T06:15:47", "owner": "bets.w.doorknob", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852698671583549, "text": "因为长得不是很方便", "created_at": "2025-11-23T05:54:18", "owner": "baiyuxuan941", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093389242718464, "text": "🤣🙌好玩", "created_at": "2025-11-23T05:19:08", "owner": "noonline.lkkw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046356611692686, "text": "实则开出来的比自拍丑", "created_at": "2025-11-23T05:08:33", "owner": "iuzzys", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18538989997037818, "text": "长的不太行而且有点怪怪的", "created_at": "2025-11-23T05:07:35", "owner": "iuzzys", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058152518285432, "text": "🤣有没有可能喜欢才拿来当头像的呢", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:04:16", "owner": "xua79034", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080538038169753, "text": "我也是被几个外国朋友问过，为什么不用自己的头像，感觉我像骗子😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T02:10:07", "owner": "ma.jerryma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992280720897228, "text": "微信十年前开始用，我以前因为自己的长相有点自卑，加上不想被人家说自恋，朋友圈上百人，用自己照片做头像的几乎都是人到中年的同事上司，而且基本都是男的。", "created_at": "2025-11-23T00:38:51", "owner": "ji.axin1213", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099732664697916, "text": "我们比较喜欢用动漫头像", "created_at": "2025-11-22T23:37:49", "owner": "zu.l.eik.adeneke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041419706651068, "text": "我是中国人，用自己的头像🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-22T23:23:42", "owner": "knitting_jimmy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048347609419882, "text": "因为我喜欢这些呆萌的头像", "created_at": "2025-11-22T21:22:30", "owner": "geiwochiyiko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102081625668393, "text": "可能是 不夠好看", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:40:35", "owner": "yk01.85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074776214221847, "text": "中国人有容貌焦虑", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:02:47", "owner": "bai.zixu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925720372031719, "text": "儒家文化的保守性熏陶，中国人普遍性压抑，不会轻易向周围人展示自己真正的模样", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:04:20", "owner": "usagiboss6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914206615232576, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:02:12", "owner": "huangjiajun192", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054104711333863, "text": "中国人骗子朵", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:48:41", "owner": "fangdun2019", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060660764237533, "text": "取名也很怪😆", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:31:38", "owner": "hsuan870629", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120676570558968, "text": "因为长得好像不是很方便", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:12:28", "owner": "27.21225734", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873042724452148, "text": "因为我长得丑啊……", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:10:02", "owner": "mo_yuhe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931625257137060, "text": "用不用自己的头像看心情，哪里那么多废话~", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:47:28", "owner": "bike79523", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085709312091042, "text": "哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:49:09", "owner": "txzd00876", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108280207620325, "text": "All right 💪", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:51:05", "owner": "yoout76", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987291330872201, "text": "Because I'm Batman", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:19:36", "owner": "yyyml_oro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034474028717674, "text": "If I use my own picture,I will feel embarrassed and other people will think I am a stupid guy.🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:06:42", "owner": "jinellezzzzzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111447979588663, "text": "我在ig上就是自己的头像", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:46:42", "owner": "lanzoezen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18336349114234945, "text": "因为喜欢或者比自己好看可爱🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:50:38", "owner": "chens_uen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108567118723368, "text": "因为这只鸭子很萌", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:45:02", "owner": "uuye234", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18333528682238825, "text": "这样我在网上随便说就不怕被认出来😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:25:14", "owner": "smithwhd1234", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143039377453454, "text": "为什么呢，因为🤣好看呗～", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:20:07", "owner": "tangyuying123456", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18346446697206245, "text": "哈哈，个有所好吧🤭🤭", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:51:22", "owner": "qinshuxian.9548", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939170842095109, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:50:51", "owner": "qinshuxian.9548", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864925618436030, "text": "没必要🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:11:39", "owner": "wanhaohaohaohao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048401057412700, "text": "在没人认识我的app上才用自己照片", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:10:08", "owner": "lschangg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544029751037243, "text": "I think it's a kind of freedom to use your own head portrait. Of course, it may mean that habits and cultures are different. In China, using your own head portrait will be regarded as fraud.There are also some Chinese people who have deep anxiety about appearance and may have a little inferiority complex more or less.And Chinese people are more introverted.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:12:00", "owner": "zealot481", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928571239150887, "text": "哈喽，各位彦祖🤓", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:59:26", "owner": "jay.56697", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907218244266777, "text": "我们是保护自己的隐私。你们这些外国人对马路上普通的治安摄像头，交通摄像头那么介意，说是侵犯隐私。却在都是骗子的网络上公布自己的照片，真名，家庭情况，毕业学校。恨不得银行账号都公布出来。我们也不理解你们这种奇葩行为。", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:10:56", "owner": "yorkchen412", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165119176384609, "text": "因为都是我们内心所向往的样子", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:50:56", "owner": "nyc11143", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988382463857974, "text": "难道卖保险吗哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:50:56", "owner": "vivian08068", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075534140221241, "text": "为了装！嗯对！", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:40:38", "owner": "babyloveyyyyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096824914799883, "text": "外国人不用别的头像=怕被当成骗子，而我们！是生因为怕有骗子😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:10:53", "owner": "puppymallow_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863734618530657, "text": "亞洲人偏沒自信居多，重點是他們比較在意他人的評價，風氣不同。", "created_at": "2025-11-21T23:41:23", "owner": "man178cm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043392140697149, "text": "觉得很尴尬", "created_at": "2025-11-21T21:19:51", "owner": "kakauuyz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18228718189305290, "text": "因为我觉得自己长得不是很方便", "created_at": "2025-11-21T18:53:12", "owner": "chenggongrenshi4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060300773559150, "text": "中國詐騙太多的關係", "created_at": "2025-11-21T18:46:27", "owner": "fogminnesinger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862537963531794, "text": "以前用过感觉有点自恋，太帅了，害羞", "created_at": "2025-11-21T18:41:17", "owner": "shishuiwuhen2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052766480339428, "text": "感覺用自己的照片的嗯 都太那個自戀", "created_at": "2025-11-21T18:37:45", "owner": "leizhi8419", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968990886825913, "text": "我的頭像最有味道", "created_at": "2025-11-21T18:36:00", "owner": "wongho_451049", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086064751821316, "text": "99%原因丑，1原因怕监控", "created_at": "2025-11-21T17:25:11", "owner": "hugo__207", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18162913744391739, "text": "TianTi Exchange Registration Link:\n\nhttps://tt.zmyoka.com/zh-CN/sign-up?invitCode=a7u5g1\nQilin Live Registration Link:\nhttps://h5.qilinlive.com/#/register?shareCode=a7u5g1\nListing Application Link:\n\nhttps://forms.gle/wdsgb7C6bX3P7M2q6\nBlockchain Explorer:\n\nhttps://scan.ctcchain.com\nQilin Wallet:\nhttps://wallet.tantin.com/", "created_at": "2025-11-21T17:02:33", "owner": "r5g6i2699", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058918685636427, "text": "不知道啊", "created_at": "2025-11-21T16:18:29", "owner": "feitianbaolong9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059015543257647, "text": "因为很羞耻", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:57:19", "owner": "sweet688518", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18211966180310590, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:16:21", "owner": "jelly_cat.0802", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18170789674373178, "text": "没你们长的好看", "created_at": "2025-11-21T14:53:50", "owner": "zzyc59", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901490095315643, "text": "我是用的自己", "created_at": "2025-11-21T14:49:45", "owner": "linyikee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084849599101316, "text": "其实我长得和我的头像差不多🤣（开玩笑的）", "created_at": "2025-11-21T14:42:17", "owner": "jc1na0413", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027101204574546, "text": "不想暴露自己的样子，因为网上不是所有人都是好人，现实中认识的人都知道你长什么样子不需要用头像去提醒", "created_at": "2025-11-21T14:24:46", "owner": "xindanism", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107996908713809, "text": "我的是我老婆的头像😍", "created_at": "2025-11-21T14:04:56", "owner": "lhz830304", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086765140814553, "text": "因为中国人思想比较保守，特别是翻墙的时候，用了自己头像就完了", "created_at": "2025-11-21T14:04:08", "owner": "peiliyuay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18431033959111607, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-21T13:54:15", "owner": "fishcatangel26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122268223544010, "text": "在中国不正常的才用自己当头像", "created_at": "2025-11-21T13:33:52", "owner": "fakeikun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18203400985318562, "text": "每个地方可能在有些方面不同这是正常的呀 评论区有些人能不能不要贬低中国了….🥹", "created_at": "2025-11-21T12:33:49", "owner": "hxin_yiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18512613691069176, "text": "1個字 害羞", "created_at": "2025-11-21T11:15:51", "owner": "hsuraven", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997249608702311, "text": "用自己当头像的比如保险😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T11:15:17", "owner": "2597203158x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18319661716174243, "text": "外国软件用自己当头像，国内软件用别的当头像", "created_at": "2025-11-21T10:54:21", "owner": "liguanyuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153883984416456, "text": "我又不是卖保险卖车的为什么要用自己的照片🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-21T10:20:28", "owner": "a2461788530", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075316577213833, "text": "看来你不认识房产中介、保险推销员、健身房私教🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-21T08:49:19", "owner": "zheng_zhi.37", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026188592575924, "text": "因为不好看", "created_at": "2025-11-21T08:36:56", "owner": "xujin952", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043971608486436, "text": "因为中国人的隐私需要自己来保护，中国并不是一个言论自由的国家，大家偶尔敏感发言的同时需要把自己隐藏起来。", "created_at": "2025-11-21T08:31:20", "owner": "lei_daydayup", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083712041510770, "text": "因为头像比我帅啊", "created_at": "2025-11-21T06:53:32", "owner": "yu161yu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078250619270430, "text": "哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-21T06:46:53", "owner": "fengluoming", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078848680915051, "text": "保护自己", "created_at": "2025-11-21T06:22:24", "owner": "niki_santa311", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118662424526494, "text": "是我了", "created_at": "2025-11-21T06:02:45", "owner": "xiaoxiao37890", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095303872881780, "text": "用自己的照片很瓜🤣🤣🤣🤣现在为了迎合你们，我也用了自己的照片🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-21T05:38:23", "owner": "elenayang500", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18297197653284340, "text": "哪来那么多为什么🧐", "created_at": "2025-11-21T05:19:23", "owner": "ccatherine1215", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105444589650175, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-11-21T04:41:29", "owner": "li253562666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063628148629210, "text": "戴上面具才能摘下面具🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-21T04:35:20", "owner": "wooxran", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963533593004203, "text": "我私人wx用自己照片頭像，工作wx不用，因為他們都是“壞人”不喜歡他們", "created_at": "2025-11-21T04:20:57", "owner": "hidestressa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964386303846104, "text": "用的自己的照片的才像骗子，只有微商和销售才会永自己照片", "created_at": "2025-11-21T04:19:33", "owner": "wcz_0214", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103739116634341, "text": "我发现一些老外也用别人的照片一般是年轻人", "created_at": "2025-11-21T02:47:02", "owner": "nocapn33d3d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18175819969324649, "text": "好玩", "created_at": "2025-11-21T01:54:08", "owner": "xi927717", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547320010052329, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-21T01:13:30", "owner": "huiwang33369", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065576471138261, "text": "I’m use myself", "created_at": "2025-11-21T00:58:38", "owner": "long.long1216", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091212223914843, "text": "因为本人长的不方便", "created_at": "2025-11-20T17:48:50", "owner": "xiaoqi11760", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331374403211053, "text": "用自己头像感觉怪怪的", "created_at": "2025-11-20T17:23:26", "owner": "tttttaq1127", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146023126433678, "text": "因为好看？", "created_at": "2025-11-20T17:12:19", "owner": "zhangzifeng788", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899372245339285, "text": "鍵盤俠不能用自己照片", "created_at": "2025-11-20T17:09:38", "owner": "exile1307", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865734841500590, "text": "上个网为什么要实名制😭", "created_at": "2025-11-20T16:57:18", "owner": "n.juati", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856854862503554, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T15:03:55", "owner": "leiqiuten9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18437418145099630, "text": "因為我醜", "created_at": "2025-11-20T14:36:15", "owner": "kayleelam9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131989816433907, "text": "There are few scammers in China.", "created_at": "2025-11-20T13:37:41", "owner": "zfeng236789", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001039319833291, "text": "Bc privacy. I think my PFP is cool :) (it’s an art from a bsf)", "created_at": "2025-11-20T12:31:56", "owner": "mcxhk_d34d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865023283433891, "text": "好看啊", "created_at": "2025-11-20T12:13:47", "owner": "tfcbx9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18537493678065219, "text": "What are you doing", "created_at": "2025-11-20T12:13:25", "owner": "tfcbx9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901397491320939, "text": "完了 变诈骗犯了🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-20T11:40:48", "owner": "54sehun_6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928300915119037, "text": "哈哈，还真是😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T10:59:44", "owner": "jease_ru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100676275739096, "text": "因为用自己的照片会被朋友笑，比如我。😮", "created_at": "2025-11-20T10:52:47", "owner": "makawen2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911829646252102, "text": "巴嘎牙路", "created_at": "2025-11-20T10:31:10", "owner": "yuqing17219", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079701596112962, "text": "privacy", "created_at": "2025-11-20T09:25:42", "owner": "quanjiatong9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061358054212656, "text": "有没有可能长太丑了😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T07:40:43", "owner": "24.63340195", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172499683371258, "text": "because we have met offline, trust established", "created_at": "2025-11-20T05:21:33", "owner": "cindy_wang2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099428632691610, "text": "交朋友有吗", "created_at": "2025-11-20T03:43:00", "owner": "xiaotaoya21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050715887382348, "text": "因为我的头像更可爱..", "created_at": "2025-11-20T02:29:20", "owner": "carolineeee881", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931540687108907, "text": "那不是搞推销的人才用", "created_at": "2025-11-20T01:13:16", "owner": "capricious_unioe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063199298396741, "text": "我不知道啊", "created_at": "2025-11-20T00:58:29", "owner": "19990101nbb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296247193257674, "text": "尴尬😅", "created_at": "2025-11-19T23:17:09", "owner": "lanyangyang4564", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879039151428186, "text": "服了，在美国上课，有个老师非要我给ins头像和昵称改成真人和真名，真的不会泄露隐私吗？？", "created_at": "2025-11-19T21:08:40", "owner": "white11_yun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183766024345718, "text": "中國人習慣生活在熟人社會，因為彼此都相互認識，所以不需要用真實頭像來區分", "created_at": "2025-11-19T19:56:53", "owner": "kkhealtheworld", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975137859794072, "text": "用自己的头像会被蛐蛐 认为是一种自恋的表现😢", "created_at": "2025-11-19T19:29:15", "owner": "beishangdehama", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968734389968384, "text": "头像就是本人🥵🥵", "created_at": "2025-11-19T18:18:20", "owner": "yhdracodraco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18373664068152655, "text": "一是感觉自己丑，二是但是那些图真的非常非常非常非常非常好看不当头像感觉非常非常非常非常非常可惜！😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-19T17:41:45", "owner": "initialteana1012635", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890321575375348, "text": "用自己的头像太奇怪了😂 会有种销售的感觉", "created_at": "2025-11-19T17:22:04", "owner": "qinggezhuojiu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18432052288108315, "text": "中国的家庭环境和社会环境给人的束缚感比较强，规矩多。所以很难自由的展现个性，反应到社交软件上就会低调的隐藏真实信息", "created_at": "2025-11-19T17:07:40", "owner": "jinl292", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18318944473168255, "text": "Because it doesn't look very convenient", "created_at": "2025-11-19T17:07:15", "owner": "peixianchi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083344417841428, "text": "不错不错", "created_at": "2025-11-19T16:16:48", "owner": "chaserichardson1971", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18437561032102709, "text": "用自己头像的人会感觉比较自恋……😮", "created_at": "2025-11-19T16:01:19", "owner": "iceyhe0101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095947369653672, "text": "怕被盗脸", "created_at": "2025-11-19T15:10:14", "owner": "zhiqinkoh927", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18289781860287327, "text": "喜欢用猫猫狗狗当头像 超可爱", "created_at": "2025-11-19T14:04:35", "owner": "ali_keumbi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085073633044955, "text": "我用自己的", "created_at": "2025-11-19T13:49:52", "owner": "laiguangyu97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974698587951217, "text": "因為自己長太醜呀 開美顏濾鏡又很詭異 所以乾脆用自己喜歡的東西唄", "created_at": "2025-11-19T13:38:54", "owner": "blackpink_in_your_area_0629", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034055252718533, "text": "用自己的头像像搞传销", "created_at": "2025-11-19T13:11:26", "owner": "macabre195", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082476740134982, "text": "没有为什么", "created_at": "2025-11-19T13:01:57", "owner": "yoyo11261212", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105420571640761, "text": "出门在外身份是自己给哈哈🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-19T12:49:00", "owner": "yuchengwei61", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879035953333522, "text": "就是自卑感🤣好听一点就内敛", "created_at": "2025-11-19T12:40:33", "owner": "edwinzlam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18319584217173109, "text": "我想用自己的脸，但是我们国家上外网违法，所以我不敢暴露自己😢", "created_at": "2025-11-19T12:17:27", "owner": "berrianing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18385621426179816, "text": "主要是长得不太方便", "created_at": "2025-11-19T12:09:53", "owner": "dachui9999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048858707400961, "text": "Privacy", "created_at": "2025-11-19T12:04:54", "owner": "poseoasis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088617928942003, "text": "那咋啦", "created_at": "2025-11-19T11:52:12", "owner": "kkf996632", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104222890581586, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-19T11:50:21", "owner": "amuziju", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082685039029974, "text": "因为长得不方便，", "created_at": "2025-11-19T11:28:57", "owner": "ku.lomi.yee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977435277943278, "text": "头像很棒", "created_at": "2025-11-19T11:18:26", "owner": "yizhilihuamao8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106923580627771, "text": "我长得好看我不早用了", "created_at": "2025-11-19T11:17:53", "owner": "x5205_20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058659452541506, "text": "用自己的头像然后被自己的好朋友用来批图，然后你和他聊天的时候就发现，你的脸出现在了各种表情包里面😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T09:58:22", "owner": "q15105824263", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094468723849825, "text": "因为长得太好看了 不敢露脸哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-19T09:21:14", "owner": "shoe8_831", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18393553330132394, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T07:09:51", "owner": "nutrition0421", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183980509348110, "text": "不好意思", "created_at": "2025-11-19T06:54:31", "owner": "johnyang981023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866853082497413, "text": "我只有自己好看的照片才拿来当头像 当然也仅限于没开智的时候", "created_at": "2025-11-19T06:06:13", "owner": "winterr_potato", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865334848507442, "text": "因為長得不好看", "created_at": "2025-11-19T05:38:08", "owner": "ma.omao1916", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094765456675842, "text": "在中国用自己的照片当头像甚至会被说是自恋普信下头男", "created_at": "2025-11-19T05:08:15", "owner": "zhangruizhuo6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078268900917417, "text": "不到啊，不一直都是这样吗？", "created_at": "2025-11-19T05:03:53", "owner": "goholuong0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933107776104782, "text": "因为不好意思", "created_at": "2025-11-19T04:33:58", "owner": "yyzyykk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073953266207314, "text": "不用自己的頭像會覺得比較有安全感", "created_at": "2025-11-19T03:51:57", "owner": "qkim_g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929173816015722, "text": "那为什么要用自己的照片当头像😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T03:32:46", "owner": "xue1145142025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060267143636154, "text": "我觉得头像文化，就像外国人纹身文化差不多，可以是一种装饰", "created_at": "2025-11-19T03:25:24", "owner": "nan.du.98434997", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859766050479725, "text": "怕当了头像吓到人", "created_at": "2025-11-19T01:55:47", "owner": "wenlijing_215", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031608923737376, "text": "因为知道自己都很丑", "created_at": "2025-11-19T00:35:08", "owner": "zaishou20jin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904441693285211, "text": "就跟你第一個想法一樣，沒錯！不要懷疑", "created_at": "2025-11-18T21:19:17", "owner": "giloo2266", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18379222705147176, "text": "因为感觉自己太丑", "created_at": "2025-11-18T20:41:40", "owner": "thz0731", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087704071778003, "text": "因為不好看😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T18:25:05", "owner": "tiam54033", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847130446606162, "text": "在网上就没必要让别人知道自己真实的样子，更想用自己喜欢的东西代表/暂替自己的形象", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:54:05", "owner": "abx77148", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914760925235076, "text": "为什么要用自己的头像", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:38:25", "owner": "wuxin2375", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987665091883136, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:28:37", "owner": "ella_chenshuaiyue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863518186521546, "text": "最后那个蔡明可以看出来在中国生活很久了🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:38:55", "owner": "xzsxsybd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075736238336944, "text": "因为我长的丑", "created_at": "2025-11-18T14:26:44", "owner": "lililililili213", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868816249406228, "text": "因为在中国用自己的头像才像骗子😮", "created_at": "2025-11-18T13:55:05", "owner": "luopengjie6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094084927870282, "text": "Your Chinese is very good", "created_at": "2025-11-18T13:24:56", "owner": "yan8415312", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397282666132817, "text": "为什么为什么？因为丑", "created_at": "2025-11-18T11:17:23", "owner": "zxk2030666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084647831049679, "text": "@sofiane_abdel 跟你講真正的原因\n因為亞洲普信人超多 公審文化又超嚴重 自從有社交媒體 臉書 脆 加上推播 直接引爆 一言不合就直接截別人照片諷刺別人個簽 學歷 諧音梗什麼都可以 就是找一群同溫層來臭酸一頓 而且酸別人的通常也不怎麼樣 都是用假帳 避免被酸 所以才有不要放自己照片跟自己空白的情況出現 避免被當成文案嘴砲 打越多越有題材可以被臭", "created_at": "2025-11-18T10:28:48", "owner": "u.nui.oliio0lloi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953225083045663, "text": "Bro, I think lots of people outside of China form Europe, US,Canada all uses web pics, it’s strange to use their own pic to be honest", "created_at": "2025-11-18T10:03:37", "owner": "michael3288lee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117203431553519, "text": "上网实名认证就可以了🤣🤣，还要还自己的頭像，出门被人认出来好尴尬呀哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-18T09:10:27", "owner": "hz233_2133", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864757912433885, "text": "因为长得很隐私hhh", "created_at": "2025-11-18T08:53:54", "owner": "02genesis20252025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085823078486079, "text": "Because it's boring🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-18T07:50:39", "owner": "liyi9296", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063609920411505, "text": "如果我长的很好看 我肯定用自己的照片😤", "created_at": "2025-11-18T04:46:59", "owner": "dorsie7426", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049400447384971, "text": "避免政治冲突", "created_at": "2025-11-18T04:15:18", "owner": "vickylim9898", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853336828577287, "text": "我是销售", "created_at": "2025-11-18T03:18:24", "owner": "heedjing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953303140039473, "text": "因为中国人不自信 用自己的自拍照会被骂普信", "created_at": "2025-11-18T03:14:23", "owner": "leonorrrrrre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986582157875765, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-11-18T03:07:37", "owner": "loewideep", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18173410126368825, "text": "有人问过我  甚至还去Google查了一下我为啥不用自己当头像？", "created_at": "2025-11-18T03:02:18", "owner": "kang_9888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18313162306222984, "text": "用自己头像感觉就是销售还有打骚扰电话的", "created_at": "2025-11-18T02:08:13", "owner": "michael130447", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353639032202534, "text": "因为中国诈骗的多，不用自己头像是为了保护自己，而且中国人含蓄", "created_at": "2025-11-18T01:08:12", "owner": "cathyshen_iii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072833162201087, "text": "用自己照片不是中介就是保险😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T01:00:16", "owner": "denghuan52", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101311888679071, "text": "我微信头像是用自己的照片", "created_at": "2025-11-18T00:51:51", "owner": "zhanglibitren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958288734880071, "text": "我记得之前 中国的设备都是黑白的 如果当自己头像 会像遗照一样 死去后会用到的照片", "created_at": "2025-11-18T00:29:17", "owner": "zhe30317", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105001414631230, "text": "习惯而已，不必上纲上线", "created_at": "2025-11-18T00:02:49", "owner": "xiaohe88169", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896061937205932, "text": "等你大头照被开出来就明白了", "created_at": "2025-11-17T22:37:25", "owner": "ahhho14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120179926529624, "text": "长得好看，谁不用自己照片呀？", "created_at": "2025-11-17T21:22:42", "owner": "yejinwushi2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112744705510238, "text": "因为怕被骗……😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T20:40:00", "owner": "xytxiaogui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085902529992016, "text": "因为醜。", "created_at": "2025-11-17T20:26:15", "owner": "emilejr92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922875103193511, "text": "长得不是那么方便", "created_at": "2025-11-17T19:48:46", "owner": "zeenhuang9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072198398023628, "text": "用自己头像算比较尴尬的事情😊", "created_at": "2025-11-17T19:09:50", "owner": "yiyu1_96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969857055976323, "text": "因为外国人实希望看到真实的自己，无论网络还是现实，中国人可能更希望在网络上可以有一个全新的面貌或者一个虚拟的身份", "created_at": "2025-11-17T19:02:26", "owner": "_kalyn.tong_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087446239989683, "text": "因为不好看", "created_at": "2025-11-17T18:23:43", "owner": "qianmian765", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095221594858172, "text": "因为过几天你的表情包就出炉了", "created_at": "2025-11-17T18:20:28", "owner": "m74549374", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076613915227155, "text": "别人不知道，我自己比较自卑😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T18:04:16", "owner": "sooskwnns", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104151250726788, "text": "Because ugly", "created_at": "2025-11-17T17:26:25", "owner": "jennymaimai2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005537288821773, "text": "长得不方便", "created_at": "2025-11-17T16:49:49", "owner": "chenchacha24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995816796848591, "text": "因为我长的不好看", "created_at": "2025-11-17T16:03:55", "owner": "lishengxuan0423", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105712198713782, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T15:01:32", "owner": "ethanethan5904", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892550716361320, "text": "別問我為什麼用鄧紫棋的照片", "created_at": "2025-11-17T13:31:41", "owner": "gemlovely_0816", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113579896565543, "text": "长相不允许我用👀🙈😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T13:13:38", "owner": "douziggai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086745557494162, "text": "因为bro觉得自己很丑", "created_at": "2025-11-17T13:05:20", "owner": "aghiighj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977946912932026, "text": "自卑嗎🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T12:36:22", "owner": "s090_5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971999232806663, "text": "只有在ig 上才敢用自己的照片……在微信上用会觉得自己是不是太自恋😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-17T12:04:26", "owner": "zooooeyi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081083006109668, "text": "你看我的头像如何", "created_at": "2025-11-17T11:52:00", "owner": "sunny807996", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104008762724907, "text": "Cause yes", "created_at": "2025-11-17T11:27:23", "owner": "bacon_from_ohio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911452321252130, "text": "用自己照片不是骗子就是房产中介", "created_at": "2025-11-17T11:05:37", "owner": "jameslu1026", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293656828274501, "text": "Because Chinese people are not good looking", "created_at": "2025-11-17T10:11:35", "owner": "yuanray39", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18162996793382978, "text": "防盜", "created_at": "2025-11-17T09:56:35", "owner": "tiffy._.baby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303099829271166, "text": "因為自己的臉見不得人", "created_at": "2025-11-17T09:48:10", "owner": "8567c.c.c.p", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985522086750683, "text": "觉得自己丑😢", "created_at": "2025-11-17T09:28:29", "owner": "wyh17413", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134663857476892, "text": "我的脸有点像正方形。头像装不下。", "created_at": "2025-11-17T09:26:44", "owner": "wkikol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097481941773514, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-17T08:50:26", "owner": "gaara7559", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062835311446256, "text": "因为丑", "created_at": "2025-11-17T08:19:43", "owner": "kenyuan2023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953519614032340, "text": "😂因为长得不太方便啊", "created_at": "2025-11-17T08:14:53", "owner": "iiiheytt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153633526408446, "text": "因为自己没有头像好看", "created_at": "2025-11-17T04:56:54", "owner": "coey_2331", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845516512609708, "text": "建模不方便", "created_at": "2025-11-17T04:33:37", "owner": "xi.ng6332", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072525476588922, "text": "用自己的脸来当头像，会被朋友弄成表情包😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T04:20:32", "owner": "ng_kah_hoong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540005944039950, "text": "主要还是长得丑", "created_at": "2025-11-17T02:41:33", "owner": "onon8610", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000916154830376, "text": "管的多", "created_at": "2025-11-17T01:18:30", "owner": "iuv1212126", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848808424565898, "text": "我就用自己当头像", "created_at": "2025-11-16T19:13:40", "owner": "ywl2511", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076590614270894, "text": "例如在小区群，我会和很多观点不同的人吵架，但又希望他们知道我住在哪里", "created_at": "2025-11-16T18:04:33", "owner": "mayalu5717", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884153140283595, "text": "外國人的頭像表現的是自己個人的身份 中國人的頭像代表的是個人的審美和靈魂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T17:45:01", "owner": "chen_chenerdong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18341645803200814, "text": "⬅️用了，高中生被别人当成中年人😢", "created_at": "2025-11-16T16:35:09", "owner": "myleszhang323", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103394851565489, "text": "因为怕帽子叔叔，大陆现在是在搞文字狱。", "created_at": "2025-11-16T16:11:25", "owner": "kekew_2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864723952504646, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-16T15:16:10", "owner": "ins.231125", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043172936486444, "text": "Is there anyone who wants to learn Chinese? I want to learn English and we can communicate with each other.", "created_at": "2025-11-16T14:32:28", "owner": "lilin43784", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929492239135950, "text": "在中国用自己的照片做头像，不是中介就是诈骗🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-16T14:14:59", "owner": "chuanqimaozhi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18189920818327567, "text": "因為長的不權威🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-16T14:00:37", "owner": "817.1212", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18519060205064681, "text": "因為愛自己的推👍", "created_at": "2025-11-16T13:26:16", "owner": "happy_20201013", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872609110378816, "text": "用自己的照片等着朋友拿你的头像当表情包对吧？🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-16T13:05:46", "owner": "fdhcg888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541290448006560, "text": "因為中國人長得不太方便", "created_at": "2025-11-16T13:01:49", "owner": "changchenchen0703", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032097590725736, "text": "😢因为😟cyberscam", "created_at": "2025-11-16T12:59:03", "owner": "yangethan170", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858631543544884, "text": "因为当不了键盘侠", "created_at": "2025-11-16T10:32:41", "owner": "yiqingying2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086053075982781, "text": "因为自己长的丑😢", "created_at": "2025-11-16T09:45:48", "owner": "xujiahao684", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17921677902189031, "text": "😂也有用的", "created_at": "2025-11-16T09:23:04", "owner": "lily200913", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164512957382942, "text": "用自己頭像，不太方便", "created_at": "2025-11-16T08:51:22", "owner": "rongyaoawei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107417383554118, "text": "@xx.airdrop 是这样🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-16T08:25:08", "owner": "muenen521116", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18512122654071965, "text": "在中国用自己照片当头像的颜值都很高，销售除外", "created_at": "2025-11-16T08:21:56", "owner": "m1273884457", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065667236620103, "text": "……从来都是用自己的", "created_at": "2025-11-16T07:26:23", "owner": "ziqiangbuxi2001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078592727328205, "text": "因為可能你用自己的樣子裝頭像，別人會偷渡了你的樣子，然後去詐騙其他人，還有另外一個要點就是我們拍照其實呢就是，不是拍得頭很大，就是會拍得監管不是你真實的樣子，醜得像個鬼一樣。就算你長得多漂亮在真實裏也好，雖然我是一個女生，我也長得不是太醜，可是就是。不知道為什麼別人幫忙拍照，如果拍到臉的話都會覺得很奇怪啦🤣😂🎀🎀❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-16T07:23:32", "owner": "sellcardslikekpop_pony_sanrio", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18542094133018584, "text": "不好意思用自己的头像当照片🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-16T06:46:02", "owner": "socheon.yoo09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063080354175461, "text": "用自己头像的是中介🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-16T06:41:37", "owner": "tangjiu68", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070246178590546, "text": "因為許多人，長的不是那麼方便，更願意讓這些替代", "created_at": "2025-11-16T06:38:26", "owner": "f9lr3xhocxe3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881404129308728, "text": "不想让别人知道自己长什么样很难理解吗😮", "created_at": "2025-11-16T06:24:51", "owner": "syhnztj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918274444207713, "text": "@nfiah_000 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T03:57:35", "owner": "a18927198271", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988698585902592, "text": "你用自己的头像，方便别人开户和人生攻击吗？😂😂😂这是一个非常不重视保护个人隐私的国家，你可以理解为没有隐私，而且很多人非常没有素质，开口就是辱骂他人。🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-16T03:52:26", "owner": "blanc_luke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865590415499524, "text": "会被朋友笑死", "created_at": "2025-11-16T03:28:42", "owner": "wtwoc2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856484431559035, "text": "跟你有毛关系，我们喜欢做啥就做啥", "created_at": "2025-11-16T01:16:56", "owner": "fe_ng2322", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100837048707124, "text": "因为我觉得我的小猫很可爱啊，我没有它可爱", "created_at": "2025-11-15T23:56:38", "owner": "tippixu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027191543773185, "text": "我就是用自己的头像", "created_at": "2025-11-15T23:46:08", "owner": "xiaosong184", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074302832194707, "text": "大多数又不是不认识对方，明明知道对方长什么样，头像用自己喜欢的有什么不好", "created_at": "2025-11-15T22:42:41", "owner": "chloewong94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078233188899617, "text": "我的呢？👁👄👁🇩🇪", "created_at": "2025-11-15T20:34:52", "owner": "gubeichen_999x", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18128915998493544, "text": "會被身邊人做成表情包", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:14:17", "owner": "m15981178707", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876285733439438, "text": "感觉没有拿自己做头像的一点想法，还是因为长的不太方便吧😢", "created_at": "2025-11-15T18:22:23", "owner": "zavqyu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096454042834309, "text": "因为看起来很像中介。。。。", "created_at": "2025-11-15T17:40:25", "owner": "liujianlong2585", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982115604766166, "text": "用自己头像感觉另类😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T17:22:24", "owner": "abcp8242332", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989739840855645, "text": "AAA建材", "created_at": "2025-11-15T16:18:49", "owner": "huang58261", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887364844265837, "text": "在中国用自己照片做avatar一般是工作账号。", "created_at": "2025-11-15T16:02:42", "owner": "waynelam0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869889532467806, "text": "难道不觉得用着自己的照片跟别人聊天很尴尬吗？感觉别人一直在盯着自己😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T15:05:59", "owner": "fxyao886", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105173599577821, "text": "用自己的头像上一段时间网发现拖家带口都被翻出来了😅", "created_at": "2025-11-15T14:27:02", "owner": "gaoguidejijiguowang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18349186279166760, "text": "谁说的我就用我自己的", "created_at": "2025-11-15T13:47:19", "owner": "a1069336446", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987703044861148, "text": "只有销售之类的的才用自己头像，一般是穿西装的大头照", "created_at": "2025-11-15T13:19:42", "owner": "tianjiawen9807", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086105747313685, "text": "用不用自己的照片當頭像跟是不是騙子沒有必然的聯繫，他們只是不自信而已。", "created_at": "2025-11-15T12:23:20", "owner": "gg042138", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081684116281760, "text": "因为好看😍", "created_at": "2025-11-15T11:45:08", "owner": "chenpengfei588", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085333052315390, "text": "因为都喜欢美颜，如果不美颜，容易形成两极分化。", "created_at": "2025-11-15T11:24:52", "owner": "xiangjun1002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980535570781881, "text": "哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-15T10:25:42", "owner": "kaihanglili", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885164446431555, "text": "因为特别尴尬", "created_at": "2025-11-15T10:24:48", "owner": "tingtan46", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085873865305050, "text": "文化差异吧，中国用自己照片当头像的话像是中介或者工作的人", "created_at": "2025-11-15T09:20:13", "owner": "shangxin.06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084743021054147, "text": "评论区咋全是中国人", "created_at": "2025-11-15T09:16:55", "owner": "pregnantclubber", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18208212835312941, "text": "It is not appearance, but the soul.", "created_at": "2025-11-15T08:17:35", "owner": "xixiwu.wu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035430872717330, "text": "怕詐騙", "created_at": "2025-11-15T07:42:06", "owner": "zoezhongliu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154371712370504, "text": "Because Chinese people have no credibility at all", "created_at": "2025-11-15T07:38:19", "owner": "daidongwade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887394676263194, "text": "感觉头像用自己露脸很尴尬。", "created_at": "2025-11-15T07:33:39", "owner": "sunyihuan77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985224807865033, "text": "因為很丑", "created_at": "2025-11-15T07:19:00", "owner": "lin358113", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18384400594144041, "text": "因为建模不好😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T06:21:03", "owner": "hmmxhwy310", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142500376401368, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T06:12:33", "owner": "ariel.liupan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091708474922885, "text": "因为物种比较低级", "created_at": "2025-11-15T06:01:23", "owner": "zssgo_odd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061093427209450, "text": "那我还怎么当网络男神🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-15T05:14:12", "owner": "bexinbaby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094384375867354, "text": "因为懒…因为觉得自己长得一般般…🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-15T03:58:15", "owner": "jiayi.zou2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962402998004491, "text": "还有牢大", "created_at": "2025-11-15T03:30:38", "owner": "haixinyaoyao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117051988544677, "text": "用自己头像怕别人觉得很自恋🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-15T03:17:05", "owner": "zhangyu._.na", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126767206499972, "text": "最早在中国出现QQ的时候，当你不在线时，你的头像会变成黑白的。如果你用自己照片做头像，顶着一张黑白照，很不合适。", "created_at": "2025-11-15T00:43:30", "owner": "marchuzii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086120722978591, "text": "这还用问？因为我长得丑啊！我要是有吴彦祖的脸我头像直接放裸照", "created_at": "2025-11-14T22:54:15", "owner": "lrq2006626", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000063758828846, "text": "因为你可能不自由", "created_at": "2025-11-14T20:15:50", "owner": "chendaddy1214", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080902133033633, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-14T19:40:28", "owner": "felicityclarkson623vpn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078580724157260, "text": "建模有点怪。😡", "created_at": "2025-11-14T19:05:33", "owner": "luna895830", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17846304345606093, "text": "因为我的脸我自己都嫌弃", "created_at": "2025-11-14T18:22:59", "owner": "xiezhenghong78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850185322593269, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-11-14T18:05:20", "owner": "meng999521", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103889239723204, "text": "在中国，用自己当头像人们会觉得你是一个“过度自信”的人，尤其是你的容貌并不出众的情况下。", "created_at": "2025-11-14T17:07:00", "owner": "michael8822lee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041292698701743, "text": "因为尴尬", "created_at": "2025-11-14T16:25:43", "owner": "xiaan1005", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875748145351183, "text": "因為用自己照片當作頭像看起來容易被騙……", "created_at": "2025-11-14T16:00:28", "owner": "mopsy007413", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047884772421520, "text": "做销售的，才用自己的照片做头像", "created_at": "2025-11-14T15:38:22", "owner": "marie_bythe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032640872526018, "text": "上一秒用自己头像，下一秒被拉出来开盒", "created_at": "2025-11-14T15:08:23", "owner": "lilimengmengtt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086799598978297, "text": "因为用自己头像骂人，会被开盒", "created_at": "2025-11-14T14:44:21", "owner": "yizeng181", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18427757674109653, "text": "我要是有这么帅就当头像了我还要让别人用", "created_at": "2025-11-14T13:45:03", "owner": "joseph_07hz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18387847792181737, "text": "因为建模不太好", "created_at": "2025-11-14T13:07:00", "owner": "sherryolo8023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111291574596709, "text": "用自己照片感觉跟销售一样", "created_at": "2025-11-14T12:31:53", "owner": "sheep.542059", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866451892490914, "text": "因为我们中国人都是骗子呀，坑蒙拐骗家常便饭😂", "created_at": "2025-11-14T10:49:52", "owner": "lyn_toya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122077561518464, "text": "反过来了🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-14T10:07:55", "owner": "feng_qingshan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972351252955528, "text": "因为我们曾经用过QQ，QQ一下线头像就会变成黑白的，所以…😂", "created_at": "2025-11-14T09:38:24", "owner": "havonnee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097612081793405, "text": "文化差异", "created_at": "2025-11-14T07:57:46", "owner": "lisiyuan974", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070670432196813, "text": "用自己的头像会吓到别人😢", "created_at": "2025-11-14T07:38:36", "owner": "47890.3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085800626059046, "text": "因为中国不可以说些敏感的话，如果说了很麻烦，所以用自己头像就很容易惹麻烦。", "created_at": "2025-11-14T06:54:54", "owner": "joey288327", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054623537643637, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-14T06:37:26", "owner": "sufenfang8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990411675855747, "text": "因為滯納可以隨時盯上你😋", "created_at": "2025-11-14T06:34:26", "owner": "furina_1213", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056698766297648, "text": "为什么要用自己的头？？？", "created_at": "2025-11-14T05:20:14", "owner": "miaotmt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054160805643983, "text": "我以为ins上面的中国人也会用自己头像呢，看来不然😢", "created_at": "2025-11-14T03:04:02", "owner": "yue.joseph", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086152357984142, "text": "主要是我颜值太像佐助了拿我脸当头像容易被其他人拿去骗人", "created_at": "2025-11-14T02:47:07", "owner": "changpaodeking", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18391948345125046, "text": "注重隐私保护", "created_at": "2025-11-14T01:34:20", "owner": "oginbarb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102903625733138, "text": "为什么呢 ins说要用自己本人头像 所以就用了自己头像 主打一个听话😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-14T01:26:39", "owner": "plushnotebook1230tiffany", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906723583293637, "text": "你习惯一下就好", "created_at": "2025-11-14T00:47:24", "owner": "jiajia_702", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331910779233768, "text": "大家都是网络男神网络女神所以不太方便用自己的脸😂而且脸也不是很不方便🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-14T00:13:07", "owner": "shanyi0824", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098209639776245, "text": "The main reason is usually just one - anxiety about one's appearance.", "created_at": "2025-11-13T23:54:20", "owner": "zhangjinhao190", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948821041061832, "text": "🤣 culture difference", "created_at": "2025-11-13T22:50:11", "owner": "birdyselenaena", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998975499832862, "text": "我这种是纯属太自恋了…", "created_at": "2025-11-13T21:08:40", "owner": "yujayda018", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17849360604595367, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-13T19:19:42", "owner": "addfg4667", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980066793923882, "text": "因为自己长得不好看", "created_at": "2025-11-13T18:17:56", "owner": "zhangxinyun1880", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18010880906804848, "text": "不自信的表现，比如我😂", "created_at": "2025-11-13T17:57:45", "owner": "weijun3ss", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18184200085343426, "text": "长得好看的用自己头像会被别人觉得有点自恋，长得不好看的那就更不愿意用自己头像了。用自己头像的一般都是工作照，和销售有关的", "created_at": "2025-11-13T17:31:54", "owner": "michael_988918", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943772827077390, "text": "有没有可能是长的不太方便", "created_at": "2025-11-13T15:27:13", "owner": "ssordjin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18335692750235233, "text": "因為沒有你們好看😢", "created_at": "2025-11-13T15:19:45", "owner": "pannylai1006", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106733536617071, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈笑死", "created_at": "2025-11-13T14:55:54", "owner": "amberlin00001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145190512440629, "text": "感觉用自己头像太“正式”了", "created_at": "2025-11-13T14:38:00", "owner": "xingfan398", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17874781284442965, "text": "这个和裸奔有啥区别哈哈哈哈哈😂", "created_at": "2025-11-13T14:31:11", "owner": "1045676080lsy", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18045673304439723, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-13T14:21:58", "owner": "car.parts.luna", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078369014132918, "text": "笑死我了", "created_at": "2025-11-13T14:19:47", "owner": "michi011108", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18099114358683880, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-13T13:54:06", "owner": "xiugou3691", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17852562021577919, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-11-13T13:54:03", "owner": "xiugou3691", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17872132776454185, "text": "因為別人會用你的照片騙人", "created_at": "2025-11-13T12:25:12", "owner": "auroratalvina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046220063439098, "text": "搞自己的頭像會被朋友截大頭照，然後拿去做表情包😂", "created_at": "2025-11-13T11:31:02", "owner": "liugege712", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920882428191286, "text": "因为在中国用自己当头像的都是卖保险的，或者很商业化🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-13T11:22:02", "owner": "tong_tong1030", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18074966087189923, "text": "应该只有中国人会刷到这个视频吧😂", "created_at": "2025-11-13T11:03:02", "owner": "zhangdapaoyezi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18309756670180247, "text": "用你自己的照片当头像骂人的时候最先攻击的就是你的长相🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-13T10:35:17", "owner": "seereen0v0", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18160069321403295, "text": "这个评论区像在中国一样🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-13T10:25:35", "owner": "linaixi123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082018532511738, "text": "没那么好看", "created_at": "2025-11-13T09:11:54", "owner": "xiaolu7870", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063431594573649, "text": "🤠", "created_at": "2025-11-13T09:07:30", "owner": "sukashi22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987799977872501, "text": "因为好看🤓", "created_at": "2025-11-13T08:54:03", "owner": "xshu9984", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929310412149568, "text": "We are a game company if you can help us with promotion please contact me", "created_at": "2025-11-13T08:53:39", "owner": "lisanala1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18335120497238060, "text": "人太多了，长得不好看的也多", "created_at": "2025-11-13T08:42:37", "owner": "mils9459", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022407728597045, "text": "从来没用过自己当头像😂", "created_at": "2025-11-13T08:15:46", "owner": "won_s0103", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860905234536093, "text": "我就ins是用自己当头像 vx上抖音QQ都是搞抽象或者用自己喜欢的爱豆 x也是爱豆头像", "created_at": "2025-11-13T07:48:14", "owner": "violet_ni7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069622553582632, "text": "可能大家都喜欢更好看的图片", "created_at": "2025-11-13T07:38:20", "owner": "natialloy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059310317244307, "text": "用自己照片感觉有点自恋 但我确实有点", "created_at": "2025-11-13T07:11:43", "owner": "zhouxin0919", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022901909774734, "text": "亞洲： 1. 為了當蒙面鍵盤俠 2.對自己長相沒自信 3.就喜歡那張圖片 4.放照片很像直銷或詐騙", "created_at": "2025-11-13T04:09:26", "owner": "_renatus.artorias_0209", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007573862650418, "text": "对不起，我是骗子", "created_at": "2025-11-13T04:04:31", "owner": "xufufeng2001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159043441402864, "text": "为什么一定要用自己照片当头像？", "created_at": "2025-11-13T03:35:54", "owner": "dewu071", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156952036398637, "text": "因為很醜", "created_at": "2025-11-13T02:36:43", "owner": "mmm29mmm_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858192937485859, "text": "因为不好意思", "created_at": "2025-11-13T02:14:40", "owner": "shengxia377", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067586369088561, "text": "我用的是自己的哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-13T02:12:38", "owner": "lucynanaaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997095525700625, "text": "很真实", "created_at": "2025-11-12T23:00:03", "owner": "crushed3358", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085552409500341, "text": "因为我长得丑啊", "created_at": "2025-11-12T22:45:17", "owner": "ljc2361", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090007327737350, "text": "低调", "created_at": "2025-11-12T21:06:32", "owner": "random_jane2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074262998231384, "text": "因为大多数中国人性格很内向", "created_at": "2025-11-12T20:01:53", "owner": "yishuihan1998", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935471850983670, "text": "就是单纯不想用😢", "created_at": "2025-11-12T19:36:53", "owner": "liny.i0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901032730314395, "text": "因为不能吓人", "created_at": "2025-11-12T19:09:51", "owner": "ycw141314", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17864147313507581, "text": "个人喜欢有关", "created_at": "2025-11-12T17:02:27", "owner": "aster_caiyichen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048524540385546, "text": "有自信就会用自己头像", "created_at": "2025-11-12T15:20:24", "owner": "cocolinda8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888253171385300, "text": "我也想用呀，可是我长得不好看啊，要是美颜更像诈骗了，所以干脆不用了🌚", "created_at": "2025-11-12T14:30:56", "owner": "isabel99235", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17881341585427277, "text": "醜", "created_at": "2025-11-12T14:20:02", "owner": "clt_fchiu1213", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18425862742108899, "text": "沒二次元好看", "created_at": "2025-11-12T13:40:47", "owner": "dgjook415", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139079932459261, "text": "😢因为我长的丑", "created_at": "2025-11-12T12:52:38", "owner": "huanghuangzhuoxian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059024255246179, "text": "因为感觉拿自己的脸当头像感觉好自恋，而且感觉被开户了一样…😢", "created_at": "2025-11-12T12:50:07", "owner": "yunsw_07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016940837738092, "text": "对的", "created_at": "2025-11-12T12:41:45", "owner": "zilingzhang812", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079348775138344, "text": "因为觉得自己长的没那么自信呗", "created_at": "2025-11-12T12:38:01", "owner": "xunxu5677", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18349553215201556, "text": "犹抱琵琶半遮面", "created_at": "2025-11-12T10:57:47", "owner": "ningbaohui_0503", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950206078052555, "text": "AAA开头的就会了🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-12T06:47:24", "owner": "imasensiblelamb", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056267645297663, "text": "因为用了怕被说自信过头", "created_at": "2025-11-12T06:35:09", "owner": "znbdzzh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862340752521386, "text": "哈哈哈，比如我😄😄😄", "created_at": "2025-11-12T04:55:04", "owner": "liufeiyu536", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18248649454290764, "text": "不想被认出来呗", "created_at": "2025-11-12T04:47:08", "owner": "coco32345678", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081531293030934, "text": "用什么是我的自由啊，我也可以用自己照片的，也可以用喜欢的动物，人的照片。网名可以改备注的，谁会在乎头像啊", "created_at": "2025-11-12T04:45:12", "owner": "jiangluer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060529832221049, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-11-12T04:37:01", "owner": "chenfenghuhu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952794843898669, "text": "為何？就因為王八朝的一切都是建立在謊言和陷阱之上的。", "created_at": "2025-11-12T03:44:28", "owner": "drmkime", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986136012912419, "text": "正確的", "created_at": "2025-11-12T03:15:17", "owner": "casrenze", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079171145128251, "text": "用自己的像銷售🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-12T03:02:15", "owner": "huaiyu525", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18418232590119690, "text": "@inty_rukbo  hahaha", "created_at": "2025-11-12T02:46:34", "owner": "amzb0616", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068965355346800, "text": "有時候", "created_at": "2025-11-12T02:18:42", "owner": "cathy._.0725", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906703042268456, "text": "你们个个大眼睛 双眼皮 高鼻梁 上镜脸 能比吗😂", "created_at": "2025-11-11T23:12:17", "owner": "xrasaffron", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066770840458457, "text": "我任何网站都是用我自己的照片、我觉得首先尊重创作", "created_at": "2025-11-11T21:36:55", "owner": "yao.meihua.5", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17974992875952996, "text": "哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-11T20:35:19", "owner": "jiaoj_iao0818", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056134238302140, "text": "因为长得不好意思😢", "created_at": "2025-11-11T18:44:33", "owner": "whistler6840", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17931697239000480, "text": "Bro never heard about discord lol", "created_at": "2025-11-11T18:39:17", "owner": "yuns._z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853906669527452, "text": "现在很少了，因为p图很累🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-11T18:30:51", "owner": "freda0.o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18345372991200479, "text": "用自己的头像，昵称就是“头像是本人”哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-11T17:24:55", "owner": "reibunkaku", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082504940012090, "text": "用自己照片当头像的不是微商就是销售🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-11T16:42:36", "owner": "yangyabg95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960383442865824, "text": "為什麼外國人注重隱私還要用自己當頭像呢😂", "created_at": "2025-11-11T15:54:00", "owner": "ais99_yu99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950354926029571, "text": "因为很多人会偷照片😢", "created_at": "2025-11-11T15:52:15", "owner": "bobolii.ovo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114711940564274, "text": "因为丑😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-11T15:43:17", "owner": "zhengdideng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866160283492999, "text": "有原创妹玩ins吗快来找我扩列", "created_at": "2025-11-11T15:30:41", "owner": "hhh663408", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18385639849182661, "text": "可能… 只要用自己的臉當頭像 在網上說了一些讓人不愉快的話 別人會攻擊你的長相😂我覺得有這種可能啦", "created_at": "2025-11-11T15:28:31", "owner": "catkk1201", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083527415091828, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-11T15:01:52", "owner": "jenniferxiao.111", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17865556929490089, "text": "为什么要用自己的照片当头像。", "created_at": "2025-11-11T15:00:17", "owner": "duanpeiwen2", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18061905137530055, "text": "因为我太帅了 我怕吓到你们😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-11T14:02:18", "owner": "tangmuxun16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18325272214215160, "text": "在中国用自己头像的才是骗子🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-11T13:47:06", "owner": "lyu93058", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843659629605390, "text": "就是不喜欢而已😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-11T13:45:52", "owner": "zsq_wz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112665046605859, "text": "长得不方便😂", "created_at": "2025-11-11T13:06:34", "owner": "xiiooil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047867045390278, "text": "😂长得不大安全", "created_at": "2025-11-11T12:59:27", "owner": "zhoujiao430", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106008877624329, "text": "在中国，用自己的头像代表着你可能是个推销的，类似销售之类的职位哈哈哈其他人都不敢用自己当头像，因为这样可能会泄露个人隐私😂", "created_at": "2025-11-11T12:34:34", "owner": "zyxdbk1007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067501850525337, "text": "因为上网的目的是说真话，用自己的头像不方便🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-11T11:46:58", "owner": "txiaoli898", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946414321062107, "text": "因为长得太丑了", "created_at": "2025-11-11T11:22:44", "owner": "inkoyeaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080376047031276, "text": "感觉哪怪怪的用自己的照片😂", "created_at": "2025-11-11T11:16:27", "owner": "qia.qia.923", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983244150866396, "text": "有沒有一種可能他真的是c羅", "created_at": "2025-11-11T10:47:21", "owner": "rip_hake92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094126297855075, "text": "因为中国平均颜值低，真的", "created_at": "2025-11-11T10:38:42", "owner": "silent.echoes.serein", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18172933912370147, "text": "因为暴露自己的隐私", "created_at": "2025-11-11T09:51:25", "owner": "liu1.01010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896222596346722, "text": "😏", "created_at": "2025-11-11T08:18:57", "owner": "luojinning64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076505815933851, "text": "自己丑", "created_at": "2025-11-11T08:01:38", "owner": "cheng.xiangming", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900049198317252, "text": "自己丑", "created_at": "2025-11-11T08:01:35", "owner": "cheng.xiangming", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071948798258065, "text": "喜欢抽象表达😂", "created_at": "2025-11-11T07:42:13", "owner": "mindy.xia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078374225157295, "text": "笑死我了", "created_at": "2025-11-11T07:34:01", "owner": "transauto98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948279036924938, "text": "因为怕别人爱上我", "created_at": "2025-11-11T07:20:42", "owner": "haoshang_cx888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104714896629890, "text": "我们都用别人的照片当自己的头像🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-11T06:18:16", "owner": "lyhlyh405", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18002454419675739, "text": "有的是因为在用喜欢的角色或人，有的是喜欢的宠物或者风景，反正基本上来讲是对自己有纪念意义或者特殊含义的", "created_at": "2025-11-11T06:09:50", "owner": "wobushiren.20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112281388585766, "text": "哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-11T05:25:40", "owner": "vickyba185", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098805748705544, "text": "普遍对自己的外貌不自信吧", "created_at": "2025-11-11T05:09:27", "owner": "sasha710423", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954630124009469, "text": "那我呢？🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-11T04:23:02", "owner": "zhou232025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118336027550872, "text": "@weihan764 在我们这里一般都是大爷这种上了年纪的直接用自己的头像", "created_at": "2025-11-11T04:20:58", "owner": "xreaml66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103799674728455, "text": "在中国，用自己的头像才像诈骗或推销的，或被人利用自己的头像做诈骗，宁可不用自己的照片。", "created_at": "2025-11-11T04:16:26", "owner": "kiwataka.chn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125499058507355, "text": "因为文化不同现在老外也有不用自己当头像的，亚洲人喜欢用自己喜欢的动漫角色影视角色明星当自己头像，或者一些自己觉得酷的照片", "created_at": "2025-11-11T04:16:06", "owner": "numberalline", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037217786706237, "text": "不光是不用自己头像，连名字都不用真名，中国人网上和现实中是俩种个性", "created_at": "2025-11-11T03:25:04", "owner": "duyaods", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069427619365519, "text": "我不是成功人士😢", "created_at": "2025-11-11T02:55:56", "owner": "huazhi7962", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105963580628018, "text": "因为不自信或者含蓄 用自己照片在我看来用自己照片证明这个人是很爱很爱自己🤣觉得自己巨好看", "created_at": "2025-11-11T02:44:07", "owner": "shanchen1991", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064709414127900, "text": "网络冲浪 头像自由 （个人观点：“为什不用自己照片当头像？”有种被道德绑架的感觉）", "created_at": "2025-11-10T21:04:22", "owner": "ss_bae7", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17947540500058077, "text": "because their country social media full with crazy ppl and scammer.", "created_at": "2025-11-10T20:52:57", "owner": "mytheresa.com.my", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376859656145846, "text": "It's my soul", "created_at": "2025-11-10T20:31:18", "owner": "rovinyuyuyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060093977233678, "text": "这就是文化的差异啦，不要啰嗦啦！", "created_at": "2025-11-10T19:54:53", "owner": "melodylikemommyjuice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104789725642979, "text": "如果我長得很好看的話", "created_at": "2025-11-10T19:35:50", "owner": "sarielowo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862391155526870, "text": "哈哈 我是我自己照片", "created_at": "2025-11-10T16:56:31", "owner": "wenyuanxuanxin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18163608787379577, "text": "我的照片可以吗", "created_at": "2025-11-10T15:27:42", "owner": "zhoumaomao369", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055595900308985, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-10T14:48:33", "owner": "zhangqilingyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071234306038787, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-10T14:45:58", "owner": "jovizhou328", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029699372535492, "text": "用自己的照片很尴尬诶😢好不好看是一回事，不好看不爱放，好看怕被人说自恋😢", "created_at": "2025-11-10T13:45:40", "owner": "muxueshanger_82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076384495942915, "text": "🤣我是用自己当头像哈哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-10T13:41:44", "owner": "xiuyixx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926139814157963, "text": "因为我丑。", "created_at": "2025-11-10T12:40:48", "owner": "yangzhiciweimao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956041119994067, "text": "i use my real picture", "created_at": "2025-11-10T12:09:04", "owner": "tsing.jack", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897079243344032, "text": "因为不自信", "created_at": "2025-11-10T11:34:13", "owner": "xsx0508", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17967209639830302, "text": "用自己照片当头像给我一种销售和中介的感觉", "created_at": "2025-11-10T11:09:33", "owner": "axue79467", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033104732723510, "text": "因为太丑了", "created_at": "2025-11-10T09:31:21", "owner": "lwhds66666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049953863349399, "text": "用自己的照片当头像比较像诈骗", "created_at": "2025-11-10T09:24:12", "owner": "zuihudie6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027358073777095, "text": "因为我长得太他妈的丑了，黄色的皮肤和扁平的面部，甚至不如哥布林。如果我长得像您一样英俊，那一定会用自己的照片做头像", "created_at": "2025-11-10T08:40:33", "owner": "mireille123411245", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18431769241096316, "text": "因为用别的好看  用自己的长得不好看 不会拍照", "created_at": "2025-11-10T08:32:30", "owner": "miss_you910", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073276970340179, "text": "普遍现象2，商务工作，才会用自己的形象照😢", "created_at": "2025-11-10T08:29:15", "owner": "menduoquan4686", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081276125100926, "text": "@lufeixb", "created_at": "2025-11-10T08:08:24", "owner": "neo_houmh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094282480674523, "text": "Because in China, people who use their own photos as headshots are usually older people, and young people generally like to use their favorite photos or people who feel cute as headshots😂", "created_at": "2025-11-10T07:55:16", "owner": "l1amck", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18295486288284897, "text": "因为喜欢谁就想用谁，用自己的照片感觉好尴尬😢", "created_at": "2025-11-10T07:15:25", "owner": "yanganli10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061930508635182, "text": "为了配合一下 我马上把头像改成照片", "created_at": "2025-11-10T06:28:31", "owner": "fionabuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062611352411739, "text": "没有吧 我用的就是自己的啊", "created_at": "2025-11-10T06:17:00", "owner": "king1314567", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103489885638491, "text": "感觉很傻", "created_at": "2025-11-10T06:12:36", "owner": "chenyuru1124", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846390748599704, "text": "除非是喜欢自拍的，否则相册里唯一的自己照片就是证件照，严肃得跟销售一样……", "created_at": "2025-11-10T05:51:50", "owner": "eisen5954", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060928739633630, "text": "因为一开始就没那习俗，qq刚开始都是默认的卡通头像，而且大部分人相册里也没自己照片，要求头像就随便上传一张。", "created_at": "2025-11-10T05:50:35", "owner": "eisen5954", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18180775333352419, "text": "奇怪 外国人不用自己照片的也不少吧", "created_at": "2025-11-10T05:17:32", "owner": "pozhen84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878377327424876, "text": "因为这样比较有意思啊，我一看到自己照片自己名字的就会觉得这个人一定一板一眼有点无聊（有点judgy我知道）", "created_at": "2025-11-10T05:14:48", "owner": "dandan.d.d.z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080792624114407, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-10T05:08:48", "owner": "tiangesi7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183664378351126, "text": "就不用自己的", "created_at": "2025-11-10T04:48:00", "owner": "yu778992753", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075367697466914, "text": "头像而已，又没要求必须用自己照片", "created_at": "2025-11-10T04:12:01", "owner": "ketch_233", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898735699180659, "text": "因为自己长的太方便了", "created_at": "2025-11-10T03:32:06", "owner": "5237.01438qq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845383909605662, "text": "becuase i think I’m ugly", "created_at": "2025-11-10T03:08:45", "owner": "shiqizhou80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074625916986724, "text": "建模不行没办法", "created_at": "2025-11-10T02:46:48", "owner": "wang.youqi123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331863001239337, "text": "我长的太丑了", "created_at": "2025-11-10T01:51:08", "owner": "lipeixuan7863", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098641666775284, "text": "长得不方便", "created_at": "2025-11-10T01:33:31", "owner": "qinjianjun2012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101687332669956, "text": "确实是我自己的照片，没有露脸罢辽🤣露脸担心被喂ai或者被挪做其他用途", "created_at": "2025-11-10T00:14:54", "owner": "to_me0825", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097179472773686, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-09T23:51:54", "owner": "ozyman.dio.s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031453712723439, "text": "最主要还是都觉得自己长的不行", "created_at": "2025-11-09T21:40:19", "owner": "hhh494516", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085321703492965, "text": "長的像沒品的", "created_at": "2025-11-09T20:11:28", "owner": "rongr._.0302", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071739860263346, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-09T19:43:46", "owner": "rachel11.71", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917012332207304, "text": "建模不抗打", "created_at": "2025-11-09T19:04:04", "owner": "1224.kaixin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090283697507964, "text": "大家都不用的情况下，不想搞特殊", "created_at": "2025-11-09T17:09:52", "owner": "y.lily.4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105596491724548, "text": "因为外面骗子多，毕竟网络冲浪会遇到几亿人", "created_at": "2025-11-09T16:48:11", "owner": "lynn.h26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987081903745677, "text": "我长得不好看", "created_at": "2025-11-09T16:10:14", "owner": "djlivef", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883189585404777, "text": "微信用自己的头像的貌似只有中介和保险🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-09T15:30:26", "owner": "qiqi45307", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979171665922043, "text": "害怕Judge a book with its cover😮?", "created_at": "2025-11-09T14:13:37", "owner": "tom9_178", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080017514118988, "text": "因為自己拍的照片很醜", "created_at": "2025-11-09T14:04:18", "owner": "unnnnn0102", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869811862467277, "text": "用自己的照片当做头像别人会觉得自恋😢", "created_at": "2025-11-09T13:56:01", "owner": "shenglarigreen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145306075442613, "text": "因为会担心自己的脸被别人评头论足 会担心遇到骗子", "created_at": "2025-11-09T13:35:43", "owner": "shinogi_soma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108111154546040, "text": "用自己的。怎么搞网恋", "created_at": "2025-11-09T13:28:32", "owner": "xiangyiyao27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094615639873414, "text": "好了，我要用自己的头像了", "created_at": "2025-11-09T13:02:55", "owner": "zhao_sanduo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987033996859904, "text": "哈哈哈哈是的", "created_at": "2025-11-09T12:34:38", "owner": "hwt855866", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865659055491936, "text": "微信不用自己头像，ig用自己头像。", "created_at": "2025-11-09T11:44:14", "owner": "yjcduola", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065875268571248, "text": "因为用自己的照片当头像会被骗", "created_at": "2025-11-09T11:29:57", "owner": "wangao123hand123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18405552439187096, "text": "害怕别人觉得自己自恋不合群", "created_at": "2025-11-09T10:59:03", "owner": "dawishy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080632894896185, "text": "因为用自己头像容易被诈骗", "created_at": "2025-11-09T10:51:24", "owner": "chenke859", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112311805581621, "text": "╯﹏╰因为会被别人嘲笑，不开心ing", "created_at": "2025-11-09T10:34:25", "owner": "zixinlily", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100237243706146, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-09T10:22:48", "owner": "liao90052", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088098391750536, "text": "我的头像就是自己的脸", "created_at": "2025-11-09T09:23:21", "owner": "hhahbs123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050611418354987, "text": "我", "created_at": "2025-11-09T09:13:55", "owner": "yongjiulaoda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086112541806099, "text": "这边还好，那边主要是怕被熟人认出来哈哈哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-09T09:09:53", "owner": "dingd_0202", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18208958347313588, "text": "自己不知道啊", "created_at": "2025-11-09T09:09:44", "owner": "whling3644", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107264602556781, "text": "因为长得不太方便😢", "created_at": "2025-11-09T08:51:16", "owner": "qianye4174", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063564425530052, "text": "因为头像是自己照片很容易被人拿去干诈骗", "created_at": "2025-11-09T08:46:59", "owner": "ruyi2570", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084702811815755, "text": "啊？我的不好看吗？", "created_at": "2025-11-09T08:31:49", "owner": "wangshiqi0622", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889769890367695, "text": "因為社恐", "created_at": "2025-11-09T07:53:49", "owner": "rin._.mwlo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948548866026732, "text": "因为长得不是很方便😢", "created_at": "2025-11-09T07:10:29", "owner": "vicente83180", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18174604483365852, "text": "呵呵", "created_at": "2025-11-09T07:05:10", "owner": "zxyyxiiing_0525", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085488529950322, "text": "有一次我用了客户的头像当头像，后来才知道那个头像是他本人。他问我为什么要用他的头像，我说我们一起追星没什么不好。他说可是我感觉像是自己跟自己对话。我瞬间尴尬到不行了。😂", "created_at": "2025-11-09T06:33:38", "owner": "alice817329", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092235373718429, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-09T06:07:42", "owner": "linmin644", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850374034553430, "text": "因為害羞", "created_at": "2025-11-09T06:07:30", "owner": "linmin644", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064570448617175, "text": "哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-09T05:48:28", "owner": "hhhhhh1122335", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052487666662558, "text": "因为显得有点自恋 尤其是长得一般甚至不太好看那种吧。我在所有以中国人为联系主体的app都是用我家猫做头像 这里的就不是了 反正他们看不到而且大家都用自己 就无所谓", "created_at": "2025-11-09T05:29:32", "owner": "kaitlyynn_01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975503133949370, "text": "因为中国人网上吵架就喜欢把别人照片找出来然后人身攻击😂", "created_at": "2025-11-09T04:34:22", "owner": "rioml49", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095228527876040, "text": "虚伪奸诈", "created_at": "2025-11-09T04:33:33", "owner": "mecon269", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086596477785225, "text": "隐私", "created_at": "2025-11-09T04:30:02", "owner": "jeron7788", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085005296475859, "text": "用人类（？）头像的好多都是卖片哥卖片姐", "created_at": "2025-11-09T04:07:53", "owner": "cb10_25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881801374412327, "text": "因为觉得自己长的不好看 所以只能用其他人的美照来当作自己的头像啦", "created_at": "2025-11-09T03:25:10", "owner": "aifei656", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086378356968347, "text": "因为好看哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-09T02:57:17", "owner": "xiiymi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18538929586048179, "text": "我们就喜欢用其他的😏", "created_at": "2025-11-09T02:38:37", "owner": "yu983855", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968038194985344, "text": "應為中國人大部分都是覺得自己的照片不好", "created_at": "2025-11-09T02:38:04", "owner": "linzitao2012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905879389271465, "text": "骗子太多了害怕", "created_at": "2025-11-09T02:33:18", "owner": "hanyanfeng88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082307215995067, "text": "是啊，名稱也ㄧ樣跟名字沒關聯！", "created_at": "2025-11-09T01:59:51", "owner": "holystop2002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121021981522651, "text": "主要现实中都比较内向吧😌", "created_at": "2025-11-09T01:34:22", "owner": "zouyunhui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081590267015618, "text": "因为在中国往往用自己照片当头像的才是骗子", "created_at": "2025-11-09T01:24:03", "owner": "w18135192358", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097521823789095, "text": "因为长得不太安全", "created_at": "2025-11-09T01:23:15", "owner": "jerry_du7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085365421969604, "text": "不是自己照片不用而是抽象图片更有性价比", "created_at": "2025-11-09T00:36:00", "owner": "gzicheng1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057943490246072, "text": "Use your own head portrait to sell", "created_at": "2025-11-08T23:46:27", "owner": "yanghaofei35", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845055673608026, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-08T23:23:30", "owner": "anqi24228", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081229160027382, "text": "翻牆出去  留言說幹話  網信辦查到了還能在亂掰😂", "created_at": "2025-11-08T23:00:57", "owner": "t225331", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085366996803422, "text": "看评论区就知道了", "created_at": "2025-11-08T22:34:35", "owner": "zhiyouzhongguorennengkandong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117247099532792, "text": "哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-08T22:16:23", "owner": "yaoqiu2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172255384323408, "text": "我爱用什么用什么，我又不是外国人", "created_at": "2025-11-08T20:14:56", "owner": "jjjjudy1014", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18327655243209934, "text": "用自己照片的一般都是销售 还有教育机构老师🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-08T18:51:43", "owner": "cherry1216n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848615302564536, "text": "好難猜測", "created_at": "2025-11-08T18:07:17", "owner": "yxg_kkyeseng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968763204961047, "text": "有没有可以解答一下这到底是啥原因呢🫠", "created_at": "2025-11-08T17:26:04", "owner": "tongtongzhihao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083834287993341, "text": "自卑的同時保護隱私🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-08T16:33:06", "owner": "cpa.2734", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865800892494526, "text": "俺表示不服气🫤", "created_at": "2025-11-08T16:32:19", "owner": "celinex177", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18394089667126386, "text": "我这种头像会被认为是诈骗", "created_at": "2025-11-08T16:27:52", "owner": "tuoba_pingan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000502235823773, "text": "我在空白头像的不是更加那个。", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:46:07", "owner": "lin132436", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915681991228761, "text": "把都字去了，有人用，有人不用，这个是你的自由，别跟我说你们民主社会一个头像还必须用真人了", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:39:09", "owner": "superstar55661", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001445060833296, "text": "怕被秒开盒🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:18:29", "owner": "chenlingyu79", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071893667210199, "text": "长得太丑，怕吓到人，所以不敢用自己的照片", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:15:54", "owner": "luckyvere", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078786803141457, "text": "我的头像是本人", "created_at": "2025-11-08T14:52:53", "owner": "z626805", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18099254662702124, "text": "看看我的", "created_at": "2025-11-08T14:35:23", "owner": "hujingex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052527239335494, "text": "6", "created_at": "2025-11-08T14:25:53", "owner": "susu307122", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927485935018113, "text": "我只用可爱的头像", "created_at": "2025-11-08T13:42:40", "owner": "hutouhunaoxiaomaodie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861755323531471, "text": "谁懂评论区刷到全是中文的救赎感😂", "created_at": "2025-11-08T13:41:25", "owner": "xiaoqi03300", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940112272089834, "text": "nice", "created_at": "2025-11-08T13:40:39", "owner": "abouahmed494", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085748902791271, "text": "因为长的不太方便😂", "created_at": "2025-11-08T13:40:10", "owner": "xiaoqi03300", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075603698269744, "text": "中国很多平台上的心理博主都说用自己照片的人很自恋，导致用自己照片的人会招来一些恶意", "created_at": "2025-11-08T13:27:40", "owner": "evy_deerrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036767279711494, "text": "因为抽象", "created_at": "2025-11-08T12:45:22", "owner": "guv0303", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119789047476688, "text": "为什么呢？这是为什么呢", "created_at": "2025-11-08T11:25:34", "owner": "sunyan3965", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968391171964443, "text": "这很正常", "created_at": "2025-11-08T11:21:15", "owner": "jake15963", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066543146378234, "text": "🌚", "created_at": "2025-11-08T10:25:22", "owner": "yya_zj_0816", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845197867604706, "text": "Here only old grannies put their own faces on the profile pic", "created_at": "2025-11-08T10:15:22", "owner": "thomas_the_only", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084840115988639, "text": "十几年前我刚用qq的时候就是用自己的头像和名字", "created_at": "2025-11-08T10:10:53", "owner": "gsfl25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888262075380582, "text": "我也用自己的脸，有问题吗？", "created_at": "2025-11-08T09:58:00", "owner": "kanzhonghua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298594090267778, "text": "用自己照片感觉有点自恋和尴尬", "created_at": "2025-11-08T09:01:41", "owner": "keailllll", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18026930324771809, "text": "在中国大部分用自己头像的都是卖保险的或者是销售。嘿嘿", "created_at": "2025-11-08T08:16:06", "owner": "alincy11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061092299403213, "text": "没有啊，我们都用自己头像啊，我们都用自己照片啊，我还把每年换一次头像，换一张新的照片作为一种有仪式感的事情去做", "created_at": "2025-11-08T08:02:06", "owner": "foxy_judy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084697775087639, "text": "我对我自己的容貌不满意，所以用动漫头像好一点", "created_at": "2025-11-08T07:46:32", "owner": "xiekangqi6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185072095341115, "text": "因為很醜", "created_at": "2025-11-08T07:45:43", "owner": "yc682472", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17968722986987004, "text": "中国人自己的头像也是ps过一百八十万次啊，你也看不出来是谁", "created_at": "2025-11-08T07:37:35", "owner": "voicesforyunnanchildren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852054241577462, "text": "我觉得 我的頭像可愛，", "created_at": "2025-11-08T07:34:05", "owner": "sammi_liqing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082066718018475, "text": "因为长得不太方便", "created_at": "2025-11-08T07:20:08", "owner": "yummmy0731_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067058072379362, "text": "我们建模不行😢", "created_at": "2025-11-08T06:49:37", "owner": "biebukaixin95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077686219919409, "text": "因为觉得自己长得丑", "created_at": "2025-11-08T06:41:51", "owner": "jiuyue1083", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085069717945802, "text": "你觉得我用这个头像是什么意思", "created_at": "2025-11-08T05:42:11", "owner": "jiangmaxiee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078690272142272, "text": "In fact, it is mainly because some parts may be ugly. Using a secondary avatar can not only cover up, but also beautify. This is just for me personally, for myself.", "created_at": "2025-11-08T05:33:26", "owner": "shenhai.xinhai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861785740523494, "text": "我可不想被开户，上次那个外国小三和老总事件直接被人扒出来账号😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-08T05:19:21", "owner": "qing_pingguo72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886859809261526, "text": "這是真的！ 當我跟大陸同學加微信我發現為什麼大家都不用自己的頭像 我他媽怎麼知道誰是誰…", "created_at": "2025-11-08T04:56:25", "owner": "87.4.21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907771213266540, "text": "你们好，我是中国人", "created_at": "2025-11-08T04:30:13", "owner": "chenyongqi20140725", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942308647081347, "text": "Because people could copy your face to do phone scam", "created_at": "2025-11-08T04:24:55", "owner": "sharon_edan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18242135170305845, "text": "Because they afraid to be kidnapped", "created_at": "2025-11-08T04:19:36", "owner": "alvin_dddd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915760108214999, "text": "台畜日常送妈", "created_at": "2025-11-08T04:16:47", "owner": "shittyonse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912940792233826, "text": "这就是文化的不同了，在中国大家注重网络隐私，不会轻易用自己的照片当头像，其次就是中国网络有一些人可能会攻击你的长相", "created_at": "2025-11-08T04:07:45", "owner": "zd010203", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865570405484726, "text": "因为长相不方便", "created_at": "2025-11-08T03:48:24", "owner": "coisa_1002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073552640232426, "text": "我现在用自己照片当头像了", "created_at": "2025-11-08T03:39:43", "owner": "tutu18688", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097409083753988, "text": "因为丑🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-08T03:06:46", "owner": "miranda_xue_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18373493722157915, "text": "微信还不用真名呢", "created_at": "2025-11-08T03:06:08", "owner": "yuchao.98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097998625704078, "text": "用自己照片当头像我怕对面问我谁拉这了😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-08T02:51:22", "owner": "liuliuliu6098", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061543451532945, "text": "在中国用自己的头像当照片看起来像是推销的", "created_at": "2025-11-08T02:31:27", "owner": "guhaibara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924989191158794, "text": "Wtf 笑死我了繁中", "created_at": "2025-11-08T01:54:28", "owner": "sssya111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082355875861222, "text": "因为这个小猫很萌", "created_at": "2025-11-08T01:54:23", "owner": "tequila_annn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18306116455301847, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈我微信用虚拟头像，ig用真人🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-08T01:54:07", "owner": "djb_597", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069026198364572, "text": "可能是历史原因，因为社交媒体刚兴起的时候不能自定义头像，只能用那些自带的，然后就习惯了，所以就没人拿自己的照片做头像", "created_at": "2025-11-08T01:50:30", "owner": "cinan236", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033776900518232, "text": "看心情吧", "created_at": "2025-11-08T01:49:17", "owner": "touch199671", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086851792780196, "text": "因为台湾省搞诈骗的太多了", "created_at": "2025-11-08T01:15:29", "owner": "laipigou39", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18327910864209801, "text": "自卑或怕被骗", "created_at": "2025-11-08T01:03:26", "owner": "iampeterwan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17857655142549657, "text": "我的头像，有谁认识吗", "created_at": "2025-11-07T22:18:01", "owner": "arep.ublic", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18093351868861459, "text": "因为一开始玩社媒就是用的各种图片当头像  这本身很好玩", "created_at": "2025-11-07T21:33:59", "owner": "ilove26750", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102795244636902, "text": "诈骗/隐私/ 盗图 太多了", "created_at": "2025-11-07T20:02:38", "owner": "ciaoouis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158480989396824, "text": "不好看就不用", "created_at": "2025-11-07T19:45:34", "owner": "kijvj3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17850079695588463, "text": "因为头像已经成为一种表达个人风格的方式了，很多人在人际交往中除了看现实生活中的行为作风，也会把社交媒体当作了解一个人的途径", "created_at": "2025-11-07T18:47:28", "owner": "jingaeting", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17943051294081063, "text": "🤣因为长得比较像小偷", "created_at": "2025-11-07T18:35:35", "owner": "ehtoheh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078693665142586, "text": "因为我长得不配做头像😢", "created_at": "2025-11-07T17:31:46", "owner": "ejiang732", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066288359377711, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-07T17:04:22", "owner": "liuqiang158", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894213979349107, "text": "用自己照片的都是干销售的。。", "created_at": "2025-11-07T16:49:31", "owner": "zhuifengzhe299", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018948077608840, "text": "@willie820914 卧槽我快笑过去了 西方有些先进国家是真的 但你的台湾是屌毛啊 先进没有国家也不是 老娘头次听说搞鸡巴的歧视还这么理直气壮 离了别的国家资助你狗屁不是 台湾 于中国而言连对手都不配当 你也还不够资格让我继续浪费时间", "created_at": "2025-11-07T16:25:43", "owner": "eyaun_618", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892557091221056, "text": "因为我们有防诈骗意识", "created_at": "2025-11-07T16:21:13", "owner": "tina_zhengshizaixia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853923268522612, "text": "看自己久了会腻，", "created_at": "2025-11-07T16:02:46", "owner": "mika_zzzzzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026575811771743, "text": "你说得都对😂", "created_at": "2025-11-07T15:24:06", "owner": "kimchan1986", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030095132729920, "text": "比如我，就用自己的头像。", "created_at": "2025-11-07T14:56:22", "owner": "lingchengrich", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18179850652357210, "text": "我就长这样，咋了", "created_at": "2025-11-07T14:54:08", "owner": "theworld.people.exe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074702150199264, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-07T14:45:27", "owner": "telangpu8299", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060672692201180, "text": "我用自己头像 我感觉我好看 但感觉相机拍不出我的美（超自恋😂", "created_at": "2025-11-07T14:24:48", "owner": "a17301760818", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913980517235907, "text": "因为泄露信息太恐怖了动漫头像多可爱呀", "created_at": "2025-11-07T13:53:08", "owner": "nihai007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886780033261106, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-11-07T13:44:25", "owner": "zhou200700", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928066705140457, "text": "因為會被盜用開假帳號騙朋友呀", "created_at": "2025-11-07T13:28:52", "owner": "ckz2888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18388723885130547, "text": "因为丑🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-07T13:21:46", "owner": "juanyong0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062555789170886, "text": "怎么一翻墙全是同胞😂", "created_at": "2025-11-07T13:18:31", "owner": "xiaozhan12051", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090200810495498, "text": "我笑死了怎么评论区全是中国朋友", "created_at": "2025-11-07T13:14:38", "owner": "zhangmin412", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18177029815316873, "text": "我真的觉得画或者特意拍好看的那种照片会比我本人的好看（）", "created_at": "2025-11-07T12:52:38", "owner": "lizeyang106", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046405994427804, "text": "長相特別出眾的人應該會", "created_at": "2025-11-07T12:42:31", "owner": "b841027", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077275586137588, "text": "有点羞耻😢", "created_at": "2025-11-07T12:12:14", "owner": "tangmu0927", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990774141894961, "text": "煞笔用自己头做头像，", "created_at": "2025-11-07T11:35:49", "owner": "im_jerry_jiang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981480321762767, "text": "我太丑了", "created_at": "2025-11-07T11:28:21", "owner": "neochenxi6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144702679441131, "text": "我是cxk😂", "created_at": "2025-11-07T11:19:39", "owner": "14.62v", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539087152028231, "text": "對不起 我想說一句話 就是我看外國人帳號都好像詐騙帳號wwww", "created_at": "2025-11-07T09:33:44", "owner": "jewa._.0602", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18493763278077265, "text": "because", "created_at": "2025-11-07T09:12:23", "owner": "hkbghhnd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878555344424942, "text": "用自己头像会觉得尴尬", "created_at": "2025-11-07T08:59:53", "owner": "hulifei37", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087865696761290, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-07T08:48:14", "owner": "cecilia23zhang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111434008597640, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-07T08:39:16", "owner": "lay_ying1007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131404774468403, "text": "因为骗子太多了", "created_at": "2025-11-07T08:17:38", "owner": "shawn77049", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903755284144677, "text": "我觉得我好像没翻出墙一样！", "created_at": "2025-11-07T07:29:38", "owner": "xing_yiz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18323684200245251, "text": "方便當一個不負責任的網民", "created_at": "2025-11-07T07:15:00", "owner": "jacky.siew", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973390767959595, "text": "尴尬", "created_at": "2025-11-07T07:06:13", "owner": "alvinwu0120", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861851878520920, "text": "不是，一定要用自己本人的头像吗？用动漫头像也可以😁", "created_at": "2025-11-07T06:59:13", "owner": "kill93632", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18428498161107459, "text": "用自己头像会被人家拿骗人家", "created_at": "2025-11-07T06:21:02", "owner": "eniddeirdreden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082254209285058, "text": "信息安全", "created_at": "2025-11-07T06:21:01", "owner": "ray.nobuaki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086521259312962, "text": "我们相反。如果不是特别好看就不会拿来做头像", "created_at": "2025-11-07T06:02:10", "owner": "hanzh_icheng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096455218835806, "text": "这么一说，还是喜欢用自己的背面做头像🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-07T05:48:16", "owner": "adargon0821", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931923955106279, "text": "有些人很自卑，有些人为了防骗子，因为他们会通过你的图片威胁你要钱", "created_at": "2025-11-07T05:01:50", "owner": "hell6king6lucifer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917412970197628, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-07T05:01:19", "owner": "woossoksks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984148020872542, "text": "…", "created_at": "2025-11-07T04:53:58", "owner": "jyu2258", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084784010481963, "text": "长得不是很方便", "created_at": "2025-11-07T04:28:17", "owner": "sonnhannnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18392345551132292, "text": "用自己照片再说一点抽象的话  和当街脱裤子拉屎有什么区别🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-07T04:13:01", "owner": "amo_z27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911076340248205, "text": "因为长得比较抱歉", "created_at": "2025-11-07T03:43:40", "owner": "etherlight0820", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074861876238740, "text": "1.害羞\n2.隐私保护，怕万一哪天得罪人了被人挂照片", "created_at": "2025-11-07T03:37:11", "owner": "ai_look_studio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983803095873967, "text": "因为他们觉得自己长得不好看🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-07T03:05:05", "owner": "joeyyang0.0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059572010242524, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-07T02:37:38", "owner": "ywrdww", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18124120336505992, "text": "因為大家都不用所以我也不用😂", "created_at": "2025-11-07T01:29:48", "owner": "sufu16186", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056708462270711, "text": "发发朋友圈还行，真当头像P得太狠了，有点尴尬😂", "created_at": "2025-11-06T23:58:28", "owner": "nuodapei", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17895321024201016, "text": "😂我就经常用自己脸做头像，😑好吧，我微信真的用的是AI制作的卡通版，但是毕竟是我自己的脸。", "created_at": "2025-11-06T23:51:29", "owner": "zhangzichu6638", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18085833031793393, "text": "因为我觉得我太丑了😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-06T21:13:46", "owner": "anna617899", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17880789144306189, "text": "用外表只是暂时方便别人，但不用外表，表达的是自己内心", "created_at": "2025-11-06T20:00:24", "owner": "niansuisui9", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077579314922574, "text": "我也用自己的", "created_at": "2025-11-06T18:57:36", "owner": "a191981212", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077919028919877, "text": "我考虑了很久，还是决定不用", "created_at": "2025-11-06T18:50:53", "owner": "laiguoting", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18101507329663500, "text": "因为我长得丑🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-06T18:36:58", "owner": "ronghanye11", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17896438782343303, "text": "而且用昵称也不用真名。Facebook 都喜欢用真名", "created_at": "2025-11-06T18:33:32", "owner": "jasmine_goodgoodstudystudy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18019161788608316, "text": "因为怕被盗用", "created_at": "2025-11-06T18:24:00", "owner": "ivanlyc001", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098673139774510, "text": "我是😂", "created_at": "2025-11-06T18:23:50", "owner": "walisa5241", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17901017673161663, "text": "用自己的照片怎么了", "created_at": "2025-11-06T17:01:00", "owner": "chenrun113", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079904071882126, "text": "我头像多可爱", "created_at": "2025-11-06T16:09:02", "owner": "qingpingguo56", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18102793351710823, "text": "打开评论区全是中文", "created_at": "2025-11-06T16:08:54", "owner": "qingpingguo56", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18536615800055186, "text": "好像", "created_at": "2025-11-06T15:55:00", "owner": "powerbyopenharmony", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18001679510826795, "text": "1. 自卑，或缺乏自信。2 因为1所以需要掩盖，修饰。中国女孩的浓妆，垫胸，重加工都是这个表现。3. 缺乏对他人的根本信任，跟1也有因果关系，跟社会大环境也有关系。", "created_at": "2025-11-06T14:57:29", "owner": "tomandjerrys0_0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18101382625709447, "text": "Bro,你想卖保险，卖房吗？VX只是一种联系方式罢了", "created_at": "2025-11-06T14:56:48", "owner": "milan_tif", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18000123734823779, "text": "感觉用自己照片会被别人说自恋🙃", "created_at": "2025-11-06T14:36:27", "owner": "gao1133557799", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17868499176397662, "text": "因為我丑", "created_at": "2025-11-06T12:59:42", "owner": "yu_le0613", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18318926860301187, "text": "国外没有容貌焦虑吗", "created_at": "2025-11-06T12:33:05", "owner": "eddie32839", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18062085542178044, "text": "隐私", "created_at": "2025-11-06T12:17:49", "owner": "lingyu2348", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072103373199209, "text": "不想当保险推销🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-06T11:24:33", "owner": "yua_li1029", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18027321635748996, "text": "用自己头像好奇怪", "created_at": "2025-11-06T10:51:47", "owner": "wfcqwfcq", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18372624865152223, "text": "害羞", "created_at": "2025-11-06T10:47:00", "owner": "ziyehuahuo77", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18138274177458566, "text": "因为不想用自己的照片哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-06T10:18:23", "owner": "wang_zai8", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18350709601166937, "text": "用自己的照片当头像，当你在网上和人吵架的时候大概率会被别人把你的照片p成表情包", "created_at": "2025-11-06T10:10:08", "owner": "dcaidzy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18101245828734748, "text": "我就是用自己的🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-06T09:26:55", "owner": "arm_yuen_1012", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17977559159947886, "text": "我就用了自己的脸哈哈哈，临时找的照片", "created_at": "2025-11-06T09:18:11", "owner": "lyrawangggggg", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055518020309782, "text": "用自己头像像是打广告的", "created_at": "2025-11-06T09:17:00", "owner": "love_xiumin9420y", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17927784165141319, "text": "@oasisapler 你去国外留学要用自己照片当头像啊😡", "created_at": "2025-11-06T09:16:02", "owner": "21rainstorm", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17865137973497272, "text": "用自己头像容易做“错”事被人肉🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-06T08:29:15", "owner": "yeahstitch", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18091036903930132, "text": "容貌焦虑😂", "created_at": "2025-11-06T08:03:31", "owner": "seoyun.tv", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18020639096785196, "text": "保险、销售人员大多穿职业装 做头像", "created_at": "2025-11-06T07:58:27", "owner": "taotao.sg", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17869245015466801, "text": "用自己照片更像诈骗的🤣要不就是卖保险的推销的🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-06T07:55:48", "owner": "yyx011026", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18531971026025868, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-06T07:53:22", "owner": "guokangwong", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17853370524528998, "text": "因为我的头像比较可爱☺️", "created_at": "2025-11-06T07:13:21", "owner": "bx18.2399", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094791865837428, "text": "因为网络不安全", "created_at": "2025-11-06T04:41:49", "owner": "mada99099", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17938475774965300, "text": "用自己的照片感覺很low🤣我是這樣認為的", "created_at": "2025-11-06T03:56:29", "owner": "l2_guo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18105940483527113, "text": "在中国用自己头像的是骗子😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-06T03:05:48", "owner": "xiaoshou180124", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084887683997718, "text": "什么好看用什么 喜欢什么用什么，哪有什么为什么，用自己照片的也一大堆，头像自由好吗？", "created_at": "2025-11-06T02:35:11", "owner": "pink_jaychou", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18018695966606984, "text": "如果我长的很帅我也不介意用自己的照片当头像的😢", "created_at": "2025-11-06T02:33:04", "owner": "jhwu914", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084692362817840, "text": "性格和文化問題 我們不願意透露更多關於自己的個人信息", "created_at": "2025-11-06T02:08:57", "owner": "mziranq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024315971585562, "text": "有时候骗子会拿你的照片去犯罪。", "created_at": "2025-11-06T00:28:51", "owner": "xiaoyunxi_iiland", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082857692002072, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-05T23:50:09", "owner": "kangl_in9", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18048738338659083, "text": "我是因为我自卑啦 觉得自己长得比较丑 多数中国人也是这种心理", "created_at": "2025-11-05T23:00:23", "owner": "john_ken_zeng_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18408084517137410, "text": "一般中国人除了老年人都用假的头像hahahaha", "created_at": "2025-11-05T21:30:56", "owner": "lihuabai.6", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17880342891412984, "text": "因为我不是房地产中介", "created_at": "2025-11-05T18:04:58", "owner": "lion.888777", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17849181873591428, "text": "因为中国的互联网是“后台实名前台自愿”你注册微信支付宝必须用手机号，而手机号必须通过实名认证。", "created_at": "2025-11-05T16:30:06", "owner": "filwu86", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18188226982327395, "text": "哈哈哈，這是真實的", "created_at": "2025-11-05T16:26:24", "owner": "xl1nowo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18035839433710140, "text": "因为对外貌不自信😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-05T15:21:55", "owner": "j64127162", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085156960990068, "text": "因為不好看 用別人的或網圖就好看", "created_at": "2025-11-05T14:49:05", "owner": "gd0818_bb.0112", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18059043686538074, "text": "大家都不用自己当头像，怕自己用自己当头像会被朋友觉得很自恋", "created_at": "2025-11-05T14:07:57", "owner": "angel326an", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060527279632088, "text": "who😂", "created_at": "2025-11-05T13:36:25", "owner": "yuriadaobe", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047302091398225, "text": "因为外国人比较自信……", "created_at": "2025-11-05T12:50:03", "owner": "ziyilinnuo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18350911573162895, "text": "因为大家人际关系比较复杂……心里都有自己的账本，太袒露了不好", "created_at": "2025-11-05T12:16:52", "owner": "emma_guozc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17948891625047470, "text": "因为我长得太丑了，我头像这个人长得比我帅，所以才换的", "created_at": "2025-11-05T11:48:35", "owner": "qiuyuqiuyu18", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18100465816664743, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-05T11:26:21", "owner": "huangmeiyue57", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17880559908304534, "text": "因为不喜欢", "created_at": "2025-11-05T10:36:53", "owner": "banxiasheng_mujinrong", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18111369121578621, "text": "我的自由，为什么在乎别人怎么想？", "created_at": "2025-11-05T10:22:50", "owner": "likexin1659", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18164243470383671, "text": "用自己喜欢的图片就行了呀，就是不喜欢自己的照片", "created_at": "2025-11-05T10:13:07", "owner": "yogiyujiamm", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18108973210609776, "text": "那我还怎么冲浪", "created_at": "2025-11-05T09:51:21", "owner": "bukaixin89", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075537509181833, "text": "我本人觉得自己不好看所以不用🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-05T09:30:59", "owner": "1zhodjxjh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17964274940992387, "text": "在中国只有卖保险的和搞销售的才会用自己照片，其余都乱随便用", "created_at": "2025-11-05T09:24:06", "owner": "qingning9025", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082135343015803, "text": "😢感觉有点装", "created_at": "2025-11-05T09:10:39", "owner": "bqioo_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17866246578421012, "text": "因为长的不太方便", "created_at": "2025-11-05T07:31:10", "owner": "zikq_0112_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080427434120250, "text": "其实就是把喜欢的照片当头像啊 也不一定是人物 还有风景什么的拍的很有feel的那种", "created_at": "2025-11-05T06:51:04", "owner": "christine.rikiii", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17861899014525377, "text": "因为长得太随便  不方便做头像", "created_at": "2025-11-05T06:39:30", "owner": "zhangyuhui356", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18048626222376630, "text": "有些原因是对自己的长相不满意使用猫的头像，还有认为拍的照片没有现实的长相漂亮就是属于不上照。", "created_at": "2025-11-05T06:19:06", "owner": "crystalartchen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17861080350458716, "text": "真的有體會，我身邊外國朋友都是用自己的照片", "created_at": "2025-11-05T06:15:08", "owner": "yanaritsu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18103893664563360, "text": "用自己照片看久了自卑😭", "created_at": "2025-11-05T05:39:15", "owner": "yd089230", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074043686264543, "text": "only salesman use their selfie in china", "created_at": "2025-11-05T05:30:56", "owner": "dexhsy3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086655637752769, "text": "我就是", "created_at": "2025-11-05T04:16:01", "owner": "mang.guo521", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18101159899670948, "text": "你们那里脑控立法了吗😭", "created_at": "2025-11-05T03:50:37", "owner": "mengnan.ccadacadac", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060418706405380, "text": "评论区的中国人果然用自己的头像好少🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-05T02:53:23", "owner": "daixin0603", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058010411250007, "text": "我会把我喜欢的图片当做头像。我想给大家展示这是我喜欢的东西。", "created_at": "2025-11-05T02:10:13", "owner": "liqiu_uuu", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17919085614188320, "text": "身边很少有人用自己的照片当头像😂", "created_at": "2025-11-05T01:38:20", "owner": "sinnai_0133", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067055897378753, "text": "bro你的口音有一点像丁真😮", "created_at": "2025-11-05T01:34:42", "owner": "wep56262", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17919676932057226, "text": "我都是用自己的照片🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-05T01:09:24", "owner": "cupidlabubu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18428550214111096, "text": "🤣我只会在外国APP上用自己的头像，因为没有熟人，就算有熟人也是最亲近的朋友，在国内用自己的头像不好，经常会接触很多陌生人加，担心不安全", "created_at": "2025-11-05T01:04:21", "owner": "zihuizhan_ttom", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18022210652593497, "text": "Yeah, ha-ha.🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-05T01:00:21", "owner": "ye73843", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18537128131040977, "text": "因为外国人的头像代表长相，中国人的头像代表灵魂", "created_at": "2025-11-04T23:43:09", "owner": "tinmia1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17968807703966755, "text": "因为这只企鹅比较烧🔥🤓", "created_at": "2025-11-04T23:39:53", "owner": "fantuan.5114", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081887617841776, "text": "因爲很醜 怕被笑。", "created_at": "2025-11-04T23:08:14", "owner": "9ay648", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966742665994900, "text": "因為長的太安全，怕別人會有危險⚠️", "created_at": "2025-11-04T20:44:17", "owner": "leegt0720", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18026369141757662, "text": "反正我是不用自己的臉，是因為我覺得自己長得不太夠好看，放在上面感覺怪怪的，加上我怕被人拿去搞什麼AI。詐騙這樣子暴露了自己的信息，所以我不敢", "created_at": "2025-11-04T19:43:51", "owner": "jjlin1981327520", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077854595153635, "text": "用自己头像的都是AAA建材王哥", "created_at": "2025-11-04T19:27:24", "owner": "z465500", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084912322990455, "text": "因为丑", "created_at": "2025-11-04T17:36:30", "owner": "dongyang995", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152254351412755, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-04T17:35:52", "owner": "hezhongxian666", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085594172315979, "text": "我发现我的英语老师也是用自己的头像", "created_at": "2025-11-04T17:16:03", "owner": "oohj_ude", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17903450832146631, "text": "沒辦法長的不好看", "created_at": "2025-11-04T16:19:56", "owner": "davidtaylor953368", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18146265427428666, "text": "因为就是不喜欢用自己的照片当头像", "created_at": "2025-11-04T16:18:47", "owner": "marco_zhaoym", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17859795216537486, "text": "因为我自己丑啊", "created_at": "2025-11-04T14:50:04", "owner": "michelmoonshine", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17927235681140762, "text": "年轻的时候用自己的当过几年😢", "created_at": "2025-11-04T14:44:02", "owner": "relaxingqueen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072794993256744, "text": "因为用自己做头像 朋友会把你变成表情包😢", "created_at": "2025-11-04T14:28:01", "owner": "dhhdjs7631", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18076147597902583, "text": "因为用自己的照片会感到尴尬🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-04T13:07:17", "owner": "yjnnz0513", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17903618394148235, "text": "国内互联网兴起的比较晚。最早qq兴起时大家很少熟人社交，包括早期的论坛，贴吧，加上早期qq人下线后头像会变黑白，这样也不吉利，成了那一代人的习惯。至于新一代年轻人则是受青春期影响加上各种文化影响，动漫啊，影视啊，梗啊。往远了说是中国人自古以来内敛的性格所致，更多是在网络上呈现出一个理想的自己，所以会有一些自认为小众哥的动漫头像，玩烂梗的比如科比头像，上年纪的喜欢花花草草头像等等。这是个很有渊源的事情，不是我这点字就能解释清楚的，不过肯定不是什么用自己头像做不了键盘侠就是了，说这话和符合它以及点赞的都是啥x来的。到国际网络上不是你做畜牲的理由，到外面大放阙词丢人现眼🤣。这种下水道里的老鼠还不如讲师甜甜圈呢，起码人家是行动派。招笑完了。", "created_at": "2025-11-04T12:33:06", "owner": "buzaole123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085490552493991, "text": "有人会抨击别人的长相", "created_at": "2025-11-04T11:50:25", "owner": "grace98242025", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17915704791217284, "text": "自卑😂", "created_at": "2025-11-04T11:44:45", "owner": "handsome_man967", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062301455400265, "text": "评论区某些人真的不会好好说话，一看到“中国”这俩字就跟应激反应似的，上来一顿无脑黑，好像完全不会自己理性思考了，真的受过教育吗", "created_at": "2025-11-04T10:51:18", "owner": "nebula_1117", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103447321659319, "text": "因為外國人大多都很好看😂", "created_at": "2025-11-04T10:47:36", "owner": "aa_990623", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18093327343848886, "text": "當你自己沒有很帥時：", "created_at": "2025-11-04T10:42:45", "owner": "cindy130626", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17880443484304254, "text": "因为坏人多，想干坏事的人也多", "created_at": "2025-11-04T09:51:57", "owner": "arthurtang_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18383681041179282, "text": "因为我们脸皮薄", "created_at": "2025-11-04T09:41:00", "owner": "yajiechen857", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17992144568719780, "text": "也不尽然如此", "created_at": "2025-11-04T09:28:24", "owner": "fukai9137", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083584225831538, "text": "老一辈人倒是也会用自己的脸当头像", "created_at": "2025-11-04T09:23:01", "owner": "cidanshiliang", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072064913003320, "text": "因为长的不太方便嘿嘿", "created_at": "2025-11-04T08:45:01", "owner": "kuxiaxia", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18067905224608577, "text": "我看过外国人用玩具用鞋当头像的 更扯不是么", "created_at": "2025-11-04T08:45:00", "owner": "pook138", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082332445866353, "text": "像一個商務帳號在做推銷業務", "created_at": "2025-11-04T07:48:11", "owner": "free_asteroid", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17850642327581470, "text": ".", "created_at": "2025-11-04T07:18:25", "owner": "shuosanjiusan62", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18103505707628701, "text": "网络安全问题，担心私人信息被泄露", "created_at": "2025-11-04T06:49:15", "owner": "rain_2sweet", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17874730941355770, "text": "用自己照片会觉得自恋🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-04T06:40:35", "owner": "smin_esther", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17850760485580990, "text": "i wll be judged absolutely", "created_at": "2025-11-04T06:40:34", "owner": "ravenhsu77", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17934835898983728, "text": "我也用自己的脑袋做头像🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-04T05:31:17", "owner": "fufun0622", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18043793207463312, "text": "有点尴尬", "created_at": "2025-11-04T04:50:35", "owner": "ceny.ao", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17905861302266595, "text": "颜值不行", "created_at": "2025-11-04T04:28:15", "owner": "user3496760", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18105910414723787, "text": "因为我们觉得自己长得不太方便", "created_at": "2025-11-04T04:04:45", "owner": "zzovoqaq", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18412942513115053, "text": "我就用自己的😂", "created_at": "2025-11-04T03:59:44", "owner": "chaoyue829", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18112531510566148, "text": "我长的丑，我怕吓着你", "created_at": "2025-11-04T03:42:10", "owner": "benqiyin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086429734762810, "text": "中国人只有老人又自己的照片", "created_at": "2025-11-04T03:19:20", "owner": "xiaomengxian6", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17967384206974593, "text": "为什么要和外国人一样，你为什么不能接受不同文化", "created_at": "2025-11-04T03:01:27", "owner": "li.lau.7777", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18041559437697771, "text": "兩個原因\n1.因為長得醜\n2.因為吹牛逼可能會被認出來", "created_at": "2025-11-04T02:51:43", "owner": "tyyuy223", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091956556699853, "text": "哈哈哈，你来自哪里？中文说得很好👏", "created_at": "2025-11-04T00:04:07", "owner": "mariadanfeng", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18436379344102017, "text": "because i am ugly😢", "created_at": "2025-11-03T22:49:20", "owner": "sofia114533", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164019106390723, "text": "现身说法", "created_at": "2025-11-03T21:26:07", "owner": "yiyu.nan277", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078807569116869, "text": "因为我们注重内在文化", "created_at": "2025-11-03T20:55:40", "owner": "jin96365", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076844393177397, "text": "用自己的照片容易遇到骗子", "created_at": "2025-11-03T20:52:25", "owner": "bang.bangcai", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082110052850219, "text": "正常情况", "created_at": "2025-11-03T20:35:51", "owner": "panwuha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894784462351611, "text": "to keep ur own privacy", "created_at": "2025-11-03T20:24:25", "owner": "kristen.305", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116781640550237, "text": "笑死了，我也发现了🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-03T19:46:29", "owner": "luoyezhiqiu34597", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998658501836640, "text": "就是因为不能键盘侠🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-03T19:26:12", "owner": "koookeamm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106040419621037, "text": "😢在中国用自己照片当头像，被好兄弟看到了，哟哟哟好帅阿好自信呀。说不定还把你照片拿去ai一万种恶搞图片", "created_at": "2025-11-03T19:03:15", "owner": "yxl714003", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18364490740084367, "text": "正常", "created_at": "2025-11-03T18:06:15", "owner": "yuge4465", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136181536461814, "text": "我是觉得自己丑拿不出手😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-03T17:37:26", "owner": "kuandu92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963102796004337, "text": "这就要从一只小企鹅开始说起了🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-03T17:37:08", "owner": "i_am_nanan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843025939603984, "text": "中国人的头像，是中国人灵魂的样子", "created_at": "2025-11-03T17:21:21", "owner": "w17267489030", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084729262969866, "text": "Chinese people rarely use their own photos as avatars, but many people use their children's photos as avatars.", "created_at": "2025-11-03T16:23:56", "owner": "houhou1120146827", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18112577032577914, "text": "因为怕暴露个人信息担心被骗", "created_at": "2025-11-03T16:23:18", "owner": "supermmm.c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046638911397143, "text": "用自己照片做WeChat头像有点自恋😂一般都用别的，类似于狗狗猫猫", "created_at": "2025-11-03T15:38:18", "owner": "tingxiao_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898153942321274, "text": "笑死我了", "created_at": "2025-11-03T15:25:06", "owner": "chunfengdeyihuazuoqiao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946000222066593, "text": "你们管什么管", "created_at": "2025-11-03T14:48:18", "owner": "uhiygiyv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030351443732689, "text": "感觉自己丑😢", "created_at": "2025-11-03T14:41:16", "owner": "wshlmo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080461504869515, "text": "因為有點自知之明", "created_at": "2025-11-03T14:25:58", "owner": "maureen08_06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945579760062198, "text": "主要是，我觉得头像是人第一映像", "created_at": "2025-11-03T14:11:02", "owner": "pantao6699", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868132234394683, "text": "恰恰相反，用了自己的头像才是个骗子", "created_at": "2025-11-03T13:45:25", "owner": "jia.ng313", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952184650039890, "text": "because Internet is like another world that I can choose who I am or what I wanna be.", "created_at": "2025-11-03T13:43:04", "owner": "amoliu9749", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024405809781275, "text": "用自己的头像容易被说出自恋😢", "created_at": "2025-11-03T13:32:17", "owner": "l1031794781", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914983444216238, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈，有被内涵到", "created_at": "2025-11-03T13:26:51", "owner": "wudidouya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884726821392195, "text": "Our parents ask for that. A real picture could lead to Using real photos could lead to identity theft, being scammed, or being gossiped about; it's very immature.😂", "created_at": "2025-11-03T13:24:47", "owner": "wong_shayang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071694389021827, "text": "自己的照片不是推销就是房地产", "created_at": "2025-11-03T13:16:22", "owner": "qking2016", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926128936118254, "text": "Здравствуйте, это 528cargo. Мы предлагаем наземные грузоперевозки из Китая в Москву с импортом в Россию через порт Уссурийск. Наши услуги наземных грузоперевозок надёжны. Свяжитесь с нами, если у вас есть какие-либо потребности в грузоперевозках. Желаем успехов в вашей работе.", "created_at": "2025-11-03T13:09:10", "owner": "taohaha90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044065481466236, "text": "因为网络上不是真实的", "created_at": "2025-11-03T13:02:48", "owner": "xc6019614", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860982403455423, "text": "因為我覺得自己很醜", "created_at": "2025-11-03T12:01:33", "owner": "tim76494", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032982398518812, "text": "因为用自己的头像才像是骗子🤥😂", "created_at": "2025-11-03T11:50:46", "owner": "muthemartist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856315156501682, "text": "自己的脸拿不出手", "created_at": "2025-11-03T11:04:30", "owner": "eva141213", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046626359410994, "text": "因为我们长得有些随便😢", "created_at": "2025-11-03T10:57:43", "owner": "henxin8", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078976094157380, "text": "我這個就是我本人啊🤣8那那🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-03T10:17:31", "owner": "yyx._.0913", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18114734755561966, "text": "我不是中國人但我喜歡用我老婆當頭像", "created_at": "2025-11-03T09:54:27", "owner": "tao_taoouo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098117350740769, "text": "那样跟裸奔有啥区别", "created_at": "2025-11-03T09:48:06", "owner": "lx_sky1016", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095902204700886, "text": "当我用自己的照片当头像时全球最帅面孔：布拉德皮特，莱昂纳多，亨利卡维尔，瑞恩高斯林，我", "created_at": "2025-11-03T09:44:08", "owner": "yiz0715", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17920740594186955, "text": "找不到好看的照片😂用個幾分鐘又覺得怪怪的就乾脆放我喜歡的圖片", "created_at": "2025-11-03T09:36:06", "owner": "yuchending0923_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933970708101172, "text": "😧", "created_at": "2025-11-03T09:14:57", "owner": "wym_114514", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038499293501767, "text": "哈哈哈，因为中国人比较注重隐私，不想因为自己的照片被人评头论足，但也会一部分人会用自己的头像的🌚", "created_at": "2025-11-03T08:40:43", "owner": "_yikebaogame.manufacturer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063297191124603, "text": "一定有人會酸 然後他自己長得醜還在那裡噴🤮", "created_at": "2025-11-03T08:23:42", "owner": "1009._.333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009547790803412, "text": "用自己照片感觉怪怪的（我说的是我自己）", "created_at": "2025-11-03T07:37:53", "owner": "heeovo7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980044776924481, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-03T07:35:52", "owner": "linjiahui787", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105558007616795, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-03T07:35:48", "owner": "linjiahui787", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058027583226436, "text": "@0228.matt", "created_at": "2025-11-03T07:35:41", "owner": "linjiahui787", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046349711419031, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-03T07:35:34", "owner": "linjiahui787", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955359892001981, "text": "笑死了", "created_at": "2025-11-03T07:35:33", "owner": "linjiahui787", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106700917625650, "text": "怕被人追", "created_at": "2025-11-03T07:30:40", "owner": "henry_idkleh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046558061691964, "text": "社交的话就是有网名和自己喜欢的好看的头像", "created_at": "2025-11-03T07:09:47", "owner": "uejikieareutues0325_7357", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075265174959182, "text": "Is there any foreign friend who can help me learn English", "created_at": "2025-11-03T06:49:36", "owner": "heqiang13", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18540461629006835, "text": "保持神秘😏", "created_at": "2025-11-03T06:40:51", "owner": "fiona2025chen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112876483503804, "text": "用自己喜歡的圖片不是表達了自己的熱愛？", "created_at": "2025-11-03T05:46:12", "owner": "ivy_wong618", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960010398861031, "text": "用z ji", "created_at": "2025-11-03T05:45:37", "owner": "ivy_wong618", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897042292336939, "text": "Because we don’t want others to stalk our pictures and scam us😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-03T05:25:13", "owner": "luvahyn_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842828311610405, "text": "銷售或者詐騙才會把自己照片當頭像😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-03T05:21:11", "owner": "shinnosuke.e.e", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17967373028826178, "text": "主要是不自信😂", "created_at": "2025-11-03T05:01:58", "owner": "caimin900719", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18527648941047024, "text": "用自己头像，别人都说我是网图😋", "created_at": "2025-11-03T04:59:54", "owner": "chuanyiwang0521", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085214851802233, "text": "因為自己的照片不好看 不能當愛情詐騙犯😍", "created_at": "2025-11-03T04:52:51", "owner": "0___oy.kolien", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137336548458703, "text": "不知道🤣😂", "created_at": "2025-11-03T04:19:29", "owner": "shalinetseng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057630524260644, "text": "没有这种惯例，就好比国内微信没有已读功能。", "created_at": "2025-11-03T03:59:00", "owner": "ha_ha6881", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081011486031547, "text": "因为用自己的照片更像是推销或诈骗🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-03T03:23:55", "owner": "insrita2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908797054255995, "text": "上网骂人会有人拿你照片p遗照^_^", "created_at": "2025-11-03T02:27:57", "owner": "henna_1688", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096665968765743, "text": "我用自己的头像", "created_at": "2025-11-03T02:02:47", "owner": "dabao4504", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946399312061760, "text": "这边一般用自己全身照当头像的都是网课老师，销售和房地产中介🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-03T01:49:20", "owner": "white_rasicals", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911166193101497, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-11-03T00:41:22", "owner": "q1175241477", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874621252356294, "text": "因为不够自信", "created_at": "2025-11-03T00:17:34", "owner": "abby06220723", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084892801969862, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-02T23:37:50", "owner": "as_dfgh8495", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048906008663414, "text": "I am Chinese, and the reason why I do this is simply because I think it looks good🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-02T22:37:07", "owner": "xculoc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18117580090478062, "text": "Cuz I don't want ppl using my dace to do illegal stuff;-;", "created_at": "2025-11-02T21:31:59", "owner": "rose_cat3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18091854472711329, "text": "会被p成遗照", "created_at": "2025-11-02T21:09:25", "owner": "sdbgs_td88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901995688291794, "text": "还有名字，不备注一下，三天可见是谁都不知道🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-02T20:51:31", "owner": "sasahumakeup", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968922639974453, "text": "因为从小就听家长说 不要把自己的真实照片和家庭住址发到网上去 形成了一种记忆模式", "created_at": "2025-11-02T18:56:15", "owner": "zzz1104_z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079999682116383, "text": "我社恐bro", "created_at": "2025-11-02T18:19:16", "owner": "95.279605", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138245986459673, "text": "喜欢用自己喜欢的游戏角色当头像（vx）这样有时候来不及找资源可以应急", "created_at": "2025-11-02T18:15:22", "owner": "_white_mantoua_a323", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919751707195697, "text": "用自己照片感覺像是賣保險的", "created_at": "2025-11-02T17:39:30", "owner": "loophho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934684611983102, "text": "我长得像💩", "created_at": "2025-11-02T17:37:07", "owner": "wison456", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070976258588057, "text": "这有什么的 也有外国人不用自己照片当头像啊 中国人也有人用自己照片当头像啊 这就是个人行为习惯而已 并体现不大出什么 就像有人左撇子有人右撇子", "created_at": "2025-11-02T17:32:37", "owner": "jademanaj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009981653798430, "text": "因為我們不像你們一樣怎麼拍都好看，看起來很像一顆饅頭🤣（無惡意）", "created_at": "2025-11-02T17:27:54", "owner": "chengye0331", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18317808928168437, "text": "因为太有个性了🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-02T17:22:12", "owner": "apieceofcake969", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938072727964352, "text": "因为我也不知道啊:）", "created_at": "2025-11-02T17:11:35", "owner": "langjiangqingshui_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987284814883633, "text": "长得好看早就用了🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-02T17:01:34", "owner": "woxinbenwulei42", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152867554412592, "text": "🤣😂🤣😂🤣😂腼腆", "created_at": "2025-11-02T16:24:33", "owner": "arlang0905", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903241558268858, "text": "Privacy", "created_at": "2025-11-02T16:18:30", "owner": "jerry.wong.3377", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083242162992737, "text": "大部分都是不自信或者害怕被认为是自恋狂吧…", "created_at": "2025-11-02T16:10:46", "owner": "adamholdenhu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072280751260287, "text": "可能中国最早的社交软件qq默认设置了很多卡通头像，然后都习惯了", "created_at": "2025-11-02T16:06:16", "owner": "hbhuojian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986456856903559, "text": "蛤？房屋仲介才會用自己的頭像！！😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-02T15:55:18", "owner": "duyichengdu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18102364720649510, "text": "笑死了", "created_at": "2025-11-02T15:24:20", "owner": "lsttt_666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029034674539537, "text": "中国人比较含蓄", "created_at": "2025-11-02T14:58:53", "owner": "loveviolentine", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18295421113284586, "text": "我個人認為的原因是容易被身邊的人笑 除非是有工作需求，不然很少直接用自己照片拿來當頭像🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-02T14:51:06", "owner": "liqingfeng.nv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962927142847901, "text": "因为太丑了", "created_at": "2025-11-02T14:41:23", "owner": "bi4296659", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18199302907317615, "text": "我就是阿👍🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-02T14:28:35", "owner": "ynn.9.13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030951311724816, "text": "怕被别人诈骗…", "created_at": "2025-11-02T14:19:31", "owner": "jessi_ye_936596", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094891732878204, "text": "我用的是自己的頭像，不過是加ai合成的", "created_at": "2025-11-02T14:15:22", "owner": "cxixt_09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159988714386381, "text": "cuz i 'm veryyyyyy ugly", "created_at": "2025-11-02T14:08:24", "owner": "jsuyan__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889837159368435, "text": "因为觉得好看就用了", "created_at": "2025-11-02T13:27:38", "owner": "kkwwtkk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18537809041048484, "text": "因为只有种姓制度下才会在意别人头像是不是真人🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-02T13:19:11", "owner": "yangdh78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916147723208407, "text": "因为中国人都是骗子", "created_at": "2025-11-02T13:19:07", "owner": "k8mm1998", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095409706698242, "text": "因为人太多了哈哈，即使是用自己的脸都分不出来", "created_at": "2025-11-02T13:17:17", "owner": "oaoecho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984775203875193, "text": "有用啊", "created_at": "2025-11-02T12:57:59", "owner": "cyrus_0822", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085762091500129, "text": "尴尬", "created_at": "2025-11-02T12:57:37", "owner": "cixinliu371", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063879455574082, "text": "啊…只是想用自己觉得可爱的形象，或是能表达自己目前状态的图片😂", "created_at": "2025-11-02T12:46:40", "owner": "woshi_xiaotuji", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160104187356968, "text": "🤣 可以找我们做headshot", "created_at": "2025-11-02T12:25:45", "owner": "lucidportraits_asian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18181073221355089, "text": "用自己的照片會被騷擾", "created_at": "2025-11-02T12:14:53", "owner": "rui_0718o", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18005190224657634, "text": "用自己的照片當頭像，那很像照騙", "created_at": "2025-11-02T12:11:57", "owner": "murasame_0722", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17914266618211271, "text": "为什么一定要用自己脸的头像呢？喜欢放什么都放什么呗，中国还有利用头像测试这个人的性格呢", "created_at": "2025-11-02T12:02:12", "owner": "jinfei319", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112324603507181, "text": "中国有先进的人脸识别和ai创作技术，用自己照片当头像反而更容易被骗", "created_at": "2025-11-02T11:58:49", "owner": "sanjin23436", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18412136263189193, "text": "我也是自己的脸", "created_at": "2025-11-02T11:09:34", "owner": "35_0234", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18543518041007427, "text": "怕被做成表情包", "created_at": "2025-11-02T10:06:39", "owner": "0112coey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078899012081846, "text": "是啊", "created_at": "2025-11-02T10:04:56", "owner": "lin.linyule", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061105580406973, "text": "人類世界不會允許哥布林出現😢", "created_at": "2025-11-02T10:01:51", "owner": "a_bei._.1223", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987589131889135, "text": "because of fashion", "created_at": "2025-11-02T09:58:07", "owner": "wahaha0279", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17842902042606077, "text": "✔👏💖💕🙌🤷‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-11-02T09:40:20", "owner": "ieun9722", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098377207689034, "text": "在ins入乡随俗了", "created_at": "2025-11-02T09:40:02", "owner": "busypanda001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133837822470638, "text": "因为怕被网暴，我们国内这种事情还是很常见的，你无法知道他们会拿你的头像干什么", "created_at": "2025-11-02T09:28:08", "owner": "yuetian520", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17864561889501117, "text": "很容易被盜或是因為不好意思，而且亞洲地區的人多半比歐美地區社恐", "created_at": "2025-11-02T09:15:57", "owner": "j_lee_73", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948124281919858, "text": "No I use myself picture", "created_at": "2025-11-02T08:38:21", "owner": "veyalighting", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18187805809337484, "text": "因为感觉自己太丑了🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-02T08:17:30", "owner": "wx.wcwx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100342726731272, "text": "haha  it's very funny", "created_at": "2025-11-02T08:01:40", "owner": "yuyoo592", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939282993962417, "text": "长得好看的拿自己做头像像诈骗，长得难看的拿自己做头像像销售要么就是老年", "created_at": "2025-11-02T07:47:33", "owner": "hxd3d7002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053566754638800, "text": "因为我觉得自己不好看，所以不用自己的头像", "created_at": "2025-11-02T07:29:21", "owner": "enyan1027", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071266802365399, "text": "上传的不仅是头像，更是灵魂和态度的表现", "created_at": "2025-11-02T07:15:37", "owner": "niannian2978", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18039537881496396, "text": "喜欢用自担或漂亮的头像", "created_at": "2025-11-02T06:54:16", "owner": "minnichao.o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901508767298815, "text": "@estee_nissan 用自己的照片在微信当头像 没有安全感，感觉没有隐私哈哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-02T06:53:02", "owner": "shekinah_yeshua33", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047747417398002, "text": "好吧", "created_at": "2025-11-02T06:41:20", "owner": "beliebingjustin9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080020490142728, "text": "我用了，但不是大头照，是个侧身照", "created_at": "2025-11-02T06:25:17", "owner": "hongyufred", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539104138012004, "text": "if u use your actual photo, than u face will be a emoticon", "created_at": "2025-11-02T06:08:14", "owner": "songwang513", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062735471157176, "text": "哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-02T05:59:42", "owner": "tiu02_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945324222935641, "text": "吃太胖了，不想用自己照片。而且确实那种电信诈骗，缅北园区的和台湾的", "created_at": "2025-11-02T05:40:28", "owner": "pjy4116", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080235392042332, "text": "我也是本人", "created_at": "2025-11-02T05:32:58", "owner": "2118996368bbk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882485860405413, "text": "因为中国使用软件本来就是实名制，而且都是娱乐用并不交朋友，所以就用自己喜欢的当头像", "created_at": "2025-11-02T05:17:13", "owner": "liim_snowu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094448692827715, "text": "👁️👄👁️", "created_at": "2025-11-02T05:07:15", "owner": "oliverma0122", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886053094391739, "text": "yes，别想让我实名上网哈", "created_at": "2025-11-02T04:39:17", "owner": "sookim1389", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026679854559052, "text": "因为怕开盒", "created_at": "2025-11-02T04:29:56", "owner": "archwellgo", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17915831631210526, "text": "建模不好 能辟邪那种😢", "created_at": "2025-11-02T04:22:31", "owner": "zoechow1122y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082155419009695, "text": "中国人用自己当头像的才想诈骗犯吧😂", "created_at": "2025-11-02T04:17:31", "owner": "dutch_marisa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864502561499410, "text": "不是没有，全是老年人", "created_at": "2025-11-02T04:09:41", "owner": "kimino114514", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073305992464034, "text": "@wuyue1569 原来是这样吗😮", "created_at": "2025-11-02T03:41:25", "owner": "yijian_0527", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943711276066548, "text": "真诚相待 把网名改成自己的名字 把头像改成自己的照片 把微信号改成自己的身份证号码 把个性签名改成自己的出生年月日 在网上得罪人了人家都不用开你", "created_at": "2025-11-02T03:20:05", "owner": "imnotweixiao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055925594301593, "text": "i just use my own profile picture 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-02T03:17:22", "owner": "kangdai95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18432542356100300, "text": "On reddit, twitch or even YouTube, many people also use random pictures as their profile picture. I", "created_at": "2025-11-02T03:04:05", "owner": "freier.zhou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853069585567272, "text": "用自己的照片会被同学拿去做表情包❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-02T02:05:20", "owner": "johnson_gkh", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17874714867354616, "text": "因为太帅了，怕妹妹之间打仗😂", "created_at": "2025-11-02T02:04:06", "owner": "guyongzj", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18289126141275907, "text": "对，用自己的照片万一碰到骗子怎么办", "created_at": "2025-11-02T01:49:16", "owner": "katharine39139", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121228459519141, "text": "用自己頭像的我們一般叫微商🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-02T01:47:22", "owner": "1997holychan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956357940880820, "text": "@iloveziyuu 我也是哈哈哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-02T01:32:07", "owner": "wlj20100108_lzx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18021184892783766, "text": "用自己照片跟被开户有什么区别", "created_at": "2025-11-02T01:27:02", "owner": "ml48062", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891929662358171, "text": "因为国人害怕信息安泄露，所以不用自己照片当头像", "created_at": "2025-11-02T01:15:54", "owner": "wcjiang848", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082169981043611, "text": "因为 样貌焦虑 身材焦虑 不自信  在意他人对自己的看法", "created_at": "2025-11-02T00:39:07", "owner": "janis0229w", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967323879967422, "text": "用自己头像，穿西装的一般都是卖保险卖车卖房的，而且中国人爱当喷子，你用自己头像会被喷。", "created_at": "2025-11-02T00:12:12", "owner": "ocr5x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897598534184804, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-02T00:05:29", "owner": "alexhuang174", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099287401707254, "text": "在中国，用自己的照片做头像比较像诈骗的🌚", "created_at": "2025-11-01T23:39:04", "owner": "gavensong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296709742257763, "text": "1.隐私\n2.个性化", "created_at": "2025-11-01T23:12:32", "owner": "5694_zoe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084629698955737, "text": "长的太丑了，拿自己头像当照片成小丑吗，我要是长成你们那样，我宁愿天天换一个头像", "created_at": "2025-11-01T23:11:16", "owner": "ruanpanqian", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17844014250604706, "text": "用自己头像，别人会认为你很strong😂🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-01T23:00:33", "owner": "rocco62249", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18091739014705755, "text": "因为我丑。", "created_at": "2025-11-01T22:12:42", "owner": "_jennieruby77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064808150118525, "text": "Aaa联塑管道批发", "created_at": "2025-11-01T20:07:24", "owner": "jonsalanalan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999347490686407, "text": "我。。。。", "created_at": "2025-11-01T19:10:44", "owner": "xma97556", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18536598694009407, "text": "隐私性比较强", "created_at": "2025-11-01T19:04:47", "owner": "tgtcici", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911641699095993, "text": "That’s so real", "created_at": "2025-11-01T18:56:48", "owner": "lichengwang_11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070469507254032, "text": "我长得不太方便！", "created_at": "2025-11-01T18:46:15", "owner": "oiaioiiaioiiiai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18317742589172143, "text": "可能是觉得自己不好看(ó﹏ò｡)我用 ai 转成了动画风格", "created_at": "2025-11-01T18:21:05", "owner": "peterchen_28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092316652884137, "text": "Maybe they want to show you good things.", "created_at": "2025-11-01T18:12:11", "owner": "michaelji5588", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18538582714011373, "text": "因為我醜 可以嗎", "created_at": "2025-11-01T17:54:57", "owner": "ky.xp06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889427254241154, "text": "用自己的照片那玩意不适合，容易被开盒", "created_at": "2025-11-01T17:20:38", "owner": "zhangzhangchengming", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031245983726868, "text": "111兄弟v我5块", "created_at": "2025-11-01T17:15:05", "owner": "roselhl111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18410548153186524, "text": "一開始用抖音的時候有人問我頭像是本人嗎 問得我有點問號😂現在懂了", "created_at": "2025-11-01T16:50:26", "owner": "rae_03_16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057666767296945, "text": "因為土，而且對自己長相不自信", "created_at": "2025-11-01T16:21:42", "owner": "zmx_666_zzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083819273062844, "text": "颜值不太适合拿出来，有点丢人", "created_at": "2025-11-01T16:15:36", "owner": "llllsr714", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900156370299981, "text": "hh", "created_at": "2025-11-01T16:09:46", "owner": "yejunbin66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094264102798395, "text": "帅得不明显，就不拿出来了", "created_at": "2025-11-01T15:57:17", "owner": "feng22426", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111359338602754, "text": "因為貓咪可愛呀！", "created_at": "2025-11-01T15:49:50", "owner": "mila_1020712", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046973402396684, "text": "因为斗地主的农民很萌", "created_at": "2025-11-01T15:19:12", "owner": "latttuuuuy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18424320079107774, "text": "出门在外形象是自己给的", "created_at": "2025-11-01T15:15:26", "owner": "milinlin9869", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970972629953089, "text": "因為不想被騙", "created_at": "2025-11-01T15:14:30", "owner": "jade16832022", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085599181988275, "text": "建模不行，不敢当头像", "created_at": "2025-11-01T15:05:31", "owner": "shellyant0707", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18118374544531775, "text": "我笑晕了", "created_at": "2025-11-01T15:04:24", "owner": "ovo.tian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072727349209103, "text": "方便在网上玩角色扮演🤓", "created_at": "2025-11-01T14:49:24", "owner": "wasd1989mn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17995432589841574, "text": "因为我长得不太方便", "created_at": "2025-11-01T14:26:10", "owner": "panchen0123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080720024119727, "text": "Actually, introverted foreigners wouldn't use their own photos as avatars", "created_at": "2025-11-01T14:09:06", "owner": "kamiyama_36", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18271454026303224, "text": "还有为什么外国人喜欢用真名当网名啊…不会很危险吗", "created_at": "2025-11-01T14:08:48", "owner": "cherrynanzigu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114902302548616, "text": "一直都这样😢", "created_at": "2025-11-01T12:45:12", "owner": "zhangyi21646", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026566661563982, "text": "因为觉得自己的照片很丑", "created_at": "2025-11-01T12:41:51", "owner": "songqing863", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042730265693450, "text": "感觉用自己当头像好尴尬😢", "created_at": "2025-11-01T12:35:24", "owner": "zhongyesanjiu968", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132521488477478, "text": "卡建模", "created_at": "2025-11-01T12:27:28", "owner": "nahuishuyuwodeyiqie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863452342435312, "text": "外國人長那麼好看當然敢拿自己的臉當頭像啊 亞洲人一個個都是廉價建模NPC欸", "created_at": "2025-11-01T12:21:31", "owner": "billy090811", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18186453304337637, "text": "@chen_23tangyuan 笑死，重点是：这是一条狗吗", "created_at": "2025-11-01T12:16:53", "owner": "gotalexchew", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964146933842622, "text": "容貌焦慮ㄅ", "created_at": "2025-11-01T11:50:04", "owner": "han_k627", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098692102740536, "text": "因为会有人用自己照片去犯罪都有可能，还会拿去做些不好的事情，是网络安全的问题", "created_at": "2025-11-01T11:26:52", "owner": "ksy_2579", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913034245233326, "text": "用自己头像的，那都是销售😂", "created_at": "2025-11-01T11:21:43", "owner": "zhangjiashun1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117122803557751, "text": "不仅是中国，其他亚洲也是这样子", "created_at": "2025-11-01T11:08:09", "owner": "jamhamham", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079964648095644, "text": "用自己脸的头像已经过时了…而且现在更容易被诈骗犯扫脸", "created_at": "2025-11-01T10:22:25", "owner": "lazybug000777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112063528601910, "text": "太醜(◐‿◑)�", "created_at": "2025-11-01T10:15:47", "owner": "s10810324", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851078011578845, "text": "中国人比较内敛 而外国相对开放", "created_at": "2025-11-01T08:56:43", "owner": "rzx4100", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055059995647423, "text": "和教育问题也有关系吧，用自己当头像在中国很容易被认为自恋😢", "created_at": "2025-11-01T08:55:08", "owner": "y1xun_ins", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088093714933142, "text": "因为我没有白猫，头像就要抱一只", "created_at": "2025-11-01T08:49:10", "owner": "chenj05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18374230420146551, "text": "在外网我就很自然就用自己照片当头像…why？", "created_at": "2025-11-01T08:37:24", "owner": "choutimim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865143157488377, "text": "Bad people", "created_at": "2025-11-01T08:15:41", "owner": "ano99696", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846444355596470, "text": "这样会被认为自恋", "created_at": "2025-11-01T07:31:26", "owner": "li.le372", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984187719920997, "text": "因为吃藕😢", "created_at": "2025-11-01T07:10:16", "owner": "tracy_luckytail", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062564969159897, "text": "中国人当头像的话，网络会干净很多", "created_at": "2025-11-01T07:08:17", "owner": "dadouxiaomi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849837352583554, "text": "华人不像白人，没那么上镜，用自己当头像显得很傻😂", "created_at": "2025-11-01T06:54:12", "owner": "leoaeaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301534051264618, "text": "我乐意", "created_at": "2025-11-01T06:44:04", "owner": "shishishang268", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045798464422732, "text": "是自己的 但不露脸😂", "created_at": "2025-11-01T06:11:40", "owner": "zxr081028", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082416890085253, "text": "都不用找大头照了😮", "created_at": "2025-11-01T05:58:13", "owner": "zeroll0l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056613698537565, "text": "长得不方便当头像", "created_at": "2025-11-01T05:37:04", "owner": "mickey_1149", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071024432216893, "text": "还有一个说法，早之前大家都用QQ，但是QQ时间长不上线头像就会变成灰色，如果用自己的照片就成遗像了……", "created_at": "2025-11-01T05:16:12", "owner": "8hechu8", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17956186958878156, "text": "尼瑪呢，因為我們長得醜啊", "created_at": "2025-11-01T04:13:23", "owner": "god_la_jupo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126857968497623, "text": "因為在中國用自己頭像的才是騙子😂", "created_at": "2025-11-01T03:39:03", "owner": "ahqfplus2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18189177607328402, "text": "P得太狠了，美的不敢用🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-01T03:38:44", "owner": "sasagzsanrong", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18028344242762698, "text": "OMG😢We all use other people's profile", "created_at": "2025-11-01T03:36:15", "owner": "poetrymo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118683259470283, "text": "这样应该很正常啊。中国家人对不对🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-11-01T03:31:20", "owner": "piaowuyoushishaobo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18363340243087776, "text": "因为我不喜欢", "created_at": "2025-11-01T03:30:52", "owner": "took81799", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989373774730826, "text": "我的长相不适合当头像", "created_at": "2025-11-01T03:22:54", "owner": "ek99463", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077546180177365, "text": "因为你们太喜欢问为什么！十万个为什么 老子们非要和你们一样？没有问什么 想怎样就怎样", "created_at": "2025-11-01T03:08:24", "owner": "zhang_776587786", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049270811354187, "text": "because there no privacy in china", "created_at": "2025-11-01T03:06:06", "owner": "wyi27157", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073003139214945, "text": "Look at me", "created_at": "2025-11-01T02:39:53", "owner": "caoge79", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894814822202519, "text": "因为用自己的照片会被不法分子拿去诈骗", "created_at": "2025-11-01T01:46:39", "owner": "limkexin.99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105358540720421, "text": "嗯嗯，那时候人人网都用自己的头像，都用自己的照片", "created_at": "2025-11-01T01:43:11", "owner": "miracle0575", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18119115847541538, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-01T01:33:10", "owner": "tj.huang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920500081051322, "text": "因为长得太丑了……", "created_at": "2025-11-01T01:33:07", "owner": "zbh_b_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968544117964841, "text": "不自信", "created_at": "2025-11-01T01:03:19", "owner": "nianguo_dong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156437878394346, "text": "用自己的头像还怎么CP👏", "created_at": "2025-11-01T01:02:34", "owner": "pang88099", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912130651236378, "text": "长的不方便啊😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-01T00:39:01", "owner": "ujinodubobo841", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078408118897082, "text": "用自己的更像骗子 😂我瞄了一眼自己的头像哈哈哈 我就是你们说的骗子", "created_at": "2025-11-01T00:20:09", "owner": "fengyue3166", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125772760450796, "text": "？", "created_at": "2025-11-01T00:05:34", "owner": "yan.gdaxia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989880027897034, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-10-31T23:26:51", "owner": "axzd_0209", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080193097874081, "text": "因为很尴尬", "created_at": "2025-10-31T22:15:37", "owner": "fengjing_lei", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066773333079191, "text": "因为骗子会通过头像选择诈骗目标东南亚诈骗份子被警察抓住是亲口说他们会通过头像筛选目标。", "created_at": "2025-10-31T22:01:43", "owner": "aog932303", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937906167963739, "text": "因为用欧美人的照片当头像反而更像诈骗😂", "created_at": "2025-10-31T20:06:33", "owner": "uglyxxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081680858047796, "text": "我长得不是很方便", "created_at": "2025-10-31T19:23:20", "owner": "xocm_1217", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376792267196360, "text": "因为好看", "created_at": "2025-10-31T18:46:26", "owner": "lulaoshi10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081815839996277, "text": "必须实名制对线", "created_at": "2025-10-31T18:09:40", "owner": "zeroluan0124", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396828925193758, "text": "因为用本人的脸当头像还需要穿西装打领带😏", "created_at": "2025-10-31T17:50:41", "owner": "yifenweier6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142908985441253, "text": "台彎人也很多不用自己的照片，我不用是想要隱私", "created_at": "2025-10-31T16:44:17", "owner": "rolox303", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075149365977485, "text": "得看看那些长的好看的人的头像😭", "created_at": "2025-10-31T16:30:42", "owner": "xiongluoyi1114", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084578326971611, "text": "中国用的都是银行", "created_at": "2025-10-31T16:14:09", "owner": "ins1011496440", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085056298798138, "text": "自己覺得自己太醜", "created_at": "2025-10-31T15:54:06", "owner": "llj._.0128", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069883367056973, "text": "因为用了自己的头像骂人怎么办😂", "created_at": "2025-10-31T15:49:09", "owner": "grc11031103", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950949220025630, "text": "因為喜歡那個照片？", "created_at": "2025-10-31T15:43:06", "owner": "timmytimmy314", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18532104775023406, "text": "长得不好看", "created_at": "2025-10-31T15:14:37", "owner": "incometax001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970756506796627, "text": "我之前好看的时候还用自己的头像，现在感觉自己变丑了，没自信用了😢", "created_at": "2025-10-31T14:03:46", "owner": "tsbyjselwc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024656762766721, "text": "因为我们不想让他们知道我们是谁", "created_at": "2025-10-31T13:40:15", "owner": "bingganxiaoyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18150228874416417, "text": "哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-10-31T13:22:56", "owner": "longmenzhengzong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081548392847066, "text": "因為自己很醜", "created_at": "2025-10-31T13:02:21", "owner": "vinci.chu7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937968696963623, "text": "😢这个应该是习惯的延续 在我小的时候 注册的第一个软件是QQ 如果你不在线 头像会变成灰色 在中国只有遗像才会用灰色的照片 所以都默认不用自己的照片了 而且一般做销售的才会用自己照片做头像", "created_at": "2025-10-31T13:00:17", "owner": "jzhyoyo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919622899053967, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏 亲爱的，我们需要身心健康！🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏希望你能试试这本多语言的免费书籍，它很好地解释了精神世界。李鸿志大师的第九章治愈了许多人，使他们身心健康。然后你可以谷歌一下，为什么中共无神论者试图对法轮功学员进行种族灭绝，甚至摘取他们的器官，强迫他们放弃信仰，但中共却失败了！\n\nwww.法轮大法.org\n\n请务必将单词连在一起阅读，并尽量读完这本书。特别是很多人对新冠疫苗过敏，所以找到保持健康的方法非常重要。我的英语可能不太流利，但我说的是真心话。你看，就是这样。", "created_at": "2025-10-31T12:45:00", "owner": "cheri2611", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850082296580428, "text": "會給好朋友截圖🙃", "created_at": "2025-10-31T10:53:26", "owner": "yip_yoham0812", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853296055564861, "text": "我不好看😂", "created_at": "2025-10-31T10:46:25", "owner": "beimo2169", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094870411698572, "text": "在中国用自己作头像的一般是卖保险的或中介😮", "created_at": "2025-10-31T10:31:11", "owner": "bingtangyuan93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044877539449463, "text": "有，只有销售一般放自己的照片😂", "created_at": "2025-10-31T09:44:01", "owner": "speedq1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111761779573385, "text": "Because I might not be happy with how the photo turns out.", "created_at": "2025-10-31T09:29:01", "owner": "jin3202023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077542280157736, "text": "因为我们是中国人", "created_at": "2025-10-31T08:50:16", "owner": "nov_rian_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142902787434031, "text": ".", "created_at": "2025-10-31T08:42:51", "owner": "auroraleung2014", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916899310207982, "text": "可以发癫ε٩(๑> ₃ <)۶з", "created_at": "2025-10-31T08:34:06", "owner": "yangqwertyui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172245382368483, "text": "_(:з」∠)_因为……", "created_at": "2025-10-31T08:33:52", "owner": "yangqwertyui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037275761510079, "text": "因为我们比较注重个人隐私，老外不光头像，网名都用真名😂（忽略我这个，打工人没办法必须用自己的形象照", "created_at": "2025-10-31T07:51:35", "owner": "jasmine.photography8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058948910631515, "text": "用自己当头像 像卖保险 干销售的才会用😢😢", "created_at": "2025-10-31T07:44:05", "owner": "linan_zhou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072548420186508, "text": "用自己照片做头像的多半是销售还有中介😂不用自己照片做头像，在网上骂人都不知道你是谁😂", "created_at": "2025-10-31T06:52:41", "owner": "aeliana_chiao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076831439142444, "text": "西方文化比較開放顯得自信，而東方人比較含蓄，至少有一定的比例不想要以本尊視人", "created_at": "2025-10-31T06:11:02", "owner": "twntc82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18370972810152823, "text": "首先大概率会被骂装货，被网暴连开盒都省了，直接拿你头像上ai做鬼图🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-31T05:51:01", "owner": "sedum_notoginseng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18379020754149501, "text": "一般都是自己喜欢的偶像，崇拜的偶像，作为你自己动力，还有一种就是，用自己的喜欢的风格，来表示自己当下的情感！", "created_at": "2025-10-31T05:44:48", "owner": "zhangzhe_bunnies_haerin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103827970647121, "text": "不行，如果被开盒了我大头照就先出来了😢", "created_at": "2025-10-31T05:41:40", "owner": "taintnear.l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18549948946014877, "text": "我们也不用真实名字", "created_at": "2025-10-31T05:40:16", "owner": "gug487073", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055360970300667, "text": "Privacy 隐私吧，毕竟你们外国人更帅😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-31T05:23:21", "owner": "ultra_ziyi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932290390108534, "text": "Animation photo sometimes could show our inner thinkings and could represent our personalities", "created_at": "2025-10-31T05:22:15", "owner": "horace_buddles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101645653591673, "text": "因为用了自己头像会被同学蛐蛐一整天哈", "created_at": "2025-10-31T03:51:19", "owner": "csuvje240", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18323774659240036, "text": "我要是臉跟歐美人一樣深邃美麗，我也會用自己的照片", "created_at": "2025-10-31T03:30:07", "owner": "joan_940411_", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17955103607889068, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-31T03:25:33", "owner": "fpq4768", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18511737493071842, "text": "用自己的头像会比较像骗子——no——", "created_at": "2025-10-31T03:24:50", "owner": "yidong_cosplay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071941232204922, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-31T03:07:03", "owner": "chenxixi212", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897245284335353, "text": "掩饰自己的一种方式，因为我们认为网络世界不代表真实世界，所以要对自己稍加掩饰。另外，中国人不太会正式自己，也不了解自己，一定程度上对真实的自我是不接受的，所以一般喜欢用喜欢的名人或者好看的网红照片做头像…时间久了你会发现中国人的虚拟头像也能反应自己的性格啦", "created_at": "2025-10-31T02:24:42", "owner": "roseeica", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861314737519094, "text": "容易被诈骗分子拿去ai骗家人😂", "created_at": "2025-10-31T01:46:51", "owner": "yu.jiecheng07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043849247465542, "text": "中国人营养不良，要么丑，要么光头", "created_at": "2025-10-31T01:42:26", "owner": "rowanshao81", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078568514116130, "text": "我就用自己的照片做頭像我的ig也是自己照片做頭像", "created_at": "2025-10-31T01:40:19", "owner": "wl2023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059084129197409, "text": "@itgalberty 中國可是實名製上網誒，掛不掛自己照片當頭像差別可不太大的", "created_at": "2025-10-31T01:01:10", "owner": "yyyyhanling", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045655709413155, "text": "@sakanarourou 要麼就是做推銷的", "created_at": "2025-10-31T00:59:43", "owner": "yyyyhanling", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049002257368651, "text": "因为长得不太方便🌚", "created_at": "2025-10-31T00:52:30", "owner": "fai_ry0920", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122230309516154, "text": "因為怕別人騙我，騙子可以騙頭像上的人物呀，哈哈哈哈😂", "created_at": "2025-10-31T00:50:28", "owner": "haosongwang978", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954658123011081, "text": "因为换自己的头像更像骗子🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-31T00:29:53", "owner": "siasiajoke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956101614882283, "text": "因为没有安全感", "created_at": "2025-10-30T23:30:32", "owner": "vviv8303", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965954385828656, "text": "这时候他们就不谈隐私了...", "created_at": "2025-10-30T22:15:08", "owner": "ruan70048", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911757544240149, "text": "因为用自己的照片会被默认为是销售比如卖保险、卖车、卖房……还有很多业务员😂", "created_at": "2025-10-30T21:47:27", "owner": "gongqilue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045588026422944, "text": "头像可以只是一种自我的呈现，或者是自己喜欢的内容，未必非得是自己的脸，就算一个人颜值高，他也可以在头像上放他认为更有意义的东西，外貌是父母赋予的不是自己选择的，人的精神里很有可能认为其他的东西更能代表自己", "created_at": "2025-10-30T20:40:41", "owner": "poceantry", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17988027533738769, "text": "自己長得太醜了⋯⋯", "created_at": "2025-10-30T19:36:54", "owner": "ying.anhy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185551114339710, "text": "应该是受早年QQ的影响吧", "created_at": "2025-10-30T17:51:30", "owner": "gxysxh2333", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079519343121969, "text": "@diwen5555", "created_at": "2025-10-30T16:11:04", "owner": "olina.0205", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854973637557404, "text": "我在國內的App也不用自己的臉，會被人覺得很裝啊，或者怎樣怎樣的，我甚至不敢發自己的照片，因為會被人攻擊長相。", "created_at": "2025-10-30T15:53:23", "owner": "who__melissa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18549541291014365, "text": "好像只有销售那方面的用自己照片当头像吧", "created_at": "2025-10-30T15:45:40", "owner": "zhangxinyun677", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070714925197126, "text": "因為中國人普遍比較醜", "created_at": "2025-10-30T14:59:28", "owner": "chickhavetotry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019120283785536, "text": "实在不想顶着自己的照片开黄腔", "created_at": "2025-10-30T14:36:13", "owner": "linhijane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981823248915126, "text": "nice", "created_at": "2025-10-30T14:32:01", "owner": "elmorabit944", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17941983768073060, "text": "因为长相不方便", "created_at": "2025-10-30T14:27:05", "owner": "yuyu72474", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079378891884991, "text": "其实我好喜欢国外这种feel", "created_at": "2025-10-30T14:14:48", "owner": "sky3239167973", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376980166195966, "text": "@nsikhi94", "created_at": "2025-10-30T14:05:35", "owner": "nineo67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18378681529145316, "text": "因為發現自己的照片沒有動漫帥", "created_at": "2025-10-30T13:11:11", "owner": "wsxty.0819", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058839311541968, "text": "會被笑", "created_at": "2025-10-30T13:07:53", "owner": "eyouioyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112096933568693, "text": "您好看房子吗", "created_at": "2025-10-30T12:54:33", "owner": "suwf41", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295089280282860, "text": "我太醜了😂", "created_at": "2025-10-30T12:27:56", "owner": "tinghsiangc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069300149369796, "text": "我一般是表达自己的爱好或者玩梗，比如这个头像懂得人就知道我是偶像大师的粉丝，不懂的人也无所谓了😂", "created_at": "2025-10-30T12:19:42", "owner": "milespanindustry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091762939721933, "text": "马来西亚也这样😂", "created_at": "2025-10-30T12:03:49", "owner": "xiewen5392", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867789427397393, "text": "文化差异，是这样的", "created_at": "2025-10-30T12:02:30", "owner": "0_7xn0th1ng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863059834438369, "text": "我喜欢用可爱的动物头像", "created_at": "2025-10-30T10:56:49", "owner": "yuho_loh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927370276013596, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-30T10:43:16", "owner": "menggaoxiang8866", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069438719460121, "text": "因為很尷尬，同學都互相開玩笑很白痴😂", "created_at": "2025-10-30T09:26:11", "owner": "anke_1224", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050175167645165, "text": "因为以前最开始的社交媒体是只能用几个官方虚拟头像的，连自己的照片都不能用，已经成习惯了，娱乐化", "created_at": "2025-10-30T09:14:55", "owner": "tian98285", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077669456153698, "text": "此帳為角帳", "created_at": "2025-10-30T09:01:00", "owner": "sirius_hane_2009", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078659296884379, "text": "用自己头像？不会拍照真的很丑啊woc😢", "created_at": "2025-10-30T08:54:19", "owner": "fuwanyuxiao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902447176290110, "text": "用自己的头像像是卖房推销保险的😢", "created_at": "2025-10-30T08:43:23", "owner": "zihobonbon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542238826014130, "text": "我就是自己的头像", "created_at": "2025-10-30T08:37:25", "owner": "xuujiajie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941979418005076, "text": "用自己头像的基本都是销售😂", "created_at": "2025-10-30T07:52:01", "owner": "hilljames966", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912637609229831, "text": "中国人用自己的头像怕被别人拿去做不好的事情😂", "created_at": "2025-10-30T07:20:42", "owner": "chenxichenxi545", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909988750251158, "text": "注重隐私", "created_at": "2025-10-30T07:16:10", "owner": "maleah.zhang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539286187057438, "text": "因为外国人好看，本人丑的要死", "created_at": "2025-10-30T06:58:22", "owner": "xyiiiiii_0527", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024739460573448, "text": "I gonna tell the simple truth，if an east asian think his/her looks not attractive then he/she won’t use selfie as avatar,even he/she is considered attractive to use selfie as avatar, but he/she still won’t because it gonna be considered as a showing off guy.", "created_at": "2025-10-30T06:01:57", "owner": "leon_feellonely", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933615622103697, "text": "我 是  大馬 人  我 喜歡 用  動漫 頭像", "created_at": "2025-10-30T05:58:34", "owner": "_lee_fox_07_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063096164148723, "text": "因为用自己当头像很尴尬😢", "created_at": "2025-10-30T05:28:43", "owner": "zhaoyaolu9", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17919304407057672, "text": "so？who care", "created_at": "2025-10-30T04:05:33", "owner": "williamwuuuuuuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068914454594768, "text": "用自己当头像看着才像骗子😢", "created_at": "2025-10-30T03:53:29", "owner": "ap.ril417i", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100100038731406, "text": "因为自己长得丑啊😂", "created_at": "2025-10-30T03:36:17", "owner": "redamancy_775", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18537970150038649, "text": "Q", "created_at": "2025-10-30T03:06:29", "owner": "13.98454824", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970479726796577, "text": "为什么要用自己的照片 我觉得很难理解😂", "created_at": "2025-10-30T03:02:37", "owner": "2088fine", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18101046583676515, "text": "對自己的外貌沒自信 所以用動畫人物😢", "created_at": "2025-10-30T02:57:52", "owner": "zeze.ivan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073208140998013, "text": "We would think that people who use own photos are very stupid😂", "created_at": "2025-10-30T02:47:23", "owner": "caiyun_anna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18435956428096370, "text": "Guhfgu it to work on Monday and I'll send it tomorrow and send me the address and send it tomorrow I have a work 😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-10-30T02:31:23", "owner": "dxzx.zx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080083856099258, "text": "用自己的头像不好骂人😢", "created_at": "2025-10-30T02:28:21", "owner": "lzh210630", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156216364395339, "text": "就是以后骗你的时候不被记住", "created_at": "2025-10-30T00:51:06", "owner": "fjempir777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882713122283825, "text": "The same thing they going to do something after accordingly. So they have to be sure they are recognized are you will never know where they live. So you cannot find them. My life experience I never know what where my boss living I even he lives. He never have his own image on his wechat or anything. And then he cheated a customer from Germany a customer  look for me after two years", "created_at": "2025-10-30T00:50:56", "owner": "fjempir777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071843561189544, "text": "因为我经常跟人在网上吵架😂", "created_at": "2025-10-30T00:27:14", "owner": "xi.aoxiao7890", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073099073269551, "text": "😂因为用自己头像的都是搞销售的人，特别是保险，大家痛恨这些卖广告，天天微信朋友圈广告不断发，牛皮鲜一样", "created_at": "2025-10-30T00:21:34", "owner": "vacuum_thermoforming", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18363575509090369, "text": "缅甸诈骗份子会用头像来骗人", "created_at": "2025-10-30T00:04:05", "owner": "dongdong3060", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18324204601212731, "text": "哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-10-30T00:03:19", "owner": "venananananaa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18129889459494014, "text": "因为用自己的照片很容易被骗子盯上", "created_at": "2025-10-29T23:49:16", "owner": "fengshuimonk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952218624897733, "text": "亚洲人普遍不上镜吧哈哈哈，p了又要被说照骗嘞", "created_at": "2025-10-29T23:40:07", "owner": "xuu_0614", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18404822599138404, "text": "可能是怕被别人觉得是自恋哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-10-29T23:33:31", "owner": "soleshow7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061910984417630, "text": "民族個性，文化差異！中國人內向低調，非華人比較⋯⋯外放！", "created_at": "2025-10-29T22:52:21", "owner": "coco_lin1117", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971111187958859, "text": "纯粹觉得自己的照片不好看而已", "created_at": "2025-10-29T22:11:25", "owner": "xujiejie55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861248752525112, "text": "Maybe I think I’m too ugly", "created_at": "2025-10-29T19:09:50", "owner": "q957946416", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063181613403914, "text": "因为在中国用自己的照片不是会被骗，就是骗人。😂", "created_at": "2025-10-29T17:52:03", "owner": "julili635", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18533535427023612, "text": "人家会觉得太土", "created_at": "2025-10-29T16:57:01", "owner": "jack.chaozhou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959664966861868, "text": "最初是因为99年那会儿很少人上网，网络世界都是陌生人，是虚拟的，感觉要与现实区分开。而且也怕被别人盗用。所以当初都说别在网络上暴露真实照片。后来就形成习惯了。", "created_at": "2025-10-29T16:41:49", "owner": "yanyan.tang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097925812704517, "text": "也许可能对自己的颜值不认可吧..", "created_at": "2025-10-29T16:30:16", "owner": "khorzhihong101119", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863803912499953, "text": "用自己的照片很危险，别人会盗用你的照片做很多事情，特别是进行诈骗", "created_at": "2025-10-29T16:29:13", "owner": "lina8481440", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082152719049644, "text": "I like to put my favorite pictures on my WeChat, so that I can see them as soon as I open it. It's not too convenient for me.", "created_at": "2025-10-29T15:52:56", "owner": "anna5347738", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084860857951907, "text": "用真名和自己照片当头像在网络上很危险吧", "created_at": "2025-10-29T15:32:55", "owner": "mila439999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093278782855970, "text": "上网当然要用网图了啊！╮(╯▽╰)╭", "created_at": "2025-10-29T15:10:26", "owner": "hello382562", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17907074082122426, "text": "怕被别人骗哈哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-10-29T14:35:16", "owner": "lei19870620xn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101670616647761, "text": "As a Chinese I event dont know how to answer", "created_at": "2025-10-29T13:43:07", "owner": "frankf072", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132976360464941, "text": "我用自己的啊？", "created_at": "2025-10-29T13:12:05", "owner": "jamie.06254", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898958626302978, "text": "感覺拍的像證件照肯定是詐騙", "created_at": "2025-10-29T13:00:44", "owner": "yueming157", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879887773304891, "text": "也不是没有，只是我们觉得用自己的照片当头像的人通常都是真的大美女/帅哥。。。你知道亚洲人容貌焦虑有多严重", "created_at": "2025-10-29T12:40:29", "owner": "lunia_mydaily", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18536815624036338, "text": "如果用自己照片当头像 被网暴的话会被攻击长相 太容易被开盒了", "created_at": "2025-10-29T12:21:18", "owner": "hannyv_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875396575431535, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-29T11:08:12", "owner": "ashelly123yue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975945273937380, "text": "用自己的头像就不能说实话了😂", "created_at": "2025-10-29T10:19:44", "owner": "tthh37269", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028983758729507, "text": "我樣不似大人 經常被騙徒問侯😂（以貌取人）", "created_at": "2025-10-29T09:53:35", "owner": "alex_kwanfaucuo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087871325496455, "text": "我长得不太方便😢", "created_at": "2025-10-29T09:00:06", "owner": "juanliyuan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17999996843820972, "text": "是的，我们都不用自己的头像😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-29T08:54:48", "owner": "xiangdan48", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969065169967734, "text": "因为自卑，你要长得帅试试", "created_at": "2025-10-29T06:59:11", "owner": "houroupei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991732644714484, "text": "cos I feel disgusted when I see my face", "created_at": "2025-10-29T06:56:06", "owner": "teriyak1sauce4real", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062661062153207, "text": "Because I think it's weird to use myself as my avatar.", "created_at": "2025-10-29T06:28:48", "owner": "j1314275", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894578395200699, "text": "觉得用自己头像有点low，工作账号没办法，但是个人账号我可以随心所欲，尤其是我很喜欢抽象搞笑的头像😂", "created_at": "2025-10-29T06:21:29", "owner": "mosparty.art", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864235063490808, "text": "我都不用照片 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-29T05:48:34", "owner": "ahui4504", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17965913291976981, "text": "自卑", "created_at": "2025-10-29T05:30:05", "owner": "chinchun1203", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854253523511706, "text": "自己照片当头像像老头老太太😂很土", "created_at": "2025-10-29T04:51:16", "owner": "w20110309", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072743624264440, "text": "因为我们不能直接拍出来能当头像的照片", "created_at": "2025-10-29T04:38:38", "owner": "liiiiieanam", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17971014368806729, "text": "要不你看看我的？", "created_at": "2025-10-29T03:35:58", "owner": "xiang99665", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086209858767757, "text": "用自己当头像的不是中介就是骗子", "created_at": "2025-10-29T03:04:44", "owner": "whoishereeeeeeee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124555201506514, "text": "這哥兒住海边是不是？", "created_at": "2025-10-29T03:04:10", "owner": "iris_yu1245", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991806024849779, "text": "Because using one's own avatar is more business oriented, and children like to use their favorite characters as photos.", "created_at": "2025-10-29T03:01:18", "owner": "mzzb1710", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027939677547838, "text": "我用自己的😍❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-29T00:16:51", "owner": "jimmychilde", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095800072651707, "text": "因为很多人长得丑，上不了镜，所以不用自己的头像", "created_at": "2025-10-28T23:15:49", "owner": "slidingeagle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871727863449926, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-28T22:14:01", "owner": "mind_y2014", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909781237249516, "text": "因為自己長太帥了所以不敢放", "created_at": "2025-10-28T22:12:16", "owner": "dfhdh_jc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17947075206062827, "text": "感觉用自己的照片当头像很奇怪", "created_at": "2025-10-28T21:55:20", "owner": "w_dx0912", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043678019454151, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-28T21:03:26", "owner": "guojianjun776", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001854308820596, "text": "像我的😂", "created_at": "2025-10-28T20:35:29", "owner": "ayse_feng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097985293687779, "text": "@zyn_bz 笑死了", "created_at": "2025-10-28T20:15:58", "owner": "chen.nuo121", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095933131692783, "text": "太帅了 没办法", "created_at": "2025-10-28T20:13:40", "owner": "n1uchao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057142403542522, "text": "Hello! Could you please help spread the word about the terrifying incident that occurred in Yunnan? A child of around three or four years old was maliciously trained, constantly forced to be naked and crawl like a dog. There might be even more horrifying details. This incident has been suppressed in China, and many reports and discussions have been deleted. Some South Korean media have already covered it. We hope you can make more people around the world aware of this terrifying event to urge the relevant Chinese authorities to rescue the child as soon as possible.", "created_at": "2025-10-28T19:46:30", "owner": "homedecstaging", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063457454630283, "text": "关你屁屁", "created_at": "2025-10-28T19:43:08", "owner": "caterinaxujinyi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055959125277438, "text": "哪来的 的这么多为什么 想放啥就放啥呗 😎😎", "created_at": "2025-10-28T18:49:27", "owner": "im_christ_mrfils_86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086364989300072, "text": "因为自己不好看/.", "created_at": "2025-10-28T18:17:56", "owner": "lemon_liliana_210428", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846256768595617, "text": "中国人普遍长得丑才是真的", "created_at": "2025-10-28T17:54:22", "owner": "y345394105", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18173236135316755, "text": "因为用自己的照片会被别人冒用，去诈骗别人😮", "created_at": "2025-10-24T02:40:33", "owner": "whitney_always123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046773515402910, "text": "他们又不用自己的名字，假名假照片。完蛋了呗", "created_at": "2025-10-24T02:31:41", "owner": "chkaif21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084602860981387, "text": "自卑", "created_at": "2025-10-24T02:26:53", "owner": "allen062_ouo", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17944604168935574, "text": "为什么要用自己的头像？", "created_at": "2025-10-24T02:26:07", "owner": "eric.djc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103236460714002, "text": "用自己当头像只会让别人觉得我是自恋狂。。", "created_at": "2025-10-24T01:53:05", "owner": "bugcato", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026889386741715, "text": "我建模能跟外国人一样我也用🌚💪", "created_at": "2025-10-24T01:40:39", "owner": "yanyiwen627", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085215553777828, "text": "你们都是美颜，更大的骗局😂", "created_at": "2025-10-24T01:29:22", "owner": "chenjun19841025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082419124834004, "text": "exactly", "created_at": "2025-10-24T01:25:01", "owner": "dddabc27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076347143331011, "text": "我试过老千拿过我的Whatsupp 头像诈骗别人借钱", "created_at": "2025-10-24T01:20:26", "owner": "lindayong31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985651869877569, "text": "我也不用自己照片😂", "created_at": "2025-10-24T01:18:40", "owner": "lindayong31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057225818637933, "text": "？", "created_at": "2025-10-24T01:03:43", "owner": "yhl.4ever", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068189063524975, "text": "是不是大家很多都容貌焦虑？ 在亚洲单一的审美是会很容易", "created_at": "2025-10-24T01:01:22", "owner": "jerryhujiji", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054371195278371, "text": "用自己頭像在亞洲別人反而覺得你是假帳號\n在歐美你不用自己頭像我都懷疑你是機器人", "created_at": "2025-10-24T00:58:40", "owner": "laobai529", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18018150566786394, "text": "如果用自己的照片要被抓去消失的話還能開通緝", "created_at": "2025-10-24T00:11:48", "owner": "hoshi_benny_svt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17891424477358093, "text": "中国人确实骗子多，而且还专骗中国人，他们还一度认为自己的国家很强，这是天大的笑话！", "created_at": "2025-10-23T23:36:25", "owner": "tdkfll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18535083460017185, "text": "Will be easy for the police to find.", "created_at": "2025-10-23T23:35:37", "owner": "tangsjane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18364120828092809, "text": "因為自己長太醜", "created_at": "2025-10-23T23:12:30", "owner": "liu.jia.ming", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096668896775211, "text": "主要怕被盗用吧", "created_at": "2025-10-23T23:11:36", "owner": "bcwny2088", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17987337974885023, "text": "因为大部分人觉得他们长的丑", "created_at": "2025-10-23T23:00:54", "owner": "jadenmotivation", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040296149485191, "text": "因为中国人对自己的脸不够自信比较自卑 也可能 内敛 不想被别人看到自己的脸。还有很多可能性", "created_at": "2025-10-23T23:00:05", "owner": "violetgrity", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862611403437989, "text": "因为我的下巴太帅了☕🫖", "created_at": "2025-10-23T22:48:18", "owner": "mika_owner_0704", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076508780517437, "text": "因為丑", "created_at": "2025-10-23T22:12:14", "owner": "wallencezhou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071511008257725, "text": "我反正不喜欢用自己做头像，有个别的长辈喜欢用自己的做头像", "created_at": "2025-10-23T22:01:12", "owner": "mml0107", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913870948216011, "text": "我想用但是大家都不用，我用會很怪", "created_at": "2025-10-23T21:56:12", "owner": "yontaovo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945444898060468, "text": "不夠好看呀😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T21:39:06", "owner": "lovezz0100", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091922446859192, "text": "因为现在AI技术太强大了，第一不安全，第二我觉得我长的太丑了", "created_at": "2025-10-23T21:17:15", "owner": "yuxiaodecember", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18360855331081082, "text": "因为普遍不自信，没有鼓励式教育也没有人会说你好看，再加上会有教育说网上的事危险不要透漏个人信息，甚至头像", "created_at": "2025-10-23T21:12:55", "owner": "karl_xux", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043219505438367, "text": "许多人都在抹黑中国，那么我就不惯着你们这些评论区里面，很多的恶意的人大多数都在说中国的这个不好，那个不好，好吧，你看一下我的头像怎么样呢？我就是使用自己的真实头像，不管是微信还是QQ，我都是这样子的。", "created_at": "2025-10-23T21:10:20", "owner": "alanchem2017", "likes": 46}, {"id": 18031626299523683, "text": "一般有职业要求，比如律师才会用。就大部分人来说只有权威人士会用，否则给人的印象是这个人好自恋", "created_at": "2025-10-23T20:34:32", "owner": "jolin51429", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18159149119388590, "text": "好吧我承认我长得丑😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T20:21:36", "owner": "mygemhouses", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041496968700043, "text": "这可能是中国社会人文里的不安全感吧！戒备心理？", "created_at": "2025-10-23T20:03:09", "owner": "weihan764", "likes": 869}, {"id": 18037685957500923, "text": "我也不明白为什么", "created_at": "2025-10-23T20:01:46", "owner": "weihan764", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076995392117892, "text": "用自己的头像，一般是比较年长的。或者是中介，或者是推销的，或者是很自恋的人，中国人都这样认为。", "created_at": "2025-10-23T19:48:04", "owner": "qwas3617989557", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18003713048821538, "text": "🍺", "created_at": "2025-10-23T19:40:12", "owner": "mupenghui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543434410040992, "text": "你認識我會知道我是誰，不認識何必知道我是誰", "created_at": "2025-10-23T19:37:15", "owner": "wai_tsang", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18058015754234493, "text": "因为在iPhone4时期，最开始中国人很多使用自己照片做头像的人，照片都被人盗用，然后诈骗他们身边的亲人", "created_at": "2025-10-23T18:58:24", "owner": "jnix_911", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090431491897175, "text": "Because some comments are not suitable to use yourself as an avatar", "created_at": "2025-10-23T18:54:15", "owner": "zmmda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970564842955612, "text": "就...醜...", "created_at": "2025-10-23T18:38:40", "owner": "qiling__1107", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878355754421565, "text": "用自己的照片才像诈骗", "created_at": "2025-10-23T18:25:58", "owner": "mimilo2011", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18114035023552502, "text": "他們醜，不敢用自己照片", "created_at": "2025-10-23T18:21:36", "owner": "king0938642720", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071060693352126, "text": "直接原因就是不自信，别人会说你装", "created_at": "2025-10-23T17:33:05", "owner": "liyu1_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081541570960263, "text": "在中國 如果用自己照片當頭像，一般會被認為是中介😂房地產中介、保險中介😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T17:28:56", "owner": "piggy_k613", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085653598943207, "text": "我給你說句實話吧，如果在外網用本人頭像很容易就會被查到你在哪是不是翻牆有沒有說共黨的壞壞，你看我就不敢用自己的頭像。", "created_at": "2025-10-23T17:12:30", "owner": "ericsung88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064131950616659, "text": "Chinese use their own photos to sell insurance or real estate agents,this is their work account, and the private account must not use their own photos", "created_at": "2025-10-23T17:07:01", "owner": "ya.04_ng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103789783530774, "text": "Not confident enough", "created_at": "2025-10-23T17:06:29", "owner": "tiantiantiantiannnnnnnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088498405908040, "text": "抱歉，我沒長這麼好看", "created_at": "2025-10-23T16:49:28", "owner": "idtwcbf30", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067846067460959, "text": "因為自卑", "created_at": "2025-10-23T16:48:30", "owner": "dim.lui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876087376425452, "text": "感觉用自己的照片当头像会给人一种自我意识很强的感觉…（客观描述无批判", "created_at": "2025-10-23T16:47:01", "owner": "hailiekim531", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096380416809032, "text": "头像反映的是自己的爱好，比如说你看我的头像就知道我是个贝斯手，用自己的脸别人看到了还是不了解你啊😢", "created_at": "2025-10-23T16:45:36", "owner": "fanshixun1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931351654103028, "text": "如何？", "created_at": "2025-10-23T16:44:36", "owner": "marcus_suen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954648556004262, "text": "In china ,Only salesman use their photo as profile ,and named as A***", "created_at": "2025-10-23T16:42:39", "owner": "alexonse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076543919155745, "text": "因為我醜", "created_at": "2025-10-23T16:40:25", "owner": "ajajaj._.6666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937427343963711, "text": "互联网水水太深，用自己照片不太好", "created_at": "2025-10-23T16:32:56", "owner": "041212hx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938202991084932, "text": "用自己照片做头像不是做生意的就是好业务的😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T16:28:52", "owner": "chen40844", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882495973404042, "text": "你想看噁男自拍嗎？", "created_at": "2025-10-23T16:18:55", "owner": "kfc584501", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111333223577864, "text": "中国人含蓄内敛，欧美人自由奔放", "created_at": "2025-10-23T16:18:37", "owner": "amv.mad_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050805296335000, "text": "用自己做头像那还怎么当键盘侠？", "created_at": "2025-10-23T15:48:04", "owner": "jacobdrakelee", "likes": 6879}, {"id": 17898600474300004, "text": "我的头像也还行吧", "created_at": "2025-10-23T15:29:26", "owner": "lee70336", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063443276576834, "text": "WeChat放个人大头像我觉得还说得过去 如果在脸书 ins用个人大头像就很怪 很装 没有隐私", "created_at": "2025-10-23T15:11:09", "owner": "ethan_wu94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875316211428968, "text": "怕被开", "created_at": "2025-10-23T15:06:58", "owner": "mat_sushi_ta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963191004842527, "text": "感觉自己的照片不想给陌生人看😂群里一点开就知道你长什么样了", "created_at": "2025-10-23T15:06:22", "owner": "cr46051", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18421540192110204, "text": "因为我喜欢😃（就单纯觉得自拍不好看", "created_at": "2025-10-23T14:59:02", "owner": "yuuuu_5138", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843846037593597, "text": "Yeah Chinese especially style i can't understand too", "created_at": "2025-10-23T14:54:51", "owner": "changwoo_overseas_korean0924", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001185755825401, "text": "感觉会很害羞的感觉吧", "created_at": "2025-10-23T14:50:40", "owner": "miaow2488", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093025480868946, "text": "我是用自己的啊，秦朝沒有p圖，保真", "created_at": "2025-10-23T14:45:46", "owner": "mcqueenlin9", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18166903963373859, "text": "用自己照片当头像会被朋友笑死的。", "created_at": "2025-10-23T14:41:48", "owner": "qwqqi_8", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18083703967781858, "text": "隐私", "created_at": "2025-10-23T14:31:14", "owner": "eric_yingwaijeun", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18072654800260719, "text": "我是沒手機可以拍😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-23T14:18:03", "owner": "liteelestar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18333086362231028, "text": "用自己的照片就不会骗你吗", "created_at": "2025-10-23T14:17:40", "owner": "wang46758", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945624772052044, "text": "@itgalberty 你这井蛙看太多三立了", "created_at": "2025-10-23T14:16:28", "owner": "hephep881", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083518609970279, "text": "因为头像也像是一个表达自己态度的媒介，我也喜欢拿可爱的图片或者喜欢的明星来当头像，另外一种向别人展示自己的方式吧～(⌒▽⌒)", "created_at": "2025-10-23T14:13:06", "owner": "angelalucky1201", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070220834034246, "text": "因为丑😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T14:12:22", "owner": "cici998010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858608218535917, "text": "中国人只坑中国人", "created_at": "2025-10-23T14:09:29", "owner": "kang94694", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061263956568219, "text": "Why can't I use other images? Why do I have to use my own photo as my avatar?", "created_at": "2025-10-23T14:00:10", "owner": "shaihan7kgvn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087539521738544, "text": "因为用自己头像和别人骂，会被人参公鸡", "created_at": "2025-10-23T13:42:33", "owner": "huanhuan2354", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096723568782716, "text": "因为中国长期处在一个悲惨的世界，", "created_at": "2025-10-23T13:35:26", "owner": "chardysun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885594277391521, "text": "因为中人都是狗", "created_at": "2025-10-23T13:30:23", "owner": "chardysun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18391053577135675, "text": "因为早期的通讯软件很长一段时间不支持上传头像只能选择软件内置的卡通头像，所以久而久之便习惯性的不使用自己照片。", "created_at": "2025-10-23T13:24:04", "owner": "rnco86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18363373468087874, "text": "China can finish online payment by scanning their face", "created_at": "2025-10-23T13:11:11", "owner": "pakkiu_08050", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17853009387560509, "text": "我是搞不懂为什么用别人的自拍当头像 那个才很奇怪", "created_at": "2025-10-23T13:09:13", "owner": "utaou37", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17850802944573458, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-23T13:01:26", "owner": "guoxr.421", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18508371979068202, "text": "在中國，只有賣保險、賣房子、中介、銷售員才會用自己的頭像", "created_at": "2025-10-23T12:44:32", "owner": "j.king_veal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934687150093360, "text": "因为用自己的头像感觉很奇怪", "created_at": "2025-10-23T12:42:52", "owner": "linfei.123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037372094503561, "text": "中國是共产", "created_at": "2025-10-23T12:41:30", "owner": "cheepeng_khoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134836126460067, "text": "我在中国的社交平台都用图片 就在这里用照片😀", "created_at": "2025-10-23T12:36:51", "owner": "maovo_0418", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113087326560747, "text": "那种自己照片的大部分是销售😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T12:36:04", "owner": "wangzeyu754", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864010978494101, "text": "比如我个人的原因是因为我长相不漂亮，所以不可以用自己的照片作为头像", "created_at": "2025-10-23T12:34:20", "owner": "dora_q_q", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17990233604708523, "text": "我虚伪，我怕别人知道我😢", "created_at": "2025-10-23T12:32:56", "owner": "ming._.ze588", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18359983525083931, "text": "很尷尬啊 而且在台灣用自己露臉的照片當頭像更像詐騙", "created_at": "2025-10-23T12:26:09", "owner": "ycc.cy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098047882669918, "text": "那是我们心灵的照片", "created_at": "2025-10-23T12:23:48", "owner": "liyuduan12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083061374487849, "text": "因為中國 騙子多", "created_at": "2025-10-23T12:09:51", "owner": "ng.chrissy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070375934589777, "text": "这个人很像牙姐前男友", "created_at": "2025-10-23T12:04:45", "owner": "quandouhuan16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18417834190114429, "text": "因為容貌焦慮吧？", "created_at": "2025-10-23T12:01:32", "owner": "hankohchung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077822669323247, "text": "在中國很多人會攻擊你的長相，是當他們吵不贏你的時候", "created_at": "2025-10-23T11:59:35", "owner": "sling0560", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136570621456147, "text": "用自己的脸做事不放心", "created_at": "2025-10-23T11:53:03", "owner": "fiskgrat", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18111060061573005, "text": "自己的照片會拿不出手啊😂尤其有些就算用自己的好了 根本認不出來 跟詐騙沒兩樣好嗎", "created_at": "2025-10-23T11:45:53", "owner": "bb429465", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044755262433760, "text": "因为中国社会缺乏的最多的就真实是真实", "created_at": "2025-10-23T11:06:42", "owner": "yuwujing999", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18296231032264558, "text": "熟悉的人你知道头像是他自己，不熟悉的有啥用，骗子用啥你能分辨出来吗，不过别的国家好像不怎么有骗子，技术含量有点高，没有抢到快", "created_at": "2025-10-23T11:00:29", "owner": "mingyuezhang06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897937609312915, "text": "因為會被盜", "created_at": "2025-10-23T11:00:01", "owner": "twjasonhung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079155896030549, "text": "以前qq账号不在线的时候，照片会变成黑白，头像变成黑白可不是什么好征兆", "created_at": "2025-10-23T10:49:20", "owner": "alienbaba51", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115990219545679, "text": "因为会联系很多现实中不认识，没见过的人，被陌生人知道自己长什么样子很不舒服", "created_at": "2025-10-23T10:30:53", "owner": "xiaohew13", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18538015891048120, "text": "没有义务！", "created_at": "2025-10-23T09:57:33", "owner": "xiangchijuban", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059510006202019, "text": "😂怕被人指指点点啊且大家*都这样*", "created_at": "2025-10-23T09:51:32", "owner": "mononokec", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075875252272752, "text": "因为中国信息诈骗的事情经常发生，所以大家比较注重保护自己的照片公开性，因为觉得这个属于隐私", "created_at": "2025-10-23T09:27:35", "owner": "zhaosen_86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126990181489242, "text": "中国国内网暴太严重，那是一种含蓄的自我保护", "created_at": "2025-10-23T09:13:09", "owner": "guxuanye0224", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083427821069900, "text": "确实中国人很少用自己头像", "created_at": "2025-10-23T09:03:44", "owner": "heweici21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18407814259137931, "text": "@tristanheadricko0o", "created_at": "2025-10-23T09:02:16", "owner": "lyt2009051_2025", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17868535953462568, "text": "没颜值😭用了恶心自己", "created_at": "2025-10-23T08:59:56", "owner": "861115elise", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076243042916022, "text": "头像我本人", "created_at": "2025-10-23T08:48:13", "owner": "_jin2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099665227734724, "text": "我跟你讲，中国人不骗中国人", "created_at": "2025-10-23T08:46:09", "owner": "gu18131921250", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083102803815498, "text": "因為中國的人容貌焦慮比較嚴重，還沒有像外國人一樣喜歡多樣的美", "created_at": "2025-10-23T08:45:53", "owner": "lazy_cat_blabla", "likes": 67}, {"id": 17906524539123227, "text": "因为自己的头像不好看😇😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T08:32:03", "owner": "lez_0213", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18084431329768458, "text": "culture difference lol", "created_at": "2025-10-23T08:31:28", "owner": "lez_0213", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966918078971498, "text": "隐私", "created_at": "2025-10-23T08:19:41", "owner": "peipei4489", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075258218324339, "text": "My head is painted by my girlfriend.", "created_at": "2025-10-23T08:17:51", "owner": "luantaibin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090650149700725, "text": "喜歡用比較抽象的圖片當頭像", "created_at": "2025-10-23T08:17:29", "owner": "qinyu10086", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004074002659751, "text": "我太丑了不好意思用😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T08:09:19", "owner": "mrlin9999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889767463365375, "text": "中国70后头像是风景和花朵，80后头像本人照片比较多，90后的头像是日韩风或者非主流头像，00后的头像是抽象风或者卡通，动漫和猫狗", "created_at": "2025-10-23T07:45:07", "owner": "seven5494", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988677447887597, "text": "就是感觉自己长得不好看，不想用", "created_at": "2025-10-23T07:40:51", "owner": "azzzwt_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867662893467694, "text": "中国人不用自己头像，因为害怕被别人骗😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T07:31:08", "owner": "nevereverying", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084710281940496, "text": "在中国只有骗子和销售会用“自己的”照片当头像", "created_at": "2025-10-23T07:26:55", "owner": "fayfayleon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18327465247210396, "text": "用自己的照片感觉很自恋", "created_at": "2025-10-23T07:26:07", "owner": "zhao_zhaoyiwen", "likes": 14}, {"id": 17848909083581450, "text": "因为中国2000左右开始出现QQ的时候，社交是从陌生人开始的，不用自己真名与头像就是这样来的，以至于后来出现熟人社交的微信，也一直延续了", "created_at": "2025-10-23T07:21:59", "owner": "chongyang7", "likes": 2690}, {"id": 18343660204204213, "text": "When you use your own photos, it's mostly fraud!", "created_at": "2025-10-23T07:13:42", "owner": "beckettliu9210", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075722755897402, "text": "估计还有一个原因 现在网络诈骗多，大家都比较谨慎，不想要泄露一丝个资！", "created_at": "2025-10-23T07:11:46", "owner": "jzhengty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061290017168335, "text": "诈骗会盗取你的照片啊，网路还是越少隐私越好", "created_at": "2025-10-23T07:09:21", "owner": "mrjphotography_studio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075795563325778, "text": "我们都不怎么喜欢用自己的照片当头像，一般用自己头像的是销售", "created_at": "2025-10-23T07:07:14", "owner": "yinyian5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003335804814970, "text": "可能是因為醜——————————————————————等下，我怎麼也用了😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T06:54:12", "owner": "ziho_su", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129584017481785, "text": "Actually, I'm a carrot.", "created_at": "2025-10-23T06:44:10", "owner": "lujie1015", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914733874205629, "text": "我就用自己的哈哈 而且也很多外国人不用自己的照片的😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T06:42:57", "owner": "carl.yiu1992", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18389917735134671, "text": "？我就是自己的照片啊", "created_at": "2025-10-23T06:19:22", "owner": "bank312586287", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961783335989910, "text": "C罗这一块🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-23T06:13:40", "owner": "siusiu7936", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18409900330139368, "text": "我在外网用自己头像。。。方便发疯，反正没人认识我", "created_at": "2025-10-23T06:12:14", "owner": "liwx085", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120356572525105, "text": "因为一旦你的自拍头像不好看你的hxd会第一时间赶来嘲笑你😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T06:10:46", "owner": "xiaochuan1086", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025925057558093, "text": "亚洲文化", "created_at": "2025-10-23T06:05:48", "owner": "dobbiechen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154595734392055, "text": "因為長的醜啊~\n\n您還可以分享一點\n\n西方人很喜歡在profile放合照，或是自己站在瀑布、山頂上的照片\n\nwhile some asians 喜歡放自拍，用美圖秀秀把自己修到不成人形", "created_at": "2025-10-23T06:01:51", "owner": "5hrm_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059445278407986, "text": "中國人自卑又自大", "created_at": "2025-10-23T05:45:01", "owner": "miii.ming", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539861146016243, "text": "因为在中国用自己照片做头像的90%是销售", "created_at": "2025-10-23T05:40:08", "owner": "songguocheng2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033424058710971, "text": "因为用了才是真正的诈骗😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T05:37:05", "owner": "anna4437678", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104191582619727, "text": "可能是因为长得一般，有些小自卑😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T05:20:07", "owner": "zhouzhouqia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113972644491603, "text": "speak for yourself. hell lot of westerners now uses anime for avatar.", "created_at": "2025-10-23T04:52:48", "owner": "sloth_belly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18294933910287807, "text": "Because they look bad or ugly on camera.😢😢", "created_at": "2025-10-23T04:48:22", "owner": "rhino.4875132", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053132258316413, "text": "因为丑，哪那么多为什么🙂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T04:29:41", "owner": "go.duck.777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056061854259470, "text": "because we are shy😆", "created_at": "2025-10-23T04:29:21", "owner": "bier_2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043658126690391, "text": "顏值焦慮", "created_at": "2025-10-23T04:15:49", "owner": "ryan_.901xx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322784095300297, "text": "用自己头像是诈骗", "created_at": "2025-10-23T04:15:28", "owner": "lilizi_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854623030502964, "text": "不用自己的头像是保护隐私吧", "created_at": "2025-10-23T04:11:56", "owner": "mereusin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099834805708979, "text": "怕朋友觉得我自恋哈哈哈😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T04:02:37", "owner": "wol_cloud.18_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954528763011141, "text": "因為人民素質太差了 特別是網路鄉民 放自己照片就是在增加對方攻擊的點", "created_at": "2025-10-23T03:37:51", "owner": "spectre1201", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881007517404648, "text": "中国人很在意别人的眼光 认为用自己头像别人觉得自恋👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-23T03:28:57", "owner": "ezhao33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062467574578831, "text": "我们怕兄弟拿我们的照片来撸管", "created_at": "2025-10-23T03:26:46", "owner": "evendy_7322", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048337823373177, "text": "貓咪特寫", "created_at": "2025-10-23T03:26:03", "owner": "yeh_debbie_kiwi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086613754741630, "text": "不自信，所以就不用自己照片做头像了😢", "created_at": "2025-10-23T03:19:28", "owner": "yamada20060601", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18046903754393111, "text": "因为国外的社交媒体一般是从Facebook传下来的模式，中国以前有人人网的时候也是用自己头像，但大部分人用微信是从QQ那一脉传下来的习惯，没有用自己头像的习惯。", "created_at": "2025-10-23T03:08:14", "owner": "blacknoon_03", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083574757985567, "text": "沒想到是反過來的😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T03:08:07", "owner": "kevinnew010200", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902483296146053, "text": "在中國用自己的頭像就是給公安、維穩系統盯上的目標", "created_at": "2025-10-23T03:00:21", "owner": "itgalberty", "likes": 186}, {"id": 18558127336032551, "text": "还不是因为长得丑自尊心又强", "created_at": "2025-10-23T02:59:05", "owner": "_calpis_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023063942584835, "text": "女生可以试试用自己照片当头像，很快你就会明白为什么", "created_at": "2025-10-23T02:57:18", "owner": "ronniaa.a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061203836396435, "text": "In Confucian cultures like China, Japan, and Korea, people often avoid using their real photos on social media because modesty, face-saving, and relationship-based identity discourage overt self-display.", "created_at": "2025-10-23T02:49:29", "owner": "xuzikun355", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18343127953205938, "text": "在中国用自己真人当头像的要么是中介要么是销售要么是骗子", "created_at": "2025-10-23T02:47:59", "owner": "dispersed_love", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060582308530259, "text": "为了保护隐私", "created_at": "2025-10-23T02:47:34", "owner": "yting_zz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032851349518617, "text": "Ha, ha, ha. So that's it", "created_at": "2025-10-23T02:47:07", "owner": "maria1997uk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17926759131118034, "text": "中国是恶俗大国", "created_at": "2025-10-23T02:45:57", "owner": "xuzikun355", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984337980913398, "text": "我也不喜欢非本人头像的人，除非是小朋友或者上岁数的叔叔阿姨😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T02:37:31", "owner": "juntanmaintan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842133163607940, "text": "双方通过才成为好友啊，至少得摸清底细吧", "created_at": "2025-10-23T02:33:30", "owner": "jasminetea._.520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18530636116006618, "text": "因为用自己的照片当头像，别人会认为你很自恋😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T02:31:42", "owner": "ch4rm1ngl0w", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116064232529044, "text": "Right", "created_at": "2025-10-23T02:19:37", "owner": "watching_so", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060033506171864, "text": "因為心中有屎，做人鬼鬼祟祟😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T02:17:59", "owner": "yammy886", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053923214307324, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T02:13:30", "owner": "beetleman6666", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081401002840807, "text": "Not only the avatars, but even the names can vary depending on the social circle. If you ask me why , I think it might be related to the culture of Asian-born individuals. Each person doesn't want to express their true selves.", "created_at": "2025-10-23T02:00:53", "owner": "fantom940510", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914124052221242, "text": "可能是用偶像的照片", "created_at": "2025-10-23T01:41:26", "owner": "hueichoong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057911495208977, "text": "hbnjjk", "created_at": "2025-10-23T01:39:31", "owner": "lhyyxfyyt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873763939352933, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T01:39:04", "owner": "lyang9527", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18535669702011232, "text": "你知我咩料啦😏", "created_at": "2025-10-23T01:31:55", "owner": "yaufung919", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109133524589350, "text": "用自己的頭像打遊戲輸了 一定會被攻擊長相😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T01:26:48", "owner": "hongxx0412", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18054665321288163, "text": "我就用自己的照片了啊。", "created_at": "2025-10-23T01:01:35", "owner": "yukong973", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977908002927591, "text": "我这个头像就很不错啊", "created_at": "2025-10-23T00:55:12", "owner": "yzy66610", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18534388621031306, "text": "因为没自信丑呗，长得硬帅的人都用自己头像，比如我。但是装也是很装。", "created_at": "2025-10-23T00:52:43", "owner": "kaiyang_lyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865117045419328, "text": "心情好偶尔可以用用", "created_at": "2025-10-23T00:40:15", "owner": "mikecmikecc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544241425053562, "text": "因为很多人会把喜欢的人物当成自己的头像", "created_at": "2025-10-23T00:37:01", "owner": "lukeofgod1122", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058619867553385, "text": "不但不用自己的头像。微信还用莫名其妙的名字", "created_at": "2025-10-23T00:34:11", "owner": "ardi.chang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968747805974205, "text": "网上泄露太多个人信息 会被销售骚扰", "created_at": "2025-10-23T00:20:26", "owner": "vvvvvvvv58882", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096419173763557, "text": "名字跟拿脚趾打的一样 太多都不知道是谁", "created_at": "2025-10-23T00:19:20", "owner": "theanaloguedoc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843876781598170, "text": "有吗，没有吧", "created_at": "2025-10-23T00:16:48", "owner": "xunxunchibubao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091197307862768, "text": "文化不同。", "created_at": "2025-10-22T23:58:59", "owner": "_soul.fs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051960269328259, "text": "因为我长得丑", "created_at": "2025-10-22T23:43:30", "owner": "crazy_dave_4321", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891235189361171, "text": "Some Chinese thinks that if you use your own face as a profile is giving your privacy to others…", "created_at": "2025-10-22T23:35:12", "owner": "liucongcong454", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091867651854228, "text": "因為我們長得沒那麼好看😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T23:32:28", "owner": "priorboard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927931297131716, "text": "在中国除非你是做销售的会用自己的照片，别的基本不会，因为会让人觉得你很不靠谱，从自己的角度来讲，用自己的照片做头像自己也觉得比较中二，所以不用", "created_at": "2025-10-22T23:26:57", "owner": "aiglan88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996494424835774, "text": "你也会说是外国人才会这样了入乡随俗知道吧", "created_at": "2025-10-22T23:04:50", "owner": "tanqingyio", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18324511870240708, "text": "因为我很丑，我害怕吓到他们😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T22:41:45", "owner": "zhaodaxia64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085953503307553, "text": "自由啊", "created_at": "2025-10-22T22:31:58", "owner": "huliuyi77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148002217420084, "text": "頭像代表一個人的喜好。", "created_at": "2025-10-22T22:31:05", "owner": "bl98860", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17860036173455327, "text": "頭像就是放自己喜歡的圖，哪來那麼多為什麼。", "created_at": "2025-10-22T22:30:28", "owner": "bl98860", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083343259801839, "text": "因为我是躲在网络阴暗面的懦夫，用自己头像要体面一点😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T22:20:29", "owner": "jiapeng0352", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977869986925957, "text": "他們覺得用自己的照片很裝😄", "created_at": "2025-10-22T22:18:18", "owner": "cl1ouis._07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103866913621433, "text": "Privacy, mate", "created_at": "2025-10-22T21:58:33", "owner": "nikokokoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157258435392139, "text": "因为会被人肉😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T21:46:17", "owner": "micheleqiu91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18432322735101185, "text": "独裁国家互害，谁敢用自己，你去看朝鲜伊朗也都一样", "created_at": "2025-10-22T21:31:33", "owner": "tomorrowstomatos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032897042516095, "text": "因为自己丑啊", "created_at": "2025-10-22T21:31:15", "owner": "niejiaodan8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899875834294091, "text": "privacy", "created_at": "2025-10-22T21:27:47", "owner": "ttrant001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099555829662597, "text": "找茬", "created_at": "2025-10-22T21:23:18", "owner": "fire202064", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928235536135593, "text": "之前QQ下线后头像变黑白色 而黑白头像一般是遗照😂😂😂😂所以", "created_at": "2025-10-22T21:21:13", "owner": "jookewang", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17896453647335924, "text": "不上镜😢", "created_at": "2025-10-22T20:17:52", "owner": "ouk0328", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18526363309012256, "text": "因为没自信 太丑没办法😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T20:08:23", "owner": "kee_dyn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926665288115427, "text": "如果用自己的照片那我的照片可能会被骗子拿去骗人", "created_at": "2025-10-22T19:52:54", "owner": "cccccg1001", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085538680994923, "text": "中国人基本都不用 用了可能还会被说自恋说是 而且对我们这种长的不太好看的不是很友好", "created_at": "2025-10-22T19:24:47", "owner": "optimkane_zerox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080752535047146, "text": "你管我们用什么头像", "created_at": "2025-10-22T18:48:10", "owner": "caro.line0819", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18177167635357903, "text": "Because Chinese is shy.😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T18:34:15", "owner": "huzig2000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909524245244541, "text": "马上把头像改成照片", "created_at": "2025-10-22T18:24:51", "owner": "lubing0504", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919398406174455, "text": "因为从小开始玩社交软件，就习惯性的使用任何图片当头像了。哪怕是那些长得很好看的网红，都不用自己的照片当头像，这是习惯问题。", "created_at": "2025-10-22T18:01:17", "owner": "niujieshi6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945066576932671, "text": "我太丑了😢", "created_at": "2025-10-22T17:56:25", "owner": "beluta233", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18148220056422729, "text": "在微信上真的用了会显得很傻，但我现在在墙外！我可以随心所欲！😍", "created_at": "2025-10-22T17:54:54", "owner": "yjq19950912", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161044276390106, "text": "长的不太方便 所以不想用自己的照片", "created_at": "2025-10-22T17:53:07", "owner": "happyhu_418", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17986939373883332, "text": "因為有這個自由。", "created_at": "2025-10-22T17:49:02", "owner": "carlosmeowww", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083470294994193, "text": "因为我的头像我做主，我想用啥就用啥", "created_at": "2025-10-22T17:43:04", "owner": "fuxiao3700", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031917953723381, "text": "我就用自己的脸做头像啊", "created_at": "2025-10-22T17:31:34", "owner": "xiaxinyu1987", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057954638534267, "text": "中国相反用的是骗子", "created_at": "2025-10-22T17:27:03", "owner": "qifanovo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094500361829097, "text": "保护隐私", "created_at": "2025-10-22T17:16:31", "owner": "cozeeeeeroman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088207627904327, "text": "想用什么就用什么，因为有很多好玩的东西🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:57:18", "owner": "goon31129", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18083139430825048, "text": "有沒有人也是因為照片被盜過。", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:56:49", "owner": "rapunzel90533", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897824491316787, "text": "因為  不好看😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:52:56", "owner": "t120715", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18051980429321648, "text": "中國人普遍都長得醜 好看的還是會放自己的照片", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:51:03", "owner": "0xdddddddddddddd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049737449336283, "text": "我瞎讲的啊….这个我也一直在纳闷呢🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:45:50", "owner": "ana_p_218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083358164304047, "text": "含蓄🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:44:59", "owner": "ana_p_218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143607853435210, "text": "我用自己的", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:40:03", "owner": "jihun6326", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17884818627391849, "text": "因为不帅 没自信呗", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:36:34", "owner": "la_aska", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078451231873278, "text": "在中国，骗子会用照片", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:26:00", "owner": "cocoa4331", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077863217157928, "text": "感觉自己的照片是很隐私的一件事情😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:18:35", "owner": "vekyah888888", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17934494238095714, "text": "因为用自己的照片，更像诈骗😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:17:16", "owner": "suina001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056840693261081, "text": "用自己照片很多都是因为商业原因不用自己照片的大部分都是为了表达自己", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:16:45", "owner": "im_kayn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078954502874034, "text": "我头像放出来，那就会被好朋友p成丑照", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:15:59", "owner": "t_blackshura", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086038498938105, "text": "而且名字都是奇奇怪怪點名字⋯還會三不五時更改⋯", "created_at": "2025-10-22T16:06:46", "owner": "_yuna________", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17863899435484928, "text": "使用習慣的差異罷了。中國真的任何一件小事情都要拉一個群，哪怕只是通知一條訊息都可以專門開一個群聊。除此之外，還有大量的商業/推廣/活動吧啦吧啦的群組，群裡面可能一個熟人都沒有，所以當然就更不想放個人照片了\n\n如果以台灣做對比的話，Line像是一個純通訊+工作app，但微信更在這基礎上還額外擁有了社交+各類資訊渠道的功能，所以使得聯絡人的數量跟成分更爲複雜，導致大家更不願意把太多個人資訊放在照片跟名稱裡", "created_at": "2025-10-22T15:52:18", "owner": "reeee_hau", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17893977678204291, "text": "我用自己的头像", "created_at": "2025-10-22T15:47:52", "owner": "woxingfeng3", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18131804965479148, "text": "因为尴尬😅", "created_at": "2025-10-22T15:34:42", "owner": "undeadtat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889709104363618, "text": "因为用自己的脸别人会觉得你很臭美", "created_at": "2025-10-22T15:31:00", "owner": "imkkris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120214492518820, "text": "朋友是个外国机长，说他一个中国同事在微信上叫little prince 😏", "created_at": "2025-10-22T15:30:11", "owner": "wtruszczynska", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898566958317988, "text": "@iriana.atsyanti 哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-10-22T15:20:13", "owner": "miemieyang8688", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18192684370325389, "text": "Low self esteem", "created_at": "2025-10-22T15:06:31", "owner": "ziyi072192", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118896382526397, "text": "为什么啦😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T15:03:17", "owner": "awesome_mask1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048554477362531, "text": "Heard one person said that not the looking of our face, that's the looking of our soul😊", "created_at": "2025-10-22T15:02:34", "owner": "aria_eatgrass", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067750964075610, "text": "@xqw0504 因为长得太邪恶了。", "created_at": "2025-10-22T15:02:09", "owner": "kimheejuuuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060168284181437, "text": "中国人可以用@也可以不用 不像老外 必须用", "created_at": "2025-10-22T14:58:07", "owner": "se_ven4298", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076158166920085, "text": "因為這叫隱私", "created_at": "2025-10-22T14:52:09", "owner": "62.3689776", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090798874700977, "text": "因为好看", "created_at": "2025-10-22T14:51:03", "owner": "liloiluo41", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18095900371815005, "text": "因为长得不好看。", "created_at": "2025-10-22T14:32:50", "owner": "youyuji391", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897146773336276, "text": "因為我很喜歡喬治六世", "created_at": "2025-10-22T14:24:45", "owner": "kim1009025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902301796314167, "text": "中国骗子太多，用自己图片容易被坏人顶住", "created_at": "2025-10-22T14:19:32", "owner": "gazelle709656", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095494000690792, "text": "Because we’re trying to hide our religion from the west after relativity, computer science, and quantum physics kept borrowing our ideas without paying us. Like paper and printing press, firework, and magnets. It’s karmic retribution that US cannot manufacture their own magnets.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T14:18:45", "owner": "fiona.ggl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18556132843008149, "text": "因為我醜😢", "created_at": "2025-10-22T14:15:27", "owner": "zhucai_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987452829734958, "text": "一是因为亚洲人五官没有欧美人长得好，所以比较自卑。但亚洲人长得好看的用自己做头像的概率明显增加。其次是中国人仍受传统思想影响，骨子里还是比较内敛羞涩的，不像欧美人性格那样阳光开朗。", "created_at": "2025-10-22T13:59:34", "owner": "josehuang0625", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298063381254291, "text": "日本人也不用自己照片当头像（亚洲专区文化）", "created_at": "2025-10-22T13:57:52", "owner": "kou_7417", "likes": 1521}, {"id": 18083441828490883, "text": "耻感文化，羞于表达自己，在意外部评价", "created_at": "2025-10-22T13:52:50", "owner": "go1d.wav", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17900545821297507, "text": "Because China is not safe", "created_at": "2025-10-22T13:50:43", "owner": "paul_xxyzc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098816623664080, "text": "Because I want to protect my privacy.😀", "created_at": "2025-10-22T13:50:08", "owner": "yuancoco_0722", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076089430922977, "text": "万一我长得丑还要发出来给你看看吗？那天你用我头像去恶心别人，你是不是怪我？", "created_at": "2025-10-22T13:38:21", "owner": "junyezhu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053247368307306, "text": "不用自己頭像和不用自己自己本名", "created_at": "2025-10-22T13:37:08", "owner": "yuming_2512", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18078424978869113, "text": "Because ugly people are afraid of meeting good people, and good-looking people are afraid of meeting bad people.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T13:32:27", "owner": "crary1997", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074427622957183, "text": "用自己头像感觉好自恋被别人说也好尴尬", "created_at": "2025-10-22T13:27:24", "owner": "hannnovo15", "likes": 297}, {"id": 18094293751794323, "text": "因为我觉得自己长得丑😂不知道其他人", "created_at": "2025-10-22T13:17:09", "owner": "an_buzhongle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18343744444206329, "text": "We jus chopped bro", "created_at": "2025-10-22T13:12:37", "owner": "ssbouncybeatss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074450786331640, "text": "觉得自己丑😢", "created_at": "2025-10-22T13:06:16", "owner": "lilabjin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964112640838409, "text": "i have only added friends on WeChat, so no chance to be scammer or something", "created_at": "2025-10-22T13:04:59", "owner": "xiaohang508", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141657352434202, "text": "用自己的头像不是房地产中介就是银行职员", "created_at": "2025-10-22T12:58:56", "owner": "toothless1212", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066389642523209, "text": "如果是1980-1995年会用自己照片，1995-2010会用网络上其他人的照片，1980以前的会用风景照片。2010年以后会是一些抽象的照片😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T12:54:26", "owner": "gaosiyu204", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882593398401499, "text": "我已经不在微信用自己脸当头像。感觉有点尴尬已经🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-22T12:53:44", "owner": "mad.and.maze", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18390807091124820, "text": "其实就是因为建模问题😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T12:52:47", "owner": "bao_dan_i", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000456671812797, "text": "在中国，想要骗你的人，用自己的头像概率更大。", "created_at": "2025-10-22T12:49:33", "owner": "shileixinhaha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891241240223713, "text": "因为我长得丑啊", "created_at": "2025-10-22T12:48:55", "owner": "jt52110", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130866169469812, "text": "因为我不需要和陌生人做进一步的交流或认识对方， 那就真的没必要把自己的头像放上社交平台了", "created_at": "2025-10-22T12:32:52", "owner": "cyy.camping", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18072583202191180, "text": "因為會被別的中國人拿頭像去做詐騙", "created_at": "2025-10-22T12:31:50", "owner": "foxson_tai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923623291027675, "text": "用自己的头像有可能被骗子利用去骗别人", "created_at": "2025-10-22T12:31:20", "owner": "liangliangzhou310", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987976461730422, "text": "因为有很多人感觉用自己的头像都会觉得很自恋🤡", "created_at": "2025-10-22T12:23:54", "owner": "der_der_derderder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927608251115256, "text": "因为社交软体不只是用于同自己相识的人交流和沟通，还要和许许多多现实中不认识的人互动，他们也可以搜索到你。这种情况下，自己真实的相貌就成为了一种隐私信息，所以不愿意公开。", "created_at": "2025-10-22T12:16:57", "owner": "litbrian1020", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065739407092238, "text": "因为中国的头像是体现使用者本人的个性显示，我们不在乎别人喜不喜欢自己的头像。😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T12:13:55", "owner": "wangwei81192", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159033277380261, "text": "我是被人盜用過， 現在都不敢露正臉", "created_at": "2025-10-22T12:12:19", "owner": "cynthia_cheuk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057750152553869, "text": "really? I like cats very much, and my profile pictures are all cats. Will my foreign friends think I am a liar?😮😮", "created_at": "2025-10-22T12:07:27", "owner": "racheljade102", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897454918336890, "text": "因为用自己头像的大多数是骗子", "created_at": "2025-10-22T12:05:41", "owner": "xuxiaoliuliu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941691148066324, "text": "我长得太丑了", "created_at": "2025-10-22T12:01:38", "owner": "s.seer_s.s", "likes": 1055}, {"id": 17983661270879337, "text": "Because using your own avatar on WeChat may be spoofed by friends and appear in the Moments, like being turned into something related to the school days.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T11:59:00", "owner": "kj92029", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079920997843595, "text": "😂😂Didn't I just use my own photos?", "created_at": "2025-10-22T11:48:56", "owner": "lcd3914", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918285790189143, "text": "Because ,WeChat from QQ😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T11:20:28", "owner": "a568604521", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949851955028526, "text": "I don't dare use my ugly self as my pfp", "created_at": "2025-10-22T11:11:29", "owner": "fxndyz.xx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109150564590012, "text": "在网上冲浪时 怕被熟人认出来", "created_at": "2025-10-22T11:10:24", "owner": "sunset70642", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17969888624806988, "text": "因為醜", "created_at": "2025-10-22T11:10:01", "owner": "joseph26276", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062693735569436, "text": "When the Internet first became popular, people in most parts of the world regarded it as an extension of the real life, while Chinese see the real world and the online world are separate from each other", "created_at": "2025-10-22T11:02:17", "owner": "_yufei42", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18513850732067329, "text": "很真實", "created_at": "2025-10-22T11:01:11", "owner": "meiyouqia3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126276715495946, "text": "不自信呗", "created_at": "2025-10-22T10:49:33", "owner": "xuchen935", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058134293545942, "text": "因为中国人多数对自己的容貌不自信。", "created_at": "2025-10-22T10:18:38", "owner": "jun930330", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17925711642148862, "text": "当你跟别人争吵时，别人会第一时间攻击你的长相😐", "created_at": "2025-10-22T09:46:48", "owner": "llyh312", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17896942212324932, "text": "人脸识别，可以刷支付宝微信付款", "created_at": "2025-10-22T09:46:04", "owner": "hokafong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963328177002486, "text": "30年前，大家用qq的时候还不能用自己的头像，所以这是习惯😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T09:43:18", "owner": "ss.ma88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113497780562009, "text": "因为长得丑的不敢用，长得帅的用了别人说你装逼", "created_at": "2025-10-22T09:27:46", "owner": "wei200001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989555583890957, "text": "因為中国不安全", "created_at": "2025-10-22T09:24:54", "owner": "hotin1108", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941047567078823, "text": "有很多都用自己的头像啊，用其他的作为头像也就是自己喜欢吧！很随性的一个事情。我也遇到过外国人不用自己的照片，有的甚至没有任何头像就是空在那里🤷🏽‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-10-22T09:16:01", "owner": "trista_shan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104197294619008, "text": "都是騙子嘛", "created_at": "2025-10-22T08:45:37", "owner": "rayin_rou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079865960022898, "text": "用自己的照片就容易被别人评判自己的样貌和气质，很多人很害怕", "created_at": "2025-10-22T08:16:01", "owner": "mars_peng_xiaodao", "likes": 178}, {"id": 18100747027728700, "text": "因为丑", "created_at": "2025-10-22T07:58:56", "owner": "1889hirohiro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071602532209526, "text": "😂我就是小熊", "created_at": "2025-10-22T07:56:00", "owner": "bucaimm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897509290323235, "text": "因为在中国用自己的头像就容易被人骗😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T07:23:22", "owner": "vivianxu2025", "likes": 85}, {"id": 18016625378786471, "text": "Well if u use ur own photo as pfp then u either sells insurance or u r npd", "created_at": "2025-10-22T06:55:27", "owner": "tsing_shuang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888553996241533, "text": "我的头像是我🤓", "created_at": "2025-10-22T06:36:13", "owner": "icanseethejupiter9527", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044699972430722, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T05:31:16", "owner": "_03va_0427", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069527213040055, "text": "我是用自己的", "created_at": "2025-10-22T04:42:36", "owner": "ma_yuyu2525", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17930066727121173, "text": "因为喜欢放自己喜欢的图片，图片包罗万千，可以是表情，可以是偶像，可以是表达当下状态，也可以是对未来的期望…总之，文化差异，表达方式不同", "created_at": "2025-10-22T04:42:19", "owner": "julietzhu2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076126135923243, "text": "文化差異", "created_at": "2025-10-22T04:39:50", "owner": "yine_www_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080290859019995, "text": "那是放喜歡的圖片的地方", "created_at": "2025-10-22T04:33:31", "owner": "sanriyuezhaomin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18025932101752641, "text": "用自己当头像感觉好自恋", "created_at": "2025-10-22T04:27:09", "owner": "gigglek", "likes": 386}, {"id": 17931828771102997, "text": "因为学校是会上传照片的，如如果他有你的一个联系方式，有你的头像，就可以能得到你所有的信息", "created_at": "2025-10-22T04:00:27", "owner": "ohsehunswify", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129525628488689, "text": "你看看我的头像，哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-10-22T03:43:09", "owner": "ying_0213_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958520160865366, "text": "因為中國的治安很糟糕", "created_at": "2025-10-22T03:23:37", "owner": "willie820914", "likes": 124}, {"id": 17923879257170863, "text": "韩国人都没有头像", "created_at": "2025-10-22T03:09:39", "owner": "tsin_lin118", "likes": 22}, {"id": 17899911585297732, "text": "不想讓親朋好友看見", "created_at": "2025-10-22T02:54:50", "owner": "_edison1998", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103932448623216, "text": "說的是我嗎？😄", "created_at": "2025-10-22T02:53:13", "owner": "_edison1998", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044039408422044, "text": "因为网上发疯不会被熟人认出来。", "created_at": "2025-10-22T00:53:32", "owner": "teing_karl", "likes": 152}, {"id": 18001619198665603, "text": "很简单，因为不好意思", "created_at": "2025-10-21T23:32:59", "owner": "later_album", "likes": 117}, {"id": 17919006750053672, "text": "我用自己的，但是有个潜水面罩🤿嘿嘿", "created_at": "2025-10-21T23:32:48", "owner": "decole_woo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069723188029300, "text": "Facial insecurity, here you have your answer", "created_at": "2025-10-21T18:38:54", "owner": "matthw_05", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17846707788565538, "text": "I noticed that too", "created_at": "2025-10-21T16:46:12", "owner": "jess.ka7", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18061200878420869, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈 因为在中国很多卖保险的才用自己当头像", "created_at": "2025-10-21T16:14:41", "owner": "kittyliio84", "likes": 2029}, {"id": 18172147924363526, "text": "JAJAJA this is so true", "created_at": "2025-10-21T15:27:15", "owner": "savarges", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18142495264436511, "text": "In China, salesmen usually use their photo as  profile😂", "created_at": "2025-10-21T15:20:03", "owner": "kewondin", "likes": 3321}, {"id": 18023732987572889, "text": "Cause then they know how i look like in real life i guess", "created_at": "2025-10-21T15:06:51", "owner": "harmin.hai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945437758055041, "text": "也可能是怕被骗😂", "created_at": "2025-10-21T13:08:34", "owner": "huanyu386", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944270796935650, "text": "And now I started to be an anonymous too because of them. Kinda like it though that I can say whatever in the Internet about their moms. Just like in 2007. Just like it’s supposed to be.", "created_at": "2025-10-21T10:32:39", "owner": "the_worst_ninja_ever", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17874910281431771, "text": "可推测他们认为自己的脸不怎么出息", "created_at": "2025-10-21T10:08:12", "owner": "confidentialness", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18059831633544524, "text": "Hahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahahaahahahahahahaha", "created_at": "2025-10-21T07:57:08", "owner": "hindhindhindya", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["china", "explore", "fyp", "funnyvideos", "viral", "funny", "fypシ", "tiktok", "culture", "profil"]},
{"media_id": 3778067642306227798, "shortcode": "DRuZIDtD25W", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRuZIDtD25W/", "taken_at": "2025-12-01T14:53:41", "caption": "大夸F人 哈哈哈😹\n————————————————————————————————\n\n🔮塔罗不是迷信 它只是一个导航给你方向\n🔮塔罗是让你觉察你的问题作出改变创造更好的未来\n\n📪来找我预约塔罗 \n@wendyy.tarot \n\n#钱 #机会 #正能量 赚钱 生活 日常 成长 思维 命运 社交 事业 工作 职场 人际关系 生活方式 开心 塔罗 塔罗牌占卜 塔罗心理咨询", "owner_username": "wendyy.tarot", "owner_id": "74437710221", "likes": 9776, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0013_DRuZIDtD25W\\DRuZIDtD25W_20251201_145341.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18104482582660488, "text": "har？等别人的上了才吃是单纯有问题吧？！？", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:04:47", "owner": "prv_ze11_2", "likes": 175}, {"id": 18047962148448222, "text": "我主要是等來了一起拍照😂 我跟朋友的飯餸多數都是分享的 所以沒有這樣的執着", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:18:50", "owner": "kttt__0427", "likes": 27}, {"id": 18126217807509719, "text": "这样我是T人(◐‿◑)�除非那个菜真的太烧了才会等", "created_at": "2025-12-02T07:10:02", "owner": "gagacai_30", "likes": 197}, {"id": 17906011752285221, "text": "我是F人 但我不會直接說啊😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:11:07", "owner": "peggy070133", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17926115181039184, "text": "？？？T人也不是不讲礼貌啊 当然是等大家来了一起吃 但是如果是self serve的那种小菜就可以自己先吃 因为对方也可以自己去拿", "created_at": "2025-12-03T17:55:56", "owner": "gnaw.ada", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18064374461178038, "text": "是直男不！", "created_at": "2025-12-02T01:43:25", "owner": "cindy.chung.5891", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18120241582546572, "text": "我有時候T有时候P", "created_at": "2025-12-03T08:21:40", "owner": "frances_chiu1102", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17968446731865437, "text": "真的F人懂F人的世界真的美好", "created_at": "2025-12-13T11:07:59", "owner": "____________________mm_mm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927185683079705, "text": "T人：自己點的自己吃", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:54:57", "owner": "page.gyu_5.7", "likes": 36}, {"id": 18549660475011687, "text": "其實這都取決於我餓不餓", "created_at": "2025-12-03T11:19:19", "owner": "yhy.0410", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064170926178344, "text": "@jack_koay F 人会直接问么？😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T15:00:33", "owner": "ms_emilyleow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080499482163536, "text": "Sorry but some table manners in my humble view is outdated and serves no real purpose but affect people negatively such as wasting time and effort.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:34:13", "owner": "cheuk_thegreat", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18112714939598635, "text": "F人表示 真的", "created_at": "2025-12-02T08:57:39", "owner": "mrusbsklshaieoen", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17902968612323039, "text": "这不就是我爸爸吗？😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T09:45:40", "owner": "lin_0105pxl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906493714148206, "text": "个人觉得这样不一定是没礼貌，单纯就是方便，况且这也不是什么正式场合", "created_at": "2025-12-09T08:50:36", "owner": "fishpei.x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068911073106996, "text": "我全家都是T人~", "created_at": "2025-12-03T08:05:44", "owner": "leon.gyingxi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074451413030908, "text": "我果然真係一個F人", "created_at": "2025-12-03T07:12:24", "owner": "haibarapiano0818", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17895125337225851, "text": "我会先吃但是会慢慢地吃", "created_at": "2025-12-07T10:12:37", "owner": "8712_ian", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["钱", "机会", "正能量"]},
{"media_id": 3703182494939476595, "shortcode": "DNkWNvdT_Jz", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DNkWNvdT_Jz/", "taken_at": "2025-08-20T07:13:37", "caption": "职场破局，以锋芒赢场面。官场谋势，借人情换情面。生意场纵横，用底线定体面。#认知 #认知思维 #人生感悟 #处世智慧", "owner_username": "stephen_choo.dy", "owner_id": "66549818672", "likes": 3793, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0014_DNkWNvdT_Jz\\DNkWNvdT_Jz_20250820_071337.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": "17974849280793238", "text": "得到了幫助都是白眼狼，沒幾個把當貴人，都是把幫助當作理所當然", "created_at": "2025-11-10T11:36:47", "owner": "reyes_cookinglife", "likes": 28}, {"id": "18371362237148082", "text": "师傅，我是你的作品", "created_at": "2025-09-02T15:59:22", "owner": "dust.1006", "likes": 13}, {"id": "18149058187393334", "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-08-29T12:43:58", "owner": "zhousixing2024", "likes": 1}, {"id": "17974018184808224", "text": "老師", "created_at": "2025-12-07T14:23:38", "owner": "superyufun", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18088527829985769", "text": "为什么在困境中 不想想陈胜吴广的名言，王侯将相宁有种乎？", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:42:11", "owner": "keep_itreal_____", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18095012461643817", "text": "大部分都是农夫与蛇", "created_at": "2025-09-03T17:53:12", "owner": "jy_rescues", "likes": 2}, {"id": "18118098331530277", "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-15T10:20:41", "owner": "fly.3852", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["认知", "认知思维", "人生感悟", "处世智慧"]},
{"media_id": 3703070183532514511, "shortcode": "DNj8rZTy8zP", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DNj8rZTy8zP/", "taken_at": "2025-08-20T03:28:09", "caption": "天机可露，世事能明。字里行间，句透人生 #智者思维 #人性思维 #谋略智慧 #谋略 #思维谋略", "owner_username": "stephenchoo.dy", "owner_id": "59700019676", "likes": 18726, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0015_DNj8rZTy8zP\\DNj8rZTy8zP_20250820_032809.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18063139805349555, "text": "如果真的就每天去他那只吃一個包子呢😂", "created_at": "2025-08-24T13:28:56", "owner": "xiaoxuan00000000", "likes": 219}, {"id": 18367711198199196, "text": "對.錢到位.就拿錢跑路.不用一年", "created_at": "2025-08-21T12:43:05", "owner": "kx4475", "likes": 493}, {"id": 18075069233005072, "text": "可以把字幕跟聲音拿掉嗎", "created_at": "2025-08-20T03:39:44", "owner": "sean_._naes", "likes": 92}, {"id": 18290764732254628, "text": "👏👏👍😱", "created_at": "2025-08-20T10:39:06", "owner": "smtdlim", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17860889292433770, "text": "这个故事明显是没做过生意的人编的", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:56:40", "owner": "ajane82124", "likes": 105}, {"id": 18404759815118759, "text": "想的美 試試你店舖附近全是老人？", "created_at": "2025-08-22T09:09:35", "owner": "chong_tsz", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18420762631108321, "text": "所以現在是包子店倒了改行拍短影嗎", "created_at": "2025-09-07T11:27:05", "owner": "boywilly56", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17913368559220613, "text": "那问题来了，为何我一定要选择那家店？若有商业竞争，附近的包子店可能更划算呢？只会是无尽的竞争", "created_at": "2025-10-25T04:39:44", "owner": "18y854hafizndjw", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080542906755479, "text": "啊對對對你沒成本你清高", "created_at": "2025-09-06T06:48:37", "owner": "tmd1073147", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18287413438277295, "text": "告訴我賺這麼多錢的包子店現在在哪裡", "created_at": "2025-08-24T03:55:17", "owner": "dez0326", "likes": 19}, {"id": 18072971819277065, "text": "29元 你會覺得 很便宜！基本上你吃到膩也不會每天報到了。因為你會覺得反正才29元 你就會有無所謂的心態。就跟你去吃到飽一樣，你會拿很多，即便你最後吃不完，你也不會硬吃完", "created_at": "2025-09-27T13:49:20", "owner": "ping_1o22", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18537160408004836, "text": "首先你在上海的水電房租就不會只有十萬 你擱這胡扯也得有點邏輯吧", "created_at": "2025-11-07T05:25:08", "owner": "david_0408__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092363755752945, "text": "会员制最大的漏洞，真的亏，就把生意关了 …. 毕竟钱已到账，加入会员前签个 TnC ，又不用受法律处罚", "created_at": "2025-09-10T10:04:18", "owner": "limhow_", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17975545277925751, "text": "如果這是在中國絕對會虧錢", "created_at": "2025-09-12T12:33:43", "owner": "c_a_r_b_o_n_li_f_e", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18096870883596567, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-01T15:26:00", "owner": "lssa.azu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17862221292396090, "text": "我主要是看洗地", "created_at": "2025-08-24T00:51:58", "owner": "camposy04", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18130473985459553, "text": "消费五块。。。净赚五块。。。韭菜割韭菜", "created_at": "2025-09-20T06:42:13", "owner": "phenck26", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17877210933311045, "text": "吃習包子", "created_at": "2025-09-28T09:49:45", "owner": "520_heibao", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087549997966914, "text": "誰會天天吃包子，不膩嗎？", "created_at": "2025-12-11T12:59:43", "owner": "uncleta_ins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087692312483985, "text": "會員制餐廳啊 快端上來罷", "created_at": "2025-12-09T21:50:57", "owner": "lai_swimhere", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861478447545816, "text": "所以你哋大陸嘅商家乜都要充值", "created_at": "2025-12-08T12:51:21", "owner": "jeffcheung926", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916928971238424, "text": "😂胡說八道  信你一成  雙目失明😂\n成件事係真嘅話  諾貝爾  經濟學獎 係屬於你嘅 \n 我的祖國prc  馬上聘請你入中央政策組 \n😂😂希望發表這些video的人  思想能夠成熟一些  不要丟我們中國prc的臉😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-12-08T02:43:29", "owner": "francishsieh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903212944328917, "text": "嘿對 都不用任何成本 👍最喜歡這種白嫖幹片了 超長智", "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:48:01", "owner": "ooo.__.181.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075041987260872, "text": "首先一点 包子要好吃 不好吃白给都没人去。", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:39:51", "owner": "blackstormla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908829040270070, "text": "开几个账号一群人轮流用就有你麻烦了。额外消费就变成零", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:25:35", "owner": "lukaviz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089905192939767, "text": "哇，太棒了！", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:31:51", "owner": "123fhand", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876587836441161, "text": "怎樣執行每人每日一個包呢？", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:58:45", "owner": "ricky_yu338_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083067551014211, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:58:41", "owner": "petra_.photo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099139576606487, "text": "😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-19T22:33:54", "owner": "waynechong_4224", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18534543742044050, "text": "收完会员费后连夜关门", "created_at": "2025-11-18T04:31:16", "owner": "fen.hong.qu.si", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074216567186496, "text": "養老院每個老人買一次會員 他們確實只要一個包子還吃不完", "created_at": "2025-11-16T12:14:35", "owner": "jincheng.6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085873183792627, "text": "逻辑不通，", "created_at": "2025-11-10T00:20:47", "owner": "ymengsansan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063609080611067, "text": "如果每個人就只吃一個包子 你怎樣辦 😅😅😅", "created_at": "2025-11-06T22:32:46", "owner": "followmyheart1234", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861322573450305, "text": "我突然想起淘vip88😂", "created_at": "2025-11-01T15:59:01", "owner": "shakeshake.man_e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079528373510867, "text": "聽故事❌解壓影片✅", "created_at": "2025-11-01T08:10:57", "owner": "sb2012__0823", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070127780346064, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-30T09:57:19", "owner": "quahteckkim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891660754225280, "text": "3000/1h", "created_at": "2025-10-26T10:25:37", "owner": "xay_1210", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888574696366452, "text": "在大陆都犯法，他妈的，全垄断", "created_at": "2025-10-26T04:14:30", "owner": "tdkfll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079276562088365, "text": "沒有成本，收到的全賺，即係借錢，借到就是賺到一樣道理😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-20T03:27:54", "owner": "skyuniquejade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084763636778158, "text": "講得好像小區只有她賣吃的一樣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-19T08:49:07", "owner": "sean._.55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939175861087679, "text": "美女包子，人工，零零碎碎的都不用钱。", "created_at": "2025-10-17T04:59:50", "owner": "cracked.king", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013120370684636, "text": "👍👍", "created_at": "2025-10-14T04:59:38", "owner": "shlim0862", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078740291014748, "text": "👍🏻", "created_at": "2025-10-13T20:48:32", "owner": "winniechen1010123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077189189319243, "text": "說得這麼容易，你就不會在這裏跟我們解釋視頻", "created_at": "2025-10-10T13:38:15", "owner": "seeehiiiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099810559652984, "text": "為什麼 會員不要每一個月辦一次 這樣賺的不是更多？", "created_at": "2025-10-10T10:05:03", "owner": "fop8769", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082394362988080, "text": "我他媽一天就只吃一個包子，其他不跟他買，我看怎麼辦？", "created_at": "2025-10-04T19:34:40", "owner": "zhaoboiong_0929", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949674885904072, "text": "一年赚100而已？", "created_at": "2025-10-04T08:24:42", "owner": "lavi.niaa_1001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051557060640888, "text": "什么样的流量最好赚。同理。\n想挣钱的流量尤其好赚", "created_at": "2025-10-03T02:41:38", "owner": "proudmoore0301", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18206705971309057, "text": "这个世界上腆着脸只吃一个免费包子的人太多了", "created_at": "2025-10-02T22:13:42", "owner": "lilcrybabythug", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062345903524215, "text": "还真有买一个包子的，而且还不少", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:56:15", "owner": "ajane82124", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079892768086018, "text": "也就只有在绝对理想的条件下才会盈利😂", "created_at": "2025-09-29T18:40:26", "owner": "henry____wuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901566334258805, "text": "啟動基金不夠", "created_at": "2025-09-29T08:35:40", "owner": "roy1010326", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021955079774849, "text": "如果真的像你说的这么厉害的话，你就不会在这里发视频了😂", "created_at": "2025-09-28T09:44:47", "owner": "yang_12242008", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904290514123149, "text": "這個道理就是Costco 的烤雞比外面便宜的道理", "created_at": "2025-09-28T07:50:47", "owner": "shuo27013", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952301238888906, "text": "講屁話是世界最簡單的事賺錢很簡單？", "created_at": "2025-09-27T12:16:32", "owner": "jiangzhongyang55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051186014274413, "text": "聽你這樣講大家都去開包子店了啊", "created_at": "2025-09-27T12:15:12", "owner": "jiangzhongyang55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060406478124586, "text": "人家有錢可以這樣搞我們又沒錢講這些屁話", "created_at": "2025-09-27T12:14:02", "owner": "jiangzhongyang55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967437843807057, "text": "29.9x30个人=十万？", "created_at": "2025-09-25T15:22:27", "owner": "birdyman_99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928859335101699, "text": "3000個會員費收到馬上倒", "created_at": "2025-09-24T03:34:12", "owner": "dj_tony_wang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999381534815061, "text": "肯定是只會吃一個包子就走的", "created_at": "2025-09-23T16:52:52", "owner": "henrygotmojo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003458513800187, "text": "這不就是龐氏騙局嗎，先集資拿完錢再跑路", "created_at": "2025-09-20T04:37:13", "owner": "zhengchengjun5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095589268588823, "text": "這胡說的計畫放在那個部落，完硬了", "created_at": "2025-09-16T04:58:46", "owner": "sherlock.kames", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064329062601412, "text": "媽的台灣政府有狗幹警察最好賺", "created_at": "2025-09-14T04:37:23", "owner": "cweixie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846568546561790, "text": "我早上只吃一個包子就飽了，怎麼辦？", "created_at": "2025-09-13T04:30:30", "owner": "wangbolun28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896871883279644, "text": "當高級官員最好賺", "created_at": "2025-09-11T22:52:34", "owner": "che_0.0.0.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942644478918218, "text": "一边听一边看他刷地板", "created_at": "2025-09-07T18:09:41", "owner": "fabric1.21.8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976479270876834, "text": "信你就是個包子", "created_at": "2025-08-31T10:27:41", "owner": "simonno586", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015278309782893, "text": "你就催啦我看你咋实现😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-30T04:07:27", "owner": "argus1250", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070761893146060, "text": "會員制", "created_at": "2025-08-28T00:53:15", "owner": "junkai000000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941345523919050, "text": "男人好色的钱不好赚，大部分违法😂", "created_at": "2025-08-27T23:10:03", "owner": "wenzi7413", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076269737051749, "text": "還有賺台灣用路人的錢", "created_at": "2025-08-26T18:22:44", "owner": "haru_931112", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18517287469017412, "text": "重點是你包子的成本跟店鋪的成本不用付嗎😂", "created_at": "2025-08-26T04:01:54", "owner": "fengyuanwanxie69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039236798391733, "text": "挣骗人的钱", "created_at": "2025-08-22T23:36:20", "owner": "chengquan505", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047560295300728, "text": "每個都在跟你辦會員，假如有人辦一堆店的會員每間都拿免費的就行，哪來有錢給你賺，只知道講屁話欸😂", "created_at": "2025-08-20T04:10:28", "owner": "gavin_huang_21", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["智者思维", "人性思维", "谋略智慧", "谋略", "思维谋略"]},
{"media_id": 3772615243239814907, "shortcode": "DRbBZNXiHb7", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRbBZNXiHb7/", "taken_at": "2025-11-24T02:20:17", "caption": "快让你兄弟谈恋爱吧，真爽！", "owner_username": "lep35542", "owner_id": "78219784537", "likes": 21597, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0016_DRbBZNXiHb7\\DRbBZNXiHb7_20251124_022017.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18093726592847140, "text": "有人留意到‘暫時都是直男’😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:39:58", "owner": "chun_08__20_lok", "likes": 724}, {"id": 17862249906539848, "text": "Steve有話要說：", "created_at": "2025-11-24T09:12:02", "owner": "aishitemasu_gomen", "likes": 1494}, {"id": 18006412409664057, "text": "這個版本的史蒂夫好爽ㄛ", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:26:03", "owner": "kimura_tiyu", "likes": 231}, {"id": 18106082386636220, "text": "要去哪里给兄弟找到一个有不同闺蜜的女朋友", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:57:44", "owner": "chernrueyng", "likes": 21}, {"id": 18118820797532973, "text": "害我想到steve", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:22:23", "owner": "xting._.2309", "likes": 182}, {"id": 17975710778795660, "text": "確定不是你比兄弟好看她想挖牆角嗎", "created_at": "2025-11-24T09:37:20", "owner": "shadow_.yu", "likes": 32}, {"id": 18365949703089333, "text": "但結婚就是兩回事了🗿", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:33:37", "owner": "sutoramun", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18429815914108080, "text": "史蒂夫吗 有点意思", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:57:16", "owner": "jwjf23", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18066974978611009, "text": "史蒂夫表示：你終於體驗到我的快樂了吧", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:08:33", "owner": "tw_kuo", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17998993313844338, "text": "@steven428428 史蒂夫怎麼說？", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:06:46", "owner": "brotherdrew_hsiao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892588027367996, "text": "上條片先聽咗首完整版嘅，steve😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:15:15", "owner": "ng_c_p", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18048317579423687, "text": "@yuteng.wang.77 我有機會當這款的Steve嗎？", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:11:47", "owner": "jinsanwulala", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17860160157485568, "text": "難怪我兄弟整天盼我談戀愛", "created_at": "2025-12-06T08:57:17", "owner": "lgg_junjun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171335119332769, "text": "史蒂夫（？", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:51:22", "owner": "snapper_ouo", "likes": 29}, {"id": 17989280795738822, "text": "好了steve", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:42:48", "owner": "lyh_0324", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18109053784556766, "text": "steve🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:28:00", "owner": "lasxty14", "likes": 91}, {"id": 18108369808619702, "text": "@satch_0708 @joe_03_09_ @imweiwei2 賓果答對了🙆", "created_at": "2025-11-24T09:14:15", "owner": "cyc_even_71._.71", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17856418878564268, "text": "@youxin2004 and my friend Steve 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-25T06:43:16", "owner": "_socrbgk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18173533528368180, "text": "直男在成都相當於處", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:35:50", "owner": "muscle_bushi", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18071814110341394, "text": "And your friend Steve", "created_at": "2025-11-30T09:03:20", "owner": "bosco.lau0311", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18108334651627748, "text": "@kyle._.yung @ivie._.123 準備俾5個人跟住😈", "created_at": "2025-11-25T06:13:26", "owner": "elo9066", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065219525147772, "text": "所以你是婚前財產", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:11:01", "owner": "ianchiu106", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17930452398011796, "text": "Steve", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:16:47", "owner": "adw_812", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17844510414618272, "text": "Steve", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:07:16", "owner": "o4tako_0128", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18381480835151059, "text": "女友也很開心：我有兩個男人，他們也是彼此的男人，也都是我的男人😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T00:22:39", "owner": "mys.moa.0304", "likes": 164}, {"id": 18413516656184905, "text": "你們需要的不是女友，是個媽", "created_at": "2025-12-08T23:21:47", "owner": "vk.c_929", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18395840683124804, "text": "@jinghao919 @zhikang_tiew @siangyee0227 @jiachi0314 @_yuheng1110_ @jsongws 兄弟的幸福靠你们了", "created_at": "2025-12-03T06:11:25", "owner": "crazy_duckart", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17890533585379980, "text": "白襪", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:45:09", "owner": "danielrgl0", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17902908630315561, "text": "hi steve", "created_at": "2025-12-12T03:26:53", "owner": "jynnnnn9787", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087913765996400, "text": "為什麼我的兄弟不像這樣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T09:53:20", "owner": "joleung_jodaren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125178874519206, "text": "如果他女朋友覺得兄弟太小隻會不會跑來找我", "created_at": "2025-12-09T09:51:56", "owner": "chen91_0531", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087176347959850, "text": "他們分手的話你要判給誰？", "created_at": "2025-12-08T09:33:38", "owner": "changgg.0519", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18166662640383059, "text": "后来他们分了（真事", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:58:49", "owner": "lubutunfiltered", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010501820648395, "text": "然后你就可以享受一夫一妻？", "created_at": "2025-12-06T00:35:26", "owner": "williamsun3578", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087718144802986, "text": "所以這樣的兄弟哪裡找", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:08:58", "owner": "rc_drugo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100646191774692, "text": "@xun._0715 兄弟～", "created_at": "2025-12-04T12:06:57", "owner": "cedric._.0208", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849573805572648, "text": "@s1046305 @zychen2020 我也想當 Steve", "created_at": "2025-12-04T06:15:58", "owner": "vegetable_tsai_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086637688975325, "text": "？兄弟有对象就兄弟都不见了？哪里还有这些福利", "created_at": "2025-12-04T00:44:56", "owner": "lhq5520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855630019575211, "text": "嫁一個送一個😍", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:53:08", "owner": "isaokevin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18178811137321561, "text": "這個劇情，不是每個人都可以像王子", "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:28:57", "owner": "xu.boxun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122012341536798, "text": "我自己就是六邊形怎麼辦", "created_at": "2025-11-30T09:32:27", "owner": "hdyajay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18370579135081384, "text": "@allen_3166 @yccccc__12ii", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:28:10", "owner": "chayo.0703", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18365886829090553, "text": "@jiun_yii", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:41:06", "owner": "yao________yao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172235728370784, "text": "Steve", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:12:28", "owner": "the_hong_0514", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097302658871432, "text": "@hsiang.1225 你快去談一個", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:59:02", "owner": "credi_in_te_stesso__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18513491134069230, "text": "STEVE", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:16:52", "owner": "magus.tarot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049821905394803, "text": "身材不像是直的啊", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:01:04", "owner": "newman_chen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066094268568834, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:35:10", "owner": "pork_barry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051333593374460, "text": "@s_h_chen steve交一個吧", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:59:29", "owner": "pingk_0504", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036135548517847, "text": "@yrainy_1029 這是一個常見的類型", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:28:27", "owner": "kasim_9497", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099830104775119, "text": "這是把你當他們比較大的小孩帶吧", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:06:39", "owner": "garon0825", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086636998999063, "text": "防風？吹風機？", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:09:18", "owner": "yezhitian8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295841389287791, "text": "這不就是Steven嗎😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:09:25", "owner": "jianliang_1217", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932270353132857, "text": "@gino_jjw 可惜", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:12:16", "owner": "jontheji", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125421649502787, "text": "原來是Steve", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:09:33", "owner": "sherlock__hou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985940517876047, "text": "史蒂夫POV：", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:42:07", "owner": "daniel_liao_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320058502172909, "text": "我的兄弟只喜歡二次元怎麼辦？", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:56:44", "owner": "gwc_1215", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923088337049609, "text": "明明就是早早搬家", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:13:04", "owner": "chinagallop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915051832238723, "text": "主要是我的兄弟都談不上怎麼說", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:10:47", "owner": "_____o413.c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122548501525757, "text": "@zhiyang11.15 我也要", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:16:19", "owner": "e.nsott1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966226380838951, "text": "@hsien.623 你什麼時候要談戀愛", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:03:11", "owner": "yusean_13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084482684022163, "text": "@shinitai_34", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:52:47", "owner": "yang_shuwei2001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083024453024467, "text": "等等閨蜜那一段我怎麼都沒遇過😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:55:11", "owner": "sky8862", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158061469365169, "text": "@emit_fo_ecein_eht 我希望你著重實施後半段", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:12:45", "owner": "johnsoncg06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062427047192620, "text": "@justin__0818 @cp_0518 有看到重點嗎", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:28:40", "owner": "yongyi_1216", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171250045374804, "text": "嘟嘟嘟嚕嘟Steve", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:41:29", "owner": "adan_0217__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183542755344722, "text": "Steve！", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:34:48", "owner": "fuklingchu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935981914107526, "text": "你是不是叫史蒂夫？", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:47:52", "owner": "lin_yonie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899628538183907, "text": "一般來說不會叫他兄弟，要改叫義父", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:57:14", "owner": "dges6211", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846505393611497, "text": "成史蒂夫了", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:50:39", "owner": "xzx80084", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542647564002649, "text": "NTR", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:31:28", "owner": "venado_0410", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093199024908385, "text": "這現實嗎？你說的可是成都欸😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:34:46", "owner": "y_o_0618", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137992822417914, "text": "@joey081604 我還在等你", "created_at": "2025-11-26T04:01:24", "owner": "luhsinkai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935226916107229, "text": "卡給我朋友看", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:35:38", "owner": "marc93.9315", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865585420509675, "text": "根本早九灣十八拐了", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:16:05", "owner": "lunlu1001", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18075140153463996, "text": "如果兄弟的對象是個男的又如何呢？", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:09:13", "owner": "jan.charles.9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544607857062967, "text": "你們三個有點曖昧了喔🤭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:14:45", "owner": "st30_happy_boy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970638918992339, "text": "你兄弟住你隔壁房間半夜還會跟他對象一起在敲你牆壁", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:05:49", "owner": "xuan_373_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970675497969972, "text": "史蒂夫😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:29:01", "owner": "chenyingshan2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987990360856544, "text": "东莞女大", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:02:18", "owner": "zaidushengjiuqianqian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087789323312698, "text": "他兄弟 不像我兄弟 現在我是那個誰誰誰", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:55:06", "owner": "maxch_11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096440737866027, "text": "@chenenshi 嗯？", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:01:27", "owner": "linian.960406", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18386323765178588, "text": "@兄弟", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:20:47", "owner": "yoshuo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083944925482460, "text": "牛", "created_at": "2025-11-24T21:57:46", "owner": "jasonlza", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17900140218325693, "text": "@christian.c_118 @xiao_517_ @p.aaron98 @stanlee_ph 幹你們超廢的 我說真的", "created_at": "2025-11-24T19:26:02", "owner": "yen____chuan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030194057734042, "text": "@so1u7ion, @yujunwang_ 沒有啊 我沒感受到", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:56:31", "owner": "p_l_h_y_5028", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083133497281829, "text": "@jim94121 謝謝", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:12:34", "owner": "pan_ching_yan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331326259209885, "text": "@9iamaran4 @cwc____0330", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:38:21", "owner": "0313_sen", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3784192844911669181, "shortcode": "DSEJ1fKiO-9", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DSEJ1fKiO-9/", "taken_at": "2025-12-10T01:45:19", "caption": "🇲🇾🇬🇧我以为我是来上大学的 没想到是来做马劳的\n\n#留学生 #ukstudents🇬🇧 #vlog", "owner_username": "injoe0717", "owner_id": "5970983133", "likes": 2433, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0017_DSEJ1fKiO-9\\DSEJ1fKiO-9_20251210_014519.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": "18148083301432923", "text": "槟城王子到英国体验生活", "created_at": "2025-12-10T02:11:43", "owner": "jycher.91", "likes": 142}, {"id": "17895195804360285", "text": "兄弟 帮我打包过期的便当🍱", "created_at": "2025-12-10T02:03:52", "owner": "jn__lim", "likes": 24}, {"id": "18549697138027926", "text": "工作時還不忘記訓練真的很強🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-10T02:13:40", "owner": "coco_nut0906", "likes": 9}, {"id": "18552409795045518", "text": "發多一點 愛看", "created_at": "2025-12-10T03:28:40", "owner": "disheng12", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18088067170803033", "text": "reading的costcutters嗎！", "created_at": "2025-12-10T11:12:42", "owner": "mcdsavesmylife", "likes": 3}, {"id": "18046440920466507", "text": "那边的Water是怎么读的", "created_at": "2025-12-10T02:36:51", "owner": "yuhernooi_____", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17842605144649239", "text": "爱看 多拍", "created_at": "2025-12-10T03:14:51", "owner": "wenooiooi_", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18047002136694792", "text": "走的时候 不拿一罐水回去喝？", "created_at": "2025-12-10T03:24:50", "owner": "zwei_3", "likes": 1}, {"id": "17909596554265520", "text": "想看恶整顾客系列", "created_at": "2025-12-10T04:26:30", "owner": "__ansonnnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18137374201417856", "text": "好难得见到马来西亚学生在英国拍content", "created_at": "2025-12-11T20:29:38", "owner": "aliexmenwoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18114345802597952", "text": "不够看 多来点", "created_at": "2025-12-10T15:49:40", "owner": "chuen_heng", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17909115636280281", "text": "Reading?", "created_at": "2025-12-11T22:51:20", "owner": "jan.cheung_", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18102654121707620", "text": "這是在reading嗎", "created_at": "2025-12-11T12:59:44", "owner": "bitchhhhboi", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17845520016625036", "text": "Damn", "created_at": "2025-12-10T03:04:34", "owner": "issactrf", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18088744516809380", "text": "随时都有可能有生命危险😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T03:56:47", "owner": "tyoo.1314", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17929925571174016", "text": "U lowkey got the accent lmao", "created_at": "2025-12-11T14:04:58", "owner": "isaac_06.23", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17955977772019783", "text": "@jiawoeyyy 他很好笑咯😂", "created_at": "2025-12-13T06:13:10", "owner": "wenle15", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["留学生", "ukstudents", "vlog"]},
{"media_id": 3784759446794836583, "shortcode": "DSGKqoSgppn", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DSGKqoSgppn/", "taken_at": "2025-12-10T20:28:26", "caption": "Calling all University of Sheffield students!\n\nDo you enjoy editing videos for fun, but also find yourself driven by a purpose to help social enterprises uplift communities in Sheffield?\n\nIntrigued to have a firsthand insight into what it takes to run the Sheffield branch of the world’s largest student-led social impact consultancy?\n\nWell, look no further and seize this chance to be a part of our Executive Team now by becoming a Multimedia Manager!\n\nApply now via the Linktree in our link in bio.\n\n#180DegreesConsulting #180dcsheffield #SocialImpact", "owner_username": "180dcsheffield", "owner_id": "68775707944", "likes": 10, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphSidecar", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0018_DSGKqoSgppn\\DSGKqoSgppn_20251210_202826_1.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0018_DSGKqoSgppn\\DSGKqoSgppn_20251210_202826_2.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0018_DSGKqoSgppn\\DSGKqoSgppn_20251210_202826_3.jpg"}], "comments": [], "location": null, "hashtags": ["180degreesconsulting", "180dcsheffield", "socialimpact"]},
