{"media_id": 3662932281514791225, "shortcode": "DLVWYDEABE5", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DLVWYDEABE5/", "taken_at": "2025-06-25T18:20:04", "caption": "Thermite tricks #r6 #rainbowsixsiege #rainbow6siege", "owner_username": "schizosiege", "owner_id": "60096969701", "likes": 55686, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0020_DLVWYDEABE5\\DLVWYDEABE5_20250625_182004.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17908825011206160, "text": "Guyss which game is this? I always watched this game like 2,3 years ago. And wished to play it now i wanna play", "created_at": "2025-08-18T05:50:12", "owner": "sparshnap1t", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18515260783048569, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-27T21:39:39", "owner": "trapperuzi", "likes": 449}, {"id": 18124707490406760, "text": "I always chuckle a bit when I blow someone’s mind by using a thermite on the ceiling and breaking reinforcement", "created_at": "2025-06-26T17:53:54", "owner": "im_hayhoe", "likes": 217}, {"id": 18058052390522093, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-27T08:01:22", "owner": "mondaymorningscotch", "likes": 20}, {"id": 17970054476874430, "text": "Use Fuze with this and they’ll have to run before they can break the charge from below", "created_at": "2025-06-29T02:59:23", "owner": "applebyhayden", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18067855739023693, "text": "I’ve been doing this for a years now😭. My strat is ruined", "created_at": "2025-06-25T20:09:35", "owner": "alessio.gonzalez", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18064853645130479, "text": "do people not know they can shoot the thermite charges through the floor board 😭", "created_at": "2025-06-26T21:21:55", "owner": "vxmpirebby", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18070210355486088, "text": "This is Super helpful thanks!", "created_at": "2025-06-25T19:10:38", "owner": "jamison_beshears", "likes": 23}, {"id": 18060081722075033, "text": "You can pair that theme park one up with a flash bang in the drone hole and flash anyone in the room before swinging", "created_at": "2025-08-16T13:47:26", "owner": "krxyz_0wen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18032661662666830, "text": "I love siege but this kinda knowledge imo is so situational that it's never actually useful to try and memorize this kinda stuff over improving your game sense", "created_at": "2025-07-06T06:17:10", "owner": "altruisticgoofball", "likes": 327}, {"id": 18068901017017373, "text": "Tame impala slaps", "created_at": "2025-07-04T16:23:19", "owner": "flip_skylark", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18052842968105919, "text": "Bout to try these later on stream and prolly die tryna do them over n over", "created_at": "2025-06-25T19:16:26", "owner": "mk3.smittyyy", "likes": 59}, {"id": 17957094971989897, "text": "Number 3 on Oregon only works if your opponents are incompetent and don’t shoot your feet out", "created_at": "2025-09-20T13:50:27", "owner": "thulean.guerrilla", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17967253136793833, "text": "Everyone above plastic 4 knows this", "created_at": "2025-08-22T09:38:36", "owner": "el.bilalakhtar", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17898071916229941, "text": "2015 start", "created_at": "2025-06-25T19:20:20", "owner": "zvbir_v", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17915012076153789, "text": "5/10 I had the most disgusting ranked match with that strat they invited me to a party and were cussing me tf out best night ever they hated my hidden Mira c4 strat too 💀💀", "created_at": "2025-08-05T00:00:20", "owner": "elwikenxo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048008342391514, "text": "@maro_1137 thermite main👀", "created_at": "2025-11-14T03:37:29", "owner": "xakhundx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082314590045179, "text": "Ancient tech,", "created_at": "2025-11-09T17:16:43", "owner": "mzchxel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965317485988560, "text": "How do you look at your gun like that????", "created_at": "2025-11-08T17:32:00", "owner": "johnnyboy45235", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078292073119208, "text": "@sparshnap1t what about now", "created_at": "2025-11-03T22:10:22", "owner": "aztekian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004191347815500, "text": "this is so old man", "created_at": "2025-10-26T14:21:14", "owner": "_gabb22_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098872309564665, "text": "literally everyone knows about these but thanks", "created_at": "2025-09-28T15:00:53", "owner": "dyl.fedrman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18526284046043128, "text": "3rd is absolute shit", "created_at": "2025-09-28T14:28:13", "owner": "lori.rubagotti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18385564978126569, "text": "@_joao_paulo_crvg @arthurhenrick1722 @", "created_at": "2025-09-23T20:50:28", "owner": "daviguedesfragoso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128237479472513, "text": "R6 movie", "created_at": "2025-09-20T06:24:45", "owner": "beauloo.tsmftx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883612450373353, "text": "Hice el de Litoral pero no m dejaba saltar", "created_at": "2025-09-19T02:05:01", "owner": "victor_kenway128", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065204927586319, "text": "u can counter a few of these the last one the easiest counter is just shotgunning the wall", "created_at": "2025-09-15T12:01:14", "owner": "kujooy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075984524082984, "text": "I Final killcam someone with that first thermite trick🤣", "created_at": "2025-09-10T10:23:04", "owner": "drummer__ld", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019485071562606, "text": "@joseph_aldazabal", "created_at": "2025-08-29T08:58:43", "owner": "w6ter._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096231757726950, "text": "Been known this sense this beautiful map when it came out", "created_at": "2025-08-28T04:44:53", "owner": "boredom_findz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891867139318701, "text": "If you shotgun the top of the wall before reinforcing it makes these much harder to accomplish as the defender. Just a FYI", "created_at": "2025-08-26T20:26:08", "owner": "121cky93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905271553225794, "text": "I like thermite tricks", "created_at": "2025-08-15T19:49:02", "owner": "jorkles_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052837805404133, "text": "if you dont know that you aint higher than plat", "created_at": "2025-08-11T09:37:02", "owner": "eliaspointinger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067159237923696, "text": "Follow me guys 🙏🏽🙏🏽🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-08-06T14:08:21", "owner": "chevyx__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045087812628531, "text": "Usually you would pop holes in the ceiling where the thermites were there, and with an optimal vertical setup none of those would work.", "created_at": "2025-07-21T13:54:02", "owner": "ilahsan4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085831822783395, "text": "Not pl but okay", "created_at": "2025-07-21T09:36:55", "owner": "onetwothre67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959092722811008, "text": "@victor_mribeiro", "created_at": "2025-07-15T16:53:36", "owner": "cesarr.augusto_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017102600740796, "text": "Yeah but this is 2025 thermites banned 24/7", "created_at": "2025-07-15T10:53:28", "owner": "0cap.4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853749781438441, "text": "@daniel_yuuy", "created_at": "2025-07-12T17:07:02", "owner": "mufattoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937638267920466, "text": "Some year y1s1 tech absolutely nobody knows because the OGs long since quit 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-11T16:21:18", "owner": "profonics", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18280335445257603, "text": "@13_colejackson, @dasejesad", "created_at": "2025-07-11T06:45:38", "owner": "drake.t02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130810738434943, "text": "Old tech lmao", "created_at": "2025-07-11T03:33:25", "owner": "fart_balls95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076902475737185, "text": "The Oregon one must be oldest one known to man 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-10T15:21:41", "owner": "_coreywesley_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071511889994172, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-09T10:08:36", "owner": "phanttomphanttomphanttom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984985941835269, "text": "grass is green ahh post", "created_at": "2025-07-06T23:52:19", "owner": "a9serpent", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051625388140665, "text": "Yes", "created_at": "2025-07-06T22:07:37", "owner": "officially_joel_422", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071715104004062, "text": "gng these tricks are nearly 8 years old each", "created_at": "2025-07-04T15:21:32", "owner": "vibescaliber", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071676241971855, "text": "Coastline is not in pro league", "created_at": "2025-07-02T01:34:36", "owner": "mh.hooti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18394658920141958, "text": "Why I prefer him over all the other opps but I mean as long as thatcher and twitch aint band you can pretty much use whatever", "created_at": "2025-06-30T17:22:26", "owner": "jesusismyspotter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061483207969037, "text": "Cant do anything this techy in bronze cuz my whole teams dead before I could even place the thermite", "created_at": "2025-06-28T10:36:12", "owner": "archercus_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071080666971485, "text": "Just won the skin on the marketplace prize game so I‘ll be playing thermite a lot more thanks", "created_at": "2025-06-28T09:33:43", "owner": "nevio_678", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901927288208381, "text": "They should reprogram that", "created_at": "2025-06-27T20:32:26", "owner": "_alino_costa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954415731971042, "text": "Know all of these but thanks for the reminder gonna hop back on therm", "created_at": "2025-06-27T15:55:01", "owner": "favourak17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875153056261960, "text": "Hold on a second. I can just place the thermite on the ground in front of a reinforced wall???", "created_at": "2025-06-27T04:28:43", "owner": "nnmikee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064054267897809, "text": "Clubhouse one is useless nobody ever uses it on logi when it can be used better on con wall", "created_at": "2025-06-27T03:38:37", "owner": "shesimp4gio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050854271423026, "text": "@samiam.2007 it’s you", "created_at": "2025-06-26T23:13:19", "owner": "jtrabo11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911890201080735, "text": "I hate to tell all y’all but if this is y’all’s pro strats it shows why half of r6 is slow asl", "created_at": "2025-06-26T03:21:27", "owner": "6drose05", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["r6", "rainbowsixsiege", "rainbow6siege"]},
{"media_id": 3773655444456515535, "shortcode": "DRet6IPjKfP", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRet6IPjKfP/", "taken_at": "2025-11-25T12:47:32", "caption": "Watch till the end 💀\n\n#csgo #counterstrike #cs2 #cs2moments #cs", "owner_username": "cs2guy_", "owner_id": "74453983623", "likes": 88166, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0021_DRet6IPjKfP\\DRet6IPjKfP_20251125_124732.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17953686678044878, "text": "Yeeeees yesssss yeeees yeeessss🗣️", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:34:40", "owner": "wzx_nobody", "likes": 16065}, {"id": 18066455705139131, "text": "Why do Russian players always have a loud and noisy mic dawg😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:26:10", "owner": "nul_is_fading", "likes": 1982}, {"id": 18113830132517635, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:21:27", "owner": "thomas.reed01", "likes": 4629}, {"id": 17885220507283576, "text": "That's Russian Motivation speech i love it!🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:03:51", "owner": "yukafisu_", "likes": 1457}, {"id": 18060156872640186, "text": "\"yeee yeeee yeeee yeees yeeees yeeeees🥹\" 😂😂😂😂 fk that shit😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T08:42:07", "owner": "7.7.7n30", "likes": 387}, {"id": 18085499575828797, "text": "Yaa yaaa yaaa yaaaaa😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:28:10", "owner": "mr.__mounir", "likes": 2754}, {"id": 18072259631036366, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:55:10", "owner": "orozbaevv.b", "likes": 9228}, {"id": 17966758728003615, "text": "That guy with yeaah yeaahh is definitely the one on the right 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:24:04", "owner": "gator.630", "likes": 1161}, {"id": 18088828954768285, "text": "Yaay.....", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:35:09", "owner": "kri_ssnnaa", "likes": 128}, {"id": 18155921479414743, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:33:19", "owner": "xd0000001001", "likes": 384}, {"id": 18088014692298809, "text": "Смею предположить что наши джентельмены хотели так выразить свое уважение и дружелюбие 🎩", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:57:13", "owner": "matsuirenn", "likes": 125}, {"id": 18086086721006936, "text": "В КС и доте, лучшее камюнити это Русское❤️😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T12:24:02", "owner": "asker_king92", "likes": 87}, {"id": 18543534451006456, "text": "Yeeeees yeeees yeeeea😭🗣️🗣️🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:21:51", "owner": "rasictgoodguy", "likes": 1370}, {"id": 17899290081341046, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T11:14:55", "owner": "faridfahrz4", "likes": 278}, {"id": 18135130927477344, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:52:47", "owner": "2_novan", "likes": 111}, {"id": 18051812981370848, "text": "Самый спокойный игрок из России", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:49:34", "owner": "riesenvl", "likes": 314}, {"id": 18065652803429306, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T12:03:20", "owner": "demondays123", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18100331074788788, "text": "Как он смачно это сказал", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:22:10", "owner": "tumyp_egrok", "likes": 1285}, {"id": 17978898521941327, "text": "What did he say? It's good for dealing with debtors 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:02:30", "owner": "peltod.co.ltd", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17847658965610021, "text": "That girl have to wait until the end of the match to use voice chat", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:54:00", "owner": "cyan_texture", "likes": 56}, {"id": 18077109163976839, "text": "They also win this game , imagine if they lose", "created_at": "2025-12-05T14:39:36", "owner": "xalmgud_yralan", "likes": 20}, {"id": 18004320896819944, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T06:36:10", "owner": "poise_breaker_", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18072007889348164, "text": "Это они ещё выиграли)", "created_at": "2025-12-02T09:46:47", "owner": "azat_gocmedow", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18067271285431685, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:29:34", "owner": "bro_cooked_", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18084319148046245, "text": "😍👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-03T08:40:11", "owner": "zikakutur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18498857407074808, "text": "😂😂😂😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:03:46", "owner": "dhanesh_m0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18135570616481402, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:11:37", "owner": "zdj.18_", "likes": 30}, {"id": 18109544797559297, "text": "Pashui nahui", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:32:29", "owner": "subhankar._.xd", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18114248728586764, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:36:17", "owner": "ahwidirhwbrwm3", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17880158544428561, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:03:32", "owner": "rickztata", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18434151475107556, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T15:41:23", "owner": "longhuynh02082012", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18349475632202251, "text": "Most polite russian", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:45:36", "owner": "rick__marinaro", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17974882988956351, "text": "И это они еще выиграли", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:20:55", "owner": "darkkluuna", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17970581444970996, "text": "ахахахахахаха", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:52:33", "owner": "iits_karlo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031483961738495, "text": "Mother's dead 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:24:47", "owner": "sadra_hf_22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063923063414328, "text": "Это они ещё выиграли", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:57:08", "owner": "yatsutko.m", "likes": 1318}, {"id": 18123749758521005, "text": "What's \"poshli nahui\" means ?", "created_at": "2025-12-02T11:30:58", "owner": "kf_rahmane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543257782061973, "text": "Cod lobbies", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:21:54", "owner": "spiderman77i", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17845278927616328, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:18:57", "owner": "oras_l2s", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18031330727550762, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-13T15:41:24", "owner": "lepak4372", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121963873536622, "text": "Dikssss", "created_at": "2025-12-13T15:31:59", "owner": "___calmo___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051390833390172