, "created_at": "2025-12-02T08:02:50", "owner": "mr_freaky214", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027616997768545, "text": "И это они ещё победили 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T07:49:54", "owner": "igor_shidlovsky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097137676869709, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T07:48:28", "owner": "fler.98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992170890727957, "text": "Everything I know is Blyaatt 😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:44:07", "owner": "arpan.psd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905654473283766, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:10:22", "owner": "sayhoytoleotolstoy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088180382295774, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:17:58", "owner": "gryphon_123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085653379994226, "text": "That's the problem of being multilingual", "created_at": "2025-12-01T20:58:14", "owner": "darkness_forever_my_style", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037582781715936, "text": "what blyat’s mean?", "created_at": "2025-12-01T20:53:53", "owner": "mohammad._.4001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096629053881894, "text": "Men☕", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:37:57", "owner": "azarmanesh.l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877985734438856, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:23:53", "owner": "afif.nou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078122525179399, "text": "Pidras mean gay!!", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:18:51", "owner": "8_gnng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18432928705106922, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:11:37", "owner": "lv7r_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18194532808333421, "text": "Blyaaat", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:35:47", "owner": "dangrious93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540803362029573, "text": "😮😮", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:21:43", "owner": "spiderman77i", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052497707661052, "text": "How to break russian cs2 player\n\n1. Play more useless than them\n\n2. The louder guy is right\n\n3. Speak when they speak\n\n4. GG they are tilted now", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:03:58", "owner": "morris_acc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088307857947777, "text":