955351645009147, "text": "that has to be the smallest bikini i’ve ever seen, that’s at max holding one lip", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:46:15", "owner": "cornonthe.kobb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142275181442845, "text": "@ayariizki ts never dissolving 😔 i’ll do better", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:44:09", "owner": "imakequietlovesongs", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18311130013180246, "text": "nutupin ap? sehelai jump boat?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:24:48", "owner": "ciyupie6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876315241353343, "text": "Perfect product. Genius design. No notes", "created_at": "2025-11-24T09:39:14", "owner": "sregexer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18327603994209555, "text": "@iamcardib", "created_at": "2025-11-24T08:46:15", "owner": "jai__2006_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085643444050850, "text": "@badgal.hailey", "created_at": "2025-11-24T08:43:40", "owner": "jai__2006_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969355071971638, "text": "@kimkardashian", "created_at": "2025-11-24T08:43:26", "owner": "jai__2006_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883049494409005, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:37:56", "owner": "hezzz484", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071009357365369, "text": "Perfect for the winter", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:16:37", "owner": "monicathehuman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865645336508762, "text": "\"it's just a prank!\"", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:25:19", "owner": "alexapleasepickarandomusername", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027753392567542, "text": "That means it’s working 👏", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:15:33", "owner": "mhidday", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17866374921498104, "text": "gelatin-kini", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:09:09", "owner": "burning_sky_falling_water", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901668145315963, "text": "My man can look at me too hard and those panties will be GONE 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:19:39", "owner": "faithann_2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086711278817837, "text": "so if someone wear this and goes to swim, it'll dissolve?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:40:03", "owner": "yo