, "likes": 0}, {"id": 18549830587003024, "text": "Oui", "created_at": "2025-11-23T02:34:57", "owner": "johanna_vly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109004074533835, "text": "Ok so it’s only gonna last like two minutes after seeing my man…", "created_at": "2025-11-23T02:24:55", "owner": "sluttyterps", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929561443118295, "text": "tendernism", "created_at": "2025-11-23T02:20:55", "owner": "sailorr", "likes": 511}, {"id": 18074368046263017, "text": "TENDERNISM🥹", "created_at": "2025-11-23T01:40:12", "owner": "shields.pl_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120827992542040, "text": "there's not much to dissolve... but I guess it gives some sort of fantasy", "created_at": "2025-11-23T01:19:39", "owner": "scaredycata", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920657332196676, "text": "Perfect swimsuit for my summer activities", "created_at": "2025-11-23T01:03:33", "owner": "_etaylor_", "likes": 91}, {"id": 18110999167606069, "text": "it would never stay on", "created_at": "2025-11-23T00:09:28", "owner": "dumbbitch6.9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914768005229535, "text": "Would this stick to my bush?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T23:47:20", "owner": "turdzgalore", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088576199302950, "text": "Art", "created_at": "2025-11-22T23:20:23", "owner": "nohya_lingerie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059983883547606, "text": "So it's just normal underwear for me then.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T22:45:59", "owner": "jevil_a_day_keeps_me_okay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048663308682422, "text": "Umh… are you guys not sweating? I’ll lost them in 10 minutes", "created_at": "2025-11-22T22:31:38", "owner": "dariga.aska", "likes": 4378}, {"id": 17987816918750433, "text": "will these come in smaller sizes? :/", "created_at": "2025-11-22T22:27:10", "owner": "aricolosimo", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18073921991252061, "text": "Fucks the point then", "created_at": "2025-11-22T22:24:35", "owner": "kenzi_korenic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025921745772639, "text": "most of my closet i only wear once anyways lemme have it", "c