, "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:10:05", "owner": "noell_wl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059549348641621, "text": "verrückt", "created_at": "2025-12-11T14:10:04", "owner": "nixistgratis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088617910809194, "text": "slay baddie", "created_at": "2025-12-09T22:40:32", "owner": "laana.grc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844133143626018, "text": "mutter 🤌", "created_at": "2025-12-09T19:31:42", "owner": "sphallulalia", "likes": 2}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3759761623973211814, "shortcode": "DQtW0blEa6m", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DQtW0blEa6m/", "taken_at": "2025-11-06T08:42:44", "caption": "把手指放在圖片中間，分別遮住另一半顏色進行簡單對比~自測冷暖皮！", "owner_username": "0003syklmuoi835", "owner_id": "75653611170", "likes": 60768, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0030_DQtW0blEa6m\\DQtW0blEa6m_20251106_084244.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18318738286168613, "text": "忽冷忽熱的 是算調皮嗎", "created_at": "2025-11-08T02:17:58", "owner": "0309___owo", "likes": 11194}, {"id": 18073518317518416, "text": "都很黑怎解", "created_at": "2025-11-06T09:13:43", "owner": "yiziyu88", "likes": 9190}, {"id": 18066584468103818, "text": "黑皮怎麼辦？", "created_at": "2025-11-07T10:53:19", "owner": "hk.13_0103", "likes": 14}, {"id": 17864102814503334, "text": "建議比耶", "created_at": "2025-11-07T09:33:05", "owner": "yeonjun._gm0923", "likes": 772}, {"id": 18081526532041515, "text": "明明測了是冷皮，但我很明顯就是很黑◉⁠‿⁠◉", "created_at": "2025-11-08T10:31:31", "owner": "yv9_yu", "likes": 64}, {"id": 17891955357360759, "text": "看不出的我：", "created_at": "2025-11-07T02:30:24", "owner": "venus_08283", "likes": 5232}, {"id": 17922572865190318, "text": "關著燈刷到的我：", "created_at": "2025-11-07T19:29:56", "owner": "c2him", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18068569595365659, "text": "我覺得深藍色不管怎麼樣都很顯白🆘🆘", "created_at": "2025-11-06T08:47:15", "owner": "fish._.ono", "likes": 179}, {"id": 18536338225047658, "text": "我都很黑的是黑皮嗎🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-06T10:09:43", "owner": "ling.00.ling", "likes": 64}, {"id": 18054106373647958, "text": "之前跟著別人測試以為自己是暖皮😂結果是冷皮是怎樣", "created_at": "2025-11-09T04:47:50", "owner": "tong_5.2.0", "likes": 32}, {"id": 17990336765887398, "text": "沒看出差別", "created_at": "2025-11-07T03:29:31", "owner": "jk.36178", "likes": 535}, {"id": 18396714613122523, "text": "靠腰我一直以為我是暖皮結果我是白皮啊！？", "created_at": "2025-11-19T23:31:26", "owner": "xieli_nglong9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081849728107414, "text": "真的不會看。。救命啊。", "created_at": "2025-11-07T03:16:39", "owner": "cjy._.57", "likes": 51}, {"id": 18078325433029042, "text": "冷皮😗", "created_at": "2025-11-07T08:56:32", "owner": "chiao._.jjjj_oooo", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18106654219541327, "text": "我兩邊都看起來很黃👀💔", "created_at": "2025-11-10T02:16:32", "owner": "sophialan0408", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080947112082496, "text": "都很黑", "created_at": "2025-11-08T02:19:09", "owner": "mani_co_lo.co", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17989257725886834, "text": "都很黑……", "created_at": "2025-11-14T09:58:50", "owner": "jing._.0522", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17926681002173742, "text": "好，那我是冷黑皮。", "created_at": "2025-12-01T12:56:40", "owner": "sylvara.8274", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18012516146797100, "text": "忽冷忽暖 眼睛也一閃一閃的", "created_at": "2025-11-10T13:01:32", "owner": "shu.39_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18496693621072101, "text": "冷!!!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-23T06:49:44", "owner": "hannah.103216", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066649943434790, "text": "我看不出來😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:12:00", "owner": "aileenlollol", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18005280848811170, "text": "我是冷冷暖冷皮", "created_at": "2025-11-07T04:06:06", "owner": "chung_man_ching4", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17997985517752047, "text": "我有时是冷皮有时暖皮 我懂了 我是凉皮", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:08:34", "owner": "wuyan4446", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18082368728029210, "text": "我一直以為我是黃黑皮", "created_at": "2025-11-23T06:50:02", "owner": "hannah.103216", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098666980741697, "text": "放中間兩邊都很黑——————>", "created_at": "2025-11-07T09:55:43", "owner": "tartaglia.0720912", "likes": 1318}, {"id": 18063308033159473, "text": "一下冷一下暖是怎樣😍", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:02:37", "owner": "kch._._", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083705447077239, "text": "我都很黑👍🏿", "created_at": "2025-11-10T13:53:17", "owner": "linzichen1029", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076420991468416, "text": "一下 冷皮，一下 暖皮。。。怎么搞（橄榄皮的痛哭）", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:24:08", "owner": "pehyeesiew", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18537789274021834, "text": "白色最亮怎么解🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-07T11:28:05", "owner": "cait_002", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18085961107830906, "text": "谁会冷皮", "created_at": "2025-12-08T13:13:36", "owner": "qiaoxin_0219", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17925777549038296, "text": "冷皮", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:20:01", "owner": "lypinjia", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18144371950437158, "text": "我就這麼黑 我難道看不出來我冷皮還是暖皮嗎🤡", "created_at": "2025-11-07T11:23:02", "owner": "7_.yuuuu", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17895644553205238, "text": "用螢幕不會準", "created_at": "2025-11-12T22:49:40", "owner": "pj182810", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18086840197770316, "text": "關燈偷玩手機的...", "created_at": "2025-11-11T09:46:27", "owner": "a3161409", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083350148084877, "text": "我以為我是暖皮 結果是冷皮", "created_at": "2025-11-08T07:13:14", "owner": "ll_.817", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18093465328879573, "text": "可能要先治自己的眼睛了…", "created_at": "2025-11-13T06:30:20", "owner": "lucid.psycho", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17908993416258610, "text": "放兩邊都白", "created_at": "2025-11-07T11:50:45", "owner": "fnsmile_123", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18084868045812871, "text": "如果看不出那就是黑皮New Year", "created_at": "2025-11-07T12:54:27", "owner": "o_0922", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133423360461894, "text": "我感覺差不多", "created_at": "2025-11-08T06:43:32", "owner": "lorna_00__323", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079575353280068, "text": "放的不一定要手指🤫", "created_at": "2025-11-08T02:07:05", "owner": "3861noname", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18082913960107796, "text": "都是黑的", "created_at": "2025-11-09T05:50:38", "owner": "mochi855_5", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070113092035445, "text": "眼 ㄆㄧㄚˊ 不會看:D怎解？", "created_at": "2025-11-06T13:26:11", "owner": "zc_216", "likes": 31}, {"id": 18047940734393478, "text": "求解", "created_at": "2025-11-07T04:43:56", "owner": "wa_ywl", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18098812951750025, "text": "建議放手腕，看得比較清楚🥸🤏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-07T14:53:06", "owner": "aq_zhy97777", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095342419837111, "text": "都一樣黑😂", "created_at": "2025-11-07T07:15:22", "owner": "haha.1020514", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071757059250214, "text": "我是黑人 都好黑怎么办🌚", "created_at": "2025-11-08T06:45:53", "owner": "tongzhenyue", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17908030278256742, "text": "一樣黑試過沒有用：）", "created_at": "2025-11-07T05:47:01", "owner": "o_o.ru", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17884045296281282, "text": "冷皮", "created_at": "2025-11-08T05:27:33", "owner": "ennnnn_0923", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17914294908228746, "text": "冷白皮👏", "created_at": "2025-11-06T11:57:47", "owner": "lijiaqin987", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17916222669210578, "text": "冷", "created_at": "2025-11-07T03:00:04", "owner": "euniceeng1101", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18419488822116035, "text": "都很黑餒", "created_at": "2025-11-07T16:16:28", "owner": "va20160928", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18119495641538862, "text": "越來越黑怎麼辦", "created_at": "2025-11-07T10:50:56", "owner": "wwo._san", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074386751191205, "text": "我是黑皮", "created_at": "2025-11-06T08:48:45", "owner": "haixx_instgram", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17920409727211604, "text": "都很黑", "created_at": "2025-12-11T14:50:08", "owner": "akabane_kaya_9756", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890150065258087, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T08:20:13", "owner": "lk_k.un", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106764148570353, "text": "两边都白", "created_at": "2025-12-11T04:57:42", "owner": "14_09050", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988871478910419, "text": "上下下上", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:41:12", "owner": "linchinchiz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084449744283051, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T13:16:43", "owner": "roychenchen1989", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102261004705596, "text": "冷", "created_at": "2025-12-08T11:42:10", "owner": "riuc08221104", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088258744807222, "text": "一样黑怎么办ಥ⁠‿⁠ಥ", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:49:27", "owner": "fhidiwhdhf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128766589503263, "text": "我是冷皮", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:52:50", "owner": "2htw_625", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069791453096556, "text": "冷皮🤡", "created_at": "2025-12-06T08:56:15", "owner": "xsq._.0606", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842670859637781, "text": "冷皮", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:34:44", "owner": "tzuno", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075852779213762, "text": "不會看😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T18:01:25", "owner": "chawanzhen5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992073450897582, "text": "冷皮？", "created_at": "2025-12-05T16:09:06", "owner": "togetherr888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100293079693690, "text": "我冷白耶！", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:24:09", "owner": "nyx_kozakana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109972132613207, "text": "欸可是我有時候黑有時候白捏 亂皮", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:59:31", "owner": "yen_yen_fu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058373165302810, "text": "冷黃皮：）", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:50:30", "owner": "wenny0717", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114398860511708, "text": "旁邊黑中間白😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T05:51:00", "owner": "y7efif_wang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085369919046565, "text": "都很白怎麼辦 小白臉？", "created_at": "2025-12-01T10:51:21", "owner": "king_panda_0726", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934483078102486, "text": "深夜滑手機的我belike:⬛️", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:30:20", "owner": "ling_03.17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968239161988114, "text": "看不出來怎麼辦？", "created_at": "2025-11-30T13:00:06", "owner": "astird611", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101553586784295, "text": "我臉暖手冷，一直以來臉和其他地方色差都很重", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:50:05", "owner": "0301oda_nobunaga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985593777919319, "text": "冷皮欸(◐‿◑)�", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:32:19", "owner": "xinbao1889", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081600599110037, "text": "冷皮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:26:10", "owner": "12_.6117", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858349984557291, "text": "都黑怎麼辦", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:03:49", "owner": "kangaroo.786506", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060474317252563, "text": "我居然是冷皮ʘ⁠‿⁠ʘ？？", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:04:38", "owner": "cyx._.0827", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859828591552405, "text": "都一样😑", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:54:58", "owner": "nini_ang12269", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917248828216977, "text": "我自己覺得暖色顯白", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:56:47", "owner": "tongxinyan90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955192822012773, "text": "感覺我已經是熱皮了，不管怎樣都是黑的", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:06:32", "owner": "_wyl_lala", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095092939847181, "text": "冷皮——————>", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:10:51", "owner": "cengcenghuifeng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18151547104424019, "text": "我这么黑是冷皮什么鬼", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:38:14", "owner": "weilan080727", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172582123375249, "text": "謝謝我手都好黑", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:13:27", "owner": "fxxkyeah._.1968341", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080878799323271, "text": "都黑算什麼", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:57:14", "owner": "bella520479", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109901932715816, "text": "如果忽冷忽熱的灑脫 是你要的自由（？", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:00:13", "owner": "lifengshun85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083252702026617, "text": "我是黑人吧💩", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:50:05", "owner": "kaini5566", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056296115650333, "text": "重点是你手指放的位子 会点赞", "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:23:39", "owner": "sheng121118", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069335921615134, "text": "看不出來的我:", "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:20:27", "owner": "20km_jason", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900594859319355, "text": "耶✌️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:07:55", "owner": "huangjiaxuan6971", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085851010954048, "text": "冷皮", "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:07:47", "owner": "huangjiaxuan6971", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18382123270146692, "text": "怎麼放都一樣", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:28:41", "owner": "aini._.1126", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079795346175835, "text": "都不显白是怎么回事呢", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:24:00", "owner": "dong363370", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18510798496069669, "text": "我只看到色調與字體，看不出皮膚適合啥顏色哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-25T00:19:04", "owner": "17apollus.selene20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048277415435839, "text": "黑皮😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:04:25", "owner": "love_740307", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095867059880474, "text": "結果發現背光所以都很黑_(:_」∠)_", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:16:48", "owner": "ting86tw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100713853670573, "text": "測完是黑皮有解嗎", "created_at": "2025-11-21T13:32:24", "owner": "a83227", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094480552893382, "text": "那麼冷暖之間的會漸變色嗎？（X", "created_at": "2025-11-20T14:23:39", "owner": "zingshum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096070591870783, "text": "什麼是冷暖皮", "created_at": "2025-11-20T14:23:20", "owner": "zingshum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18345339925236918, "text": "全都很黑 怎麼辦", "created_at": "2025-11-20T07:16:29", "owner": "winkyy_ii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036050912719881, "text": "半夜滑手機的我：手指頭是黑色的😢", "created_at": "2025-11-19T18:48:51", "owner": "tianxizhi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972369699809774, "text": "各放一個可以對比那個黑❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-19T15:53:24", "owner": "kasina9311", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103293691648937, "text": "冷皮（記得調亮度", "created_at": "2025-11-19T07:35:22", "owner": "ruoyu._2322", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046673792680054, "text": "你猜猜我放什麼上去😋", "created_at": "2025-11-18T09:59:23", "owner": "haavk_lin._df", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086549276487862, "text": "都很黑的去哪裡換皮", "created_at": "2025-11-18T09:19:47", "owner": "alpaca_0329", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924902092036760, "text": "又冷又暖", "created_at": "2025-11-18T04:49:04", "owner": "ccl_.1419", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886476877396996, "text": "都很白怎麼辦", "created_at": "2025-11-17T11:13:19", "owner": "cc_.1015_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067898432089450, "text": "請不要放手指以外的部分", "created_at": "2025-11-17T11:12:20", "owner": "jirming_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933556243104475, "text": "檸檬黃要確定耶", "created_at": "2025-11-17T08:26:10", "owner": "39.saya__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958015879007991, "text": "我冷皮", "created_at": "2025-11-17T03:24:36", "owner": "asa10_16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18534289522014151, "text": "躺著滑手機原本以為是上面顯白，手機轉過來後發現他媽的室內燈光就在上面照", "created_at": "2025-11-16T17:43:30", "owner": "huuu_lan_tao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006161102818417, "text": "超讚👍🏻原本還在遮來遮去比較", "created_at": "2025-11-16T16:36:14", "owner": "hinanokolei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18245042011291591, "text": "怎麼說呢 我好像那黑人似的", "created_at": "2025-11-16T13:37:12", "owner": "lucas10240727", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18488631370078912, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-16T06:25:34", "owner": "yan_wei_zhang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868321201472950, "text": "原來我是冷皮", "created_at": "2025-11-16T03:41:57", "owner": "21kair_ikiru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901313758300370, "text": "騷皮怎麼辦", "created_at": "2025-11-15T14:43:19", "owner": "c_k_en456", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048097310411086, "text": "看不出来，怎么看？", "created_at": "2025-11-15T11:15:01", "owner": "nanaso121005", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077365925332324, "text": "放中間是要怎麼比啦", "created_at": "2025-11-15T11:14:19", "owner": "mingshuliao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072401933027129, "text": "不懂怎看？_？", "created_at": "2025-11-15T06:09:22", "owner": "3________145pop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927910171144871, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-15T04:26:11", "owner": "zkom._.x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098155168692773, "text": "黄皮", "created_at": "2025-11-15T02:37:08", "owner": "yongchingwing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050449901354835, "text": "我很確定顯白的那邊\n光線比較好", "created_at": "2025-11-15T01:15:28", "owner": "owen03_01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18163775965377807, "text": "懂了\n我是黑皮", "created_at": "2025-11-14T23:39:33", "owner": "rita8chang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958382359010122, "text": "为什么都是黑的", "created_at": "2025-11-14T20:34:23", "owner": "oydg.dk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972062430800102, "text": "都一樣", "created_at": "2025-11-14T19:44:31", "owner": "_snow.540", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082205729015124, "text": "這就當遊戲就好....不用太認真😂", "created_at": "2025-11-14T19:02:32", "owner": "sis.image.style", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18346847944205415, "text": "我黑皮", "created_at": "2025-11-14T14:49:39", "owner": "1020_tsai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864351118509534, "text": "冷皮ㄟ", "created_at": "2025-11-14T13:20:40", "owner": "lxp_1023520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082818002094448, "text": "冷皮", "created_at": "2025-11-14T11:00:41", "owner": "25.9067902", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987376458910493, "text": "冷皮的", "created_at": "2025-11-13T23:10:36", "owner": "xiao5131420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103053649646236, "text": "我怎麼都沒變", "created_at": "2025-11-13T16:42:29", "owner": "xiao.feng196", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086940514984359, "text": "我关了灯看到都很黑", "created_at": "2025-11-13T13:48:38", "owner": "wuiteckkk69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857840425491605, "text": "如果手指本身就是一边黑一边白怎么办😀", "created_at": "2025-11-13T13:32:19", "owner": "yuiio_ot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050998229663603, "text": "都白怎么样", "created_at": "2025-11-13T13:24:54", "owner": "foong_199706", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073748300334189, "text": "手機調亮是不是大家都是冷白皮", "created_at": "2025-11-13T10:30:08", "owner": "_yoyo_1130", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052987256337090, "text": "原来我是冷皮啊😮", "created_at": "2025-11-13T04:48:00", "owner": "ji.aqi8611", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070354379360933, "text": "我居然冷皮嗎", "created_at": "2025-11-12T21:01:15", "owner": "peggy20040514", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18246169282291117, "text": "可是现在是晚上没开灯。", "created_at": "2025-11-12T16:22:48", "owner": "iiizyzyzy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113700076575604, "text": "冷皮～～～", "created_at": "2025-11-12T13:41:59", "owner": "emilyweng24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968866122973155, "text": "還是一樣黑", "created_at": "2025-11-12T06:15:27", "owner": "huang_.0823", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071940521254583, "text": "嗯...看起来算是冷色但是自己好像是黑皮", "created_at": "2025-11-12T05:33:06", "owner": "sammel.cos_0607", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027534260758662, "text": "放在中間兩個都一樣是怎樣？😢", "created_at": "2025-11-12T04:36:01", "owner": "zhangfengminzhang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18365109610083824, "text": "我冷皮", "created_at": "2025-11-12T04:20:42", "owner": "coxer8877", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18195644338323141, "text": "都白咋辦", "created_at": "2025-11-12T03:51:41", "owner": "zhuy_.0807._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157323727398262, "text": "那一黑一白算混血？", "created_at": "2025-11-12T03:17:28", "owner": "lou_hun26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083730086073928, "text": "Oh，my god，全部都是白的，没有黑黑的，真的😮", "created_at": "2025-11-11T15:04:46", "owner": "lov_2013s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18343782853204362, "text": "都差不多", "created_at": "2025-11-11T14:18:47", "owner": "pei7_1122", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987101322904488, "text": "黑人穿什麼顯白", "created_at": "2025-11-11T13:40:37", "owner": "ziruilee222", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864662956505195, "text": "半夜看不到欸", "created_at": "2025-11-11T13:25:57", "owner": "ycn._.gy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915811324231062, "text": "区别在哪😂", "created_at": "2025-11-11T13:02:16", "owner": "szhen2023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946952773059304, "text": "冷皮", "created_at": "2025-11-11T11:28:06", "owner": "katie20140727", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18377360755144096, "text": "滑鼠...", "created_at": "2025-11-11T10:23:46", "owner": "43je.nny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069458807595630, "text": "不會看", "created_at": "2025-11-11T08:08:29", "owner": "m23142514", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051517283648537, "text": "看到快脫窗了還是看不出來⋯", "created_at": "2025-11-10T16:52:04", "owner": "nightmare_angel7889", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859270342474255, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-10T15:51:56", "owner": "d1nn3x_10.11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080790457896197, "text": "黑皮不happy🫠", "created_at": "2025-11-10T15:39:45", "owner": "hx_0511o3o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184997779341250, "text": "Ehhh", "created_at": "2025-11-10T13:35:30", "owner": "tictic_booboo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055258928312249, "text": "皮膚不同地方有超明顯色差怎辦💔", "created_at": "2025-11-10T11:50:27", "owner": "smiling.thumb_0w0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068692511369819, "text": "通通都背光啊笑死", "created_at": "2025-11-10T11:03:56", "owner": "liangsumo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089050033939307, "text": "我明明很黃卻是冷皮？", "created_at": "2025-11-10T09:59:37", "owner": "xixixi_tattoo._.hi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044919308473109, "text": "色弱的我幾乎快看不到字了", "created_at": "2025-11-09T19:06:41", "owner": "leon_sfg9609", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903744196284154, "text": "逆光", "created_at": "2025-11-09T17:37:59", "owner": "hiromi_chung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078626357130266, "text": "暖皮", "created_at": "2025-11-09T14:34:35", "owner": "aubbov247", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161155864384921, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-09T14:16:20", "owner": "kenwong.922", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906635518280067, "text": "冷皮:0", "created_at": "2025-11-09T13:31:30", "owner": "_cunra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999378096737289, "text": "冷皮跟暖皮怎麼分啊？", "created_at": "2025-11-09T12:45:53", "owner": "songzan_0226", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991190829890702, "text": "我是黑皮", "created_at": "2025-11-09T12:42:29", "owner": "sher.ry5729", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090035008908000, "text": "我是黑人", "created_at": "2025-11-09T12:26:20", "owner": "amis._.1218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890684014366253, "text": "都黑怎麼辦🗿❓", "created_at": "2025-11-09T08:58:55", "owner": "cos_cwj_12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320687398169919, "text": "全是白的", "created_at": "2025-11-09T08:18:48", "owner": "light000__io", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920718547187458, "text": "沒區別", "created_at": "2025-11-09T07:58:57", "owner": "_wtkay_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943357624073844, "text": "有些下面的比較顯白 有些上面的比較顯白 什麼意思 冷暖皮嗎😢", "created_at": "2025-11-09T04:33:04", "owner": "f2223399", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18535342690032397, "text": "不管怎样都很黑的是橄榄皮", "created_at": "2025-11-09T02:45:34", "owner": "ling140719._.3p", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118321066531014, "text": "冷皮", "created_at": "2025-11-09T02:21:25", "owner": "s_02250615", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081034898105783, "text": "沒說一定要用手指", "created_at": "2025-11-08T23:59:33", "owner": "godxiaobai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963894855848403, "text": "没区别😢", "created_at": "2025-11-08T23:52:50", "owner": "dr._lu1205", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875640436439107, "text": "我關燈了只有剪影(⊙ω⊙)", "created_at": "2025-11-08T20:04:46", "owner": "diya990924", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095878531870765, "text": "都蠻白的啊😂", "created_at": "2025-11-08T19:39:24", "owner": "angela8101120", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097486738806562, "text": "原來我是冷白皮！？一直以為自己就是白而已", "created_at": "2025-11-08T18:46:38", "owner": "kay_jyj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103406077647610, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-08T18:43:54", "owner": "fa.cheung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875896408436302, "text": "我覺得你在耍我", "created_at": "2025-11-08T17:20:25", "owner": "vertexttr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079880933023849, "text": "都一樣白", "created_at": "2025-11-08T16:13:30", "owner": "s0413667", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093933136880633, "text": "等一下我有點中性", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:29:08", "owner": "s17888_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542695759049030, "text": "冷皮", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:27:38", "owner": "harpershyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366394576081583, "text": "冷皮", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:17:00", "owner": "hx._0720", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075109691225271, "text": "倒轉後 白的手指還是白 咋解？", "created_at": "2025-11-08T15:10:32", "owner": "monkeylee97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105838597626145, "text": "放橫的看不出來ㄚ", "created_at": "2025-11-08T14:44:22", "owner": "l256983741456", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075836272958554, "text": "更黑了🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-08T14:25:33", "owner": "0419_hbl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060310133200667, "text": "冷皮？？", "created_at": "2025-11-08T13:23:11", "owner": "dory._0514", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18245851381290997, "text": "冷……", "created_at": "2025-11-08T12:02:08", "owner": "1011127a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156114838397521, "text": "看來我是溫皮", "created_at": "2025-11-08T11:42:17", "owner": "mr.818.jl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047763032395645, "text": "又冷又暖是什麼鬼", "created_at": "2025-11-08T11:37:12", "owner": "happy_980913", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083559500317392, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-08T11:34:12", "owner": "wang._.48", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066477839575821, "text": "冷皮🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-08T10:33:20", "owner": "huang.yuching.334", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18242843794295320, "text": "我居然是冷皮😍", "created_at": "2025-11-08T10:27:04", "owner": "pan_baijin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047855873391181, "text": "都很白怎么办", "created_at": "2025-11-08T09:56:55", "owner": "aiwei444", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069336224359998, "text": "晚上看的非常清楚……..", "created_at": "2025-11-08T09:37:05", "owner": "zhengminhong5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18163565842377028, "text": "冷皮", "created_at": "2025-11-08T09:03:31", "owner": "chiang_hj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055134077649244, "text": "如果都很黑就請把手機螢幕調低😂", "created_at": "2025-11-08T08:25:03", "owner": "ran.yj_0511", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062596616426677, "text": "都很白咱辦？", "created_at": "2025-11-08T08:20:45", "owner": "ie_09.06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920653906192198, "text": "冷皮", "created_at": "2025-11-08T07:56:58", "owner": "carotina_520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18313527322220798, "text": "冷皮😂", "created_at": "2025-11-08T07:40:25", "owner": "hyzj11.9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097227706701087, "text": "都一樣怎麼辦", "created_at": "2025-11-08T07:17:16", "owner": "qinyu._.107", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396384493122724, "text": "黑皮", "created_at": "2025-11-08T06:40:37", "owner": "98_5_09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918607882206975, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-08T06:35:54", "owner": "sher.ry5729", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876640624430862, "text": "我是冷皮", "created_at": "2025-11-08T06:27:57", "owner": "hebe._.1022", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064510070133428, "text": "一下冷白一下暖白 真的很皮欸", "created_at": "2025-11-08T06:03:35", "owner": "allen_shih_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110211832578948, "text": "我是冷皮", "created_at": "2025-11-08T05:55:20", "owner": "anne.wang_1217", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045538046448914, "text": "冷皮 但本人不白:))", "created_at": "2025-11-08T04:27:07", "owner": "e04._.0730", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112418527571760, "text": "黑皮", "created_at": "2025-11-08T04:16:43", "owner": "chiao.riman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896937451341055, "text": "我是Happy", "created_at": "2025-11-08T04:16:00", "owner": "8yui._.12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107577463541714, "text": "我冷欸", "created_at": "2025-11-08T04:14:11", "owner": "_.mowmn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993507918846398, "text": "冷暖皮是什麼意思", "created_at": "2025-11-08T04:13:05", "owner": "leobunny723", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981292308921943, "text": "不懂", "created_at": "2025-11-08T03:42:58", "owner": "b28480357", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862148206520819, "text": "都很黑啊😂", "created_at": "2025-11-08T03:10:28", "owner": "ying._.0918", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097788946686386, "text": "看不懂", "created_at": "2025-11-08T03:06:12", "owner": "wendy9171023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889970317241480, "text": "两边 有时都可以是怎么回事", "created_at": "2025-11-08T02:33:37", "owner": "jjunaan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135232549461599, "text": "冷", "created_at": "2025-11-08T02:30:40", "owner": "tingyu0217wendy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18208244539314171, "text": "欸乾好好笑  手指頭一側曬黑一側白  我是要怎麼測", "created_at": "2025-11-08T01:10:34", "owner": "s_yu_1113", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045382286451913, "text": "我一直都很白", "created_at": "2025-11-07T23:16:49", "owner": "stamywer_.0227", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18306014977301908, "text": "难怪我配蓝衣服", "created_at": "2025-11-07T23:03:31", "owner": "jaypleleaf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050022503354371, "text": "我怎麼又冷又暖的？", "created_at": "2025-11-07T19:47:38", "owner": "imk_710", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036089588713350, "text": "眼睛痛", "created_at": "2025-11-07T18:52:21", "owner": "___ooh_ops", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912964483092305, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-07T18:18:23", "owner": "untitled0128_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863077096511733, "text": "為什麼在其他測試的都是暖皮然後到這裡我就變成冷皮", "created_at": "2025-11-07T17:33:15", "owner": "1130_ann_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087865444762188, "text": "又白又黑", "created_at": "2025-11-07T17:12:41", "owner": "feijimi_0505", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072685886243991, "text": "在黑暗中看手機的我：？", "created_at": "2025-11-07T15:44:16", "owner": "gear5.lf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087746203758180, "text": "有没有想过我是混血的呢，有时候那个皮肤会变成黑，变成白。黑，就是巧克力色那种的皮肤，嗯，也不太算吧，也不算那种马来人的，就是那一点点黑", "created_at": "2025-11-07T15:30:26", "owner": "keyi6134", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005377235821633, "text": "我是 醜皮", "created_at": "2025-11-07T15:05:12", "owner": "wang_star_815", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098067019755305, "text": "我是冷暖皮（#", "created_at": "2025-11-07T14:37:59", "owner": "wanderer._.0312", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865134994427309, "text": "看不出來的怎麼解😅", "created_at": "2025-11-07T13:47:31", "owner": "xiao_shik_1221", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071458847350208, "text": "看來我是冷皮🌚👍", "created_at": "2025-11-07T13:13:50", "owner": "1204jje", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028201184551103, "text": "喔虧了我是熟皮，因為已經被太陽烤的很熟了", "created_at": "2025-11-07T12:39:47", "owner": "oog._.777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866456509416578, "text": "冷皮：）", "created_at": "2025-11-07T12:24:11", "owner": "asdfgh092739", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074066360215900, "text": "他媽手機光源背光鯊逼嗎", "created_at": "2025-11-07T12:00:01", "owner": "kairui833", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986481909881098, "text": "根本沒差", "created_at": "2025-11-07T11:51:26", "owner": "moa_ae716", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065858975383812, "text": "都一樣黑💀", "created_at": "2025-11-07T11:49:12", "owner": "cxn0128", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077660426143661, "text": "冷皮 然後呢", "created_at": "2025-11-07T11:22:44", "owner": "liuiu_iuiu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899255068326537, "text": "好吧我是黑皮", "created_at": "2025-11-07T08:29:26", "owner": "yeeeeeee_weeeeeeeeee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102422416630186, "text": "誰跟我一樣是溫皮🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-07T07:59:20", "owner": "liu._.mi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058670759245062, "text": "前面两个图我是冷皮 后面一张图我是暖皮", "created_at": "2025-11-07T07:20:26", "owner": "yaaaaaa_306", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083496214834814, "text": "求解", "created_at": "2025-11-07T05:24:09", "owner": "lhc._.0131", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3673423048678636221, "shortcode": "DL6nszWOPq9", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DL6nszWOPq9/", "taken_at": "2025-07-10T06:06:12", "caption": "过度礼貌换来的不是尊重，而是他人更大的恶意 （3）", "owner_username": "zheyilu6", "owner_id": "54137636947", "likes": 16653, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0031_DL6nszWOPq9\\DL6nszWOPq9_20250710_060612.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17924223810069964, "text": "我是老師，我也覺得能這樣很好，能勇敢表達需求，而不是壓抑，生活也比較健康", "created_at": "2025-07-13T14:03:49", "owner": "huafei_chen", "likes": 337}, {"id": 17945122737024728, "text": "說得很對，沒有錯，謝謝您，您對他人越友善很尊重，但別人卻都是，沒有對自己很友善，很尊重的！！", "created_at": "2025-09-08T10:49:35", "owner": "lianyiyun5", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17893343412146830, "text": "你去跟習維尼講", "created_at": "2025-07-10T23:24:00", "owner": "ruifu_h", "likes": 186}, {"id": 18035350754465533, "text": "什麼跟什麼，做人不是要有禮貌嗎？大人還反過來要求小孩理解？別拿你們的標準當全世界的標準，雙辮女孩那一句爸媽知道會不高興就是後台，否則工作人員會多給一勺，老師會答應換座位？", "created_at": "2025-08-08T15:31:42", "owner": "the_rain_star", "likes": 14}, {"id": 17956326974971099, "text": "👏👏👏👍👍👍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-07-15T03:54:12", "owner": "feralee999", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17877382200366153, "text": "過度的話，長大就變成過度自我中心理所當然", "created_at": "2025-07-17T09:05:02", "owner": "qiannnqian", "likes": 13}, {"id": 17890295508281712, "text": "教育孩子很重要，让孩子有自信心，不要自卑", "created_at": "2025-07-20T04:22:01", "owner": "ui76jittochin82", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17864267139398338, "text": "但我看到大部分的學生對他們自身提出的任何要求，都認為自己是合理的", "created_at": "2025-09-17T08:35:54", "owner": "bymysoul_47", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18034615052710963, "text": "说话咋么笑声我无语…", "created_at": "2025-10-11T05:33:35", "owner": "sunshine_8837", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085963837752040, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-07-12T09:39:02", "owner": "yuanchunxiang1842", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074188508485402, "text": "台灣應該是要完全相反喔！🤣太GY誰理妳", "created_at": "2025-08-14T14:18:11", "owner": "shuuiphotostudio", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18289718656302141, "text": "好了， 多一點這種視頻\n不久之後一零後就會搞出大事情🔥", "created_at": "2025-07-11T09:05:47", "owner": "calvinkwchan", "likes": 24}, {"id": 18101159011576013, "text": "辮子妹妹說得對", "created_at": "2025-07-20T11:43:48", "owner": "huangweixiang29", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18079583707809233, "text": "學會別人怕什麼", "created_at": "2025-09-21T13:16:45", "owner": "won_tall", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17958877394967148, "text": "尤其是政府，希望你們對政府也可以這樣", "created_at": "2025-08-21T00:17:14", "owner": "ier520", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18070905209018332, "text": "@yfl_11111 对的敢敢说", "created_at": "2025-07-15T09:12:09", "owner": "callalily96", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17880724413349898, "text": "欺善怕惡的道理", "created_at": "2025-07-12T05:20:57", "owner": "pin.zhu", "likes": 59}, {"id": 17889820995291457, "text": "大陸是這樣教的？", "created_at": "2025-07-13T09:12:59", "owner": "tientsaiku", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18370020832150098, "text": "天生萬物以養人", "created_at": "2025-10-02T12:47:08", "owner": "tonytong0219", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074570027000540, "text": "人善被人欺", "created_at": "2025-08-09T03:13:22", "owner": "joeyhush", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17933211570062637, "text": "因該被教育的是大人吧～小朋友提出需求，大人因該要聽到，何況影片的小朋友都是很有禮貌的提出需求不是嗎？非得要人兇，非得要威脅才聽懂，這種說話方式有比較好嗎？！", "created_at": "2025-07-14T08:25:17", "owner": "mmclomm", "likes": 107}, {"id": 18060511058337958, "text": "亂教小孩真糟糕，什麼爛影片", "created_at": "2025-07-12T07:13:12", "owner": "linhwating", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17842698330646892, "text": "難怪內地人沒禮貌", "created_at": "2025-12-11T09:57:00", "owner": "cwk803616", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095303647894079, "text": "這套理論只能用在中國...先把整個社會假想成100%欺善怕惡，但其他國家惡人大概只佔5%，這樣教只會讓社會越來越多猜忌。", "created_at": "2025-12-10T18:38:45", "owner": "jinyude0520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979705377937130, "text": "簡單來說.....就是給你三分顏色你就開染房了？", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:00:00", "owner": "zhangzhensung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18151047298422278, "text": "@luc_xing", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:17:10", "owner": "summerwong1116", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885864109400969, "text": "这什么垃圾片，给台湾人多推，那边人读书少，分低都能考大学。", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:31:36", "owner": "ganray54", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076301869968801, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-19T22:49:18", "owner": "waynechong_4224", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094392439848886, "text": "然后彭彭就消失了", "created_at": "2025-11-16T07:00:15", "owner": "alan_xls", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073772426266327, "text": "對岸的品德教育不普及化", "created_at": "2025-11-15T20:05:45", "owner": "rojantw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901013548167602, "text": "清楚自己的權利和位置才是重要", "created_at": "2025-11-05T14:51:08", "owner": "marcobowkk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052746836319983, "text": "借力使力", "created_at": "2025-10-28T06:13:45", "owner": "eason830108", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331924498230325, "text": "她敢說是有背景家人教她怎說怎做了", "created_at": "2025-10-25T06:29:24", "owner": "imis1352", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082468318960182, "text": "希望中國人都可以這樣對習近平説\n還有傷害于朦朧、喬任梁的那些魔鬼高官權威", "created_at": "2025-10-12T00:53:14", "owner": "hinishiny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041034884478595, "text": "假如你的要求不合理，那就是無理取鬧！所以重點是你有沒有“真正”的理在先！片面的只說合理就爭取，那只是垃圾毒雞湯！🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-09T09:03:19", "owner": "edi.chin.7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028475696526856, "text": "維尼：你說什麼", "created_at": "2025-10-03T10:55:53", "owner": "wesin001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955658955867249, "text": "好滯脹的影片", "created_at": "2025-09-28T22:15:26", "owner": "amis_zorn1995", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18384943624134778, "text": "⚠️⚠️⚠️各位愛看劇的朋友們有福啦⚠️⚠️⚠️\nLine社群🔰陸小漫短劇🔰尋找愛看劇的你❤️‍🔥\n免費入群✅免費看劇✅還可以許願喲🥰\n‼️‼️重點裡面劇全部是完整版的‼️‼️\n社群氣氛活躍💯大家都好相處✌️\nLINE搜尋社群🔍🔰陸小漫短劇🔰\n如果有任何不會的 可以直接私訊我哦👋\n趕快來要去追劇聊劇吧😋😋\n偷偷告訴大家🫢\n近期社群會舉辦抽獎活動🤩\n豐富獎品等你來拿", "created_at": "2025-09-19T13:31:21", "owner": "fwo124_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915786208172097, "text": "社會環境不同。", "created_at": "2025-09-16T16:19:18", "owner": "pcobba6089", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052734485560864, "text": "螂性🤣", "created_at": "2025-09-12T10:22:17", "owner": "chrisgoderom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053734292618776, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-09-01T10:24:52", "owner": "ooxx1104", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922362037011955, "text": "把禮義廉恥當封建餘毒，文革後的蘇維埃共和國，活下來的大部份都是畜牲。", "created_at": "2025-08-30T00:04:43", "owner": "hnnisih", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049369058268883, "text": "國家比你港人權理先有資格講人權", "created_at": "2025-08-17T01:29:47", "owner": "midorimandy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18287100271264788, "text": "所以咪俾人打囉", "created_at": "2025-08-09T00:36:28", "owner": "lokachun0713", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053063093440133, "text": "合理的要求是訓練 不合理的要求是磨練", "created_at": "2025-08-06T08:19:05", "owner": "rrass678b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891990901163188, "text": "所以做人太有礼貌不行…要难缠，因为那些人给脸不要脸", "created_at": "2025-07-29T06:54:21", "owner": "yummi.l", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067165565124280, "text": "刷\n到\n这\n条\n评\n论\n都\n发\n财😍", "created_at": "2025-07-26T09:56:18", "owner": "dmdodkjdjdjdk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939882031019899, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-07-20T13:40:47", "owner": "samlucky31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321558046225580, "text": "人就賤~给您客氣當隨便！", "created_at": "2025-07-19T13:48:13", "owner": "zkp20170", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128896945450727, "text": "更了打我一下！🙏", "created_at": "2025-07-10T06:57:15", "owner": "scsg_mok0706", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18053722364605057, "text": "人之初性本贱🫣🥲😂", "created_at": "2025-07-10T06:48:28", "owner": "kwacs", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3782660120426209018, "shortcode": "DR-tVaQCl76", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DR-tVaQCl76/", "taken_at": "2025-12-07T22:58:10", "caption": "世界上最大的謊言之一，便是自詡為「白手起家的百萬富翁」。\n\n沒有人能夠單憑一己之力成功，世上根本沒有所謂的自我成就！\n\n所有的勝利，都是團隊合作的成果。\n\n更何況，我能走到今天，全因我的伴侶給予我堅定不移的信念與支持。\n\n事實上，我認為你身邊的人——尤其是你的人生伴侶——將決定你是否能夠成功。\n\n因此，今天我很高興能在聖誕節為妻子買了一輛新車，試著表達我有多麼感激她。在我一無所有、默默無聞時，是她一直支持著我。\n\n她相信著我，並在過去二十三年裡帶給我無數快樂。我們應當更多地談論這種深厚恆久的愛，並以此作為一種生活之道。\n\n別總覺得對岸的草地更青翠——你用心澆灌之處，方有生機盎然。\n\n#simonsquibb #dream #施夢啓 #夢想", "owner_username": "simonsquibb.cn", "owner_id": "72287889950", "likes": 2674, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0032_DR-tVaQCl76\\DR-tVaQCl76_20251207_225810.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": "17987698265910113", "text": "😍😍😍\nthanks for your sharing.\n佩服你的舉動\n為他人圓夢\n你看他的眼睛裏🈵是驚喜\n星星💫之火🔥\n足以燎原🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥\n你的善良💖\n大善之人必有無窮的福報🧧\n詞窮😉", "created_at": "2025-12-07T23:31:34", "owner": "tiffany.wong.328_", "likes": 4}, {"id": "17853758322591318", "text": "為什麼不選特斯拉為什麼選了mini想聽聽你的看法", "created_at": "2025-12-08T06:47:50", "owner": "thecarry1996", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["simonsquibb", "dream", "施夢啓", "夢想"]},
{"media_id": 3783833576316417757, "shortcode": "DSC4JcNiTbd", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DSC4JcNiTbd/", "taken_at": "2025-12-09T13:48:54", "caption": "原來Hello Kitty是這麼嗆的嗎？難怪後來不給她嘴巴了", "owner_username": "ani3small_meme", "owner_id": "42272613480", "likes": 5320, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphSidecar", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0033_DSC4JcNiTbd\\DSC4JcNiTbd_20251209_134854_1.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0033_DSC4JcNiTbd\\DSC4JcNiTbd_20251209_134854_2.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0033_DSC4JcNiTbd\\DSC4JcNiTbd_20251209_134854_3.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0033_DSC4JcNiTbd\\DSC4JcNiTbd_20251209_134854_4.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0033_DSC4JcNiTbd\\DSC4JcNiTbd_20251209_134854_5.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0033_DSC4JcNiTbd\\DSC4JcNiTbd_20251209_134854_6.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": "17977459004948385", "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T23:39:20", "owner": "laravivalavita", "likes": 2}, {"id": "17941810215086167", "text": "原來kitty也這麼口直心腸", "created_at": "2025-12-10T04:57:00", "owner": "kattikao", "likes": 25}, {"id": "17983605908781868", "text": "我終於理解為什麼Hello Kitty沒有嘴巴😍", "created_at": "2025-12-09T22:46:32", "owner": "_superb.glacier", "likes": 18}, {"id": "17899792131342446", "text": "貓大統領嗎", "created_at": "2025-12-11T07:29:29", "owner": "melmel.chen", "likes": 3}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
