{"media_id": 3782656646041044984, "shortcode": "DR-si2ejAf4", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DR-si2ejAf4/", "taken_at": "2025-12-07T22:51:14", "caption": "Angry Thieves 😭\n#viralreels #50cent #netflix #viralvideos #funnymemes #viralvideos #thief", "owner_username": "ama_hazyfm", "owner_id": "7109131743", "likes": 146155, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0035_DR-si2ejAf4\\DR-si2ejAf4_20251207_225114.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18074337296255347, "text": "Somebody tell me if these are AI or not?", "created_at": "2025-12-09T01:49:44", "owner": "greenbosha", "likes": 64}, {"id": 18116764975562534, "text": "I detect AI 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T13:47:04", "owner": "a_fineart19", "likes": 497}, {"id": 17907071178274858, "text": "Ai or not, people have actually done this and it is a great idea 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:07:27", "owner": "emkay_91", "likes": 1670}, {"id": 18101857411738327, "text": "Love it when they get two the car can you imagine the mess inside that car perfect?", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:16:01", "owner": "leeandrewdavid", "likes": 750}, {"id": 17945424093080681, "text": "They deserve every bit of it.  Great job to the home owners", "created_at": "2025-12-09T02:00:43", "owner": "laurie.hansen.18", "likes": 5650}, {"id": 18080357150156209, "text": "What a brilliant idea... where can you buy these??", "created_at": "2025-12-08T14:18:40", "owner": "mike.felton", "likes": 3262}, {"id": 18092055619940022, "text": "The fact that they ask what's wrong with you 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:34:13", "owner": "jonny_therealjonathan", "likes": 289}, {"id": 17932322316132231, "text": "I wish you would call the police on them cause you know what you’re the one that’s stealing food you’ll be going to jail,,, I love it please call the police please I want you to,,,😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T06:44:32", "owner": "cherylcataniavazquez", "likes": 122}, {"id": 18080718920467744, "text": "With love from logistics 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:21:57", "owner": "m_h_hussayin", "likes": 32}, {"id": 18076058018192686, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T05:28:48", "owner": "gasquire", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068601827614754, "text": "How will you sue? 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T09:51:02", "owner": "semakatso", "likes": 41}, {"id": 18093731516505283, "text": "This is satisfying 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T20:48:33", "owner": "drrayofficial_", "likes": 33}, {"id": 17868657786483603, "text": "Absolutely Hilarious!", "created_at": "2025-12-09T20:52:35", "owner": "boulder47", "likes": 27}, {"id": 17843086905639261, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👍👍👍👍👍", "created_at": "2025-12-09T10:33:44", "owner": "ewajaninawojccik", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18059093324651695, "text": "Stop stealing peoples boxes", "created_at": "2025-12-09T03:23:34", "owner": "ejackson.0301", "likes": 1127}, {"id": 18000533849833331, "text": "Roban y encima se enojan 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:35:44", "owner": "luis.dls", "likes": 391}, {"id": 18006479747665426, "text": "👍👍👍😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T09:25:10", "owner": "insta_20231", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18106665220630794, "text": "Simple don't steal from people👏", "created_at": "2025-12-09T06:08:30", "owner": "gregdow37", "likes": 251}, {"id": 18084816455113344, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T12:54:49", "owner": "boyotistop", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18116869138574266, "text": "Don’t steal!", "created_at": "2025-12-09T20:53:56", "owner": "cathycoxnewman", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18066179036156559, "text": "Every single one of them also a registered Democrat", "created_at": "2025-12-09T18:47:03", "owner": "formulaforinsanity", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18539274880058005, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:37:48", "owner": "antonioda7319", "likes": 99}, {"id": 18185172226348132, "text": "Lol, I LOVE THAT,  IT'S WHAT YOU DESERVE 👍 GO AHEAD CALL THE COPS AND TURN YOURSELF IN 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T18:21:23", "owner": "mistyl.bechtol", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18338722795230430, "text": "I’m I the only one heard I will call the cop ? 🤡 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T21:37:29", "owner": "piroman_page", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17966835215847311, "text": "Shouldn’t steal!!! A little C4 goes a LONG way", "created_at": "2025-12-09T19:07:31", "owner": "wchurtt", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18035353739726705, "text": "She wanted to call a cop😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T08:59:39", "owner": "mind__blowingfacts_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18002499461685857, "text": "The packages exploded prematurely.  If they are remotely controlled, the owner should wait until all the door are closed before hitting the button.  This way, all the dye is contained inside the vehicle, bigger cleanup job.  Just be sure the package doesn't explode while the vehicle is in motion or the thief might lose control and hurt someone.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:19:46", "owner": "jetvalmonte", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18100584157696950, "text": "The Nerve to be Upset! That's what you get for taking something that doesn't belong to you..", "created_at": "2025-12-11T03:49:04", "owner": "mscecirockett", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17938216428070477, "text": "In the car!!! Awesome 👍", "created_at": "2025-12-11T04:40:21", "owner": "williamstuartlarson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892834087243233, "text": "@hanier.24 @maicol_fandino12 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-11T02:56:32", "owner": "kmpufa31", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18339949252230615, "text": "Why are they angry and want to call the cops ??? Strange thievery", "created_at": "2025-12-09T22:25:17", "owner": "fact55fact", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18155293663415008, "text": "Imma swallow you? 😅😅😅😅🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:30:45", "owner": "ogbus3ud", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087435236047114, "text": "Lesson: Don't steal other people's awaiting packages!!!!", "created_at": "2025-12-09T22:07:30", "owner": "randy__hawkins", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18088410509485748, "text": "I’m gonna sue. I’m gonna sue all of you.😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T02:31:03", "owner": "lambornelton", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17899425396348002, "text": "Yesssss thank you for the timing 👌🏽👏🏽👏🏽", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:20:56", "owner": "blessed_soraidam", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17931909744115749, "text": "brilliant", "created_at": "2025-12-11T00:25:23", "owner": "leecornel123", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18002465513835674, "text": "It’s the effrontery for me😂 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T23:43:02", "owner": "uglymillz_wf", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17955414275897258, "text": "AI", "created_at": "2025-12-10T23:20:40", "owner": "moon.knight_2006", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18544054543008526, "text": "That just to funny. I was literally rolling in the floor laughing when I saw this", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:37:57", "owner": "john379042", "likes": 17}, {"id": 17941459989095276, "text": "To the individual who is reading this please quit overthinking everything every day and night. Stop obsessing over your failures. Stop doubting yourself and seeing the greatness in everyone else but you. You are better than that. You deserve more. Start showing up differently to yourself. Believe in yourself. God won’t ever hand you something you can’t handle. You are a star in this world. May God bless whoever sees this, amen 🙏🏽 ☁️", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:56:37", "owner": "daveelilnaps", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18073953437042409, "text": "That's bad... do it again 😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-10T21:15:44", "owner": "ekow_reigns", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088347427959846, "text": "👏👏🤣🤣👍", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:39:03", "owner": "deramusblake", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075325592243777, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T08:07:51", "owner": "chriskirwa", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18012104873647255, "text": "😭😭😭💀💀💀💀", "created_at": "2025-12-10T08:50:07", "owner": "fatgeeez", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17862792876540430, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂👍🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-10T10:42:52", "owner": "westcoast_frenchies87", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18055360484331732, "text": 