id": 17895355467224084, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:41:19", "owner": "johnhassanadas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065370761413809, "text": "It has to be illegal to put explosive devices in packages regardless if people are stealing them?! Could cause severe bodily injury and I’m all for for it but it still has to be illegal!", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:40:43", "owner": "walterjstern", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965987280847507, "text": "It is hilarious", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:39:52", "owner": "papa71499", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059293412294060, "text": "Why majority of these thieves fatties?!?!", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:38:27", "owner": "victorcommaj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066381758153351, "text": "👍🤣🔥😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:38:22", "owner": "maxsimus713", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073453733359162, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:37:50", "owner": "tower_fierro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088295504289828, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:35:38", "owner": "geraldyarbrough25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087863723063010, "text": "Wie geil ist das denn 👍👍👍😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:35:02", "owner": "magimo_707", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076727453252475, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:33:13", "owner": "hooman_panjeh_shahi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061933880236300, "text": "Aaaaaaaaa hahahaha, I love seeing these selfish morons get with they deserve.", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:30:10", "owner": "legundah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849495928609734, "text": "Encima se cabrean🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:29:48", "owner": "joseveloso81", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041945774507208, "text": "Your fault theif", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:27:18", "owner": "jamiehannivan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889554118262129, "text": "Hope that ink doesn't come off.😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:26:54", "owner": "tamashido1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902825464332062, "text": "Fckn idiot", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:23:25", "owner": "kauaisonz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100941184694460, "text": "From a hungarian perspective, I don’t understand the idea of leaving the package on the porch. Here you always have to take it personally from the courier. I know that X years ago this was working there, and nobody stole your package, but come on… And also, if you’de try this in Hungary, the owner (or at least the 50% of them) will beat the shit out you if you try to take my stuff like that.", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:19:29", "owner": "migview2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864253567452967, "text": "What does a turkey have to do with his thieving 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:13:25", "owner": "sergio_b_63", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084201587089556, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:13:03", "owner": "djhardrockint", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978415215952412, "text": "I wanna hear the phone call to the police and the body cam footage when they show up.", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:11:44", "owner": "82_edwin_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097385623662388, "text": "Ai", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:08:13", "owner": "kamran.khn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848178004614219, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:08:01", "owner": "pbacon892", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084323710875443, "text": "Qué descaro! Tras de qué están tomando lo ajeno! Se enojan y amenazan! Yo no pondría una caja, pondría 3…", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:07:46", "owner": "cindy_021", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078290812973643, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:04:18", "owner": "danhansen28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033760361742363, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:00:59", "owner": "b_m_4000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060761060262496, "text": "Why do they complain they are stealing deserve everything they get", "created_at": "2025-12-11T04:56:45", "owner": "jamesthomerson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18399205882125994, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T04:55:07", "owner": "alexandro.contreras.587", "likes": 0}, {"id": 181