9504132571, "text": "Thief Ghetto SLUG Gonna SUE.. 🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-10T22:21:13", "owner": "maryottjohn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046472117699297, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T22:21:04", "owner": "lolcu_mrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18299189752286921, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣... Ghetto SLUGS..", "created_at": "2025-12-10T22:20:12", "owner": "maryottjohn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916633795090576, "text": "There’s a lot of videos out there that appeared to show porch pirates being having packages exploding on them. Where can you buy these? Exploding things to put in your packages? I would love to have one.", "created_at": "2025-12-10T22:20:08", "owner": "joedubs52", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124941565518417, "text": "Que rico le sabe que se les estalle en la cara pero mas me sabe cuando las suben al carro, es que hay que ver que son descarados", "created_at": "2025-12-10T22:20:00", "owner": "guisscambronero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122012926532780, "text": "Eu acho mais engraçado ainda, é que além de roubarem a caixa, ficam bravos...🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-10T22:19:32", "owner": "eliane.li.3154", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002276273688112, "text": "I love the ones where they get the package into the car first 😂😂😂 your never gna clean that out of your rig... brings me so much joy. \"IMA SUE ALL OF YOU!!!!\"😂😂😂👍", "created_at": "2025-12-10T22:19:28", "owner": "atlantianservices", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543880864039525, "text": "Got you", "created_at": "2025-12-10T22:18:44", "owner": "gee.gee.43", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036992678721500, "text": "Y de paso se molestan 😮🙄😏💁🏻‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-12-10T22:18:43", "owner": "isabelji31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926633614170162, "text": "ha ha", "created_at": "2025-12-10T22:17:29", "owner": "michael434250", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120323020546520, "text": "I love this show !", "created_at": "2025-12-10T22:17:16", "owner": "munizestremera", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960200082878319, "text": "Now how you gonna get mad and sue when 