92908916357, "text": "Chaaar", "created_at": "2025-12-09T20:07:47", "owner": "axel.francois", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084656401865261, "text": "They act like they’ve had something stolen from them. They get mad. Oh that’s so funny!! I hate a thief !! If I lived where people do this stuff like this. I’d plant an exploding package too. I think it’s hilarious. I live in the woods. If you come down my drive way you better be coming to see me. Or else you’re totally lost. I live living in t e woods.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T20:07:22", "owner": "lcsingley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054318503359688, "text": "If the parcel and the camera were mine, I would feel so pleased if the thief managed to to get the parcel into the car before it exploded.😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T20:06:44", "owner": "birpug", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903743524313692, "text": "Oh the guy, the mad man at the end I would’ve came out with a pistol or a fucking shotgun and put it near his head said you better not come back", "created_at": "2025-12-09T20:06:44", "owner": "siemersdave", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056193668328482, "text": "Yeah, call the cop. I’ll be smart then they can see the doorbell what you did and you’ll be charged with theft. They can’t charge you nothing in the neighborhood with that. He didn’t do nothing wrong. He painted you. That’s all.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T20:06:21", "owner": "siemersdave", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081057101140766, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T20:05:45", "owner": "den_04007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857760910512287, "text": "They should do it.. then everyone get to see who the real thieves are in  their town 🤣🔥🔥🔥🔥👍😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T20:05:44", "owner": "ronniegonzales650", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074040791031053, "text": "Mencantaaa 🤣👍🔥🤣😂🤣👏👍🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-09T20:05:28", "owner": "parabavides", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18199823605324006, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T20:05:22", "owner": "gadeamauro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18538