ing angry??? Insane", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:49:43", "owner": "marescagambino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059133425291947, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:48:53", "owner": "pedrovillain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118190650560093, "text": "I know this are AI but damn are they funny", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:48:22", "owner": "guinbrandon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077248799463178, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:47:36", "owner": "bosscarinteriors", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971992674968049, "text": "👍👏👏👏👍", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:47:06", "owner": "cirvis45", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953821366022713, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:46:07", "owner": "cirvis45", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063338144205693, "text": "Еще и возмущаются 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:44:48", "owner": "accnv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082742990109769, "text": "“i know where you live”", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:44:37", "owner": "brady_eacker", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18426437227116638, "text": "Ось вам суки злодії", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:44:13", "owner": "usenko3501", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892495501244502, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:43:51", "owner": "turymtaiuly.b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844180825624716, "text": "Love this", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:43:51", "owner": "jaydeew0306", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103231237673641, "text": "En el penúltimo video la chica sube la caja a un auto oscuro de determinado modelo. Luego de la \"explosión\" el auto cambio de modelo y de color, y la caja sigue intacta.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:43:40", "owner": "motoverde1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080310785469309, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:43:21", "owner": "shortdog430", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974117436806366, "text": "Так им и надо! Воры!", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:43:16", "owner": "wolf.5213251", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18341786494231243, "text": "🤣 LOSER 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:43:14", "owner": "malusa8482", "likes": 0}, {"