ppen if you wasn't a thief. Fym call the cops?", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:16:17", "owner": "tycoon1017", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842521801645528, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂👍👍👍", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:16:00", "owner": "nostalgie_bordeaux", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18186884788343476, "text": "A generation of ‘what’s yours is mine’!! Nothing but societal grubs!!", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:15:51", "owner": "andrewpaul5357", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065433587451119, "text": "I love the Ai.....😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:15:49", "owner": "yugesh_venkatachalam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090908939482153, "text": "Pls tell me its real!", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:15:32", "owner": "kingdippo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980664114945748, "text": "So funny.  Great", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:15:06", "owner": "mrpaul6071", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957705787012488, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:14:39", "owner": "paulettemadray", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942573949094253, "text": "🤣😂😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:14:08", "owner": "michaelhenderson276", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042278144501871, "text": "😮😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:14:06", "owner": "singh_1_9_71", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875184625451190, "text": "Got what you had coming their pos", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:13:54", "owner": "don.delli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071676287579978, "text": "I want one", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:13:40", "owner": "tuppabear", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005450093824062, "text": "Wish this was real", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:13:30", "owner": "fabriciovb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910544323123810, "text": "That just looks like AI", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:13:20", "owner": "kulkalirai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352356211161581, "text": "Sadly AI thou", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:12:34", "owner": "tim.lxh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18343809214230374, "text": "Just like Randy marsh said: “why is it always the economically challenged that make things more difficult?”\nthese players a