9T11:37:10", "owner": "jemstergram", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131118292440760, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:36:28", "owner": "brown.amanda2018", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091443658946423, "text": "Got cha modafaka! 🔥🔥🔥🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:35:35", "owner": "niko_leonart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871166854397540, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:34:37", "owner": "bekbonu93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096413107831229, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:33:57", "owner": "muscleygiraffe88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18247228270293124, "text": "Delightful 😊", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:33:31", "owner": "mamoflx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183194104360052, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:33:25", "owner": "demin.fsp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030879140753949, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:33:08", "owner": "ajdsr23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868985086494285, "text": "I love it 💯💯💯👏👏😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:33:08", "owner": "lorenzospath", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084848317861073, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂 تستاهل", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:32:11", "owner": "adnan.thamer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085565756028890, "text": "Вот интересно, воруют и еще возмущаются!", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:32:00", "owner": "almatystefan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937647960980745, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:31:13", "owner": "marvinewilsonjr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18381926284199947, "text": "Great job 👏", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:30:59", "owner": "bilalshah10101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081785567321948, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:30:51", "owner": "federicods71", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095782432880710, "text": "Mad because stealing someone’s goods 👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:30:45", "owner": "vandalizegfx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977444835953530, "text": "人の家の物を盗んだ馬鹿野郎が何逆ギレしてるの？オマエ、泥棒だよ❗", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:29:31", "owner": "kotarou1966", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067971881428814, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:28:50", "owner": "ericmolloymail", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103508245676103, "text": "I don’t understand how people can be so indignant when they’re ripping peoples packages right off their porch.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:28:22", "owner": "sam3p0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032194841537187, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:26:12", "owner": "snellman.paivi59", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880681876329336, "text": "Ying yang motherfucker...", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:26:08", "owner": "patient_amadioha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135619990471247, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:25:53", "owner": "nu.ri4336", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18332180050242603, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂callin the cops on you,seriously????lmao🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:25:41", "owner": "ionut_preda84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878726659439054, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:25:36", "owner": "royeizan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104503972679868, "text": "Good work", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:25:22", "owner": "alfarajbusness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087294112976420, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:24:58", "owner": "greghy7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843714499633812, "text": "Почему они у вас почти все жирные?", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:24:31", "owner": "mse.rgeevich", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088670492317227, "text": "Why do you have to find him/she if you know where he/she lives", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:24:06", "owner": "pdbenoito6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101808700708146, "text": "These porch package thieves are Hillarious 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:23:22", "owner": "tsunami7864_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940417666099964, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:23:00", "owner": "yo.inma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182771362357977, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:22:19", "owner": "hakancikikci", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084829420847846, "text": "😂😂😂😂 angry thieves 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:22:06", "owner": "kuyak88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002499461685857, "text": "The packages exploded prematurely.  If they are remotely controlled, the owner should wait until all the door are closed before hitting the button.  This way, all the dye is contained inside the vehicle, bigger cleanup job.  Just be sure the package doesn't explode while the vehicle is in motion or the thief might lose control and hurt someone.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:19:46", "owner": "jetvalmonte", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18086572412072267, "text": "Splendid🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:19:39", "owner": "immvincible", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990830955871820, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:18:26", "owner": "jess_zen_et_form_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100409038754576, "text": "You stupid turkey eating mofo", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:18:04", "owner": "jdvince21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064504298404785, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:17:47", "owner": "murat_isnel_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088500091812850, "text": "Who are all these plump individuals? 😮", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:17:30", "owner": "sven_minke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928047553168424, "text": "So much entitlement", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:15:46", "owner": "caphunachonco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084831521018548, "text": "Ахаха ппц жиробасы", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:15:45", "owner": "kuzz_007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18149068276382745, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:13:25", "owner": "adonis_mackay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062753159226815, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:13:22", "owner": "moony.kg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994774287707419, "text": "Super😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:13:12", "owner": "regina19540413", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083240491882840, "text": "😂😂😂🤣😂😂🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:12:11", "owner": "yvesg.sanchez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075532355017837, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:11:39", "owner": "yaxir_huxxaini190", "likes": 0}, {"id": 179817