haelalexbraun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905225650298837, "text": "The best prank :))", "created_at": "2025-12-09T09:18:14", "owner": "imgaman94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036766037513093, "text": "Die Klauen die Pakete, begehen damit eine Straftat, aber Regen sich auf, wenn ihnen das Ding um die Ohren fliegt und wollen Anzeige erstatten? Wie dumm kann man sein? 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T09:17:25", "owner": "hopeman83", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942291078960749, "text": "I got a kick out of it... 😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T09:16:20", "owner": "dennislisadiaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081570506273625, "text": "A very good bait for thieves.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T09:16:01", "owner": "omaraboderin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080069750172731, "text": "Тағыда өздері ренжидіғой😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T09:15:33", "owner": "mu_slima7773", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18076940081184970, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T09:14:38", "owner": "camperuwe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868992502493928, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣 gördünmü ebeninkini 😂😂😂👏👏👏.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T09:14:24", "owner": "timothy_bergsteiger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920933068207433, "text": "😂😂😂😂 i'm crying", "created_at": "2025-12-09T09:13:15", "owner": "charlene.thum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086339801062305, "text": "Is AI right?", "created_at": "2025-12-09T09:13:08", "owner": "elrealvalor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892423789380303, "text": "Sei tu stupido che rubi", "created_at": "2025-12-09T09:12:58", "owner": "sgiarovellodavid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025354613592248, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-09T09:12:53", "owner": "masnizam_mamud", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942195738961484, "text": "😂😂😂👍👍👍", "created_at": "2025-12-09T09:12:06", "owner": "musheg.manukyan.50", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853204804547179, "text": "Has anybody noticed that every clip it’s always raining", "created_at": "2025-12-09T09:10:48", "owner": "bdlove988", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857131930568334, "text": "“I know where you live”..while he’s at t