 stealing packages?????", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:30:34", "owner": "fletcherjohn065", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085234862045621, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:26:57", "owner": "erik.eliasen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957804013010720, "text": "How dare they be angry. Thieving toe rags.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:18:54", "owner": "llindaross5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907071178274858, "text": "Ai or not, people have actually done this and it is a great idea 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:07:27", "owner": "emkay_91", "likes": 1670}, {"id": 18030092714743325, "text": "I’m of the opinion that the charges should be delayed till they are all the way in the car 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:03:47", "owner": "girl_dad_surfer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106774408637206, "text": "A I", "created_at": "2025-12-08T18:24:17", "owner": "s_a_s_h_183", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032555252739054, "text": "Grear idea...but in america your probably get sued", "created_at": "2025-12-08T18:20:47", "owner": "paul489732", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085666631091442, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T18:00:29", "owner": "marietteperzon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062877494230768, "text": "Why are they all so large", "created_at": "2025-12-08T17:55:03", "owner": "lilly.the.lhasa.apso", "likes": 41}, {"id": 17989600628859930, "text": "I love it especially when they get verbal, my stomach is aching with laughing so much lol", "created_at": "2025-12-08T17:55:03", "owner": "alan.jukes.5151", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139598254462852, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T17:52:33", "owner": "ganeyooo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18548419903050817, "text": "@grady092", "created_at": "2025-12-08T17:42:08", "owner": "ltup.ol89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011648150645013, "text": "Hahahaha", "created_at": "2025-12-08T17:23:20", "owner": "seedmd1988", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929830537078485, "text": "😂😂😂😂👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-08T17:21:12", "owner": "giorgi84361", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18175473133370134, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T17:10:14", "owner": "george007davies", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18297846244284827, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-08T17:00:28", "owner": "smariosgr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18550492135062988, "text": "🔥👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:44:43", "owner": "richardkorotkevih", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085094092865293, "text": "YOUR STEALING DUMB ASS", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:25:41", "owner": "michellekeyor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183701212352343, "text": "Call the cops on them", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:21:08", "owner": "debbiezarb", "likes": 37}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["viralreels", "50cent", "netflix", "viralvideos", "funnymemes", "viralvideos", "thief"]},
{"media_id": 3783256363959614017, "shortcode": "DSA055UDHpB", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DSA055UDHpB/", "taken_at": "2025-12-08T18:42:14", "caption": "How can you send a learner driver to war and I’m not even allowed on the motorway with learner plates I’m fuming #tank #war #help #uk #instadaily", "owner_username": "tom_jones_wales", "owner_id": "48897754460", "likes": 31922, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0036_DSA055UDHpB\\DSA055UDHpB_20251208_184214.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18122910934524089, "text": "I did a tank driving test in 1997. It had L plates on......", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:12:34", "owner": "belgian_malinois_champi", "likes": 2741}, {"id": 17943501885094223, "text": "'A vehicle steered by its tracks' is a driving licence category requiring a separate test. Therefore you need to take a specific test to drive a tank (or bulldozer for that matter) on the road, hence the L plates.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:58:23", "owner": "mcmartface8", "likes": 1388}, {"id": 18137400748461752, "text": "Not really sending them to war is it", "created_at": "2025-12-08T20:04:23", "owner": "jonathan.daniel.mcnamara", "likes": 201}, {"id": 17969527994830408, "text": "Wait till he finds out the Warrior IFV can turn on the spot 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T00:20:31", "owner": "markoneill14", "likes": 364}, {"id": 17959261058881867, "text": "How did this guy think they prepare drivers for tanks?", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:43:29", "owner": "something_beans_", "likes": 28}, {"id": 18091116163746471, "text": "Just back from Castlemartin after their Driving Test 👍😎", "created_at": "2025-12-08T18:45:25", "owner": "kxtdesign", "likes": 30}, {"id": 17988777686910944, "text": "“Oi mate, you got a loicense for dat tank?”", "created_at": "2025-12-09T01:13:13", "owner": "w0lfr0gue_ii", "likes": 94}, {"id": 18077408179976719, "text": "\"Three point turn\"...? Google \"Chieftain Neutral Turn\" and prepare to have your mind blown... 🤘🤪", "created_at": "2025-12-09T10:20:26", "owner": "yellowjack165", "likes": 155}, {"id": 17866695012511938, "text": "You're better than this, everybody needs to learn and the L plates are to keep others safe...", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:02:40", "owner": "sarahrushton_851", "likes": 95}, {"id": 18322160779168774, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-08T21:56:17", "owner": "peterd26997", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17904409962317495, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:51:40", "owner": "anastaba626gmail.com3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057462248644551, "text": "How the fuck else are they gonna learn", "created_at": "2025-12-09T19:10:05", "owner": "thezenarck550", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18185250622350134, "text": "We had L plates on Tracked Rapier vehicles at Bovington 1989", "created_at": "2025-12-09T08:26:03", "owner": "streetkeithg", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18546581683035050, "text": "In a tank, it’s a one point pivot", "created_at": "2025-12-09T10:01:30", "owner": "bo_francisco_films", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18052769474345850, "text": "I had L plates on my tank when I was learning to drive it. No need for a 3 point turn when a neutral turn is an option. Xx", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:59:47", "owner": "dannyhammer10", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18398210398130978, "text": "It's not a tank!", "created_at": "2025-12-08T20:30:58", "owner": "jwcchristiansen", "likes": 37}, {"id": 18075690647255409, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:17:06", "owner": "benhaughin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073740938593734, "text": "More interested in what’s carrying the “Tank” 👀👀👀👀", "created_at": "2025-12-09T08:25:47", "owner": "british_army_tank_transporting", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18085658747035563, "text": "Not a tank but easy to drive", "created_at": "2025-12-09T08:54:51", "owner": "chrismileman", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17957635385891802, "text": "Not a tank", "created_at": "2025-12-09T06:23:39", "owner": "tomkinson.brian", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17902077366335256, "text": "What do you thinj you dont need to conduct a track licence qual and learn “to drive a tracked vehicle” or do u think its not got to be road legal", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:00:34", "owner": "georgie_b027", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18070097561096756, "text": "well you do have to take a test to drive them", "created_at": "2025-12-09T20:48:33", "owner": "bootneck_mark1664", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17981103623778064, "text": "As a tank driver this is funny . But it’s tough to learn how to drive a tank when u never drive any vehicle before", "created_at": "2025-12-10T02:43:53", "owner": "ron.lch03", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100611907814964, "text": "@cooldude78212 @nthn1l @bilal_husse99 shall we lowk pull up to uni in a tank tomorrow", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:54:29", "owner": "hamzad10837", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17873415480459900, "text": "We don’t 3 point turn . We pivot 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T02:44:20", "owner": "ron.lch03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18418263916141403, "text": "@thefarminggardener91", "created_at": "2025-12-12T17:25:01", "owner": "sunshine_coast_girl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17866294704513862, "text": "I taught them to drive warriors while in army it was scarey 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T21:04:08", "owner": "montylewiscoryn", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18087669851061938, "text": "When I did the test, yes 3 point turn was a requirement, emergency stop etc. and not flattening other road users (despite their best efforts)", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:52:14", "owner": "mikehodgson12", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18541981345030974, "text": "It isn't a tank .", "created_at": "2025-12-08T20:13:51", "owner": "philip.rawlinson.16", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18162393739398381, "text": "They are not thanks 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T21:00:12", "owner": "ken.wilkinson.944", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844814509628190, "text": "Not a tank", "created_at": "2025-12-09T05:14:12", "owner": "terence_1245", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18178580701367633, "text": "Got to learn at some point 👏", "created_at": "2025-12-08T18:51:23", "owner": "katpat17", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18044170964489325, "text": "IFV nya dari Surabaya? Plat L", "created_at": "2025-12-10T01:34:05", "owner": "diablo_san4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086188838061546, "text": "\"Okay, you passed the U-turn test. Now drive over those enemy soldiers. Okay, good, make sure you get all of them... great. Alright, you pass, congratulations!\"", "created_at": "2025-12-13T15:53:12", "owner": "earthandwatertreks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920848642203215, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T20:12:53", "owner": "kh2724_200", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101629444691112, "text": "Tanks don't need 3 point turns.... They can literally rotate around its axis.", "created_at": "2025-12-12T13:29:46", "owner": "iertje.de.boomkikker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18436934185104469, "text": "To be road legal, a vehicle is required to carry plates, irrespective of ownership or type of vehicle.", "created_at": "2025-12-12T13:29:02", "owner": "iertje.de.boomkikker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869972386479243, "text": "You can send anyone to war🙄", "created_at": "2025-12-12T03:10:56", "owner": "shaneetrulls", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18398537479135185, "text": "Ffs ppl Dk wat a driving lesson is for a tanker crew ?", "created_at": "2025-12-12T01:56:01", "owner": "jscottdrake14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18173114371327924, "text": "How do you think they learn to drive them 😂 and it's not a tank 🤪", "created_at": "2025-12-11T19:05:02", "owner": "geldydrift", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305858686268676, "text": "How els are they supose to lern", "created_at": "2025-12-11T16:47:39", "owner": "the_tvdm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933904003130240, "text": "It's similar to L plates on buses and lorries. The L plate isn't they are a overall learner it's that they are going for that specific licence class.", "created_at": "2025-12-11T13:40:52", "owner": "rosswithers3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086462320840050, "text": "Easier to drive than a car tbh lol", "created_at": "2025-12-11T09:52:08", "owner": "bendavies589", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058646303638662, "text": "Having been in the army, do you think we just spontaneously learn how to drive military vehicles by being in the military?", "created_at": "2025-12-10T23:47:50", "owner": "jethrowegener", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142387489459205, "text": "You don't really have the smarts do you", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:06:52", "owner": "valter_35mm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084792959024343, "text": "It’s not a tank….its an IFV…great fun to drive…", "created_at": "2025-12-10T18:56:11", "owner": "alex_highlander285", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545114059051760, "text": "I’m not surprised. Tanks are enormous. If you think you can operate one without training, you’re sorely mistaken. You know how when you’re driving the Rhino tank in Grand Theft Auto, you can both drive the tank and aim and shoot the turret gun? That’s grossly inaccurate. It actually takes several people to operate a tank. One to drive it, one to operate the turret gun and yet another to load the shells into the turret gun.", "created_at": "2025-12-10T18:13:24", "owner": "supercar5522", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113955121579850, "text": "Fahrschule… did my learner course in Germany", "created_at": "2025-12-10T17:01:48", "owner": "09ea63", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103213549675616, "text": "Not a tank. Not going to war. And finally, how do you train armoured fighting vehicles drivers ? Answer that and make your brains work.", "created_at": "2025-12-10T16:40:08", "owner": "trap_r04ch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088549985287905, "text": "You shouldn’t be on your phone whilst driving 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T15:51:44", "owner": "mrbusinessfitness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084917288022186, "text": "Wait until he realizes a licence is not usually required in war", "created_at": "2025-12-10T14:50:47", "owner": "mesi_mum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337561165235981, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T11:42:47", "owner": "cindysassie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092966375494949, "text": "Which tank is this", "created_at": "2025-12-10T10:43:11", "owner": "a33idk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956747188040496, "text": "Join up and you can....", "created_at": "2025-12-10T10:00:18", "owner": "jim_c6446", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992410515728567, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T09:59:07", "owner": "jonnyfkp37", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090491776758822, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T09:22:29", "owner": "jessthurston23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942091393089040, "text": "Not a tank.", "created_at": "2025-12-10T08:55:39", "owner": "moabdestroyer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088477813800272, "text": "They’re not learner drivers, they will have to hold a Cat B license before they can be trained on tracked vehicles in order to get their Cat H.  Please also note, it’s not a tank!!!!", "created_at": "2025-12-10T08:36:56", "owner": "stm2593", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18275190454303381, "text": "At the back of the trailer too.' L' Long vehicle warning?", "created_at": "2025-12-10T05:07:56", "owner": "rajk0431", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033747509529384, "text": "Quick question do you even need to do a three point turn in a tank?😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T04:53:21", "owner": "bollocks1812", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156190387413742, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T02:47:32", "owner": "aesthetich_writer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540834391062416, "text": "You can draft one", "created_at": "2025-12-10T01:36:44", "owner": "unc_sage", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927014242171757, "text": "Of all the drivers I've ever had the pleasure of working with, military trained guys are hands down the best out there.", "created_at": "2025-12-10T01:30:01", "owner": "colmscottbaird", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091639762930657, "text": "You dont need to do a 3 point turn because the tank should be using skidsteers, spins on a dime", "created_at": "2025-12-10T01:15:37", "owner": "how_to_hide_a_body", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972038352973738, "text": "kier  would do anything to make us all learn to drive a tank from the age of 16 to 40 yrs old.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T23:50:57", "owner": "anthony.chopra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100406533755421, "text": "You can do a one point turn in a tank 💀", "created_at": "2025-12-09T22:40:20", "owner": "joshdlanigan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066671843431068, "text": "firstly not a tank. secondly you need to be qualified to drive it as it’s different to a car", "created_at": "2025-12-09T22:08:01", "owner": "archie.brown.n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18247287013293084, "text": "@pin_quill", "created_at": "2025-12-09T22:04:11", "owner": "miss_steam_me", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096659032894092, "text": "Don’t do a 3 point turn in a tank, those fucking things 360 on 50p turning circle. Straight up kinky manoeuvres in those beasts", "created_at": "2025-12-09T21:27:14", "owner": "chrishorner32", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18436023673106976, "text": "Same here in Sweden. The tank drivers start learning on Volvo and Scania trucks and then go over to armoured vehicles before they take the civilian truck license", "created_at": "2025-12-09T21:02:28", "owner": "h_ericsson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100163482761627, "text": "😳😳😳", "created_at": "2025-12-09T20:04:50", "owner": "adz981s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18413925244139026, "text": "Nah nah it's an infuriating and brilliant tactic", "created_at": "2025-12-09T19:42:06", "owner": "foxywaiter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968593266833751, "text": "You do something better in a tracked vehicle. A neutral turn. There is 1 point.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T19:14:31", "owner": "where_is_reee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034620368749476, "text": "War the best place for a learner driver", "created_at": "2025-12-09T18:33:49", "owner": "basko.80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967409055840103, "text": "What's worse than being stuck behind a learner driver? BEING STUCK TWO OF THE SELFISH PR-", "created_at": "2025-12-09T18:28:19", "owner": "goats_of_gains", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086168684046152, "text": "Is not a tank. Is an APC. armoured personnel carrier. A scimitar to be precise", "created_at": "2025-12-09T17:56:33", "owner": "brierleybobby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869881063481755, "text": "Don't need to do a 3 point turn in a tank you can just run everything over", "created_at": "2025-12-09T17:42:04", "owner": "russellwilliamsonphoto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108059272712096, "text": "The way this Country is going,  I would happily buy a used APV for the Price of a Ford Mondeo! Space for 12+ personnel,  and a 30 mm cannon included. A Bargain! 👍🏻😂🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:59:21", "owner": "matt409157", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087792029074274, "text": "Do ppl not understand that soldiers train holy fuck ppl are stupid", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:55:18", "owner": "lee699018", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972766647964689, "text": "How do you think they get their H class?", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:51:00", "owner": "pauledwards396", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028582712567867, "text": "…how do you expect them to learn to drive? and those are IFV’s not Tanks", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:32:06", "owner": "hhill.04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072088028342622, "text": "Not a tank but easy to drive", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:55:51", "owner": "challenger_2mbt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101140573753222, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:41:23", "owner": "shadowblade976", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367024672089075, "text": "Tanks can do 0 point turns mate…\nThey can spin one track in reverse and the other forwards to turn on the spot", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:02:13", "owner": "alex.of.the.w.variety", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902521891302357, "text": "No need to do a three point turn just out the tracks in opposite directions at equal speed and it’ll speed at its centre point.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:51:41", "owner": "mythic_darkness1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078794270333267, "text": "The other day here the base was arriving the LAVs through town, had big ol' \"Student Driver\" banners on them", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:50:27", "owner": "thecamotrooper", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085074242029793, "text": "OSHKOSH", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:38:56", "owner": "3wmason", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057830171646783, "text": "No 3 point turn, you neutral ground. Passed my H licence tank in a Challenger 2.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:37:03", "owner": "marcus_cribb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861626344547525, "text": "Nah it's the truck drier that's the learner 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:34:02", "owner": "animalbru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18391083064181687, "text": "@cool501.st", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:24:03", "owner": "mani_m.s.19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048513800442552, "text": "fun fact! You don’t need a US drivers license to be qualified on a military vehicle!", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:22:00", "owner": "jeremyt_78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069072158607605, "text": "It's not a Learners on a tank it's a LUNATIC IN DEVELOPMENT.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:56:03", "owner": "g.ovanuhoroskopu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302044003282289, "text": "WRITE YOUR OWN SUBTITLES FFS, STOP USING AI SLOP. WTF IS THE POINT OF HAVING SUBTITLES IF THEY'RE NOT FKING CORRECT???", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:52:27", "owner": "notxander.private", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957962134010244, "text": "Learner drivers can take motorway driving lessons with an approved driving instructor on motorways in England, Scotland and Wales.\nIn order to do this learner drivers must be:\naccompanied by an approved driving instructor\ndriving a car fitted with dual controls\nthe vehicle must display L-plates to the front and rear", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:12:14", "owner": "rf398_the_spirit_lives_on", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064299479188728, "text": "Were you born with an innate ability to drive a AFV or Tank?? Of course they have L-plates on, you numpty.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:04:46", "owner": "rogtrog", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948080145935407, "text": "Jokes aside they do have training vehicles based on tank chassis", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:02:44", "owner": "crimsoncarnotaurus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956760976019554, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:48:42", "owner": "jenniferkeyes17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071288360590452, "text": "Can you get tanks in the UK? That sounds so cool", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:41:06", "owner": "___apratham___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897908827199506, "text": "I had L plates on the lorry that I learnt in.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:34:56", "owner": "cs6000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114811234513745, "text": "Well people aren't born knowing how to drive a tank 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:30:19", "owner": "kingstonmike", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079043183180302, "text": "bay parks are always easy though", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:27:28", "owner": "vacxnt_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933387403110248, "text": "Never mind on the back of a lorry, I’ve been behind one on the road with L plates 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:46:29", "owner": "littleun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075118007260100, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T10:59:34", "owner": "ddebbs63", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18348732667207425, "text": "To be fair, a tank swerving out of control towards the enemy is a pretty good intimidation tactic 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T10:45:28", "owner": "fattulk123gaming", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18212337418310790, "text": "And people want to go to war for the bureaucratic EU? 🤣🤦", "created_at": "2025-12-09T10:13:37", "owner": "richariri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118677994605601, "text": "It’s an L standing for Lost hearing from the Ajaz", "created_at": "2025-12-09T09:54:20", "owner": "boz.227", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18186222388346045, "text": "3 point turn in tank ? Bruh that is just spin lol", "created_at": "2025-12-09T09:53:24", "owner": "yea_bunny_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084996410011205, "text": "Not a tank 🤦🏻‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-12-09T09:35:14", "owner": "salop_matt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071237006601563, "text": "When you see L plates on a commercial jet then you can moan.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T09:17:50", "owner": "maurice_oneill123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544945561017123, "text": "Not tanks", "created_at": "2025-12-09T08:52:18", "owner": "oliver_addison616", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094770172909231, "text": "…..well….you have to train and then do the course….then take a test….its a category of vehicle that will …on occasion share the road with civilian vehicles…. Ffs", "created_at": "2025-12-09T08:32:11", "owner": "goolie845", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842402854652160, "text": "Not a tank.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T08:14:36", "owner": "dougall6003", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041252492716197, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T08:10:06", "owner": "kensington_portraits", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18511765777070453, "text": "Send them in to Gaza and say \"here you go. That is your kindergarten track come back when you get low on fuel\".", "created_at": "2025-12-09T08:06:13", "owner": "kissbelle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876882481444040, "text": "Some people!!🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T08:00:35", "owner": "nobby_pompey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964187212004915, "text": "Military in sweden does the same lol", "created_at": "2025-12-09T07:43:19", "owner": "asp_rasmus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085350914099682, "text": "What dors it matter when its on a low loader you melt", "created_at": "2025-12-09T07:40:22", "owner": "wobbly_dangly_ones", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075004160201393, "text": "Also, its an Infantry Fighting Vehicle not a tank.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T07:13:14", "owner": "richards_armour_models", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063138758627464, "text": "@llamedos_reknaw I’d beg to differ ya sheep shagging bumda", "created_at": "2025-12-09T07:09:06", "owner": "jimmyb_boxing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063260756199816, "text": "M8 id day its more dangerous to send a learner, they gonna be running over the enemy", "created_at": "2025-12-09T06:59:09", "owner": "matthew.nigh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095043040879776, "text": "Tanks are literally the best vehicles to do a 3 point turn in .", "created_at": "2025-12-09T06:55:50", "owner": "doc_do_little_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091883056914818, "text": "I'm sure there is a bit in a driving test about using mobile phones while driving..... especially on a motorway", "created_at": "2025-12-09T06:53:54", "owner": "rob_1359", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088901251792267, "text": "Haha, there is a 3 point turn on the “tank” practical, I took my test day after my 18th birthday!💪🏻", "created_at": "2025-12-09T06:46:32", "owner": "dirtyrecymech", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088898312310946, "text": "Yeah mate people have to learn how to drive them", "created_at": "2025-12-09T06:44:04", "owner": "cal.w00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047679191439259, "text": "Yea you just join up and automatically have the skills and license to drive said armoured vehicles (not tanks).", "created_at": "2025-12-09T06:41:47", "owner": "bike.r2476", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094663475504902, "text": "Not a tank, but yes in most countries its more legal to own and drive a tank than anything tesla makes or elon musk comes up with", "created_at": "2025-12-09T06:36:20", "owner": "kenneth_albert_wright", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968876151834814, "text": "“It’s not a tank”", "created_at": "2025-12-09T06:35:41", "owner": "joconocoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906381232280524, "text": "Think its like a H license or soke shit", "created_at": "2025-12-09T05:51:54", "owner": "j.rule04", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18136370539474931, "text": "U need a specific license to drive tanks on UK roads and they require L plates fuck knows why", "created_at": "2025-12-09T05:51:42", "owner": "j.rule04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930672103077867, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T05:50:13", "owner": "zermmmmmmmmmmm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115187836513738, "text": "Why would you want to do a 3 point turn in a tank when you can just turn 360°", "created_at": "2025-12-09T02:17:01", "owner": "davycr0ck3tt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18168076774344293, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-09T02:05:51", "owner": "635pathfinder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908822515270080, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T00:26:29", "owner": "ashleehitching_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896390527359664, "text": "Not worried about the L plate it's the green P plate I'd be 😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-12-08T23:53:43", "owner": "philgoss36", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18194689762333521, "text": "If i remember correctly,  the army gives you a drivers licence if you are working for them and become part of the RAC", "created_at": "2025-12-08T23:36:21", "owner": "quey_gim__knewts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888376879393007, "text": "I reckon you need to hit up the boys at @tanksalot432 and book a quick driving lesson.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T23:18:27", "owner": "tobiasmills", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18349557415204112, "text": "How else you supposed to train them 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T22:24:47", "owner": "silentblade63", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079139705269548, "text": "Don't be a whopper everyone needs to learn and last I'd heard we hadn't gone to war with you sheep botherers", "created_at": "2025-12-08T21:46:25", "owner": "dsc085", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842492131643384, "text": "You have to learn how to drive them .😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T21:29:34", "owner": "martinsaceandneverwrongfacefuk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096505051858131, "text": "I used to teach people to drive them….", "created_at": "2025-12-08T21:24:22", "owner": "mattemberton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066078200390555, "text": "Yip you kin you kin spin it on a 5p as their track driven I took ma test in 74  in the Munster training area in a 432 APC  ma licence says a kin drive any track vehicle", "created_at": "2025-12-08T21:06:03", "owner": "johnsomervillejnr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892142005379947, "text": "😂they’ve got to learn at some point mun 😂😂🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-08T20:46:42", "owner": "christinephillips4185", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368424988091579, "text": "They were the days", "created_at": "2025-12-08T20:36:35", "owner": "neilbromuk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122865661520866, "text": "Gotta learn somewhere", "created_at": "2025-12-08T20:33:51", "owner": "hipster_jesus99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007482086817383, "text": "You can do a 3 point turn but don’t need to when you can neutral the mother dunker 👍💪👍🇬🇧", "created_at": "2025-12-08T20:07:21", "owner": "perrott.simon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927980626155564, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:51:07", "owner": "stevehydes111111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863466418539594, "text": "Made me wonder if helicopter pilots have L plates 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:48:58", "owner": "kingbracebridge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069921968457871, "text": "I saw them after they were off loaded.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:25:47", "owner": "gazjardine", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["tank", "war", "help", "uk", "instadaily"]},
{"media_id": 3781704573912931393, "shortcode": "DR7UEYNjNxB", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DR7UEYNjNxB/", "taken_at": "2025-12-06T15:18:57", "caption": "I’ve defrosted… ski season is finally here ❄️\n\nPrepare to be sick of me 🤪 My fav pics from last season with @lorealparis by @rebeccaspencer_photography 📸\n\n*fun fact I was SO hungover when we took these photos but we powered through 🤣", "owner_username": "isobellorna_", "owner_id": "43957005158", "likes": 124998, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphSidecar", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0037_DR7UEYNjNxB\\DR7UEYNjNxB_20251206_151857_1.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0037_DR7UEYNjNxB\\DR7UEYNjNxB_20251206_151857_2.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0037_DR7UEYNjNxB\\DR7UEYNjNxB_20251206_151857_3.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0037_DR7UEYNjNxB\\DR7UEYNjNxB_20251206_151857_4.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0037_DR7UEYNjNxB\\DR7UEYNjNxB_20251206_151857_5.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0037_DR7UEYNjNxB\\DR7UEYNjNxB_20251206_151857_6.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": 18410071528191593, "text": "The heels!!!", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:29:33", "owner": "withsophiayu", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18173376541372620, "text": "Iconic", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:21:03", "owner": "emthenutritionist", "likes": 122}, {"id": 18096120091868392, "text": "Have you ever thought about a collaboration of some sorts with @victoriabeckham ? You're giving me Victoria vibes, and I think she would probably love you ❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:00:36", "owner": "jovibennisonofficial", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18100971043689597, "text": "This needs to be framed 🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:01:34", "owner": "aleeyce", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18060284630268478, "text": "Worst pics of ski ever seen. Congratulations", "created_at": "2025-12-07T22:56:50", "owner": "evll17", "likes": 246}, {"id": 18089469658769559, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-12-07T16:10:00", "owner": "saraprincess20", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17869395339474690, "text": "@m.iles probably quite annoying skiing with her…", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:41:41", "owner": "henryporpora", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18064916078445735, "text": "i remember this trip. Lots of men telling you you couldn’t ski. Despite the fact you were doing controlled turns.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:06:47", "owner": "morgan_ersk", "likes": 79}, {"id": 18394167931130594, "text": "She IS the moment 🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-10T10:57:34", "owner": "amelia_dolores", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17848944453609572, "text": "Fantastic photo ❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-08T09:56:15", "owner": "portmanboutiques", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18036757469718863, "text": "Can’t wait to see what this ski season has in store 🙌for", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:28:31", "owner": "ruanuaofficial", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18062598791541399, "text": "Still remember these photos", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:36:27", "owner": "sarah_olivia_rose", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18106875286638009, "text": "This is iconic quite frankly", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:17:05", "owner": "lifeofjodes_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18050091158401520, "text": "Iconic omg😍", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:55:54", "owner": "lindsaysolmer", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18077825573243212, "text": "I remember these like they were yesterday!!! 😍", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:37:31", "owner": "miss.jacquelyn_", "likes": 35}, {"id": 18111942514592769, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-07T12:23:40", "owner": "exclusivebutik.pl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086135909511482, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:25:52", "owner": "iamnotapplicable", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18110367928720504, "text": "Omggg love thissss sooo diva 🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:28:08", "owner": "keetemuort", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18095968096849905, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:16:05", "owner": "anastasiabampali", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18103648402668525, "text": "I REMEMBER THESE 🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:58:40", "owner": "krithy_kumar",