{"media_id": 3780428892306918799, "shortcode": "DR2yAxIk82P", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DR2yAxIk82P/", "taken_at": "2025-12-04T21:04:42", "caption": "日本利用压电瓷砖将脚步转化为电能。这些瓷砖捕捉\n来自你脚步的动能。当你行走时,你的重量和动作会\n对瓷砖产生压力。瓷砖会轻微弯曲,从而产生机械应\n力。瓷砖内部的压电材料将这种应力转化为电能。每\n一步都会产生少量电荷,而数百万步结合在一起就能\n产生足够的电力来驱动 LED 灯、数显示屏和传感\n器。在像涩谷车站这样繁忙的地方, 天大约有 240\n万个脚步为这一系统作出贡献。这些电能可以被储存\n或立即使用,从而减少对传统电力来源的依赖,并支\n持可持续的城市基础设施。这种方法将日常运动转化\n为实用的可再生能源 #日本#知识 ##实 #你知道吗\n#推荐 #科技#创新 #历史 技技 实验 #热门", "owner_username": "savagesnipeshq", "owner_id": "61259600920", "likes": 25959, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0038_DR2yAxIk82P\\DR2yAxIk82P_20251204_210442.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17909863128266421, "text": "Someone's darling little sweet innocent son and brother", "created_at": "2025-12-06T06:13:02", "owner": "thatmedschoolguy", "likes": 2268}, {"id": 18098134612795050, "text": "So glad I’m single", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:15:01", "owner": "tanner_slayden", "likes": 2891}, {"id": 17870921943398578, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T13:26:13", "owner": "_sebba_er", "likes": 132}, {"id": 17917888347228854, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:29:50", "owner": "juanluisjr", "likes": 655}, {"id": 18072326063595972, "text": "Isn't it so hot?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T15:43:18", "owner": "sanaya_lives", "likes": 26}, {"id": 18306217858267839, "text": "Not just someone's future wife even someone's future husband's too...", "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:08:59", "owner": "inkwhisperer_0", "likes": 325}, {"id": 17842494336644044, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-08T21:32:39", "owner": "logandame07", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17950869453047873, "text": "Reminds me of why i like being single", "created_at": "2025-12-09T21:22:09", "owner": "bullsh1tm4n.jr", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17845715445607296, "text": "I’ll take a gay son", "created_at": "2025-12-06T08:14:34", "owner": "viktorengstedt", "likes": 1050}, {"id": 17965321629003619, "text": "", "created