{"media_id": 3767946659415329734, "shortcode": "DRKb4X3EgvG", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRKb4X3EgvG/", "taken_at": "2025-11-17T15:48:56", "caption": "Am I straight enough yet? \n直的起來嗎？Twink其實是小鮮肉的意思\n（在這情境應該可以直翻成0️⃣）\n\n#好笑 #trendy #迷因 #memesdaily #viralreels #有趣 #funny #funnyreelsvideo #分享 #twink #handsome #イケメン #男男 #男朋友 #gay #gaystagram #cute #可愛 #可愛い #搞笑影片 #boysloveboys #boyslove", "owner_username": "d______avi______d", "owner_id": "567601478", "likes": 26975, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0039_DRKb4X3EgvG\\DRKb4X3EgvG_20251117_154856.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18414728611137559, "text": "At least tag @itsbengrosskopf for credit", "created_at": "2025-11-19T00:36:14", "owner": "danielgreenberg_22", "likes": 200}, {"id": 17952845685024891, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T03:39:47", "owner": "calebshinobi", "likes": 41}, {"id": 18200311867319488, "text": "😁", "created_at": "2025-11-17T20:16:17", "owner": "daviddekoninck", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18154356094413137, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T22:25:23", "owner": "drew_shava", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18083997488514404, "text": "HAHAHAHAHA 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-19T00:59:52", "owner": "juuunordonez", "likes": 41}, {"id": 18213306799308634, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-19T06:17:23", "owner": "verseswitharpit", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17901102831325016, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T17:11:37", "owner": "saki_ito_0223", "likes": 187}, {"id": 18145638034429765, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T04:01:57", "owner": "liangyatang", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17909076711123056, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T03:15:14", "owner": "itsdaulay", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18099430747810493, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T17:09:55", "owner": "medlenvojta", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18438805762102751, "text": "This is me….", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:35:12", "owner": "willie_07_06", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17849520828563991, "text": 