{"media_id": 3781957413621644826, "shortcode": "DR8Njrikr4a", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DR8Njrikr4a/", "taken_at": "2025-12-06T23:41:40", "caption": "1.\tI spent nine nights alone in a hotel room, trying to convince myself I wasn’t as lonely as I felt.\n\t2.\tI went on nine different dates — nine different men — hoping one of them would make me forget how empty everything had become.\n\t3.\tNight 1 was sweet, but he only talked about his ex.\nNight 2 was fun, but he disappeared the next morning.\n\t4.\tBy Night 3, I started pretending I was okay… smiling, laughing, acting like the girl who “has it all under control.”\n\t5.\tNight 4 told me I was “too emotional,”\nNight 5 told me I was “too quiet.”\nNight 6 told me I was “too much.”\n\t6.\tNight 7 didn’t even look at me — he scrolled on his phone while I talked.\n\t7.\tNight 8 said he “loved my energy”… then asked if I had any friends for him too.\n\t8.\tAnd Night 9… the one I thought might finally be different… left without saying goodbye.\n\t9.\tI went back to my hotel bed every night, wiping my makeup off and telling myself it was fine — that tomorrow would be better.\n\t10.\tBut the truth is… every new date made me feel smaller, cheaper, easier to replace.\n\t11.\tBy the end of the trip, I realized I wasn’t searching for love — I was just trying to fill a silence that kept getting louder.\n\t12.\tAnd that’s why I cried in that hotel room — not because of them, but because I finally admitted how lonely I really was.\n\nIf you want to talk to me or just make me feel less alone tonight… my link is in bio. 💗\n.\n.\n.\n#foryou #fyp #foryoupage💙 #foryoupage #foryourpage #lmao #funny #fypage #fypシ #viral #explore #explorer #explorerpage #reels", "owner_username": "louniiiiia", "owner_id": "530265823", "likes": 17876, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0040_DR8Njrikr4a\\DR8Njrikr4a_20251206_234140.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18076993604336918, "text": "So you 