", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087565313049793, "text": "Bonny black?", "created_at": "2025-12-10T05:52:59", "owner": "cruijsm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148661269427555, "text": "The caption still doesn't explain the police cars?", "created_at": "2025-12-10T05:39:57", "owner": "lukelawson1221", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890569090388910, "text": "You need God. I’ve been in a very similar situation as you. I was lost and going from girl to girl looking for someone to fill a hole in my heart. One day at a church camp it hit me. I didn’t need a person. I needed God. I made the best decision of my life that night and got baptized the next day. I’ve been happier than I ever have after that. It’s been around 4 years since then and I’m so much better than I used to be. You probably won’t see this but hopefully it reaches the right people. I will be praying for you.", "created_at": "2025-12-10T05:38:25", "owner": "htxjperk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088889464952143, "text": "😝", "created_at": "2025-12-10T05:31:15", "owner": "slutty.zoya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146078077439650, "text": "A Lock that is opened by 9 different keys isnt a Good Lock.", "created_at": "2025-12-10T05:27:20", "owner": "syrianleo195", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087390127952881, "text": "7 is a g😎", "created_at": "2025-12-10T05:26:12", "owner": "atxhoodreacts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011290937808550, "text": "Cum bucket", "created_at": "2025-12-10T05:24:22", "owner": "aarontargett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543934351002022, "text": "4 the streets", "created_at": "2025-12-10T05:15:25", "owner": "theonewhoknowsit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18328733113246445, "text": "Whole video available, just skip the ad... https://shrinkme.io/Kings", "created_at": "2025-12-10T05:03:44", "owner": "r.atedrose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998544690705707, "text": "My culture is not your whore reel music", "created_at": "2025-12-10T04:37:58", "owner": "gabeherronlyfans", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977764029948815, "text": "Murder :(", "created_at": "2025-12-10T