: 18087054593071033, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T00:46:33", "owner": "huechihuenupi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872182132467917, "text": "Dm", "created_at": "2025-12-10T00:45:24", "owner": "__gravityisunknown__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866451598438139, "text": "Immigration came in", "created_at": "2025-12-10T00:15:35", "owner": "bizzlehd27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885236533294261, "text": "So you did all that realised how lonely you were and still have an onlyfans make it make sense", "created_at": "2025-12-09T23:49:00", "owner": "g.jennings06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165640084384459, "text": "When did prostitutes become so bold? 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T23:35:18", "owner": "hollywood_dgaf12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18391726468176224, "text": "Gay", "created_at": "2025-12-09T23:29:34", "owner": "jessihertwig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956515675014577, "text": "Yuck", "created_at": "2025-12-09T22:55:57", "owner": "lagoslocos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065548061171255, "text": "OFdetected opinion rejected", "created_at": "2025-12-09T22:54:01", "owner": "lizardlicker1776", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303739528250190, "text": "OF DETECTED OPINIONS REJECTED", "created_at": "2025-12-09T22:44:49", "owner": "austinchan6127", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050523578391268, "text": "But why the cops where there? I read all of the text", "created_at": "2025-12-09T22:40:33", "owner": "koebi_tboy_tg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101537755687670, "text": "Nigga ain't no one care", "created_at": "2025-12-09T22:28:38", "owner": "m3ntal.d1s0rd3r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972528606969610, "text": "How bout therapy, make friends, pick up bird watching nah ho out instead 😭✌️", "created_at": "2025-12-09T21:36:27", "owner": "urfavjesus.fr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090375263301657, "text": "I feel same to😢", "created_at": "2025-12-09T21:18:01", "owner": "poy13205", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120056650536228, "text": "Failed parenting", "created_at": "2025-12-09T21:05:36", "owner": "dylan_leonard1998", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18292489159285049, "text": "She made 10 mistakes and had a new excuse everytime, not one time did she say I am tripping, I am wrong, women...😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T20:34:14", "owner": "bigmanxi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034826384526011, "text": "Haha nice", "created_at": "2025-12-09T18:36:32", "owner": "nessi_mag_texi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049353629425172, "text": "whore", "created_at": "2025-12-09T18:17:45", "owner": "arfanzaman_sora", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057569708311805, "text": "Men… do better than to lay with a woman with no self respect. Look for a wife not a prostitute", "created_at": "2025-12-09T17:37:14", "owner": "sir_trinidad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000502415838686, "text": "Deserved", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:10:14", "owner": "eagle.1447", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895532446223324, "text": "Hi", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:37:18", "owner": "kosinski.alan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093901043495311, "text": "Well yeah", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:54:14", "owner": "spicymcchickens69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994911513715868, "text": "Yo,if u feel THAT bad,I'd talk 2 u-just msg me,ok,?!", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:43:12", "owner": "orig.bigjohn74", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886143559288891, "text": "I’m glad you came to this realization it’s the first step you take in getting better", "created_at": "2025-12-09T07:00:16", "owner": "n8mare68", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962694108865378, "text": "I hope your dad is already dead", "created_at": "2025-12-09T01:01:19", "owner": "gcga808", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088220177483193, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-08T21:56:19", "owner": "fairouz.a.2022", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070108217595714, "text": "Yeah being lonley really sucks", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:44:41", "owner": "darkflora13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072738062595832, "text": "You should be executed tbh", "created_at": "2025-12-08T02:32:11", "owner": "i_am_defeated", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858350002501968, "text": "Well.. yea", "created_at": "