xt": "不不不，一定是要去賣風鈴了", "created_at": "2025-12-05T15:58:04", "owner": "hsu._.0207", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18188496952341445, "text": "聽著像空的", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:07:34", "owner": "seanchong616", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041594999708177, "text": "保利達，通通都是保利達", "created_at": "2025-12-04T14:17:58", "owner": "wu_xiu_du", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103517374663947, "text": "@da._.ma 是妳嗎", "created_at": "2025-12-04T08:33:32", "owner": "_hau0114_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116958646497774, "text": "聖誕節🎄\n叮叮噹叮叮噹", "created_at": "2025-12-03T08:02:05", "owner": "jack_hsu0.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18436852444100635, "text": "這種規格就是俗稱浪跡天涯小包包", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:50:16", "owner": "chencheyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954545517900610, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:31:44", "owner": "yago1634yago1634", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071606246524410, "text": "你好 請問有賣半島鐵盒嗎", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:37:00", "owner": "peterlee6921", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098605399824709, "text": "跟我一樣😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:33:25", "owner": "andy_hychen", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["三寶藥師", "pov", "tgif"]},
{"media_id": 3783249122862128076, "shortcode": "DSAzQhhAVvM", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DSAzQhhAVvM/", "taken_at": "2025-12-08T18:28:20", "caption": "hello!!! my name is jordan and i work in the american formula series of indycar! i work with drivers and teams to help build brands and market themselves. if your dream is to work in motorsport; follow along! i love showing all the behind the scenes of my work! i started with zero experience, and i love showing you how i got here! \n\n#oscarpiastri #landonorris #mclarenf1 #formula1 #f1 #nascar #indycar #motorsports #abudhabi #abudhabif1 #abudhabigp #racing #sportsmarketing #creativeagency #photography #videography #maxverstappen #redbull #redbullracing #redbullf1 #womeninsports #womeninmotorsport #femalesinsport #businessowner #internship #studentjobs", "owner_username": "jordanagajanian", "owner_id": "10962120", "likes": 714, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0043_DSAzQhhAVvM\\DSAzQhhAVvM_20251208_182820.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": "18185700721351553", "text": "❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-09T04:46:53", "owner": "haseebenterprises1", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17886351183405004", "text": "How does one get into the tech team? That’s a dream of mine is working with a formula team", "created_at": "2025-12-08T18:34:44", "owner": "afk_.jay", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18078901910332416", "text": "U needa do photography for emmmmm", "created_at": "2025-12-08T22:18:18", "owner": "sleepless_photos", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["oscarpiastri", "landonorris", "mclarenf1", "formula1", "f1", "nascar", "indycar", "motorsports", "abudhabi", "abudhabif1", "abudhabigp", "racing", "sportsmarketing", "creativeagency", "photography", "videography", "maxverstappen", "redbull", "redbullracing", "redbullf1", "womeninsports", "womeninmotorsport", "femalesinsport", "businessowner", "internship", "studentjobs"]},
{"media_id": 3759339825829328674, "shortcode": "DQr26dciTci", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DQr26dciTci/", "taken_at": "2025-11-06T13:00:03", "caption": "anywhere but site 🥀\n#r6siege #rainbow6 #rainbow6siege #siegememes #r6memes #rainbow6siegememes", "owner_username": "rainbow6_uk", "owner_id": "16146941746", "likes": 14676, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0044_DQr26dciTci\\DQr26dciTci_20251106_130003.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18086432176786967, "text": "Lmao", "created_at": "2025-11-09T21:50:56", "owner": "supdudechillin", "likes": 14}, {"id": 17867055009474539, "text": "Fix the game", "created_at": "2025-11-10T10:55:09", "owner": "axron_dodo974", "likes": 132}, {"id": 18208002379312543, "text": "Bro in garage", "created_at": "2025-11-13T08:44:14", "owner": "eduardrequena_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17998734872693055, "text": "#savesiege", "created_at": "2025-11-11T17:32:56", "owner": "r4f_sm", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18199118278320968, "text": "Anything but fixing the problems", "created_at": "2025-11-12T10:21:13", "owner": "ef.kl_mute", "likes": 62}, {"id": 18041867810497399, "text": "@tentaxz._ nee thaan da", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:12:12", "owner": "ahamed_usman_46", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17902396737317658, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T07:49:20", "owner": "prestonhughes2002", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18302370634283295, "text": "hello thats me im the amaru with the lunchbox in b when we are rushing 2f", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:41:42", "owner": "gar_lover_uk", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18385694308177268, "text": "Hey ubi, you know how you're no longer a billion dollar company? And you know how we gave you all that money, and kept giving you money but you did nothing but waste it on shitty games and updates that did nothing?", "created_at": "2025-11-10T16:47:34", "owner": "joshsanders21", "likes": 25}, {"id": 18082976834087204, "text": "@ofktu", "created_at": "2025-11-09T12:46:40", "owner": "ur1rz", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18077991215140265, "text": "@william.otoni.silva  @adno99", "created_at": "2025-11-13T16:13:05", "owner": "williamcoelho83", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085302047080805, "text": "@og_jayway", "created_at": "2025-12-12T20:23:41", "owner": "jerry_nash620", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18537741193001307, "text": "Not even bro it’s always some random that spammed for it before we could get it", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:27:08", "owner": "lthompson0619", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18541027255065529, "text": "the best thing is that's is always the rusher (amaru or ash) who have the defuser and aren't on site when it's clear", "created_at": "2025-12-12T05:05:58", "owner": "nekomata_mottsii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852269128598500, "text": "Nah an Amaru would be dead by then", "created_at": "2025-12-12T04:53:49", "owner": "beckbanta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085904050989729, "text": "Revert it back to how it was during White Noise. Hands down the best season", "created_at": "2025-12-11T03:35:09", "owner": "sleepyjoe_42069", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085814942025158, "text": "@sebasguzmaaan", "created_at": "2025-12-10T22:22:13", "owner": "rtg.theisen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546069106010952, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-12-10T08:48:24", "owner": "pumpkinguns.r6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920194642206622, "text": "Always the one with defuser is on the last enemy and fighting each other 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T14:22:51", "owner": "leon.frhbs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067305431436961, "text": "It be like that", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:50:56", "owner": "xxjeffjayxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072749525588651, "text": "@neopolita0", "created_at": "2025-12-03T05:48:12", "owner": "sawi2345", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061372256537066, "text": "every time", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:25:32", "owner": "julies_turn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064297835166789, "text": "Fixing bugs❌ Making memes✅", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:35:12", "owner": "y0ru4ever", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969243264989823, "text": "The one guy at the start of the game who spawns on the other side of the map and drops it", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:18:31", "owner": "pineapplesm00thie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844917004605830, "text": "Ok, that's funny", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:04:54", "owner": "adrien__rb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930011446118848, "text": "I am on a remote island, in the northern most region of alaska….", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:41:57", "owner": "kawfee.beans", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900615982339416, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:36:46", "owner": "itzjhb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853497415580289, "text": "Stop making memes and fix hitbox", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:49:20", "owner": "alejandro_vega.robles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136918699465515, "text": "Droped at spawn", "created_at": "2025-11-23T21:01:50", "owner": "jstwseiira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113102014505366, "text": "@_misag.h", "created_at": "2025-11-20T15:25:38", "owner": "_iambarsam_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884329270285726, "text": "😆", "created_at": "2025-11-19T21:49:35", "owner": "dowdsy01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100480219731713, "text": "😪🫠 I need defuser 24/7", "created_at": "2025-11-19T18:10:57", "owner": "iamshortiie_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915847000217373, "text": "Ok that is funny😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T08:56:03", "owner": "erikurfi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047303306691738, "text": "@d.amnp.b", "created_at": "2025-11-18T04:56:23", "owner": "nima_c2h4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043201889701999, "text": "Thats why i always drop the defu", "created_at": "2025-11-16T12:19:38", "owner": "weorhe_2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112652482591872, "text": "Fake, amaru would die in the first 10 secs of the round", "created_at": "2025-11-16T10:20:25", "owner": "dovakinusss_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925760806172423, "text": "They had an idea 👏", "created_at": "2025-11-13T20:43:36", "owner": "lmfao.vivi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18225261385307455, "text": "No what’s even better is when the person that had defuser drops it at the beginning of the round thinking their gonna frag out just to be first pick and now we have site control and now defuse 🫩", "created_at": "2025-11-13T02:07:26", "owner": "valide.simus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031075577741772, "text": "@dallas.bln01", "created_at": "2025-11-12T07:32:19", "owner": "joker_aus.24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18335812447239971, "text": "🤣🤣🤣😂", "created_at": "2025-11-12T04:40:49", "owner": "manuelcruz26240", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081846350097424, "text": "@jo._.wrld", "created_at": "2025-11-11T10:00:50", "owner": "david._.stolz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861696418531929, "text": "That one mf that got killed while roaming...", "created_at": "2025-11-09T19:29:55", "owner": "bgliera", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986748405743253, "text": "@ji_ji1170 mamabicho deja a amaru y ven a poner el SEDAX", "created_at": "2025-11-09T18:32:32", "owner": "monkey_lover_33", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["r6siege", "rainbow6", "rainbow6siege", "siegememes", "r6memes", "rainbow6siegememes"]},
{"media_id": 3781837116553312549, "shortcode": "DR7yNIKjDkl", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DR7yNIKjDkl/", "taken_at": "2025-12-06T19:43:12", "caption": "畢咗業睇返以前啲野好戇鳩", "owner_username": "lemon_1130_", "owner_id": "8949268795", "likes": 3969, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0045_DR7yNIKjDkl\\DR7yNIKjDkl_20251206_194312.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18097051291868803, "text": "隔壁班嘉豪😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T08:39:16", "owner": "119_emma_so", "likes": 106}, {"id": 18082619441115290, "text": "別的不說，帥炸了", "created_at": "2025-12-07T15:54:05", "owner": "enyou84", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18105972427646920, "text": "哇塞😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-12-08T03:49:00", "owner": "renjun.lin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18194862301333300, "text": "咁正嘅咩😆🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-08T02:45:27", "owner": "benyuphoto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102470170738529, "text": "超帥", "created_at": "2025-12-11T11:00:47", "owner": "hongan940416", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905275648299186, "text": "有點帥🥴", "created_at": "2025-12-07T11:08:59", "owner": "lin._.04._.1010", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18083824102874480, "text": "咋這麼會拍", "created_at": "2025-12-06T23:39:50", "owner": "iouv7.owo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066924116141171, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-12-08T11:31:19", "owner": "wudishiduoduomojimo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990192792903339, "text": "帅帅的美女", "created_at": "2025-12-07T09:30:20", "owner": "ngs_iukei", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086881874067746, "text": "帥哥？", "created_at": "2025-12-08T12:47:07", "owner": "baixiong369", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933951763076532, "text": "認真咩😮", "created_at": "2025-12-07T10:20:24", "owner": "alan1128hk", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3782223545045177985, "shortcode": "DR9KEZviVaB", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DR9KEZviVaB/", "taken_at": "2025-12-07T08:30:03", "caption": "滑雪控注意啦～準備好你的雪板、滑雪外套，Eurostar今年冬季又推出超方便的雪地專列（Snow Train），從倫敦直達法國阿爾卑斯最熱門滑雪度假村，讓你從城市喧囂直接飛進雪白仙境。\n\n這條高鐵路線，每個滑雪季的星期六早上出發，途經Chambéry、Albertville、Moutiers、Aime-La-Plagne、Landry及Bourg St Maurice（需在Lille換一次車）。回程則在星期日出發，今年更貼心地提供每週兩班回程，方便大家靈活安排行程。\n\n班次詳情：\n去程：倫敦St Pancras International 每週六 09:01（12月20日至3月28日）\n回程：Bourg-Saint-Maurice 每週日 10:54 或 13:45（12月27日至4月4日）\n\n坐火車去阿爾卑斯比飛機更環保，沿途還能欣賞雪山美景，完全是從都市直達冬日仙境的最佳方式。無論是滑雪新手還是老手，Eurostar雪地專列都讓你的阿爾卑斯滑雪行輕鬆又愜意。\n\n下一個週末，就準備登上雪地專列，開啟你的阿爾卑斯冬季小旅行吧～", "owner_username": "seedenjoy", "owner_id": "61724457040", "likes": 1399, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphImage", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0046_DR9KEZviVaB\\DR9KEZviVaB_20251207_083003.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": "17916611034215253", "text": "真棒的旅行方式！🚄⛷️ 從倫敦直達阿爾卑斯滑雪，真是令人興奮的体驗！出國旅行時，別忘了使用 Uncle Sim 漫遊數據服務，隨時分享你的精彩旅程！https://unclesim.net #Eurostar #滑雪 #歐洲旅行 #漫遊數據", "created_at": "2025-12-10T00:05:23", "owner": "unclesim_roaming", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18106406401651217", "text": "超棒", "created_at": "2025-12-08T10:04:11", "owner": "hardtolovejan", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3766942968590724975, "shortcode": "DRG3qv8AW9v", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRG3qv8AW9v/", "taken_at": "2025-11-16T06:31:18", "caption": "04年表妹氣質成熟優雅，顯得97年的我像個土狗 #搞笑 #迷惑行為大賞 #00後 #矮個子", "owner_username": "meo0019980", "owner_id": "76124254819", "likes": 83954, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0047_DRG3qv8AW9v\\DRG3qv8AW9v_20251116_063118.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18061738346242631, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:51:39", "owner": "924_hei_ng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072628616211243, "text": "往好處想，她這身粉紅色夠亮眼，走丟很容易找XD", "created_at": "2025-11-17T02:14:52", "owner": "nick930407", "likes": 4204}, {"id": 17850527664593274, "text": "龍卷跟吹雪嗎？有意思", "created_at": "2025-11-16T23:32:30", "owner": "tulh84", "likes": 177}, {"id": 18139184062409333, "text": "90後都這樣😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T13:12:53", "owner": "masonloyp", "likes": 2716}, {"id": 18128054734501070, "text": "今天怎麼沒有穿男模套裝 更像父母了", "created_at": "2025-11-16T22:36:51", "owner": "onijima_jin", "likes": 1324}, {"id": 17899748658325630, "text": "各有特色😂表妹真的很優雅🌹", "created_at": "2025-11-17T03:46:03", "owner": "aauroraau", "likes": 228}, {"id": 18103813456710187, "text": "我喜歡姐姐身高真萌😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-16T22:56:59", "owner": "t631010s", "likes": 394}, {"id": 18085300445081850, "text": "哎，04的都这么大只了", "created_at": "2025-11-18T05:31:23", "owner": "laura_zhu604", "likes": 59}, {"id": 18428065285105632, "text": "小嘴巴 閉起來\n90後認證", "created_at": "2025-11-17T01:55:04", "owner": "ga87078go", "likes": 413}, {"id": 18175137118366772, "text": "其实这种反过来的现象是正常的，我就是大学最喜欢酷的打扮，二十五以后反而比较无所谓，因为什么造型都试过了，打扮太高冷会有距离感，亲和点也挺好的，而且材质舒服便于活动和打理的衣服很方便", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:47:51", "owner": "poceantry", "likes": 32}, {"id": 18061015262199854, "text": "我喜歡那鞋子😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-18T03:52:15", "owner": "comet5522", "likes": 32}, {"id": 18029782211749168, "text": "她自己穿這衣著.....", "created_at": "2025-11-16T22:04:22", "owner": "wingng318", "likes": 86}, {"id": 17898842157339786, "text": "@kt.mm_09 我覺得你喜歡他的鞋😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:44:19", "owner": "_oscar1102_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18099185590746928, "text": "那个鞋子有没有关键词，好可爱😍", "created_at": "2025-11-17T02:07:43", "owner": "dongziming420427", "likes": 28}, {"id": 18032809160723383, "text": "正常的呀，小孩喜歡裝大人，老人喜歡裝可愛", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:48:39", "owner": "shit_tower_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18440526604101654, "text": "04年的表妹.外表比97年的表姐老很多🥱\n04年才21歲.外表像40多歲.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:38:02", "owner": "cecilia_ng0909", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18065933567629812, "text": "我要那個鞋子！", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:49:58", "owner": "vul3n4", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18188022145340968, "text": "一家三口", "created_at": "2025-11-16T11:53:52", "owner": "yumihuyumi", "likes": 330}, {"id": 17856338052561833, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:16:44", "owner": "weijun.hong.3551", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18081001838030793, "text": "90後各種抽象😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T21:15:18", "owner": "tank7975", "likes": 40}, {"id": 18030240734758032, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-17T13:05:06", "owner": "yjing_1013", "likes": 47}, {"id": 18113636173506596, "text": "矮不是問題，穿那一身才真崩不住", "created_at": "2025-11-20T21:59:54", "owner": "cba25209", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18379638418198991, "text": "龍卷和吹雪😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:02:32", "owner": "liquan730", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18081147823890893, "text": "无痛当爹妈😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T02:01:55", "owner": "zme_1709", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17879099169429274, "text": "me😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T04:02:00", "owner": "lyf_maggie", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18113865034497862, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-16T13:03:10", "owner": "thc098765", "likes": 19}, {"id": 18140884669454031, "text": "我想要那個鞋子😍", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:44:59", "owner": "annesophie.marichal", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18065515844579957, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-19T10:12:45", "owner": "hannah99soon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096825061828980, "text": "鞋子的淘寶連結呢", "created_at": "2025-11-17T07:37:15", "owner": "tung2015167", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086106331961629, "text": "想問鞋哪買的😍", "created_at": "2025-11-17T04:18:00", "owner": "dean840920", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18107879314626853, "text": "你妹妹的聯繫方式，我覺得我需要", "created_at": "2025-11-25T06:45:11", "owner": "hengling29", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18164558488377461, "text": "兔子鞋子好可愛！😍", "created_at": "2025-11-18T03:21:29", "owner": "o917536", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18128363776443639, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂正宗南方迷你土豆🥔我喜欢那鞋", "created_at": "2025-12-07T06:09:14", "owner": "tang.rosy", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18296327992262319, "text": "那个鞋子真的是大学生喜欢的东西哈哈哈哈！！！", "created_at": "2025-11-18T04:56:33", "owner": "syuenzzz", "likes": 496}, {"id": 18086078582016722, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-13T17:01:31", "owner": "hojaiyi5203", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955551415018767, "text": "04像40", "created_at": "2025-12-11T10:38:01", "owner": "aliceyipppppp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992428827896835, "text": "不不 風水輪流轉 老了便知有沒有😂 就不想穿小媽風了", "created_at": "2025-12-10T16:19:11", "owner": "sylvia__823", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901733317343539, "text": "鞋子有链接吗宝宝", "created_at": "2025-12-10T10:17:47", "owner": "niangao_28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980705799783002, "text": "哈哈", "created_at": "2025-12-10T03:55:21", "owner": "jr5586000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138500398461968, "text": "小個子多好", "created_at": "2025-12-09T20:45:00", "owner": "lustar170", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058615859558382, "text": "啊哈哈哈好可爱", "created_at": "2025-12-09T02:05:42", "owner": "raymondhikari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999833190840293, "text": "晃來晃去的，看的頭好暈", "created_at": "2025-12-09T01:44:35", "owner": "xueling2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086327546091332, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-08T22:41:35", "owner": "agt.pie_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850616779565979, "text": "沒毛病，年紀大了就想扮點可愛", "created_at": "2025-12-07T14:51:25", "owner": "bjx250mimi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943362436088872, "text": "小嘴巴閉起來😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:02:46", "owner": "huajung0830", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100372045761199, "text": "所以鞋子的連結呢🔗", "created_at": "2025-12-06T06:34:34", "owner": "yingholytw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060518636258657, "text": "超可愛的好不好", "created_at": "2025-12-06T01:26:36", "owner": "loyong_akshan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18410305237191891, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:12:31", "owner": "pokin0706", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942200944066728, "text": "求鞋子鏈接🔗😍", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:34:18", "owner": "jiangjiang_guaigeqiqihuijia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18317502016247821, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:39:01", "owner": "liuminci66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088682443980342, "text": "鞋子好可愛…", "created_at": "2025-12-04T08:49:47", "owner": "vivian901119", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118690909558629, "text": "妹妹had more to eat growing up", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:18:06", "owner": "eriic.__.lin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099251968764913, "text": "我跟我弟弟和弟媳去逛街，也是像一家三口", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:19:00", "owner": "sukilaw_118", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079744531925507, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T20:57:16", "owner": "yenchiangtung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991564377893556, "text": "丟人", "created_at": "2025-12-01T18:24:21", "owner": "sanqkouq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867882592487086, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:34:13", "owner": "coco123cs54", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074625119204335, "text": "為啥一直蹲著呢 腿不痠嗎（狗頭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:02:43", "owner": "_peydol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102736099672585, "text": "鞋子有連結嗎", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:50:15", "owner": "308__joker_chang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049223945666239, "text": "@tammy_0517 兔子找人", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:51:03", "owner": "troy.v.q", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927601051153094, "text": "表妹讚啦", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:43:04", "owner": "shihjay7775", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973023702809345, "text": "好可愛", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:07:33", "owner": "iu0791", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010560008645022, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:58:24", "owner": "shuangzi00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031920593729771, "text": "真的好像一家三口哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:22:44", "owner": "nicole_q11k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545339167009771, "text": "Cos家庭不叫我", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:28:10", "owner": "luohaoran487", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092253598734140, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:31:25", "owner": "hoooz1314520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048538127425605, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:48:55", "owner": "liuh04784", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185977786351013, "text": "有没有鞋子的链接啊", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:03:06", "owner": "beixiaofeiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847296664585822, "text": "我的眼中只有茶姬x 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:47:27", "owner": "siaojalee1105", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096302200829083, "text": "@natsuki.145cm 😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:16:16", "owner": "taierdimu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087011632971889, "text": "那個鞋子。有點想買", "created_at": "2025-11-24T20:14:31", "owner": "jilljilljao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099307594795171, "text": "難怪我閨蜜跟我出門都要緊緊牽著我😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:02:11", "owner": "lukuanyu2005", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18433036198103210, "text": "那鞋子很可愛 耳朵會立ㄟ", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:30:16", "owner": "boyu370", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084562763022789, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T21:24:15", "owner": "liudidi2talk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051018272368704, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T16:08:42", "owner": "chenqingru67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048882629679042, "text": "我覺得姐姐蠻可愛的，我還蠻喜歡的", "created_at": "2025-11-23T11:10:48", "owner": "hong401022087", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931018519137694, "text": "姐夫要變妹夫了嗎？😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T02:35:38", "owner": "jiazhe_0428", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293402728302474, "text": "男生長得好像今井龍太郎...", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:52:36", "owner": "hana_.0223", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878202199429484, "text": "李村夜市 救命🆘🆘🆘", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:02:09", "owner": "ritalee7259", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885457741404140, "text": "拴一个热气球😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:44:58", "owner": "yyao76278", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105408937560584, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:12:20", "owner": "a0910890690", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079363508515316, "text": "像一家三口🧑‍🧑‍🧒帶娃", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:28:51", "owner": "sandro08lam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18190471414327202, "text": "綁氣球啊！", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:59:39", "owner": "dryada35741", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066881585579019, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:27:33", "owner": "yuenmeiwong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073672232210334, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:58:42", "owner": "dg88997", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924225499179352, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-21T22:19:30", "owner": "1996_10_20_bo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032717885737144, "text": "好可愛😮", "created_at": "2025-11-21T13:04:56", "owner": "bear_7971", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092625394893140, "text": "90后人都营养不良 哈哈哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-21T09:25:14", "owner": "yvonne.leeee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098713324695685, "text": "這哪的口音🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-21T07:50:20", "owner": "liang_yuqin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857781268556107, "text": "GAY", "created_at": "2025-11-21T04:26:28", "owner": "liu_x._.x_uil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082248584280033, "text": "粉紅色那個不是睡衣嗎", "created_at": "2025-11-21T01:44:46", "owner": "1025ginayutzu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060898127531675, "text": "他如果不穿成這樣 真的會很難找🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-20T15:39:22", "owner": "x51555", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931057978136356, "text": "有鞋子購買網址嗎", "created_at": "2025-11-20T13:27:38", "owner": "eric85124xp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113333665571408, "text": "41秒 那个脸好像小潮院长啊", "created_at": "2025-11-20T04:49:44", "owner": "the_ch_ys", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042055010704737, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T11:40:10", "owner": "aaron_chow1106", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929086360014715, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T10:35:44", "owner": "tongyu0617", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882453736409782, "text": "我147cm😂也近30🫠", "created_at": "2025-11-19T08:23:15", "owner": "wangyichelle12jan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886053172402209, "text": "我喜欢这个鞋子😍", "created_at": "2025-11-19T02:03:27", "owner": "cccjxc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866403061487520, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T00:31:16", "owner": "sosa126kimo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066091457375344, "text": "😂有一種我的即視感", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:47:50", "owner": "qing.sylvia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052630913647308, "text": "龍卷姐妹", "created_at": "2025-11-18T13:42:51", "owner": "super_rockgod", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941843011082174, "text": "想要那雙拖鞋", "created_at": "2025-11-18T12:14:27", "owner": "y.ging2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861485839536903, "text": "那鞋子哪買的，鏈接發我。", "created_at": "2025-11-18T11:52:53", "owner": "mortimer03.13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18187962436337256, "text": "The almost 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-18T08:45:30", "owner": "sum.dmus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887662411261656, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T08:41:36", "owner": "sarah.kathrina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076907276185756, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-18T04:16:38", "owner": "dennipan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145425412432796, "text": "有沒有120cm?", "created_at": "2025-11-18T01:53:49", "owner": "boi_monotonous", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030549659737365, "text": "🤣🤣🤣真的一家三口了🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-18T00:41:06", "owner": "chenyuwen4788", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079457663167647, "text": "145cm路过😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T00:10:47", "owner": "bibianachen87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087445891768162, "text": "個子小那位...鞋子超好笑，很有趣耶😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T17:03:14", "owner": "veryhot888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875955955351967, "text": "真係太像", "created_at": "2025-11-17T14:27:03", "owner": "c___9i7___c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079496930515239, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T14:18:13", "owner": "q82872551", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182009977355806, "text": "好可愛的鞋子", "created_at": "2025-11-17T13:53:40", "owner": "yahe4444", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041281637695853, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T13:19:34", "owner": "rockysreemukhi143_offical", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849541123597263, "text": "不良人⋯阿姐？？？？那鞋子好酷", "created_at": "2025-11-17T12:00:21", "owner": "boboshoo520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923891488042611, "text": "喜歡姐姐這樣，九零後都是這樣了啦、最主要開心", "created_at": "2025-11-17T11:57:37", "owner": "rongching95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132301342485277, "text": "穿這樣可以啊 好認", "created_at": "2025-11-17T10:28:35", "owner": "hiimweichen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990367857730207, "text": "一家三口出門逛街？🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-17T08:52:35", "owner": "vikingtiger1986", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058469612266092, "text": "那個鞋子😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T07:00:04", "owner": "andyorshang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18334487788233393, "text": "鞋子好可愛", "created_at": "2025-11-17T06:28:56", "owner": "yaoyao5875", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18490194643073492, "text": "年紀輕輕一把年紀", "created_at": "2025-11-17T04:47:23", "owner": "rhys.tyr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930460351113824, "text": "我是90年", "created_at": "2025-11-17T03:24:38", "owner": "liukailing543", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999668925829618, "text": "挺可愛的", "created_at": "2025-11-17T01:11:11", "owner": "bryancheunghin", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["搞笑", "迷惑行為大賞", "00後", "矮個子"]},
{"media_id": 3737094212841341137, "shortcode": "DPc02L4k4DR", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DPc02L4k4DR/", "taken_at": "2025-10-06T02:11:17", "caption": "小孩需要正能量。#香城映畫 #搞笑視頻 #粵語 #香港 #aesthetic #quotes #reel #hongkong", "owner_username": "arno95707", "owner_id": "74839340117", "likes": 20410, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0048_DPc02L4k4DR\\DPc02L4k4DR_20251006_021117.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18056057120218307, "text": "那是少年勇者的卡片嗎😮😮", "created_at": "2025-10-07T04:30:10", "owner": "tycoon0121", "likes": 49}, {"id": 18050732204646254, "text": "少個人分家產？咁父母老咗唔洗養？一個養兩老好定兩個以上養兩老好？呀，不適用於不孝人士", "created_at": "2025-10-07T04:03:53", "owner": "chunlam_0430", "likes": 103}, {"id": 17869605477447097, "text": "老豆會盡量洗晒啲錢，仲借一身屁債，咁咪幫你同細佬妹爭身家嘅煩惱囉🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-06T08:30:34", "owner": "kiyoshimania", "likes": 323}, {"id": 18096824020849262, "text": "@jc_.0756 點解邊度都有你？", "created_at": "2025-12-06T05:10:35", "owner": "_.xbearoi__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18028032239725387, "text": "我睇咗d 乜野 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-07T03:04:31", "owner": "kyo7532", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18081478499483378, "text": "細佬，我而家睇返四十年前嘅樓價，我一炮過比晒都得，你確定你中學畢業啲錢夠比首期😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T04:32:22", "owner": "hokeehorus", "likes": 134}, {"id": 17858076081478013, "text": "可唔可以話俾我聽條片喺邊度睇😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-28T14:55:24", "owner": "st.ear_lch", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18069968864249414, "text": "BS 卡😢", "created_at": "2025-10-06T12:42:08", "owner": "nick555_5", "likes": 46}, {"id": 18024081986566344, "text": "想問點樣提高媽咪爹哋避孕意識係咪慢慢瞓喺床下底😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T11:13:21", "owner": "monster3story", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18089518600857047, "text": "@paktwenty2_9", "created_at": "2025-10-06T17:15:36", "owner": "howard___23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18423960754104517, "text": "分家產？你講到我屋企有家產咁喎😂", "created_at": "2025-10-10T17:09:22", "owner": "lusus_f", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17869625925376757, "text": "@lamlonghei  老細：賣比你，呢個月又賺廿萬", "created_at": "2025-10-07T04:50:08", "owner": "kevin_sai0904", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18207693823308203, "text": "咁買iPhone既錢邊度嚟？", "created_at": "2025-10-06T11:34:26", "owner": "lili.l0liiii", "likes": 969}, {"id": 18181227577339317, "text": "冇咗後面嗰段嘅，佢話佢日日同屋企人去食早餐都嗌腸仔煙肉個段呢🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-13T10:28:55", "owner": "iyuki_cyy", "likes": 43}, {"id": 18108065107581811, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-08T18:05:04", "owner": "3834_matthew", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17858797722521382, "text": "分公屋😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T20:47:31", "owner": "harrisip222", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17896400103324713, "text": "部iphone有2000賺，南亞人自己唔賺俾你賺？", "created_at": "2025-10-11T11:02:11", "owner": "cliffchan7", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18528080014028658, "text": "咩戲", "created_at": "2025-10-07T06:35:31", "owner": "lukapple", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084637243745974, "text": "此子斷不可留🔪", "created_at": "2025-10-07T11:44:10", "owner": "ar_lam_matthew", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540594424056306, "text": "@aaaacchow @dannyyytyl @sunnysunsunha", "created_at": "2025-10-27T02:33:39", "owner": "ambrose_puinam", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17882399256282786, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-25T07:53:41", "owner": "ugoyan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950383017899119, "text": "世子之争素来如此，朕予改封已是仁慈", "created_at": "2025-10-09T17:10:03", "owner": "augustuscbo", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18103737964540799, "text": "唔好買樓呀 2020買了 現在負資產", "created_at": "2025-10-07T00:11:55", "owner": "terry.c.h.yee", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17907195585252851, "text": "What movie is this?", "created_at": "2025-10-07T03:18:36", "owner": "channyboy0101", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18285673354277743, "text": "跟住比南亞人搶晒啲錢 全劇終😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:36:04", "owner": "dracoooo_707", "likes": 95}, {"id": 18098249992661079, "text": "正常人8-15年就供完，50歲😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T11:07:27", "owner": "soching18", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18058254041253456, "text": "冇記錯呢套好似係年少日記🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-19T13:07:12", "owner": "tak_yip0211", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085960220491306, "text": "果然有生意頭腦！😍", "created_at": "2025-10-29T11:09:59", "owner": "anton_ccw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18537306553037583, "text": "let him cook", "created_at": "2025-10-22T18:25:59", "owner": "c_crob", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970851138956332, "text": "未來巴菲特", "created_at": "2025-10-19T11:48:35", "owner": "pony.0423", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845451484573792, "text": "層樓未公完啊爸啊媽就走咗, 然後你瞓街", "created_at": "2025-10-14T14:57:48", "owner": "enxo_m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081568337100053, "text": "你老豆老母層樓未供完㗎，傻9", "created_at": "2025-10-14T07:12:01", "owner": "bmattering1234", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086693539938655, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-13T04:47:14", "owner": "onizuka_zy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905067448257164, "text": "望都望多幾個幫手養啦😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-13T03:18:04", "owner": "oclovehk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056474558230024, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-12T11:18:36", "owner": "oscaryuen_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004168685812486, "text": "宜家興PKM卡啦😂..球星卡，OP卡..好多炒到幾萬一張", "created_at": "2025-10-12T08:06:55", "owner": "heath_lwf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086068213941150, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T14:28:55", "owner": "veryoridinary25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052117796305321, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-09T15:30:33", "owner": "ch99.sum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098386978657598, "text": "Too late bruh I already got 2 sis to split with 🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-09T12:07:54", "owner": "fungling0630", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080495257848724, "text": "我的生涯規劃😢", "created_at": "2025-10-09T08:53:59", "owner": "wjoe1980", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962020014995841, "text": "@kkkenneth_lcw @o_kaaahooooo", "created_at": "2025-10-08T07:31:26", "owner": "superkc_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902504134269689, "text": "呢套係咩戲", "created_at": "2025-10-08T01:44:35", "owner": "hyouketsu_emilia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18365270464155592, "text": "真水假水混水觀音水", "created_at": "2025-10-08T00:15:55", "owner": "metaversepaci", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081395116943744, "text": "@_isaac_ting_ @cheok_06", "created_at": "2025-10-07T16:56:25", "owner": "tms_hei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020092427775641, "text": "真係\n小朋友 無大人係度 就係傾呢堆野\n我有個朋友 推自己大肚老母 落樓流產\n大個厄朋友老豆老母錢", "created_at": "2025-10-07T11:06:50", "owner": "khmsimaoheavenlymaster", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001107674667707, "text": "@eugene_x_hc", "created_at": "2025-10-07T06:14:55", "owner": "henchlai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861188674436219, "text": "你點樣確定到你老竇老母嘅身家留返俾你呢？", "created_at": "2025-10-06T23:11:13", "owner": "urboss66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18237577993288329, "text": "@eee4li_", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:46:12", "owner": "itz_chi_lam", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["香城映畫", "搞笑視頻", "粵語", "香港", "aesthetic", "quotes", "reel", "hongkong"]},
{"media_id": 3775276771189814677, "shortcode": "DRkejibjXWV", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRkejibjXWV/", "taken_at": "2025-11-27T18:28:03", "caption": "Sydney Sweeney created a PowerPoint for her parents when she was a teen to convince them to let her act.\nThe presentation showed a well-thought-out plan for her to become a successful actress.\n\nHer parents took it seriously and supported her on the journey to make it in Hollywood.\nVia @5.36am", "owner_username": "availablxe", "owner_id": "9180890972", "likes": 15493, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphSidecar", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0049_DRkejibjXWV\\DRkejibjXWV_20251127_182803_1.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0049_DRkejibjXWV\\DRkejibjXWV_20251127_182803_2.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0049_DRkejibjXWV\\DRkejibjXWV_20251127_182803_3.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0049_DRkejibjXWV\\DRkejibjXWV_20251127_182803_4.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0049_DRkejibjXWV\\DRkejibjXWV_20251127_182803_5.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0049_DRkejibjXWV\\DRkejibjXWV_20251127_182803_6.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0049_DRkejibjXWV\\DRkejibjXWV_20251127_182803_7.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0049_DRkejibjXWV\\DRkejibjXWV_20251127_182803_8.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0049_DRkejibjXWV\\DRkejibjXWV_20251127_182803_9.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": 18171180751375485, "text": "Yeah so convincing….", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:38:28", "owner": "eylul.santo", "likes": 360}, {"id": 18548942326043009, "text": "so there werent other pics of her?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:21:18", "owner": "nelu.sandu", "likes": 212}, {"id": 18350689663167564, "text": "Y esta quien es", "created_at": "2025-12-07T05:28:04", "owner": "takia_usagiyama", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17856027939577439, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T07:58:59", "owner": "uknowalexball", "likes": 35}, {"id": 17949451461064109, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T09:36:28", "owner": "pouya.valid", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18496897762077848, "text": "Cutieeee 😭🛐🛐🛐", "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:19:52", "owner": "911yassh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087182155820530, "text": "“I’m attractive with huge cans. That’s marketable. Thank you for listening.”\n- Sydney Sweeney (probably)", "created_at": "2025-12-07T22:20:58", "owner": "shafe41", "likes": 39}, {"id": 18087163289478406, "text": "She looks much cuter", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:05:02", "owner": "yourlocalsugarmommy", "likes": 14}, {"id": 17958834530878491, "text": "Amore della mia vita", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:22:23", "owner": "alessandromarti94", "likes": 35}, {"id": 18329707879211236, "text": "We don’t gaf", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:32:43", "owner": "cgaumar", "likes": 79}, {"id": 17929152558155552, "text": "@sydney_sweeney marry me😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:38:30", "owner": "aryan_18792", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060701714250677, "text": "if only she wasnt a republican 💔", "created_at": "2025-12-07T15:45:57", "owner": "b4dcup", "likes": 21}, {"id": 18544814287063105, "text": "Pretty 🙂‍↔️💞", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:52:16", "owner": "sphia_bxx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058698551304184, "text": "she could’ve been so cool and unique", "created_at": "2025-12-07T19:39:38", "owner": "ssam.miless", "likes": 63}, {"id": 18060248378644043, "text": "She sucks at acting 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T20:08:40", "owner": "mr.edwardo.the.fifth", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17975716202959537, "text": "the size of the cup doesn't change the taste", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:39:46", "owner": "abdouxw___", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077778217958840, "text": "Yyeaah they are probably just fine with her making all those sex scenes. Just saying i wouldn’t be🙋‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:14:41", "owner": "33333v.s3331312", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17855759562575385, "text": "Sydney’s taking a 💩 is the Hottest thing Ever!🥵🥵🥵", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:08:22", "owner": "williamjordanfurman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116278864506592, "text": "😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-12-12T16:31:33", "owner": "pinottiw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122593528528377, "text": "Fuck I wanna tiddy phuck her so bad", "created_at": "2025-12-11T23:52:55", "owner": "jackblack7794", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085410794091841, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T18:52:10", "owner": "ifuseekjayda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057024068635178, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T18:51:41", "owner": "ifuseekjayda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854522101589852, "text": "Terrible acting, mid asf", "created_at": "2025-12-10T23:41:53", "owner": "pacotaco707", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109227142627778, "text": "😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:32:54", "owner": "natalee007__fan1111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999519219837554, "text": "sad shes evil now", "created_at": "2025-12-08T08:30:35", "owner": "m6disonannie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912461368251685, "text": "الحب", "created_at": "2025-12-07T21:46:44", "owner": "_ym_22__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18342756541234823, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:33:03", "owner": "morpheus8690", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077241077462609, "text": "Ölürüm ya", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:55:30", "owner": "emrennsn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999915537836071, "text": "Cooked", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:32:41", "owner": "pierrewannacomeout", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842199799643186, "text": "Perfect body", "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:07:28", "owner": "brain33285", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3773347211909476383, "shortcode": "DRdn0wUEzAf", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRdn0wUEzAf/", "taken_at": "2025-11-25T02:34:47", "caption": "过渡提醒就是提前纠错#亲子关系#教育孩子#亲子教育", "owner_username": "vivian.wee01", "owner_id": "76133061723", "likes": 57646, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0050_DRdn0wUEzAf\\DRdn0wUEzAf_20251125_023447.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18086464654820784, "text": "家長看不到系列", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:06:16", "owner": "_x3x3x3_x30", "likes": 4940}, {"id": 18159701329396746, "text": "還沒做就先被罵、還沒開始就被否定的感覺。就是這種被預設會做不好 的那種窒息感。很多老一輩的都會這樣，覺得自己是在幫你避免錯誤\n但實際上讓孩子感受到的是：\n你一定會出錯，所以我必須先擋住你。", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:49:29", "owner": "sandymiaomiaocheng", "likes": 1644}, {"id": 18063705677181588, "text": "作為一個過來人\n我覺得太對了😂\n你要我做我就偏不做 覺得很煩\n家長的好意 但沒有哪個孩子天生就會想\n等他會想的時候應該也和我差不多大了", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:47:35", "owner": "jackson_01_15", "likes": 171}, {"id": 18060613913240423, "text": "小小年紀頭髮就快禿了？", "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:00:09", "owner": "gieja87", "likes": 751}, {"id": 18494874346075765, "text": "亞洲家長：「為你好」", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:14:47", "owner": "wei_o6.l4", "likes": 521}, {"id": 17858165004557682, "text": "亞洲家長：這小孩怎麼這麼沒家教 講了還不開心那就不要吃了", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:48:07", "owner": "chieh01", "likes": 81}, {"id": 17887417479273637, "text": "我媽：你要說好～我知道了～不然搞得好像我雞婆", "created_at": "2025-12-01T21:54:51", "owner": "liumiaoling_811", "likes": 23}, {"id": 18099484573875797, "text": "怎麼讓我爸媽看到", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:28:44", "owner": "wkaifaiaaa", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18164612791387715, "text": "我該怎麼樣才不會讓我媽一直唸我！我受不了", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:16:04", "owner": "cherryxu663701", "likes": 95}, {"id": 18088524167489473, "text": "實際上這就是一個心靈折磨，你原本自己想做的事做完之後會有成就感，但當你準備做是父母提醒你一句會變成是別人要求你做，做完之後反而不會有成就感，更多的是這件事不是我自己想做的", "created_at": "2025-12-01T14:38:23", "owner": "xqzwp0210", "likes": 13}, {"id": 17921026815192506, "text": "我到底要怎樣做才不要讓我媽一直唸我", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:12:31", "owner": "cherryxu663701", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18113621839508922, "text": "家長不懂啦", "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:35:27", "owner": "webbliu.world", "likes": 33}, {"id": 17917905294228097, "text": "在催要去買立群抽了", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:24:51", "owner": "xdp__qbx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17928118722159375, "text": "為什麼最後要把他的喉結放大（？", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:55:40", "owner": "lu._.2518", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18063894893566939, "text": "確實，剛要看書就被叫去看書，突然就不做了", "created_at": "2025-12-02T09:28:02", "owner": "_renatus.artorias_0209", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092789407929176, "text": "PTSD", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:04:19", "owner": "trevneo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057103364657617, "text": "150讚 我就發給我媽", "created_at": "2025-12-12T18:56:43", "owner": "charlotteisdumb0521", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061054373242319, "text": "@_yunyun919", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:36:08", "owner": "lu755115", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18436502710102899, "text": "水杯跟我的一樣", "created_at": "2025-12-07T05:22:24", "owner": "liaoyunsheng8", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094360789879936, "text": "亞洲家長看不到系列", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:33:55", "owner": "hu_jyuer0518", "likes": 53}, {"id": 18066958244147879, "text": "還不是為你好 \n不喜歡被管你可以搬出去啊", "created_at": "2025-12-10T01:20:36", "owner": "0326_kami", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920110909084486, "text": "@lucky.1107 沒辦法", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:05:55", "owner": "berrylavender0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050315123666360, "text": "中國共慘黨人死光❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-06T03:12:59", "owner": "fucking_69king", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18010675064804543, "text": "煩不煩人，噁心", "created_at": "2025-11-26T13:01:09", "owner": "__linian225__", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18058589234303860, "text": "@qihui270", "created_at": "2025-12-13T10:19:39", "owner": "jacob.1014.030", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924784051193768, "text": "提醒可以口氣改一下", "created_at": "2025-12-13T09:35:31", "owner": "kk20121995", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945245425068686, "text": "神經病家長", "created_at": "2025-12-13T09:06:57", "owner": "a0939016561", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087711055956934, "text": "家長無感系列", "created_at": "2025-12-13T02:24:07", "owner": "vicoco_1340", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873906223463514, "text": "做的時候不要戴套", "created_at": "2025-12-12T16:07:57", "owner": "kaixu.c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126753160510670, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-12-12T14:56:59", "owner": "jiecaiwe126", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861523054551010, "text": "过后就会讲 怎么顶嘴 原本要很勤劳。要去做东西啊结果被他一催又不想去做", "created_at": "2025-12-12T13:32:21", "owner": "lyz5161", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954523195044893, "text": "非常認同", "created_at": "2025-12-12T07:51:25", "owner": "chiif0093", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031769960750084, "text": "你這什麼態度🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-12T04:30:48", "owner": "minshengzhang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056667932642729, "text": "我老婆就是", "created_at": "2025-12-12T00:45:47", "owner": "lisaaaa10101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887160163404446, "text": "養肥？", "created_at": "2025-12-11T08:46:11", "owner": "zjw_0103", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18412139053188250, "text": "@k_l.goh", "created_at": "2025-12-11T00:14:20", "owner": "peiwennnnn.n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367780225082287, "text": "真的，看着都难受", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:18:28", "owner": "jey_sunn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18291613651262988, "text": "亞洲地區通用", "created_at": "2025-12-10T12:51:50", "owner": "shen.02_20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096419503861473, "text": "真的", "created_at": "2025-12-10T09:02:02", "owner": "wowwow0130230", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945364390080181, "text": "別光吃菜 多吃點肉 別光吃肉 多吃點菜 別光喝飲料 你怎麼都不喝飲料", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:08:59", "owner": "_yunxzc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894000088369189, "text": "還好我不當父母，因為我也不知道成功的父母長啥樣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T04:08:03", "owner": "jiaxian8855", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086443334000140, "text": "他們覺得我是弱智，好啊我就弱智氣死他們", "created_at": "2025-12-08T18:08:54", "owner": "yellow_point__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087136082073360, "text": "我婆婆对我这样，怎么办？", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:14:52", "owner": "yanghongcheng11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18324547651244999, "text": "然後每次叫你你都要應 然後每次跑過去了結果不重要 不如直接說", "created_at": "2025-12-08T14:19:59", "owner": "hifs0wo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18405826069125934, "text": "他最后那个表情是不是突然想起房间电脑上的黄色网站忘记关了", "created_at": "2025-12-08T10:55:38", "owner": "q1_ann19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034392848531608, "text": "這叫冤枉", "created_at": "2025-12-08T03:56:15", "owner": "the_show_kao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058404857299939, "text": "你要我幹嘛我偏不做🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-08T03:15:49", "owner": "lolo95656", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18518544169067483, "text": "還有一個 我不說你就不會做", "created_at": "2025-12-07T09:55:43", "owner": "tim._.0.5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18314289754247981, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-12-07T06:31:38", "owner": "waynechong_4224", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986412441871475, "text": "我媽都說我做了不就不會說了嗎😇（ㄚ不是做了嗎呵呵🥰）", "created_at": "2025-12-07T01:57:42", "owner": "bella._.ffg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091348537822569, "text": "當做沒聽到，接著做不理人。接下來問對方你提醒完了嗎？是有病嗎，感快去看精神科。", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:16:51", "owner": "9784iris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055013114645951, "text": "我後來都不在他們面前做事，聽的好煩", "created_at": "2025-12-06T11:42:09", "owner": "bright_zen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903544948164808, "text": "很像雙魚座的我 只要被有人指指點點我就不幹了😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:24:07", "owner": "xiang_.0221", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874372510453377, "text": "我也是这样被害死的", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:03:44", "owner": "jason.loh.1293", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100079890697893, "text": "他的那个杯子我也有", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:55:36", "owner": "gem713816", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050351567401687, "text": "由於這是家長刷不到系列，所以轉發給他們看", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:47:11", "owner": "rhys201596", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18395713147125205, "text": "好險我是水瓶座不受這種控制哈哈 免疫控制", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:46:04", "owner": "finfly123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18195683476330267, "text": "如何不經意的讓家長看到", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:34:38", "owner": "rt_.813", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877435261351107, "text": "懂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:42:40", "owner": "patrrr._.kkkk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541595971020718, "text": "整天就知道待在家\n整天就知道出去玩", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:21:31", "owner": "jo6fup6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049299689410986, "text": "男子：啊？我廢了？", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:47:40", "owner": "allen_.03.16", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17958974040010895, "text": "作為一個過來人，我的建議是別過來，因為退一萬步來說，我根本聽不見家長說甚麼", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:47:59", "owner": "arieongo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068997020377948, "text": "利群没少抽吧！", "created_at": "2025-12-04T04:01:39", "owner": "fangmi._.0622", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994912443714421, "text": "每次還沒做就被念然後說了不是你想的那樣又不信堅持自己的設想是對的，明明什麼都還沒做", "created_at": "2025-12-03T15:33:46", "owner": "yi08030215", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855672415527883, "text": "老公看不到系列", "created_at": "2025-12-03T13:29:01", "owner": "yayaya_0204", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047415641452681, "text": "他媽的我一直以為是我自己叛逆", "created_at": "2025-12-03T09:44:02", "owner": "qwq._.0613", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065888945438756, "text": "可是也没有把菜夹起来了又放回去的道理啊", "created_at": "2025-12-03T08:18:46", "owner": "0222_chua7886", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126759994509196, "text": "當初那個我就該反向操作傳這部", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:58:32", "owner": "yu._.chia0905", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045779309686633, "text": "我是廢物", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:10:52", "owner": "xinhong_0120", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090470071820604, "text": "家長永遠看不到😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:51:27", "owner": "czn_alhbhb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842040574635713, "text": "所以要拿利群", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:14:19", "owner": "him._0925", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070968926582862, "text": "「臥槽，怎麼有旁白」", "created_at": "2025-12-02T11:43:49", "owner": "love_violet007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099109744795040, "text": "幾乎每個人的阿嬤：", "created_at": "2025-12-02T10:20:18", "owner": "ytwt_0122", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008658845654566, "text": "真的，身為家長自己也極度厭惡被提醒。", "created_at": "2025-12-02T05:29:15", "owner": "shixiaojie547", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18431494444111630, "text": "....然後最後來一句：你看！都要我提醒....", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:46:43", "owner": "tiffanyenfj.0123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033320996529452, "text": "好像受到指令才去做一样！", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:20:41", "owner": "limxinxin2104", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047704652451588, "text": "@shannytan_", "created_at": "2025-12-01T12:53:31", "owner": "yohohoho1458", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095460607843245, "text": "谢天谢地幸好我妈不是这样", "created_at": "2025-12-01T08:08:53", "owner": "yukuanxiang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930339856146198, "text": "我媽", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:21:59", "owner": "jacoby_huang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541191877040502, "text": "力群", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:20:58", "owner": "twsas._.0315", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943463893080947, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:02:11", "owner": "shaoyuan_lu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086996012003834, "text": "不要每天都說我要做的事情", "created_at": "2025-11-30T09:13:40", "owner": "kljm0379", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142742458453635, "text": "在職場上好像如此……🙄", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:40:20", "owner": "iop7557", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975089850956829, "text": "孩子身在福中不知福", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:16:06", "owner": "hp.4856", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085902746049261, "text": "超反感這樣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:35:25", "owner": "ashion_yang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183645712348838, "text": "我想問問大家喜歡吃乾身的飯還是好像黏土的飯？", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:47:13", "owner": "pongpongpong415", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979140066941380, "text": "父母是不会看了，自己看看吧，也没用，没老婆没孩子😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:05:42", "owner": "jokbjdjwhxhx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895793362357654, "text": "每個中部家長都這樣吧", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:23:25", "owner": "surge.319", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998048436839225, "text": "要怎麼不小心讓我媽看到", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:21:50", "owner": "jason632632", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860731054476387, "text": "跟國軍一樣 嘖嘖", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:18:22", "owner": "830630wakeup", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852159838550778, "text": "然后就会站在道德至高点说：我是为了你还，你还敢顶嘴，你比那个谁还叛逆，你没礼貌，你不尊重长辈，你很不乖，那个谁都比你乖，有你这种女儿啊，唉", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:29:42", "owner": "kikisleepyyy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18499139980076249, "text": "因為傳統家長不跟孩子談心事\n永遠只談事業名利成就\n所以自然找不到親子話題\n硬是講幹話", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:34:32", "owner": "nini_o3o4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866722969501301, "text": "首先，对付这种父母就是拿钱丢他们。钱最大权利。你有钱独立了你赚钱回来给他们一点，然后在摆脸色。这种父母说白了就是心理不成熟。不成熟的人就做父母你们觉得会爱小孩子？不可能。他们只会找借口理由。害死很多孩子的父母一大堆。他们从来不觉得他们自己有问题。永远都是年轻人有问题。他们自卑又要控制自己的孩子，把不安投射到孩子身上，愤怒就把孩子当发泄品。他们自己文化思维认知逻辑低，就每天啰里啰嗦的跟你们年轻人说大道理对不对？怕人看不起他们。自作聪明罢了。他们就好像小屁孩那样。又喜欢天天贬低你。嘴巴吐不出来几句好听的话甚至鼓励。这种父母永远不要去同情他们。你同情你傻。活该被他们控制。你要想办法当主人，而不是他们的工具。", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:02:26", "owner": "sroki1117_ig", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18061660238207257, "text": "我是成年人了早就是社會人士", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:54:58", "owner": "cherryxu663701", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978615966945633, "text": "为什么最后一定要这个表情看着人😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:50:14", "owner": "brandon_skyline", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104633254661139, "text": "其實喔！就學他吧！家長怎麼說，小孩就過度提醒", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:10:54", "owner": "liwei2340", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094458542507817, "text": "如果是你們的話怎麼跟你們的媽媽說呢？", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:39:43", "owner": "cherryxu663701", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950201100919749, "text": "我好像懂了什麼", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:33:36", "owner": "zixiey75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074649173265349, "text": "我媽看到我吃東西動不動就要一直唸都不能安靜吃東西了煩死了", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:07:09", "owner": "cherryxu663701", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081445910283973, "text": "這小弟弟的媽媽是有啥毛病不讓他安靜吃飯一直唸", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:06:16", "owner": "cherryxu663701", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100595791776433, "text": "家長看不到系列", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:57:21", "owner": "aoyaoyao235", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087783637782589, "text": "我小时候就这样😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:27:41", "owner": "xiiaoyu.95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049969694382891, "text": "通常覺得煩的都是傻逼⋯\n根本不會想 把家人的好意當成敵意 通常就是稚嫩⋯無需反駁", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:21:38", "owner": "lofiof", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["亲子关系", "教育孩子", "亲子教育"]},
{"media_id": 3774063132826285881, "shortcode": "DRgKmxoAjc5", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRgKmxoAjc5/", "taken_at": "2025-11-26T02:17:58", "caption": "還記得嗎，以前嬉戲打鬧的我們… #情感共鳴 #劇情 #真實還原#云南白藥氣血康#云南白藥元氣小金瓶", "owner_username": "lndaore34599", "owner_id": "75841986644", "likes": 61361, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0051_DRgKmxoAjc5\\DRgKmxoAjc5_20251126_021758.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17925514296173310, "text": "兄弟間就不能說謝謝？", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:08:57", "owner": "eric__04_28", "likes": 220}, {"id": 17855883042567374, "text": "你還是我的兄弟，但已經不是我認識的那個兄弟了", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:43:08", "owner": "wolf.214539", "likes": 1732}, {"id": 17849615127567851, "text": "没有对错，每个人立场不同😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:53:22", "owner": "jinkai_2333", "likes": 527}, {"id": 18079432802182334, "text": "兄弟變了\n但自己沒變\n所以不可能再用以前相處的方式繼續延續這段友情", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:08:48", "owner": "xiangjiaoda347", "likes": 255}, {"id": 18010154189777254, "text": "確實幼稚啊 講那種屁話給自己兄弟聽？", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:09:03", "owner": "agow_so_dope", "likes": 557}, {"id": 18104298622655461, "text": "爸爸陪兒子玩不是天經地義嗎\n兒子孝敬爸爸不也是天經地義", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:02:27", "owner": "w1822705604", "likes": 44}, {"id": 17880697422424137, "text": "小全不會讀空氣，識時務者寒暄幾句就好聚好散", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:48:29", "owner": "baixiaowei_86", "likes": 33}, {"id": 18093043177929777, "text": "到底在演什麼 \n即便遇到類似這種事情只需要做一件事就能分辨有沒有疏遠\n那就是🖕", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:24:27", "owner": "shintaollo_han", "likes": 41}, {"id": 17922927486055522, "text": "wait wait wait what？因为两个开始不同罢了就要删好友？？？？😮", "created_at": "2025-12-09T01:49:02", "owner": "ss4n88", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087758333295843, "text": "我們從來不說謝謝啊😍", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:53:58", "owner": "laiyanxi39", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17847797568582345, "text": "跟爹不需要說謝謝", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:18:20", "owner": "hypocrisy_yen", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18075265832246986, "text": "當你跟你爹我說謝謝的時候就已經不是同路人了", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:48:07", "owner": "pinocchio_0223", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087917903479558, "text": "好哥們都不會說謝謝 說謝謝證明已經疏遠陌生了", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:40:21", "owner": "boomboomplanet", "likes": 99}, {"id": 18081246848034879, "text": "不應該謝謝義父嗎", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:01:47", "owner": "tuna_pple", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18083027411104395, "text": "對家人最好都要有習慣說謝謝 默契可不是隨時都適用的", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:30:22", "owner": "march_1d3r", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18085779880837649, "text": "沒有兄弟會說謝謝 只會用曖昧的方式表達", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:12:40", "owner": "clancy_brawlstars", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062342084545328, "text": "@st._1101 快來看一堆沒有兄弟的留言區", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:06:10", "owner": "pumpkin8766e", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17901278808334032, "text": "说了句谢谢 直接被删了", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:24:25", "owner": "chan_hei.0108", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18079775353898315, "text": "別太幼稚了", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:56:04", "owner": "xiong._04.15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075038483244013, "text": "謝三小，叫爹", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:33:53", "owner": "kakkoii_wei0326", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18079360541518311, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:51:14", "owner": "xjian.hing", "likes": 20}, {"id": 18048297110673342, "text": "演的什么🐔8️⃣\n人家上班辛苦不熬夜玩了\n自己各种阴阳怪气别人\n大老板 熬夜数钱\n正常好朋友会这么说话？\n\n人家都得上班养活自己\n有的人还能通宵出来玩\n谁才是不需要工作的富裕人家呢🤔\n\n最后不好意思让你送\n怕你辛苦最后给你东西\n说声谢谢到你这成了不是朋友了\n真有你演的这样的朋友也挺可怜的", "created_at": "2025-11-26T08:59:30", "owner": "yaojian1121", "likes": 5393}, {"id": 17842207569626884, "text": "一個謝謝都可以讓中國人破防，真是服了你們", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:40:28", "owner": "jian_ren", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17868172368505951, "text": "自己爛不能別人好", "created_at": "2025-12-13T01:24:46", "owner": "latromm1_st", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100364578775605, "text": "這種朋友遠離，沒本事陰陽怪氣自悲的要命，原地踏步還要拖別人下水，真兄弟是：爸養我", "created_at": "2025-12-09T04:59:22", "owner": "a246810a2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967032840843257, "text": "上次跟兄弟說謝謝 問候我是不是有病", "created_at": "2025-12-08T08:53:12", "owner": "rice2280", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18412288414137962, "text": "不只是谢谢，对不起也是", "created_at": "2025-12-07T16:13:55", "owner": "yuanchang09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941679288960177, "text": "真兄弟是都不說謝謝，謝謝是對不熟跟同事之間的客套話", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:45:36", "owner": "h710620", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084647129041885, "text": "唉人总有时候会变但自己不会（但我自己一个人喜欢孤独一个人）", "created_at": "2025-12-06T11:42:17", "owner": "potongtan60", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880429279426535, "text": "不要說兄弟 我就連兄弟姐妹的人情我都一定還 可能只有我爸媽的還不完而已", "created_at": "2025-12-06T08:00:31", "owner": "douka_tokage", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917215258218397, "text": "刻意說謝謝，但得明白他的謝謝是劃清界線", "created_at": "2025-12-06T06:18:22", "owner": "pisces_emperor24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079746566469521, "text": "階段性", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:01:16", "owner": "yaye_520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950776363062340, "text": "@liang09_02 有一天这个样子劳资锤你", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:38:47", "owner": "bryannnn_here", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17950082876920264, "text": "只能解讀成，自己該離開別當損友了⋯", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:43:44", "owner": "black.bunny.6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125542027509506, "text": "所以呀，我們賺錢，就是為了解決沒有錢解決不了的事。", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:09:17", "owner": "aprilapril7265", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987304233910730, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:14:56", "owner": "baixiaowei_86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099633424739100, "text": "@jiangliuxuanjiang 🚫這樣", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:56:57", "owner": "zhuang6686", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050143826676993, "text": "沒那麼玄乎，就是玩不到一塊兒了，就這麼簡單。", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:31:01", "owner": "siwasiva_1057", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18375395593153741, "text": "係真的 有啲人 發咗達就唔記得佢窮嘅時候 幫過佢嘅兄弟🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:48:40", "owner": "97panthe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845195908617536, "text": "無聊劇情", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:07:48", "owner": "jimmy_yu23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070994267063464, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:10:55", "owner": "jackel_cps", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165775660378972, "text": "上帝和瑪門你只能選一個", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:22:51", "owner": "rin.hanyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049918556665872, "text": "真正朋友間從來不談工作 不談事業 不談錢 除非遇到了瓶頸需要建議 除非錢是我們出去玩A的", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:12:53", "owner": "leon_leo_pold", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901902244323266, "text": "我觉得更像在阴阳怪气", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:12:07", "owner": "gagacai_30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083128604510703, "text": "本質上的如初", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:52:17", "owner": "doro._.xiaoxiao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086080187072414, "text": "☠️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:17:12", "owner": "dub.0524", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906172852272970, "text": "这样狗眼的朋友 绝对不是一起长大的 是认识没几年的可能没几天的 有钱的狗 和没钱的人 就看你自己怎么选了", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:57:31", "owner": "lim6_6sy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18548770510043636, "text": "神经病吧😂 这个删友法。圈子不同了 思维自然也不一样啊 这不是很正常吗", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:13:18", "owner": "jwjf23", "likes": 9}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["情感共鳴", "劇情", "真實還原", "云南白藥氣血康", "云南白藥元氣小金瓶"]},
{"media_id": 3769102427363692642, "shortcode": "DROirApE1Bi", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DROirApE1Bi/", "taken_at": "2025-11-19T06:00:00", "caption": "你見過網絡失語症嗎#喜歡 #戀愛 #愛情 #情侶 #治愈 #分手 #感情", "owner_username": "chen_ling_huo", "owner_id": "76215768384", "likes": 31182, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0052_DROirApE1Bi\\DROirApE1Bi_20251119_060000.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18034459964510280, "text": "問一下什麼是燒杯", "created_at": "2025-11-19T13:26:14", "owner": "lngtuybi909", "likes": 80}, {"id": 17937247911097528, "text": "我觉得沒问题啊？除了嘲笑唐氏患者", "created_at": "2025-11-19T08:58:17", "owner": "axin4287", "likes": 148}, {"id": 17868163065412461, "text": "完了 台灣小孩也逐漸變成這樣了，整天中國用語、網路用語掛嘴邊 聽了就燥", "created_at": "2025-11-20T04:37:10", "owner": "aya_.92811", "likes": 2067}, {"id": 18073816334270623, "text": "哪個年代不是這樣😂－代笑一代，八股文你都不一定看得懂，還笑？", "created_at": "2025-11-19T23:38:37", "owner": "privatechef_alstonleunghk", "likes": 20}, {"id": 17847220674582019, "text": "杜蕾絲新廣告嗎", "created_at": "2025-11-19T13:18:57", "owner": "handsome_man967", "likes": 284}, {"id": 18106389886711281, "text": "这和方言和 slang 有什么区别吗? 大惊小怪的", "created_at": "2025-11-19T23:06:28", "owner": "loululull", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18387455629183792, "text": "8964 better", "created_at": "2025-11-19T09:59:50", "owner": "1aman1g", "likes": 204}, {"id": 18050895836348600, "text": "下次剪高壓電線😊", "created_at": "2025-11-19T10:44:09", "owner": "_.yasm1n0v0", "likes": 64}, {"id": 17902218576161470, "text": "哪代没有自己的破梗呢", "created_at": "2025-11-20T10:37:06", "owner": "lllengzhiqi", "likes": 48}, {"id": 17931166809112107, "text": "很多留言都喜歡笑唐氏患者\n說點什麼他們還不開心\n就跟影片中小孩一樣🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-19T09:08:40", "owner": "vixx0210", "likes": 2125}, {"id": 18081701675326875, "text": "哇靠，這是我啊", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:00:45", "owner": "_sheep210", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18135208648466945, "text": "所以偶尔打骂还是需要的", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:06:30", "owner": "ye_mren", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17882828364407760, "text": "網路潮語跟正常話語最大的不同是潮語需要不斷更新，結果小孩就忙著更新這些詞搞到那些學一次就好的基本話語都不會說😩", "created_at": "2025-11-20T06:32:38", "owner": "lfung711", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18113458084571468, "text": "六十七比較好笑", "created_at": "2025-11-19T16:46:43", "owner": "peterchiu0001", "likes": 34}, {"id": 18163397200389899, "text": "以前說人家很六是很屌的意思，怎麼現在完全變了", "created_at": "2025-11-19T14:07:44", "owner": "junhong_1218", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17969135207972039, "text": "覺得說是可以的，但要分場合對象，也要明白那個詞的意思。小時候也學過別的孩子說髒話，但其實我根本不懂那意思，長大後覺得這是一段黑歷史😂\n之前還有言論說應該將一些網路用語納入正規中文😅個人覺得書面語跟口語還是應該區分開來的", "created_at": "2025-11-20T06:23:14", "owner": "chubby._.gummy", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17869313904478202, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T00:29:03", "owner": "ian.champ68", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18338857495227508, "text": "保險套廣告", "created_at": "2025-12-01T05:41:11", "owner": "a88107s40230", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18060369320554888, "text": "要用得這麼流暢也是不容易", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:02:05", "owner": "kasim_9497", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18349705555162760, "text": "平板小孩抖音腦 養出來就是沒教養", "created_at": "2025-11-19T15:52:26", "owner": "a_de0316", "likes": 1078}, {"id": 18539747782032983, "text": "兄弟忘了自己不是在和平精英裡", "created_at": "2025-11-20T07:37:04", "owner": "max_love_gura", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18099285757815472, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T14:02:38", "owner": "_11.20.__", "likes": 58}, {"id": 17928668817149562, "text": "那個小男孩長得好像馬嘉祺", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:33:06", "owner": "art_elizachoi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17879941704426425, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T16:13:37", "owner": "mr.haome", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061780424638008, "text": "太觸了", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:16:04", "owner": "_.33j33._", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049695833398006, "text": "再好的梗落到根本不會看時機說話的屁孩手上，就只會變得低級", "created_at": "2025-11-19T14:07:26", "owner": "90tl.y", "likes": 131}, {"id": 17902519074298082, "text": "真的好恨說六的人🙄張口閉嘴都只有六", "created_at": "2025-11-19T12:48:07", "owner": "darren_wong_yeuk_lai", "likes": 275}, {"id": 18076937564272782, "text": "@hung.6_19 包的", "created_at": "2025-11-19T17:12:57", "owner": "swenbaola", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17842204071624310, "text": "羽毛球打輸小孩確實菜", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:10:05", "owner": "barryyyyy_li", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071260421054450, "text": "67", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:18:24", "owner": "rarski0000", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17968717721824727, "text": "知道为什么吗？你试试打一段文字描述一下疫情期间的遭遇，看看多少政府敏感词，然后你就知道为什么需要网络语了。共产党这二十年最大的恶，就在教育和语言限制上。", "created_at": "2025-11-19T10:49:23", "owner": "untilledprofessorhamasaki", "likes": 329}, {"id": 17860281816541360, "text": "其實打一頓就怕了", "created_at": "2025-11-20T07:49:23", "owner": "lsx._._.0824", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17901224490300300, "text": "所以7891到底是什么意思？", "created_at": "2025-11-19T08:18:33", "owner": "_5x735", "likes": 601}, {"id": 18305760013266064, "text": "@izhii_yian181029 登峰造極", "created_at": "2025-12-10T13:01:20", "owner": "amiable_1904", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17886444687284648, "text": "其實我就是台灣小孩，我同學就是這樣，都不會分辨，一直在那邊用網路用語，我看了也挺不爽，根本不懂的分辨，甚至還在那邊不懂意思跟風", "created_at": "2025-12-13T12:06:29", "owner": "avocadoronnie", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085780468997133, "text": "@chien_7547 @usually_________ @we1xzzz @yclee9876 那咋了", "created_at": "2025-11-20T18:07:54", "owner": "koukakei_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17991322670891123, "text": "原來不是只有台灣家長這麼想", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:30:11", "owner": "dm0._112", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18094729759855686, "text": "低能啊", "created_at": "2025-11-19T18:23:50", "owner": "scoar.1117chen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17901539997316686, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-20T09:37:01", "owner": "su0eijiak", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17876978586351741, "text": "我25岁这么说话，am I cooked 💀💀", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:17:19", "owner": "zhangchi6724", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18492537223074923, "text": "@_lgh.212 燒杯", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:03:48", "owner": "kooji__176", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057888983291000, "text": "6767", "created_at": "2025-11-23T11:15:40", "owner": "jen_su.11.16_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076369003957903, "text": "口癖時期很快就會過了，耐心不懈潛移默化的家庭教育和接觸的環境，會讓他自己慢慢矯正過來", "created_at": "2025-11-20T00:44:18", "owner": "wangrui3829", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17957583246009418, "text": "絡失哈哈 笑死我了 懂的都懂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:33:52", "owner": "you.0630_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095736973659944, "text": "@r0ya1wei 媽的馬上想到你", "created_at": "2025-11-21T08:14:00", "owner": "luoancheng0624", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078489610922443, "text": "使用又沒什麼問題，問題是他們不懂的尊重好嗎？不要把錯誤怪在用語，是小孩的問題", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:16:54", "owner": "yao.yujin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988523655878198, "text": "67", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:18:41", "owner": "zhang318398", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17858096832555517, "text": "@luo_512169 你真的很解", "created_at": "2025-11-20T03:57:42", "owner": "y___bing", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18432594250129754, "text": "@zyylbxzy", "created_at": "2025-11-19T14:27:58", "owner": "marvin.0210", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18084127718013648, "text": "@lsh_05.10 @_chtzh75 你別這麼唐行不行", "created_at": "2025-11-24T09:38:51", "owner": "happy_everyda_y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997732806699032, "text": "@xuan_love_kae 哈哈哈这怎么似曾相识故人来", "created_at": "2025-11-23T16:39:43", "owner": "moxinylomi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047406386425195, "text": "这小孩演出生不像演的", "created_at": "2025-11-20T00:58:14", "owner": "yixiang07", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17857678122556669, "text": "说不是问题 问题得分清场合", "created_at": "2025-11-20T03:34:21", "owner": "imnotjimliu", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18071259350369262, "text": "67🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-19T13:45:47", "owner": "yy_.1218", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18174339937369597, "text": "求下一集 🥺🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-19T08:38:58", "owner": "cly950707", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065678021570058, "text": "笑死 這些小孩感覺不像演的😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T00:06:46", "owner": "lllllinlin7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17973255377951488, "text": "幹快笑死", "created_at": "2025-11-20T06:00:44", "owner": "litakaane", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17992862267717768, "text": "現在唐這個字已經變成台灣小孩的一種通俗用語了 真的很慘", "created_at": "2025-11-19T19:13:25", "owner": "921102_angushs", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18165036619375941, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-20T06:07:40", "owner": "walesern", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18365943361094168, "text": "如何呢，又能怎。这个梗让我连带着连单依纯都特别讨厌了😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T17:40:24", "owner": "4602leslie", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17908245825126043, "text": "@mizuto._.04 這你😢", "created_at": "2025-11-20T14:35:50", "owner": "where_is_my_firefly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068478497094037, "text": "頂級小學生", "created_at": "2025-11-19T14:15:42", "owner": "_youjunnn", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17936291009982823, "text": "誰啊出來", "created_at": "2025-11-20T10:18:49", "owner": "x_yc.c", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18273803764304269, "text": "男孩一定欠揍", "created_at": "2025-11-19T13:01:52", "owner": "nala.leung_0205", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18099099811829468, "text": "我不行巴掌没办法让他们收敛", "created_at": "2025-11-20T03:29:56", "owner": "tzh_11250", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18110534560610694, "text": "這些網絡/熟人之間說一下無什麼問題，放到現實生活說就顯得不正常", "created_at": "2025-11-20T09:22:29", "owner": "plasticplayer.larp.hk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020616284785150, "text": "給到一個npc", "created_at": "2025-11-19T22:34:53", "owner": "fananyee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18328097230210488, "text": "笑都不能？", "created_at": "2025-11-19T13:53:43", "owner": "cch_nitezx1030", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18061659326575805, "text": "還不是他們自己發明的", "created_at": "2025-11-19T11:09:50", "owner": "ldc._.1227", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18037230644723779, "text": "67 is better (I live in China)", "created_at": "2025-11-19T14:11:49", "owner": "_minlixxiee_", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17846171472609375, "text": "Six-seven 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-19T15:08:35", "owner": "frapoo.png", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17953305704899169, "text": "✖️🧠👉🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-11-19T13:05:50", "owner": "a217015", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18095848636876504, "text": "埃及拔草", "created_at": "2025-11-19T17:50:30", "owner": "_yun.1016", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090451498915822, "text": "我以為是67", "created_at": "2025-11-19T12:46:33", "owner": "fbrbchdcikc", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18166973539348632, "text": "這種智障小孩，建議趁還沒長大先燒4ˇ🔥❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-13T13:50:25", "owner": "sun_10.29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085516138863722, "text": "每代都有自己的網路用語這沒問題，但新一代小孩他們的問題是，分不清楚場合以及會用網路用語去掩蓋自己的錯誤和不禮貌", "created_at": "2025-12-13T09:58:19", "owner": "lolo95656", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18318989275222301, "text": "我们不说包的，我们说志在必得😂", "created_at": "2025-12-13T09:37:34", "owner": "crush13._.48", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082836692115204, "text": "有的時候小朋友被罵了卻在嬉皮笑臉，不是因為他真的白目，而是他覺得這樣可以掩蓋他內心的不悅。如果在班上被公眾處罰更有可能這樣", "created_at": "2025-12-12T15:13:29", "owner": "zzzzzzzzzzzzzzuo_0111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927268555175687, "text": "志在必得", "created_at": "2025-12-12T13:56:05", "owner": "0618_sean", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121052839539071, "text": "不分场合，这是傻", "created_at": "2025-12-11T10:42:22", "owner": "richter_92.2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980601102782133, "text": "这个视频真的唐", "created_at": "2025-12-11T07:06:01", "owner": "n070127", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136924993465980, "text": "123也不行", "created_at": "2025-12-11T00:45:46", "owner": "rx179001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963395316861272, "text": "说梗跟不礼貌是两码事，不礼貌是情商低的一种表现", "created_at": "2025-12-10T05:51:00", "owner": "omega.9.5.2.7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185715097356524, "text": "我真的會把這孩子吊起來打，給他們一個完整的童年😍🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:56:18", "owner": "anita._.0801", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303889285250217, "text": "幹他媽聽了很躁", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:04:50", "owner": "1_cnrxay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087838025491458, "text": "應該重新施行體罰😏😏😏", "created_at": "2025-12-07T21:55:21", "owner": "dkmy731", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887548075402597, "text": "弱智仔", "created_at": "2025-12-07T13:03:21", "owner": "king1013369", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074415881205095, "text": "包的是什麼意思", "created_at": "2025-12-07T07:39:46", "owner": "fen670127", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979789419945274, "text": "漢语是漢语，支纳语是支纳语", "created_at": "2025-12-06T08:31:30", "owner": "yan_201a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948290547934690, "text": "他們什麼都能想歪 說下面就是…黃色就是….", "created_at": "2025-12-06T03:38:53", "owner": "leikelody", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064768403574602, "text": "安卓小孩😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T01:12:55", "owner": "vivivintan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923127064053578, "text": "望子成龍鞭+痛改前非架 混合雙打", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:52:24", "owner": "zli65400", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137958025464313, "text": "@khlbzzn stop", "created_at": "2025-12-03T23:33:21", "owner": "siudingg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896938894349190, "text": "@liyutian 你真燒", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:55:23", "owner": "fixer092257", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18349582252202524, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:56:37", "owner": "geez._.wth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303536128265249, "text": "其實梗也沒什麼，但小朋友可能不能判斷什麼場合能說，失了禮貌🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-02T08:04:34", "owner": "maggielin1029", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082778335867838, "text": "什么是78 91？", "created_at": "2025-12-02T07:36:57", "owner": "neochenxi6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885511588407103, "text": "不就都抖音害的？ 影片那些言語很沒禮貌不覺得嗎？", "created_at": "2025-12-01T18:45:00", "owner": "ekuseren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002403971833273, "text": "受著", "created_at": "2025-12-01T12:43:00", "owner": "x1q0jiba666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158619346403525, "text": "每個年代都會 但現在網路太發達 ，小孩都覺得 ，理所當然", "created_at": "2025-12-01T10:49:01", "owner": "jing._.0111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023638319790193, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T06:40:46", "owner": "wubvches", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047952083429528, "text": "3c育兒囉", "created_at": "2025-12-01T02:25:11", "owner": "funyoung1995", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857055016511455, "text": "一巴掌下去🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:08:38", "owner": "yamada1994yt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065368970419457, "text": "低俗是… 嗯 在一个不能自由和批判性思考的过渡保护社会里的唯一乐趣…. 咳咳咳", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:55:18", "owner": "xiona.lixiang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080864045115432, "text": "让我想起当时百度贴吧还是哪里禁用傻逼这个词，搞得有段时间逼的人用伞兵代替，结果一看这伞兵那儿伞兵没办法，不得已解封了傻逼", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:32:24", "owner": "weemansteve218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862820680534658, "text": "其實還好啦……現在幾乎沒人會這樣吧（本人是小學生）", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:02:44", "owner": "alex_love_bakugo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105043780657366, "text": "其實也是他們的父母沒有家教才會教育出他們 他們父母的父母與師長也沒有家教 人類從文明開始到現在就全都是廢物\n所以人類要好好檢討進步了嗎？\n不給世界一個大改變\n就只能永遠像螢幕上的人們\n整天說謊裝傻充愣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:21:49", "owner": "louisli1024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867477352489809, "text": "家暴神拳", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:51:22", "owner": "likongwen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091702348926161, "text": "弟弟也有因為看太多中國片", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:12:26", "owner": "joj38915", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18381835660151275, "text": "有點低能", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:58:01", "owner": "marigold_0318", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900709420324419, "text": "阿對對對", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:48:58", "owner": "chensheng53", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18516154573065633, "text": "我反手就是一巴掌，喜歡這樣講我就送去愛心之家體驗體驗生活🙂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:11:48", "owner": "yiting_0322_810_923", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919734976197599, "text": "91是啥", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:42:50", "owner": "yuan86_10_22_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102534928671393, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T17:10:11", "owner": "kt.n._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090883660906189, "text": "印象以前還會辦火星文大賽（網路剛起來的時候），那年代還沒如此政治正確，個人覺得不管看蠟筆小新、烏龍派出所還是天線寶寶，最終的人品還是要看自己，想不想跟風，跟這些東西本質要分開來看。", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:58:44", "owner": "jinyude0520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094031005872112, "text": "@fangwel0324 你別這麼唐", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:13:17", "owner": "kukuo547538_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18339928405229161, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:30:38", "owner": "hi_felix_pri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18414140131141533, "text": "看太多抖音，都變白癡了，抖音一開，父母白養", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:13:44", "owner": "siulong_25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949470454048210, "text": "抖音一關\n世界平安", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:30:52", "owner": "chi_angel09487", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086765818987263, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T14:14:29", "owner": "nimtznimtz07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079655645169694, "text": "結果長輩自己都先被抖音控制", "created_at": "2025-11-23T14:08:10", "owner": "bluesky2022_lan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008470268650997, "text": "你別這麼唐我直接笑爆", "created_at": "2025-11-23T12:53:28", "owner": "alex__.0828_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18192308623328507, "text": "蠻可悲的  自以為這樣很厲害 跟漂亮", "created_at": "2025-11-23T11:32:24", "owner": "mingkaihe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100989193757932, "text": "但，那是小孩子的天性，就像我們小時候聽到 兩條線相交(香蕉)，A,比B大(比逼)，我們也會笑。種族歧視和嘲弄病人是不好的，一定要指正，但學習會有壓力，為什麼不能看短視頻笑笑呢？", "created_at": "2025-11-23T11:31:54", "owner": "sunny20200508", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867780046481321, "text": "欸我又沒有多老怎麼都聽不懂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T10:38:31", "owner": "allenchao0131", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842036431629854, "text": "觸", "created_at": "2025-11-23T07:05:38", "owner": "g._.gg.ggggggggg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092636395912914, "text": "7891是什麼意思", "created_at": "2025-11-23T06:17:45", "owner": "hung._.1208", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18294664822285530, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:00:18", "owner": "_sb878787", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106426453627254, "text": "我們以前是先有三觀才有手機，現在小孩是在抖音快手學三觀", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:00:47", "owner": "surtr42_chen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18317415670220998, "text": "很好啊", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:30:39", "owner": "too.ez.4.me", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540536824039389, "text": "屁孩真的不懂什麼該說什麼不敢說就閉上你那欠打的嘴", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:52:43", "owner": "yuanbotant5338", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109451761719154, "text": "攻击力好高", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:01:23", "owner": "cy1.048596", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074872811001383, "text": "7891", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:38:43", "owner": "buishuen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062587166564080, "text": "這種就是寵壞了、沒家教、沒教養、一點規矩都沒有", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:24:24", "owner": "john155151", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867143767488795, "text": "小孩大人講這種話都很想巴下去", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:02:29", "owner": "j._6_._y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930761914132176, "text": "說我菜就多練我看你是欠我殺球", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:44:04", "owner": "_small_ian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101265544688426, "text": "發個朋友圈還要去網絡搜文案，這句攻擊力太強了", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:29:34", "owner": "cutegirlbosen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939773397963967, "text": "兩岸現況", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:56:04", "owner": "chiwa_.0207", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083603414050589, "text": "可以說人話嘛？", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:03:21", "owner": "izayoi1986", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979187394941993, "text": "燒杯跟7891什麼意思😮", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:00:41", "owner": "jzx.1.3_1121", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874065841450476, "text": "我们那个年代网络好歹没那么流行，就算偶尔讲些网络梗也是非常轻微的，作文里也根本不会写。如果真的像影片那样那就是大问题了，所以说做父母的在孩子面前要言传身教，不刷短视频，多看书，孩子的家教还能好点", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:19:23", "owner": "yy_dd_1910", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353180635160841, "text": "你知道什麼比24好笑嗎", "created_at": "2025-11-21T23:59:56", "owner": "ran.yj_0511", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917348089075818, "text": "其實真的沒什麼問題 \n我們小時候也是這樣的", "created_at": "2025-11-21T22:10:04", "owner": "anniethingelse_ss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539714383053479, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-21T14:12:40", "owner": "shin._.0323", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082100765115289, "text": "@j_ccy1023 我們", "created_at": "2025-11-21T13:29:34", "owner": "dreamrunnerz_rody418", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088594207768239, "text": "來頓閃電五連鞭，哭了就說哈哈你急了，幾次就正常了", "created_at": "2025-11-21T11:25:27", "owner": "zhao_xianyi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012920960799833, "text": "@owob__0408, @lu.shaoxuan, @ronekew, @yh._810, @sandy_0w0d, @vex_1i7u_vexx, @zhang.__kai, @5omegaysa__, @7ike.zy_, @1yooz_, @luquan.0, @rh1cks_ox6 你們超唐", "created_at": "2025-11-21T10:39:35", "owner": "y_sh__529._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079955270169522, "text": "請問包的和菜花在小孩圈子裡是什麼意思？", "created_at": "2025-11-21T07:18:13", "owner": "wen8057abc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112487977599703, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-21T05:07:20", "owner": "poppydontsleep_zz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103482979726409, "text": "@wan.g2009 罵的就是你這種梗小鬼", "created_at": "2025-11-21T04:17:51", "owner": "kua._.scalp_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18082083344025648, "text": "@z3r0perc3nt 你沒救了", "created_at": "2025-11-21T03:44:28", "owner": "dejavu__0_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18103046302590679, "text": "有的沒什麼好罵的大人也在罵", "created_at": "2025-11-21T01:08:52", "owner": "cadillacu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845165287613032, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-20T20:14:58", "owner": "5tcy2r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042518771699744, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-20T20:14:56", "owner": "5tcy2r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18328411615209294, "text": "中国就喜欢开发抖音这种损人不利己的应用", "created_at": "2025-11-20T17:29:46", "owner": "testacc4381", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338280709226389, "text": "屁話一堆 以前那幾代還不是智障淦你娘cnm dllm天天掛嘴邊  那代的小朋友有學起來跟老師講嗎  沒禮貌就沒禮貌  跟迷因和梗有關係嗎", "created_at": "2025-11-20T16:41:04", "owner": "sk_iixx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18416227315191669, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-20T16:03:28", "owner": "weiyin516", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123226840460768, "text": "既然時事梗都不能講那我學古人創造出來的成語要幹嘛？那也是古時候古人的慣用詞？笑死還要背典故", "created_at": "2025-11-20T15:46:53", "owner": "siyen_1213p", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18351778444165906, "text": "這是一種文言文嗎", "created_at": "2025-11-20T15:33:54", "owner": "mnba147258", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078098789515374, "text": "67", "created_at": "2025-11-20T15:24:05", "owner": "min_.0629", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18415493821137610, "text": "這種真的有夠討厭，像點擊輸入文本", "created_at": "2025-11-20T15:00:32", "owner": "hahaha_12345_hio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844485418602521, "text": "@brian._.0417 你個小燒杯", "created_at": "2025-11-20T15:00:25", "owner": "sean._.0915", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049734503676194, "text": "67", "created_at": "2025-11-20T14:57:35", "owner": "jaesey_crumps", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080253845161222, "text": "當下我就會跟孩子說，等一下我就讓你變燒杯，笑屁笑，出去站著，你真給你媽丟臉", "created_at": "2025-11-20T14:33:44", "owner": "yachin1994", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083428436020899, "text": "@freqwency._ 十磅雞巴勃", "created_at": "2025-11-20T14:10:53", "owner": "randy_xing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960889086865326, "text": "No one care nigga 🥀🥀🥀", "created_at": "2025-11-20T14:10:08", "owner": "hatsune_mikujvkhx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18180833176358361, "text": "靠腰好像咯嘅成", "created_at": "2025-11-20T14:02:56", "owner": "shuven_c715", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940596372961385, "text": "老铁们，所以 8964 到底是啥意思😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-20T13:56:34", "owner": "k19z.eth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544791262011924, "text": "連強國都受不了支語啦 還是我偉大的黨🤫", "created_at": "2025-11-20T13:44:55", "owner": "amd.r5.8600g_pro.user", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855033121569193, "text": "啊現在家長不打小孩嗎", "created_at": "2025-11-20T13:39:21", "owner": "ano87379", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18365748799094379, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-20T13:34:55", "owner": "marcus__1001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952823644046330, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-20T13:08:29", "owner": "d33zbnuts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104624794632239, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-20T12:29:15", "owner": "zejing0908", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18378067975147957, "text": "91rb", "created_at": "2025-11-20T12:12:57", "owner": "minidodo860302", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135742795465414, "text": "6", "created_at": "2025-11-20T11:59:51", "owner": "yusnaez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18411887134140442, "text": "低文化社会", "created_at": "2025-11-20T11:49:17", "owner": "lin_zilinguo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915968077215090, "text": "裝什麼好人， 一掌打下去回復原廠設定", "created_at": "2025-11-20T11:42:39", "owner": "enelenion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890942167243706, "text": "市場永遠是對的，抖音才是未來主流", "created_at": "2025-11-20T11:40:10", "owner": "walker4009", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18374111203158137, "text": "不会好好說話，出去不要說自己是00后讓全世界覺得00后都長这样", "created_at": "2025-11-20T10:33:43", "owner": "alvin_19275", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919355530211225, "text": "所以说要打 小孩子天性其实都有点贱", "created_at": "2025-11-20T09:28:53", "owner": "aeezya", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079378385141349, "text": "67", "created_at": "2025-11-20T09:03:56", "owner": "berger.ccji", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964277659005723, "text": "怎麼沒有地果跟報一絲", "created_at": "2025-11-20T08:59:53", "owner": "shuxian4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108387916532000, "text": "@rayboy0107 @juiiuoo1111 牛皮", "created_at": "2025-11-20T08:50:37", "owner": "andy920319_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068112572457699, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-20T07:44:20", "owner": "ingrid_bunny_girl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934915639125564, "text": "急了", "created_at": "2025-11-20T07:30:26", "owner": "fook__1001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383209411196681, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-20T07:15:51", "owner": "tofu_flower_m4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060385829557381, "text": "唐氏綜合症不是「病」", "created_at": "2025-11-20T05:12:03", "owner": "justin_h.corgi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884541778403324, "text": "@bzn_d.7 這他媽你", "created_at": "2025-11-20T05:05:17", "owner": "zhen.11__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18386417983181146, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-20T04:57:33", "owner": "kevin.tingqian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066346439121775, "text": "6什麼67嗎", "created_at": "2025-11-20T03:58:41", "owner": "panp4n_42", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123341023518655, "text": "安全套廣告🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-20T03:55:05", "owner": "22hin_714", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005381696667213, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-20T02:14:00", "owner": "suzukakyou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031591619754926, "text": "怎么没有67", "created_at": "2025-11-20T01:24:22", "owner": "fwh_67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087604817480860, "text": "超無聊的梗 難笑", "created_at": "2025-11-20T01:06:20", "owner": "sybau_idgaf_fr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859914724476187, "text": "還以為發成績那段要説67", "created_at": "2025-11-20T01:03:24", "owner": "lil_jiez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18551392864024600, "text": "講屁，你們中國人不懂粵語也不懂正體字", "created_at": "2025-11-20T00:04:42", "owner": "jeffery_hin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028344146558243, "text": "一個巴掌下去就老實了", "created_at": "2025-11-19T23:10:54", "owner": "sktt2jason", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18340224985231059, "text": "67", "created_at": "2025-11-19T21:00:29", "owner": "sean.t.24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946872190061251, "text": "欠如揍🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-19T20:55:21", "owner": "joey_pao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957485190882407, "text": "@yuuuu.1026", "created_at": "2025-11-19T20:39:17", "owner": "cstkb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980096445775936, "text": "唐唐症症的中國人", "created_at": "2025-11-19T20:37:51", "owner": "zackgogogo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058634690252839, "text": "67", "created_at": "2025-11-19T19:40:54", "owner": "yym995", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851047663592132, "text": "没有67吗？", "created_at": "2025-11-19T18:47:27", "owner": "fnsmile321_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950012365026078, "text": "拍片字幕，個個字詞都定義為敏感字，注定出現腦殘中文", "created_at": "2025-11-19T18:20:02", "owner": "pc10932025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18413033929136091, "text": "这就是中国，", "created_at": "2025-11-19T18:09:13", "owner": "alan_xls", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18339474844226540, "text": "看不懂網路用詞怎麼來的 一群低能當老師在網路一直流傳奇怪的方言", "created_at": "2025-11-19T17:48:27", "owner": "chun_0925_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17937401667096564, "text": "這種小孩，打死就好了", "created_at": "2025-11-19T17:12:32", "owner": "dragon_7749230", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063891305182550, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T16:49:00", "owner": "wck.me", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18411371596136946, "text": "@amodigaga 666阿", "created_at": "2025-11-19T16:45:00", "owner": "yu07l8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074017100005996, "text": "燒杯😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T16:24:58", "owner": "shy_ann_ann___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103249273654815, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T15:51:30", "owner": "mrcloudy0918", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098419621761055, "text": "破如防是什麼鬼之語法😢", "created_at": "2025-11-19T15:50:06", "owner": "dukesheng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087895733479333, "text": "反正機棒子下去都老實了", "created_at": "2025-11-19T14:15:32", "owner": "zzzaice", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18133771642469321, "text": "超🍬", "created_at": "2025-11-19T14:12:08", "owner": "alston_0315", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929341624137306, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T13:58:26", "owner": "shiraryo_0403", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843251998611820, "text": "雖然我沒有很常說 我只覺得說網路的一些梗都要看場合 可能是年紀太小吧 不然誰沒事跟大人玩梗 而且一般的就算了 開地獄梗只是讓別人知道自己素質低", "created_at": "2025-11-19T13:42:31", "owner": "lin.x.x.x", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18116635912493108, "text": "妙妙喜歡Idle嗎 看她衣服上有Neverland", "created_at": "2025-11-19T12:46:34", "owner": "lb_yeliah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396079906131321, "text": "8964", "created_at": "2025-11-19T12:06:09", "owner": "chungweijen", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["喜歡", "戀愛", "愛情", "情侶", "治愈", "分手", "感情"]},
{"media_id": 3714635237746703325, "shortcode": "DONCRFYCnvd", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DONCRFYCnvd/", "taken_at": "2025-09-05T02:24:29", "caption": "當你只是想分享自己的生活時#中式教育 #父子#火雞面", "owner_username": "erry69764", "owner_id": "75679677402", "likes": 117068, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0053_DONCRFYCnvd\\DONCRFYCnvd_20250905_022429.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17963435126816972, "text": "所以我都不想講", "created_at": "2025-09-05T07:01:21", "owner": "07_06_o3o_", "likes": 11133}, {"id": 18069899399232530, "text": "首先家裡窮不是小孩的問題", "created_at": "2025-09-21T09:30:31", "owner": "fcac_77", "likes": 2454}, {"id": 17990101145835993, "text": "每個家長不都這樣嗎", "created_at": "2025-09-06T06:00:47", "owner": "coco_01097", "likes": 1320}, {"id": 18055768508168676, "text": "15元你跟我說貴？？？？", "created_at": "2025-09-06T00:16:32", "owner": "jingyan1108", "likes": 4746}, {"id": 18264904987303305, "text": "要生就不要靠邀😌", "created_at": "2025-09-05T23:39:23", "owner": "zzzzzzh._.x", "likes": 840}, {"id": 18116031139508138, "text": "如果換成西方的家長，反而會被罵說怎麼沒買他的，然後還說吃一口結果一半的麵都被吃走，之後打鬧的回家，中式教育多跟西方學學", "created_at": "2025-09-06T13:49:43", "owner": "jamse4689", "likes": 596}, {"id": 17911294854204257, "text": "想一想是不是很瘋狂，我的父母認識我的時間比這個世界上任何人都要久，可是他們卻依然沒有解鎖那種能夠讓他們知道我喜歡什麼書、什麼音樂的「關係等級」。今天在公園隨便一個陌生人，卻能在十分鐘內就知道了。 \n他們總是堅持說他們最了解我，但他們不知道的那個「我」，其實是經過精心挑選和塑造的，只是為了盡量減少衝突以及和他們的互動。 \n我的父母從來沒有花心思去關心我的生活或興趣，在他們眼中，我只不過是成績單上的幾個數字。那是唯一能讓我得到他們認可的方法，如果夠幸運，還能讓他們刮目相看。每次我談起自己喜歡或熱衷的事，他們的回應不是「你是不是迷上這個了」就是簡單的一句「嗯哼」和點頭。並不是我不想讓他們知道我的生活，而是每次都會變成單方面的對話，或者變成一堂人生課。 \n他們到現在還以為我最喜歡的顏色是粉紅色，可那早在很多年前就不是了。", "created_at": "2025-09-06T12:20:07", "owner": "lost.stay.luv", "likes": 1012}, {"id": 17878463706397605, "text": "都是澱粉除了調味料有差嗎", "created_at": "2025-09-05T23:29:48", "owner": "jinglin272", "likes": 47}, {"id": 18082477606785184, "text": "爸爸 呼吸器也太貴了 要不我們別用了吧😢", "created_at": "2025-10-03T09:27:29", "owner": "megua__", "likes": 96}, {"id": 18074729809845123, "text": "和爸媽分享以後想去的學校，然後她開始說要努力不要每次都三分鐘熱度...", "created_at": "2025-09-05T17:36:41", "owner": "751_713", "likes": 28}, {"id": 18082243540807453, "text": "大概85年後當爸就會：欸幹你怎麼有錢買！分我吃億點😂", "created_at": "2025-10-08T15:13:58", "owner": "allen.w.3886", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18097469665719969, "text": "歐幹！竟然真的對上了。美好的童年回憶😍", "created_at": "2025-09-06T09:58:01", "owner": "like_cat0927", "likes": 23}, {"id": 18054422060280421, "text": "我爸就這樣，每次都被他搞到很想哭🙃", "created_at": "2025-10-20T15:34:14", "owner": "rui1001023", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17971255289927388, "text": "只吃米飯的確沒這個營養（？", "created_at": "2025-09-05T13:54:27", "owner": "yeh_debbie_kiwi", "likes": 364}, {"id": 17863285044398533, "text": "這就是亞洲教育下的悲哀，小孩從小就需要看大人的臉色做事，不敢有太多自己的想法，只會被說不要想那麼多、聽父母的就對了，導致長大後，不知道自己想要什麼、茫然的過完一生😢", "created_at": "2025-09-06T12:41:42", "owner": "mr.dopeeee", "likes": 43}, {"id": 18407994358116091, "text": "嘖嘖小孩自己爽生\n生後又不爽 一開始在爽什麼", "created_at": "2025-09-06T04:08:03", "owner": "muku10__12", "likes": 425}, {"id": 17994708140828089, "text": "分享生活通常被這樣掃興一次，下次就不會找他說了", "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:25:07", "owner": "tatsuya_5566", "likes": 735}, {"id": 17963136254846919, "text": "只是部短影片而已，卻看到我火都上來了", "created_at": "2025-11-04T08:08:06", "owner": "kai_en_2", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17911401483075277, "text": "亞洲父母：\n沒考到狀元你這輩子沒了\n考到狀元了 然後呢 能當飯吃嗎", "created_at": "2025-09-06T13:25:52", "owner": "zi._.chen09", "likes": 443}, {"id": 18521056675043974, "text": "很多时候长辈总是在不恰当的时间说教", "created_at": "2025-09-06T12:29:06", "owner": "honggm04", "likes": 42}, {"id": 18014193389785937, "text": "我媽耶😢", "created_at": "2025-09-06T11:08:31", "owner": "roy1010326", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067516634241802, "text": "我爸不会和我这样子说话的,他会我想什么买什么没钱问问他拿就可以了😁", "created_at": "2025-09-27T02:28:49", "owner": "winoul_01.06", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18032544710722587, "text": "家長都這樣🙃", "created_at": "2025-10-21T04:34:12", "owner": "tina.wang0513", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17851370541571636, "text": "兩張N卡期待融合出SR卡", "created_at": "2025-10-26T19:31:57", "owner": "guanlunfu", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17980893695885003, "text": "莫名其妙", "created_at": "2025-09-06T09:25:26", "owner": "zhen._224", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18533359966043164, "text": "那以後住院不也是要花我的錢，那我現在不花你的錢，以後是不是就可以不用幫你花錢？", "created_at": "2025-09-13T14:18:38", "owner": "peter.pan8787", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17907855576124975, "text": "我妈就是这样，然后自己炒股亏了十几万，有三万块钱还是我刚工作存的", "created_at": "2025-11-16T23:29:59", "owner": "liuyuexin1016", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085558510931964, "text": "笑死很想傳給我爸但不敢(◐‿◑)�", "created_at": "2025-10-09T11:22:36", "owner": "8._lrz", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18138690214442386, "text": "當初套不帶好現在就不要吵", "created_at": "2025-09-19T13:39:55", "owner": "yi.sl._.mmm", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18080804105513179, "text": "？才3元喔", "created_at": "2025-11-13T11:55:50", "owner": "venus_08283", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17970444629952678, "text": "論家長的邏輯", "created_at": "2025-10-19T08:05:55", "owner": "j117301", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18121545175492837, "text": "简单 翘二郎腿然后看着他 然后边吃边弄到很大声 然后一直夸赞这个食物 让他羡慕，如果他又骂你 你就说 既然父亲鼓励我了，那我只好吃了", "created_at": "2025-09-06T07:02:16", "owner": "fnsmile321_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18024371291739749, "text": "3塊丟給他 看他能買多少米\n買不到一斤 整碗麵糊他臉上", "created_at": "2025-09-21T11:23:00", "owner": "nigezheng", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17869584897467978, "text": "愧疚式教育", "created_at": "2025-11-12T01:24:13", "owner": "mad_ban.931216", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17901776931124989, "text": "這種家長最靠北", "created_at": "2025-09-06T14:28:32", "owner": "_fn12.yi", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18534399745012006, "text": "@zhang_0405_ “你是不是哑巴”", "created_at": "2025-10-19T00:34:56", "owner": "incometax001", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088028458912353, "text": "窮人第一次掌握權力的樣子", "created_at": "2025-10-20T10:51:43", "owner": "ovo99888", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18029530922567883, "text": "没事，早死早托生了。", "created_at": "2025-12-12T13:08:11", "owner": "ruohong.lin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17925522570078259, "text": "難度：亞洲", "created_at": "2025-10-19T08:55:55", "owner": "ch_.hank", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18409056529191418, "text": "我受不了欸我會炸掉要唸大家一起念", "created_at": "2025-10-24T12:01:12", "owner": "yuki.__.0110", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17887711359384029, "text": "這時候我比較想做後座", "created_at": "2025-10-25T13:14:15", "owner": "huc_1029", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18040183622492162, "text": "這是現在家裡的狀況被找到一個小錯誤就會被抓的不放", "created_at": "2025-10-28T06:59:37", "owner": "chad1231._.t", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084084643972993, "text": "所以才不想跟家裡人有交流。無意識的全方面人格打壓是真的令人窒息。我就是對仇人，挖空心思都沒辦法做到這樣大傷害。", "created_at": "2025-11-10T18:24:17", "owner": "kongzhengxy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075002438082978, "text": "你知不知道我每天在學校有多辛苦？給點獎勵應該的🌝", "created_at": "2025-09-07T09:43:30", "owner": "zc._.520._.1314", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18058831988248171, "text": "中國3塊台灣15塊", "created_at": "2025-11-09T12:05:26", "owner": "jhe03172025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068022581220591, "text": "陰陽怪氣🙂‍↔️", "created_at": "2025-09-16T23:41:31", "owner": "nyy._0226", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18033388307709646, "text": "分享欲0", "created_at": "2025-10-11T16:57:35", "owner": "dcnoicc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17983626131879616, "text": "這就是為什麼有時候真的不想說生活上的事", "created_at": "2025-10-12T10:37:08", "owner": "oo09721", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18107583655603538, "text": "所有家長都需要去看醫生了這種觀念已經過時了", "created_at": "2025-10-12T21:17:23", "owner": "atar19971110", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18037752986708800, "text": "这是中华传统最不应该遗传下来的", "created_at": "2025-10-19T02:39:12", "owner": "huangyanqing348", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17942120247064607, "text": "頂嘴一句，父母就在那自言自語一個小時。", "created_at": "2025-10-17T07:42:32", "owner": "thethxcute", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18044198954447616, "text": "只能说穷就别生🤔又不是孩子的错", "created_at": "2025-10-21T16:59:02", "owner": "teabag_d", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056400839622482, "text": "亞洲父母刷不到系列", "created_at": "2025-09-07T08:11:28", "owner": "liaoyuquan11.18", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17889597093345475, "text": "地球online客服：恭喜抽中地獄難度 亞洲人", "created_at": "2025-09-13T13:27:56", "owner": "r.r.chattini1213", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098058556708506, "text": "亞洲父母be like 👍", "created_at": "2025-10-17T10:49:17", "owner": "_.georgebye", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17892739575302707, "text": "「買都買了」", "created_at": "2025-09-06T11:50:21", "owner": "_.09._.27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089547913696467, "text": "當屁在聽就好", "created_at": "2025-09-06T06:51:33", "owner": "chencyril24", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18003376691802066, "text": "一個月工資天天吃可以吃兩年呢", "created_at": "2025-09-05T21:17:12", "owner": "cba0810", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17982902156750769, "text": "《你花的是我的钱》《不像你这么有钱》", "created_at": "2025-10-15T14:27:48", "owner": "henryispro", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079444079487391, "text": "說話又說是頂嘴，不說話又說是啞巴😌", "created_at": "2025-10-04T17:26:24", "owner": "kaylie_ying_1022", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18194613400319114, "text": "來都來了", "created_at": "2025-10-12T11:41:05", "owner": "fuhongxun", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17922164610159547, "text": "所以我選擇不跟他講話", "created_at": "2025-10-08T14:07:45", "owner": "robinn_0818", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17949101934044331, "text": "亚洲惭愧式教育👏", "created_at": "2025-09-26T07:30:43", "owner": "manho.30", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17845452231549251, "text": "跟父母講他們只會說又亂花錢", "created_at": "2025-09-06T19:14:08", "owner": "cc._.yto", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17966537072977704, "text": "@zxc_0524", "created_at": "2025-10-10T08:42:24", "owner": "husky_0216", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17922321579115010, "text": "好像咒人死似的", "created_at": "2025-09-06T16:11:09", "owner": "miaoen._o", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18080299114797576, "text": "我爸：阿怎麼沒買我的", "created_at": "2025-09-27T16:11:02", "owner": "memory970410", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056411423222524, "text": "要是我的話，回家就往你的油箱裏灌砂糖", "created_at": "2025-10-07T10:16:35", "owner": "ttt_06llt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17863880700473765, "text": "壓力局", "created_at": "2025-10-07T11:10:24", "owner": "lonely._.329", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17891895780344885, "text": "買不起15塊的火雞面你是不是以前沒讀書😍", "created_at": "2025-10-07T12:04:19", "owner": "028a19", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18015445814784361, "text": "所以3塊錢能買多少米", "created_at": "2025-09-13T16:01:00", "owner": "ryan11.18", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18325573066237017, "text": "我小時候我家人也是這樣跟我教育的，然後做了什麼學了什麼跟他們分享也只會得到一句‘’學這個有用嗎？‘’或是‘’一天到晚都不唸書，只知道玩玩玩‘’最後呢？我玩也玩不過別人，唸書也是唸不過別人，而我在學校因為玩不過別人也念不過別人而被霸凌的時候，我家人卻要我忍下來", "created_at": "2025-09-15T05:45:57", "owner": "ironman_1997.10.16", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18082174492756799, "text": "跟我爸一樣沒苦硬吃", "created_at": "2025-09-27T12:10:14", "owner": "iey0703", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18529141159043469, "text": "學生輕生案的關鍵！！！", "created_at": "2025-09-27T14:22:08", "owner": "czl0222_dwdk_tw", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17853570582532830, "text": "所以我跟家人在一起是不會主動開啟話題的，總有事情可以唸", "created_at": "2025-09-06T14:26:41", "owner": "din_os.aur", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090694222762901, "text": "加油\n亞洲的大家抱抱\n當小孩好難…", "created_at": "2025-09-25T10:09:26", "owner": "ugenachen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18480103915072639, "text": "這我媽🫱", "created_at": "2025-09-24T23:41:13", "owner": "dolleny_cindy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18024504035543171, "text": "中国式家长", "created_at": "2025-09-22T23:27:36", "owner": "lee_zyc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17860120701490896, "text": "這就是為啥現在孩子內向 他們又說孩子自閉", "created_at": "2025-09-18T11:59:29", "owner": "pixelmosquit0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18038053616462483, "text": "對啊！不回話就被說是在跟牆壁講話嗎？講了又說罵你還理由一大堆💢💢💢", "created_at": "2025-09-07T07:00:57", "owner": "apricot_nuclear", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18162227908375453, "text": "亞洲父母啊，以前跟他分享搞到我分享欲沒了，後來連聊天都懶就在那邊說我都不陪他聊天？？我傻眼欸", "created_at": "2025-09-15T10:37:40", "owner": "cyy._.fly0831", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096093559637100, "text": "其實只是想聊天而以", "created_at": "2025-09-20T11:48:04", "owner": "kyle_98_95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956718900851102, "text": "太好了是亞洲教育我們沒救了😍", "created_at": "2025-09-19T17:20:47", "owner": "cqz1221", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075053488870932, "text": "然後當你漸漸跟他們疏遠時 他們又會開始抱怨你不跟家人分享事情._.", "created_at": "2025-09-19T12:37:03", "owner": "yera_neverland711", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17992094762832486, "text": "谁叫你生下来", "created_at": "2025-09-05T14:11:35", "owner": "fook__1001", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17946293841039971, "text": "如果真是三元一份 我買100份", "created_at": "2025-09-13T08:41:12", "owner": "elvis.presley2.0.s5", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18063023858597236, "text": "可憐", "created_at": "2025-09-06T11:51:27", "owner": "liyuerong56", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18118004395513242, "text": "來都來了~ 買都買了~", "created_at": "2025-09-17T16:20:24", "owner": "ethan__no.1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17963785622956818, "text": "才RM1.80😶？将便宜我天天买", "created_at": "2025-09-08T02:37:25", "owner": "wen._.62", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18075133592022697, "text": "亞洲父母都這樣，我也習慣了😢", "created_at": "2025-12-13T11:25:05", "owner": "7746331hsy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006636590829938, "text": "你為什麼要在我家裝攝像頭😡", "created_at": "2025-12-13T03:46:46", "owner": "renjie_0211", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079872971125996, "text": "不是 所以 當初為什麼要生小孩👎", "created_at": "2025-12-08T11:20:37", "owner": "reality_fishlee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062327387213353, "text": "所以他没读书？然后没钱？", "created_at": "2025-12-06T14:58:42", "owner": "deadmanquestion089", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917087776227784, "text": "屠龙者终成恶龙，现在我也这样了，咋办呢", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:23:57", "owner": "daniell_wuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085470821075342, "text": "又一個裝監視器的😢", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:02:25", "owner": "noire.ash", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075356461993891, "text": "爸药太贵就不给你买了哈😈", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:01:11", "owner": "unicorn.996767", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088558166498128, "text": "要準備好掰呼吸管了", "created_at": "2025-12-02T07:01:21", "owner": "10dragon2009", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102547528671280, "text": "這就是為什麼孩子漸漸不想待在家", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:04:39", "owner": "11._.lucas_yoma66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367162954092948, "text": "真的我都幾乎沒在講", "created_at": "2025-11-30T13:22:13", "owner": "yuc_1086", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930568171012172, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:39:49", "owner": "99_q76", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064846376440122, "text": "原本是想分享的，但說什麼只會被罵，到後面乾脆就不說了，反正說什麼都會被其他理由罵…", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:56:48", "owner": "yiawn_1ove", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090736138934945, "text": "所以說為什麼不帶", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:19:14", "owner": "sakura_22326", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961000300007275, "text": "趴掐狗", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:34:59", "owner": "auvnny1109", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128879254497272, "text": "窮就給我閉嘴🫵🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:50:57", "owner": "lys._05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18408901864190788, "text": "“我可不像你那么有钱”？？？？3块钱？？？？？", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:18:05", "owner": "yt._.121119", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105458218646370, "text": "越噴越上頭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:08:14", "owner": "hu.zongbo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18226084837307723, "text": "確實都這樣，但這影片更吸引我的是他車上帕恰狗的墊子👉🏻👈🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:19:11", "owner": "yu12._.09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069437720090227, "text": "我不知道要怎么回他 他就说我哑巴啊", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:06:25", "owner": "bruh.10100", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544596541009066, "text": "“想无缘无故骂我直说”", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:46:05", "owner": "atomyi1896", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119877748536884, "text": "+1", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:11:48", "owner": "ryanhuang03140314", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18315140431218192, "text": "你爸以後的財產是不是你的那現在是不是就是花你的錢你應該要頂嘴的😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T06:31:49", "owner": "emily20140615", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542425174059557, "text": "然後他們又説我們怎麼不跟他們說話🙄😠", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:16:39", "owner": "wongitoa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098269876751615, "text": "神經吧", "created_at": "2025-11-21T13:32:58", "owner": "li01_27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989271450881294, "text": "雖然但是，你自己掙那麼少不就是你自己的問題嗎？", "created_at": "2025-11-20T15:54:03", "owner": "ziyu.chmn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074512181519101, "text": "没吃过这个面，真的好吃吗？", "created_at": "2025-11-18T22:35:37", "owner": "_zzziggy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080818049152743, "text": "完美的亞洲父母", "created_at": "2025-11-18T08:21:18", "owner": "davisjim0301", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952733461024728, "text": "麵直接潑他臉上啊", "created_at": "2025-11-17T13:59:29", "owner": "lil_pottt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904736791146650, "text": "三块的火鸡面…这么便宜还要压力吗", "created_at": "2025-11-17T12:34:18", "owner": "chen.xi2022", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033512249523302, "text": "所以医生我爸就不需要救了。我找的钱也是辛苦钱 我爸爸火化 比较便宜过手术", "created_at": "2025-11-17T10:02:06", "owner": "anson_yap8998", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095249785895531, "text": "什麼叫我花他的錢，他以後遺產是我的，相當於我花我的錢：）", "created_at": "2025-11-17T07:26:43", "owner": "sam_liao.320", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854909407566267, "text": "你爸就是心情不好了哪一天的那心情好了你就這樣跟他講他就會跟你說：「是啊，那你多吃一點」", "created_at": "2025-11-16T14:24:05", "owner": "nina104520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983339889761121, "text": "我也是這樣😂😂而且不讓我打工又說我沒在賺錢...", "created_at": "2025-11-16T13:27:56", "owner": "brocoli_leo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095914039655397, "text": "@$%%#家長小時候是沒零用錢是不是", "created_at": "2025-11-16T11:20:51", "owner": "qiwei6835", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092935639868482, "text": "🌚", "created_at": "2025-11-16T05:47:13", "owner": "evanlierl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103696870726945, "text": "難道他們不是嫉妒嗎？😂可笑", "created_at": "2025-11-15T16:49:29", "owner": "plumbagoauriculata_642", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057207524293657, "text": "哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-15T14:50:02", "owner": "eighteeboy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543074353030690, "text": "你可以說：你知不知道我學習有多累，而且現在在花你的錢，長大後我賺錢不就換成你花我的錢了？現在你這樣唸我你信不信我長大後也這樣唸你", "created_at": "2025-11-15T13:02:44", "owner": "zhaoyihua20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083039762021415, "text": "這種父母我有一種解：忽視", "created_at": "2025-11-15T09:23:07", "owner": "kuan65807", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18410406724187327, "text": "如果吃了应该就没问题了", "created_at": "2025-11-15T06:53:26", "owner": "cynthiarosalinda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110426995526031, "text": "愛吃不吃", "created_at": "2025-11-15T05:05:59", "owner": "cbacbaj2010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100785859779339, "text": "小時候真的很常被這樣念 但現在工作才知道有多累", "created_at": "2025-11-14T10:36:13", "owner": "chen._jing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122632801522434, "text": "为什么骂自己", "created_at": "2025-11-13T08:57:17", "owner": "dal.ton824", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083061935046996, "text": "沒苦硬吃真的可悲 一輩子都去吃你的苦", "created_at": "2025-11-10T10:01:27", "owner": "randy.01_1m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865872064494318, "text": "台灣實心190元五分鐘就賺到還不能花媽喔的確步行它悶只有我們的一半", "created_at": "2025-11-09T12:07:21", "owner": "jhe03172025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075491414186028, "text": "@htc.__.1024", "created_at": "2025-11-08T10:30:11", "owner": "a7765a6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123231034512827, "text": "為什麼不打工", "created_at": "2025-11-07T18:01:40", "owner": "shaorong85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134055613470321, "text": "陰陽怪氣", "created_at": "2025-11-05T18:14:22", "owner": "phc_137", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851953417570858, "text": "掃興的父母", "created_at": "2025-10-29T22:03:52", "owner": "azsx_0805", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902515111295818, "text": "那咋了", "created_at": "2025-10-29T14:22:51", "owner": "tuhh_11278", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18311771260300409, "text": "Ts giving me ptsd 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-27T17:13:24", "owner": "realazee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073797779517584, "text": "12塊台幣靠腰什麼（？", "created_at": "2025-10-27T16:14:28", "owner": "xk_10.07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975721776939595, "text": "First rule: avoid any possible conversation to prevent conflicts", "created_at": "2025-10-26T11:10:09", "owner": "yapxiangloong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18392282080121735, "text": "爸爸活著太貴了，要不我們一起去天台吧？", "created_at": "2025-10-26T10:59:59", "owner": "sophia_101919", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072992528187009, "text": "跟我爸一樣 天🖕", "created_at": "2025-10-26T08:39:09", "owner": "funk._.70", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110872789576159, "text": "很便宜啊", "created_at": "2025-10-26T08:16:23", "owner": "hello___hello______hello_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045912257409309, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-25T16:21:33", "owner": "kwan_fishfish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18532450588039466, "text": "没说话就被爸爸说是一个木头人", "created_at": "2025-10-25T15:23:34", "owner": "isaaclooloo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121810996512135, "text": "被爸爸骂的时候说话会被爸爸骂说顶嘴", "created_at": "2025-10-25T15:23:19", "owner": "isaaclooloo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901738171294829, "text": "買都買了", "created_at": "2025-10-24T02:11:41", "owner": "ieieieieieieieieie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087269839934525, "text": "爸❌媽✅", "created_at": "2025-10-23T11:02:41", "owner": "dripped_jayy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18377743666180588, "text": "ㄗㄞ ㄊ ㄕㄞ", "created_at": "2025-10-22T08:34:22", "owner": "eathan_0821", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085121260771084, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-20T18:48:49", "owner": "zenkun._ryuuu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17904873774257259, "text": "依旧左脑攻击右脑", "created_at": "2025-10-20T03:56:53", "owner": "hx_315", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897563194177180, "text": "一模一样", "created_at": "2025-10-20T00:19:21", "owner": "zhy551818", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851654293568483, "text": "小碗吗？！？😢", "created_at": "2025-10-19T14:55:08", "owner": "jie5200829", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917018188193393, "text": "真的啊自己窮關我屁事啊養不起別生啊說得好像我逼得似的", "created_at": "2025-10-19T13:53:56", "owner": "white080630", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18324284044208079, "text": "這家長對$3的吠什麼？😂", "created_at": "2025-10-19T12:39:57", "owner": "hosqlomm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065140418093042, "text": "每次他們™在那邊苦難式教育的時候我都很想罵國粹，可是仔細想想畢竟他們也是長輩，但我又真的覺得他們很囉唆，然後我就會用一種很奇特的語氣說：「好，好，我以後賺了錢也甭給你買，不賤康，你每天就吃傳統白飯泡水，都我的錯，行了嗎？！」🙃", "created_at": "2025-10-19T09:41:28", "owner": "cindy1010921", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081544325001980, "text": "3不就是15💀", "created_at": "2025-10-19T07:59:22", "owner": "ys._.cy_07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065719286600408, "text": "超便宜好不好", "created_at": "2025-10-19T06:16:09", "owner": "sherryou21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107270494606323, "text": "老都老了為什麼不去死一死", "created_at": "2025-10-19T02:52:18", "owner": "akaeiii_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18327599941225212, "text": "相信我即便是好成績，也一樣會這樣😂", "created_at": "2025-10-18T18:23:33", "owner": "fin_chen_er", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061856690575400, "text": "根本一模一樣", "created_at": "2025-10-18T11:45:40", "owner": "znn928.skr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855528481542745, "text": "觸法連招", "created_at": "2025-10-18T11:09:13", "owner": "kekezhang818", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156446122394471, "text": "🐔巴老爸", "created_at": "2025-10-18T10:45:53", "owner": "20100203gg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863734909482041, "text": "⋯幹一模一樣", "created_at": "2025-10-18T06:49:24", "owner": "judy511_0304", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947590558021613, "text": "去死吧", "created_at": "2025-10-18T05:30:03", "owner": "mint0205_gzb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036681167502661, "text": "一模一樣🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-17T19:41:43", "owner": "fish._.0801", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073278095333292, "text": "一張R卡妄想另外一張R卡成為SSR", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:02:26", "owner": "keiwei__cho970418", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999651408823150, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-16T06:42:07", "owner": "dwang_yuyuyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057495668631329, "text": "我都在外面吃完才回家 被問吃什麼就說隨便吃", "created_at": "2025-10-16T05:25:31", "owner": "kaixiao.x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092588347877231, "text": "我家都這樣啥都不講讓他們自己想", "created_at": "2025-10-15T11:13:52", "owner": "l_y0326", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18315186616171420, "text": "只能說一模一樣", "created_at": "2025-10-14T13:10:55", "owner": "ydy_320", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869379142451193, "text": "养不起就不要生", "created_at": "2025-10-14T11:47:26", "owner": "jaesey_crumps", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17887985019363199, "text": "火鸡面也不是垃圾啊😢", "created_at": "2025-10-13T17:37:10", "owner": "hannah._hedoesntlikeme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107428687522900, "text": "Gaslight masters", "created_at": "2025-10-12T15:42:58", "owner": "painguin28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102199924619018, "text": "那你以後也不要生病，住院了花我一堆錢，吃個幾頓怎麼了", "created_at": "2025-10-12T07:51:41", "owner": "yuyu_329", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068582978523478, "text": "真实的", "created_at": "2025-10-11T12:59:46", "owner": "yosimi.15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945776329056939, "text": "高架上猛拉手刹 下一题", "created_at": "2025-10-11T10:54:12", "owner": "jeremypei17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843917908591907, "text": "父母看不到系列", "created_at": "2025-10-11T05:33:02", "owner": "yuxiesong789", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18394969633193441, "text": "我爸會直接說我也要吃", "created_at": "2025-10-10T18:24:38", "owner": "k0982669101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18290854843256816, "text": "長得好像林宥嘉", "created_at": "2025-10-10T11:42:29", "owner": "taljimadrau.k_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093676948816993, "text": "那你生個屁啊", "created_at": "2025-10-10T09:05:33", "owner": "jjean_wu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089012452704396, "text": "評論一群抱怨自己父母的 等你們長大後最好都不要成為你們父母 只是一群在網上打屁求安慰和點讚關注的小屁孩而已😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-10T05:27:17", "owner": "_yyds87", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17989116353712957, "text": "可憐欸情緒控管有問題就不要生", "created_at": "2025-10-09T18:26:09", "owner": "m_20.90.5.00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012826325622006, "text": "怕穷就别生", "created_at": "2025-10-09T10:56:28", "owner": "yeekeongteh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081274466070930, "text": "零花錢是他給的嗎？", "created_at": "2025-10-09T06:21:56", "owner": "tsanghin621", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973298703946754, "text": "反而我現在打工了花錢更大手筆了", "created_at": "2025-10-08T17:30:41", "owner": "cheng_2222225", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091823389832233, "text": "@himhim.6969 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-08T12:40:27", "owner": "himhim.6996", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055484087545677, "text": "高情商：晚上吊死在爸爸房門口", "created_at": "2025-10-08T05:47:25", "owner": "chankahappy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17979274847924842, "text": "国内父母是这样的", "created_at": "2025-10-07T04:30:21", "owner": "wuqu775", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043777193396048, "text": "賣火雞面的都比出去打工賺得多他那一盒人民幣3塊錢每週一到五在學校擺攤賣100盒全賣出去的話一個月6000人民幣他們打工賺的一個月3000、4000人民幣哪個吃香", "created_at": "2025-10-06T17:32:49", "owner": "every_0718", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18294886069265447, "text": "閉上你的狗嘴，畜生。", "created_at": "2025-10-05T18:14:19", "owner": "roks_ghost_commander", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999512544819107, "text": "我好害怕它弄到車上", "created_at": "2025-10-03T11:37:28", "owner": "clelia_ho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155059282387999, "text": "來都來了", "created_at": "2025-10-03T10:16:27", "owner": "zhankainingzhan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053104838286301, "text": "我需要的是你听我说 而不是说我", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:12:58", "owner": "woshicyan_kx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012350936797398, "text": "沒事，以後我也沒那麼多錢讓你插管，我會親自幫你拔", "created_at": "2025-10-01T15:52:21", "owner": "fanxin557", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080043442826895, "text": "我不理解有些家長為什麼會這樣，窮就不要生，生完又把氣撒在孩子身上，還說什麼有多幸苦，沒苦硬吃", "created_at": "2025-10-01T04:55:45", "owner": "ithaquas_dog", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876627553318941, "text": "沒錢真的不要生小孩，小孩不是出生當賤奴的真的", "created_at": "2025-09-29T08:42:38", "owner": "kdwkk923", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084244135905665, "text": "有錢買車沒錢買火雞麵", "created_at": "2025-09-27T08:55:27", "owner": "chan._.noob", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078285310834012, "text": "亞洲父母", "created_at": "2025-09-25T08:34:42", "owner": "sean_wu.misanthrope", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072474808917991, "text": "你累死累活就賺了3塊", "created_at": "2025-09-25T07:52:23", "owner": "youting0528", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981493200747098, "text": "呀看完想哭勒", "created_at": "2025-09-24T15:00:40", "owner": "ruby_jk.0430", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908860720093853, "text": "某些人：怎麼不是第一名，怎麼沒有滿分，少一分打10下，下次再少手機不能用，沒第一名就別回來這個家了", "created_at": "2025-09-23T02:37:39", "owner": "starfire_oao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083296292505237, "text": "我給我爸看他還破防了", "created_at": "2025-09-23T00:48:33", "owner": "what.is.dse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067827362350085, "text": "誰叫你要跟你老婆在那邊嗯嗯嗯，不然不要做啊，叫屁", "created_at": "2025-09-22T14:03:00", "owner": "hu_yu0912", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991153467702781, "text": "以後等着被拔氧氣管吧", "created_at": "2025-09-22T12:12:32", "owner": "cindyhosoong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18411469402116866, "text": "亞洲父母 💀", "created_at": "2025-09-21T10:29:57", "owner": "12kiana25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077479226316994, "text": "讓我想到昨天姊姊突然回家話講到一半就跟我聊說我研究所準備得怎麼樣\n真的不會聊天就不要硬聊媽的", "created_at": "2025-09-19T02:26:04", "owner": "cobe_yi1026", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928601908100171, "text": "我現在開始賺錢了\n我還是覺得便宜😢", "created_at": "2025-09-18T14:57:31", "owner": "xuan_ttp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844568701561229, "text": "😮‍💨", "created_at": "2025-09-18T01:35:36", "owner": "uno_reverse_card100", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18375892639197182, "text": "活該，現在在怪我不理你，就是因為知道你們是這種人", "created_at": "2025-09-17T06:34:09", "owner": "stray_cats267", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103904323593329, "text": "那你也是窮到不行15塊而已", "created_at": "2025-09-16T12:06:03", "owner": "psh_.34", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073124483323518, "text": "有問題的家長", "created_at": "2025-09-16T11:41:44", "owner": "xiaoshizi998", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17854580997475630, "text": "我爸知道我吃這麼便宜的東西都會問我是不是缺錢了", "created_at": "2025-09-16T10:41:05", "owner": "evanlin998thehappyguy", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18048600920663675, "text": "So this is universal 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-16T10:01:56", "owner": "kamsndek", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18408135364114014, "text": "我會搶走小孩的跟他說，來50塊給你你再去買一份多的當零用😂", "created_at": "2025-09-16T09:54:34", "owner": "j.c___k_k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046947971647070, "text": "講到後面那次不是談成績", "created_at": "2025-09-16T09:38:09", "owner": "lin.9_18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050406155300192, "text": "直接還回去，再陰陽怪氣就回學校住著，等警衛找到你再讓父母多跑幾趟，每次唸就每次這樣搞，搞到父母放棄唸你就可以了", "created_at": "2025-09-15T17:31:57", "owner": "steven861222", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396637669143565, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-09-15T13:58:44", "owner": "huanghao1005", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040588976414304, "text": "先3蚊多啲，好平啦喎", "created_at": "2025-09-15T09:29:17", "owner": "him_mercury.112", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089783644830565, "text": "來都來了", "created_at": "2025-09-14T15:04:34", "owner": "austinwang0831", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093089548664827, "text": "來都來了", "created_at": "2025-09-14T11:32:53", "owner": "qi377e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338076880166324, "text": "他爸爸要累死累活才能爭到一點點錢，就代表他的腦不夠聰明只能幹苦力活啊！以前不讀書，怪誰", "created_at": "2025-09-14T09:28:49", "owner": "jenny.10_09", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18020060348568086, "text": "就一盒火雞麵扯到那麼遠是在叫三小", "created_at": "2025-09-14T06:58:34", "owner": "1230._.joan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879531430390879, "text": "我直接叫他閉嘴", "created_at": "2025-09-14T02:32:19", "owner": "stiven_tan0322", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18184103131333532, "text": "是不是自己小時候也不努力才連三塊都這麼計較？", "created_at": "2025-09-14T01:31:22", "owner": "l_.oao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873754429421921, "text": "如果是我我會直接出去給車撞說我他嗎不花你的錢了我現在命也還你", "created_at": "2025-09-13T19:24:56", "owner": "ziqi8777", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18099517894623759, "text": "重開吧 建議找卡車 有機率開出爽號", "created_at": "2025-09-13T15:06:57", "owner": "cho_jay123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146780701407374, "text": "加一顆半熟蛋和煎肉", "created_at": "2025-09-13T11:42:05", "owner": "chenwei_811", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867875197371052, "text": "你這混蛋怎麼這麼難聊天", "created_at": "2025-09-13T08:27:34", "owner": "chara_dreemer_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912326602207501, "text": "等等3塊在台灣只能買飲料", "created_at": "2025-09-13T04:49:29", "owner": "zhi1010815", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18022733021741148, "text": "12塊這很省了", "created_at": "2025-09-13T03:23:25", "owner": "8567c.c.c.p", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070963279917999, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-13T03:04:03", "owner": "lori02240224", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121098550498964, "text": "为什么分享火鸡麵会扯到成绩🙃", "created_at": "2025-09-13T01:52:07", "owner": "iris_20120909", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036936377694429, "text": "台灣人：你告訴我這一大碗15？", "created_at": "2025-09-11T11:05:44", "owner": "jolink0106", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979994772858996, "text": "不是我不想分享啊！是完全沒意義啊", "created_at": "2025-09-11T10:50:20", "owner": "hxy.001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922096243146038, "text": "@bury1116 這誰家", "created_at": "2025-09-11T09:45:10", "owner": "gung.p1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018132761769172, "text": "@", "created_at": "2025-09-10T22:58:11", "owner": "chengen851", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000479063810383, "text": "你考一個好大學沒有辦法找什麼好工作這個劇本的爸爸就很像是那個問你說你是要一個億還是清華大學的錄取書一樣拿那個爸爸會說我要清華大學拿完全不知道選清華大學要從三小", "created_at": "2025-09-10T15:05:46", "owner": "21_0718_ami", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855407554516625, "text": "666", "created_at": "2025-09-10T07:08:22", "owner": "yu_shuang9924", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066212777206540, "text": "每次都扯東扯西", "created_at": "2025-09-09T17:01:51", "owner": "_newjeansdiary", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070066337167568, "text": "完了，這真的是我媽，就算打工自己賺的錢，他也能說我都在浪費錢💀", "created_at": "2025-09-09T01:02:56", "owner": "yang_.cjy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18187842250322940, "text": "講了生氣不講生氣", "created_at": "2025-09-08T15:16:47", "owner": "junzhang684", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18526720177019368, "text": "後來發現大學畢業之後真的能天天吃泡麵了", "created_at": "2025-09-08T14:54:24", "owner": "orgalorg0619", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116876584509636, "text": "跟他說等你死後就是我的了", "created_at": "2025-09-08T14:36:19", "owner": "gon._.cifa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080341894765538, "text": "不會欸我媽會給我39塊買學校外面的歐練", "created_at": "2025-09-08T13:48:37", "owner": "jin.___.ic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095489209635438, "text": "一字不差", "created_at": "2025-09-08T13:35:38", "owner": "xin_12202011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126931063422374, "text": "各位玩家由於您開局表單填：非常簡單，系統自動分配高難度伺服器", "created_at": "2025-09-08T13:25:10", "owner": "20090925leon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079509406788386, "text": "My bitchass father always like this 😭", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:07:40", "owner": "kai_080430", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060831734525563, "text": "话术一模一样😢🙂🥲", "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:07:19", "owner": "yxn.0408", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940107837935872, "text": "一直PUA，成年直接走了，不用往来。", "created_at": "2025-09-08T11:36:36", "owner": "lunaewine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055652477170531, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-09-08T10:39:48", "owner": "cyzkyle0715", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320251390214703, "text": "爸爸：買都買了，\n紅姐：來都來了。", "created_at": "2025-09-08T09:57:11", "owner": "x._.16140._.x", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18077565289987526, "text": "典型亞洲家長", "created_at": "2025-09-08T06:47:03", "owner": "prophet_kyc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069633616939501, "text": "生活發洩器  別怪小朋友不想分享自己生活事", "created_at": "2025-09-08T06:28:32", "owner": "senior_chanms", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065083265219765, "text": "买都买了😂", "created_at": "2025-09-08T05:37:59", "owner": "kson0123", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18025908692525129, "text": "垃圾亞洲家長ㄍㄋㄋㄧㄤ", "created_at": "2025-09-08T04:13:25", "owner": "lille_chen_xt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939786142052498, "text": "：媽媽你看有麵 🗣️：作業寫完沒有", "created_at": "2025-09-08T03:38:54", "owner": "andy920319_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965224947809488, "text": "哇15塊貴嗎😂，老了換你養他\n買東西亂花錢敗家你現在用的是我的錢，我可以不給你錢你知道嗎\n😂", "created_at": "2025-09-07T15:56:39", "owner": "mystery4_17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084913462718657, "text": "所以我都沒在聽，我都在想帥哥", "created_at": "2025-09-07T15:20:06", "owner": "yyre_cxva15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088034686829761, "text": "所以說為什麼火雞麵不讓他吃老爸", "created_at": "2025-09-07T14:12:00", "owner": "da.re8329", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066415898219043, "text": "咁你想我點先？🙄", "created_at": "2025-09-07T13:40:57", "owner": "not._.sakura._.mochi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069907159934052, "text": "看起來比較像窮人教育", "created_at": "2025-09-07T13:05:42", "owner": "lian_kuo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17896972278284099, "text": "情勒", "created_at": "2025-09-07T13:03:09", "owner": "zz.ly15", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076908335076331, "text": "老話一句，還是不能接受父債子還的道理，沒錢又想要孩子，然後再讓孩子一起吃苦😢", "created_at": "2025-09-07T12:58:36", "owner": "kkaa987660", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061375811072040, "text": "小惡作劇: 生個生命出來然後整天對他情緒勒索🥰", "created_at": "2025-09-07T12:42:42", "owner": "playingbandits6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086502451686891, "text": "這些的家長到7-80歲子女都不理他們就會後悔", "created_at": "2025-09-07T12:03:08", "owner": "nightnova3419", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111502774535312, "text": "來都來了", "created_at": "2025-09-07T12:00:26", "owner": "andrew_wick_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136307959434788, "text": "所以我什么都不想说；当我什么都不说时他们又讲没有把家人看在眼里😒", "created_at": "2025-09-07T11:35:47", "owner": "xling0914", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024839375726626, "text": "難怪一堆人直接7414ㄌ", "created_at": "2025-09-07T11:31:14", "owner": "john90_0313", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025415363526829, "text": "真的是說了叫頂嘴 不說叫啞巴", "created_at": "2025-09-07T11:12:38", "owner": "yangchenghao269", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864442183456074, "text": "一上車父母開啟嘴碎模式", "created_at": "2025-09-07T10:42:12", "owner": "yinai945", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18504925699071179, "text": "幹15塊而已是在叫什麼", "created_at": "2025-09-07T10:12:41", "owner": "hoshina__030", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18054859148442276, "text": "15那麼一大碗 我的一餐就會吃這個 哪裡貴了！", "created_at": "2025-09-07T10:08:46", "owner": "051._yt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18018729977765563, "text": "超耐磨😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-09-07T10:03:51", "owner": "dal.idv_0717", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021975611725879, "text": "比起跟這種家長分享我寧願那去請討人厭的老師", "created_at": "2025-09-07T09:50:16", "owner": "shuo27013", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046829759322477, "text": "要靠邀就不要生", "created_at": "2025-09-07T08:36:56", "owner": "yujie._.0228", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922958575131212, "text": "受不了一點", "created_at": "2025-09-07T07:51:38", "owner": "83_8157", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080322608502510, "text": "不生是種善良，請結紮！", "created_at": "2025-09-07T06:45:39", "owner": "ppd20141107", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025742429723901, "text": "老了之後沒什麼東西可以講，只能講政治或讀書", "created_at": "2025-09-07T04:51:15", "owner": "yuanbotant5338", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892046953332670, "text": "我花我自己的錢也被這樣靠北", "created_at": "2025-09-07T04:01:39", "owner": "zheng6412", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971462196930937, "text": "幹那個火雞麵直接扣他頭上", "created_at": "2025-09-07T02:20:57", "owner": "lya04182010", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17921665896120686, "text": "回了說頂嘴 不回又說是啞巴嗎都不說話", "created_at": "2025-09-07T01:52:47", "owner": "yu.ki.0611", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077384608976289, "text": "亞洲父母😂", "created_at": "2025-09-07T01:46:28", "owner": "mil._line", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077366089826266, "text": "回嘴被罵，不回也被罵😂簡直跟我以前一樣，只能聽父母唸完😢", "created_at": "2025-09-07T01:37:51", "owner": "a0905063723", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871869667424276, "text": "如果是我，我会讲：反正钱已经花了，你还要怎样", "created_at": "2025-09-07T01:34:35", "owner": "jason_drangon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895642519162518, "text": "他是不是不知道三塊多少", "created_at": "2025-09-07T01:25:50", "owner": "zenohsu0407", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893005030313476, "text": "工作到底哪裡累..？", "created_at": "2025-09-07T01:18:03", "owner": "ben._.97511", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898542400146502, "text": "跟我媽一模一樣", "created_at": "2025-09-07T00:28:57", "owner": "flying_vegetable", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076432349490751, "text": "还好我的父母不是这类的", "created_at": "2025-09-06T22:34:27", "owner": "acenloo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062363396458443, "text": "也知道自己賺不多還要在那邊靠邀", "created_at": "2025-09-06T21:41:32", "owner": "_voicz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096243694629517, "text": "触发连招了", "created_at": "2025-09-06T21:17:43", "owner": "aghiighj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078684398294431, "text": "没钱别生孩子，苦了自己也苦了孩子", "created_at": "2025-09-06T20:28:05", "owner": "linkunliu915", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18356677639088615, "text": "買都買了 來都來了", "created_at": "2025-09-06T20:00:01", "owner": "lin._.255", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060945743374873, "text": "直接砍死就好liao😈", "created_at": "2025-09-06T19:54:27", "owner": "zz.c213", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964152885968760, "text": "把面扔他脸上 说****.", "created_at": "2025-09-06T18:27:44", "owner": "youngxin0930", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853619134534069, "text": "我能活成這個樣也是因為你小時候不好好讀書 現在怪我囉", "created_at": "2025-09-06T18:13:11", "owner": "kenjai_05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056529902150273, "text": "我爸什麼時候去演戲了🧐演的太像了", "created_at": "2025-09-06T17:48:51", "owner": "zach.__05.3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997181043665227, "text": "他媽 亞洲父母…害…", "created_at": "2025-09-06T17:30:12", "owner": "junyeahhhh._.0903", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013789571788147, "text": "打開門走出去 直接坐在馬路中間吃", "created_at": "2025-09-06T17:10:48", "owner": "a4710126", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18524004142011281, "text": "亞洲家長篇嗎？有意思🥵", "created_at": "2025-09-06T16:34:24", "owner": "wow._.0626", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075148955079448, "text": "然後你不說話就說你都不關心家人🗣️🗣️🗣️", "created_at": "2025-09-06T16:11:14", "owner": "guanyu.1211", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954848173004359, "text": "不要講幹話了🌚 都什麼年代了 別在那邊靠北 可憐", "created_at": "2025-09-06T15:57:30", "owner": "xcvhghc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104458180510366, "text": "分享成績 跟我說 是不是有人比你高分 你考那邊有什麼好高興的", "created_at": "2025-09-06T15:49:06", "owner": "j1.z_7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856158628514390, "text": "以前跟現在不一樣 以後就知道為什麼父母總是這樣說了", "created_at": "2025-09-06T15:38:28", "owner": "10.z_02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039246089432240, "text": "我都不會這樣", "created_at": "2025-09-06T15:37:11", "owner": "benson77k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103393084580038, "text": "沒多少錢就戴套不要生", "created_at": "2025-09-06T15:33:09", "owner": "uc_527416", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096508423566058, "text": "跟媽媽分享生活好多了", "created_at": "2025-09-06T15:27:56", "owner": "charlie.__1107", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881507974259725, "text": "這時候就回他，我以後賺錢打死也不給你，然後你就沒有以後了", "created_at": "2025-09-06T15:10:52", "owner": "jack._.2210", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074619215034525, "text": "所以變得都不想講", "created_at": "2025-09-06T14:59:48", "owner": "cjs_.423", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954380949862649, "text": "我不分享又要罵我什麼都不跟他們說😢", "created_at": "2025-09-06T14:39:48", "owner": "shan_3.33.333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058343333617602, "text": "跟他說一下學校發生什麼事\n他們總是有理由罵我們⋯\n誰要說啊\n我就跟他們說\n我只是想跟你們分享\n他們就說什麼\n你做錯我就是要糾正你\n誰要說瓦\n總比我不跟你說好吧⋯", "created_at": "2025-09-06T14:01:09", "owner": "bella752012", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18040266713395477, "text": "買都買了", "created_at": "2025-09-06T13:50:49", "owner": "ollie0711", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18319152097213430, "text": "亞洲家長", "created_at": "2025-09-06T13:45:39", "owner": "alien_no.16", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072183173132951, "text": "才1块7？？？", "created_at": "2025-09-06T13:41:49", "owner": "ychong.0827", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074160296024400, "text": "家長超愛沒事找事", "created_at": "2025-09-06T13:38:36", "owner": "akinarice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18370053277197955, "text": "哇！這種家長那麼窮了嗎！？，都不吃火雞麵", "created_at": "2025-09-06T13:30:35", "owner": "yyz_1004", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17984854082854224, "text": "才挣钱多少钱的话要不要找找自己的问题", "created_at": "2025-09-06T13:21:32", "owner": "hre_xiaolibai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892950424321647, "text": "我爸媽也是，在跟他們分享我同學的成績，結果換來的卻是問為什麼人家可以有好成績，你為什麼不行", "created_at": "2025-09-06T13:16:02", "owner": "zhu.zhupinrui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886422052358594, "text": "大同小異說實話", "created_at": "2025-09-06T12:59:58", "owner": "kent_960213", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859954483476061, "text": "就說了別玩亞服，玩美服多爽，正常拿人頭刷金幣沒問題的😂", "created_at": "2025-09-06T12:45:39", "owner": "sun101084", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067823668952242, "text": "我媽：\n你買了啥\n給我吃一口", "created_at": "2025-09-06T12:45:11", "owner": "xinyan3138", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065545586014403, "text": "賺錢確實很難", "created_at": "2025-09-06T12:44:39", "owner": "heuk1_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099885355556766, "text": "还好我妈咪不是这样的人😁我妈咪虽然不喜欢吃 但是她说只要你开心就好🥹", "created_at": "2025-09-06T12:39:03", "owner": "obsidian0125", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039565217422644, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-09-06T12:20:06", "owner": "moragod1017", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066897791464537, "text": "都有車可以座了買個麵是在靠邀三小？", "created_at": "2025-09-06T12:14:49", "owner": "mimi06113", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054359426445843, "text": "真的烦", "created_at": "2025-09-06T12:10:06", "owner": "jingyi_sings", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18521479525034872, "text": "我媽真的超煩\n我就要那33騙個首儲就說浪費錢？？\n偶爾自由走回去買個波霸奶茶就說奢侈？？？", "created_at": "2025-09-06T12:02:22", "owner": "fish_but_little", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078883939946025, "text": "吃麵沒有配菜配肉不營養", "created_at": "2025-09-06T11:45:47", "owner": "yee_see_ice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043972610654495, "text": "来都来了", "created_at": "2025-09-06T11:38:51", "owner": "kan090211", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18043245932363674, "text": "我已經想好他們老了怎麼玩了", "created_at": "2025-09-06T11:34:37", "owner": "echen_831107", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18094558201734317, "text": "如果三餐吃，ㄧ個月也伙食費也只要臺幣1350元而已", "created_at": "2025-09-06T11:29:08", "owner": "jim1011029", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066939185245186, "text": "中式教育你贏了", "created_at": "2025-09-06T11:28:12", "owner": "ruanzhenying9", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17940890865053054, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-06T11:25:23", "owner": "chenxingyu637", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054796184570758, "text": "真的", "created_at": "2025-09-06T11:11:10", "owner": "hce1105", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073204597895042, "text": "一天買25塊麥香紅茶的我看完後的感想：公鯊小😂", "created_at": "2025-09-06T11:05:43", "owner": "yu.tim0609", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066747863227210, "text": "我爸媽是不會講什麼，反正他們也不指望我什麼，光是我們能在他們那種放養方式活下來就不錯了", "created_at": "2025-09-06T11:00:52", "owner": "zhi359", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085582576857594, "text": "喔我爸可能會跟我要然後直接吃一大口🗿", "created_at": "2025-09-06T10:08:50", "owner": "han_08_31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18151112872396170, "text": "太真實了", "created_at": "2025-09-06T10:07:27", "owner": "fish_0417_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18373531153180018, "text": "你不吃我想吃欸", "created_at": "2025-09-06T10:02:31", "owner": "lil.sig17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062094215355223, "text": "跟我的爸一样", "created_at": "2025-09-06T09:19:16", "owner": "cuterubybaby12465", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054474563566669, "text": "15台這樣的話，我會買爆", "created_at": "2025-09-06T09:08:04", "owner": "zhiyu._.1010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145931476410063, "text": "工作壓力+社會壓力+金錢壓力+家庭壓力 = 暴躁老爸", "created_at": "2025-09-06T09:06:14", "owner": "jasperyang0122", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094108207731741, "text": "淦，當初幹什麼不好，偏偏把他生下來，那就不要靠邀啊，不然你當初為什不射在牆上", "created_at": "2025-09-06T08:54:40", "owner": "yuliangyang1013", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17935658784073840, "text": "所以所有事情都不會跟家長講 他們問的話我們會思考他們下一步是做什麼 想到的結局是好的我們就說 想到是不好的就謊編一編就好", "created_at": "2025-09-06T08:50:42", "owner": "s_y103", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899794168267097, "text": "我會直接開吃", "created_at": "2025-09-06T08:42:36", "owner": "fosioaif", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091499731686413, "text": "《亞洲人難度》", "created_at": "2025-09-06T08:30:50", "owner": "sys._.e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014753693783932, "text": "窮不要生，以為自己會抽到SSR喔哈哈", "created_at": "2025-09-06T08:26:47", "owner": "cosmo_1028", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043057499361902, "text": "絕密地球的入場任務", "created_at": "2025-09-06T07:57:38", "owner": "dingrong_li", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086416507873911, "text": "要堵住他的嘴只有一個辦法 \n親他！", "created_at": "2025-09-06T07:53:26", "owner": "dj900117", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022124399728551, "text": "有錢買車", "created_at": "2025-09-06T07:44:00", "owner": "dingwu59", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088822105837070, "text": "對岸的每月薪資很多人都是3000RB所以3RB算多了", "created_at": "2025-09-06T07:39:50", "owner": "scthk_14", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18078215927481579, "text": "这爸的父母一定是这个样，所以这爸才会这样", "created_at": "2025-09-06T07:39:21", "owner": "_dudu1409_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880312285389234, "text": "😢My dad👉🏻", "created_at": "2025-09-06T07:08:54", "owner": "huai_0611", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982012347896179, "text": "有錢買車,三塊錢的火雞面也買不起嗎?", "created_at": "2025-09-06T06:46:48", "owner": "tch_1206_meow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295325440267335, "text": "3块钱被你说贵，那你找到5毛钱的饭盒面吗？煞笔", "created_at": "2025-09-06T06:29:48", "owner": "jian_ren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134066188454335, "text": "我童年………🥲", "created_at": "2025-09-06T06:21:41", "owner": "k5en26._.20", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18022813460538146, "text": "垃圾78人", "created_at": "2025-09-06T06:17:05", "owner": "zeng_zixun._.0108", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104466550579616, "text": "莫名其妙就被罵了😢", "created_at": "2025-09-06T06:05:46", "owner": "ethanethan687", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052219280551792, "text": "如果你回你就會得到一句 我才說一句你頂我3句", "created_at": "2025-09-06T06:03:02", "owner": "abc145609", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049601552280188, "text": "典", "created_at": "2025-09-06T05:52:58", "owner": "kevinnew010200", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898832404269303, "text": "你不吃可以給我吃嗎", "created_at": "2025-09-06T05:38:49", "owner": "linkk._.09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083728549910280, "text": "其他的可能是老爸問題，你他媽的買了不吃？！別跟我說什麼壞父母的毒雞湯", "created_at": "2025-09-06T05:35:04", "owner": "scthunder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946562955901136, "text": "3元买个鸡毛米饭啊", "created_at": "2025-09-06T05:17:31", "owner": "marcusbee31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983371950730517, "text": "@firefly__dinosaur 我在學校隨便買一個飲料都比這個便宜☠️", "created_at": "2025-09-06T05:13:30", "owner": "wdrb.7mgof", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147838828404688, "text": "所以不說話就沒事", "created_at": "2025-09-06T05:02:36", "owner": "2009.12._.04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18189280453321259, "text": "買都買了⋯", "created_at": "2025-09-06T04:57:01", "owner": "mpshys_4096", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038106548465082, "text": "我家", "created_at": "2025-09-06T04:39:11", "owner": "tic_cit0913", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076197761001980, "text": "白飯是澱粉類主食 搭配上蔬菜和肉有了纖維素和蛋白質 這才是營養。澱粉並不能代表所有的營養 吃太多還容易胖", "created_at": "2025-09-06T04:27:20", "owner": "lu.jaylu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052256579216441, "text": "賺錢有讀書難？", "created_at": "2025-09-06T04:15:42", "owner": "junwei_0612", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038874119438295, "text": "幹跟我媽媽一模一樣", "created_at": "2025-09-06T04:12:20", "owner": "16cmdick._", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17844797076565323, "text": "觸發npc", "created_at": "2025-09-06T04:11:53", "owner": "yucheng_0419", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087436291840407, "text": "每次想到有什麼喜悅要分享時，想到他會一直唸就想說算了", "created_at": "2025-09-06T04:09:43", "owner": "cjjh04someonesyarestupid._.74", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18087336202854617, "text": "True", "created_at": "2025-09-06T04:04:23", "owner": "shai.black.aura", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18173709559346611, "text": "只要不分享就沒事，TM又不是什麼事都要跟父母說，TMD我們自己的生活不能自己決定是不是，回一句話就算頂嘴，拜託這種父母不要在用那智障的邏輯來貶低小孩", "created_at": "2025-09-06T04:03:17", "owner": "zxieting", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086017975880771, "text": "老鄧你狗叫什麼 工作沒找好怪誰🤡", "created_at": "2025-09-06T03:47:39", "owner": "wu._.1014", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080659768820596, "text": "那么真实干嘛？", "created_at": "2025-09-06T03:41:25", "owner": "mo.li9106", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18015569516774494, "text": "我妈也这样", "created_at": "2025-09-06T03:22:25", "owner": "cnm.9936", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086721553871296, "text": "幹這種爸爸超可悲", "created_at": "2025-09-06T02:22:46", "owner": "leo100829", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18377029975176945, "text": "真实", "created_at": "2025-09-06T02:13:59", "owner": "star_guardian3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070614293179766, "text": "屁話一堆", "created_at": "2025-09-06T01:18:38", "owner": "xn._.uea", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18104975281568012, "text": "🤡", "created_at": "2025-09-06T00:21:46", "owner": "die._.748", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978468033753378, "text": "講也有錯，不講錯更多", "created_at": "2025-09-05T21:23:38", "owner": "brianwen67", "likes": 20}, {"id": 18071867783131090, "text": "所以我都不跟爸分享的😂", "created_at": "2025-09-05T17:47:18", "owner": "wc00115", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18079887296306082, "text": "張愛玲那句話說的太對了😢", "created_at": "2025-09-05T16:52:59", "owner": "supergalaxyxiang", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17913497271189400, "text": "一模一樣", "created_at": "2025-09-05T11:36:16", "owner": "afgxfhb", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17943632664025213, "text": "跟我一樣", "created_at": "2025-09-05T10:36:41", "owner": "jerry._.9453", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["中式教育", "父子", "火雞面"]},
{"media_id": 3763983051429896365, "shortcode": "DQ8WqSREeCt", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DQ8WqSREeCt/", "taken_at": "2025-11-12T04:31:22", "caption": "情侶間貧富差距過大相處真的很累 #情侶 #階級差 #真實還原 #夏日薄系穿搭 #歐若風寫真", "owner_username": "bella2264331", "owner_id": "75518466083", "likes": 108839, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0054_DQ8WqSREeCt\\DQ8WqSREeCt_20251112_043122.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18095071753867477, "text": "這不是沒錢\n這是自卑", "created_at": "2025-11-12T11:26:45", "owner": "imbr0825", "likes": 9845}, {"id": 18543244267020556, "text": "不是其實男生說他要付的那一瞬間女生還是可以阻止一下或者說我來付 但是男生也有問題，可能他前一次戀愛已經讓他覺得每次都要男生的財富", "created_at": "2025-11-12T11:09:23", "owner": "zhuangjiexiangzhuang", "likes": 2497}, {"id": 17995486412752536, "text": "女生有钱，还要考虑穷人男朋友的感受。你又要生气，那还不如找那种有钱人男朋友咯，他们就不会自卑生气", "created_at": "2025-11-13T08:34:42", "owner": "sroki1117_ig", "likes": 929}, {"id": 18082704443063217, "text": "兩個人才1280 很划算啊", "created_at": "2025-11-12T23:42:10", "owner": "lpo.03113", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17879069478426201, "text": "沒錢就不要搶著買單呀，自己自卑還搞的對方不舒服😕", "created_at": "2025-11-13T15:42:01", "owner": "hesenjiang", "likes": 157}, {"id": 18081981323024499, "text": "這哪是貧富差異引起的, 根本就是掛不下面子承認對方比自己有錢", "created_at": "2025-11-12T14:43:59", "owner": "dark_wolf_0316", "likes": 999}, {"id": 18337248217229500, "text": "什么面包用来吸油不吃？", "created_at": "2025-11-12T19:12:44", "owner": "steve.c_96", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17988416798884639, "text": "其实就可以看得出一个人她有没有去认真看待感情这件事情，每天都在一起彼此都认识对方，哪里可能不知道对方的经济情况，不要将自己消费观放在别人身上以为你吃鱼翅别人就吃得起😂干脆点直接分，这种感情多数不会维持很久相信我😂", "created_at": "2025-11-13T01:55:57", "owner": "mansan_19", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17859584946541548, "text": "沒有錢真的不要逞強欸😂但好像很多男生會有有面子的問題", "created_at": "2025-11-12T14:57:27", "owner": "tgb304520", "likes": 191}, {"id": 17893044846225380, "text": "所以說 這種女朋友哪裡有", "created_at": "2025-11-13T07:44:19", "owner": "juyi._.bai", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18099236365753670, "text": "結婚對象要碼同階級門當互對，要碼自己努力點多學習或者其他技能找條件稍微好些的，下嫁不會幸福的，香港名媛分屍案就是最典型的例子", "created_at": "2025-11-23T01:07:01", "owner": "nafirlina_third", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18079098947323514, "text": "轉轉：請輸入文本", "created_at": "2025-11-12T22:35:59", "owner": "kaiwen_.06", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18116802991544892, "text": "不要問，直接買\n跟這種人相處就是這麼簡單", "created_at": "2025-11-13T02:12:37", "owner": "younggo4", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17854054161569949, "text": "這朋友哪裡找", "created_at": "2025-11-12T23:02:32", "owner": "kaozeng1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17912999331239779, "text": "舊的去轉轉回收了", "created_at": "2025-11-19T08:49:43", "owner": "francisyan0809", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18087918623507418, "text": "轉轉呢？", "created_at": "2025-11-12T14:05:19", "owner": "huang_.0823", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18106483348627219, "text": "年少不知富婆好，錯把少女當成寶", "created_at": "2025-11-13T07:48:24", "owner": "tw_jssjthoxjdfhm", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18094614100874960, "text": "bro 這麼好的女朋友讓給我吧", "created_at": "2025-11-13T11:42:26", "owner": "cky_11.3", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17977873025945455, "text": "其實只有窮的是男生才會發生這種問題…", "created_at": "2025-11-13T09:44:31", "owner": "daidai1326", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18021199619600671, "text": "旧的手机依然还可以用啊，为什么不能用，只要旧电话还活着为什么一定要买新的呢？我的男友一直说 没钱没钱 他的手机已经用了快7/8年了🌝里面都已经有一条线的了🌝", "created_at": "2025-11-13T00:18:17", "owner": "stellaliwin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073059569011835, "text": "所以无论交朋友还是谈恋爱都最好远离和自己经济状况差异太大的人，还不够吵架的呢…", "created_at": "2025-11-13T04:35:12", "owner": "kakalok_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071102513522085, "text": "故事教我们别和收入不一致的人交往", "created_at": "2025-11-12T18:59:14", "owner": "melowying", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17951396418044160, "text": "舊的上轉轉上賣掉了", "created_at": "2025-11-12T14:01:15", "owner": "bomofis", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18123104044512629, "text": "你覺得這真係是情侶嗎? 只是朋友吧....", "created_at": "2025-11-13T04:02:29", "owner": "laichiufung", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18022346984786386, "text": "其實彼此都沒有錯 只是因為彼此賺的錢數量不一樣 導致女生想幫他 但是男生以為女生在可憐他 男生也很自卑", "created_at": "2025-11-12T15:31:36", "owner": "lzy_.12", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18083964719043816, "text": "我恨不得女生付錢好嗎", "created_at": "2025-11-12T21:01:53", "owner": "ryan_fang_crombee_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17990201603728681, "text": "果断分", "created_at": "2025-11-12T15:47:05", "owner": "untilledprofessorhamasaki", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17872794945377337, "text": "好想累一下", "created_at": "2025-11-12T17:19:49", "owner": "remhim27", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17899323024336254, "text": "原來麵包還可以拿來當吸油的長見識了", "created_at": "2025-11-12T19:06:44", "owner": "wjz0115", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078704474326259, "text": "奉劝大家，要是遇到什么事真的都要和伴侣沟通看看不要因为面子闹到大家都不愉快，面子在爱情面前根本不重要，真的爱你的人不会因为你没钱还是没学历就嫌弃你，不要让彼此成为遗憾。。。", "created_at": "2025-11-13T04:40:43", "owner": "wenwen_8234", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17973954377957863, "text": "舊的放轉轉上面賣了🗣️", "created_at": "2025-11-12T11:45:45", "owner": "dnxb_fuck", "likes": 6413}, {"id": 18159383605397679, "text": "舊的上轉轉", "created_at": "2025-11-13T07:35:23", "owner": "lyt_11.14", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17950542174044689, "text": "誰有錢花誰的唄，這不叫自尊，叫小孩子心性，傍上富婆一輩子都有了", "created_at": "2025-11-13T06:12:17", "owner": "befu_001", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18052406189351710, "text": "面子問題，我們還是很願意為有錢的女朋友學習的，我這裡有幾位都很樂意學習奢侈 @kjj_1010  @f.cs05 @simplyboiii", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:43:55", "owner": "kaixu.c", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18086956774769513, "text": "自尊不能當飯吃", "created_at": "2025-11-12T15:27:31", "owner": "kelly_89487", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17862769698521538, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-12T19:21:04", "owner": "jiawei11_10", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100867531665846, "text": "到底一堆男的再说什么劳女😂根本没什么给我们好劳的", "created_at": "2025-11-13T01:03:30", "owner": "leesol0221", "likes": 214}, {"id": 18090080507501725, "text": "性別問題？？？？\n還是我認知問題？\n還是性別自助餐不願意面對的問題？", "created_at": "2025-11-13T10:18:49", "owner": "chace001", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17851079817583727, "text": "所以不要說女人勢利，跟比自己窮的男人交往就是這麼多毛。女人只好向上找對象。\n然後經濟發展工業革命家族繼承都讓女人變有錢，所以只能繼續往上找更有錢的男人。窮男人更沒機會找對象。", "created_at": "2025-11-12T16:20:51", "owner": "knnnnny_i", "likes": 153}, {"id": 18093980113883288, "text": "因为男生都会下意识觉得付钱是男生的事，不然自尊心受损，但是自己要付的就闭嘴忍着咯，自己还生气就是不对了", "created_at": "2025-11-12T18:26:18", "owner": "edwinng.ng", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18319916431173971, "text": "放下你的自尊心，爽就完事了\n現在外面比比皆是", "created_at": "2025-11-13T10:20:44", "owner": "chace001", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18325193386243901, "text": "你不谈我谈 我喜欢富婆😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-13T10:44:53", "owner": "0503sifan_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079897309893256, "text": "倒不完全，你帮我付我叫义父👏", "created_at": "2025-11-13T12:54:51", "owner": "zhenghongkang80", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18314829058220523, "text": "建議分手（？", "created_at": "2025-11-13T14:29:47", "owner": "beibei040794", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17926005624154751, "text": "面包怎么用来吸油", "created_at": "2025-11-13T13:36:19", "owner": "anima_l0919", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077287196155601, "text": "之前我另一半，明明也沒什麼錢\n但又愛花錢大手大腳，\n反倒是我雖然不窮，\n但摳摳搜搜的想節儉，\n跟影片完全相反好好笑", "created_at": "2025-11-13T15:03:27", "owner": "muling_0517", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18159848923394799, "text": "👧：這麵包是用來吸油的 👦：媽啊 真香阿 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-14T01:48:31", "owner": "fongdin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17842852047616035, "text": "吸油又不吃的麪包？？🧐👨🏻‍🍳", "created_at": "2025-11-14T00:43:04", "owner": "privatechef_alstonleunghk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079411448167283, "text": "我觉得主要不是阶级差异，而是男生那是没钱自尊心又强还自卑，是我就安安心心的吃软饭了😂", "created_at": "2025-11-14T06:11:12", "owner": "itskuupa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17866494555491047, "text": "拍完自我感动系列上新啦", "created_at": "2025-11-14T04:08:39", "owner": "zachguilbeaux", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18093389758881022, "text": "這種朋友哪裡找 有沒有那位姐姐的聯繫方式", "created_at": "2025-11-14T07:05:58", "owner": "zoomers_mihawk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17925329769169421, "text": "友誼也是", "created_at": "2025-11-14T09:39:28", "owner": "yyyyyy._0725", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17879598651422856, "text": "為啥不AA", "created_at": "2025-11-14T13:21:34", "owner": "nanami_pear", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18296528050256293, "text": "我不会有这种问题姐姐考虑一下包吗", "created_at": "2025-11-14T17:08:18", "owner": "ivan_is_shabi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075646748186908, "text": "舊的撇了", "created_at": "2025-11-14T22:46:39", "owner": "liuyouyun22", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058793660257192, "text": "買了新手機 舊的該怎麼辦呢", "created_at": "2025-11-15T12:38:20", "owner": "naigee_huang", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17886346623392451, "text": "可是麵包拿來吸油是真的嗎😭😭😭麵包很好吃耶", "created_at": "2025-11-15T12:04:49", "owner": "gl4vm0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077682535924500, "text": "舊手機，上轉轉", "created_at": "2025-11-15T18:31:08", "owner": "mogazaza_euo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18541513339053404, "text": "這種女友哪裡找？", "created_at": "2025-11-16T02:46:16", "owner": "shang.8862", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18089375980933345, "text": "就是为啥将来择偶标准一定是和我们家家庭条件差不多的", "created_at": "2025-11-16T05:33:33", "owner": "j31287895", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060310214242531, "text": "唉", "created_at": "2025-11-16T06:14:58", "owner": "kaoqqt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17960844788865469, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-16T10:14:51", "owner": "taotao4319", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18112558480571320, "text": "寫好劇本才發現沒廣告商：", "created_at": "2025-11-16T11:53:39", "owner": "mengkai511", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17991384230887412, "text": "居然没有转转的广告", "created_at": "2025-11-16T11:49:26", "owner": "mizu__0717", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067244468458587, "text": "本来就不该交往 自卑是本能 别说异性之间了 就是同性也做不了朋友。 不清醒。", "created_at": "2025-11-16T14:09:50", "owner": "hongzhe_liu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083042810044877, "text": "我會很開心的吃軟飯（沒", "created_at": "2025-11-16T16:51:54", "owner": "kewi_94", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18393417685122575, "text": "沒事的兄弟你不要給我我想要富婆姐姐包養我", "created_at": "2025-11-16T22:59:47", "owner": "yl9116794", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069624110608929, "text": "門當戶對很重要", "created_at": "2025-11-17T07:48:47", "owner": "lys._05", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074761691271555, "text": "女生有钱就女生多出点，男生有钱就男生多出点，过日子不是零和博弈", "created_at": "2025-11-17T18:20:07", "owner": "suibb111", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17891968179368401, "text": "沒有苦硬吃系列", "created_at": "2025-11-17T19:25:29", "owner": "_xzhiiu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085568633087639, "text": "反正舊的我都放轉轉上賣", "created_at": "2025-11-18T09:44:32", "owner": "rice10.06", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17930293317120227, "text": "我以為要說舊的放轉轉了", "created_at": "2025-11-19T17:37:08", "owner": "ig._.adj", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18025064348670406, "text": "什麼吸油", "created_at": "2025-11-20T16:51:33", "owner": "tangfenoao", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068742698079004, "text": "門當戶對非常重要", "created_at": "2025-11-20T22:46:47", "owner": "citizenation", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17999029421837282, "text": "有阶级有差距，肯定会出现有很多问题，所以更应该多沟通，不管那个是男方那个是女方，当你们发现你们有一定差距时，就必须做好准备，一个带着另一方成长，一个努力追上对方的脚步，不要说什么你选的你宠着那种天真的话，除非你很有实力，可以完完全全的养着他，然后工作方面带着小助理或秘书应酬，而对方不会吃醋你们同时也完全不理会别人闲言闲语", "created_at": "2025-11-21T19:58:24", "owner": "xiiaoyu.95", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083258873085725, "text": "還好吧如果一直拿你還會覺得他 當你的付出理所當然", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:02:28", "owner": "2ryan_sun", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17908752231128539, "text": "還不跑自卑太可怕", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:46:35", "owner": "did.1923", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18010464488646897, "text": "我发现我脸皮挺厚的", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:15:50", "owner": "alextan_0624", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17950010813924469, "text": "又没让你付 请你吃都不乐意", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:10:40", "owner": "connor.sese", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17903278779305396, "text": "啥？被包養就要有被包養的覺悟，有沒有富婆", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:02:46", "owner": "chocotoast_ken", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18389880997176068, "text": "bro 这么好的女朋友你居然还装上了，😳", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:51:25", "owner": "huafeinianqi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084814852992631, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-30T13:19:14", "owner": "wongwasan567", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18046135517690287, "text": "面包拿来吸油😮 价值观都扭曲成这样了么@浪费食物理直气壮", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:12:42", "owner": "vanessazhang678", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18539390767061901, "text": "不就是兩個啞巴嗎", "created_at": "2025-11-13T18:26:09", "owner": "wh__4.i.6__te", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18061272338549749, "text": "轉轉二手把它賣掉🤗", "created_at": "2025-11-12T14:22:41", "owner": "7ong._.121", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18076019938951489, "text": "差點上廣告了😄", "created_at": "2025-11-12T14:31:39", "owner": "i_love_90_bear_jchoi", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18097836391783599, "text": "每次請別人其實挺爽的", "created_at": "2025-11-12T15:18:39", "owner": "lulu20070609", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18084531661995642, "text": "今天反過來女方是比較經濟弱勢的 男方經濟比較強勢 通常女方都理所當然", "created_at": "2025-11-13T01:39:24", "owner": "fury_2893", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18104268523648460, "text": "只要值得，付出不是問題\n但很多人並不值得", "created_at": "2025-11-13T10:53:54", "owner": "fairy_tank", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18145125289436969, "text": "当对方感受到差距时，内心会很抗拒那种“我在下位”的感觉，根本就是自尊心强，不愿努力反而怪对方", "created_at": "2025-11-12T23:57:43", "owner": "1120imnttek", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17878416363328521, "text": "如果在經濟讓你覺得自卑，那你就用愛來補上", "created_at": "2025-11-12T15:09:09", "owner": "ni_chi_s_074", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18329564458241830, "text": "我也是，我的钱都是两个人花", "created_at": "2025-11-12T14:27:34", "owner": "ykh_43", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17871796404457347, "text": "女生都喜歡會付錢的男生，真付錢了說自己沒錢，女生又說沒叫男生付🤦🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-13T16:08:08", "owner": "f_628.sun", "likes": 27}, {"id": 18302631331269856, "text": "不止 朋友也会有类似情况😢", "created_at": "2025-11-12T10:02:36", "owner": "bongsizheng1", "likes": 253}, {"id": 18096407878657814, "text": "还有一种就是家里不穷但是父母穷养的教育下长大", "created_at": "2025-11-12T17:31:08", "owner": "syhly_99", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18071796425596614, "text": "死裝窮鬼", "created_at": "2025-12-12T10:11:10", "owner": "7.xinn16_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070041020456066, "text": "舊手機？交給神秘眼鏡女吧", "created_at": "2025-12-12T02:15:51", "owner": "katarina_10_02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18324080485174492, "text": "還有為後面會說：舊的…我放轉轉上面賣了", "created_at": "2025-12-11T17:42:04", "owner": "dsr0204", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909620311269590, "text": "我不會生氣 😍", "created_at": "2025-12-10T07:00:15", "owner": "jay890916", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18326452345245994, "text": "strong哥", "created_at": "2025-12-09T04:56:39", "owner": "77_qqjenny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969876852829121, "text": "所以我都請吃飯", "created_at": "2025-12-09T03:27:47", "owner": "hcy0291", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067140794124600, "text": "沒錢就不要搶著買單啊，真是服了", "created_at": "2025-12-07T18:55:33", "owner": "yu072300", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126788299454609, "text": "大专里有富二代？😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T11:13:48", "owner": "isabnerrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991180101884145, "text": "所以门要当户要对", "created_at": "2025-12-07T10:51:08", "owner": "libai59211", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000138254692144, "text": "真的 我跟我前任就是 我出國跟他分享樂趣他只會說我在炫耀 我請他吃飯他說我瞧不起他 送禮物送好一點的就說我施捨他。相處起來超累", "created_at": "2025-12-07T10:04:33", "owner": "pj._.1102", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18195034009330560, "text": "自卑", "created_at": "2025-12-07T03:28:00", "owner": "surtr42_chen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100749514692029, "text": "这女的这么有钱也和你没啥钱一起，也这么关照你，你自己强大起来让别人在未来看的起，给她更好的生活就是了。你他妈的就是要面子最后这么好的女生都弄没了", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:05:46", "owner": "zengj.1617", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066327230430216, "text": "这样的朋友我需要一打", "created_at": "2025-12-03T08:53:32", "owner": "leowyanbin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164498719391790, "text": "我覺得戴帽子的女友太拘束了，雖然男友長頭髮偽娘但也不必自卑", "created_at": "2025-12-03T00:09:19", "owner": "ty_lefver", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088615678786499, "text": "哪裡找？我很缺錢餒", "created_at": "2025-12-01T08:51:25", "owner": "uta_sj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030264374758457, "text": "我是男女互换过来，也挺难受的，消费水平不一样很难谈恋爱😢总感觉男朋友为了迁就我的消费水平很委屈自己", "created_at": "2025-12-01T08:20:47", "owner": "carolmiaoz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068581703567780, "text": "旧的上转转回收", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:15:13", "owner": "guardianwang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18186282055343954, "text": "我问你用什么枕头能做这样的梦，我问你用什么枕头！", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:48:13", "owner": "magillliu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024815858589584, "text": "妈的，看得我一肚子火，没钱抢着买单，完了买完单之后还跟女的哭诉说自己没钱，人女的一开始就没想着让你买，你自己非得买，买完了又在那里抱怨，既要又要，放不下自己自尊，接受不了别人给的好处自己又没能力，你逞nm的能呢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:08:36", "owner": "guojiangzc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085452758062677, "text": "这男的纯有病，明明没有钱，别人给的好意也不受，反过来还要说别人的不是，人钱都给你了，世面也带你见了，你还想咋滴？还得小心翼翼的呵护着你那可怜的自尊，又不是你家保姆", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:05:54", "owner": "guojiangzc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099150982702273, "text": "是太要面子了", "created_at": "2025-11-19T16:47:03", "owner": "albee12.24", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100054918738334, "text": "這男就是個傻B，軟飯這麼好吃又容易消化還不懂珍惜", "created_at": "2025-11-14T10:26:29", "owner": "hang123_123", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18153201484410911, "text": "差距再大也不需這樣！這是心理病！唉😮‍💨", "created_at": "2025-11-14T02:53:35", "owner": "shaohua79", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17984839346750626, "text": "我还以为旧的又要上转转app了", "created_at": "2025-11-13T16:45:06", "owner": "alvin.k.0322", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18064178387427286, "text": "有这样的女朋友做梦都要笑醒好吗，也是我的话每天变着法的哄女朋友开心。", "created_at": "2025-11-13T14:16:35", "owner": "4602leslie", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18302491045250143, "text": "@juliashenn_  YOU!", "created_at": "2025-11-13T14:05:55", "owner": "nini.7.7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081234718869020, "text": "这个是太自卑了吧😂😂😂心态问题", "created_at": "2025-11-13T12:23:00", "owner": "the_lazyrat0744", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057992726274347, "text": "就算今天家庭條件一樣\n從小女孩要富養這句話在無形之間害死了很多男生\n女孩子賺到的錢，基本上都是自己的\n男孩子一開始賺錢無論多少家人就會默默地過來伸手了\n有時候男生沒有錢有自卑感\n真的不是自己沒有能力造成的\n而是這個社會對男生的期許還有原生家庭慢慢累加的", "created_at": "2025-11-13T05:16:56", "owner": "hec_0828", "likes": 18}, {"id": 17947215321059759, "text": "不怕找穷的怕找个又穷又傻情商又低的，不要把穷跟傻B混为一谈", "created_at": "2025-11-13T03:46:50", "owner": "omega.9.5.2.7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929627185113795, "text": "能交到这种女朋友，我直接吃软饭算了，贫富差距太大，别人可能做一天顶我一个月，此时此刻什么尊严面子都无所谓了", "created_at": "2025-11-12T22:56:24", "owner": "houwai_fung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935792304980417, "text": "岁数差距也是如此 打个比方，当一个打游戏的几个女孩交朋友 一个11y一个18y 11y那个就会觉得自己差很多真的适合当对方朋友吗", "created_at": "2025-11-12T21:50:44", "owner": "ny119_xoen2y", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18384116017177216, "text": "@tmh_idgaf u s", "created_at": "2025-11-12T19:52:44", "owner": "thomastang0904", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18034508153723511, "text": "@chuangminif", "created_at": "2025-11-12T17:04:15", "owner": "08coco__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17930078058109224, "text": "😮‍💨真的誰懂啊 對象有錢 而自己卻每餐都要算可不可以吃 但又礙於面子 跟他出門能給他的都給了 結果自己卻沒錢也不敢找家人朋友借😮‍💨", "created_at": "2025-11-12T13:57:59", "owner": "_7._.ious", "likes": 43}, {"id": 17985276467870829, "text": "其實只要互相付出,不要變得理所當然,其實這段戀情還是可以繼續下去,但問題就在自尊心", "created_at": "2025-11-12T13:46:06", "owner": "gicujl_iu", "likes": 35}, {"id": 18102209971737132, "text": "舊的放轉轉上面賣了", "created_at": "2025-11-12T06:32:15", "owner": "18_tiffanyyyy", "likes": 35}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["情侶", "階級差", "真實還原", "夏日薄系穿搭", "歐若風寫真"]},
{"media_id": 3713551615912806575, "shortcode": "DOJL4T5j4iv", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DOJL4T5j4iv/", "taken_at": "2025-09-03T14:31:56", "caption": "Ranking the most HOTTEST Nonsense Outros by @sabrinacarpenter 🔥😈 #sabrinacarpenter #nonsense #nonsenseoutro #livemusic #concert", "owner_username": "getyourquizz", "owner_id": "66305242411", "likes": 58893, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0055_DOJL4T5j4iv\\DOJL4T5j4iv_20250903_143156.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17963475824816729, "text": "Unbelievable how do people enjoy this", "created_at": "2025-09-05T22:15:53", "owner": "joeyglennon33", "likes": 736}, {"id": 18087899683807330, "text": "I’m sorry but BBC one still takes the cake for me… especially bc they told her not to do it and she was like nope I’m doing me and made it sooo creative", "created_at": "2025-10-05T08:33:43", "owner": "savvy7157", "likes": 1390}, {"id": 18068220188332247, "text": "Help the bbc one is too creative to handle 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-09-04T12:54:52", "owner": "eatraspberriesstaycool", "likes": 7635}, {"id": 17941808112048935, "text": "Justice for the Chicago outro, 6/10??? Smh", "created_at": "2025-09-04T22:37:01", "owner": "_eleanorhaynes_", "likes": 979}, {"id": 18043457495670768, "text": "I’m in ❤️ w her", "created_at": "2025-09-22T13:17:52", "owner": "jess.havok", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18073730272996597, "text": "\"he is kinda small but I don't care though, cupid must've hit me with an arrow, cuz I'm in love with Rio de Janeiro\" gotta be there 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-09T19:47:15", "owner": "geoyorgos", "likes": 144}, {"id": 18290512558283786, "text": "Rio de Janeiro is THE BEST, caipirinha Brina", "created_at": "2025-09-06T00:50:03", "owner": "dayannapiccheto", "likes": 16}, {"id": 18076792790101848, "text": "They did it backwards haha", "created_at": "2025-09-05T03:42:29", "owner": "theskyesthelimit", "likes": 331}, {"id": 17980319234908725, "text": "and that \"Boy i am in your area like Blackpink\" one too", "created_at": "2025-09-05T04:56:54", "owner": "sahilbhallaa", "likes": 104}, {"id": 18077397629291691, "text": "she’s so quirky & unhinged, i love her", "created_at": "2025-09-13T21:41:40", "owner": "mare.olll", "likes": 189}, {"id": 18098215105653403, "text": "and people say the juno poses were explicit 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-28T07:06:27", "owner": "marikit.aroha", "likes": 50}, {"id": 18402215932136497, "text": "that’s bbc’s own fault tbh", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:00:59", "owner": "huckle.berry__", "likes": 224}, {"id": 17901079605267305, "text": "So why is 9.5 lower than 7/10", "created_at": "2025-09-04T22:04:34", "owner": "chr.stina_braddock", "likes": 113}, {"id": 18529211407008997, "text": "Cinderella >", "created_at": "2025-10-01T15:59:16", "owner": "ssonoava", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18106296187562775, "text": "Chicago should be number 1 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-15T03:38:39", "owner": "nyle_armstrong", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18528728677063622, "text": "i don’t like sabrina let alone do i enjoy her whole rebrand however i have to admit that the nonsense outros where very creative and outstanding", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:45:18", "owner": "bbtopiq", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17998642346660116, "text": "why are all her songs the exact same sound lol", "created_at": "2025-09-06T02:29:53", "owner": "rugby_league_26_gameplay", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18058340597402799, "text": ".......okkk", "created_at": "2025-09-14T21:57:44", "owner": "kingg.ced", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18290391781268234, "text": "justice for vmas outro", "created_at": "2025-09-05T12:57:49", "owner": "drewperujo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155623078393560, "text": "Sad", "created_at": "2025-10-18T07:59:59", "owner": "terrarium86", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067071551578034, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T17:50:38", "owner": "chargemy_iphone15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050847953679696, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T17:50:32", "owner": "chargemy_iphone1