{"media_id": 3675903435560924572, "shortcode": "DMDbrLpPzWc", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DMDbrLpPzWc/", "taken_at": "2025-07-13T15:51:26", "caption": "🎤 From Disney star to global pop sensation Sabrina Carpenter is owning her moment ✨\n\nStarting out as Maya on Girl Meets World, she’s now topping charts with back-to-back hits like “Espresso” and “Manchild” 💿🔥\n\nWith a Grammy-winning album (Short n’ Sweet), a sold-out world tour, and her upcoming project Man’s Best Friend set for August 29 Sabrina is proving she’s not just a rising star… she’s the moment 💅💫\n\n🎬 Follow @americancelebnews for more on your favorite artists and the stories behind their rise 📲\n\n#SabrinaCarpenter #Espresso #PleasePleasePlease #Manchild #ShortNSweetTour #PopPrincess #CelebrityNews #americancelebritynews", "owner_username": "americancelebnews", "owner_id": "71306555338", "likes": 33625, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0056_DMDbrLpPzWc\\DMDbrLpPzWc_20250713_155126.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17974010186864691, "text": "You call that a global pop sensation?", "created_at": "2025-07-13T16:28:29", "owner": "_.marioskarlisss._", "likes": 2070}, {"id": 17948539701081903, "text": "Isnt most of her fans teenage girls?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:06:40", "owner": "louvonbrockdorff", "likes": 184}, {"id": 18008784380811109, "text": "The Bonnie Blue of music.", "created_at": "2025-11-21T07:48:50", "owner": "_dreambrother_", "likes": 1400}, {"id": 17902623168246712, "text": "Ain't gotta dig deep at all... 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-27T06:25:29", "owner": "di4z3", "likes": 662}, {"id": 17891534643374194, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:02:03", "owner": "tigercarranza", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18083941684850161, "text": "Meh", "created_at": "2025-08-17T21:53:27", "owner": "iainframe", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17912708772249924, "text": "These are not bars bro 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:25:49", "owner": "iggy_vibes7", "likes": 39}, {"id": 17932146741069765, "text": "This is crazy to do in public", "created_at": "2025-07-18T19:49:23", "owner": "cfwebs", "likes": 229}, {"id": 17967397622968735, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-30T08:35:32", "owner": "unpococroco", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18097626388802574, "text": "This gotta be Ai", "created_at": "2025-11-05T21:55:48", "owner": "dirtysmellybum", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17944557960020932, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-03T20:06:35", "owner": "aisharamya123", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17861028249484980, "text": "Didn't have to dig deep to understand that.", "created_at": "2025-09-27T17:11:46", "owner": "fairuz_yahaya", "likes": 23}, {"id": 17853073794507876, "text": "ALMOST flashed", "created_at": "2025-08-06T22:12:34", "owner": "jimmy317127", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18125544571472054, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-14T05:51:02", "owner": "coincidenceofuniverse", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100138171511704, "text": "This is so rubbish", "created_at": "2025-07-18T08:50:21", "owner": "gerry9m", "likes": 102}, {"id": 18079207478507323, "text": "Black tylor swift", "created_at": "2025-08-01T18:28:10", "owner": "n_8chh", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18143371030439887, "text": "Oh yeah, you really need to dig deep for that one. Very intellectual.", "created_at": "2025-11-09T08:31:50", "owner": "pavlovic.miro", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17900767410302964, "text": "All the young girls looking up to her", "created_at": "2025-11-18T22:05:30", "owner": "bryanthomas982", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17844055551557814, "text": "I actually like Sabrina. But that’s just sad….", "created_at": "2025-08-22T02:32:54", "owner": "norrisforris", "likes": 324}, {"id": 18193944073313022, "text": "She has a white bf and talking abt BBC in her", "created_at": "2025-07-14T08:29:33", "owner": "im_narrowed", "likes": 1341}, {"id": 18076988893901712, "text": "i miss the nonsense outros 🥲", "created_at": "2025-07-13T16:46:00", "owner": "cherished_05", "likes": 302}, {"id": 18006077927654975, "text": 