{"media_id": 3780095044163377785, "shortcode": "DR1mGo0kpp5", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DR1mGo0kpp5/", "taken_at": "2025-12-04T10:04:18", "caption": "不過我系絕對唔會開鋪（暫時）\n楓糖漿果仁醬漢堡=瘋人漢堡😂\n\n漢堡包麵包 （6個）\n3.6鮮牛奶  173g\n提子乾發酵液/水  28g\n北海道櫻花野酵母  3.5g\n上白糖  25g\n春豐麵粉  290-340g\n沖繩栗國鹽  7g\n日本全蛋  半只\n日本蛋黃  半個\n南瓜/奶油南瓜/薯蓉  60g\nisigny牛油  30g\n\nPatties （80g@1, For 2 burgers)\n封門柳 160g \n牛小排 160g \n調味 \n沖繩黑潮海鹽 少許\n馬拉巴黑椒 少許\n\n三重堅果醬 (For 2 burgers)\n花生20g\n芝麻 20g\n腰果 20g\n花生油 少許\n*用攪拌機打醬，建議起碼打200g以上\n\n洋蔥1個 （For 2 burgers)\n水 適量\n\n加拿大楓糖漿 1tsp\n\n#漢堡包 #burger", "owner_username": "kenricsan", "owner_id": "248028589", "likes": 16704, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0057_DR1mGo0kpp5\\DR1mGo0kpp5_20251204_100418.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18054861662670271, "text": "你講完咁耐，啲洋蔥炒得咁靚，塊牛咁多汁汁，又拍晒片又剪晒咁，原來無鋪，我而家好嬲。", "created_at": "2025-12-05T14:52:38", "owner": "queeniensk", "likes": 960}, {"id": 17900178711337541, "text": "所以請問個漢堡包店喺邊度？", "created_at": "2025-12-04T12:41:30", "owner": "hcfhugo", "likes": 263}, {"id": 18088996930980670, "text": "你可以舖我會嚟幫襯", "created_at": "2025-12-04T10:20:42", "owner": "doncallit", "likes": 367}, {"id": 17924814042176006, "text": "好想食。", "created_at": "2025-12-04T11:07:02", "owner": "onlyyjorie", "likes": 23}, {"id": 17975607278958244, "text": "諗起某foodie起到話隱世burger，包現成，肉現成，醬現成，配菜現成，讚到天上有地下無，我睇完條片得啖笑。你呢d先係自製burger🙂‍↕️🙂‍↕️", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:51:50", "owner": "st.terry", "likes": 81}, {"id": 17913325098251726, "text": "我唔理你有冇開鋪，我正係想知你可唔可以整個比我食", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:15:09", "owner": "4k_kurt", "likes": 34}, {"id": 18106711006639694, "text": "想吐槽下一片菜都冇😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:04:35", "owner": "f1shoxo", "likes": 15}, {"id": 17880221265333676, "text": "芝士呢😢", "created_at": "2025-12-04T11:34:54", "owner": "simon_tsang0502", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17872024590466353, "text": "唔建議開舖，賺又加租，唔賺又加租，最後一定輸錢。", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:10:07", "owner": "rancho_yip", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18127404853508247, "text": "想知個bell點整(｡ ́︿ ̀｡)", "created_at": "2025-12-08T08:47:57", "owner": "yoyoo.yoyo", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17967556836002543, "text": "認真問個包食譜", "created_at": "2025-12-08T09:23:59", "owner": "filmwithjoe_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17987878691865878, "text": "可唔可以俾步驟食譜？教我點做？\n想試吓聖誕節整🤡", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:52:45", "owner": "janlwy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18433188046103242, "text": "Eeerrrrr 求求開舖俾我地試吓（祝Burger大師同女朋友每日幸運 青春常駐", "created_at": "2025-12-10T04:21:10", "owner": "selina_chow_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085145608841201, "text": "完全未夠班。一啲蔬菜都冇，成個包沒有層次。", "created_at": "2025-12-07T21:47:42", "owner": "benzguyw202", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17860518765485289, "text": "呢個combination同澳門某漢堡包店好似😆真心會勁好食", "created_at": "2025-12-08T14:54:08", "owner": "snowliving", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17861627055544176, "text": "請問可否分享步驟食譜給我嗎？🙏🏻😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T16:15:37", "owner": "conivia_164", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18144355648446450, "text": "成本太高，做唔得奈😢", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:20:50", "owner": "bryanwong1023", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18028409471568128, "text": "所以已經有外賣了嗎🤤", "created_at": "2025-12-05T15:30:29", "owner": "fungkaho.1020", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088144501798038, "text": "想幫襯！！🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:20:36", "owner": "ahloandpojai", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18379022203157698, "text": "芝士呢 好想食", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:27:58", "owner": "keigorrrrr", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18060496325636270, "text": "我花生敏感，好想食arr", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:30:58", "owner": "mok.mok_jelly", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18352782784202206, "text": "食burger 對個包一定要有要求", "created_at": "2025-12-05T16:06:15", "owner": "_cy.0n0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18148523497378938, "text": "如果你地有戴手套，可能會試。", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:43:31", "owner": "nicolastfu", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18369406702086984, "text": "賣幾錢？太貴不如食扒⋯⋯", "created_at": "2025-12-06T02:32:12", "owner": "fermon903", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18114913318510440, "text": "係唔係放漏左啲資訊😢", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:03:33", "owner": "kan.tang_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18116263999563003, "text": "Yum ! Yum ! Yummilicious 🔥🔥🔥🤤🤤🤤🍔🍔🍔🍟🍟👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-06T04:45:44", "owner": "chanlame", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17909206167271841, "text": "淨係個包，個面咁靚已經好想食", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:48:05", "owner": "0321chung", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18185622076342499, "text": "有冇得試食", "created_at": "2025-12-08T06:34:31", "owner": "hanselhwf", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085630249990456, "text": "@trevorrrrr588  @iow_hai484 無茄汁", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:18:50", "owner": "kin_tai_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18328230715245915, "text": "同個個泡麵之神一樣，缺點就係無呢間店😢", "created_at": "2025-12-07T11:15:38", "owner": "jeffy_chan.cwt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18034670390527031, "text": "cheese", "created_at": "2025-12-07T16:33:25", "owner": "cz4123", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084144536319112, "text": "開鋪!!!", "created_at": "2025-12-07T14:46:03", "owner": "kt_tnc", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18370944550083623, "text": "好想食", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:04:42", "owner": "kayicjeung1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17938611504096211, "text": "係有腰果芝麻花生醬既Burger, 好想試下個醬汁😱😋🥺", "created_at": "2025-12-11T13:08:28", "owner": "iamokie", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080626441923765, "text": "冇芝士冇靈魂😔", "created_at": "2025-12-07T10:23:51", "owner": "markcco_dgdj", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087869032966945, "text": "Why no cheese", "created_at": "2025-12-07T11:55:02", "owner": "khhchiuu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088886191985876, "text": "好過咩野鋒味果d", "created_at": "2025-12-07T08:29:03", "owner": "alawagua", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18216049819310887, "text": "跟住話唔開舖。好嬲。", "created_at": "2025-12-10T15:18:45", "owner": "bryan_tmhk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077662408976528, "text": "個包會幾甜，下次試下自己整", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:58:19", "owner": "littldolphin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17844669186630608, "text": "肉餅個形狀令我諗到元朗嘅大寶冰室，每一塊肉餅都係嚟自元朗大師級肉餅工匠嘅手工之作，我哋圍內有真實力識食嘅手足都稱之為味蕾炸彈，全亞洲最優秀嘅肉餅飯，大件夾抵食，而且仲要係地鐵站附近巴士總站，交通方便。", "created_at": "2025-12-12T07:37:44", "owner": "jonhem0728", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17861484693543988, "text": "本身已經諗住搵地址😢", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:26:20", "owner": "harrykam_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18046463159468961, "text": "開鋪咁樣做 會蝕死😂\n招呼下朋友就得", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:23:55", "owner": "burcehung", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17851977657597866, "text": "成本幾多🤨", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:08:39", "owner": "xegx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18355592029202906, "text": "有興趣，第日開咗舖頭一定去食", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:21:01", "owner": "lam.heidiii._", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18165969508349016, "text": "想試！", "created_at": "2025-12-04T10:24:34", "owner": "karenlaiph_15", "likes": 6}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["漢堡包", "burger"]},
{"media_id": 3781924260701652878, "shortcode": "DR8GBPejceO", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DR8GBPejceO/", "taken_at": "2025-12-06T22:36:48", "caption": "A day in the life with Nina, Vice President at 180 Degrees Consulting Sheffield.\n\nFrom leading meetings and supporting project teams to coordinating operations and driving strategic initiatives, Nina plays a key role in keeping our branch running smoothly and impact focused. This behind the scenes look offers a glimpse into the leadership, collaboration, and dedication that go into delivering high quality consulting work throughout the year.\n\nWe are proud to spotlight the team members whose commitment helps strengthen our mission of creating positive social impact through student consulting. \n\n#180DC #Sheffield #180DCSheffield #DayInTheLife #StudentLeadership #WomenInLeadership #ConsultingLife #StudentConsulting #BehindTheScenes", "owner_username": "180dcsheffield", "owner_id": "68775707944", "likes": 37, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0058_DR8GBPejceO\\DR8GBPejceO_20251206_223648.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": "18341916121225899", "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-06T23:06:11", "owner": "gaininjaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17887595646400825", "text": "🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:52:24", "owner": "aabdulmajeed03_", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18105073279579097", "text": "Chloe guest appearance", "created_at": "2025-12-06T23:17:24", "owner": "mahdi.azmy", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18089503489770011", "text": "Nina you're so productive 🤭", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:01:23", "owner": "chl0e.w", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18544168873032269", "text": "Ninaaa my bsffff❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-07T00:13:40", "owner": "nikzxzag", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18097550509667589", "text": "Wuuuuuu go Nina!!", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:51:47", "owner": "willthoburn", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["180dc", "sheffield", "180dcsheffield", "dayinthelife", "studentleadership", "womeninleadership", "consultinglife", "studentconsulting", "behindthescenes"]},
{"media_id": 3780110612379004819, "shortcode": "DR1ppL2iO-T", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DR1ppL2iO-T/", "taken_at": "2025-12-04T10:32:38", "caption": "🇨🇳🇫🇷", "owner_username": "emmanuelmacron", "owner_id": "3859569796", "likes": 82027, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0059_DR1ppL2iO-T\\DR1ppL2iO-T_20251204_103238.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17875989354446012, "text": "我已经分不清领导是真的好这口还是拿小孩子反讽朝鲜了，好逆天", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:12:35", "owner": "irgendx", "likes": 373}, {"id": 18061486799637636, "text": "Dragon celeste", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:00:33", "owner": "picklemile", "likes": 49}, {"id": 17954325840021940, "text": "羨慕小孩子和馬克龍", "created_at": "2025-12-08T15:43:00", "owner": "eshouhuo", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18068200967420620, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:10:30", "owner": "gustave_dh", "likes": 92}, {"id": 18536038348050720, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:37:54", "owner": "_xm1._", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18164280700387391, "text": "万歳🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:23:48", "owner": "laimeng355", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18080161736133610, "text": "朝鲜有太阳，中国也有", "created_at": "2025-12-06T03:55:51", "owner": "chxny09", "likes": 62}, {"id": 18087831253955623, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:10:10", "owner": "abc13957", "likes": 4406}, {"id": 18114110350598752, "text": "President Macron, I hear you are visiting China. China still has no animal protection laws, and animals are treated badly. Please urge President Xi Jinping to enact animal protection laws🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-04T11:44:43", "owner": "shoko216mame", "likes": 98}, {"id": 18436991986101657, "text": "我的妈，和朝鲜有什么区别😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:28:05", "owner": "zyz_dennis", "likes": 18766}, {"id": 18085342412082939, "text": "French President Macron! You are visiting China. Please ask President Xi Jinping to enact animal protection laws in China for the sake of the Chinese people and animals! Please do so for the sake of China's future!", "created_at": "2025-12-04T10:50:37", "owner": "yosee.takahashi", "likes": 286}, {"id": 18159729841719046, "text": "Monsieur le Président Macron, vous êtes en visite en Chine. Veuillez exhorter le Président Xi Jinping à promulguer des lois de protection animale en Chine, pour le bien du peuple chinois et des animaux. Merci pour votre soutien à l'avenir de la Chine.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:30:00", "owner": "xx_rkf_xx", "likes": 32}, {"id": 17958342594001681, "text": "crazy is this 2025？", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:08:23", "owner": "vincent_he_ho", "likes": 30}, {"id": 18229569781305982, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:23:22", "owner": "fanyoujia_183", "likes": 55}, {"id": 17874181230377904, "text": "French President Macron. You are visiting China. Please ask President Xi Jinping to enact animal protection laws in China for the sake of the Chinese people and animals! Please do so for the sake of China's future!", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:02:22", "owner": "jis_gram", "likes": 27}, {"id": 18059786918286083, "text": "En Chine, des personnes maltraitant des animaux se vantent de leur actes et les affichent  sur les réseaux sociaux. La Chine est un pays sans loi sur la protection animale. Monsieur le Président Macron, demandez au Président Xi Jinping de promulguer la loi,s’il vous plaît.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T12:27:30", "owner": "mijikanoko", "likes": 62}, {"id": 18030085076556192, "text": "为什么都在说中国虐待动物，很好奇", "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:34:17", "owner": "huishao9527", "likes": 1664}, {"id": 18088592453317936, "text": "将军✋🏻😭🤚🏻🇰🇵🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-13T13:10:45", "owner": "fengsheng114514", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085998253839899, "text": "总统先生 可以通过您让习主席知道中国宁波医疗事故故意杀害一名五个月的女孩吗？她叫小洛熙，她的爸爸妈妈在维权但是被打压的太厉害😭😭❤️🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:29:44", "owner": "lujialing1105", "likes": 281}, {"id": 18077373788586034, "text": "不知道的以为到朝鲜了", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:09:14", "owner": "dongjm123", "likes": 4298}, {"id": 18543223141041311, "text": "凑热闹是人类的天性，希望马不要被冲昏头脑OK?", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:23:52", "owner": "sylviawang2333", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080088869171388, "text": "A red sun in the sky over Paris today", "created_at": "2025-12-04T10:33:51", "owner": "yugosiavia", "likes": 969}, {"id": 17869209933494735, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T08:02:14", "owner": "3cmsmllgg", "likes": 243}, {"id": 18118349746552559, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:35:14", "owner": "tsako.22", "likes": 11108}, {"id": 18098236924891635, "text": "@jaaayiiwhoo 你若三冬来换我一城雪白", "created_at": "2025-12-13T08:53:09", "owner": "youyouyouleile", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074358008260821, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T11:26:16", "owner": "epm0o7", "likes": 17003}, {"id": 17976156332958168, "text": "中国の経済発展は素晴らしいです。しかし残念なことに、欧米では多くの国が動物愛護法など素晴らしい法律があります。\n中国も先進国で有ればそれは当たり前ではないですか？\nどうか🙏🏻動物虐待者を取り締まる強い法律を作ってください‼️", "created_at": "2025-12-04T11:41:45", "owner": "chisan_desu", "likes": 218}, {"id": 17916295506237259, "text": "北朝鮮みたい", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:25:56", "owner": "tokutani_daito", "likes": 1967}, {"id": 18004263305831729, "text": "From Japan\nI would be grateful if you could address the horrific cat abuse cases that are terrifying people around the world during your meeting with China.\nI believe that international cooperation can become a strong force to stop this cruel act. 🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-04T14:39:50", "owner": "ninaninacucu", "likes": 76}, {"id": 18090585700765323, "text": "这是朝鲜吗？🇰🇵太阳这一块 有点刺眼", "created_at": "2025-12-08T02:17:21", "owner": "na2co3boo", "likes": 16}, {"id": 18046199024481128, "text": "为什么这个年代了  这一招还在？哈哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:12:41", "owner": "y.ting31", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17991379118733455, "text": "🇹🇼 Taiwan is a legitimate independent country. 🇨🇳 The People's Republic of China should respect 🇯🇵 Japan❗️", "created_at": "2025-12-04T11:23:48", "owner": "take_bridgestone", "likes": 17}, {"id": 17975923283959036, "text": "looks like ceausescu’s visit to north korea", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:14:48", "owner": "ethanhu714", "likes": 29}, {"id": 17846176062619237, "text": "習近平のためにこんな洗脳教育をされてる子供たち", "created_at": "2025-12-05T17:53:17", "owner": "sasaking_0823", "likes": 32}, {"id": 18086859836067230, "text": "Similar to North Korea", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:11:53", "owner": "iambear95", "likes": 42}, {"id": 18165097900389584, "text": "North Korea moment", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:08:26", "owner": "masterdenis", "likes": 47}, {"id": 17903485875162921, "text": "マクロン仏大統領、\n中国ご訪問の折に、ぜひ習近平国家主席へお伝えいただきたいことがあります。\n中国の人々と動物たちのために、動物保護法の制定をご検討いただけるよう、働きかけていただけませんか。\n中国の未来がより良い方向へ進むために、どうかよろしくお願いいたします。", "created_at": "2025-12-04T12:10:06", "owner": "cat_cat.lovecat", "likes": 213}, {"id": 17920115949205698, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:33:39", "owner": "qwerhjjhh", "likes": 32}, {"id": 18067683713616140, "text": "怖い", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:25:50", "owner": "atsushibou", "likes": 19}, {"id": 18121531711544152, "text": "lets go 🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:42:51", "owner": "tonycheungcy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18372130066086788, "text": "看我把什么带来了👏👏👏👏🌷🌷🌷🌷👍👍👍❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-13T01:04:08", "owner": "416lucifer", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17895274218360552, "text": "机器人？ 马克龙好像没去朝鲜啊", "created_at": "2025-12-07T01:02:52", "owner": "wentiannaitnew", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18136312684476544, "text": "Veuillez conseiller à la Chine d'adopter des lois interdisant la cruauté envers les animaux.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T11:33:08", "owner": "hima.wari0812", "likes": 71}, {"id": 17850368436599561, "text": "中国は素晴らしい国であるが、動物に優しい国となれはもっと素晴らしい国になるでしょう。どうか中国に動物虐待禁止法の制定をお願いしてください🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-04T11:36:31", "owner": "aya.u.s.a.k", "likes": 649}, {"id": 18110020648620775, "text": "我以為看到北韓，這就是獨裁專制主義的國家", "created_at": "2025-12-11T02:29:23", "owner": "leegt0720", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18050274809394211, "text": "Free Tibet", "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:12:34", "owner": "doldol_khal", "likes": 17}, {"id": 17904905190292639, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T14:03:52", "owner": "3cmsmllgg", "likes": 19}, {"id": 17953736103022027, "text": "North Korea? 🇰🇵😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T04:52:26", "owner": "gutelaunebecher", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18103477198673146, "text": "日本人中了什么毒 关动保什么事啊？什么新型洗脑模式", "created_at": "2025-12-04T14:17:57", "owner": "oliviaisqw", "likes": 86}, {"id": 18041102660716132, "text": "啥年代了还搞这种欢迎仪式真可怕", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:23:14", "owner": "zhaoliangstudio", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18096019720876682, "text": "🙌😭🙌😭🙌😭🙌😭🙌😭🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:37:40", "owner": "enz0_wyc", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18107191762651174, "text": "這些小孩不用讀書嗎", "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:38:33", "owner": "lufeng.castle", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17903643426321087, "text": "這些小孩感覺就是被逼的", "created_at": "2025-12-10T10:18:23", "owner": "youcheng487", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18101038996755719, "text": "I thought it was North Korea. Everyone's brains are controlled.", "created_at": "2025-12-10T03:59:20", "owner": "_____oink____", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18090134680759832, "text": "Le mandat des cieux à été délivré, longue vie au camarade Macron 🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:07:21", "owner": "gege_oui_c_moa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18106314520639346, "text": "让小孩欢迎领导人咋了，想去还去不成呢", "created_at": "2025-12-10T23:45:19", "owner": "celinakabel.28", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17960004045008341, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:23:48", "owner": "hinbimabro", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17990976686881387, "text": "你竟然喜欢朝鲜方式的欢迎仪式", "created_at": "2025-12-10T19:18:27", "owner": "dennis_dxy", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17887823352403705, "text": "Cette belle image pour dire qu on renonce a la langue francaise. Jusque il y a 25mn le nom de cette ville était : Pékin.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:38:16", "owner": "vincent_1234_mfy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18106565911652788, "text": "🇰🇵🇰🇵🇨🇳🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-10T11:27:13", "owner": "herocheng697", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064852037451138, "text": "As a chinese i ask myself if it's staged? Who the hell like macron?!", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:59:48", "owner": "nicholas_734.prv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302082040259470, "text": "🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-10T23:16:21", "owner": "chen140512", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18091966126910301, "text": "🇰🇵❤️🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-11T03:05:12", "owner": "deiliw", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17891888091382327, "text": "🙌🇰🇵🙌🇰🇵🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-11T03:05:31", "owner": "deiliw", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17956008003041440, "text": "AI kids", "created_at": "2025-12-11T04:07:48", "owner": "oscarttyu123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108882169614246, "text": "Il faut donc faire 8000 km pour trouver des gens qui font semblant d’être heureux de voir Macron! 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T11:12:44", "owner": "faj.pcn", "likes": 1848}, {"id": 17951524488049262, "text": "中国政府へ動物虐待者を厳しく取り締まる法律の制定を急ぐようにお力添えいただけないでしょうか。これは動物を愛する私たちの心からのお願いです", "created_at": "2025-12-04T11:58:45", "owner": "mi_do_miya", "likes": 245}, {"id": 18080240923915908, "text": "mayonnaise??", "created_at": "2025-12-04T10:54:42", "owner": "imron_oiiia95", "likes": 5022}, {"id": 18144127507453008, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:25:14", "owner": "olop.off", "likes": 678}, {"id": 18158416093407127, "text": "Hello, Mr. President! Welcome to Chengdu, China. I have made some videos of you interacting with giant pandas. Can you like and comment on my videos?It’s important to me that more people can see cute pandas. 🐼🐼🐼🐼🐼", "created_at": "2025-12-06T05:13:38", "owner": "zijia59", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17890782570380307, "text": "😅😅😅😅😅😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:56:19", "owner": "lanbos688", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18095075209861443, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T14:20:01", "owner": "chunming_mw", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18084465550860987, "text": "🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-07T20:01:18", "owner": "gura114514", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18095892331892009, "text": "《戴高乐到访平壤》限时体验卡", "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:23:05", "owner": "rchen03", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18049162619419815, "text": "Hello, Mr. President! Welcome to Chengdu, China. I have made some videos of you interacting with giant pandas. Can you like and comment on my videos?It’s important to me that more people can see cute pandas. 🐼🐼🐼🐼🐼", "created_at": "2025-12-06T05:13:41", "owner": "zijia59", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17947403214079175, "text": "😵😵😵", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:52:36", "owner": "joeythebeast___", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17992449023855686, "text": "Ça fait penser à la Corée du Nord, avec tout le respect", "created_at": "2025-12-04T10:40:15", "owner": "ant_one75", "likes": 270}, {"id": 17982894851923751, "text": "你从丹东来还我一身雪白 想吃广东菜～～☀️☀️", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:38:45", "owner": "yasuaki1331", "likes": 18}, {"id": 17959115567886351, "text": "我自己身为中国人，我都感觉这个太夸张了", "created_at": "2025-12-09T00:40:31", "owner": "andy556355", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18037593383514729, "text": "我听到什么？“我爱朝鲜？！？？🇰🇵”", "created_at": "2025-12-08T15:55:27", "owner": "jensen_1031", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18046991372473806, "text": "你若三冬来 还我一城雪白🖐️😭🤚", "created_at": "2025-12-09T10:41:13", "owner": "lol945120", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18108601597624107, "text": "他们在说什么", "created_at": "2025-12-06T03:29:32", "owner": "g1ar32", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17883309102414167, "text": "瑪莉歐賽車場邊的奇諾比奧", "created_at": "2025-12-07T09:02:03", "owner": "kuantayu", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17868427773486885, "text": "✋😭🤚✋😭🤚✋😭🤚", "created_at": "2025-12-06T00:03:59", "owner": "issac_goat0828", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18193926295332663, "text": "我愛朝鮮？", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:23:47", "owner": "chiang_kai_shek_1887", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17969912282963647, "text": "我们就是朝鲜🇰🇵😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:00:49", "owner": "sbcnmd78", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087310274002440, "text": "VIVE LE GLORIEUX RÉGIME COMMUNISTE CHINOIS 🇨🇳🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:25:37", "owner": "dorian.joestar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086852429062014, "text": "Oh my god 这是让孩子们在干啥啊🥲🥲🥲🥲", "created_at": "2025-12-13T17:40:51", "owner": "golf0_0golf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976208109950956, "text": "同学之间不要互相嘲笑🇨🇳🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-13T16:58:11", "owner": "citron2765", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866563315523941, "text": "刁狗", "created_at": "2025-12-13T16:27:11", "owner": "cyx987957", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910771759122505, "text": "ハニートラップ国家らしいな", "created_at": "2025-12-13T15:27:20", "owner": "jiantai850", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878115445443598, "text": "I hope President Macron doesn’t enjoy this", "created_at": "2025-12-13T15:07:25", "owner": "donginbiofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052972637668712, "text": "❤️❤️❤️🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-13T14:59:00", "owner": "ke.ven1703", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941628615965727, "text": "✋😭✋", "created_at": "2025-12-13T14:13:52", "owner": "yutre0302", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18317897416217247, "text": "🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵👏", "created_at": "2025-12-13T14:05:19", "owner": "scott3361488", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17851563651600170, "text": "🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-13T13:33:59", "owner": "ohmy7370", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927734149161100, "text": "🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-13T13:32:31", "owner": "jacksonieong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944086768086577, "text": "神经病吧 谁们家小孩子表达欢迎是这样的 好丢人啊", "created_at": "2025-12-13T12:20:00", "owner": "wswjsldhdd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082176968170359, "text": "歡迎來到🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-13T11:53:26", "owner": "sophie96118", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098184604660804, "text": "🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-13T11:04:05", "owner": "_alan.chau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016978487631044, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂和朝鲜有什么区别。我爱国但我不爱形式主义", "created_at": "2025-12-13T10:35:26", "owner": "heywilliamti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079272067958965, "text": "支那人は中国共産党を終わりにしたくないのかな？\n国に管理されのが楽なのかな？", "created_at": "2025-12-13T10:34:08", "owner": "sato.shi7279", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073386806367333, "text": "🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-13T10:24:48", "owner": "jesse_zhou_50", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954897922022175, "text": "👍👍👍❤️❤️❤️🌹🌹🌹，带了点土特产", "created_at": "2025-12-13T10:21:04", "owner": "ysj5548", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097101250862487, "text": "Pourquoi les enfants demande Tibet libre à président Macron ?", "created_at": "2025-12-13T10:11:58", "owner": "tenla915", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062958107215144, "text": "見吾子民皆得其樂，朕心乃安。", "created_at": "2025-12-13T08:55:55", "owner": "real_qin_shihuang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18399525259125861, "text": "I love China, but I really hate this slavish action performed by children.", "created_at": "2025-12-13T08:33:24", "owner": "daisy20sui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990182004866334, "text": "🤢🤢🤢", "created_at": "2025-12-13T08:13:53", "owner": "ryandezun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545654218042481, "text": "這是在北韓嗎？🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-13T07:31:30", "owner": "yehharold", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855686893583579, "text": "朝鲜万岁🎉", "created_at": "2025-12-13T07:30:30", "owner": "ylimhs_131", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912805519255939, "text": "日本排放核污水对动物的伤害更大，很多水里生物都因为日本排放的核污水而死亡💀，所以日本应该尽快书面向全世界道歉，对动物死亡负责，倭寇侵略着，把琉球王国还给人家，给琉球人自由！ 残忍的日本人！ 不然，又有小男孩和胖子 到达日本人的家门口咯！！", "created_at": "2025-12-13T07:12:45", "owner": "kylie3t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090475894748954, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-13T07:08:54", "owner": "wxn969", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924252937049950, "text": "丢人啊", "created_at": "2025-12-13T04:55:45", "owner": "liuzz57", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931416511119079, "text": "Poor children", "created_at": "2025-12-13T04:00:53", "owner": "echolov.e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013577915804271, "text": "？？？朝鲜", "created_at": "2025-12-13T02:14:35", "owner": "rainyjay870425", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883917751419826, "text": "what are they doing？", "created_at": "2025-12-13T01:13:10", "owner": "edwardzhangshuai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898667560357219, "text": "🇰🇵❤️🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-13T01:12:01", "owner": "adio.l.m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956150644046854, "text": "?", "created_at": "2025-12-13T00:44:58", "owner": "heyhey_fi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966152013990063, "text": "I feel ashamed as a Chinese 🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-13T00:30:13", "owner": "caoyuchen2001", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18139629541459723, "text": "👏👏👏👏🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-12T23:47:59", "owner": "nebbbbcct", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165452620389129, "text": "Cheer for their live", "created_at": "2025-12-12T22:05:58", "owner": "jcyharry999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077238089335332, "text": "🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-12T22:05:34", "owner": "ykonguo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087055253084017, "text": "歡羊您", "created_at": "2025-12-12T20:43:05", "owner": "ellenliu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901071592186253, "text": "Sooo", "created_at": "2025-12-12T20:14:35", "owner": "alireza865100", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18416913010137807, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-12-12T20:13:42", "owner": "hamoufahem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086008790088609, "text": "경애하는 최고령도자 김정은 동지께서", "created_at": "2025-12-12T18:50:44", "owner": "one23481097", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18224488246307863, "text": "北朝鮮だ。\n中国人もそろそろ気がついてほしい。\n中国人の環境が良くなることが世界にとってもいいことだと思う。\n日本や台湾など協力してくれる国に攻撃する理由は、中国が国内の問題を国民から隠そうとしていることだ。\n中国人の頭のいい人間はみんな気がついてるだろ？\nでもどうしようもないのもわかってる。\nでもネットでは本心で語ろうぜ。", "created_at": "2025-12-12T17:55:27", "owner": "__mgjpd_429", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062734658227561, "text": "لطيف", "created_at": "2025-12-12T16:32:03", "owner": "abdulaziz_abuelkheir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114164125598749, "text": "你从丹东来，想吃广东菜🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-12T15:47:30", "owner": "ekk0010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980351976929606, "text": "🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-12T15:20:06", "owner": "philipt10_10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006618149669847, "text": "子供たちかわいそう", "created_at": "2025-12-12T15:03:08", "owner": "tetetete2344", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065002214184621, "text": "誤入🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-12T14:28:23", "owner": "345863295ww", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887090062401289, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-12T12:46:02", "owner": "simonkasparek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933641869136478, "text": "🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-12T10:32:29", "owner": "eechengggggg030", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892772125242483, "text": "🙄🙄🙄你觉得这很光荣？你不觉得这很傻逼吗？", "created_at": "2025-12-12T10:24:50", "owner": "lidabai1993811", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030169460762184, "text": "西朝鲜", "created_at": "2025-12-12T09:58:25", "owner": "5l1nfen9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844424197632696, "text": "🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-12T09:41:46", "owner": "lin950917", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974055204806010, "text": "吓不吓人", "created_at": "2025-12-12T09:00:55", "owner": "daoke_67373", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18300950569280506, "text": "这什么鬼", "created_at": "2025-12-12T08:01:04", "owner": "kezuenhauezlkl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109871788620015, "text": "日本人还好意思提动物保护，你们杀了多少海豚和鲸鱼，这都是病危动物", "created_at": "2025-12-12T07:39:15", "owner": "aboutyou2009", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875072338457787, "text": "樣板戲半個世紀都不變！", "created_at": "2025-12-12T07:36:01", "owner": "itgalberty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029409716761820, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-12T07:26:54", "owner": "payphone888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114291895603432, "text": "🇰🇵🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-12T07:16:14", "owner": "tjx00001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116450632566666, "text": "🇰🇵👏🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-12T06:00:01", "owner": "liang96tw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085594904107563, "text": "🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵像不像？法兰西的太阳？", "created_at": "2025-12-12T05:58:26", "owner": "linyu10311031", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099025516833282, "text": "像朝鲜一样😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T04:44:49", "owner": "wangyouquan510", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136149007478559, "text": "我以为是ai", "created_at": "2025-12-12T03:37:48", "owner": "pyy159357", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18379854520153567, "text": "好可怕～ 心痛", "created_at": "2025-12-12T03:37:01", "owner": "yifancello", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101930350786357, "text": "？", "created_at": "2025-12-12T02:32:37", "owner": "audrey.xjhx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984146139781874, "text": "小孩在说什么噢", "created_at": "2025-12-12T01:52:23", "owner": "hl123712", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047804111694146, "text": "我要吓晕过去了", "created_at": "2025-12-12T01:41:45", "owner": "rita_wanwannnnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892931065241977, "text": "North Korea???", "created_at": "2025-12-12T00:10:30", "owner": "raybenpepe0312", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087274931054744, "text": "666，最讽刺的恩情画面竟然发生在…？！", "created_at": "2025-12-11T23:43:22", "owner": "aka_taaaaaan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049969208404994, "text": "Dear French President Macron, you're visiting China. For the sake of the Chinese people and animals, the friendly relations between China and France, and the future of the world, please tell President Xi Jinping to enact animal protection laws in China!", "created_at": "2025-12-11T23:36:32", "owner": "lunesauvage7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161168917400811, "text": "越来越像朝鲜了！！", "created_at": "2025-12-11T19:41:48", "owner": "lengyankanshijie78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960320959009310, "text": "朝鲜？", "created_at": "2025-12-11T18:13:36", "owner": "ye.mei.li.521", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135598243480158, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T17:21:34", "owner": "___le_renard___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075358544203452, "text": "朝里朝气", "created_at": "2025-12-11T16:51:55", "owner": "wshunlia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088986751791812, "text": "Monsieur le Président Macron, vous êtes en visite en Chine. Pour le bien du peuple chinois et des animaux, pour les relations amicales entre la Chine et la France, et pour l'avenir du monde, je vous prie de dire au Président Xi Jinping de promulguer des lois de protection animale en Chine !", "created_at": "2025-12-11T16:51:31", "owner": "yuki.like.coffe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18334687282234778, "text": "你若三冬来", "created_at": "2025-12-11T15:54:28", "owner": "pelery1231", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088227743066150, "text": "作孽的安排！", "created_at": "2025-12-11T15:49:32", "owner": "junli499", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965705478991092, "text": "？？？？？？？馬將軍恩情", "created_at": "2025-12-11T15:35:26", "owner": "coconutmomogram", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086750786316686, "text": "金将军？？？", "created_at": "2025-12-11T15:34:27", "owner": "coconutmomogram", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137693500476123, "text": "其實這從很久以前就有了，而且是朝鮮學中國，只是朝鮮搞得更大而已。", "created_at": "2025-12-11T15:32:34", "owner": "chairman0316", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934310737130420, "text": "Xijinping is dead in 2030", "created_at": "2025-12-11T14:24:10", "owner": "matsumatsu1993", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088501657989012, "text": "hi", "created_at": "2025-12-11T13:31:52", "owner": "sam2119511", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074006549048715, "text": "🙄🙄🙄👎🈲🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-11T12:45:48", "owner": "fairy1118", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083731064032377, "text": "都快成太阳了😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T10:22:26", "owner": "an.nan0127", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18370093213093618, "text": "快相親😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T10:15:16", "owner": "ovo_0721", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143941546452615, "text": "废了，什么时间下台", "created_at": "2025-12-11T08:53:02", "owner": "wanga30523", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051953195676959, "text": "🇰🇵🇰🇵🇨🇳🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-11T08:39:21", "owner": "zhongmo228", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087804082952659, "text": "🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-11T07:29:47", "owner": "jaxynraze", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071354924605300, "text": "タコ🐙８踊り", "created_at": "2025-12-11T07:09:39", "owner": "damodaji", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093445171931360, "text": "Is this DPRK? 🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:51:40", "owner": "sebastiangaogao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904047790314602, "text": "🖐️😭🖐️🖐️😭🖐️\n✍️😭✍️😭✍️😭", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:46:13", "owner": "jimmnnnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986037591917441, "text": "😅🤢🤢", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:44:51", "owner": "dearevaxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842027416660783, "text": "💛💛💛💛💛💛💛💛💛💘💘💘💛شاد  باشید", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:38:50", "owner": "om.ran9726", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118448500492741, "text": "ai", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:21:35", "owner": "namast332", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908949016273028, "text": "感觉习想玩怀旧服啊", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:15:20", "owner": "_caesar_lee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092477134930809, "text": "我觉得吧，这些小孩子都是抱着娱乐或者功利的心态去做这些事的，朝鲜那种是真的强迫洗脑，这种可能就是一个评优评先的机会，或者在公开场合抛头露面的机会，跟你在学校操场里表演一个性质。这种事不就跟你元旦晚会上去唱 rap 一个道理，没上去的都在底下骂你傻逼，上去了抛头露面，以后拿这个照片吹牛逼。", "created_at": "2025-12-11T04:38:19", "owner": "aaaugustuszzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945525637065017, "text": "宣传", "created_at": "2025-12-11T04:17:07", "owner": "will.dg__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987689757871974, "text": "フランスから日本の友達に伝えたいんだけど、中国のボットはすごく遅れていてバカだよwww 心配しないで、日本のような民主主義国家と中国や北朝鮮のような独裁国家を混同しないで。🇫🇷🇯🇵🇫🇷🇯🇵🇫🇷🇯🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-11T04:15:37", "owner": "will.dg__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002147339691111, "text": "Fake", "created_at": "2025-12-11T04:07:43", "owner": "oscarttyu123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094847458873434, "text": "吓哭了 鸭绿江双雄", "created_at": "2025-12-11T03:06:49", "owner": "pengbo060812", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069350699455524, "text": "北韓化試運行", "created_at": "2025-12-11T02:53:01", "owner": "marrisionlim_8964wtp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086294927082166, "text": "You are welcome", "created_at": "2025-12-11T01:14:47", "owner": "qiuyan962", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18355714894165957, "text": "尬死了😭", "created_at": "2025-12-10T23:28:45", "owner": "putalermatata", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080623556157373, "text": "Hahahhahahahahhajahah", "created_at": "2025-12-10T21:36:45", "owner": "charlottezhou2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18437378953104637, "text": "我们就像个小丑在玩一样在一起吗这不算吗那不是吗你看你能说出个什么我是真的爱的很吗\n是因为。 你也不要多吃些饭呀你就不能喝点\n😭🤣为了让", "created_at": "2025-12-10T21:31:51", "owner": "tom_7even", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898668949197276, "text": "「やらせ」", "created_at": "2025-12-10T21:15:03", "owner": "shiyejiayilang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104383282652476, "text": "Un enfant à côté de son père. MACRON DEMISSION", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:59:11", "owner": "nicholas_734.prv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934414210108375, "text": "神经病", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:47:45", "owner": "aries20000329", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962784078864452, "text": "666朝鲜来了", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:45:26", "owner": "philip_08619", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075759536586228, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:29:46", "owner": "thegxio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049458740412887, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-12-10T19:55:28", "owner": "zizi88410", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072100031369101, "text": "🇹🇼", "created_at": "2025-12-10T17:38:57", "owner": "wyz137891", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119270914558400, "text": "台湾", "created_at": "2025-12-10T17:38:54", "owner": "wyz137891", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936810340104866, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T16:11:35", "owner": "edgarycheung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18520707970064439, "text": "\\o/\\o/\\o/\\o/\\o/\\o/\\o/\\o/\\o/\\o/\\o/\\o/\\o/\\o/\\o/\\o/\\o/\\o/", "created_at": "2025-12-10T16:08:53", "owner": "xiaohahahahaaaaaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110364691716540, "text": "哥们以为到🇰🇵朝鲜了", "created_at": "2025-12-10T16:07:29", "owner": "imis.su439", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959512533878660, "text": "穿小鞋~穿小鞋~穿小鞋~", "created_at": "2025-12-10T15:39:27", "owner": "lukx.ashes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017505311795570, "text": "中共一贯作风，自我欺骗。请一堆演员来安慰自己", "created_at": "2025-12-10T15:29:51", "owner": "i_dont_care1028", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901189363180458, "text": "@sbc3.14rad 來看🤓", "created_at": "2025-12-10T15:26:14", "owner": "lin_19_cr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956035348022444, "text": "🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T15:24:21", "owner": "t01234956", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861186265551267, "text": "🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-10T15:24:09", "owner": "like_hk416", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066162644161695, "text": "🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-10T14:59:43", "owner": "caijunyi32", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066068774159826, "text": "欢迎仪式是给人家老马看的，你们先问问人家老马喜不喜欢，看得开不开心。", "created_at": "2025-12-10T14:32:57", "owner": "sunpoet412", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18428326849115557, "text": "What Lovely Chinese Kids🇨🇳💛💋🐰🐤🐮 :)", "created_at": "2025-12-10T14:30:05", "owner": "saving.our.earth11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997385046848682, "text": "结果马克龙回国就加对中国的税了😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T13:34:01", "owner": "junzhezhang883", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072402602460500, "text": "please stop Japan from killing whales and Dolphins 🐬", "created_at": "2025-12-10T13:29:20", "owner": "dustydewdew", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086639423073836, "text": "🤢🤢🤢", "created_at": "2025-12-10T12:54:36", "owner": "bachlor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113298370606243, "text": "🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T12:24:14", "owner": "chengshihang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090845167937333, "text": "🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-10T11:53:51", "owner": "b_lu519", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114084445608003, "text": "funny", "created_at": "2025-12-10T11:49:21", "owner": "bicetoky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18389640523178258, "text": "🇰🇵🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-10T11:46:45", "owner": "jzq20008000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102533608706068, "text": "谁他娘的安排这样欢迎仪式的，精神病吧。 死性不改 丢人显眼。", "created_at": "2025-12-10T11:07:09", "owner": "guinn_mq", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18083366963114509, "text": "也别光保护动物了，我建议肉类一律禁止食用😀不觉得很残忍吗流着红色的血液跟人一样的器官。要保护就彻底一点咯 各国网友请素食谢谢🙏反正我本来是吃素的哈哈哈🤣 我不在乎", "created_at": "2025-12-10T11:06:50", "owner": "yuyuf123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865793842528864, "text": "❤️🇨🇳🇫🇷👏🇰🇵😍🙏😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T10:55:52", "owner": "joe_alison_swift", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322408981175951, "text": "因为外网都是坏种。", "created_at": "2025-12-10T09:44:30", "owner": "junwenyao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046921385469427, "text": "🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-10T09:31:11", "owner": "masssjjk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053397920654805, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T09:11:43", "owner": "haram11181118", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030270236757160, "text": "马克龙以为到朝鲜了😂，北朝鲜，这里是西朝鲜", "created_at": "2025-12-10T08:13:06", "owner": "shujunliuliu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092795254909031, "text": "将军🤚😭✋", "created_at": "2025-12-10T07:50:53", "owner": "chen.xi519", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115342228572771, "text": "恶心", "created_at": "2025-12-10T07:38:29", "owner": "yaojunxiang01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918911521223771, "text": "Korean?", "created_at": "2025-12-10T07:20:10", "owner": "yeosung3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085798754009442, "text": "我还以为将军来啦😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T07:09:38", "owner": "diandongji18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869780521480128, "text": "🇰🇵?", "created_at": "2025-12-10T06:58:08", "owner": "j.d.l.i.u", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083746253038099, "text": "看到这一幕的时候，我的脑海中已经开始响起恩情小曲儿了 😅", "created_at": "2025-12-10T06:55:05", "owner": "zq_utoronto_utsg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18167186707389114, "text": "Assalamu'alaikum wr br. Yaa anak cucu Rasulullah nabi besar muhammad saw. Ikhlas la engkau. \n( Bagaimana ) dengan umat qu. Yang ada di dunia.. Mereka raji ibada dan ta'at dengan allah swt. Di dunia di akhirat... \nPerjalan Baginda Rasulullah nabi besar muhammad saw. \nDari masjid Al-Aqsa sampai ka'bah. \n2027..bulan 2 tanggal 3.\nJam 03 02... Demi nama al-qur 'an. Kesempurnaan al-qur'an dan hadist.. Kesucian hajar aswad dan ka'bah. Kebenaran masjid Al-Aqsa.. Yaa raja raja arab.... Dirikan kembali istana kerajaan islam... .. Ibadah umroh. Dan Haji.. Rukun iman dan islam..\nKita akan melewati nyaa di dunia dan di akhirat allah swt.. \nKerjaan islam.. Akan menghancurkan \n**kerjaan kafir... \nFir'aun akan di keringkan kembali..", "created_at": "2025-12-10T06:48:09", "owner": "hardwork4819", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302551357270235, "text": "动物保护是何意味", "created_at": "2025-12-10T06:36:24", "owner": "clockwork__h", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037096205517992, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T06:04:00", "owner": "le_groupe_7777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935789005137064, "text": "Рабы", "created_at": "2025-12-10T04:22:36", "owner": "magomed_sama", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088674910797981, "text": "逐渐朝鲜化😭", "created_at": "2025-12-10T03:37:22", "owner": "ton_466466", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088786678985299, "text": "気持ち悪い、、こいつら全員人間じゃないな", "created_at": "2025-12-10T03:15:05", "owner": "same.yuzu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949372753003253, "text": "西朝鮮歡迎馬應龍pm", "created_at": "2025-12-10T03:14:07", "owner": "asahi20007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084359051018778, "text": "陰陽師！陰陽師！陰陽師！", "created_at": "2025-12-10T03:08:45", "owner": "yatsutaman56", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17993179004895811, "text": "鸭绿江没加盖 不想过了交250自己过去 什么？你们也知道朝鲜不收垃圾啊😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T02:13:04", "owner": "johnwen198964", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107999773715898, "text": "只能说这校长太sb了，我都能看出习近平很尴尬😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T01:33:52", "owner": "rozierdonalddonald", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948468951934568, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-10T01:31:12", "owner": "bv_players.ofc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925600060188465, "text": "脑残行为，不懂为什么要搞将军这一套", "created_at": "2025-12-10T00:25:01", "owner": "cxk4178", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086410706010777, "text": "能见到两国总统谁不高兴？我要是有这个机会我也这样", "created_at": "2025-12-09T23:04:58", "owner": "peilin287", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850196743605209, "text": "只要钱给够，就可以～", "created_at": "2025-12-09T22:23:39", "owner": "yuguanghei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989330826906492, "text": "👍🏻👍🏻", "created_at": "2025-12-09T20:23:58", "owner": "zildaferreira1159", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931179580012211, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-09T20:20:24", "owner": "yanxiaof7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070655393080339, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-09T19:49:45", "owner": "7.zip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869738827411314, "text": "将军：你会爱上这种感觉的", "created_at": "2025-12-09T19:46:31", "owner": "9am905", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079632848243326, "text": "这居然是马克龙本人😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T19:25:50", "owner": "zhinengyong5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951281962047868, "text": "北朝鲜🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-09T19:13:11", "owner": "yao2223735", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937594762102215, "text": "不是，我服了", "created_at": "2025-12-09T18:46:11", "owner": "bsjjsjssn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864767254449475, "text": "\"Dear French President Macron, you're visiting China. For the sake of the Chinese people and animals, the friendly relations between China and France, and the future of the world, please tell President Xi Jinping to enact animal protection laws in China!\"", "created_at": "2025-12-09T18:18:32", "owner": "cadmium86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852458605596722, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T17:33:49", "owner": "cari5959", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994410396851327, "text": "Vous voulez pas le gardé?", "created_at": "2025-12-09T17:08:36", "owner": "user33dxb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18416016667142934, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-09T17:01:21", "owner": "3345678_diu_ni_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923687434049369, "text": "🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:27:20", "owner": "jack428112", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031883915548422, "text": "🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳❤️👏", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:01:53", "owner": "1736854051qq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086278988069948, "text": "Mr bean?", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:42:55", "owner": "hh0930_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008713643653965, "text": "🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:17:38", "owner": "wewe94we", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547764781061526, "text": "你若三冬来，还我一身雪白", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:00:52", "owner": "huaxiaodongh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925035982192078, "text": "太恐怖了", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:39:22", "owner": "bbqhong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937567233980324, "text": "🇰🇵🇨🇳👏❤️😍", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:29:36", "owner": "travisxu2007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099557662693880, "text": "不是咋搞的像朝鲜一样，我嘞个豆", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:34:27", "owner": "bc666506", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969061623994129, "text": "C'est super étrange de poster des enfants forcés de le soutenir", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:33:40", "owner": "_tartalognon_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072143699603290, "text": "🇰🇵🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:30:06", "owner": "zhuanye5519", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080262346901904, "text": "马克隆在成都都夹道欢迎😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:19:04", "owner": "junjun54188", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939398542106208, "text": "共匪真是賤", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:52:21", "owner": "ccpisshit123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852917191553997, "text": "matrix.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:40:19", "owner": "cinenuts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986994372755956, "text": "👏👏❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:27:27", "owner": "sen_akupuntur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973148106970007, "text": "Pourquoi n'amenez-vous pas Mbappé en Chine pour une visite d'État et un échange sur le football ?", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:27:10", "owner": "certainlygsuw", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17959434425881063, "text": "那你也没说有没有案例呀", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:24:03", "owner": "18923212q", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080083090922445, "text": "真係有啲似北韓", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:45:45", "owner": "tszwahfong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898414789346328, "text": "🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:36:30", "owner": "joshua_yip_123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097253161841145, "text": "Coglione?", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:28:33", "owner": "mazza_.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898037239199860, "text": "🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:25:52", "owner": "hanniwuwu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074668361366364, "text": "Npc😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:24:20", "owner": "shunshanlu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338743627236643, "text": "🖐🏻😭🖐🏻🖐🏻😭🖐🏻🖐🏻😭🖐🏻🖐🏻😭🖐🏻🖐🏻😭🖐🏻", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:12:17", "owner": "dismas0416", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920234662084250, "text": "🇰🇵👏🇨🇳😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T10:52:10", "owner": "tiangesi7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083734280039224, "text": "马克龙也想当金将军了", "created_at": "2025-12-09T10:49:22", "owner": "ookokkkokok569", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106298668652974, "text": "鸭绿江双雄不是白叫的🙏🙏🙏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-09T10:37:38", "owner": "muziyue.yyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865791586515594, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-09T09:42:33", "owner": "ojirooo_046", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073391975049862, "text": "也是排练的", "created_at": "2025-12-09T09:04:29", "owner": "zhengwenjie3496", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136604746481897, "text": "这欢迎仪式太离谱了吧，给恩哥搞点就算了，Macron也好这口？话说虐待动物又是啥事儿", "created_at": "2025-12-09T08:48:20", "owner": "terry57182", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076124912192590, "text": "Though the France prim minister is having a good time... as a Chinese person I feel like using a greeting like this makes china a bit too... 🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-09T08:28:32", "owner": "williamliu20111130", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920152810212113, "text": "🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-09T06:57:34", "owner": "luhefu11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029914394750366, "text": "煞笔吧，我以为只会发生在朝鲜，愈发地倒退了", "created_at": "2025-12-09T06:57:21", "owner": "zhanghan_0206", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903483766320167, "text": "🇰🇵🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-09T06:30:07", "owner": "chri.dgue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087359045006161, "text": "666", "created_at": "2025-12-09T05:52:47", "owner": "pcpc0630", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049131599677994, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-09T05:22:35", "owner": "farzonafoodblog", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147464179437626, "text": "this ain't north k, right", "created_at": "2025-12-09T05:11:53", "owner": "browgamesstronger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927419740155625, "text": "🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵👏❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-09T05:02:02", "owner": "erezzz_hinthluni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064117733564648, "text": "Is there North korean?", "created_at": "2025-12-09T03:55:06", "owner": "hsw84256", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954973411044008, "text": "癫趴👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-09T03:25:53", "owner": "solomony_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296462572274243, "text": "朝鲜🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T03:03:10", "owner": "zhenyu7838", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953312776025132, "text": "…", "created_at": "2025-12-09T02:45:56", "owner": "ceyootmr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912173068255629, "text": "🇰🇵👏👏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-09T02:21:04", "owner": "max0507may", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003560846681604, "text": "🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-09T02:20:58", "owner": "max0507may", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918136222218720, "text": "鴨綠江雙雄之大哥，中國獨裁熊", "created_at": "2025-12-09T02:10:01", "owner": "heying.deng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090269701766059, "text": "Poor kids 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T01:57:30", "owner": "amyzang123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352511809164470, "text": "💙", "created_at": "2025-12-09T01:51:55", "owner": "arditemerllahu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087395395963010, "text": "🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-09T00:59:07", "owner": "qingsong2023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925305001191506, "text": "这种俗套的欢迎仪式……其实安排一对孩子送花就行😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T00:43:08", "owner": "luciano8090", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050266247689469, "text": "\\o/ \\o/ \\o/ \\o/ \\o/ \\o/ \\o/ \\o/ \\o/ \\o/ \\o/", "created_at": "2025-12-09T00:35:02", "owner": "wx041228", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099666454765215, "text": "Dear sir please help my country Cambodia 🇰🇭 need a real peace Thailand 🇹🇭 is starting the war again and again😭😭 have a lot of peoples died. I have a lot of baby just seven month two year five year and seven year old. Please help my country 🙏🙏 please help my country is so poor", "created_at": "2025-12-09T00:27:51", "owner": "somineasek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543735673030569, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-08T23:42:11", "owner": "paramecium233", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934808356109451, "text": "What’s the difference with North Korea🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-08T23:29:35", "owner": "alvis.lam_0408", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086584631083918, "text": "他们在说什么？我爱朝鲜？😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T23:12:14", "owner": "hxpd1110", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048860663428400, "text": "Are you proud? 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T22:21:19", "owner": "andy_fieri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156315346415666, "text": "‏‎May Allah forgive me and my parents and the believers male and female the living from among them and those who have passed away‎", "created_at": "2025-12-08T21:54:35", "owner": "ryj1622", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954999526041666, "text": "Well brainwashed education from the juniors...😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T21:54:15", "owner": "lunchiehlee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137129365421983, "text": "VIVA  LE  FRANCE  REALISER  lIMPOSSIBLE  MARIE  CURRIE", "created_at": "2025-12-08T21:32:25", "owner": "richardjarrett4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18309843811301730, "text": "🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-08T21:31:19", "owner": "v1ncem28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18403681453125227, "text": "VIVA  LE  FRANCE,", "created_at": "2025-12-08T21:30:53", "owner": "richardjarrett4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842084386656830, "text": "🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-08T21:18:22", "owner": "qwe102938374756qwe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031301471547831, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🇫🇷🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-08T20:30:26", "owner": "21_mustafa_26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917576014236651, "text": "‼️LEAVE AFRICA ALONE 🇬🇼🇧🇯‼️", "created_at": "2025-12-08T20:29:49", "owner": "pavelvieira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950981217915221, "text": "卧槽大陆人表示我一点都不喜欢这个😟", "created_at": "2025-12-08T20:28:31", "owner": "frantzll0499", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869460637496038, "text": "西朝鲜，达成", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:08:37", "owner": "tomorrowstomatos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046773497474128, "text": "🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷❤️❤️🇨🇳🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-08T18:41:59", "owner": "team_axeel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080520446130793, "text": "这种上个世纪遗传下来的场面 每次看到都会令人恶心发呕", "created_at": "2025-12-08T18:04:14", "owner": "mmk960123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900688570183425, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-08T17:57:48", "owner": "ak4972582", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048015620460811, "text": "我曹，我以为是朝鲜呢", "created_at": "2025-12-08T17:48:59", "owner": "lincoln110511", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861672355476728, "text": "May God protect great France, may God protect the great French people, and may God protect President Macron.🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-08T17:41:00", "owner": "alhmr9053", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089619154946792, "text": "1084056023Or via the Zangi app. Thank you very much to all of you.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T17:40:34", "owner": "alhmr9053", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870366877472631, "text": "I have been here for three years looking for someone to help me get out of my country Yemen because I am poor and I do not have money. I did not find someone to help me get out of my country. I am a young man who has passed the stage of despair. I do not know how to surrender. I surrender to weak people.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T17:40:29", "owner": "alhmr9053", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069645530096387, "text": "I am a single young man, born in 1993. I want to get married, I want to settle down, I want to start a family, I want to work, I want to learn the English language, I want to help my family in Yemen to make a living. This is what I have been planning to do for three years, but unfortunately...", "created_at": "2025-12-08T17:40:19", "owner": "alhmr9053", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052359479660538, "text": "I want to leave my country, Yemen, sir, because of the war in Yemen and the economic conditions are difficult. I am a 29-year-old young man. I cannot get married because of the economic conditions and war in my country. My dream is to leave my country, Yemen, and learn the English language, but unfortunately I am poor and do not have money, sir. I want to find someone to help me, and when I arrive, I will work. \nAnd return the money he lost for me. I am not looking for money. I am looking for someone to help me get out of my country, sir. This is my dream.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T17:40:14", "owner": "alhmr9053", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972816012975652, "text": "I am Osama from Yemen. My dream is to learn the English language directly on the ground in Europe or America. My dream is for a family to send me an entry visa from Europe or America in an official way and I will pay money for my stay with them. I will work for that and learn the language. I am a poor citizen and if a family wants money \nIn exchange for this, I will pay when I travel for all the losses he incurred, provided that he sends the invitation and it is reviewed by the lawyer", "created_at": "2025-12-08T17:40:09", "owner": "alhmr9053", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957369009891962, "text": "😂😂😂孩子们都累了吧", "created_at": "2025-12-08T17:38:06", "owner": "piscacisca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859124119559098, "text": "🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-08T17:27:13", "owner": "hb10hsu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895127770359810, "text": "The people of Taiwan Province are really brainwashed too badly.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T17:17:25", "owner": "zxcasd0071", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100455139796663, "text": "死共產國家 真悲哀", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:59:55", "owner": "mingchen002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062266949541435, "text": "只有我聽成“壞將軍”嗎", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:53:41", "owner": "ztwc07060919", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18166518592381217, "text": "大哥你发这个干啥", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:43:07", "owner": "mimipa99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331102420209518, "text": "ai做的", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:40:43", "owner": "zimo1618", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074698910010377, "text": "欢迎", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:04:43", "owner": "attat9766", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082832896881083, "text": "……", "created_at": "2025-12-08T15:56:18", "owner": "yahooo0911", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086848568490912, "text": "Macron est terrible...", "created_at": "2025-12-08T15:29:14", "owner": "matt_vslk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089220403945278, "text": "🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-08T15:22:20", "owner": "chenyian091557", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110801641612862, "text": "感谢大家支持🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-08T15:09:18", "owner": "militarychina_reporter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079972294920317, "text": "不要啊🥹怎么学上恩情欢呼了🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-08T15:07:01", "owner": "furno_l_archery", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066058493452489, "text": "独裁者下台😡", "created_at": "2025-12-08T14:43:05", "owner": "huanmeng102", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115642927576337, "text": "可以关注一下著名艺人于朦胧被虐杀事件吗？ Could you take a look at the case involving the torture and killing of the well-known actor Yu Menglong? #yumenglong", "created_at": "2025-12-08T14:39:47", "owner": "wbzdjsmmzu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18157133728407765, "text": "C’est les enfants de qui qu’on prends pour accueillir les présidents je me suis tjr demandé", "created_at": "2025-12-08T14:28:00", "owner": "pr_hazel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008910872819359, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-08T14:21:19", "owner": "james__belanger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856390597570960, "text": "🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-08T14:12:10", "owner": "machia_33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058265693301117, "text": "Bienvenue au Président en Chine", "created_at": "2025-12-08T14:04:10", "owner": "dalomattress", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067250867126472, "text": "🇨🇳=西🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-08T14:02:09", "owner": "jax_kuo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113775739587512, "text": "?", "created_at": "2025-12-08T13:57:14", "owner": "reiko__0000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081281606157725, "text": "🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-08T13:30:15", "owner": "yangjinjiu3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966668826844753, "text": "🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-08T13:12:26", "owner": "naopimale222", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995006025720118, "text": "到平壤了", "created_at": "2025-12-08T13:12:16", "owner": "naopimale222", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071353508594009, "text": "闇の残党", "created_at": "2025-12-08T13:07:47", "owner": "sen.xinghao", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18144158497443485, "text": "これが、共産主義と独裁政治を続けた国か.....", "created_at": "2025-12-08T12:58:01", "owner": "duozhijiandahe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069310802366704, "text": "为什么要当这些话娃儿跳 好好说话不行吗", "created_at": "2025-12-08T12:39:50", "owner": "littlecassieguo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870873232471587, "text": "大家有沒有想過能在這歡迎的都是天龍人😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T12:27:56", "owner": "godwyn_leung531", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160354246404563, "text": "我甚至怀疑这是ai", "created_at": "2025-12-08T12:22:41", "owner": "youada", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079678427179499, "text": "\\o/🇰🇵\\o/\\o/\\o/\\o/\\o/\\o/\\o/🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-08T12:21:19", "owner": "bowenlyus117", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18389420437176459, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-08T12:09:37", "owner": "marutsimgh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928537819149532, "text": "鸭绿江双雄", "created_at": "2025-12-08T11:59:36", "owner": "yyangshengl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074271395520363, "text": "器官真親切😍👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-08T11:54:06", "owner": "chenchenzuoxuan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087243502821635, "text": "詭異的像ai", "created_at": "2025-12-08T11:45:37", "owner": "ischl0e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851136463563995, "text": "🇰🇵🇰🇵😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T11:39:52", "owner": "foreverone__st", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106582033715511, "text": "果然苏系都挺抽象的😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T11:39:19", "owner": "foreverone__st", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17951403722917910, "text": "AI?🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-08T11:37:37", "owner": "6sixninenine99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901223599182315, "text": "唉🤦", "created_at": "2025-12-08T11:35:58", "owner": "cuijialin75", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062732228234697, "text": "ウイグル、チベット、南モンゴル、台湾に平和を🕊️🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-08T11:33:05", "owner": "jmmz70", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17842000098659080, "text": "acting class", "created_at": "2025-12-08T11:16:23", "owner": "cwingl13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881185078325698, "text": "这我还以为是朝鲜", "created_at": "2025-12-08T11:05:14", "owner": "tonytony0503", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082321838167846, "text": "🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳其实我去迎接过奥巴马", "created_at": "2025-12-08T10:45:18", "owner": "wormwood_thomas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867760828501061, "text": "What a scene", "created_at": "2025-12-08T10:32:42", "owner": "hsien.ying", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845462464622959, "text": "北朝鮮やん", "created_at": "2025-12-08T10:20:37", "owner": "satoshi19810101", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18144404692446477, "text": "独裁者", "created_at": "2025-12-08T10:20:32", "owner": "busili61", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085191482089900, "text": "국가보안법 폐지된후 대한민국: ---)", "created_at": "2025-12-08T10:14:04", "owner": "gimbagsawang1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996424392854474, "text": "这不就朝鲜吗", "created_at": "2025-12-08T09:43:33", "owner": "lei16.8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951429946060342, "text": "😂👏", "created_at": "2025-12-08T09:30:50", "owner": "masuai5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093362203909227, "text": "🇰🇵😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T09:06:42", "owner": "hidic685", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109671334719146, "text": "He's enjoying this", "created_at": "2025-12-08T08:59:29", "owner": "noonyjufee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916556551089450, "text": "그 두나라가 만났다ㄷㄷ;;", "created_at": "2025-12-08T08:59:28", "owner": "ljh0011_6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886680118281831, "text": "比北朝鲜还热烈😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T08:28:27", "owner": "tianww2015", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104831524736159, "text": "🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-08T08:23:40", "owner": "imnot.bagelsun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061958639230182, "text": "China is teaching it's young generation about common prosperity even with Europe", "created_at": "2025-12-08T08:16:33", "owner": "lord_hilpolith_rothschild", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070893503358865, "text": "Quel enthousiasme non dissimulé. M le Président, cette spontanéité fait chaud au cœur. Avoir autant d’amis qui transmettent autant d’amour, c’est merveilleux !\nGrande et longue vie à notre Président céleste, à notre guide suprême, à notre seigneur de la clairvoyance et de l’empathie, à Macron et ses dix mille noms 🎉🎉🎉", "created_at": "2025-12-08T08:06:03", "owner": "maxenceducellier", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17981832491776214, "text": "第一眼看成朝鲜", "created_at": "2025-12-08T07:34:03", "owner": "a521.418", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059798816275673, "text": "🇰🇵：？", "created_at": "2025-12-08T07:29:42", "owner": "fnsmile321_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049804496410926, "text": "…中國現在怎麼和朝鮮一樣虛偽了，學會演戲了", "created_at": "2025-12-08T07:23:49", "owner": "oldwan.whf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930536914119998, "text": "🇨🇳=🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-08T07:21:05", "owner": "sujit.asan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073902302353427, "text": "这些儿童的欢呼是一个败笔", "created_at": "2025-12-08T07:19:23", "owner": "zsz3544", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062946413221963, "text": "🗣🔥🔥🔥 VALLANSE VALLANSR", "created_at": "2025-12-08T07:16:19", "owner": "lorenzo_gods", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865416385524620, "text": "@itsbabeiris 吓死我了", "created_at": "2025-12-08T07:02:51", "owner": "sakurasoooy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105028222710497, "text": "Ptdr y'a que des 🇨🇳🇰🇵 dans les com ou quoi", "created_at": "2025-12-08T07:00:45", "owner": "jerem_.ps", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086790370817896, "text": "迫真的演技", "created_at": "2025-12-08T06:34:23", "owner": "jerryking0706", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943432027094223, "text": "普通人的孩子进不来！投胎是个技术活😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T06:26:14", "owner": "chnxie7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096174724865106, "text": "1979年中国副总理邓小平访问美国时，卡特总统特意安排美国小朋友合唱《我爱北京天安门》这首歌颂毛主席的歌曲。", "created_at": "2025-12-08T06:21:10", "owner": "tan_tan_tanminator", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986095086869140, "text": "🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-08T06:11:10", "owner": "neoneoneoneoneo_neo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154775698373517, "text": "原來人民可以不罷工嗎…", "created_at": "2025-12-08T05:35:48", "owner": "hypocrisy_yen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122468041532524, "text": "这…很难评好吗！", "created_at": "2025-12-08T05:02:07", "owner": "tyytvto_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066368309150805, "text": "いっぱいアンチに聞こえる", "created_at": "2025-12-08T04:10:39", "owner": "yuta1_352", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140849512455282, "text": "🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-08T03:57:14", "owner": "freddyshi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115001002511717, "text": "un président très populaire 😍👏🏻", "created_at": "2025-12-08T03:50:06", "owner": "bensomersetberkeley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908280547272810, "text": "子供にこんなことやらせんなよ", "created_at": "2025-12-08T03:37:51", "owner": "wagi8222", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17844614358628597, "text": "你从丹东来～", "created_at": "2025-12-08T03:35:43", "owner": "royal_young7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118770958559385, "text": "✋😭🤚✋😭🤚✋😭🤚✋😭🤚", "created_at": "2025-12-08T03:15:28", "owner": "g3p3q0j6m.2151078", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18506389537068612, "text": "🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-08T03:12:21", "owner": "wangyaoguo1234567", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164726329385138, "text": "封建大屎坑", "created_at": "2025-12-08T02:53:35", "owner": "huangzhan429", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930527203148306, "text": "O melhor presidente do mundo, depois  do Lula ❤️🇫🇷🇧🇷🇧🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-08T02:33:26", "owner": "anderson.inlive", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045467921702005, "text": "🇫🇷🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-08T02:33:14", "owner": "wenhonghongw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131613469440749, "text": "How much do the kids get paid?", "created_at": "2025-12-08T02:14:11", "owner": "its.mikeyshan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18369677116087394, "text": "这只是金將军的幻想罢了", "created_at": "2025-12-08T02:10:44", "owner": "ilikeitcojin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860270497555621, "text": "个人崇拜!后文革时代的红小将.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T01:55:42", "owner": "2921_good", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072169283365544, "text": "🇨🇳👏🇨🇳👏🇨🇳👏🇫🇷👏🇫🇷👏🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-08T01:48:31", "owner": "samueljackson0130", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130637260499630, "text": "最大的獨裁國家", "created_at": "2025-12-08T01:35:21", "owner": "tsai11.13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090177409756586, "text": "🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵干得漂亮", "created_at": "2025-12-08T01:23:52", "owner": "zhiaizzq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986968509871408, "text": "?", "created_at": "2025-12-08T01:12:00", "owner": "4yuno3o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084256940041073, "text": "我还以为是朝鲜", "created_at": "2025-12-08T01:04:24", "owner": "akinamidnight", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081648767141666, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-08T00:56:53", "owner": "boyi0414", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087522959074492, "text": "当今圣上演都不演了😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T00:53:38", "owner": "yourchinesebrother", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106272256644834, "text": "So miserable #64tiananmen", "created_at": "2025-12-08T00:53:32", "owner": "marchoffortune_leon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078561772964781, "text": "Un homme qui 