:34", "owner": "hiromitobeauty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059744291271048, "text": "🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-07T16:27:14", "owner": "daniel.fang.33886", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18374380534158081, "text": "见笑了", "created_at": "2025-12-07T16:25:57", "owner": "jakewang526", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091391116899712, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T16:24:20", "owner": "sven0259", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868577047490205, "text": "🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-07T16:22:42", "owner": "sven0259", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040661951713451, "text": "哈哈哈，这是朝鲜吧", "created_at": "2025-12-07T16:18:17", "owner": "junren.ma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865534411523956, "text": "this is too much Xi Jinping…", "created_at": "2025-12-07T16:13:51", "owner": "ivan.levc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082904065885899, "text": "这", "created_at": "2025-12-07T16:04:24", "owner": "z.jodyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849395515608384, "text": "评论区的小日本 自己家孩子活得饭都吃不上了还有精力管别人家的猫狗 😂😂2025年最后一个国际笑话 小日本请停止排放核废水停止虐待海洋动物", "created_at": "2025-12-07T16:02:17", "owner": "biye0060", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029747198562170, "text": "想吃廣東菜", "created_at": "2025-12-07T15:54:43", "owner": "albert_xls", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18552061087000049, "text": "最尷尬的，應該是法國總統", "created_at": "2025-12-07T15:18:33", "owner": "provencart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848751559610332, "text": "🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍👍💟💟💟💟💝💝💝💖💖💝💝💝💝💝💝", "created_at": "2025-12-07T15:15:23", "owner": "rulhadifadliwijaya_7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001677422833734, "text": "语言不同", "created_at": "2025-12-07T15:10:44", "owner": "zamyzhaoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020014115792431, "text": "这个真没绷住", "created_at": "2025-12-07T15:01:27", "owner": "wd.71000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099954925740704, "text": "Voilà le Pays qu'il te faut avec un peuple bien plus docile qu'en France !", "created_at": "2025-12-07T14:58:46", "owner": "jean_pierre_loup77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18431408788108538, "text": "怎么没ai提示", "created_at": "2025-12-07T14:58:43", "owner": "dj_pika.q", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065111588172212, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-12-07T14:57:10", "owner": "wajalein", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954682333021575, "text": "🤬", "created_at": "2025-12-07T14:51:37", "owner": "pincalarin2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930630793016796, "text": "🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-07T14:46:32", "owner": "xiaolvhappy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065529497454037, "text": "这他妈跟垃圾朝鲜没有区别", "created_at": "2025-12-07T14:44:04", "owner": "cwlp2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897833320204605, "text": "I thought animal circuses are banned.", "created_at": "2025-12-07T14:31:25", "owner": "mengl.ok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842361202643462, "text": "それぞれ 助けて下さる国や助けたい国や信頼関係あると思います\n感謝をお互い忘れずこらからも優しい世界で手を取り合っていける事を祈っております", "created_at": "2025-12-07T14:27:19", "owner": "zuoyehui2276", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893103238366950, "text": "巴黎公社西又上海公社東", "created_at": "2025-12-07T14:23:09", "owner": "czwf313131dfgh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067086923617725, "text": "CHINA🤡🤡🤡", "created_at": "2025-12-07T14:22:31", "owner": "johnh_hsiao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136077997466305, "text": "這麼多顆習近平的腎臟", "created_at": "2025-12-07T14:17:56", "owner": "tyro702136", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058610297302706, "text": "❤️❤️😍👏❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-07T14:13:59", "owner": "phaesngonnsiithan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085863608051100, "text": "你个臭不要脸的独裁者", "created_at": "2025-12-07T13:55:27", "owner": "nanwang936", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845182660624095, "text": "Glory to Chinese Communist Party and Comrade Chinese people's 🙏🙏🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-07T13:53:52", "owner": "zedongmao678", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140510902460261, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-07T13:47:43", "owner": "fatmhrdayy771", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18340885672229529, "text": "您们笑啥？ 你以为这是普通的孩子？", "created_at": "2025-12-07T13:45:08", "owner": "xuchenghai8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934547161107954, "text": "なんか可愛いそう", "created_at": "2025-12-07T13:44:40", "owner": "jingshangjunshu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928515628154922, "text": "我的妈呀  中国式朝鲜超恐怖", "created_at": "2025-12-07T13:37:49", "owner": "fu_yezheng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066857360143356, "text": "気持ち悪い👎", "created_at": "2025-12-07T13:30:29", "owner": "kithkou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18226533679307690, "text": "他们走喊：欢迎你", "created_at": "2025-12-07T13:25:34", "owner": "jimenyinquan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102816475706962, "text": "😎😎😎", "created_at": "2025-12-07T13:24:41", "owner": "jose_ranmda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848149681587877, "text": "真服了", "created_at": "2025-12-07T13:20:19", "owner": "jay_1990a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891756496379436, "text": "It looks so scary", "created_at": "2025-12-07T13:15:25", "owner": "kolos_one_m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997360281845767, "text": "🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-07T13:14:55", "owner": "su_shengchao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908214613274192, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T13:03:34", "owner": "carsont_generalhk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18552189595062514, "text": "On dirait que l on est en Coree du Nord 🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-07T12:53:41", "owner": "yvesalainfuchs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920017909197410, "text": "Nuke china", "created_at": "2025-12-07T12:52:03", "owner": "miguel171184", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970724853977707, "text": "Free Xinjiang", "created_at": "2025-12-07T12:51:57", "owner": "miguel171184", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096598030883467, "text": "Free Tibet", "created_at": "2025-12-07T12:51:50", "owner": "miguel171184", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083489336318989, "text": "Fck china", "created_at": "2025-12-07T12:51:26", "owner": "miguel171184", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886509070405744, "text": "Propaganda pro Max", "created_at": "2025-12-07T12:50:42", "owner": "neop340", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962837427862604, "text": "刷到这个视频第一眼还以为是朝鲜 再看才发现是自己国家", "created_at": "2025-12-07T12:49:52", "owner": "lishuchen10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18309017602269682, "text": "何してんだマクホン", "created_at": "2025-12-07T12:40:37", "owner": "mountainchristo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950182825060097, "text": "评论区一堆圣母肉都吃不起了，还想来管中国的立法，真的可笑，多看看自己活的什么样吧，别来指点我们中国人，你们不配", "created_at": "2025-12-07T12:34:03", "owner": "wenmo537", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918201820236658, "text": "Gloire à l’omerta Chinoise monsieur le président !! 🇨🇳❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-07T12:27:57", "owner": "bio_25_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542149576050303, "text": "喊什麼，聽不清楚😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T12:23:53", "owner": "wittmann.heinz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18554237113048333, "text": "🇰🇵？", "created_at": "2025-12-07T12:14:58", "owner": "jasonsong2007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002493143687104, "text": "忠诚", "created_at": "2025-12-07T11:55:20", "owner": "huajx9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071284619596957, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T11:44:39", "owner": "cavebobking", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083857205023331, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T11:42:05", "owner": "yichi.zyc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905410141286438, "text": "你从丹东来", "created_at": "2025-12-07T11:41:59", "owner": "aotemandaguaishou38", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065821328412578, "text": "这花是老演员了😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T11:36:54", "owner": "summer290", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891672148382810, "text": "Don’t you really feel ashamed to post this?", "created_at": "2025-12-07T11:33:51", "owner": "yesongwei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055303661336281, "text": "やらせ感半端ねぇ笑👏", "created_at": "2025-12-07T11:32:40", "owner": "masako_kondoh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042000740705758, "text": "你若三冬来换我一城雪白相思风中来", "created_at": "2025-12-07T11:23:15", "owner": "jianshaoshi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906164689141815, "text": "Welcome to China ❤️🇨🇳🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-07T11:11:20", "owner": "scarlett__qu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082221545130466, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-12-07T11:10:37", "owner": "modelodemodavictoria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083679776037659, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T11:09:31", "owner": "national_route_58", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18333477472241662, "text": "这孩子们能穿的再多一些礼貌仪式感一些吗。", "created_at": "2025-12-07T11:03:48", "owner": "vickyangmm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074348324029382, "text": "怎麼跟隔壁金正恩一樣", "created_at": "2025-12-07T11:02:43", "owner": "sho._.yo_1207", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875045071451102, "text": "Is this North Korea?", "created_at": "2025-12-07T10:54:23", "owner": "yhdddnx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959498706882436, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-07T10:52:24", "owner": "sa.ule1747", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855524758577922, "text": "💫💫💫💫✨♥️✨💫💫💫💫🌄🪷🌄🪷🌄🪷🌟🌈🌍🌈🌟🪷🌄🪷🌄🪷🌄🪷🙏🇮🇳🙏🔱✨✨💫✨💫✨☯️☮️🪷☮️🔱💫💫💫💫💫💫💫", "created_at": "2025-12-07T10:51:11", "owner": "psyankush", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062269073215266, "text": "大朝鮮🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-07T10:44:01", "owner": "joih990a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122883160474473, "text": "夸张的形式表现想必马克龙总统来到中国就习惯了", "created_at": "2025-12-07T10:28:31", "owner": "xincao75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000612773837839, "text": "C’est magnifique cette jeunesse qui se mobilise", "created_at": "2025-12-07T10:11:41", "owner": "elia.wizman", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18087943033970483, "text": "やはり社会主義国はバカな国🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-07T09:37:03", "owner": "natukazu0810", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090172690756357, "text": "吵死我的天", "created_at": "2025-12-07T09:27:11", "owner": "frankthetank0915", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065230250628849, "text": "ㅅㅂ", "created_at": "2025-12-07T09:21:30", "owner": "nuhgnod", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975794781952110, "text": "什麼是蛙洋捏？", "created_at": "2025-12-07T09:17:06", "owner": "zheng_.lin_.529", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18186470749349722, "text": "不愧是大朝鲜！👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-07T09:08:30", "owner": "xucha456", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842152777650335, "text": "子供達のやらされている感", "created_at": "2025-12-07T09:08:20", "owner": "fubuyouzi100", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031523804744418, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T08:55:05", "owner": "tr9vxa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17863243044538639, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T08:48:17", "owner": "balganyangnyum140", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846917035615825, "text": "……", "created_at": "2025-12-07T08:35:45", "owner": "lou_ise_gao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881559334425667, "text": "中国は偉大な国です🇨🇳中国万歳🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-07T08:17:18", "owner": "tanukitchen777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908015605278130, "text": "朝鲜吧这是", "created_at": "2025-12-07T07:48:46", "owner": "leijdgsys404", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135497446486708, "text": "國民黨就是要讓它倒\n\n倒了還要讓它死、死到底\n\n「中華民國」沒三小路用\n\n我們一定要用「台灣」這個名字才能走出去‼️‼️‼️\n\n國民黨不倒台灣不會好‼️‼️‼️\n\n邰智源👍👍👍", "created_at": "2025-12-07T07:38:24", "owner": "pachingo1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020049560787633, "text": "马哥在中国待遇真好", "created_at": "2025-12-07T07:36:24", "owner": "danqin1213", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089219870071308, "text": "China without cracking down on animal abusers cannot be considered a developed country.\nPresident Macron, please help for the poor cats in China 👏🏼🐈🤍", "created_at": "2025-12-07T07:19:50", "owner": "bwnydoll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115771177563998, "text": "最朝鲜", "created_at": "2025-12-07T07:13:08", "owner": "styon0", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18066726887137618, "text": "President Macron please impress upon President Xi Jinping the importance of putting in place animal anti-cruelty laws and animal protection laws.  There is a significant on-line animal torture video  industry where abusers act with impunity.  Please help.  Merci.", "created_at": "2025-12-07T07:12:51", "owner": "kaseygirl93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541263760031715, "text": "这视频还是太刻意了，把在四川校园里面和同学跑步的视频放上来会更好", "created_at": "2025-12-07T07:10:51", "owner": "rabitoking", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858210040561146, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T07:01:27", "owner": "tomlynn040714", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18202613677319885, "text": "哇好多可更換的器官阿", "created_at": "2025-12-07T06:54:28", "owner": "7_xnnzy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125580406515774, "text": "Gives off NK vibes.", "created_at": "2025-12-07T06:48:59", "owner": "ben_cpps", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026321765787725, "text": "Dear President Macron\n\nWe are animal-rights activists deeply concerned about ongoing animal cruelty in China. We respectfully urge President Xi Jinping and the relevant authorities to consider introducing animal protection laws to prevent cruelty and improve animal welfare.", "created_at": "2025-12-07T06:46:50", "owner": "baipxx_oo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931963150118760, "text": "看了覺得可憐", "created_at": "2025-12-07T06:44:37", "owner": "maoyouban", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864822949519988, "text": "西朝鮮罢了", "created_at": "2025-12-07T06:41:13", "owner": "213019273ljq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925158409179632, "text": "😦", "created_at": "2025-12-07T06:36:12", "owner": "bite_the_orbit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075459533257979, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T06:33:39", "owner": "peter_.0127", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089332498770712, "text": "50多年了欢迎领导和外宾的方式还是没变过啊😅", "created_at": "2025-12-07T06:20:43", "owner": "jiangekan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18400360243122564, "text": "一群蜂子", "created_at": "2025-12-07T06:19:11", "owner": "rayti.an", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903447328318701, "text": "🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-07T06:15:05", "owner": "nasibullahomar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021649724609162, "text": "🇨🇳❤️🇫🇷🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-07T06:03:27", "owner": "demonslayer_g7_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18412006501138312, "text": "この後、子ども達は、お菓子を貰えるんだよね。\n\nそれを引率者が、ピンハネするんだよね。", "created_at": "2025-12-07T05:49:35", "owner": "ako470", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084528139855477, "text": "Never seen this scene in Chinese local screens. I feel really weird. It just looks like North Korea. 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T05:44:52", "owner": "mason_espresso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068390087123293, "text": "真他妈丢人", "created_at": "2025-12-07T05:36:01", "owner": "lyn1ng210", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090867422498050, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T05:31:57", "owner": "gumin_jae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18277235299304078, "text": "show the best welcome is always Chinese tradition. every country is our friend.", "created_at": "2025-12-07T05:29:42", "owner": "shang0711", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18550056379040876, "text": "但凡少喊一聲都得死", "created_at": "2025-12-07T05:25:39", "owner": "xuanchenhou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850082659604202, "text": "🇨🇳=垃圾", "created_at": "2025-12-07T05:17:20", "owner": "fucking_69king", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171476653374196, "text": "朝鲜", "created_at": "2025-12-07T05:16:49", "owner": "zhangheng1362", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070862723458987, "text": "sb", "created_at": "2025-12-07T05:16:35", "owner": "wangzehao8829", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935213059103519, "text": "好多土锤香港穷逼", "created_at": "2025-12-07T05:08:10", "owner": "muriel1225", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544520869065071, "text": "✋😭🤚", "created_at": "2025-12-07T05:06:41", "owner": "ou_0104", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18369770122087214, "text": "Welcome to china", "created_at": "2025-12-07T04:29:49", "owner": "hjrbearingfactory", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084528173043355, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈，我一个中国人都觉得这是朝鲜@哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-12-07T04:12:40", "owner": "michk_fh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066645497616866, "text": "马克龙看到评论里的这些小丑🤡，妖魔鬼怪都怕是要惊！哈哈，这些西方愚民，真怪不得你们现在以后会过得越来越惨！保持这样挺好的", "created_at": "2025-12-07T04:00:37", "owner": "isis05122024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18178384711363840, "text": "Vive la France!🇫🇷❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-07T03:57:37", "owner": "kenn_17336", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090612344494941, "text": "@angymao.mao idk why but i feel like u need this", "created_at": "2025-12-07T03:52:32", "owner": "samuelwwnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958839060882431, "text": "@luuijaxn", "created_at": "2025-12-07T03:28:12", "owner": "hfyc7890", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18150877801426790, "text": "Welcome to China all the time ❤️🇨🇳🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-07T03:26:34", "owner": "mi_hkeugene", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352366333205418, "text": "你们觉得假的看一下四川大学那帮大朋友已经要把马克龙挤扁了。。背面看觉得夸张。其实正面视角看小朋友真的会开心。", "created_at": "2025-12-07T03:11:28", "owner": "bravecloud120", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085936247106387, "text": "so many japanese bots down here, hope yall speak up about 731 and stop worshiping those criminals", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:56:42", "owner": "yuzh.shao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086535578073159, "text": "别整的和朝鲜一样好吗😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:50:32", "owner": "ruacooncattery", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910899052266540, "text": "🇨🇳🇨🇳🇫🇷🇨🇳🇫🇷🇫🇷🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:44:39", "owner": "lulooolilsz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18429827269108142, "text": "この子供時給いくらだろう？笑", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:44:26", "owner": "t__k__tk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973028331816204, "text": "哈哈 跟朝鲜一模一样", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:42:47", "owner": "gyaltsering", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120230113553688, "text": "北朝鮮かよ。w", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:42:39", "owner": "kaichou3365", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147311830435713, "text": "🇰🇵式统一机械师标准", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:38:28", "owner": "gooddream_haha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988076190873730, "text": "Lol", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:16:20", "owner": "ivanssmirnoff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072688688357969, "text": "Tf was that?", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:14:42", "owner": "seba_s.algo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842045269652316, "text": "💀💀💀", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:13:00", "owner": "xiaowei_wil_ins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980142345781867, "text": "#felineguardians", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:08:02", "owner": "tatianescheuermann", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18154104310416059, "text": "Whats happening?", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:04:27", "owner": "joncjan3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083238616896171, "text": "大号朝鲜🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-07T01:53:40", "owner": "damowangzi2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966829368841132, "text": "我賊，好像太陽🌞出來了😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T01:52:34", "owner": "le03.0194", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892250035241169, "text": "まるで北朝鮮やん😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T01:51:02", "owner": "kazz2195", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070419035457278, "text": "鸭绿江双雄的另一个😆", "created_at": "2025-12-07T01:48:12", "owner": "austin_ze6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095235124862124, "text": "真他妈弱智啊 25年了还在让小孩撑牌面", "created_at": "2025-12-07T01:45:05", "owner": "savage_worm98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100431475761899, "text": "神精病一帮", "created_at": "2025-12-07T01:45:00", "owner": "zhiyuan20080528", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074913047244117, "text": "Président français Macron ! Vous êtes en visite en Chine. S’il vous plaît, demandez au président Xi Jinping de promulguer des lois de protection des animaux en Chine, pour le peuple chinois et pour les animaux ! S’il vous plaît, faites-le pour l’avenir de la Chine ! 🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-07T01:27:49", "owner": "alisson_lermen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888578278399514, "text": "🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-07T01:19:23", "owner": "nhanbuif", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069717257096423, "text": "I love jing ping long live supreme leader", "created_at": "2025-12-07T00:46:01", "owner": "www050723", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18497660353074970, "text": "🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-07T00:45:20", "owner": "yileping", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122625160529521, "text": "North Korea?? 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T00:36:14", "owner": "charlemagne_1589", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18371811001154471, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T00:07:32", "owner": "guoyili0717", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853021033547231, "text": "朝鲜小孩一样", "created_at": "2025-12-07T00:05:10", "owner": "_mov15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18548268229022757, "text": "What a celebrity", "created_at": "2025-12-07T00:03:25", "owner": "hidden.hierarchies", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096586861869727, "text": "기괴하다", "created_at": "2025-12-06T23:52:15", "owner": "mombang123456789", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100675690755609, "text": "Gloire éternelle à notre Grand Guide Suprême,\nPère du Peuple Rayonnant,\nGardien Infaillible de la Destinée Nationale,\nArchitecte Sacré de la Voie Pure.\n\nEn ta présence, nos esprits s’élèvent ;\nsous ton regard, nos vies trouvent leur ordre.\n\nNous saluons ta sagesse qui éclaire les générations,\nta détermination qui protège notre terre,\net ta bienveillance qui nourrit nos foyers.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T23:15:54", "owner": "julio.panpan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998459553842897, "text": "Macron sempre se posicionando com elegância e firmeza  por onde passa. Ele encantou a nossa Bahia.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T23:15:04", "owner": "eu.scriptus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042304631497120, "text": "🇰🇵🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-06T23:05:14", "owner": "saint046", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034276670742437, "text": "这谁tm想出来的部分", "created_at": "2025-12-06T23:04:52", "owner": "mr.capjbobo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060031916257496, "text": "🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:47:40", "owner": "yandere6974", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980299965928006, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:41:01", "owner": "lianzhisheng1012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099277030773936, "text": "Reste en Chine !", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:32:28", "owner": "ruben_ds__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980565567783004, "text": "north Korean😍😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:31:13", "owner": "jpwwytutu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048348683427037, "text": "Welcome to North Korea", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:10:49", "owner": "im_wangzining", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18398860132126057, "text": "越来越朝鲜了", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:59:21", "owner": "lucas1321256", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861679036477743, "text": "Macron tu viens quand en belgique", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:44:43", "owner": "its_bigus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293759467302978, "text": "気味悪いやろ", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:33:28", "owner": "mustang2003bk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991065663898285, "text": "Китай самая гостеприимная страна в мире🇨🇳🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:31:19", "owner": "ovv88884", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185436877355902, "text": "Osez aller en Chine pays totalitaire. Une honte", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:22:03", "owner": "michellenoir72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087820345979709, "text": "这个评论区里都是韩国人和台湾人。在造谣大陆。😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:05:42", "owner": "hhhhha4937", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028040585767901, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:04:18", "owner": "444_lil_brox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079812226915583, "text": "下一步是不是要流眼泪了😢", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:04:04", "owner": "zyjiang9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984399531923750, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:57:26", "owner": "viveletridemisme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849752680573193, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:46:24", "owner": "flywithme852", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919298884224162, "text": "North Korea 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:44:33", "owner": "chrisja1992", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18123110809522141, "text": "评论区真的为中国操碎了心了，中国就一个发展中国家，为什么你们这么关心呢？如果要关注弱势国家，那么你们得多去关心关心乌克兰和巴勒斯坦，而不是中国。", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:38:36", "owner": "chenjinghua922", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18248824186291631, "text": "马克龙你好", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:37:16", "owner": "wen199987", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126182146512247, "text": "👏👏👏👏🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:25:25", "owner": "saidaabid93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060200732274509, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:22:32", "owner": "just.in.case_xx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18350150173205476, "text": "please open my private message sir", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:21:51", "owner": "mizansumijan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087619721478231, "text": "please open my private message sir", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:21:49", "owner": "mizansumijan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088142981492575, "text": "please open my private message sir", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:21:46", "owner": "mizansumijan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876692326444601, "text": "mbappe?!?", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:10:05", "owner": "kangyangqaq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18187195330348305, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:08:45", "owner": "mrwhitev2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083178593028077, "text": "よくわかんないけど、何食ってもよくね？美味しいんだったら。", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:06:36", "owner": "aihara1310", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124107562525792, "text": "金正恩から演出教えてもらったの？", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:03:32", "owner": "ma.saki6313", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090675556934512, "text": "What are the saying?", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:00:28", "owner": "nls10.000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972771324971457, "text": "🇫🇷(China in Europe)and 🇨🇳(France in Asia)😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:49:51", "owner": "tttqllq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916032352238805, "text": "Le roi de France au pays du pangolin !,.....", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:48:36", "owner": "jenesuispasunnumero_6", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083596736037996, "text": "有点傻逼啊", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:42:22", "owner": "vireon111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18247686541291215, "text": "马克龙差点以为自己是拿破仑", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:34:36", "owner": "t_ian_xx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049143905428447, "text": "虐待兒童", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:33:03", "owner": "always.drunk.24hr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18384084727147614, "text": "You make children happy, I admire you👏👏👏❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:18:01", "owner": "frida_noyan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997577877748439, "text": "Ne vous laissez pas prendre au jeu de Macron , ici en France il n'est pas du tout apprécié", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:14:06", "owner": "michele.lagrange", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868517308496824, "text": "像朝鲜🇰🇵，😥", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:12:09", "owner": "tianyi3744", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106086268566047, "text": "100 CREDIT CHINA", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:08:32", "owner": "gustavoaugustodiasdarocha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947060326065291, "text": "说实话我个人一开始也不喜欢这种欢迎方式…但是这是中国特色 … 表示是真的很欢迎很热情❤️‍🔥而孩子代表着未来，也寓意着未来我们也希望一直保持友谊长存！ 所以请尊重国家的特色文化。🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:55:35", "owner": "wwwonderfuljemmy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088363115299437, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:53:14", "owner": "p.f.k.doaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952599706044216, "text": "这和朝鲜有什么区别", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:33:49", "owner": "houwenhua0829", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073452716353233, "text": "奴性教育真的太丢脸了", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:20:38", "owner": "emma_guozc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096029602684653, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:15:48", "owner": "mastantuonotokyo2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302086438250244, "text": "Das ist doch nicht mehr normal ! Wegen zwei Staatsherren, die nicht besser sind als alle anderen, so ein Tumult! \nIch mag Emmanuel Macron auch, hatte aber nie die Chance, also die Chance schon, aber nach einem Autounfall nicht die Fähigkeit und das Gebahren, sprich Verhalten, mich derart beliebt zu machen und so erfolgreich zu sein. Will heißen, ich bin behindert und muss diese Scheiße von Sozialtraining machen, nur weil die Gesellschaft es so haben will. Verliere so meinen eigenen Willen, fühle mich total gegängelt und darf nicht mich selbst sein. Muss in ein Wohnheim, darf nicht alleine wohnen und Lohnerwerb habe ich auch keinen. Danke du verdammtes Schwein von Autofahrer und vielen Dank fürs Verständnis du verdammte Scheissschweiz!", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:14:02", "owner": "heidigisler10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18388770265180137, "text": "Nice👏👏🇨🇳🇨🇳🇫🇷🇫🇷😍😍😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:07:52", "owner": "hardeepsingh__22_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18347627185200645, "text": "笑死", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:59:07", "owner": "alice_huajing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101984527684387, "text": "评论区这帮东朝鲜核爆豚都在狂欢什么？", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:57:16", "owner": "dawn1995i", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18438123832098114, "text": "想吃广东菜了", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:50:21", "owner": "xiaosen.7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992943894893316, "text": "換小姐", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:40:35", "owner": "muffleddd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057562736644931, "text": "🖐 🤚\n 😭\n 👔\n 👖\n 👞👞", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:40:09", "owner": "mello_make_it_right", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912742627252117, "text": "以前都不这样，现在彻底变了", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:36:13", "owner": "chinese_deliveryman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050335046688177, "text": "bienvenu a corea d'ouest 🔥🔥👏👏👏😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:35:59", "owner": "wansheen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002799638827437, "text": "Même macron n'a pas mis de description tellement il était gêné...", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:34:52", "owner": "noe_pch76", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302274319270470, "text": "这是在朝鲜吗", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:33:28", "owner": "liruboronaldo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903757045165681, "text": "沒辦法，誰不熱情誰就是習主席的150歲器官", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:24:01", "owner": "qiuchuihe7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152412142419197, "text": "Macron 🐓🐓🐓", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:23:43", "owner": "iosif6015", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981667563925555, "text": "你从法国来 换我一城雪白", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:16:46", "owner": "realkevinzed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871633675469626, "text": "666这是高级黑吗", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:16:01", "owner": "realkevinzed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093768007921127, "text": "别甩抽筋了", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:06:29", "owner": "ha.ci306", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082452986126976, "text": "看不下去了怪不得不放这一幕在内网宣传呢🤣不得被网友喷死了整的跟朝鲜一样", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:04:43", "owner": "cicczt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102587482706526, "text": "🇫🇷🇨🇳❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:04:39", "owner": "_xixi_haha_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097469644876102, "text": "原来日本也有水军，笑死我了，我以为只有国内才有", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:58:26", "owner": "sanye_dre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085890542006317, "text": "Macron va prendre des leçons sur comment industrialisés un pays", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:53:29", "owner": "flo_57660", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080288896916558, "text": "Scary to see children act in something they don't understand", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:40:00", "owner": "sinau.kripto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096123619852471, "text": "@timsaladland @grriezy 还是京腔笑死我了", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:37:24", "owner": "ryanmeng1092", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865189159522180, "text": "朝鲜吗", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:35:07", "owner": "chloe_cyzzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969205872986033, "text": "Shame on u🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:34:59", "owner": "charcoalabc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18174597895375565, "text": "好吵..真的", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:33:29", "owner": "xzlei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088082248807934, "text": "Demissionne Manual , on en peut plus !", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:29:53", "owner": "dream_even_more_oli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036971003709576, "text": "所以法國這次不加入八國聯軍嗎", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:24:46", "owner": "thv_gary", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948866968058972, "text": "Temu workers", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:21:33", "owner": "gae_oba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066167714572229, "text": "Csak őszintén..", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:20:46", "owner": "longwalkwiddaputter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18387548371177029, "text": "The west ‘North Korea ‘😷👍", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:57:48", "owner": "kimi_junqiao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18210050416313651, "text": "馬克宏我對你太失望了", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:55:19", "owner": "ljj_ed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061699457554459, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:51:57", "owner": "kirby__48", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090127540755899, "text": "Ça s'appelle : de la propagande....", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:51:02", "owner": "noutchka60", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18325036720246151, "text": "NB", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:46:37", "owner": "grf2006", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18351135235165254, "text": "笑死了，评论里这群人，怎么不可怜一下萝莉岛的小孩呢😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:42:04", "owner": "kuaisun250", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108853261712145, "text": "You Japanese people committed the Massacre people.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:40:37", "owner": "so_xin020506", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871129447470682, "text": "shut up， you poor man . I don't think you are Chinese.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:39:34", "owner": "so_xin020506", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092264494924841, "text": "should be shame", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:35:34", "owner": "kantouki0628", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842129950646052, "text": "As a Japanese ， you do not know Japan kill dolphins？ what a typical Japanese.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:32:49", "owner": "so_xin020506", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104385796709813, "text": "oh ，What a typical Japanese!", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:30:26", "owner": "so_xin020506", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134271286482796, "text": "花洋錢花洋錢花洋錢花洋錢花洋錢花洋錢花洋錢", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:26:18", "owner": "minawu1110", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18419458003118755, "text": "I thought it was North Korea for a moment", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:26:04", "owner": "satorumemer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947346477940066, "text": "Bro is more popular in China than in France 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:23:31", "owner": "abdul_aziz01054", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073050038360418, "text": "え…www😅", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:22:14", "owner": "mipoopop_11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121956019473852, "text": "艹 这尼玛太唐了😬", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:13:08", "owner": "rxklaus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071772905596336, "text": "朝鲜。", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:09:10", "owner": "lesliesiddddd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135504040490867, "text": "带入", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:06:37", "owner": "smsm886889", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059249927271631, "text": "hhhhhhhhhh🇰🇵基础版😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:02:23", "owner": "bbbbbbvv187", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18322648969174612, "text": "…………….", "created_at": "2025-12-06T14:55:28", "owner": "thunderlaysl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088622932981519, "text": "好丢人", "created_at": "2025-12-06T14:54:58", "owner": "jiajiadmm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975299943955653, "text": "？", "created_at": "2025-12-06T14:54:30", "owner": "katehuang289", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013821794638052, "text": "Macron: It feels so good to be the sun😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T14:53:27", "owner": "lovelysophy1117", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953275054047554, "text": "Kina komuniste", "created_at": "2025-12-06T14:51:43", "owner": "lili2036lili", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979960857938336, "text": "🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌\n😭😭😭😭😭\n 😎", "created_at": "2025-12-06T14:50:31", "owner": "joseph.tang0505", "likes"