}, {"id": 17876765028443703, "text": "These little chigga looks so cute😍", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:53:52", "owner": "twilight.2o4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927540757167041, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:49:49", "owner": "nigo_car_parking", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396330223130392, "text": "法國已經得跟朝鮮共處了", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:44:48", "owner": "nick.chou.969", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18177776758363820, "text": "M le Président, au lieu de ne parler qu’affaires, parler de la torture que la Chine fait aux animaux ! En ne disant rien vous êtes indirectement complice de cette maltraitance ! Arrêtez de fermer les yeux et de penser qu’à l’argent !!", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:44:36", "owner": "aless_0731", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966867756843222, "text": "看见太阳了🌞", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:40:36", "owner": "housheng_li", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17974048679960944, "text": "太搞笑了", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:38:01", "owner": "ianbynn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896313835360272, "text": "😹😹😹", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:33:57", "owner": "xun_.23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892269445242710, "text": "Don't trust China. China is supplying weapons to Russia including gunpowder and artillery and Chinese representatives are involved in weapons production on Russian territory.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:28:47", "owner": "arty_90000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101321401738763, "text": "Will", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:27:27", "owner": "billy_bloooom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953068842912267, "text": "这么多年了还是这样", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:25:56", "owner": "iuuii_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125945875522604, "text": "Wii sports", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:24:30", "owner": "hariny_acnh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021557501607042, "text": "叉出去", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:22:28", "owner": "my_sky_jane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950696157919406, "text": "……我真的不知道说啥了 越来越像了", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:22:21", "owner": "lz_itak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097569463834031, "text": "Quand on brille à l’étranger alors qu’on est le néant dans son propre pays !\nIl est temps que cette mascarade se termine. Vous êtes la honte de la France @emmanuelmacron \n\n2027 ! Vite !!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:19:41", "owner": "juju42240", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080136827131548, "text": "北朝鮮と一緒〜！！笑笑", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:11:49", "owner": "jas0629t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035943020721750, "text": "逐渐朝鲜化😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:11:46", "owner": "outstanding_youth666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035103338720775, "text": "啥年代还搞这个", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:06:02", "owner": "jason_lin5250", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077083069977795, "text": "🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:04:38", "owner": "marinelavallefebvre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102898243676222, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:00:29", "owner": "sonjeonghyeon6919", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910637410257371, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T11:59:32", "owner": "christopher_pjl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064474247624353, "text": "中国实在是太给马克虫面子了，就是这个东西是个扶不起的阿斗，回去后对中国就是另一个态度。", "created_at": "2025-12-06T11:47:31", "owner": "bbls_bbls_bbls", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858815224560531, "text": "评论区真的让我长见识了，世界还是太大了", "created_at": "2025-12-06T11:35:39", "owner": "ea.son5318", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883149166309540, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T11:35:31", "owner": "zengffeng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981225075778956, "text": "🐈✌🤾🏿", "created_at": "2025-12-06T11:34:54", "owner": "mcconnell18199", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097383196879262, "text": "将军的恩情还不完😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T11:12:02", "owner": "cheungyeukyang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18439719448103621, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T11:09:13", "owner": "ju_cu_ji", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155084932409167, "text": "You like the idea?", "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:58:44", "owner": "ma_rk1332", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930001642017572, "text": "Et vous etes fier de montrer une vidéo, où l impression des enfants sont endocriner a secouer des pompoms pour vous souhaiter la bienvenue. Restez en Chine au plus grand bonheur du peuple Français qui bosse, qui galère et a qui vous prenez tout !  Merci de rendre ce service. Vite aux urnes.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:54:58", "owner": "cxrbp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095625751869702, "text": "人権ない、こわい😱", "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:42:25", "owner": "yu.mi.on", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17971031660969422, "text": "🇰🇵北朝鮮と思ってしまった", "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:39:19", "owner": "npo_sawasdee_yamagata", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088051252977639, "text": "❤️🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:27:21", "owner": "mr_serruty_le_francais", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18248860636291926, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:26:28", "owner": "0007.1111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108167992620673, "text": "We can experience the greatest parts of North Korean culture in Beijing👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:18:20", "owner": "nobu.gaoqiao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006279983666564, "text": "马克龙？", "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:17:03", "owner": "niuniu3822", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870929083398044, "text": "역시 유럽의 중국🇫🇷🇫🇷🇨🇳🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:16:43", "owner": "jjijil._.gum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030834911749777, "text": "😭✋🤚😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:13:54", "owner": "yixing.chen2011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086939593817905, "text": "I really don't understand what these brain-damaged Europeans are thinking? You are called to protect animals, but you eat meat yourself, such as steak, snails, etc. Since you love animals so much, why don't you make a law to ban meat in Europe? Let's talk about other countries when Europe has a law banning meat. I don't understand what you brains think. You can't do it yourself and let others do it every day. The double-standard behaviour has become the life label of you brain-damaged Europeans.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:07:49", "owner": "yunwwiwang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158248372364962, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:04:08", "owner": "2541948183hh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915348904250993, "text": "这也只是小孩子这样吧，大人又不这样，朝鲜是大人连带小孩子一样都得双手举高，这个场面都是群小孩子那怎么了？", "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:03:52", "owner": "lilili73563", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18401552536130092, "text": "👏🏻👏🏻👏🏻 👏🏻👏🏻👏🏻 👏🏻👏🏻👏🏻", "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:03:19", "owner": "catalin24brutus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916199983234650, "text": "全て演技❗️", "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:02:51", "owner": "pompommaron", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18551309935047678, "text": "马克龙好享受的样子", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:52:33", "owner": "jianhuashu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005481407821854, "text": "北朝鮮と変わらない笑", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:49:50", "owner": "hayato_45651", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331481458244259, "text": "This video shows how small and immature Emanuel is, and somewhere there we see ,why that problem with older wife", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:37:16", "owner": "martinlovrant", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865848814521520, "text": "NPC", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:34:39", "owner": "vigennn5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002409005834140, "text": "…..这干嘛啊😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:34:19", "owner": "smallplumm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949895545049758, "text": "عروسک خیمه شب بازی", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:28:57", "owner": "ho.dariush", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065820218420086, "text": "✋🏻😭✋🏻✋🏻😭✋🏻", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:27:31", "owner": "andy_hoileung", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084136436107057, "text": "Big north korea🇰🇵＝🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:25:39", "owner": "6zen666", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18105788455726550, "text": "The dictatorial Communist Party is no different from North Korea.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:24:47", "owner": "whaoyu4567", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016449041797325, "text": "マクロンはいつから中国よりになったの？", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:24:24", "owner": "seiitsukudo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100441795695621, "text": "Can't believe ts, ppl on china internet still make fun of north Korea 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:22:53", "owner": "gbx9722", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543954064004149, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:10:55", "owner": "acesdae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064822010180148, "text": "老辈子们的审美能不能改改……一群小孩这样子机械式地欢迎并不可爱……🙃", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:09:49", "owner": "no_bdcare", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930058558155161, "text": "Wishing you a peaceful and beautiful 1st Sunday of Advent, surrounded by loving thoughts. Love to friends and family - Stallone🇮🇹🇺🇲🇫🇷🇨🇳🇺🇦🇹🇷🇩🇪🇮🇪", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:07:31", "owner": "hasankahya4790", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058497431302234, "text": "테크노크라시 방문", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:06:05", "owner": "givonion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945906433082794, "text": "脱糞中国🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-06T08:56:43", "owner": "emawatoworld", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079474247154010, "text": "中国習近平脱糞", "created_at": "2025-12-06T08:56:32", "owner": "emawatoworld", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087472144823136, "text": "唐懵逼了", "created_at": "2025-12-06T08:55:23", "owner": "boom27473828", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917037871216545, "text": "無理やり😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T08:54:44", "owner": "syamu_715", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842018059651311, "text": "妈呀….", "created_at": "2025-12-06T08:53:14", "owner": "chenyuhang.cn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087830413988702, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T08:47:28", "owner": "o__oooeee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17969799860986021, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-06T08:46:57", "owner": "michaelaschneider95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047113571446818, "text": "不用看评论。看了也只是说中国不好。哪国没有没素质的人呢？日本 韩国 美国。全世界。哪没有。都是政治言论。都被洗脑。看不得别人好。", "created_at": "2025-12-06T08:42:04", "owner": "hspringna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981991407930063, "text": "Pauvre homme, lécher les bottes a  ce point est écœurant", "created_at": "2025-12-06T08:31:29", "owner": "1ptibisou", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053512880692389, "text": "Nothing weird 都是表演", "created_at": "2025-12-06T08:28:13", "owner": "airupt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078999382943159, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T0