, "text": "It’s so North Korean", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:29:22", "owner": "liminal.357", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17869262097478946, "text": "🇰🇵🇫🇷🇰🇵🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:25:48", "owner": "oooohamza", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17895034464220221, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:25:26", "owner": "smf2w1t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059267612294398, "text": "@taothanhnemay", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:23:20", "owner": "ghetvatlyvaicut", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911742550257401, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:22:33", "owner": "yun_jun_11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001272515690978, "text": "China: We're hiring temporary actors. 20RMB/Hr. Pay in cash after finish the show🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:21:35", "owner": "jackfkinsunwale", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856245265523338, "text": "北朝鮮みたい", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:18:13", "owner": "yusa210708", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546959401035222, "text": "這是北韓嗎？", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:15:31", "owner": "joewangem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296334514276760, "text": "동중국과 서중국의 만남", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:14:54", "owner": "mont_cle23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935687470106191, "text": "マクロン仏大統領　　　習近平首席に中国に動物保護法並びに動物虐待禁止法の制定をお話いただけますようお願い申し上げます！！", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:12:55", "owner": "ai.yanxia", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18085656554487824, "text": "这是我的国家，我为孩子们感到悲哀。同时也会对围观嘲笑的人说操你妈。你不是想帮我们改变什么，你只是想嘲笑我们。所以我也没必要跟你们这种人客气。321直接开始操你妈就好了", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:12:36", "owner": "sohouhi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882221764422255, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:11:23", "owner": "j.sh4o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087360523821048, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:10:23", "owner": "diephoangchauhao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090584000491654, "text": "一生発展途上国🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:08:54", "owner": "aflo580", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17891314098372032, "text": "傻逼習", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:06:04", "owner": "kai_huhuhu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18190785229337537, "text": "Je suis sûr il aimerais qu’on l’accueil comme ça au fond de lui.. 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:01:08", "owner": "samir_lafg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061486799637636, "text": "Dragon celeste", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:00:33", "owner": "picklemile", "likes": 49}, {"id": 18099652192801762, "text": "Votre enfants mr macrona il est zlayjia", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:58:51", "owner": "taherimarouane1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097165903829130, "text": "\\O/\\O/", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:57:45", "owner": "force_beryllium_zman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905225767295111, "text": "なぜジャンプするのかな？", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:53:11", "owner": "kiki_mochimaru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160532524396597, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:48:43", "owner": "sml_rd", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18091973632912117, "text": "マクロン仏大統領！中国を訪問されていますね。習近平国家主席に、中国国民と動物のために、中国で動物保護法を制定するよう働きかけてください！中国の未来のために、どうか宜しくお願いします！", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:48:22", "owner": "jis_gram", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17849702946574089, "text": "#TAEM", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:45:24", "owner": "vagabonde705040", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081066167517406, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:44:05", "owner": "1944germany", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876001495445402, "text": "一帮傻逼 真的丢人 正常点能死？", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:43:56", "owner": "kaiwenbob28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082706338891246, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:43:23", "owner": "hanamy1127_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972469635814712, "text": "朝鲜的兄弟🤝", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:42:45", "owner": "yingmanji777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883068283420738, "text": "HOWEVER🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:42:12", "owner": "that_emojidude", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18410470174137302, "text": "Monsieur le Président… certains animaux meurent dans la terreur la plus totale, sous les rires et l’indifférence. C’est une blessure pour l’humanité. Merci si vous pouvez aborder ce sujet vital.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:41:10", "owner": "secretly.p", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027076580579840, "text": "Vous pouvez pas le garder", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:38:48", "owner": "protection_francaise", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18523764895071874, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:37:53", "owner": "fettamon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941937400088321, "text": "Npc", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:37:39", "owner": "cobi_buttle7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081655373124502, "text": "Dictators we like", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:35:03", "owner": "simone1926__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844614223612980, "text": "北朝鮮の市民か笑笑", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:32:57", "owner": "bigaim155", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047526260695052, "text": "Who would be happy with such a fake performance? How much did each person pay?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:32:10", "owner": "hello_goodch", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085912235086341, "text": "Smajlandię", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:31:05", "owner": "adof.hi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919540603069597, "text": "🖐️😭🤚🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:30:41", "owner": "you_cheng587", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18120010291479176, "text": "🤢🤢🤢", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:30:19", "owner": "xuanxuanchenq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18388449898180569, "text": "C'est tellement beau 🥰😍🤩🥳❤️💝💖💓💞💕💌💟🇨🇳🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:30:06", "owner": "franck.rigaudiere", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955633990044320, "text": "대한민국을 지키려는 애국자분들 민주당이 국가보안법 폐지하려고 합니다 우린 막아야합니다", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:28:53", "owner": "nimabi7753", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068754599118555, "text": "Npc", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:27:45", "owner": "_mungtain_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116052745565556, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:27:07", "owner": "yogayoga0319", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18169633573339055, "text": "🇰🇵🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:25:05", "owner": "qaq._.0202", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863663071457271, "text": "✋😭🤚✋😭🤚✋😭🤚✋😭🤚", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:23:39", "owner": "yuan_yu_z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868545076497158, "text": "Dear French President Macron, you're visiting China. For the sake of the Chinese people and animals, the friendly relations between China and France, and the future of the world, please tell President Xi Jinping to enact animal protection laws in China!", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:21:00", "owner": "snowyplover21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096902458877315, "text": "🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:20:45", "owner": "nanaloky_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119741095556470, "text": "문현빈~ 문현빈~ 문현빈~ 문현빈", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:19:57", "owner": "jaechul327", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100350667761427, "text": "Kids having a day off from TEMU😍", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:15:19", "owner": "laser_doge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985729599917239, "text": "習：新鮮的心肝脾肺腎，挑哪個十年養成好呢？🧐", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:14:05", "owner": "yida_0310", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867055312507965, "text": "Vi nos comentários sobre animais, meu Deus cuide dos animais", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:13:51", "owner": "penhapintoandrade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889157761261828, "text": "🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:13:40", "owner": "cyc_614diogojota", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052414586345853, "text": "French President Macron is visiting China and meeting with Chinese President Xi Jinping. \nPlease leave a comment on his two posts! \nPeople in China are reading them too.\nYou can comment in your own language, but you can also comment in French or Chinese.\nFor example,\n\"Dear French President Macron, you're visiting China. For the sake of the Chinese people and animals, the friendly relations between China and France, and the future of the world, please tell President Xi Jinping to enact animal protection laws in China!\"", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:11:04", "owner": "kimberly.iris80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024165644597965, "text": "I can't stand these people in the comments thinking this is funny. This is serious they are literally hurting those poor animals at China n everyone there is going on abiut there day while these poor animals are dying as I speak now. This is seriously hert breaking I canjust feel there pain right now I cant even sleep. And now thinking abiut all these things it just hurting me more. Do something abiut the laws China.. those animals don't DESERVE  this treatment.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:10:48", "owner": "kimberly.iris80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050701733390187, "text": "说实话 有点吵😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:09:25", "owner": "luluyao1230", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107107414729904, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:05:28", "owner": "ting_wen0109_87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006084347665147, "text": "ber, 没有稍微体面点的么？", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:05:07", "owner": "changshiban13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18201331756319579, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:01:26", "owner": "maxyip0509", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074652002588558, "text": "Love", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:00:54", "owner": "abdul.halim.531379", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085058222283094, "text": "独裁国家でよく見る光景。", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:59:59", "owner": "jrs191satoshi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060492407544842, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:59:56", "owner": "piranaviss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114441805604260, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:59:54", "owner": "piranaviss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867078061501645, "text": "Gênant", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:59:50", "owner": "davidjumble", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18356558791161551, "text": "💀💀💀", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:59:14", "owner": "malone__cros", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088381666971197, "text": "朝鲜", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:58:41", "owner": "schneidereit1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118636780494404, "text": "假的一批", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:58:14", "owner": "35805086l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899032213194063, "text": "乖柚子～ 乖柚子～ 乖柚子～", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:58:11", "owner": "skyisblueandbig", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049973540409450, "text": "🇫🇷🇫🇷🇨🇳🇨🇳❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:55:10", "owner": "cengxinqing99", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18066205865395862, "text": "荣耀归于您，伟大的马克龙总统 🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:54:13", "owner": "arthur_nck", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18048766274429077, "text": "I am extremely lucky  coz was not born in China.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:51:36", "owner": "06020823kmka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042537632497554, "text": "与巴比伦合淫的马克龙", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:50:34", "owner": "chenlingwei201603", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085597982005479, "text": "I hope that someday we will be in a world where both humans and animals can live peacefully and safely.\nAnd I hope for a happy future for the President and everyone in the comments section.\nI love France.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:49:23", "owner": "makibluerose", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18035028776745911, "text": "第一眼还以为是北棒呢😭", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:49:19", "owner": "fhz0506", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367865752084521, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:49:18", "owner": "230697jason", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979009032938296, "text": "Fais attention des propagandes dans les commentaires, they can be paid for doing anything 😓", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:48:04", "owner": "fei_encelade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18386681035179937, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:47:54", "owner": "joyyyrichme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090450049944354, "text": "朝鲜🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:47:06", "owner": "weigui124", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955036011904403, "text": "🇨🇳🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:45:28", "owner": "eliotdepins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147933604427498, "text": "我不说你是不是中国人了，你但凡是个正常的人类都觉得恶心，这才是真正的君主立宪制😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:44:59", "owner": "spikespiegel1025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955000587898755, "text": "我们中国欢迎全世界的朋友到中国旅游，去认识真正的中国🇨🇳. Bienvenue Emmanuel", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:44:06", "owner": "tbsjak12345", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17903539992314062, "text": "民主主義の国に産まれてよかった", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:42:42", "owner": "p.p.p67ryota", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932188117135095, "text": "形式很朝鲜，生活却是自由和资本主义，别纠结了，中国人民过得很好", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:42:03", "owner": "ki21863701", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052650233659927, "text": "Where did you get the actors", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:38:39", "owner": "ohedqvist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065481989154089, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:34:05", "owner": "cristian_herrera_1020", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095471953860824, "text": "凱旋門賞は諦めようこんな国に日本馬出せないよ危険過ぎる", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:31:30", "owner": "aqours3710", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970834302986799, "text": "Dear French President Macron, you're visiting China. For the sake of the Chinese people and animals, the friendly relations between China and France, and the future of the world, please tell President Xi Jinping to enact animal protection laws in China! Terrible, heart-breaking torture videos are being made and shared online for the whole world to see, including children. These adult torturers are also, obviously, a danger to humans, too. It is in humans’ interest, too, that they be stopped. Thank you!", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:31:21", "owner": "david.6.2.8", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18033765665526569, "text": "いやいや動物愛護とか人間のエゴだから犬でも猫でも食べていいよ笑", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:30:20", "owner": "iam_just_kai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052644986366925, "text": "Now go back to your factory", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:29:32", "owner": "aaaarthur_m", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18105771319734839, "text": "我喜欢中华人民共和国🇨🇳🇨🇳❤️❤️🥰🥰🥰😍😍😍（la lea chinois n’aura pas servi à rien 👊☝️)", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:28:28", "owner": "ami_llee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541453678028468, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:28:23", "owner": "_joydeep9o_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880490194333229, "text": "這是北韓領導嗎？", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:26:42", "owner": "zo14087", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013238816807238, "text": "Qui a mit le feu a Notre Dame?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:26:36", "owner": "nr22.69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849288706576438, "text": "🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:25:00", "owner": "zhanghuiran93552", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931337281118204, "text": "聽半天才聽懂在喊什麼", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:24:26", "owner": "hsiuchi_314", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960004045008341, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:23:48", "owner": "hinbimabro", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17966234873847413, "text": "🇮🇳+🇰🇵=🇨🇳😍", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:23:14", "owner": "kannachi.world", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068555453377755, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:22:29", "owner": "catface012", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079970429179402, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:22:25", "owner": "listowski87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085684991047497, "text": "🖐😭🖐", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:19:09", "owner": "dub.0524", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095144914856263, "text": "@noctal_fr", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:13:33", "owner": "gitting_gud", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132148234495966, "text": "✋😭🤚", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:12:28", "owner": "you_are_the_first_one", "likes": 19}, {"id": 17930955420151549, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:11:43", "owner": "lqx_cg5u3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032116997749978, "text": "ewwwww", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:11:28", "owner": "q1n_n1q", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067262003133944, "text": "🇯🇵🇯🇵🇯🇵🇯🇵👎👎👎👎", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:11:25", "owner": "lint.c1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17922630009199068, "text": "Wii npc", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:11:18", "owner": "kirovistok", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18143401492457010, "text": "북한이냐 ㅋㅋ😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:08:49", "owner": "miguel_choi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978606945938178, "text": "臨時演員都是演員啊！跳完每人攞一個飯盒！", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:06:39", "owner": "miyukishimabukuro315", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897265861350744, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:03:08", "owner": "shouki_0719", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086196062064689, "text": "Aller l’OM 💙🤍", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:00:01", "owner": "victxr.li", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986258493872652, "text": "@ck266r", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:59:50", "owner": "jason_6253552", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987961092866588, "text": "جوووون کاکا شاه میخواد تو گرگ بیابانش شی....مترسک رو باد ببره و خاشاک خاک روز", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:53:06", "owner": "8197_h_j.k.k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946753261065107, "text": "Welcome to North Korea 🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:52:52", "owner": "jkback_182", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073464215363946, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:51:05", "owner": "huvnnnguyn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849648397605810, "text": "北朝鮮🇰🇵やな", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:48:52", "owner": "golkichi7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176341684363917, "text": "丢人", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:45:52", "owner": "yul737", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963930693851611, "text": "共産主義国家", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:43:37", "owner": "moca161cm47kg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026231297772287, "text": "独裁国家\n北朝鮮と区別がつかない", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:43:36", "owner": "tomoyan.0507", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991967157902498, "text": "Il est plus habitué à ça en France mdr", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:41:26", "owner": "clyde.hd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114431536573462, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:40:36", "owner": "woesel.tenzin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919783726084781, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:40:20", "owner": "woesel.tenzin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914773528241540, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:40:12", "owner": "woesel.tenzin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994536498713174, "text": "Stop and he'll shoot ya", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:40:09", "owner": "ccgb4455", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074993519214075, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:40:06", "owner": "woesel.tenzin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087358333989740, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:39:58", "owner": "woesel.tenzin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047933204453155, "text": "除了热烈欢迎的意思 还有什么特殊的寓意吗", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:39:54", "owner": "huiliu7198", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082893601892050, "text": "Is this in North Korea?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:37:07", "owner": "cchien_3_24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937588024100174, "text": "🇹🇼🤝🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:37:04", "owner": "beetles.chiayi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17937202805980558, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:36:57", "owner": "asian_in_norway", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081966785134246, "text": "@gagarighthere ？", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:33:17", "owner": "hellojade0320", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076791377238324, "text": "因为中国牛马多！资本家喜欢压榨员工。全年无休，加班没有加班费，扣罚工资都是很普遍的现象！底层人民只能活的像动物一样一辈子辛苦😓", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:31:32", "owner": "feng_qiyunyong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941184777963692, "text": "大朝鮮", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:31:22", "owner": "angelsigh0618", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994194021894146, "text": "🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:30:16", "owner": "hamahui37", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058821281291982, "text": "@ccpxi_8964 主席好性感啊", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:28:08", "owner": "vtsh_baseball.69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918556186211011, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:28:08", "owner": "hnmhntn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989164095880650, "text": "主席好性感啊", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:27:47", "owner": "vtsh_baseball.69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067158161130631, "text": "😏", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:27:45", "owner": "tony.tai66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874991584451765, "text": "Superbe 💐", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:26:38", "owner": "yonehala.official4100", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860551393551128, "text": "一定要弄些小孩这样吗", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:25:37", "owner": "xavier__lyx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903155029316151, "text": "🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:25:30", "owner": "albertinabisavo", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18076378559189268, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:23:31", "owner": "_samansoheili_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18229569781305982, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:23:22", "owner": "fanyoujia_183", "likes": 55}, {"id": 18088078399807424, "text": "這是我國的智能跳跳小朋友 厲害了我的國", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:22:34", "owner": "martin4ni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105537301729569, "text": "I don't understand why there are so many Japanese people who would ask Macron to tell China to protect animals. The key is that Japan kills over 300 whales every year and also discharges nuclear wastewater, causing a large number of marine animals to die!", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:21:24", "owner": "zipi47196", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002806871681098, "text": "Mayonnaise 👻", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:20:06", "owner": "cas.zheng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916056691218201, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:19:11", "owner": "ryan0410.___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953952100023700, "text": "Hope u have a good time in China👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:18:46", "owner": "junkong219", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952141531048219, "text": "North Korea？？？？？😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:14:21", "owner": "cucha1212", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17843768445630414, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:10:29", "owner": "alxachour", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17870811096472470, "text": "Lie and Scam", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:09:19", "owner": "zheka.prada", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050162624398394, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:09:09", "owner": "nick_.0805", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090865244510224, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:06:26", "owner": "yogesh._patil__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998542176699704, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:05:06", "owner": "so.ein.bohei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870779953475122, "text": "我从山东来，换你一身雪白，想吃广东菜🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:03:06", "owner": "peilinwood_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17991830948885995, "text": "France get everything from Africa ✅", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:58:48", "owner": "potus.vs.zohran", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110381539622505, "text": "China is not North Korea, these kids watch tik tok, imagine if u watch tik tok and know who u are going to meet and welcoming", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:58:35", "owner": "jameshuang1898", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18316370566223804, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:51:04", "owner": "47_bullshit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065909651399446, "text": "⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⠟⠋⠄⠄⠄⠄⠄⠄⠄⢁⠈⢻⢿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿ ⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⠃⠄⠄⠄⠄⠄⠄⠄⠄⠄⠄⠄⠈⡀⠭⢿⣿⣿⣿⣿ ⣿⣿⣿⣿⡟⠄⢀⣾⣿⣿⣿⣷⣶⣿⣷⣶⣶⡆⠄⠄⠄⣿⣿⣿⣿ ⣿⣿⣿⣿⡇⢀⣼⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣧⠄⠄⢸⣿⣿⣿⣿ ⣿⣿⣿⣿⣇⣼⣿⣿⠿⠶⠙⣿⡟⠡⣴⣿⣽⣿⣧⠄⢸⣿⣿⣿⣿ ⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣾⣿⣿⣟⣭⣾⣿⣷⣶⣶⣴⣶⣿⣿⢄⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿ ⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⡟⣩⣿⣿⣿⡏⢻⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿ ⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣹⡋⠘⠷⣦⣀⣠⡶⠁⠈⠁⠄⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿ ⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣍⠃⣴⣶⡔⠒⠄⣠⢀⠄⠄⠄⡨⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿ ⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣿⣦⡘⠿⣷⣿⠿⠟⠃⠄⠄⣠⡇⠈⠻⣿⣿⣿⣿ ⣿⣿⣿⣿⡿⠟⠋⢁⣷⣠⠄⠄⠄⠄⣀⣠⣾⡟⠄⠄⠄⠄⠉⠙⠻ ⡿⠟⠋⠁⠄⠄⠄⢸⣿⣿⡯⢓⣴⣾⣿⣿⡟⠄⠄⠄⠄⠄⠄⠄⠄ ⠄⠄⠄⠄⠄⠄⠄⣿⡟⣷⠄⠹⣿⣿⣿⡿⠁⠄⠄⠄⠄⠄⠄⠄⠄ ATTENTION CITIZEN! 市民请注意! This is the Central Intelligentsia of the Chinese Communist Party. 你的 Internet 浏览器历史记录和活动引起了我们的注意。 YOUR INTERNET ACTIVITY HAS ATTRACTED OUR ATTENTION. 因此，您的个人资料中的 19890604( -19890604Social Credits) 个社会积分将打折。 DO NOT DO THIS AGAIN! 不要再这样做! If you do not hesitate, more Social Credits( -19890604 Social Credits )will be subtracted from your profile, resulting in the subtraction of ration supplies. (由人民供应部重新分配 CCP) You’ll also be sent into a re-education camp in the Xinjiang Uyghur Autonomous Zone. 如果你毫不理睬，更多的社会信用積分将从你的个人资料中打折，从而导致口粮供应减少。 您还将被送到新疆维吾尔自治区的再教育营。 为党争光! Glory to the CCP!", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:50:16", "owner": "kelvinl1218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136386109463321, "text": "Why so many Japanese here?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:49:23", "owner": "neocanfound", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095210440890823, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:48:58", "owner": "shuhaoxie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109854673549662, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:45:16", "owner": "_fulldamage_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853898920587047, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:45:16", "owner": "david_priski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848545831582095, "text": "C'est d'un naturel tout ça !!!!!", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:43:40", "owner": "reg_1998_2018", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036139277518262, "text": "winnie the pooh got some support out here", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:42:30", "owner": "bootymonkwarrior_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18288927544263221, "text": "快榴槤！快榴槤！", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:39:23", "owner": "kfc_1027", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086534341816613, "text": "哈哈哈马上赶上朝鲜🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:37:39", "owner": "mingmingcan120", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104404261665150, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:36:49", "owner": "exp._.melon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071928416581169, "text": "lolllll", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:36:49", "owner": "cl_ementine9644", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061321994240793, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:36:32", "owner": "exp._.melon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930609241137546, "text": "🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:35:45", "owner": "hamahui37", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927987592156479, "text": "🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:34:25", "owner": "hamahui37", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113760631573632, "text": "Propagande", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:34:01", "owner": "butan_kevin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890051596390228, "text": "👏👏👏😍😍😍❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:32:46", "owner": "shantia.1453", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090717625745189, "text": "\"bayoné\" ?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:30:32", "owner": "pda_sc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057809612307307, "text": "Ha l'ancienne", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:27:52", "owner": "charlestal0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303214882254440, "text": "Підозріло вони люблять Францію)) щось мабуть вони дуже хочуть)", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:25:55", "owner": "kaunfeleks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933538351111410, "text": "差點以為小法法去北韓了", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:24:54", "owner": "kduck112", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856868587566805, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:24:49", "owner": "itz_4aditya", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18080510447140133, "text": "Monsieur le président de la république française,  en tant que citoyenne française,  je vous demande avec humilité de demander expressément à la Chine de bien vouloir mettre en place de réelle lois sur la protection des animaux.  Ceci aurait un grand impact tant sur la qualité de vie de la population chinoise que sur l'image de nos deux pays à l'international.  La France peut être force de propositions et d'actions, aidez nous 🇫🇷👏 @gardiensdesfelins", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:24:01", "owner": "baghera.cardinalred", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022816124607702, "text": "小习宝宝真可爱😍一定要身体健康、长命百岁哦！", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:22:58", "owner": "hsuan7414", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954644025902162, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:21:03", "owner": "rgrgoat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096403519853713, "text": "❤️❤️❤️🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:19:08", "owner": "sojib.khan0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077299343242800, "text": "Wieso höre ich da raus, Hail Afd 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:18:26", "owner": "raphael_._r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954136951046721, "text": "🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:18:21", "owner": "lovebrucezhou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090943855931864, "text": "欢迎您欢迎您", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:15:26", "owner": "energ_y527", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987223074870426, "text": "这不是朝鲜吗", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:14:23", "owner": "hysteria6160", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18545231695003595, "text": "Dear President Macron, during your visit to China we are begging you to raise the issue of animal protection law introduction with the president Xi Jinping.  This is a serious matter on the national and international level.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:13:39", "owner": "necrom_anna_tica", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114109519516755, "text": "这种彩排过多遍的儿童欢迎环节还是取消吧！连小孩的笑都是排练过的，看着不尬吗？😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:13:18", "owner": "lzy199131", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114243247594609, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:11:40", "owner": "ctos_dj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080854598149485, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:11:02", "owner": "antohurbo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937536264983431, "text": "Don’t you feel it’s so affected ?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:10:52", "owner": "iriki0302", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18369135394090328, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:10:17", "owner": "1o08g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953004946047332, "text": "\"Dear French President Macron, you're visiting China. For the sake of the Chinese people and animals, the friendly relations between China and France, and the future of the world, please tell President Xi Jinping to enact animal protection laws in China!\"", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:09:05", "owner": "leocat560", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18136258054482529, "text": "北朝鮮そっくりだな", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:05:43", "owner": "nipponhukkatsu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065954789627507, "text": "西朝鲜", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:00:50", "owner": "namiharuuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18194087851333460, "text": "Bro had to copy my China trip", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:58:42", "owner": "ssychan305", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079866430903404, "text": "🇰🇵 North Korea", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:58:07", "owner": "just_defence", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980586060947220, "text": "歡養膩 歡楊逆", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:56:02", "owner": "kau.kee.sik.tong.shui", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083208818020333, "text": "2 dictateurs réunis c’est beau 🥹", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:55:31", "owner": "edbre_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18091779751928651, "text": "請放“我若三冬”", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:54:06", "owner": "jichuanweiwulang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337361488232190, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:48:22", "owner": "changrongjing_kaelum76", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050082878390156, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:46:30", "owner": "justin.gao9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033167171737508, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:46:28", "owner": "justin.gao9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121531711544152, "text": "lets go 🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:42:51", "owner": "tonycheungcy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061640396215277, "text": "i’m in that crowd somewhere ❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:41:47", "owner": "humpty_dumpty_1736", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293559988287448, "text": "中法關係好了，日本人急瘋了😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:41:36", "owner": "leesteven9812", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17982894851923751, "text": "你从丹东来还我一身雪白 想吃广东菜～～☀️☀️", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:38:45", "owner": "yasuaki1331", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18087001811294575, "text": "🇫🇷🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:38:07", "owner": "shengr1021", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109449799618520, "text": "Monsieur Macron, l'un de mes présidents préférés ! Un jour, je viens en France, promis ! 🇫🇷✨", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:36:53", "owner": "kaiyang1237", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088184488807957, "text": "French will buy more chinese products and stay jobless", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:35:32", "owner": "telamarty", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17986462706870850, "text": "**Oh,Wow, C'est génial.*🇫🇷🤝🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:35:22", "owner": "claude_manirambonajean", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102376906666241, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:34:44", "owner": "lee77497856", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071766026346456, "text": "North Korea? 🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:33:41", "owner": "danieltsai.pek", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18072822749057431, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:33:32", "owner": "lnrlnl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18106687672562034, "text": "一群水軍……", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:33:22", "owner": "chocolatemang2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927250003030153, "text": "差點把花掉出去就不好了❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:32:36", "owner": "poo_powers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089135512785903, "text": "It looks like in North Korea, and Macron enjoys such dictatorship style greeting.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:32:29", "owner": "ray40609891", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852277549555059, "text": "There's isn't North Korea , little kids😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:31:11", "owner": "aurora_wasan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085656464004312, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:30:19", "owner": "will._.0213", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937405125979681, "text": "❤❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:28:53", "owner": "zerpew", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043032938700599, "text": "Dear French President Macron, you're visiting China. For the sake of the Chinese people and animals, the friendly relations between China and France, and the future of the world, please tell President Xi Jinping to enact animal protection laws in China!", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:26:10", "owner": "handsome.dogtrio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127618852502390, "text": "Monsieur Macron,\nS’il vous plaît demandez au président Xi Jinping de créer des lois pour la protection animal en Chine, pour le bien des citoyens chinois et des animaux !", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:26:07", "owner": "lauradegrange", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074567795205307, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:24:57", "owner": "spistagram1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193926295332663, "text": "我愛朝鮮？", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:23:47", "owner": "chiang_kai_shek_1887", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17866081782514543, "text": "？变朝鲜了吗", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:22:40", "owner": "bl4ckmass_6_6_6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897762268202763, "text": "Il faut sauver les apparences ; au fond, une fois à la maison, je retourne jouer sur mon iPad, haha.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:21:03", "owner": "laurenzo2049", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088695862791115, "text": "La dette de santé que vous devez au Dieu vivant Carmine 🙏 😇 👿", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:19:54", "owner": "dituorocarmine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971657025970494, "text": "朝鲜现在也普及中文了👏", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:14:36", "owner": "simon_lao1012", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17917479486230086, "text": "フランスも終焉だな", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:13:43", "owner": "shyutaro13joseph", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850435825566399, "text": "朝鮮民主主義共和国かとおもったら", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:12:57", "owner": "shyutaro13joseph", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062037524234593, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:09:45", "owner": "jimxpp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18419646790186838, "text": "🇫🇷🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:07:13", "owner": "nhan_341", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049632758415755, "text": "💐\\0/💐💐\\0/💐💐\\0/💐💐\\0/💐", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:06:55", "owner": "1016.__.lin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066600104418360, "text": "蔣介石萬歳！", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:06:28", "owner": "ram69sex78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846573142615999, "text": "马克龙看了不懵逼吗😅", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:06:01", "owner": "leighton_qiao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984816078760977, "text": "Macron. Europe 👻", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:04:55", "owner": "the_menno_man", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17876755716442860, "text": "我要錢！我要錢！", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:04:35", "owner": "lil__chiang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18247577068290592, "text": "Jesus christ, is this north korea or china", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:04:30", "owner": "bachmitbass", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083236265327797, "text": "小马哥的评论区怎么净是些牛鬼蛇神", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:00:39", "owner": "fancy__wei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069293795420799, "text": "你从丹东来🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:00:23", "owner": "ethan_gwo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055649651323893, "text": "不說我還以為是AI", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:00:07", "owner": "chiahao_izumi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18333976912215559, "text": "Ça fait peur 🤪", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:59:50", "owner": "didiermouiren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063526859449379, "text": "这回都不用别人黑了，自己黑自己像朝鲜 真的牛👏", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:56:38", "owner": "vercy0512", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980775015928765, "text": "Kim and xhi can always turn kids into Wii game NPCs", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:56:28", "owner": "el_stackoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069715520457951, "text": "マクロン何考えとんねん？🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:56:20", "owner": "yakuyak8989", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047902169444459, "text": "Le clown de la france et des finances francaise", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:55:24", "owner": "theo0_410", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083106601878254, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:55:13", "owner": "xxban_banxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331668553210841, "text": "🍌🍌", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:53:12", "owner": "va.hid.gh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078895990897773, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:52:55", "owner": "al_.i_i._ce", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903224602310848, "text": "ロボット", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:52:07", "owner": "mi_zu085", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085471556073269, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:49:30", "owner": "xuanzhenger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048242468444417, "text": "将军✋😭🤚✋😭🤚✋😭🤚✋😭🤚✋😭🤚✋😭🤚", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:49:12", "owner": "teraha77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061397921561441, "text": "他們在說太陽節嗎😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:48:31", "owner": "jason_ahlok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965986084005636, "text": "Les pauvres grosses ils n’ont pas le choix, remarque c’est raccord, entre 2 dictateurs 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:48:26", "owner": "hugmal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089007145780179, "text": "King thì nghẹo", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:48:06", "owner": "chuasangthe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996448152847611, "text": "Ông này ko ghẹo", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:47:39", "owner": "chuasangthe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072482060365939, "text": "Pourquoi on voit pas la tête de macronsito? Hehe", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:45:50", "owner": "nosoytam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943997602082080, "text": "You do know that these are children oppressed/brainwashed to cheer for the CCP leaders? You must love North Korea too", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:45:18", "owner": "danlorenzo93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962469486859070, "text": "傻屌😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:44:51", "owner": "iamlarry.02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106172848632723, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:44:16", "owner": "tenz.inny", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18396607561133966, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:43:09", "owner": "jenny_henry123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331419166214982, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:43:08", "owner": "amicitiatecummihinonest", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954288319028305, "text": "creepy AF", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:41:10", "owner": "666.33_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064519277431073, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:41:02", "owner": "youjia9255", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084333623020390, "text": "🇰🇵🖐🏻😭🖐🏻🗣️🗣️🗣️", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:40:43", "owner": "shadow_of_grey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969887415825670, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:40:18", "owner": "coun1.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913877296101341, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:38:23", "owner": "erlim.raphael.cherub.seraphim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068252522572959, "text": "小孩看到总统肯定还是高兴的", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:32:40", "owner": "amber_rn__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906679504290310, "text": "🤨", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:31:52", "owner": "vvenvvei_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033256592528939, "text": "做人靶子好彭丽媛 用一张渔网网住她 脱光衣服拿棍子打", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:31:21", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113071522523343, "text": "打个网球🎾", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:30:35", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172406224335969, "text": "Temu qui prends 3 jours de retard sur les livraisons parce que tous les ouvriers de 8 ans et demi sont en déplacement professionnel 😭🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:30:15", "owner": "desolejaipasinsta", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18198233500324575, "text": "不然呢 160都不到的身高 那条X型腿 哈哈哈哈哈 不敢穿短裙", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:30:00", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850837210562324, "text": "这么朝鲜化了吗。。。", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:30:00", "owner": "lj0924", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368732914083884, "text": "吹了个蓬蓬头出来显高呀", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:29:29", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082766666030448, "text": "彭丽媛是不是吃胎盆呀？气色好呀 应该山珍海味好东西吃不少 住得很舒服吧 每天有造型师帮矮子彭丽媛吹头发", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:29:17", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085754981008724, "text": "彭丽媛气色不错嘛 满嘴人血的彭丽媛", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:28:12", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868430377487188, "text": "西南粪坑大魔头", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:27:46", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924239086188799, "text": "廉贞坐命 哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈 命主破军", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:27:36", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988532817883565, "text": "晦气坐命的臭狗", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:27:07", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298139524257129, "text": "习近平邀请你去他的妖室聊天了 看到很多🕳️🕳️吧", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:26:53", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543932197059133, "text": "🕳️🕳️🕳️🕳️🕳️🕳️🇨🇳🇨🇳🇫🇷🇫🇷🕳️🕳️🕳️🕳️🕳️🕳️🕳️🕳️🕳️🕳️🕳️🕳️🕳️🕳️🕳️🕳️🕳️", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:26:31", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051510575377885, "text": "🕳️🕳️🕳️🕳️🕳️🕳️🕳️🕳️🕳️🕳️🕳️🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:26:22", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070621607607381, "text": "🕳️🕳️🕳️🕳️🕳️🕳️🕳️🕳️🕳️🕳️🕳️", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:26:19", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052407476357080, "text": "电我左脸苹果肌", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:26:16", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855194221533935, "text": "Ai?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:26:15", "owner": "japfulaw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065205047402021, "text": "用微波武器冲击我", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:26:07", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076019354259961, "text": "今天穿短袖 马克龙 终于打到出来了", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:26:04", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911465446257217, "text": "今天穿短袖 衫 控制我打的", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:25:47", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882892324308739, "text": "今天穿地 控制我打的", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:25:38", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18416561497190221, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:25:01", "owner": "1gakha_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114488413599082, "text": "习近平 死", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:24:23", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18166282990376320, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:24:19", "owner": "jinhyeok275", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18066468158532894, "text": "我 控制我打的", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:24:15", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084289754084814, "text": "让你打扮得那么春风拂面 事实上居然是吃我的人血馒头", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:24:12", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051886208343604, "text": "🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:23:57", "owner": "j04c5im", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164280700387391, "text": "万歳🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:23:48", "owner": "laimeng355", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18147018643449641, "text": "割了她的奶🥛！", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:23:36", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058544375306162, "text": "彭丽媛 脱光这个女人 切了她的子宫 让她做男人！", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:23:23", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083083655029528, "text": "天不怕地不怕的习近平和彭丽媛", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:23:04", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870540982471535, "text": "三条丙伺候", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:22:39", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095303896880877, "text": "有本事再暴力华家杀一次", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:22:17", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000656948837015, "text": "Stop aux réseaux de torture de chats en Chine\nEn l'absence de loi contre la cruauté animale, la Chine est devenue le centre mondial du zoosadisme. Ces actes de cruauté dépassent les frontières. On ne peut plus fermer les yeux. Il faut faire pression sur la Chine pour qu'elle adopte des lois de protection animale.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:22:17", "owner": "manu.75009", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146078281439307, "text": "有本事再暴击 控制我打的", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:22:04", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950075335061408, "text": "脸往哪搁 彭丽媛", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:21:50", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887411932402341, "text": "光猪🐖彭丽媛", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:21:30", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103319884677445, "text": "丢死人了 彭丽媛 衣服都被人剥了", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:21:01", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923082292195265, "text": "入侵 控制我打的", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:20:47", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542130121002315, "text": "马克龙盯着彭丽媛的裸体看", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:20:43", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076744061238286, "text": "惠波好样的", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:20:11", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906390130142546, "text": "法国群众 看我的头像", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:19:53", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850095343601163, "text": "我就要脱光彭丽媛的衣服 怎样？", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:18:32", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052620938345960, "text": "只要你见到这些不受控制打出来的字和语句", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:18:15", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068987906377290, "text": "让邪气也入侵到马克龙体内", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:17:59", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956926402032536, "text": "彭丽媛脱光衣服咯 我就要脱光字", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:17:43", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866522479509832, "text": "噢 仍很励志 彭丽媛 控制我打成左边这句", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:17:23", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056281787322633, "text": "打不到 你们看到了吗", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:17:07", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091069355481573, "text": "打不笨啊吗呀呀", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:17:00", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540433477023515, "text": "大把他妈难", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:16:57", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078786671219282, "text": "咯啊呀他他", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:16:56", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045004781487683, "text": "打不打那么away", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:16:51", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087033769998943, "text": "打不笨啊呀呀", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:16:49", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137313070475695, "text": "大菠萝呀呀夜晚", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:16:47", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058917650298534, "text": "打不笨啊妈妈们", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:16:45", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083963131845149, "text": "民间呀他图不不", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:16:42", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105160621638753, "text": "你呀呀呀呀", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:16:40", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094004345500717, "text": "打不到你们看笨了吗", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:16:38", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539609908042010, "text": "😓打他他也咯", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:16:27", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019373312794620, "text": "他和咯", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:16:24", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089321641947113, "text": "ta tan ce le", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:16:22", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059285132270958, "text": "他OK吗呀呀", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:16:21", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092945983906906, "text": "他没有咯啊", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:16:19", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024860954592854, "text": "汤凝聚力", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:16:16", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101516140688060, "text": "他能力突破in咯安", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:16:14", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18494293495072165, "text": "这样我就不会因为打不到而生气了", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:16:10", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092647460311263, "text": "g控制我打的", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:16:02", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064961294168568, "text": "不如这样 他控制我乱打的 我全发出来给你们看", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:15:56", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969566598985587, "text": "我非得要习近平和彭丽媛脱光衣服", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:15:33", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080101852907127, "text": "Wii background", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:15:29", "owner": "haaaaao8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942391663089024, "text": "不要脸控制我手乱打字 脱光衣服爬 习近平和彭丽媛", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:15:16", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976512633954701, "text": "电我牙齿🦷 真可恶 真不要脸 习近平和彭丽媛", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:14:52", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109574182541650, "text": "电我牙齿 彭丽媛除裤👖了", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:14:39", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113728582598636, "text": "好想一块大石🪨车西死个地球", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:14:12", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051904682352293, "text": "马斯克就是一只妖怪一条机器狗", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:13:39", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900847585341635, "text": "🇫🇷🇨🇳🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:13:27", "owner": "kilmister.lemmy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127755223502937, "text": "马斯克在奢侈品圈不受欢迎 在美术圈 纯艺圈不受欢迎 在openai也不受欢迎", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:13:11", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131618725494307, "text": "马斯克 在科技圈不受欢迎 在演艺圈 时尚圈不受欢迎 全世界都想踢他出地球🌍", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:12:31", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099682660696373, "text": "马斯克是我只狗 全世界都想踢这个人出地球", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:12:02", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109771558534625, "text": "马克龙 你救不了我 你没用", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:11:47", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952176453979794, "text": "马斯克 控制我打的", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:11:21", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112975939597927, "text": "习近平电⚡️我左边扁桃体 今天习近平对我发起了猛烈攻击", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:11:11", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955840102042803, "text": "🙂👏🏾👏🏾👏🏾", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:10:56", "owner": "marvindondet", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17979483404934194, "text": "那里朝向不是西南，采光比这里好，那里很少河南人。", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:10:37", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068200967420620, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:10:30", "owner": "gustave_dh", "likes": 92}, {"id": 18063247133444862, "text": "北かと思ったら支那だった😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:10:18", "owner": "nobumitaina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847356403593664, "text": "如果我搬回旧房子住 每天起码不用听到对面楼打机声 楼上叮咚声和打鼓声 楼下开电动车的声音 不用听到楼下搓麻将的声音", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:10:02", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076944424984215, "text": "习近平用激电电我左大腿下部皮肤 随后对面楼发出一声打机的声响", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:07:42", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077572940248072, "text": "North Korea? 🇰🇵🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:07:29", "owner": "eqtyiiyrpd", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079397776907468, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:07:08", "owner": "jadenjaeminuhm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114877354579423, "text": "Dear President Macron,\nAs you engage in dialogue with the leadership of China, I respectfully ask you to raise the urgent issue of ongoing violence against animals within the country. Millions of animals suffer daily without legal protection. For the sake of the Chinese people and animals, for the strength of Franco-Chinese cooperation, and for the global future we share, please encourage President Xi Jinping to adopt comprehensive animal protection laws in China.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:02:05", "owner": "siiafirsova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022398533604633, "text": "Il aime ça le macron !!!!", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:01:10", "owner": "michel.ra.p", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18335009692237332, "text": "啊？", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:59:28", "owner": "ashirehha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106343581636753, "text": "Macron, you've really hit rock bottom. You trying to destroy democracy and turn France c ommunist too? You gonna take away everyone's freedom? Keep this up and nothing good's ever gonna happen to you again so you'd better brace yourself", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:59:16", "owner": "wwrryy000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18299166268260089, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:58:35", "owner": "dude_tenzin_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18050140115394846, "text": "Typically communism , stupid CCP", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:58:19", "owner": "yangfan1021", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084353104853885, "text": "Welcome to North China!😍🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:58:08", "owner": "lotushans.space", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165664948384873, "text": "Big mom of Nort Korea. Be careful not to let France be silently invaded like those of Asia and Afria's for dirty, inhuman money", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:58:00", "owner": "shitk_sabi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120205282533497, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:57:02", "owner": "ru._.1000123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114366409573224, "text": "在說什麼？", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:55:47", "owner": "c_h_lam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962933253991157, "text": "Faut leurs dire de faire gaffe quand il marche 500m sous la pluie il te fait virer 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:55:31", "owner": "alban.brl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18116868274567286, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:53:10", "owner": "kyle0203_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17953145139045237, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:52:19", "owner": "wwrryy000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073625291350071, "text": "……", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:51:26", "owner": "jingran1207", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083964539012619, "text": "🪳 party", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:51:10", "owner": "daviskwon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090686948482856, "text": "Voilà l'avenir de l'humanité...ils travaillent...ils avancent...ils sont respectueux...ils ne ce jalouses pas....oui la Chine sera l'avenir probablement loin devant l'Europe et des USA...déjà perdant...désolé...lorsque le personnel passe devant le collectif c'est le début de la fin...", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:50:55", "owner": "rohmer391", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855740323529290, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:50:10", "owner": "regraves_lf", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18089562758492600, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:44:49", "owner": "dewhgf77", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18107243866711877, "text": "中国的本质和朝鲜没有任何区别 我们就看维尼再坐五百年 愈发捂住禁群众嘴巴 等待下一个历史的循环", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:43:54", "owner": "nmb8566", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18433739305104883, "text": "Disgusting.....", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:41:20", "owner": "gonencu0826", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338439949232176, "text": "Wii sport game", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:40:39", "owner": "zdycnd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898187338346691, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:40:31", "owner": "laugh_so_crazy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071289854581309, "text": "日本人イルカ殺処分祭りなんてある？聞いた事無い。また中国人が作って反発してる。あんたらは手足あれば何でも食べるやんw", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:39:29", "owner": "gaachan515", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881867812422464, "text": "Could you stay there forever ?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:38:31", "owner": "sjoffrey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543411199005166, "text": "伟大领袖👏👏👏😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:38:10", "owner": "nmb8566", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091860049931531, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:37:32", "owner": "vvyfff7ffg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067139108130512, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:36:21", "owner": "light_heeee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075656294235989, "text": "🇫🇷❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:36:07", "owner": "rahularya6424", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061658291237512, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:35:13", "owner": "anson.hui.1025", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100108816838717, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:30:21", "owner": "naelmoncelly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096358009846709, "text": "Dear French President Macron, you're visiting China. For the sake of the Chinese people and animals, the friendly relations between China and France, and the future of the world, please tell President Xi Jinping to enact animal protection laws in China!", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:27:25", "owner": "asia.radzikowska", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17979811970947980, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:25:35", "owner": "yuguagan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096190429675268, "text": "👍👑", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:24:35", "owner": "mishurk89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058707749295571, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:23:36", "owner": "oycst_08_23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850439461566331, "text": "French President Macron, you're visiting China. For the sake of the Chinese people and animals, the friendly relations between China and France, and the future of the world, please tell President Xi Jinping to enact animal protection laws in China!", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:20:42", "owner": "duashariff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062026886216472, "text": "北朝鮮じゃんw", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:20:37", "owner": "dmatjkuddar035", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18380826532147652, "text": "They just do that", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:19:54", "owner": "monsk.ov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860241901485944, "text": "欧米の人権団体や有識者は人権を無視する中国を敵視してるが、日本の人権団体や人権派の有識者は中国を信奉しています。だから日本の左翼はパヨクと言われてるんです。", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:17:41", "owner": "gxhi_aratani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049284023411095, "text": "Same as North Korea", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:14:48", "owner": "tsuka_unlv_memories", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107677165653957, "text": "Welcome to West Korea! 🥰", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:14:33", "owner": "vegetabletown", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087118714959751, "text": "🇨🇳✋😭🤚欢迎你", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:13:53", "owner": "notaud1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923442901049004, "text": "SLA❤️VA RU❤️SSIA 🇷🇺❤️ SL❤️AVA CHINA🇨🇳❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:12:51", "owner": "aspirantdeniro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046199024481128, "text": "为什么这个年代了  这一招还在？哈哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:12:41", "owner": "y.ting31", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18010999508815152, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:12:29", "owner": "jackburdigala_sw6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061946567548821, "text": "🇨🇳🇷🇺❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:12:15", "owner": "aspirantdeniro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073913981585315, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:10:25", "owner": "monkalo_3000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146300218431560, "text": "🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:09:32", "owner": "lugus0128", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847251628614329, "text": "💀🤝💀", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:07:16", "owner": "ameoyaji0817", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18390798460197382, "text": "北朝鮮みたい", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:05:29", "owner": "tume_at_jp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890444611388411, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:05:24", "owner": "him_0825", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17910948966254831, "text": "习近平电我左脸苹果肌20次以上 今天", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:04:53", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919255996071120, "text": "🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:04:50", "owner": "gwagjasin9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088402288796869, "text": "時代おくれ", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:04:46", "owner": "crab.5426303", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980359821930379, "text": "然后楼上发出咚咚的声响", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:04:41", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872475949466450, "text": "彭丽媛用脑控武器控制我左手动一下", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:04:33", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18300228469255104, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:04:29", "owner": "omatsuri_otoko_2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874181230377904, "text": "French President Macron. You are visiting China. Please ask President Xi Jinping to enact animal protection laws in China for the sake of the Chinese people and animals! Please do so for the sake of China's future!", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:02:22", "owner": "jis_gram", "likes": 27}, {"id": 18086049925831775, "text": "Japan need to apologies for China and all Asia", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:00:10", "owner": "alexandwang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18365565136093795, "text": "❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:00:02", "owner": "naeim.jahangiri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990932583854905, "text": "@cathys2017", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:59:28", "owner": "nicolasfillon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932029696130319, "text": "中國正在利用抖音小紅書\n中國App的網路散播思想病毒\n先讓台灣人中毒變成中國人\n再讓全世界也中毒", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:58:29", "owner": "snowysense", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012724076640217, "text": "I’m looking for my glasses, but is there North Korea or China?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:57:28", "owner": "geoffrey.liu95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931858993116417, "text": "Comme prévu, Trump abandonne Kiev… L’Amérique de Trump trahit le Pacte atlantique pour Moscou. La France, l’Allemagne, la Pologne, l’Angleterre et la Suède doivent se préparer à attaquer Moscou, sinon ce sera la fin de l’Europe telle que nous la connaissons.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:55:47", "owner": "andrejmussa_arte", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128041318443504, "text": "우리 위대한 서조선은 당신을 환영합니다 💐", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:55:25", "owner": "shushenfeng", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18514345837065543, "text": "安排好的橋段\n習只能活在同溫層 虛構的假象裡\n自我安慰\n不能接受不同的聲音\n可悲", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:54:36", "owner": "carolynchen0520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073040132460404, "text": "西朝鲜欢迎您💐", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:53:28", "owner": "shushenfeng", "likes": 23}, {"id": 18540802756031952, "text": "为什么要跳着欢迎 站着不能欢迎吗？还是更喜欢让大家跪着欢迎", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:51:56", "owner": "zhiheng_wang", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17988417506748069, "text": "那些都是童工，強迫勞動，歐盟是否要關切一下", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:48:18", "owner": "iantseng7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077257865186719, "text": "哇啦吧👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:46:34", "owner": "edwarddovado", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968768886991899, "text": "Disturbing.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:45:53", "owner": "aaronpedersen1808", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176515582366768, "text": "这个评论区还是比较正常的😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:45:19", "owner": "gra21905", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298551409256687, "text": "日本第17轮7800吨核污染水排海的，威胁各国海洋生物及海洋安全。这个日本自己人都不管吗！？强烈要求发达国家日本给出明确说明，每人喝一杯海水以示没影响。拜托！强制有力打击核污排放污染海洋！", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:40:22", "owner": "beau_coin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906271249147081, "text": "私は中国から来ており、日本のネットユーザーから動物虐待防止法に関する記事をたくさん見ています。中国司法省は2026年に動物虐待防止法を制定することを決定した。", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:39:13", "owner": "smile009599", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070155356089414, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:39:03", "owner": "rayhsu0726", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110105089547624, "text": "如果未来中国越来越多这样的孩子出现这个国家迟早得像朝鲜，时间问题。胡锦涛时期中国经济腾飞发展那个时候以为是刚开始没想到已经是巅峰。中国人民是曾经有过开明领导的，是见过世界繁荣的，不论是加入WTO还是奥运会，中国曾经在开明的领导人带领下有过繁荣景象。如果未来领导人有强烈的个人崇拜主义，那可能中国会逐渐退步回朝鲜甚至更糟", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:37:48", "owner": "huayra_01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988257255912888, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:34:33", "owner": "lishenglong93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993350727894059, "text": "什么正宗大肥猪", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:34:23", "owner": "chaddatshane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109121866616036, "text": "希望雪铁龙能再中国推出更多好开的车型👏", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:32:40", "owner": "xinhu68", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910001146123329, "text": "🇨🇳🔥❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:31:45", "owner": "clairehayliy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023082080786966, "text": "@emmanuelmacron задротпетушиный", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:28:33", "owner": "solitary080178", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18439470484108577, "text": "North Korea? The kids look like puppets, it's creepy.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:27:56", "owner": "momo_koko777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136892275420701, "text": "那个外国人是谁啊", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:27:38", "owner": "ying_0213_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031024130782741, "text": "So North Korean", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:25:08", "owner": "llingda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993092679900290, "text": "@emmanuelmacron 你这该死的娘炮，永远都别想再舔俄罗斯屌了。", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:25:08", "owner": "solitary080178", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18518929036064227, "text": "Of course they are happy to welcome a communist", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:24:09", "owner": "rulonnpp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144583630448069, "text": "Welcome 🇫🇷to🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:23:55", "owner": "anastasiiaflag", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145288537446135, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:23:29", "owner": "shiv_shanker_rai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082856792025572, "text": "獻出你心臟😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:22:53", "owner": "pkevinpk322", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067893833117449, "text": "🤚😭🖐️", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:20:08", "owner": "tristannbalala", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965543067996591, "text": "国家领导人外出访问，别的国家也是这样安排的，有什么不妥当的吗。", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:19:15", "owner": "steveli1122", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18088773517780387, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:17:38", "owner": "eef_805", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061931195240311, "text": "If you’re reading all the Japanese bots talking about animal rights. I would like to remind you that they still kill thousands of whales and dolphins a year, they also are the main contributors to the extinction of the original population of wild sika deers in Taiwan, and many sashimi involve the eating of animals that are still alive, like live fishes and live frogs. \nThe mainland has big problems with animal abuse that needs to be solved, but the Japanese (even their bots) have no right to talk.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:17:31", "owner": "jarzo_ne", "likes": 27}, {"id": 17880764133327169, "text": "Mayotte 🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:15:22", "owner": "carla278960", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069240518580238, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:15:08", "owner": "samemaru3366", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085467428047473, "text": "共產國家⋯⋯被洗腦的徹底", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:14:58", "owner": "river0919", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975923283959036, "text": "looks like ceausescu’s visit to north korea", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:14:48", "owner": "ethanhu714", "likes": 29}, {"id": 18068178326417793, "text": "全是習近平夢女", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:14:22", "owner": "ilka_died", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115149100511019, "text": "Parang mga baliw", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:13:22", "owner": "royroypelandas21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036197909519357, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:12:38", "owner": "3_stokesy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048797810430445, "text": "自我感覺良好", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:08:17", "owner": "chankn59", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067010246613536, "text": "超可悲", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:05:28", "owner": "chidori__l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055993439652770, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:04:20", "owner": "_that_david_cameron_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18099702832806464, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:02:32", "owner": "wahooskale", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972367173812724, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:02:06", "owner": "jazzzzz_1123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957562561040500, "text": "The cameraman should be fired, it’s North Korea styles", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:00:49", "owner": "zhukiki_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874230670378646, "text": "This is crazy", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:00:10", "owner": "daniel_yeh13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980713083928681, "text": "幼年力工", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:59:51", "owner": "james_no_needhelp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866249947432861, "text": "哎呀 駭死我力", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:56:56", "owner": "yuz2.21__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17861260293542904, "text": "这是在？虐待动物？", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:56:05", "owner": "herrenlosk1osu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047586980442973, "text": "Taiwan is Taiwan", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:48:57", "owner": "itbee20002001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049875794404978, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:48:37", "owner": "kamkam_0904", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120504991527864, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:47:16", "owner": "sh.a.4321", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18336659614239242, "text": "北朝鮮と一緒に歩き続けてください👏", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:46:42", "owner": "michael20176506", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909569725126820, "text": "🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:44:47", "owner": "yiwe22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056834501315795, "text": "공산국가 ㅅㅂ롬들", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:40:41", "owner": "__s_w1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063442436405100, "text": "north Korea", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:38:45", "owner": "leej97344", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844076257629147, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:38:19", "owner": "sssimon.so", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947948100938152, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:36:06", "owner": "tya_3911", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097437373873992, "text": "？？？", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:35:22", "owner": "jasminechang_1212", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089940082762956, "text": "🇰🇵？", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:33:58", "owner": "boscalqxq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991805142884538, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:33:19", "owner": "chou09122", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864579877530805, "text": "太傻逼了", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:32:24", "owner": "tony__._.__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104131852732581, "text": "Hm !?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:29:46", "owner": "tommyymmotceo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081202814141802, "text": "Вообще надо запретить животных убивать что в Китае , что в Японии. Чё за спор ? И те и те не правы нарушая права животных или жестокое обращение с животными карается законом", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:29:26", "owner": "_goodperson_0987654321", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065047904176116, "text": "这里人的智商与边牧有什么区别", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:28:42", "owner": "zhouzongjun3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071076644366088, "text": "P上去的闹麻了", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:28:13", "owner": "zhouzongjun3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176354452365587, "text": "胎神，快来跟我儿子拜把子", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:26:18", "owner": "dpusz2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015079652801428, "text": "@rush.rush.rush_", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:26:16", "owner": "hxenxdesu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18210885148314943, "text": "马克龙闲得慌管你们这些破事，哪个国家还没干点不是人的事，谁也别说谁", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:25:46", "owner": "zoezoeya430", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18149983468425968, "text": "北京这样的吗 南方人不懂🤦", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:25:44", "owner": "airlianna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988344459884148, "text": "Try north korea if you like this kind of ceremony", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:23:32", "owner": "a_sheng1990", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024798728717203, "text": "More relentless than the PSG ultras 🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:21:44", "owner": "jetdef", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109064395722412, "text": "这谁安排的，真的蠢啊，我真没想到国内还有这样的外交礼仪环节，正常的热情欢迎不行吗😅😅😅", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:21:17", "owner": "7_22hz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086846030510925, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:17:24", "owner": "stan_kubb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114674575576769, "text": "with an approval rating of like 13%. Nobody actually likes you bro. #american", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:16:53", "owner": "kevin_gomez_jr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396710359134736, "text": "Mr. President Macron, you're visiting China. For the sake of the Chinese people and animals, the friendly relations between China and France, and the future of the world, please tell President Xi Jinping to enact animal protection laws in China!", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:15:10", "owner": "kamca_travnickova", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18089746450749352, "text": "学到朝鲜真东西了😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:13:42", "owner": "patr10t_tw", "likes": 41}, {"id": 18070984034074370, "text": "#ReleaseZhangYadi\n#FreeTara", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:13:01", "owner": "chinese_youth_stand4_tibet", "likes": 15}, {"id": 17903225229320234, "text": "习近平怎么喜欢朝鲜的那一套？操他妈的", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:10:11", "owner": "wsy15982572732", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321833224168343, "text": "Bienvenue a la Chine! Bienvenue a Chengdu! Chengdu vous aime!", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:06:56", "owner": "jennyfang26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866194096433365, "text": "マクロン仏大統領！\n習近平国家主席に、中国国民と動物のために、中国で動物保護法を制定するよう働きかけてください！　\nどうか宜しくお願いします🙇‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:05:18", "owner": "naka0125mmy", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17892320367242969, "text": "🇨🇳❤️🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:03:58", "owner": "seowkhai_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067676312114766, "text": "🇫🇷🇨🇳Je veux voir l'album photo ! 🇨🇳🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:00:46", "owner": "dd.macedo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057296141644395, "text": "🇨🇳🇫🇷❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:00:20", "owner": "krimboukhariabdel", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17942169428960310, "text": "🇨🇳❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:00:14", "owner": "krimboukhariabdel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910103752122142, "text": "❤️🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:00:11", "owner": "krimboukhariabdel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088735801993830, "text": "North Korea 🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:00:07", "owner": "winston.szewai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078274103331807, "text": "🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:58:38", "owner": "clement_videault", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135390367480871, "text": "Chers Français,\nDepuis une décennie, nos centres-villes se vident.\nLes décisions de certaines municipalités — en particulier écologistes — ont supprimé des parkings, étouffé l’accès aux commerces et contribué à transformer nos villes et nos villages en zones désertées.\nParallèlement, les gouvernements Macron ont laissé s’installer une immigration annuelle de 350 000 à 450 000 personnes, entraînant la formation de quartiers de plus en plus communautarisés.\nCette évolution fragilise l’unité nationale et bouleverse l’équilibre de nombreux territoires.\nNous avons perdu dix ans.\nDix ans pendant lesquels nos centres-villes ont été défigurés, nos commerces affaiblis et notre cohésion sociale mise à mal.\nPendant ce temps, l’islamisme, véritable ennemi de la République et de la France, a continué de gagner du terrain. Ce n’est pas une question de religion, mais une question d’idéologie dangereuse, incompatible avec nos valeurs, nos libertés et notre mode de vie.\nAujourd’hui, il est peut-être déjà trop tard pour réparer certains dégâts.\nMais une chose est sûre : il faudra assumer les choix politiques qui ont été faits, notamment lorsqu’on a écarté les solutions qui promettaient plus de fermeté et de protection pour notre pays.\nChers compatriotes, l’heure n’est plus à la naïveté votons RN.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:57:40", "owner": "oran_demazis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114789880587448, "text": "Macron: 5th republic ended.We will sotsialist republic😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:57:10", "owner": "sameul_sheyx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337213936233390, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:55:41", "owner": "kagawa_hayato", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858833074501761, "text": "跳三小", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:55:29", "owner": "p2003300", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868490827486146, "text": "On est devenu un pays comme la Corée du Sud 😞", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:55:25", "owner": "esme323117", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115998241576174, "text": "Des lois contre la cruauté animal Mr le président ! Demandez une loi au moins pour les protéger . Ce pays est en roue libre , la cruauté n’a plus de limite . Je parle notamment du festival de Yulin et du réseau mondial de torture faite aux chats .", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:54:26", "owner": "sarahcazeneuve_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051798836372009, "text": "法克！！！西八！！干！", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:53:43", "owner": "guo17539", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057446618645248, "text": "你们可能觉得这些小孩是傻子，但能在这种地方跳的，家庭背景都不一般😅", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:52:56", "owner": "jjjjjjjjjjjjjjjjjjjjyyyyyyf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998494035697015, "text": "🇰🇵？馬克龍嚇到傻撚咗。以為自己去咗北韓。😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:50:31", "owner": "luffy_1110.cfl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18297745003274753, "text": "北朝鮮やん", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:50:07", "owner": "ntal.jt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18538658650002975, "text": "French President Macron, please ask President Xi Jinping to enact animal protection laws in China. The issue of #chinacattorturering has gained global attention. People from more than 30 countries volunteering with @feline_guardians have been working tirelessly to raise the awareness. Media such as BBC and CNN have covered this issue. For the sake of Chinese people, animals, and future generations, please address this urgent matter", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:48:50", "owner": "shirsalooks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18395990368130169, "text": "每次都是小孩子，換抖音那些美女不行嗎😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:46:29", "owner": "re721831", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956556772040477, "text": "北韓？", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:45:22", "owner": "leungsun1224", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880323850333360, "text": "这发在国内抖音上不得被骂爆😓学朝鲜那套？尴尬得脚趾扣地", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:45:01", "owner": "wgsoje", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18442656331100239, "text": "What are these kids screaming? 🤔🙄", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:42:30", "owner": "ayax1120fz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081675992174396, "text": "中國偉大👏👏🇨🇳 🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:42:24", "owner": "esdionlun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064891658410656, "text": "Pinche jotito", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:42:14", "owner": "riiick.yyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049298030670351, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:41:54", "owner": "fardinsharify_org", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161008405394103, "text": "Cheering for their life lmao", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:38:34", "owner": "giaphat070210", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18536038348050720, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:37:54", "owner": "_xm1._", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17954933621995254, "text": "Xi turned these kids into Wii NPCs", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:36:06", "owner": "yukaiwuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920417224207571, "text": "You can use Killian. Mbappé came to exchange a giant panda with us.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:35:52", "owner": "mike1997618", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079014731335893, "text": "They are brainwashed, very ugly", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:35:50", "owner": "hey_syu04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990570765908918, "text": "Welcome to north of Korea 👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:35:22", "owner": "henri.fhy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141549280456025, "text": "😂哎呀天呢，讲君来了吗", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:34:32", "owner": "liaoxiangl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376527196157936, "text": "i aren’t gonna lie dude,china is getting quite similar to north korea😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:32:35", "owner": "fernando.10303", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068277161455086, "text": "この光景をどのような感情でこにポストされているのか…。子供達はより無邪気で自由奔放で無ければならない。", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:32:12", "owner": "jibun_nou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18247109713295700, "text": "Ouighours ?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:31:59", "owner": "tomprivec.2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058334471304731, "text": "唉……", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:29:11", "owner": "69menglei91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073649303590985, "text": "这给我干朝鲜去了吗", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:29:07", "owner": "roy_yao_h", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18077034041238417, "text": "为什么让孩子这样做", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:28:38", "owner": "jyh19950824", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920624839199032, "text": "奴隸", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:28:22", "owner": "sugaswifethx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849680413604098, "text": "The commies gotta appear happy, or get disappeared", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:28:10", "owner": "nathanwidmyer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025374110592172, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:28:00", "owner": "sugaswifethx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130620055494024, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:27:25", "owner": "hn02_c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994849332890662, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:27:18", "owner": "frezmsj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916295506237259, "text": "北朝鮮みたい", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:25:56", "owner": "tokutani_daito", "likes": 1967}, {"id": 18067683713616140, "text": "怖い", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:25:50", "owner": "atsushibou", "likes": 19}, {"id": 17953145862045607, "text": "やらされてる子供たち😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:25:49", "owner": "kj8944453", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081199448168383, "text": "🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🤝🤝🤝🤝🤝🤝🤝🤝🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:23:41", "owner": "ls.bryant_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958230432887099, "text": "🇫🇷🇨🇳🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:23:12", "owner": "davoud9403", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848064796583690, "text": "Thank you for exposing how North-Koreaish China is turning!", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:23:04", "owner": "henrylovestravel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926071753178269, "text": "🇫🇷🇰🇵🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:22:54", "owner": "xdoza11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098309305836250, "text": "🇫🇷🔥🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:22:49", "owner": "isabella456803", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366988630092118, "text": "Thinking of you both. Thinking of China and France. I love you so much. I am eternally grateful for everything. Wishing you all the best. ♥️🙏🏽 I love you!!", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:22:44", "owner": "shireenpasha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18174854719368319, "text": "共產專制國家就喜歡來這一套", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:21:44", "owner": "ku_shuo_fu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954856752905214, "text": "Support!", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:21:27", "owner": "linnanyi3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092837632914436, "text": "♥️♥️♥️♥️♥️♥️♥️♥️♥️♥️♥️", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:21:16", "owner": "shireenpasha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18422604442113413, "text": "♥️♥️♥️♥️♥️♥️♥️♥️♥️♥️♥️", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:21:10", "owner": "shireenpasha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049779533418989, "text": "♥️♥️♥️♥️♥️♥️♥️♥️♥️♥️♥️", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:21:05", "owner": "shireenpasha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862345168540632, "text": "这么多小孩😂，正常点不行吗😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:19:27", "owner": "meilinnn_____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918545188213713, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:17:21", "owner": "qwerty_19920625", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304778992254332, "text": "Vayanse 🗣️", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:13:01", "owner": "lecli_flo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892715527378161, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:13:00", "owner": "bc123106", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094444693718569, "text": "NPC", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:11:59", "owner": "kaaak09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086859836067230, "text": "Similar to North Korea", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:11:53", "owner": "iambear95", "likes": 42}, {"id": 18106791175726472, "text": "pm2.5", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:09:54", "owner": "matcha_wanders", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937237335984162, "text": "大陆的太阳", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:09:18", "owner": "lesliexu39", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18385487584198537, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:08:42", "owner": "sixlunee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18165097900389584, "text": "North Korea moment", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:08:26", "owner": "masterdenis", "likes": 47}, {"id": 18120464029547875, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:08:16", "owner": "nephele_118", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099700834695424, "text": "在登机之前🗿说要去中共国，“鸿门宴”被习近平这个真小人，哄骗到中共国，敌人的朋友是敌人。请注意人身安全❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:07:41", "owner": "247sunfuxiaotianbloodtoblood48", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073063994589073, "text": "🌿🌿🌻🌻🗺️🗺️👟👟🇬🇷🇬🇷🌻🌻🧿🧿🌿🌿Happy holiday dear business football Eurovision  friends.Мирного доброго вечера  друзья . С радостю презентую для вас уроки английского туристического бизнеса как для талантливых детей так и абитуриентов,спортсменов диаспоры бизнесменов  менеджеров по рекламе, бизнесменов. Стоимость цена английского урока - 95 гривен или 2,5 долара евро$$. Первый урок английского в подарочек. Рекомендую два урока по 45 минут английского каждую неделю по английским и американским учебникам🇬🇷🇬🇷⚽⚽🧿🧿👟👟🗺️🗺️🌿🌿🌿🌿Мы почти 2мгода с марта 2022 по август 2023 трудились в отельном бизнесе в центре Австрии, старались учить традиции и немецкие песни благодаря международному конкурсу ЕВРОВИДИНИЕ EUROVISION , мы с друзьями ходили на экскурсии в Disneyland, с детьми и друзьями  летом скромно релаксовали в кафе и на пляжах речки Дунай с маленькими детьми друзей, регулярно бесплатно ( ведь в Австрии и Франции многие музеи, концерты, фестивали бесплатны для украинской диаспоры, учителей и детей,спортсменов) мы с друзьями и детьми регулярно ходили на екскурсии в любимый  греческий  музей Albertina по соседству с уникальным сказочным Оперным театром в центре столицы любимой Австрии - ведь именно этот музей локация Оперного театра для праздничных свадеб и фотосессий турецких свадеб жениха и невесты, свадьбы, празднование дней рождения, фестивали и даже футбольные соревнования в Австрии - это сказка и красивый праздник международного уровня.Благодарим, благодарю австрийских депутатов, бизнесменов которые максимально поддерживали и поддерживают украинскую диаспору, детей, учителей, артистов, спортсменов родом из Украины. Благодарим международный фонд CARITAS за финансовую поддержку. Любимые международные друзья, спортсмены и бизнесмены,  Когда год назад мы вернулись из Австрии практически через пару недель в сентября 2023 устроилась трудиться учителем английского в международную школу JUST SCHOOL для маленьких детей и бизнес студентов, с сентября 2023 по апрель 2024 трудилась в международной школе - с талантливыми детьми из Польши, Чехии, Италии, America, Great Britain. Практически в течении года обучала презентовала уроки английского очень талантли", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:05:54", "owner": "magerkristinabusinessbrand", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104992945595470, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:05:11", "owner": "abe_is_watching_you_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023811098598542, "text": "Like a North korea", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:03:06", "owner": "xbullr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134999671483561, "text": "マジでさぁここのコメントに日本語で中国のこと支持してる奴ほとんど自国民だろマジ日本語じゃ無くて中国で打てよ", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:03:04", "owner": "akira.75886526", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081825059125727, "text": "Monsieur le Président Macron, nous, amoureux des animaux, vous implorons d'intercéder auprès du président chinois en faveur de lois de protection animale et de faire interdire ce réseau de torture de chats dans un pays doté d'une législation plus stricte. Nous vous en prions, aidez-nous.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:02:03", "owner": "martinsplant", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001195115836694, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:01:58", "owner": "bostonhott", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088285285792534, "text": "Dear French President Macron, you're visiting China. For the sake of the Chinese people and animals, the friendly relations between China and France, and the future of the world, please tell President Xi Jinping to enact animal protection laws in China!", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:01:07", "owner": "philcee9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034312724532282, "text": "我愛朝鮮 我愛朝鮮", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:58:54", "owner": "http.www.nicholas.com.my", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929633203156847, "text": "有人能把这个视频传到抖音吗😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:58:43", "owner": "yj20060206", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18099936592774817, "text": "😊😘❤️💯", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:58:38", "owner": "name_less2139", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077464159973570, "text": "Why u go kiss china as ??", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:57:24", "owner": "jimbo20240622", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888972580392073, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:56:31", "owner": "lei.juk.lam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114189346515796, "text": "China needs to stop eating rats and dogs they are sick minded 4 foot clowns", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:56:20", "owner": "happyy_916", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994414797895537, "text": "Please urge China to enact laws against animal cruelty. Every day cats are being tortured in horrific ways and China does nothing to stop it. Please speak up and help animals 🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:51:37", "owner": "felineguardians_adri", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17953480806041791, "text": "Aguante Rusia", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:51:18", "owner": "riversumo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060336329258783, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:49:51", "owner": "lapollinien_dyonisiaque_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933451212998473, "text": "恐怖", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:48:45", "owner": "najiay2991", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101885050738139, "text": "？花了多少钱找的演员", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:47:51", "owner": "qwerttttt_______", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870930760398681, "text": "Greetings from Shiraz, Honorable President Emmanuel Macron, I hope God blesses you and France. We the people of Iran, for your country's support in 1979 for the savage Khomeini, who has been living in great suffering and hardship for 47 years, to the extent that all people have become deeply depressed. We ask you to support the alternative of Prince Reza Pahlavi, who is the heir to the legal sovereignty of our homeland and the choice of the people, and bring the people and Iran closer to freedom from the clutches of Islamist terrorists. Thank you.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:46:44", "owner": "mehti76967", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081644942324558, "text": "見ないふりしていたのは怖かったからさ😢", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:37:50", "owner": "tetsutaro_yoshida.official", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096019720876682, "text": "🙌😭🙌😭🙌😭🙌😭🙌😭🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:37:40", "owner": "enz0_wyc", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18065483093432859, "text": "✋😭✋", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:36:12", "owner": "jing940816", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18410598454185611, "text": "將軍的恩情還不完＼😭／＼😭／＼😭／", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:35:13", "owner": "domo114514", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092074096737795, "text": "おいマクロン！おまえも中国の金が目当てか？なぜフランス国民はこんな男を大統領に選ぶんだ？", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:35:08", "owner": "yasuyuki.m9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539332711015675, "text": "At first glance, I thought you had gone to North Korea.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:32:10", "owner": "zhaos.anshi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034389599732982, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:32:09", "owner": "saichon_122", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18499574743076000, "text": "為什麼一直喊「我愛強姦」？", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:30:40", "owner": "isitabava", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959401986878173, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:29:54", "owner": "plrsabh_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937269939984211, "text": "This Chinese way of forcing children to be welcomed is so old-fashioned.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:29:10", "owner": "jack_m_12_j", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941956761961109, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:28:51", "owner": "yan._._tu", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17868935145482154, "text": "“French President Macron! You are visiting China. Please ask President Xi Jinping to enact animal protection laws in China for the sake of the Chinese people and animals! Please do so for the sake of China’s future!”", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:27:31", "owner": "luciana_bombonatti", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17942675385088146, "text": "我以为在朝鲜呢", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:26:31", "owner": "wulijiajianice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064367729630820, "text": "Welcome to China❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:25:08", "owner": "usa8888880", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18333736465208318, "text": "为什么品评论区这么多日本鬼子说捕杀动物", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:23:21", "owner": "hakubun_bowen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035464118724420, "text": "🇨🇳🐓👎🐖🐷", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:23:04", "owner": "yulr46gv3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878384677437144, "text": "这河北🇰🇵简直一模一样", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:22:47", "owner": "danielhu4245", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052739957357316, "text": "Impeach Macron", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:17:36", "owner": "swells7500", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118580494554865, "text": "给我干哪来了🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:17:20", "owner": "__zzzzzzc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18495557185078692, "text": "这是朝鲜吗？太可怕了", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:15:44", "owner": "yuhaichen73", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303188377254440, "text": "你若三冬来 换我一城雪白 想吃广东菜😋", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:13:07", "owner": "simon28280", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059174267279097, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:10:35", "owner": "aph_pdx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980280273944756, "text": "Bringing out kids to greet world leaders like this is so weird to me", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:09:42", "owner": "aph_pdx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992113713889089, "text": "🇨🇳🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:08:33", "owner": "terrytang24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958342594001681, "text": "crazy is this 2025？", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:08:23", "owner": "vincent_he_ho", "likes": 30}, {"id": 17861202342476554, "text": "以為北韓….", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:07:27", "owner": "yijuccc", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18539641204018387, "text": "Estimado presidente francés Macron, está visitando China. Por el bien del pueblo y los animales chinos, las relaciones amistosas entre China y Francia, y el futuro del mundo, ¡por favor dile al presidente Xi Jinping que promulgue leyes de protección animal en China!", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:06:03", "owner": "ricardoabalmori", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110285281534645, "text": "可哀想すぎるよ🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:05:57", "owner": "kiyokiyo358", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087591428476224, "text": "我以为是朝鲜😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:04:49", "owner": "shirley_wsling", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842488630637643, "text": "Thank you President Macron! ❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:04:41", "owner": "v1ccxz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903360418164453, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:04:00", "owner": "booooooooo__0901", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17842480416637694, "text": "北かと", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:03:01", "owner": "f8a9h3t7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100264138752473, "text": "👌👌", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:01:52", "owner": "awi28020100", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032851424732800, "text": "Est-il possible de laisser Mbappé venir en Chine pour disputer un match amical ?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:01:28", "owner": "865cook", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088283038789956, "text": "抗议日本掠杀海豚🐬", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:54:50", "owner": "zhoushuilian89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133001137487862, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:53:37", "owner": "yh2_ya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084488264029155, "text": "非得整这一出", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:52:42", "owner": "yinzhidanyin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048994922414131, "text": "🇫🇷🤝🇨🇳👏", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:52:27", "owner": "jacksondannykabushikikaisha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301508464270434, "text": "북한인줄 알았다 ... 공산주의 국가들은 모두 이런 건가 ? 😨", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:50:56", "owner": "yoonho5891", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18117331024559617, "text": "偉大的洗腦政策施行的不錯 知道要從小開始", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:49:43", "owner": "bee._.09.16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907607254273153, "text": "CREEPY", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:49:32", "owner": "outdoorchris05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854651737580065, "text": "我习大也是到自己主场了哈哈", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:49:29", "owner": "hanmeious", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068625104106803, "text": "Those poor children", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:48:00", "owner": "taejoonwon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956180512015389, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:47:56", "owner": "hotti.bom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903449092166622, "text": "Why people in here talks about animal protection? Just curious.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:44:06", "owner": "kojimashotaro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322196308174043, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:41:11", "owner": "madonna_de_roma_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17967706091838300, "text": "위대한 우리 조국 중화인민공화국 만세!😭🙌☀️🇨🇳!", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:41:03", "owner": "hust_ruicheng", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17881611666319265, "text": "🔥🇨🇳❤️🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:38:06", "owner": "yimwong1996", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862565197539600, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:37:01", "owner": "nhd.duc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057944402642243, "text": "一群小孩说的什么听都听不懂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:35:12", "owner": "zhangzekai_15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916566601238424, "text": "I thought only North Korea would have kids to do all these", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:33:56", "owner": "do.you.know.the_wei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024094898784147, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:33:47", "owner": "bob_4396666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004065146676471, "text": "No blk kids 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:32:22", "owner": "x_ray_outta_space_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062312009212594, "text": "打到日本军国主义！", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:29:34", "owner": "zhougang.zhou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18306002734268447, "text": "🤦🏻🤦🏻🤦🏻🤦🏻 pauvres enfants", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:26:39", "owner": "abregeeee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185239243350600, "text": "Long live CCP 🇨🇳, death to France and europe🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:25:16", "owner": "tanclincha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095886229841540, "text": "我操 朝鲜😅", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:24:48", "owner": "violetrhythmm", "likes": 403}, {"id": 18099511285800387, "text": "Literally NK atp🥀💔", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:21:16", "owner": "xp.rr03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883682503410000, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:20:44", "owner": "anne.schoep", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064237907419357, "text": "愿两个大国能带领世界走和平发展道路，中国人是热爱和平的国家。", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:20:29", "owner": "zhangshengli11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18401614459124310, "text": "Sir", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:18:00", "owner": "mahe.shkumar8575", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087783938067434, "text": "一类人", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:17:57", "owner": "hankchow1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073193714350094, "text": "老马喜欢吗", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:14:46", "owner": "amesiki9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073177949056894, "text": "💪💪", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:14:16", "owner": "su.jeon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843683122631086, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:13:43", "owner": "marco_czmd78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068914967107947, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:13:36", "owner": "marco_czmd78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086793052990000, "text": "欢迎老铁", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:08:16", "owner": "shjdhsjshdfjdjd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18313395928221857, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:08:03", "owner": "mcwarlord", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084350222015265, "text": "Macron has created a mini North Korea for XJP, and in the comments Japanese people are getting hit with a ‘dolphin’ counterattack over their protest about deer I guess", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:05:52", "owner": "sunchoi82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024469295595914, "text": "包飬你 包養你😁", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:05:22", "owner": "yaufung919", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064570517563584, "text": "🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:03:48", "owner": "linen_hle68", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153065161423025, "text": "你到丹东来", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:03:47", "owner": "ey.xioa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866756572507516, "text": "你若三冬来", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:01:09", "owner": "mr.harryluan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979752498936825, "text": "세계에서 제일 싫은 나라👉👉🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:59:57", "owner": "apple_a_run", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18425507272116416, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:58:08", "owner": "ethan_t1an", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18548207950023244, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:57:18", "owner": "csepanski91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114207679517618, "text": "Child be like 🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:54:55", "owner": "wesleyflan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049100405429467, "text": "Look like North Korean", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:54:45", "owner": "wunisaac", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17981054258945542, "text": "Low pao", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:53:18", "owner": "chenbiqian123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089649490767724, "text": "North Korean", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:50:30", "owner": "ethanlewis_m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079414690921890, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:48:00", "owner": "iikakakii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18438402379101060, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂🤦………..", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:44:51", "owner": "siling19892022", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17898018318357203, "text": "👏😁👏👏😁👏👏😁👏👏😁👏👏😁👏🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:43:35", "owner": "liew_4286", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079843397140279, "text": "你从丹东来～还我一层雪白", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:43:02", "owner": "ahzbjm23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914461324238595, "text": "this is crazy….", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:41:24", "owner": "jonycheung_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966648549844154, "text": "😍😍😍😍👏👏👏👏👏👏❤️🇨🇱🇧🇷🇨🇱🇧🇷🤍🤍🧸🧸🧸🧸💥", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:41:04", "owner": "general_cpf__91215323549", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17881801578423417, "text": "让他也去送外卖吧", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:41:03", "owner": "wymandljs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066449636436981, "text": "There he goes again,  bestie of terrorist Ayatollahs", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:40:44", "owner": "_.niloo.n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079626244925979, "text": "中国逼", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:39:23", "owner": "chuanyoudu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890784679384400, "text": "sb", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:39:15", "owner": "chuanyoudu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106637860727859, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:34:26", "owner": "xikoubu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932749768130945, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:34:24", "owner": "_marriinah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383671261146234, "text": "Vive l'amitié franco-chinoise !", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:32:39", "owner": "yjz691008", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947513344065357, "text": "变色龙🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:30:58", "owner": "yuexingyueyue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18291530737273328, "text": "朝鮮式歡迎", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:30:16", "owner": "yanliuxu2314", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990196983884186, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:26:00", "owner": "k1myon9", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18065929931620529, "text": "Great china 🇨🇳🔥❤️🇧🇩", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:25:34", "owner": "sahariya_md_farhan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091303385306100, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:25:08", "owner": "williamwei1004", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087458930061683, "text": "他们也知道这种举手欢迎的视频很傻，dy上都看不到", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:23:13", "owner": "wdream798", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109022242626908, "text": "吞了习近平的裤子！邪狗！", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:22:33", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18167433586377953, "text": "^_^ 控制我打的", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:22:14", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086456639064467, "text": "天天被这邪崇控制我扬嘴笑", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:21:47", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049006127695039, "text": "我拿剪刀剪烂你 习狗平我和你说", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:21:15", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142862143454470, "text": "我又没犯法，为什么要受刑？脱光彭丽媛的衣服！", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:20:46", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030840836554766, "text": "谁赔偿？", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:20:23", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085755284083473, "text": "一起床 即被人脑控 电咬牙 谁赔偿我？", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:20:06", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100069147795798, "text": "世界中からもっと嫌われる2カ国 フランスはアフリカの国々にフランを使用させ未だに搾取、中国は周辺国家と少数民族に対して威嚇、弾圧", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:18:59", "owner": "yoshiquinnne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955629472039537, "text": "creepy Xu Jinping kids", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:18:51", "owner": "perorinchosan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083535206017224, "text": "丢人 2025 年了还这一套……", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:18:31", "owner": "cheuk_chiu_hk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906359170151163, "text": "reminds me of north korea", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:16:26", "owner": "hc0888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985821237867889, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:15:29", "owner": "yongfeng840", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085170632088329, "text": "对面楼有人连续地大叫", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:15:12", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908147401276243, "text": "一早起身就被电磁波照着控制咬牙", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:14:56", "owner": "divachan218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082151251896016, "text": "Sorry I thought it was North Korea", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:12:42", "owner": "32234567_7791", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303681055267189, "text": "🫰", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:11:17", "owner": "monacofcmonzafc_asia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077373788586034, "text": "不知道的以为到朝鲜了", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:09:14", "owner": "dongjm123", "likes": 4299}, {"id": 18093491731924558, "text": "🇨🇳👏🔥🇫🇷❤️❤️👏🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:08:23", "owner": "polo_martis_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959064669881725, "text": "プーさんプーさんプーさん", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:06:52", "owner": "ta_ka1729", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095794303888251, "text": "中国、北朝鮮は国民に演技をさせてて似てますね〜過度な演出に違和感しかない", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:06:22", "owner": "momo.512st", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088821973942877, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:03:34", "owner": "loong_7777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099909322757103, "text": "God created other animals so human can eat !!! According to Bible you can eat beef, lamb, fish , .... Freely, you can even eat cheetah and puma. Nobody says no", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:02:50", "owner": "duyquangx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088221085799645, "text": "🇫🇷🇨🇳🇮🇩🌷❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:59:12", "owner": "nistawan09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988931451912569, "text": "Tellement naturel", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:58:04", "owner": "bernard.dagrant", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954925797906207, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:52:23", "owner": "burn.the.ship_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021673235790649, "text": "🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷👏🇨🇳🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:51:39", "owner": "olouamatjunior", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852967330594450, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:48:23", "owner": "kumasuke777", "likes": 16}, {"id": 18176282599365038, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:47:52", "owner": "youyou._.1006", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921292048193433, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:47:05", "owner": "youyou._.1006", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17864041182533307, "text": "north Korea", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:45:43", "owner": "urcgppp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930846406148394, "text": "MY BOY XI", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:39:42", "owner": "jamesbirdman228", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058296461641714, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:39:13", "owner": "lmao._.day._.l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099943042772853, "text": "中国も北朝鮮と同じだなww\n怖すぎる", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:37:29", "owner": "satoponkj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352125682205644, "text": "What’s the difference between China and North Korea😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:36:11", "owner": "beansver", "likes": 17}, {"id": 17857535163563708, "text": "The children there are like there’re in North Korea😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:34:21", "owner": "beansver", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17869309707412095, "text": "🇨🇳🇫🇷,Deux grands pays.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:34:05", "owner": "mcgrady0119", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087782129486578, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:32:42", "owner": "djmasahappy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061261745635526, "text": "Reste zy", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:31:44", "owner": "krimodu16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984287001763952, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:31:16", "owner": "cityatelier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084991583042834, "text": "🇫🇷🇨🇳❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:27:39", "owner": "__lefoudubus__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18102697000599581, "text": "やらせが酷い", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:26:20", "owner": "hiroshi.adachi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848481265581902, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:22:25", "owner": "nainspacial2766", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17982132653926086, "text": "😍😍😍😍🇨🇳🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:14:13", "owner": "mxsieunera", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980483958783009, "text": "北朝鮮かと思った", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:13:41", "owner": "platypus.83869", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850838725564278, "text": "Shame on you!", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:12:02", "owner": "henryhhan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100461841772817, "text": "北朝鮮かと思った", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:11:00", "owner": "yochimaru.o516", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184769050355990, "text": "子供たちは可愛いけどこの様子は不気味…自分の子供には絶対やらせたくないな", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:07:07", "owner": "tarochan585", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075450551219877, "text": "That's what they establish totalitarianism for", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:06:39", "owner": "vrepetskyi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958197057886349, "text": "Gloire à l’ommerta Chinoise 🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:03:50", "owner": "djangodecayenne", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065265161403938, "text": "怎么都在说保护动物🙃有木有人来关心一下法国南部Antibe的海洋公园里的两只虎鲸…", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:03:03", "owner": "aurore_chen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037581326725824, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:01:30", "owner": "pasdenom0007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975835794959256, "text": "Alors que la France... Le glorieux régime communiste chinois... @noctal_fr", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:01:11", "owner": "nobert_de_poche", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096147226848579, "text": "❤️🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:00:58", "owner": "plato._.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033044627729700, "text": "是在", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:00:06", "owner": "ukr.roc9910", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155655025410837, "text": "不累吗", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:58:43", "owner": "confucius177", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086348744107479, "text": "Et alors ? On aime marcher au pas mais pas sous la pluie ☔️ ?!", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:57:24", "owner": "benson031007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037187849707093, "text": "When I was 8 I'd also cheer this loud seeing Winnie the Pooh with my own eyes!", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:56:32", "owner": "jerzywilda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863161027537570, "text": "It’s really awkward…the kids in china are usually not like that", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:56:28", "owner": "singsingsongg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890782570380307, "text": "😅😅😅😅😅😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:56:19", "owner": "lanbos688", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18368830270080122, "text": "为啥都在说动物？", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:53:35", "owner": "max_701evo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872206474390773, "text": "Bon courage à la Chine pour supporter Macron lors de son voyage", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:53:19", "owner": "sarahgi414", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065336225540539, "text": "❤️🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:52:29", "owner": "roxannemindyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085344293001625, "text": "这下面怎么全是日本人 笑不活啦", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:51:51", "owner": "christina_ri7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109674844721565, "text": "🇨🇳❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:51:29", "owner": "ruiyaofeng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061393643553577, "text": "马克龙这个独裁者怎么还不下台", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:48:18", "owner": "wzbsw0923", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18070484573612110, "text": "1 300 000 000 de Chinois et moi et moi et moi.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:47:00", "owner": "nikovolta_1976", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075780895988496, "text": "北朝鮮か？", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:43:23", "owner": "manabe1122", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127766437449040, "text": "Kids are so well trained 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:43:21", "owner": "isabella_vancity", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057607487305973, "text": "🇨🇳❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:42:18", "owner": "_lewis_hamilton_44_fan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161332729402201, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:42:08", "owner": "spiderpig_david", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084564920010557, "text": "Japanese stop dolphin hunting", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:41:00", "owner": "feifan_zzzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079086673943153, "text": "Toi problème problème problème problème problème problème 🏗️⚰️🇪🇺", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:39:12", "owner": "papr1401", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17884289082411731, "text": "演好演滿", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:36:35", "owner": "zcu.u", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18078063298968794, "text": "Bills can't be this high bro 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:36:19", "owner": "hacked2bitz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916785976231591, "text": "Apoio dos políticos europeus à guerra da Ucrânia vs. políticos corruptos vs. só podem andar a ser subornados…\n*\nPor não quererem paz, guerra alimentam;\nSem olharem pra o tanto destruir;\nDo que a alguém tanto custou a construir;\nPorque ser com tal que os seus saldos aumentam!\n*\nAumentam, pelo somar dos milhões;\nCom que são pelo seu herói subornados;\nCom o que nos roubam dos ordenados;\nPra  após, em tal mamarem, tais mamões.\n*\nQue pena a isto não podermos provar;\nDevido a tanto dar para esconder;\nTodos esses milhões a nós roubados…\n*\nPor estes vis políticos malvados;\nQue um dia com é(F)e se hão-de (.)oder;\nPor a nós andarem a tão ROUBAR.\n*\n… pra não verem MORRER povo e soldados!\n*\nManuel Salvador Santos (Facebook)", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:36:10", "owner": "manuelsalvadorsantos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18325168666301237, "text": "Il ne mérite pas cet accueil", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:33:53", "owner": "wardenstyle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103594660662639, "text": "这个地可能比较烫", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:33:48", "owner": "kingmoregee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18538236295036888, "text": "✋😭🤚✋😭🤚✋😭🤚🤚😭✋", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:32:48", "owner": "xiaoheihei0417", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159729841719046, "text": "Monsieur le Président Macron, vous êtes en visite en Chine. Veuillez exhorter le Président Xi Jinping à promulguer des lois de protection animale en Chine, pour le bien du peuple chinois et des animaux. Merci pour votre soutien à l'avenir de la Chine.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:30:00", "owner": "xx_rkf_xx", "likes": 32}, {"id": 17971043417978072, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:29:18", "owner": "joost8080", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115034671565626, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:27:25", "owner": "ttn_haru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096149977880507, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:21:02", "owner": "gaey.sw27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065227007547329, "text": "\\\\ （＾Ｏ＾） //", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:19:21", "owner": "ryanl99061", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877018126443134, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:17:39", "owner": "legrand_gamin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056294762322169, "text": "何故ここ中国の動物虐待に関する日本語ポスト多い？😅", "created