ated_at": "2025-12-04T21:52:59", "owner": "claudio_1581", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18371133757083744, "text": "@hkuserr", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:52:52", "owner": "jetaimpa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843697411630770, "text": "NATO NEEDS UKRAINE 🇺🇦 💪💙💛 Ukraine in NATO NOW‼️ Young Europeans will not have a future if Europe does not do everything to bring ruZZia economy down, Stop buying trading with ruZZia. Stop talking ACT Ukraine is defending you cowards NATO, EU and Europe Shame @emmanuelmacron @bundeskanzler @secgennato @nato @eunic.brussels @eucouncil @europeanparliament you only have this life now make it count be on the right side of history show LEADERSHIP a WILLingness to DEFEAT ruZZia NOW‼️", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:52:22", "owner": "annakuznichenko1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18384412210196467, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:52:21", "owner": "jaysunbeland", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101538484740414, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:50:43", "owner": "tenzinskso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086086042833054, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:47:07", "owner": "alan_guille08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875456806446033, "text": "🔥🇨🇳❤️🇫🇷🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:45:22", "owner": "mr.ahmed.najati", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868339219490509, "text": "Vidéo grotesque !", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:43:45", "owner": "philippe.simon.75098", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866109733511727, "text": "This looks so weird and unnatural to me.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:43:41", "owner": "accepteality", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396646018121312, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:42:24", "owner": "richardperrat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003110906681740, "text": "中国这种知名的虐猫大国还需要争辩吗，你是眼睛长皮炎里了还是脑子被狗啃了😃抖音小红书每天一大把这种事，世界藤壶活该得不到世界尊重，你们这种臭虫就好好躲在华人圈抱团取暖得了🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:38:40", "owner": "salutelover", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368294107090282, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:38:35", "owner": "rmj111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016569761795775, "text": "Monsieur le président, Nous peuple français nous vous demandons de promulguer des lois pour la protections des animaux à vote homologue Xi Jinping. Cela prend une ampleur mondiale et vous avez le devoir en tant que président de nous écouter et de faire valoir nos droits. Nous voulons que les abus sur les animaux cessent car qui traite mal un animal ne peut guère traiter mieux l'Humain !", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:37:57", "owner": "_____aaaaaaaaah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071667878353235, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:36:51", "owner": "jouieyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920115949205698, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:33:39", "owner": "qwerhjjhh", "likes": 32}, {"id": 17865627915513866, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:33:38", "owner": "qwerhjjhh", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17842836165634324, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:26:56", "owner": "kaoutar.sohier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020463446612156, "text": "🌏🌍🌎🕊️⚖️", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:25:31", "owner": "s_solaisamy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367511743091959, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:22:48", "owner": "dr.jellofish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842373964638365, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:21:49", "owner": "jmyyy22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112984753604884, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:21:24", "owner": "maxmclennan04", "likes": 49}, {"id": 18166291552379715, "text": "北韓的即視感", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:20:48", "owner": "ronnie.th.wu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077596327961726, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:19:22", "owner": "0_antinatalist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092985215497617, "text": "C'est limite 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:19:17", "owner": "thomas.dmtl__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18167220583380336, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:18:56", "owner": "akram_amerali", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303332215266276, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:17:41", "owner": "david_tejada_869", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18098173078832436, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:17:35", "owner": "boarder593", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18550972423014966, "text": "Аллах накажи всех притеснителей мусульман 🤲", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:15:03", "owner": "milana._2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917443630230544, "text": "نماینده های مجلس و مردم محدود عراقی و حماس و اینها با کل مردم قم متحد هستند نقشه داشتند کل افغانی محدود ما را بفرستند در کنار شما آیسان که چشم شما به جمال اینها روشن شود بعد کل افغانی در کنار شما باشند از لابی سازمان ملل .بعد هم کل زنهای منطقه ما برابر کل  متن کامنت هایم که برای شما و بسیاری افراد. میگذارم  اینها تقلید میکنند در محافل سخنرانی میکنند با مردان عیاشی میکنند با صدای بلند آنچنان تقلید متن نوشته های من را بیان میکنند که طرف گمراه شود که من در آنجا بودم کل منطقه ما خیلی ترفتند دارند اینها چون از قدیم با بازیگران و کارگردانان زمان شاه در ارتباط بودند و لوکیشن فیلمبرداری و‌گریم از زمان شاه  در منطقه12تهران بود،برای همین منطقه ما مهم بود برای ساختن فیلم ،بسیار بازیگر و هنرمند شدن  اینها خیلی مکاره هستند بعد هم یک عده امار من و خواهرم را دارند که اصلن از خانه بیرون نرفتیم اصلن طوری برای ما حمله میکنند که  ما دیده نشویم بعد هم آدمهای هستند که دیدم سیاه پوست هستند از پشت ما میآیند با دست علامت میدهند که همه به ما بی توجهی کنند این رفتارها از قدیم برای ما کردن جدید نیست .زنهای خیلی بدی هستند که رفتارهای فاحشه وار دارند و مثل بازیگران تئاتر نقش اجرا میکنند شب هم تا الان از بیرون از خانه نبودیم از نوجوانی تا الان .به همه گفتن با ما دوست نباشند\nمن و خواهرم اگر کسی بود که به کمک یا توجه میکرد ،نیاز نداشتیم از ظلم هایشان برای شما کامنت بگذاریم\nمستقیم با صحبت کردن در فضای حقیقی مشکلاتمان را حل میکردیم .\nاین زنان حقه باز ظالم بخاطر شهرت و اعتبار ،کامنت های من  و خواهرم را مثل  بازیگران تئاتر و سینما بعنوان نمایش یا فیلم نامه\nمی‌بینند\nدر مکانهای مهم و افراد سرشناس\nبازگو میکنند با مردان اقوامشان\nابرو برای ما نداشته\nو افراد رو گول میزنند که مالک اکانت اینستاگرام من و خواهرم سهیلا هستن", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:14:44", "owner": "luxel1ight", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048018044446484, "text": "English (corrected):\nMembers of parliament, a limited group of Iraqis, Hamas, and similar groups are united with all the people of Qom. They had a plan to send all of our few Afghan people to be alongside you, Aysan, so that you could see them for yourself. After that, all the Afghans would be alongside you through the UN lobby.\nAll the women in our region use all the comments I leave for you and many others. They imitate me, speak in public gatherings, behave with indulgent men, and loudly recite my written words in such a way that people are misled into thinking I was there. Our whole region is very cunning. They’ve been doing this for a long time because they have connections with actors and directors from the Shah’s era, and filming locations and makeup studios from that time were in District 12 of Tehran. That’s why our region was important for making films. Many of them became actors and artists. They are very sly.\nSome people even have records of me and my sister, even though we have never left the house. They attack us in ways that make us invisible. I have also seen people, including black individuals, coming up behind us and signaling for everyone to ignore us. These behaviors are not new; they’ve been happening for a long time.\nThere are very immoral women who behave in a vulgar way and act like theater performers. My sister and I have not been outside since adolescence. They have told everyone not to be friends with us.\nIf my sister and I had support or attention from anyone, we wouldn’t need to leave comments about their oppression for you. We could have resolved our problems by speaking directly in real life. These deceitful and cruel women, for the sake of fame and prestige, see my and my sister’s comments like theater or movie scripts, use them, and, with the collaboration of men from their families, retell them in important places and to prominent people. They have no decency toward us and deceive people into thinking that the owner of my and my sister’s account is Soheila, my sister and I, these women are deceitful…\n---", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:14:42", "owner": "luxel1ight", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090728879304609, "text": "Merci Monsieur le Président. La France brille à l'étranger grâce à vous. 👌👍🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:13:37", "owner": "michelleseron", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100526332695851, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:11:30", "owner": "valoutreoo1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062276708198535, "text": "🇫🇷et la france,France, s'en occupe quand ?", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:10:13", "owner": "catherine.rag1956", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005708015822944, "text": "北朝鮮か‼️", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:05:00", "owner": "yoshihiro.emotion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096174904847891, "text": "North Korea???", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:04:17", "owner": "chrisguo__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17969403851829408, "text": "Блять, та що відбувається 😶‍🌫️😶‍🌫️😶‍🌫️", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:00:40", "owner": "kucherenko_vl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868479478493132, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:00:26", "owner": "usuf9970804", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366716473095299, "text": "🇺🇦🇨🇿🇨🇭❤️😇🙏😇🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:59:20", "owner": "pavlina_sch_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098389510631971, "text": "🤨", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:59:19", "owner": "clint_sikorski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980482374929094, "text": "🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:58:37", "owner": "usuf9970804", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086238125004706, "text": "(Gloire à Emmanuel) lol", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:56:58", "owner": "lafoudre96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18430475572109151, "text": "Haha les enfants ils en connaît hein? 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:51:47", "owner": "kimdd88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088019080808051, "text": "North Korea does it better 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:50:01", "owner": "unidentifiedap", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087141499971815, "text": "🇫🇷🤝🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:49:39", "owner": "guoceline", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049318004409291, "text": "❤️🇨🇳🔥🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:49:07", "owner": "chrisever_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933044914134076, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️🇨🇳🇫🇷👏🙏😍", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:45:27", "owner": "amramenqasmalariqi123bvcgmail", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085722035069759, "text": "Japanese 🇯🇵 friends in the comments section please tell me how to earn this money？\n\nI've read that the Japanese\nmedia are recruiting a lot of web people to produce and disseminate content that praises Japan and\nbelittles China for 1,000-2,000 yen a message, and it turns out that someone is already doing it! Did the Japanese government send you money in a timely manner? I would like to know if I should pay you immediately after posting or first? Waiting for your reply, thanks", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:44:19", "owner": "wanglisa53", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18091947193936284, "text": "EM = t.r.a.m.p", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:42:54", "owner": "joellazzari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937496652982926, "text": "🥴", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:41:40", "owner": "jakexsf", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18127453864509020, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:41:28", "owner": "antoine_nvc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18179231542320563, "text": "能不能表现自然一点？而不是全部是演戏", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:40:03", "owner": "tao0tim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088109990056413, "text": "🇫🇷❤️❤️❤️🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳🇫🇷❤️❤️❤️🇨🇳🇨🇳😍😍", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:39:46", "owner": "marc.d92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951788800027273, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:33:30", "owner": "sangay.ca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891825022245637, "text": "Ces jeunes enfants exécutent sans même savoir qui est ce type qui leur fait un clin d'œil 😩🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:32:59", "owner": "michellelegard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397393159131569, "text": "The people of Qom have placed magic in the Tehran dam and thrown dead bodies in it so that we all drink water with the taste of the dead, affecting us. The Afghans in Qom are originally Indian and Chinese, who write magic with jinn. They came to Iran a long time ago, over a hundred years ago. They used to do carpet weaving with prominent carpet sellers; the carpets are made of fine silk. These families are Chinese and Indian, who recite magic over water. Water dances in the air, or the Indians walk on water. They send jinn into everyone’s house. Also, all the neighbors in our limited area are people from Qom. They have become our neighbors. They place old sneakers, dry bread, black water stains, and anything else at our doorstep to bring jinn into our lives. In general, they throw soil from the dead in front of our house. They send dead soil from southern Iran to us.\nThey have a plan to deport my brother so that their families can be seen alongside you, next to the Saudis. Their thoughts are strange. They especially want to be seen with Aysan Eslami and want to marry her. They intend to deport my brother from Sweden. The Afghans in Qom and the Ghareh Bagh region of Ghazni are Uzbek and Pashtun.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:32:04", "owner": "a.m.i9.09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18512545009071829, "text": "Marion Maréchal\nElle présente le chantier comme « celui de la plus grande mosquée d’Europe » avec un “budget de 32 millions d’euros”. \nElle accuse le projet d’être “mené par Millî Görüs, une organisation islamiste turque” qu’elle décrit comme “sulfureuse”. \nSelon elle, cette organisation “promet un islam frériste, séparatiste et hostile aux valeurs françaises et européennes”. Elle invoque un lien supposé entre ce projet et un agenda “politique” ou “idéologique” venant de Turquie. \nElle considère que des élus — de gauche, du centre, voire “de la fausse droite” — ont accordé des subventions, permis de construire, prêts de salles ou terrains afin de faciliter ce type de projets, ce qu’elle qualifie de “compromission” vis-à-vis selon elle d’intérêts étrangers ou d’un “islamisme politique”. \nElle appelle les électeurs, lors des élections municipales, à “faire barrage” aux élus qui, selon elle, soutiennent de tels projets, en assimilant ce soutien à un “risque pour la sécurité, l’identité, la laïcité, la cohésion nationale”.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:31:52", "owner": "oran_demazis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094454446858224, "text": "Un voyage pour influencer le Président Chinois à larguer POUTINE le reste de sa visite est secondaire. Mais FLOP !", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:31:05", "owner": "snoopyvaillant", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869373427474350, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:27:53", "owner": "aurore_hartmann68", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051852179670995, "text": "🇫🇷👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:26:36", "owner": "juca.goncalves.731", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056474234648252, "text": "虚假的欢迎", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:20:11", "owner": "alfonso___zhang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086608672989020, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:17:09", "owner": "clovis.lcx", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18123203644524736, "text": "Un sourire ça ne fait pas de mal…", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:16:43", "owner": "chereil_luc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105147886638647, "text": "démission", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:10:30", "owner": "passam79", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032663612537215, "text": "🇨🇳🇫🇷❤️😍👏👏👏👏🇫🇷🇫🇷👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:10:25", "owner": "larapolidori", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18187340944347292, "text": "Tell me it’s AI😢", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:09:07", "owner": "bbbbbb_anthony", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047765879445599, "text": "It means that the Afghans in Sweden, because they came from Qom, have a lot of hostility toward my father. They even went to Sweden and ruined my father’s life. Since they identified all the wealthy Iranian men in Sweden, they approached them, became close to them, even became relatives, and then—by sabotaging my father—they improved their own lives.\nMy father started a restaurant partnership with someone named Sultan. After they learned a lot of cooking techniques from my father, they harassed him night after night. He felt as if there were supernatural beings in the house, and finally he fled from the city of Malmö. This is only a small part of the harassment he experienced.\nThere is a restaurant called Saffron where Pashtuns and Hazaras work together. They even use my father’s name to run the restaurant, and they made sure that everyone there is a cook now. They also paid special money to a restaurant near our home in Tehran, and many Pashtun and Indian women learned my father’s cooking style so they could become well-known.\nMy only mistake was posting a picture with koobideh; they immediately rushed to become cooks just to deceive people. They control my page. All the Afghans from Qom—because they have family connections with officials in Iran—created laws out of mischief so that when my father was in Iran, he had no right to work. They spread rumors and encouraged people to ruin the lives of my father and brothers by using women to manipulate men. These people in Qom claim to be religious.\nThat is why, according to them, all the Afghan sorcerers have settled in Qom.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:06:27", "owner": "a.m.i9.09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985182411916181, "text": "The Afghans from Qom who live in Sweden only want to be noticed, and they are plotting against my father in Sweden. One woman, in particular, filed a special and fabricated complaint against her husband, and her only goal was to have someone imprisoned. The Swedish police even sent this woman’s complaint letter to my father’s home, and then they deceived the entire building in order to ruin my father’s reputation with just one complaint letter.\nThe Afghan women in Sweden behave extremely inappropriately, and they lack proper manners and humanity. Their plan is to have my father imprisoned with a complaint that has absolutely nothing to do with him.\nAt one point, this same woman filed a complaint against her husband, and because he had divorced her and was staying at my father’s home, the authorities interrogated my father for two hours because of her complaint. Later it became clear that the Tajik Aminis and their daughters—who have strong connections and influence—were behind it. They use every possible tactic through the police to harass our family, and the Afghan embassy in Sweden is coordinated with them.\nThis situation feels very dangerous for my father and my brothers. Swedish law is very unfair and biased against men.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:06:24", "owner": "a.m.i9.09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18180811921359358, "text": "إذا هاجم بوتين قارة أوروبا سنحتل الروس وعمقهم هذاااااااااا وعد... إن تطغى نطغى", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:01:19", "owner": "tiger_show_6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155939104411514, "text": "رسالتي للسيد الرئيس التنفيذي لدولة روسيا العظيمة ولا عظيم سوى الله عز وجل. رسالتي له بعد تطلعي على تصريحات الأخيرة من السيد رئيس فخامته فلاديمير بوتين... ياااااااااااا صديقي هل طغيت أم ماذا قارة أوروبا بأكملها تقول هتحاربها.. ياااااااااااا هذاااااااااا ألم تنسى دولتك إستعمرت من طرف ألمانيا فقط... لم تدري هذاااااااااا... أنت محارب ع بلدك هذاااااااااا ما إحترمناه... الحرب الروسية الأوكرانية خلصت وفضت.. أنت تناقش المشاكل ولا حلول.. ولا ننسى ان أوروبا قسمت بلدك.. هل هذاااااااااا حقد ذفين... إلتزم حدودك رئيسك مات في إفريقيا من التالي...!!", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:00:45", "owner": "tiger_show_6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18386086531196522, "text": "Pov : tu achètes de la popularité sur Temu", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:57:54", "owner": "kharthylaire_epistemon", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18082748696025039, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:56:29", "owner": "guybouscary", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071897216345702, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:56:02", "owner": "cbrechard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873170221462244, "text": "Les pauvres gamins…..", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:55:20", "owner": "afeinchur_564", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050485682397358, "text": "Country Name?", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:54:55", "owner": "natqssss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955086925031296, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:53:44", "owner": "drongpa_vidyadhara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916454926249130, "text": "7 days of public mourning for the people of Iran, the capital of the Middle East, 7 days of demonstrations across the streets of the world to save the people of Iran from the evil of the criminal Jewish globalists in Israel, Europe and the Democratic parties in America and around the world\nThe majority of human and child killings in Iran are carried out by Jews and their fake enemy in the Iranian government, with executions, assassinations, air polluted with biological toxic gases, drinking water and toxic food, poverty and high inflation and artificial famine, drought, fires, unemployment, child suicides, trade in child body parts, rape of girls and thousands of other crimes\nWe call on the patriotic military to attack NATO, the criminal army of the hidden government, and move towards the Middle East and its capital, Iran. Dear people all over the world, come to the streets and chant against the globalists. Hackers expose the friendship between Israel and the Iranian government and their fake war. Iranians all over the world, come to the streets", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:53:16", "owner": "iranian_new_makers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114005836595369, "text": "❤️🇫🇷❤️👑👏😍☀", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:46:33", "owner": "abroyanstella", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009457832811567, "text": "Quel accueil chaleureux 👏👏👏👏 pour notre Président français 🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳 qui est en visite en Chine.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:46:33", "owner": "alexisjmhebert", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902785573317701, "text": "🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:43:18", "owner": "psych4_xx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090769454503835, "text": "Omg🙀🙀🙀🙀🙀", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:41:18", "owner": "adri_avr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059237555270130, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:39:33", "owner": "lasynaloa__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078580879945979, "text": "Quelle mascarade, on disait qu il fallait se passer de la Chine et voilà notre bande de clowns qui débarque en Chine !!", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:38:20", "owner": "philjames2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887823352403705, "text": "Cette belle image pour dire qu on renonce a la langue francaise. Jusque il y a 25mn le nom de cette ville était : Pékin.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:38:16", "owner": "vincent_1234_mfy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18173418496329809, "text": "❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:38:09", "owner": "thembela4289", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088521961795858, "text": "Ele fez a mesma coisa na visita do Lula a Pequim", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:36:24", "owner": "douradokleber", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948514956932674, "text": "Welcome to my lovely country ❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:35:35", "owner": "fragrancy_elva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098861953840698, "text": "Il cherche des gens pour la guerre parce qu'il sait que nous on ne se laissera pas faire", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:29:01", "owner": "duchatellelouis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541831396058683, "text": "T'as pas dit Zipp !!", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:27:47", "owner": "juillet_1970", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295980193258945, "text": "❤️🙌🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:27:39", "owner": "gilbert_seton91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18217402252308343, "text": "Si seulement ils savait qui ils ont devant eux", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:27:20", "owner": "duchatellelouis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104594389642890, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:25:58", "owner": "donn_liri_zabeli", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096693829674558, "text": "They brought out all of the Temu workers for this💀", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:23:29", "owner": "marc0_der_deutsche", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065116142387583, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:22:28", "owner": "weadley_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135174310468736, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:21:03", "owner": "skywalker_oo4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945697030077013, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:20:11", "owner": "mostafa_gabr30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140704753459845, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:20:05", "owner": "kirtsygan2004", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866539759508975, "text": "Quel honneur 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:16:12", "owner": "lamireaupeewee", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17962908548860914, "text": "Monsieur le président, veuillez demander à la Chine de promulguer des lois contre la cruauté animale, c'est terrible les vidéos de tortures d'animaux qui circulent sur internet !", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:15:57", "owner": "ummummimane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031795118534700, "text": "🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵🇰🇵", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:11:51", "owner": "tran55886", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18319591249216068, "text": "ifoukoi manu", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:11:01", "owner": "enz0_qsda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078424223231954, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:07:25", "owner": "markouchryssa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183768049347633, "text": "🫶🏼", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:06:07", "owner": "factuallyknowledgeable", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084885656107879, "text": "Macron et Merz ont averti zelensky que les États-Unis pourraient \"trahir\" l'Ukraine dans la question des territoires. Ils disent que vous écouterez les États — Unis-vous perdrez du territoire.\nD'accord. Zelensky doit écouter Macron et Mertz, puis il va perdre toute l'Ukraine, et c'est beaucoup mieux.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:06:06", "owner": "snowlazyleo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088498451304687, "text": "Candace Owens!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! ❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:03:18", "owner": "diaphanumsverige", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106625941574657, "text": "🔒🔒🔒🔒🔒", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:01:47", "owner": "hh122234", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922203223054560, "text": "Candace Owens!!!!!! ❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️ 🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:59:49", "owner": "abbelilles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970058472824940, "text": "Qu'est-ce que cette parodie pathétique de Napoléon a à offrir à Xi Jinping? Une économie effondrée? Faible Note? Un drapeau arc-en-ciel? L'appel à épouser des femmes plus âgées qui étaient des hommes? Pourquoi tout cela en Chine?", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:58:50", "owner": "snowlazyleo", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17990969849886547, "text": "Xi jiping fait attention il est rusé ce renard", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:55:39", "owner": "minlaeti_uk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067188929127232, "text": "Emmanuel Macron lors d'une réunion avec Xi Jinping a proposé d'imposer un moratoire sur les frappes de la Fédération de Russie sur l'énergie ukrainienne.\nLe niveau IQ79 a fière allure.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:53:48", "owner": "snowlazyleo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18101555020683829, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:53:04", "owner": "susanav_bkll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367704397088279, "text": "❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:45:54", "owner": "fardous_hasan_sani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087007591821027, "text": "Laissez les enfants tranquille !", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:45:54", "owner": "maeliss.rineva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18387598042183803, "text": "This looks like north korea", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:43:37", "owner": "limaoooooooooooooo", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17958927986881468, "text": "🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:41:45", "owner": "chaliervincent", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999198594838981, "text": "🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:41:39", "owner": "chaliervincent", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842116180640294, "text": "🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:41:34", "owner": "chaliervincent", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18163777495387252, "text": "🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:41:28", "owner": "chaliervincent", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18387465712179998, "text": "😍💐🇪🇬🇨🇳🇫🇷🕊❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:41:16", "owner": "ahmedtiyatro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18203616958317205, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:40:27", "owner": "davidzhou20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104960605634306, "text": "English Translation  A woman from Afghanistan living in Sweden keeps making complaints, especially against her husband. She reports to the police almost every day, saying that her husband threatened her, and with these depressing reports she has also bothered all of this man's friends. This woman intentionally plans to have her husband imprisoned. She has joined with many Afghan, Kurdish, and Rashti immigrant women, forming a group whose purpose, according to her, is to kill all the men, enslave migrant men, or sexually assault all migrant men — both poor and wealthy. As a result, Sweden is no longer safe for men. In general, Afghan women especially, after having two children with their husbands, cut off the relationship, but due to severe psychological issues and improper upbringing, they create lies, stage fake rape scenes, create violent scenes of beatings, and trap men. They even turn Swedish white men into sexual slaves through Swedish law. Moreover, many Pashtuns, Uzbeks, and Arabs from Hamas in Sweden, according to her claims, assault men as well.  Then, men who are afraid of being imprisoned sometimes write false addresses to avoid arrest warrants, causing the police to send complaints to someone else’s home, creating problems for the homeowner.  According to these claims, human rights are being violated in Sweden against all migrant men, and men have been subjected to assault.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:37:13", "owner": "luxel1ight", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062167487630852, "text": "the best welcome macron received so far 😁", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:36:41", "owner": "yuliyalee12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541863121042657, "text": "🇹🇷🇦🇿2 Aralık 2025: Bulgar Türk kelimesi, Türk ismi, Türk adıdır - eğer bu adı daşıyırsınızsa ama gavur dilinde danışırsınızsa onda dönmesiniz. Sizin dininizde yalandır ve özünüzde bunu yaxşı bilirsiniz. Eğer bunların hamısını bilirsenizse və ona rağmen bu yalanı sürdürmeye devam edirsinizse onda siz şeytana 😈 uymusuz. Siz sığınmacı olarak geldiniz biz size yer-yuva, yemek, elbise ve iş verdik - siz yediniz içtiniz çoxaldınız ve ilk imkanda bizim Bulgarıstandaki dede-babalarımızı öldürüb onların yerine geçtiniz! Bize bunu eden - bunu her kese eder. \nBütün Türk devlətlərindəki bütün Urus məktəbləri bağlanmalıdır həmdə həmən sonra yox. Əvəzində Türk məktəbləri Urusiyətə açılacağ. Sonra yox indi. Mən bilirəm ki bu məktubu FSB oxuyur və ona görədə deyemezki oxumayıb.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:36:26", "owner": "ahan62808", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988257438747337, "text": "Respect 🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷❤️🇫🇷🇫🇷❤️🇫🇷❤️😍😍😍😍🙏🙏🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷❤️🇫🇷🇫🇷🔥🇫🇷🇫🇷❤️🇫🇷Respect Emanuel Makron great 🇫🇷 king 🇦🇱 🤴 👑 🦁 😍😍😍😍😍🙏❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:36:01", "owner": "gloria77421", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873904405457940, "text": "Why there is no protection law in China ?", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:35:43", "owner": "dr.ardinsalva", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18125558401513305, "text": "Save animals in China:.::", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:34:58", "owner": "dr.ardinsalva", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086198219061386, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:33:34", "owner": "jessy.cnt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077195909596707, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:33:26", "owner": "joey__974", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087979318986014, "text": "西朝鲜", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:31:52", "owner": "llleeo776", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935050081073689, "text": "可怕", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:31:48", "owner": "duguyilv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035087945721041, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:29:30", "owner": "life_ray1993", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18380921890147974, "text": "👏🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:29:19", "owner": "hesammmm3000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091464776310307, "text": "Emmanuel is sooo nice honour him with love and affection of chainA...🇨🇳👏👏👏👏👏of course our xi knows everything", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:26:11", "owner": "sairamkurapati2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971419188979238, "text": "Démission!", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:24:39", "owner": "passam79", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925603276042603, "text": "Doentio 🤢", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:21:28", "owner": "telles_osbourne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088298176948885, "text": "Never forget summer palace 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:21:00", "owner": "darrenn.chen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304178425249630, "text": "Bienvenue en Chine 🇨🇳🤝🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:19:48", "owner": "hanks_liu._03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923497507051280, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:18:22", "owner": "rashik_raj_parmar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844975996622334, "text": "Так ще ж нема різдва", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:18:08", "owner": "lifeis_2026", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970971498974169, "text": "North Korea ?😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:16:51", "owner": "_nicklastay_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868467532483499, "text": "中国有虐待动物？请举出例子", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:12:37", "owner": "hyman_wong_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057959957303777, "text": "❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:09:03", "owner": "massod_____m_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927781717154794, "text": "👁️👁️", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:07:24", "owner": "zhongzhong9674", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055897106329493, "text": "I LOVE YOU MACRON 😍😍😍 pls unregonize palestine tho", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:05:36", "owner": "char_r15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903093289320542, "text": "真丢人啊，西朝鲜", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:02:36", "owner": "mikeliu029", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060603587259769, "text": "C'est horrible ! mais quel bonheur absolu Emmanuel ! quel choix merveilleux des puissants se moquant des vies simples. des pétales de roses dans une baignore d'or ?  On ne saura jamais ces détails particuliers  qui flatteraient les latins.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:01:00", "owner": "vigierph", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893901661376202, "text": "法国总统你去的到底是中国还是朝鲜？😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:00:26", "owner": "linag_mini", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926214634036299, "text": "@clementzatt13 laissez les enfants , la jeunesse en dehors de ça Mr Macron 😌🙌🏾", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:58:12", "owner": "leoangekamga", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17921354274199205, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:56:25", "owner": "shahana.chechu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061431380551348, "text": "每个国家都有好人坏人……大部分人民都是爱好和平，所有的偏执只是相互文化的不了解！", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:55:12", "owner": "aj.un203", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18202956238320428, "text": "我说以后能不能别安排这些环节了除了领导老登爱看没人爱看好吧😑尴尬的一批", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:55:04", "owner": "_._melquiades_._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950972923053073, "text": "Est ce que la monarchie va bien ?? 😊👍", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:51:50", "owner": "franapois", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075790967004856, "text": "Instead of talking behind Donald Trump his back, you idiot, you better work together to find peace and not working against and talking about Witkoff. Seriously, FFS you are an idiotic leader. WORK TOGETHER WITH USA AND FIND PEACE INSTEAD OF TALKING BS ABOUT THEM AND WARNING ZELENSKY. ARE YOU STUPID ? WORK TOGETHER! WAKE UP! @emmanuelmacron", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:50:29", "owner": "jonathan_mai1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992210298883923, "text": "Pitié  garder  le...😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:48:00", "owner": "petite_didi12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864946420517166, "text": "Après se faire ridiculiser par usa dont l'Europe est le premier client, l'URSS partenaire de la Chine, qui tous ne pensent qu'a une chose : soit nous envahir economiquement et detruire nos emplois, soit nous detruire. Quand on aura compris et que l'Europe comprendra qu'il faut maitriser l'immigration et etre jne grande puissance militaire, alors ils nous lecheront les pieds. Pour l'instant c'est l'Europe qui leche les pieds des grandes puissances. Ce grandes puissances qui nous piratent, nous observe et se marre. Tant qu'ils auront de l'argent a tirer de l'europe on pourra peut etre survivre. Voila ou nos gouvernements, mzis aussi nos politiques et nos syndicats nous ont emmenés a toujours regarder l'interieur en se croyant puissant et seuls au monde.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:47:22", "owner": "par_adams", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073224530339908, "text": "欢迎来到中国🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:46:40", "owner": "zwq301012350", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981757407923430, "text": "متاسفم ریس جمهور چین به استقبال مکرون نیومد 😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:46:11", "owner": "babak_leila13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075107897254067, "text": "درود  بر فرانسه  و ایران", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:45:20", "owner": "3aeedjafari70gm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152418115425697, "text": "🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇮🇷🇮🇷🇮🇷🇮🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:45:12", "owner": "3aeedjafari70gm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950224582056987, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:44:09", "owner": "jolieinparis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104616121680103, "text": "Kids are forced and traumatized", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:43:33", "owner": "akshath_rang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185383168352072, "text": "🇨🇳🤝🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:42:52", "owner": "jasondu94700", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960127444009754, "text": "🇫🇷🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:39:56", "owner": "le_fils_de_reserve", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079520186139507, "text": "Jss ko", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:36:23", "owner": "bounlhom", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18031125443534939, "text": "Il en est réduit à aller à l'autre bout du monde pour se faire acclamer", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:35:32", "owner": "assier.benoit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009365507818365, "text": "不跳会死吗。把小孩调的跟傻逼一样站着挥挥手不就够了", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:32:20", "owner": "angelinatsui_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 1831546