 "Il est pour le moins contradictoire de constater cet engouement soudain au Japon pour le bien-être animal, tandis que la chasse à la baleine se poursuit dans le pays.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:23:38", "owner": "jiji.ss", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17951845821026269, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:22:02", "owner": "rinziyk.a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18514875553071066, "text": "🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:21:56", "owner": "katsun_draw", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18184918150345173, "text": "Content de voir des enfants endoctrinés ...", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:21:18", "owner": "beryl_laine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952299526050928, "text": "🇫🇷🇨🇳😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:19:36", "owner": "gidiyang2020", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18021338129788277, "text": "Il est en Corée du Nord ou quoi??", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:19:21", "owner": "mathilde.le.blond", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072037118524514, "text": "🇨🇳🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:17:21", "owner": "lasekoutkast", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948923097932767, "text": "🇫🇷Ayuda para Haití y un presidente nuevo urgente por favor 🇺🇲🇭🇹🙏💔☮🫂❤😍Erzulie Dantor ❤ Bilolo ❤ Haitian Voodoo ❤ Ayuda para el gobierno de Javier Milei en la Argentina por favor 🇦🇷🇬🇧🏑☮🫂❤😍paz a Ucrania ☮ ❤ 🫂 Paz a Israel ☮ ❤ 🫂 muchas gracias ☮ ❤ 🫂 🌍☮🫂❤", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:15:26", "owner": "imaz_aguez", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17905444653292074, "text": "Какое отвращение, когда детей заставляют махать цветами и радоваться искуственно", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:14:59", "owner": "dastan09248", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085806611066770, "text": "@aymeric3907 vive l'omerta Chinoise 😍🇨🇳👏", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:13:36", "owner": "tymeo_bvcn_ren", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18061748543200226, "text": "❤️🇫🇷🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:13:29", "owner": "annamoseleyperez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18409825747185760, "text": "We call on China to first uphold respect for individual dignity and basic human rights, and secondly, to stop supporting evil Russia.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:09:38", "owner": "aki_chansan007", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18031837418541106, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:08:33", "owner": "evan_pnh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18330727039208541, "text": "Free Taiwan And East Turkestan!", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:07:26", "owner": "serdardemir_67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100245931747582, "text": "🫡", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:07:16", "owner": "lucasdeno_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17930617257138602, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:04:57", "owner": "victor.pmrr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18389043955178700, "text": "😍😍🇫🇷🇫🇷❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:03:28", "owner": "wassim_w17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043077722495896, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:03:20", "owner": "kckartwork", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096739558893727, "text": "Will you be passing out little red books? Also — about Candace Owens… no comment yet??", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:03:10", "owner": "kckartwork", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954120466023855, "text": "I'm from Lebanon living in Sichuan Chengdu", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:02:49", "owner": "shopping.china0404", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088032493951881, "text": "Can see you in Chengdu", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:02:24", "owner": "shopping.china0404", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845600974604353, "text": "♥️♥️♥️♥️♥️♥️!.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:02:20", "owner": "aboutworldland", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100123501796139, "text": "Quand tu réussi un strike sur Wii sports", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:01:46", "owner": "robaiiiiiiiiiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134542069427951, "text": "Le rêve de Macron 🇨🇳🇨🇳🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:56:23", "owner": "human_travel88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114435916584322, "text": "Long live King Macron❤️🇫🇷❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:56:06", "owner": "abbasfarajollahii", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17972410613976100, "text": "Merci pour partage Le President Macron 🇫🇷🇨🇳", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:54:20", "owner": "andreaskuhnert72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18537708979008419, "text": "越来越像朝鲜了，学到将军的精髓了", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:52:07", "owner": "zhaowujiang00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085818082838882, "text": "🇺🇦🇺🇦🇺🇦🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:52:01", "owner": "1163.misha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104268370677721, "text": "🙏🙏🙏 Мир", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:51:46", "owner": "1163.misha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064496537627024, "text": "À part claquer l’argent de la république dans vos voyages superflus vous servez à quoi???? A rien ça vous réussissez à fâcher la France avec le monde entier ### démissionner ### dissolution ###frexit #### otanexit", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:51:29", "owner": "brunogenevois", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18558980227010802, "text": "Oh, il est pas content le macron, pas de bisous bisous pas de caresses dans le dos. Pas d'embrassade pas de collades. Triste journée pour le squatteur du palais de l'Élysée.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:51:18", "owner": "marinhodiasteixeira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546232621044591, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️🇫🇷😍😍", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:51:17", "owner": "ardackanian_amir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100349101774352, "text": "✅👍🏾", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:50:49", "owner": "the_cosmo_french_congo_paris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067435793425076, "text": "🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷❤️❤️🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:43:42", "owner": "yahw_eh2020", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914229613252022, "text": "🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷 🇺🇿 🇺🇿 🇺🇿", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:43:16", "owner": "abdu5554", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000968072836813, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:41:54", "owner": "soomurfette", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886279003404605, "text": "disco", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:38:28", "owner": "chengchingyu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987853272910440, "text": "Minions!", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:38:14", "owner": "o.arasius", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18207975913314160, "text": "Macron rotchild boy. Now Ukraine will sell you to Rasha. We will