 of them", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:53:58", "owner": "fam_whole_world", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873326983386469, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:53:03", "owner": "mehrdad_taheri_avarvand_2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126995794507850, "text": "To President Emmanuel Macron, President Xi Jinping, and the people of France and China, \nYour nations embody heritage, vision, and resilience. \nMay your leadership and unity continue to inspire humanity toward dignity, creativity, and peace. \nLor Mehrdad Taheri Avarvand – Masjed Soleyman", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:53:02", "owner": "mehrdad_taheri_avarvand_2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002486351826533, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:51:26", "owner": "avvalboevakbar", "likes": 16}, {"id": 18145985539449862, "text": "🇨🇳🇫🇷❤️👏👏👏👏👏🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:51:23", "owner": "silvinhaclint", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852831544592645, "text": "Is this why you wanna ban social media and implement chat control 2.0? To turn the EU into the people's republic of China?", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:49:47", "owner": "iaminvictuss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076995302206015, "text": "JPPPPPPP", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:48:32", "owner": "postbadjean", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066019028403429, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:48:18", "owner": "ibrahim_90005", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367902943089117, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:45:43", "owner": "gurilde", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17849665470574218, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:45:08", "owner": "mahamadsardarblbas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112078462607054, "text": "Great day 🐰🪄🎄🍿❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:44:28", "owner": "mohamad1994yes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962340684865849, "text": "🇫🇷🇨🇳💪", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:42:26", "owner": "vic.693.30", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17864963175444767, "text": "Ça alors", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:41:39", "owner": "miaoumiam6613", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048415325688431, "text": "Макрон в Китаї?", "cr