{"media_id": 3781491279570445774, "shortcode": "DR6jkiYCKXO", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DR6jkiYCKXO/", "taken_at": "2025-12-06T08:17:29", "caption": "Day 6- British Advent Calendar 🇬🇧\n\n#christmas #adventcalender", "owner_username": "tinogiaccotto_comedian", "owner_id": "51806811508", "likes": 2853, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0060_DR6jkiYCKXO\\DR6jkiYCKXO_20251206_081729.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17941858307960950, "text": "😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-06T08:45:21", "owner": "kris.macg24", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17969351222975792, "text": "Ci sta!😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T08:34:30", "owner": "anninapat", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065025812431046, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T13:24:06", "owner": "sspring_breakerss", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18037525418722038, "text": "Only 19 days left!", "created_at": "2025-12-06T08:19:16", "owner": "tinogiaccotto_comedian", "likes": 23}, {"id": 17855383929577985, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T08:34:28", "owner": "smmmileforme", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18009300269655504, "text": "😆😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T18:22:24", "owner": "xsarahhickey", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18294970309263528, "text": "Legend", "created_at": "2025-12-06T08:56:21", "owner": "crowleyengel", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18415989847189467, "text": "Getting benefits Is the most British thing", "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:37:47", "owner": "alessia1984yeah", "likes": 113}, {"id": 18114868162578090, "text": "Thank you for embracing the culture 🇬🇧", "created_at": "2025-12-06T11:20:02", "owner": "funk_master_deluxe", "likes": 36}, {"id": 18073851326040745, "text": "Same same but different 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:09:12", "owner": "renee_veronica80", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065215289571025, "text": "Wait till you realise why the billionaires love immigration from low wage countries so much and why record numbers of British people are quitting the workplace. I know it’s not the reason (wealth inequality) but you can’t have low wages without people willing to accept them (immigrants from second and third world countries) 🤔", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:20:49", "owner": "tarnieturnip420", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18097319485834675, "text": "blessed to be the first one here", "created_at": "2025-12-06T08:28:59", "owner": "_.elizabeth.h", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18065281439181442, "text": "Oh my god 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T22:14:02", "owner": "_adelicieux", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083680756873734, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T17:14:11", "owner": "butchbtw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103262671670519, "text": "😂😂😂😂 same thing but different 😂😂 indeed!", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:33:47", "owner": "lizebueno", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18194167282328141, "text": "Goddamnit @ilaria_pugi and @ciarara09 !!!", "created_at": "2025-12-08T21:30:31", "owner": "underdeconstructionphotos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871432429469703, "text": "Benefits? Damn your stealing all the reform voters jobs 😔 god forbid they might have to get a job and not simp to millionaires", "created_at": "2025-12-08T08:34:50", "owner": "rachael_louiseox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18410769211185373, "text": "You are British now!", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:15:05", "owner": "patsanchez56", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930335692158876, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T23:17:40", "owner": "sharonxx_iluv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145962832439311, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:55:01", "owner": "maiarapereiracunha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055517345334744, "text": "You're adapting well. 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:47:09", "owner": "l_la28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939110371130129, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:42:00", "owner": "melindadreamer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101249599683885, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:23:32", "owner": "dubstepzoe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097952719840651, "text": "😂😂😂👏", "created_at": "2025-12-06T11:07:57", "owner": "pedagog_uk", 