{"media_id": 3746710947462171843, "shortcode": "DP-_cF7jMzD", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DP-_cF7jMzD/", "taken_at": "2025-10-19T08:37:14", "caption": "Maui Wowie 😽\n#kottbussertor", "owner_username": "shin.sucker", "owner_id": "7922645891", "likes": 2566273, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0062_DP-_cF7jMzD\\DP-_cF7jMzD_20251019_083714.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18083298646955175, "text": "Comments are proof that there are always people who hate you, especially when you're just happy and want to have fun. That's exactly when you're doing everything right! Do your thing No matter what as long you don’t harm anyone or yourself. 🫶🏻🫂\n\nBy the way, I've removed right-wing extremist and discriminatory comments because I won't allow them to have any space!", "created_at": "2025-10-20T14:45:50", "owner": "shin.sucker", "likes": 50379}, {"id": 18081197864480883, "text": "Love those girls girl who were hyping her up in bg 😩😩", "created_at": "2025-10-20T10:59:25", "owner": "mohima.shawty", "likes": 141029}, {"id": 17939385282084638, "text": "I was hoping and praying that shit was gonna break😭", "created_at": "2025-10-20T03:12:16", "owner": "niilokaarre", "likes": 23272}, {"id": 17923833831156119, "text": "10/10 fit", "created_at": "2025-10-19T20:26:59", "owner": "ninaimamovic_", "likes": 8414}, {"id": 17870797575377503, "text": "Holding your body weight with one hand is impressive", "created_at": "2025-10-20T14:52:17", "owner": "hayvi_hr99", "likes": 71710}, {"id": 17842331295622322, "text": "I was hoping she fall", "created_at": "2025-11-19T22:53:32", "owner": "pal292023", "likes": 143}, {"id": 18422453653119683, "text": "Das krasseste an der ganzen Geschichte ist einfach dass sie auch noch wirklich stolz darauf sind und glauben etwas geleistet zu haben 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:53:50", "owner": "dembauernseinetochterihrsohn", "likes": 17}, {"id": 18004911461819483, "text": "She gave us a face, a body, 