8774051012664, "text": "my balls are jingle", "created_at": "2025-12-13T16:55:23", "owner": "b4k4n11_010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18340676689227276, "text": "If you look closely you will see she's actually playing the drum 🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-13T16:53:16", "owner": "i.have.kids.for.sale", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063515426206384, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T16:45:41", "owner": "sensationalcoco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067595867570296, "text": "Don't ask me the color of anything, besides two", "created_at": "2025-12-13T15:43:30", "owner": "chafii002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065739917395078, "text": "Definitely not weirdo pervert behavior", "created_at": "2025-12-13T13:51:19", "owner": "azim_bishbohl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090084277779222, "text": "@", "created_at": "2025-12-13T12:03:44", "owner": "theylove_greg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089372773783709, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T11:37:43", "owner": "lucyver111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989202627874946, "text": "Drums", "created_at": "2025-12-13T09:24:18", "owner": "ccgb4455", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958022803008695, "text": "🍑👀", "created_at": "2025-12-13T09:18:29", "owner": "xxderpamonxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993924156897167, "text": "Now..this is the walk we need in glasgow", "created_at": "2025-12-13T08:32:05", "owner": "simps_on77778", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052516385377829, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T07:56:44", "owner": "stilllxckingurheart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322248391174664, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T07:08:31", "owner": "tomizou_true", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080259713233729, "text": "Viva el patriarcado", "created_at": "2025-12-13T05:19:02", "owner": "tucho_photography", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111846643613922, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T05:05:03", "owner": "mrtyshkls", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854344576591665, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T05:00:33", "owner": "rogue_usec", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920207191237178, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T04:38:51", "owner": "helsosmarh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883747507307526, "text": "Goku", "created_at": "2025-12-13T04:22:55", "owner": "xdarw1nx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185836627352393, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T04:21:45", "owner": "thebayharbourgooner_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18204778138316203, "text": "😘😘😋😋😋👅😋😋🤤🤤🤤🤤🤤🌹🌹🌹", "created_at": "2025-12-13T04:14:54", "owner": "yordin4540", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296971216285471, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T04:09:43", "owner": "yagiiz290", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085027013115344, "text": "creen que estudia enfermeria??", "created_at": "2025-12-13T04:00:39", "owner": "sebas_caimn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084930311047634, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T03:17:26", "owner": "coffee4rclosers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065769590571852, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T02:44:39", "owner": "yoshida_skylove", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050359793676367, "text": "私たちは国も人種も言葉も宗教も異なるが、たった1つの目的でここに集まった。", "created_at": "2025-12-13T02:31:55", "owner": "tpamtgm5pm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305381761254021, "text": "The one girl you see on vacation then you never see ever again but someone y'all still text 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-13T02:19:19", "owner": "beananator669", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892358023246180, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-12-13T02:02:56", "owner": "mikillaoc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127014277507389, "text": "Thick Latinas Would bang that drum", "created_at": "2025-12-13T01:41:27", "owner": "nb74oz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077741483193084, "text": "creo que me estoy volviendo hetero", "created_at": "2025-12-13T01:41:17", "owner": "worsnsos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101234113777433, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T00:56:26", "owner": "p0c0ch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176711539369686, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T00:38:08", "owner": "vivrs_420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120690481541281, "text": "Yes insta I’m very interested", "created_at": "2025-12-13T00:03:04", "owner": "finance.and.maneuver.ne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896826919360635, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T00:02:50", "owner": "el_cano_7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106761250629672, "text": "Hey! It’s me, Goku!", "created_at": "2025-12-12T23:54:45", "owner": "reimgrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999254760697165, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-12T23:48:09", "owner": "ilovegrovefrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941519388964168, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-12-12T23:36:00", "owner": "carlosbatistados12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015042566802811, "text": "悟空の顔が真っ白に…", "created_at": "2025-12-12T23:31:30", "owner": "tyytmhh08018", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843390478639453, "text": "Man, what a thick as- is that goku?!", "created_at": "2025-12-12T23:29:15", "owner": "thehonorj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077426213252620, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-12T23:21:27", "owner": "cortesjimenezomar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073519889584739, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-12T23:10:29", "owner": "dillon_peter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873475135465622, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-12T22:55:38", "owner": "brodyrabalais", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063737126445071, "text": "pq caralhos o goku tá ali", "created_at": "2025-12-12T22:19:50", "owner": "_ocouto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067631873139428, "text": "I am suddenly Ecuadorian. VIVA ECUADOR", "created_at": "2025-12-12T21:53:58", "owner": "ofaculi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086776073102001, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-12T21:53:27", "owner": "ofaculi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145955608451887, "text": "IS THAT MUI GOKU!?!", "created_at": "2025-12-12T21:27:50", "owner": "grim451208", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895615810224432, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-12T20:59:46", "owner": "the_jeff_man01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088396216793251, "text": "Peak Mexican behavior", "created_at": "2025-12-12T20:51:52", "owner": "simplescribe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889390450397101, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-12T20:47:09", "owner": "not_so_creepy_stalker101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 180950720