", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049469417406840, "text": "I would bang that drum", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:32:14", "owner": "jabbaadams", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084272062844799, "text": "Not to be rude or place my sight at the wrong place but, her right thigh had a scar/scratches because of the pointed drum's part. I hope she treats them right away. 😧", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:28:29", "owner": "dwipeae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067182671626245, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:10:59", "owner": "tonsuphatphuangngern", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862219939541819, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:06:27", "owner": "clou_dfur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18523466854064863, "text": "Someone give Goku some senzu beans 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:05:25", "owner": "gb_knightrider", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089873431990691, "text": "que puta", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:38:19", "owner": "yakuza_fitness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076320494219777, "text": "La carnazza❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:32:13", "owner": "wubik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893241673369730, "text": "Looks like she doesn’t wipe", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:33:32", "owner": "locnessn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17860245708552937, "text": "Mexico moment", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:21:56", "owner": "the.great.melon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005129336818553, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:18:12", "owner": "allah1017bsm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094505083705067, "text": "They have a parade every day because of her", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:00:07", "owner": "monkedonke.tv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066140714426804, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:46:11", "owner": "_ilye6se_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18306168385265750, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:45:46", "owner": "jeicoalmonte", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076641578190035, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:36:24", "owner": "entr0per", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078113840237126, "text": "Does she need papers ?", "created_at": "2025-12-0