{"media_id": 3780802801052598218, "shortcode": "DR4HB2yir_K", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DR4HB2yir_K/", "taken_at": "2025-12-05T09:27:17", "caption": "How often do you run late because you can’t find your keys? \n\nI do (more often than I’d like to admit) That frustration inspired this speculative design project.\n\nWhat if small and easily-to-lost objects could be more visible? Through animations and an AR experience, I explore how we might find them faster and avoid being late\n\n#speculativedesign #blender3d #blenderanimation #augumentedreality #animation #motiondesign", "owner_username": "mityukovaaaaa", "owner_id": "35461817826", "likes": 47, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphSidecar", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0066_DR4HB2yir_K\\DR4HB2yir_K_20251205_092717_1.mp4"}, {"type": "video", "path": "0066_DR4HB2yir_K\\DR4HB2yir_K_20251205_092717_2.mp4"}, {"type": "video", "path": "0066_DR4HB2yir_K\\DR4HB2yir_K_20251205_092717_3.mp4"}, {"type": "video", "path": "0066_DR4HB2yir_K\\DR4HB2yir_K_20251205_092717_4.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": "18100773328686300", "text": "I need this 🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:25:50", "owner": "ikubiak", "likes": 1}, {"id": "17966566124843318", "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:07:39", "owner": "polinananananananananana", "likes": 1}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["speculativedesign", "blender3d", "blenderanimation", "augumentedreality", "animation", "motiondesign"]},
