l___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135602899478304, "text": "I was waiting for the Mooo", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:08:33", "owner": "knockyouoff.k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928847593021814, "text": "I’d love to invite you to consider the hope and forgiveness that Jesus Christ offers. He died, was buried, and rose again for our sins, giving us the chance to experience true forgiveness and everlasting life. The books of John and Romans are a wonderful place to start, and there are plenty of free Bible apps if you don’t have a bible. Some verses to reflect on: John 14:6, John 1:29, 1 Corinthians 15:3-6.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:06:54", "owner": "jrw3243", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845637898606675, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:01:16", "owner": "bintemafia44", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103872079662359, "text": "This is funny", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:58:28", "owner": "thtgaleve", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035936183742025, "text": "Fck that what’s onnem feet’s", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:55:25", "owner": "ismokeyopotna21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995596341849168, "text": "Do nigga next", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:36:10", "owner": "unc_tonio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18214788418312640, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:35:37", "owner": "mmmunny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087369424966614, "text": "That is not make PIXAR logo like that", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:33:37", "owner": "nlacey3529", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080653199336803, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:33:01", "owner": "detroithairdresser", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023982929600706, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:29:18", "owner": "kassidybanks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18318236599220959, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:25:00", "owner": "sonyateclai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048196673679646, "text": "Pixarrrr vibes", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:24:50", "owner": "_justcallmemy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097166899871937, "text": "Nah this too hard 😂🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at":