{"media_id": 3769456538163425408, "shortcode": "DRPzMABgTCA", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRPzMABgTCA/", "taken_at": "2025-11-19T17:44:33", "caption": "📺 The Wolf of Wall Street (2013)\n\n⏱ Runtime: 2h 59m\n🎭 Genre: Biography | Crime | Comedy | Drama\n\n---\n\n📈 Ratings:\n\nIMDb: 8.2 / 10\n\nRotten Tomatoes (Critics): 80 %\n\nAudience Score: 83 %\n\n---\n\n🎥 Plot:\nBased on the real-life memoir of Jordan Belfort, the movie follows his rise from a young Wall Street stockbroker to a corrupt, drug-fueled, unbelievably rich mastermind of financial fraud.\nAs Jordan (Leonardo DiCaprio) and his insane partner Donnie Azoff (Jonah Hill) build a shady empire, things get out of control — fast. 🚁💰💊\n\nExpect:\n\nWild parties\n\nOutrageous scams\n\nFBI chases\n\nLegendary comedy moments (yes, the quaalude scene 😵‍💫)\n\nAll directed by Martin Scorsese with his trademark style.\n\n---\n\n🎦 Where to Watch:\n\nAmazon Prime Video\n\nNetflix (in some regions)\n\nApple TV, YouTube Movies, Google Play (Rent/Buy)\n\n---\n\n💡 Why You Might Like It:\n\nOne of DiCaprio’s best performances\n\nFast, stylish storytelling\n\nHilarious + shocking at the same time\n\nIconic scenes and quotes (“Sell me this pen.”)", "owner_username": "moviesvibes001", "owner_id": "66446888069", "likes": -1, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0076_DRPzMABgTCA\\DRPzMABgTCA_20251119_174433.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18057401612288046, "text": "💎Welcome Our Telegram Channel 🍿\n🏆Watch Free Movies & Web Series", "created_at": "2025-11-23T12:34:42", "owner": "moviesvibes001", "likes": 66}, {"id": 17864907615435274, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T03:17:56", "owner": "manisandhu1083", "likes": 26}, {"id": 18092463943934232, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😍😍😍😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:41:11", "owner": "tanatagitara03", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18031074317727309, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:05:03", "owner": "hinarao8484", "likes": 19}, {"id": 1810478