 "text": "very beautiful🩷とても綺麗🩵", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:52:58", "owner": "yoshihiro2407", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17941219170088853, "text": "Que fofura! 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:08:01", "owner": "christianrobin1212", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083067098105666, "text": "😍💐", "created_at": "2025-11-26T13:10:10", "owner": "pepeartiga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051662258356437, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:15:37", "owner": "gioragips", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302768917271036, "text": "Merry Christmas and happy new snow 😂❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:17:54", "owner": "beowulf_1970", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997684632702761, "text": "Beutiful ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:03:41", "owner": "juaneliasvillarrealsalin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002875022832526, "text": "@roxithepilot A gdzie czapka? Będziesz chora! 🤪", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:05:37", "owner": "emwu1987", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049481810680703, "text": "😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-12-02T05:54:09", "owner": "khairodivaio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908463901269904, "text": "Stunning ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T13:48:28", "owner": "wainis66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159600475403793, "text": "👏🔥🔥❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:26:50", "owner": "turkey.jewellery", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866677900427007, "text": "Quality capture. Safe travel", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:07:06", "owner": "ronhammersly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18192557338332872, "text": "How about flying a long way south for a total Season reversal, ha ha!!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:44:19", "owner": "tarquinio.joe", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17983031957923589, "text": "My Love 😍🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:47:11", "owner": "marcoseuro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101224108780600, "text": "Perfecta 🔥😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:23:50", "owner": "legal_braian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057554570308507, "text": "❤️😍", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:58:54", "owner": "holarjaroslavml", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043481519715595, "text": "Have fun on Poznan airport...it was cold to come home...🌡🥶...✨️👌🏻😊👍🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:16:39", "owner": "flyfisherguy2023", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063574355442003, "text": "😍🔥❤️wow Roxi, Look, your plane got snowed in!😄😄❤️❤️❤️😘😘😘😘", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:31:17", "owner": "adrigeo33303", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155677003371865, "text": "Nice job", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:40:04", "owner": "bstwrth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098074282811127, "text": "😍😍nice", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:59:29", "owner": "riderscem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029503535754799, "text": "Elza, to Ty? 👀", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:54:41", "owner": "soltysiak.mz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983902257916191, "text": "You are the light in my eyes, and in my heart I will always love you. You are the cure for my wounds, and I will never forget you. Days pass and I wait for your voice, days pass and I long for a glance from your enchanting eyes, and life goes on and I love you... I love you... I love you.❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:41:42", "owner": "kaderfetouhi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17993226275854977, "text": "your phone name its brand what📱?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T13:11:09", "owner": "esmailmhmmdainummsswrns", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193529656328075, "text": "THE MOST B E A U T I F U L AND TALpENTED ROXI ✨️🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:15:33", "owner": "gioragips", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129859462494698, "text": "Nie ma wyjścia trzeba skrobać! 😉", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:05:45", "owner": "bartoszkij", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085963489966390, "text": "👋🛬 il ne reste plus qu'à faire un bon dégivrage de l'avion. 💥🌞🌞🛫❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T08:37:54", "owner": "dimitrithor2", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["pilot", "pilotlife", "pilotlifestyle", "winter", "snow", "pilotgirl", "womanpilot", "femalepilot", "ryanair", "buzz", "avgeek", "aviation", "boeing", "boeinglovers"]},
{"media_id": 3778584613309125565, "shortcode": "DRwOq-eDBO9", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRwOq-eDBO9/", "taken_at": "2025-12-02T08:00:09", "caption": "牛津大學出版社（Oxford University Press）剛公布 2025 年度詞彙——不是新科技、不是新潮語，而是一個令全球網民都感到似曾相識的字眼：rage bait（挑釁言論）。\n\n這個詞在過去一年使用次數急升三倍，被形容為「最能反映今年網絡文化走向的詞彙」。根據牛津語言團隊的定義，rage bait 指的是刻意使用煽動性、冒犯性語句，藉挑起憤怒來刺激互動與流量的內容。簡單說，就是「越惹你嬲，越有人睇」。\n\n為何它會當選？\n近年社交媒體的演算法愈來愈精準，平台會以互動率作為推送指標，而「憤怒」這種情緒往往比「讚好」更能令用戶停留。無論是爭議性貼文、令人不服氣的短片，抑或是激起兩派網民對撼的留言區，都是 rage bait 。\n\n雖然不是所有網民都會被牽動情緒，但牛津語言部指出，這種利用憤怒換流量的做法確實在不同平台日益普及，成為今年網絡討論的核心現象之一。\n\n其他入圍詞：同樣反映當下生活方式\n今年同時入圍的，還包括：\naura farming（營造氛圍感）\n指透過穿搭、拍攝手法、生活佈置等，營造出一種「氣場」或「氛圍」，以吸引關注。\n\nbiohack（生物黑客）\n指透過飲食、訓練、科技儀器等方法提升身體或精神狀態，屬於新興的生活方式概念。\n三個詞放在一起，像把我們的日常照了個現代版的 X 光：\n\n我們努力打造形象、提升效率，同時亦在瞬息萬變的網絡環境中學習如何應對挑釁與情緒勞動。\n\n牛津年度詞彙＝一面看清時代的鏡\n年度詞彙從來不是潮語大賞，而是觀察社會文化的窗口。從 selfie、goblin mode 到去年大熱的 brainrot，每一個詞都捕捉到某種集體心態。今年的 rage bait，則提醒了我們：網絡世界不單是資訊平台，也是一場情緒的競賽。\n\n面對愈來愈精密的演算法，牛津語言團隊建議保持警覺——不是要遠離網絡，而是學會辨識哪些內容是真的資訊，哪些只是「想你嬲」。", "owner_username": "seedenjoy", "owner_id": "61724457040", "likes": 92, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphImage", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0078_DRwOq-eDBO9\\DRwOq-eDBO9_20251202_080009.jpg"}], "comments": [], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3777342378911275975, "shortcode": "DRr0OFiCRvH", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRr0OFiCRvH/", "taken_at": "2025-11-30T14:52:22", "caption": "lost all aura", "owner_username": "jadefii", "owner_id": "65714591413", "likes": 1049580, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0079_DRr0OFiCRvH\\DRr0OFiCRvH_20251130_145222.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18184475722354875, "text": "She has a promising career in metal music", "created_at": "2025-12-03T16:20:41", "owner": "simoneqa", "likes": 16182}, {"id": 17914945512234474, "text": "I know her... that's ME", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:03:27", "owner": "bruisedbeans", "likes": 76079}, {"id": 17917984038212514, "text": "I have learnt to say \"thank you\" everywhere in such a situation 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:22:16", "owner": "saihang._", "likes": 6301}, {"id": 18351967555200570, "text": "\"Oh you too!\" and they doesn't have any purse with them 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:25:37", "owner": "zeeamuze._", "likes": 22880}, {"id": 17895573114358990, "text": "I always say thank you even when im the one giving 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T08:17:42", "owner": "imceileen", "likes": 2242}, {"id": 18066846764410109, "text": "When its the pretty women too 😭🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-03T22:18:01", "owner": "questkiller_3277", "likes": 1962}, {"id": 18026836181769682, "text": "me", "created_at": "2025-12-02T11:49:59", "owner": "shivangipithisaria", "likes": 124}, {"id": 18120485065479520, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T02:56:39", "owner": "vaganosss", "likes": 13159}, {"id": 18003864704748629, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T08:54:25", "owner": "sada_wa_amm", "likes": 4066}, {"id": 18060885569556780, "text": "At least you responded I completely ignored them by accident 😭😭 they probably think I am a mean person 😞", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:12:26", "owner": "itsmi._.shalaka", "likes": 2426}, {"id": 18231661369305983, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:41:42", "owner": "yeonjuntwerkingontherunway", "likes": 851}, {"id": 18422407360114760, "text": "Someone said sorry and i replied thankyou 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:24:39", "owner": "radha_lune", "likes": 256}, {"id": 18063199853548852, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T08:54:12", "owner": "sada_wa_amm", "likes": 352}, {"id": 18100352857774866, "text": "Me", "created_at": "2025-12-01T21:42:52", "owner": "ari.bdski", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17894666565226161, "text": "Me coreee😭✋️😭✋️", "created_at": "2025-12-01T18:18:43", "owner": "samiksha._jalotra", "likes": 191}, {"id": 18112536952526248, "text": "Two random girls in a mall told me “excuse me you are so pretty” I was like uh-oh ok- t-thank you", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:12:32", "owner": "yoonie_bearz", "likes": 70}, {"id": 18049161971412545, "text": "Same", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:14:05", "owner": "chazeemgordon", "likes": 354}, {"id": 18088794215314405, "text": "SHES SO ME", "created_at": "2025-12-01T12:41:05", "owner": "nebras_kavun7", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18088515760959521, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T05:04:13", "owner": "nyxii.o", "likes": 351}, {"id": 18167386945347675, "text": "😢 always", "created_at": "2025-12-03T13:28:29", "owner": "xohnd", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17894554962226183, "text": "I felt this on another level", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:06:06", "owner": "lionschild3", "likes": 72}, {"id": 18147288043436365, "text": "me", "created_at": "2025-12-06T13:16:14", "owner": "rooosesr", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18116155684573563, "text": "said good evening while walking past someone today. he just said \"hi\" wayy to quickly", "created_at": "2025-12-01T05:16:56", "owner": "oaktreewc", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18066143081419660, "text": "Dude a really pretty girl said she liked my fit and I froze", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:38:08", "owner": "x.tiddies4life", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18440142196103148, "text": "\"Cool jacket\" \"I know\" 🤦", "created_at": "2025-11-30T22:48:48", "owner": "taideneko", "likes": 47}, {"id": 17972449904812419, "text": "got told im pretty, became deaf, and responded with “oh”", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:21:28", "owner": "maanyapatawari", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18083795495121997, "text": "Lady: I like your bag.  Me: (panicked and too loud) thanks.  End my suffering", "created_at": "2025-12-01T06:06:15", "owner": "juliet_krzysik", "likes": 88}, {"id": 18299079274285855, "text": "Yea when somebody accidentally stepped on my shoe in public and they said sorry I replied with a welcome...🥀", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:48:44", "owner": "rimayea.ha", "likes": 27}, {"id": 18081469892322928, "text": "As a chronic walk-by-complimenter, I promise we’re giggling as we walk away and are not thinking about your lil brain toot!!", "created_at": "2025-12-04T06:51:00", "owner": "comfymels", "likes": 88}, {"id": 18074585261352737, "text": "Me", "created_at": "2025-12-07T11:50:20", "owner": "bbellaa.xx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18114862690585431, "text": "😭 absolutely me", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:40:19", "owner": "reveloeved", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17889403203258920, "text": "When someone smiles at you and you don't smile back in time😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:00:09", "owner": "juweldavis", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17933509221077037, "text": "@rodrigoacc08 this is just me", "created_at": "2025-12-07T00:53:45", "owner": "baixu_xin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18146857072434548, "text": "THAT'S ME", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:00:28", "owner": "serenely_niya", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077255690241757, "text": "Nothing is Worse than failing another baddie", "created_at": "2025-12-02T08:20:15", "owner": "_kashvi.eats_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18171683152374271, "text": "felt that in my soul", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:41:09", "owner": "_yururin__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17842839291651966, "text": "Fr that's me😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-12T14:06:16", "owner": "rocksy_yt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068461997106740, "text": "Defense mode", "created_at": "2025-12-01T05:34:33", "owner": "nyxa.rae", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18075338963015786, "text": "Fr😔", "created_at": "2025-12-13T00:56:15", "owner": "arindi_dea_ananda", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074590151204428, "text": "literally all engineering students /j", "created_at": "2025-12-01T12:03:38", "owner": "abrahambrandonp", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18116643049565533, "text": "\"Thank You\" and \"You too\"... Simple", "created_at": "2025-12-11T04:01:49", "owner": "stevenr543", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17962216226862715, "text": "SAME GURLLL😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T09:21:42", "owner": "mirahhee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18191599696336735, "text": "i had a lana del rey shirt on once in school and some girl said “omg i love lana del rey!” and i said thank you 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:40:53", "owner": "yurilover66", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17880752673331276, "text": "@amrutaa__a 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-11T02:36:59", "owner": "ashish_jagtap__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18050291636680661, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:20:04", "owner": "marwan_mkrch", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17952217842048722, "text": "@hglmira", "created_at": "2025-12-10T15:00:07", "owner": "mochi_thefrise", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066238484423301, "text": "Guys pls help, what can I say other than thank you in this kind of situation😭", "created_at": "2025-12-10T04:43:01", "owner": "xiaohu2311._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138297664461856, "text": "Yes", "created_at": "2025-12-08T21:31:18", "owner": "adyclimbs", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18545605492022232, "text": "Me oh my days", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:08:09", "owner": "0x.cupid.x0", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18296456719272785, "text": "me", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:17:20", "owner": "trippydoesntart", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18082212485041882, "text": "I'm crying", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:19:09", "owner": "yk_lee619", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17935937721130657, "text": "That’s me Lamo lil every time 💔", "created_at": "2025-12-07T08:26:20", "owner": "ranj_d7", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17903478102319696, "text": "So meee 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:57:15", "owner": "shezaaanbhatia", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18068828435107907, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:20:09", "owner": "callme.kimchi07", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17874421611378696, "text": "Fr😭 that's my problem.My brain doesn't work fast enough in social situations", "created_at": "2025-12-09T05:50:17", "owner": "_kpop_stan_____", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17958710447881069, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:12:36", "owner": "kanta_t33", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18007480613662437, "text": "Wth I live there one night I swore I heard someone yell that", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:10:19", "owner": "v1c.y24", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17905888659295069, "text": "@duane_also_allyson 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:22:41", "owner": "darthjosh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073321598201608, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:11:31", "owner": "thisistarunzz", "likes": 64}, {"id": 17976156293963494, "text": "@alexi_priv44", "created_at": "2025-12-08T10:09:28", "owner": "liv.via8", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17877850926440328, "text": "@tcatalysts the fact that this happened to me once", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:23:15", "owner": "vinsyvines", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092782259494499, "text": "@nathaliemknutsen @linnea_iren", "created_at": "2025-12-07T00:06:59", "owner": "philipmk06", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17953933470046144, "text": "ME", "created_at": "2025-12-06T08:04:54", "owner": "ouyang.emma", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18093944323904197, "text": "No, cuz after that i just want them to be my bsf 😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-02T08:06:18", "owner": "jeprica09", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18089792089754291, "text": "I hate THAT 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:05:11", "owner": "a7med_.3d", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18064243871183380, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:00:10", "owner": "giftynifty", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17970140252975611, "text": "me everyday😇", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:50:53", "owner": "j.113ee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844362595624248, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T11:03:31", "owner": "coronxtion_", "likes": 41}, {"id": 17856423213569776, "text": "R E A L", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:30:15", "owner": "alex_up_at_midnight", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18318018448221812, "text": "@inhoign đc cả ngta chào mình mà ko nhận ra ai nữa...", "created_at": "2025-12-05T16:29:04", "owner": "_ngw.aahcu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989500041912064, "text": "she is so me😭", "created_at": "2025-12-05T14:00:33", "owner": "setayesh.all2", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081269132154438, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:55:20", "owner": "rocketmillionyt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18348585307206153, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T23:50:27", "owner": "laaaauren._.meeeek", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18066491345385348, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T01:05:36", "owner": "mclarenp1lovee9", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100147150756976, "text": "“You too” to everything 🫠", "created_at": "2025-12-04T04:05:47", "owner": "yangsco", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074038364339588, "text": "stop recording me🙄🙄👾", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:14:23", "owner": "idk.its.just_me", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17866335306508995, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T05:50:20", "owner": "kaito_yaps", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17842769220634225, "text": "SHE JUST LIKE ME FR 🥀🥀🥀", "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:53:37", "owner": "httpsmedss", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17923725819179628, "text": "Just know i meant to compliment you back 😓😓", "created_at": "2025-12-03T23:27:59", "owner": "_emmariee__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18155840536407041, "text": "@flowerfae77", "created_at": "2025-12-04T10:33:01", "owner": "fs4yysuv4j8", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17855609154528453, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T15:31:46", "owner": "death_region", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18107418562645558, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T05:47:16", "owner": "laura.bryndova", "likes": 61}, {"id": 18068928650377196, "text": "Happened to  me .... twice ( I hate it)", "created_at": "2025-12-02T09:54:04", "owner": "chaar_packet_maggie", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18089346484759048, "text": "i was once asked 'how are you' and replied 'yeah good yeah good uh'", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:44:19", "owner": "thonkusbonkus", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18347270194203014, "text": "I know this place", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:37:36", "owner": "nathancheng1100", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17926260855036661, "text": "When i realise too late i responded in my head and not with my voice so now it sounds like i’m ignoring them 💀", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:09:41", "owner": "bleblea._.2ndacc", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17946161261942871, "text": "Social anxiety in hong kong🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-04T03:47:24", "owner": "lchm.apt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18182071411360688, "text": "@httpscwwzz", "created_at": "2025-12-02T15:04:26", "owner": "monchi_3333", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078074594224743, "text": "Once people asked me in the elevator \"are you going up👆 oder down👇?\" me:\"up👇\" (I was going down😛🫩)", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:45:05", "owner": "veronikaa_blnn", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17855736177573017, "text": "All the time I am like: \"ugh.....pahamxjxosmdl.....ugh yes thank me you us...please ahh\"", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:43:42", "owner": "just_random.anja.shit", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18083781251319743, "text": "Same 😭🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-02T01:11:29", "owner": "tamana.a_2010", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17950302359917719, "text": "Don't remind meee 😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-03T12:36:40", "owner": "parulll_s", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18141230893409682, "text": "Caine road mentioned🤑🤑🤑🇭🇰🇭🇰🇭🇰😻😻😻👍🏼👍🏼👍🏼", "created_at": "2025-12-01T08:24:56", "owner": "_.lukeakaluke._", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18134963671489107, "text": "Ohhh that building l used to live there", "created_at": "2025-12-01T05:48:04", "owner": "swirly.beetle_3", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18095135995860794, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:31:06", "owner": "zyrillmicosa", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18103857952737543, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T08:14:12", "owner": "naraswinniethephu", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18077330564331818, "text": "That's definitely me😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T11:42:00", "owner": "silver_wolf364", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368835421093988, "text": "Me except is the 3 languages in my mind crashing out and nothing comes out on time bc my brain cant decide if this is a German or English or spanish interaction 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-13T18:41:40", "owner": "sarahs.daisiess", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032741849754211, "text": "FAHHH😭", "created_at": "2025-12-13T15:31:02", "owner": "lyphuongmeo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18441381421102813, "text": "pls just act like u don’t saw me haha", "created_at": "2025-12-13T15:26:33", "owner": "ch_____________chrd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081409523138909, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T15:09:35", "owner": "legg_zo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870637378474280, "text": "Literally me", "created_at": "2025-12-13T12:48:30", "owner": "itsmoefi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080612912134249, "text": "or like when you can’t hear them because it’s so loud 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-13T12:23:33", "owner": "krustykat7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089273561286703, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T11:03:59", "owner": "stick.jpeg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072317993360344, "text": "Always pre-firing a \"huh?\" in those situations", "created_at": "2025-12-13T08:36:52", "owner": "richard_fbd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066541592145553, "text": "‘ They’re brain work faster enough, it’s just that sometimes even the strongest one’s need one hugs with supportive friend too ‘.🤍🧠✨", "created_at": "2025-12-13T07:41:33", "owner": "salmahzibia_xu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105017302710471, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-13T07:00:55", "owner": "faibee_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144115963453070, "text": "Mid-levels", "created_at": "2025-12-13T06:47:02", "owner": "holami.mak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087330677475536, "text": "me too", "created_at": "2025-12-13T04:41:22", "owner": "ixelbunny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892712647382806, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-13T00:41:41", "owner": "oke__e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892708765382098, "text": "PERNAH, HABIS ITU MALU BGT. DI TANYA APA JAWAB APA", "created_at": "2025-12-13T00:02:16", "owner": "quinnsey_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859484776501413, "text": "oh nice cruise😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T23:49:39", "owner": "chrstiangio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858989083560730, "text": "“Hey there” thank you.. FVCK", "created_at": "2025-12-12T23:34:00", "owner": "demehh._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850375378607964, "text": "They just dont give me time to think 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T22:27:18", "owner": "vaughn_loves", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092667793912281, "text": "me at a rave when someone tries complementing me", "created_at": "2025-12-12T19:43:42", "owner": "ravebabybella", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852506881597626, "text": "嗯對就是 我沒有應變能力 所有事情都需要提前預演一邊否則無法執行 而這種臨時狀況會讓我死機…", "created_at": "2025-12-12T19:29:44", "owner": "ninenine_aub", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062721557241667, "text": "A few weeks back I got photos of my beloved ex bf printed so that I could keep them in a medallion to cheer me up when I’m down, the shop clerk said \n« -Wow that’s a lovely looking person !\n-Thanks ! *weird awkward silence for 5sec* »\nfucking *thanks*\n\nI still dreadfully think of that interaction", "created_at": "2025-12-12T18:38:26", "owner": "the_chechen_cowboy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18327113095244428, "text": "@jenniferbollipo14 HAHA", "created_at": "2025-12-12T18:31:45", "owner": "aakanshyarout_1807", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880894618329891, "text": "我", "created_at": "2025-12-12T18:12:22", "owner": "fannjji", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367906066095233, "text": "A teacher told me merry christmas when I finished a test and I said okay, thank you", "created_at": "2025-12-12T16:43:42", "owner": "_koi_anna_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978709410943315, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-12T16:16:51", "owner": "rloc1840", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055630268334493, "text": "😂😂😭", "created_at": "2025-12-12T14:02:33", "owner": "_wtfhyasp_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848692204588224, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-12T13:27:16", "owner": "ane_lis123se_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901267648338485, "text": "Some girl once complimented my eyeliner so I wanted to compliment her back, but she didn't have any... So instead I panicked and complimented her eyes💀 the look she gave me is unforgettable", "created_at": "2025-12-12T12:37:21", "owner": "sunflowter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546630679058754, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-12T12:05:06", "owner": "sam_14.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065719319173049, "text": "Fumbled so hard😭🙏🥀", "created_at": "2025-12-12T11:10:48", "owner": "rekasa1113", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302211847248567, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T08:26:16", "owner": "abdelali5449", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100093060812614, "text": "Its weird if i reply \"you beautiful\", if someone praise me like that", "created_at": "2025-12-12T08:16:43", "owner": "x_wo.ow_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903951895316571, "text": "Same problem bro 😢", "created_at": "2025-12-12T08:10:05", "owner": "dead_delicate_stalker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112951567591732, "text": "Im sorry", "created_at": "2025-12-12T08:07:02", "owner": "lipa_lidan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075060944018622, "text": "🤷🏻‍♂️dude it’s Hong Kong and you don’t give compliments, you criticise people (lmao", "created_at": "2025-12-12T07:01:13", "owner": "chl.0424", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118232545564829, "text": "For me it's the being deaf/shitty auditory processing having me me like !?!?", "created_at": "2025-12-12T05:20:26", "owner": "mikayla_005", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073016189057049, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T03:47:53", "owner": "manoele__fonseca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928123618155756, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-12T01:21:45", "owner": "feral4arielle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060065528278102, "text": "thats literaly ME😢😢", "created_at": "2025-12-11T23:21:09", "owner": "airaa__eunji", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295726789275604, "text": "I just mash all the words I want to say into one word. instead of “hey thanks I appreciate it” I just go “heythnkseyeprecit”", "created_at": "2025-12-11T22:16:28", "owner": "defeochops", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103760407663648, "text": "Can relate", "created_at": "2025-12-11T21:59:02", "owner": "leggymclegface", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113022391594456, "text": "FR ME..💔", "created_at": "2025-12-11T20:25:11", "owner": "neco_mushroom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016489166630492, "text": "Soo me😭😭😭💔", "created_at": "2025-12-11T20:23:13", "owner": "urv_sisina4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094212067920198, "text": "\"next time, I'm gonna be ready!\" famous last words💔", "created_at": "2025-12-11T19:49:34", "owner": "natal_ka254", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114179032582891, "text": "Im the you too 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-11T19:41:37", "owner": "mazyjca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076492673224823, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T19:28:20", "owner": "latyagatyatanc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089255116962605, "text": "She's me and I'm her😭", "created_at": "2025-12-11T17:22:17", "owner": "_haxshuuu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072265184365397, "text": "Literally me", "created_at": "2025-12-11T16:35:58", "owner": "hotlineblink92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937773072984651, "text": "I'm sowwy 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-11T16:23:12", "owner": "shaa_siii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914403985252046, "text": "Me every single time", "created_at": "2025-12-11T14:24:06", "owner": "xxjhrkz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098470882665408, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T13:16:41", "owner": "heyy._.chiku", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367714243091863, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T12:33:01", "owner": "akhmetovaetibor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089140673296331, "text": "Mashuk santulan update", "created_at": "2025-12-11T11:38:00", "owner": "rabbita_101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860989978554126, "text": "When ppl compliment my dreads 🥲", "created_at": "2025-12-11T09:29:07", "owner": "sterling.spectrum_007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084963022847019, "text": "Neighborhood: 😧", "created_at": "2025-12-11T09:12:51", "owner": "al.alex.a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546564979013613, "text": "@_mxsgkk", "created_at": "2025-12-11T08:57:01", "owner": "srr.grsla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903520174302585, "text": "Me", "created_at": "2025-12-11T07:28:24", "owner": "_banasmita_borg._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086505505962194, "text": "no cuz last time someone was like “cute leg warmers!” AND I WAS LIKE UHMM WHAT LEG WARMERS 😇😇😇😇😇😇", "created_at": "2025-12-11T06:09:18", "owner": "ok_burppies", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895209193361623, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:54:03", "owner": "vinceoneofone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062653649532448, "text": "me😭", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:36:42", "owner": "jessie_qiqishao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856219840577772, "text": "EU NAO SEI RESPONDER EU JURO😭", "created_at": "2025-12-11T03:39:17", "owner": "tatiane.maciel21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941004280097713, "text": "LITERALLY ME", "created_at": "2025-12-11T03:38:29", "owner": "some_gingerale_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055641038638339, "text": "Bruh me fr", "created_at": "2025-12-11T02:19:59", "owner": "simisbaybe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091986526930148, "text": "It literally happened to me this afternoon when I left work. The guard looked at me weird 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-11T02:10:46", "owner": "calweeaboo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069829046093697, "text": "Yuri", "created_at": "2025-12-11T02:04:40", "owner": "lazuli__0_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082495769325733, "text": "me", "created_at": "2025-12-11T01:58:59", "owner": "summerskx_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030561776557160, "text": "Once had a middle schooler tell me \"we have the same first name\" my response was \"thank you\" 💀", "created_at": "2025-12-11T01:53:42", "owner": "brittneybateman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132313723493774, "text": "😂😂 Oooo", "created_at": "2025-12-11T01:38:51", "owner": "joelmelophile13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052673591349420, "text": "The post you stole this from was literally one above", "created_at": "2025-12-11T01:26:21", "owner": "droorzn_xrksvi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063299252198822, "text": "😅😂🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-10T22:08:20", "owner": "nafisahcreations", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18398449189127322, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:20:02", "owner": "marwan_mkrch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099484075765086, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:20:01", "owner": "marwan_mkrch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048720002454511, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:19:59", "owner": "marwan_mkrch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18385867450194876, "text": "😮😮", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:19:58", "owner": "marwan_mkrch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062434913241486, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:19:56", "owner": "marwan_mkrch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851243734599243, "text": "Yaaaaaaas🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:19:52", "owner": "marwan_mkrch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065641145438843, "text": "\"oh nice purse\" \"good night... wai-\"", "created_at": "2025-12-10T19:54:00", "owner": "luma.bsantos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917129161244492, "text": "That sounded so relatable. I felt the pain through the screen😭", "created_at": "2025-12-10T19:11:27", "owner": "abbyharper_ig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079588277242018, "text": "@snehasaysso_ 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-10T18:44:37", "owner": "silverr_stardust", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931509895012352, "text": "Then again, the last time someone complimented her purse, she said \"You too\".", "created_at": "2025-12-10T18:06:03", "owner": "dsouzasohan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080127986229309, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T17:08:53", "owner": "makeupbynishamrta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065714612171988, "text": "gwlah si gagap itu😭", "created_at": "2025-12-10T16:26:58", "owner": "nblhnsl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089421887310220, "text": "Me", "created_at": "2025-12-10T14:14:47", "owner": "meheerr__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048483677438349, "text": "that’s her soul screaming", "created_at": "2025-12-10T14:07:13", "owner": "deadwxlf_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907730755272055, "text": "BAHAHAHA", "created_at": "2025-12-10T13:53:24", "owner": "silly_sophie13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076368773256800, "text": "🙆‍♀️sooo meeee🛐", "created_at": "2025-12-10T13:52:14", "owner": "guni_dixit42", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115067623584453, "text": "me 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-10T13:26:58", "owner": "hphamxox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082703501115383, "text": "Real", "created_at": "2025-12-10T13:06:50", "owner": "silouzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304488400264931, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T12:23:12", "owner": "th0r3_56", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980560674783573, "text": "Hk", "created_at": "2025-12-10T12:00:52", "owner": "jgtheuser", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958807069011286, "text": "Was funny and relatable when the first 200 people made this video", "created_at": "2025-12-10T10:04:07", "owner": "beardie_hat_guy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067314545569584, "text": "🥲🥲😭", "created_at": "2025-12-10T09:15:02", "owner": "justwannaspammmm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065268620545589, "text": "This really happens....", "created_at": "2025-12-10T09:03:37", "owner": "linthoingambi_yumnam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970864506971149, "text": "At least she doesn't say \"I have a boyfriend\"", "created_at": "2025-12-10T07:51:53", "owner": "kimrothmony", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305121949252175, "text": "Ado?", "created_at": "2025-12-10T07:23:20", "owner": "a.g_agnes_lsw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144472447447773, "text": "Nice boobs", "created_at": "2025-12-10T07:07:15", "owner": "salmonellato_pkdk2025aafc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903356578303621, "text": "O lo #t😮@th", "created_at": "2025-12-10T07:07:13", "owner": "greekmoonn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133852057487118, "text": "Just say thanks", "created_at": "2025-12-10T06:41:12", "owner": "ha_mid6300", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974189346989375, "text": "This is me 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-10T06:11:32", "owner": "imjustamessygirl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18384964003199811, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T05:31:20", "owner": "joecclimbs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069033692613638, "text": "God, that's me!!!", "created_at": "2025-12-10T05:19:12", "owner": "aniko.revesz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068267894384796, "text": "😔 twin", "created_at": "2025-12-10T03:34:11", "owner": "matchamocchi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303897508251376, "text": "Just say you too and walk away", "created_at": "2025-12-10T03:15:41", "owner": "xander_wxchen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084463993866242, "text": "me", "created_at": "2025-12-10T02:30:09", "owner": "mg.6173", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18411628006184861, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-10T01:09:04", "owner": "___imniceee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058928111295407, "text": "Lol me too ..", "created_at": "2025-12-10T00:14:09", "owner": "kozmobunny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103584658674986, "text": "Her name lulu chu?", "created_at": "2025-12-10T00:05:25", "owner": "selenophile212_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075020009261603, "text": "Or when you look over and they smile but you were not expecting it so you look mean by not smiling back", "created_at": "2025-12-09T23:56:33", "owner": "emmaantalis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968215554996573, "text": "This is soo meee! 😭😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T22:28:58", "owner": "jhobethssi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871056439472480, "text": "@mo11yshen  is this you 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T19:13:59", "owner": "hazimr6656", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926702281181218, "text": "@yeshmitaa YOU 🫵🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T18:57:32", "owner": "nawangyonzon", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063465053202610, "text": "-836216739392652728 aura", "created_at": "2025-12-09T18:37:09", "owner": "maqa_ig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854077624591015, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-09T18:30:41", "owner": "mayra_here_13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084991460020150, "text": "I was wearing college sweatshirt and they said “Love that college!” Like how do I even respond to that?? “Thanks??” It’s not like I run the college?!", "created_at": "2025-12-09T18:17:04", "owner": "lake.random", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18428102137128101, "text": "Me 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-09T17:28:41", "owner": "neverminditsnotherr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084692344860240, "text": "Me core", "created_at": "2025-12-09T17:00:57", "owner": "anime_x_poketitan10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976860147954065, "text": "gweh tiap ditanya mau kemana pas papasan", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:37:04", "owner": "uchihasamuel125", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941514877097258, "text": "Love how people in the background staring at her", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:01:44", "owner": "ki_mi2399", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985048179916957, "text": "Are you in China", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:01:18", "owner": "ki_mi2399", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148834441430676, "text": "If anyone wants to join the international friendship group, contact me via dm.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:25:59", "owner": "my.lenam__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18278014969303686, "text": "i always hit the \"where it's from\" \"how much i got it for if it was on sale\"", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:06:13", "owner": "kaemorgan__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088320872507607, "text": "DEYM IT😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:50:27", "owner": "nytaa.nl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18400787278192867, "text": "Gotta upgrade the internet connection and CPU", "created_at": "2025-12-09T10:14:03", "owner": "lee6malaysia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18351963982203558, "text": "💔😭", "created_at": "2025-12-09T09:21:44", "owner": "eyr4_4me", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092952085930698, "text": "me fr", "created_at": "2025-12-09T09:17:59", "owner": "qshadowciaq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923168722192954, "text": "“You welcome”", "created_at": "2025-12-09T08:56:44", "owner": "n4xz1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992368020854275, "text": "Where I live if someone tells you this you better start running", "created_at": "2025-12-09T08:49:12", "owner": "ona_k_skincare", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950726565918307, "text": "i you blink hard three times, she will go away", "created_at": "2025-12-09T07:37:53", "owner": "superpinya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102888583665146, "text": "im afraid this is me", "created_at": "2025-12-09T06:14:30", "owner": "wizahdcos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932176252135198, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-09T04:27:51", "owner": "_b.doe_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091233331902703, "text": "Layhfdaak 🤓👍🏼", "created_at": "2025-12-09T03:45:23", "owner": "braheem._0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000179387835555, "text": "fr😢", "created_at": "2025-12-09T02:18:25", "owner": "xmxrxxllx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18429700108109301, "text": "MEEEEE😭", "created_at": "2025-12-09T01:28:36", "owner": "kanianfz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119177119489384, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T01:06:43", "owner": "montevalleyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981409353779432, "text": "I just immediately say what so they can say it again and I can process it fast enough😌😌😌", "created_at": "2025-12-08T23:43:25", "owner": "0.denny0919.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002507906683330, "text": "\"morning\" \"thank you\"", "created_at": "2025-12-08T22:59:41", "owner": "bangsplosion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957398929012772, "text": "Realist shit I’ve seen damn it", "created_at": "2025-12-08T21:41:48", "owner": "mixisbryan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970687473823519, "text": "Also, \"Have a great day\" at night!🥲", "created_at": "2025-12-08T20:15:37", "owner": "noshubear24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862219948470556, "text": "SaMe😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:57:35", "owner": "lizy_peasy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066074807528821, "text": "So me", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:36:08", "owner": "lopamudra.98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18200139922323327, "text": "I told a rickshawala \"Goodnight\" when he dropped me at work", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:09:32", "owner": "kharemadhukar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043707122494831, "text": "Sybau", "created_at": "2025-12-08T18:36:20", "owner": "atosy_hk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107208190569025, "text": "Once a friend passed by me like that and said “HEY” and I said “bye” 😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-08T17:12:49", "owner": "kangyskies", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967415545005445, "text": "😆😆", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:05:59", "owner": "boxing_rach", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860414632488289, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T13:44:07", "owner": "antontongep", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998763657700177, "text": "not relatable", "created_at": "2025-12-08T12:57:09", "owner": "ferrariassassins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088268611793008, "text": "Truee 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-08T12:48:32", "owner": "s3jal_0301", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059810783636492, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-08T12:45:12", "owner": "m1ja__3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049842467412520, "text": "Dude. This is Mid Levels! Ahhhhhh!", "created_at": "2025-12-08T12:25:04", "owner": "wawankun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085843604511568, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-12-08T12:08:52", "owner": "arabellakamu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145747288447917, "text": "bro in white was looking at her stunned too 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T11:29:18", "owner": "cxtecxnt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065401823545522, "text": "Unfortunately, that’s me😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T10:33:22", "owner": "y._4cxx_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918647953229120, "text": "Me", "created_at": "2025-12-08T10:29:21", "owner": "aratheamae15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113644264597061, "text": "When I reply on time I reply something completely different from the topic the person talked about", "created_at": "2025-12-08T05:48:06", "owner": "alexbasumatary_21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017472443801495, "text": "This was so funny that even my dad laughed🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-08T05:22:22", "owner": "ar1a5055", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376866979159000, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-08T03:52:57", "owner": "djmalig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873193432465034, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-08T03:52:28", "owner": "djmalig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080608718172977, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-08T03:52:22", "owner": "djmalig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087355330821275, "text": "Me AF Lmaooooo", "created_at": "2025-12-08T03:45:07", "owner": "mr.respectx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18399287689135173, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-08T03:10:15", "owner": "p_r_i_y_a_m_._p_a_r_u_a_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083491315867860, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T02:46:31", "owner": "pnw_party", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153501697421672, "text": "That’s me. I’m good with responding funny text but I can’t come up with a split second response to save my life.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T01:22:01", "owner": "the_fitdoctor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18177293266364886, "text": "FUCK👹", "created_at": "2025-12-07T23:06:44", "owner": "becs.bmth_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895663441357576, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T22:37:04", "owner": "isaac_sanchez_24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043184291686926, "text": "In desperate attempt to get anything out,  my brain and mouth collaborate on phrases and get one half out that they each like. for example TAKE LUCK! (take care +/- good luck).", "created_at": "2025-12-07T22:24:30", "owner": "sanpickachu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083977612872798, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-12-07T21:18:58", "owner": "ghaisanisa15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18385754644146586, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T20:38:38", "owner": "syedzadaali69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063922133192792, "text": "The waitress \"enjoy your food!\" You too!!!...... Can I just get my check and go now?", "created_at": "2025-12-07T20:11:11", "owner": "earthstaraster", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099190447833559, "text": "Real", "created_at": "2025-12-07T20:03:11", "owner": "lillybean462", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921653551196897, "text": "Maksudnya apa ? Gak ngerti gw jokesnya", "created_at": "2025-12-07T19:38:45", "owner": "mafriyogi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087304168821402, "text": "She was like: “that wasn’t part of the script 😭”", "created_at": "2025-12-07T19:22:53", "owner": "inaky_06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048923708430608, "text": "The she gets this trauma for the rest of her life 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T19:06:13", "owner": "greenbean419", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103237609706851, "text": "Hahahhahahaha yes", "created_at": "2025-12-07T17:39:12", "owner": "adriecu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084135593104576, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T17:14:43", "owner": "c__a___xi_e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856486156570757, "text": "why is this me", "created_at": "2025-12-07T16:27:14", "owner": "venus.esmeralda_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908263096274674, "text": "Repeat after me: Thank you!", "created_at": "2025-12-07T16:27:11", "owner": "jeremy.s27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023372723602650, "text": "yo", "created_at": "2025-12-07T16:21:08", "owner": "patriziasaavedrae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865263634519545, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T15:38:55", "owner": "impossib_l_e_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906403060143136, "text": "AGHHH I HAGE IT", "created_at": "2025-12-07T12:55:58", "owner": "eminjoleen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893799397365860, "text": "Literally ME", "created_at": "2025-12-07T12:46:49", "owner": "floro_223", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541986805048609, "text": "Im glad its not just me", "created_at": "2025-12-07T12:39:11", "owner": "praveen.w_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18351264436203687, "text": "THAT WAS SO ACCURATE", "created_at": "2025-12-07T11:41:50", "owner": "naveessan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18277277239304153, "text": "Gen z really needs to get their shit together.", "created_at": "2025-12-07T10:47:58", "owner": "franklynsteinn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842954356638088, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-07T09:37:08", "owner": "siivakokilaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041299781507293, "text": "Valid crash out😭", "created_at": "2025-12-07T07:32:10", "owner": "_subha_sahoo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080480170924070, "text": "Meeee😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-07T07:18:19", "owner": "_s.a.t.y.a_1804", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115205464507371, "text": "Didn't someone else post this exact video?", "created_at": "2025-12-07T06:00:34", "owner": "itsnot_brooklyn0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080960135174428, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-07T05:30:15", "owner": "from.my.archivees", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084226775011533, "text": "Its me", "created_at": "2025-12-07T04:08:02", "owner": "taiyo_mein", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098441413838022, "text": "\"Enjoy your meal!\" \"You too\" FUCK💔", "created_at": "2025-12-07T03:50:17", "owner": "jean.cloveri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065530694172786, "text": "Nooo not the people staring in the back…", "created_at": "2025-12-07T03:48:15", "owner": "tucherwesley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113813746582325, "text": "Js say, \"you too\". Work's every time 👏", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:31:56", "owner": "syahmiid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124312252465832, "text": "I once went to the dealership to pick up my car, the guy at the front said \"thanks got coming\". I said you too (i walked out in silence and drove home in silence)", "created_at": "2025-12-07T00:09:23", "owner": "elvism_1600", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540062737017402, "text": "It’s alright, happened to the best of us", "created_at": "2025-12-06T23:25:53", "owner": "shuri_n_ken", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980658888937124, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T23:05:44", "owner": "xxrunnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868411771485800, "text": "HELP THIS IS SO TRUE 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:54:30", "owner": "charlotte_mickgolf6070", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986569503755365, "text": "Like that", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:30:25", "owner": "rafa_demboscki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034251764754369, "text": "Me fr", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:46:42", "owner": "ishitasharma3113", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119607385547403, "text": "SOOOO REALLLL 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:15:37", "owner": "alex_the.champ", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540975829025053, "text": "Actually, my problem:", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:48:30", "owner": "j_777234", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122995795545006, "text": "QTE be hitting us fr", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:48:09", "owner": "shidokey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18414367387140827, "text": "Helpp true😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:39:41", "owner": "norwayisgreen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096031111893179, "text": "Why it's me 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:34:01", "owner": "salwa_maloee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931815232120644, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:32:45", "owner": "lololayan2941", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918706225216664, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:02:25", "owner": "mintymelon2828", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103201384671116, "text": "I always bcm so dumbfounded.. My mind goes to processing", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:31:04", "owner": "afr3n_simii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092426194912458, "text": "Me", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:18:17", "owner": "fantasylover_ank", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030730229753044, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:56:04", "owner": "cikiwidd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851353618598427, "text": "she's really screaming 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:52:26", "owner": "ferdlnan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18386448199144938, "text": "Fuckkkkkkkkk", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:25:35", "owner": "__wineyyyyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304245043248825, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:08:05", "owner": "tawhida.akter_20005", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080473742145927, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T14:40:38", "owner": "bvsmvlv.___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134664706488430, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:52:44", "owner": "fatgirthyleg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397189411125932, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T11:50:42", "owner": "thate.mokid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987391338913138, "text": "Pro", "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:58:12", "owner": "redboi3005", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119935492555106, "text": "People always end up thinking imma stupid 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:23:31", "owner": "ur.future2011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870971512393971, "text": "me, this is me!", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:35:03", "owner": "jvdebabe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093340030894628, "text": "No probs. A simple “thanks” is enough…", "created_at": "2025-12-06T05:24:56", "owner": "partitions_and_resonances", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109990426619973, "text": "Thank you and sorry not in her vocabulary 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T04:13:54", "owner": "saifulbasri.abuseman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969843369967884, "text": "You wanted to make her day but ruined it😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T04:09:03", "owner": "iam.salohiddin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878164171441030, "text": "Real asf 🥀", "created_at": "2025-12-06T03:41:20", "owner": "will.is.lowkey.ded", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931436827139425, "text": "JUST SAY THANKSSS", "created_at": "2025-12-06T03:04:33", "owner": "derincemrebozkurt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18189121507343350, "text": "I panicked once and just groaned😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T02:08:44", "owner": "clearly_apotato", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087670531999584, "text": "Wow I know exactly where ts is i would do thay too FUCK", "created_at": "2025-12-06T01:11:37", "owner": "pludotz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941809782961694, "text": "Me too😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T00:33:51", "owner": "k4r_woj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870190972405284, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T23:20:09", "owner": "prune.ogg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865383505521019, "text": "Them: here's your book\nMe: hi!! \nMe: oh no I wasn't thinking 😭😭😭\n(This happens to me legitimately a lot$", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:49:23", "owner": "jks_night_apple.poison", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148198906442420, "text": "BOTH my teachers said hi to me this morning and I smiled so awkwardly bc I forgot how to speak before they ran away 💔", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:26:59", "owner": "bred_person", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028836992762308, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T18:44:03", "owner": "alt.tgsf69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901748818323516, "text": "Happened with me today 😢", "created_at": "2025-12-05T17:15:26", "owner": "mnijungkookholic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025251962716789, "text": "me😭", "created_at": "2025-12-05T15:02:02", "owner": "_sharkattackk_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870249661405573, "text": "Sometimes I literally just repeat back exactly what they said to me. People must think I’m a skinwalker.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T14:47:48", "owner": "kikistarflier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923048038195062, "text": "@wiiii._.sshhhhh ye to tm hi ho anjuu no doubt 🥱", "created_at": "2025-12-05T14:37:19", "owner": "adarsh.singh.rajputt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056325779328913, "text": "You think you lost all aura, this is actually an opportunity to grow a closer bond than a passing interaction. To truly get at the heart of why your feeling like this with a stranger. Maybe that stranger cms become a friend. Wear your heart on your sleeve, another ribcage will house it in no time", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:23:10", "owner": "cybercrashers_tv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094446649853250, "text": "Lit", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:44:57", "owner": "takido_desu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080649809176009, "text": "Me lot", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:44:55", "owner": "takido_desu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064999586166105, "text": "im so fkin tired", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:20:56", "owner": "nnevsturns", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914024146246816, "text": "Did she vomit 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:52:30", "owner": "kittyshot7878", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076579642983472, "text": "Just take your biggest toothpast-ads like smile and say nothing ✨😄✨ you will also fail, of course. But the other will laugh at least", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:53:05", "owner": "onyx_the_gargoyle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18195203092331436, "text": "The reason why my brain says “thank you” everytime even tho they havent done anything", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:16:53", "owner": "owoagapeuwu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045075605703595, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:00:36", "owner": "noahbvns_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886524460281704, "text": "I kinda learned to make em slow down for a few sec so i can respond without accidentally seeming rude💀", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:42:51", "owner": "zaddy_n1teshade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18416599627143979, "text": "retableable", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:10:29", "owner": "khayrulamzar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18166697941386101, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:02:03", "owner": "kaleshi.aurat58", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103953364662574, "text": "true", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:43:38", "owner": "ciwchi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906166537145528, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:21:37", "owner": "apocalypse_bride", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093818704912499, "text": "casa bella mentioned 🇭🇰🇭🇰🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:38:40", "owner": "why_lottie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947030359063431, "text": "The way she said fuck", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:36:23", "owner": "samarhabib_88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844807057625215, "text": "a", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:07:54", "owner": "liansfjzx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954889656900849, "text": "I think the auntie got scared", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:02:42", "owner": "choco.sachima", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907423885271032, "text": "😭😭😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:42:40", "owner": "coco_0255", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102048847708334, "text": "Soooooo.......you're single?!?!?!", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:00:13", "owner": "foamingfeet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845296204622000, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:50:47", "owner": "coldbeerkevin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931583896138866, "text": "Hmm.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:49:47", "owner": "j0nio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950900520922976, "text": "i think thats you @hxliate", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:46:13", "owner": "hyunoh_.hong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923999506194019, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:33:28", "owner": "simao.sa.921", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994031754850799, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:10:51", "owner": "capcut_fandomeditz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070113638602232, "text": "Real 🫩", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:57:26", "owner": "txvsn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850818220563131, "text": "at this point, i auto say thanks, especially when someone says \"you have long hair\" ill say thanks and then think \"FOR WHAT, MY HAIR GROWING?\" 😭😭😭🤦‍♀️🤦‍♀️🤦‍♀️🤦‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:41:56", "owner": "miss.piikaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066187556148338, "text": "My template (quick) reaction to every situation is THANKS.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:47:52", "owner": "ayu.pritalia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933513669999465, "text": "LITERALLY ME😭", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:37:39", "owner": "vi_o_o7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930848020119276, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:21:38", "owner": "kanojiajyoti814", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037766984722169, "text": "Me", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:44:49", "owner": "neelakshihihihihi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18350780416205139, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:25:32", "owner": "dindanamirra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044679161697771, "text": "Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr Fr", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:24:52", "owner": "yourbromayank", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921499477198741, "text": "I HAVE THE SAME EXACT SHOES", "created_at": "2025-12-04T12:47:26", "owner": "_.maria._diam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920830135198043, "text": "KUPIKIR CUMAN AKU 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-04T11:27:44", "owner": "zhediary", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083395628112709, "text": "Quick time event failed", "created_at": "2025-12-04T10:37:11", "owner": "xmawimawiix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084198794100960, "text": "and then they think I’m rude 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-04T09:29:08", "owner": "zqra.ss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103970728659246, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-12-04T09:22:05", "owner": "wsknmari_a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096582616675288, "text": "Me everytime 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-04T09:15:24", "owner": "iamadarshjohnson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071048750367710, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T08:33:59", "owner": "marccoloma_filoblink_2026", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18344210320224466, "text": "damn", "created_at": "2025-12-04T07:22:20", "owner": "sanjanarv_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048295757423858, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-12-04T07:01:05", "owner": "__ipungkyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18308545696255536, "text": "Fact", "created_at": "2025-12-04T06:05:48", "owner": "williams_billssz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087700636794703, "text": "same 🥲", "created_at": "2025-12-04T04:42:41", "owner": "istelledm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18380744920146748, "text": "LITERALLY ME", "created_at": "2025-12-04T04:14:56", "owner": "sweetintentionzzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085381772082541, "text": "same😭", "created_at": "2025-12-04T01:55:48", "owner": "junjunjungjung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885707002283775, "text": "So I always say \"Thank you, I love your hair\" even to the bald", "created_at": "2025-12-04T01:15:18", "owner": "insangphoto_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090172495748794, "text": "Wait 😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-04T01:03:43", "owner": "lil.scallion.pancake", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099363523696091, "text": "“good thanks, yourself?”", "created_at": "2025-12-04T00:06:26", "owner": "dj.plecides", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089639005757411, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T23:46:40", "owner": "jryzx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918625684219271, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:43:39", "owner": "obliviousaurora0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090508861745656, "text": "I fear this is me..", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:03:20", "owner": "cupofcappuccana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031686446735372, "text": "the people in the back", "created_at": "2025-12-03T19:30:25", "owner": "ruth.di.mauro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074922008243318, "text": "BAHAHAHAHASHWJHSHEHDJJS", "created_at": "2025-12-03T19:10:55", "owner": "arabela.rosales", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073157120523247, "text": "SAMEE!! And it’s always so embarrassing😭😭😭💀", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:22:05", "owner": "ruby416890", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858756688558151, "text": "😭✋🏻", "created_at": "2025-12-03T17:49:36", "owner": "biiii_kaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089197699948144, "text": "@awsom_adam don't hide. we all know you do this too.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T17:35:16", "owner": "awsom_adam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18365478688095892, "text": "bitch this is me all the time", "created_at": "2025-12-03T15:37:59", "owner": "veeseeonn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119965300477635, "text": "Waiter: Enjoy your meal Me: You too Waiter:......", "created_at": "2025-12-03T15:18:52", "owner": "justaworker_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930449587016654, "text": "This happened to me", "created_at": "2025-12-03T15:02:06", "owner": "nada.leuwis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124790476515208, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T14:54:06", "owner": "pawsywawssy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911695600251192, "text": "been there done that", "created_at": "2025-12-03T14:48:56", "owner": "nb.starset", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867575749497273, "text": "😮😢", "created_at": "2025-12-03T14:31:54", "owner": "akmaker_7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18374686309152010, "text": "WAIT THIS IS IN CAINE ROADD I LIVE CLOSE I LIVE IN ROBINSON ROAD AND PLUS I GO TO THE NEAR BASKETBALL COURT IF YALL KNOW", "created_at": "2025-12-03T14:19:14", "owner": "harry.i_like_steph", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903297286167867, "text": "It’s not that deep", "created_at": "2025-12-03T14:07:43", "owner": "fw_pryg7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013260725635157, "text": "OH NICE PUrSsEY.. thanks 😁 wait...😐", "created_at": "2025-12-03T13:51:17", "owner": "_aldoas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855270130577835, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T13:47:30", "owner": "marlosraphael", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088300999987095, "text": "i'm you, you're me", "created_at": "2025-12-03T13:28:35", "owner": "arseatexture", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847892035585604, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T12:35:55", "owner": "teramisu12321", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100458373750613, "text": "\"Nice purse\" is still okay. The most evil people are the ones that quickly say \"Hi, how are you?\"", "created_at": "2025-12-03T12:03:13", "owner": "jsjrenato", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063189842402089, "text": "That's me", "created_at": "2025-12-03T10:21:54", "owner": "just_sugar01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176396005366743, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T08:31:57", "owner": "abigailsunaryo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968658474977031, "text": "I know", "created_at": "2025-12-03T08:29:08", "owner": "amartyapardeshi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866146951509135, "text": "SO ME", "created_at": "2025-12-03T07:23:31", "owner": "_prinbelle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068789783615920, "text": "SO REAL OMFG", "created_at": "2025-12-03T05:52:32", "owner": "radhaslateagain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096909223836206, "text": "Me", "created_at": "2025-12-03T05:36:16", "owner": "ifeel_toska", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18440231053100833, "text": "When people say hi when I walk by them and if I don’t have enough time to react I make noises as my way to say hello", "created_at": "2025-12-03T05:20:56", "owner": "rynz472", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066381134611849, "text": "Damn this is me 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-03T05:03:14", "owner": "niighttliightt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101079892813798, "text": "😭💯", "created_at": "2025-12-03T04:47:13", "owner": "bumpyirl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088679689951812, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:37:53", "owner": "elie.l162", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083493626024776, "text": "“Good Morning!!!”\n \n‘You too! 🤦🏻‍♂️’", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:37:51", "owner": "byinstantgrams", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087627679807515, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:56:20", "owner": "milkmilkteains", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086957660510954, "text": "I just go FAHHH", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:55:50", "owner": "mariapojoga_09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096457354881893, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:43:48", "owner": "jojo.mhflutie_17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991498275855876, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:52:48", "owner": "ybonskies", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904144312318964, "text": "\"QTE failed. Stranger will remember that.\"", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:46:01", "owner": "justyourlocalcultist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085992070831511, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:42:20", "owner": "ygot.h", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061364405218757, "text": "Same sister, same ✊😔", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:38:13", "owner": "themultiverse64", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18105765121632034, "text": "How’d you get this footage of me", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:38:04", "owner": "armorysbooknook", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011538797644256, "text": "Eu", "created_at": "2025-12-03T00:40:23", "owner": "carladealcueto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889012654266021, "text": "that's actually me😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:57:49", "owner": "trashofib", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18537661930008078, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:39:58", "owner": "mathbycarl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087223826475961, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:10:04", "owner": "danielnoahlol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18200576158321403, "text": "Omg meee 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:24:51", "owner": "helloitsnoelia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141788128404637, "text": "Fvck👹👹👹👹👹", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:09:37", "owner": "dustsanslv100", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087579286825894, "text": "She is me, I am her 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:38:57", "owner": "they.luvxtionne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084083075026023, "text": "@yaaarrpoo same to u 🤣😆😆😆😆", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:26:25", "owner": "vydu_27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981129516946264, "text": "Id say thank you and smile", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:10:37", "owner": "barbara_tkd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102068830741310, "text": "Real 4 this 😌", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:08:35", "owner": "curiousmrroboto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843123691625154, "text": "yeah, and I just wanna die when l couldn't even make that shit smile", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:38:15", "owner": "enaj512707", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18548497285028075, "text": "Me : ohh...um...ahhh...THANKYOU!!😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:06:30", "owner": "_eunha.78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035175596735676, "text": "😂😂😂🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:05:01", "owner": "hongkong_frames", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959326791878702, "text": "I just say \"oh thank you!\" before realizing i'm supposed to compliment them back", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:59:39", "owner": "mrfroglord", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897477781200357, "text": "😂🙌 me >>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:55:46", "owner": "ravshanalimov_007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320142304170861, "text": "Hahaha... thats me bcs when i called customer i read the VOICEMAIL SCRIPT NOT THE OTHER ONE", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:02:01", "owner": "lamphorxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092234164732158, "text": "“No worries”", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:35:21", "owner": "gz6113phev5", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085985792511008, "text": "FVCK 🗣️🗣️🗣️🗣️🗣️", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:02:57", "owner": "ethan__jm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087217627953529, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T15:55:49", "owner": "shazeb_akhtar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952949041018563, "text": "exactly", "created_at": "2025-12-02T15:49:02", "owner": "erinrumara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320270794169469, "text": "😂😢", "created_at": "2025-12-02T15:39:29", "owner": "abdraimovva_77", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18108444535716245, "text": "@mo_ola21 my brain asf", "created_at": "2025-12-02T15:01:46", "owner": "mo_ola21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157317442405602, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:54:02", "owner": "raise_your.rahrahrah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985130016924077, "text": "too much phone like my mom said", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:53:55", "owner": "kristyhlgs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909364111126282, "text": "So truee", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:52:18", "owner": "xenovia_rex", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17932768665110146, "text": "That guy: 哇屌係咪黐線㗎？", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:48:03", "owner": "alex_zzz308", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139053391459419, "text": "：😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:45:46", "owner": "tyun12._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18381530653150955, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:45:12", "owner": "kai433522", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953915044031732, "text": "She is me😭😭💔", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:29:44", "owner": "8moon09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070909925071417, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:18:38", "owner": "royalte310", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18328070455246379, "text": "Is it a trend for people to start a conversation while walking away? Is this what social media has done to our society?", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:12:31", "owner": "mochifm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931793857136431, "text": "Me frfrfr", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:11:54", "owner": "nicolechangchi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084793703284282, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:57:39", "owner": "wfzriyans", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18411612211138298, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:53:46", "owner": "samlucky31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18202174573318575, "text": "Stop this literally happened less than 24 hours ago for me its got me tweaking 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:48:04", "owner": "thederpdaneel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912607963247657, "text": "@k3bhn", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:35:37", "owner": "zzip.01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023483681597979, "text": "hahahaha", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:32:54", "owner": "aimeezhao_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082614995028696, "text": "Me", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:32:23", "owner": "abcdefghiklmopqrstuvwx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103801927676175, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:27:47", "owner": "septiyan.n7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040899680504085, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:24:16", "owner": "_justmejo18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112973608589603, "text": "I know her...... that's ME 😑", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:17:24", "owner": "sitanshuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895504342357717, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:09:36", "owner": "stupidhappiness_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865724107512490, "text": "Yes, it's me", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:09:02", "owner": "omg_i_love_you______noooooo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18193797310329707, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:06:57", "owner": "dy1ng_5lut", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853127551590408, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:45:49", "owner": "gebsss.bi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086033351084410, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:44:00", "owner": "derpychris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856014544570326, "text": "Ussss", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:30:44", "owner": "jeonfraiyaz7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079099676330782, "text": "i feel that girl its okay😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:26:07", "owner": "damiijk98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103068931680229, "text": "REAL 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:23:03", "owner": "xcebeaodes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072207359344706, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:14:21", "owner": "yvan1llez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063854591187989, "text": "So true 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:10:16", "owner": "riitcharrd_j", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090986534501071, "text": "Omggggg so reallllll😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T11:53:45", "owner": "esy1ex_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867213322427253, "text": "literally me", "created_at": "2025-12-02T11:53:37", "owner": "cacabiens", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089571829758331, "text": "I kinda made myself automatically say yes to whatever lmao", "created_at": "2025-12-02T11:49:33", "owner": "codederror92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914757448248637, "text": "Everytime😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T11:45:54", "owner": "rprajanti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097706413827325, "text": "Dont know how to small talk😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T11:43:02", "owner": "gale14526", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135488416479401, "text": "Everyb single time", "created_at": "2025-12-02T11:42:06", "owner": "samaugust2.6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064257557570013, "text": "THIS IS LITERALLY ME ARGH", "created_at": "2025-12-02T11:41:14", "owner": "gablyisgonnacrashout", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057934679639892, "text": "All the time😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T11:31:46", "owner": "c86__________y31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868957522481390, "text": "Is it not clocking with you she's standing on business.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T11:23:09", "owner": "william_btz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853164910589618, "text": "my awkward ahh", "created_at": "2025-12-02T11:18:25", "owner": "jazfaizaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959335926882008, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T11:12:09", "owner": "gaanesh.___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067553228525751, "text": "Me", "created_at": "2025-12-02T11:07:08", "owner": "matthew.cjl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987530217913108, "text": "The other day I was in a pub trying to look for the toilet and some nice person gave me instructions to get there and all I said was “oh okay” 😭 I feel so rude for that", "created_at": "2025-12-02T11:05:02", "owner": "inkurinkuri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18437510965098068, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T11:05:00", "owner": "3adballah0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099047140835309, "text": "when someone says hi to me but i dont register it quick enough to say hi back cuz i walk so quickly", "created_at": "2025-12-02T10:57:25", "owner": "jiji.pau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096949567869072, "text": "thats me😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T10:52:00", "owner": "daniyakhan9_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969768150822510, "text": "Just say thanks and flee", "created_at": "2025-12-02T10:42:04", "owner": "apratimdinda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080448896273118, "text": "A normal day in Central", "created_at": "2025-12-02T10:18:18", "owner": "rakulokjaiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843206239621440, "text": "Literally 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T10:08:08", "owner": "chinu_gotpagar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044004038487576, "text": "That's me 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T10:04:49", "owner": "tamanna7369", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321427765175281, "text": "me fr", "created_at": "2025-12-02T10:01:40", "owner": "mwahshivani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096160696681243, "text": "I feel you feel you 🙌😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T10:01:24", "owner": "popolivier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927618616172088, "text": "Me😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T09:46:53", "owner": "staceystarlitzzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18151881916420105, "text": "so true😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T09:44:14", "owner": "topherainier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087998500800252, "text": "That’s so meee😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T09:11:19", "owner": "geefl1x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066212384138778, "text": "The girl at the back 😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T08:58:28", "owner": "trueself004", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055814030322567, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T08:49:08", "owner": "bajouk_ali", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895245256437896, "text": "me as hell", "created_at": "2025-12-02T08:42:42", "owner": "xrabikorrax", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980759976938139, "text": "I had this at Disneyland. Walking thru the hotel lobby and thought a woman was in a nice dress for an event and casually complimented her. It was fucking Belle.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T08:30:56", "owner": "sdghamsters", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065928575389238, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T08:29:14", "owner": "sundaythoughta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074537855337435, "text": "Someone in my building asked for some yeast and when they came to pick it up I SAID THANK YOU TO THEM WHILE HANDING THEM THE PACKET", "created_at": "2025-12-02T08:24:44", "owner": "feriromero15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993093555890911, "text": "Women", "created_at": "2025-12-02T07:24:49", "owner": "filipforza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991733154728594, "text": "Real", "created_at": "2025-12-02T07:16:28", "owner": "angelicquantumflux", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926845849174471, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T06:49:46", "owner": "val._.zc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878438785438052, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T06:49:28", "owner": "corpse_.alex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058316759288261, "text": "Me!", "created_at": "2025-12-02T06:46:19", "owner": "bes_hiyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18173571622375413, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T06:43:29", "owner": "uncardoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086786708046482, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T06:43:26", "owner": "alvarezshaina3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994425096852919, "text": "no bc tell me why i introduced myself to a girl and she said “pretty name” and after she said her name i said “oh *pause 5 seconds* nice to meet you” WHATTTT😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T06:40:05", "owner": "itznyomiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088789699787366, "text": "Oh, ummm... duh... duh... FUCK!", "created_at": "2025-12-02T06:39:08", "owner": "lord.d1_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884431516409430, "text": "Same mammas", "created_at": "2025-12-02T06:38:24", "owner": "davina.weekes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006041816667718, "text": "Had a girl compliment my F1 hat as she walked by me. I said “Yup” and cursed myself al the way home.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T05:58:19", "owner": "_brandon_coleman_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100886872782317, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T05:37:29", "owner": "millerbrazel1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18208949089315563, "text": "😂😂😂😭 She lost socialising", "created_at": "2025-12-02T05:27:50", "owner": "i_m_professional4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849596680602554, "text": "Happened to me a couple weeks ago where I was at the store with my mom and one of cashiers was like “want a lollipop?” And I was like “uh-huh-… no thank you” my brain malfunction…", "created_at": "2025-12-02T05:22:17", "owner": "greenlieeve", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086177105097457, "text": "Person in white like 👁️👄👁️", "created_at": "2025-12-02T05:22:06", "owner": "_novastri_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17859541248555641, "text": "hahaha", "created_at": "2025-12-02T05:15:46", "owner": "alexsungnyc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086413883051117, "text": "It's a daily occurrence...", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:46:27", "owner": "daniboi94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032701427733269, "text": "SAME", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:39:36", "owner": "ayrshfa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973597536808452, "text": "me afffffffff😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:33:26", "owner": "rrrobynnnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368544070087814, "text": "i fear this is me", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:24:58", "owner": "calleigh.bk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045545471479439, "text": "When I started dying my hair weird colors it started becoming much more common to receive unsolicited comments so I've FINALLY learned to say \"thank you thank you\" on autopilot. Now I fear I will do it in a situation where I should definitely not be thanking", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:09:22", "owner": "maneoc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18417917821137541, "text": "Just say, “right!” No matter the question And keep on keeping on.🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:02:49", "owner": "j.ck9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887053420405053, "text": "me", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:01:27", "owner": "lovveshan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067641716123701, "text": "LMAOOOO", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:01:26", "owner": "awscaranha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992050596906826, "text": "guys. it’s “thank you”", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:58:04", "owner": "rheamouly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897790237345314, "text": "🤝🏼", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:52:57", "owner": "ranggiarohmansani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329351944214424, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:35:56", "owner": "im_the_goddamn_batman__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957136225013398, "text": "@ally.sona", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:33:09", "owner": "glaaizaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077825888268933, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:32:07", "owner": "_snig.luv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047590982450980, "text": "Relatable 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:25:44", "owner": "sufizzan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090489064946822, "text": "Me…🫩👏", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:25:12", "owner": "1rissn0w", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113129917594833, "text": "Oh That just like me", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:18:34", "owner": "autistic_art2000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910016509124121, "text": "@lqstkiss_", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:18:18", "owner": "ellaswiftie8779", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100096249761396, "text": "This is me. ALL. THE. TIME!!!! I wonder what it's called. 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:17:19", "owner": "danielmorgan1126", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066873563133450, "text": "Meeeeee 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:57:29", "owner": "gwynethflowers101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051814625367627, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:48:10", "owner": "paper.crane_no.1001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098732662694190, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:36:04", "owner": "angevil2116", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083320775097903, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:30:15", "owner": "wukai_jiang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050495948672525, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:13:04", "owner": "gohar_g07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081742301320413, "text": "Wkwkwk sering terjadi", "created_at": "2025-12-02T01:58:10", "owner": "alvndmyn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902980672318526, "text": "This is why I don't take my nice stuff when I leave the house", "created_at": "2025-12-02T01:57:16", "owner": "buckyogi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18369924532086951, "text": "I’ve never seen a video that describe the brain fart so accurately, I feel this in my soul 🥲", "created_at": "2025-12-02T01:49:58", "owner": "theavatarstate1996", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865968550433930, "text": "me😭💔", "created_at": "2025-12-02T01:39:08", "owner": "doremifasolasijulll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994865205716310, "text": "😔✊", "created_at": "2025-12-02T01:38:30", "owner": "qtmartu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893269003368437, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T01:32:40", "owner": "itsme_lexiexsushi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051486239374760, "text": "I had to stop wearing my favorite shirt out in public cause this happened TWICE with it 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T01:31:00", "owner": "the_italianstallion_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18441692446103533, "text": "Happens to me in every conversation", "created_at": "2025-12-02T01:09:23", "owner": "burley4536", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084395909016238, "text": "That's why you must create automatic answers", "created_at": "2025-12-02T01:00:31", "owner": "titpattus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877721554434426, "text": "euuuu", "created_at": "2025-12-02T00:51:07", "owner": "nayarahs29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086934272493011, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T00:42:49", "owner": "llamapalousa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979387983947773, "text": "😭😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T00:42:37", "owner": "carminajoooy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880062724332586, "text": "me irl", "created_at": "2025-12-02T00:38:48", "owner": "egeyamak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100892764743567, "text": "LMAO ME", "created_at": "2025-12-02T00:38:42", "owner": "samartinda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547132426005043, "text": "“You too!” Be the most embarrassing comeback 🤣😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T00:23:11", "owner": "tienytenten", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864837496518486, "text": "I’m start doing this but so me", "created_at": "2025-12-02T00:18:49", "owner": "foweva_jamesgrl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109962187549761, "text": "That’s me", "created_at": "2025-12-02T00:18:12", "owner": "fae_fides", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17970749147987503, "text": "Me too", "created_at": "2025-12-02T00:18:00", "owner": "l.l0623", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079923659138908, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T00:16:06", "owner": "vhionugroho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075059261253196, "text": "I hate when I can't find the right automated response quick enough 🥲", "created_at": "2025-12-02T00:08:33", "owner": "the.neverending.rory", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074966933236031, "text": "Felt that f*ck in my soul", "created_at": "2025-12-02T00:06:48", "owner": "danzo3768", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898133959346509, "text": "I just want you guys to know, this made my laugh so hard. Made my whole week 😂 happy December yall 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:48:54", "owner": "adventureswithshaylah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057670925313509, "text": "Or your voice turns into a high wavy pitch like alien sound when you respond 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:48:29", "owner": "megsters1204", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050554256391768, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:45:40", "owner": "hgecko25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953466880021280, "text": "A few weeks ago a random 12 year old boy complimented my hair. I was so caught off guard, I vaguely mumbled a thank you. And now that sweet kid is probably never going to compliment a stranger again because I didn’t seem appreciative enough. 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:37:40", "owner": "littlemisssplatterbrain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099719737692723, "text": "@issfanfan", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:34:26", "owner": "aunimjoarder8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017672018619717, "text": "that's me in 100%", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:14:51", "owner": "jagoda_0.8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035675345740948, "text": "Sooo me", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:13:29", "owner": "ceinlinn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854227150579734, "text": "Tbh the best thing is to just ignore it lol. No one can quick enough to react in the moment😂😂 if you want to talk just stop by lol", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:09:42", "owner": "xujn__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853487869590143, "text": "Just say thanks", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:51:17", "owner": "curritzki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18562549222016332, "text": "FUUUUUVCCCKKK", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:50:45", "owner": "young3rc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18306590995264458, "text": "ME CORREEE 😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:43:45", "owner": "pvds_mariis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930253747014209, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:36:06", "owner": "i.consume.bees", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971367939973886, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:32:06", "owner": "melanieem19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109167502625130, "text": "Luckily I've gotten good at this part, it's when they stick around for conversation that I suck at 💔", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:20:58", "owner": "ssssmokki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067464548425019, "text": "Honestly even that would be a win for me, if the situation is that fast I would straight uo just not understand what they said at all 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T21:41:43", "owner": "aquajasper_out", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032030876751395, "text": "Happen everytime😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T21:37:01", "owner": "lesssugarcandy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069757790094305, "text": "It's giving \"oh, um, UGH- FVCK\" 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T21:22:46", "owner": "spencer_lukas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091959931931818, "text": "i dont normally stutter but i do when im caught off guard like this", "created_at": "2025-12-01T21:18:24", "owner": "bellorie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105824440628733, "text": "Y luego estoy yo que eNCIMA se me olvida hablar hasta en mi idioma", "created_at": "2025-12-01T21:15:35", "owner": "mergglez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083923244017912, "text": "This is literally me and it makes me so made like THEY THINK IM STUPID NOW", "created_at": "2025-12-01T21:14:07", "owner": "miranda__velez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028149308572050, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T21:09:14", "owner": "munhjuun", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18031122980549334, "text": "She soundedike a deer", "created_at": "2025-12-01T20:45:59", "owner": "sarica._.bombonica", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099625393695490, "text": "Headphones have saved me multiple times in this situation, either I won't look rude because they'll assume my music is too loud or they'll actively try to get my attention", "created_at": "2025-12-01T20:44:49", "owner": "indiemindy9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044587343485884, "text": "me😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T20:35:00", "owner": "filippesz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078796079157572, "text": "Oh yeah, especially when English isn’t your first language. Usually in small talk I say something like muahlbdatghc or start to tell everything about my weekend", "created_at": "2025-12-01T20:28:19", "owner": "na.zhivo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077163382977816, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T20:08:26", "owner": "zubrans", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009036566812035, "text": "F*CK🗣🗣🗣👹👹👹👹", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:58:19", "owner": "velegant100", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095075917849815, "text": "I.... 😔😔", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:41:51", "owner": "_sum_airaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099324685697075, "text": "🙋😑😖😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:31:25", "owner": "gusminghetti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082374773277967, "text": "My brain doesn’t even know what’s a social interaction. Either I talk to much about random things or I don’t talk 🧍🏾‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:00:44", "owner": "_fierwolfe_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855217561576910, "text": "me fr..🥀", "created_at": "2025-12-01T18:57:59", "owner": "myonllyexr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900007423183352, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T18:55:03", "owner": "isaiahwarrgamez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105853390650130, "text": "It happened to me a lot when all my friends and teachers used to tell me, “Your hair is beautiful,” and I didn’t know how to respond except with a sticker, so I used to make strange reactions and cry because I didn’t know how to respond to them. That’s why I don’t like anyone praising me.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T18:52:03", "owner": "just1_hadeer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112382980593305, "text": "literally same 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T18:47:06", "owner": "mirim.love", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081212585128573, "text": "Me😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T18:32:17", "owner": "nikolia.pounentii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100506658764516, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T18:11:13", "owner": "iicludix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005959886666955, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T18:09:24", "owner": "tim_al_janabi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124418440523176, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T18:06:07", "owner": "issaclee414", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000560087837931, "text": "@jennyiiisyn_ 过载", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:36:08", "owner": "estowang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063690842556865, "text": "My classmate said HAVE A NICE DAY and I said NO WORRIES 😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:26:52", "owner": "xamariwassimx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051498446379220, "text": "Who gave you the right to call me out like that? 😅", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:25:46", "owner": "dell.sydney.11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065931071613893, "text": "Can I Atleast have a single original experience in life", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:19:12", "owner": "justinverbon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070304882584315, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:16:07", "owner": "heyimprachi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057899378639967, "text": "It takes practice. Youll get there, i believe in you", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:11:37", "owner": "jannanananananana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902463601321554, "text": "I give off awkward smile..😃🔫", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:08:49", "owner": "ishal_emaan13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072247235055262, "text": "Gosh SO REAL💔", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:57:39", "owner": "dpsyyks.r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124180522516143, "text": "Me fr 😭🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:48:44", "owner": "littlemiss_princess18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103448611679854, "text": "Real😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:40:50", "owner": "abetakuhfx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922052227054718, "text": "Fugme", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:39:47", "owner": "bahahahajsjsjs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877029520355473, "text": "Yeah.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:30:24", "owner": "scarf.and.mittens", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861028471544824, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:23:43", "owner": "art_mystic_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097089691892508, "text": "same😩", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:18:14", "owner": "sonia_ns134340", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103340074672294, "text": "Me", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:15:40", "owner": "gabriel__eilish", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17876400474443831, "text": "No cos all I can say is thank you and then later get mad I didn't compliment back", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:56:58", "owner": "franzi_staaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985994265914791, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:55:38", "owner": "raquelle.sr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877684687433699, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:47:30", "owner": "alann_trn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100601410745454, "text": "MEE", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:41:56", "owner": "chrv_777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852355174593994, "text": "That's not that bad.. I just smirk like an idiot lmao", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:39:31", "owner": "steven.oscar21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081329327320812, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:33:31", "owner": "smritidas__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066113501395854, "text": "la même pose que sur sa photo de profil", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:26:40", "owner": "syxukii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129262453496090, "text": "My conversation skills 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:16:37", "owner": "ikram.mohiuddin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087658084789067, "text": "lost it when she scream 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:14:54", "owner": "hanandleeknowbetwerkingat3am", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074477981018399, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:14:24", "owner": "kaa_n_aak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069965705460975, "text": "This", "created_at": "2025-12-01T14:50:29", "owner": "dreary.dreaming", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980754669778589, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T14:44:33", "owner": "damarislupu3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048620801427759, "text": "I saw the original one like 2 days ago..", "created_at": "2025-12-01T14:24:44", "owner": "a.by_06soo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083408332877085, "text": "😔", "created_at": "2025-12-01T14:10:25", "owner": "its_lil_gud", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18433028536107430, "text": "The bystanders just watching 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T14:04:12", "owner": "daedric_nightshade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891893713239816, "text": "Omg I have been loving this trend. The crashouts are so realll. Just in my head ofc", "created_at": "2025-12-01T14:03:29", "owner": "daedric_nightshade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991405914887325, "text": "That’s me !!!!", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:57:29", "owner": "uhsiang08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059733353256939, "text": "That’s me 🥲", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:45:39", "owner": "stevia_29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164560696387924, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:34:02", "owner": "alanaasinero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060553631633152, "text": "Dude in the back was concerned 😭🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:33:22", "owner": "zi._.yuan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059040776275712, "text": "Lmao I feel this", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:29:10", "owner": "horse_urine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900175858337336, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🥲", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:28:58", "owner": "hakunnsipvang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110668894606308, "text": "NO BUT REALLY (hi Lila)", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:21:24", "owner": "im_literlily_awesome", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18066126311612086, "text": "Frr 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:03:05", "owner": "huhhh.1000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002027315682177, "text": "I suffer from this and being awkward", "created_at": "2025-12-01T12:54:10", "owner": "sezjournals", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321219712171277, "text": "“thanks! you too!” (they don’t have a purse) 🕳️🏃‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-12-01T12:48:23", "owner": "blu3.berri_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18492509005072480, "text": "me when someone gives me the compliment of despair and agony", "created_at": "2025-12-01T12:40:50", "owner": "cashisataehyungholic_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085999669997612, "text": "@c0rps3bvnny", "created_at": "2025-12-01T12:32:50", "owner": "miriya___", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17852608827543807, "text": "Hk background?", "created_at": "2025-12-01T12:24:26", "owner": "ashwee_ong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874284229452259, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T12:12:17", "owner": "vveecl3000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109798933533904, "text": "Me when an officer said have a good evening and I said good morning 💀", "created_at": "2025-12-01T11:57:17", "owner": "e.baechu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111817735608250, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T11:47:33", "owner": "crow.kaeru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087410848955635, "text": "Yup, thts me 😐", "created_at": "2025-12-01T11:42:53", "owner": "wsahehe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024126635595043, "text": "🙌😢", "created_at": "2025-12-01T11:27:34", "owner": "_heleniee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082558405884945, "text": "@idk.anshikaa", "created_at": "2025-12-01T11:13:46", "owner": "idk.anshikaa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095356618803677, "text": "Ik where this is I think it’s in HK cuz I been there before", "created_at": "2025-12-01T10:28:21", "owner": "waffleplayz_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18400664992124242, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T10:12:17", "owner": "ccc.s_j.x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074200085523926, "text": "Nice", "created_at": "2025-12-01T10:10:18", "owner": "mels_clozet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932517115131780, "text": "It's meeeee😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:53:43", "owner": "nurmita._.afruz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18375521422155673, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:47:21", "owner": "whos_pransh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027209006577406, "text": "Meeeeeee", "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:37:49", "owner": "yash2_00928", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18548934319026128, "text": "SAME💔", "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:34:51", "owner": "xoxojahnaviii_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144438958449087, "text": "me when i have to say good evening but instead i say,full of confidence \"yeah,gOoD MOrnInG🤓🙏\"", "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:03:52", "owner": "reb_ose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049978601400783, "text": "Frrrr", "created_at": "2025-12-01T08:45:33", "owner": "audwn75", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17884979430406871, "text": "西半山🫰🏻", "created_at": "2025-12-01T08:40:05", "owner": "emily.dayoooo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085557422045451, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T08:35:14", "owner": "joujou__6m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856173121568925, "text": "....me", "created_at": "2025-12-01T08:20:52", "owner": "tammyang1984", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066793967454697, "