{"media_id": 3776576273230098187, "shortcode": "DRpGByBDG8L", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRpGByBDG8L/", "taken_at": "2025-11-30T05:31:01", "caption": "日本利用压电瓷砖将人们的脚步转化为电能。\n这些瓷砖能够捕捉你脚步产生的动能。\n当你行走时，你的体重和动作会对瓷砖产生压力。\n瓷砖会轻微弯曲，产生机械应力。\n瓷砖内部的压电材料会将这种应力转化为电能。\n每一步都会产生少量电荷，数百万步加在一起，就能产生足够的电力来驱动 LED 灯、数字显示屏和传感器。\n在像涩谷车站这样人流密集的地方，每天大约 240 万步都在为这个系统做贡献。\n这些电力可以储存起来或立即使用，从而减少对传统能源的依赖，并支持可持续的城市基础设施。\n这种方法把日常的动作转化为实用的可再生能源。\n#日本 #知识 #事实 #你知道吗 #推荐 #科技 #创新 #历史 #技术 #实验 #热门", "owner_username": "absxlute.edits7", "owner_id": "64677930205", "likes": 45486, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0080_DRpGByBDG8L\\DRpGByBDG8L_20251130_053101.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18112828108526308, "text": "bruh gabi's original is 10/10 bruh", "created_at": "2025-12-01T18:31:12", "owner": "ruhaan_ok", "likes": 1199}, {"id": 18422789230119507, "text": "Gabi ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-30T13:02:47", "owner": "1.kingsuraj", "likes": 501}, {"id": 18045896153702555, "text": "Why Gabi original voice kinda...🔥❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:07:18", "owner": "chxttrx_chxtxn", "likes": 36}, {"id": 18087239956824371, "text": "never rate again", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:25:36", "owner": "mr_prince_miri", "likes": 875}, {"id": 18074400854193772, "text": "Gabi❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:44:08", "owner": "doutziepoutzie2016", "likes": 32}, {"id": 18100940860776659, "text": "her voice is good but that song is cheeks so 0/10 bro", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:25:46", "owner": "absolutely_not_a_person", "likes": 86}, {"id": 17953910844023747, "text": "Ava Max's song is so good!❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-01T14:41:20", "owner": "zhangtingru69", "likes": 47}, {"id": 18211655815310449, "text": "Ava max 🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:33:46", "owner": "soma40440", "likes": 156}, {"id": 18045428780479977, "text": "Gw setuju bgt untuk gaby dan ava max's", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:15:12", "owner": "xnsnly_17", "likes": 73}, {"id": 1808259