{"media_id": 3736556504544224521, "shortcode": "DPa6lgAiKUJ", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DPa6lgAiKUJ/", "taken_at": "2025-10-05T08:36:34", "caption": "Cranbrook Applefayre No. 22: Fête de la Pomme. Avec Inspector Clousseau, Marie Antoinette et Les Folies Bergeres.  Marveilleux!  #cranbrook #applefayre #villagelife #fêtedelapomme #cancan #ohlala #", "owner_username": "don.barclay", "owner_id": "3132152447", "likes": 59049, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0081_DPa6lgAiKUJ\\DPa6lgAiKUJ_20251005_083634.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18068311643380126, "text": "The men really appreciating the culture and making their presence honourable. I can tell", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:18:43", "owner": "brokenight247", "likes": 424}, {"id": 17927035452171079, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:03:01", "owner": "elxero0", "likes": 3723}, {"id": 18105828145623030, "text": "Vive le France", "created_at": "2025-11-12T15:39:40", "owner": "marcusblonde", "likes": 498}, {"id": 17856811398568169, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T11:57:38", "owner": "praga_deesh2005", "likes": 435}, {"id": 18092222287905969, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:06:27", "owner": "animeshedits", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18053464004635392, "text": "That kid at the front didn’t need the internet that night..", "created_at": "2025-10-12T16:10:49", "owner": "stivka001", "likes": 12764}, {"id": 17979536864938348, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:19:06", "owner": "lil_amachi", "likes": 767}, {"id": 18246751837290955, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T11:48:23", "owner": "shhumeet_6", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18006964835664279, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:02:33", "owner": "himan_shu.editz", "likes": 139}, {"id": 18050386115389922, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:03:41", "owner": "elxero0", "likes": 766}, {"id": 17879051895433351, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:51:28", "owner": "sok.willy", "likes": 157}, {"id": 18407172052140481, "text": "Stop showing the crowd, concentrate on the stage", "created_at": "2025-10-11T11:35:50", "owner": "chander51", "likes": 2103}, {"id": 17894695257368025, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:38:52", "owner": "nabajeet_mandal", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18546131725031585, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:44:38", "owner": "eltonpoersch", "likes": 83}, {"id": 17991184469909320, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T13:05:40", "owner": "ecx_zoro", "likes": 23}, {"id": 18083556296113589, "text": "Muito legal 😍 Porém talvez, Não deveria ter crianças na plateia 🤔", "created_at": "2025-12-13T02:50:48", "owner": "jeanklugcosta", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098169427773388, "text": "En el futuro eso estará prohibido por el gobierno musulmán qué se les viene", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:11:02", "owner": "hobbies.y.colecciones", "likes": 1036}, {"id": 18035034149724428, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T23:26:23", "owner": "otebguerra", "likes": 87}, {"id": 17871331803443791, "text": "It’s a day that the young lad at the front will never forget!😮", "created_at": "2025-10-12T20:48:15", "owner": "paul_swain77", "likes": 1114}, {"id": 17946137247078919, "text": "Noooss somos 4", "created_at": "2025-12-07T16:27:26", "owner": "bismarks1", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18065827073176082, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T19:27:27", "owner": "tadej_crnko30", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17980775036942063, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T17:07:14", "owner": "_al1.mardon_007", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18087511895485333, "text": "Imagine bringing your children to this 🤡", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:31:24", "owner": "jyoshiee", "likes": 137}, {"id": 18113731891586945, "text": "La vida de un crítico es sencilla en muchos aspectos arriesgamos poco y tenemos poder sobre aquellos que ofrecen su trabajo", "created_at": "2025-12-12T14:57:15", "owner": "alfamoreno6", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17928682668079452, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T10:11:44", "owner": "