try or get banned\"", "created_at": "2025-12-13T18:40:45", "owner": "g.ethye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036811715519318, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T18:29:27", "owner": "otromsatse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070367111457149, "text": "Idk if I like this tradition", "created_at": "2025-12-13T18:15:36", "owner": "phantomhusband007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083660462025707, "text": "🙏✌️👌🫡", "created_at": "2025-12-13T18:06:21", "owner": "shiven2301", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338734456224690, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T17:55:15", "owner": "savulika_0299", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080716759930618, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T17:23:11", "owner": "7bobur_256", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047396342694807, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-13T17:13:13", "owner": "rodrigo.pincer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18190324378338109, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T17:07:09", "owner": "cyderx_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990898452861698, "text": "Isn't that a brothel dance?", "created_at": "2025-12-13T16:53:18", "owner": "felipe.ur_87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544984180038218, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T16:46:46", "owner": "viptor_soaress", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972685551972210, "text": "Ooh yeaaahhh", "created_at": "2025-12-13T16:44:11", "owner": "voorhees_wrx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992666613730774, "text": "Somos 5 prostitutas lalalalalalal hajajajajah", "created_at": "2025-12-13T16:42:36", "owner": "desgarrador_drogskol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853593244596040, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T16:21:12", "owner": "_nightmare_97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063246440226584, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T16:09:15", "owner": "rov_thecat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18412159054143620, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T15:52:27", "owner": "lucca_mx7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090396103763165, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-13T15:40:40", "owner": "saad.shakil7n7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105528475644046, "text": "Thanks, we ve seen everything 😂😂😂", "create