amentally immoral.☹️", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:46:09", "owner": "the_master_981", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046344062472310, "text": "\"somos 4 prostitutas las más grandes de putas de esta discoteca La La La La La\"", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:27:50", "owner": "justincor08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18190653019338928, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:20:38", "owner": "binu_4_bro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922836490054345, "text": "I love this culture", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:01:19", "owner": "marksmieeetu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065931983390529, "text": "Would’ve been better if they had a real band playing instead of speakers", "created_at": "2025-12-08T15:40:39", "owner": "imtherealaiden3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889209949264042, "text": "Кан-кан танец проституток 👍🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-08T15:07:48", "owner": "ru.sik0808", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087940186789720, "text": "Teaching these young men early 👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-08T14:42:29", "owner": "iisitworthittravel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18318117604220932, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-08T14:03:11", "owner": "gowreesh_anil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085074083012921, "text": "Bad cameraman", "created_at": "2025-12-08T12:25:20", "owner": "16arpitmaurya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172490020372408, "text": "Where where where", "created_at": "2025-12-08T11:19:39", "owner": "gabriel_maciiel_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843561676633783, "text": "Essa raiz cultural precisa ser preservada, não o culto a feiura dassa gentalha woke.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T10:35:06", "owner": "henrique_piologo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094549370504327, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-08T09:44:46", "owner": "a.rus1k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087632245811439, "text": "Bu hangi kültür bilmiyorum ama bu kültürü seviyorum", "created_at": "2025-12-08T07:32:14", "owner": "darkus_wolffenoid_v2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18149165290425191, "text": "I was born on a mountain", "created_at": "2025-12-08T07:29:36", "owner": "nic_atlas", "li