, "owner": "_enricobellini_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030178274757038, "text": "Le garçon avait une belle vue, j'en suis sûr 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:20:03", "owner": "grrrreyes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884797552408935, "text": "👏👏👏😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:49:40", "owner": "freddy_yami", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131294011495972, "text": "Why people are mad at parents bringing their children to this? It's a cultural festival, not a strip Mall.. Please come out of your hub and touch some grass.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:48:06", "owner": "maxpoweroverdr1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077638645973490, "text": "Worst camera man", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:44:53", "owner": "ora_ora_ora_jj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008184134817875, "text": "Probably the only reason to go to France @kitsune_spirit__", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:42:40", "owner": "ysocosplay", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18087950605798576, "text": "😍😍😍🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:35:09", "owner": "saglamergunergun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954672240900671, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:19:03", "owner": "sh4dman_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18326270257244636, "text": "Trash camera man😭 and what is this culture", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:31:13", "owner": "keyaru_sama_76", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872997145463643, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:28:02", "owner": "maikal_ota", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091277026937948, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:00:25", "owner": "demon_heart_29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396858193134158, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:51:42", "owner": "jv_desenho_miniaturas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079011634949008, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:11:17", "owner": "gar_polo_zzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881054317424481, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:59:11", "owner": "aeb3000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003885623821797, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:18:45", "owner": "e1mayones0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063893369194737, "text": "", "crea