}, {"id": 18093846676720763, "text": "Saint denis😃", "created_at": "2025-12-04T03:23:34", "owner": "meiti_021", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18427999714128624, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T03:09:46", "owner": "avinash.lakra.5220", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025308362784032, "text": "Le LFI est extrêmement en colère", "created_at": "2025-12-04T03:02:28", "owner": "xsurvivands1993x", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17988921941745565, "text": "We need more videos of this wonderful dance art for.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T02:56:30", "owner": "djdannyfierce", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877199653353575, "text": "Шикарно! 🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-04T02:48:47", "owner": "druzhinin971", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915063670252478, "text": "Pas mal non ? C'est Français 🗿 🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-12-04T02:41:43", "owner": "ara_ara_matteur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088086568982080, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T02:16:45", "owner": "rin_h10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121231381545036, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T02:07:04", "owner": "ernandesalv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096124897687398, "text": "And the Brits complain about brown people invading their lands. Lmfao guess they forgot Belgium exists mainly due to English hatred for the French? Lol Or that the USA mainly exists because of the Frenchs hatred for England. Lmfao", "created_at": "2025-12-04T01:57:53", "owner": "pinkmandan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083574803039931, "text": "EEUU?", "created_at": "2025-12-04T01:55:23", "owner": "kenerudopp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100174834762887, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T01:51:56", "owner": "0xacikus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18549968812050319, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T01:46:16", "owner": "al3x_alvarex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079922882164535, "text": "Se le ve la caries a las muelas", "created_at": "2025-12-04T01:38:25", "owner": "perseo_1993", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096338719850412, "text": "Somo cuatro prostitutas, la banda de putas, de esta discoteca lalala", "created_at": "2025-1