: 0}, {"id": 17857570044559199, "text": "The people of the west that where shoes inside their houses the same as they were them outside also think that this is some kind of family entertainment for their children", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:34:17", "owner": "gterchen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082487198283587, "text": "Where is this place? I'm coming to live there. 👏👏👏😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-26T04:51:18", "owner": "isimsizkahraman929292", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926307559160893, "text": "ご機嫌だぜ〜っ！🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:33:55", "owner": "0719.sasaki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850894648596098, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:05:00", "owner": "m.rodri91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942024502084643, "text": "Rapaz. 😳😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:20:55", "owner": "tocadorpra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035885333734170, "text": "🤩🤩🤩🤩🤩🤩🤩🤩🤩🤩🤩🤩🤩🤩🤩🤩🤩🤩", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:07:01", "owner": "luizpaulo2258", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982062138926371, "text": "Франция не изменилась 🔥 Молодцы", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:18:51", "owner": "mujer_con_abanico_verde", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087549484982135, "text": "Music so🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:17:05", "owner": "blackbird239.2.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081891461024785, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:47:06", "owner": "adme_cad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987234666871142, "text": "Die Melodie ist ein richtiger Ohrwurm", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:38:55", "owner": "jonathanlampert", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896788378205173, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:38:41", "owner": "jonathanlampert", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100266169690211, "text": "😂😂😂😍👏🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:07:22", "owner": "rotterdam1nl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084660422012893, "text": "👍👍👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:29:23", "owner": "mazinraffoly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084793103083148, "text": "Cancan due secoli di storia e non sentirli, cabaret, Belle Epoche, Moulin Rouge. Danza dal ritmo incalzante e piena di energia vitale. Spaccate, ruote, calze nere, biancheria intima, scandaloso e provocatorio per i valori vittoriani dell'epoca, sfidava l'ordine borghese, simbolo della libertà e dell'emacipazione femminile esaltato e immortalato da Toulouse Lautrec.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:16:54", "owner": "gianfrancopagnotta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078206476938962, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:42:36", "owner": "margit.larsson.775", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545013328039256, "text": "Очень, очень красиво!!! 🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:33:54", "owner": "fiodorovvaleriipetrovich", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078532681907412, "text": "OUTSTANDING 👏👏👏 The REAL Can Can", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:20:32", "owner": "stanhope719", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131005021495838, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:17:58", "owner": "juliacademico", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059125070266869, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:17:22", "owner": "hkosroalvand", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052087883657366, "text": "Ублюдки Европы только копытами тресут", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:11:09", "owner": "aksabox2640490", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17860453968476824, "text": "This women husbands : 😶", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:45:05", "owner": "arvindhan_98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366585124087954, "text": "😍😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:42:37", "owner": "aa.rman765", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073140554519760, "text": "یاد فیلم های وسترن قدیمی افتادم 😂👏", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:30:45", "owner": "akramganbarei1982", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102944866676126, "text": "🙌❤️👏🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:26:55", "owner": "aleksdudinskiy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908692702270618, "text": "Super", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:25:20", "owner": "vaumbela", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18551649532044414, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:51:53", "owner": "pepsi93193", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083130851279625, "text": "😂😂😂👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:46:21", "o