{"media_id": 3678750704646144795, "shortcode": "DMNjEZnpsMb", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DMNjEZnpsMb/", "taken_at": "2025-07-17T14:10:41", "caption": "A particularly charming and widely circulated viral video features a very young Sabrina Carpenter performing Carly Rae Jepsen’s hit song “Call Me Maybe,” where she adorably experiences a minor stumble. The clip, which resurfaces periodically and delights fans, shows a pre-teen Carpenter on what appears to be a stage, likely at a talent show or local performance.\nFull of youthful energy and enthusiasm, she’s singing her heart out, moving around with typical childhood exuberance. At one point, perhaps caught up in the moment or the choreography, she loses her footing and takes a tumble. However, true to her future professional demeanor, she quickly recovers, barely missing a beat in her performance, and continues to sing with a smile.\nThis sweet and relatable moment has resonated with many, serving as a testament to her early passion for performing and her innate resilience. For fans who know her now as a successful pop star and actress, the video offers a delightful glimpse into her beginnings, showcasing her natural talent and charismatic presence even from a very young age, long before she became a household name. It’s a reminder that even seasoned performers had their endearing, clumsy moments on the road to stardom.", "owner_username": "celebscoobdaily", "owner_id": "74940342201", "likes": 699594, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0082_DMNjEZnpsMb\\DMNjEZnpsMb_20250717_141041.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18280450690279460, "text": "„Where you think you‘re going baby?“ 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-09-04T15:20:43", "owner": "jakob_ausberlin", "likes": 9917}, {"id": 17977106165865934, "text": "Que profesional para seguir cantando desde el piso...", "created_at": "2025-09-03T22:33:23", "owner": "quevez2d", "likes": 4129}, {"id": 17868176370411977, "text": "Sabrina Carpenter❌ Sabrina on the carpet✅", "created_at": "2025-07-20T10:07:44", "owner": "aviation_skies_and_planemodels", "likes": 54333}, {"id": 18059603786098091, "text": "Casi nos quedamos sin Espresso 😅", "created_at": "2025-09-05T01:05:37", "owner": "estefaniaestrada251", "likes": 11031}, {"id": 17863165404387585, "text": "sabrina carpenter ❌\nla sobrina del carpintero ✅", "created_at": "2025-08-11T20:06:55", "owner": "prz_alessiaaa", "likes": 3796}, {"id": 17935104558064575, "text": "Sabrina Carpenter ❌ El Primooo !!✅", "created_at": "2025-08-14T02:31:46", "owner": "zakary.md", "likes": 1037}, {"id": 18078808273798361, "text": "SONÓ DURÍSIMO JAJAJAJAJA 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-09-14T20:35:58", "owner": "isa.idkomg", "likes": 194}, {"id": 17950146059862006, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-22T19:59:14", "owner": "aureliociancio", "likes": 1542}, {"id": 17862991854378065, "text": "Bros face after she fell", "created_at": "2025-07-26T02:35:33", "owner": "domdom7oh7", "likes": 10083}, {"id": 18033929450499260, "text": "La huella digital de Sabrina 😭", "created_at": "2025-09-14T16:50:19", "owner": "life.with_aila", "likes": 541}, {"id": 18294312844261029, "text": "por isso nenhum homem sobrevive aos clipes dela", "created_at": "2025-10-26T04:12:29", "owner": "lauramontoia", "likes": 2829}, {"id": 18084197113914210, "text": "Is she still alive?", "created_at": "2025-08-30T14:31:12", "owner": "cysinstax", "likes": 64}, {"id": 17973569102862347, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-21T13:48:05", "owner": "rik.broederseftely", "likes": 34194}, {"id": 18067297580160214, "text": "🗣\"Where you think you going baby\"", "created_at": "2025-07-22T19:05:45", "owner": "vicasmelo", "likes": 4291}, {"id": 18078512644789556, "text": "Sabrina carpenter actually turned into a carpet after this..", "created_at": "2025-09-04T04:36:37", "owner": "naina.choudhary1111", "likes": 1825}, {"id": 18368666983082456, "text": "THAT WAS SABRINA CARPENTER????", "created_at": "2025-11-24T22:44:15",