ated_at": "2025-09-03T19:13:02", "owner": "margarita_tasakou", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18494156215070523, "text": "Fall me maybe", "created_at": "2025-09-11T00:26:09", "owner": "axel_williams2011", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18006775052820583, "text": "Ahora entiendo de dónde viene el amor de Sabrina hacia los hombres 🥰", "created_at": "2025-11-16T16:08:14", "owner": "ax_alns", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063663176430560, "text": "She fell that espresso released", "created_at": "2025-11-16T10:48:15", "owner": "ylqly.lqq", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18182849206353464, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-15T22:42:06", "owner": "mariana_marianaaaa2013", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17959597509006761, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-14T11:59:03", "owner": "p__t_g_l_k", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17848839690575519, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-11T17:01:13", "owner": "sparks_comfy_24", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18102188515612120, "text": "@yuhitstegan this was her???🤣", "created_at": "2025-09-20T06:56:14", "owner": "blindingobsession", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18077847802964005, "text": "Legend has it that this exact head slam is what gave her the brain injuries that cause her to genuinely believe that her music is good", "created_at": "2025-09-13T03:18:52", "owner": "john_mueller27", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17919142671172238, "text": "That was the bonk she needed", "created_at": "2025-09-28T23:17:54", "owner": "666seduction", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147968704417305, "text": "@imng05._ cười dón", "created_at": "2025-10-01T17:05:24", "owner": "nguyenmomo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920747206039056, "text": "Casi nos dejan sin expreso", "created_at": "2025-09-28T07:17:00", "owner": "emi.burnout", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17937010785074754, "text": "Industrial plant from the start", "created_at": "2025-09-26T11:17:52", "owner": "expoclothing111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125873893484581, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-23T12:59:42", "owner": "bwu_5", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075004907095369, "text": "NO DO IT ON THE BEAT DROPPPP", "created_at": "2025-09-14T23:16:27", "owner": "sixshot_1016", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104871682599431, "text": "*ughm* 🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-19T17:57:31", "owner": "_stivenmj_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18032921675491733, "text": "he broke her nose", "created_at": "2025-08-20T19:43:22", "owner": "anitaraggii", "likes": 73}, {"id": 18045662465339286, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-17T16:37:46", "owner": "bardin_ethan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18198564649314269, "text": "That thud tho 😭", "created_at": "2025-09-11T15:06:36", "owner": "vicentefgoncalves", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18077831401952527, "text": "Youre fine! Youre fine! Dont tell mom! 😂🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-09-16T15:55:43", "owner": "wildcoastbeachcomber", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18052607708626798, "text": "is she still alive 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-09-17T04:35:06", "owner": "deepmind52", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042114683381246, "text": "E foi assim que Sabrina Carpinteira parou de crescer", "created_at": "2025-09-03T23:36:39", "owner": "lucena.jeni", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18033221288503573, "text": "We almost ran out of espresso. 😭", "created_at": "2025-09-14T17:01:50", "owner": "berenjena.pb", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18151940377394379, "text": "Foi aí q ela parou de crescer", "created_at": "2025-09-13T15:24:33", "owner": "viniccius_23e", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17943274416023978, "text": "very deserved", "created_at": "2025-09-13T18:02:35", "owner": "itzbelliboo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18429519736102081, "text": "Is the table okay", "created_at": "2025-09-13T05:26:28", "owner": "ghost_girl_forever_ever", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17854599177532541, "text": "Это не Сабрина", "created_at": "2025-09-13T14:31:40", "owner": "mentllish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109587226550868, "text": "She became a bop bro", "created_at": "2025-09-12T01:38:48", "owner": "_fried_donut_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079652536782079, "text": "Sabrina Spine bender", "created_at": "2025-09-12T11:39:03", "owner": "hashimloreez_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 1806049273