ikes": 0}, {"id": 18075430160205635, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:26:18", "owner": "ford_yana7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396921205123545, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:11:48", "owner": "leafs_lounge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946347169077665, "text": "Agora tá explicado a bunda quadrada", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:44:52", "owner": "uma_fa_da_ladygaga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928383409154604, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:40:06", "owner": "solseabras", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061627370215080, "text": "THAT WAS SABRINA", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:10:20", "owner": "erick_neumann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856201243569701, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:02:13", "owner": "sophia1236073", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032655479726808, "text": "EU TO ME MIJANDO DE RIR JÁ", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:28:19", "owner": "elianemonte55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089509499296365, "text": "le hizo la de raw vs smackdown", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:30:41", "owner": "jair_.6._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18166417399378764, "text": "lol😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:45:13", "owner": "charleigh.curtis.dancer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109575562533021, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:28:24", "owner": "vaqtbu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18006664559659498, "text": "Why does it look like ai to me?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:46:21", "owner": "trustissuesblondeguy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18170633581373828, "text": "Alguém sabe quem é esse menino com ela? Eles podiam refazer desse vídeo akakakka", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:59:21", "owner": "tataolivetree", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990151788736209, "text": "ESSE VÍDEO NUNCA PERDE A GRAÇA KAKAKAKAKAKAKAKKAAKAKKAKAKAKAKA", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:25:43", "owner": "zazahsantos_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084617354047451, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:47:53", "owner": "sazym481v03cfj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065894225133949, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:06:00", "owner": "kalmikze", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990811698885000, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:34:02", "owner": "youlin_1494", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084444539010763, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:20:57", "owner": "me_gustalazarzaritaa", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17911628532254479, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:32:26", "owner": "joss_gonzales993", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885634621405159, "text": "It does make a sense", "created_at": "2025-11-26T13:55:16", "owner": "mijanawei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067265021113159, "text": "@fra.iannuu", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:15:32", "owner": "pianteebasta_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067576784109445, "text": "Did they survive?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:20:16", "owner": "joshua.arenas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159015538404416, "text": "That’s my future wife y’all", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:22:41", "owner": "ic_e_t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111722137521118, "text": "The *BANG* tho😭", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:33:08", "owner": "bobthebuilder8541", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046649057678849, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:23:17", "owner": "_eht7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032955746720278, "text": "Cuál es esa pose de juno?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:26:19", "owner": "luuchopp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027333305769136, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T18:38:17", "owner": "znaim9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105678562727288, "text": "Oh, Sabri, are you okay? How are you? Everything alright? Can you sing? She says, \"Yes, I'm fine, I'll sing,\" and then she hits him like she does to her, since the same thing happens to her. xD There's that beating! xD 🗿🗣️", "created_at": "2025-11-23T16:13:14", "owner": "acosta.giovanni_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873782515377597, "text": "\"There's not much more I can do to help Sabri,\" said the kid, \"but hey, you're okay now, Sabri,\" said the kid, \"calm down.\" xD 🗿🗣️", "created_at": "2025-11-23T16:12:24", "owner": "acosta.giovanni_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989109921857740, "text": "I put on my Christmas hat and off I go, boom, that happens, well, I don't know how to do it, dude xD 🗿🗣️", "created_at": "2025-11-23T16:06:11", "owner": "acosta.giovanni_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545822497023665, "text": "* Sabri y el amigo friend: *", "created_at": "2025-11-23T16:05:29", "owner": "acosta.giovanni_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083826080082366, "text": "\"Okay, let's see what we have here,\" said the kid. \"Good Sabrina, relax your ass from singing, ehhhhhhhhh, what are you doing?\" How are you going to move me like that, Sabri? Okay, I'll start holding on to you, then I'll lift you up a little more Next, we're going to move you here. Oops, Sabri, are you okay? I wanted to get a good grip on you But I just slipped and fell, butterfingers! Oh well, I don't know what I'll do. Help! Or should I sing since she can't xD Next move, I sing like her 🗿🗣️", "created_at": "2025-11-23T16:04:47", "owner": "acosta.giovanni_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18411948625190375, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T11:05:21", "owner": "diesel_2008", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083298578104559, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T10:01:45", "owner": "orpenbat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065125364625832, "text": "@sabrinacarpenter", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:14:32", "owner": "iczzyyyyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085434182072407, "text": "Desde chiquita ya era puta", "created_at": "2025-11-22T21:43:44", "owner": "zyx.rov3r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073281116196822, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:12:45", "owner": "wat_da_panda_doin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066280637570998, "text": "That was Sabrina? What? How didn’t I connect that 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:48:28", "owner": "yyellow_babyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973463157955425, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:58:33", "owner": "lalax.chula", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18335756221236054, "text": "Se murió", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:47:46", "owner": "debloox_12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070675601067929, "text": "This blow somehow affected her behavior in adulthood. Apparently, some neuron was damaged.😑", "created_at": "2025-11-21T20:13:42", "owner": "rm_aliiiiiiiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851854621588459, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-21T10:38:03", "owner": "nore.177", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114290365574871, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T00:54:09", "owner": "gh_pvd_18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119467504552121, "text": "It’s crazy that Call Me Maybe can out in 2014 and Sabrina Carpenter looks that young", "created_at": "2025-11-21T00:39:18", "owner": "ryannixon60", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066450863577913, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-20T23:54:24", "owner": "daltonlikesmen41", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075372419189542, "text": "Sabrina Carpenter: ❌ Sabrina on the Carpet: ✅", "created_at": "2025-11-20T23:43:02", "owner": "alonesitoyt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135356656474784, "text": "@sabrinacarpenter", "created_at": "2025-11-20T21:38:04", "owner": "_mart.in3z_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070730444198477, "text": "Tell me there siblings 😟", "created_at": "2025-11-20T19:48:08", "owner": "miabrynleyjones", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859608163546425, "text": "Poor Sabrina 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-20T12:11:26", "owner": "just_gefen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851225239591343, "text": "قتل زهرة شبابها بلحظه", "created_at": "2025-11-20T11:53:16", "owner": "ns_i47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18192265918328536, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-20T10:58:14", "owner": "that.1kid23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108596545618199, "text": "I’m just here wondering who dropped her", "created_at": "2025-11-20T09:45:33", "owner": "timmylekimngan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993373044851026, "text": "😂 راسها انطعج", "created_at": "2025-11-20T04:17:34", "owner": "xt.iil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953629449901630, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T03:19:28", "owner": "hppst_amir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969233517974686, "text": "so this brain damage is her secret to her brilliant lyrics?", "created_at": "2025-11-20T02:57:43", "o