ieantonietteaban", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035396444707777, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-14T11:18:51", "owner": "hayley.fawkes", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18111341251569683, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-13T00:05:48", "owner": "shellaknightly", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18133092913464861, "text": "Love you Sabrina carpenter hope I get to meet you one day", "created_at": "2025-10-12T21:35:56", "owner": "mia_buny_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18535535878046566, "text": "WHERE DO YOU THINK YOURE GOING BABY?", "created_at": "2025-10-12T19:51:44", "owner": "cuentatiktokluciamm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061160681383215, "text": "Everyone was doing that back in 2012, thanks to Justin Bieber and Selena Gomez. Virality before the cray cray mainstream we live in today", "created_at": "2025-10-11T18:57:50", "owner": "bauldepetardez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070244426188388, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T00:16:32", "owner": "jhon_jhon_br2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106219291590195, "text": "Call me maybe❌️I believe a can fly✅️", "created_at": "2025-10-10T22:48:24", "owner": "zazou_12j", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069976595214277, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-10T09:27:32", "owner": "ivyregalario_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072207617235092, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-10T06:28:32", "owner": "dra.nel.p", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145818610424427, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-10T06:24:37", "owner": "sora4u95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882167524396054, "text": "Who's that boy?", "created_at": "2025-10-09T11:47:37", "owner": "imjustagirlxr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085050341509201, "text": "Oop........................Are u ok", "created_at": "2025-10-08T09:56:59", "owner": "iamlezhane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079315570838923, "text": "OG youtube.", "created_at": "2025-10-04T20:22:46", "owner": "tallmant14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006814361640422, "text": "Kkkkkkkkkk", "created_at": "2025-10-01T21:00:38", "owner": "leojr.cwb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080109451820217, "text": "Ese fue el golpe del éxito? 🥹", "created_at": "2025-10-01T12:30:29", "owner": "yaninabel_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922484119152219, "text": "Yeah, that had to hurt!", "created_at": "2025-09-26T09:51:16", "owner": "ishmael123455", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983123370906902, "text": "\"a minor tumble\". Nice one, AI description 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-25T19:33:14", "owner": "_monkey_boy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991823889702767, "text": "Thats not Sabrina Carpenter.", "created_at": "2025-09-25T18:48:26", "owner": "cheyneordonio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18538458661008890, "text": "What is the storyline here, I need to know", "created_at": "2025-09-25T14:59:00", "owner": "max_not_welll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069329015270378, "text": "🤣🤣🤣😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-09-24T18:35:23", "owner": "_11aik123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074757653282240, "text": "It's the new remix \"call me an ambulance \"", "created_at": "2025-09-23T13:11:29", "owner": "voiceonline7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064827137593146, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-23T01:32:47", "owner": "fausto.soberon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092551183689943, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-22T21:24:12", "owner": "robert_burtt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995165241684360, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-22T21:23:53", "owner": "robert_burtt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17986725263722577, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-22T09:33:39", "owner": "jayl3n.webb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18385219204125844, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-09-22T02:49:59", "owner": "urgurl_andelita", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125298271470432, "text": "😭🤣", "created_at": "2025-09-22T02:48:04", "owner": "rique_morningstar1968", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133598899455218, "text": "Thanks to that moment she became stupid and started to sing", "created_at": "2025-09-22T00:26:25", "owner": "d4ydre4minn_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899737483145774, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-21T19:05:39", "owner": "theofficailjulishow", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17962886621826457, "t