 "_bentotskiiiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090844486763627, "text": "\"Where you think you're going baby?\" To the floor apparently😭", "created_at": "2025-09-18T14:23:53", "owner": "tired.koffee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882860602380655, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-18T05:59:38", "owner": "zaidan_soud", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895156426316293, "text": "Desde ahí no creció más jajajaja", "created_at": "2025-09-18T04:51:39", "owner": "yossi.cs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846356359545791, "text": "Send her sleeping btw 🥀", "created_at": "2025-09-17T22:19:00", "owner": "niemand.berlin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096472615646149, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣😮👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-17T15:59:08", "owner": "stephanielandais0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18166848883366693, "text": "Why is Emilia Clark there?", "created_at": "2025-09-17T14:16:33", "owner": "silas__design", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990969690698332, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-17T10:34:40", "owner": "orochimaru_the_snake_king", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857034025457343, "text": "Those are skin walkers", "created_at": "2025-09-17T06:19:39", "owner": "nayi91209", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876191167304611, "text": "how dare u guy not @ her @sabrinacarpenter this u?", "created_at": "2025-09-17T00:39:56", "owner": "8vk08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052966166242281, "text": "K.o.", "created_at": "2025-09-16T19:39:09", "owner": "jonah11200", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930255831981150, "text": "FATALITY", "created_at": "2025-09-16T18:31:30", "owner": "bojanszwedo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048494564314726, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-15T20:30:38", "owner": "pam_cocan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176450386346436, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-15T19:56:13", "owner": "itsmeee.jesssicaaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980944875903882, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-09-15T19:54:38", "owner": "maximakinsky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077366411068941, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-15T19:29:59", "owner": "lucasoft31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021011543563338, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-15T14:15:34", "owner": "lyseaaaaa_mntl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17893759533182304, "text": "Homicídio gravado", "created_at": "2025-09-15T13:18:17", "owner": "adilsonpresley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984844035893826, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-15T10:08:28", "owner": "bryan4875i", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094435633604630, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-15T06:07:02", "owner": "aaraiz_22xlife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971234256942181, "text": "Is she ok", "created_at": "2025-09-15T06:05:53", "owner": "kaiyukilani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18416853178109332, "text": "ELLA ERA SABRINA???", "created_at": "2025-09-15T04:33:20", "owner": "annli__014", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099595483617756, "text": "Ni la canta Sabrina carpenter", "created_at": "2025-09-15T04:11:43", "owner": "conyxmilo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076981790001225, "text": "explains alot", "created_at": "2025-09-15T03:21:25", "owner": "dimwittledee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085723048846518, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-15T02:59:24", "owner": "jaxa_buxara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18291553024253878, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-15T02:58:57", "owner": "arturo_the_tigga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055898378446911, "text": "I respect her so much I was trying not to laugh but it came out", "created_at": "2025-09-15T02:26:21", "owner": "layshaa01_backup", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079250815959914, "text": "AHHAHAHAHAHAHAHHAHAHAHAHAHHAHAHAHAHHAHAHAHAHAHAHHA", "created_at": "2025-09-15T01:24:28", "owner": "joaogabrielbrayandos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084036976926265, "text": "Não precisava matar a menina também", "created_at": "2025-09-15T00:16:45", "owner": "jon_fabbri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958316853972777, "text": "Are we gonna ignore how Sabrina Carpenter wasn't even the one who made this", "created_at": "2025-09-14T23:27:12", "owner": "alterthedark", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075564728024010, "text": "Holy mackerel", "created_at": "2025-09-14T23:12:46", "owner": "ur_lovin_mya", "