_amer09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039305093658180, "text": "Sobase🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-13T01:44:33", "owner": "pabloztre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18393092077191466, "text": "Not it sounding like an explosion 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-13T01:36:43", "owner": "emrose328", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073543625062425, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-13T01:27:43", "owner": "giorgiaaa_0027", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18175445548338890, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-13T00:25:58", "owner": "thomasjames.jones", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093535114647224, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-13T00:23:18", "owner": "ali_fb05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18402164512116414, "text": "Sabrina Carpetner ❌ Emilia Clarke✅", "created_at": "2025-08-12T23:30:43", "owner": "s.amelish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090689656736855, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-12T23:25:51", "owner": "reby_20handball", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101143126594660, "text": "Really where are you going", "created_at": "2025-08-12T21:26:21", "owner": "jamesnorwood803", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18361696879196613, "text": "\"Where think you going baby. Nah just inspecting the table closer\"", "created_at": "2025-08-12T21:16:16", "owner": "why_not.kris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087676615766376, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-12T21:09:40", "owner": "maria.sara.b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944875144037893, "text": "When you ask your brother to do something for a video, but you’re really not into it and you just wanna go back and play your video games but you have your annoying ass mom telling you to go do the video with your sister 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-12T20:27:43", "owner": "demonicravenking", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909247717072345, "text": "\"youh, Ale urwał\"", "created_at": "2025-08-12T20:03:43", "owner": "polonazo111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914487682169333, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-08-12T19:47:19", "owner": "jonyx_84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853986274505200, "text": "THAT WAS HER?", "created_at": "2025-08-12T18:22:38", "owner":