rina carpenter❌ Sabrina Carpeted✅", "created_at": "2025-08-11T07:00:10", "owner": "madden__sd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851722795516760, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-11T06:37:45", "owner": "maksymiliantomiak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091072750734550, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-11T06:33:29", "owner": "xela27860", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046816769294781, "text": "Where do you Think youre going baby", "created_at": "2025-08-11T04:40:19", "owner": "hutzelsider_vilfred", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011265359604631, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-11T03:27:22", "owner": "m33lite", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068041835132265, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-11T02:35:37", "owner": "abdiel_0087", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033090002488420, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-08-11T01:47:05", "owner": "giovannakathleencosta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093595540641876, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-11T01:22:17", "owner": "elias.nany28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18307142887171469, "text": "Why does she look animated by Disney???", "created_at": "2025-08-11T00:27:58", "owner": "medefl24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967360056937013, "text": "She fails the song “Where u think u going bby” 😭😂", "created_at": "2025-08-11T00:13:58", "owner": "willi__16_17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050250158234235, "text": "Co tu robi młody multi ?", "created_at": "2025-08-11T00:12:16", "owner": "_panda.brumbrum.szmaty_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071318882026759, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-11T00:01:43", "owner": "isa_belly04717", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969568551930556, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-10T23:38:53", "owner": "antoinepiret19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955147080848115, "text": "Gente será que é por isso que ela parou de crescer", "created_at": "2025-08-10T22:43:48", "owner": "jhonofcx300", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843126775545682, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-10T20:54:55", "owner": "lorenzolarrouke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856165360483632, "text": "Ela caindo igual merda", "