{"media_id": 3649220428849165794, "shortcode": "DKkoqVIpzXi", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DKkoqVIpzXi/", "taken_at": "2025-06-06T20:17:05", "caption": "Anyone else have this hobby?😩", "owner_username": "lexfreemyer", "owner_id": "1549139710", "likes": 1409569, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0085_DKkoqVIpzXi\\DKkoqVIpzXi_20250606_201705.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18302896459246446, "text": "We were poor, so I chased mine with a knife", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:12:17", "owner": "cealeena", "likes": 263619}, {"id": 18359306344198020, "text": "I know she’s traumatized whenever she sees that horse😭😭", "created_at": "2025-06-06T20:18:13", "owner": "seydi.v.12", "likes": 78007}, {"id": 18070598419962155, "text": "COME HERE 🗣", "created_at": "2025-06-07T02:34:48", "owner": "walkerodeo", "likes": 22965}, {"id": 17931156101942606, "text": "the horse is running in italics", "created_at": "2025-06-08T03:42:55", "owner": "mohineetvirdi", "likes": 9637}, {"id": 17963715374781904, "text": "“BURN THOSE CALORIES GURL CMON”🗣️🗣️", "created_at": "2025-06-07T09:01:01", "owner": "yobihfavwhiteboy", "likes": 119520}, {"id": 17853552258452725, "text": "Horse is probably like \" oh we doing this again...ok bet\"", "created_at": "2025-06-06T21:04:46", "owner": "piece_of_f.ing_trash", "likes": 141477}, {"id": 18107825602551663, "text": "Hahahahahaha I did this to my little brothers and then they started scaring the horse and I almost fell. Good memories .", "created_at": "2025-07-23T16:49:44", "owner": "wendydourado", "likes": 116}, {"id": 18063425951134837, "text": "Practice throwing a rope while you’re at it", "created_at": "2025-06-06T21:00:26", "owner": "chase._.nichols", "likes": 48848}, {"id": 17842013670532489, "text": "What's your sister's favourite hobby", "created_at": "2025-06-29T11:12:11", "owner": "cormac.maher", "likes": 229}, {"id": 18047393327388095, "text": "C'MERE 👹🗣️🗣️", "created_at": "2025-06-07T12:08:36", "owner": "roxannabanana120", "likes": 7782}, {"id": 18051770822093688, "text": "This is going to come out in a major meltdown at Thanksgiving dinner ten years from now. Make sure you video it. 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T15:27:27", "owner": "jameswilliamsinsta1", "likes": 2943}, {"id": 18410131552103012, "text": "If I had a little sibling I would of been doing this haha", "created_at": "2025-06-07T01:25:33", "owner": "briehammo", "likes": 3468}, {"id": 18405811327105888, "text": "CAHHMM HERE 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T03:36:03", "owner": "lyssornelaz", "likes": 567}, {"id": 18009809867769572, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-05T01:44:54", "owner": "nurungi_hamster", "likes": 24}, {"id": 18110878123558090, "text": "mind you i came here from the Lorax video", "created_at": "2025-09-18T20:54:56", "owner": "jacob_groth", "likes": 43}, {"id": 17927208471149869, "text": "bro i love whatever is wrong w you😂😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-13T19:11:31", "owner": "ykufw.maraa", "likes": 177}, {"id": 17864053710353015, "text": "Me chasing my kids", "created_at": "2025-07-03T22:28:23", "owner": "lauren.stewart.living", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18035653118343648, "text": "Is that horse drifting?", "created_at": "2025-06-08T15:30:04", "owner": "micahhaney1000", "likes": 90}, {"id": 17970498671749753, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-09T15:36:07", "owner": "ez7_dondon", "likes": 13}, {"id": 17915132253015843, "text": "Red dead IRL", "created_at": "2025-06-12T15:06:46", "owner": "chibigreen.official", "likes": 308}, {"id": 18055153208341318, "text": "Lol 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-29T16:37:46", "owner": "justincaseexotics", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17916032754116930, "text": "Precious", "created_at": "2025-07-22T23:19:23", "owner": "airbornecamera", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17981797136838116, "text": "She learned that from her ancestors 😂😬", "created_at": "2025-06-13T03:09:44", "owner": "tw11k_w", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18504193927043682, "text": "This reminds me of a rooster that use to chase me. That dam rooster scared the crap put of me", "created_at": "2025-06-06T20:29:14", "owner": "_lovely_poison_92", "likes": 4126}, {"id": 18024821459719343, "text": "Why is your horse not moving straight", "created_at": "2025-09-11T12:56:44", "owner": "y0fta", "likes": 16}, {"id": 18075465163923393, "text": "“Rawwrrr” 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:59:14", "owner": "thebitchtheylovetohate", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068629403455323, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-12T23:35:47", "owner": "josmgarcia", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17990053031668113, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-17T11:02:45", "owner": "webb.devil", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18532143889025144, "text": "I need to get a new hobby haha", "created_at": "2025-10-26T20:52:08", "owner": "thedeokjun", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18047358770411265, "text": "My sister chased me with a clothes hanger, this isn’t fair", "created_at": "2025-06-08T03:20:04", "owner": "mellysomerville", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18124133083458225, "text": "i want to do this to my sister so bad 😂😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-20T12:46:59", "owner": "eclipwzeiee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17952598140025953, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:51:18", "owner": "alonor1526", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17874543105375246, "text": "LMFAO that’s my fav hobby too. Just chasing her period @sumooch", "created_at": "2025-12-03T00:54:39", "owner": "huhusay", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17877831108346838, "text": "We’ve been trying to reach you about your car extended warranty", "created_at": "2025-06-08T11:50:34", "owner": "paul_.argentine", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17934186921127262, "text": "That's slavery 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:08:26", "owner": "messyhair_41", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18399692356119120, "text": "No prisoners, no witnesses", "created_at": "2025-07-22T16:51:14", "owner": "eswar_sai_2002", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082569359472698, "text": "How is the horse drifting", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:49:00", "owner": "leka.shala", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18007937108607814, "text": "Low honor Arthur Morgan activities", "created_at": "2025-07-10T04:09:59", "owner": "vault_tec_services", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18183912022319400, "text": "Pavloving your horse to hunt down your sister whenever they get the chance", "created_at": "2025-06-12T12:15:16", "owner": "afterartist", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18083172322696074, "text": "She's playing IRL Red Dead Redemption", "created_at": "2025-06-08T18:04:17", "owner": "pulkitm15", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18050349101454129, "text": "Absalom + Solomon core", "created_at": "2025-06-20T17:31:12", "owner": "au510_criggler", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17953455056830826, "text": "The sibling dynamic is a universal experience", "created_at": "2025-06-14T06:09:37", "owner": "gooper_c", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053965997651679, "text": "If you haven't run your sister over with a horse, you and i have lived very different lives.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:44:09", "owner": "angh2377", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18081137794640300, "text": "I used to do this to my brother omg hahahahahaha", "created_at": "2025-06-10T23:26:12", "owner": "oliviagraceross", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18088576285644134, "text": "CMERE 🔥👺🔥🔥🔥👺", "created_at": "2025-06-08T06:02:01", "owner": "apparentlyarhm", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18283637239248190, "text": "I wish my sister did this to me", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:56:06", "owner": "hawkishbynature", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18363219262092791, "text": "BURN THOSE CALORIES 🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-17T04:31:15", "owner": "drummer_gd_elijah", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17993625764650279, "text": "When I saw you liked this 🤣 @ingreedo", "created_at": "2025-06-11T10:01:24", "owner": "cynthialeu", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17890840332269431, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-06-18T08:41:38", "owner": "lavish___999", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068432219476760, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T17:22:00", "owner": "kybrinx", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17873311194376057, "text": "Sure to chase her sister on her horse she likes to chase her boyfriend ex-boyfriend on her horse hey sweetheart can't chase you on my horse see how fast can you run and I kiss you and yes the kids on the lips😍❤️🌹", "created_at": "2025-11-19T03:52:17", "owner": "cherrydallasbill", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17975802248939625, "text": "Why is ur horse running in italics? 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-09T21:48:24", "owner": "pawparazziiiiii", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18046667465631001, "text": "Absolute menace to society… Do it again", "created_at": "2025-06-25T13:37:39", "owner": "stefaniespat", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17999955512834289, "text": "@upa_gogoi__ me🫶", "created_at": "2025-11-09T16:32:41", "owner": "insincerelyyourrs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862174126532668, "text": "Would it be too mean to try and lasso her? 😬 Sisterly love only 😊", "created_at": "2025-11-14T12:22:31", "owner": "black.sheep600", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17845585083498934, "text": "🗣️ Komm Her komm her (sounds totally German to me)", "created_at": "2025-06-07T12:57:25", "owner": "_the_real_slim_lady_", "likes": 38}, {"id": 17952885639041547, "text": "😂😂😂👏🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-23T21:25:13", "owner": "jaimeulisesochoa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18012882701671745, "text": "@mcryyc @freyja.loves", "created_at": "2025-11-08T08:35:00", "owner": "dudi_kiz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17853565551485687, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-17T14:57:04", "owner": "lauriekbluesdancer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096541444575160, "text": "#She’s always my sister 🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-08T16:09:35", "owner": "sa.almousa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17879658627417699, "text": "Excellent use of free will", "created_at": "2025-11-02T16:00:21", "owner": "vijdipika452", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17984926376884371, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-09T18:45:27", "owner": "raddad_rolls", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18116942962546768, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-28T12:12:05", "owner": "jeannel88", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17856468492491519, "text": "Oh we used to do this with slaves. Next best thing.", "created_at": "2025-10-27T23:03:55", "owner": "youdontevenknow1880", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082903550057130, "text": "You seem like so much fun", "created_at": "2025-10-28T15:57:12", "owner": "e.smitty86", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087621481931173, "text": "@mallory.in.neverland if your childhood was a meme", "created_at": "2025-10-28T22:50:27", "owner": "thisoliverlife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070931084214371, "text": "“we js wanna bite🗣️”", "created_at": "2025-10-15T01:44:58", "owner": "anna81518195", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17918546211105734, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-23T09:58:07", "owner": "ilovehealthysoda", "likes": 56}, {"id": 17915884371011641, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T17:18:48", "owner": "thepursuitpublication", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061314446247715, "text": "COME HERE🤠🗣️", "created_at": "2025-07-09T15:25:36", "owner": "elena_og_sotar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057013877522867, "text": "It's giving red dead redemption🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-10T11:29:25", "owner": "felixmoua", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18315708712171421, "text": "Now here me out, learn to lasso…", "created_at": "2025-10-12T08:26:40", "owner": "audihismind", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067158407044165, "text": "Yes Instagram, I am interested", "created_at": "2025-06-10T05:06:32", "owner": "alexdillon836", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18069876458131330, "text": "Been trying to reach youuu about your extended warrantyyyyyy 😢", "created_at": "2025-08-13T09:47:54", "owner": "wrenwag", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18321652837243838, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-10T16:44:22", "owner": "preeminent.jb", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17861981097424605, "text": "i wish i had a horse 😔", "created_at": "2025-06-15T22:26:30", "owner": "massicrisologo", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18507467848022832, "text": "@hollyyy.cheer u and Haden or Miley", "created_at": "2025-08-02T02:38:44", "owner": "ryleigh12342023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079577579482780, "text": "She is going to hate you later in life", "created_at": "2025-09-09T00:52:21", "owner": "castil24692", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17877358488407073, "text": "😂😂😂😂 @g_hump this why we didn’t have horses", "created_at": "2025-09-22T21:29:30", "owner": "rockylucian0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18413969692116065, "text": "Love this woman", "created_at": "2025-09-19T00:20:27", "owner": "ellieee255", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18026749070521063, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-13T16:26:03", "owner": "michael_mcgaughy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18356733568080166, "text": "This shit just made me cry my brother used to chase me with his horse when we were kids R.I.P ERIC HaPpy Heavenly Birthday", "created_at": "2025-09-16T03:08:22", "owner": "erika_kanezz", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17950659830881582, "text": "Bond level 4 maximum🫡", "created_at": "2025-09-01T00:58:55", "owner": "rundown_parker23", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18285426403279681, "text": "Hahahahah when adults say “no screen time “ and mean it 🐎😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-15T03:00:06", "owner": "itsme_kendallripetta", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062069326981443, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-06-30T22:58:55", "owner": "donquixote_aya", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17979873293859489, "text": "Can I borrow your sister? I have none. Only horses.", "created_at": "2025-09-12T18:55:11", "owner": "_xcaity", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17854158765476361, "text": "Perfect ice agent practice", "created_at": "2025-09-10T18:24:03", "owner": "extremly_reformed", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18089869486691413, "text": "We just want a bite😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-31T03:45:03", "owner": "isabellworstell", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18521793961063532, "text": "I wish someone would do this so I could burn some calories 💔💔", "created_at": "2025-07-17T04:03:52", "owner": "urviturnedintokirby", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096796603715176, "text": "Legend has it she still running form her sister and the horse 🐎", "created_at": "2025-08-31T22:49:19", "owner": "santibanez6410", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18106749796643733, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T16:25:05", "owner": "big_st3w", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028884836780549, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-13T15:15:53", "owner": "x.nonchalantnayyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088321717950272, "text": "@averycyrus y’all need to collab lol", "created_at": "2025-12-08T13:32:31", "owner": "nonnovito1937", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903107278319196, "text": "I felt this as the little brother", "created_at": "2025-12-08T06:13:21", "owner": "_ma1nj_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086578439287912, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T04:33:02", "owner": "t00finebay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952398625051070, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T04:16:20", "owner": "aggyevie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863733310457677, "text": "Me when I usted to chase the damn kids my mom would take care of 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:06:18", "owner": "09asantos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870845407394599, "text": "😂😂😂😂 she def running to tell", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:09:34", "owner": "theheavenfaye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877355491351679, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:49:19", "owner": "itssarahnow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397734373121041, "text": "Girl just drifted that horse", "created_at": "2025-12-04T00:42:21", "owner": "j.t.m_style", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18519566482065695, "text": "You need a saber or a lance immediately", "created_at": "2025-12-04T00:33:20", "owner": "dtownsend104", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969252195829017, "text": "Your favourite hobby is linching", "created_at": "2025-12-04T00:12:38", "owner": "fraserhay979797", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058914482300442, "text": "MY FAV HOBBY IS BEING CHASED BY A HORSE!!!", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:29:15", "owner": "call_me_caroline_13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086960270007455, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T14:42:37", "owner": "marwan.mahjooba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877205305353370, "text": "I was expecting a cool lasso trick", "created_at": "2025-12-03T13:24:20", "owner": "369darwin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931039360136254, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T10:50:16", "owner": "gamaqinaqvuus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092704268502204, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T10:49:20", "owner": "arshdeep_libra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320739046300501, "text": "Deja vu..", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:02:10", "owner": "empty12482938210", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105492034733866, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:25:14", "owner": "j0m0thy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073208045039901, "text": "Wait, do you have a minute to talk about your lord and savior Jesus Christ?", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:05:49", "owner": "mike_robbins_realtor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059351585641188, "text": "Leena said she chase with knife 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T15:49:27", "owner": "yashuuuuuuuuuu_2103", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146896402437859, "text": "@_._zaiiiina_._", "created_at": "2025-12-02T15:31:05", "owner": "_.wretched.__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047672126448293, "text": "Showing my dad snakes (He has a fear of snakes)", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:00:33", "owner": "rearabetswemenyatso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057956276294031, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T08:35:59", "owner": "myjomojojojo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066371255626179, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T08:15:43", "owner": "fancymars", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075477302257887, "text": "“COME HERE 👹COME HERE 👹", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:14:08", "owner": "itsminova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946428963995829, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:53:24", "owner": "charlie_sags", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098254702645960, "text": "YOUR A DEAAAAAAD MAAAAN IAM SENDING YOU STRAIGHT TO HEELL", "created_at": "2025-12-01T21:57:59", "owner": "adem_hammas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065919137149602, "text": "This is what Mongolian siblings do", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:51:11", "owner": "tuguldurbatbaatar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926258026168029, "text": "So THIS is the hobby horsing that everyone’s been raving about", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:46:38", "owner": "franknfield", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068561720105896, "text": "🗣️Come hea 😂😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:01:49", "owner": "inkad3lic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059096189283692, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:29:36", "owner": "drewcorbusier0903", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071590931588639, "text": "Use a lasso next time 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:52:58", "owner": "mehrzad._znj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18412597336141016, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:53:16", "owner": "micheal.graham.148", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119831401545446, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:39:59", "owner": "the_grumpy_octopus_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137318878476113, "text": "She was born to be in the cavalry", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:04:04", "owner": "kaikoenig27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063975968184335, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:30:26", "owner": "amourxmariiiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068733209374611, "text": "I JUST NEED TO TALK TO YOU ABOUT YOUR CAR INSURANCE", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:02:21", "owner": "slap206", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105972541560055, "text": "‘In the Old West you’d have been dead 30 seconds ago.’", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:55:40", "owner": "clh1607", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909609970260829, "text": "Today's lesson is slavery 😈", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:11:21", "owner": "tomas11lo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18438349249103408, "text": "Imagine she was black😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:38:54", "owner": "_ltk._.mwas_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083583830515229, "text": "She has lvl 2 horse bond 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:55:29", "owner": "stef.an.a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101352103684785, "text": "You need to rope her, its good practice!", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:48:50", "owner": "rex.mcclellan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920538091200444, "text": "i used to Chase mine naked with a knife", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:57:04", "owner": "7734r.e.z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071948006363911, "text": "Peak older sibling activities", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:43:10", "owner": "p22mh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071455856600609, "text": "Average pole in 1683", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:16:29", "owner": "jude.hendler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18551793256027419, "text": "Low honor Arthur Morgan", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:58:48", "owner": "__.hawary13.__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080651342140579, "text": "We just wanna bond 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:14:24", "owner": "lucykeniston", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902819347318152, "text": "Normans and Anglo Saxons be like", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:10:14", "owner": "realbenrw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302889349249996, "text": "We’re just trying to reach you about your car’s extended warranty!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:58:05", "owner": "therealfindingdori", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987639522873259, "text": "lasso her", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:57:21", "owner": "dr.ahm4d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988657983908738, "text": "Menace 😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:22:19", "owner": "relly_the_npc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991450173900547, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:13:12", "owner": "azraelneito", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547905835043276, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:05:53", "owner": "nosteviejustjai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075716291462623, "text": "\"Riding on my horse right after a beer\" 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:18:11", "owner": "incontinensdraugr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068182097380136, "text": "“Burn those calories COME ON”😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:24:47", "owner": "mayte.boggyn.official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087369106990866, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:57:22", "owner": "mr.looner_life", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001797146833898, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:03:55", "owner": "pavel_milov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888504799395388, "text": "I have an idea. Do you have a lasso?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:28:21", "owner": "uniqueusername12345", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083272970018471, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:30:08", "owner": "hussmhh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112646011585523, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:44:25", "owner": "mo.gobel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030581012742160, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:53:38", "owner": "eshosh_20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876852310441004, "text": "That is some evil ass s***😂🔥😂🔥 we sister bonding lmaoooo", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:00:40", "owner": "manifestingmycrown", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087852139994919, "text": "The Hound VS The butcher’s boy", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:08:19", "owner": "marcusriveraoman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105604246567109, "text": "Get the hammer the war hammer", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:29:12", "owner": "connerd_the_squirl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091572568909089, "text": "You need a lasso 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:17:49", "owner": "iron.blood.76", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026095601580507, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:09:56", "owner": "sami.kara_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103083841668780, "text": "Genetics 🧬", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:09:20", "owner": "sami.kara_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982967709766427, "text": "I don't have a horse or knife, so I used a chainsaw", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:13:08", "owner": "esparza_roy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086953438801618, "text": "You gotta lasso her too though", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:40:18", "owner": "incongrousvillain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086285371970817, "text": "You should've roped her ankles 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:41:20", "owner": "scarrybutterfly1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915955525086768, "text": "Luck bitch 😏🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:18:45", "owner": "khalife.patrick", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057733133642022, "text": "Why is your horse drifting?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:06:27", "owner": "oscar.cnds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086065256059690, "text": "Peak🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:22:44", "owner": "alitorkashvand2004", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086742004814895, "text": "Comee hheeee COMEE HEEE", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:47:18", "owner": "kamshet_bezer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030999911546836, "text": "Peak🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-26T08:21:06", "owner": "alitorkashvand2004", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155128672417048, "text": "You are literally sooooo funny!!! 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:42:13", "owner": "cassi_love_lee_magnusson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865269592436274, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:22:35", "owner": "maurocassol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18399699736120263, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:57:41", "owner": "clonewars_2018", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133613884490761, "text": "My type of girl right there.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:36:51", "owner": "timothy.mark9563", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128206975503269, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:23:19", "owner": "jenniferlynnchristie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982430937768257, "text": "OMG IM DYING WITH THE BURN THOSE CALORIES", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:03:36", "owner": "louise3988", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905796931290203, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:12:43", "owner": "dee.dfh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095228998889842, "text": "Sounds like something a brother would do", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:03:06", "owner": "aluoo.ooo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159963718393945, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:30:29", "owner": "pratik20x_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18314825914223732, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:28:24", "owner": "xclusiveescape", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089565859751533, "text": "I’m here to talk about your car’s extended warranty", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:07:51", "owner": "redwolf_21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18327032116245172, "text": "Red Dead Redemption 2 vibes", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:07:40", "owner": "_abhishek_borkar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060885218635019, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:10:29", "owner": "aint_that_aashay", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098835601693532, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:00:48", "owner": "gxhsjsjvd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086645882483365, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:51:58", "owner": "javi_nulls_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966171453840466, "text": "How about grab a bow and an arrow (obviously the fake onces) and try shooting that running \"target\" you'll learn a new skill while she will burn calories a lotttt", "created_at": "2025-11-25T06:55:45", "owner": "aligardezi757", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105736774726023, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:55:01", "owner": "user_not_found2864", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866708566487580, "text": "If I had a horse...", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:12:30", "owner": "darkwolf17___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18538732153010925, "text": "Guarantee she has a rope", "created_at": "2025-11-25T00:09:34", "owner": "stingraybalsemer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068579654597347, "text": "C'mon", "created_at": "2025-11-25T00:01:50", "owner": "mr.creole1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102440935668735, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T00:01:41", "owner": "mr.creole1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925666663035457, "text": "That's looks fun i wanna try it 😁", "created_at": "2025-11-24T22:21:06", "owner": "atefkeven", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079709153149742, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T19:40:43", "owner": "moham_no_ham", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997173624703054, "text": "Horse probably loves this btw", "created_at": "2025-11-24T17:01:36", "owner": "cameronwillford", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923837938174470, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:45:47", "owner": "msbartai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062820182530797, "text": "🤣🤣🤣😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:42:19", "owner": "its.gazkhan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079035556923120, "text": "That’s A Nice Horse‼️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:35:21", "owner": "thatduuudddeeeeee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899306311338868, "text": "Is she/he drifting?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:56:18", "owner": "syphen1102", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113303734581469, "text": "*Low honor sound effect* 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:53:01", "owner": "ben.raras", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114350092577397, "text": "Need a lasso", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:52:46", "owner": "imranizzuddinshah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078311078167271, "text": "This is some Django Unchained stuff", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:26:58", "owner": "victor_v_wang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047328500691096, "text": "Wait stay there young lady dont run from the queens guard", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:02:24", "owner": "buurtpreventie83", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092100196926737, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T09:02:39", "owner": "1__rama", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949694982925301, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T08:51:35", "owner": "tomaldrch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102756544736683, "text": "a drifting horse ??", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:42:30", "owner": "deceased_carrot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074404664197906, "text": "😂😂I did this but with a chicken Caz she was scared of em 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:09:26", "owner": "samoyasweetcreations", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086714608965705, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:05:17", "owner": "daddydon274", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18200672047319981, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:49:24", "owner": "rattuslucas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928354870117654, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T00:25:05", "owner": "thugg2thebone2.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18198459109322882, "text": "Best sister ever! 😜 mine just chased (and hit) me with her four wheeler lol", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:54:44", "owner": "burke__young", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545753596001533, "text": "All of a sudden, I have a need for a new hobby. 🤷‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:48:27", "owner": "theeasyrider117", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076723448231738, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T19:27:41", "owner": "seeealferez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045235571694456, "text": "Only Kind of Hobby horsing i can Accept", "created_at": "2025-11-23T19:12:26", "owner": "aushilfskellner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078970790164935, "text": "Where’s the laso?", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:57:21", "owner": "cornejo777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991914198726366, "text": "This is what slavemasters use to do when you tried to get away 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:07:34", "owner": "treypinardnyc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024526592784501, "text": "That’s fucked up😂😂😂 but my brother probably would have done the same thing.", "created_at": "2025-11-23T16:26:54", "owner": "dagames_unofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376406869152209, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T11:52:07", "owner": "puneet__sharma_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18429859303108337, "text": "😂❤️😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T11:05:43", "owner": "demetrius.boardley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093653962877683, "text": "You Forget The Hunter", "created_at": "2025-11-23T07:27:20", "owner": "qazi.a.basit7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060434531239035, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T06:03:19", "owner": "joseph_guerrero916", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142444348453811, "text": "@sarah.has.hope", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:34:31", "owner": "ntwoodson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002426906822145, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T02:08:44", "owner": "analufuji__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18336596413231110, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T23:32:57", "owner": "mezzox7x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143479393453109, "text": "😂 that’s totally me every day", "created_at": "2025-11-22T21:08:02", "owner": "bunny___2326", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18414651781137558, "text": "if she was black that would have made sense", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:54:53", "owner": "sparzone_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106279159627930, "text": "The mongols had a point ngl", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:42:46", "owner": "0liver_knight", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064083437170850, "text": "HEY, GET OVER HERE", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:43:59", "owner": "connordenman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184651936346185, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:54:02", "owner": "vincent.0_0_z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136916038460831, "text": "Only thing you're missing is the lasso 🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:46:50", "owner": "mar_cyon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113237893600795, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:37:36", "owner": "mattyc202", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18550433932015428, "text": "Seems funny 😅", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:20:55", "owner": "rlly_mad_goose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907507042266894, "text": "“Burn those calories gurl “😹👏", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:42:34", "owner": "x.christine_b.x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076084814238283, "text": "The most funny thing I have seen today", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:04:11", "owner": "olivia.jonesss02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098903797692310, "text": "That’s sick 👍🏻👍🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:36:01", "owner": "robertf4250", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078569212906361, "text": "I like her", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:41:33", "owner": "gromit_the_bird_murderer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060367157240391, "text": "Omg 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T12:44:07", "owner": "simii_311", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940160662098372, "text": "Hell no 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T07:06:55", "owner": "lameez.sage", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155682355424487, "text": "funny", "created_at": "2025-11-21T06:01:54", "owner": "hoofbeat_magic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104432839578983, "text": "Now do it with a lasso next time for extra fun", "created_at": "2025-11-20T22:32:24", "owner": "justdrawitbro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842249821621878, "text": "\"Riding on my horse, just after a beer 🎶 hey that bump, is shaped like my sister 🎶\"", "created_at": "2025-11-20T20:28:22", "owner": "anguerrand_vdl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928276549158444, "text": "Give me a horse, sweetheart I love to chase you", "created_at": "2025-11-20T20:24:28", "owner": "craig20082025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885852862398164, "text": "\"We just wanna bite\"", "created_at": "2025-11-20T15:45:14", "owner": "vindanolaviking", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068433335619034, "text": "Why is it running sideways", "created_at": "2025-11-20T14:01:17", "owner": "potato.qtie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141971860402442, "text": "Comere 👹 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T06:11:09", "owner": "ant87boss_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077659418273277, "text": "You evil! 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-19T23:51:51", "owner": "rickynutss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18434761378107009, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T10:58:32", "owner": "yuriman01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997164237698973, "text": "😂😂😂😂🔥😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T05:47:26", "owner": "surfboy498", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874397701446081, "text": "@lexfreemyer she sounds like a southern Irish lass but she’s American German?", "created_at": "2025-11-19T04:26:06", "owner": "whobutdjb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904996387148091, "text": "+ 1 sister added to cart + 1 horse added to cart", "created_at": "2025-11-19T00:06:29", "owner": "23grace_mae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103074676559785, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T21:25:20", "owner": "mineralbuddy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908463460263619, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-17T19:28:28", "owner": "carlgdev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871912957464589, "text": "We just wanna buy", "created_at": "2025-11-17T15:44:51", "owner": "kunya_ar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540870532047175, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-17T13:55:54", "owner": "toxickknight", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050037941658155, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T06:09:35", "owner": "persianpridemma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879213154327548, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-17T04:56:57", "owner": "hirukpikok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293907913260182, "text": "Do u need a lasso ?", "created_at": "2025-11-17T01:26:28", "owner": "khadkaankitjung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064566086408731, "text": "Red dead redemption gameplay", "created_at": "2025-