vity", "created_at": "2025-11-15T09:36:02", "owner": "arda_hanma1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185491291341733, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-15T06:41:22", "owner": "llachlangaxnt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086806501945186, "text": "I dont know your sister so ill have to say no I dont do that lol", "created_at": "2025-11-14T20:21:52", "owner": "andyfromtheshires", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18378127753148633, "text": "Future gold Metalist or successful jail breaker.", "created_at": "2025-11-14T19:56:00", "owner": "1stdaveorama", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918093001207425, "text": "@khloedaprettiest_ you think Boo would hurt the horse or you if you did this?", "created_at": "2025-11-14T19:04:47", "owner": "heyauntieerica", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096359683838361, "text": "😍😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-14T18:18:26", "owner": "raymappy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039790412702931, "text": "Reminds me of something , I just don’t know what", "created_at": "2025-11-14T17:37:18", "owner": "zai_mh_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893017621360131, "text": "@vsiolets", "created_at": "2025-11-14T17:35:36", "owner": "frau_melody", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086037989486909, "text": "Your giving me ideas", "created_at": "2025-11-14T15:33:25", "owner": "mostly_moth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110560933585190, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-14T13:52:25", "owner": "iamfatman._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077585176926596, "text": "Well she is White soooooo", "created_at": "2025-11-14T08:46:54", "owner": "raad89355", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063303311171256, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-14T08:32:36", "owner": "dunnwiigi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080789996472920, "text": "We just want a bite 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-14T07:22:47", "owner": "qlee50", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849537517595203, "text": "I’m a low-key tell my coach in college to get a horse to run with us", "created_at": "2025-11-14T06:37:31", "owner": "bramhan57", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918137386209143, "text": "Some people just felt like 1800", "created_at": 