kes": 0}, {"id": 18064165595350456, "text": "I aspire to be exactly like you", "created_at": "2025-08-31T07:33:33", "owner": "_k3taa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18280817065277840, "text": "I know your goat is named dikie", "created_at": "2025-08-31T00:53:20", "owner": "brookiescookie35", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18341593402163234, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-30T19:46:14", "owner": "anabrieva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940280752058781, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-30T17:09:08", "owner": "ownerfinanceddeals", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030105971687827, "text": "I would too tbh", "created_at": "2025-08-30T15:11:44", "owner": "aidangoebel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869167204351654, "text": "why the horse running in italics", "created_at": "2025-08-30T09:35:42", "owner": "brooklyn.neethling", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963731988814322, "text": "Now learn to rope 🤣 I'll teach you. I mean my dad's better at roping than I am, but, I'll teach you", "created_at": "2025-08-29T20:17:22", "owner": "tommy.badd.4444", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041704985656709, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-29T17:15:47", "owner": "awesome180000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074965475318859, "text": "Umazing 👍", "created_at": "2025-08-29T14:15:33", "owner": "seanmatt1425", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891470038320586, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-28T04:53:20", "owner": "brunabrujaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981705699894489, "text": "@trashy_barbie96  this is my idol", "created_at": "2025-08-28T00:50:53", "owner": "vatkinson02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878508454278931, "text": "nigga are u riding the horse diagonally", "created_at": "2025-08-27T20:03:46", "owner": "itsrayyxn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075718379510706, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-08-27T12:52:50", "owner": "cartier2riches", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102878500579857, "text": "You are my hero", "created_at": "2025-08-27T04:26:14", "owner": "captainkappa04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18372854914179347, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-08-27T04:11:40", "owner": "autumnskye199", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925536289102010, "text": "Nah, its my brothers, there so scared!😂", "created_at": "2025-08-27T02:29:46", "owner": "moberlyadreanna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085712185857871, "text": "My hero academia", "created_at": "2025-08-26T19:44:53", "owner": "captainkappa04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074948288084506, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-26T14:25:38", "owner": "officially._k23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057114437134015, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-08-26T13:56:08", "owner": "victoriaevelynrose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071256821514612, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-26T09:30:08", "owner": "dalieyaa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859293325473367, "text": "Dang my sister did the same 👏", "created_at": "2025-08-26T02:43:38", "owner": "banners0319", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079060150938840, "text": "😂😂❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-08-26T01:18:44", "owner": "king._wendell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853216507529950, "text": "This whole page is hysterical", "created_at": "2025-08-26T01:07:46", "owner": "red_samsin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070610180130940, "text": "Lol 😂 🐎", "created_at": "2025-08-25T17:20:07", "owner": "molly_boulden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920451895114940, "text": "My is chasing my brother in my dirtbike on the winter", "created_at": "2025-08-25T11:45:54", "owner": "kuwaiti_susu_15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855050203456486, "text": "Run run for your life 😅", "created_at": "2025-08-25T09:02:43", "owner": "__raghukumarapu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140958850423306, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-25T04:43:38", "owner": "ivette.evee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088547866699197, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-25T04:42:50", "owner": "tashas.belle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080747374900206, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-25T00:58:03", "owner": "re.car.detailing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18234591451293012, "text": "We are secretly best friends you just don’t know it you are literally the funniest person ever", "created_at": "2025-08-24T23:11:49", "owner": "katieterry123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964400118795756, "text": "When I was 8 I asked my Dad for a horse he got me a Honda CRF 125 lol", "created_at": "2025-08-24T19:46:32", "owner": "dreaholtzhausen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981026133857943, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-24T19:23:38", "owner": "sashadagreat__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049756562255020, "text": "Uuuum", "created_at": "2025-08-24T17:14:52", "owner": "lyssaadore", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036789839692295, "text": "It’s the drop in voice tone, when’s he says burn those calories girl 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-24T17:11:26", "owner": "devinloud", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067665617170718, "text": "Girl I do the same thing, but with my car", "created_at": "2025-08-24T15:32:37", "owner": "jerisumam", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076101107057710, "text": "Next time use a net to catch her like in planet of the apes", "created_at": "2025-08-24T12:14:14", "owner": "lucasg852025", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18153038776380065, "text": "Jay ar and @shanpngn situations😂", "created_at": "2025-08-24T04:22:31", "owner": "_dan1lle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164050600367601, "text": "Get a rope next", "created_at": "2025-08-23T17:07:42", "owner": "wacky_wavy_inflatedman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077147179970511, "text": "@1sergioh", "created_at": "2025-08-23T16:58:42", "owner": "gretel_xo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18531803764059404, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-08-23T15:39:40", "owner": "arrlenes_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064672223006463, "text": "older sis activities", "created_at": "2025-08-23T13:28:14", "owner": "jennadebord", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894355075166665, "text": "My sister chased me around with a spray bottle 🫤🫤🫤", "created_at": "2025-08-23T13:00:08", "owner": "ari11788_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18018069212754793, "text": "Inquisition 2.0", "created_at": "2025-08-23T11:35:38", "owner": "sergey.ventures_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990881658833703, "text": "Littest lifestyle 🔥", "created_at": "2025-08-23T03:42:09", "owner": "unicorn_snacks_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960076104827801, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-23T02:59:58", "owner": "britty_c_23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926420215072236, "text": "Your page is funny af. You cool as hell", "created_at": "2025-08-22T21:48:21", "owner": "justtayyyyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026673770516109, "text": "Dude, I love how you can SEE your horse leaning away from her 😂 he like “bitch AGAIN with the chasing people?? Everyone’s gonna hate me dude wtf” 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-22T12:37:02", "owner": "gh_0stie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896243401270095, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-22T10:02:41", "owner": "vixixmmxi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931279593963701, "text": "You should put a wig on toenail", "created_at": "2025-08-22T04:49:33", "owner": "willowlajoie13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069686909165634, "text": "😂😂😂👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-08-22T03:29:56", "owner": "dylankocourek80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081108545506983, "text": "\"KOM HER\" 🗣🗣🔥🇩🇰🇩🇰🔥🇩🇰", "created_at": "2025-08-21T23:27:57", "owner": "plagooarts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095424127727015, "text": "Bwahahhahahah! “Burn dossss calories girl!” 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-21T23:23:37", "owner": "heirloomphotocompany", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038709140419111, "text": "I'm now investing in a horse 😌", "created_at": "2025-08-21T23:06:12", "owner": "lipatterson50", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075699950008236, "text": "If my daughter had a horse she'd probably torment her siblings this way too lmao 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-21T22:27:49", "owner": "serenitaaayyyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000106367649094, "text": "I think this is called hunting", "created_at": "2025-08-21T14:29:22", "owner": "husssain667", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064243781249709, "text": "RDR2", "created_at": "2025-08-19T19:24:31", "owner": "hyellny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094657468630679, "text": "One time my grandpa gave beer to the horse", "created_at": "2025-08-19T19:07:04", "owner": "gabino7208", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843009883560076, "text": "I feel like we may have something in common wait a second while I go buy a horse 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-19T15:13:37", "owner": "tal_5114", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18150203668393732, "text": "Quit horsin around 🐴", "created_at": "2025-08-19T04:14:51", "owner": "voltz008", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856726618486048, "text": "DRIVE IN MY HORSE RIGHT AFTER A BEER", "created_at": "2025-08-19T01:16:13", "owner": "ryangabas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045395471321774, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-18T15:20:25", "owner": "crimsons_cat", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18108351295554553, "text": "Menace 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-18T11:20:14", "owner": "danniejade_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984524904711955, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-18T05:04:42", "owner": "_.555.yana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991952124683107, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-18T03:26:02", "owner": "edgardo_car9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123012691469133, "text": "this girl funny as hell", "created_at": "2025-08-18T01:32:01", "owner": "jjjjameswilson", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18035939510476052, "text": "Even if I absolutely hate western riding  and I'm country and do Equestrian riding I STILL LOVE whatever's wrong with u. (Not in a bad way)", "created_at": "2025-08-16T23:18:46", "owner": "__itsmaddi__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123406717484950, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-16T17:51:31", "owner": "monair_pritchett", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087469135757269, "text": "I'm your carriage driver get in!", "created_at": "2025-08-16T17:47:31", "owner": "victoria.mayyy4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021273293539523, "text": "Reminds me of chasing slaves back n the day", "created_at": "2025-08-16T07:07:10", "owner": "yaf_savvy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102363838576581, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-15T13:29:00", "owner": "life.with_kyle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084888889842382, "text": "Satisfying for the horse as well", "created_at": "2025-08-14T16:15:03", "owner": "christopher_ligman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014957870772968, "text": "The house wants to talk to you about you sister’s car’s extended warranty! No big deal!", "created_at": "2025-08-14T13:20:23", "owner": "hestonhunter55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18354022657083925, "text": "I need more toenail content.", "created_at": "2025-08-14T03:49:59", "owner": "missyrobichaud.xoxo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874633111401581, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-13T07:44:44", "owner": "dev_pundir8942", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926248516100243, "text": "The fact that that horse didn't catch up to her immediately is crazy", "created_at": "2025-08-12T19:50:32", "owner": "jacob_aaron_hi_5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134712379438974, "text": "I have a question how many animals do you have? Like girl you almost have everything animal in the farm", "created_at": "2025-08-12T18:54:42", "owner": "urfavpookie_102", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867632677352272, "text": "We should start doing this to fat people in public", "created_at": "2025-08-12T15:40:10", "owner": "slater1k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090339979664402, "text": "I love whatever’s wrong with you", "created_at": "2025-08-12T11:28:20", "owner": "allegra_banksclark", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005205365630901, "text": "Your drifting the horse", "created_at": "2025-08-12T10:39:21", "owner": "cl3v3land_harr1s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076194613807153, "text": "Wish I had a sister like this. I wouldnt be chubby 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-12T06:52:46", "owner": "victorius_rex25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088247188782864, "text": "💀💀", "created_at": "2025-08-11T23:31:50", "owner": "karlyys_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966301755944639, "text": "@malu_pontel_ 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-11T23:15:23", "owner": "isabellapontell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065439094973952, "text": "Arthur Morgan?", "created_at": "2025-08-11T15:45:23", "owner": "abdallahsg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980912760728184, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-11T13:07:31", "owner": "kaibee_1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053873111153246, "text": "YESSS", "created_at": "2025-08-11T06:01:54", "owner": "n3ssa622", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050822606215061, "text": "That chase felt personal", "created_at": "2025-08-11T05:14:48", "owner": "steak_n_egg", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18071284292085003, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-11T02:01:17", "owner": "mariamaria29_2919", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072670877042749, "text": "Deltarune reference 🥀", "created_at": "2025-08-11T00:40:16", "owner": "swit_chi_v3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18319727635210574, "text": "“COME HERE COME HERE”🗣️🗣️🗣️🗣️", "created_at": "2025-08-10T21:23:39", "owner": "bree98795", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184455163322479, "text": "@mollyclaxton", "created_at": "2025-08-10T19:05:49", "owner": "nllj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050750522196773, "text": "@tabarkedris so you can burn your calories 🙂‍↔️", "created_at": "2025-08-10T18:11:46", "owner": "tased_99", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17952811472995891, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-10T01:30:35", "owner": "bethebird__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052202507188822, "text": "Translate, you are speaking rich", "created_at": "2025-08-09T22:23:56", "owner": "incognita_belle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041899829650460, "text": "I love children's tears", "created_at": "2025-08-09T22:16:49", "owner": "rip_7o26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051079325534846, "text": "Rug is his name", "created_at": "2025-08-09T16:46:45", "owner": "emrah.n.angel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007254677792331, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-09T12:27:30", "owner": "davidkirl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18289545220248838, "text": "me on my dirt bike", "created_at": "2025-08-08T21:49:14", "owner": "tyl3r_.sm1th", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036938096422459, "text": "Thoughts confirmed your my little sister before she was born 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-08T16:01:44", "owner": "real.hunter.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18351789661083786, "text": "She needs more power Stam speed stats I think the wit is fine for now, maybe invest in corner recovery and swinging maestro", "created_at": "2025-08-08T10:20:08", "owner": "gay_bobdylan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016883183574775, "text": "@chloeforero", "created_at": "2025-08-08T04:14:33", "owner": "0adam.russell0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072534244861206, "text": "You should lasso her", "created_at": "2025-08-07T20:53:46", "owner": "marcotuiioo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094190905719982, "text": "@laillimirza need this kinda content with you and alizey pls", "created_at": "2025-08-07T20:52:54", "owner": "fvtimv.s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075701272814434, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-07T14:20:36", "owner": "remalfadhli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048971900247929, "text": "that last cmon tho. say it with your chest fr", "created_at": "2025-08-07T08:31:24", "owner": "_pierced_penguin_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113500333503191, "text": "Driving in my caaaar right after a beeeeeeeer", "created_at": "2025-08-07T04:23:57", "owner": "gooberino_137", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859576096462918, "text": "Should have a rope for added fun", "created_at": "2025-08-07T01:09:03", "owner": "migue1__ang3l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075153253821272, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-07T01:06:25", "owner": "hilarioflores", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085278418865040, "text": "its going sideways 😢", "created_at": "2025-08-06T22:56:44", "owner": "vaylroses", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926729685984737, "text": "I do 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-06T22:50:51", "owner": "dunsrwaysiyheart_neverinmylife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915728224039001, "text": "Where is the ostrich?", "created_at": "2025-08-06T18:32:21", "owner": "kassie_olney0119", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064339256337082, "text": "hey idk y i feel the way i do but this never happened to me before tmb please 🫩", "created_at": "2025-08-06T16:26:46", "owner": "4evahavinshiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995669424813412, "text": "Am I the only one who noticed that the horse is running sideways?", "created_at": "2025-08-06T07:00:18", "owner": "susie_iscool", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075428224973819, "text": "Run like your Irish it's your wedding night and I'm the kings men", "created_at": "2025-08-05T20:48:24", "owner": "dakotatotten", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076416551482146, "text": "Lmfaoooo", "created_at": "2025-08-05T20:36:26", "owner": "thississmalori", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052416506175951, "text": "DRIVING IN MY HORSE RIGHT AFTER A BEER", "created_at": "2025-08-05T20:06:29", "owner": "dirty_lilratboy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17903712978218834, "text": "The voice of come here", "created_at": "2025-08-05T19:06:08", "owner": "bori1782", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064042568190007, "text": "Lmao", "created_at": "2025-08-05T19:06:00", "owner": "bori1782", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085089241801469, "text": ",,Burn those Kalories come on”😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-05T16:48:43", "owner": "sarah.techn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108556933551017, "text": "You should rename your pig to first name Chris middle name p last name bacon", "created_at": "2025-08-05T16:05:45", "owner": "payden247365", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064194029218896, "text": "😂😂😂😂🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-08-05T14:34:36", "owner": "bigdivine__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011859776774655, "text": "Omg i ride horse tooooo", "created_at": "2025-08-05T12:35:12", "owner": "sophiebleeker2013", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071100328876828, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-05T05:21:52", "owner": "royalskyemusic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130703089448728, "text": "I love horses 🐎", "created_at": "2025-08-05T04:34:48", "owner": "apreston2010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18377540476127068, "text": "I love horse", "created_at": "2025-08-05T04:34:35", "owner": "apreston2010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171963166354293, "text": "We just want a bite killed me", "created_at": "2025-08-05T00:26:17", "owner": "terrifictrilla", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17960694713816765, "text": "The horse probably chases her every time it sees her out of habit 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-05T00:04:02", "owner": "tampag.url", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011058911604968, "text": "RIDING ON MY HORSE RIGHT AFTER A BEER🗣🗣🗣🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-08-04T23:45:48", "owner": "33_broken_parts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922361203101876, "text": "I’d give anything to live on a farm 😍", "created_at": "2025-08-04T23:04:29", "owner": "averyleblanccc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17855463930483498, "text": "Name the pig what Elon musk named his kid gurl", "created_at": "2025-08-04T21:28:40", "owner": "that_one_bunny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075827110989891, "text": "\"COME HERE WE JUST WANNA BITE\"", "created_at": "2025-08-04T17:49:19", "owner": "zainaldensaeed", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17974464563872237, "text": "Imagine one day she just stops and faces you. 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-04T15:50:22", "owner": "ciliary_dethmetal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093056797711185, "text": "My sister was terrified of horses cuz one tried to have sex with her n it tried to eat her hair cuz it thought her red scrunched was an apple n she had peach scented gel in her hair lol I almost peed my self while saving her life", "created_at": "2025-08-04T09:47:46", "owner": "5morning5star9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040242122367937, "text": "Can you be my girlfriend", "created_at": "2025-08-04T09:23:55", "owner": "natea8_the_great", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914731702168003, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-04T00:23:21", "owner": "mashaelzel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031272386490230, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-03T23:49:40", "owner": "chill_out_w_ya_reel_out", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322226479236493, "text": "🏃‍♀️💨 🏇", "created_at": "2025-08-03T22:40:54", "owner": "the_real_b_luis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013590428592027, "text": "COME HERE👨", "created_at": "2025-08-03T21:43:18", "owner": "dance_with.liv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141027619417798, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-08-03T19:18:38", "owner": "think_big_ho3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078290908916550, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-08-03T12:16:53", "owner": "hustlerhus86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 1836