8013, "text": "🗣️we just want a bite 🗣️no", "created_at": "2025-07-23T13:21:17", "owner": "just_agirlwho__believes_in_god", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18150949897379006, "text": "U missed hunter 🤠🤠🤠", "created_at": "2025-07-23T11:01:21", "owner": "mrdevil_wf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152613991376322, "text": "Get a lasso for maximum effect", "created_at": "2025-07-23T08:22:14", "owner": "andrew_p_jo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071151200086059, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-07-23T07:02:01", "owner": "grahamnancarrow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877881283366953, "text": "Do we need to get you a tazar", "created_at": "2025-07-23T04:45:38", "owner": "crsharks1945", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914114281119577, "text": "Me and my friend need to do that 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-22T22:02:08", "owner": "isla_and_rosie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18407706667116569, "text": "You are funny.", "created_at": "2025-07-22T21:50:57", "owner": "keisha_just_keisha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070914737286184, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-22T21:48:30", "owner": "blondiebomb.supra.rx7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041870159640352, "text": "1206 Mongolians pov:", "created_at": "2025-07-22T20:36:52", "owner": "numistuna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957437865973610, "text": "Horse doesnt wanna step on her btw", "created_at": "2025-07-22T19:33:20", "owner": "ali_inceoglu8888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121490116465433, "text": "Just one bite of that flesh 🤠😈😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-22T19:24:34", "owner": "donnyred65", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848971402516125, "text": "Why she drifting the horse", "created_at": "2025-07-22T17:44:31", "owner": "waviest_hair", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073856374802871, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-22T13:47:32", "owner": "wtf_fffffffffffffffffffff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18286893199268366, "text": "Why do you drifting your horse :)", "created_at": "2025-07-22T11:31:31", "owner": "kim2themia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857472337463981, "text": "Prefer to use a 400 - 600cc quad bike", "created_at": 