ug shite on it", "created_at": "2025-07-18T14:50:31", "owner": "1049_dave", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057633422062780, "text": "Damn what a great idea 🤣🤠", "created_at": "2025-07-18T14:43:46", "owner": "kevin_viktor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099844516516525, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-18T14:04:24", "owner": "ersuerwa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094152031627855, "text": "Get a lasso", "created_at": "2025-07-18T13:14:08", "owner": "cullencurtis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18350137957094007, "text": "Dracarys🔥", "created_at": "2025-07-18T09:57:39", "owner": "reiy0011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18311016313213812, "text": "@noggi.a", "created_at": "2025-07-18T07:35:28", "owner": "agamadir_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072636781971339, "text": "That so rude please can you replace it by McLaren", "created_at": "2025-07-18T02:59:31", "owner": "no_onehit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849516931511642, "text": "@beve_t", "created_at": "2025-07-18T01:39:29", "owner": "claudbraz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321290182225022, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-17T23:16:46", "owner": "nixon_darkart", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18532318051057348, "text": "Lmaoooooooo🤠", "created_at": "2025-07-17T21:52:53", "owner": "neyshaeee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071381981097071, "text": "Ok now I want a horse and learn to ride it", "created_at": "2025-07-17T21:37:22", "owner": "d_kmp22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080911597712418, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-17T21:25:15", "owner": "kyiioshin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018037064552771, "text": "Lasso her", "created_at": "2025-07-17T20:03:30", "owner": "lysosome_o_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023766221516090, "text": "This reminds me of something back in the 1800s 🤠", "created_at": "2025-07-17T19:49:01", "owner": "this_aint_von", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071748203083487, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-17T19:17:57", "owner": "_justalilbabylover", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18149906674379157, "text": "Reminds me of good old days 🗣️ just saying", "created_at": "2025-07-17T15:40:26", "