3619, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-16T15:31:34", "owner": "layeredbykimia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088482427666647, "text": "@xhanmurphyx", "created_at": "2025-07-16T15:07:11", "owner": "robbiemcquade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082959277772882, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-16T15:04:37", "owner": "oicrwl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088895776735335, "text": "“If you ask me what my favorite hobby is it’s chasing my sister with my horse”😛😛😛💅💅💅 Come heyah 😈 come heyah 👁️👄👁️", "created_at": "2025-07-16T10:52:50", "owner": "jaxob_918", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076867591930103, "text": "Why does your house like pointing in 0130 and then W+A ing instead of just 0000 and W like what", "created_at": "2025-07-16T08:31:10", "owner": "babyold1510", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060423011211358, "text": "Yes, master", "created_at": "2025-07-16T07:56:31", "owner": "jaxtonsk8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18276903628274504, "text": "Love it :-)", "created_at": "2025-07-16T07:38:31", "owner": "opcoyote", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070830905493622, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-16T04:48:53", "owner": "ssasi007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061080263520434, "text": "“Come here girl!”🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-16T03:56:52", "owner": "marktheshark_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095198449619311, "text": "cmere boiahhh🤠🗣️", "created_at": "2025-07-16T02:52:23", "owner": "lqhkm.adnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993880827664242, "text": "😮😂😍", "created_at": "2025-07-16T02:06:40", "owner": "kishelement", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954657462978028, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-07-16T00:38:20", "owner": "jerry__wooooong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104359282548174, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂, “come here👹”", "created_at": "2025-07-16T00:25:40", "owner": "iiam.kinahhk._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119517769479813, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-16T00:04:44", "owner": "luvvonaee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939062686019122, "text": "What in the Last Of Us", "created_at": "2025-07-15T22:15:46", "owner": "cameronedmunds636", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865545916423451, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-15T22:10:55", "owner": "classygkirl._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995784090653487, "text": "You gotta learn how to use a lasso now, imperative you do so", "created_at": "2025-07-15T21:17:32", "owner": "jstn_prlo412", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056706632367059, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-07-15T20:45:49", "owner": "mxri2.0xoxo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069356518870469, "text": "I don't think I watched this part of the barbie movie", "created_at": "2025-07-15T20:41:55", "owner": "itsmirrorface", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857154217462398, "text": "I chase my sister with my cat", "created_at": "2025-07-15T20:08:08", "owner": "thomas_shermer4011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081650851848187, "text": "I need a horse 😭😂 @e_slingz", "created_at": "2025-07-15T19:20:33", "owner": "elexysmua", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100778005577360, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-15T18:51:23", "owner": "kanon_verdugo_777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092564143566547, "text": "@oh_tray I used to do this but with frogs I think we can graduate to this wys?", "created_at": "2025-07-15T17:45:57", "owner": "sharonade0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095162011621047, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-15T16:53:37", "owner": "its.znob01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987370161827016, "text": "@sblyyth I’m glad you liked this and brought it to my algorithm", "created_at": "2025-07-15T16:49:29", "owner": "cuffkurtt", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17859941865445961, "text": "It’s giving “WHERES MY HUG”🤠🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-15T16:42:19", "owner": "kelceyromo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956131206829850, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-15T14:28:57", "owner": "lars_maarleveld", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17893616484269394, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-15T14:28:41", "owner": "lars_maarleveld", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18304344823174608, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-15T13:38:51", "owner": "mheatwoles", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086593612685140, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-15T10:24:05", "owner": "fhelu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072944824968596, "text": "Yeah my kiddo used to chase her sister on her horse til they actually caught her and RAN HER DOWN she’s ok tho.", "created_at": "2025-07-15T09:40:01", "owner": "lthm42", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880459603356451, "text": "🗣️🗣️🗣️🗣️🗣️🗣️🗣️", "created_at": "2025-07-15T09:26:12", "owner": "ggrapefield", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140160313409137, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-15T08:39:15", "owner": "fatima_fallahpour", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090468241638786, "text": "@laurenrudolph92 do you so this to Emily", "created_at": "2025-07-15T08:31:01", "owner": "stella._moore", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18378983866126588, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-15T07:47:09", "owner": "_mehrin_akter_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086079748703533, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-15T06:43:51", "owner": "gaelsandoval352", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916364092110599, "text": "\"BRING THAT ASSS BACK HERE BOI!!!\" me every time I ride on my horse and see him doing nothing.", "created_at": "2025-07-15T04:56:19", "owner": "xeroaliu_rexuilao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910121059169812, "text": "Rope her", "created_at": "2025-07-15T03:08:57", "owner": "sw_psyops", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842136649540176, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-15T02:59:37", "owner": "timmy_is_weird", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086439847683805, "text": "@larkieschepers see I wasn’t soooo bad with the car haha", "created_at": "2025-07-15T02:46:39", "owner": "aislinnschepers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070192099841928, "text": "🤠 More I watch, more I laugh. It's me, with my nephews. But I drive a car and drive over the passenger's path. I'm such a cool uncle.", "created_at": "2025-07-15T01:35:18", "owner": "gntrsebastian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913107193141654, "text": "Glir this is fixing to be my hobby when ever I get a horse", "created_at": "2025-07-15T01:09:25", "owner": "beth_alysa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072472127046964, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-14T23:54:38", "owner": "danielle_moon_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085177939819317, "text": "“COME ERE 👹🐎”", "created_at": "2025-07-14T23:01:54", "owner": "claranaomi08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015696713563671, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-14T22:41:37", "owner": "not_yumzi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843648841529239, "text": "Now get a lasso and chase her it’ll be more fun 🤠", "created_at": "2025-07-14T22:19:33", "owner": "stayuponthatrise67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936268858058547, "text": "The horse wants you to get closer 🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-14T21:55:04", "owner": "clash.13studio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867801277334539, "text": "@igaks_a  something you wud def do", "created_at": "2025-07-14T21:47:07", "owner": "sugarannspice._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884685742335575, "text": "The cherry on top would've been if she lassosed her while riding 😭", "created_at": "2025-07-14T20:28:51", "owner": "chris.a.lyons", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105761617552966, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-14T19:22:59", "owner": "__c.love__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061382426221848, "text": "why is ur horse running in italics", "created_at": "2025-07-14T18:15:02", "owner": "fuckoff.1_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914547091031398, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-14T17:31:21", "owner": "ej_dzino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055465754094313, "text": "The horse is drifting 😭", "created_at": "2025-07-14T17:10:12", "owner": "kimkrgr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059836925351655, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-14T16:48:40", "owner": "jaaddah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069149828038183, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-14T16:18:45", "owner": "el__h30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967551489922742, "text": "Wait until she takes the uno reverse card out🤧🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-07-14T15:24:46", "owner": "i_play.with_monsters", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18471302986077425, "text": "🗣️ Don’t run from the Lorddd 😂🤠", "created_at": "2025-07-14T15:24:38", "owner": "bigsby12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058753904041467, "text": "Why’s she running like a new born giraffe", "created_at": "2025-07-14T15:04:19", "owner": "theomakproject", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100075141572521, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-14T14:41:25", "owner": "copemz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914600044140082, "text": "Why’s the horse drifting 😭", "created_at": "2025-07-14T14:35:09", "owner": "brodyreynolds473", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18314484652209481, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-07-14T14:34:56", "owner": "k2._.getactive", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885276055328709, "text": "You are a menace 😂 and I'm here for it 😭🩷", "created_at": "2025-07-14T14:08:10", "owner": "__shaylarosetta__x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886858993311881, "text": "why is it running in italics", "created_at": "2025-07-14T13:34:54", "owner": "clawmachinemonster", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978423591730971, "text": "it would have been even funnier if you pulled out a lasso", "created_at": "2025-07-14T13:02:36", "owner": "brandon101horne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066947936122990, "text": "🤣😭", "created_at": "2025-07-14T12:28:06", "owner": "nsc_kj119", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070793201479000, "text": "\" come HEREE👹:", "created_at": "2025-07-14T11:54:01", "owner": "julloyt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078803719723969, "text": "I wanna do this so bad", "created_at": "2025-07-14T11:05:37", "owner": "jadu__69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994638567815298, "text": "id never do this", "created_at": "2025-07-14T11:02:34", "owner": "jensutton25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966175854785911, "text": "avrage older sibling experience", "created_at": "2025-07-14T09:58:31", "owner": "stanojevc_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18306501760244873, "text": "@literallypratishtha 🗣️", "created_at": "2025-07-14T09:56:43", "owner": "km27.pvt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992365452666328, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-07-14T08:51:05", "owner": "nun_new4q", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849020824513802, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-07-14T06:11:37", "owner": "jacoessa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062846500972772, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-14T05:55:29", "owner": "jkmchar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182311291323014, "text": "This made me lol", "created_at": "2025-07-14T03:55:16", "owner": "rams_grams", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897445525251902, "text": "Umm they ain't ur freaking toys duhhh but living beings .get off from horse", "created_at": "2025-07-14T02:35:18", "owner": "nothnwithouturluv613juno00echo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897421684252291, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-14T02:11:50", "owner": "reckless_7377", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054986735600454, "text": "Get a hunter in hand", "created_at": "2025-07-14T02:04:24", "owner": "rayansiddiqui96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073608788503718, "text": "I thought she said “we just won a bike.” 😭", "created_at": "2025-07-14T01:51:34", "owner": "jmartine135", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18230350069291316, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-14T01:35:18", "owner": "yt_jaymontana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914204743137554, "text": "The horse must love this hobby too 😏", "created_at": "2025-07-14T00:37:59", "owner": "mamas_cookie909", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086002798689931, "text": "@lexfreemyer this was fabulous 🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-14T00:29:03", "owner": "amitis_frances_ariano", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109331347515642, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-07-13T23:11:45", "owner": "xzhane_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107086078532907, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-13T21:24:41", "owner": "anthonycacks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089475733590876, "text": "Cowboy ahh", "created_at": "2025-07-13T20:53:51", "owner": "memmomancs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079012400506643, "text": "ahahaha!...you're fired!", "created_at": "2025-07-13T19:32:12", "owner": "rhmxelroy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061273019209920, "text": "The horse 🐎 drifting", "created_at": "2025-07-13T18:48:29", "owner": "guilhermehachimine", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17976197237897091, "text": "This is hilarious ahahaha", "created_at": "2025-07-13T18:36:07", "owner": "jadeslife831", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054031325608169, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-13T18:11:29", "owner": "young_jizza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859580287448651, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-13T17:37:02", "owner": "ms.filthyrich", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126158254409462, "text": "Hästmotfolkgrupp🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-13T17:31:12", "owner": "alexandernielsen75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073378244479835, "text": "OMG I used to do that to my sister. 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-13T17:23:59", "owner": "mellymelchandler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889235695291902, "text": "كام هير👺👺", "created_at": "2025-07-13T16:41:36", "owner": "5rrro_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010783796772067, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-07-13T16:35:19", "owner": "barefoot.animo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305015644170774, "text": "Why he drifting", "created_at": "2025-07-13T16:13:11", "owner": "hi_colombian_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072366698314047, "text": "Halloween idea when kids are walking to your door and trick-or-treating if y’all live somewhere like that, y’all should have your sister dressed as a which and you’re just as a pilgrim it just chase her around yelling, which", "created_at": "2025-07-13T16:07:05", "owner": "hem.jayden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18362553505149589, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-13T15:46:00", "owner": "fisherbarry03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048351632201876, "text": "That's awesome 😭", "created_at": "2025-07-13T15:32:40", "owner": "moemoetoronto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886466635320290, "text": "Why is the horse running sideways?", "created_at": "2025-07-13T15:02:16", "owner": "its_hussein011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050369396172806, "text": "My brother does this to me😭", "created_at": "2025-07-13T14:44:29", "owner": "flukiewt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068780618028926, "text": "“I’m YOUR Uber driver GET IN!”", "created_at": "2025-07-13T13:13:26", "owner": "justjoshin60", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071181143489593, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-13T12:34:06", "owner": "saurav_hyung_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048411362201919, "text": "I lost 70", "created_at": "2025-07-13T11:38:31", "owner": "gang_baby_nia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861285070440622, "text": "Is This Australia?", "created_at": "2025-07-13T11:21:30", "owner": "vikrannnnt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063074333199453, "text": "Just get you a lasso 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-13T11:04:38", "owner": "sawyer_dover", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049575035617395, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-07-13T10:58:46", "owner": "danilobernate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142110139406602, "text": "“We just want to talk to you about your cars extended warranty”", "created_at": "2025-07-13T08:33:31", "owner": "whatindatruck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131207641432823, "text": "🤣😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-13T08:20:06", "owner": "5starmarkel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954437277976082, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-13T06:21:00", "owner": "ledsmoke18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18513536956007268, "text": "if you don’t already know how, you 10000% need to learn to rope", "created_at": "2025-07-13T06:20:57", "owner": "max.somebody", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18394708426190351, "text": "We used to paintball my sister on her horse while we chased her on the dirtbikes", "created_at": "2025-07-13T04:04:58", "owner": "reallyphil", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062266682337986, "text": "How dainty! ✨", "created_at": "2025-07-13T03:12:53", "owner": "sorsheilish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894669016255081, "text": "You forgot the whip", "created_at": "2025-07-13T02:41:06", "owner": "____tosh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072786709997206, "text": "The horse running in italics😭", "created_at": "2025-07-12T22:43:41", "owner": "xx_itz.alice_xx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143414791404614, "text": "Lasso her one time for the culture 🤠", "created_at": "2025-07-12T22:18:54", "owner": "not_interested.py", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890585362281268, "text": "Red dead redemption: suburbia", "created_at": "2025-07-12T20:26:10", "owner": "jnr.xn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084792967793901, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-12T20:12:54", "owner": "0catalan0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058049858358383, "text": "🔥😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-07-12T18:50:39", "owner": "_sweeethoneeey_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011137982779494, "text": "Border control be like", "created_at": "2025-07-12T18:36:08", "owner": "dirtbikeguy97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18273588634302430, "text": "ههههه خرب يومج🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-12T17:57:00", "owner": "m.sadiq800", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909525949056825, "text": "Thats my N.... 🗣️🗣️", "created_at": "2025-07-12T17:39:46", "owner": "floflotteflorian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065556266181832, "text": "Let it be 1890s style", "created_at": "2025-07-12T16:34:41", "owner": "caencfy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915203968131839, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-12T16:09:35", "owner": "oeeaeoeeea1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988571352683706, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-12T16:06:44", "owner": "basitsoomro828", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069224693120841, "text": "Bro the horse doing a drift 🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-12T14:14:40", "owner": "astrynoname", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17907727803188031, "text": "Aight when we gonna marry?", "created_at": "2025-07-12T13:43:20", "owner": "noel.srd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073319311802298, "text": "Use a rope", "created_at": "2025-07-12T11:52:35", "owner": "azooz123568", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137881588418546, "text": "invest in a lasso", "created_at": "2025-07-12T11:43:04", "owner": "jnkyuo0", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18063610990958244, "text": "Instead a Sister a my Cousin but whit a Spear,Gun and Bow& Arrow", "created_at": "2025-07-12T11:30:50", "owner": "radman_2014", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035881409401487, "text": "COME HERE🤠🗣️🗣️", "created_at": "2025-07-12T11:21:54", "owner": "nyxshiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322908295229986, "text": "Saint denis activities", "created_at": "2025-07-12T08:57:20", "owner": "crimsa_dawn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072095188979641, "text": "Now get a whip", "created_at": "2025-07-12T08:10:47", "owner": "bartosz.bromowicz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100067062602991, "text": "Omg can I get a hey plz!!! I LOVE YOU SO MUCH you inspire me tbh!! I ride horses too.", "created_at": "2025-07-12T04:51:50", "owner": "its_me_mad.b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011813609588419, "text": "😂😂😭😭🤠", "created_at": "2025-07-12T03:05:31", "owner": "santoshcharan_1204", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18027806921704842, "text": "Girlhood", "created_at": "2025-07-12T01:10:59", "owner": "legendarialeija", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887539132299786, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-12T01:03:51", "owner": "asvpjay._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047381948241525, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-07-12T00:35:43", "owner": "markbernardo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012038582776250, "text": "My life inspiration:", "created_at": "2025-07-11T21:37:31", "owner": "anna_grabczewska", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086260132781686, "text": "Ride down those peasants", "created_at": "2025-07-11T21:13:16", "owner": "wise_oldowl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875970097425165, "text": "The horse knows the mission", "created_at": "2025-07-11T20:04:07", "owner": "will_cameron6591", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051442613574228, "text": "Arthur Morgan 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-11T19:19:40", "owner": "digogin235", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852319585447068, "text": "Bro I can’t even run that fast 😭", "created_at": "2025-07-11T19:10:06", "owner": "yunithefatrat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081234853866009, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-07-11T18:40:06", "owner": "aguatography", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056535815073553, "text": "bro wants to talk about our lord and savior Jesus christ", "created_at": "2025-07-11T18:26:46", "owner": "jellybean.addyaddy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072816518079760, "text": "What happened to candy ?", "created_at": "2025-07-11T17:59:17", "owner": "jozzlynnn_2012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152442016347006, "text": "‘ we just want a bite ‘ 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-11T15:49:47", "owner": "maddies_rrps", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927796752966070, "text": "Ahhh god old hobbys from 1830", "created_at": "2025-07-11T15:21:42", "owner": "nic_ausholz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079848625721359, "text": "Will will will", "created_at": "2025-07-11T15:19:42", "owner": "mland_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977043699896688, "text": "\"I just wanna talk to him\" ahhh reel", "created_at": "2025-07-11T15:15:17", "owner": "zachbauer07", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18002457035630625, "text": "The only thing your messing is a lasso 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-11T14:26:08", "owner": "mahmoudkaher_el_yahod", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843710212532651, "text": "Good cardio", "created_at": "2025-07-11T14:23:13", "owner": "cbouchard013", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106047370546227, "text": "Who needs brothers when you have sisters", "created_at": "2025-07-11T13:47:01", "owner": "_s.p.a.z.z._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164013673318497, "text": "where's ur rodeo", "created_at": "2025-07-11T11:25:10", "owner": "dagoinang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18150041311377662, "text": "Come here nigga", "created_at": "2025-07-11T11:10:26", "owner": "alenso04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903776230206617, "text": "We just want a bite😭", "created_at": "2025-07-11T10:59:09", "owner": "blui253", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137449831411651, "text": "POV: Me chasing the NPCs in red dead after they saw me commit the worst crimes know to mankind", "created_at": "2025-07-11T10:57:13", "owner": "mikewitamic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076375468741617, "text": "😂😂🤣😭", "created_at": "2025-07-11T10:36:09", "owner": "kaitlyndiaz827", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089200753735148, "text": "We were poor so i chased my big sis with a axe and she chased me with the door she broke klol", "created_at": "2025-07-11T09:27:11", "owner": "zoeyley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069123050025026, "text": "i fucking cackled watching this", "created_at": "2025-07-11T07:51:30", "owner": "jaiyu1002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973747155751110, "text": "Last thing the 1800s women saw when the natives came over.", "created_at": "2025-07-11T03:02:54", "owner": "ganon.yok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998346057641332, "text": "I need me a horse", "created_at": "2025-07-11T00:22:43", "owner": "dturner.06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931689789949252, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-10T22:39:31", "owner": "bbalbrandon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846326680501795, "text": "@estherabels", "created_at": "2025-07-10T21:34:57", "owner": "abels_sarah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060738677246541, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-10T19:09:07", "owner": "tannerquigg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062639159334840, "text": "She'll become a great athlete", "created_at": "2025-07-10T18:54:35", "owner": "hadjeeer_blg", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18286163260252884, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-10T18:30:17", "owner": "xlr8_christus_war", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18179436091323822, "text": "Burn those calories!!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-07-10T18:02:16", "owner": "a.wheezing.picl.prophet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075756709743825, "text": "Me if I had a horse", "created_at": "2025-07-10T17:36:23", "owner": "c0nans_version", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915384052135413, "text": "This cannot be safe what if she falls?", "created_at": "2025-07-10T15:54:45", "owner": "lorialonee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066166310155973, "text": "\"Burn those calories gurl\" haha", "created_at": "2025-07-10T15:49:49", "owner": "youssra_laoui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18372456943134955, "text": "\"Obey the Dark Lord!💍🐎⚫️\"", "created_at": "2025-07-10T15:06:00", "owner": "alon_frishman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067557701035359, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-07-10T14:39:14", "owner": "a11rezarad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076498495899091, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-10T11:42:09", "owner": "nyls589", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049909484402474, "text": "Is your sister black", "created_at": "2025-07-10T10:24:27", "owner": "abhijeetkumar6734", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18080656594855389, "text": "She just had a flashback", "created_at": "2025-07-10T10:09:57", "owner": "ali.al.bahr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047013611628076, "text": "Omg yeehawww lezz go", "created_at": "2025-07-10T08:05:23", "owner": "mariyahreunion53", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18051264305148803, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-10T05:19:04", "owner": "addam.25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18208824445307352, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-10T00:13:17", "owner": "jaylenethunder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072661061509774, "text": "bro your horse drifting ?", "created_at": "2025-07-09T23:56:56", "owner": "hungry.el_gato", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17940418527032627, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-09T23:40:40", "owner": "big_daddy_cookie_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18405953881128604, "text": "Who wants to hunt me for sport like this?", "created_at": "2025-07-09T23:26:41", "owner": "mariii.00i", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140514100408160, "text": "My hobby is to chase my sister with a dirty mountain of bananas and she thinks she's a mouse", "created_at": "2025-07-09T18:33:09", "owner": "v_rasavcevic_9", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18107384770525648, "text": "Sibling energy is best energy", "created_at": "2025-07-09T17:38:38", "owner": "issac.wtf2", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079559926698405, "text": "Tell me she don't sound like an owner", "created_at": "2025-07-09T17:17:30", "owner": "darnellyoucool", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17980991807707413, "text": "Get a whip", "created_at": "2025-07-09T16:43:00", "owner": "beansincann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891389278278208, "text": "🗣️COME HERE 🗣️👿", "created_at": "2025-07-09T16:18:53", "owner": "dania_twin777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939764623030916, "text": "Close enoufh, welcome back arthur morgan", "created_at": "2025-07-09T16:03:07", "owner": "atlas_on_the_mountain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18369125677183972, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-09T15:37:59", "owner": "not.joseph_muc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148444399390627, "text": "Cmere👴🏼,Cmere👴🏼", "created_at": "2025-07-09T15:33:15", "owner": "woaaaitz._yae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974728005745841, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-09T15:06:56", "owner": "kevin_jefrey", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18139751113410829, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-07-09T15:00:33", "owner": "whaever14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927394129079050, "text": "come here👹", "created_at": "2025-07-09T14:47:14", "owner": "that_one_texas_guy1107", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18168692290352421, "text": "why is the horse drifting", "created_at": "2025-07-09T14:38:49", "owner": "shaknibi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045453539545936, "text": "\"Easy gurl your okay\" ahhhh hobby🤠", "created_at": "2025-07-09T14:25:24", "owner": "k.m_prays", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975204159904292, "text": "that's so rude. do it again", "created_at": "2025-07-09T11:50:32", "owner": "surreallizu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062443675957918, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-09T10:27:33", "owner": "ea_80a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065940545137385, "text": "😭🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-09T05:06:59", "owner": "2waheba", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17901461733253966, "text": "All you need a lasso🤠", "created_at": "2025-07-09T04:21:13", "owner": "aman_maurya_28", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081733939829175, "text": "Oh to be an older sibling to chase a younger sibling", "created_at": "2025-07-09T04:06:32", "owner": "_.hello_0501", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098746036598669, "text": "i was i had a sister like you mine just hides in her room all the time :(", "created_at": "2025-07-09T03:32:15", "owner": "nothing.but.vi", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18513699019039445, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-09T03:31:35", "owner": "banvoa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072442096824018, "text": "Type shit id do w my brother", "created_at": "2025-07-09T02:41:42", "owner": "thetruestpiano", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17882125731220836, "text": "Y is bro drifting?", "created_at": "2025-07-09T01:32:36", "owner": "ben.eppo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062541247976457, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-09T00:36:11", "owner": "hudhud0011", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17965452320923277, "text": "we chased our little brother on a lil kiddie four-wheeler and ran him over lol", "created_at": "2025-07-09T00:24:59", "owner": "jo.lizabeth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064209632332566, "text": "Why r u running lil sis", "created_at": "2025-07-09T00:06:23", "owner": "apri_l7718", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916502203111456, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-08T23:26:18", "owner": "ladyycripp_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856551679459739, "text": "Meeee", "created_at": "2025-07-08T22:50:18", "owner": "zoellatonioli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043100126309936, "text": "Red dead online gameplay", "created_at": "2025-07-08T21:27:16", "owner": "aedynpronoucedaiden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083966098702909, "text": "@claudiayayagomez  she’s just like you lol", "created_at": "2025-07-08T20:47:24", "owner": "mamirosi23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093475384717601, "text": "Yeah... Generations go by but your people still have this terrible habit of chasing people with horses...", "created_at": "2025-07-08T19:55:33", "owner": "meiomuitoamargo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913867768034243, "text": "You need a rope🤠", "created_at": "2025-07-08T19:32:39", "owner": "k9_sunny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052195961129931, "text": "Need a lasso", "created_at": "2025-07-08T19:00:44", "owner": "mpodfoto_street", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048098381204721, "text": "The voice drop was everything🤣😭", "created_at": "2025-07-08T18:53:20", "owner": "you_dont_know_me0129", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080177224875631, "text": "Why is your car going sideways", "created_at": "2025-07-08T18:28:55", "owner": "eltamam_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18044172464290982, "text": "@brittany.stanczyk93  I’m crying!", "created_at": "2025-07-08T18:25:50", "owner": "thekaramccalahan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100281400569151, "text": "why do it look like she is drifting the horse?", "created_at": "2025-07-08T18:21:16", "owner": "g_double_a_jr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857288107458097, "text": "At least her sister isn't black... the comment section would be a totally different vibe 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-08T18:03:46", "owner": "crawford8149", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065053297918013, "text": "At least her sister isn't black... the comment section would be a totally different vibe 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-08T18:00:53", "owner": "crawford8149", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071105723003451, "text": "I would’ve accepted my fate. I’m running out of breathe seeing her run 🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-08T17:38:01", "owner": "pk_sarah03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976813458896638, "text": "She low key driftin a bit tho", "created_at": "2025-07-08T17:15:55", "owner": "theg_gaming", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071054263840776, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-08T16:24:28", "owner": "coachaaronrha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059799974193829, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-08T15:46:21", "owner": "kymluvsu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080485714882278, "text": "You need a lasso", "created_at": "2025-07-08T15:16:51", "owner": "derekhornor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033637916450796, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-08T12:18:27", "owner": "reacherj95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879286111241860, "text": "Now I want a horse😛", "created_at": "2025-07-08T11:48:35", "owner": "j_consuegra_15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968551584770928, "text": "You gotta learn how to lasso her 🤠", "created_at": "2025-07-08T10:04:51", "owner": "skywlkrxog", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060747664992439, "text": "I do that too", "created_at": "2025-07-08T06:14:43", "owner": "isabellar2793", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040948091325282, "text": "Why your horse drifting", "created_at": "2025-07-08T04:58:58", "owner": "bbandhanthapa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18514192942023469, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-08T03:30:24", "owner": "ljc_2314", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095468146610435, "text": "is this mantracker", "created_at": "2025-07-08T03:02:56", "owner": "iihearthue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978103884893022, "text": "My algorithm fucking cracks me up omg 🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-08T02:20:52", "owner": "karissy.nicole", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18313030558238454, "text": "Where are you running Boi", "created_at": "2025-07-08T00:37:44", "owner": "parham.phoenix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932588410062977, "text": "@ashasmetherham  top comment", "created_at": "2025-07-08T00:20:51", "owner": "elliesmetho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074565247946493, "text": "Bruh 🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-07T23:51:41", "owner": "sebastianabreu00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842006122534928, "text": "Omgggg this is soooo funny 😭😭😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-07T21:55:01", "owner": "noni.kae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936904750024776, "text": "Type shit I'd do if I had a horse", "created_at": "2025-07-07T21:34:26", "owner": "yeet_urself_off_a_cliff", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18179359048324267, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-07T21:04:22", "owner": "brollowhimself", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087260614672182, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-07T21:02:40", "owner": "hi_minoutrewe", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17905143750198232, "text": "You should have lasso her fr", "created_at": "2025-07-07T19:56:04", "owner": "icewblue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039920822650713, "text": "Why the horse drifting 🐎", "created_at": "2025-07-07T19:31:19", "owner": "cotuin4k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881873035223076, "text": "@marta_wojtowicz__", "created_at": "2025-07-07T19:19:47", "owner": "h_wojtowiczz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071448038001422, "text": "How were you drifting the horse?", "created_at": "2025-07-07T17:34:51", "owner": "ew.jayden", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18332920651167619, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-07T17:06:01", "owner": "cold_is_here07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072773266995419, "text": "i want a horse now", "created_at": "2025-07-07T16:40:12", "owner": "040.yassin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068865647042781, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-07T16:22:32", "owner": "cheeseman1273", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17869182525403191, "text": "Name your ostrich diva", "created_at": "2025-07-07T15:53:00", "owner": "ellllo_yt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970874874870464, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-07T15:23:51", "owner": "brahimdouag", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047850248208817, "text": "She woulda done numbers back in the day 👀", "created_at": "2025-07-07T15:03:04", "owner": "josh.plewka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925807093088831, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-07T14:00:44", "owner": "eastside.sy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18332099515161696, "text": "💂🏻💂🏻", "created_at": "2025-07-07T13:12:36", "owner": "liliesosilly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18369549550181233, "text": "You're a good woman, Morgan Arthur 🗣️🤠", "created_at": "2025-07-07T12:35:21", "owner": "nastyanarchy", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18086319508777284, "text": "Me when i play Red Dead Redemption", "created_at": "2025-07-07T10:59:18", "owner": "horwood.oliver", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132236914390904, "text": "We love u Mrs Thatcher", "created_at": "2025-07-07T10:57:14", "owner": "leonovuuuuuuuuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858911026446810, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-07T10:53:41", "owner": "smiley.me_404", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920248206996260, "text": "That horse is very hungry it could eat your sister", "created_at": "2025-07-07T10:42:04", "owner": "dan1_not.hobo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094967755718295, "text": "That plantation kicking in", "created_at": "2025-07-07T10:04:32", "owner": "disaster_tour_guide", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18231321769291654, "text": "I like you", "created_at": "2025-07-07T09:37:47", "owner": "jesse_markestein", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014409017573940, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-07-07T08:45:44", "owner": "philliplaity65", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073339673482567, "text": "@eti26_2 יש לך מזל שאין לי סוס", "created_at": "2025-07-07T08:23:18", "owner": "ninet_haya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037250675656514, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-07T06:27:56", "owner": "m.lulu0306", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913345678159537, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-07T05:52:25", "owner": "tallantovaae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090023473634450, "text": "💀💀💀 @rebecca.tattooist", "created_at": "2025-07-07T05:04:07", "owner": "divine.insights.yqr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927626887085015, "text": "0553273452", "created_at": "2025-07-07T04:58:17", "owner": "rahab76918", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068981597070963, "text": "You should get a lasso and lasso her", "created_at": "2025-07-07T04:20:35", "owner": "kevin_r_the_photographer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093402694624064, "text": "You're a good man Arthur Morgan", "created_at": "2025-07-07T02:25:42", "owner": "why878957", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848026150513119, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-07T02:11:30", "owner": "vahanplus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089505325642724, "text": "🤠🤠", "created_at": "2025-07-07T01:41:30", "owner": "heyitsbhavy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18365276761199370, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-07T01:26:13", "owner": "romris.jpg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963179397938488, "text": "She was in touch with her ancestors", "created_at": "2025-07-07T01:24:39", "owner": "romris.jpg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868056115404982, "text": "Me on rdr2", "created_at": "2025-07-07T01:14:50", "owner": "manurgfreitas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159353959367878, "text": "@emma_schreider", "created_at": "2025-07-07T01:08:26", "owner": "tessschreider", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068213203875353, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-07T01:04:06", "owner": "zeeshan4_real", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18470802742076698, "text": "@lace.x", "created_at": "2025-07-07T00:38:09", "owner": "chanelanai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047206325232822, "text": "This is family bonding", "created_at": "2025-07-06T23:19:38", "owner": "tinyxtato", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032782442675808, "text": "One more reason to get yourself a horse", "created_at": "2025-07-06T23:10:09", "owner": "smileeedee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864369505424238, "text": "No we were so poor I chased her with a damn butter knife 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-06T23:00:29", "owner": "omuniz576", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057375887348754, "text": "are you drifting WITH A HORSE ?", "created_at": "2025-07-06T22:08:44", "owner": "leo_m______", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071648294303642, "text": "If her brother said that about the calories it sound be was in these comments lmfao", "created_at": "2025-07-06T22:05:30", "owner": "who_is_levant", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088414822733846, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-06T21:35:47", "owner": "chasethemoney111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970859952867634, "text": "\"Comere\"!", "created_at": "2025-07-06T21:17:55", "owner": "wierzbickijacob", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109996207517095, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-06T21:15:25", "owner": "aaroncn88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005348231792580, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-06T20:35:07", "owner": "temesgenteshome20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067030064278446, "text": "The sister \"stop! stop! stop\"", "created_at": "2025-07-06T19:52:05", "owner": "lalalaurenwhitney", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928417852072732, "text": "We need a video from her perspective lol", "created_at": "2025-07-06T19:51:43", "owner": "lalalaurenwhitney", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940291987013426, "text": "I'm soo jealous rn...😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-06T18:38:13", "owner": "wajidh_shaw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18282416284254400, "text": "My sister rides horses and sometimes I’ll do the same thing 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-06T18:29:32", "owner": "ellisynbolduc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18139650547414360, "text": "Give her a lance", "created_at": "2025-07-06T18:24:44", "owner": "ignaz.se", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084425365747144, "text": "Awhhh she’s role playing as LA police how nice", "created_at": "2025-07-06T18:15:39", "owner": "christopher_hocevar99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18349341766082495, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-06T18:10:46", "owner": "da_big.d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868554604319266, "text": "You're just taking care of her. This is training for the post-apocalyptic world", "created_at": "2025-07-06T17:32:17", "owner": "christian_a_l_m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148303849351633, "text": "Minecraft irl🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-06T17:15:46", "owner": "semaj_triple_o.g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172026559339235, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-06T15:37:14", "owner": "unkno.wnnigga12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860486074440375, "text": "Me next please", "created_at": "2025-07-06T15:22:20", "owner": "mehdielyounsi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061347317465644, "text": "Why is the horse running so slow but diagonally 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-07-06T15:03:27", "owner": "nevvvacaught", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050459132413434, "text": "@_tita_sr  do u remember 😉😉", "created_at": "2025-07-06T14:51:15", "owner": "nannnou4874", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058859402023940, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-06T14:35:13", "owner": "mershaa.j", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915836797111859, "text": "The horse is like:  should I be doing this...is this okay..", "created_at": "2025-07-06T14:32:04", "owner": "tryna.find.autumn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923992767981928, "text": "Smash both", "created_at": "2025-07-06T14:18:24", "owner": "barwar.saeed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093234865626940, "text": "@rubycolleyx you with a cat 🤣 @harrietcolley", "created_at": "2025-07-06T14:11:21", "owner": "lilcolley", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098382784604777, "text": "Idk if it’s worse or better than having tons of enemies 😭😂", "created_at": "2025-07-06T13:46:50", "owner": "kiyan.sz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896312980126581, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-06T12:58:25", "owner": "khang_kong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305538832245850, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-06T12:36:36", "owner": "jad_m_5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035526977400792, "text": "Fun fact: if you take your dad's handgun she is going to run even faster.", "created_at": "2025-07-06T11:50:48", "owner": "vasekcz42", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074888203936175, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-06T11:29:11", "owner": "tfn.28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128782081451116, "text": "So when you chase your sister while riding a horse it's fine, but when I chase a brother while riding a horse I get in trouble? How's that fair?!", "created_at": "2025-07-06T11:15:17", "owner": "un_sale_typ3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18149008873352875, "text": "I Unterstand komm her in german", "created_at": "2025-07-06T11:01:38", "owner": "klqinmqlik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947843415866502, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-06T10:20:07", "owner": "thatguy.diablo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060150026262222, "text": "Real", "created_at": "2025-07-06T09:52:28", "owner": "invisighoul2000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18335214118165347, "text": "This looks sooo fun omg", "created_at": "2025-07-06T08:32:59", "owner": "dani.se1f", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054323288458752, "text": "Omg same", "created_at": "2025-07-06T08:29:36", "owner": "szolyajana", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18050243003571504, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-06T08:26:07", "owner": "mercorlley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18309250942243599, "text": "get a sword it makes it more fun", "created_at": "2025-07-06T07:47:59", "owner": "liam_best_mortal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917021641016637, "text": "You're a good man Arthur Morgan", "created_at": "2025-07-06T07:39:45", "owner": "redalowcost", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855797365420910, "text": "I love how your voice changed 😭🤣🗣️", "created_at": "2025-07-06T07:04:58", "owner": "celina_root", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048710075449885, "text": "It’s the sideways running for me 😭", "created_at": "2025-07-06T06:58:17", "owner": "shadow._.flight", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884242348328391, "text": "HELP", "created_at": "2025-07-06T06:55:23", "owner": "stringed_heart", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18170622529345824, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-06T05:50:36", "owner": "hamsesdnb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18512225059030832, "text": "😂😂😂😂🤠", "created_at": "2025-07-06T05:20:20", "owner": "bossup_cream", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18167073484359388, "text": "stop🗣️🗣️", "created_at": "2025-07-06T04:22:47", "owner": "user02828371824363", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045819212251119, "text": "PLEASE get a sword", "created_at": "2025-07-06T03:24:55", "owner": "paul_is_still_a_person", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18388078894184029, "text": "This is true horse girl definition", "created_at": "2025-07-06T03:06:53", "owner": "theartsyfartsychild", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091238422723060, "text": "We didn’t have a horse so my brother used to throw darts at my feet while I tried to get up the stairs", "created_at": "2025-07-06T03:00:09", "owner": "sarhlbrown", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18277116100277430, "text": "You kinda sound like baby Justin Bieber", "created_at": "2025-07-06T02:39:50", "owner": "rq.arj_kekel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971357373869737, "text": "Out running a horse is impressive", "created_at": "2025-07-06T01:02:55", "owner": "yayata513", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923852952981458, "text": "@abimfarlam 🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-06T00:47:59", "owner": "courtsharvey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081310504883653, "text": "What’re you? Cavalry?", "created_at": "2025-07-06T00:37:11", "owner": "daniel_mcf98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080491567885855, "text": "One spear and that animal is falling down", "created_at": "2025-07-05T23:47:22", "owner": "finnmark_mf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18513602686041663, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-05T23:26:56", "owner": "martinmorales4808", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182339542324978, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-05T22:21:43", "owner": "naceo19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014167865567989, "text": "I was going to make a joke but this is wholesome", "created_at": "2025-07-05T21:58:03", "owner": "dime_cat_darrell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18407332903108497, "text": "Please tell me you have a lasso 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-05T20:59:22", "owner": "junebug243159", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045328859267810, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-05T20:46:36", "owner": "ladpo0l", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17980675688718754, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-05T19:52:20", "owner": "11.11.7l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959653851949492, "text": "Why is your horse running sideways", "created_at": "2025-07-05T19:40:49", "owner": "jojosbizarre_66", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090309055650583, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-05T18:57:18", "owner": "__thyy_h", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114867145498243, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-05T18:20:24", "owner": "iamabaleeva.jo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047433017232636, "text": "The accent 😂😂🗣️come here", "created_at": "2025-07-05T17:40:42", "owner": "vaicious_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936794877915649, "text": "2016 jb ahh voice", "created_at": "2025-07-05T17:14:48", "owner": "saadwildin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110619121511885, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-05T16:45:47", "owner": "alex.j346", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18524222431018478, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-07-05T16:39:50", "owner": "aliyyamemon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18512856751015314, "text": "😂😂😂😂 stop", "created_at": "2025-07-05T15:17:22", "owner": "lombahesayzso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18354509266155128, "text": "Fair enough lol 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-05T14:21:51", "owner": "ruby62131", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088443238662126, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-07-05T11:40:57", "owner": "_bob__by__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933824461057978, "text": "I always knew horse girls are dangerous like that LMAO", "created_at": "2025-07-05T11:07:40", "owner": "dnisify.veg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912227797152139, "text": "New episode of Steel Ball Run looks great", "created_at": "2025-07-05T10:40:34", "owner": "_conorm10p", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069154454019920, "text": "My chasing my friends with my big shalong out", "created_at": "2025-07-05T09:20:55", "owner": "explosivediarrhoea_ptsd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033967775427523, "text": "Get a lasso", "created_at": "2025-07-05T05:18:41", "owner": "muddkipper1268", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056099324524191, "text": "The kinda motivation I need 😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-07-05T03:58:37", "owner": "hriday_gupta__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970258626913212, "text": "😂😂This is my favourite hobby", "created_at": "2025-07-05T03:23:49", "owner": "iib.eo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087437797664388, "text": "Lmao 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-05T02:51:53", "owner": "therealestfrom601", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006320468785693, "text": "Where’s the part where she gets ran over?", "created_at": "2025-07-05T00:21:01", "owner": "jaxoncronkhite", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079660288698706, "text": "I wanna know what your parents do", "created_at": "2025-07-04T22:37:59", "owner": "fille_allumee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303975679244272, "text": "ARISE, RIDERS OF THEODEN! FAIR DEEDS AWAIT, FIRE AND SLAUGHTER!", "created_at": "2025-07-04T21:52:32", "owner": "alek_the_pal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138678316415387, "text": "🤣😂 training day", "created_at": "2025-07-04T21:24:34", "owner": "echap0719", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943189330001395, "text": "Don’t this remind you of the old days?", "created_at": "2025-07-04T20:56:09", "owner": "xqp_71", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171321205339903, "text": "All fun and games until she trips and your horse doesn't jump over her.", "created_at": "2025-07-04T20:38:08", "owner": "mc_mongrel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061439339222820, "text": "Is this the new horse girl game?", "created_at": "2025-07-04T20:31:40", "owner": "crispydolphin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071713321966538, "text": "Where’s the lasso?", "created_at": "2025-07-04T19:27:51", "owner": "snickersfrickers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899309134230538, "text": "Hahaha", "created_at": "2025-07-04T19:09:40", "owner": "brukme_25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165523420358272, "text": "#theinternetisundefeated", "created_at": "2025-07-04T19:06:36", "owner": "thatadoopig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106222015475602, "text": "Totally thought this was @shailenewoodley at first! 🤷", "created_at": "2025-07-04T19:02:56", "owner": "greg.johnson.208", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972322371911723, "text": "@cealeena lollll!!! Same.", "created_at": "2025-07-04T18:24:10", "owner": "gudrunwolff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854492206468066, "text": "Ahhhhhh I would love to do this 😂😂😂😂😂🤠🤠🤠🤠", "created_at": "2025-07-04T18:22:00", "owner": "aceoracles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848711149507353, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-04T17:40:30", "owner": "fireandrainman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980938263712644, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-04T16:49:32", "owner": "naman_mlk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063410783515772, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-04T16:30:39", "owner": "_saldiaz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074798222306818, "text": "In a parallel universe: \"GET THOSE BLEACHES\"", "created_at": "2025-07-04T16:27:39", "owner": "miska.1008", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060899330464389, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-04T16:18:48", "owner": "__jeremiah_29_11__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933056184940605, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-04T15:36:07", "owner": "boss_429_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889968460164802, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-07-04T14:48:13", "owner": "elousek_13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085583746689072, "text": "Need horse", "created_at": "2025-07-04T14:43:37", "owner": "abyososos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872455033385642, "text": "Stop trampling yourself , stop trampling yourself", "created_at": "2025-07-04T14:06:21", "owner": "biggs11689", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047706413211398, "text": "Naw @lesdidit now y u go and like this post!!!! Frfr 🤣😭", "created_at": "2025-07-04T13:33:24", "owner": "nbward19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867119230328945, "text": "WHY ARE YOU DRIFTING THE HORSE???", "created_at": "2025-07-04T12:13:16", "owner": "bpeszleg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041732948317137, "text": "I'm in love 😍", "created_at": "2025-07-04T11:45:14", "owner": "lior_zamir_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18372488776178288, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-04T11:13:10", "owner": "a.e_markov05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890040751163506, "text": "WE JUST WANNA BOND 😭", "created_at": "2025-07-04T11:03:46", "owner": "_sassysnowqueen_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912979123154898, "text": "C'MERE BOY‼️🤠🗣️🗣️🗣️", "created_at": "2025-07-04T10:38:40", "owner": "milkman5.56", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18484558294069584, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-04T07:46:47", "owner": "zamangwanedla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054246950374912, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-04T07:43:36", "owner": "zamangwanedla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057073865058331, "text": "Your a good man Arthur morgan", "created_at": "2025-07-04T06:04:01", "owner": "abhishek_r2008", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090855895650077, "text": "We just want to talk to you about our lord and savior Jesus Christ", "created_at": "2025-07-04T06:02:47", "owner": "ericahegs", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18048987353189470, "text": "its neck is like a tilted D", "created_at": "2025-07-04T05:56:11", "owner": "rajatjangraaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888489034296861, "text": "Get a lasso", "created_at": "2025-07-04T03:19:59", "owner": "_dallas2real_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946428955006753, "text": "Just waiting for the horse to get angry and kick you", "created_at": "2025-07-04T02:49:01", "owner": "straight_edge_preston", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18354453835155038, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-04T01:35:43", "owner": "t9frm34th", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869684137306753, "text": "OK this is cute!", "created_at": "2025-07-04T01:03:06", "owner": "minigerpaul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850469668457493, "text": "….now I want a horse", "created_at": "2025-07-04T00:42:11", "owner": "littleredpanda2186", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984408768697246, "text": "Same", "created_at": "2025-07-04T00:40:34", "owner": "evangeliomedarna", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17926184991066628, "text": "The horse://////", "created_at": "2025-07-04T00:37:10", "owner": "balsam_luv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18210092566306333, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-03T22:08:20", "owner": "uncle__joe71", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073513618786518, "text": "Applejack", "created_at": "2025-07-03T21:22:07", "owner": "rayydwk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119595871473844, "text": "Excellent.", "created_at": "2025-07-03T21:08:34", "owner": "dadaseabear", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944089897008091, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-03T20:47:03", "owner": "miyah3.__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051065126409135, "text": "You ride it very good", "created_at": "2025-07-03T20:28:12", "owner": "__.rachid_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066632729117398, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-03T19:29:34", "owner": "floryan_78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927432064079769, "text": "Yes instagram, i am interested.", "created_at": "2025-07-03T19:25:36", "owner": "molliemoo2093", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073043917797581, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-03T19:10:14", "owner": "rebeca.brunow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050105309171896, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣lmaooo", "created_at": "2025-07-03T18:42:39", "owner": "sayylil.n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884367427199676, "text": "I like sinking to the bottom of lakes", "created_at": "2025-07-03T18:21:56", "owner": "maxbigpp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158767177368090, "text": "Ohhh the Mongols......", "created_at": "2025-07-03T16:58:49", "owner": "sreenuthehind", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969814959766805, "text": "“COME EAH”👺", "created_at": "2025-07-03T15:29:25", "owner": "iiamtlc._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130647862440944, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-03T15:17:47", "owner": "xanhonaker12", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18092876059617222, "text": "👹come here", "created_at": "2025-07-03T13:20:09", "owner": "sophiea_hh_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089803999648591, "text": "It’s a sentient animal I think it’d know when to stop why she runnin for", "created_at": "2025-07-03T12:45:22", "owner": "malakyedemosani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18359978809144270, "text": "\"WE'VE BEEN TRYING TO REACH YOU ABOUT YOUR CARS EXTENDED WARRANTY!\"", "created_at": "2025-07-03T12:38:50", "owner": "nels721", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159144604365065, "text": "You need a curved Calvary sword or a lance. Aim for the middle of the back.", "created_at": "2025-07-03T12:16:54", "owner": "the_titanium_tibia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080349763677191, "text": "Come ere 🤠", "created_at": "2025-07-03T10:21:16", "owner": "alliedmastercomputer877", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069542654089543, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-03T10:10:12", "owner": "bash_kid404", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064229236915895, "text": "And if you catch her..", "created_at": "2025-07-03T09:49:05", "owner": "alexpereirafan101fan101", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081861799837427, "text": "😂🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-03T08:51:54", "owner": "remyatoy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922571472988445, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-03T08:04:55", "owner": "mariahconners", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083997724755396, "text": "burn them calories cmon 🗣️", "created_at": "2025-07-03T05:49:01", "owner": "maggik.2xl", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18101819617491548, "text": "Used to chase my good old dog Tom 😂 I'd tell my horse \"get em\" and he'd take off", "created_at": "2025-07-03T05:33:38", "owner": "willow.worth", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18016917197737446, "text": "Why was your sideways running horse for like 3 seconds", "created_at": "2025-07-03T05:22:38", "owner": "peanutbutter_with_crackers", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17855007507463942, "text": "C’mere Boah!", "created_at": "2025-07-03T04:37:28", "owner": "elijahzaitz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050469689419987, "text": "So funny, your sister will never get fat 🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-03T04:08:40", "owner": "14bhappy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18511355941060264, "text": "Hey this woman a whip", "created_at": "2025-07-03T02:40:56", "owner": "jemiller2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062507753470615, "text": "lol learn to lasso next 😭", "created_at": "2025-07-03T01:51:00", "owner": "midnight_phosphor", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17958422972954038, "text": "Where’s the whoop🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-03T00:40:26", "owner": "abhi10manyala", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934530109048137, "text": "\" today's topic ... slavery \"", "created_at": "2025-07-03T00:09:51", "owner": "weam_badr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18163186573363889, "text": "you sound exactly like shailene woodley at the beginning", "created_at": "2025-07-02T23:07:01", "owner": "jtheripri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054739196080090, "text": "STOP 🗣️🛑 STOP 🛑 STOP 🚏🗣️ STOP 🗣️🗣️🗣️", "created_at": "2025-07-02T22:30:14", "owner": "ladydorky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047169911561256, "text": "What my personal trainer had to do to get me running", "created_at": "2025-07-02T22:01:51", "owner": "_aylinatk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071400469970039, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-02T21:36:43", "owner": "p_bito_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919144555130372, "text": "Vine moment 😭💀", "created_at": "2025-07-02T19:36:23", "owner": "celestialart03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144566338399520, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-02T18:47:50", "owner": "rosietoejam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081942403834626, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-02T17:23:11", "owner": "blakeissupercoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042966059302569, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-02T16:59:13", "owner": "shobielope", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941176161994005, "text": "@meghanjp", "created_at": "2025-07-02T16:38:56", "owner": "s_edwards10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016607345733168, "text": "“COME HERE 👹👹👹”", "created_at": "2025-07-02T16:21:23", "owner": "d4zzl1ng._.d0llyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082856209748130, "text": "Why is the horse running in Italics?", "created_at": "2025-07-02T16:01:12", "owner": "rocky_benetton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953480850838316, "text": "Not the horse drifting😂", "created_at": "2025-07-02T15:37:29", "owner": "j._.liljeberg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064331197933604, "text": "I have no sis but a cousin sissy yes", "created_at": "2025-07-02T15:32:55", "owner": "_rexian.7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18272366692279669, "text": "H💰A💰H💰A💰H💰A💰H💰A", "created_at": "2025-07-02T15:31:50", "owner": "_islam.a.a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18169770316351710, "text": "Lasso", "created_at": "2025-07-02T15:05:39", "owner": "callsign_echo_04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987588468827442, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-02T13:34:42", "owner": "luvraghuvanshi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971533245879980, "text": "Gotta tell her you're here to talk about her car's extended warranty", "created_at": "2025-07-02T13:31:15", "owner": "averagejoey33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990118695818737, "text": "That my hobby to chasing my brother 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-02T12:55:58", "owner": "fai_amank", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962680194942434, "text": "Run Forrest RUNNN!!! 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-02T12:33:41", "owner": "andrew_kurtz8618", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18363942253194909, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-02T11:39:27", "owner": "_m.r_02_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016784519733012, "text": "Nigga", "created_at": "2025-07-02T11:12:08", "owner": "c0sm0z_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066964487120803, "text": "My brother puched me down the stairs and ask me to do it again", "created_at": "2025-07-02T10:23:04", "owner": "allis_duintevetvem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064864958133688, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-02T09:44:44", "owner": "paulphiri459", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083902603779458, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-02T08:45:11", "owner": "meshaalahmed7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064679854923075, "text": "Why u lwk drifting with the horese", "created_at": "2025-07-02T07:02:21", "owner": "ktm_danilo11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071636668971845, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-02T06:21:44", "owner": "wilsonbryer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18514845844059704, "text": "Is your horse drifting", "created_at": "2025-07-02T05:55:34", "owner": "ozymandius_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972286194909579, "text": "I’ll follow if you get a lasso and drag her next time", "created_at": "2025-07-02T05:10:25", "owner": "vulayton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038444807655886, "text": "@chloewilson123 🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-02T05:09:18", "owner": "megan_allice", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18015213629559071, "text": "I love your vids", "created_at": "2025-07-02T04:41:56", "owner": "kays_lays1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079003525893109, "text": "The cool kind of hobby horsing", "created_at": "2025-07-02T03:45:29", "owner": "notenoughxptounlockme_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877543015359879, "text": "Nice try, welcome back Arthur Morgan", "created_at": "2025-07-02T03:27:31", "owner": "rio_is_tall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896300404239538, "text": "This is so funnnnn", "created_at": "2025-07-02T02:46:50", "owner": "saramishal44", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18230098063295064, "text": "I would tie mine to the front fence and spray her with the hose.", "created_at": "2025-07-02T02:12:53", "owner": "keto.loser", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857815870450164, "text": "Oh my gosh Lexi 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-01T23:41:02", "owner": "eventing_with_mads", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880755112229788, "text": "I'd do it", "created_at": "2025-07-01T22:01:11", "owner": "ominous_grim012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869285425395004, "text": "o meu correu atrás de mim com uma faca, mas acho que vai de cada um", "created_at": "2025-07-01T21:59:40", "owner": "becruzr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040659527329508, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-01T21:35:52", "owner": "ibrahim_t_a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18523917487051447, "text": "Can you please put a bobber on the horse", "created_at": "2025-07-01T18:38:27", "owner": "jost_kayla", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17977520258848894, "text": "She crab walking", "created_at": "2025-07-01T15:29:21", "owner": "cam.ak0827", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072629626799513, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-01T15:16:28", "owner": "hosesngd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941962987010941, "text": "I ran my brother over with those kid sized cars that you can drive yourself and I also got kicked into a wall by my brother 🤭🥲", "created_at": "2025-07-01T14:39:30", "owner": "zoejane886", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18281217706262448, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-01T13:59:58", "owner": "casualenjoyer314", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18519925402033493, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-01T13:55:47", "owner": "titowahlstrom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18355836769155672, "text": "I bet this is fun", "created_at": "2025-07-01T13:54:01", "owner": "cooooooomes", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17940478665010894, "text": "Run for your life, run🤠🤠🗣️🗣️😭😭🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-01T13:43:36", "owner": "trimsy.edit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055905326070566, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-01T13:05:11", "owner": "gabesubie59", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977542308731230, "text": "🤠", "created_at": "2025-07-01T12:46:59", "owner": "aiga0016_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063188812958553, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-01T11:02:53", "owner": "joelvictor02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066628211109150, "text": "But she's not even black", "created_at": "2025-07-01T10:42:45", "owner": "_ahmed.k_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072164101794856, "text": "Why are you drifting the horse?😭", "created_at": "2025-07-01T10:02:06", "owner": "joana.kblnz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144148474394698, "text": "Hahahaha! You should learn to lasso and chase her with it while twirling it in the air!", "created_at": "2025-07-01T09:42:35", "owner": "allan.d__", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17851059111484556, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-01T06:37:23", "owner": "ermas712", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071099074951414, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-01T06:02:09", "owner": "yasser.plays1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967483908919432, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-01T05:54:42", "owner": "sunnynandaofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064070195140060, "text": "Horses do hungry he could eat a girl", "created_at": "2025-07-01T05:31:10", "owner": "mr._.mayonnaise", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911611204156553, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-01T04:17:01", "owner": "philjohntee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872121421287965, "text": "\"We would like to talk to you about our lord and saviour \"", "created_at": "2025-07-01T04:16:27", "owner": "mamamoo5ey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107820991521977, "text": "😭🤠😍", "created_at": "2025-07-01T03:42:19", "owner": "kaspa773", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067160969102795, "text": "i NEED a horse now", "created_at": "2025-07-01T01:23:09", "owner": "ki1ler_six", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046488863236647, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-07-01T00:52:07", "owner": "jjjh_775", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016473197737737, "text": "😭🤣u gained a follower from the wigs on the goats during your UN medicated crash out🤣😭", "created_at": "2025-07-01T00:27:29", "owner": "lafayette.ebony", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18168446260350425, "text": "You just need a lasso now", "created_at": "2025-07-01T00:02:33", "owner": "_matthew.moralesv2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18229905994289475, "text": "Oh I chased mine with a meat syringe…then my parents hid it and I haven’t seen it since", "created_at": "2025-06-30T23:30:51", "owner": "dirpygirl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18021666281511625, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-30T23:13:19", "owner": "don_dhadha_13", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078860881868378, "text": "This is diabolical 🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-30T22:53:24", "owner": "tucker_g_03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923522016983318, "text": "Apaches in 1871", "created_at": "2025-06-30T22:26:04", "owner": "julianfonsecabjj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014984564737855, "text": "COME ERE COME ERE", "created_at": "2025-06-30T21:31:28", "owner": "lubabsba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037075685344815, "text": "This deserves a follow 😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-06-30T21:11:51", "owner": "benjiboyog.n2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878671765241011, "text": "This is so wrong for this era😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-30T20:36:27", "owner": "toshanna_madello", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051674627579394, "text": "COME HERE COME HERE🤠🤠🤠", "created_at": "2025-06-30T19:43:09", "owner": "zakariaoharris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071334413292616, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-30T19:36:19", "owner": "connercharles_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004619732790417, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-30T19:00:35", "owner": "1ki.3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164944492357756, "text": "Where's your lasso🤠", "created_at": "2025-06-30T18:17:25", "owner": "optimisfitbalance", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118868095468471, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-06-30T17:52:17", "owner": "zombie_vonny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882064150337477, "text": "RUN THOSE CALORIES GURL 🗣️", "created_at": "2025-06-30T17:23:14", "owner": "franchuddrago", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18347558365094344, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-30T17:15:31", "owner": "m4_the_king", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855316552417399, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-30T17:10:27", "owner": "raynebowmo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926904135963550, "text": "First world problems lol", "created_at": "2025-06-30T16:58:20", "owner": "slick_85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068645177011003, "text": "Cavalry and infantry", "created_at": "2025-06-30T16:53:09", "owner": "mover76_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878632864244701, "text": "RUN N***** RUN  RUN RUN RUN", "created_at": "2025-06-30T16:20:20", "owner": "mo_tafa07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898429057234405, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-30T16:13:57", "owner": "kru_bob", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18312429913215981, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-30T14:51:10", "owner": "kaniazm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079445800852213, "text": "“I just want shake ur hand”", "created_at": "2025-06-30T14:40:16", "owner": "dirtypotatos765", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068178140482564, "text": "@sem.vanderkroft  so us", "created_at": "2025-06-30T14:29:56", "owner": "ivar_spie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912442609036409, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-30T13:37:39", "owner": "kryptid_kermit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853494463470233, "text": "Muscle memory😭", "created_at": "2025-06-30T13:23:36", "owner": "jasinski.leon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090402457572368, "text": "I use to just aim a football at my sisters head", "created_at": "2025-06-30T13:08:33", "owner": "pauldelacey1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18316396423232989, "text": "Come er 👹", "created_at": "2025-06-30T12:51:46", "owner": "sweetmarigoldsphotography", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18329246065205521, "text": "Every RDR 2 encounter with an NPC", "created_at": "2025-06-30T12:36:02", "owner": "ranjansengupta97", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18180912475323530, "text": "@simranthinkthings i wish i could", "created_at": "2025-06-30T12:34:17", "owner": "manpreetsingh_bamotra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053764625369194, "text": "@shamasspace  me if we had moneyyyyyyy", "created_at": "2025-06-30T12:26:05", "owner": "9_oumayma_6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912550417036805, "text": "I know I’m doing to my friends when I get a license now 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-30T11:38:36", "owner": "astin_mtb.priv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18513894931045098, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-30T11:27:18", "owner": "sanchez138", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875460343363531, "text": "🤠🦋", "created_at": "2025-06-30T10:00:44", "owner": "swagfromthesouth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084764368703805, "text": "COOOOOOME HERE", "created_at": "2025-06-30T08:07:06", "owner": "julieboeijen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069225647093439, "text": "🐴 : ///////", "created_at": "2025-06-30T07:20:27", "owner": "rushillverma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922620760069951, "text": "Why's it running sideways", "created_at": "2025-06-30T07:05:32", "owner": "khuziwesithole.x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095364307614836, "text": "WHY R U RUNNIN😭", "created_at": "2025-06-30T06:08:58", "owner": "vigga_w6", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17883991371202627, "text": "why it looks like horse is drifting", "created_at": "2025-06-30T04:40:21", "owner": "krispi_seysi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070009820070663, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-30T03:59:02", "owner": "iam_cici", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058190129587516, "text": "😂😂🤠🗣️😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-30T03:54:23", "owner": "mohogony_manifesting", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104488744479944, "text": "Lasso her !", "created_at": "2025-06-30T01:35:54", "owner": "neilsarkar412", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083363119695033, "text": "I chased mine with fire😊", "created_at": "2025-06-30T00:32:42", "owner": "abdiweezer12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116842009485158, "text": "Thats so evil..... do it again", "created_at": "2025-06-30T00:29:46", "owner": "average_outis_lover", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075828445898634, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-29T23:50:14", "owner": "annabelle_walls03", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18488766937091375, "text": "This is the real reason I wasn't allowed to have a horse growing up", "created_at": "2025-06-29T23:04:29", "owner": "ninar.c0s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064187648514475, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-29T21:42:46", "owner": "thatsneosun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073706636498353, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-29T21:16:17", "owner": "scarlettegc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089738563653912, "text": "A whip is missing", "created_at": "2025-06-29T19:59:03", "owner": "_big_hun", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047289965201131, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-29T19:58:32", "owner": "g6p_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063887657141487, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-29T18:44:42", "owner": "goldpantha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888684895293525, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-29T18:41:05", "owner": "myleovibe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992142129805209, "text": "All I see is an eldest daughter helping raise her siblings", "created_at": "2025-06-29T18:03:54", "owner": "vic428ki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18398170207112827, "text": "Sounds like John Marston on estrogen", "created_at": "2025-06-29T18:00:10", "owner": "mabybee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079762177868954, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-29T17:30:10", "owner": "thilo.schmitz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911731183150467, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-29T17:28:03", "owner": "apostlefishing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087744481669254, "text": "We were in the hood so I chased mine with a butcher knife 🤠", "created_at": "2025-06-29T16:44:26", "owner": "feen_4redd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997702137800148, "text": "I think its the horses favorite hobby too", "created_at": "2025-06-29T16:14:04", "owner": "thenameofthemoon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066125993116782, "text": "Rdr2 bounty moment", "created_at": "2025-06-29T16:12:13", "owner": "lucasjep", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155879578374790, "text": "You know that horse bites or some shit 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-29T16:06:54", "owner": "betthisoneistaken2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069362618051371, "text": "Why was she drifting her horse💀💀", "created_at": "2025-06-29T15:58:18", "owner": "_kaleab.b", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18172782382337678, "text": "you should get a jbl speaker and play mario juddah while chasing her", "created_at": "2025-06-29T15:20:26", "owner": "hazymarkayzee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18347766241086831, "text": "She’s playing rdr2 in real life", "created_at": "2025-06-29T15:18:49", "owner": "carmenclifford_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074579282506621, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-29T15:09:02", "owner": "alecsoncloud", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914859070112477, "text": "You should try to lasso her", "created_at": "2025-06-29T15:08:37", "owner": "eli_______190", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075356653938001, "text": "Texas way of mess with younger siblings …. Heuuuuaaaaaaaa", "created_at": "2025-06-29T14:41:56", "owner": "l0octor_78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070970410999933, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-29T13:57:09", "owner": "conan_otaka", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18072188590798380, "text": "Bet that reminds you of the good old days @achilles_come.d0wn", "created_at": "2025-06-29T13:41:48", "owner": "_owlishh_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060904766467768, "text": "🤣 We just wanna play 🤣🤠", "created_at": "2025-06-29T11:47:13", "owner": "billyrusspiz.42", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947778984865864, "text": "RUN EM DOWN", "created_at": "2025-06-29T11:36:40", "owner": "jamie.thundrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080295061878169, "text": "Bet she does a lot more with that horse", "created_at": "2025-06-29T11:30:46", "owner": "doggomuncher", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083720491753492, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-29T10:28:59", "owner": "korhonen4677", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096766237585117, "text": "\"Giddy up boy🤠\"- a cowboy from the west", "created_at": "2025-06-29T10:28:08", "owner": "sarthakvermardr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18487587589070568, "text": "I want this as my pacer and motivation 🏃🏻‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-06-29T10:22:59", "owner": "theskyfromhere_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889514485163402, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-29T10:13:42", "owner": "lampakangon", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17858659272443480, "text": "You're a good man Arthur Morgan", "created_at": "2025-06-29T10:01:17", "owner": "ruddehz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974170770886938, "text": "whys it running sideways", "created_at": "2025-06-29T09:26:32", "owner": "goonicidebestway", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18143949757395865, "text": "why that horse walk sideways", "created_at": "2025-06-29T09:14:18", "owner": "akiraa_loves_pia", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18361777831147970, "text": "Me.\nJust put my brother", "created_at": "2025-06-29T09:14:11", "owner": "maple_spring_gameing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981001509847835, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-29T08:44:09", "owner": "jacobrosendahluldahl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18334969243163019, "text": "Practice your lasso too", "created_at": "2025-06-29T07:49:23", "owner": "anthonyhimself91_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032816498443120, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-29T07:14:39", "owner": "rl9ea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875323066265314, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-29T06:39:53", "owner": "christopher_montero31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031301945678300, "text": "So nobody's gonna talk Abt that briddle just look at the ears 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-29T05:35:28", "owner": "_diljxxt_24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889658752165702, "text": "My ex gf used to do this to me", "created_at": "2025-06-29T05:34:16", "owner": "scoots_sgvla", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17931240276060030, "text": "Westworld", "created_at": "2025-06-29T05:33:25", "owner": "_____arnold__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077191582920843, "text": "Drifting the horse is cw", "created_at": "2025-06-29T05:31:42", "owner": "dyzafyk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070264337492995, "text": "You are my favorite sprit animal now 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-29T05:11:46", "owner": "vish_sr20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18418661857096499, "text": "Why the horse running at an angke😭", "created_at": "2025-06-29T04:52:07", "owner": "scarlet_ngga", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18303999241172595, "text": "Get back to the fields!!", "created_at": "2025-06-29T04:48:46", "owner": "underwaterforrestgreene", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851990620476059, "text": "I suddenly understand the thrill of the hunt", "created_at": "2025-06-29T03:39:48", "owner": "beaver_music", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17947955408859182, "text": "That would be fun tho icl", "created_at": "2025-06-29T03:36:23", "owner": "ciaran_365", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970073007875469, "text": "Probably how they be chasing them slaves back then", "created_at": "2025-06-29T02:49:44", "owner": "graham_creation", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18063522638259391, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-06-29T01:51:19", "owner": "halid0812", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071348530959775, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-29T01:51:16", "owner": "halid0812", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18510584845006113, "text": "🫨🫡", "created_at": "2025-06-28T23:59:48", "owner": "micah4.6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055968623608579, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-28T23:40:38", "owner": "dylan_lunch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18470696329077735, "text": "@jas_murray27 @angiemayk", "created_at": "2025-06-28T21:57:28", "owner": "miss__smiles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073302352983899, "text": "Bruh 😂 if i had a little sister id totally do this. They would prob be 28 yrs old though cause im 34", "created_at": "2025-06-28T21:27:06", "owner": "dustin_magdales", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069868550484268, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-28T20:54:34", "owner": "solodolotoni0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940416192898124, "text": "So good", "created_at": "2025-06-28T20:28:09", "owner": "christophervigneau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842254381529062, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-28T20:01:24", "owner": "ossama._.os", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915939580127010, "text": "Slayyyy 💅", "created_at": "2025-06-28T19:54:34", "owner": "wlazer______", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064413574928097, "text": "Ya need a lasso..", "created_at": "2025-06-28T19:27:53", "owner": "sillybilly1982", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848834311465779, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-28T19:05:46", "owner": "eduz1530_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18388504390189494, "text": "Terror on a new level", "created_at": "2025-06-28T18:46:37", "owner": "n510_82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953020536985623, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-28T18:41:30", "owner": "vulawaluilimotama", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103254133530054, "text": "When it's bath time but your sister is out loose -", "created_at": "2025-06-28T17:45:33", "owner": "snir1601", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873908566373741, "text": "Exercise for the rider, exercise for the horse, exercise for the sister. Win, win, win.", "created_at": "2025-06-28T17:09:13", "owner": "maron_art", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18131107612441245, "text": "White people chasing a runner on horseback. A tale as old as time", "created_at": "2025-06-28T16:53:25", "owner": "quazijoe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880141573346189, "text": "This game looks fun", "created_at": "2025-06-28T16:46:27", "owner": "keegan_p5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961321395940117, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-28T15:27:54", "owner": "polymath_ofc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033886040661703, "text": "My sis would do that to me but then she got me and I got kicked", "created_at": "2025-06-28T15:26:30", "owner": "jordyn_nav", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073042463497830, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-28T15:15:36", "owner": "shanices_____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028588568489894, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-28T15:13:35", "owner": "alijeh_reik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923577894984177, "text": "Well kinda but it with a fourwheeler and I have a brother", "created_at": "2025-06-28T14:47:08", "owner": "jacobberry2840", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043150619288549, "text": "The deed stock bin", "created_at": "2025-06-28T14:43:03", "owner": "logamcko0992021", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082850104838425, "text": "@dominique1087 looks like you weren’t the only crazy sibling 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-28T14:42:36", "owner": "yoyoyigittyyo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054098414096833, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-28T13:49:55", "owner": "erica_elizabeth_thee_goddess", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062482472465965, "text": "My favorite hobby is you", "created_at": "2025-06-28T13:16:37", "owner": "dionelivingg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063372362179718, "text": "Movie seen", "created_at": "2025-06-28T13:05:35", "owner": "rishabhkatiyar01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895742263250601, "text": "I think your horse has stick drift", "created_at": "2025-06-28T12:48:57", "owner": "sog_steppin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970466310910795, "text": "@keirstyn_bailey I chased you with a knife❤️❤️💕", "created_at": "2025-06-28T12:48:38", "owner": "lills.thy.3rd", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17972414681860947, "text": "@_.mkelly", "created_at": "2025-06-28T12:09:24", "owner": "rodrigo71836", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094540393609839, "text": "🗣️🗣️COME HERE! COME HERE!", "created_at": "2025-06-28T11:59:03", "owner": "_n_ruth_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063952490172854, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-28T11:12:34", "owner": "slick_.gad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067335341020888, "text": "Same but with a Harvester", "created_at": "2025-06-28T09:03:55", "owner": "j_25___99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950127504990986, "text": "I once scared my younger cousion with first showing him nat geo croc documentries. Then gifted him a jump scare croc toy which I specifically bought out with all of my toy money which would suddenly open its mouth with red tongue coming outside. He was so scared he threw it away with bawling his eyes out. Whenever over the week i would show him toy he would start bawling. I would soothe him and then again chase him with the toy. I terrorised the hell out of him for nearly a week and a half we were vacationing together. Oh the good old days!", "created_at": "2025-06-28T09:03:25", "owner": "grjndr96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066205094023247, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-28T08:51:27", "owner": "zihad_ar2023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991322334665919, "text": "oh joy u have 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-28T08:11:04", "owner": "grahamcoller", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18294055948187503, "text": "This is how the French thought Agincourt gonna end like", "created_at": "2025-06-28T06:44:48", "owner": "__shadhin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067432781018474, "text": "@azanzami jajjajajajajajajajjajajajajjajajajajjaja", "created_at": "2025-06-28T06:16:03", "owner": "marazanza", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18365899177198639, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-28T05:44:21", "owner": "k_junheon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080838871858817, "text": "If someone riding a horse thats running sideways comes at me you bet believe im dipping also 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-28T05:36:40", "owner": "zach_samuelz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107266672525923, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-28T05:20:27", "owner": "masonaaronmiller", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139695343409906, "text": "Why she drifting the horse😭🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-28T05:02:59", "owner": "_jackamo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17991085919818760, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-06-28T01:42:18", "owner": "___josh___90s_kid_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051187271129112, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-28T00:39:58", "owner": "ally.cecilia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054865031083783, "text": "😂😂😂😭", "created_at": "2025-06-28T00:19:28", "owner": "fatih_ege_yildirim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329932666207201, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-28T00:02:53", "owner": "gage_eich3r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18510096925031694, "text": "There's some disgusting producers who'll be looking for you. Resist.... resist.  Do your own thing and thing and monetise it yourself. This is fucking hilarious 😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-27T23:28:51", "owner": "bubface", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011294942584904, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-27T22:38:43", "owner": "murdrox_87", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17970024962864554, "text": "COME HERE 👹👹👹", "created_at": "2025-06-27T22:28:09", "owner": "slloma__.f15", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17868042048403008, "text": "Thought this was Shailene Woodley at first!!! 😅🤣🤣💖💖", "created_at": "2025-06-27T20:56:07", "owner": "claudiagonzalez20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991057452667960, "text": "Nomads chasing eastern European farmers every couple of decades", "created_at": "2025-06-27T20:05:02", "owner": "ahura_505", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066926789293045, "text": "True hobby horsing", "created_at": "2025-06-27T19:59:19", "owner": "huddy_buddy.28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086115748674141, "text": "Is the horse supposed to drift and swerve?", "created_at": "2025-06-27T19:10:41", "owner": "cheefqueef41", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17869443819392847, "text": "I love you", "created_at": "2025-06-27T19:10:34", "owner": "azureskymusic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078323293873046, "text": "Reminds her of a similar time “get back here boi”", "created_at": "2025-06-27T17:46:03", "owner": "_let.it.flow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070202945481895, "text": "This is so older sibling coded", "created_at": "2025-06-27T17:37:14", "owner": "beccahrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012127076580945, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-06-27T17:03:27", "owner": "luxi_zuxi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038363393650397, "text": "Today's subject....slavery", "created_at": "2025-06-27T16:51:26", "owner": "shahed_almatarneh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093882826615164, "text": "Why you drifting da horse", "created_at": "2025-06-27T15:57:48", "owner": "isidorkennedy_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064189834899620, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-27T14:23:31", "owner": "alexkiriaki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078831028701545, "text": "is that horse drifting?!", "created_at": "2025-06-27T13:51:55", "owner": "byhexl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103892230553164, "text": "How are u drifting the horse", "created_at": "2025-06-27T13:33:16", "owner": "anjero_211", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083606836691697, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-27T12:58:03", "owner": "bbycloudz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035056322401045, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-06-27T12:26:59", "owner": "duchondc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044854751535177, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-27T12:00:32", "owner": "hal.psd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842477638526943, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-27T07:14:17", "owner": "d_y_r2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844487578502384, "text": "🤣 oh that poor girl", "created_at": "2025-06-27T07:07:28", "owner": "lunneytoon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047773607445983, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-27T06:23:48", "owner": "ricky117007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064381301138152, "text": "Pov: u r worm rider on Arrakis and u c someone", "created_at": "2025-06-27T05:08:03", "owner": "ihajurcik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301325182216881, "text": "Yee ha", "created_at": "2025-06-27T04:48:02", "owner": "doomhound59", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041361380310755, "text": "Lmfao 🤠🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-27T03:52:41", "owner": "develish_toast_crunch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079579363871094, "text": "The horse is obviously saying “seriously? Okay…”", "created_at": "2025-06-27T03:50:33", "owner": "claffs_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085729987708148, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-27T01:25:32", "owner": "nagatupuariki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087403348670728, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-27T00:22:05", "owner": "jfrank.o", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18507744658044215, "text": "I got chased with a belt😢", "created_at": "2025-06-26T23:27:58", "owner": "jay.2k25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073964980756598, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-26T22:04:56", "owner": "k1ng_rodriguez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091084480652547, "text": "You should dress as a cuirasser and do it with a foam sword. Trust me it would be hilarious", "created_at": "2025-06-26T21:48:19", "owner": "water_melonmurderer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898185613238464, "text": "@gabeshady1", "created_at": "2025-06-26T21:33:45", "owner": "forrestcastle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058519934462760, "text": "Hehehehehehehebeb🤠", "created_at": "2025-06-26T20:13:22", "owner": "tg112_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948462975996435, "text": "Why she run like a video game character", "created_at": "2025-06-26T20:08:23", "owner": "therealgreekcupid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068512376044512, "text": "Just like the Wild West", "created_at": "2025-06-26T19:23:06", "owner": "nyquilnchill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102210883487703, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-26T19:14:34", "owner": "jinx.rar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908526214176130, "text": "@hibafaroooq", "created_at": "2025-06-26T19:00:05", "owner": "neha_adhira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057362561042480, "text": "👹BURN THOSE CALORIES GIRL", "created_at": "2025-06-26T18:27:13", "owner": "terrencejays", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085673653707899, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-26T18:16:55", "owner": "tonii_rg__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016144574733593, "text": "I bet if horses was my brothers hobby instead of mine hed DEFINITELY do that.", "created_at": "2025-06-26T17:02:58", "owner": "fjb.trump24.85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352916119156804, "text": "I'm not even going to lie I would run too😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-26T16:34:39", "owner": "gnome.slayer007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870402343390802, "text": "Learn to lasso 🤠🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-26T16:11:12", "owner": "ramibey226", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098834128505009, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-26T15:09:41", "owner": "samson.fratello", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18048125594426089, "text": "@wittogzz", "created_at": "2025-06-26T14:34:19", "owner": "y4el_13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096278947589137, "text": "sister core!", "created_at": "2025-06-26T14:02:30", "owner": "beccadrury", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033046469441659, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-26T13:50:19", "owner": "2408_aat", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067233440485045, "text": "Next time chase her with lasso", "created_at": "2025-06-26T12:58:44", "owner": "its_pikachu_uwu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072502768787395, "text": "Why the horse got stick drift", "created_at": "2025-06-26T12:12:30", "owner": "yoboychanning2.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996394647642582, "text": "@se_ghene_ 🤠", "created_at": "2025-06-26T12:06:25", "owner": "r_elguiri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18391771927188187, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-26T11:39:04", "owner": "alazeey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900202099210612, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-26T11:36:33", "owner": "mr.titusbjourney", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093273646530473, "text": "Went from pouching a kangaroo. To chasing your sister on a horse lol. This girl rich fs", "created_at": "2025-06-26T10:22:21", "owner": "chase_mtb_44", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068992592314154, "text": "This looks familiar", "created_at": "2025-06-26T09:54:13", "owner": "thecoolmemes82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880067536342666, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-26T08:50:18", "owner": "j_uhnny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011104655586825, "text": "Come here boy", "created_at": "2025-06-26T07:08:46", "owner": "itzmosestone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18284315662255146, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-26T06:41:51", "owner": "travel_saavychic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052923683375379, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-26T06:17:58", "owner": "8.frs4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080031202677250, "text": "🤣🤣🤣 çome here lol 😂  run run girl", "created_at": "2025-06-26T04:33:47", "owner": "dragonfly_dbro19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095836576607488, "text": "Please get a lasso and trip her with it. For the skit", "created_at": "2025-06-26T04:00:29", "owner": "lewis_d04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883590586202430, "text": "Now throw a lesso around her and drag her behind like in sleepy hollow", "created_at": "2025-06-26T02:03:37", "owner": "johnnyrmb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048272870422372, "text": "Cavalry charge!!!!", "created_at": "2025-06-26T01:39:29", "owner": "the_really_real_dr.greg_house", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18039605129646777, "text": "WE JUST WANT A BITE 👹👹👹", "created_at": "2025-06-26T01:31:35", "owner": "wyatt_veelle", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18060464540224176, "text": "The Older Sibling Department approves.", "created_at": "2025-06-26T00:54:02", "owner": "thislifeoninsta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080760730836528, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-26T00:37:05", "owner": "you_know_i_got_lumbago", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18522182284018808, "text": "Ur funny pls don’t go bald", "created_at": "2025-06-26T00:24:06", "owner": "76milktae", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070974638001022, "text": "\"come here, we just wanna buck\" while thinking of when I got bucked off and almost stomped 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-25T23:21:52", "owner": "rangikapua13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088321246635594, "text": "She was def a slave owner in a former life", "created_at": "2025-06-25T23:18:03", "owner": "danthebeehiveman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926569950964483, "text": "how many wigs do you have?", "created_at": "2025-06-25T22:31:06", "owner": "claire_irl22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918900613000757, "text": "Come outside we're not gonna jump you", "created_at": "2025-06-25T22:02:54", "owner": "kidbass.official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046682576203265, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-25T21:59:42", "owner": "frenchi_baby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069040870858310, "text": "If I could I would 🤠", "created_at": "2025-06-25T21:25:16", "owner": "_evolily_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844352404504520, "text": "COME ERE👹", "created_at": "2025-06-25T19:28:49", "owner": "brn_dwwdy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008589404598014, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-25T18:35:07", "owner": "mudasinger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953390727835017, "text": "COLLAB WITH @tooturnttony 🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-06-25T18:21:14", "owner": "giacoflockaflame", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866329141331069, "text": "Sibling love", "created_at": "2025-06-25T17:26:25", "owner": "noahthomson2010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032687267441042, "text": "How do we partake in this character development", "created_at": "2025-06-25T16:16:19", "owner": "devomane_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059463646994603, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-25T15:59:14", "owner": "simonesomorin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17899492812228140, "text": "Dude give the horse and yourself armor and chase her around while holding a sword and a sheild", "created_at": "2025-06-25T15:58:57", "owner": "judel640", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844358344515305, "text": "Come here partner ain't nothing bad going to happen to you", "created_at": "2025-06-25T15:04:05", "owner": "officer_chad_nate_higgerson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931690792062457, "text": "Butttt, you can't be chased if you dont run.", "created_at": "2025-06-25T14:23:52", "owner": "j4l_3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054717215363751, "text": "My brother chased me with boxelder Bugs", "created_at": "2025-06-25T14:23:22", "owner": "j4l_3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990364965669883, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-25T12:57:24", "owner": "ottothebug_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081198421659926, "text": "Man that’s so funny and cool", "created_at": "2025-06-25T12:37:07", "owner": "sweetooth_2.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102641395490060, "text": "You're a good man, Arthur morgan😌", "created_at": "2025-06-25T11:28:55", "owner": "benmannion8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928287235074819, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-25T10:46:20", "owner": "loli.f67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851899375473486, "text": "@j_dakow 🏇 @_g.georgievva_", "created_at": "2025-06-25T10:44:36", "owner": "lacho_g_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914651194121430, "text": "She was running for her life 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-25T10:37:33", "owner": "warmonger.z6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061274096183603, "text": "You need a rope", "created_at": "2025-06-25T10:20:14", "owner": "qqweti13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933357654938357, "text": "SHREK WE COME FOR YOU 😾🐎🗡️", "created_at": "2025-06-25T08:54:36", "owner": "rastin.hojjat.shamami", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032026715671743, "text": "I can't afford a horse, so I'm using car instead", "created_at": "2025-06-25T08:37:19", "owner": "k_y_t67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18361080148196616, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-25T08:26:55", "owner": "sshtick", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054630554345799, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-25T07:58:11", "owner": "nizamsam._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916036612014646, "text": "Run forest! Run!!", "created_at": "2025-06-25T07:10:43", "owner": "chinchilla1720", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952064463844414, "text": "Burn those calories 🗣️🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-25T06:12:00", "owner": "bernie.wanjohi.986", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18344807077090339, "text": "I think I’m next to do this to my sisters and nephews 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-25T03:40:24", "owner": "meherixkhan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867890383402231, "text": "Whae ar yoo runnin", "created_at": "2025-06-25T02:42:59", "owner": "diasriraaa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098489095574877, "text": "Horse ova thier drifting", "created_at": "2025-06-25T01:53:12", "owner": "jay.tr1ppin06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096915850582311, "text": "IT’S JOHN MARSTON MICAH 🗣️🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-06-25T01:36:16", "owner": "aslulv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071389202483245, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-25T01:35:54", "owner": "alyuranday", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18302433652174858, "text": "NOBODY BROUGHT AN EXTRA BAG", "created_at": "2025-06-25T00:00:34", "owner": "gabrielchamberlain_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027700424699698, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-24T23:25:14", "owner": "chev__chelios__769", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074813257745186, "text": "Top 3 things my sister would do to me", "created_at": "2025-06-24T23:09:56", "owner": "louise.goettems", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083575372776729, "text": "She make her favorite 😌", "created_at": "2025-06-24T22:49:05", "owner": "rafalborekig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862135741439296, "text": "Now you just need a jousting lance", "created_at": "2025-06-24T22:23:28", "owner": "andre.ambuter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053973953459677, "text": "horse got stick drift why’s it running sideways", "created_at": "2025-06-24T21:58:59", "owner": "renvgoku", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17990848952667037, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-24T21:52:42", "owner": "haydentaylor785", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18089162989712147, "text": "I’m remaking this", "created_at": "2025-06-24T21:31:53", "owner": "tristanhamm", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17990143733812892, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-24T21:31:38", "owner": "tristanhamm", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076929211906004, "text": "As an older sibling I envy you", "created_at": "2025-06-24T21:29:58", "owner": "bradford0414", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039659378331147, "text": "My friends chased me with a wheat wacker🤠", "created_at": "2025-06-24T21:14:53", "owner": "noah.m1d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842961202521644, "text": "I need to hire you , randomly got signed up for a spartan challenge. I need training and hate cardio🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-24T20:45:31", "owner": "antlersonskyline", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158289811370644, "text": "Paint her brown and wield a bullwhip", "created_at": "2025-06-24T20:45:16", "owner": "who_is_peazy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079916185683909, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-24T19:33:32", "owner": "lon_mowa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068659754059604, "text": "You need a lasso though", "created_at": "2025-06-24T19:22:49", "owner": "romann.he", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889162411164563, "text": "Not the \"we just wanna bite\" 🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-24T18:15:43", "owner": "samir6lana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904768825188335, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-24T18:01:18", "owner": "2dolarek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038368694652977, "text": "Chase me😭💔🥀", "created_at": "2025-06-24T14:12:52", "owner": "stack._.chaser", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18313557622214941, "text": "How she could be faster than horse", "created_at": "2025-06-24T13:15:59", "owner": "mr.deuv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991775109807300, "text": "@tomelderfield make that video 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-24T12:50:16", "owner": "philippe_torres", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17930269170065834, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-24T12:35:46", "owner": "josue_cjcr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049784513407017, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-06-24T12:11:56", "owner": "kiityzi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18335449321160704, "text": "I fucking love u 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-24T11:06:02", "owner": "hollyrongomai_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956580945958133, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-24T10:08:34", "owner": "michalis_gate7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071347327806507, "text": "Lolllll that’s all what siblings were about in young age", "created_at": "2025-06-24T09:14:15", "owner": "idon0tcare", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18083249080812978, "text": "This would be so funny edited with a old timey slave song 💀💀", "created_at": "2025-06-24T09:05:18", "owner": "hazy1296", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18006524438608828, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-24T03:39:44", "owner": "nawab_abbaskhan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088037593726189, "text": "This has Vhagar and Lucerys vibes all over it.", "created_at": "2025-06-24T02:50:03", "owner": "worm2171", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18506458600007459, "text": "Whip her", "created_at": "2025-06-24T02:45:49", "owner": "hershey.peter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870646444296145, "text": "My sister would never come to the barn so I could never chase her ☹️", "created_at": "2025-06-24T02:36:43", "owner": "zozo_ondagogo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18045865253550194, "text": "🤣😭", "created_at": "2025-06-24T00:50:31", "owner": "hm__00zy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18347507254080614, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-24T00:49:19", "owner": "lordmayhem_3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088816690726450, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-06-23T23:58:12", "owner": "elfamoso.chapo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078967543881631, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-23T23:02:58", "owner": "hijadelpatron", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050267405149533, "text": "COME HERE 🗣️", "created_at": "2025-06-23T22:16:38", "owner": "aedyn777", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18517959388026305, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-06-23T22:06:17", "owner": "psg2500", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013402877741679, "text": "I'm surprised you don't have a lasso my brothers did the same thing and he used to last so my ankles and make me trip", "created_at": "2025-06-23T21:53:56", "owner": "budbuds18", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18001393922794251, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-23T20:28:21", "owner": "comiendolaluna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030915233677377, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-23T20:02:00", "owner": "barbiebeejamminn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051013736123933, "text": "@pauvillalobos08 era entretenido hasta que te enganchaste en la reja JAJAJAJ", "created_at": "2025-06-23T18:20:39", "owner": "vale_villalobosm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18510371389033108, "text": "LMAO", "created_at": "2025-06-23T16:35:26", "owner": "zenae.hyman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157608769370432, "text": "Rdr2 Bounty Hunteing", "created_at": "2025-06-23T14:54:07", "owner": "arnad.hodzic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855863629453246, "text": "MY NAME IS JOHN MARSTON 🗣️‼️‼️", "created_at": "2025-06-23T14:01:39", "owner": "t.c.ca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049060796390469, "text": "COME ERE 🗣️", "created_at": "2025-06-23T13:25:10", "owner": "tenley.knolly", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18305662297241337, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-23T13:10:20", "owner": "zurgpl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320087119235945, "text": "Same my granddaughter loves that to", "created_at": "2025-06-23T11:19:07", "owner": "robertshawdebbie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078669574878576, "text": "This is what hobby-horsing should be", "created_at": "2025-06-23T10:05:20", "owner": "browngirlinthesnow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131664997428216, "text": "Can I borrow your sister? I’ll bring my own horse.", "created_at": "2025-06-23T08:44:49", "owner": "collin_1no", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914138923105822, "text": "😭😭😭🗣️🗣️🗣️🤠🤠🤠😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-23T08:14:24", "owner": "vinodmane488", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971435181863678, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-23T03:27:14", "owner": "chowaiian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086961319661898, "text": "They used to do this with people of color!", "created_at": "2025-06-23T02:46:19", "owner": "jbsrihere", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900671776217346, "text": "Why the horse drifting", "created_at": "2025-06-22T23:29:23", "owner": "dominicselimi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17972934212900103, "text": "This is my sister fr", "created_at": "2025-06-22T23:13:05", "owner": "aadi.goodnight14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924104098090291, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-22T23:00:09", "owner": "mcnicoldan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947621529861149, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂🤠🤠🤠", "created_at": "2025-06-22T22:53:23", "owner": "wolverine_4455", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058790273190675, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-22T22:30:39", "owner": "wkrpcinnoh1939", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18517095520005259, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-22T22:00:30", "owner": "loonlogan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035602130656915, "text": "There doing that in LA as well🤣🥲😢😭", "created_at": "2025-06-22T21:58:09", "owner": "munkin3605", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933182694934631, "text": "This is big brother energy", "created_at": "2025-06-22T20:31:35", "owner": "tristan._hughes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18276089191260727, "text": "After a few iterations, can the horse do it without a rider? 😅", "created_at": "2025-06-22T16:15:12", "owner": "smith_sb23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036669926361792, "text": "اختها تركض مثل ركضي من الحرامي بالحلم 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-22T15:34:59", "owner": "alhanoof__45", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18315399892225424, "text": "Hit her with the lasso chief", "created_at": "2025-06-22T14:16:11", "owner": "the_sailor_meme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867414496401276, "text": "This is how my brother made me exercise when I was little but he told me if he caught me he was going to beat the shit out of me 🤣😭", "created_at": "2025-06-22T14:06:21", "owner": "nutmegwild", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070632046969122, "text": "We just wanna bite", "created_at": "2025-06-22T13:03:56", "owner": "efash.x_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117109402473182, "text": "Oh Snap ❗️ run", "created_at": "2025-06-22T11:51:29", "owner": "phatleeapparel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020806886710863, "text": "This is horseplay", "created_at": "2025-06-22T09:59:18", "owner": "peterankerman18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947659582004707, "text": "Whay Are You Running", "created_at": "2025-06-22T09:49:20", "owner": "dandman68", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879831556343695, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-22T09:20:05", "owner": "kai_lani_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293469316246941, "text": "Kai and Paedyn be like:", "created_at": "2025-06-22T08:48:52", "owner": "rvj_rose099", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074966899899087, "text": "oh so ur one of those riders got it 😬", "created_at": "2025-06-22T06:02:31", "owner": "anna.r_05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118114948489092, "text": "Why the horse got stick drift", "created_at": "2025-06-22T04:43:19", "owner": "jstcj17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065105882119499, "text": "When you ancient mongol ancestry kicks in", "created_at": "2025-06-22T04:14:40", "owner": "lavy_davy15", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18032669222658925, "text": "You gotta lasso her....", "created_at": "2025-06-22T04:11:30", "owner": "autumn.r5055", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072108893300070, "text": "Yeah we just used sharp objects", "created_at": "2025-06-22T04:02:50", "owner": "adeliadelea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051193112133776, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-22T03:58:20", "owner": "the_954_goon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160070362365212, "text": "@el.rmss", "created_at": "2025-06-22T01:33:11", "owner": "rubyyuhh127", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066304619083312, "text": "@kerrigan_cannon", "created_at": "2025-06-22T01:32:23", "owner": "rubyyuhh127", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18316911307226931, "text": "Why is it running like it’s italicized", "created_at": "2025-06-22T01:25:08", "owner": "sazzlemander", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928353283072341, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-22T00:56:02", "owner": "jake_taitimu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079944703851089, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-22T00:19:12", "owner": "inner_circle.ult", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883259167202495, "text": "She letting her ancestors take over😭", "created_at": "2025-06-22T00:18:04", "owner": "jellybellybear_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034454981391617, "text": "“We’ve been trying to reach you about your cars extended warranty” 🤠", "created_at": "2025-06-21T23:52:28", "owner": "edn_fit_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17842708812520122, "text": "@oliviacb__ top comment", "created_at": "2025-06-21T23:36:07", "owner": "_alexia_b", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085442896670865, "text": "I love chasing my friends and my siblings and my family on my horse. It's so fun 😊", "created_at": "2025-06-21T22:54:09", "owner": "elly16.ott", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045697925219643, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-21T22:43:33", "owner": "marouane__elbo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048824327426047, "text": "That's not a hobby, that's a flex 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-21T22:38:41", "owner": "sandgale", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988485561676739, "text": "“BURN THOSE CALORIES” 😭", "created_at": "2025-06-21T21:55:02", "owner": "lilmijo2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019909469716288, "text": "That was hilarious. I want to see more videos of that!", "created_at": "2025-06-21T21:41:39", "owner": "dieselrubicon22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042745259292112, "text": "Peak sisterhood", "created_at": "2025-06-21T20:23:12", "owner": "abbs2bee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895590301246788, "text": "You’re a good man Arthur Morgan", "created_at": "2025-06-21T19:52:25", "owner": "nismonezamuddin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886365403293528, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-21T18:23:30", "owner": "galaxy_empty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062851778138882, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-21T18:22:52", "owner": "rich_khid7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143203180396438, "text": "HAHAHAHA wish I had a horse growing up just for that !!", "created_at": "2025-06-21T17:50:35", "owner": "eeduu27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052334648116626, "text": "Real", "created_at": "2025-06-21T17:46:22", "owner": "claustrophobicteletubby7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880603297223362, "text": "Pobre caballo, las niñas que tiene que aguantar", "created_at": "2025-06-21T17:45:58", "owner": "patricialbb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062597885321914, "text": "Poor animal", "created_at": "2025-06-21T17:31:49", "owner": "giss_gissrodriguez", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068314663850951, "text": "\"Burn those calories, girl!\" 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-21T17:20:10", "owner": "joshb3b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923880175093815, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-21T17:05:05", "owner": "aserinjoseph", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062923811142465, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-21T16:31:37", "owner": "jamalson780", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086851759674135, "text": "Rich people:", "created_at": "2025-06-21T15:40:10", "owner": "vr_xk4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18334287442165128, "text": "I shoot my brothers with an order gun", "created_at": "2025-06-21T15:19:02", "owner": "hockey2025_15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092454037717386, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-21T15:10:13", "owner": "stein987651", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857325778446630, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-21T14:59:53", "owner": "monosynaptic_guy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972013008864161, "text": "If my sister did this i would start chasing the horse🤠😁🫡", "created_at": "2025-06-21T14:32:22", "owner": "nxz4_a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064850390152861, "text": "Lowkey want her to do this to me", "created_at": "2025-06-21T12:59:03", "owner": "ypierredagoat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851902822437058, "text": "Why you are running 🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-21T12:47:18", "owner": "mkbender9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070264409301304, "text": "Them hereditary genes really kicking in 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-21T12:27:17", "owner": "loganjojo19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933330954934602, "text": "That looks fun. Can I have a turn? Also \"come here we just wanna what?\"", "created_at": "2025-06-21T12:02:35", "owner": "cdgarrison427", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915102112111091, "text": "She js want a bite ☹️", "created_at": "2025-06-21T11:53:13", "owner": "_m4rko_8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899563372214337, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-21T11:16:09", "owner": "aagam9529", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070028189059561, "text": "Burn those calories 🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-21T11:00:41", "owner": "shayanorm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057908159517507, "text": "“I just want to talk to you about your cars extended warranty”", "created_at": "2025-06-21T10:53:48", "owner": "monicarii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18509424616022059, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-21T08:56:22", "owner": "kekkobashita", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146493271395181, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-21T08:05:41", "owner": "angellofsorrow", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18086984074675762, "text": "How they used to catch runaway slaves", "created_at": "2025-06-21T07:31:07", "owner": "ericmizusawa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18122510014460261, "text": "🤠🤠🤠🤠🤠🤣🤠🤣🤣🤠🤣🤣🔥🔥🔥🗣️🗣️🗣️", "created_at": "2025-06-21T05:38:05", "owner": "ricardo_ferras666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103557310533508, "text": "Do you still have that kangaroo? If so, we need more videos of it.", "created_at": "2025-06-21T05:12:21", "owner": "bellaniralynn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962768295928382, "text": "Bro’s running sideways😭", "created_at": "2025-06-21T04:31:15", "owner": "_et.h.an__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304366987170446, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-06-21T04:17:27", "owner": "alimalhi41", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063730207904022, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-21T03:30:09", "owner": "jp_lizanaperez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083597287756426, "text": "Throwback!!! lol literally loved this", "created_at": "2025-06-21T03:22:48", "owner": "mirandaroseharrison", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064622174118400, "text": "I have a sister, but not a horse. She's so lucky I don't......", "created_at": "2025-06-21T02:55:32", "owner": "dreadroth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010461011685460, "text": "lol Danny would love this but he isn’t allowed too🤠 (that’s my horse)", "created_at": "2025-06-21T02:49:04", "owner": "tmspam723", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079269598883160, "text": "You can tell by the angle the horse has the most elegant jack sparrow stride. 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-21T02:21:46", "owner": "nellhellkite", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936658942034153, "text": "Homie discovered cavalry.", "created_at": "2025-06-21T02:11:36", "owner": "bilbohangand", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915160285111977, "text": "This is the definition of horsing around 🐴", "created_at": "2025-06-21T01:03:47", "owner": "miranda_barlow14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842323819521839, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-21T00:54:20", "owner": "kigorisan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055207376064339, "text": "I want a horse so bad 😭", "created_at": "2025-06-21T00:22:27", "owner": "samuel.edgemon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094180834611398, "text": "White girls don't walk on this farm run white girl run 🤠", "created_at": "2025-06-20T23:57:35", "owner": "420aj420aj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856576072399195, "text": "You chase her with the voice of a plantation owner in 1887", "created_at": "2025-06-20T23:50:24", "owner": "josiah_hepworth_k20a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100829254492074, "text": "Why the fucks the sister running like how we all run in our dreams @maddiwinks", "created_at": "2025-06-20T23:15:53", "owner": "claire_winks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900576916209678, "text": "Gurl why your horse do like that ->", "created_at": "2025-06-20T21:51:13", "owner": "shiraraz2012227", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064902299113348, "text": "why’s the horse running sideways", "created_at": "2025-06-20T21:31:20", "owner": "artem_prim01", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18129650617439901, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-20T21:01:46", "owner": "villalobos_buti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084675667776963, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-20T20:00:59", "owner": "kevin_andraca27", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18309156568242021, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-20T19:59:05", "owner": "_trinabirtos_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934399804026620, "text": "She got Arthur Morgan Essence", "created_at": "2025-06-20T19:45:38", "owner": "_francis_paula_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18271233133302732, "text": "@nivedita_nagvanshi", "created_at": "2025-06-20T19:26:08", "owner": "erwinsmith1818", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027433133491098, "text": "You are so bored", "created_at": "2025-06-20T19:21:43", "owner": "abu_muhammad_al_halabi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059094524225624, "text": "THE BRITISH ARE COMING THE BRITISH ARE COMING🗣️🗣️", "created_at": "2025-06-20T19:07:34", "owner": "ed1th_the_sp4rkly_cr0w", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18026567687689479, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-20T19:03:34", "owner": "ben.2010_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008551376762218, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-20T18:23:12", "owner": "jay_dee_1200", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070976503955112, "text": "This has Vine energy", "created_at": "2025-06-20T18:18:15", "owner": "amc9012", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18302899000168538, "text": "Like that 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-20T17:52:29", "owner": "joshua_0502_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095360404587134, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-20T17:50:42", "owner": "joshua_0502_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060979199237473, "text": "COME HERE BOI!", "created_at": "2025-06-20T13:36:09", "owner": "jaque_n_coke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118369126463606, "text": "I used a broom as a horse. Ah dear me.", "created_at": "2025-06-20T13:09:22", "owner": "jesslynndexter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070453180984664, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-20T12:01:33", "owner": "ronja_anderesn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092952904526868, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤠Looks fun", "created_at": "2025-06-20T12:00:19", "owner": "doom_cat123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066332063284033, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-20T11:30:14", "owner": "ma___ria.a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142278349398590, "text": "I chase mine with a lasso", "created_at": "2025-06-20T11:26:03", "owner": "silent_valor999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079960117858058, "text": "Can u chase me 🤨", "created_at": "2025-06-20T10:11:17", "owner": "fatkidinacandystore", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18358245355146044, "text": "🤠", "created_at": "2025-06-20T08:40:32", "owner": "debanjan_sarkar03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146830606383486, "text": "Is the horse crip walking why is she sideways.", "created_at": "2025-06-20T06:49:08", "owner": "joey.hemphill3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070288745297136, "text": "Can u chase me I need to burn some calories", "created_at": "2025-06-20T06:26:52", "owner": "great.gemson", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18030397913479464, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-20T04:59:01", "owner": "abhhira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119329822420712, "text": "🏃🏻‍♀️ stop 🏃🏻‍♀️🏃🏻‍♀️stop 🏃🏻‍♀️🏃🏻‍♀️🏃🏻‍♀️stop 🏃🏻‍♀️🏃🏻‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-06-20T03:57:46", "owner": "ozen__02", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17886848190289332, "text": "Its all giggle and shit till nighttime when your sister holds a knife ❤️", "created_at": "2025-06-20T03:08:20", "owner": "moresahil07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176870779336410, "text": "You ever lasso her?", "created_at": "2025-06-20T02:31:39", "owner": "xdammit.chrisx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909535321157355, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-20T02:27:42", "owner": "elsie.yys", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883087849320041, "text": "Is the horse drifting?", "created_at": "2025-06-20T02:16:06", "owner": "nsauzbri201", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17938702404032605, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-20T02:02:16", "owner": "lailah_zaro._.xo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070921178504495, "text": "COME HERE", "created_at": "2025-06-20T02:00:10", "owner": "lexiwolf2023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850087045483667, "text": "@sstoneddbarrbiee", "created_at": "2025-06-20T01:53:23", "owner": "shadynate72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012417596572711, "text": "Get a lasso", "created_at": "2025-06-20T01:42:35", "owner": "hylianmaestro", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18325853710204791, "text": "Come here come here😡😡", "created_at": "2025-06-20T01:29:50", "owner": "kevin_1of1.2010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142972870398654, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-06-20T00:37:42", "owner": "thalifeofaj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891549145142893, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-20T00:31:52", "owner": "erazokiismail_uou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844515145513144, "text": "My brother chased me with pliers because he would twist my ears", "created_at": "2025-06-20T00:19:12", "owner": "owen_carroll38", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957125106812768, "text": "🤣🤣we just want a bite", "created_at": "2025-06-19T23:59:50", "owner": "xa_theeinvader", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045612083233546, "text": "first ur ex now ur sister babes🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-19T23:16:45", "owner": "3lilli4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18283958170269476, "text": "I need this .", "created_at": "2025-06-19T21:44:58", "owner": "saroo0h9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886031470290269, "text": "Man I chase my cousins on my horse and dirtbike", "created_at": "2025-06-19T20:52:16", "owner": "waylonkidd000000000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18311406394214055, "text": "DONT RUN FROM THE LORD", "created_at": "2025-06-19T20:42:51", "owner": "madaalynnn2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304020175171398, "text": "NO🗣️ NO🗣️ NO🗣️", "created_at": "2025-06-19T20:23:15", "owner": "blondegothicc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072317926785718, "text": "@kendalljenner", "created_at": "2025-06-19T19:51:45", "owner": "rishabhpuranik_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891618796147975, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-19T18:58:25", "owner": "caroline.gubi", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17994188441798626, "text": "Ahem, reminds me of the good old 1800s", "created_at": "2025-06-19T18:50:07", "owner": "aayush_singh187", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111110515444195, "text": "Hiiiiiihaaaaaa", "created_at": "2025-06-19T18:48:08", "owner": "aichaousghir53", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980779596847214, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-19T18:30:50", "owner": "cooper_franklin05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893298430253635, "text": "Red Dead bounty missions", "created_at": "2025-06-19T18:00:46", "owner": "taq_blackout", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883524307320673, "text": "No flaming arrows??", "created_at": "2025-06-19T17:47:18", "owner": "rajimx1x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050598269524643, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-19T17:00:20", "owner": "yumm_diary", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036328277347991, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-19T16:11:58", "owner": "un_garsv2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021341153713344, "text": "Burn those calories took me out😂😂😂😂😂😭", "created_at": "2025-06-19T15:45:07", "owner": "cherz_64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072681484772597, "text": "My  little sister would just chase us with chickens and dead mice.", "created_at": "2025-06-19T14:42:28", "owner": "kaileearzadon", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058922579004658, "text": "I love doing this to my brother and bonus points because he’s scared of horses😂", "created_at": "2025-06-19T14:00:28", "owner": "dahumanmax", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845969122508512, "text": "Slowly kick the horse with the side of ur feet.", "created_at": "2025-06-19T13:50:41", "owner": "itx_irtaza67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083218777761161, "text": "COMERE👹👹", "created_at": "2025-06-19T11:32:21", "owner": "lyanxdra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964761528783233, "text": "PLEASE do it with a lasso and a cowboy hat", "created_at": "2025-06-19T10:27:45", "owner": "ace_vanguard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066779231018330, "text": "why is your horse in shift lock", "created_at": "2025-06-19T09:49:01", "owner": "allsnotz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057588527596707, "text": "Horse like „we chasing the child again? Gotcha.“", "created_at": "2025-06-19T09:28:40", "owner": "denise.ja.lol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909046795166251, "text": "@zyraazend I could see you doing this to your poor lil sista 😭🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-19T07:57:03", "owner": "zenaida.zend", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047891843401436, "text": "As a younger sister, I KNOW she’d be bringing that up in therapy for the rest of her life", "created_at": "2025-06-19T03:23:59", "owner": "its.a.rendefor.life", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085210210705940, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-19T02:38:47", "owner": "jacobbfieldss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943784871882103, "text": "This is hilarious 🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-19T00:47:14", "owner": "delajimjim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044993177541825, "text": "Red dead redemption two online", "created_at": "2025-06-18T23:39:34", "owner": "honeyspollen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036021692364454, "text": "You training for the LAPD?", "created_at": "2025-06-18T22:53:09", "owner": "jake.morningstar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857639164444664, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-18T20:09:46", "owner": "soledelasha_l_l_c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933316024049522, "text": "Girl channeling her inner Genghis Khan", "created_at": "2025-06-18T19:27:20", "owner": "andresesamaya34", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18347227261080210, "text": "Mine just beat the shit out of me", "created_at": "2025-06-18T18:44:18", "owner": "buba_texas1974", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877539226241671, "text": "The type of girlfriend I want😂😂🤠", "created_at": "2025-06-18T18:32:37", "owner": "idk_r0bert_idk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020017856709706, "text": "Hahaha come here! Hahaha🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-18T18:18:48", "owner": "sjim30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396922174112672, "text": "Lmfao", "created_at": "2025-06-18T18:17:33", "owner": "xtherealslimcaityx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057043922259835, "text": "\"COMEAH 🤠🗣️🗣️\"", "created_at": "2025-06-18T18:08:44", "owner": "xenn044", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18515489776008794, "text": "They yearn for heavy armoured medieval combat. Humanities need for horse lead cavalry.", "created_at": "2025-06-18T17:36:17", "owner": "thebigdepression_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18375103633193424, "text": "Close enough, welcome back John Marston", "created_at": "2025-06-18T17:14:05", "owner": "my_knees_are_bees", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880594738339810, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-18T16:49:41", "owner": "as.ya1466", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031377575675665, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-18T16:19:04", "owner": "r.yan_576", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984624642693322, "text": "Aight now i start to like horses", "created_at": "2025-06-18T15:58:45", "owner": "manuelgonzalez2462", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074362216904974, "text": "Hey girl you can come out to my pasture and chase her 🙂", "created_at": "2025-06-18T15:46:41", "owner": "that_boy_braycen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059047469001335, "text": "I thought I was the only one 🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-18T15:39:20", "owner": "thathorsegirl_elydia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065678470887079, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-18T15:27:33", "owner": "j.ledford501", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18330912007165776, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-18T14:57:28", "owner": "chefgulagg_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18308496961243194, "text": "Yall, like why is this 2 hours long", "created_at": "2025-06-18T14:35:17", "owner": "marijehiemstra2012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053419412585922, "text": "Why is this funny😭", "created_at": "2025-06-18T13:38:46", "owner": "senpeighost_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053126672607196, "text": "Chased my brother with a skid steer", "created_at": "2025-06-18T13:11:47", "owner": "ijbrit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978732306712304, "text": "Plz do it again", "created_at": "2025-06-18T13:01:29", "owner": "rony._rezaul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875981227358990, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-18T12:46:14", "owner": "ahbgtfup", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882887896203667, "text": "Why yo jorse tilted😭", "created_at": "2025-06-18T11:32:05", "owner": "laith.lys", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058862747223582, "text": "Hey there mister", "created_at": "2025-06-18T10:44:43", "owner": "filip_minarik12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18357048568150431, "text": "STOP🛑🛑🗣🗣🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-06-18T10:27:13", "owner": "vivaan_singh1101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069082328068151, "text": "Where is her ATV", "created_at": "2025-06-18T07:47:03", "owner": "tommy_piercejp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063031789924512, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-18T07:33:25", "owner": "rakoczarafae", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18227904706289223, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-18T06:21:54", "owner": "oracle_high_priestess", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073820521934963, "text": "RDR activities", "created_at": "2025-06-18T05:12:25", "owner": "lucky_koylah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18361140532197863, "text": "By training her to be faster and faster you’re unknowingly bringing about your own downfall 😎", "created_at": "2025-06-18T04:45:44", "owner": "kenzingtonthe1st", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933066024936106, "text": "her ancestors kicked in", "created_at": "2025-06-18T04:31:05", "owner": "gltrgrlll", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067657490085697, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-06-18T02:53:46", "owner": "ayeecupid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18515330965021283, "text": "My sister chases me with chickens and she’s 5 years younger than me someone buy me a horse to get revenge", "created_at": "2025-06-18T02:50:52", "owner": "sad1e_1028", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083350474766599, "text": "Starting her track career", "created_at": "2025-06-18T00:46:51", "owner": "lilkaay.y", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18031627991441808, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-18T00:46:11", "owner": "__danyaris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862768726353677, "text": "@springtopfarms Bodie 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-18T00:32:07", "owner": "teeee_perk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353658583154171, "text": "You should get a saber", "created_at": "2025-06-18T00:13:16", "owner": "senor_fluff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058883117018589, "text": "Now this is a vine 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-17T23:53:23", "owner": "jeremy_llamas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946763143004864, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-17T21:23:16", "owner": "ayden.greschak", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18397449838118504, "text": "No but it looks like fun 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-17T21:16:06", "owner": "eli.852730", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18467663590076283, "text": "🤣🗣️", "created_at": "2025-06-17T20:33:39", "owner": "mariacoronado2011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862753765356804, "text": "You fr gotta get a lasso 😭", "created_at": "2025-06-17T19:09:15", "owner": "gman3190", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147327811383949, "text": "i love to chase my friends with my pony 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-17T19:01:18", "owner": "poppyandbelle1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055829882585750, "text": "@lillyjennifermarshall", "created_at": "2025-06-17T18:46:45", "owner": "cdawg4eva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061126916178742, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-17T18:38:06", "owner": "morgan.colleen08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001218704795437, "text": "\"Miss, do you have time to talk about our Lord and Savior Jesus Christ?\" 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-17T17:34:36", "owner": "bauwsyo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18388546552142629, "text": "Oh I love playing plantation escape", "created_at": "2025-06-17T17:29:01", "owner": "tuckerfmurphy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935563198035182, "text": "Why the horse running sideways??", "created_at": "2025-06-17T17:04:53", "owner": "zeed_moo1966", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988164315819409, "text": "@andrea.baschung ☹️", "created_at": "2025-06-17T15:55:18", "owner": "regula_baschung", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18210934012305873, "text": "How much do you charge for this gym membership?", "created_at": "2025-06-17T15:52:50", "owner": "live.like.mat", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18068580296079374, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-17T15:47:35", "owner": "everettbenoit05", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057316700338159, "text": "😂😂😂😂🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-17T15:31:16", "owner": "anghel7282", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119471641473709, "text": "Got another horse?", "created_at": "2025-06-17T15:20:34", "owner": "samuel.pitzn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18416492725096773, "text": "I LOVE HORSE RIDINGG OMGG", "created_at": "2025-06-17T15:13:36", "owner": "ahmed.alkuwari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077261305854834, "text": "My younger brother used to do this to our little sister then he'd hogtie her when he caught her 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-17T14:56:39", "owner": "totally_not_a_werewolf_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18469212331072433, "text": "Sounds like we all love irritating our siblings 🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-17T14:51:20", "owner": "loganzthe1st", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18348612091082665, "text": "You're missing the lasso", "created_at": "2025-06-17T14:39:38", "owner": "el_dawndishsoap", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044787458240735, "text": "We just want a bite 😭", "created_at": "2025-06-17T14:34:10", "owner": "safwaan_7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193795042311537, "text": "I was riding with my sister once and the horse she was on would do whatever mine did. So I kicked him up real hatd and hers ran off too and she couldn't stop it and I couldn't stop laughing 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-17T13:06:56", "owner": "gi_jo118", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015071747724791, "text": "@jes.topia", "created_at": "2025-06-17T12:41:09", "owner": "doombone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875881588358831, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-17T12:29:33", "owner": "haitian.dae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013386482746219, "text": "This is so funny I’m BAWLING 😭", "created_at": "2025-06-17T11:33:12", "owner": "rosaaa___89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083975641702941, "text": "@siraimorgan_ come ere", "created_at": "2025-06-17T11:27:08", "owner": "piper_morgan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054398510358474, "text": "What happens is the horse gets use to it and starts chasing her by its self", "created_at": "2025-06-17T11:21:10", "owner": "s1eepless_ty", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17994963392802889, "text": "lex even the horse is having fun 🐎", "created_at": "2025-06-17T09:27:53", "owner": "danielisfearless", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070532932960338, "text": "Why the horse driftin like that tho😭", "created_at": "2025-06-17T08:49:48", "owner": "rajaskasar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931331287058438, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-17T08:13:20", "owner": "hi_i_am_d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18168740020346170, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-17T07:11:22", "owner": "azraelisberen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17868230184306169, "text": "Now get a lasso and get her 🤠", "created_at": "2025-06-17T05:57:34", "owner": "v.peezy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014704442726152, "text": "\"we just wanna buck\" ohhhh hell nah thats ur sister why u wanna butt fuh her", "created_at": "2025-06-17T04:26:56", "owner": "j.harps29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18356004325156109, "text": "How does not have more likes😭", "created_at": "2025-06-17T00:24:07", "owner": "ilikemusic1245", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18343238485088668, "text": "\"She said she couldnt fit in her prom dress by saturday, I say otherwise. RUN CHUBBY TUBBY RUN\"😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-17T00:09:02", "owner": "brettonmoore", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002392259788983, "text": "I chase my sister with kitchen knife", "created_at": "2025-06-16T23:35:25", "owner": "evara_unseen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931947552940068, "text": "I might have a type 🤠", "created_at": "2025-06-16T23:33:12", "owner": "absolute.jem01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950302959847801, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-16T23:28:15", "owner": "lukailic705", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988476681673971, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-16T23:27:49", "owner": "izzybella0411", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071516812986196, "text": "Lasso her", "created_at": "2025-06-16T23:08:16", "owner": "kilmisterlemmyspades", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089827966640672, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-16T22:38:40", "owner": "rileykane01", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082891834765904, "text": "Lmfao 🤣 looks like your having fun.... You're sister 🥲", "created_at": "2025-06-16T22:20:09", "owner": "taylorgomez296", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18168067708346425, "text": "Yes in the blood", "created_at": "2025-06-16T22:11:42", "owner": "theresa_says", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027888488487577, "text": "nataly lucky i dont have a horse", "created_at": "2025-06-16T22:02:30", "owner": "chhinini", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847216420500671, "text": "She drifting the hoe", "created_at": "2025-06-16T21:50:26", "owner": "geno_irwin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042832910633116, "text": "Bro would have loved mantracker", "created_at": "2025-06-16T21:19:07", "owner": "spookybizniz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911115805117649, "text": "Just hear me out imagine if that was a b person", "created_at": "2025-06-16T21:01:01", "owner": "narcos_aao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062148254332950, "text": "Me with a knife", "created_at": "2025-06-16T20:30:54", "owner": "teenxo.xo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058724159223518, "text": "that’s a toxic thing to say to a young person", "created_at": "2025-06-16T20:21:04", "owner": "horses_suck_balls", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053862695357609, "text": "@lexfreemyer this is the best post ever!", "created_at": "2025-06-16T19:34:15", "owner": "bulla_t_live", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851664313470975, "text": "Av red Dead expérience", "created_at": "2025-06-16T19:04:45", "owner": "geot_ank", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18365115994177649, "text": "Same with me but with a dead cockroach 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-16T18:59:53", "owner": "somaya06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847563235498659, "text": "Why does it look like the horse is running sideways", "created_at": "2025-06-16T18:29:45", "owner": "arhaan_9884", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075516769737351, "text": "Stop horsing around! 👿", "created_at": "2025-06-16T18:15:38", "owner": "trucktechkev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043233281637525, "text": "Now u need a laso", "created_at": "2025-06-16T18:10:03", "owner": "mariion.romo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901104592088411, "text": "Let me gaff.She does the same to you", "created_at": "2025-06-16T17:16:56", "owner": "sakura_bakery_cafe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891325090142311, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-16T16:53:47", "owner": "jjust.l3o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071317441790017, "text": "Why is your horse going diagonal 😭", "created_at": "2025-06-16T16:18:28", "owner": "pubert.mctardpants", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047975684166855, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-16T16:15:48", "owner": "ruben_fg99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063388510907445, "text": "Hahahahhahah", "created_at": "2025-06-16T16:03:32", "owner": "annlei_smith_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855312856451698, "text": "ₛₜₒₚ!  ₛₜₒₚ!  ₛₜₒₚ!", "created_at": "2025-06-16T15:55:51", "owner": "___bunnyfoofoo", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17900921169208879, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-16T15:18:39", "owner": "joibear19", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18036082025349355, "text": "why was the horse drifting???!!???", "created_at": "2025-06-16T14:58:35", "owner": "_marianara_sauce", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18024538313701571, "text": "“We just want a bite” 💀💀💀", "created_at": "2025-06-16T14:56:05", "owner": "_meme.gif", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053611451359937, "text": "Why are you drifting da horse 🗣️", "created_at": "2025-06-16T14:53:30", "owner": "nataclumsyy", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18055884716340849, "text": "bobby on falcon chasing mitchell ahh🙏", "created_at": "2025-06-16T14:38:26", "owner": "hadiya.123n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18489495790071978, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-16T14:15:33", "owner": "alanchai97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18227919445289291, "text": "youre a good man arthur", "created_at": "2025-06-16T14:15:06", "owner": "ivan.owliveira", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18365383327132665, "text": "She looks like the girl from divergent", "created_at": "2025-06-16T14:06:33", "owner": "_a_book_addict_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070117051815845, "text":