Awesome 💯", "created_at": "2025-06-16T04:42:42", "owner": "noballerina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862530880422221, "text": "Ahh my favorite work out class😌", "created_at": "2025-06-16T03:09:25", "owner": "claudiaregalado_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032807285404583, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-16T03:03:07", "owner": "whittenmaurice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125854954451459, "text": "THIS IS SO FUNNY", "created_at": "2025-06-16T02:57:55", "owner": "yourmomslover_asf", "likes": 13}, {"id": 17913219720131545, "text": "Most Sibling core thing I’ve seen in a while", "created_at": "2025-06-16T02:55:09", "owner": "without__motive", "likes": 15}, {"id": 17956954007812406, "text": "Can confirm, this is a fantastic past-time", "created_at": "2025-06-16T02:39:33", "owner": "nickbozilovofficial", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18095893699591392, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-16T02:19:30", "owner": "carolyn.brosnan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097830727504977, "text": "Now chase her boyfriend again", "created_at": "2025-06-16T02:14:23", "owner": "ken_ley_b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18270404704287069, "text": "my sister ran me over with a bike 🧍‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-06-16T02:03:54", "owner": "lyds2sexyy2behurt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18351844225158185, "text": "I all of a sudden want a horse", "created_at": "2025-06-16T01:42:44", "owner": "e_faiers2010", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077566141718657, "text": "🤣😭", "created_at": "2025-06-15T23:09:07", "owner": "jwyoder15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18507363466053984, "text": "@hello.itsjae this could be us but we poor af", "created_at": "2025-06-15T23:00:12", "owner": "shiningwizkid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874230793265324, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-15T22:55:04", "owner": "memento_mori_cyka_blat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912084103116171, "text": "Why your horse be running in italics 😭😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-06-15T22:04:08", "owner": "sarah_warwick___", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18347405053086922, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-15T21:34:19", "owner": "jacobbrundl420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933102510932123, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-15T21:09:23", "owner": "ryan_pittman518", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918356880999714, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-15T20:49:54", "owner": "dhoward3558", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944001399878128, "text": "i wish I had horses kangroos n goats wtf", "created_at": "2025-06-15T18:47:52", "owner": "liiamm.b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053952332356626, "text": "Red dead redemption 🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-15T18:42:48", "owner": "jasmine203073", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977860032846391, "text": "iPad kids, take notes", "created_at": "2025-06-15T18:19:15", "owner": "steil_17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096492364598415, "text": "Give yourself to the Lord and Savior Jesus Christ", "created_at": "2025-06-15T17:57:03", "owner": "crayneumann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18356456575148361, "text": "i thought this was @averycyrus 😭", "created_at": "2025-06-15T17:53:51", "owner": "cofffe3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066468968474457, "text": "🤣😭", "created_at": "2025-06-15T17:52:55", "owner": "mztoni87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846373612478408, "text": "I like how the horse is chasing her but like reluctantly 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-15T17:12:46", "owner": "nate_rb_14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969171039868554, "text": "You should apply for the LAPD, this seems to be a required skill", "created_at": "2025-06-15T16:41:59", "owner": "chicken_fries_guy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069088822834708, "text": "Born to chase mine on my horse , forced to chase them with a knife", "created_at": "2025-06-15T15:02:16", "owner": "_mikhail208", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077595649698621, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-06-15T13:41:22", "owner": "pearce__vern", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076955164896492, "text": "How much money is in that girl's therapist fund lol", "created_at": "2025-06-15T13:37:33", "owner": "bluecat6849", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951199236842626, "text": "Siblings 😂 just have to do it 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-15T12:32:43", "owner": "adrian.boogie.9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965311056775863, "text": "@avina_vijay_ 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-15T12:31:25", "owner": "the_ayana_vijay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042547403298427, "text": "@kyliebagay need this para pumayat HAAHAHA", "created_at": "2025-06-15T12:18:14", "owner": "natalyroseee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18048570812432546, "text": "Descendant of Arthur Morgan", "created_at": "2025-06-15T12:09:46", "owner": "loicfrisina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054875699346792, "text": "All I WILL SAY is ... PAYBACK‘S A ... and she doesn't forget.  Have fun sleeping with one eye open in the future.", "created_at": "2025-06-15T11:49:35", "owner": "vl800.suzuki.adventure", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097331548571292, "text": "🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-06-15T10:34:53", "owner": "global.land.invest", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135136210417647, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-15T10:05:29", "owner": "gesp_0908", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047127860440217, "text": "Don't chase me I'll pull a mongo", "created_at": "2025-06-15T10:01:19", "owner": "funbad.whimsical.anarchist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843460627505171, "text": "Pro doll", "created_at": "2025-06-15T09:58:15", "owner": "funbad.whimsical.anarchist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18388552078190045, "text": "Lasso her", "created_at": "2025-06-15T08:28:48", "owner": "vibekingr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862703107351485, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-15T08:25:36", "owner": "ivi0t0_ni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128005111436407, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-15T08:03:20", "owner": "pesche.specht", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082639198756018, "text": "Chasing defensless people with a horse? Oh you gonna be a fine cop.", "created_at": "2025-06-15T07:18:52", "owner": "circilusvitae", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18011940674745348, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-15T06:18:28", "owner": "callme_netocee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933991213070312, "text": "Stop it! I laughed so hard I almost choked eating dinner. Lol", "created_at": "2025-06-15T05:49:17", "owner": "jeffreysarsfield", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970045548864198, "text": "Bro why is ur horse doing the jack sparrow run", "created_at": "2025-06-15T04:16:59", "owner": "hannna_yb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048440342167422, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-15T02:32:25", "owner": "___.bodoque.valdez.___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18508347790000265, "text": "That horse was doing the slick-back down that driveway", "created_at": "2025-06-15T02:11:42", "owner": "fishethant", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926506639080904, "text": "your sister is fast as fuck holy moly", "created_at": "2025-06-15T01:47:09", "owner": "bimpadimp", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17881570659324650, "text": "😭frr", "created_at": "2025-06-15T01:45:32", "owner": "jaz_4791", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884784415291810, "text": "@teach_english_zap your favorite hobby", "created_at": "2025-06-15T01:38:36", "owner": "fateme___ahmadpour", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18377301124125036, "text": "I got a plan Arthur", "created_at": "2025-06-15T00:07:41", "owner": "mathhalima", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946553877966585, "text": "We just wanna bite 😂😭😂", "created_at": "2025-06-14T23:26:29", "owner": "hernameisbrandy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068822597294799, "text": "Come here 🗣️", "created_at": "2025-06-14T22:22:34", "owner": "xotigerlillyox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18505608352030124, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-14T22:02:31", "owner": "hiram_j_alvarez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057599732246721, "text": "Your alignment is kinda off ngl", "created_at": "2025-06-14T21:52:49", "owner": "sossa.4r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18360162190198659, "text": "I feel like I’m having Ancestral flashbacks", "created_at": "2025-06-14T21:34:32", "owner": "_elijahshabazz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070431856944373, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-14T21:30:23", "owner": "big_boss_1776", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888386185162723, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-14T21:05:33", "owner": "mead1552", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904349812071006, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-14T21:00:27", "owner": "briii.reigns", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049076231436833, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-14T20:52:40", "owner": "yourfav__brazilan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905674288184989, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-14T20:27:18", "owner": "litsaviation", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004992155717312, "text": "Aww I remember my older brother used to chase me with the four-wheeler", "created_at": "2025-06-14T19:48:30", "owner": "greta_thunberge1776", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072057646787649, "text": "😂😂😂 \"COME HERE!!\" 🗣️🗣️🗣️", "created_at": "2025-06-14T19:08:54", "owner": "zech34.mrt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991769934660323, "text": "I’m poor and we don’t have a dog so me and my siblings have to take turns barking at the mail man…", "created_at": "2025-06-14T18:17:35", "owner": "vector_ohyeah2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076909921861814, "text": "This would’ve been better than a knife", "created_at": "2025-06-14T18:09:26", "owner": "soramae.acevedo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041202431305894, "text": "*throat singing*", "created_at": "2025-06-14T17:21:21", "owner": "le_pont_et_la_porte", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062606180131214, "text": "🤣🤣🤣 you're hilarious, we just want a bite 🤠", "created_at": "2025-06-14T17:16:55", "owner": "feddragzo6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089157109572361, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-06-14T17:13:19", "owner": "xray___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847184947498599, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-14T16:20:26", "owner": "homestead.jayy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853674502462292, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-14T16:12:36", "owner": "shayann.ahmed08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18404112850128199, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-14T14:53:15", "owner": "niek_beatz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112521340494685, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-14T14:16:19", "owner": "pavle.tc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051359291371769, "text": "Question, does chasing my friends on my quad count? Although we need to get the axle out since I kinda bent it...", "created_at": "2025-06-14T13:32:22", "owner": "josiah_gasper25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058852703227872, "text": "@emersonsouthh", "created_at": "2025-06-14T12:39:13", "owner": "brooklynsouthh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086256697672745, "text": "You look like Shailene Woodley", "created_at": "2025-06-14T12:27:11", "owner": "renratatouille", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102299605545033, "text": "I can feel the six pack coming", "created_at": "2025-06-14T12:20:21", "owner": "clair_eaaliyah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862411561354007, "text": "I chased mine with bugs", "created_at": "2025-06-14T12:10:34", "owner": "zmbie333", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17963108288927982, "text": "Why is the horse drifting😭", "created_at": "2025-06-14T11:26:54", "owner": "felix.mannynoksa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055729682345132, "text": "@sophia_lpi", "created_at": "2025-06-14T10:30:13", "owner": "jona.mpi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18034699562378065, "text": "I have the same hobby, but no horse", "created_at": "2025-06-14T10:05:13", "owner": "_iyebiye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158890657365960, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-14T10:02:10", "owner": "rickygti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014800157741174, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-14T09:28:57", "owner": "x6_liza_9x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068884450998098, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-14T09:08:23", "owner": "dennis_boelius", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18512137723025492, "text": "Lasso her next time, and hog tie her 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-14T08:36:46", "owner": "ayeimzach", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072553112498345, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-14T07:32:50", "owner": "bart260778", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047358209570292, "text": "Bru the fact tha Ik if I had a horse I would b the one running  bcs that’s how it was with the knife 😭", "created_at": "2025-06-14T07:20:53", "owner": "509.delilah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085165819673764, "text": "Omg i wanna do that to my friends 💖", "created_at": "2025-06-14T07:10:31", "owner": "jo_naeun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849397855483622, "text": "Why is your alignment off on your horse", "created_at": "2025-06-14T06:48:41", "owner": "lemoonpeenut", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047718788167889, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-11T18:00:59", "owner": "lil1rico", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104069797543614, "text": "Well well I only need a little sister 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-11T17:49:40", "owner": "msz.q1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052687478593044, "text": "Why does your horse have stick drift", "created_at": "2025-06-11T17:29:09", "owner": "michael_beitler11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853016533463028, "text": "\"C'MERE\" part sounded like Dean Winchester for some reason 😭", "created_at": "2025-06-11T17:26:49", "owner": "just_ainsley2.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080398792765786, "text": "Shit you can chase me on a horse any day of the week", "created_at": "2025-06-11T17:23:16", "owner": "graskala_vaerdi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885421135182201, "text": "🤠👍🏼", "created_at": "2025-06-11T17:04:56", "owner": "mcpohernandezmusn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903875392188003, "text": "blessed because all my big sister did was lock me in my own closet @sarinaa_fr", "created_at": "2025-06-11T16:55:14", "owner": "river.gh0ul", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17846419704499498, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-11T16:47:26", "owner": "stackstito", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930446715944210, "text": "Hahahahahahahahaha", "created_at": "2025-06-11T16:37:58", "owner": "focusonscience96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099158500498312, "text": "My ex used to chase me down with the horse", "created_at": "2025-06-11T16:26:52", "owner": "r.davis35", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062698831904059, "text": "COME HERE 👺👺👺", "created_at": "2025-06-11T16:17:08", "owner": "bestofnkh_06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067938695285168, "text": "Me to Nora", "created_at": "2025-06-11T15:40:48", "owner": "tianisador", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062183663174698, "text": "HAHAHA me to 😭🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-11T15:09:28", "owner": "johqnnaq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069924388948053, "text": "Was the horse cripp walkin ?!😭", "created_at": "2025-06-11T14:41:02", "owner": "matt_james1024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038847497645694, "text": "Get her bitch ass", "created_at": "2025-06-11T14:05:50", "owner": "daontelowery", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066248951102537, "text": "The shit I'm doing in red dead when I'm bored", "created_at": "2025-06-11T13:47:08", "owner": "n.u.nes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104630770522662, "text": "I swear, for a moment I heard Arthur Morgan", "created_at": "2025-06-11T13:46:53", "owner": "ulises_nombre.gracioso_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047389835189437, "text": "Run👹👹👹👹🗣️🗣️🗣️", "created_at": "2025-06-11T13:05:36", "owner": "qing_korrie", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17962140299927395, "text": "The horse is obviously forced to do this.🗣️", "created_at": "2025-06-11T13:00:58", "owner": "jin.ksa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18278425837256334, "text": "The horse is obviously forced to do this.", "created_at": "2025-06-11T13:00:46", "owner": "jin.ksa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18361104460149199, "text": "\"BURN THOSE CALORIES GURL 👹 CMON!\" 🤣😭", "created_at": "2025-06-11T12:54:48", "owner": "sarahsagheh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18372866404132009, "text": "😂😂😂😂🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-11T12:51:56", "owner": "nomndy1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088011634715197, "text": "As a younger sister im rolling", "created_at": "2025-06-11T12:46:03", "owner": "angelenergyjenna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070918159949211, "text": "Wonder what her great grandparents hobbies were 💀😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-11T12:25:01", "owner": "yugendra_ms", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932960610931157, "text": "@mollyyyydavis us but I’m on the horse", "created_at": "2025-06-11T12:22:56", "owner": "theameliamyers", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066600512285201, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-11T12:19:23", "owner": "cats_and_ktms", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056650961255102, "text": "Pretty sure she sees this in her sleep", "created_at": "2025-06-11T11:49:30", "owner": "6.nadia.6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031726508662075, "text": "where is the lasso?", "created_at": "2025-06-11T11:36:38", "owner": "celina_thefirst", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844422880492476, "text": "I didn’t think I would hear Daquan over here 🤨", "created_at": "2025-06-11T11:27:18", "owner": "ugo_nwakanma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113634910495139, "text": "You owe your sister all her therapy bills 🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-11T11:11:58", "owner": "theadventuresofagoofball", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17851059894437419, "text": "@ang.lama.796", "created_at": "2025-06-11T10:47:48", "owner": "tashi_dolma1w", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043818335542291, "text": "@sarahz.24", "created_at": "2025-06-11T10:47:46", "owner": "sepehrzandi95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074186824906787, "text": "Look like a fun way to exercise thooo ,better than gym🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-11T10:27:19", "owner": "menamekorya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934711563922712, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-06-11T10:03:40", "owner": "kris.tellx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993625764650279, "text": "When I saw you liked this 🤣 @ingreedo", "created_at": "2025-06-11T10:01:24", "owner": "cynthialeu", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17908315515159756, "text": "😂😂😂😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-06-11T09:47:27", "owner": "fth_nel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935662066029593, "text": "@ki.ran_awayy love you baby", "created_at": "2025-06-11T09:30:46", "owner": "simarrjeetkaur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18389411242186560, "text": "Muscle memory", "created_at": "2025-06-11T09:24:15", "owner": "omerda1first", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069817537821765, "text": "HAHAHAHAHHAHAHAHAHHAHAHAHAHAHHAHAHAHAHAHAH😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-06-11T09:00:25", "owner": "noclueforme", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18010272305760000, "text": "Collecting money for horse ear plugs button —>", "created_at": "2025-06-11T08:01:23", "owner": "boud.ouin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902311222196606, "text": "Get a lasso at this point, go all the way😭", "created_at": "2025-06-11T06:44:47", "owner": "solarsunfish", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058343768245422, "text": "We had a horse but my dad refused to let us ride him. So we chased each other trying to rope each other.", "created_at": "2025-06-11T05:30:38", "owner": "sprightly.dani.88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057156497021188, "text": "i feel so bad for the horse’s neck like me with the grocery cart", "created_at": "2025-06-11T05:21:50", "owner": "madisonngwyneth", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17851406436468191, "text": "@mahnoosh.mslmi", "created_at": "2025-06-11T04:46:48", "owner": "hera.haller", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908388787159933, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-11T04:13:38", "owner": "nx_jsanchez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104695702520991, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-11T03:30:59", "owner": "real.grubagrubs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946618734859486, "text": "I love it, 😂 😂 ❤️", "created_at": "2025-06-11T03:20:11", "owner": "devinfrench312", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904725166067046, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-11T03:09:07", "owner": "james_l_henderson", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18348829891158055, "text": "Jason won’t get that one on Friday the 13th! 🏃‍♀️💨💨💨", "created_at": "2025-06-11T02:52:00", "owner": "studiobydc2", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17939127645010095, "text": "Hitting my older brother", "created_at": "2025-06-11T02:15:25", "owner": "salvealexis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18359213956194380, "text": "Ima do tis in 2 months", "created_at": "2025-06-11T02:05:02", "owner": "giftmeadawg", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18310767748214904, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-11T01:20:48", "owner": "pewpewconcepts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033767036654183, "text": "That horse is like “IMMA GET YOU” 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-11T01:01:39", "owner": "alexis.mckenzie32", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065104640120780, "text": "Chasing her down like she's a German Soldier in 1918", "created_at": "2025-06-11T00:38:46", "owner": "yesacoconutnut", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18035579126350558, "text": "Why the horse crip walking to her", "created_at": "2025-06-11T00:10:12", "owner": "tedwillcatchthebag", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070746518309087, "text": "That's evil. Do it x20. 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-11T00:03:57", "owner": "renbrulee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18183366589318274, "text": "Horsie be driftin’", "created_at": "2025-06-10T23:56:29", "owner": "lucasfields96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008496320762225, "text": "You need to learn how to lasso her", "created_at": "2025-06-10T23:27:02", "owner": "kyleschnobb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081137794640300, "text": "I used to do this to my brother omg hahahahahaha", "created_at": "2025-06-10T23:26:12", "owner": "oliviagraceross", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18074085620496831, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-06-10T23:09:00", "owner": "eenyclan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906899170055533, "text": "🙆🏻‍♂️☠️😂", "created_at": "2025-06-10T23:00:29", "owner": "josephm51", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910754293139149, "text": "Why yo horse walk heterosexually", "created_at": "2025-06-10T22:57:58", "owner": "kidfromfartsville", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085530595736838, "text": "Madam that is what lassos are for", "created_at": "2025-06-10T22:17:23", "owner": "sky.c.b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911680108030873, "text": "😍😍😍❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-06-10T22:16:20", "owner": "andresdejesus.garcia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847532992493264, "text": "You should get a lasso", "created_at": "2025-06-10T22:06:22", "owner": "mega_bear27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061652126177726, "text": "@olivia.overson", "created_at": "2025-06-10T21:38:37", "owner": "armanhsalim", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051213446103865, "text": "Well well well what do we have hereee", "created_at": "2025-06-10T21:31:00", "owner": "f_arooqi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945045630871550, "text": "ههههههههههههههههههههههههههههههههههههههههههههههههههههههههههههههههههه", "created_at": "2025-06-10T21:27:17", "owner": "moony._.ksa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938212954034725, "text": "@alennyo_  if we only had a horse😂🤣😂🤣😂🤣😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-10T21:23:19", "owner": "_aorovio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026876897667965, "text": "The mongols were a real fan of this", "created_at": "2025-06-10T21:00:48", "owner": "jaxonp007", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17991029432661432, "text": "I love horse girls", "created_at": "2025-06-10T20:38:41", "owner": "beroskiberoska", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18009126821749419, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-10T20:23:42", "owner": "annamariahagn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040015214626771, "text": "Hahahhaha @hollystovin", "created_at": "2025-06-10T20:18:24", "owner": "alexstovin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068701708985866, "text": "Older sibling behavior", "created_at": "2025-06-10T20:07:18", "owner": "sweetsleepyirony", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17958769139941108, "text": "The honse running sideways", "created_at": "2025-06-10T20:04:54", "owner": "doug_eb17", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17984691227830175, "text": "My little brothers favourite hobby was chasing me with things, good times", "created_at": "2025-06-10T20:02:30", "owner": "maui_laboucan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059286362238029, "text": "Why the horse lowkey drifting", "created_at": "2025-06-10T19:55:19", "owner": "sdustalien", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056334350361682, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-10T19:54:26", "owner": "elishaholgz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18279558127252798, "text": "@fiona.riaaah 😂emmm", "created_at": "2025-06-10T19:51:49", "owner": "hexe12666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968517636764111, "text": "@jessiohtx this reminds of that day at the fairgrounds", "created_at": "2025-06-10T19:43:09", "owner": "monicazay1cek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843042226503867, "text": "Get a water gun", "created_at": "2025-06-10T19:42:11", "owner": "beersandimports", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397918138114066, "text": "My mom did this to a boy in her class when he was rude to her so she bringed her horse and ran after him😭", "created_at": "2025-06-10T19:36:49", "owner": "odafh_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047080619441568, "text": "That’s evil", "created_at": "2025-06-10T19:35:45", "owner": "lukastippy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18372391960192752, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-10T19:34:15", "owner": "_lxtzayy4x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055983347365363, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-10T19:04:54", "owner": "alex.past94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005354327785223, "text": "Why is she running like that? 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-10T19:02:51", "owner": "insane_cat_king", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882448861305098, "text": "We played trip the reindeer... little brother would run with a rope tied to his foot and whoever tripped him won", "created_at": "2025-06-10T18:59:44", "owner": "jessicadejong307", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055902251196834, "text": "@jaimelynn__watson I’m grateful @the_ah_life didn’t do this to me as a kid 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-10T18:41:41", "owner": "woah_nastasia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858131569433991, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-10T18:38:47", "owner": "m0hussain524", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067733735061986, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-10T18:34:59", "owner": "zehra.ezz3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18509766181006091, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-10T18:34:50", "owner": "ellosercruiser", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18361745059195494, "text": "How did we get here like what were the events that led to this lmao", "created_at": "2025-06-10T18:31:01", "owner": "trans_boy_dusty", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047321048575044, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-10T18:15:56", "owner": "salimel_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842045239517209, "text": "why is the horse running in italics", "created_at": "2025-06-10T18:09:34", "owner": "buggailll", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086934649659197, "text": "“I just wanna play 👹👹” 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-06-10T17:53:10", "owner": "sdgfuhxjncdhhsargcj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18506391040030573, "text": "Sniper no swiping 😭", "created_at": "2025-06-10T17:42:19", "owner": "_mlk_ryn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087888637578331, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-10T17:36:25", "owner": "fitfunlive75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080361118824422, "text": "Well mine chased me and my little brother with a mountain bike when he was younger and a four wheeler when he got older😂", "created_at": "2025-06-10T17:35:37", "owner": "isaac.kosel19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18507135505015319, "text": "No lasso?", "created_at": "2025-06-10T17:24:56", "owner": "darko_malinovski996", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007943303773393, "text": "I feel like this is the horses favorite hobby. When ever the horse sees her it’s on site", "created_at": "2025-06-10T17:22:56", "owner": "cerv_antesjose1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137351464406985, "text": "That would be so fun 😭", "created_at": "2025-06-10T17:21:02", "owner": "0strawbearyvy0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064910030281214, "text": "I wish", "created_at": "2025-06-10T17:19:37", "owner": "lillalaluu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873795841261358, "text": "Did blud just drift with that cow?", "created_at": "2025-06-10T17:18:50", "owner": "villemel1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961307559791681, "text": "Please throw a giant net onto her (do a reenactment of The Planet of The Apes when the apes are capturing humans)", "created_at": "2025-06-10T17:18:09", "owner": "thalia_problem_child", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953703147825608, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-10T17:14:20", "owner": "shawn_unseen_goa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18280237957283308, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-10T16:43:49", "owner": "juxttnani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082669540690287, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-10T16:38:55", "owner": "everyday_jpa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146456965389977, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-10T16:26:44", "owner": "john_papandreou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125465821448060, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-10T16:20:15", "owner": "d_eoll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050037176622714, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-10T16:12:43", "owner": "mrsmelrose4eva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103268770530595, "text": "Proper use of a horse", "created_at": "2025-06-10T15:48:11", "owner": "alliesantina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960602568928936, "text": "\"Come her!!🧔🧔\"", "created_at": "2025-06-10T15:44:43", "owner": "trixfancars", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845935849479944, "text": "Lol I do that too to my older brother Lmao🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-10T15:42:28", "owner": "urlocalequiniegirl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031108772445393, "text": "Actually yes", "created_at": "2025-06-10T15:36:06", "owner": "gracie_thecrazy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18194513203308523, "text": "😂😂🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-10T15:33:40", "owner": "denise_gutagu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065104604285134, "text": "“COME HERE” 👹🗣️", "created_at": "2025-06-10T15:20:39", "owner": "iconicbeliefs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934388680043558, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-10T15:05:35", "owner": "yourema2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964722825924261, "text": "@indumati_______", "created_at": "2025-06-10T14:55:25", "owner": "shek_1708", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034611938657659, "text": "We used to let the horse chase us 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-10T14:54:37", "owner": "controlobsolete", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972351777908901, "text": "get that lasso out girl", "created_at": "2025-06-10T14:16:50", "owner": "slpstrm_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18510996244014916, "text": "@diane.gha", "created_at": "2025-06-10T13:57:14", "owner": "lore_ahaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068441867077304, "text": "Atleast she’s gonna have good stamina", "created_at": "2025-06-10T13:49:14", "owner": "vhoqist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102991366541348, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-10T13:44:01", "owner": "ondra_polcar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057944210235414, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-10T13:23:17", "owner": "lilylollilollipop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18328252744203590, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-10T13:17:59", "owner": "4fourfour_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897286000220486, "text": "Get this woman a lasso", "created_at": "2025-06-10T13:04:46", "owner": "gen.l.b", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18074633266918582, "text": "You could also use the term horse riding", "created_at": "2025-06-10T12:41:57", "owner": "fa1zan_75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071794510771192, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-10T12:16:23", "owner": "ip7fon2eu0n4k2l0a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062438696137955, "text": "Love this authentic stuff 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-10T12:12:59", "owner": "speakvids", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881607502328556, "text": "As a youngest sibling I need you to know I hate you", "created_at": "2025-06-10T12:05:01", "owner": "barber_pole01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010073006583401, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-10T11:36:51", "owner": "rice1010_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046366358572803, "text": "Seems fun.", "created_at": "2025-06-10T11:29:19", "owner": "mr_muffin2310", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895815937239194, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-10T11:03:14", "owner": "sarihey_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087076528591028, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-10T09:28:56", "owner": "coldxrevenant", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877117678349069, "text": "How are you able to drift a horse?!?!?", "created_at": "2025-06-10T09:27:45", "owner": "benjiamato", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142635757395835, "text": "Why that horse start running heterosexually", "created_at": "2025-06-10T08:51:05", "owner": "wyatt_corbin13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909522580119560, "text": "Little sister got some wheels 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-10T08:41:03", "owner": "uh1pilot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047146331566024, "text": "Get a lasso", "created_at": "2025-06-10T07:30:59", "owner": "diewernersau", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055259444461252, "text": "Slave owners when slaves ran away:", "created_at": "2025-06-10T07:25:15", "owner": "not.the.tea_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970662672883236, "text": "You are so damn gorgeous😭", "created_at": "2025-06-10T07:18:51", "owner": "leze05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093244879610990, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-10T06:59:03", "owner": "krampuskramps", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066738779286397, "text": "Great, now I need a fking horse", "created_at": "2025-06-10T06:58:55", "owner": "ofelipevet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096870847503815, "text": "Too funny", "created_at": "2025-06-10T06:49:04", "owner": "strawhatsolis777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009433874771987, "text": "I’ll lend you my Heeler, he needs enrichment", "created_at": "2025-06-10T06:44:07", "owner": "dirt_bag_karl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075012415731369, "text": "Sister of the yea🫡", "created_at": "2025-06-10T06:11:22", "owner": "thah_future", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040395764556301, "text": "We've been trying to reach you about your car's extended warranty!", "created_at": "2025-06-10T05:54:35", "owner": "hoser41", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017972723717662, "text": "Lasso her up with a rope and tie her on the back of the horse like red dead redemption while dressed like Arthur Morgan", "created_at": "2025-06-10T05:42:20", "owner": "maddie_m260", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979386342836553, "text": "Hahahah @devynbaldwin there we are", "created_at": "2025-06-10T05:28:11", "owner": "austyn.baldwin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882659497316906, "text": "Do it again as you tell her about her car's extended warranty", "created_at": "2025-06-10T05:25:04", "owner": "yoheyitsalex", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17885325384180035, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-10T05:08:01", "owner": "greys_ondillon7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067158407044165, "text": "Yes Instagram, I am interested", "created_at": "2025-06-10T05:06:32", "owner": "alexdillon836", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17873696181262523, "text": "معتوهه بس يونس 🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-10T04:40:40", "owner": "rana.h9991", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032855348409699, "text": "Where's your lasso? Lol 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-10T04:38:03", "owner": "a_nights_work", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032040791422118, "text": "the lapd", "created_at": "2025-06-10T04:10:51", "owner": "maddie.desroche", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028360730679338, "text": "Just chasing people in general niw", "created_at": "2025-06-10T03:45:36", "owner": "dancer_jiz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068049289997701, "text": "We've been trying to reach you", "created_at": "2025-06-10T03:28:20", "owner": "garzaj4676", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876659392350940, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-10T02:57:17", "owner": "brittanynwisniewski", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18061828460138624, "text": "BURN THOSE CALORIES GUHH C’MON", "created_at": "2025-06-10T02:43:44", "owner": "goosewiddaglock", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969938982886239, "text": "How are you drifting the horse 😭", "created_at": "2025-06-10T01:58:20", "owner": "inzayne_51", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18084429346664679, "text": "don’t let my horsey sis see this 😭", "created_at": "2025-06-10T01:51:27", "owner": "josspinhero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934543194914743, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-10T00:54:39", "owner": "a.nicolexo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092572405545473, "text": "lasso her", "created_at": "2025-06-10T00:44:32", "owner": "kittievampirez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18514401931058948, "text": "Haha the video, but mainly the comments 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-10T00:40:36", "owner": "kellybalch", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18160964428318177, "text": "My first girlfriend did exactly this to me", "created_at": "2025-06-10T00:29:29", "owner": "arsonogenic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067688213095458, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣 this is amazing", "created_at": "2025-06-09T23:40:22", "owner": "mark.ceniceros.9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18228599542291376, "text": "We just wanna bite", "created_at": "2025-06-09T23:02:52", "owner": "archbb18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078427762869742, "text": "Jack: man that whole Dutch thing sucked, time to make a new life\nThe nefarious Sadie Adler:", "created_at": "2025-06-09T22:59:36", "owner": "johnny_boi0815", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917723494099417, "text": "I’m farrrking dying 😂😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-09T22:53:30", "owner": "roo_vin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17896580634230390, "text": "LA police maxxing", "created_at": "2025-06-09T22:19:45", "owner": "i_lack_toes_in_todler_ants_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005545706773729, "text": "OMG, no joke but I chase my brother", "created_at": "2025-06-09T22:03:37", "owner": "littlespice3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884438197295301, "text": "someone get this girl a lasso", "created_at": "2025-06-09T22:00:56", "owner": "wheeziiii1", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17907412437053499, "text": "I have never even thought about people doing this…", "created_at": "2025-06-09T21:52:46", "owner": "drewlaino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036928829646965, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-09T21:47:59", "owner": "itzanikdatta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070408442052605, "text": "Funny but not for her", "created_at": "2025-06-09T21:43:40", "owner": "johnnycash2348", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950210544976993, "text": "Hahahh I love that", "created_at": "2025-06-09T21:41:41", "owner": "harleyrose352", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044168714622902, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-09T21:41:26", "owner": "gingasso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030619151669525, "text": "That seems so fun lol😂🤣❤️", "created_at": "2025-06-09T21:14:21", "owner": "ggives2028", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101971294478191, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-09T21:13:02", "owner": "thtkidlee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067254968011041, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-09T21:12:26", "owner": "corniestskate16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058066046193142, "text": "That’s so evil😭", "created_at": "2025-06-09T21:11:08", "owner": "izzway_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18402058516129556, "text": "Where’s your lasso?", "created_at": "2025-06-09T21:00:32", "owner": "masathehiro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048447701615290, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-09T20:40:01", "owner": "kellmvtorr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963239571925783, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-09T20:26:58", "owner": "brooklynperryofficiall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071713550302011, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-09T20:05:43", "owner": "evelynosorio45_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879440749225000, "text": "I too enjoy this hobby @taryn_olson", "created_at": "2025-06-09T19:59:03", "owner": "brielle_ruff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092040853545903, "text": "Easy there LAPD.", "created_at": "2025-06-09T19:31:56", "owner": "mctsketch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924825138962804, "text": "I would do the exact same thing🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-09T19:28:08", "owner": "johnmeyer21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844292827492863, "text": "Bite lol", "created_at": "2025-06-09T19:25:06", "owner": "friedrich.jan.georg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946409467005054, "text": "The horse of absolute chase, permanent turmoil and persecution", "created_at": "2025-06-09T19:24:40", "owner": "maximilienabl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084582748731673, "text": "\"You rode him down?\"\n \"He ran...\"", "created_at": "2025-06-09T18:56:51", "owner": "scarfington_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074143807929407, "text": "Burn those calories!!!", "created_at": "2025-06-09T18:42:51", "owner": "scottcunningham1927", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955575267951456, "text": "Stop horsing around", "created_at": "2025-06-09T18:05:22", "owner": "watermyths", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18142929049393100, "text": "@sweet_n3lla_", "created_at": "2025-06-09T18:02:34", "owner": "disnamiko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093777646608792, "text": "Sister needs to learn how to spook a horse haha🤣 🐎", "created_at": "2025-06-09T17:53:17", "owner": "twrpwr1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045071675232946, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-09T17:52:38", "owner": "xo_duss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18327079576202013, "text": "Komm her ? German ?", "created_at": "2025-06-09T17:38:48", "owner": "robin_dms47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083105083751350, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-09T17:14:20", "owner": "erikaadane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066845987097708, "text": "As a tormented little brother, just wait and you won’t be laughing in a few years 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-09T17:06:03", "owner": "lavenderdiscosexpapi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048465653612290, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-09T16:34:10", "owner": "aspanayu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884150905299264, "text": "Buy a lasso", "created_at": "2025-06-09T16:18:12", "owner": "felixlara3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952278585977057, "text": "This is exactly what growing up with an older sister is like, and why do many Hollywood sibling relationships are totally unbelievable to me", "created_at": "2025-06-09T16:07:56", "owner": "xstardewbaddiex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964714677920336, "text": "The 'COME HERE' is frying me💔💔", "created_at": "2025-06-09T15:52:18", "owner": "3vonnx.e", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18406612915104086, "text": "@chichibeja me if roles were reversed and I rode horses", "created_at": "2025-06-09T15:45:38", "owner": "mimi_beja", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991200657807672, "text": "“We just wanna buck!”", "created_at": "2025-06-09T15:44:04", "owner": "_6ixz_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17970498671749753, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-09T15:36:07", "owner": "ez7_dondon", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18032330945404474, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-09T15:18:59", "owner": "89basti_89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929593302947760, "text": "78.4% why I wanna get a horse", "created_at": "2025-06-09T15:06:32", "owner": "petitnifique", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087603262649667, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-09T14:47:45", "owner": "best_in_the_world08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919854850009273, "text": "Burn those calories 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-09T14:36:27", "owner": "msf_bennett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048369212152610, "text": "@nesteateaa Me You and hairspray with lighter ❤️😂", "created_at": "2025-06-09T14:36:00", "owner": "alvergili", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18033866540403000, "text": "I LOVE THE HORSE IS WITH HIS BIG SIS BS😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-09T14:33:35", "owner": "muizzonie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048535961154698, "text": "😂😂😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-06-09T14:16:57", "owner": "loredpanda29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879994822339748, "text": "I literally screamed 🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-09T14:06:25", "owner": "ciaobellllllla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050866019110764, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-09T13:46:34", "owner": "c_grizzy_music", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913863481102953, "text": "B-roll footage for \"Nope\".", "created_at": "2025-06-09T13:32:30", "owner": "quintessantgreatness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989539203667494, "text": "Hilarious....\"burn those calories, girl!!...come on!!!!\"", "created_at": "2025-06-09T13:24:33", "owner": "insta_james_k_b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074975947912178, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-09T13:23:36", "owner": "certifiedchillin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124449559454284, "text": "COME HERE 👹", "created_at": "2025-06-09T13:18:18", "owner": "ashleymeagan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17950837448866082, "text": "COME HERE , COME HEREEE🗣️🗣️", "created_at": "2025-06-09T12:52:13", "owner": "_lolaetjesaispas", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18062253211913358, "text": "I almost skipped this reel, and I was like, oh wait this is actually funny 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-09T12:51:36", "owner": "number101964", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068879554972564, "text": "@not.miamarie this is u with savi lmaooo", "created_at": "2025-06-09T12:00:02", "owner": "hanancote", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914890519016762, "text": "You should learn how to lasso so you can round her up🤠", "created_at": "2025-06-09T11:59:46", "owner": "cameron.neish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942276271008057, "text": "I wonder are the horse enjoy this hobby too..", "created_at": "2025-06-09T11:36:44", "owner": "jacktggrande", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910686220037824, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-09T11:34:03", "owner": "story_film_writer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913839637130131, "text": "If she needs to burs some more calories send her over 🐎💨🤪", "created_at": "2025-06-09T11:33:20", "owner": "royaltry_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068682191053729, "text": "This is what castle lords were getting up to throughout most of European history", "created_at": "2025-06-09T11:31:58", "owner": "placehole_der", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015540983538406, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-09T11:21:56", "owner": "blairtheblondie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888887599268413, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-09T11:20:02", "owner": "winsonwyh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902733952193608, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-09T10:35:18", "owner": "its_khalid_mohamad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012729599563975, "text": "We just wanna what? 😭", "created_at": "2025-06-09T10:10:09", "owner": "hayahuascah", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17940238467009180, "text": "Where can I get a horse", "created_at": "2025-06-09T09:39:56", "owner": "thedrew.exe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062196551126082, "text": "Girls being gorws", "created_at": "2025-06-09T08:55:20", "owner": "grant_gahm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077189551803977, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-09T07:41:16", "owner": "angxl.fangs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974977929854827, "text": "Samee", "created_at": "2025-06-09T07:17:20", "owner": "stacey.equestrian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088680826639401, "text": "🔥🔥😂😂 we just want a bite ...", "created_at": "2025-06-09T07:01:15", "owner": "hshshn.alamoot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18370895386127942, "text": "@pagolsagolzuni", "created_at": "2025-06-09T05:37:40", "owner": "digitalshundori", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091971196615049, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-09T05:19:29", "owner": "iam_phoon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18507314518032778, "text": "😂🤣😂", "created_at": "2025-06-09T04:35:12", "owner": "sheree_hb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982377444696458, "text": "Ahh I used to do that to my little brother and his friends and they would hide under the trampoline 😭", "created_at": "2025-06-09T04:22:01", "owner": "jade_jonas14", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17927847459067487, "text": "I really like this thank you", "created_at": "2025-06-09T04:14:31", "owner": "luna_camp27", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18344672920086848, "text": "This the part where you throw a rope at her feet and Dutch ride her", "created_at": "2025-06-09T04:10:24", "owner": "adrian._.g.o.n.z.o", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17937762873011519, "text": "HAHHAHAHA", "created_at": "2025-06-09T04:05:02", "owner": "muhaymin_dus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058573166007637, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-09T03:22:30", "owner": "canative45", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969119823911619, "text": "Aussie activities 🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-09T03:10:54", "owner": "janaka_vision", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059766040982910, "text": "Your horse is gonna have a thirst for blood", "created_at": "2025-06-09T03:10:48", "owner": "redneddean", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964923573921874, "text": "Wheres the laso haha", "created_at": "2025-06-09T03:09:43", "owner": "acehood248", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956313498813452, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-09T02:49:42", "owner": "cindytrinispice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066469151026115, "text": "Um… so you know this is so dangerous right? What if your horse gets a taste for human fear and trains its horse friends to take over the world and farm humans for their fear? What are you gonna do then, huh? 🤨", "created_at": "2025-06-09T02:29:49", "owner": "soular_fox", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17953462082977251, "text": "No lasso?", "created_at": "2025-06-09T02:19:43", "owner": "jar_meng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939418924008670, "text": "Shoulda done some lines from a western ya know", "created_at": "2025-06-09T02:13:15", "owner": "faizalavi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856560751442567, "text": "Hunting the peasantry POV", "created_at": "2025-06-09T02:08:06", "owner": "keegan_marsh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070903558981498, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-09T02:03:57", "owner": "ashcashradtech", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033664070661023, "text": "\"stop🗣️🏃‍♀️.... stop🗣️🏃‍♀️.........stop🗣️🏃‍♀️.\"", "created_at": "2025-06-09T02:01:59", "owner": "blakat.nrg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160846156317398, "text": "Low key something g I would don", "created_at": "2025-06-09T01:55:10", "owner": "napahidean", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067445900090769, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-09T01:46:06", "owner": "amarit287", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914772481014444, "text": "I just know the horse enjoys this too😂", "created_at": "2025-06-09T01:38:26", "owner": "rose_tigerlilly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936932953040918, "text": "In the best way, why do you sound like young Justin Bieber", "created_at": "2025-06-09T01:29:55", "owner": "bull_.sp0nge_phr0g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064887950032113, "text": "Can you rodeo your sister 🤣 like throw some rope to her", "created_at": "2025-06-09T01:26:00", "owner": "zzyyypppp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059979997975150, "text": "I've never been so jealous in my life....", "created_at": "2025-06-09T01:25:16", "owner": "nadialinnett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060883412330535, "text": "@bellah_petersen me to Tino 🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣😭", "created_at": "2025-06-09T01:13:54", "owner": "nastassjakinski9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083068837740874, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-09T01:13:21", "owner": "duncansito328", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081115045817467, "text": "It’s giving @allie_r27", "created_at": "2025-06-09T01:02:18", "owner": "meg_wel", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17986792784820662, "text": "@urnilsa", "created_at": "2025-06-09T01:01:04", "owner": "sainaaa0_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154148935334445, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-09T00:49:08", "owner": "fireassassinvi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059423747183823, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-09T00:42:07", "owner": "lester.gz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972674997895323, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-06-09T00:32:59", "owner": "archerlaser", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352312513153012, "text": "Sisterhood at its core 🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-09T00:18:22", "owner": "mckennarimstidt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903688768071867, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-09T00:17:22", "owner": "azure4lanz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18510797641008780, "text": "She using her farm voice and everything", "created_at": "2025-06-09T00:14:09", "owner": "kfortch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890604292147710, "text": "I love the voice change!!🤣🤣 \"Come here! Run!\"😂", "created_at": "2025-06-09T00:11:46", "owner": "nannrae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842335219514415, "text": "@ll.szcki why’d you like this 🥺", "created_at": "2025-06-09T00:05:00", "owner": "jessieskii", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051931706587534, "text": "Now I do", "created_at": "2025-06-08T23:56:47", "owner": "bibby3260", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042307091285838, "text": "Dose bringing a whole ass live goose to her room while she's on call with her friends count :)", "created_at": "2025-06-08T23:44:21", "owner": "ends_eye", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18014851661737238, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T23:36:22", "owner": "therealbryu84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853482058456286, "text": "Now you need a rope", "created_at": "2025-06-08T23:27:02", "owner": "madisonkay_mester", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056135921256500, "text": "If you don't already know how, start using her as lasso practice", "created_at": "2025-06-08T23:25:22", "owner": "_.sydney.moore._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18473845834068787, "text": "That is hilarious I use to do the same thing with my brother and now he stays inside playing video games😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T23:20:39", "owner": "georgebritton81", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850913599432860, "text": "Lucky she runs fast 😭", "created_at": "2025-06-08T23:14:11", "owner": "ellaxrose03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967726194766438, "text": "Try to add lasso throwing at her next time for better experience", "created_at": "2025-06-08T22:57:08", "owner": "ritchieism", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031742531422444, "text": "That's so mean..... do it again.", "created_at": "2025-06-08T22:55:48", "owner": "the_real_sara_shady", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967778532912016, "text": "Bro😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T22:50:13", "owner": "gortklaatu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057356066252625, "text": "COME HERE, WE NEED TO TELL YOU ABOUT YOUR CARS EXTENDED WARRANTY", "created_at": "2025-06-08T22:47:06", "owner": "lukeareinhardt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032623514418968, "text": "That’s how slaves kept so fit. Their only two options were working jobs that required a lot of muscle, or trying to outrun people on horses.", "created_at": "2025-06-08T22:42:39", "owner": "romain_fr_34", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029404634466302, "text": "Me in red dead redemption chasing a random person 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T22:24:38", "owner": "3kn3t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082951261685528, "text": "We used to lasso each other and play demolition derby on our bicycles. Need for Speed: Hot Pursuit was to blame.", "created_at": "2025-06-08T22:23:43", "owner": "s33w33d_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040833776644867, "text": "Now rope her feet", "created_at": "2025-06-08T22:02:13", "owner": "halie_bransyn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898052362216806, "text": "Lasso her", "created_at": "2025-06-08T21:55:21", "owner": "mattkloeckler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064994177152482, "text": "Now u need a nerf gun 😭", "created_at": "2025-06-08T21:48:24", "owner": "_mtgoat_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070098175962923, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T21:47:54", "owner": "savagepresley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051292904595506, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T21:47:42", "owner": "savagepresley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068288150085036, "text": "Hold on wait.  We’ve been trying to reach you about your car extended warranty!", "created_at": "2025-06-08T21:45:10", "owner": "thatdougieguy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18510354988059172, "text": "Stop! 🏃‍♀️ Stop 🏃‍♀️ Stop 🏃‍♀️ Stop 🏃‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-06-08T21:44:22", "owner": "stattjo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030908510450916, "text": "Some things are simply in your genes.", "created_at": "2025-06-08T21:43:45", "owner": "00110110l00111001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086685562639624, "text": "My kids will learn work or we’re taking cold showers 😂 internet isn’t turned off it’s a privilege that will be turned on.", "created_at": "2025-06-08T21:39:00", "owner": "dcremins_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942283425886570, "text": "Sibling life 🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-08T21:38:08", "owner": "franklingirl85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18326070166200539, "text": "Come hear Come hear", "created_at": "2025-06-08T21:32:38", "owner": "ced_ced_ced_cedric_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061337612229041, "text": "KOM HER 🗣️", "created_at": "2025-06-08T21:26:03", "owner": "tauznen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072659483509559, "text": "“Come ERRE” 🗣️👹", "created_at": "2025-06-08T21:17:33", "owner": "vicinthewoods", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057144134014896, "text": "tell me you have siblings without telling me you have siblings", "created_at": "2025-06-08T21:09:49", "owner": "hannahgoesforward", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850915990433655, "text": "Red Dead Redemption post game:", "created_at": "2025-06-08T21:01:38", "owner": "brintolololoo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17880746253332220, "text": "Learn how to lasso and open a bunch of new possibilities", "created_at": "2025-06-08T20:56:49", "owner": "agamemnon969", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921200011068154, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T20:45:46", "owner": "_saymoy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18513613768012512, "text": "typa shit i'd do if i had a horse. or a sister", "created_at": "2025-06-08T20:35:26", "owner": "bentbliley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154961788374839, "text": "@__.himjaa.__ i’m waiting for you to come to my place 😈🎀", "created_at": "2025-06-08T20:24:15", "owner": "praapttiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165919117354404, "text": "Where are u i want to lose weight", "created_at": "2025-06-08T20:23:50", "owner": "silix76", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18077581720855089, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T20:17:49", "owner": "bnut_biggarillo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060457747960868, "text": "You need an alignment", "created_at": "2025-06-08T20:17:47", "owner": "rogereffinrabbit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077327659894819, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T20:17:12", "owner": "hbirdjesse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067174082088828, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-06-08T20:09:25", "owner": "ingainathi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087132331659043, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T20:09:18", "owner": "ingainathi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366247063176323, "text": "Why the horse running like jack sparrow 😭", "created_at": "2025-06-08T20:05:37", "owner": "ale_njoy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858487489431728, "text": "Pretty sure this is how Hunchback of Notre Dame begins", "created_at": "2025-06-08T20:03:21", "owner": "itsdeanam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971857764747503, "text": "Gyro Zeppeli activities", "created_at": "2025-06-08T20:00:47", "owner": "_ab0masn0w_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043883609531094, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T20:00:40", "owner": "prometheius", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952252809966387, "text": "OMG😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T19:59:19", "owner": "jasy.42", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079826101897282, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T19:58:59", "owner": "gmjamesldn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124915510450121, "text": "🗣️🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-08T19:55:27", "owner": "damesweety", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18168093244353471, "text": "Get a WIP next time makes it more fun 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T19:52:01", "owner": "ajbrown836", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896918662226847, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T19:47:07", "owner": "tokoruahawe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084101659613751, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T19:40:47", "owner": "grxntomerta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974739816734922, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T19:39:02", "owner": "lips0714", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057093572257973, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T19:37:02", "owner": "papijwalk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065738777046810, "text": "Are u sayin Komm her! or is it jst me", "created_at": "2025-06-08T19:35:50", "owner": "lippitz.gabriel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066823718047682, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T19:35:11", "owner": "v.vmber", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063354068133366, "text": "Can we talk about how her sister knows the zigzag technique? A literal military tactic", "created_at": "2025-06-08T19:34:51", "owner": "k1nghandy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095696047526149, "text": "\"Remember when you used to chase me while riding your horse?\"-\"hahaha Good times...🥂\"", "created_at": "2025-06-08T19:32:46", "owner": "theeshort1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18151387711373726, "text": "Lol 😭🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-08T19:32:36", "owner": "onewolf88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864889654332238, "text": "Laso her 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T19:31:35", "owner": "realspanisheyez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858557140435116, "text": "Love it😭", "created_at": "2025-06-08T19:29:28", "owner": "ttvkillomanjaro420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030685928440570, "text": "Guess you can call it a hobby horse 🐴😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T19:20:35", "owner": "themadsaiyanmonkey", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17908430766156723, "text": "Why is her horse riding diagonaly??😢", "created_at": "2025-06-08T19:20:29", "owner": "xaver_gell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959646918955634, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T19:19:42", "owner": "shiyuan_ruben", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050374352523469, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T19:14:48", "owner": "tyrant_lizard_king_66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950293572844324, "text": "Bro was running side ways", "created_at": "2025-06-08T19:14:47", "owner": "sirian_j2.0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17971842764884804, "text": "“This ranch ain’t big enough for both of us sis”", "created_at": "2025-06-08T19:13:15", "owner": "mkr_p9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111873382493077, "text": "she just wants to ask about her cars extended warrenty", "created_at": "2025-06-08T19:08:22", "owner": "alexaeherrera", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17984585861830036, "text": "“We’re just trying to reach you about your extended car warranty!”", "created_at": "2025-06-08T19:07:40", "owner": "_j_uriel_s_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062904716153090, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T19:07:32", "owner": "ilyytinkkk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880477852333196, "text": "“Come here” 🤺🤺🤺", "created_at": "2025-06-08T19:06:12", "owner": "scopefiy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18211853677306191, "text": "This is how Pikemen are made.", "created_at": "2025-06-08T19:05:22", "owner": "jammer_in_tn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18252235993304199, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T19:02:04", "owner": "auzstuff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18351991549153833, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T18:59:36", "owner": "gwenanimegirl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058864754517190, "text": "😂😂😂😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-06-08T18:59:10", "owner": "88flaw88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871380904370098, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T18:53:36", "owner": "nice_viking_chains_bro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066102719011738, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T18:53:10", "owner": "blood_wing_sum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957146562953214, "text": "So diabolic at the most 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-08T18:49:34", "owner": "mossgerard87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058536499997061, "text": "“COME’ERE 👹”", "created_at": "2025-06-08T18:48:52", "owner": "just_peachy412", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18345298927092517, "text": "Learn to rope her too😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T18:47:20", "owner": "zacharyeskelson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044255840239019, "text": "You can tell the horse loves it too 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-06-08T18:47:02", "owner": "nottwodisappear", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18165448144353133, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T18:45:43", "owner": "thiswomanslifejourney89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055026293053577, "text": "I just chase my sister (I just run full speed at her and she just run away) it all started with me running to her because my mom needed her and she ran and ever since I just do it randomly 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T18:41:58", "owner": "we.love.cayla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079777543658157, "text": "COME ERE🗣️🗣️👹", "created_at": "2025-06-08T18:40:14", "owner": "simon_hoge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080806252808743, "text": "Me in Red Dead", "created_at": "2025-06-08T18:40:02", "owner": "mysterious7here", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031998752425184, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T18:38:48", "owner": "lamontsmith7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070995073968705, "text": "That's got dark 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T18:35:41", "owner": "umair4138", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18388682395186431, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T18:35:28", "owner": "deb_karmakar_02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056920307252123, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🗣️", "created_at": "2025-06-08T18:33:29", "owner": "fakamil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18360771574149393, "text": "This is entertaining", "created_at": "2025-06-08T18:33:26", "owner": "ghoztle_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18209659540306316, "text": "MY NAME IS JOHN MARSTON!", "created_at": "2025-06-08T18:29:26", "owner": "loving_european", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052460171093125, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T18:28:24", "owner": "myasia5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971758503912440, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T18:21:00", "owner": "myka_gleave_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366522943179520, "text": "My brother chases me around with a belt normal people use the leather he used the buckle clocked me in the head crack my skull I don’t have the memories", "created_at": "2025-06-08T18:18:58", "owner": "joseph.pitta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044284016242629, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T18:13:35", "owner": "rarity_03m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895898464230668, "text": "why do you look like Shailene Woodley?😭", "created_at": "2025-06-08T18:12:55", "owner": "xx.im.not.real.xx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18328410265207484, "text": "Ma’am u think your horse needs an alignment", "created_at": "2025-06-08T18:09:52", "owner": "matthew_ramirz", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18083172322696074, "text": "She's playing IRL Red Dead Redemption", "created_at": "2025-06-08T18:04:17", "owner": "pulkitm15", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18069223381972249, "text": "My brother chased me with a stapler scissors or a knife lol", "created_at": "2025-06-08T17:59:46", "owner": "grace_luvs_summer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949695840988788, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T17:54:24", "owner": "_jeanpierre365", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040917947294779, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T17:52:28", "owner": "elementalsigil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884792608282651, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T17:52:04", "owner": "khadhill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971262054897183, "text": "I use to chase my sister with a clown mask 😂 😂I call it Character development ❤️", "created_at": "2025-06-08T17:51:34", "owner": "ebby_entourage", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078787168890361, "text": "Starting her motivation early 🤣 let's go", "created_at": "2025-06-08T17:49:04", "owner": "srewo1f", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085600066737159, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T17:45:30", "owner": "noseln", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301242748171529, "text": "Everyone needs a hobbie!👍", "created_at": "2025-06-08T17:37:35", "owner": "brettatx_z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18506347675055961, "text": "We were poor. So my bug brother chased me with a chainsaw", "created_at": "2025-06-08T17:35:39", "owner": "yassineatarid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18512414950037595, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T17:35:26", "owner": "jrzy82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18361620430181917, "text": "She’s a good personal trainer", "created_at": "2025-06-08T17:34:07", "owner": "the_kid_blah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918831262096543, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T17:32:26", "owner": "hay2hercules", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049001723527587, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T17:31:20", "owner": "ycxcv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915088309077475, "text": "No lasso in sight , fake 😔😮‍💨", "created_at": "2025-06-08T17:30:27", "owner": "master_kush_king", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009718655584606, "text": "Oh my god this is so funny LMAO", "created_at": "2025-06-08T17:30:10", "owner": "deadlyletty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961736718924534, "text": "You're probably an asshole, but one day your sister's going to win the Olympics", "created_at": "2025-06-08T17:29:21", "owner": "gobeastdude", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18169610173341178, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T17:26:13", "owner": "lucas_albuquerque_xvi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096703621574356, "text": "Close enough, welcome back Sadie Adler.", "created_at": "2025-06-08T17:25:34", "owner": "mhmm.nino", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069651193816381, "text": "@molldrew_", "created_at": "2025-06-08T17:25:08", "owner": "kevbramm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029480399476647, "text": "It’s in there blood.", "created_at": "2025-06-08T17:22:44", "owner": "uhuh90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076764979896311, "text": "close enough welcome back Arthur Morgan", "created_at": "2025-06-08T17:22:31", "owner": "ryan_not_trump_ler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068432219476760, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T17:22:00", "owner": "kybrinx", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18065636342489547, "text": "“COMMEERRREE”👹", "created_at": "2025-06-08T17:21:54", "owner": "yallysauce", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18276445570281662, "text": "@eeve.lynnns @itswendyef ahahahaha goals", "created_at": "2025-06-08T17:20:45", "owner": "realgiovas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921418377985279, "text": "This is hilarious 😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T17:20:04", "owner": "qwestproducer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915884371011641, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T17:18:48", "owner": "thepursuitpublication", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17895240555246992, "text": "for sure this is great fun! 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T17:11:42", "owner": "dogs223344", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056284211205201, "text": "Why are you running away from the lord", "created_at": "2025-06-08T17:10:24", "owner": "tonykfc21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041311265298007, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T17:08:18", "owner": "olehelgeantonsen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18509090905028249, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T17:08:13", "owner": "liilkp_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17879471559225353, "text": "i wish i had a horse for this omg", "created_at": "2025-06-08T17:05:15", "owner": "bloodybogwitch", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18038123753330290, "text": "Does the horse comprehend that its just a game or does it think that your arch enemy is your sister", "created_at": "2025-06-08T17:05:07", "owner": "sunnynightsky2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033657953399360, "text": "I’ve been trying to reach you about your cars extended warranty", "created_at": "2025-06-08T17:02:33", "owner": "dtathab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057116615246465, "text": "Ahh yes when I win the lottery this will be one of many signs", "created_at": "2025-06-08T17:02:26", "owner": "karla.ghdz91", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17917417874997349, "text": "Peak older sibling", "created_at": "2025-06-08T16:59:35", "owner": "buieproductions", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17870227311283179, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T16:58:20", "owner": "speaksavvy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051829487458325, "text": "I would do this to random people. Lol", "created_at": "2025-06-08T16:57:57", "owner": "muhsheen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096213967595354, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T16:57:24", "owner": "justshix", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18097457947601830, "text": "Lasso", "created_at": "2025-06-08T16:49:15", "owner": "vega_even", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18062079832932487, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T16:46:04", "owner": "skull_2369", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069744532955269, "text": "Horse running like jack sparrow 🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-08T16:45:34", "owner": "azi._.solit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912692986078968, "text": "gimme them toes", "created_at": "2025-06-08T16:45:22", "owner": "davld23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023999726686996, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T16:44:06", "owner": "captainsazon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141801136398103, "text": "Learn to rope. That would some RDR2 shit!", "created_at": "2025-06-08T16:37:58", "owner": "spite_lip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303177892173940, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T16:35:31", "owner": "leeebenji", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145762522380544, "text": "I chase my little brother with a mower 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T16:33:59", "owner": "maddy_landstrom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847260829493124, "text": "I think all the southern 🫤\n\nCome here boy*", "created_at": "2025-06-08T16:32:17", "owner": "ulfr_rvn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120367198413291, "text": "COME HERE 😈😈", "created_at": "2025-06-08T16:31:18", "owner": "remy_ehab_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17914783515129798, "text": "Get a lasso", "created_at": "2025-06-08T16:30:28", "owner": "himaru_roshen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18518051824031998, "text": "That's one way to exercise your horse and sister 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T16:27:36", "owner": "lamarkandis1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184977403316129, "text": "She running to 😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T16:26:56", "owner": "jazy.land", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065897498107583, "text": "Why am I turned on?", "created_at": "2025-06-08T16:24:41", "owner": "thebeefhammer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057282542223097, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T16:22:48", "owner": "krmgno", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045569861404240, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T16:22:38", "owner": "alenacaluya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928997809062787, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T16:20:01", "owner": "sad__soup", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18507862390054158, "text": "No lasso?", "created_at": "2025-06-08T16:19:50", "owner": "eureekagarcia", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084640333778693, "text": "Next time lasso her!", "created_at": "2025-06-08T16:18:43", "owner": "xenomorphxx121", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18046702739181577, "text": "I need this kind of weigjtloss motivation 😂...where can I sign up", "created_at": "2025-06-08T16:17:30", "owner": "13hennessy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063659651118502, "text": "Look at these two horsing around", "created_at": "2025-06-08T16:17:27", "owner": "jonahpetre", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17951637974971903, "text": "If my oldest did this it would be the last time. If she did it to post it her phone would be in two pieces and the amount of chores she’d be doing would be unlimited.", "created_at": "2025-06-08T16:14:52", "owner": "jpbuckjoycat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063503861278011, "text": "IV  STOLEN mums FLIPSs t chase mine\nWE R BOTH GET TING CHASE NOW help!!!’nnnn", "created_at": "2025-06-08T16:12:40", "owner": "lucathepauli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128745097428951, "text": "“Don’t be part of the problem. Be the whole problem!”", "created_at": "2025-06-08T16:11:43", "owner": "ghengilhar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905993959168599, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T16:11:37", "owner": "tejedaluis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912492883131905, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-06-08T16:11:31", "owner": "ankita__0999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064595807121732, "text": "🤣 @kerrywinterr", "created_at": "2025-06-08T16:09:52", "owner": "chelle_molloy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070553971809243, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T16:09:48", "owner": "saxolotl1534", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096541444575160, "text": "#She’s always my sister 🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-08T16:09:35", "owner": "sa.almousa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18019459469709944, "text": "Excuse me sir, do you have a moment to talk about our Lord and Savior, Jesus Christ? Dont’t run from the LORD, where’re you goin!!", "created_at": "2025-06-08T16:05:56", "owner": "theprettypanda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125998234401367, "text": "Maybe someday your sister can get a horse 🐎", "created_at": "2025-06-08T16:04:57", "owner": "boyd.roland", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069072875503768, "text": "I love this", "created_at": "2025-06-08T16:02:40", "owner": "ctpeacock3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916639186100104, "text": "Put a helmet 🤷🏿‍♂️🤷🏿‍♂️🤷🏿‍♂️🤷🏿‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-06-08T16:02:20", "owner": "luqi7358", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094411774599145, "text": "Yt privilege😂😂😂😂😂😂😂 \"we just want a bite!\"😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T15:52:39", "owner": "stnmtnrich", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014596448549070, "text": "@naomibgood", "created_at": "2025-06-08T15:45:19", "owner": "asiamgood", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041433122303051, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T15:45:16", "owner": "joaco_bruzzo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971019312752835, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T15:43:44", "owner": "edisana14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056985338257990, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T15:41:25", "owner": "3amer.salameh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031909733430855, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T15:41:01", "owner": "kyliemarie4444", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907430005168042, "text": "“Burn those calories girl c’mon”", "created_at": "2025-06-08T15:40:54", "owner": "whiteboiiiwhiz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852219175463750, "text": "Aye she’s pretty fast 🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-08T15:36:08", "owner": "sergioescudero777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091622659620260, "text": "Warum verstehe ich : komm her", "created_at": "2025-06-08T15:33:57", "owner": "danielkleinemaus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922987234086879, "text": "I send my pitbull after my brother, she plays rough 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T15:31:51", "owner": "t3am_pursuit", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18035653118343648, "text": "Is that horse drifting?", "created_at": "2025-06-08T15:30:04", "owner": "micahhaney1000", "likes": 90}, {"id": 18114483862491325, "text": "bro really changed from to cutscene to first person 💀", "created_at": "2025-06-08T15:27:15", "owner": "hendoghd", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18107781511460006, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T15:27:02", "owner": "kh_nazerke02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977014233849460, "text": "Now this is the kind of hobbyhorsing i can get behind", "created_at": "2025-06-08T15:22:05", "owner": "____andrealew", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18330652180165715, "text": "Covarda KKKKKKKKKKKKKKKKKKKKKkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkkk", "created_at": "2025-06-08T15:1