33", "owner": "foamingfeet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926868109070296, "text": "That's so mean. Do it again", "created_at": "2025-06-08T11:40:01", "owner": "mattydtx3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054171281068533, "text": "Where is the lasso", "created_at": "2025-06-08T11:38:12", "owner": "tristankolczok2.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077320687705110, "text": "This is evil", "created_at": "2025-06-08T11:33:31", "owner": "riesling_n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001677365788432, "text": "Lol. Now when that horse will train the baby horse to chase the smaller human.", "created_at": "2025-06-08T11:31:31", "owner": "sabreth23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087270433634375, "text": "Com here 😭🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-08T11:29:00", "owner": "ivhon3sty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088666666565022, "text": "Get a rope and catch her like a pig", "created_at": "2025-06-08T11:28:47", "owner": "dreamboyazzy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078238678876890, "text": "Why did he run sideways 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-06-08T11:28:14", "owner": "julious_mandela", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18283306948302038, "text": "Please Use a Lasso for your own safety", "created_at": "2025-06-08T11:22:10", "owner": "gaaaauuuurrraaaavvv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068006888047110, "text": "Custer on his conquest before Little Bighorn (colorized) *", "created_at": "2025-06-08T11:20:29", "owner": "adammiller21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935428390030385, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T11:20:25", "owner": "abdulkareem_a_h", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072391417763490, "text": "Jajajajajajajjajaa", "created_at": "2025-06-08T11:19:07", "owner": "fernandovaldez1409", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18314953921230876, "text": "Well, Well, Well 🗣️", "created_at": "2025-06-08T11:13:47", "owner": "uv400nero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069986497818403, "text": "bro is a ruthless bandit roaming the western territories in the 1860s", "created_at": "2025-06-08T11:12:11", "owner": "a_schmidy_botanist", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18058994831269707, "text": "……………………🤣😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-08T11:09:33", "owner": "illmigo_uno", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882060823204620, "text": "Wait until you learn to rope", "created_at": "2025-06-08T11:04:48", "owner": "martin_browser", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092117086530566, "text": "We wear poor so I didn't had a sister (only child) 🙏🥀", "created_at": "2025-06-08T11:02:44", "owner": "_caretus_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967358655876145, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T11:00:08", "owner": "fahhimzasza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18345357475080964, "text": "Burn those calories 😂😂😭", "created_at": "2025-06-08T10:54:05", "owner": "mar.bella_23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063824675161922, "text": "Seems like fun. Where do I sign up?", "created_at": "2025-06-08T10:48:37", "owner": "destinycomfy1337", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089008138722407, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T10:47:38", "owner": "oktv.sadama", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077603305872157, "text": "🤣😭", "created_at": "2025-06-08T10:44:09", "owner": "i_hill0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060648086275556, "text": "Thanks for reminding me how ugly I am", "created_at": "2025-06-08T10:40:48", "owner": "rahlemar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092504440613242, "text": "Now you need a lasso and start catching her", "created_at": "2025-06-08T10:40:44", "owner": "pumpkinking.2025", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18166593796352344, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T10:36:48", "owner": "rishi21611", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928361446057967, "text": "Why the house crib walking", "created_at": "2025-06-08T10:34:07", "owner": "dobhalabhinav", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18275459818284547, "text": "Almost Like Arthur Morgan from RdR 2 Like come on boy!!!😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T10:31:05", "owner": "kaskadermik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867466207310884, "text": "and me my twin is pretty close now", "created_at": "2025-06-08T10:27:18", "owner": "alecyoung591", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069565387973807, "text": "I once did this to my sister, with a car of course", "created_at": "2025-06-08T10:25:52", "owner": "surya_jith_denny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18509779528053432, "text": "When I was a kid, I used to chase my sister with a knife and me and my twin brother also got in a fight when we were kids and I stabbed him with a stick knife right next to the heart he’s still alive. He just don’t dare to get near me when I have a knife. after that day, a couple days after that, he smashed my head off of a hardwood chair.", "created_at": "2025-06-08T10:25:31", "owner": "alecyoung591", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849222226481238, "text": "Run Forrest! Run!!", "created_at": "2025-06-08T10:24:46", "owner": "hikoisbored", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960268299943474, "text": "don’t judge if one day i just", "created_at": "2025-06-08T10:24:22", "owner": "axxmmetova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865274893403237, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-08T10:21:22", "owner": "alecyoung591", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913974415104437, "text": "we just wanna play 🗣️", "created_at": "2025-06-08T10:14:50", "owner": "jessica.mae.r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028616807661196, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-08T10:08:28", "owner": "jjaw4608187", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974242785889730, "text": "A missed opportunity 😔", "created_at": "2025-06-08T10:02:33", "owner": "akborum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912107167142248, "text": "@samiraa_safavii @soheylasafavii 🚶🏻‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-06-08T10:00:55", "owner": "sevdasafavi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083497534682650, "text": "Get a lasso", "created_at": "2025-06-08T09:56:34", "owner": "_rochbeben_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973006299902556, "text": "I used to chase my brothers with a cow turd on a stick, they had incentive to run faster.", "created_at": "2025-06-08T09:53:57", "owner": "trogdortheb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969444408875984, "text": "Paint her black, there is more fun.", "created_at": "2025-06-08T09:52:54", "owner": "dr_zi.vado", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062483368935939, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-08T09:47:26", "owner": "liamish21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876595900242293, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😭😭", "created_at": "2025-06-08T09:42:04", "owner": "roman.wehbe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978746829841858, "text": "Lasso her", "created_at": "2025-06-08T09:41:54", "owner": "shkar.007_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090840094626740, "text": "Come here👹", "created_at": "2025-06-08T09:41:53", "owner": "gonzales__2499", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025287290497043, "text": "STOP🗣️STOP🏃‍♀️‍➡️STOP👟STOP💨", "created_at": "2025-06-08T09:39:08", "owner": "morroncherry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097179088505062, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T09:36:37", "owner": "itszgood", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081410203811984, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T09:34:24", "owner": "yummyr1ss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992881923650986, "text": "One person gets really fit 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T09:29:34", "owner": "gunbarul_3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881082754317856, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T09:29:08", "owner": "hussan.afg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071009575782626, "text": "This is pretty much how the targaryen civil war started", "created_at": "2025-06-08T09:28:30", "owner": "icanchangethisatanytime_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074237590921994, "text": "COME HERE.👹🗣️ COME HERE👹", "created_at": "2025-06-08T09:26:18", "owner": "_jam_lee", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18110305936446725, "text": "so i take it she is afraid of horses 🤔 i mean it looks fun enough. but all my friends who are scared of things, are usually scared of spiders. if only i knew where to get the horse sized arachnid mount to chase them.", "created_at": "2025-06-08T09:09:04", "owner": "aleksejs.skorodumovs", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070168621993293, "text": "My parents just chased me with constant disappointment", "created_at": "2025-06-08T09:07:21", "owner": "riazu_j", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096336580508203, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T09:05:49", "owner": "vass_csanad", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17898614184215617, "text": "Do u say \"Kom her\"?🗣️🗣️", "created_at": "2025-06-08T09:04:45", "owner": "_c.e_94_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18513126739048491, "text": "Come heyaa🗣️🗣️🗣️🗣️😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T08:59:46", "owner": "beckxamillie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081386638795762, "text": "Mine used to chase me w a knife", "created_at": "2025-06-08T08:46:49", "owner": "haalbehaalhaiji", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056605010214541, "text": "Why is the horse in 𝓘𝓽𝓪𝓵𝓲𝓬𝓼", "created_at": "2025-06-08T08:45:19", "owner": "rishab_prasoon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061405808472032, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T08:44:11", "owner": "sunmansg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069173588484235, "text": "You have the instinct of a medieval knight high on his own feudal power", "created_at": "2025-06-08T08:41:57", "owner": "hellmuth.son.of.hellmuth", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17951817377979027, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T08:40:10", "owner": "titoun29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102964945536450, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T08:35:32", "owner": "1ynx._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18509748868040519, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T08:32:28", "owner": "christian__b14", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047494952177967, "text": "Lasso her", "created_at": "2025-06-08T08:32:06", "owner": "bahramsmoke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030447770664340, "text": "This looks fun", "created_at": "2025-06-08T08:28:35", "owner": "belles_.equestrian._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070310560797126, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T08:24:54", "owner": "peeekab0o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295839367220388, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T08:16:36", "owner": "piano.with.parsa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058266596186708, "text": "Damn,why your horse drifting?", "created_at": "2025-06-08T07:59:11", "owner": "qx.31a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066676787093494, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T07:55:33", "owner": "pretty_d1eg0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058917068221616, "text": "Dame on some red dead redemption tasks right here", "created_at": "2025-06-08T07:48:16", "owner": "theeabarcaguy007", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063227768152659, "text": "If you throw a net over her it’s like playing Planet of the Apes.👍🏼🦍", "created_at": "2025-06-08T07:40:06", "owner": "sunnyg8r", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18515654068001366, "text": "If you ask me what my favourite hobby is🎀🎀🎀 a few moments later COME HERE🗣️🗣️", "created_at": "2025-06-08T07:40:00", "owner": "rudraksh_7710", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302505013246697, "text": "The next time PLEASE take a sword or a spear with you 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-08T07:34:18", "owner": "andreou_ilias", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945912492997217, "text": "I would be tempted to bring a net", "created_at": "2025-06-08T07:31:43", "owner": "theflyingstud", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119081902422903, "text": "Hahahaha yep, sure used to", "created_at": "2025-06-08T07:12:13", "owner": "littlerabbit57", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030997331444596, "text": "Wrangler her ass", "created_at": "2025-06-08T07:04:45", "owner": "sansom1149", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18279078013258726, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T06:58:50", "owner": "alexandervhugo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028611272670034, "text": "You holding the camera weird or does your horse run like a spaz?", "created_at": "2025-06-08T06:47:13", "owner": "bradleylow__", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17848205526484951, "text": "Mine was the fork when the knife wasn’t available", "created_at": "2025-06-08T06:41:06", "owner": "maddsebaggs", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18341045398095218, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T06:40:41", "owner": "jayvailey", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17849329545478850, "text": "\"BURN THEM CALORIES GIRL COME ON\" is sooooo me core🤣😭", "created_at": "2025-06-08T06:25:16", "owner": "brookecookie469", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18043481936548094, "text": "Alignment’s off a bit", "created_at": "2025-06-08T06:25:09", "owner": "clairity.grace", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18018308441707648, "text": "😭😭idk how ur sis still alive", "created_at": "2025-06-08T06:24:55", "owner": "noneoftheyear76", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014568761548181