 terrifying for her lolol", "created_at": "2025-06-08T05:11:02", "owner": "zorasaturn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064548485291024, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T05:09:30", "owner": "itsurbwoybill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18274860037280250, "text": "dont say dracarys bymistake", "created_at": "2025-06-08T05:08:39", "owner": "srajanacharya_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068027819048982, "text": "Omg Id yell I've been trying to reach you about your cars extended warranty! 🗣️🗣️", "created_at": "2025-06-08T05:06:04", "owner": "l.ostman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066663671087730, "text": "🙄🫩", "created_at": "2025-06-08T05:05:49", "owner": "_dthemyscira76", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954118245955798, "text": "😂😂🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-08T04:50:58", "owner": "thunderhawk_streamer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376439278124537, "text": "The fact the horse running in slow motion so she gers away😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T04:49:50", "owner": "funnybritz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066386024046851, "text": "I do this to my sibling, but I also rope them", "created_at": "2025-06-08T04:48:16", "owner": "western.werewolf.studios", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046751000184341, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T04:42:56", "owner": "lildetroit1990", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882133156199619, "text": "Who’s single ❤️", "created_at": "2025-06-08T04:42:48", "owner": "kdm19_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093530896594051, "text": "Burn those calories girl come on 😭😭🗣️", "created_at": "2025-06-08T04:41:22", "owner": "kaosvibes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925053972964081, "text": "Didn't know horses run sideways", "created_at": "2025-06-08T04:37:26", "owner": "wolfxd_art", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082665055688692, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T04:29:16", "owner": "rhandikai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893720635247915, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T04:28:35", "owner": "likewhatbye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084470257664166, "text": "That  was sexy af", "created_at": "2025-06-08T04:27:58", "owner": "special_k_real_ting_dis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859274590377236, "text": "The way you say \" come ere!\"", "created_at": "2025-06-08T04:22:53", "owner": "institutionstew", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17913025887135556, "text": "LMAOOOOO🤣😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-06-08T04:22:52", "owner": "izdzy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951517050971741, "text": "She's got the *you gone pick that cotton boy* voice", "created_at": "2025-06-08T04:20:12", "owner": "peter_and_18_others", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073491868901085, "text": "You single 🥺? So rare to see old school female", "created_at": "2025-06-08T04:13:37", "owner": "aurnob_censored", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909078079116785, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T04:12:27", "owner": "adv_yashoodev_singh_thakur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083151478741533, "text": "I chased my sister on my horse", "created_at": "2025-06-08T04:08:06", "owner": "macie.davenport_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057115055193136, "text": "My sister and I used to play tag on our horses 🥰🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-08T04:06:55", "owner": "hailey_abbott_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992943465800635, "text": "Why was the horse walking slanted?😭", "created_at": "2025-06-08T04:05:45", "owner": "moon_flower.exe", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17913401805103807, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T04:05:30", "owner": "the_brother_q", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18362266294179398, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T04:01:02", "owner": "tashas.belle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862057780349030, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T04:00:34", "owner": "cd15_elite", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867561874309134, "text": "You should carry a whip next time 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T03:56:12", "owner": "cpt.chicken", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959443179948811, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-08T03:55:41", "owner": "sour_ume", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18294818425222211, "text": "Does every older sibling say “c’mere” the same lmao", "created_at": "2025-06-08T03:51:19", "owner": "domwasright", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033966194384721, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T03:50:45", "owner": "656n.n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977888187712071, "text": "we just wanna bite🗣️", "created_at": "2025-06-08T03:48:41", "owner": "r.r_shoikot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052132856096404, "text": "😂😂😂 should add the lassov", "created_at": "2025-06-08T03:43:35", "owner": "allthingswesley1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861892276356639, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-08T03:43:11", "owner": "qwaisha.sweeps", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931156101942606, "text": "the horse is running in italics", "created_at": "2025-06-08T03:42:55", "owner": "mohineetvirdi", "likes": 9637}, {"id": 18067932479291725, "text": "Looks fun tho 🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-08T03:41:54", "owner": "krggguan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967773606764308, "text": "Is bro drifting?", "created_at": "2025-06-08T03:40:20", "owner": "ramanswastik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18405811327105888, "text": "CAHHMM HERE 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T03:36:03", "owner": "lyssornelaz", "likes": 567}, {"id": 18017873363523332, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-08T03:33:57", "owner": "rprior_088", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908701669150958, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-08T03:32:26", "owner": "denzilsnaggs", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070765936791033, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T03:25:56", "owner": "nickjr_87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087983980641370, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T03:25:37", "owner": "baobanger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18346385563094391, "text": "And you did all that without a lasso??? 🤠", "created_at": "2025-06-08T03:21:19", "owner": "weirdo_.who._watches", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18507128317035770, "text": "“We just wanna bite” 😆", "created_at": "2025-06-08T03:21:18", "owner": "dknigs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047358770411265, "text": "My sister chased me with a clothes hanger, this isn’t fair", "created_at": "2025-06-08T03:20:04", "owner": "mellysomerville", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17913483330104854, "text": "We just want a buck young buck 😐🤨", "created_at": "2025-06-08T03:17:07", "owner": "juliojonjr301", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18504191740043245, "text": "Back then, i made her my horse", "created_at": "2025-06-08T03:09:34", "owner": "tteoktwinks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994274304802859, "text": "“excuse me ma’am, but we are calling about your cars extended warranty”", "created_at": "2025-06-08T03:08:24", "owner": "dollfvcex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18375429373120544, "text": "REAL👏😍", "created_at": "2025-06-08T03:06:23", "owner": "islarayvirtue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18273548905275844, "text": "Bro going to collect taxes from the peasant 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T02:58:51", "owner": "ashu42003singh", "likes": 27}, {"id": 17864138190408224, "text": "Her ethnic history makes this video interesting…", "created_at": "2025-06-08T02:51:37", "owner": "warriorkoakai", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18088496263567484, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-06-08T02:50:20", "owner": "michaeladuerson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18402493255107162, "text": "Lasso her", "created_at": "2025-06-08T02:49:29", "owner": "idonteatspiders", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085172875674341, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T02:49:10", "owner": "ashby_scribblez", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17989770920814810, "text": "@sooj._.ing 아니이거 몬데웃기지", "created_at": "2025-06-08T02:48:56", "owner": "god.seungchul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18507901471028550, "text": "Love how the voice changes as soon as the horse starts moving.😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T02:47:19", "owner": "le_connoissur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18510315124055433, "text": "This shit right here is one of many reasons horse girls  are frowned upon 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T02:46:50", "owner": "submittoshy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058425308242692, "text": "So do you bill by the hour or session for being a person trainer ?😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T02:46:22", "owner": "howie.pearson.14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18508176121025243, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T02:44:52", "owner": "daking_detailing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046718330181322, "text": "You’d catch me with a pike formation with the boiz lmao", "created_at": "2025-06-08T02:42:45", "owner": "erskineaveron", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18285406429271965, "text": "😂😂😂😂🗣️🗣️🗣️🗣️🗣️", "created_at": "2025-06-08T02:31:18", "owner": "abovegroundproduction", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18280678603253030, "text": "𝘖 𝘮 𝘢 𝘨 𝘢 𝘢 𝘢 ! ! ! 😱", "created_at": "2025-06-08T02:30:13", "owner": "ucapan_seorang_pendosa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926982445075011, "text": "𝘖𝘩 𝘔𝘺 𝘌𝘺𝘦𝘴 ! ! ! ✨👀✨", "created_at": "2025-06-08T02:30:11", "owner": "ucapan_seorang_pendosa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982603161835234, "text": "𝘎𝘸𝘦𝘯𝘤𝘩𝘢𝘯𝘢² ! ! ! 💔🫂❤️‍🩹", "created_at": "2025-06-08T02:30:08", "owner": "ucapan_seorang_pendosa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066054181869150, "text": "𝘗𝘰𝘱𝘤𝘰𝘳𝘯 𝘨𝘶𝘺𝘴 ! ! ! 🔥୧⍤⃝🍿🔥", "created_at": "2025-06-08T02:30:05", "owner": "ucapan_seorang_pendosa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060204887180335, "text": "𝘙𝘶𝘯 𝘉𝘦𝘴𝘵𝘪𝘦 𝘙𝘶𝘯 ! ! ! 🌈. . .🤸🏻‍♀️ . . . 🚩. . .", "created_at": "2025-06-08T02:29:59", "owner": "ucapan_seorang_pendosa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18510812314017772, "text": "This hobby may have been passed down a couple generations....y'all used to chase us for fun to, U might wanna look into that😕", "created_at": "2025-06-08T02:29:55", "owner": "clairely1me", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982582767832260, "text": "Id get a lasso", "created_at": "2025-06-08T02:27:04", "owner": "an_it.nam3d_e", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17967999809868494, "text": "What his name", "created_at": "2025-06-08T02:24:39", "owner": "alias_slime._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897018703228320, "text": "“Come here boy” 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T02:23:41", "owner": "rayscrashingworld", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067031741101640, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T02:17:09", "owner": "chillin_panda_420", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065992034038400, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T02:15:36", "owner": "couthlesssst", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097822972561416, "text": "I had that hobby too but had to stop because my horse would get waaaay too into trying to run her down 😂😂😂 she really would have been a great cattle horse lol", "created_at": "2025-06-08T02:14:49", "owner": "hobbit_in_spirit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141586894401082, "text": "Where's your lasso cowgurl?", "created_at": "2025-06-08T02:14:08", "owner": "eggroll62947", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164716222356780, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T02:11:35", "owner": "potterhead199494", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17925165510080449, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-08T02:10:58", "owner": "desmondluque", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077580349857043, "text": "See, this is the type of trainer I need but have yet to find. The algorithm is always right😌", "created_at": "2025-06-08T02:10:45", "owner": "cindylou956", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049289918148085, "text": "I want to do this now", "created_at": "2025-06-08T02:09:53", "owner": "fall_isthe_best", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17942257670887840, "text": "😂😂😂gd 1", "created_at": "2025-06-08T02:02:44", "owner": "siva_v16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18391197967188778, "text": "Bully 🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-08T02:01:16", "owner": "roach622", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087986935637126, "text": "This is how I want my girls to grow up to be like", "created_at": "2025-06-08T02:01:05", "owner": "charlemagnecw", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084084034739186, "text": "Do you by any chance know how to rope cattle? I'm trying to see something.", "created_at": "2025-06-08T01:53:55", "owner": "nathan_lindekens", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058038827192504, "text": "Your ancestors did something similar to mine", "created_at": "2025-06-08T01:51:30", "owner": "large.bag.of.lays", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067086364995429, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T01:48:46", "owner": "dudeonetonothin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065463377024906, "text": "😂😂🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-08T01:46:17", "owner": "justus77799", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886910041274407, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T01:44:30", "owner": "steph2890_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995374173799084, "text": "Is it me or the horse is drifting? 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T01:42:17", "owner": "fa.rojasx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083007451708236, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T01:37:45", "owner": "fashioned_iman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086119696670377, "text": "My friends and I used to rope each other 🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-08T01:36:50", "owner": "outdoorkase", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18319404235224621, "text": "The trauma is going to make the younger sister an excellent comedian", "created_at": "2025-06-08T01:36:48", "owner": "rob.maxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064664798484212, "text": "Why is she running", "created_at": "2025-06-08T01:36:32", "owner": "ericscott__1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915231358131558, "text": "@abiupwall lmao", "created_at": "2025-06-08T01:34:48", "owner": "huan_say_hii", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18144202003400402, "text": "Not the horse running sideways 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T01:34:06", "owner": "part_vibes420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945982036002434, "text": "I like horses now but when I was in the 7th grade in Tampa Florida, the school horse almost bit my nipple off through my shirt during agricultural class. That scarred me for a few years", "created_at": "2025-06-08T01:33:01", "owner": "cardomarcielo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068281976044654, "text": "😂😂😂🤣😭🤣😭👏👏❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-06-08T01:32:47", "owner": "mrblack37413", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092153020609224, "text": "I wanna do it with my brother", "created_at": "2025-06-08T01:29:18", "owner": "itsmyaltego", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18271439506278575, "text": "Hahahha", "created_at": "2025-06-08T01:28:54", "owner": "corrinaaamack", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107246230511485, "text": "Burn them calories gurl 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-06-08T01:25:26", "owner": "pretty_face_vare11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063308555173381, "text": "“this is horse shit” 🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-08T01:20:10", "owner": "mmmmmhead", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087242002646255, "text": "Get the lasso out 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T01:19:20", "owner": "dj_mistapipsta", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17904944814179273, "text": "Oldest sibling hobbies", "created_at": "2025-06-08T01:18:18", "owner": "rob3.1415926535897", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061504787515034, "text": "I JUS WANNA TAWK TO YOU! lol", "created_at": "2025-06-08T01:18:09", "owner": "drew_da_loo86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865305340327666, "text": "I have 3 sisters and now 3 good reasons to get a horse", "created_at": "2025-06-08T01:18:07", "owner": "artistformerlyknownasdan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058109978260314, "text": "@kayteedooley", "created_at": "2025-06-08T01:16:13", "owner": "that_j.i.g.g.a.__pat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845923609497701, "text": "Her great great grandaddy came out in those \"come heahs\"! Ole Colonel Talbot!", "created_at": "2025-06-08T01:11:52", "owner": "the_mighty_bo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903012751191112, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T01:11:38", "owner": "brandnewbabyzzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072540625766423, "text": "Don't send tobby away, tobby be good for your han boss, good for han master", "created_at": "2025-06-08T01:09:02", "owner": "reverse_mopar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054206567356642, "text": "🤣🤣🤣😁😁😁🤭🤭🤭👍🙋‍♂️🙏🙏🙏🐎", "created_at": "2025-06-08T01:08:02", "owner": "kevinaustin1868", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057874973516685, "text": "This reminds me of that video of the donkey chasing the goats around", "created_at": "2025-06-08T01:06:46", "owner": "landonmaynes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034679681343483, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T01:05:48", "owner": "matthewd_johnson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887130073274440, "text": "Damn. I definitely missed an opportunity when I had my horse.", "created_at": "2025-06-08T01:01:02", "owner": "l.hemingway207", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056834621193442, "text": "JAJAJAJJAJAJAJAJ", "created_at": "2025-06-08T01:00:35", "owner": "syarha._.p", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054457304069183, "text": "🔥🔥🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-08T00:57:17", "owner": "lcstopshop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049746653379358, "text": "You need a lasoe. 🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-08T00:55:28", "owner": "vincediaz911", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002956061786297, "text": "\"We've been trying to reach you about your cars extended warranty \"", "created_at": "2025-06-08T00:53:13", "owner": "dannyschlemm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049615703587536, "text": "\"Come heaaa\" 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T00:52:40", "owner": "jayyseals", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18110051614446591, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T00:49:48", "owner": "gen_demfrmto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045286958213909, "text": "Run run! 🤣😭", "created_at": "2025-06-08T00:49:24", "owner": "sniperfox_22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18502777144053857, "text": "Your so generous you gave her a distance head start how loving and kind!❤️", "created_at": "2025-06-08T00:46:11", "owner": "kerseysadie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141348055363260, "text": "No thanks... P-Diddy", "created_at": "2025-06-08T00:42:27", "owner": "thomas____________thomas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935527078019574, "text": "This is why I need a horse also because i’m too blind to drive", "created_at": "2025-06-08T00:42:04", "owner": "jr_im_so_cold", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929964553062664, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T00:41:23", "owner": "d4vid.nsr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046667489192828, "text": "Why is the horse running in italics", "created_at": "2025-06-08T00:40:26", "owner": "jjuspamm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985247577686171, "text": "@theyfw_.teiiii 💝", "created_at": "2025-06-08T00:38:53", "owner": "kaistariver", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18158312050365585, "text": "“STOP! Stop! Stop……. Stop! Stawp! This is (idk what she said)”", "created_at": "2025-06-08T00:36:59", "owner": "halleys_comet_16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097673317566172, "text": "And that's what you call the middle child 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T00:35:38", "owner": "bushboyliam101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067554515071590, "text": "Arthur Morgan style antagonizing", "created_at": "2025-06-08T00:33:01", "owner": "starsandsun99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011496278566743, "text": "Evil 😂😍", "created_at": "2025-06-08T00:29:12", "owner": "lindsay_aka_ling.ling", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978268878712555, "text": "“RUN” 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T00:24:33", "owner": "seththraxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888409153271873, "text": "You’re a good man Arthur Morgan", "created_at": "2025-06-08T00:19:44", "owner": "sc.arroll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054410120366437, "text": "I hope your sister grows up to chase you and your horse on her elephant 🐘", "created_at": "2025-06-08T00:19:39", "owner": "johnnyrob321", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867380845307323, "text": "My sister would chase me with her car 😞🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-06-08T00:19:34", "owner": "malak_s_g_r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032788073657881, "text": "I guarantee this is also the horse's favorite hobby", "created_at": "2025-06-08T00:19:03", "owner": "faux_tographer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18358332808150627, "text": "This would also have been my favorite hobby", "created_at": "2025-06-08T00:18:11", "owner": "faux_tographer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066476443875687, "text": "@the_western_mossback this reminds me of when you ran me over with your bike", "created_at": "2025-06-08T00:17:46", "owner": "coraejarrett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043627274632546, "text": "Why is the horse running sideways 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-08T00:16:18", "owner": "nicholasdh_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030817538440584, "text": "@jlsherwood23", "created_at": "2025-06-08T00:15:43", "owner": "kelley_surewould", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062305940177204, "text": "What’s another hobbie you have?", "created_at": "2025-06-08T00:12:38", "owner": "metro_lo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973402749853250, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T00:11:14", "owner": "jubba_the_gut123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116328295488624, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-08T00:08:46", "owner": "changingufarm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077686093853020, "text": "Ahaha I like how the horse pulls away like “woooh Nelly we about to run ole girl over!!” An it hears the older sister hootin’ 🦉 in excitement and it doubles down like “oooooh you wanna run down ole girl? 👧 okay bet 👌🏽🐎 (looks directly at the girl as it bolts forward)” ahaha.", "created_at": "2025-06-08T00:08:20", "owner": "dishesbydoole", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873358081362660, "text": "I had a nightmare almost got ran over by a blue dump truck doing 200", "created_at": "2025-06-08T00:05:58", "owner": "treymarsh40", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953620458825274, "text": "Good sisters", "created_at": "2025-06-08T00:04:50", "owner": "freemandirk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044384261563182, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-08T00:02:01", "owner": "ki_lu17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128748436431720, "text": "@ellie.savage1 hallie😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-06-08T00:01:10", "owner": "elladory_2", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18031972385666148, "text": "Meanie head, burn those calories, really, she's fine as she is", "created_at": "2025-06-08T00:00:59", "owner": "nobodycareanyway13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912444190111405, "text": "Lasso that sb", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:58:23", "owner": "fisherman_258", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097176955568780, "text": "Can you chase me too, i need to lose 10kg 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:57:26", "owner": "nurshafirahh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124936954453205, "text": "we just wanna bite???😭😭", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:57:24", "owner": "dragons_artist_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102403093541771, "text": "It’s giving vine vibes", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:56:43", "owner": "__hederahelix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050591756592969, "text": "Did she say \"Come here, we just want to bite” ??", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:56:07", "owner": "r8nex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028894394471807, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:56:00", "owner": "blue.sky7236", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007641494771937, "text": "Arthur Morgan Simulator 2025", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:55:57", "owner": "relentless_as_the_tides", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18284955700268292, "text": "We were broke so my cousin chased me around with a knife and a lighter", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:54:02", "owner": "i.n.d_comics", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117468946486299, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:53:48", "owner": "jabbarlaw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002597423792486, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:52:03", "owner": "workman3246", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034633664372658, "text": "This seems like something from Family Guy 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:51:53", "owner": "skelton_iii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128784280440047, "text": "“We just wanna buck” lmaooooo", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:51:05", "owner": "decently_recently", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078236011845643, "text": "Crib walking", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:49:10", "owner": "hellsingerbk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146552986391320, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:48:22", "owner": "hufflepuff_hermit_witch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879391969224594, "text": "Your little sister is track star!!", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:46:50", "owner": "akira_olmilla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034738733376071, "text": "I know you're lying, she doesn't look like she's used to run", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:44:59", "owner": "vzgustavo7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035697845663305, "text": "Haha😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:44:23", "owner": "unclecreepykris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041143337545909, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:43:29", "owner": "benny_dough", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073923268913552, "text": "Valid", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:43:17", "owner": "saesi.04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304761583240752, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:43:08", "owner": "benny_dough", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948382848992146, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:43:07", "owner": "patrickdoesstuff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18410609149103994, "text": "Lasso her 😭", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:41:49", "owner": "dj.amika", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932236660050765, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:41:24", "owner": "dj.amika", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887894638268186, "text": "It would be sp funny if your horse just starts chasing your sister without you 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:41:12", "owner": "robdrobot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030124364465176, "text": "Come here BOAH", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:39:20", "owner": "isaacnojabroni", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17996172116640420, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:36:13", "owner": "xavier17712024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18508236988048901, "text": "Shorten this and it would've did numbers on vine", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:35:02", "owner": "mm_hyena", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014384378546236, "text": "Mine chased me with a bat", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:34:39", "owner": "waffle_lord7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041869016300865, "text": "The Mongolian horde would be proud", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:32:06", "owner": "ten_trillion_termites", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097874614563114, "text": "You give me Shailene Woodley vibes and iiiii like it 😎👍🏾", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:28:46", "owner": "j4y_r_7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934380699915750, "text": "Who brought back slavery", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:28:04", "owner": "samrand__24", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070334203790910, "text": "This is so evil. I need a horse. 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:27:28", "owner": "fire.wine.victory", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951074376967736, "text": "It would be so funny if the horse started doing this alone", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:27:19", "owner": "shupe_unofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874601077360032, "text": "Com’ere 🗣️‼️👹👹", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:27:03", "owner": "gabrieloduyemi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043025426259608, "text": "Lucky that horse isn’t a little more cow-y lol", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:25:59", "owner": "siren_says_so", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18312916027239085, "text": "Lasso her like cattle while you're at it why don't ya?", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:24:19", "owner": "kyleigh.__hill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902833891191973, "text": "Literally my fav thing ever!!!", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:24:19", "owner": "alicen_wedig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140175124406014, "text": "Get a lasso", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:24:17", "owner": "forggyfan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17927593131064584, "text": "I know that horse is a quarter horse bc he's 100% on board with chasing things", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:21:03", "owner": "theoiler95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067130411512004, "text": "When she used the drill sergeant voice; that’s when I could tell she was in it for the love of the game.", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:19:57", "owner": "onigoshua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067178027089869, "text": "COMEER🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:18:06", "owner": "meagababe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18357696166148173, "text": "Get some of those pop it things and toss them at her😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:13:38", "owner": "williamfm1996", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18054077387360265, "text": "Where’s the lasso at?", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:13:15", "owner": "zachtennessee", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18294604885216212, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:13:07", "owner": "issa_me_mighty", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18025833776694816, "text": "I’m dead.", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:13:06", "owner": "jannibal_lectard", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18054422909360454, "text": "Pov: hun warrior chasing Roman comitatensis, circa 440 AD", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:10:26", "owner": "fireflyocean21", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086732896588111, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:07:32", "owner": "_hareish.r10__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056122340465725, "text": "You need to get a whip! Whip that bitch!", "created_at": "2025-06-07T23:06:48", "owner": "augustus_gaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036660896338900, "text": "I love this !!!", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:58:51", "owner": "emma68741", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961063611930763, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:58:28", "owner": "aligned__alchemy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17896875762226891, "text": "Tell me your family rich without saying it 🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:57:37", "owner": "doe.troy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070597846791205, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:57:21", "owner": "luxor_rr87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950375160844100, "text": "FREEZE", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:54:41", "owner": "multisa888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18390553576184224, "text": "I want to buy her a  horse or a dirt bike it doesn’t seem fair", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:54:10", "owner": "enricodelgado", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934235341018589, "text": "😂😂👏👏", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:54:06", "owner": "2099parkk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064577774162190, "text": "Question Where’s her Horse?", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:52:50", "owner": "enricodelgado", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055113869461287, "text": "So Cute", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:52:21", "owner": "enricodelgado", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053377604600977, "text": "😂🔥", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:51:38", "owner": "cloudsbesmoking", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067823149983888, "text": "“COM EYA”", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:50:10", "owner": "my_name_is_javin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927571966075713, "text": "I apparently chased mine with a hammer and threatened her with it, I guess a horse works too😭", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:50:05", "owner": "mochaurso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18345570859093749, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:49:15", "owner": "viper_actual", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990543864810445, "text": "Horse experiencing a blood memory of running down Roman auxiliaries in Anatolia", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:48:33", "owner": "joshua.pape", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056784329197777, "text": "My sister hates horses and it started when I was 5 and has continued since then and I still do it today so real", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:48:19", "owner": "olivia.katebarrett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006315668602052, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:47:45", "owner": "v.ibeswithmo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873582961266131, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:45:17", "owner": "bendykanak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046748069185898, "text": "Chased her down like she was a runaway slave", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:44:06", "owner": "seryeeticus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068674667493282, "text": "Why does he look like he's running sideways", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:43:59", "owner": "2x.wtss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070154401978234, "text": "👏👏😂 great use of a younger sibling hahah", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:40:47", "owner": "mustardtiger1688", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055639859058961, "text": "You’re terrible… you’re extremely funny and hilarious, but you’re a terrible sister and possibly human if you actually hurt your sister. This POV of your sister running for her life was enough to make milk bubbles from my nose though.🤣👍🏽🤭", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:37:32", "owner": "niko.havok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041602397280754, "text": "Bro.💀😭", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:36:40", "owner": "daniel_palero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158662525364308, "text": "Her second favorite hobby is lassoing her sister from the back of her horse", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:35:20", "owner": "pickle.jenner", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17870274339382347, "text": "I bet it hits them deep plantation owner roots", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:35:16", "owner": "kydreads", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858360223433426, "text": "👹COME HERE", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:35:03", "owner": "akpolynesian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047425490578939, "text": "Heritage not hate 🙏🏿", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:34:55", "owner": "williamslyfestyle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101221738555813, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:33:28", "owner": "4braahm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044675801233150, "text": "You should get a water gun and do it 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:31:18", "owner": "chaunceysrj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917422320997148, "text": "Um maybe you shouldn’t do that because you could actually kill her. I know it may seem funny but it’s actually dangerous. You actually kind of sort of incriminate yourself. I know your parents didn’t teach you or responsibility, but I’m letting you know that this is not OK.", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:30:49", "owner": "tansusie13", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17887311264272898, "text": "One day she's gonna make you an offer you can't refuse.", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:30:12", "owner": "ieduhs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18279077071284924, "text": "Why is the horse drifting 😂🙏🕊️", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:29:57", "owner": "jubal_mathew", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087135823653575, "text": "Get her her own horse and each of you armour, then joust", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:28:57", "owner": "violetfuller_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079308691836889, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:26:04", "owner": "ge0463_cap0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095231302598629, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:24:45", "owner": "ifnasara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301294849172680, "text": "That is messed up, but hilarious", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:24:24", "owner": "the_gingerilla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985066401820665, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:21:58", "owner": "chava.reyes98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074010568920123, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:16:29", "owner": "bojjisa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863160460410392, "text": "Wish I had access to a horse during these years", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:15:35", "owner": "wolf_butts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957258786797260, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:12:33", "owner": "leelacrissy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095179504524235, "text": "Me and come here", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:09:41", "owner": "ashleeiscoolforlife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907422862160492, "text": "“COME MERE”", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:09:22", "owner": "_shaboingus_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052488590366746, "text": "“Come here! 👹😈 come here! 😈👹”", "created_at": "2025-06-07T22:04:28", "owner": "s.r.s86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848660398483956, "text": "COME EYA🗣️‼️🔊 RUHN‼️🗣️🔊", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:58:24", "owner": "jiminy_spigot", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18126275800447697, "text": "good idea 💡 🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:57:12", "owner": "helen_razx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080094166826708, "text": "@3zzzzra 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:57:04", "owner": "realexoticskottie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061885177917673, "text": "I don't believe you, it's the same hobby as my sister. 😢", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:56:33", "owner": "wntrbearmak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18283637239248190, "text": "I wish my sister did this to me", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:56:06", "owner": "hawkishbynature", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18165309913354427, "text": "She's gonna hate horses as an adult 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:55:35", "owner": "donetellog", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007185836767338, "text": "Hahahah if I had a horse I would have chased my sister like this 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:54:57", "owner": "rasto_not_rasta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842802124504903, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:53:40", "owner": "chunkyboyz832", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960590496927826, "text": "How much horsepower", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:52:58", "owner": "chunkyboyz832", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080598793775029, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:51:31", "owner": "eddie.rs87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044652665574258, "text": "lol okay so I need to learn to ride a horse so i can harass my siblings too 😭", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:51:13", "owner": "dopeassdom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085587202676696, "text": "Nahhh this myght be the new method", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:50:14", "owner": "dk_kin47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977058975846794, "text": "My daughter does the same to her little sister then my husband chases her with his way bigger horse", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:46:03", "owner": "mexiqueen13_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061316645166214, "text": "Mean ASF lol", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:44:06", "owner": "gagelindemann715", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092817946610374, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:38:54", "owner": "lawrenc3surfs_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987373329676672, "text": "Yooooo 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:38:29", "owner": "missedfaith", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055002755066066, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:37:38", "owner": "hey_dakxta_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066249407013322, "text": "You didn’t even catch her! 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:37:22", "owner": "charlesgoupil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964642716778582, "text": "Maybe it’s a good thing I didn’t grow up with my sister 🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:37:03", "owner": "sharonjo74", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040618979311915, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:36:14", "owner": "xloudxfinsta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929182201063376, "text": "You should be a Mount police officer. It’s police officers on horses.", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:36:11", "owner": "checkers9797", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063902708511578, "text": "“WE JUST WANNA BUCK”", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:31:14", "owner": "copy__casper", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17922625560092897, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:31:07", "owner": "lerok.d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051070349110811, "text": "i chased mine with a broom", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:25:58", "owner": "annasimon_awad", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17884125141287907, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:22:34", "owner": "_mr.llama___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125443564445855, "text": "I didn't have a horse. Just my dad's pistol", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:19:35", "owner": "cry__848y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082556977814961, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:19:06", "owner": "thedancingmustache", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072752570309045, "text": "You need a lasso", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:18:24", "owner": "steph.ruvy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071864080766921, "text": "🌽⚽️", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:17:34", "owner": "sergeant.dornan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913462945105975, "text": "She's just trying to reach you but your car's extended warranty", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:17:06", "owner": "jamiethestylist10", "likes": 92}, {"id": 17898111849213546, "text": "I would have poisoned the horse. 🤷‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:16:09", "owner": "cmgreeson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087054202639609, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:14:51", "owner": "frostborne.fitness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059703974228040, "text": "Do you have a lasso? 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:12:38", "owner": "adedicatedfan9248", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18034316900371057, "text": "The deep voice had me", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:12:35", "owner": "v818a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031020554673838, "text": "yo si tuviera un caballo \n@wendy_rocio14", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:11:28", "owner": "iriscastillo7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17934827043030215, "text": "Ruffnut chasing Tuffnut on a hog I’d say", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:10:54", "owner": "lilienthefox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039609074643854, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:10:52", "owner": "diabeatings_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066025802013518, "text": "No lasso?", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:09:46", "owner": "gonzalo_mi_gusto_es_conducir", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18046839803185678, "text": "💕if you wanna know what my favorite hobby is 💕 👹COMEMERE 👹", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:09:26", "owner": "linz_mick", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18497049724028788, "text": "I love how the horse joins in too", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:05:49", "owner": "somepotatolovingsystem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866614381396895, "text": "need someone to teach me so i can do this to my baby sister IMMEDIATELY", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:00:49", "owner": "salmansguitar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17862021720420322, "text": "😭🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-07T21:00:18", "owner": "blackouttt.615", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049231304397754, "text": "😍😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T20:58:48", "owner": "zamir_kajti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073661591498470, "text": "I used to do this to my brother 😂😂😂 he hates horses now", "created_at": "2025-06-07T20:58:12", "owner": "areillyv4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848126578484624, "text": "\"RUN! RUN! BURN THOSE CALORIES GIRL, C'MON!!\"", "created_at": "2025-06-07T20:56:57", "owner": "_sofyvn_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011507093565454, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T20:55:56", "owner": "ceogarrel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068311493053289, "text": "Muscle memory", "created_at": "2025-06-07T20:55:42", "owner": "isaiahzgotgame", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065415658891752, "text": "It’s giving Plantation owners when their slave runs away", "created_at": "2025-06-07T20:48:33", "owner": "jaytotheulian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066716804090924, "text": "Get a lasso", "created_at": "2025-06-07T20:48:18", "owner": "forgotd.name", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049000745421354, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T20:44:53", "owner": "chrizzdafizzz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061709528325764, "text": "“COME HEA “ 👹", "created_at": "2025-06-07T20:43:28", "owner": "missmicheee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056318375258390, "text": "Red dead ahh hobby", "created_at": "2025-06-07T20:41:35", "owner": "dead.accountb58", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130958311425547, "text": "POV: you're a 12th century Mongol charging across the Eurasian steppe", "created_at": "2025-06-07T20:40:46", "owner": "julian_saunches", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037570241644086, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T20:35:13", "owner": "newsomedarius", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951262206975063, "text": "I wonder if my Mongol-fighting genes might kick in if this happened to me, and I might manifest a crossbow", "created_at": "2025-06-07T20:34:37", "owner": "bablo_hawkingstar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073396934494193, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T20:32:02", "owner": "jake_createz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985769661819372, "text": "Oh I would have shot that horse FR", "created_at": "2025-06-07T20:29:02", "owner": "kjosley_24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847913224485748, "text": "\"stawp\" \"stawp\" COME HERE👹", "created_at": "2025-06-07T20:25:09", "owner": "kesli_wilson31", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17982902348831518, "text": "Roping practice", "created_at": "2025-06-07T20:24:48", "owner": "katie_rose_8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006749609600663, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-06-07T20:23:58", "owner": "_sweet_shelly_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17879478384335457, "text": "My brothers used to chase me with the family dog.  We had a Rottweiler", "created_at": "2025-06-07T20:23:26", "owner": "tdgraduate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095879134588208, "text": "Lmao nuc if you buck", "created_at": "2025-06-07T20:22:40", "owner": "thewormwhispererfarms", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039648008632490, "text": "Lasso her", "created_at": "2025-06-07T20:21:19", "owner": "jcen24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18279114460268143, "text": "That “come here” has me rolling 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T20:21:17", "owner": "mysterious_libra713", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094780312593927, "text": "Im so happy i was an only child 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-06-07T20:20:12", "owner": "_twiggypea_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898372621218395, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T20:19:18", "owner": "alexxter12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051759875598323, "text": "Should have threw a rope at her, then drag her with the horse", "created_at": "2025-06-07T20:16:46", "owner": "yngp.htown", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18273152929273733, "text": "That's how Usain Bolt was born. But little bit darker", "created_at": "2025-06-07T20:16:35", "owner": "i.am_lukiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060213901967668, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T20:12:03", "owner": "wild_gambino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043041710545706, "text": "Where’s the lasso?", "created_at": "2025-06-07T20:11:22", "owner": "partimax", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047912699433423, "text": "I'd turn it into lasagna if I were here sister", "created_at": "2025-06-07T20:07:11", "owner": "realjannis", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17879435475339352, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T20:07:04", "owner": "theejasmynesymone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089950762626759, "text": "@g_varela_ and his kids in the future", "created_at": "2025-06-07T20:03:37", "owner": "mnadyan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911314582134921, "text": "You need a foam sword to smack her with.", "created_at": "2025-06-07T20:03:28", "owner": "colevidmar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18052254044521740, "text": "oh so you’re the sibling with the knife", "created_at": "2025-06-07T20:03:02", "owner": "wickedstarss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933206746021878, "text": "In SF the poor siblings use used needles off the street 💉", "created_at": "2025-06-07T20:02:30", "owner": "tahoemannyxxl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088411978715231, "text": "This is what it means to grow up on a farm with only girls", "created_at": "2025-06-07T20:02:13", "owner": "bella.irene.spitzer", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095714368600112, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T20:01:38", "owner": "jay_rock150", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070545991790063, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:57:57", "owner": "wiskeycowboy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056071559051199, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:56:59", "owner": "hashtagmattd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041754437302665, "text": "😂🤣😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:56:02", "owner": "forlerdebbie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862108828350372, "text": "Now you need to practice roping her lol.", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:54:04", "owner": "j_l_mede", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051403928578288, "text": "Komm her!", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:51:27", "owner": "e.m.n_n", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18103330951536320, "text": "@brookeyyyp", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:51:15", "owner": "jenseyyann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058586153237130, "text": "The best thing ever 🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:49:53", "owner": "becxx.fm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18406695895111257, "text": "Its really the horses fav hobby", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:49:22", "owner": "sakurafloraa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17913318660102323, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:47:34", "owner": "26.mingi.bbyongming", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891085726257540, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:46:05", "owner": "vivaxbella", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062400935145715, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:45:05", "owner": "grahzzy2026", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882570484317515, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:44:35", "owner": "kxrma.bxby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035333759359545, "text": "The \"no deserters\" special.", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:43:13", "owner": "ajieniichan", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18062475950142500, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:42:49", "owner": "gregis71.glgreglewgreggy420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18504312775031174, "text": "I already know she has trauma from horses 😭", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:40:27", "owner": "huricanegabby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042388010279956, "text": "\"We just want a bite\"🤣🤣🤣😭", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:40:04", "owner": "bully_rusher76", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18310834384233184, "text": "I bet if you leave the horse untied one day it would chase her lol", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:39:51", "owner": "teakkey7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18253953292304468, "text": "I used to chase mine on a fourwheeler. Hit em if I could.", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:39:42", "owner": "cstanley_014", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18386802319138082, "text": "Lasso her red dead redemption style", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:38:25", "owner": "hana_inkfiend", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070104664956572, "text": "Link trying to save the princess", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:37:27", "owner": "gusdoesstufff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062431702933622, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:36:53", "owner": "wolftzigane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072074023944471, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:32:40", "owner": "whizboyy7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845448826499785, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:32:12", "owner": "eli.2.x2xx5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016421597533717, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:31:15", "owner": "daysia969", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017870003717445, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:31:11", "owner": "blessedtingzs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088176358651559, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:26:03", "owner": "matthewcisneros_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073000780934823, "text": "If it's a mare it was her idea originally", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:23:51", "owner": "burrlonk", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18106280341518723, "text": "This is a woman we fight wars for 😂😂😂😂👏👏", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:23:41", "owner": "vidovic_samir", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082192342692595, "text": "Looks like you’re drifting the horse", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:23:06", "owner": "joshua_spiewacki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922449952083671, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:22:16", "owner": "bufffrankenstein", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881394535318505, "text": "Playing RDR2 irl is crazy 🔥", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:20:57", "owner": "wyatttufts09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054151601060940, "text": "Get a fishing cast net and try and catch her", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:20:40", "owner": "reid_stoltz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17884704714293374, "text": "YESS we do it in the arena too haha 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:20:27", "owner": "chloe4036", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088519696561260, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:17:33", "owner": "ro.vedo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067234628094397, "text": "She’s faster than a horse!!", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:16:53", "owner": "cherrificbird", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152298127374723, "text": "Damn she fast", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:15:31", "owner": "tomatoesarebetterraw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18308608549210969, "text": "Horse drifting", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:15:10", "owner": "iamdefinitelynotnamedkyle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054174509062770, "text": "She's training her to time travel back to when america was at war with england 😭", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:14:41", "owner": "alienjerboa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396657451115038, "text": "If I had a sister id probably be skinny lol 😝 and my room would be clean! lol", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:14:40", "owner": "fupinktink", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047276210411939, "text": "Oi stop horsing around", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:12:56", "owner": "dat._.chicc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969490860857629, "text": "Do u think the horse likes this lmao", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:12:50", "owner": "dat._.chicc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040609889542025, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:12:19", "owner": "mominzb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903570712074586, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:10:15", "owner": "chin_o0526", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062260511123771, "text": "i wanna do that", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:10:06", "owner": "emmasroses2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074122837916319, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:05:50", "owner": "ummm_teddy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062271880935915, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:04:49", "owner": "mahmoud_harrabi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069595531817126, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:04:34", "owner": "justus_55555", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18466235410078370, "text": "Pull an Arthur Morgan and grab a lasso, then drag her behind you", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:04:19", "owner": "savgavmav", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18280131322251657, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T19:03:11", "owner": "joethatboy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922762045088146, "text": "This gotta be some type of abuse🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:59:55", "owner": "kimbrianna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907663555161366, "text": "She’s going to be a D1 athlete", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:57:12", "owner": "wildfire_lady_", "likes": 197}, {"id": 18070198138974992, "text": "@orli_tammam this like is dark 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:57:11", "owner": "rdacoachindia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18508079449040279, "text": "You should get a lasso", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:56:18", "owner": "8enjirect", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982071285832289, "text": "You’ve gotta learn to rope, I chase my cousins with my horse and practice roping", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:56:17", "owner": "kaydenburtleson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148766626375970, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:55:51", "owner": "josephjo575", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852663949462516, "text": "That’s the best hobby horse thing I’ve seen", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:54:56", "owner": "emmalenesversion12", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17946277907999741, "text": "Sisterly activities ❤️✨", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:54:31", "owner": "con.stan.tchaos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073595650929825, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:54:15", "owner": "nielleofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081366319838276, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:47:17", "owner": "matsunny", "likes": 1085}, {"id": 17982093233831403, "text": "You’re so real for this", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:46:38", "owner": "starr_chilldd", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17849147451481194, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:44:53", "owner": "tbi_brad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867494143310220, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:44:03", "owner": "harriet_tubmanpistol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874433524360455, "text": "FREEZE ‼️", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:42:33", "owner": "keekadio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116881033486339, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:42:27", "owner": "310bear", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871218403370464, "text": "@evebfiliatrault", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:41:11", "owner": "thewidowkid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911556688140149, "text": "Gotta get a lasso so you can take her into the sheriff and collect her bounty", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:40:07", "owner": "quesly467", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903234679190471, "text": "LASSO HER", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:39:52", "owner": "evelyn_saintjames", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032231936408943, "text": "Lol you do that with a horse, see I'm from the south Bronx we were broke in the 90s so we chased each other with our feet or bikes😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:39:47", "owner": "angelopagan70", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148946200346468, "text": "Oh, i need a horse now!", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:38:06", "owner": "sumidem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879362998221018, "text": "«Seize her!!»", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:35:46", "owner": "cptcannonman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057847430239548, "text": "Lasso her next time!", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:34:19", "owner": "javier.flores.4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844386841502341, "text": "This is funny", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:34:03", "owner": "jayalbajr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852057364428599, "text": "It's good to have a healthy hobby.", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:31:47", "owner": "jimmynugg4life", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154282009327670, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:31:38", "owner": "goldenkevin67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376092343125389, "text": "This was probably what the nobles did to their peasants for fun back in the good ole days", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:30:54", "owner": "filthisin168", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18519887005048129, "text": "in a past life you were a warrior in the mongol horde", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:30:40", "owner": "flamingsquidward", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071311712309274, "text": "You just need a whip or lasso now", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:28:36", "owner": "whos._.hoo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059776445228475, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:28:17", "owner": "smileymh61", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18511542061029655, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:23:36", "owner": "sara_030_ff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076927633883935, "text": "Mean ole sounding “RUN” 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:23:27", "owner": "a.nords.art", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17951452103972672, "text": "That’s how you build a trauma at someone", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:21:27", "owner": "enzocomh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993731001648221, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:20:54", "owner": "d_breezy901", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989426376667356, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:20:23", "owner": "friedchickenlvrr3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17854450407451141, "text": "@victoria._.sheffield  texans", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:18:35", "owner": "gabohr_26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114920065487216, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:17:22", "owner": "theriiii_varsha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041552768291405, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:17:06", "owner": "chidinmaaaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842796892504534, "text": "As a proud owner of a little sister I approve this 🦅", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:15:21", "owner": "zs_libai", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17922332055093970, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:12:47", "owner": "itz_iguana_90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164304673351414, "text": "We'll get along great!", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:10:56", "owner": "hch_pro_gaming", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082159837752475, "text": "I showed my sister a i laugh 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:07:46", "owner": "bam.bam.gomez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128748862427607, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:07:27", "owner": "_rachelgleason", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067986265975968, "text": "“You better move those Oompa Loompa feet!”", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:07:00", "owner": "_chuck21_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17908049382168284, "text": "“KAHMR!!”", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:06:41", "owner": "officialjustinwhiteband", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917453763997972, "text": "Well, someone’s getting their head shaved in her sleep.", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:05:29", "owner": "christiana_joy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352279186157626, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:03:43", "owner": "jayboogiepoetry_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067297919079363, "text": "The amount of times I’ve watched this is unhealthy.", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:03:12", "owner": "jdags34", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140774212394011, "text": "Im fat. Can I Book you and your horse?", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:02:45", "owner": "mraquilus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048384878608583, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:02:39", "owner": "angelina_the_1_pet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100514254557283, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:02:09", "owner": "jaslenna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074285836916085, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:00:53", "owner": "saud_al3nzii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18390188119143580, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T18:00:11", "owner": "foxy_bk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041839796280712, "text": "Lore accurate sibling behavior😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T17:57:00", "owner": "ya_boi_kg_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962444964926624, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T17:50:29", "owner": "karliwyg_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028524422480671, "text": "I used to sneeze in my sister's face. That was more affordable for the family.", "created_at": "2025-06-07T17:49:22", "owner": "music.angel333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18300930469175001, "text": "Bhuoy, where do you think you are running? Where is the cotton you owe to me??", "created_at": "2025-06-07T17:49:08", "owner": "estrangedkat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067812335095919, "text": "👻👻👻👻👻", "created_at": "2025-06-07T17:47:25", "owner": "0owak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184669933318109, "text": "big vine energy", "created_at": "2025-06-07T17:40:46", "owner": "danii.galo", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17851442262467703, "text": "COME HERE👹👹", "created_at": "2025-06-07T17:40:23", "owner": "megangeihsler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062521535167043, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T17:39:33", "owner": "max_verstappen_546", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984862017687961, "text": "Why horse run sidewase", "created_at": "2025-06-07T17:38:54", "owner": "kitra_2055", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18515688667062999, "text": "We just wanna bite 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T17:38:52", "owner": "benji.d.tv", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068356229493919, "text": "“BURN THOSE CALORIES GIRL” 😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T17:38:47", "owner": "queenb33_2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872971063366108, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T17:37:18", "owner": "m1chaellangfitness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994695189644279, "text": "👏😂 Amazing", "created_at": "2025-06-07T17:35:08", "owner": "tj.munroe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857313985439403, "text": "@_ruthyg_", "created_at": "2025-06-07T17:34:56", "owner": "_charliejean_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038364866333760, "text": "You know what….Id probably do the same with my Lil Brothers💀", "created_at": "2025-06-07T17:33:17", "owner": "shouse_michael", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972187422903228, "text": "Haha that’s kinda rude but funny", "created_at": "2025-06-07T17:32:29", "owner": "kungfukickflip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153987268329098, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T17:31:13", "owner": "beavertails_3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009270965586735, "text": "Builds character", "created_at": "2025-06-07T17:26:32", "owner": "_softshock_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861877588353509, "text": "Master got me working", "created_at": "2025-06-07T17:25:39", "owner": "dante2kx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095552908581320, "text": "My sisters had it easy then cause i chased them with bugs 😂 BUT A HORSE 🐎 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T17:21:41", "owner": "ap_actual", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17975771624731064, "text": "ho is yu drifting", "created_at": "2025-06-07T17:20:58", "owner": "userrr207_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18508649827016926, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-07T17:19:46", "owner": "the_granberry_ranch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18384145177185412, "text": "We just wanna talk to you about your extended warranty", "created_at": "2025-06-07T17:18:42", "owner": "shewhisperedtohorses", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18471314521075864, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T17:18:28", "owner": "6422natalie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030759692443546, "text": "Horse probably is like ok back to the cowboy days chasing cows", "created_at": "2025-06-07T17:18:25", "owner": "graceodonovan_1234", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17871352092369556, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T17:18:16", "owner": "maaleak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088391674639508, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T17:17:07", "owner": "jakub_roflik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088320316577496, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T17:16:24", "owner": "zaffhere", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007847438769907, "text": "DON'T RUN FROM THA LOOOORD🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-07T17:16:01", "owner": "_dallas.j.green__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17942007555006647, "text": "Grab the lasso for additional sibling trauma… I mean fun", "created_at": "2025-06-07T17:16:01", "owner": "wkswafford47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18273708175272658, "text": "Needs more red dead redemption style. You chase your sister but at what cost to yourself 🤔🤠🐴🥃", "created_at": "2025-06-07T17:13:29", "owner": "akita_nii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038826923636492, "text": "You need a lasso.", "created_at": "2025-06-07T17:13:17", "owner": "leololauzone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059077838194221, "text": "Horse girls scare me 😂😭", "created_at": "2025-06-07T17:13:14", "owner": "mercifulace333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987962625812540, "text": "@roxanehassid  מצאתי דרך לגרום לך להתאמן 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T17:10:47", "owner": "shelly_l3vy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048812525601710, "text": "I chase dogs on the horse that I don’t own their fast and small and that’s a challenge for me", "created_at": "2025-06-07T17:06:26", "owner": "cb.c4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911984614120460, "text": "Uhhh😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T17:03:56", "owner": "luke212018", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006658256716986, "text": "Drifting the horse to catch her is wild work", "created_at": "2025-06-07T17:01:54", "owner": "scr3wball00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935619568019003, "text": "Close enough. Welcome back, Arthur Morgan!", "created_at": "2025-06-07T17:00:26", "owner": "ratedrgibby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075465163923393, "text": "“Rawwrrr” 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:59:14", "owner": "thebitchtheylovetohate", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069312968298931, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:58:50", "owner": "gary1072", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971901690858541, "text": "That is absolutely diabolocal😭😭", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:58:13", "owner": "hhhhhhhan__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946220028859174, "text": "The horse is drifting 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:57:16", "owner": "_just_1701_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000939707788054, "text": "Just run inside girl 😭🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:57:00", "owner": "saylorrenee31", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060633320180607, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:56:22", "owner": "dadangdogs_3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18330784159162126, "text": "My favorite hobby is chasing my sister around with the knife ☺️ we have so much in common", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:54:55", "owner": "gen_igga14710", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18331802191165343, "text": "Arthur Morgan ahh video", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:54:54", "owner": "robert.vh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18513664834013579, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:53:04", "owner": "soulearthy__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915847015104098, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:52:18", "owner": "christiana_chrisz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850818745433510, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:52:18", "owner": "boujieyana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368759401135918, "text": "I love seeing chestnut mares fine their  match", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:52:16", "owner": "sophia70787", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052597001461160, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:49:13", "owner": "king_kevdawg", "likes": 63}, {"id": 17882048715311896, "text": "Why does she sound like “TIMMY”", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:48:52", "owner": "athanribleyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077347348697637, "text": "The come here had me dying", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:47:56", "owner": "yuri_yn_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050855942373809, "text": "Female version of Arthur Morgan 😂👏🏻", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:46:02", "owner": "allyyy.v.r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914407060103875, "text": "cmon girls quit horsing around", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:45:12", "owner": "freakysatire", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884336839294843, "text": "This is gonna be my new hobby", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:44:48", "owner": "8riix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929697244059707, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:43:27", "owner": "ramirothezer01777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115272298488278, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:43:10", "owner": "yvan.y2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165217402353796, "text": "“We just wana bond!” …. NO! 🏃‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:43:04", "owner": "anemal_luv_rvt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951303927968168, "text": "😈 @biscuitsandfries", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:42:48", "owner": "jileebeans", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050841596111258, "text": "WHY THE FUCK IS UR HORSE GOING SIDEWAYS", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:40:58", "owner": "kayt420_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068767313062513, "text": "Lasso ? 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:39:59", "owner": "ig.looner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043411733252570, "text": "Fighting childhood obesity, I like it", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:38:09", "owner": "savannahhaggerty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890432095145576, "text": "9 times outta 10, A Sweeper onna horse is crazy😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:37:57", "owner": "grxycxmxtxries", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18355001944158586, "text": "I love how the horse is moving sideways 😅", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:37:21", "owner": "abbs_hug", "likes": 25}, {"id": 17862088173350435, "text": "😂 The deep horse voice", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:37:19", "owner": "blochmatheson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062063365919135, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:35:15", "owner": "wrose10040", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960228864947891, "text": "CMERE 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:34:45", "owner": "saya_yasam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880965346325834, "text": "Massa used to make us run like the cattle for his enjoyment 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:34:42", "owner": "mrsmosleysbookclubbabes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296681260216522, "text": "the horse is so committed", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:32:48", "owner": "vini.rosa.roo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18273311728279281, "text": "my brothers uses to make me run while they shot me with paintball guns 😂 it was the summer and i had a winter coat on while running", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:31:11", "owner": "buckwithit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970281288862889, "text": "Why's the horses neck side ways😢", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:30:45", "owner": "dakota_r.ukidding", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063147167327475, "text": "Use a whip on her it will be more nostalgic 🙌", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:30:40", "owner": "jerrythemouse_08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073494178926957, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:28:01", "owner": "angelo.00013", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066207935511017, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:26:21", "owner": "jesse_trek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842116402514433, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:26:01", "owner": "darrenmeyerswineguy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013291127741073, "text": "Your chasing voice. 🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:25:32", "owner": "a.wallly", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18355085335152451, "text": "The horse is actually drifting? 🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:23:16", "owner": "romain_frz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18191630065311469, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:23:05", "owner": "_lachay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18503748031065497, "text": "CUM ERHHH", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:22:31", "owner": "nicolas1.1.1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18046536440578415, "text": "great use of free will, would def have me motivated to burn calories 🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:20:12", "owner": "sammah1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138109063410693, "text": "I now have hope for this generation", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:19:38", "owner": "jk79_or", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18002871512787074, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:19:02", "owner": "justinpuskas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096303301575561, "text": "🏃💨 🐎", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:18:28", "owner": "carl.modelo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067036277017150, "text": "This is low honor arthur Morgan", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:16:40", "owner": "ecclescfc", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18034310021376662, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:16:02", "owner": "linzbridge", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18302896459246446, "text": "We were poor, so I chased mine with a knife", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:12:17", "owner": "cealeena", "likes": 263623}, {"id": 18091940302549731, "text": "You're my sleep paralysis demon omg", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:12:05", "owner": "leafavid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044514710215130, "text": "Now learn to lasso and give her the full experience", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:11:44", "owner": "bill_k1n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045756377213966, "text": "Just like when they escaped the plantation", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:11:09", "owner": "indian__tech__support_v2", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18038100845636885, "text": "This bro wrong. She's experiencing YALLs ancestral traumas 😭🤠🐝🐝🌞", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:09:51", "owner": "ttgriest", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971079411856280, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:08:48", "owner": "dad_mcg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18507125662039752, "text": "That is fun", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:07:33", "owner": "travel_photographer26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18359354017146341, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:06:45", "owner": "badd_wolf", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18067468174853943, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:06:44", "owner": "josealvarez805", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899461342214461, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:06:27", "owner": "barbiegamboa17_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034403321375554, "text": "Please tell me she's acting. She actually seems scared. 💔", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:06:04", "owner": "angel_draws__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884420608299128, "text": "This is 10x funnier in 2x", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:05:21", "owner": "kitty_and_cookie_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095476627601619, "text": "It be hilarious if you said mush 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:04:26", "owner": "yalahow_in_the_house", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012871742738788, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:04:21", "owner": "8_points_ranch_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010278617749287, "text": "i do this to my mom", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:03:40", "owner": "taylor._.catherine", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18071989405769919, "text": "Hmmm it's giving slave catcher. ..", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:02:13", "owner": "phaphani_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084394735606934, "text": "Next level of sibling rivalry", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:01:05", "owner": "gothiclemonade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18162913546359990, "text": "That horse lowkey hit a meannn drift 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T16:00:35", "owner": "roadmanrell", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18139783786399216, "text": "I wonder if it’s also the horses favorite hobby lol", "created_at": "2025-06-07T15:58:38", "owner": "g1789y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084678118666485, "text": "Literally my older sister and I 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T15:56:41", "owner": "riley_quinlan_01", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056634026263100, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T15:54:34", "owner": "978puty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096409318514932, "text": "The horse is enjoying this as well 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T15:54:23", "owner": "itscoach_eb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105182101521211, "text": "RUN!!!! 😆😆😆", "created_at": "2025-06-07T15:53:56", "owner": "brandonflloyd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971163519752966, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T15:53:06", "owner": "wilfredo.lanuza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109579513502931, "text": "@maddymay.26 Or chasing your dad 😆", "created_at": "2025-06-07T15:52:39", "owner": "vkbeeck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857673331434998, "text": "Cumear", "created_at": "2025-06-07T15:52:12", "owner": "ryanbungart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014779997685034, "text": "Future personal trainer. Ha", "created_at": "2025-06-07T15:47:10", "owner": "capt._todd_w", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072171121766833, "text": "I love how the horse turns his head as if he’s asking here where she’s gonna go", "created_at": "2025-06-07T15:45:56", "owner": "slumex_borlung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18345107185091613, "text": "\"We just won a bike\"", "created_at": "2025-06-07T15:44:56", "owner": "rob_constrictormemes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991663329658483, "text": "She should have a net and chase her Planet of the Apes style", "created_at": "2025-06-07T15:43:04", "owner": "powerful_pete16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065843401877415, "text": "This is something my sister would do to me as a kid, but she would be holding a Bamboo stick to whip me with lol. Later on in life I learned Kung Fu to defend myself, and now she never tries anything on me haha.", "created_at": "2025-06-07T15:41:13", "owner": "imahiggs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949355712989301, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-07T15:40:23", "owner": "yngkeira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157523323368779, "text": "Mom infound a new hooby🗣️🗣️", "created_at": "2025-06-07T15:37:11", "owner": "drios5.9", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17985731261683438, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T15:34:40", "owner": "marah.marrah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922349020092191, "text": "Come errr", "created_at": "2025-06-07T15:34:05", "owner": "_alexandra.ross._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080657155641334, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T15:34:00", "owner": "simon.peart85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870965929372286, "text": "Horse is like \"this is a weird game.  I'm just following orders\"", "created_at": "2025-06-07T15:32:09", "owner": "erkuteronat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989292555810357, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T15:31:31", "owner": "yic.sparkk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845207644501128, "text": "Now you just need a lasso", "created_at": "2025-06-07T15:31:23", "owner": "kcbriggs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077094217700312, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T15:29:49", "owner": "brando.cp23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301806220174757, "text": "Jesus love you", "created_at": "2025-06-07T15:29:08", "owner": "sophia_mcfarland", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972001296896365, "text": "knowing how fucking smart horses are, i bet they're in on the joke too.", "created_at": "2025-06-07T15:28:06", "owner": "ale0aras", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051770822093688, "text": "This is going to come out in a major meltdown at Thanksgiving dinner ten years from now. Make sure you video it. 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T15:27:27", "owner": "jameswilliamsinsta1", "likes": 2943}, {"id": 18066265016015625, "text": "Horse girls", "created_at": "2025-06-07T15:26:25", "owner": "jartymenkins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18211387429305291, "text": "It looks like the horse is running lopsided 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T15:24:45", "owner": "sweendoggli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18388472431142436, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T15:24:23", "owner": "sweendoggli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912250396111395, "text": "COME HERE! 👹👹", "created_at": "2025-06-07T15:19:59", "owner": "nathan_s_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881562673302296, "text": "😂👏", "created_at": "2025-06-07T15:18:26", "owner": "matthewtufford1st", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065429471089244, "text": "Younger siblings are to be tortured. John 21:6 Praise the Lord", "created_at": "2025-06-07T15:17:55", "owner": "calorifersara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053717498075952, "text": "😮😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T15:17:44", "owner": "pedro_schmitt11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984565980689120, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T15:16:56", "owner": "tyrell_f.13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18309401122209937, "text": "Get you a lasso 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T15:13:52", "owner": "chill_be_chillin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066425150085851, "text": "No lasso?", "created_at": "2025-06-07T15:09:55", "owner": "tamimsa80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050038703121036, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T15:08:31", "owner": "hardingjake371", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032298185415499, "text": "This is every fps to me", "created_at": "2025-06-07T15:07:15", "owner": "silverbladez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087456979629567, "text": "Looool I'd have long-term nightmares about this, if I was your sister 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T14:58:16", "owner": "amain04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18313035481236441, "text": "me in rdr2 chasing down the witness to my wagon robbery", "created_at": "2025-06-07T14:57:54", "owner": "jul.d0203", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879313561222269, "text": "“Let me talk to you about your extended warranty. “", "created_at": "2025-06-07T14:56:39", "owner": "panda.manda456", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18192465865311218, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T14:56:20", "owner": "missnatangel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061369265238019, "text": "I'm not", "created_at": "2025-06-07T14:52:12", "owner": "hondayguy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053172185596318, "text": "Get a lasso I have an idea", "created_at": "2025-06-07T14:50:07", "owner": "theworstitch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941896704887807, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T14:49:41", "owner": "me_myself_and_i_624", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083483716683311, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T14:46:36", "owner": "aroundtheworldandblakc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046640048570046, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T14:44:13", "owner": "psychedelic_paradox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047726147454388, "text": "I used to do this to my ex boyfriend", "created_at": "2025-06-07T14:42:39", "owner": "anouri09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076304986716058, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T14:41:28", "owner": "roks1986", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937720459009151, "text": "Lasso her...", "created_at": "2025-06-07T14:38:24", "owner": "d.u.i.l.y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18174966859333663, "text": "👹CMERE👹", "created_at": "2025-06-07T14:36:24", "owner": "ma_ary___", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18141548035402333, "text": "I would appreciate this but hate it at the same time because you'd be helping me exercise but also giving me horse related nightmares 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T14:33:21", "owner": "suong123le", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117301024466131, "text": "“Burn those calories girl come on”🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-07T14:32:30", "owner": "j_dmd_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909010978154715, "text": "Grab a lasso next time", "created_at": "2025-06-07T14:30:55", "owner": "choomsteaparty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18370558339125229, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T14:29:37", "owner": "michael_deharo_jr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918166045097119, "text": "I want this hobby to beat my brother's dumb ass", "created_at": "2025-06-07T14:23:48", "owner": "sh_wizr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18386170873141555, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T14:16:48", "owner": "yahirajael_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855403336444718, "text": "DONT RUN FROM THE HORSE!!!", "created_at": "2025-06-07T14:15:21", "owner": "marnixlowl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902314306196315, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T14:14:07", "owner": "scottloko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957708468948901, "text": "Red dead redemption looks different somehow", "created_at": "2025-06-07T14:12:55", "owner": "s.mahataya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984725406836766, "text": "Come here boy!🤠", "created_at": "2025-06-07T14:09:39", "owner": "alexanderhoffmann693", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18462724384074274, "text": "This weeks episode of “man hunter”", "created_at": "2025-06-07T14:09:17", "owner": "nabeke88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910203820079964, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T14:08:18", "owner": "lingzero181", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18175176445331762, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T14:06:07", "owner": "theobliviousf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18315650950229684, "text": "There’s nothing like sibling love lol", "created_at": "2025-06-07T14:05:40", "owner": "sabrina_amelia3", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18039844508638176, "text": "Scythian activities 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T14:05:36", "owner": "heavy_cole", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953650728826277, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T14:04:35", "owner": "tiandavinaquraini", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17853883413452704, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T13:52:12", "owner": "tadan_goose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857664343435644, "text": "My cousin used to do this to me, and it was the scariest thing ever", "created_at": "2025-06-07T13:47:57", "owner": "_tony773", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940551595007743, "text": "We just wanna bite 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T13:42:26", "owner": "jocal024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066177092044674, "text": "I need you to marry me 😩🫶🏼", "created_at": "2025-06-07T13:40:55", "owner": "axeljuarezo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071916184939928, "text": "Get a lasso and tie her up when she gets slow😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T13:39:53", "owner": "mattwright4090", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047590652399019, "text": "Learn the throw a rope and catch her in the loop that’s what I do to my brother", "created_at": "2025-06-07T13:39:22", "owner": "jackbillings0318", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17878324320341329, "text": "That is hilarious, and it’s funny when you said “run run burn those calories girl comes on” lol 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T13:39:20", "owner": "rossmason63", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030550592441646, "text": "Lmao", "created_at": "2025-06-07T13:38:51", "owner": "ramonmarrujo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056659862029430, "text": "Cooooool", "created_at": "2025-06-07T13:37:09", "owner": "moinsightt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042713201620449, "text": "We just wanna buck lol", "created_at": "2025-06-07T13:36:58", "owner": "malikasheila", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862097827350528, "text": "on some 1800s american catching an African type shi", "created_at": "2025-06-07T13:35:27", "owner": "johnsonbabytalcumpowder.baby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065396033031564, "text": "Somewhere I sense some deep rooted racism😩 this is giving your ancestors were slay masters and this what they did to them when they were getting caught running away.", "created_at": "2025-06-07T13:34:18", "owner": "the.ballchinian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054987317364712, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T13:33:59", "owner": "el_vaquerochinito", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064887589890745, "text": "We've been trying to reach you about your horses extended warranty!", "created_at": "2025-06-07T13:33:30", "owner": "david.d.harris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046367846623765, "text": "Valid. Don’t stop doing the big sister tasks 🔥👏", "created_at": "2025-06-07T13:31:15", "owner": "jasmine.thorb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301333507172990, "text": "Why the horse drifting tho 🤔", "created_at": "2025-06-07T13:27:21", "owner": "cj._.kd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970193514908320, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T13:26:41", "owner": "tvoje.mama.vol.2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141226567400354, "text": "my sister rather to stay and die which is no fun😮‍💨", "created_at": "2025-06-07T13:25:44", "owner": "hesy_ak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919425202070665, "text": "😆😆😆", "created_at": "2025-06-07T13:15:03", "owner": "dti.9670", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007799987594313, "text": "You should get a whip too", "created_at": "2025-06-07T13:14:41", "owner": "dr.octopussssss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072504529940333, "text": "Rope her", "created_at": "2025-06-07T13:14:35", "owner": "panda_mad_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133125925422276, "text": "Older sister activities at its best 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T13:12:43", "owner": "ashy_baby05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182594212320650, "text": "“We’ve been trying to reach you about your cars extended warranty”", "created_at": "2025-06-07T13:10:00", "owner": "remington._.77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109972759501081, "text": "It’s giving…. history", "created_at": "2025-06-07T13:07:28", "owner": "isaidnoice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072429829937585, "text": "Meanwhile that horse don’t know what’s going on💀", "created_at": "2025-06-07T13:03:10", "owner": "karsb33", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18090491767627676, "text": "I have a hobby of punching my brothers in the face every time they bother me 😁", "created_at": "2025-06-07T12:57:50", "owner": "carmengibson1390", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17845585083498934, "text": "🗣️ Komm Her komm her (sounds totally German to me)", "created_at": "2025-06-07T12:57:25", "owner": "_the_real_slim_lady_", "likes": 38}, {"id": 17891281386257985, "text": "Okay red dead redemption", "created_at": "2025-06-07T12:55:43", "owner": "michael_eshleman500", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014010974726323, "text": "It’s not a hobby if everyone does it", "created_at": "2025-06-07T12:50:59", "owner": "wyattwoody1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851823751466492, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T12:50:39", "owner": "rvgz___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892828174252554, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T12:49:41", "owner": "lauren.broderson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978128634846137, "text": "COM HEA🗣️🔊", "created_at": "2025-06-07T12:49:31", "owner": "cnicoliec", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124301587457259, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T12:48:39", "owner": "ryanadm212", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925354420080147, "text": "The “come here” is taking me out 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T12:46:17", "owner": "ayyepicasso", "likes": 612}, {"id": 17950943261976411, "text": "Cavalry always beats infantry", "created_at": "2025-06-07T12:42:17", "owner": "suleman.lohar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17880692241326629, "text": "Certified oldest sibling behavior 💀", "created_at": "2025-06-07T12:40:59", "owner": "__park_ji.min__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121254481463857, "text": "The way I can tell you’re holding the horse back too is hilarious", "created_at": "2025-06-07T12:39:42", "owner": "laney_lgh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17896081074227958, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T12:39:36", "owner": "wible.josh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932473696027219, "text": "😂 why are you chasing your sister? You should be helping your sister protecting her you crazy girl be nice😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T12:38:07", "owner": "asielc_bluelife", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18515059387042319, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T12:34:57", "owner": "capricorn_starlight", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043738580246141, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T12:34:43", "owner": "_sophiechenkin_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070679764975364, "text": "COME HERE👹👺🗣️", "created_at": "2025-06-07T12:34:32", "owner": "nate_toll1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17875153212357461, "text": "U got stick drift", "created_at": "2025-06-07T12:32:03", "owner": "dj_b_hyde", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17935430739019369, "text": "She def used to own slaves", "created_at": "2025-06-07T12:31:28", "owner": "lex45001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18374335801134269, "text": "Lasso her 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T12:28:12", "owner": "ivailotoshev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862024771351394, "text": "LMAO 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T12:24:13", "owner": "brembo_spike", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062223740150494, "text": "Now learn how to lasso her so it's extra fun for one party lol", "created_at": "2025-06-07T12:23:46", "owner": "spare_serotonin42", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17897127702234886, "text": "This is so Mongolian coded", "created_at": "2025-06-07T12:23:21", "owner": "red.mel049", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18047393327388095, "text": "C'MERE 👹🗣️🗣️", "created_at": "2025-06-07T12:08:36", "owner": "roxannabanana120", "likes": 7782}, {"id": 18091575763529609, "text": "🙌❤️", "created_at": "2025-06-07T12:07:59", "owner": "toiltused", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953854350967578, "text": "\"Burn those callories girl, C'MON\" Hahahaha", "created_at": "2025-06-07T12:07:26", "owner": "crazy.train95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052755875084306, "text": "Same but on a dirt bike or 4 wheeler", "created_at": "2025-06-07T12:07:15", "owner": "maddie_lee365", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067889126489429, "text": "Lmao should of lit her up w/ one of those semi-automatic water blicky's 😂...", "created_at": "2025-06-07T12:06:14", "owner": "edwardbcharles", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18047941508159879, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T12:04:22", "owner": "marleyjohro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045660221441257, "text": "My favorite thing to do in red dead 2", "created_at": "2025-06-07T12:02:36", "owner": "k.rin1x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069460579964667, "text": "Lasso her", "created_at": "2025-06-07T11:55:16", "owner": "sunnyhyland", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010938452748651, "text": "I need this", "created_at": "2025-06-07T11:50:48", "owner": "sofi.shimmer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066066623108460, "text": "I want to be friends with you 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T11:45:18", "owner": "tradillegra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153337282372541, "text": "Yk what I’m happy my sisters didn’t have horses because I’m the young one and yeah this would fs taunt me for the rest of my life 😭", "created_at": "2025-06-07T11:42:41", "owner": "lyudmilishkaya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077622502859094, "text": "@debra.tampu", "created_at": "2025-06-07T11:42:11", "owner": "andriesha_24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042193829280176, "text": "I suppose this type of harrassment 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T11:34:54", "owner": "yvon.ne787", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067450361053235, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T11:27:04", "owner": "robert.hynes.5876", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034223225653841, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T11:25:40", "owner": "nassi_nasom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060234271950886, "text": "“COMEERE 👺👺🏇🏇”", "created_at": "2025-06-07T11:14:35", "owner": "vati___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918726094098322, "text": "Pov me on red dead redemption 2 to a random NPC", "created_at": "2025-06-07T11:13:44", "owner": "gamer__4_ever", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876532807244721, "text": "Ever roped her? 😳😂😂😂😊✌", "created_at": "2025-06-07T11:09:45", "owner": "mikeperry3164", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959608143921670, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T10:59:35", "owner": "7ven.god_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010020590756528, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T10:56:57", "owner": "dr.zahrataheri_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18405795061107812, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T10:52:59", "owner": "albakjellbakk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081937711743259, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T10:52:46", "owner": "blacchammer_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029413067683397, "text": "@atenagh16 تو:", "created_at": "2025-06-07T10:42:27", "owner": "parisa_.gh1989", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139851460406730, "text": "🗣️🗣️: RUN!! RUN", "created_at": "2025-06-07T10:24:00", "owner": "6leilaaaa7", "likes": 49}, {"id": 18310842829213928, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T09:51:22", "owner": "chandrewill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087151396581686, "text": "@mu7h0l ❤️", "created_at": "2025-06-07T09:50:47", "owner": "theshvitlon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035355407343610, "text": "Haha, I used to scare the horse away with a trash bag if my brother did that✌️", "created_at": "2025-06-07T09:45:17", "owner": "jonat_han6817", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844674646486673, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T09:34:13", "owner": "mike_pari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014816876542606, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T09:16:35", "owner": "stemagskog", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067550795081816, "text": "I do this to my best friend haha", "created_at": "2025-06-07T09:15:58", "owner": "elano.vibes.by.finja_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060658666951109, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T09:13:47", "owner": "ritz357", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963715374781904, "text": "“BURN THOSE CALORIES GURL CMON”🗣️🗣️", "created_at": "2025-06-07T09:01:01", "owner": "yobihfavwhiteboy", "likes": 119520}, {"id": 18053669258348762, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T08:52:24", "owner": "monesboss", "likes": 572}, {"id": 18079048801833553, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T08:48:17", "owner": "ayshin.arezi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17931555821937954, "text": "You can’t run from the lord ah post", "created_at": "2025-06-07T08:41:24", "owner": "wedoingbadshit", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049125350579618, "text": "She a runner she a track star 🗣🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-06-07T08:33:35", "owner": "y0ur_10ca1_em0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094771708593162, "text": "BURN THOSE CALORIES GIRL C'MON", "created_at": "2025-06-07T08:31:24", "owner": "urlocal_roodt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071451379963266, "text": "One time my sister was being really mean in front of a bunch of other people and embarrassing me like usual but I was mounted so that time I literally just ran her over like hella in front of hella kids 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-06-07T08:28:16", "owner": "cmalone303", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18024906431497397, "text": "Not gonna lie if I had a horse I’d have the same hobby", "created_at": "2025-06-07T08:22:20", "owner": "forever_free_rai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18508243594003384, "text": "Why is the horse running sideways😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-06-07T08:10:56", "owner": "adam.lehar83", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898128490212739, "text": "Now learn how to lasso🙂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T08:04:54", "owner": "genericlogic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032131718419862, "text": "“This IS CHILD ABUSE”. Got me laughing", "created_at": "2025-06-07T08:04:49", "owner": "lilly_mclean2014", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17937587019032283, "text": "@paige_brogden", "created_at": "2025-06-07T07:57:22", "owner": "oliviabrogden131", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072286657756299, "text": "I feel like your horse is enjoying this more than you 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T07:51:53", "owner": "chrispewkreme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18311226208234965, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-06-07T07:43:59", "owner": "glitch1799", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026577407492809, "text": "This is great. I cant quit watching this", "created_at": "2025-06-07T07:41:07", "owner": "wsbrown61", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067898171005471, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T07:30:11", "owner": "whoaho.itsnai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301595926175793, "text": "burn those calories 🗣️", "created_at": "2025-06-07T07:25:30", "owner": "princeofrodeodrive", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014227583549234, "text": "I want a horse so bad but I just do not have the means 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T07:18:04", "owner": "leaelizabeth___", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18189249544315090, "text": "This giving 1800s vibes😂😂a1", "created_at": "2025-06-07T07:06:27", "owner": "maciso_villapudua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18209602177306356, "text": "Do the divergent scream", "created_at": "2025-06-07T06:57:29", "owner": "evil_lunax3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18042360902281014, "text": "I love this hobby too", "created_at": "2025-06-07T06:54:10", "owner": "iamhanyun", "likes": 157}, {"id": 17979540989836480, "text": "How do I sign up!? I need to burn some calories to😢", "created_at": "2025-06-07T06:18:35", "owner": "tugboat8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906227410177193, "text": "lol come air", "created_at": "2025-06-07T06:09:39", "owner": "rolandabgrall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069048152058096, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T05:58:01", "owner": "kimberlyscogland", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042563471563221, "text": "Gotta get one of those medieval jousting poles too", "created_at": "2025-06-07T05:56:23", "owner": "killianharding", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099525751566114, "text": "The bourse looks like it’s running sideways bc the neck 😭😭lmao", "created_at": "2025-06-07T05:54:58", "owner": "sk8.monkeyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141684691392364, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T05:51:24", "owner": "zermmmmmmmmmmm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056243681248485, "text": "Same but on my dirtbike", "created_at": "2025-06-07T05:40:42", "owner": "allenmckinleybeth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183782302317309, "text": "Well.. I don't have a horse yet. But I like this!", "created_at": "2025-06-07T05:30:23", "owner": "zoe__gabrielli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084521971672182, "text": "Life goals 🙌🏼", "created_at": "2025-06-07T05:24:45", "owner": "taziytaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060120529980782, "text": "Your alignments off", "created_at": "2025-06-07T05:13:51", "owner": "ellie_07_25", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057710090022464, "text": "I freak heavy with this", "created_at": "2025-06-07T04:41:38", "owner": "isabela__lucas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066847103020142, "text": "Cmere👹", "created_at": "2025-06-07T04:41:15", "owner": "maurifromthe_276", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972025305887549, "text": "Same", "created_at": "2025-06-07T04:36:25", "owner": "crazy_ass_child", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039447290639786, "text": "Thats Queen Lex 👸 lolo 🤷‍♂️🤣", "created_at": "2025-06-07T04:33:17", "owner": "rock_n_rolla7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030674927447923, "text": "COME EH! COME AW!👹👹👺😈", "created_at": "2025-06-07T04:25:41", "owner": "maria_kanyuka", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18118491904465609, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-07T04:25:33", "owner": "andrewgale2965", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18167713252341979, "text": "“EXCUSE ME! Have you heard about our lord and savior Jesus Christ”🤣🤣🤣🤣🙏🏼🫶🏼", "created_at": "2025-06-07T04:21:41", "owner": "redneckhippiechica", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17870142867282483, "text": "I like roping people and pulling them around a little lol", "created_at": "2025-06-07T04:13:25", "owner": "harshman177