06-06T20:24:39", "owner": "emma_122453", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18101803171554982, "text": "LOVE THIS", "created_at": "2025-06-06T20:22:32", "owner": "marleebesana1333", "likes": 13}, {"id": 17885872623278650, "text": "Can you redo the dirt bike vs horse but with sm who can ride LMAO", "created_at": "2025-06-06T20:22:16", "owner": "landon_dino_nerd_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17867342790311022, "text": "Lmaooo", "created_at": "2025-06-06T20:21:49", "owner": "landon_dino_nerd_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18078330937843639, "text": "If I wouldn’t get in trouble, I’d trace my brother with a horse", "created_at": "2025-06-06T20:19:47", "owner": "hugheymadison", "likes": 25}, {"id": 18359306344198020, "text": "I know she’s traumatized whenever she sees that horse😭😭", "created_at": "2025-06-06T20:18:13", "owner": "seydi.v.12", "likes": 78007}, {"id": 17887656591165701, "text": "first comment", "created_at": "2025-06-06T20:17:38", "owner": "reedrylanleigh07", "likes": 9}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3757060647294055435, "shortcode": "DQjwsDBj7QL", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DQjwsDBj7QL/", "taken_at": "2025-11-02T15:16:43", "caption": "The way she said Meow 😭 \n\n[🎬] Desperate Housewives\n\nDesperate Housewives is an American mystery comedy-drama television series created by Marc Cherry, and produced by ABC Studios and Cherry Productions. It aired for eight seasons on ABC from October 3, 2004, until May 13, 2012, for a total of 180 episodes. Executive producer Marc Cherry served as showrunner. Other executive producers since the fourth season included Bob Daily, George W. Perkins, John Pardee, Joey Murphy, David Grossman, and Larry Shaw.", "owner_username": "the.nostalgic.addict", "owner_id": "61160797131", "likes": 73406, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0086_DQjwsDBj7QL\\DQjwsDBj7QL_20251102_151643.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18100759750780070, "text": "Follow us 🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-09T22:29:51", "owner": "the.nostalgic.addict", "likes": 152}, {"id": 18081459311088045, "text": "Did they actually made a child dress like this ? Bruh", "created_at": "2025-11-10T16:24:21", "owner": "facun_senz", "likes": 1179}, {"id": 18075006694983492, "text": "She’s like 12… 😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-08T20:19:19", "owner": "mattiassjodin_82", "likes": 1945}, {"id": 18550783969010516, "text": "Mee-Aaw.. 😁", "created_at": "2025-11-12T17:52:05", "owner": "joseph_reynolds_59", "likes": 51}, {"id": 18087187270768214, "text": "epic scene ' MEOW' 👍😂👊", "created_at": "2025-11-11T20:18:40", "owner": "gioramolani", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18082972970050248, "text": "Explain: Lynette is separated from her husband Tom, and Tom’s girlfriend is getting close to her daughter. The girlfriend even offered to make a Halloween costume for her, so Lynette got jealous and said she’d do it herself. But she secretly just bought one… and that was the result. 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-05T11:25:07", "owner": "seuru7i", "likes": 189}, {"id": 18086451587308753, "text": "I love this show! 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-04T23:11:15", "owner": "stitch_62608", "likes": 100}, {"id": 18061291127176114, "text": "Can someone explain to me why lynette did that...... Cause i'm sure she did that with a purpose😂", "created_at": "2025-11-04T07:37:47", "owner": "w.i.n.t.e.r.b.e.l.l", "likes": 518}, {"id": 18027097802554662, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-06T07:02:11", "owner": "travisgarvin005", "likes": 466}, {"id": 18139283245454710, "text": "Hollywood and their obsession with sexualizing kids. \nThey did a similar costume in “modern family”", "created_at": "2025-11-11T21:18:18", "owner": "pooooooopooooor", "likes": 240}, {"id": 18080557553130937, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:23:46", "owner": "_renizeqo1_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18497408317075966, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T17:47:07", "owner": "antonio.robbery", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100060882691015, "text": "😃😃", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:46:47", "owner": "fadl_46fr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075931907274999, "text": "Meow 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-05T07:38:42", "owner": "she___is___a_lady", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18185660419340916, "text": "That is fucked up, who is behind the scenes making a child wear this kind of clothing for a movie scene. I am disgusted at the ppl behind this and should go to jail in my opinion", "created_at": "2025-11-11T16:11:09", "owner": "a_ceiling_fan111", "likes": 41}, {"id": 18092174617923889, "text": "Movie name?", "created_at": "2025-11-13T22:24:18", "owner": "connorrothen62", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971835963796471, "text": "Can someone please tell me the name of the movie?", "created_at": "2025-11-10T15:26:09", "owner": "dingmans_o_shit", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073578568986226, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-04T14:37:50", "owner": "v._.s._.v123", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18539768071009618, "text": "She have a TAIL?!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:02:41", "owner": "k.kroenen.1945", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082382282278966, "text": "The TAIL!!???", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:44:14", "owner": "ranlebogabonem", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17862838794534556, "text": "Who directed this...tf", "created_at": "2025-11-30T19:59:10", "owner": "earlrides", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060351815234612, "text": "\"Trick or Treating for dollar bills\" 😭😭😭🙏🏽🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-12T11:54:03", "owner": "your_tribal_chief_isiah", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18047892716691199, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:50:55", "owner": "3utba_69", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18107670487549831, "text": "What show is this", "created_at": "2025-11-09T14:13:01", "owner": "bradwatson17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077895202907374, "text": "\"Attacked by dogs\"? Really? 🤨", "created_at": "2025-11-10T18:13:18", "owner": "mkeguide_org", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18097311190836566, "text": "I think that was moms-💀🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-19T13:14:35", "owner": "ultraspamsuperstar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062803058181251, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-12T01:52:17", "owner": "emon__su", "likes": 28}, {"id": 17970731156972000, "text": "She is just cosplaying catwoman so what's wrong with it?", "created_at": "2025-11-09T21:27:47", "owner": "___jan7", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18073310222587358, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-11T23:46:47", "owner": "lowpressuresodiumvaporlamp", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17868253554471718, "text": "…This is why you need fathers. Stop normalizing this single mother crap, Hollywood.", "created_at": "2025-11-10T07:15:21", "owner": "hisway1", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17850740787548681, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-09T19:03:51", "owner": "arienchengkan", "likes": 105}, {"id": 17850646656588806, "text": "I ain't a pedo but GODDAMN!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-10T08:49:53", "owner": "rapier_03", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18106633642618251, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-09T18:16:19", "owner": "tedidulli", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18080755148111160, "text": "Jews at it again", "created_at": "2025