{"media_id": 3776814533009545079, "shortcode": "DRp8M6ukRd3", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRp8M6ukRd3/", "taken_at": "2025-11-29T21:27:01", "caption": "On the 7th day He rested… but first He hit that 6-7 😂 \n\n#christianhumor #jesus #67 #ugc #fyp #funny", "owner_username": "jennpalfreyman", "owner_id": "590618984", "likes": 2473113, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0088_DRp8M6ukRd3\\DRp8M6ukRd3_20251129_212701.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18048249125423772, "text": "this would've done numbers on vine", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:02:24", "owner": "oh.hey.its.me.maarz", "likes": 212495}, {"id": 17954498988028955, "text": "Jesus deciding if he should rest on day 6 or day 7 lol", "created_at": "2025-12-02T05:28:42", "owner": "candy.cane2720", "likes": 81435}, {"id": 18341124739229946, "text": "BRUUUUH 😭😭💀", "created_at": "2025-11-30T21:56:49", "owner": "johannaenough", "likes": 34581}, {"id": 17877070467351256, "text": "Literally best 6-7 I’ve seen 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:40:08", "owner": "jle.128", "likes": 2366}, {"id": 18064228592426967, "text": "I was not expecting the portrait 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:41:04", "owner": "kelsgorgeous", "likes": 2026}, {"id": 18090818879498336, "text": "Jesus is like I’m doing this one for the kids lol", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:29:58", "owner": "m_to_the_j_ayye", "likes": 1416}, {"id": 17899949904341999, "text": "Oh Lawwwd", "created_at": "2025-12-11T03:52:35", "owner": "jules_wasmyfirstlove", "likes": 14}, {"id": 17994154322707558, "text": "“So I had six or seven loaves….”", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:55:47", "owner": "seshen7", "likes": 65523}, {"id": 17898087075348118, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:44:26", "owner": "its_futile8", "likes": 1245}, {"id": 18083923364098973, "text": "Okay this one is actually funny 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:18:05", "owner": "piecingmoments", "likes": 3967}, {"id": 18542738128060612, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:30:57", "owner": "doughertydozen", "likes": 292}, {"id": 18101359972687977, "text": "I think Jesus just looked down from the Throne, facepalmed then chuckled. 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:06:00", "owner": "shadoxir.wav", "likes": 2782}, {"id": 18088490195304249, "text": "“Wait wha— ….oh” 💀", "created_at": "2025-12-03T17:33:24", "owner": "juicyjuiceusa", "likes": 3590}, {"id": 18382062034149706, "text": "He knew this was going to happen, and He still chose to die for us. We are truly blessed.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:14:53", "owner": "sir_william_2nd", "likes": 26009}, {"id": 18424362628117007, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:12:50", "owner": "dellmac301", "likes": 27}, {"id": 18183902311348736, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T10:21:02", "owner": "_mdhv_n_10", "likes": 13284}, {"id": 18095435512892344, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T11:15:05", "owner": "_matekiladze_", "likes": 678}, {"id": 18138421753461050, "text": "may god have mercy upon your souls", "created_at": "2025-12-12T18:33:32", "owner": "comea_tmebro3", "likes": 66}, {"id": 18514824619071078, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T09:29:53", "owner": "anike", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17886252945406086, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T10:32:50", "owner": "dutchaunda", "likes": 50}, {"id": 18368432815087219, "text": "BROO😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T05:03:43", "owner": "miguelsaldana23", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18053767403349389, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T04:49:01", "owner": "david_chac0n", "likes": 84}, {"id": 17944092744083508, "text": "So my 6 year old wasn’t lying? He told me 6-7 is from the Bible😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:59:42", "owner": "ozgefullmoon", "likes": 3873}, {"id": 18076019306005551, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T21:09:45", "owner": "j_valentova13", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18034346588526644, "text": "First time I ever laughed at this", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:57:56", "owner": "the_dadvocateig