er view", "created_at": "2025-12-13T06:37:53", "owner": "radityainmalbourt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18544591333032972, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-13T11:08:33", "owner": "dafinagadragon", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18105867478640895, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-13T11:18:32", "owner": "munizafaisal", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17932040427118134, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-13T09:10:29", "owner": "z.__.aa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18536190139001465, "text": "💀👏", "created_at": "2025-12-13T09:13:28", "owner": "lily_maraino", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075446867250051, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-13T12:18:49", "owner": "ullis_me", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18421761562115192, "text": "Uhhhhmmm why is a LITERALLY BABY SAYING IT?!?! ISN'T HE BABY TOO YOUNG FOR THIS??", "created_at": "2025-12-13T13:20:54", "owner": "claudialachicaloca78", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17847159969612461, "text": "BRO ICANT 😭💀🤣😭💀 @seba.mrtn", "created_at": "2025-12-01T10:28:25", "owner": "dennyyooo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17994019031706704, "text": "are u telling me this meme was promised to us 3000 years ago?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:08:51", "owner": "tal_.asf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113345191588981, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:33:25", "owner": "shuffled_steps", "likes": 45}, {"id": 17876940477356526, "text": "😂😂😂😂😍😍😍 The accuracy", "created_at": "2025-12-01T02:46:25", "owner": "darealbbjudy", "likes": 188}, {"id": 18104788921660554, "text": "😭🤣🤣🤣😭👏", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:10:52", "owner": "rex.wastaken", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18111679873591327, "text": "If she knows this “meme” then she prolly too old for that binky 😭 🤦🏼‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:50:20", "owner": "thewhitebro", "likes": 528}, {"id": 18087584158971302, "text": "Okay this 1 time i will accept it 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T13:25:53", "owner": "consational_79", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074676662251385, "text": "😭😭🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:36:00", "owner": "samanthaidio", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17949072267052959, "text": "Six heaven", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:16:31", "owner": "benji.gvh", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18164875453351790, "text": "i love the idea that since god’s all knowing that technically means he saw this trend and possibly posed like that a lot knowing what it would mean 2,000 years later 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-30T22:05:43", "owner": "theemilio_contreras", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18430208251128814, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:05:24", "owner": "coachvalj", "likes": 32}, {"id": 18089250943938092, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:01:34", "owner": "xshx_3", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18154416721410962, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-08T18:46:46", "owner": "www23102009", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18117164824566991, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-12T16:40:14", "owner": "madziiaa_91", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17881559010327185, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T07:48:12", "owner": "azqaahdyh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061112108540534, "text": "Nonono,he keeps the air flowing (because there are two holes on his hands )💀💀💀", "created_at": "2025-12-13T05:30:53", "owner": "ctyn_0321", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17861255526477858, "text": "NOOOO😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:27:26", "owner": "onlineniku", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961816887991796, "text": "And on the 6th or 7th day, the Lord rested.", "created_at": "2025-12-12T16:17:32", "owner": "lydia.grace1", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17946263811079436, "text": "Omg. No 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-13T02:57:01", "owner": "lyla.m.shea", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18034032953726643, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T05:23:59", "owner": "az_mirshad", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081155597153718, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T16:40:25", "owner": "doryaann", "likes": 23}, {"id": 18065316920389083, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-13T04:22:59", "owner": "tetetg1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17848238586614635, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-13T01:36:43", "owner": "zakiria", "likes": 1}, {"i