}, {"id": 17869083726496106, "text": "HE IS JELP ME", "created_at": "2025-12-07T04:39:56", "owner": "xr1l3ssizt00swaggxx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17849023980609346, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-07T04:31:57", "owner": "hari.mahefa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17845767210606583, "text": "8 or 9", "created_at": "2025-12-07T04:25:40", "owner": "topeschack", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096787663849578, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T04:22:43", "owner": "pam_goff66", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076770182216891, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T04:20:41", "owner": "roxannagomez_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17970789701972647, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T04:18:33", "owner": "the_dr.longwood", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048350582452255, "text": "😌", "created_at": "2025-12-07T04:11:13", "owner": "phattarawadee__chanawong", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17992686638900339, "text": "To be fair, he does kind of look like he's doing that. Maybe he was really ahead of his time and that's the real reason why he got crucified", "created_at": "2025-12-07T04:04:42", "owner": "trellmke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18212338138312874, "text": "@ssolacole, @eyelacole", "created_at": "2025-12-07T03:55:57", "owner": "mzbcole", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18206898067315002, "text": "NOT JESUS 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-07T03:55:25", "owner": "broisthatnox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104383096680054, "text": "Galatians 6:7\nNew International Version\n7 Do not be deceived: God cannot be mocked. A man reaps what he sows ....accurate", "created_at": "2025-12-07T03:54:29", "owner": "aigo_kakashi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888956116393000, "text": "I dont get it.", "created_at": "2025-12-07T03:49:53", "owner": "sheilather_londonont", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925863133189218, "text": "I am gonna end my misery", "created_at": "2025-12-07T03:46:57", "owner": "lala.wth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964542753851706, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T03:45:16", "owner": "courtneyyoulllove", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17920547088217843, "text": "Now I know that it was def prophesied in the old testament 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T03:27:43", "owner": "mumtowilliam", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17923616241049403, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T03:18:48", "owner": "_johqns_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843272236635182, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T03:17:25", "owner": "originalronald", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087600970954386, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T03:14:25", "owner": "realitys_dream_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18338794681225550, "text": "Why this kid still have a pacifier", "created_at": "2025-12-07T03:13:36", "owner": "littrell_ryan1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968883573991037, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T03:02:48", "owner": "nathanparsly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086997628960285, "text": "I quit", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:55:56", "owner": "ki.dwknd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115056436575006, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:55:46", "owner": "marinninna", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075581678265192, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:50:30", "owner": "_bluebrat", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18305854639269950, "text": "LMAO", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:49:14", "owner": "single2singleton", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090760909930158, "text": "6+7=13", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:42:17", "owner": "fuelgoodglendora", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087694933808680, "text": "I mean he did biblically 6-7", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:39:02", "owner": "theebluest", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923188321053402, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:20:52", "owner": "j.bueno_g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016387145630514, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:17:11", "owner": "palz_14_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18160150645402680, "text": "😭😭💀💀", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:17:02", "owner": "___tasmia_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060925529635809, "text": "He was trying to figure out the Lords Day, 6th or 7th day of the week.", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:14:28", "owner": "soulmate517", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136668691486870, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:05:03", "owner": "naightlife", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068456984457852, "text": "@sarahgvnde", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:04:32", "owner": "cc510j", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962944776858799, "text": "💀", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:01:27", "owner": "doctahbarillas", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083567738113254, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:00:24", "owner": "yafa._.yasin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17876428713446355, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T01:48:45", "owner": "fish_lord22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869538619477843, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T01:44:51", "owner": "jacob200811347", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922581238206625, "text": "My parents have a Jesus pic that my husband swears hes throwing up gang signs in it 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-07T01:29:13", "owner": "aliciatbebeh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056316761322528, "text": "Up in heaven… six seveeeen", "created_at": "2025-12-07T01:27:00", "owner": "geminiangel92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080746337231931, "text": "💀", "created_at": "2025-12-07T01:26:44", "owner": "imanolmatos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18317295511217436, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T01:25:38", "owner": "ureawildmistake", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082682351110333, "text": "This has gotta be a sin", "created_at": "2025-12-07T01:17:29", "owner": "eatingdicloxacillin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087207466963479, "text": "Oh mygod 🗣️💔🔥🥀", "created_at": "2025-12-07T01:16:43", "owner": "rzki_henrique", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18033405497743516, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T01:11:51", "owner": "authenticallyzaria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087580829052159, "text": "@courtney_pound", "created_at": "2025-12-07T00:45:50", "owner": "trenity_tene", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982516446921958, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T00:40:00", "owner": "grabernadine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157429678408066, "text": "🤦🏻‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-12-07T00:31:40", "owner": "liv8055", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074668580010109, "text": "Funny, but crazy how an innocent child looked at a religious or spiritual figure as a joke like in that major sporting event 😉. Still a funny video though 😆.", "created_at": "2025-12-07T00:29:32", "owner": "xivenoix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18495206278072394, "text": "You gotta take that picture down now 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T00:28:01", "owner": "xkennyrtx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079806172913617, "text": "Today 6 tomorrow 7 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-07T00:07:53", "owner": "pao_nikolaza", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18034010291724568, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-07T00:06:12", "owner": "jillynmueller", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18125297005520642, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T23:59:48", "owner": "azhigulov.n69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088907428981881, "text": "When Vine comes back you need to upload this asap 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-06T23:56:58", "owner": "nikkilauranwrites", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18086934511967288, "text": "@elw_93", "created_at": "2025-12-06T23:51:10", "owner": "terriwithanni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842312935644048, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T23:48:48", "owner": "chicafierce", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18099022948691750, "text": "@wiselifewithv", "created_at": "2025-12-06T23:36:59", "owner": "leahbreanna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547720903049251, "text": "@ritikayadavv_", "created_at": "2025-12-06T23:31:52", "owner": "calebgeorge16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986870967870474, "text": "@minfordsj 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T23:30:15", "owner": "stephaniem005", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301008694283126, "text": "@jenniiferr.ortezz", "created_at": "2025-12-06T23:29:09", "owner": "esc0_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088529194950079, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-06T23:23:01", "owner": "dawnka_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17955157635023092, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-06T23:19:57", "owner": "avilagracielaplascencia", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18396071416134719, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-06T23:16:11", "owner": "mrs_ndupu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17902888077324815, "text": "MANO PQ A @flaviacalina CURTIU ISSO?? KAKAKAKAAKAKAKAKKAK", "created_at": "2025-12-06T23:15:17", "owner": "tatalovemetal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054709610663243, "text": "OK, incredible 💀", "created_at": "2025-12-06T23:10:23", "owner": "pricecommasteve", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18353556844166688, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T23:07:52", "owner": "_cashcobbs", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18303732283268019, "text": "What did she say?", "created_at": "2025-12-06T23:06:11", "owner": "little_ego._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064046003183524, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T23:05:41", "owner": "owen.thompson0213", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084133856028634, "text": "Is that white Mormon Jesus 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T23:03:05", "owner": "bonnie_clyde_26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901014382181590, "text": "@luciano_pattipawaej5 @desym_ynl", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:47:06", "owner": "miltonpattipawaej", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545430619022641, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:46:58", "owner": "leoqs13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105008200655336, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:46:01", "owner": "kelly_marie_french", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065401946413708, "text": "I broke the house 6-7 ban because I had to show my son this 😂 (yes, Im the mean mom that was about to lose her mind so I told my son that I would prefer that he keep that...somewhere else. Anywhere else.)", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:44:40", "owner": "brandi.bourne", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18091199839820684, "text": "Let her go touch grass Please for all our sake", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:43:25", "owner": "elpidaxarakida", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17983758044921827, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:35:42", "owner": "__innergoddess", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17991808292856448, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:31:25", "owner": "anthiauniquee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542701339039959, "text": "No", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:31:17", "owner": "oliviajovanovicc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18333776434209833, "text": "Why’d my mom also send me this…", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:29:05", "owner": "madelynhnatiuk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133170640490228, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:28:22", "owner": "laurelbell85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987619272872512, "text": "@rinafantasy 😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:26:36", "owner": "catcondia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031722479539895, "text": "I hate this meme... But this got a giggle out of me X3", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:23:47", "owner": "harukaze_desu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068900543575592, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:15:57", "owner": "broqwerty123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544982752056734, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:15:06", "owner": "kht_orion_hobbyhorse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126885622504051, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:08:24", "owner": "246_bvnes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032304770665487, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:04:22", "owner": "dixit_maria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329289148242479, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:04:18", "owner": "dixit_maria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880512775329925, "text": "Can u delete children like Alt F4", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:02:32", "owner": "oskar_11_04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866704009514690, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:01:55", "owner": "theuzrare", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18174345559371705, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:56:17", "owner": "_gymbro4lyfe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088196182985934, "text": "Haha I’m not a church goer but when my dad died he wanted to have his funeral in a church and at the church they have a massive party Jesus statue. He is ready for a rave. I couldn’t not see it. 😂 at least I was able to have a little giggle at such a sad time.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:50:02", "owner": "philly.vdl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060059522273215, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:49:23", "owner": "alonzo_medina__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100082302819046, "text": "It was prophecy all along", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:45:50", "owner": "tyler_m.j_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855939922575300, "text": "The way she can tell she's accidentally doing a bit 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:37:10", "owner": "benbriggsmusic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088976707985112, "text": "SHE IS RIGHT AND SHE SHOULD SAY IT", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:36:43", "owner": "benbriggsmusic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069401216579638, "text": "Damn", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:28:15", "owner": "bubblesmaria910", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069820217078140, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:27:14", "owner": "k.kirkland14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072143585587301, "text": "So Jesus is who started it all? 😮", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:25:37", "owner": "taide_chavez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915044500238168, "text": "Fuck this account", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:24:34", "owner": "the_firm_handshake", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089765488980261, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:19:08", "owner": "silverpig3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075522356351263, "text": "Amen but the answer is 42", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:15:07", "owner": "69tipsea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184516180350615, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:08:50", "owner": "_ja_ni_ne_4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062986670213871, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:01:51", "owner": "dannygurl_08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302141986283811, "text": "Someone please cut off the internet for the Yankees", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:55:29", "owner": "julio.n.19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145319653451668, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:55:07", "owner": "nader.a.kader", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048547850450649, "text": "Sad", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:53:37", "owner": "anniethechef", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977648112949140, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:46:32", "owner": "om