t funny", "created_at": "2025-12-06T07:55:28", "owner": "alvin.a___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872956738464369, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T07:45:59", "owner": "bd678899", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845812270601573, "text": "Bruhh... lol he knowsss !!", "created_at": "2025-12-06T07:43:53", "owner": "naynaylocs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132004453494941, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T07:38:40", "owner": "reeveytown_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112792477606554, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T07:34:48", "owner": "prettybrowntam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063870548532394, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-06T07:33:01", "owner": "shutup_aaradhya7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013120079804922, "text": "Jesus", "created_at": "2025-12-06T07:31:37", "owner": "jakobderelektromagier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064366853191511, "text": "That ain't Jesus", "created_at": "2025-12-06T07:28:46", "owner": "iman_almalki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103625527675639, "text": "@mapau30", "created_at": "2025-12-06T07:22:01", "owner": "luisaromerin5.8.3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033684506724970, "text": "JAJAJAJAJAJAJJAAJAJAJJAJAJAJA", "created_at": "2025-12-06T07:21:46", "owner": "luisaromerin5.8.3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903069715321936, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T07:15:44", "owner": "702ejunior", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001867928834688, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T07:00:15", "owner": "pr.bml", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064457276560947, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T06:59:38", "owner": "marsbel31212", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960620307871702, "text": "dont laugh😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T06:58:37", "owner": "alw_nd_hungry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860624413554622, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T06:56:07", "owner": "karmanomics", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935132026105423, "text": "🙃🙃🙃", "created_at": "2025-12-06T06:44:10", "owner": "its.ta_jacksonx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051042806657562, "text": "All the haters... for those of you who are confused,