: "jacecarstens", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101876041705143, "text": "😭 @__tonicia__", "created_at": "2025-12-05T23:48:45", "owner": "teeemmduhb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080076319912969, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T23:47:35", "owner": "andewlopez343", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901294672336778, "text": "okay but why is jesus doing that. is he a prophet or something", "created_at": "2025-12-05T23:47:24", "owner": "just.chezz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052178339341996, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T23:31:33", "owner": "janz1246", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18501464980072980, "text": "Hey Jesus, how many days do you think it’ll take to make the earth?\nJesus: I don’t know… 6, 7? 🤷🏻‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-12-05T23:28:26", "owner": "logangenduso", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17979968174933179, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T23:28:19", "owner": "dana.hjo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17948758094932463, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T23:23:13", "owner": "asht0nish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073158680604196, "text": "Jesus isn't doing 67, when he opens his palms like that he is probably in a prayer, blessings or healings. And for most of u that don't know what 67 means listen to the music and thank me later.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T23:16:23", "owner": "bluelili2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908959405270697, "text": "She's too cute and too young 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-05T23:03:36", "owner": "mara.0301_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17873456412462650, "text": "That man on ur wall is doing 6-7. We don’t know what Jesus is doing.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T23:01:21", "owner": "deycallmenish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890684662253463, "text": "Oh….my….god!", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:59:41", "owner": "amanduh_jean", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18038664542708106, "text": "Oh fucking you do you wanna fucking fist in your fucking in or your fucking face? Because that is not what sex is it’s a demonic evil thing 89", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:54:30", "owner": "ry46769", "likes": 0}