nt deities that the singer prays too. But this is better 😆", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:22:46", "owner": "victoriarebeca__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055087604654633, "text": "@_n4homii", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:22:12", "owner": "dyupp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064561727402249, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:21:11", "owner": "maxpascarella", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18334320115300194, "text": "Blow up the baby", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:19:00", "owner": "jaylynn0.69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053023331662069, "text": "This generation is finna be cooked when its gonna turn 2027 cuz of 67😭", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:18:14", "owner": "dylan_iscool305", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18399110320124713, "text": "No way 😂👏🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:16:54", "owner": "sarinka_sakii", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17989500590862929, "text": "La generación alfa esta perdida", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:16:48", "owner": "crazygamer2011122", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084496826319638, "text": "@tarekeddib @malle.bjj 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:12:56", "owner": "bellarebeckabaier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919991209084154, "text": "....wtf", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:11:34", "owner": "0nlyy.xl0vv_.c0m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866635921506051, "text": "🔥”6-7 Merry Christmas Heaven”🔥\n\nhttps://www.instagram.com/reels/audio/2289857364863696?igsh=ZHRyNGY2dnh2OW1r", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:11:07", "owner": "n8begaganagani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048527615422736, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:09:24", "owner": "tammytalks1575", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096741889877691, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:07:47", "owner": "isrolior", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853078921592994, "text": "Jesus is not doing 6 7 before GTA VI", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:07:20", "owner": "aidenududhd", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070855235366746, "text": "I mean, she’s not lying 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:06:48", "owner": "theresarockface", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18341351722224683, "text": "💀💀