ber is 7, y'all know what that means right?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:24:42", "owner": "ilk4rma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071364959071206, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:23:19", "owner": "misken2911", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18161392468401155, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:21:21", "owner": "benzotoast_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17906061666292104, "text": "💀", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:15:10", "owner": "suehey_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075795515221673, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:15:04", "owner": "queen.dayna", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17874525228459490, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:10:18", "owner": "schattenschlag321", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293403904274827, "text": "@hawkma4 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:10:13", "owner": "salman_alsalman2009", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17952627141047886, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:09:41", "owner": "alaiyah982023", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17893327728368730, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:06:24", "owner": "r0siep0ps", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078772486945863, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T20:55:45", "owner": "max_249r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062356007206717, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T20:55:36", "owner": "jinxjass", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18538039075016749, "text": "Biblically accurate 6-7 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T20:43:55", "owner": "ricoginkgo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136385992422809, "text": "I need that", "created_at": "2025-12-05T20:43:18", "owner": "codyclawsoncaldwell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18277804162304650, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T20:41:54", "owner": "small.dih.big.dreams", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098212228642045, "text": "Y'all be joking about everything just remembered one sin God can't forgive is disrespect", "created_at": "2025-12-05T20:38:55", "owner": "book_worm.gk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17916168510229098, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T20:34:15", "owner": "cao_sv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18201842761321163, "text"