", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075433777999040, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:29:52", "owner": "brownjacket38", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18248688148292733, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:26:23", "owner": "maxontianna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075605018223148, "text": "She Got a point!!! Lmaoo", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:23:28", "owner": "love_diz_money", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141158932456688, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:22:55", "owner": "joycecarlino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102585928707194, "text": "And on the 6th 7th day…", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:22:48", "owner": "averyhufff", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18416098660184683, "text": "😂😂😂💀", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:22:44", "owner": "chronically_uniquelyjaime1985", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842312047636889, "text": "@esthertuitert", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:22:21", "owner": "djeenlill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004241807821406, "text": "⁶🤷⁷", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:18:40", "owner": "abdulmajidadam37", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18108771733717790, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:15:49", "owner": "train.w.aysia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18174881017374979, "text": "😭 teach her something good", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:14:10", "owner": "itzrealf1l1r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143860609444833, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:09:59", "owner": "thenextdoriangayle", "likes": 97}, {"id": 18026320166780149, "text": "⁶🤷‍♂️⁷", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:09:20", "owner": "roughhroughh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906246136277360, "text": "Disrespect btw", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:08:07", "owner": "unknowlqser", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544717807038854, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:05:49", "owner": "miiss_llc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296225506278957, "text": "@imanirlewis", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:00:50", "owner": "mrglassclass", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108495157559107, "text": "You shouldn't have an iPad yet! How the fuck dese she know 6 7", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:00:11", "owner": "tomy201221", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096084121848594, "text": "💀💀💀💀💀", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:59:08", "owner": "shinelikesheen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063358841443314, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:57:41", "owner": "zayvon_tosadori", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955744729012568, "text": "What does 6 7 mean?", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:56:58", "owner": "h.y.0m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18505013101078581, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:56:32", "owner": "jonsmom89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021504827787353, "text": "That's not funny but god bless your little girl ❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:53:33", "owner": "97_.robert", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048023642455782, "text": "@_lova_johansson @a1exjohansson", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:51:32", "owner": "carro_johansson80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18251683498295547, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:51:10", "owner": "yauna.bihhhh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894756958362561, "text": "𝓗𝓪 (°ロ°) !", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:50:26", "owner": "eva.lawder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047812868449702, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:49:37", "owner": "localsun_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990024915909858, "text": "Hier ist der Beweis das die Leute zur Jesu Zeit der Trend schon bekannt war 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:48:35", "owner": "rickelenhannahvan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18492068230075858, "text": "Omg 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:48:27", "owner": "blakindi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929292313150601, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:48:19", "owner": "pedronasc304", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18490862332076899, "text": "Good luck Charlie, you’re gonna need it", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:48:02", "owner": "the_new_nooch_the_king", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18009252371812833, "text": "What's about 6-7? I don't get it", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:47:48", "owner": "forged_ram_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873288892463186, "text": "And then you realise Jesus died for that..", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:47:47", "owner": "vassilis_142", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969026748830891, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:45:39", "owner": "bzin_26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088324312974549, "text": "I can’t unsee it 🤣😭", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:38:33", "owner": "mommysmagnificentmess", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032661590734135, "text": "She got a point tho why is there a painting OF GOD", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:34:43", "owner": "napleon.xx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955015408031066, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:32:17", "owner": "jay_22_eeeeee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868144060492926, "text": "Charlie Charlie 😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:31:33", "owner": "its_me_jhyna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058343819302771, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:30:43", "owner": "ark8802", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100083202752359, "text": "@jacksbigpapa", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:29:40", "owner": "nomamn_1988", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943379764085507, "text": "Suuuuuuuuu", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:28:25", "owner": "itz_yass_min", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077585603226136, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:27:15", "owner": "ashkins13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098820817652343, "text": "The fact that you guys will get that friend that’s a ritual 67 is a ritual like in the other cop saying it’s funny that’s not funny😮💀", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:26:29", "owner": "kris200918", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989863101912662, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:21:19", "owner": "nailsglxari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856638601568897, "text": "@dzbos", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:20:52", "owner": "becherovvvka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097426237877231, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:18:07", "owner": "mwadi_na", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082635712890163, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:13:00", "owner": "_leo.mller", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18051707756371458, "text": "No fucking way lmfaooo", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:12:07", "owner": 