25-12-03T19:12:15", "owner": "sowreaperist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856015651522837, "text": "@_.pagey._ 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-03T19:11:52", "owner": "ima.lejand", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18050836106680715, "text": "I dont understand this💀", "created_at": "2025-12-03T19:11:35", "owner": "jerguus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000741575835856, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣 he RESTED ON THE 7TH DAY", "created_at": "2025-12-03T19:11:30", "owner": "lashaylee__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035708405520551, "text": "Amen 👇", "created_at": "2025-12-03T19:08:23", "owner": "davi.dremer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088132015949998, "text": "1st. Really not funny to make jokes on God.. 2nd why a small kid have access on social media and know trends..", "created_at": "2025-12-03T19:04:39", "owner": "rita.q.r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931671460148999, "text": "💀🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-03T19:04:03", "owner": "_atomic_amber_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092806954731300, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T19:01:14", "owner": "aydennic44", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964621911991331, "text": "That's why ALLAH the true God doesn't show us His face, so that we don't do these trivial things We cannot depict our Creator", "created_at": "2025-12-03T19:01:14", "owner": "ada_jjk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079315772467064, "text": "@lydia.blake__", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:58:48", "owner": "joannagibson.ellis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073823582364282, "text": "@sahil_5_9_5_9", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:56:11", "owner": "euuuu.guru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080299859177460, "text": "6/7 is a demonic chant. Let's NOT joke about this with Jesus... not trying to be rude. Just look up the real meaning behind it.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:54:06", "owner": "scranton.g2531", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107143597646170, "text": "Ts so ass", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:49:10", "owner": "its_joseph_28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890956222385426, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:48:09", "owner": "_x6d9_", "likes": 149}, {"id": 18087899305973715, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:42:02", "owner": "imnotibnu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031733627732090, "text": "Hate from Florida", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:40:34", "owner": "ben_don_johnson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068331464613020, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:40:25", "owner": "kantate3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990843258857480, "text": "That’s not Jesus, it’s some Spanish dudes son… but whatever", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:37:39", "owner": "nick_brooks_aka_scoobsweetlove", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084664652512023, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:37:14", "owner": "prettiii_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994612950712883, "text": "HAHHAHAA", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:36:50", "owner": "leahlovesjadee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093319756727991, "text": "Stahppppp it 💀😭", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:35:21", "owner": "colombianaa32", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064830134573585, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:32:43", "owner": "a0iuz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894668002361600, "text": "Even jesus knew the 67 theory", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:29:40", "owner": "bob149322", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18191425654338456, "text": "He been on that forever", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:29:27", "owner": "sleepy_slaps", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973621539806145, "text": "What in the white Jesus… 👀", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:24:08", "owner": "ameenah_asante", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892165606243364, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:20:48", "owner": "veiledemu731925", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065194187400645, "text": "I like to think Jesus would find it objectively funny", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:18:53", "owner": "angusbugga", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18092011658507531, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:15:42", "owner": "jenniferk.justwink", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065723780614103, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:15:33", "owner": "cheap._.v0dka", "likes": 557}, {"id": 17942028576092633, "text": "Good Fuking Dmmit", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:14:14", "owner": "avarela_02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122487211523177, "text": "Saying this because I had issues, I would look into her teeth and make sure the binky isn’t messing with her teeth :( mine did that and it sucked !!!", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:13:22", "owner": "tanner_sw1nd4ll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101657437610301, "text": "I still don't know wtf 6 7 mean", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:11:26", "owner": "tonekaallen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087854218811836, "text": "67 is demonic so no he isnt", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:10:18", "owner": "ivenlink2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100019398744846, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂@", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:09:44", "owner": "supernovastarlight0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103020721736524, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:05:06", "owner": "nband2433", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031036313729655, "text": "@c4ryss.s", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:03:51", "owner": "dan_dan_92", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084561845012965, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:01:20", "owner": "erick29417", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18389544358180921, "text": "I need that frame", "created_at": "2025-12-03T17:57:47", "owner": "jameser.7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951746668050871, "text": "Gen alpha’s done for", "created_at": "2025-12-03T17:54:50", "owner": "sl33ples_nights", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366986302088171, "text": "LMFAOOOO", "created_at": "2025-12-03T17:54:05", "owner": "yzm.iii", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17849921082603151, "text": "Wtf?", "created_at": "2025-12-03T17:53:17", "owner": "legendary_ponyta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322034056175732, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T17:52:35", "owner": "reda_vv17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048563183422516, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T17:50:50", "owner": "mattlately", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864424084518499, "text": "6 7", "created_at": "2025-12-03T17:50:41", "owner": "bethbennett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18167679829376945, "text": "LMFAOOO😭😭", "created_at": "2025-1