4158842163798, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:57:36", "owner": "negrita0426", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18514581973066363, "text": "@racheldawn1123", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:56:26", "owner": "sherribaby99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18186295978342670, "text": "Love it! Too cute!", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:55:54", "owner": "sheilafulton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109391233532393, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:54:12", "owner": "vish_anjali78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849900406600969, "text": "We're all biblically cooked fam...", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:54:07", "owner": "naz.arjuna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100038175691492, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:51:52", "owner": "xbmw.m5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987616755873053, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:51:44", "owner": "0__magbool__babiker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082695461157419, "text": "I mean she's not wrong lol", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:51:23", "owner": "jenniebattishill", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18108275635628242, "text": "Yes but no", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:48:30", "owner": "sorasakiwalker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069049490105959, "text": "Why does she still have a bunking", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:47:02", "owner": "y2k_jax12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932122006011372, "text": "that ain't Jesus ..but thats another story 🤷🏾‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:46:45", "owner": "mazzi__metr33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074485295519619, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:46:24", "owner": "parker_richardson123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054621062334709, "text": "That's a portrait of some random dude not Jesus 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:46:22", "owner": "umar_zulu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17859304659492465, "text": "Why make fun of Jesus to entertain your kids for a meme and internet clout?", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:44:52", "owner": "hassan_autobody", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143943340449781, "text": "So jesus did the og 6-7 ?😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:40:13", "owner": "_bipolarx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953938942020498, "text": "Question is what are you doing? If your child can talk, she sure the hell don’t need a pacifier.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:39:27", "owner": "studio1queen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994142373899791, "text": "As humanity we are sooooo fucked up", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:36:18", "owner": "s7riper", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085716629001304, "text": "Why Fernando Alonso why 😭😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:32:19", "owner": "saif_mt15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067435649384273, "text": "WTH😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:31:47", "owner": "kayevava", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17968805948986183, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:31:17", "owner": "moali6047", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18549345118018389, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:30:37", "owner": "dfe_and_media", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109360414623151, "text": "6767😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:26:14", "owner": "bbherna518", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18549059200028150, "text": "Got you bro!", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:26:01", "owner": "aceredacewing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050815859662886, "text": "Can someone explain this to me please", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:22:36", "owner": "war_is_stupid_2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902171197315267, "text": "@aimeemcrae", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:20:22", "owner": "parkerrosethesalon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18370764547080013, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:19:33", "owner": "thelovelyou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183622963355422, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:18:11", "owner": "kingatemie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071950949360351, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:16:43", "owner": "x_simonmewingthethird_x", "likes": 59}, {"id": 18051030368670413, "text": "Stoooop💀", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:15:57", "owner": "badass.y.bonita", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846585973596970, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:14:47", "owner": "shaunaquick_realtor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061491188240805, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:12:36", "owner": "pammy6727", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855530038529240, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:10:56", "owner": "jairus_13th", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120897025553997, "text": "I remember him doing this in John 6:7", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:03:49", "owner": "quakerdx", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18051321782373130, "text": "Officially logging off all social media Lmmfao", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:00:19", "owner": "desvalisa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008100572812999, "text": "Although she’s a kid it’s not funny, don’t encourage this kind of disrespect 👎🏼👎🏼", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:58:28", "owner": "weetie_dingo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077294378268819, "text": "😆😆", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:56:51", "owner": "kelzhintz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936406888101651, "text": "We’re cooked.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:52:49", "owner": "minimadii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089065132941683, "text": "Thats not funny and disrespectful as shit 🫩", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:52:27", "owner": "avi_yu_800", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18108722503721558, "text": "💀💀", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:52:09", "owner": "helloguyswrrt12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892065592377788, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:51:47", "owner": "__ashley__monique__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082896185126751, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:47:46", "owner": "brittanytavares_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100245241685723, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:45:57", "owner": "kiank.iamkhin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090816037745168, "text": "Nop", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:44:49", "owner": "fabricioxzzzk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061420376558944, "text": "Proverbs 6:16-19\n¹⁶There are six things the Lord hates, seven that are detestable to him:\n¹⁷ haughty eyes, a lying tongue, hands that shed innocent blood,\n¹⁸ a heart that devises wicked scheme, feet that are quick to rush into evil,\n¹⁹ a false witness who pours out lies and a person who stirs up conflict in the community.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:44:46", "owner": "kiank.iamkhin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078046400270479, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:43:35", "owner": "leifcrix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878104129439645, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:43:33", "owner": "korr_a", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18544889629012044, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:41:38", "owner": "troll.tits", "likes": 81}, {"id": 17842257234636598, "text": "O k but he literally is", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:38:46", "owner": "madelinewiggins18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028537790567846, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:35:06", "owner": "behi__h", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106247050565660, "text": "The person who rote the 67 song admitted to worship false Gods", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:33:39", "owner": "black0guy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852687925545435, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:32:54", "owner": "choco_liyah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009501137650650, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:32:06", "owner": "zeyy_dom12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064082054183500, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:28:53", "owner": "nsbates", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18512571904069371, "text": "@martha593", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:28:20", "owner": "iyouman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095510491884242, "text": "Imagine explaining this 5 years ago", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:28:19", "owner": "_.tokumei_._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176461537366524, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:27:25", "owner": "lidopimienta", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18350007484202357, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:18:46", "owner": "its_razo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060169703263405, "text": "And after he created all things on the 6th day, he rested on the 7th", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:18:01", "owner": "nathan.p.moore", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061667462235984, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:14:30", "owner": "shaimaa_aly_rsrs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866591788507905, "text": "🤣🤣😭", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:13:04", "owner": "estrellarozelle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993468417892774, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:12:49", "owner": "raregem2992", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075676925227857, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:12:45", "owner": "kristie_lee_c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075219890350758, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:11:20", "owner": "2000_jbug", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18198724186324219, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:11:02", "owner": "yoboiivega10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072799268040649, "text": "He gave his disciples six seven wines", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:11:01", "owner": "ash_mufid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005629136819221, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:10:01", "owner": "my.beloved.savage", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18348490918205495, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:06:14", "owner": "simply_melyssa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046116563466005, "text": "What's 6 7 ?", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:02:15", "owner": "mlk_vs_honey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086944868487468, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:57:24", "owner": "ajp3000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893732674367936, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:56:02", "owner": "leo_cnls2010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109208086621387, "text": "I'm taking a shit right now.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:55:59", "owner": "xysamuelxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859785679488228, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:53:05", "owner": "haircoloristgy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070745888605788, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:52:57", "owner": "boys3333k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157858705408769, "text": "Lol", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:52:48", "owner": "suzidogs2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065054438170095, "text": "Cristo se sacrifico en vano 🚬😔", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:52:11", "owner": "nose_9382", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994491828714828, "text": "💀", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:50:12", "owner": "priv.rafa_l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18507193282068727, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:48:38", "owner": "3stherg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086961548312660, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:47:58", "owner": "joyous.bhardwaj", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066928391571213, "text": "@queen_lopez91 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:46:57", "owner": "legrapes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079131334935200, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:44:49", "owner": "greengyrl06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184431670345758, "text": "The tears that have left my eyes 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:42:13", "owner": "azarri.white", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18106438774644866, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:38:30", "owner": "lacednlocs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084043355106136, "text": "Back in my day we had red pill or blue pill", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:31:42", "owner": "leeuwenarivan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129111418499848, "text": "The prophecy", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:25:49", "owner": "roy.mango.nz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145289563435110, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:22:22", "owner": "soflyy_soduggy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18328467088241193, "text": "@kmhudson2", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:20:11", "owner": "codyhudson2010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321992581171429, "text": "😭🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:19:48", "owner": "la.v3nen0sa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18160325008398402, "text": "6-7 also keeps coming back from the grave", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:18:55", "owner": "laurenhaldeman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152619373418633, "text": "She definitely doesn’t need a binky anymore😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:14:39", "owner": "_austin_253", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926320051038497, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:14:29", "owner": "twinkdrumz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083917904010312, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:11:57", "owner": "blondiemcphattie", "likes": 1}, {"id": 1809714