00718584322, "text": "Blasphemous!!!!", "created_at": "2025-12-03T00:13:19", "owner": "bobevans5347", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925778701175199, "text": "First time i laughed at this stupid 67 joke", "created_at": "2025-12-03T00:12:46", "owner": "rdeezy14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089563108967289, "text": "Hilarious", "created_at": "2025-12-03T00:08:18", "owner": "kamunakate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539575423030108, "text": "Oh no!! 🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-03T00:08:16", "owner": "lakefront_brokers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105057622641723, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T00:05:30", "owner": "nicole_gart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074070413256799, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:57:41", "owner": "ashcashradtech", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062714516629096, "text": "STOP 💀😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:57:11", "owner": "thepamelajoyful", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074588759256412, "text": "Wait till she finds out about 9-5", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:56:46", "owner": "dexterp_07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860044852553911, "text": "Is that Mormon jesus", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:51:22", "owner": "k1llswitchy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060092273258826, "text": "@i.armgcf", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:51:14", "owner": "ferk.urta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066727712141157, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:49:01", "owner": "webheadaf15", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078499028192882, "text": "What is this painting called?", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:48:03", "owner": "gameingareus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967908528834973, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:47:58", "owner": "silvie_corrales", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088424392778947, "text": "@dejchante lmfaooooo 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:47:41", "owner": "fro_goddess14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898087075348118, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:44:26", "owner": "its_futile8", "likes": 1252}, {"id": 18135228562475242, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:42:17", "owner": "dialak11", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18297422806258851, "text": "@sidequestjesus", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:41:53", "owner": "june_blooms39", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082208252032984, "text": "New South Park idea 💡", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:40:25", "owner": "busyindazone", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18388832641178234, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣No way", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:38:01", "owner": "emilybrandao55", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085666787003565, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:36:55", "owner": "philipsonvisuals", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18554912608062669, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:36:48", "owner": "metemiirr_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891151945382351, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:35:38", "owner": "happamomof5", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087781486795239, "text": "will i make the animals on the 6th or 7th?", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:28:13", "owner": "jgui._.s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890684563385589, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:27:03", "owner": "pdrx.vaz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161199271395201, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:26:38", "owner": "renee.norton.378", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18143416444450446, "text": "😂😂😍", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:26:10", "owner": "cari_et", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084341873096279, "text": "God, please find this funny so I can laugh 🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:25:25", "owner": "psim.12", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072598010459980, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:23:37", "owner": "jerodan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071607500365523, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:23:02", "owner": "salcedolaura_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18101252431707382, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:19:07", "owner": "ft.zxira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18332306785210563, "text": "Jesus Christ wants a relationship with you", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:16:54", "owner": "camdengotfred", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915359722231659, "text": "I don't get it", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:12:13", "owner": "orgullo_guanajuatense", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007198460746441, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:11:22", "owner": "_kittygo_14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854223145581935, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:07:53", "owner": "chaotically_alluring", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070208762523554, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:07:42", "owner": "jawzero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064180925531597, "text": "If everything happens for a reason then Jesus definitely planned 67", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:06:48", "owner": "lexi7.613", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869468716481682, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:05:53", "owner": "narta_uzumaki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843187897631943, "text": "I wish the sun explode", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:01:50", "owner": "rebeccaaugustus143", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087002213066847, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:58:58", "owner": "charlie.warner.1996", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981141300777769, "text": "💀🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:57:30", "owner": "ishootox805", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18185491147345718, "text": "@stacey_lacey 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:56:25", "owner": "samantha.c.xx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17851028790598394, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:55:32", "owner": "adrilemke", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17970593471988062, "text": "😂😂💀", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:53:34", "owner": "shaily_bagherian", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17903350632302379, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:50:21", "owner": "llewsing_it", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18369068614081673, "text": "😭🤣🤣🤣💀", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:47:49", "owner": "abel_blaze_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073284863599673, "text": "Proverbs 6:16-19 There are six things the Lord hates,\n seven that are detestable to him:\n17  haughty eyes,\n a lying tongue,\n hands that shed innocent blood,\n18  a heart that devises wicked schemes,\n feet that are quick to rush into evil,\n19  a false witness who pours out lies\n  and a person who stirs up conflict in the community", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:44:47", "owner": "jjoshuua_21", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17957669669892155, "text": "Well first of all that’s not Jesus 🤷🏾‍♂️😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:43:15", "owner": "gustavobands", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100220839749076, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:42:20", "owner": "mia.mayoush", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066604157424756, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:42:07", "owner": "miguel_pereira_araujo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152180902421953, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:41:42", "owner": "lookieee_pookieee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930263404015998, "text": "Now ask her what’s the number of the beast and God’s number. Answer: 666 and 777", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:40:57", "owner": "edgardoriveraramos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122591752525806, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:36:00", "owner": "azlarisa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090249349938080, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:34:58", "owner": "omar_habjoka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870601564396144, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:34:15", "owner": "_phamquang08_", "likes": 103}, {"id": 17998014098699858, "text": "@cold_kicksj23", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:33:42", "owner": "__almadulce", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947004570938822, "text": "I dang near choked when the camera turned 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:33:35", "owner": "__almadulce", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074097065216013, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:32:34", "owner": "agapecollectiveofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094667113698694, "text": "Jesus doing 67 before gta 6 or 7", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:29:53", "owner": "gema.williams211", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18050707385385998, "text": "....... We failed.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:29:47", "owner": "sh7ia_159", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078228506183818, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:25:54", "owner": "connors_addiction", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868490914415534, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:25:35", "owner": "dylan_kejo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396488353127026, "text": "Should I rest on day 6 or 7 ?", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:22:01", "owner": "carlos_q2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034496201755233, "text": "How sad", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:22:01", "owner": "arciolla22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100065673772724, "text": "Remove her ipad", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:21:25", "owner": "ennin712", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007406636818304, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:20:32", "owner": "mchltz1205", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887326138273634, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:18:45", "owner": "snowbass.official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087839926797244, "text": "Wheres jesus?", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:16:31", "owner": "retailtherapy402", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109494694551922, "text": "Aahhh hahahahah!!", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:15:46", "owner": "skallywaggs.33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18381745906148731, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:13:15", "owner": "rafzsxl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049802468388393, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:12:50", "owner": "marichka_sova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085330697058417, "text": "We’re cooked", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:12:23", "owner": "five50_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322314835170713, "text": "Cutest thing ever 😍", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:12:12", "owner": "katiepodson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18149262994428157, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:11:39", "owner": "just.kidding.abdeel", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18337150192230445, "text": "Holiest 67", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:10:53", "owner": "john.njoroge1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079906936914475, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:10:38", "owner": "wandkrebs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18230730901306463, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:10:25", "owner": "ajbellabeauty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081187238516660, "text": "@lahja_cs, @michalina.1711 🥲", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:08:45", "owner": "jam._.pcdr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139406440411334, "text": "I mean she’s not wrong", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:08:40", "owner": "mckennak78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18208885078314010, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:07:59", "owner": "jeydenpadilla2025_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165145642391433, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:07:13", "owner": "lil.lamine10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842030800639499, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:06:26", "owner": "j.m0neh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873847942378881, "text": "we are cooked as a country and probably even species", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:04:08", "owner": "the_real_sarahbarany", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18206847436315473, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:03:46", "owner": "its_rafaelw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867686197498694, "text": "@vermeertatjana 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:02:59", "owner": "maikelv1980", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100442377748525, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:02:09", "owner": "1106gs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990270201884445, "text": "67💀67", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:59:55", "owner": "anniewho08", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096153034842090, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:59:26", "owner": "c.mastis", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18248142727291441, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:56:52", "owner": "michele_mad_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18366841486092201, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:54:36", "owner": "julepdawolf", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084386725854023, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:53:31", "owner": "deadkin12345", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120681487533399, "text": "We’re actually cooked", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:53:20", "owner": "m2h3463h", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087124753824234, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:51:56", "owner": "hamzas111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086588789003481, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣💀", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:49:49", "owner": "alinunez22", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18122304877523274, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:49:09", "owner": "dv76xoxo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073881596597277, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:48:44", "owner": "britanwalker", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17978930891947332, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:48:18", "owner": "jennbaby624", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18050474798386998, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:47:56", "owner": "inz.jackson_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064669691175978, "text": "Jesus did it first!😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:46:53", "owner": "cdubwills", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18087531445789798, "text": "@ciara_cowap 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:46:47", "owner": "amyoflaherty1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065211479426675, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:45:09", "owner": "fiyababy1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084926198071357, "text": "I am Muslim", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:44:40", "owner": "eyed.elsaued.2011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866448196506528, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:44:26", "owner": "christina1733_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17869501623481998, "text": "@salvage_title_858", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:42:36", "owner": "jsauna_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050283611679630, "text": "@dudesderpodcast 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:39:10", "owner": "melli.soula", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865184080525154, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:38:10", "owner": "dawnlea184", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119618545542840, "text": "Short beard jesus….Mormon😂🤦🏽‍♂️smh", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:36:43", "owner": "keeshawnv24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067193960115943, "text": "“alexa play take it there”", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:36:11", "owner": "pabznotmally", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17842263930636293, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:35:46", "owner": "_miyaako_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135577231465586, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:35:37", "owner": "offtuned_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117959251491543, "text": "Hes doing fix heaven!?", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:33:58", "owner": "bromclargehuge", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18022258898604024, "text": "I'm sorry to say Mexicans did it first, example: \"como andas\" \"2 3\", \"como va quedando\" \"ah 2 3\", it's 2 3 not 6 7 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:33:23", "owner": "munekiita.de.pastel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106308265570132, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:32:19", "owner": "_danimmoreira", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17949837552050816, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:32:11", "owner": "nahu_0550", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912951142250424, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:32:06", "owner": "1beautifulbre_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18128884672501223, "text": "That’s not Jesus. Just for the record….", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:29:31", "owner": "kiingkaro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087465262813690, "text": "LDS?", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:28:48", "owner": "_aseyacont", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088210189981662, "text": "Bro this habe to stop 🥀 this is not funny 💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:24:56", "owner": "kyan.vibes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866061085432962, "text": "Sorry but for me it isn't funny it's like making fun of god in my opinion or maybe I am misundersting", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:24:50", "owner": "xxshatwanxx9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096952522886098, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂hillarius", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:24:29", "owner": "gatitasantos_official", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17886198714282147, "text": "Wait till she find out that’s not Jesus", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:23:37", "owner": "thereal_braithwaite", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950725531058177, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:22:56", "owner": "djuniera", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059685422253464, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:20:28", "owner": "liliy_adofan38", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083296154037734, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:18:57", "owner": "happy.and.harmony", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17959301363878454, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:14:50", "owner": "stinakikki", "likes": 0}, {"id"