ated_at": "2025-12-02T20:33:39", "owner": "chrissmariee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985830174870129, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:33:23", "owner": "monstaneff9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111762460610182, "text": "@bertha_lutgerink 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:32:40", "owner": "reinata78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18328917526210982, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:32:05", "owner": "pinklady_1908", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079426463174028, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:29:55", "owner": "aknymann", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084090068028664, "text": "@viktorosen", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:29:20", "owner": "lisavestefjell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926516245170741, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:27:34", "owner": "josh.nova", "likes": 63}, {"id": 17859839499485945, "text": "@olafossumsund  @halvor12341", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:26:17", "owner": "olafkristian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057876149308307, "text": "Astafirlah", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:25:25", "owner": "mahmudov_j1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877159384354677, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:25:18", "owner": "rebekah_n_sheri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193729495326476, "text": "Well, I am against depicting or drawing prophets and messengers and displaying their pictures, which of course are not accurate images. ..... In addition, I believe that Christ is a prophet. .... And you consider him more than a prophet I don't want to be rude. But I was annoyed by this. I know she's a young girl, I don't blame her, but the father...", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:18:41", "owner": "miro_250601", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18436667074101727, "text": "Yes it took my GOD six days to create the world on the seventh day he rested. 67", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:15:10", "owner": "jet_jville904", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18322170454172401, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:12:58", "owner": "hansi_devanmini", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17995330703715194, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-