man", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136641823465655, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:14:56", "owner": "tnemz87", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067949957121284, "text": "Have yall listened to that song and yall still let yall kids say that??? Yall be quick to just on some dum shit and don't know what it mean", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:13:15", "owner": "toyaaustin48", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073492847252385, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:11:27", "owner": "dingledangle.xo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058643732558522, "text": "she don’t need that damn binky", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:11:14", "owner": "baileejade33", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18136472707464041, "text": "Bro going to hell", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:11:09", "owner": "samdawood39", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948029260072633, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:10:48", "owner": "lulusalce", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18202511968320662, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:09:13", "owner": "gracemorrison88", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059956766261983, "text": "Elektronischer Kommunikationsbereich, ich denke wir sind gekocht. 💀", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:07:13", "owner": "vgtre123789", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956759737010950, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:04:24", "owner": "onlythomas_s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121098328533196, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:01:41", "owner": "austyyn___", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18246284857292885, "text": "Mormon Jesus?", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:00:35", "owner": "pattiplant", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074574659602265, "text": "Society’s ruined", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:00:16", "owner": "noahpimlott", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18297662749260422, "text": "Tell me you have older siblings without telling me. 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:59:10", "owner": "marlainaharkey", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17931707865116161, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:56:42", "owner": "amber_kramer_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18348899662202516, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:52:27", "owner": "what_5531025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842119702638369, "text": "It was foretold 🙌🏽", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:51:17", "owner": "oblivionic", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076126913586125, "text": "How many days did it take you to create everything?", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:50:58", "owner": "jumplegyn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18349393234167385, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:50:50", "owner": "_ageofaquarius", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087128773969438, "text": "Alright Jesus so hear me out we got 6 glasses of wine and one of water but 7 people..", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:48:46", "owner": "bsnodsgrass", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085720715046306, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:47:04", "owner": "val_quad_dam", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18005530793819995, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:46:32", "owner": "_.zsofi._sz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078548600272732, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:46:09", "owner": "daniela_mastrofitness", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17842392369634656, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:45:13", "owner": "pamela_rosariori", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18110186164620010, "text": "😮😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:43:27", "owner": "pinky_worldpossible", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18380932342147117, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:43:05", "owner": "octavianbarligea", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18027920579774000, "text": "Jesus did 6-7. It was an inside job", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:42:39", "owner": "matthewfougeremusic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067193231527462, "text": "This is sad", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:41:49", "owner": "wika.crochet", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088226434959485, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:41:11", "owner": "nurs3_sin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072543905365874, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:39:56", "owner": "laurarf_escobar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051600806657946, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:39:37", "owner": "xenotonyx",