3:45", "owner": "lizzydarks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18538543225013468, "text": "“Your dad built the world in HOW many days?”", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:21:10", "owner": "enna._.lame", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039856256708913, "text": "Oh and he finished creating the world on the 6th day and rested on the 7th", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:21:08", "owner": "caterinemi", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18063358625548596, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:21:06", "owner": "riisyaand", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082237622513882, "text": "Nooo😭💀", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:20:06", "owner": "vargaszasza7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081162569145975, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:16:56", "owner": "lhj._.821", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087298079003050, "text": "The pan over to the picture made me cry laughing g this is GOLD", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:16:44", "owner": "kiragreywiley13", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18031832456536510, "text": "🤓☝️", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:15:10", "owner": "xxmud_moonxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18190146130340840, "text": "In what moment you give a Phone with social media to a Kid BRO STOP", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:14:46", "owner": "danii_aldir_010", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18322581070168761, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:13:13", "owner": "sfrondr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18167836714381301, "text": "1,1м", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:11:56", "owner": "meusaio_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086274458001054, "text": "New gen is doomed", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:11:09", "owner": "mparator.beyefendi", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18065801006562677, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:04:03", "owner": "deboralloret", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17932956038997888, "text": "I wanted to laugh and dunk my phone in my cup of coffee at the same time", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:03:27", "owner": "_kysostfu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079387315922500, "text": "That’s not Jesus", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:00:33", "owner": "nadeaufam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 180656134