e918", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17947900113063284, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:12:19", "owner": "nousaster", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17988232463879043, "text": "“Let the children come to me” I love it", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:12:13", "owner": "moth.3xe", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053900915657749, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:09:00", "owner": "brito.gene28", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17854425228580026, "text": "Because he made the world in 6 days and rested on the 7", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:04:13", "owner": "backsiderah", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17868018786483866, "text": "did i heard \"sexting\" ?????? 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:02:50", "owner": "jozhfy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18150183016425074, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:01:44", "owner": "midad_muhtadi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18304951912269186, "text": "Of Jesus had internet access like that he probably would have loved some memes like buddy christ", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:01:16", "owner": "midad_muhtadi", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18291074965275353, "text": "Nooooo😭😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:00:46", "owner": "jenny.huereca.7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18106906486650169, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:00:15", "owner": "jenniferfelix9017", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18050772431678239, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:00:14", "owner": "wheels_on_rush_o_x", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17921831964187126, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:59:49", "owner": "chiamorgan_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18001771070684089, "text": "Is this a abacus joke?", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:58:54", "owner": "abbas.bazmi_bmg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952319944047113, "text": "Pacifier ?? She looks like 5 yo 😮😮", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:57:29", "owner": "dimakotdrift", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866125030506615, "text": "@kiesh430", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:55:54", "owner": "jasmine_thejuiciest", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986697681877646, "text": "I want to believe it's AI, otherwise, give your son a goldfish.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:54:33", "owner": "vyker_17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084381749089953, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:53:50", "owner": "lablover247", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081390566133658, "text": "@step8710", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:52:32", "owner": "chun_leroy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069151472617196, "text": "After doing about an hour and a half of research finding the actual origins of 6 7 I come across a demon summoning ritual that uses the phrase 6 7 at least six times! So I cannot believe Jesus would be doing that.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:52:13", "owner": "blazelytyear", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090639979746862, "text": "😭 @brickhouse115", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:51:51", "owner": "megabeauty_n_blessed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870772564470515, "text": "🤣🤣🤣 I have to show this to my kids 👏👏👏 love it 😊", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:51:26", "owner": "prayersoverthekitchensink", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17868636339495857, "text": "I guess that 6-7 thing will always escape me. I guess hat's the point.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:50:06", "owner": "saintrichard3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17903039130300242, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:49:20", "owner": "shakshamghimire7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909837925123389, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:48:51", "owner": "happipantz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077943215187536, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:45:53", "owner": "tttrx05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087975595946112, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:45:49", "owner": "tttrx05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066511754126900, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:42:04", "owner": "wizkhalliah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18391910665131673, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:41:14", "owner": "reidhimmelsbach", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113283889588930, "text": "@pgmarilisa_", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:41:04", "owner": "cee0420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064423028562139, 