0}, {"id": 18084737621042282, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:40:29", "owner": "just_jennie1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959399449009236, "text": "Pacifier was shaped like a Cross", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:40:21", "owner": "stalliyon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935828824031246, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:38:59", "owner": "_aizzen_zzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298235065258943, "text": "I need to know what this picture is called", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:38:41", "owner": "nicroangel", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18157616140406135, "text": "No it's def 8, 9", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:36:07", "owner": "zombgetsu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088886219479828, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:35:24", "owner": "gka_2508", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083665916079541, "text": "Ok. I thought 9 10.😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:34:55", "owner": "rameshal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973418958808440, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:34:11", "owner": "akeishag", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926733217080194, "text": "Bro 😭💀", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:33:57", "owner": "ggursimrann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072892559589686, "text": "?", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:30:42", "owner": "1y.911", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995052543848197, "text": "@merle_van_steen", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:30:12", "owner": "ilse_van_steen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17935873053102653, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:29:53", "owner": "la_bere5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101535538688921, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:28:08", "owner": "emma_and_ellia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18400107643126671, "text": "Even the kid💀💀", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:26:38", "owner": "skibidi_at", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353788012164832, "text": "IM CRYING", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:25:35", "owner": "maybe_its_aaliyah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18413046682184703, "text": "🤣🤣🤣 epic", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:21:06", "owner": "bhavika.09.shah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850475350564037, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:20:58", "owner": "shelan.alsulaimani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100955929741362, "text": "That’s not Jesus Christ and you people are not in the bible !! The skin is the curse mark of GOD..", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:17:25", "owner": "the_two_olive_trees_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032826806733229, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:16:55", "owner": "tombomb1205", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18105672943710950, "text": "Why is the picture of Jesus ai", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:15:13", "owner": "bee_boyo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953242176908255, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:14:02", "owner": "elliotthartman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038278934707305, "text": "Sh!t good luck Charlie life ain’t gonna be easy", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:13:48", "owner": "elliotthartman", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17869099584496533, "text": "@fedmindy2", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:13:45", "owner": "_bigtee___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18435074002100153, "text": "8,9", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:13:14", "owner": "jj_biyela", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861931135539899, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:11:53", "owner": "forthesweetloveofchaos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075736358262276, "text": "were so cooked", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:11:50", "owner": "_poteido", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18102357553665599, "text": "The joke here is that he called the hippie in that picture Jesus 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:11:35", "owner": "the_montegonian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931853584114318, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:11:30", "owner": "rastam5540", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069220619614268, "text": "💀", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:08:19", "owner": "shrinking_becky_83", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035959289713934, "text": "he probably saw how 6’7 would blow up and had a insane joke and it himself😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:07:57", "owner": "weirdo171627_i", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868497421415034, "text": "Lets pray Jesus finds this funny 🥀✌️", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:07:52", "owner": "neel.mjl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18113873683603946, "text": "My 5 yo son heard the elder on platform with his speech , he named a verse of the Bible saying Mathew 6:7 and my son just yelled: 6,7!!! Everyone just laughed and me just wanted to evaporate 🫠🫠🫠 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:06:59", "owner": "claribeltovar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18029610119753223, "text": "67 is healthier than Christianity btw", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:06:59", "owner": "cigan6948", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930837577114157, "text": "@make_life_harder", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:05:49", "owner": "i.melech", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931154137115740, "text": "💀💀💀💀😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:03:51", "owner": "crystalrose_segura", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124465177519405, "text": "This is the best video on the internet 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:02:55", "owner": "deckroz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921270103191193, "text": "I cant unhear 9/11", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:02:54", "owner": "asurathian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121577278473747, "text": "I hate that Jesus prolly knew this would happen 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:00:51", "owner": "emperor_josephus", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18010531295646570, "text": "This generation is cooked and I guess now I know that some  parents are too", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:00:32", "owner": "cummins_lover6", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18416396923142226, "text": "I mean, she's not wrong. Probably. Lol", "created_at": "2025-12-01T06:58:59", "owner": "val_noona", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164598439375776, "text": "Good luck Charlie", "created_at": "2025-12-01T06:57:13", "owner": "cornball_the_artist", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17860722714479018, "text": "@missjemv 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T06:57:09", "owner": "shazmalikesbubbles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080612330328977, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T06:54:56", "owner": "momsofankara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057683813303933, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "cre