"2025-12-01T01:38:47", "owner": "44straw18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046313870676297, "text": "Stop saying that crap and look into what it means….its nowhere near funny!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:38:12", "owner": "thisistheway83", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009112559652704, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:38:12", "owner": "singing_to_flowers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897561316345834, "text": "He worked for 6 days and rested on the 7th!", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:37:32", "owner": "lboymom", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071270738597793, "text": "@kickbutt_adz @marivicmaceren @abceej @zyreen_vigil @chottokate", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:36:48", "owner": "theaustinrichie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864250948519451, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:35:49", "owner": "ilhakyre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987998751747586, "text": "🤣💀🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:34:33", "owner": "karma_still_mybitch", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18052251968648226, "text": "Guess they don’t know what 6 7 mean 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:32:44", "owner": "ob_proppa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901815685326606, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:32:30", "owner": "young_yoda.j", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18542904214020855, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:32:15", "owner": "young_yoda.j", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935385112104293, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:32:05", "owner": "young_yoda.j", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876029527443978, "text": "lordt 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:31:48", "owner": "abbytlntn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18542738128060612, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:30:57", "owner": "doughertydozen", "likes": 293}, {"id": 18320684041170650, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:30:10", "owner": "all_i_do_is_win_888", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17956864079891891, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:29:35", "owner": "pink_floyd_lover09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18550541269043406, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:26:51", "owner": "hair.i