reated_at": "2025-12-01T01:15:12", "owner": "viridianacrespo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17988533000745385, "text": "The 6 7 trend comes from a song that talks about gods and goddesses aka demons. Please know what your kid is saying.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:14:46", "owner": "bloodandwordtestimonies", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048970520412634, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:14:33", "owner": "fetih_kucukyarak", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17975420231955967, "text": "I know these comments are hot", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:14:31", "owner": "whotfuthinkufoolin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065652950618878, "text": "We’re cooked", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:14:13", "owner": "zachvol2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048525080422935, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:13:57", "owner": "mrsjizellesmith", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18081893507156920, "text": "😂😂😂😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:12:37", "owner": "beatrizandrame", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080787476146251, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:12:07", "owner": "nunuboujeee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843095620621218, "text": "Pretty accurate.. he doesn’t do a damn thing else. 😑", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:12:04", "owner": "shadow_man_todd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117949867488378, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:11:38", "owner": "thepinksunflowerllc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048248345676838, "text": "Screaming but that kids absolutely right 👏", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:09:25", "owner": "devkianita", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931923022131388, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:09:19", "owner": "ryan_ragubir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936764481980999, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:08:54", "owner": "g13_2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899957341184952, "text": "Smart", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:07:58", "owner": "mcdicky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293273125273596, "text": "That 6 7 shit is demonic", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:07:57", "owner": "celina_84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083763235847085, "text": "‘Or’ 💀", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:07:34", "owner": "xzchieme", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17992730978857262, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:07:22", "owner": "ltf525", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18073576682356595, "text": "🥰 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:07:20", "owner": "claudio_pov", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17888651265264610, "text": "Fue dios el que hizo todo, no Jesús. Jesus es su hijo, el vino en otra época cuando todo ya estaba hecho.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:06:59", "owner": "ale.lims", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870601639396541, "text": "@younji_89 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:06:34", "owner": "syccjt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085752029002720, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:06:07", "owner": "trishy0924", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18499089478079966, "text": "😭😭😭😭😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:06:05", "owner": "lipstick_nd_lies", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018621272795635, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:05:56", "owner": "xiryshiett", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17863235898456660, "text": "VERY DISRESPECTFUL...IF YOU ONLY KNEW THE MEANING BEHIND THIS...", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:05:30", "owner": "eduardovillarreal8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067868639434153, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:05:29", "owner": "thecurlconqueror", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18105049105658063, "text": "🤦🏻‍♀️🤦🏻‍♀️🤦🏻‍♀️🤦🏻‍♀️🤦🏻‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:03:46", "owner": "phibrows.by.rossa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959665338991246, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:02:53", "owner": "laj0li3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18197382448324765, "text": "@graceanne_w07  @jessieweeks27 \n🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:02:33", "owner": "mommy.scatterbrain", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18014999720797514, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:01:33", "owner": "caromancia", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18193691146332729, "text": "I actually thought it was AI for a min", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:01:18", "owner": "lukewithoutuke", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18060486800244563, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:01:06", "owner": "time_traveling_crusader", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097314823831485, "text": "@laurenskaggs0708 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:00:23", "owner": "latrese_sowells", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065564357625010, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:00:19", "owner": "moni.gem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861029998546576, "text": "I… I think this is it. This is the moment that “6-7” has reached its peak. Nothing can compare to this.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:00:05", "owner": "itsme_zeebee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17866390020432260, "text": "✝️Last Supper Waiter: We have 5-6 Chairs Jesus, How Many More Should We Bring Out.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:59:30", "owner": "drizzywitdadreads", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18368505094087047, "text": "💀", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:58:51", "owner": "gianni_ehui", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18178881685321456, "text": "Yes he is...", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:58:39", "owner": "lz_h0liveira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087949438987014, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:58:13", "owner": "ugh_m3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185597899343279, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:56:36", "owner": "morronsito_elgato", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17931522570134818, "text": "The fact that Jesus died for us knowing damn well your daughter would one day look at a painting of him and say this 🤣 I love it though, praise the Lord.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:56:18", "owner": "mama_cici126", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18145957594437767, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:56:04", "owner": "laserhousenyc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883024717416334, "text": "@juliaaa_sstt @valentin.sth das wild", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:55:35", "owner": "kristiinlovewithlife", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17926976949168413, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:54:43", "owner": "jessicabonillaaa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18397260193135127, "text": "Tskkk", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:54:37", "owner": "_ibn_hussein_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054310487662476, "text": "That’s messed up he saved all of us and this is what he gets", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:53:57", "owner": "nobody__knows_kid", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104865292642905, "text": "😂 but wait why Jesus ain’t black", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:52:18", "owner": "sherm_doug_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967469979992324, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:51:28", "owner": "susandisrudganske", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071317040363916, "text": "🤣😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:51:26", "owner": "nyreelowery", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18395318662134071, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:51:19", "owner": "yohelausa1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18143968090446570, "text": "What the 67 mean, it's everywhere and I don't understand it", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:51:15", "owner": "sarasia_sas", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18106563241711746, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:50:37", "owner": "ally_bacon_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064237313408074, "text": "I hate this generation", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:49:45", "owner": "awtattoos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18248642926293924, "text": "jesus doing “67” before GTA 6💀", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:49:38", "owner": "mikeyl2011", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076326265983966, "text": "Hahahaha", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:49:03", "owner": "natheerbell", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18112802329579450, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:48:36", "owner": "fam_619_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080100395146793, "text": "I mean he did work 6 days, and rested on the 7th", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:48:16", "owner": "iamkingedwards", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18054508025335992, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:47:52", "owner": "indiansommerz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086968243952101, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:46:06", "owner": "jo3un", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039861554705815, "text": "I think this is one of the funniest videos I’ve ever seen 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:45:51", "owner": "os_sandwichmaker", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18005823779665864, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:45:31", "owner": "bobsagetmcgee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874396957374633, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:44:44", "owner": "mikagoxha", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18169343533339047, "text": "This is lowk horrible", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:44:21", "owner": "thatguyjan6", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18292152022274518, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:43:48", "owner": "magik_may", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17904141030295115, "text": "Do u guys makes fun of ur god now?", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:42:26", "owner": "nobody_a3326", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032102306734068, "text": "Ngl this is one of the saddest things i have ever seen since i was born", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:42:21", "owner": "_.diogozn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18197489377325103, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:42:02", "owner": "westsidebinkx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028714112762035, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:41:42", "owner": "mikapaige_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18006466478663003, "text": "I’m sure Jesus is laughing at this. 😂😂 kids are so pure", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:41:20", "owner": "brandee__", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18093255994730452, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:40:48", "owner": "talievbeauty", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051146720382308, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:40:24", "owner": "ganddsmom", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18048292034436278, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:39:33", "owner": "shxnezoid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031227215740393, "text": "That’s ain’t Jesus that’s frank from the smoke shop!", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:39:21", "owner": "tsp08079", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113132929585046, "text": "💀", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:39:13", "owner": "fifty.sense", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876872398356567, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:39:07", "owner": "__desii___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107373157621820, "text": "@jordan.