minic_uccello", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18372135625159111, "text": "@josh_howerton", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:31:30", "owner": "malissafitzpatrick", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958784860010070, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:31:13", "owner": "ian_cast_117", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17944698276077613, "text": "1M shares we all going somewhere", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:31:00", "owner": "ramonagbisit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966013288462940, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:30:34", "owner": "bklynmary", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17849048043605797, "text": "What did she say?", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:29:14", "owner": "natvp.18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065576954567559, "text": "67 means a lot of things to a lot of different people. 67 to me believe that on the periodic chart 67 stands for holmium and what are the two first letters in that word? That’s why kids scream out 67.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:28:18", "owner": "christine_l_r_007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046908581449689, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:25:55", "owner": "sheraymonique", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103405429664450, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:25:13", "owner": "heatherfitness_usa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078912772933651, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:23:40", "owner": "john.m.crumpton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064424699167685, "text": "Charlie, that ain't Jesus boo", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:23:18", "owner": "ms.latoyaj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159092953403692, "text": "😁89", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:22:52", "owner": "yuffie999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864547474529476, "text": "So.. god is brain rot.. hmm I like it", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:22:06", "owner": "erinjohnson3085", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891888955243436, "text": "What about 8 9", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:21:54", "owner": "evan_kempington", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17862291438537844, "text": "@paymeskrilla", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:21:00", "owner": "infinitetux", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088714589482433, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:20:37", "owner": "ilycxrterrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958280674002170, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:20:22", "owner": "wentincogni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059754671272044, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:20:16", "owner": "idk67049", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109924654551366, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:19:36", "owner": "oneunikegirl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086067433991061, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:19:12", "owner": "nannerz777", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17971699913975024, "text": "WE ARE CHARLIE KIRKKKK", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:19:05", "owner": "butter.my.noodles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062479640213559, "text": "Jesus didn't die and come back to life for this😔", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:18:57", "owner": "izakp95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911248822259268, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:17:51", "owner": "jonny_valadez", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17924007924188909, "text": "Man or God. Choose 7 and rest on the sabbath, his 4th commandment. There remains a sabbath rest for the children of God ❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:17:17", "owner": "cippadrienne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883212835421619, "text": "The Lord finished creating in the 6th day and rested on the 7th...", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:17:15", "owner": "imstilleri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047422649456113, "text": "💀😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:17:14", "owner": "sofiapulido25", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18304485181267311, "text": "Jesus Christ this is hilarious! 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:16:08", "owner": "soyla_mzadeh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120345307536731, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:15:11", "owner": "charlie320", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025005119592558, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:14:00", "owner": "sandtonmadetravis", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18097292263876428, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:13:56", "owner": "taydonn__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18400296433124178, "text": "I'm mad i understand and laughed at this🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:13:55", "owner": "simply_cyn928", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17956128492034726, "text": "When trying to find the good in everything. But still supporting demonic spirits. Am one for jokes but with demonic sayings I wouldn’t even try to find a way to connect it with Jesus.  Look into SKRILLA and what he supports. THE ONE WHO STARTED THAT. One of his Gods is Number 6 and the other is 7.  Stay safe #partypooper #hatethetrend", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:13:30", "owner": "sumatime_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18021398858607114, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:13:22", "owner": "63a_______", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905470996282311, "text": "@emj.jo @amyjademc", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:13:21", "owner": "karae_patrice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396304477132397, "text": "@ananiya.xx Noo wayyy😭😫", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:13:13", "owner": "shinychristinageorge", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17955712974016342, "text": "My little cousin (5 years old btw) made 67 out of playdough", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:12:18", "owner": "elizabeth072113", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088482112966547, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:12:00", "owner": "greendayfansixtyseven67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983706510763859, "text": "She's either too old for the pacifier or too young for the Internet", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:11:44", "owner": "max_bigwood", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18439085296102720, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:09:42", "owner": "chris.art2017", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071915531357951, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:09:42", "owner": "9._b76", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876647383443287, "text": "Stop tying this demonic shit to our lord.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:08:54", "owner": "itzmar.yk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127293784504315, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:08:37", "owner": "radoslawp_09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056683754643330, "text": "MY WHOLE FEED IS SIX SEVEN", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:07:45", "owner": "brandelynland", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075442229350203, "text": "I don't understand???", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:06:32", "owner": "more6196", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396301033134552, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:05:00", "owner": "gorynoso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950129580924513, "text": "@ernesto93mtz", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:04:49", "owner": "isabeldiaz62", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905885602144002, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:03:29", "owner": "carolinebourkemartin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17868632046497181, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:02:44", "owner": "liviu._.4090", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127026163504934, "text": "💀💀💀", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:00:55", "owner": "keturahisrayel", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18066722267386849, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:00:39", "owner": "sinivasic", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18170931004374364, "text": "HAHAHAHAHAHAHAHA", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:59:22", "owner": "melissaprincesa_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18083786123033264, "text": "The fact ppl don't realize how demonic this is or even the reason it's relevant is proof society is cooked", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:58:57", "owner": "lil_lerk_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087867841947371, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:58:52", "owner": "corazonpisaac", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066925316413805, "text": "💀", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:58:29", "owner": "tinahamash", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18121779970535467, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:57:59", "owner": "meeshinyaa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17972725454962197, "text": "@sabrinacarpenter 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:56:56", "owner": "joselyndiazcadena", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18073433081586551, "text": "He seeks heaven.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:56:48", "owner": "yanisbervas", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18109414828716881, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:56:07", "owner": "mrsanagam", "likes": 1}, {