: "pxaxm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087341398812806, "text": "😂😂😅😅", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:12:27", "owner": "farhang_homayoun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085805023966561, "text": "8-9", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:12:18", "owner": "jonathorus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868364635497337, "text": "Then you say 8 9 and do the complete opposite hand movement and see how they react 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:11:00", "owner": "official.macho_da.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887271367403819, "text": "Actually a demonic term buddy get right while you can", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:10:41", "owner": "ryans_truth", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18061776311548556, "text": "HOW OLD is she sucking on that pacifier???", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:10:35", "owner": "godly1freaky2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154082872418143, "text": "can someone pls explain the 6-7 meme to me pls ive become a boomer", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:09:41", "owner": "vincent.vermilion", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18549456295028225, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:08:17", "owner": "ylmz_turker2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113832973572757, "text": "I mean…if it keeps her engaged 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:07:53", "owner": "simon_3.16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087547429802486, "text": "Fun fact you can’t joke like this about him as a Muslim", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:07:32", "owner": "usman.jan.12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049916324410917, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:07:26", "owner": "nazzi1702", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864472399520035, "text": "Mormons Jesus lol", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:07:13", "owner": "garrettjphillips", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916158142232143, "text": "😂😂😂😂🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:06:50", "owner": "sabryna_werneck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885419473407621, "text": "You know 67 is actually a demonic chant he mentions all the fallen angels in the song", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:06:30", "owner": "bradleywhite_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544491508000984, "text"