s": 0}, {"id": 18048135869425967, "text": "😭🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:31:25", "owner": "dteressaguevarra", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17849910606569736, "text": "@clowreed", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:30:42", "owner": "melissajane8033", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18410923990188933, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂 I love our generation", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:29:37", "owner": "fatimaderder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295067380274763, "text": "Lmao 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:29:17", "owner": "thatssorave", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17865784260434822, "text": "Took him 6 days to create the world then rested on the 7th .. it’s ALWAYS been 6-7", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:29:07", "owner": "monttyy97", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18121247425550166, "text": "The only funny 6 7 joke", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:28:25", "owner": "mehdi___mahfouzi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083846084015811, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:28:16", "owner": "david.y464", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077249287979880, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂💀💀💀💀💀", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:27:49", "owner": "montmillz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18011666594810615, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:26:52", "owner": "eithan_wasser77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090162199752397, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:26:26", "owner": "shin90ra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18291144241287491, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:26:19", "owner": "bre.ccs", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18310785730247418, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:24:53", "owner": "artichowdhury", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097389070840208, "text": "💀", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:24:22", "owner": "gretchen.lloyd", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086128367006730, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:23:58", "owner": "momianna_25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026823041772344, "text": "Ese no es Jesús ese es Marco Antonio Solis", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:23:58", "owner": "_leandro_plp_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18194175070333366, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:23:44", "owner": "ayludgood", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102371734669740, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:23:22", "owner": "nieenaaaaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193212019329954, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:23:17", "owner": "kht_diament", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075545108219041, "text": "67", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:23:09", "owner": "just_me_mine_here", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080283377136674, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:23:07", "owner": "colelan3", "likes": 99}, {"id": 17862173754540086, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:22:30", "owner": "sib.haider.__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885262717287290, "text": "Are you fucking kidding me", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:21:50", "owner": "bradm_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064912667414784, "text": "@letshugo @qoqsik1", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:21:26", "owner": "ellocouruguayo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888655591261834, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:21:09", "owner": "shahlaelatrashofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18371469613154900, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:21:03", "owner": "char.wavy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061596635234294, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:20:40", "owner": "sisterofpalestine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147254605386686, "text": "“If the devil was 6…\nIf the devil was 6…\nIf the devil was 6…\nTHEN GODDDDD IS 7!!!!!”\n.\n-The Pixies", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:20:25", "owner": "focusaurus_rex_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050121344672234, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:19:48", "owner": "mariselarmstylist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910239892258427, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:19:38", "owner": "nay_fashionista", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888603676391260, "text": "First of all, you shouldn’t have any paintings of Jesus not supposed to have any images of him. You don’t know what he looks like. Second, please research this 6 7 thing and the artist made it famous. He’s into  full blown witchcraft Sacrificing animals in the name of the entities, he worships.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:19:21", "owner": "oddisc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17865234240525040, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:19:21", "owner": "zealousfights", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842888644630731, "text": "😍this is hilarious 😆", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:18:47", "owner": "___daniela___pangher___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18381857281149975, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:17:55", "owner": "jdizzle670", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117878491559917, "text": "no a true depiction of what he lqqks...this is what da vinci's gay boyfriend lqqk'd like...", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:17:55", "owner": "wipetwicevideosports", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979667979783466, "text": "That picture does not actually depict the son of God he has hair of wool and skin of olive that is just a recreation of what the Catholic religion wants the image of the son of God to look like, what are we teaching our children today?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:17:38", "owner": "stetson4877", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084554350856727, "text": "“And on the 6th or 7th day, he rested", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:17:21", "owner": "phishtankkk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058756121292259, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:17:21", "owner": "__victor_csn__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918972925068748, "text": "My kids just agreed with her.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:17:10", "owner": "jenatencio80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056955341646051, "text": "I know an LDS Jesus when I see one 😌", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:16:21", "owner": "theekylewilson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087578212978539, "text": "خخخخ😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:16:11", "owner": "3mmar_ahmed0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17903304357316747, "text": "Oh no plz😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:16:07", "owner": "lama.salloum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118600993554010, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:15:46", "owner": "bernotroccolo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086332610488