 18048813281678096, "text": "Ok I’m sorry but that got me", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:09:37", "owner": "acidwashed54", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079350181939009, "text": "Btw 67 is an evil thing. Look it up what it means", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:08:57", "owner": "lobo_dreamz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069810437594971, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:08:52", "owner": "_5p_p", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17920851855215451, "text": "Poor thing already brainwashed", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:08:48", "owner": "okiloveyoubuhbye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077844454964459, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:08:14", "owner": "_alwajdd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984333579920671, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:07:59", "owner": "kzxboytheone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092020633906890, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:07:32", "owner": "sammmywammmy26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031063334725120, "text": "Jesus predicted it", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:07:22", "owner": "eldirian24", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18067540862387074, "text": "Best 6/7 I ve seen 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:06:59", "owner": "selmabelagra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979850247783106, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:06:38", "owner": "ice_cream1002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109609825616048, "text": "Yes", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:06:01", "owner": "mrryn.10", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077387554952392, "text": "ah hell nahhh", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:05:58", "owner": "_marissa_gallegos", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18139918444459628, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:05:43", "owner": "_teesh_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863184040455904, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:05:31", "owner": "ashli_regan_13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942919420006254, "text": "good luck Charlie 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:05:27", "owner": "wish_lish", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17927183298171598, "text": "🫲8 🫱9", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:05:17", "owner": "voidun4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098531470771815, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:04:42", "owner": "oussama_user_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086334605074741, "text": "Hey jesus, what number day are we on?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:04:29", "owner": "od_lot", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17971487288972948, "text": "1. That’s not Jesus\n\n2. Jesus wouldn’t be doing a trend created by someone who sacrifices animals to false deities.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:04:23", "owner": "viggoguwopp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991283037733317, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:04:20", "owner": "liiud_25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023863991598549, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:04:05", "owner": "aiisfunne", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061966481554875, "text": "I’m done 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:03:46", "owner": "_p.s_iloveu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17979947774928734, "text": "Throw away the child", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:03:20", "owner": "foopa_troops", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18173974648364786, "text": "i mean he did see all the sins in the world", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:03:01", "owner": "calebs_fryd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870783955469587, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:02:45", "owner": "n4dyq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901319674319871, "text": "Poor dad …. Your cooked bro shes already funny and adorable. Girl dads are always the best but man it’s stressful lol 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:02:37", "owner": "dakotatotten", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18095234566875900, "text": "I mean if he was here he would’ve laughed at this, Jesus def had a sense of humor", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:02:24", "owner": "super_syndrome5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059990975269153, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:01:46", "owner": "junipurrx3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18408935692185174, "text": "She’s not wrong lol", "created_at": "2025-11-30T19:59:58", "owner": "alhan.jaberi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885247714286295, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T19:59:36", "owner": "omar50903", "li