T18:22:26", "owner": "lynbyrinth", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17957365103892302, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:21:46", "owner": "benson_bvirus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088782434506544, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:21:27", "owner": "justinsdavis", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17985989375915347, "text": "God Yeshua and The Holy Spirit are great love know and bless you but 6-7 is not Godly at all, the guy that made the song worships African gods, Yeshua probably does not like 6-7, I love yall God bless you in Yeshua’s name amen!", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:20:51", "owner": "d3rekhoskins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082138667142984, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:20:43", "owner": "dfuh121", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889081786391936, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:20:41", "owner": "dfuh121", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18194366188330784, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:19:17", "owner": "nathaliemariemathers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114322867602700, "text": "That don’t look like Cesar whatever his name is what Jesus is this ??", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:19:14", "owner": "xtravyagraaa__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077909771242123, "text": "10 Hail Marys for you. 🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:19:09", "owner": "nettemd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842154949635012, "text": "Charlie???", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:18:41", "owner": "bocatadeatunsinpan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078633340945961, "text": "💀😭😭😭😭😂lawd she’s innocent 🥰", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:18:19", "owner": "shauntae_13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937386793101155, "text": "I hate it here", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:18:18", "owner": "katelynnzthomson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061915373227435, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:18:17", "owner": "its_mii_takeit_or_leaveit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980146584933354, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:17:55", "owner": "call_me_karazyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165743626350257, "text": "He’s actually looking at Christians and say “what the f@ck!!!”", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:17:46", "owner": "kylejay68", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18063433034184828, "text": "Omg! We watched Home Alone last night and, just a warning to all you people, there are so many “6-7” clips I almost turn the tv off 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:17:35", "owner": "mai.rz11", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18159503029401724, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:17:24", "owner": "damnnnn._ginaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036673649512090, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:17:07", "owner": "just__a__normal___guy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368578351082172, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:17:06", "owner": "katoalreadytaken", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055587038328910, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:17:05", "owner": "zuanchen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059748284268211, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:16:34", "owner": "willyfrsilly", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17931331764135687, "text": "Jsisoagej nshs", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:16:12", "owner": "ahmet.suleyman5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970820799974878, "text": "Hshs", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:15:47", "owner": "ahmet.suleyman5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860108836485060, "text": "😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:15:35", "owner": "loubnanboul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936825322103142, "text": "i want to hate this so much but i cant 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:15:25", "owner": "pwter_lol", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18055059131325405, "text": "When that vines revive is back I need you to put it on there", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:15:04", "owner": "x.x.misaki.x.x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085793624082247, "text": "Yeah I guess he is", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:14:48", "owner": "parker.odonoghue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115114057574087, "text": "O💀", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:14:35", "owner": "matamumaisha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909085333125293, "text": "@ryan.shaon", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:14:31", "owner": "rthvikkkggs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079937143922605, "text": "That’s cute, but that’s not Jesus😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:14:29", "owner": "follow_christ_love", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035786483709931, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:14:14", "owner": "_iamlyonx_", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17872298664464888, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:13:59", "owner": "carteraxel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071408087061894, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:13:55", "owner": "pj_sparkles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059029958279874, "text": "It’s due to the current mix up of the sabbath being on Saturday or Sunday. The picture checks out", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:13:41", "owner": "mattruetten", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064191482390798, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:13:23", "owner": "tommm1211", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17860833837542128, "text": "Laughed way harder than I should have", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:11:58", "owner": "marcus_adelaido", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18151415578424247, "text": "Oh my mom wouldve been pissed 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:11:13", "owner": "cyb3r_s1nz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871852873464631, "text": "Omg😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:10:22", "owner": "lifewithkidjumbo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029874959554099, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:10:21", "owner": "themauryasempire", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18098246215650494, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:10:19", "owner": "itsyourflowergirl1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055174592325316, "text": "67", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:10:03", "owner": "uncle_cosplay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086611516988960, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:10:00", "owner": "mommaquinci", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298570000256059, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:09:18", "owner": "yo.kir.091", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061546211233318, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:08:40", "owner": "chicloren_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100886587688321, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:07:44", "owner": "ms.mermy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114942313506417, "text": "💀💀", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:07:42", "owner": "charlottetadams14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073540883249667, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:07:42", "owner": "ohjoshyyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891140773382357, "text": "Lol", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:07:38", "owner": "charlottetadams14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087097255968119, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:07:17", "owner": "ken_sntrl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075553967585012, "text": "Yo Jesus how many days did it take God to make the world?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:06:51", "owner": "steven._.propes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18247835833293126, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:06:40", "owner": "alex.isak15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060835913636808, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:05:47", "owner": "ekzotic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085585700009362, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:05:42", "owner": "ms_classy_and_confident_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852101644553815, "text": "🤣🤣 siiiiixxxx seeeeevvveeeennnn 🫴🫳", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:05:37", "owner": "haddy__jat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968905965831352, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:05:04", "owner": "yannis.0615", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100779910703435, "text": "@hurley.2cool4skool", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:04:48", "owner": "melchris1127", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086808775820521, "text": "🤣 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:04:40", "owner": "miss_stefuly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18380209984195584, "text": "@faye_victoria_l", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:04:31", "owner": "sj83murphy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881879620422226, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:04:13", "owner": "keesha_kbrown", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087026977807195, "text": "My 8 yr old ... \"it does look like it!\"😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:38:55", "owner": "lilmiss_lin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098153743828089, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:38:50", "owner": "zaizaib", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082274750120902, "text": "So cooked😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:38:37", "owner": "mo.wraithy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058419344646462, "text": "This video and the \"counting sheep\" one are the only funny uses of that shit meme", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:38:31", "owner": "jerrelben", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034196891529694, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:38:18", "owner": "sevgiurall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065965781151729, "text": "Six seven", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:38:08", "owner": "raghavmokal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909848122123729, "text": "That hangs in your house?…. Crazy", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:37:12", "owner": "thegrimmett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085644401043669, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:37:00", "owner": "anabel_rios_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892354345372183, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:36:18", "owner": "echeverrai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544904995028934, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:35:39", "owner": "jmo_writer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933970156135495, "text": "Sacrifice it...", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:35:11", "owner": "heavy_metal_mike1981", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891805591241052, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:34:51", "owner": "dianas_lil_babies", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087534916983037, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:34:49", "owner": "maryliv_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897698206357322, "text": "Is she retarded?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:34:48", "owner": "5ive6ix2._.adol40", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110442052612308, "text": "6 days it took to do everything 7th day to rest", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:34:18", "owner": "sergio_ismael_lee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074113310010117, "text": "HE WAS DOE 🤷🏽‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:34:17", "owner": "allforsself", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545997223034861, "text": "Good luck Charlie", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:34:07", "owner": "hezeki4h", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17998230890699474, "text": "اويلي عليك جيسوسسسسس😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:33:58", "owner": "xp_qx999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120785551546465, "text": "That's Ceasar Borgia bro", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:32:04", "owner": "marcuswilliams236", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928970461151681, "text": "🤣 bahahaha 💕", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:31:49", "owner": "tammygunit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028462469567366, "text": "guys you need to hold on posting such bangers vine is about to make a comeback", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:31:44", "owner": "ilomae", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17844135042623197, "text": "Burn the child", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:31:21", "owner": "_jj_burns_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086332415001081, "text": "God finished on the 6th day. And then one the 7th he didn’t know what to do. This picture was taken as he was debating on whether to rest or go fishing.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:31:20", "owner": "corey_webb93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010255937804343, "text": "so you guys think like that for your god?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:31:08", "owner": "usmanculpritofhisown", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956864430891785, "text": "😮😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:30:11", "owner": "sophea3311", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18164159251389722, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:29:53", "owner": "jvliesantanaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979310910933112, "text": "Jesus? 🥴😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:29:16", "owner": "ree_sjrs87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976776963949091, "text": "🤦‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:29:12", "owner": "genealcoker", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18105525418566763, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:28:39", "owner": "gwop_krashout", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18411031441142736, "text": "Is that a Del Parson painting?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:27:47", "owner": "drewsclues.py", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18059896757250373, "text": "Charley kirk?!", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:27:33", "owner": "chanterelleefox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962934807991353, "text": "good luck charlie", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:27:23", "owner": "_haileybby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069818171372585, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:26:54", "owner": "drea.n_30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940251141963476, "text": "bro.....", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:26:02", "owner": "jamesterohsteel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079218994934638, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:25:35", "owner": "saida_bed29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125153842520072, "text": "😮😮😮😮😮😮😮😮😮😮😮😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:25:03", "owner": "nicaycastillo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100292236774244, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:24:35", "owner": "essadeknada", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18082782529893633, "text": "@irmaapmc", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:23:29", "owner": "arskaamma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093056887921476, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:23:23", "owner": "_rezazanganeh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035110820523852, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:22:42", "owner": "dolce_bynadine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18248237404288384, "text": "He's not NOT doing 6-7", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:22:40", "owner": "cstat5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066776624140296, "text": "“So basically there are 6-7 days in the week”", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:22:27", "owner": "pinsninfiffr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925905967174176, "text": "Wooooooww🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:22:07", "owner": "cinnamonpeppers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992098638906472, "text": "I hate this so much", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:21:48", "owner": "vicdamoan26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938576128097385, "text": "💀", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:21:09", "owner": "runningtofindmyself", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091881101497483, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:20:49", "owner": "araqueoriana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940405857963034, "text": "@katiemiclat 67777", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:20:46", "owner": "clt_cruzer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058105670647329, "text": "He’s actually doing 8,9", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:20:01", "owner": "ryan_malatesta7870", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929269060135952, "text": "To be fair… in that picture… He kinda is 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:19:18", "owner": "bill_the_barman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067445435121115, "text": "Sometimes I think our generation needs its own personal saviour....like we need a Jesus that relates this generation😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:18:21", "owner": "rubi.boina", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18124586290518984, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:17:38", "owner": "rafaeljae7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119498539551708, "text": "He's doing the iconic family guy gesture to let his disciples know it was time to laugh at his funny joke", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:16:31", "owner": "the_nut_shredder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115757638566701, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:15:55", "owner": "jairus.sellsrealestate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067783556377445, "text": "Charlie, That's Not Jesus. That's some random Dude posing in what is represented as Jesus.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:15:41", "owner": "heilfigure", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17901275616335242, "text": "That ain’t Jesus tho.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:15:41", "owner": "the.master.killa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18342819631229280, "text": "😂😂😂😂🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:15:36", "owner": "shanell.3308", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105328267732875, "text": "HAHAHAH", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:15:27", "owner": "luemariec", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075392225190113, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:14:25", "owner": "bamachica27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088041217789551, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:14:18", "owner": "ubasakozkan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097311316831955, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:13:59", "owner": "miakroberts37", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547575928057168, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:13:42", "owner": "felix_sky_why", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905864704291372, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:13:39", "owner": "araantonel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547155802013858, "text": "🤣🤣😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:13:10", "owner": "sashay.chante_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988451286873889, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:13:09", "owner": "sammysweetheart95_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086506298050102, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:13:00", "owner": "___petuniaa___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081938549130975, "text": "Except its actually a demonic thing that the person who created it openly admitted this. For those who haven't done the research go look up the Chicago rapper... He openly admits to practicing Santeria and praying to demons", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:11:37", "owner": "2luvme_is2hateme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147695146381973, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:10:04", "owner": "bery91016", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087752435293519, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:09:38", "owner": "imjdot_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897472552346981, "text": "WE ARE LOST", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:09:03", "owner": "dawczechowski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18247071829291962, "text": "No way 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:07:37", "owner": "fabylouscharlie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329470060244109, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:07:24", "owner": "keyanna_keyanna1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975320703951142, "text": "She needs to shut the fuck up", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:07:21", "owner": "youwishyouwereme_lmao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969741882991954, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:07:14", "owner": "taniyadeshay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100850827781418, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:06:59", "owner": "david_primee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060541046559332, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:06:48", "owner": "mecaail", "likes": 69}, {"id": 18063647999392111, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:06:42", "owner": "mitik0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046238327474609, "text": "The trend is so annoying but this is funny as hell", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:06:32", "owner": "tantegabyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071215808588669, "text": "The lords favourite number is 7 but Satans favourite number is 6 that’s why god is greater he😂 but I loved your daughter’s answer that was super funny.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:05:52", "owner": "the_mad_art1st", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17919596292229121, "text": "Probably the real reason they crucified him", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:05:44", "owner": "spacegoats0g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090810769901418, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣the best", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:05:38", "owner": "arezouarts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185585113347429, "text": "@aitimalima 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:05:37", "owner": "gulzhikhan_gilmanova", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071469683587230, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:05:36", "owner": "libertyimnida", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18330770581215371, "text": "We’re coooooked hahah", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:05:31", "owner": "kalebthompy90", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056269103647336, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:05:12", "owner": "consuelo.grc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073845671592738, "text": "Is this what the atheists call “indoctrination”?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:04:58", "owner": "munchkinfirst", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063268586547541, "text": "Psalm 67", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:04:58", "owner": "snook.glass", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075484058238041, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:04:50", "owner": "mamaofotis_gerrykenney", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087557182791755, "text": "Well God literally did 6-7.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:04:02", "owner": "duuuudeewhaaaaat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993996297896773, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:02:43", "owner": "thealesnik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101599978667270, "text": "And on the 6th or 7th day he rested", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:02