78594627, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:37:54", "owner": "jonask3103", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18372246463159924, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:37:32", "owner": "sarahw087", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087506935987296, "text": "You know that the Pacifier looks like across at the beggining of the video", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:36:37", "owner": "juliorivera673", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028867640749395, "text": "He’s actually saying “come oooonnn” to the Romans", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:36:34", "owner": "poppinpapi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061404638549771, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:36:21", "owner": "zzigzzagzu_07", "likes": 374}, {"id": 17989445162897240, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:36:16", "owner": "shar369", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113838643587811, "text": "⁶🤷⁷", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:35:42", "owner": "manu_coelho_rafah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091745657508554, "text": "6-7 the fight between good and evil.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:34:34", "owner": "that.red.head.mom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18438759223099915, "text": "Could someone explain me what hell is the \"6-7\"???", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:34:32", "owner": "awsouza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059220800281636, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:33:40", "owner": "jz.money", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18409407940142787, "text": "Hahaha", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:33:33", "owner": "dpdoll25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915517615236239, "text": "Both jesus and 6 7 are jojo refferences", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:33:08", "owner": "reapergreen_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098908648697943, "text": "🤣👏", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:32:35", "owner": "joe_xox7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064685423409984, "text": "🤣😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:32:31", "owner": "aramad27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102861307668075, "text": "Her name is charlie...", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:31:56", "owner": "osamaabdeljabbar_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18061698197536448, "text": "😭😭",