2025-11-30T14:57:03", "owner": "_doubl3_ac3_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949268941052554, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:56:40", "owner": "burberrydari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080356064158809, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:55:16", "owner": "bgravitter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987265647750742, "text": "🤣🤣😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:55:03", "owner": "mel.issarey", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18007754432813568, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:54:33", "owner": "ambernhubb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539784022060128, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:54:23", "owner": "queenscot1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011141867813720, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:53:34", "owner": "toniaa_a__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547366240056300, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:53:21", "owner": "tuann407", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120963049534555, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:52:19", "owner": "ozibrahim189", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089831318492922, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:51:39", "owner": "ramina_malik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998504565696780, "text": "😳👀🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣 I was not expecting that 😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:51:36", "owner": "jfernandez183_ox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303563944250270, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:51:13", "owner": "neshaj08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996005289848020, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:51:06", "owner": "lisan_arkawazi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051868922348324, "text": "In Islam God rested on the 6th day\n6 ☪️ 7 ✝️", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:51:02", "owner": "amytroy.ok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935200537072833, "text": "my lil brother said that 6-7 was in the bible 😂 now I believe him🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:50:59", "owner": "alizz.go", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17879621511334603, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:50:49", "owner": "thunderdanloveskittens", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993359802893531, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:50:31", "owner": "sandy2783", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111679873591327, "text": "If she knows this “meme” then she prolly too old for that binky 😭 🤦🏼‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:50:20", "owner": "thewhitebro", "likes": 528}, {"id": 18399648850135232, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:49:50", "owner": "paigeariele", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17845225893607387, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:49:46", "owner": "jennrespicio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128039158444202, "text": "@jess.lempert", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:49:35", "owner": "cherokee411", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877157092348375, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:48:58", "owner": "arie.enchanted", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17900020563339968, "text": "we are making christmas gingerbread cookies today. Now we have 6 and 7 cookies for the holidays 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:48:40", "owner": "keto.kalypso", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18337827913231862, "text": "🤣🤣🤣Def doing 6-7", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:47:54", "owner": "shine_nicole7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18349379803206439, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:47:30", "owner": "keela882", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146064895434886, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:46:46", "owner": "6arba_roja", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18306402565251642, "text": "He is not doing 6 7, he is doing VI VII", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:46:33", "owner": "faeez_najeeb84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18202819513319316, "text": "😭😭😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:45:55", "owner": "deron_mataz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068542307415872, "text": "Definitely not showing this to my 5th grader.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:45:30", "owner": "belovelyphotos", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18052770959661743, "text": "67😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:45:13", "owner": "xo__nic", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064250255627018, "text": "Show respect ediots", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:44:56", "owner": "johnny_habchy99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298539691258960, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:44:06", "owner": "__phils__bike__up__page", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079979429155725, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:44:06", "owner": "northbest_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865140385514092, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:43:36", "owner": "the_blessin_and_the_lesson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078105920270488, "text": "Crazy to now be a part of the older generation and understand the connotation is definitely different for them, they say there is no meaning and I understand that part I really do I used to go around t posing saying 4 pack with a kfc bucket on my head- but I also understand there’s a whole backstory of emotions  in their minds of how jesus may have ended up making this face and doing 6-7…. This may be the last meme of its kind that I will halfway understand 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:43:15", "owner": "cameronwillford", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17860791033478584, "text": "I just laughed to loud😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:43:01", "owner": "chickiekaleb", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060546800556745, "text": "Cooked generation", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:42:45", "owner": "xx_mustybello83_xx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17994238340707468, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:42:36", "owner": "ivqanairam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134265949478563, "text": "Forgive them Father for they know not what they do", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:42:26", "owner": "italianswann", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18109004890559332, "text": "Oml", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:42:24", "owner": "lila_likes_rain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063080654399402, "text": "Do you know what those numbers mean? Look up the artist who sings it, the numbers, and what the artist believes in.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:41:44", "owner": "ritch_the_nursecoach", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193249117333585, "text": "@genesismcastellanos Liam", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:41:43", "owner": "classickeyla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161974165401671, "text": "My jaw-😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:41:16", "owner": "unrealfatimah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071584829601408, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:41:15", "owner": "sertafication", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003002480828096, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:39:44", "owner": "unemployed_unc41", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18210500671313595, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:39:43", "owner": "poracadandolalora", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998339286836260, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:39:31", "owner": "unemployed_unc41", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067403237123675, "text": "Hilarious", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:39:16", "owner": "_s.ro__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072559619357426, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:39:15", "owner": "8gatesturtle_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864205858521074, "text": "@rich_lippert @mick_lippert29 @georgedelaney2810", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:37:53", "owner": "jeannemarie8876", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097159546885988, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:37:40", "owner": "ms_mobetta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105538108724515, "text": "Listen to the children 👏", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:37:18", "owner": "heypookieily", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134569639427895, "text": "😂😂😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:36:20", "owner": "kahukz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18538331950029074, "text": "No lies told here 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:36:09", "owner": "nayallday_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100646176779691, "text": "Since 67 means “nothing” sounds about right.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:36:09", "owner": "mullen4649", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094839130872270, "text": "dude i genuinely thought you were fernando alonso", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:35:26", "owner": "niknikmechanik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992019615886872, "text": "Are u a devil worshiper (6) or a Follower of GOD (7)", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:34:27", "owner": "krissylove24k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183214855350358, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:34:02", "owner": "unique.dior", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072142337057754, "text": "I mean ,she ain't wrong but it's messed up", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:34:02", "owner": "guevarrajeanty20", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17859636504486787, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:34:01", "owner": "albertojosemartinezavila", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108612634620000, "text": "Was the earth made in six or seven days?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:33:44", "owner": "thats_my_life_871322", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17866316751507987, "text": "Omg", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:33:22", "owner": "dardaririta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095388448847608, "text": "Oh my sweet Lord🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:32:17", "owner": "leticia.perucci", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009380924812378, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:31:56", "owner": "jayrl1fe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032691584742771, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:31:23", "owner": "brittvsbratt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18130505149494910, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:31:20", "owner": "jayymar347", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076015103464191, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:30:58", "owner": "ashleyblack_2020", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077048960231914, "text": "Someone painted the man in your picture the wrong color! Jesus was from PALESTINE!! The picture is giving white supremacy!!", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:30:55", "owner": "a.female.barber", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868698112479137, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:30:46", "owner": "at_every_comment", "likes": 86}, {"id": 18066487337141908, "text": "This is when he decided it’ll be on the 7th day", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:30:39", "owner": "dieun.jean", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17867667990490116, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:30:13", "owner": "_selfish_87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932210653136445, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:29:59", "owner": "denis_yakybovskiy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883824100411650, "text": "😭🫶🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:29:24", "owner": "thaquitta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854767156576751, "text": "I meannnn😭😭😭 he is", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:29:04", "owner": "amberamari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056889119643582, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:29:00", "owner": "alexandra.theonie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104556601660025, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:28:53", "owner": "natv.arts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990871206885565, "text": "I’m putting this on a shirt today", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:28:10", "owner": "iitzfresh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079254452172537, "text": "@paymeskrilla", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:27:46", "owner": "ms.yvonnealexus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074843615010116, "text": "Charlie too old for that binky", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:27:37", "owner": "decemb3rstars", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973276014808734, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:26:45", "owner": "hamzawy_x90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967640865992681, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:26:36", "owner": "austejapeceliuniene", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048359498678833, "text": "ia tuu hahahaha", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:26:30", "owner": "rahmanihjismail", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888640363390274, "text": "@nirerez85 @lioofek", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:26:21", "owner": "ortaleen_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120712405550256, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:25:53", "owner": "smokinbarbie45", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002905490677501, "text": "At least she knows who Jesus is 👏", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:25:49", "owner": "donutsnbooty", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18103694728589315, "text": "Made the universe in 6 rested on the 7", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:25:45", "owner": "josh.burt.39", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18115398811576370, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:24:50", "owner": "izuku342016", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864622414521701, "text": "😭🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:24:41", "owner": "emmagraycex", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17851142334597334, "text": "😂💀💀💀", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:24:37", "owner": "smmartin.xo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18189967246339528, "text": "jesus🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:24:24", "owner": "lillongla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086111069025889, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:24:18", "owner": "u_mutha_trucka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121699798535547, "text": "Yeah", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:24:12", "owner": "ruined_k1ng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945842887074159, "text": "@paymeskrilla 😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:23:52", "owner": "bellaqueenlove", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077274881241320, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:23:50", "owner": "24readingit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18151520557419434, "text": "Yk what 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:23:49", "owner": "alyxransom", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086866835056124, "text": "He foretold 67🙌 may he rest in rizz", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:23:32", "owner": "paigealice", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18160957756402215, "text": "what did she said?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:23:30", "owner": "wendyguarrera", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134475685487373, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:23:26", "owner": "hopelessfromantic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915232579237472, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:22:57", "owner": "carusellee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18336290452230965, "text": "صرخت ضحك ههههههههههههههه", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:22:31", "owner": "l6ii.8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948982654070233, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:22:26", "owner": "stibalis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032041493534652, "text": "@justin_danger_nunley", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:21:34", "owner": "elisabethmaria_94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903036961161469, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:20:52", "owner": "aplus100", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072851882038804, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:20:48", "owner": "sham_hafar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075188003001540, "text": "Shit, ya, I guess he is..", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:20:34", "owner": "d4rk_vigil", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17994415700715005, "text": "She's not wrong I guess 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:20:29", "owner": "_snig.luv", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067160480122065, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:20:11", "owner": "lin.babyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18548414284007555, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:20:08", "owner": "iam.sandrella", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367264471087606, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:19:46", "owner": "mzsmith2020", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18162657586399243, "text": "The dad cannot even say he isn't doing that either which makes it funnier😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:19:00", "owner": "ap_4.1.4", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18030690479549341, "text": "That pacifier is going to ruin her dental development", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:18:31", "owner": "mollynye_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846981397594670, "text": "@cjbrenn518 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:18:27", "owner": "mrsangelabrennan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17868330576416723, "text": "@alavery269", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:18:19", "owner": "katelyn_zimmerman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977062719953579, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:17:39", "owner": "pua197", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024536213717272, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:17:13", "owner": "urpecanpie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118774909546969, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:17:04", "owner": "gillburnside7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077133014216607, "text": "😂 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:17:02", "owner": "yeahitsshaunie_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18316417369301376, "text": "\"Charlie, what is daddy doing?\" \"Indoctrinating?\" \"Yeah, I guess he is.\"", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:16:29", "owner": "muncle.c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104642848678578, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:16:07", "owner": "truongbeouu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075838666986532, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:15:53", "owner"