r": "jussben_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845979487615788, "text": "@aaronarvidsson 😁", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:47:18", "owner": "annacarinarvidsson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908275384275741, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:47:10", "owner": "gina.fayad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18407215024141219, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣 that was too good 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:47:05", "owner": "big_mood_a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044518802652008, "text": "Bro this is not funny", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:46:44", "owner": "soljo_gabi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092149966926317, "text": "My daughter asked me when she was six years old about a statue we had in our hallway of Mary and Joseph and baby Jesus with a crucifix in his hand. Q, did they know he was going to be crucified?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:46:17", "owner": "nupnag_aka_akaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083691431020300, "text": "Pov me coming into the comment section to see \"mormons aren't christians\" or the heresy gif 👀", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:46:12", "owner": "james_swallom.53", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17877007002354509, "text": "💀💀💀💀💀💀💀💀💀💀💀💀💀", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:45:36", "owner": "icegrill4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926627464034882, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:45:29", "owner": "dr.fatimah.aldalooj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956693218033459, "text": "I don’t understand what the child said 😢? Anyone can type please", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:44:21", "owner": "anzavarzina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076278457983502, "text": "@briiee__xo", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:44:03", "owner": "trice2b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989032584871460, "text": "😂🔥👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:43:46", "owner": "chickagreeka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064601024450518, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂 so cute", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:43:20", "owner": "coloredge5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075224009258685, "text": "Oh god 🤦", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:42:55", "owner": "twowhyt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852217468593059, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:42:47", "owner": "soukaynaa.benyahya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18188437885337711, "text": "God created the heavens and the earth in 6 days, on the 7th he rested", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:42:35", "owner": "dantd2404", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864908245516427, "text": "L ball knowledge", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:42:12", "owner": "sleepy.rakesh", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18070385483605092, "text": "What would Jesus do?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:41:45", "owner": "stoofacedown", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17936974121979696, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:40:56", "owner": "this_is_mr_nj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025190033783768, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:39:59", "owner": "witha_melanatedflow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863107606536425, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:38:28", "owner": "dominik.bacskai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122975512530086, "text": "Ts so frying me", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:38:10", "owner": "nfarrazn3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088160167782217, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:38:04", "owner": "shahinrefa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991845546855085, "text": "Bwaaaaa!!", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:37:25", "owner": "mpsgrl78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925260688168357, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:37:18", "owner": "made.by.miik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903575707326728, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:37:05", "owner": "jaydamorganxoxo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116064235602722, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:36:50", "owner": "celinewogan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18550541674013307, "text": "she’s a baby how does she know this?!😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:36:41", "owner": "rat_of_the_family", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864058609531310, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:36:08", "owner": "artsy_kita", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077467294975117, "text": "Good luck Charlie", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:34:05", "owner": "eh_its_just_jay", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094812955881232, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:33:46", "owner": "_c3f", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18134944966426750, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:33:18", "owner": "arfzzn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897298084204154, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:33:14", "owner": "aryantambe_0802", "likes": 45}, {"id": 18079683983150619, "text": "Not being rube but this generation is beyond SAVING", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:33:01", "owner": "linxx.av", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18162576571354891, "text": "That’s not Jesus", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:31:58", "owner": "rehanees", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902113384302139, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:31:02", "owner": "ikramzouhiri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083073611118751, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:30:24", "owner": "je_02_emiko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025700000589279, "text": "As soon as they are talking take the bink away. They don't need it", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:30:16", "owner": "ericjahnphotography", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055138916650081, "text": "He is tuff😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:28:30", "owner": "haitham_212127", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18175441306368646, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:26:59", "owner": "sk____2928", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868640611481629, "text": "Here before this blows up", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:26:46", "owner": "stabbed_with_darkness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074584781206133, "text": "Can someone please tell me what is she saying?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:26:27", "owner": "florescu.marina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089383000755784, "text": "Should’ve and her how many days it took God to create the earth. 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:25:57", "owner": "kyonzilla", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090324832939872, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:25:52", "owner": "kristinamlx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085434629069906, "text": "I found out that this is a  divine sign. The meaning of the number stands for family and wisdom. So let them all shout out loud 67.  It’s the transformation! We are ONE Humanity", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:24:45", "owner": "leerkoerperin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075937787261278, "text": "Why did you do that?! It s our Lord ,God, Saviator!!! NOT A FREAKING 6 7 MACHINE!!!! GOD BLESS US", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:24:21", "owner": "books_lover509", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17882953860416791, "text": "Lol", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:24:08", "owner": "mynameisnikkita", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973397976808863, "text": "explain it what is 67 ?😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:23:53", "owner": "axf_ktc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18380554786148858, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:23:31", "owner": "voidnonly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075559958519274, "text": "😂😂😂 nahh we cooked that generation is soo danm cooked", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:22:48", "owner": "sir__looka___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132490933492456, "text": "this is amazing hahahha", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:21:54", "owner": "sussman2.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930888790117772, "text": "Oh my godddd", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:21:27", "owner": "0xk_xk0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164862511389145, "text": "This generation is cooked 🍚🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:20:59", "owner": "mandelorian.1329", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088272358967286, "text": "Our Lord and saviour never did that but sure get your views.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:20:52", "owner": "augustinenathan87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120417310532865, "text": "Jesus, how many days did it take to make the world?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:19:35", "owner": "jonathan.dekleer", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18146755465432180, "text": "U have a special place in Hell", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:19:24", "owner": "fred_wsmith", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18412858099186109, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂 MY GOD IS A ON TIME GOD!", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:19:20", "owner": "laron.bryan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18550952380019038, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:19:13", "owner": "jodidareal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18166350406386030, "text": "This is so sad this whole generation", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:18:58", "owner": "barcode1010101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160057579404045, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:18:49", "owner": "linitjikouwa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859696021486155, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:16:43", "owner": "tsunamyee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087163237813198, "text": "😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:15:42", "owner": "ms.emilyyyyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917878780217967, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:15:25", "owner": "rockstarsworld2023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046036706468855, "text": "What is this strange thing with 67 i don’t understand ? 🧐", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:14:24", "owner": "maloglaus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18318151750223971, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:14:18", "owner": "alziodavankafahrezzi", "likes": 1313}, {"id": 17994341675719203, "text": "Jesus knew...", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:14:13", "owner": "lemonadecharles614", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025681046770132, "text": "I am too old for that and can’t understand what does 6-7 mean. My kid says it all the time but I thought it was just numbers. Can anyone explain what does that mean?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:13:43", "owner": "mia_lanc96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901406962324603, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:13:27", "owner": "teestephon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903638590315759, "text": "That’s Obi-Wan Kenobi. Jesus was from between the Tigris and the Euphrates river and what would be modern day, Iraq.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:13:15", "owner": "b.d.shep", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867561835499169, "text": "Bro she really does look just like good luck Charlie 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:13:11", "owner": "rocstarplayboi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991842501887485, "text": "@daniel_guevarra1", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:12:42", "owner": "iiskaaah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185121748357764, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:12:07", "owner": "x7xao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935240974107142, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:11:22", "owner": "hlo_fake_id_bro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947117137077040, "text": "Now look at Matthew 6:7 and keep reading. It’ll take you to a pretty well known prayer.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:10:33", "owner": "missfowefing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067276706112240, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:09:59", "owner": "diane.9187", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049014857404846, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:09:41", "owner": "bougie_queen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049826378403642, "text": "😭🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:09:09", "owner": "rozjdlee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121642075543593, "text": "The caption lmaoooo", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:04:33", "owner": "cinnaswirl_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094209238701768, "text": "@jessx.046", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:04:20", "owner": "audreyjesje", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905052958297643, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:02:12", "owner": "tyking0330", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074722352193689, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:01:04", "owner": "ei2jjeiw8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986244987916235, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:00:11", "owner": "varunpreet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068764583095769, "text": "Broo 6 7 is DEMONIC", "created_at": "2025-11-30T10:59:47", "owner": "bruk_call_me_bura", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066076802428711, "text": "Jesus looked at her like “oh my child no”😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T10:56:16", "owner": "angeliadmatthews", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084921128042057, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T10:56:06", "owner": "kshitijbhanu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133097122488418, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T10:55:40", "owner": "ademefun.dev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094072804851605, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T10:55:17", "owner": "lamees_hamasha369", "likes": 3}, {"i