ict", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17970044801994145, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:22:58", "owner": "fuentesfamily13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974409510950798, "text": "Hahhaa !!!", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:35:03", "owner": "karlaashleyjane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981509382931476, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:43:38", "owner": "materialisticmonk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988580982914017, "text": "😂😍", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:33:08", "owner": "abeerhdd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002814470827037, "text": "Blasphemy 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:15:48", "owner": "shaka_going_nonstop", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18004002128827612, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:41:44", "owner": "simplee.joi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004570952819200, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:13:02", "owner": "leanne300994", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006338660819240, "text": "Hashhahahaha😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:31:17", "owner": "lauraniemeyer", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18009505202651423, "text": "bahahaha! 6 7 is the stupidest thing ever except for this 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:37:28", "owner": "heathergiles_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18020104544611724, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:14:42", "owner": "liza.juarez1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022021691606159, "text": "Omg that’s HILARIOUS 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:36:58", "owner": "laura_walton_23", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18038177789720000, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:34:36", "owner": "siobhang52", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038489783706515, "text": "Galatians 6:7, which says, \"Do not be deceived: God is not mocked, for whatever one sows, that will he also reap", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:09:10", "owner": "sasviv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050065172402219, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:09:52", "owner": "mzshitpopper_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050998013378314, "text": "I’m crying laughing. I want to wake my kids up and show them idk why 😭🤣", "creat