 "likes": 0}, {"id": 18538596232002298, "text": "Six fishes and seven loaves of bread", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:29:53", "owner": "thirty_turtle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544115779029839, "text": "Shits spreading like a plague", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:30:26", "owner": "blaruss420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18548160097033277, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:20:29", "owner": "shema.smile", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868584241481926, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:14:22", "owner": "guillermo32ruiz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876928384356310, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:56:55", "owner": "adrieblueberry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877070467351256, "text": "Literally best 6-7 I’ve seen 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:40:08", "owner": "jle.128", "likes": 2368}, {"id": 17890943958373777, "text": "Can someone please explain… what does it mean 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:34:17", "owner": "gurjantsingh_rathore", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17892870048431716, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:07:12", "owner": "nathyu7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17897150031204919, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:49:03", "owner": "q33n.elly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921881119055565, "text": "@genevievethedawn_ show this to Z!", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:40:42", "owner": "haveacupofajaye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927466213166087, "text": "That’s Cesare Borgia", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:06:12", "owner": "evamarie1023", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17929716618156268, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:41:52", "owner": "tiana_hongara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930433723117636, "text": "Omg stop it 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:55:49", "owner": "thatgalvalofficial", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17946495059942451, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:34:10", "owner": "hercules.cuevas", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17949724664918703, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:50:37", "owner": "inthemiddleofmommyland", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956184