0713529766726, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:31:10", "owner": "a.nicolexo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103207735604582, "text": "I can’t underestimate what she’s saying?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:00:13", "owner": "theavondiaries", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105274084726953, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:13:44", "owner": "je2ss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109515658627107, "text": "😂 this is mental", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:54:34", "owner": "garinawly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112940629590702, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:57:03", "owner": "viciouslydivine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119761123548794, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:41:30", "owner": "__diana_nyaboke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119971930546584, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:58:28", "owner": "philadelphia_jordan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120924625539188, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:53:39", "owner": "bigprivlege", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18121924375471672, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:45:18", "owner": "noniwahla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135643384464501, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:49:40", "owner": "erikstattoos", "likes": 131}, {"id": 18135876631483058, "text": "Jesus wept ❎ Jesus laughed ✅", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:57:41", "owner": "sixtwentyfiveeighteenthirtyone", "likes": 53}, {"id": 18158827795401587, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:01:37", "owner": "hosseinafshari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18162090658397809, "text": "6️⃣7️⃣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:28:04", "owner": "ellaposy", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18193235176334790, "text": "@hsmathew", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:39:29", "owner": "emmamathew", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18299695189258055, "text": "Bahahaha!!", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:37:28", "owner": "carjewls0331", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18335625796237440, "text": "@caseythurst", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:53:34", "owner": "carriejrich22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18339482785231522, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:02:08", "owner": "shayfulmama", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383105215147390, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:00:12", "owner": "one_n_only_t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18535983961013478, "text": "Pretending he's white", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:56:33", "owner": "medarnell65", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18549998299008984, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:06:33", "owner": "malak_abdss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847814458586369, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:46:51", "owner": "yeahdig25", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17863129512454828, "text": "That is adorable!", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:42:26", "owner": "tgorzalski", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17865444534513364, "text": "😂😂😂😍", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:06:48", "owner": "itsclaudiaalvarez", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17865560475511746, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:16:15", "owner": "jewlyforever", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17866127181505700, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:10:15", "owner": "thequeen.7865", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899915290184908, "text": "She's not even wrong", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:15:24", "owner": "die_and_run", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17915903616234865, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:04:50", "owner": "caligirl.ina.pnwworld", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17925896934038994, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:54:31", "owner": "jackio613", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17936988251984425, "text": "666 777", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:44:34", "owner": "itismejimmylee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941809234091516, "text": "The original 67..", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:38:46", "owner": "dfwrealestate_vickiehendricks", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17948357480929014, "text": "Haha so funny!!", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:52:19", "owner": "lauriejcraft", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17954198202024327, "text": "GOD created in 6 days and rested on the 7.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:19:08", "owner": "elvia_dalaz", "likes": 19}, {"id": 17965391363845254, "text": "Vine material", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:57:11", "owner": "whiskeypapacito", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17844190167611613, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:17:00", "owner": "1.blasiann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846360295615061, "text": "☠️☠️☠️☠️", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:30:26", "owner": "norrr_1914", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17847814458586369, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:46:51", "owner": "yeahdig25", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17863129512454828, "text": "That is adorable!", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:42:26", "owner": "tgorzalski", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17925896934038994, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:54:31", "owner": "jackio613", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17936988251984425, "text": "666 777", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:44:34", "owner": "itismejimmylee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940269288964877, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:32:30", "owner": "_nickydiamond", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17941809234091516, "text": "The original 67..", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:38:46", "owner": "dfwrealestate_vickiehendricks", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17944648491074109, "text": "I seen a post from someone in my old town and they made up a meaning for 6-7 in biblical terms and it was “god created everything for 6 days and on the 7th day he rested”. Not my words but I thought it was cute also don’t steal the creds because I’m definitely not", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:27:04", "owner": "k.cherie17", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17948357480929014, "text": "Haha so funny!!", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:52:19", "owner": "lauriejcraft", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17952924180047676, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:25:03", "owner": "msmajestyp", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17965449878848512, "text": "Omg 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:45:05", "owner": "lupiita.dguez", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17983055699919279, "text": "Built the heavens and the earth in 6days and then rested on the 7th. 6-7", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:15:47", "owner": "coast2coastpw", "likes": 5081}, {"id": 17987702282747090, "text": "😂😆😆", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:20:32", "owner": "lilsusz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17991301568730211, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:47:43", "owner": "dreamingcasually86", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17991582644728238, "text": "@basicallyunfiltered", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:29:35", "owner": "e_ratic.killah", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17994117662719869, "text": "The transition from 6 to 7 in this religious interpretation represents the shift from human striving and incompleteness to resting in God's grace and finding wholeness through divine intervention. So technically she’s not wrong", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:35:52", "owner": "thecapncrunck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994154322707558, "text": "“So I had six or seven loaves….”", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:55:47", "owner": "seshen7", "likes": 65555}, {"id": 18031384616535300, "text": "Hahaha", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:18:16", "owner": "imstacia", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051617129670865, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:52:08", "owner": "genesisgoris_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051796754370445, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:56:29", "owner": "oleg_balitskyi", "likes": 4061}, {"id": 18059064062279577, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:33:02", "owner": "rina_0030", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061816979204549, "text": "Proverbs 6:16 (and ironically 1+6=7 so it fits even more) 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:18:51", "owner": "wiggs.8", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18061832966629637, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:51:17", "owner": "kayka.grigsby", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064228592426967, "text": "I was not expecting the portrait 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:41:04", "owner": "kelsgorgeous", "likes": 2026}, {"id": 18064801286397519, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:34:47", "owner": "blunderbuss_witha_switch9000", "likes": 1197}, {"id": 18065426696616951, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:35:23", "owner": "peacelovenfarm", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066414398572009, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:40:59", "owner": "chelli__sol", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068778707098118, "text": "😂 Winner", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:24:10", "owner": "chancey.hurt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073448768353100, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:56:59", "owner": "karen.s.miles.3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077598734238418, "text": "Ok!! This one Wins Hands Down😂😅Fight that Evil 🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:24:21", "owner": "69lovethyself69", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18080304992163470, "text": "Fair enough", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:37:14", "owner": "gordis_one_89", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081459539121625, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:55:47", "owner": "steffi_noronha_19", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082057177890128, "text": "Jesus is loving every bit of this for 2025’s kids and teens 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:56:54", "owner": "bethcparker35", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083485727079683, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:48:17", "owner": "_denisseelimelech", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083957056849794, "text": "@theshaderoom 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:15:10", "owner": "travel.junkee2", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18086467748512862, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:33:49", "owner": "mrs.tblueeyes", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087237163793358, "text": "Nah I heard “nick Saban”", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:49:46", "owner": "jc_thadude", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089393722987399, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:46:09", "owner": "kegdoty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090818879498336, "text": "Jesus is like I’m doing this one for the kids lol", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:29:58", "owner": "m_to_the_j_ayye", "likes": 1417}, {"id": 18093720295889758, "text": "Throw it away...", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:31:42", "owner": "petebraxton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098905546770075, "text": "Jesus been ahead of the game 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:25:51", "owner": "boutabogey", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18101688322666104, "text": "@mth383s", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:19:00", "owner": "bussjaeger", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18103757251662871, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:46:20", "owner": "iamkandi_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18103920925667738, "text": "I mean…she’s not wrong…", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:46:38", "owner": "julian_z404", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104015035658808, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:22:10", "owner": "kkia_raa_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18104046151678879, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:23:42", "owner": "cinniecynn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109354366625539, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:35:38", "owner": "smpdslprkr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18130569550441973, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:55:51", "owner": "numidia_barbie_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18212498695311762, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:36:05", "owner": "mel_d_87", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18299751280258439, "text": "😂 as a Play Therapist, I hear this so many times a day. ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:46:56", "owner": "magalogocamille", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18305714734250041, "text": "@j_levss 😭🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:42:36", "owner": "klevxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322131139220917, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:23:42", "owner": "emmasencouragement", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18350101906206881, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:53:46", "owner": "nylsa.j", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353032726200984, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:29:31", "owner": "chimlee_ittai", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18394856584126939, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:47:53", "owner": "channelle.moniqueee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18434703766108361, "text": "🤦‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:49:55", "owner": "taniarulz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17850598656598376, "text": "She’s not wrong. 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:58:49", "owner": "lynnzee3m", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17853411456584952, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:13:25", "owner": "alej_ber", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17864141898519866, "text": "🤣 She’s so cute!!", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:12:56", "owner": "jackygw86", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17867446761489996, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:03:52", "owner": "el_teniente07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869041132472782, "text": "😂 she’s so cute!", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:38:42", "owner": "cchelseyybro", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17870398779397293, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:32:21", "owner": "_mayracereceres", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872853709460895, "text": "Oh yeah this will pop off", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:08:43", "owner": "dsxndoval", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17873768289378936, "text": "Omg I can’t stop laughing 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:04:07", "owner": "grxcieee.grace", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17897181675205404, "text": "No way 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:56:42", "owner": "jlo_lyn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900655186336429, "text": "😂🤣😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:00:51", "owner": "dangobaby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901778461307681, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:02:31", "owner": "viviana_nnj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902949997167831, "text": "😂🤣🤪💀", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:22:12", "owner": "lazarusthegrate", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17913448566239177, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:51:42", "owner": "taimalyz716", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17918984706069300, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:38:07", "owner": "cintia__21", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17923766223191146, "text": "Hahaha Charlie PLEASE 😭😭😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:45:23", "owner": "joykeara_elizabeth", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17931688161131651, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:54:34", "owner": "shalimasimo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17944092744083508, "text": "So my 6 year old wasn’t lying? He told me 6-7 is from the Bible😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:59:42", "owner": "ozgefullmoon", "likes": 3875}, {"id": 17962740708005648, "text": "Choose the 6’s or 7’s my child", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:16:53", "owner": "dani_yell10", "likes": 60}, {"id": 17991280694893407, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:35:36", "owner": "rsin30", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17991284213903941, "text": "I’ll take the 7s Charlie!", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:06:03", "owner": "harmsyy73", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18025824659760432, "text": "Send me this post", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:37:51", "owner": "utahfams__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048249125423772, "text": "this would've done numbers on vine", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:02:24", "owner": "oh.hey.its.me.maarz", "likes": 212645}, {"id": 18052181174342361, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:05:00", "owner": "shannon.gram", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061774517541634, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:30:32", "owner": "bigmamayoshi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061796963215056, "text": "@iamzoie", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:58:55", "owner": "3079coco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071592029199263, "text": "@siana_varuu 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:01:00", "owner": "joanna_jawn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074771057461303, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:04:17", "owner": "kingdomdigitalpodcast", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075885230253636, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:01:14", "owner": "nikitamhatre0807", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083603237089070, "text": "None of the 80’s sci-fi movies prepared me for this level of dystopia.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:57:50", "owner": "dannydelorean", "likes": 95}, {"id": 18083629715023079, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:03:28", "owner": "rrmafe", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083923364098973, "text": "Okay this one is actually funny 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:18:05", "owner": "piecingmoments", "likes": 3967}, {"id": 18085427936053999, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:05:57", "owner": "shesloccs", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086672230989098, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:14:59", "owner": "travel.junkee2", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086828876486387, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:03:50", "owner": "maldonado500", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18091006159943059, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:08:49", "owner": "dsxndoval", "likes": 272}, {"id": 18094050784721398, "text": "I did not understand what she said 🤷🏼‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:39:44", "owner": "hraphael2020", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18094344349698371, "text": "But that’s not Jesus", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:03:39", "owner": "_munchuniversity", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18095488762675298, "text": "THIS NEEDS TO GO VIRAL", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:06:16", "owner": "justpriyanka__", "likes": 28433}, {"id": 18100824406781415, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:12:08", "owner": "lvndrbeauty", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18101359972687977, "text": "I think Jesus just looked down from the Throne, facepalmed then chuckled. 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:06:00", "owner": "shadoxir.wav", "likes": 2782}, {"id": 18102806302679563, "text": "Bye😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:07:33", "owner": "k.bell.ame", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18105471085714139, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:55:39", "owner": "jamela_rae", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18107452441651506, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:56:03", "owner": "ph_osophy", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18120158029528749, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:10:30", "owner": "_miisschriiss", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18129465328496845, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:58:17", "owner": "lovealwaysg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143222152393126, "text": "Anglo Jesus is definitely doing 6 7", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:46:54", "owner": "xiamara922", "likes": 53}, {"id": 18146950279377620, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:06:12", "owner": "melissa.avaje", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148148662438272, "text": "Omg, she’s hilarious!", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:08:28", "owner": "kayzway4211", "likes": 96}, {"id": 18148837621427044, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:05:42", "owner": "____space_cadet", "likes": 42}, {"id": 18166089835378694, "text": "The best one so far ! Jesus forgive me!", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:32:18", "owner": "yudisneyl", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18172357030336776, "text": "Bahahhahhahahaha", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:34:11", "owner": "kianastew", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18302147959282019, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:36:31", "owner": "arm_dem", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18422005183114223, "text": "💀", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:06:31", "owner": "c.gxxii", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18441558424103048, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:40:30", "owner": "vincentxmg451", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18501052852072730, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:28:39", "owner": "taylorshaley", "likes": 1}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["christianhumor", "jesus", "67", "ugc", "fyp", "funny"]},
{"media_id": 3696645991558481780, "shortcode": "DNNH_GTNwd0", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DNNH_GTNwd0/", "taken_at": "2025-08-11T06:43:13", "caption": "Day 5 of BelleBonjour 🇫🇷❤️\nFive days in. Still running on croissants, caffeine, and chaos.\nSomehow, it works.\n\n#BelleBonjour #Day5 #FrenchCoupleVibes #LoveLanguage #DailyLaughs #CuteAndChaotic #BonjourBae #PlaidAndLove #FrenchMood #LaughTogether #ReelRomance #CoupleEnergy #ParisVibes #FrenchLoveStory #RomanceInReels #MatchMyMood #EverydayWithYou #ViralCouple #LoveAndLaughter #RelationshipGoals #CoupleContent #DailyBelleBonjour #LifeWithBae #ForeverMood #LaughingTogether", "owner_username": "bonjourgirl_daily", "owner_id": "76047726580", "likes": 2083534, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0089_DNNH_GTNwd0\\DNNH_GTNwd0_20250811_064313.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18068067536334171, "text": "Stop laughing ,you are single", "created_at": "2025-08-24T18:37:18", "owner": "shrish_shukla01", "likes": 47758}, {"id": 17921443254014759, "text": "I smiled, then I cried 🥹", "created_at": "2025-08-25T03:05:18", "owner": "gavbiker", "likes": 49881}, {"id": 17946315675033759, "text": "Men scroll ✅ men see ✅ men happy✅", "created_at": "2025-08-25T12:26:24", "owner": "omkumar__15", "likes": 41979}, {"id": 18069184301251423, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-25T16:24:47", "owner": "nglvu2", "likes": 21494}, {"id": 18073841018186257, "text": "Slapping on the laps was incredible", "created_at": "2025-11-09T01:16:48", "owner": "p_r_i_s_c_o", "likes": 4210}, {"id": 18079463816475781, "text": "Bro...\nThey made it...", "created_at": "2025-10-17T16:38:36", "owner": "lucky_coolio", "likes": 8852}, {"id": 18059455853230740, "text": "Someone said I smiled, then I cried 😭 I feel thisssss", "created_at": "2025-11-06T18:18:04", "owner": "odh.ani", "likes": 497}, {"id": 18154835305402699, "text": "I hope a love like this will find us❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-11T18:16:58", "owner": "bellabokka2000", "likes": 1065}, {"id": 18098708212615316, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-24T18:35:35", "owner": "osman_krss", "likes": 2732}, {"id": 17983807637750776, "text": "I love this video so much 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-04T12:20:50", "owner": "javidbayramli", "likes": 111}, {"id": 18344015485205743, "text": "I smiled then I remembered I am single😢", "created_at": "2025-10-16T06:52:29", "owner": "reddevil_xhark", "likes": 502}, {"id": 17987234456885873, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-13T10:11:02", "owner": "aadi___1308", "likes": 143}, {"id": 17895337395223300, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:41:22", "owner": "detectorplays", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17976375590959699, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-08T14:39:14", "owner": "musadassad", "likes": 234}, {"id": 18000596810809915, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-24T20:44:30", "owner": "jh.blackluke", "likes": 5260}, {"id": 18077416693792169, "text": "Enjoying the real until you realise your single 😢", "created_at": "2025-08-25T07:11:38", "owner": "x.blue_22", "likes": 4902}, {"id": 17986761503871046, "text": "Dear Allah ... may this kind of love finds me ... Ameen🤲🥹", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:16:34", "owner": "hello_ugly_humans", "likes": 12}, {"id": 17850736107583109, "text": "Did I just catch you smilin lil bro?", "created_at": "2025-11-05T03:41:08", "owner": "noobrett_plays", "likes": 107}, {"id": 18078099428477727, "text": "Me who don't even know them but smiling and being happy for them 💖✨😂", "created_at": "2025-08-25T15:43:31", "owner": "shaneelzehri", "likes": 221}, {"id": 18077616409938935, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T22:33:40", "owner": "leratophasha_", "likes": 30}, {"id": 17879225514406909, "text": "Ok be happy 🙌and stay away from my feed", "created_at": "2025-10-10T06:55:30", "owner": "beyondtheblueytchannel", "likes": 166}, {"id": 18082330649139629, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:17:47", "owner": "juliusnism", "likes": 22}, {"id": 18065342588521538, "text"