732404, "text": "🥹🥹", "created_at": "2025-11-30T21:55:06", "owner": "bboakye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080325554170716, "text": "Very lucky men 👏🙂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:16:04", "owner": "pradiomanan_da", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908342467272834, "text": "why am i smiling 🙂....", "created_at": "2025-11-30T19:45:38", "owner": "shivam2004_19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845367616601596, "text": "Men Scroll✅Men See✅Men happy✅Men wake up to reality✅ men sad", "created_at": "2025-11-30T19:42:36", "owner": "_harshal_suryawanshi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948798052066155, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T19:35:32", "owner": "brahamaulakh_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940058161095388, "text": "❤️❤️😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T19:11:55", "owner": "meron_hagos12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931870627114941, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:45:05", "owner": "r_____711h", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146765047435782, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:31:57", "owner": "yabe_yb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099846220796638, "text": "So much violence in your choice of words.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:26:10", "owner": "rumelby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087970714987066, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:08:04", "owner": "mr_ace19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546660499059102, "text": "Real Soulmates", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:03:47", "owner": "aayush_l_kharat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028699247565643, "text": "I live lebanon", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:52:11", "owner": "therobenn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074086463014619, "text": "So accurate 🥲🤭🥰", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:38:47", "owner": "onahi01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933085717120830, "text": "FUCK.  YOU", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:31:02", "owner": "sambit955", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862852675536011, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:15:08", "owner": "v.i.s.h.a.l_b055", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063074336445206, "text": "Only thing worth being jealous of", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:04:53", "owner": "kaluthemalugu