": 0}, {"id": 18044111915663867, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-25T01:48:35", "owner": "marvin_phlp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059612585385753, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-24T19:26:08", "owner": "chuzaa1432", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082741414938488, "text": "@halina_ali17 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-24T19:05:23", "owner": "faizaabukar788", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071435993178690, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-09-24T17:34:32", "owner": "btw__nomann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876866365409417, "text": "Go to her feed😭", "created_at": "2025-09-24T14:52:22", "owner": "memoirsofanziel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957673215995628, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-24T14:48:43", "owner": "jryll_c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067405616014384, "text": "Senyum senyum kau bujang🗿", "created_at": "2025-09-24T11:43:00", "owner": "edelweiss_8_", "likes": 38}, {"id": 17873198592426382, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-24T09:30:06", "owner": "utshavgm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080001295972322, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-24T08:22:30", "owner": "cn_declassified_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060530693575593, "text": "Why you laughing? You are single 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-24T07:09:52", "owner": "shadhin_the_distroyer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077567135009495, "text": "😂❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-24T05:11:51", "owner": "saiwailintun1995", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094241656732659, "text": "that’s mean", "created_at": "2025-09-03T06:01:11", "owner": "stellalouuuuuu1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068919850946610, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-30T14:18:05", "owner": "__ayushh.h___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065345597190297, "text": "🥹😄", "created_at": "2025-08-28T14:36:37", "owner": "muxtrvw.3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039342293422892, "text": "Te amo 😢 tu sabes que es exactamente a ti ❤️", "created_at": "2025-08-28T13:59:23", "owner": "yishmael.llopez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861194836467663, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-28T08:37:45", "owner": "_jasur__sh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886477783223893, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-28T07:27:41", "owner": "meme_gal_meme_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065520059462306, "text": "😂❤️", "created_at": "2025-08-28T07:19:23", "owner": "shoh_oke20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042695480354345, "text": "God is coming! You must repent of your sins. We don't know when or what day God will arrive, but we must be prepared before his arrival. God wants us all to go to heaven with him.some will go some will not and you know what God will say to the person who did not go to heaven with him and God said depart I never knew you it can be scary but if you put your faith in him everything is possible many people say there is no god god exists otherwise we would not be in this world god died for our sins on the cross so we can live but we We don't deserve it, God is coming, repent! This is our last chance, where God comes, we must be ready, many people go through bad times, but God always has a reason.because God wants us to learn to have patience and then what we asked for will come, repent, God is coming!", "created_at": "2025-08-28T06:46:43", "owner": "_khxrlwn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073710745850924, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-28T06:35:29", "owner": "uiluuljihlaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932822713092913, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-28T05:56:29", "owner": "moa.1050", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074881490013020, "text": "🤨🤨🤨🤨🤨🤨🤨", "created_at": "2025-08-28T04:46:12", "owner": "shikazu3783", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103532467605796, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-28T04:43:53", "owner": "ginmareee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059451125608551, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-28T02:05:05", "owner": "ndee_taufiq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183927559328135, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-28T01:43:39", "owner": "nu3k1_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18089616862773085, "text": "Lol😆", "created_at": "2025-08-28T01:35:38", "owner": "edinsc77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891386983321221, "text": "nyengir gak tu", "created_at": "2025-08-28