{"media_id": 3713685813599948159, "shortcode": "DOJqZJPCE1_", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DOJqZJPCE1_/", "taken_at": "2025-09-03T19:00:22", "caption": "At a Carly Rae Jepsen concert in April 2024, a security guard unexpectedly stole the spotlight. While Carly was singing at the edge of the stage, he stood right in front of her, completely serious and focused on the crowd. The funny contrast between her energetic performance and his calm, professional expression made the audience cheer and record the moment.\n\nThe clip quickly went viral, with fans loving how his unshakable focus made the scene even more entertaining.\n\nIt became one of those unforgettable “background star” moments that  fans still share today.", "owner_username": "top.music.songs", "owner_id": "70335242764", "likes": 136149, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0091_DOJqZJPCE1_\\DOJqZJPCE1__20250903_190022.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18144237535411745, "text": "Call me maybe 🗣️💅", "created_at": "2025-09-04T11:29:58", "owner": "ashittt_ok_2.0", "likes": 8840}, {"id": 18112245940581788, "text": "Bro face 🗿 \nBro voice 🥰", "created_at": "2025-11-19T15:50:59", "owner": "albus_ls", "likes": 5159}, {"id": 18036247031702536, "text": "he was caught off “guard”", "created_at": "2025-09-03T19:33:16", "owner": "joel.pinana.cs", "likes": 6272}, {"id": 18370845112150551, "text": "Wait 2024!? I thought this was like 2012? The camera quality, the hairstyle, the singing 😅", "created_at": "2025-09-03T19:39:25", "owner": "_julialc", "likes": 1109}, {"id": 18066568177986551, "text": "He's waiting this sooo long 😁😁❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-03T21:59:52", "owner": "norim.tai.darom", "likes": 638}, {"id": 18052530902670850, "text": "perfect job buddy😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:50:32", "owner": "rikoprimanto", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17946496829939800, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:49:34", "owner": "ale_bew", "likes": 53}, {"id": 18040929857710356, "