 "owner": "litnott", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082274683902103, "text": "🗿", "created_at": "2025-09-05T09:18:59", "owner": "obachann_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18324257077227319, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-05T08:17:49", "owner": "sascha.eder1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129547303455925, "text": "Gardaworld", "created_at": "2025-09-04T21:30:28", "owner": "sahilverma9241", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078493888963190, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-04T18:34:41", "owner": "tee.ray313", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086778079834744, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-09-04T15:39:14", "owner": "pavlik._.x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042447158653865, "text": "Hell yeah 😂🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-04T14:42:34", "owner": "gusion.khiam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961581648971461, "text": "Love ittt!!!! 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-04T09:47:33", "owner": "eun_.corn", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18102466384609313, "text": "Aawwww that was cute 👏👏😍", "created_at": "2025-09-04T01:36:24", "owner": "steve_le_chien", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090914947739011, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-04T01:16:44", "owner": "dannygarcia1834", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18052082855221088, "text": "Barbie sabi ko na", "created_at": "2025-09-03T23:40:03", "owner": "ayiyieee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134646574447558, "text": "❤️😍", "created_at": "2025-09-03T22:21:50", "owner": "fadoua.1f", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970134324939642, "text": "SHOW VAGANA", "created_at": "2025-09-03T22:14:18", "owner": "madeofcrowfeathers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016347311773947, "text": "After shaking hands with the Americans, you should count the fingers on your hand that have not decreased.\nVirtual kidnapping\nThe new slavery of the struggle for freedom. \n\"I used my best colors for your portrait.\"\n\"Touch me, and you'll never be alone.\"\n\"I can read you like a magazine.\" \nAll of them are part of the lyrics of Taylor Swift's songs.\nBut these are not just songs. Taylor Swift is an author of crime fiction that is authentic and has done all the killing.  Students study hard and you easily steal their ideas from their brains.  It is my responsibility. We are imprisoned in a place whose slogan was freedom.  Do not travel to the USA, ever, even for a short time. If you have a special knowledge or skill or invention, they will steal it from your mind. The US government initially used this method to identify people who intended to harm the United States.  But today they use it for many purposes, including stealing information from people's minds. Many celebrities like Taylor Swift and Harry Styles are helping to deceive the US government. They can see everything you see. You will never have privacy even with your family. They can see everything you think. Money, power, and dark magic are the three levers they use to achieve their goals. \n......................................\n#TaylorSwift_is_the_criminal\n#HarryStyles_is_the_criminal\n#Selenagomez_is_the_criminal\n#Biden_is_the_criminal\n#KamalaHarrisIsCriminal \n#TrumpIsCriminal", "created_at": "2025-09-03T22:07:34", "owner": "55red21", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18018797174568624, "text": "Kirain Iben", "created_at": "2025-09-03T21:33:03", "owner": "leonrd.26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027669125511642, "text": "Ilkoknomimommmmmikk", "created_at": "2025-09-03T21:03:14", "owner": "alex.t1655", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094524994734022, "text": "Mikijk", "created_at": "2025-09-03T21:03:12", "owner": "alex.t1655", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038231702452241, "text": "so scam me baby", "created_at": "2025-09-03T20:42:32", "owner": "jamestunnard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074496350103696, "text": "Who", "created_at": "2025-09-03T20:12:27", "owner": "jwhit2023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077894573053935, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-03T19:11:59", "owner": "d.c.garcia", "likes": 256}, {"id": 18094897135642931, "text": "Mr voice crackkk👏", "created_at": "2025-09-03T19:09:36", "owner": "_kalaashhhh", "likes": 3}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3775989075401347568, "shortcode": "DRnAg7bDZHw", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRnAg7bDZHw/", "taken_at": "2025-11-28T18:30:58", "caption": "A joke that somehow didn’t find its way into the TV edit.🤔\n\n#standupcomedy #uk #china #comedy #bbciplayer #fyi #tv #london #chinese", "owner_username": "blankpeng404", "owner_id": "25934400471", "likes": 23997, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0092_DRnAg7bDZHw\\DRnAg7bDZHw_20251128_183058.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18321722254220029, "text": "But in BBC you can criticize British government and their colonial hegemony", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:48:35", "owner": "abdullahkorkmazzz", "likes": 501}, {"id": 18299580943257197, "text": "Another ccp spy", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:20:58", "owner": "gobbolover", "likes": 406}, {"id": 18085748717510571, "text": "Where in China are you from?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T15:55:35", "owner": "hummusmaximus", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17992646390887483, "text": "Try criticize Indonesia😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T08:42:26", "owner": "taupik.mohammedannsch", "likes": 31}, {"id": 17850611754562305, "text": "Can u critized my government please... Cpi 37 Points", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:34:38", "owner": "deaddy_xy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18305686315265726, "text": "FOR A MOMENT I THOUGHT IT'S NODA MEGUMI FROM NODAME CANTABILE LIVE ACTION. YOU LOOK EXACTLY LIKE HERRRRRRRRR (out of context but I can't help it, sorry)", "created_at": "2025-12-02T06:46:13", "owner": "_tanmoy.desu_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17844233583614653, "text": "Never seen BBC criticising china", "created_at": "2025-12-01T14:43:16", "owner": "shaktar132", "likes": 23}, {"id": 18118025935484447, "text": "Do they pay well", "created_at": "2025-12-01T18:16:22", "owner": "pr8yush", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916733296228031, "text": "Need guts to say this 👏😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T16:25:28", "owner": "ebtisam_haider10", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18113314786589722, "text": "你有中文脱口秀吗？想看。", "created_at": "2025-12-03T14:41:37", "owner": "chenjinghua922", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18089058371297772, "text": "In USA and Europe, you can critisize everything except that one not real country", "created_at": "2025-12-03T07:00:54", "owner": "fweasley09", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17926203417035351, "text": "Try criticising israel in UK or US😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:32:26", "owner": "keenyl09", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17958640835886751, "text": "When are you coming to Toronto? 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T16:50:22", "owner": "realarmaansidhu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105736987629766, "text": "Bad taste can also draw laughter", "created_at": "2025-12-03T12:04:11", "owner": "kennethtseung", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18176286748370296, "text": "What's this british x chinese accent", "created_at": "2025-12-08T20:00:23", "owner": "anchor_limited", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541610455061302, "text": "But in China you can criticize Israel but if you do in UK, US then there's no freedom of speech", "created_at": "2025-12-03T05:31:23", "owner": "ch.dawood000", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17999251589842584, "text": "But you cant critizise Israel in UK", "created_at": "2025-12-02T10:53:22", "owner": "andriramadhan.id", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18303398089282990, "text": "What about if we criticize BBC ?", "created_at": "2025-12-03T08:43:02", "owner": "rezavitali", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929601253017477, "text": "It's true and I am using the money to buy some Xiaomi and BYD stocks.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T15:29:39", "owner": "imukara", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18034135061527662, "text": "-10.000 credits poin.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T08:06:38", "owner": "user319495", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17868917385416271, "text": "The fact that this didn’t make it to the tv edit means….oop 🤫", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:55:36", "owner": "brettxie", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18007426382824573, "text": "Your crown left behind in China queen🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-05T15:38:48", "owner": "zulmi_vasa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546629182009740, "text": "这种谣言没意思的。这些公众媒体比如BBC,澳洲的ABC，美国的pbs立场都比较中立，在中共国内封锁，国外宣传的环境下，世界需要这些媒体来抗衡。别忘了六四，covid的时候是谁替正义发声的。就算他们有经费反共，要选的话我也支持那些不用墙去把国人围起来manipulate的媒体", "created_at": "2025-12-04T14:59:48", "owner": "alex.lin.au", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18049628822413984, "text": "😂😂😂还好您在海外！！in cn说点男女笑话就被封杀了！🥲", "created_at": "2025-12-04T01:28:22", "owner": "cunningwhiskers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972808977960386, "text": "You risked your life for this joke.😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T08:40:32", "owner": "mojito_and_rum", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18314107078222187, "text": "In UK, you cannot criticize china in wechat and ticktok, and then go back to ChIna", "created_at": "2025-12-02T06:38:13", "owner": "know_the_truth_worth_to_die", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085940408003016, "text": "Now they will give u names like CCP bots / double agent ans what not 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T06:14:56", "owner": "ryugam_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877256593356505, "text": "In india you can critize anyone on their face🙌😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T05:47:49", "owner": "exotic__mohan_18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114194158601302, "text": "BBC British Broadcasting Colonialism", "created_at": "2025-12-03T10:15:58", "owner": "saukijoy", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17991204008899988, "text": "Try criticize my government in Indonesia😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T01:40:45", "owner": "jogihernado6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135315508477445, "text": "will you be able to come back to China?", "created_at": "2025-12-12T01:41:20", "owner": "louisedai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066810566399033, "text": "Try criticise 1sra31", "created_at": "2025-12-13T16:56:20", "owner": "bayareashitpeople_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903042241163321, "text": "There is assumption that China is to fascism, vs BBC has an agenda !", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:38:58", "owner": "kevinyungsoo_hong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915041686234190, "text": "So what if in China u criticise uk ? Will u get pay fm media too?", "created_at": "2025-12-03T15:27:47", "owner": "cherietang0701", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18550140133062839, "text": "Try to criticize isreal and the Jois...", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:02:49", "owner": "liyupulsar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18548981152054689, "text": "You get $7000 if you criticise Israel. Try it", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:24:28", "owner": "jaygyoko", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098907400691876, "text": "I’m Russian and we have 100% the same situation", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:27:37", "owner": "_olegkosarev", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079868504135710, "text": "british today is muslim country,", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:54:44", "owner": "ancientgoldstatue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098987590774757, "text": "nice try jinping👍🏻", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:12:58", "owner": "wv_be", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096602482857174, "text": "Now try criticizing Israel.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:23:37", "owner": "eng4073", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18305538661248296, "text": "Ya said the truth 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:43:09", "owner": "kurrobadiv_v", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051446255379792, "text": "What if u critisize gov in UK?", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:03:47", "owner": "paweljasinski3963", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849755953601439, "text": "I don’t get the joke. Can you explain the context?", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:20:34", "owner": "schoenesintung", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18049792760388203, "text": "Thats boy or girl?", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:42:01", "owner": "aki_from_korriban_temple", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084887669098275, "text": "Have you really lived in China? I think you've been living in the UK for a long time and really don't know what China is like", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:44:27", "owner": "fuerkang123", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104917699657362, "text": "Haha so funny. Give her awards", "created_at": "2025-12-01T06:01:36", "owner": "kaswangy", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18161517115403536, "text": "有打算開開台灣的玩笑嗎 哈", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:13:27", "owner": "yantong_1213", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18318079414217255, "text": "Find a new job perhaps", "created_at": "2025-12-01T08:16:14", "owner": "evangongx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090237530494142, "text": "she talks funny", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:12:24", "owner": "ssdesbw", "likes": 117}, {"id": 18400550011193452, "text": "I may or may not have state secrets which I may or may not be willing to divulge if you know what I mean 😉", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:31:09", "owner": "thomas_lale_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099807334740992, "text": "If I criticize my govtvi will be jail.  Which country do u think I am from?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:45:18", "owner": "sommy_sharma", "likes": 95}, {"id": 17984959400870139, "text": "Next criticize immigration", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:00:22", "owner": "nikowasbored", "likes": 151}, {"id": 18088063045802455, "text": "@blankpeng404 come to the USA. You can criticize the UK and anything you want!", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:30:01", "owner": "moe_joe_bro_bro", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18073939013249374, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:17:59", "owner": "comedypreet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067560659113877, "text": "Blank living life to the edge", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:55:57", "owner": "jakesteerscomedy", "likes": 65}, {"id": 18113872225604041, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:16:05", "owner": "la_laurapeli", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17970465638977242, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:13:32", "owner": "lateeflovejoy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906104761277931, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:30:37", "owner": "_jennytian", "likes": 33}, {"id": 18070749332077614, "text": "😂 but it’s the best one though", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:46:51", "owner": "vaancao", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049777805400986, "text": "🤣🤣 I feel naughty for being the first to like this clip! (👏👏👏)", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:32:37", "owner": "kuanwencomedy", "likes": 23}, {"id": 18091377442940601, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-12T11:14:48", "owner": "rizkakadafi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092485972901389, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:27:29", "owner": "hehuangcomedy", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18294101821277081, "text": "We have many well-documented cases where people were jailed in China simply for peaceful criticism — for example, Nobel laureate Liu Xiaobo, Xu Zhiyong, Pu Zhiqiang, and many others.\nNow compare that to your claim about the BBC.\nIf you believe the BBC pays people specifically to criticize China, then please provide even one verifiable case — with evidence such as contracts, emails, payment records, or official investigations.\nSo far, no credible source, court case, whistleblower document, or independent investigation has ever shown a single instance of someone being paid by the BBC to criticize China against their own free will. If you have such evidence, please present it. If not, then the claim has no factual basis.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T14:39:11", "owner": "shsosl2782", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18115880830574464, "text": "BBC always showing negative china and india", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:54:36", "owner": "anilverma.0i", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075105767520208, "text": "Tibet is the part of INDIA ❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-03T13:08:11", "owner": "mahesh_kushwaha_361", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969750498972198, "text": "3point to this🔥🔥😅", "created_at": "2025-12-04T12:33:24", "owner": "andri_rahmat08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969385296994033, "text": "In India we become Anti-national 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:58:10", "owner": "rrrrik00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042425144708715, "text": "Старый советский анекдот\nПоспорили русский и американец, у кого свобода круче. Американец:\n‑ Я могу выйти к Белому дому и крикнуть «Рейган козел!».\nРусский:\n‑ Подумаешь, я тоже могу выйти на Красную площадь и крикнуть «Рейган козел!».", "created_at": "2025-11-30T13:41:08", "owner": "ildarakhmadullin", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18099397705806624, "text": "I love you sister you are fecking amazing 🔥❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:51:17", "owner": "leslieisleslie", "likes": 31}, {"id": 17892180255367450, "text": "BBC believers are crying. Btw I’m Chinese I don’t believe in bbc nor Chinese government", "created_at": "2025-12-01T06:14:22", "owner": "lemonredg", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064490993165734, "text": "看来只能吃一碗饭😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:59:18", "owner": "liusha5217", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057916283295012, "text": "Yeah critise china for what for being from bottom to the most powerful in the world ,elimated proverty within its nation. In the mean while what did Uk do?", "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:48:31", "owner": "monkeyslayer007", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17869094910478697, "text": "No", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:21:47", "owner": "occulstone", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079373564269681, "text": "Thank you for the money", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:26:38", "owner": "celticsbound_sg", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090004378756688, "text": "Danger", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:26:29", "owner": "celticsbound_sg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920081173069001, "text": "Guys, I’m looking for a girl (15-17 years old )who wants to learn English together(b1-2) if u interested please send me a message 🤍", "created_at": "2025-12-13T07:07:04", "owner": "bint_kuanysh.09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865547962518480, "text": "wkwkwk", "created_at": "2025-12-13T06:44:15", "owner": "rezaadjiefrmnsyh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842700523655460, "text": "台灣中國！一邊一國！\n台灣獨立萬歲！\n東突厥獨立！圖博獨立！\n光復香港！時代革命！\n香港獨立萬歲！\n澳門獨立萬歲！\n打倒中共！建立民主中國！\n打倒中華文化！", "created_at": "2025-12-13T05:25:37", "owner": "winghay.y13_2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874096087386428, "text": "Ommh😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T21:13:52", "owner": "shahid_yazdaan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067926032434267, "text": "I love her accent 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T16:05:11", "owner": "peter19ace", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077088062333083, "text": "While in China, if you don’t criticise 🇬🇧, you get in jail.", "created_at": "2025-12-12T14:54:46", "owner": "hmx45703", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028140692772997, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T05:42:22", "owner": "ikymars", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929589016148987, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T16:34:29", "owner": "apiipp.png", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871280215394449, "text": "In the uk u will get arrested immediately !!", "created_at": "2025-12-10T16:24:32", "owner": "mousechka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028960361574527, "text": "I live in China for couple years，criticizing the government is so much in the Weibo or WeChat.don’t believe? Go to China, get the truth by yourself", "created_at": "2025-12-10T14:18:54", "owner": "jason82598", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18215661688308801, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-12-10T09:46:56", "owner": "xing_yu_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084261770028819, "text": "That’s not funny", "created_at": "2025-12-08T04:24:48", "owner": "jinzhao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091033408933307, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T17:22:14", "owner": "an_earthian_human", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18511444318070143, "text": "😂👏", "created_at": "2025-12-07T16:52:18", "owner": "s.mari.8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096383827871272, "text": "You can criticize government in China, if you didn’t know, you should read more about that part…..", "created_at": "2025-12-07T14:00:19", "owner": "karldelest", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919554784068870, "text": "In China you change policy not the party in Britain you change party not policy😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T09:03:30", "owner": "abhiyan5423", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002657465842028, "text": "为钱而诋毁自己的祖国。 还笑得出来，台下的是开怀大笑还是嘲笑或是什么笑呢。", "created_at": "2025-12-07T03:57:10", "owner": "gao.zhengming", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541216054037635, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T01:03:21", "owner": "soahamgaur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866375395433031, "text": "哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:07:37", "owner": "sanye_dre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989005227914270, "text": "In China, if you criticise the West, you actually get paid 50 cents by Communist lmao WUMAO🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:38:17", "owner": "jtcf_0v0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842250166642069, "text": "就你这态度在国内马上给你抓到派出所", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:08:22", "owner": "orlando.nie90394", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031622396749431, "text": "That's the truth 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T13:06:53", "owner": "shenaoran314820", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907955905269884, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T13:01:26", "owner": "itz_manish_samrat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18426420217119644, "text": "When will you coming in India?breath aqi of 500 and do yoga,you'll be immortal.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:20:21", "owner": "deveshpandeyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060461024263532, "text": "You looks more japanesse than china 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T03:13:09", "owner": "oland_ady_wijaya_dwi_saputra_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002946449681297, "text": "@blankpeng404 there is a sentence like this:  to know who is controlling u...try to list who you could not criticize😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T23:04:39", "owner": "liyupulsar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870976810399183, "text": "Well...im Chinese...actually you could criticize the Chinese government privately or openly. But u could not organize a group of people and just intentionally Do action or gather or whatever to criticize the government of try to over throw it. U might get invited to drink tea or other more serious treatment depends on the seriousness of the things u do.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:59:45", "owner": "liyupulsar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931927648115787, "text": "But who she is.. i will brought her in #India 🥰😅", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:58:33", "owner": "dr_abuzarkhan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096747577799905, "text": "Ryt😅👌", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:56:09", "owner": "dr_abuzarkhan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047361524463611, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:28:04", "owner": "fotografitai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121254880544092, "text": "in Chinese social media it's a consensus that BBC, CNN spreading accusations against the CCP. But as a Chinese the information have actually accurate.  With CCP blocking all outside media to manipulate its citizens, it's important to have some public media revealing the truth. It's not ethical to use it as a comedy material. Remember 8964, remember covid? Without these media outlet the world will be fooled by the CCP propaganda. You can say they have propaganda too but you rather trust the CCP who try so hard to block all major media  outside China in order to hide the truth from its citizens?", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:11:21", "owner": "alex.lin.au", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077091893336568, "text": "In the UK if you criticize minorities you can go to jail", "created_at": "2025-12-04T04:46:03", "owner": "insta_maa39", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096869086836187, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T01:57:17", "owner": "adptra30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887737138401634, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:23:48", "owner": "ahmaddd.hamidi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997015212848796, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:14:58", "owner": "tamaldas72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087741071315401, "text": "Sorry", "created_at": "2025-12-03T19:33:51", "owner": "issaacc.isu5566", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067386602566144, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T19:27:05", "owner": "maria_._istic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933256320997679, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T19:07:00", "owner": "uzairkhalid2498", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18292538254277054, "text": "R u safe😂?", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:58:51", "owner": "elite._.patience", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918504931208305, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:00:46", "owner": "nasrullah_kalmati", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933350293000786, "text": "👏👏👏facts 👏👏BBC works exactly that way.  If you criticise China and Russia, you will be in their shows regularly and consider you as a good person, but if you criticise Isreal you are a terrorist.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T17:37:21", "owner": "mensankano", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133902163488830, "text": "This is cool", "created_at": "2025-12-03T17:14:50", "owner": "saswat.sarangi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083874478875315, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T16:37:07", "owner": "lazizbek_akmalov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006703187817879, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-12-03T15:17:04", "owner": "qdzwy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845236036620008, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T14:47:39", "owner": "nucs_gates", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041136626502453, "text": "If you criticize indonesia government, you are called anak abah", "created_at": "2025-12-03T14:36:19", "owner": "k.ydiw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082584232886204, "text": "Dangerous Beutiful Woman Slapping BBC without Hand Voice 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T14:09:36", "owner": "its_shoyeb_01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058452386288829, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T13:53:16", "owner": "mr.a_w", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126259171514166, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-03T12:04:25", "owner": "iyut_siregar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911272633251460, "text": "now try to criticize the British government and tell us", "created_at": "2025-12-03T10:56:56", "owner": "fg.nacho91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093072733928904, "text": "wkwk", "created_at": "2025-12-03T10:16:33", "owner": "yon_not", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111482959609786, "text": "I think you should change the words😂😂😂 if I’m telling the truth about China government I will be in danger🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-03T10:09:12", "owner": "stewart_wong007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18536433868030774, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T08:49:40", "owner": "ubaidmalik1238", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068388503613076, "text": "I don't think Chinese people should criticize their government because china is a direct threat to the USA , so all western people and American people hate china because their supremacy is ending, as an Indian I also feel threatened from china rise but indian people accept it but western people never. 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T06:54:08", "owner": "nomad_neeraj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098920414694845, "text": "I criticize Chinese government every single day for 12 years, talk about 1988 Tiananmen square every time if I have chance. guess what, Chinese government give fuck about it but people around me think I am a lunatic, girls stay away from me and can't get laid all the way to my mid 30 because I talk that political shit in front of them every time even during the date.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T06:19:11", "owner": "sunxiaochuan3914", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842717557627117, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:34:10", "owner": "imxichi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541985233043781, "text": "You are really fukyn' smart", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:19:05", "owner": "chido.mandarin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067725944615914, "text": "If i criticize my Country,My President will say\"Kita adalah bangsa yg besar..HIDUP JOKOWI\"..", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:43:41", "owner": "chiill_man", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329373583244974, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:48:21", "owner": "chefkarim109", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049447754412759, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:58:02", "owner": "hill61699", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950958433025609, "text": "Your voice sooting ngl 🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:31:54", "owner": "ashlok___adarsh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980794602928182, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:19:15", "owner": "hana.xplorz_uk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112338601592338, "text": "好喜歡❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:55:50", "owner": "rainertwppl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545712244004484, "text": "@blankpeng404  when your a comedian and you have angry idiots online trying to insult you how do you handle all the hate blanka 😂?", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:25:38", "owner": "japanese_carculture_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091013920934498, "text": "Britishers left our country but mf BBC", "created_at": "2025-12-02T15:54:57", "owner": "csravi456", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904683760297782, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T15:26:54", "owner": "utkarshpatel_r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968888220985383, "text": "But just remember if you go back to China government remembe your criticize video 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T15:17:05", "owner": "priyankamouriya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095653351885875, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:30:41", "owner": "ap0537489", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874401088371972, "text": "In UK if you criticize Israel you will be in danger", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:27:46", "owner": "karar_muzhir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076059742999007, "text": "BBC crying in corner 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:13:15", "owner": "rahul_x_bhumihar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047307089464245, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:49:25", "owner": "slvinnm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926345929173387, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:27:45", "owner": "crossmichael905", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919358692074296, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:00:00", "owner": "whosefaizz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989046621858822, "text": "FUK CCP", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:45:06", "owner": "greenflag0171", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868000588497335, "text": "Same as if you were in Indonesian or Philippine here 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:25:11", "owner": "chord_kupetik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087076630955944, "text": "Assange and Snowden like it", "created_at": "2025-12-02T11:28:34", "owner": "sherzodbek_martov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898148860196350, "text": "I love your joke 🥰 brilliant", "created_at": "2025-12-02T08:43:55", "owner": "imnotahomosapien.imj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105235576634886, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T07:37:46", "owner": "mp.mariposa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089685019767168, "text": "Lucu juga Ria SW.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T07:30:17", "owner": "herbizantaka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116356681564368, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T06:44:51", "owner": "alle.nxzavier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879944470330915, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:57:52", "owner": "copercupies", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052364189354973, "text": "This is the first time I've heard a British-chinsese accent", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:22:02", "owner": "midad_muhtadi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17845982838617237, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:08:52", "owner": "ayman244342", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091576249933507, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T01:33:37", "owner": "besnikdafku63", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138782305462095, "text": "She deserves Oscar 👏", "created_at": "2025-12-02T00:01:56", "owner": "li475959", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856355335568837, "text": "請問你歸化入咗籍未 咁講嘢會唔會返唔到大陸", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:44:12", "owner": "walterl1027", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046413293695200, "text": "UK... The country that arrest anyone who says \"free palestine\"??? WOW you are a big sold b..tch", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:36:04", "owner": "ricardo.romero.777701", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026783093768551, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:17:07", "owner": "bardianik1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949502623048414, "text": "She says in danger, not in jail. Because to be a Chinese Citizen is already in jail 🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:30:12", "owner": "agungheryw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301381546250430, "text": "hahahahaha", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:13:12", "owner": "mauricio303391", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18394264066133823, "text": "How can I get BBC money?", "created_at": "2025-12-01T21:41:56", "owner": "blurwaterer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952974454028972, "text": "Hi Tricia Takanawa", "created_at": "2025-12-01T20:19:40", "owner": "bjshdqwy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101018809689101, "text": "It's business", "created_at": "2025-12-01T20:18:02", "owner": "ig__ssk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903051880315636, "text": "here in Pakistan they will send us to the grave 🪦 your neighbor though 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:55:30", "owner": "asad.44781", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116393974567867, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:51:02", "owner": "diyorbekrustamov893", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099047116838357, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:40:05", "owner": "dcrts1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100255837764797, "text": "If i criticize my government, my social media will be banned. Where am i from? 🤔", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:38:21", "owner": "damanique_sama", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18244459036292107, "text": "Chinese accent with British intonation – sounds great!", "created_at": "2025-12-01T18:50:42", "owner": "betsu.ni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074587664017880, "text": "In USA if you criticize Israeli government, you will be in danger", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:32:59", "owner": "mdhasmatmondal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087776209972591, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:50:05", "owner": "iamsujayy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066255017143386, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:44:39", "owner": "nasimian__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957540952012658, "text": "1000000/100 for THE ACCENT🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:17:34", "owner": "yudasanjaya111_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144497845447555, "text": "But yeah in china you really cant Just pass It off", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:12:57", "owner": "cleocommunist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960735423871851, "text": "Id you critize UK in UK lately people have been arrested", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:12:35", "owner": "cleocommunist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879972040332312, "text": "it's like a derivative of that Reagan joke \"I'm a Soviet citizen, I can go to the Soviet president and criticize the American president\"", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:50:49", "owner": "richard.shek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994112403715240, "text": "真的么？我天天骂活的很好啊", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:18:44", "owner": "dr_narcissus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18493228324077249, "text": "哈哈😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:15:23", "owner": "leeyu9118", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125695618511316, "text": "funny and u are pretty", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:10:46", "owner": "chovy654", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397009891132698, "text": "You're cute", "created_at": "2025-12-01T14:45:51", "owner": "ali_jmale", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853260817588791, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T14:21:34", "owner": "llss0zero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959575423002613, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:58:41", "owner": "jamess.feliz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854710192577618, "text": "If you criticize Isnotreal in UK, you get charged for Terrorism 🥶🥶", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:30:14", "owner": "dawoodimamshah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060114560251976, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:16:40", "owner": "weum_45", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18333271996215264, "text": "😏", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:09:14", "owner": "jasheylife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18386876350181487, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T12:31:18", "owner": "its__harsh_sharma07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900972871323865, "text": "👏👏👏👏😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T12:17:01", "owner": "jameshoang_61", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028577597568626, "text": "有趣逻辑😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T11:42:02", "owner": "johnyyfeng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909377413126237, "text": "离开中国就不会说话了是么", "created_at": "2025-12-01T10:55:02", "owner": "hexiongyanghahaha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100527730774829, "text": "You are  amazing 🤩", "created_at": "2025-12-01T10:19:17", "owner": "jolly.anto1989", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865799776437078, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T10:06:55", "owner": "legijeren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100805575705939, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂 your funny", "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:53:52", "owner": "nicky_question_mark_2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182889847360789, "text": "中国人出来混饭吃，能不能不要提政治、你要点逼脸吗、天天黑、妈了个逼", "created_at": "2025-12-01T08:02:40", "owner": "perhaps.wu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094500541882178, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T06:40:14", "owner": "biva__chan36", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106303420644507, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T06:20:39", "owner": "harosaja", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057013421315115, "text": "If you like Chinese dream but I tink you can sleep because this is dream 😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T05:45:08", "owner": "chenzhisen991", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123218197517255, "text": "You are Chinese dream 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T05:44:15", "owner": "chenzhisen991", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967400670990989, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T05:39:28", "owner": "san.imann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067535600387080, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T05:02:32", "owner": "andhikakrismaintya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858375415559312, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-01T02:52:05", "owner": "mezzocedar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059996318261641, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T02:29:02", "owner": "mohkrar533", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113675866580485, "text": "为何美国人仍执着于民主选举？政府并非为人民服务，而是为自身腰包和0.1%的精英阶层效劳。耗费数万亿美元在异国对有色人种实施种族灭绝。美国的财富根源于入侵他国，通过种族灭绝、强奸和占领掠夺财富、石油与资源。美国人消费的，正是他人流淌的鲜血。\n发自我的中国手机", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:35:30", "owner": "john34kkk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931876099134013, "text": "How much money?😂😂😂, it’s look like easy momey to make anti china propaganda 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:34:31", "owner": "d4z0.art", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972818757967587, "text": "in the UK/europe/ usa / japan if you badmouth China you will get paid", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:37:00", "owner": "mahaputra5758", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064432256616206, "text": "It's always nice to see literal wage slaves regurgitating capitalist propaganda in the comments.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T22:25:55", "owner": "a.rizakarabulut", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107765566625247, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T21:05:14", "owner": "opus.228", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869224837473745, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:28:01", "owner": "keap1.nrf2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915798451087256, "text": "if you swap china for russia, the meaning won't change", "created_at": "2025-11-30T19:34:45", "owner": "ibrgmv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000881870832385, "text": "In uk criticize Islam or Israel is hate crime they can go to jail", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:52:34", "owner": "sakura_gun21", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18048744074422715, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:54:10", "owner": "abesellshomes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097035334875075, "text": "Double agent", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:07:30", "owner": "roshan_mangukiya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154871344416802, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:52:29", "owner": "nelemathew", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136699192462478, "text": "In india you can criticize  government whatever. But in BBC also you can criticize  india without money ..", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:32:25", "owner": "prabakarselvi134", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843036334621968, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:02:01", "owner": "franciscoxaviernic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857588686560382, "text": "Ahh can I have something of that mooooniez? 😭😭😭😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:27:20", "owner": "fractionsofmyself", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022853327788022, "text": "😭❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:01:08", "owner": "hunter.forsberg_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990941316914776, "text": "Try criticizing israel", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:58:50", "owner": "nippongraphy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921181363190491, "text": "哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:56:25", "owner": "deathcastpodcast", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847562725586035, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:39:33", "owner": "kevingreen3169", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547009903032442, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:43:54", "owner": "milkshake_thee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135932284466364, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:19:58", "owner": "1713_1137", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["standupcomedy", "uk", "china", "comedy", "bbciplayer", "fyi", "tv", "london", "chinese"]},
{"media_id": 3766324647861106696, "shortcode": "DRErE_4jzgI", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRErE_4jzgI/", "taken_at": "2025-11-15T10:02:09", "caption": "In the 1930s, workers digging in London uncovered something bizarre—dozens of ancient clay tablets buried under the city. 🏛️ What shocked them was that the tablets were written in cuneiform, the script of Mesopotamia, thousands of miles away. No one has ever explained how they ended up there.Some historians think they were brought over by collectors, others whisper about secret trade routes or even lost migrations. The tablets are now in the British Museum, sitting quietly as if mocking us with a reminder: history hides more than we’ll ever uncover. 📜👀", "owner_username": "pubewitty", "owner_id": "77792187051", "likes": 656092, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0093_DRErE_4jzgI\\DRErE_4jzgI_20251115_100209.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18432955096106087, "text": "Please don't leave without following 🥹", "created_at": "2025-11-16T12:14:05", "owner": "pubewitty", "likes": 6518}, {"id": 17965594955987861, "text": "The slow turn on the last one 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-16T16:07:41", "owner": "ur._.girl._.ronnie", "likes": 8856}, {"id": 18320031262223436, "text": "“That’s bedroom stuff, not here stuff” 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T15:32:04", "owner": "sdillon24", "likes": 32034}, {"id": 18104035684584467, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T11:59:19", "owner": "_s_h_a_d_o_w_0_", "likes": 9229}, {"id": 18349752382200641, "text": "Please like so I can watch it again", "created_at": "2025-11-21T01:42:51", "owner": "iitsme_dave", "likes": 983}, {"id": 18066644456122409, "text": "i love how we kids cant handle the ideaa of  our parents doing it ..while  our existence is literally the proof of them doing it😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T11:26:26", "owner": "elonmusk_here", "likes": 8912}, {"id": 18094848202861052, "text": "The ambarasment on their faces 😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T14:59:21", "owner": "itz_jfh", "likes": 1910}, {"id": 18029201690725557, "text": "Bombastic sideeye", "created_at": "2025-11-15T21:47:11", "owner": "luen.g", "likes": 23561}, {"id": 17950233912025420, "text": "The last one hilarious 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T17:41:24", "owner": "mr.haseeb45", "likes": 3146}, {"id": 18075855065237194, "text": "Please give this comment a like  so I can binge watch this and laugh more.🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:59:51", "owner": "justaharmlessrebel", "likes": 208}, {"id": 18299921533264414, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-20T10:50:00", "owner": "shocking_joe", "likes": 622}, {"id": 18108166636617412, "text": "The little girl’s facial expression in number one was priceless. 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T11:24:19", "owner": "asasparks226", "likes": 4291}, {"id": 18112510222589422, "text": "Last..One.. with the glass ..she is traumatized 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-21T14:25:32", "owner": "sulthana_najeem_", "likes": 967}, {"id": 18087475559489498, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T05:43:55", "owner": "dominickcardenti", "likes": 203}, {"id": 18079993913515992, "text": "please like so i can watch it again 😍😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:42:16", "owner": "isnt_krishii", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17974162550975526, "text": "bedroom stuff 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:28:13", "owner": "iervinaa", "likes": 39}, {"id": 18307633861252041, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-09T09:06:23", "owner": "ris_hanksharma", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18066855005149002, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T13:54:54", "owner": "underrainwalker", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17948690058051340, "text": "I’ve called my husband, daddy for so long and my kids don’t even react anymore 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T02:51:42", "owner": "tammyhartman03", "likes": 787}, {"id": 18087713089811011, "text": "The real scandal is that children and teens know that this is porn talk…", "created_at": "2025-12-01T10:48:02", "owner": "los_mopsos", "likes": 394}, {"id": 18049439147422922, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-09T21:24:36", "owner": "alentz07", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17946932030934469, "text": "Wait, what? My wife and I call each other mommy and daddy in front of the kids. didn’t realize it was cringe 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T17:23:43", "owner": "teamrich2nv", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18083711513023262, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-08T09:22:38", "owner": "jeyjimm", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17945921123943002, "text": "lol I call my husband daddy all the time because that’s the kids call him 🤷🏼‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-12-04T03:39:34", "owner": "lynnzeeburns21", "likes": 28}, {"id": 17854173762570638, "text": "I've never understood the \"call me Daddy\" thing. Never will I ever so don't try to explain it. However as soon as our baby is born, that man I married is no longer Jake, or Babe, or Sweetheart, his name is now Dad, or Daddy, or Dada (depending of course on the age of the child) nothing sexual about that except he is the father and I will call him such. Just as my name is now Mom or Momma.", "created_at": "2025-11-20T13:19:26", "owner": "trina.i.tyler", "likes": 259}, {"id": 17864845779516967, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T00:15:55", "owner": "patmoss10", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18337743364228918, "text": "The kids all KNOW 👀 good reminder for them that their parents are also a couple 😇", "created_at": "2025-11-17T07:55:41", "owner": "arvinoyou", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17869317975474103, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T09:09:26", "owner": "absolutejerry", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17977974509954248, "text": "Them kids is traumatized 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-04T14:56:11", "owner": "carla_062179", "likes": 74}, {"id": 18381019267148186, "text": "Traumatizing kids one day at a time 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T21:39:21", "owner": "jcblue10", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18104955007657638, "text": "Wtf 🤣😭", "created_at": "2025-12-12T16:13:01", "owner": "razi_ansari_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18431586061104722, "text": "How come calling your man ‘Daddy’ ends up being a sexual thing😑", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:26:18", "owner": "nadia_tremblay_nt", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18174429763370269, "text": "Whats wrong? Snowflakes..", "created_at": "2025-11-18T22:04:00", "owner": "just_drake_the_dragon_one", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17958643851034962, "text": "My mom called my dad Daddy when we were kids because that's what we called him as children. Then society had to turn all nasty and gross with it.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T17:40:20", "owner": "tammyrowellrealtor", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17900805603184741, "text": "@ctzakirah diam la tak segan ke emuk 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-12T01:58:18", "owner": "wignes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046602320438001, "text": "My mother always called my dad \"Daddy\". Not a trend. It's pretty common.  But the kids reaction is funny.", "created_at": "2025-11-21T14:42:37", "owner": "irdrumr", "likes": 56}, {"id": 18046755347473777, "text": "This shouldnt be bedroom stuff !🤢", "created_at": "2025-12-08T23:25:54", "owner": "thawkx501", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18099317584756927, "text": "Kids :👁👄👁", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:01:49", "owner": "min_sofyhian1", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18030354359744531, "text": "Her face! 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:11:50", "owner": "onetruth16", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17930065671112463, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T13:22:08", "owner": "stevehydes111111", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18321255580170018, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T15:09:32", "owner": "melinda099090", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18186189058348917, "text": "Please spare us from the making process of us.😭", "created_at": "2025-12-10T16:14:00", "owner": "fayenting_for_you", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17890469289244021, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T17:30:17", "owner": "sophia576345", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18380230975147300, "text": "The last one is crazy", "created_at": "2025-11-16T16:23:27", "owner": "poppaclutch_texas", "likes": 17}, {"id": 18423701221114736, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:33:54", "owner": "_prithvi_raaj_", "likes": 91}, {"id": 18147136477436507, "text": "Hi I'm Korean my English is not perfect. What's that daddy mean?? Is it not the same with dad??", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:42:22", "owner": "doeuning_s2", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18289803424263551, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T19:35:10", "owner": "___.arhangel.___", "likes": 17}, {"id": 17925618936173339, "text": "Embarrassing but funny 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T10:30:45", "owner": "lovetix__", "likes": 328}, {"id": 18076698401203599, "text": "@gennysoriano27 😘😘😘", "created_at": "2025-12-10T07:42:51", "owner": "edwin_2908hernandez", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17933037831110981, "text": "I need mooooreeeeee", "created_at": "2025-12-10T14:42:15", "owner": "lunnaris_luiz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18202699126320344, "text": "It’s a southern thing also besides a sexy thang’ I have always called my husband daddy since we had our first son and he’s been calling me Mommy since we had him too so 20 years now going strong and my kids don’t think nothing of it . Also grew watching Berenstein Bears 🐻 that’s where l must have learned it", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:35:55", "owner": "xocpox", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17908498485267217, "text": "tolong,ngga paham saya ges😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T02:23:43", "owner": "ardiyansyah_an", "likes": 16}, {"id": 17987210663912140, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T09:31:41", "owner": "alliceseptiani", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17852102181581419, "text": "... This is a trend?! My wife does this constantly! In front of both our kids, out in public, in front of my Father-in-law!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-16T13:55:12", "owner": "cyro_fournier", "likes": 403}, {"id": 18136776109484007, "text": "kenapa sih emang kata kata \"daddy\" ? 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-09T06:38:07", "owner": "ccaptjo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082633130085651, "text": "English is my third language, what is wrong with daddy?😭 Can someone explain?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:00:22", "owner": "predatorx_13", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17981287430776232, "text": "hmm what's wrong? smth weird?🤨 i think that cute, kenapa orang rumah komplain tentang itu, bahkan anak kecil melihat itu aneh, apa dia melihat yg seharusnya gk dia lihat🤨 dia masih kecil", "created_at": "2025-12-04T09:42:03", "owner": "moi_lamoi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075276800209766, "text": "Thats not here stuff 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:49:20", "owner": "thebevampcouture", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18068945645382603, "text": "So what are all kids watching that informs them of how parents talk in the bedroom?", "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:00:59", "owner": "samus_the_service_dog", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18101363179703735, "text": "The only thing disturbing about this video is that last kids haircut😮😮", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:50:34", "owner": "cgervais56", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084998300284058, "text": "😂😂🤣😭🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-07T21:42:46", "owner": "trl_d_king", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061711325240607, "text": "I would be cheering on my dad 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:31:47", "owner": "cdwt_mrthompson", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064114553621518, "text": "SuRe BaByGuUrl 🔥🗣😆", "created_at": "2025-11-16T16:35:48", "owner": "sasamitdemesel", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17864473590527170, "text": "That’s a daddy syndrome 😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:09:32", "owner": "vj_prmr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17904827265280315, "text": "One of my kids didn’t speak until they were 5 years old. Part of the speech therapy was call each other by what we wanted to be called. So 10 years later we still call each other mommy and daddy and grandma and grandpa. 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:06:49", "owner": "tybecker78", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18046828382676893, "text": "In india it's too tooo common......women tell there kids go ask daddy somthing even they save there num with 89766....daddy😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T10:30:11", "owner": "9536_zouja_e_sheikh", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18041408258495488, "text": "🤨 I'm calling my hubby Daddy always in front of my kids.. It's normal.. Maybe not for u guys😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:56:28", "owner": "hirumahajime", "likes": 19}, {"id": 17885303592407223, "text": "Why was it so traumatizing tho 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-06T02:34:15", "owner": "mariacecher.uy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17876159556444602, "text": "I feel like these kids are just S*** spoil. Daddy just something normal for a man who has kids,", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:52:59", "owner": "celiajemimah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051527213352673, "text": "Do these kids think that mommy wasn’t calling him daddy before she was born? He was her daddy first.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:02:11", "owner": "blue_dragon_1991", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17983733153768953, "text": "'That's bedroom stuff'😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T12:33:06", "owner": "maykedeinum", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18051138533690598, "text": "Teenage girls are always overreacting 🥀", "created_at": "2025-12-04T10:45:25", "owner": "_skh890_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18110565019719150, "text": "Thats bedroom stuft... all dead Reaktionen when teenage daughter say that... And how you know that?", "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:17:48", "owner": "ripper_d_the_reaper", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17888605542258688, "text": "My parents have been calling eachother mommy and daddy for the last 3 years😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:35:27", "owner": "secretly_.2o", "likes": 36}, {"id": 18109152832529818, "text": "what is wrong here? i don’t get it 🤷🏻‍♂️ maybe it’s something hidden? where i from its normal call Wife or husband mommy or daddy in front of kids. even when they grown.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:06:40", "owner": "guy_from_past", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17883940476409097, "text": "Bombastic sideeye 🤣🤣the little girl facial expression", "created_at": "2025-11-30T09:10:48", "owner": "riddhi__00000", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18066717971381782, "text": "So how do they know the difference", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:33:30", "owner": "britius3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104301364712275, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T02:49:01", "owner": "kiikiiiiiii____", "likes": 21}, {"id": 18085878922827719, "text": "YouTube Shorts AHHH moment !! 💯💯💯🤣🤣🤣🎉🎉🎉", "created_at": "2025-12-03T15:01:53", "owner": "sasindu_goyum", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17969985995980039, "text": "Langsung merinding anak² nya 🤣😂🤣😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:04:54", "owner": "lasss.tri", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18035264894518816, "text": "The 2 looks like she's 13 and 55 at the same time", "created_at": "2025-11-24T09:58:35", "owner": "alxw47", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076631896985452, "text": "Excuse my ignorant but what this mean. I went through alots of the comments but I didn't get yet. So what is it, Please", "created_at": "2025-11-30T22:02:11", "owner": "zeyadnabeel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962316663977569, "text": "Daddy or diddy", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:46:23", "owner": "deniz_08333", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18120784852541417, "text": "Bakışlar çok iyi", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:42:56", "owner": "zeynebruyasukarakus", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100066852743508, "text": "another normal word that it is inapropiate in public  in US…haha\nThe list is quite long by now,and updated every few hours.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:02:16", "owner": "juanantmad", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17931702632999868, "text": "I think this is more of a US thing", "created_at": "2025-11-15T23:20:23", "owner": "lp.8866", "likes": 146}, {"id": 18194267683331197, "text": "And what's wrong with calling her husband a daddy? His real daddy, because he has children", "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:12:05", "owner": "sev_wolve", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905710645289209, "text": "In Africa is a normal thing", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:59:18", "owner": "chiazor1900", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18331359877209830, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T23:14:45", "owner": "moongoddness18", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18548784001065099, "text": "😂😂😂🤣🤣Naaah 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-13T22:31:08", "owner": "yussseiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991625142902528, "text": "The 4th one was all them kids realizing why they are four kids 🤣 busy parents", "created_at": "2025-12-13T21:58:47", "owner": "lumenardens", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088639607004427, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T21:48:42", "owner": "kaimak.daniels", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928343599159985, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-13T19:49:16", "owner": "shakiramitchell55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097848658832234, "text": "But my mom calls my dad ... Daddy.. like that's literally a normal thing and he calls her mommy", "created_at": "2025-12-13T19:16:08", "owner": "ezgx01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846940618602575, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-13T19:12:01", "owner": "jax__teller0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093880564915321, "text": "\"Moooom!!\" *proceeds to stuff face*", "created_at": "2025-12-13T17:31:03", "owner": "yuesh_85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18307947634268801, "text": "Why...", "created_at": "2025-12-13T17:23:00", "owner": "xjason_ghostx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096205846873364, "text": "Have it end with the dad saying “that’s a good girl” and watch these kids crash out 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-13T17:09:40", "owner": "nickygirl_thatgirl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995703084715238, "text": "😂😂😂 you could bare the betrayal in her eyes", "created_at": "2025-12-13T16:46:16", "owner": "thespartanking777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046597664695986, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-13T16:10:17", "owner": "binettienza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869398177416563, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-13T14:25:29", "owner": "chriss__vibron", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036191471735623, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-13T14:09:56", "owner": "chrissywatts1983", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866626237521484, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-13T11:53:26", "owner": "_saad_zid_01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18332330680241495, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T10:04:26", "owner": "bilal.mansoori.5249", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066486020612460, "text": "Like, it doesn't bug me here causes its all jokes, but it's super gross when people do that irl, so I'm on the kids side, lol.", "created_at": "2025-12-13T09:48:52", "owner": "cruentusluna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161873833360376, "text": "Outta tha bish", "created_at": "2025-12-13T09:25:18", "owner": "frechopa4yhu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097178605851098, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-13T09:16:42", "owner": "rosita_roses97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888696340395758, "text": "🤭", "created_at": "2025-12-13T08:25:13", "owner": "l.o.y.3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018132068797634, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-13T07:38:16", "owner": "zeekymaine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107563660650108, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T07:09:02", "owner": "volkovsergey85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074204003584206, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T06:07:21", "owner": "atharva_narkhede07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094199782899916, "text": "That's \"gross\" not bedroom stuff", "created_at": "2025-12-13T05:52:32", "owner": "deathstar.24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010212557815490, "text": "Alabamacore I guess is funny?", "created_at": "2025-12-13T04:33:10", "owner": "cillianmusic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111334264528504, "text": "Salt and pepper daddy was crazy😂", "created_at": "2025-12-13T03:55:14", "owner": "xtopher_nj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131330905500402, "text": "Proof parents shouldn't give their kids unfettered access to the internet from the time they can read.", "created_at": "2025-12-13T03:33:52", "owner": "routineritual", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105654868640608, "text": "But... they're all technically daddies... they are his kids🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-13T03:12:42", "owner": "atkins.907", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087772705987392, "text": "Jaja ya see si veo a un gringo guapo diré: Daddyaa lo que fuera por unas papitas fritas.😈", "created_at": "2025-12-13T01:40:03", "owner": "tupakly7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18174853057375143, "text": "The reactions are priceless", "created_at": "2025-12-13T01:39:33", "owner": "disarror_daccdd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888550150396457, "text": "I never understood the appeal of having many kids until now. The more kids, the more discomfort and embarrassment you can create.", "created_at": "2025-12-13T01:26:51", "owner": "kvmommy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916616539239505, "text": "Is it weird to anyone that these kids so young know what that even is insinuating??", "created_at": "2025-12-13T00:23:04", "owner": "msealey1108", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935650531110003, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T21:33:14", "owner": "mr_castle_castle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863520739540293, "text": "Call (816) 801-0462 if you want to hear random train noises", "created_at": "2025-12-12T19:49:36", "owner": "brand_yop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862163569549583, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-12T19:49:17", "owner": "ahmed_chaalali", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066528509411167, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T19:42:15", "owner": "iam_drayee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051864221383758, "text": "Sometimes we forget that our parents were once sweethearts.", "created_at": "2025-12-12T18:59:49", "owner": "snakecharmerp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296345890282936, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T18:09:25", "owner": "taydawgbabby0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858092077512084, "text": "😂😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-12T17:46:25", "owner": "crosslatonya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352510243163991, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-12T16:58:53", "owner": "mvungi302", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901551307338714, "text": "Okay bt how these kid's know that 👀?", "created_at": "2025-12-12T16:30:57", "owner": "__shalinisinghrajput__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067014632625548, "text": "No tienen problemas serios los yankees? Jajajaja", "created_at": "2025-12-12T16:08:09", "owner": "paortiz49", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952666318049540, "text": "Brilliant!!!! These young thundercats need a wake up !", "created_at": "2025-12-12T14:50:11", "owner": "amaroquai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146905639446095, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T13:38:18", "owner": "svr_rjb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095789557881957, "text": "3😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T13:21:42", "owner": "jaiye_emma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18318375049222978, "text": "Last clip, the guy wi bowl cut is crazy tho😢", "created_at": "2025-12-12T13:12:08", "owner": "kevcar_08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088686875489847, "text": "Daddy 😂😂😂😭", "created_at": "2025-12-12T12:47:00", "owner": "but_ego_prince", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030830570561902, "text": "why dady?", "created_at": "2025-12-12T12:22:32", "owner": "elsaaa4zhr_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867783250506696, "text": "The girl pokerface from the last one", "created_at": "2025-12-12T11:26:18", "owner": "dattihamisu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088660150790091, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T11:03:20", "owner": "m_f_fitnes_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923997718051393, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T10:51:25", "owner": "iam_olatunjee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852154789599017, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T10:49:33", "owner": "anyalorariwa2013", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18180396670362208, "text": "Honestly, I don't understand what the meaning is or why the situation seems funny. Can someone explain it to me?", "created_at": "2025-12-12T10:21:01", "owner": "mnyr401", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059354438290976, "text": "What does it mean by daddy 🤔", "created_at": "2025-12-12T10:16:21", "owner": "mr.hazzi006", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003060947832639, "text": "HabHahahah the betrayal on the faces !!!!", "created_at": "2025-12-12T09:24:24", "owner": "otteringaboutaround", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065867168166442, "text": "Last one, how many kids do they have, damn 😐", "created_at": "2025-12-12T07:59:16", "owner": "b.r.y.c.e_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107544301724105, "text": "😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-12T06:36:54", "owner": "mjbaradi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970656090967287, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-12T06:06:14", "owner": "anonymous_010._0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980754117948525, "text": "How she knows that is bedroom staff? Just wondering! 🤔🤔🤔", "created_at": "2025-12-12T04:19:53", "owner": "714santa_anero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894682033369406, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T03:16:48", "owner": "ninjaweld", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003745361837230, "text": "Yoooo, Friar Tuck was trippin at the end", "created_at": "2025-12-12T02:23:03", "owner": "jamespivit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060312359269486, "text": "Chamar o marido de pai soa sexual pra eles?", "created_at": "2025-12-12T01:28:09", "owner": "charlesk_09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889608652264499, "text": "Why is this weird?", "created_at": "2025-12-12T00:29:24", "owner": "johnvotawbjj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18429746590107668, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-12T00:11:35", "owner": "delahunty_paul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068622074119534, "text": "The lil girl at the end is gonna kill 🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-11T23:28:02", "owner": "its_margaman_bitch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107853745575051, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T23:19:32", "owner": "willian.jr_1117", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052886315366589, "text": "Gross, would never be me calling any man daddy.", "created_at": "2025-12-11T23:02:29", "owner": "bossclt28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969747351978732, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-11T22:59:30", "owner": "calitosll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873414457464813, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T22:55:43", "owner": "lisaseymourmiceli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875293333371076, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T22:54:52", "owner": "rafatkhanantia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102882175741346, "text": "@cordelia_reid", "created_at": "2025-12-11T21:58:51", "owner": "matt83reid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106297579730669, "text": "My mom calls him dad or daddy if we all are talking to him so we are all calling him the same name, otherwise she uses his name, so I would not be surprised if she called him daddy 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T21:20:04", "owner": "tgurnettt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18173059903332072, "text": "What no like tell daddy?", "created_at": "2025-12-11T21:17:57", "owner": "yepezda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050751416392463, "text": "كلشي ما فهمت  بس خلي اضحك😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T19:37:36", "owner": "uo0ij", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546667618013613, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T19:21:41", "owner": "cynurbinaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916707529231261, "text": "The real question is why do so many really young kids understand the reference", "created_at": "2025-12-11T19:03:27", "owner": "acraige88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115562890574353, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T18:54:09", "owner": "seamas.cm_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062160089637589, "text": "They all gotta realize that's exactly how they got here 😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-11T18:52:58", "owner": "hwallace285", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080215420900898, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-11T17:48:53", "owner": "maitra._.11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137261455469341, "text": "\"Bedroom staff\" 😭🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-11T16:53:13", "owner": "abeid977", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903935527165665, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-11T16:37:18", "owner": "melody__hlondo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029061092766819, "text": "The little one is fed up... Appetite gone😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T16:25:53", "owner": "swag_sauce87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122951179468297, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T16:19:39", "owner": "yurkosir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060003524263785, "text": "Gringos..... That's so normal between the Mexican people", "created_at": "2025-12-11T15:25:19", "owner": "jossgonzalez85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115276780583610, "text": "I can just imagine the daughters calling the boyfriend ‘daddy’ in front of their parents .the payback will be brutal.", "created_at": "2025-12-11T15:24:29", "owner": "nicolasscotti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980394765928795, "text": "3 was ready to jump out of the car 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T15:02:54", "owner": "wild.chrysanthemum97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843442156637550, "text": "Tha last vid; that kids haircut is a hatecrime", "created_at": "2025-12-11T14:55:20", "owner": "jcaudi06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086600536840580, "text": "The one that said \"Ew that's bedroom stuff\". How does she know? That's concerning.", "created_at": "2025-12-11T14:25:27", "owner": "djmellotv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993318183885642, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T13:45:21", "owner": "ilan_x74", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977384772956812, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T13:31:09", "owner": "mixitart78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920457466211279, "text": "What haircut was that on the last one😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-11T13:17:49", "owner": "cr1msoon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053485397369356, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T11:42:31", "owner": "windexoninsta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097703545803172, "text": "Literally kids spend too much time on Internet has been proved duhhh bad parenting . The last second clip was atleast better", "created_at": "2025-12-11T10:52:36", "owner": "nothnwithouturluv613juno00echo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970770276826415, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T10:46:49", "owner": "tzelat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050176904412296, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T10:25:24", "owner": "jasmeetsingh__84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078183109975155, "text": "Omo in Africa our mothers call our fathers daddy even pastor self", "created_at": "2025-12-11T08:53:35", "owner": "renedy_m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106136695728641, "text": "Don't look at your parents like that!  They were young once too and its how you got here. Show respect!", "created_at": "2025-12-11T08:31:42", "owner": "crawl38237z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18430581967129838, "text": "В чём прикол?", "created_at": "2025-12-11T08:03:55", "owner": "aniev_sidek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100455331773119, "text": "All I can notice was, the second family has four kids!!! How lucky they are", "created_at": "2025-12-11T07:53:27", "owner": "dr_das_k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066719834414774, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T07:11:22", "owner": "dj_girish_04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088114654968748, "text": "white boy at the end got the edgar cut 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-11T06:49:07", "owner": "d.hoodie18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096541555851330, "text": "The kids get traumatized 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T06:29:28", "owner": "doding_dan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063817595192402, "text": "Every one is ok but that little girl at the end, Oh she is judging them for sure 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-11T06:13:07", "owner": "le_m4x_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18300135184256888, "text": "Majority have big fams…. How yall think you got here 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:18:36", "owner": "yungdurado", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070221203609255, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T04:42:38", "owner": "khristian_m3rcado", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867961192506828, "text": "For non-speakers (English) - explain please", "created_at": "2025-12-11T04:41:05", "owner": "almaz_q", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093129634931697, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T04:38:47", "owner": "mrsnotmiss2you", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073754306356123, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T04:07:50", "owner": "rony49_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025689362782972, "text": "That's bedroom stuff🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-11T02:27:51", "owner": "iamit_kumar2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881162677428239, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T02:20:21", "owner": "huff.10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112095865608325, "text": "😂😂😂 👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-11T02:15:24", "owner": "jillcarrwehner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970228164989212, "text": "My exes parents called each other mom and dad. Do with that what you will 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-11T00:38:34", "owner": "traegriffin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867463324506470, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T00:29:29", "owner": "da1an9ek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931028197151609, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-11T00:15:13", "owner": "adish_ree10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091516838512878, "text": "bedroom stuff 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T00:08:46", "owner": "ken_an_97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846461866607285, "text": "The horror", "created_at": "2025-12-10T23:56:51", "owner": "matt.best.nz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077851235186727, "text": "That’s normal on Dominican family.", "created_at": "2025-12-10T23:50:38", "owner": "officialjvargas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099642949815559, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T23:43:55", "owner": "audre_y82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107271958635744, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T23:02:29", "owner": "douchez08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047638442463562, "text": "What is this? Really? I call my husband daddy in front of our kids, my mother in law and everyone 😂 didn’t know its sound dirty. I even once scream daddy from the other side of supermarket 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T22:42:54", "owner": "nefitriratu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056555453322200, "text": "My only issue is why children seem to understand that there’s a sexual undertone to the word. 😢\n\nPS: most parents call each other Mommy and Daddy when the kids start coming in, why is it being sexualised? \n\nOr am I broken? 😅", "created_at": "2025-12-10T22:30:17", "owner": "leonzora.naturals", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868052902427501, "text": "All of these children have second hand embarrassment and I love it", "created_at": "2025-12-10T21:40:33", "owner": "gab.moore", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094412554923593, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T21:39:46", "owner": "semperfi200408", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084876323031458, "text": "Kids are growing up to fast. When I was a kid (yeah its one of those posts), if my mom would've called my father \"daddy\" I would've laughed because he wasnt grandpa.", "created_at": "2025-12-10T21:14:22", "owner": "riggs_hb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030982166560103, "text": "Serious question why do little kids  know what “daddy” means??", "created_at": "2025-12-10T21:10:29", "owner": "jahel_dgm_photography", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065816261154685, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T21:05:12", "owner": "hemin_serwan09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873708529462568, "text": "I'm the only one who find calling their partner Daddy/Mommy (in bed or not) is weird asf why sexualizing those words?", "created_at": "2025-12-10T21:03:12", "owner": "sans_pseudo46788", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17993509718897787, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:51:56", "owner": "vixiyer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026345282588092, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:51:45", "owner": "its._.anii._.143", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18204786628318464, "text": "I loved how all the families looked happy , very nice 😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:45:52", "owner": "amid_kizmaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058287794304449, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:26:24", "owner": "engr_zakky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296483776273199, "text": "Bed room stuff😭😭😭🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:25:55", "owner": "orangeworld77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105944203643328, "text": "He waa het daddy before yall ...relax", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:20:10", "owner": "saibabangida", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039994682709252, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😭🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:16:12", "owner": "f.emrecicek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104160799664840, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T19:30:56", "owner": "iamclara_theo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109253704625489, "text": "lol 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T19:30:38", "owner": "singhateh012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18249762820290812, "text": "Love it", "created_at": "2025-12-10T19:20:40", "owner": "proudwhiteperson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070445888579423, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T18:07:18", "owner": "uce._.dav3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110844472611159, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T17:49:46", "owner": "__baylaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869755333478063, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T17:19:59", "owner": "installuminati", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891908206379576, "text": "I have seen that 3rd clip so many times 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-10T17:08:21", "owner": "triforce223", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066753350426264, "text": "I love when our kids forget that their parents do that stuff too 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T16:21:15", "owner": "redgamma2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18388453735178040, "text": "Be thankful the parents still love eachother! 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T15:38:25", "owner": "rivbalt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083848355114811, "text": "😭🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-10T15:35:24", "owner": "moizawan811", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974106459798717, "text": "Kids know all about them 😁 and also me huh", "created_at": "2025-12-10T15:29:39", "owner": "quai.1234", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001239626838996, "text": "5 should have been 1", "created_at": "2025-12-10T15:10:30", "owner": "hallsie1954", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106707121631677, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-10T14:42:20", "owner": "lunnaris_luiz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028120259577436, "text": "So many mixed emotions 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T14:21:58", "owner": "jermaine.holness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544280668028945, "text": "Bedroom stuff is #1 and always will be", "created_at": "2025-12-10T12:36:28", "owner": "billieeilishrox13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108048412712724, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T12:18:46", "owner": "tamashreebag", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544764454056111, "text": "Can anyone tell why the kids are traumatized when their mom calls their husband daddy? I really wanna know", "created_at": "2025-12-10T12:05:05", "owner": "gold._.squirrel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115689694584270, "text": "I know damn well youngin in the last video ain’t laughing looking like one of the stooges😭😭😭 boy see it’s V for vector 💀💀💀", "created_at": "2025-12-10T11:43:16", "owner": "legate_legend", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18438096757109830, "text": "Number 3 best 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T11:26:20", "owner": "kuaforbedirhanofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075774878586561, "text": "@caslin85", "created_at": "2025-12-10T09:38:52", "owner": "colin_george_theonly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18149627455426565, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T08:50:49", "owner": "chou.no001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011023787649071, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-10T08:50:34", "owner": "survivor.vlada", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900035221342705, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T08:47:40", "owner": "igg_g19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115742074605704, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T08:23:14", "owner": "saran_envirevo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18163540867380326, "text": "Can explain?", "created_at": "2025-12-10T08:04:09", "owner": "_hlyya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910752796124007, "text": "Me and my wife call each other mommy and daddy all the time! You lot are perverts 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T07:29:59", "owner": "richard___walker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974789562958741, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T07:09:35", "owner": "martin.gra1997", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970391673976424, "text": "I didn’t get it. What’s wrong here?", "created_at": "2025-12-10T06:43:54", "owner": "monu.4.phour", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18300320809283669, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T06:38:14", "owner": "abhinav.un", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18318860695218586, "text": "me acting like idk shi so they don't pick up what I know", "created_at": "2025-12-10T06:19:56", "owner": "your_favouritedemon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973259142816258, "text": "Hahaha I did this to my kids, their reaction was HILARIOUS😂😂😂. EMOTIONAL SCARRO MOM!!!! \"hot chick\" reference lol", "created_at": "2025-12-10T06:04:24", "owner": "1__noelia__1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953282041046505, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-10T04:56:23", "owner": "nisvara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18226673506307524, "text": "These are some nice daddy’s !!😳😍🤭", "created_at": "2025-12-10T04:23:18", "owner": "dimmler60", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847226101616255, "text": "Now the husbands do it with mommy term lets see whats gonna happens", "created_at": "2025-12-10T04:09:28", "owner": "eazyome16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034768115737718, "text": "What's meaning?", "created_at": "2025-12-10T03:20:21", "owner": "mohamadsahari13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980408256815522, "text": "That last kid can't be laughing with that bowl cut 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-10T03:19:05", "owner": "melody.nivani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18356316406204511, "text": "The number of kids D's in each of these families, they've heard it all through the wall already I'm sure.  But the shock value is priceless", "created_at": "2025-12-10T02:40:08", "owner": "jordan.a.romain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062629094542493, "text": "Lol 😂 but in Asian cultures, after marriage, you have kids... the wife will call her husband 'daddy' instead of 'a hobby.' Lol no more sexyness lol", "created_at": "2025-12-10T02:26:23", "owner": "dd77fl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18549076273037817, "text": "Some of these kids ready to throw hands 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T02:10:40", "owner": "aorta_1993", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071955539369818, "text": "I thought there was a state in America where full grown men talk about their father with \"my daddy used to say \"", "created_at": "2025-12-10T01:47:17", "owner": "rj.work.kokk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049268024424286, "text": "Is this how I get my daughter to never ever fucking say this shit to another man", "created_at": "2025-12-10T01:28:40", "owner": "achadtoremember", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18299705311261969, "text": "THAT'S BEDROOM STUFF😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T01:11:53", "owner": "vinaa.mz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105162784643642, "text": "LOL😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-10T01:10:25", "owner": "vinaa.mz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027438032581533, "text": "Kids are dying of embarrassment 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-10T00:48:05", "owner": "coralista_zee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126966859505289, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-12-10T00:32:55", "owner": "idk_mia.6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067508696577216, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-10T00:29:07", "owner": "p.soul_litude", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075064580522564, "text": "Every son realized. They can no longer call him dad. He is Father now 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T00:21:56", "owner": "peterlaguerre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056775179321727, "text": "What is wrongwif you (wife) call \"daddy\" Well... In my country specialis at sorong papua... Me( AS wife) respect him because his the leader of the relation until dead... Well its my ootion👏🌹", "created_at": "2025-12-10T00:07:44", "owner": "ethaanggonuboba86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090552196759547, "text": "Calling your husband daddy in front of their actual daddy 😂😂😂😂 diabolical 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-10T00:04:38", "owner": "tejasvi_challa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926587132161241, "text": "« That’s bedroom stuff.. »", "created_at": "2025-12-09T23:52:46", "owner": "kimy_ihateyou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955589778898175, "text": "That’s how you stop that 6-7 nonsense.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T23:39:13", "owner": "andy_l63", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850848445602346, "text": "🤣🤣🤣😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T22:54:25", "owner": "truesunshinelove", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18389971288198395, "text": "WHY DO ALL THE KIDS KNOW 💀", "created_at": "2025-12-09T22:44:29", "owner": "natasha_april22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105355519731477, "text": "past 40 yrs I've heard wives use \"Daddy\" as the one & only way to refer to him in front of their kids", "created_at": "2025-12-09T22:19:24", "owner": "mattabanana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141789406455372, "text": "I WOULD LOVE TO CALL MY HUBBY “DADDY” (selama suamiku ga menunjukkan muka cringe dan go with it)", "created_at": "2025-12-09T22:15:32", "owner": "onlyshyadow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901236496182135, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T21:53:15", "owner": "kmdillard13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085290143095392, "text": "This is the bullshit western culture 💩", "created_at": "2025-12-09T20:59:32", "owner": "nitin.kumarr17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18538451530014461, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T20:59:22", "owner": "diyawahab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030941102750526, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T20:40:37", "owner": "schnmnty1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293199706277636, "text": "The whole “daddy” and “papi” only work in the US/UK and Latin countries - so it never picked up in Northern Europe for instance 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T20:29:40", "owner": "typicals.co", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026042735588414, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T20:20:12", "owner": "disrespected__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093431116906247, "text": "wtf", "created_at": "2025-12-09T19:03:44", "owner": "judy.158017", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096671635875825, "text": "Are we gonna speed past the number one spot with the kid that has the Will Byers  haircut?", "created_at": "2025-12-09T18:16:31", "owner": "__body__by__dtc__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888715228400662, "text": "My mom always call my dad dad.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T18:00:24", "owner": "what_of_me", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547564786058710, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T17:58:49", "owner": "dak_shu_007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992117388728841, "text": "this indicates a family with healthy relationship", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:32:14", "owner": "sumontra_chakma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182869162356922, "text": "Why that small girl knew", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:24:15", "owner": "fate_breaker_fang_yuan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966600039995676, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:49:33", "owner": "itz.unique_ash", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993333789896601, "text": "Aren't they \" daddy\" for her children? My mom always says grandma to her mom, although she is my grandma...", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:46:04", "owner": "josephine.lav28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105981247638328, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:30:10", "owner": "pheni_x75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115895230566339, "text": "Something I would do with my kids haha", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:27:46", "owner": "rikasilva_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895291387223832, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:52:37", "owner": "aangelinee__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18499378234074527, "text": "What the children have. It's just a word and why does everyone know that already in this ambiguity? I also say Daddy, constantly. For our normal. And when she asks why, she is told. America is so prudish.😅", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:35:02", "owner": "waving_jane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007511123662946, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:03:00", "owner": "0v.fk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18411994105137535, "text": "@____just.kili 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:59:56", "owner": "__v.xhakh_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086380889287108, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:50:16", "owner": "altanyazici01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099185857694853, "text": "Ok why that reaction? I don’t get it 😀", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:49:06", "owner": "doctor.muniza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065880947410198, "text": "It’s so beautiful to have Kids 😍", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:07:31", "owner": "prom_an", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086010515005627, "text": "The first one 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:06:37", "owner": "dedman_matthew6969", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18422329555114506, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:06:23", "owner": "dedman_matthew6969", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025935368777247, "text": "I’m Asian and my mom always calls my dad daddy or dad because that’s how we refer dad to. Like yk when we ask her “mom can i get some money” n she goes “bruh go ask daddy first”😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:42:40", "owner": "_xia.tian_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080847035142807, "text": "My wife and me always call ourselves Mom and Dad. Otherwise we wouldn't listen", "created_at": "2025-12-09T10:43:50", "owner": "wolfvertical", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105397432646798, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T08:48:51", "owner": "oep_ilgaring", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102381238688561, "text": "Meanwhile common in Indonesia \"mamah berangkat ya pah\"", "created_at": "2025-12-09T06:54:35", "owner": "zieyouagain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543584026031490, "text": "Good sign they are happily married 😊", "created_at": "2025-12-09T06:16:41", "owner": "themanbehindlens", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089656256486003, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-09T06:12:04", "owner": "didiomacias", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932860165120849, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-09T05:37:09", "owner": "jayemmbee23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028766054768248, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T05:34:36", "owner": "dragokingsta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986761683908610, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-09T05:06:59", "owner": "isaswetts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933438871076962, "text": "\"bedroom stuff", "created_at": "2025-12-09T04:46:05", "owner": "lynalpha67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940517185093928, "text": "That's trauma. That's violence 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T04:04:57", "owner": "jonathanmelara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074210510356108, "text": "this is my aspiration.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T03:56:08", "owner": "jibontaibritha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085853615512334, "text": "Number 5 was my reaction when my mom also called my dad \"Daddy\"", "created_at": "2025-12-09T03:51:59", "owner": "sasha_and_ivycreator", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099301615840196, "text": "Maybe it's cuz i'm mexican but i don't get whats wrong with that... 🤔", "created_at": "2025-12-09T03:51:04", "owner": "ponchoram_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862318582468411, "text": "Not here stuff 😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-09T03:42:03", "owner": "jayy_mamba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057989543316279, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T03:26:27", "owner": "tan.judy.522", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970437699977941, "text": "What was bros cut at the end 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T03:11:53", "owner": "_shady_bones_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102523540666792, "text": "How are these kids being raised? Have they ever seen their parents kiss or be lovely to one another? 🙃", "created_at": "2025-12-09T02:11:55", "owner": "alejandr0_santana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104399686733490, "text": "I call my husband daddy hubby baby 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T02:10:53", "owner": "frau.husin.ica", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065977697421397, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T02:09:10", "owner": "__mmayen__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064172117554519, "text": "What's wrong with all these kids?", "created_at": "2025-12-09T01:56:06", "owner": "anselmonchaidez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18415108741185350, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T01:28:47", "owner": "gs_raw_gstar_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059750687282186, "text": "#2 been smoking", "created_at": "2025-12-09T01:24:31", "owner": "tyler.ryuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955545607041566, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T01:17:37", "owner": "ldest89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056926439633961, "text": "How many kids do these people have.  Wtf just stop", "created_at": "2025-12-09T01:14:13", "owner": "williamattmore", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083285030118709, "text": "Não intende por que essa surpresa quando a esposa chama o marido de pai", "created_at": "2025-12-09T01:06:32", "owner": "stryfeemdonascimento", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18326823322246698, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T00:53:48", "owner": "xuan_tiep.nguyen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18386297521177153, "text": "Diabolical 😂🤣🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-09T00:53:27", "owner": "briceno8358", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987652905866824, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T23:42:36", "owner": "biofire25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087304687983295, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T23:38:24", "owner": "dfw___nini", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856908034570084, "text": "The last guy with the bowl cut. 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-08T23:01:38", "owner": "ukita_cosplay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18234586174306709, "text": "Husbands loving it, and the kids are grossed out 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T22:30:55", "owner": "raquelcanbecrafty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926489626036927, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T22:29:53", "owner": "opoku_sekyi_dennis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092761534736404, "text": "Nothing about how hot are ALL of them no 3?", "created_at": "2025-12-08T22:26:16", "owner": "bogdanton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18500804101076001, "text": "We have 5 kids. They are all like this.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T22:25:24", "owner": "mcshannigans", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082997065890219, "text": "Lmfao 😂the look of disgust 😬 is undeniable 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T21:20:16", "owner": "sandoval.4994", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927369817157628, "text": "4th wasss goooddd", "created_at": "2025-12-08T20:46:50", "owner": "itz.siddhi_492", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013715477802613, "text": "My wife has called me daddy and I have called her mommy since she was pregnant with our oldest 45 years ago. All five of our children have heard that since the day they were born. There is nothing sexual about it and our kids have never thought it to be sexual. They are terms of endearment.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T20:18:21", "owner": "samthelamanite", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971475810977204, "text": "Even the little girl got it? 😮 She looks young enough that that's his name still!", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:44:50", "owner": "ignisv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152391595423437, "text": "I cannot wait to do this when my kids are older 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:44:01", "owner": "brookie_nekol19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993450795857536, "text": "incest and pedo culture all in one.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:28:04", "owner": "johnny.rotten.tale", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932502631141096, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T18:51:16", "owner": "3amparanormal13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084620626864844, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T18:28:43", "owner": "arkanjo70", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541397797041814, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-08T17:48:26", "owner": "vignesh.leo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994515669893646, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤌🏼🙉", "created_at": "2025-12-08T17:37:55", "owner": "nina_mirosfrau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873453331463289, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:39:38", "owner": "foodie_animegirl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084502153864848, "text": "Embarrassing your kids with your PDA is the greatest joy that will come to you", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:03:38", "owner": "mrs.hazle_eyed_nutt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921848047191577, "text": "Raising fucking so l u ts! As you are one", "created_at": "2025-12-08T15:53:18", "owner": "systematic_psy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072788141587347, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T15:00:47", "owner": "jandaarioush", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088823725981997, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T14:27:29", "owner": "dr.saeedfaal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109278742617808, "text": "Di Indon gk bisa lagi😭 hrus nyari laki bule ini", "created_at": "2025-12-08T14:18:12", "owner": "sareinsgrayon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923782675051366, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T13:41:26", "owner": "vinushan_2351", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114759298583217, "text": "Criminal of sedeye..", "created_at": "2025-12-08T12:41:24", "owner": "isra.balooch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103410181668869, "text": "Seeing the youngest at the table being offended shows that the kids are TOO exposed to sexual stuff at too early an age. Dad is dad and moms call the dads daddy or dad, cause that’s what the children call the dad, daddy. Dad will call mom, mama or mummy. It isn’t to be sexual. But ya see, normalizing these things over social media has corrupted the kids a lil too early", "created_at": "2025-12-08T12:37:50", "owner": "father_of_a_superhero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941190330965978, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T12:03:33", "owner": "davidcarey805", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087029704822906, "text": "Is that funny", "created_at": "2025-12-08T11:40:16", "owner": "loskor2004", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074135186522140, "text": "😂🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-08T11:22:30", "owner": "eva.luna93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070839842347182, "text": "That \"mooom\" was Personal😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T11:01:09", "owner": "autistenrappx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937702692984604, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T10:47:25", "owner": "smajumder075", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018256838621764, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T10:10:18", "owner": "intraaar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072310970365101, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-08T08:26:29", "owner": "arizona.ryokucha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100677841695973, "text": "He was her daddy first though 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T07:59:20", "owner": "jay_omera23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868115374489590, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T07:34:03", "owner": "vanessaalwaysalady_taylor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959213988881179, "text": "American retarded", "created_at": "2025-12-08T07:19:42", "owner": "mark_dio_pre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293945590287930, "text": "I can't wait to make my future kids hella uncomfortable and embarrassed 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T07:16:28", "owner": "alister5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908918176265813, "text": "I do not know why the kids are like eww or making faces, how did they think they got here🤷🏼‍♂️😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T06:09:01", "owner": "_a_s_h_018", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18214538401309149, "text": "Kids are getting more sensible these days 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T02:28:23", "owner": "nieraj_p", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068095388418319, "text": "Doing this in front of the kids is innapropriate", "created_at": "2025-12-08T02:12:29", "owner": "bloodhoundsinthedarkness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083637278118786, "text": "Pretty sure the girl in number 4 is my number one opp at school", "created_at": "2025-12-08T02:09:34", "owner": "thefrcutesyvamp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906542140145402, "text": "Boombastic sideeye 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-08T02:03:30", "owner": "pixelated_.punk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105057787640574, "text": "The two boys at the and and the lil girl too🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-08T01:58:24", "owner": "yousef_alfailakawiq8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083699317871831, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T01:29:11", "owner": "horacewillis3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915342028238633, "text": "Y como creen que llegaron todos ustedes, chiquillos? 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T01:05:36", "owner": "varos01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095433826874601, "text": "I call my husband Daddy all the time out in public 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-08T00:41:51", "owner": "maria_gaffett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073837427197971, "text": "On the last one, how does the little one know what that means lol?", "created_at": "2025-12-08T00:14:58", "owner": "sasukerobinson1287", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079681292518508, "text": "My grandparents used to call themselves mommy and daddy 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T00:04:46", "owner": "countryboyfrom1970", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397540564130906, "text": "😭😭😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T23:49:17", "owner": "dozyay_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023970719785975, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T23:15:09", "owner": "m7jasskd325", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883237213304764, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-07T23:12:42", "owner": "tonyelliott45", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991821519728513, "text": "The pepper and salt daughter looked at her mom like a jealous woman \"that'