": "😭", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:30:48", "owner": "akudikaaa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18413153056190008, "text": "Why beat your kids when you can traumatize them with words?", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:27:22", "owner": "china_doll2472", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074047406260309, "text": "These children need to worry about what their social life is gonna be like with the hair they have. Not what their parents are doing", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:05:24", "owner": "superguard1020", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051638321682819, "text": "O significa isso ????", "created_at": "2025-12-07T01:36:26", "owner": "gabhxzlj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914364010096799, "text": "I want to see the husband's in-laws reaction next!! 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T00:57:37", "owner": "fasterdrivers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028989014568578, "text": "I need more so funny", "created_at": "2025-12-07T00:34:13", "owner": "patrick.dale.758399", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935214427111100, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T00:25:06", "owner": "eric37j0ker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933575953115313, "text": "The fact that it’s all white people or American too", "created_at": "2025-12-07T00:09:59", "owner": "funmexican_123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18551252629024078, "text": "number 3 decided to mind her business 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-06T23:27:13", "owner": "nolan_frogman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18415416334137687, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:02:13", "owner": "russianwaankaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955104405902812, "text": "the slow turn🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:54:05", "owner": "ya_mi4251", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862879369539850, "text": "How'd they know?? 😭😂😂🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:49:19", "owner": "skabettydebs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853422316591736, "text": "I relate to the teens", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:28:19", "owner": "addyb2011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084475622116664, "text": "I think its weird how u have women out here calling there husbands and boyfriends daddy that's some real freaky shisnit 🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:17:59", "owner": "sarahbrady570", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073126826614683, "text": "Kids on US are too soft", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:10:10", "owner": "otiopew", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082914977141254, "text": "“That’s bedroom stuff” child the whole house was for bedroom stuff before you came along", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:29:58", "owner": "junglefighter13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024381938598178, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:29:50", "owner": "nathanaelehall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074622677014358, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:29:20", "owner": "sennie1987", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050428355403583, "text": "Well yeah I'm pretty sure the kids don't want to find out that Mom gets dominated in the bedroom", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:21:29", "owner": "marcusgraves069", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863787460458390, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:18:59", "owner": "llkoble63", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050394221399076, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣 now that’s too bloody funny 😆", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:10:07", "owner": "shel_36mk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067602032377295, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:10:24", "owner": "sahinonder89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051526550677914, "text": "Gen. Is cooked😢", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:09:36", "owner": "quizztime9_9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868609561485350, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:32:21", "owner": "unwantednews", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982819185927692, "text": "Знаете, это очень странная херня, звать своего мужика папочкой.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:16:12", "owner": "the_lerik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082188757887346, "text": "Why are even the youngest reacting? 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:01:50", "owner": "l.e.d_973", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088527227296807, "text": "India mein.. koi nikalega v nhi agr esi related kuch baat v react kr diya naa baccho ne .. dusri baar hasne ke liye to kya zinda hi nhi rhenge😢", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:42:50", "owner": "ishmiitaaa__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090730504758086, "text": "🤣😂🤣😂🤣😂🤣😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:40:05", "owner": "lilshaq34", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110585086538131, "text": "Being called daddy in any way by your spouse is a turn off and disgusting", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:18:00", "owner": "nuthinspecial333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086670607993533, "text": "🤣🤣😭😭🤣🤣😭😭🤣🤣😭😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:07:44", "owner": "h_i_l_e_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18328080193245750, "text": "Number 3 was ready to jump out that car", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:12:24", "owner": "0rganised_cha0s_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089416894787065, "text": "That girl in the car was about to jump out of a moving vehicle. And that look on the kids face in the last one had me dying.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T14:56:51", "owner": "biggrizz78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067044716567164, "text": "The stare of last baby girl 😂 she wasn't ready for it", "created_at": "2025-12-06T14:29:22", "owner": "emrkhann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106699846653894, "text": "It's really embarrassing, first of all call daddy for dirty stuff, second wide free  access to porn sites with no age limitations", "created_at": "2025-12-06T13:49:12", "owner": "shimaashirazii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091098031938059, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T13:40:38", "owner": "ruthdrummond1965", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115782220567410, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T13:38:57", "owner": "goodnewxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854106361589647, "text": "That means children’s all know 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:50:17", "owner": "mr.gorkhali_0028", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842015737651932, "text": "Ca veux dire quoi?", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:44:24", "owner": "jerome.ctm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18306046363302094, "text": "A lot of Nigerian married women call their husbands Daddy. Not in a sexual way. Its so funny watching this and seeing the cultural difference. Their husbands call them Mummy too. 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:03:15", "owner": "anneoreoluwa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042059186704195, "text": "KIDS HAVE ACCESS TO PORN", "created_at": "2025-12-06T11:15:48", "owner": "smoothmentalist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909351316267426, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T11:11:32", "owner": "miki_django", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088873283308076, "text": "What this kids use to watch wen they are alone. They know to much", "created_at": "2025-12-06T11:09:35", "owner": "ans_elmof", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074994161018707, "text": "These kid been calling their boyfriend daddy..", "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:48:32", "owner": "laurine_99620", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932512036133370, "text": "Whats wrong if she say daddy in front of kids ?", "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:47:28", "owner": "zack.usatx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058680842290098, "text": "AHAHAHAH😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:47:08", "owner": "909ze._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850603240599212, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:42:34", "owner": "krisztina_2012.11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103138423664058, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:21:39", "owner": "adamprayoga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954544978028959, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:15:25", "owner": "balkaran_sudan1108", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092694961928441, "text": "Like, in front of the kids? Who also call him daddy? These reactions are mental haha", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:04:23", "owner": "semtex_elvis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100414942815474, "text": "Sory I am from Indonesia, memang kenapa kalau istri dia memanggil (Dedy)", "created_at": "2025-12-06T08:42:49", "owner": "alumni_kbng12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931350964116269, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T08:27:44", "owner": "naziburzamanchoudhury", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18436294768096668, "text": "They've heard it", "created_at": "2025-12-06T08:08:19", "owner": "jasonhugo427", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18555471583021006, "text": "I dont always wish i was married with children but when i do, this is a why. 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T06:30:38", "owner": "tyrosean", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903329401319000, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T05:54:53", "owner": "r__a__n_a___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881784811424933, "text": "The boys at last be like: the Bluetooth device is connected all successfully", "created_at": "2025-12-06T05:47:51", "owner": "retubis.keish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18335394910232042, "text": "That little girl at the end hahahahaha", "created_at": "2025-12-06T05:30:16", "owner": "clubberlaing23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076043435245257, "text": "Younge kids have no idea whats it is about", "created_at": "2025-12-06T05:15:11", "owner": "justrandomphot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122330317468504, "text": "That bombastic side eye at the end😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T04:33:35", "owner": "kaylaverse23_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048847904677671, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-06T04:06:13", "owner": "willhowell69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891030040383676, "text": "What was eleven and will doing in the last video", "created_at": "2025-12-06T03:45:50", "owner": "vishnu_prasad_g_t_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009855626652878, "text": "2nd kid knows their secrets", "created_at": "2025-12-06T03:30:19", "owner": "vex89.2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904269079295467, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T03:17:37", "owner": "lil_whist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134658658486111, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T03:05:49", "owner": "nickhillbillyoutlaw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867468436426643, "text": "I have watched this for the 65347796319837th time and I'm still laughing 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T03:00:16", "owner": "leifblade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868911898491294, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T02:50:50", "owner": "averageguy2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100003678765209, "text": "La pasaban re mal jajakaba", "created_at": "2025-12-06T02:12:01", "owner": "flor_cab_06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031303025744140, "text": "Perfect family do exist gaes 😤", "created_at": "2025-12-06T01:46:25", "owner": "ehmd2396", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065554322440411, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-06T01:28:48", "owner": "officiallattrellgolden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109822189540007, "text": "Their kids know this stuff since 9??", "created_at": "2025-12-06T01:10:44", "owner": "alexken418019", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979427229786154, "text": "Do American parents not refer to each other as mummy and daddy to their kids? Not until you’re a broken ass adult should mummy and daddy be odd words.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T01:08:20", "owner": "sam_phillips_afc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053860499654448, "text": "What's wrong with that, I think it's normal", "created_at": "2025-12-06T00:31:51", "owner": "kennetth0405", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922919839053573, "text": "It's 'rank' because it implies incest. Why do Yanks not understand what they are saying? Epstein would be proud of you fing weirdos", "created_at": "2025-12-06T00:22:14", "owner": "owenbenton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893702356364094, "text": "Daughters reaction towards mother always funny 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T23:48:53", "owner": "tejas_1c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059595689558405, "text": "This is the correct way to parent", "created_at": "2025-12-05T23:38:03", "owner": "jordan_isabella98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868421353484271, "text": "We do it all the time.. is it because we are latin? Is not rare", "created_at": "2025-12-05T23:09:38", "owner": "claudia_es.c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101061319783181, "text": "My parents always referred to each other as “mama” and “daddy” because that’s what my sister and I called them. That’s what my wife and I do now. Nothing sexual about it; it’s basically just a title. This new sexual connotation is what’s weird.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:58:14", "owner": "t.rogers70", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854054272588996, "text": "My parents said it & now I can say it. Every generation thinks they invented sex & dirty talk.😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:43:39", "owner": "gregmonchak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110533300537388, "text": "First vid, dads smiling cus he lowkey likes it but not the time with a child in the room present 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:28:49", "owner": "jbuchanan97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071197286523080, "text": "That last little girl made me laugh so hard. I watched her reaction at least 10 times. 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:20:29", "owner": "shayyy007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089336588508876, "text": "I see no issues here 🤣😎", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:10:50", "owner": "highvalueoutlaw_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920821825206466, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:20:30", "owner": "edits_by_cooper", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050445041402625, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:13:06", "owner": "matthewtozzi47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080749759898944, "text": "Wait that's not normal?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:09:22", "owner": "mikeywayfan_01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043301129702983, "text": "😂😂😂😂real", "created_at": "2025-12-05T20:59:25", "owner": "benzemah1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062152541633874, "text": "It’s gross", "created_at": "2025-12-05T20:51:23", "owner": "russellvperry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101821468689347, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣 all of their looks is how u know they know everything even if u haven't talked to them about that 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T20:29:01", "owner": "saoirse_122", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079287833180315, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:47:40", "owner": "r.n.c.jr_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065656814159928, "text": "The first one is too shy 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:46:31", "owner": "paulinasocas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941828872096619, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:23", "owner": "robertosmfranco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941801500087851, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:18:57", "owner": "alibea