338367313230684, "text": "*BOOMBASTIC side eye*😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T15:19:39", "owner": "mr.sh3v", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988568421748020, "text": "The disgust 😭🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-05T15:18:48", "owner": "cotton.lama", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18328461457300929, "text": "its bad when your kids has better morals", "created_at": "2025-12-05T14:50:00", "owner": "honda_prime", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862502980465558, "text": "I still don't get why the kids react like that??? Its cute to call the hubby daddy in front of kids.. I am sorry but whats wrong with it🥴 it am confused 😕", "created_at": "2025-12-05T14:29:10", "owner": "noor_ali_20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320845168170425, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T14:06:39", "owner": "winny_laburundaise", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18351999568201986, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:05:04", "owner": "ga__rrix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970371606994424, "text": "Okay but like. The fact that even the youngest of the kids understand the subtle connotations of this exchange shows they’re watching shit they shouldn’t on the internet. 🙃", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:01:15", "owner": "cynikalpsykosis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183873439358922, "text": "Q nojo", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:40:07", "owner": "russinik_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028256141773268, "text": "The slow look on the last one ... 🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:09:21", "owner": "bg_ddy_c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087867001972643, "text": "I literally do it all the time with my teenager daughter and her friends, go ask daddy or go ask daddy dave. I dont see the problem im like im not going to refer to your dad as Dave to you am I. The other day I said well fo downstairs and be nice to your daddy and ask him if he'll give you his dodgy stick (fire stick) she was like mum i can't believe your just said go ask your daddy for his stick her friends was in hysterics. Im like your the dirty perverted minded ones not me lol", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:03:01", "owner": "lindseywilliams.1985", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962761476862649, "text": "The fact that they all know what it means should raise some questions for the parents 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:01:54", "owner": "savadrian_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18326565628210369, "text": "Why does the last boy got yee yee ahh haircut ?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:44:29", "owner": "prashantmar97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036161777719347, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:14:30", "owner": "fungi031", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113043844521339, "text": "Bedroom stuff 🤣not here stuff", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:11:22", "owner": "amany_l22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093421694508715, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:32:59", "owner": "sakhihussaini5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074827286205631, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:09:19", "owner": "miriam_streck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115253659584593, "text": "OH Up Wait A MINUTE soUnd NOt Right", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:17:08", "owner": "oat_parrotx2_610", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087090637825911, "text": "I don’t really get it sorry 😂what it means in their culture?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:07:45", "owner": "mohdabusada", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048819719435388, "text": "I can't skip this vid 😭😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:46:17", "owner": "malekfarid0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033493271737797, "text": "But he's your daddy and he's also a mother f*****😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:31:46", "owner": "halakwinik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935505157128862, "text": "How do they know the \"naughty\" context of the word though? My aunt and uncle called themselves mommy and daddy so their toddler would get used to calling them that. So in conclusion to know the \"naughty\" context someone must have watched some naughty content.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:29:57", "owner": "xxdjdmkxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094711510884878, "text": "The bowl cut 😭😞", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:23:44", "owner": "xusmanx_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930670963014875, "text": "I'm Italian. I don't know what's wrong with it", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:10:53", "owner": "gigiagrifa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115765192568981, "text": "🤢🤢🤢🤮🤮🤮", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:47:16", "owner": "b_sun_4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990369687879413, "text": "Its so good to see how parents have jokes with their kids while its very rare in asia mostly south 😔😔😔", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:37:57", "owner": "itzz_zay28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849857809572893, "text": "Did I see Eleven and Will in the last one? 😐", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:24:23", "owner": "saagarrwaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396680863121991, "text": "Last kid 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:14:14", "owner": "iamtrisips", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305667400271182, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:16:11", "owner": "msmeinsonnenschein", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854246779587491, "text": "We saw will & eleven at the end 😅", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:23:35", "owner": "geralt__of__riviia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071420933460148, "text": "What did the tablets have to say?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:13:38", "owner": "dagoldenboii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056927612315878, "text": "\"How'd y'all think you was made?\" Is whay Id say 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:10:58", "owner": "_mnkyd_luffy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058829243287035, "text": "\"That's bedroom stuff\" That's why it's so cringe to hear that LOL 😆.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:31:10", "owner": "metallunar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061934852535330, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:09:57", "owner": "browsbillion_bykookkie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048160604442585, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:00:36", "owner": "dumberryrene", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877438840350211, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:27:53", "owner": "the_chill_wise_cat812", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066186221159949, "text": "I'm pretty sure my wife had a kid with me just so that she could call me Daddy in public.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:14:14", "owner": "snarfhard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073292219039291, "text": "My Father last word before he passed away calling my Mom (2012) was: \"Mummy\".", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:18:52", "owner": "wfherrycool", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084402008030204, "text": "Why did the little girl get so offended? 🤔🤨", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:11:55", "owner": "joelvinkle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072263588354594, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:03:50", "owner": "ajayyyd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034297604743315, "text": "The girl facial Expression so impressive🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:57:20", "owner": "deddyandro_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100932748683032, "text": "That's traumatic", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:56:47", "owner": "_caravantes.jonathan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915943756090608, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:28:18", "owner": "yeffy_inthe5.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976895673952597, "text": "Scripted or Americans are insane", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:17:25", "owner": "nivx_nimx_ig.com235", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158675341407007, "text": "Afro-American version????", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:06:16", "owner": "joctan_villalom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048322595429501, "text": "Omg, my son hated when I'd call my husband Daddy 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:40:34", "owner": "bentleysmom228", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18323168182246449, "text": "🤮", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:40:29", "owner": "tachibanaukyoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978789654946373, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:59:11", "owner": "bluboy__nd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080975282164846, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:56:40", "owner": "rodn.eyhill59", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079509751901810, "text": "Quelqu’un peut m’expliquer, je suis pas américain, je comprends pas pourquoi c’est mal 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:40:18", "owner": "louis_176.t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064056875630773, "text": "Her calling him daddy got y’all here. HUSH", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:40:15", "owner": "queen_among_kings", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165792925387321, "text": "Just don't.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:37:10", "owner": "giftkunst", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090787102936262, "text": "We listen and we judge… 🤣 \nDt was the last girl at the dinner table 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:10:30", "owner": "rothschild3390", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096549076872522, "text": "I started calling my husband “daddy” when our son was small and I didn’t want him to call his dad by his name. I’ve accidentally called him daddy in public, oops. He’s my daddy too 🤷🏻‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:47:53", "owner": "heylucydee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121289089541040, "text": "Да объясните что там происходит то?", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:22:09", "owner": "antonionys", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106566235575118, "text": "It sound like illegal infront of kids😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:13:57", "owner": "the_real_kivuyo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972468912971890, "text": "Why do woman call there partners daddy and small@children call their father daddy. What’s the connection", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:56:42", "owner": "johnggray86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383884906146850, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:50:44", "owner": "fitjuana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113123059520473, "text": "How do you kids think you got here?", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:22:28", "owner": "wildmanwesley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103957171708342, "text": "Indian households would be trauma for American kids", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:10:13", "owner": "rere_lobo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892228189242366, "text": "Hello, I'm Brazilian and unfortunately I confess I didn't quite understand the issue of calling one's husband \"daddy\".", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:09:55", "owner": "_marcusmaia_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103380886708675, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:31:00", "owner": "themechanist9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058229894306963, "text": "Number 2 had a point..", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:14:47", "owner": "sven_markum_817", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905552893281382, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:00:27", "owner": "sabineidinger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18391857121180816, "text": "😂😂😂😂❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:47:23", "owner": "__i_am_r.j", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18387433303180695, "text": "How to traumatize your kids 101 lmfao", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:42:13", "owner": "jason011235", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943034779093671, "text": "第二個女孩觀念正確😍", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:09:30", "owner": "fxxkyeah._.1968341", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866129989433809, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:00:24", "owner": "k.e.v.i.n___21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080103103933707, "text": "Aku nampak dah masa depan anak-anak aku HAHAHA", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:58:40", "owner": "vibeswithalia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18389781700180418, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:24:29", "owner": "the__unfilteredfounder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075193256338189, "text": "What's gross was Lil homie haircut", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:24:21", "owner": "bosquez2155", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082551385886605, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:41:36", "owner": "moonlit_.marisha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544738771027628, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:10:04", "owner": "b.ceasar718", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070301165609249, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T14:53:15", "owner": "angelic.apocalypse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954058462041943, "text": "Hä? Wo ist das Problem?", "created_at": "2025-12-04T14:26:50", "owner": "dschiniroy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981503754921266, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T14:05:12", "owner": "muhamed_mo0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147238738436844, "text": "Love how Americans rather traumatize their children for clicks instead of just getting a fucking job", "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:28:28", "owner": "viggitron", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18295410193278276, "text": "I call my husband daddy sincd ever since. 😏", "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:03:56", "owner": "venice_daffodils", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843225112624584, "text": "@saraobertino  we need to do this in Tahoe!  It would be priceless!", "created_at": "2025-12-04T12:48:39", "owner": "troybriggs89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941070619095138, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T12:03:20", "owner": "slicytaless", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889007944266051, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T11:53:18", "owner": "lizwrites.it", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083467337031104, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T10:36:14", "owner": "oalonson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081042569515496, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T10:27:29", "owner": "polk_f.s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089506144758682, "text": "I llllllove it", "created_at": "2025-12-04T10:25:21", "owner": "enkey.75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077385026334044, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T10:07:02", "owner": "myz3ro_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075190982339899, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T09:21:04", "owner": "kingdom._of.heaven_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160075477402801, "text": "Daddy should be use in bed not in front of kids🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-04T08:57:57", "owner": "peerless_future_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106461613630392, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T08:12:40", "owner": "mobayotumininu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112689097586242, "text": "Everyone's grounded😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T07:55:57", "owner": "joyboii.24x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088633945783136, "text": "Who can explain? I bad speack English", "created_at": "2025-12-04T07:33:08", "owner": "iavitastas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870276175473066, "text": "was that inappropriate in other countries ? cause here in tge Philippines it's a term of indearment?  we call our husband daddy dad dhie you know?", "created_at": "2025-12-04T07:00:13", "owner": "honeycarlos02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049147046413919, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-04T05:59:55", "owner": "fernandezjoseluismedina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956384326041057, "text": "💀", "created_at": "2025-12-04T05:25:13", "owner": "allegedmom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868527922416715, "text": "Trauma just trauma", "created_at": "2025-12-04T05:01:28", "owner": "uncommonoutlawttv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903220609300283, "text": "Wait why do young teens know this 💀", "created_at": "2025-12-04T04:06:25", "owner": "yajanrjoshi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086224754319516, "text": "Used to be normal to hear. Not sure when it got relegated to the bedroom.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T04:01:09", "owner": "jamestravis48176567", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994570851719905, "text": "That shits weird ✌🏽🫩", "created_at": "2025-12-04T03:47:03", "owner": "asian_lover6969", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097088608829014, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T03:19:58", "owner": "martinang2l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068835935108774, "text": "horrible how this word is sexualized to the point their kids find it gross and humiliating.  I call my husband daddy quite often and our kids don't bat an eye lash over it", "created_at": "2025-12-04T03:18:16", "owner": "eeehheeheeehaha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062054414215152, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T03:12:27", "owner": "ha.rsha3480", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136766878422321, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T02:51:36", "owner": "symplee_sara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305900845249762, "text": "I love the bowl cut bringing it back", "created_at": "2025-12-04T02:39:41", "owner": "906patriot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115672513575018, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T02:06:11", "owner": "kc_kia1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18178061320365017, "text": "Very funny but… the last bit, The kid has a true bowl cut. They put a bowl on his head and cut his hair around it. Some things must stay in the past.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T01:17:59", "owner": "tinhattim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064732637170036, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T01:09:26", "owner": "odonnelljg81", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18399512713121027, "text": "My mama literally called my dad daddy during their entire marriage. But it wasn’t sexual..it was just cause we called him daddy 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-03T23:58:25", "owner": "pretty.toxic.vu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941958351961639, "text": "“That’s bedroom stuff, not here stuff”😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T23:45:05", "owner": "mdpenn66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086279537063499, "text": "The last family, it's like 500 kids at that table. How do they think they got here 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-03T23:43:33", "owner": "mrs_fury1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18336690529237778, "text": "☠☠☠☠🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-03T23:31:56", "owner": "greggwalker67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927488836172380, "text": "What in the bowl cut is that hairstyle😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-03T23:20:07", "owner": "serenityarkadie2012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847876648587364, "text": "Jajajajajajaja 🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:41:26", "owner": "cesarich79", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18380476051149144, "text": "Madde", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:31:19", "owner": "whowaser3n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860633152547557, "text": "The last girl and boy reaction 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:24:06", "owner": "vasa_marashli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097789948862838, "text": "My future hahaha 😍🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:12:07", "owner": "starlightglowingstrength99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338695021227828, "text": "HOW DO THEY KNOW", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:53:07", "owner": "zfallon84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091798490309985, "text": "The fact that some of the smaller kids know whats up. Thats super scary. Damn.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T19:31:33", "owner": "ifm_inc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087584975052071, "text": "last one CRIMINAL SIDE EYES", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:48:14", "owner": "eragon_776", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113711134597716, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:28:32", "owner": "micha_we44", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056857613312149, "text": "How these kids think they got here", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:20:17", "owner": "chrispreston29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884715319407943, "text": "How you kids think you landed at that table. 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:03:29", "owner": "jacob.a.miller.9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068857055569635, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T17:45:57", "owner": "tony_rogers6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086492276069286, "text": "I feel like this was always the norm, and then somebody made it a kink and now people think its weird.  You guys ruin everything! 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-03T16:41:56", "owner": "mdia2002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076491917259376, "text": "In front of the kids is wild", "created_at": "2025-12-03T16:32:44", "owner": "jjjurmann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873112090462989, "text": "I kind of hate how fathers have very few terms and we sexualized the OG so much now that even kids know it has undertones when it's said.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T16:06:38", "owner": "nickfcukingpowell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18378532279157053, "text": "In Nigeria, even the kids call their father daddy, it's a norm, what makes it different is the tone 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T15:27:38", "owner": "nxg_design", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295546423286272, "text": "Queeee en México ed común que así de la nada como \"cariño\" (aunque no esté bien) el marido de la diga \"mami\" a la esposa y que la esposa le diga \"papi\" al marido JAJAJAJA", "created_at": "2025-12-03T14:54:14", "owner": "roxi_2706_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109970221719904, "text": "Whats wrong with that? I didnt get it", "created_at": "2025-12-03T13:57:57", "owner": "dj_ahen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047017187465158, "text": "Their look of digust 🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-03T12:35:00", "owner": "samuelhyunillee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852665857594276, "text": "4 was bessssstttttt", "created_at": "2025-12-03T12:21:36", "owner": "am_mehetab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988944693863095, "text": "The expressions on the kids faces are priceless😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T10:57:27", "owner": "sharonfowler2121", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991824702855981, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T10:08:32", "owner": "floweryy_auraa6143", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880670707327002, "text": "@haybay6412 you know what we gotta do now", "created_at": "2025-12-03T04:24:19", "owner": "christian___saint", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062520152208624, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:53:43", "owner": "anderccdl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061723196642397, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:36:01", "owner": "sachin_jangid_97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975707613953349, "text": "Yo the way I laugh off of all of these kids' reaction phenomenal.😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:30:44", "owner": "oneunapologeticallyblackwoman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094570969847425, "text": "Bro with the bowl definitely lost a bet", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:10:57", "owner": "matthew_mlb__butler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083825746870134, "text": "Imagine being in a relationship and having fun like this.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:59:55", "owner": "lampkebill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18167518069379063, "text": "Them kids are not innocent at all lol", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:26:51", "owner": "dejmedic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010755656647589, "text": "It's so funny to watch the kids reactions. Our 13 year is so unfazed when I call my husband \"Daddy\".", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:24:35", "owner": "jere_mei_kai_robs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096368437856190, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T00:27:35", "owner": "cal3b_nycc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953475421043793, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂bombastic side eye criminal offensive side eye", "created_at": "2025-12-03T00:08:02", "owner": "ome.rceline", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18186750859348848, "text": "What 's meaning ? I am Indonesian, n i don't know what the meaning .. anyone can explain to me", "created_at": "2025-12-03T00:00:26", "owner": "rumahbakhtiar.id", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18347491180200976, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:40:43", "owner": "sana.k.imran", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367274353086840, "text": "Lmao😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:38:38", "owner": "freshconmiz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914024896243641, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:19:07", "owner": "sealjennifer33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087279721794791, "text": "I love the fact that low IQ people post their videos for our entertainment 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:55:51", "owner": "tommysd82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975738687958715, "text": "That’s bedroom stuff 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:55:44", "owner": "mnbleau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894887653223463, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:39:46", "owner": "karol.karinac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153539701419382, "text": "‌", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:04:50", "owner": "devin._.77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974338707950882, "text": "The cringe in the second one could not get ratcheted any higher", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:46:41", "owner": "oursweetbums", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059250398279933, "text": "What is wrong??😮", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:40:11", "owner": "seaman_maritaim_1992", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141426115454149, "text": "😂🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:36:56", "owner": "axvr.oa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062453138217600, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:16:13", "owner": "zermmmmmmmmmmm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075362150006838, "text": "Whats wrong if the mom calling her husband « Daddy »?", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:04:43", "owner": "rodjiih_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083357600024605, "text": "The bowlcut is way too clean 🥀", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:04:06", "owner": "s.z.katica", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082535308869033, "text": "I wanna come back again🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:03:33", "owner": "trendyhome_hub_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18423957283115753, "text": "No entiendo el porque ????", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:43:56", "owner": "mauricio_andres021", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923310871191908, "text": "People are so weird for saying Daddy in a sexual way. What Crazy relationship you have to your fathers", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:43:42", "owner": "pape111311", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071802038582532, "text": "Kids are traumatized 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:43:27", "owner": "dimi_19_93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010387676813119, "text": "Avg American family 🤡", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:38:39", "owner": "the_awakengod", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104257846735287, "text": "Why does that little ass girl in the last video know about “daddy” 🤧🤧🤧 not her looking hard too like wtf did mom just say 🤨🤧🤧", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:28:30", "owner": "_angelito7hdz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084678539011248, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:16:15", "owner": "ruben2828", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870709825396082, "text": "Not the whole family with the bowl cut 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:07:42", "owner": "shiffteam_32", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977848278951500, "text": "Well, we all know the daughter in number 2 is going to be a goer. 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:52:51", "owner": "eryri_boy80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087351580981224, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:36:36", "owner": "time.ytd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050088209398363, "text": "It's sounds alot more normal in Afrikaans 😂 but daddy oh please no 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:21:25", "owner": "fridayizcrazy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113503684596228, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:21:23", "owner": "billblatos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096823756661982, "text": "Estos gringos !🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:07:38", "owner": "diklc_errante", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301066399257354, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:04:07", "owner": "j_tate_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878220886436450, "text": "La pregunta importante es porque la última niña de el video sabe cosas?", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:43:12", "owner": "agu_ilar503", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193170445328333, "text": "In nigeria here it's a common saying sha", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:42:56", "owner": "asio_favie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080891192325851, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:33:32", "owner": "jec1136", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105542446725230, "text": "I wish yall could hear the weezing 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:12:36", "owner": "hamingerbenham", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074084621211225, "text": "Thought that was normal", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:52:31", "owner": "carson1367", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867137527500430, "text": "I don't understand why it's sexualized to call your husband Daddy, it's friggin creepy, and weird id dump a chick in a heartbeat if she called me daddy", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:30:09", "owner": "the_dad_father", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18215396749308212, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:19:25", "owner": "anahaa_10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116441251599115, "text": "Me as a mom🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:13:26", "owner": "sandylaufeyson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105305293729343, "text": "🤣🤣the last reaction omg I'm dying 🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:12:24", "owner": "marinettec5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110363893539698, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:05:42", "owner": "riviecarlos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121335646540585, "text": "Respectfully, why are we acting like we don’t say that exact same thing to people on our own time like their parents do it it shouldn’t be that that weird because we also do it too", "created_at": "2025-12-02T15:44:08", "owner": "shadowknight2486", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539117710063677, "text": "Side eye 😒 bombastic", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:47:42", "owner": "mariabinticoletah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943173238079354, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:30:13", "owner": "lynne_thalievianna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955078360042313, "text": "Then don't come to Colombia we call our wife or husband mommy and daddy in any case bedroom or normal day timme", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:23:34", "owner": "serge512_jvs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18403537171124483, "text": "WAHAHAHAHAHAHAHHAA NEVER LAUGHED THIS GOOD 🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:19:30", "owner": "as_in_darc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18179851459364557, "text": "As one way to get your little girl, not to be a well, I'm not gonna finish that statement, but you understand what I'm saying they're gonna get too embarrassed to ever say that phrase", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:16:54", "owner": "abettertim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085994069474293, "text": "You families are broken ngl 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:07:40", "owner": "knownasluca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164425168382148, "text": "The fact kids know this stuff so well", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:43:22", "owner": "josh278.bda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298111792287302, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:33:29", "owner": "kaifi.ya6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087481093806160, "text": "I'd cringe myself into a black hole, but not before laughing my ass off at the SHEER AUDACITY😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:30:36", "owner": "eurydice_forsaken", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18340719598237121, "text": "Seriously this \"daddy\" thing is really creepy", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:47:01", "owner": "lilcsoreal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18351899005162217, "text": "😂😂😂🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T11:34:29", "owner": "lachula1216", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049218863389535, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T11:17:50", "owner": "wadaleaayushi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976361196794462, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T10:36:07", "owner": "taranpreetsinghkhatri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005340134818545, "text": "Já to nechápu v Evropě se po tom.cp.se narodí děti normálně nazýváme mamka a taťka 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T10:12:59", "owner": "danka_sus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099999772778702, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T09:43:51", "owner": "hemkay_king", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888986569264834, "text": "is 2 autistic??", "created_at": "2025-12-02T09:42:32", "owner": "ramuskio.tn3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112884067599698, "text": "Surely they've grown up in the house hearing it all the time.. especially this 3rd and 4th children. Do parents not refer to each other as mummy and daddy to their children?", "created_at": "2025-12-02T09:18:47", "owner": "matt._1985", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081890398887696, "text": "Yet they all like the idea if they get to do it 🤷🏻‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-12-02T08:43:33", "owner": "lev.jessl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001008923832468, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T08:26:18", "owner": "kiiyanzivari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945557500073020, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T07:49:07", "owner": "praadha._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941168983067037, "text": "That’s her daddy b4 he became their  daddy 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T07:16:18", "owner": "ladyjoie_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104024980596475, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:33:39", "owner": "z_ostrander", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905793457290435, "text": "Disgusting kids", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:22:30", "owner": "jaredredredline", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976754787952389, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:09:22", "owner": "jen_lee_34", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067563092420921, "text": "I wouldnt even call him dad, i would likely end up calling him by is first name for the next week 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:13:29", "owner": "braydencase5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049499117417872, "text": "اخر واحد مو طبيعي هههههه", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:10:42", "owner": "itsamsom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546809566027406, "text": "The perfect response when your kids keep saying 6 7", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:21:04", "owner": "xxmashadoxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867632878487195, "text": "Need more parts😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:06:55", "owner": "teardropdiaryyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890674450382446, "text": "they dunno.. in this country normal call husband daddy because have kids. so wife will call daddy front of kids. it's normal. in Indonesia. i dunno what the joke ??😢", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:04:00", "owner": "soniia.utt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086944883063387, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T01:43:43", "owner": "mandylynmiller", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856471006569789, "text": "Lah gimana aku yg manggil suami \"bapak\"? Suami manggil aku \"mamak\"🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T01:10:20", "owner": "mothysmom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097362706828803, "text": "🤣😭why does this bother the kids so much???", "created_at": "2025-12-02T01:03:36", "owner": "bblunt_da_don", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006902180819605, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T00:32:10", "owner": "leomax_santos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034013603527650, "text": "How is this a thing that’s weird and funny? My mom used to call my father, daddy, dad or Viejo. We all just assume that that’s how our parents talk to each other.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T00:27:10", "owner": "nico747477", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087515734799213, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:41:43", "owner": "sami98204", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068301257578437, "text": "My mom calls my dad pere like dad in French. But the way she says it... It took me way to long to figure out she was basically saying the same thing 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:53:30", "owner": "narex8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161673166398381, "text": "Youngins often forget how they get here🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:42:07", "owner": "anilestyler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954697480028805, "text": "If I'm not going to marry a woman who does that, I don't even want to. 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:41:47", "owner": "lucxs._19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058255103298078, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:37:29", "owner": "guruxbhaskar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106745683712231, "text": "How I side eye my parents when they kiss a bit too hard 🫩 like in front of my salad ??", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:14:19", "owner": "chillafire", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073339697253348, "text": "The jawline on the 4 video 😮‍💨", "created_at": "2025-12-01T21:22:47", "owner": "beki42_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065180594409568, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T21:16:41", "owner": "manushita_kushan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958416948886306, "text": "1st one the girl thinking that's my daddy😒", "created_at": "2025-12-01T21:16:21", "owner": "ths3_y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303196684262713, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T21:11:49", "owner": "devaughnraa04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862895374460533, "text": "This is unhealthy", "created_at": "2025-12-01T20:41:21", "owner": "lenaoftheyah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052291280354092, "text": "@saychat07", "created_at": "2025-12-01T20:27:31", "owner": "garitra70", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887231038403493, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T20:23:10", "owner": "miya_sanders007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540748258022200, "text": "Number 3 deffo into it 🥴🥴😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T20:20:31", "owner": "driven_by_mike", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337362073232006, "text": "The awful part is the kids know what it means.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T20:08:01", "owner": "_modern.druid_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903203290165372, "text": "The way the kids all know about it 😂🫢", "created_at": "2025-12-01T20:03:52", "owner": "xnat_82x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866007340508670, "text": "Mommy", "created_at": "2025-12-01T20:02:15", "owner": "radim.2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842270983634321, "text": "I need the IG of bedroom stuff", "created_at": "2025-12-01T20:01:25", "owner": "theafsharr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068862446375707, "text": "Could someone please clarify what is wrong in calling the father of your children daddy? I know there’s something going on but I am not sure what it is. Why is it bedroom stuff? Why are the kids looking so embarrassed. 🤔", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:36:29", "owner": "rajimuddala", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18550191124028088, "text": "Mooo👹mmmm🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:36:18", "owner": "ri2000han", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298087630260696, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:27:41", "owner": "britchiq00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152189500419511, "text": "Que cultura tan rara que las mujeres latinas nos llamen así todo el tiempo no es extraño", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:19:47", "owner": "leyvatamayorubiel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099456979695182, "text": "My wife called me daddy for like 5 years because if she didn’t, my daughter would start calling me “Trevor”.. people would do double takes, but that’s cuz they have dirty minds.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T18:55:30", "owner": "clvrtrvr17", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18203107831319203, "text": "How these kids even know what this means ?!?!", "created_at": "2025-12-01T18:32:10", "owner": "hennes.walker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098624164773412, "text": "I call my husband daddy all the time infront of my daughter lol", "created_at": "2025-12-01T18:08:17", "owner": "scarybunny224_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914892130090697, "text": "Terrible ???😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:39:02", "owner": "obiageli___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062258996202114, "text": "Leaving these children BOTHERED LOL", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:31:56", "owner": "curaga777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845326861605634, "text": "Bedroom stuff 🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:22:00", "owner": "hooraynaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099756139754310, "text": "we need a mommy version", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:12:50", "owner": "amirlands_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114053128580135, "text": "What happened?????", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:04:15", "owner": "hmdfyz240", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114264016586652, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:58:38", "owner": "the.bavarian.90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051802973666679, "text": "The kids are about to explode🤣😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:19:41", "owner": "s_amarth_g7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850065814566461, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:11:46", "owner": "abdelhafeezali", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877027228352347, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:11:34", "owner": "yasa_khan7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925647370178212, "text": "What's wrong I don't know", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:45:26", "owner": "rmnuurmajdiy31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059974325260041, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:42:12", "owner": "valentinaungurjanovic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18385311469196713, "text": "That's bedroom stuff not here stuff 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:10:58", "owner": "storrymakerr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954311643904175, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:10:33", "owner": "storrymakerr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958992138882436, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:01:00", "owner": "taniacostamoura", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073697882352806, "text": "Wonder where these kids think they came from lol", "created_at": "2025-12-01T14:53:26", "owner": "meetthechonks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546151219042408, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T14:12:19", "owner": "abrish.777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921976582054628, "text": "But ... its the daddy ... so whats wrong ?", "created_at": "2025-12-01T14:08:34", "owner": "tomclan32", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337873642237631, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:51:57", "owner": "cheftx57", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853462675584918, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:31:50", "owner": "tootallbilal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068771144524028, "text": "But what does it mean?", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:19:04", "owner": "djamel_luz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008657909814325, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:18:59", "owner": "lost_girl_journey_100", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061411013219538, "text": "I cannot wait to traumatize my children in this way🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:13:40", "owner": "ita_correa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069813416420382, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T12:46:15", "owner": "hars_hita9375", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929366938018320, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T12:29:33", "owner": "kevinsherman1377", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068902118525812, "text": "Why?", "created_at": "2025-12-01T11:38:23", "owner": "oyen_icut", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18169360429339065, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T10:58:08", "owner": "nacherescriviviendo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084451603856524, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T10:05:38", "owner": "mcrzn.corey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916429675227291, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:53:37", "owner": "dahiijalebiiiiiiiiiiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073297421586631, "text": "Wtf🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:51:45", "owner": "y.usufhasan_07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087606814810724, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:46:56", "owner": "marylynnbernard31_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048258587436643, "text": "Explain please", "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:25:03", "owner": "hometech_service.kz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090297910944702, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:15:45", "owner": "vigstirx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980744250778883, "text": "@hoss1265", "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:04:45", "owner": "mnady6700", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045995981468095, "text": "😂😂😂😍😍", "created_at": "2025-12-01T08:32:39", "owner": "marckendynoeland", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095376625866938, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:09:32", "owner": "glitched_.sanity", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058114076291484, "text": "Well for the fourth one the kids at least already know who’s gonna be sleeping in the couch that night", "created_at": "2025-12-01T06:49:55", "owner": "panda_king231", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109199341720863, "text": "Bedroooommm stuffff 😭👏🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-01T06:48:56", "owner": "shaheer_ahmed.xd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958734093882857, "text": "Hey guys, don't stress yourself about dissertations and research and everything about your academics, let a pro handle it.... Kindly reach out to me. DM", "created_at": "2025-12-01T06:41:36", "owner": "wanja_mugambi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18186069241354458, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T06:31:45", "owner": "sourav___dalui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071395958602852, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T05:33:44", "owner": "amanullahmalik90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845307823619117, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T05:08:18", "owner": "johnybeckham", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095243497855330, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T05:06:04", "owner": "divinewithlove", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065244695159851, "text": "Bedroom stuff 😂😂😂😂 and the way she said it 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T05:00:09", "owner": "jkrs02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078983206919373, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:54:00", "owner": "skr.8876", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101638414708188, "text": "Bedroom stuff", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:30:07", "owner": "godstewartgriffin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930548371120150, "text": "More videos", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:23:05", "owner": "sm00k1e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894635332224835, "text": "Please like this so I can watch this again", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:11:26", "owner": "totallynotkyl3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000698768838026, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:47:00", "owner": "ryan_givens2007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18385185118177670, "text": "Honestly the hair cuts some of these kids have sjpuld@worry them more than what there parents are saying", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:35:19", "owner": "haydenmehlhop23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075600848244111, "text": "Por favor alguém me explica o que significa esse \"daddy\"?", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:21:08", "owner": "akiragabriel2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084628034043017, "text": "My family we all call him “daddy”, is that not normal?? 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:14:09", "owner": "bui.bearblack", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051825410369632, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T02:44:48", "owner": "polerbear97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874422496453848, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T02:37:14", "owner": "kayla638910", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074142062459891, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T02:02:50", "owner": "uncle_shan73", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069620495376835, "text": "It's pretty common in Asian families to call the husband some version of \"daddy\".", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:56:25", "owner": "nightwing_nocturne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18412137496141662, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:44:17", "owner": "elijahtorri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068539997104296, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:32:10", "owner": "antonis_psonara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030816647738073, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:51:40", "owner": "plank.d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891892741242665, "text": "Algum br pra explicar?", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:50:21", "owner": "chagasguiof", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183410656358652, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:49:55", "owner": "diazcpink", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057426041298350, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:47:45", "owner": "just_johnniedenise", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541071859054497, "text": "How the hell this kids think they got there!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:46:49", "owner": "aniarobaina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860568871548661, "text": "This is white people issue's. Hispanic women call their men papi all the time and the kids don't care.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:30:52", "owner": "danny_d369", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099241390692103, "text": "T", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:21:48", "owner": "_malkonx", 