 hereditary 🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:17:54", "owner": "jennifers0419", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019327193615496, "text": "The last clip...🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:05:10", "owner": "mindsetwealth101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176634544367760, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:03:55", "owner": "das_protik_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885464035285202, "text": "Fastest way to traumatize your children", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:49:23", "owner": "ketaballern161", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032044253538796, "text": "The DISGUST😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:45:23", "owner": "kutestlove", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032865776734772, "text": "Id be grossed out more than the kids", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:37:45", "owner": "jonmford90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18549770257051302, "text": "No is wondering how these kids learned this so young?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:35:18", "owner": "patinomii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907499089268933, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:28:25", "owner": "vegaszebra2012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931368979115160, "text": "It’s always the daughters that get the most freaked out by it 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:11:02", "owner": "legendary_cal19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146735494429547, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:07:22", "owner": "_hadi_shams_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054594302335495, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:44:30", "owner": "janneman416", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067304531412587, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:38:04", "owner": "justlookinaroun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843060952621268, "text": "😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:46:13", "owner": "fleerseib", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109357570717404, "text": "YOU JUST KNOW WHO THE MIDDLE KIDS ARE FROM THEIR REACTION", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:45:23", "owner": "beef_bean_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962362932861025, "text": "Lmao 💀☠️☠️☠️", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:26:11", "owner": "janevibe1311", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080303027130731, "text": "With your vape on the table. Such a good example for those kids", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:20:14", "owner": "adam_wrestling", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159229819362253, "text": "What’s the problem???", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:10:53", "owner": "shira196935", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147373252436499, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:09:19", "owner": "tornadomusic_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956011786013321, "text": "En América es ilegal tener menos de 10 hijos ?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:08:00", "owner": "xavieren26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860255518551000, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:56:40", "owner": "paulo71935", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976370799953289, "text": "That last little girl looked way to young for her to be knowing what that meant 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:06:22", "owner": "bailey.wilkes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092705150307170, "text": "Honestly loved seeing my parents being lovey dovey when I was a kid. A lil embarassing if hands started touching weird parts but kissing and being all flirting was kinda funny", "created_at": "2025-11-30T13:46:32", "owner": "mguest0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909150391126898, "text": "I’m not a prude or anything but you have to wonder why such young kids would associate this with anything but Dad.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T13:32:12", "owner": "mbrainard70", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071960966599348, "text": "The first one 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:50:30", "owner": "dazeio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396863962135981, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:48:18", "owner": "being_sigma_for_a_cause", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084485417282387, "text": "Awesome.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:46:43", "owner": "american_survivor62", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874010950452319, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:06:39", "owner": "yhck_1202", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134498695486072, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:23:31", "owner": "debbiezappen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18317476795220993, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:16:36", "owner": "erionb77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113923354601606, "text": "I was with my kids father till our first born was 5. She never knew our first names because we always called each daddy or pa and mami or ma 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T10:27:11", "owner": "lavidalupe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152423689423933, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T10:25:08", "owner": "kmxmarian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993717036894279, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T09:50:13", "owner": "ha7__60", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096300187848402, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T09:46:06", "owner": "cpinheiro72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099507583748662, "text": "It's so messed up that chidren understand the joke.. What a terrible time to live in", "created_at": "2025-11-30T09:28:23", "owner": "guess.yassine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914764693092346, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T09:22:26", "owner": "fanaru.catalin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074500364264470, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T09:14:17", "owner": "ceejay_225", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089539058506398, "text": "🤣🤣the last one", "created_at": "2025-11-30T09:11:08", "owner": "riddhi__00000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141468151454499, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:59:20", "owner": "mathias_1887_hsv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083597852018908, "text": "fffkkkkkk", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:59:20", "owner": "s00per.bee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081090104131015, "text": "Crack me.uppppp", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:25:43", "owner": "timero_oh1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040266296507259, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:58:48", "owner": "yaxyobek_03_22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068076608119774, "text": "Last guys be like: wait whaaaat", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:57:53", "owner": "fahimmontassirshimul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095793562675518, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:52:52", "owner": "emerevangelista1771", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18387343825180211, "text": "The girls are half naked all the time. Wtf", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:45:55", "owner": "erroorrs404", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977989128947006, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:03:54", "owner": "1secound2impact", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900505711338341, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:54:13", "owner": "yappophile", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112003756594493, "text": "I'm not down with being called \"daddy\" by my wife... that's some creepy incest shit right there.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:49:30", "owner": "aaron.welk.7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864547072531267, "text": "Ma dove sta il problema? 🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:42:11", "owner": "motoxjonfri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845222371605255, "text": "I called my husband daddy even in front of his and my parents 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:55:17", "owner": "amykeh826", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108625309720418, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:53:27", "owner": "bhuvaneshshettykc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376446274152243, "text": "The “daddy” in the car…seriously.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:23:43", "owner": "navmike", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889858375389659, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:35:57", "owner": "boston_roman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994111686712722, "text": "I think the 2nd one was the healthiest reaction", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:10:27", "owner": "amiri_coder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083691509285522, "text": "What’s gross is that even the kids think it’s inappropriate…. But why!? I call my actual dad “daddy,” and all the ratchet females ruined it for little girls who love their fathers 🙄💔", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:05:11", "owner": "blartygill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077917877183237, "text": "Jokes on them because I double down the joke", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:45:33", "owner": "nati.whistles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064238456181456, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:41:23", "owner": "cykloud_nation", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970793001980589, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:27:23", "owner": "hollidaydonaldr1969", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113409625599994, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:02:58", "owner": "rajmanikya.r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860882053542806, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:00:53", "owner": "i_m_kky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951341599026150, "text": "African-raised children wouldn't flinch, ours is when you use the first name 😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:27:26", "owner": "datbolaji", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876955624355813, "text": "😂🤢😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:23:36", "owner": "photopooba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069977048376390, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:18:36", "owner": "rainman_scv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966354084840261, "text": "The little girls face on the last one 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:13:36", "owner": "jun_bug1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106306783565978, "text": "We don't need anymore siblings......STOP IT!!!!! LOL 😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:36:10", "owner": "d1deem34_igael", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079370206911189, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:35:09", "owner": "d1deem34_igael", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547513561036404, "text": "When your kids get upset to “ Daddy” time to watch them kids", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:32:14", "owner": "shawn.michael70", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867693076486844, "text": "MWSA-Make Wives Submissive Again🔥🔥❤️🌹❤️‍🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:32:05", "owner": "therealtylerleavitt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18151124860422047, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:03:00", "owner": "obsessedbyneon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108633706714509, "text": "Here in the Philippines it's ok to do it in front of your kids. It's no big deal or issues", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:45:41", "owner": "gardoedluza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18398333791125812, "text": "My question is: why do these youngsters already know what “DADDY” is referencing?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:37:23", "owner": "28mcryan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18181518964361095, "text": "The children were too stunned to speak 🤣😂🤣😂🤣😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:30:10", "owner": "heather_feather8614", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071192030345981, "text": "All kids already know meaning of it?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:18:10", "owner": "jankozibrik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077491658336930, "text": "So one is able to read the ancient text?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:07:10", "owner": "self.made734", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18163948564389946, "text": "What the means? Sorry i cant understanding", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:57:30", "owner": "edhodanu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059069249273926, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:56:02", "owner": "mugurasiconstantin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059549369252257, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:55:58", "owner": "mugurasiconstantin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18317281087223569, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:53:35", "owner": "jefedidit1st", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081146042274945, "text": "🔥👏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:08:05", "owner": "808nastygt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092182150909266, "text": "We don't have the equivalent expression for a bedroom daddy expression so it's so funny witnessing that kind of joke in English lmao 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:02:37", "owner": "alex_xwalt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849573487600122, "text": "The kids are appalled🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:55:33", "owner": "rebeccaswish2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064391168612924, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:35:52", "owner": "mr.woodard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852445090591201, "text": "Brooo that last clip😭 bro doesn’t wannna eat in the same house as his mum again 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:34:39", "owner": "dwayno420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086412391971978, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:33:27", "owner": "beneditanoberto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18307364014267109, "text": "The horror 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:26:47", "owner": "igotbookworms", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18306263989268156, "text": "C'est quoi le problème ?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:23:36", "owner": "tassurementraison", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079336520153131, "text": "That little girl at the end knows too much 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:21:48", "owner": "zac_denneen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979748859783454, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:04:36", "owner": "srita.corleone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061842506217924, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:57:36", "owner": "aquadrealest36", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176534263365442, "text": "The kids faces 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:57:31", "owner": "april_185280", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087280030798039, "text": "\"Stare all you like i had daddy x times and now yall here\" ahh moments 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:39:52", "owner": "andreanoelwhiterose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854077666579921, "text": "Someone explain to me 🤔🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:37:25", "owner": "el_dido_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094607086850642, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:04:37", "owner": "ms_goodytwoshoes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891892666244195, "text": "What is it that makes them want to throw up in their mouths😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:04:20", "owner": "donnab.rash", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072777569038812, "text": "Do I not understand why the shame?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T20:47:25", "owner": "luisvillarroel21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095613676869636, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T20:39:19", "owner": "lisawhite779", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082044905320857, "text": "No entiendo qué pasa si llamas a tu marido daddy delante de los niños?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T20:38:02", "owner": "vicky_veck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545234338021476, "text": "I love it", "created_at": "2025-11-29T20:31:33", "owner": "c_b_ligorria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888947500390113, "text": "Huh? You already call your husband 'daddy' before they came out, and that's the reason why they came out 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T20:24:42", "owner": "ev3rywheretogether", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088453684987548, "text": "😂😂😂 made my day! 😂 Thank you! 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T20:03:41", "owner": "emmi_emmchen79", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991756104728829, "text": "It's wrong that kids know that type of \"Daddy\" is frightening", "created_at": "2025-11-29T19:55:16", "owner": "j.asiatic0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904419043296238, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T19:49:44", "owner": "sojipiano", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035610908721003, "text": "Good. Teach them its gross to call the man your sleeping with daddy.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T19:22:50", "owner": "nadeaufam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971535261974653, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T19:03:16", "owner": "xkissesx89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158379094367095, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:59:04", "owner": "mariamq644", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058248041293862, "text": "Lmaoooooooo", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:43:42", "owner": "maseratirome", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084988913095158, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:39:28", "owner": "hernandezofernando", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890497327391787, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:33:14", "owner": "maja_vienna__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084723568858741, "text": "Don't get thaaaaat 🤮", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:29:43", "owner": "indunn_90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096041965889234, "text": "There are some parents that do so much worst in front if their children by what they tell them, truly sickening, no respect for the child and their feelings, some things kids will never forget what you told them, some people don’t deserve to be parents they are to self absorbed in their sick lifestyle, truly feel sorry for their children, that why they have no respect for for you, rightfully so", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:28:10", "owner": "jan12sla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035548241721352, "text": "O que significa, tendi não", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:07:32", "owner": "edvaldo_emerson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966655600000990, "text": "This generation is cooked", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:00:28", "owner": "bedwellbryan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109002898527113, "text": "Who is your daddy now?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:44:51", "owner": "ssuon8665", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105936205636067, "text": "Eksena", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:42:35", "owner": "asapjeysi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156260956409708, "text": "@villapluis", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:39:33", "owner": "lepapa_r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019036340616252, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:27:24", "owner": "kandie_kiss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943408450074697, "text": "How do the childrens know?! Murica!", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:20:11", "owner": "354culinary", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100441165750041, "text": "Lowkey my mom has called my dad daddy for as long as I can remember and I truly thought it’s because that’s what me and my brother called him….. I’m 18 this video made me realize k might be wrong", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:09:35", "owner": "honestly.aly_mei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964031034851152, "text": "Dawg 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:57:09", "owner": "cpatrick313", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135240610467136, "text": "#1 salt and pepper 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:56:31", "owner": "joepinto34", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329860822212782, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:55:58", "owner": "isiermx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048743735409829, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:51:20", "owner": "blvnc9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352142440202424, "text": "#1 has a vicious bowl cut 🫩✌️", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:45:02", "owner": "acwozniak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956063338010504, "text": "Numbers are all off here, number 3 is by far the best one. Pure disgust on her face 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:40:07", "owner": "stoeyjyles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087473008966954, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:39:52", "owner": "skylightawakensofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914335714250349, "text": "Aisian kid don't ever try to laugh I'm saying on my experience😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:32:10", "owner": "_ojha_darsh.04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18409363453186548, "text": "I call my husband daddy lol..did realize how creepy it is lol 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:11:10", "owner": "stellataillefer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069883532082842, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:54:35", "owner": "daviegold2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059851256259613, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:24:29", "owner": "jorgensenroberto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298080466282808, "text": "That last kid 🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:22:43", "owner": "alphaghost06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18350824039204439, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:09:55", "owner": "heavenlyaguilar_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100524913684493, "text": "The last kids were in disbelief 🫢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:42:37", "owner": "tyjape", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048127502438232, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:19:43", "owner": "geoffreyasa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098583469693301, "text": "Imagine this trend in India 🗿", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:17:35", "owner": "letsmake.19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953572042044667, "text": "Funny .. but once is enough", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:08:15", "owner": "jaspa_ty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113454766597453, "text": "If u are questioning this short please state the country u are in so men can follow and escape these horrid situations here in America", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:06:49", "owner": "neoblackpill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18273239785303285, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:04:14", "owner": "nicoleve2015", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18179533627320826, "text": "Sugar daddy", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:01:32", "owner": "fabienjaillet92200", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086305816963863, "text": "These \"teens\" are fragile God dam 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:59:55", "owner": "mar_mk6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18151112347423832, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:54:48", "owner": "the_nicest_demon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978270867951772, "text": "The fifth one is my favorite", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:39:02", "owner": "vezinaarnaud", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18435562576097701, "text": "Better than fighting infront of kids", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:19:23", "owner": "_r__k__r__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912700858247911, "text": "🤣🤣😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:14:32", "owner": "_wiz._imon_._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116822044560034, "text": "Here I am taking a sht in the toilet.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:53:04", "owner": "andrewllosa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915392134226661, "text": "I get called daddy. It’s a habit from talking for the kids when they were little.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:32:59", "owner": "jameshbkyle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930992602120236, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:11:03", "owner": "franklincavalcante2105", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329375812210542, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:57:57", "owner": "muneeb_farooq150", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073367885598285, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:41:23", "owner": "amurdererwithagoldenmask", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906528916275067, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:16:50", "owner": "hrmndhimn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117530368492498, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:10:43", "owner": "mbe55403", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021115037784702, "text": "All of those children vomited 🤮 in their mouths.!😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:03:35", "owner": "joelsmithrainey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157859839406475, "text": "What is cold palmer doing there at the end😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:47:43", "owner": "its.gurdeep.sidhu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988853070879669, "text": "Darry", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:00:37", "owner": "mr_fifa_badar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055688123645860, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:00:24", "owner": "delvnoche", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902612461309655, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:22:06", "owner": "pm.f___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068841344102410, "text": "J’ai pas compris le problème x)", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:06:33", "owner": "cvl.tommy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852396061544485, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:49:17", "owner": "alanadrev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065513690561487, "text": "And? Sorry, what is the point?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:22:08", "owner": "ondrej_vesely_financni_poradce", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099993019696953, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:18:34", "owner": "4__eaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18423173131116175, "text": "Bedroom stuff 🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:48:47", "owner": "xorrocotxoc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048106931422902, "text": "Emg knp kalo panggil daddy???", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:29:07", "owner": "sebrinacf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18375101062152855, "text": "😂😂😂👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:55:32", "owner": "simply_keryn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113387578582817, "text": "That's what my mom call her husband always and dad calls her wife mummy. So is a normal thing for me", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:54:17", "owner": "moneks_m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047267909443131, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:51:31", "owner": "vladimirhrostov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065182418157170, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:49:18", "owner": "candy.lula", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069101015376627, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:41:17", "owner": "julian.lph", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049603508391164, "text": "No! No! Not even in the bedroom. I could never call my lover “daddy”, I would remember my father. 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:14:03", "owner": "marciamodenese", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042106385498418, "text": "What's wrong with \"daddy\" word?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:06:54", "owner": "abuaywa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084406400006556, "text": "Bombastic side eye... 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:06:42", "owner": "vac_grafix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077667559952382, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:54:29", "owner": "brianreese50", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068166320455832, "text": "The disgust on their faces😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:38:46", "owner": "ishleyness2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121303105532885, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:06:42", "owner": "2.plus.3.equals.5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077246741518682, "text": "How to punish your kids without touching a hair on them 101 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:04:43", "owner": "mainedovinci", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846520612613801, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:53:44", "owner": "neethu_orion7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003629507828088, "text": "I don't get it.  For a long as I can remember,  my parents called each other mom and daddy", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:45:04", "owner": "papa.opah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897157372204213, "text": "It's  a bedroom stuff was the best caption", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:43:59", "owner": "bilal_khanabdali", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110113567544229, "text": "The last one lol", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:38:26", "owner": "notyouronlymans423", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087513439985761, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:34:55", "owner": "gasgodd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080756327328160, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:10:42", "owner": "ruf__07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061067432534963, "text": "@lll_jieun ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:59:17", "owner": "sang_joon_yoon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955578310043627, "text": "That's their whole job as parents is to embarrass the kids with weird stuff! 😆", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:45:16", "owner": "treblemaker613", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980393832929983, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:41:22", "owner": "blue_ron_6030", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102785449730880, "text": "A BOWL CUT?!", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:32:50", "owner": "andrew.ctru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950447674054180, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:28:58", "owner": "aelunaaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015548261629946, "text": "why not? someone please tell me  the reason…", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:11:52", "owner": "borampark1107", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001910639829962, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:10:42", "owner": "pettersson9724", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988669272867548, "text": "#2 was the best one 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:00:30", "owner": "phoenix_firelight", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988531107862561, "text": "Now who's your daddy?😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:52:56", "owner": "karjo2484", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091179763901290, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:29:08", "owner": "skatin_introvert", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087697046305432, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:00:12", "owner": "olivermarquez__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18336321616228140, "text": "“Terrible” was so dang quick and he KNEW what he was doing. (And doing later)", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:55:49", "owner": "josiahhuddleson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010502231804656, "text": "Did anyone read about the clay tablets?🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:27:55", "owner": "janicedouglas768", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18299215381257132, "text": "I think the number 5 was the best", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:19:26", "owner": "seagull2244", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906493345274168, "text": "It's weird, because they literally are all \"daddies\". My SIL/BIL have called each other Mommy and Daddy since their daughter was born.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:16:04", "owner": "gokblok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862047979540107, "text": "😂🤣🤣 i cant stoppppp laughing 🤣🤣🤣😭🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:11:26", "owner": "xtine511", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547516072049534, "text": "وش يعني", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:52:04", "owner": "salmbnhryz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925785211038982, "text": "How is the last kid going to look like he's grossed out when he has a bowl cut at the dinner table?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:15:31", "owner": "david.walsh.718", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051201188668077, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:10:36", "owner": "robertrodgers3995", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923682913189945, "text": "Hell nah! I am never calling my daddy or mommy! 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:01:00", "owner": "kuramavalentine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921263137198028, "text": "I'm french. Can someone explain to me please ?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:57:39", "owner": "kayrnou", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17917035126219400, "text": "Nothing Luke torturing the kids😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:56:28", "owner": "amanisch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900928093336129, "text": "It would be normal if you did it from the beginning", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:13:48", "owner": "an_ever_fading_22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030868007549972, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:57:22", "owner": "oo_ddin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909895603263565, "text": "Oh poor children 🤣 😮", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:23:13", "owner": "ali_baba.bd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005298902665888, "text": "The last girl with the  side eye😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:03:50", "owner": "saarah_mmd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113120164603631, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:58:30", "owner": "inesnininahazwe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930964768116481, "text": "😮😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:57:55", "owner": "boschmanpete", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979542606941231, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:57:29", "owner": "alecerna_90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901148506324577, "text": "يعني واذا شنو المشكله", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:19:36", "owner": "44_s_ss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084577208046839, "text": "So the logic of the teens is that they have 5 sisters and brothers because of magic? or what? 🤣Ewww mom and dad are saying naughty stuff… jsjsjs TEENS for sure 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:12:33", "owner": "_leo_nobrega", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987307956863966, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:10:22", "owner": "s_taqi_naqvi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901852771324934, "text": "From the little one to the elder one everyone knows what is being said ... family awareness at its peak 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:03:59", "owner": "singhomania", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046635779439784, "text": "And what is that? Daddy , and what ? why they so expressed?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:53:53", "owner": "beerlikebeer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940640341090815, "text": "Why is that an issue? Pinches gringos a todo le encuentran modo.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:45:24", "owner": "antizion77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547206190018092, "text": "That was insanely funny", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:44:49", "owner": "kmillion7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987244551913616, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:39:23", "owner": "chivo305", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184704085348259, "text": "I call my husband daddy and my kids don’t care.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:14:35", "owner": "on_point_event_bartending", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105282760722975, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣😭😭😭😭🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:13:01", "owner": "baconcheesemuskopf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987301410910699, "text": "„Dont laugh like that! That’s how you were made“", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:56:29", "owner": "lars_drillen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080490452167015, "text": "Traurig dass Kinder sich mit sowas auskennen", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:47:21", "owner": "meysam.te.mh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046831991459407, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:33:27", "owner": "silver_surfer_5.oh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062291504208216, "text": "How kids means that ?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:32:56", "owner": "noar777236", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041771198499806, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:29:35", "owner": "cristian3976", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099682051768834, "text": "Ruining that whole thing for the next gen 🤌🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:30:15", "owner": "t.shock.puwc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067440836110812, "text": "My grandmother actually does this constantly with my grandfather. Mothers side. Even as kids my parents and me a grandkid never bothered by it. That said she and he speak mostly Portuguese. They can of course speak English and use this in the English. I realize they have no idea how this can come off to some people.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:15:47", "owner": "kenneth_dias.n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074717996350293, "text": "The evil laugh at the beginning😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:05:49", "owner": "konstantin_hrtm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064392809166623, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:59:35", "owner": "stevenmarolda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18417889753113885, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:58:53", "owner": "stevenmarolda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847600606609477, "text": "My daughters hate when I call their step dad’Daddy’ tell them well I don’t have a daddy 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:53:41", "owner": "sabbiesan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18297299650274129, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:34:33", "owner": "atiqullahmohammady", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945266532949254, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:31:45", "owner": "itancha.khan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329687146213856, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:29:22", "owner": "simin__azimi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891562216241766, "text": "How you think you got HERE!!!!😎😎😎🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:20:13", "owner": "juniorb18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931514467136945, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:15:07", "owner": "huseynxan.agayev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104122720590960, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:04:21", "owner": "angel_eyes225", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087988462988262, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:01:50", "owner": "kronnick_1976", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18356397859161488, "text": "But our mothers called our dads daddy 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:46:41", "owner": "therealveev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888505123260158, "text": "Nah this is gross", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:43:52", "owner": "alexjmcarthur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060078983254296, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:30:41", "owner": "yudith.fernandez46", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18379008664151574, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:18:16", "owner": "mikemcdonough68", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011069000643601, "text": "The baby at the end😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:10:08", "owner": "patbo619", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182544076357659, "text": "The last one was diabolical 💀🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:02:15", "owner": "ralphfrommb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008914958650521, "text": "2😂👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:50:25", "owner": "poyan.moghadam.07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866199805432159, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:10:20", "owner": "livia_sol0307", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540953308011363, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:50:43", "owner": "ks75652_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915964540236971, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:43:52", "owner": "yonyleonram", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931514491136136, "text": "The main thing I noticed from this is children know what that means far too early", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:25:41", "owner": "jarviskid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106732087634991, "text": "The kids are so embarrassed at thier mom 😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:24:00", "owner": "official_easternprince", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096327727889068, "text": "Whats wrong?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:16:37", "owner": "antonius.prakarsa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882660688418948, "text": "Wait the last kid even knows these stuff 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:12:48", "owner": "nana_akwasi_sarfo_adjie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876754969352404, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:12:04", "owner": "elvinwood85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083291813036737, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:02:43", "owner": "niiteye_priest", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944426635064376, "text": "@nastashavasilieva 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:01:01", "owner": "usman_j205", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18535374586035711, "text": "That last girl just started her villain arc", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:53:39", "owner": "damecookie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099141298793881, "text": "🤣🤣🤣👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:38:02", "owner": "mehdii_malmir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015749591799893, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:35:51", "owner": "ilcapo.666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18208801729313496, "text": "Nah what is that kids hair in #1 bro looks like vector from fucking despicable me", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:31:15", "owner": "joshbeare6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086974109072226, "text": "En América hispana es tan normal que nos digan papi, papito, papá nuestras mujeres...", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:23:56", "owner": "maxi_t_ledesma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055605707319804, "text": "d look of disbelief", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:20:34", "owner": "suemohamed72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383350843194090, "text": "🤣🤣😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:19:07", "owner": "pawanlakra369", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105803287650206, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:10:54", "owner": "sidneymack847", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096980620656385, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:38:36", "owner": "fatemeh1378maa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902782636312798, "text": "I don't care. I'll be calling him daddy daddy daddy DAAAAAAADDDYYYYYYY all day long!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:29:11", "owner": "tinyshore24", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18155208388416077, "text": "@peter0ersted 😂 kan du huske ungerne da jeg sagde det til dig 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:29:09", "owner": "louise_solhoej", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099260281815014, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:27:56", "owner": "tdfam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980236692777916, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:24:59", "owner": "nash_mohamed78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071051927071696, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:23:06", "owner": "que.ball.146", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068623829611449, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:18:57", "owner": "r.madison7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144498097436909, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:18:38", "owner": "r.madison7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104865535728601, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:18:32", "owner": "r.madison7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067045082619411, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:11:55", "owner": "3ain9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085736432074151, "text": "They all thinking they got made by magic", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:56:34", "owner": "cupcakecutie280", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063689705531398, "text": "😭🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:52:03", "owner": "harrysuhedi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113478733581536, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:44:51", "owner": "pejess03_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092210044910787, "text": "The first one, her laugh is priceless!🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:13:42", "owner": "sir_sanka_lot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087206360316753, "text": "Is that bedroom stuff only in english ? Cause in French, we sometimes call ourselves \"papa\" or \"maman\" in real life in front of the kids, nothing \"weird\" 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:11:28", "owner": "mikaouul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129851704496375, "text": "Pl plat p", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:10:12", "owner": "vic_rom84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125324554507693, "text": "Daddy was a innocent word when I was a kid", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:07:39", "owner": "_thok_chom____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088485853777965, "text": "I wanna say this just for the sake of it. When the words mommy and daddy make us puke a little 😂 but it's so funny", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:58:59", "owner": "maevemew", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136644325464277, "text": "She said it's Bedroom stuff. How did she know? 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:58:36", "owner": "thereal_dubemanozie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070759847359983, "text": "Bedroom stuff 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:56:15", "owner": "kein_biervor.4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080336138160400, "text": "How do the younger ones know what that term is used for", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:33:31", "owner": "dr_van.gogh_vg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089495266757524, "text": "@sole_ful_soul hamare yahan to bacha hone k baad se daddy ar papa hi bola jata h 😂😂🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:24:12", "owner": "koi_ladki_hai_jab_wo_hasti_hai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856780375512230, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:07:27", "owner": "fadhilobaid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973635438951137, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:19:35", "owner": "praveensasindran", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098829280771850, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:17:31", "owner": "mnryhn3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18410698156187645, "text": "Biasanya panggil apa?😭🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:49:13", "owner": "gumina_02.22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322087651172255, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:39:40", "owner": "wheredoyoupoopandwhatdoyoueat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867604483497027, "text": "Sehr unangenehme Anspielungen (Pädophil)", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:23:38", "owner": "1988fred", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102926188669942, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:52:32", "owner": "michaelboboya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952763767045964, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:52:10", "owner": "ugly_silver", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112880743598629, "text": "Emang nya kenapa si? Gua ga ngerti 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:46:02", "owner": "assaskyblue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007962917654921, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:17:08", "owner": "official_mohkamsingh01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104419468669850, "text": "I understand it has a sexual meaning but what is it exactly ?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:16:38", "owner": "mushtateer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954339709037439, "text": "So how many kids do you want?\n-Yes!!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:01:00", "owner": "g0kalp_cetin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099377869750609, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:56:49", "owner": "x_nighthawk_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18208743151313549, "text": "I’m hollering🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:54:32", "owner": "jbuck.bawa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072561638603170, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:52:20", "owner": "mrfr3nkie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936857289982085, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:42:54", "owner": "jerrbearfff69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870287551398151, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:38:03", "owner": "vanisdewi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099296194701511, "text": "Lol 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:10:12", "owner": "m_dee002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085677014283125, "text": "The last one was the best! You could even see their thoughts saying “we will have another sibling soon!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:02:20", "owner": "anhe73", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012384059802493, "text": "\"Bedroom stuff\"..before she was born, it was everywhere stuff", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:44:08", "owner": "el_sr.edwinbh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865308745509087, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:39:14", "owner": "xxl_yooo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903008719315331, "text": "The thought of calling my husband daddy 🤮🤮🤮", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:08:45", "owner": "meanmaxine80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029634077746412, "text": "1st one 😭all kids were traumatized 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:51:32", "owner": "smartbinit2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867715051492981, "text": "Dis one na normal thing for my country 🇳🇬 lol but no be the same meaning 😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:47:48", "owner": "ekanniwa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086924542803840, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:33:00", "owner": "mrprendie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919794424203271, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:28:57", "owner": "teddyp03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18365675710088965, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:58:35", "owner": "jacy.vanalstine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078749890903763, "text": "Love the look on the kids faces 👉🇯🇲💐🇯🇲👈", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:44:35", "owner": "shangullshangfit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090045829745637, "text": "Emotional damadge", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:19:59", "owner": "drrobert.wilson1978", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847268473611121, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:12:34", "owner": "percykelkar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18173048350369140, "text": "But it's common for Indian deshi mom", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:11:18", "owner": "anil_s_ydv_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083067128041734, "text": "😂😂😂🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:27:09", "owner": "riyagalaxy20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155759701406933, "text": "I paid more attention to the description than to the video.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:47:02", "owner": "koalalindo6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095806747875790, "text": "Why those young kids know the meaning of that", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:43:56", "owner": "donaldstewart8626", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104578648581138, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:25:47", "owner": "ale.verdugob", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842278531632278, "text": "MOOOOOMMMM!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:11:05", "owner": "carpenter85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969733515824366, "text": "This is why my dog is called Daddy!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:05:58", "owner": "70s.exe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067951877617930, "text": "😮😮🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:59:48", "owner": "pranjal_rahangdale____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919322875067396, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:56:14", "owner": "bino_gui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891377503371748, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:43:11", "owner": "datg2016", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18208846234314811, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:37:21", "owner": "pardonmyswedish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926407291170039, "text": "@vekene94 😭🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:22:35", "owner": "varni_tjm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031307255537737, "text": "How do you like dinner daddy? Terrible 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:17:23", "owner": "j_o_fxtrader", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087095971812086, "text": "🤣 the little girl at the end i can't 🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:11:32", "owner": "bri1320257337", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148634218427078, "text": "It’s bedroom stuff not here between your kids 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:09:16", "owner": "i.am_the_joker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155209354408309, "text": "@lily_sweetsoul", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:48:50", "owner": "jabbabash12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109008166717649, "text": "i'm too asian for this", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:16:30", "owner": "mass.ardi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068655641575162, "text": "limiPhilanthropist explains to me", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:05:16", "owner": "1_sim_o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064168604166929, "text": "شنو معناهه يااا عراق", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:04:38", "owner": "h._.z23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18187171264345207, "text": "Calling someone you fuck daddy is disgusting", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:58:29", "owner": "ahahahahahahahahahahahahaha222", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082081469037865, "text": "Kids acting like they didn't say daddy and mommy when they were a few years younger 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:52:18", "owner": "ryuen58", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160333150404223, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:00:41", "owner": "lyasdiesel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842098918633197, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:57:47", "owner": "rihab._.gh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084922031083187, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:30:28", "owner": "mistert2006", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071243264068436, "text": "Terrible 🗿", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:29:35", "owner": "kaveh_kamaei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041798000701269, "text": "I did this accidentally 🤣my kids face", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:27:49", "owner": "brimama_143", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915208897088594, "text": "I don't get why people are actively calling there partners daddy 🤔 it sounds vile and like someone has daddy issues 🤮🤮🤮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:21:27", "owner": "karencreelie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992160597903520, "text": "@letizia_rin 😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:16:32", "owner": "gianluca.galliani.7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078784855914925, "text": "Why are the kids weirded out by it?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:56:44", "owner": "wisejazzer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137787067415272, "text": "🤮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:53:34", "owner": "i_can_not_run", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842369071630869, "text": "@lotchenpotchen #daddytjeerd", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:27:10", "owner": "hexbreakerdoom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075798560193491, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:26:59", "owner": "ottoszecsei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18163402315383886, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:15:04", "owner": "gmiles4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074850254257078, "text": "It's not like the f..ING in front of you chill", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:14:24", "owner": "barberamanuel27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18190931335334092, "text": "Why kids should know any of that?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:59:06", "owner": "aristotelisthd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884029882409126, "text": "@kaliemccleery we HAVE to do this when they're older", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:49:08", "owner": "jmack2391", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18523737502064830, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:43:49", "owner": "el_extra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095528146874686, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:42:55", "owner": "scorpiochild9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061231352540364, "text": "You can tell they are not Dominicans and I’m not taking about looks… Dominican kids are used to listed to their mom call her husband daddy 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:35:04", "owner": "hpolanco1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120170044527074, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:34:11", "owner": "victory_omogbai_esq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908589145266274, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:22:15", "owner": "ca_hairstyle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302913601269715, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:17:18", "owner": "frederiick_d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065928548145527, "text": "The Cups on the Table gave me the Rest at the Last one😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:06:25", "owner": "53ilyass", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080346944515820, "text": "The word my kids hate is also “moist” 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:05:25", "owner": "queenredbabe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861815092538534, "text": "I mean... What's wrong if a wife calling her husband daddy? What is the problem? It's not like a bad thing to say or something", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:00:48", "owner": "sunitatomar8747", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104979739729207, "text": "No cache ni una 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:49:04", "owner": "felipebp37", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004069781837870, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:44:36", "owner": "theresaladyluv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067206569111819, "text": "😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:35:37", "owner": "sweetly_mymy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950013363919454, "text": "🤣jajajajajajajs Dios que risaaa", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:33:25", "owner": "_stalife_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296863324283771, "text": "Better for your kids to remember cringing at their parents being too lovey than constant arguments", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:33:16", "owner": "nizon87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086216101963491, "text": "😂😂😂👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:33:09", "owner": "joe1950282", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18400618717121692, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:31:42", "owner": "marr_5552011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073827149351128, "text": "Number 2 needs a trim omll, the ends girl", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:30:28", "owner": "nordic_lavender", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962003616861631, "text": "Hey what daddy ane mommy means? I'm Brazilian idk whats means", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:28:49", "owner": "luiz_dudu98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132266404491052, "text": "I watched this 3 times 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:11:34", "owner": "selective_133", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917096446215401, "text": "So they all watch porn right", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:02:49", "owner": "moh1b_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105337552655304, "text": "😂🤣😂🤣🤣😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:46:59", "owner": "hatchetbear", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085387985062839, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:46:03", "owner": "jarealcharles2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074251130350177, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:46:00", "owner": "bunny34290", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084058642853871, "text": "That’s bedroom stuff 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:43:03", "owner": "ilopine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103436416734964, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:40:15", "owner": "rino_roofer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054572984650457, "text": "Bro the last video with the kid looking @ her mom is crazy", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:11:29", "owner": "schneider_million", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079864970133849, "text": "The little girls face reaction got me crazyyy as fuck🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:59:39", "owner": "aishhh3286", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304621858250119, "text": "Uhmm I know this is a joke but your moms really don't call your dads daddy???", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:54:11", "owner": "johnnypishere", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119869411546413, "text": "Last clip second last boys reaction 🧐😦😦😧", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:52:43", "owner": "bajiraokhedkar681", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105311482649803, "text": "Hate how this gen of mongrels sexualized a normal word like that", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:23:34", "owner": "m.trinci", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100895491745809, "text": "I don’t get this one. My daughter is 8 her mom and I have been separated over 5 years now and when we’re around each other I’m still daddy and she’s momma.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:03:37", "owner": "56long", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18177170635322608, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:45:05", "owner": "pipz.alves", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18332810491232351, "text": "Number 4 was unfazed.... My kind of people", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:44:00", "owner": "family_crushh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049363343391295, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:32:46", "owner": "evil_barett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908456308272718, "text": "The two sons synced up in a way they never thought possible lmao", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:19:11", "owner": "dhuggs_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075483896192875, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:14:48", "owner": "rouba.aboukheir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081283784281489, "text": "I love the 3rd daddy also 🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:57:32", "owner": "nujnujasuncion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870472336398040, "text": "@qveen_arbi", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:48:12", "owner": "jauntymighty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064594427426932, "text": "Those girls gonna call someone daddy in college 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:37:51", "owner": "adam_dox_paints", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919914880197743, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:33:57", "owner": "aranegavanessa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048116489458910, "text": "🤣😂🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:29:45", "owner": "mikeswaggedwards21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544340242020549, "text": "Calling a man you have sex with \"Daddy\" is repulsive 🤮🤢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:20:24", "owner": "srcstcshrw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18202820554316273, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:18:24", "owner": "payan2802", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042912647694972, "text": "How come those kids understand 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:15:54", "owner": "royaltyapparel25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100982098777396, "text": "#2 is the best", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:01:59", "owner": "project_kennedy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028044563750330, "text": "I can’t stand it when parents do this.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:58:46", "owner": "vissershoshana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085897924825932, "text": "The amount of time I'm watching this is unhealthy😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:58:14", "owner": "ibrahimmgang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867443851498117, "text": "😂😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:48:17", "owner": "deepaprasad1605", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074503295244260, "text": "Can someone please like my comment🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:43:31", "owner": "iam_olayinkami", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106212967637606, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:36:59", "owner": "joeee.zz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847134319610923, "text": "When we were kid's our mom used to call our dad \"Dad\" sometimes but not \"Daddy\" 😆. It never bothered me at all  probably because we were always a very outgoing family idk 🤷", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:25:17", "owner": "shelikesthed07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065624396574437, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:18:38", "owner": "allenharris3232", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953647801022234, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:17:39", "owner": "allenharris3232", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066139106424804, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:15:54", "owner": "allenharris3232", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100136473809518, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:15:17", "owner": "allenharris3232", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974553192959017, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:13:21", "owner": "allenharris3232", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544596871016896, "text": "Really in Africa it's normal, 😆😆😆", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:03:16", "owner": "mj_braveheart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069244886094607, "text": "The last girl, criminal offensive side eye 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:53:19", "owner": "guardianb12", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17951498589028534, "text": "Mooom😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:32:34", "owner": "fadekemhy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954528312897549, "text": "@elliereedd1", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:05:16", "owner": "nezz_erdem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926080648173966, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:58:52", "owner": "isack.002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986799855879791, "text": "This is way too funny 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:52:11", "owner": "lauren_23_pala", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095775913841520, "text": "Где перевод🤬🤬🤬", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:30:46", "owner": "kabar__939", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956811955010264, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:22:05", "owner": "___sandu.__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098800216810357, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂good one ☝️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:44:05", "owner": "_iam_theodore_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086020777829889, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:27:45", "owner": "nicolas.irimia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902091952315143, "text": "“ Mooom That’s bedrooms stuff “ 😹", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:17:30", "owner": "k_u_s_h__fdo__27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061878659197667, "text": "and what about waiting for them to hatch from the egg? and that little brat at the end... that's a bit much. don't give kids access to social media", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:14:01", "owner": "audi.gg4q", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061214675221713, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:39:37", "owner": "diogo_catano", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072207587341192, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:37:11", "owner": "sayyed_ierffan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980399160927274, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:13:23", "owner": "lulybig7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881866453419027, "text": "Diddy", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:11:42", "owner": "user806537841", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18377497021150820, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:59:01", "owner": "gimeosvaldo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098623978839525, "text": "I'm asian and i don't get it. Can anyone explain it?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:33:35", "owner": "dan.sebagainya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085866874998259, "text": "Whyyy ....", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:31:53", "owner": "khosongchemil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876975592442463, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:22:48", "owner": "behnam_kia24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060160475247223, "text": "Generation Youporn", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:03:36", "owner": "dieletztehoffnung_de", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095377876883537, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:47:32", "owner": "monquette", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18194191507333710, "text": "No one is going to think or say.How do the kids know that that's something bad and that's only in the bedroom?Where did they get the idea that that's where they should only say that", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:13:33", "owner": "willethecomedian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073100261027444, "text": "Last was horrible 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:11:01", "owner": "musharraf_rasool", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090614686738946, "text": "The last kid needs a better haircut, wtf was that? a mushroom? Go sue your barber", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:59:43", "owner": "mobn.karimi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338915941226493, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:40:22", "owner": "nicojameskent", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858736324492519, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:34:20", "owner": "gentalmentfriend", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171619825332055, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:14:38", "owner": "1.17yl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026221559776592, "text": "This generation must wiped out from this planet - it's normal family  things - but they are brainwashed from po** videos", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:05:49", "owner": "ahd.idan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083899343097742, "text": "But how does these kids know what daddy means. And how do they know that's bedroom stuff... 🤔🤔🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:56:46", "owner": "arifhbk5786", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054426002325399, "text": "@ange_271724", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:27:27", "owner": "arzel_mako_the_enchanting", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875267887361949, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:27:05", "owner": "twoonearraafi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932665917998945, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:12:25", "owner": "jesusramos1463", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869614594471983, "text": "Homeschool your kids", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:05:31", "owner": "mckenzieja", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083025350120874, "text": "NOOOPE second place actually cleared this whole line up 😂😂 she questioned reality and got to thinking about bedroom stuff for sure because it’s not here stuff 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:19:10", "owner": "d_beltz105", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105733903633649, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:11:06", "owner": "davidbarnes245", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870187327397681, "text": "This is all my kids ever hear. WTH is wrong with all you people?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:04:09", "owner": "hhammer907", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963985023851767, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:03:03", "owner": "dlourdes17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302944627268860, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:02:30", "owner": "mz_independent1202", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986150961873712, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:01:44", "owner": "otbkvc__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18375938563152902, "text": "This is reason enough to have children", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:43:14", "owner": "allbayleydoes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058440107641565, "text": "Wouldn't work in my house. My mom called my father daddy a lot so that we knew what to call him", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:03:57", "owner": "lala52878", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982101411772006, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:02:39", "owner": "iisanz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368299345092343, "text": "Making your kids cringe is one of the greatest joys a parent can have", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:48:27", "owner": "bernhardpucheruk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977958192947439, "text": "Bedroom studrdudhdudddddfuent 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:45:03", "owner": "skibi.misox_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083828885044037, "text": "Needed a good laugh,  thanks 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:44:44", "owner": "playinhooky_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965071714002859, "text": "Sorry, im spanish man, so i dont know what is the problem call Daddy at your husband", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:43:35", "owner": "le_chapois", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051649178359010, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:31:07", "owner": "janati.saman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098777680695253, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:26:56", "owner": "gamlin_sigma2.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057462074295699, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:26:09", "owner": "missus_nyx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064030616395952, "text": "Creo que de tanto escuchar que en Ecuador , colombia y Venezuela dicen papi o papito o papacito😂 (mujeres a sus parejas)", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:25:16", "owner": "a_andygenhis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088359979944961, "text": "The boys laugh and the girls gross out!!!!!😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:22:07", "owner": "mike_brinker_daddy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075772970238861, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:00:57", "owner": "navdeep_kumar23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092333965728805, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:54:29", "owner": "joepetty1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122728459524682, "text": "Es tipo ewwww. Jsjssj 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:51:00", "owner": "madrydg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070669607077177, "text": "the haircuts on the kids in the last clip… jfc\ni thought we got rid of mullets & bowl cuts", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:35:31", "owner": "drunkie.twins.being.basic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901532620321790, "text": "That little girl was disgusted", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:01:34", "owner": "thebigbadwo11f", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855990385567403, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:58:13", "owner": "fordjohnmichael", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100764712740626, "text": "I’ve been calling my husband daddy since our kids were babies so it’s totally normal to them to hear me say it 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:52:27", "owner": "soulshine_33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18319696207174504, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:34:02", "owner": "latierraqueelmundoolvido", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026014379584948, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:25:46", "owner": "pereira.miguel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890695111383195, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:23:14", "owner": "iabusemywife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18162586831387935, "text": "Its pretty natural to say \"daddy\". Especially when your kids.my mom says daddy in Spanish to my dad apparently  im use to it 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:18:37", "owner": "mystery_saja_huntrix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929531032141393, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:06:23", "owner": "sara.lee_rowlands", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882200776304597, "text": "Why does calling someone \"daddy\" have sexual connotations?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:04:52", "owner": "vasconceloscm89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868331230475212, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:45:38", "owner": "agrownasswomanboutique", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087465331976238, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:41:34", "owner": "_taffetaa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865364827438760, "text": "I dont find it weird bc my parents already did this and it felt normal. Dad would say go ask mommy and mom would say go ask daddy. And this was before daddy was used as a weird term😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:39:42", "owner": "falsehope911", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18330873601210143, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:32:40", "owner": "munnmia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892957810368996, "text": "That’s some gross pedophilia 💩!!! Not kinky, not sexy. JUST DISGUSTING!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:23:49", "owner": "joebob0484", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368180056088428, "text": "How do the kids recover?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:10:09", "owner": "natur_e_is", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095423617849323, "text": "When they're older they'll understand 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:01:34", "owner": "raymondsshamaniclife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087855865800092, "text": "The last family, how did the kids think they came to be? 😂🤣😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:53:36", "owner": "tejflow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879554527331403, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:59:59", "owner": "monkey2268", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18190174102336979, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:35:32", "owner": "dumblow_54", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087838927987868, "text": "My childish self would have gagged.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:32:08", "owner": "_aleirbag_gabriela", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114435070603326, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:31:45", "owner": "jose251rodriguez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133961533466869, "text": "Well no I’d call my husband daddy in front of my kids because that’s what they call him if I say his name then they’ll be like who’s that because they’d call him that so i would", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:26:00", "owner": "useless_girl_yummy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865449424436740, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:21:43", "owner": "rozrols", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008724659652337, "text": "The question is how they know in this age the meaning of Daddy in this way that all adult people knows? \nThat's not funny that's terrible 👎", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:04:22", "owner": "dimo.nouri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134150806487801, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T19:34:43", "owner": "marianachile2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894851272216734, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:53:43", "owner": "boogalew_4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096053947843679, "text": "Daughters always give the best reactions 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:40:06", "owner": "josh_emerson84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096586963831228, "text": "That poor little girl in the last one looked absolutely horrified that her momma just called dad \"daddy\"😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:15:25", "owner": "dylan.officer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957293304889121, "text": "Idont understand", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:53:33", "owner": "askr.khaled", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128818987496834, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:29:35", "owner": "kawle_yogesh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865505203434303, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:29:33", "owner": "kawle_yogesh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069416492582659, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:14:54", "owner": "shawnszocinskis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108951100529092, "text": "The first one was a Candice shout", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:11:01", "owner": "gino.haas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044822237483305, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:55:41", "owner": "johnintyre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18538839646036364, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:46:52", "owner": "zeus.athena2020", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063331331180185, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:29:08", "owner": "jessienhaj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119821717546289, "text": "@merle.w14 😆", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:28:31", "owner": "tastaturslaven", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084837065046475, "text": "Bedroom stuff👏🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:20:48", "owner": "talha771991", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18316631548221762, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:16:36", "owner": "_mirweys_ferdosi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113075062578396, "text": "its sad to see… kids are being exposed to too much adult content 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:09:28", "owner": "footloosestreamer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900285511180355, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:58:40", "owner": "mary7019808", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18399198616125875, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:58:01", "owner": "mary7019808", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065817878390412, "text": "Yall would go into a coma in the south.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:36:39", "owner": "stace.mill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036275522706799, "text": "Never so hard, Daddy!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:35:27", "owner": "pigeonguy52", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060577655234052, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:34:22", "owner": "mr_biotch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873354529377875, "text": "Children's have more knowledge than parents,how shameful", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:30:34", "owner": "mokarraomhossain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079293727927531, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:21:14", "owner": "alan.schumacher.10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888965182389532, "text": "We went childfree, but videos like this are the only thing that make me feel that I’ve missed out on something.  I’ll never have a little buddy to torment in ways that will shape their psyche forever.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:15:26", "owner": "chalkarts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865291183436365, "text": "J'ai pas compris", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:10:17", "owner": "mohh.vlx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085293728061597, "text": "I love the second one 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:07:14", "owner": "ss_13_85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026463035585396, "text": "@kngblkarot402", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:53:26", "owner": "luscious_babygurl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071371127607469, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:50:55", "owner": "_.superfly.__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080522123328160, "text": "Your kids have too much internet access if 10 year olds are understanding the sexual reference", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:47:48", "owner": "corbin.huber", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090107111301638, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:23:44", "owner": "76r__t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542126404043339, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:18:08", "owner": "itsme_tparks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045030272466440, "text": "Bedroom stuff😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:15:26", "owner": "japoo_685", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086833201971782, "text": "Emotional damage", "created_at": "2025-11-26T13:43:57", "owner": "vasileioyspyros", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18291464347272620, "text": "How do they think they got made??!!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T13:39:08", "owner": "the_fanny_bohn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085798619059079, "text": "That's bedroom stuff 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T13:38:48", "owner": "lorevanoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082584743511788, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T13:31:58", "owner": "sharmajikabeta.141", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926888959170698, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:58:39", "owner": "01diyako", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032967317738472, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:44:35", "owner": "kbeautydimishop.ir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084913655084736, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:23:36", "owner": "n.mst4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18340983037227040, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:29:18", "owner": "thegoodricecooker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18372905725155250, "text": "Whats is so strange about it ..", "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:13:28", "owner": "alex_jacob825", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18433562479105743, "text": "Number one the betrayal in little girl eyes dooo😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:04:56", "owner": "kelly_mk29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063200528563264, "text": "Bei uns schon normal 🤣😅🙈", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:53:06", "owner": "vampiragruft", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544497631052347, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:09:55", "owner": "smoses.ai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895334464358011, "text": "I’m a little worried the age some of these kids understanding the context.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:50:44", "owner": "bobthejedi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18335679226238683, "text": "Hahahaha 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:40:21", "owner": "marfil_oliver06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080000483177061, "text": "Have you “shame” in the US or…?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:26:50", "owner": "ste_llacad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999135756836202, "text": "What's Will doin?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:22:41", "owner": "hirak_in_knowledge07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104988184647896, "text": "that kid girl 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:15:47", "owner": "_shahbaz__ansari__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085348304095597, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:54:43", "owner": "alone_boy_mohit_90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030914762748195, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:23:32", "owner": "saraaliop26733", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031971191735843, "text": "@daryon1", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:17:47", "owner": "branz_438", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114030280574429, "text": "فهمونا يعلن خيركم", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:08:30", "owner": "mor7_ad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069056876088542, "text": "Side eye on last 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:02:23", "owner": "inain_wani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084577850009499, "text": "Bomba clat🔥....💣", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:51:28", "owner": "marvel_guy03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867477907494566, "text": "@mangoxp_", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:46:42", "owner": "bridge_and_shutter_photography", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090735391937406, "text": "The oldest kid are the best reaction", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:39:10", "owner": "fleshx215", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878484523430433, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:33:37", "owner": "gupta.vipul03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091710172904891, "text": "Kids reactions are funny, but can’t say it’s a trend. I remember growing up and my parents called each other mom/dad/daddy. My siblings did the same with their kids. It was a way to get kids to know who you were talking to especially if you don’t want kids calling you by your name.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:33:25", "owner": "feliciabeier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086553193946869, "text": "Making your kids cringe - priceless! 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:32:32", "owner": "andrey_andrikov_arcane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366888721090491, "text": "\"bedroom stuff\" 🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:01:04", "owner": "marodarb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102619873664382, "text": "Yea I don't get this shit at all....", "created_at": "2025-11-26T04:55:26", "owner": "kennethdean401", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006010754819437, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-26T04:33:02", "owner": "its_danny_27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936356062102086, "text": "\"That's bedroom stuff\" got me 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T04:19:05", "owner": "sohanur_sohan03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072751199586230, "text": "😂👏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:43:09", "owner": "_mahdin_khan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978304668947195, "text": "Is that bad?. 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:33:40", "owner": "samies96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947452605935935, "text": "How do these kids think they were made😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:32:01", "owner": "mnm_matt81", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905780557277795, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:15:40", "owner": "laurarodriguez5105", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036162845723469, "text": "With the last one, where'd all them kids think they came from?😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:47:36", "owner": "seanwrodgers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904144651290496, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:37:42", "owner": "keithsawyer24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900449353336148, "text": "Ummm so is it weird then that my parents call each other mommy/daddy on a daily basis? Like just for communication 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:29:10", "owner": "claytonthellman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863913748520563, "text": "Torturing and embarrassing your kids is so much fun!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:20:17", "owner": "da_gustafson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065006336152769, "text": "What's wrong, it's actually normal in Indonesia. I mean, father will call mother just like how the child calls \"mama\", \"ibu\", \"mami\", and vice versa, mother will call \"daddy\", \"papa\", \"ayah\". Like speaking for children.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:16:44", "owner": "haiii_its.me_itutt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114823234599061, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:42:33", "owner": "only_bouba25k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049627571689436, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:37:43", "owner": "malcolm.withers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100682047706403, "text": "it's a normal things in my family, like my mother and us (the children) calling my father \"pa\", and my father and us calling my mother \"ma\"🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:30:55", "owner": "zahran.f.a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088925860763788, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:30:37", "owner": "joyhijara_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952857091042827, "text": "Embarrassing your kids is one of life’s great pleasures. 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:13:33", "owner": "floriankubes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102461947662273, "text": "That's bedroom stuff, not here stuff 🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:07:07", "owner": "engineerin.made.it.all.possibl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086725585965422, "text": "I grew up with my grammacalling my grampa \"papi\" or \"Daddy\" didn't think anything of it till I found my own 🤣😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:39:58", "owner": "jtownsend7289", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102833836672516, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:35:53", "owner": "rachid_cls", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932425201129006, "text": "I would have left right there", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:27:47", "owner": "lucas_chapa1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085682563967395, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:25:04", "owner": "raulskonto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940820175962141, "text": "Lmao", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:22:00", "owner": "pabloreyes2243", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929055451119935, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:07:48", "owner": "mike_1970s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146692120436337, "text": "Creepy... always was", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:11:53", "owner": "jgordon1974", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974614872957523, "text": "@ellabailey_24", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:09:27", "owner": "amella46", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095690629854895, "text": "So daddy is now bad?this children def", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:53:29", "owner": "wyl_shammal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934251751103935, "text": "Then you call her Kitty Cat 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:45:23", "owner": "shawn.barnhurst", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953051391908017, "text": "By the time any kid I have is a teenager, they'll be used to it 😉", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:27:23", "owner": "arliss_feathergill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952799224022589, "text": "They get alarmed there, but in Latin America it's very common and we love it 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:03:19", "owner": "dulloab27f", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063612446624758, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:44:03", "owner": "16jtx3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050426213382920, "text": "… lots of kids having to listen to this … disrespectful 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:38:11", "owner": "italorw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892706197367945, "text": "The last one always kill me🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:32:07", "owner": "i150819", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18246123664295200, "text": "Non-native here: why do little girls make weird faces too? If it's something from the ‘bedroom’, what meaning do they give it?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:30:49", "owner": "aleskimal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047962505426650, "text": "🤣😂🤣😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:30:11", "owner": "austinmumphery", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131586340489570, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:07:01", "owner": "cryptosporidie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063507860186154, "text": "Somebody, Can Explain because I’m French and I don’t Understand", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:51:17", "owner": "vikitor_09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064010489429766, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:40:40", "owner": "urcstudio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018613910789743, "text": "Salt and pepper was best 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:23:28", "owner": "armaanrana717", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067557863116471, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:08:32", "owner": "known_as_rahin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087465304979255, "text": "I mean these mommies have lots of babies!😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:02:34", "owner": "omid_tzu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901396711326397, "text": "How did she know it's a bedroom stuff.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:01:11", "owner": "martbesh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021621050784856, "text": "????", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:58:26", "owner": "torresnezz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112281646609185, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:41:49", "owner": "mckale.dean26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991219236904019, "text": "That’s bedroom 🤣🤣🤣 not here in front of the kids", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:17:23", "owner": "alex_and_chill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898363657345247, "text": "Can Someone explain me? I'm Brazilian and don't speak english Very well", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:10:11", "owner": "eduardolimapaes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123105505524141, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂kids reacting 😮", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:08:55", "owner": "mickbeesmeds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917538013214556, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:05:07", "owner": "max_garysh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17924006457184490, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:26:07", "owner": "k7kuro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925807357173268, "text": "Now say it in Spanish ahhh papiiiii 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:24:11", "owner": "lady.carolina25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899444290183638, "text": "Errr do we need to retire daddy then? 🤷‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:15:05", "owner": "chrisheason", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061294724224979, "text": "The terrible dad is terrible", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:01:44", "owner": "nsoforjulieth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070792178580449, "text": "Only legend can understand😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:01:05", "owner": "shailesh_jaiswal_6999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872285293461458, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:51:31", "owner": "joelmathew76002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078888758141591, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:48:37", "owner": "reshaping_ralf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088814375478474, "text": "Lifetime trauma is 60 seconds 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:46:49", "owner": "ash.cz10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084120863008135, "text": "Thats bedroom stuffs🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:25:52", "owner": "itsnot_nishan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376606288154830, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:16:53", "owner": "gokcilerbergin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845597989614974, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:03:22", "owner": "ausamaalqutob", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910112566255119, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:52:11", "owner": "lmlawt_420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065459870139579, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:59:19", "owner": "javali_art99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097818169833869, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:41:31", "owner": "_saqib._.1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17900153322180889, "text": "America cooked 🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:12:14", "owner": "_no__oman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063707270397581, "text": "Americans", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:51:49", "owner": "nain_raza97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075498725189086, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:15:22", "owner": "whats_up_roy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031196972729298, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:57:17", "owner": "abhinav4639", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061579028202096, "text": "???? My Mom call my dad daddy. I call my daddy, daddy and my mom, mommy. West is sometimes weird. That's why I am concerned about my Christian American friends. The divorce rate is almost 50%. The cheating rate of husband when the wife is pregnant is 20%.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:55:04", "owner": "wisdomireceived", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950753890028484, "text": "I think it’s just me on this take… this isn’t the flex we think it is…. 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:40:15", "owner": "dbrand_deji", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546013720018772, "text": "Means uhh ?? Can any one plz explain", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:36:42", "owner": "mr.yuvi_yt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159083320403835, "text": "I am worried how kids such little ages know it", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:30:43", "owner": "rubianaaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002088587681278, "text": "The death from cringe is priceless!!", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:16:23", "owner": "taaliba80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047445392423412, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:16:17", "owner": "hadjilah__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917603587221189, "text": "If i call my husband babe so my twins also call they father with babe 😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:07:10", "owner": "leerachman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078656723326580, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:06:34", "owner": "nice_mantinz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879930256326975, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:01:47", "owner": "rdn_dewaa16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078772345920333, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:50:24", "owner": "yi.9as", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930887764114535, "text": "Déjà la question est \"pourquoi les jeunes enfants réagissent bizarrement ce mot 🙄😅🤣😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:34:14", "owner": "miti_taps987", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18430723942108867, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:31:51", "owner": "akashh____m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541898326045700, "text": "In the car daughter reaction is so good 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:16:42", "owner": "christopherseiminlun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897090394345415, "text": "ternyata masalah internasioanl🤣🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:13:45", "owner": "lusiansfr.ii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062443844563824, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:06:57", "owner": "agnieszka.konarska.16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007278152655895, "text": "Ok I get the joke....but don't yalls parents call each other mommy and daddy?!?!?😅", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:52:19", "owner": "mytho.art", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094392475860665, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:11:12", "owner": "k2_billy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139036555458633, "text": "Объясните пожалуйста? Что такого что они говорят Папочка?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:10:06", "owner": "abdy.temirbayev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091337036495382, "text": "Salt & pepper 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:57:51", "owner": "andreambaks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041833694705666, "text": "How does little one know", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:52:19", "owner": "sumeethkumar94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908220085269929, "text": "I think my favourite thing is the way the groups of kids immediately turn and look at each other. Like did y’all motherfuckers hear this shit too", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:12:08", "owner": "mitchisawkward", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030825506541126, "text": "I don't get it. how parents call their significant one in front of the kids?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:01:31", "owner": "fennec_printer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033785963727250, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T06:47:48", "owner": "riskapretty_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543176914047708, "text": "I didn't know that was weird. both my wife and I call each other those", "created_at": "2025-11-25T06:04:48", "owner": "garysavich", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057747581290754, "text": "It's time to boom boom😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:45:40", "owner": "aristocrat_monsieur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946328599072190, "text": "Yeah Thats RIGHT", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:09:07", "owner": "llantas_calientes3006", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082776781877630, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T04:34:09", "owner": "catalaya_ros", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541049599037377, "text": "Prove of they started watching porn", "created_at": "2025-11-25T04:33:14", "owner": "tbaglyve", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049582217400386, "text": "I cannot WAIT to pull this BS with my 4 when they’re teens 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-25T04:10:00", "owner": "btgn513", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920368681197031, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T04:02:33", "owner": "kb_grg123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134546527486977, "text": "Kids looked traumatized 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-25T04:00:03", "owner": "asm0deus____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18538771918015606, "text": "Didn’t know this was considered weird.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:43:37", "owner": "thejaquio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872687347457172, "text": "2 number clips girl's thighs 🤤", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:14:53", "owner": "arshxn_01", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18348999700203108, "text": "They be looking so disgusted. 🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:55:08", "owner": "daninicole_85_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062234921546925, "text": "The last one she killed me 🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:54:59", "owner": "zuruck_zum_schwarz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842963905625067, "text": "What does it mean daddy??😂😂😂😂 I think it’s like our daddy 😂😂It’s like carry way😀😂Noo????? In my country it’s not bad word it’s like forexample moms says to kids our daddy comes soon from work or our dady is tired or hungry something like that but exactly not bad way 😀Someone explain me please 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:49:06", "owner": "jamilisazade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088893248479692, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:45:36", "owner": "dfifthwheel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080699366154829, "text": "How would the youngest understand though?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:28:49", "owner": "paytoncraft7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979858842945427, "text": "We is Daddy in the house all the time however, it’s the way I say it sometimes (on purpose), that gets my teenager all freaked out", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:20:48", "owner": "buttercuptazsquirrel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072992264010481, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:15:45", "owner": "enigmaguy2011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159911578400227, "text": "Que viagem kkk alguém sabe explicar a equivalência em português?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:01:19", "owner": "tinho.roots", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060415430550315, "text": "Você pode explicar essa brincadeira em Português do Brasil?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:37:02", "owner": "heliomar75934", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066155693129125, "text": "Snowflakes", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:34:01", "owner": "ferceya_cr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852041731547801, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:32:15", "owner": "mohamed44438", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902462194313519, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:25:30", "owner": "ezzasworld", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086053991071589, "text": "Throw in a “papi” see what happens 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:21:49", "owner": "sagemaddi1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988401912907159, "text": "What's up? Why this is funny?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:06:30", "owner": "nelsonabreufilho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081673871152247, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T00:57:25", "owner": "__s_kumar__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917857372204900, "text": "I didn't understand anything, why do they look like that when the mother says that?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T00:38:03", "owner": "ner_o4q", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980298123928033, "text": "Eu ja vi esses vídeos um zilhão de vezes, até acho engraçado, mas não entendo pq pega tão mal. Fico me perguntando se tem um equivalente em português 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T00:34:35", "owner": "favarofernando88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083195066096357, "text": "The girl with the yellow cup 😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T00:29:30", "owner": "aarjuhiyaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049156754397659, "text": "My mom always referred to my dad as \"daddy\" because that's what my siblings and I called him.  If she used \"dad\" it was always in reference to her own father.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T00:24:48", "owner": "doublestitch1993", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052749263675998, "text": "My husband and I call each other mommy/daddy.. it's our names to our kids.. we have always done it so they don't give us the look", "created_at": "2025-11-25T00:20:04", "owner": "garlingerlaura", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18166229734387667, "text": "Number 3 wanted to jump out of the car immediately 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T00:05:15", "owner": "nunovialpando", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027775178569130, "text": "Last one is that Will Byers in the back", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:47:50", "owner": "bigtuck084", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083914160018866, "text": "Traumatizando crianças em 3,2,1......", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:28:15", "owner": "khell.paes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888263137391540, "text": "I think I would accidentally not just pretend to but genuinely ram the fork into my hand to override this perception", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:27:10", "owner": "lil.blue.bird", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100721398705189, "text": "Noticing a trend here", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:26:36", "owner": "hoopshopkins666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547162951049984, "text": "The last one girl killed me😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:10:33", "owner": "h.a.u.s1981", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902068357321222, "text": "If they didn't grow up hearing it ya'll doing something wrong😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:09:33", "owner": "harley_mobbin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119791510543783, "text": "My grandma called my grandaddy this all their lives. And he called her “Mama”. So it’s never felt weird to me one bit", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:07:46", "owner": "deano__06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902581603167644, "text": "I always call my husband daddy lol my kiddo (8) does not care haha.", "created_at": "2025-11-24T22:56:11", "owner": "cheyvengeance", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909947410256091, "text": "Hahahaha hahahaha hahahaha hahahaha! Ohhh the realization that your parents are people too!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-24T22:00:16", "owner": "towers_1637", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905267506142151, "text": "🤣😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-24T21:56:26", "owner": "goose.265424", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003085238821295, "text": "Ummm the guy holding his mouth on the last one should be doing that while looking at his haircut bahaha", "created_at": "2025-11-24T21:48:31", "owner": "izzie_m_pat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875576146443131, "text": "The little girls look in No.1 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T21:47:05", "owner": "daviesbunny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929583463015051, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T21:24:01", "owner": "tayyab.adeel007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078380080942645, "text": "@jwilson323 do it", "created_at": "2025-11-24T21:22:20", "owner": "zaq.20", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18372558115159541, "text": "Please \"Please, could you explain to me, if you don't mind, why the expression 'daddy' is embarrassing?\"", "created_at": "2025-11-24T21:10:14", "owner": "rodrigogonzalez6435", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164061748391181, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T20:57:35", "owner": "silverbackbowens", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853437799581401, "text": "Why is it weird for mom to say daddy?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T20:55:53", "owner": "kmynate2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087104237506567, "text": "so no", "created_at": "2025-11-24T20:54:53", "owner": "purely.dior", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989453508911069, "text": "✨ that's bedroom stuff ✨🤣 killing me", "created_at": "2025-11-24T20:50:10", "owner": "_ribaal_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153452107416235, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T20:37:31", "owner": "eunjoli33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541290769035969, "text": "Fcking with your kids is really what parenting is about.  Hats off to everyone involved.", "created_at": "2025-11-24T20:34:08", "owner": "whynottravelstore", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880392454423846, "text": "🤣🤣😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T20:29:44", "owner": "allansylvester10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028144292562859, "text": "Weird trend calling your partner daddy. Why would anyone do that? Who wants to think of there dad during intercorse", "created_at": "2025-11-24T20:08:57", "owner": "juliehunt3734", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991093989731189, "text": "😂😂🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-24T20:01:44", "owner": "lionwoman1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165784711388226, "text": "No entendí", "created_at": "2025-11-24T19:57:34", "owner": "manu_gnr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928976872017763, "text": "The last one was the smoothest one lol", "created_at": "2025-11-24T19:24:00", "owner": "tscfox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902353516162236, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T19:17:56", "owner": "tamaldas72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049038935405458, "text": "What's with these kid's stupid haircut", "created_at": "2025-11-24T19:04:26", "owner": "ozzieashen03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18433371778128086, "text": "Don't be grossed out, if she didn't call him daddy you wouldn't be here. What do you think kept him from pulling out?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:58:43", "owner": "t3xasm4de", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847208815586274, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:54:05", "owner": "m.arsalan_k4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18395937280133432, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:25:08", "owner": "_almavieja", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164211511380862, "text": "It was fine when you were 2. You’ve changed…", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:25:07", "owner": "mallory_who_hikes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915575680238386, "text": "The last one has me on the fucking floor 🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:13:47", "owner": "alleykrookz_boss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894018010224672, "text": "No...not in front of the kids", "created_at": "2025-11-24T17:38:41", "owner": "hoover_prime", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933167560106413, "text": "That diabolical laugh is chef's kiss....\"bwoohahaha...hahaha\"😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-24T17:34:39", "owner": "thewhittierhousewife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114859846564446, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-24T17:02:11", "owner": "itx._.safiullah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18244803061294768, "text": "👁️BoMbAsTiC sIdEyE👁️👄👁️👀", "created_at": "2025-11-24T16:58:01", "owner": "itsmehanna643", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18436936642097395, "text": "Terrible 😏😏😏", "created_at": "2025-11-24T16:57:14", "owner": "its_ayhan.m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070351508347108, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-24T16:53:34", "owner": "heyflaskamp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126758497504603, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T16:21:43", "owner": "manou_a2601", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069607424579282, "text": "Third one is mind blowing 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T16:11:02", "owner": "hassanshokat19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18382235293150881, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T16:07:46", "owner": "jaripitkaranta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18516513745065763, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:38:28", "owner": "santanacardozo5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086597689979943, "text": "@nleachet23  Kep strikes again with #1", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:37:44", "owner": "a.tribe.of.5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080321726172957, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:32:29", "owner": "_panadol_extra7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081777770145304, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:24:20", "owner": "exilevern", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894172612220201, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:19:32", "owner": "bina_bina2022", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18418796791112397, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:51:58", "owner": "restyms", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18272739706305151, "text": "😂😂😂🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:45:49", "owner": "dr_shirazpt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060890756232502, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:44:33", "owner": "fattana_1966", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061100888219429, "text": "There is no hater like a teenage daughter", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:30:17", "owner": "mekkah23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008567990653638, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:16:16", "owner": "azni.hadi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024569249590373, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:15:22", "owner": "2.2wrs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086029403051159, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:00:32", "owner": "giggs_officiall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089030990305190, "text": "4,5", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:58:31", "owner": "muhammad_shifat_hossen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030355877546222, "text": "I'm asian, i don't understand, please tell me why?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:55:01", "owner": "giffari_rmdhni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930991204134385, "text": "Sooooo… kids fail to do chores = turn up the bedroom talk. 👏", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:50:23", "owner": "updatedklee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953058190023426, "text": "The funny thing is in their age they already know the concept 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:49:11", "owner": "marioru4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899476678339021, "text": "Di Indonesia itu adalah hal biasa 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:32:28", "owner": "zaid.aiman59", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132200620490599, "text": "Can someone explain to me what is the problem?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:25:06", "owner": "dr.n7x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070223435373314, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:11:22", "owner": "ozo_wan_gie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934938361130347, "text": "“ that bedroom stuff “ 💅", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:00:42", "owner": "its_.hammad_", "likes": 16}, {"id": 18087096304795369, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:52:01", "owner": "conork_23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891452188244565, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:45:46", "owner": "dre0428", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071986505594534, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:40:16", "owner": "_.cattwomen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087364051961321, "text": "Nothing wrong with this. My wife calls me “Daddy” all the time in front of our family.  Because I’m the dad of the family!…plain and simple.  Everyone knows this, everyone respects this.", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:24:08", "owner": "artist_ronkramer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068146547381709, "text": "Bedroom stuff 😂😂😂 funny but here in France i dont think there would be reactions like that, Will try it 🙃", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:19:14", "owner": "romainluchard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103501033661115, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:35:51", "owner": "menaca2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948588412062933, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:57:34", "owner": "fhime_nouri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069532502359880, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:42:04", "owner": "kootsi_c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065048663159416, "text": "Can someone explain to me please? Thanks)", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:38:44", "owner": "the_mike_3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025941956774644, "text": "Last one with Will's haircut....must be a dare lmao😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:29:15", "owner": "_._sithija_._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080335268139508, "text": "I love all the kids reaction 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-24T09:37:54", "owner": "nananirmala", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086392819952939, "text": "هیچ وقت نمیشه با فطرت انسان جنگید", "created_at": "2025-11-24T09:34:05", "owner": "smaeel_gorgani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076924676223703, "text": "Criminal offensive side eye", "created_at": "2025-11-24T09:27:34", "owner": "chvkwvebvka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543900535058069, "text": "So the kidz watch porno 🫣🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-24T08:49:43", "owner": "thommy.ts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18300159694280918, "text": "These children should be appreciative that their mom still thinks paunchy, bear bellied man daddy... that's peak love moment.", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:58:17", "owner": "rajshreeniharika", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063757100434505, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:57:05", "owner": "sexto777_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915120799086101, "text": "Can explain", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:47:49", "owner": "suren_mathan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095641291878414, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:14:38", "owner": "lisaayudstr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988101162884928, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:01:42", "owner": "mohammad_hamid1203", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032377787721849, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:41:08", "owner": "wiviiina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367222180082954, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:38:52", "owner": "laghertha_80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075278351236883, "text": "We all know what that means😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:36:11", "owner": "miabutterfly2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026729498775577, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:12:13", "owner": "niallcrazyhorse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18198614590320069, "text": "Will Byers at the end", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:08:59", "owner": "ran.dy1440", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18380928283144633, "text": "@natalie_burgess87 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:03:53", "owner": "_rjs_82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075058352247551, "text": "The only embarassment my kids are gonna have 😌", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:53:34", "owner": "priyeaah_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912034024248737, "text": "Bombastic side eye😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:09:35", "owner": "______s__o__f__i__y__a______", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113887993599035, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:05:16", "owner": "kuttuzz_hentry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18379998097146713, "text": "That side eye 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:54:25", "owner": "focussolomon22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298735696284674, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:48:02", "owner": "walterlabarrete", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076902481953034, "text": "(That's bedroom stuff) lmao  that got me", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:43:29", "owner": "boomjayyyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953918190905173, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:32:34", "owner": "moonlongkong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164775925385558, "text": "Picture and next to you say I love you Daddy to my crusty BS", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:30:25", "owner": "jr6427743", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060563402240541, "text": "😂😂😂😂🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:22:36", "owner": "siberianknight0143", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060269759540753, "text": "Does calling me Dad and my calling my wife Mom make us weird?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:16:39", "owner": "dukejones64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086731489805123, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:12:47", "owner": "aveimichael", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18421364704112722, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:10:50", "owner": "brooksiew83", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966115749989700, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:04:46", "owner": "deathdealer4078", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098830228811117, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:30:54", "owner": "luckykumawattt02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546780718054242, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:25:01", "owner": "paul_boem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993726480852530, "text": "That dude at the very end ⬆️⬆️", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:24:18", "owner": "paul_boem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879008713430345, "text": "يعني يبيعون علينه مثليات بس ب الافلام 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:14:11", "owner": "14im1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882014107304812, "text": "My mom calls my dad \"Daddy\" almost all time. So for me, it's quite normal, I guess.", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:12:50", "owner": "val_fernandez2004", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139979839409696, "text": "In my family unfortunately it’s a very commonality", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:10:51", "owner": "landanthecool", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863711248517386, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:08:58", "owner": "spanishfemale1983", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881975665309037, "text": "😂😂😂😮🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:08:31", "owner": "raihan_sekh_143", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061978439204544, "text": "I can’t wait to get to this age with a teenager tbh cx \nI have fun embarrassing my nieces but it would be 100x more fun with my own kid cx", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:01:43", "owner": "tantrumtorres", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085177651971768, "text": "The little girl", "created_at": "2025-11-24T02:38:32", "owner": "i_like_dried_mango", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337655299227254, "text": "It's Papi...kids are use to it now...next", "created_at": "2025-11-24T02:38:21", "owner": "bill1174", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18297120310287615, "text": "아빠라고 부르는게 어느정도의 수위이길래 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T02:35:50", "owner": "ginnee93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084802451063874, "text": "Excellent", "created_at": "2025-11-24T02:24:50", "owner": "clint.robinson.3192", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103288936598133, "text": "If your young kids find that weird somewhere as a parent you fucked up", "created_at": "2025-11-24T02:18:58", "owner": "kelly_g_796", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085675034051394, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T02:09:35", "owner": "stephangiehl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103433791678505, "text": "نظر عيونها 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T02:04:14", "owner": "bader203q", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182801467357896, "text": "Astaghfirullah 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:43:19", "owner": "tasnifshiron.rs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109575760539423, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:18:15", "owner": "_abdelhak_ayach_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069200261524968, "text": "Es 1 demostración de cariño...\nO significa otra cosa?...\nEs papito, no?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:01:22", "owner": "rubinho.74", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114352078504967, "text": "It could be worse, there really be some parents who get freaky in the sheets while the spawns are home and they're loud as shit", "created_at": "2025-11-24T00:35:08", "owner": "bet4_pl4gue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062267474198734, "text": "She fr said bedroom stuff not here stuff🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-24T00:34:23", "owner": "averybartley6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061061795229855, "text": "Aqui no Brasil tão borms", "created_at": "2025-11-24T00:02:13", "owner": "abdaferreira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963960045990027, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T23:55:26", "owner": "kaua.9809", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104682937729131, "text": "Guys what is your problem with pants?", "created_at": "2025-11-23T23:40:58", "owner": "pn9y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024414212592786, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T23:40:34", "owner": "colindlevis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842351611625722, "text": "I don’t see what’s weird???", "created_at": "2025-11-23T23:37:17", "owner": "03_moradel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099151597702022, "text": "One way to traumatize your kids real quick", "created_at": "2025-11-23T23:34:03", "owner": "vessels_girl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18167196205378738, "text": "The fact that children that young know that the word has sexual connotations means they already failed as parents.", "created_at": "2025-11-23T23:30:49", "owner": "thegreatratedr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862154833536650, "text": "<<<<<", "created_at": "2025-11-23T23:10:54", "owner": "tankerdad27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082476245140215, "text": "The bowl haircut at the end.  Lmfao", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:59:28", "owner": "ba21ba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18565575019012168, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣👊🏾👊🏾", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:50:43", "owner": "m3woodley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143053921448143, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:41:31", "owner": "khawarsheraz2011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113019100604286, "text": "I dont get it ?", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:05:37", "owner": "drsupermonkey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928251625146393, "text": "When we were burying my grandma, one of my grandpas friends was like where are you going to go when you get buried? My grandpa: I’m going on top of her. Shit I’ve been on top of her for 39 years! \nMy uncle and I looked at each other like gaaaaawwwsshhhh 😩 🤦🏻‍♀️ 🤷🏻‍♀️ I was like you got kids (my uncle) and grandkids (me) in the room! (But we’re grown ass adults) 🤣😂🤣😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T21:52:37", "owner": "mxdcornflakes7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988219650859948, "text": "The first and the last 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T21:52:25", "owner": "n_91p", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085448006499692, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T21:49:00", "owner": "ofc_itsaysha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961990029861511, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T21:34:20", "owner": "terrencejamescoleman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854603242571484, "text": "Calling Daddy is so nasty!", "created_at": "2025-11-23T21:25:09", "owner": "ferreiraruipedro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134038351477503, "text": "حد يفهمني ياخوان بالله عليكم الي فاهم يفهمنيييي 🙂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T21:24:54", "owner": "motaz____prvvv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086882881972037, "text": "Qual o problema de usar o daddy?", "created_at": "2025-11-23T21:08:52", "owner": "caliljunior_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049091075660981, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T21:01:26", "owner": "arnoldsabugara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950242701922011, "text": "The side eyes are extreme lol", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:58:33", "owner": "moca_cupcake", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061450052637803, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:51:57", "owner": "cesaltinomonteiro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936662346980906, "text": "@bby_roo", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:32:43", "owner": "vcyux", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051039467356843, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:31:57", "owner": "king_infamousz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541935706003611, "text": "Number 2 has good upbringing", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:16:27", "owner": "mikesss.14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086309710824205, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:06:09", "owner": "falt_jeff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894601327217802, "text": "This is some newer generation kids freaking out cuz look here all of us country folk blue collar southern south Florida and Georgia and country people ... My dad would always call my mom mama and my mom would always call my dad dad when she called him to do something in the house or he needed her or something he said moma come here for a second... These kids now are just gutter brain I guess thinking nasty", "created_at": "2025-11-23T19:59:21", "owner": "lealssikes85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085021759828788, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T19:54:35", "owner": "north_decotah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295335718277198, "text": "The fact that they all know what it means makes it funnier😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T19:39:15", "owner": "vrsmith21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989836554737257, "text": "Did he say terrible with your kids around?", "created_at": "2025-11-23T19:38:24", "owner": "dr.brigitta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087783862769210, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T19:36:21", "owner": "sahotra2526", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099916873692227, "text": "😂😂😂👏", "created_at": "2025-11-23T19:35:29", "owner": "sahotra2526", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083674394091031, "text": "remember when it used to be a cute word?", "created_at": "2025-11-23T19:16:20", "owner": "spac3yca53y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064200821161666, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-23T19:06:55", "owner": "ivette8166", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862213909535637, "text": "The last video though. that bombastic side eye, Crimmmmmminnnnal offensive side eye 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T18:51:25", "owner": "helennwosuvictor", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17993104541722128, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T18:41:34", "owner": "ayalfkihi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061028744636272, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T18:33:19", "owner": "dy_lao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936505359978964, "text": "Look at the eyes", "created_at": "2025-11-23T18:12:06", "owner": "china54doll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873811234371191, "text": "Both sons on the last one are proud and disgusted with their father lmfao 🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-23T18:03:32", "owner": "threat_level_pax", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17905254123142288, "text": "I think Daddy has been sexualized by the porn industry and the exposure to kids has created the weirdness of a spouse calling the husband \"daddy\" makes them weirded out. The reactions are funny, but when you think why they are reacting this way..m it's kind of sad that kids are exposed to so much that something that was once innocent, is now looked at grossly.", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:33:35", "owner": "andrew2_21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954209698019007, "text": "What is wrong with that phrase? I just don't get it! :(.", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:31:15", "owner": "ne.soham.mitra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298484950261780, "text": "Salt & pepper 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:28:52", "owner": "ajibolaseun_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111055846598237, "text": "That haircut 🫡", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:27:20", "owner": "kray4_3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046789550439574, "text": "this is so awkward", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:17:56", "owner": "slowmundane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884609770405045, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:16:32", "owner": "visit.to.miami", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18411757051136558, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:08:46", "owner": "elizabethenigmaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053544983335523, "text": "What is daddy", "created_at": "2025-11-23T16:26:51", "owner": "otashko11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872444338461183, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T16:17:38", "owner": "yoo2963", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132099022489198, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T16:06:55", "owner": "tanha_.ro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091337818914020, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T15:37:30", "owner": "milo_ovaltin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331294033209887, "text": "The slow turn😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T15:36:31", "owner": "maison.doe", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17933140758110755, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T15:25:10", "owner": "willyboy694", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031581161536483, "text": "video#4 everyone felt a cringe 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T15:24:44", "owner": "you_have_nothing_better_to_do", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185414629355563, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-23T15:16:24", "owner": "malerin3006", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18177983863364532, "text": "My folks called each other mom and dad. Pretty much all of gen x parents did. It wasn't weird", "created_at": "2025-11-23T15:14:27", "owner": "joellohnes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072348506344015, "text": "Bedroom stuff😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T15:06:05", "owner": "saturo_gojo_anime", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996344355841948, "text": "The last clip— why is Will Byers there 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T15:02:44", "owner": "skullduggeryman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928067392152104, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T14:57:53", "owner": "finn0351.801", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103048690660881, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T14:54:09", "owner": "sodnr1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18309343222302091, "text": "The two in the last one really said \"you heads this shit too right\"", "created_at": "2025-11-23T14:41:50", "owner": "tg.broooooooo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965777055841002, "text": "All the boys have terrible hair.", "created_at": "2025-11-23T14:35:44", "owner": "if_rain_sank", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320728006173698, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T14:35:26", "owner": "durkasmurf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085536956058323, "text": "@dolphinluvr84", "created_at": "2025-11-23T14:33:56", "owner": "timjeanes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844326853617111, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-23T14:31:03", "owner": "patriciavrinds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053108552338769, "text": "Being called daddy by a woman is PDF file vibes.", "created_at": "2025-11-23T14:22:59", "owner": "matias.garza27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079987321911175, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-23T14:12:39", "owner": "stillstann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171500875333468, "text": "Itsi terriboll 🤌", "created_at": "2025-11-23T14:11:00", "owner": "lewishamiltonmersedes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542276080061106, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T14:05:40", "owner": "_navjyotsingh1313_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971194194816104, "text": "😂😂🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-23T13:54:42", "owner": "ap.ril_r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296958667283789, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T13:53:59", "owner": "brianvansevers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910228951258295, "text": "Im too african for this 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T13:40:32", "owner": "peter_the_great_1st", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970953579977321, "text": "How we perverted a normal innocent word like daddy is beyond me😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T13:25:42", "owner": "champkila", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152103355418816, "text": "Please stop promoting pedophilia. Gross.", "created_at": "2025-11-23T13:15:39", "owner": "kt001235", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18178690495366755, "text": "The kids are mortified 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T13:12:33", "owner": "lazydrumm3r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083536220014205, "text": "I call my wife ma or mama and she calls me daddy. It's the truth of who we are in the home.", "created_at": "2025-11-23T12:59:32", "owner": "whocolate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110888101580656, "text": "Bedroom stuff knows the game well", "created_at": "2025-11-23T12:59:23", "owner": "iamsalahm", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072188933049735, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-23T12:57:11", "owner": "tioseasalt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014709449799832, "text": "It's amazing that they all know the meaning of daddy, even those under 15", "created_at": "2025-11-23T12:48:43", "owner": "victorya_kdr7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063132791395755, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T12:25:38", "owner": "bruno_txrs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088957588766022, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T11:49:16", "owner": "sunflower_farms_smiley_tex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888506542259113, "text": "3😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T11:45:12", "owner": "i_saibaj4455", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072455987337710, "text": "Bro these families are so healthy", "created_at": "2025-11-23T10:58:05", "owner": "moha41013", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059082176249492, "text": "Now explain me please what's the issue with daddy word? I don't get it. Why the kids feel embarrassed?", "created_at": "2025-11-23T10:00:19", "owner": "eminrahimov54", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890745985382442, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T09:52:43", "owner": "essam_778", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061761611447423, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T09:19:52", "owner": "mannu0591", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066621554434882, "text": "Americans are weird.", "created_at": "2025-11-23T08:25:01", "owner": "bigjontheoriginal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068259116377360, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T08:01:58", "owner": "ajay_r.k.o_03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029271458757014, "text": "So no one dey innocent again 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-23T07:40:32", "owner": "adewunmi2567", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926563054166488, "text": "Saying the dinner was terrible is not nice.", "created_at": "2025-11-23T07:27:54", "owner": "the.sarahsamantha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958643016877452, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T07:23:11", "owner": "akatochishi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087786862942676, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T07:15:16", "owner": "esmeraldacreationshop805", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082352062877020, "text": "That is completely normal when mother calls a childs father a dady.", "created_at": "2025-11-23T06:39:59", "owner": "alvis_55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077190104232147, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T06:24:39", "owner": "_shruti.deo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137468314465518, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T06:17:05", "owner": "comoque12719", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076359959266167, "text": "Boy in the blue shirt in the second.. he was 😏", "created_at": "2025-11-23T06:14:11", "owner": "sassjapan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120277816532217, "text": "ما فهمت ليش بقولوا لأزواجهم يا دادي(ابي)", "created_at": "2025-11-23T06:11:49", "owner": "fanitas.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854597332574854, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T05:50:41", "owner": "arpit_fitness_09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147091417428367, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T05:44:05", "owner": "masta_wizard22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977825655945729, "text": "I'm going to kick your ass mom", "created_at": "2025-11-23T05:30:45", "owner": "noval.nofal.338", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024954932771160, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T05:27:02", "owner": "gman6t3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065197082434228, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T05:04:12", "owner": "marianovillaplana2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098098336744621, "text": "Where do all these children think they came from?! That’s right, daddy!,,, 😜😜😜😜", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:57:26", "owner": "susanczeck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974336193958829, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:46:56", "owner": "_katty21__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545229325018143, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:43:55", "owner": "katthroughalens", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18497286340074874, "text": "Traumatizing the kids what fun", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:38:03", "owner": "knight_percival07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066331523433070, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:07:39", "owner": "cerophis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861024952539796, "text": "It should be big daddy", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:52:05", "owner": "wam1112164", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874365580449083, "text": "Uai? Kkkk", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:47:20", "owner": "samu.h21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981256689931460, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:26:14", "owner": "mikeowens1776", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909160951123504, "text": "Can someone explain the reason for these reactions?! 😅", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:25:34", "owner": "everton9400", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147228829429400, "text": "The last young lady was disgusted with her mom!\"😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:19:45", "owner": "golfguy1986", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093479749888788, "text": "Bombastic Side eye 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:03:24", "owner": "horlardimeji1655", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964378290995145, "text": "The last one with that child. That child knows too much too soon", "created_at": "2025-11-23T02:22:58", "owner": "darnellhalfling", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078811906906407, "text": "anyone explain 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-23T00:48:27", "owner": "creative_nandha_004", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905382217277767, "text": "Na I just grab her my the throat and she moans 😂 kids go ewwwww", "created_at": "2025-11-23T00:40:50", "owner": "darrickjoiner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18535602874051108, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T00:40:18", "owner": "matthias_mock_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18201919153316802, "text": "What’s wrong?!", "created_at": "2025-11-23T00:40:08", "owner": "wiz_man007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950909161045235, "text": "Yeah your girl children are whores.", "created_at": "2025-11-23T00:22:22", "owner": "nish_0n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305508385252239, "text": "Не понимаю. Почему так реагируют на слово папа?", "created_at": "2025-11-23T00:13:31", "owner": "progulki_po_osetii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934038370108978, "text": "Emotional damage 👟!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T23:58:53", "owner": "vbmx_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950867872027929, "text": "bombastic side eyes", "created_at": "2025-11-22T23:57:38", "owner": "ikii.uwais", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085351385511445, "text": "😭🤣💀", "created_at": "2025-11-22T23:53:53", "owner": "kushsmokegunsmoke_99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903994927312649, "text": "The 2 boys looking at each other in the last one🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-22T23:45:58", "owner": "gsxr_max", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084934742004237, "text": "I don’t get why they all react like this, if I recall well, daddy in English just mean dad, English people are weird", "created_at": "2025-11-22T23:33:35", "owner": "kennthekernel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048221756683451, "text": "Nah hold on, why does that little girl at the end of the video making that face…she’s a victim of the hub", "created_at": "2025-11-22T23:29:30", "owner": "thesoulzfate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091359019897633, "text": "Je suis français et c'est quoi le problème de dire daddy devant ses ados? 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T23:17:15", "owner": "matinik_972", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077802892946573, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T23:06:12", "owner": "nazar_ka_safar_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18394671109132334, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T22:46:11", "owner": "monilein1102", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18420272197117847, "text": "Funny thang is I call my hubby daddy and my kids dont even blink....", "created_at": "2025-11-22T22:40:18", "owner": "chaos_samson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879616462423917, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T22:28:19", "owner": "newimagefitnessandnutrition", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125451448504168, "text": "That little girl at the end was ready to throw hands at her mom 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T22:23:09", "owner": "chavaayanna1972", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18422942587117764, "text": "Qué tiene de malo? Hablo español no entiendo qué tiene de malo que le diga Daddy...", "created_at": "2025-11-22T22:10:19", "owner": "uruboss007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892921465365689, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-22T22:00:37", "owner": "leila_lpasha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843563620612714, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T21:59:46", "owner": "sinna_dwella_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102585313677394, "text": "The trauma…🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-22T21:42:53", "owner": "staytinymama", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881878123303858, "text": "Notice theyre all white....Lol 😂😂😂Got daddy's! 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T21:38:36", "owner": "2ryansdontmakearight", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087100801795710, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T21:36:22", "owner": "veronicaa2332", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112197301587629, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-22T21:18:15", "owner": "arielortega90432", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052651250338827, "text": "?????", "created_at": "2025-11-22T21:07:31", "owner": "kelviomonteiro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918271756072244, "text": "BOMMMBASTIC SIDE EYE", "created_at": "2025-11-22T20:59:09", "owner": "sacred_sentinel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044893766694167, "text": "Bro that’s so gross in front of kids.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T20:52:12", "owner": "shogunsky06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087654662483147, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T20:50:08", "owner": "brian.miller6216", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965189595995444, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T20:33:04", "owner": "_big_odg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939985404965963, "text": "Watch the little girl the whole time in the Salt pepper video. 😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T20:21:51", "owner": "iwannahavethelongestnameonig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126727921449600, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T20:18:06", "owner": "pshariati.official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954724492029975, "text": "Number one the kid in the back lowkey look like will (stranger things)", "created_at": "2025-11-22T20:08:15", "owner": "susette_hein", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082894906855449, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:59:02", "owner": "_christian_24.9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141618187451250, "text": "I don't understand, isn't it normal ? Is a cultural thing ?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:52:28", "owner": "jose.medinaaraujo.9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103757011639164, "text": "OMG 😱", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:47:53", "owner": "johnny_bees_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078909160921866, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:38:33", "owner": "le_farid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077027656962138, "text": "😂😂😂 this why our kids can’t stand us now!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:20:25", "owner": "big.bore.b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993683712706967, "text": "If my mom did this I would have died by laughing", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:19:55", "owner": "ze.ke7731", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059037740259095, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:51:38", "owner": "abhis12140", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086539522823946, "text": "😂😂😂🤣🤣🤣👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:37:37", "owner": "xzumvs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869113357405872, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:30:59", "owner": "s.faisal01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18412029730142111, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:07:41", "owner": "luxet1me", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541827457061579, "text": "The laugh of mom 1 priceless", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:07:01", "owner": "perrel93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861875539537321, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:03:11", "owner": "danielpapi2211", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030200822554731, "text": "that last haircut was brutal", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:55:47", "owner": "i3y5tand3r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892618705364555, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:55:43", "owner": "jainalynvirgen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074628872197139, "text": "These are funny as hell....", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:45:40", "owner": "josephbrent56", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070841426595564, "text": "The 2nd family - is that the dinosaur kid 🦕", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:45:10", "owner": "ericgoeseverywhere", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081447761032191, "text": "Lmao! That little girl at the end has me in tears!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:34:41", "owner": "seanzy4321", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18389715790176899, "text": "@sanne_koppens @chefsjefstef", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:34:32", "owner": "romyjane92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18375222115153880, "text": "She nuked the whole family table on the last one 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:34:13", "owner": "forcedtomakeaccount3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907399702278108, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:28:12", "owner": "domernoff", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17879161710329260, "text": "😂🤣😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:16:31", "owner": "feelingfroggy5000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057171350299768, "text": "#3 had me goin...🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:15:41", "owner": "suedareaper", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067951883572254, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:57:02", "owner": "emma_deathangel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091301243307881, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:54:26", "owner": "tattooandarttl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18420889129114163, "text": "My husbands name is Big Daddy😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:48:01", "owner": "shrtfrnd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18380614879146346, "text": "My mom and dad always called each mom and daddy. But not in a sexual way. And think it starts with having baby’s so they know what to call the parents.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:45:51", "owner": "bengeesnewman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987037113876916, "text": "Lmao! 😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:33:15", "owner": "jareds_702", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18514102720070481, "text": "Americans are so weird.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:30:52", "owner": "craigmurrayauthor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027483653566070, "text": "😂😂🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:24:07", "owner": "poojasingh261195", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903877360294130, "text": "Their faces are priceless.😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:21:08", "owner": "juanca_d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108768898545093, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:16:14", "owner": "lsaavedra940", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960690975867253, "text": "The reacts show they know too much", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:14:23", "owner": "dan.j.k.c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052313282675307, "text": "Yellow cup girl is traumatized 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:54:01", "owner": "nimi_1124", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050356913378116, "text": "I feel the cringe, it hurts too much.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:32:07", "owner": "the_rising_17.18.19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854741119527361, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:25:20", "owner": "f3ns_7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352537819163110, "text": "It's common in India.. referring to your man as Daddy in front of kids...", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:24:43", "owner": "rupali.smk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103414387590420, "text": "Look at the little girl innocence is gone", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:10:53", "owner": "sand.man153", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843970960617570, "text": "Bombastic side eye, criminal offensive side eye", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:00:41", "owner": "necromancer_1.5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074289344197809, "text": "O clima pesando", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:58:38", "owner": "raquelsoiree", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094655767850544, "text": "God forbid their parents love each other 🙄 /j", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:48:29", "owner": "i_am_a_pidgeon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18351282436205142, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:47:01", "owner": "_9gd9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084406205304245, "text": "That dude eyes first blur 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:38:13", "owner": "tohshine_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060197198637750, "text": "Embarrassing that someone made this!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:29:49", "owner": "deemibenway", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17940598469961738, "text": "Ewwwwwww", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:26:31", "owner": "makakio1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029915579759628, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:26:00", "owner": "blocut16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033887954732731, "text": "Lol", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:01:24", "owner": "wapman7054", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086933173960043, "text": "In Africa we don't have a problem with that. Maybe it's cultural. In USA, it's a bedroom stuff, I don't get it", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:33:04", "owner": "kulutuyaya436", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113623651582449, "text": "They just want a daddy too", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:14:20", "owner": "stxvee.pct", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915037270086662, "text": "3 definitely calls her other daddy", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:11:25", "owner": "wazzup_you_know_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086365751488811, "text": "Moooom!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:08:25", "owner": "renardkevin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024028793589671, "text": "Got in the western feed again😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:03:08", "owner": "ritwick180", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083849723099028, "text": "The first one, is my favorite her laugh every time", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:40:06", "owner": "fieldsrossa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892230934367362, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:38:37", "owner": "zetesrc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850730347595530, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:24:20", "owner": "levgamer1987", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989623674734256, "text": "Embarrassing your kids is the highlight of every parent’s life", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:59:42", "owner": "lizzy3694", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075762833270663, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:51:14", "owner": "johnkatsanos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922998511192712, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:36:57", "owner": "ma.rius4176", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924236131180167, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:36:17", "owner": "ma.rius4176", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088982264495051, "text": "😂😂😂👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:02:12", "owner": "julio.foto.p.g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065512559128184, "text": "How to traumatise your kids I love it 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:23:42", "owner": "debra.squires.31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863817613530692, "text": "مشان الله شو معناها", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:14:14", "owner": "z_zekos_999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941077903050139, "text": "\"that's bedroom stuff\" 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:06:33", "owner": "yagosilva29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114433681588597, "text": "Baru paham pas video ke 4 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:46:11", "owner": "afrazaamy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18319936828168077, "text": "Pffff Not for Europe - prudish US stuff", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:27:40", "owner": "stefanisliker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18327444271215132, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:49:32", "owner": "rickem1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852803881583226, "text": "Will Byers at last scene", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:47:42", "owner": "deadusernametaken", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087152461976942, "text": "А в чем проблема?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:36:41", "owner": "feofelisiti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854769727525384, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:24:43", "owner": "leo_fem_", "likes": 43}, {"id": 17988080891876735, "text": "Не совсем понятно, они все одну и ту же по*нушку смотрели?)", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:21:46", "owner": "vadim_nzv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859315264486556, "text": "I don’t understand the daddy thing it’s sick 🤢", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:55:35", "owner": "alley_catz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012429743634747, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:51:26", "owner": "ryanrosas4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080562149170216, "text": "ماهو الخطئ من هذا اللفظ ؟", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:36:23", "owner": "hayder_majeed_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876426559349250, "text": "All the kids got traumatized 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:27:11", "owner": "gen_z_kidx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956479474012479, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:09:28", "owner": "indaga420_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046244870461776, "text": "What it means ?????", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:48:10", "owner": "muradmood", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156850633403274, "text": "Turned bro into a broken record 😭 what", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:44:43", "owner": "finelaziness__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867367039481426, "text": "The n°2 looks high as a kite", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:38:30", "owner": "the_tourist_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18179689927360079, "text": "Snowflake generation", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:33:23", "owner": "adibartha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005045864817649, "text": "The fact that everyone understand it even the little one. These generations is falling", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:07:26", "owner": "cliffe_in_black", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076796858236008, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:00:36", "owner": "monique.cheong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984983802756606, "text": "@schninchen_07  call me Daddy Baby at Oklahoma 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:46:06", "owner": "teufel696", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091994345508875, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:45:26", "owner": "grafsovetnikov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882084559410598, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:57:37", "owner": "genelation_1023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073708619461121, "text": "@kelseyleeannjackson", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:11:57", "owner": "kerryjackson84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071652662048679, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:49:13", "owner": "chrisdotsonig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146647570440618, "text": "😂🤣😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:48:11", "owner": "roxannashrager", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038149355717333, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:36:17", "owner": "pitegaillard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086147336513224, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:20:26", "owner": "jr_garveyite", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937126426099674, "text": "I’m Russian and I don’t understand why do they react so", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:07:53", "owner": "yunuseseneev204", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048100838420721, "text": "It’s so fun to troll young teenagers! I’m glad the parents are having a blast with it.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:34:09", "owner": "afdtk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970190964969311, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:28:42", "owner": "surinder_singh_andhroa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945043482944235, "text": "Am I the only one seeing the guy at the ends hair😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:26:45", "owner": "jacqueline_demp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18177795994362914, "text": "@gradysang", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:16:20", "owner": "gradyvonwhatthefck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954214633031229, "text": "The funny thing is we always called dad daddy while we were growing up.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:53:39", "owner": "david265776", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18198711646324444, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:33:38", "owner": "kberentzen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070399556369982, "text": "\"What?\"🗣🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:15:25", "owner": "cutekitten67832", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078514157469326, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:07:19", "owner": "norshazzie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077104304331384, "text": "My daughter would react the same way, and she's 25.", "created_at": "2025-11-21T23:46:48", "owner": "jaquezeli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875663038448186, "text": "Daughters most definitely affected", "created_at": "2025-11-21T23:40:25", "owner": "russell_the_kelpie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089064112758721, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-21T23:07:29", "owner": "jerkgkk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078720526919653, "text": "The last one “salt and pepper” that girls reaction had me dying! Oh man I laughed sooo hard😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-21T22:09:52", "owner": "love_never_fails89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929124379153883, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T22:06:37", "owner": "_4j.xe_77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397168834120068, "text": "I call my wife mommas...and my sister in law too. Whats wrong with that?", "created_at": "2025-11-21T22:05:18", "owner": "pvt.toast", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18166294465346982, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T22:01:35", "owner": "andreaspan8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887954152262181, "text": "My mother ALWAYS CALLED HIM THAT, still does… has no idea how gross it sounds", "created_at": "2025-11-21T21:14:10", "owner": "olafbjornstal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083825753086025, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-21T21:08:03", "owner": "its.isaacck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540811663017226, "text": "Bedroom stuff reaction shawty high ash😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T21:04:09", "owner": "bikeeedoeemenace", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099232096695740, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T20:46:23", "owner": "antonio.lugo.758", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970104723817422, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-21T20:41:27", "owner": "mbirding", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901160365312038, "text": "So much embarrassment from the kids. How do they think they got here???😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T20:24:05", "owner": "mrs_pocket", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073577228210528, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-21T20:23:09", "owner": "vandalxxi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052948781335067, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-21T20:22:42", "owner": "djbl84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952236562029282, "text": "Where these damn kids think they came from…..", "created_at": "2025-11-21T20:19:42", "owner": "jordan.fike.35", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867304210495067, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-21T20:19:18", "owner": "yordis_cmg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098327725832523, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-21T20:18:01", "owner": "83mzmoody", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154889839410930, "text": "Meanwhile daddy is blushing😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T20:15:53", "owner": "gowithit85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849708976562264, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T20:15:39", "owner": "gowithit85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100048663688738, "text": "😂😂😂 that was so funny🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-21T20:01:36", "owner": "uniquenaturallady", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024180416781334, "text": "\"MOM👹\"", "created_at": "2025-11-21T19:59:31", "owner": "mireille.mrl", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18085588634073016, "text": "The first is my favorite 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-21T19:45:07", "owner": "whatsina_name19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068641982597567, "text": "Hahahaha…nice👌🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-21T19:41:16", "owner": "7thdaydrumr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067890164578044, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T19:40:15", "owner": "the_boyz_65", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157736974404475, "text": "🤣I've always called my husband daddy, and my children have grown up hearing him called daddy, and I have an 18-year-old daughter, and they don't care 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-21T19:36:42", "owner": "angie_roma_34", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049328363676208, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T19:33:04", "owner": "lyndabmonty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145286218437087, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T19:30:55", "owner": "mrrobgiumarra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866446849427294, "text": "I call my husband, daddy and he calls me mommy we don’t ever use our actual names in front of our kids cause I’m not trying to walk around having my kids call me by my real name, but my kids are also under the age of six", "created_at": "2025-11-21T19:15:39", "owner": "ceceann_42", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856858561559550, "text": "I would’ve never understood this when I was a teen. But now, I do.", "created_at": "2025-11-21T19:11:02", "owner": "tomboy_1931", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114792883571263, "text": "Lmao kids look of disgust is sending me. 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-21T19:10:21", "owner": "kingvirgo614", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933718138075165, "text": "like this i wanna come back", "created_at": "2025-11-21T19:07:42", "owner": "suhagalahsan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119288599551399, "text": "😂😍", "created_at": "2025-11-21T19:00:49", "owner": "steffen_hoffmann1980", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18413909992191052, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-21T18:47:32", "owner": "misters._gaming", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376325368196647, "text": "Wheres the emotional damage guy!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-21T18:35:16", "owner": "slade_gerry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064388369435333, "text": "Saying “daddy” isn’t as embarrassing as the last kid’s haircut", "created_at": "2025-11-21T18:17:51", "owner": "knitpants", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056341127306638, "text": "Nobody gonna mention that kids haircut in the last clip", "created_at": "2025-11-21T18:14:31", "owner": "braden_fris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080884295119754, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T18:11:29", "owner": "j.eaton84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947299998934405, "text": "Wife and I just call each other Mummy and Daddy in front of our kids so we are all calling each other the same names 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-21T18:00:50", "owner": "_mannchini", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969825072989089, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T17:58:13", "owner": "vasudev87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854316178571904, "text": "Fawking red necks eating dinner w paper plates", "created_at": "2025-11-21T17:55:41", "owner": "chiquitobb751", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18162270775388097, "text": "The strange part is this was normal until this generation perverted it. Mothers use to call the fathers daddy so the kids would call him daddy. The idea of it is spending the rest is their lives together and it was a badge of honor bcuz you are the “daddy “ of the house just like she’s the mommy", "created_at": "2025-11-21T17:41:51", "owner": "iamajmiles_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844135885616449, "text": "That’s bedroom stuff 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-21T17:40:34", "owner": "nayem_yt3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18423317956113149, "text": "What's sad here is those teenagers know what the word means.🙄", "created_at": "2025-11-21T17:29:29", "owner": "cowpokebar29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18308026990301758, "text": "No entiendo por q se ponen mal llamándole papi", "created_at": "2025-11-21T17:27:38", "owner": "momentus_darius", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18348779941205472, "text": "If your not embarrassing your kids, are you even a parent", "created_at": "2025-11-21T17:20:41", "owner": "pandabear43400", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18400003918124310, "text": "These moms are diabolical", "created_at": "2025-11-21T17:20:34", "owner": "rocketstang87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145079251435203, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T17:06:42", "owner": "tinuke_11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090842216306869, "text": "İlk abideki vatan gülüşü 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T16:59:59", "owner": "cihankurtar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114558154586519, "text": "If eyes could kill🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-21T16:50:16", "owner": "lesliejr2002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948833623059100, "text": "The last one the little girl felt insulted 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T16:48:20", "owner": "awesomechains721", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046395593447992, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T16:47:41", "owner": "bukidngbayan04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086177905996456, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T16:37:04", "owner": "marcodavid5370", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090118699898134, "text": "The last side took me out the lil sis with the powered side eye😂😂😂😂😂😂 brother choking😂😂😂😂😂👏🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-21T16:30:06", "owner": "sporty420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094429774856442, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-21T16:27:35", "owner": "najib_haidari_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863734228517690, "text": "Bro I dropped my phone at the last one", "created_at": "2025-11-21T16:25:41", "owner": "sunsetjj7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18336765673225078, "text": "My mom did that when we were kids and we never had an issue.  But of course now my fiance calls me daddy", "created_at": "2025-11-21T16:20:29", "owner": "truck3r_96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989652009888383, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T16:14:53", "owner": "bonlagua7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084233384090718, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:58:34", "owner": "the_cytex_sama", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927257617159249, "text": "Why isn’t this normal though lmao like? What else is the mom supposed to call them in front of the kids my mom does it every time 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:57:51", "owner": "alice.lavender.rose.art", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18537516751058982, "text": "Are they in their own home and eat from a paper plate and drinking from plastic cups? America is such a shit hole", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:57:43", "owner": "euda.8352", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087164086949802, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:25:08", "owner": "filipeacosta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097364689645940, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:07:32", "owner": "kellyiangagaza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071726639048720, "text": "That bombastic side eye 🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-21T14:44:27", "owner": "lyf_of_morgan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18517186324064512, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-21T14:17:23", "owner": "shamsouddine0ff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086057960071532, "text": "We need part 2 also plz 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T13:42:50", "owner": "nitin_boss01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030652514534374, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T13:42:13", "owner": "nitin_boss01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064104824414512, "text": "Poor kids🤷", "created_at": "2025-11-21T12:47:49", "owner": "weristgeorge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030836645546382, "text": "\"Whaet ??\" 🤨😧", "created_at": "2025-11-21T12:21:06", "owner": "aragorz_tenpetrp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078556606913912, "text": "Every teens are a lil' bit too much aware for daddy s meaning.....how convenient...", "created_at": "2025-11-21T12:19:00", "owner": "hrlm.exe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103014211734984, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T11:57:42", "owner": "janka557788", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18434841112103411, "text": "😂👏", "created_at": "2025-11-21T11:52:33", "owner": "felisiasurelly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076870766337167, "text": "Its normal at us. :D", "created_at": "2025-11-21T11:32:22", "owner": "papp_andras", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068503118599670, "text": "The last one😂😂😂😂❤️🇦🇷", "created_at": "2025-11-21T10:48:36", "owner": "daher.emilio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049022708397127, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T10:23:14", "owner": "mr__paul__99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18430286629128617, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-21T10:16:34", "owner": "levoates", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938944813092189, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T09:42:28", "owner": "jannitagrace", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058843763249511, "text": "Can we talk about the  hair from the boy in the last one? 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T09:37:57", "owner": "xmarcel1305x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088799936499584, "text": "njir", "created_at": "2025-11-21T09:17:20", "owner": "junbagas____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089444966498430, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-21T09:13:27", "owner": "amyltsang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864929320437807, "text": "This isn't okay", "created_at": "2025-11-21T08:36:55", "owner": "david.linsday.56", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940825921088756, "text": "That last one with the kid and the bowl cut lol 😂 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-21T08:19:31", "owner": "joshua92r33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984191790867971, "text": "👏😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T08:07:22", "owner": "clamcey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844429633604318, "text": "I like #2", "created_at": "2025-11-21T08:02:06", "owner": "nightdreamer_stitcher", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970751073975688, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T07:58:03", "owner": "rabbit.344375", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544298845028152, "text": "Stop traumatizing your kids😢😢 that's disgussssssyinggg", "created_at": "2025-11-21T07:48:58", "owner": "slimshaddy7eleven", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871746982462511, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T07:19:02", "owner": "jb_robertson30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051676469661627, "text": "Some of those haircuts were more frightening! 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T06:44:07", "owner": "pudgesbestfriend", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873448861376868, "text": "I love kink but this obviously send wrong message to the kids.", "created_at": "2025-11-21T06:37:21", "owner": "berkguven", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893782045225280, "text": "MEANWHILE THE FILOS", "created_at": "2025-11-21T06:20:44", "owner": "_xl.oo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18202845919316884, "text": "That’s what they get for using normal ass words for perverted lingo. 🤣  And when that last little girl knew… just shows they’re seeing and hearing too much too soon on the $1000 phone you pay for.", "created_at": "2025-11-21T06:12:34", "owner": "droppin_boxes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039217499706526, "text": "I call my girl Mommy", "created_at": "2025-11-21T05:43:35", "owner": "rob_dawg02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074577436993053, "text": "That last kid who was about to throw up lol", "created_at": "2025-11-21T05:39:58", "owner": "mykee_1995", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863741050515504, "text": "Money is my Daddy😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-21T05:25:03", "owner": "uyoukok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844955974613849, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T05:22:47", "owner": "unapologetically_alysha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18536234395014562, "text": "The girl with the yellow cup 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T04:09:26", "owner": "sallyannkipp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060978989553636, "text": "Every one of these people had a litter of children around them and it’s amazing to see😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T04:08:05", "owner": "tonka0110", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904912324271416, "text": "The last one with the baseball team of kids is now traumatized 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-21T04:05:21", "owner": "johnnydemon713", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076186300970134, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T03:43:58", "owner": "brendan.naicker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18365232973088247, "text": "Daily for my wife and I , kids never reacted like that..", "created_at": "2025-11-21T03:11:52", "owner": "hartiaacres", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18198194716323534, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T03:06:36", "owner": "charltonrafaela", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18412662118138355, "text": "See I can’t with the “daddy” kink because that’s what I actually call my father.. I know some find that weird but like I find the word being used as a kink even more weird. Like why are you calling your partner in bed a name that’s most often used and started as a nickname for fathers! Makes no sense to me.", "created_at": "2025-11-21T02:36:53", "owner": "trouble1044", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073141403016451, "text": "My extra wife would have never done this. Public or private. Which is why she is my ex.", "created_at": "2025-11-21T02:30:52", "owner": "leif_gberg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104394187635627, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T02:18:13", "owner": "edmartiniv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18407854252191904, "text": "Laro Benz family did it the funniest", "created_at": "2025-11-21T02:16:30", "owner": "keen_is_here", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934405063101867, "text": "Last one for sure 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T02:16:28", "owner": "shoreline_derek_w_beach_life", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171951406334398, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂 maybe they're traumatized now🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-21T02:07:03", "owner": "emileynrose1984", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842098741625795, "text": "??", "created_at": "2025-11-21T01:59:29", "owner": "rizkydwihastomo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086978824778819, "text": "Sooooo.... when my first kid was a baby I started calling my husband papa, so he would learn how to say it.... so now is normal for my kids to hear me calling g him that 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T01:49:01", "owner": "karemygr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18407648962185699, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T01:38:53", "owner": "mr.philippines_06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896462905349174, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T01:33:19", "owner": "rloyles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092342365921916, "text": "Every single guy in this video is smiling that’s what matters most 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-21T01:33:10", "owner": "sonnymont", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086752630796540, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-21T01:26:18", "owner": "jeffery.garcia12", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17944021571947803, "text": "My wife's been calling me that for 25 years our oldest boy is 22 nothing wrong with that", "created_at": "2025-11-21T01:22:47", "owner": "nickelson82003", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303731404268596, "text": "😂 my husband is Big Daddy in my phone so when he texts me with my teenagers in the car they see it pop up. Never disappoints", "created_at": "2025-11-21T01:09:57", "owner": "calihoosier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083170589041964, "text": "This is great, can use to torture  my teenagers", "created_at": "2025-11-21T01:09:21", "owner": "dan97537", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18386567797178471, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-21T01:06:52", "owner": "kyleautrey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893686516225195, "text": "Is this not normal in every household?!", "created_at": "2025-11-21T01:06:45", "owner": "zj_willi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967248786981944, "text": "Im asian wife, why ? Wht happen? I  asia we do that. We Call daddy, papa, etc to our husband", "created_at": "2025-11-21T01:00:27", "owner": "fbiebugz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953667507900275, "text": "Gross 🤮 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T00:46:36", "owner": "millerkurt88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096406153843693, "text": "My wife calls me daddy all the time, my kids don’t think it’s strange at all… this kids haven’t heard Mom call him that, they’re not used to it, this is probably their first time, that’s why the reaction", "created_at": "2025-11-21T00:30:15", "owner": "luis.rudy.588bn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068342948607304, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-21T00:23:31", "owner": "cowboymike229ga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107073787529557, "text": "Oh no, her virgin ears", "created_at": "2025-11-21T00:20:33", "owner": "summerof69nj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957337009009283, "text": "lol😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T00:06:33", "owner": "la_bella_vita2323", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930251941128971, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T23:49:37", "owner": "wileyhall87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366197848095185, "text": "How do the kids think they got here? 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T23:47:18", "owner": "joanliechti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081860789106017, "text": "Deron stuff is crazy work🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-20T23:41:24", "owner": "im_reborn_again", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18408358117191091, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T23:22:35", "owner": "kittyvonbiskett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331473487211566, "text": "Black southern country families don't have this problem", "created_at": "2025-11-20T23:14:48", "owner": "calel2401", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932140053998148, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T23:07:42", "owner": "perryoneal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116678752492083, "text": "What's with the haircut of these boys?", "created_at": "2025-11-20T23:07:12", "owner": "igor_roaddog", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101511064674088, "text": "Can we just boycott list of five videos. As soon as I see those numbers I just get.", "created_at": "2025-11-20T23:06:36", "owner": "samueloplinger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064103468625857, "text": "En español please", "created_at": "2025-11-20T23:03:19", "owner": "ellaboris22_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064443986573984, "text": "Now they realize how dumb they sound calling a man who ain’t their dad daddy 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-20T22:51:55", "owner": "queenkillz90gaming", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082644086473029, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T22:50:49", "owner": "suga_cookie91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982201149926944, "text": "Well you just revealed some crazy shit about my life", "created_at": "2025-11-20T22:41:54", "owner": "vinsta.gram__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025335890583683, "text": "My parents did this normally my entire life, then switched to gma/gpa when my nephew was born", "created_at": "2025-11-20T22:41:13", "owner": "josephriopelle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010796891801295, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-20T22:31:56", "owner": "m_atheng.e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854242618574341, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T22:27:22", "owner": "damien_anderson_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951944869046114, "text": "#2 got me dying! 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T22:08:02", "owner": "no1nole", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18187617532350636, "text": "Um i do call my husbad daddy normally so this trends dumb", "created_at": "2025-11-20T22:07:13", "owner": "treesbrenda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18163677217384334, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T22:02:31", "owner": "rogierb0251", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099211603793724, "text": "That's\nSome childhood trauma. Funny trauma. 😅🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-20T21:45:47", "owner": "osovaning", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858408241553004, "text": "Que lindo trend", "created_at": "2025-11-20T21:42:16", "owner": "juance_rock", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120180892547274, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-20T21:30:59", "owner": "zombiehuntingmonkey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086854099988627, "text": "How did she know it's bedroom stuff 🤔 What is she up too??", "created_at": "2025-11-20T21:18:37", "owner": "eric_stew21", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17925346587172269, "text": "That must mean something really bad in their language….", "created_at": "2025-11-20T20:47:52", "owner": "maximus_leximus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086142136994097, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T20:46:14", "owner": "kentonbianca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086727988946016, "text": "Bedroom stuff .", "created_at": "2025-11-20T20:27:53", "owner": "x_hadj_mkl_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112304593602772, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T20:22:45", "owner": "selwyndexter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094154047874550, "text": "😂❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-20T20:14:45", "owner": "faustinolopezjr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931932595112260, "text": "En español cuál sería la real traducción", "created_at": "2025-11-20T19:57:38", "owner": "jaimejimenez3996", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118301479542325, "text": "Im used to it gng", "created_at": "2025-11-20T19:44:20", "owner": "alaska_470", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051007784361215, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T19:42:32", "owner": "jlstory12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075073403249307, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T18:58:32", "owner": "pablo__cohen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183384238346186, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T18:16:51", "owner": "nerdgirl_1994", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896592247201320, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T17:39:25", "owner": "josehumbertoandia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108101809621780, "text": "Nope even for a joke I couldn't do it... just creeps me right out", "created_at": "2025-11-20T17:25:48", "owner": "areia51", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908408833261285, "text": "\"Faaaaaahhh\" ahh momemt", "created_at": "2025-11-20T17:23:43", "owner": "thaitinosaurier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079532471158805, "text": "What?..why are these kids reacting like this?", "created_at": "2025-11-20T16:21:07", "owner": "christiangjerpe1978", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940866493086506, "text": "This is weird.  My kids and girl call my daddy. Its not a weird word unless its made to be.  Yall weird", "created_at": "2025-11-20T16:20:24", "owner": "lanky714", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030384695548405, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T15:39:50", "owner": "mariab6052", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078737372125667, "text": "While they too make light of it, kids instinctively know it's disgusting", "created_at": "2025-11-20T15:04:07", "owner": "satyasaadhak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183125635348293, "text": "Je suis français en quoi c'est mal de dire daddy a son mari devant ses enfants aux USA ?", "created_at": "2025-11-20T14:23:18", "owner": "lulutomtom", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17852110335588543, "text": "💩🖕💩🖕💩🖕💩🖕💩🖕💩🖕💩🖕💩🖕💩🖕💩🖕", "created_at": "2025-11-20T14:02:24", "owner": "benruayewe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103955602659884, "text": "Não entendo de psicopatia americana, então.... Fiquei sem entender a merda dessa piada lixo!!", "created_at": "2025-11-20T14:00:47", "owner": "benruayewe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896436031199906, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T13:57:20", "owner": "gatagansta07", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17971967996957855, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T13:21:45", "owner": "the_1_and_only_sos", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18381801919199363, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-20T13:16:43", "owner": "juniie77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060843806196904, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T13:12:52", "owner": "shalliab803", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18384901354179493, "text": "The daughters genuinely hate it.", "created_at": "2025-11-20T12:54:46", "owner": "source_papi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18245321044289341, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T12:38:24", "owner": "kaiswunschwelt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027388991572613, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T12:10:40", "owner": "afraniodesafilho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866113954426619, "text": "Definitely p e d o i n c e s t b i w o m e n a n d m e n", "created_at": "2025-11-20T12:05:37", "owner": "alexhaynesmemorylose27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132458833488425, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T11:55:13", "owner": "tsabitdieni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972169938796805, "text": "The last reel for me😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T10:46:17", "owner": "katrinagyap", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081266672511030, "text": "Who’s your daddy 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T09:52:19", "owner": "monizjason", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145281535433129, "text": "The emotional damage, priceless!", "created_at": "2025-11-20T09:40:29", "owner": "kevin_charmer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546587095050389, "text": "@fabienne_virchow hahahahhahaa", "created_at": "2025-11-20T08:10:42", "owner": "hagenvirchow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849746380561134, "text": "I love it, it’s planting good seeds in their lives", "created_at": "2025-11-20T08:07:49", "owner": "_dragonflyjones23_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104829988575387, "text": "❌ children reaction. Just look at the Daddy reaction 😉", "created_at": "2025-11-20T08:05:19", "owner": "vijayasree6789", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868715137472763, "text": "Imma do the same thing in front of my kids 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T07:34:54", "owner": "jaysims4life06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091723360907805, "text": "I don't really see the issue. Though my family pronounced it deddy (kinda like you're saying dead with the E sound after), everyone including mom called him Deddy. I honestly paid more attention to it if she called him by his name Steve.", "created_at": "2025-11-20T07:01:59", "owner": "brian766j", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062058017630613, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-20T06:55:38", "owner": "deepakthakur2019", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092770543903711, "text": "Damn your daughter's got someone they calling daddy already!? Wtf is wrong with this generation 😵‍💫😵‍💫😵‍💫", "created_at": "2025-11-20T06:17:50", "owner": "kimosabe1995", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057281408554250, "text": "These poor children have never been to a Filipino house. Where's mommy? Where's daddy? Back and forth all day. Between three different generations. Grannies+Gramps, Mom+Dad AND siblings with spouses.", "created_at": "2025-11-20T06:02:45", "owner": "plainjoyce", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18098721040700432, "text": "LMAAOOOOO that last one oml 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T05:41:38", "owner": "trxpstxr.dennis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100392547665999, "text": "Hello. Ada orang indo Disni. Maksudnya gimanaa ya kok manggil daddy ke suaminya seperti aneh didengar anak?", "created_at": "2025-11-20T05:21:05", "owner": "barbar_.86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057687983288295, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T05:02:45", "owner": "ashdhiman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077741786143065, "text": "😂😂😂❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-20T04:30:37", "owner": "techdanguiano", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941245072084978, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T04:10:07", "owner": "mehdipakzaddd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093675850699861, "text": "I love how all the dads don't react at all, \"sure baby here ya go\" lol", "created_at": "2025-11-20T04:04:19", "owner": "ravenjawss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184091377348454, "text": "Shows this generation is cooked that they know what “daddy” means other than another name for “dad” or father”", "created_at": "2025-11-20T03:49:15", "owner": "mikuu._chan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044626202466165, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T03:35:43", "owner": "jutetlim2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18398715550120147, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T02:58:30", "owner": "donegal62", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085997485968337, "text": "😂😂❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-20T02:57:34", "owner": "syatray", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065427239530263, "text": "Yes daddy 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T02:51:37", "owner": "alubagun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095276887862940, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T02:28:19", "owner": "asanthi__kalugamuwa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124132123514128, "text": "Bedroom stufff😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T02:11:01", "owner": "__lj21__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076390595236041, "text": "AAAAAAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHA..........babygirl looking at her mom like \"wtf did you say?\" 😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T02:06:54", "owner": "keederatwell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071209547065190, "text": "What it mean ?", "created_at": "2025-11-20T01:40:21", "owner": "mehde_jamel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844376707605443, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T01:15:13", "owner": "dabo2015", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022766273777669, "text": "My wife would call me big daddy in front of the kids. They would get icked out and then I would say thank you hot momma. They would holler, stop that", "created_at": "2025-11-20T01:07:16", "owner": "clifford.snyder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004415516668264, "text": "That second to last kid was about to cry", "created_at": "2025-11-20T00:55:37", "owner": "lilmizzaniml", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366422533088034, "text": "I find it a little sad that some of these younger kids get the joke. That's a conversation for when they're older", "created_at": "2025-11-20T00:39:21", "owner": "low2noincome", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083465653848748, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-20T00:36:20", "owner": "lightweavingmistborn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913060204096749, "text": "I’m only laughing because it’s not my parents doing this 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T00:24:59", "owner": "editgraveyyard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046538915454296, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T00:23:17", "owner": "jennifereze222", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18380178478148184, "text": "Am I trippin or was there a common denominator?", "created_at": "2025-11-19T23:33:00", "owner": "coscal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074304818337612, "text": "How do kids even know this is sensual, versus calling your husband honey or baby? 🤔🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-19T23:19:00", "owner": "macyfrom705", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908090290127130, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T22:55:21", "owner": "richardcrr6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003289055674753, "text": "My question is how do all the kids know what it is , in the meaning I’m sure they are thinking", "created_at": "2025-11-19T22:47:30", "owner": "jackspotscars", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073026830462625, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T22:31:52", "owner": "brown.arnob", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018303323794050, "text": "If the teenagers understand the sexual implication, they’re grounded.", "created_at": "2025-11-19T22:18:40", "owner": "lord_cl_street", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920898892195036, "text": "This generations lingo sucks. If my mom called my dad daddy, I wouldn’t have flinched. So stupid", "created_at": "2025-11-19T21:56:43", "owner": "jkgeorge2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987033285873622, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T21:20:07", "owner": "wes_ley_1983", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073143518216863, "text": "I need more of this 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T21:05:44", "owner": "_rudy_the_ancient_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995373231847617, "text": "The last one😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T20:49:57", "owner": "andyintrona", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122667514516550, "text": "Papi or papacito", "created_at": "2025-11-19T20:16:06", "owner": "will_d_62", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846440530608677, "text": "How y'all think y'all got here?", "created_at": "2025-11-19T20:14:55", "owner": "csabb50", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908157616258637, "text": "She asked for salt and pepper", "created_at": "2025-11-19T19:48:08", "owner": "saryehubenyisraelhalevi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367817092081348, "text": "Lol, it's crazy how all of the kids know what that means.", "created_at": "2025-11-19T19:35:06", "owner": "jay.tee.7315", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059355866544297, "text": "And traumatized", "created_at": "2025-11-19T19:20:24", "owner": "normie2022", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922253992189384, "text": "I used to call my daughter sweetheart every time I seen her especially in front of her boyfriend. I didn't like him and I didn't want him calling her sweetheart. It worked.", "created_at": "2025-11-19T19:18:13", "owner": "phacup", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864859384433811, "text": "They wanted to vanish 😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T18:58:03", "owner": "sorcererdarkhold_666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145367575437359, "text": "White people 😂😹", "created_at": "2025-11-19T18:19:51", "owner": "h4r3krsna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027717683762539, "text": "That last one embarrassed by mom but not that bowl cut….😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T17:46:26", "owner": "wellhell67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008471675810922, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-19T17:21:58", "owner": "3rdcoast.angler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020374790787589, "text": "I took great pleasure and pride in making the kids uncomfortable.", "created_at": "2025-11-19T17:09:17", "owner": "jackson9672024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165863203383558, "text": "I been calling my husband daddy since our first child. It’s a normal thing especially down South", "created_at": "2025-11-19T16:11:22", "owner": "theserialhustlenomic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085424356815996, "text": "How do they think they got here 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T16:11:05", "owner": "msley_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913089223098244, "text": "My kids see my husband and I showing affection towards one another is teaching how to be a good spouse. My parents only ever yelled at one another. So yes, I also call my husband \"Daddy\" 😂🔥❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-19T15:34:16", "owner": "stitching_saber", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096195913669773, "text": "Girl: DAMNNNNN", "created_at": "2025-11-19T15:34:10", "owner": "henriquecalland", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100063417670424, "text": "Half those kids shouldn't understand the reference 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T15:15:01", "owner": "triberussell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110611741610803, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T14:48:24", "owner": "downing6529", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916881859229600, "text": "Wouldn’t work. Been calling my husband “daddy” since we had a kid. My teen doesn’t even bat an eye.", "created_at": "2025-11-19T14:41:12", "owner": "kimmyg_42", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963820032868292, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T14:31:27", "owner": "evil_craniax_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000701903828279, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T13:58:36", "owner": "smileyshreya_11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075324194240140, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T13:37:54", "owner": "kp448_8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097175740789296, "text": "Bedroom stuff 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T12:09:51", "owner": "4lmost_th3r3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18381742876145053, "text": "It's always the daughters that react 🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-19T11:28:23", "owner": "mbappejr2407", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145835395432783, "text": "Why they know this IS the question", "created_at": "2025-11-19T11:12:18", "owner": "jo_isinfinite", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18347595118200150, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T11:10:56", "owner": "mp_f410", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119017882552610, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T10:52:37", "owner": "marwan_marwan_marwan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065816171126586, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T10:38:32", "owner": "martinpaidar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18431384236106810, "text": "The last one 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T10:36:04", "owner": "said.aysll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064081445451129, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-19T10:26:26", "owner": "kurzen_30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897028261341640, "text": "Last one 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T08:46:37", "owner": "sakamoto_taro7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979782630922747, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T08:12:29", "owner": "this__alireza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947748978932631, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T07:18:38", "owner": "seyfuhkun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081168641125858, "text": "why the mf in th bowl cut laughing 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-19T07:10:47", "owner": "tokyos.revengee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902100667164184, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T06:12:47", "owner": "curated_blendz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911114704253312, "text": "The bowl cut at the end 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T05:52:49", "owner": "oddball_1984", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062369447395095, "text": "That is fucking disgusting", "created_at": "2025-11-19T05:44:34", "owner": "beckstroud", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18174137386369864, "text": "The yellow cup girl had the best reaction", "created_at": "2025-11-19T05:20:54", "owner": "sylathis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18394545844133948, "text": "The moms laugh on the first one is pure gold 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T04:58:10", "owner": "dirk.jay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060487556541144, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T04:17:22", "owner": "rdmv67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056009576307393, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T03:11:39", "owner": "visser3271", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062767589531513, "text": "Now do it in front of their friends 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T03:00:41", "owner": "danarchy777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18371868202159308, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T02:59:33", "owner": "dovhakin1983", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932216485111342, "text": "The last one….😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T02:55:26", "owner": "avirnig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120308968535848, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T02:54:00", "owner": "pamelacobbvail", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113750854585615, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T02:29:54", "owner": "raciel_cris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183133006348965, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T02:23:04", "owner": "badabim_badaboomx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542056165039655, "text": "Funny as H***. Makes me think of how my 2 would react.  LMAO", "created_at": "2025-11-19T01:24:57", "owner": "bonanza_joe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083266361077844, "text": "Holy bowl cut Batman!", "created_at": "2025-11-19T00:55:50", "owner": "fish4life1994", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18169890445331061, "text": "I wanna know why that little girl gets that message ? Kinda odd", "created_at": "2025-11-19T00:47:32", "owner": "tjucpc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905862223278799, "text": "I never understood the real meaning for “daddy” in this context. Can someone explain it? (Here in Brasil we don’t use that)", "created_at": "2025-11-19T00:29:20", "owner": "thiagothomas.vocal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033780320719189, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T23:51:52", "owner": "iamabhishekshaw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056588396304460, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T23:43:08", "owner": "hay_der_ali", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086739346798005, "text": "Qual a brisa? 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T23:36:47", "owner": "bielmarques.xy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080375597325597, "text": "Why😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T23:18:19", "owner": "husna_setya_purwaningsih", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918768655198414, "text": "As my dad would tell us,”How do you think you got here.”", "created_at": "2025-11-18T22:35:10", "owner": "richardsoncaleb70", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18349038121163969, "text": "That’s weird AF", "created_at": "2025-11-18T21:44:58", "owner": "c._matthew_terrell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046308776422025, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-18T21:33:50", "owner": "clove2_3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041571839499567, "text": "Porque é vergonhoso?", "created_at": "2025-11-18T21:31:07", "owner": "mercadoebazarda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18174450952369037, "text": "Who’s yer daddy? 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T21:18:22", "owner": "bbarber7419", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095366446871875, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T21:05:31", "owner": "texasraiderfan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101538793671805, "text": "@vanagrimm", "created_at": "2025-11-18T20:52:36", "owner": "maik.grimm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18178180384359683, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T20:38:21", "owner": "pierrean_grr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137617696460793, "text": "Me: “Hey (daughter’s name), you want some Daddy daughter time with a movie tomorrow?”\n\nDaughter: “Yeah, but it’s “father daughter” time because only mom calls you “Daddy.””\n\n… this child is going places…", "created_at": "2025-11-18T20:30:22", "owner": "obsidian_sithin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886349851393996, "text": "My wife been calling me daddy in front of our kids their whole life, in front of our parents. In public doesn't matter. I call her Mami same way. It's normal. Let's normalize pet names", "created_at": "2025-11-18T19:45:00", "owner": "filthyphatboi83", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18547307287005640, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T19:38:36", "owner": "drsilver__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079200503131784, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T18:39:02", "owner": "bulli4780", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18089050898492549, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T18:33:58", "owner": "chill_town_rob", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17927120937160529, "text": "All them sitting there like ay yooo", "created_at": "2025-11-18T18:24:53", "owner": "shapingskulls", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18386869735179993, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T18:23:18", "owner": "gimpyoldman_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067005956367264, "text": "Now imagine he is her real daddy 🫣", "created_at": "2025-11-18T18:22:29", "owner": "smile290982", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122369677517341, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T18:13:02", "owner": "gabrielleberniceclennon64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872111065459385, "text": "2 girl look high", "created_at": "2025-11-18T18:02:49", "owner": "ishanka_qla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105581023653821, "text": "The last one traumatized those kids😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T18:01:17", "owner": "this_is_osmium", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050145578367970, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T17:52:50", "owner": "shawn_ships_cars", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082522906878983, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T17:51:34", "owner": "geesege9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064853894628453, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T17:51:33", "owner": "robby_robertorobz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304311373248692, "text": "If I was a girl, I'd be super grossed out that my dad likes to be called \"daddy\" in that way....probably slightly or a lot scared.", "created_at": "2025-11-18T17:29:23", "owner": "hall.kevinjames", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960461215001727, "text": "So nobody else saw that kids Utah’s polygamy hair cut on that last one", "created_at": "2025-11-18T17:26:30", "owner": "whitesnake_moan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029884358732384, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:19:37", "owner": "cortesben", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109186507721552, "text": "Не стОит переводить 😂 Всё понятно", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:57:06", "owner": "ahuivashka", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18374224459155796, "text": "Why would these young kids have any inkling what daddy means?", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:40:40", "owner": "brianzamparelli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118845928480959, "text": "Roflmao done 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:40:04", "owner": "sirmathewaccetti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142599328444067, "text": "Бригада?", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:21:36", "owner": "the_chernov_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18433269808110343, "text": "Somebody tell me what the meaning is", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:12:48", "owner": "rasoolmohammad995", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074440577223963, "text": "Ne anlama geliyor bu biri açıklaya bilirmi lütfen", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:10:36", "owner": "bedirhan.253", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118361065556843, "text": "You can’t just say “daddy” it’s got to be “💕Daddy💕” You really got to make those kids die of embarrassment.", "created_at": "2025-11-18T14:49:49", "owner": "s.crabtree76", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856823197559965, "text": "I love the expression on the girl in the backseat of the car.", "created_at": "2025-11-18T14:27:45", "owner": "dessaguy2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543461161000649, "text": "Last kid shoulda said “What?” to that haircut.", "created_at": "2025-11-18T14:26:07", "owner": "joncfoto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890751772244231, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T14:22:15", "owner": "yanis_karamanos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087643747767993, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-18T12:30:13", "owner": "rodneygreen5996", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18499436107079512, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-18T12:30:08", "owner": "seabee429", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033127829528158, "text": "how do the kids, especially the youngest ones know this?", "created_at": "2025-11-18T11:36:59", "owner": "john.us.hanlon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963683521002772, "text": "Bedroom stuff😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T11:27:57", "owner": "domoboby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541773832010418, "text": "Terrible 👑", "created_at": "2025-11-18T11:25:07", "owner": "pam_pachak999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890762809368294, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T11:09:05", "owner": "bbryan1973", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293702497278305, "text": "so what?", "created_at": "2025-11-18T11:02:47", "owner": "ryandaveguico", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18538180093022266, "text": "That’s sweettt come onnnn", "created_at": "2025-11-18T09:57:58", "owner": "allaboutherdays", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891400558367360, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T09:33:22", "owner": "justinvtee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298486165284052, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T05:44:46", "owner": "timothy.mark9563", "likes": 27}, {"id": 17926649238151793, "text": "At least she’s getting her treatment", "created_at": "2025-11-18T04:40:36", "owner": "matthewb81702", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073109453583381, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T03:26:59", "owner": "jaimeestradamoreno", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940914352092852, "text": "😆", "created_at": "2025-11-18T03:15:34", "owner": "gabbie64964", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058926617635978, "text": "Calling someone u have sex with “daddy” is gross.  Why is this a thing??", "created_at": "2025-11-18T02:53:37", "owner": "ikathyb71", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899283772183167, "text": "She knew that was bedroom stuff. 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T02:44:08", "owner": "soso_icey", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18044068118481133, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T02:17:30", "owner": "graciemc1986", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904908676276067, "text": "please someone explain", "created_at": "2025-11-18T02:16:19", "owner": "jorgemiranda_la1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081563204031118, "text": "Me lo pueden explicar para un argentino? No entiendo el chiste", "created_at": "2025-11-18T02:05:08", "owner": "nicolas_latina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031872398753676, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣 the last one- the youngest child was straight OFFENDED 🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-18T01:43:40", "owner": "kctatumdfo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104901931649983, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T01:36:21", "owner": "surtur_ca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925756948029803, "text": "These are funny!!", "created_at": "2025-11-18T01:30:43", "owner": "murphy333003", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085136222513745, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T01:14:01", "owner": "brittney_knows_realty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977972841935046, "text": "งง", "created_at": "2025-11-18T00:52:16", "owner": "maeyed_iharenie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921410887053600, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T00:33:19", "owner": "helenlucy30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058001798248359, "text": "The fact that all these kids know what it means is disturbing lol😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T23:49:35", "owner": "airborne0929", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158100145400390, "text": "Pornkids", "created_at": "2025-11-17T23:15:46", "owner": "schalkse_49", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849398290597633, "text": "My MIL always called my FIL this 😂\nTook me a min to get used to, ngl", "created_at": "2025-11-17T22:56:07", "owner": "irahdei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18300956941250811, "text": "Whats with that?", "created_at": "2025-11-17T21:32:43", "owner": "demetris_georgoulis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971452515814388, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T21:31:07", "owner": "your_highness_quay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352231978161269, "text": "Bombastic side-eye from her daughter at the end...😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T21:02:00", "owner": "splash.frost", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066942707528687, "text": "This is funny 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-17T20:27:59", "owner": "shodow_1997", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007087178657966, "text": "What’s that fucking haircut", "created_at": "2025-11-17T20:15:18", "owner": "uggghgross", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085236637790257, "text": "The girl is right, bedroom stuff should be in private", "created_at": "2025-11-17T20:11:48", "owner": "sunny_nurda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903657331287262, "text": "Thats bedroom stuff hahahaha😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T19:36:26", "owner": "markus__krueger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119028013534974, "text": "The youngest daughter face,pure n utter disgust!", "created_at": "2025-11-17T19:35:25", "owner": "griffinsez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104049331642683, "text": "İdk", "created_at": "2025-11-17T18:48:23", "owner": "ssrouquess", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18294037210259894, "text": "@bettyrosina_", "created_at": "2025-11-17T18:20:54", "owner": "adamcharleslukegarnier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998009556839438, "text": "It is normal in our culture to call your husband daddy affront of your kids just to imphasize on his role or to the kids that he is the Dady", "created_at": "2025-11-17T12:47:49", "owner": "alaa_al_esh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085515076823909, "text": "My grandma called my grandpa \"Dad/Daddy\" when their kids were around, just meaning he was the father of the house. But yeah, if you don't use it like that. Then outta nowhere. That would be gross😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T12:10:48", "owner": "tinnitus_brad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041586299703189, "text": "Why?", "created_at": "2025-11-17T10:25:24", "owner": "freeskier_takeshi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057302465299781, "text": "emm aku selalu panggil laki aku abah..abah sayang mama tak😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T09:39:35", "owner": "cik_bunga0895", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18208147672314829, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-17T08:47:30", "owner": "eppsfactor95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121939642464449, "text": "Foolish 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-17T08:45:30", "owner": "kimlerkimder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146702806442580, "text": "I mean they’re teenagers, how can they know its a bedroom stuff lol", "created_at": "2025-11-17T08:20:11", "owner": "_ewbo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083173112086487, "text": "Daddy😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T08:12:19", "owner": "ermanparcon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088668563501424, "text": "The fact that in mexican culture you call \"papi\" to little kids as inderment and a lot of times wifes openly call their husbands that to just like as a caring way with no $exualization, we hear our parents say stuff like that all the time (along with mamá, papá, mami, papi, just to each other and little kids)", "created_at": "2025-11-17T08:00:32", "owner": "nic0le_v3ntu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971755362797453, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T07:58:59", "owner": "raffaele_mero_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18162171112399254, "text": "In Germany this is normal that people call their husband or wife as dad or mom in front of the kids 🤷🏻‍♂️ Mostly old people 😅", "created_at": "2025-11-17T07:58:30", "owner": "fabianwantel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935968524980514, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T07:39:57", "owner": "zayu_312", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961065612858672, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T07:22:49", "owner": "selbybower", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098514589695331, "text": "Okay am I the only one who grew up with mom and dad calling each other that without it having an innuendo?? 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T07:00:49", "owner": "sarah_n_richart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074496674350497, "text": "Protect number 2 at all costs", "created_at": "2025-11-17T06:37:05", "owner": "earthyspoon83765", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041860799651228, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-17T06:35:27", "owner": "redacted.ger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979029810781214, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T06:05:59", "owner": "westp1ru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073274894203502, "text": "the thing is, it's only weird mostly in the west cause you all made \"daddy\" weird.", "created_at": "2025-11-17T05:31:56", "owner": "edzrama", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18349158142201790, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T05:21:43", "owner": "luis.gutierrez1024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104099764640725, "text": "The little girl took me out, confused af 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T04:53:10", "owner": "batuc11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18151606516417596, "text": "The kids at the end. 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T04:13:14", "owner": "limmick", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103666819643900, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T03:40:27", "owner": "cin_o_m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18548404549063720, "text": "@feelwitchy 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T03:15:47", "owner": "haney.1773", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035487839717948, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T02:58:34", "owner": "savageghost77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057232982275866, "text": "So all Christian daughter are no more virgin in this reel😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T02:44:49", "owner": "shayeranasahil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103225117636137, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T02:44:04", "owner": "oficial_oliveira_nath", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085355050818770, "text": "Im definitely doing this on my birthday in front of my  kids.", "created_at": "2025-11-17T02:43:10", "owner": "raybani1973", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113041681585113, "text": "I never had to deal with that, my mama when she’s talkin about my daddy, litterally says shit like “daddy needs this.” Etc.", "created_at": "2025-11-17T02:29:09", "owner": "currygirl2_2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088211255310254, "text": "With that many kids you know shes called him daddy plenty", "created_at": "2025-11-17T01:49:47", "owner": "russlindner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075979735969239, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T01:49:02", "owner": "felizrobin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956850759886449, "text": "The bowl haircut in the last one did me in. 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T01:27:38", "owner": "poodiemuckle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542110933044142, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T01:25:54", "owner": "fitriarpugh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904601050145900, "text": "It's quite normal with Asian where people call each other by their highest position in the family. For example husband can be call daddy when their child has no child yet, but like after their kids have kid, then the husband will be promoted to granddaddy.", "created_at": "2025-11-17T01:05:13", "owner": "jasonminh94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067140587527998, "text": "In Indonesia, they (husband and wife) normally call each other with mom and daddy", "created_at": "2025-11-17T00:55:48", "owner": "meds_ca97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091285948731645, "text": "That slow turn/side eye in the last video was diabolical!", "created_at": "2025-11-17T00:38:30", "owner": "chazzzz_p_4875", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078362047919566, "text": "Only works in the us as they can’t tell the dad from the uncle", "created_at": "2025-11-17T00:37:02", "owner": "milobiddle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18536107171031350, "text": "As an actual father anyone calling me daddy besides my kids is just creepy and weird. Anyone who likes to be called daddy in the bedroom needs to have their harddrives checked.", "created_at": "2025-11-17T00:11:11", "owner": "sketch_arnold", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082622663011643, "text": "Nah, you're a whore 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-16T23:44:37", "owner": "brendonszen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107954794613808, "text": "Got love it daddy 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T23:37:31", "owner": "seven_2win", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078161572903389, "text": "I love this, laughing the whole time😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T23:18:57", "owner": "kaleb_skrzypek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107146891618767, "text": "I would be ✨️traumatized✨️", "created_at": "2025-11-16T23:12:28", "owner": "juliafrancesca29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539614915040383, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T23:07:37", "owner": "juan.c__16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076433719962028, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T22:43:15", "owner": "jpro_yo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143736538441332, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T22:16:58", "owner": "tatancardenas90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148431292426376, "text": "Para tener un pedofilo de presidente son bien cartuchos los gringos 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T22:05:17", "owner": "kealani666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103017826658870, "text": "When i was a teen that would have went in one ear out the other lol", "created_at": "2025-11-16T22:00:37", "owner": "craigdk4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865266166432042, "text": "Salt n pepper 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T21:43:05", "owner": "tbarbarian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147002722440542, "text": "My ex and I did this infront of my daughter when she was younger and I was with my ex. She got really mad and yelled \"no hes my daddy!\"", "created_at": "2025-11-16T21:34:10", "owner": "leos.lament", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001906706831343, "text": "Les enfants ont oublié comment ils étaient venus au monde 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T21:21:00", "owner": "arhk_dino93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048414299690809, "text": "Why is it the girls that freak out", "created_at": "2025-11-16T21:16:45", "owner": "graham.on.de.gram", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081584560891069, "text": "My grandmother ONLY called my grandfather Daddy.  And she kicked me out to go play many an afternoon. “Don’t come back in this house for at least two hours”. Then when I got older I realized…", "created_at": "2025-11-16T21:16:30", "owner": "yesitsjayagain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052902002667841, "text": "Why do all of the Kids in USA know what Daddy means?", "created_at": "2025-11-16T21:11:49", "owner": "s.m.damb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887493487392129, "text": "I thought that was normal... we use mama and baba to refer to females and males here 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T19:44:44", "owner": "tegcal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990383376902182, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T19:35:35", "owner": "jimmyfigz84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099655099685727, "text": "GOD DAMN I JUST UNDERSTOOD IT", "created_at": "2025-11-16T19:34:18", "owner": "nothing_good_to_see_lol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875906998441422, "text": "Sorry kid, you're not the *star of this chikchok", "created_at": "2025-11-16T19:30:23", "owner": "achadthatmaybeacat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935570889984716, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-16T19:14:50", "owner": "_urtypicalguy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541236070036667, "text": "I don’t know why, but the bedroom stuff one always extra funny for me!😂 she was shook AF! Lmao!", "created_at": "2025-11-16T19:08:17", "owner": "alexprinceariez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036335195706431, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😍👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-16T19:00:51", "owner": "ramirezhector2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107296510718269, "text": "Terrible 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T18:56:33", "owner": "grayking39", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934963150101367, "text": "This is only weird to the non melanated", "created_at": "2025-11-16T18:42:18", "owner": "justcallmemike7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184680967346251, "text": "P", "created_at": "2025-11-16T18:31:40", "owner": "iamkenkaku", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855657733561493, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T17:47:05", "owner": "davidaramoszaira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092536840920335, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T17:43:02", "owner": "kevinwurmser", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092986477911353, "text": "See my parents say inappropriate things like this in front of me all the time. So I can’t wait for the day I get a serious partner so I can give it right back to  my parents and say all sorts of stuff in front of them", "created_at": "2025-11-16T17:41:31", "owner": "libbyjo11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397892560193895, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T17:33:24", "owner": "poppa_ray_92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918290722207674, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T17:21:02", "owner": "gabrieldima78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847879234599209, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T17:16:11", "owner": "otaku4life87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916024177217110, "text": "Aaayyyoooo", "created_at": "2025-11-16T16:16:08", "owner": "fujiyama.panic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052035581660311, "text": "#1, is that kid from stranger things", "created_at": "2025-11-16T13:44:51", "owner": "pikapikachu3737", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17951714238028225, "text": "Why so many of you maniacs use paper/plastic dishes as a regular thing?!?", "created_at": "2025-11-16T11:41:34", "owner": "mistertony95", "likes": 28}, {"id": 17955093501033426, "text": "Terrible is diabolical lol", "created_at": "2025-11-16T11:37:34", "owner": "edc_and_stuff", "likes": 31}, {"id": 18065064551143449, "text": "Call her GOOD GIRL in return 🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-16T10:45:22", "owner": "lovethedeejaynow93", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18091327211507821, "text": "Hahahaha 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T05:53:33", "owner": "honkeie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144171079445295, "text": "So the girls are calling their boyfriends daddy.😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:03:23", "owner": "czecjohn", "likes": 40}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3726986812725522797, "shortcode": "DO46sJ_EfFt", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DO46sJ_EfFt/", "taken_at": "2025-09-22T03:25:02", "caption": "Which version of the song you heard first? 😂 #sofimanassyan #funny #relatable", "owner_username": "sofimanassyan", "owner_id": "175213552", "likes": 141222, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0094_DO46sJ_EfFt\\DO46sJ_EfFt_20250922_032502.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18077011534861209, "text": "The anxiety song gives me anxiety", "created_at": "2025-09-23T00:51:23", "owner": "ac1d_guts", "likes": 21116}, {"id": 18069913747960884, "text": "Honestly…I like the original, I don’t really like Anxiety..it hurt my soul to hear that the first time.😭", "created_at": "2025-09-22T15:04:44", "owner": "jiji.jangmi", "likes": 4315}, {"id": 17922307194150569, "text": "As an '09 I feel extremely offended", "created_at": "2025-09-25T00:04:42", "owner": "isfutile", "likes": 5548}, {"id": 17989315343849616, "text": "SOMEBODY'S WATCHING US HIS NAME IS JESUS👏👏👏🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-23T23:08:18", "owner": "vani_vanilla2", "likes": 94}, {"id": 18050199047309362, "text": "2012 and I know it", "created_at": "2025-09-23T17:14:19", "owner": "margotmommertz", "likes": 944}, {"id": 18078951428055829, "text": "Somebody That I Used to Know.", "created_at": "2025-09-24T07:08:57", "owner": "alexaaaa91608", "likes": 1689}, {"id": 18091495963699249, "text": "I was born in 2007 and heard when it first leased", "created_at": "2025-09-23T08:31:19", "owner": "stew5040", "likes": 143}, {"id": 17987239568911446, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-14T00:29:04", "owner": "jo1blink", "likes": 90}, {"id": 18428933110096507, "text": "I'm 2010 born but i like old one", "created_at": "2025-09-23T08:03:21", "owner": "baka_naushi.o", "likes": 145}, {"id": 18100565230795555, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:13:27", "owner": "london_harlan428256", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18099734887764425, "text": "As a 2013 I heard the first version and liked it better", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:38:06", "owner": "whois_haniyahk", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17879165205399772, "text": "2009 hates anxiety with our whole hearts", "created_at": "2025-09-22T19:58:10", "owner": "d3monic.us3r", "likes": 1100}, {"id": 17885987325364951, "text": "I’m from 2012 and I know the original.", "created_at": "2025-09-24T13:46:51", "owner": "l.jeliciccx", "likes": 50}, {"id": 18152675809414904, "text": "the anxiety version is so bad, why it is a thing?", "created_at": "2025-11-13T20:52:59", "owner": "vitor.bowen", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18538814296029714, "text": "Sorry what?  Anxiety came out like 2 years ago what the heck are you talking about?  And it's trash, just thought I should put that there too.", "created_at": "2025-11-09T08:14:17", "owner": "imagineering644", "likes": 75}, {"id": 18066308678012186, "text": "2011 and I still remember the first version", "created_at": "2025-09-22T04:40:46", "owner": "tomas.kusta", "likes": 425}, {"id": 18079700963486691, "text": "2011 and I prefer the original", "created_at": "2025-09-24T00:36:14", "owner": "chinychinchin_ry", "likes": 64}, {"id": 18342729436167326, "text": "I love the original, and anxiety just sucks😂", "created_at": "2025-09-29T16:54:34", "owner": "skz_girl_08", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17965629977987078, "text": "05? Im 2011 and even 2015 know the og one", "created_at": "2025-11-05T22:34:18", "owner": "lusia_in.crime", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17858254722454625, "text": "BUT YOU DIDNT HAVE TO CUT ME OFFFFF... realest song...", "created_at": "2025-10-02T05:27:29", "owner": "jsh_the.king", "likes": 192}, {"id": 17949122715019961, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-23T12:21:25", "owner": "m.saim5537", "likes": 535}, {"id": 18049111595353738, "text": "As a 2011 Gen Z, I DO NOT SING ANXIETY AFTER THAT INTRO...", "created_at": "2025-11-03T03:35:42", "owner": "levi.shults", "likes": 293}, {"id": 18079759628141066, "text": "Nah I was born 08 and I grew up on ‘somebody that I used to know’", "created_at": "2025-10-26T15:20:40", "owner": "itslondondrake", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18093587452857955, "text": "2005❌️genz✅️", "created_at": "2025-10-21T11:53:50", "owner": "ilaynabian505", "likes": 357}, {"id": 18099275371627624, "text": "I was born in 2010 and ik the original??", "created_at": "2025-09-23T00:11:45", "owner": "jax.conner3", "likes": 5300}, {"id": 17941107479961750, "text": "Im 2013 and I know this is the original and first the comes to my mind", "created_at": "2025-11-30T13:37:17", "owner": "darthvader422025", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18091377358930182, "text": "Anxiedih🥀", "created_at": "2025-11-23T14:33:58", "owner": "_fastgooner", "likes": 20}, {"id": 18070715618343098, "text": "Anxiety is just A 💩", "created_at": "2025-11-01T19:52:07", "owner": "sina_tonweber", "likes": 14}, {"id": 17985149294731504, "text": "I hate anxiety😔", "created_at": "2025-09-23T15:11:27", "owner": "vanny_kpopp", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18059750936408482, "text": "I was born in 2011 and i really liked this song when i was little!", "created_at": "2025-09-29T07:19:46", "owner": "8._.bea", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064431314420289, "text": "only the original ❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-21T19:46:26", "owner": "axl_rose_fp", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18078496507877806, "text": "I was born in 2012 and when i listend to anxiety i felt like i listend it before", "created_at": "2025-10-15T18:05:59", "owner": "rach.a9150", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17941333539092263, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-11T13:23:25", "owner": "jwan._.ayoub", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17943852234078911, "text": "I think she means after 2019", "created_at": "2025-11-08T02:42:34", "owner": "top_yuh", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17934688064982687, "text": "After 2012 maybe you mean 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-31T20:45:34", "owner": "motredella._._", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18366892636094147, "text": "Being from '07, I hate anxiety, it doesn't generate the same emotion as somebody that i used to know", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:01:36", "owner": "lelyuuuxs.x_x", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17897020719341641, "text": "You mean born after 2015\nThere's no chance in hell people aged 15-20 are thinking of that shitty remix 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-12T00:16:45", "owner": "causey_max", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17931734808132756, "text": "I, as a '06, love Somebody That I Used to Know. And despise Anxiety", "created_at": "2025-11-05T03:58:28", "owner": "oupa.john3", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17947479099078571, "text": "People born in 2012 but knows this song 👉", "created_at": "2025-12-12T10:15:36", "owner": "jreenergreener", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108055822529421, "text": "It’s not because you were born after 2005, it’s just because you don’t have good music taste!!! I was literally born in 2009!", "created_at": "2025-11-09T15:56:15", "owner": "livkor18", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17967797792973949, "text": "i was born in 2011 and i know and PREFER the original one", "created_at": "2025-10-29T00:36:37", "owner": "ale.d_2701", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18065061578389226, "text": "Ban Anxiety song👉", "created_at": "2025-11-18T17:11:56", "owner": "shivraj_d.45", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17878219335431748, "text": "Anxiety", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:01:18", "owner": "fader.fly", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18111868072477005, "text": "I know both of them 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-09-22T03:28:24", "owner": "pumpkin0926lg", "likes": 905}, {"id": 18024874565774297, "text": "No my brother was born in 2014 and he knows it", "created_at": "2025-11-21T06:26:56", "owner": "safirnagismolot52", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18164936098342953, "text": "I thought it was anxiety to being a 2008", "created_at": "2025-11-01T11:05:08", "owner": "anthonywheaton08", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18076866533173638, "text": "speak for yourself", "created_at": "2025-11-07T10:20:38", "owner": "_skias_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18100057018669525, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-02T18:36:53", "owner": "nick_spina24", "likes": 104}, {"id": 18116219650553048, "text": "You got the year wrong. I'm a 2007, and I still get pissed when it's Anxiety instead of Somebody I used to know playing", "created_at": "2025-10-28T18:00:29", "owner": "anitabarrera_2007", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18004311479819769, "text": "I know the original one and I’m 2009", "created_at": "2025-11-18T01:34:11", "owner": "gigip450", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884049142284645, "text": "It feels like the original version is much better (purely personal) (I was born in 2010) (Don't scold me)", "created_at": "2025-11-13T14:22:44", "owner": "leona_rsenal", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077250443100505, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-29T09:09:06", "owner": "arcade_nemo", "likes": 136}, {"id": 17865996249463680, "text": "ɪ ᴛʜᴏᴜɢʜᴛ ɪᴛ's ʙᴀ ʙᴀ ʙʟᴀᴄᴋ sʜᴇᴇᴘ 🐑", "created_at": "2025-10-01T09:40:10", "owner": "she_zuko7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087030197302176, "text": "The original, as an 04, I don't like anxiety, og beats new", "created_at": "2025-11-12T23:34:06", "owner": "raulk__218", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18122847703518012, "text": "YOU DIDNT HAVE TO CUT ME OFF 📢📢📢📢", "created_at": "2025-11-12T15:23:24", "owner": "rupdose", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18109474753721698, "text": "I know this song by that finger thing 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-11T08:46:56", "owner": "thats_me_anshika_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18108634246500163, "text": "After 2010", "created_at": "2025-09-23T18:36:59", "owner": "gregorstockem", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17863966992508303, "text": "Brat @_daika_zaika_  tova si mqsa na teb", "created_at": "2025-11-10T21:59:31", "owner": "rumbakizzz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17995571582681624, "text": "Bro I actually kinda don't like anxiety 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-09-22T15:15:25", "owner": "omimi2.0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068314802607538, "text": "Girl stop you're not special cuz you're old, kids born in 2014 still know the og version", "created_at": "2025-09-29T20:33:13", "owner": "omar_elharfi", "likes": 20}, {"id": 18081300560030984, "text": ".... I feel offended cause that's not true 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-09T17:28:22", "owner": "kyrie_max", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084571462993248, "text": "I'm literally born in 2009 and I don't sing that anxiety song", "created_at": "2025-11-09T12:00:57", "owner": "claudialachicaloca78", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068784032597391, "text": "Now n then...", "created_at": "2025-11-06T02:36:30", "owner": "mdm_456_09", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17990165084889447, "text": "Nah bro I grew up with the original", "created_at": "2025-11-08T06:38:05", "owner": "gigi_entertainmen1", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18247761427289311, "text": "As 2010 I know original...", "created_at": "2025-11-08T10:31:18", "owner": "m.jachimczakk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069205469200739, "text": "2005 ❌️ gen alpha ✅️", "created_at": "2025-11-04T21:55:20", "owner": "skyfr0676", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18117006250510654, "text": "I don’t like anxiety 🫥", "created_at": "2025-09-26T14:16:31", "owner": "aidanlaidan", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17898817128311734, "text": "Sameeeeeer", "created_at": "2025-11-02T02:48:29", "owner": "plengplengy_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17928191394117546, "text": "I’m 2005, absolutely not 😭😭 I will always sing the OG", "created_at": "2025-11-07T11:46:47", "owner": "scaley_the_dino", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18149991226421685, "text": "Somebody that I used to know haha", "created_at": "2025-11-06T13:56:32", "owner": "nate_epicsaurus_rex", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18312156982223966, "text": "‘08 here, how dare you", "created_at": "2025-11-06T06:16:43", "owner": "dogzill54", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086063755803901, "text": "As someone born after 2005, I don't think I'm comfortable without now and then here 🫠🫠🫠", "created_at": "2025-11-05T15:26:51", "owner": "l_sandyawan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17924326815154872, "text": "I’ll be pissed if this wasn’t a skit", "created_at": "2025-10-31T03:10:37", "owner": "tonyfromwiisports", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18085815676812018, "text": "I prefer Gotye’s version", "created_at": "2025-11-03T02:47:53", "owner": "ianndiorsfeet", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18307999618164928, "text": "That not true i hate anxiety I'm 2006 i love the original", "created_at": "2025-11-03T21:25:07", "owner": "sonia_leder", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18378420172195985, "text": "Ik both of them, but only the og is in my playlist", "created_at": "2025-10-18T09:37:00", "owner": "cld._.art", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080737909843285, "text": "Oh yeah you guys are so special", "created_at": "2025-11-01T17:56:47", "owner": "andreagonzalezv187", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18245243671290249, "text": "As a 2012 I totally agree \n.\n.\n.\n.\n.\n.\n.\n.\n\n.\n.\n\n.\n.\n.\n.\n.\n.\n.\n\n.\n\n.\n To cancel u 🥳🥳🥳🥳🥳🥳", "created_at": "2025-11-02T09:35:43", "owner": "sorour4325", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17855078559534564, "text": "bro i am born in 2012 and i know somebody i used to know when it was 2022 or something 💀", "created_at": "2025-09-22T04:53:32", "owner": "t.hanasarous_", "likes": 116}, {"id": 18106458175615974, "text": "I'm from 2008 and I was also going to start singing anxiety", "created_at": "2025-10-31T19:18:53", "owner": "ashnajabeen8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153264856399604, "text": "Me born in 2010 knowing the original song", "created_at": "2025-09-22T14:04:33", "owner": "_2pretty5t4r", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18294239809260306, "text": "Twinkle twinkle little star. How I wonder what you are.. up above my world so high like an diamond in the sky!", "created_at": "2025-10-31T08:21:11", "owner": "angel_70407", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17858703159538177, "text": "As a kid which still am but just younger i loved the video of the song", "created_at": "2025-10-28T15:35:08", "owner": "matyas4882", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18089294231494418, "text": "Anxiety better", "created_at": "2025-10-30T16:56:50", "owner": "laurineisenkolb", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080130091798289, "text": "I now the old😅", "created_at": "2025-09-22T21:52:44", "owner": "badieee_official", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17974744343936835, "text": "Je suis une 06 et je me fais toujours avoir et je chante l'original", "created_at": "2025-10-23T20:11:11", "owner": "audreylareine327", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17870240151453931, "text": "Umm no. I'm a 2006 and I despise Anxiety", "created_at": "2025-10-26T04:42:43", "owner": "smurfette_omelette", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17948273018897415, "text": "2011 I hate anxiety with all my being and I have been streaming somebody I used to know since I was like 5", "created_at": "2025-09-24T00:05:40", "owner": "evangelinajones_xx", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18160610839385531, "text": "Somebody that I used to know cures anxiety", "created_at": "2025-10-26T14:26:19", "owner": "kye.washington", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18425527945111658, "text": "I was born before 2005 and for me it goes \" Baa, baa, black sheep, have you any wool?\nYes, sir, yes, sir, three bags full\"", "created_at": "2025-10-25T16:12:35", "owner": "lkronik420l", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18285639175273367, "text": "Either or", "created_at": "2025-09-22T03:32:14", "owner": "totallynotclaudia25", "likes": 62}, {"id": 17915510310252913, "text": "Not me doing the finger dance thing😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-13T18:01:58", "owner": "call.me.michaellllllll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158581135404300, "text": "Anxiety its just so cringy", "created_at": "2025-12-13T13:26:14", "owner": "joacoromeroo02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104550094678835, "text": "Anxiety is giving anxiety to all", "created_at": "2025-12-13T09:36:38", "owner": "_yaxh._o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063827267642934, "text": "Me born in 2013 doing that finger thing😭", "created_at": "2025-12-13T07:23:44", "owner": "disanorin_cf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072978950598954, "text": "More like after 2015 duh", "created_at": "2025-12-13T00:48:48", "owner": "concretewall2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18386574001182399, "text": "I’m confused 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T21:11:04", "owner": "axa.taa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932453245138672, "text": "Anxiety gives me anxiety", "created_at": "2025-12-12T18:20:06", "owner": "maevecollins444", "likes": 0}, {"id"