owner": "adeevanoorcallista", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998667783703913, "text": "IM HIGHLY OFFENDED/ref", "created_at": "2025-12-10T04:36:03", "owner": "squidi6289", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099652825695534, "text": "2010 and the best one is the oldest one", "created_at": "2025-12-09T20:59:57", "owner": "frasav04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185205955351889, "text": "Who tf likes anxiety???", "created_at": "2025-12-09T20:23:35", "owner": "apazidis13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060764951254880, "text": "Huh", "created_at": "2025-12-09T19:25:14", "owner": "itzzyuqi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18341847001227402, "text": "Go fucking die", "created_at": "2025-12-09T18:51:28", "owner": "moldovanomar6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889454725262835, "text": "I hate the anxiety song that’s creator copied the original music", "created_at": "2025-12-09T17:59:17", "owner": "zbdl_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18198481195322093, "text": "Huh... Even exist something like 'anxiety' for that song?", "created_at": "2025-12-09T17:39:27", "owner": "n.amee.7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067945019616156, "text": "The finger song?", "created_at": "2025-12-09T17:13:56", "owner": "chunhuangchingjane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062515391239822, "text": "I only know the first one 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-09T09:42:35", "owner": "i.love.plushiee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080323816914301, "text": "Second ,idc", "created_at": "2025-12-09T03:43:39", "owner": "adehyper9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945011308081697, "text": "SOMEBODY YOU USED TO KNOW(i don’t listen to anxiety it’s trash btw born 2012)", "created_at": "2025-12-09T01:24:34", "owner": "charlottebond1211", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18355041463162724, "text": "I would say the younger genz hates anxiety too", "created_at": "2025-12-08T22:31:29", "owner": "f1zerstorertrams", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864380620535766, "text": "I'm 2008 and I feel offended", "created_at": "2025-12-08T15:31:36", "owner": "matixon0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104143429737524, "text": "2001 kid and I actually like both (the original is better tho)", "created_at": "2025-12-08T06:51:52", "owner": "cng507", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064084592191693, "text": "SOMEBODY THAT I USED TO KNOW BY GOTYE", "created_at": "2025-12-08T04:10:20", "owner": "david_anouchian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18370503193083533, "text": "I'm born in 2012 but the oh is better", "created_at": "2025-12-07T21:44:50", "owner": "itsmeadrianlii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352129237167154, "text": "Me knowing I was born way after 2005 and still preferring the original than Anxiety ———->", "created_at": "2025-12-07T17:16:47", "owner": "bookz.and.anime", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989303814906709, "text": "I am from 2014 and I started singing the original \n🎶✨Now and then I think of when we were together", "created_at": "2025-12-07T14:03:01", "owner": "elizabethkrzyzewski14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927239560033344, "text": "Hell. I'm 2012 and I HATE Anxiety I love \"somebody that I used to know\"", "created_at": "2025-12-07T11:55:42", "owner": "szymox4076", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140820664455345, "text": "I hate both of the songs", "created_at": "2025-12-07T03:24:28", "owner": "last.hope.wolf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946139821079029, "text": "Guess you're just somebody that I used to know", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:08:04", "owner": "kei.mon_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027292142762497, "text": "Nah 2012 too", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:43:07", "owner": "my_name_is_not_enable", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096128509881675, "text": "Excuse me? I was born in 2008 and I still don't like Anxiety?", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:54:39", "owner": "aeris__dreams", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092773027915723, "text": "Are we serious bruh. I'm 2009 and I listened to somebody I used to know.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:34:54", "owner": "beauxizawsome", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061278434641681, "text": "Eso es generalizar wey", "created_at": "2025-12-06T06:29:32", "owner": "mateoquezadamontana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001806590688468, "text": "09 and umm anxiety, I can’t with that song, but Someone that I used to know love it", "created_at": "2025-12-06T05:34:27", "owner": "ponyup261", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917959414232542, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T03:12:35", "owner": "allyk.208", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959666583878360, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T02:52:48", "owner": "maucia1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981060906780060, "text": "Am I the only one who can listen to both songs at the same time?", "created_at": "2025-12-06T00:36:40", "owner": "jessy_furlan11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864561862532373, "text": "I know both songs and I was born in 2009 but I prefer somebody that I used to know", "created_at": "2025-12-06T00:07:34", "owner": "godfreyjuniper", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993260424888536, "text": "As a 2012 I feel very offended", "created_at": "2025-12-05T23:53:16", "owner": "minimicmax", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853456468590196, "text": "Omggg after 2013", "created_at": "2025-12-05T17:06:17", "owner": "jrubysss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106397680651214, "text": "Anxiety", "created_at": "2025-12-05T14:05:39", "owner": "haritos_dri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18300594256258270, "text": "As some kid born in '12 with a gacha phase I feel disrespected", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:58:28", "owner": "linnylean", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075509086998883, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:45:14", "owner": "todd_noo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18442475851097166, "text": "Only people who would sing anxiety are 40 yr old moms", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:03:18", "owner": "loreb312", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072659693249364, "text": "GOTYEEEEE-SOMEBODY THAT I USED TO KNOW IS WAY BETTER THAN ANXIETY ❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:58:06", "owner": "leone_deligne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063371483638114, "text": "Baa baa black sheep 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:25:14", "owner": "junrie.patigayon02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962801775861390, "text": "Nacido en 2011 y conozco el original y anxiety", "created_at": "2025-12-04T03:57:14", "owner": "manucordova1206", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104518138659088, "text": "Its galaxy brain meme song", "created_at": "2025-12-04T03:14:15", "owner": "communism228", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18351551797161136, "text": "Am i the only one that sang 'you didn't have to cut me off' 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:15:37", "owner": "me._pixel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084000578319269, "text": "As a 2013 girl I feel offended😢 I love the original", "created_at": "2025-12-03T19:14:45", "owner": "electraskarpa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133975273477128, "text": "This is offensive. I was born in 2009 and I grew up with Somebody that I used to know", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:32:42", "owner": "bandkidwriter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130139983498282, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:47:41", "owner": "oak_gemini", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129038608499640, "text": "You didnt have to cut me off, make out like it never happened and that we were nothing.  Btw I'm 2008", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:45:07", "owner": "shaleva217", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927854392148985, "text": "a b c d e f g", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:33:09", "owner": "ayushpai316", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100702918705982, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:22:47", "owner": "clemchou_1989", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089079359480819, "text": "Anxiety gives me anxiety", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:41:53", "owner": "lea_insta2012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067953314116034, "text": "When i hear anxiety i wanna end my living", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:40:18", "owner": "sb.xlv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086484143012125, "text": "I would always sing \"somebody that I used to know\"  I absolutely hate anxiety I prefer the original version", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:45:21", "owner": "tota.llynotmira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031013627546984, "text": "I said bla bla black sheep 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:40:02", "owner": "wayum.viraj.3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926888557171894, "text": "You didn't have to cut me off", "created_at": "2025-12-01T08:01:32", "owner": "jakayadiatatur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113593744592659, "text": "As an 07, I agree", "created_at": "2025-12-01T05:00:02", "owner": "nicholes6245", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061525925560507, "text": "Anxiety can shoot itself in a ditch", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:43:52", "owner": "etaingiggus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078000449184706, "text": "Im 2010 and im offended", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:10:38", "owner": "_cecike_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059619854270931, "text": "2013 and I find anxiety very scary", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:10:50", "owner": "musicode_kavya7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095154841850569, "text": "You mean born after gen z", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:18:57", "owner": "sweetp.0tat.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926416984080368, "text": "Somebody Used to Know, was my jam when i was kindergarten", "created_at": "2025-11-30T13:19:50", "owner": "gehardpahalatua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088815136788389, "text": "2013 and hate anxiety", "created_at": "2025-11-30T10:57:06", "owner": "katarinak749", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005873789668036, "text": "The anxiety song should be banned", "created_at": "2025-11-30T09:42:11", "owner": "jacebrashier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105011479637023, "text": "The anxiety song is the worst song ever we should apologize to ksi", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:17:04", "owner": "joaquin_pinerua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940289413096320, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:35:39", "owner": "petrim72_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904909681277337, "text": "Your voice is beautiful.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:42:06", "owner": "ale.ks7686", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18398964238133804, "text": "Please get rid of anxiety", "created_at": "2025-11-29T19:30:52", "owner": "ethan_aspin25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18347455489204291, "text": "Well, i was born in 1994, i dont know this", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:49:41", "owner": "linkyboy94_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109287754528817, "text": "2012 and I still know this song really well", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:32:13", "owner": "miuukat._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137940610413975, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:00:22", "owner": "juliasirri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864721042530422, "text": "Make that born after 2015", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:16:32", "owner": "corntrooper2.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108885769548081, "text": "I heared the first one not the anxiety from deochi", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:10:58", "owner": "alexandra9485287", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127886464448384, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:04:23", "owner": "anka_bunuka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978591450946955, "text": "I’m offended, somebody that I used to know is the correct song. Not this", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:54:17", "owner": "frontierjax", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126315112503134, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:13:32", "owner": "1ngr1d_13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977900715954677, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:38:04", "owner": "danny_amirghah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130296349500595, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:35:30", "owner": "brainbow97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030004574742230, "text": "The worst part is that people give more credit to Anxiety than to the Original", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:07:23", "owner": "angelito_urip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18381490051148981, "text": "More like borñ after 2012", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:48:48", "owner": "shadowknowpain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916212535216796, "text": "as a gen alpha,fuck that anxiety song,I'd rather listen to Taylor swift", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:51:52", "owner": "therealcheeseoutlaw", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18547861336010488, "text": "2010 here! anxiety sucks!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:27:01", "owner": "vindowviper01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876455062442834, "text": "I always heared this song in my childhood , I had like a Walkman and there was this 1 song on it 😂❤️‍🩹", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:36: