r I’m 2007 and I like the original Better", "created_at": "2025-11-18T20:39:22", "owner": "westbaby_best", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18429290470108343, "text": "She is not doing it right", "created_at": "2025-11-18T19:00:27", "owner": "lucaskuipersmusic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097121116705679, "text": "✋❌", "created_at": "2025-11-18T17:36:03", "owner": "m_xs.vm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094726084853677, "text": "How to destroy Gen Alpha", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:16:19", "owner": "ilko_bratanov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927406348159834, "text": "I heard the original first🙏🏻🥀", "created_at": "2025-11-18T10:10:08", "owner": "whos.tanmayee.lol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848260816572488, "text": "As a 07’ i feel offended.", "created_at": "2025-11-18T09:35:42", "owner": "eliott.rmy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051572438655367, "text": "2005 ❌ gen z ✅", "created_at": "2025-11-17T22:01:52", "owner": "sidahmed_fekir_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997294491699048, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-17T21:29:29", "owner": "realmilfhours_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085661263818368, "text": "👌✋👌✋", "created_at": "2025-11-17T15:57:24", "owner": "1nonxly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18292456804285090, "text": ".................", "created_at": "2025-11-17T15:31:16", "owner": "sprzedam___nerke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142749250445490, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-17T14:05:17", "owner": "__not.your.ella__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18393028069193489, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T09:54:46", "owner": "shaundu_toit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086528149973808, "text": "I was born in 08 I grew up with Somebody I Used To Know. I HATE Anxiety", "created_at": "2025-11-16T23:37:51", "owner": "comrade.sinister", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920969533056379, "text": "When I hear someone singing Anxiety I have urge to kick or do the thing that William Afton did to kids", "created_at": "2025-11-16T17:38:53", "owner": "mp12312535", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935763201984533, "text": "Tf you mean. I'm 2010 and I prefer somebody that I used to know", "created_at": "2025-11-16T17:01:47", "owner": "manu_ohboy1007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084286835093509, "text": "The old one forever", "created_at": "2025-11-16T12:27:20", "owner": "its.rosaa_01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18498196039073568, "text": "You are off by like 15 years, anyone born before 2010 and maybe 2013 hates this", "created_at": "2025-11-16T05:58:40", "owner": "justincalhoun19311", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084513721993955, "text": "Nah, \"someone that I used to know\" is so much better than that crap (as a '07 I feel extremely offended)", "created_at": "2025-11-15T18:29:50", "owner": "_.lapis._156", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073128980355758, "text": "no? im born in 2013 and i hate anxiety ...", "created_at": "2025-11-15T12:19:31", "owner": "ostry__kabanos_1312", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979540470927760, "text": "2010 and I know the original and hate this new version so much", "created_at": "2025-11-15T07:18:28", "owner": "xavier_a_clippies", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062893025181049, "text": "me senti super ofendida", "created_at": "2025-11-15T01:36:48", "owner": "priivv.beccaaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879061891426009, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-14T18:59:16", "owner": "lucat_mmers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18533051401036806, "text": "Me listening to anxiety gives me anxiety", "created_at": "2025-11-14T13:58:27", "owner": "legoandplush", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881226982307115, "text": "I’m from 2006 and only listen to sombody that I used to know", "created_at": "2025-11-14T13:45:52", "owner": "yorben_pereboom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034980344510250, "text": "At first I like \"Anxiety\" but now idk it's just bad I like the original now", "created_at": "2025-11-14T09:59:13", "owner": "kastarafirmansyah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087299519314525, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-14T09:47:32", "owner": "han__00007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18231873697305729, "text": "Anxiety stole all of the instrumentals if this song", "created_at": "2025-11-14T01: