ter", "created_at": "2025-11-11T18:23:05", "owner": "andrewb_1272_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958217628992873, "text": "bro wth", "created_at": "2025-11-11T18:19:38", "owner": "kyliesswagger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071955425462496, "text": "to know❌ Anxiety✅", "created_at": "2025-11-11T09:29:12", "owner": "ergulozguraras", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18364454605087659, "text": "2005???? Brother when do you think the cutoff for gen z is???", "created_at": "2025-11-11T05:04:38", "owner": "ky_clavell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055911056639084, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-10T22:00:44", "owner": "cerentaskiran__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027466694757327, "text": "Im 2012 and I would know the original", "created_at": "2025-11-10T19:25:17", "owner": "bastlwithsteez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18380390830150620, "text": "I was born 2006", "created_at": "2025-11-10T15:47:57", "owner": "payton.06_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852275815578377, "text": "Bro just made millions of enemies. I was born 2007 and absolutely hate anxiety", "created_at": "2025-11-10T13:46:30", "owner": "_.ash.797._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948577458915221, "text": "This isn’t the original song, the original song is a Brazilian song from Luiz Gonzaga!", "created_at": "2025-11-10T13:12:14", "owner": "duu.hcarvalhoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18190552267326539, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-10T13:07:43", "owner": "l._.ls3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862629739516232, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-10T06:39:40", "owner": "vkiwee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064463498390429, "text": "Dude, after 2012, WE, GEN Z, (or some) have good taste", "created_at": "2025-11-10T02:07:16", "owner": "dap.gon_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035133095717470, "text": "Just you girl", "created_at": "2025-11-09T22:23:53", "owner": "saragzzzb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946758898059943, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-09T21:00:15", "owner": "zenobiyaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084156323000451, "text": "im a 09 baby and ik that song is somebody that i used 