es": 0}, {"id": 17948615154047627, "text": "I was born in 2008 but still somebody that I used to know is my fav", "created_at": "2025-11-06T19:37:16", "owner": "deadman___69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18242663398295211, "text": "Im an '08 and i prefer the original", "created_at": "2025-11-06T17:38:15", "owner": "alexmegp0id_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140245234443086, "text": "I'm Born 2010 but i still like the original one", "created_at": "2025-11-06T15:33:05", "owner": "dana_s.13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856287718554617, "text": "Anxiety song gives me anxiety 😂😂😔😮‍💨😮‍💨😮‍💨😮‍💨", "created_at": "2025-11-06T11:24:59", "owner": "jigy_dpnn2012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843238267604890, "text": "As a 2010 kid, i love the u used to cut me off, the anxiety is shit", "created_at": "2025-11-06T11:07:43", "owner": "ejgfn_gkw192010", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075256117960885, "text": "I love both of them ....", "created_at": "2025-11-06T05:02:40", "owner": "kazneedssleep", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989479704895019, "text": "Ahm..... Ahm... 🐭2011", "created_at": "2025-11-06T04:59:00", "owner": "wdym___imokayy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18537671284056936, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-06T03:18:42", "owner": "plara209", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092928406684828, "text": "i was born after ‘05 and im not scared to say ik gotye’s before doechii’s", "created_at": "2025-11-06T01:25:37", "owner": "fashioniqstaaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136551382417377, "text": "Not true, anyone past 2017", "created_at": "2025-11-06T00:47:05", "owner": "declaration.of.independence_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070934270355252, "text": "I think anybody born til this day won't sing fucking Anxiety along with this melody 😠", "created_at": "2025-11-05T23:07:33", "owner": "derschiri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073502396252741, "text": "Ban doechi", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:43:31", "owner": "umut_baytok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18187919323337133, "text": "Doechi ruins everything she touches", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:43:28", "owner": "umut_baytok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985467813870808, "text": "Somebody that i used to know>>>anxiety", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:43:15", "owner": "umut_baytok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082114253076709, "text": "My ears bleed when i hear anxiety or any other doechi song", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:42:46", "owner": "umut_baytok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932524225105714, "text": "I havent heared anything worse than anxiety", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:42:31", "owner": "umut_baytok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852799783570953, "text": "Doechis songs sound like a raccoon passing out while its stoned", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:42:15", "owner": "umut_baytok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979502334923256, "text": "I hate doechi so much", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:41:47", "owner": "umut_baytok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133704679475131, "text": "Mideity🥀", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:41:33", "owner": "umut_baytok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158086633401609, "text": "Midoechi🥀", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:41:23", "owner": "umut_baytok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079330214513877, "text": "Even kpop better than anxiety(or not i cant compare them)", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:41:15", "owner": "umut_baytok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015158816623159, "text": "Anxiety is the worst song oat", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:40:46", "owner": "umut_baytok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892499191220795, "text": "Anxiety is unbearable", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:40:23", "owner": "umut_baytok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971690811809021, "text": "Whenever i hear anxiety i want to tear apart my ears and explıde my mind", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:40:13", "owner": "umut_baytok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886640404263194, "text": "The original is way better", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:39:55", "owner": "umut_baytok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074099612273419, "text": "Anxietys lyrics are so stupid it makes no sense", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:39:32", "owner": "umut_baytok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069377189059853, "text": "The lyrics of anxiety is trash", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:39:20", "owner": "umut_baytok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108358822608440, "text": "Doechi shouldnt be considered an \"artist\"", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:39:01", "owner": "umut_baytok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985160490864683, "text": "Doechii ruined the dong so bad it gives me ptsd", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:38:35", "owner": "umut_baytok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101803576731791, "text": "The old was way better", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:38:19", "owner": "umut_baytok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870446713386807, "text": "Doechi ruined this generation", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:38:13", "owner": "umut_baytok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992490684713227, "text": "Doechi is weird", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:38:05", "owner": "umut_baytok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950412295046647, "text": "Doechi just makes stupid noises", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:38:00", "owner": "umut_baytok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18267528013304741, "text": "My grandmas fart is better than anxiety", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:37:41", "owner": "umut_baytok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062743955420351, "text": "This song has no skill", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:37:28", "owner": "umut_baytok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902692078297394, "text": "I hate this song", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:37:20", "owner": "umut_baytok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953346577030634, "text": "Honestly, I didn't even listen to anxiety till it became popular and I only listened to somebody I used to know so I'm kind of offended but no hate", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:05:25", "owner": "abbyroegirl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029017739751531, "text": "Japanese version of Sophie rose ahh", "created_at": "2025-11-05T17:07:24", "owner": "_makmal4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045944795450135, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-05T16:43:11", "owner": "unidentified_pikachu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864848494501888, "text": "Bro don't even, somebody I used to know came out in 2011/2012 😭 I was born in 2006 and that song was on the radio all the time when I was a kid", "created_at": "2025-11-05T14:21:09", "owner": "bladearu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100362223676198, "text": "That's how you beat anxiety. Teach them the right song. Gotye all the way.", "created_at": "2025-11-05T14:19:35", "owner": "gui.cante", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861666340519543, "text": "I hate the anxiety one so much", "created_at": "2025-11-05T05:26:28", "owner": "lilianaxoxo007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065402657122460, "text": "I’m ‘08 it angers me", "created_at": "2025-11-05T02:06:57", "owner": "love.ly.alliee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912650188235785, "text": "Me(2007) act the same with her", "created_at": "2025-11-05T01:15:18", "owner": "mason_shih07", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18091640284891234, "text": "I was born in 2012 and I was RAISED on this song def not that « anxiety » song", "created_at": "2025-11-04T23:28:57", "owner": "nadia.babineau__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890752741362279, "text": "I think the song is bah bah black sheep have you any wool? Yes sir yes sir I fogot the rest shit", "created_at": "2025-11-04T11:31:56", "owner": "drillsergeant490", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084244603817104, "text": "As an 10 person anxiety is shit", "created_at": "2025-11-04T11:16:03", "owner": "birkett_2710", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110907820584837, "text": "08 I got mad when anxiety played in Walmart", "created_at": "2025-11-04T09:26:03", "owner": "callaway.alana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089914462933298, "text": "2010 and i knew it 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-04T04:08:48", "owner": "piacat.justice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046671758398385, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-04T01:58:20", "owner": "anime.fan.jade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028961309536518, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-03T20:38:15", "owner": "a_ghost68", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064186622421763, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-03T19:39:02", "owner": "aylivaisthediva_027", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18429632266110621, "text": "This girl was literally created in a tube for social media purposes", "created_at": "2025-11-03T16:47:01", "owner": "headybandit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086655257295972, "text": "This is the other way around for me", "created_at": "2025-11-03T16:04:38", "owner": "ethanbeck105", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867577525405320, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-03T14:09:49", "owner": "dekguss.__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053840600648590, "text": "2013 and I know the original", "created_at": "2025-11-03T06:37:27", "owner": "dude_i_drink_paint", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949070236024906, "text": "You not dance any more ya? Just asking. Not a follower🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-03T05:12:48", "owner": "_mrnazirul_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061987778180132, "text": "Born 2014 Ik the original", "created_at": "2025-11-03T03:41:47", "owner": "somegirlnamedzauria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081732136973262, "text": "Thats also my reaction but only if its not Somebody I Used to Know but Anxiety 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-03T03:24:00", "owner": "samantha.hapka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144939418381539, "text": "I was born in 2003, and I know the original.", "created_at": "2025-11-03T01:55:30", "owner": "lilrich0edouble4oe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901094044295804, "text": "I know all 3, baba sheep, and the two on screen", "created_at": "2025-11-03T00:57:17", "owner": "irene_mei01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098854372741472, "text": "Im 2012 and i think the OG song is better we owe KSI an apology", "created_at": "2025-11-03T00:41:39", "owner": "kayhanpatel722", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084301249825630, "text": "I'm 2012 and i know the song not Anexity", "created_at": "2025-11-03T00:11:55", "owner": "lauryn2013pjo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057299507269425, "text": "More like after 2020", "created_at": "2025-11-02T23:05:38", "owner": "allmyfriendsrfruit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848148757592325, "text": "We now know the other song as just dance map gotyes version is better", "created_at": "2025-11-02T20:44:12", "owner": "ricky31134", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910931401240414, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-02T16:34:11", "owner": "_borisoww__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984009120871404, "text": "I was born in 2014 and ik the original", "created_at": "2025-11-02T09:10:40", "owner": "leo_mrtnk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146762548425773, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-02T08:01:46", "owner": "vincent.s.ruch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18395589646193771, "text": "What the name of this song someone pls tell me😢", "created_at": "2025-11-02T07:45:32", "owner": "maiwa.sm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861569293530717, "text": ".", "created_at": "2025-11-02T03:26:57", "owner": "truspinsoul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859575052537210, "text": "When she stared singing my smile was gone. I'm from the 2009 and I know the whole lyrics of the song. I seriously dislike the song anxiety, it's so annoying.", "created_at": "2025-11-02T00:13:37", "owner": "mochipowerrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947273536020002, "text": "I'm born in 2011 and I love Somebody that I used to know and dont like Anxiety ?", "created_at": "2025-11-01T20:20:10", "owner": "lysandre_._caps", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089188555928437, "text": "Me, when my sister puts songs on Spotify, she plays this song and I start singing, but it's this song😂", "created_at": "2025-11-01T17:42:48", "owner": "nicoleta547", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082943390512278, "text": "Me, a 2007 native, who listened to the song on repeat a few years ago: 👁️👄👁️", "created_at": "2025-11-01T15:18:15", "owner": "vikis.sunshine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929704153111424, "text": "I was born in 2015 and I know the original", "created_at": "2025-11-01T12:04:56", "owner": "em_utzza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991960020707052, "text": "I wonder how i wonder why", "created_at": "2025-11-01T09:02:31", "owner": "malikgabrielshaar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863522824507839, "text": "For me it is the exact opposite and I was born after 2005", "created_at": "2025-10-31T23:28:45", "owner": "drewknowstech", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913784020086360, "text": "I was released in 2010 and I know the original so sybau", "created_at": "2025-10-31T17:39:40", "owner": "no_32264", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084870739951133, "text": "2009 but I know the original", "created_at": "2025-10-31T16:00:33", "owner": "abby.dollar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903328030144270, "text": "Bro im 2006, and i known original song before that version", "created_at": "2025-10-31T14:30:23", "owner": "dogza900", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134034484478945, "text": "I am a 2013 one but still know you didn't have to cut me off", "created_at": "2025-10-31T12:49:58", "owner": "lavit_17_here", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054993572312385, "text": "Im 2005 and would sing the original. The anxiety song is more of a gen alpha thing. Plus its annoying as fuck😭", "created_at": "2025-10-31T05:19:48", "owner": "helllo.kitty_y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18291307525277306, "text": "Wait the lowk made me giggle", "created_at": "2025-10-31T04:01:25", "owner": "kat2.kool", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944551357065473, "text": "back away miss…..", "created_at": "2025-10-31T02:30:36", "owner": "rmnx_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135661189462311, "text": "I was born after 2005 and Sombody That You Used To Know is sooooooo much better", "created_at": "2025-10-30T23:08:17", "owner": "wack_ycat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978032985938834, "text": "I was born in 2008 and I know the original.", "created_at": "2025-10-30T22:49:08", "owner": "ethanfellen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064197134385335, "text": "Nah, born in 2009 and I hate the anxiety one", "created_at": "2025-10-30T20:31:45", "owner": "just._alexx09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970436730796456, "text": "Nobody cares about anxiety", "created_at": "2025-10-30T17:27:13", "owner": "8rud_ass", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094720144865636, "text": "I was born in 2012 and the original song was my childhood.", "created_at": "2025-10-30T15:51:59", "owner": "lindoronthetop.xd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000263303826842, "text": "Maybe 2013