, "owner": "jasperail44", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951796912041397, "text": "Somebody that I used to know 😍", "created_at": "2025-10-28T19:19:31", "owner": "starly_ali_lokmane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062624195627691, "text": "hey so that is wrong", "created_at": "2025-10-28T18:06:58", "owner": "icouldntwriteshmelhere", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986838213904872, "text": "Anxiety song sucks", "created_at": "2025-10-28T15:39:54", "owner": "natalija.gp03_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078690158118818, "text": "I know the both lol", "created_at": "2025-10-28T15:14:48", "owner": "nildasnl.35", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969787305967787, "text": "Sounds like the ABC song", "created_at": "2025-10-28T14:43:11", "owner": "toad__likes_picklez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076385293930374, "text": "I was born in 2011 and I know it", "created_at": "2025-10-28T13:24:08", "owner": "emmy_mitch05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008931473803311, "text": "AND YOU DIDN'T HAVE TO CUT ME OFF!", "created_at": "2025-10-28T10:38:43", "owner": "enzoloi72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896763364338147, "text": "2010 OG", "created_at": "2025-10-28T03:09:00", "owner": "back_again_amor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060875504162902, "text": "I hate anxiety", "created_at": "2025-10-27T20:54:10", "owner": "patriciaaaabarincovaaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061930187424753, "text": "More like born in 2013", "created_at": "2025-10-27T19:37:41", "owner": "asael_rivas__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077907227124503, "text": "I just can't unhear anymore the old song😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-27T14:29:08", "owner": "z._asuna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18163217146381783, "text": "Every time i hear the song on the radio or in a gasstation or market i try to guess wich one is it", "created_at": "2025-10-27T14:17:24", "owner": "alexandra_cr0itoru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063628889433527, "text": "Somebody I used to know", "created_at": "2025-10-27T00:34:29", "owner": "elizabristol18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109313080573117, "text": "Hey Gen Z, do you wanna revisit your childhood? Then come see my webcomic series about a team that time travels to the 2000s.", "created_at": "2025-10-26T18:58:59", "owner": "greenessentialmystery_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996964833831309, "text": "Uhm, 2008 and I know this? Hello??", "created_at": "2025-10-26T16:37:14", "owner": "tailsfan10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975619581944513, "text": "İts not true", "created_at": "2025-10-26T16:20:51", "owner": "hmaadk8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136446595459706, "text": "I love old version👏", "created_at": "2025-10-26T16:15:48", "owner": "mensimov_26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071480081203700, "text": "@yellow.pym no", "created_at": "2025-10-26T14:39:44", "owner": "tristanjpb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098373619683327, "text": "2008 knows the original", "created_at": "2025-10-26T08:38:09", "owner": "_.bad_zuz._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18393371626131139, "text": "The song Anxiety should be exterminated from earth..", "created_at": "2025-10-26T06:29:31", "owner": "aaaa.alice.eeee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985484079907589, "text": "I was born in 2007 and prefer the original the other one pisses me off 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-26T04:07:33", "owner": "scxrred_rxses", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117406798546239, "text": "We beefing with literal 20-year olds now🥀🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-25T23:02:52", "owner": "thousandyear_window", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888467764373516, "text": "Im 2012 and i was born to this song", "created_at": "2025-10-25T21:31:14", "owner": "deniska_stiskalova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104743465527188, "text": "long time no see", "created_at": "2025-10-25T20:05:02", "owner": "nocturnal031", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983402625859911, "text": "I prefer this song to \"anxiety\"", "created_at": "2025-10-25T19:22:30", "owner": "3maaz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18484105504073937, "text": "The originals better.", "created_at": "2025-10-25T16:36:36", "owner": "cameronn0427", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860523211517131, "text": "now and then i think of all the times you screwed me overrr", "created_at": "2025-10-25T14:54:48", "owner": "luciajisoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321344935245636, "text": "Uh no...", "created_at": "2025-10-25T11:50:53", "owner": "vavaaaa09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092607994888043, "text": "Я знаю что ты говоришь по русскому", "created_at": "2025-10-25T09:02:42", "owner": "arietta465", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153723838404547, "text": "Hearing the song anxiety after that intro is like winning a appointment", "created_at": "2025-10-25T06:43:28", "owner": "ayd_yb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070925294247719, "text": "I was born in 2010 I get pissed off when its “AnXiETy!!!!”", "created_at": "2025-10-25T06:28:28", "owner": "red_crayon_muncher5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874732501434444, "text": "And she also has a Mario labubu so ofc she’s gonna sing anxiety 🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-25T05:38:55", "owner": "skullz_1000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143099293428025, "text": "HAHAHAHAHAHAHAHA😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-24T23:44:10", "owner": "dionne_l27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042645545477008, "text": "Both at this point play in my head when I here the beat", "created_at": "2025-10-24T22:52:08", "owner": "emreyrenae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028441757543539, "text": "I hate anxiety so much just bc it freaking makes me so angry when I start singing the original..", "created_at": "2025-10-24T21:26:42", "owner": "moriah.neely.luvs.you", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366282592153958, "text": "BUT YOU DDINT HAVE TO CUT ME OFF", "created_at": "2025-10-24T18:26:35", "owner": "jordy_loves_liv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081192305086073, "text": "2011, and I prefer 'Somebody that i used to know' than the cursed \"Anxiety\"", "created_at": "2025-10-24T10:48:12", "owner": "niranjan_s_14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897278359182473, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-24T01:45:00", "owner": "k0ombiya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944428626934201, "text": "The original is better", "created_at": "2025-10-23T11:26:16", "owner": "xxrandytimexx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108778594588734, "te