lette", "created_at": "2025-10-22T02:48:44", "owner": "kayson_bruised", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871787680443919, "text": "More like born after 2024", "created_at": "2025-10-22T02:00:43", "owner": "santidemi01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102411874561682, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-21T21:49:16", "owner": "stane_boss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074598419516575, "text": "05??", "created_at": "2025-10-21T21:07:27", "owner": "korallover_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081446251822150, "text": "Anxiety🤮 original🥰", "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:24:46", "owner": "pavel_fabiaq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913819777228153, "text": "This is my favoriet song", "created_at": "2025-10-21T17:45:33", "owner": "charlotte.wierenga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119781091522689, "text": "I was born in 2007 and know the original 💀", "created_at": "2025-10-21T14:57:44", "owner": "_k4t4r1n4_5t_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100386586734923, "text": "2012 and every time I hear anxiety I wanna punch somebody THAT I USED TO KNOWWWW", "created_at": "2025-10-21T04:01:23", "owner": "xj_the_bean", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18029097386531195, "text": "I was born in 2015 so I am only 10 and I know the original", "created_at": "2025-10-21T01:52:21", "owner": "miahallog1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542113858008773, "text": "as an '11 i am offended to be associated with that stupid anxiety song😭", "created_at": "2025-10-21T01:48:31", "owner": "clarinet__yumm__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096839959702328, "text": "I was born 2011 and i like the original, this song is 2012", "created_at": "2025-10-20T21:48:58", "owner": "bernalvespf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866438800405477, "text": "You misstyped 2010", "created_at": "2025-10-20T20:19:02", "owner": "jens.ketting_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084140443796460, "text": "Bro after 2009", "created_at": "2025-10-20T16:23:44", "owner": "wd_jinx.v1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18357535054092286, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-20T12:54:58", "owner": "pirananfactory", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068864444048584, "te