d I know that this doesn't have any relation with anxiety", "created_at": "2025-10-01T10:01:38", "owner": "raadheygulmohar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981102057872351, "text": "Old 100% better", "created_at": "2025-10-01T08:51:09", "owner": "martin.benoni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099253735634850, "text": "I was born in 2009 and I still know the original one😂", "created_at": "2025-10-01T05:48:47", "owner": "park_anuj219", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051720629309834, "text": "Heyy🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-01T04:12:11", "owner": "followeveryone53", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18416670961116027, "text": "I'm from 2006 and this is so wrong. 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-09-30T21:49:00", "owner": "4nn0y1ng.m3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18309354046216411, "text": "Born in 2011 and Ik the og", "created_at": "2025-09-30T11:54:50", "owner": "thename.s_ilakiya", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18081222511796524, "text": "Why was the mosquito", "created_at": "2025-09-30T08:56:41", "owner": "samii_s_samiksha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060279215453116, "text": "i actually know the old version, like the chorus, but I never knew that the starting was the same as anxiety 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-30T07:21:36", "owner": "itz_lil_yuyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996320592683827, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-30T05:17:55", "owner": "sakx.rocks_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979084761878743, "text": "I think it’s up to 2012 people", "created_at": "2025-09-30T04:09:16", "owner": "jheyden_leonidas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970623576792978, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-29T10:33:57", "owner": "_shekeba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094292500615469, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-28T21:42:58", "owner": "afrianus.p", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138602317436348, "text": "I know the finger trend", "created_at": "2025-09-28T20:44:29", "owner": "clara.salesribeiro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068007530243265, "text": "Born after 2005 and proud to say im not like this", "created_at": "2025-09-28T20:12:10", "owner": "luhvstqr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18