the original", "created_at": "2025-09-28T01:25:13", "owner": "simply._.divin3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068654342249694, "text": "Am I the only one who likes both?", "created_at": "2025-09-28T00:36:38", "owner": "lacy_817_ph", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18289383040285384, "text": "the anxiety song is ass", "created_at": "2025-09-28T00:18:09", "owner": "articwolf34", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843803008583054, "text": "2007 😮😍", "created_at": "2025-09-27T21:59:44", "owner": "eli.the.dinosaur_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097940206710698, "text": "2009. Og>>>>>>> anxiety crap", "created_at": "2025-09-27T21:18:34", "owner": "dundari_13", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18410110813116682, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-27T18:22:14", "owner": "emmakaas16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077753474087114, "text": "Why does she have a Mario Labubu 😭💔", "created_at": "2025-09-27T16:40:28", "owner": "nugget_xdd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18358139452080258, "text": "I was born after 2005 and i like the real one", "created_at": "2025-09-27T15:40:27", "owner": "namusbae_vip03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877300786303818, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-27T14:56:11", "owner": "bakh_r0m0v", "likes": 16}, {"id": 18065121239595133, "text": "Pov you were born after 2025", "created_at": "2025-09-27T13:25:00", "owner": "1.s.o.r.a.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058427837543338, "text": "I’m the opposite I hear anxiety way too much", "created_at": "2025-09-27T11:24:59", "owner": "gabbyvartak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029533124713937, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-27T09:48:55", "owner": "niniko6293", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084096949929773, "text": "Ik both song", "created_at": "2025-09-27T09:03:16", "owner": "jaylo_chester", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141181183440834, "text": "2008 n ik the og", "created_at": "2025-09-27T05:27:28", "owner": "wasi_fr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984911892905047, "text": "After 2010 maybe", "created_at": "2025-09-26T19:15:32", "owner": "jxnnes.mrt09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044897651342048, "text": "Now and then, I think of when we were together\nLike when you said you felt so happy you could die\nTold myself that you were right for me\nBut felt so lonely in your company\nBut that was love, and it's an ache I still remember\nYou can get addicted to a certain kinda sadness\nLike resignation to the end, always the end\nSo when we found that we could not make sense\nWell, you said that we would still be friends\nBut I'll admit that I was glad it was over\nBut you didn't have to cut me off\nMake out like it never happened and that we were nothin'\nAnd I don't even need your love\nBut you treat me like a stranger, and that feels so rough\nNo, you didn't have to stoop so low\nHave your friends collect your records and then change your number\nGuess that I don't need that, though\nNow you're just somebody that I used to know\nNow you're just somebody that I used to know\nNow you're just somebody that I used to know\nNow and then, I think of all the times you screwed me over\nBut had me believin' it was always somethin' that I'd done\nBut I don't wanna live that way\nReadin' into every word you say\nYou said that you could let it go\nAnd I wouldn't catch you hung up on somebody that you used to know\nBut you didn't have to cut me off\nMake out like it never happened and that we were nothin' (ah)\nAnd I don't even need your love\nBut you treat me like a stranger, and that feels so rough (ah)\nNo, you didn't have to stoop so low\nHave your friends collect your records and then change your number (ah)\nGuess that I don't need that, though\nNow you're just somebody that I used to know\nSomebody I used to know\nSomebody (now you're just somebody that I used to know)\nSomebody I used to know\nSomebody (now you're just somebody that I used to know)\nI used to know\nThat I used to know\nI used to know somebody", "created_at": "2025-09-26T18:32:52", "owner": "johan.h.26", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17889993804345819, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-26T15:06:54", "owner": "f_z.u5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023158451763946, "text": "No no no", "created_at": "2025-09-26T10:43:34", "owner": "maria_xxiv_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006905207804367, "text": "2010 and I love the original", "created_at": "2025-09-26T00:08:36", "owner": "boyinthesouth2028", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076564805100401, "text": "Are you nuts?", "created_at": "2025-09-25T23:24:38", "owner": "shahrammuradi093", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033684338502040, "text": "Thats not possible if anxiety is from 2024 im 2013 i heard this song million times in 2020 with those scary vids", "created_at": "2025-09-25T20:29:25", "owner": "tomsecretidk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18423452197101219, "text": "No im a 2010 end i sing this music", "created_at": "2025-09-25T12:24:17", "owner": "lyajovien", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056033435423243, "text": "Wack gen", "created_at": "2025-09-25T05:47:33", "owner": "chingkhuba_hallaluyahuah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077217530015794, "text": "Hell naw, im 2006 and I will forever hate the anxiety version bro", "created_at": "2025-09-25T04:38:14", "owner": "mia_uneventful", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979658526910403, "text": "So we're Lying u are literally born after 2007. Don't ever try to lie again", "created_at": "2025-09-25T04:11:45", "owner": "_s3f08_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077038187016682, "text": "The one time Bru", "created_at": "2025-09-25T01:06:45", "owner": "notz.cori_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885676621245450, "text": "I like the og better nd im born after 2005", "created_at": "2025-09-25T00:38:46", "owner": "reastarz7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988867155853761, "text": "😣😢🤚🏻✋🏻❌", "created_at": "2025-09-24T20:31:28", "owner": "sophia.yaghoubi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074606330116313, "text": "I think you mean if you were born after 2010", "created_at": "2025-09-24T20:01:52", "owner": "lauren_smethurst1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041912453679104, "text": "Come to think of it you really like this dress 😊", "created_at": "2025-09-24T18:27:59", "owner": "bluefireesam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845906287574618, "text": "I was born way after that and I know the original… 😬", "created_at": "2025-09-24T17:24:47", "owner": "zoesmifh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18290660029259396, "text": "Cut the bullshit", "created_at": "2025-09-24T16:16:17", "owner": "fficsxx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092230276793566, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-24T15:57:32", "owner": "b0nes._4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858705589509176, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-24T14:31:16", "owner": "chungkimmy1104", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103609294608589, "text": "I heard somebody that i used to know first. And i HATE anxiety", "created_at": "2025-09-24T14:23:28", "owner": "hartsu.hertsu", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18080150161802781, "text": "Gotye", "created_at": "2025-09-24T14:09:05", "owner": "timeateglasi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106291795508418, "text": "𝟐𝟎𝟏𝟏 𝒂𝒏𝒅 𝑰 𝒔𝒊𝒏𝒈 𝒕𝒉𝒆𝒚 𝒖𝒔𝒆𝒅 𝒕𝒐 𝒄𝒖𝒕 𝒎𝒆 off🙂💀", "created_at": "2025-09-24T13:36:44", "owner": "r1t_a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058927442147576, "text": "The levela of cringe in this", "created_at": "2025-09-24T11:43:31", "owner": "whyiamherehey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934624080965797, "text": "Stfu", "created_at": "2025-09-24T10:58:08", "owner": "tam_lyd_444", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18239628868295340, "text": "Axienty is a 2025 song 😭", "created_at": "2025-09-24T10:14:58", "owner": "thodorisdalaveros", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058080212575831, "text": "🦭", "created_at": "2025-09-24T09:21:53", "owner": "thewolfore", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911647078212951, "text": "2013 and i hate it", "created_at": "2025-09-24T06:44:12", "owner": "yaelspam00", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18038640251693678, "text": "I like the origina", "created_at": "2025-09-24T06:29:35", "owner": "frankieleighaurelius", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042487421390205, "text": "Bruh, I was born in 2012 and I hate anxiety 😭", "created_at": "2025-09-24T06:22:40", "owner": "clikkie_seth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908786419092373, "text": "Anxiety gives me anxiety, coming from a 2009", "created_at": "2025-09-24T05:44:00", "owner": "joeyeyie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126400321469120, "text": "aloo khaoge", "created_at": "2025-09-24T05:15:08", "owner": "kaarav7713", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106150189516246, "text": "fuck do you mean \"after 2005\"", "created_at": "2025-09-24T03:24:50", "owner": "cowboykillingg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102168058529136, "text": "I love the original 2010", "created_at": "2025-09-24T03:00:45", "owner": "ifyouknowmeyoudont69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176237509353205, "text": "Not her saying anxiet...", "created_at": "2025-09-24T02:52:11", "owner": "onlymxico", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057550736420522, "text": "I was born after 2005 and I know the original", "created_at": "2025-09-24T02:38:19", "owner": "obvi_your_not_that_good_8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077961131096250, "text": "no??", "created_at": "2025-09-24T02:28:30", "owner": "zoey.raelynn.12", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063691865600854, "text": "I’m 2006 tho and I hate anxiety", "created_at": "2025-09-24T02:23:25", "owner": "alwaysthegoddamnbabysitter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043940429375036, "text": "I hate the song Anxiety but I love Somebody You Used To Know", "created_at": "2025-09-24T02:22:59", "owner": "alg_andrew", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928184974012626, "text": "2012 and I HATE the new one bro", "created_at": "2025-09-23T23:50:05", "owner": "xx_elena_a_xx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17968269224967627, "text": "🖐🏼🖐🏼🖐🏼🖐🏼🖐🏼❌❌❌❌", "created_at": "2025-09-23T23:30:00", "owner": "manuelacardozo.ok", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["sofimanassyan", "funny", "relatable"]},
{"media_id": 3776161495537183263, "shortcode": "DRnnt-MAGof", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRnnt-MAGof/", "taken_at": "2025-11-28T23:48:23", "caption": "宏福苑大火，制度層層失守\n由承建商、物管，到勞工處、房屋局、消防處，多重警告無人聽\n呢啲唔係天災，係人禍。\n\nPS火警設施圖片僅為參考，並非大廈原裝環境", "owner_username": "kong_hub", "owner_id": "36266977105", "likes": 50139, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0095_DRnnt-MAGof\\DRnnt-MAGof_20251128_234823.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18097155955834136, "text": "哩場火係哩個政府既成績表", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:28:46", "owner": "chan_kee", "likes": 396}, {"id": 18060282227560782, "text": "感謝有中英字幕，好幫到手，真係要畀個世界了解更多", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:05:27", "owner": "hohoho_krismashahaha", "likes": 1107}, {"id": 18085661507073134, "text": "以前香港仲話有ICAC,依家香港ICAC係一個名同過去😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:50:09", "owner": "lowbhui", "likes": 102}, {"id": 18061697369216228, "text": "唔講真係唔記得咗1.5億既緊急警示系統\n啲錢用咗 但無用過", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:54:14", "owner": "cuddle_me", "likes": 1068}, {"id": 18063877844540895, "text": "首先要多謝習近平主席", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:26:59", "owner": "nemuri0612", "likes": 200}, {"id": 17927785104153887, "text": "最尾彈出黎果條友好令人心寒🥶\n多謝你地發聲🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:45:32", "owner": "yuki_suki", "likes": 56}, {"id": 17854665186576390, "text": "你知我知單眼佬都知", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:49:26", "owner": "yipkwanfai", "likes": 943}, {"id": 18066501539384820, "text": "真到唔敢repost 開翻細ac先（悲情）", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:10:16", "owner": "stnt_workshop", "likes": 47}, {"id": 18231943552306082, "text": "勞工處，房屋局不作為", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:14:26", "owner": "snow_pear611", "likes": 46}, {"id": 18072894857350820, "text": "房屋局用澳門的圖咁攪笑？", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:43:19", "owner": "mikewong.jp", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18085611059003923, "text": "好完整，基本上講哂所有問題", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:52:05", "owner": "markch3ung", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18059599619265771, "text": "明白點解拉個連署訴求嘅大學生，但冇一個官員被拉或下台。", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:24:04", "owner": "kisthinking", "likes": 94}, {"id": 18024623849765962, "text": "個保安想盡力都無計，真係好灰", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:58:01", "owner": "voodoocowboy", "likes": 50}, {"id": 18086316265976133, "text": "講得好", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:27:12", "owner": "lycanlee1984", "likes": 31}, {"id": 18086539153820764, "text": "來龍去脈，十分清楚", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:16:08", "owner": "tastechampion", "likes": 15}, {"id": 17902956525162381, "text": "咁似乎係消防處勞工處及房屋局呢三個部門冇跟進喎！", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:15:57", "owner": "happygnuel", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18063784187407728, "text": "成個政府管治失效，偉大共产主義国家主席會搵哋算賬", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:22:48", "owner": "leonlamb", "likes": 35}, {"id": 18138176554412068, "text": "今次仲唔問責，真係害人不淺😡😡😡", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:26:09", "owner": "zilla.hk", "likes": 68}, {"id": 18099775693699064, "text": "緊急系統嗰個好有point\n即係如果喺屋企聽緊歌又唔知火燭嘅人收到呢個訊息都起碼知道着火", "created_at": "2025-12-02T09:41:21", "owner": "l.e.m.o.n_0505", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18075449288520244, "text": "邊個造成今日局面邊個承受，我永世都記得個阿婆叫人滿意你咪走囉，而家真係走晒啦", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:34:38", "owner": "hho0o__o0ohh", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17881886307422093, "text": "政府用收稅搶錢，呢班友用維修大廈搶，搵幾撚多都無用，輕輕鬆鬆拎每戶十幾萬", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:17:45", "owner": "kalam0829", "likes": 46}, {"id": 17845258338603244, "text": "要廣傳開去, 要全港人都知才有用", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:09:13", "owner": "modaobession", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18079448411135102, "text": "香港已經係一個高危嘅城市，隱患處處", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:49:32", "owner": "patk9896", "likes": 50}, {"id": 17900203680184099, "text": "勞工處屋宇署消防處三個署長辭職問責", "created_at": "2025-12-02T01:30:07", "owner": "funnyhkgse", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17933833716107783, "text": "全部局長都要下台", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:32:54", "owner": "louis_h1n", "likes": 30}, {"id": 17901579042326754, "text": "呢個講的太好了👏\n唔该唔好再係度講竹架唔夠金屬架好\n呢個講法係轉移視線，避重就輕\n因為如果only竹架有問題啲政府人員就可以話係落後唔係佢地失職", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:48:42", "owner": "mr_chan_vip", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18104891527645302, "text": "3.3億工程！應該分賍好平均！所以可以做到完全無人跟進！所以ICAC應對所有收到投訴而無跟進既官職人員進行調查！", "created_at": "2025-11-30T10:39:48", "owner": "lonely_driver88", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18086091427828755, "text": "越嚟越似中国喇", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:59:24", "owner": "jinrong452", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18189852007336299, "text": "ICAC needs to do their job, too many problem here", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:37:27", "owner": "chungdha", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17932587381115676, "text": "好能嬲", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:31:42", "owner": "waichunyuen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072198080353652, "text": "天災又好，人禍又好，只要是愛港就好☺️當然唔洗做出黎，口講就得😉", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:52:42", "owner": "mypippen", "likes": 41}, {"id": 18049377614682349, "text": "首先解決提出問題嘅人 有定罪 有收監 就再冇問題！", "created_at": "2025-12-11T12:03:53", "owner": "leungmingkam", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077154554221776, "text": "重點就係無左一班真正會盡責監督政府為民發聲既議員係香港 😢 淨返扮工同淨係識叫人和諧既人", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:37:52", "owner": "molly__momo", "likes": 37}, {"id": 17953822479023470, "text": "要管的人唔管， 唔到佢管的人又加多把咀入黎。 好意思咩。誰大誰惡誰正確", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:52:28", "owner": "benny__kwok", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18089196932311985, "text": "唔講唔記得個警報系統一早俾人掉左落垃圾桶!", "created_at": "2025-12-02T10:12:15", "owner": "tonysin123", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17901724605323785, "text": "咁多樣嘢加埋一齊簡直係謀殺", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:02:34", "owner": "liam._.avo__o", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18049481447400338, "text": "全城憤怒了。人神共憤。天理不容。", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:57:12", "owner": "ringtone2468", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17903058519322317, "text": "pk 鄧，出少句聲當幫忙😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:20:35", "owner": "yinkimiki", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18062358167199780, "text": "竹架永遠都好過金屬架", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:47:19", "owner": "chocolate_blueberry_117", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18120306511547275, "text": "冇左真係為民服務嘅派別監察，所有制度已經淪為虛有", "created_at": "2025-12-02T00:22:12", "owner": "vball_jumpman", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17902301919320452, "text": "消防高層都係咁", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:31:50", "owner": "snoopy88202005", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18074897339518704, "text": "國安處準備開車", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:27:44", "owner": "mr.travelgenius", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024434273783628, "text": "👏Well said", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:54:39", "owner": "alice_choi_0905", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17958913163878254, "text": "全部瓦解了", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:43:36", "owner": "stellagoei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951983494048805, "text": "咁緊要嘅大火唔去個緊急SMS alert function!!! QE AE有function改動用嚟alert全港巿民.................................., 唔識講! 再一次話比大家知<讀書多,職位高>並唔代表識做野!", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:42:14", "owner": "dorothy25521", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18084917888073431, "text": "最緊要感謝主席", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:03:12", "owner": "__aaa.ron", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18156121492409208, "text": "完全冇監管😡", "created_at": "2025-12-02T01:17:34", "owner": "acagneschan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079579715135710, "text": "今時今日講真相，有冇事㗎？", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:12:44", "owner": "sakiyummy", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18335935636239725, "text": "係要搞到甘震撼，震撼到無可能琴得住，全世界都見到，今日睇體育新聞都有個運動員話悼念香港嘅死難者，喺一個已發展城市，國際級嘅城市，發展左甘具體甘有規模同埋認受嘅各種法例同埋指引，發生甘震撼嘅事。以前d媒體早早會拎返d 歷史考證去講，依家無一家媒體做過！好，我自己去搵，查過維基百科，大家都可以去睇下，打關鍵字：［香港 火］就搵琴", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:28:43", "owner": "qql.ool", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18083431369856590, "text": "官僚就像銅場鐵壁火燒不進水潑不濕", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:06:02", "owner": "wanglu42446", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18061175780560925, "text": "今時今日嘅香港  一日唔死都已經要還一日神  走唔到嘅就自求多福啦", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:57:56", "owner": "jerrygonnafly", "likes": 20}, {"id": 18065565557424638, "text": "國安係會保護好呢啲 上流社會人才\n香港有救啦", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:56:04", "owner": "wht_thomas", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18079563532935878, "text": "建議可以翻譯成唔同既語言放上youtube 🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:21:27", "owner": "woodvilliage", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17891648034244011, "text": "回归后香港的日子越来越差 哎", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:12:54", "owner": "hoholooo", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18062421413542796, "text": "大家心知肚明", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:28:02", "owner": "07.18888", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17903302161304196, "text": "真嘅又唔講得😿\n講左又冇人理🥲", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:01:41", "owner": "_oka_man", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18026271482582072, "text": "有冇英文version？", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:30:33", "owner": "kittyleekt", "likes": 16}, {"id": 18193205485336130, "text": "我很好奇，现在香港人还能上街游行吗？", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:19:46", "owner": "xu_changcheng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153074713418536, "text": "想當年班後生仔做咁多野為乜？\n\n反賣房委資產\n反強積金\n反強醫保\n雨革\n黑暴\n\n香港人加油，返工", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:11:25", "owner": "03364263d", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18102448180665834, "text": "無言無奈", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:51:28", "owner": "yuksimchan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083105821877616, "text": "🆙🆙🆙", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:50:58", "owner": "rosie.icy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18544510720021073, "text": "政府冇辦法理咪報東張囉", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:27:12", "owner": "queenie.chui.96", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17971591157977091, "text": "佢哋會安心睡覺嗎？若然不報，時晨未到🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:38:41", "owner": "dannydannylee0725", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17879537763429927, "text": "唉！So sad to hear that.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:54:27", "owner": "danchoi882025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081915788116402, "text": "Well said", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:05:33", "owner": "lipstick_tassels", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18048382901412893, "text": "問題係邊度 。係個掣度", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:30:21", "owner": "yeung.ho.754", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098072413649434, "text": "有待真相……期待实情", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:42:13", "owner": "sun112337", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17857223424561814, "text": "飯桶文化", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:06:45", "owner": "kevinkouphoto", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18304855981249213, "text": "人祸", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:27:10", "owner": "christinelowwm", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17923418718190320, "text": "政府對香港人無交代，就要推到菲律賓，印尼，問責香港政府 (咁多caregivers過身)!!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:18:52", "owner": "onehungrycoconut", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087359486059011, "text": "由治及興！", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:07:22", "owner": "sssimon.so", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18202692982318472, "text": "🖕🏼🖕🏼🖕🏼🖕🏼🖕🏼🖕🏼🖕🏼🖕🏼🖕🏼🖕🏼🖕🏼🖕🏼🖕🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:16:07", "owner": "edenkclo", "likes": 20}, {"id": 17856100959569945, "text": "澳門房屋局：？", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:52:52", "owner": "mhy.damian", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18074756336245979, "text": "屌。片尾嚇親", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:24:26", "owner": "jasonpylam", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083710769085459, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:57:52", "owner": "gasovino", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18003119000821241, "text": "@zcd_lolfzach", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:26:43", "owner": "_tai_ya_ki_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157510615409401, "text": "Diu", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:42:34", "owner": "irisyips2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063076124216100, "text": "唔需要供樓,告政府🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-13T15:08:10", "owner": "wanwan8266", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980189586943447, "text": "自己人查咩！", "created_at": "2025-12-13T01:39:24", "owner": "garymok1003", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042870818496355, "text": "你唔認過到自己得 咁先有官威 但社會要你還", "created_at": "2025-12-12T14:11:49", "owner": "zackovervo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068479730123083, "text": "呢把聲係咪張文采？", "created_at": "2025-12-12T14:02:08", "owner": "yanyeecheung2023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136224283469085, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-12-12T04:10:57", "owner": "vivianlin0313", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121266010548575, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-12-12T01:21:57", "owner": "jeffchan002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143158435456510, "text": "蘋果日報後繼有人，每日抹黑政府自媒體", "created_at": "2025-12-11T20:39:52", "owner": "mademacau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097187797876749, "text": "😭😭事實！😭😭現實！", "created_at": "2025-12-11T14:46:22", "owner": "kooremon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077724787973642, "text": "反对派？去自愿捐献xx名单稳拉🌚", "created_at": "2025-12-10T14:00:23", "owner": "maak.huang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920400358236640, "text": "其實大家都明、都知係冇人咁講", "created_at": "2025-12-10T12:38:13", "owner": "ajdave8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18369867787085365, "text": "從有關政府部門查起，人命關天，這次火灾希望引起香港政府重視，不要坐在辦公室只識聽下邊人匯報、睇手上送來的文件，希望多啲親身了解及巡查", "created_at": "2025-12-10T01:37:01", "owner": "ianglaw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105093124656769, "text": "柒頭出耒吠請打格仔好嗎？？😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T00:51:27", "owner": "wing_m110", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18052570262354081, "text": "人禍", "created_at": "2025-12-09T03:50:25", "owner": "hopingtak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543218581027427, "text": "好撚小氣㗎呢班仆街，講一句都殺人全家", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:12:01", "owner": "billychan0512", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119790052529037, "text": "講得非常好，真係越聽越嬲⋯⋯⋯ 🤧", "created_at": "2025-12-08T18:50:40", "owner": "kyliechanoiyi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099642589767832, "text": "感謝報導真相😢😢", "created_at": "2025-12-08T18:34:31", "owner": "little_fan_fred", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104359435661903, "text": "💯❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-08T17:27:39", "owner": "moonaddsun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897336217356602, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-08T10:20:29", "owner": "kwanbol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059586020280780, "text": "佢哋話俾大家聽 咁又點呀？你吹得我脹咩？", "created_at": "2025-12-08T05:35:54", "owner": "danny1985112420200207", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900619375184557, "text": "謀殺既唔止係人", "created_at": "2025-12-07T16:12:55", "owner": "hk.wil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070876556594004, "text": "人禍😡😡😡", "created_at": "2025-12-07T15:01:08", "owner": "kikifung3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842960527637499, "text": "全政府部門冇做過嘢", "created_at": "2025-12-07T01:30:35", "owner": "sonic_monster", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084731375020706, "text": "有關官員要炒尤魚?", "created_at": "2025-12-06T13:15:29", "owner": "fishmanking", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104719807661822, "text": "廢柴", "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:13:04", "owner": "huangxiaoyan9000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18202041499318636, "text": "記者都查到咁，你哋要查幾耐先比到市民交代", "created_at": "2025-12-06T04:50:35", "owner": "hing227", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855585124576178, "text": "支持國務院介入調查", "created_at": "2025-12-06T02:49:44", "owner": "fafafifish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861574459542393, "text": "國安後的香港大陸化得驚人", "created_at": "2025-12-06T00:22:00", "owner": "acolourfulwinterday", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114770125576325, "text": "真係可以拘捕所有利益鏈？有官，有議員，有區議員，有承辦，有判頭，有黑社會，卻沒有\"調查\"", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:51:41", "owner": "ma_rio_son", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080051324272068, "text": "之前嗰十幾單火燭又唔見佢做嘢，出大單嘢喇先去做嘢呢班咪僕街政府都唔係做嘢㗎", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:22:57", "owner": "kcc.86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139678780416915, "text": "垃圾政府", "created_at": "2025-12-05T18:34:48", "owner": "le.e.30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085389728094534, "text": "🥶🥶🥶🥶🥶🥶🥶🥶🥶", "created_at": "2025-12-05T17:20:38", "owner": "jackylui744", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109414918615623, "text": "人命可貴 ！問責問責問責", "created_at": "2025-12-05T17:13:31", "owner": "fannychongle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069183530576484, "text": "次次都係出事先來查！冇事寫埋投訴信！你又當睇唔到唔理！呢啲仲唔係人為可以係咩！", "created_at": "2025-12-05T16:21:01", "owner": "ho_tsz_ming", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18384370822197564, "text": "香港李政府！請問你對宏福苑的冤魂,覺得點樣,不掉了之還是追責到底", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:08:37", "owner": "wakoksun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860727679550925, "text": "即係大部份嘅問題都係政府部門出現問題而導致", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:31:04", "owner": "bee_1010ve", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086445121990494, "text": "重中之重！", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:29:51", "owner": "sy.flora", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100632679695958, "text": "點解甘多膠層官員都無一個出來道歉！萎過於竹就算！又7出國際！好悲哀糸一個甘既城市生活！命如螻蟻！自求多福🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:59:01", "owner": "nicole_tsui007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376355692154223, "text": "一 Pat S (kanasai) !", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:04:03", "owner": "turbo.pajero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367854847092191, "text": "證明而家的政府高官？？？一啲作用都冇", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:50:31", "owner": "king41340624", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852864145547003, "text": "梗係唔會跟進啦？因為做官的佢本身都貪污", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:48:50", "owner": "king41340624", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092366393495408, "text": "首先三位處長，落台，唔該", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:13:46", "owner": "diem136268", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850438555599380, "text": "成個政府各個部門做得好好 睇721已經知道啦 加埋831", "created_at": "2025-12-04T14:35:57", "owner": "da_ddy03262024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012624521802331, "text": "要俾個like,支持民主，要安居樂業，市民必須要為自已發聲。", "created_at": "2025-12-04T14:01:02", "owner": "ansonchong2016", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914837344239369, "text": "又係借這個機會去抹黑香港政府", "created_at": "2025-12-04T12:30:07", "owner": "wallacewkn110", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085896263002035, "text": "如果香港人可以安居樂業嘅，唔擔心自己生命財產嘅，咁又何須咁樣表達自己意見呢？", "created_at": "2025-12-04T10:09:27", "owner": "vincentlee590", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849945355601047, "text": "好一句口口聲聲乜乜國際大都市，原來也只是垃圾化粪池渣人渣事", "created_at": "2025-12-04T10:04:21", "owner": "ray.hui.3979", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048118868441245, "text": "政府無能係人都知！懶人又多！反對派收錢去反對又係個個都知！有反對派可以解決問題？我真係有保留", "created_at": "2025-12-04T09:59:58", "owner": "dickwu1011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954989886901108, "text": "你有你講，閂埋門佢有佢䟴䟴腳 扮慘扮豬卸膊就最叻", "created_at": "2025-12-04T08:37:45", "owner": "laichuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081175268159569, "text": "消防掛牌跟閹左成個消防系統係兩件事", "created_at": "2025-12-04T06:36:04", "owner": "newtyperay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102726706664646, "text": "唔止唐超同big嬌 仲有柒婆", "created_at": "2025-12-03T16:43:57", "owner": "beautycaca1994", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946682650078612, "text": "呢幾個政府部門都有罪", "created_at": "2025-12-03T15:07:51", "owner": "mycandymei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082279220278471, "text": "落糖！", "created_at": "2025-12-03T13:28:22", "owner": "forrest_stop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109654012720200, "text": "Exactly like #GrenfellTowerFire in London. Concerns were brushed aside from working class ppl until it was too late 🤦🏻‍♂️🤬😭", "created_at": "2025-12-03T12:15:18", "owner": "dtks888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130214143496254, "text": "💔😭🤬", "created_at": "2025-12-03T12:09:23", "owner": "dtks888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046683905474165, "text": "支持周润发选香港特首。", "created_at": "2025-12-03T07:36:48", "owner": "poonlawrence", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099915454693703, "text": "係咪要迫到啲人上街呢？", "created_at": "2025-12-03T07:33:56", "owner": "bowie.wong.545", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864025693531759, "text": "做野既人都俾個政府DQ晒啦，得番啲忠誠的垃圾", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:52:05", "owner": "hfks89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025044368592145, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:28:35", "owner": "patpatlei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158743567405384, "text": "😡😡😡😂😂😂香港人相信政府真係有監管冇包庇，定係相信我係劉德華？", "created_at": "2025-12-03T00:32:29", "owner": "funnyhkgse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842672011626558, "text": "突然ig少咗好多宏福苑資訊!", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:26:31", "owner": "jiuj.iu97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006959393659754, "text": "講得好👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:47:34", "owner": "jaden_7886", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022612979602586, "text": "消防署長😮😮😮點向你嘅同袍交代啊", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:17:33", "owner": "g_for_pig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103693120727304, "text": "玩完咯hk", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:33:12", "owner": "tulong93333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088887073778248, "text": "多謝你，做得好詳細。", "created_at": "2025-12-02T15:19:15", "owner": "lewislo697", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074479100011978, "text": "你講都冇用啦， 呢個香港政府都聽唔到睇唔到嘅。", "created_at": "2025-12-02T15:12:44", "owner": "wc.chan5796", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994425531876520, "text": "仲要喎\n投左票先啦", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:51:56", "owner": "candice.meowmeow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107414107713086, "text": "奸商在政府保駕護航下為所欲為，坑害港人", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:37:47", "owner": "edward65hk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544061974049897, "text": "小心又俾人告煽動😢\nBtw 絕對係人喎！！！！！！！\nDllm rubbish HK gov 🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:52:21", "owner": "annat_un", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075037973250804, "text": "確實人禍，公務員多做多錯唔做唔錯，份工係政府就被人鬧，梗卸波咖。惡性循環黎。", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:18:09", "owner": "nichola.kwok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874646059453130, "text": "小丑", "created_at": "2025-12-02T11:08:38", "owner": "elsa.ho707", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010116935812783, "text": "感謝祖國 感謝黨", "created_at": "2025-12-02T10:57:49", "owner": "donkon251208", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987133890751509, "text": "好清晰", "created_at": "2025-12-02T10:42:36", "owner": "leochan2003", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109498303614349, "text": "要人頭落地！", "created_at": "2025-12-02T10:33:29", "owner": "kaiyan_lam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911529244254780, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-02T09:46:18", "owner": "twk.andy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065014745174098, "text": "嘩  真係要小心說話吖  D 公公好小氣㗎  因住國安又出頭喎 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T09:16:14", "owner": "ringo30708", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17870664270395469, "text": "😤😤", "created_at": "2025-12-02T07:53:39", "owner": "noahy_2022", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109900483613443, "text": "強制樓宇大維修，\n呢個餅咁大，", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:18:22", "owner": "hoiyiutang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970735887977147, "text": "Errr.. in legal documents you might wanna ask lawyers what should means... I'm not a lawyer but in some countries should means you have to, not a word that lets you some kind of vague area", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:14:07", "owner": "lemonk999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842191654636147, "text": "You can’t make this shit up 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:08:28", "owner": "avgrdn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083573738025000, "text": "佢幾時聲稱過\n如果聲稱過合規洗咩巡查所有地盤", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:07:11", "owner": "sai911202", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065634962454035, "text": "我说过香港没强制使用阻燃网的条例，还给喷过😂，所谓的言论自由就是脑瘫们可以随心所欲的胡说八道。", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:26:54", "owner": "haochen8635", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109013284718132, "text": "希望頭兩秒同最後兩秒可以打格仔真心見到就作嘔", "created_at": "2025-12-02T00:12:11", "owner": "adcdream", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18074884400252744, "text": "由治及興的年代", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:57:26", "owner": "lowabcdef", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096866569839415, "text": "呢d係外國分′鐘卑人告到政府甩褲", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:53:27", "owner": "nathan_hcf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098204293789604, "text": "其實講來都無用，過去式係唔受㗎，投訴咁多都唔理，即係大家都知咩事，所以收手唔做", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:41:35", "owner": "fortunato0_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909430792266185, "text": "其實鬧就預左\n有錯咪改囉", "created_at": "2025-12-01T12:33:42", "owner": "alicehocy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109219177718140, "text": "好L啱", "created_at": "2025-12-01T12:16:49", "owner": "houhillhill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088244317789695, "text": "攞咁多人工 都係得個睇字 唔撚理？", "created_at": "2025-12-01T11:55:55", "owner": "6666kuen66664", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077089445189127, "text": "啲問題咁深，唔識答", "created_at": "2025-12-01T11:26:48", "owner": "chanking.fai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844321705623052, "text": "緊急警示 潛水系統", "created_at": "2025-12-01T10:01:13", "owner": "ryan_chan__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998348991844780, "text": "WTFFF man 🤌🏽🤬🤬🤬🤬🤬🤬", "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:59:26", "owner": "mlfw_30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109777165542503, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:58:45", "owner": "mlfw_30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18395510380127942, "text": "仆街命鄧承機係度搭雞棚", "created_at": "2025-12-01T08:58:04", "owner": "emma.tse.982", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864715492529971, "text": "賊過興兵", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:51:48", "owner": "uncle_chris_chan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917600857212551, "text": "這班人攞咁高工資做這樣嘅事天理何在", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:37:25", "owner": "ahwah193", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063743852565968, "text": "真係無間道", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:36:46", "owner": "jacky3030", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540417391015642, "text": "以為死咗出黑白相，空歡喜！", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:13:16", "owner": "dannieyung_07241234", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048156527443118, "text": "冇人死咪冇事", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:17:53", "owner": "outrex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889842457387386, "text": "根本如果政府監管得好….. 一陣間又俾人話國安法", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:50:45", "owner": "lin.sze", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926249164176232, "text": "由治及興", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:37:27", "owner": "sunny_wong6628", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107724277617811, "text": "份工幾好撈", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:29:10", "owner": "kenetyeung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082227791120739, "text": "哪里有可能会自己烧、都是人为啰想不想到啰~", "created_at": "2025-11-30T22:40:24", "owner": "stevewongswpc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909138139128492, "text": "疯狂打脸邓炳强", "created_at": "2025-11-30T22:17:21", "owner": "fu.jasmine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094017748713858, "text": "😡😡人禍😡😡", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:30:08", "owner": "cocokung39", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987890223747353, "text": "憤怒", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:44:15", "owner": "bh_contreras", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18197138863324758, "text": "今世唔還，下世更苦", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:18:00", "owner": "kf2bc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030857018760179, "text": "自求多福", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:15:52", "owner": "kf2bc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065315399171109, "text": "個前保安主任有料，知道易孭鑊走人，又真係出大事！\n其他政府部門⋯⋯無糧出就會有反應，有事就A字膊龜縮！", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:10:42", "owner": "mi_tsang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085448546047066, "text": "謝謝用心整理咁詳細嘅資料🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:01:24", "owner": "winnie_ms.funeral", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099396433747434, "text": "因為爛到透晒！", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:41:37", "owner": "eugeneng1981", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063858005434160, "text": "係人渣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:33:55", "owner": "jsmiracleworkshop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052021334358272, "text": "港共拆棚網就是心虛", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:21:58", "owner": "simon1225_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888741556259736, "text": "睇到都想喊。。。。", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:11:01", "owner": "denny130", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902136886307430, "text": "應該拿回那些他說是聲稱客服標準嘅棚網拎去他的住所圍封在燃燒🔥被它嘗試吓那個標準合乎嗎？", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:02:03", "owner": "oscar0168", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070142213082397, "text": "全部都係殺人兇手", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:51:43", "owner": "joeyiu01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102644974673934, "text": "人禍", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:30:45", "owner": "jchanhker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843934354625041, "text": "推", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:46:22", "owner": "mr_amazingun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110297167612706, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:07:18", "owner": "laichuhoho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073795361351732, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-30T13:39:00", "owner": "heihei0103", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104550886657230, "text": "比卡超不喜歡這個貼文", "created_at": "2025-11-30T13:06:32", "owner": "fung__g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094526806853474, "text": "咁大隻加昭好得人驚", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:58:15", "owner": "82_tin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044329943686398, "text": "正明一言堂的惡劣後果", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:29:44", "owner": "henrychan6665", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065799806614003, "text": "扮工，呢班人都唔係真係做嘢嘅", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:34:29", "owner": "m_abelpo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877290034354463, "text": "😡😡😡😡😡😡😡😡😡😡", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:04:05", "owner": "sin_sin_leung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902465260320022, "text": "滅聲行動已經開始\nNEVER FORGET; NEVER FORGIVE", "created_at": "2025-11-30T10:29:23", "owner": "princeradar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132328702489660, "text": "必須追究失職", "created_at": "2025-11-30T10:11:11", "owner": "german_tcyin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128526718501227, "text": "方丈已慰問啦!", "created_at": "2025-11-30T10:00:58", "owner": "tangchanson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18246576115291436, "text": "口口聲聲話會將市民嘅生命放喺第一位，實情係😡😡😡😡", "created_at": "2025-11-30T09:48:48", "owner": "wendy_ng99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066248048389369, "text": "合標做咩要拆 你班撲街係咪同鄧SIR作對 !", "created_at": "2025-11-30T09:48:28", "owner": "kwansiu00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051981095356044, "text": "傀儡特首😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-30T09:41:55", "owner": "tjs5351", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083779189856099, "text": "现在香港还能报道这个案件，和讨论事件发生的原因。换做是在中国，无声无响，不准追问！死的人都不准给提名和悼念，连化成灰的尊严都没有！", "created_at": "2025-11-30T09:41:50", "owner": "momo.128128", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868492258480042, "text": "我寧願斯大林再世大清洗一次", "created_at": "2025-11-30T09:36:07", "owner": "_kami.nkf_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103504075673265, "text": "一句說話：「成班垃圾」", "created_at": "2025-11-30T09:27:55", "owner": "ryan_liiiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026787869585416, "text": "仆街上師，有報應，惡有惡報", "created_at": "2025-11-30T09:16:47", "owner": "shanpang78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052443998342896, "text": "自求多福啦", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:34:25", "owner": "rexwan1989", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051623927344400, "text": "明明就天下太平，民生、經濟都穩步上揚，你係咪想比卡超捉你", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:29:14", "owner": "adh_dme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108281416626533, "text": "鄧炳強落台啦！你估出事你哋高官沒有責任嗎 ？", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:34:28", "owner": "r_for_ringo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112300960605595, "text": "剛剛開始，慢慢適應下，多啲去大陸網睇下當下佢地生活，即係我地明日生活。", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:21:36", "owner": "shiroikoibito03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878511925430547, "text": "如果係真嘅，咁嗰啲部門阿頭應該要被問責俾社會一個交待！", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:56:28", "owner": "waiiptang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026845211584480, "text": "擔心你，被說造謠。", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:42:36", "owner": "gordonhung2046", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988814694889679, "text": "查下棚網係大陸邊家企業做，就知喪強點解咁講！", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:26:10", "owner": "6016ken", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861795598540501, "text": "正苦選擇性監督", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:57:43", "owner": "angelinurareaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950526655060342, "text": "👍🏻👍🏻👍🏻👍🏻👍🏻👍🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:57:31", "owner": "shing9219", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013469627635932, "text": "Deepest condolences.\n The contractors may be negligent but their actions are encouraged when authorities turn a blind eye to non compliance.\n Citizens depends on regulators to regulate and protect the interests of citizen. May the truth be brought to light and the culprits get their due justice.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:54:06", "owner": "txtlinda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087996937780807, "text": "👍🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:38:34", "owner": "singlinkvpn.com.hk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101793595668386, "text": "哦！老餅強話合格就合格啦…你哋再講就你反中亂港㗎！就拉得你。", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:14:55", "owner": "yukelaine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130560418494999, "text": "因為成班淨係識出糧同食飽魚", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:10:06", "owner": "davidwong619", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851856616554728, "text": "棚網純口講合格…", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:59:07", "owner": "mr.0524", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088553452947376, "text": "OMG 😰", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:41:29", "owner": "alysia20032007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105384982637005, "text": "上屆業主委員會主席 佢大推大維修 揀天價承建商 到呢一刻都未拉", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:40:38", "owner": "0ktng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143716228451083, "text": "無恥", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:39:36", "owner": "moon497286", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18379518229146792, "text": "🍌🍌", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:07:33", "owner": "alankkcheong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122329996524011, "text": "呢啲post好明顯就係黃絲所為，搞亂香港社會與政府搞衝突想破壞香港,大家唔好俾呢啲反社會反香港人士利用！", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:04:33", "owner": "amay.luo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879775999333138, "text": "又一單高官問責制， 無錯何來有責既案例", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:04:19", "owner": "oscarwong9211", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071840108362930, "text": "相關人等一定要坐監落台", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:58:18", "owner": "anguskong5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087221413952733, "text": "多謝做了那麼多資料搜集，希望都是真實的資料", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:36:24", "owner": "starust_hk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107048857722355, "text": "是人禍⋯⋯說得對，冇人跟進，忽視提出問題，所有相關人士就算唔使附上法律責任，都會受到良心責備！", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:23:17", "owner": "franceskoo2023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932929675134922, "text": "請大家不停分享。唔好俾呢件事停止🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:21:17", "owner": "signbwinnie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044730761485639, "text": "不是天灾，是人祸", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:19:32", "owner": "tstvyz250", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083701897843893, "text": "呢單野, 應該係謀殺案. 根本冇可能會用發泡膠封窗.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:19:31", "owner": "st_eve4683", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542029021057220, "text": "立法局有誰有能力有權力監督？", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:18:33", "owner": "lzybd10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093122395909989, "text": "知你係黃色，唔好咁大聲，快啲刪咗啲舊相先，一陣國安上門呀。😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:16:01", "owner": "ricky131214", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18318823312216693, "text": "李书记还在感谢皇恩", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:10:56", "owner": "hakkamanjj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058318625273134, "text": "放心，愈揭露得多真相愈令人憤怒，然後結果都係唔會變，因為民意唔係呢個政府嘅kpi", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:09:53", "owner": "amethyst_lam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877693681346080, "text": "最後一點，當你拍呢條ai片指出魔鬼犯罪犯錯要佢改邪歸正，魔鬼會用郭安髮麗去話你有罪消滅你，而邊個監督、核實或者控制到郭安髮麗…就係魔鬼佢本人…！另外中国香港滿佈毒蛇風水陣係國家任務一環，然後香港就變成無壓止嘅群魔亂舞天堂，仲會不斷愛國愛黨愛錢走火入魔失去常性咁，中国香港已經成為一個羅剎鬼域嚟，善心者慈悲者必死無疑，仲想生存就只有同流合污成魔之路成為其中一隻魔或者佢嘅僕人…！", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:04:50", "owner": "denny_studio_photography", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18110903293611336, "text": "講多句，告你煽動ar", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:24:05", "owner": "fwong94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876432523444989, "text": "屌你地呢班仆街老母 殺人填命 一定有報應", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:02:10", "owner": "charlieburritoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099555196748161, "text": "各政府部門,而家真係好多嘢都唔理,制度大倒退,越嚟越差！", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:01:19", "owner": "cclam321", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930442297139645, "text": "Diu", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:42:40", "owner": "let_you_go88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071944334346883, "text": "小心有人會話你哋無全力支持證撫司正係有罪架，阿彌陀佛！", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:42:33", "owner": "stephenwong286", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027985766774865, "text": "厚顏無恥", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:39:28", "owner": "andyyiu_0214", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993044430852143, "text": "全部炒鱿鱼😡😡😡", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:05:50", "owner": "lim.c.chow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084684416288541, "text": "垃圾政府", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:56:03", "owner": "elvis_ef26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950283378923156, "text": "出大事才去跟進，香港政X官X每出事才肯出一叮点力，跟著全港一小𢸍，該跟進上掛了綱的拆除就知道有幾多不合規，有法不依，每次出大事死人才安樂，真好心痛小民百姓，無辜死傷過百人，未計失联人士，出事的不是竹棚，香港用了百年，最主要點解用發泡膠，點解用易燃棚綱，點解一次過把七八幢屋苑維修，點解有人投訴無人跟進？🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:49:19", "owner": "leechungpong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909612067123400, "text": "呢個人應該簽咗「不自殺聲明」先", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:47:07", "owner": "gideonkam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066623180569563, "text": "人在幹，天在看啊，照下鏡啦", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:46:33", "owner": "gonpak47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18317960416216922, "text": "保安局劳工处的失职官员也应该判刑", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:05:08", "owner": "pangpang.xiao.12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065313080148135, "text": "有關相連遺法,遺規,管理,職責,貪污,政府相關內部員工對此事的責任,全都要調查重判坐牢。以祭死了的亡靈，唉呀香港怎麼變成這樣,廉政公署你要為死了的人去調杳清楚，包抱政府部門與此工程的職員,替全港市民去主詞公道了。wolf👏👏👏😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:34:21", "owner": "lokimmanlo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069789980595595, "text": "依家做咩都無人反對 邊會有好既香港丫", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:21:27", "owner": "siukinqq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943806151070627, "text": "票投民建聯🔥災毀妳家園😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:49:41", "owner": "hk_superman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079216525923741, "text": "保安金紫荊星章😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T20:54:34", "owner": "ky390613", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086736925971099, "text": "然後維權個幾個俾人拉左", "created_at": "2025-11-29T19:49:57", "owner": "dd_pwd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087541003795903, "text": "The whole Hong Kong government is a fucking joke now. Even the ICAC is severely compromised at the top while the 2 inept quasi communist lapdogs John Lee and Chris Tang are corrupt to the core.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T19:29:55", "owner": "0d40_liberty_prime", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096210742869893, "text": "🐕🐕", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:15:55", "owner": "kwan518972", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143235517448647, "text": "政府就係敢！無人死就闊佬賴理，有人死亡才做嘢，大厦維修是一個勞民傷財計劃，個個屋宛都着做主席，就是大厦維修掙這舊肥豬肉，其實可唔可以監管有沒有人掏取暴利！", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:12:51", "owner": "sugarsugar000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876202147442015, "text": "符合國情", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:02:34", "owner": "woshing1913", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079667749919367, "text": "係妖言惑眾呀～🙂🙂🙂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:56:00", "owner": "patrick.leong.948", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086696830821051, "text": "人禍 😡", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:34:46", "owner": "adam.design852", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119706334552747, "text": "一班胡作非為無良知嘅Lun Diu棺，一定要去墊屍底！", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:27:43", "owner": "je66wu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073161368031712, "text": "原來個個政府高都知，只有市民自己唔知😱😩", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:22:19", "owner": "ngarchunwong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044015000705071, "text": "係人為， 人禍", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:22:06", "owner": "kayu7788", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865784329436354, "text": "dllm", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:55:43", "owner": "allkindofmind", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116783446564641, "text": "@accubaaa let u know what happened behind the scenes or under the table", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:53:01", "owner": "new_leaf_830", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035813024512074, "text": "嘩，__嘢唔好攞嚟講啦...\n依家萬眾一心眾志成城，有共同嘅敵人\n齊心打擊批評分子緊...\n平安。。", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:49:07", "owner": "derektaisonkan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843916195623102, "text": "😡😡😡😡😡😡😡", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:41:36", "owner": "ma_rk2962", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847142440611218, "text": "好彩先前嗰個保安辭咗職 執返條命", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:32:56", "owner": "catcecilia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134675629489796, "text": "@hk01news", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:20:59", "owner": "wajei86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121614103472932, "text": "💔💔💔😡😡😡", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:12:53", "owner": "jessie_2120", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074095754337561, "text": "正👍", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:12:34", "owner": "graceclh0516", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094714186872424, "text": "👏講得好", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:36:53", "owner": "jennn_mn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061749374554876, "text": "全部癈柴要负责", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:32:58", "owner": "yam6144", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073261133588137, "text": "你地班仆街", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:32:53", "owner": "angellung168", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17885247468288176, "text": "以結果為目標", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:31:07", "owner": "misteringing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086701682065819, "text": "沒有反對人就變咗冇牙老虎咁", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:27:04", "owner": "macyng_lam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972142956814025, "text": "🤬", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:26:17", "owner": "yue10netvigatorcom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088064404954932, "text": "push", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:24:14", "owner": "xjinhh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110285110612248, "text": "擺明全部嘢係個局", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:20:19", "owner": "ren.kwg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18410878828138408, "text": "報還報，2 條友可以打格嘛？", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:14:56", "owner": "kwan_siu_fu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040697732505001, "text": "今次事件最大責任係政府，係有關部門，事後派錢，派呢派路有撚用，呢班扑雞應該拉去打靶", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:58:04", "owner": "laukamchau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027438407575925, "text": "咁樣做可以再加快香港回歸懷抱", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:55:28", "owner": "thethe_charles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064535939163021, "text": "👏👏多謝整合。", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:54:48", "owner": "ranzahowltan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842234836629767, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:45:21", "owner": "adams_mok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932150269132906, "text": "沒事沒人理， 有事個個瀉膊", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:42:56", "owner": "marjacso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18537420028003961, "text": "成個政府完全冇責任，只會卸膊⋯⋯", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:37:31", "owner": "jasonwyy", "likes": 35}, {"id": 18087706792812170, "text": "😡😡😡😡🤬🤬🤬🤬", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:35:41", "owner": "jasonwyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047464691456121, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:28:09", "owner": "lalacarko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18201569920319280, "text": "Dklm政府。。庸官。。 用晒d 建制傻9 議員。。 乜都唔監測。。。", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:23:20", "owner": "igwestcc1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022262780604408, "text": "香港墮落到咁真係要多謝祖國", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:20:19", "owner": "168phat", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18111722122609863, "text": "政府部門唔正視問題！", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:12:32", "owner": "pleyip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164745043352872, "text": "仲漏咗水炮車", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:08:00", "owner": "heybabyfan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918978148206430, "text": "真係無法無天", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:06:26", "owner": "k.p.hiu.yik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900123436339170, "text": "政府好撚野！繼續做show 啦！", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:06:14", "owner": "ginang1314", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18095580670890853, "text": "屌", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:53:09", "owner": "minisister_seoul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071051120588219, "text": "Always because Money $$$$ 😮", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:40:38", "owner": "mulligan_panda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103747933731208, "text": "講得好👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:39:48", "owner": "hellohihigigi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117006202500328, "text": "你知我知天知地知，只係有人扮唔知同無知。😞", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:36:09", "owner": "jack_leung_tat_keung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301839622264479, "text": "低質擦牙狗好小氣架。", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:29:01", "owner": "80z_noize", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113036539523102, "text": "水太深", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:12:46", "owner": "hangip104", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856946455565371, "text": "No independent opposition to over see what is happening. This is what happens. Corruption!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:54:23", "owner": "chrisandmimi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922645750192142, "text": "呢班廢人要即刻落台！！", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:47:49", "owner": "toffyamy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322106083171956, "text": "一針見血！", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:39:36", "owner": "stringsiu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026331440769962, "text": "講真相會犯國安😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:34:27", "owner": "sean_chen11000170", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027710690567492, "text": "全部都係廢柴", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:24:14", "owner": "fungszechun1234", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193665811331802, "text": "HK government failed big times", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:15:17", "owner": "pusinne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086888521953212, "text": "我單位外面就係拆網唔拆棚😂\n9成9個網有問題", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:04:03", "owner": "sam.c.0109", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18430215295110816, "text": "成班人都係殺人兇手", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:54:22", "owner": "summerkasy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083429885041075, "text": "仲留係香港做咩。地獄黎架啦", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:38:24", "owner": "konchim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093341899911248, "text": "只可以話，呢個只係開始。", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:30:32", "owner": "zerodo_0420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024146795782740, "text": "大家心知肚明！🫡處身於這地方衹能相信自己《自保》", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:25:10", "owner": "kenneth.73594479", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886226644401629, "text": "即刻拆除罪證", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:22:52", "owner": "ngsamsan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18398083027124766, "text": "香港不是沒有反對派 只是香港沒有外國控制的反對派", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:11:18", "owner": "liyouxiang20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970837791969224, "text": "系变相谋杀", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:06:30", "owner": "jixuan20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970870329977458, "text": "系政府班底人祸啦", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:04:28", "owner": "ckchengcheng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868860877412355, "text": "希望阿爺睇到呢段片！", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:57:33", "owner": "koochikooball", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18202153960321995, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:53:57", "owner": "rabbitvk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366692836081526, "text": "推到你爆view❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:51:06", "owner": "irisyaniris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921846868197207, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:47:01", "owner": "joey._lo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976728501950381, "text": "@skynews @bbcnews @bbcchinese @nbcnews", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:45:58", "owner": "just__a__normal___guy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110224795609618, "text": "勞工處立的安全法例，都岸L鳩嘅，永遠不思前想後，永遠勞民傷財，工人又身苦咗，又唔係安全咗。🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:16:59", "owner": "chuming87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086739907951450, "text": "So called, cut out opposition 🫣... now no way to reflect", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:13:48", "owner": "zetsuboujs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992156706886833, "text": "姑姑唔貪污有咩做呀", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:03:39", "owner": "zhangjianqiang9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18190025437338070, "text": "當然不是天災100%是人禍😡\n\n人性的貪婪，越富裕越高位更加貪得無厭\n心痛香港人，憤恨作威作福的人\n求上天的公平公義能夠臨到這一批貪婪自私的人身上，讓佢哋受到應有嘅懲罰🙏🏻🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:58:37", "owner": "canmy_hi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879826435329883, "text": "必须查到底这是人祸", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:56:00", "owner": "chameleon.803911", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987854886869420, "text": "嗰啲唔係人係畜生", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:55:52", "owner": "samhunghung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929694355152756, "text": "😮 the HK Government Officials and corrupted Renovation Contractors are Fully Responsible for this Man-make 🔥Fire Disaster ! Unforgivable.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:49:20", "owner": "jefftsh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17996636855839890, "text": "唉！全部淨係識吸水！", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:43:36", "owner": "weiwen897", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087491833791642, "text": "我都幾肯定能條片出現嘅人 冇一個會有事", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:43:20", "owner": "shan123_elf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987972078749002, "text": "呢個正苦... #人類總要重複同樣的錯誤 🤷🏿‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:33:45", "owner": "kl0129", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164218462387259, "text": "所以好多人，都不喜歡政府人員的做法。", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:33:22", "owner": "tomchat11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091073068935562, "text": "鄧炳強呢個7頭.佢係保安局長啫佢識條鐵咩!對呢啲防火物料工程上嘅嘢佢憑乜嘢 資格去話 呢啲棚網係合格呢？ 又冇呢一個專業知識喺度扮7曬嘢 官僚.人之禍🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:27:32", "owner": "tang.meiyi.3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045039251480758, "text": "投訴冇門", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:26:11", "owner": "lizliz924", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072917816346439, "text": "C Honteux!", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:21:02", "owner": "wannymalt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063695924419748, "text": "事實", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:16:22", "owner": "lwh0017", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890985676374106, "text": "😢水和警钟都停了 窗户都封死这样有可能是懂事局想逼迁 把这些楼房拆了 改建为赚钱其它用途 而这几栋楼不搬就用火烧😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:15:53", "owner": "situ.eric", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096861313661954, "text": "🔥🔥🔥👏👏😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:13:57", "owner": "tc_fung0505", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060840308542822, "text": "亞爺亞爺爺…小超係咪應該要落去🧐", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:12:06", "owner": "_nup.nup_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901447813324576, "text": "如果有用到緊急警示系統應該救返好多條人命", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:07:04", "owner": "toomuch_z_z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080483225275613, "text": "遺嗅萬年祖宗姓", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:06:21", "owner": "sunny.kan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052627301665099, "text": "呢班人要問責 😮政府係最大責任人 推卸唔到嘅", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:00:19", "owner": "eddychau.18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045672272468350, "text": "好清楚。一目了明 push 去比全世界知件真相", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:50:10", "owner": "frankieyim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098457529816150, "text": "句句都係事實\n但係而家嘅香港會比班官話你搞分化\n指出佢哋問題就係分化\n垃圾政權", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:40:44", "owner": "img_gloria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083591141034300, "text": "係合規，係易燃，係易燃合規網，支共特色", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:30:34", "owner": "weihaods", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064179575170844, "text": "最應該換特手，佢淨係識擦鞋，但係香港唔需要", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:26:27", "owner": "skyuniquejade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051450233348433, "text": "全部都炒得😡", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:17:31", "owner": "tracymak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086087038831102, "text": "😡", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:15:56", "owner": "doctor.winny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889200115389880, "text": ".好", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:07:59", "owner": "chanzenii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051890102347816, "text": "忠誠嘅廢物", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:07:54", "owner": "____cfhyuuuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095468326862688, "text": "全部都有份😡🤬", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:02:58", "owner": "victorsitk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100391716758877, "text": "今日又拉8個，信唔信就算再拉十個八個，都唔會有部門被問責，唔會拉到某政黨背景啲人", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:00:47", "owner": "garrylt2003", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034818131735285, "text": "係人禍", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:59:12", "owner": "yutung.tang.10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079629133899994, "text": "拆網既就係冇靠山既\n冇拆網燒埋既就係有靠山\n都幾易分\n#好似係", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:56:12", "owner": "rayin_rou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547623127022957, "text": "人在做，天在看！", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:53:09", "owner": "852spartacus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065667968618429, "text": "深惡痛絕😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:47:04", "owner": "m1ng_kk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320253760171178, "text": "不是棚竹有事！是棚綱出事！所以現在香港有大維修既屋苑都紛紛拆網！因為承辦商知道自己不是用安全合格的網！", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:44:37", "owner": "bonbon.bon.10236", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545887273002370, "text": "放心…一定最後冇事", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:41:40", "owner": "magnet_worker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052022819356779, "text": "好明顯是棚網有事", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:41:02", "owner": "bonbon.bon.10236", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061947797222634, "text": "共業", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:39:42", "owner": "markshamhp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112265200607118, "text": "真正阻燃的是美國貨，阻燃物料叫做哈龍，是杜邦化工公司造的，貴好多！怎肯買美國貨而拒買大陸貨呢？", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:29:53", "owner": "gerson2026", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086848231825359, "text": "換人啦", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:24:22", "owner": "tinghonglt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18330860920212196, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:24:18", "owner": "dani_hohoho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047920595449540, "text": "嘥氣啦冇用㗎，其實在座各位包括埋我自己都只不過一椂廢物嚟，淨係識得屌毫無意義，畀世界再知道更多，咁又點？一啲用處都冇，而家係我攞筒火油喺你面前燒死一個人， 畀你見到咁又點呀？有證據咁又點呀？ 同埋我直頭同你講，係呀係我燒死佢架，咁又點呀？我地係永遠唔會有事㗎， 關愛隊，大陸人議員 黨派圍標黑箱作業 警察撞人冇事 一切一切好多好多 一理通百理明, 從今以後唔會再睇新聞，唔想再睇到呢啲嘢，見到就直接劃走", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:53:47", "owner": "azkopqwem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057841475307787, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:53:03", "owner": "liewsantong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894329809220867, "text": "梗係拆除啦因為發展商佢啲物料全部都係混合，將合格同有問題嘅混合", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:52:03", "owner": "bbroy2000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845226037601367, "text": "垃圾政府，垃圾官員統統下台問責", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:33:56", "owner": "no.novem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298753429258670, "text": "殺人兇手", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:32:35", "owner": "vincentpun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033331124741000, "text": "講得啱，冇咗反對派，政府為所欲為，藍屍想要嘅香港，求仁得仁👏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:32:09", "owner": "ching0130", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091063423909397, "text": "全部都係殺人兇手", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:26:34", "owner": "hotin1108", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090334900746077, "text": "全中", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:24:40", "owner": "bbq42215", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090634288931053, "text": "@tito_man_6610 @sweet_7.8 @zcy_2009 @wsl_06_19", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:17:52", "owner": "y._.6610", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101155597683361, "text": "终于有人讲真说话", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:10:35", "owner": "hkhealthy2021", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868312864416310, "text": "冇錯！係人禍！", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:09:17", "owner": "himto628", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546055912018348, "text": "由治及興啦已經 點解會咁 🤦", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:09:11", "owner": "bming087", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963630880004495, "text": "個問題係邊到 係個「制」喥.GIF", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:08:59", "owner": "hansonon99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055498703648151, "text": "由治及興👏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:02:47", "owner": "veryhea__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061399859228398, "text": "香港人！忍夠！", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:57:50", "owner": "kochrisko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859533085486608, "text": "什麼高層收投訴唔理啦！大家圍威喂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:57:21", "owner": "marcolaw0906", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054408938657837, "text": "逼到好人都要辭職離開", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:55:11", "owner": "dilarclues", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547054966032442, "text": "我都唔敢分享出去，有啲嘢，真都會有強而有力的人士去改變佢⋯⋯", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:55:00", "owner": "fermon903", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073357904461444, "text": "See one time sad one-time", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:39:28", "owner": "taytiongboon.boon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147623236386477, "text": "所謂大維修 先係謀財 最後害命", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:36:43", "owner": "wagor628", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894411706223705, "text": "根本係一場有預謀有計劃🔥謀財害命🔥未來捐款將會突破億元🔥大家拭目以待捐款會去用到哪裏？", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:35:49", "owner": "97panthe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928109884171605, "text": "火燒屋苑都唔係佢哋呢一班人住嘅屋苑亦都唔係佢哋返工嘅地方自私自利全部都要炒晒自辭職都唔算數，仲要即時收更沒收個人財產不得離境才對得住死者", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:28:25", "owner": "happychuku", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096763600857493, "text": "要感謝中央嘅支持", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:24:17", "owner": "tako99478", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18424913044118344, "text": "垃圾癈柴政府。提出反對意見嘅人都鎖起曬啦。唔聽，唔做，又唔改…. 白兜幾廿萬人工🤬害死咁多人⋯⋯", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:21:46", "owner": "cwhchoy123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080812973153738, "text": "要好好保護潘卓鴻", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:19:11", "owner": "vinmax666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18418074796114824, "text": "係垃圾🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:18:42", "owner": "minglee_c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397410139132904, "text": "好快到實驗室出事🤫🤐", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:16:52", "owner": "sky_wong_depress", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105904909646948, "text": "擦鞋港", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:04:16", "owner": "wong.wingyuk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18411721225190663, "text": "咁多個部門.. 全部都係廢柴 …", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:04:14", "owner": "cjjr27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027015959575904, "text": "分析得好好", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:55:27", "owner": "jennifer.wong09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542181376040280, "text": "奪命港！", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:53:52", "owner": "alcolas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079088549328986, "text": "呢個正苦唔配香港人留低...", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:51:20", "owner": "yi920920", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066453305142201, "text": "完全正確，根本香港重衰過大陸，成班都係垃圾", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:38:47", "owner": "jeffersontsang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100389061742211, "text": "政府一樣要負責", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:37:51", "owner": "kinskuok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070297787608907, "text": "合格，但全港一齊拆 屌你老尾。", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:37:29", "owner": "luvmasonnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053087624338786, "text": "直接整多多國語文配音版？\n英文字幕有啲細🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:37:27", "owner": "anitaaal0125", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929497498017116, "text": "😡😡😡😡", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:33:56", "owner": "cherish.them.au", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064910867154133, "text": "thank yiu for rhe ENGLISH subtitles", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:32:10", "owner": "no.1_unifineline_fan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929055520138543, "text": "不過促使啲單維修工程成功嘅唔係黃碧雲之前嗰個議員咩？好似又係民建聯嘅，係佢促成呢單天價工程，而且好似話佢用返自己嘅物料公司提供啲唔合格嘅材料", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:18:07", "owner": "the_master_of_drunk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972952761959804, "text": "問責", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:17:56", "owner": "jo_hn.wong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153681661422239, "text": "係咁架啦好出奇咩？有冇反對派都好政府部門都會射波，一日未有人死一日政府都好係懶懶閒咁回應", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:14:00", "owner": "the_master_of_drunk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18491172430077825, "text": "冇王管", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:10:44", "owner": "kand280", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916737697213142, "text": "最尾整件黑白撚樣嚇撚死", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:09:10", "owner": "thisisnotnym", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071658296360446, "text": "如果有更多語言分享畀多啲人就好", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:08:23", "owner": "cnw326", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948314127930351, "text": "港共政權", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:07:30", "owner": "kelvinsimpsons", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108525172628220, "text": "還要大眾市民義務幫助災民, 馬會企業損咁多錢但只派小許.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:03:37", "owner": "spinnervirgo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027658319769017, "text": "香港管治廢哂😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:03:01", "owner": "billbill_chau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992494077896511, "text": "咁而家五級火，死咗八鳩嘅人，都話冇嘢，咁肯定冇啦", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:01:23", "owner": "gianluigibuffonju", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137724388476628, "text": "依D又吾李生出黎講，明知一講死硬所以叫鄧生上馬，李生你好嘢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:55:36", "owner": "wingchan.c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085334969291897, "text": "悲劇", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:51:00", "owner": "nini.tang.31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076410251185095, "text": "是人禍", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:50:01", "owner": "christine.yuen.1238", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047859878430182, "text": "人在做 天在看🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:45:56", "owner": "hanjing__gg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135126637463789, "text": "而家我哋香港官員都唔使問責嘅", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:44:18", "owner": "hk_may_12345678", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987460665872347, "text": "我唔會信阻燃達標之說！", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:39:43", "owner": "ikki_miracle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383339215197887, "text": "邊個夠膽再話反對派為反而反？\n無左佢地成個正苦變左黑箱作業", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:38:51", "owner": "sle_yai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965797126005287, "text": "你班冚家剷全部冇一個好死😡😡😡", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:38:45", "owner": "divingyuen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305417398265453, "text": "香港高官 = 垃圾", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:38:23", "owner": "mr.centralist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298626763282855, "text": "馬後炮陸續出現", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:37:38", "owner": "hdzkaoru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135791437480731, "text": "😡😡😡😡😡", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:33:36", "owner": "joann.ng.0324", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928192972161115, "text": "政府系咁，唔出事就唔理，一出事就出黎做樣", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:31:02", "owner": "apm1134", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18175158172371793, "text": "可以腐敗到咁真是難以想像，希望習主席要這些人下台才可以安撫一點香港人的憤怒", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:28:49", "owner": "alyssacheung1000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083859193854047, "text": "Yea crack them all down", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:25:22", "owner": "cassius.jay24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989650965897124, "text": "人在做😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:22:31", "owner": "sivots", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18192406180333516, "text": "做得呢啲位個個都貪，但去到關乎人命，好心貪小啲啦", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:18:59", "owner": "chikinyeung987", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031480760751761, "text": "什麼吾重要愛國最重要", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:17:10", "owner": "peterwong1585", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042878321492632, "text": "推🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:16:26", "owner": "mrs_ng_bb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926206468080240, "text": "唉。。講出真相，拉得呀", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:12:43", "owner": "s.mmmmmalll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298806226258185, "text": "講得好，要追究到底", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:10:34", "owner": "carrie_heygirl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065730698150085, "text": "係囉個alarm有咩用🚨，去日本韓國人哋至少都會善用呢一個功能去搵失蹤人口", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:09:41", "owner": "maggy_giyagi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979887840930131, "text": "呢啲視頻會觸及國安法⋯⋯", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:08:00", "owner": "jackylamnz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941226390960631, "text": "最後，點解又要擺我超哥上台😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:07:34", "owner": "aaron.lin2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886133449403182, "text": "🐶", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:07:23", "owner": "yuanxi0919", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108890104619100, "text": "收皮啦，要做你哋班友一早做咗啦，講咁多廢話，如果唔係邊會有今日呢場人為火災發生吖，無恥！", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:05:03", "owner": "ho.h.man", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105391087631879, "text": "我一早已經吾相信政府部門 香港想生存只可靠自己", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:03:33", "owner": "chowzac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089381491751443, "text": "無競爭自然更腐敗", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:01:40", "owner": "crusader00018", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17861783952541036, "text": "政府突然咁好，一定有古怪", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:58:44", "owner": "su.be.do.wa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18246820666288594, "text": "又即管睇下政府嚟緊會做啲乜。不過大家都唔好期望太多。", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:56:51", "owner": "hopin.hk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086557489996110, "text": "這班共孽者自有報應！🤬", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:55:29", "owner": "viviansinyois", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18169562188378060, "text": "講得好", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:55:11", "owner": "ngchungyiu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916717873236114, "text": "簡單啲講，呢128條人命就係比呢班官害死", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:37:04", "owner": "andrewcheung123", "likes": 68}, {"id": 18126878869505701, "text": "莫不關心市民的安危，倒屎政府", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:36:54", "owner": "manlau4", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18105209926656751, "text": "問責啦！班官唔係可以過骨呀？點解無回覆？竹俾你過到骨姐，呢個睇你點兜", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:36:17", "owner": "j0n.myk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083512730323616, "text": "陰公！香港俾班垃圾官員搞成咁樣！", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:32:49", "owner": "chairmansaltyguy", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17955732900021491, "text": "人禍\n都唔係網定竹問題了", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:31:27", "owner": "eddie.ccy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090594394898864, "text": "洗太平地前梗係要打聲招呼", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:30:14", "owner": "wayne_ita_3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073821446196385, "text": "人禍", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:26:05", "owner": "paker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059339297262903, "text": "全部炒啦⋯祭一祭亡魂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:24:40", "owner": "4oni_nicholas", "likes": 26}, {"id": 18061750694206738, "text": "所有有关部门人员都有责任这次的火灾,他们都欠灾民和死者一个说法与道歉。", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:22:35", "owner": "taypeckhwa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859608490486371, "text": "大話講得多，連自己都呃埋", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:21:27", "owner": "hei_tardis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124124635519710, "text": "最後面嗰位做乜唔馬賽克？", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:13:12", "owner": "ivywoodautung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106594357711731, "text": "And they'll blame the bamboo.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:12:51", "owner": "misterjkw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117883672560166, "text": "有理由相信 多個政府部門 貪污 官商勾結 ICAC 唔請 大埔立法會區議員 去飲咖啡 可能都有份😏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:11:44", "owner": "yaufung919", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050257169382946, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:05:07", "owner": "lizng623", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902562700321647, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:04:51", "owner": "tangotam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091926745912517, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:48:44", "owner": "ben_sonnnnnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094696264859019, "text": "作為小市民不反對一言堂，但係你做好先得吖，看看星加坡，吊，連北韓都做得好過你，自己弱智無能就死開啦！害自己無所謂，你唔害人啦！正垃圾！", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:46:13", "owner": "la_wrence16216", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084129914042855, "text": "MLXXG❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:45:34", "owner": "rayscs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164529832387388, "text": "🤬", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:27:43", "owner": "doramoniwong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015994721801288, "text": "正PKs", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:22:39", "owner": "dickyiu0516", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070952096607266, "text": "政府無包庇打死我都唔會信......一定要查出真相", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:21:42", "owner": "pkfung0222", "likes": 283}, {"id": 18571155607006693, "text": "真係垃圾到一個地步，層層包庇，由官商勾結到管理員都頂唔順個上司走埋，一户交成16-18萬外牆維修，交完最後點呀，比人熄咗個警鐘，消防喉泵。。一出事就互相卸膊。。仲可以開記者會證明棚網係安全嘅。。🤬🤬🤬🤬🤬", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:18:57", "owner": "edwin8485", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18011699756811891, "text": "差唔多啦⋯⋯呢個正苦．．個個逗十幾廿皮一個月，有事發生關人𠹌事，以前啲人會引咎辭職，宜家賴死唔走，乜撚嘢都唔關我事冇收過，冇潛在危險，而家有事厚住面皮繼續坐喺度，一定唔可以負責，因為會冇咗份旬工", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:02:55", "owner": "oobboo135", "likes": 183}, {"id": 17844849402619211, "text": "😡😡😡😡😡😡😡😡😡😡😡", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:01:46", "owner": "kittychan371", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929673685138062, "text": "成班狗官去食屎啦。", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:58:22", "owner": "inlandtiger", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17873517468459423, "text": "大聸呀你 方丈份人好少器😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:35:00", "owner": "cherry_yl.b", "likes": 1569}, {"id": 17849697492599948, "text": "Thank you for reporting of the incompetence and corruption of all concerned.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:25:14", "owner": "pigxy_chan", "likes": 11}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3772421924118939499, "shortcode": "DRaVcC6AUdr", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRaVcC6AUdr/", "taken_at": "2025-11-23T19:57:26", "caption": "Blue Elmo has a funny conversation with a Cosplayer! callsign.pickles", "owner_username": "peterprankster", "owner_id": "50104113889", "likes": 41135, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0096_DRaVcC6AUdr\\DRaVcC6AUdr_20251123_195726.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18539108356007705, "text": "Who is she", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:31:40", "owner": "d.k_photosandscenery", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17923465074081721, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:12:45", "owner": "paparoach", "likes": 676}, {"id": 18081334676167497, "text": "IM EARLYYY lol she looks pretty what the", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:30:11", "owner": "moldedulce", "likes": 221}, {"id": 18059640719559616, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:43:33", "owner": "leaneinportugal", "likes": 1462}, {"id": 18085435544294077, "text": "Cute", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:09:31", "owner": "hollowman1966", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18096797080891786, "text": "How does she not know Avril Lavigne?! 🙄", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:09:25", "owner": "chrislibra22", "likes": 91}, {"id": 17923009596049598, "text": "Now we know why Avril Lavigne doesn't sing Papa Roach songs.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:01:00", "owner": "thechefcomic", "likes": 537}, {"id": 18184813489349275, "text": "Does she have one colored contact on or just born w 2 different eye colors?! 👀 looks pretty cool!!", "created_at": "2025-11-23T21:11:39", "owner": "utermohl", "likes": 19}, {"id": 17921365866057928, "text": "She quoted the wrong thing", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:17:46", "owner": "rollingdutchmann2.0", "likes": 1251}, {"id": 17847174108583645, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:43:13", "owner": "ivseenenough", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18047706686427789, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:40:44", "owner": "jeff_the_gooning_shark", "likes": 164}, {"id": 17843281719620968, "text": "“It’s okay you already do” 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:30:28", "owner": "thebr0adways", "likes": 383}, {"id": 17916572460215889, "text": "\"What's the cause?\" was an underrated joke😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T21:16:09", "owner": "regflori", "likes": 153}, {"id": 18082735286037608, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T23:52:04", "owner": "rtx.jay_j", "likes": 66}, {"id": 17968806872989248, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:32:12", "owner": "jezisuv_respawn", "likes": 71}, {"id": 18496057540078622, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:06:58", "owner": "_.rxan._606", "likes": 25}, {"id": 17873732973373696, "text": "She is so pretty and cute what the heck...", "created_at": "2025-11-24T00:33:22", "owner": "sonicdragongalaxy", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18099218665802687, "text": "I lost it with Gru😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:18:42", "owner": "awink02", "likes": 16}, {"id": 17913241158249330, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T08:44:29", "owner": "alien_x2333", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18082348070516218, "text": "Here a little too early…..", "created_at": "2025-11-23T21:58:48", "owner": "lucckkyy209", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17858352126501772, "text": "Find me this girls insta. Her gear is fire.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:47:33", "owner": "hero_clips1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17869352439475802, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:07:37", "owner": "_.rxan._606", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18397607413193717, "text": "😂😂 bluey is a savage", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:06:01", "owner": "josepenap02", "likes": 29}, {"id": 18075360041258420, "text": "K NGL she do be fine thoo 🔥👏", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:00:19", "owner": "thio_is_da_best", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17872792620467786, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-09T21:46:05", "owner": "bluecraft_9002", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18077818235179378, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:19:57", "owner": "dgzbih", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18437756395103815, "t