"iam_realsheyni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919260319071898, "text": "Her eyes, different colour on each side", "created_at": "2025-12-02T06:04:44", "owner": "mafialand_mf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950271636915106, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T05:58:32", "owner": "proxy_phanian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067055897575642, "text": "Dumb blonde Avril Lavigne doesn’t sing last resort 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:55:07", "owner": "bigboss956713", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540190105054597, "text": "That’s some pretty awesome heterochromia in her eyes.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:10:35", "owner": "cast.abraxas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917380897212778, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:40:14", "owner": "guest_altnever", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099858337840185, "text": "Her @?", "created_at": "2025-12-01T21:52:39", "owner": "vj_sot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914584174245632, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T21:41:28", "owner": "jon.100", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047353472460803, "text": "“I’m gonna look stupid”‘it’s ok you already do’ hahahahahaah😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T20:44:49", "owner": "michael_hates_the_internet", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18289979449263025, "text": "🤣🤩✌️", "created_at": "2025-12-01T14:44:30", "owner": "mathias.gt5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063056105410196, "text": "She has two different eye colors that’s hella sick", "created_at": "2025-12-01T10:53:42", "owner": "matin_delahaye._._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125006743516589, "text": "Haha she's cool asf lol 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T10:13:16", "owner": "joshuajailidden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914063968095649, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:36:42", "owner": "rjdh_innit", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17878837323431988, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T08:20:57", "owner": "fuq_uer", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18085017311003244, "text": "Nah She In ICE 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T05:12:20", "owner": "thenickscorpion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18194250334329704, "text": "Papa Lavigne.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:11:23", "owner": "itstabish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18249364762288465, "text": "“Whats the cause ?” 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:41:34", "owner": "generationggz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098519992827093, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T02:29:10", "owner": "mikes612s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295898971286111, "text": "Why all these wannabe people wearing a hell ton of tactical equipment like if they were in some serious missions?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T21:23:28", "owner": "alex98cg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867870634500827, "text": "Riveting stuff 🥱🥱🥱", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:11:22", "owner": "jay106132", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18333523828210776, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:06:58", "owner": "sukuna_reborn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18166762393375784, "text": "Go’ head", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:28:52", "owner": "stpaulinferno2626", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992984118892181, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:14:35", "owner": "jonny_vicious", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051654626364182, "text": "Super cell ID?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:39:07", "owner": "bobgarris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081631097471927, "text": "Try using your chin strap. CHIN STRAPS SAVE LIVES!!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:23:15", "owner": "dankoyotl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062216927208478, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:57:59", "owner": "fahrdienstredner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18175135534366803, "text": "Avril Lavigne singing Chop Suey from Linkin Park ☝🏽🧐", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:13:29", "owner": "_corazon.d.pirata_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863228806533428, "text": "@avrillavigne if you ever get to serve, I will redeploy", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:52:50", "owner": "karl_laschnikow87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18180483259357145, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:48:51", "owner": "stayforlife__channieee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027152807575741, "text": "How much are those NODS?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:32:34", "owner": "jolly_roger.915", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165171631376272, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:34:01", "owner": "big_mike88_batman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929893030014643, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:30:32", "owner": "velkan_the_wolf", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18097007272870753, "text": "\"ITs NigHt ViSioN\".... is it though? Just looks like some regular flip down binoculars from here 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:22:11", "owner": "cwwtexas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065714285454936, "text": "Temu nvg's", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:23:29", "owner": "juseliustv_v2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057131978310530, "text": "Her eyes are so cool! She has this Homophobia thing", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:02:47", "owner": "chriskaribik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080868788122591, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:44:36", "owner": "ghostwolf1956", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059440379637481, "text": "😍😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:44:32", "owner": "jase_3d_artist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089702989939071, "text": "Thats papa roach 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:19:46", "owner": "o.marquito", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18017627342619574, "text": "Are those actual 31 bravos?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:15:43", "owner": "mpatdmv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848766454574156, "text": "Who is she?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:38:08", "owner": "t1s.dr3am", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084449270082621, "text": "Umm that wasn’t Avril", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:49:38", "owner": "ixnay.on.the.padre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18517415437065891, "text": "Lmao wrong persons song", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:58:18", "owner": "iamjoshua_sd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131071060437239, "text": "“You look like Avril Lavigne” starts singing papa roach", "created_at": "2025-11-25T00:39:15", "owner": "kartersgoneinsane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107877391622883, "text": "Quuuut", "created_at": "2025-11-24T22:42:24", "owner": "kegie999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083998838016417, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T22:28:47", "owner": "billie_dad_adrienne_mom_2026", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352505914166795, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T21:43:43", "owner": "leoboro2", "likes": 221}, {"id": 17864010399515663, "text": "Cut my steak into pieces, this is my knife and fork.", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:45:39", "owner": "tj_sweatpea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063190346448120, "text": "Propaganda lookin mf", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:32:07", "owner": "buttmuncher69000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301104736269967, "text": "Did she just do a Papa Roach song whenever she was called Avril Levine?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:16:32", "owner": "officer420w", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070689470062965, "text": "Does Papa Roach you dumb bitch😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:58:36", "owner": "bensimonsen87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078364424270533, "text": "Thats the hey girl where the f*** your eyebrows guy!!! the laugh 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:15:56", "owner": "stevie_ss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979469976929784, "text": "That's a dude wearing nvgs", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:53:52", "owner": "johndanger357", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070771136522466, "text": "Where did she find night vision military equipment 😮🤷‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:18:58", "owner": "taro_misaki_84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844725325606342, "text": "I do not remember avril ever making music like that 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:55:31", "owner": "hyde_gla1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115159639566288, "text": "She looks like Avril Lavigne but sounds as Miss Piggy😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:46:56", "owner": "tekaropulos92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088784038757399, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:17:04", "owner": "tristanaudenaerd", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18176423776366462, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T08:03:17", "owner": "masoncapybara0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065651360139830, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:02:05", "owner": "bigkountry.the.stallion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955061095019382, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:48:09", "owner": "leaneinportugal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048774602411128, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:21:29", "owner": "smaramemes", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3741623719526866700, "shortcode": "DPs6vLtkx8M", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DPs6vLtkx8M/", "taken_at": "2025-10-12T08:12:18", "caption": "Two guns. One latte machine.\nBy sundown, only one of us gets the last croissant🥐💥#carlislestreet #missmatcafe #cafesofmelbourne #melbourne #au #melbourneeats #fyp #cafesofinsta #foryou #viralvideos #viral #funny #ice #😂😂😂 #fypシ #tiktok #showdown #west #cowboy #cafe #cafelife #memes #funnyvideos #funnyreels #work", "owner_username": "missmatcafe", "owner_id": "48548289502", "likes": 170991, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0097_DPs6vLtkx8M\\DPs6vLtkx8M_20251012_081218.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18074535854265506, "text": "ATO ?", "created_at": "2025-10-13T14:48:19", "owner": "saadmalik363", "likes": 2623}, {"id": 18085317430756209, "text": "What is ATO gonna do about her ??", "created_at": "2025-10-13T22:02:13", "owner": "chaudhary_haryana619", "likes": 371}, {"id": 18084171715771382, "text": "Why always an Indian?😂❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-13T04:45:48", "owner": "abhishek.gajjar_", "likes": 3697}, {"id": 18075499256152959, "text": "Forget HR — this cafe needs UN peacekeepers 😭 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-13T11:18:15", "owner": "ashlon_r", "likes": 51682}, {"id": 18153395977403740, "text": "ATO is Australian Taxation Office guys! Welcome to Australia 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T00:36:14", "owner": "syu_ha", "likes": 28211}, {"id": 18026387561549151, "text": "God forgives but the ATO doesnt", "created_at": "2025-10-19T10:27:41", "owner": "fishburgerw", "likes": 7114}, {"id": 18081879217951263, "text": "Oh girl the ATO don’t play 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-14T21:10:15", "owner": "itsjustz.hs", "likes": 6822}, {"id": 17984404304904929, "text": "\"The cafe ain't big enough for the two of us\" ahh 😭😭🙏🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-15T01:57:17", "owner": "ashishmishra_317", "likes": 3807}, {"id": 18429055630101409, "text": "His phone is the right side up . I think he’s winning the standoff 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-13T22:33:40", "owner": "seco.ronal", "likes": 1504}, {"id": 18099150790642399, "text": "Which is more terrifying? The ATO or those giant spiders that come into people’s houses?", "created_at": "2025-10-14T23:02:06", "owner": "johnnigrneyez", "likes": 411}, {"id": 18046874942375666, "text": "that's a whole latte drama😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T14:39:05", "owner": "down_the_food_rabbit_hole", "likes": 329}, {"id": 18079907749855196, "text": "So someone is breaching their Visa and someone is not paying Super 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T23:50:46", "owner": "thedawgdk", "likes": 201}, {"id": 18083766868962377, "text": "The real meaning of,\" Dono tarf hi dar ka mahol jari hai.\"", "created_at": "2025-11-08T21:22:40", "owner": "manan_kumar08", "likes": 378}, {"id": 18058474673294369, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T02:18:36", "owner": "caio.au", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18167504572372546, "text": "ATO calls gonna take 2 hours just to get a response", "created_at": "2025-10-15T06:56:43", "owner": "wadood_for_real", "likes": 69}, {"id": 18064091813113837, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-30T02:14:42", "owner": "rossreviewsau", "likes": 23}, {"id": 18431051122110232, "text": "What’s ATO?", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:27:47", "owner": "x.6p3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18426399106111391, "text": "❤️ That's one hell of a fight with never ending loop.", "created_at": "2025-10-16T08:54:39", "owner": "jagadishladawa46", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18537745171023390, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T01:16:48", "owner": "they_call_him_rk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085634929798214, "text": "Call UN 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-05T07:32:07", "owner": "marwan_rasheed89", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17863953612457510, "text": "To be fair - the ATO will destroy your life worse than immigration will destroy his. I’d do whatever he says", "created_at": "2025-12-09T05:45:10", "owner": "invisagestudios", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18091135162921487, "text": "Trump is working hard for to Make peace between you guys 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-09T08:49:03", "owner": "saitarunbuddala", "likes": 21}, {"id": 18102467032654963, "text": "SHOTS FIRED 🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-06T13:59:26", "owner": "unhinged.oracle", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18082348801786531, "text": "Me still waiting for my order 😢", "created_at": "2025-10-17T09:19:13", "owner": "wut_duh_fudge", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17913194991249507, "text": "@iamzeynepakdemir 😂 reminded me of you", "created_at": "2025-12-04T04:32:54", "owner": "zmgdgnm", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18117539353524584, "text": "Fair play 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T02:07:31", "owner": "diogocohea", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17927384274153071, "text": "He wins…. No one escapes the ATO 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T05:11:48", "owner": "linskie123", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18086587411931355, "text": "Mexican stand-off (but don't tell ICE).", "created_at": "2025-10-13T20:09:42", "owner": "jmargo09", "likes": 393}, {"id": 17856547254550759, "text": "You guys have a dark sense of humor! I like it", "created_at": "2025-10-28T01:10:24", "owner": "jaredthomson", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17991257933845747, "text": "@australia_immigration_police , @australiataxation", "created_at": "2025-10-20T06:52:58", "owner": "vishal_r_1813", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17956644828013173, "text": "The Indian guy is probably on a visit visa, which means he’s not allowed to work and doesn’t have a Tax File Number. He might also be on a student visa and only allowed to work a limited number of hours per week. The lady owner chose him as a worker because she can pay him lower than the standard hourly rate, pay him in cash, avoid taxes, and avoid paying superannuation. The setup is a form of blackmail against each other. 😆", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:59:45", "owner": "snapsby_jazzy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17850554460534279, "text": "Hahahaha 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T22:11:15", "owner": "its_lyrie_2.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099814501646147, "text": "Home affairs will come back in 12 months. ATO will find your coordinates in 12 minutes", "created_at": "2025-10-13T00:03:32", "owner": "latitude_ho", "likes": 41497}, {"id": 18095356861741706, "text": "Ring health inspector. She wins!", "created_at": "2025-10-12T09:29:43", "owner": "chefgordo1974", "likes": 869}, {"id": 17880854562328046, "text": "Definitely eating here. Yall a wild.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T11:26:48", "owner": "thebangladeshiwolverine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882240835400318, "text": "only one can survive ahhh situation", "created_at": "2025-10-16T06:11:40", "owner": "isaidimduy", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17851021899566715, "text": "That's how illegal markets keep afloat. Business exploit and workers want to get exploited 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-16T05:31:50", "owner": "khizar_shah1", "likes": 18}, {"id": 17856379227538731, "text": "😂😂😂 You are amazing guys", "created_at": "2025-10-12T08:23:45", "owner": "amp.cosmetic", "likes": 55}, {"id": 18055929635561245, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂 i can’t even i’m laughing too much", "created_at": "2025-10-13T13:28:37", "owner": "tadra.cafe", "likes": 12}, {"id": 17867917011493765, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂 This needs more Views", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:18:43", "owner": "kurtis_2589", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18544725898004958, "text": "Finally shake hands and do the next job🤣😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T08:02:41", "owner": "manojkumar4546", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18241674058293425, "text": "Gonna come have a coffee because of this", "created_at": "2025-10-31T05:55:09", "owner": "_hugo_armstrong", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18083542903948533, "text": "Both of you should call therapist for eachother 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-28T00:42:04", "owner": "__mubby_46", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065759231136093, "text": "You guys seem cool, can I work at your cafe (I promise I can trusted with steaming hot cups of coffee)", "created_at": "2025-11-20T04:51:49", "owner": "mew_misbah", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17976360569776184, "text": "Let’s call in trump, he can add one more thing in his bragg list 😅", "created_at": "2025-10-14T00:45:37", "owner": "gurudhalliwal", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18093270787828667, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T08:45:27", "owner": "mrkakaki", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085288280073092, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-13T22:24:24", "owner": "avinaashthanabalan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076532435336239, "text": "Mutually assured destruction, the modern way to achieve peace.", "created_at": "2025-11-18T08:44:05", "owner": "cameronrobertjohn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863340718481079, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T08:38:03", "owner": "melbourne_halal_guide", "likes": 22}, {"id": 18373663180147432, "text": "Bro this is so funny", "created_at": "2025-10-15T06:30:37", "owner": "riemaisgood", "likes": 16}, {"id": 17881555185308789, "text": "Never forget, the detectives could never bring down Al Capone, but the tax man could.", "created_at": "2025-11-17T10:12:43", "owner": "filipskumpija", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18118675705543761, "text": "I have arrived on the Australian side of things 😂😂😂\n\nFor 🇺🇸, ATO = IRS.", "created_at": "2025-11-11T17:48:48", "owner": "abdullahal1997", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18542136952023571, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T08:49:45", "owner": "mapaulagodoy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083700314024027, "text": "Wait what's ATO 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-12T20:46:24", "owner": "a_cybertronian_nt5", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18049769966343180, "text": "The good, the bad and the undocumented", "created_at": "2025-11-07T14:14:44", "owner": "rp.231006", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18292455742286680, "text": "Raj i already called immigration Dehli don’t want u", "created_at": "2025-10-13T06:14:55", "owner": "bfeldman100_real_estate", "likes": 86}, {"id": 18067647746083776, "text": "He looks serious 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-12T21:18:57", "owner": "somanmdu", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18073188140182040, "text": "So good", "created_at": "2025-10-12T18:25:46", "owner": "simseeraly", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18182837572339747, "text": "Fair Work Ombudsman don't forget 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T06:49:52", "owner": "fajarsurya.putra", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17909477748254071, "text": "What is ATO", "created_at": "2025-11-12T03:48:37", "owner": "so41.21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108753484604921, "text": "Owner gonna need UN peacekeepers instead of bodyguards 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-16T13:14:42", "owner": "ig_jashn", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18072131420587374, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-06T10:05:21", "owner": "kartikccz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17889505098367366, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-05T05:50:11", "owner": "thapaaa_gaurav", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919185124195292, "text": "And me waiting for my order", "created_at": "2025-11-10T12:57:30", "owner": "crimson._.horizon", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063443015126618, "text": "Humour making a comeback finally", "created_at": "2025-10-25T00:48:00", "owner": "fourskyn", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18160343650351623, "text": "Eh, if he calls the ATO he will have to pay the tax back 😂 good luck", "created_at": "2025-10-24T04:47:51", "owner": "evangelina.s.richter", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18058892063531975, "text": "ATO: Australian Taxation office", "created_at": "2025-10-25T20:04:56", "owner": "supreet.sippy17", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18061446008628903, "text": "LOL", "created_at": "2025-10-13T08:47:09", "owner": "aurevoirdarling", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17905637127124735, "text": "well both the department people watching this reel lol 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-13T06:56:16", "owner": "soubh_z", "likes": 3183}, {"id": 18364693408084557, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-07T14:08:04", "owner": "hari.bhai4566", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18073154768521182, "text": "😮😮😂", "created_at": "2025-11-09T07:24:46", "owner": "dawsons__edits", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077414837129758, "text": "Damn!! 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-09T00:14:55", "owner": "farhan_adib", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17997705704836115, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-08T06:00:13", "owner": "imsayf_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068874479206928, "text": "You guys crack me up 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-12T08:45:14", "owner": "m.felix88", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18075877163130705, "text": "Threat to call the IRS. now everyone calm down", "created_at": "2025-10-17T07:17:17", "owner": "spooky_lxix", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17912230026228949, "text": "Anti terror organization or sm?", "created_at": "2025-10-25T03:13:29", "owner": "yan.is.suffering", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061944422180826, "text": "Is this in Melbourne? Is Melbourne healing? 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-05T06:11:08", "owner": "luke418.ministries", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18346042024204995, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-28T09:09:05", "owner": "sharmiishere", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18100028971735555, "text": "I guarantee he hasn't paid tax on his remittances.", "created_at": "2025-11-06T22:56:45", "owner": "w.hy_no.t", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18316828945170566, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-05T06:52:27", "owner": "fikri_dfa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18336722509238934, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-06T06:36:49", "owner": "tej_4464", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17861427057515065, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-02T11:34:23", "owner": "ctrlanand", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18093280390797763, "text": "what is ATO?", "created_at": "2025-11-06T08:17:37", "owner": "humpty_dumpty_1736", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894979006200757, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-03T19:15:33", "owner": "namrah_shafiq", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068822609070537, "text": "A Mexican standoff 🇮🇹", "created_at": "2025-11-01T17:14:30", "owner": "uomreels", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088087289072325, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-13T19:07:06", "owner": "paramrandhawa93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084378611035046, "text": "Too far hun", "created_at": "2025-12-12T13:45:30", "owner": "eafverit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088271332966238, "text": "The ATO probably the scariest animal in Australia", "created_at": "2025-12-12T08:25:40", "owner": "mellow1665", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087499598059196, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T05:33:35", "owner": "resolvefinancecolletteiorfino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893670058367559, "text": "LMFAO", "created_at": "2025-12-12T04:50:49", "owner": "elanurgulay_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997637466847917, "text": "“Well played Patel”", "created_at": "2025-12-11T13:45:49", "owner": "yumeth.dep", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991064613735154, "text": "Immigration you can run from, the ATO will always get their money no matter the cost", "created_at": "2025-12-11T09:39:49", "owner": "m3mes6942", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025183958597058, "text": "You might have a chance, still on hold with ATO!", "created_at": "2025-12-11T08:37:38", "owner": "onemoreabblebeez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159533749402007, "text": "Stalemate", "created_at": "2025-12-11T08:18:50", "owner": "kody_nic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855224656582921, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T08:18:45", "owner": "kody_nic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970551354827411, "text": "He’s got you by the balls 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T06:13:20", "owner": "becbourdain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071672036074201, "text": "That said, are you free for an tax audit this Monday.", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:45:23", "owner": "rick_rach", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090525733766244, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:17:12", "owner": "moisespfluck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857755045565706, "text": "THIS IS EPIC 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-10T23:43:23", "owner": "ardyokta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100024033755277, "text": "Hahahhahah lmao", "created_at": "2025-12-10T11:11:51", "owner": "lannalorena_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992952195889855, "text": "You pass wind and the ATO will find you lol", "created_at": "2025-12-10T06:58:35", "owner": "shadowandthebear", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980424030932007, "text": "ATO vs SART (Steam Account Recovery Team) who's winning?", "created_at": "2025-12-10T04:25:53", "owner": "chimera.13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092828512912241, "text": "Is this supposed to mock the US and ICE? If he's there legally, then he doesn't have to be scared.", "created_at": "2025-12-10T01:43:17", "owner": "newsstalker47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919475659217086, "text": "Lol 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T20:52:24", "owner": "alphasvb37", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092763767482784, "text": "Whats immigration gonna do if he is legally there", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:34:08", "owner": "im_ikkyu_san", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18395971909135374, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:48:43", "owner": "triggerpitt_87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879122488438849, "text": "who else read the ‘late machine’ in the caption as machete 😩", "created_at": "2025-12-09T05:25:16", "owner": "th3_m0d1f1c8t0r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916566394086106, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T12:54:41", "owner": "derpvinmindead", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874206523459584, "text": "Not the ATO 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-08T06:14:32", "owner": "renegade_stitches", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067313291626615, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T00:08:37", "owner": "ayush_0802_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002384378830694, "text": "😂😭", "created_at": "2025-12-07T06:36:23", "owner": "carendavita", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957342850012615, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T04:40:28", "owner": "davidrhinoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18217361128307976, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:47:02", "owner": "lbertt_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094307581810004, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:44:34", "owner": "fatgirthyleg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081036752166683, "text": "Just a fine. He gets deported . Call his bluff", "created_at": "2025-12-06T04:04:17", "owner": "iaminternetfamous", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917896759226997, "text": "Cracka everyone is concerned about the staff. \nHave a look at that menu 🤤", "created_at": "2025-12-06T02:43:31", "owner": "busted_meme187", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049548440402690, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T00:18:43", "owner": "theskinboutique.newtown", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856631257570296, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T18:52:52", "owner": "via.bary", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086661724832772, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:04:41", "owner": "indian_sikh27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097696519839727, "text": "Never take chance against ATO! 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:16:12", "owner": "mymigration", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033710942724841, "text": "😮😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T19:54:02", "owner": "ninijanny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084600979852677, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:39:06", "owner": "tamim_tifo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070647626582429, "text": "Sounds like the public should call both 🤷🏻‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-12-03T16:53:09", "owner": "ahsol91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086294114000074, "text": "Call immigration, I'll pay your tax", "created_at": "2025-12-03T08:30:11", "owner": "yourmotherismycardio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088012792962170, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T08:11:50", "owner": "brm0295", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849591292573108, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:41:17", "owner": "sumayea_walid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063440171451760, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:41:57", "owner": "jatinder_x_bhullar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852721480543419, "text": "Kkkkkkkkkkkkkkkk", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:47:39", "owner": "fernandataysa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946023985075089, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:22:23", "owner": "ltnailsfortmyer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852521983594276, "text": "Lol so funny 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T10:02:30", "owner": "dooti_foodie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950151990917280, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:50:44", "owner": "dmpno1fan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124473250517086, "text": "I've been wanting to move to United States as well but I'm having a hard time figuring something out. Leaving the fares and stuff behind, how do I actually get a residency pass there in US? I once read that it is hard to get a citizenship and can only get one if you have a job and stuff there and things like that but I have no connection and that's been my dream.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:13:03", "owner": "gaikuthui_gangmei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065649170151747, "text": "What is ATO?", "created_at": "2025-12-01T05:52:56", "owner": "torontochino22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914756488091195, "text": "Both dodgy. I’ll make a call 📞", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:41:24", "owner": "egi0831", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947211367070406, "text": "Hahaha", "created_at": "2025-11-30T10:50:32", "owner": "dhillon_lovepreet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080687492118899, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:24:59", "owner": "s_hussain_haider", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888619291261956, "text": "Diabolical haha", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:35:57", "owner": "sydneymotosales", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969582084825736, "text": "Bro just got permanent residency now it's time to start threatening him with ASIO", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:04:50", "owner": "euan_forbsey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860364157549848, "text": "Hahahahahahaahahaha", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:52:56", "owner": "cappuchenooo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863606359531628, "text": "This is top tier comedy and marketing strategy 😭🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:30:00", "owner": "thebluehulk96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950510806061529, "text": "Go back to europe  and india both now", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:44:10", "owner": "alex419942", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882236857310416, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:40:41", "owner": "yunosuke2002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922187125193713, "text": "How much is that leg piece 🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:55:26", "owner": "abs4mamun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970968912963546, "text": "Jesus 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:22:09", "owner": "we.hate.cilantro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109044748722273, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "create