astiancalderonjau", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18077380649166654, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-08T11:52:37", "owner": "kdr_blgnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182263627350769, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-08T10:31:29", "owner": "jesutitomi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18336135517238032, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-08T05:16:20", "owner": "0g.mayur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072212780017728, "text": "Dark", "created_at": "2025-11-07T12:48:09", "owner": "the.storysage", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18328807771215451, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-07T12:24:18", "owner": "benmallox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980877660770315, "text": "Yall wild af 😂😂👌", "created_at": "2025-11-07T07:17:38", "owner": "ians_bakeshop97", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17913799881086909, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-07T05:56:30", "owner": "mrssiavallejos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083762410984692, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-07T03:49:48", "owner": "_saran_vs_2000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18536250253026170, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-06T23:57:17", "owner": "esteban_trader", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088020817943697, "text": "Tas crazy🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-06T22:52:42", "owner": "adhithyafx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861204622456819, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-06T14:44:08", "owner": "snabeelaliii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937078831098417, "text": "Deport him", "created_at": "2025-11-06T11:22:55", "owner": "ghazalirazaqadri2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069258014065548, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-06T03:51:43", "owner": "evelynvantori", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077726423034907, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-05T09:19:53", "owner": "vlogs_with_deepu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088375127506514, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-05T07:44:36", "owner": "theraghavjoshii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065816945576967, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-05T06:29:41", "owner": "sandhu221197", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865496266495316, "text": "I’d dare say Immigration acts much faster than the ATO.\n🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-05T05:35:25", "owner": "ks22881620", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113629615563511, "text": "The ATO does a full sweep over every industry in Australia 😂 eventually they'll get to your business @albomp how else do these dinosaurs get paid 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-05T04:19:13", "owner": "vaughan_golding", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18379505053195121, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-05T02:00:40", "owner": "iyanispt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18089073760738789, "text": "Karenpoop with the jokes😂", "created_at": "2025-11-04T16:11:43", "owner": "abundancep_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872235241449812, "text": "I read ATO as NATO and thought he was ordering a tactical airstrike on her 😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-04T15:46:37", "owner": "der.vollmond", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17929079157135133, "text": "I was expecting “the ungrateful biatch hotline”", "created_at": "2025-11-04T11:30:31", "owner": "zeeshan.m_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874815400356716, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-04T10:45:49", "owner": "assi_param", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084679015944572, "text": "Tax officials are supreme 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-04T08:58:26", "owner": "ichillowon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857617816546275, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-04T07:23:58", "owner": "nidrafi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146217016426920, "text": "the ato dont fuck around lmfao", "created_at": "2025-11-04T04:11:58", "owner": "k.vieni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858635620479994, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-04T03:37:48", "owner": "subhamgupta03", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17849686833554582, "text": "It would be good If Trump's hair would be tumbling between you 2 in the reference for the tumbleweed 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-04T03:36:09", "owner": "banoor_8", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17984004590873449, "text": "@loveislandau can you include them in your next season 😮", "created_at": "2025-11-04T03:31:14", "owner": "sastracikitsaka", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17942751770948161, "text": "Immigration don't do anything anyway....", "created_at": "2025-11-04T03:05:53", "owner": "robinh1994", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869136490466593, "text": "@sproggy119 @desbletas", "created_at": "2025-11-04T01:32:25", "owner": "zanedj_13", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17923401336160077, "text": "Uhh hello???? I’m still waiting for my dirty chaiii", "created_at": "2025-11-03T12:18:10", "owner": "nowandforeverco.pg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031174928731722, "text": "🤣🤣🤣wtf", "created_at": "2025-11-03T11:02:32", "owner": "stfu_laiba77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109040500607252, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-03T10:13:12", "owner": "antoniettadefazio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847643002567049, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-02T14:23:58", "owner": "arans00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927859969141023, "text": "An unstoppable force meets an immovable object ahhh situation", "created_at": "2025-11-02T09:53:35", "owner": "carlojtassone", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071399951018691, "text": "🔥🔥🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-02T07:48:18", "owner": "ramakrishna_onthego", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067768313457274, "text": "Game set go 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-02T07:45:37", "owner": "ramakrishna_onthego", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17922514575168336, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-02T06:14:55", "owner": "y.chothia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882899749283521, "text": "Popping in to say that we appreciate this sense of humour 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-02T05:48:43", "owner": "michelago.general.store", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184042063342807, "text": "Oh so it’s like the IRS for us Americans, yeah neither one plays i see", "created_at": "2025-11-01T18:41:52", "owner": "ohyohnny", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17903061015275625, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-01T12:09:09", "owner": "voidphenomenon", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18195936514325610, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-01T06:06:51", "owner": "mehdi.rezwani314", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029370743726605, "text": "It’s not worth it", "created_at": "2025-10-31T18:39:11", "owner": "juliaadams_1997", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18027972791743574, "text": "Don’t do it", "created_at": "2025-10-31T18:39:06", "owner": "juliaadams_1997", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064835735454423, "text": "Hahahahahahahahahahahah🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-31T07:09:06", "owner": "varunsethi381", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064612805386465, "text": "I wa like hold up Anti Terrorism Organisation??? 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-31T04:29:08", "owner": "nirmiiit", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18507151087069906, "text": "Sahi hai, koi toh hai gori ko dhamkane wala. Proud of u bro. Cheers. Warna saare launde BKL nikalte hai", "created_at": "2025-10-30T20:07:50", "owner": "agli.olioo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127842064441099, "text": "Meanwhile ATO and Immigration watching this video- 🏃🏻‍➡️🏃🏻‍➡️🏃🏻‍➡️", "created_at": "2025-10-30T14:02:59", "owner": "shankharaj19", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17912626008234548, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-30T13:15:39", "owner": "fitlifty66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097849963706701, "text": "get a room you two🤦‍♂️🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-30T11:19:16", "owner": "the_bogs_show", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957521823992437, "text": "The people behind are ready to call the police 🚔", "created_at": "2025-10-30T10:31:53", "owner": "yahya56hayat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18535939702052267, "text": "😂😂 hospitality showdown", "created_at": "2025-10-30T07:50:59", "owner": "bernie_fn_mack", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097741621669165, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-30T06:32:21", "owner": "_raj_ch0urasiya_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18024321098579199, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-30T03:36:02", "owner": "legacythaiboxing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985803003879641, "text": "Uno reverse🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-30T03:04:39", "owner": "chelseak136_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088223740909511, "text": "Call immigration? And what get everyone he ever met back home over here?", "created_at": "2025-10-30T01:57:24", "owner": "rowan_fnq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18287764891277402, "text": "Now kiss", "created_at": "2025-10-29T14:15:45", "owner": "viktaken", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854572060559419, "text": "Not paying your taxes and getting an audit is a far bigger problem than immigration lol@😂 gold", "created_at": "2025-10-29T11:59:24", "owner": "james_ausnz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069018800585901, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-29T11:58:52", "owner": "james_ausnz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108444892737049, "text": "He will definitely call the ato I can see it in his eyes", "created_at": "2025-10-29T10:47:04", "owner": "ahmedkhaled1121998", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172888429366315, "text": "@faithii33 🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-29T02:38:10", "owner": "sidhant3858", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879620263420468, "text": "I’d rather talk to immigration than ATO 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-29T00:18:55", "owner": "__sluzza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077809787279981, "text": "\"You ain't got no green card.\" \"You ain't go no green\"", "created_at": "2025-10-28T21:40:21", "owner": "yaboynyon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028091768754677, "text": "Calling the ATO is the equivalent of calling the IRS", "created_at": "2025-10-28T20:53:17", "owner": "sirbuttcheek1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18137098231458692, "text": "Need jbo", "created_at": "2025-10-28T15:25:11", "owner": "football_is_my_drug_7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056063204266819, "text": "Immigration and ATO on site visit be like..... \"no, which reel... just passing by for coffee... btw...\" 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-28T10:09:47", "owner": "dpace.o_o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116800492477643, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-28T09:08:39", "owner": "m_t_m619", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17923345047177021, "text": "Where is the coffee?", "created_at": "2025-10-28T04:03:23", "owner": "cheepeng_khoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977793273779462, "text": "This reel will backfire. Not a smart idea 🤦🏽‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-28T01:54:38", "owner": "jaz_kohli", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17901973287293650, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-27T21:29:29", "owner": "gapcio._", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047806382670804, "text": "So you are both criminals? And decided to post it to social media? @ausimmigrationandcitizenship", "created_at": "2025-10-27T21:07:42", "owner": "dough001", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086084083766825, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-27T20:15:14", "owner": "harvecxo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18290920234280779, "text": "Miss read ATO as ATF 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-27T13:27:34", "owner": "observer_b_42", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062195084447132, "text": "Fun loving pisstake in 2025? Are we back on the correct timeline???", "created_at": "2025-10-26T23:50:26", "owner": "ilkiw.morgan", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17887093860379508, "text": "Whats wronf with calling ato?", "created_at": "2025-10-26T13:10:25", "owner": "_shayan.akhxn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305447065301390, "text": "Please don't mess with the ATO.🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-26T10:34:00", "owner": "vanya_fernando", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18043621487449893, "text": "@sriman_reddy_ Hiii", "created_at": "2025-10-26T07:44:52", "owner": "akhil__mak9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980575632920832, "text": "😂😂😮😮😮😍😢😢👏🔥🔥🙌🙌🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-26T06:12:56", "owner": "adity_abhandari_45", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18308226517247446, "text": "Haha love it", "created_at": "2025-10-26T03:00:07", "owner": "biteswithsanjay", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062752556411717, "text": "Bruh....atleast you could have used two aprons😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-25T09:50:46", "owner": "desi_vibes_au", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18538232380010918, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-25T08:03:47", "owner": "dayana_hortiyechuks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084702488484067, "text": "@_monkey_d._swapiii_ @wahid_r1m 🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-25T08:00:49", "owner": "abhinav_singh1701", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18300798241252910, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-25T07:08:15", "owner": "yugandhar.tak", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047395508667606, "text": "Why the ATO ?", "created_at": "2025-10-25T05:49:04", "owner": "ebaydowneyjr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093904630825105, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-24T22:58:03", "owner": "idarshanshelat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865275373413515, "text": "It’s Australia, we’re all criminals here 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-24T22:14:17", "owner": "blue_dog_resto", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18062249339439017, "text": "Lol what a toxic work environment 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-24T16:45:08", "owner": "bigbossugo7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067886561198725, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-24T10:14:24", "owner": "hakuna_matada_1234", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18315688996221330, "text": "Ah yeah ATO the equivalent of IRS.", "created_at": "2025-10-24T08:18:06", "owner": "5.56x30ar", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18069824651340484, "text": "My living situation with my landlord be like", "created_at": "2025-10-24T05:45:55", "owner": "maximiliankot_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18077757422117788, "text": "I think the girl would get away with calling DIGITAL DRAUD DEPARTMENT", "created_at": "2025-10-24T05:13:55", "owner": "hasanalifayzan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18206998702311167, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-24T03:21:47", "owner": "amolveer_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082733603075494, "text": "Wait we got denim aprons now. Super cool", "created_at": "2025-10-23T17:54:26", "owner": "rayan.k201", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061003049527519, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T16:58:52", "owner": "otisonly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18411575662138829, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T12:55:07", "owner": "ez_angelica", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18531869245021970, "text": "@yashjari_08", "created_at": "2025-10-23T11:10:20", "owner": "mr_mishi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18535407610018824, "text": "😂😂where is the head shake", "created_at": "2025-10-23T09:03:46", "owner": "mad.manland", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540074368020694, "text": "Didn't even have 2 aprons", "created_at": "2025-10-23T06:16:07", "owner": "adittttttyyyyaaaaaaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856449784486362, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T02:28:10", "owner": "trinadh_7777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083689568297358, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣 Now you both in trouble 🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-23T01:11:09", "owner": "senetala_em_jo_ed_zac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18312437824222639, "text": "Yall got mexicans down south too??", "created_at": "2025-10-22T22:50:26", "owner": "marz.ouq_17", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18015499307792601, "text": "We got a MEXİCAN standoff here", "created_at": "2025-10-22T20:56:43", "owner": "__ertugrull_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18045527975406112, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-22T17:49:53", "owner": "jay_chaudhari289", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144977776424002, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-22T15:33:22", "owner": "kxrmxn_pvt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104923750540303, "text": "Whoa whoa , easy there cowboy", "created_at": "2025-10-22T11:16:39", "owner": "01gurkaran_preet", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17872149111444206, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-22T10:43:11", "owner": "1am_zia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004341308658512, "text": "“I'm crazy enough to take on Batman, but the IRS? No thank you!\"", "created_at": "2025-10-22T09:13:09", "owner": "frideeyz", "likes": 44}, {"id": 17916180564067205, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T00:05:59", "owner": "celestialbilli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058593515532985, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:48:53", "owner": "thesampatterson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022353281587876, "text": "Love this one! 😂😭😭😭💀", "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:40:24", "owner": "pranasaba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987402648884504, "text": "Friendly fire 💀", "created_at": "2025-10-21T09:30:06", "owner": "i_am_livinstun", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18015494204793944, "text": "she gets put on hold and he doesn’t even need touch the phone cos the ATO was already listening 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-21T09:00:20", "owner": "sucks_to_suck_eggs", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17854455180556315, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-21T08:44:03", "owner": "sekkiq