:50:58", "owner": "saint_alvin2005", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18076267703164831, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-19T09:44:57", "owner": "sumayah.jpgg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850350511571747, "text": "Literally", "created_at": "2025-10-19T09:41:30", "owner": "p_club_pics666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896032342334966, "text": "Call IRS and they'll be already on table", "created_at": "2025-10-19T09:06:06", "owner": "cedrusart0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077673238888958, "text": "Et se pathar", "created_at": "2025-10-19T07:12:44", "owner": "diddy_ka_mama", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090920224867161, "text": "Bro ends up calling NATO", "created_at": "2025-10-19T06:42:04", "owner": "xenskye", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17864998356472667, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-19T05:29:52", "owner": "_s_u_y_a_s_h_2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852467605560893, "text": "It seems ur joking but he's actually tryna do that", "created_at": "2025-10-19T05:23:00", "owner": "im_a_shit_dude", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055017524635868, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-18T23:24:30", "owner": "michael_ezeo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982704255750565, "text": "What is ATO", "created_at": "2025-10-18T23:13:33", "owner": "9skd6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082416935059352, "text": "oh that’s not—", "created_at": "2025-10-18T23:11:52", "owner": "omerprazole", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967711617965644, "text": "😂😂 my kind of jokes 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-18T16:49:33", "owner": "bettymoorree", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059064344442504, "text": "Duel at highnoon❌️call at highnoon✅️😂", "created_at": "2025-10-18T15:38:55", "owner": "bala_n27", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17911230876091986, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-18T14:37:59", "owner": "nikhilchintha7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049560020339348, "text": "The ATO and Immigration watching like 👁️🫦👁️", "created_at": "2025-10-18T14:27:10", "owner": "therealbenajani", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18063637088110815, "text": "He is wearing a Piastri shirt, he can stay it's okay.", "created_at": "2025-10-18T13:00:47", "owner": "cyz0c", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17891083548219066, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-18T11:09:25", "owner": "akshay.dthakur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066261536522546, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-18T10:37:47", "owner": "mubashir_alliii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081335038991698, "text": "What", "created_at": "2025-10-18T08:39:05", "owner": "rayhan.firdaus19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963622863990219, "text": "Silly joke", "created_at": "2025-10-18T08:05:08", "owner": "rexzidoh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112611580560788, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-18T07:41:46", "owner": "anjamma0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17978877923926057, "text": "Love turned into border control vs tax control  now that’s what I call a fully governed breakup! 💥🎤", "created_at": "2025-10-18T06:24:51", "owner": "vicky_7803", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043378430446701, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-18T04:30:51", "owner": "keveeno_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143255296434843, "text": "I'm calling your mothers 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-18T01:45:18", "owner": "yvon.ne787", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095136103695366, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-18T01:13:37", "owner": "sami_janjua_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17972986586949397, "text": "*The manager threatening to fire you both*", "created_at": "2025-10-17T22:46:29", "owner": "hammers_and_brushes", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17887189032369363, "text": "Both on their way💀", "created_at": "2025-10-17T21:32:23", "owner": "that_buttar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054099845290101, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-17T18:20:02", "owner": "gulerikartik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058438235563249, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T18:12:26", "owner": "ibn__alee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064524671098150, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:36:33", "owner": "one.above.all.1111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156193669400740, "text": "Eak Nirmala Sitharaman fek ke marunga bhagti firegi😎", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:17:06", "owner": "vaibhav_1999__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032479433721775, "text": "@twistentiger all of their reels say Victoria, Australia", "created_at": "2025-10-17T11:48:06", "owner": "rzani1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873941284430293, "text": "Parley?!", "created_at": "2025-10-17T10:22:42", "owner": "maaz_amjad_warsi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965726046825759, "text": "I dont care just bring my ordered food first afterwards do whatever the shit you want 😏😒", "created_at": "2025-10-17T09:42:06", "owner": "mono_2728", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067730351587325, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-17T09:38:06", "owner": "mir_hassan_ali_khan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082808761815197, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T06:44:40", "owner": "kuya_peanut_guy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100321843680551, "text": "okay, we don’t want to take sides - but if she does call immigration, you know who to call 😉", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:26:25", "owner": "themigrationstudioau", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18109230790602352, "text": "🤣 yeah unfortunately ATO will investigate quick smart😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:14:53", "owner": "mylittlecornertoday", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850128229574776, "text": "Me who is researching their address and asking for a Manager job with good pay else tagging both", "created_at": "2025-10-17T01:31:28", "owner": "travelpotraits", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17851865973526462, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T00:54:55", "owner": "jere_ocyaden", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17888091987368147, "text": "He already sent message 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-16T22:12:32", "owner": "lizaisbaby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064497917371999, "text": "ATO?", "created_at": "2025-10-16T18:39:16", "owner": "conquistador.gagan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118108090532705, "text": "Hahahahahhahahah", "created_at": "2025-10-16T15:55:15", "owner": "princenextdoor_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066587069360155, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-16T14:44:45", "owner": "itz_karan_haryana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915277309071019, "text": "Then hire me I will be a judge. Give me half half both 🤣🤣🤣😂", "created_at": "2025-10-16T11:58:29", "owner": "kt_tori", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145578436425975, "text": "The Fight is so On", "created_at": "2025-10-16T09:00:49", "owner": "rischie78", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18088384678924290, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-16T07:59:27", "owner": "perpetually_effervescent", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142513063437145, "text": "Technically won't get deported if he came there the legal way. Don't worry i understood the joke & found it funny, but not haha funny, but more of: ahh now thats a funny joke & a good 1 too.", "created_at": "2025-10-16T07:49:52", "owner": "john_vantarakis", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18092136922876323, "text": "Literally the most healthiest working environment.", "created_at": "2025-10-16T07:30:02", "owner": "johnxu8888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18533075227013571, "text": "I won't play with the ATO. they're faster than home affairs 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-16T06:23:15", "owner": "mdtordecillas", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17900017065295764, "text": "😂😂😂😂 what a standoff.", "created_at": "2025-10-16T06:22:17", "owner": "mdtordecillas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086550397740358, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-16T02:46:21", "owner": "unofficial_jellyvelly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18315213946172143, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-16T02:45:42", "owner": "theinsuranceinfluence", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18538968292046969, "text": "He should call HR for this cos.. nope", "created_at": "2025-10-16T02:35:50", "owner": "_victoria.morganson", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078799382098865, "text": "ATO is gynaecologist who ponders deep to find any underlying issues", "created_at": "2025-10-15T22:34:57", "owner": "dulletjs", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18394496545193469, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T22:29:33", "owner": "parthingu", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18535414945011777, "text": "Best 🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-15T22:21:25", "owner": "0_suger_free_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116475952531550, "text": "Lmao yeah keep laughing, but this is a bona fide \"Mexican\" stand off.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T21:07:59", "owner": "scumbag_1982", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081960734051778, "text": "You know what, this is too funny 🤣 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T20:48:57", "owner": "mukaamy", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18118665040513603, "text": "😂😂😂 🇮🇳❤️🇦🇺", "created_at": "2025-10-15T20:32:04", "owner": "iamskyy666", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057251510216626, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T18:46:36", "owner": "sagar_instant", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008473118797726, "text": "If Trump meditates here , he will surely get nobel peace", "created_at": "2025-10-15T18:31:08", "owner": "mayurniya", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18043108463429479, "text": "I just knew that the T was tax because nobody gets away from tax man", "created_at": "2025-10-15T15:51:17", "owner": "ismailameer", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17969438945808744, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-15T15:41:44", "owner": "max1m_a_v", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17946908988046903, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T14:24:06", "owner": "chanakacool", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876009616334300, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:55:47", "owner": "zaidagarciareposteria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079714804861074, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-15T13:45:57", "owner": "akshat_chauhan_aox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984518841880876, "text": "ICE ICE", "created_at": "2025-10-15T12:44:50", "owner": "thomas.gabriel.23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084385408768150, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-15T12:43:13", "owner": "eminent.in.shadows", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078807215108912, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T12:42:47", "owner": "revanth_trainer", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18052012556646303, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T12:27:20", "owner": "zen_wisdoms", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116117755475391, "text": "ATO - australian taxation office", "created_at": "2025-10-15T11:53:22", "owner": "a_white_devil_16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073191050219018, "text": "Pretty sure this cafe will have the most peaceful environment 🤌🏻", "created_at": "2025-10-15T11:30:10", "owner": "just.too.awesome", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072067181466553, "text": "And this is called as “Mexican” standoff….", "created_at": "2025-10-15T10:58:28", "owner": "shivesh_rane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029874149735137, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T10:27:24", "owner": "malaikashito", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043051394452208, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T10:04:37", "owner": "caeciliapl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071158655245955, "text": "ATO ?", "created_at": "2025-10-15T09:39:55", "owner": "nbmysterious", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074249590913642, "text": "❤️❤️❤️😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T09:14:28", "owner": "otavianoedson", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17876866074422073, "text": "let's go😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T09:11:34", "owner": "fyrohit3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057271628227295, "text": "Lucu bet", "created_at": "2025-10-15T09:10:20", "owner": "lvamalia", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18099990796638435, "text": "Holy shit reminds me of my old job when my boss caught someone stealing but they were underpaying everyone.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T08:59:33", "owner": "evii_duck", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17958101840865065, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T08:56:46", "owner": "hima_sai_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981086652874492, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T08:47:53", "owner": "creative_nazim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052018655316463, "text": "@ATO 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T08:17:07", "owner": "silaarta05", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17901990141279247, "text": "There can only be one Barista in this town 🤠", "created_at": "2025-10-15T08:03:15", "owner": "gazoleanz_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17949576213042116, "text": "Meanwhile 🇬🇧 threatening to win one match in the Ashes", "created_at": "2025-10-15T07:58:54", "owner": "meetrahuldev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893118676347483, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T07:50:33", "owner": "anirgs24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976869432779969, "text": "Wow wonder who this could be like hahaha", "created_at": "2025-10-15T07:25:34", "owner": "shanebaker4112", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072686864268720, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-15T06:16:54", "owner": "vibeswall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948477262022054, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-15T05:33:16", "owner": "_.ganesh12._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966005520969573, "text": "What is ATO", "created_at": "2025-10-15T05:26:42", "owner": "pastprsent", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060639152453216, "text": "ahh, mad for each other.", "created_at": "2025-10-15T05:22:54", "owner": "aakashbhardwaaj", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17851548216563200, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-15T05:08:53", "owner": "therocking.raj", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18404092504137776, "text": "Never F with the tax man", "created_at": "2025-10-15T04:58:46", "owner": "indianyeti", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18043390694689439, "text": "just call your boys after shift and wait for him to go around the back and then jump him 🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-15T04:50:59", "owner": "filam_boi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054964181277446, "text": "This is so FUNNY once you get it", "created_at": "2025-10-15T04:47:17", "owner": "chexrieeeee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083011393791922, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-15T04:46:49", "owner": "the.blackfyre", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18109074550508595, "text": "Tramp is on his way to bring peace to this war", "created_at": "2025-10-15T04:35:09", "owner": "uday_ldrago", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17999359499674491, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T04:33:57", "owner": "him_wale", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18117488761473002, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T03:53:56", "owner": "arsh_aus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061633580614375, "text": "Anti terror organistaion?? ATO", "created_at": "2025-10-15T03:53:36", "owner": "ashrafshahnawaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985798776860862, "text": "I thought Anti terror organistaion", "created_at": "2025-10-15T03:53:07", "owner": "ashrafshahnawaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060790154149661, "text": "What's ATO ?", "created_at": "2025-10-15T03:42:55", "owner": "zubairyusuf543", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18358547401086092, "text": "This is insane marketing lmao", "created_at": "2025-10-15T03:33:32", "owner": "mohitrao_", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18430329835096183, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T03:12:22", "owner": "k_nk24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031299059512614, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T02:45:50", "owner": "firelight25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055007189550821, "text": "@jiahhauzi", "created_at": "2025-10-15T02:12:23", "owner": "ali.elmir.79", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925461193119460, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂 best duel", "created_at": "2025-10-15T01:22:23", "owner": "dk.shsh", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18058451183542482, "text": "😂😂 *super 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-15T00:01:36", "owner": "utkarshganorkar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082111327994837, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T22:20:27", "owner": "violetoyong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902840773271886, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-14T21:09:51", "owner": "omair_chohan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18316580275172308, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T21:06:15", "owner": "mk_kaden88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090549790857566, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T20:20:41", "owner": "md_huzaifa_k", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17896006206183487, "text": "@juan433two_six", "created_at": "2025-10-14T20:13:11", "owner": "jrwdza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057725987231813, "text": "But question is, who won? 🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-14T19:57:15", "owner": "everlykaiya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003711803702054, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-14T18:29:57", "owner": "prabhpreets99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082547770985496, "text": "Anti Terrorist Org?", "created_at": "2025-10-14T18:13:24", "owner": "gramifica", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121525504510729, "text": "I just called them on you both", "created_at": "2025-10-14T18:05:46", "owner": "jameseees", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18316327225171571, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T17:40:42", "owner": "soaring_phoenix_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104493610555442, "text": "Was wondering why it isn't ICE vs IRS. 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T17:03:22", "owner": "madrasibythesea", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17993095601845048, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T16:55:04", "owner": "mark_gomes45", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18530085121023355, "text": "There's only place for one of us in this town 🤠 ahh", "created_at": "2025-10-14T14:33:28", "owner": "football_slayer07_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922828381080053, "text": "So Tax terror is global 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T14:28:37", "owner": "darewin_mendonsa", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18034533335711598, "text": "Hahaha", "created_at": "2025-10-14T13:25:22", "owner": "ithankgodformakingmejuicydaily", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107444638579856, "text": "does america also call their ato the ato cause australia also had the ato are they both taxation offices…. i need to call the ato to help me get into my account i need to see if i owe the government or if they owe me for this tax year… ssiigghh", "created_at": "2025-10-14T13:09:00", "owner": "glamcock_fazrock", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068759720251304, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-14T12:59:32", "owner": "suleman.lohar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17884754973263824, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T12:58:58", "owner": "suleman.lohar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990214293717824, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-14T12:32:50", "owner": "lethalgadgets", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18186528178328607, "text": "Bringing peace here may be last hope for Trump to bag that Nobel prize 🕺", "created_at": "2025-10-14T12:17:03", "owner": "goldsgang", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17928536475126365, "text": "Yes Instagram, I’m interested in this joke.", "created_at": "2025-10-14T12:11:36", "owner": "fierzav", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080128483835238, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T12:07:58", "owner": "rrn_8888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111312184501364, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T11:26:06", "owner": "sah7599", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18341299318200704, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-14T11:16:29", "owner": "nitishh._.20", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18082082578955118, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T11:15:56", "owner": "glitz_on_heelz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061383269625152, "text": "Music choice 👌🏻", "created_at": "2025-10-14T10:56:57", "owner": "narelle17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057806561559709, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T10:54:53", "owner": "zoluushki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110276329562528, "text": "U know the cafe is shit when they be calling the espresso machine a \"latte machine\" or maybe they were referring to the baristas", "created_at": "2025-10-14T10:24:37", "owner": "rays_beans", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18290957683286337, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T10:22:19", "owner": "ignaafrns", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18315791659169808, "text": "And then a nato agent comes in 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T09:36:11", "owner": "sameer_shaikh_11714", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17900735487286209, "text": "I'm Australian, that's where I watch my student debt rise. What's this ATO?", "created_at": "2025-10-14T09:17:39", "owner": "t.c.read", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079626700851466, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T09:09:09", "owner": "sidbirari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851631370525286, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂 Miss u guys 😢😢", "created_at": "2025-10-14T08:54:27", "owner": "cityofstyle_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18427766908097719, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-14T08:39:28", "owner": "_yoandco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859313419527923, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-14T08:35:58", "owner": "gergopal99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074436164128266, "text": "Immigration wouldn’t do anything in this country", "created_at": "2025-10-14T08:16:24", "owner": "joffajames", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949165369021248, "text": "I wouldn’t worry, the ATO is probably already watching her. Nothing is as efficient as the tax collector", "created_at": "2025-10-14T08:13:22", "owner": "jesse_llewellyn_lancaster", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18053358266315906, "text": "Better call Saul", "created_at": "2025-10-14T08:04:57", "owner": "puneeth_kumar22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072891086332172, "text": "Good humour. Love everyone getting along", "created_at": "2025-10-14T07:59:06", "owner": "prolific.one_21", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17965605611823520, "text": "Meanwhile boys looking where scomo is these days.", "created_at": "2025-10-14T07:57:12", "owner": "itiz_sourav07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089278372862160, "text": "Deep 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T07:53:49", "owner": "umair_aslam32", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18427145593105515, "text": "Yoooooo hahaahaha", "created_at": "2025-10-14T07:52:20", "owner": "franzzzvee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917236054193826, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-14T07:41:58", "owner": "odk7_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18428206576103991, "text": "UN be like we are closely monitoring the situation and want to invite both parties in UN to discuss peace 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T07:31:41", "owner": "shivaamchandraatiwari0951", "likes": 104}, {"id": 18411924628118889, "text": "do you want Trump to sign you a peace deal also?😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T07:21:50", "owner": "zigmundroyeca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074739742899588, "text": "Hahaha this is too real 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T07:18:41", "owner": "jono.grawr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076022126132456, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T07:14:34", "owner": "brklyn_the_creator", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909816157247646, "text": "WHATTT", "created_at": "2025-10-14T07:13:13", "owner": "sibraan_ram", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077817373884061, "text": "Fair Trading is watching calmly.", "created_at": "2025-10-14T07:12:57", "owner": "prudti", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17915266965070598, "text": "Who’s miss matt ?", "created_at": "2025-10-14T06:55:44", "owner": "________rabinn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142528711429689, "text": "Call Fairworks 🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-14T06:42:18", "owner": "mahela_x98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070672403246455, "text": "Zacchaeus will find you the moment he starts dialling.", "created_at": "2025-10-14T06:31:39", "owner": "t_teeez", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18307386679217661, "text": "And in between all this… someone just sold the 🥐!!", "created_at": "2025-10-14T06:29:56", "owner": "sleek2006", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18082976980954584, "text": "Not remotely funny", "created_at": "2025-10-14T06:29:36", "owner": "ootenaula", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18009256313797675, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T06:19:02", "owner": "justamitoz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18534488194027180, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T06:14:15", "owner": "commando_98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010584446796650, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T06:09:10", "owner": "xxunorthodoxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134639860457856, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T06:08:58", "owner": "xxunorthodoxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064158086378373, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T06:03:12", "owner": "_juhishah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082903732998816, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-14T05:50:06", "owner": "leonardcty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543832333037995, "text": "It seems that a stalemate has been reached", "created_at": "2025-10-14T05:44:48", "owner": "freshys05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957502503868500, "text": "Indian stand off 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T05:22:25", "owner": "peter_mavr_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18289755214286829, "text": "Customers threatening to call Consumer Affairs as there's no one to take their order 🤳🏼", "created_at": "2025-10-14T05:18:32", "owner": "bhaskarmc", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17985497222884051, "text": "😂😂 bravo", "created_at": "2025-10-14T05:17:24", "owner": "xxstallion", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18150317326417036, "text": "Let's be honest. Australian immigration isn't going to do anything other then probably import the rest of his family", "created_at": "2025-10-14T05:10:38", "owner": "natehiggers110", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18108628840603629, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T05:09:34", "owner": "_a._r_u_n", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053258036300656, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T05:08:06", "owner": "shashi_cant_sing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043569953456796, "text": "Haha, that’s hilarious, tit for tat.", "created_at": "2025-10-14T04:57:21", "owner": "mandak2.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887501263366484, "text": "Love it 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T04:55:55", "owner": "ysh_rdy8", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17861347548510678, "text": "@nokiang90", "created_at": "2025-10-14T04:55:31", "owner": "latdavanh_v", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18166778170332777, "text": "😂😂😂🔥🔥🙌🙌❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-14T04:48:03", "owner": "kartiktyagi4993", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18335998432230304, "text": "I think ATO is more reliant on their staff 😂😂😂. Home affairs takes about more than 12 months to think 🤔 and ask another document 😁😁😁", "created_at": "2025-10-14T04:45:49", "owner": "mr._ravin", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18075676220154979, "text": "DEPORT.", "created_at": "2025-10-14T04:42:48", "owner": "thumos_wolf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072873421957920, "text": "What a statement on the current state of Australia's hospitality industry.", "created_at": "2025-10-14T04:32:11", "owner": "andrew_lynam", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17916953841193862, "text": "ATO means", "created_at": "2025-10-14T04:20:38", "owner": "pradeepkannan_py", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874961614425258, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T04:18:55", "owner": "nivodmenusha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041697779693819, "text": "The tax office cares more than immigration 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T04:03:57", "owner": "paul_marwick", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17977786481923227, "text": "What kind of civil war is this", "created_at": "2025-10-14T04:00:29", "owner": "gixxer_riderr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143266018439099, "text": "Good game", "created_at": "2025-10-14T03:56:36", "owner": "ti_mugen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069350054602784, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T03:55:17", "owner": "maddy_moo4829", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076772078122959, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-14T03:54:21", "owner": "simonmorgan4040", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17925025056118710, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-14T03:47:25", "owner": "jayzochen", "likes": 29}, {"id": 18098452801732279, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T03:47:08", "owner": "normalmalluboy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18089130101497263, "text": "Call Fair Work and she will be saying \"sorry sir\" every second... ❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-14T03:46:00", "owner": "lior1734", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153359983403232, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T03:38:56", "owner": "aytida_ma_i_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081742280476558, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T03:36:34", "owner": "_p_r_a_g_y_a_n_a_n_d_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081911873492602, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T03:33:16", "owner": "vancity_j", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18184146337338394, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T03:10:47", "owner": "aram_momeni", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17898042123306067, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T02:51:59", "owner": "saviri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18186444664329990, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T02:51:28", "owner": "dan_latif27", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17864483157473242, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T02:46:37", "owner": "vickyshira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043104674448364, "text": "🤣🤣💀💀", "created_at": "2025-10-14T02:45:51", "owner": "nav.1n_p", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18097815754706638, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T02:39:25", "owner": "_rtrichstealyogrill_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090606463865064, "text": "HAHAHHAAH", "created_at": "2025-10-14T02:38:14", "owner": "mxttraa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852931741557223, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T02:30:54", "owner": "richardelayo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17918017182057245, "text": "Keep your friends close, and your enemies closer 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T02:22:08", "owner": "wilson_kct", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18139754773443275, "text": "@vxdchand lg", "created_at": "2025-10-14T02:09:02", "owner": "ctrlherfire", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988251306895988, "text": "@vxdchand  lg", "created_at": "2025-10-14T02:08:34", "owner": "ctrlherfire", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018508976780428, "text": "Lovely work environment", "created_at": "2025-10-14T01:52:30", "owner": "xhumans", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17860077993514386, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T01:45:34", "owner": "karanjitkanda", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075322208132596, "text": "It's ok, my cousin is in immigration. Just DM me, get it all sought for you😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T01:34:26", "owner": "joeazza073", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028576301729710, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T01:33:17", "owner": "wahekambozz", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18074124689230863, "text": "Looks like you're at a stalemate 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T01:24:32", "owner": "lisanoothernameavailable", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944826814053237, "text": "HAHAHAHAHAHHAA", "created_at": "2025-10-14T01:22:18", "owner": "merbsandspices", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090318901874521, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T01:16:57", "owner": "pratik20pino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048840650662848, "text": "Cool know where we arent going, this racist hole", "created_at": "2025-10-14T01:14:39", "owner": "kingrat19999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130684339470960, "text": "Ato will suck anyone dry 😅irrespective of your colour or origin😅😅", "created_at": "2025-10-14T01:09:11", "owner": "fools_of_april", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18391102954135602, "text": "More scared of the ATO", "created_at": "2025-10-14T01:02:09", "owner": "redg102", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18537790585021809, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T00:58:25", "owner": "smv.style", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064128509570931, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T00:51:22", "owner": "nonecares.03", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17936535566964919, "text": "Top notch humour material 👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-14T00:50:04", "owner": "mr_nextmistake", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053663633289555, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T00:49:16", "owner": "parthm96", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070871912256712, "text": "Now that’s funny lol", "created_at": "2025-10-14T00:25:39", "owner": "walkingpalimpsest", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960368329005374, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-14T00:23:44", "owner": "lee.ahh97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069504209520226, "text": "Ok but his McLaren @quadlock shirt wins 🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-14T00:10:35", "owner": "pariserceg_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18107962609590135, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T00:09:24", "owner": "the_advent_philomath", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055421930248995, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T00:08:58", "owner": "nckiboo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062770982621874, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-13T23:58:47", "owner": "boringdevv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972452334951759, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-13T23:53:15", "owner": "findingpal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102295666715298, "text": "A phone is a weapon.", "created_at": "2025-10-13T23:36:17", "owner": "thesonicscriber", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064851467093940, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-13T23:33:43", "owner": "jerinjjoseph", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115034230541180, "text": "Tax evading cougar doesn’t get any better than that, 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-13T23:29:38", "owner": "ryan.sarav", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981758001870769, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-13T23:13:56", "owner": "ju_ono", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091645672873190, "text": "Looking at both of them, i think i’ve been to this cafe", "created_at": "2025-10-13T22:42:54", "owner": "aadityasoni16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904106482260747, "text": "Love it!!!!", "created_at": "2025-10-13T22:39:41", "owner"