", "created_at": "2025-10-13T20:11:05", "owner": "13.mehtab", "likes": 40}, {"id": 17890536816225422, "text": "ATO will win just stand down on this one", "created_at": "2025-10-13T20:10:32", "owner": "blaccitachi7778", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18145961041426523, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-13T19:50:08", "owner": "t.n.t_1f", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041321165469061, "text": "😂😂 I choked on my coffee", "created_at": "2025-10-13T19:48:55", "owner": "thatweirdgirl_666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063158669387995, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-13T19:47:02", "owner": "polynesianelectrical", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047611682358870, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-13T19:45:35", "owner": "azmpd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132010738466242, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-13T19:30:38", "owner": "grumpy.bald.man.daddy.hayer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077204555155614, "text": "As an Fellow Indian. I am not at all offended.", "created_at": "2025-10-13T19:30:36", "owner": "grumpy.bald.man.daddy.hayer", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18093053491834754, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-13T19:30:21", "owner": "grumpy.bald.man.daddy.hayer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153055363406531, "text": "So technically you would be wrong on both fronts - doing tax fraud AND harbouring illegal immigrant or working more hours than allowed.", "created_at": "2025-10-13T19:24:18", "owner": "uhjit33369", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18067236116342199, "text": "Hahaha love this , the stand off begins", "created_at": "2025-10-13T19:23:12", "owner": "ben.may.9619", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069797627260097, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-13T19:14:13", "owner": "jabakie", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17863140375491066, "text": "My first glance at the caption reads: two guns, one machete", "created_at": "2025-10-13T19:07:49", "owner": "jerrrimiah_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063093797623793, "text": "ATO means", "created_at": "2025-10-13T18:43:11", "owner": "itsme_vicky_777", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17947854678044928, "text": "No one w