{"media_id": 3768439167509457550, "shortcode": "DRML3TxEeqO", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRML3TxEeqO/", "taken_at": "2025-11-18T08:02:57", "caption": "【MUSE News】\nEmma Watson 加入牛津大學賽艇隊 妙麗英國大學生活再進化！🚣‍♀️🎓✨\n\n相信哈利波特迷，每次見到 Emma Watson 真人「高材生生活日常」都會超興奮！自從佢入讀牛津之後，真係愈讀愈投入 campus life，最近仲俾人影到佢積極參與唔同活動——直接加入英國大學入面最傳統、最英倫 vibes 嘅運動：Rowing 賽艇！🇬🇧🌊\n\n早前比賽入面，Emma 更加擔任賽艇隊嘅精神靈魂人物——Cox（舵手），坐喺船尾負責節奏、指令同策略。成個畫面完全係 Hermione 上身：冷靜掌控 + 精準判斷，氣場 MAX✨🧙‍♀️\n雖然而家佢哋隊伍嘅戰績就一般般，對手打贏後仲播《Harry Potter》主題曲「挑機」慶祝🎶😂 不過 Emma 照樣保持超好運動精神，笑住應對，超級大方又 cute 💛！\n\n一路玩賽艇一路讀書，Emma Watson 喺牛津嘅生活真係 英倫名校模式 FULL ON！📚🏆🇬🇧\n\n#EmmaWatson #Musetv #👽", "owner_username": "musetv_hk", "owner_id": "51321839334", "likes": 4798, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphSidecar", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0098_DRML3TxEeqO\\DRML3TxEeqO_20251118_080257_1.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0098_DRML3TxEeqO\\DRML3TxEeqO_20251118_080257_2.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": 17949501227921206, "text": "她超可愛", "created_at": "2025-11-20T16:41:03", "owner": "22_jennyinabottle903", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18108670786552340, "text": "咁變性人參唔參加得賽艇?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T06:04:11", "owner": "mugengmuji", "likes": 17}, {"id": 18337955527226668, "text": "好羨慕🫢", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:48:44", "owner": "coey_10.15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999179472693303, "text": "舵手？一路向左？！😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T00:41:55", "owner": "he_man_o", "likes": 12}, {"id": 17880573243333984, "text": "一路向左", "created_at": "2025-12-09T02:29:59", "owner": "waon_426", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070657364351599, "text": "同埋，唔好再播哈利波特首歌，播返迪士尼belle 首歌", "created_at": "2025-11-19T12:21:34", "owner": "dear_mm_llll", "likes": 30}, {"id": 18135157153463376, "text": "活出一個美好嘅人生👏👏👏👏\n唔好俾垃圾JK影響", "created_at": "2025-11-19T12:20:41", "owner": "dear_mm_llll", "likes": 33}, {"id": 18065595365129932, "text": "Free ride", "created_at": "2025-11-19T06:15:15", "owner": "warehouse7135", "likes": 4}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["emmawatson", "musetv"]},
{"media_id": 3741033244125602521, "shortcode": "DPq0eopCKLZ", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DPq0eopCKLZ/", "taken_at": "2025-10-11T12:35:33", "caption": "Follow to know more about Cultural diversity in UK 🇬🇧 scholarships and job opportunities. \nKabhi Socha Nhe tha before moving here 🤗 Follow for Part 2\nDesi saaray Follow kr lo for Life in UK : @dr.cerf", "owner_username": "dr.cerf", "owner_id": "65765520284", "likes": 7511, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0099_DPq0eopCKLZ\\DPq0eopCKLZ_20251011_123533.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18141088507439079, "text": "Follow for More Guys 💕", "created_at": "2025-10-18T22:34:35", "owner": "dr.cerf", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17854282191561927, "text": "Students visa + insta + restaurant = international student", "created_at": "2025-11-03T23:30:54", "owner": "ritzzyyy1", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17901238131166138, "text": "Moor market Sheffield city center 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-09T00:55:04", "owner": "shollycutie1", "likes": 21}, {"id": 17916515235214347, "text": "Our beautiful Sheffield ❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-16T18:25:15", "owner": "ghpeyman", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18086308931074664, "text": "Sheffield ❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-13T18:26:50", "owner": "shukraw", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18171466969375243, "text": "Sheffield", "created_at": "2025-11-06T13:55:36", "owner": "2ndeslash", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18514728937068164, "text": "The real of UK : United Karachi/ United Kerala. ✌️😁🤭👍👍", "created_at": "2025-11-17T00:36:48", "owner": "me_for_gtr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068073785381840, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T21:58:18", "owner": "sanam_teri_khasam", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086834195316160, "text": "Moor market", "created_at": "2025-11-19T07:16:53", "owner": "daisyluv01", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17950524192058914, "text": "😂😂😂fr", "created_at": "2025-11-20T22:26:58", "owner": "___agathokakological", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084718222971852, "text": "This is Sheffield, moor city center", "created_at": "2025-11-15T00:01:17", "owner": "aynur_el_halil", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18015682526797562, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂 I understand you .", "created_at": "2025-11-21T01:37:28", "owner": "bae__kay_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18119856031533747, "text": "Looks like sheffield moor market", "created_at": "2025-11-19T19:01:37", "owner": "farlane83", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18119106367557352, "text": "This is Sheffield right?", "created_at": "2025-12-03T12:44:33", "owner": "tysonmohana", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18111063475576398, "text": "So you’re not a foreigner in the UK but Nigerians are ??? 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-28T05:41:32", "owner": "oddguy2406", "likes": 26}, {"id": 18105206458636877, "text": "I love that song so much! I wish someone will sing it…. 😍😍", "created_at": "2025-12-05T17:03:26", "owner": "keeinah", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070749370985489, "text": "Cultural Diversity, That’s what I love about UK 🇬🇧💕", "created_at": "2025-10-11T12:59:57", "owner": "sarfarazqayyum", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18070732589599476, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-03T16:38:19", "owner": "sahidkhan_49_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063162191569268, "text": "Meeeeee🥹🥹🥹🥹", "created_at": "2025-11-15T21:28:35", "owner": "mhiepossy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17926570059117247, "text": "In my class all are Brits, americans, French, Australians and only one Asian guy is me😌", "created_at": "2025-10-26T16:33:14", "owner": "sour__av_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17849093490598362, "text": "Re-migration", "created_at": "2025-11-19T07:44:41", "owner": "justsomegeezer83", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17986897199879145, "text": "You could choose native area", "created_at": "2025-11-15T17:22:28", "owner": "ndrkkbrsf", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079054309910723, "text": "The great replacement continues", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:53:25", "owner": "fashionutopias", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18119976817544022, "text": "True story", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:51:30", "owner": "mrpotato_pv", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18413975839190389, "text": "It’s a true shame the lack of English…", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:03:06", "owner": "may__flower__08", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17930910720106428, "text": "Let's make Asia great again!!!", "created_at": "2025-10-20T11:35:56", "owner": "abidajannath27", "likes": 41}, {"id": 17974959413959128, "text": "You are a foreigner….", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:02:01", "owner": "may__flower__08", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18082461764327950, "text": "Moor market 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T14:13:57", "owner": "lif3inchains", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18125577682504901, "text": "You're foreign too🤡", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:13:47", "owner": "alll_gasss", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17981805995926119, "text": "The Patriot Act 2030 🏴󠁧󠁢󠁥󠁮󠁧󠁿", "created_at": "2025-11-26T08:54:17", "owner": "mr.diamond___", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18327246388210360, "text": "Don't refer 🇳🇵as desi ..pls we were never a desi !!", "created_at": "2025-11-19T14:40:01", "owner": "wooglyyybogglybeep", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909521347264120, "text": "India 2.0", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:39:30", "owner": "zack_amana", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18030088409562811, "text": "🇵🇰🤮", "created_at": "2025-12-09T18:32:36", "owner": "anjana_mohan345", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085475351513294, "text": "Deport him", "created_at": "2025-11-19T05:42:28", "owner": "walking.on.a.dream.au", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18298735171282243, "text": "Spot the white man", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:11:58", "owner": "sammy_p1989", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17898764625344719, "text": "Naaa fkk", "created_at": "2025-12-01T14:26:18", "owner": "its_saf42069", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095005042872052, "text": "what a nightmare", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:12:02", "owner": "hdhshusj26", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057607226280173, "text": "This makes up for all the rapes and terrorism", "created_at": "2025-11-12T16:12:37", "owner": "stif.meister7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084857321058729, "text": "Mix of 🇧🇩, 🇮🇳, 🇳🇵, 🇵🇰, 🇬🇧, 🇰🇿", "created_at": "2025-11-02T22:41:03", "owner": "ssajeda._0", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18081758602848287, "text": "This happened because the university’s here don’t mix indian, nepali, Bangladeshi & pakistani people with other nationalities", "created_at": "2025-11-02T10:40:10", "owner": "snowy.cato", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18375914488197865, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-02T04:22:59", "owner": "boxer_and_yogini", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094091296885636, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-02T12:40:24", "owner": "sanahidbd", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18046640954678492, "text": "Sheffield", "created_at": "2025-11-02T17:33:32", "owner": "waqar_ahmad_takal", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18382835701199594, "text": "Absolutely true in my class 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-02T22:28:22", "owner": "arshadmalik8445", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074091596188932, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-03T00:50:51", "owner": "bas_bhai_theeky", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18103782133565044, "text": "Is cheez ke liye mene interview dia tha ke mujhe multicultural society me Parhna hai 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-03T19:59:00", "owner": "sheesh.zoyaa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17907160380126848, "text": "😅🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-05T07:32:37", "owner": "fahim.anayet", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094259563875055, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-05T10:29:05", "owner": "_umar798", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084432280826389, "text": "I have Hong Kong, Indian Pakistani Nepali Bulgarian Nigerian Ghana and Moldova", "created_at": "2025-11-05T21:56:16", "owner": "tahir_malik_786", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100267105667430, "text": "the moor Sheffield", "created_at": "2025-11-06T01:14:33", "owner": "chriskong123", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17897977467335449, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-06T02:25:58", "owner": "iarlahsib428", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064304783145095, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-06T13:22:19", "owner": "sabirali.khalil", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17922712842174122, "text": "😂moor market", "created_at": "2025-11-01T12:30:16", "owner": "naseeb.exe", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18104670427718893, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-06T17:50:27", "owner": "doct_melody", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18542365390019186, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-07T00:59:50", "owner": "shristichand75", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18295394977281619, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-07T04:23:53", "owner": "drn.dorchi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18380759131195879, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-07T13:02:54", "owner": "ramo_razal", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078266159146752, "text": "@i_am_amal_prasad", "created_at": "2025-11-08T02:42:51", "owner": "nishan_ahammed", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17909352978252947, "text": "🤣🤣😂", "created_at": "2025-11-08T08:16:09", "owner": "aman_pasrlai", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096774175801237, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-08T09:59:28", "owner": "advayishaqureshi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18145998808433770, "text": "Growing up in the uk it’s not kl to study or be interested in things like history now thus meaning universities will have to make up their fees from international students which seems to benefit the country in the long run", "created_at": "2025-11-09T10:35:23", "owner": "gutss_bsm", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17989758566730705, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-11T08:55:05", "owner": "tuliyeasmin_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18029116451547805, "text": "Bhai for real", "created_at": "2025-11-10T21:58:38", "owner": "spamhaivroo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18245218417291753, "text": "Sheffield doesn’t want to hear this poo!", "created_at": "2025-11-13T16:26:56", "owner": "furnthehoff", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18096228529687568, "text": "So true i was depressed on the first day seeing I spent triple the amount just to end up in a classroom filled with desis", "created_at": "2025-10-15T19:34:48", "owner": "_subhanjon_goswami", "likes": 180}, {"id": 18542115403059966, "text": "I don't have a single classmate from india Pakistan or Bangladesh almost all are either from Uk or Europe ... some are from other countries.", "created_at": "2025-10-19T12:15:42", "owner": "humza18_", "likes": 22}, {"id": 18111810247502595, "text": "Real😂", "created_at": "2025-10-31T15:50:32", "owner": "mominawasimm", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17892521664347186, "text": "No i have a Scottish,British,American,Nigerian,Pakistan,Indian,Bangladesh,Chinese,Japanese, \nMalaysia", "created_at": "2025-10-16T03:27:28", "owner": "iamsamrexnn", "likes": 47}, {"id": 18376110667195132, "text": "Kisi achi university jana tha na.", "created_at": "2025-10-20T18:16:31", "owner": "ahtshmshyk", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18075582317179814, "text": "Jealous???", "created_at": "2025-11-05T07:35:56", "owner": "renewedbenjamin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18050233388358043, "text": "Btw bakwas singing", "created_at": "2025-11-05T13:35:56", "owner": "erkalp123", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086340748788264, "text": "True", "created_at": "2025-11-07T06:58:28", "owner": "h_abid_p", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18108654421581006, "text": "That one Nigerian smarter than us tho @demilade_p 🙌🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-15T20:20:32", "owner": "impaarth_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17864122554498166, "text": "Lol so much related😂", "created_at": "2025-10-30T13:49:52", "owner": "pranjiilaaa.26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027637781752522, "text": "Fucking true 😂😂😂 i have only one Nigerian girl and all others are from Nepal, India and Pakistan 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-25T15:45:56", "owner": "joginder_chaudhary", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17933920670980616, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-27T23:31:24", "owner": "_.nys___", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18016225625790837, "text": "Guys we should all go back to south asia and help our countries 😍", "created_at": "2025-10-22T07:40:39", "owner": "mrjamesvanoli", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17864938293413815, "text": "Because the courses you chose is only designed for desi people British students have different courses and classes and you can’t be in those classes without A levels or something", "created_at": "2025-10-19T22:30:58", "owner": "peace_makers_planet", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18361809070094571, "text": "This is how universities designed the courses!", "created_at": "2025-10-31T01:35:07", "owner": "ar_grif", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18131526616474851, "text": "Desi is a hindustani pagan term nothing to do with Pakistan and India", "created_at": "2025-10-31T03:34:04", "owner": "lonestranger22", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18112530220560192, "text": "Haiyaaa😂", "created_at": "2025-10-19T22:47:19", "owner": "emma_lama22", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100840393642891, "text": "Omgg foreigner Nigerian classmate so true 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-16T19:18:55", "owner": "agirlfromkashmir", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17979691565923853, "text": "@njayman.sh", "created_at": "2025-10-16T17:55:00", "owner": "xoa_nvm", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18321686629241723, "text": "Itna sach nahi boolna tha 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-14T17:22:39", "owner": "srivastavaaman25july", "likes": 38}, {"id": 18143010310386692, "text": "true ..i wanted my classmates to be from europe uk latin america 😂😂but at the moment i all my classmates are from india pakistani bangladesh nd nepal", "created_at": "2025-10-22T15:34:39", "owner": "nxv_deep_007", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18505527040069990, "text": "Can't relate I'm like the only indian in the entire department  in france", "created_at": "2025-10-20T20:55:31", "owner": "shaiva_muthaiya", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18172091452367351, "text": "@dr_abdul_samad2  hum tou bs 2 e thy desi baki koi ni dekh ly level apna", "created_at": "2025-10-30T22:48:36", "owner": "life_with_abdaaal", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17858095164479073, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-10-30T18:19:27", "owner": "surender_donthamalla", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18379796092179976, "text": "In my class everyone is from India, Africa, Middle East or Caribbean, just me from Argentina a polish guy, a Portuguese and a guy from Ecuador", "created_at": "2025-10-30T15:59:55", "owner": "jascas_2406", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18136814629470070, "text": "English cities are no longer English anymore.\nFull of alienating foreigners with zero English ancestral roots. \nMulticulturalism, a one way traffic of mass immigration into European nations but never the other way in Asian countries.", "created_at": "2025-12-13T13:38:29", "owner": "haakon5055", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875620606452684, "text": "Its good see our people. Don't know why people hate their own people", "created_at": "2025-12-13T03:42:11", "owner": "leodsouza9i", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048322859438127, "text": "Criminals and fake students", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:57:29", "owner": "tazz4501", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075176336249871, "text": "Fsiled society", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:15:49", "owner": "casisbroke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102132037679906, "text": "The british should have forcefully isolated the south \"asians\" from the rest of the world", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:45:39", "owner": "13km798", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928117933134098, "text": "Inky pinky pookey daddy bought a donkey 🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:05:56", "owner": "joshhughes96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159094105392231, "text": "If all cultures are equal, then cannibalism is just a matter of culinary taste . Worshipping a PEDOPHILE is always a massive red flag", "created_at": "2025-11-23T10:37:54", "owner": "ukpearson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094726870880378, "text": "Loved the way this guy changed his pose after watching being filmed. Hope this reel reaches him so he can see that he went viral.", "created_at": "2025-11-19T14:49:01", "owner": "dr.cerf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074239136265292, "text": "The racist colonisers taking over our country need to be driven out. This poison needs to go.", "created_at": "2025-11-16T12:55:06", "owner": "gnrg72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107254096626848, "text": "Shithole 😂 guaranteed  the busker has not been too the council too get a permit.  The japenese shop is run by Albanians too money launder and the nigerians are in class too live in the uk then rape white women at night time", "created_at": "2025-11-16T09:20:18", "owner": "terencebrown2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093972277854818, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T21:10:12", "owner": "unknown_74910", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853063765571931, "text": "Madarchod bheenkh hee maang tu", "created_at": "2025-11-09T07:06:48", "owner": "mazid_mendesarmyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976013379949038, "text": "Na all Chinese bro", "created_at": "2025-11-08T11:40:49", "owner": "reganye008", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062930750408086, "text": "The sooner this lunacy stops the faster we can begin the healing process", "created_at": "2025-11-07T13:39:20", "owner": "bananahammock119", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18067402583079927, "text": "Wasted🙂🤌🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-03T00:08:38", "owner": "shebzho", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085813162944487, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-02T10:38:34", "owner": "snowy.cato", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865951345415268, "text": "U r on stupid peeples uni 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-01T02:21:14", "owner": "billie8g", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18131503021466942, "text": "What happen england likes India so mess!! 😮", "created_at": "2025-11-01T02:18:51", "owner": "billie8g", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18312852853219152, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-30T01:56:53", "owner": "chowdhury_giiti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876814291427730, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-29T18:52:05", "owner": "evvolving_man", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066406685593436, "text": "Honestly, depends on the university you choose:)", "created_at": "2025-10-24T18:01:55", "owner": "tanuja_sunkaraa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073306535232322, "text": "Caper", "created_at": "2025-10-24T13:03:16", "owner": "wilwatikta1994", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18044774414691599, "text": "real 🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-24T09:42:36", "owner": "simplesolomoon", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18031199255527003, "text": "Hello Japan 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T21:39:07", "owner": "reubenpopoola", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18086310298763757, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T17:43:30", "owner": "tasi.kongcha", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047456333672664, "text": "Literally all (95%) my classmates are Indians and I can tell u, it’s a thorn in d flesh 😏", "created_at": "2025-10-23T03:06:00", "owner": "iam_therock_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085784140777918, "text": "Bpp university 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T21:49:45", "owner": "hassan_nawaz009", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075457964129653, "text": "😂😂😂😂 second that", "created_at": "2025-10-21T14:47:25", "owner": "nahlqureshi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18023068667584867, "text": "Invasion", "created_at": "2025-10-20T17:04:55", "owner": "mr.willy_t3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18101318065628976, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-20T16:47:03", "owner": "masaeid003", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17917924716191843, "text": "In my case it totally opposite I got only two British in my class", "created_at": "2025-10-19T21:43:53", "owner": "bushra.khan.796", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18023843843780739, "text": "Actually in my courses we don't even have black people😢It's just us south Asians😅😥I was actually disappointed", "created_at": "2025-10-19T20:42:07", "owner": "sandu1810", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053448341310524, "text": "😂😂tf", "created_at": "2025-10-19T19:38:15", "owner": "sxhiru", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17925857490018223, "text": "@_nmm29_", "created_at": "2025-10-19T17:34:29", "owner": "muhammad_abubakar_raja", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17898392376300241, "text": "save 🇬🇧🏴󠁧󠁢󠁥󠁮󠁧󠁿", "created_at": "2025-10-19T16:45:00", "owner": "lightlysaltedchip_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18168531592374643, "text": "Ha maru Sheffield ha", "created_at": "2025-10-19T16:10:18", "owner": "27varunn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17922437193036912, "text": "Trueee", "created_at": "2025-10-19T15:29:43", "owner": "yashraj_singh_yadav", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18424820656105444, "text": "@__tahsan___", "created_at": "2025-10-19T10:08:46", "owner": "_its._.ijjjtaba", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18389692615124370, "text": "Meri class me bhi majority Indian he but other people are from carribean turkey China srilanka burma", "created_at": "2025-10-19T09:38:03", "owner": "utkarshmp09", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17975119808948957, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-19T06:45:14", "owner": "vaishali_vaidya14", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18130937434465061, "text": "Depends on the university and the course. If you are going there only for visa then you probably end up in a useless course like IBM in a useless college.", "created_at": "2025-10-19T06:39:21", "owner": "insta_krishna07", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18177457666357170, "text": "nah rarelyyy any gora pakoras these days 🥲", "created_at": "2025-10-19T05:04:24", "owner": "marium_20x", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17946770651922455, "text": "💯", "created_at": "2025-10-18T22:22:12", "owner": "fatematuz_johara", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18390547090131827, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-18T17:48:55", "owner": "bd.insiders", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18296034688249234, "text": "Nepalese aren’t desi 😂 we aren’t desi wtf 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-18T11:50:57", "owner": "unknownbrainm", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18103346722617076, "text": "Sheffield ❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-18T11:21:41", "owner": "adeola.oyebowale", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17885498694385745, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-18T08:37:58", "owner": "its_pp__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047654846355984, "text": "Fortunately I had classmates from 19 countries...😍", "created_at": "2025-10-18T07:47:35", "owner": "jitheshliji", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18028549916730794, "text": "Not really true in my case but my friends from other faculties can attest to this 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T23:25:45", "owner": "darth.hassan_thewise", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17927687601125904, "text": "Sheffield City Centre 🩵", "created_at": "2025-10-17T21:05:29", "owner": "_dinesphere", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075184424133602, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T19:55:04", "owner": "beejay_lamar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094803175693659, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T19:26:13", "own