{"media_id": 3776512302258940920, "shortcode": "DRo3e4aCWv4", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRo3e4aCWv4/", "taken_at": "2025-11-29T11:22:50", "caption": "29 NOV 25\n誇部門聯合簡報會\n整合", "owner_username": "newhkclub", "owner_id": "53854275000", "likes": 16547, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphSidecar", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0101_DRo3e4aCWv4\\DRo3e4aCWv4_20251129_112250_1.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0101_DRo3e4aCWv4\\DRo3e4aCWv4_20251129_112250_2.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0101_DRo3e4aCWv4\\DRo3e4aCWv4_20251129_112250_3.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0101_DRo3e4aCWv4\\DRo3e4aCWv4_20251129_112250_4.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0101_DRo3e4aCWv4\\DRo3e4aCWv4_20251129_112250_5.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": 17902847673162127, "text": "本専頁全力支持行政長官帶領特區政府依法施政", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:54:12", "owner": "newhkclub", "likes": 87}, {"id": 17877033243351493, "text": "第2張圖有少少亂⋯第一下以為84+44係128同150之間overlap，但見到128=84+44⋯如果係overlap嘅話，exclusive係上面嗰部分就會係0⋯", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:41:41", "owner": "henrik.hyc", "likes": 159}, {"id": 18075370043185505, "text": "8+3+1(國安）", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:48:12", "owner": "achi_1107photo", "likes": 235}, {"id": 18121445656472833, "text": "辛苦曬做整合出post🙌 寫錯咗個字，應該係「跨」部門", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:30:12", "owner": "thisislws", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17921849328054301, "text": "南無阿彌陀佛", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:47:59", "owner": "mathewng8", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17875796772445179, "text": "被捕人數 + 1 （煽動）", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:23:03", "owner": "thchung53", "likes": 677}, {"id": 18143377852452346, "text": "又想學多次南丫海難咁全部官員無人需要負上責任啊？又要我地自己追查真相啊7.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:16:36", "owner": "nok_0926", "likes": 56}, {"id": 18079560677144729, "text": "請繼續跟進😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:25:10", "owner": "hk_bxb", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17867931684494604, "text": "国安拉學生未計", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:50:42", "owner": "kickasstype", "likes": 26}, {"id": 17867899554483759, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:44:48", "owner": "funkau530", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845239897606557, "text": "8+3+1", "created_at": "2025-11-30T13:27:28", "owner": "im_himlee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099341125841051, "text": "張珊珊滅藍大使！👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:35:38", "owner": "hungpurplewong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982686681927145, "text": "依家香港仲黑暗過大陸", "created_at": "2025-12-01T06:36:06", "owner": "jodiechubby", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18081830123473607, "text": "香港無左問責制好耐啦", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:40:47", "owner": "_rmeic_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984421188760570, "text": "無公道，不安息！", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:50:52", "owner": "siusiucody", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18155579299413724, "text": "唔好意思差開話題 你哋啲infograph好靚", "created_at": "2025-11-30T10:51:53", "owner": "goodest.monkey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953813281042899, "text": "尋求真相都要拉乜撚嘢世界？😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-30T19:50:36", "owner": "toshi.ng.10", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18119925964547826, "text": "點解唔派多d心理輔導員", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:49:02", "owner": "nelson.lhf", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17984316227763920, "text": "係8+3+1", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:35:18", "owner": "tin.sora", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084936674288221, "text": "大陸出現呢啲災難 啲官員免晒職喇", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:19:13", "owner": "mugengmuji", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085633099832781, "text": "點解提問就係煽動？？？", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:39:28", "owner": "eddie_skylines", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861296716544706, "text": "睇住啲數字好恐怖", "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:54:46", "owner": "soniclee1000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903402136166380, "text": "呢方面香港真係威盡國際", "created_at": "2025-12-04T07:23:14", "owner": "bearbearchaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304972966249206, "text": "到而家都仲未有官員問責下台😤", "created_at": "2025-12-07T08:02:12", "owner": "harrison_gu_y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055222481330427, "text": "第一張圖....遠睇同宜家官員的咀臉好似", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:35:04", "owner": "marcowong747", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089235766762999, "text": "0", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:24:34", "owner": "hahahalalalafafafa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090144214764743, "text": "上任業主委員會主席拉左未 仲有個收左著數幫手推既區議員", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:19:55", "owner": "0ktng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081866744471927, "text": "發生什麼了", "created_at": "2025-12-01T12:07:51", "owner": "ru._.1000123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888569209262122, "text": "中國香港 不意外", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:57:21", "owner": "osakaslowlife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973404801801615, "text": "官唔會錯，錯就錯在你做唔到官", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:10:05", "owner": "wahwah8878", "likes": 31}, {"id": 18330960349240699, "text": "想殺人唔使坐監，入政府啦！入政府啱㗎喇！唯一出路呀，殺人放火咩事都冇呀🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:17:20", "owner": "tonyhung112", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030882788546684, "text": "Please sign new petition: https://c.org/zj97nnbgnN", "created_at": "2025-11-30T09:52:06", "owner": "letshop_hermes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18291204205276832, "text": "因為政府監管不力，幾多人活活被燒死😢，特首理應下台", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:30:15", "owner": "bryanwong1023", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
