{"media_id": 3767916743214556035, "shortcode": "DRKVFCOjOOD", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRKVFCOjOOD/", "taken_at": "2025-11-17T14:44:59", "caption": "I like what I like. don’t blame me!\n\n#mymun #muncommand #debatebetter #ModelUN #ToTheMUN #unitednations #lovetriangle #modelunitednations #MUN", "owner_username": "mymunofficial", "owner_id": "5681849002", "likes": 7633, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphImage", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0103_DRKVFCOjOOD\\DRKVFCOjOOD_20251117_144459.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": "18084366836316709", "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-17T20:21:42", "owner": "3333_gt", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18087193765787747", "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-11-17T17:42:16", "owner": "lennart_bruns", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18144459916452563", "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:16:59", "owner": "sotvoldiyev_570", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17932486785121081", "text": "The holy trinity! 🙏 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:26:48", "owner": "wimunsecretariat", "likes": 2}, {"id": "18048609641391278", "text": "So real!", "created_at": "2025-11-23T13:58:52", "owner": "society_d_redquill", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18368386300088082", "text": "Mâine", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:23:05", "owner": "robert_lazarr", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18329258695244951", "text": "Heavy on the coffee", "created_at": "2025-11-17T15:27:25", "owner": "lando_pando1", "likes": 2}, {"id": "17922596577190627", "text": "Fr fr", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:02:26", "owner": "anuwithbrainissue", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18075531242333107", "text": "Every MUN has those 3", "created_at": "2025-11-17T14:48:31", "owner": "modeldiplomat", "likes": 7}, {"id": "17864393964514038", "text": "😍😍😍😍👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-18T12:50:47", "owner": "ldr_pg", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["mymun", "muncommand", "debatebetter", "modelun", "tothemun", "unitednations", "lovetriangle", "modelunitednations", "mun"]},
{"media_id": 3762491276496294618, "shortcode": "DQ3DeGmEVLa", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DQ3DeGmEVLa/", "taken_at": "2025-11-10T03:06:08", "caption": "⬇️The idea of a 18-year-old choosing their major *for the rest of their life* is… somewhat ridiculous, don’t you think?\n\nIf you feel like your major is draining you — you’re not alone.\n\nEntering my undergrad, I decided to go to law school. At first, law felt so right:\n❤️‍🔥 truly what interests me\n📝 aligns with my strengths\n🫂 helps people\n💸 lucrative long-term\n\nBut in a year everything changed…\nWhen job search started.\n\nThat’s when I felt the downsides:\n🚫 I’m in undergrad and can’t work in the field yet\n💰 Law school = *major* debt\n⏳ 5 more years until a full-time paycheck\n📚 LSAT prep + apps = expensive\n\nAnd it’s a stretch.\n\nThis made me question everything.\n\nAnd I think I’ll still pursue law — but I’m also searching for ways to pivot — just in case the downsides will start to weight on too much.\n\n🎓 Anyone else rethinking their path lately? I’d love to hear your story too.\n\nI started this blog to be honest about the parts of student life we don’t always talk about. No “looking back” wisdom — just the things I don’t hear people say out loud.\n\n#university #student #studygram #studywithme #academia #prelaw #uoft #lawschool #lsat #universitymajors #universitystudent #undergraduate", "owner_username": "academia.diaries", "owner_id": "10507410904", "likes": 185501, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0104_DQ3DeGmEVLa\\DQ3DeGmEVLa_20251110_030608.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18155957740365115, "text": "18 year olds used to lead armies and revolutions....", "created_at": "2025-11-12T01:29:25", "owner": "legally.lvs", "likes": 5444}, {"id": 17939587236091736, "text": "pov ur doing cs", "created_at": "2025-11-10T05:16:41", "owner": "ananyamadane", "likes": 3027}, {"id": 18000806735681828, "text": "learning is so much fun, school is not", "created_at": "2025-11-10T20:46:25", "owner": "dsr__15", "likes": 16006}, {"id": 17888131566384072, "text": "Best advice - pick a hobby that could become a career and you really love. That way your building 2 careers simultaneously so if you burn out from the corporate works you have a fallback plan", "created_at": "2025-11-11T11:34:00", "owner": "ayla.mollen", "likes": 2366}, {"id": 18086111368803887, "text": "This is so funny aww you have to write a paper so hard like huh", "created_at": "2025-11-12T14:29:25", "owner": "tomas_sosin", "likes": 301}, {"id": 18083952079997620, "text": "Marketing is draining me sm! I wish I chose a different major. :(", "created_at": "2025-11-12T11:46:23", "owner": "esratreads", "likes": 17}, {"id": 17917297236207759, "text": "Felt that with econ lol. Especially as it got more mathy", "created_at": "2025-11-10T16:04:12", "owner": "mia.miaroo", "likes": 193}, {"id": 17990239469902927, "text": "its really not that deep", "created_at": "2025-11-20T18:19:19", "owner": "jonas.hrdtt", "likes": 55}, {"id": 17945732430060203, "text": "POV:you took mechanical engineering", "created_at": "2025-11-10T18:00:19", "owner": "this_tea12", "likes": 1027}, {"id": 18545903158012933, "text": "Ahahahahahahahahailostmyhairhahahahahahahahhaiambaldnowhahahahahahahah", "created_at": "2025-11-20T14:09:13", "owner": "william_az_", "likes": 364}, {"id": 17866337103482844, "text": "Literally balding from Aerospace engineering😢", "created_at": "2025-11-11T16:56:02", "owner": "cpt_mehdi", "likes": 1096}, {"id": 17859747453538366, "text": "Tough time don’t last tough people do , Keep going everyone it’s gonna be alright🫶", "created_at": "2025-11-11T12:31:06", "owner": "aditya_mjj", "likes": 81}, {"id": 17954215941021605, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:37:27", "owner": "jorgan_von_strangle6", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18214297864312809, "text": "I kind of feel like this right now. I’m a freshman in college and I’m close to finishing my first semester. I haven’t gone to any parties or really any outgoing with friends mostly because I kind of haven’t really made friends here? Like I have classmates who I can consider friends, but I don’t talk to anyone outside of class besides my roommate who just so happens to be in the same major as me. But I’ve just been so stressed with schoolwork and assignments that I’ve literally had little to no time to do anything 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-16T09:45:06", "owner": "violetmae.becrazy", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18544742650000270, "text": "so true, same w psychology but I love it lol 😔 all the best tho :)", "created_at": "2025-11-10T19:11:38", "owner": "validcrashout.__", "likes": 24}, {"id": 17905725438269134, "text": "You can do it bro", "created_at": "2025-11-11T17:08:37", "owner": "rodel.exalted", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17898843417342551, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:51:41", "owner": "zachery_stanley3", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18029531063741830, "text": "This is what studying physics did to me", "created_at": "2025-11-11T20:43:43", "owner": "codingmermaid.ai", "likes": 106}, {"id": 17842038234624834, "text": "I went to college for two years and felt myself drain every day until I got my final test grade back. I had passed all my classes and I snapped, I unenrolled that summer and will never go back.", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:59:02", "owner": "marion_walker_pr", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18076351774950649, "text": "I’m at a point in my life where I feel genuinely lost. I know I’m good at math, enjoy science, love history, and can tolerate writing (though I like poetry). I’m also passionate about music, photography, cooking, acting, and sports. It often feels like I could be good at almost anything if I had the time to practice.\nBut now, at 20 and more than halfway through my History Pre-Law degree, nothing has truly called to me. I’ve never felt real conviction about my future. I chose history as a flexible foundation, yet everything seems to push me toward teaching, and the pay does not match the lifestyle or hobbies I care about. Even though I’d love to build a career around a passion, I’m not sure I could reach financial stability fast enough.\nSwitching paths into something like engineering or medicine feels too costly in both time and money. It is hard not to envy people who seemed to know their path in high school and got a head start because of that clarity.\nI still feel behind my peers. I worry I’ll end up in debt, unhappy with where I land, or unable to improve quickly enough. All of this leaves me unsure of what to do next. That uncertainty keeps me stuck while everyone else seems to move forward. My mind is cluttered with stress and distractions, which makes it hard to take meaningful steps or seek help. I procrastinate decisions because I’m scared I’ll choose wrong, and life is not a video game with save files.\nSometimes I worry I’ll never feel fulfilled, or that I’m taking up space without moving forward. In those moments, I don’t know who to talk to or whether the effort I put in is even worth it. I feel stuck.", "created_at": "2025-11-14T04:00:13", "owner": "eltonmartensz", "likes": 39}, {"id": 18068365235524225, "text": "Architectural engineering 👀👀👀👀", "created_at": "2025-11-10T21:32:25", "owner": "doll.in.blue", "likes": 82}, {"id": 17860252329542653, "text": "Supercell ID?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:17:33", "owner": "dhrv.5kr_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17903849286289154, "text": "Bro….. you showed like three 2 second clips.. bruh attention seeking maxima", "created_at": "2025-11-20T01:53:50", "owner": "zach.jumper", "likes": 28}, {"id": 18079926805882134, "text": "omg don’t scare me, im a senior in hs and my plan is to go to law school", "created_at": "2025-11-13T13:33:47", "owner": "yesdarlingv", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17987304116875303, "text": "love seeing people being like oh 18 years old used too like buddy back then it was affordable to buy a house now it cost my life, in ten years a 200k now gets offers for 500k in a random neighborhood its a standard 2 story house", "created_at": "2025-12-01T05:16:59", "owner": "nightmare_ghost57", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18548814037046873, "text": "I had to chose at 16😭", "created_at": "2025-11-11T10:35:27", "owner": "_.pvich._", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18078257657323996, "text": "Have you tried alcohol and cigarettes", "created_at": "2025-11-17T23:35:00", "owner": "sean_is_ok_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18108197062615371, "text": "I'm pretty new to college (sophomore year) so I won't say too much. But what I have been by my piers is that eventually eventually everyone gets burnt-out with the school work. But if this is truly your passion, and you can persevere through the burn-out, the work is where it gets enjoyable again and where your passion for your major reignite. That's what I've been told.", "created_at": "2025-11-11T18:53:42", "owner": "abramgrimsley", "likes": 48}, {"id": 18074355938193967, "text": "before and before", "created_at": "2025-11-11T07:38:30", "owner": "clankerhater12hater", "likes": 13}, {"id": 17936295989982109, "text": "Cutting hair short is so real.....", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:30:39", "owner": "eshuuu__prsd___19.9", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17865797745508024, "text": "this is so real", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:47:01", "owner": "rainmoriah", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17959846547867474, "text": "It's scary that i can relate", "created_at": "2025-11-13T17:17:58", "owner": "prakritichakraborty_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18133797721471649, "text": "After I do hw for electrical engineering I’m looking at how to apply it to another concept. It depends on how much you love what you’re doing.I am up at 3:40 doing multi variable calculus and I love it!", "created_at": "2025-11-12T08:34:52", "owner": "adrian.gallegos.ee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18000284441684405, "text": "I studied international law for 3 weeks but I feel i was gaslighting myself into wanting to cause what I really wanted to study was film (artists are broke) and I saw it as a way to help people. But all the injustices in the world made me realise international laws were just suggestions and theres nothing I could really do. I left and didnt look back that schools wasnt even high ranking and asking me for 15000€ a year (very big amount in europe)", "created_at": "2025-11-19T17:33:26", "owner": "mushroom_dweller", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18092019115926341, "text": "What about a 16 years old choosing their 🫂💔", "created_at": "2025-12-02T15:32:34", "owner": "llleeennn.k", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060153251248981, "text": "I’m a sophomore in college and this semester I switched my major from zoology to American Sign Language. I have no regrets.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:07:50", "owner": "orion_the.star", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18329573449211550, "text": "I'm sixteen and started college two months ago (I started schooling quite early), and I'm constantly doubting if I made correct decision while choosing my major, this constant thought literally makes me numb sometimes, can I get some advice from people here with experience?", "created_at": "2025-11-18T18:49:41", "owner": "just_let_me_readd", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18066153929166415, "text": "Plenty of life seems left, could be drained more. Keep on until it does.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T00:49:43", "owner": "dhaliwal__prabh_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18117789790546291, "text": "We saw how happy you were for passing study and learn what you chose and you will find happiness. But now imagine all the men that went through the same thing you did while also being the providers and fathers everyone hates nowadays.", "created_at": "2025-11-17T20:41:36", "owner": "soleasm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915188902227853, "text": "Feeling this as of late my friend", "created_at": "2025-11-17T21:22:57", "owner": "griffy_t03", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090349498745124, "text": "Education would be SOOOO fun if school didnt 3xist", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:29:42", "owner": "kiaan_sharma147", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17875474986349920, "text": "Electronic engineering 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-11T10:03:55", "owner": "ahmed_far_away", "likes": 28}, {"id": 18383728195178976, "text": "You have some beautiful eyes", "created_at": "2025-11-11T04:56:54", "owner": "emilymartini72408", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18056819825280172, "text": "chemistry🤮", "created_at": "2025-11-15T05:31:20", "owner": "utsavluthra", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18046029410457126, "text": "Still 10/10", "created_at": "2025-11-11T10:30:04", "owner": "j.lattyar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17844691401615443, "text": "So is this a sign of saying law isn't good?", "created_at": "2025-11-21T10:05:43", "owner": "bae.of.memes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102865081710166, "text": "Yea if this is your version of being drained god help us", "created_at": "2025-11-17T18:36:35", "owner": "mandus_monarch", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17893537245222934, "text": "Engineering 🥲", "created_at": "2025-11-17T22:31:54", "owner": "anton.dey11", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18213088033308666, "text": "Architecture be like…", "created_at": "2025-11-11T05:52:24", "owner": "_henry_jk", "likes": 22}, {"id": 18073840382256298, "text": "rich white girls feeling 1% of the struggle the average person goes through", "created_at": "2025-11-19T08:35:19", "owner": "systemblow3r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293602033258663, "text": "I think it's opposite for me?", "created_at": "2025-11-11T03:43:11", "owner": "akmalvna_j_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889315105379591, "text": "you just... cut your hair??", "created_at": "2025-11-18T20:20:37", "owner": "mayannaise77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18319244608216489, "text": "Think of the pay", "created_at": "2025-11-17T17:08:20", "owner": "your_friendly_local_terrorist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093229504854582, "text": "I had to choose my major as a sophomore in high school I hope I made the right choice 😪", "created_at": "2025-11-11T14:24:49", "owner": "gigi_dacosta", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18077384228137364, "text": "Let me guess medicine?", "created_at": "2025-11-12T14:57:39", "owner": "pavly_ezzatt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18045551714440547, "text": "Chemistry wasn't the problem, exams and CGPA were.", "created_at": "2025-11-11T17:09:50", "owner": "vx.roselle.93", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18031928867735146, "text": "She cuts her hair, and she became that one girl no one can get🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-11T17:56:24", "owner": "anas.bada", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18065370095130309, "text": "@n_nemy__ @_sinthiya_nikita_ @__j_a_r_i_n__  taak hoye jabo", "created_at": "2025-11-12T15:36:11", "owner": "fabliha_raisa", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18081591194085748, "text": "How's it going now though? You know if the school burns down you can still get a free degree right? Just in case...", "created_at": "2025-11-11T23:44:39", "owner": "crazyvas1190", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030817007733998, "text": "Still in high school and I'm 110% sure on aerospace engineering.u know,coz it's unethical and legal,and cashy and my passion.WDYM changing decisions,u hear ur whole school life to decide.so,I DON'T EXPECT TO RELATE TO THIS", "created_at": "2025-11-11T17:15:16", "owner": "vexnon_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18035026820721555, "text": "Can relate", "created_at": "2025-11-10T18:18:43", "owner": "guido_marzetti", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17978987525778552, "text": "Been there. I am gonna follow you.", "created_at": "2025-11-11T15:32:37", "owner": "spandan.94", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086727130940592, "text": "it is not for the weak thats for sure", "created_at": "2025-11-11T04:18:38", "owner": "david.fernando.3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18109682074614825, "text": "Day one of studying quantum mechanics! I'm so excited!", "created_at": "2025-12-13T07:43:42", "owner": "new._.violet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865821193518323, "text": "Try majoring in both electrical and mechanical at the same time😭💔💔", "created_at": "2025-12-11T16:54:42", "owner": "khawliiiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087769849985300, "text": "Been there, took physics and I don’t even do basic calculus 😆😭", "created_at": "2025-12-11T01:30:02", "owner": "sphialsh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122061913471350, "text": "I feel you", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:48:19", "owner": "nic.cardos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864125296538076, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:21:46", "owner": "atharva_0_0_7_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305827138271903, "text": "When I have this fucking degree I'll be so back", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:41:46", "owner": "henrik.mader", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906085369292936, "text": "U dont have to do it, lol. U are building your own prison inside of a prison.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:24:52", "owner": "piano_koen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060753677265061, "text": "I love my major and chosen field but goddamn every semester drains the life out of me", "created_at": "2025-12-09T01:12:22", "owner": "dreamibelle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301467886281724, "text": "It’s about not losing the big picture", "created_at": "2025-12-08T06:07:56", "owner": "theocmelvin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101729818688357, "text": "She still looks...... lively.....MOOOOOOREEEE", "created_at": "2025-12-07T19:50:15", "owner": "lugal_glyndr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113132152606794, "text": "DO NOT TAKE CS", "created_at": "2025-12-07T18:33:32", "owner": "yasminf02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087604753972853, "text": "والله your major هذا ما يستحي حسبي الله", "created_at": "2025-12-07T15:13:41", "owner": "0x.neo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540765157053756, "text": "U look like Donna from Twin Peaks", "created_at": "2025-12-07T06:15:12", "owner": "angelinahandris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903143587314621, "text": "Started med clg at 17 ...I'm 21 as well as 29 how can I explain💀", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:56:29", "owner": "loboz_pvt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18333319948208256, "text": "I started getting forehead wrinkles at 14 bro", "created_at": "2025-12-07T00:07:22", "owner": "connor.kyle.96387", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539152303042429, "text": "Whats worse is when our parents doesnt give a shit", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:37:15", "owner": "rifkyzena", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933678223109528, "text": "Try physics", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:43:33", "owner": "gianmanesis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944740876073856, "text": "I feel you!", "created_at": "2025-12-05T17:03:33", "owner": "kuchkaamhaikya_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926579938038778, "text": "you were beautiful before and you’re beautiful now", "created_at": "2025-12-05T16:56:44", "owner": "mbev11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164836996354333, "text": "You cut a hair strand. Cringe", "created_at": "2025-12-05T14:18:21", "owner": "etapafinalapw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941695008962228, "text": "I had to choose at 16 which sucked(I chose computer science🫣) , turned 18 last october and still have no idea about where i want to go in life.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:07:09", "owner": "darkwood2085", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542014510022949, "text": "I wanted money and to work 3 months out of the year.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:34:37", "owner": "its_just_oj_now", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052259993671760, "text": "genuinely what do you do in this situation??", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:33:26", "owner": "alyssabossee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913346725248031, "text": "The best of diamonds are made in the highest of pressures, questioning things is normal as you chose a path that you felt right, give it the best you can, more than likely you'll be sucrssful, if you fail you'll have learnt something to take to the next opportunity", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:20:26", "owner": "alpha_k1lo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18162595033395256, "text": "Why yall hating? If 18 years old used to lead revolutions, why Arent yall leading yours? SCROLL TF DOWN if you don't like the video for fk sake. It's just a vid about her experience in college why y'all care so much", "created_at": "2025-12-04T09:38:11", "owner": "tanvirakos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090612607821467, "text": ".", "created_at": "2025-12-04T08:22:56", "owner": "tiger_moth98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980851830937712, "text": "All this for something you chose to do while still being in a first world country", "created_at": "2025-12-04T07:34:03", "owner": "hunterthatdudeoverthere", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159958216392143, "text": "I’m trying so hard to not go out of shape and keep going to the gym", "created_at": "2025-12-03T22:55:12", "owner": "mohammad_mr__pv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085469684319095, "text": "All she did was get a haircut lmfao", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:11:16", "owner": "colbya.48", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974279811950867, "text": "welp in sweden you choose at 15/16", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:42:08", "owner": "jowanna_k11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864669292521140, "text": "So ur saying that ur Major played a \"Major\" part in u losing ur spark? 🤨😋😋", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:40:46", "owner": "venkatesh_ramesh_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868566829485549, "text": "Fr 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T14:22:33", "owner": "tweaktweak2011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102051313687653, "text": "Waterloo claims another soul", "created_at": "2025-12-03T12:48:26", "owner": "mochi_blues", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063636350401409, "text": "Knew it was gonna be stem or law", "created_at": "2025-12-03T09:45:58", "owner": "ajoseph.07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971639166973607, "text": "Lazy", "created_at": "2025-12-03T07:51:23", "owner": "dan.ielllfl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952385518027076, "text": "People used to apprentice from childhood to work a specific trade their entire life. If anything 18 is late to the game.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:21:47", "owner": "die__letzt_joseph", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097838056835950, "text": "Opposite for me my major had felt like such a joke I damn near have lost my passion", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:04:40", "owner": "mtsiegrist04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993506169893167, "text": "Never to late to drop out and flip burgers", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:18:03", "owner": "jackgriff_25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061479998550344, "text": "It seems at least her hair is healthy", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:39:52", "owner": "prasan_zz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847712212587542, "text": "Once again, ‘Studying is just you undermining your potential’ and ‘If you never acknowledge it, it never exists.’", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:19:08", "owner": "dungton2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844233526625298, "text": "Meh 🫤 suck it up!", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:50:12", "owner": "saracen168", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18303584077248810, "text": "Don’t regret my entire career decision but holy shit am I going to blow up (CompSci + Bioeng)", "created_at": "2025-12-02T01:18:24", "owner": "k.irei01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949224229062583, "text": "Waterloo effect", "created_at": "2025-12-02T01:10:10", "owner": "benjaminfrischhertz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848248957582715, "text": "Lol, didn't realize that law and medical degrees are for the kids of wealthy people who can pay off the insane amounts of debt. Go into engineering instead, then start your own firm and send kids to law/medical school with the added bonus of getting to blow up random Iranian children! (Obv satire on that last)", "created_at": "2025-12-02T00:55:43", "owner": "haydenjmiller6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072896615262237, "text": "I totally felt that way in my undergrad when I was a psych major because I wasn’t interested in a career directly related to psych and felt like I was wasting my time. I’m now applying to nursing school!", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:09:02", "owner": "clairejgrant", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082963985143766, "text": "im thinking of switching to math or physics bc my major is draining the hell out of me but if i stick with it i can probably be more financially stable....", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:45:11", "owner": "aarav_s_boring_username", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081969685894520, "text": "Taking my senior-level computer science classes has caused me so much stress to the point I'm now dealing with medical issues. I honestly can't wait to be done and move on.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T20:42:48", "owner": "lillyluna052", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067122179126644, "text": "Life rn:", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:04:24", "owner": "mrids_mi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853835482581473, "text": "What’s ur major? Why are ppl acting so rude wthh😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T05:11:59", "owner": "0liveolivia._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077264585181916, "text": "When the full time postdoctoral research in mathematics job pays 55k a year", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:33:26", "owner": "noah.ryals", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159032158395268, "text": "I'll be real with you, college is a scam. You don't need it. Go out there and do the things you want to do.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:42:00", "owner": "totally.rad8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061753769227485, "text": "Loser😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:40:28", "owner": "dlo77ds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079393445332284, "text": "Just because you’re studying this major, that does not mean you’re getting a job you’re doing in your major for whole life. Many people changed their field when they enter the workforce.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T09:11:05", "owner": "laibashah0913", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164146072387567, "text": "U look damn good 🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:45:17", "owner": "yuvrajunfolded", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099343720692359, "text": "💯💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:50:17", "owner": "hawra_m3xx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073564178586127, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:55:58", "owner": "_teddy_logan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396733027127934, "text": "I'm so happy that I quit college to persue my dream carreer. Next week is my final week in training", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:14:03", "owner": "tactical_andy05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097599586864760, "text": "People commenting it's not that deep.. really don't know what a bad environment and choice does to u ..", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:43:38", "owner": "hhhh_gallery", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065414942528846, "text": "Pov: You have taken up architecture as your major", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:46:07", "owner": "shootex007__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027152348576738, "text": "Arts", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:48:20", "owner": "starlistica", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321020947174617, "text": "People at my campus had to work hard to get here. When they did they looked like zombies finally coming out of their graves", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:06:04", "owner": "rajaskasar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950058990917610, "text": "What did you major in? Astrophysics???", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:38:28", "owner": "the_j.ulloa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884202634406640, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:04:07", "owner": "sleomile", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075288257005537, "text": "Second year aviation major and so mar no regrets", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:38:46", "owner": "owen.heck491", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902667508166808, "text": "Real", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:13:53", "owner": "frankiewillywonk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925136986168767, "text": "I studied philology for literature and aesthetics, it didn't fulfill me, didn't interest me at all.. killed even my motivation to work. I'm studying religion now, thinking about adding Theology to it. It's not easy major from where I come from, but it's worth it. Good luck in your studies 🤍 don't be afraid to take the leap if you find something else which makes you feel like living", "created_at": "2025-11-26T19:34:46", "owner": "bacak_any", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952446856041911, "text": "Completely optional btw..", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:52:34", "owner": "urleastfavboxer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069666926584743, "text": "Real (Engineering + heartbreak )", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:20:36", "owner": "cesar_marquez2004", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18413044285188422, "text": "Skill issues", "created_at": "2025-11-26T13:33:24", "owner": "shubhpvt_6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044595287701670, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:13:37", "owner": "farhan.kabir.739326", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949752714925204, "text": "life before getting into engineering.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:11:41", "owner": "ramzi_flyr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932730276998149, "text": "Normalize putting the content in the fucking video", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:11:17", "owner": "st4r.grrll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875399698447500, "text": "Major isn’t the issue, the professors are… very unprofessional people leading students is like a blind man leading the blind", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:17:03", "owner": "965_must", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915961963217755, "text": "cut your hair? wow?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:53:28", "owner": "gulag.himself", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867318559487907, "text": "niggas will live in first world countries n still bitch and moan", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:23:13", "owner": "czarthyo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844826152605147, "text": "I thought college would be a dream come true I was so wrong I'm sorry younger me", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:43:24", "owner": "_jaelynngonzalez_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541979857014393, "text": "What major girl ???", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:39:35", "owner": "ranwk.01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18289422094302765, "text": "I’m taking a events management degree and I just feel like I’m getting drained because I’m not passionate about it and only pick it for the scholarship option, I wanted to take Marketing/ Business management/ entrepreneurship", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:26:33", "owner": "dodi_a.j", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085248446072399, "text": "You are kinda cute!", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:09:46", "owner": "cuz_adi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854893378574026, "text": "having a major is just some trailer to your whole professional life. So good luck I guess.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:17:02", "owner": "ardaddisko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079782209169690, "text": "Oh poor you, you can't go clubbing and partying for a little while. God forbid you have to put in the works to be successful", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:32:40", "owner": "padishah_emporer_umid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077761777951204, "text": "Nursing BSc 🥲", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:51:17", "owner": "the_aesculap", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085263989081982, "text": "Let me guess, you're a medicine student aren't you?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:25:05", "owner": "suchataaaaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080300576236816, "text": "Bro school is not that important you shouldnt let it impact your health", "created_at": "2025-11-25T04:01:25", "owner": "tom_kennerley_xviii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929347687117846, "text": "*redirects to average engineering student", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:56:12", "owner": "1andonlydoughboy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935403079106125, "text": "Thank you ChatGPT for the caption", "created_at": "2025-11-24T22:56:38", "owner": "92alois", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925630861039033, "text": "new fear unlocked", "created_at": "2025-11-24T21:05:11", "owner": "ghoulgirlhowru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904143292292928, "text": "Comp sci was the biggest mistake of my life. Fuck money, I just want to be happy", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:32:15", "owner": "notinsaneipromise", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074744609462419, "text": "The reason why I chose happiness over stem😌", "created_at": "2025-11-24T17:24:07", "owner": "ishottheground_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133938394472819, "text": "I want to be a law student...", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:52:24", "owner": "minha.kcore", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025619573774588, "text": "Bwaaahhaahahaha", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:13:29", "owner": "arth.frtas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070799186458595, "text": "I'm on last semester and golly my energy drainage is insane to the point i've been so lazy to do my year end projects and stuffs", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:08:16", "owner": "jxn.bxdxron", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078531494125141, "text": "I started mechanical engineering it fucked me so bad I didn’t even recognize myself, just a depressed, unmotivated guy that didn’t even go out with friends anymore, I went to an career counsellor and Im now actually happy with what I do and I have the energy to do other things than just class", "created_at": "2025-11-23T18:45:47", "owner": "will1.535", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061511126535379, "text": "Damn she’s stunning", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:02:02", "owner": "saadkocher7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915249616238681, "text": "2nd clip top looks so good where is it from", "created_at": "2025-11-23T15:20:44", "owner": "eiyina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925328914039307, "text": "Physics Is draining me a bit", "created_at": "2025-11-23T13:03:56", "owner": "star.rick.618b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119394523528332, "text": "Counterspike", "created_at": "2025-11-23T06:18:28", "owner": "dylannicolasbruin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873830815449779, "text": "Yea, Went to college at 18 for computer science. Dropped out one semester in because I found my career. At 20, the place I worked at was sold off and we were all let go. Fast forward to this year, at 26 I’m the AGM of a huge pizza chain store, making decent money. Brand new 2024 car, working on savings. Then- it hit me. I wanna go back to school. Well, now I’m in school for Psychology- but I’m staring down the PhD cost and I’m so scared. Not sure what to do since anything lower than a master’s in Psych is basically worthless… I’m not interested in anything else..", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:53:50", "owner": "bubmet2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075199937255127, "text": "I majored in college in English and I loose alot of interest in poetry and novel day after day when literally that was the whole point !!", "created_at": "2025-11-23T02:53:18", "owner": "elmasry5597", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913705813236375, "text": "real.", "created_at": "2025-11-23T02:25:13", "owner": "_jake.burns_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071038412589055, "text": "I DID THE SAME THING! I wanted to be a defense attorney soooo bad, I started college this year and was doing my first 4 years in business. But i'm sitting here realizing oh shi, i literally have to go through 4 years of proving my intelligence to random professors to finally start the degree i want to learn about. It's a joke, i dropped out and am building wealth independently", "created_at": "2025-11-23T00:55:09", "owner": "yktreyfrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070638278460471, "text": "is it just me, or did her eyes lose their color? I know its weird to say, and could be because of the lighting. But the way we say \"she lost her spark\" makes sense a bit.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T23:38:06", "owner": "sdlck24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086850629305012, "text": "I’m 18, and next year I’m supposed to go to uni, and I feel the same way. I’m from Europe, so there are some differences, but the concept is the same. I started feeling this way about not wanting to go to uni after two years of high school because… I don’t know, it just doesn’t feel right at the moment.\n\nChoosing a school that’s supposed to set the rest of your life is kind of scary, and I think it would be a waste of time if I ended up dropping out later because I didn’t enjoy it. Right now, I’m focusing on other aspects of life. I’m not saying I won’t go… just not now.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T22:21:45", "owner": "andrej_eremeev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064592618158960, "text": "I think it was just college in general i knew id hate it but my parents wanted me to have a better education. I mightve been better off if i just graduated high school and started working", "created_at": "2025-11-22T20:45:43", "owner": "gaemawngrawl666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929411965015298, "text": "Already 2 degrees and then I worked a year, now I am studying again...", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:26:14", "owner": "diny.verheyden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086716754485520, "text": "Beautiful", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:09:00", "owner": "mr._schofield", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100272445742798, "text": "Literally just cut off some hair lmao", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:50:10", "owner": "q_r1xx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867395599496690, "text": "I feel you... I wanted graphic design and ended up in interior architecture. And in the beginning it was fun and I fell in love with the projects and making new spaces but sadly... It has become SO FUCKING tiring. To the point where I get sick more easily just from pure stress. The only thing keeping me together is the fact I have 1 year left and then I can just go either to graphic design and or find something else. I feel like majors like law, medicine, engineering etc can become SOOOO toxic just from the sheer workload, expensiveness of materials and the competitiveness in the market....", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:48:20", "owner": "xheamoonlight.jpeg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886305454400229, "text": "what’s with the chatgpt caption", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:32:03", "owner": "erensroommate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860272570478464, "text": "Never do that first look omg 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:12:38", "owner": "punit_alagappan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077592158465448, "text": "\"wahh my major is hard\" Alexander The Great conquered Persia in his 20s while outnumbered 2 to 1", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:21:59", "owner": "m_vidanovic07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894480718360430, "text": "I got fat lol what the hell", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:56:23", "owner": "xztj1403", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066641567132320, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:12:58", "owner": "abdel3ziz_omar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121516378521319, "text": "I feel the same way studying psychology right now, thinking about graduate school, and then earning a doctorate, it seems overwhelming. And while I love psychology, I don’t think I’m passionate enough to pursue it that far", "created_at": "2025-11-21T23:16:48", "owner": "justjennyolech", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919689151212857, "text": "It would probably sound rude but if the course you're pursuing is as per your word, DRAINING THE LIFE OUT OF YOU, that course is probably not for you. Change teachers, change schools, if even that doesn't work, explore similar fields of study but do it with enjoyment, passion and love. Learning should never be a punishment.", "created_at": "2025-11-21T20:26:51", "owner": "moonlit_red", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099383890783164, "text": "Engineering was genuinely best thing ive done with my time. I hate and love studying, i feel like doing this made me feel alive", "created_at": "2025-11-21T19:30:35", "owner": "saka_disoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080037365142971, "text": "I felt so excited to be a neurosurgeon. Where did all that excitement go", "created_at": "2025-11-21T19:28:56", "owner": "tocieie1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113149639581287, "text": "Medical student here who has been harassed by academic dishonesty", "created_at": "2025-11-21T19:28:33", "owner": "tocieie1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086167654961215, "text": "I choose to have one drop year but now it's going to be 3 drop years and now I am afraid to start college once a topper now nothing I will be 20 when I start my college but I don't know how to handle this situation and I am clear about goals but now I think I am too late", "created_at": "2025-11-21T13:45:40", "owner": "eunwoooo.c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867048979492030, "text": "This hits so hard", "created_at": "2025-11-21T05:43:18", "owner": "seanduy5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093082477713115, "text": "As a 35 year old that spent years studying film and is now changing careers.... Don't trip. You can always pivot. The degree barely matters these days anyways", "created_at": "2025-11-20T22:42:54", "owner": "bored_in_the_valley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078909245516060, "text": "18 is pretty fine, here in France you must choose three majors at 15 that will rule the university you can go to or not", "created_at": "2025-11-20T20:06:02", "owner": "mathis_l_f", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097912123745844, "text": "Pretty eyes.", "created_at": "2025-11-20T20:00:08", "owner": "kuraim17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153079711413585, "text": "So, when's the best time to chose your major ?? No matter you do u ll find it boring one day This is human nature", "created_at": "2025-11-20T19:21:05", "owner": "_imane_se_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090066895737379, "text": "lemme guess. math or law", "created_at": "2025-11-20T19:07:34", "owner": "humpty_dumpty_1736", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18299344216254347, "text": "It's sad to see people losing their spark in majors they love due to materialistic shit", "created_at": "2025-11-20T18:15:47", "owner": "syf_rhl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099100924760006, "text": "I was gonna do cs and give JEE (like 50% indians) then I thought I should give american colleges a try", "created_at": "2025-11-20T18:08:43", "owner": "mister.rigal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912620209240084, "text": "Waterloo Engineering", "created_at": "2025-11-20T14:55:39", "owner": "bladesxcz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053335835336058, "text": "I'm in law school too.kinda feelings the same.", "created_at": "2025-11-20T12:18:50", "owner": "maunota2005", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902488279297371, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-20T11:32:10", "owner": "programmertheweb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158891785396084, "text": "Kids at 18 choosing thier major is one thing, but imo in portugal we have it worse, we gotta choose it at 14, and that locksyour whole highschool experience as a mini major already", "created_at": "2025-11-20T10:06:26", "owner": "camilakaki8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114595348566409, "text": "I changed my major 5 times. Just get a bachelor's in like communications from like a 95% acceptance rate university and start applying for jobs or try trade school.", "created_at": "2025-11-20T07:25:08", "owner": "eliana.levi2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078170162184038, "text": "switched majors twice alr", "created_at": "2025-11-20T03:43:20", "owner": "pvg24ow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183466006351419, "text": "Girl I know you used GPT for that caption", "created_at": "2025-11-20T01:37:12", "owner": "cowboyrave", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543599581050152, "text": "I've been suptessing this feeling for months now as an art student..its agonizing", "created_at": "2025-11-19T22:27:04", "owner": "berry_juiceys", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874091077447794, "text": "I'm glad I saw this today.. this is something 90% go through in my opinion, but it's hard to accept that maybe you need to change directions.. it's scary to think about it. Hopefully we can trust the timing and our life story to find ourselves again from this \"being lost\" feeling :)", "created_at": "2025-11-19T21:02:21", "owner": "_1and.only1_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997668213699876, "text": "good thing i want to do to pastry school", "created_at": "2025-11-19T19:12:28", "owner": "evilmatchaman27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131846560490283, "text": "Yall, its not a shame to feel lost. I figured school aint for me and dropped out, went to work for 4 years just to go back to school soon, to get my degree. Life aint a straight line, sometimes you just go in circles for a bit but thats fine. Dont stress yourself to much about having to choose a major now, you can go to Uni all your life", "created_at": "2025-11-19T17:22:46", "owner": "lukas.fuer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960570568006766, "text": "once again, im so glad i changed my mind from studying medicine", "created_at": "2025-11-19T17:18:55", "owner": "ekinsafeplace21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18327677293210658, "text": "If that's how a drained life looks then I am beyond cooked....... even deep fried and burnt", "created_at": "2025-11-19T08:43:43", "owner": "009stupif009", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118869274548764, "text": "If anything, I learnt academia is fake and doesn't apply to the world,  I wish they joined us in reality.", "created_at": "2025-11-19T06:19:44", "owner": "undo03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905692063279194, "text": "Crying from reading books lol. There are millions of people who would swap lives with you in an instant.", "created_at": "2025-11-19T03:55:50", "owner": "aliziadmoussa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901995730164439, "text": "In my country we chose it at 15", "created_at": "2025-11-19T01:55:25", "owner": "mini3_72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863423851527111, "text": "😒", "created_at": "2025-11-19T00:50:50", "owner": "1saifty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087323027511116, "text": "Went and got an associates degree in a trade, best decision of my life, bringing in $3,475 off 50 hour work weeks with no hard labor and learning/getting to do something different every day", "created_at": "2025-11-19T00:04:18", "owner": "naamanperakis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078861826897567, "text": "waterloo engineering", "created_at": "2025-11-18T19:11:53", "owner": "dead_mans_concubine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070293542347311, "text": "This is making me not wanna choose engineering…", "created_at": "2025-11-18T18:15:16", "owner": "lilly.the_silly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906717667271912, "text": "You look like Alexandra Dadario", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:15:11", "owner": "chimoon2379", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097615048700250, "text": "Choosing medicine is my biggest regret💔", "created_at": "2025-11-18T14:28:47", "owner": "_._axela", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027685439756795, "text": "what you said about law is so right", "created_at": "2025-11-18T13:28:36", "owner": "alwaysgrahamm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18230725300305593, "text": "Studying is temporary.\nEarning potential is forever.", "created_at": "2025-11-18T10:14:48", "owner": "blanquita_miata", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18300817174281883, "text": "Bro I was planning for law 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-18T10:07:45", "owner": "maaz.farhaj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884087599407677, "text": "If it ain’t engineering u ain’t “suffering”", "created_at": "2025-11-18T09:34:29", "owner": "diaawastaken", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936040041978978, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T09:33:59", "owner": "justaaarya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060834101234604, "text": "It could be they case that you're dopamine receptors has been conditioned to live a life that exciting. Homeostasis can be difficult afterwards", "created_at": "2025-11-18T08:10:33", "owner": "pumpum_crusader", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866055838497374, "text": "Cant you just extend it? I study a.i. in germany and never go beyond my stress tolerance (around 6 study hours per day). I mean just think: If you graduate bachelor in 3 years but aged 5 years because of stress then how is that better than just studying 5 years w low stress? But ok if its cause of money/tuition fees im sorry for you", "created_at": "2025-11-18T08:01:12", "owner": "sami_12983", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060552008541172, "text": "Lmao at least she pretty", "created_at": "2025-11-18T06:23:30", "owner": "gastonriboxxh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075690952970943, "text": "I NEED NO STUDY", "created_at": "2025-11-17T23:26:33", "owner": "edoardo__villani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049390604383037, "text": "Literally business major 💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-17T20:45:03", "owner": "e7y_o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968454834985641, "text": "Boo hoo", "created_at": "2025-11-17T19:22:22", "owner": "antorck2154", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929948149113991, "text": "Obtaining knowledge is actually great until they start adding deadlines and marks for everything like ffs kill yourself", "created_at": "2025-11-17T19:20:57", "owner": "abdelhafid_dlt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086371784509203, "text": "yo u look like Audrey Horne from Twin Peaks gng", "created_at": "2025-11-17T18:46:34", "owner": "obi.wan_za2zl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078053198126112, "text": "I love my major, I hate my university", "created_at": "2025-11-17T18:37:52", "owner": "_im.dp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073838969000899, "text": "i love that you're open about it but i feel like the chatgpt comment made it less genuine", "created_at": "2025-11-17T18:36:04", "owner": "samjhma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18394894726133503, "text": "well where i live and other countries we choose what we want to be at 14...sick", "created_at": "2025-11-17T18:12:57", "owner": "4nyd1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055582289316269, "text": "Me after choosing engineering:", "created_at": "2025-11-17T16:35:54", "owner": "nairastaria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090130780739256, "text": "Idk how it drained your life cause you look full of it and will you share some of it with me", "created_at": "2025-11-17T15:31:42", "owner": "barneystinson1421", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18181143085350795, "text": "You look like Jane from blindspot", "created_at": "2025-11-17T14:15:55", "owner": "shitlesshorrorcretin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098355943702837, "text": "Electrical engineering nigga 🥀", "created_at": "2025-11-17T11:53:24", "owner": "ztricep", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071539790369573, "text": "Ppl when life has ups and downs and sometimes youre happy and full of life and sometimes you just live and thats enough (realismmaxxing)", "created_at": "2025-11-17T10:14:01", "owner": "jakub._.kacer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085479031824246, "text": "Me after taking architecture", "created_at": "2025-11-17T10:09:33", "owner": "issociallydepressed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992016948886096, "text": "Same", "created_at": "2025-11-17T06:43:43", "owner": "andreanarg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112439236603597, "text": "Just graduated from uni with dual degrees to attend law school. I took a trip and a few people met later, I realized that it just wasn't for me. I think every person has a different version of risk. Law school is considered a risk - of debt, of time, of the soul. Every career is a type of risk. But, I had to accept that law school is not my type of risk. I think every person should pursue a career path that they know feeds them. I was in love with connection, building something from ideas, and seeing a result form into a long lasting legacy. So, I picked the business and sales field. Best decision of my life. But, @academia.diaries , you just have to romanticize the risk of it all. It will work out, it won't work out - it's all part of the game called life. You got this, and everything will work out (:", "created_at": "2025-11-17T01:02:13", "owner": "jeloux.mp4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087893128765531, "text": "Idek what i want anymore, i’m already drained and exhausted just from midterms of senior year in high school, i don’t know how i’ll still be alive by finals and.. all that while neglecting university exams and still can’t be sure what to major after graduation, gosh i envy middle school students (choking myself to dea’th ahh) \n\nahm ahm anyways, what do you guys think about pharmacy major or pathology?", "created_at": "2025-11-16T22:15:56", "owner": "7skyll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968433591980070, "text": "Waterloo effect", "created_at": "2025-11-16T20:06:48", "owner": "a1nish_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861909217457454, "text": "I tried to go for my psych degree and burned myself out cause I was lonely in college and etc. But now I am going to go back either complete my degree or switch paths to smth else :^)", "created_at": "2025-11-16T18:48:51", "owner": "r.a.u.lr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18166522870343054, "text": "It’s ridiculous.", "created_at": "2025-11-16T16:57:14", "owner": "eeeellllaaafff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18409200775190966, "text": "sorry how you are so pretty....", "created_at": "2025-11-16T16:53:37", "owner": "alover.az", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086475928781972, "text": "That’s why I’m just gonna be a farm hand", "created_at": "2025-11-16T10:56:20", "owner": "the_quiefanator", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065408795414341, "text": "You have really pretty eyes", "created_at": "2025-11-16T07:35:17", "owner": "basement_boy__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118823908542788, "text": "Sammmmmeeee😩", "created_at": "2025-11-16T04:59:57", "owner": "__.f.e.f.e.__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985998837861548, "text": "then you need to change ur major", "created_at": "2025-11-15T23:53:14", "owner": "rachael_jmac_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951842608046208, "text": "I get you mechanical engineering is draining what little life I had left to begin with at this stage i don’t even think I’ll be alive long enough to even use this degree in a meaningful manner", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:54:06", "owner": "angel_1.44", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053192999336893, "text": "Psychology", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:47:00", "owner": "starseed_being_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157679332402846, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-15T16:20:28", "owner": "azoz_youssef761", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931758330996270, "text": "what major, so i dont pick it 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-15T16:11:11", "owner": "beomt3a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879692854423869, "text": "My major makes me feel the most alive and drained at the same time. I think it's not the major , it's the education System of countries that make you feel drained", "created_at": "2025-11-15T15:24:00", "owner": "lunetteici", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184932916343636, "text": "Electrical engineering does that to a mf", "created_at": "2025-11-15T03:57:22", "owner": "jthok_chom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103237918732040, "text": "Molécular biology (i love it though, just to dense)", "created_at": "2025-11-14T20:57:33", "owner": "alec_trsk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879499186423525, "text": "I did computer engineering and after five years I started regretting", "created_at": "2025-11-14T20:51:56", "owner": "simplygoalie__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989177742862897, "text": "A little trick if you want to go into law school is to major in a discipline that will allow you to get your prerequisites done, but also get a different job if you decided to pivot. A good example of this is social studies education.", "created_at": "2025-11-14T20:47:18", "owner": "katie_jo_1734", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060273629217454, "text": "Benimle evlenir misin?", "created_at": "2025-11-14T20:20:46", "owner": "enes.tenma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331656205243490, "text": "In 12th grade rn, don't know what to do - what course or degree to go for as nothing excites me, don't have interest in any of then subjects.", "created_at": "2025-11-14T19:03:10", "owner": "lichit_licht", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105252052642122, "text": "I have switched majors, so I understand how you feel", "created_at": "2025-11-14T18:34:29", "owner": "rahmana.basit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130198768493629, "text": "Real, cutting hair tells so much", "created_at": "2025-11-14T18:25:53", "owner": "_enil_asy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076017619973014, "text": "Mine is different. I love science subjects very much as a child but when I get to enter highschool with pure science course, I start to have mental breakdown. Now, I will sit on the final exam with those subjects that I hate. Don't worry, I will continue my studies in a field not related to science", "created_at": "2025-11-14T14:20:02", "owner": "enraxin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118716490551460, "text": "Looks the same", "created_at": "2025-11-14T10:47:43", "owner": "patirnuss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098781115687079, "text": "No pain no gain", "created_at": "2025-11-13T18:01:44", "owner": "pascal_hanse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992865165855066, "text": "Ik this is irrelevant BUT UR EYES ARE SO PRETTTY GIRRLL", "created_at": "2025-11-13T16:00:02", "owner": "meimeitheimposter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850678267589257, "text": "Just came out of calc 1 with a big zero. Wondering how I'm going to graduate", "created_at": "2025-11-13T14:57:57", "owner": "tortle_lover_0_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107401687558081, "text": "Biochemistry minoring with psych and health sciences 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-13T12:50:55", "owner": "m00nlight_rainefall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044169011466299, "text": "😔…", "created_at": "2025-11-12T19:15:52", "owner": "kuohero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080898785033622, "text": "Pre engineering 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-12T18:41:11", "owner": "ayaan.afq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894581905357248, "text": "Had the exact same problem studying for bachelor in psychology. For me learning and studying wasnt the problem, but the ever increasing study debt and increasing housing rent just made me reconsider what i was doing. I was feeling a lot of stress to dont fuck it up, because it will end up costing me a ton. For me i felt burned out because i had no time taking care of myself (taking time for making music, or seeing friends) because studying and paying everything in the netherlands as young adult just is surviving (if you dont have rich parents). Sometimes it feels unequal. Now i am a delivery driver, and i feel happier than i was studying because now i have time music and seeing friends, i have steady income. So, moral of the story just do what makes you happy, and fuck all expectations (like expectations from familly or society)", "created_at": "2025-11-12T12:19:09", "owner": "niels_julian", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18118295128479460, "text": "This is me but with Psychology", "created_at": "2025-11-12T10:05:52", "owner": "read.regale.write", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971756550798394, "text": "Yo esa", "created_at": "2025-11-12T09:37:07", "owner": "not.torix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933166534105324, "text": "Accounting?🙂‍↕️", "created_at": "2025-11-12T09:07:43", "owner": "juttomi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887046877264981, "text": "Didn’t choose what I wanted to do until I was 25 and I just earned my associate’s degree at 27.", "created_at": "2025-11-12T01:30:08", "owner": "a5h7041", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097630774789191, "text": "I agree its pretty ridiculus", "created_at": "2025-11-12T01:18:52", "owner": "galacticjellos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068228171376709, "text": "Lorelai Gilmore(Emily's version)", "created_at": "2025-11-12T01:06:34", "owner": "isaicurrey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101262688734534, "text": "It is insane but it wll be worth it. Holding onto that.", "created_at": "2025-11-11T23:52:47", "owner": "wonderfully.made.07", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18422700829129022, "text": "this is so true", "created_at": "2025-11-11T23:19:56", "owner": "moghrabi_saeed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061637816532071, "text": "Everything that kills me makes me alive!", "created_at": "2025-11-11T23:07:01", "owner": "seventeenie_svt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901798990296457, "text": "yes absolutely. i've had a very similar experience with pre vet. this is all i've ever wanted and i feel so validated practicing medicine and interacting with animals. but vet school, another 4/5 years plus hundreds of thousands of dollars in debt, is so insanely daunting. it seems like an impossible road but when i think of alternatives there are none. it's hard to", "created_at": "2025-11-11T22:50:57", "owner": "brig_hardick", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17846561985582142, "text": "Atleast its not from meds", "created_at": "2025-11-11T20:18:57", "owner": "tijl_cresens", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031971257718177, "text": "Same but engineering , tbh I call it maturing , probs if I didnt do eng I wont mature, I met ppl in hs and they were mature its mindblowing", "created_at": "2025-11-11T19:21:49", "owner": "xbb23s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874081204444256, "text": "pharmacy but i love it", "created_at": "2025-11-11T18:33:52", "owner": "ceilroselie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931504654000221, "text": "And the worst is yet to come ig", "created_at": "2025-11-11T18:04:21", "owner": "rajanyajiya", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078221765229482, "text": "It’s never too late", "created_at": "2025-11-11T15:10:26", "owner": "thepashtoonlad_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108445246615026, "text": "Wanted to take medicine since I was 6. Learning bio is fun but chemistry sucks the life out of me", "created_at": "2025-11-11T13:34:18", "owner": "hiroto_azure", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18146388535437868, "text": "It’s engineering ofc", "created_at": "2025-11-11T06:07:45", "owner": "jana.2859", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121689724521396, "text": "I think same is happening w me ig", "created_at": "2025-11-11T04:48:58", "owner": "mahek_030", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969665061810653, "text": "American?", "created_at": "2025-11-10T18:58:10", "owner": "meloun_mini", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["university", "student", "studygram", "studywithme", "academia", "prelaw", "uoft", "lawschool", "lsat", "universitymajors", "universitystudent", "undergraduate"]},
{"media_id": 3763072413245630269, "shortcode": "DQ5HmwXk-c9", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DQ5HmwXk-c9/", "taken_at": "2025-11-10T22:21:47", "caption": "🥩按此睇邊到任食雞翼薯條小食⬇️\n話說聽過一個餐飲集團老闆講，香港大部份餐廳最好賣嘅小食，其實就係雞翼。呢到38蚊任食，簡直低估咗香港人對雞翼嘅熱愛，都未計薯條，呢件事揚咗出去嘅話，可能去麥當勞請人黎炸都會冧檔。\n\n呢間西餐都好多年，但聽講呢排翻新轉咗新班底，推埋任食雞翼薯條小食，竟然加38蚊就有。大家亦都唔洗驚便秘，炸粟米條、沙律呢啲都係任食，加多100蚊仲有free flow任飲，可以call定的士返屋企。\n\n-\n🥓任食無限追加小食 (Set+$38)\n🥢炸單骨雞翼 (香草/水牛城/鹹蛋黃）\n🥢意式炸薯條 (原味/黑松露/海苔）\n🥢脆炸魷魚圈 🥢墨西哥炸粟米\n🥢沙律 🥢湯 🥢蒜蓉包\n🧊Free Flow任飲紅白、指定飲品 (Set+$98)\n1️⃣其實呢到都幾有誠意，雞翼同薯條唔會得一種，會有幾款任食，雖然最回本係食雞翼，但最正係啲連皮粗薯，紫菜仲要係shake果種。\n2️⃣唔知係咪睇漏眼，唔見有寫限時，我諗係個漏洞黎，總之帶大胃王黎執行清場行動就啱。\n\n🍝Dinner Set ($268)\n🔸Main (選一)\n🥢日本赤玉 月見卡邦尼意大利麵\n🥢香烤低溫慢煮西班牙BB豬仔脾\n🔸Starter (選一)\n🥢經典凱撒沙律🥢法式鵝肝醬多士 🥢脆炸軟殼蟹\n🔸Soup 🔸Coffee/Tea\n如果為咗佢地上邊嘅任食，最抵食一定嗌呢set，加多38蚊就可以任食，豬仔髀好似抵食啲，但最後揀咗卡邦尼，出奇地濃厚仲配日本蛋。\n\n-\n🥩Deluxe Dinner Set ($480)\n🔸主菜 (選一)\n🥢法式紅酒燉羊膝 🥢西班牙黑毛豬鞍\n🥢辛辣蒜香白洒沙白意大利麵\n🥢炸軟殼螌蟹黃意大利飯\n🥢美國頂級西冷牛扒(10oz)\n🔸Starter(選一)\n🥢黑松露蟹肉多士 🥢法式鵝肝醬多士\n🥢意式火腿拼盤 🥢煙燻蟹肉牛油果他他\n🥢忌廉白酒煮青口拼沙白\n呢Set就明顯地豐富得多，多咗唔少重本食材，一定係揀鋸扒，牛扒唔洗另外加錢；前菜就揀青口沙白，都幾新鮮大份，但我仲想留肚食上邊啲雞翼薯條。\n\n🔸Soup - 海鮮濃湯\n🔸甜品 (選一)\n🥢焙茶焦糖燉蛋 🥢意大利提拉米蘇\n🔸Drinks - 紅/白/氣泡\n\n-\nGreen Orange\n🗺️上環永樂街50號昌盛大廈2樓\n📞2541 9090\n❇️生日訂位仲有甜品畫碟，啲畫功真係痴線，建議畫師去日本幫手加速畫下集鬼滅。", "owner_username": "foodiegogoooo", "owner_id": "19019732548", "likes": 7895, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0105_DQ5HmwXk-c9\\DQ5HmwXk-c9_20251110_222147.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17947882560050741, "text": "🥓聽過一個餐飲集團老闆講，香港大部份餐廳最好賣嘅小食，其實就係雞翼。呢到38蚊任食，簡直低估咗香港人對雞翼嘅熱愛，都未計薯條，呢件事揚咗出去嘅話，可能去麥當勞請人黎炸都會冧檔。大家亦都唔洗驚便秘，炸粟米條、沙律呢啲都係任食。", "created_at": "2025-11-10T22:25:59", "owner": "foodiegogoooo", "likes": 61}, {"id": 18072268196252358, "text": "你啲介紹真係好正，但有時睇太多真係搵唔返想食嗰啲地方係邊度😆", "created_at": "2025-11-11T02:38:43", "owner": "jc4lamb", "likes": 27}, {"id": 18536203948009198, "text": "限時幾耐？", "created_at": "2025-11-12T01:52:22", "owner": "zoecomputer", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18068817206077472, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-11T06:30:59", "owner": "asian_chinabosslady", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18030558344742501, "text": "이빨 사이 낀 spaghetti 빼고 싶니? Bon appétit\n그냥 포기해 어차피, eat it up, eat it, eat it up", "created_at": "2025-11-11T04:54:34", "owner": "kelvinc0526", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18104917819651489, "text": "幾正喎", "created_at": "2025-11-12T00:55:39", "owner": "ww67424", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077863004324059, "text": "今晚去食？", "created_at": "2025-11-12T04:24:26", "owner": "t.chan225", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18011820278802539, "text": "正", "created_at": "2025-11-11T04:11:16", "owner": "dennis6678", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17850034779591477, "text": "Where", "created_at": "2025-11-11T18:29:37", "owner": "183u_u", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18319918987173628, "text": "😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-12T09:14:01", "owner": "duelaquarz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17957570768882278, "text": "@woody_lok666", "created_at": "2025-11-19T13:24:29", "owner": "kakawoo0512", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892204705360403, "text": "💮成日有網友問起啲Reel同文字係幾多人做，其實都係自己一人製作，真心多謝每位鍾意睇嘅網友，想係到Credit返大家，講聲超級大感謝！\n \n❇️最近更新1：其實一向都有寫係我bio，如果邊間鋪頭做得唔好，請隨便inbox dm我。我會代大家撥個輪直接去投訴反映，香港餐飲業需要大家意見先可以做得更好🦪\n \n❇️最近更新2：仲有已經係封面寫埋地區，方便大家Bookmark翻睇搵食，仲有入黎profile @foodiegogoooo 睇地區搵食都易啲❗️🥩🦞🥞🍔", "created_at": "2025-11-10T22:23:13", "owner": "foodiegogoooo", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18063400571624760, "text": "正😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-12T14:59:13", "owner": "johnwalker3243960", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18091504519909279, "text": "❇️細個有兩個夢想，一個係做畫家，第二個係做作家，雖然而家兩個都做唔到，但我係從未放棄每日鍛鍊寫作放屁，如果想知幾錢邊到同介紹，㩒入影片左下角內文就有❗️", "created_at": "2025-11-10T22:23:15", "owner": "foodiegogoooo", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18078826274324068, "text": "Where?", "created_at": "2025-11-18T12:41:05", "owner": "william1073938", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3717814673782355524, "shortcode": "DOYVL97iDZE", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DOYVL97iDZE/", "taken_at": "2025-09-09T11:42:51", "caption": "POV: 喺外國留學一年返香港第一件事", "owner_username": "sammi.foodie._.life", "owner_id": "1072189617", "likes": 12448, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0106_DOYVL97iDZE\\DOYVL97iDZE_20250909_114251.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17864389548399090, "text": "1年都咁樣，想像下4年！！😍", "created_at": "2025-09-18T17:05:54", "owner": "isabel.lavish", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18340300900165567, "text": "譚仔😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-09-09T19:34:18", "owner": "elizabethw0923", "likes": 54}, {"id": 18130066072460980, "text": "如果你真係香港人,就會轉機去日本先食啦", "created_at": "2025-09-09T17:04:27", "owner": "arhatfung1219", "likes": 298}, {"id": 17850822135542302, "text": "YES first things first", "created_at": "2025-09-09T13:20:34", "owner": "eatwithjmoney", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18075050171038010, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-09T11:43:35", "owner": "sammi.foodie._.life", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051674372255800, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-09T13:50:09", "owner": "gymer.runner.hk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074489869844700, "text": "一定要食番夠本", "created_at": "2025-09-12T10:24:44", "owner": "food.print.hk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981889893886854, "text": "元氣better🙌", "created_at": "2025-09-09T21:56:13", "owner": "amosss_leungg", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17846883750564829, "text": "唔建議喺開咗學1個月嘅時候碌到呢個reels💀💀💀", "created_at": "2025-10-18T09:27:38", "owner": "sou.kairos", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18045075188691887, "text": "一落地簡直想食翻個譚仔先😂", "created_at": "2025-10-23T12:53:56", "owner": "sin21day_klw", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18089068775062850, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-08T14:10:57", "owner": "yutiangaoshi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176385466345875, "text": "sushiro 😆", "created_at": "2025-09-13T23:53:18", "owner": "rachelchoyesu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854074006551092, "text": "🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-09T08:34:34", "owner": "christy.0036.hk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133518712445962, "text": "heck yes", "created_at": "2025-09-10T10:56:45", "owner": "onlyyjorie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016551821769519, "text": "1年？我5年啦😭加拿大好悶啊", "created_at": "2025-09-10T01:12:52", "owner": "absolutely_not_a_person", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18074492684177556, "text": "@ttgene 每天都在想這個", "created_at": "2025-10-11T17:11:38", "owner": "lialciat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087791881849499, "text": "Relatable", "created_at": "2025-09-09T14:50:46", "owner": "sekai_no_whitenight", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18528640135046672, "text": "@t.k.m08 ??? So where’s my lunch???", "created_at": "2025-09-11T17:06:18", "owner": "car_sonlam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925747497998115, "text": "I’ve never related to anything more", "created_at": "2025-09-10T02:05:38", "owner": "christy_teaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18291032785278646, "text": "I literally missed everything 😢", "created_at": "2025-10-14T17:50:54", "owner": "a_random_human_from_the_world", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121516147495539, "text": "@ryan_slh @don_1i", "created_at": "2025-09-11T03:21:53", "owner": "gordonth_520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095107597709407, "text": "@n1cholas.ch PLEASE COME BACK😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-09-15T09:22:25", "owner": "ecspaghetti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942120757025863, "text": "what", "created_at": "2025-09-09T21:57:30", "owner": "gokunotfor", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3688096031444527699, "shortcode": "DMuv8zbx2pT", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DMuv8zbx2pT/", "taken_at": "2025-07-30T11:35:00", "caption": "[If you’re interested in global job hunting, my eBook is available — link in bio!] \n\nNot gonna lose again 😅\n\n#구글#구글러#google#googler#googlesingapore#googlesingaporeoffice#googleoffice#googleperks#corporategirl#corporategirlie #해외취업#해외살이#해외생활#해외#동기부여#자기개발#싱가포르#싱가포르취업#motivation#selfdevelopment", "owner_username": "kaysnote", "owner_id": "63330321817", "likes": 53603, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0107_DMuv8zbx2pT\\DMuv8zbx2pT_20250730_113500.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17859882558458793, "text": "Does this cut from your salary or you ah", "created_at": "2025-07-31T08:41:26", "owner": "aaditbansal08", "likes": 5444}, {"id": 18150887236382044, "text": "but its wired", "created_at": "2025-08-08T18:17:40", "owner": "_tmturk", "likes": 766}, {"id": 17891494860324193, "text": "Is it free", "created_at": "2025-08-26T12:14:53", "owner": "unkown_dragon21", "likes": 2341}, {"id": 18078623263916121, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-07-30T12:51:56", "owner": "grace.barcelona", "likes": 164}, {"id": 18062748272007687, "text": "Wow❤️", "created_at": "2025-07-30T13:48:36", "owner": "dancingsonia", "likes": 54}, {"id": 18055499537532581, "text": "damn I guess selling all my data is pretty lucrative, look at all the free nice shit it buys 😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-09-10T23:39:32", "owner": "el_jefry_grande", "likes": 95}, {"id": 18156613582404487, "text": "Did u have to pay for this?", "created_at": "2025-11-13T13:21:47", "owner": "kash.iiishhhh", "likes": 17}, {"id": 18076071931777567, "text": "To even work.. This generation needs fancy laptop", "created_at": "2025-08-04T11:54:37", "owner": "archer_ztudios", "likes": 924}, {"id": 17858986137517774, "text": "Is this really free or it gets added to your assets list or charges to your cost centre like generally happens \nOr there is max cap.", "created_at": "2025-10-11T03:20:29", "owner": "prayasvijayvargiya", "likes": 32}, {"id": 17905010757212172, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-30T12:54:20", "owner": "minjujo", "likes": 26}, {"id": 18292536448283928, "text": "Wow i wanna work for Google now", "created_at": "2025-10-22T06:26:44", "owner": "diz.grinds", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17947132721885609, "text": "Brand?", "created_at": "2025-08-01T18:52:16", "owner": "stefshere", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18074298131244080, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-23T15:46:10", "owner": "yffd.fc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053403704412620, "text": "I saw that yubikey", "created_at": "2025-07-31T03:39:19", "owner": "thejonabbott", "likes": 26}, {"id": 18050705141272232, "text": "@signifi_solutions_inc delivered this amazing solution! #ITAM", "created_at": "2025-09-11T12:48:18", "owner": "dpackc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058355018363868, "text": "Curiouuus - do you have to return it after? 😮", "created_at": "2025-07-30T11:56:02", "owner": "mejiamia", "likes": 328}, {"id": 18017957900559031, "text": "For Free?", "created_at": "2025-07-30T14:31:38", "owner": "brendonism", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18057799799248223, "text": "Send me a security key 👀 I totally lost mine", "created_at": "2025-10-23T05:16:27", "owner": "thejacobacklin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877473490403296, "text": "For info: it is wired earplugs, not pixel buds", "created_at": "2025-09-11T14:32:38", "owner": "etom.ai", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18109978501520881, "text": "YUBIKEY VENDING MACHINE????", "created_at": "2025-08-01T23:18:20", "owner": "itsha0221", "likes": 46}, {"id": 18123522361485908, "text": "But ai doesn't need headphones and all ☠️", "created_at": "2025-09-02T01:01:49", "owner": "satyam_srivastava_513", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18130056577458449, "text": "And yaha kharab ko bola thik h use karne 🥲😵‍💫", "created_at": "2025-09-10T11:22:23", "owner": "_nidhi__bhanushali_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113656549582175, "text": "Those are earphones", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:17:35", "owner": "ayeshaizhar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901470796319759, "text": "I kinda hate google 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:08:31", "owner": "kaiserbnny77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087974821786980, "text": "Made in vietnam❤️👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-23T11:18:04", "owner": "tomthiunangok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990031650736696, "text": "Free?", "created_at": "2025-11-23T01:51:36", "owner": "pattycs6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071045663587151, "text": "You can get security keys", "created_at": "2025-11-07T06:26:06", "owner": "lol_idk792", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18167959279373258, "text": "@arpanbhutda looks like a side mission in a video game", "created_at": "2025-11-04T05:30:09", "owner": "sneakygoku", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081896774012963, "text": "Ah yes, fuck the planet", "created_at": "2025-10-26T06:15:16", "owner": "nbr97__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910022191249169, "text": "Prey fabricator ahh", "created_at": "2025-10-23T06:35:26", "owner": "sylvia_cta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886621957380611, "text": "In Amazon too...", "created_at": "2025-10-20T16:04:12", "owner": "balajirajubalu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18412649632112476, "text": "At 2am", "created_at": "2025-10-18T02:37:17", "owner": "jadhammache3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863909065495317, "text": "I USED TO LOVE THIS SONG SMMMM OMG", "created_at": "2025-10-16T07:40:21", "owner": "riddlexonia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043841849428898, "text": "It's free there?", "created_at": "2025-10-11T22:19:08", "owner": "santoi_9742", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144680755425238, "text": "Cool I’m forced to listen to blaring shitty country pop music while I work.", "created_at": "2025-10-11T18:07:41", "owner": "mysistersfugazishirt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18388265410127419, "text": "Can I also buy a muffin 🧁", "created_at": "2025-10-08T08:12:02", "owner": "meirplotnik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067121228202422, "text": "cost?", "created_at": "2025-10-01T23:11:46", "owner": "simplychloehehe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018359813589679, "text": "You not alone ❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-29T05:43:37", "owner": "frasescristianas840", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975002433928579, "text": "Get me in google plssssss", "created_at": "2025-09-24T19:00:51", "owner": "emrhns.uzn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882203062389037, "text": "Zepto instamart blinkit", "created_at": "2025-09-21T09:37:06", "owner": "almass.z.s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930340006101127, "text": "Bloody showoff fucked", "created_at": "2025-09-20T07:58:46", "owner": "emo_artiste", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18375538252177260, "text": "😍❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-19T16:07:47", "owner": "syed._33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875737375409570, "text": "I would have 7 million earphones", "created_at": "2025-09-13T08:18:05", "owner": "dishitamukherji", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18514606213001003, "text": "ewaste-buds", "created_at": "2025-08-01T18:16:55", "owner": "casatijacopo", "likes": 19}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["구글", "구글러", "google", "googler", "googlesingapore", "googlesingaporeoffice", "googleoffice", "googleperks", "corporategirl", "corporategirlie", "해외취업", "해외살이", "해외생활", "해외", "동기부여", "자기개발", "싱가포르", "싱가포르취업", "motivation", "selfdevelopment"]},
{"media_id": 3681937182699912602, "shortcode": "DMY3lwkIX2a", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DMY3lwkIX2a/", "taken_at": "2025-07-21T23:40:41", "caption": "You just gotta lock in and you’ll make it🫡\n\n#businesstips #entrepeneur #inapikel #pikel #mindset #businesslifestyle #lockin", "owner_username": "inapikel", "owner_id": "61781359363", "likes": 40658, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0108_DMY3lwkIX2a\\DMY3lwkIX2a_20250721_234041.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17885999871200886, "text": "Or just sell one burger for £36.5 million", "created_at": "2025-07-23T16:52:55", "owner": "mohammedasaria01", "likes": 9732}, {"id": 18056891981374304, "text": "10,000 a day...... dreamer!", "created_at": "2025-08-08T18:35:39", "owner": "shakesandlattes", "likes": 384}, {"id": 17991714893818222, "text": "The maths are mathing 🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-22T06:15:49", "owner": "thehalalfoodfestival", "likes": 159}, {"id": 18054827675411822, "text": "Where you get food trailers from for 3 n hslf grand", "created_at": "2025-08-10T21:39:25", "owner": "billycrawford570", "likes": 27}, {"id": 18039744833352195, "text": "Who the hell is selling 10,000 burgers", "created_at": "2025-07-29T21:50:03", "owner": "a_abdel23", "likes": 2503}, {"id": 17981947400849324, "text": "Time for One Burger: 2.5 minutes per burger.\nTotal Time for 10,000 Burgers (Sequential): 10,000 burgers × 2.5 minutes = 25,000 minutes.\n25,000 minutes ÷ 60 minutes/hour = ~416.67 hours.\n416.67 hours ÷ 24 hours/day = ~17.36 days.\nSo, if the food truck operates 24/7 with no breaks, it would take about 17.4 days to serve 10,000 burgers.", "created_at": "2025-07-24T00:20:00", "owner": "z__buk", "likes": 1705}, {"id": 18089826724680084, "text": "Time Unit\tBurgers Sold\nPer second\t10,000 ÷ 86,400 ≈ 0.116 burgers/second → 1 burger every ~8.64 seconds\nPer minute\t10,000 ÷ 1,440 (minutes in a day) ≈ 6.94 burgers/minute\nPer hour\t10,000 ÷ 24 = 416.67 burgers/hour", "created_at": "2025-07-24T18:19:12", "owner": "madmax.v", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17871218466401283, "text": "10k a day 😂 inshAllah tho akhis", "created_at": "2025-07-22T00:35:46", "owner": "36__247", "likes": 189}, {"id": 17857393863482503, "text": "Bro the current world record for most amount of burgers sold in a day is less than 6,500. No one is selling 10k burgers a day", "created_at": "2025-08-19T22:37:01", "owner": "vintageaerialist", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18124475596413457, "text": "Bro can barely sell 100 a day 🤣🤔", "created_at": "2025-07-22T00:55:17", "owner": "bfc_bruxy", "likes": 213}, {"id": 18277375687275347, "text": "Impossible to sell 10,000 a day from a food truck though. Lucky to sell 500", "created_at": "2025-07-24T10:06:04", "owner": "carleyjones100", "likes": 495}, {"id": 18519680860023562, "text": "You can never sell 10000 in a day", "created_at": "2025-07-23T10:03:33", "owner": "georgechifu", "likes": 523}, {"id": 18027866156686842, "text": "10k burgers a day ????? Is a lot", "created_at": "2025-07-31T13:16:18", "owner": "rinsekid.k", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18131495899395689, "text": "lol it all sounds so easy", "created_at": "2025-08-14T11:23:29", "owner": "nattycancook_", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18072998096149724, "text": "Burgers from kebab shops are £4-£6 these gotta be some top level burgers to be a tenner", "created_at": "2025-09-27T16:08:43", "owner": "ian_cognito118", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18380900929198840, "text": "How about selling the food truck for 36.5 million", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:56:12", "owner": "eroo_ji_ji", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18015862880749176, "text": "Me doing the maths on the calculator to check if £36.5m was right and it was 😂😂😂👏", "created_at": "2025-07-24T11:13:19", "owner": "mattioli78", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17868615420410809, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-23T23:58:01", "owner": "deadly_r3al", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18093933976584461, "text": "don’t forget licenses, supply and wages 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-19T15:54:34", "owner": "j.amz18", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17867482476430721, "text": "10,000 a day! Where the hell you parked up!?", "created_at": "2025-08-21T13:34:14", "owner": "wheelermedicine", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17990485190879650, "text": "Libros Ostrava", "created_at": "2025-12-07T16:59:58", "owner": "dajos._.hradil", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080706872045805, "text": "The food truck costs more than £3500! And where the hell in the uk u can sell 10000 burgers a day 🙄", "created_at": "2025-10-12T15:34:11", "owner": "bristolsneakersntingz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064465106248608, "text": "£10?!! Nope", "created_at": "2025-09-02T09:43:37", "owner": "jools9243", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18181224502335552, "text": "Now find me what van that actually sells 10 000 Burgers in one day. 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-09T10:34:47", "owner": "walid___________1", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18416522209105342, "text": "Impossible to sell 10000 burgers from a food truck", "created_at": "2025-07-24T08:25:26", "owner": "fazilio_official", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18154292827396840, "text": "@bradski lol", "created_at": "2025-10-22T15:25:08", "owner": "chapterandversemusic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397530298139560, "text": "Food trucks are not £3500", "created_at": "2025-07-24T08:24:46", "owner": "fazilio_official", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18074466688996400, "text": "We will supply the buns 🙌", "created_at": "2025-07-31T19:07:04", "owner": "breadaheadbakery", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18352839640094128, "text": "Or, or, or sell 20000 and make $73 million in one year. Thank me later.", "created_at": "2025-08-09T21:43:47", "owner": "retep.lv", "likes": 34}, {"id": 17983521833911765, "text": "That 10 burgers a minute for 16 hours of being open. Not possible!😮", "created_at": "2025-10-08T17:47:53", "owner": "marcyshamburgers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084543658811589, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-24T21:14:41", "owner": "alizan121", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054896840265031, "text": "Where did you buy a food truck so cheap !!", "created_at": "2025-10-11T11:39:00", "owner": "pizzamorepoole", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18126767737411550, "text": "Got a mate who made 36.6 million selling burgers from a van", "created_at": "2025-08-13T21:50:37", "owner": "danielhooperart", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17902860426096148, "text": "U never selling 10k burgers a day u be lucky to sell 50", "created_at": "2025-07-24T13:54:51", "owner": "solsagramz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058737746619389, "text": "Better business plan below:\n1. Steal a food truck\n2. Sell 500 burgers for £200 per burger \n3. Congrats that’s £42,000,000 per year\n\nReinvestment plan once at £42,000,000\n\n1. Steal another food truck\n2. Put this one in another location \n3. Sell 500 burgers for £200 per burger \n4. Congrats you are now on £150,000,000 gross profit per year\n\nSide note: can also charge £50 for condiments such as sauces, onions, pickles, salad etc (PER CONDIMENT WE ARENT RUNNING A CHARITY) \n\nRemember me when you’re rich", "created_at": "2025-09-18T11:02:37", "owner": "v.sixu", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18070055147352089, "text": "What math is that  it’s still a good number but cmon bro your off too much", "created_at": "2025-10-26T01:34:34", "owner": "toni_g7300", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18075415006826386, "text": "More human sweat in them burgers than beef", "created_at": "2025-08-12T11:37:41", "owner": "c.l.11_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18083544475939289, "text": "Jajajajajajajajaja yeah right", "created_at": "2025-10-05T10:25:19", "owner": "themeatbusorlando", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18295500067264332, "text": "If you worked 8 hrs in the day you would need to serve a burger every 2.8 seconds!", "created_at": "2025-09-02T09:56:22", "owner": "cain_tony", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17897310513298124, "text": "10000 a day? :DD", "created_at": "2025-09-15T09:22:50", "owner": "stasdalibor", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18050733074559170, "text": "Love this one", "created_at": "2025-09-17T11:12:55", "owner": "tobiasjamesceo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075910916084829, "text": "Good luck selling a thousand burgers a day, every day and with free ingredients. Have a word with yourself before you allow your self to step out into the real world.", "created_at": "2025-09-16T12:45:08", "owner": "colinmp2003", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094837102578004, "text": "Lol thats 7 burgers in a minute! And then youre working 24/7 no sleep!😂 lock out!😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-01T19:22:24", "owner": "prinsvirr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17995276007816498, "text": "16-20 burgers a minute for 8-10 hours. No problem!", "created_at": "2025-07-23T05:21:14", "owner": "joegilbert8", "likes": 69}, {"id": 17890413969202649, "text": "Then the food truck owner woke up from his sleep and went back to 9 to 5 job hoping he would sell 20k burger next day 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-13T06:40:01", "owner": "salman_s_f_m", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18162808303328826, "text": "You said:\nVan cost (one-off investment): £3,500\nSelling price per burger: £10\nSales per day: 10,000 burgers\n---\n1. Daily Revenue\n10,000 \\times £10 = £100,000 \\; \\text{per day}\n---\n2. Costs to Consider in the UK\nRunning a food van isn’t just selling burgers – there are significant costs:\na) Ingredients (food cost)\nBurgers (meat, bun, salad, cheese, sauces, packaging, etc.).\nIn UK street food, food cost is typically 25–35% of sales.\nLet’s assume 30%:\n£100,000 \\times 30\\% = £30,000\nb) Staff wages\nRunning a van for 10,000 burgers/day would need a big team (multiple vans or a large setup).\nUK minimum wage ≈ £11/hr (2025).\nIf you need ~50 staff working 10-hour shifts:\n50 \\times 10 \\times £11 = £5,500 \\; \\text{per day}\n(Realistically, it could be higher if you pay above minimum or need more staff.)\nc) Overheads\nFuel, rent for pitch, gas/electricity, cleaning, insurance, marketing, etc.\nLet’s assume 5% of sales = £5,000/day.\nd) Taxes (UK Corporation Tax)\nCurrent corporation tax is 25% on profits.\nVAT (20%) also applies if you’re VAT-registered – burgers will be subject to VAT, meaning you must charge £10 including VAT, so the actual revenue is £8.33 net per burger.\nSo really:\n10,000 \\times £8.33 = £83,300 \\; \\text{net daily revenue}\n---\n3. Profit Calculation (Approximate)\nRevenue (excl. VAT): £83,300\nFood cost (30%): –£25,000\nWages: –£5,500\nOverheads: –£5,000\nOperating profit before tax: ≈ £47,800/day\nCorporation tax (25%): –£11,950\nNet profit ≈ £35,850/day\n---\n4. Van Cost Payback\nVan cost = £3,500 (one-off).\nAt £35k profit/day, you’d cover that in about 10 minutes of trading.\n---\n⚠️ Reality Check: Selling 10,000 burgers per day from one van is unrealistic – most vans manage 200–600/day depending on location/events. At 10,000/day, you’d need an industrial-scale operation with multiple vans or a permanent site.", "created_at": "2025-09-10T11:00:55", "owner": "googiexmatt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18164789545369510, "text": "No overheads or other costs just pure profit 😂", "created_at": "2025-09-08T16:03:34", "owner": "john_dmc_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080071802507582, "text": "10000 a day ? Where are you serving??? Army training camp ??", "created_at": "2025-09-01T23:55:56", "owner": "piyushwalia_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17965857695793027, "text": "LOL. Impossible to sell 10000 burgers in 1 day 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-06T15:02:08", "owner": "theburgerbar_sa", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17872924083326163, "text": "Why stop at 10,000? Just sell a million and be set for life. You're welcome, please follow for more financial advice.", "created_at": "2025-09-03T11:13:39", "owner": "_elkaytrading", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077839310062548, "text": "What a load of bollox, who ever posted this hasn’t got a single clue about business obviously", "created_at": "2025-09-02T12:32:34", "owner": "jas00n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18191026579316144, "text": "You wouldn’t sell 10,000 burgers at a full capacity Wembley stadium. 🏟️", "created_at": "2025-08-02T13:01:18", "owner": "davidtoubianofficial", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088400092688375, "text": "Sell 10'000 a day as done me in ya know 😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-12T18:56:25", "owner": "discarda", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17878989576260081, "text": "Who’s buying a burger for a tenner 🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-09T11:46:43", "owner": "harry_sm7", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18371254477199674, "text": "10,000 a day from a van 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-09-01T15:45:27", "owner": "no3restaurant", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17899969845255411, "text": "Where did u buy a food truck for 3500 asking for a friend", "created_at": "2025-08-18T16:41:12", "owner": "dinewithdope", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18153664435380199, "text": "Let say you’r open 14 hours a day, that would be an average of 11 burgers a minute. 🤷🏾‍♂️🤷🏾‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-08-29T18:34:04", "owner": "cura_s3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17940991164020625, "text": "Phuck it,  just sell 20,000 a day and work part time", "created_at": "2025-08-26T15:07:14", "owner": "insta.nab", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18017841077757659, "text": "This guy must never work in a kitchen before.. no food cost, no labour", "created_at": "2025-08-22T05:50:29", "owner": "wuterrance", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087598126653697, "text": "That’s 17 burgers a minute, ten hours a day", "created_at": "2025-08-21T19:12:56", "owner": "euandyer", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17951321048991572, "text": "Never ever will U sell 10,000 burgers in a day 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-21T20:23:40", "owner": "zero0ne10q", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069810998125166, "text": "10k burgers a day. 😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-22T12:28:19", "owner": "eln0n1m0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069519224032847, "text": "It’s actually my dream to do this. I wanna own a food truck and travel the word with my girlfriend @xemmz.19x", "created_at": "2025-07-23T19:12:14", "owner": "r9996002", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18078244798944045, "text": "Employees ,materials and electronic and or gas appliances all cost money", "created_at": "2025-08-19T15:38:07", "owner": "3tan_strrn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18396764698138301, "text": "I wish i could do this! Just started up making sauces and marinades! They’re doing well! #pepperyzest", "created_at": "2025-07-24T14:48:00", "owner": "pepperyzest", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18018714263561213, "text": "10.000 burger in a day, Bro stop watching The Wolf of Wall Street please", "created_at": "2025-08-16T15:56:16", "owner": "manuel_carigi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866600878434496, "text": "Oui! You got a loisense for that truck? Youre under arrest for not employing enough islams.", "created_at": "2025-08-16T23:47:04", "owner": "rickles1999", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18103723561564063, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-26T21:32:53", "owner": "moohatch", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18048806681254827, "text": "Buy a burger. Make 10000 foodtrucks. Voilá", "created_at": "2025-08-16T07:29:36", "owner": "giovannidamontemalbe", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18046417850308667, "text": "You could have a chance at a football match but unlikely", "created_at": "2025-08-16T08:58:16", "owner": "plym.ts", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092758834733760, "text": "Projekt Management at peak!", "created_at": "2025-08-15T20:56:36", "owner": "absentofmind", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18048170237559852, "text": "10,000 a day? Smoking something in the back? Ya, Sure", "created_at": "2025-08-15T02:23:08", "owner": "wakeupitstommorow", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18081552283810182, "text": "Love me daily festivals", "created_at": "2025-08-15T20:50:06", "owner": "skinandbones_studio", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104344426607431, "text": "Why is everyone talking about the logistics when the Maths is wrong? 🤨", "created_at": "2025-08-15T19:06:46", "owner": "sleuth_gang", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069627848132598, "text": "A McDonald’s don’t even sell 10k burgers a day.", "created_at": "2025-08-15T19:30:28", "owner": "dotworkboss", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17918854353113975, "text": "No one talking about buying 10k burger meats and buns", "created_at": "2025-08-15T18:53:25", "owner": "luke.h_is_here", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18283966177275437, "text": "Are those burgers halal 🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-15T01:26:06", "owner": "billyboyscot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903237676233832, "text": "Buying supplies, paying workers, paying bills, finding customers, gaining reputations - and here you are barely to breakeven.", "created_at": "2025-08-14T14:16:49", "owner": "sergiy.kudla", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18133785562439787, "text": "Aint nobody paying £10 for a burger", "created_at": "2025-08-13T13:33:05", "owner": "smithy197488", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072939359079725, "text": "You ain't going to find a food truck that cheap", "created_at": "2025-08-13T14:33:52", "owner": "shawnheatbeats1980", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17852359293500082, "text": "Fun and games till HMRC come for your 36.5 Million 💀", "created_at": "2025-07-25T12:49:50", "owner": "mohhib.khan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17866233084424489, "text": "What abt the expenses? Meat, staff electric,  etc", "created_at": "2025-07-22T02:20:13", "owner": "shazsikander", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17885557590216788, "text": "But how do you get the funds in the first place...", "created_at": "2025-08-12T09:28:39", "owner": "st3ve_b3rry", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095479393626714, "text": "New pizza truck £19,500, Conversion  cost including equipment £40,000 takes 2 months to kit", "created_at": "2025-08-08T10:38:56", "owner": "panik80", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18233989495293205, "text": "Too damn staff for a food truck", "created_at": "2025-08-11T20:49:34", "owner": "pgtipsaretop2andnot2", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18033655004676905, "text": "@cattleandsmoke let’s go halfs 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-26T14:51:36", "owner": "leonw84", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18074912207063640, "text": "So just need a second food truck to store these 10000 burgers and the buns 🤔", "created_at": "2025-07-23T06:42:47", "owner": "d.c.cookie", "likes": 19}, {"id": 17893345752166778, "text": "Yeah right", "created_at": "2025-08-11T09:25:17", "owner": "wesley_derksen_mad_customs_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18288465958250059, "text": "10k day is dreamy 😂🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-11T09:32:55", "owner": "its___mexy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096528178619396, "text": "A burger truck for £3600 😂😂. 10,000a day 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-11T10:32:18", "owner": "darrenfairfax", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077515123946439, "text": "10,000 a day is wild", "created_at": "2025-08-11T02:44:45", "owner": "lordoftherizzlers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057630692365509, "text": "😂😂😂😂 love it 😉", "created_at": "2025-07-22T04:39:52", "owner": "papajifood", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18072025613458292, "text": "Let’s start with just 1000 burgers ok", "created_at": "2025-12-13T20:32:08", "owner": "chailafleur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928572565157437, "text": "Bullshit", "created_at": "2025-12-13T19:02:14", "owner": "maestro.55555", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010166435650504, "text": "Why stop at 10.000 and not sell a zillion.", "created_at": "2025-12-12T17:07:00", "owner": "neechancom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185832835358674, "text": "What food truck is able to kick out 10k burgers a day.", "created_at": "2025-12-11T23:01:07", "owner": "rtdragonstorm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955421895902749, "text": "10.000 a day🤣okay", "created_at": "2025-12-11T20:09:59", "owner": "kershawricky2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543512062030521, "text": "10.000 a day in 1 food truck 😂😂😂🦄", "created_at": "2025-12-11T18:09:35", "owner": "bernonibourg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067934270412050, "text": "10 000 burgers a day from food truck wahahaha", "created_at": "2025-12-11T01:44:47", "owner": "miki_bborojevic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18552966925060474, "text": "That's 7 burgers a minute.", "created_at": "2025-12-10T22:35:49", "owner": "henerz.tv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073233200036536, "text": "10,000? Closing by lunch are we", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:37:20", "owner": "kiwi_fancies_delilah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080710823516137, "text": "How about taxes and paying the city for the spot you park your truck. How about the license and the purchase of your goods to make the product with.", "created_at": "2025-12-10T17:11:48", "owner": "realkevinkm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934906840111040, "text": "10,000 burgers a day?", "created_at": "2025-12-10T16:43:32", "owner": "manlikereds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861614485476236, "text": "What kinda food truck is for $3500", "created_at": "2025-12-10T06:41:00", "owner": "thesuavesoul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18300851677258498, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T04:44:51", "owner": "flooring24hoursservice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925983262158416, "text": "Bull 💩", "created_at": "2025-12-10T02:59:13", "owner": "chefsdinnertable", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18388346023181188, "text": "Lazy, sell 20,000 and bang; that’s double. If only McDonalds workers realised this", "created_at": "2025-12-09T23:12:13", "owner": "stephenisabadinfluencer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979561476933688, "text": "10k in 5 years lol", "created_at": "2025-12-09T20:29:00", "owner": "waltervettese", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079420670464706, "text": "Selling a burger every 4 second is easy... you guys are weak 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T17:11:09", "owner": "mehdiii_dahmani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993720711896032, "text": "10000 aday lol", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:18:47", "owner": "frankbrett43", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108486847621596, "text": "And if you save a dollar a day for a year you will have approximately 30 thousand dollars.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T04:11:36", "owner": "bignick566", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094540826308633, "text": "Whaat 10.000 on day...Are you fucking Crazy", "created_at": "2025-12-08T23:42:46", "owner": "mirre31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033450437731889, "text": "Bull shit", "created_at": "2025-12-08T22:59:16", "owner": "7meatball6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118967215487981, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂10k a day 😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T22:33:16", "owner": "justproductions_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069434318096719, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T22:32:10", "owner": "otto.moto.multiverse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898265140348524, "text": "How i laundering money 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T20:45:51", "owner": "huese1010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034843553527038, "text": "10.000 burgers a day? U kidding me. I ought to live in Mumbai to achieve this selling rate😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T08:21:23", "owner": "mirzajonov_hasanboy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095412925857387, "text": "Think you 3 to many cooks", "created_at": "2025-12-07T20:52:27", "owner": "daheebman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159762253397270, "text": "Why not sell a 100,000 burgers instead and make 10x. 😎", "created_at": "2025-12-07T19:13:39", "owner": "thegourmetranch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008522366815371, "text": "10000 per Day yep! 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T14:11:47", "owner": "ep_mada", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18191566468337059, "text": "10,000 a day?? Burgers or onion pieces???", "created_at": "2025-12-07T10:24:09", "owner": "cheemasubhan699", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867808420498104, "text": "It’s not as easy as buying a food truck", "created_at": "2025-12-07T06:32:20", "owner": "lem554", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112300294466910, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-21T07:18:42", "owner": "_trailblazer911", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18151523881383148, "text": "where can I find a 3500£ food truck bro? 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-21T06:54:34", "owner": "don.baltini", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18354870484085455, "text": "10000 burgers a day😂", "created_at": "2025-08-21T06:33:20", "owner": "renaud_ignace", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153767077383357, "text": "£10 per burger ?? 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-21T04:51:59", "owner": "notwirehangers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966717321794604, "text": "Even one McDonald's restaurant can't flip 10,000 burgers a day 😂 You want to inspire people with numbers, but you can't do a simple logical calculation😂", "created_at": "2025-08-21T03:32:37", "owner": "damihaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957658182988991, "text": "10,000 / 10 hours lets say = 1000 burger in one hour non stop or 16,7 burgers in one minute \nBro i know everyone likes to be viral but this one even the mental patient will not buy it 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-21T01:36:30", "owner": "userunknown.112233", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073383493866079, "text": "Who is selling one for 3.5k?", "created_at": "2025-08-20T23:58:14", "owner": "conbaggo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857212318436512, "text": "10,000 burgers a day get fked no chance stop dribbling 💩", "created_at": "2025-08-20T23:36:55", "owner": "robertcrossway", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076309237961560, "text": "GUD BUT ALSO ADD SOME FEMALE. STAFF", "created_at": "2025-08-20T22:05:07", "owner": "waki26_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152767981377529, "text": "Crapola.", "created_at": "2025-08-20T21:12:17", "owner": "goldlex1963", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977249724751276, "text": "10.000 a day🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-20T19:49:40", "owner": "tjsoundsmusic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041895995365171, "text": "10.000 burgers a day are big numbers", "created_at": "2025-08-20T19:06:37", "owner": "h_lako", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959020551992230, "text": "What about food cost , rental , taxes, workers , supply , electricity, gas, and margin ,accounting , its all for free yeah !", "created_at": "2025-08-20T19:02:38", "owner": "ameerzubedat12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054584693159164, "text": "10,000 a day. Lol... 🙄", "created_at": "2025-08-20T18:57:24", "owner": "philnewis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18386258983121151, "text": "Great maff", "created_at": "2025-08-20T18:27:40", "owner": "justinxbatchelor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18260030587303392, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-08-20T18:25:06", "owner": "nycorkr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090369874742481, "text": "Just sitting here doing a mental costing for this 🤔", "created_at": "2025-08-20T17:50:11", "owner": "dub.patrick.f", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087122542833772, "text": "Who the fuck Sells 10 k burgers a day", "created_at": "2025-08-20T17:45:04", "owner": "yannick.jozef.catherina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876813250393692, "text": "Maybe he wanted to say 10000$ and also the amount would 3650000 per year", "created_at": "2025-08-20T14:58:01", "owner": "fardinehussen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093854050588834, "text": "Lets say you work 12 hours a day . And lets say that 1 burger takes 1 minute to be made. That means that you made 720 burgers", "created_at": "2025-08-20T13:37:22", "owner": "g.apostologiorgakis_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964489443953198, "text": "Bullshit , the guy that create that possible never been inside a kitchen", "created_at": "2025-08-20T10:58:57", "owner": "apothikabay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896452591273073, "text": "🤣🤣🤣now post every single cost associated with that and give us the profit.", "created_at": "2025-08-20T04:23:29", "owner": "theniueanjourney274", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857393863482503, "text": "Bro the current world record for most amount of burgers sold in a day is less than 6,500. No one is selling 10k burgers a day", "created_at": "2025-08-19T22:37:01", "owner": "vintageaerialist", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18140896450421636, "text": "STFU", "created_at": "2025-08-19T22:25:24", "owner": "andy.craven12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843915235548592, "text": "We don’t have the same math , maybe that’s the reason you can only work at a food truck ; lean math first or go back to school", "created_at": "2025-08-19T22:06:30", "owner": "the.johnny.mercier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069191216126720, "text": "Take that naff math biz plan to the bank … see if they divvy up! But yeah … be realistic on the projections, get the kit for 3.5k … aim for 500 sales a day??? 5k a day. 25k a five day week. Your “days off” … suppliers, etc. and why make all that cash without a rest day?", "created_at": "2025-08-19T20:55:02", "owner": "cottontownsound", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076285810960747, "text": "Just Sell 100k a day that will be 365 million better sell 1 million a day and elon musk will ask you for money within 10 years", "created_at": "2025-08-19T20:35:47", "owner": "jonathan_19il", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073508297073500, "text": "You forgot about taxes", "created_at": "2025-08-19T17:55:23", "owner": "dante.nikolas77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124209169486942, "text": "10k burgers a day in a food truck?  Good luck", "created_at": "2025-08-19T17:54:55", "owner": "somethinelse79", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18300977593221584, "text": "Time to buy some school classes with that money 🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-19T17:24:32", "owner": "luukschulte", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896772571146082, "text": "Do the 3.6 million beef burgers come free with the truck ?", "created_at": "2025-08-19T16:03:55", "owner": "the_gambling_monkey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093933976584461, "text": "don’t forget licenses, supply and wages 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-19T15:54:34", "owner": "j.amz18", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18078244798944045, "text": "Employees ,materials and electronic and or gas appliances all cost money", "created_at": "2025-08-19T15:38:07", "owner": "3tan_strrn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17975874914916982, "text": "Not even burger king sell 10,000 burgers a day", "created_at": "2025-08-19T15:02:36", "owner": "certainmuel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020713556549571, "text": "And people get paid nothing?🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-19T13:10:10", "owner": "lekkerevenkijken", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058303145593566, "text": "10,000 burgers a day 😂 😂 This post epitomises the stupidity of Instagram.", "created_at": "2025-08-19T13:05:37", "owner": "carliarno87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054285710408776, "text": "Shut up you cunt", "created_at": "2025-08-19T11:14:47", "owner": "mgw__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086191108667867, "text": "Factor in how much I hate being a cook . And we back to zero dollars. See it's more complex than you cleverly thought.", "created_at": "2025-08-19T09:50:24", "owner": "shadowbannedking", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057359195113168, "text": "Why is the burger going for 10£ ?", "created_at": "2025-08-19T09:03:48", "owner": "craigchiggx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18310226788245105, "text": "Why not  Selling 100.000 burgers a day and makind 365 milliion in a year ? Whats stopping us at 10k burgers?", "created_at": "2025-08-19T05:53:34", "owner": "melih_sabancioglu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860287858412850, "text": "Err thr maths don't add up...😂", "created_at": "2025-08-19T05:20:03", "owner": "paulwhosintofitness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088714879695326, "text": "I bet your burgers are as shit as your logic", "created_at": "2025-08-19T03:10:13", "owner": "jacoboddesty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18351802501080125, "text": "10,000 a day its a bit much mate maybe 200-500 sounds fair", "created_at": "2025-08-19T03:05:20", "owner": "blakedoyle55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127257898415873, "text": "10,000 per day. Yep 👍", "created_at": "2025-08-19T02:40:09", "owner": "jamierhoose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968411238940290, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-08-19T02:32:45", "owner": "marouf_palestine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156384631378213, "text": "10k hamburgers a day😂", "created_at": "2025-08-19T01:15:19", "owner": "johnny_shaw13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094144951630766, "text": "America…….", "created_at": "2025-08-18T23:09:32", "owner": "pomegranate_mom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353261167086636, "text": "Thats 5 times more than the average mcdonalds restaurant sells a day. You really think youre gonna outsell a franchise that has 15 employees in it at all times, a drive through, delivery orders, walk in orders, and on top of that theyre also cheaper and their burgers are pre cooked. Good luck.", "created_at": "2025-08-18T23:02:29", "owner": "elliotstorer10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958061193974413, "text": "May Allah give yall the wealth Amin.", "created_at": "2025-08-18T22:28:11", "owner": "alhashimito", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899266333266414, "text": "Or do it 100 a day get the 365.000 mark pay rent , tax , products , personal , unexpected costs and stay with the 1/5 win ratio which is an amazing ratio 70.000+ a year \n\nGood job 👍", "created_at": "2025-08-18T22:08:50", "owner": "jimkallis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030790028697622, "text": "Math much?", "created_at": "2025-08-18T21:53:51", "owner": "rsmith1843", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18163506664371636, "text": "None of that math is anywhere close to real.\nThere’s no fucking way you’re serving 10,000 burgers a day", "created_at": "2025-08-18T20:52:54", "owner": "prishaug", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085859785662776, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-18T20:45:23", "owner": "margaritisrossios", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969018639942273, "text": "Who is Going to  but Burger for £10 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-18T20:41:49", "owner": "visiontovictory_ig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975870441756606, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-18T20:25:32", "owner": "happiness172824", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075738634970623, "text": "Not even fking mcdonalds sells 10k hamburger in a day", "created_at": "2025-08-18T20:17:51", "owner": "sinaestethic_blur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18358492456154441, "text": "There’s ton of research that restaurant businesses have one of the smallest margins", "created_at": "2025-08-18T19:55:17", "owner": "folasalami_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081500215927745, "text": "👏or 5 a day then take a nap", "created_at": "2025-08-18T19:47:13", "owner": "burgerdogboy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111743347521912, "text": "10,000 a day ha ha ha ha ha", "created_at": "2025-08-18T19:18:04", "owner": "falbie79", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896747746272682, "text": "You would have to have supplies  stacked up around the block for 10k burgers", "created_at": "2025-08-18T18:49:21", "owner": "heath__smith", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857589400481261, "text": "Aiming low. If you sell 1 million’s burgers a day, that’s 3.65 billion per year.", "created_at": "2025-08-18T16:44:08", "owner": "adstjj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899969845255411, "text": "Where did u buy a food truck for 3500 asking for a friend", "created_at": "2025-08-18T16:41:12", "owner": "dinewithdope", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18021128771738275, "text": "Is it halal? If so, I’ll leave it.", "created_at": "2025-08-18T16:22:33", "owner": "dbaf.c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064652897240099, "text": "Make education great again", "created_at": "2025-08-18T12:52:10", "owner": "jairjanga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117043273497935, "text": "10,000 a day unless it's a franchise and well known + cost of living crisis location ect can be hard with targets like that maybe 10000 a week at first more realistic even than now is hard with cost of living", "created_at": "2025-08-18T12:24:57", "owner": "cboynw3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142231849414517, "text": "10,000 burgers ÷ 12 hours = ~833 burgers/hour 833 ÷ 60 minutes = ~14 burgers/minute\nThat means a burger needs to leave the window every 4 seconds.\nThis is McDonald’s factory mode, not a casual grill setup.", "created_at": "2025-08-18T06:56:32", "owner": "saarsvi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054719516425794, "text": "Just selling a casual 10k a day no big deal", "created_at": "2025-08-18T06:54:12", "owner": "lee.irl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089268970744490, "text": "Im mot paying $10 for a mystery meat burger", "created_at": "2025-08-18T06:47:37", "owner": "arcade_retro_junkie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957813621987127, "text": "Why not get 79 trucks and make 5 gazillion a month?", "created_at": "2025-08-18T06:31:57", "owner": "mindauuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092406229732681, "text": "#nothingbeatsajet2holiday", "created_at": "2025-08-18T06:18:32", "owner": "dj_young_einstein", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940050289047470, "text": "Thats 4t of burgers or 1t of pattys. Gonna be difficult to store 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-18T05:57:27", "owner": "alexwayne90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968549394956380, "text": "Yes, I'm sure your ingredients, raw material and staff cost nothing.", "created_at": "2025-08-18T00:26:49", "owner": "1angrymonkey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068709019937798, "text": "You sell 1000 a day at max", "created_at": "2025-08-17T23:34:31", "owner": "krinkiespijer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087289795835307, "text": "No food truck has ever sold 10,000 burgers in a day", "created_at": "2025-08-17T23:15:12", "owner": "willywonka2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918368638153162, "text": "More like 100 a day, 300 on a busy day", "created_at": "2025-08-17T21:45:25", "owner": "luke.m.jpg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892019491297147, "text": "Oh yeah 14 burgers a minute for 12 hours..... come onnn at least post something realistic", "created_at": "2025-08-17T19:48:13", "owner": "jess_sanderson1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056142257124593, "text": "I love how stupid the world has become", "created_at": "2025-08-17T19:15:45", "owner": "takdawg183", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18289598611270071, "text": "Where is truck for 3500?", "created_at": "2025-08-17T19:03:39", "owner": "kodkugle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18287105602250597, "text": "Not profit that’s turnover", "created_at": "2025-08-17T18:25:10", "owner": "realisteppa4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944226202011424, "text": "If we are already dreaming...let's sell 10,000 pizza (8 slices) a day", "created_at": "2025-08-17T17:19:11", "owner": "nirsagi1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918978886116729, "text": "@davidsteed1987 com on lad", "created_at": "2025-08-17T17:18:19", "owner": "d_a_s88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041413502350251, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-17T17:11:33", "owner": "ghost_on_the_block", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047470295295250, "text": "😆 love these posts...just do this unrealistic thing and you'll be a millionaire", "created_at": "2025-08-17T16:11:51", "owner": "buckerz_87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051261110542048, "text": "3500??!?🤣🤣🤣 Are you kidding??!😀😀😀", "created_at": "2025-08-17T16:00:58", "owner": "iampavlo_delo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017458760571630, "text": "Just go to McDonald’s", "created_at": "2025-08-17T15:31:03", "owner": "notanotherpic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933588559084621, "text": "Milchmädchen glänzt mit Rechenkünsten...", "created_at": "2025-08-17T15:22:53", "owner": "bernd_der_seewolf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073404314489710, "text": "How is the maths in the US so bad.", "created_at": "2025-08-17T14:08:52", "owner": "jjmwfw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18497041459071850, "text": "10 000 a day. 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-17T13:56:10", "owner": "misterjames21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925307737102039, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-17T13:42:22", "owner": "adrian7.21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18380084917121922, "text": "No bro just sell 1 million burgers in 1 day", "created_at": "2025-08-17T12:13:31", "owner": "jibbe51_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981123942734281, "text": "Staff costs, pitch rent?", "created_at": "2025-08-17T12:05:25", "owner": "instakunty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088979020782708, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂 just no", "created_at": "2025-08-17T10:50:08", "owner": "the_lonely_farmerv2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001880837802085, "text": "ROFL BULLSHIT!", "created_at": "2025-08-17T10:16:39", "owner": "thepureenglishman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18150735160402441, "text": "And where you finding a food truck for 3500k???", "created_at": "2025-08-17T09:16:53", "owner": "ardmusicupdates", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950368131875119, "text": "American math for sure.", "created_at": "2025-08-17T08:50:23", "owner": "soboro_horotonogo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993958671819868, "text": "Are you for real….. 10,000/- a day. 🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-17T08:47:23", "owner": "design_by_tq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069112622146050, "text": "No it isn’t", "created_at": "2025-08-17T07:47:23", "owner": "mando_rider", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035329988478021, "text": "10k a day 🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-17T07:18:52", "owner": "pokedonsd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18170746369357744, "text": "What about including the cost of ingredients too 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-17T06:36:52", "owner": "rohanmikaelsamad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089038306695944, "text": "Absolutely moronic post", "created_at": "2025-08-17T05:32:36", "owner": "articmonkibeatanorexia90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070732529167519, "text": "Wtf someone can't do simple maths", "created_at": "2025-08-17T05:31:37", "owner": "articmonkibeatanorexia90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052141163410571, "text": "The math ain’t mathing in terms of hours in a day and time it takes to serve a burger.", "created_at": "2025-08-17T04:09:47", "owner": "gary2qing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903149065240032, "text": "How much did the meat and buns cost? How much did the labor cost? How much did the electricity or natural gas cost? What kind of liberal BS post is this?", "created_at": "2025-08-17T04:01:32", "owner": "thejaygivan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18291285931264893, "text": "The pure stupidity of these figures", "created_at": "2025-08-17T02:34:50", "owner": "bo87killer1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073295528002415, "text": "Its not about how many burgers you can cook an hour. It's all about how many customers you can attract in that hour!", "created_at": "2025-08-17T01:21:54", "owner": "jonathanelderfield", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866600878434496, "text": "Oui! You got a loisense for that truck? Youre under arrest for not employing enough islams.", "created_at": "2025-08-16T23:47:04", "owner": "rickles1999", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063037286020482, "text": "First learn math before posting garbage and drink real coffee", "created_at": "2025-08-16T23:23:17", "owner": "minersdencoffee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920051866017560, "text": "Yes ghosts will come n buy the 10,000 a day ode", "created_at": "2025-08-16T22:11:10", "owner": "doubleprinz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084506728846454, "text": "I dont even have 10k people in mu city", "created_at": "2025-08-16T22:11:01", "owner": "_alexandercarlone_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078399898758105, "text": "Absolute dribble.", "created_at": "2025-08-16T20:37:44", "owner": "cappa_e_spada", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18189037738320953, "text": "Where the FUCK are you selling 10k burgers a day, every day, for 365 days...", "created_at": "2025-08-16T20:15:17", "owner": "t_a_1_9_9_4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18499397104068200, "text": "Learn some math. 10,000 burgers a day is about 417 burgers per hour, in a 24 hour period. 🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-16T19:15:19", "owner": "dirti3.casa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049708913246176, "text": "What a load of bullocks", "created_at": "2025-08-16T19:11:48", "owner": "skellybrickwork4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851887204479941, "text": "Just sell a single burger for 1,000,000. Thats 365,000,000 per year. Hash tag passive income", "created_at": "2025-08-16T18:38:32", "owner": "mycrosoftcontinsr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109124125543537, "text": "10000 a day 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-16T17:47:40", "owner": "giftzbydezign1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093086773631208, "text": "Getting my truck soon here in Africa", "created_at": "2025-08-16T17:28:13", "owner": "dundeal_fitness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103389424572087, "text": "Who is going to a burger van to buy a burger at 10 pounds and then you need 10l customers per day. I don't think so", "created_at": "2025-08-16T17:16:30", "owner": "joe.winterburn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018714263561213, "text": "10.000 burger in a day, Bro stop watching The Wolf of Wall Street please", "created_at": "2025-08-16T15:56:16", "owner": "manuel_carigi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085484839854988, "text": "If you don’t pay your staff, you‘ll earn even more. ☝🏻", "created_at": "2025-08-16T15:51:18", "owner": "blueshift24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18356638741158935, "text": "Classic Arab lie", "created_at": "2025-08-16T14:57:54", "owner": "mosheufnick", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885476989220440, "text": "10k a day ? 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-16T14:57:08", "owner": "mosheufnick", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068720075140553, "text": "£10er.  Fk sake see how thin they are? 😮", "created_at": "2025-08-16T14:30:49", "owner": "tastefulcrow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18326872006231245, "text": "Rechne mal lieber mit 300 Burger pro Tag", "created_at": "2025-08-16T14:06:33", "owner": "schwabo2023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103440514573353, "text": "How ya gonna sell 10,000 a day ffs", "created_at": "2025-08-16T14:05:15", "owner": "butchmeister80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009512147612572, "text": "Thats a a burger every 8/9 seconds for 24 hours straight", "created_at": "2025-08-16T13:52:38", "owner": "djswear_word", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18529164946008200, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-16T13:33:20", "owner": "fama_elegance_watch_store", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063781901208735, "text": "Sell 1 burger for $100m ya scrub 💀 what are you even doing with your life", "created_at": "2025-08-16T11:39:52", "owner": "z.enziie", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18330519640207583, "text": "This idiocy in just one post 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-16T10:53:25", "owner": "redzaien", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054842258152904, "text": "Dude, you re my hero", "created_at": "2025-08-16T10:52:51", "owner": "the_oreli1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041623685358268, "text": "Where did you see a fully equipped food truck with all the cooking equipment for only 3500 usd?", "created_at": "2025-08-16T09:53:37", "owner": "adelyan.kh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079189439502423, "text": "Let’s just forget all the legal agreements you need 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-16T09:48:45", "owner": "clearwaytransport", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093339424584481, "text": "How stupid is this post?", "created_at": "2025-08-16T09:17:01", "owner": "framaggiore78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075392411094565, "text": "Please send me DM I’ll pay you BTC for more of your secrets also I am Prince of Zambia", "created_at": "2025-08-16T09:10:12", "owner": "dk_sw7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046417850308667, "text": "You could have a chance at a football match but unlikely", "created_at": "2025-08-16T08:58:16", "owner": "plym.ts", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18038733461400937, "text": "Illegal s,working there", "created_at": "2025-08-16T07:40:30", "owner": "ssteve777777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048806681254827, "text": "Buy a burger. Make 10000 foodtrucks. Voilá", "created_at": "2025-08-16T07:29:36", "owner": "giovannidamontemalbe", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18176702374340515, "text": "Or you can just piss off with your ridiculous calculations 🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-16T06:29:05", "owner": "s3b5ki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989772063751814, "text": "Ooooh taxes are going to crush this company with those math skills 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-16T01:42:39", "owner": "justcinder1919", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037922891418544, "text": "You can sell maximun 600 per days, if you have a non stop rush of 5 hours per days, everydays. Including the rainning days, the cold days and the others bad days... 👎 Stop spreading falses informations", "created_at": "2025-08-16T00:28:40", "owner": "hau_kalima_brossard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026000036708740, "text": "Pretty sure you don't have 79 customers at the same times, all the times.", "created_at": "2025-08-16T00:25:39", "owner": "hau_kalima_brossard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051132134232685, "text": "Wer kommt und kauft 10000Burger ? Hast sehr überzogenen Vorstellungen was für wie viele Kunden kommen schon garnichts bei 10£", "created_at": "2025-08-15T23:42:18", "owner": "olliverreichmann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18528418789019463, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-15T23:32:08", "owner": "rodrigofookingsantos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092137225679242, "text": "I want a burger van", "created_at": "2025-08-15T22:35:13", "owner": "jodiebunnyrealsofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068318675136779, "text": "10,000 a day 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-15T22:20:21", "owner": "martinchivers1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852454900515486, "text": "10k a day 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-15T22:00:31", "owner": "aperfglgore", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889662922336620, "text": "Why not sell a million a day…!? Just as realistic….! 🤦‍♂️😂", "created_at": "2025-08-15T21:59:45", "owner": "rob.blackwell.5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353034061087599, "text": "10000 burgers a day 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-15T21:56:53", "owner": "thomaswright731", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092758834733760, "text": "Projekt Management at peak!", "created_at": "2025-08-15T20:56:36", "owner": "absentofmind", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100562896522871, "text": "That's like 20 milion £ in taxes though", "created_at": "2025-08-15T20:51:02", "owner": "skinandbones_studio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058541582580706, "text": ".", "created_at": "2025-08-15T20:51:02", "owner": "skinandbones_studio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081552283810182, "text": "Love me daily festivals", "created_at": "2025-08-15T20:50:06", "owner": "skinandbones_studio", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17876240274283899, "text": "Or sell them for £20 and do it in 6 months?", "created_at": "2025-08-15T20:10:15", "owner": "lennonmccartneyharrisonstarr9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069627848132598, "text": "A McDonald’s don’t even sell 10k burgers a day.", "created_at": "2025-08-15T19:30:28", "owner": "dotworkboss", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104344426607431, "text": "Why is everyone talking about the logistics when the Maths is wrong? 🤨", "created_at": "2025-08-15T19:06:46", "owner": "sleuth_gang", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18022837331723428, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-15T19:01:42", "owner": "ivona_s_trendl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049561916547690, "text": "Why, when i sell 50000 hotdogs a minue and earn 3794040040r4055yeye63673737483383 a day", "created_at": "2025-08-15T18:58:24", "owner": "onghee.papa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918854353113975, "text": "No one talking about buying 10k burger meats and buns", "created_at": "2025-08-15T18:53:25", "owner": "luke.h_is_here", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17865278622374820, "text": "Another stupid clickbait video", "created_at": "2025-08-15T18:36:00", "owner": "nikulpatel2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044550755327066, "text": "The best thing is, you don't have to pay wages, taxes, the truck, the energy, the ingredients,....", "created_at": "2025-08-15T18:23:45", "owner": "gunnarstrandt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056541581374011, "text": "What idiot thinks you can sell 10000 burgers a day!", "created_at": "2025-08-15T18:22:53", "owner": "raveuntilidie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059865683077433, "text": "Show me where you can buy a food trailer for £3500??", "created_at": "2025-08-15T17:17:28", "owner": "elricosuaves", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119813500492286, "text": "Only if you buy my online course for $499.95", "created_at": "2025-08-15T15:47:56", "owner": "adizamfir7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068115548128981, "text": "Charging gas staff fuel costs do not include this man", "created_at": "2025-08-15T15:42:47", "owner": "marcodeboeff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028249040687724, "text": "Selling ration food as a full meal,", "created_at": "2025-08-15T15:29:52", "owner": "jaysummers92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978453597904425, "text": "10000 a day 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-15T14:48:55", "owner": "brasilocoleo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857575168475946, "text": "How long would it take to grill 6 million?", "created_at": "2025-08-15T13:42:52", "owner": "i._bajram", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098350945611839, "text": "way too many staff", "created_at": "2025-08-15T13:38:00", "owner": "grignoterwaffle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889900867325076, "text": "Bullshit post", "created_at": "2025-08-15T13:27:32", "owner": "machorz84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917501962154954, "text": "Too many people. Floor is dirty. Come one we can do better. Ps 10k burgers", "created_at": "2025-08-15T13:18:49", "owner": "marcus62000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938506687060403, "text": "7 burgers pr.minute 24/7 from a food-truck 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-15T12:10:42", "owner": "orjanmeloy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888805855323112, "text": "Or move to Dubai, and sell one or 2 burgers for the same profit...😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-15T12:07:54", "owner": "bdarchstudio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072331262478225, "text": "Whoever came up with the math go back to elementary school and learn the basics.", "created_at": "2025-08-15T11:56:29", "owner": "ppantzari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088011148834093, "text": "No one is selling 10000 burgers a day. Wtf you even talking bout. 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-15T11:49:20", "owner": "bananasheath", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072047807108133, "text": "10 for one Burger ?", "created_at": "2025-08-15T11:38:55", "owner": "gth3908", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867820885356406, "text": "10,000 a day!! 🤦🤦 so stupid", "created_at": "2025-08-15T09:03:54", "owner": "mik3_tee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845087779550851, "text": "😂😂no one ever sold that many from a van", "created_at": "2025-08-15T06:51:53", "owner": "cambercustom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048170237559852, "text": "10,000 a day? Smoking something in the back? Ya, Sure", "created_at": "2025-08-15T02:23:08", "owner": "wakeupitstommorow", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17920624284015102, "text": "Bro sales is 100k", "created_at": "2025-08-15T01:43:55", "owner": "darkweargt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123815020472066, "text": "Ten pound for a burger. Jog on...", "created_at": "2025-08-15T01:42:54", "owner": "dazmanaka_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893280676290750, "text": "Bellend", "created_at": "2025-08-15T01:32:09", "owner": "kimpossible636846", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18283966177275437, "text": "Are those burgers halal 🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-15T01:26:06", "owner": "billyboyscot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852341941517378, "text": "1000 a day every day mmm", "created_at": "2025-08-15T01:24:51", "owner": "genuinejulian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018860729560750, "text": "Are you 8 years old? 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-14T23:31:26", "owner": "tfgcph", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063788672225557, "text": "B.S.", "created_at": "2025-08-14T23:08:46", "owner": "2saltysarges", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038232851666082, "text": "🥱", "created_at": "2025-08-14T23:01:18", "owner": "idude24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049219541629975, "text": "Rookie numbers.", "created_at": "2025-08-14T22:06:34", "owner": "raymond.tuite", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934661029063879, "text": "10k?", "created_at": "2025-08-14T20:58:14", "owner": "radelic_packe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850434952532827, "text": "Do you know how much sales 10K a day is!\nI don’t think you know!", "created_at": "2025-08-14T20:47:40", "owner": "vloratvitija", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984266775717729, "text": "God forbid you are in charge of a business", "created_at": "2025-08-14T20:13:52", "owner": "hally250", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18516850906047362, "text": "Proof that basic maths.... doesn't qualify you for basic business", "created_at": "2025-08-14T19:40:23", "owner": "radio_controlled.co.uk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959781141977208, "text": "In other words, a great money laundering opportunity", "created_at": "2025-08-14T19:29:50", "owner": "halfdan59", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063107021202740, "text": "Who (other than McDonalds) is selling 10,000 burgers per day. My sister has a food truck and barely breaks even, and on top of that she grafts like fuck!", "created_at": "2025-08-14T19:29:19", "owner": "archinanga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18235991236295409, "text": "10000 a day 😂 You morons 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-14T19:15:23", "owner": "paultully.safari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903486928228724, "text": "Mcdonalds don't sell 10,000 so how is a food truck🤔", "created_at": "2025-08-14T18:57:04", "owner": "algarveian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853651150508850, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣 ya youll be lucky to sell 10 burgers a day", "created_at": "2025-08-14T18:37:58", "owner": "ivandaterrible23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856133785487452, "text": "Lmao.", "created_at": "2025-08-14T18:25:00", "owner": "poteytang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072664360852735, "text": "You also need to buy 10,000 burger ingredients to start with up front. And that’s just a for a days work. So let’s say you order weekly, you need to have the cash for 70,000 burgers in pocket. So like what, 120k… on top of the cost of the burger van", "created_at": "2025-08-14T18:18:06", "owner": "__nekzy__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069128189155543, "text": "Just 10000 a day… don’t be lazy sell 1000000 a day instead", "created_at": "2025-08-14T18:06:37", "owner": "lijies_daddy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906164395090249, "text": "Who the fuck is gona pay £10 for a shitty burger", "created_at": "2025-08-14T16:57:40", "owner": "leighmowat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020867795538773, "text": "Not even a McDonald’s is selling 10,000 burgers a day 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-14T15:57:16", "owner": "sunsetbeach_vibe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056197181527151, "text": "17 burgers/min if they work 10 hours a day", "created_at": "2025-08-14T15:37:19", "owner": "ulf.travel_777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041273846355660, "text": "10,000 burgers a day. I somehow doubt it.", "created_at": "2025-08-14T15:14:56", "owner": "steve_searle67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903237676233832, "text": "Buying supplies, paying workers, paying bills, finding customers, gaining reputations - and here you are barely to breakeven.", "created_at": "2025-08-14T14:16:49", "owner": "sergiy.kudla", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17890468656317493, "text": "Bro forgot the insane tax cut", "created_at": "2025-08-14T14:04:43", "owner": "l.mc.johnson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968270409944713, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-14T13:58:23", "owner": "michaeldufourvoetmann70", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051508646564568, "text": "The things you put in burgers are not free 😭. And employees", "created_at": "2025-08-14T13:54:13", "owner": "marcii008_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18181712878328687, "text": "Just got a loan for a cattle ranch and abetoire cut out the middle man, if I slaughter 5 cows a day and  buy a bull work him 24 hours a day in a cow brothel I could have a never ending stream of beef", "created_at": "2025-08-14T13:17:00", "owner": "ch4sing_sunsets", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068109049899417, "text": "10k a day 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-14T12:32:09", "owner": "dongbigdaddylong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048637952536121, "text": "6 million burgers?", "created_at": "2025-08-14T12:10:12", "owner": "realjasbir.mattu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051031871224950, "text": "I want to buy a food truck for 3500", "created_at": "2025-08-14T12:04:09", "owner": "robertomatys", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091739341678377, "text": "Ok so how big are your burgers? 5ounce smashed? Okay not you gotta buy enough meat to make 10k burgers, of wait. Buns. Sauces. Tools for making the burgers, you putting salad in them? Fries? Baskets and take out containers. Disposable cutlery, napkins, fuel for the truck and the grill. Are all the cooking equipment and utility included in the food truck price? Insurance, staff wages, your wages, licences, training. Don't talk about opening a business like its a quick loan from the bank and your set by dinner time", "created_at": "2025-08-14T11:40:37", "owner": "jaysamateurboxingclub", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920560240135492, "text": "Doesn't work like this...", "created_at": "2025-08-14T11:34:08", "owner": "masha__akimova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131495899395689, "text": "lol it all sounds so easy", "created_at": "2025-08-14T11:23:29", "owner": "nattycancook_", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17920738233129954, "text": "Just sell 1 million a day…idiot.", "created_at": "2025-08-14T11:22:06", "owner": "jazzper74", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18514830397016214, "text": "If you work a bit harder and sell 100.000 a day you make 356 million", "created_at": "2025-08-14T11:14:39", "owner": "thierryvth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052117610560684, "text": "10,000 a day is crazy", "created_at": "2025-08-14T11:10:54", "owner": "silentak_47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073382522077655, "text": "Why dont you sell 20.000 a day for double profit? Think big!", "created_at": "2025-08-14T10:41:11", "owner": "denn.fri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859396624469478, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-14T09:57:33", "owner": "bushy1901", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910958878083663, "text": "10.000 a day😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-14T09:25:48", "owner": "freddy_180_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892150111296506, "text": "10k burgers means i should park the food truck at winn dixie parking lot to buy buns and meat", "created_at": "2025-08-14T05:52:25", "owner": "oiceeee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961736043959688, "text": "Except you sell 100 a day 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-14T03:36:38", "owner": "shaneormianer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087600127786307, "text": "Lol. Where's the food cost, permits, wages and all the other hidden costs", "created_at": "2025-08-14T03:26:30", "owner": "no_timetocook", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087077527745402, "text": "That many burgers a day ffs instagramban these fools", "created_at": "2025-08-14T02:44:56", "owner": "rhysman87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935999299065508, "text": "Dumb ass fuck nobody sell t", "created_at": "2025-08-14T02:44:37", "owner": "rhysman87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096551338621696, "text": "Can breathe cant move dont care", "created_at": "2025-08-14T02:15:53", "owner": "creator.cody", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979553250904798, "text": "10000 yeah of course", "created_at": "2025-08-14T01:07:20", "owner": "patrick_olowrey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856156387494632, "text": "You won’t be in business long with this math.", "created_at": "2025-08-14T00:30:42", "owner": "balkowitsch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982918875853705, "text": "Buy 6 million food trucks a day for £1 and sell each food truck for £3,500 you will have made £780,00 per burger", "created_at": "2025-08-14T00:17:56", "owner": "tas5ard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079728515497807, "text": "Your Mc,ds then ?", "created_at": "2025-08-13T23:59:49", "owner": "bpw110", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952188783863800, "text": "😂😂😂 10000 per day that's almost 17 burger per minute. What kind of food truck is that?", "created_at": "2025-08-13T23:49:41", "owner": "rabou201", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104420257561137, "text": "Nobody can sell 10k burgers per day 🫣😂 what a stupid video", "created_at": "2025-08-13T23:27:00", "owner": "giovinco1212", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904846333230288, "text": "If calculation is correct, 500 a day, 50 an hr if 10 hr day wd still get 1.8m a year", "created_at": "2025-08-13T22:46:40", "owner": "will__macc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009723521788391, "text": "10,000 a day. How big is that truck?", "created_at": "2025-08-13T22:34:35", "owner": "simonford14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043735247657747, "text": "@raya_noah2023 💀", "created_at": "2025-08-13T22:23:35", "owner": "manianarcyz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077037106943588, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-08-13T22:00:09", "owner": "biscotti_boyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126767737411550, "text": "Got a mate who made 36.6 million selling burgers from a van", "created_at": "2025-08-13T21:50:37", "owner": "danielhooperart", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17860621938405888, "text": "You would need to attend a premier league game every day of the week for an entire year, and even then you probably wouldn’t come close, and that’s with most stadiums filling upwards on 30 to 50 thousand people 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-13T21:12:22", "owner": "alta.sound", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956135766992365, "text": "Im sorry but there’s only one person I know of who’s selling 10 thousand burgers a day, and that’s Mr McDonalds, no one else can come close ⛔️", "created_at": "2025-08-13T21:08:17", "owner": "alta.sound", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976995294906705, "text": "Is Diane Abbott your accountant?", "created_at": "2025-08-13T20:39:22", "owner": "sco.77w", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18379370968130727, "text": "At £10 each 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-13T20:32:28", "owner": "hollidz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072826492860263, "text": "10,000 burgers 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-13T20:19:01", "owner": "jaxx._1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917549755156083, "text": "Math was never the burger guys strong suit. 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-13T20:04:00", "owner": "pizzadude_mhk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076777147786481, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-13T20:00:31", "owner": "adamgib051", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103038904575285, "text": "Shite", "created_at": "2025-08-13T19:44:57", "owner": "gazonie1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041006036662511, "text": "Who is selling 10k a day 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-13T19:00:49", "owner": "dinodindodino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045062636637059, "text": "Who the hells selling 10k burgers every day apart from McDonald's like 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-13T18:58:41", "owner": "davieparker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075300343971874, "text": "You ain't selling 10,000 a day in that truck ya toss pot", "created_at": "2025-08-13T18:49:28", "owner": "rosscojondoe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18501879835064274, "text": "Sell 10k a day where's your pitch glastonbury 😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-13T18:22:19", "owner": "meditation_for_freedom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397514938137731, "text": "Ahahahahaha 10k a day", "created_at": "2025-08-13T18:11:33", "owner": "uk.garcia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054448652577338, "text": "10k burger a day", "created_at": "2025-08-13T17:54:56", "owner": "chris_wipit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109141300541387, "text": "Bro food buisness is hard. But we need you guys", "created_at": "2025-08-13T17:40:46", "owner": "johnislam353", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18476517517078477, "text": "You selling 10kburgers a day the McDonald’s or BK is going to buy you out", "created_at": "2025-08-13T17:13:45", "owner": "selwaybob", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090143563706228, "text": "Food trucks aren’t that cheap, try again", "created_at": "2025-08-13T16:40:36", "owner": "kicky80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088352770802738, "text": "10.000??? Xd", "created_at": "2025-08-13T16:26:02", "owner": "hakan.acr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18478642681078455, "text": "Ye right like its easy to sell that much 😆", "created_at": "2025-08-13T15:48:35", "owner": "bunjit123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038900780398348, "text": "How ya goingto sell 10 thousand a day from a truck", "created_at": "2025-08-13T15:30:15", "owner": "kurgan_victor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072939359079725, "text": "You ain't going to find a food truck that cheap", "created_at": "2025-08-13T14:33:52", "owner": "shawnheatbeats1980", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18409335721119211, "text": "10k a day😂 okay", "created_at": "2025-08-13T14:27:29", "owner": "0gabrielsv0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954817524995782, "text": "Who the hell sales 10000 burgers and who the hell buys 10$ burger", "created_at": "2025-08-13T13:52:07", "owner": "arctic_glance", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063990593007681, "text": "Hahahhahahahahahah hahahahah", "created_at": "2025-08-13T13:43:31", "owner": "maciej_man", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133785562439787, "text": "Aint nobody paying £10 for a burger", "created_at": "2025-08-13T13:33:05", "owner": "smithy197488", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055682477139569, "text": "500 is possible 20 a piece with fries and a coke. 10 k a day", "created_at": "2025-08-13T12:57:46", "owner": "powderaddict23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897364678257171, "text": "10k burgers a day 😂hahaha", "created_at": "2025-08-13T12:09:21", "owner": "voiceofsilence001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077353937501488, "text": "Who tf sell 10k a day", "created_at": "2025-08-13T11:29:42", "owner": "abdallahhijazii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090336604709022, "text": "10k a day 😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-13T11:23:54", "owner": "cengosburgershot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063731981261155, "text": "Why not 50,000", "created_at": "2025-08-13T11:13:54", "owner": "stanajdanny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940980760044872, "text": "😂😂😂😂 10.000 a day!! Joker!! 🤪🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-13T11:05:22", "owner": "john_minnaard82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353919232081258, "text": "Why 10k? Go fir 100k", "created_at": "2025-08-13T10:29:58", "owner": "datenisma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976340886750681, "text": "Where we can buy food truck cost of $3500?", "created_at": "2025-08-13T10:08:18", "owner": "pema.4123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963060633797861, "text": "You forgot some taxes", "created_at": "2025-08-13T08:50:57", "owner": "joostb1983", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869682559340126, "text": "That's if burgers are free to produce", "created_at": "2025-08-13T08:21:12", "owner": "mattcrawley_music", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937492825060821, "text": "7 a minute for 24 hours", "created_at": "2025-08-13T03:41:35", "owner": "therapy_lv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029473124695547, "text": "That’s 416 an hour for 24 hours", "created_at": "2025-08-13T03:41:01", "owner": "therapy_lv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093575785633444, "text": "Can’t sell 10k a day idiots", "created_at": "2025-08-13T03:40:36", "owner": "therapy_lv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076921075780198, "text": "Why not 10x that shit", "created_at": "2025-08-13T00:46:57", "owner": "bkoeck318", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18524833981005249, "text": "Apparently that's on the worst businesses to start from another IG account go figure 🤔", "created_at": "2025-08-13T00:07:27", "owner": "bingy1963", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062060834196346, "text": "Lol 10000 a day", "created_at": "2025-08-12T23:48:45", "owner": "branalvere", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048383195271870, "text": "Ya can’t buy a food truck for that 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-12T23:20:22", "owner": "floating_boating_2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041320694364134, "text": "Maths are struggling😂", "created_at": "2025-08-12T22:53:09", "owner": "voyagerphoto1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930341080088452, "text": "14 per minute on a 12 hour day out of a van ... ha ha ha ... good luck summoning the fairies 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-12T21:57:31", "owner": "jonnyboyj69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089270608688295, "text": "This is beyond retarded. Selling 10,000 burgers 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-12T21:22:19", "owner": "dehuffski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858805180469628, "text": "If you earn 35 million a year you ain't continuing to run a food truck. Hell 3 million and you are quitting", "created_at": "2025-08-12T20:44:28", "owner": "thefury77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981804732852271, "text": "Realistic number is atleast 1000, 10,000? Lol", "created_at": "2025-08-12T20:29:46", "owner": "a_l_i_l_i_o_n_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172948399350177, "text": "No never you sale burger for 10£", "created_at": "2025-08-12T20:15:47", "owner": "montanafez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930015442090014, "text": "Sell them for 100 and that's 365m a year", "created_at": "2025-08-12T19:52:45", "owner": "liampenny2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076091515801437, "text": "It's actually 3.65 milli ... but who tf sells 10.000 a day? 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-12T19:45:01", "owner": "cryspopa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043916303328826, "text": "Everyone selling these thin smashed burgers these days. At higher prices. Less for more seems to be the way to go. It used to be more for less back in the good old days", "created_at": "2025-08-12T19:32:10", "owner": "jamesframed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040710689356311, "text": "10000 a day 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-12T19:20:25", "owner": "ndnikolic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093501259647818, "text": "If you do a more reasonable 100 burgers a day it would still be 360.000 a year. In turnover not profit though.", "created_at": "2025-08-12T19:13:10", "owner": "gids_in_groningen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18519405760058817, "text": "That easy love the dude on the grill that’s skills", "created_at": "2025-08-12T18:57:42", "owner": "boakinse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088400092688375, "text": "Sell 10'000 a day as done me in ya know 😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-12T18:56:25", "owner": "discarda", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18307347511170740, "text": "There is no restaurant that consistently sells 10,000 burgers a day, I do know that one Restaurant sold 9000 and one day and one day only , food trucks cost $70-$150,000, nothing on this site is real", "created_at": "2025-08-12T18:16:16", "owner": "genegoycochea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086916754697080, "text": "20k a day and that 73m 🤯", "created_at": "2025-08-12T17:58:28", "owner": "faabs147", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054725018381362, "text": "Better option to sell 25,000 burgers a day", "created_at": "2025-08-12T17:24:47", "owner": "___alen.i_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038147684404451, "text": "10.000 a day 😂😂😂😂 max 1000", "created_at": "2025-08-12T17:19:27", "owner": "ali3848osman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080349259920469, "text": "10,000 a day 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-12T17:11:16", "owner": "m_a_sutherland", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096459760621717, "text": "Except you ain’t selling 10,000 a day🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-12T17:10:04", "owner": "the_last_colonialist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18524283280010182, "text": "Impossibel to sell 10.000 a day.Maybe 300😂", "created_at": "2025-08-12T17:03:30", "owner": "dorelboerean", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931478446085312, "text": "As if 10 thousand a day not happening", "created_at": "2025-08-12T17:00:47", "owner": "genta_gb_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054332903615814, "text": "You’re probably going to sell 500 at most for $5", "created_at": "2025-08-12T15:56:12", "owner": "js4jxck_chi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068201297135296, "text": "A McDonald’s restaurant doesn’t sell 10k burgers a day 🤦🏻😂", "created_at": "2025-08-12T15:04:40", "owner": "dale_collinson7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18335911375201572, "text": "taxes ?", "created_at": "2025-08-12T14:54:47", "owner": "j.alahame", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134178550434486, "text": "What foodtruck sells 10000 burgers a day ?", "created_at": "2025-08-12T14:46:31", "owner": "tasos_kld_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098120950540070, "text": "Only if you have a prime spot with the same foot work daily", "created_at": "2025-08-12T14:31:53", "owner": "ktjs_wraps_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919787299017232, "text": "10.000 per day 🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-12T14:04:55", "owner": "aiflyingclub", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032760074491022, "text": "I share videos about amazing restaurants and food experiences in Dubai 🍽✨\nFollow me to discover hidden gems, unique dishes, and the best spots to eat! 😋", "created_at": "2025-08-12T13:54:21", "owner": "chefgiacomob", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878008675384578, "text": "Guys got a food truck listed on ebau", "created_at": "2025-08-12T13:49:16", "owner": "wilmerben", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852675712514375, "text": "I know a lad in Dubai he bought a food truck for $20k flipped it for $25 Billion in cash. Insane world. Comment I like Cock and I will teach you how to di it ✅️", "created_at": "2025-08-12T13:12:55", "owner": "medlotfy16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18188794183321743, "text": "This aint accurate", "created_at": "2025-08-12T12:39:01", "owner": "henno669", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075415006826386, "text": "More human sweat in them burgers than beef", "created_at": "2025-08-12T11:37:41", "owner": "c.l.11_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17848518708502671, "text": "Not a hair net on one of them big beards scruffy C U N T S", "created_at": "2025-08-12T11:03:03", "owner": "micka_b_92", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18014914985588819, "text": "ah yeah sell 10,000 ofc bro", "created_at": "2025-08-12T10:59:23", "owner": "arn.wlt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904690315231647, "text": "Thats not how it works u think the buns, food and manual labour is free", "created_at": "2025-08-12T10:01:56", "owner": "lalf2217", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885557590216788, "text": "But how do you get the funds in the first place...", "created_at": "2025-08-12T09:28:39", "owner": "st3ve_b3rry", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17869935708419541, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-12T09:09:40", "owner": "liverpoool_31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856412356436483, "text": "How about a realistic number of burgers🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-12T09:03:39", "owner": "dankermichiel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102658114514427, "text": "wen u have an extra 5 dollar bye urself a  calculator to u gona need it", "created_at": "2025-08-12T09:01:34", "owner": "beno.trading", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093866344726379, "text": "Yeah of course life's that easy you fool", "created_at": "2025-08-12T07:03:39", "owner": "david.flowers.779205", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18398818003187214, "text": "These business gurus man 😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-12T06:38:31", "owner": "pdgnssr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094821454727045, "text": "Why not 50,000 a day 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-12T04:38:57", "owner": "i.c.concepts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966918831791833, "text": "That is a great strategy if it actually was possible in reality most go bankrupt within a year. But thanks for", "created_at": "2025-08-12T03:25:08", "owner": "buldo22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089132065686330, "text": "Good joke", "created_at": "2025-08-12T00:47:15", "owner": "chefsumu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075268558951783, "text": "10k burgers per day?😂😂😂 no way", "created_at": "2025-08-12T00:01:22", "owner": "a23i75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995792085815732, "text": "I Was soo stupid!", "created_at": "2025-08-11T23:59:32", "owner": "maximi_maximo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932706598087724, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂what a scam", "created_at": "2025-08-11T23:09:23", "owner": "nuernberg2412", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18320543656208638, "text": "And watch HMRC Come knocking on your 🚪", "created_at": "2025-08-11T22:06:26", "owner": "hj091256", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934326127074308, "text": "Yea no im not going to scam the population in buying an overpriced burger", "created_at": "2025-08-11T22:01:55", "owner": "jeroen058", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18233989495293205, "text": "Too damn staff for a food truck", "created_at": "2025-08-11T20:49:34", "owner": "pgtipsaretop2andnot2", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065497777977615, "text": "10 quid  for a burger  I'll  go hungry", "created_at": "2025-08-11T20:42:50", "owner": "mike.sykess", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064094906519395, "text": "Get a phone; start posting stupid s#!t; now you have $1100 less and the Internet knows you're dumb.", "created_at": "2025-08-11T20:17:39", "owner": "seda.seb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063853184255172, "text": "1,5 tonnes every day 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-11T20:14:51", "owner": "andro1684", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055114523576483, "text": "Pays employee $15/hr", "created_at": "2025-08-11T20:05:28", "owner": "hanes_92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097428967720627, "text": "10000 burgers a day 😮 psss, I sell 10000 I one hour 👀", "created_at": "2025-08-11T19:43:31", "owner": "sanjin4588", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18525813646034630, "text": "Sell a trillion a day and you can retire after one day easy", "created_at": "2025-08-11T19:34:39", "owner": "andy.hutchings", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855815509487973, "text": "No way you're selling 10000 a day", "created_at": "2025-08-11T19:11:54", "owner": "higgi_l29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851349493479961, "text": "Selling a burger every half second is one thing. Making one in that time is another.", "created_at": "2025-08-11T18:59:42", "owner": "mariocoolcats", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053423843168368, "text": "and 50% Taxes", "created_at": "2025-08-11T18:54:29", "owner": "seko_hero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014417402777340, "text": "Easy", "created_at": "2025-08-11T18:01:19", "owner": "robthreepwood", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068230660922542, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-11T17:59:46", "owner": "pit261065", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061220282201326, "text": "Nobody sells 10.000 burgers in one day", "created_at": "2025-08-11T17:52:51", "owner": "rainvittel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066278210233384, "text": "Lost me at 10 000a day", "created_at": "2025-08-11T17:52:09", "owner": "juss_marv_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143261716408266, "text": "10k burgers...hahahhahahahaha this is how millenians do math and dreams", "created_at": "2025-08-11T17:46:47", "owner": "george.marian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073411367073336, "text": "What kind of piece of shit foodtruck you can have for 3500£ 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-11T17:42:41", "owner": "ez3kouille", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023824922722584, "text": "Yea", "created_at": "2025-08-11T17:40:21", "owner": "jason.ali.520900", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902579974234048, "text": "10,000 burgers a day? You're completely insane 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-11T17:17:32", "owner": "evo_57", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961389942969421, "text": "Bro I have done it remember u pay for many things……. Not just buy a foodtruck , anyways inshallah kher", "created_at": "2025-08-11T16:47:43", "owner": "renokrd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010779734607046, "text": "Country like Finland there's no customer. Crisesin Finland", "created_at": "2025-08-11T16:39:51", "owner": "manjit3542", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087236215695934, "text": "10 X that shit!", "created_at": "2025-08-11T16:08:24", "owner": "ben_sweetman_poker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060620276589157, "text": "Why sell 10,000 sell 10000000000", "created_at": "2025-08-11T15:53:44", "owner": "sharvil_g6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943457920018139, "text": "If he’s that busy and if each order is 17.99 he’s making bank 🏦", "created_at": "2025-08-11T15:42:36", "owner": "maybe_tuesday_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012677909599119, "text": "This aint accurate", "created_at": "2025-08-11T14:56:56", "owner": "henno669", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18359704405156907, "text": "10000 a day 😝", "created_at": "2025-08-11T14:53:24", "owner": "timmypowell2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052265084407100, "text": "😂😂🤦🏽‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-08-11T14:26:36", "owner": "eskay.2929", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18350217058095362, "text": "Well obviously not.....needs to pay for gas,stock and the pitch the truck is on", "created_at": "2025-08-11T14:06:31", "owner": "kevmcgov66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022819601723530, "text": "10 mila a day?!?!😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-11T13:48:50", "owner": "bevabbe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880418476367013, "text": "You mash ain't mathing", "created_at": "2025-08-11T13:35:35", "owner": "nigelhg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869150695423845, "text": "10K burgers from one burger van 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-11T13:25:16", "owner": "j30_jah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075105161057985, "text": "Yes, 50 towns around combined don't have that many people, including infants", "created_at": "2025-08-11T12:34:26", "owner": "hillbilly_monster", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152424517386299, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-11T12:16:06", "owner": "jantoub", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855789166494574, "text": "Shit", "created_at": "2025-08-11T11:47:35", "owner": "brad_j_c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096528178619396, "text": "A burger truck for £3600 😂😂. 10,000a day 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-11T10:32:18", "owner": "darrenfairfax", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092688208727629, "text": "Just sell 1 000 000 a day and make 10 000 000 a day, thanks me later", "created_at": "2025-08-11T10:20:54", "owner": "somasage1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18288465958250059, "text": "10k day is dreamy 😂🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-11T09:32:55", "owner": "its___mexy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17893345752166778, "text": "Yeah right", "created_at": "2025-08-11T09:25:17", "owner": "wesley_derksen_mad_customs_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18052826480567557, "text": "Staff? Stock? Pay? Insurance? Equipment? 3.5?!🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-11T09:22:02", "owner": "x_rhys", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956214723841857, "text": "The average burger van isn’t even open 8 hours a day, it’s lunch and dinner .. let’s say it’s 8 hours. Thats 10,000 / 8hrs =1,250 burgers an hour 1250 / 60 = 20 burgers every minute that would need to be prepared, cooked (which takes like 5 mins) then dressed, wrapped, boxed and packed.. 5 burgers from raw to handed to the customer every 15 seconds", "created_at": "2025-08-11T09:11:44", "owner": "jamiesonontherocks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046157789303599, "text": "20 Cheeseburger/Minute", "created_at": "2025-08-11T09:04:32", "owner": "brooklynbenz1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18168246718360528, "text": "Just make up numbers and you can make as much as you want in your head.", "created_at": "2025-08-11T08:36:17", "owner": "kevp1985", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090093394687092, "text": "the blue boxes homie", "created_at": "2025-08-11T07:41:02", "owner": "ginnofrmd6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897909988267140, "text": "What food truck is selling 10,000 burgers a day 😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-11T06:47:55", "owner": "hrce00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884929390220407, "text": "👏🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-11T06:01:27", "owner": "topiaslindroos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944656116901828, "text": "Bros math isn't mathing.", "created_at": "2025-08-11T04:16:14", "owner": "julzmitchy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077515123946439, "text": "10,000 a day is wild", "created_at": "2025-08-11T02:44:45", "owner": "lordoftherizzlers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074536174988678, "text": "🤣🤣🤣 what about profit? 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-11T02:12:20", "owner": "abdullah_a_l_fahad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040638254655733, "text": "B.s", "created_at": "2025-08-11T01:50:07", "owner": "mptequities", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084283558672252, "text": "Yea ok", "created_at": "2025-08-11T01:49:57", "owner": "mptequities", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909761053220508, "text": "Who tf is selling 10k burgers a day.", "created_at": "2025-08-11T01:00:41", "owner": "osiris_echos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049510403630579, "text": "10K a day 🙄", "created_at": "2025-08-11T00:47:37", "owner": "nastyblackshark", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884393875346766, "text": "10000 burgers a day is alot even for mcdonalds", "created_at": "2025-08-11T00:46:48", "owner": "andrewchorro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919817593120833, "text": "You’ll never sell 10,000 burgers a day", "created_at": "2025-08-11T00:46:24", "owner": "mcgrath.mick", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030501866704933, "text": "or just sell 36000 burger in one day to make 36mil", "created_at": "2025-08-11T00:09:57", "owner": "k.a.k.47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987388908837461, "text": "Without 10k orders per day, I think it is a nice fantasy to have. 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-10T23:32:14", "owner": "mikealexandernewell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054827675411822, "text": "Where you get food trailers from for 3 n hslf grand", "created_at": "2025-08-10T21:39:25", "owner": "billycrawford570", "likes": 27}, {"id": 18120229369436197, "text": "No way", "created_at": "2025-08-10T21:25:36", "owner": "hlizasanchez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303751450223002, "text": "These numbers make no sense", "created_at": "2025-08-10T21:17:03", "owner": "original_retro_burp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979365363902554, "text": "Soooooooooooo everything's free after the initial purchase, Tom was hit by confusion", "created_at": "2025-08-10T20:51:02", "owner": "teejdee.93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078832606922382, "text": "Génius 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-10T20:43:32", "owner": "nexafish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982775280848173, "text": "10,000 a day?? No bother 😮", "created_at": "2025-08-10T20:22:09", "owner": "ross.gillan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18517387426016042, "text": "Sell one burger für 10€ and 100000 time you make one million in a day 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-10T20:17:13", "owner": "wasim_foolad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083833531846512, "text": "You can sell one burger for 1$ and just sell as many millions of per year as you want", "created_at": "2025-08-10T20:16:40", "owner": "darkjackbad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067952590916584, "text": "Stick to grooming ya deluded toucher", "created_at": "2025-08-10T19:53:06", "owner": "666_pepe_666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071841263031486, "text": "Only? Just sell 928477472828449499294 burgers per day...😂", "created_at": "2025-08-10T19:45:50", "owner": "padnikit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074174956962221, "text": "A little unrealistic lol 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-10T19:22:23", "owner": "gavin_hopkins0615", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18339789073167732, "text": "10,000 a day 🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣👍 we have a financial genius here", "created_at": "2025-08-10T19:22:18", "owner": "born2bfast_running", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010320839608818, "text": "McDonalds don’t sell 10 ,000 a day in a branch", "created_at": "2025-08-10T19:22:01", "owner": "arnoldwhites1919", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18524944027062879, "text": "10k burgers a day be serious bro. Ain’t nobody starting a food truck burger business from scratch selling 10k burgers at £10", "created_at": "2025-08-10T19:20:34", "owner": "ajfinesseqsmofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185168602321814, "text": "10000 a  day? In a food truck? 😂😂😂 did ever work in all.your life?😂", "created_at": "2025-08-10T19:12:45", "owner": "christianalessandrini", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117287839494660, "text": "10k burgers a day 😂😂😂 where n how", "created_at": "2025-08-10T19:05:26", "owner": "glitchtv2018", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119127106492201, "text": "1000 day are enough", "created_at": "2025-08-10T18:55:04", "owner": "klidi_s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995138007668129, "text": "electricity? buying the burger buns ? the meat? employees?", "created_at": "2025-08-10T18:54:52", "owner": "painkiller_pilll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910604077192090, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-10T18:25:44", "owner": "s_and_w_sd9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018315953743071, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-10T18:00:50", "owner": "warmeth42ii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058380659599406, "text": "Light work, just sell 100,000 every 10th day and you can have 9 days off inbetween and make that money and chill!", "created_at": "2025-08-10T17:40:02", "owner": "a_golf_and_golf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920274436136017, "text": "Let me know when you sale 10.000 burgers a day", "created_at": "2025-08-10T17:39:54", "owner": "veronica.cohen.18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889771999318863, "text": "Where u getting a food truck for 3.5k ??", "created_at": "2025-08-10T17:31:42", "owner": "owen_richb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099162184599139, "text": "Put some Golden Arches on the truck for them numbers", "created_at": "2025-08-10T17:31:20", "owner": "tdrproductions", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171347845350784, "text": "Where can I buy a food truck from for 3.5k ?? Coz recently I looked and they are 20k starting", "created_at": "2025-08-10T17:17:16", "owner": "craig.stewart.777701", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322008193229767, "text": "10,000 1/4 pound burgers is like 1,133 kg 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-10T17:12:07", "owner": "drewofthenorth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851312809526274, "text": "Lol.... no chance e of ever selling 10000 burgers a day. The math is there to get you hooked. It's a load of bollocks", "created_at": "2025-08-10T16:42:21", "owner": "essexgary", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912585583052863, "text": "Ask ChatGPT - “how much volume would 10,000 burger patties + the equivalent burger buns occupy and compare that to the size of a £3500 food truck ”", "created_at": "2025-08-10T16:37:34", "owner": "masblackbear", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933561964071520, "text": "Buy a rifel for 1000. Become a Hitman. Kill people for 10000. Kill 10000 and you are a Millionär.", "created_at": "2025-08-10T16:12:49", "owner": "mr_miro212", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040477616361072, "text": "Sell 10,000 a day - or (assuming a 10 hour day) - 1,000 an hour - or 17 a minute.", "created_at": "2025-08-10T16:02:04", "owner": "riceuten", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102451504601227, "text": "Minus all cost of meat and all of that shit", "created_at": "2025-08-10T15:29:24", "owner": "ereenn.88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084226429677134, "text": "That equals 4,3 burgers per second for 12 hrs per day, everyday. You breath slower that😂", "created_at": "2025-08-10T15:19:48", "owner": "jensjia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048219059632247, "text": "“just sell 10,000 a day” brutal", "created_at": "2025-08-10T15:17:25", "owner": "turanlegendary", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124743139465249, "text": "Even if you could sell 500 (10,000 would be impossible from a good truck), you still need to pay for overheads - the biggest of which will be staff wages. 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-10T15:13:27", "owner": "hokkenbaals", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851563738522623, "text": "Lmao", "created_at": "2025-08-10T14:46:08", "owner": "isndarka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133809550432580, "text": "Even McDonald’s doesn’t sell 10000 burger in a day…", "created_at": "2025-08-10T14:44:21", "owner": "brian_michel_mtl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997536837653966, "text": "Better 100.000 Burger 🙌", "created_at": "2025-08-10T14:00:03", "owner": "stipe_ki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059335367596197, "text": "Sell 1000 and you good", "created_at": "2025-08-10T13:40:58", "owner": "chokopokovac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18394211854191098, "text": "That’s why your never gunna succeed in business buddy", "created_at": "2025-08-10T12:42:09", "owner": "101myink", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18351956983090282, "text": "Let we say you need 1 hour for 150 or 200 burgers you work 12 hours you can max 2500", "created_at": "2025-08-10T12:29:17", "owner": "farid._.650", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913432603048895, "text": "£10 a burger 🍔😮😮. Be lucky for people to play that", "created_at": "2025-08-10T11:56:21", "owner": "thisthatgoodies", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986753574841733, "text": "10,000 a day is easy 👏", "created_at": "2025-08-10T11:48:32", "owner": "south_jigsaw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870391585332658, "text": "Why stop at 10,000 a day. Why not just make 12 million a day. Lock in", "created_at": "2025-08-10T11:48:17", "owner": "hyperlemon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044007236329810, "text": "If it were that easy everyone would do it", "created_at": "2025-08-10T11:45:41", "owner": "byronc4130", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029722280501160, "text": "Apparently ingredients and labour and overheads are free.", "created_at": "2025-08-10T11:36:41", "owner": "marcpole", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050568386565753, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-10T11:08:43", "owner": "kastro_co", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887363689205880, "text": "this whole calculation is wrong so don't try ...", "created_at": "2025-08-10T11:05:52", "owner": "umarmughal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093121228645348, "text": "For starter, get a food truck and all its equipment for £3500", "created_at": "2025-08-10T10:56:31", "owner": "samzthename", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033900953693904, "text": "🤣🤣10,000 a day🤣🤣 man where you from?", "created_at": "2025-08-10T10:35:58", "owner": "sc14_tokyo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881184541362398, "text": "Good luck with 10,000 a day", "created_at": "2025-08-10T10:29:19", "owner": "pburchill74", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087487804744673, "text": "If only reality doesn’t exist.", "created_at": "2025-08-10T09:29:57", "owner": "tshering9176", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18310263472246863, "text": "Who sells 10k burgers a day 😂😂😂 if you sell 1k that’s good already", "created_at": "2025-08-10T09:22:49", "owner": "erwinpatryk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977739045897310, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-10T09:09:50", "owner": "bowbumbrown", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082556428895260, "text": "10k  burgers a Day 😂😂😂😂😂😂 das macht nicht mal MC Donald s, 500 wären schon absolut top!", "created_at": "2025-08-10T08:09:13", "owner": "donnieazoff2212", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085990651839461, "text": "Why u need that many man in that small space", "created_at": "2025-08-10T07:38:52", "owner": "raks.993", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18524933050022562, "text": "10k 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-10T07:02:55", "owner": "vincentcaeyers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096704887719532, "text": "It's not that simple.", "created_at": "2025-08-10T06:41:38", "owner": "truefrank89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070792673323266, "text": "Math is not mathing bud", "created_at": "2025-08-10T06:41:17", "owner": "iamtheonlyquiet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051670811623456, "text": "That's 2,500 Lbs of burgers a day. Where are they stored on the truck.", "created_at": "2025-08-10T06:26:48", "owner": "watamon420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052317749620510, "text": "10000 burgers a day lol. He obviously cannot do maths . That’s almost 7 burgers a per minute assuming you work 24 hours . If you work 8 hours, that 21 burger per minute. One everything 3 seconds. “Change hands Darrell”", "created_at": "2025-08-10T04:43:16", "owner": "alleynchris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18377677876121309, "text": "Buy the van for $5, sell burger for $50 , sell 30,000 a day $547m a year.. my plan is better", "created_at": "2025-08-10T03:44:01", "owner": "garethbill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020978810535675, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-10T03:36:12", "owner": "christop12g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103383205604961, "text": "Foodtruck för 3.500??😂😂 That won't cover even the equipment", "created_at": "2025-08-10T03:22:07", "owner": "poffertjes.se", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095447761642686, "text": "McDonald's doesn't sell that much in 5 locations, combind.", "created_at": "2025-08-10T03:02:42", "owner": "zachari313", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305093731223187, "text": "10000 a day are you on meth ?", "created_at": "2025-08-10T02:56:17", "owner": "bakedmuffin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068011406142530, "text": "What kind of morons are you? They put this ad together that you could sell 10 thousand hamburgers a day every day for a year and you're gonna make $36 billion out of a food truck selling hamburgers! Put the cracked pipe down🤯", "created_at": "2025-08-10T02:32:23", "owner": "marano2316", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091409431660960, "text": "10.000 burgers a day where ?", "created_at": "2025-08-10T02:17:49", "owner": "flex69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052225514188789, "text": "There is not a single foodtruck on this planet selling burgers even at 10% of what is shown here.", "created_at": "2025-08-10T01:45:35", "owner": "rafwalks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916938769155256, "text": "Guess those workers are considered slaves that you don’t have to pay.", "created_at": "2025-08-10T00:38:44", "owner": "jamesdolan84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876303526390433, "text": "sell 10k 😂😂😂😂illegal already gone", "created_at": "2025-08-10T00:29:54", "owner": "boycali01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082014181857342, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-10T00:19:57", "owner": "shandub24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012772394716520, "text": "lmao", "created_at": "2025-08-10T00:04:50", "owner": "johhny_k167", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18521707975023317, "text": "Math ain’t mathing", "created_at": "2025-08-09T23:53:50", "owner": "realdarxnyght", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18179302552333315, "text": "It’s sad that some people believe that to be true", "created_at": "2025-08-09T23:12:01", "owner": "jde8042", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021745448718050, "text": "10000 lol", "created_at": "2025-08-09T23:01:29", "owner": "benjaminrussellbr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098797594614105, "text": "10000 it's too much daily, but 1000 possible and it's not bad 😀", "created_at": "2025-08-09T22:46:07", "owner": "bohas_tara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010232225781547, "text": "Some crap on here", "created_at": "2025-08-09T22:37:49", "owner": "respectflag", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352839640094128, "text": "Or, or, or sell 20000 and make $73 million in one year. Thank me later.", "created_at": "2025-08-09T21:43:47", "owner": "retep.lv", "likes": 34}, {"id": 17940574440021859, "text": "B5", "created_at": "2025-08-09T21:40:33", "owner": "mikestraveldiary", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059508476070735, "text": "So food cost, gas, electric, licences, tax, manual labour etc etc. so that doesn't exist ???", "created_at": "2025-08-09T21:30:09", "owner": "sj_rodrigues97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038428613391074, "text": "10000 a day, you having a laugh! 😆 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-09T21:19:11", "owner": "buzzman1974", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968705046931347, "text": "Anyone who thinks this sounds possible is in cloud cuckoo land", "created_at": "2025-08-09T21:11:39", "owner": "steve19652024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176324608338006, "text": "Go Play Lotto Choose the 6 Numbers Right and win 2 mio", "created_at": "2025-08-09T20:58:14", "owner": "chrisiiiiko_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037828286421119, "text": "Just like that", "created_at": "2025-08-09T20:25:54", "owner": "nick587115", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18175647517337413, "text": "Where the fuck am I selling 10,000 burgers a day. A busy McDonald’s doesn’t do that.", "created_at": "2025-08-09T19:57:51", "owner": "crazybear213", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054166808426572, "text": "A food trailer isn’t £3.5k minimum you’re looking at is £10-£16k, they don’t tell you how hard it is to get a location and how many groups there are that are within food that have to approve you first, if it was easy to get a spot everyone would be doing it, I bought mine for 10k couldn’t get a location!", "created_at": "2025-08-09T19:33:53", "owner": "ecruzal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089164357743052, "text": "Why not sell 1,000,000 burgers a day", "created_at": "2025-08-09T19:24:41", "owner": "dam_1992r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075769120815188, "text": "Also dont pay tax because cash only haha", "created_at": "2025-08-09T19:24:14", "owner": "benjamin1991m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130820575452976, "text": "Bitch who's gonna buy 10k burger /day ? 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-09T19:15:33", "owner": "mazalzain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892373332290627, "text": "I’d just sell 20,000", "created_at": "2025-08-09T19:03:46", "owner": "geordie_treker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068995661124935, "text": "bullshit", "created_at": "2025-08-09T18:57:07", "owner": "molldyez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18286279510258802, "text": "10,000 burgers a day? The most ever sold is 6336 burgers, and that was a one off for me record books.\nWhat’s the point of just making up nonsense?\nWhy not say a million a day, that’s equally absurd?", "created_at": "2025-08-09T18:51:57", "owner": "nonpaul2080", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077703455304819, "text": "Good luck trying to sell 10,000 a day 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-09T18:50:59", "owner": "drkj_jordan_28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075067442477369, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-09T18:30:42", "owner": "tony.8.8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001194332638984, "text": "Buy 10 food trucks, sell 100,000 burgers and buy a thousand more food trucks and then sell 10 million burgers. Then ten X that. Then wake up at 5am and ten X that again. Billionaire. Easy", "created_at": "2025-08-09T18:21:22", "owner": "boywolfemurray", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938256652053297, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣 10,000 a day in what world", "created_at": "2025-08-09T18:16:36", "owner": "heartfeltquotes2024", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085665406660988, "text": "Or sell 30,000 a day and triple your money 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-09T18:16:35", "owner": "whestworld", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17847515964513612, "text": "You aint selling 10k burgers a day bro 🥀", "created_at": "2025-08-09T18:08:16", "owner": "totallynotfernandoalonso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919744402103631, "text": "Thats like 1 burger every 7 sec 24 hours 365 days a year… stupid context", "created_at": "2025-08-09T18:01:28", "owner": "61okandemirtas", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18093764782567143, "text": "Food truck for 3.5k ?? In which galactic?", "created_at": "2025-08-09T17:52:24", "owner": "timtoya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051813413624210, "text": "No one is selling 10k burgers a day", "created_at": "2025-08-09T17:13:04", "owner": "oliverholroyd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093053617728559, "text": "If it takes 3 mins to boil an egg how long will it take to boil 3 eggs. 🥚", "created_at": "2025-08-09T16:51:58", "owner": "ritchy_dulai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18351172642081365, "text": "But surely one would cook a few burgers at the same time.", "created_at": "2025-08-09T16:50:22", "owner": "ritchy_dulai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060932975051438, "text": "Maths ain’t mathing 😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-08-09T16:48:19", "owner": "ritchy_dulai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050756702533125, "text": "Or just sell 1.000.000.000 burgers a day!! 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-09T16:47:08", "owner": "nickibille14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939926079924984, "text": "If you had 10 wagons, at Glastonbury, you might do 5000 a day.", "created_at": "2025-08-09T16:24:33", "owner": "arm_wrestling_store", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895900795146908, "text": "10’000 burger a day looool", "created_at": "2025-08-09T16:01:29", "owner": "blastingrobin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905041612218285, "text": "Just why? Absolute nonsense. Please do your homework first.", "created_at": "2025-08-09T16:00:51", "owner": "mattb19711962", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043660202328829, "text": "10.000 burgers a day !? ...🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-09T16:00:07", "owner": "df_silviu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064070311992259, "text": "Why not sell 20k burgers?🤔", "created_at": "2025-08-09T15:44:46", "owner": "antonis_gratsias", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872939881310969, "text": "Love it when the maths is math-ing 💪🏾💪🏾💸", "created_at": "2025-08-09T15:30:20", "owner": "ghayesinc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071189455882531, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-08-09T15:19:26", "owner": "the.notorious.b.e.l.o.v", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066498317174668, "text": "How are you gonna sell 10,000 burgers in one day", "created_at": "2025-08-09T15:05:44", "owner": "roya_london_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090009679675090, "text": "Get a toast and a cat, tape them together. They will spin forever. Infinite energy.", "created_at": "2025-08-09T15:01:18", "owner": "zigapodkrajsek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852555967510000, "text": "10000 is possible?", "created_at": "2025-08-09T14:52:53", "owner": "fyrozesheik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048439562269774, "text": "Lesd the product... Less the employees... Less al the licenses... Less all you lonely lufe expenses... Less taxes... U fucked", "created_at": "2025-08-09T14:25:47", "owner": "bemp_f4l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092345473732702, "text": "You should be gay to work there", "created_at": "2025-08-09T13:48:03", "owner": "alino493", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017197616564426, "text": "Imagine the smell of B.O. 🤮🤮🤮 you need your head read if you buy anything off that truck 🤮", "created_at": "2025-08-09T13:41:48", "owner": "_ape_strong_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038865284399782, "text": "Sell 10000 a day🤣🤣🤣 , yup 👍 if you have gun then you can do 😂😂 point the gun to the people and easily you can sell more then 10k 😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-09T13:23:43", "owner": "iankbolt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041001941352502, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-08-09T12:31:16", "owner": "olaideonifaarii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894768298270743, "text": "10000 burgers a day? 😂 Unless you have a time machine , may Chronos help you", "created_at": "2025-08-09T12:27:30", "owner": "thegamercheftgc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916