e_220280", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939826669021878, "text": "These smart advice  Wow!", "created_at": "2025-08-08T19:44:22", "owner": "dalen112", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987866265700955, "text": "Or sell 36.5 million burgers in one minute.", "created_at": "2025-08-08T19:27:53", "owner": "broskiamigo420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087248698769754, "text": "Is it a joke to sell 1000 burgers per day 🤯", "created_at": "2025-08-08T19:23:43", "owner": "kxmxnx01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925371175070740, "text": "Sell 10,000 a day?? Do you think your chef is Gordon Ramsay??", "created_at": "2025-08-08T19:06:29", "owner": "nobody89646", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878891155264942, "text": "Meat bread and others and salary need pay money so need minimum 10.000 for start and daily cant sell 10.000 burgers. Its his fantasy world", "created_at": "2025-08-08T19:03:51", "owner": "livadream", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18393271771191517, "text": "@tausifhernandez @___emm94 @__ravi94_", "created_at": "2025-08-08T18:48:54", "owner": "bluerolls4u", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103063159562656, "text": "@tausifhernandez", "created_at": "2025-08-08T18:44:54", "owner": "bluerolls4u", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088040239760913, "text": "10.000 a day.... thats 30 per Minute.... 24 hours open 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-08T18:38:31", "owner": "egalmario", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056891981374304, "text": "10,000 a day...... dreamer!", "created_at": "2025-08-08T18:35:39", "owner": "shakesandlattes", "likes": 384}, {"id": 18051550685452141, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-08-08T18:16:50", "owner": "changeuberlin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884737513223963, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-08T18:05:59", "owner": "abbasimtiaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847393324513514, "text": "Depot", "created_at": "2025-08-08T17:53:14", "owner": "beemanolie6683", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18520181431020562, "text": "Where can I get a trailer for that price?", "created_at": "2025-08-08T17:44:30", "owner": "unrulyk9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064619458986456, "text": "Y’all just make stuff up to sound cool and be motivating bullshit.", "created_at": "2025-08-08T17:37:10", "owner": "kelvinthetycoon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18520428607014756, "text": "10.000 a day😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-08T17:35:57", "owner": "aciu.narcis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074282197998675, "text": "Likely tob sell 1000 average a week . That's why they shut down half a year in many places", "created_at": "2025-08-08T16:41:40", "owner": "archive_infamous", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073996261998726, "text": "10,000 a day,it's not mcdonalds ffs", "created_at": "2025-08-08T16:31:05", "owner": "jabbathakut", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18280987855274740, "text": "10000 a day 🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-08T16:12:50", "owner": "bitz_banga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047984978280283, "text": "This is the same kinda maths as if you’re homeless, just buy a house.", "created_at": "2025-08-08T16:07:36", "owner": "biboy43_ccg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894472246279238, "text": "Sell 10000 haha", "created_at": "2025-08-08T15:56:58", "owner": "truestorypersia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953130943004394, "text": "Got to pay for food staff electricity gas for cooker tax. Then national insurance tax", "created_at": "2025-08-08T15:28:47", "owner": "stuartnethercoteturner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096183760615653, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-08T14:42:27", "owner": "1982besim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18308204119173237, "text": "Man who gon sell 10000 sandwiches a day? Stop with the unrealistic nonsense", "created_at": "2025-08-08T14:37:23", "owner": "mac_boy_yoyo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090871603662900, "text": "You can’t sell 10k a day 🤦🏻‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-08-08T14:32:31", "owner": "jan_staskiewicz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18410432338128407, "text": "You not serving 10000 burgers a day you wanker 🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-08T14:10:38", "owner": "tiedshoelace1r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075360331801605, "text": "Ok, let’s break this down.\n1. If you are selling burgers for £10, you are not selling 10,000 a day.\n2. Even if you were, you are neglecting the cost of burgers, buns, salad, condiments etc which go on the burger.\n3. Consider the work that would be required to make a £3,500 food truck operational and pass food safety inspections.\n4. Consider the fuel cost for moving your truck around and the gas for cooking your burgers.\n5. Staff costs. There is no way on gods green earth are you flipping and assembling 10,000 burgers every day without a day off. All if the help needs to be paid. In this picture there are 6 people at £13 an hour (and for 10,000 burgers your probably 12-14 hours a day) so 6x14x£13=£1,092 a day or £398,580 a year before you pay overtime. Then you pay their national insurance and pension contributions holiday pay etc and you are about £600,000 - £700,000 in staff costs alone.", "created_at": "2025-08-08T11:26:32", "owner": "ralphsorley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109119205528303, "text": "Who is buying a burger for £10 🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-08T10:53:32", "owner": "sbaggy84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095479393626714, "text": "New pizza truck £19,500, Conversion  cost including equipment £40,000 takes 2 months to kit", "created_at": "2025-08-08T10:38:56", "owner": "panik80", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18259736521304316, "text": "Or sell 36.5m 1000times and then buy a foodtruck for 1€", "created_at": "2025-08-08T09:55:09", "owner": "113914.38989", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065007668181650, "text": "10k a day??.", "created_at": "2025-08-08T09:53:32", "owner": "bfg_bearsted", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18412306633105634, "text": "Is someone forgetting costs and tax?", "created_at": "2025-08-08T09:29:22", "owner": "teabag_oneshot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916841869116801, "text": "Is someone forgetting costs and taxes?", "created_at": "2025-08-08T09:28:58", "owner": "teabag_oneshot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083343841843322, "text": "Nice theory", "created_at": "2025-08-08T09:21:41", "owner": "fer.lfu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069560717038643, "text": "10k burgers a day? You mean you just open them from freezer and give. Or order from others and just serve for 10", "created_at": "2025-08-08T09:04:59", "owner": "popey_all", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987511596696909, "text": "Bro food raw materials like bread beef cucumber vegetables,salaries of employees and maintenance every month like fuel cleaning plumbing etc.", "created_at": "2025-08-08T08:18:46", "owner": "berett92fs", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053131868618693, "text": "10000 a day 😅😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-08T08:11:52", "owner": "ha_shg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035968535462446, "text": "How much is the pitch per year", "created_at": "2025-08-08T07:39:55", "owner": "rocjoeshow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066190517177627, "text": "I ordered from there twice and both times they forgot a part of my order and didn’t make good on it or refund the difference. So they are a big fail and I’ve made sure no one else goes there either. Small thing for them, but a huge deal for a customer.", "created_at": "2025-08-08T07:39:32", "owner": "imrankhandotcom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063809807002309, "text": "Looks dirty", "created_at": "2025-08-08T07:35:59", "owner": "sthelenshelpinghands", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902450779234582, "text": "Another shitpost. Block", "created_at": "2025-08-08T07:15:45", "owner": "shaunsnewgram", "likes": 119}, {"id": 18074544793984289, "text": "You're not selling even close to 1000 a day. lol stop reaching....", "created_at": "2025-08-08T07:11:02", "owner": "1faded_nismo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864272899441012, "text": "Come is no track for 3500 first and you sure will sale 10000 burgers day 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-08T06:16:49", "owner": "moussaed_8080", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091468828670219, "text": "Who pays 10 pounds for a burger?", "created_at": "2025-08-08T06:11:20", "owner": "chrisshill58", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076248316784571, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-08T05:42:10", "owner": "nebojsa_koscuk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054440105615688, "text": "good luck selling 10k burgers everyday", "created_at": "2025-08-08T05:41:47", "owner": "demio0515", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089216407684466, "text": "You would have to make andsell 21 in 1m for your 8h shift in order to make that", "created_at": "2025-08-08T05:36:06", "owner": "nickscoin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057146255577891, "text": "What if I sell 1000000 burgers per day...then I am a billionaire?", "created_at": "2025-08-08T05:34:07", "owner": "holistichefstathios", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939745276025632, "text": "10000 a day😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-08T04:26:52", "owner": "waldmeisterlover", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939774903916873, "text": "Yiu dont pay taxes ,permit , employees , food costs ??", "created_at": "2025-08-08T04:03:46", "owner": "skyabove070", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069293543120930, "text": "200 burger /day per truck food. Work reinvest into 50 other  food truck . And that's 10 000 burger per day.🔥", "created_at": "2025-08-08T03:54:25", "owner": "ramanuigaret", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912802579170354, "text": "A joke", "created_at": "2025-08-07T21:39:55", "owner": "marcin_superhero_daddy_hubbie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993372003675123, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-07T21:09:26", "owner": "dudek_alex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035346452462807, "text": "Ya cos u get the burgers and staff for free", "created_at": "2025-08-07T20:51:10", "owner": "weturntablesclub", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074679011490711, "text": "If you pay £10 for a burger you must be stupid.", "created_at": "2025-08-07T20:48:13", "owner": "ktothejj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080830132923572, "text": "Bollox ur math..", "created_at": "2025-08-07T20:34:31", "owner": "e_ad__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18520685131018972, "text": "Hehe", "created_at": "2025-08-07T19:20:05", "owner": "bill_o61", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18282823813258640, "text": "10,000 a day? unless at a festival", "created_at": "2025-08-07T17:33:52", "owner": "ekongwtw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051826712393663, "text": "Bullshit", "created_at": "2025-08-07T17:24:16", "owner": "douglasskelvin1980", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069012113328980, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-08-07T13:25:04", "owner": "s.2_3_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072480782011626, "text": "Lmao, 10000 a day.  100 on a good day", "created_at": "2025-08-07T12:52:03", "owner": "mrmizushobai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069592058327408, "text": "First your gunna have buy all the van and burgers 🍔 and everything which will cost 10 k and then you have to slowly make that money back to get even 😆 🤣 😂 😹 😆 and not many people are paying 10 pounds for a burger unless your in Mayfair london and then they are to posh to be going burger vans anyway", "created_at": "2025-08-07T12:21:11", "owner": "calmwalkslondon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081683215848029, "text": "That's so stupid 36 million 💸 💰 🤑 a year from that , that's insane if you belive ypu are making that 😄 🤣 😂 😆 😄 🤣 😂 😆 😄 🤣 😂 😆 😄 🤣 😂 😆 😄 absolutely stupid", "created_at": "2025-08-07T12:19:47", "owner": "calmwalkslondon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911951626175960, "text": "If only it was that easy who gell is even paying 10 pound for a burger in a cost of living crisis 😄 🤣 😂 😆 😄 🤣 plus you go to buy all those burgers 🍔 first you no way are going to be making millions , you are going to be earning a standard wage if that lol", "created_at": "2025-08-07T12:16:34", "owner": "calmwalkslondon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18169125223355497, "text": "that’s if you don’t declare it.", "created_at": "2025-08-07T12:15:57", "owner": "dw_rvnz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968477568930996, "text": "Do they all work for free ?", "created_at": "2025-08-07T10:54:28", "owner": "cav.nah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073740539056314, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-08-07T10:31:56", "owner": "tastingtokyo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072551825097411, "text": "Probably sell 10 a day...", "created_at": "2025-08-07T08:02:04", "owner": "allthingsbeautifulfootball", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067448930173608, "text": "Where u gonna find 10000 customers 7 days a week ?", "created_at": "2025-08-07T07:39:57", "owner": "yodat4camper", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067186472231978, "text": "Now who do I give this slap to? 👋", "created_at": "2025-08-07T01:48:40", "owner": "khalilmajestic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089049457779471, "text": "Easy mode . Work 24hrs a day and sell 1 burger every 8.5 seconds", "created_at": "2025-08-06T21:46:11", "owner": "englishbrian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18405027757114242, "text": "@gemma_sloss_1111", "created_at": "2025-08-06T21:11:59", "owner": "jay.sloss2011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892721956292866, "text": "Bro, where can I buy a food truck for 3500 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-06T20:44:53", "owner": "the_security_samurai_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974972892871942, "text": "10k a day …  burger van sales final boss", "created_at": "2025-08-06T20:25:21", "owner": "lukespooner1991", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049609283237003, "text": "Clearly never owned or worked on a food truck", "created_at": "2025-08-06T19:07:58", "owner": "benpurdy1988", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075725032990153, "text": "Dummy 🤡 there is no way for you to serve 10k burgers per day in a food truck 🤦🏻🤡", "created_at": "2025-08-06T18:14:33", "owner": "clemcit0z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135716311437761, "text": "10,000 what planet are you on!\nLucky to do 100 max", "created_at": "2025-08-06T17:58:22", "owner": "cudabass", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171534322344732, "text": "The math ain't mathing you bunch of Camel shaggers", "created_at": "2025-08-06T15:57:51", "owner": "rmnoface_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076742428981090, "text": "Ho is gonna buy 10k burgers a day?🤦🏻‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-08-06T15:22:35", "owner": "albertttt.m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965857695793027, "text": "LOL. Impossible to sell 10000 burgers in 1 day 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-06T15:02:08", "owner": "theburgerbar_sa", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18159555070330921, "text": "Allahuma barrek", "created_at": "2025-08-06T13:57:24", "owner": "therendergremlin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044851694319446, "text": "Good luck with that", "created_at": "2025-08-06T10:28:17", "owner": "margen207", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077743474751518, "text": "Schaff erstmal 2K an nem tag zu verkaufen und red dann weiter", "created_at": "2025-08-06T10:18:44", "owner": "m0o.ptc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922717731999028, "text": "Theres no way you're selling 10,000 burgers/day everyday even if you are popular truck. Lucky to get 1,000.", "created_at": "2025-08-06T05:26:52", "owner": "_oknature", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108933985470470, "text": "Bro sucks at math's 🙌😂", "created_at": "2025-08-05T19:36:49", "owner": "earlvieira", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18168684613354968, "text": "10K a day?", "created_at": "2025-08-05T19:02:19", "owner": "faz78601", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043438298324475, "text": "Who sell 10000 burgers in a day not even McDonald’s? Be lucky to sell 100 and that is at a event", "created_at": "2025-08-05T18:15:18", "owner": "karl_cabbie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092964988650960, "text": "£10 for a burger your smoking greed", "created_at": "2025-08-05T18:12:46", "owner": "graft4liz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067215826914944, "text": "10k a day sales? Your math is way off. If you mange 100 you did extremely well", "created_at": "2025-08-05T17:41:13", "owner": "vanchotikvius", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948133176878016, "text": "Dumbest post of the day goes to....", "created_at": "2025-08-05T14:17:35", "owner": "carrnick12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069420242118027, "text": "Just sell 10,000 burgers a day, sure. Where are are you storing 10,000 burger and buns?", "created_at": "2025-08-05T13:40:14", "owner": "jamiescarfe", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18108546685536229, "text": "Ez if you are the only burger stand in the planet. Genius", "created_at": "2025-08-05T13:18:11", "owner": "egzonrama36", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000044474643363, "text": "Grill smoke cancer  price?", "created_at": "2025-08-05T13:02:39", "owner": "hi9h_drop_j4h", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060848033038884, "text": "if you sell 100 a day you lucky 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-05T12:21:57", "owner": "dattagramm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859778101462180, "text": "Paying staff 👏", "created_at": "2025-08-05T12:01:00", "owner": "forthenation666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980180403889245, "text": "10k a day? 🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-05T11:48:46", "owner": "rhys.o_whisk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053498534430322, "text": "This is such a stupid post.", "created_at": "2025-08-05T07:47:48", "owner": "alexduncansyd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18287702401267435, "text": "10.000 a day.....😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂sure!!! Good luck!!!", "created_at": "2025-08-04T23:43:02", "owner": "audifan75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172756957343017, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-04T23:41:16", "owner": "9319chb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118260139499192, "text": "Hahahhahahahahhahah idiot.", "created_at": "2025-08-04T22:46:48", "owner": "winiar213", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881757418241659, "text": "😂😂😂😂 .... sell 100000 then ...just make sure your day has more than 7200 hours 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-04T22:13:51", "owner": "zeezserano", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052920599164762, "text": "10,000 a day 😂😂😂😂🙈🙈🙈🙈🙈", "created_at": "2025-08-04T21:57:43", "owner": "huwbuilder", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17901819438237255, "text": "10‘000 burgers in one  day 😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-04T21:53:28", "owner": "alphacey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071145920082602, "text": "You will never ever sell 10,000 a day that is impossible I own 30 of these units", "created_at": "2025-08-04T21:49:33", "owner": "laurence8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074326274286427, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-04T21:36:56", "owner": "amiroz_fit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085870696646683, "text": "A truck like this would cost at least 15k", "created_at": "2025-08-04T21:17:36", "owner": "bigal_mcr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057604913096388, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-08-04T20:40:49", "owner": "izak5621", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035644550441236, "text": "💩💩💩", "created_at": "2025-08-04T20:01:58", "owner": "caledonianportraitstudios", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959093592974526, "text": "10,000 a day.  That is ridiculous, that will not happen", "created_at": "2025-08-04T19:27:50", "owner": "codde.rs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073721405474206, "text": "10,000 a day ain’t happening man", "created_at": "2025-08-04T17:30:04", "owner": "emiikimchi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917608636135130, "text": "A good truck for 3.5k? Yea add the 10k needed to get it up to scratch", "created_at": "2025-08-04T17:12:46", "owner": "deeshroomz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864857785439406, "text": "Cash hand 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-04T15:44:49", "owner": "m___simoes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047139734541960, "text": "10000 a day 🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-04T15:21:14", "owner": "jaimeco75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922635655000409, "text": "10,000🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-04T14:07:47", "owner": "metalcrafta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955480992841288, "text": "Pointless inaccurate video ffs 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-04T12:47:09", "owner": "ned_kelly76", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18527902801048349, "text": "You’d be lucky to sell 100.", "created_at": "2025-08-04T11:05:32", "owner": "muyi_baba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973475682865338, "text": "Get me a food truck worth 3.5", "created_at": "2025-08-04T10:51:47", "owner": "curtis_rhys_thomas_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110397730464183, "text": "10000 a day. You are not the sharpest pencil in the box. 😂 or maybe you are a sandwich 🥪 short of a picnic 😄", "created_at": "2025-08-04T09:04:45", "owner": "dragonflysphotos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18369366640195077, "text": "Anyway, it’s £3,650,000 not £36,500,000.\nAnd honestly, I’d love to see a food truck pump out 1,000 burgers every single day, all year long.\nThese three guys are supposed to make 3.65 million burgers in one year… from a food truck?\nYou’re lucky if you sell 50 a day, my friend.", "created_at": "2025-08-04T01:17:28", "owner": "dogtrainerandconsultant", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990472755824241, "text": "Skip the numbers , if the cashier filled with 3000€ per day , one year you getthe1 million", "created_at": "2025-08-03T21:48:37", "owner": "chef_farzu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061762823211652, "text": "Who actually wasted their time on this nonsense?", "created_at": "2025-08-03T19:34:10", "owner": "paulhusk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040086398344803, "text": "Costs of production left the chat", "created_at": "2025-08-03T19:23:11", "owner": "rajveerhonrao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18379836262193323, "text": "10 000 a day😂🤣😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-03T17:20:14", "owner": "liyaija", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052089929182365, "text": "From a drunk motivational speaker.", "created_at": "2025-08-03T17:18:58", "owner": "dowzy1111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977429046880541, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-03T17:15:38", "owner": "paul_drisc84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984927735837892, "text": "10.000 people walking by his truck and buy his food! Must be a festival!", "created_at": "2025-08-03T17:05:57", "owner": "angelicnails_southport", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069168548030719, "text": "Who sells 10k burgers a day ? I wanted to see that restaurant", "created_at": "2025-08-03T16:56:07", "owner": "rashidramzan721", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18394777792189644, "text": "10,000 in one day 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-03T16:47:04", "owner": "jamierussell9062", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155974000340318, "text": "Sounds good. Tell me where I could potentially get 10k customers per day. Or even 1k. I’d be happy.", "created_at": "2025-08-03T16:44:51", "owner": "zeropostclub", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845656582539915, "text": "10000 in one day 😂😂😂 how do you people come up with such nonsense", "created_at": "2025-08-03T16:42:01", "owner": "nappypandaofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934775638070854, "text": "I have 0 money, I bought a plane for $10'000. I have customers every 5 minutes willing to rent that for $30k. I make now 70 trillion a year . Easy , everyone else is lazy . This is how to be rich", "created_at": "2025-08-03T16:21:30", "owner": "royuk115", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067273903922509, "text": "Nah bro it's £98 billion a year .", "created_at": "2025-08-03T16:20:14", "owner": "royuk115", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164507179367857, "text": "10,000 talk realistic init", "created_at": "2025-08-03T15:22:21", "owner": "hustledamoneyrecords", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897039457258550, "text": "10,000 a day ????", "created_at": "2025-08-03T15:21:46", "owner": "hustledamoneyrecords", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073953647003751, "text": "Im sure its thay simppe", "created_at": "2025-08-03T14:26:20", "owner": "iamattp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054499583436766, "text": "@luyone_wandisa", "created_at": "2025-08-03T14:15:58", "owner": "aaron_renzo1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17847733320502625, "text": "Let us handle your waste cooking oil and recycle it responsibly!\nCall us at 07402861522 or send us a text.\nWe operate nationwide, picking up your waste oil and offering you a choice:\nReceive 20 liters of fresh cooking oil, or\nGet cash in return.\n\nContact us today for a seamless and eco-friendly solution!", "created_at": "2025-08-03T13:39:17", "owner": "thegreenoilrecyclers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094398862723648, "text": "What about ingredients and staff pay and such", "created_at": "2025-08-03T13:08:45", "owner": "woodstockbluehaigh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143367544408880, "text": "Not true 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-03T13:02:01", "owner": "hubbe6464", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121516639479308, "text": "10k a day seems abit bs 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-03T12:45:34", "owner": "chambers_skateshop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18516837331050215, "text": "No one is selling 10k burger from that a day", "created_at": "2025-08-03T12:19:28", "owner": "whatmichaeldid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090533557668630, "text": "@bianca.raluca98 😂😂🔥", "created_at": "2025-08-03T11:43:59", "owner": "undertheredcloud", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18381325699135420, "text": "Assuming you cook one burger at a time", "created_at": "2025-08-03T10:56:18", "owner": "timefor_a_new_world", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922420842997837, "text": "Not one English person", "created_at": "2025-08-03T10:24:56", "owner": "rick.taylor.102", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990867060684044, "text": "Take in to account expenditures you aint makeing anywhere near that", "created_at": "2025-08-03T08:36:35", "owner": "weeman_tekileo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022913522724962, "text": "10k burgers not even some fast foods reach that number", "created_at": "2025-08-03T07:55:50", "owner": "un_argentino_perdido", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922484719099549, "text": "How thin are the burgers, 1mm, you couldn’t store that many burgers in cold storage, unless your carting an industrial fridge, but we all know health and safety along EHO standards aren’t your strong point", "created_at": "2025-08-03T07:39:50", "owner": "schnauzer74", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18405673753113612, "text": "10000 a day 😆 🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-03T02:49:56", "owner": "shananharris5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093157870634701, "text": "Get on dragons den fucktards", "created_at": "2025-08-02T22:29:12", "owner": "mr_ngq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962123457951018, "text": "Give me full info", "created_at": "2025-08-02T21:48:56", "owner": "imsaad_khalid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904912036213357, "text": "Fucking moronic. Even if you worked a 12hr day you'd still have to pump 17-18 burgers a minute 😂 stupid post making people think they'll be millionaires running a burger van! Wise up", "created_at": "2025-08-02T21:14:02", "owner": "matthewmccombe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996311010658743, "text": "Is this guy a fucking idiot.", "created_at": "2025-08-02T17:47:12", "owner": "scharlie91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062354360251836, "text": "If you were at a festival with 20,000 people  and no competition for 365 days maybe you’d make around £5,000,000. But the reality is your numbers drop off when people are sleeping and after lunch late afternoon. So totally unrealistic. If such a venue did exist you’d lose most of that in pitch fees to the landowner.", "created_at": "2025-08-02T17:21:00", "owner": "phat_vegan.ig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089895559813574, "text": "Rookie! Buy two food trucks!", "created_at": "2025-08-02T17:00:48", "owner": "themodernplan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975892074905337, "text": "10,000 burgers a day hmmm 🤔 doable at a festival ?????", "created_at": "2025-08-02T16:44:53", "owner": "garylewisphd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18162019978367423, "text": "It’s easy, just sleep 3 hours per day. That’s how millionaires thrive", "created_at": "2025-08-02T16:36:32", "owner": "zorzbilali", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041164715643400, "text": "Impossible to sell 10k burger a day", "created_at": "2025-08-02T16:31:46", "owner": "honestadvice1966", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915382582155925, "text": "The math is not mathing 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-02T16:04:52", "owner": "nabfur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855554554437224, "text": "Make food trucks for $500, sell each one for $50,000. Sell 10,000 a day. $5bilion a year. Lock in.", "created_at": "2025-08-02T14:57:00", "owner": "gailsman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18191026579316144, "text": "You wouldn’t sell 10,000 burgers at a full capacity Wembley stadium. 🏟️", "created_at": "2025-08-02T13:01:18", "owner": "davidtoubianofficial", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18019187090548508, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-02T12:47:11", "owner": "arciss0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969234822778829, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-02T12:47:04", "owner": "arciss0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055393535603154, "text": "No one is selling 10,000 burgers a day, you muppet", "created_at": "2025-08-02T12:23:23", "owner": "benjlango1307", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908774359196160, "text": "Not included pitch fees ingredient costs", "created_at": "2025-08-02T12:12:48", "owner": "peter.crick", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039627656359411, "text": "Where can I find a food truck for 3.5k😂", "created_at": "2025-08-02T11:46:23", "owner": "freddy_lion_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866650930353826, "text": "Buy a food truck for 1$ and sell the burger for 1M", "created_at": "2025-08-02T11:45:57", "owner": "lucashohmann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18317542273224237, "text": "MONEY MONEY MONEY - MAKES THE NARCISSIST 🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-02T11:26:27", "owner": "thatsfreshhh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063908339244084, "text": "Sickkkkk wish I knew this years ago. Just gotta lock in and BOOM! Magic.", "created_at": "2025-08-02T10:41:39", "owner": "eatsandreceipts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016747919756892, "text": "Both your local McDonalds and Burger King combined didn’t sell 10,000 burgers today so good luck", "created_at": "2025-08-02T10:24:09", "owner": "childofthetrap", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071222447009298, "text": "You mean 3,6 millions a day. But you can't sell 1000 burgers a day and you need to reduce the price of meat and vegetables and bread , electricity , gaz etc .... and the salaries", "created_at": "2025-08-02T10:11:36", "owner": "perso4507", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182059972324182, "text": "10k a day!", "created_at": "2025-08-02T09:18:37", "owner": "drxperiencewilliams", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886469050336969, "text": "Do you sell 10k in a day?", "created_at": "2025-08-02T06:23:42", "owner": "silivastrucostin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065669981469863, "text": "Your not selling 10.000 burgers a day from a burger truck", "created_at": "2025-08-02T05:23:22", "owner": "momolee3312", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338645782160697, "text": "10,000 burgers a day LOL", "created_at": "2025-08-02T00:09:27", "owner": "alex.neil93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089696128662486, "text": "Good idea, bravo !!!! 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-01T23:29:32", "owner": "chrispanicjr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877091671271679, "text": "Thats 20 burger per minutes on a 8 hours shift", "created_at": "2025-08-01T23:23:14", "owner": "hugodeschamps7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070515377028163, "text": "I have one.. I sell max 50/day...", "created_at": "2025-08-01T22:02:24", "owner": "sergiu_420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18340493161161202, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-08-01T21:32:48", "owner": "vvsbee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946931527002085, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-01T20:13:30", "owner": "sohandsomebarbers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846397534537661, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-01T20:13:28", "owner": "sohandsomebarbers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979410594736664, "text": "Balls is it! Burger van = tax and insurance. Fuel. Personnel hire. Food ingredients. Licence to serve food. Health and safety training.", "created_at": "2025-08-01T19:59:33", "owner": "smdphotog", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049718261631619, "text": "Go back to school", "created_at": "2025-08-01T18:12:25", "owner": "max.blake02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104083951497151, "text": "Ov yeah, totally viable.", "created_at": "2025-08-01T18:04:45", "owner": "vitaliy.grynchyshyn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946653688008481, "text": "10000 per day is thinking way too small 🤣", "created_at": "2025-08-01T17:12:26", "owner": "tony_tony_m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916127866152843, "text": "And all the people work for free…", "created_at": "2025-08-01T16:28:58", "owner": "niels_wouters79", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146197138403538, "text": "Buy a burger van, do a meal deal burger chips and powdered coke for 50 and make 50,000 a day thats 18,250,000 call your food truck pablos 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-01T15:39:49", "owner": "nevets2023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368202376148558, "text": "10,000 a day from a truck 🤣 keep dreaming", "created_at": "2025-08-01T14:51:57", "owner": "charlieh4200", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043097771337101, "text": "10,000 burgers per day, that must be a prime location!!!", "created_at": "2025-08-01T13:15:17", "owner": "terrance.ndlovu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097038703529561, "text": "10k burgers / day?! Let’s be real now mate!", "created_at": "2025-08-01T12:35:12", "owner": "mufis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906491752198966, "text": "Die Rechnung funktioniert \nwenn du das Raum-Zeit-Kontinuum biegst, ein Paralleluniversum anzapfst und auf Schlaf verzichtest.\n\nOder du startest einfach mit 200 Burgern pro Tag, schraubst dich hoch – und bleibst dabei wach, freundlich und realistisch. 😄", "created_at": "2025-08-01T12:33:36", "owner": "kattwinkelcologne", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17859214056462324, "text": "Did not think you sell 10k burgers in one,would not have thought macs do either,(in one of there restaurant)", "created_at": "2025-08-01T12:03:15", "owner": "r44_eco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074246921061024, "text": "10 a burger 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-01T09:29:27", "owner": "hadley.edd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878296519265914, "text": "@s.f.x", "created_at": "2025-08-01T08:45:21", "owner": "official_griztme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053023388161334, "text": "You can also sell 1 million burgers per day. In one year and retire really faster than expected.", "created_at": "2025-08-01T08:20:57", "owner": "harrys.gantz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062522800989544, "text": "Loooool😂", "created_at": "2025-08-01T05:45:03", "owner": "rogerschefer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090566557664570, "text": "10k burgers a day? Who did that maths?", "created_at": "2025-08-01T04:02:18", "owner": "raielc_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030348938499263, "text": "So where do I just get free burgers to sell 💁‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-07-31T23:50:49", "owner": "bailigrave", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074494562488839, "text": "10k per day?? I’m all for setting goals but seriously….", "created_at": "2025-07-31T22:40:40", "owner": "jayjayjay_jj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002877416801273, "text": "Major gaslighted here", "created_at": "2025-07-31T21:24:39", "owner": "newenergy888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861093676449318, "text": "So you could retire a year later", "created_at": "2025-07-31T20:08:47", "owner": "daccordlemonde", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074466688996400, "text": "We will supply the buns 🙌", "created_at": "2025-07-31T19:07:04", "owner": "breadaheadbakery", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18351661192090294, "text": "10,000 burgers a day😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-31T18:53:55", "owner": "_grafflix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855571564480411, "text": "10, 000 a day", "created_at": "2025-07-31T17:59:46", "owner": "comward106", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978670140855802, "text": "Far to many people in one small space that would piss me right off the bat", "created_at": "2025-07-31T16:44:11", "owner": "kazblade7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172567306344264, "text": "10k burgers a day from a van 🤣🤣 maybe between 10-15 vans", "created_at": "2025-07-31T16:34:30", "owner": "greeny0124", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156875035374018, "text": "No one would sell 10k a day. So, there's that.", "created_at": "2025-07-31T16:26:13", "owner": "pscbw1981", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092879704724242, "text": "CAP! The grill doesn’t take more than 10 burgers at a time. So you the entire east london is consuming only burgers daily?!", "created_at": "2025-07-31T16:13:22", "owner": "lebrownofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989448972689121, "text": "10k burgers a day is wild", "created_at": "2025-07-31T15:35:24", "owner": "its_aokyyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861899017446608, "text": "10 thousand a day ???!!! 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-31T14:12:28", "owner": "l.a.u.r.a_sm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18521347222004293, "text": "Yes in 12h you have to sell only 833 burgers .. 70 per hour 😂 and - cost of thos what you use for burgers .... and tax ? 😂 you are poor again 😜", "created_at": "2025-07-31T14:03:41", "owner": "grzegorzszczepanskiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027866156686842, "text": "10k burgers a day ????? Is a lot", "created_at": "2025-07-31T13:16:18", "owner": "rinsekid.k", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17924766888098585, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-07-31T13:00:06", "owner": "jahsiuah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069253691107141, "text": "10,000 a day behave !", "created_at": "2025-07-31T12:03:27", "owner": "m6rk_r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118692613471078, "text": "Love it haha", "created_at": "2025-07-31T11:21:21", "owner": "alexgalexgalexg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958386636975708, "text": "Who the fuck can sell 10k burgers a day you soppy cunts", "created_at": "2025-07-31T10:54:29", "owner": "itsjustdt85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036248873424924, "text": "10,000 a day yea right…..wouldn’t sell more than 100…..", "created_at": "2025-07-31T10:23:26", "owner": "saywhatiseealways", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872077471303860, "text": "Thanks for doing the working out, I knew it was bs but couldn't be bothered to do it myself.", "created_at": "2025-07-31T10:05:59", "owner": "danny_does_dinner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042248648646730, "text": "10k a day, alrighty 🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-31T09:49:13", "owner": "doner_bros_uk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036980306408931, "text": "🤣🤣🤣 obvious this is ironic…. A £3,500 food truck. That’s basically going to be a horse box without any equipment. For one the size of the one showed here and second hand your looking at least 10k. But you need a van or truck big enough to tow it plus all the equipment. Minimum 30k set up for all those parts.\n10,000 burgers a day is 17 burgers a minute. Grill will cook about 12 every 8-10 mins. I’m going to work out the rest of the maths….", "created_at": "2025-07-31T08:27:44", "owner": "cheeserollerspub", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062627183203920, "text": "10k burger a day ?! Yeah no way that's gonna work for a food truck , even a full time NYC oodtruck  wont do that much burger", "created_at": "2025-07-31T05:54:00", "owner": "ramy_maur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087277225761726, "text": "Try calculating how much it cost you to produce the burger. 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-31T05:47:14", "owner": "rayallen236", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916701391138316, "text": "The burger, hot dogs, cold drinks can i see has tue same set up. Two young girls maybe 24 - and they sit on the two chairs outside placed for customers. And they definitely do not sell 10,000 a day. Maybe a small luncthtime rush but its probably just making wages \nSo its bs - keep ur 3.5\nThe math is correct / the realistic prospects of it working are geographical only.", "created_at": "2025-07-31T04:39:56", "owner": "tonyaddisonjones", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978692037902247, "text": "Where th you gonna find 10000 customers in a day bro like cmon let’s be serious", "created_at": "2025-07-31T03:37:50", "owner": "cg_raul17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050026169538133, "text": "10,000 burgers (a day) = 2500lb of beef. Good luck", "created_at": "2025-07-31T01:43:08", "owner": "chefandrewcarter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088723819706315, "text": "More like selling 500 burgers a day foodtruck cost 10k and maybe make 1m a year", "created_at": "2025-07-31T00:19:38", "owner": "jordan_sthlm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887358769323821, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-30T23:32:20", "owner": "ah_jacob_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072664688083715, "text": "You would have to sell 100k a day to make 36.5million", "created_at": "2025-07-30T23:12:40", "owner": "davehendersonmusic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059639852344878, "text": "Shey naa spirit you want sell 10k burgers to?  Let's normalize discerning reality and being a delulu 4ck!", "created_at": "2025-07-30T22:37:20", "owner": "god.did101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071253368081766, "text": "Great business plan!!", "created_at": "2025-07-30T21:30:15", "owner": "andyclement2144", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030063947694958, "text": "Well it can work\"  thats why most are done by  foreigners", "created_at": "2025-07-30T21:09:35", "owner": "artistin_brandon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036971522414211, "text": "Assuming a 15 hour day, thats over 11 burgers a minute 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-30T20:23:02", "owner": "johnnicholson6891", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130801885451427, "text": "@lashes_em I will buy the truck and pay for the licenses n that and the pitch to put it you do the cooking we split the money ? No joke If your onit I’m down my g", "created_at": "2025-07-30T19:58:28", "owner": "mtrapierre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059893997351143, "text": "6 staff a day , 6 wages . \nyou’d be lucky to sell 200 on rainy days no chance 10000 every day just unrealistic", "created_at": "2025-07-30T19:56:25", "owner": "jmahou1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096244528721209, "text": "Considering McDonald's sells 6.5million a day across 41,000 sites that works out as 160 burgers per site per day and most are 24 hours i don't see this as being viable", "created_at": "2025-07-30T19:49:35", "owner": "avvision15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062739440224476, "text": "7 burgers a minute 24 hours a day", "created_at": "2025-07-30T19:31:46", "owner": "alan_g67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955077321980985, "text": "No way sell a burger for £10", "created_at": "2025-07-30T19:03:10", "owner": "lizmchugh2105", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966378783943684, "text": "Ok, 10,000 burgers sold within a 12 hour span (let’s be realistic and say 12pm-12am)….thats approx 833 burgers sold an hour, thats 14* burgers sold a minute…. I dont even think a regular McDs branch is hitting those numbers. Selling 10,000 burgers a day is not easy but i rate the mindset 🫡", "created_at": "2025-07-30T18:22:34", "owner": "dannydicegram", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061188785352754, "text": "Even McDonald's don't sell that many a day", "created_at": "2025-07-30T18:21:13", "owner": "chef.westygram", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938228323058369, "text": "Omg", "created_at": "2025-07-30T18:10:15", "owner": "pipers_grounds_maintenance", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052623662574895, "text": "Burger van, not food truck man.", "created_at": "2025-07-30T17:16:53", "owner": "tasty.tasty.corn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946792407886012, "text": "Got about 17 man in that truck and still ain’t pumping out that many burgers 😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-07-30T15:55:53", "owner": "bandizuru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981989073852524, "text": "10,0000 burgers on the first day LOCK IN 😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-07-30T15:55:24", "owner": "bandizuru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075069925803331, "text": "Yeah don’t pay any staff or permits and sell 10,000 a day easy a’ lol", "created_at": "2025-07-30T15:28:32", "owner": "feckdeath", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073837279826240, "text": "10.000 per day 😆😆😆😆😆", "created_at": "2025-07-30T14:48:45", "owner": "kaya.o1907", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154723873384315, "text": "416 burgers an hour so 7 a minute...speaking from a cooking point of view id say that's impossible without shitloads of prep.  Or giving an entire city ecoli", "created_at": "2025-07-30T13:39:46", "owner": "omega_reborn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938243266046897, "text": "Fuckin love burgers doe", "created_at": "2025-07-30T13:00:41", "owner": "theaveragejoe123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18364989721150023, "text": "Yeah but half is paying it back into the company to keep it running for a while", "created_at": "2025-07-30T13:00:20", "owner": "theaveragejoe123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863056231440705, "text": "The math is mething", "created_at": "2025-07-30T12:39:11", "owner": "iharshitsinha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322939132225320, "text": "The maths ain’t maths’ing but your point is heard loud and clear", "created_at": "2025-07-30T12:14:47", "owner": "manlikenaija", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071107193030572, "text": "For 10k a day That’s one burger every 11 second 24/7.  And still makes 3.6 million in a year. Not 36. I vet you voted Trump with your skill level", "created_at": "2025-07-30T11:33:57", "owner": "p.t.g.dorset", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18471440173073109, "text": "10.000 burger weights far more than the truck", "created_at": "2025-07-30T11:19:23", "owner": "otmaroo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107839117531800, "text": "10000 😳😂😳😂", "created_at": "2025-07-30T10:36:41", "owner": "steelstarcustoms", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039759836355626, "text": "You ain't selling 10000 in a day from that truck 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-30T09:24:34", "owner": "michaeldraggatt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965226846793279, "text": "Then u got tax", "created_at": "2025-07-30T09:22:02", "owner": "bmalakhai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042785096327366, "text": "I guess that’s why they are flipping burgers. Cause math isn’t their strong point", "created_at": "2025-07-30T08:44:14", "owner": "cristiansavulescu89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18420756541099143, "text": "10000 burgers a day 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-30T08:19:19", "owner": "tattooeddadireland", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079993429924854, "text": "Yeah just sell 10,000 burgers a day ..from one burger van. LOL", "created_at": "2025-07-30T06:06:33", "owner": "mattfoxall92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077683369746595, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-07-30T01:40:49", "owner": "a1jbillzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172640296343355, "text": "10k per day ? Even five guys don’t make 10k per day.", "created_at": "2025-07-30T00:51:10", "owner": "akaash_295", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901957669237528, "text": "10k burgers not even McDonald’s can do that unless in central place", "created_at": "2025-07-30T00:35:25", "owner": "mushus78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035002538456083, "text": "🤢🤢🤢", "created_at": "2025-07-30T00:18:24", "owner": "davelambert1991", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088338322780042, "text": "Do you know how hard it is to sell 1500 units a. Day & how you have to build that business up to get there 10k units a day. Everyday is unrealistic", "created_at": "2025-07-29T22:57:18", "owner": "big___price", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052421240176928, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-29T22:56:17", "owner": "big___price", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039744833352195, "text": "Who the hell is selling 10,000 burgers", "created_at": "2025-07-29T21:50:03", "owner": "a_abdel23", "likes": 2503}, {"id": 17958129917823179, "text": "We ran a loaded hotdog van & done an event we sold over 1,000 in 3days & it was absolutely chaotic for 72hours 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-29T21:48:15", "owner": "lewy8smith", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068852315034445, "text": "Smash burgers need to go away. I dont want burger pancakes", "created_at": "2025-07-29T21:34:17", "owner": "wolfmansgotnards", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043104074324128, "text": "Can you really sell 10000 burgers a day???", "created_at": "2025-07-29T21:07:12", "owner": "rachelchowchow2312", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070608134018072, "text": "Everyone caught up on the big numbers when the small 3.5k for a truck is the starting issue here!! 🤣🤣 20-30k for a second hand truck that’ll come with one 3-4ft griddle so you’ll probably still need to put more into it to make it work for such high volume output of trade? £10 burgers are becoming more common nowadays, that’s not greed it’s cost increase of quality produce!! If you know you know", "created_at": "2025-07-29T20:06:50", "owner": "lukeelward", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366113194149254, "text": "The fact you want £10 for a burger. You don't need  a van you want a getaway car😂", "created_at": "2025-07-29T19:55:40", "owner": "bovril1963", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051898382432664, "text": "Bullshido calculations..", "created_at": "2025-07-29T19:32:31", "owner": "laci_8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942951438906249, "text": "10,000 a day, where you selling burgers at?", "created_at": "2025-07-29T19:26:21", "owner": "lukiejersey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922196553996716, "text": "Most burgers you can sell a day maybe 300 not even macdonalds can sell 10,000 burgers in one day!!!", "created_at": "2025-07-29T19:15:46", "owner": "dolcy_dotcom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046598669559203, "text": "10,000 burgers a day? Highly unlikely… maybe a central London McDonalds", "created_at": "2025-07-29T18:45:02", "owner": "mixtapemessiah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050479802569454, "text": "10,000 😮", "created_at": "2025-07-29T18:33:26", "owner": "chri.s88lane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18283906894268180, "text": "10’000 a day from a van 😂😂😂 yeah alright", "created_at": "2025-07-29T17:57:56", "owner": "heres_coopa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053056241419321, "text": "They must be intoxicating burgers", "created_at": "2025-07-29T16:53:00", "owner": "ajazfaqir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070753526074453, "text": "Good luck trying to find 10,000 mugs willing to spend a tenner on a van burger", "created_at": "2025-07-29T15:40:20", "owner": "maddogboon1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044977466307002, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-29T15:10:07", "owner": "billythehuskita", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074787448789463, "text": "Clearly you're at a festival there, you ain't getting that busy on your home turf", "created_at": "2025-07-29T13:38:22", "owner": "aggycollects", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909930829187434, "text": "Where you selling 10,000 a day at??", "created_at": "2025-07-29T13:00:48", "owner": "richardfloyd2944", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898234756126819, "text": "Or just resell the truck for 36.496 million?", "created_at": "2025-07-29T11:54:41", "owner": "michel_leonhalilovic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18317860660234455, "text": "Why stop at 10k burgers. Sell 1 million a day since you are making shit up anyway.", "created_at": "2025-07-29T11:47:28", "owner": "jon_d_hulme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078330793902231, "text": "10,000 a day? lol", "created_at": "2025-07-29T10:11:24", "owner": "axelk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092947597652536, "text": "This includes the 📦 maal selling a day out back van lol", "created_at": "2025-07-29T09:09:50", "owner": "markytommo82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092294830639492, "text": "10k burgers a day 🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-29T09:01:02", "owner": "melon333head", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082142884859510, "text": "10,000 burgers a day? What's your name? Ronny McD?", "created_at": "2025-07-29T08:51:45", "owner": "advancedcleaning2021", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089961592677482, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-29T06:34:53", "owner": "przemyslaw.chipsinski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866739271425694, "text": "unfortunately a food truck cost way more than 3.5k 😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-29T00:57:46", "owner": "pizza_papiii_99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066648038135699, "text": "20 burgers a minute for 8 hours straight 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-28T23:47:14", "owner": "fallen_angel201_5", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18066629291128347, "text": "Sell 10k burgers a day 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-28T23:12:46", "owner": "easymoneydagger_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020774858730089, "text": "How are you making 36.5mil ? Slave labour?", "created_at": "2025-07-28T23:10:46", "owner": "piash0171", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18512468200011619, "text": "No way your selling 10000 burgers", "created_at": "2025-07-28T22:58:14", "owner": "yu53fc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18471966322079560, "text": "Flatten them burgers anymore it’ll be thinner than bacon", "created_at": "2025-07-28T21:22:21", "owner": "pjcarpman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105982858555078, "text": "10,000 a day😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-28T21:21:31", "owner": "pjcarpman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966542592927309, "text": "Those burgers are so thin", "created_at": "2025-07-28T20:47:08", "owner": "airyeezy5.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063898211265380, "text": "Isn’t that 100k? Minute van 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-28T18:39:26", "owner": "chrisbody360", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076731004748044, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-28T18:17:14", "owner": "fullaflavourz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102347137567666, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-28T18:16:07", "owner": "fullaflavourz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877490560374317, "text": "Sign us up 💯💯🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-07-28T18:16:00", "owner": "fullaflavourz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18516209353024818, "text": "Load of shite", "created_at": "2025-07-28T17:29:57", "owner": "dannym_new", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035289038439583, "text": "D!ckhe@d", "created_at": "2025-07-28T15:59:53", "owner": "marcfincham", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110373178523017, "text": "Yup gotta be really stupid to spend 10 quid on a shit burger van burger lol or more money than sence but then again you'd be dumb lol", "created_at": "2025-07-28T15:28:54", "owner": "ryansyde", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963676827955310, "text": "£10 ? Sounds pricy", "created_at": "2025-07-28T15:24:57", "owner": "frog.spawn182", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058383428371734, "text": "😂 who the fuck is doin ten thousand burgers a day 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-28T15:07:23", "owner": "pacheannoo_0151", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052701155161657, "text": "Willing to buy food truck in 300,000 and the spot rent.. if u show me how to sale 10k burger a day", "created_at": "2025-07-28T11:56:50", "owner": "cafe.bar.yehuda", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17940269712037236, "text": "Iluse a taco press and paper to prep", "created_at": "2025-07-28T11:28:30", "owner": "saltgubbe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897723160253585, "text": "Sell 10 thousand in a day good luck .", "created_at": "2025-07-28T11:26:45", "owner": "justinmarks94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051066734572843, "text": "Maths left the chat 🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-07-28T11:26:09", "owner": "hijueputanegro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892857367272657, "text": "You'd never sell 10,000 burgers a day", "created_at": "2025-07-28T07:58:44", "owner": "turtleboyj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067715114168388, "text": "10000 a day 🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-28T04:33:18", "owner": "geoffreythomasgreene", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066330134274916, "text": "😂😂. Minus the labour,taxes,food cost.  That comes with hard work sacrifice.", "created_at": "2025-07-28T03:51:57", "owner": "rey_escobar1981", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096210814531935, "text": "Need a billion staff too", "created_at": "2025-07-27T22:40:55", "owner": "bairakhalid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918354430129483, "text": "Bro isn’t selling 10k burgers a day sorry.", "created_at": "2025-07-27T21:37:51", "owner": "davie_123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305780869174631, "text": "Never gonna happen.", "created_at": "2025-07-27T21:22:57", "owner": "craftworks_street_kitchen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915658555032862, "text": "Yeah…1,000 burger a day.\nwondering where he will storage all 1000 buns and meats at on the truck…", "created_at": "2025-07-27T19:53:11", "owner": "fellippeesteves", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941416618032235, "text": "9", "created_at": "2025-07-27T19:50:46", "owner": "input_kitchens", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035960225436225, "text": "Do nothing...stay in migrant hotel.", "created_at": "2025-07-27T18:19:14", "owner": "moochie338", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046176266277789, "text": "Hahaha that's pure woman maths", "created_at": "2025-07-27T17:05:03", "owner": "longshanks_ht", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18173865142341116, "text": "A food truck is 30 grand", "created_at": "2025-07-27T16:24:02", "owner": "chefmarkirwin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086932765762570, "text": "Jewish Math is amazing 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-27T15:44:49", "owner": "flyingburrito2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085953826694172, "text": "10k a day?? 😆", "created_at": "2025-07-27T14:59:36", "owner": "sjwroe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110170579518910, "text": "Are forgetting overhead’s?", "created_at": "2025-07-27T14:46:11", "owner": "chefcarlcarlosgaldins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053821574132125, "text": "Bakwaas", "created_at": "2025-07-27T14:36:54", "owner": "yaz_ijaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036269114681316, "text": "10,000 a day 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-27T14:16:19", "owner": "ash_breeze1990", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051948554391911, "text": "No one’s cooking 10k burgers.", "created_at": "2025-07-27T14:13:14", "owner": "leonmaculewicz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042904256640527, "text": "Who sells 10,000 burgers or more day unless ur McDonald's", "created_at": "2025-07-27T14:02:10", "owner": "chef.gordy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894797290143557, "text": "salary ?", "created_at": "2025-07-27T13:44:59", "owner": "jaih_l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956993892830761, "text": "Where you selling 10k burgers a day??", "created_at": "2025-07-27T13:33:46", "owner": "oxcarper", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061427579023143, "text": "Aye it's that easy. Load of pish", "created_at": "2025-07-27T13:12:56", "owner": "scottandwilsonbar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074789965807241, "text": "How much per burger? 🤮 Scammers gonna scam", "created_at": "2025-07-27T12:14:49", "owner": "happy_spaniels", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066206570169122, "text": "No human can sell 10k a day. Maybe a good 160 of maybe If Ur fast and good 200.", "created_at": "2025-07-27T11:53:45", "owner": "timur_eki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106844491546658, "text": "This is why there's an 80% failure rate up to 10 years for new businesses", "created_at": "2025-07-27T11:01:14", "owner": "jojoe_126", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051844697179304, "text": "10,000 you chat some shit", "created_at": "2025-07-27T10:24:54", "owner": "thorpe1979", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073716401069050, "text": "I'd like to know where you get a food truck for 3.5k??", "created_at": "2025-07-27T10:23:32", "owner": "roy_goodger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989474097683524, "text": "Who the fk is selling 10,000 burgers a day 😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-27T09:35:27", "owner": "mellor_fella", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847071223505813, "text": "Mc ds clear 1500 to 2000 a day. How are you doing 10k? Stop the lies 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-27T09:03:38", "owner": "kabzeetech", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075411671502605, "text": "Which truck sells 10000 burgers a day? More like 100-200 on a very good day", "created_at": "2025-07-27T08:47:54", "owner": "maryska_market", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072701930480605, "text": "Abit optimistic they don't even sell 10000 at Hyde park festival 1200 a day and that's if 40000 people are at an event", "created_at": "2025-07-27T08:47:06", "owner": "capturethemoment271", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064195376336312, "text": "Bollocks", "created_at": "2025-07-27T08:34:11", "owner": "geordiebap1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053171165402273, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-27T06:37:12", "owner": "snapfeast.pk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914945290141125, "text": "Why the pointless post", "created_at": "2025-07-27T05:39:15", "owner": "alistair_harris_nz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18287759404252004, "text": "Again a bullshit. Food cost, permit, payroll, taxes. This BS posts always highlight only toplines. Margin? And always most of the overeducated birds celebrating bullshit", "created_at": "2025-07-27T05:00:15", "owner": "sgretva12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905621998208525, "text": "6 employes🔥", "created_at": "2025-07-27T02:42:38", "owner": "nielsfromuden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891555049277175, "text": "10000 a day from a truck. Shut the fuck up. That’s just retarded numbers and not possible from a fucking truck especially daily.", "created_at": "2025-07-26T23:53:43", "owner": "lairdoruadhain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034918007448919, "text": "10,000 a day", "created_at": "2025-07-26T23:02:27", "owner": "parisvintage1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912945934046986, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-07-26T22:16:09", "owner": "jcdidit__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070077989488325, "text": "Taxes and more?", "created_at": "2025-07-26T22:11:58", "owner": "osnli06", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18103723561564063, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-26T21:32:53", "owner": "moohatch", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18089319571708344, "text": "Go work at mcdo. You will sell more for less money 🙌", "created_at": "2025-07-26T21:22:38", "owner": "kennymichiels89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130245634394054, "text": "Bullshit", "created_at": "2025-07-26T20:53:11", "owner": "michael_wingking", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950488491865323, "text": "10,000 a day.... riiigght", "created_at": "2025-07-26T20:34:29", "owner": "croot.steve", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18283343242257203, "text": "Then find out that some of your hired indian lads had no visa and pay big fine", "created_at": "2025-07-26T19:35:14", "owner": "wineiseverything666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18515434159000298, "text": "No one will sell 10k burgers a day. At most 100.", "created_at": "2025-07-26T19:19:44", "owner": "luciast0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337773115165191, "text": "XD", "created_at": "2025-07-26T19:03:37", "owner": "00ed397699", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075159574948267, "text": "10000 burgers a day, every day? Grow up 🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-07-26T18:13:59", "owner": "davidgaskell52", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056254283355259, "text": "Let’s agree with the calculation for a minute… what about the expenditure, salaries and co… back to time- wrong calculation on the sales per day", "created_at": "2025-07-26T18:00:25", "owner": "myaudiomack", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039219083356702, "text": "Are sure 10k in a day 🤣and all days are not same", "created_at": "2025-07-26T17:58:28", "owner": "shakir_mohd161", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950301363867518, "text": "We forgetting about tax licenses and stock 😂 they don’t come for free", "created_at": "2025-07-26T17:50:26", "owner": "darraghmoran98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066532382129621, "text": "10,000 a day 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-26T17:45:57", "owner": "paulsutton86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075893509945698, "text": "7 burgers per minute 24 hours a day. Hope your book keeping is better", "created_at": "2025-07-26T17:45:30", "owner": "stonefxwalls", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18417830242098934, "text": "10000 a day.. your weed is strong😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-26T17:41:26", "owner": "lassana_d_masso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093457615723212, "text": "10000 a day 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-26T17:18:47", "owner": "nicky.boy44", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875983897382665, "text": "Math ain't mathing bruv", "created_at": "2025-07-26T16:46:36", "owner": "audi_phant", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060020843521431, "text": "You still gotta buy the burger, etc. Pay the staff.. Pay the pitch.. Cummon", "created_at": "2025-07-26T16:42:10", "owner": "dj_relentless76", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883576159225486, "text": "How do you store 10.000 burgers. Rolls chips etc in the fridge or is it a TARDIS fridge", "created_at": "2025-07-26T16:11:03", "owner": "chrisjtaylor47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038279420663731, "text": "No one is going to buy a burger for Tenner 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-26T16:01:24", "owner": "b1sh4l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964627644936036, "text": "17 burger per Minute in 10 hour shift? Possible?", "created_at": "2025-07-26T15:43:27", "owner": "mondogusto.ch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966207780933161, "text": "Indian math?", "created_at": "2025-07-26T15:41:42", "owner": "krzysztof_kada", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033655004676905, "text": "@cattleandsmoke let’s go halfs 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-26T14:51:36", "owner": "leonw84", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18379272451133414, "text": "Yeah sounds like a good money laundering business 😂👏", "created_at": "2025-07-26T14:46:40", "owner": "steviekerr83", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986494614836444, "text": "Easier said than done", "created_at": "2025-07-26T14:44:58", "owner": "real_myviewtoronto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995461050661016, "text": "Then the taxman comes", "created_at": "2025-07-26T14:41:07", "owner": "hharryhughes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941996953035029, "text": "I wanna be the guy adding the salt! 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-26T14:04:32", "owner": "gurkan_bozdere", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017808542727001, "text": "Math is not this guys strong point 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-26T13:48:17", "owner": "geoff.diamond", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919543789130895, "text": "Excuse me since When a foodtruck coast 3.500", "created_at": "2025-07-26T13:34:52", "owner": "davidtannery", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875025487282129, "text": "Forgot about expenses....", "created_at": "2025-07-26T12:42:32", "owner": "thegeorgeanddragonw3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943040301903911, "text": "At least the digital product version of this was logistically possible.", "created_at": "2025-07-26T12:15:10", "owner": "onthejazzzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062791168998925, "text": "10000 burgers out of a van 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-26T12:01:01", "owner": "indygray", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18415273243111782, "text": "That's 7 burgers a min if you're open 24 hours a day. Lol", "created_at": "2025-07-26T11:43:25", "owner": "elliott.revell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891899968282665, "text": "You idiot", "created_at": "2025-07-26T11:36:48", "owner": "jim690919", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052997678529286, "text": "3.500?😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-26T11:13:46", "owner": "_________________bruno", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049509245201949, "text": "And how much is lost to employees, supplies ect?", "created_at": "2025-07-26T11:11:13", "owner": "zackthethinker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337911646163898, "text": "Why not sell 30,000 a day", "created_at": "2025-07-26T10:54:03", "owner": "j_dubya77", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092147785725000, "text": "Who the fk sells 10k burgers a day? :)) not even automated and you can't sell that much", "created_at": "2025-07-26T10:44:58", "owner": "bondariiulian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101362087603292, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-26T10:26:52", "owner": "speggyuk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098800663521968, "text": "Come on 10000 a day is beyond realistic", "created_at": "2025-07-26T09:43:48", "owner": "wavy__webb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921147784196171, "text": "10,000 a day haha", "created_at": "2025-07-26T08:34:17", "owner": "milesp.b25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948146811874808, "text": "Be lucky to sell 10 a day at that price", "created_at": "2025-07-26T07:55:39", "owner": "vx16gaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013360970760133, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-07-26T07:05:42", "owner": "1873inf23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918239722017631, "text": "Who’s selling that many in a day fam 🤣🤣🤣🤣🤷🏾‍♂️🤷🏾‍♂️🤷🏾‍♂️🤷🏾‍♂️you’re not at wireless!!!!!!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-07-26T02:20:23", "owner": "michaelwaynepowell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18166493059361091, "text": "What?", "created_at": "2025-07-26T01:29:00", "owner": "slymnmhmwdldyk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033826337467506, "text": "🤣 Let’s start with 100", "created_at": "2025-07-26T00:11:29", "owner": "klargeist_82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18516314959034657, "text": "3,65 mil😂", "created_at": "2025-07-25T23:32:41", "owner": "mauricenatorgaming", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073017793989766, "text": "No food costs ,no payroll no taxes ,no delivery expenses, brilliant business model", "created_at": "2025-07-25T23:16:31", "owner": "stitch_the_gremlin", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17898822648248189, "text": "Fuck off", "created_at": "2025-07-25T22:31:18", "owner": "kconroy281185", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055581440380459, "text": "10.000 a day Hahahahahah", "created_at": "2025-07-25T22:31:13", "owner": "kconroy281185", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366469570147515, "text": "Pay your employees shit", "created_at": "2025-07-25T22:27:09", "owner": "caribesonic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929620843080703, "text": "You cant calculator right thats for sure 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-25T21:58:20", "owner": "leoncree", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012194978769510, "text": "Easier said than done ✅ 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-25T21:19:51", "owner": "___godwithus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020413547722029, "text": "125 burgers in 7 mins? For 10 hours no breaks", "created_at": "2025-07-25T21:15:35", "owner": "mitcherally", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876756886381727, "text": "Wildly over exaggerated numbers.\nWe ranked the 7th best burger in the world and only sell 3,000-4,000 orders a day. Each burger has 2 smash patties so it’s 6,000-8,000 patties a day but that doesn’t magically inflate the order numbers.", "created_at": "2025-07-25T20:54:44", "owner": "chefdutchie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042017021652529, "text": "7 burgers a minute 24-hours a day", "created_at": "2025-07-25T20:48:17", "owner": "wannabeme99901", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057485207360007, "text": "10,000 a day 😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-25T20:37:28", "owner": "bass_on_lures", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909776230177712, "text": "Wouldn't buy none that shite", "created_at": "2025-07-25T20:07:46", "owner": "jamie902023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18369091264180581, "text": "😂😂😂😂 10.000", "created_at": "2025-07-25T19:40:46", "owner": "mix_boom_edit_repeat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958166769822869, "text": "Keep dreaming 🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-25T18:37:28", "owner": "fitpoel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911133448178743, "text": "Why not sell 100k a day 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-25T18:28:38", "owner": "nicmac_exteriorcleaning", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082144420897019, "text": "I always like to account for overheads.", "created_at": "2025-07-25T17:44:47", "owner": "incomparablystephen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084617614808707, "text": "Yeah till tax man robs you. And all other expenses they rob you for", "created_at": "2025-07-25T17:28:22", "owner": "brown68618", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878338153367863, "text": "No, you need to pay the goverment so you already lost 65% in your first year", "created_at": "2025-07-25T17:12:02", "owner": "thiago_garnett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859762678452289, "text": "Absolute bullshit.", "created_at": "2025-07-25T17:07:30", "owner": "darrencharlton1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914417056117693, "text": "Hahah food tuck can’t even storage it .. anyway I doubt is this busy .. and the tax man will eat more than half of it", "created_at": "2025-07-25T16:18:16", "owner": "leandro_error", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052036931166908, "text": "Make sure it they pay cast then it 20 a day", "created_at": "2025-07-25T16:14:17", "owner": "james.mul1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018198989743651, "text": "10k a day not a hope", "created_at": "2025-07-25T16:06:27", "owner": "big_joe_joyce1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117402460494184, "text": "True I mean all your doing is just locking it in. Two simple menauvers", "created_at": "2025-07-25T15:52:58", "owner": "northvanisbest604", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074366575964598, "text": "You qint selling 10000 a day though", "created_at": "2025-07-25T15:48:54", "owner": "1991ashs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322347433236109, "text": "That's very unrealistic", "created_at": "2025-07-25T15:22:50", "owner": "sidra8787", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886680571197276, "text": "I don’t think even think the  elite top chefs sell 10,000 burgers a day in a restaurant. Stop the cap. More like your selling 50/100 burgers a day", "created_at": "2025-07-25T15:22:12", "owner": "kieran26dunne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018031175554360, "text": "Delusional", "created_at": "2025-07-25T14:57:07", "owner": "floineire", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063915653336154, "text": "10000 burgers in a day 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-25T14:45:49", "owner": "lawrencereid1415", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18515182948054150, "text": "What does lock in mean", "created_at": "2025-07-25T14:28:31", "owner": "yag1.45", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990895956821373, "text": "Visa on its way", "created_at": "2025-07-25T14:20:01", "owner": "cbanni01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925774818979456, "text": "Twat", "created_at": "2025-07-25T14:13:58", "owner": "dorates13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998279973810965, "text": "So that’s 6 burgers every minute, 24 hours a day 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-25T13:51:44", "owner": "dannnywatt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859536694398299, "text": "Who’s paying £10 for a burger? 😂 £1 - £3.50 round here 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-25T13:40:37", "owner": "official_craigdavies", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072214274090909, "text": "Is that right🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-25T12:53:47", "owner": "oristarchaser", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897182881249568, "text": "No no don’t before get experience it’s is all lies", "created_at": "2025-07-25T12:50:04", "owner": "waji9083", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852359293500082, "text": "Fun and games till HMRC come for your 36.5 Million 💀", "created_at": "2025-07-25T12:49:50", "owner": "mohhib.khan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17960473625952562, "text": "You idiots doing 10,000 a day?  Must be loading mushrooms on those bad burgers🤔😳", "created_at": "2025-07-25T12:44:33", "owner": "adamdv2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18409707775129954, "text": "10.000 lol", "created_at": "2025-07-25T12:41:54", "owner": "pihl1000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034782914440709, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-25T12:41:02", "owner": "joseph_92718", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904525867089586, "text": "Corner", "created_at": "2025-07-25T12:40:00", "owner": "joseph_92718", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976057257910791, "text": "Say yes Chef, Yes Chef", "created_at": "2025-07-25T12:39:58", "owner": "joseph_92718", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955561167978521, "text": "Behind yes Chef", "created_at": "2025-07-25T12:39:48", "owner": "joseph_92718", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072594845068028, "text": "Where will you have 10.000 burger customers", "created_at": "2025-07-25T12:32:16", "owner": "dayton933", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863137471439590, "text": "10,000 burgers a day for a year... The only way that would work is if the Superbowl hired you exclusively and they held it every day of the year.. People do not think before posting", "created_at": "2025-07-25T12:23:58", "owner": "joe505c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969824565771316, "text": "So many other expenses have been missed out on", "created_at": "2025-07-25T12:19:03", "owner": "nathanmc_37", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858728296407817, "text": "10,000 a day SURE try 100 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-25T12:17:43", "owner": "hondapcx.scotland", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085972744772305, "text": "£70ph in wages 😂 why so many staff 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-25T12:15:03", "owner": "lynertron", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074319796814355, "text": "10.000 burgers in a day 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-25T10:47:12", "owner": "berg_nickvanden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337709824166160, "text": "just sell 10000 food trucks a day for 10$ and skip the effort of making burgers", "created_at": "2025-07-25T10:15:16", "owner": "adyaan.dj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940627822029026, "text": "Dreaming.. 10k a day", "created_at": "2025-07-25T10:14:43", "owner": "c63s666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053214995428345, "text": "Why do you need 6 of you in there", "created_at": "2025-07-25T09:42:29", "owner": "wonkyukclothing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18364799917147094, "text": "No one is 10x’ing their burger vans yet. I’m going to disrupt the burger market by 10x’ing my baps first, then sauces, then finally the patties. \nI’ll use the 10x to buy my first shipping empire and then lease all the ships back to the world for all the tea in China. \nYou suckers and your lack of 10x’ing makes me laugh. Still, more for me and my disrupters. Post ‘DISRUPT’ to join my Discord and become one of my team so you can 10x too. Only seriousness.", "created_at": "2025-07-25T09:14:02", "owner": "roll_a_blade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098332084599617, "text": "10000  a day PATHETIC", "created_at": "2025-07-25T08:47:43", "owner": "jackanory1967", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071437039848438, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-25T08:17:11", "owner": "farina48.pizza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939583783026080, "text": "Were do you buy a food truck for 3,500? Were do you get free food to sell and people that would work for free ! Were do you sell 10,000 a day? Dude your dreaming! There is no money in food anymore it's about volume McDonald's got that sorted", "created_at": "2025-07-25T08:08:12", "owner": "pieter_dk69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014011055581106, "text": "No one‘s gonna buy a shitty burger. I have a shitty food truck for $10 on top of that you’re not gonna sell that many a day", "created_at": "2025-07-25T07:47:25", "owner": "dookin_foof", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18393447070142603, "text": "Bros got the Bradford math skills", "created_at": "2025-07-25T07:26:24", "owner": "zia_ahs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073177405832664, "text": "Thats 800 burgers and hour or 14 burgers a minute..... where and how you will do that 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-25T07:25:50", "owner": "robdabank75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145449724392675, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-25T07:00:40", "owner": "the_purge83", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929979732961525, "text": "You couldn't cook 10k in a day bullshit news", "created_at": "2025-07-25T06:54:34", "owner": "garrattossie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903570571093945, "text": "Tell you what … wash windows, £10 front of the house , do 10,000 in a day haha … never gonna happen 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-25T06:42:37", "owner": "dcrenovations", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036615302418152, "text": "Only 10000 per day. Is that all?!", "created_at": "2025-07-25T06:22:05", "owner": "malibudan1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889796767291382, "text": "Park that van outside the immigration office in Dover,  should get you 20 000 sold in a day, all paid for by government, and then they will take the van off ya!", "created_at": "2025-07-25T03:30:33", "owner": "seanieboi_no1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18514869214049612, "text": "Other expenses where did it go", "created_at": "2025-07-25T02:26:55", "owner": "__m.e.l.v.i.n_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059768531204366, "text": "Hahah. Don’t forget to pay your personal? Buy your meats, pay the daily fee to park your foodtruck? 😉", "created_at": "2025-07-25T01:53:05", "owner": "ghalied_b84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057002771615396, "text": "Quick maths.....", "created_at": "2025-07-25T01:50:52", "owner": "oliver.steele1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060638999033412, "text": "10000 a day 🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-25T01:17:53", "owner": "thevinylrebellion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074346994794813, "text": "Or sell em for £5 and still make 17+ million ?", "created_at": "2025-07-25T01:13:05", "owner": "chris_medz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085915465760904, "text": "I'm not buying anything from a truck that cost £3500 ! 🤢", "created_at": "2025-07-24T23:21:52", "owner": "slipmat73", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089602381663708, "text": "How is the smashing not sticking to the meat I really want to know", "created_at": "2025-07-24T22:30:18", "owner": "notoriousstreetfood", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071445224099451, "text": "10000 a day, utter rubbish", "created_at": "2025-07-24T22:13:16", "owner": "mccreadieservices", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063107434998189, "text": "Someone lost the plot in the arithmetic room", "created_at": "2025-07-24T21:43:53", "owner": "davesouthwood", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098324152592851, "text": "Ain't  no burger van selling that per day😂😂 also a tenner a burger? You fuckin what? Are you daft or something a burger is a fiver", "created_at": "2025-07-24T21:43:32", "owner": "nubnutts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868909063409908, "text": "10.000 € from food truck. You going to be joking 😃", "created_at": "2025-07-24T21:33:59", "owner": "illegalkitchenhurghada", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089582254658864, "text": "Employees wages , permit charges to park the van , business insurance , H&S / Food safety courses for yourself and staff, cost of ingredients???", "created_at": "2025-07-24T21:28:37", "owner": "moovi_mulliani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070254797030549, "text": "Macdonald", "created_at": "2025-07-24T21:01:15", "owner": "nori_shed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18510094852036816, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-24T20:57:07", "owner": "bruno.pintooo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876276046380003, "text": "Well 10000 a day 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-24T20:41:25", "owner": "sjrbassfx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853682773495587, "text": "£10! Jog on", "created_at": "2025-07-24T20:34:01", "owner": "nodge33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069241393892208, "text": "Even if you gave away free burgers you couldn’t give out 10,000 a day lol", "created_at": "2025-07-24T20:33:36", "owner": "legend_87x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18377801911131795, "text": "10k lol", "created_at": "2025-07-24T20:20:00", "owner": "mikembdu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865643245427803, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-24T20:15:04", "owner": "fenerliahmet85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089344108682027, "text": "You will not sell 10000 a day from a food van", "created_at": "2025-07-24T20:14:21", "owner": "mr1order2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955404156977724, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-07-24T20:12:32", "owner": "jonh65_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094255150713654, "text": "You can never sell 10,000 burgers per day as a sustainable base line. Also what about VAT and Corporation tax??", "created_at": "2025-07-24T20:06:40", "owner": "keithpatterson9102", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086861992696811, "text": "Yeah minus the cost of the food , gas , electric and the 25 illegal immigrants that you've got there working in a space that's safe for about 3 people", "created_at": "2025-07-24T19:56:53", "owner": "carroll.neil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046783040560922, "text": "You’re on -£1200 a day there just on staff alone 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-24T19:56:20", "owner": "jvcobv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18197736718310868, "text": "You need to 10x that, then manipulate time 🕰️", "created_at": "2025-07-24T19:43:09", "owner": "eldeanio100", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075133801977679, "text": "£10 burgers …. from a truck ?", "created_at": "2025-07-24T19:31:26", "owner": "charles_ojechi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912461527171247, "text": "LOL 10,000 in a day?😂😂 you'll be lucky to average 80-90", "created_at": "2025-07-24T19:30:39", "owner": "ranjdillinger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18299052169219573, "text": "Not enough time in the day to cook 10k burgers in that van", "created_at": "2025-07-24T19:28:44", "owner": "j.moore1988", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086446285692248, "text": "🤷🏽‍♂️WTF", "created_at": "2025-07-24T19:28:22", "owner": "msp_nw_ltd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865948258353341, "text": "No ones gonna buy a burger from truck for a tenner unless at an event or in London.", "created_at": "2025-07-24T19:25:18", "owner": "jaydee_xiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067330736143988, "text": "No way, if you’re selling burgers for let’s say 12 hours in a day, that’s 833 burgers an hour and 14 burgers a minute, non stop", "created_at": "2025-07-24T19:24:01", "owner": "theoriginalhoots", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18514637023028037, "text": "Duh", "created_at": "2025-07-24T19:21:58", "owner": "merlin45454545", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18406530052117648, "text": "Sell a million a day, easy", "created_at": "2025-07-24T19:20:28", "owner": "joe.gryson94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918771721015464, "text": "Wake up !!! \n10.000 a day! \nYou’re dreaming !", "created_at": "2025-07-24T19:20:02", "owner": "ingmar.me", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18364502047148649, "text": "One proper grill cost from 5-20 k , one van cost 2k - add full kitchen 50k minimum. Spot to sell 500$ day , 1- 5 staff 150$ to 1500$ a day, cost to run electricity, gas, supplies 300$-1000$ day, misc 50$ day , a rainy day you’re cooked, a cancelled event you’re cooked. I don’t think  you’re in the business ’ dm for info.", "created_at": "2025-07-24T19:06:15", "owner": "denis__teodor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050146460196873, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-24T18:59:15", "owner": "velocefresco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145287880396957, "text": "Make sure not to have a day off and that Xmas day you sell all 10k burgers", "created_at": "2025-07-24T18:54:16", "owner": "charlito77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061887812193083, "text": "You wouldn't make that, as you need to pay staff, packaging, ingredients etc", "created_at": "2025-07-24T18:51:22", "owner": "aztakkal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957062043960419, "text": "How u sellin 10,000 burgers a day my bro tell me ??", "created_at": "2025-07-24T18:45:18", "owner": "trippy_smy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938544921914660, "text": "Sorry but health and safety could fine you for an over crowded trailer too many in there", "created_at": "2025-07-24T18:41:20", "owner": "garywilson764", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084296167833296, "text": "10k a day 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-24T18:36:31", "owner": "mo_raza786", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119070625433825, "text": "Skipped maths for cooking class", "created_at": "2025-07-24T18:33:17", "owner": "adamski2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18363931315194087, "text": "10k a day are you right in the  head", "created_at": "2025-07-24T18:31:39", "owner": "leewilliams160", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871688203401928, "text": "I see your vision and now Ill think about it", "created_at": "2025-07-24T18:28:15", "owner": "dragon.of.swenett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071095841086097, "text": "Well technically let's say he sells 100 a day for the price of 5$\\€\\£ that's 500 a day make that 5days and in a month you have 10000👏👏he's not actually wrong", "created_at": "2025-07-24T18:26:21", "owner": "dragon.of.swenett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931051141068900, "text": "If you traded for 8 hours a day the you’d only need to see 21 burgers met min for every minute of that 8 hours. You got this 🥸light work!!!! 😏", "created_at": "2025-07-24T18:24:31", "owner": "chris_saintpt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089826724680084, "text": "Time Unit\tBurgers Sold\nPer second\t10,000 ÷ 86,400 ≈ 0.116 burgers/second → 1 burger every ~8.64 seconds\nPer minute\t10,000 ÷ 1,440 (minutes in a day) ≈ 6.94 burgers/minute\nPer hour\t10,000 ÷ 24 = 416.67 burgers/hour", "created_at": "2025-07-24T18:19:12", "owner": "madmax.v", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18072438545075820, "text": "Does any here know McDonald’s?", "created_at": "2025-07-24T18:16:24", "owner": "jssiikayoung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076433606491408, "text": "What idiot is gonna pay 10 pound did a burger….", "created_at": "2025-07-24T18:15:57", "owner": "jssiikayoung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916348393113097, "text": "@hmrcgovuk don't think this lad is paying tax with maths like that 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-24T18:11:43", "owner": "seankeane19785", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886006294205855, "text": "man said 10000 a day??? yeah scammer.", "created_at": "2025-07-24T18:09:29", "owner": "western7seven", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016084232741595, "text": "10.000 a day???? Huh?", "created_at": "2025-07-24T17:57:19", "owner": "giles_g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040703285661574, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-24T17:53:50", "owner": "minipiresbear", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059841947047567, "text": "Sell 10,000 a day is their a robot tha comes with the truck Lol", "created_at": "2025-07-24T17:51:21", "owner": "steven_peto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907891813195445, "text": "Tax 36.5million", "created_at": "2025-07-24T17:51:18", "owner": "moguk20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081840103892913, "text": "10,000 per play… to who???\nWhere?\nAnd how do you store that much food in a food van!? 🤦🏼‍♂️😂", "created_at": "2025-07-24T17:51:04", "owner": "leevolution247", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965628894930991, "text": "100k a day for 365 days", "created_at": "2025-07-24T17:49:46", "owner": "kenduro_enduro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935021652942706, "text": "Give me@the location for selling that many in a day & you be better of selling something else", "created_at": "2025-07-24T17:48:30", "owner": "kenduro_enduro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18150232249388124, "text": "Sell 10k a day hey !!! There is still time to delete this post brother 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-24T17:46:07", "owner": "billycummo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144872296398335, "text": "It’s no where near as easy as that", "created_at": "2025-07-24T17:25:49", "owner": "krashdemkilly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088795531735898, "text": "10 thousand a day. Dream on", "created_at": "2025-07-24T17:11:39", "owner": "ihobson2021", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856175245472000, "text": "Probably won’t make that much with that many people working in the kitchen", "created_at": "2025-07-24T17:10:59", "owner": "rikki_lou_and_lyla_too", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052713749161829, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂 that's is 7 every minute 24/7.. I don't see you make 1 in 30 seconds... lies don't make you rich😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-24T17:09:06", "owner": "ballongert", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911241205173965, "text": "More like 100 a day", "created_at": "2025-07-24T16:53:58", "owner": "2wheelsor2feet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121410328469630, "text": "Ten thousand a day 😂😂😂😂 okay", "created_at": "2025-07-24T16:51:55", "owner": "kye_335d_torque", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092155213642849, "text": "f y", "created_at": "2025-07-24T16:51:52", "owner": "arispizza_mykonos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126358759454421, "text": "U wish", "created_at": "2025-07-24T16:50:23", "owner": "frenchy_with_a_tail_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926916442088227, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-07-24T16:47:56", "owner": "big_lunny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322083085239193, "text": "Mathemagician", "created_at": "2025-07-24T16:46:19", "owner": "lightweight20twenty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896114449253202, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-24T16:41:04", "owner": "itzchrismoon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014435531581562, "text": "Who is buying a burger for 10 pound  3.50 where I'm from quit ur jibba jabba", "created_at": "2025-07-24T16:37:00", "owner": "waynesargent12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304755412175308, "text": "Deduct 20% for VAT,  36% wages and NI contributions , 17%fuel and travel,  25% raw materials,  GOGS and insurance.", "created_at": "2025-07-24T16:22:28", "owner": "kevindouglasburt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133575085428043, "text": "£10 for a burger 🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-24T16:20:19", "owner": "aldama1510", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907218283194327, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-07-24T16:11:38", "owner": "mrhsevirp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910942102178458, "text": "10,000 a day on one van😳", "created_at": "2025-07-24T16:02:33", "owner": "paulcarter2204", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061775615336844, "text": "Bet it fucking smells in there 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-24T15:58:42", "owner": "ste_c_83_g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037342523394833, "text": "Hardly cover the bills. Where the hell would you find 10000 a day eating burgers", "created_at": "2025-07-24T15:50:19", "owner": "tiguan000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18351349807082521, "text": "Lmao no food truck makes fraction of that", "created_at": "2025-07-24T15:45:56", "owner": "mister_greyi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052625612536194, "text": "10000 a day 🤡", "created_at": "2025-07-24T15:39:34", "owner": "juss3400", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939105232028302, "text": "10000 a day 😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-24T15:32:19", "owner": "peter_electrical333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975233547884586, "text": "Where are you selling 10,000 burgers a day ?", "created_at": "2025-07-24T15:30:06", "owner": "lord.ljs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957694023827299, "text": "So you don't pay for the burgers or the rolls or tax", "created_at": "2025-07-24T15:27:48", "owner": "gordon.s6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138235429423638, "text": "You couldn't sell that many a day, 30 tops.  Supply and demand, but you're doing a great thing for increasing your personal demand", "created_at": "2025-07-24T15:24:52", "owner": "uhtredofbebenburgh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001802093800141, "text": "Now the tax man knows what you make dam fool 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-24T15:19:54", "owner": "chriskafetzis_40", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086967181811128, "text": "36.5 million 😅, tax man coming for you", "created_at": "2025-07-24T15:18:00", "owner": "s_e_b_195", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18391716016136615, "text": "Maccys sells 10,000 burgers every 52 seconds around the world 🌎 I suppose it’s a matter of volume and outgoings 🤔", "created_at": "2025-07-24T14:58:59", "owner": "cpg_chris_pierson_global", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396764698138301, "text": "I wish i could do this! Just started up making sauces and marinades! They’re doing well! #pepperyzest", "created_at": "2025-07-24T14:48:00", "owner": "pepperyzest", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18128612566455462, "text": "🙌🏾🙌🏾", "created_at": "2025-07-24T14:40:21", "owner": "mr_swan007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060367574259942, "text": "10,000 a day ? Your dreaming", "created_at": "2025-07-24T14:30:49", "owner": "michaeljthie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18520912963057488, "text": "If you do a 12 hour shift thats only 14 burgers every minute you have to sell 😊 But be warned, if you need staff your BS money goes down, if you need to pay for the site your BS money goes down, if you need a refrigerated truck to keep your 10,000 burgers in, your BS money goes down, 10,000 buns…. plenty of gas and or electric….. the list goes on, oh and 10,000 customers who are happy to wait for hours…… But if you are a bit thick then defo go for it and good luck, 14 a minute, 10,000 a day, everyday for a year, you’ll smash it, I’m sure. PS say hello to Elvis for me 😊", "created_at": "2025-07-24T14:14:09", "owner": "f1.chris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000622565799852, "text": "That's nothing! Sell 100,000 per day at £20 and you'll make £730 million! Why settle for only £37 million?!", "created_at": "2025-07-24T14:11:52", "owner": "ianmayman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161287909369106, "text": "£10 for a bit of mince and a bap? Fuck off", "created_at": "2025-07-24T14:04:21", "owner": "_jw_81", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902860426096148, "text": "U never selling 10k burgers a day u be lucky to sell 50", "created_at": "2025-07-24T13:54:51", "owner": "solsagramz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18229426282292625, "text": "My maths may help you. 10,000 burgers a week maybe but theirs no restaurant on the planet that’s doing that in a day. Nah no way!!!", "created_at": "2025-07-24T13:46:54", "owner": "len_vinci", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062690876193921, "text": "The people got to McDonald's cos the burgers are cheaper 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-24T13:13:42", "owner": "lexi.lee.666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18471722014077530, "text": "Just sold my burger van only had it 23 days got 9 £million  in the house CASH ONLY 👏👏", "created_at": "2025-07-24T13:09:31", "owner": "davemalko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854192590483256, "text": "10,000 a day?", "created_at": "2025-07-24T13:02:29", "owner": "cc_ldn1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947616024878056, "text": "10000 a day?🤣how", "created_at": "2025-07-24T12:55:16", "owner": "dad_on_purpose_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857420725415429, "text": "Will there be any costs, rent, bills and wages to pay?", "created_at": "2025-07-24T12:51:23", "owner": "manners_a84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061382972198354, "text": "Probably 100 a day at best", "created_at": "2025-07-24T12:43:59", "owner": "davidjago78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894515323147469, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-24T12:38:34", "owner": "dewetcarel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011295932772186, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-24T12:28:24", "owner": "charliexavier111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048589418568205, "text": "What about workers", "created_at": "2025-07-24T12:22:50", "owner": "solomankhon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104108260495655, "text": "Yeah, your not selling 10k burgers a day you twerps..! McDonald’s busiest sites don’t do that.  #instagramtimewasters", "created_at": "2025-07-24T12:12:42", "owner": "marvinhestonanddeliadogs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990355566683939, "text": "Four burgers a second over 24 hours.", "created_at": "2025-07-24T11:51:38", "owner": "russieg94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18312552391241168, "text": "To many people I could Work that close", "created_at": "2025-07-24T11:44:52", "owner": "teddy77797", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914769409037173, "text": "Get a uniform to drag the van from and to the venues too", "created_at": "2025-07-24T11:43:43", "owner": "allelite67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913723654160519, "text": "Lol - 10,000 a day - where the hell are you selling that many burgers every day", "created_at": "2025-07-24T11:34:34", "owner": "hengerdavid83", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945426973007412, "text": "pitch fees food cost labour cost  van cost 10,000 are you mad", "created_at": "2025-07-24T11:34:22", "owner": "retrobikerestorations", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036108713437595, "text": "10k burgers a day 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-24T11:30:46", "owner": "daniboi2012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914960932154224, "text": "The math from start too finish 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-24T11:17:28", "owner": "danwaring1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015862880749176, "text": "Me doing the maths on the calculator to check if £36.5m was right and it was 😂😂😂👏", "created_at": "2025-07-24T11:13:19", "owner": "mattioli78", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18395397694188162, "text": "Making burgers using an assembly line ?", "created_at": "2025-07-24T11:12:41", "owner": "anaskamal89", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18045873254279821, "text": "Short sighted. Theres 24 hours in a day. You can sell 10k per hour. Work harder", "created_at": "2025-07-24T11:07:50", "owner": "rob_burbs", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082889773662098, "text": "Even McDonalds can’t sell that many in a store.. the average is about 1500 per day..", "created_at": "2025-07-24T10:49:45", "owner": "don.chaudhry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967657629926042, "text": "1year world has no more cows haha", "created_at": "2025-07-24T10:34:53", "owner": "akikoudela", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069130555886529, "text": "😂😂 10.000 a day bro 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-24T10:33:19", "owner": "garycarr91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18522035533039014, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-24T10:27:20", "owner": "amber13md", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108562648528260, "text": "Or just sell the truck on for £36.5 million.", "created_at": "2025-07-24T10:26:04", "owner": "tomaswarnes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18511714900003861, "text": "10000 a day 😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-24T10:22:18", "owner": "titopayne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034451024447684, "text": "@terrynisbet89 our new business lol", "created_at": "2025-07-24T10:21:38", "owner": "henry420raver", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18277375687275347, "text": "Impossible to sell 10,000 a day from a food truck though. Lucky to sell 500", "created_at": "2025-07-24T10:06:04", "owner": "carleyjones100", "likes": 495}, {"id": 18131857339447663, "text": "£10 - 30% staff - 20%vat - 30%food cost - 10% utilities leaves you with a £1", "created_at": "2025-07-24T09:51:41", "owner": "chefkhymia", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18010795376775431, "text": "You're full of crap. Where does he store 10000 patties ?", "created_at": "2025-07-24T09:35:11", "owner": "theretropixel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072754912968345, "text": "Please prove to me someone sold 10 , 000 burgers from burger van in 1 day .. I don’t think my local mac ds sell that a day ..\nThe bullshit people write just for 5 minutes of fame", "created_at": "2025-07-24T09:29:12", "owner": "sir_t_tmacc", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18112914340507776, "text": "Buy a lottery ticket every week. Win the lottery every week. Lock in.", "created_at": "2025-07-24T09:19:22", "owner": "marney3012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046527389256940, "text": "10,000 a day 🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-24T09:04:21", "owner": "alexmitch654321", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090796138731256, "text": "Then let us maximise profits and keep costs low for you 😎", "created_at": "2025-07-24T08:59:53", "owner": "mytaxdoc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071537672094168, "text": "You couldn’t sell 10,000 a day. Plus there isn’t $10 profit in a $10 burger. Am I supposed to take business advice here???", "created_at": "2025-07-24T08:58:47", "owner": "danruss76", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048687485215108, "text": "Not even a McDonalds sell that many a day", "created_at": "2025-07-24T08:55:48", "owner": "paparmoscas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089666557674981, "text": "10,000 burgers a day? Sure. However if that's the case, you should be quoting and budgeting for another vehicle to house all your stock.", "created_at": "2025-07-24T08:35:35", "owner": "tgkmarbella", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152222656376080, "text": "10,000 a day LOL", "created_at": "2025-07-24T08:32:21", "owner": "watchfulweaver", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887753590316775, "text": "Max ull ever sell is about 150-200", "created_at": "2025-07-24T08:28:46", "owner": "legacy_creative_media", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18416522209105342, "text": "Impossible to sell 10000 burgers from a food truck", "created_at": "2025-07-24T08:25:26", "owner": "fazilio_official", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18397530298139560, "text": "Food trucks are not £3500", "created_at": "2025-07-24T08:24:46", "owner": "fazilio_official", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17844894609523418, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-24T08:13:44", "owner": "tush350", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131422732440174, "text": "Lightwork", "created_at": "2025-07-24T08:13:38", "owner": "__sav__7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936762120932717, "text": "Yes and society really could do with more people selling burgers", "created_at": "2025-07-24T08:10:18", "owner": "dontduckfitness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026541743705192, "text": "🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-07-24T07:39:49", "owner": "tripoliexpress", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046559912270292, "text": "Yuk. Poor quality meat😂", "created_at": "2025-07-24T07:36:14", "owner": "kobellla66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056642660086944, "text": "Who sells 10 k a day wtf dumb target is that", "created_at": "2025-07-24T07:33:51", "owner": "lukeuleeese", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061453130206546, "text": "😂 10.000 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-24T07:24:15", "owner": "yavs_is_the_name", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848295898491465, "text": "13 burgers per minute over a 12 hour period?", "created_at": "2025-07-24T07:14:02", "owner": "urbanphysiques", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070171970100037, "text": "Bullshit don’t believe this. This is pure communism", "created_at": "2025-07-24T07:10:18", "owner": "eagle.ae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844945255536437, "text": "Too many staff members, that's your profit gone!", "created_at": "2025-07-24T06:46:18", "owner": "strawberryfields99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066132506328355, "text": "Or sell 36.5 million in one day for 10k each be much easier", "created_at": "2025-07-24T06:46:16", "owner": "d_hoose592216", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18066480602329348, "text": "Nobody selling 10000 burgers a day unless you McDonald’s nigga 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-24T06:45:10", "owner": "the_ghost_847", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18048764261541902, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-24T06:22:18", "owner": "____.ad3lek3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060510986587350, "text": "How can i contact", "created_at": "2025-07-24T06:20:36", "owner": "sadi0803", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914210944146588, "text": "Tax Man is after you 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-24T05:58:22", "owner": "dodgermellie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082256929862361, "text": "10,000 a day lmfao", "created_at": "2025-07-24T05:45:17", "owner": "steriopeter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039232505354805, "text": "10 thou a day yeah na you would need a supermarket right next to you", "created_at": "2025-07-24T05:32:20", "owner": "ants_davis_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921297046101398, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-24T05:08:48", "owner": "jazzy_thorn_xox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100163848605599, "text": "Get £2 berger off McDonald's just as good", "created_at": "2025-07-24T05:07:26", "owner": "maarkbarrows", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083187370857639, "text": "Don’t forget to buy a small warehouse for the 10,000 burgers, buns and ketchup you’ll need each day.", "created_at": "2025-07-24T04:37:01", "owner": "tiny_rick_83", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893714725277077, "text": "Even if you manage to sell 10.000 burgers per day😂😂😂 then STAFF WAGES, NI, CORPORATION TAX, VAT, STOCK PURCHASE, FOOD TRUCK MAINTENANCE, FUEL INSURANCE ROAD TAX.  YOU LEFT WITH 6 MILION 😂 STILL NOT POSSIBLE", "created_at": "2025-07-24T04:04:15", "owner": "jakubp3", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17842526685542560, "text": "Your net income is very wrong 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-24T03:35:00", "owner": "dchandler2019", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959924592953878, "text": "Your never selling that many burgers youd struggle to even store them lol", "created_at": "2025-07-24T03:12:37", "owner": "clubk3poker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914602039039118, "text": "10000 a day😂😂😂😂😂 stop asking chatgpt to generate u business ideas", "created_at": "2025-07-24T02:52:38", "owner": "nesusireiksmink", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18510187933013478, "text": "Lucky if you sell 100 in a day", "created_at": "2025-07-24T02:42:20", "owner": "jackbenjaminjohnson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847725211527076, "text": "10 thousand in a day?", "created_at": "2025-07-24T02:39:34", "owner": "conorgram_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880640449242367, "text": "You have to sell 17 burgers every minute for 10 hours in the day to make that", "created_at": "2025-07-24T02:12:26", "owner": "yanited_fc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015848726566750, "text": "That's such great advice. Please tell me where I can buy a good trick for £3500, a venue where I can sell 1000 burgers an hour, 366 days a year, and how I can fit 10000 burgers into that truck whilst trying to prepare and sell a burger every 3 seconds...,.", "created_at": "2025-07-24T02:10:48", "owner": "hornsman_hifi_soundsystem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055169777374189, "text": "Imagine if you sold world class burgers ??? Now I’d like to see that", "created_at": "2025-07-24T02:08:00", "owner": "mysuperstarfamily", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910518322055696, "text": "Lies", "created_at": "2025-07-24T01:26:14", "owner": "trusturstruggle__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078129001918397, "text": "😂😂😂 BS", "created_at": "2025-07-24T01:21:07", "owner": "geomcdermid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969509580774310, "text": "Math isn't this guys strength", "created_at": "2025-07-24T01:04:28", "owner": "fairfield.florist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894489364142973, "text": "I'm baffled that people don't see its a joke", "created_at": "2025-07-24T00:57:05", "owner": "ian_macleod_81", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18031585379703036, "text": "Guess you failed math too..... 9hours is 540 m8nutes, 5 m8nutes to make a burger equates to 108 burgers a day. ?????", "created_at": "2025-07-24T00:55:39", "owner": "hugo.vandendool", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077582866929014, "text": "Stupid post!", "created_at": "2025-07-24T00:49:40", "owner": "workinphoto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039491867343474, "text": "Yeah, you not getting anywhere even close to selling 10,000 of ANYTHING a day.", "created_at": "2025-07-24T00:48:16", "owner": "itsatry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091422172631195, "text": "1000 - 3000 is marginally possible but only at a festival - A top headlining festival which equates to maybe 10 - 20 festivals a year at max.\nWho the heck posts this garbage content.", "created_at": "2025-07-24T00:37:21", "owner": "creme_dela_ken", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18417970927096550, "text": "You are living in cloud cookooo land - but an icee cream van for £3500 sell 10000 ice creams at £5 £50k a day  that’s £18.25 Million a year statement of fact but doesn’t make it feasible", "created_at": "2025-07-24T00:21:48", "owner": "priceyplates", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17981947400849324, "text": "Time for One Burger: 2.5 minutes per burger.\nTotal Time for 10,000 Burgers (Sequential): 10,000 burgers × 2.5 minutes = 25,000 minutes.\n25,000 minutes ÷ 60 minutes/hour = ~416.67 hours.\n416.67 hours ÷ 24 hours/day = ~17.36 days.\nSo, if the food truck operates 24/7 with no breaks, it would take about 17.4 days to serve 10,000 burgers.", "created_at": "2025-07-24T00:20:00", "owner": "z__buk", "likes": 1705}, {"id": 17972989685869138, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-07-24T00:18:54", "owner": "priceyplates", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052201046157764, "text": "When u do sell 36.5m lend us 3.5k to buy the truck 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-24T00:03:25", "owner": "nick_greaves_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868615420410809, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-23T23:58:01", "owner": "deadly_r3al", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17961368372809525, "text": "Trolling to the max", "created_at": "2025-07-23T23:56:50", "owner": "king_eric_786", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913920952155067, "text": "So you want us to sell ten thousand burgers every day for a whole year lol... McDonald's can't even pull that off", "created_at": "2025-07-23T23:50:19", "owner": "joshneversleeps", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090332791709251, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-23T23:32:53", "owner": "ukblackchefsnetwork", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035598419437851, "text": "£10 per burger is a violation", "created_at": "2025-07-23T23:32:18", "owner": "ssdiaz778", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074095840957386, "text": "Buy the food truck for 1p and sell it for £10 trillion, just have to lock in bro, actually don’t buy it steal it, saved 1p", "created_at": "2025-07-23T23:11:27", "owner": "kozz_47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914717914153054, "text": "10,000 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-23T23:07:19", "owner": "richiel100", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053074610611301, "text": "Whose buying burgers for a Tena ? And don’t u buy no stock", "created_at": "2025-07-23T22:58:22", "owner": "paulskinley.81", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17855218683473414, "text": "I can’t buy a food truck door 3500", "created_at": "2025-07-23T22:44:22", "owner": "erendouza66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049181006536793, "text": "Youd have to sell 7 burgers per minute, non-stop for 24 hours. is theoretically possible but in practical, real world terms, it's extremely unlikely.", "created_at": "2025-07-23T22:37:45", "owner": "balendin01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039011414358549, "text": "Rubish", "created_at": "2025-07-23T22:32:32", "owner": "jabbaadams", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048306539234305, "text": "Drugs money 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-23T22:25:33", "owner": "ssb00010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868758112329691, "text": "10k burgers a day . Stfu 😆", "created_at": "2025-07-23T22:15:34", "owner": "multistraingrower", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950262907002476, "text": "Thousands for the pitch", "created_at": "2025-07-23T22:09:07", "owner": "welsh3511", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910712500179118, "text": "Who is buying burgers on Xmas day ?", "created_at": "2025-07-23T22:06:37", "owner": "ess_haitch2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106510750542533, "text": "So thick", "created_at": "2025-07-23T22:05:24", "owner": "nickppot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871334743404007, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-23T22:01:27", "owner": "matttups13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073227719293033, "text": "Only 10.000 per day.👏", "created_at": "2025-07-23T21:51:58", "owner": "apgbuildingltd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052116332614445, "text": "3 million not 30 million", "created_at": "2025-07-23T21:46:56", "owner": "syedameer86", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17865979350350336, "text": "Minus intake of meat,burger buns and other expensives you got self a new total my friend ✅📉", "created_at": "2025-07-23T21:32:28", "owner": "givenchyawful", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052382984575067, "text": "He must have Usain Bolt serving the burgers at that speed", "created_at": "2025-07-23T21:12:02", "owner": "platty_13", "likes": 