"created_at": "2025-07-23T19:50:14", "owner": "bhaven_singh_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038994989359682, "text": "Nah all them men one little burger van…. Fuck thatttttt imagine the germs", "created_at": "2025-07-23T19:42:59", "owner": "jakerogers_22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008542091785072, "text": "10k burgers a day…", "created_at": "2025-07-23T19:30:54", "owner": "azi_muk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862686097440502, "text": "Who tf is buying a 10 quod burger from this", "created_at": "2025-07-23T19:28:42", "owner": "polish_terminator", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975263292883890, "text": "Have cost of ingredients, taxes, pitch fees, licence fees, wages and utility bills been taken out of this \"gross profit\"?", "created_at": "2025-07-23T19:27:31", "owner": "i.am.other82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064854583955048, "text": "100-200 a day and your busy af bout 10000 burgers 🍔 where your burger van at ??😂 And further more it would be hard AF to give away 10000 burgers a day never mind consistently for even a week 🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-07-23T19:23:38", "owner": "pawwfectionmobiledoggrooming", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17951746944003028, "text": "The staff.just come of the latest boat??? Fu.king idiots", "created_at": "2025-07-23T19:21:48", "owner": "davidoug1984", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132057727435877, "text": "A load of BS SHIT", "created_at": "2025-07-23T19:19:06", "owner": "sunpal06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039024347666109, "text": "You mixed up your days with weeks", "created_at": "2025-07-23T19:13:41", "owner": "hepworth5349", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069519224032847, "text": "It’s actually my dream to do this. I wanna own a food truck and travel the word with my girlfriend @xemmz.19x", "created_at": "2025-07-23T19:12:14", "owner": "r9996002", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18067872332516345, "text": "You couldn't sell 10000 in a year", "created_at": "2025-07-23T19:06:20", "owner": "grahamscott124", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059611793363938, "text": "Cock burger sucker. Mug. Do the naths burger breath", "created_at": "2025-07-23T19:02:54", "owner": "lolcarroll_007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078978595901226, "text": "Them 6 working for free? Not declaring tax? Where are you finding 10,000 people a day that want burgers? 🤦🏽‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-07-23T19:00:42", "owner": "in20686", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891844612295324, "text": "Food truck is a good buiseness I will also have that in my buiseness chain", "created_at": "2025-07-23T18:49:48", "owner": "ownwise69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18318535441225629, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-23T18:45:39", "owner": "andy__pkent", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083513122662751, "text": "If it’s Halal you’ll easily sell 10,000 a day \nYes Ma’am", "created_at": "2025-07-23T18:35:11", "owner": "prof_haddock", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18520483636063939, "text": "Never buying a burger for £10", "created_at": "2025-07-23T18:24:51", "owner": "devotedpaintinganddecorating", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104115103493870, "text": "AHH so the key is to lock in and sell 10k products a day??? Should have said sooner.. noted.", "created_at": "2025-07-23T18:13:24", "owner": "monumentgarageconversions", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084530128837913, "text": "Definitely didn't go to business school", "created_at": "2025-07-23T18:01:17", "owner": "pleb________", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18060357107340395, "text": "10.000  a day.... be realistic", "created_at": "2025-07-23T17:43:26", "owner": "johnbrechon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929795556960026, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-23T17:34:10", "owner": "adrianlazarusart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115332607499306, "text": "You aint selling 10000 a day you might do between 50 - 100 on a good day 8 months of the year its raining and you get about 30% of your customers", "created_at": "2025-07-23T17:00:26", "owner": "arran.s.g.thomas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885999871200886, "text": "Or just sell one burger for £36.5 million", "created_at": "2025-07-23T16:52:55", "owner": "mohammedasaria01", "likes": 9732}, {"id": 18318146011234817, "text": "Great work helping ppl with ideas mots don't take only if they did", "created_at": "2025-07-23T15:41:17", "owner": "saim2_019", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18336120904161674, "text": "To buy meat to 10.000 burgers would use half the yearly bugdet", "created_at": "2025-07-23T15:39:16", "owner": "svend_rugaard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861775156444118, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-07-23T15:17:07", "owner": "tyrken.oba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046506809541962, "text": "7 burgers per minute 😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-07-23T11:49:56", "owner": "aisindicate", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18060421904034110, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-23T11:05:51", "owner": "vma9225", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905589679200962, "text": "70% taxes bro , you will work for the gouvernement", "created_at": "2025-07-23T10:47:08", "owner": "ciaoskipper125_rian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028996025703878, "text": "£10 For a burger or a meal", "created_at": "2025-07-23T10:37:36", "owner": "kiran65432", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18519680860023562, "text": "You can never sell 10000 in a day", "created_at": "2025-07-23T10:03:33", "owner": "georgechifu", "likes": 523}, {"id": 18017229242729292, "text": "What do you do g 14 hours a day 🤣🤣🤣 pointless even writing a business plan about making millions of your gunna stand in the van all day 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-23T09:38:32", "owner": "ballerzbets", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074912207063640, "text": "So just need a second food truck to store these 10000 burgers and the buns 🤔", "created_at": "2025-07-23T06:42:47", "owner": "d.c.cookie", "likes": 19}, {"id": 17995276007816498, "text": "16-20 burgers a minute for 8-10 hours. No problem!", "created_at": "2025-07-23T05:21:14", "owner": "joegilbert8", "likes": 69}, {"id": 18305939290173107, "text": "So where can I get one of these van for 3,500?", "created_at": "2025-07-23T01:35:44", "owner": "takeabite.one", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842000338547888, "text": "😂😂😂😂 10,000 burgers a day what u got a chain off McDonald’s u definitely ain’t selling that amount on a burger van", "created_at": "2025-07-22T23:03:25", "owner": "urban_streetfood2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890637601289477, "text": "And where do you “ park” it? No “ rent”?", "created_at": "2025-07-22T20:52:51", "owner": "nazh9521", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935908077935752, "text": "A foodtruck for 3.5k fully done are you mad", "created_at": "2025-07-22T16:44:09", "owner": "daniel_mirzet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880490125241806, "text": "If you can buy a food truck that is kitted out for 10,000 burgers a day capacity for £3,500 then you definitely are in a world of your own and it’s called “La La Land”", "created_at": "2025-07-22T16:34:09", "owner": "polla212", "likes": 32}, {"id": 18033753683678540, "text": "Who’s on it message me", "created_at": "2025-07-22T11:07:24", "owner": "i_love_dadeen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991714893818222, "text": "The maths are mathing 🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-07-22T06:15:49", "owner": "thehalalfoodfestival", "likes": 159}, {"id": 18275546284275422, "text": "10000 🤣🤣🤣🤣🤔", "created_at": "2025-07-22T06:05:46", "owner": "steve.jenkins1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057630692365509, "text": "😂😂😂😂 love it 😉", "created_at": "2025-07-22T04:39:52", "owner": "papajifood", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17866233084424489, "text": "What abt the expenses? Meat, staff electric,  etc", "created_at": "2025-07-22T02:20:13", "owner": "shazsikander", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17984843369845527, "text": "Might need a bigger plancha bro", "created_at": "2025-07-22T01:59:24", "owner": "chefdannygrounds", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18124475596413457, "text": "Bro can barely sell 100 a day 🤣🤔", "created_at": "2025-07-22T00:55:17", "owner": "bfc_bruxy", "likes": 213}, {"id": 17871218466401283, "text": "10k a day 😂 inshAllah tho akhis", "created_at": "2025-07-22T00:35:46", "owner": "36__247", "likes": 189}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["businesstips", "entrepeneur", "inapikel", "pikel", "mindset", "businesslifestyle", "lockin"]},
{"media_id": 3766714212030798960, "shortcode": "DRGDp5ygtxw", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRGDp5ygtxw/", "taken_at": "2025-11-15T23:00:45", "caption": "00後獨居醫科生 #£3煮飯challenge🙈\n\n放咗學簡簡單單煮餐好食嘅🥰\n今次意粉加煙肉雞蛋成本加埋一齊4磅分開每個人食\n人頭£2 😱😱😱😱\n\n記得重點‼️熄咗火先落蛋漿🩵\n\n簡單又好味各位懶人/慳錢學生一齊試吓~\n\nDM 💌 for full recipe ~!!!!! \n\n#懶人 #快 #三磅英國料理 #00後獨居 #carbonara🍝 #foodie #foodlover #pasta", "owner_username": "tiffwingg.uk", "owner_id": "62336126923", "likes": 3937, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0109_DRGDp5ygtxw\\DRGDp5ygtxw_20251115_230045.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": "17932627863128153", "text": "落cheddar cheese唔係carbonara....", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:32:11", "owner": "tat_tricks", "likes": 9}, {"id": "18051022931356471", "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:32:27", "owner": "bananamilkexpresso", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18064953869440208", "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:30:33", "owner": "stella_xuxuxu", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18085351385051579", "text": "試下先", "created_at": "2025-11-16T05:26:44", "owner": "angel.cures", "likes": 3}, {"id": "18086285719964944", "text": "新手不敗👏", "created_at": "2025-11-17T05:45:27", "owner": "peckyc", "likes": 4}, {"id": "18046417340447780", "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-21T13:55:45", "owner": "daviddavidfanfan", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18119129866548402", "text": "咁我要跟你個做法 我上星期二先整完Carbonara 覺得有少少失敗 但係整得幾好食", "created_at": "2025-11-18T20:04:36", "owner": "assin_justin", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18090639703744060", "text": "Egg yolk fine, pecorino and parmegiano combo mixed with egg yolks should have been done instead. Mgoi.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T19:40:29", "owner": "ummmtang", "likes": 2}, {"id": "18080831147110485", "text": "@fhjwert 😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-17T03:35:43", "owner": "fhjwert", "likes": 1}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["懶人", "快", "三磅英國料理", "00後獨居", "carbonara", "foodie", "foodlover", "pasta"]},
