{"media_id": 3741488141962912232, "shortcode": "DPsb6RRCSHo", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DPsb6RRCSHo/", "taken_at": "2025-10-12T03:36:43", "caption": "蛋黃醬辛辣麵🍜\n\n想要食譜就留言「ramen」\n\n做個住家男人Day 31\n\n#煮飯仔 #煮飯日常 #做個住家男人 #辛辣麵", "owner_username": "mr.bellywongs", "owner_id": "66259180267", "likes": 16337, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0112_DPsb6RRCSHo\\DPsb6RRCSHo_20251012_033643.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18048762194390009, "text": "有冇人試過煮好唔好食？", "created_at": "2025-11-20T16:22:43", "owner": "sukiethan_bb_mama", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080391194039693, "text": "Ramen", "created_at": "2025-10-13T05:55:20", "owner": "chan_ho_tat_ben", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18484926562072132, "text": "正", "created_at": "2025-10-13T11:10:25", "owner": "cindyccchan", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18115402804555124, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-10-12T03:45:57", "owner": "linyan5105", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17967332228822567, "text": "公仔麵一定要過冷河🔥 一定要過冷河🔥 一定要過冷河🔥\n咁先過曬啲膠質 咁先會爽口彈牙\n因為好重要所以要講3次", "created_at": "2025-11-02T07:56:52", "owner": "aplovemc1314", "likes": 17}, {"id": 18080410696997239, "text": "求賜教🙇🏻‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-10-12T11:10:39", "owner": "nickax123", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17895930558185520, "text": "ramen", "created_at": "2025-10-13T16:30:11", "owner": "sukisum_ss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960948009868052, "text": "ramen", "created_at": "2025-10-12T14:27:20", "owner": "ban_chow_chow", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17944942128027081, "text": "ramen", "created_at": "2025-10-12T16:19:34", "owner": "k_au_ra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105005329660332, "text": "ramen", "created_at": "2025-12-12T11:49:13", "owner": "something._.joshua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100563946695459, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-12-10T14:36:52", "owner": "selyena39", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846080194619770, "text": "Ramen", "created_at": "2025-12-09T09:12:47", "owner": "venusypyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980381091940785, "text": "Ramen", "created_at": "2025-12-03T09:17:4