{"media_id": 3768023088157066669, "shortcode": "DRKtQjrEoWt", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRKtQjrEoWt/", "taken_at": "2025-11-17T18:17:02", "caption": "all we do is walk and take the metro😭 \n\n.\n\n.\n\n#creator #studentlife #hwud #dubai #contentcreator #uae #heriotwattuniversity #student #internationalstudent #studentindubai #explore #relatable #uni #university", "owner_username": "liza_gabelaia", "owner_id": "39852864684", "likes": 9812, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0113_DRKtQjrEoWt\\DRKtQjrEoWt_20251117_181702.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18086963521938327, "text": "I travel 2 hours up and 2 hours down for a 1.5 hour lecture like whyyyyyyy", "created_at": "2025-11-18T09:18:28", "owner": "ni_ce_gu_rl", "likes": 385}, {"id": 17951007171045379, "text": "This and sitting in traffic. 🥀 Like all that just to watch a powerpoint and sit around.", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:35:28", "owner": "ozmaton", "likes": 43}, {"id": 18096631240825759, "text": "I KNOW RIGHT THE BEST 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:26:57", "owner": "imrnotinthemood", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17856635151506083, "text": "she takes like 10 minutes of metro btw", "created_at": "2025-11-17T18:29:59", "owner": "n0or_xx7", "likes": 131}, {"id": 18034592705714901, "text": "ნაღდად არ მეგონა ჩემს გარდა კიდევ სხვა ქართველიც თუ სწავლობდა დუბაიში 😄", "created_at": "2025-11-19T15:05:58", "owner": "_xor_xe", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18139530004458228, "text": "Have fun in my homeplace, hopefully you like the food", "created_at": "2025-11-19T10:49:30", "owner": "rebirth.appassionato", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18047315810678778, "text": "Hold up my university? In the wild? AGAIN 😭⁉️", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:58:30", "owner": "ac28.__", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18395398558126913, "text": "Realll used to do 2hours 1 way holy", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:36:24", "owner": "_thenx7", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18072062255197787, "text": "And then they dismiss you after 20 mins", "created_at": "2025-11-19T23:41:37", "owner": "sooria_66", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18329024311212585, "text": "To reach my uni , I literally have to take metro then rta bus , one day professor literally took 10 mins class just to accounce something 😭😭😭😭😭🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-18T13:30:19", "owner": "scrubs_and_dreamsss", "likes": 17}, {"id": 17878411119338340, "text": "That's heaven compared to commuting between Emirates", "created_at": "2025-11-20T16:04:00", "owner": "const_apa", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18096953242646049, "text": "Too relatable", "created_at": "2025-11-19T08:21:59", "owner": "aakankshamalla_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18380983726177561, "text": "Live in dubai but not relatable😍yay", "created_at": "2025-11-18T20:03:15", "owner": "goldensunflower48", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066466472526352, "text": "I miss internet city", "created_at": "2025-11-19T16:36:13", "owner": "fedyushh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18004988534667195, "text": "Send me this post", "created_at": "2025-11-17T18:17:53", "owner": "dubai._life_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18155698609410253, "text": "Thank da lord I’ve never took metro or bus", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:35:14", "owner": "notshaik_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18166011940380689, "text": "@ixha__09 you 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:44:19", "owner": "faizjunaidd", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061906520544582, "text": "From life pharmacy to dic is nothing 😭😭😭😭😭 @the.goat0177 @zi.iz.here know the real struggle", "created_at": "2025-11-19T20:30:27", "owner": "husban.ky", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087900623479188, "text": "R u in Heriot Watt or UOWD", "created_at": "2025-11-19T02:31:09", "owner": "3mer3rar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18349745755203853, "text": "you are complaining about riding the metro for 7 mins?, try living in sharjah while your uni is at dubai", "created_at": "2025-11-19T10:50:01", "owner": "naz.sa13", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18086238418986770, "text": "Some ppl die of thirst but others drown", "created_at": "2025-11-18T11:00:55", "owner": "aditya_seshadri_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18173177866367783, "text": "Big deal, Equiti to DIC", "created_at": "2025-11-18T23:16:41", "owner": "hunainraza_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18181930855357071, "text": "Bruh doomscrolling lead to enemy territory reels now", "created_at": "2025-11-20T05:44:32", "owner": "paramjitmehta9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075472202238351, "text": "*lecture is canceled* FAAHHH", "created_at": "2025-11-19T16:56:56", "owner": "saifadouchana", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18135913753482323, "text": "Where is that it is so clean lol", "created_at": "2025-11-19T15:01:36", "owner": "andreiv1z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095137189677130, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:47:07", "owner": "ilyas.___.ob25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092191792905021, "text": "you so beautiful", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:21:14", "owner": "tvs_kamil70", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993990276715010, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:09:14", "owner": "corpse_335", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122181607524307, "text": "i come from ad to dubai 4 times a week🥲", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:40:09", "owner": "i.rkk6_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116423317564378, "text": "REALLLLL 💀💀💀", "created_at": "2025-11-21T19:21:41", "owner": "ad00m__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105548890650820, "text": "Worth it for a job right. For a job right?", "created_at": "2025-11-21T08:32:59", "owner": "justired.28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18372286948156306, "text": "Same atp imma js quit", "created_at": "2025-11-21T07:43:04", "owner": "628mzl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18014488049800640, "text": "Is this the current market🥀🥀", "created_at": "2025-11-21T07:35:19", "owner": "ali06the3rd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097445539827270, "text": "Lecture - 1.5hrss👍, Red line traffic💀😭", "created_at": "2025-11-21T04:49:00", "owner": "abdllah_.7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059038853260013, "text": "You are getting education in such a fantastic city", "created_at": "2025-11-20T19:52:02", "owner": "jitesh_ailani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852871489580177, "text": "Yeah imagine wait in a line for 1 hour just to take a bus to your college then walk for 5 kilometers to get there", "created_at": "2025-11-20T16:11:34", "owner": "or66.6626", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945801100004311, "text": "Just so that the professor reads of a slide", "created_at": "2025-11-20T07:51:06", "owner": "yousof_alawneh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988241568911029, "text": "3 hr lecture here, sometimes 2 classes of them", "created_at": "2025-11-20T04:43:42", "owner": "thekhilafat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947487621930702, "text": "Frr dude...this is ssoo accurate 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-19T18:44:01", "owner": "joicyfrankline", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121309177526408, "text": "The realist thing wallah and u end up being late and waste 2 hours going back home", "created_at": "2025-11-19T07:56:16", "owner": "ghaithhh27", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18141666466447198, "text": "got a reality check at the worst mood, now I feel like taking the day off😭", "created_at": "2025-11-19T06:15:11", "owner": "s9idd", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17988066485895991, "text": "I need to join such university", "created_at": "2025-11-19T02:29:58", "owner": "henti.with.senpaii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144059167442709, "text": "I feel you😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T02:00:16", "owner": "d.zorla06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858821182551510, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T19:22:35", "owner": "omair_chohan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17884017981407037, "text": "Its just 10 mins at max", "created_at": "2025-11-18T18:53:59", "owner": "must1wash3r3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18562398379016351, "text": "База", "created_at": "2025-11-18T12:16:39", "owner": "azizmmnv", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["creator", "studentlife", "hwud", "dubai", "contentcreator", "uae", "heriotwattuniversity", "student", "internationalstudent", "studentindubai", "explore", "relatable", "uni", "university"]},
{"media_id": 3766614704895729484, "shortcode": "DRFtB4jEp9M", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRFtB4jEp9M/", "taken_at": "2025-11-15T19:38:41", "caption": "TIRAMISU CLAW MACHINE 🍫🕹️😋\n\n#trending #viral", "owner_username": "itsmejuliette", "owner_id": "9229889", "likes": 41333, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0114_DRFtB4jEp9M\\DRFtB4jEp9M_20251115_193841.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18119813602545918, "text": "What claw machine should I make next???👀👀👀", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:44:50", "owner": "itsmejuliette", "likes": 1113}, {"id": 18025975232760339, "text": "All Fun till the roaches invade", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:40:51", "owner": "vv.evan.vv", "likes": 1645}, {"id": 17987913908882246, "text": "Roachmisu👏", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:42:33", "owner": "viralfoodanddrink", "likes": 735}, {"id": 18089357516495761, "text": "You went big on this one. Love it!", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:40:06", "owner": "itsgoodbyetwenties", "likes": 128}, {"id": 18112399711584205, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:43:08", "owner": "tony_lockstark", "likes": 880}, {"id": 18064089770570769, "text": "That’s gonna spoil after a day..", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:39:55", "owner": "viralfoodanddrink", "likes": 403}, {"id": 18000641147686027, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:43:01", "owner": "sergioiskool", "likes": 272}, {"id": 18000955865831705, "text": "Wow! I want one for the kids menu at my Italian restaurant", "created_at": "2025-11-16T21:36:01", "owner": "chefspsa", "likes": 20}, {"id": 18093703843895938, "text": "Just like my Nona used to make.", "created_at": "2025-11-16T20:16:38", "owner": "dennistodisco", "likes": 42}, {"id": 17901126210302550, "text": "How does one achieve this level of utilization of free will", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:33:37", "owner": "aaravbtr", "likes": 86}, {"id": 18538832296016213, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-16T08:19:48", "owner": "lily_star_88888", "likes": 163}, {"id": 18059862251540630, "text": "I want one", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:40:36", "owner": "doughertydozen", "likes": 37}, {"id": 18178684906364546, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:56:15", "owner": "dulce_grwm", "likes": 31}, {"id": 18351111982164250, "text": "the spoon claw 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-15T23:49:34", "owner": "justinyi_", "likes": 55}, {"id": 18073038467250182, "text": "I need one in every room!", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:53:43", "owner": "sophiesophss", "likes": 26}, {"id": 17866982643415950, "text": "What the internet should be used for", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:43:48", "owner": "rawbeezeitz", "likes": 239}, {"id": 18186898279339643, "text": "@caitlinelised", "created_at": "2025-11-17T15:01:28", "owner": "ryanwasoba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090521944914688, "text": "Great idea, terribly executed lol", "created_at": "2025-12-03T22:19:29", "owner": "sell.it.like.mike", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098541244692383, "text": "@eatswithalia", "created_at": "2025-11-22T21:00:35", "owner": "suzie_bakos", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17879376663423849, "text": "Genius", "created_at": "2025-11-15T20:14:30", "owner": "thejcheneats", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18111599470588457, "text": "Ah, so this is what you were planning lol😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:40:54", "owner": "otherdietpepsicola", "likes": 18}, {"id": 17856671478559902, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-17T00:07:36", "owner": "acomer.pe", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18069672020375696, "text": "Exactly what the product engineers had in mind. 🤣🙌🏼🍰", "created_at": "2025-11-17T22:12:04", "owner": "arcade1upofficial", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18091807559495310, "text": "juliette pls i can’t do this anymore", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:50:44", "owner": "land___shark", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096926215835959, "text": "One handful of scrambled egg per child", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:57:16", "owner": "billpepsi", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18144879097437024, "text": "@dimaismadduh", "created_at": "2025-11-18T17:40:17", "owner": "patsandora", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898036534200599, "text": "@ondapastabar next up", "created_at": "2025-12-07T21:05:44", "owner": "finchbakery", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073800752192430, "text": "Fingers crossed this is under my Christmas tree this year 🤞🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-15T20:04:16", "owner": "smokinmalenurse", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18160714981393824, "text": "I hate how much food is wasted by content creators", "created_at": "2025-11-17T20:33:32", "owner": "chrtucci", "likes": 55}, {"id": 18060042854623323, "text": "This made me lol like all ur vids but more for this one", "created_at": "2025-11-15T23:02:22", "owner": "eatitkatie", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17855678733561796, "text": "some people starve, by the way", "created_at": "2025-11-16T20:51:26", "owner": "ludovicotta.priv", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17874959694443434, "text": "“Lasts a couple of weeks” 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:55:53", "owner": "pauliesandwiches", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18108953560545548, "text": "@dylan.tg", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:12:11", "owner": "tbabytgb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18192621862331723, "text": "Your family is going to love it.  Now time for your lobotomy. 😮😂😮😂😮", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:49:53", "owner": "tom_mulligan987", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17898034890339369, "text": "Tara Mee Sue...", "created_at": "2025-11-18T02:16:12", "owner": "bryan.balak", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17892853992363518, "text": "Thats going to collect MOLD!!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:55:59", "owner": "dulce_grwm", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090188014768110, "text": "@judithstaals 😂😂😂😂 het loopt uit de hand 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T11:47:53", "owner": "aimee.mezzel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993805473850275, "text": "Well I wonder if my swing trick will work on this 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T13:56:54", "owner": "clawmaster_30", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18059096072267778, "text": "@dafyddgriffiths", "created_at": "2025-11-22T22:57:01", "owner": "bethtilldeath", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18376592953145491, "text": "@renskesmids kan tiramisu op een oktoberfest?🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-17T08:18:23", "owner": "twentserfje", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17857024899558110, "text": "@lionfieldmusic", "created_at": "2025-11-16T10:01:12", "owner": "jeffz23_yt_the_ashley_fan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17897542878341976, "text": "I need this", "created_at": "2025-11-15T21:03:31", "owner": "cocobellycakes", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17917884126072044, "text": "Tierra Mia Misu", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:41:52", "owner": "uiises_", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17952159951029492, "text": "You have really outdone yourself with this masterpiece.", "created_at": "2025-11-17T14:22:28", "owner": "olivia.wyles", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17867163720418863, "text": "It’s like an ai dessert chef", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:55:59", "owner": "obistimothy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18035183459518269, "text": "@reaganozaeta", "created_at": "2025-11-17T00:49:54", "owner": "thebestofeurest", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853770298575100, "text": "I hate this and I hate tiramisu!! Lol", "created_at": "2025-11-15T22:57:17", "owner": "420sparkleprincess", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18113109958582889, "text": "I love you", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:39:48", "owner": "mr_e2021", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948537895051473, "text": "Goddamn, you’re smart", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:44:13", "owner": "djmaxx_bass", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18080022497124452, "text": "this is your best", "created_at": "2025-11-16T04:39:30", "owner": "juliancomeau", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17868149400472756, "text": "@ameloucp", "created_at": "2025-11-16T18:29:19", "owner": "vin.darb", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18089223170310917, "text": "@p.cakess", "created_at": "2025-11-16T16:58:30", "owner": "dr.adelynn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18512403622069393, "text": "@manuel.toth @embootv @e.l.l.l.ias", "created_at": "2025-11-16T16:16:34", "owner": "stefan_gangl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17940207863960574, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:40:31", "owner": "dangerous_demon420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329189248211325, "text": "HI-TECH 👏", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:39:58", "owner": "ricewingparty", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18093008914852257, "text": "@jessie_lorpa", "created_at": "2025-11-16T09:51:40", "owner": "sharon__vaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048173651691860, "text": "100000+ missed calls from @lionfieldmusic", "created_at": "2025-11-16T08:43:49", "owner": "princeofpersia2004", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17885937498392981, "text": "THE SPOON CLAW OMG", "created_at": "2025-11-15T22:22:31", "owner": "califoodventure", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17869222218397679, "text": "@jeppsonsmalort claw machine?", "created_at": "2025-11-15T20:10:40", "owner": "nombre_kj", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17926088238155567, "text": "@aclowry1790", "created_at": "2025-11-15T21:15:32", "owner": "dangercrain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077933830899952, "text": "im obsessed with this girl @ci.chica", "created_at": "2025-11-15T20:03:47", "owner": "sammmiejo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081665147097099, "text": "It feels wrong without blue Gatorade", "created_at": "2025-11-15T20:01:01", "owner": "tonysasojr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17981737514935796, "text": "It obviously didn't work, hence the cut scene", "created_at": "2025-12-13T21:18:29", "owner": "zenandava", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990833931901693, "text": "I want to add one at my food truck on the beach in Hawaii 🔥😍", "created_at": "2025-12-13T16:04:57", "owner": "lavernescateringhawaii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069160220385727, "text": "Bro breathe 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-13T13:20:00", "owner": "corre_vs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876186031451481, "text": "Terra Misu", "created_at": "2025-12-13T03:52:51", "owner": "lostmywalkie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028637171777340, "text": "If Spencer from iCarly was doing something with a tiramisu claw machine in one episode, that wouldn’t be that out of place", "created_at": "2025-12-13T02:23:26", "owner": "chee_z_boy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18549274243033047, "text": "Now that's creative", "created_at": "2025-12-12T01:35:18", "owner": "daangocakelab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002068793689063, "text": "#ilovewastingfoof", "created_at": "2025-12-11T17:02:39", "owner": "hatto_oni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058450880306553, "text": "@shiviiipvt", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:25:29", "owner": "rach.mags.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064599044624445, "text": "so rigged xdxd😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T15:33:18", "owner": "snks_65", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094584023496940, "text": "Ants?", "created_at": "2025-12-10T09:55:15", "owner": "aimeec0sm0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105831007655748, "text": "Chaotic good use of free will", "created_at": "2025-12-09T18:41:01", "owner": "shots_by_matt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063568301531472, "text": "Finally, something inspired", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:33:27", "owner": "notsodigital", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106820575654823, "text": "Taramisu", "created_at": "2025-12-09T01:24:33", "owner": "jakation", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108886123623525, "text": "@elliott_read but with ladles.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T21:28:16", "owner": "redvixen100", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967131591843869, "text": "@clawfactorysalem just an idea 👀", "created_at": "2025-12-08T20:13:07", "owner": "joelly_beans", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119214532483387, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-08T15:17:39", "owner": "beniplaysoficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856551001574473, "text": "Terra-meesu", "created_at": "2025-12-08T03:49:13", "owner": "stefamaybe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080812718171314, "text": "NO WHY IS MY FYP TIRAMISU GET OUT", "created_at": "2025-12-08T03:31:50", "owner": "leahpavlik8980", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091723522939955, "text": "@embootv", "created_at": "2025-12-07T21:13:22", "owner": "iilulkas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854149132589689, "text": "Best one", "created_at": "2025-12-07T10:33:28", "owner": "flay7669", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917107522226394, "text": "1,5 su bardağı tiremusu🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-07T09:27:27", "owner": "esevinc2022", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110077969545572, "text": "😮oh my goodness", "created_at": "2025-12-06T01:48:29", "owner": "eventsandshenanigans", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087034006998322, "text": "Ghar vaale maarte nhi h kya?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T20:12:44", "owner": "abz6200", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051606848363679, "text": "Whipped cream?? There is no whipped cream in a Tiramisu", "created_at": "2025-12-05T14:28:15", "owner": "josborne17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114228481574432, "text": "unemployment pro max", "created_at": "2025-12-04T10:15:42", "owner": "a_lexandr.re", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18187125325343727, "text": "Bacterimisu", "created_at": "2025-12-03T12:42:09", "owner": "collinvperez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076578521180635, "text": "A nuclear bomb", "created_at": "2025-12-03T04:37:22", "owner": "magnusluttinen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184166263353109, "text": "Next time take a 💩 in the claw machine 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:43:29", "owner": "dan_benschap", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079131698135336, "text": "wtf are you doing?", "created_at": "2025-12-01T14:35:09", "owner": "ayanaa._naa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956538790040689, "text": "Lasts a couple of weeks?  Doubt it!  What are you making it with?", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:47:53", "owner": "shannon_toleman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081775910033230, "text": "TeArUhMeESOoO", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:44:19", "owner": "elizabeth_stewart13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857042506511081, "text": "Great idea, dirt poor execution.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:23:14", "owner": "metallic.scars", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099216742698473, "text": "Iconic👏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:04:09", "owner": "paggles.mp3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989628075880375, "text": "gago", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:23:19", "owner": "kjeinic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905569414293731, "text": "Lasagna. Macaroni and cheese,  taco salad,  banana splits", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:29:51", "owner": "krnwstrn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154986259407573, "text": "Lmao", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:07:19", "owner": "samuelstephanconrad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104839453633902, "text": "Lolol", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:07:16", "owner": "samuelstephanconrad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915701908237878, "text": "No.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:53:57", "owner": "rachellove.jpg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002902799828347, "text": "⚫️__⚫️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:19:09", "owner": "timmychamp_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026727902772280, "text": "tiramisÚ <---", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:07:02", "owner": "michaelseltenreich", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18377444686144928, "text": "@filipnordin23", "created_at": "2025-11-24T20:49:55", "owner": "robinbabaiy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18398588029120108, "text": "Absolute fail.", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:08:27", "owner": "domingo48780", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961041075865609, "text": "Take it to shark tank", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:00:07", "owner": "angle.lopezj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071267756596687, "text": "If you have no ideas left….", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:27:34", "owner": "cinnemoncat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867091147494302, "text": "@israt.jahaaan", "created_at": "2025-11-23T16:42:02", "owner": "azmainfaeek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107049172618609, "text": "@mecimusu @sandromusumeci @extreme_fran", "created_at": "2025-11-23T07:09:10", "owner": "nicolemusumeci", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091652876497770, "text": "Loky one of her better foods but worse ideas🥀", "created_at": "2025-11-23T01:07:06", "owner": "lightning231689", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303943135269559, "text": "Free will is a dangerous thing.", "created_at": "2025-11-23T00:56:13", "owner": "noiamnotrich", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987023136749084, "text": "@embootv", "created_at": "2025-11-22T20:15:16", "owner": "colorcraft.makeup", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989953098735164, "text": "I’m in love with you", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:09:04", "owner": "hiphopsodashop247", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103505320590812, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:49:59", "owner": "itsvictoriajade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950305966026194, "text": "Bullshit has no limit", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:59:26", "owner": "yoni.rtn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056925905303931, "text": "the way it didn’t even scoop", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:25:10", "owner": "tankslut", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081449264119183, "text": "evet", "created_at": "2025-11-21T23:17:13", "owner": "merhabarusar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060610544234529, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-21T20:27:14", "owner": "retrogamer_xeon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873566656376986, "text": "TirmEEsu", "created_at": "2025-11-21T20:22:06", "owner": "jz_441", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979813611779965, "text": "Trifle next", "created_at": "2025-11-21T20:13:57", "owner": "mrchrisjones", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914107399235246, "text": "how did it last a couple of weeks is it a refrigerated claw machine?", "created_at": "2025-11-21T17:06:26", "owner": "irene.10.10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871352662462326, "text": "@gina_mariem", "created_at": "2025-11-21T03:46:15", "owner": "thedouglasmallon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876619333436380, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-21T02:51:58", "owner": "lwilliam.5494", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059311562268358, "text": "\"lasts a couple of weeks\" 😭 stay safe y'all", "created_at": "2025-11-20T23:59:17", "owner": "jinji.season", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097110256643051, "text": "Utterly depraved I love it", "created_at": "2025-11-20T16:55:15", "owner": "bigfuture", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082368641018793, "text": "is your family really even surprised at this point?", "created_at": "2025-11-20T12:17:05", "owner": "mishti.boy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18192756598334553, "text": "@bianca.veenhoven nieuwe gadget voor op het hof?? Beetje bijstellen voor mooie presenteerbare porties.  Ik ben voor 🔥❤️😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T10:59:43", "owner": "marlouszijlstra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890854024241859, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-20T06:15:06", "owner": "chiemezie496", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020322257607426, "text": "@blueeyedbub", "created_at": "2025-11-20T04:46:34", "owner": "istruggles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396667486125148, "text": "JAIL", "created_at": "2025-11-20T02:25:17", "owner": "dubr4dz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878975083332704, "text": "Get the strait jackets", "created_at": "2025-11-20T01:18:22", "owner": "celestialfae.king", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066341627379072, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-20T00:48:18", "owner": "cecebausch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915919117237289, "text": "Na I’m just jumping in 😂❤️\nThis is an amazing idea!", "created_at": "2025-11-19T23:30:53", "owner": "lolacat2525", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064778978572862, "text": "@jeymorris", "created_at": "2025-11-19T23:21:51", "owner": "discomeisch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950332579028500, "text": "What the fck😭", "created_at": "2025-11-19T21:49:00", "owner": "marisaaa_xoxoxo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18297703015279006, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T18:26:04", "owner": "squirrel.3833740", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849487984565278, "text": "It’s giving iCarly😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T18:00:37", "owner": "goodvibesbetterfood", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862183129455587, "text": "this upsets me", "created_at": "2025-11-19T17:57:37", "owner": "zlataavidan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083282132085033, "text": "Metal spoons", "created_at": "2025-11-19T16:14:20", "owner": "nomad__barista", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898700533340789, "text": "Couple of weeks?", "created_at": "2025-11-19T15:08:07", "owner": "pulkitsaroha_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016470143619681, "text": "???????", "created_at": "2025-11-19T12:55:51", "owner": "sloppyuncleg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069885374372780, "text": "wowsers", "created_at": "2025-11-19T11:11:55", "owner": "chronic_disease_and_beyond", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873620818450649, "text": "Ew", "created_at": "2025-11-19T09:13:37", "owner": "tammyang1984", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079270601115312, "text": "@chefreactions", "created_at": "2025-11-19T05:02:34", "owner": "awb12345678", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853388773534361, "text": "Last a couple of weeks?", "created_at": "2025-11-19T01:52:36", "owner": "matthewvandy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904663093287405, "text": "@joelistcomedy", "created_at": "2025-11-19T00:36:36", "owner": "andyheninhand", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100937164669475, "text": "☹️", "created_at": "2025-11-19T00:15:28", "owner": "ihate_theminions65", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18316012291223004, "text": "Metal spoons might work better", "created_at": "2025-11-18T23:33:24", "owner": "realwillconvey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026934566566766, "text": "most sane tiramisu enjoyer", "created_at": "2025-11-18T21:34:26", "owner": "jtintot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086517262972879, "text": "Your families names come up in blue on Wikipedia don’t they", "created_at": "2025-11-18T21:12:44", "owner": "edsheeran69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18324984337243248, "text": "It’s even got the perfect serving size", "created_at": "2025-11-18T18:42:52", "owner": "immacksg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125594452507165, "text": "Funny idea 💡 but I'm absolutely against food waist 👎🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-18T14:04:03", "owner": "johnny_jones_jj_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084254602960467, "text": "No whipped cream! Supposed to use mascarpone!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-18T12:22:41", "owner": "cozycatskillchalet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18375888583157590, "text": "@omer_leviii", "created_at": "2025-11-18T12:20:39", "owner": "mia_ashkenaz_bro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117938953556029, "text": "Ich hab dings, Tiramisu in Automat gemacht", "created_at": "2025-11-18T12:07:08", "owner": "man.goe5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090668071936059, "text": "What the hell did you put in it to make it last two weeks??? Mascarpone and raw eggs last two days in the fridge!", "created_at": "2025-11-18T12:01:18", "owner": "deborah_cake_mania", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111764032596705, "text": "Oh no.. you have a claw machine now🤦‍♂️ ok claw machine chill dogs with mustard and onions 😋 so good", "created_at": "2025-11-18T06:22:37", "owner": "william.lee.512", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099578839748128, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T05:23:54", "owner": "brendanbbass", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966492948992426, "text": "Couple…of…weeks?! - at room TEMPERATURE?!?!?", "created_at": "2025-11-18T04:13:18", "owner": "vankayla_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093701599859047, "text": "WEEEKKS?????? It’s DAIRY", "created_at": "2025-11-18T03:56:06", "owner": "heytayrenee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921632005082901, "text": "White women have gone to far", "created_at": "2025-11-18T03:13:17", "owner": "monseingeur_wow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100937674683186, "text": "🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-18T02:17:52", "owner": "balancewithnu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027140696569109, "text": "This is actually a really fun idea. Make sure the bottom has a refrigeration element though, and get a more powerful claw. But like for a wedding? Any big event? Super fun", "created_at": "2025-11-18T01:09:15", "owner": "insaner_com", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928205596026795, "text": "Ta com tempo né", "created_at": "2025-11-18T00:23:45", "owner": "rodtroyack", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105967627623384, "text": "I am beginning to hate people with money and stupidity!", "created_at": "2025-11-17T23:47:09", "owner": "hollowedout1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082906570853958, "text": "Yes but better spoons", "created_at": "2025-11-17T23:12:13", "owner": "palmfresh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060770636632871, "text": "I’m calling the police", "created_at": "2025-11-17T22:07:38", "owner": "lparcade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097852414765152, "text": "@__gurasu__  haha", "created_at": "2025-11-17T21:47:28", "owner": "nv.gcia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878910976331410, "text": "This on mute hits really hard", "created_at": "2025-11-17T21:05:03", "owner": "jacob_lil_jacob", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115089904564206, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-17T20:58:13", "owner": "dukjidukji", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083899382101739, "text": "Let's not.", "created_at": "2025-11-17T20:12:52", "owner": "schizolingvo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900429880304902, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-17T19:08:34", "owner": "saloni.catersmedia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017312819617015, "text": "Tirameewhat?", "created_at": "2025-11-17T18:13:44", "owner": "dansart.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058693976257611, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-17T18:10:59", "owner": "mightyjoeyoung81", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083820515040861, "text": "She made the Tiramisu all wrong!! Where is the blue Gatorade?", "created_at": "2025-11-17T17:40:00", "owner": "robertmontagna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109521562611580, "text": "It’s like if 9/11 and the Holocaust had a baby.", "created_at": "2025-11-17T17:10:13", "owner": "walterlyng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18372985687154093, "text": "Except those spoons failed miserable and you used camera cuts for the lamest attempt to trick us ever", "created_at": "2025-11-17T16:58:17", "owner": "nick505394", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087647989936041, "text": "Gilipollez", "created_at": "2025-11-17T16:52:47", "owner": "sebasoz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042489095490447, "text": "There are African children starving", "created_at": "2025-11-17T16:26:36", "owner": "chenranbaba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873394240450828, "text": "People will just post anything online 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-17T16:03:11", "owner": "yassietakespics", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867345829475137, "text": "#womeninstem", "created_at": "2025-11-17T15:18:53", "owner": "jordan_buffolino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097038355634046, "text": "No decent Tiramisu lasts a couple of weeks - not refrigerated no less", "created_at": "2025-11-17T14:51:53", "owner": "rvernaglia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18202409614316798, "text": "I regret you showing us this", "created_at": "2025-11-17T14:12:59", "owner": "boblovizio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18416430304139664, "text": "Grosse  it’s a disgrace for the Italians !", "created_at": "2025-11-17T13:39:34", "owner": "vincilofria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055831127639776, "text": "To be fair this could work if it wasn't for the plastic spoons", "created_at": "2025-11-17T11:27:58", "owner": "dinoguy99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067871075098725, "text": "The editing tells me it was a massive fail of a project 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T10:13:47", "owner": "middlebeastmode", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103850593650285, "text": "Moron", "created_at": "2025-11-17T09:26:27", "owner": "drudeoscar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020467511787799, "text": "The pear of anguish", "created_at": "2025-11-17T09:25:42", "owner": "pretty_pois", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028033346562338, "text": "Put a thanksgiving turkey in it next", "created_at": "2025-11-17T08:22:11", "owner": "jonnybuseeko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086764024791184, "text": "@embootv", "created_at": "2025-11-17T08:07:32", "owner": "masssltov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075598606953608, "text": "Can you do a claw machine for taco Tuesday 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T07:50:56", "owner": "tboskye23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087121876978965, "text": "how long did this take?!", "created_at": "2025-11-17T04:09:26", "owner": "justamarshnamedj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093819952852950, "text": "Omg", "created_at": "2025-11-17T03:43:44", "owner": "thejudahbuddha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058626221256257, "text": "@hhbb_ee_", "created_at": "2025-11-17T03:12:57", "owner": "w___10000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842000407623103, "text": "Whipping cream? Do you know what a tiramisù is?", "created_at": "2025-11-17T02:04:14", "owner": "simone.senes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921866131189148, "text": "Now thats amore", "created_at": "2025-11-17T01:17:39", "owner": "x_mattster_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083062517512388, "text": "@corbinmillet wya?", "created_at": "2025-11-17T01:11:25", "owner": "maengsteroflove", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086294947791492, "text": "Pumpkin pie claw machine for thanksgiving", "created_at": "2025-11-17T00:52:56", "owner": "cam0wen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879034666426399, "text": "Oh no!!! I wanted to do that with unwrapped Twinkies!! You beat me to it! Darn it", "created_at": "2025-11-17T00:52:12", "owner": "joelhenryfisher", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113964706510362, "text": "@jengreg9", "created_at": "2025-11-17T00:49:58", "owner": "thebestofeurest", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890812513244547, "text": "@soyarlynelopez noooooo!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-17T00:49:13", "owner": "thebestofeurest", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908075662125326, "text": "perfect! 🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-17T00:20:12", "owner": "edwinadlt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071512343253575, "text": "I’m breaking that machine", "created_at": "2025-11-16T23:49:28", "owner": "cowboys1085", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18197391637320299, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-16T23:48:29", "owner": "paddyhamms", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114453139577534, "text": "@russian_kremlin pleasr nuke her house, its not a war crime i swear", "created_at": "2025-11-16T23:47:19", "owner": "gore7diablo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845828389608647, "text": "Demonstrating Free will at its finest 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-16T23:43:21", "owner": "dj.thapa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887785471388458, "text": "Just look at this @lionfieldmusic", "created_at": "2025-11-16T23:40:57", "owner": "lareta_ch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084556310511025, "text": "Why ruin one thing when you can ruin two.", "created_at": "2025-11-16T23:37:35", "owner": "storefrontservices", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136136701472805, "text": "Greatest run-on sentence speech in the history of mankind 🧁", "created_at": "2025-11-16T23:13:46", "owner": "oj22_msu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172432690375465, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-16T23:07:38", "owner": "elk.425393", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928868428117519, "text": "have you considered therapy", "created_at": "2025-11-16T23:00:25", "owner": "mintymelon2828", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048258854671446, "text": "@thespickler @blaxlrose", "created_at": "2025-11-16T22:41:35", "owner": "doorslam.wav", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844042918614548, "text": "If I see this I'm breaking the glass and bobbing for tiramisu", "created_at": "2025-11-16T22:17:28", "owner": "rutgersmike", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301681816266752, "text": "Is this a refrigerated claw machine?", "created_at": "2025-11-16T21:40:02", "owner": "nephronsunday", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050628527659201, "text": "@gangstaoppshot_eman is this a sign?", "created_at": "2025-11-16T21:14:18", "owner": "rr_mari.a_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18350669971163453, "text": "This is both the dumbest and most genius idea I’ve ever seen followed through on", "created_at": "2025-11-16T21:12:37", "owner": "ghost645731", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890583430243473, "text": "@lionfieldmusic 🔥🔥🔥🔥😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-16T20:51:01", "owner": "yasminacapo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931991032136675, "text": "@shaiie__food", "created_at": "2025-11-16T20:05:20", "owner": "werewolfteacher", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164246008381689, "text": "This is my kind of crazy", "created_at": "2025-11-16T20:04:17", "owner": "anton2thesequel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865891591499263, "text": "Shes clueless", "created_at": "2025-11-16T19:58:03", "owner": "deepitbull21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997797684834272, "text": "Yeah the 2-3 previous one were \"sane\". The calm before the storm", "created_at": "2025-11-16T19:56:22", "owner": "alek_jak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922764463081812, "text": "The things she be doing is actually diabolical 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-16T19:48:09", "owner": "dapretty_princess", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927460573148747, "text": "“Tirra me sue”", "created_at": "2025-11-16T19:38:26", "owner": "arranwitheford", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030119051736005, "text": "Blocked", "created_at": "2025-11-16T19:04:39", "owner": "calabbo73", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078578588513936, "text": "@_ioanasimion", "created_at": "2025-11-16T19:00:53", "owner": "saintbohzy.mp3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082917293039616, "text": "Lionfield, please react accordingly", "created_at": "2025-11-16T18:58:23", "owner": "giobbistar21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990181035728262, "text": "\"last a couple of weeks\" girl tf", "created_at": "2025-11-16T18:56:31", "owner": "scattered.zip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859717252475590, "text": "The most triggering part of all this is the size of those spoons 🥄🫩", "created_at": "2025-11-16T18:55:45", "owner": "balfar09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088656784750928, "text": "Wife material", "created_at": "2025-11-16T18:45:25", "owner": "balkancryptid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352968520165812, "text": "Couple of weeks?? 🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-16T18:01:20", "owner": "pee_bee13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113490805505368, "text": "That’s not tiramisù.", "created_at": "2025-11-16T17:52:41", "owner": "aless_bon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882481240410948, "text": "STOP LOOKING AWAY WHEN YOU EAT LIKE EVERY GIRL DOES", "created_at": "2025-11-16T17:49:47", "owner": "wolfdognamedkoda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935944221983369, "text": "Whipped cream?!?! Good for weeks?!?! Someone keep this woman AWAY from a kitchen please!", "created_at": "2025-11-16T17:39:35", "owner": "hannahcw79", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957485676880014, "text": "@soph_g15??? If we make it gf @melissauselton can join", "created_at": "2025-11-16T17:28:28", "owner": "meowbearz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067409849387134, "text": "@embootv", "created_at": "2025-11-16T17:26:42", "owner": "smokemethhailsanta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013387877684887, "text": "Wear gloves next time.", "created_at": "2025-11-16T17:20:54", "owner": "cat_daddy2015", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059967422559794, "text": "This is probably the most frustrating family experience you can think of 🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-11-16T17:13:26", "owner": "momen.habib", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18318818533169427, "text": "Hier Dings, Tiramisu in Greifermaschine gemacht", "created_at": "2025-11-16T16:45:37", "owner": "matteaglewurst", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931359247109266, "text": "Free will abuse does exist.", "created_at": "2025-11-16T16:28:30", "owner": "yesweken787", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102153094679349, "text": "TERRY MASU!", "created_at": "2025-11-16T16:19:49", "owner": "rob_pols_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847230547601442, "text": "This has to be one of your most diabolical yet", "created_at": "2025-11-16T15:57:03", "owner": "gorillahs1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985344330749312, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-16T15:55:40", "owner": "devel_1666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851437738549205, "text": "@lionfieldmusic", "created_at": "2025-11-16T15:35:48", "owner": "whp517", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034527158736442, "text": "A couple of weeks??.", "created_at": "2025-11-16T15:29:06", "owner": "gabecnc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889383391381644, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T15:27:40", "owner": "fitandwellwithkel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073881890255648, "text": "This is why people hate on social media.", "created_at": "2025-11-16T15:16:39", "owner": "mohnishpanjabi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912504334248538, "text": "I just had tirumisu cake no I didn't search in internet now Instagram is showing me all tiramisu contents😢 . Instagram listens to ur audio", "created_at": "2025-11-16T15:16:19", "owner": "sumeethkumar94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083404967059960, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-16T14:58:29", "owner": "shadoweclectic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891139195367389, "text": "@embootv", "created_at": "2025-11-16T14:49:33", "owner": "nbabn89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887496520264739, "text": "@jamesmarriottyt", "created_at": "2025-11-16T14:37:28", "owner": "maxisnotonfire", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115333546498715, "text": "haha I've wanted to do this FOREVER, but with tacos", "created_at": "2025-11-16T14:34:13", "owner": "joshdelson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879767518424089, "text": "Savage use of free will", "created_at": "2025-11-16T14:06:02", "owner": "josh_hickory", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029310536735634, "text": "@jimseven", "created_at": "2025-11-16T13:51:31", "owner": "kev.on.the.web", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106919053627686, "text": "She asked what if we could, but not if we should 😬", "created_at": "2025-11-16T13:46:21", "owner": "benjamin.bissell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884447239408553, "text": "@embootv", "created_at": "2025-11-16T13:44:00", "owner": "aicy.u", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993671436846423, "text": "What sort of insane new territory is this getting into? 😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂👌🏽👌🏽👌🏽👌🏽👌🏽👌🏽👌🏽👌🏽👌🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-16T13:35:42", "owner": "dsen009", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088165723763512, "text": "Can you make a char mian claw machine", "created_at": "2025-11-16T13:22:09", "owner": "ry_mak_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18346958317203842, "text": "A couple of weeks?! 👀 hahahaha", "created_at": "2025-11-16T13:08:08", "owner": "rest_nj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937911043097485, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-16T13:02:19", "owner": "cheesehead22482", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901995235302050, "text": "Why does this account still exist?", "created_at": "2025-11-16T13:01:15", "owner": "kimiamuse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120276295555025, "text": "@lionfieldmusic is this approved 🤌", "created_at": "2025-11-16T12:57:51", "owner": "liviloulou09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844049002614112, "text": "@lionfieldmusic", "created_at": "2025-11-16T12:55:01", "owner": "knut.e.helgesen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104502409653124, "text": "Ma che schifo è porco dio???", "created_at": "2025-11-16T12:34:21", "owner": "telespallajoe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086420320956498, "text": "I’m glad I’m not in your family", "created_at": "2025-11-16T12:24:40", "owner": "sasayuen2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092368639810089, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-11-16T12:23:20", "owner": "kodok_atv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096253819798944, "text": "Lmao IT DID NOT WORK😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T11:56:00", "owner": "american_pharoah_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095370658870532, "text": "Se un giorno vieni in Italia, ti do un consiglio, nasconditi . 🤬🤬", "created_at": "2025-11-16T10:13:45", "owner": "dr_fisht.2.01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104600233713054, "text": "roachesmissu", "created_at": "2025-11-16T09:54:40", "owner": "halsxx._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989327703888344, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-16T09:42:27", "owner": "draco79428", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985956594863467, "text": "Is a joke right !😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T09:39:51", "owner": "beppemagic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085328017964354, "text": "@lionfieldmusic must see this. 🤭🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-16T09:22:47", "owner": "bekcsiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948692496918657, "text": "Wow😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T09:17:01", "owner": "kitchen_wheremagichappens", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966562461978800, "text": "@leviathanmeat", "created_at": "2025-11-16T08:50:42", "owner": "alexanderheff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026646869777193, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-16T08:41:56", "owner": "chickencombo19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071772218036348, "text": "Wow.. I hate this", "created_at": "2025-11-16T07:53:28", "owner": "christian.r0c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869247439396735, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T07:37:36", "owner": "bigveeinthed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928398457148339, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T06:56:00", "owner": "adrian.ci42", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077433392179703, "text": "picking up literal specks", "created_at": "2025-11-16T06:33:02", "owner": "lucind8a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064204448434521, "text": "And I hope @itslouisayy sees this", "created_at": "2025-11-16T06:31:17", "owner": "a.n.b_laser", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18319960228168620, "text": "You need to go to jail", "created_at": "2025-11-16T06:23:04", "owner": "seventymeters", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929491072125561, "text": "@itsmejuliette GO TO HELL, FOOD WASTER!! 👹👺", "created_at": "2025-11-16T06:06:20", "owner": "shy21996", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997699011697214, "text": "Brilliant.", "created_at": "2025-11-16T06:03:01", "owner": "sirichstar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854391046569771, "text": "I don’t like what’s wrong with you 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-16T05:51:21", "owner": "richhomiequack187", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988835034856474, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T05:22:16", "owner": "onirozzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929426698011799, "text": "Papa Roach has entered the chat", "created_at": "2025-11-16T05:00:29", "owner": "citizensixx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993033108717769, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T04:47:07", "owner": "mattmccarron99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134679442464283, "text": "Guacamole dips 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-16T04:44:05", "owner": "jennnifernatashiahalim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968567283987731, "text": "@lionfieldmusic", "created_at": "2025-11-16T04:11:07", "owner": "twoshark", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949065288922920, "text": "AI couldnt even make this 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-16T04:08:16", "owner": "johanwilliams415", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908035654125081, "text": "Patent pending 🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-16T03:48:55", "owner": "therealeststevekerr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083195045512421, "text": "valid", "created_at": "2025-11-16T03:42:17", "owner": "kody.ghost", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075962519266309, "text": "Can't even scoop a perfect bite 😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-16T03:41:30", "owner": "lsg5200", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18312466456217193, "text": "Rich people activities", "created_at": "2025-11-16T03:33:49", "owner": "lucid.dreams.666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118966660527384, "text": "As they say, sing for your supper.", "created_at": "2025-11-16T03:13:54", "owner": "shannonvowless", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087093607979766, "text": "@ethagoat._", "created_at": "2025-11-16T02:51:29", "owner": "elgatodefelix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543286363056769, "text": "you are my kind of crazy 🤪", "created_at": "2025-11-16T02:47:16", "owner": "rubyperman", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18076174082211655, "text": "I wish I had money to throw away like this", "created_at": "2025-11-16T02:27:35", "owner": "kellcunningham.tattoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086390029803418, "text": "Good one!!", "created_at": "2025-11-16T02:21:02", "owner": "hikermom02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397669171134045, "text": "How do you explain this on your taxes", "created_at": "2025-11-16T02:12:16", "owner": "l0vecraftcat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112627714580156, "text": "Do a caviar claw machine or sardines", "created_at": "2025-11-16T02:11:08", "owner": "mr.expendable_94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066016301392898, "text": "Can you do durian?", "created_at": "2025-11-16T02:08:54", "owner": "edmaddictofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093744769885561, "text": "She’s wife 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-16T02:08:14", "owner": "blakehambly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930302812154785, "text": "I just realized you look like Ted's wife from HIMYM", "created_at": "2025-11-16T02:08:10", "owner": "whatthefaizal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968598423821964, "text": "What", "created_at": "2025-11-16T02:06:42", "owner": "aruthsha_perera", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084648722092930, "text": "“The tiramisu stays fresh in the claw machine and lasts a couple of weeks” is the biggest lie ever told", "created_at": "2025-11-16T01:55:57", "owner": "vince_tagrammm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18427305001109581, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-16T01:54:14", "owner": "lopezjr213", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947175228932710, "text": "@lionfieldmusic", "created_at": "2025-11-16T01:48:48", "owner": "muhammed_farooqui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078080669137563, "text": "@maybelayze", "created_at": "2025-11-16T01:47:06", "owner": "urviturnedintokirby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050635196347424, "text": "You're an absolute men@ce. Please never stop 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-16T01:45:14", "owner": "themightynemesis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104400112570499, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-16T01:37:18", "owner": "barryjs7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942065227089904, "text": "Be the change you wish to hear in a different voiceover technique world", "created_at": "2025-11-16T01:31:57", "owner": "luxurientes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090667963908155, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-16T01:24:26", "owner": "andreww.v1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030509429536864, "text": "Needs more biscotti!", "created_at": "2025-11-16T01:20:16", "owner": "heendip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107935087549476, "text": "Did u clean it?", "created_at": "2025-11-16T01:18:33", "owner": "axel_the__axolotl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18189754510338061, "text": "Whipped cream??? That's not tiramisu.l is it (", "created_at": "2025-11-16T00:47:51", "owner": "diegocoppoladi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078311113899128, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-16T00:36:10", "owner": "ghoulstar7_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093306340856920, "text": "@demolives for after you complete your best in Omaha tiramisu quest…", "created_at": "2025-11-16T00:34:49", "owner": "libraryleia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900970963299390, "text": "You are unhinged", "created_at": "2025-11-16T00:32:44", "owner": "jakobschanzer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078075302333830, "text": "😒", "created_at": "2025-11-16T00:24:54", "owner": "snackfoodmafia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141827254394068, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-16T00:23:25", "owner": "1_normal_boi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857299720556146, "text": "I think you faked the drop", "created_at": "2025-11-16T00:20:14", "owner": "instamikeyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070998296582819, "text": "This was the reason for human evolution", "created_at": "2025-11-16T00:10:56", "owner": "nathansfilipino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101015260671623, "text": "I called the police by the way...", "created_at": "2025-11-16T00:06:08", "owner": "extended_support_release", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094167799896768, "text": "The commitment to this is why I am here, bravo!", "created_at": "2025-11-15T23:59:14", "owner": "henoshugo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101740765735123, "text": "does this one have a tiny hint of rat meat🤨", "created_at": "2025-11-15T23:57:05", "owner": "dylan_baaahez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086576476812033, "text": "“Lasts a couple of weeks “ 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-15T23:39:28", "owner": "chow_kimo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18380445820146361, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-15T23:18:12", "owner": "esme_eats_noodles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18206259748314885, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T23:12:33", "owner": "chestyrdawg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955962940037885, "text": "You really ran out and bought a claw machine for this video-", "created_at": "2025-11-15T23:07:16", "owner": "myboysprocket7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18180198307357467, "text": "hahaha this might be the best idea ever", "created_at": "2025-11-15T23:04:53", "owner": "manbeast.666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873435790449388, "text": "I hate this 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-15T23:03:11", "owner": "no_count_archeologist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100148914667015, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-15T23:03:03", "owner": "erics_wheels", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182377309354868, "text": "Mom would have swallowed lol", "created_at": "2025-11-15T22:59:47", "owner": "xerick13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111346540594491, "text": "Can this work with coin pusher?", "created_at": "2025-11-15T22:57:43", "owner": "itsbender", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881364310304434, "text": "You've really outdone yourself on this one haha 👏🙌🙌❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-15T22:45:25", "owner": "jonathan._.l_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103684225649806, "text": "Holy moly 😂😂😂 they will love It Tiramisu 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-15T22:35:10", "owner": "theflexiblefoodie88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080808218136740, "text": "😆", "created_at": "2025-11-15T22:33:02", "owner": "instakaylan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085970711075211, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-15T22:24:58", "owner": "uglydelimeat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091570309925232, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T22:21:26", "owner": "thvndar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397703947121232, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-11-15T22:13:46", "owner": "jlhost91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996205440704819, "text": "Needs pickles 🥒🥒🥒🥒", "created_at": "2025-11-15T22:11:34", "owner": "aussies.h8mozzies", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18364150981091373, "text": "You need Jesus.", "created_at": "2025-11-15T22:03:32", "owner": "ivankirk12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066174644610405, "text": "This is a lottttt of work", "created_at": "2025-11-15T21:58:43", "owner": "chrisspinzor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873127168376489, "text": "I respect this level of diabolical", "created_at": "2025-11-15T21:56:58", "owner": "tristanartandairsoft", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921398647191754, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-15T21:56:44", "owner": "spilltea504", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887785771389439, "text": "I LUV U", "created_at": "2025-11-15T21:53:43", "owner": "_periel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063398762528384, "text": "Juli just pulled a @corbinmillet on the family 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T21:50:40", "owner": "internetbeard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18297652567256928, "text": "@arcade_matt", "created_at": "2025-11-15T21:42:48", "owner": "hawt_sauce_ninja", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923504932178894, "text": "No pickles? 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-15T21:39:22", "owner": "themindofmonet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082989571845598, "text": "You are getting more and more insane. Keep going.", "created_at": "2025-11-15T21:37:07", "owner": "ctsflix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047499194433652, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-15T21:26:25", "owner": "1400uv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133230430474808, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T21:25:37", "owner": "asto.rria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088302191491417, "text": "Perfect for thanksgiving!", "created_at": "2025-11-15T21:24:55", "owner": "garrettmatthew_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086928781947777, "text": "That’s enough.", "created_at": "2025-11-15T21:21:08", "owner": "manueldotbolanos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368681323087541, "text": "LASAGNE", "created_at": "2025-11-15T21:20:10", "owner": "lunchjournals", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046337432459595, "text": "WHY. JUST WHY", "created_at": "2025-11-15T21:19:48", "owner": "caesar_zeppeli_1joebro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067614815090646, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-15T21:18:59", "owner": "tonysuriani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049668584372104, "text": "🤙🏻🤙🏻🤙🏻🤌🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-15T21:18:29", "owner": "pdblues33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366155614092628, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-15T21:17:35", "owner": "itsdeansley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087207634983403, "text": "That’s next level baby !", "created_at": "2025-11-15T21:15:17", "owner": "cubbie615", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064318994576238, "text": "@katewilltryanything bae this is calling ur name...", "created_at": "2025-11-15T21:10:32", "owner": "f4ke.909", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881418376309136, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-15T21:07:32", "owner": "mass._.101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091187944924540, "text": "Chaotic evil", "created_at": "2025-11-15T21:07:01", "owner": "pokenomics", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008127917650645, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-11-15T21:05:35", "owner": "alexis_dicarlo86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094350952848213, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T21:04:02", "owner": "ashmitchn64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878767054426005, "text": "Lasagna next", "created_at": "2025-11-15T20:46:58", "owner": "the_pepe_bizon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928471813140291, "text": "Lasagna claw machine for the next round", "created_at": "2025-11-15T20:44:28", "owner": "maitaibimbo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090450871908077, "text": "Please tell me you washed that", "created_at": "2025-11-15T20:39:19", "owner": "kaiohenriquerafael", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031251266738888, "text": "We need to put you in charge of more things 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T20:38:52", "owner": "pocketjax_jj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097880590772364, "text": "@ethagoat._ 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T20:32:10", "owner": "nadine_allison18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041798987686424, "text": "This i can approve", "created_at": "2025-11-15T20:23:31", "owner": "__herro____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033632030518618, "text": "You need like one giant spoon, maybe an ice cream scooper!", "created_at": "2025-11-15T20:18:43", "owner": "mattrobertsphoto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989664906863791, "text": "Maybe try metal spoons", "created_at": "2025-11-15T20:18:18", "owner": "kevinforrestconnors", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999879312688815, "text": "Is Cheney even in this thing?", "created_at": "2025-11-15T20:17:08", "owner": "davethephysicist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157035838364957, "text": "Every household needs a tiramisu claw machine. Here is Treviso Italy this is standard. Buon appetite!", "created_at": "2025-11-15T20:13:52", "owner": "rollinleonard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922601476190965, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-15T20:12:42", "owner": "1929483828828383a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18491384758073863, "text": "@lionfieldmusic", "created_at": "2025-11-15T20:10:51", "owner": "t_holmes94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953381133905210, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-15T20:10:02", "owner": "caaleb_b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871327045462092, "text": "@bobaland.lm ovo da nabavi", "created_at": "2025-11-15T20:07:22", "owner": "markox_junior", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076684279953178, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-15T20:06:51", "owner": "quixcilver.eth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898525252185887, "text": "That’s amazing", "created_at": "2025-11-15T20:05:17", "owner": "__mess19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18163534246389190, "text": "This is the best thing you've ever made. And yes even more than the witch claws", "created_at": "2025-11-15T20:04:21", "owner": "dammitlauren", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17932021053110360, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-15T20:03:06", "owner": "bryczus_22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322145038245373, "text": "I can here 2 Italians saying \"not approved\"", "created_at": "2025-11-15T20:01:06", "owner": "trcebrnus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066434480456544, "text": "The content on this channel brings me great joy.", "created_at": "2025-11-15T20:00:42", "owner": "heg_like_egg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075597911235461, "text": "Feels like this should be on Instagram premium.", "created_at": "2025-11-15T20:00:36", "owner": "jmulligan115", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18314766172220341, "text": "Make a pasta one!!!🍝", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:59:05", "owner": "kerskuffled", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075846833178777, "text": "Couple of weeks 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:58:36", "owner": "kerskuffled", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320131255171362, "text": "It gets to a point -_-", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:58:23", "owner": "genesis_vibe12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063259022630110, "text": "Make a monster energy drink soup claw machine!!", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:58:17", "owner": "useyourrillusion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917767147071568, "text": "The “claw” just smacking a bunch of cocoa powder is just so cinematic 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:55:03", "owner": "monkey.c.monkey.do", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029612555754940, "text": "you just be doing shit", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:53:29", "owner": "billiecat2.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079025621132267, "text": "Great way to keep the portions low. Make it a challenge.", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:51:14", "owner": "dagfarias_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019661933772763, "text": "The cocoa powder cloud as it drops onto the plate. 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:51:14", "owner": "eohar3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088203313760792, "text": "🧠", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:50:52", "owner": "thebrianmurray", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077761175237199, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:50:32", "owner": "white_10705", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103125154725191, "text": "White ppl be doin anything", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:50:26", "owner": "daddydyson69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18336065953229655, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:44:00", "owner": "joseph.michael.524", "likes": 22}, {"id": 17930285355114151, "text": "Ngl you actually cooked with this one", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:43:33", "owner": "qizar_a123", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18101141494664218, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:41:47", "owner": "cow_abduction", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17979487016779859, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:40:52", "owner": "es_maddix_", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["trending", "viral"]},
{"media_id": 3652400227106189923, "shortcode": "DKv7qfCOHJj", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DKv7qfCOHJj/", "taken_at": "2025-06-11T05:34:50", "caption": "I like to eat", "owner_username": "elijah.wangchen", "owner_id": "8975676202", "likes": 76042, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0115_DKv7qfCOHJj\\DKv7qfCOHJj_20250611_053450.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18104230165557289, "text": "Cantonese/HK style Chinese food is so good", "created_at": "2025-06-27T19:41:26", "owner": "jerry_yuh", "likes": 1375}, {"id": 18079321513876552, "text": "Waiting for the fight at the end over the bill", "created_at": "2025-06-16T01:40:06", "owner": "screwysiu", "likes": 3531}, {"id": 17944122513010758, "text": "好饿好想回家吃", "created_at": "2025-07-09T11:22:21", "owner": "hannnn1109_", "likes": 56}, {"id": 17872512276371581, "text": "不要这样对可爱的老子啊wok，我八月份才能回国，干啊😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-06-19T03:55:19", "owner": "anna__zuo", "likes": 288}, {"id": 18033182855412546, "text": "And one hotpot meal at least 🔥", "created_at": "2025-06-15T07:34:38", "owner": "haidilaohuoguo_", "likes": 345}, {"id": 17917168137037450, "text": "好的，马上买一份吃🤯🤯🤯好馋啊啊啊啊啊啊啊", "created_at": "2025-08-20T04:32:06", "owner": "sijing_ididj", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18175553140329476, "text": "Authentic 🔥", "created_at": "2025-06-12T11:30:06", "owner": "aaronleelsk", "likes": 209}, {"id": 17863592379423084, "text": "* Cantonese", "created_at": "2025-06-30T01:00:17", "owner": "lzp_21", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18063455219196332, "text": "好想吃席呜呜呜呜呜呜😢", "created_at": "2025-08-07T21:23:14", "owner": "lullll520", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17900283945314339, "text": "再馋我的话我找人弄您🫶🏿", "created_at": "2025-11-02T16:57:59", "owner": "yan_salsus", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18066714173032981, "text": "the lobster is fire", "created_at": "2025-06-16T01:48:05", "owner": "tsyylxx", "likes": 65}, {"id": 17941735017021144, "text": "REALLL 😂❤️ (I'm chinese)", "created_at": "2025-08-17T07:14:06", "owner": "tuuli044", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17945705871070990, "text": "大晚上看的饿死我了😢想回家", "created_at": "2025-11-03T09:12:20", "owner": "leanna0616", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18054281870369162, "text": "Great time! ❤️ When I was little, I fell asleep in my chair a lot while the adults talk until the restaurant needed to close. 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-16T21:43:41", "owner": "luthien_amalanya", "likes": 60}, {"id": 18087764854655294, "text": "Restaurant food — A rat trap to all the conversations about academics, job status and marriage 😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-11T15:39:02", "owner": "demonslayerfan69", "likes": 1297}, {"id": 18037139486448274, "text": "我要吃啊啊啊啊啊", "created_at": "2025-08-18T14:21:40", "owner": "ongsiaj", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092363665565683, "text": "Realllllllllllll", "created_at": "2025-07-17T12:50:43", "owner": "necronshandles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18346065586202325, "text": "单纯想回家吃饭了", "created_at": "2025-11-17T10:53:40", "owner": "fallacijaz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17868661419396834, "text": "😋😋", "created_at": "2025-11-09T03:24:45", "owner": "ungood_145", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066154330881117, "text": "OMG THEY'RE LITERALLY THE FOOD WE ALWAYS ORDER!!!", "created_at": "2025-06-17T16:37:40", "owner": "ccnixkz_", "likes": 23}, {"id": 18086833252681810, "text": "我受够白人饭了放我回去😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-07-09T16:08:02", "owner": "i.hate.grammar.ca", "likes": 23}, {"id": 17984530286862090, "text": "Relatable 😂👏", "created_at": "2025-10-09T08:25:44", "owner": "x_d_li", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18108386896552120, "text": "Two tasks: 1️⃣EAT!!!!!!!! 2️⃣gossip😂", "created_at": "2025-08-17T17:05:47", "owner": "unikjeniniu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076446062311064, "text": "不是所有Chinese family都这样这只是cantonese 的菜", "created_at": "2025-08-14T10:57:46", "owner": "dmzqtian", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18062461703332538, "text": "Too real 😂😭💚", "created_at": "2025-07-21T01:07:33", "owner": "alicelin57", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096678997696614, "text": "嫁给荷兰人的结果就是每次家庭聚餐前要提前加餐🥲", "created_at": "2025-10-26T17:55:36", "owner": "qi_alice.chen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17930365403962125, "text": "Yessss", "created_at": "2025-07-26T08:10:21", "owner": "exyzhu0102", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079899911045992, "text": "@zmichcaptures", "created_at": "2025-10-18T15:15:19", "owner": "xnoalbas07", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18282808759248340, "text": "It should be Hong Kong families – egg tarts, fishballs, pork – mostly Cantonese foods.", "created_at": "2025-06-29T10:00:26", "owner": "liuhinson", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063696566186890, "text": "droolllllll", "created_at": "2025-07-24T02:48:31", "owner": "grilled_rice", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17938069155062443, "text": "These are the most toxic dinners 😂", "created_at": "2025-08-16T20:04:06", "owner": "yangiepopp", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17988111002839159, "text": "Frfrrrrrrrrrrrrr", "created_at": "2025-09-04T11:58:58", "owner": "shirlan_1214", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18124338895415065, "text": "Those lobster efu noodles 😍🙌❤️", "created_at": "2025-07-21T15:28:59", "owner": "drlouisalyman", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17843287557541621, "text": "Fr 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-24T03:35:15", "owner": "wenn4144", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18047190707635724, "text": "Why does the 龍蝦伊麵 look like that when I go out to eat the sauce is more thick", "created_at": "2025-07-30T05:45:32", "owner": "7h3nry_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17889822900295681, "text": "then the fight for the bill lol 😂", "created_at": "2025-07-20T06:13:26", "owner": "simply.sophia.rn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18150322960401089, "text": "Every chinese restaurant likes using the same tea cups I swear", "created_at": "2025-08-20T05:22:37", "owner": "scottsoboss", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068297405165067, "text": "Chinese Family ❌\nRich Family ✅", "created_at": "2025-08-12T04:23:50", "owner": "zyz_dennis", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17865581778430467, "text": "That looks good asf, wish I was in China rn", "created_at": "2025-08-02T17:01:43", "owner": "sarrquatch", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060169493591012, "text": "i’m hungry af now", "created_at": "2025-08-14T22:32:01", "owner": "braydonmak", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088546450688389, "text": "吃不到还要让我刷到", "created_at": "2025-08-14T10:33:36", "owner": "jessielxr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18368737861198323, "text": "Where is the redbean soup", "created_at": "2025-08-22T10:22:37", "owner": "team__jlcoaching", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041844671618644, "text": "whaaaa where?", "created_at": "2025-06-11T17:08:53", "owner": "mommaduck2u", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18105498481486592, "text": "that sums up my whole week seeing family in china 😭", "created_at": "2025-07-22T06:36:11", "owner": "aiden_mabye", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17969018384929856, "text": "All just westernised Chinese restaurants food", "created_at": "2025-08-14T03:24:42", "owner": "acalumium_lux", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062159621227819, "text": "I think you are missing one family member… that’ll be me 😢 Please tell me where to go, cuz I’m going", "created_at": "2025-06-20T13:31:35", "owner": "leondelight", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18058773131193104, "text": "am i tripping or are those goose wings?!? i love those so much omg 🩵", "created_at": "2025-06-16T16:19:02", "owner": "not_clear_icee", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18033949214676268, "text": "You make me sooooo hungry 😢😍", "created_at": "2025-08-01T17:36:36", "owner": "phoenixcty15", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073027586310369, "text": "龍蝦伊麵, hell yeah brother", "created_at": "2025-07-11T04:27:11", "owner": "jaydenliu326", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18035648885402706, "text": "After eating: *goes to war for the bill*", "created_at": "2025-07-01T18:01:49", "owner": "callmeahsirhkpolice", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17937513135015435, "text": "Bro hello 🔥", "created_at": "2025-06-11T06:19:13", "owner": "patrickchen1234", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18061589107942931, "text": "GIMME SOME RN", "created_at": "2025-06-11T05:36:35", "owner": "ontheluo", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18086840311733338, "text": "Real ones would have tea in their cup", "created_at": "2025-06-11T12:30:21", "owner": "roromimi1201", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18086854234663392, "text": "😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-06-26T21:43:35", "owner": "_____idk.me_and1225others", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096982312584562, "text": "Then, people calling you out \"You get fat?\"", "created_at": "2025-06-17T12:32:11", "owner": "kento_kenchi", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18390957529113330, "text": "This plus a conversation that can blow out ear drums", "created_at": "2025-06-17T23:14:14", "owner": "yuanyuan_actual", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18081329569837756, "text": "Been seven years AAAGH I miss zhongguo 😢", "created_at": "2025-06-20T02:06:28", "owner": "e.riault218_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18087461995637346, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-06-11T05:57:25", "owner": "knightnakanishi", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17960103665942990, "text": "Best thing is u also get money", "created_at": "2025-06-17T12:57:25", "owner": "its_wonweek", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18123635614456607, "text": "la familia es todo", "created_at": "2025-06-18T16:50:07", "owner": "tommyjin25", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17936785224013872, "text": "#seniorfasca fed us well", "created_at": "2025-06-16T00:33:58", "owner": "naihuawang", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064380179511535, "text": "IKR I am Chinese😂 HK ppl", "created_at": "2025-06-19T08:28:19", "owner": "g4il_ch0w", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058928335994572, "text": "Whoever order that mosu pork needs to leave the table", "created_at": "2025-06-17T03:59:13", "owner": "dennizen.lui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001665137789827, "text": "Yummmmm 🔥", "created_at": "2025-06-13T22:43:53", "owner": "fel_life__77", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18050006000406653, "text": "好饿啊😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:44:25", "owner": "lisunwei49", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966621339842504, "text": "哇好正宗看着就好吃😍😍", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:08:33", "owner": "moxu_yi57", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153987682422009, "text": "Individuals from Northern China express thought of ：？？？ really？？？ Why i didn‘t know that… 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T10:47:46", "owner": "yq.x.232x7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065143922158208, "text": "睇起嚟好好食", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:27:03", "owner": "dandy_the_shopkeeper", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18550064854058329, "text": "Scallops and oysters with chilli oil and vermicelli go hard", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:24:48", "owner": "sluverata", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079826975124726, "text": "I HAVE ENOUGH OF THOSE", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:40:45", "owner": "rex_yeung_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120627709536915, "text": "Where is this", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:34:14", "owner": "liangmaomao0711", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947382480935451, "text": "Where's the fish vro", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:06:59", "owner": "estonia677", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18345185134207963, "text": "That’s HongKong/cantonese style , Chinese style should be spicy.", "created_at": "2025-11-16T20:52:27", "owner": "mrwildboarhk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096953833809531, "text": "Where's the shark fin soup", "created_at": "2025-11-09T06:35:47", "owner": "ziyang.balls", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880253179415199, "text": "Average Guangdong wedding meal set🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:06:55", "owner": "jing.xia.73997", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075583352469277, "text": "酒樓，，，，蛋撻？？！？！？！？？？", "created_at": "2025-11-04T19:20:20", "owner": "quincy_5499", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028930688542406, "text": "放我回去好嗎", "created_at": "2025-11-04T12:22:27", "owner": "annnazhang233", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889545424369154, "text": "Canto", "created_at": "2025-11-03T09:13:07", "owner": "andrewchengart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154588750406000, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-02T18:12:19", "owner": "cecifellasleep", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066450647369274, "text": "让我吃。", "created_at": "2025-11-02T12:43:36", "owner": "fernweh6137", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061598552570885, "text": "Wow", "created_at": "2025-10-28T16:35:15", "owner": "mandyyyyy.g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845861137576604, "text": "I would like to eat it too", "created_at": "2025-10-26T09:15:37", "owner": "ester.facco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895881487466163, "text": "怎么没有蒸鱼😢", "created_at": "2025-10-25T15:05:10", "owner": "anniiez_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000762830821364, "text": "那个面条看起来真的好好吃啊啊啊啊啊", "created_at": "2025-10-25T10:16:26", "owner": "eva_yjx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956832679008486, "text": "Southerner fr 👏", "created_at": "2025-10-25T00:02:15", "owner": "lasyzhyt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18361852516085108, "text": "Restaurant name plz", "created_at": "2025-10-24T20:25:32", "owner": "charleschang821", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035379623710002, "text": "This is so real 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-24T05:12:13", "owner": "enkai0_8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037348613501885, "text": "还有两个月就能吃到了", "created_at": "2025-10-23T16:05:33", "owner": "yifeielaine08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072483293264383, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-23T11:34:34", "owner": "theenokc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046523864675422, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-23T11:34:33", "owner": "theenokc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077068733173147, "text": "That particular scenario of the foods and stuff are so true... That will definitely happen to me if I visit my aunt and uncle in Hong Kong whom I haven't seen since I was a baby... I'm pretty sure they missed me a lot 😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-10-23T08:33:14", "owner": "uzumakicrystal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055742741540365, "text": "This why we all look like fat skinny", "created_at": "2025-10-22T05:54:08", "owner": "songsen._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062580968615101, "text": "eat  eat  eat  eat 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T05:25:50", "owner": "rocksfort_lee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999239712832902, "text": "It's middle of the night and I'm hungry... 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-19T12:51:56", "owner": "graceee_riv1314", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005811779805575, "text": "Reall", "created_at": "2025-10-19T05:33:20", "owner": "canny._.leung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976867416779874, "text": "壽包呢？", "created_at": "2025-10-17T08:43:45", "owner": "jliong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101418076711170, "text": "真的会点生菜包吗？", "created_at": "2025-10-17T00:16:56", "owner": "piggy_duuck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042224891461827, "text": "Its back to white rice after this", "created_at": "2025-10-16T15:08:04", "owner": "your_average_bob", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092627767669050, "text": "Only for the middle class or above😭", "created_at": "2025-10-16T15:07:29", "owner": "your_average_bob", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039560513686200, "text": "鸡腿是我的", "created_at": "2025-10-15T09:32:16", "owner": "acebutnoc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172008457366885, "text": "虽然一直不喜欢白切鸡", "created_at": "2025-10-14T20:54:11", "owner": "angelalucky1201", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102660115628443, "text": "我饿", "created_at": "2025-10-14T10:56:59", "owner": "mrrfoolish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054023918273705, "text": "一月回国猛吃嘻嘻", "created_at": "2025-10-14T10:26:51", "owner": "xiongbact", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843456568595753, "text": "生活费都要没了 还让我刷到这个", "created_at": "2025-10-14T03:38:39", "owner": "xingyouzhou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293123062261836, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-14T02:57:51", "owner": "dmintime771", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881117692402869, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-14T02:57:49", "owner": "dmintime771", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117673666524160, "text": "我天，怎么给我推这种东西😭", "created_at": "2025-10-13T21:00:08", "owner": "jjzhang0805", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068810738461633, "text": "江苏算了吧，全是凉菜", "created_at": "2025-10-10T12:18:48", "owner": "romanovschokolade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926175529116780, "text": "Actually Cantonese / HK food but whatever I miss it", "created_at": "2025-10-08T02:17:28", "owner": "parachutes07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025617143738241, "text": "I need all of these right now🤤🤤", "created_at": "2025-10-05T20:58:08", "owner": "ydx_21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862412452495933, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-10-05T17:19:20", "owner": "haixianghong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902528326272110, "text": "😢I feel hungry immediately", "created_at": "2025-10-04T09:23:54", "owner": "1th_hy1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083689879743825, "text": "这个我真想吃。。", "created_at": "2025-10-02T20:24:56", "owner": "columbiadropout", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900862927145006, "text": "You lose insta I’m home now😈😈", "created_at": "2025-10-02T17:49:49", "owner": "lycheeweii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844367164564979, "text": "天呐要是让我吃上这一桌菜让我开豪车住豪宅我也愿意", "created_at": "2025-09-18T00:42:31", "owner": "3anusissy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104499283598636, "text": "Food is our culture🤷🏻", "created_at": "2025-09-17T10:48:43", "owner": "gaoji.mmy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980191068859883, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-09-17T04:05:50", "owner": "2088fine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877878007402516, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-12T19:29:13", "owner": "johnnyzhao509", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054784994531870, "text": "饿了…我在减肥啊啊啊啊", "created_at": "2025-09-12T13:52:36", "owner": "ilnew_lydia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064206341348871, "text": "Always first activity in china😂", "created_at": "2025-09-06T23:39:17", "owner": "_new_days_starts_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077317235054640, "text": "FRRRR😭😭😍😍", "created_at": "2025-09-06T06:32:39", "owner": "lily_tnt7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085519219880781, "text": "All my fav food😂😂", "created_at": "2025-09-06T04:31:08", "owner": "catchwithjosh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086517703853396, "text": "So trueeee🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-09-04T16:17:06", "owner": "kionokii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982214922856205, "text": "Why'd you pass the egg tart!!", "created_at": "2025-09-04T07:44:46", "owner": "k3v1nliu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18288212164283761, "text": "yum", "created_at": "2025-09-01T18:06:39", "owner": "giaannaz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987616707848010, "text": "When not in China 💀", "created_at": "2025-09-01T12:34:27", "owner": "windskyovo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064993127261293, "text": "I saw egg tartsssssssss", "created_at": "2025-08-31T23:54:27", "owner": "huliinn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107300239494119, "text": "😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-08-27T20:42:31", "owner": "crybabytinaaaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942987534991340, "text": "Where rice", "created_at": "2025-08-27T13:58:38", "owner": "sereyvattanakkruy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053001332620793, "text": "manifesting", "created_at": "2025-08-22T16:19:44", "owner": "1osin3r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923480077125015, "text": "Nah bro where’s the gigantic fish on that metal platter with the fire at the bottom", "created_at": "2025-08-22T05:34:08", "owner": "salmondonburibowl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051607502234031, "text": "Screams paradise to me😍", "created_at": "2025-08-21T08:14:55", "owner": "peace_where_areu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096972004616082, "text": "Battle royale of parents for the bill :", "created_at": "2025-08-20T21:18:14", "owner": "j.zhn011.2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041751434355621, "text": "留子落泪", "created_at": "2025-08-20T16:50:58", "owner": "_risk_averse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919109677114904, "text": "This is me when i went to china for family reunion (trust me when i say, there was easily more than 30 people)", "created_at": "2025-08-20T03:08:42", "owner": "lazer_pool", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035522855475417, "text": "Aaaaaah the dishes!!! My mum be like \"Eat more!\"", "created_at": "2025-08-17T08:51:45", "owner": "imhannahbananaaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017356799759349, "text": "Real🔥", "created_at": "2025-08-17T08:51:39", "owner": "hilary_5777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124651651461162, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-17T07:12:47", "owner": "potatoes_67911", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909719581069046, "text": "好饿啊啊啊啊啊啊", "created_at": "2025-08-16T13:23:52", "owner": "iamliyama", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944864536011671, "text": "😍😍😍❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-08-16T11:38:40", "owner": "qqqqqqlnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017354975572643, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-08-15T17:32:11", "owner": "hiukai8loop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076998659297776, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-08-15T10:03:16", "owner": "iamisaduck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869794024420239, "text": "so real 😭", "created_at": "2025-08-13T04:28:01", "owner": "1nfinit2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065728820186066, "text": "And I only like to eat one dish 😔", "created_at": "2025-08-13T02:50:23", "owner": "dora_yikyau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053881580435531, "text": "BRO everyone can relate: the joy of not having that red bean soup for dessert 😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-08-13T00:41:49", "owner": "jazzy_htoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846204361525298, "text": "Cantonese families to be more specific", "created_at": "2025-08-11T01:52:17", "owner": "gz6113phev5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872980210306896, "text": "no dont stop the food looks so good😋🤤", "created_at": "2025-08-11T01:01:13", "owner": "olivia_themuncher", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090582316680111, "text": "stop your making my mouth water", "created_at": "2025-08-11T01:00:14", "owner": "olivia_themuncher", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016694918768797, "text": "笑死我了评论区都好真实结账恨不得打起来", "created_at": "2025-08-10T20:03:55", "owner": "li.kuncan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067666951908504, "text": "Nah this is only for Cantonese", "created_at": "2025-08-10T12:44:30", "owner": "from.viet.with.luv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074719399971127, "text": "@hrqnicx._", "created_at": "2025-08-09T20:48:13", "owner": "jstjovitax", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322079071235046, "text": "So true", "created_at": "2025-08-09T19:40:48", "owner": "asaiblade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076107403946397, "text": "Fr tho", "created_at": "2025-08-08T11:22:52", "owner": "abrahamauyeung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18339790204167715, "text": "Fr", "created_at": "2025-08-07T16:54:29", "owner": "jwee_ner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18513435472008935, "text": "@ivanlu10 🔥", "created_at": "2025-08-07T14:05:22", "owner": "jacky_chen3103", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075279196992277, "text": "Forgot the abalone 🥀", "created_at": "2025-08-06T21:15:01", "owner": "nakatani_steve", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093559348650574, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-08-03T13:27:18", "owner": "leasch.__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18392180002141420, "text": "Yummy banget 😋😋", "created_at": "2025-08-02T13:49:13", "owner": "juliannalunn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041134067649763, "text": "I don’t know about the egg tarts, but everything else…yea. Where red bean soup?", "created_at": "2025-08-01T05:25:20", "owner": "vivianyip_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976357110866679, "text": "it never stops. as a white person who gets judged for not eating \"enough\" im about to throw up. but dont want to be rude", "created_at": "2025-07-27T23:39:29", "owner": "peteythechamp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18409088446129461, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-07-25T16:51:07", "owner": "iris_kanghui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973104441879216, "text": "I miss these 😢", "created_at": "2025-07-24T12:56:48", "owner": "hockooi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059749361206846, "text": "PEKING DUCK!!", "created_at": "2025-07-24T02:39:17", "owner": "yyxpumpkin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844426591527253, "text": "So real", "created_at": "2025-07-24T02:23:11", "owner": "felix.s.121", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046045496289232, "text": "@yyanxi_wu 眼不眼熟", "created_at": "2025-07-23T18:52:13", "owner": "6956julie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070133191874665, "text": "Too true, but don’t forget the bill fighting, bragging about their sons occupation, and the roasted peanuts and tea at the start", "created_at": "2025-07-22T19:16:36", "owner": "joshuacheng89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877399108366548, "text": "真的很好吃欸", "created_at": "2025-07-21T00:37:29", "owner": "llgch_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074397676786153, "text": "Im taking the pork, the noodle duck, the fried rice, and all this free right?, I want like to order the pork dish", "created_at": "2025-07-20T11:42:01", "owner": "ch.arlie.7200", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993967638813796, "text": "I dont want to be filipino anymore", "created_at": "2025-07-19T05:23:17", "owner": "sacrificialgoatparty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901499542222028, "text": "Slavic ones are the same way", "created_at": "2025-07-18T17:30:29", "owner": "wcraft0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035643440673094, "text": "So true", "created_at": "2025-07-18T15:53:09", "owner": "kirbychen2011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853668133480346, "text": "It looks so good brah", "created_at": "2025-07-17T15:58:53", "owner": "vicksstarz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955761021973032, "text": "ew man it doesn’t look good", "created_at": "2025-07-17T10:39:34", "owner": "lamyukshing1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052709417415272, "text": "Wow ❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-07-15T21:45:52", "owner": "that_little_grape", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071515469059048, "text": "I want pork belly", "created_at": "2025-07-11T05:09:11", "owner": "r0astedduck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071884330988436, "text": "Let me pay the bill waiter!\nNo! I will pay it for you all", "created_at": "2025-07-09T10:44:03", "owner": "orr0_o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975190698897520, "text": "What name is the restaurant?", "created_at": "2025-07-08T16:52:17", "owner": "siumaai_media", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129335041453254, "text": "My fave", "created_at": "2025-07-08T15:37:58", "owner": "mdizzly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18391479703187606, "text": "YAM CHA🔥", "created_at": "2025-07-07T13:05:08", "owner": "coralo78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068626363864169, "text": "Look like Cantonese dish", "created_at": "2025-07-06T20:46:58", "owner": "melody678968", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061593422270420, "text": "看起不好吃", "created_at": "2025-07-03T00:23:55", "owner": "zijinchen886", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018575390735403, "text": "给我看饿了……", "created_at": "2025-07-02T10:09:16", "owner": "blackcatwinguwu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007459505602893, "text": "So truuu", "created_at": "2025-06-30T23:52:11", "owner": "ilovepvs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056528972343798, "text": "Can I join your family reunion?", "created_at": "2025-06-30T17:24:52", "owner": "nickyshiky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172903315337641, "text": "Where is the 扇貝？", "created_at": "2025-06-30T10:19:59", "owner": "jaguar_watermelon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138252079413872, "text": "Best day of the year", "created_at": "2025-06-30T09:00:17", "owner": "donn.nielsen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058502117033162, "text": "damn that's a lot of egg tarts", "created_at": "2025-06-30T05:15:19", "owner": "thirsttrapsrus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935172676025680, "text": "Adopt me please 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-30T03:25:20", "owner": "tina.cooper1119", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075405514821951, "text": "So basically, once a week..,", "created_at": "2025-06-30T02:57:01", "owner": "mayra_isms", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075491674932678, "text": "This audio is from cocomelon. Dont ask me how I know.", "created_at": "2025-06-29T21:46:21", "owner": "knc_techno", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062576464955841, "text": "Nobody know how many foods I ate everyday 😂me: monkey 🐵 to pig 🐷", "created_at": "2025-06-29T20:45:34", "owner": "hhhhhhhhh1t00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103234930551293, "text": "Where are the jealous Taiwaneses? 😍", "created_at": "2025-06-29T04:39:17", "owner": "benbenlegato", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072303670954442, "text": "Where's the fish?!? Gotta have a steamed fish! (Dibs on the eyes and cheeks)", "created_at": "2025-06-29T04:01:50", "owner": "christopher.james.lau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075552583929719, "text": "You in thr wrong if you young and can't finish the table 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-29T00:42:21", "owner": "wickedfoodz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842440681525247, "text": "🔥❤️😍🇨🇳🤤", "created_at": "2025-06-28T22:23:41", "owner": "pandalove927", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114642088441112, "text": "When people realize they can get this food themselves without the elders", "created_at": "2025-06-28T17:33:18", "owner": "allanschow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911776750143349, "text": "I was about to say where the soup was", "created_at": "2025-06-28T08:38:49", "owner": "cyrus_chg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171606862341532, "text": "Damn true 😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-28T00:48:39", "owner": "elvisw101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044573885264151, "text": "Ye", "created_at": "2025-06-26T21:33:26", "owner": "pretzel50", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050248547427205, "text": "Remember to eat ur red bean soup for dessert", "created_at": "2025-06-26T20:20:54", "owner": "itsrosie.lin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049833776396400, "text": "... Do you also invite westerners? 🥺", "created_at": "2025-06-26T19:55:46", "owner": "dryadenblut", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894843337249703, "text": "Just reminded me of all the good stuff I wanna eat now that I'm back from UK", "created_at": "2025-06-26T19:18:28", "owner": "not_really_isaac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366245974181994, "text": "This and Boba after😂", "created_at": "2025-06-26T16:18:56", "owner": "dan_benschap", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18285101257252177, "text": "That’s literally all my favourite dish oh my god 😭😭😭💕", "created_at": "2025-06-26T12:37:35", "owner": "peter_ng214", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991070331816657, "text": "And that’s why I always get fat when I visit my family in China 🥲😅", "created_at": "2025-06-26T07:42:27", "owner": "danni20011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969879855872181, "text": "It's weekly Sunday dinner, no?", "created_at": "2025-06-26T02:52:09", "owner": "elle_la1ne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18284789611268096, "text": "Fr", "created_at": "2025-06-26T02:02:19", "owner": "gerren.12345", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981387060836574, "text": "在广东吧？", "created_at": "2025-06-26T00:55:26", "owner": "gigf233_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063768376911881, "text": "REAL", "created_at": "2025-06-26T00:12:24", "owner": "mythicalgoosegod", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056995889362759, "text": "And then get fat shamed and called dumb all at the same time while being compared to their better child and then the fight for the bill and you wanting to punch everyone there and leave", "created_at": "2025-06-25T21:50:48", "owner": "alvina_yunoa_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18087340345677709, "text": "Maybe it is Cantonese family😂", "created_at": "2025-06-25T21:31:45", "owner": "sizhe_notsize", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966350847778864, "text": "BUT!!!! Don’t forget they will ask you about your wife, house, car, salary and stuffs", "created_at": "2025-06-25T19:02:51", "owner": "nexus_qaq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049487330162032, "text": "😨😰Apples and bananas..🙂‍↕️", "created_at": "2025-06-25T18:58:14", "owner": "daisy_vander_kooi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937455799042523, "text": "So Americanized food", "created_at": "2025-06-25T18:36:37", "owner": "theamazingspiderman6160", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012075107772462, "text": "😍😍😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-06-25T17:19:13", "owner": "_u.r_g.i.r.l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089921665723226, "text": "exactly 🫠", "created_at": "2025-06-25T12:52:34", "owner": "otististis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871760068284742, "text": "Accurate", "created_at": "2025-06-25T10:55:39", "owner": "chillibunny_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048923378578424, "text": "I swear to god, they always order too much, even though I have warned them that they can't finish it", "created_at": "2025-06-25T03:47:23", "owner": "wilbert.liao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063150749150391, "text": "@liyaxieshua555 主播想回家吃酒席了😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-06-24T19:45:30", "owner": "fhanyi09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081916213838761, "text": "So real bro", "created_at": "2025-06-24T18:13:04", "owner": "lil_k2t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18507102259062606, "text": "Followed by a massive nap", "created_at": "2025-06-24T03:33:09", "owner": "miteymike177", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064227554125601, "text": "+ immense food waste because no one packs it up", "created_at": "2025-06-24T02:38:20", "owner": "lucyyaang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940656067013171, "text": "Fried soft tofu is 🔥", "created_at": "2025-06-23T04:54:01", "owner": "two_ism", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18509586682028080, "text": "1000% accuracy 🥢🥢", "created_at": "2025-06-22T18:28:57", "owner": "qinuo.w44", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18345035248093959, "text": "Why do I never get the oysters 😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-06-22T05:32:02", "owner": "aaronchan_.ty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875117344362478, "text": "Oooooooo yeah", "created_at": "2025-06-22T02:05:24", "owner": "alilili__n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044891792631000, "text": "@boshgram_ choi-nezz", "created_at": "2025-06-22T01:00:56", "owner": "mick.griddle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126599509454806, "text": "Every time I go visit my Grandparents:", "created_at": "2025-06-22T00:11:27", "owner": "e.d.e.n.tsoi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035947370372233, "text": "You’re killing me bro, Denver doesn’t have food like this", "created_at": "2025-06-21T17:05:45", "owner": "sabsmdlln", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046103147545600, "text": "@krabbypattyrick", "created_at": "2025-06-20T23:52:54", "owner": "magggiemoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083287006752075, "text": "They feed you a lot then make fun of your weight...while having a waist triple your size. Make it make sense😂", "created_at": "2025-06-20T16:05:33", "owner": "_.fishb0wl._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032977271657766, "text": "Very true, thats cantonese , we must eat the whole chicken,  n today i just had a whole chicken on my own.  Hahahaha😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-06-20T15:12:31", "owner": "ye.heidi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059290049006025, "text": "😍😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-06-20T13:38:33", "owner": "siewgaiyek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028207772688200, "text": "I already ate dinner man I can't be hungry again", "created_at": "2025-06-20T13:33:12", "owner": "noodelous", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18213892219305723, "text": "Yummy", "created_at": "2025-06-20T11:42:09", "owner": "laylafree2028", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105921097521861, "text": "@wang_mingen @katie.jin3 pls invite me to one of ur reunions pls I’m begging u", "created_at": "2025-06-20T03:02:01", "owner": "ksenia_kolomeisky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059237978248528, "text": "kings crab?", "created_at": "2025-06-20T02:28:06", "owner": "3dwqrdlanq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078271291861549, "text": "bro forgot the part where they take the leftovers home", "created_at": "2025-06-20T01:03:38", "owner": "necosanro2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036362591360891, "text": "That’s all Cantonese food dawg", "created_at": "2025-06-19T23:17:13", "owner": "frankfrank_freew", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078292324884769, "text": "Man I wish I was Chinese that food looks so good", "created_at": "2025-06-19T20:16:04", "owner": "gumercindo9150", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081913963837409, "text": "im hungry js watching this.", "created_at": "2025-06-19T18:12:12", "owner": "moldybredxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069349997064443, "text": "2 dozen egg tarts is massive back behavior", "created_at": "2025-06-19T17:44:42", "owner": "rhapsodoxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033836954416244, "text": "@yeet0479 yeeet", "created_at": "2025-06-19T13:25:01", "owner": "jrlee_11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886866718290959, "text": "Hell yeah 🔥", "created_at": "2025-06-19T07:47:53", "owner": "lost_november1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024573107704201, "text": "EAT 🔥🗣 EAT 🔥🗣 EAT 🔥🗣 EAT 🔥🗣 EAT 🔥🗣", "created_at": "2025-06-19T03:14:32", "owner": "hakurei_reimu00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18348538072081380, "text": "All my favourite dishes!!!", "created_at": "2025-06-19T02:05:49", "owner": "big_bacon_yxh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081873835633251, "text": "We all know what restaurant this is right", "created_at": "2025-06-19T00:07:06", "owner": "myr345ye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039895934640834, "text": "“Not enough! You eat more!” 🔥", "created_at": "2025-06-18T18:56:20", "owner": "timothy1701a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028952858676692, "text": "Where’s the scene when they fight for the bill", "created_at": "2025-06-18T15:26:24", "owner": "ronneyyu07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969810336872990, "text": "That looks so good 😍😍", "created_at": "2025-06-18T14:49:28", "owner": "nacbytse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854083123460866, "text": "This is me whenever I go to NY", "created_at": "2025-06-18T05:34:20", "owner": "y.haiqii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18269505214263885, "text": "😋", "created_at": "2025-06-17T23:14:38", "owner": "mtl.www", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016788227724644, "text": "Apples and banana", "created_at": "2025-06-17T20:21:59", "owner": "str8azn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072860860758631, "text": "and then fight over that $300 bill after 🥴", "created_at": "2025-06-17T18:42:35", "owner": "sorely_beholden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099991621497778, "text": "So true as a Chinese studying in Switzerland", "created_at": "2025-06-17T17:41:59", "owner": "jasonyang3817", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147944437376047, "text": "u make me missing home😭😭", "created_at": "2025-06-17T16:22:23", "owner": "lam.3874", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011901728685548, "text": "Yes please", "created_at": "2025-06-17T05:20:39", "owner": "polarcoffee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965308155778166, "text": "It’s always that same disposable table cloth too", "created_at": "2025-06-17T03:38:27", "owner": "natalillak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972484113885318, "text": "Where's the fruit plate at the end or sweet bean soup? 😂", "created_at": "2025-06-17T00:10:33", "owner": "donn1e_bb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086840089730743, "text": "True", "created_at": "2025-06-16T19:22:20", "owner": "aaronliu0731", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066933683020033, "text": "Fr", "created_at": "2025-06-16T14:24:27", "owner": "bel.lad0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860853250426248, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-06-15T22:00:11", "owner": "kelvin.7er", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060327604975060, "text": "Damn, no cta", "created_at": "2025-06-13T05:43:02", "owner": "yeezyuniversity2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859047709430548, "text": "😋", "created_at": "2025-06-11T12:26:31", "owner": "lauraa_lai", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3767881031693650350, "shortcode": "DRKM9XSCEmu", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRKM9XSCEmu/", "taken_at": "2025-11-17T13:39:15", "caption": "guess the price !! (you’ll never guess)\n.\n.\n.\n.\n#matcha #ceremonial #ceremonialmatcha #holistichealth #healthylifestyle #matcha1kg #unboxing", "owner_username": "zuzalys", "owner_id": "75277744349", "likes": 80767, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0116_DRKM9XSCEmu\\DRKM9XSCEmu_20251117_133915.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18118362028537184, "text": "i’m sorry girlll that is definitely not “ceremonial grade” matcha. with that colour, at most culinary grade lol", "created_at": "2025-11-19T07:03:57", "owner": "bubbacupbean", "likes": 9282}, {"id": 17959475111870255, "text": "Who is buying one kilo of coke, omg", "created_at": "2025-11-21T01:23:35", "owner": "samanthkath", "likes": 1181}, {"id": 18083525801071947, "text": "Oh my god where did you find that?! 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T06:05:06", "owner": "matchamaya_", "likes": 18}, {"id": 17986796543873485, "text": "Are you sure that’s ceremonial? In that bag? Hmm no", "created_at": "2025-11-20T11:37:26", "owner": "_raqvel_", "likes": 548}, {"id": 18084366920100550, "text": "$40?", "created_at": "2025-11-18T12:35:23", "owner": "steph.venture", "likes": 53}, {"id": 18103825417639629, "text": "whereeeeeee ? 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-20T13:05:52", "owner": "claire_meder", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18100757650612579, "text": "and i buy 1kg of traditional rice", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:24:35", "owner": "wxrssso", "likes": 108}, {"id": 18035602511512114, "text": "Let people be happy with their matcha. Everybody has different taste buds", "created_at": "2025-11-20T03:58:19", "owner": "iamclairesndz", "likes": 1219}, {"id": 18175795597366400, "text": "whoever sold you that must be playing a prank on you. matcha should be stored in opaque containers. matcha is VERY sensitive and oxidizes quickly just from exposure to sunlight", "created_at": "2025-11-21T02:24:38", "owner": "vivot.craftcafe", "likes": 2665}, {"id": 18082314017090098, "text": "From the colour I can tell it’s not really good", "created_at": "2025-11-19T17:21:36", "owner": "y3_a_3", "likes": 364}, {"id": 18084276977487078, "text": "Hey girl! Don’t know if someone’s said this already but do not keep it in that clear bag. The colour is going to further oxidize and the matcha will further degrade because sun is coming through the clear bag. There’s a reason why reputable brands all sell in aluminum bags that do not let sunlight through!", "created_at": "2025-11-21T17:02:42", "owner": "veggiekins", "likes": 753}, {"id": 18085636138976389, "text": "How will you finish that before it oxidizes 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-20T16:51:59", "owner": "mandy_dawnn", "likes": 67}, {"id": 18074500174998408, "text": "but the quality degrades over time 😢 could be worth it if you have multiple drinks per day, bake with matcha, etc.", "created_at": "2025-11-19T19:42:46", "owner": "earthtokristy", "likes": 24}, {"id": 18065051915166740, "text": "buy the coke instead", "created_at": "2025-12-02T07:43:36", "owner": "rudrakash_93", "likes": 33}, {"id": 17968664141825282, "text": "Idk who told me “ceremonial grade” isn’t a thing but someone did 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-20T08:13:29", "owner": "lania_young", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18084066680086316, "text": "Girl that matcha color is bad", "created_at": "2025-11-20T03:28:29", "owner": "alvinaapastry", "likes": 80}, {"id": 18066634454117144, "text": "Need that 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-20T11:09:10", "owner": "jazzfoodtravelshop", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18119612698477279, "text": "i buy both", "created_at": "2025-11-20T17:42:48", "owner": "sshahzsultan", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18074126207462866, "text": "Ceremonial matcha isn't even a real thing 😭😭 just a name", "created_at": "2025-11-20T17:47:24", "owner": "noodlesouppppppppp", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18093240091885833, "text": "As a matcha fiend if someone gave me this i’d ask for coke instead", "created_at": "2025-11-20T17:08:12", "owner": "huhrei", "likes": 12}, {"id": 17921095698057098, "text": "I don’t think anyone has the money for 1kg of ❄️ love", "created_at": "2025-11-20T18:42:03", "owner": "decimate404", "likes": 32}, {"id": 18551205187017743, "text": "Who cares if it’s ceremonial or not, if it tastes good it’s good 🙂‍↕️ and if you drink like 7 matchas a day I don’t see the reason why not", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:24:11", "owner": "koldbrew.png", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18084685187083539, "text": "@lilyisle", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:50:58", "owner": "kevvvyk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18113168233600758, "text": "real matcha lovers know you should never store it in a clear container", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:08:31", "owner": "d55nny", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18211282360311342, "text": "Obviously not a real ceremonial matcha haha 🤣 Looks like green tea powder more than matcha", "created_at": "2025-11-20T20:05:27", "owner": "iamjeonda", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18100571260692332, "text": "Diva nobody buying 1 kilo of coke?! Are u crazy?????", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:21:27", "owner": "fr.rvr0923", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18081164693160852, "text": "@luca_janosch  Wir 🤝", "created_at": "2025-11-30T13:09:13", "owner": "jansonnenb_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18028217564754094, "text": "Buy both and mix em together", "created_at": "2025-11-21T12:33:07", "owner": "eliosauruss", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17948013527932241, "text": "@creepkss", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:15:12", "owner": "rodrigodur87", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098099056772992, "text": "Why", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:23:10", "owner": "lsialerf", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17874552594445428, "text": "Hi everyone! ✨I’m a passionate Pilates instructor (and psychology student) dedicated to holistic wellness. Follow me for tips, routines, and inspiration to become a healthier, stronger version of yourself. Feel free to subscribe and join the journey! 🫶🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-20T01:49:51", "owner": "zuzalys", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18123247378517513, "text": "@jemifying you have to write it like this! Hope it helps @ang_e.e @sleeepybunniee", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:44:01", "owner": "asiandumbledore", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18066629051433448, "text": "oh to be rich to afford 1kg of coke", "created_at": "2025-11-20T15:01:22", "owner": "m.breznova", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17900140071181619, "text": "Lowk same price these days😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:44:25", "owner": "simplyy.yasmin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072062678032278, "text": "No one buy 1k of c0ke just like that.😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T16:27:07", "owner": "sara_kadosh5", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098324476868922, "text": "I'd rather buy coca cola", "created_at": "2025-12-07T07:29:46", "owner": "spami_xxhoi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941039830094012, "text": "$250", "created_at": "2025-11-23T19:32:59", "owner": "babybobatj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902408023162905, "text": "Ceremonial 😂 I've a bridge to sell you.", "created_at": "2025-11-23T15:19:47", "owner": "biscuit_base", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17924947539039747, "text": "okay but can you share the steps on afyer you click on the link😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-20T02:29:23", "owner": "bxnhmi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17944274876948303, "text": "@miaadeez", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:05:49", "owner": "autumsmoon", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17876281602353068, "text": "@niharikadatt_", "created_at": "2025-11-23T21:09:42", "owner": "sadhikawahi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134427715477540, "text": "@lianajulia tú", "created_at": "2025-11-23T00:51:15", "owner": "jordanoroger", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18349410583204927, "text": "@nratlh._", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:38:04", "owner": "mochaluvswave_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062772275530815, "text": "looks like some costco matcha", "created_at": "2025-11-20T17:41:26", "owner": "joowahn", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18326641183242310, "text": "You’re rich rich", "created_at": "2025-11-19T21:02:59", "owner": "ugcanamorais", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18028716470559428, "text": "Just to ruin it with a metal spoon 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T19:13:06", "owner": "_natnivlek_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083929448476495, "text": "I wish I could", "created_at": "2025-11-20T08:09:03", "owner": "lironcess", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18416901460141826, "text": "Hell yeah", "created_at": "2025-11-21T04:48:34", "owner": "kaylagudsell", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18034346612719096, "text": "Guys…it wasnt matcha…😓😓", "created_at": "2025-11-19T21:55:58", "owner": "mf47997", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17843261100615288, "text": "Almost same price btw", "created_at": "2025-11-21T09:52:11", "owner": "wi_.wi_wi_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18183275899356428, "text": "Yeah, no", "created_at": "2025-11-20T19:13:21", "owner": "moesdeph", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925723399161084, "text": "Fortune🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-19T15:36:55", "owner": "asy.sayk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071469071057005, "text": "If that was an actual ceremonial grade match, that would go for hundreds if not a thousand of dollars", "created_at": "2025-11-20T09:31:26", "owner": "yanchenkotaras", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18108812107539025, "text": "@bhak_tea \"", "created_at": "2025-11-20T12:13:11", "owner": "harshavardhan_tambe", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18097650157745490, "text": "Congratulations for your anemia", "created_at": "2025-11-20T11:33:51", "owner": "linathesparkle", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077139416233597, "text": "140$", "created_at": "2025-11-20T18:20:46", "owner": "xkvbra", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17968868597982493, "text": "Moving 2.2s", "created_at": "2025-11-20T18:27:52", "owner": "antman.iv", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18243650827293332, "text": "dream", "created_at": "2025-11-20T13:55:17", "owner": "inesabdrn", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17859273573544192, "text": "Who is your dealer ?", "created_at": "2025-11-20T19:06:18", "owner": "isabellaonthebeach", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088555159757359, "text": "@izabelahberrones", "created_at": "2025-11-20T18:36:39", "owner": "paattycx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18103760965654923, "text": "This so u @shimmienope", "created_at": "2025-11-20T15:06:09", "owner": "i_zaidghaffar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095253667878110, "text": "Hahaha du @ehlengast", "created_at": "2025-11-20T12:47:38", "owner": "le.snoor", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18032038739722846, "text": "Probably costs more than the coke", "created_at": "2025-11-19T22:25:09", "owner": "arayahope111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027958067563653, "text": "i need this asap!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-19T17:11:16", "owner": "fayesaddict", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17880998136421141, "text": "@prarthanaahuja", "created_at": "2025-11-19T13:19:43", "owner": "aksheethaaa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17904330693312699, "text": "Probably more expensive than coke lmao", "created_at": "2025-12-12T19:51:27", "owner": "pink_bon_bon_spam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981042030781622, "text": "And somehow this is more expensive than coke too", "created_at": "2025-12-12T12:52:52", "owner": "blueberry._matchaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089337409777229, "text": "Do not show this girl kratom", "created_at": "2025-12-11T17:44:41", "owner": "dr.shrimp.purtorico", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079603472186678, "text": "~$1000?", "created_at": "2025-12-11T10:24:18", "owner": "nayan029260", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903720763302374, "text": "Girl i think u got scam", "created_at": "2025-12-11T07:46:10", "owner": "sigadisbobo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107105068565985, "text": "Yeah, no one’s buying 1kg of coke but 1g it’s better than matcha", "created_at": "2025-12-10T23:03:46", "owner": "banirakiti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075457697349711, "text": "Ceremonial doesn't exist in Japan. Only premium. Go for premium. You got scammed then..", "created_at": "2025-12-10T13:50:32", "owner": "l0uizza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930115729018055, "text": "That's shrimp shit. Real matcha is found almost nowhere and 1 Kg?hell no", "created_at": "2025-12-09T21:35:58", "owner": "omerglz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060578711267359, "text": "Where ?", "created_at": "2025-12-09T07:28:54", "owner": "gafcomics", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973939944796726, "text": "Lol", "created_at": "2025-12-09T03:12:36", "owner": "trinandherpets", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18429387835129457, "text": "you got scammed", "created_at": "2025-12-08T15:36:35", "owner": "el4ine20_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546766807029770, "text": "It’s not about the colour it’s just powder milk mixed relax guys … nothing wrong just softer taste", "created_at": "2025-12-08T11:12:59", "owner": "sevofficiaal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993839640890118, "text": "ceremonial…Impossible", "created_at": "2025-12-08T10:09:58", "owner": "_itsjbreezy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148590781434088, "text": "Girl it’s not that deep. It’s just green tea powder", "created_at": "2025-12-08T01:07:14", "owner": "winxtera", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857362621566272, "text": "charli buys both", "created_at": "2025-12-08T00:44:18", "owner": "starvingvultures", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152505061423021, "text": "It's just dyed coke in a way.. (if mixed with milk n sugar..😍)", "created_at": "2025-12-07T22:27:06", "owner": "flunt01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902822935326657, "text": "sorry i like both actually!", "created_at": "2025-12-07T19:28:40", "owner": "laurenlemon333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917735278229093, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T15:38:43", "owner": "angelixakitchen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898519150345227, "text": "YES PLEASE", "created_at": "2025-12-07T03:49:35", "owner": "justchristen__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18181719367360016, "text": "Over/under you hated it at first until it started trending.", "created_at": "2025-12-07T03:26:04", "owner": "mikaelroque", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098861044836544, "text": "Hate to break it to you, but 1kg of matcha is supposed to come im aluminum packaging. Should cost ya around $275-400", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:44:50", "owner": "jack.wentworth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089005840787868, "text": "looks lowkey oxidized, i put mine in the fridge to avoid that :)", "created_at": "2025-12-07T00:30:06", "owner": "mothkiid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028445153770824, "text": "Matcha in a ziploc bag is crazy", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:45:07", "owner": "loveyou_alatte", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106579561630695, "text": "Matcha is supposed to be done in the first month, buying more than 100g isn’t good it should be 50g per month.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:02:43", "owner": "donsoltani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972580287971132, "text": "Hi @irvhvrun", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:51:12", "owner": "farahidayu__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083087426512855, "text": "I bought 1 kg coffee 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:56:29", "owner": "olive_greeeeeeen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084183083023094, "text": "matchaholic😭😭i can't 😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T00:41:14", "owner": "xinxkn__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091607866935557, "text": "Lmaooo looks so fake 😢", "created_at": "2025-12-06T00:15:59", "owner": "your_gay_husband", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935457193104292, "text": "\"i bought 1kg of shit that's gonna make me infertile for life\"", "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:32", "owner": "_juliee.nst_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058727078640710, "text": "okay first of all: no one is buying 1kg of ❄️", "created_at": "2025-12-05T18:15:43", "owner": "g0r3_wh0r3_444", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087133504821018, "text": "Yall hating, where you get it from sis?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T14:57:44", "owner": "myiana.bu18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18348530380201208, "text": "A kg of coke is like 30-40grand. That bag is probably 50 bucks", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:28:50", "owner": "jesseclaytonjames", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868196863484599, "text": "For the value of $40 you're not even buying Matcha but green tea powder.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:39:51", "owner": "priscizinha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919935949400902, "text": "we support this addiction", "created_at": "2025-12-03T17:05:10", "owner": "lifesbetterwithyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855758266526689, "text": "All that just to place a metal spoon inside ;p", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:07:42", "owner": "zammy.wav", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103803886676228, "text": "coke is just strong matcha", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:08:48", "owner": "mackenzie2696", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048396026422662, "text": "Looks like a party 🔥💚", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:20:13", "owner": "_oshi_land", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082220777125995, "text": "But can u do a bump with matcha? Didnt think so", "created_at": "2025-12-01T11:27:31", "owner": "its.craigycrack", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18377593498151669, "text": "That’s the right way to go 🫠🤤", "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:48:59", "owner": "paulajimenezcreator", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304813213269493, "text": "somos @felipeavt", "created_at": "2025-12-01T06:09:43", "owner": "kleberomero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18214992655309330, "text": "Same price", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:30:13", "owner": "adasroszkowski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857792350560326, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:50:59", "owner": "soye.b9898", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922102951192732, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:36:16", "owner": "_piscesbbg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973795131955549, "text": "@alexairypr, @grimlin.nabi  you wish that was you, huh?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:13:14", "owner": "valucianos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105716842711466, "text": "This is my vibe hahahaha", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:33:59", "owner": "hausofnore", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337211905239306, "text": "Who ever buys a kg of coke y quite fucking ritch", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:33:49", "owner": "davidf_fer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086514685966304, "text": "who the fuck is buying 1kg of coke", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:56:02", "owner": "soapie_02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058934741285945, "text": "I attract this energy", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:47:48", "owner": "skelemusic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543130291061857, "text": "😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:32:43", "owner": "monnnmena", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086381588068890, "text": "$70k vs $40", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:49:41", "owner": "expressfee3392", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050208887386893, "text": "Free?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:35:00", "owner": "kidnappingwhenimfaded", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062624672550399, "text": "but can you snort it ? Askin for a friend", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:29:17", "owner": "lucie_dunikova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066602456134716, "text": "Try kratom", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:39:35", "owner": "sippinonprescription", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011549333804661, "text": "Use gulaal bole hai laadli", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:25:22", "owner": "aark.quake", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067776839107030, "text": "It last you the whole month or have you finished it already?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:18:30", "owner": "smolodyssues", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949916472918757, "text": "She's gonna be bruiiiiiised", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:43:47", "owner": "daniel.v.diaz.69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902228368320675, "text": "do you carry that shit with you at all times ?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:43:34", "owner": "hammzuni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962079135862014, "text": "Ceremonial grade is just a scam to charge more anyway", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:49:36", "owner": "st.clairemily", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18379430323147506, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:38:26", "owner": "oceanbean.coffee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18423189022118645, "text": "Its fake", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:23:01", "owner": "jewusmaximus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352593574162191, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:24:17", "owner": "janani_chandrasegaran", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075943598248071, "text": "Just age yourself theory", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:38:27", "owner": "gnosticocculare", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120925570534679, "text": "gotta buy it in bulk", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:40:45", "owner": "minhkhueeeee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979132965937811, "text": "I only buy 1 gram of coke, I’m not rich", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:25:09", "owner": "honestly_jadee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040990979500997, "text": "there is no such thing as ceremonial grade matcha. also the color of your matcha looks like shit. also nobody buys a kilo of cöke.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:23:05", "owner": "sad_lobster", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083356300861511, "text": "I know!!!🥰", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:12:17", "owner": "sherwin_hora", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894062122221219, "text": "u got scammed", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:22:36", "owner": "eddalarudottir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087086423483356, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:22:18", "owner": "mp4_jj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991850550894888, "text": "I would separate it into airtight containers or even vacuum sealable to slow down oxidation. While the amount is amazing by the time you get half way it’s gonna be hecka oxidized and the flavor will change 🥲 Sometimes you can get bulk but it’s multiple bags that are sealed and will stay fresh until opened", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:44:23", "owner": "_youandmecoffee_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116865058495634, "text": "Well i buy a kilogram of coke", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:11:32", "owner": "g3vix3ty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127242544501224, "text": "Yesss👏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:52:10", "owner": "menthaylimon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096722683798425, "text": "Omg thats a lot lol", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:11:56", "owner": "createdbybrycee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065819972138221, "text": "Technically if i color coke green and label it as matcha yall think the Interpol is gonna notice?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:08:26", "owner": "serena_.thd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888344311263580, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:09:12", "owner": "phakawan_mgn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065058557402061, "text": "Well well well", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:54:40", "owner": "redktsune", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902318296321764, "text": "I‘m buying 10kg of ground beef", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:43:31", "owner": "danieta97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847072495610695, "text": "I don’t give ahctam about ts video", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:31:47", "owner": "raidhillon_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158675197396377, "text": "i bet you dont even like it", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:31:16", "owner": "epicdoritopug222", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082466815891511, "text": "Who’s your dealer woman ?!!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T13:42:30", "owner": "_nirups__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068588732570929, "text": "That defs ain’t ceremonial grade matcha. They would never sell it in a clear bag", "created_at": "2025-11-26T13:32:03", "owner": "cllaudsbaby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862895203534475, "text": "@fhibli fav.mo 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:22:25", "owner": "slvj_rm15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083682283858754, "text": "a kg of bag in this economy", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:28:43", "owner": "rakai.rangi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886136383401589, "text": "Link please", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:29:51", "owner": "csalderete3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908275948269453, "text": "@nmuds_", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:51:01", "owner": "kevvvyk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18375298288152665, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:48:46", "owner": "in_ganja_we_trust_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047364266454312, "text": "I need both", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:12:38", "owner": "spentaarma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069674300078742, "text": "600", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:04:08", "owner": "safarisdiary", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18444429946099405, "text": "Seems yellowish", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:01:29", "owner": "angelberry.96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952962271030235, "text": "Matcha addict 🍵💚", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:52:03", "owner": "itzel_.montero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18292743934302575, "text": "good for you", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:58:37", "owner": "rodrrriiigo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844826323606509, "text": "The color tells me its fake 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:38:39", "owner": "juzexa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102264835681071, "text": "girl that’s someone’s ashes", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:23:44", "owner": "gospel.of.rage", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18440896390100731, "text": "😄🙌🏼💚", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:42:22", "owner": "funcmatcha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069577484606550, "text": "If Low iron girls are in chat don’t drink much matcha it will harm u more than good.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:15:02", "owner": "estherr.yan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932656650999548, "text": "Ceremonial grade is a tourist scam", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:08:45", "owner": "nick.cyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046975436462438, "text": "Me", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:10:21", "owner": "ambrochiazoi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929819956138501, "text": "shit smell like stinky fish shits nasty af", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:58:51", "owner": "monkoy_25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853703530579509, "text": "Careful with your iron girl! Also enjoy", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:56:47", "owner": "maggie.hwrs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18198061573324164, "text": "You got scammed:(", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:22:37", "owner": "estecamus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066642428118569, "text": "I choose coke", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:27:01", "owner": "paschkasigaret", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971201709816611, "text": "no way ts ceremonial grade lmao", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:20:33", "owner": "chickenkoolaid_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052880276659032, "text": "totom", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:23:24", "owner": "rikiikindafunny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954457564031873, "text": "Ya know unless you consume those matcha in 2-3 months tops it’s not gon be good no more?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T04:24:38", "owner": "prideandprosciutto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872276455461462, "text": "Keep it in a metal and airtight canister to maintain freshness it will oxidize faster and then yellow if not", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:58:23", "owner": "pancit.cayton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094029238872479, "text": "Important Matcha tip: store it in a dark place + a UV-protection bag to prevent oxidation. Maximum freshness is key 🍵", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:50:51", "owner": "mariabelenveloz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892962508365721, "text": "She’s rich rich guys", "created_at": "2025-11-25T00:42:27", "owner": "riptide.rhi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320075464171070, "text": "1kg matcha and 1 kg Coke haven‘t the same value", "created_at": "2025-11-25T00:09:13", "owner": "juri.aus.berl1n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075833951334758, "text": "The dream", "created_at": "2025-11-24T22:29:38", "owner": "sofi_camarena14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076089440214682, "text": "Banker", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:34:40", "owner": "ummmtang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081680900277874, "text": "WHERE HOW", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:13:31", "owner": "marisa2acc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048567899406007, "text": "Yeah, it’s the same price", "created_at": "2025-11-24T17:41:24", "owner": "daniela_svrc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088040584945118, "text": "rather buy a kg of ❄️", "created_at": "2025-11-24T17:13:14", "owner": "alexhannides", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094692082677254, "text": "Technically 1kg of coke is a lot of coke 😅", "created_at": "2025-11-24T16:53:26", "owner": "rzomarco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125684311507485, "text": "No one buys a whole fucking kilogram", "created_at": "2025-11-24T16:30:43", "owner": "ceasarsidari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923971924191142, "text": "Ah so this is why there's a shortage lol", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:22:56", "owner": "maryhasaballa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18493481650073769, "text": "Ceremonial grade is a fake grade created by a Canadian to make it sound more premium", "created_at": "2025-11-24T09:22:39", "owner": "metrogrooming_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18534018235051213, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T08:24:36", "owner": "theartofsloliving", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320457583171754, "text": "u know matcha goes bad really fast?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:47:26", "owner": "shiikee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183803005349042, "text": "Powdered grass 😌", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:34:09", "owner": "billy.03_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18524479981064797, "text": "Who’s your supplier?👀", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:05:19", "owner": "jeanpaul.ortega", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112343458606527, "text": "tf is this comparison", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:04:34", "owner": "prodricee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120294460531715, "text": "80 dlls", "created_at": "2025-11-23T23:15:15", "owner": "alee.smiles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863829682522234, "text": "Girrlll put that in a sun proof container fasttt 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:01:32", "owner": "evalindz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087962317777962, "text": "1 kg of coke?! right….", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:49:09", "owner": "gabbi.rose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144804739439311, "text": "Probably cost the same", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:27:12", "owner": "ron_arbiv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080931326515586, "text": "Both is good", "created_at": "2025-11-23T19:28:51", "owner": "brshwita", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18409582609190611, "text": "I don't know which one tastes worse", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:27:27", "owner": "azalajock", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026739953772028, "text": "Matcha is disgusting and you guys are all sheep for falling into the matcha trend", "created_at": "2025-11-23T14:28:13", "owner": "liam.umpelby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128579095497922, "text": "Ceremonial matcha in a transparent bag and of that colour? Probably not. At least put it into some opaque box ffs", "created_at": "2025-11-23T14:05:13", "owner": "veronika.silinger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915977119238269, "text": "that shade of green… nooo 😫", "created_at": "2025-11-23T11:55:50", "owner": "foxybunfits", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18326011294243893, "text": "I buy 1kg of kratom. Looks the same tastes just as bad but at least it gets me flying.", "created_at": "2025-11-23T11:12:40", "owner": "adam.novosad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932607808104834, "text": "Unless you're a shop, good luck going trough it without oxidising. (Im not sure freezing would help for this amount?)", "created_at": "2025-11-23T10:05:22", "owner": "martinsonzuls", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078262946241809, "text": "I prefer the coke one", "created_at": "2025-11-23T07:16:37", "owner": "r111ckyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090650920906610, "text": "There is no any ‘ceremonial’ matcha will pack like this…", "created_at": "2025-11-23T07:02:40", "owner": "lmfaiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991785147893421, "text": "yeah we all buy kilos of coke 😁", "created_at": "2025-11-23T06:51:01", "owner": "greypaisley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921606190056314, "text": "I’m thinking how to get pass the TSA", "created_at": "2025-11-23T05:17:02", "owner": "oscarnvmm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867981307475229, "text": "why not both?", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:54:41", "owner": "harriet_peachey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842654182624526, "text": "Ah yes, for what's more culturally israeli than canggu and matcha", "created_at": "2025-11-23T02:36:43", "owner": "relicoftrust", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050201786381149, "text": "It’s not gonna stay fresh though", "created_at": "2025-11-23T01:05:43", "owner": "hirotino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888058687262175, "text": "In a see through plastic bag?", "created_at": "2025-11-23T00:38:44", "owner": "helenamariafein", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886402402394453, "text": "no one buys 1kg of coke", "created_at": "2025-11-23T00:33:20", "owner": "mellyssa.xz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924801181178513, "text": "i thought you weren't supposed to touch it with metal because it does something to the matcha?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T23:21:10", "owner": "rottingxflesh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090720349923300, "text": "Yall see the side effects  of too much matcha ? 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-22T20:53:07", "owner": "la.petite.shay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096215962669769, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:12:28", "owner": "thatsoanna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090611815934348, "text": "Most Performative", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:36:47", "owner": "vaanwhisky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063119762539148, "text": "And somehow the 1kg of matcha is still 10 times more expensive than coke", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:47:09", "owner": "josefamorenod", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18166285939382066, "text": "you have to be facking rich to buy one kg of cokein", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:18:14", "owner": "brmscky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095890840877339, "text": "Some people know how to take care of their “ceremonial matcha” some people don’t, they just like to stand out “ceremonial matcha” as if that was a thing. Pobres criaturas.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:06:13", "owner": "chantru77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120425113546645, "text": "m💸mm💸💵mat💸tchaaaa💵💵💸💸💸", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:34:48", "owner": "dummb.puppy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086357785969971, "text": "There’s really not much difference tbh", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:02:43", "owner": "guttaballz___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113283550584493, "text": "@hp_log", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:04:16", "owner": "v____ze", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064178789154274, "text": "If it's from bali probably 10/20usd", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:50:03", "owner": "healingmy.soul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18412919752187038, "text": "@wafaellaaa ‼️‼️‼️‼️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:26:06", "owner": "childish.gambibo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859504057549313, "text": "“Ceremonial grade” is just an American marketing term, means nothing.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:18:28", "owner": "mathew_zon0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058641281262072, "text": "Cokes sold in liters???", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:02:48", "owner": "abubakrsalie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927480073157064, "text": "And about the same price these days 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:31:00", "owner": "koseik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120234793538541, "text": "the scale never lies, i’m 2.2 incentivized", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:24:44", "owner": "negron.elijah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18535532428063958, "text": "Hope you didn’t pay ceremonial pricing cos that ain’t it.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:49:09", "owner": "walkingpalimpsest", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102511189674649, "text": "1000$ +", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:41:07", "owner": "selespictures", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331599955210489, "text": "omg these people are like coming at you 😂 enjoy your giant bag of matcha girl!!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:00:53", "owner": "kaelinrmagee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183796843346950, "text": "1kg green kool aid", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:58:46", "owner": "good_on_ya_sonya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073802072005326, "text": "the term ceremonial grade was invented by a white man for marketing purposes hahahaha", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:15:55", "owner": "sriracheu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071735993363052, "text": "Looks like mid ceremonial matcha! High quality matcha is needed", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:26:42", "owner": "jacquigallenero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081611572894014, "text": "Why was I waiting to see if she was gonna go a matcha challenge or snort it 🤣 my brain", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:23:06", "owner": "thecarnivalvixen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084499142287535, "text": "Natural fluoride unfortunately", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:14:55", "owner": "thecosmicdoggo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083806523274149, "text": "No encuentro fallas en su lógica", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:48:40", "owner": "mariana.gomezd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092884489908344, "text": "Clear(maximum sun exposure) bag for matcha is crazy", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:46:53", "owner": "superseokers", "likes": 61}, {"id": 17929625058012452, "text": "No one buy 1kg of c0ke", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:06:22", "owner": "kamylle_pz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083481389082193, "text": "Ceremonial would never come in a bag with a shitty seal like this nor would you be able to order in this size unless you have a connection", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:17:04", "owner": "its_urboi_chris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18437033545103164, "text": "costco matcha is the best in the world", "created_at": "2025-11-21T23:59:44", "owner": "erick_turbski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18512883964071607, "text": "It’s giving✨", "created_at": "2025-11-21T23:48:29", "owner": "jellycat.matcha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18287898220263852, "text": "Price is close enough 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-21T23:28:23", "owner": "gracetrombly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050713304360846, "text": "🫤", "created_at": "2025-11-21T22:59:30", "owner": "tetiiibikunle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932184621999023, "text": "coke would probably be a lot cheaper", "created_at": "2025-11-21T22:20:31", "owner": "pickled_alien", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086693104794751, "text": "Spare some please 🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-21T20:58:47", "owner": "hi.skully", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075094388224832, "text": "\"ooh I'm so different\" type shi", "created_at": "2025-11-21T20:18:11", "owner": "cr4zy_maria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854435476573073, "text": "Literally nobody’s buying 1kg of coke", "created_at": "2025-11-21T19:55:23", "owner": "chainsawbunni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029913197728549, "text": "Girl please put it in a light-tight bag/container/jar with an airtight seal. When matcha powder is exposed to air, moisture or light, it oxidizes quickly", "created_at": "2025-11-21T19:26:17", "owner": "the.irinab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016503437618566, "text": "Ur baddddd", "created_at": "2025-11-21T19:01:49", "owner": "sheisjayla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067710548421867, "text": "Where can i even get this much asking for me 👏😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T18:57:15", "owner": "seasonoftay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105596032722971, "text": "Where can i buy this from!", "created_at": "2025-11-21T18:57:07", "owner": "sa.brie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113821606575088, "text": "Pretty much same price 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T17:30:41", "owner": "ynnenu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056382611305603, "text": "1000", "created_at": "2025-11-21T17:16:55", "owner": "_emisqkaa__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848216347601210, "text": "“Ceremonial grade” was made up by westerners to make matcha more marketable btw! There’s good matcha from brands that care and shitty matcha from those that don’t, that’s about it guys", "created_at": "2025-11-21T17:00:25", "owner": "mad.ilynr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986394639872959, "text": "same ting", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:33:25", "owner": "mmlinq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18178504537318826, "text": "Coke is better", "created_at": "2025-11-21T14:24:32", "owner": "cockroach_hu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154436323405918, "text": "1000€", "created_at": "2025-11-21T14:08:09", "owner": "diane_mfrdi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861827458536625, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-21T13:58:46", "owner": "tuff_k__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087655928509170, "text": "Now record you eating it raw", "created_at": "2025-11-21T13:28:20", "owner": "voquanghuy2711", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989551677739478, "text": "i buy 1kg creatine", "created_at": "2025-11-21T12:54:00", "owner": "sqlxp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102428623591280, "text": "ceremonial flour maybe", "created_at": "2025-11-21T12:39:26", "owner": "j4ke.808", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113947456510016, "text": "Don’t store your matcha like that🫣😩😩", "created_at": "2025-11-21T11:48:06", "owner": "glowwup.guru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063942578436155, "text": "I buy both of them", "created_at": "2025-11-21T11:44:43", "owner": "its_nikolu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18179756317360727, "text": "Bro that colour is not it", "created_at": "2025-11-21T11:37:32", "owner": "6ekx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117714571554060, "text": "i buy both", "created_at": "2025-11-21T11:16:32", "owner": "urfavouritekanack", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979544556923672, "text": "Ceremonial grade lol. Japanese are rolling.", "created_at": "2025-11-21T10:18:32", "owner": "sallypello", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124280671460645, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-21T08:32:49", "owner": "izuna_aaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040837688496409, "text": "that doesnt look ceremonial…", "created_at": "2025-11-21T06:29:14", "owner": "elvniv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967238493833906, "text": "I’d go through this criminally quick", "created_at": "2025-11-21T06:11:56", "owner": "pinchofparsley_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126728341504788, "text": "Who tf can afford 1kg of coke", "created_at": "2025-11-21T04:52:15", "owner": "alistaircsmith", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931115632114531, "text": "Hey! My friend and I are a top 10 supplier of matcha in the United States. We ship internationally. We got you! Hmu!", "created_at": "2025-11-21T04:23:52", "owner": "landoncibulka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18245555206290537, "text": "Who's buying 1 kg coke ? 🫣🤧", "created_at": "2025-11-21T02:44:12", "owner": "nakulaggarwal007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107260984717913, "text": "In this economy nobody is buying 1kg of c0ke darl", "created_at": "2025-11-21T02:08:21", "owner": "jade.rachel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863711041516775, "text": "Shi that took a year  to make gonna be gone in 2 months", "created_at": "2025-11-21T01:55:03", "owner": "sewerat59", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086679712987246, "text": "😂😂😂😂right", "created_at": "2025-11-21T01:36:31", "owner": "lafaille.legacy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038469161706241, "text": "سدر هذا", "created_at": "2025-11-21T00:30:20", "owner": "oiamnai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978747645931989, "text": "Not bright green enough to be ceremonial grade babes…", "created_at": "2025-11-20T23:04:07", "owner": "airamor_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097934176697296, "text": "@sophia.henwood", "created_at": "2025-11-20T22:31:26", "owner": "olivia_irvin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100588720736381, "text": "My friend loves both @ntashachung", "created_at": "2025-11-20T21:12:44", "owner": "lorenzaamarita", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066093533621047, "text": "queen behaviour ✨👑🌿🧚", "created_at": "2025-11-20T20:26:25", "owner": "holisticallyamelia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080150780171667, "text": "Where did you buy ?", "created_at": "2025-11-20T20:15:40", "owner": "pumatress_rai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048078632416649, "text": "How much the price?", "created_at": "2025-11-20T18:29:37", "owner": "nicolesinaga89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027825245751727, "text": "Good Matcha never comes in plastic bags,\nYou bought chinese quality matcha trying to sell for japanese 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T18:28:32", "owner": "twaantoch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967682847986738, "text": "Ceremonial is usually a few shades darker lol, she got scammed 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-20T17:05:40", "owner": "douyinus", "likes": 51}, {"id": 18099669949744952, "text": "that color", "created_at": "2025-11-20T16:24:29", "owner": "svamariaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100374172690393, "text": "Doesn’t it oxidize after you open the bag? It’s best used one month after opening. That’s why it’s usually sold in small batches unless you’re a company that goes through a lot of matcha quickly.", "created_at": "2025-11-20T15:45:11", "owner": "tony.fromearth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064254662413047, "text": "cada quién con sus vicios🙌🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-20T15:38:32", "owner": "midnighttchords", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970943091812374, "text": "That’s not ceremonial🙂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T12:28:16", "owner": "itsrobeen1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302479315270560, "text": "This is flour with sugar and green colouring. $3 for this. Dont quote ceremonial when only you do not know what ceremonial grade is", "created_at": "2025-11-20T10:29:47", "owner": "herblackcat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918412417209579, "text": "Sometimes when you dunno what ceremonial grade is  its best not to flaunt and be come a joke", "created_at": "2025-11-20T10:28:30", "owner": "herblackcat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127629586501895, "text": "The same as 1 kg c0ke :,D", "created_at": "2025-11-20T10:27:06", "owner": "itsbabynath", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925577107034647, "text": "@mannattpvttt", "created_at": "2025-11-20T09:35:30", "owner": "simrannn10_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088240640304632, "text": "lol same", "created_at": "2025-11-20T06:47:21", "owner": "loucelfaithcandamo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911481637252849, "text": "doesnt look good. sorry but this is not a ceremonial grade matcha. If it is bulk, it should be packed on alumunum bag", "created_at": "2025-11-20T06:20:41", "owner": "le.viviana_hb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867777412477452, "text": "link", "created_at": "2025-11-20T03:08:58", "owner": "carlotaalonsof", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062208635188822, "text": "ceremonial is a buzz word and marketing scam", "created_at": "2025-11-19T18:43:28", "owner": "faithhmariee__", "likes": 5464}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["matcha", "ceremonial", "ceremonialmatcha", "holistichealth", "healthylifestyle", "matcha1kg", "unboxing"]},
{"media_id": 3759102308249068999, "shortcode": "DQrA6H9iWXH", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DQrA6H9iWXH/", "taken_at": "2025-11-05T10:52:34", "caption": "All you have to do is add water and boil! Why are you guys paying so much for instant hotpot with all those dehydrated and preserved vegetables?! Make this instead and keep it in your freezer for rainy days. 😍🍲\n\nMiso Soup Base: \n1 tbsp dashi soup stock (or chicken stock)\n2 tbsp Miso\n1 tbsp Soy sauce\n1 tbsp sake or Mirin \n1 tbsp brown sugar", "owner_username": "xoy", "owner_id": "1391424", "likes": 76869, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0117_DQrA6H9iWXH\\DQrA6H9iWXH_20251105_105234.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17894287326345683, "text": "其實之前都睇到啲日本嘅片段，我都想問吓有啲人講過膠袋載住會唔會食返膠袋嗰啲物質？", "created_at": "2025-11-05T11:22:11", "owner": "lawliet__mak", "likes": 635}, {"id": 17861239002458813, "text": "明明可以食新鮮野 係都要雪\n都市人個個寒底唔係無原因", "created_at": "2025-11-06T07:52:27", "owner": "fffung704", "likes": 371}, {"id": 18003992012820979, "text": "As a professional chef, ready to go frozen soup kits are absolutely genius 😮👏❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-05T11:04:04", "owner": "gazza_za84", "likes": 199}, {"id": 18098769190732952, "text": "😍😍😍😍😍😍👏", "created_at": "2025-11-05T11:49:12", "owner": "_jessica.see_", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18044926739461885, "text": "大約可以keep幾耐", "created_at": "2025-11-05T10:56:42", "owner": "laz.ruri", "likes": 95}, {"id": 18093298777896253, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-11-05T11:19:20", "owner": "gigimdamo", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17949881478052073, "text": "菜冰過再煮會霉哂，況且每種食材嘅受熱時間都唔同", "created_at": "2025-11-06T15:37:30", "owner": "joe.ngk", "likes": 102}, {"id": 18130516162486995, "text": "好靚嘅牛肉😍請問可以介紹邊間買呢？", "created_at": "2025-11-05T13:19:46", "owner": "biggreybear", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18085110337981644, "text": "This would work but not in my mums fridge where it’s packed to the brim 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-05T13:19:20", "owner": "thanislim", "likes": 55}, {"id": 18096520438793775, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️😍", "created_at": "2025-11-05T12:25:31", "owner": "motekiling", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18121689655523581, "text": "Smart!!", "created_at": "2025-11-05T12:03:47", "owner": "indulgenteats", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18080439502878039, "text": "可以擺幾耐", "created_at": "2025-11-06T07:51:13", "owner": "_.janisz_", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17984015918755160, "text": "請問買邊一隻膠袋先可以放食物而沒有致癌物？求介紹。", "created_at": "2025-11-05T11:21:27", "owner": "lovececi_lia", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17989607510728071, "text": "肉片和蔬菜是否分开存放比较好？😲", "created_at": "2025-11-06T06:40:20", "owner": "gwynne7h", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18103253683726775, "text": "根本就係一鑊熟咋嘛，邊係火鍋......", "created_at": "2025-11-07T06:28:01", "owner": "daniel_tang_hk", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17872845672446429, "text": "You’re Cantonese so cute!😂", "created_at": "2025-11-05T12:04:04", "owner": "jerry_sun_fc", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18332634520300094, "text": "抄襲", "created_at": "2025-11-05T23:23:39", "owner": "monchichi628", "likes": 28}, {"id": 18088601938931787, "text": "菇菇急凍之後再煮，口感會不會差？謝謝", "created_at": "2025-11-05T23:00:10", "owner": "stay_home_mom808", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18057046901273325, "text": "肉唔會老咩？", "created_at": "2025-11-06T07:46:02", "owner": "an.yu.t", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18072111116252637, "text": "你知唔知咩叫打邊爐？", "created_at": "2025-11-06T14:07:43", "owner": "mcheung0426", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18110202049610482, "text": "@monster_annieee  不错啊", "created_at": "2025-11-15T01:38:52", "owner": "cc.cc__________", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18388795252183189, "text": "Awww so cuteeee😢", "created_at": "2025-11-08T16:33:21", "owner": "ana_alb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906146728266561, "text": "雪藏味人人都愛", "created_at": "2025-11-06T01:20:18", "owner": "chrisppp3414", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18086506208477721, "text": "火鍋？一野放哂D料落去叫火鍋咩？", "created_at": "2025-11-06T01:43:01", "owner": "toughking2002", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18110342284525215, "text": "唔好用膠袋，用專用可放冰箱保鮮袋", "created_at": "2025-11-06T04:32:14", "owner": "alegna_uy", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18334562707225218, "text": "请问是用哪种塑料袋呢？", "created_at": "2025-11-09T06:28:26", "owner": "iammaychia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989726157730807, "text": "隔夜菜會釋放致癌物質～🤭", "created_at": "2025-11-07T07:48:45", "owner": "ws617831mc", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18056677733294973, "text": "d 菜冰完唔得架，勁難食", "created_at": "2025-11-10T12:27:13", "owner": "yukitsang1225", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902140054293682, "text": "大陸火鍋料全部都喺「科技與狠活」！ 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-08T06:40:18", "owner": "frankasyung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969226098967813, "text": "冰過嘅菜，食落好怪", "created_at": "2025-11-06T08:41:45", "owner": "jenny_yeung_yeung", "likes": 35}, {"id": 18048232667679355, "text": "@yenpengbelle @leroslau_66", "created_at": "2025-11-21T08:40:37", "owner": "baoyuk96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910904569248691, "text": "🐄🍲🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-06T08:51:57", "owner": "bckxlash", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059456984217622, "text": "明目張膽抄日本content", "created_at": "2025-11-07T14:37:56", "owner": "cldyapple", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18077396483145241, "text": "我試過 這裏雪花牛 煮很久也不會柴\n奇怪 留言的反應這麼激烈", "created_at": "2025-11-07T04:11:05", "owner": "joe.fok", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17898413205181224, "text": "@tapikichi_recipe お邪魔してすみません。この投稿はあなたの動画を盗作しているようです。スタイルも内容も非常に似ています。", "created_at": "2025-11-07T23:37:02", "owner": "itsu.raku", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18080791097028302, "text": "肉加菜放埋一袋，好易交叉感染，肚痾，唔係人人都得", "created_at": "2025-11-06T16:22:21", "owner": "auching526", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17895344991201442, "text": "The taste of veg will not be as fresh  tested & will nv do it again 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-06T05:49:34", "owner": "angel_wif_black_wings", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18301259794254293, "text": "Reference 人地？", "created_at": "2025-11-06T07:33:38", "owner": "yolotime141", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17975940860948497, "text": "無知", "created_at": "2025-11-10T12:51:46", "owner": "dauba99", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095777755878459, "text": "煮就簡單喇，洗菜、切菜、分裝先係最複雜", "created_at": "2025-11-06T05:13:52", "owner": "upppikit", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18091305877903488, "text": "懒人火锅吧，冻汤还可以菜的话会烂掉吧", "created_at": "2025-11-07T10:31:40", "owner": "icezowl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17843346681602741, "text": "菜打冰了可以丢去垃圾桶咯。", "created_at": "2025-11-06T07:12:52", "owner": "munfongyeow", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17969520269969380, "text": "其實係一鑊熟 😆", "created_at": "2025-11-06T15:19:55", "owner": "livia.lau921", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17904646518278219, "text": "抽埋真空會更好", "created_at": "2025-11-06T11:00:50", "owner": "wongvincent0912", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17920954731195653, "text": "咁咪有雪味噜😅😅", "created_at": "2025-11-07T02:47:49", "owner": "cliffordkoo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17884470138400362, "text": "自製預製菜，果然係啲會食大陸湯底嘅人會做嘅事", "created_at": "2025-11-06T14:55:43", "owner": "ttungttunghae1025", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100346662678839, "text": "學到嘢！", "created_at": "2025-11-06T19:42:31", "owner": "kaso.9up", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047476352401296, "text": "咁樣仲叫火鍋？🤣方便就真既", "created_at": "2025-11-06T14:09:43", "owner": "hidechiu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085916143979435, "text": "菜唔使洗嗎", "created_at": "2025-11-06T15:49:15", "owner": "wwytracy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069913577369032, "text": "完全多如", "created_at": "2025-11-06T10:00:16", "owner": "mr.damonchans", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18083603567482985, "text": "想問下啲菜放完落冰格會唔會營養流失", "created_at": "2025-11-06T12:02:10", "owner": "_tinhiutin_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056099732290243, "text": "抄", "created_at": "2025-11-06T02:37:14", "owner": "cannnchannnn", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18082114582834840, "text": "E個idea好耐之前係YT睇過喇", "created_at": "2025-11-06T04:43:12", "owner": "blacklilithff", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18373564861152669, "text": "这是打算天天吃火锅吗？若不是一时半刻吃完，肉和菜避免放在一起，很容易细菌交叉感染！", "created_at": "2025-11-06T06:38:02", "owner": "chinglooi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17888175972382278, "text": "預製你個預製菜", "created_at": "2025-11-06T02:00:06", "owner": "tom372100", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18069742250596053, "text": "我嘅食量要食兩袋 😂 所以冰櫃唔會夠位", "created_at": "2025-11-05T17:03:53", "owner": "yannn1290", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18086209504980508, "text": "So convenient!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-05T11:46:28", "owner": "yukimaryrosel", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17985505217879291, "text": "放冰櫃可以雪約多日", "created_at": "2025-11-06T02:19:54", "owner": "suelau", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18351242839166642, "text": "GENIUS😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-05T12:06:13", "owner": "no7", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18056286269289009, "text": "@xoy this is exactly the same as the other Japanese content creator! @tapikichi_recipe", "created_at": "2025-11-05T11:46:59", "owner": "w0b1n0520", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18074508095241844, "text": "I like it😍", "created_at": "2025-11-05T11:26:21", "owner": "san_karenl", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17934784523982884, "text": "Good idea 👏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-05T10:55:17", "owner": "haryvonne", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18053324231328485, "text": "☝🏻自己煮好呀💯👍🏻👍🏻👍🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-06T04:05:15", "owner": "sammychan110", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17866222353418068, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-05T11:45:05", "owner": "ireneswee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068471753605649, "text": "冰箱無咁大", "created_at": "2025-11-05T22:04:28", "owner": "markgor_kitchen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18543392221009693, "text": "Sooo smart 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-05T13:39:38", "owner": "emma_lauren", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18085955713947837, "text": "Hi, may I know how long can I keep in the freezer?", "created_at": "2025-11-05T11:57:03", "owner": "puffx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17931547473106434, "text": "Бля моя так готовит 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-05T11:02:02", "owner": "strelok841", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17941440053965005, "text": "好聪明", "created_at": "2025-12-11T21:12:27", "owner": "nathanielxiang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072377435598293, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2025-12-09T00:45:05", "owner": "hgf7.621", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892797130380903, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-12-08T06:22:56", "owner": "c_laurennnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089216513499600, "text": "Geniussss", "created_at": "2025-12-06T04:22:48", "owner": "bonnieschen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895070572220076, "text": "为什么不把肉包裹在外层呢？这样肉可以熟，蔬菜也不会太烂👏", "created_at": "2025-12-03T13:03:28", "owner": "wuweilam777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071666780524509, "text": "How did you cut the carrot into shapes!!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:27:18", "owner": "tiklemeang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145950523441514, "text": "this is genius", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:18:44", "owner": "melanie.sylim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956265735892144, "text": "So smart 喎", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:52:54", "owner": "wil_an", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147717835386672, "text": "GREAT IDEAAAAAA😍", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:07:17", "owner": "aelke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042239177493427, "text": "一鑊熟", "created_at": "2025-11-23T15:16:39", "owner": "potato_jm9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088435415312019, "text": "多此一舉，火煱料要食鮮味不是垃圾。", "created_at": "2025-11-23T10:55:57", "owner": "mkwong432", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18371096206154798, "text": "frozen vege can eat meh... It's get soften leh", "created_at": "2025-11-23T06:19:03", "owner": "janetcyp666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877422163437948, "text": "抄襲", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:53:55", "owner": "carolcheungcy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18355634023161409, "text": "好耐之前已經見日本人用咗呢個方法，已經跟佢咁做。方便，快捷，放工返嚟10分鐘就有得食。", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:03:18", "owner": "giantmanta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083869286063105, "text": "好👏", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:31:55", "owner": "carsonckl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106555630714371, "text": "Banker", "created_at": "2025-11-21T19:32:17", "owner": "ummmtang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18212112028308584, "text": "Miso 要在煮好後熄火後才放才會保留到Miso的營養.", "created_at": "2025-11-21T13:43:08", "owner": "pollypmijc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082987237847827, "text": "In my school days. I always do this shortcut way", "created_at": "2025-11-21T07:31:50", "owner": "_evonlai_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085151564007581, "text": "問題嚟啦，咁同落料煲麵有咩分別😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T19:19:27", "owner": "luxuria_hana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867797644480632, "text": "學日本影片吧", "created_at": "2025-11-20T01:02:14", "owner": "sossos174", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101766976664784, "text": "中國人食多啲中國嘢啦", "created_at": "2025-11-19T19:49:49", "owner": "suishek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842139892621588, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-19T15:43:19", "owner": "tiksilpsupa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104996989635104, "text": "邊度好食架！都係分開煮喇", "created_at": "2025-11-19T15:29:08", "owner": "raylo_iv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993775083712764, "text": "不用解凍", "created_at": "2025-11-19T10:01:37", "owner": "loying1a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058007321634259, "text": "好像江若琳的聲音", "created_at": "2025-11-19T04:56:52", "owner": "calvinckkang2103", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941575501068065, "text": "食物中毒啊，小弟。", "created_at": "2025-11-18T23:53:27", "owner": "tongwei141", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159647368394096, "text": "i gotta try this", "created_at": "2025-11-17T02:19:58", "owner": "v4nns", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870432616465651, "text": "只是扼流卜量\n菜冰過會梅唔好食\n香港買菜唔係外國咁難\n有新鮮既又何苦食凍貨", "created_at": "2025-11-16T15:02:22", "owner": "vicatholic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873308278450182, "text": "OMGGG i’m def doing this", "created_at": "2025-11-15T17:04:14", "owner": "casserolebites", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100120027683368, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-15T14:25:50", "owner": "jonathanlieu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960387376007801, "text": "Love this", "created_at": "2025-11-15T03:09:56", "owner": "19kevinlee91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071198918340488, "text": "咁食食多兩次會好悶,之後擺雪櫃好耐都無食全部一陣雪味車晒落垃圾桶", "created_at": "2025-11-14T04:33:58", "owner": "artsphoto_nice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102275545734469, "text": "THIS IS GENIUS", "created_at": "2025-11-11T15:45:10", "owner": "notwasabi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397040692192876, "text": "如果狗肉呢？", "created_at": "2025-11-11T06:34:00", "owner": "tom_low95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881305369417412, "text": "Interesting whenever my family makes hotpot we usually go for a sour soup base as sour eases the greasiness of the fatty meat", "created_at": "2025-11-10T19:29:07", "owner": "_daichi_tran1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093595561894795, "text": "My mother would do it and Blanche it before actually cooking it to eat. Is blanching necessary?", "created_at": "2025-11-10T04:23:31", "owner": "dianaaa_103", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088520341930300, "text": "Stupid idea😮 frozen veggies tasted weird", "created_at": "2025-11-09T22:42:46", "owner": "cornucopia88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18168759343327813, "text": "好讚🥰", "created_at": "2025-11-09T12:22:59", "owner": "as70725", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952887229040851, "text": "题議是好的，但是菇類急凍做法，我怕中毒。都是即食即加。", "created_at": "2025-11-09T08:53:09", "owner": "hangsinchan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301386925265839, "text": "急凍要用PE袋＇她用的保鮮袋是不可以急凍＇急凍後會脫落塑化微粒", "created_at": "2025-11-09T08:39:56", "owner": "tim.tsoi.7731", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049977962365039, "text": "This is the meal prep I need in my life", "created_at": "2025-11-09T08:04:51", "owner": "amateur_ivysaurtrainer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18387152869180538, "text": "Great idea!", "created_at": "2025-11-09T01:42:19", "owner": "the.wai.of.life", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077326432903068, "text": "But miso isn't supposed to be boiled in the first place? I thought they're added at the very last step.", "created_at": "2025-11-09T01:06:33", "owner": "msaniella", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081439781029588, "text": "Good ideas to save time but at the same time it took out all the fun out of doing hot pot which is taking the time to cook everything separately in a timely manner to bring out the best flavours in all the ingredients. Some things are worth waiting for in life and hot pot is one of those things for me 😎🔥🍲", "created_at": "2025-11-08T17:48:19", "owner": "rvwbve", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082869467008612, "text": "請問d菜洗左整乾先雪定真系煮之前先洗？", "created_at": "2025-11-08T14:47:40", "owner": "binnnnnoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073272344265955, "text": "👍👍👍", "created_at": "2025-11-08T13:27:05", "owner": "virginia_mooming", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097668094814957, "text": "殭屍火鍋", "created_at": "2025-11-08T13:00:17", "owner": "shyhoiyiu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872713081449787, "text": "Good budget 👍", "created_at": "2025-11-08T09:13:09", "owner": "angelietanemura", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097231672697191, "text": "不建議用中國的湯底，全是科技與狠活", "created_at": "2025-11-08T08:44:02", "owner": "ihsuantsao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080504132031605, "text": "I won't agree with the raw meat with the vegetables though", "created_at": "2025-11-08T08:37:44", "owner": "tsangdora", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084875033297427, "text": "Vege n raw meat u put in a same bag? OMG. R.I.P..", "created_at": "2025-11-08T08:14:55", "owner": "sunnyho.y.s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911926897231612, "text": "好棒", "created_at": "2025-11-08T07:14:20", "owner": "kpisno1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917356603069797, "text": "呢個膠袋唔可以冰凍㗎。", "created_at": "2025-11-08T06:21:40", "owner": "owesdaydreaming", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953814841041869, "text": "faint", "created_at": "2025-11-08T05:37:09", "owner": "mrjoshuatree", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084417599294238, "text": "天才😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-08T05:30:51", "owner": "babybryanbaby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070908905353526, "text": "肉老了。 菜煮烂了。", "created_at": "2025-11-08T04:16:37", "owner": "kientham", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964215468993142, "text": "超級正🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-08T04:01:25", "owner": "nj5101117", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098681530775342, "text": "菜的口感会烂烂绵绵的，别问我为什么知道🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-08T02:25:30", "owner": "caroljong13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109086058591152, "text": "笑死...自製預製菜", "created_at": "2025-11-08T01:30:59", "owner": "herotam999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082590542007934, "text": "有料🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-07T23:18:26", "owner": "wangdawang7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143990635436614, "text": "Why copy ideas from others but no credits at all??????", "created_at": "2025-11-07T22:47:37", "owner": "717.04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083059553287153, "text": "Omg 😱", "created_at": "2025-11-07T22:44:19", "owner": "jessie.lee.16144606", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905568340268741, "text": "还没有熟的肉和蔬菜不能放在一起。胶袋也不能放食物", "created_at": "2025-11-07T15:19:38", "owner": "devilscott", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080733575111491, "text": "👍👍👍👍👍", "created_at": "2025-11-07T14:05:27", "owner": "amychanchu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084658918823949, "text": "Urmm menarik lg mudah mncepat tp bekukan semuanya ker???", "created_at": "2025-11-07T14:01:50", "owner": "lizaisa2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18344953114161058, "text": "點解同日本個個一樣", "created_at": "2025-11-07T13:41:21", "owner": "stanley.tang.5811", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112559530568536, "text": "菜無洗，真方便😅", "created_at": "2025-11-07T13:17:56", "owner": "renoyip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047609321421572, "text": "Good", "created_at": "2025-11-07T10:25:27", "owner": "happily_ajm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095219857836512, "text": "菜唔會凍壞？", "created_at": "2025-11-07T10:17:12", "owner": "c.o.n.n.i.e.bb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928019602138756, "text": "可以講國語嗎？", "created_at": "2025-11-07T09:58:30", "owner": "allen3821", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086332879787008, "text": "食物中毒过 🤣不敢这样吃了", "created_at": "2025-11-07T08:57:30", "owner": "cindy.ch.336", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383490262195203, "text": "亂咁嚟", "created_at": "2025-11-07T08:45:07", "owner": "suet0841", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871635844452295, "text": "Isnt it store frozen in glass container are better than plastic bag?", "created_at": "2025-11-07T08:31:52", "owner": "zenillion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094084921680815, "text": "带上山食火鍋，正", "created_at": "2025-11-07T08:24:35", "owner": "keunghsieh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18535646569044652, "text": "❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-07T06:48:59", "owner": "d0ngb0y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929345482125261, "text": "🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-07T06:47:39", "owner": "tom_lok_man", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024377147584948, "text": "廚餘", "created_at": "2025-11-07T05:47:19", "owner": "kuenkuen.lee.14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059555744222067, "text": "请问你汤底是用什么材料？", "created_at": "2025-11-07T05:09:08", "owner": "stephanie.stw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956856114878134, "text": "没有营养，也对身体不好。长久下来，chatgpt会告诉你身体疾病有哪些！", "created_at": "2025-11-07T05:06:49", "owner": "ireneyongai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18336231712231193, "text": "冷凍菜口感不好啊！", "created_at": "2025-11-07T04:19:44", "owner": "roselu0912", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081964898093996, "text": "喜歡你的片 實際可行", "created_at": "2025-11-07T04:06:48", "owner": "joe.fok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119714869532142, "text": "好嘅學~🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-07T03:48:11", "owner": "erictaylor519", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852715540571676, "text": "營養流失曬", "created_at": "2025-11-07T03:45:29", "owner": "alicechan_chh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18201061189319329, "text": "JENG AHHHHH gonna try it tonight🤭", "created_at": "2025-11-07T03:21:47", "owner": "no7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938578956966323, "text": "太好了，学习了", "created_at": "2025-11-07T02:56:22", "owner": "sheanchew", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032369780727848, "text": "不用洗？", "created_at": "2025-11-07T02:45:14", "owner": "shehwinnie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093108775882711, "text": "no way..i perfer the fresh way..", "created_at": "2025-11-07T01:23:42", "owner": "ktainy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917967721229179, "text": "English subtitles please", "created_at": "2025-11-07T01:21:52", "owner": "yy336699", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875161675351114, "text": "優質嘅食材，但係選擇垃圾嘅做法，搞撚彎哂啲煮飯文化", "created_at": "2025-11-07T01:06:52", "owner": "forever_tsui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062415254417250, "text": "勁呀。支持你", "created_at": "2025-11-07T00:03:43", "owner": "nelson_naked", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193493857323196, "text": "懒人包", "created_at": "2025-11-06T21:20:42", "owner": "peggy.wan1gmail.com_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000040907839610, "text": "請問可以係冰箱keep 幾耐 ？", "created_at": "2025-11-06T20:20:35", "owner": "ecatcan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088024315943956, "text": "Eating too much microplastics ..", "created_at": "2025-11-06T19:50:39", "owner": "eleebehappy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111070357584657, "text": "4am cravings😮", "created_at": "2025-11-06T19:39:54", "owner": "swizzyinsg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111244213584723, "text": "新鮮食材總好過食雪藏嘢掛", "created_at": "2025-11-06T18:45:50", "owner": "lauwaiyee35", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085612243806238, "text": "@twd_92", "created_at": "2025-11-06T17:24:02", "owner": "mikechew444", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954795253010109, "text": "唔洗洗？", "created_at": "2025-11-06T17:04:45", "owner": "tai.calvin.75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042227180701616, "text": "最喜歡呢d diy影片，健身一流", "created_at": "2025-11-06T16:01:25", "owner": "vvaanngg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912931204234786, "text": "So convenient!", "created_at": "2025-11-06T15:53:54", "owner": "roots.pantry.ca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097437061776564, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-06T15:23:32", "owner": "chesterkenny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082983995095370, "text": "Plastic bag is microplastic proof? I hope so! But creative idea🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-06T15:22:05", "owner": "m.a.d_couple", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082387765842709, "text": "可以雪多久？", "created_at": "2025-11-06T15:21:08", "owner": "lam_vicki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071118551035521, "text": "On9", "created_at": "2025-11-06T15:19:59", "owner": "worldexploring9527", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117387613553568, "text": "預制菜 勁呀", "created_at": "2025-11-06T15:19:10", "owner": "painting_master_hk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932907619103901, "text": "Good luck", "created_at": "2025-11-06T15:13:32", "owner": "enjjell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103486804730010, "text": "一個人住的就係要諗下這些橋", "created_at": "2025-11-06T15:09:43", "owner": "magicvalley2018", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929430994132206, "text": "This is brilliant!!", "created_at": "2025-11-06T13:18:01", "owner": "domo_osso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18392299582120470, "text": "個煲好靚😍 可唔可以講下咩牌子", "created_at": "2025-11-06T12:30:07", "owner": "karlkcl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055140842312305, "text": "女生： 还是自己制作的预制菜吃的安心", "created_at": "2025-11-06T12:24:15", "owner": "charles_liangkc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114211231605210, "text": "自家預製菜🤪👍", "created_at": "2025-11-06T12:06:09", "owner": "garyhosuper", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971113320950204, "text": "安全吗", "created_at": "2025-11-06T11:38:35", "owner": "alan_wong_123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048047204394234, "text": "瓜和菜 冰🧊過係唔好食的", "created_at": "2025-11-06T11:17:27", "owner": "angel.chee.50", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098462350705372, "text": "慢性自殺", "created_at": "2025-11-06T10:55:45", "owner": "tennoji_wai_hkride", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102143002657340, "text": "要個冰格好大先得㗎", "created_at": "2025-11-06T09:51:20", "owner": "1391mayuri1391", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079737898895327, "text": "快靚正😍多謝分享🙌❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-06T09:29:42", "owner": "babylam0128", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006981170803613, "text": "So smart", "created_at": "2025-11-06T08:41:56", "owner": "bigdavidsze", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084336386049598, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-06T08:19:24", "owner": "jasonwong11090", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080701168878075, "text": "可以儲存幾耐呢！", "created_at": "2025-11-06T07:54:43", "owner": "elaineng1125", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18288433657263771, "text": "痴線 冰咗嘅菜會霉晒已經唔掂 咁大包 個冰格邊有位", "created_at": "2025-11-06T07:38:40", "owner": "beard_bryanman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069971945197973, "text": "預製菜", "created_at": "2025-11-06T07:32:52", "owner": "reveluvdavid_afterlike_2023", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3746992034063118470, "shortcode": "DP__WcOjPCG", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DP__WcOjPCG/", "taken_at": "2025-10-19T17:53:30", "caption": "The world-famous French bistro in London that’s been serving just one dish for years — steak and chips 🥩🍟 served twice for each person.\n\nHave you ever tried Le Relais de Venise L’Entrecôte in Marylebone?\n\n#londonrestaurants #francefood #marylebone", "owner_username": "russogioacchino", "owner_id": "53353125822", "likes": 47019, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0118_DP__WcOjPCG\\DP__WcOjPCG_20251019_175330.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18084067346295111, "text": "Guys! I don’t know where you’re coming from, but steak in London is usually cooked RARE! 🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-26T21:19:40", "owner": "russogioacchino", "likes": 599}, {"id": 18174468790322058, "text": "\"This place has only 1 dish\" ... proceeds to show a reel with 2 dishes in it....", "created_at": "2025-10-20T09:40:23", "owner": "mikebruski", "likes": 1664}, {"id": 18026804375555592, "text": "What's the vegan choice?", "created_at": "2025-10-25T00:05:35", "owner": "riffygoogs", "likes": 22}, {"id": 18102238411726856, "text": "Raw meat and chips??? No thanks.", "created_at": "2025-10-26T20:05:37", "owner": "winniesgrandma", "likes": 78}, {"id": 18055904588280195, "text": "I’ve been to the original one in Bordeaux. Fabulous.", "created_at": "2025-10-24T13:28:53", "owner": "pigeoncottagekitchen", "likes": 21}, {"id": 18086685908482576, "text": "Frozen chips", "created_at": "2025-10-27T15:40:54", "owner": "paulhuitson", "likes": 107}, {"id": 18081028880041796, "text": "Have tried it. Over 10 years ago. Was amazing!", "created_at": "2025-11-08T08:58:10", "owner": "neelusarkarofficial", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17852446071566259, "text": "Reviews say it is not worth it for the price, the wait and the crammed restaurant. Looks good, though, but I think I will pass...", "created_at": "2025-10-26T13:56:37", "owner": "saramarieatkinson", "likes": 62}, {"id": 17861607660514823, "text": "Best when drunk.", "created_at": "2025-10-26T20:37:29", "owner": "maz_nico", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18047326883394091, "text": "@gemma.kelly_ a", "created_at": "2025-11-09T19:41:39", "owner": "alexandra.ramirez.suarez", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068723123597498, "text": "I know this place very well. Totally  delicious amd worth the queue.", "created_at": "2025-11-08T06:28:14", "owner": "clarissaparishartist", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17927176758017532, "text": "What’s the green sauce?", "created_at": "2025-11-02T20:28:03", "owner": "marin_the_marvelous", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099900670680403, "text": "Been there. Not so good", "created_at": "2025-11-05T21:44:05", "owner": "jpvbm", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18035667221710389, "text": "Once a month I go Miller and Carter - £20 steak and a flat bread starter.", "created_at": "2025-10-23T12:48:41", "owner": "official_matt_paradise", "likes": 42}, {"id": 17856007608572877, "text": "I was in the nice Italian restaurant opposite last week and this place had a queue around the block. Must be doing something right.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T19:32:27", "owner": "philatkins282", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081894391866547, "text": "@benjyleeds", "created_at": "2025-11-15T14:58:52", "owner": "james.newman.3110", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17975992283943985, "text": "Looks a bit like a tourist trap. I lived in London for over 30 years, and I have never heard of this place.", "created_at": "2025-10-30T10:53:27", "owner": "ehebbelmann", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17911053984238655, "text": "There’s one of these in NYC (or there was). Delicious.", "created_at": "2025-11-07T02:06:01", "owner": "planyouradventure", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18200867329316353, "text": "I’ve been and o really don’t get the hype. Food is nothing extraordinary and waiting outside for an hour? Nope", "created_at": "2025-10-24T04:50:43", "owner": "skinsurgeon", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18097356601743124, "text": "Beef is served rare. Full stop.", "created_at": "2025-10-29T21:40:30", "owner": "mrfroggy", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18084036118947670, "text": "Its good steak but the london city one is better. This one made us sick for some reason!", "created_at": "2025-10-20T10:42:36", "owner": "neelam_cz", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18183649615352172, "text": "Just visited the original in Paris", "created_at": "2025-10-26T20:22:17", "owner": "hitchenliam", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18376823845151596, "text": "We went a month ago and were underwhelmed. Portions were small, fries so so. The reviews suggest some people like it but we won’t be back. Much prefer Flatiron as an experience.", "created_at": "2025-11-09T22:50:15", "owner": "incognitocards", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18112735717511153, "text": "@hannahdakin_stevens", "created_at": "2025-11-10T18:57:00", "owner": "jsteb1990", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18494286451073844, "text": "I wish i could go, but last time i was in London i got Stabbed 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-09T13:27:53", "owner": "keikxz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079682345122695, "text": "Miam miam!", "created_at": "2025-11-11T16:28:17", "owner": "verosimil_2000", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18108994492603577, "text": "Very rushed and crowded, the tables are sooo close together.", "created_at": "2025-10-20T14:45:05", "owner": "deanna26o2", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18098861806684697, "text": "It’s steak frites. Don’t ruin the fancy with “chips”", "created_at": "2025-11-07T03:17:12", "owner": "cmrnch", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18149203504424161, "text": "Tourist trap", "created_at": "2025-11-08T21:18:29", "owner": "t_mcnicol_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18085726588781906, "text": "I remember when it was £17", "created_at": "2025-10-30T22:18:50", "owner": "stuartfisk", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18063394673420259, "text": "So no bananas?", "created_at": "2025-11-12T18:34:31", "owner": "straightupmonkey", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17903419740317177, "text": "I tried before. Bad taste. No recommend 👎🏼 Cheap choice and low quality", "created_at": "2025-12-13T07:44:42", "owner": "wkeric23", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18419050177118845, "text": "Oh my god! I want", "created_at": "2025-11-06T19:49:39", "owner": "pala.din1219", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18243504760293818, "text": "Vedo un cappuccino x caso ? 🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-25T17:54:22", "owner": "jessicalucia_chiesa", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18057612854230729, "text": "cheap cuts and oily crisps", "created_at": "2025-10-29T18:14:33", "owner": "local_p_", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18049257605355856, "text": "Presented like slop!!! 🙈", "created_at": "2025-11-01T23:55:30", "owner": "c.patricia.s2020", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17918916666189903, "text": "@zoey_turnbull", "created_at": "2025-11-03T21:52:21", "owner": "dan_turnbull_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077427095150067, "text": "And yet I see two dishes", "created_at": "2025-11-04T03:28:52", "owner": "mcgovern2318", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18102669121568566, "text": "@zara.sv omg les gooooo", "created_at": "2025-10-31T22:04:13", "owner": "jacie.burger", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18191137360330059, "text": "Late to the show", "created_at": "2025-11-02T11:12:03", "owner": "siab.88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083419477959867, "text": "@therealpatrickanderson", "created_at": "2025-11-02T01:42:27", "owner": "cjhunter407", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074699602942253, "text": "I've Been There!!! It's Really Good!!", "created_at": "2025-10-20T17:20:17", "owner": "mykalzvmr", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18026900174758634, "text": "@amybalabil", "created_at": "2025-10-25T18:30:35", "owner": "robb_klim", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18044738375688094, "text": "How much", "created_at": "2025-10-29T22:25:03", "owner": "alexnaulab", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18133276897418047, "text": "Looks amazing", "created_at": "2025-10-19T18:24:02", "owner": "panpannnisme", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18054741431299942, "text": "Ha riaperto ?", "created_at": "2025-10-19T19:34:43", "owner": "giorgiorossgram", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073288019333948, "text": "Il sito dice che è chiuso per restauro.", "created_at": "2025-10-19T19:34:32", "owner": "giorgiorossgram", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18087322388497843, "text": "Looks amazing", "created_at": "2025-10-19T19:29:26", "owner": "drmoomoo098765", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095669593706614, "text": "@manabishnu_", "created_at": "2025-10-19T21:25:03", "owner": "_notmithun", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18490379326078838, "text": "@aleckandro", "created_at": "2025-10-19T19:52:13", "owner": "mona___mon___", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095477137762071, "text": "Where is it", "created_at": "2025-10-20T17:35:44", "owner": "simoneoflondon", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18151132150408838, "text": "Superb 👏", "created_at": "2025-10-20T16:41:23", "owner": "rick.surf25", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062350175608800, "text": "looks so good!", "created_at": "2025-10-20T14:45:40", "owner": "spottedbymeli", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072826487228667, "text": "I want to try!!", "created_at": "2025-10-20T11:22:36", "owner": "eatzanddrinkz_charlotte.mallin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051604016329435, "text": "Price???", "created_at": "2025-10-20T19:40:24", "owner": "san16godfrey", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18010334918796500, "text": "@pennyhennessy 👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-20T19:27:24", "owner": "rachelmarycleary", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081036038019073, "text": "Its ...ok.", "created_at": "2025-10-20T19:05:02", "owner": "pubsoflondon1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18127980844491837, "text": "@paulriley87", "created_at": "2025-10-20T18:15:16", "owner": "kate_riley__", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17874823782430447, "text": "@acfatty_86", "created_at": "2025-10-20T18:15:52", "owner": "karzz86", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18109489579599279, "text": "Looks fabulous.", "created_at": "2025-10-21T05:50:54", "owner": "beautifulvictoria15", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079343054031239, "text": "Looks revolting 🤮", "created_at": "2025-10-21T07:04:04", "owner": "mariya.nylon", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18531018040002536, "text": "@harleyricharda", "created_at": "2025-10-20T21:33:34", "owner": "lorean2016", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17969056502809763, "text": "Clearly saw two dishes.", "created_at": "2025-10-20T21:54:00", "owner": "pyfagorass", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18031057235523822, "text": "Not same", "created_at": "2025-10-21T14:00:12", "owner": "atiladolarslan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17988056246902895, "text": "What is it,I don’t like the look of that gravy", "created_at": "2025-10-21T13:38:45", "owner": "stephen_hollands1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094013503697625, "text": "@tesscarmichael @jkayebc is it any good?", "created_at": "2025-10-21T10:23:51", "owner": "ewanmews", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17982601862911409, "text": "£33 I’m not sure it’s good value", "created_at": "2025-10-21T07:18:51", "owner": "justanotherday2506", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17890290894363349, "text": "Yuk meat is raw", "created_at": "2025-10-21T17:17:04", "owner": "caoimhepfd", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17882057637284907, "text": "I am sorry but it does not look that appetising… everything seems to be thrown on the plate. Non merci.", "created_at": "2025-10-21T17:00:46", "owner": "brilliantmagpiebookbinding", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18158364409389134, "text": "reminds me of the polidor in Paris", "created_at": "2025-10-21T15:48:18", "owner": "patriciaguppy7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17884583649394957, "text": "They only give you one steak refill, unlimited chips", "created_at": "2025-10-21T14:32:21", "owner": "thisisthekh", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18083509354795314, "text": "That doesn't look like steak... also, I see two dishes (\"steak\" frites and profiteroles)", "created_at": "2025-10-21T17:40:28", "owner": "zefrographica", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076341677277141, "text": "@kaizokuoni", "created_at": "2025-10-21T18:23:19", "owner": "michaelcrabbe92", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18537968281015239, "text": "Our favourite @chris_rose1101", "created_at": "2025-10-21T18:49:08", "owner": "michellerose1103", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18053242325320027, "text": "I visited the one in Paris this year, really delicious, more restaurants should focus on one or two dishes and make them great, rather than big menus.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T05:30:54", "owner": "larathefoodgoddess", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17873944374439170, "text": "It doesn't", "created_at": "2025-10-22T04:56:23", "owner": "mike690329", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084613442307255, "text": "I saw two dishes", "created_at": "2025-10-22T00:21:23", "owner": "leewilroybusonrel", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049116866654069, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-10-22T02:36:11", "owner": "diana_doina_t", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18559665034058466, "text": "Tourist trap! Always long queue for that is not worth.", "created_at": "2025-12-13T12:52:23", "owner": "haiiihennnnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084826801864924, "text": "It’s soooo good!!! 😊", "created_at": "2025-12-12T23:53:46", "owner": "susie_b75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873373225466067, "text": "They serve salad, then steak frites and green sauce. They ask you if you want seconds when you’re done. That’s the only thing that’s rare.", "created_at": "2025-12-10T21:31:02", "owner": "remi_n_flossy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138217684461565, "text": "Was this a all you can eat remember it likw that", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:51:08", "owner": "ddenizkurtcn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021145478790144, "text": "Steak frites, goddammit", "created_at": "2025-12-07T19:29:43", "owner": "exitstageruscha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955384762043857, "text": "Steak frites, goddammit", "created_at": "2025-12-07T19:11:32", "owner": "exitstageruscha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084148898320834, "text": "The queue in the original Paris is hell", "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:19:03", "owner": "riyandirahmantio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868638334418563, "text": "Very clever concept", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:00:14", "owner": "pamelashabi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988771032874228, "text": "The best steak and frites in London", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:59:47", "owner": "pamelashabi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937813519097820, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T14:07:25", "owner": "refrqcted", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084160327862605, "text": "@lozzzyc3 like in Paris xx", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:35:56", "owner": "hayleyhotspurs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993033498902465, "text": "@wtng2010 this steak place#", "created_at": "2025-12-03T10:47:48", "owner": "jan1128", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099555643789378, "text": "the only serv barf sauce and chips? lol", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:09:24", "owner": "willytoochilly.ttv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066353963144262, "text": "It’s a complete rip off", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:32:03", "owner": "mark.g.n.b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924057247176865, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:23:51", "owner": "stitch_the_gremlin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086610224484171, "text": "Used to be £20 and you could get as many refills of frites and salad as you like. I wonder if they still do that…", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:54:59", "owner": "gym_date_check", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878117326439092, "text": "🐐", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:15:17", "owner": "nathan_mountford", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087767932944470, "text": "The best steak 🥩 chips and sauce ever i need this restaurant in poulton Le Fylde !!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:58:07", "owner": "veryverysherrie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090797906496783, "text": "not worth it", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:05:08", "owner": "dancastah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089894998944426, "text": "Oven chips and mediocre steak. I'll stay home thanks", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:30:30", "owner": "tomthorpe_03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064402838165784, "text": "Esto es una copia de suiza y Francia", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:06:50", "owner": "chagalo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079588933922173, "text": "No option without fries? Like veggies? Surely that isn't difficult to do", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:37:29", "owner": "luka.milutinovic2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016961033794546, "text": "The steak looks alive", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:18:23", "owner": "levyngrace", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081839290896401, "text": "It’s so good I went to the original in Paris for my birthday", "created_at": "2025-11-26T19:56:42", "owner": "explorer_wayne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060514784554341, "text": "Swiss butter in London is better", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:37:38", "owner": "__stu__nicol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083739211863617, "text": "Nope", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:07:14", "owner": "maddalenabt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009624194648463, "text": "@olaeriksand", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:46:29", "owner": "omagnusson78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931436557112044, "text": "Its not that great", "created_at": "2025-11-20T12:01:26", "owner": "harley.n.p", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044979839472662, "text": "This place is my fav", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:57:42", "owner": "tigerpearl486", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962737581991032, "text": "Unfortunately they serve a curry sauce instead of a butter one, doesn’t taste like the original", "created_at": "2025-11-17T16:03:46", "owner": "sam.caell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958573479876751, "text": "🤮🤮🤮🤮🤮🤮🤮", "created_at": "2025-11-16T17:47:57", "owner": "gilocha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087370348949391, "text": "That meat is still mooing", "created_at": "2025-11-16T17:25:31", "owner": "jons.days", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057116753280357, "text": "Haven’t been there for 20 years but I’m going this week!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-16T16:08:06", "owner": "a_deep_sea_diver", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957376476882104, "text": "Let's go !!", "created_at": "2025-11-15T14:35:47", "owner": "mickeycarroll8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889003573379393, "text": "What’s the name ?", "created_at": "2025-11-14T19:44:26", "owner": "bazza_2728", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944995176940673, "text": "Clearly a scam", "created_at": "2025-11-14T12:24:44", "owner": "kalamwrenaedw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054542393322460, "text": "\"2nd serving\"", "created_at": "2025-11-13T23:45:42", "owner": "alastairmckenzie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18247628014295426, "text": "That’s why you can see many fat people in UK", "created_at": "2025-11-13T21:11:51", "owner": "tonytong1025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069037313343810, "text": "Who has a cappuccino with dinner? Or lunch?", "created_at": "2025-11-12T18:54:34", "owner": "rhys_tagram", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118297264533615, "text": "As a French, no thanks", "created_at": "2025-11-11T16:35:10", "owner": "glorytospeedpaint", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881957305408712, "text": "France is only across the road why do they have to put it in London?", "created_at": "2025-11-11T14:30:21", "owner": "cameronrozelaar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050822531360801, "text": "Would not eat there", "created_at": "2025-11-11T14:29:29", "owner": "cameronrozelaar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115890499491869, "text": "Need this in my life", "created_at": "2025-11-11T06:50:17", "owner": "tarasholloman_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18375256480159949, "text": "all day long....every day!", "created_at": "2025-11-11T01:21:08", "owner": "vcstapleton2323", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352631323166076, "text": "@leximackleyy", "created_at": "2025-11-10T14:08:03", "owner": "renardmackley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18365634796095696, "text": "Rudest staff ever 🤮", "created_at": "2025-11-09T23:34:32", "owner": "mrgokky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132922105486726, "text": "*Serves only one dish* Shows two dishes 🤡", "created_at": "2025-11-09T21:13:48", "owner": "korpomemes_berlin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542349742059939, "text": "Been one time , and is lady time., smoll portion of meet, 🍟 only .", "created_at": "2025-11-09T21:00:53", "owner": "_david87__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079209470472064, "text": "Only serves one dish. Proceeds to show 2", "created_at": "2025-11-09T20:12:23", "owner": "low2180", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890047939243088, "text": "@tmallmason", "created_at": "2025-11-09T09:18:42", "owner": "kirstydonnellydrystonewaller", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113502787563021, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-09T07:53:51", "owner": "gab_gab_gabi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083194106022927, "text": "Seriously it looks bad.", "created_at": "2025-11-09T07:28:22", "owner": "kesilopi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061616975563200, "text": "The sauce 🤤😩🙌🏾", "created_at": "2025-11-08T22:14:30", "owner": "drewsyute", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080146243879436, "text": "How much", "created_at": "2025-11-08T14:51:28", "owner": "renlikesitalianfood", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122327929518061, "text": "13", "created_at": "2025-11-08T13:22:18", "owner": "stephen.unwin13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065977790578934, "text": "Oh wow", "created_at": "2025-11-08T11:38:03", "owner": "sheepers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903955114148164, "text": "🩵🩵🩵", "created_at": "2025-11-08T01:00:16", "owner": "yale.roses", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084574633989810, "text": "French fries, I’ll pass", "created_at": "2025-11-07T22:52:09", "owner": "muhlohnee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045359444448911, "text": "This place is rammed. But still great. I prefer Rowley's personally - same thing but they also have interesting specials, plus it's in Piccadilly so close to the theatres.", "created_at": "2025-11-07T18:26:27", "owner": "the_cabalist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070029377600626, "text": "Incorrect - starters, desserts…….", "created_at": "2025-11-06T23:42:34", "owner": "stephencourt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019614203607810, "text": "Were we were gunna go", "created_at": "2025-11-06T10:16:15", "owner": "j0e_arnold", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055775723286293, "text": "Looks awful", "created_at": "2025-11-06T01:08:31", "owner": "lawlessmyles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927282661017352, "text": "Very bad experience! 50 minutes waiting time! Don’t go there!", "created_at": "2025-11-04T22:07:47", "owner": "annettedeiters", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086837579481918, "text": "How much?", "created_at": "2025-11-04T20:30:23", "owner": "88hushi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966637671973071, "text": "Go #Vegan for the animals!", "created_at": "2025-11-04T14:43:45", "owner": "totally_british_animal_lover", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152210824370354, "text": "Invite me here @oding928", "created_at": "2025-11-03T17:36:37", "owner": "kriziav_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154510978409894, "text": "Keep", "created_at": "2025-11-03T17:30:18", "owner": "kimmoffatt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091659787915817, "text": "Must go when in Landan", "created_at": "2025-11-03T10:04:14", "owner": "shazan_z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068582984062406, "text": "Heard so much about it!! Is it as good as people say it is?", "created_at": "2025-11-03T09:23:03", "owner": "hungryandfreee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18300907105271916, "text": "Lord God almighty please let me have this some day amen", "created_at": "2025-11-03T03:10:10", "owner": "joshua.bonkley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084120088950056, "text": "Halal?", "created_at": "2025-11-02T19:38:33", "owner": "tango_orange0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095922514702455, "text": "We used to have that in Amsterdam late ‘70s - early ‘80s. Called L’Entecôte in the famous PC Hooftstraat. There is a ripoff version still around but this one is nothing new or innovate. Probably overpriced.", "created_at": "2025-11-02T18:43:33", "owner": "pons_mel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025869206777041, "text": "And it’s not worth it! Don’t be fooled by stupid influencers!", "created_at": "2025-11-02T16:34:04", "owner": "sarah_isabel_bowyer", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17858951742539415, "text": "Served with Belgian fries!", "created_at": "2025-11-02T14:40:04", "owner": "bmissoul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18150288910418925, "text": "No beans?!", "created_at": "2025-11-01T20:25:12", "owner": "dangtalley", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049274336668721, "text": "I'd love to go to this place, when I visit France they have a similar thing that was in a chain called Buffalo Grill,  it's probably changed but their whole business was based on just steak and chips done well and not well done... Lol.", "created_at": "2025-10-31T22:25:58", "owner": "richardtattonhereford", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072342014245696, "text": "How much is this ?, looks good", "created_at": "2025-10-31T19:42:01", "owner": "pmccusker769", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18054377684309750, "text": "How have I never been here", "created_at": "2025-10-31T15:39:34", "owner": "eatingforthe_sukh_of_it", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17973900872789607, "text": "@dimitridehennin", "created_at": "2025-10-31T12:14:47", "owner": "tomastaecke", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17942280651073833, "text": "Looks gross", "created_at": "2025-10-31T03:58:41", "owner": "louiseabramsbraff", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17863468620507939, "text": "I've been there. It really is absolutely delicious 🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-31T02:22:35", "owner": "madame.sara.fox", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18117796207554509, "text": "Steak frites. Duh…", "created_at": "2025-10-31T00:18:01", "owner": "nonotmiketoo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082293896082917, "text": "Yuck that green goo comes out if plastic canisters 🤮", "created_at": "2025-10-31T00:04:23", "owner": "luciemerasicka", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18550037719040613, "text": "@georgewhitburn is this near you? Xx", "created_at": "2025-10-30T22:58:28", "owner": "nickspurway", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18182548303354693, "text": "Don’t worry ve Gan work it out !", "created_at": "2025-10-30T17:35:58", "owner": "stiffcrumb", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18116195632483403, "text": "@jfenwick__ let's go!", "created_at": "2025-10-30T17:32:41", "owner": "live.sacred_lea", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17956276205885449, "text": "Ugliest fries l have ever seen", "created_at": "2025-10-30T16:11:23", "owner": "yahyadarboe", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18028886672538184, "text": "I saw two dishes", "created_at": "2025-10-30T15:36:07", "owner": "derrick.jong", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18536744005024666, "text": "Swiss butter ?", "created_at": "2025-10-30T11:07:25", "owner": "95ymr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18010025270802716, "text": "Yes, I have eaten there frequently.", "created_at": "2025-10-30T00:13:37", "owner": "goonercolin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17874785547356029, "text": "If “find one thing and do it great” was a restaurant….", "created_at": "2025-10-29T23:57:18", "owner": "lil_tiny_peptalks", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18179631304359023, "text": "@debbiedb7", "created_at": "2025-10-29T20:16:45", "owner": "eoghanc1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17975427395788352, "text": "@muhibamini when is our next date?", "created_at": "2025-10-29T19:14:32", "owner": "juliusalexispogi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18103435612648205, "text": "@fettlahgram", "created_at": "2025-10-29T19:02:27", "owner": "jsaw82", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18536757478045220, "text": "Dreamy!", "created_at": "2025-10-29T17:37:08", "owner": "forksofthenorth", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18015801011792101, "text": "Steak is cooked perfectly, these commenters are plebes", "created_at": "2025-10-29T15:03:30", "owner": "schoobydoo", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17895714720342679, "text": "This looks perfect 👏", "created_at": "2025-10-29T14:03:54", "owner": "emjpittstop", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18081354116014129, "text": "@thomas_sisauri 👏", "created_at": "2025-10-29T12:59:43", "owner": "ioane_tsagareishvili", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17940576606066450, "text": "This place is utterly rubbish, the biggest mistake I have made in recent time in waiting to eat this shit", "created_at": "2025-10-29T12:34:04", "owner": "mkkv_88", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18111150484581164, "text": "And it looks like they serve it well!!", "created_at": "2025-10-29T08:40:20", "owner": "yosefsilver", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098347447739597, "text": "This place is decent... Paris grill steak sandwiches are better though", "created_at": "2025-10-29T03:39:20", "owner": "harrison.chapp", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082735049002792, "text": "This place started out in Paris and is a complete winner! You get an entree, main course and dessert and it’s yummy! 🤤 🥇", "created_at": "2025-10-28T22:29:37", "owner": "alexkingbennett", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092447623678087, "text": "Went about 20 years ago and enjoyed it. You also get a walnut salad and the original is in Paris.", "created_at": "2025-10-28T21:24:28", "owner": "peterthornton448", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18111639586574823, "text": "But its shit", "created_at": "2025-10-28T21:15:16", "owner": "littlefatsi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18207178987311813, "text": "The one in Nantes was 10x better", "created_at": "2025-10-28T19:31:16", "owner": "ydae.5", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18431453956100413, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-28T15:04:48", "owner": "adrianrfletcher", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18180394825349546, "text": "@olivia.mcf", "created_at": "2025-10-28T14:39:28", "owner": "elledee2801", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066488666377353, "text": "Always a long queue and I do not think it worth the wait", "created_at": "2025-10-28T11:59:41", "owner": "lindyloohird", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18229908295305416, "text": "@sidman69 🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-27T19:36:12", "owner": "nataliehughes8360", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084697531960799, "text": "Had it- it’s mid", "created_at": "2025-10-27T19:14:02", "owner": "fat_sammys_slice", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18102329446569296, "text": "that green sauce... think it contains sea food.... rather have peppercorn", "created_at": "2025-10-27T16:19:31", "owner": "pjpringle1981", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17883101094281286, "text": "This is delicious! Worth the queue", "created_at": "2025-10-27T16:04:59", "owner": "ew.itslou", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18089200354931021, "text": "This is NOT a bistro, it’s a gimmicky brasserie.", "created_at": "2025-10-27T13:40:36", "owner": "wwest22_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18040718909484494, "text": "https://www.relaisentrecote.fr/\n-\nhttps://relaisdevenise.com/locations/london-marylebone.php?lang=en", "created_at": "2025-10-27T12:25:34", "owner": "wille9116", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17933957825986080, "text": "Big mistake!! I will never go there again!", "created_at": "2025-10-27T10:11:20", "owner": "inezlammers", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18364827379083791, "text": "It’s like Le Marbeuf in Paris. Sauce looks exactly the same.", "created_at": "2025-10-27T07:40:28", "owner": "herreboudtjean", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17870190198455130, "text": "Yes, there’s a restaurant in Madrid near the archeology  museum that does the same thing", "created_at": "2025-10-27T06:23:19", "owner": "ronhasler_2025", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062001962618853, "text": "Glad i been there before Instagram", "created_at": "2025-10-27T00:11:54", "owner": "chflouris", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17903064585276606, "text": "You know what they say, fear not the person who has practiced 100 tricks once, but one that has practiced one trick 100 times. Or something like that.", "created_at": "2025-10-26T22:51:57", "owner": "m25.lss", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074561141145415, "text": "And people have the nerve to say French food is better than British", "created_at": "2025-10-26T22:43:50", "owner": "bobaboy888", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18106724260529139, "text": "i’m going to go here one day", "created_at": "2025-10-26T20:07:17", "owner": "isaack991", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18061882547529887, "text": "This is a copy of the French restaurants in France or the same owners ??", "created_at": "2025-10-26T19:03:18", "owner": "alexandremartelet", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18084388931483706, "text": "And ruined by social media. Smaller portions, longer queue and half of what it was pre covid unfortunately.", "created_at": "2025-10-26T18:36:12", "owner": "ajd20886", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17924615280151231, "text": "Quick question-is it English or French beef that is served. No offense, but the taste is quite different.", "created_at": "2025-10-26T16:49:00", "owner": "claire.kelly.14019", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18316603525169095, "text": "Only in London where people have more money than sense would this shit work", "created_at": "2025-10-26T16:32:13", "owner": "tophatghost", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18031780892719191, "text": "Slopped onto plates no thanks", "created_at": "2025-10-26T11:46:46", "owner": "debris64", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17868217623466304, "text": "Frozen potatoes 🥶🙃🥸", "created_at": "2025-10-26T07:23:25", "owner": "felixromero09", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18089465104810188, "text": "There is the same or similar in Paris. Absolutely rubbish.", "created_at": "2025-10-25T19:32:15", "owner": "mickspurs77", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062027951402254, "text": "Ten mins walk from my home this.", "created_at": "2025-10-25T18:26:28", "owner": "beachfit303", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18037509887502841, "text": "Can highly recommend", "created_at": "2025-10-25T15:19:13", "owner": "gjh9051", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18242156392291551, "text": "I visited the restaurant in Geneva where this all originated from, there’s no menu,green salad to start then incredibly good steak and fries with the secret recipe green sauce, when you think it’s all over they’re back for round two. Good bottle of sassicia job done!", "created_at": "2025-10-25T15:06:14", "owner": "craigbarton1", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18041097200699091, "text": "Is it halal?", "created_at": "2025-10-25T15:05:27", "owner": "lampemarko", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17967177257971239, "text": "I’ve been there myself. All of it is clockwork and it is insane. How organised they are as a team and how they bring all the dishes out at once.", "created_at": "2025-10-25T14:00:11", "owner": "kenwardjay", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18003944933817052, "text": "This page scammed me! BEWARE of the person running this account, I have been asking for my money back for several weeks now they keep deleting my comments and blocking my accounts, I have to make new ones in order to message or write a comment again. You have been warned! BEWARE!.", "created_at": "2025-10-25T11:19:53", "owner": "howtom3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072068899991357, "text": "There was a pudding and a coffee though", "created_at": "2025-10-24T21:38:43", "owner": "alcohol_free_reviews", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076387190131767, "text": "No because I would prefer not to have my food thrown on to my plate. Undercooked steak and overcooked fries.", "created_at": "2025-10-24T21:20:25", "owner": "lesleyjohnson6162", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17980120274768604, "text": "I love this pace , same back twice", "created_at": "2025-10-24T20:37:19", "owner": "elpidavoy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092612728855767, "text": "I have been to the Relais de Venise in Paris many times. I will have to check this one out on my next trip to London!", "created_at": "2025-10-24T19:50:09", "owner": "ritaderuysscher", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18043619915443656, "text": "There’s 2 dishes + they steak is still raw 🫣", "created_at": "2025-10-24T19:36:21", "owner": "rosiexdollface", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087123286926966, "text": "That's from WW1 older lady who has become helping to feed some French army and up opening a small restaurant. Become famous Cafe de Paris Restaurant. Only served special sauce on a steak and french fries.", "created_at": "2025-10-24T19:32:26", "owner": "cengizdawn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130015564476962, "text": "@kitstix can we go please? Xxx", "created_at": "2025-10-24T17:13:16", "owner": "masonichedgehog", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18171013165364054, "text": "Swear I saw two dishes in the vid", "created_at": "2025-10-24T14:59:38", "owner": "versorium", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18012252908632024, "text": "Over rated.", "created_at": "2025-10-24T13:24:37", "owner": "bonnaud_dowell", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17907821397269810, "text": "It's the Best!", "created_at": "2025-10-24T12:57:44", "owner": "jlarson517", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17891412828224228, "text": "That meat could walk off that plate😮", "created_at": "2025-10-24T10:13:34", "owner": "yvesse2024", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17860677615517689, "text": "Been to two in Paris.", "created_at": "2025-10-24T09:58:52", "owner": "taffelaide", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18109286008608822, "text": "Is this Béarnaise sauce or pepper sauce? 🧐", "created_at": "2025-10-24T07:43:44", "owner": "racuch777", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18136278451459882, "text": "Love this place", "created_at": "2025-10-24T05:46:50", "owner": "mlc2465", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17902621827142822, "text": "What’s up with European fries? Consistently mid AF.", "created_at": "2025-10-23T22:45:01", "owner": "erik_duncan", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18076029160944031, "text": "Went to one in Paris 6 yrs and it still makes my mouth water thinking about it!", "created_at": "2025-10-23T22:07:08", "owner": "jensinemackzum", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18417093982119805, "text": "Like my food cooked", "created_at": "2025-10-23T21:25:53", "owner": "josephine.stokes", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18319039294246473, "text": "@ejlucasx", "created_at": "2025-10-23T21:25:37", "owner": "jessicalucas.x", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18105452380617209, "text": "@orlandobfox", "created_at": "2025-10-23T21:08:33", "owner": "travelmorison", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18091189948893753, "text": "Is this where you went??", "created_at": "2025-10-23T20:59:01", "owner": "kim.banha", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17900923050295894, "text": "Looks disgusting", "created_at": "2025-10-23T19:23:25", "owner": "nicocoddy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065048093368628, "text": "No doubt expensive as it's London.", "created_at": "2025-10-23T19:12:37", "owner": "daf430sm", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17968142108970192, "text": "Had a great time there and not terrible pricing considering the location...", "created_at": "2025-10-23T17:45:59", "owner": "rainbowsilks65", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17857340244540490, "text": "Have they tried cooking the steak?", "created_at": "2025-10-23T17:05:15", "owner": "savagestella73", "likes": 19}, {"id": 18115818343551896, "text": "Bland tasteless sauce & vastly overrated in general. Amazing the amount of mugs I see constantly queuing up every day. Went once, never again.", "created_at": "2025-10-23T17:03:25", "owner": "italian_stallion70", "likes": 19}, {"id": 18059049014190621, "text": "Used to be really good! Now it’s all a bit greasy & disappointing 😕", "created_at": "2025-10-23T16:55:12", "owner": "ra.ch998", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18119165302467398, "text": "Heart attack food …grub", "created_at": "2025-10-23T16:49:48", "owner": "rankingrodger", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18097394602741919, "text": "Those profiteroles were not steak and frites", "created_at": "2025-10-23T15:43:12", "owner": "davidxcrowe", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17922872211039444, "text": "I saw 2 dishes in this clip", "created_at": "2025-10-23T15:39:58", "owner": "daudi_kisakye", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17981042369766263, "text": "Raw meat , yummy", "created_at": "2025-10-23T14:50:19", "owner": "fergalsharkey", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17970155390796212, "text": "What’s the green sauce?", "created_at": "2025-10-23T13:00:54", "owner": "rockgod001", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18172783033363232, "text": "Similar in Bordeaux", "created_at": "2025-10-23T12:35:15", "owner": "barn_and_beach", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17984155859875878, "text": "lol only for tourist or people who don’t know what a good steak is", "created_at": "2025-10-23T12:29:48", "owner": "kisskool_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100260034644845, "text": "This place was amazing but not quite as good as it used to be. Too focused on making cash from tourists now.", "created_at": "2025-10-23T12:09:01", "owner": "sussexdogdays", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073883474186601, "text": "I live around the corner but have never been as I can’t stand the queuing system.", "created_at": "2025-10-23T12:00:21", "owner": "luciajaffer_illustration", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18105792994534621, "text": "I love this place and have been going to the one on Throgmorton for years. In fact I will go next week", "created_at": "2025-10-23T11:46:57", "owner": "big_bad_ox", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18132757795482360, "text": "@margotvlaer_", "created_at": "2025-10-23T11:05:02", "owner": "alexw_113", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095824189799902, "text": "IS IT HALAL?", "created_at": "2025-10-23T10:48:24", "owner": "vysam195", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047305844662003, "text": "It’s quite poor, unfortunately", "created_at": "2025-10-23T09:58:46", "owner": "crisfatheroftwo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17976326372934379, "text": "@hannah.scl", "created_at": "2025-10-23T09:41:29", "owner": "max_lowrie", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084860815786659, "text": "What is that green sauce", "created_at": "2025-10-23T09:38:21", "owner": "dominicaustin", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18303517804255448, "text": "@bitetwicefoodreviews", "created_at": "2025-10-23T09:08:40", "owner": "mammy_and_arya", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047421518364402, "text": "I saw like three dishes", "created_at": "2025-10-23T08:29:54", "owner": "translewscent", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072341441225301, "text": "Absolutely not worth it. It was OK at best and a massive wait. You can get better steak and chips in London", "created_at": "2025-10-23T06:40:14", "owner": "theultimatemorgan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17868765759463359, "text": "I counted 2 dishes including the profiteroles", "created_at": "2025-10-23T05:48:53", "owner": "pastynight2025", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18103397056640994, "text": "If they only serve one dish what's the chocolate bullshit", "created_at": "2025-10-23T04:49:23", "owner": "pumpmaximum_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17999685986824776, "text": "Many More desert options than main ........ 6 to 1 i recall", "created_at": "2025-10-23T03:53:30", "owner": "johnyankee083", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18163923052373270, "text": "Doesn't look like the same sauce they serve in France!", "created_at": "2025-10-23T03:19:47", "owner": "paul_at_large", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18051850529319758, "text": "I absolutely am appalled when I see fine dining restaurant in France and they serve you a big pile of fried potatoes😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-10-23T02:46:55", "owner": "scottenrique469", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17902296165289164, "text": "Beef or horse?", "created_at": "2025-10-23T01:34:24", "owner": "gmartine", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18099607810676171, "text": "Used to be a nice date night meal.", "created_at": "2025-10-23T00:25:56", "owner": "gulfcoastfineart", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18029574920729710, "text": "@halloneumann", "created_at": "2025-10-22T23:49:22", "owner": "cath77", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056457356258840, "text": "lower ur expectations to enjoy there and remember my comment after you have gone :)", "created_at": "2025-10-22T23:10:09", "owner": "dt.tanerbektas", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18097619092739899, "text": "City only", "created_at": "2025-10-22T22:37:54", "owner": "tbizzy101", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066988553373032, "text": "Everyone eats steak n frites.. do you always have dessert Mike??", "created_at": "2025-10-22T22:26:48", "owner": "rich.glithero", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17919681096048867, "text": "will they also cook the beef if you ask nicely ?", "created_at": "2025-10-22T21:08:47", "owner": "pr0teus", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18180245860355634, "text": "@lubella81", "created_at": "2025-10-22T20:26:41", "owner": "gavinwiltshire81", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18105004072720515, "text": "Used to have one in Canary Wharf.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T20:17:22", "owner": "al.ison69", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18417136843116740, "text": "Lush", "created_at": "2025-10-22T20:05:32", "owner": "hollandsinaus", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083312591285173, "text": "No, can’t get in, the queue’s too long", "created_at": "2025-10-22T19:40:28", "owner": "pvofthewells", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18530627545003431, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-10-22T18:56:01", "owner": "j_attwoodthomas", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17982243989873564, "text": "I’ve been there before.Overrated !!!", "created_at": "2025-10-22T18:54:31", "owner": "muscaradu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17982913670877667, "text": "I first went about 5 years ago…it was great! Since then, portions became smaller and prices shot up!", "created_at": "2025-10-22T18:30:32", "owner": "gregm1ddleton", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18111794707506542, "text": "I see two dishes there", "created_at": "2025-10-22T18:07:55", "owner": "grbrro", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18046966421398195, "text": "@emilyburton9638", "created_at": "2025-10-22T18:07:18", "owner": "andrewdburton", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18121115410508791, "text": "Please stop advertising its already full enough one day we will no longer be able to get a table", "created_at": "2025-10-22T17:58:46", "owner": "benjiman801", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17845733847594242, "text": "Working class?", "created_at": "2025-10-22T17:53:59", "owner": "daniel_internet", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059102702210562, "text": "Absolutely off the chart food, recommend to everyone", "created_at": "2025-10-22T17:17:31", "owner": "drum.merz", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18207956527310320, "text": "Amazing 🙃🤙", "created_at": "2025-10-22T15:42:35", "owner": "tho_asessl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18028682495735529, "text": "The best", "created_at": "2025-10-22T14:50:41", "owner": "ziabhaloo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17936473320086246, "text": "vreten maar jongens! en daarna weer etalages kijken op de Champs!", "created_at": "2025-10-22T14:33:04", "owner": "onceinabluemonday", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17924366160151274, "text": "@mewalfie", "created_at": "2025-10-22T14:04:27", "owner": "helenhlb", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18112391311568156, "text": "Explain what does ‘served twice for each person’ mean?? 2 portions of Steak and chips for each Diner doesn’t make sense??", "created_at": "2025-10-22T11:19:19", "owner": "cfos027", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047143955663343, "text": "Hey 😊 thanks so much for this! I was there 🤗 that day. It was my first time there and L’entrecote did not disappoint.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T08:33:02", "owner": "ferozashababi", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18111083485601621, "text": "@archiesd07", "created_at": "2025-10-22T06:06:35", "owner": "joeboy_1981", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18161062951377606, "text": "Should be a life motto... \"Do one thing, do it well\"", "created_at": "2025-10-21T23:31:18", "owner": "labtnt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17996775344832453, "text": "Yeah it’s great. They give you a second helping.", "created_at": "2025-10-21T23:24:02", "owner": "danbronks", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17851680435569946, "text": "They definitely have a full menu, but the steak frites is most popular", "created_at": "2025-10-21T22:47:47", "owner": "samantha.sdp", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17869830147459428, "text": "It’s a shit hole with terrible food just go to Paris instead", "created_at": "2025-10-21T19:47:28", "owner": "hamish06", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18116521267546712, "text": "WAIT STOP. WHAT IS THAT SECOND DISH I SAW SERVED WITH THE BROWN STUFF?! HEY ANSWER ME :U LIARS!", "created_at": "2025-10-21T19:31:57", "owner": "tacotimepablo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18343036483200625, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-21T19:04:24", "owner": "rachelbelinfante", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18048439307348248, "text": "Over rated salty chips and chewy steak 😬", "created_at": "2025-10-20T23:34:37", "owner": "loveandlaughter_20", "likes": 55}, {"id": 18116145739531373, "text": "The tables are way too close, it's virtually 1 long table 😳", "created_at": "2025-10-20T02:35:19", "owner": "welshwandererau", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17860877607510641, "text": "Hey  I really enjoy your content! I’m a professional video editor and I help creators & brands make engaging Reels and ads with smooth transitions, subtitles, and cinematic effects. Your style would look amazing with this kind of editing. If you’d like, I’d love to share some samples with you.", "created_at": "2025-10-19T18:03:41", "owner": "editsbykrish03", "likes": 2}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["londonrestaurants", "francefood", "marylebone"]},
{"media_id": 3775823655130474273, "shortcode": "DRma5vykach", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRma5vykach/", "taken_at": "2025-11-28T12:34:37", "caption": "( 貼文分享 ) 執到隨濃煙風吹來的功課薄封面，希望呢位同學及家人平安🙏\n\n來源 : Melody Chau ▶️ 大埔人大埔谷 / Facebook Group", "owner_username": "stand.for.hk", "owner_id": "3267973544", "likes": 38654, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphImage", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0119_DRma5vykach\\DRma5vykach_20251128_123437.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": 17916245301237641, "text": "大埔官立中學已被殺校十多年\n相信這位「同學」已起碼30多歲了\n希望這「同學」平安🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:51:58", "owner": "edwardfung_english", "likes": 6240}, {"id": 18032741237722193, "text": "啊!!!! 同人好珍貴㗎😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:15:41", "owner": "kankanquentin", "likes": 607}, {"id": 17896291854357137, "text": "想知那本同人誌的內容🫣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:55:09", "owner": "fumizuki_stardust", "likes": 1671}, {"id": 18111806236606363, "text": "希望呢位同學仔同佢嘅家人平安啦。", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:37:12", "owner": "lawrencewcy0527", "likes": 506}, {"id": 17922665877189258, "text": "同校人希望佢平安🫡", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:22:55", "owner": "trowa_kong", "likes": 85}, {"id": 18140932513458755, "text": "🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻祝平安", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:38:34", "owner": "_niko.luv.fa_", "likes": 42}, {"id": 18086367121817586, "text": "慘…btw，係同人誌小說…", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:50:38", "owner": "judgegundam2018", "likes": 361}, {"id": 18083136362013024, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:59:39", "owner": "judychung04", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18147924130431052, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:45:22", "owner": "nicole62135280", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18053525897659504, "text": "好彩人冇事，同人小說嘅心血冇咗雖然好可惜，但日後仍有機會創作", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:23:48", "owner": "elysia_kawaiidesu", "likes": 77}, {"id": 18062834270404173, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:59:17", "owner": "yokamjai", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17933321738998511, "text": "變咗古董😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:17:20", "owner": "imbigmike415", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18029473085752415, "text": "同人誌……雖然唔係某坑既巨，但都寫過幾篇同人文 ，同幾個同擔岀過下同人誌。希望呢位太太平安🥹", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:10:42", "owner": "bier_sappirus", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18100366207744451, "text": "keep住，有機會 比番佢。 歷史記錄", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:58:03", "owner": "wgsx9", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17998106102839103, "text": "02年1月12日", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:48:18", "owner": "_mict", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18439798033103671, "text": "睇到呢張心好up😞感覺好似人已喇去🥹不在了😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:34:42", "owner": "kobeee_leonggg_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17852121957592145, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:10:28", "owner": "mmmmagmag", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17842404609631897, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:12:49", "owner": "hunggeeying", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17928873369154157, "text": "祝平安", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:37:17", "owner": "d10sd10s", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18030221561760638, "text": "🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:33:30", "owner": "micha3lso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868589380416033, "text": "我老豆間中學💀🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:45:09", "owner": "no_name_080615", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17847905772609133, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:15:19", "owner": "kwanbol", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18384896983146515, "text": "平安", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:54:19", "owner": "_tomato.68", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18086168459496753, "text": "唉", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:41:27", "owner": "thomas.hist.geo", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17987841011910441, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:45:35", "owner": "mh_studio_hk", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18317845855223058, "text": "😢😢😢😢 this is beyond heartbreaking.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:34:16", "owner": "pupa_poki", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18058177763294886, "text": "為什麼我本習作簿封面咁受歡迎🫣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:17:49", "owner": "stopptsang", "likes": 1925}, {"id": 18102232369668850, "text": "吉人天相", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:54:19", "owner": "mingfai.lam.1232", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891157387245594, "text": "記得前晚fb大埔gp見過呢張相，個post好似話呢位同學係平安無事的", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:41:36", "owner": "seeme__everywhere", "likes": 796}, {"id": 17977799174957100, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:11:09", "owner": "jewjitsuuuu", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18320728438173619, "text": "Rip Ye", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:31:11", "owner": "jewjitsuuuu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17986428437911385, "text": "民建聯黃碧嬌，胡健民，黑箱作業😡😡，害到人家破人亡！願逝者安息，獲救者平安，天佑香港🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:36:52", "owner": "singh0nz", "likes": 281}, {"id": 18298746817259266, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:40:30", "owner": "jewjitsuuuu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086994200048894, "text": "同人⋯⋯", "created_at": "2025-12-13T12:37:06", "owner": "imnotalvin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116260333502623, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-12-10T04:32:56", "owner": "kelvinkwokhk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089506829507762, "text": "AI？", "created_at": "2025-12-04T11:01:14", "owner": "imfrancis2013", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866125531506860, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-12-02T05:57:55", "owner": "simonchong2000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087086752976274, "text": "希望佢平安無事 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-30T22:55:14", "owner": "wpk2047", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910330069255895, "text": "望👀呢位同學平安無事啦.🫰🫰", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:59:23", "owner": "cheong.chun.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18202256416319076, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:15:25", "owner": "ka._.t.en", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074019863206848, "text": "Me 沙官中", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:30:53", "owner": "fion.a8734", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063207791528743, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:07:21", "owner": "chowcaini", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062416649443279, "text": "用學校note寫同人,同我一樣。希望佢平安", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:46:51", "owner": "_noah_chen_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847458013588071, "text": "校友😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:35:50", "owner": "charisss_c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136823335419292, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "create