text": "\"YOU WILL NEVER FIND A GIRL LIKE ME! \"", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:08:07", "owner": "khavarmamishova8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058375511307647, "text": "Can i take one?", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:58:33", "owner": "vladimirahad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065285825428145, "text": "Fuck off", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:55:25", "owner": "supcuz379", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18555272152033034, "text": "😮🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:32:37", "owner": "sanyaok07", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080788979164593, "text": "Every shot has an address", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:25:13", "owner": "kobicohe1515", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927389128173698, "text": "\"aa\"", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:24:04", "owner": "zarftamlayicisi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920538550198932, "text": "Pure Nordic blood", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:12:03", "owner": "rob.gerb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18248933695293807, "text": "weird comments", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:06:42", "owner": "2dollydoll2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849896020606997, "text": "What are you talking about? Half y’all look like him", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:02:34", "owner": "averybaker_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012400058807060, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:45:52", "owner": "sancakwalsh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17860665495552067, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:36:13", "owner": "___matteo___9", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18369848350095749, "text": "Dads got the secret sauce", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:32:37", "owner": "thyshallsmoketh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128601391500805, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:27:10", "owner": "j0nny.rs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176490400364847, "text": "ای نفوذی کصکش", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:25:46", "owner": "amo.21993", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048795455449137, "text": "They all gonna date black guys", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:22:25", "owner": "zillo520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860211895487118, "text": "dad got a magic dih", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:23:42", "owner": "chenpingan94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917910721081146, "text": "Me gustó la de ojos azules🫢", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:19:16", "owner": "b.randoncs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18325115404246074, "text": "\"aaaall that he wants, is another baby... to beee a son. aaaall that he wants, is a sooon hee-ee-eeh\" 🎶🎵🎶😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:09:09", "owner": "johnny_inflagrante", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030049286772405, "text": "This is the premium side of Instagram! 😮🤩✨ Please tell dad to not stop the production, cuz he can save the Europe by himself! 💪🏻🤩", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:46:17", "owner": "viku_the_best", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074211491601431, "text": "Sería una pena que alguna llegase a procrear para un marrón xd", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:25:42", "owner": "lmfc.00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18537410548008372, "text": "I were supposed to watch twice before I realized that there’s Dad on the right 🙈", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:23:16", "owner": "funtehnik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082836242038011, "text": "Oi 3rd girl are u ugly?", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:21:54", "owner": "ex__spirit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091552780740398, "text": "I want to see dad", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:57:51", "owner": "tasnemayob", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847622002590952, "text": "for my mental health, this is AI", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:54:55", "owner": "amalia.sdlr_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099466909695230, "text": "I looked at other pictures- their hair got a little help from a bottle of dye.  My girls can highlight their hair to look like that.  These are beautiful girls, however the comments in this feed made my stomach crawl.  They are NOT superior human beings, just people.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:31:29", "owner": "nonnasfix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109391428558989, "text": "snow bunny haven", "created_at": "2025-12-06T14:40:15", "owner": "jaxi3k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182521693358894, "text": "😍😍😍😍❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-06T14:01:04", "owner": "wladimiro1974", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946899138940673, "text": "House of Targarians🤤", "created_at": "2025-12-06T13:58:29", "owner": "callmejzee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051609794372268, "text": "keep up the good work", "created_at": "2025-12-06T13:57:02", "owner": "tamas_papp_10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052474364365176, "text": "Note the song they chose… it’s more meta than you think", "created_at": "2025-12-06T13:34:35", "owner": "tomflowers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094747657710939, "text": "AI fam", "created_at": "2025-12-06T13:31:31", "owner": "kuzulankuzu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967136950002773, "text": "Allahim sanki cennet bura", "created_at": "2025-12-06T13:21:31", "owner": "wfurkanmr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105535672643305, "text": "You all look like your dad wym", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:55:43", "owner": "yobtdub", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126656575507227, "text": "Purity and perfection.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:40:54", "owner": "overland_4runner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065957333577482, "text": "fucking beautiful looking family", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:38:20", "owner": "brandonsexton12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103375483663353, "text": "Keep working mate", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:23:19", "owner": "jstlegendary", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058709477304399, "text": "Ctrl+C/Ctrl+V", "created_at": "2025-12-06T11:58:30", "owner": "henri_payen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058855052289985, "text": "KEEP THE TRADITION PLEASE. NEVER MIX 👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-06T11:04:36", "owner": "tsa1aa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934467610106073, "text": "To all of the people in the comments confused about the gene part, what they meant was chromosomes. The dad is the only one that can carry the y chromosome which is needed to make a male, the woman cannot carry a y chromosome; therefore, women cannot be the cause of a male child.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:58:45", "owner": "rascalb0b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065795669434379, "text": "I would argue that they are some of the most beautiful specimens I have ever laid eyes upon. If not thee most. Those are the types of women that I look at in public, then turn a my head away and down because I know for a fact that I'm not good enough in any aspect.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:56:48", "owner": "rascalb0b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053809634669792, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:05:20", "owner": "__.rigel.__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895157275223680, "text": "Big fan of your work sir", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:33:59", "owner": "shadow.__.uchiha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060507500248546, "text": "Dude is in trouble 😳", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:10:33", "owner": "adrian.boogie.9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098115652874233, "text": "In France we say : Je vais prendre vos 4 snap", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:06:43", "owner": "_adrianoff_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17858929926557592, "text": "crtl C crtl V", "created_at": "2025-12-06T08:45:08", "owner": "dhr_bos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924645535187865, "text": "Are they Norwegians or not", "created_at": "2025-12-06T08:04:00", "owner": "herosandnna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925103776178389, "text": "I mean... The dad has the same exact features as the mom so I don't think there is a difference wether they did stand a chance or not. U js wanna join the trend do it right", "created_at": "2025-12-06T07:10:55", "owner": "bobby._urhobby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103022749709229, "text": "I know a dictator named Adolf who would love your family he believes you’re “pure” whatever that means… has this scary hatred for Jews though.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T06:31:36", "owner": "jonww__19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950854032917579, "text": "Dad’s got the magic formula.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T06:26:17", "owner": "scr.br1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884607121410285, "text": "Ctrl V Ctrl C", "created_at": "2025-12-06T05:59:31", "owner": "ja_____ka_____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18348913045202031, "text": "Lucky father😝", "created_at": "2025-12-06T05:48:46", "owner": "brandon.polizzi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18511848499067050, "text": "Dude should open a sperm bank.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T05:41:57", "owner": "michael_d_scott", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909281266266784, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-12-06T05:31:17", "owner": "phoenixcv7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933731659132747, "text": "Abi baba da sarışın mavi gözlü değil mi işte", "created_at": "2025-12-06T04:42:27", "owner": "muhtelif.hiciv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079189061332233, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T04:30:43", "owner": "infinityaura12042003", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115047175503387, "text": "Perfect family❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-06T04:15:01", "owner": "madd_maxx90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845754292604175, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-12-06T03:43:50", "owner": "tegakrambualam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18318212899218930, "text": "Генофонд 🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-06T03:32:16", "owner": "doctor.borisova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086495549478712, "text": "Tô pensando em me mudar daqui…… 🎶🎶🎼", "created_at": "2025-12-06T02:49:26", "owner": "jorloan1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916999075229011, "text": "He would say u are perfect. If u kniw what i mean", "created_at": "2025-12-06T01:55:55", "owner": "w0jtek.10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086009387068310, "text": "How about wanting a career, or a homeless volunteer job, or wanting to be a civil rights attorney - anything... really lady????", "created_at": "2025-12-06T01:55:41", "owner": "grovessheri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897479278205840, "text": "Dad could single-handedly fight off the invasion of Europe.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T01:52:38", "owner": "_coffee_fiend_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106343176563981, "text": "That’s exactly what adolf was thinking about", "created_at": "2025-12-06T01:39:03", "owner": "the___benito43", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18210964675311606, "text": "💍 precious 🧙‍♂️🧝‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-12-06T01:20:09", "owner": "m_zaitsu_m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079832566930375, "text": 