236619254879, "text": "Sisters Lisbon", "created_at": "2025-09-28T00:22:19", "owner": "aline_sampraiera", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044817734344624, "text": "Damn bro is good", "created_at": "2025-09-28T00:18:58", "owner": "mateotd._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077441893861153, "text": "The factory cannot stop", "created_at": "2025-09-28T00:15:13", "owner": "___lhvieira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18361349092083406, "text": "Make one for me", "created_at": "2025-09-27T23:50:49", "owner": "goofyahhbro69420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091205197772451, "text": "creepy", "created_at": "2025-09-27T23:12:45", "owner": "dan.jacs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18236654263291677, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-27T23:08:35", "owner": "andrijakuvac4", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088047178888544, "text": "actually dads genes did try", "created_at": "2025-09-27T23:04:11", "owner": "danielcaesarian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999238923818281, "text": "Actually the father‘s chromosomes determine the gender giving either an X chromosome to make females like in this case or a Y chromosome for males. The mother is obviously always XX, hence, she can only give the X chromosome. \n.\nAlso the gene for blonde hair for example is recessive meaning if any of the parents werent blonde likely the majority of the kids would also not be blonde.", "created_at": "2025-09-27T22:53:09", "owner": "dan_2ko3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18356731267080297, "text": "Bitxxes factory", "created_at": "2025-09-27T22:46:47", "owner": "thegodwhorulesak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18343136170200866, "text": "Smash", "created_at": "2025-09-27T22:36:17", "owner": "hertog78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18282184249277423, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-27T22:34:52", "owner": "niko_kukhianidze", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064854101583187, "text": "The dad's genes are what decides if ur a boy or girl bru. U only can get an X chromosome from the mom, and she can't give another chromosome. The dad either gives another x or a Y chromosome. So rly the only reason ur a girl is bc ur dad's genes stood a chance", "created_at": "2025-09-27T21:00:49", "owner": "m119_howitzer", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17938428198078536, "text": "A little about myself: sharply charming, attractive, very sociable, not high-minded, a little interesting... How to say... sad and cheerful, I can be bold, and also gentle, rude. A little sweet... and shy) I almost forgot, very handsome😁 I'm in love with you all ❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-27T20:39:03", "owner": "zulambyakk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095915755678324, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-09-27T20:21:57", "owner": "eliaswue24", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18053963801556057, "text": "He is blonde with blue eyes wtf you mean they didnt stand a chance.", "created_at": "2025-09-27T20:08:32", "owner": "nikehatesthem", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18077148320082177, "text": "Hitlers favorite kind of ppl", "created_at": "2025-09-27T20:00:01", "owner": "uhhhhidk2025", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18334042393205865, "text": "Siblings or dating taken to a whole different level", "created_at": "2025-09-27T19:23:21", "owner": "matysart_and_stuff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982371498859347, "text": "Thank you for your service sir", "created_at": "2025-09-27T19:12:23", "owner": "liam_shusha", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18005707244641295, "text": "👱‍♀️👱‍♀️👱‍♀️👱‍♀️👱‍♀️🍎", "created_at": "2025-09-27T19:06:21", "owner": "jasm1ne.__k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078464594078709, "text": "The Austrian painter's dream", "created_at": "2025-09-27T18:54:51", "owner": "mikeguzman22", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18220786336305987, "text": "Keep the factory on 👏", "created_at": "2025-09-27T18:40:29", "owner": "paul.pjh", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17883281205381481, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-09-27T18:15:56", "owner": "lylacharlezed", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18140149252433460, "text": "Holy", "created_at": "2025-09-27T18:15:04", "owner": "sasho._.010", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17857406916525971, "text": "Damn Nice cum bro", "created_at": "2025-09-27T18:05:57", "owner": "elpolo_zgr", "likes