{"media_id": 3737335883427221064, "shortcode": "DPdry9KAA5I", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DPdry9KAA5I/", "taken_at": "2025-10-06T10:06:57", "caption": "英国和陕西有事儿。#uk #shanxi #china", "owner_username": "roxycatsis", "owner_id": "63165672796", "likes": 11545, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0121_DPdry9KAA5I\\DPdry9KAA5I_20251006_100657.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18115292275468346, "text": "：都有很多中國的文物💀", "created_at": "2025-10-06T14:42:12", "owner": "_yhw.py", "likes": 3466}, {"id": 18030165701520005, "text": "那上了延安大学等于上了剑桥牛津", "created_at": "2025-10-07T04:13:32", "owner": "thisisklkoh", "likes": 520}, {"id": 18313759249171649, "text": "陕西好吃的很多，英国不好吃的很多😄", "created_at": "2025-10-06T16:26:32", "owner": "hank_su", "likes": 1287}, {"id": 18054311966267035, "text": "英国有女王，陕西有女皇武则天", "created_at": "2025-10-11T05:50:34", "owner": "miaoz34", "likes": 118}, {"id": 18056239961224404, "text": "都有自己的钟楼", "created_at": "2025-10-07T17:51:21", "owner": "atw.md", "likes": 33}, {"id": 18080301962314071, "text": "英国有汉堡包，陕西有肉夹馍。", "created_at": "2025-10-08T04:08:15", "owner": "aviciirui_zhang", "likes": 302}, {"id": 18131246587463512, "text": "姐你瞧这大实话说的 都很多中国文物给我笑到了", "created_at": "2025-10-08T00:49:02", "owner": "youghvaudough", "likes": 80}, {"id": 18243334705295919, "text": "最后一个梗，不是西安人get不到哒：当年的西安站前面 哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-10-23T18:42:53", "owner": "jh_li1009", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17983355915746557, "text": "挺自卑 秦国统一天下 英国能够統一欧洲吗？", "created_at": "2025-10-06T17:17:55", "owner": "shinnshyong_w", "likes": 130}, {"id": 17861232111437416, "text": "没觉得陕西跟英国像，真要跟欧洲哪里对标，那还得是普鲁士😎", "created_at": "2025-10-07T17:02:06", "owner": "ysq1447", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17859689148522474, "text": "笑死！太牛了", "created_at": "2025-10-14T17:09:06", "owner": "puyu_retreat", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17876218524444549, "text": "仅有的区别是在英国地铁不会有人扒衣服😍", "created_at": "2025-12-05T20:07:11", "owner": "cookiemacchi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18097246411673439, "text": "天气也差不多，上个月去了7天下雨5天", "created_at": "2025-10-10T15:11:03", "owner": "violetakacj", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18081218488991768, "text": "中国文物我笑晕了😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T10:47:46", "owner": "cris.bibibi", "likes": 152}, {"id": 18223570432306450, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-06T14:16:45", "owner": "jack_in_wd", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17895727206324799, "text": "陕不列颠不是白叫的", "created_at": "2025-10-06T22:15:33", "owner": "limeuuu", "likes": 16}, {"id": 17983383644872715, "text": "笑死", "created_at": "2025-10-06T14:57:27", "owner": "cynthia414", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18094095973704042, "text": "在英国的陕西人笑死", "created_at": "2025-10-06T20:49:44", "owner": "layla_bai_", "likes": 26}, {"id": 18026372321723186, "text": "大秦列颠 集合！", "created_at": "2025-10-06T23:48:42", "owner": "troy_bai", "likes": 48}, {"id": 18065135912075970, "text": "@pappchristian @wenjuan.xue.754 @grays012 evidence for that debate 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-10T11:01:41", "owner": "ruomeibai", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061438130570419, "text": "英国有国王 陕西也出了个皇帝", "created_at": "2025-10-13T05:20:36", "owner": "jam833_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18062038121139776, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-18T14:09:19", "owner": "augmastudio", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18539477833047565, "text": "I refuse to be a Londoner pls no 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-12T21:19:44", "owner": "the_shix", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17974318562930208, "text": "不如英国并入陕西吧", "created_at": "2025-10-09T17:07:09", "owner": "sharon_qian_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17925427305114812, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-10-06T19:05:36", "owner": "liuxxawwww", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18102896281549131, "text": "英國為祖國神聖不可分割的一部分🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-06T17:51:40", "owner": "popo.911911", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18106784080606106, "text": "最后一句骂的真脏", "created_at": "2025-10-06T22:35:13", "owner": "timmyyaooooo", "likes": 37}, {"id": 18075873623275081, "text": "都有很多中國文物 我快笑死", "created_at": "2025-10-23T17:52:02", "owner": "macau5566", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18537895228052511, "text": "Both have lots of coal..", "created_at": "2025-10-12T11:14:27", "owner": "robert_h_beckett", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17962409189994119, "text": "HAHAHAHAHHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHHAHAHAHA", "created_at": "2025-10-11T22:57:56", "owner": "qaqueena", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113465701547324, "text": "都有很多穆斯林（x", "created_at": "2025-10-08T10:50:36", "owner": "k_m_75035", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18015908144609442, "text": "四捨五入我認為她說的沒問題", "created_at": "2025-10-07T08:59:51", "owner": "jokbjdjwhxhx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18146175715435278, "text": "赶紧往回走，发金条了。回来碟面", "created_at": "2025-12-12T08:01:43", "owner": "kaixibli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138419860462443, "text": "伦敦地铁应该没有保安会扒女乘客的衣服啦。", "created_at": "2025-12-07T01:09:12", "owner": "chifanisfun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028488215775471, "text": "你武汉人吗", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:16:35", "owner": "2cats_wumaobao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889050703261556, "text": "哈哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:04:05", "owner": "luxuriantrill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547064866041759, "text": "陕西小偷多如狗！", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:29:57", "owner": "best_22888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947667585932866, "text": "地圖也太像", "created_at": "2025-11-19T11:38:06", "owner": "_ello_there_mate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110998738591132, "text": "西安火车站小偷也不少", "created_at": "2025-11-18T19:58:40", "owner": "melon_character", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18187852096337560, "text": "都是蛮夷", "created_at": "2025-11-17T15:52:51", "owner": "lifei568888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062382515178441, "text": "西交利物浦，", "created_at": "2025-11-11T13:35:03", "owner": "davidfence_666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077591371925873, "text": "额真的是不行咧", "created_at": "2025-11-09T04:07:39", "owner": "arianaforgood_14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068260289458551, "text": "你很厲害耶", "created_at": "2025-11-07T23:55:57", "owner": "lialaviva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074179802464793, "text": "最后一个笑死我了", "created_at": "2025-11-07T19:21:13", "owner": "titianandot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938601829089489, "text": "英国最近火车还出事了", "created_at": "2025-11-04T01:22:00", "owner": "gu.7080", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849980863553781, "text": "😂Hahahaha", "created_at": "2025-11-04T01:21:02", "owner": "gu.7080", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880263397310157, "text": "终于有人说了 谢谢你 真的", "created_at": "2025-11-03T19:49:31", "owner": "dicot.22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055896755298273, "text": "小偷确实也特别多🥹😅😆", "created_at": "2025-11-03T12:43:26", "owner": "guestband", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18243881881293733, "text": "太好了，2025年在ig确诊荷兰人", "created_at": "2025-11-03T12:35:38", "owner": "l_love_milktea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045536060427512, "text": "陕西人很难忍住不来评论哈哈哈哈😂", "created_at": "2025-11-02T17:21:14", "owner": "xiaoliang_dong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078705968324500, "text": "西安小偷也是出了名的", "created_at": "2025-11-02T12:32:41", "owner": "joe_shaw0617", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908202139254636, "text": "最后一句点睛之笔", "created_at": "2025-11-02T03:41:33", "owner": "hanhouhou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983956047876769, "text": "我有个留子哥们，炸鱼薯条吃了一个礼拜之后绷不住了问我怎么做番茄炒蛋", "created_at": "2025-11-01T14:10:15", "owner": "rafetusswinhoei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948306916028494, "text": "桌子上有一碗42号混凝土", "created_at": "2025-10-31T14:39:55", "owner": "daniellam1992", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928324180128085, "text": "两边都有很多穆斯林哥们😂", "created_at": "2025-10-31T03:23:03", "owner": "beluta233", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939317932097287, "text": "脑洞清奇哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-10-30T06:49:50", "owner": "tanggishereid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18363413494095353, "text": "avg chinese comedian jokes tbh", "created_at": "2025-10-28T23:28:10", "owner": "lijiahua_whitewashed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956058696877979, "text": "最后一句。。。爆笑如雷家人们", "created_at": "2025-10-26T07:42:41", "owner": "ledeng16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145370686425844, "text": "😂😂😂😂❤️❤️❤️❤️👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-10-25T19:21:34", "owner": "wliuspe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024625694770335, "text": "那我就在伦敦住😂", "created_at": "2025-10-25T08:27:11", "owner": "__luming", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945553906052927, "text": "陕西小偷也特别多，还很多外国小偷，我发现小偷摸我兜，骂他还得说英语", "created_at": "2025-10-24T20:14:53", "owner": "mogumogu_mushroom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18534142639033163, "text": "+507 6451 3817", "created_at": "2025-10-23T08:29:21", "owner": "hxiq123b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888495892238692, "text": "长这么大 第一次发现自己是伦敦人😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T03:37:53", "owner": "vir.vw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158947651385774, "text": "啊哈哈哈啊哈哈啊哈哈😂😂😂🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-21T03:05:09", "owner": "queenxxm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171865111365040, "text": "西安小偷也多哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-10-20T00:31:33", "owner": "zixuwangly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049236608661957, "text": "有道理", "created_at": "2025-10-19T18:07:42", "owner": "yu_xiaoxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905657110125785, "text": "这个解说到位了。😂", "created_at": "2025-10-19T17:43:17", "owner": "zhangzhiengg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080578477853860, "text": "陕西人牛批 陕西是全世界最ning的", "created_at": "2025-10-19T02:57:24", "owner": "feng_yyyyuhao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076222919331597, "text": "你是哪人啊？这么有柴😂", "created_at": "2025-10-18T14:50:31", "owner": "vivianxu2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876185425328519, "text": "逻辑满分💯", "created_at": "2025-10-18T05:43:41", "owner": "unikjeniniu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055115246284385, "text": "西安曾经的别称👉🏻贼城😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-17T06:36:38", "owner": "borjigitkhongirad", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18082655410976289, "text": "我笑的不行了", "created_at": "2025-10-17T04:08:40", "owner": "gloria.and.bunnies05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071437060965176, "text": "本陕西人觉得你说的太对啦！", "created_at": "2025-10-15T08:24:04", "owner": "mufun_lee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097987948679317, "text": "笑飞了😂等我下次去陕西我就可以用上这个视频了", "created_at": "2025-10-14T13:40:20", "owner": "yss1925h", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18314260822172066, "text": "@im_kerine 所以我们去的是伦敦", "created_at": "2025-10-14T06:02:00", "owner": "shiwu.1215", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074688808931259, "text": "碑林童话", "created_at": "2025-10-14T04:14:55", "owner": "tuyyue9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109541404573290, "text": "额贼！", "created_at": "2025-10-13T05:19:23", "owner": "sddx_yzjxffelx_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17897391024315619, "text": "陕西西安人在此！", "created_at": "2025-10-13T02:44:08", "owner": "ma.niubi12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984040080860985, "text": "陕西人报道！", "created_at": "2025-10-13T02:43:59", "owner": "ma.niubi12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072722867180424, "text": "额贼 乡党", "created_at": "2025-10-12T05:51:35", "owner": "kangmeikuaipao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079477598085205, "text": "吃饱了再说吧，貌似中国文化吃饭时候不说话才礼貌", "created_at": "2025-10-12T01:19:34", "owner": "dj11211806", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058599824533919, "text": "最后一句大家可能没get到。西安以前有中国巴黎之说（贼都xj人）", "created_at": "2025-10-11T23:21:51", "owner": "num9527", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843538066585027, "text": "《都有很多中国文物》这一块😂", "created_at": "2025-10-11T06:28:55", "owner": "jingen_98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892327612346927, "text": "神经哦😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-10T12:12:43", "owner": "xiaoyuansunsun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064626437525038, "text": "哇很厉害😁😁 @jyjy_sophie", "created_at": "2025-10-10T10:30:04", "owner": "mac_n_cheese_please", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130732708475723, "text": "有点东西", "created_at": "2025-10-10T09:33:08", "owner": "em.lee.la", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854087110551002, "text": "连小偷多都同频了😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-09T22:09:46", "owner": "dandan.d.d.z", "likes": 20}, {"id": 18055213589558826, "text": "西安小偷也….", "created_at": "2025-10-09T05:00:25", "owner": "xyzjerry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046107773380848, "text": "我信了", "created_at": "2025-10-09T04:06:15", "owner": "miukshake", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081456764512386, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-08T23:14:10", "owner": "chefmeowdork", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110819155501142, "text": "我记得前几天看到有人说西安小偷也多😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-08T23:05:10", "owner": "pear_with_salt_", "likes": 84}, {"id": 18532524667063131, "text": "It’s ’the empire on which the sun never sets’. Well, change to past tense now: set", "created_at": "2025-10-08T14:45:39", "owner": "chrsrdpth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982970457909257, "text": "一个是小米一个是android", "created_at": "2025-10-08T13:30:05", "owner": "bagelclouds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044633999390302, "text": "小偷都多😂", "created_at": "2025-10-08T11:43:12", "owner": "tigre.zhang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974288322940135, "text": "河南绷不住了哈哈哈哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-10-08T10:21:22", "owner": "talia_ccccccc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866026033397117, "text": "秦人集合！", "created_at": "2025-10-08T10:07:16", "owner": "jacobwangooo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060252725411166, "text": "陝西盜墓賊也特別多", "created_at": "2025-10-08T10:00:15", "owner": "choo_011116", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094232131695116, "text": "英国好多穆斯林小偷\n西安好多新疆小偷", "created_at": "2025-10-08T02:43:41", "owner": "bwv_drawer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884189575259935, "text": "最后一句  此时无声胜有声😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-08T02:29:54", "owner": "chny565127", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106429423611378, "text": "西安小偷也多", "created_at": "2025-10-08T00:45:17", "owner": "barcalan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094965943819021, "text": "e shui si lan, Han song 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-07T17:26:53", "owner": "lasyzhyt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060351296573057, "text": "@minoroffense_", "created_at": "2025-10-07T16:49:07", "owner": "tin_wai_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092726578828523, "text": "西安河南人也不少😂", "created_at": "2025-10-07T16:07:47", "owner": "chinam.leung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986934633730342, "text": "唯一共同点就是穆斯林都很多", "created_at": "2025-10-07T09:37:43", "owner": "ma.ke24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033749015709488, "text": "傻B", "created_at": "2025-10-07T06:09:43", "owner": "blacknoon_03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904683490128072, "text": "西安小偷也特別多 西安以前叫賊都😂", "created_at": "2025-10-07T06:09:09", "owner": "jasperyik0406", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18129311620464267, "text": "哈哈哈哈😂", "created_at": "2025-10-07T05:05:59", "owner": "txxiaoyu7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376801759145864, "text": "西安小偷也挺多的哈哈哈", "created_at": "2025-10-07T04:28:01", "owner": "jasminnotjasmin", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18068771438021260, "text": "不是应该倒过来吗？国庆节陕西挤不下了吧？", "created_at": "2025-10-07T01:19:15", "owner": "oliverrobo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848453326574174, "text": "你这个工作放着让我们东北人来", "created_at": "2025-10-07T00:11:30", "owner": "jojo992378703", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064952663361658, "text": "我们是老乡", "created_at": "2025-10-06T21:58:14", "owner": "pete_r2661", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022536923569043, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-06T21:41:29", "owner": "alakazam2047", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18106895377598274, "text": "这娘们在国内要是红了是我极少数认为应该红的货😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T19:42:17", "owner": "tumschewy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084838594745904, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-06T18:45:10", "owner": "kang.rw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096757996735549, "text": "说话好像陶白白", "created_at": "2025-10-06T16:47:44", "owner": "cardinal9419", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861390310499449, "text": "你不会真的陕西人吧 哈哈", "created_at": "2025-10-06T10:52:22", "owner": "mrzzzzzzzzzz10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982759452748660, "text": "猫姐猫姐！！！嘿嘿嘿", "created_at": "2025-10-06T10:13:06", "owner": "xiaoqin_01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073432334334754, "text": "So true", "created_at": "2025-10-06T10:10:01", "owner": "isitture", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["uk", "shanxi", "china"]},
{"media_id": 3760586408009624228, "shortcode": "DQwSWnkk2qk", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DQwSWnkk2qk/", "taken_at": "2025-11-07T12:00:00", "caption": "ya she's defo ready after kicking me out of the house and trying for another baby #ying #trend", "owner_username": "yinternet05", "owner_id": "74276292337", "likes": 119595, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0122_DQwSWnkk2qk\\DQwSWnkk2qk_20251107_120000.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18081468791010788, "text": "She almost wanted to crashout 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-07T13:21:55", "owner": "tharvman_", "likes": 28395}, {"id": 18075407761957096, "text": "Labubu", "created_at": "2025-11-07T12:33:27", "owner": "daimon_sw", "likes": 33811}, {"id": 17890841589243858, "text": "\"labubu\" im crying 😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-19T00:37:03", "owner": "jiangdichen06", "likes": 5167}, {"id": 18160272769361752, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:05:10", "owner": "leoaberg19", "likes": 3383}, {"id": 18049848440387749, "text": "“Mmm… OII OHII OHIII!!! UYAEAEEEE AAHA-aaaAA”", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:07:27", "owner": "ritikadivakar", "likes": 290}, {"id": 17933252816991120, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-10T14:30:18", "owner": "shiilinnnnn", "likes": 2513}, {"id": 18097777099746441, "text": "My mom will slap me 0-100kmh in 0.6 sec", "created_at": "2025-11-10T13:17:15", "owner": "nvshln", "likes": 11615}, {"id": 18146492230437205, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:10:46", "owner": "ayyinrealife", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17968324718981594, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T14:49:55", "owner": "zuriel_seong", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18101012002730125, "text": "You got lucky if my mom was your mom that will be your final destination", "created_at": "2025-11-07T15:02:56", "owner": "_lian_xiaoyu", "likes": 3332}, {"id": 18075050204225523, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-14T04:36:31", "owner": "fwpeace12", "likes": 1111}, {"id": 18052994279661418, "text": "She was so close to disowning u 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-04T07:30:07", "owner": "irah_me919", "likes": 246}, {"id": 17927584905151031, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-09T04:52:57", "owner": "indahp_002", "likes": 2571}, {"id": 17870720910462447, "text": "She was holding almost a liter of milk dude", "created_at": "2025-11-12T15:25:36", "owner": "gupt_vyakti", "likes": 2022}, {"id": 17873814372447743, "text": "Labubu 💀💀", "created_at": "2025-11-15T19:34:46", "owner": "_that_david_cameron_", "likes": 28}, {"id": 18057128960279945, "text": "la bu bu", "created_at": "2025-11-10T15:07:40", "owner": "fungzao__", "likes": 45}, {"id": 17946667515060622, "text": "\"labubu\" 🤣😭", "created_at": "2025-11-12T10:33:33", "owner": "joeyhft", "likes": 116}, {"id": 18384262987183834, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T12:58:20", "owner": "fairy_butter_cup", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18096091873772789, "text": "Mom at that moment thinking how to sell away this labubu", "created_at": "2025-11-10T10:38:03", "owner": "http.www.nicholas.com.my", "likes": 4998}, {"id": 18063348278147418, "text": "MASI SEMPETNYA LABUBU???!!! LABABI LA😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-10T14:19:12", "owner": "buditabutiii", "likes": 23}, {"id": 17990537249906913, "text": "gotta train her again for her grand kids", "created_at": "2025-11-10T18:57:29", "owner": "yeongiek", "likes": 277}, {"id": 18075124685263311, "text": "That's a lot of milk lmaoooo", "created_at": "2025-12-04T08:16:19", "owner": "aiman_my", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18157467139395160, "text": "-1HP -1HP -1HP -1HP", "created_at": "2025-11-11T18:50:29", "owner": "chiedozie_20", "likes": 382}, {"id": 18075388751207674, "text": "labubu 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:17:11", "owner": "vanillacakeblossom", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18087728642058914, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T04:39:58", "owner": "rareguy_rishxbh__", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18099146218648416, "text": "Safe to say she doesn’t 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-05T20:31:33", "owner": "tehyacreates.official", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17934325245112700, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T02:14:23", "owner": "im_haozhe0712", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17873661387444613, "text": "she regrets not swallowing", "created_at": "2025-11-09T11:25:48", "owner": "diabetic_doughnut_cream", "likes": 84}, {"id": 18052888508322412, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-12T09:44:24", "owner": "kevv.wwin", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18069972020062624, "text": "okay now do a diaper blowout", "created_at": "2025-11-11T10:59:38", "owner": "dan_dayao", "likes": 17}, {"id": 17957505612001207, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-13T17:29:12", "owner": "axwty_", "likes": 18}, {"id": 17852668542534882, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-10T13:13:44", "owner": "lil.t3ck", "likes": 24}, {"id": 18074076377600659, "text": "The way she just kept going 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:49:45", "owner": "baby___mochi369", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18003804788674101, "text": "This is my first impression of you", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:23:23", "owner": "st6iia", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063332600568404, "text": "first impression of u btw", "created_at": "2025-11-14T07:23:45", "owner": "joesus2004", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18121004257529485, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T19:49:05", "owner": "gguksfly97", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18335684077232752, "text": "I think she misses the abortion that didn't happen.😂", "created_at": "2025-11-11T16:47:23", "owner": "theresnogummyhere", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17848056120568166, "text": "anything for clout", "created_at": "2025-11-07T13:08:31", "owner": "ibadlover22445", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18081479297283180, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-09T09:46:40", "owner": "sea_.nnn", "likes": 219}, {"id": 18133693765470090, "text": "HAHAHAHHAAHAAH I WILL DO THIS TO MY MOM WHEN I GO THERE FOR A VACATION HAHAHAHAHAH", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:31:53", "owner": "coleenzkiii", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18108473935611244, "text": "nah I'm making that disgust face right now 😐