re", "created_at": "2025-11-13T16:13:55", "owner": "daddyfadddy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076973470947239, "text": "HAHAHAHHAHAHAHAHJA", "created_at": "2025-11-07T18:01:53", "owner": "riannacharisse", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18544300966006728, "text": "Wtf 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-12T01:16:01", "owner": "ayranistwyld", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17843022708614631, "text": "Labubu", "created_at": "2025-11-11T01:41:18", "owner": "pipnipper", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17850885453543357, "text": "Labubu 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-11T05:02:22", "owner": "muqriezadam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902045302292047, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-08T04:51:18", "owner": "trustedpaki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146610793449518, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T11:02:22", "owner": "_harsh_pratap_singh_parihar_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091652354303651, "text": "Thought she actually threw up for a second.", "created_at": "2025-12-13T10:47:45", "owner": "sixfeetbeneathh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154982980411306, "text": "Not me watching literally while drinking milk😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-12T13:21:49", "owner": "mikeyljerish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084947561016977, "text": "Your mom looks like yuki", "created_at": "2025-12-12T11:17:29", "owner": "elvanwwww", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854183056591339, "text": "She just figured out how a touch screen phone works and then you do this gng🥀🥀🥀", "created_at": "2025-12-12T02:56:44", "owner": "your_glorious_goat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18549710086034462, "text": "Tf", "created_at": "2025-12-11T14:14:49", "owner": "imbibingnoob", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065678585168865, "text": "Disgusting why'd you need the feel to do this", "created_at": "2025-12-11T14:01:01", "owner": "fallenknght", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048585479443733, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T10:17:36", "owner": "kixkath", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977074560956360, "text": "Why would you do this? What compelled you, what thought?", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:39:45", "owner": "0osoft_and_weto0