"_moana_tiana_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068045528624903, "text": "😭 I'm quite sure, later she ended up beating the shit out of you", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:00:55", "owner": "lazyyoreoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121432675539587, "text": "Did u get a beat8ng after", "created_at": "2025-12-06T13:35:11", "owner": "dibyayanm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540946282047078, "text": "Wth", "created_at": "2025-12-06T11:23:28", "owner": "ketocherapi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062563508207377, "text": "Mom or jacky chan??", "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:47:40", "owner": "ruved_pathan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092494663901219, "text": "You can still be aborted now you know?", "created_at": "2025-12-06T06:47:10", "owner": "kleptem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848070622587202, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T04:48:25", "owner": "just_small_potatooooooo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084129524103773, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T02:50:27", "owner": "sandiia.sandiia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131115241493190, "text": "labubu ❌ lafufu ✔️", "created_at": "2025-12-05T23:19:02", "owner": "only.priyanshuuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904520851311701, "text": "oh my god mine would beat the shit outta me 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-05T14:16:37", "owner": "jehifujo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18162071515402371, "text": "I’ve seen two of these and I’m wondering if women can actually do this or some shit please help😭", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:32:21", "owner": "unit_mk2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086191583510708, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:39:21", "owner": "brentjester_28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013384022635733, "text": "SHE LOOK LIKE SHE HOLDING A BRICK AT A QUICK GLANCE", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:19:27", "owner": "dlnk_dl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065652584161584, "text": "You almost died btw", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:44:33", "owner": "idonknow69man", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18210146113313698, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T16:14:58", "owner": "hhkmhh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965414491002702, "text": "why's her tees so hydrophobic 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-03T07:08:01", "owner": "hafiyyan_arga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077638976335928, "text": "Well blocked", "created_at": "2025-12-02T10:14:12", "owner": "tinkobill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102329764736529, "text": "Normalize doing this to all the relatives asking you when are you having kids", "created_at": "2025-12-02T08:49:49", "owner": "nyaaryetjoswa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095940754880740, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:48:16", "owner": "molletesconquesooo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864771793516787, "text": "Or is it grandchildren?🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:57:08", "owner": "oluskloc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073961036520336, "text": "I actually ha*te this trend😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T18:07:09", "owner": "merov_557", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["ying", "trend"]},
{"media_id": 3772376759635460433, "shortcode": "DRaLK0NAsFR", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRaLK0NAsFR/", "taken_at": "2025-11-23T18:27:49", "caption": "Gen Alpha, Gen Z, and Millennials. Three different generations. Each distinctly different, yet completely the same. \nWelcome to my Ted Talk 💡\n#Bluefranklin #slang #67", "owner_username": "bluefranklin1", "owner_id": "78732765707", "likes": 307013, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0123_DRaLK0NAsFR\\DRaLK0NAsFR_20251123_182749.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18094541356803990, "text": "Gen alpha slang actually makes no sense", "created_at": "2025-11-24T17:28:20", "owner": "emimithechaotic", "likes": 47737}, {"id": 18100624804801652, "text": "I’m a mix of Gen Z and millennial vocabulary 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T06:42:59", "owner": "d4r7h.z0r4n", "likes": 27174}, {"id": 17867404356496981, "text": "I'm a teacher and this has helped me more than you know 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:04:09", "owner": "thestrangerschoir", "likes": 3530}, {"id": 18087630283798581, "text": "I have *never* heard a millennial say 'you're done' like that", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:23:20", "owner": "thenerdyrockstar", "likes": 2348}, {"id": 17881628508421626, "text": "Me, a Gen Z with the vocabulary of a Millennial 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:08:54", "owner": "elsadubroca28", "likes": 4769}, {"id": 18094309696889813, "text": "English isn’t real. It can’t hurt me.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:13:09", "owner": "rebeka_beka_a", "likes": 10829}, {"id": 18148599628431004, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T15:07:20", "owner": "dannyisinyourphone", "likes": 141}, {"id": 18054850952661245, "text": "Millennial here....just gonna say half the stuff you have under our names we never said........example \"old head???\"", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:42:11", "owner": "jno_tinkerbell", "likes": 1206}, {"id": 18048500360415801, "text": "Just shut up. Please. This was a painful watch", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:04:11", "owner": "bongbeforebeer", "likes": 24023}, {"id": 18077393080965685, "text": "Wouldn't \"WTF?\" be \"dafuq?\"", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:38:39", "owner": "hermitpop", "likes": 246}, {"id": 17862811725456558, "text": "Omg I just realised how much millennial I am minus the odd one here and there where I actually prefer to use the Gen Z way of speaking", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:39:31", "owner": "cherry.adhd", "likes": 456}, {"id": 17857442790558715, "text": "Translate this into Gen X please what’s this about pasta?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:58:08", "owner": "georgealley", "likes": 58}, {"id": 17896994304359188, "text": "wtf is 41😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T02:50:23", "owner": "amirajazeera", "likes": 30}, {"id": 18105624994632534, "text": "And if you're black, OD and Twin were around long before GenZ and Alpha were born.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:27:03", "owner": "jeffjustdesigns", "likes": 87}, {"id": 17906789352272707, "text": "Not a single millennial term was right ??", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:03:25", "owner": "kcannonball2", "likes": 1260}, {"id": 17971040438970064, "text": "What the hell is 41? Please i can’t handle another number", "created_at": "2025-11-24T17:07:40", "owner": "tommybroutt", "likes": 434}, {"id": 18079653127917939, "text": "Bruh", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:09:59", "owner": "bossbabybritt.millionaire_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18119335570546337, "text": "Did I just have a stroke?!", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:26:55", "owner": "nickj1015", "likes": 4097}, {"id": 18100543249706947, "text": "I'm Gen Z. Never heard backrooms or fry tax in my life", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:05:51", "owner": "dawnbudd3", "likes": 2043}, {"id": 18540072088012613, "text": ".... bruh I don't think you actually understand some of the words you're filtering for people. Ohio and Backrooms are not the same? Definitely not as flippant and more usable than Creepy Pasta. I'm confused because half of the phrases you're using aren't nearly as related to each other as you're implying.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:31:20", "owner": "xx_acrillec_xx", "likes": 605}, {"id": 18086783083820727, "text": "Reaffirming that I’m a zillennial", "created_at": "2025-12-04T14:36:33", "owner": "thatnerd_trace", "likes": 459}, {"id": 17867843637481366, "text": "I have no idea what 6 7 and 41 is and u know wat I think it best I don’t want to know", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:07:37", "owner": "mojihiro", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18085090049476510, "text": "Jesus how did Alpha ruin lingo😭", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:21:07", "owner": "axelrichie170", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17898288336203674, "text": "You’re speed running through someone’s Linguistics Dissertation right now", "created_at": "2025-12-13T00:17:40", "owner": "piper_cj", "likes": 33}, {"id": 18078515579171803, "text": "Fries in the bag is not the same as lock in bro. Fries in the bag is telling someone they aren’t good enough at what they do to do it full time and for them to get a job. Lock in is like kinda uplifting", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:07:23", "owner": "brandonstne11", "likes": 1916}, {"id": 18118145176489119, "text": "I disagree with the first one, 67 is NOT 21, and 21 is NOT 69😂😂 idc idc idc idc", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:41:41", "owner": "grizlemynizle", "likes": 184}, {"id": 17873109018454897, "text": "i learned so much", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:17:59", "owner": "vanessa.gregg", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17850617346565842, "text": "Can't compare 69 to 67 ever. 69 is a figurative description.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T09:45:40", "owner": "dg_glorena", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17937578286099640, "text": "No not even true most of these are incorrect or in the wrong generation", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:58:57", "owner": "saberfirefly3", "likes": 23}, {"id": 17912584935253715, "text": "Nah nightmare fuel is still it", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:04:16", "owner": "itsiananderson", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18055547843654197, "text": "I'm somehow somewhere between Gen Z and a millennial according to this", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:59:53", "owner": "carpie_xx", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18061063961255841, "text": "🫩 why do I know these terms as a millennial", "created_at": "2025-12-08T20:00:07", "owner": "itspresence", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18145895062448839, "text": "Who tf is alpha", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:32:20", "owner": "orel_mizrachi0", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18069752159092689, "text": "Tf was 21", "created_at": "2025-12-06T01:05:19", "owner": "taro.megumi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065379932158357, "text": "UNFORTUNATELY a bunch of the “alpha” ones are actually gen z, it’s too early to say things are gen alpha when most of them are literal kids and the youngest are still being born rn in 2025", "created_at": "2025-12-05T16:31:36", "owner": "letpolonia", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071778911362904, "text": "I'm a Gen Z what's 21?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:04:00", "owner": "titoforos", "likes": 2803}, {"id": 18101012785685812, "text": "I’m 1998 which means I wasn’t gen z or millennial truly so I was confused by any and all lingo", "created_at": "2025-12-06T06:11:54", "owner": "i_kenzie_you", "likes": 16}, {"id": 17842929387648466, "text": "Gen alpha doesn't translate to anything. They' mean nothing, they do nothing, ans they often think nothing", "created_at": "2025-12-13T18:10:30", "owner": "henry.and.beef", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065689535437744, "text": "This is so wrong", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:29:25", "owner": "kellyekennedytv", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058742462290787, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:51:13", "owner": "enamasiama", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18068211407378725, "text": "All of these gen alpha terms belong to gen Z ngl", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:54:23", "owner": "justinalejandr0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17967833321993273, "text": "Afraid I’m gonna need the next category as well….!??", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:38:58", "owner": "javen_bear", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17908459698268224, "text": "Wtf", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:36:50", "owner": "chau.ng_", "likes": 16}, {"id": 18412127542140869, "text": "Omg I lived through all 3 and maybe more 💀💀💀", "created_at": "2025-12-08T23:45:53", "owner": "dorianl_133", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18409391860184965, "text": "41????", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:30:57", "owner": "v33nd3tta", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18068044283378933, "text": "This just showed me age…The fact I had to watch this to understand what the kids are talking about…Yup.", "created_at": "2025-12-13T07:55:41", "owner": "lake_van_aken", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051693290347991, "text": "Holy shit this needs to be made into a public PSA! 👏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:31:15", "owner": "epiccomedyberlin", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18062210564630378, "text": "You got ah couple wrong", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:46:26", "owner": "callme_freshhh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18148560379439228, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T05:11:24", "owner": "ryan_kramer12", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17902668306327237, "text": "Dam I didn't get the firmware update 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-07T15:24:24", "owner": "apicvisuals", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088876138974836, "text": "Chad is a millennial/gen z thing", "created_at": "2025-12-10T13:42:40", "owner": "topanga_666", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18049046324416662, "text": "Can you translate this into “The greatest generation?” Need to explain to my grandpa born in 1927 who was in WW2", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:56:32", "owner": "pranaychat", "likes": 25}, {"id": 17932647831136236, "text": "Wait so 67 is oral?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:01:02", "owner": "tytybooth", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17915184366239442, "text": "This actually helped me understand gen alpha slang thank you", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:43:28", "owner": "ritualnailsxo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086909086998047, "text": "As a millennial what the hell does ‘fry tax’ mean. Also we prefer to be known as 90s kids", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:04:59", "owner": "imrant1234567890", "likes": 136}, {"id": 18001187801832630, "text": "i use all of these because i’m chronically online", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:46:17", "owner": "strawbwycakes", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17991079676735173, "text": "I’m 27 and relate more to alpha I think i ruined my frontal lobe", "created_at": "2025-12-06T11:18:58", "owner": "salvijune", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18092084809901267, "text": "This WAS needed😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T15:12:49", "owner": "ashleyxsyd_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18141256645457028, "text": "I think if you understand all of these you need help", "created_at": "2025-12-02T09:31:38", "owner": "naseemdraws", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069139649082040, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:26:48", "owner": "iamjessbrooks", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17880906309426116, "text": "OD is definitely not Gen Alpha", "created_at": "2025-12-03T16:37:18", "owner": "kxrmaou", "likes": 19}, {"id": 17865396141527946, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:09:22", "owner": "junglesimi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17935146519104270, "text": "What's the lore of 21 yall", "created_at": "2025-12-03T05:46:48", "owner": "selinatoliyat", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17936998524105451, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:43:09", "owner": "ronycruz.sv", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17844857547619309, "text": "Alpha slang just makes me cringe 😭 speaking as a Gen Z, it reminds me of being a cringy 13 year old", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:05:35", "owner": "beyondthe3arth", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18071141966365500, "text": "Gen Alpha makes no sense, glad Im a millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:04:47", "owner": "stress.less34", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18090319697313246, "text": "My head hurts lol", "created_at": "2025-12-01T18:25:17", "owner": "sunnyjacksen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18112252885600264, "text": "41??? wtf is 41", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:57:22", "owner": "mikxllx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17864029668533225, "text": "This was the parenting guide I didn’t know I needed", "created_at": "2025-12-05T17:00:25", "owner": "lorraineosborne_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063653147447340, "text": "Lock in isn't put the fries in the bag.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:27:38", "owner": "danyoj99", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18005992478818960, "text": "God i love linguistics", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:14:59", "owner": "ginademarsh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18089289821498198, "text": "i feel old and i’m not even old 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:38:10", "owner": "zyzy_zero", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17929833015117336, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:30:44", "owner": "what_a_fuckin_dork", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18372355441155927, "text": "Gen Z I say most a few millennials words but mostly Gen z lol (1996)", "created_at": "2025-11-30T21:06:53", "owner": "mattieleigh_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18083164841024837, "text": "Sims language", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:17:00", "owner": "_leaanni_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074379164010113, "text": "Gen alpha slang is all vibes no context", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:58:26", "owner": "seams_familiar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17983407059923092, "text": "Im so sad, im now an old gen z😭", "created_at": "2025-12-11T01:29:21", "owner": "adelekeshavarz_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078646424140752, "text": "Cringe is universal and that is this video.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:54:46", "owner": "brittneynicole126", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18400494808120919, "text": "I am a mix of gen z and millennial 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-10T17:06:03", "owner": "iiriismusic", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18081278177468409, "text": "Why do we always cringe over new slang? It’s kind of predictable at this point yall", "created_at": "2025-12-08T22:07:59", "owner": "_aro_ace_based_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18162000613398093, "text": "wtf is fry tax/fanum tax? and for us zillenials (in between gen z and millennial), our renagade was “the quan” or “whip/nae nae”", "created_at": "2025-12-11T04:26:37", "owner": "neptunemagicc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154265986423539, "text": "Chat, why do I know all of these? I’m lowkey scared.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:44:23", "owner": "astral.sensei", "likes": 38}, {"id": 17850060579600336, "text": "I say a lot of Mil stuff and im 26", "created_at": "2025-12-04T01:41:19", "owner": "thr.if.ty", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17876211720442135, "text": "So basically Gen alpha are the Sims 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:21:22", "owner": "32pawsandme", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065466275148187, "text": "way more gen z that i realized", "created_at": "2025-12-04T03:34:56", "owner": "stephenseanford", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17882879988305214, "text": "WHAT ARE THESE TERMS, I’m so old stop😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:21:56", "owner": "gracie.gray.14", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18125099185457740, "text": "What Language is this 💀! I was listening to it without the video and I thought it was sims", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:56:32", "owner": "ria.shades", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18152456395424669, "text": "I genuinely hate this so much 😭😩", "created_at": "2025-12-09T07:33:54", "owner": "emsoph_kau", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17869481142481796, "text": "1738 was my 67", "created_at": "2025-12-08T13:37:52", "owner": "i.am.dizzy24", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084876656084825, "text": "Wtf is Alpha", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:19:00", "owner": "maqthebarber", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17911899267249267, "text": "Solidifying my Zillennial status 😩", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:11:20", "owner": "this.is.cortez", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18002472422681011, "text": "Ok yes this video confirms all of my friends' suspicions that I'm actually a millennial trying to hang with gen z people. Thx for the translation, these make me feel so lost occasionally", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:05:36", "owner": "annyogrezeanu", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17860373616479384, "text": "Just about all of the Gen Alpha ones are also Gen Z", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:37:39", "owner": "eclipse_jc12", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17921621364083928, "text": "Watching this made me slightly more stupid than what I already was 🙃", "created_at": "2025-12-14T02:11:25", "owner": "handsofdoom52", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115861195505279, "text": "type shiii", "created_at": "2025-12-14T01:53:45", "owner": "dwin_doe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987471534918834, "text": "I thought fries in the bag was I ain't reading all that", "created_at": "2025-12-14T01:48:38", "owner": "no.lo.es.lane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904208332299980, "text": "I still say hella and you can’t stop me", "created_at": "2025-12-14T01:27:08", "owner": "kendrabreannebb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073984961040539, "text": "Saving this for when I step into my fifth grade classroom next month 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-14T01:23:08", "owner": "mikaya.d.b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135655873483947, "text": "The fact that at least 90% of the millennial \"slang\" is not even a thing makes me question the credibility of it the other two slangs respectively 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-14T00:56:05", "owner": "rrrrogelio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911688268255439, "text": "Problem is 69 actuallybhave meaning compared to whatever 67 is XD", "created_at": "2025-12-14T00:37:23", "owner": "ht_offiv2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106783060567146, "text": "The first example I knew I was old FR", "created_at": "2025-12-14T00:23:24", "owner": "the_boss_model", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000385109840789, "text": "U look like the corrupt lawyer guy from Power", "created_at": "2025-12-14T00:05:16", "owner": "darintjuhh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105324451730442, "text": "Its funny as a mill i rarely use the slang listed here for mil I mostly use gen z", "created_at": "2025-12-13T23:47:48", "owner": "nekofreek13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869829826491121, "text": "I don’t think anyone has used renegade ever.", "created_at": "2025-12-13T23:38:23", "owner": "papichulotacosgrande", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101474422786235, "text": "i didnt realize how much older millennial slang feels than gen z, and how much more gen z lingo i used … but what the fuck is this alpha shit lmfao.", "created_at": "2025-12-13T23:36:43", "owner": "qaasimofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869533243415519, "text": "This gave me a stroke", "created_at": "2025-12-13T23:32:48", "owner": "sallythesilly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073629266048532, "text": "I’m gen z and use nothing but millennial vocabulary 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-13T23:05:21", "owner": "matttmann15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013269197642214, "text": "Helpful, thank you 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-13T22:46:05", "owner": "thebambideer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145260961450057, "text": "A lot of the alpha stuff is actually gen z as well, it cane from us", "created_at": "2025-12-13T22:42:30", "owner": "_rotting_fruit_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113931856598220, "text": "SYBAU is Gen Z", "created_at": "2025-12-13T22:04:28", "owner": "blade_runner1996", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088283260955211, "text": "Dog water is Gen Z", "created_at": "2025-12-13T22:00:18", "owner": "rhyno_m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050057450408889, "text": "Facts", "created_at": "2025-12-13T21:54:55", "owner": "carleyjcollective", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304414759283466, "text": "Many of these things are just not what we say and never have… but also, saying a thing commonly does not mean that that word means the same thing as a thing another generation says commonly. 69 is not the same as 67 because 69 is a sex joke, it has an actual reason for being a subversive joke, it is not meaningless or popular for being meaningless, quite the opposite.", "created_at": "2025-12-13T21:45:46", "owner": "brendanplease", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075925760590260, "text": "Creepy pasta is not what you think it is 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-13T21:40:34", "owner": "gatewaybug", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088317715820787, "text": "ngl i use some of gen alpha slangs 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-13T21:35:27", "owner": "xoxo._yonii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886533853407678, "text": "I’m only 25 but this was really helpful I don’t even know my own gen terms 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-13T21:27:05", "owner": "mf.greatest", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115727068587033, "text": "stfu being gen z slang lmfao what kind of authority is ts", "created_at": "2025-12-13T21:04:16", "owner": "vhsinthefleshh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941029015096762, "text": "My brain hurts now", "created_at": "2025-12-13T21:04:16", "owner": "teli7ta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869466586418111, "text": "Nigga a lot of those Gen Z slangs are millennial slang. some of the millennial slang i’ve never heard of and i’m a millennial", "created_at": "2025-12-13T21:02:51", "owner": "juniorrnyc_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107499826577181, "text": "Learned from this that my lingo is millennial (I’m Gen Z)", "created_at": "2025-12-13T20:35:38", "owner": "abbymdickerson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087077537001197, "text": "Nah unc sorry you're too outta touch to make this video", "created_at": "2025-12-13T20:05:53", "owner": "calhanma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088639144964685, "text": "Ebonics • The people = generational language, the hood always sets the tone 🫶🏾✨", "created_at": "2025-12-13T19:57:24", "owner": "amorrie_shay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068758439122781, "text": "Chronically online is you", "created_at": "2025-12-13T19:49:48", "owner": "boobediebo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18350279200205140, "text": "SYBAU is stfu is sybau", "created_at": "2025-12-13T19:29:18", "owner": "losthyrulian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075917639012131, "text": "Sorry no, my brain isn't working", "created_at": "2025-12-13T19:11:22", "owner": "natkwq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18391874473183076, "text": "Ohio is Timbuktu", "created_at": "2025-12-13T17:35:20", "owner": "abrar.tohid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938292786982472, "text": "this is too fast i need you to slow. it. down. 😅", "created_at": "2025-12-13T17:06:12", "owner": "mollyraelene", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071688011580625, "text": "Wtf is chuegy???", "created_at": "2025-12-13T16:26:24", "owner": "tee7seb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085038368018121, "text": "OD is also NYC millennial", "created_at": "2025-12-13T16:18:57", "owner": "regneedoux", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879745684434323, "text": "Ok, but just put the fries in the bag is elite. It is an uncommon gen alpha w", "created_at": "2025-12-13T15:46:27", "owner": "caitlyn_flower", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079371854236424, "text": "I was born in 2007 and most of my vocabulary is millennial with a tiny bit of Gen Z 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-13T15:06:35", "owner": "skychild72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114465160591559, "text": "Millennial version of 67/21 should be 42", "created_at": "2025-12-13T15:00:10", "owner": "shira.lieberman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969833790830965, "text": "Nah 69 is for every generation it's eternal", "created_at": "2025-12-13T14:59:15", "owner": "shira.lieberman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057614579652692, "text": "Listening to all of them, makes it all sound so dump 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-13T14:47:21", "owner": "cptbenbarborsa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086066585019283, "text": "Once cool street slangs for chosed turned into clown show", "created_at": "2025-12-13T14:45:50", "owner": "tutti_skcz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18247356724292135, "text": "I'm a millennial and huh????", "created_at": "2025-12-13T14:45:27", "owner": "r.a.craig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920815615068337, "text": "I’m millennial wtf is old head 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-13T14:41:31", "owner": "twilightpalms", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032421311543046, "text": "Me being technically Gen Z but only understanding most of them from the Millennial explanation 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-13T14:40:55", "owner": "babybatgirl2002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096802255684562, "text": "Where tf did you get some of this because aw a Mil I’ve never heard of “old head”", "created_at": "2025-12-13T14:39:22", "owner": "bunnii_chanel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303047080270975, "text": "I got more lost 😅", "created_at": "2025-12-13T14:36:40", "owner": "mahayla_music", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032051507766331, "text": "I'm a gen z but I don't understand what is 21. I know 69 though", "created_at": "2025-12-13T13:39:34", "owner": "masardiarsa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077401631191174, "text": "What the sigma ….. wtf", "created_at": "2025-12-13T13:24:37", "owner": "jacccky_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085970333283118, "text": "I am so zillenial", "created_at": "2025-12-13T12:58:11", "owner": "maryasegil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136942405474862, "text": "NAH BRUH  dog water was Gen Z", "created_at": "2025-12-13T11:51:47", "owner": "i_vanished_19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059723495298051, "text": "Gen Alpha lingo is Lowry Gen Z lingo passed down cause nga I’ve been aura farming since I’ve been born 🤣 and I’ve used aura countless times before these Toddlers in middle school and highschool could even think about aura", "created_at": "2025-12-13T11:41:12", "owner": "teosoguapo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352215397202345, "text": "You’re out here doing the LORD’S WORK !! 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-13T11:35:38", "owner": "theee_dime", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096079339892536, "text": "I think i use slangs of: 5% gen alpha, 70% gen z, 25% gen y", "created_at": "2025-12-13T11:23:52", "owner": "yasminmicki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006052007814432, "text": "After gen alpha slang i created my own lingo", "created_at": "2025-12-13T10:36:58", "owner": "xmsa_.x9d2l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18524798971064988, "text": "Oohhhh as a zeleniall I so needed this Gen A key", "created_at": "2025-12-13T10:23:16", "owner": "kynah_jai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050564654691690, "text": "I’m a millennial. The hell is “creepy pasta?!”", "created_at": "2025-12-13T10:20:27", "owner": "c_maziarz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073608239604780, "text": "You gonna have to run back on Freddy Fazbering cause Huh?", "created_at": "2025-12-13T08:01:54", "owner": "cjex_00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091008568936976, "text": "If nothing else, gen z actually has the best slang out of all the gens, this is objective", "created_at": "2025-12-13T07:54:29", "owner": "icarium_revolar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063150932222448, "text": "@thenerdyrockstar we used to say “and you’re done” when we were roasting each other or telling a story and someone said something nasty, off color joke, or made everyone gag and we were like “you’re done” with a hand out. This was like mid 2000s. 😅", "created_at": "2025-12-13T07:48:57", "owner": "thesnarkyduck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917308438214984, "text": "damn ive used all of these", "created_at": "2025-12-13T07:29:09", "owner": "knumearz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106949848650700, "text": "What the fuck? Dude bro?... nah dawg, we don't say some shit like that", "created_at": "2025-12-13T07:04:19", "owner": "biggpoppaphill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097220965684611, "text": "Tf is creepy pasta??", "created_at": "2025-12-13T06:10:05", "owner": "hmanayrua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058856321292692, "text": "All rubbish. lol", "created_at": "2025-12-13T05:49:29", "owner": "k1ng_0f_peac3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850185085576696, "text": "The internet has trained me in all the 3 gens of slang atp", "created_at": "2025-12-13T05:43:37", "owner": "bron.tris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995599818848983, "text": "I CAN’T DO THIS ANYMORE😭", "created_at": "2025-12-13T05:43:19", "owner": "wut.is__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079132172183640, "text": "I want the time back i wasted watching this", "created_at": "2025-12-13T05:20:06", "owner": "stevenbaker490", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999408378698618, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T05:15:57", "owner": "famousdopeboiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127708357509321, "text": "as someone whos gen z, i understand more things millennials say😭", "created_at": "2025-12-13T05:10:46", "owner": "foapfoam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102835474688342, "text": "Wth even is 21", "created_at": "2025-12-13T04:39:08", "owner": "_cxmnh_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862167343549470, "text": "Boomer was def millennial 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-13T04:12:01", "owner": "phaayeee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848121508615535, "text": "I am a zoomer 2007 I say some zoomer 1996-2009  and I say some millennials.", "created_at": "2025-12-13T04:08:27", "owner": "jaxon.c.patterson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088954303813482, "text": "Then you for clearing up 67 I had no idea still💀🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-13T04:08:09", "owner": "phaayeee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058358087309534, "text": "Creepy pasta… stfu bro", "created_at": "2025-12-13T04:07:51", "owner": "baking_waking420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033630551751451, "text": "What millennial said that shit?!", "created_at": "2025-12-13T04:03:58", "owner": "the_redface.beauty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948423073069722, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T03:55:09", "owner": "eric_solis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865587052530953, "text": "Nightmare fuel? Who said that ever?", "created_at": "2025-12-13T03:23:43", "owner": "sunainamenawat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066108089154733, "text": "Dude clearly has never met a real millennial", "created_at": "2025-12-13T02:46:43", "owner": "bizzlesnitch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058860080307021, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T02:36:58", "owner": "z.ontap", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368727568093309, "text": "Sybau?", "created_at": "2025-12-13T01:58:05", "owner": "leopriotto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18369561037091092, "text": "✍️✍️✍️✍️", "created_at": "2025-12-13T01:48:46", "owner": "psyche.sydney", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859815124558800, "text": "ima need this bi-annually pls", "created_at": "2025-12-13T01:40:40", "owner": "hopskotch_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921715330206261, "text": "Damn Im a mix of alpha and gen z", "created_at": "2025-12-13T01:32:22", "owner": "georgia.soutar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851517745562521, "text": "I'm a mix of All three 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-12T23:59:22", "owner": "whispercharlie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135416566488742, "text": "I hate being a 96 baby, I know Gen Z and millennial slang 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T23:45:43", "owner": "lillyoftheallie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18402656206122986, "text": "Its Old f**k", "created_at": "2025-12-12T23:11:42", "owner": "kevinsukesh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058349333643223, "text": "Omg no", "created_at": "2025-12-12T22:40:21", "owner": "pecanblazian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103005931665764, "text": "I think I had a stroke watching this", "created_at": "2025-12-12T20:58:10", "owner": "spione", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927170593181177, "text": "wanny wan", "created_at": "2025-12-12T20:43:22", "owner": "rafikplz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058781186304467, "text": "As a millennial...this helped a lot, which hurts a little to admit..", "created_at": "2025-12-12T19:35:01", "owner": "_.limc._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920787436207362, "text": "I'm a Gen Z and don't talk like any of these?", "created_at": "2025-12-12T19:34:00", "owner": "zirenbrown", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862796536468109, "text": "Finally a translation—thank you!!", "created_at": "2025-12-12T19:26:24", "owner": "mickymacsea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927585073177006, "text": "Jesus christ 🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-12T19:23:36", "owner": "carlmalherbe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087961139483090, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-12T19:13:48", "owner": "_jbarragan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904845928316838, "text": "This is does mot apply to people of color. 🙃", "created_at": "2025-12-12T18:57:03", "owner": "theadeolaoso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852959512554582, "text": "Being a Zillennial gives you double the slang 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T18:38:09", "owner": "deviline95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084380762281657, "text": "You had Chad and alpha backwards just saying", "created_at": "2025-12-12T18:34:22", "owner": "ianhabener", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18234015223306354, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-12T18:16:56", "owner": "ireallyhatebraindeadsheep", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861973420550214, "text": "Od and high key aint the same od is u doing to much and high key is somthing obvious", "created_at": "2025-12-12T18:11:24", "owner": "kirbyisrael_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18384439462148204, "text": "Alpha slang is harder than Latin stg", "created_at": "2025-12-12T18:00:44", "owner": "midwest_madds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113955712582765, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-12T17:50:39", "owner": "_arisanc86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861820045476591, "text": "Top tier post", "created_at": "2025-12-12T17:11:01", "owner": "lukascho_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041301965710361, "text": "Who chose him to translate cuz he got alot of them wrong 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T16:19:08", "owner": "gym_brat58", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063228338553680, "text": "Ohio é o Acre do brasileiro", "created_at": "2025-12-12T16:07:18", "owner": "sunset_clouds_fairy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055594535649502, "text": "The actual fuck", "created_at": "2025-12-12T16:05:46", "owner": "tomscearce", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995365530719862, "text": "Street cred????", "created_at": "2025-12-12T16:02:58", "owner": "mdawnnnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18414291910138950, "text": "Bro wtf you’ve lost me long time ago", "created_at": "2025-12-12T15:55:04", "owner": "miskysalad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18319967983217722, "text": "I speak like both Gen Z and millennials but this was actually really helpful lol", "created_at": "2025-12-12T15:52:10", "owner": "mystreious.memories", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18198815503354906, "text": "DOING THE WORK TO UNCOVER THE TRUTH!! WE ARE ALL CRINGE!!", "created_at": "2025-12-12T15:32:48", "owner": "fractal.patch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015398744797978, "text": "No start from mil so i know what were talking about", "created_at": "2025-12-12T15:23:35", "owner": "ryleechristine1016", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071957474369505, "text": "I thought sybau was a brain rot thing", "created_at": "2025-12-12T15:20:47", "owner": "_301.725_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18194892934331346, "text": "Gen Alpha has way too many words", "created_at": "2025-12-12T14:55:49", "owner": "thrud205", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067996862415292, "text": "Im genz but I got more millennial vocabulary than anything", "created_at": "2025-12-12T14:48:51", "owner": "as.ab0ve_s0.bel0w", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895672198221555, "text": "What is boomer 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-12T14:38:05", "owner": "_xia.tian_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866769907437427, "text": "I'm confused I'm three generations", "created_at": "2025-12-12T14:34:33", "owner": "taylordude469", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18187222720353197, "text": "Whats 21?", "created_at": "2025-12-12T12:55:51", "owner": "devendra.here", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090903388757592, "text": "Why are you mixing Alpha and GenZ slang together? Some of the “Gen Alpha” slang started with GenZ", "created_at": "2025-12-12T12:36:43", "owner": "jae___4203", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076624736520068, "text": "Twin. Is most from Atlanta and it spreaded everywhere", "created_at": "2025-12-12T12:36:22", "owner": "tx.ravrc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095689804853432, "text": "I hate all of them 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-12T12:10:10", "owner": "parrotspalace", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095936530856807, "text": "Shut up nerd (universal*)", "created_at": "2025-12-12T11:53:10", "owner": "and7rew", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876095665366582, "text": "Im technically a gen z but i relate more to millennials humor and vibes wise in my opinion 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T11:11:12", "owner": "tazib00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068062625123719, "text": "Chad has been here since gen z at leats if not milenials", "created_at": "2025-12-12T09:52:12", "owner": "alex_o_leao123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077832466979070, "text": "Why do I have all three in my vocab", "created_at": "2025-12-12T09:38:12", "owner": "purelykali", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18511429639068573, "text": "Bro why am i fluent in 3 generations, youtube what the fuck did you do to me", "created_at": "2025-12-12T09:18:37", "owner": "gend3r._b3nder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18167029855382986, "text": "No it's not", "created_at": "2025-12-12T08:47:15", "owner": "rainbowperformer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962610493007447, "text": "What the actual f", "created_at": "2025-12-12T08:45:24", "owner": "liviloulaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990481419911420, "text": "POV: you’re at a station standing by the departure board waiting for them to announce your train.", "created_at": "2025-12-12T08:24:42", "owner": "dotheycallyoubooksie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072030368070552, "text": "This hurts… I almost couldn’t watch that and I’m 18😭", "created_at": "2025-12-12T08:07:01", "owner": "connert001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075694526264497, "text": "Hella is a Bay Area term", "created_at": "2025-12-12T08:00:03", "owner": "kingroblo.eth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906823222144387, "text": "get Alpha out of here ew", "created_at": "2025-12-12T07:56:47", "owner": "cherylecious", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110559235526863, "text": "Bro delete this", "created_at": "2025-12-12T07:43:35", "owner": "zelda_2099", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096970471846334, "text": "I somehow wondered in what universe is funny about skibidi and 6 7. Somebody explain the humor behind it.", "created_at": "2025-12-12T07:33:21", "owner": "doobeebobbin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079420175229354, "text": "I’m 2003, and I use both Millennial and Gen Z slang 😭 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-12T06:45:22", "owner": "averi318", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889706407265082, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-12T06:39:27", "owner": "gazpacho1914", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076317545005575, "text": "What are you some kinda word... guy?", "created_at": "2025-12-12T06:36:27", "owner": "dick_castle666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066924647617028, "text": "Crazy how i lived through them all being an early genz", "created_at": "2025-12-12T06:21:28", "owner": "aah.shafin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032974952758490, "text": "You’re doing gods work", "created_at": "2025-12-12T05:42:06", "owner": "christinabocca_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865097431532285, "text": "Od is not an new term", "created_at": "2025-12-12T04:58:38", "owner": "uploadnprogress", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18186570271353478, "text": "This made me significantly more confused", "created_at": "2025-12-12T04:55:52", "owner": "lee.schwinn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077139167266236, "text": "Crazy by definition I’m Gen Z but I only say bestie bc I’m a 98 baby and I’m also not from the west 🤪", "created_at": "2025-12-12T04:06:11", "owner": "rihi_fihi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122333347534766, "text": "OD been a thing for a while and I’m in my thirties lmaoooo", "created_at": "2025-12-12T03:15:01", "owner": "islvndy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017351126798538, "text": "ive always said dog water before it was even a thing", "created_at": "2025-12-12T02:24:30", "owner": "bananasmeow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100222246827246, "text": "Unc has been in use long before boomer champ 👍", "created_at": "2025-12-12T01:37:10", "owner": "ghost2511", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301322335283677, "text": "Hella", "created_at": "2025-12-12T01:06:11", "owner": "fromundernothing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910557502270604, "text": "Omg I finally understand gen A slang. Thank you 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-12T00:02:50", "owner": "phoenix_9457", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068424626624452, "text": "As a boomer I can’t. Do ASL have this problem?", "created_at": "2025-12-11T23:50:14", "owner": "edwin.spencer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137925547463265, "text": "Learned something new today", "created_at": "2025-12-11T23:49:02", "owner": "alinadossi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103873831600281, "text": "STFU is the equivalent of the Millennial term of SHUT IT!! 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T22:38:01", "owner": "phoebe_bunz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892876432242655, "text": "ig im woke", "created_at": "2025-12-11T22:35:33", "owner": "iemilyhope", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086175041053046, "text": "Chad is NOT Gen alpha", "created_at": "2025-12-11T22:35:10", "owner": "cozyart69325940", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060747497248573, "text": "You know nothing about millennials. Hang it up.", "created_at": "2025-12-11T22:02:21", "owner": "amazingacekitty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18324120745171010, "text": "wtf is fry tax", "created_at": "2025-12-11T21:59:54", "owner": "liftingwithlia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066843050531468, "text": "I am... All over the pace", "created_at": "2025-12-11T21:47:26", "owner": "unlikelyaztec", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098870437830252, "text": "the fuck xd 💀", "created_at": "2025-12-11T21:39:16", "owner": "elizab._.th", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080489455911891, "text": "Wouldn't put \"lock in\" in the place you did.  Lock in is more telling someone to focus. Fries in the bag/wrap it up is more telling someone to just stop what their doing because they're acting out", "created_at": "2025-12-11T20:51:50", "owner": "love_or_logic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072667214599341, "text": "I don’t think I’d even be a millennial with the way I talk. \n\nId describe myself as the male version of the queen of England with my cat at my side while screaming at the wall at 04:37am after having a great gym session having hit new prs when I couldn’t even get myself out of bed the previous morning 😃💔🩸", "created_at": "2025-12-11T20:17:08", "owner": "hunt_photo_acc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034684244725691, "text": "When all your siblings are Millennial and you’re genZ but don’t get the GenZ vocabulary and only the Millennial vocab", "created_at": "2025-12-11T19:57:43", "owner": "laughing_is.my_life", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337914586238406, "text": "Sybau has been a thing before alpha could brainrot", "created_at": "2025-12-11T19:47:43", "owner": "chris.lucas01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338652289235825, "text": "Being a teacher has never been more difficult 💀", "created_at": "2025-12-11T19:44:46", "owner": "simayyiss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864128932537598, "text": "I hate it here lol", "created_at": "2025-12-11T19:35:01", "owner": "demeramoodley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086300440840799, "text": "Unc status (I’m 25)", "created_at": "2025-12-11T19:27:39", "owner": "ricky.wamsley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080896937134244, "text": "Best Duolingo lesson", "created_at": "2025-12-11T19:18:16", "owner": "arielleigh13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081636668326016, "text": "am i…a…millenial-😟", "created_at": "2025-12-11T18:21:58", "owner": "br333zyj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077459840228064, "text": "I might need a lesson in millennial because I didn't know a lot of them as a millennial 😢", "created_at": "2025-12-11T18:00:01", "owner": "ohyouread2_juju", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989652537875899, "text": "All the mil terms are dumb as shit", "created_at": "2025-12-11T17:58:07", "owner": "woltind", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845681002626343, "text": "GEN ALPHA DIDN'T COME UP WITH DOG WATER", "created_at": "2025-12-11T17:57:08", "owner": "light_by_dawn1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982757307771612, "text": "Ohio is Detroit's in gen Z, I'm not sure abt the millenial", "created_at": "2025-12-11T17:28:53", "owner": "deciduous_capybara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954305008043663, "text": "@xiaomanyc remind me of your high school video", "created_at": "2025-12-11T17:17:31", "owner": "qtzeva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18548042857042259, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T17:10:34", "owner": "itskriscope", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104878837590863, "text": "Wait when did 41 came in?", "created_at": "2025-12-11T16:55:02", "owner": "beanbag.2119", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059554703297921, "text": "The hell is old head? Guess I missed that memo as an elder millennial lol", "created_at": "2025-12-11T16:13:29", "owner": "alohajen3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099756457697201, "text": "What the fuck is creepy pasta", "created_at": "2025-12-11T15:55:38", "owner": "markkd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073912829596198, "text": "It's ok...we gen z can ruin any generation..gen alpha is nothing to us ... because we gen z is mix of millennials+ gen alpha", "created_at": "2025-12-11T15:44:44", "owner": "omg_haelyn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993583764892631, "text": "I’m just sitting here waiting for the next generation to say Gen Z is old and watch the same happen to Gen Alpha lol", "created_at": "2025-12-11T15:29:15", "owner": "korees_world", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856384912529179, "text": "Wtf is 41???", "created_at": "2025-12-11T15:18:21", "owner": "goatarino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064199360432167, "text": "i’m so shocked that gen alpha slang exists and i dont understand most of it😭", "created_at": "2025-12-11T14:52:05", "owner": "harmusiall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869044159494014, "text": "Gen X here and I understand like three things you said. Like totally not tubular dude.", "created_at": "2025-12-11T14:27:31", "owner": "notyourmom790g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933091402132451, "text": "Who in the actual fuck comes up with this stuff", "created_at": "2025-12-11T13:48:35", "owner": "awe12492", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966343758846884, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T12:48:41", "owner": "skur14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100297141845290, "text": "Wtf is old head", "created_at": "2025-12-11T12:09:24", "owner": "rabbitspewtattoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080896145135212, "text": "I'll give Alpha their credit: twin is the best of the 3 imo", "created_at": "2025-12-11T12:06:51", "owner": "nick_e_minaj_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137285125422853, "text": "2002 baby here. i got;\n1. i don’t use these but my friends use 21 the most\n2. i use both STFU and YOU’RE DONE. but STFU a lot more.\n3. rarely use it but BOOMER\n4. WRAP IT UP. i’ve never even heard of the other two till right now😂\n5. both CRINGEY and AWKWARD depending on the situation and context\n6. never used any of it\n7. CHAOTIC or RANDOM based on situation and context\n8. its giving MAIN CHARACTER ENERGY😌\n9. CLOUT\n10. i want me an ALPHA mannn\n11. never used any of it\n12. grew up with BFF then switched to BESTIE mid-teens\n13. TRASHH.\n14. HIGHKEY & LOWKEY\n15. rarely use FAM but still do. usually its just YOU GUYS.\n16. …tf is a fry tax??? never used either\n17. SAVAGE. never heard of based before. \n18. BRUH and WTF depending on what mood im in\n19. heard of renegade but i like DOUGIE more. would literally randomly dance to it in the middle of the day\n20. KISS ASS\n21. GLOW UP\n22. FLEX\n23. am i really gen z??? wtf is curved?? i use BLEW OFF\nthats itttt. thanks for reading if you did🥰", "created_at": "2025-12-11T11:59:41", "owner": "ft.kissteenah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147337000436746, "text": "Now I can finally learn to speak fluent Alpha💀", "created_at": "2025-12-11T11:42:27", "owner": "lemur.catta_drottle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967004955842650, "text": "As a millennial who’s engaged to a Gen Z and teaches high school students, thank you for your service.", "created_at": "2025-12-11T11:30:16", "owner": "kell_spurrier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383989930148508, "text": "All this is bull shit", "created_at": "2025-12-11T09:48:56", "owner": "stevt1309", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929725870156264, "text": "Notice millennials are the ones most likely to use real words that other humans understand", "created_at": "2025-12-11T09:12:13", "owner": "krileygram", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849048265582330, "text": "I didn’t know I was this behind", "created_at": "2025-12-11T09:01:46", "owner": "andoeni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087055564974466, "text": "Are you an old youtuber who's greek named panos or something???", "created_at": "2025-12-11T08:28:04", "owner": "percy.finniz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18416693068186490, "text": "All Gen alpha memes comes from Gen Z tho", "created_at": "2025-12-11T08:22:33", "owner": "ontologyi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050749643399222, "text": "Dog water is not new that was in the late early “10s”", "created_at": "2025-12-11T08:09:56", "owner": "milky_mufasa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122450920532655, "text": "Finally I understand.", "created_at": "2025-12-11T07:58:04", "owner": "soul_enclosed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18431935246106347, "text": "as gen z why did i have to wait for millennial to understand💀💀", "created_at": "2025-12-11T07:42:36", "owner": "_soph.herrera_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048799127674796, "text": "I’m Gen Z and alpha 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-11T07:12:51", "owner": "fvcktree", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938491714099647, "text": "I am millennial and you are talking shit 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T07:05:39", "owner": "kevinbernardinphotography", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081697733139377, "text": "These aren’t entirely accurate", "created_at": "2025-12-11T07:04:08", "owner": "ahjewelicjordan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039526547711726, "text": "Five nights at Freddy’s hahahahaha I didn’t see that one so,done fill me in there was an elementary paraody", "created_at": "2025-12-11T06:59:26", "owner": "lexiberg2001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897308578361036, "text": "Why boomers think that gen z still watches kids shows? We all are grown ups now not little kids", "created_at": "2025-12-11T06:53:58", "owner": "tyces78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18549525046063968, "text": "GRIDDY IS RENEGADE IS DOUGIE. 🤯", "created_at": "2025-12-11T06:03:10", "owner": "marin.sori", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103732102707976, "text": "Literally half of this shit was wrong!", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:44:04", "owner": "kanishkbhattacharya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18354086632161273, "text": "I say all of these bye", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:18:30", "owner": "lildalliance", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869771851475220, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:17:51", "owner": "_fer_8a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18389299762178567, "text": "This is soooo helpful", "created_at": "2025-12-11T05:10:43", "owner": "jnnamlls", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866627902513882, "text": "My head hurts😅", "created_at": "2025-12-11T04:51:43", "owner": "ionica_ralu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091319335940389, "text": "Glizzy is 🍆 riding 💀", "created_at": "2025-12-11T04:35:08", "owner": "alice.laperla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176921908364720, "text": "I understand so much now", "created_at": "2025-12-11T04:14:11", "owner": "chartreusethegreat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856990879571020, "text": "All lame. Say what you mean and mean what you say!", "created_at": "2025-12-11T03:43:54", "owner": "jpearfam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100662412801480, "text": "I feel like my brain just glitched.", "created_at": "2025-12-11T03:39:43", "owner": "keyswitkendra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087376550002393, "text": "Wth is alpha tlking abt", "created_at": "2025-12-11T03:39:13", "owner": "soodreaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013826402638078, "text": "why am i a gen z but im more millennial vocab 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-11T03:34:02", "owner": "elizabeth._.felske", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108412621616565, "text": "half ts wrong", "created_at": "2025-12-11T03:27:09", "owner": "thearchiveceline", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18335816362236046, "text": "Why am I a millennial that understands gen z more 😂💀😭", "created_at": "2025-12-11T03:12:02", "owner": "slynn_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153800815420438, "text": "Omg I'm genz and use most of them 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T02:51:15", "owner": "topherkingz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079123346468195, "text": "This is legit helpful. Thanks!", "created_at": "2025-12-11T02:09:27", "owner": "kevin.kreis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080338022174204, "text": "Thank you for this 😮‍💨", "created_at": "2025-12-11T01:55:06", "owner": "inbloomphotographync", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063607103553630, "text": "As a millennial…this helped a lot", "created_at": "2025-12-11T01:53:16", "owner": "itsmecassielee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099188704753207, "text": "And as a Zilennial it's \"bruh, wtf?\"", "created_at": "2025-12-11T01:45:43", "owner": "justbiibii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060546485258965, "text": "I’d argue that aura is Swag", "created_at": "2025-12-11T01:33:03", "owner": "soju_sergeant", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154414579419868, "text": "I’m Gen z and I feel like Gen z uses a lot of millennial terms while also the others you said cuz I use vibe all the time lolz", "created_at": "2025-12-11T01:02:00", "owner": "purplehearts167", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084017342125950, "text": "Who the hell says street cred ? And if you do,  stop it", "created_at": "2025-12-11T00:31:14", "owner": "shutupitsjsmn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18552397882049067, "text": "I do not find this to be accurate", "created_at": "2025-12-11T00:30:56", "owner": "michael_triboulet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865283380533670, "text": "Nope", "created_at": "2025-12-11T00:20:52", "owner": "ape_on_rhino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917441509230435, "text": "What in tarnation", "created_at": "2025-12-11T00:18:04", "owner": "amberrmendozaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074886641584137, "text": "In between gen Z and mil", "created_at": "2025-12-11T00:10:08", "owner": "zeng_tyler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861982591477627, "text": "I didnt understand or even know that any of the alpha language was happening 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T23:56:09", "owner": "there.go.boujee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865561543518867, "text": "Definitely sounding more Gen Alpha by the day as Gen Z", "created_at": "2025-12-10T23:40:49", "owner": "brandoncukrow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069042671434249, "text": "I hate everything about this💀", "created_at": "2025-12-10T23:22:40", "owner": "toje_rose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089826508768258, "text": "Gen z is 21 and 69", "created_at": "2025-12-10T22:52:24", "owner": "l.v.c123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013861511684099, "text": "Damn , I lived thru em all", "created_at": "2025-12-10T22:52:10", "owner": "vamptanaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999319296696261, "text": "What am I 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T22:20:47", "owner": "cassiecatastrophe___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101363509691278, "text": "What is “spilling cheese all over my lunch” and “munt”", "created_at": "2025-12-10T21:43:52", "owner": "mirror._.perspective", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928363357079771, "text": "Not exactly. Seems like 67 means \"Blah blah\" so for gen z it was 25 from spongebob and millennials word for that was \"derp\" or \"herp dee derp\" 🧐📖☝🏽", "created_at": "2025-12-10T21:26:28", "owner": "ello911", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843183232639755, "text": "As gen z I have more mil bc of my dad having an influence on me. So honestly its how youre molded by those around you. Introduce a kid to the online world and they get this terrible terminology. Introduce them to a mil person they pick up more on their terminology.", "created_at": "2025-12-10T21:15:58", "owner": "y0ur_av3rag3_g1rl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076958774214280, "text": "I’m a gen Z who grew up with millennials on vine and all the memes that came with it and this helped me understand brainrot sm better😭💀", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:35:00", "owner": "sista.kat7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065093891163901, "text": "I’m 27 but must be Gen X then, because wtf is any of this…", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:34:09", "owner": "jmmarin259", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948673306060548, "text": "Sybau is so much better than stfu", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:28:09", "owner": "spankk__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18150010540441172, "text": "I'm just gonna stop fucking talking", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:17:19", "owner": "makimamaart_extra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991499148859191, "text": "Im a mix of gen z and mil", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:07:57", "owner": "mels5_55555", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950906568924660, "text": "this is basically word for word a video i saw from another creator….", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:03:17", "owner": "reidbevan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842001523661883, "text": "You couldn’t be more wrong on so many lol", "created_at": "2025-12-10T19:55:11", "owner": "jst.jaking", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18306165952270507, "text": "21?", "created_at": "2025-12-10T19:33:14", "owner": "lumos98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304301608248839, "text": "OD Is 100% a millenial thing", "created_at": "2025-12-10T19:17:15", "owner": "supreme_trell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954970675028962, "text": "Alpha is just a buncha nonsense is what im learnin", "created_at": "2025-12-10T18:32:32", "owner": "ferry.paye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052447622372658, "text": "I was that funny little grey area of millennial and Gen Z", "created_at": "2025-12-10T17:58:17", "owner": "sl33py_ash", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917461537228181, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T16:58:08", "owner": "chief_choke_ahoe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544057009039633, "text": "21 is a thing?", "created_at": "2025-12-10T16:44:04", "owner": "nnnnrip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110840386528050, "text": "Oh my GOD the first one is so real", "created_at": "2025-12-10T16:10:33", "owner": "dakota.kalani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927729433032013, "text": "Mann wtf is this bs.", "created_at": "2025-12-10T16:08:22", "owner": "mortalllove", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072038831369804, "text": "I'm too old for this i got a headache from this", "created_at": "2025-12-10T16:04:16", "owner": "srey_dah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958408390009401, "text": "I don’t understand a single thing you said as a millennial. None of those things are in my vocabulary.", "created_at": "2025-12-10T16:00:20", "owner": "whoiskennethkylemartinez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18390656011181706, "text": "67 is more like 1738", "created_at": "2025-12-10T15:55:27", "owner": "villatrue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096697717842087, "text": "This is helpful actually", "created_at": "2025-12-10T15:50:52", "owner": "obsessed_366", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046796690657413, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T15:49:44", "owner": "olivalemuel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856792507571893, "text": "“shut ur black ass up” shouldn’t be on here…", "created_at": "2025-12-10T15:43:01", "owner": "gina_ext", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866560954437862, "text": "It’s all just aave", "created_at": "2025-12-10T15:40:22", "owner": "feirmaiden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054554888670913, "text": "Saying OD is alpha is comical 🤣 we were all saying that back in the 2000s in NYC", "created_at": "2025-12-10T15:38:04", "owner": "xonesimo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036102341733342, "text": "This is actually extremely helpful 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-10T15:30:33", "owner": "skye.osbourne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952633843047586, "text": "Creepy pasta is and never was a thing", "created_at": "2025-12-10T15:17:38", "owner": "josh.krueger89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958067982994428, "text": "I have never had my exact age predicted so accurately", "created_at": "2025-12-10T15:12:02", "owner": "chloe_g_dunne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901146451181626, "text": "yea idk this sounds like 3 generations of what could possibly b gay lingo", "created_at": "2025-12-10T14:35:01", "owner": "mr_you_allreadii_kno", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030328550741719, "text": "Aura = BDE = mood", "created_at": "2025-12-10T14:33:49", "owner": "blake_ge1inas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976995564955784, "text": "I hate this", "created_at": "2025-12-10T14:26:36", "owner": "grungekidd0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980073417940445, "text": "i agree with some. but this one needs to be switched. \nmillennial - stfu\ngen z - you’re done", "created_at": "2025-12-10T13:50:24", "owner": "glamr.ghoul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102757516683342, "text": "Ohio / backrooms / creepypasta have absolutely nothing to do with other", "created_at": "2025-12-10T13:36:15", "owner": "kieranandstuff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857757892565452, "text": "I like saying twin 😂😂 I’m 25 😞", "created_at": "2025-12-10T13:30:40", "owner": "bbyjwett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100456777780628, "text": "Just stop", "created_at": "2025-12-10T13:22:07", "owner": "mildly_saturatedsucc.v2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923170315192748, "text": "I really am a Zellennial 😅", "created_at": "2025-12-10T13:18:35", "owner": "bree.xv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184690123359784, "text": "you mixed up Alpha and Chad I think", "created_at": "2025-12-10T13:17:06", "owner": "ahhhreee._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128949916449603, "text": "Dudebro was a Time Machine.", "created_at": "2025-12-10T13:05:31", "owner": "the_autodidactic_layman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929597092139978, "text": "Pretty sure chad is fluid throughout the generations 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T12:52:08", "owner": "canihaveasip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18442062079102430, "text": "U mixing up genz and alpha", "created_at": "2025-12-10T12:32:23", "owner": "show_me_nath", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18318610438247989, "text": "Huh", "created_at": "2025-12-10T12:14:48", "owner": "angrysamoangirl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18208848883313559, "text": "New verbal reasoning assessment just dropped", "created_at": "2025-12-10T12:13:36", "owner": "alex.taylor.ac.uk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078593605958193, "text": "Jesus. I am old.", "created_at": "2025-12-10T12:11:33", "owner": "iamalyssal.c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101825710738460, "text": "I’ve never heard of most of this", "created_at": "2025-12-10T11:59:00", "owner": "stacie_m92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103662886708013, "text": "Never heard “old head” before", "created_at": "2025-12-10T11:26:20", "owner": "itskyzaah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18324723616245164, "text": "lock in is NOT put the fries in the bag 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-10T11:09:41", "owner": "aliferous_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043877945491019, "text": "Ew", "created_at": "2025-12-10T11:05:29", "owner": "monzutaro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897351082357535, "text": "All right, we’ll talk here. No, you’re wrong about 67 because I know exactly the root of it because I have a Gen Alpha. It comes from a random video of a kid who at 67 in the middle of a basketball game for no reason at all, there’s literally no reason it just went viral for well. It’s basically just brain rot. That’s all it is.  Please stop making shit up and also making parents nervous when there’s no reason to be nervous. It is literally just a stupid trend.  Just like we had trends when we were millennials too that made no sense.", "created_at": "2025-12-10T10:44:05", "owner": "lifeofkhendri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090487210975560, "text": "chatgpt wrote this script", "created_at": "2025-12-10T10:18:32", "owner": "caseyjohnellis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041582366502660, "text": "So I’m a millennial got it", "created_at": "2025-12-10T10:16:29", "owner": "tinyfishbowl_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100829950695658, "text": "The realy millennials where walking around going waaaatttttaaaaaaap actually", "created_at": "2025-12-10T10:14:57", "owner": "ourweemoments", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161819578399078, "text": "Ah now they make sense", "created_at": "2025-12-10T09:38:11", "owner": "carina_is_a_slytherin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107473822631792, "text": "I am a gen alpha but i don't like gen alpha💀", "created_at": "2025-12-10T09:04:07", "owner": "calytrix1412", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134378581485138, "text": "Tf is even that", "created_at": "2025-12-10T09:00:46", "owner": "mohmbana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18207075634315797, "text": "Creepy pasta being a millennial thing is loaded. This whole list is flawed.", "created_at": "2025-12-10T08:58:47", "owner": "wynn_digoh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088115539969117, "text": "Alpha just speaking SIM speak at this point", "created_at": "2025-12-10T08:28:04", "owner": "louisw199", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18445105027100853, "text": "i donno bout this update", "created_at": "2025-12-10T08:14:25", "owner": "its_ali_imran_04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940743937096489, "text": "The whiplash I got from creepypasta omfg", "created_at": "2025-12-10T08:06:23", "owner": "woahbrotooslow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076850630519630, "text": "Unc is not form gen alpha", "created_at": "2025-12-10T08:02:55", "owner": "raysheesha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842001559658158, "text": "Alpha’s did not create “OD”", "created_at": "2025-12-10T08:01:06", "owner": "0.zeee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086230439319897, "text": "Too many millennial terms were credited to Gen Z", "created_at": "2025-12-10T07:20:23", "owner": "cuddlesforallan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18388322743180801, "text": "What's 21?", "created_at": "2025-12-10T07:18:16", "owner": "_amelie_w_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873745282464560, "text": "thank you for sharing your profound knowledge", "created_at": "2025-12-10T07:10:56", "owner": "izzokie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18413402557139093, "text": "stupid american made up words, just keep ur kids away from this brain rot. some country banned gadget already until they are 16yo.", "created_at": "2025-12-10T07:08:18", "owner": "safred_safwan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927025549036578, "text": "I'm mixed gen z and mil", "created_at": "2025-12-10T06:56:25", "owner": "patti_webster11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094596844859541, "text": "so im a mix of all…", "created_at": "2025-12-10T06:48:14", "owner": "_kaklou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100364830828806, "text": "someone show this to their conservative grandpa asap", "created_at": "2025-12-10T06:46:01", "owner": "cierra_uh_huh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884710648417689, "text": "As a Gen Z, the fuck is 21?", "created_at": "2025-12-10T06:31:07", "owner": "sabrina_newton_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861612670549366, "text": "So Gen Z stole all the millennial slag", "created_at": "2025-12-10T06:07:43", "owner": "memelordbee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866098915511786, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T05:49:58", "owner": "graciegabbs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029243798750328, "text": "What’s “chat” to Gen Z and Mil? lol", "created_at": "2025-12-10T05:33:50", "owner": "chrsnillo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18414236284136945, "text": "What in the world.", "created_at": "2025-12-10T05:31:03", "owner": "aneriyx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102540067740617, "text": "I didn’t understand a lot of all three", "created_at": "2025-12-10T04:48:03", "owner": "charliethachristian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079934699131067, "text": "How did 69 go to 21 go to 67? Explain please ;~;", "created_at": "2025-12-10T04:44:30", "owner": "darksourceofcode", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881427559425915, "text": "Doing the lords work with this one. I’m 28 and wondering how I got here.. I don’t understand shii lol", "created_at": "2025-12-10T04:40:09", "owner": "bigsisakira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902715562332080, "text": "💀", "created_at": "2025-12-10T04:34:50", "owner": "emily.n.hoang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092963264506811, "text": "I tell my kids that I'm so done with you guys so now they repeat it so much, it makes me laugh and cry at the same time 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T04:22:30", "owner": "h.e_shaikh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903812869322908, "text": "we gen z use twin, sybau, 67, looksmaxxing and many more… and some of these make no sense i’ve never used curved in my life…", "created_at": "2025-12-10T03:59:27", "owner": "anupam_kun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927140182177196, "text": "alot of those \"aplha\" slang are of gen Z origin like u wrong hars", "created_at": "2025-12-10T03:49:02", "owner": "juraj_ilic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094938562912626, "text": "I am a mix of all💀", "created_at": "2025-12-10T03:45:54", "owner": "juna_banana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120132136555340, "text": "Mixed of millennial and Gen z funny cuz my year is the last year for millennial", "created_at": "2025-12-10T03:13:47", "owner": "elfrankie61", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18392104537183651, "text": "They say egoed now instead of get aired or whatever", "created_at": "2025-12-10T03:06:59", "owner": "jenyazhi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18548599045052374, "text": "oh I NEEDED THIS", "created_at": "2025-12-10T02:19:23", "owner": "__cecizee__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869244511418464, "text": "You don’t speak for us", "created_at": "2025-12-10T01:57:14", "owner": "kalaverse_137", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159242767405190, "text": "Millennial made all ours + Gen Z then all the Gen Alpha talk came straight from twitch somehow lol", "created_at": "2025-12-10T01:38:10", "owner": "its_bee_rad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036223175731851, "text": "Somebody please shoot me", "created_at": "2025-12-10T01:04:40", "owner": "luke.richardson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940047016097685, "text": "I need to know what millennial he was talking too because???", "created_at": "2025-12-10T01:04:28", "owner": "dancedee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847926649614163, "text": "Nah it’s dad tax for MIL", "created_at": "2025-12-10T01:03:46", "owner": "mrssgoddess", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870022429475851, "text": "This made me realize I’m very much a Zellenial must mostly Z 😬", "created_at": "2025-12-10T01:03:28", "owner": "lexydelsol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934803004107966, "text": "💀💀💀 i miss when there was some class and elegance in our speech! Wtf", "created_at": "2025-12-10T00:49:11", "owner": "abcd_deca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18169533928378606, "text": "I was born in 95…..so I get the perks of being a millennial while growing up with Gen Z lingo", "created_at": "2025-12-10T00:41:44", "owner": "sanguinefiend13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980541972783138, "text": "Gen-z real 😭💀", "created_at": "2025-12-10T00:26:40", "owner": "yapping_postting.919", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052782287347885, "text": "New gens got more creativity I feel like. Lol. I’m waiting for when millennials end up forgotten just like gen X. We are a dope ass generation so maybe we’ll be legendary like boomers but in a good way?  lol.", "created_at": "2025-12-10T00:08:38", "owner": "i8pnutbutter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084922796017948, "text": "Im sorry. No. 69 meant something. 6 7 means literally nothing", "created_at": "2025-12-09T23:55:01", "owner": "sixxisvi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070987718605312, "text": "wtf is 21 lol", "created_at": "2025-12-09T23:38:05", "owner": "asaplucyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088422883991282, "text": "What is 41?!", "created_at": "2025-12-09T22:56:15", "owner": "jupitermaui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160301197403542, "text": "Zillenials --------------->", "created_at": "2025-12-09T22:42:53", "owner": "_amliterallycommenting", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028556042760845, "text": "Am... am I a milennial? 😳", "created_at": "2025-12-09T22:10:58", "owner": "teodoir.van.staden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918557653219058, "text": "Definitely disagree with the 6/7", "created_at": "2025-12-09T22:05:42", "owner": "_datjules_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931480945136588, "text": "This is mostly incorrect, thanks!", "created_at": "2025-12-09T21:38:18", "owner": "yeah.probably.maybe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146409112441475, "text": "Tf is renegade", "created_at": "2025-12-09T21:19:16", "owner": "monicajjude", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081192191327763, "text": "As someone born in 1996 and addicted to Instagram I use a mix of gen z and millennial 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-09T21:17:42", "owner": "bonebleached", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102465628667329, "text": "Gen z", "created_at": "2025-12-09T21:01:28", "owner": "ade_monae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119939446550816, "text": "You going to fast i can't write that fast", "created_at": "2025-12-09T20:31:08", "owner": "_pinto47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062407136233309, "text": "I know more mil than genz and im 06😭", "created_at": "2025-12-09T20:28:47", "owner": "gabby__.g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18356074816163435, "text": "what about rad?", "created_at": "2025-12-09T19:45:36", "owner": "mauvetheblues666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116938522561721, "text": "I talk like a mix of a millennial and gen z, cuz I was born in 2000, so that checks.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T19:45:10", "owner": "drey_wander", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102515926740546, "text": "I'm genz tf is 21💀", "created_at": "2025-12-09T19:38:35", "owner": "hcneyxqueer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082186184117295, "text": "So im a 22 year old millennial ig", "created_at": "2025-12-09T19:31:16", "owner": "bored.kale", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095938381853457, "text": "I think i m way too old to even get the millennials😭", "created_at": "2025-12-09T19:20:28", "owner": "__popcorn.22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069831143093223, "text": "Why do I not know what some of these even mean", "created_at": "2025-12-09T19:15:50", "owner": "maddie.evans627", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080003126126844, "text": "You're a hero! ÓUÒ", "created_at": "2025-12-09T18:51:12", "owner": "lady_haraki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060207119269152, "text": "One of them I disagree", "created_at": "2025-12-09T18:50:27", "owner": "samura1_sage", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901133851180120, "text": "When did we go from actual words that mean something to literal nonsense?", "created_at": "2025-12-09T18:48:52", "owner": "chrisostapchuk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124781260517094, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-09T18:46:32", "owner": "facingdatruth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068466704123542, "text": "Millennials created STFU in like 2001 on AOL instant messenger", "created_at": "2025-12-09T18:44:32", "owner": "mtn.tops", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909227368273143, "text": "You just making up millennial lingo.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T18:20:15", "owner": "strappalachian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086301764009321, "text": "Rosetta stone of our time", "created_at": "2025-12-09T18:15:58", "owner": "corinnestagramster", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074339930198605, "text": "I’m a millennial and I don’t know the millennial vocab.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T18:13:24", "owner": "jadesofivy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029803166758260, "text": "As an almost 30-year-old youth pastor I can’t tell you how helpful this was 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T18:10:45", "owner": "the.apple.eater", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995084424852180, "text": "Don't forget that what is lost in translation", "created_at": "2025-12-09T18:02:18", "owner": "alphaprocyonx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990799179908780, "text": "I lost about 1,000 brain cells watching this thanks", "created_at": "2025-12-09T17:56:43", "owner": "igotanxiety_boi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898027414202342, "text": "Wtf is 41", "created_at": "2025-12-09T17:52:50", "owner": "hrtbunniess", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090126833310024, "text": "You literally got so many of these wrong.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T17:36:34", "owner": "danwise_g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087817130510820, "text": "me a Gen Z’er with the vocabulary of a Gen AlphaZ", "created_at": "2025-12-09T17:30:08", "owner": "yval.son", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034717523529718, "text": "Gen Z is 90% gamers calling 😂 I use mix of genz and millennial.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T17:06:48", "owner": "sahil_ar123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908090602277112, "text": "So I was right talking about this yesterday our lingo just became more stupid 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T17:05:05", "owner": "where_is_the_blunt_pakelika", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880632301333769, "text": "Yea, lemme block you with this dumb shit", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:53:16", "owner": "im_jay_scott", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18495713482073927, "text": "slow down, I’m taking notes 📝", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:48:54", "owner": "silly.mcgillicuddy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876005794450174, "text": "Im supposed to be gen z or something but I really mostly understood the stuff und Millenial bcs wtf are those words??", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:46:15", "owner": "pixmxrie_wk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337602850237603, "text": "OD is Alpha??", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:43:02", "owner": "uni_myst.ky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079718756150908, "text": "So now I know what sigma is because my 6 and 3 year old says it all the time🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:38:28", "owner": "cherrylipz21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089444657293140, "text": "I’m so confused", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:07:05", "owner": "berrydoll96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066122663148062, "text": "Sir...... Thank you", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:55:39", "owner": "lovely_lights", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084735572033578, "text": "You don’t even know how many questions you answered that have been bugging me in this one video. Thank you for making this and thank you to the insta algorithm! 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:40:27", "owner": "ashleigh2222", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074665034194226, "text": "Now I can understand these kids", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:34:39", "owner": "chanty.b.xo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048572801452434, "text": "You damn well it’s not called meat riding", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:32:23", "owner": "__noahsworld__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18385350085197804, "text": "This guy doesn't know too too much. Folks were saying OD way back in 2008. It was an acronym for oh dam", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:31:27", "owner": "latimuschadimus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102120676670776, "text": "Main character energy is a nuisance tho. Folks are too self absorbed while being another common nobody likes stfdd😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:30:01", "owner": "latimuschadimus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926221906177244, "text": "41 ? 21 ? 6 7 is the modern day 304 my guy. Try again.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:27:52", "owner": "latimuschadimus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046860011477591, "text": "I hate this timeline 😂😅", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:55:29", "owner": "emilynn_kay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106382320641019, "text": "That’s enough internet for today", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:33:38", "owner": "cl8777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112732087607790, "text": "Am I a millennial cause what the hell", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:25:32", "owner": "keimyathatsme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083620346104551, "text": "Please tell me you have a whole series of these 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:07:22", "owner": "urdreamtjanelle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922471354193394, "text": "i hate gen alpha characteristics 😭 \nmakes no sense…. & it’s even crazier bc i didn’t know a lot of these 😭😭🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:34:06", "owner": "only.henny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915480445246707, "text": "A lot of these Millennial ones are things none of us said.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:27:47", "owner": "shigeki.ei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114786229603688, "text": "I’m tired 🫩", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:24:04", "owner": "snj_3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024410912600667, "text": "Twin was around in the early 2010s in my highschool too", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:22:08", "owner": "babydavejr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862835098540978, "text": "My older cousin been Sybau since the 90s big dawg. They just never shorthaned it", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:21:34", "owner": "babydavejr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988119810867844, "text": "You do not get to give them Freddy fazbear that’s been around since I was a kid", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:46:07", "owner": "sxtxns._spxwn._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080223716170663, "text": "Early Gen Z being a mix of Gen Z and millennials. \nUses half the Gen Z and majority millennial terms", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:41:43", "owner": "hp4eva9526", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087121819989442, "text": "Just realized lock in is nawt the same as wrap it up either, nor is you’re done to stfu, but it’s more so the genz and alpha terms that are still similar to the other", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:26:26", "owner": "jessicamsernaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970375734825178, "text": "Nah 69 is not the same as the others", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:24:21", "owner": "jessicamsernaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034097096725105, "text": "Do \"chud\"", "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:04:04", "owner": "jabmooo000000000se", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932340463130898, "text": "Need this....I have a child in each😳🫤🙃", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:52:00", "owner": "msval_zpb1920", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846849367617960, "text": "OD has been a thing for so long", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:04:12", "owner": "latinojello", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063331490210599, "text": "Not gonna lie, aura points sounds cool af!!!", "created_at": "2025-12-09T09:51:24", "owner": "savamusic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096304786878636, "text": "Bro you’ve completely mixed up Gen Z and Millennial 🤦🏻‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-12-09T09:43:13", "owner": "jsolo873", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18187880905341024, "text": "I realized that brainrot is just shitpost. And shitpost was YTP", "created_at": "2025-12-09T08:54:29", "owner": "avdol_ramen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18425778559112523, "text": "This is funny and pretty accurate The people who are millennials/ Gen Z and missed out on the slang because they weren’t trendy or on the internet a lot back then, trust me he is right about 90% of them lol", "created_at": "2025-12-09T08:18:56", "owner": "plasticsavage", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081447503172553, "text": "The bruh. Sent me bc it really is gen z huh", "created_at": "2025-12-09T08:13:48", "owner": "aliciaannicole", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089037778964865, "text": "What the hell is 41", "created_at": "2025-12-09T08:07:00", "owner": "d0gth1ef", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383441872195861, "text": "I’m so old now", "created_at": "2025-12-09T07:29:44", "owner": "hezkieeel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099085207755398, "text": "I'm definitely a Zillennial", "created_at": "2025-12-09T07:23:08", "owner": "kaydoepotato", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088321381792175, "text": "I'm a gen z/ millennial as I had only older siblings and born in 96 but the Alpha terminology doesn't translate the other 2. Like 6 7 isn't 41 or 69. 6 7  is closer to millennial \"whatever\" or gen z \"meh\"", "created_at": "2025-12-09T07:13:45", "owner": "tylerloublack", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031620716750528, "text": "Gen Z and millennial all made sense, but the alpha...what on earth?", "created_at": "2025-12-09T06:55:36", "owner": "lx.kitty.xl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862846399539811, "text": "I feel really dumb after watching this and now none of the words make sense", "created_at": "2025-12-09T06:46:28", "owner": "skullsculptor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18355122046160230, "text": "69 is a position, right? You can see the position by looking at the numbers. What am I supposed to see when I look at 21 or 67? L7 makes sense and that’s boomer slang. I’m lost 😞", "created_at": "2025-12-09T06:42:16", "owner": "tiffanymiller585", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030837773773417, "text": "Bruh", "created_at": "2025-12-09T06:34:53", "owner": "zakisgone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051127070672465, "text": "I’m 26 and I don’t understand any of this 😭💀", "created_at": "2025-12-09T06:29:50", "owner": "bethaniebeauty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545124520058326, "text": "Damn I used to watch your yt vlogs.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T06:26:36", "owner": "kristian420k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906535792144075, "text": "Never heard 41 or 21, what are they origins?", "created_at": "2025-12-09T06:24:18", "owner": "rinaldigiacomo98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102922819739955, "text": "I ain’t never heard of creepy pasta before did I miss that one 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-09T06:14:54", "owner": "danielpaulferrer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184294249358854, "text": "U R GOING TOO FAST 😭🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-09T05:56:56", "owner": "fridose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083281295134540, "text": "i’m sorry to say this was actually very educational 😔", "created_at": "2025-12-09T05:48:35", "owner": "heymickey47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004308476831229, "text": "When you understand all of them :')", "created_at": "2025-12-09T05:34:40", "owner": "kreamo.o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144878926447390, "text": "hey so half of the “alpha” stuff was created by gen z just the younger gen z", "created_at": "2025-12-09T05:21:02", "owner": "alexisroper14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085004492030193, "text": "Ohio is gen z", "created_at": "2025-12-09T05:16:48", "owner": "espeletia_sp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928165429177241, "text": "Millennials have been calling dude bros Chad for 20 years. Don’t give alpha that glory lmao", "created_at": "2025-12-09T05:16:12", "owner": "miranda_danda_panda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081164165129326, "text": "You know you’re on the cusp when you understand 50/50 of Gen Z and Millennial  learn the other 50/50 of what other people been saying lol", "created_at": "2025-12-09T05:05:07", "owner": "gracefully__disheveled", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102832471672511, "text": "Thank you for your service", "created_at": "2025-12-09T04:46:03", "owner": "stvphnova_ox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106074181584463, "text": "Firstly this took like 10 years off my life secondly why do you have so many boob lights in the back lol 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T04:43:58", "owner": "abbymorrow15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086700191290507, "text": "God bless you", "created_at": "2025-12-09T04:35:13", "owner": "ohnojudydnt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088148071810849, "text": "I don’t think millennials were as obsessed with 69 as alphas are with 67 and 69 actually meant something lol", "created_at": "2025-12-09T03:51:35", "owner": "kyla.hazen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929102296118827, "text": "You forgot 1738 Gen z", "created_at": "2025-12-09T03:49:50", "owner": "sasukestarofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871667551470392, "text": "Yeaaah, but how many licks does it take? 🗣️", "created_at": "2025-12-09T03:45:30", "owner": "elcoolcucumber", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075105710203332, "text": "I needed this!!", "created_at": "2025-12-09T03:37:43", "owner": "john.a.harmon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087030826821812, "text": "Insta block", "created_at": "2025-12-09T03:04:32", "owner": "geraghtypatrick", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033544328533718, "text": "R IS FOR RETARDS", "created_at": "2025-12-09T02:41:12", "owner": "adott_4l", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070209383100157, "text": "Nah. Some of those mil words you made up 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T02:34:59", "owner": "kaliecoe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055672637323926, "text": "I’m sorry but gen alpha cannot claim chad that’s been around for a whilleeeeee", "created_at": "2025-12-09T02:33:43", "owner": "amelia.russell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18199307806322681, "text": "Can we all agree that this guy doesn't actually understand half the ones he's comparing", "created_at": "2025-12-09T02:28:11", "owner": "bandgeek225", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065240276180791, "text": "I need a monthly subscription of this guy 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-09T02:17:01", "owner": "elisa.j__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081192779157078, "text": "Based actually comes from \"based god\" which is the millennial slang", "created_at": "2025-12-09T02:15:00", "owner": "nelsnoms", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062644568223781, "text": "I hate that this was helpful 🫩", "created_at": "2025-12-09T01:58:39", "owner": "smaaash03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101586496707420, "text": "there goes 3 minutes i’ll never get back", "created_at": "2025-12-09T01:38:37", "owner": "mochikatttt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321811276174886, "text": "God... I am so cooked,send me to the backroom chat", "created_at": "2025-12-09T01:34:44", "owner": "kuntoajril", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082722902165665, "text": "My head hurts", "created_at": "2025-12-09T01:27:02", "owner": "itsreccca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123201901522513, "text": "wtf is old head", "created_at": "2025-12-09T01:25:41", "owner": "linds_spacekitten", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988170558872321, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-09T01:15:06", "owner": "elchapowasjesus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873309025465343, "text": "Bro used Google translate. Because whaaaaaaat???😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T01:07:58", "owner": "moshito_m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853395946546934, "text": "Wait aren't millennials the parents of gen alpha? What the fuck are they doing", "created_at": "2025-12-09T00:38:56", "owner": "zu_w_may", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092436809502274, "text": "How did half these saying come around? \"Oh my signa\" replaces \"bruh\" how did we go from abbreviation to using more words to say a single word.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T00:36:03", "owner": "wes_bro94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091835461938374, "text": "Wow.. and for the first time it all makes sense.. thanks bff, from an old head millennial 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T00:02:52", "owner": "itspatchbae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108480181618238, "text": "Now let’s do AAVE vs Gen-z slang and see what we come up with and how many people are using it & how Genz slang is just stolen AAVE from different parts of the US ☝🏾🤓", "created_at": "2025-12-08T23:26:47", "owner": "fairyelfangel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18413336389143023, "text": "You look like this guy I used to work with…", "created_at": "2025-12-08T22:50:14", "owner": "bed.cath.and.beyond", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17927063841187376, "text": "Same! 2002!", "created_at": "2025-12-08T22:28:19", "owner": "scrv32", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106570807567338, "text": "Gen z w", "created_at": "2025-12-08T22:20:22", "owner": "t.333.aaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876416620446691, "text": "What's 9 plus 10", "created_at": "2025-12-08T22:02:51", "owner": "scott_murrrrrrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914773822251041, "text": "I ain’t never heard “just put the fries in the bag” that’s funny as fuck😭 that’s how y’all walk in now?!", "created_at": "2025-12-08T22:02:48", "owner": "____blaque_cthulhu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942499641962268, "text": "🤣 I’m so thankful my alpha son does not talk like an alpha", "created_at": "2025-12-08T21:54:43", "owner": "unnoticed_echo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985302309761426, "text": "Is it bad I only understood The Millennial ones.. and not my gen z", "created_at": "2025-12-08T21:36:44", "owner": "milton_random_04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878790208433131, "text": "I’m definitely mil", "created_at": "2025-12-08T21:30:24", "owner": "the_traveling_mommy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066024395161011, "text": "Why does it sound like the SIMS language?🤔", "created_at": "2025-12-08T21:19:56", "owner": "miichellelizakruger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083921180113094, "text": "You’re doing the Lords work.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T21:18:52", "owner": "trentjofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094449316915444, "text": "Please do more of this.. I’m 27 my son is 8 and he said I was beta 😵‍💫", "created_at": "2025-12-08T21:17:08", "owner": "_kelsealynn_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075345086262264, "text": "I use “put the fries in the bag” as “give up”", "created_at": "2025-12-08T21:03:48", "owner": "thodwrhs.zoub", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992867475897991, "text": "Dude, alpha doesn't make any sense man", "created_at": "2025-12-08T20:39:54", "owner": "dere7linus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296782561260174, "text": "I hate it here 💀", "created_at": "2025-12-08T20:24:44", "owner": "leirbag88ozar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368231494085174, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-08T20:21:04", "owner": "tattoosbyjasonrose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110354839620264, "text": "I'm so Mil.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T20:16:35", "owner": "andrilchakraborty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082518971130241, "text": "Who ever said 41 or 21..... Also 67 is not 69 . 67 literally means nothing to confuse us, 69 is a sex reference", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:58:39", "owner": "mellojellojeff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886123870285953, "text": "God I'm stuck between gen Z and mill I'm done", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:53:34", "owner": "theblacknight_official", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17984208800767133, "text": "But 21 had 9+10", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:53:26", "owner": "tincoco_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016706630631851, "text": "Gen alpha did not create the chad shit that is more millennial or gen z😭💀", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:52:12", "owner": "cherry_trees.19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18234691522305656, "text": "am i dyslexic", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:47:08", "owner": "rupeeless", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904750060298120, "text": "Im a millennial foreigner, who grew up in non English speaking country.. im cooked", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:36:05", "owner": "smrtme_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135619138479804, "text": "I, and no millennial I know, uses 40% or what you said🥶", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:22:02", "owner": "a_thrill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137508424465555, "text": "I'm gen z but I use gen z and millennial and then never heard a few of them at all", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:20:36", "owner": "weirdplantt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082426748031916, "text": "Twin is definitely gen z 🥷🏾 been saying that ish for mad years", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:20:27", "owner": "thegreatdeceiver82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967824357994157, "text": "😭WTH did I just listen to 🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:05:47", "owner": "brittanyrosebeauty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107481259649474, "text": "This makes me a millennial.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:05:39", "owner": "allynn_rosa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114062593603647, "text": "Me, a Gen Z, with gen alpha slang", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:02:52", "owner": "gr3y50n.216", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056131145320024, "text": "Can you add the GenX translation to this one. I don’t even understand my own generation….", "created_at": "2025-12-08T18:50:23", "owner": "hankthetank1687", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087783601980220, "text": "Old head?? Wrap it up? Fry tax? As a '91 I am so lost.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T18:48:46", "owner": "blacklobeliapins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115057624583478, "text": "Ehh, no. Nope. Absolutely not. We're NOT doing this. 😐", "created_at": "2025-12-08T18:45:33", "owner": "_bobesa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18370230343083723, "text": "When you’re a mix of millennial and Gen Z", "created_at": "2025-12-08T18:37:52", "owner": "princess_mato_2311", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937729374983447, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-08T18:27:05", "owner": "2eyeshigh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959430105877910, "text": "I don’t think you’ve ever spoken to a millennial", "created_at": "2025-12-08T18:20:31", "owner": "tnoodle412", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298505428284352, "text": "Old head? We never said that", "created_at": "2025-12-08T18:19:43", "owner": "tnoodle412", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18319278889223682, "text": "What's 21", "created_at": "2025-12-08T18:03:03", "owner": "bam_emily", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923917201189599, "text": "Thank you for this translation", "created_at": "2025-12-08T17:54:34", "owner": "ru30104", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994792722712858, "text": "It- Freddy fazbearing??? When did that become a thing??😭😭 Also I'm a Gen Z with half Z and half Mil vocab lol", "created_at": "2025-12-08T17:47:17", "owner": "rocksy_yt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18107475238651759, "text": "Gen Z is arguably the least unhinged but also creative.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T17:37:09", "owner": "blakeacuff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032265890742763, "text": "what the fuck is 41", "created_at": "2025-12-08T17:21:25", "owner": "yost.rubie_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075149168205356, "text": "This is actually the Rosetta Stone of this age 😮", "created_at": "2025-12-08T17:08:17", "owner": "lilshiro123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109726741628211, "text": "It’s not crap it’s hot garbage…where did you get this shit from", "created_at": "2025-12-08T17:05:10", "owner": "akui0816", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18548044957042802, "text": "I refuse to believe Alpha is walking around talking like this. 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T17:04:11", "owner": "mister.coop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858626845560527, "text": "So Gen Z is just from New York? Lmao", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:52:24", "owner": "healinevolving_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929067727157684, "text": "So if that’s the case, Why is everyone saying 69 then lol", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:46:16", "owner": "diumplingz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086108171065954, "text": "1738 is genZ 67 btw", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:41:01", "owner": "tgray._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067458134431153, "text": "Twin(z) is Fat Joe & Big Pun lol", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:34:47", "owner": "parisdiamondforpresident", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047687063692661, "text": "You are going to heaven 🙏🏾", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:33:16", "owner": "shanique_peart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065991890428658, "text": "If you’re a black millennial we probably say all these", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:18:12", "owner": "soycollinito", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100169899696003, "text": "Genz & Mill here", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:08:44", "owner": "kurzefault", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090970097501488, "text": "What the skibidi sigma? Dudebro just put the fries in the bag with the creepy pasta looksmaxxing the aura, total glazing.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:00:57", "owner": "hi_key_xanny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087822857312450, "text": "Aura is pervasive it's not just alpha", "created_at": "2025-12-08T15:55:07", "owner": "houserz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152179294420898, "text": "I feel like genz and alpha are being credited too many of the millenial words, but im ashamed of them anyway so they can keep em", "created_at": "2025-12-08T15:46:21", "owner": "angellomaggio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884647441417403, "text": "Pretty much", "created_at": "2025-12-08T15:41:03", "owner": "chaossol2005", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959895372878812, "text": "When you use a mix of these (mostly Gen Z and Millennial) as a Gen Z", "created_at": "2025-12-08T15:24:39", "owner": "nocturnal._.bibliophile__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046920524477550, "text": "@o.o_diana", "created_at": "2025-12-08T15:10:57", "owner": "mellowmarsh21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092697814912899, "text": "Pretty sure dog water has been around before Gen Z was even born 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T14:59:28", "owner": "ya_habesha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978706311939156, "text": "Well i guess that makes you a choogy boomer lmfaoo", "created_at": "2025-12-08T14:54:34", "owner": "jonah_kench", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871865071469437, "text": "I speak English not moron", "created_at": "2025-12-08T14:11:25", "owner": "daniellgarrett3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108248308619472, "text": "Thanks for the dictionary. As a millennial, I needed it", "created_at": "2025-12-08T13:54:45", "owner": "fluxelectro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082738090886199, "text": "Got every single one except unc", "created_at": "2025-12-08T13:50:48", "owner": "dcursedsavior", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859085632501708, "text": "Im such a mix of gen z and Mil", "created_at": "2025-12-08T13:48:27", "owner": "kenny81330", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544140982033374, "text": "Some of these I can’t co sign , fuck is creepy pasta. And “you’re done” was like not everybody. And sybau in Mil is shut your bitch ass up. We don’t abbreviate", "created_at": "2025-12-08T13:37:29", "owner": "frostondon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111726355617623, "text": "All ts is dumb 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-08T13:35:14", "owner": "nahlicroix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084327806513996, "text": "I didn’t even understand some of the millennial ones😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T13:32:46", "owner": "caitlyn_rose318", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942423666962149, "text": "Thank you because I have not installed the latest software update 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-08T13:18:06", "owner": "not.ur.cupcakke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049947233412387, "text": "Gen Alpha sounds like absolute brainrot", "created_at": "2025-12-08T13:02:28", "owner": "mesamsugandh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116997100562338, "text": "Im pretty sure 67 is more on par with 1738 than it is 21", "created_at": "2025-12-08T13:01:24", "owner": "crown.rose11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101048824776873, "text": "I’m an older millennial and I haven’t heard of half of those millennial ones…. But my kids have taught me all the others. 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T12:50:54", "owner": "rose.david163", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917230888228870, "text": "I thought people knew canto with the 67", "created_at": "2025-12-08T12:40:46", "owner": "shawnteaye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113770321601155, "text": "The only one I have a problem with is your explanation of 67.You got that so wrong as someone that not only has a gen z child but an alpha child as well.67 means so so. Or in millennial terms it's whatever", "created_at": "2025-12-08T12:26:22", "owner": "country_queen2010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136060447469519, "text": "@z_lewison 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T11:55:38", "owner": "tattylolo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861531307547126, "text": "Is this rage bait?", "created_at": "2025-12-08T11:44:02", "owner": "michaeliot", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18161844190398820, "text": "@x__.__jordy__.__x", "created_at": "2025-12-08T11:42:42", "owner": "shancreatescontent", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979457490933679, "text": "Um. How the fuck is sigma, based and savage even remotely similar", "created_at": "2025-12-08T11:38:12", "owner": "browniewhat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059517248282033, "text": "Damn! 😅😅😅 I never understood the vocabulary until I saw the mil version now!", "created_at": "2025-12-08T11:09:11", "owner": "devilz_incarnation", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858473713561389, "text": "What is 67 😭 this just made it more confusing. Google and chat saying different things aswell sigh", "created_at": "2025-12-08T10:53:38", "owner": "lady.joa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932323726132707, "text": "Realising I am definitely a cusp baby of Gen Z and Millennials 😪", "created_at": "2025-12-08T10:50:12", "owner": "alesha.honnor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978845937937262, "text": "I don't really agree with 67 and 21, 21 was a reference to a specific video that was funny to watch and mock because the kid got it wrong. 67 has dubious origins and isn't referencing anything", "created_at": "2025-12-08T10:45:05", "owner": "zxnightfall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041494988505769, "text": "Did the Alphas steal cheugy boomer from the sims?", "created_at": "2025-12-08T10:22:44", "owner": "shani.drawz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18339968893227369, "text": "Thanks!\nWe need more of this!", "created_at": "2025-12-08T10:20:53", "owner": "matrix_matrix_matrix_neo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063450203212707, "text": "I also enjoy the 90s very much. But I wasn't born yet.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T10:00:58", "owner": "tjlg999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959343507878736, "text": "I talk mor like a millennial. Even though I am a Gen Z", "created_at": "2025-12-08T09:59:19", "owner": "tjlg999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042978581687295, "text": "Does lock in and youre done mean 2 different things? Alpha one makes no sense do idc about it", "created_at": "2025-12-08T09:57:06", "owner": "brad.05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984051084923917, "text": "i get unc and that’s all i understand from gen goldfish.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T09:29:39", "owner": "hlnx.personal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065984612387205, "text": "But gen z use aura", "created_at": "2025-12-08T09:28:10", "owner": "s.2601_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119367874556436, "text": "This really helped thank you", "created_at": "2025-12-08T09:23:32", "owner": "eynav_haviv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101249809774633, "text": "wtf is fry tax", "created_at": "2025-12-08T07:46:17", "owner": "mewkitsu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883212175303858, "text": "Repeat with Gen X please", "created_at": "2025-12-08T07:14:48", "owner": "texasm87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18355114672164942, "text": "i laughed so hard at sybau bc ive never seen that yet but instantly understood, scrolled to the next reel (a whole other topic), laughed and checked comments to see what the people are saying and see SYBAU 😂😭 wtfff", "created_at": "2025-12-08T06:42:00", "owner": "mvrie.idv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027719069575892, "text": "When the heck did we ever say, \"Old head\" or \"creepy pasta\" or \"Nightmare fuel\"???", "created_at": "2025-12-08T06:31:13", "owner": "crispkittens", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131025727501037, "text": "The way that I have to watch these now to know wtf is going on 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-08T06:29:46", "owner": "donkeygonmel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048901889679591, "text": "Od barely made it to gen z, no fkin way it’s gen alpha", "created_at": "2025-12-08T06:26:49", "owner": "jaybravopark", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051369791385624, "text": "Your millennial terms are way off my guy", "created_at": "2025-12-08T06:25:15", "owner": "young_and_aspiring", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103721329676900, "text": "First one is wrong. Almost every single one after that was wrong. Also, millennials were saying “dog water” back in 2010.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T05:59:19", "owner": "matthawkz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900464137184250, "text": "This dude has zero fucking idea what he’s talking about.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T05:52:37", "owner": "fuckinely", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104235997664696, "text": "Ngl…I’m only 30 & this helped 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-08T05:47:16", "owner": "avatar.arii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003453770681857, "text": "No bc why did this check out", "created_at": "2025-12-08T05:44:22", "owner": "evbraybrook", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18415874188136939, "text": "According to this video: \"alright bucko, no more Mr nice guy, see you later alligator\" - A millenial probably", "created_at": "2025-12-08T05:30:45", "owner": "_foxxy_grandpa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888061804402515, "text": "Nah, 21 and 69 have origin stories, 67 literally means nothing.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T05:19:36", "owner": "odiseven", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993165420906317, "text": "As a millennial, i don't know any millennial that says \"creepy pasta\" TF", "created_at": "2025-12-08T05:14:50", "owner": "ekaytenshi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909842902267074, "text": "Is this white millennial lingo????", "created_at": "2025-12-08T05:12:10", "owner": "ekaytenshi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18393553258132478, "text": "?????????", "created_at": "2025-12-08T05:11:38", "owner": "ekaytenshi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107067547647251, "text": "What’s old head", "created_at": "2025-12-08T04:52:52", "owner": "pawhaus_cafe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091401193935227, "text": "idk what any of this is lol", "created_at": "2025-12-08T04:52:23", "owner": "xx.paolaa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064842011168048, "text": "Bruh moment !!!!", "created_at": "2025-12-08T04:40:38", "owner": "undergroundcatgarage", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868963456486220, "text": "no wonder people think im a millennial 😅", "created_at": "2025-12-08T04:36:21", "owner": "snaildealer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089900423064235, "text": "@theforreststump", "created_at": "2025-12-08T04:33:10", "owner": "fulmetalartimis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050468423389954, "text": "This makes me want to bury my head in sand", "created_at": "2025-12-08T04:21:28", "owner": "sadieee_d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109092709615702, "text": "So Gen Z got the best lingo", "created_at": "2025-12-08T04:01:08", "owner": "notwilliamng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135745414475521, "text": "41?", "created_at": "2025-12-08T04:00:03", "owner": "pacmantheking", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18514250299070563, "text": "Ngl a lot of the alpha slang is actually gen z", "created_at": "2025-12-08T03:23:41", "owner": "3rd_w0nderr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931786864112763, "text": "Noooooo it’s all wrong", "created_at": "2025-12-08T02:58:17", "owner": "authenticallyshanice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023974511600698, "text": "Thank you. I didn’t know what any of them were saying🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-08T02:49:48", "owner": "lilmoma12777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073724696357485, "text": "aired is alpha slang now? ive been saying that longer than all of them have been alive lol", "created_at": "2025-12-08T02:18:44", "owner": "raptore.x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304502068264087, "text": "not the \"h311a\" 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-08T02:07:33", "owner": "eggutartuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086763941073129, "text": "Millennials have unanimously decided this was a lie 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T02:04:59", "owner": "carlos_m_realtor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148500373438068, "text": "Older Gen Z here and I prefer to use Millennial slang cause that’s what I grew up using. The new Gen Z terms are more for younger Gen Z and came into play in like the last 2-3 years.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T02:04:23", "owner": "swethagollapalli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878927092438302, "text": "Old head ass", "created_at": "2025-12-08T01:51:08", "owner": "damnitdannny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855506398577284, "text": "Nobody says creepy pasta", "created_at": "2025-12-08T01:48:33", "owner": "ferrdahh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025669163784519, "text": "no way 41 ie an actual thing", "created_at": "2025-12-08T01:22:07", "owner": "epsoundsest2k17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078645838952480, "text": "Bro doesn't know ball...21 is millennial", "created_at": "2025-12-08T01:17:12", "owner": "khalididdisah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950745459918124, "text": "Yeah some of the mil word were like nah.i never used that.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T01:10:51", "owner": "iamkevinheard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544410424024666, "text": "Thanks, I need this! 🥀", "created_at": "2025-12-08T01:04:11", "owner": "grahamlee0218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148360807441888, "text": "Thank you.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T00:51:59", "owner": "elegantedge_beauty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061914293236986, "text": "I feel like the Gen z one is actually millennial bc huh we use stfu and glow up , boomer, and lock in. Never heard the millennial versions of those ever used lmao", "created_at": "2025-12-08T00:47:15", "owner": "cantarella.kisses", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870464806472336, "text": "Creepypastas are definitely Gen Z, but more so early to mid Gen Z.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T00:25:14", "owner": "bbrydrip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115294384566621, "text": "This was incredibly informational thank you", "created_at": "2025-12-07T23:47:29", "owner": "_pandas.x3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320043835220412, "text": "Thank you, please do this every six months 🤣🤣🙌🏽", "created_at": "2025-12-07T23:43:02", "owner": "callmeindigo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069345608569613, "text": "this is the dumbest shit", "created_at": "2025-12-07T23:41:52", "owner": "_j.kalai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893547355367196, "text": "I talk so many languages and none of them are usefull 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-07T23:34:08", "owner": "elda_uwu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088533475800722, "text": "This helped alot thanks", "created_at": "2025-12-07T23:30:47", "owner": "bythewiz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101038465781711, "text": "I'm just gonna delete myself", "created_at": "2025-12-07T23:22:08", "owner": "ninjamaster1721", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121500037539370, "text": "So I'm a Gen Z with a mix of Gen Z and Millennial vocab. Got it. But in all honesty Gen Alpha slang is just \"dog water\" 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-07T23:10:50", "owner": "jibarlakka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056650544322470, "text": "I'm all of it", "created_at": "2025-12-07T22:44:22", "owner": "ma.dmax4124", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860914468551006, "text": "Isn’t chugey a millennial word? I remember it being talked about in articles in high school", "created_at": "2025-12-07T22:06:19", "owner": "redhac_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18402220039193499, "text": "This is all wrong 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T22:03:11", "owner": "iv0ctob3r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130909768494675, "text": "No hating on alpha pls!!", "created_at": "2025-12-07T21:54:59", "owner": "rach.l.neil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544552657048538, "text": "This is so helpful!!", "created_at": "2025-12-07T21:54:49", "owner": "rach.l.neil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979540206785603, "text": "Im gen z and i didnt know that we replaced 69 for 21 wtff???", "created_at": "2025-12-07T21:42:48", "owner": "akustikami", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911329972257229, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T21:30:31", "owner": "k3nny_v3l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085670990485963, "text": "21, 420, 69", "created_at": "2025-12-07T21:16:35", "owner": "ewan_32", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075359009258714, "text": "Half of the stuff you say is mil is Gen z", "created_at": "2025-12-07T21:10:37", "owner": "need_lamp_am_not_mothman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950926482921251, "text": "Now that I know I’m gonna use an intricate Alpha sentence on my 12 year old and freak her tf out I just gotta watch this video 8 more times 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T20:54:15", "owner": "_mahoganywood", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961052587007137, "text": "I died in pain waching this.", "created_at": "2025-12-07T20:44:03", "owner": "trusted__adult", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061543697240848, "text": "hard watch", "created_at": "2025-12-07T20:42:24", "owner": "nottthefrackingg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952604617025874, "text": "I have a headache now 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T20:34:34", "owner": "being_j.e.s.s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071947898368190, "text": "Very helpful", "created_at": "2025-12-07T20:31:31", "owner": "farha_laskar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18297079612256502, "text": "wtf is is Gen Z lingo please that alpha shit is wack lol", "created_at": "2025-12-07T20:19:30", "owner": "onlyone_trizz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072886157346463, "text": "This is all part of the devils plan 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T20:17:22", "owner": "djkswift", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060279341268282, "text": "I’m gen z and Mil…..I was born 1998😅🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-07T20:15:39", "owner": "cute_bunny_girllhugv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049873601414553, "text": "Gen Alpha is over the top", "created_at": "2025-12-07T20:06:40", "owner": "neurotic_overthinker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095954065861878, "text": "Ohio is the one I am most shocked by", "created_at": "2025-12-07T20:05:50", "owner": "keliannnnailek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845879536606335, "text": "Why does some gen z & millennials slang I don't understand.....I'm an alien", "created_at": "2025-12-07T20:00:58", "owner": "sherriee0910", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050845604397474, "text": "I’mma tell you right now my mom doesn’t know any of these words as a millennial, mil slang is just 2018", "created_at": "2025-12-07T19:57:53", "owner": "honey_belle.920", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870242887473753, "text": "A lot of the gen z slang examples are millenial though", "created_at": "2025-12-07T19:24:08", "owner": "lunar_femme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083778761323073, "text": "Tick Tok slang is AAVE is black", "created_at": "2025-12-07T19:22:19", "owner": "lytehill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031961576749585, "text": "Bruh why do I have a mix of all three 😅😭💀", "created_at": "2025-12-07T19:12:22", "owner": "dani3.0518", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877735093441664, "text": "As a mil I habe never said some of that", "created_at": "2025-12-07T18:47:32", "owner": "muh__ree_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919034011226940, "text": "Cheugy was gen z but niche gen z", "created_at": "2025-12-07T18:40:29", "owner": "ohmminus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118167664564068, "text": "Fk Gen Alpha", "created_at": "2025-12-07T18:37:02", "owner": "jxvier_nitroxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352394140203046, "text": "@tylerjackowskiofficial", "created_at": "2025-12-07T18:28:54", "owner": "whiterabbit6304", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879056239435365, "text": "Millennial/genz  fluent.  Too old for alpha", "created_at": "2025-12-07T18:10:28", "owner": "froggie_babie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18569176414016314, "text": "This was educational 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-07T18:08:02", "owner": "the.real.me19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924078424190639, "text": "I’m getting off the internet", "created_at": "2025-12-07T17:58:31", "owner": "mellow_mouse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18422051185112802, "text": "I don't think those Alpha phrases are used often though", "created_at": "2025-12-07T17:56:19", "owner": "nuriya_nazar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866369368435015, "text": "I’m a mix of gen Z and alpha, and yet, I was born in 2002, WHAA?!", "created_at": "2025-12-07T17:26:14", "owner": "nessrules44", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18106458718633958, "text": "As a millennial I’ve never heard of any of those lmao", "created_at": "2025-12-07T17:08:26", "owner": "alohanu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955165848898069, "text": "As an elder millennial I don't understand any of the apparently millennial slang except stfu and 69", "created_at": "2025-12-07T16:46:11", "owner": "lynvank", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048625733444658, "text": "I’m a little of all three but I’m also raising gen z and alpha 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-07T16:35:04", "owner": "thee.tianarae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083108951103741, "text": "As a millennial I’m glad they made dog water a thing again been saying it my whole life", "created_at": "2025-12-07T16:20:07", "owner": "zac_the_builder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062128673235703, "text": "Thank you for your services.", "created_at": "2025-12-07T16:04:51", "owner": "dani_admas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037290188715887, "text": "I’m so confused lol do we even speak English anymore lol", "created_at": "2025-12-07T15:56:17", "owner": "quxxnangel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988412610909411, "text": "Fuxk all this shit ion even know what they talm bout", "created_at": "2025-12-07T15:53:18", "owner": "manny1464", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929231197145245, "text": "i taught me so much i don’t know", "created_at": "2025-12-07T15:49:18", "owner": "drobliviouss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176441047366719, "text": "I hate it here", "created_at": "2025-12-07T15:18:06", "owner": "hippiemermaid420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084172100098585, "text": "Thank you.  I'm going to use this yo make sentences to communicate with my children because the words I use they don't understand.", "created_at": "2025-12-07T14:52:00", "owner": "justsomerandommichelle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087003926079332, "text": "All things said is retarded", "created_at": "2025-12-07T14:45:18", "owner": "lberg_1983", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866321899513249, "text": "Wait you went to fast go back!", "created_at": "2025-12-07T14:37:53", "owner": "mt_rush2fit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889225117265922, "text": "Why am i a mix of mil and gen z? And 0% related to gen alpha?", "created_at": "2025-12-07T14:36:06", "owner": "3li_el3li", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052709609341890, "text": "And then there is Pauly Shore 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T14:05:11", "owner": "livilivi82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977927094948734, "text": "literally i’m almost 30 and i’ve been saying dog water since i was 9", "created_at": "2025-12-07T14:04:30", "owner": "owennsmiith", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084495488107198, "text": "I just speak English because I've gone through schooling..", "created_at": "2025-12-07T13:52:27", "owner": "androneshots", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18192037258329320, "text": "I’m sorry. Over half of these I’m still not sure of wtf you said.", "created_at": "2025-12-07T13:43:18", "owner": "sohmageek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160731490393414, "text": "What do they use for xD?", "created_at": "2025-12-07T13:35:30", "owner": "nadywing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056416217330649, "text": "I refuse to accept 67 is the new 21", "created_at": "2025-12-07T13:32:33", "owner": "theironfrontraven3424", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022286573607436, "text": "gen alpha: chef", "created_at": "2025-12-07T13:19:24", "owner": "owizuka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075511661007130, "text": "Wat 😶", "created_at": "2025-12-07T13:19:05", "owner": "ifaa.amit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842342299644351, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T13:18:38", "owner": "maide.akd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903418900318175, "text": "“Just put the fiees in the bag” is somerhing i would say to a former friend while he tries to make small talk", "created_at": "2025-12-07T13:17:55", "owner": "abduraim_geaner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078650030272733, "text": "During the millennial years, phrases were based from the city you were from and not social media like Gen z and alpha. Those phrases you mentioned for millennials were just off because you placed some catchy ones that were probably used in your hometown.", "created_at": "2025-12-07T12:55:39", "owner": "gorditorich", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015401480801218, "text": "atleast till GenZ is still understandable by words.. 😭💀", "created_at": "2025-12-07T12:41:58", "owner": "nekoruu06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045292919480268, "text": "Sybauysf", "created_at": "2025-12-07T12:40:59", "owner": "kenzielunt_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077712467238292, "text": "I mean which millennials are these??", "created_at": "2025-12-07T12:37:51", "owner": "milinshah486", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18343200970229042, "text": "As a gen z, i go by milenials and some genz sht", "created_at": "2025-12-07T12:35:03", "owner": "kasper.martens2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879748813431884, "text": "Can we go back to speak proper English instead of trying to come up with idiotic dialects.", "created_at": "2025-12-07T12:25:20", "owner": "macw.alt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18326873260245628, "text": "69 will always be 69… it’s 69 for a reason!!! 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-07T12:20:51", "owner": "ahb1998_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861259129479940, "text": "Haven’t heard “nightmare fuel” in so long", "created_at": "2025-12-07T12:19:28", "owner": "c__brisa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338467741229469, "text": "Missinformation 67 is NOT 69", "created_at": "2025-12-07T12:15:41", "owner": "alxndrlctvn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154714693423879, "text": "67 came from alpha Gen", "created_at": "2025-12-07T12:15:41", "owner": "jd_parrott", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853386583592247, "text": "6 7 doesn't have a meaning so it doesn't correlate with anything you mentioned", "created_at": "2025-12-07T12:12:20", "owner": "nextorarepar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915384172093045, "text": "What am I? Gen M?😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-07T11:48:39", "owner": "makkayy_oz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889733452391013, "text": "41 now? 🙃😭\n17-38 👀", "created_at": "2025-12-07T11:48:20", "owner": "asonjj_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18328249612208652, "text": "Bahaha this is the most accurate representation I’ve seen", "created_at": "2025-12-07T11:41:50", "owner": "lexi.huff_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992287041728088, "text": "Gen alpha screams circumcision is causing  people to lose brain cells", "created_at": "2025-12-07T11:22:40", "owner": "bluielouis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085256323999156, "text": "Please slow down 🤣💀", "created_at": "2025-12-07T11:11:32", "owner": "kayghetto_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18394803418124880, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T11:03:49", "owner": "aastreas_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998343687704559, "text": "What’s 41 guys", "created_at": "2025-12-07T10:28:10", "owner": "sybau_turtle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855594436577440, "text": "I feel like you mixed up gen z and millennial.... Because I've never heard of the millennial ones but I say the gen z ones", "created_at": "2025-12-07T10:26:41", "owner": "personal.danielwilliams", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18173099191371213, "text": "Why does Gen Alpha have so much FNAF slang", "created_at": "2025-12-07T10:20:59", "owner": "cjy_ct_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139041865411260, "text": "I’m lost and ur going too fast", "created_at": "2025-12-07T10:18:56", "owner": "asilajaay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979764879946607, "text": "This doesn't make any sense and also really speaks louder for why Americans are strange and needing for so many words, pronunciationsexc. 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-07T10:10:22", "owner": "bjoern.frederiksson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096312241875998, "text": "Mog...had me looking for thick moms", "created_at": "2025-12-07T09:34:57", "owner": "joiedamack", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148117039384374, "text": "Gen Z and Alpha hyvrid here, Im literally 21", "created_at": "2025-12-07T09:34:19", "owner": "kaisenable", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082081259320056, "text": "What in all numeral fucks is 41 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-07T09:17:57", "owner": "rhino746969", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087872320806858, "text": "Nah bro caps", "created_at": "2025-12-07T09:00:03", "owner": "spicydragonspunk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971064459968107, "text": "mama no way this isn’t shit u made up", "created_at": "2025-12-07T08:59:54", "owner": "emillyrobins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18521708059064005, "text": "As a Gen Z who also counts as a Zillenial . Ty. There’s been a lot of confusion.", "created_at": "2025-12-07T08:54:15", "owner": "ragingrachelgoddessofwar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854374324588908, "text": "Omg i love gen alpha slang. First half i was mostly gen z and mil but second half alpha was growing in me. \"Twin\" for bestie is hella cute. And od for hella also just chefs kiss.", "created_at": "2025-12-07T08:37:40", "owner": "nickelcreations", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991016253904394, "text": "Brain rot is brain rot is brain ROT", "created_at": "2025-12-07T08:31:52", "owner": "nickofpie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931160635012331, "text": "What about gen X and boomer slang?", "created_at": "2025-12-07T08:15:43", "owner": "vanta5514", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105425107729796, "text": "Oh… I’m gen z but talk like all 3", "created_at": "2025-12-07T08:14:01", "owner": "thekayleighanne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995127381854637, "text": "I'm 100% Gen Z", "created_at": "2025-12-07T08:12:24", "owner": "3msmobileyt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916691704229075, "text": "OD and High key are literally not the same.", "created_at": "2025-12-07T08:11:12", "owner": "trirenee_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995331855854518, "text": "OD is overdose, ODEE is hella", "created_at": "2025-12-07T08:08:56", "owner": "lunardlight", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18548886316018831, "text": "What generation am I from if I talk like a millennial but I understand Gen Z", "created_at": "2025-12-07T07:57:09", "owner": "_davidlott", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058479905301394, "text": "I’ve heard and said old head or og depending", "created_at": "2025-12-07T07:56:25", "owner": "harleyquinn2169", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087918520818377, "text": "Glazing is great", "created_at": "2025-12-07T07:53:01", "owner": "ernie602", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000497081693156, "text": "yall know when genz started right?? all those millenial ones are literally genz ones", "created_at": "2025-12-07T07:33:21", "owner": "x_z0mb13edd1e_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900979786342347, "text": "I guess I’m old ? Because the millennial slang feels like it was written yesterday 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-07T07:33:20", "owner": "viribus____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071329292372806, "text": "I talk like a mix of Gen Z and Millennial with a dash of Gen Aloha when I feel like being annoying", "created_at": "2025-12-07T07:26:29", "owner": "life_is_a_m3ss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914369368243486, "text": "I’m mostly gen z, some millennial and just a tiiiny bit of alpha in there \nBorn in 94 ✌️", "created_at": "2025-12-07T07:14:09", "owner": "tayaspirits", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302037223269790, "text": "Everything gen z is millenials too lmao.", "created_at": "2025-12-07T07:06:38", "owner": "lextheshaman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068039054385935, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T06:56:46", "owner": "e_hoot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072380078361537, "text": "Creepy pasta? I’ve never heard anybody say that in my life. 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T06:56:32", "owner": "samueldutton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117853978491859, "text": "Zillenial represent!", "created_at": "2025-12-07T06:56:13", "owner": "e_hoot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936679366106276, "text": "I honestly appreciate you for making this.", "created_at": "2025-12-07T06:55:05", "owner": "ashleylynnwarren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079437010946189, "text": "So this is what my child be saying!!😮😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T06:50:44", "owner": "lovemillzforevr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18173925781373136, "text": "Alpha is cooked.", "created_at": "2025-12-07T06:40:27", "owner": "ericreesefn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171223750374198, "text": "“Chad” has been used for way longer than alpha has been alive", "created_at": "2025-12-07T06:28:11", "owner": "louwho.g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093067369912462, "text": "most of gen z are wrong", "created_at": "2025-12-07T06:11:19", "owner": "hinata.san7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102725575742960, "text": "6,7 and 21 is nowhere in the same league as 69", "created_at": "2025-12-07T06:03:03", "owner": "nodough_gaming", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050515958400986, "text": "Bruh my son always say what the sigma and I thought he was just makin up ish 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T06:02:43", "owner": "cyn.cyr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969448473830202, "text": "I don't really understand Gen Alpha slang at all.. Mostly because I'm an early/middle Gen Z that still got a so much of Millenial's influence -- fuck, I don't even understand some of Gen Z's slang- 🥀", "created_at": "2025-12-07T05:54:32", "owner": "brin_a_brinn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137957626417912, "text": "Fuck my life", "created_at": "2025-12-07T05:34:31", "owner": "gamerey43", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18299014111256367, "text": "I'm a millennial and I just got to say the newer Generations are retarded as f***😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T05:28:27", "owner": "tha_randomguy66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066824279145036, "text": "Naa thank you fr 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-07T05:25:11", "owner": "anne_skye20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895156222360058, "text": "I'm still using the wtf wth and awkward 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T05:19:46", "owner": "gundamalternateuniverse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975545322950114, "text": "I fear all of this would have been easier to understand if gen alpha actually used sentences and didnt just say the random words. \"This is so creepy pasta coded\" \"Its giving backrooms\" understandable if you know what those are.... and via context clues and actual sentence structure would make Ohio understandable but they dont say \"This has Ohio energy\" or \"its giving ohio\" they just say \"ohio\" and on context it makes no sense without an actual sentences", "created_at": "2025-12-07T05:18:49", "owner": "bubbles_2528", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074093207032564, "text": "How 6/7 can be 69?? 🤌🏻", "created_at": "2025-12-07T05:10:23", "owner": "arthurscmdt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096428806868423, "text": "I’m gen z but ya know I’m more like zillenial but anyways this helped so much cuz now I can know what the kids talk about at my work (I work in a school) 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-07T05:04:07", "owner": "brisa.girl143", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076806476220791, "text": "Ah.. ahhh fuck i suddenly get it when it hits the mil mark. Ffs", "created_at": "2025-12-07T05:01:48", "owner": "trecklerzzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049727363410834, "text": "Going too fast for my Millennial brain", "created_at": "2025-12-07T05:00:06", "owner": "annniejl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867332704505745, "text": "I feel my brain cells dying with each word", "created_at": "2025-12-07T04:45:05", "owner": "eloinhilo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972522876969406, "text": "Who the hell is Cheugy boomer?", "created_at": "2025-12-07T04:44:52", "owner": "_myrie._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986808789912657, "text": "I am saving this.", "created_at": "2025-12-07T04:43:33", "owner": "thebadhairguy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954261154045675, "text": "@kennyl_g bro o finally learnt what Sigma means", "created_at": "2025-12-07T04:32:03", "owner": "kristuckher", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078184199195426, "text": "Wait wait wait, let me grab a notepad and repeat slower", "created_at": "2025-12-07T04:12:12", "owner": "unashamed85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077017775221849, "text": "I hate that I understand", "created_at": "2025-12-07T04:05:20", "owner": "madiwgiler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862489072541235, "text": "Never do this again", "created_at": "2025-12-07T03:59:10", "owner": "not.braedon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120939328540165, "text": "Gen Alpha did not come up with Chad bro 🥀", "created_at": "2025-12-07T03:58:27", "owner": "celexials", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18173594116369751, "text": "Okay but this actually helped so much ty", "created_at": "2025-12-07T03:48:00", "owner": "britwen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048894335425464, "text": "This was so helpful ty", "created_at": "2025-12-07T03:43:17", "owner": "four.eyed.dreamer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867567907489675, "text": "OK, I’m kind of getting it now. If only you added the GenX, I probably would have really gotten it. 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T03:23:15", "owner": "melid211", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18323052964245420, "text": "OMG THAK YOU", "created_at": "2025-12-07T03:16:52", "owner": "forgets_and_shiggles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097306537881546, "text": "thank u, finally i can understand younger people again xD", "created_at": "2025-12-07T03:10:30", "owner": "artemiss_eve", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988505979864697, "text": "None of these were accurate comparisons lol", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:30:32", "owner": "cosmaxology", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18179438779363015, "text": "Holy shit full circle gen alpha brought back od 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:29:16", "owner": "kae.taurus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885104299406753, "text": "Lol thing is a lot of the terms of one gen come from a streamer of the previous gen.", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:25:30", "owner": "mikeyj2salty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052210487367793, "text": "I’m definitely a zillennial", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:22:30", "owner": "realitys_dream_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321314128170108, "text": "this is god’s work", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:19:03", "owner": "studiotoxic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086247320088064, "text": "I’m ngl 90% of the “millennial” ones were just Gen Z ones", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:17:43", "owner": "soratehe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077994821230463, "text": "Wait why am i Alpha and GenZ but a sprinkle of Mil 😣", "created_at": "2025-12-07T01:56:29", "owner": "justngozi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127445599513992, "text": "Not Gen z trying to take credit for our bruh. 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-07T01:53:54", "owner": "jazzi_fizz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081647330175879, "text": "I got stupider watching this", "created_at": "2025-12-07T01:25:15", "owner": "cameron.jensen.5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106098616728399, "text": "When half of these are wrong bro 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T01:22:56", "owner": "sumercruz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18382553290151458, "text": "Confirmation of my millenialism", "created_at": "2025-12-07T01:21:04", "owner": "kika_foodie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972838713812317, "text": "That's Rosetta Stone Stuff.", "created_at": "2025-12-07T00:50:38", "owner": "mht0404", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121902187542235, "text": "I never heard of creepy pasta", "created_at": "2025-12-07T00:39:52", "owner": "theditsy.hufflebutt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891452995380083, "text": "Put the fries in the bag is not the same as lock in", "created_at": "2025-12-07T00:37:39", "owner": "496d20736f20616c6f4e65", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547801555023106, "text": "Gen Z clears", "created_at": "2025-12-07T00:21:11", "owner": "chad.naquin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051806072376030, "text": "Gen Z is the best slang", "created_at": "2025-12-07T00:13:28", "owner": "sam_ashby_97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868351306494115, "text": "First one I’ve seen that’s accurate", "created_at": "2025-12-07T00:10:49", "owner": "mgarden06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094691902705117, "text": "67 means everything and nothing at the same time. 69 means a specific thing. Never used old head, I’d say a dinosaur or fossil. GTFO would be a more appropriate equivalent to STFU than “you’re done” and I’d argue all three of those are mil words. “Lock it in” would be more like “commit.” Awkward and cringe are mil words and cringe is negative while awkward is not necessarily negative. Random is for a thing/situation while rando is a person. Aura = energy = vibes (all three are used by millennials in different situations.) Hella is high key? I wouldn’t know but something tells me this is wrong.", "created_at": "2025-12-07T00:05:49", "owner": "jcaranda2002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138768790411276, "text": "Tf is 21??? And 41", "created_at": "2025-12-06T23:48:46", "owner": "klb.grace", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869011573483945, "text": "od is not gen alpha", "created_at": "2025-12-06T23:26:14", "owner": "a.doork", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892248871243524, "text": "Gen x had your mom.😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T23:18:33", "owner": "dazza_brunton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084926354012796, "text": "unc means uncool", "created_at": "2025-12-06T23:18:05", "owner": "jizzy.pop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092001569479574, "text": "I hate how much this helped my millennial ass.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T23:17:57", "owner": "pamela_really", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917688037219251, "text": "These are all wrong everything but alpha", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:52:30", "owner": "kyneedtolosefat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331822177210597, "text": "U forgot abt the whip", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:51:25", "owner": "nathanpmajor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061405643556605, "text": "Im somewhere between gen z nd millennial 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:47:17", "owner": "ssspeedyspiceofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544970803033301, "text": "wtf is 41", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:46:41", "owner": "myung.jae_puppz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000200324814662, "text": "This is low key helpful unc on god no cap", "created_at": "2025-12-06T22:12:29", "owner": "emmatfetting", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079527500163860, "text": "wtf is creepy pasta?!?! 💀 i’m 35 and have never said that in my whole entire life", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:53:37", "owner": "marietta.josephine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072013961053362, "text": "Every time I see stuff like this, I only get more sure I am Ziliienial", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:49:01", "owner": "destructively", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060708710264173, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:30:40", "owner": "moneybaggg_vicc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18399087106126817, "text": "OD has been around longer than gen alpha", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:17:33", "owner": "liyah926", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063753839648677, "text": "Wtf is a creepy pasta", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:13:30", "owner": "cntgetright_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091414235493847, "text": "Only thing I say of alpha is chat 😂 but im mixed of gen z and mil", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:58:23", "owner": "shaaybanks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980533758780559, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:57:36", "owner": "officialjobeporter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058412225306495, "text": "Fr millennial slang is wrong I don’t say nun of those words", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:42:50", "owner": "itzmebruhh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869023438482457, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:41:34", "owner": "aandakaroliina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099234136826720, "text": "Sybau is the best, it got more aggressive overtime", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:33:44", "owner": "the_real_thiexony", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959485353880620, "text": "Respectfully I don't see how chat is the same as fam", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:23:22", "owner": "yurinyourhead", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164652946387399, "text": "a gen alpha that got raised from gen z 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:08:08", "owner": "gwgwk_at", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956273413018424, "text": "Thankyou for this lesson", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:06:43", "owner": "shaima.momin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18199228369326338, "text": "These all just float around in my brain now", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:05:51", "owner": "joybug23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968762733988646, "text": "Gen Alph slang makes absolutely no sense. As an early 2000s Gen Z I feel like we use a lot Millennial vocabulary.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T20:02:44", "owner": "aisha_2004_m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086609635838047, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:53:18", "owner": "ralucarazus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001774121686208, "text": "Feel like a boomer since I needed this 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:53:06", "owner": "makkichiaki.x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172826497335472, "text": "The Rosetta Stone", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:45:35", "owner": "aleksanderhtx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032647763713329, "text": "Wrap it up is just out the fries in the bag & twin is from gen z", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:44:05", "owner": "thereal.kayanne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18425416516119126, "text": "I had a brain aneurysm listening to this", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:36:55", "owner": "josejonathan_arthur1787", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084921952854451, "text": "can someone explain 41 to me", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:32:17", "owner": "aariesmooon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906368902291192, "text": "This was very helpful thank you", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:16:22", "owner": "mariarosa345", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031953776759666, "text": "Tell me how I’m an 04 and half of the gen z I’ve never heard.. just the millennial ones", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:01:17", "owner": "_diana134_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029754584770175, "text": "I've never heard anyone from any generation say old head 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:57:50", "owner": "txxvnnv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934914691104696, "text": "@munchmasterjray here ya go some help with the new words and translation to ours 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:51:34", "owner": "shapeshift_tricks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092322595902573, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:41:45", "owner": "19enrico46", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904615129483659, "text": "Not a millennial was spoken to", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:27:52", "owner": "bouncyblue_and_squishypink", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930886393138274, "text": "Omgosh I can’t believe millennials are literally the oldest lane now 😢", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:19:08", "owner": "jeral_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075417464353429, "text": "Thank you sm for this -Gen Z unc just tryna make it out🥹", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:05:56", "owner": "axtually_mxcah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039424616719441, "text": "What in the sims language 🤔🤔🤔🤔", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:05:16", "owner": "shinin2bright", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943257844110255, "text": "Im gen z and we use vibe, hella, and savage", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:46:35", "owner": "coconchas2001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049487450415837, "text": "“Fries in the bag” is not “Lock in” tf?", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:39:40", "owner": "willixm_l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115063705573010, "text": "My head hurts now", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:37:59", "owner": "dragonslashlol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115480639601254, "text": "Creepy pasta 😂 TF is that? I’m a confused millennial", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:36:05", "owner": "yessy__cc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842222194643372, "text": "I mean, you tried. You failed, but you tried.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:34:21", "owner": "skibly643", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18413559895184435, "text": "All of them with a select few were all created by millennials", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:29:29", "owner": "papiinotdaddii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106768894653200, "text": "GTFO, not \"you're done\" wtf lol", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:26:50", "owner": "k92_888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911558578255086, "text": "I get a visceral reaction every time I hear gen alpha slang. Only a few that I can get by lightly 😭. I use Gen Z and Y slang lmao", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:22:19", "owner": "a.g._elizabeth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850626421600371, "text": "This helped 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:20:52", "owner": "soph_henryy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033362687753962, "text": "half of these originated in 2020 when gen alpha wouldn't have even technically existed yet , i did NOT say \"dog water\" as a 13 year old just for you to say its gen alpha slang 😞", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:18:30", "owner": "bleeblez", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18304975462251150, "text": "what the fuck is 41 ????", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:13:32", "owner": "bleeblez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087550796066883, "text": "I really think ppl forgot basic english", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:09:13", "owner": "cheriee_vie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843060619627026, "text": "I no longer know where I belong", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:00:09", "owner": "e_roseb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088044704509114, "text": "Chad is older than alpha", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:58:39", "owner": "lowkeymon_trainer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139076059415336, "text": "I saw twin was now twan", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:57:36", "owner": "kyraturneroftheson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969617118990854, "text": "Gen z millennial", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:56:51", "owner": "dannyfink5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165004627351811, "text": "41?! 41?!??", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:56:21", "owner": "scooterroogers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18386524432198283, "text": "👑", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:55:52", "owner": "darakhsha.j", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892001536372028, "text": "od is literally nyc lingo 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:55:30", "owner": "nova.kanee_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844357870628899, "text": "Who the fuck says “dudebro”", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:52:36", "owner": "hi.itsme.carlos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029769707769075, "text": "Not really any", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:41:55", "owner": "saki_akuma_king1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973986747809172, "text": "This feels like brain rot", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:32:59", "owner": "xoloveshell_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082489859277593, "text": "Twin been around. In fact I’d say most of the stuff being said is just aave that’s made it to the mainstream because of people stealing from blk creators", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:32:39", "owner": "bbneaux", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868408372498995, "text": "This was helpful. And my nose started to bleed.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:26:18", "owner": "peejers5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897723904199324, "text": "The only one I disagree with was lock in.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:23:26", "owner": "scurrylurry42", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068191694529948, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:23:02", "owner": "latiamayra_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917241583230935, "text": "holy frick, i think gen alpha is getting to me 😭😭😭im gen z yet i say half of those to", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:20:22", "owner": "vibezwtonii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967066113843027, "text": "I'm gen Z and slang is fucking retard.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:15:56", "owner": "j_hutterer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107587921628369, "text": "I'm sorry Freddy fazbearing?", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:14:33", "owner": "digitwlz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062087792231728, "text": "Wth is 41", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:14:00", "owner": "makaylarhayne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910226716258894, "text": "No most of this is AAVE…", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:51:57", "owner": "kd__watson20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945402690949155, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:49:57", "owner": "joshua.innocent1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119725894483350, "text": "Even though I’m a millennial, apparently I’m not any of those generations", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:43:46", "owner": "ferrisbugler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974362839963297, "text": "Tf means 21 ? I’m Gen Z", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:42:26", "owner": "elia.tto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853017328548156, "text": "You clearly dont know millenial slang 🤣 wtf", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:29:34", "owner": "hard_cruise_racing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080076181920308, "text": "69 is genz and milenial", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:24:02", "owner": "bittcrak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011229932811451, "text": "Yyuuuuuuuuuck!!!!", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:22:54", "owner": "viewonly777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066329258387546, "text": "You got Chad and alpha mixed up lmao", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:15:11", "owner": "seanog24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105923110659093, "text": "You’re done? No I don’t think so, more like talk to the hand 🫷", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:02:44", "owner": "chiibichio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951708058025201, "text": "I am a millennial and I've only heard like 2 of those. Where's legit? Awkward turtle? Gang gang?", "created_at": "2025-12-06T14:57:12", "owner": "phdelery", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088187821950437, "text": "Aye g chill out idk if you know what your tb", "created_at": "2025-12-06T14:55:22", "owner": "udontknonobody", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296476357276037, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T14:54:24", "owner": "avslv_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011216495807213, "text": "Today I learned I use some from each generation. Because Mills are the best.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T14:51:38", "owner": "817_l0pez_92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981393420928031, "text": "This video is absolutely incorrect 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-06T14:45:01", "owner": "theskincareduchess", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061868924240899, "text": "I only understand millennial", "created_at": "2025-12-06T14:33:18", "owner": "mclellan.jared", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866225761439891, "text": "I think I'm a cheugy boomer with major aura.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T14:27:09", "owner": "kittiec12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945457624077743, "text": "Bruhhhhhhh…. Thank you… cause WTF I’m hella behind with all this especially because I don’t have TikTok… I try to vibe with my goddaughter but sometimes I be making it awkward cause I don’t know any of this trash 🥴", "created_at": "2025-12-06T14:09:39", "owner": "freckle_z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100062676780692, "text": "Im Zillenial", "created_at": "2025-12-06T14:07:23", "owner": "bielarnaut", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083022116151619, "text": "cringe!!! shut up bro !!!", "created_at": "2025-12-06T14:06:03", "owner": "pin_diep", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853349455591522, "text": "When ur Gen Z and just know all of them. but “just put the fries in the bag bro” and “lock in” are not the same", "created_at": "2025-12-06T14:05:42", "owner": "yk.nashhh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046282808479950, "text": "You sound like you're speaking in Sims! 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T14:05:23", "owner": "parisleslie_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090180043747514, "text": "I hate this so much just speak 🤬 English", "created_at": "2025-12-06T13:51:39", "owner": "adnelomyerro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083757241869760, "text": "mil I still use these words 😆", "created_at": "2025-12-06T13:46:38", "owner": "jadorejenae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843584557621411, "text": "As a millennial…. Huh?", "created_at": "2025-12-06T13:36:54", "owner": "lanternwaste", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026396945758842, "text": "OD  for Gen Z and Mil is Overdose.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T13:35:07", "owner": "aprameyamarkii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842218090642824, "text": "I'm old enough that I was trying actively to stop the overuse of 'vibe' by trying to push a normal, real word that fills the same niche, 'aura,' only for things to come full circle and now the proper word is the slang???", "created_at": "2025-12-06T13:07:41", "owner": "shopneolithics", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18339130195239060, "text": "Dog water has existed for years?????", "created_at": "2025-12-06T13:03:38", "owner": "takendruid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18169732243337631, "text": "\"just put the fries in the back\" is not the same as \"lock in\" let's be so fr", "created_at": "2025-12-06T13:02:58", "owner": "takendruid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080735666126545, "text": "Me Gen Z with vocabulary as Gen Alpha", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:47:25", "owner": "seangatesman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977120514954098, "text": "I’m pretty sure Gen Z is creepy pasta …backrooms was like a more recent thing", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:42:46", "owner": "caitlin.ashley_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965497662991087, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:39:51", "owner": "hamirhassanuddin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842293807640820, "text": "I’ve got a very ‘healthy’ mix of gen z and mil", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:19:05", "owner": "rhiannonthegoth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092045192508997, "text": "What is 21 even mean wtf Its not from us", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:12:13", "owner": "_ilyadaxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087334867998081, "text": "My head hurts", "created_at": "2025-12-06T11:43:14", "owner": "thejadaiman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055189808335006, "text": "I used all of these except skibidi 💀am I cooked chat", "created_at": "2025-12-06T11:39:18", "owner": "draegonborn_420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084773945022528, "text": "67 is actually from a song where the dude is saying 6 under 7 feet apart. About killing and how they going to end up. JUST AN FYI", "created_at": "2025-12-06T11:35:23", "owner": "its_l3v3ls_2dis_shit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977027292949644, "text": "I am definitely a zillennial 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T11:18:10", "owner": "daynass__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075452081264549, "text": "Why you given gen z millennial shit?", "created_at": "2025-12-06T11:16:24", "owner": "unknownsmom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897734785199671, "text": "So much of this is wrong man", "created_at": "2025-12-06T11:11:31", "owner": "bigfudge_49", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070975793070551, "text": "My brain hurts", "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:54:47", "owner": "cliffy10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547201216009070, "text": "Those millennial ones gotta be gen x because we don't use most of those im a millennial I use the gen z ones", "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:04:59", "owner": "yellowbird.pt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058554623300272, "text": "People born in ‘85 are sooooo much infinitely more different from people born in ‘05 than people born in ‘65 are from people born in ‘85. Same 20 year age gap but about four or five generations of culture removed from one another vs barely one generation", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:55:08", "owner": "real_evang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876095110448465, "text": "wtf", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:20:34", "owner": "carl05_a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122129053535031, "text": "Millennial said garbage, not crap", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:15:52", "owner": "mogurtttt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884744041410953, "text": "Oh no.. this is the most 29 I've felt.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:07:17", "owner": "wasnthatfun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108372571622011, "text": "Is it weird that I don't know any of these generations words?", "created_at": "2025-12-06T08:32:05", "owner": "siser_sarah22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086115953066928, "text": "@sara_akhtar 😅", "created_at": "2025-12-06T07:59:25", "owner": "pbjiselley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18553865896029658, "text": "2", "created_at": "2025-12-06T07:48:19", "owner": "lilac_whoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011125040810425, "text": "Talk normal please", "created_at": "2025-12-06T07:28:39", "owner": "_matthijs_mulder_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916300666088403, "text": "I need to save this, I didn't understand until you said it the Millennial way lol found myself saying \"Ohhh that's what that means\" lmak", "created_at": "2025-12-06T07:08:29", "owner": "crzy_angie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903630994319899, "text": "Sir, i think you’re confused", "created_at": "2025-12-06T07:04:29", "owner": "lilredlanihood", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929903074017478, "text": "Wtf is 21??", "created_at": "2025-12-06T07:03:41", "owner": "k_thakur134", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087835412068851, "text": "so this confirms i’m a zillennial", "created_at": "2025-12-06T06:52:11", "owner": "marykategober", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902925229318567, "text": "Umm.. Gen Alpha did not and I repeat did not make ODE… that has been a thing wayyyyyyyy before they were even born ..", "created_at": "2025-12-06T06:51:31", "owner": "gwtp._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088749140058719, "text": "What is fry tax lol", "created_at": "2025-12-06T06:47:18", "owner": "aprilisme11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065300582403373, "text": "It finally makes sense", "created_at": "2025-12-06T06:35:36", "owner": "_teo_ross_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147267982447021, "text": "This just pissed me off. My little cousin bet not say that dumbass mess around me 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T06:22:02", "owner": "jusjessiicaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960320200001297, "text": "Same I still don't understand the 67 part", "created_at": "2025-12-06T06:19:24", "owner": "itz_____a.b.h.r.a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080690216515877, "text": "I just realize how Gen z i talk", "created_at": "2025-12-06T06:11:11", "owner": "avensnow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066834122620061, "text": "Huhhh😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T06:01:06", "owner": "_niaa_514", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074781932351878, "text": "*taking notes* 👀", "created_at": "2025-12-06T06:00:39", "owner": "allieesthetic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063308282546462, "text": "Thank you. This both answered a bunch of my questions and confirmed that I am a millennial.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T05:52:52", "owner": "taylorhubertt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065272268170478, "text": "You're using a lot of millennial phrases as gen z, and there are millennial phrases i do not recognize", "created_at": "2025-12-06T05:43:03", "owner": "chelcwelc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842255692641374, "text": "i dont think this is strictly used for those ages, ill say 67 as a joke and im 34, and ill also say cringe and i love kpop so idk why this is so age dependent when its just at times their released", "created_at": "2025-12-06T05:25:20", "owner": "affural", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18413538823184631, "text": "okay but why do i know them all", "created_at": "2025-12-06T05:12:34", "owner": "anafroeseler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18433062319129628, "text": "No no no we are not giving Gen alpha “Dog water” we started saying that junk before they were even born.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T05:12:25", "owner": "757ericjr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034104635752640, "text": "Just put the fries in the back =/= lock in to me", "created_at": "2025-12-06T05:12:01", "owner": "_childish.brandino_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545307100000684, "text": "Nothing makes sense", "created_at": "2025-12-06T05:05:26", "owner": "jeelahmed93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974607414972781, "text": "I guess I lean heavily more millennial even though I’m gen z", "created_at": "2025-12-06T05:00:50", "owner": "mattc_0726", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971322162967956, "text": "Wtf is creepy pasta (millennial asking)", "created_at": "2025-12-06T04:50:35", "owner": "west.coast.country", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911681080255416, "text": "21?? I'm Gen Z and I'm lost. Help.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T04:47:42", "owner": "fried_potat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913688575249554, "text": "It’s crazy how my scans is a total toss up between Gen z and millennials. Like I knew I was in the weird in between but this feels like proof", "created_at": "2025-12-06T04:15:50", "owner": "alexleeclark27_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18249631999290039, "text": "I am confusion", "created_at": "2025-12-06T04:13:31", "owner": "soonfloowerz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842057245646454, "text": "What is 21? What is 41?? \nOs it comparable to 31er in german? Help 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T04:02:16", "owner": "lv.etta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880280857329339, "text": "Slow down!!! Lol", "created_at": "2025-12-06T03:56:46", "owner": "oddlymi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930237742139150, "text": "Thank you for your service. 🫡", "created_at": "2025-12-06T03:54:14", "owner": "__hello.melo__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084885413088831, "text": "Awwe damn we phasing out", "created_at": "2025-12-06T03:46:30", "owner": "eeclover9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077546618225809, "text": "h311a 🤔", "created_at": "2025-12-06T03:41:44", "owner": "imanmanh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084713228025187, "text": "The way I had to wait for a lot of the millennial slang to even know what we were talkin about 💀😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T03:34:50", "owner": "arborescently", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994342239890056, "text": "Ohio , backrooms and creepy pasta are not the same .", "created_at": "2025-12-06T03:03:28", "owner": "beastleveling", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049671215419220, "text": "noooo 6 7 is 1738 for Mil", "created_at": "2025-12-06T03:02:01", "owner": "love_thehuman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086310085836300, "text": "Pano?", "created_at": "2025-12-06T02:58:57", "owner": "williams_jamichael", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065203451397547, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T02:56:48", "owner": "aigo_kakashi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078152467969668, "text": "6-7 is not the same at 69 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T02:55:46", "owner": "ozziepez88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152177359420625, "text": "Ohio is a young gen z saying", "created_at": "2025-12-06T02:31:41", "owner": "crestfallenchief", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099895312701717, "text": "Is don't care", "created_at": "2025-12-06T02:19:14", "owner": "kevinhomestead", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945270139076450, "text": "Millennial is gen z", "created_at": "2025-12-06T02:13:52", "owner": "currenarch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096578314849496, "text": "Where did the 41 come from?? I only heard my 5yo say it and shes not even online 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T02:12:25", "owner": "ambiguous_alexandria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075739718464504, "text": "Chad is not Gen Alpha", "created_at": "2025-12-06T02:02:05", "owner": "devin_d24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100155841772471, "text": "I’m a mix of everything", "created_at": "2025-12-06T01:55:07", "owner": "skelviss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915212962094895, "text": "seems as thought you don’t actually know too many millennials.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T01:50:27", "owner": "c_tolaski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088380575489695, "text": "All of the words were invented by Gen Z??", "created_at": "2025-12-06T01:48:11", "owner": "___thicks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095268745686837, "text": "SYBAU? ohio? I'm 25 btw", "created_at": "2025-12-06T01:39:28", "owner": "jackie_kyr_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18149641216438808, "text": "Huh?", "created_at": "2025-12-06T01:09:59", "owner": "shirakarsen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065419754422374, "text": "I talk more millennial than Gen Z but I’m both", "created_at": "2025-12-06T00:51:59", "owner": "dimensionalxdreams", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104380048710086, "text": "Thank uou", "created_at": "2025-12-06T00:46:47", "owner": "_makay1a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049473881427474, "text": "Learn something new everyday", "created_at": "2025-12-06T00:38:51", "owner": "emma_sampsonn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089086736492260, "text": "\"Fries in the bag\" isn't lock in. It's moggin someone of a lesser social status, tellin them to shut up do what you asked.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T00:32:54", "owner": "lunchtime.og", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089273060492938, "text": "Yes okay. This makes sense.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T00:30:39", "owner": "miss_lill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077341390967432, "text": "Definitely needed and definitely saved lol", "created_at": "2025-12-06T00:27:41", "owner": "_lilliess", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18410784838186304, "text": "Bro fucked up", "created_at": "2025-12-06T00:22:54", "owner": "lilsmash720", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081387392126374, "text": "I would just like to be accurate in what slang I know so I could reply back.\n\nI may not understand you, but I know a roast when I hear one you microplastic wonder.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T00:12:26", "owner": "god_emperor_sporelord", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079880758921266, "text": "41?", "created_at": "2025-12-06T00:07:59", "owner": "buchz.98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18389703985182388, "text": "alpha is gen alpha and chad is genz", "created_at": "2025-12-06T00:06:27", "owner": "qnabix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923713414190676, "text": "MZ 🤣💀", "created_at": "2025-12-05T23:51:28", "owner": "hotaru.koyuki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172965313326383, "text": "Meat riding is AWFUL", "created_at": "2025-12-05T23:35:46", "owner": "j9_rossi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047998952449737, "text": "Tf is creepy pasta", "created_at": "2025-12-05T23:16:18", "owner": "alex_on_aux_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087187141958184, "text": "This hurt my brain.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T23:11:25", "owner": "craziiasiann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18395181274131889, "text": "A few of these are not really the same between the gens. Did you seek mil input? Lol", "created_at": "2025-12-05T23:11:23", "owner": "lexicutioner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865543936525008, "text": "Not a single mil term was correct...", "created_at": "2025-12-05T23:09:03", "owner": "kxng.wxlters", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060555401558372, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T23:08:28", "owner": "matrixdropoutgod", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063941207398969, "text": "Worst part is a lot of this gen alpha shit I heard from my millennial mother", "created_at": "2025-12-05T23:07:25", "owner": "austin_lea.h", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867101326503844, "text": "Gen Z… tf is meat riding…?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T23:06:15", "owner": "good_ish_yani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544028023015555, "text": "Is this ragebait because as someone out of the loop even i know half of these translations are total nonsense", "created_at": "2025-12-05T23:03:50", "owner": "illimske", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972914706812431, "text": "I stil have the 21 in my head, slip out some laughter as I think about it lol.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T23:02:21", "owner": "for_restcall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048550460425349, "text": "This is fucking horrendous", "created_at": "2025-12-05T23:00:30", "owner": "xannyclouds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905534803297362, "text": "Millennial here.. wtf is \"fry tax\"", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:58:36", "owner": "red_lion197", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086306927001795, "text": "Nah dog water is definitely a millenial term", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:45:47", "owner": "_thatoneguygrant", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028542062571727, "text": "💀", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:43:34", "owner": "albaxplores", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127270843507846, "text": "This is really giving me falling at the very edge of Mil and Gen Z. Cause my responses are a pretty mixed bag. Officially a millennial but sometimes you can tell I almost didnt make it", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:43:19", "owner": "soul_musings777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087319361066249, "text": "SENSE WHEN IS CREEPYPASTA MILLENNIAL WHAT?!", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:38:14", "owner": "bunnykingollie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085307342060383, "text": "Not me taking goddamn notes", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:34:41", "owner": "seanbroo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888579316393508, "text": "What is fry tax and I am a millennial.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:30:08", "owner": "joannachiang1994", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148279066388975, "text": "Become a mixing pot", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:29:56", "owner": "touchofsynesthesia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087781040486838, "text": "Got some from gen z and some from millennials? Look up “zillennials” 👀", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:24:41", "owner": "chrissel313", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853273276591606, "text": "I’m a millennial and I’m so fucking confused", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:09:49", "owner": "morgantilton_realtor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061633172247127, "text": "67 does not equate to 69. There is an actual straight forward meaning to 69. 67 is just idiocy", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:54:53", "owner": "dbyrd1992", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900775648182680, "text": "I hate it make it stop", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:54:22", "owner": "littlelulu271", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18395130973135550, "text": "6/7 is not 69", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:53:58", "owner": "elssa.xx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072676571596593, "text": "🤨", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:51:22", "owner": "bracho_120", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092917807904488, "text": "As someone who is the oldest Gen Z but the youngest Millennial, I hate all of this 🥴", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:47:39", "owner": "lindseyrae5683", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937674069981933, "text": "I feel like this would play better if it was slowed down a bit.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:45:09", "owner": "casuallyalfred", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088897175487302, "text": "I'm genz but wtf is 21?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:16:42", "owner": "nuriaslanikashvili", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105143644646296, "text": "OD has always been OD in NY lol", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:15:03", "owner": "lippy._lindo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17868464790497325, "text": "I don’t think it directly translates exactly, but interesting premise", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:11:52", "owner": "the_nate_dawg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948628245932970, "text": "This was so helpful like incredibly", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:05:56", "owner": "baylee004", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924319738179059, "text": "67 is still Gen z dude😑 Gen alphas are not even teenagers yet😐", "created_at": "2025-12-05T20:55:39", "owner": "9the9jotunn9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18191672377326502, "text": "So all generations are cringe af then", "created_at": "2025-12-05T20:32:40", "owner": "parkermartin98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305114110266758, "text": "1. Gen z/mil\n2. All\n3. Alpha/ gen z\n4. Gen z\n5. Gen z/mil\n6. Mil\n7. Mil\n8. Mil\n9. Gen z\n10. Alpha/mil\n11. Mil\n12. Alpha\n13. All\n14. Gen z/mil\n15. Mil\n16. None\n17. Gen z/mil\n18. Gen z/mil\n19. Gen z\n20. All\n21. Alpha/gen z\n22. Mil\n23. Mil\nI’m gen z btw lmao", "created_at": "2025-12-05T20:12:40", "owner": "hawkmoon_lacrue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305462362252428, "text": "Thanks for the translations 👍", "created_at": "2025-12-05T20:10:45", "owner": "marks.cheese", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075826079229479, "text": "This is weird", "created_at": "2025-12-05T20:08:28", "owner": "poloblendz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850931692564250, "text": "I swear the Alpha talk is making me cringe lol😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T20:04:59", "owner": "t_gaor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078735761183228, "text": "Mog and flex is not the same. \nGetting mogged is like getting one upped or getting beaten. It comes from incel/lookism blogs where they said a good looking person mogs an average joe. Or something like that.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:55:55", "owner": "heavenlyhurt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059240897301595, "text": "I miss when we didn’t have internet and we don’t have to know these shits", "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:54:07", "owner": "c__a___xi_e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091308403742621, "text": "💀", "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:49:55", "owner": "aka_shane_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128278372446534, "text": "Great now i feel old", "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:45:44", "owner": "m88nlighter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066972800452768, "text": "What is 41?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:44:10", "owner": "asmitoshshinde", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895227232220460, "text": "Imagine learning English and coming across this@video 😅", "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:57", "owner": "annainthepaddock", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106233289632337, "text": "Sybau,  uncle and old is aave .", "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:25:21", "owner": "bnj0613", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008607338819181, "text": "ohhh", "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:17:04", "owner": "saturn.bebe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941798838961940, "text": "Bruh, what?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:13:44", "owner": "_my_three", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103872499679146, "text": "Lord never heard of any of these I’m ole school cat", "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:09:42", "owner": "memphis_bro27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051752330660884, "text": "me who has acquired all and uses them interchangeably 🤭✨", "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:08:45", "owner": "bxmblebee____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077754121958942, "text": "born as genz, know only millennial slang", "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:07:57", "owner": "thew0mper", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075751759992461, "text": "Thought I was a millennial. Turns out I’m Gen Z", "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:04:37", "owner": "dragonofessos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071767307581835, "text": "alpha can’t have OD. that’s a millennial new yorker thing", "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:00:47", "owner": "highfreequeensees", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902529646300006, "text": "I feel like GEN Z AND GEN alpha still share both", "created_at": "2025-12-05T18:56:01", "owner": "b.abrilv", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18125602078510532, "text": "stfu has been around for ages, the original urban dictionary entry for it was posted 2003 when even the oldest gen Zs were like 5-6 years old max.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T18:48:21", "owner": "notlaura", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099370669694931, "text": "Bros really making a Rosetta Stone.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T18:44:18", "owner": "nightlordjay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902979127316873, "text": "More than half of the gen z you listed was actually gen alpha", "created_at": "2025-12-05T18:44:03", "owner": "thatguywiththerussianhat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137044093417917, "text": "I’m Ngl I actually really needed this", "created_at": "2025-12-05T18:39:30", "owner": "biancalovelatour", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980430939781554, "text": "I live under a rock🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-05T18:14:58", "owner": "2022cmlarochelle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997897353848434, "text": "@ayushimhatre_  man doing god's work", "created_at": "2025-12-05T18:07:23", "owner": "kahitari_ugich", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088663780768489, "text": "Swag not used even once 😢", "created_at": "2025-12-05T17:54:33", "owner": "_liyah._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055445654662538, "text": "Still don’t understand 67", "created_at": "2025-12-05T17:52:45", "owner": "deepvoicex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963951358004843, "text": "I'm 20 and I use most of the millennial slang ...", "created_at": "2025-12-05T17:34:41", "owner": "riley_ftsfr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081577172124960, "text": "we should have a thesauraus for this", "created_at": "2025-12-05T17:19:57", "owner": "eddymerlyborja.lit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096912379828287, "text": "(NY Millennial here) wth is DUDEBRO? Did you make some of these up...", "created_at": "2025-12-05T17:09:30", "owner": "ajure_ajure", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869079652477702, "text": "Thank you 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T17:00:15", "owner": "lorraineosborne_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087240142965916, "text": "67 is 69? But 69 means and stands for something. What does 67 stand for?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T16:47:56", "owner": "halcon.escaso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968510262988549, "text": "Some of these are def not the same meaning", "created_at": "2025-12-05T16:36:59", "owner": "jgon8014", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121635928536835, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T16:21:11", "owner": "lynxa420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903442951299327, "text": "THIS IS AMAZING", "created_at": "2025-12-05T16:19:49", "owner": "vvdkrs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069376550100855, "text": "Fuck this, I ain't doing this word jumble muble", "created_at": "2025-12-05T16:01:48", "owner": "_ratila_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084780890000812, "text": "Language is finished", "created_at": "2025-12-05T15:58:56", "owner": "suptrina_tron", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866169655434943, "text": "I lose brain cells after watching this bro not you just the evolution of out slang", "created_at": "2025-12-05T15:46:03", "owner": "mariowashere23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075586241185104, "text": "Im a Gen Z that talks like a millennial but honestly all of this is nonsense 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T15:38:49", "owner": "heyitsnickwright", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077174477225669, "text": "I think I just had a stroke", "created_at": "2025-12-05T15:37:03", "owner": "sam_tilden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059131631284131, "text": "I'm a millennial, I've said dog eater since elementary", "created_at": "2025-12-05T15:23:55", "owner": "itsschowderr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047064677462037, "text": "Very helpful!!", "created_at": "2025-12-05T15:23:23", "owner": "dvashadara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071058179367834, "text": "My brain cells💀", "created_at": "2025-12-05T15:13:05", "owner": "davidbennett8232", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079879870927487, "text": "How could y’all forget 1738 that’s also with Gen Z for 21", "created_at": "2025-12-05T15:07:45", "owner": "rivers___z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18317742943223826, "text": "I feel like half  of the millennial ones are very subgroup specific because I didn’t say half of them. But that also made me realize some of the younger ones are probably only in certain groups too", "created_at": "2025-12-05T15:04:48", "owner": "re.joyce.ful", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911073814266679, "text": "Ew", "created_at": "2025-12-05T15:02:48", "owner": "helenainheadlights", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932764333131515, "text": "You might be a language expert haha", "created_at": "2025-12-05T14:50:04", "owner": "karan_bodhisattva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892347145379734, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T14:49:42", "owner": "ns7_7_7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102573835736927, "text": "lock in and wrap it up are sooo dif", "created_at": "2025-12-05T14:42:07", "owner": "jasminekay333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088434277798121, "text": "This is good", "created_at": "2025-12-05T14:40:39", "owner": "xo_mp3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321302656174431, "text": "Alpha SUCKS", "created_at": "2025-12-05T14:36:53", "owner": "retro_radium", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18063633191547324, "text": "Wtf at least 69 makes sense compared to 67 and 41 makes no sense only one person doing the work. Ill stay millennial talk and a little Gen Y from the older siblings", "created_at": "2025-12-05T14:31:41", "owner": "q_deepie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136362949463878, "text": "wtf is sybua", "created_at": "2025-12-05T14:25:29", "owner": "j.a.villain_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083941684862910, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T14:13:10", "owner": "minion.chan_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18083377577086488, "text": "What is frytax", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:49:05", "owner": "briana_marisel_av", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096951154828828, "text": "these are the moments where slang slaps me on the face as a reminder that im not a native speaker", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:47:06", "owner": "greta_shi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909187711267593, "text": "Can we just go back to proper English?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:46:57", "owner": "amtrfdie35", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081912239278116, "text": "Stfuuuup. 69 has a meaning", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:17:58", "owner": "wine42__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094806118851192, "text": "I will now be able to understand my little brother. Thanks", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:10:42", "owner": "princesslaunna", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17901848718327574, "text": "I think Ohio is not quite right.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:48:22", "owner": "victoria_effing_prince", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084152729048822, "text": "Wtf is 21", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:21:29", "owner": "hardfor__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088140011485460, "text": "I’m millennial, but “Just put the fries in the bag” is actually a good one!", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:50:28", "owner": "kiwi_nate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061825004231669, "text": "I’m honestly scared for gen A🙃", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:44:40", "owner": "a.h.i.d.a.m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855306103578040, "text": "No 69 is gen z", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:38:21", "owner": "john_brumskine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092856787905306, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:18:40", "owner": "rayanvanessa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073870586350309, "text": "i’m a mix of all 3 only because i’m terminally online", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:07:26", "owner": "tardyblooomer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075015962256666, "text": "No twin is definitely gen z we been saying that for years", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:59:44", "owner": "pringles_niqua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070925306457643, "text": "Adding that a lot of this stuff is common AAVE that white people got access to and made a trend.😒", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:20:57", "owner": "literature__addiction", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18248924833293347, "text": "Yeah I’ll never remember this", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:58:28", "owner": "nourish_renew_repeat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984512172762511, "text": "I’m-what kind of psychosis did I just experience ?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:19:59", "owner": "lesly_99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058984253540802, "text": "you really just threw some in there for fun", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:08:45", "owner": "bluejaytea_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073180151591916, "text": "i got lost 10 seconds in lol", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:05:29", "owner": "thatgirlsherr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063890051408034, "text": "If you liked or appreciated this translation, you’re definitely not an alpha💀", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:01:03", "owner": "shannon.divine_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993721284850267, "text": "Gen alpha so cringe", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:36:05", "owner": "electrovoltz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895476202216746, "text": "I’ve said none of these. 😬", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:35:46", "owner": "sherryisfortified", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872827159464497, "text": "I thought gen z was 17 38", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:31:03", "owner": "axlhisgym2026", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878833627438934, "text": "This was all came up with by a bunch of twelve year olds trying to sound cool", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:28:12", "owner": "mrbunnysky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910750663257199, "text": "Creepy pasta??", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:24:45", "owner": "freshavocadotoast_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18440568790098050, "text": "Not a single one of these is right wtf 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:10:12", "owner": "thereal.stevejobs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18493821862076365, "text": "Didn’t relate to any 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:09:43", "owner": "cl12136", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993599739894004, "text": "Holy this is amazing thank you", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:48:21", "owner": "_daha150_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049937798679396, "text": "What the language did I just listen to?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:45:04", "owner": "withmycrownon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007994843654774, "text": "Wait, hold the phone! What the sigma is a real thing?! I thought that was something my 6-year-old made up and was part of her unique personality 😂😭", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:40:16", "owner": "jazzzzy.jessss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066194873431744, "text": "Soooo what if i use a mix of allllll of them????", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:32:05", "owner": "staciastarlightcos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084416507516614, "text": "None of these were right", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:20:52", "owner": "enoch_tostada_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18299969857287416, "text": "Wait this actually helped me understand what so many of these words mean lmao", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:18:59", "owner": "its.lexlexlexia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100354825751389, "text": "Unc is actually gen z and older but that’s a black community thing", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:14:09", "owner": "monti.q", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18045466157480257, "text": "What!?? The hek?? Is?? 41!?? I JUST figured out 67", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:07:06", "owner": "mybellavoce", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152520511423639, "text": "I feel like most of these are not correct", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:56:44", "owner": "strawberrygirl_ashley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089879431756248, "text": "As a 90s baby, my nieces are in this alpha gen, I swear its so werid. Their words take so long to to say to be consider short or cool. Us millennial took all the short slang. This new gen has nothing but made up words and it's sound dumb but I guess that's how it is🤷🏾‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:51:24", "owner": "sarikajasmine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028443980776748, "text": "I lost brain cells. I am a millennial and I have no idea what these words are.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:48:22", "owner": "simplyjustkam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097704199833335, "text": "Thank you for this.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:44:43", "owner": "goldfeathersfly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065159711530513, "text": "No 67 is not 69. 69 actually means something", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:37:00", "owner": "loganreichhart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005574194820040, "text": "Wait im actually learning 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:35:50", "owner": "cantwoabc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087869705485147, "text": "Alright that's it take their phones away", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:34:03", "owner": "cdcage_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088297813789956, "text": "it’s been scientifically proven here, guys. zillenials are a generation of their own", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:18:45", "owner": "_noturavgsportspage", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084263272871634, "text": "As a Gen Z I needed this to understand what anyone is saying ever. Thank you", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:07:13", "owner": "wyattjsnow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089633314940750, "text": "wtf is a sybau", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:58:48", "owner": "animewh0re_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061720235532676, "text": "alpha sound like simlish HAHAHA CHOOWAGAJUJU!", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:56:07", "owner": "x.kk.x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18551771995026489, "text": "What I can’t keep up 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:53:13", "owner": "vanarayems", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081101465272801, "text": "I’m SORRY BUT WHAT", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:50:57", "owner": "cfranyc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850468444568182, "text": "Thank you professor", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:40:32", "owner": "deli_ssandro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906184417147024, "text": "Wow I felt old! Lmao", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:36:01", "owner": "ally.v15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927425770080241, "text": "AAVE ≠ generational slang. I mostly heard AAVE and their updates that got popular and gentrified by yt ppl", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:35:52", "owner": "6.the_infamous_t", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18061808111221441, "text": "What the hell is 41", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:21:41", "owner": "livagainfinds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842000344644753, "text": "Most of the Gen Z ones are just early alpha we did not say half that stuff in early 2000s", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:17:54", "owner": "bigdx2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958038604008673, "text": "Ohio is backrooms", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:10:17", "owner": "dolllfangz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18535302718043476, "text": "The Gen Z column is actually more akin to the Millennials. Gen Z are the younger siblings of Millennials that stole our lingo!", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:08:53", "owner": "eliza_thornberrry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545019160019341, "text": "Gen Alpha speaks in code, I’m scared of them now 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:06:30", "owner": "eliza_thornberrry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000862028838343, "text": "Chad is always Chad", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:58:50", "owner": "bakebread.30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121155415527872, "text": "Being a genz, I'm more towards millennials then genz and ,for gen alpha i don't know what vocabulary they use 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:42:47", "owner": "sadistpawn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090891550935995, "text": "Told my little sister to just put the fries in the bag and she looked me at and immediately said “what the fuck?” 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:37:56", "owner": "ina_lissb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928450909157429, "text": "Me being a Gen Z speaking more like a millennian😭", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:31:56", "owner": "morimora14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061223540540920, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:52:59", "owner": "_its.ni_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18298309642282150, "text": "Im 97’ and I know all 😭😭😭 and use all wtf", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:45:55", "owner": "keylagabriela0_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917159950219178, "text": "21?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:45:00", "owner": "edjaimesbz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963895702004718, "text": "Gen X here, now just more confused,  cuz we got forgotten , again lol", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:25:59", "owner": "iliasterlingdesigns", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032360678732131, "text": "I keep hearing 67 but wtf is 41? 💀", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:18:20", "owner": "eyeyambach", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059313704277447, "text": "Who 25 + years old cares about this", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:09:02", "owner": "loganhfl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543997996036517, "text": "Wait when did we have 21 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:04:55", "owner": "lettersfrom.grace", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845539714619834, "text": "Griddy was 1000% Gen Z. Idk where you get your info from", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:04:04", "owner": "heavenleemixon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057482138309471, "text": "As a millennial- wtf is old head.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:54:45", "owner": "brooke_new", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032357087746455, "text": "Oh shit, this all suddenly makes so much sense", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:47:31", "owner": "ocean_pyramids", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069789560456908, "text": "Gen Z is elite.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:47:11", "owner": "lailaakberzie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957202615015742, "text": "In my 36 millenial years I have never once heard of fry tax", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:47:10", "owner": "broturtle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18427446397113451, "text": "Ohio is soooo backrooms", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:38:15", "owner": "tiredgingerr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18192839407328989, "text": "I use all three lingos💀", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:34:55", "owner": "micaela.anne12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106551199712782, "text": "2003 - mix of Gen z and millennial", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:24:28", "owner": "talkingwithtori_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028354379772455, "text": "Clout is better than aura and street credds", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:04:15", "owner": "isthat_bh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929004559155697, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:53:58", "owner": "kylej9791", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154453609408123, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:25:36", "owner": "hollywoodjblaq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090090418755824, "text": "Not a single one was correct 🤡", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:02:13", "owner": "korbin.long_2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966992184995451, "text": "This was actually really helpful thanks", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:58:04", "owner": "kaylenajanelle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116733055499891, "text": "Omg I’m scared", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:38:42", "owner": "jilliancareycolin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059880236268119, "text": "Thank God I only know a few of these...I will never use most of these terms...", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:33:06", "owner": "c_d_r_0_m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971474064816767, "text": "I must be from the 1800s then", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:29:30", "owner": "benjamichael", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077354285180239, "text": "Made up millennial terms lol", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:29:23", "owner": "whoisimmane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098982490747742, "text": "Thank you I needed this", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:17:45", "owner": "rebekah.hurst23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18189847771340431, "text": "I am lost", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:04:58", "owner": "sannevherp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085237928102880, "text": "What the hell 21 means🤣 I'm a gen z", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:03:04", "owner": "wissen.sirr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926306395178658, "text": "Someone signed 2 and 1 to me on my drive home. Im a milleial was and sooooo confused, im until right now. 😂😅😅", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:52:23", "owner": "its.abbiequirk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886487137404479, "text": "Guess I’m a young millennial lol I don’t even relate to Gen Z", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:52:13", "owner": "flarewestmedia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852849757547385, "text": "ohio is not creepy pasta 😭😭😭 hullo???", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:51:28", "owner": "officially.sol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057894968639719, "text": "“Curved”?? I thought it was “swerved”", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:49:00", "owner": "car.snip_01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090749192490120, "text": "Aint gonna talk in freaking slangs, learn to use proper words people!!!", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:47:19", "owner": "dwayne_is_here", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105136024633839, "text": "My head hurts lol", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:44:49", "owner": "labribri23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115844521576324, "text": "The first one there is no link to that stupid 67 . 67 quite literally has no contacts behind it while the other ones at least do and I'm trying to defend millennials too as a Gen z", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:37:31", "owner": "hydra_scales", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887407297393260, "text": "Mil slang makes sense.. why the alpha generation have to slaughter good slang", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:29:27", "owner": "reil_vessels", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080451056162612, "text": "Did I just have a stroke 😥", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:03:56", "owner": "jocworld1990", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121626169539088, "text": "Fry tax?", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:01:01", "owner": "saraialove", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079344190905744, "text": "I don’t understand why people are getting upset, if anything this just proves that everyone has always had slang and expressions that older people get annoyed by. Literally doesn’t harm anyone in any way. Yes the frequency of it can be annoying if you are in close contact with a gen alpha using these but it’s not inherently worse than the slang that has existed before them.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:55:18", "owner": "evveakesson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172623499374131, "text": "Are these real slangs wth", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:47:22", "owner": "niicotiin3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159075409398106, "text": "So many of these are wrong 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:45:12", "owner": "drews_main_", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18086916055818089, "text": "@daanniib3 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:39:11", "owner": "casfacer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031501736536646, "text": "You're done and stfu r not the same", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:32:28", "owner": "bachamami91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145854589449432, "text": "Understanding a bit of everything lezgooo", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:30:03", "owner": "code._.over", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084228164471914, "text": "Hated every second of this", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:29:07", "owner": "pearnpeaches", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18394629163193185, "text": "I just feel like OD is the same in all three lmao", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:21:31", "owner": "bonniskn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18247609486293269, "text": "Nahhhhhh broOO I BEEN saying DOGWATER  as a millennial", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:18:24", "owner": "chadaholic_12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058318037302798, "text": "I think I just had a stroke", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:13:43", "owner": "altniaj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049524833412273, "text": "Yeah this tew much", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:03:24", "owner": "kevnbuffet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842273812639214, "text": "I lost several brain cells from this", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:01:58", "owner": "i.am_nish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910136479122300, "text": "Did the millennials dirty ngl half those sound like my grandpa's vocabulary bro??", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:59:10", "owner": "mike_wazowski_z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059257124277449, "text": "Old head? WTF is that", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:51:30", "owner": "machin3mod3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917273149221603, "text": "Thank you for translating 🙂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:38:52", "owner": "mrs_fostah_warren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397684258132124, "text": "Holy crud, we have a cheat sheet now.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:37:43", "owner": "glitchy_24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18412144156136385, "text": "Where the hell did 41 come from? That's a thing!?", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:04:34", "owner": "natepolidoro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861301516544408, "text": "F*ggot = Loser \n\nTrust me in the 90’s-Early 2000’s it was the norm calling people losers", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:00:45", "owner": "darth_vader1993", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049905776401552, "text": "I don't got time for all that... It will change after these current freshmen become sophomores and so on 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:59:08", "owner": "benji_tha_c4t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18213407560310529, "text": "What's creepy pasta?", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:52:59", "owner": "jerrylsz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902647300328483, "text": "I genuinely love this", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:49:50", "owner": "31courtney13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879198754431534, "text": "Some of this is just Black slang.  Also we've been saying OD in New York since before I was born. It doesn't originate when white kids find it.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:44:44", "owner": "unsided", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028663535565524, "text": "GenX: ……What?  No.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:44:00", "owner": "arglvz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084198569028048, "text": "These mil terms are nonsense.. wrap it up", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:39:34", "owner": "nizedatfam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077286175981414, "text": "Am I a milenial? All my lingo is not GenZ and I'm 22 I'm 03 so people try to gas light me and put me into GenZ but wtf 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:29:43", "owner": "voytomorada.es", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086005021992956, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:27:29", "owner": "faygoisvamp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080718182136308, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:24:31", "owner": "_journey_19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072697121598352, "text": "very difficult watch", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:18:34", "owner": "loveshack_baby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084281060088618, "text": "just put the fries in the bag =/= lock in =/= wrap it up, unc. jfc", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:17:31", "owner": "loveshack_baby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076215289982981, "text": "Od has been used my new Yorkers for decades fam cut that out.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:06:49", "owner": "jimmy_deblasio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985439487916538, "text": "honestly thank bro so much I was gettin so confused out here", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:59:38", "owner": "jesssicabond", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18202211959321172, "text": "✍️hold up old head your going too fast 🫦", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:57:53", "owner": "wtfgiraffes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111370417614078, "text": "This actually made a lot of sense, except I thought “Just put the fries in the bag” was kinda equivalent to “Ma’am, this is a Wendy’s”😭", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:54:12", "owner": "_leahs15_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071656625630169, "text": "Now do Gen X.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:20:12", "owner": "crlyrd1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906971581273417, "text": "Stop 💀", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:02:14", "owner": "thesolidmidgetofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869342080412309, "text": "67 is 1748", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:51:25", "owner": "i.nannaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18151378102427020, "text": "Soooo basically gen Alpha is retarded ??", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:50:27", "owner": "liljody.jo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847257331613959, "text": "WTH is dudebro", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:48:13", "owner": "_elej", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17865203649517794, "text": "Said no one ever! What in the ??", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:45:45", "owner": "___jackie_g.___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863447005536702, "text": "i’m gen z and alpha", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:37:39", "owner": "joslyn_mae_miller", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085060319477392, "text": "I feel so seen with the “21” sometimes I wonder if I was dreaming when the 21 joke was ac a thing", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:32:35", "owner": "willakate_p", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876967465442847, "text": "So many of these were incorrect", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:32:07", "owner": "boulderbimbo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959143248877859, "text": "No", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:32:06", "owner": "chelseybabycakes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109037344617141, "text": "Slangs make no sense the moment they stop originating from black speech", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:29:44", "owner": "kreamlord.supreme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076494323193886, "text": "Wowowoeowowow", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:28:37", "owner": "callmequasha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081830939148452, "text": "Yeah mixed with Gen Z and Mil mostly for that", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:26:54", "owner": "hitomi_sparky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869519611477834, "text": "Im so over alpha", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:23:56", "owner": "belt_x3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070800542369064, "text": "GENennial", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:18:03", "owner": "hoezsay_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955181929018192, "text": "This millennial was calling cod kids dog water before gen alpha could talk", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:14:10", "owner": "gabedalfx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868612405413453, "text": "i’m a mix of Gen Z and Millennials vocab", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:09:01", "owner": "snwbnyy.diary", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989011770864077, "text": "Gen alpha have bastardized English, we need to go back to something normal", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:08:49", "owner": "lapuathecoywolf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858203920506061, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:03:40", "owner": "justin.daran", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932473411111804, "text": "Will the next generation be generation beta? That would be epic", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:46:39", "owner": "bendtheknee7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842371711637824, "text": "I need this in an excel spreadsheet 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:43:34", "owner": "lizintheeast", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026038829589924, "text": "I’ve been saying OD for 15 years 😂 I didn’t know kids say that now 😂 do y’all remember “trill”? 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:34:16", "owner": "ballingail", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931168777131663, "text": "I'm genz but talk like a Mil😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:33:23", "owner": "roman_fitz32", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083653910112734, "text": "I say SYBAU only online as a millennial since it’s easier to type but in real life I say the whole thing when dumbasses be saying some dumb shit. It just hits harder", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:32:31", "owner": "sillyalmonds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083840147116796, "text": "You’re not a Millennial…", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:29:23", "owner": "dkc.dane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070684157610579, "text": "When did I get so old lmao", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:23:35", "owner": "blackmantra_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18398452414125063, "text": "😢ty", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:22:11", "owner": "15kks17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099856195753571, "text": "Nigga no shut up 🤫", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:20:02", "owner": "progressive_growth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114525433604404, "text": "U just saved humanity", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:06:08", "owner": "honchohodg", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062143451222670, "text": "Ooooooohh it all makes sense now", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:59:47", "owner": "kvng_t96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865143976530889, "text": "I just genuinely hate Alpha's slang like...", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:57:43", "owner": "lulu_xo98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927834976161341, "text": "Very informative", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:44:22", "owner": "jackson_brinn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903195793167678, "text": "It's weird hearing Gen Alpha slang while my Gen Alpha kids just started talking 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:41:45", "owner": "shannd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976199625950717, "text": "Thank you for this. Idk what these kids are saying to me anymore 😩 69 forever", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:35:04", "owner": "the_peach_raves", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087747266510777, "text": "OD is gen Z we were saying that back in middle school/ high school", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:34:56", "owner": "sharpdoritos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18350347111205935, "text": "its actually a different language 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:34:44", "owner": "mariibobarii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109225180621355, "text": "Why does it actually work thoo😭", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:31:48", "owner": "_2cutemyah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937282456101830, "text": "i hate everything about this", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:27:49", "owner": "_dariandiva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929767762146998, "text": "I need flash cards 😅", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:01:58", "owner": "vikkthebutcher", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969074826977299, "text": "Missed milenial speech by a mile", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:55:53", "owner": "margs9184", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065133992168267, "text": "Could you go all the way to my Gen X, or just say Dude for all of them 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:55:06", "owner": "savrikatea", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18124567702515082, "text": "I’m a mix of all of them", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:50:56", "owner": "alex_juarez273", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17852785251543111, "text": "I’m so upset how helpful this is lol", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:47:31", "owner": "lj_the_smell_j", "likes": 14}, {"id": 17897152569346064, "text": "👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:42:29", "owner": "je.suis.row", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885599884405497, "text": "Question🙋🏻‍♀️ where did you learn the Gen Alpha slang? Asking for research purposes", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:34:17", "owner": "karismatickrissy", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18088888360770290, "text": "We're doomed", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:27:52", "owner": "pichart2025_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098674252630852, "text": "Why did I feel like I lost some brain cells...", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:23:34", "owner": "stevenstygstra", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18084399527039142, "text": "I dont fit any of these weird fucking classed 1 2 3 type human.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:21:34", "owner": "scrollingawaymylife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893089783368339, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T14:41:22", "owner": "godsilliestgoose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086491340060046, "text": "pls recreate your impression of lumpy space princess rapping anaconda", "created_at": "2025-12-04T14:41:21", "owner": "monikasj69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108669073620705, "text": "Getting older is realizing you do t use these anymore", "created_at": "2025-12-04T14:28:47", "owner": "ctrainbjj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075915134224183, "text": "Think I actually lost brain cells watching this.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T14:21:23", "owner": "morgan_wiz", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17930399820014645, "text": "This video had me smiling the entire time cos it brings clarity to stuff Gen Alpha is saying 😅😅", "created_at": "2025-12-04T14:12:58", "owner": "benjibatch", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17941318860088562, "text": "Doing the lords work !", "created_at": "2025-12-04T14:08:33", "owner": "v.ramlalsingh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160213471401057, "text": "Didn’t Gen Z make ‘twin’", "created_at": "2025-12-04T14:04:34", "owner": "th4tboydee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897420796206099, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T14:03:52", "owner": "camachodaniel28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882129478421365, "text": "Gen Z will forever be the masterminds of slang", "created_at": "2025-12-04T14:03:52", "owner": "th4tboydee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063505943566615, "text": "Thank you for your service", "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:56:52", "owner": "carlosoria_o", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17967082148989309, "text": "This was still inaccurate? So ok.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:53:21", "owner": "thatsambeech", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091710973822083, "text": "No", "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:48:24", "owner": "mf.oom", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17950119459058599, "text": "Sorry but….STFU belongs to us Millennials.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:46:17", "owner": "lorehunt3r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856796365568523, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:32:04", "owner": "bannedjose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099249100696569, "text": "Tf is 21", "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:31:45", "owner": "_downtondays_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136488013463849, "text": "Millenial here…when tf did we use fry tax??", "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:29:32", "owner": "itsmekatobrero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111114670527176, "text": "I’m a milennial and I needed this translation guide for the gen alpha slang 🤣 thank you", "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:29:21", "owner": "ringette1995", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18158371945365508, "text": "Gonna save this for my future kids, so they know their history", "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:09:49", "owner": "zzenzoe", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17918456568217746, "text": "Just no lol", "created_at": "2025-12-04T12:08:02", "owner": "that_giirl_sammie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083253032031879, "text": "I'm using this as the authoritative source for these translations.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T11:47:26", "owner": "alex.bralex", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18057510722309169, "text": "Sybau is actually gen z. Generation Alfa are still in in say care and elementary school 😭😭 ! while the youngest of gen’s are in highschool. So a lot of the new stuff yall seeing is still gen z lmao. People forget that a “generation” makes up 25 to 30 years lol.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T11:30:09", "owner": "dollfacedfaye_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17906015142144114, "text": "I hate how Ebonics is known as gen z or gen alpha slang 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-04T11:12:49", "owner": "luhva.kenzie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067157126145049, "text": "This is, super helpful and lowkey cool to see 🤟🏾✨️", "created_at": "2025-12-04T11:11:35", "owner": "jahqyad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074130698258114, "text": "Just put the fries in the bag is us not them", "created_at": "2025-12-04T10:57:28", "owner": "itsoddly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148138243435797, "text": "You couldnt have been more wrong", "created_at": "2025-12-04T10:54:10", "owner": "119dam961", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003571577675259, "text": "No", "created_at": "2025-12-04T10:45:13", "owner": "jennyjen1986", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846117688618259, "text": "lol I can tell what I truly am based on what I mostly understand haha", "created_at": "2025-12-04T10:42:17", "owner": "purposefully_k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193737670331258, "text": "How do you”your done” relate to shit your bitch ass up OR shut the fuck up needa og ta lmk", "created_at": "2025-12-04T10:29:05", "owner": "_agm.d_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115176259574527, "text": "I feel like I just had a stroke wtf", "created_at": "2025-12-04T10:28:06", "owner": "sineadelizabeth729", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18032402915537229, "text": "Now where in the dictionary are all these blabbers?", "created_at": "2025-12-04T10:27:01", "owner": "selvansegaran", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18099062818790839, "text": "i speak like gen z and millennial", "created_at": "2025-12-04T10:24:10", "owner": "06xrhiannonnx", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18397537702124663, "text": "Anyone that actually talks like this is a moron", "created_at": "2025-12-04T10:20:51", "owner": "strongtag", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050309453391721, "text": "U Forgot Swag", "created_at": "2025-12-04T10:01:21", "owner": "spacey1800", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18180333817361391, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T09:55:13", "owner": "ywvy.exe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077885072518451, "text": "Man, 21 just means you can buy alcohol in the US", "created_at": "2025-12-04T09:54:56", "owner": "seriousjojo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089234951313087, "text": "tf is 41???", "created_at": "2025-12-04T09:51:07", "owner": "janisomiso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113437237590434, "text": "Nah I feel like a lot of gen z and millennial slang is more similar than this, then there what ever the fuck is going on with the iPad kids", "created_at": "2025-12-04T09:49:56", "owner": "vickyg4202", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18099344080826605, "text": "This has been very informative, thankyou", "created_at": "2025-12-04T09:08:41", "owner": "loading_at.chaos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004459523674644, "text": "Wtf is \"creepy pasta\"?!? Neva said this!", "created_at": "2025-12-04T08:15:55", "owner": "cherize16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898099813345415, "text": "Millennials and Gen Z definitely had some crossovers", "created_at": "2025-12-04T08:12:55", "owner": "lady_mercedes_classic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854266942589683, "text": "I trully needed this", "created_at": "2025-12-04T08:12:01", "owner": "hui_ying.h", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035996582716190, "text": "Gen z has and is actively making gen alpha slang", "created_at": "2025-12-04T07:54:05", "owner": "m_l_x64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065000696176330, "text": "Gen z here , millennial was better", "created_at": "2025-12-04T07:44:01", "owner": "arshiajeiroodi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010268426813945, "text": "Me a Gen Z not saying a single bit of Gen Alpha slang at all because it’s actually ridiculous and I don’t believe “Rizz” is a word or “Skibidi” and 67 isn’t funny 🫠 be so for real Gen Alpha", "created_at": "2025-12-04T07:40:12", "owner": "coeecatherine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18327862492244213, "text": "Wtf is old head?!", "created_at": "2025-12-04T07:25:17", "owner": "photogirlfitz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183449332357373, "text": "As a millennial idk wtf you think we say but it ain’t this lmao", "created_at": "2025-12-04T07:02:08", "owner": "vagabondlives", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128083222453605, "text": "this is wrong ohio is not back rooms what", "created_at": "2025-12-04T06:54:30", "owner": "sheeptrayn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171552622372893, "text": "Whaaaa the frick is creepy pasta?", "created_at": "2025-12-04T06:38:13", "owner": "kasslsa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083357461869404, "text": "Oh god I'm an amalgamation 💀", "created_at": "2025-12-04T06:37:06", "owner": "justlevs04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105784570655485, "text": "I don't understand any of them not even millennial wtf???", "created_at": "2025-12-04T06:36:14", "owner": "heffernan5595", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085168358318237, "text": "And this is why I don’t get why everyone’s hating on Gen Alpha slang when it’s literally nothing new nor is it that bad. This is how language evolves. This is how slang evolves. It’s just a fad at the end of the day.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T06:31:30", "owner": "sareeli05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949957567114070, "text": "Wait hold up millennial used to be in the middle 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-04T06:21:30", "owner": "ffxrxh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966911901989162, "text": "Ok this is the first one to ever help and now I get them all except don’t know Ohio in any gen’s lingo. wtf is OHIO", "created_at": "2025-12-04T06:13:45", "owner": "brica_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095089738889047, "text": "SHIT IM IN ALL 3 💀", "created_at": "2025-12-04T06:05:21", "owner": "jxcie3l._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084758260844561, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T06:00:38", "owner": "littleleondra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106207636712582, "text": "L ragebait", "created_at": "2025-12-04T05:54:22", "owner": "thelittlefaiz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18417468619187990, "text": ".... fuck I was trying to understand what the fuck all this nonsense you were saying was 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T05:53:42", "owner": "vkmicrov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946920813942764, "text": "How dare you give based to Gen Z this is an atrocity", "created_at": "2025-12-04T05:51:31", "owner": "spkantaris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099120052838535, "text": "🤣🤣taking notes at this point", "created_at": "2025-12-04T05:48:57", "owner": "nubianteyana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900857230338438, "text": "Am I the only one hearing him talk in “ Sims language “ 😂😂😂😂😂 if you heard it too —->", "created_at": "2025-12-04T05:47:15", "owner": "theqingtezzz1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079420970165279, "text": "Shut up", "created_at": "2025-12-04T05:43:49", "owner": "anthonycollabs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859084015557564, "text": "Ofc a mill is making this vid", "created_at": "2025-12-04T05:43:00", "owner": "choccyflan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085844312474693, "text": "H3lla 🤣😭", "created_at": "2025-12-04T05:35:12", "owner": "itslecthou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842022049641400, "text": "OD was NOT Gen Alpha", "created_at": "2025-12-04T05:34:20", "owner": "nate_da_great27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065677784620435, "text": "wtf is 21?", "created_at": "2025-12-04T05:28:57", "owner": "marg1day", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983627364922372, "text": "Very informative", "created_at": "2025-12-04T05:26:38", "owner": "itbevitico", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18192954502335869, "text": "@shila.shrestha_  FYI", "created_at": "2025-12-04T05:16:41", "owner": "monsaa111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18212192164313443, "text": "Tf im gen z and i hardly know any of these", "created_at": "2025-12-04T05:14:16", "owner": "aarondyck891", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066762362390520, "text": "Why am I a mix of Gen Z and Millennial😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-04T05:09:31", "owner": "gra.ce.unhinged", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953698135021280, "text": "The way this told me I’m a millennial 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-04T05:08:54", "owner": "thetaylortouch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071777246594466, "text": "No. I don’t talk any of this shit bruh!", "created_at": "2025-12-04T04:54:56", "owner": "andweeglass88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974009451953275, "text": "Is it bad that I mix between all 3 😅 ‘98 raised as millennial but somehow adapting to the alpha slang 🤷‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-12-04T04:50:50", "owner": "s.arah.kate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089147846307222, "text": "Wtf is 41 and fry tax", "created_at": "2025-12-04T04:46:58", "owner": "neobongzzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046326740478341, "text": "...I'm a mix of all three but I'm Gen Z. 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-04T04:45:27", "owner": "kittencybelle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107630317713751, "text": "Don’t think I’ve ever used any of these words. What’s actually happening!?! Yall good? 🥺", "created_at": "2025-12-04T04:31:55", "owner": "0toddbbot0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114898411602197, "text": "This was honestly so helpful thank you 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T04:29:49", "owner": "alexismerker", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087916504795224, "text": "do you know what tho, i’m gonna keep this one in my back pocket", "created_at": "2025-12-04T04:28:30", "owner": "theperks_ofbeing_amanda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956500567032415, "text": "Ugggggghhhhhhh 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T04:18:52", "owner": "liinn_tn1_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939501268098163, "text": "I'm Gen Z... what's fry tax 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-04T04:17:18", "owner": "nasima321", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089415988757498, "text": "Fry tax?", "created_at": "2025-12-04T04:10:46", "owner": "sikahkhan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049087463414406, "text": "21????", "created_at": "2025-12-04T04:06:23", "owner": "kikeconpique", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105463942647817, "text": "a lot of that stuff you said is alpha is z", "created_at": "2025-12-04T04:05:17", "owner": "reese.i.kinney", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086244239008255, "text": "I’m so old", "created_at": "2025-12-04T04:04:20", "owner": "rglenn1977", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984366858764124, "text": "I have zero street cred", "created_at": "2025-12-04T03:53:20", "owner": "kristenwandering", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109128898619874, "text": "Nah bro 21 meant something !", "created_at": "2025-12-04T03:51:57", "owner": "janky_series", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295601740287568, "text": "Just put the fries in the bag is lowkey genius lol", "created_at": "2025-12-04T03:49:49", "owner": "shaka.jpeg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984413790760823, "text": "ok i’m logging off from the internet for now", "created_at": "2025-12-04T03:44:55", "owner": "sallyyapto", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17959238471878831, "text": "NO", "created_at": "2025-12-04T03:41:44", "owner": "prettyblackmujer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098472964632097, "text": "What the heck is all this", "created_at": "2025-12-04T03:37:34", "owner": "192.168.25.97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090258664944581, "text": "Ohio is a catch phrase now? 😂 why?", "created_at": "2025-12-04T03:33:20", "owner": "caressesn777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120476308543553, "text": "💀💀💀", "created_at": "2025-12-04T03:28:52", "owner": "hhsauthor06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082654091024153, "text": "💀😮", "created_at": "2025-12-04T03:28:21", "owner": "somebudtender", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069311969388305, "text": "When I taught vsarious generations of younger teens I never used their slang. They lliked that. Trying to be cool is not the way to go ...", "created_at": "2025-12-04T03:13:05", "owner": "2616briggs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082722644284950, "text": "“Put the fries in the bag” is “sir this a Wendy’s” is “cool story bro”. Not lock in.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T03:06:04", "owner": "bryan_logan93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860037130484799, "text": "I’m Gen Z and I didn’t even know half of mine wtf", "created_at": "2025-12-04T02:53:58", "owner": "autumnleeplaxco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033247247529138, "text": "I feel old. I haven’t even heard of 99% of the Alpha slang 🥲", "created_at": "2025-12-04T02:49:24", "owner": "princesspillbox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18364877038094531, "text": "OD is definitely a millenial thing. From a zillenial.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T02:46:44", "owner": "sun_god_nicka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945992196943020, "text": "Then call me an OLD AF millennial at 88", "created_at": "2025-12-04T02:31:59", "owner": "ohheyitscode", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859445962556447, "text": "Guess I’m more genz than millennial cause you must be referring to older millennials speech I’ve never heard 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T02:07:56", "owner": "kaiocamx10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868566973493321, "text": "I’m a mix of all three 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-04T02:06:43", "owner": "joeee9.4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992085978892659, "text": "How old is this dude i don't think get got the millennial ones right", "created_at": "2025-12-04T02:03:40", "owner": "georgeetaughtme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547768660041288, "text": "A lot of gen z words are copied from millennials and for some reason millennials have new ones now?", "created_at": "2025-12-04T02:02:46", "owner": "mar73n90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868636600413606, "text": "21 OR 26/27", "created_at": "2025-12-04T01:55:06", "owner": "queer_trash_rat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084740120027526, "text": "i know what they mean now...", "created_at": "2025-12-04T01:48:42", "owner": "h3_mitchell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097675555770479, "text": "This is the most educational video I've ever seen", "created_at": "2025-12-04T01:44:46", "owner": "j3ss4succ3ss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015315515799892, "text": "How am I half a millennial?😭 I’m an 05 baby 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-04T01:39:57", "owner": "z_3nn1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17913534543253884, "text": "Maybe I belong to nothing 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-04T01:38:10", "owner": "myradiati0n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095052934853566, "text": "Is this the generational Rosetta Stone??", "created_at": "2025-12-04T01:33:07", "owner": "sopranoblues", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085205333071630, "text": "Ppl been saying sybau……..", "created_at": "2025-12-04T01:32:03", "owner": "amarra______", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012817484811871, "text": "I’m a mix of all 3", "created_at": "2025-12-04T01:26:03", "owner": "truaccv2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856907059568720, "text": "i feel like aura should’ve translated to swag", "created_at": "2025-12-04T01:25:39", "owner": "official._sweet", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18086218472054662, "text": "Dang?! Can I pick a category 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-04T01:18:23", "owner": "aneya.raynor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127812967501774, "text": "not me asking the new intern how to use aura in sentence and he explaning the logic on aura points", "created_at": "2025-12-04T01:03:20", "owner": "carol.gm14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088505449781473, "text": "The Rosetta Stone of 2025", "created_at": "2025-12-04T01:02:46", "owner": "blacjoker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887570158400837, "text": "Renegade is definitely not Gen z", "created_at": "2025-12-04T00:55:11", "owner": "queen.mo__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078675071332041, "text": "Wtf is 21 😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-04T00:33:37", "owner": "verca.valisova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093536864493591, "text": "Finally complete translation!! 😅🤣💀😭", "created_at": "2025-12-04T00:25:13", "owner": "depgemmecachee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013526330636567, "text": "I'm a millennial and I haven't even heard about half of these sayings 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T00:12:34", "owner": "_a.marie.2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989794254862088, "text": "I’m so glad my mom kept me away from media or owning any devices until I was 20 (2022). We should bring English back 😭🙏🏽💔", "created_at": "2025-12-04T00:10:11", "owner": "manu_meleeee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890669449388469, "text": "I’m elder Gen Z and have NEVER heard of 21, backrooms, meat riding, and acting cursed 🫠 I’ve been around Millennials most of my life, so I use their vocab most of the time", "created_at": "2025-12-04T00:07:54", "owner": "margaretvelto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088097555051971, "text": "Dont you give GenZ credit for Millennial sayings! “STFU” and “boomer” were ours", "created_at": "2025-12-04T00:07:42", "owner": "lgerd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084478964319915, "text": "When did the Alphas steal OD from Millennials???", "created_at": "2025-12-04T00:04:49", "owner": "mcooper62619", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17852932449592421, "text": "Did i just get called old", "created_at": "2025-12-04T00:03:49", "owner": "rob_eb_05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953755398907856, "text": "As a millennial,  i have learned so much", "created_at": "2025-12-04T00:03:15", "owner": "odezzas_collection", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18090953536820819, "text": "meat riding ?!", "created_at": "2025-12-03T23:59:13", "owner": "aidangarry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984102906763173, "text": "Man.. We could really use a massive genocide or extinction event right about now..", "created_at": "2025-12-03T23:49:48", "owner": "mlcvdbrand", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992461854879988, "text": "Bruhhhhhhh no one says “youre done” anymore :(", "created_at": "2025-12-03T23:46:45", "owner": "live_session", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541615507009502, "text": "what", "created_at": "2025-12-03T23:46:18", "owner": "meganweijman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980007342945210, "text": "How is my vocab a weird mix of all 3??", "created_at": "2025-12-03T23:45:14", "owner": "kings.kid.37", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048069257438220, "text": "I’m having a stroke", "created_at": "2025-12-03T23:44:56", "owner": "second.fig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915326083244089, "text": "How does he keep getting away with this? The millennial words are wrong every time.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T23:38:52", "owner": "bo_yahga34", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100221439789679, "text": "Ok stop🤭 it tew much…so millennials really started changing the English language…the way how we’ve pass the torch🥹😍. I love it!", "created_at": "2025-12-03T23:31:15", "owner": "ra_rising", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193784479327100, "text": "Creepy pasta is gen z…", "created_at": "2025-12-03T23:17:34", "owner": "martens3114", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090638194932915, "text": "As a Zillenial, I still use most of the Millenial and Gen Z stuff 😅", "created_at": "2025-12-03T22:59:03", "owner": "_the_blue_bonnie_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008035478659160, "text": "I'm a mix of genz and millennial, gen alpha makes 0 sense", "created_at": "2025-12-03T22:54:24", "owner": "0x.kaito.wolf.x0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860859955545904, "text": "What in the Freddy Fazbearing is this gen alpha slang? 😦", "created_at": "2025-12-03T22:53:38", "owner": "trash_bear29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096114115851187, "text": "Dog water is Gen. Z.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T22:39:24", "owner": "mr_wolf126_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065169182566590, "text": "What’s with the millennial ones?", "created_at": "2025-12-03T22:38:29", "owner": "a.a143cmgdl1216", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063649295548838, "text": "as a ZILLENIAL (millennial & gen z born in 96) idk how this is english atp", "created_at": "2025-12-03T22:21:33", "owner": "vvs.lakai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185596963355035, "text": "not me triple dipping", "created_at": "2025-12-03T22:16:01", "owner": "poprock727", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135552055478159, "text": "I dont use any 'newer' slang because I grew up with a family using 'old' slang. Hearing most of these words just makes me uncomfortable", "created_at": "2025-12-03T22:04:31", "owner": "shaze_dreameryt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303659038281281, "text": "I think “just put the fries in the bag” is more equivalent to “you’re not him lil bro”", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:59:53", "owner": "thealexlaurens", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18330298876214412, "text": "It makes so much more sense now. 🤦‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:56:02", "owner": "musicjunkie411", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034741049722649, "text": "Once again the millennials trying to guess how we speak 🥀", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:52:16", "owner": "_eduardonotfound_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951987844052891, "text": "Ewww gen alpha needs to stop", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:39:37", "owner": "_.bhiiu._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106822123713929, "text": "This hunterxhunter ass slang we have", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:32:14", "owner": "brownsuga2xx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920020138068357, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:27:53", "owner": "bleufeline", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065297252434242, "text": "Call me a boomer but gen alpha slang is genuine nonsense", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:04:04", "owner": "moonlit_witch6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049668572395639, "text": "Alpha makes no sense tho tf", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:01:42", "owner": "paul.chedozeau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18192494941327021, "text": "I still don’t get 67 or 41?!?", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:46:29", "owner": "fevenn7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18130616254493496, "text": "This gave me a stroke", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:34:15", "owner": "yugoth_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17940919652963256, "text": "Gen z here , millennial was better", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:16:49", "owner": "arshiajeiroodi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084094432863183, "text": "Bro i dont even want to keep up anymore stfu 😍", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:15:13", "owner": "sowhatsansu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376947022159598, "text": "Gen z here , millennial was better", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:15:03", "owner": "arshiajeiroodi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852202831554608, "text": "Im finally understanding some of these things 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T19:56:07", "owner": "miss__monique__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087709706065063, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T19:32:43", "owner": "dragonofthevoid.01.exe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986190846873104, "text": "What ever happened to GTFO 😢", "created_at": "2025-12-03T19:27:58", "owner": "f.e.r.n.e.t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867989368487805, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-12-03T19:26:56", "owner": "beautiful__beee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085516442038626, "text": "So... im a millennial born in gen z...?", "created_at": "2025-12-03T19:04:10", "owner": "xandel_8312", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932956432132014, "text": "We used h3lla? What? I didn't know and that is so coool!", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:54:50", "owner": "t.kristne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867908704498891, "text": "As a genz, thanks for explaining", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:48:05", "owner": "paintingg_the_stars", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18102717790673156, "text": "Dog water is not alpha I refuse to", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:43:23", "owner": "kyle_fauberez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18495327469074836, "text": "I think he mixed them up", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:23:00", "owner": "rosegold_babygirl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087375784966485, "text": "I’m 37 and never used any of these. So idk if I’m an any of these.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:22:11", "owner": "officiallyrpd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081389324159245, "text": "Tf is fry tax?", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:21:01", "owner": "haseulpuff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052514282347873, "text": "We never said awkward. But I understand you can’t use the G word", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:20:44", "owner": "officiallyrpd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848358844609494, "text": "Dam", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:14:21", "owner": "yash104503", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882799468304727, "text": "A lot of Gen Z slang be black people millennial slang. White peoples just got it late.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:13:35", "owner": "therealblackjackofalltrades", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296192932274229, "text": "I am all three somehow", "created_at": "2025-12-03T17:51:41", "owner": "kieramoonlight", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18382285120146443, "text": "Od is a millennial term", "created_at": "2025-12-03T17:42:20", "owner": "shelzz3d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089731618750690, "text": "Wtf is creepy pasta??? 😭 I’m a millennial and have no idea what that is??", "created_at": "2025-12-03T17:39:47", "owner": "theepoeticdoula", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105562288729472, "text": "I didn't think aura and vibe are the same", "created_at": "2025-12-03T17:39:29", "owner": "md.fermaint", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18300715117255829, "text": "69 has been 69 since the 1700’s. 6/7 is a stupid brain rot thing for kids. When they grow up they will be using 69 and cringe when they are told the association idiots like you give it to 69. Also 21 was never a thing you’re just stupid.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T17:31:16", "owner": "kell.el", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18532980871036726, "text": "67 cannot mean 69💀 but 67 is 21", "created_at": "2025-12-03T17:29:08", "owner": "huynh.ing_winning", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889012507392030, "text": "Gen alpha slang does lean more absurd, and I mean that also as a genre. If you study absurd theatre is came after and around the world wars, people were literally traumatized and the way they expressed themselves was just as removed from reality— absurdism. So I think that with social media, constant awareness of suffering, and of course a global pandemic. We’re seeing a look into how that generation of children is dealing with the world they were given. The cards they were dealt.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T17:22:01", "owner": "carlymaureend", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084870071020187, "text": "Wtf is 67? Lls I have no idea n I’m 25🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-03T17:15:04", "owner": "thee.apex_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900699574180921, "text": "I appreciate this but I am also having a stroke trying to understand it", "created_at": "2025-12-03T16:57:00", "owner": "whattever_foreverr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074486465192560, "text": "I thought dog water was gen z I’ve been saying that before gen alpha😭", "created_at": "2025-12-03T16:56:32", "owner": "ari_chi1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105259204637693, "text": "Very educational", "created_at": "2025-12-03T16:55:54", "owner": "garysbarnes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987822069862698, "text": "W t f", "created_at": "2025-12-03T16:50:45", "owner": "katiefrezza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109131763718973, "text": "I thought dog water was gen z", "created_at": "2025-12-03T16:42:02", "owner": "tree.nguyen22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994609131714136, "text": "@cvgomez89 twinnnnnnnn", "created_at": "2025-12-03T16:41:51", "owner": "nicoledanifit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049941035668729, "text": "Today I learned I am a mix of z and millennial", "created_at": "2025-12-03T16:32:22", "owner": "sleepyashlee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969950943823078, "text": "6, 7 is 69 minus two fingers", "created_at": "2025-12-03T16:31:58", "owner": "hail_hydron", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074765735595319, "text": "Aura is bde", "created_at": "2025-12-03T16:15:00", "owner": "chumbuckets77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966858564840923, "text": "What is 21 ?? I'm genz but not English speaking", "created_at": "2025-12-03T16:04:45", "owner": "_.staey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113115181585523, "text": "21 ? I am gen z but what the hell is 21", "created_at": "2025-12-03T15:47:22", "owner": "rat_for_clg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030702563765513, "text": "GenZ is 420-69 cmon man", "created_at": "2025-12-03T15:45:41", "owner": "bhanuabram", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082007726177355, "text": "isnt sybau from korean curse word sybal", "created_at": "2025-12-03T15:41:03", "owner": "am_dewz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023008397790348, "text": "How is 6 7 69... Two completely different reference", "created_at": "2025-12-03T15:31:02", "owner": "shujoun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034288277720585, "text": "“Old head” for millennial’s “unc”? Nah. It was “oldfag.”", "created_at": "2025-12-03T15:25:49", "owner": "bentai_senpai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059575571276684, "text": "giving terms out wrong frl. & most of em aint gen alpha😭", "created_at": "2025-12-03T15:05:18", "owner": "sileni.don", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855748921525586, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T14:41:29", "owner": "smoking_fox_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068829590614656, "text": "@vitaminc.eci", "created_at": "2025-12-03T14:30:10", "owner": "yennn.nggg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108431206619456, "text": "Hell nah leave me alone", "created_at": "2025-12-03T14:24:43", "owner": "annoxxee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878568064431913, "text": "As a millennial I don’t approve.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T14:20:14", "owner": "tttaniaaa333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079408937142395, "text": "As a millennial from New York, I think it’s OD that y’all think OD Is GenZ slang when I’ve been saying that shit since I was 10 LMAOOO", "created_at": "2025-12-03T14:15:02", "owner": "datfrogjj_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932086363011419, "text": "As a gen z I related more to most of the Millennial ones lol", "created_at": "2025-12-03T14:10:28", "owner": "jairbear73", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988928478856186, "text": "My kid has been calling me Bestie the whole time?! I thought it was a joke because we are blood related! 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-03T14:04:54", "owner": "jmbeihl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099543145771818, "text": "Old head an skippy pasta was not One millennials…", "created_at": "2025-12-03T14:02:08", "owner": "maciekman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087035171069102, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T13:44:40", "owner": "_ash_like_snow", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084848564048245, "text": "As a Millennial, I’m sadly embarrassed for you mate for making this video 😅🤷🏽‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-12-03T13:41:15", "owner": "wellington_eric1237", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956071987032339, "text": "Cheugy boots is millennial lol", "created_at": "2025-12-03T13:40:49", "owner": "married2ed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084969098081784, "text": "69 / 420*", "created_at": "2025-12-03T13:29:32", "owner": "irelevus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084942535991116, "text": "As a Gen z, we also use aura unc and chad. Idk about the other shit however I may start using Ohio for backrooms bc that’s funny asf lmao", "created_at": "2025-12-03T13:27:02", "owner": "burr.skrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991535982855641, "text": "One thing missin: 42", "created_at": "2025-12-03T13:14:09", "owner": "jillibohne1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865207507515492, "text": "Old head? Wtf says that? 💀", "created_at": "2025-12-03T13:12:56", "owner": "mellyscoffeecorner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908247244274906, "text": "Sigma balls.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T13:09:31", "owner": "jdm.dennis", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18089990092927385, "text": "No dude. You're off on a lot of things", "created_at": "2025-12-03T13:02:17", "owner": "redridinghijab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995759130852286, "text": "Alpha does not own dog water, ive been using that for YEARS in early 2010's", "created_at": "2025-12-03T12:58:59", "owner": "literally.the.fox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905361985292883, "text": "… is my app broke…?", "created_at": "2025-12-03T12:47:00", "owner": "spudbulletlives", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992035776885735, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T12:46:18", "owner": "jtrixalpha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136912684463925, "text": "Gen A just reheated gen zs nachos i remember hearing dog water like 10+ years ago im 23", "created_at": "2025-12-03T12:46:14", "owner": "oshyns_galaxy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074712902011831, "text": "Im a mix of Gen Z and millennial 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T12:43:00", "owner": "callsign.gh0stshark", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17915425734233155, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T12:34:48", "owner": "winntheagent", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053815568338775, "text": "remember when ppl said \"fierce\"", "created_at": "2025-12-03T12:34:30", "owner": "winntheagent", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18438164650100839, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T12:28:17", "owner": "winntheagent", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862645699537944, "text": "These Alpha Words are just horrible😞", "created_at": "2025-12-03T12:18:23", "owner": "gaster__69", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075186809256269, "text": "I never knew I needed this and it hurts", "created_at": "2025-12-03T12:13:28", "owner": "dreamlikegia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993523959723278, "text": "I had to stop and out loud said \"wait....Freddy fazbearing?!\"", "created_at": "2025-12-03T12:06:07", "owner": "amoosedad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928128739169172, "text": "thank you for this", "created_at": "2025-12-03T11:48:13", "owner": "saradelanoval", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902123149312721, "text": "Could you do one for older generations as well? This is so interesting", "created_at": "2025-12-03T11:44:54", "owner": "vorpal.cavity", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084205663841280, "text": "wtf is 21", "created_at": "2025-12-03T11:44:05", "owner": "_keshke__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18166055356388753, "text": "OD is millennial for New Yorkers 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T11:42:23", "owner": "imkuest", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067603442374647, "text": "Inaccurate asf", "created_at": "2025-12-03T11:41:38", "owner": "wwlioww65391", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923519272190157, "text": "This guy like gay n retarded", "created_at": "2025-12-03T11:40:18", "owner": "drphilzzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001286843833385, "text": "Alpha vocab is absolute lunacy 🫩 gen z and mil ftw", "created_at": "2025-12-03T11:40:12", "owner": "ccms175", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861045619477315, "text": "Stop trying to make cheugy a thing, Gretchen!", "created_at": "2025-12-03T11:07:46", "owner": "buffy_the_one_and_only", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165157990381414, "text": "Hey atleast 21 made sense🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-03T10:51:15", "owner": "_jesslindsay_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030097310770180, "text": "😭😭💀 bruh", "created_at": "2025-12-03T10:46:06", "owner": "ingkurokono", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091894066931477, "text": "All the stuff for gen z is for late gen z", "created_at": "2025-12-03T10:40:33", "owner": "tony_gong_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060631550559382, "text": "I still don’t get the 6-7 thing", "created_at": "2025-12-03T10:37:23", "owner": "xiana.a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081183530145322, "text": "Hol up, whats 21?", "created_at": "2025-12-03T10:33:31", "owner": "vonskrict", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979189086946630, "text": "Millenial here 👋🏻 I was so confused reading the Alpha at first, until I read the slang under Millenials and everything made sense.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T10:26:28", "owner": "fannette2012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18181915204357665, "text": "The English language is cooked", "created_at": "2025-12-03T10:20:06", "owner": "mofe_j", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296050405272470, "text": "Who uncle ???", "created_at": "2025-12-03T10:16:14", "owner": "orangeking26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182797012360022, "text": "I’m crying 😂😂💀", "created_at": "2025-12-03T10:16:05", "owner": "orangeking26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845650903602778, "text": "I’m 30 and I literally don’t understand about 70% of these so wtf", "created_at": "2025-12-03T10:15:52", "owner": "jesswesterman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873306205459445, "text": "Nah this kinda help me", "created_at": "2025-12-03T10:14:24", "owner": "plutonium_x1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18197211397324204, "text": "Amazon about being born in 2004 is that you sometimes use all of these and get away with it", "created_at": "2025-12-03T10:13:53", "owner": "im._.loveee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088056749294505, "text": "Does anybody else feel like they just lost brain cells?", "created_at": "2025-12-03T09:56:36", "owner": "its.lauriana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940807653964398, "text": "The hell man, how tf am I a mixed bag of all different slangs.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T09:52:07", "owner": "gg.life_ggs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057323936638764, "text": "Looksmaxxing is incel wordage let's not normalise it plssssss", "created_at": "2025-12-03T09:24:16", "owner": "certifiedbookaddict", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867758896489696, "text": "Omg thank you", "created_at": "2025-12-03T09:10:38", "owner": "gigihab1nh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933399816998931, "text": "This is rage bait right? Dude is so wrong with so many terms lmfao", "created_at": "2025-12-03T08:59:17", "owner": "_themaynard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014553356796588, "text": "This was useful", "created_at": "2025-12-03T08:44:04", "owner": "harrygold__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901774633308467, "text": "I hate it here", "created_at": "2025-12-03T08:35:45", "owner": "xhtnyfromeastlondon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135623113478470, "text": "Sigh....thanks....", "created_at": "2025-12-03T08:29:28", "owner": "keldunkek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857450179514129, "text": "What’s the first one??? I don’t get it", "created_at": "2025-12-03T08:26:12", "owner": "wild_weird_guy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135026263480220, "text": "I’m a millennial sun with a gen z rising", "created_at": "2025-12-03T08:21:54", "owner": "alexslocum20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057493577307294, "text": "Me always thinking I am more millennial than genz because of my raising now realizing how much genz lingo I actually use", "created_at": "2025-12-03T08:12:24", "owner": "jacemultistan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062478035632089, "text": "I only agree with some of this", "created_at": "2025-12-03T08:03:44", "owner": "deccakat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096111487872974, "text": "I'm convinced you made all those up", "created_at": "2025-12-03T07:58:36", "owner": "cassn___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026081795586694, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T07:56:12", "owner": "iambattibwoy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870717787396074, "text": "Thankyou for explaining😭😭😭 i had NO idea wat sigma, skibidi, ohio or mog meant until now😭", "created_at": "2025-12-03T07:51:47", "owner": "jahnae.salvatore", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921448135062905, "text": "Gen alpha makes no sense.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T07:51:03", "owner": "ladycakeslauren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989022225871843, "text": "wtf was all that. 🙅🏽‍♂️🙅🏽‍♂️🙅🏽‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-12-03T07:46:53", "owner": "nextdoorrobert", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891398929385482, "text": "I got called a goat by a six lil boys  and I told them \"I'm human I promise\" and they laughed 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-03T07:17:03", "owner": "beth_selimi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160396966395817, "text": "That’s highkey hella od", "created_at": "2025-12-03T07:16:32", "owner": "coreyymackk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121954519474449, "text": "the greatest number of all time is 69", "created_at": "2025-12-03T07:15:10", "owner": "pldthomefiber_7fb28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988095306865745, "text": "I learned more in this video than I did in school… all my questions have been answered. Thank you, Good Sir.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T07:14:50", "owner": "nicoleethomp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130996504493727, "text": "Genius", "created_at": "2025-12-03T07:08:41", "owner": "abysdeepdark", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067394651136136, "text": "alpha done fucked 💀", "created_at": "2025-12-03T07:03:49", "owner": "dmelizo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107237314723261, "text": "Cheugy is such an old phrase isn’t it?", "created_at": "2025-12-03T06:31:47", "owner": "elyse.meyers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18306123130249499, "text": "I lowkey think that some of the millennial vocab is different, but otherwise I’m mostly millennial with some gen z 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-03T06:29:30", "owner": "ya.its.jesxaden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089593424303285, "text": "So I'm between Gen Z and Millennial, got it. 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-03T06:29:04", "owner": "zachkoto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907939456270594, "text": "bro im so done with my generation", "created_at": "2025-12-03T06:26:48", "owner": "akaza_ag2727", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031045244548491, "text": "So whats the translation of rawrrr :3", "created_at": "2025-12-03T06:24:28", "owner": "kennypahina", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17863421187536525, "text": "kys", "created_at": "2025-12-03T06:21:19", "owner": "jacksonpriven", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057245336308515, "text": "NO", "created_at": "2025-12-03T06:16:22", "owner": "greenyjeans", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051995402341913, "text": "Imagine watching this video pre covid haha", "created_at": "2025-12-03T06:16:05", "owner": "_melanis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939936109096609, "text": "Rizz ->swag -> dunno what else lol", "created_at": "2025-12-03T06:10:13", "owner": "carm_muse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057373295315822, "text": "I'm sorry but who the f*** millennial-wise says creepypasta", "created_at": "2025-12-03T05:30:50", "owner": "x.aura.explora.x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913890331249082, "text": "Omg! My kids are gen z and gen alpha! I NEEEEEDED this! Where have you beeeeen?!?! Lmao", "created_at": "2025-12-03T05:30:27", "owner": "belizegal06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18550732327009692, "text": "As a millennial I do NOT approve of this message most of the so called “millennial” ones I’ve never heard of.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T05:09:09", "owner": "elskan_baby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111708583610613, "text": "As an older gen z, this was helpful! I’ve heard some of the gen alpha stuff but honestly did not get it", "created_at": "2025-12-03T05:06:52", "owner": "butterflysapphirefire", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096510820834650, "text": "Aura is swag for GenZ", "created_at": "2025-12-03T05:02:29", "owner": "aleczhai.png", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962543541862420, "text": "You're \"mostly\" right I guess..,?", "created_at": "2025-12-03T05:01:00", "owner": "olivero_primos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885968608408484, "text": "But I literally just watched a video talking bout 6/7 and  I was like I don't get it lol no I understand  Gen Z here", "created_at": "2025-12-03T04:56:12", "owner": "daytwondames", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066229616408482, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T04:54:19", "owner": "ennnziii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084112115318269, "text": "I am all 3 lol", "created_at": "2025-12-03T04:53:55", "owner": "makeupkatalinabaez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124333078518055, "text": "Is he a genius or something. I barely know all the millennial stuff 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T04:53:24", "owner": "whateva_baby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18212626480310176, "text": "Nah. Millennials said, \"MIKE JONES\"", "created_at": "2025-12-03T04:52:09", "owner": "yvettej1111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077599351959138, "text": "Lock in, isn't wrap it up", "created_at": "2025-12-03T04:50:33", "owner": "jacky__b0y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937187658979760, "text": "41 isn't a thing", "created_at": "2025-12-03T04:50:24", "owner": "jacky__b0y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030511826553380, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T04:46:49", "owner": "ian.villanueva_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064557863165345, "text": "I feel dumber listening to these lingos", "created_at": "2025-12-03T04:41:38", "owner": "sonic_bong1270", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044364038704333, "text": "I was about to send ts to grp thank God I watched till end 😭💀", "created_at": "2025-12-03T04:35:59", "owner": "its_redhood7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848341330582603, "text": "I would say instead of dougie its the Harlem shake, yall loved ts", "created_at": "2025-12-03T04:28:01", "owner": "brett.brak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872042749467679, "text": "I’m Gen Z and the only one that I know is Glazing", "created_at": "2025-12-03T04:23:21", "owner": "benlopez_239", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058961324639864, "text": "Tryna figure out if if in gen z or mili 🫠", "created_at": "2025-12-03T04:19:15", "owner": "bouquet_by_hadiya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927824479154790, "text": "lmfao wow", "created_at": "2025-12-03T04:19:02", "owner": "shnymi94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941385996961994, "text": "Gen Z musta fell off real hard cuz I aint never heard not nay one. How is it that I understand the children better? 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-03T04:17:07", "owner": "terrancereshay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102991684735890, "text": "Protect this man at all costs lol", "created_at": "2025-12-03T04:12:14", "owner": "love2love87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985392123916418, "text": "I feel like I’m in a foreign language class. Queeee?? 😅", "created_at": "2025-12-03T04:10:42", "owner": "virtuouslyjoy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092453734897701, "text": "I don’t think wrap it up and lock in are the same at all and I have no idea what that has to do with fries", "created_at": "2025-12-03T04:10:37", "owner": "llanigirll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897288316204870, "text": "Wtf is SYBAU???", "created_at": "2025-12-03T04:09:41", "owner": "llanigirll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086477576058725, "text": "Gen z here but i use mil😭 00 baby", "created_at": "2025-12-03T04:09:19", "owner": "amir03altuni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937225701985028, "text": "What thee entire fuck is Creepy Pasta?!!!", "created_at": "2025-12-03T04:08:24", "owner": "saafi_jaani", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18099640168773693, "text": "You’re wrong — it’s “awko taco”", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:39:41", "owner": "theseawitchofsirius", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18092194000898012, "text": "...thanks for the translation", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:21:31", "owner": "eve.lynnnnne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844406767613139, "text": "Reel, is cringe, is chopped", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:14:35", "owner": "vissexbruh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18421094113112749, "text": "Wait I thought Chad was a male Karen", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:11:35", "owner": "brandocammando_81", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049135160411373, "text": "I didn’t know 85% of this lingo 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:05:56", "owner": "beanzkhetade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877051378441472, "text": "bro studied", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:01:29", "owner": "breeganderaine", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17849813568601391, "text": "Girl what the hell are any of these millennial phrases", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:53:59", "owner": "emma.altmeyer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064742339390532, "text": "Zillenial crisis", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:52:36", "owner": "cody.crs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091231163494013, "text": "Not me being so much", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:42:20", "owner": "kitsua_mimi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037640468717670, "text": "I'm very well-versed in the older two but please can we get rid of the Gen alphas I'm tired of them. They're all really stupid and I'm horrified to see what the iPad generation is going to be like", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:39:18", "owner": "the_goddess_life", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868579060418548, "text": "Did Gen alpha have a stroke while talking?", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:37:51", "owner": "asian_photographer11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172616128328931, "text": "Why do I not know most of these for any generation😅", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:35:21", "owner": "percy_1519", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067956500383214, "text": "I’m gen z\nAlthough I use both gen z and millennial\nNever heard of a few of them tho 🤷‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:32:15", "owner": "hbright07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845478652603923, "text": "No fuck you gen alpha did not coin Chad.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:29:27", "owner": "gomgo22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869475262474118, "text": "So much of gen z was wrong imo", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:18:06", "owner": "the_7th_rat.king", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542324416025293, "text": "I’m so happy my algorithm brought me to this dictation direct hottie", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:11:13", "owner": "plantdaddy_mn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085556804001967, "text": "Some of these are off twinfolk", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:09:33", "owner": "trincity_saff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124545898512988, "text": "What millennials did you ask?", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:06:15", "owner": "aywcmedia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085456412072799, "text": "this so dumb 😢💀", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:05:16", "owner": "deusxyz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100727161703500, "text": "I know you are speaking English. I know I speak English. But I have no idea what language you were actually speaking.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:00:33", "owner": "the_keto_stoic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990621672910123, "text": "You can still explain it and Alpha slang is still gross", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:59:04", "owner": "queenvictoria.22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136416208424353, "text": "This is very cheugy boomer cringy awkward.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:55:33", "owner": "ddf333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931250533116109, "text": "Fuck I didn't understand any of this.... and I'm a millennial 💀", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:52:42", "owner": "imgadv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067977647433099, "text": "Dog water is not gen alpha, I’ve been saying it for years and I’m 30", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:52:07", "owner": "cravinfornavin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892394194376606, "text": "I'm old 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:48:12", "owner": "armyernst", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101254138743573, "text": "Fun fact skibidi actually comes from a song sung in complete gibberish by a Romani singer", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:34:41", "owner": "lina.lry8_official", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084429029010881, "text": "I feel like you don’t know what a millennial is", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:29:36", "owner": "milton_joya93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061237220235333, "text": "What’s 41?", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:28:07", "owner": "toriwest3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083273993089496, "text": "As a 1993 millennial I relate more to gen z fam😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:17:32", "owner": "dominique.emmarose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847856755583939, "text": "I hate that this all makes sense and I want to play in traffic now", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:17:24", "owner": "db6_ttv_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872564014464037, "text": "Huh", "created_at": "2025-12-03T00:42:58", "owner": "itz_loid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854484727580592, "text": "And zillenials have all these lmfao", "created_at": "2025-12-03T00:40:47", "owner": "mariooootic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031289003549082, "text": "Alpha gen is just shitting slurs", "created_at": "2025-12-03T00:30:05", "owner": "iremcils", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080898827171174, "text": "Creepy pasta is millennial? Wow", "created_at": "2025-12-03T00:29:51", "owner": "iremcils", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971445135816975, "text": "Twin>>>bestie although", "created_at": "2025-12-03T00:22:17", "owner": "tareq_ur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18336043288236403, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:52:53", "owner": "juicyqz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088196257797843, "text": "Thanks I hate it", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:51:11", "owner": "phoenixpersevering", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100526530695344, "text": "This just made me so much more confused", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:50:05", "owner": "vhuscha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970766973963593, "text": "Half way through I lost the intension to learn more like “to know” because both generations’ language is stupid", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:47:00", "owner": "vampireteen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087798034947157, "text": "Wait… 6 7 is the same as 69??? Like oral s-x????", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:28:45", "owner": "melshomestead", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086084189292467, "text": "🤯", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:26:08", "owner": "micheemee15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093839686847814, "text": "All the millennial quotes are just early gen z or \"zillennial\"", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:25:22", "owner": "jakescorneroftheinternet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056795570317268, "text": "Still inappropriately crediting gen z with AAVE and things created by Black gay men before gen z was even born. They just stole so much of it from watching Black gay men in media…", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:21:00", "owner": "danibeef", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099132820837700, "text": "I think you got gen z and millennials mixed up on a few of them bruj", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:18:52", "owner": "itsxavierallen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18097946053810371, "text": "I’m def a millennial I don’t care that I was born in 98", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:13:21", "owner": "jenjami98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544541560001133, "text": "I consider myself a millennial and I apparently talk Gen Z. I’m having an identity crisis 😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:07:11", "owner": "smashmario", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937280892982205, "text": "Millennial at 27 😅", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:03:50", "owner": "noia_cha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117295414566121, "text": "🤔 why do I feel like you mixed up some millennial and gen z slang? Or is that just me 😅", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:54:05", "owner": "schellebelle7_mrs_parker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866435062507884, "text": "Welcome all late 90's kids who are a mix of GenZ and millennial vocabulary", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:46:54", "owner": "nightingfae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998220963698478, "text": "wat", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:44:52", "owner": "andresoteric", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18099359050697839, "text": "I’m a millennial ?", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:43:34", "owner": "elaf_ghnaw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086940512049594, "text": "OD was also a millennial term…", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:42:48", "owner": "joao_cueto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023253494786931, "text": "I... use them all", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:36:52", "owner": "dylan_4_24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110006287614465, "text": "I would change based & savage!!", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:20:10", "owner": "gabzye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193046830331892, "text": "I am an old millennial and I haven’t heard of most of these phrases", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:11:48", "owner": "breaking.phoenix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148610125437196, "text": "Millennial accuracy is kinda mid", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:05:22", "owner": "alexrubbish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035097062734033, "text": "I like 69 more as a gen z", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:40:10", "owner": "maxxstars0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18379423411147725, "text": "So im somewhere between genZ and mil 🥲", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:32:57", "owner": "butchernoemi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17977153451948398, "text": "Saved for later 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:26:47", "owner": "_savtalley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542005438044820, "text": "I’ve been saying dog water since before alpha was invented", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:20:48", "owner": "mariahchloee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18389047048183029, "text": "wtf is creepy pasta?!?", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:13:58", "owner": "mrcooley91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083205052873262, "text": "I’m chronically online, I speak exclusively through whatever the hell is being frequently used here", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:10:41", "owner": "valora.joestar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933102030999615, "text": "I speak Gen Z and alpha 🧍‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:06:00", "owner": "kimi.self", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956440336031948, "text": "GenZ and Millennial slang is just AAVE but also you're wrong on a lot of these", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:04:27", "owner": "a1kc32", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079365415920746, "text": "As a millennial, I have no clue what most of those millennial words are.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:04:15", "owner": "_kristenlopez_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908076952275001, "text": "67 is 1337 ELIIIT", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:59:12", "owner": "im.literally.lilo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18211290037310750, "text": "Not a single millennial fact lol", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:58:55", "owner": "illustrious_gems", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880524676425886, "text": "The way I watched this to see if there was any new lingo. I don’t know yet. Mog is still questionable to me.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:53:20", "owner": "sweetpea1410_2.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086450393097673, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:49:41", "owner": "jon_dai1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143426983453934, "text": "Some of this is just AAVE? What is happening 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:36:38", "owner": "jalonterae_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979562880784063, "text": "8 9 🫷🫸", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:36:19", "owner": "dearaliiice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117878488492902, "text": "I know I am old cause all the gen alpha ones are fucking retarded and just piss me off 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:34:29", "owner": "bou_dre_aux", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164609593389258, "text": "I am 30. I say all 3", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:28:02", "owner": "brokken_hypebeast", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087968777293959, "text": "These videos are cringe and awkward. So Sybau", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:24:34", "owner": "the_exception_to_the_rule", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903205666163501, "text": "Dafuq u talm bout 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:24:27", "owner": "catpatience2000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868022017492909, "text": "Thank you for translating to millennial", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:08:19", "owner": "lauren_p_2019_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966276306843090, "text": "You’ve messed up so many", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:06:38", "owner": "piepazz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132682423435970, "text": "Boomer is millennial", "created_at": "2025-12-02T20:05:20", "owner": "piepazz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852665494547656, "text": "Creepy pasta?? I missed that one", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:56:55", "owner": "thatatthename", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888800785263825, "text": "Holy hell, I’m glad I’m a cowboy. I don’t ever have to listen to this. Use it or try to speak it.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:53:38", "owner": "wolfofwilderado", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079628606133346, "text": "Um. Saving 😬", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:53:02", "owner": "whtvrlownts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128004334507100, "text": "Us Millennials aren't saying this shit", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:31:51", "owner": "ironaddict.sd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922141825057222, "text": "Going through all the generations of slangs is just surreal", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:21:16", "owner": "heiuwuyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887416960395961, "text": "Half these terms are wrong", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:18:00", "owner": "_anteboi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952811803024528, "text": "Taking notes, aunties and uncles this is for US! \nBecause idk wth these kids be saying!!!", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:13:51", "owner": "soofficialgracee_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964814070848856, "text": "Ew 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:13:01", "owner": "queenloudwine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155177569413049, "text": "Mil- Mojo\nGen Z- Swag\nAlpha-Rizz", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:05:35", "owner": "d_villarreal98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092583169902058, "text": "Nah the millennial 67 is 1738", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:03:00", "owner": "_thesupremekai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059564708555612, "text": "I'm a millennial with gen z and gen alpha kids, and I have only heard a few of these. 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:00:06", "owner": "klhpensil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072117755367066, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:55:09", "owner": "itsjustkeic", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18140154988457522, "text": "💀", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:54:35", "owner": "i_rebbie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105608098636557, "text": "Feel like he gave a lot of millennial terms to gen z and gave us late 90s slang, like we weren’t 5-9 years old when people were saying those words", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:38:38", "owner": "its_a_badday", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048596069693469, "text": "Most of this is just old black slang/AAVE and when white people figured it out and often use it incorrectly. Honorable mentions: woke, FAFO.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:34:30", "owner": "mritinerant", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932878708000413, "text": "At least gen z and mil make SENSE! They’re still English!!", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:28:41", "owner": "ajdog1205", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146290396436613, "text": "@tishawtayyy now I know", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:24:50", "owner": "_adityax25_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18198526342324714, "text": "This is art. Or possibly science.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:22:53", "owner": "clairnusbaumer", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17952488784022995, "text": "Nah but why did some of this actually help 💀", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:16:51", "owner": "artist_warhammer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075624361993593, "text": "Incorrect In so many things", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:10:02", "owner": "integralanomaly50", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18551094391044057, "text": "Unc has been around way before alpha gen. Gotta be around more black folks I tell ya that lol", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:38:22", "owner": "sharonssita", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126036211509604, "text": "I’m a mix of both Gen Z and millennial", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:34:10", "owner": "gabriel_caro_aguilar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843074872632282, "text": "what's a mix of all three????", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:33:20", "owner": "karunakumarpvt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18164749654387626, "text": "And once again, I'm between Gen Z and Millennial", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:13:27", "owner": "withloveyourbabypanda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864941275530592, "text": "Why did you sound like you made up some of these words 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:09:11", "owner": "combatheels247", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864454666520658, "text": "As a millennial, I have no idea what reality you exist in", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:01:11", "owner": "spazticneko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18174587389368897, "text": "I'm an early millennial and about half the millennial terms you used I've never heard in my life.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:58:53", "owner": "aimlessecho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857979571502804, "text": "Weird. Idk any of these terms.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:57:47", "owner": "serenitizzy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089001184771105, "text": "Ima Gen Z and I use more millennial talk then Gen Z talk, I get tired of new lingo fast I start acting like how my parents acted when something came out of my siblings and my mouth. Then say “speak English I don’t know what that means”", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:56:34", "owner": "angelina_jo17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096588526866026, "text": "I’m from 97’ but like I do nothing Gen Z lol", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:54:09", "owner": "obduratex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069245183611232, "text": "Is 42?!!!!!? The hitchhikers number excuse me", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:52:03", "owner": "vedra_savage", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302861188255060, "text": "Old head?", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:47:34", "owner": "alexsdjfg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099723046771974, "text": "Stick to OF bro 😭💀", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:40:41", "owner": "jonathanm.jpeg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18411616507142369, "text": "no😭 not at all", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:35:00", "owner": "enri.villalobos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897507904202178, "text": "Alll that other shit, is sommmmmmmmmeeeee bulllshittt - millennials", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:27:25", "owner": "_josayeeeee_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082259549325708, "text": "I hate Alpha like what even is that? Like now you’re just saying shit just to be different.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:18:23", "owner": "nivekg720", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087605485990131, "text": "Thank you for explaining it 😭 (I wont remember)", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:16:22", "owner": "charagotbanned", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18300061927261718, "text": "Get Z with a vocabulary mix of Gen Z and Millennial", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:05:45", "owner": "jerrysm64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18300357991262292, "text": "Wait what the sigma is actually a thing😭I thought my 6yro was just mispronouncing something😅", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:05:36", "owner": "s.teeepphh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970284969978147, "text": "Don't you dare compare 69 to 6 7. One has meaning and the other  is preschool humor.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T15:42:02", "owner": "jonathan670tinian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867640408496809, "text": "Lemmi save it real quick 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T15:37:26", "owner": "desilemurianbride", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18519541054067001, "text": "These are all Gen Z, Gen Alpha is 12 and under. Plenty of Gen Z 13-29 say all Gen Alpha ones ironically since the one who started the song are all in their 20’s", "created_at": "2025-12-02T15:04:16", "owner": "armando.chavezzzz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18164158666390173, "text": "Creepypasta was my interest im Gen Z", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:56:09", "owner": "danza1804", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18292652248273810, "text": "What the heck is 6 7", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:55:57", "owner": "_minettezi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877517893441358, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:46:43", "owner": "aaroncmoraless", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110095276617876, "text": "This is so millennial coded and cringe", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:40:35", "owner": "carvi8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053032565664422, "text": "Where do you get your millennial words 🤣😭🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:39:44", "owner": "socfunguy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321212290216109, "text": "I talk like a gen z and millennial", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:36:05", "owner": "demeaningrope06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099576430755353, "text": "wtf is creepy pasta lmao", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:31:36", "owner": "nicmic423", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012608378803260, "text": "So gen alpha just be using more words to describe shit?", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:04:35", "owner": "05_chris_1718", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18061828190551023, "text": "69 had a meaning tho… always did", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:59:06", "owner": "kegletron", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928987201148519, "text": "This was very helpful. Thank you!", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:56:14", "owner": "skin.therapy.by.emma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865859095514689, "text": "As gen z the slang is Get more and more weird....", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:41:50", "owner": "im.seri_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005159348819635, "text": "It depends on how I’m feeling but put the fries in the bag I’m stealing it is that a millennial thing do we steal things?😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:36:46", "owner": "whoisblossomm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106561339632335, "text": "Im a zillennial😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:24:19", "owner": "973kozy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352717525160382, "text": "NAH YOU ATE THIS 😭💕", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:15:23", "owner": "jai.jenningss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097226128867165, "text": "Am I the only early 90s millennial that uses both Mil and Gen Z slang? Like I’ve used more Gen Z slang than the one mentioned as Millennial", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:15:10", "owner": "breejgarcia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852146053554692, "text": "Bro this is painfull to hear and watch wtf this slang bro💀 just speak normaly", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:08:03", "owner": "ziggy.vdl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086819525007435, "text": "Lock in and wrap it up are not the same wtf", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:05:44", "owner": "mitchstewart311", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117478768496986, "text": "Just made up some shi for millennials and gen z 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:56:49", "owner": "secretcervixagent", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099799354765458, "text": "I hate us all.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:55:10", "owner": "michael_mott", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320061529222721, "text": "girl you ate this DOWN 😌", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:47:34", "owner": "dabeanbrooks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091073726498175, "text": "Tf is 41???", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:45:56", "owner": "star_alisah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18177567295364442, "text": "As a Gen Z, wtf is 21?!???", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:31:17", "owner": "maubrey_draws", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977856906939582, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:27:11", "owner": "00__bailey__00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545395603031802, "text": "a 1000 monkeys would have made a better reel, lock out", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:24:14", "owner": "popizd_neizdrz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854147503581772, "text": "Or 41??? Why with the numbers", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:21:29", "owner": "chimpansara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955143247031139, "text": "I really am a Zillenial 💀", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:20:06", "owner": "roel.brekelmans", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864278725520876, "text": "Ohhhhhhh thank u", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:01:21", "owner": "rainebelle_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156523030405931, "text": "Glazing = brown nosing", "created_at": "2025-12-02T11:52:53", "owner": "bash_rahmat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916605121230589, "text": "This made me realise im getting olf", "created_at": "2025-12-02T11:49:04", "owner": "futurebysarang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077718259958195, "text": "When a Gen z dude tries speaking for millennials.... None of these are our terms tf", "created_at": "2025-12-02T11:06:10", "owner": "shaman_jeff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069891167607920, "text": "I felt sick while listening.  What a headache.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T10:56:54", "owner": "mario9587", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134197846427511, "text": "Asf/af???", "created_at": "2025-12-02T10:42:56", "owner": "caillan_k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910417780262721, "text": "So 6 7 means something...💀", "created_at": "2025-12-02T10:28:14", "owner": "jorissima", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990090762887278, "text": "How did we get from 69 to 67?", "created_at": "2025-12-02T10:19:42", "owner": "heymeg10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082482856892076, "text": "67 replaced 69 because 7 ate 9", "created_at": "2025-12-02T09:54:07", "owner": "fight._.meh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118260655482943, "text": "Ghetto", "created_at": "2025-12-02T09:50:36", "owner": "freddieroberts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951923925914160, "text": "I say things between gen z and millennial but for the most part I don't talk gibberish", "created_at": "2025-12-02T09:47:00", "owner": "kokosbar3.3.3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074210063463732, "text": "Ugh", "created_at": "2025-12-02T09:40:25", "owner": "danica.thoms", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060862826246775, "text": "lol 69. Still funny.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T09:26:44", "owner": "daniel.james.johnstone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032573306727734, "text": "There must be a hidden gen between z and millenials..", "created_at": "2025-12-02T09:12:44", "owner": "_.sarkana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076286393210878, "text": "I’m sorry where did the 41 come from????😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T09:12:32", "owner": "francesca._.malek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895600309359439, "text": "Let's not pretend Gen Z doesnt have most of the same slang as Millenials.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T08:50:00", "owner": "midas.hunts.treasure", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048678626424925, "text": "Thanks for this I been out here lost 😂🤣😩", "created_at": "2025-12-02T08:45:55", "owner": "jade.brienne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072916604200120, "text": "The fact I’ve used mainly “millennial” terms shows that it’s not just millennials 💀", "created_at": "2025-12-02T08:35:47", "owner": "xxsidd._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048828422687918, "text": "Tell me I should be a Millenial without trying 💀", "created_at": "2025-12-02T08:35:22", "owner": "judithter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039711416710335, "text": "Dude. Turns out I was never cool", "created_at": "2025-12-02T08:33:54", "owner": "noraochoa125", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544807825031120, "text": "Gen Z is actually so superior", "created_at": "2025-12-02T08:25:58", "owner": "lovelylightworker_vr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909982027269268, "text": "Inaccurate", "created_at": "2025-12-02T08:24:46", "owner": "jonathan_bojorquez55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18398578045127170, "text": "How am I all the above 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-02T08:15:14", "owner": "_.achar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18536089408016741, "text": "I thought I spoke young people as a millenial. I do not 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T08:09:06", "owner": "mrssgale270118", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979120032929322, "text": "What’s between Gen Z and Millennial.. cause I’m both", "created_at": "2025-12-02T08:03:03", "owner": "pmpkn77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164391631388946, "text": "Lock in is NOT put the fries in the bag 🙂‍↔️", "created_at": "2025-12-02T07:54:12", "owner": "angelbrx19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18210561448313649, "text": "I’m like mix lingo on mil and gen z", "created_at": "2025-12-02T07:46:39", "owner": "potato_face_hoi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125687704513614, "text": "67= HO Element 67 on the periodic table is Holmium.. 🤣 Get it!", "created_at": "2025-12-02T07:42:20", "owner": "lorelle82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088245427966994, "text": "Base god mentioned", "created_at": "2025-12-02T07:37:49", "owner": "micailalexus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18178211245363236, "text": "Move all the slang over by one and it’ll be more correct", "created_at": "2025-12-02T07:32:22", "owner": "lee_giallombardo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094976479879771, "text": "I'm half genz and half mil apparently", "created_at": "2025-12-02T07:31:52", "owner": "zanecobriana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106586302643434, "text": "I think you used a lot. Of young millennial slang so as a gen  z 2001 baby I used a lot of that slang tooo also use OD 🤷🏻‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-12-02T07:12:28", "owner": "lovely_j3wls", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877668262440739, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T07:10:35", "owner": "ellyte1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095054005851693, "text": "I genuinely don’t understand why the alpha generation slang sounds so stupid 😑", "created_at": "2025-12-02T06:34:44", "owner": "beautiful_hawaiian_girl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882667135309306, "text": "Omg 67 is 69??? Noooooo. The kids are not alright. 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T06:34:37", "owner": "rookyinsta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18290425801302830, "text": "THANK YOU", "created_at": "2025-12-02T06:33:41", "owner": "x_dimpl3z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304827151253156, "text": "Actually gen z is 1738", "created_at": "2025-12-02T06:27:13", "owner": "ocean.goth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079706507323317, "text": "maybe bc i'm a younger millennial but like I say a lot of the gen z stuff ? 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T06:16:42", "owner": "sokopuffs_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070581284601136, "text": "Eventually… we will be the generations that nobody talks about like the baby boomers or boomers. Let that sink in.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T06:06:37", "owner": "theplagueclinic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353665540160721, "text": "OD is very interesting for gen alpha grew up in NYC born in the 90’s and that’s still standard lingo", "created_at": "2025-12-02T06:03:07", "owner": "kennytianna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18399856327130872, "text": "This….*taking aggressive notes*", "created_at": "2025-12-02T05:59:31", "owner": "katieloo1113", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084728147101339, "text": "This was retarded...", "created_at": "2025-12-02T05:55:57", "owner": "pdidok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870360739471128, "text": "Me realizing I’ve been using these so wrong 💀 jhahah", "created_at": "2025-12-02T05:55:21", "owner": "mariaxim3na", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086937086483359, "text": "Wtf I’m Gen z but use only millennial stuff. 90s baby moment", "created_at": "2025-12-02T05:45:18", "owner": "ciscc0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922258384057131, "text": "I’m too much of a zillennial 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T05:45:13", "owner": "nic4rd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872005105467672, "text": "Yea this dude ain’t no millennial and prob doesn’t know any either", "created_at": "2025-12-02T05:39:31", "owner": "kingdomlivin1l0vee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855933934522822, "text": "I need to save this 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T05:29:25", "owner": "stella.miquella.lucis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18411358333188386, "text": "wtf is fry tax?!?!?", "created_at": "2025-12-02T05:29:19", "owner": "who_is_isaiah_2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059795576536204, "text": "“Put the fries in the bag” is not the same as “lock in”", "created_at": "2025-12-02T05:28:26", "owner": "who_is_isaiah_2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051831311342333, "text": "Dog watsr was gen z slang, dont even trip. Been sayin that since MW2", "created_at": "2025-12-02T05:25:24", "owner": "riley_shugart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121901590473504, "text": "I thought Ohio was 'cringe' or something bad", "created_at": "2025-12-02T05:24:04", "owner": "judithjsoostrom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127809088509892, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T05:15:37", "owner": "tomophobe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853478473587699, "text": "Finally someone made it make sense! Not me saving this… 🧐", "created_at": "2025-12-02T05:12:30", "owner": "kayjayy718", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105917803654458, "text": "You’re doing the Lords work 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T05:04:58", "owner": "khadijahlopez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18385037227194157, "text": "I see", "created_at": "2025-12-02T05:00:51", "owner": "donnie33941", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958369051006146, "text": "As a Gen Z, I don’t know any of this crap😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T05:00:38", "owner": "maddiegw02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897585436351328, "text": "@ayyysebas", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:57:20", "owner": "michelada_06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091611811902294, "text": "Being born 2000 is a confusing time. Mixing way more millennial then gen z. Not understanding half of gen z though I was born in the era is too real 😅", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:55:35", "owner": "sakuratogepi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146520862437158, "text": "Wtf did I just listen to", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:41:40", "owner": "dragondram", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18421240660118200, "text": "What the actual fuck 😂🤦🏽‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:38:38", "owner": "bertha_ac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080384036323293, "text": "👁️👄👁️", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:37:32", "owner": "geraldinerivera99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845958025617208, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:36:48", "owner": "jasminestricklnd", "likes": 23}, {"id": 18111559513611262, "text": "Feels written by chatgpt", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:31:36", "owner": "e_aspen_a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113686573586847, "text": "How do I unsubscribe", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:29:20", "owner": "danielatriaym", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087233501061379, "text": "oh shit i’m getting old wtf is alpha on", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:29:10", "owner": "llloriann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032504666737740, "text": "Damn. I feel old.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:21:46", "owner": "r_a_n_d_o_r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338549950232452, "text": "Chad is gen z slang. I was saying Chad before alpha was born bro", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:20:06", "owner": "thom.sher", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088114021791649, "text": "Sit this one out black people", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:18:16", "owner": "mycoachtspice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094957537705798, "text": "OD is New York not Gen Alpha", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:17:19", "owner": "mycoachtspice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080947340148392, "text": "Hummm.... 6/7 means nothing while 6/9 is a sexual position. Not the same ew", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:15:15", "owner": "lance.cupido97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146341231428955, "text": "OD is millennial tbh", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:13:26", "owner": "seanboycejohnson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079258648907070, "text": "So it’s gradually getting dumber..", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:10:36", "owner": "neekadoughts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072981266600303, "text": "I use all three", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:04:59", "owner": "die4santanaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102949063708548, "text": "I lost brain cells watching this.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:03:57", "owner": "allcarsociety", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052244639655583, "text": "Thank you for your service sir", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:57:42", "owner": "reileyjude", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096356245862185, "text": "STFU does NOT belong to gen Z", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:51:55", "owner": "the_maester", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546392353003499, "text": "How am I all three", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:45:12", "owner": "bowsette_23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091428718897956, "text": "No Mil ever said “creepy pasta”", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:43:20", "owner": "nerdyxnature", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083133658879319, "text": "Dog water was awhile ago tho 👀", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:31:21", "owner": "theres.a.beee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052189727341071, "text": "So true bestie is for real is true", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:29:24", "owner": "hmm_okayxd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090572884938145, "text": "GenA + millennial vocab  no cap 💀😭😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:27:38", "owner": "arpita__irl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18151481368421932, "text": "I'ma gonna need ya to go back 1 more generation for me....", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:12:42", "owner": "kazmick6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068212745122149, "text": "41...? Never heard it😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:02:00", "owner": "sd_odysseus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076528181337489, "text": "Am I millennial ? Lmfao 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:01:49", "owner": "camen.daniella", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903066118167509, "text": "Tf is fry tax? - an older Gen Zer", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:51:10", "owner": "breanna2001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886697710401985, "text": "💀💀 I talk like millennial and Gen Z", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:35:41", "owner": "__raviethesweetheart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396530986193438, "text": "This video is like an alien came down from space and has only read Reddit and made a video about generational slang because what was any of this", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:35:24", "owner": "imjoshrose", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17963724267005344, "text": "No mention of swag got me upset", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:29:50", "owner": "karl__not__carl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18302351824281715, "text": "Thank you for the explanation!! My brain just entered stroke and I'm now on deathbed to meet my great grandparents", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:16:17", "owner": "kylede0wl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085043255305054, "text": "This is dumber then dumb", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:16:10", "owner": "alistairf954", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919841683068271, "text": "what happend to “epic”", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:08:40", "owner": "not_av_23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086115539048845, "text": "Od is NOT alpha that’s BEEN millennial talk", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:01:22", "owner": "sassmonstress", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945478636072918, "text": "bruh what’s the point of all this", "created_at": "2025-12-02T01:43:44", "owner": "nanawrway", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077429372232559, "text": "Do another one but go all the way up to Boomer lol", "created_at": "2025-12-02T01:43:16", "owner": "scarletttuck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853760956584998, "text": "wtf is 41, genuinely so confused", "created_at": "2025-12-02T01:39:40", "owner": "makayla.h1", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17973383861805816, "text": "You're done universally means you're finished", "created_at": "2025-12-02T01:32:55", "owner": "atomicxshotz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095972833846464, "text": "TF IS 41??!! 😭😭💀", "created_at": "2025-12-02T01:28:44", "owner": "tenebris_9178", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18549672586045962, "text": "What the ___ is \"fry tax\" am I a boomer???", "created_at": "2025-12-02T01:28:11", "owner": "briatheartist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18187999642339755, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T01:18:57", "owner": "__goldo0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052199702341586, "text": "Yeaaa... no. Vibe is not a millennial term. A lot of these were wrong", "created_at": "2025-12-02T01:13:34", "owner": "teggyeric_89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880161691426142, "text": "21 is millennial pls", "created_at": "2025-12-02T01:13:07", "owner": "d33javu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109426414720338, "text": "21?", "created_at": "2025-12-02T01:08:26", "owner": "pinky_vamp_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897225607205254, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T00:56:35", "owner": "brandon98.jpg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099192652770613, "text": "Ok young gen zers cannot tell me im millennial now", "created_at": "2025-12-02T00:46:31", "owner": "alishakodib", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990793752734314, "text": "24", "created_at": "2025-12-02T00:45:07", "owner": "karlohorcicka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18517173070065629, "text": "Im coming to realise i never use slang", "created_at": "2025-12-02T00:24:18", "owner": "jgray2433", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981318615926737, "text": "You only got alpha right", "created_at": "2025-12-02T00:16:39", "owner": "breadley____6280", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971692704816737, "text": "okay so some of those make me feel millennial instead of gen z and that was really upsetting bc what the fuck is “based”", "created_at": "2025-12-02T00:07:33", "owner": "nailsbycailyn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17865343548515959, "text": "Gen Z and Millenial slang blends together like we all use both but Gen A is just in its own world", "created_at": "2025-12-02T00:00:13", "owner": "sarah_l_wimmer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109042954615564, "text": "This was very educational, thank you", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:57:43", "owner": "the_carlybeth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991422285730108, "text": "Oh so we’re all insane cool", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:43:22", "owner": "_itsclur_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087829852947481, "text": "The way 80% of this is just AAVE😔", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:38:18", "owner": "phoenixxoxo42", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18026267405586696, "text": "“Shut your bitch ass up” is absolutely not claimed by a generation no older the 11 years old rn. That’s a gen Z thing bud. Credits due sir", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:37:55", "owner": "memezzzz47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066762095616261, "text": "Some of these are completely wrong ohio and bavkrooms dont mean the same", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:37:33", "owner": "jasongyselinck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096326818877171, "text": "As a millenial I never said \"you're done\" but I do always use STFU and SYBAU 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:29:17", "owner": "stygian.beast", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935733493105802, "text": "Right terms, wrong meaning for Millennials. Next, try again. Not", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:25:35", "owner": "e.m_aertist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980225631779553, "text": "Look... dog water has me in a choke hold as a Zillennial", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:23:42", "owner": "thegardenofale", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927847654160534, "text": "Comments saying millennials didn’t say that is because most of it is AAVE. 🤣😆😂\nCuz black people have been and continue to say these. 😆😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:18:29", "owner": "ann_hutch__crunch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089174737942747, "text": "put the fries in the bag does not equate to lock in at all", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:15:03", "owner": "zach_jpg_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058433687296426, "text": "This video will be linked in my suicide note, stfu", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:14:17", "owner": "gabe_wheeler_ky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029021957570609, "text": "Chad is way older than Alpha", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:06:34", "owner": "sdrescher8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304146322267992, "text": "WTF IS 41", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:05:39", "owner": "oxyperez_03", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071578748598342, "text": "\"Meat\" riding has ALWAYS had a sexual undertone? Wow, that's...umm...uhh...interesting???", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:03:31", "owner": "magic_zicca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854293354579941, "text": "You lost me completely", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:03:14", "owner": "aestheticbrh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544805992030831, "text": "Ok so I’m not even Gen Z", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:51:05", "owner": "arinaafra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18349951906207837, "text": "No... What??? Some of this was absolutely wrong", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:46:01", "owner": "ravens_and_foxes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907381720277347, "text": "I‘m 25, and Know only 3 of ALL of these words.. \ndon’t tell me I’m the only one. And if so; guess I’m just a time traveller..", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:38:45", "owner": "simsim.mi369", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112563865590123, "text": "Whats 21??", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:30:17", "owner": "solomonera1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844811914620665, "text": "Whats 🫲🏼8 9🫱🏼?", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:28:38", "owner": "gggiyannn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960362311007570, "text": "I hate all of it", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:20:57", "owner": "goddamitstone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047721314689851, "text": "Gen alpha isn’t making any slang they’re all 15 and younger", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:19:16", "owner": "al_radd99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882666826305344, "text": "Who even says Cheugy Burger....", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:13:41", "owner": "_orangesfpop_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099633154702362, "text": "Bro this video was so bad I had to block you (i never block on ig)", "created_at": "2025-12-01T21:54:15", "owner": "gsustoobeast", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085770514840794, "text": "I understand nothing from Alpha, gen z, I knew and used just a bit from it. I'm sad", "created_at": "2025-12-01T21:50:38", "owner": "primerose_ytb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954851562901532, "text": "oxford dictionary word of the year type sh", "created_at": "2025-12-01T21:44:12", "owner": "jlouispop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956076250040249, "text": "ur doing alot for archaeolinguistics", "created_at": "2025-12-01T21:41:38", "owner": "lilinist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134800207470996, "text": "Why is 41 turning into a meme?", "created_at": "2025-12-01T21:35:52", "owner": "bekkie_wekkie_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114109951563166, "text": "Wtf is creepy pasta??", "created_at": "2025-12-01T21:30:45", "owner": "aunaturalerbc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977184018950367, "text": "petition to change \"you guys\" into \"homies\"", "created_at": "2025-12-01T21:26:54", "owner": "creeperb33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18336202369231058, "text": "Bro dog water has been a thing for like a decade", "created_at": "2025-12-01T21:23:19", "owner": "fretchart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025241039590904, "text": "Thanks", "created_at": "2025-12-01T21:20:02", "owner": "petitemaria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934442242126099, "text": "Almost everything in the gen z column is just stuff black people have always said. And almost everything in the millennial column is just white YouTuber lingo.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T20:57:49", "owner": "joehendo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147863728434460, "text": "6 7 is not 69 😅", "created_at": "2025-12-01T20:57:05", "owner": "ayyjayysworld", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074626739584334, "text": "I'm a Mix of everything", "created_at": "2025-12-01T20:32:02", "owner": "cakeychan.xoxo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026248721582044, "text": "Bulshit is the one word for this.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T20:12:27", "owner": "bachata.jay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991934148730875, "text": "If you have kids, you learn to use this one 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T20:05:43", "owner": "sheroth.reads", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17915048553236395, "text": "Im Gen Z but also I think im stuck in mil", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:39:29", "owner": "michllle0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074809142006833, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭💀", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:31:59", "owner": "vibeswithjuls", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125256499516013, "text": "Thank you for helping me communicate with my child. 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:27:38", "owner": "miss.sunshinedust", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909045901267859, "text": "No", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:22:49", "owner": "flac0n0more90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857904928502895, "text": "I learned something 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:22:06", "owner": "chantalekes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885470863288183, "text": "I'm sorry, Twin has meant that long before current Gen 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:21:25", "owner": "retheren_silk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18519653206071830, "text": "Gen  z born after 05 refer to alpha", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:02:49", "owner": "ybs._jayy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093049657899014, "text": "Don't know a lot of these from any generation lol", "created_at": "2025-12-01T18:56:22", "owner": "imwithcalvin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331308754212525, "text": "I don't belong to any generation", "created_at": "2025-12-01T18:53:08", "owner": "prriyamedddhhhh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320499019168697, "text": "I still need translation lol", "created_at": "2025-12-01T18:36:13", "owner": "melanin_maiden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18382023481145431, "text": "Listen, I’m JUST catching up on Gen Z, please don’t get me started on alpha vocabulary yet. UGH 🤣😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T18:28:28", "owner": "azulbebey", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17933778069121155, "text": "I think I'm having a stroke 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T18:13:47", "owner": "kdot_mr.moral", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954466749899117, "text": "Nah as a toxic gamer I've been calling people dog water for years when I don't want to be chat banned for cursing", "created_at": "2025-12-01T18:09:08", "owner": "silence_can_be_our_bliss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368060491088010, "text": "Most of these aren't even accurate lmfaoo", "created_at": "2025-12-01T18:04:59", "owner": "303._.keef", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321048814171630, "text": "None of these have any correlation through vocabulary evolution.\nGood try though, maybe take some linguistics corses next time\n\nThe real diabolical disgrace is thinking “put the fries in the bag” has anything to do with “lock in” bro a bot", "created_at": "2025-12-01T18:01:08", "owner": "eeppraa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102605923706269, "text": "Clout / bestie / dogwater / trash / fam / based / bruh / meat riding / glow up / flexing are not exclusive to gen z lmao", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:53:29", "owner": "sawaters", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933202027129715, "text": "6/7 is 69? 😂 that would be horrifyingly creepy", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:53:24", "owner": "lelandhasadventures", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904458145297655, "text": "Im solo definitely genz lol😂😂 gen alpha makes NO FVKING SENSE 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:45:23", "owner": "sarah__free_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061752428214152, "text": "at this point these kids just made their own language! 🤦🏼‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:42:55", "owner": "sophiaa.altmann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855478171528947, "text": "I’m gen z but apparently I’ve been using millennial lingo my whole life", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:42:55", "owner": "certifieddedicatedsinner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080436557330890, "text": "We're getting dumber each generation", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:26:02", "owner": "americanbiguy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126379387510999, "text": "Think im all 3 wus dat mean?", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:24:40", "owner": "francisco_esqu559", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928349185153944, "text": "I don’t like this at all", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:11:09", "owner": "_unk0wn_n1sw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944969230079165, "text": "I just got more confused than my dyslexia", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:02:18", "owner": "xobeautiful_xo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078678419464596, "text": "Gen z created dog water… just saying", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:55:59", "owner": "avery.march8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18548842309049015, "text": "What? STFU is a millennial thing! I also feel like based is a millennial too but I could be wrong", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:53:06", "owner": "hennybasedgod", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18349892134206563, "text": "Millennials disagree here", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:51:16", "owner": "coy_san_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368345119090014, "text": "We don’t say meat riding, we say gassing up", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:49:47", "owner": "jainie.uwu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876910090355207, "text": "old head? Said no millennial ever. We said Boomer too. Reminder millennial is mid 80s to late 90s. We’re almost all 30.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:42:04", "owner": "vanloondusty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029336918559081, "text": "What the fuck is 41", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:39:47", "owner": "_princeofmars_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073390262521837, "text": "You really missed out on corny for millenials when explaining cringe", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:37:26", "owner": "chelseyyyymae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042291986709598, "text": "I felt my brain melting listening to this shit", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:34:20", "owner": "kaprovsky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165856342388551, "text": "Millennial with a vocabulary of a millennial born 95", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:30:25", "owner": "days_nats_kessys_mommy_1995", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860972932542725, "text": "This doesn't seem accurate", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:21:34", "owner": "luccis_love", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338375239237016, "text": "This was painful to watch, especially the so called alpha language", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:18:14", "owner": "justz_0920", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089291821767100, "text": "Why was there an add countdown…", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:17:37", "owner": "iamthe_og_loser", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101159272754723, "text": "69 is a movement between couples", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:13:56", "owner": "technosquadfilms", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064712705445698, "text": "In conclusion, GenZ stayed saying 98% Mil slang. And there’s Alpha that makes up dmb shzz", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:10:40", "owner": "dejavutho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078278108332158, "text": "this was so fast i feel like i minored in slang", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:08:39", "owner": "lolzorgfykys", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082563875170227, "text": "Lets keep things like how they were in the early 00’s…. Thats 💩 was tight", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:02:18", "owner": "hec.xcvii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18198799528326131, "text": "No idea what's going on with ohio", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:00:36", "owner": "callmechargie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905051911284316, "text": "Mil is 42069\nMil is STFU. Not “your done”, duh fck bruh?\nMil is boomer and old head\nNever heard a Mil say “wrap it up”, those were teachers teaching mil breh.\nMil is both street cred and  clout.\nNgl Mil started cringy(I hate that word)\nMil is both back rooms and creepy pasta\nMil is both vibe and MCE…\nMil said “Chad”. Ain’t nobody said “dudebro”, tf?\nMil said bestie and Bff \nMil started “trash” and dog water, everyone says crap bro.\nHow are you getting these wrong bruh?\nMil says “high key” / “low key” \nNo one said “fry tax”. fanum tax is a Fanum thing…\nI agree with all three on “savage” term.\nMil mos def says “tf” not “wtf” and also “bruh” breh…. \nMil is renegade obviously.\nMil is 110% “meat riding” and “kissing cheecks”…. \nMil started grow up, glow up \nNo one says “flex up”? Tfym? It’s “get flexed on” \nMil says get “curved”, “murked” but both girls it’s actually Mil that says “curved” or “airball”..", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:59:57", "owner": "dejavutho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147911773426715, "text": "I never realized i needed a translator until now. I am officially a millennial", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:55:09", "owner": "192.168.420.6.9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010513100647173, "text": "Why do I not know half of this slang ...", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:48:42", "owner": "georgina.chiu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951817378029097, "text": "I finally understand now.Thank you for 😅", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:39:34", "owner": "jahlil15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082624438884046, "text": "What's funnier than 24", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:33:17", "owner": "_that_white_chevy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936743805983359, "text": "i’ll argue that twin is more gen z than alpha 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:29:09", "owner": "almaleallour", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18334932055243234, "text": "Im between Mil and Gen Z", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:27:16", "owner": "supremo.ram", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957972316031471, "text": "I'm zillenial 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:26:38", "owner": "avantika_sha789", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988453377745422, "text": "it’s ya, you keep giving them a platform", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:22:51", "owner": "jwpremebeing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18328126021245476, "text": "I just learned that I was never a part of the “in crowd” with any of these. As a millennial, I have never said these phrases.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:19:53", "owner": "lauraturnsthepage", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104332063661407, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:18:05", "owner": "greenteatown02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047208932441079, "text": "I’m a millennial… what are these words you’re telling me we say?", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:18:05", "owner": "aimm_demm17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999993000850173, "text": "Street Cred for the win! 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:14:29", "owner": "lilone127", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087498104489936, "text": "Aura is Gen Z tho", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:14:08", "owner": "coyote_gospel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067924877111265, "text": "69 is a sex pose that’s why we thought it was funny wdym 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:10:55", "owner": "renasaur.cos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085626227003521, "text": "I'm a mix of gen Z and Millenials vocab then lmao", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:00:49", "owner": "maxime17max", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078762917233601, "text": "This made my head hurt", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:00:28", "owner": "justintisdale75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975689289953124, "text": "I'm gen z and I'm just now hearing about 21, the fuck did i miss?", "created_at": "2025-12-01T14:58:41", "owner": "void_aram", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160895155402538, "text": "Agh I just wish they sounded more iconic like what happened to this gen? They all look like the new MLP and Monster high combined", "created_at": "2025-12-01T14:53:21", "owner": "carlos_mgomez23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073283996203161, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T14:34:32", "owner": "baubautungtungrizzlerfanumtax", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080001596162665, "text": "wtf is 41 now!!!!!! 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T14:27:51", "owner": "djdance04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968711854000337, "text": "Are these all made up?\nSpeak English bro", "created_at": "2025-12-01T14:27:26", "owner": "lukefinamore", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155734924405067, "text": "As a Zillennial. I like the Gen Z better except for savage", "created_at": "2025-12-01T14:22:16", "owner": "dericktors.cut", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075854954226132, "text": "I’m so lost", "created_at": "2025-12-01T14:09:21", "owner": "g.rae13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086485246979137, "text": "I’m more confused about where I belong now than ever", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:45:57", "owner": "taylordeion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986957319752264, "text": "He’s obviously not a melanial", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:34:25", "owner": "tony_goldman_way", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083460836107120, "text": "Did I really miss 2 generations of slang? I only remember Millennial😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:32:04", "owner": "iamjonesinn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098347738769357, "text": "Each generation gets more unintelligent", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:31:37", "owner": "blakealanmartin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131119831496236, "text": "Son is wrong on the millennial slang", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:31:16", "owner": "drewsmith__18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882586507306345, "text": "He was very wrong a lot and it pissed me off", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:24:46", "owner": "kingreggiedavisbih", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076952759224681, "text": "Can we just mis GenZ and Millenial?? Because i am GenZ and I use millenial vocabulary", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:21:13", "owner": "len.volkov_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045881477469438, "text": "All this tells me is I don't belong to any of them 😂 a little bit of here a little bit of there, but not enough to classify.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:20:50", "owner": "wolfpajama", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18327854080214338, "text": "You got these more mixed up than the trans community", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:01:05", "owner": "mastersetmarcus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095533897857394, "text": "I’m confused", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:00:02", "owner": "sephra_ti_yah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074717993221850, "text": "Thank you. Lol 😅", "created_at": "2025-12-01T12:55:17", "owner": "itzcrabtree", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104847304634443, "text": "This is so wrong it isn’t even funny. 😂😂😂 you don’t know millennials at all.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T12:38:00", "owner": "bryognosis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047259875453183, "text": "Only one I think you missed was Millennial Fry Tax should be Dad Tax imo but this is spot on 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T12:31:47", "owner": "presidentnoir", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17867862948487882, "text": "Wait the chat thing makes so much sense because I was playing tekken with a stranger at PopCon and he kept saying \"im gonna lose chat\" and I thought he kept saying it out of twitch stream habit and it threw me off. I still beat him at Tekken though", "created_at": "2025-12-01T12:09:39", "owner": "anduong2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928188838155645, "text": "Never heard someone say Ima put the fries In the bag to “lock in”", "created_at": "2025-12-01T12:09:28", "owner": "tothegio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068631011097272, "text": "How is dog water alpha. Ive been saying that for like ever. Im 30 and ive been saying that for like 14 years", "created_at": "2025-12-01T12:08:32", "owner": "gravity1man", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088020931790202, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T11:45:59", "owner": "romotabb32", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079272595935944, "text": "1738", "created_at": "2025-12-01T11:27:05", "owner": "universified777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051978230366568, "text": "As a 1997 Gen Z, thank you for confirming that I'm actually a millennial 🫶", "created_at": "2025-12-01T11:11:06", "owner": "alyssa_engdahl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114729580570428, "text": "All the things in Gen Alpha have no freaking meaning", "created_at": "2025-12-01T11:10:49", "owner": "sumanta_ssr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098205661650653, "text": "nnnnoooooooOOOOOOOOOOO!!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-12-01T11:10:23", "owner": "foundersofolympus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164745817385533, "text": "I'm a Gen Z who talks like a Millennial........", "created_at": "2025-12-01T10:53:30", "owner": "s0rta.unusual", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988431114910121, "text": "Half is wrong", "created_at": "2025-12-01T10:26:32", "owner": "justice_t_02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065018804165342, "text": "ok kinda get it now", "created_at": "2025-12-01T10:21:41", "owner": "nicolecorbes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066549041138726, "text": "Am i millennial?", "created_at": "2025-12-01T10:17:27", "owner": "rick.borghuis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099333499772132, "text": "Please god make it stop", "created_at": "2025-12-01T10:07:41", "owner": "babeexpunk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972047928964939, "text": "Team mill 💯", "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:52:36", "owner": "kingxrae600", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002312237682148, "text": "Can you make a dictionary please I would buy it", "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:48:45", "owner": "davidbadillo2301", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18395482072123903, "text": "All the mil is literally still Gen Z", "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:41:50", "owner": "valory_gayle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18521371369066030, "text": "Most of this is just stolen black slang. 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:39:45", "owner": "mochioffline", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094972870867364, "text": "Gen Z here! Uhhh lemme help yall SYBAU is shut yo bitch ass up...I didn't know millennials  did know that until I talked to my sister 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:35:46", "owner": "peanuttaylor4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086325953066585, "text": "Nah I've been saying dog water for 10 years now", "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:08:57", "owner": "darnellkr17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912431962253161, "text": "41??????", "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:04:31", "owner": "mamapanda_05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086319512284585, "text": "Mans doesn’t know genz or millennials", "created_at": "2025-12-01T08:53:13", "owner": "solomon_grungyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18517697452066575, "text": "I think I'm both genz and millenial", "created_at": "2025-12-01T08:33:50", "owner": "yours_truly_dodo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123792739464187, "text": "Ive never heard “old head”", "created_at": "2025-12-01T08:31:13", "owner": "sweatmonst3r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007705649662303, "text": "This is just completely inaccurate.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T08:31:02", "owner": "magnusdr_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18090079186910369, "text": "I’d rather have a stoke because at least then I’d get some medical attention. I understood and learned nothing omfg", "created_at": "2025-12-01T08:28:09", "owner": "patcheese97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087310024955209, "text": "Nothing will age you more than the lingo you refuse to let go of 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T08:26:58", "owner": "jessealvarezsig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18173621659375019, "text": "Thank you!", "created_at": "2025-12-01T08:20:55", "owner": "unclebud83", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876295000445067, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T08:00:31", "owner": "dillon_brownie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845290783604346, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:45:48", "owner": "oh_what_heathens99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903168310164223, "text": "I am all at once?!", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:45:44", "owner": "mktybdjr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081573419115629, "text": "No - millennial was “awko taco” 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:45:14", "owner": "rantyauntyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098729149766407, "text": "Literally bs", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:33:52", "owner": "connor.co.uk_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077029489976039, "text": "I love calling my friends chat", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:33:03", "owner": "indigo_sews", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987407496747817, "text": "I'm Gen Z, but understood Millenial slang better than Gen Z and Alpha", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:19:38", "owner": "ce.vanne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078453248274192, "text": "Ok so I’m officially old. Got it.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T06:59:53", "owner": "cecelovablekay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082107721887692, "text": "Not one of these words is in the bible", "created_at": "2025-12-01T06:55:42", "owner": "ariellergordon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889582816385045, "text": "Half of these are wrong lmfao probably just for engagement 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T06:44:02", "owner": "bttry_acid", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063625532566888, "text": "I don’t say any of that shit haha", "created_at": "2025-12-01T06:40:48", "owner": "pedraza_ryan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18398323723126514, "text": "Renegade as the comparison to dougee almost made me up the switch ngl", "created_at": "2025-12-01T06:31:16", "owner": "neglectedbuilt", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18066370802580723, "text": "Shut uppppp 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T06:28:30", "owner": "21january", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919715302067873, "text": "Just put the fries is NOT lock in 😂.\nIt means stop complaining and do your job.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T06:21:52", "owner": "saifchowdhuryartandtv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077826503335224, "text": "Kms mannn😅😅😅😅😅", "created_at": "2025-12-01T06:19:17", "owner": "devilroxan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066624224452893, "text": "Just no", "created_at": "2025-12-01T06:08:54", "owner": "k.d.j.29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858026632558467, "text": "The 67 69 thing. I said it", "created_at": "2025-12-01T06:05:33", "owner": "lifforra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932952465999202, "text": "Why does the millenial slang sound so formal", "created_at": "2025-12-01T06:00:59", "owner": "jameswalsh486", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301866892254359, "text": "Most of them are created by the recent millenials", "created_at": "2025-12-01T05:55:11", "owner": "woiseman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153239944420342, "text": "Can we get a Gen X version? My parents are Gen X but are closer to Millennials than Boomers", "created_at": "2025-12-01T05:53:16", "owner": "andrews.version_26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547083430035790, "text": "I learned a lot just now", "created_at": "2025-12-01T05:51:53", "owner": "sfv_bonehead", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921636994206531, "text": "This pissed me off😭🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T05:45:23", "owner": "the_ahuddle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971139813968682, "text": "Omg thanks for explaining all this gen alpha and some gen z slang haha", "created_at": "2025-12-01T05:35:44", "owner": "reygniter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148623979430827, "text": "How did stfu become Gen Z? That’s like RuneScape, mIRC, and live chat slang for me lol.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T05:35:21", "owner": "neverliftagain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067946921570735, "text": "Neither of the numbers relate to 69, 69 has an actual thing, the gen z is weird, gen alpha one just makes absolutely no sense", "created_at": "2025-12-01T05:33:50", "owner": "keeley.jobe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18231416392305746, "text": "Thank you! My father decided to have another child after me so I need this to understand my younger brother. 💀", "created_at": "2025-12-01T05:27:07", "owner": "opulentnails_ann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035973428518251, "text": "I'm to high for this", "created_at": "2025-12-01T05:18:54", "owner": "teabagsmcgee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18402267334193494, "text": "What language is this", "created_at": "2025-12-01T05:18:21", "owner": "dinosaur_lifts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303277654270037, "text": "Nah we been saying OD since the 90s", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:59:35", "owner": "cuturu12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066963083542824, "text": "As a millennial… we had OD", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:53:59", "owner": "sabri13diaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853483492588584, "text": "I guess I'm a Zillennial - a mix of gen z and a millennials", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:52:30", "owner": "ljchea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024362162593515, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:51:25", "owner": "8bit_mello", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066776591411987, "text": "Somehow I’m a mix of genz and millennial…", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:44:39", "owner": "jjacoby_tessa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18440076316102916, "text": "So I have never heard any of these alphas 😂😂except 6 7", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:35:18", "owner": "amayyyd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864832081516359, "text": "@itsjcbitches", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:31:49", "owner": "mjayworld_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048943643415329, "text": "I’m a 33 year old millennial and I never heard “old head” in my life.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:31:28", "owner": "chasethecomposer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885454483407164, "text": "I’m a millennial with a touch of Gen Z 😌", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:27:51", "owner": "the_ty_show", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066146009575372, "text": "I’m having a generational crises because was I gen Z saying all the millennials slang?? Or am I a millennial😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:22:44", "owner": "_parisent", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874617535370736, "text": "Wrap it up and lock in are 2 separate things my guy", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:22:31", "owner": "clabo1220", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184847134358145, "text": "\"stfu\" is definitely millennial", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:19:57", "owner": "my.stupid.reels", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953552305029335, "text": "I don't know any of this bs except wtf", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:12:09", "owner": "roscoe_the_beav", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014546768801041, "text": "Me casually cherry-picking from all of them.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:07:26", "owner": "scrolldragon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845283097607071, "text": "Wtf is fry tax😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:07:11", "owner": "myculoburnssendhelp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082536434036042, "text": "Nah, just put the fries in the bag is Gen z-Mil. It was around before Lock in", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:07:07", "owner": "rainboy_00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082014554112692, "text": "dog water was Gen Z", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:03:18", "owner": "juliakleenex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007272836819575, "text": "No", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:01:16", "owner": "voiddiver1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099088021808480, "text": "OD AND HIGH KEY DONT MEAN THE SAME THING WTF??? like “oh no he’s high keying someone get the narcan kit!!” 😭😭💀", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:00:32", "owner": "wolfyking321", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109316215618195, "text": "Yeah alpha isn’t Gen Z bro", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:58:57", "owner": "wolfyking321", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090663397938260, "text": "I don't think backrooms = creepy pasta.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:57:18", "owner": "thickstraw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989739615883485, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:55:23", "owner": "kellysjellys", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18379304281198362, "text": "I talk like a mixture of Gen Z and millennials", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:41:04", "owner": "moonshinerise27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121309528530443, "text": "Man what? Is bro speakin English?", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:35:52", "owner": "elion_gonzalez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922847833051094, "text": "I'm definitely a Gen Z cuz wtf Gen Alpha about 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:34:22", "owner": "duck_everybody", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102540670676073, "text": "Some of these work but others don’t", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:29:56", "owner": "thattwitsig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145417054439239, "text": "this just proves that 2000s kids are millennials", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:29:34", "owner": "bri_chrysler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919786795198803, "text": "I'm gen z and never heard of 21 before 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:25:45", "owner": "turtle.critter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106083112566572, "text": "Does any millennial actually use most of these \"millennial\" slangs that bruh  just mentioned?", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:25:13", "owner": "silver_ang", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18091491658926648, "text": "No", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:23:18", "owner": "kaylon47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092826577911361, "text": "No no no", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:23:04", "owner": "blur.w7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909773605121219, "text": "Hala chuz ♿️ don’t talk that wayz", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:22:18", "owner": "itz_bakz_lo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081235322138661, "text": "Fuck .. braincells so gone", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:21:45", "owner": "f4sayk3n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085808480075795, "text": "I guess I didn’t know all of these", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:21:36", "owner": "akayardbyrd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18435526345100814, "text": "The way I float back-and-forth between a millennial and Gen Z like a true zillennial", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:19:28", "owner": "ashycatt101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074359283206506, "text": "NOBODY SAYS CHEUGY💔💔", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:17:17", "owner": "kaprelote", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542423881026921, "text": "This millennial has no fucking clue what half of this is 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:09:57", "owner": "rage_with_gauge", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17938568571097674, "text": "I'm between Millennial and Gen Z", "created_at": "2025-12-01T02:52:28", "owner": "tshegothawalter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110680438609894, "text": "Mix of millenial And gen z", "created_at": "2025-12-01T02:49:00", "owner": "fantasyworld2422", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541191088001004, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T02:34:42", "owner": "evalencia13_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849228427603650, "text": "8=9 you suck your old", "created_at": "2025-12-01T02:33:59", "owner": "patoloco503", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087656905982260, "text": "I think I got dumber. I see what he's doing, I get the idea and applaud the effort....still think I got dumber. 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T02:32:18", "owner": "phoenix_journals", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156233197398432, "text": "Haha, when is Chad ever been alpha? It’s usually like in cha.a.a.a.ad", "created_at": "2025-12-01T02:31:47", "owner": "lesutoandtravel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065920700612032, "text": "So retard, retard, and more retard… got it 👍🏻", "created_at": "2025-12-01T02:20:07", "owner": "kaseypvkd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085694099050853, "text": "All of this to gen x is your fucking gay.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T02:08:32", "owner": "poser002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089591617761279, "text": "Lock in", "created_at": "2025-12-01T02:04:52", "owner": "mikayleewilsonbrand", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18395616700134036, "text": "I am GenZ but feel now like Mil (that’s not a bad thing I am happy about this)", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:58:13", "owner": "lovely.leilei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046977743456088, "text": "Gen X is just over here.  Ignored.  And happy about it.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:57:57", "owner": "judyfinn73", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930080935140567, "text": "I’m a millennial professor, teaching a bunch of GenZs, who now want to adopt GenAlpha slang. @bluefranklin1 thanks a ton 🤩", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:55:18", "owner": "theonlymandke", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18089551747756309, "text": "I literally have a mix of slang from every generation help", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:54:23", "owner": "xstuna._.draggyx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876970987356465, "text": "So I’m a mix of millennials and gen z", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:53:08", "owner": "re.nae_21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868008019483746, "text": "I won’t survive the next generations I’m a mix of millennial and boomers", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:40:21", "owner": "lryn_515", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897205906346955, "text": "What did I just witness HAHA my brain can’t", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:34:04", "owner": "lyndseygerbec", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978415155947228, "text": "Just pick the best from each generation", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:32:30", "owner": "bariatric_patrick", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092996716904626, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:31:43", "owner": "wuraspeaks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085411013078078, "text": "Turns out this is how I find out im a millennial", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:30:59", "owner": "mashed_newall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060596342250021, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:29:34", "owner": "sara_sayless", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397375315126943, "text": "I understand it now", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:24:30", "owner": "rayo.kms", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903045847305921, "text": "420", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:23:47", "owner": "r3d_shlft", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100288285704597, "text": "I don’t think you’ve actually met a millennial because I have never heard half those things come out of a millennial’s mouth 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:21:30", "owner": "fallingisjustlikeflying", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18412614523143257, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:14:26", "owner": "rdicaro", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18063068021631276, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:06:24", "owner": "blueasfuckk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080259695124455, "text": "I was born in ‘06 but I only remember the millennial one, especially creepypasta lolll", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:05:18", "owner": "stxrrysxmi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086908873988428, "text": "Huh", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:03:21", "owner": "swarada414", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085810523012862, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:53:34", "owner": "schildhauerryan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880987864424989, "text": "Need to save this video", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:42:39", "owner": "zejiaolyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051912746361302, "text": "OD is Not Gen Alpha", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:32:22", "owner": "lore_trends1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18409781143140447, "text": "Whyyyyyyy🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:30:56", "owner": "melodic_tea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089466422313962, "text": "The millenians are trying to make cheugy a thing again", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:29:40", "owner": "garf_lvr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932284978133395, "text": "Creepy pasta? That’s a new one 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:28:51", "owner": "haffye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959837500007556, "text": "So my high school students aren’t even using the new alpha gen slang correctly, and they’re Gen Z technically and so am I. Good to know", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:27:19", "owner": "ddambrosio_9915", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18551927125012400, "text": "why did this actually help", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:17:03", "owner": "britny.cloud", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083258792015327, "text": "I use all these!  Im stuck in all 3 gens.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:12:28", "owner": "thenoodlesgod", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18424184980115336, "text": "Millennial was very off", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:10:50", "owner": "budhalovesbooty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079991822154045, "text": "At some point you stop being in the circle.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:09:11", "owner": "footandme11", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18204566797316287, "text": "Rip public english literature", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:06:41", "owner": "ahmadzeidan96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087014218812177, "text": "What is fanum tax / fry tax??", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:50:07", "owner": "jimmy_n.n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983901117763826, "text": "This is like.learning a new language.. taking notes to try and communicate", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:44:11", "owner": "samueladda_gamedesigner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057548738297821, "text": "Wtf dog water is not recent 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:39:44", "owner": "c3rtified_dumbshiz69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930172234016595, "text": "Watching as Gen Z, just about keeping up with Milennial & not knowing Gen Z 😅", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:33:06", "owner": "diezmck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868382542414316, "text": "I'm mil or gen Z", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:28:46", "owner": "mrivd10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114958669573866, "text": "Atleast 21 is funny the alpha sh1t is so dumb lmao", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:27:58", "owner": "jose_sanchez1438", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892738453369210, "text": "Why alpha stealing unc? That's a culture thing", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:25:07", "owner": "nw112021", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905551963290778, "text": "Wth", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:25:01", "owner": "theneneshow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877035277356859, "text": "You looked some of these up bc no we didn’t say that lol", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:15:42", "owner": "yoogirllbree", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067053035529952, "text": "How you miss on every generation", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:12:33", "owner": "elisile", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946029658091285, "text": "What in verbose nonsense is this", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:05:05", "owner": "art_by_ms.oni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071694446348709, "text": "Dog water gets a pass", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:03:14", "owner": "lol.sup.g60", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542175790054768, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:01:58", "owner": "_millpickle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541927966036435, "text": "all the above so i can speak to everyone and understand since nowadays everybody be speaking in code 🤦🏾‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-11-30T22:58:32", "owner": "samthespunjah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135835510422821, "text": "Gen Z wins this sorry, except Old Head", "created_at": "2025-11-30T22:46:21", "owner": "isapereztv", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17862636600537480, "text": "Fries in bag is not lock in at all.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T22:33:11", "owner": "thosewhostay_11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133323646482836, "text": "I think the Ohio Backrooms Creepypasta one is a bit of a stretch, but the rest are spot on.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T22:30:42", "owner": "kiwicola.toma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079328831133333, "text": "Why is half of millennial ones just gen z slang", "created_at": "2025-11-30T22:23:24", "owner": "itsnixiph", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954027958042413, "text": "As a millennial I don’t resonate with those words", "created_at": "2025-11-30T22:22:46", "owner": "harrietlam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887683573401138, "text": "Wait can you make one that includes gen X so I can explain what this shit means to my mom", "created_at": "2025-11-30T22:12:59", "owner": "wacky.slaughter", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18099368836766723, "text": "Baby words all grown up.....", "created_at": "2025-11-30T22:09:00", "owner": "yodaddy_77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986874567866389, "text": "Can you elaborate on the 21? As a GenZ I have no idea are you talking about. 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-30T22:07:37", "owner": "sa._.kam99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994357887718659, "text": "I think someone broke in to an Ebonics Dictionary,  and just started fuckin around ...", "created_at": "2025-11-30T22:07:25", "owner": "0cap3ll0_senpai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101849161663971, "text": "If mog is a flex, what's pog/pogchamp?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T21:55:52", "owner": "kali_kliam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981120357776923, "text": "I use random shid from each generation😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T21:53:16", "owner": "novice_ministrel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062163446208122, "text": "Is this really what my generation says? 🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-30T21:49:51", "owner": "jstarchicago", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077853556959285, "text": "@etymologynerd", "created_at": "2025-11-30T21:47:10", "owner": "maigloeckchenxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847037896594482, "text": "So I’m genz that grew up like a millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-30T21:43:53", "owner": "infaimous_v3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111202567607529, "text": "How am I mixture of all three ? 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-30T21:38:04", "owner": "yummiest_omelette_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080804102164146, "text": "Get a job", "created_at": "2025-11-30T21:31:32", "owner": "ishrsaint", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113727442585153, "text": "i thought 6-7 would he our 1738", "created_at": "2025-11-30T21:27:00", "owner": "ewwitzluis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090048085940784, "text": "I’m gen z and what is 21?? Have no clue!", "created_at": "2025-11-30T21:23:25", "owner": "imnot.interestedbut_i", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926687467170906, "text": "As a millennial why did you give gen z some of our slang", "created_at": "2025-11-30T21:21:44", "owner": "rtyui122", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855388603526986, "text": "Millennials don’t say those things..", "created_at": "2025-11-30T21:11:46", "owner": "ashley.j.3000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890432986374928, "text": "Gen Z with Millennial vocabulary 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T21:07:34", "owner": "xploringdinsredearth", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18146079844436683, "text": "Bro wtf is the faggot vocabulary", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:58:24", "owner": "lemalcriao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078058286242129, "text": "Never knew that is what 6 7 meant...sheish", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:45:45", "owner": "lilith.moon.bru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015625436630061, "text": "Okay so I'm a technical gen z with an older sister millennial so I feel like this isn't fair. 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:39:10", "owner": "c0smic._.dream", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072839204210509, "text": "Dude bro?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:37:11", "owner": "gabrielle.li.navarro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945694789065049, "text": "What the helly is creepy pasta", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:36:47", "owner": "gabrielle.li.navarro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138854827417073, "text": "People don’t call me unc yet which is good. Well it’s because I look like I’m 16 & I’m 21 but idk 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:36:25", "owner": "maxwoodsevans", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042405671497396, "text": "69? I don’t know about that, I think it’s more… “what’s funnier than 24?25”", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:36:14", "owner": "gabrielle.li.navarro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080825954146775, "text": "Gag", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:35:03", "owner": "5w3.q", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030280421550218, "text": "I say trash!!", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:28:42", "owner": "jaymichaelmartinjr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18420526513119608, "text": "As gen z thank you for your i be confused when little kids talk Lol", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:22:47", "owner": "yah_homie_tray", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075894197262597, "text": "WTF IS 21? I'm Gen Z...", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:20:54", "owner": "aeolus_in_the_wild", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117809488490052, "text": "Brutal…", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:20:02", "owner": "thearmorer01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064020260409658, "text": "I'm Gen z with mix of Gen z and millennial. I'm an only child while my cousins are Millennials.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:15:28", "owner": "mikeythewarrior__mtw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995014608850389, "text": "69 at least has meaning 😅", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:11:00", "owner": "hawkeye13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856610101565765, "text": "This is actually pretty informative. Gen Alpha means the same things we do they just have dumber names for it", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:07:19", "owner": "son_of_boio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910143907257434, "text": "Jesus flying fuck! Thank you for the damn translation I needed this 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:03:26", "owner": "dilan.normandia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059970119260644, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T19:59:39", "owner": "evyukr", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18165044521390713, "text": "This is helpful ahead of the holiday seasons and hanging out with alpha cousins 😅", "created_at": "2025-11-30T19:50:14", "owner": "_ines.li_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931185388117686, "text": "Dog water is aquafina 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T19:47:34", "owner": "country_luvin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090628841503630, "text": "Anyone else feel this is a bit inaccurate?😂 (late Gen Z)", "created_at": "2025-11-30T19:47:04", "owner": "5hekinahjoy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18004925054672349, "text": "@codyko @twohotpeople", "created_at": "2025-11-30T19:44:14", "owner": "__summaiyah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868650748481969, "text": "how does ohio correlate to creepy pasta and not swag?!😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T19:36:56", "owner": "ms.abag", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17878442370437130, "text": "This is one of the most informative videos I’ve seen about this. I learned so much. I also feel “old” 😬🫣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T19:33:23", "owner": "sisivariety_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941748643089816, "text": "Eliminate Ebonics", "created_at": "2025-11-30T19:31:01", "owner": "letsgohakuuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916367317232595, "text": "To my fellow people born in 97-02 we are the culture", "created_at": "2025-11-30T19:30:41", "owner": "_yinmn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962267343864405, "text": "Am I old omg", "created_at": "2025-11-30T19:30:21", "owner": "jehloni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051587372341073, "text": "SYBAU?? did you sneeze wtf is that??", "created_at": "2025-11-30T19:18:59", "owner": "madie_lambert", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541822039050369, "text": "They just be inventing random phrases and words, then give them a definition that doesn’t correlate with the phrase or word. WHAT IN THE FUCK IS A SKIBIDI AND HOW TF DOES IT MEAN CHAOTIC", "created_at": "2025-11-30T19:08:44", "owner": "luc1f3rrrrrrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918505942211575, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T19:00:45", "owner": "alyssaaarias", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979688211931310, "text": "....is this PANO? from Youtube?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:51:58", "owner": "this.torn.prince", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18394591585193538, "text": "My Netflix, Disney+ and Amazon Prime PIN password is \"6969\".", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:48:38", "owner": "naz.arjuna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069700706459899, "text": "Never as a millennial have I said \"creepy pasta\" 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:48:12", "owner": "nicolechristine761", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066402089145785, "text": "I'm saving this as a guide", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:46:16", "owner": "notshadydetective", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076810976264478, "text": "Dudebro", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:46:03", "owner": "themanontherock", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296779792277686, "text": "i’m a gen z and wtf is 21? we also grew up w creepy pasta so", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:44:58", "owner": "jaepiphany", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067799036384967, "text": "What's 21?😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:41:48", "owner": "zoo_top_ia_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884559397419867, "text": "Learning english has never been tougher then now", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:40:14", "owner": "asad_tour_guide", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089189032769477, "text": "I’m Gen Z and I do a mix of these 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:30:34", "owner": "gymnasticsandjesus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18370366054081423, "text": "💀 I never heard of SYBAU", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:27:30", "owner": "pyro_1997", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088337677968987, "text": "This was gay", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:11:13", "owner": "jdummydetrick", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083896214017180, "text": "Im a mix of z and millennial with using these words", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:08:36", "owner": "karmazb1sh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293323522263055, "text": "So Gen Z slang is just copy paste AAVE...", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:04:33", "owner": "mayonnaisepatty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988046322909149, "text": "The f*ck is \"41\"????", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:58:29", "owner": "themepark_creature", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080307608124875, "text": "Based on this lingo, we will all be speaking in acronyms in no time- no!", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:54:48", "owner": "allie.duch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953616481018680, "text": "I have an alpha kid and he said most of this is incorrect. 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:49:21", "owner": "toritheangel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087590311971366, "text": "What generation am I if I say none of these?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:45:03", "owner": "itsmatkai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544100260009296, "text": "learning the vocabs for IELTS band 9 be like", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:38:50", "owner": "auckyrh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086927887817457, "text": "THANK. YOU. I’ve been so afraid to ask🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:38:15", "owner": "amy_m394", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971986692974498, "text": "Alpha slang makes me wonder if I’m having a stroke or aneurysm", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:32:45", "owner": "little.jazzie_jaz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085823903000666, "text": "I don’t think this fruitcake has ever met a millennial irl because I’ve never said or heard 90% of these.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:31:03", "owner": "brandonbarracuda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868354375413467, "text": "Put the fries in the bag is not lock in lol. Put the fries in the bag is “stick to your day job”", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:25:18", "owner": "editsbymarcel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085305002013539, "text": "Guess I'm Gen Zillenial", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:08:32", "owner": "infinitynerd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087969124983177, "text": "All of those words came up in the last two years.. so before it was 20 years only mil? Gen z was the shortest generation.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:05:30", "owner": "kalifornia_kobra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865660993439864, "text": "Gosh darn it! Thank you", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:53:36", "owner": "volosthebear", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865689073437792, "text": "This proves that alot of Gen Z language was derived from Black millenial communities. Cause we did not use half of those millenial words.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:52:50", "owner": "damedahall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970562634969495, "text": "What is fry tax", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:52:34", "owner": "messy.bedroom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933495976133324, "text": "Stop 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:51:37", "owner": "damedahall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547153228038460, "text": "Alpha ate with aura and quarter zip boys 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:30:39", "owner": "nadalineeee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865775554433596, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂 got a mini stroke tryna understand this", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:29:45", "owner": "nadalineeee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084458323848952, "text": "I appreciate this", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:28:41", "owner": "steakbag_senior", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18432530047106627, "text": "This shit is wrong", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:25:14", "owner": "zacharibinx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065275472388800, "text": "As a Millenial I never remember using old head lol", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:25:02", "owner": "afazal1231", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075946727253933, "text": "I need this put into excel, printed out and laminated", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:23:52", "owner": "cukies22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079614554135198, "text": "As a 29 year old with a 21 year old and 13 year old brother this helped me so much😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:23:29", "owner": "lynn96.23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028910255569849, "text": "This video confirmed Im a zillenial cause I only understand half of each millenial and genz terms 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:17:00", "owner": "diss.ass.oh.so.she.ated", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096306991837033, "text": "wtf is 41", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:11:24", "owner": "kbink___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919998130200096, "text": "Add Gen X", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:09:40", "owner": "kimmiemaru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868306099413787, "text": "WHAT IS 41 THERES A NEW ONE NO", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:58:25", "owner": "12thedobie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109399768543832, "text": "Gen Z understand lol 😅 Never knew Mil was that hard", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:55:43", "owner": "1simply_tan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18323580883171249, "text": "Can sometime make this into an excel sheet and send me the link", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:52:48", "owner": "chloe.p.anderson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110568901610561, "text": "Today I realized that I’m in between gen Z and mil", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:44:56", "owner": "thog.ong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088470943950095, "text": "I’m happy u explained the 6 7 bc I was like we never said weird numbers growing up….. whole time my whole school was constantly like “21”", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:41:48", "owner": "annointed_4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367778524095441, "text": "I’m not sure I’m any of these.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:41:33", "owner": "curlyfries1158", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542194762041502, "text": "God I’m old", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:31:49", "owner": "lydia_val7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031215968735393, "text": "Born in 2000, but I COMPLETELY relate to millennial slang", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:28:20", "owner": "dalacul00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083514572080829, "text": "wtf is 41", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:23:45", "owner": "trasie_lynn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919803970199027, "text": "Jajajaja 😝 bru is a geographical thing lol u been liked in yo room too long…. Making these videos go out to the street bru bruh lol 🤣 @bluefranklin1", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:10:46", "owner": "p.a.p707", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878415859431691, "text": "I remember you from YouTube", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:05:08", "owner": "rahuanch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867881773487848, "text": "I’m so glad I’m a mix of gen z and millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:54:13", "owner": "jourdywest", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121020505533507, "text": "Gen Z made dog water actually", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:51:51", "owner": "kushotachi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104958769640887, "text": "Wtf is 21?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:44:16", "owner": "j_hoce", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305084419266745, "text": "WTF DID OHIO DO NOW,? 😂 DAM", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:37:06", "owner": "9pairs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097772632838508, "text": "I thought the GenZ's \"Clout\" part was \"Social Creds\"", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:31:51", "owner": "kuyachr1stian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844186321622570, "text": "I’m so pissed how helpful this was lmao", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:30:05", "owner": "n0t_the_on3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068040602104896, "text": "Tf is 41?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:27:30", "owner": "motionmanchik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114058111583596, "text": "67 means 69??? 😅", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:17:22", "owner": "thesarahlynnette", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099044482693631, "text": "This was actually kinda helpful and informative haha", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:16:15", "owner": "sandelion25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147576754382348, "text": "Talking about that BDE", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:12:10", "owner": "brotha_crane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095378641873005, "text": "Who came up with the millennial lingo?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:02:23", "owner": "themodellawyer_426", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091002521497720, "text": "I’m too old for this shit", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:00:53", "owner": "cia.bianca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945848419064908, "text": "I'm GenX,  all of it sounds weird to me", "created_at": "2025-11-30T13:39:35", "owner": "giovanni_ljs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103893037655122, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T13:35:55", "owner": "taylop7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868538575495763, "text": "A lot of the Gen Z and Alpha slang from this video I hear mostly younger people say while people around my age in my circles say mostly the Mil stuff... We're all officially Gen Z (actually Zillenials)", "created_at": "2025-11-30T13:27:05", "owner": "rakki.officially", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083309210034531, "text": "I needed this", "created_at": "2025-11-30T13:26:15", "owner": "kimmieketchup", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18192713182336847, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:57:01", "owner": "jojo._.sixx7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932552644112375, "text": "Tho im gen alpha, i barely even heard any of these \"gen alpha\" sayings, im more in millennial somehow", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:56:32", "owner": "aesprya_tong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972322644960996, "text": "I forgot about 21", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:25:42", "owner": "return_of_thematt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854288368580036, "text": "what", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:23:31", "owner": "samm.mc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135831331478407, "text": "As you look at it you can see it gets more retarded by generation😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:23:22", "owner": "zingoooooo1234", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103986748588088, "text": "U r so wrong about the millennials words", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:23:10", "owner": "left_eris88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160024048400696, "text": "Lots of Alpha slang seems to refers to gaming I’ve noticed.☺️", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:11:49", "owner": "claudiafashionfg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076346606222169, "text": "Tf is this bullsht 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:10:58", "owner": "d.malina_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070622783340853, "text": "I’m still never going to understand any of this shit…", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:03:51", "owner": "static._.wagon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123070657523181, "text": "Me genZ using all the Millennial slang 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:02:22", "owner": "weixuan1969", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18409369540185254, "text": "67 does NOT mean 69, not even close wtf lol", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:44:45", "owner": "advah_kdvara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046147469476944, "text": "GenZ uses a mix of all tho💀", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:23:37", "owner": "womp.womp_1012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086427964969611, "text": "I'm def. A gen Z but still familliar with millenial language from my early childhood. Gen Alpha is just a whole new world😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T10:50:45", "owner": "jildauduinkerken", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074799812225356, "text": "This was a very helpful translation guide", "created_at": "2025-11-30T10:48:25", "owner": "river_162", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097780075861858, "text": "Hella ain’t millennial it’s just Bay Area slang", "created_at": "2025-11-30T10:29:59", "owner": "100k.wrld", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095734597886961, "text": "69 is 69!", "created_at": "2025-11-30T10:20:09", "owner": "surasilver6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18551375347042399, "text": "Uh, cheugy was a word made in the 2010s, don’t get it twisted", "created_at": "2025-11-30T10:18:07", "owner": "vivian_augustusss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058480301637391, "text": "This is actually helpful and a reminder that every generation sounds ridiculous to the generations before them so we should probably stop complaining about gen alpha", "created_at": "2025-11-30T10:13:29", "owner": "ventus_91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18421023871116059, "text": "just got a headache, bt i get it now😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T09:57:39", "owner": "shaybhabi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183494449345218, "text": "Wait, what's 41 ??? 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T09:34:47", "owner": "damian.visuals", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085473065490506, "text": "It all makes sense now", "created_at": "2025-11-30T09:32:09", "owner": "silversurfer077", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916397224218675, "text": "were u on npr??😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T09:10:15", "owner": "cavephoriic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947527875935605, "text": "I share Millennial and gen z vocabulary", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:54:39", "owner": "leahkey2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879863653333118, "text": "@aakankshakhadka I think we speak Gen Z mostly", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:53:31", "owner": "tangsangsubba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184797265355151, "text": "No, just put the fries in the bag is \"aight bro log off\"", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:51:11", "owner": "jackson.charlton_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049613663391012, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:43:54", "owner": "cecilysaurus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18263882869305236, "text": "I… is I … is Le Me", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:40:44", "owner": "xhrmn_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000278837836943, "text": "I learned a lot here. And sent this to every teacher I know.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:29:13", "owner": "allthatdazzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847662205610870, "text": "Random vibe dudebro", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:27:12", "owner": "missy_mjx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079175164933562, "text": "This was very helpful 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:25:04", "owner": "ilikeyobootaybutimnotgay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101257876686211, "text": "If ohio is backrooms, then what's Florida", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:22:20", "owner": "liana70078", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103522984663725, "text": "I would like to argue that \"chat\" is also Gen Z...", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:20:13", "owner": "_atra._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052591277352172, "text": "I’m already dead confused with this 💀😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:19:15", "owner": "genvid0824", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853457905585296, "text": "….have I been using back rooms wrong this whole time (🤭🤭🤭)", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:09:45", "owner": "witchbitch0807", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18517199446066350, "text": "So I’m gen z but relate more to malenial", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:46:31", "owner": "eri.36987", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184931557344946, "text": "Im a mix of all of these at 32 lol", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:44:14", "owner": "lustremutt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17961769877865856, "text": "Umm, I think you need to do some better investigation on your millennial lingo. B/c wtf? I've never heard nor said half of those.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:44:03", "owner": "tiffdk89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072040574069657, "text": "this made everything make so much more sense now wow thank u", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:40:56", "owner": "elizabethacoleman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025123319779300, "text": "I have never heard of any of these millennial slangs.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:32:37", "owner": "bigbardathepigdog", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295114825279128, "text": "Umm, respectfully, wtf?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:23:55", "owner": "liblovinglife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966500862994431, "text": "I’m a Gen Z only using millennials vocabulary, while the number one…I don’t understand any of them… 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:08:05", "owner": "transitvisionsglobal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093272893903328, "text": "Damn this was a good one to one but I just lost like 4 brain cells", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:59:34", "owner": "___dderekkk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049457060418827, "text": "Huh", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:57:45", "owner": "lyssa.marie.92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991595634857266, "text": "I flirt between Gen-z and Millennial slang. Alpha slang is just brain rot", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:49:56", "owner": "ariellelovespink", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081429230114089, "text": "I thought “mog” was like, a facial expression thing? Am i mixing it up with “mug?”", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:26:32", "owner": "bookwormreilly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059878766258481, "text": "I’m kind of honored that Gen X is too old to be included in these things anymore lol", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:18:39", "owner": "a_w0ww", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987382266748678, "text": "And it all makes sense now!", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:06:06", "owner": "atayvay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088617178940707, "text": "So alpha is retarded?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:05:22", "owner": "the_icywitch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063727841447350, "text": "Lmao apparently I'm dudebro", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:02:46", "owner": "chadwix_ramdieramramsay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016990691623846, "text": "This explains so much thank you", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:58:07", "owner": "rascal_ghastly713", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847093102612798, "text": "OH MY GOD. THANK YOU.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:50:25", "owner": "twatfle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113511688599754, "text": "I don’t get any of this and I’m a gen Z", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:48:43", "owner": "sophia_nordin_22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061367927215336, "text": "I’m like 60% Gen Z, 30% millennial, and 10% alpha", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:45:40", "owner": "mistyswirl2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092995291723882, "text": "I appreciate", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:40:53", "owner": "schpears", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851540350595191, "text": "Oke I know where 67 came, but we're 41 came into the picture? Hearing about 41 for the first time", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:38:42", "owner": "red_the_duke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132447709477403, "text": "THANK YOU FOR EXPLAINING. lol I feel like a boomer because I’m constantly confused by their lingo", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:36:38", "owner": "angelicavv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107938336714216, "text": "Wait am I a millennial I’m only 19 😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:32:38", "owner": "popcat4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921844240055519, "text": "wtf is creepy pasta", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:32:22", "owner": "queenlizbih.tx.edition", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087174206317865, "text": "I hate this. Viscerally.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:30:26", "owner": "katonime", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104323198633073, "text": "dog water is not Gen Alpha", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:29:51", "owner": "the_awesome_jacob", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161242465393360, "text": "This just changed my daily routine with my 7 year old and broke the 6/7 curseeeeeee THANK YOU!", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:16:55", "owner": "sephchaos666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066418517123983, "text": "Ive always called myself a zillenial since I was born in 2000 and relate more often to millenials than younger gen z", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:13:40", "owner": "ketagrammy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17948153027931523, "text": "Wait....fry tax??", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:08:23", "owner": "amanda.rose168", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862697128536933, "text": "I love you ! This is why I incorporated into my language also because I have a 10-year-old cause I get it", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:04:52", "owner": "vibing_withstephanie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036220748513616, "text": "67 is 1738 bc songs duh", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:59:41", "owner": "diamondgamesandathreefive", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154785487412329, "text": "This was what finally confirmed for me that im a gen z/mil cusp", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:58:22", "owner": "nastyasolovyevaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904764541292693, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:51:55", "owner": "fl0werh0und", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057253340640203, "text": "I had a 15 y/o call me unc when he found out I was 24. Literally kill me.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:49:25", "owner": "nina.torrise", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870559753470049, "text": "I want to watch an older person unfamiliar with all of this react to this video- or someone not as familiar with English", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:45:08", "owner": "visceral.vacancy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065642645149692, "text": "I use literally none of these", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:39:56", "owner": "steve_rohr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118719574489047, "text": "Who the fucks says 41. I’ve never heard of that", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:38:42", "owner": "by.a_monsters_hand", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066743696622056, "text": "Freddy who?!!", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:35:46", "owner": "lamontllier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321819883222162, "text": "You have 2 Gen Z groups in those lists. Just older and younger versions of the same generation.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:23:56", "owner": "mrpastorchris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930133603140065, "text": "As a 1999, I am half millennial half gen z. And thoroughly confused about gen alpha", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:22:14", "owner": "kylie.giel", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18113944450600958, "text": "Man appears on my reels and a flashback from 7 years ago with Andres came running back 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:12:50", "owner": "jerry_merch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109879963625391, "text": "Bro my brain cant remember a whole new generation of slang... i was born in 2000 but a majority of my personality is/was shaped by millennial... this video is helpful bc I've literally had no clue & context clues from Gen alpha dont actually give context all the time 😮‍💨 how am I supposed to remember this for daily use 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:12:35", "owner": "rhi.kae_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131021653494174, "text": "I'm a mix of millennial and Gen z", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:09:11", "owner": "ariharum.star", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909059395266710, "text": "Wait 6 7 means 69??", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:07:39", "owner": "___tiredandsleepy___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368614465082019, "text": "I hate this world", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:02:22", "owner": "illuminangles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115229626569408, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:55:58", "owner": "edmund_gsf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113598835590293, "text": "A non American would have a fuckin stroke 😅", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:46:24", "owner": "bettyonit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18339401947237138, "text": "As a millennial thay grew up in England.. idk half of \"ours\" lol 😆 🫣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:37:39", "owner": "huemanish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902328601324237, "text": "I thought I was a millennial but my vocab is Gen Z🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:33:07", "owner": "alyssap2011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172996381372402, "text": "I’m part of the Gen Z and millennial ven diagram", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:19:22", "owner": "skyblu____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947442858933858, "text": "dogwater is mil ngl", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:19:22", "owner": "dashxxiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930948664147599, "text": "What's the 21? I'm gen z, but i don't get it.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:14:56", "owner": "aubrey.aesohn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849330523603361, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:12:18", "owner": "yooalandro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093820099714053, "text": "I finally understand gen Alpha 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:06:11", "owner": "knowrowan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060612122249803, "text": "Finally, I understand the slang", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:04:22", "owner": "crystal.oflilith", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095083516874298, "text": "i recall being online for all three of these", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:53:51", "owner": "issacwaltz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067435913113880, "text": "OD is millennial wym😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:52:58", "owner": "prince_inspiration_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17897040048204714, "text": "It’s who the f u c k talks like this as a millennial #notoneword", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:43:02", "owner": "donnishaarmstrong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878119996432334, "text": "Creepy pasta? 🥴", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:42:35", "owner": "eatpraybrooklyn", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18064548722172678, "text": "Trust me I'm happy being a genz😭😭😭it's much more easier!", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:31:32", "owner": "accalia_thunder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987522180877232, "text": "Bro OD  just unloaded generational barriers. Its still lost in translation for parents 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:31:23", "owner": "amala_lalala4eva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18369410239082361, "text": "why do u have 3 b00b lights in a row like that tho...", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:19:46", "owner": "em_chenko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093384631912811, "text": "We never said boomer", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:14:32", "owner": "itztekk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109650391541820, "text": "This is dumb. We just called old people geezers", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:13:54", "owner": "itsthestars", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928017685156176, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:03:22", "owner": "sartorius_et_gracilis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960259549007883, "text": "Kinda fire", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:58:06", "owner": "4288clay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096503695888009, "text": "What the actual fk?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:53:26", "owner": "h0ney.b22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879598900427666, "text": "Dog water has been used for ever", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:48:08", "owner": "rodrigo3_7_12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085592060280813, "text": "Aye you kinda look like Justin Bieber", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:42:27", "owner": "eternalmakeshift", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896621596357222, "text": "Am I even Gen Z fr", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:42:06", "owner": "eternalmakeshift", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077473028233236, "text": "6/7 = 1738 in millenial and aura = swag in millenial", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:35:20", "owner": "thepurplespectre06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111784420595788, "text": "I just lost 🧠 cells watching this 💩", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:27:57", "owner": "petey_pete__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085790972488956, "text": "Thank you", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:24:22", "owner": "nyl3_podcast", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109860004552097, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:20:57", "owner": "dmjwdrums", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101903071708808, "text": "All of the millennial stuff was horse shit. Ive never heard anyone use these.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:18:37", "owner": "zombie_trash416", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097720690836208, "text": "Notice how the younger they get the more removed it becomes from the actual context/stupid it gets", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:16:38", "owner": "zack.ls_alt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884280865410303, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:13:16", "owner": "qkieunta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161329273395584, "text": "This is retarded.  Which is retarded,  retarded,  retarded", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:07:59", "owner": "archive_infamous", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874024747379037, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:03:58", "owner": "jday_ii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074845793220171, "text": "I feel like you're probably Canadian based off these", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:02:10", "owner": "r.lafavers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945744802071333, "text": "Ur wrong on all of these wut?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:01:29", "owner": "_chadteh_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085963954997418, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:00:37", "owner": "chamu.thenuja", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084051704031532, "text": "😂I DON'T KNOW ANY OF THIS KAK", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:59:43", "owner": "daixdr3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080391065139655, "text": "Wait...we aren't doing \"WTF\" anymore?😢", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:59:10", "owner": "chezquow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942412162084531, "text": "Oooooooohhhhh now I get it 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:57:25", "owner": "milos_world_bunny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071183549593077, "text": "chad predates alpha", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:52:01", "owner": "xpatgx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18192779065331892, "text": "Ctrl is Alt is Delete the whole generation", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:45:44", "owner": "kaprisuhn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18535843684052305, "text": "I am SO LOST. What is he trying?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:26:08", "owner": "silly.krul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120603622535028, "text": "I thought “dog water” was Gen Z", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:13:43", "owner": "_shrimpchip_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105635482730538, "text": "Mix of Gen z and millennial 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:12:14", "owner": "_insane_lil_neko_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18300425509257799, "text": "Thanks", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:45:24", "owner": "myohmyali", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062983943406156, "text": "Can tell this was made by a millenial", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:27:10", "owner": "pvmfee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353152993167749, "text": "Sole of these were backwards. Boomer is millenial word. Old head is gender z word", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:26:38", "owner": "pvmfee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069573719371899, "text": "I am half gen z half millennial 😅", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:23:23", "owner": "tahamc999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397755883130860, "text": "Wtf 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:04:44", "owner": "chemicaltoro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104961214658699, "text": "God I forgot about 21 💀 why did you have to remind me - still better than 67 tho", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:56:27", "owner": "kobirussellinsta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885283591283381, "text": "Early Gen Z so I be. Mix of both millennial and gen z.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:54:31", "owner": "jack.gru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159014071398349, "text": "Educational", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:52:17", "owner": "just.sam.healy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085541509839914, "text": "If ur gen z u likely get alpha because who tf you think is making the content??💀", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:50:58", "owner": "cosmichatmuse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071671025459862, "text": "Half of this ish is wrong", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:49:25", "owner": "keekee0128", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084584003024415, "text": "Alpha is speaking in The Sims 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:34:21", "owner": "stephanie_pavbon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067178534615021, "text": "OHIO IS NOT back rooms or CREEPY PASTA…. sincerely an on the cusp millennial /gen z", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:32:50", "owner": "thea_theoneandonly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18422791420116403, "text": "This made me wanna drink some bleach with a side of orange", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:21:20", "owner": "inkbuddist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18246041032288443, "text": "Why do i have all of them in my vocabulary", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:05:20", "owner": "ikykhii808", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921885487054248, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:04:41", "owner": "sonido_arkangel_uriel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087553507785674, "text": "@jacksfilms found your dictionary", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:04:34", "owner": "allan_rincon.23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094806142845916, "text": "This isn't even accurate to begin with lmao", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:59:55", "owner": "nicolaspierrelami", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921620200256329, "text": "What happens if you’re a 1997 baby and relate to both gen z and millennial?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:58:10", "owner": "chrimesstopper", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097980256636674, "text": "lock in and put the fries in the bag are different and should be switched anyways", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:30:12", "owner": "preztheartist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988524540745421, "text": "I feel like Gen Z and millennials or a mix of both and I vibe with it.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:24:07", "owner": "jz_moon24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072148520057597, "text": "Stfu", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:21:36", "owner": "kieranliau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18315108187247457, "text": "nigga you are so inaccurate it hurts", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:15:56", "owner": "rockycoronado6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002382257832273, "text": "What in the world is dougie?! I have neve heard anyone in my gen speak like this. This is more vine kid talk.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:12:08", "owner": "sparkrunner14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18389905813180285, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:09:17", "owner": "gameshowcraig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930400126156473, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:05:31", "owner": "_nick24t_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065741090147996, "text": "I get it", "created_at": "2025-11-29T20:55:04", "owner": "khallibra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950691988058263, "text": "I'm sure this is rage bait 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T20:53:10", "owner": "kylefate.mov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853715488581776, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T20:39:02", "owner": "jagoleingod", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959549220875800, "text": "I'm gen Z with millennial speech 😭😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T20:32:02", "owner": "masani_the_goddesss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105606739653767, "text": "what degree is this?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T20:23:08", "owner": "estrehemo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864563275522093, "text": "This is how I figured out that I’m a millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-29T20:20:31", "owner": "_shayner_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18415163434188081, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T20:16:23", "owner": "phoenixsglowstudio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071601071598954, "text": "Mix of Gen Z and Millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-29T20:15:55", "owner": "makiarizona", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861040453544106, "text": "Skibidi had been a thing since 2015 ngl 🤔. Back then it was \"Skibidi Joe\". \"Get skibidi Joed\" = \"Get shit on\" 🥲. This kid on Instagram wrote a whole poem about Skibidi that I saw in 2019 😆.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T20:13:52", "owner": "o_tiky_o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18181719052357249, "text": "Jesus christ. 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T20:12:48", "owner": "ttvdrumrolltony", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065113697174277, "text": "This, is dumb, I hate it.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T20:08:45", "owner": "step_in_faith", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134813608466392, "text": "I’m a mix of Gen Z with a little millennial on the side. But tbh, I don’t know most of these lol", "created_at": "2025-11-29T19:58:05", "owner": "fairytalefavesbookstagram", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058392227293238, "text": "Never been so glad to be a millennial 🥹✌🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-29T19:50:33", "owner": "ryankeano", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868426945481842, "text": "Im a mix of all", "created_at": "2025-11-29T19:20:39", "owner": "mister_tirtha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103882066661569, "text": "As a youth pastor, I wanna say this here is gold! Thank you! 😅", "created_at": "2025-11-29T19:15:57", "owner": "hectorejr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895420231359705, "text": "Thanks needed this", "created_at": "2025-11-29T19:09:02", "owner": "l3lackjesus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092532901918296, "text": "Omg omg I just got a fucking AD watching your video??? What is this! When did that happen", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:56:29", "owner": "im_barely_local_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082767476079053, "text": "Not my vocab being older than me. Thank god I sound more like a millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:55:43", "owner": "veil_of_ven0m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320495230171832, "text": "Dog water is not a gen Alfa saying 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:54:01", "owner": "_melmel1011_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084370979078476, "text": "this is not accurate", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:52:46", "owner": "uluvmartiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940457487965965, "text": "I feel like you get more embarrassed by the shit your own generation said... I was 12 saying some of this shit bruh, it hurts me. And I'm going to be saying that about myself again in 10 years time", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:41:33", "owner": "ladywhiterabit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096292813841060, "text": "Ummmm.... what kids are you talking to to get this information? I ask because you're wrong with some of these... as a millennial, you're super wrong with lots of these being affiliated with the newer slang... 6/7 is Nowhere near affiliated with 69.... you just making ish up?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:40:59", "owner": "melancholy_vonnie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068702849578081, "text": "Can the millennials please stop pretending gen z words are theirs", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:39:08", "owner": "jacob_forton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945180319082133, "text": "I’m annoyed. 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:37:55", "owner": "heir_jourdyn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876185041443715, "text": "OD? Like overdose?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:32:27", "owner": "amelia.b.defranco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079398421918739, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:23:03", "owner": "timjamesmah", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18099940258747358, "text": "wtf is 21", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:14:35", "owner": "on9shabi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973094064806758, "text": "What is 41??? I’ve only heard 67", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:10:15", "owner": "lydileft", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869341477473244, "text": "Bruh wtf is alpha this dumb don't even understand they're words . I'm gen Z", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:10:04", "owner": "sethbougoures2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863939395531845, "text": "I still don’t know what the fuck is going on in the millennia category … feels like most of that is regional! We never said any of that In SoCal! Maybe 69", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:08:15", "owner": "g1rlf1ghter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090024830489571, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:59:25", "owner": "smokintrash", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065420777618423, "text": "What the fuck is wrong with gen alpha and their slang lmao", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:56:53", "owner": "miguelrdzo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097274926839516, "text": "So Im sitting somewhere between Gen Z and Millennial 🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:56:43", "owner": "niteblazes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079227902333106, "text": "Im.. Just gonna stop trying to be hip with the kids this is too much 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:42:41", "owner": "misakiblossom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539745784013751, "text": "Half of these are wrong 🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:41:09", "owner": "seraphimvav", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084280064013818, "text": "Dude you did NOT know what you were talking about with Millennials, You gave Gen Z some of our shit and made us sound like Boomers. Stop Stealing Millennial Swag.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:37:12", "owner": "emilionairr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953021326046033, "text": "Gen z got it right", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:33:18", "owner": "connerjpink", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080884088320777, "text": "Gen alpha = the kids these days literally don’t make sense", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:31:28", "owner": "miajthom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085925453050985, "text": "This made me start looking for a sturdy rope, congrats", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:30:27", "owner": "richorsomething", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896697889351293, "text": "Can I get a Gen x translation. Still not getting it", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:29:55", "owner": "deckervit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301901389250576, "text": "Noooo… 67 is a cop code for homicide/murder.. good try tho.. keep clout chasing", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:23:14", "owner": "fittyshades_of_red", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049967759662500, "text": "I never heard of SYBAU but I love that i can immediately tell what it is", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:22:56", "owner": "koi.luna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080156621325188, "text": "Gen z but find myself talking like a millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:21:28", "owner": "mitsulogan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097169917838859, "text": "[Looks on in silent GenX😄]", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:19:26", "owner": "principal_clark", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066078299575673, "text": "Curved. Long hakve i notp heard that word. I guqsss i am unc status👴", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:10:30", "owner": "thirdacc_wazza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897252676203385, "text": "This was legitimately helpful", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:05:22", "owner": "pup_zef", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037435748709894, "text": "why would u start in the wrong order 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:03:18", "owner": "snatchedbydaddy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080970437113484, "text": "I heard dog water from people my age growing up, I’m gen Z js", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:59:13", "owner": "a.tree00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18162075460358213, "text": "And thats why I hate the new slang. Phrases instead of a word😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:56:33", "owner": "mellifluous_kato", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18205945744315928, "text": "Another painful watch", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:48:55", "owner": "korkkkk33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144323902450179, "text": "I was about to type \"bruh, wtf\" and became self-conscious. 😭💀", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:48:47", "owner": "alek_daniels", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139491487460270, "text": "You forgot Xillennial and Gen X. Radical → Cool → Yaass → Slay → Bussin", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:47:09", "owner": "nevetsenolam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172089400326682, "text": "Who the fuck says “just put the fries in the bag”", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:45:45", "owner": "morris.dagoat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086328055958501, "text": "Wow im so lost with the alpha generation", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:42:26", "owner": "xk.magic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184311388349449, "text": "Gen Z here… I’ve never heard alpha before this new generation. We used to say Chad all the time", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:39:02", "owner": "kelseyjadebacon", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18058023527637142, "text": "Can someone explain to me, as an individual caught between Gen Z and Millennial influences bc I was born 2000 on the dot- how is Ohio like Creepy Pasta? I actually loved creepy pasta as a young teen and am lost lmfao", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:36:45", "owner": "jordanmbfitness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119781820547831, "text": "These do not correlate I fear", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:36:17", "owner": "nikki_niddie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047047727453178, "text": "The fuck is 41?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:35:44", "owner": "d.rugz_s.i.t.t", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100620730702660, "text": "I been saying dogwater since mw1 and RuneScape wym", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:33:52", "owner": "vvnvwvnvv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18354222442166108, "text": "Super weird to have English as your second language and knowing all three versions lol. Because you keep passively learning the language 🤷‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:26:02", "owner": "_i.vanish_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104189191660954, "text": "Dude so 67 is a sex position?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:24:49", "owner": "mranubis280", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921775084193361, "text": "shit when millennials say WTF they mean “bruh”?????", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:22:25", "owner": "angelinatasada", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17853359199583481, "text": "These generation things keel changing the age 10 years ago I was a millennial and now im gen z 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:21:08", "owner": "_.nopls._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025639616584781, "text": "‘Just stop’ What generation is that?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:20:25", "owner": "synphill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18420306805117243, "text": "What the hell is creepy pasta???? Lol", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:15:49", "owner": "lil_ms_smile", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119143543557945, "text": "I’m sick of gen z having a claim on high key WE CREATED HIGH KEY (and hella)", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:06:45", "owner": "kdkelseydoolittle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18391034083177807, "text": "Gen Z and Millenial merge a lot lmao", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:01:53", "owner": "maxramirezflute", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933555235129071, "text": "FINALLY! Thank you!! As a millennial I was completely lost 😂 but now I am found 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:58:59", "owner": "bok_shabazz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18227720098306333, "text": "Why am i still watching this 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:56:06", "owner": "dinoranger94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855274201528701, "text": "420 is millennial 6-7", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:53:43", "owner": "magick_thoughts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18277080694304925, "text": "It's not 69 at all.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:53:19", "owner": "cupcakesnsparklz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947206009065832, "text": "Most of those gen Z isms, we millennials made up", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:47:36", "owner": "therealdudleynightshade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144219289452136, "text": "I was born in 97 with older siblings so I have a mix have millennial and Gen z vocabulary", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:45:55", "owner": "bengeez29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18292972969272364, "text": "So I’m Mil with a Gen Z Engine ?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:43:54", "owner": "soultakerx3_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989601690884089, "text": "thank you for translating actually", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:43:49", "owner": "haybailey02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945864600942869, "text": "Normal words > idioms > nonsense", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:42:03", "owner": "moriahkspence", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083630990103428, "text": "Fanum Tax is PC is fry tax", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:40:23", "owner": "k.b2chill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092984032722942, "text": "Dawg keep that smile to yourself.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:38:32", "owner": "youregrandparents", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099949702758857, "text": "I’m millennial and I didn’t say more than half of those", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:36:34", "owner": "aoutram4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065719934426880, "text": "Through this video I finally understand what skibidi Ohio toilet rizz means 🥹", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:35:33", "owner": "minabee.5902", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543045244049399, "text": "its not about generations its just how we communicate", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:33:13", "owner": "kittie.foxie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909520396123688, "text": "Creepy pasta? No.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:29:33", "owner": "narnian_lioness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546285193036785, "text": "I didn’t know I was a millennial lol cool.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:25:20", "owner": "joely.skinner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18537870802014833, "text": "Retarded language just stop", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:14:04", "owner": "kev_eli_inc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068902256097229, "text": "Creepy pasta is gen z", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:07:51", "owner": "sammy112100", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087408143476031, "text": "Lock in is out of place with \"just put the fries in the bag\" and \"wrap it up\"", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:05:43", "owner": "alice.moo.girl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096406378842284, "text": "Rosetta Stone", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:58:37", "owner": "navigrey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975510171956213, "text": "I feel less intelligent after watching this", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:53:12", "owner": "aaronkylelombard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084631640095293, "text": "Wtf?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:50:55", "owner": "yellowflashthehokage", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084959615009395, "text": "Hold up I’m lost", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:48:57", "owner": "yuciel0923", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321249193170352, "text": "I’m a Gen Z but DEFINITELY speak like a Millennial 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:48:21", "owner": "deadbass_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059787032248568, "text": "I didn't understand oldhead until I realized you were sanitizing the slur", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:42:49", "owner": "c_morris48", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870302824399319, "text": "Sybau bruh💔✌️", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:33:47", "owner": "azayda.joestar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929343601140150, "text": "I don’t know half of these from gen Z where was I", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:27:47", "owner": "mollylang38", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942825805082455, "text": "67 isn't 69. 67 is just some random shit and 69 is a sexual reference", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:13:58", "owner": "thefoxinwhite", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877214020440225, "text": "Thank you for this information, you have saved all my unwanted google time !! May god bless you!", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:08:33", "owner": "_ira.varghese_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17842811970625979, "text": "What’s 21? 9+10?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:02:09", "owner": "limsoup_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051171722665750, "text": "It's so dumb.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:01:08", "owner": "kayxclue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088603102784540, "text": "Is it weird that i know all of this even tho technically I am just genz", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:56:44", "owner": "mohammed_asim_27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135718201473560, "text": "67 is NOT the same at 69 💀 sign someone with gen alpha kids", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:56:26", "owner": "cynthia_mheck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118529137483782, "text": "Can you do them in Xennial? 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:50:50", "owner": "raysmckinnon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108600703623200, "text": "I think 67 is more 1738 (gen z) or 369 (millennial)", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:34:56", "owner": "whosannamay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076478699349710, "text": "I talk like the Xennial I am, a mix of Gen X and Millennial!", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:06:28", "owner": "kristi22001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073718507261685, "text": "Half the millennial I haven’t heard.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:56:52", "owner": "sarflower", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104683864725220, "text": "Wait what the fuck is 41 now?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:50:13", "owner": "koto_sonofanders", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087305575977571, "text": "Whoa whoa whoa sir dog water has been a term used across generations 😅", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:44:00", "owner": "nate_clorasin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856324075566711, "text": "Its official kids today are brain dead", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:39:36", "owner": "exzakly__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543192739011161, "text": "\"Target audience\" ahh comment section💔✌️", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:23:21", "owner": "danielhuntley69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083400647043652, "text": "Me a gen z: Am I secretly a millennial…?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:17:58", "owner": "mutated_mutts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067360931420425, "text": "Wtf is fry tax", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:15:52", "owner": "cattheminion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067269947123474, "text": "Nah, bro mixed up some of the vocab", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:11:31", "owner": "akum_the_one", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096493519856912, "text": "Nah I've said dog water since 2014 and I'm now 26 l.ao", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:07:47", "owner": "plague_doc_r_us", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965198541848303, "text": "How am I all of them", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:07:07", "owner": "xocrystalll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928447015154424, "text": "Okay am I am a millennial then 😅", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:50:43", "owner": "romydmusic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099929488692516, "text": "Sorry gen Z but 21 is gay", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:21:57", "owner": "ammar.alkraidi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086630986988397, "text": "I know 67 but what’s 41😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:08:15", "owner": "millyha11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078076504959366, "text": "I prefer the good ole shut the fuck up.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:46:56", "owner": "kiadude714", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070106576608146, "text": "Lock in is Millennial. It means to get focused & block out all the noise. Only man on the basketball court type s**t. @bluefranklin1", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:46:07", "owner": "trevorschiess32", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946179115062365, "text": "I use all (2006) 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:32:10", "owner": "keikinized", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075004385007537, "text": "Okay...I need a hand manual to deal with this. New dictionary needed ASAP. Pocket sized if possible. Tx💀", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:25:10", "owner": "small_bird_big_world", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031074710537733, "text": "Lmao mil slang all the way", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:01:57", "owner": "ladystarfoxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063585308449323, "text": "It's giving Rosetta Stone energy ngl", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:40:19", "owner": "stupidanimemes", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095986759870292, "text": "Ain't no way OD is alpha, I've been hearing that shit since the 2000 from New York mfs", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:39:33", "owner": "mechachoco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071598977591920, "text": "Wait a min idk any of these", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:36:32", "owner": "hues_of_beige", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867841462490157, "text": "Bro still got most of these wrong 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:27:52", "owner": "eastmadison4848", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098981209695253, "text": "Thank you. I feel geriatric lol", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:25:32", "owner": "ashwithapassion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076004039225146, "text": "i was raised on the early 2010's internet as a gen z kid so i also went through the cringe millenial random XD im not like other girls chicken nuggets minions phase fully so. might as well go into the retirement home rn", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:09:44", "owner": "coffee.frogger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974095419953720, "text": "Giving OD to Alpha is crazy I've been using it since I was 5", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:02:14", "owner": "hua_soles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865241848512050, "text": "The fuk? As a millennial, your Hella wrong af.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:59:32", "owner": "rosadogp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987698787747108, "text": "I’m three months older than my man, we’re both 28. But he’s Gen Alpha and I’m millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:58:25", "owner": "marta_mei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894482800224387, "text": "I’m young enough to know and understand Gen alpha slang, but old enough to know and understand millennial slang", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:46:18", "owner": "foggy_day07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867580045500308, "text": "As a millennial this video is too fast paced for me to keep up", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:41:29", "owner": "lisa_s675", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065172425620773, "text": "Mostly finding this funny because i am on the edge of both gen z and millennial so i switch between which one i use. And i teach gen alpha.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:27:19", "owner": "kathleen.taran", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936257599105907, "text": "Being a cusp baby and knowing all of them but gen alpha", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:24:26", "owner": "thelastoflexi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902814784326787, "text": "…This actually helped, thank you", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:10:01", "owner": "vivaldi579", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104875762733772, "text": "False", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:06:44", "owner": "dardenhext", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868248541416039, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:03:22", "owner": "adriezzyy2323", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891758950240179, "text": "Wish you started with MIL, because I’m so confused lmao", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:36:30", "owner": "xtumi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872290885462085, "text": "Gen Alpha’s already using SYBAU is craaaazy work 😮‍💨", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:23:37", "owner": "redturnado18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088188097946456, "text": "L take", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:23:14", "owner": "octave.ruben", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131607661495960, "text": "Giving you're done to millennial is CRIMINAL", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:18:54", "owner": "kaytestrophe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18273166456304118, "text": "Oh fuck yeah thank you.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:15:17", "owner": "soupstarsandsilence", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18194310544330898, "text": "I am an elder millennial and just came here to say dog water has been around way longer than Alphas have been alive. It may have been more regional but I heard it used when I was a kid.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:11:58", "owner": "e.m.fidler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18272721544304709, "text": "You’re wrong 😑 it’s not 69 it’s 24", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:11:42", "owner": "iforgotmyoldone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18419963995114720, "text": "Thanks for the translation 🤙🏾", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:57:42", "owner": "javi_l33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905699875145613, "text": "Wtf!? Lock in.... related to those 2 phrases??? I'm calling mad bullshit.  Nah!!", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:43:59", "owner": "primal_artworks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877744237438855, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:29:51", "owner": "hellajazzyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18336766663232188, "text": "This cannot be real.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:28:15", "owner": "dasein.lindsey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063582077407865, "text": "Can you do them in Xennial? 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:26:00", "owner": "raysmckinnon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18209877787312766, "text": "Can you do them in Xennial? 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:23:50", "owner": "raysmckinnon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004663418821463, "text": "finally. i can understand my cousins.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:22:03", "owner": "jdotcurtis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006573308810919, "text": "Some day a future archeologist or scientist from another world will unearth this video and spend spend the rest of their life trying to decipher it", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:10:56", "owner": "strawb.frog", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918792916072603, "text": "wtf is creepy pasta???", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:10:40", "owner": "aprilc3516", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088628684490596, "text": "i still don’t get 6 7, i thought it was like lame 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:56:30", "owner": "agosmedix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872441521463956, "text": "Millennials sound classy in comparison", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:42:12", "owner": "sal.93_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18210004903312286, "text": "thank u", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:41:10", "owner": "carehoule", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051694634356012, "text": "u know it’s weird when u stuck between gen z and millennials lingo", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:38:07", "owner": "wellmetindreamss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030035624759886, "text": "Who else had to pause every time the millennial translation came on to let it sink in? 🙈😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:27:33", "owner": "kierstenleah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902448784317165, "text": "Idk what millennials this dude is quoting. Either they’re not urban/African American or they’re from California. 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:25:23", "owner": "pharaohreignsesq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870800254467969, "text": "Ok so I use both genz and mil and none of alpha", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:18:02", "owner": "necrotic_artist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029742059752735, "text": "THANK YOU im so lost", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:16:06", "owner": "amandaaaxd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935597176106397, "text": "41???", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:15:30", "owner": "egap.syelda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18309433777251122, "text": "Bruh, not all are correct correspondence yo", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:10:23", "owner": "sylthfern", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082107335037929, "text": "So I'm a millennial that speaks gen Z with an alpha child.. what am I doing here? Because I get it and then I don't.. but I do..😭😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:01:16", "owner": "brooksnukcpb", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17987715065747309, "text": "Oh my goodness I didn’t know I needed this breakdown. Thank you so much.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:49:40", "owner": "mlalatimer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171859885327794, "text": "Mill is wrong bro", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:46:51", "owner": "dn_rock_g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076808299977431, "text": "I'm 42. I've never heard anyone in my Gen say \"old head\" literally ever.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:42:59", "owner": "clairek177y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18297840646284248, "text": "I’m generally a mix of Z/Mil but there were times I didn’t understand a single thing you said. Can we please go back to real actual English 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:36:45", "owner": "wirtzsophia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882064957422571, "text": "This is how I know I'm only accidentally a millennial bc I did not know a single one of them.  I am, but all intents and purposes,  and Gen X", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:32:16", "owner": "peralta_me", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858978112556990, "text": "Sorry where's YOLO", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:20:20", "owner": "salahnotwrong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069096368083794, "text": "Thank you. As a teacher, I needed this translation", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:17:49", "owner": "yogi_art_teacher", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048266525422771, "text": "Back room???", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:10:20", "owner": "chloekav6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959321623002613, "text": "I’m a gen z and I still don’t know our slang 😔 wtf is literally anything ever", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:06:53", "owner": "_rover.over", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143331091451345, "text": "So as a Gen Z, I have a pretty mix vocabulary between Gen Z and Millennials. Which makes me think I am either on the older side of Gen Z or Gen Z and Millennials have a mutual hate of Gen Alpha.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:04:40", "owner": "immabeabltch", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078994595332559, "text": "Bless you", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:54:31", "owner": "jamardiggs", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047728913443976, "text": "So… I’m just existing I guess because wtf", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:49:00", "owner": "golden.gyal1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047419595443194, "text": "According to this i’m millennial with a sprinkle of Gen Z 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:46:40", "owner": "kelseybair", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079425269322951, "text": "thanks for the translation", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:43:48", "owner": "j_weinsteinsears", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913590043249215, "text": "Nightmare fuel!?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:36:06", "owner": "melanin.magic____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858227545500861, "text": "What’s creepy pasta !?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:35:42", "owner": "melanin.magic____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073824524263049, "text": "Wtf is a fry tax? Just put the fries in the bag huh", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:35:30", "owner": "melanin.magic____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879716671333918, "text": "I speak like someone who was talk real English in a classroom", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:30:27", "owner": "jr.rickiewoodson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914745976246335, "text": "Okay sure but 69 has an actual meaning, over-done like any of them yes but it's still an actual real thing.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:24:19", "owner": "jonwhite490", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18411072901186011, "text": "6-7 is NOT 69.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:19:36", "owner": "soyselene", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883465795410088, "text": "My head hurts", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:19:12", "owner": "jossi3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086777737819161, "text": "So I'm between Mil and Gen Z", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:18:24", "owner": "averageguybodyphysique", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184800550352421, "text": "Now do Toronto slang", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:16:52", "owner": "guccicraycray", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902640529310460, "text": "Ohio creepy pasta???", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:05:23", "owner": "bumbleb2320", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051583982343161, "text": "As a z lennial i needed this", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:01:16", "owner": "babyghost.xix", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18119559961477253, "text": "Tf is 41?!?! 🤦🏼‍♀️🤦🏼‍♀️🤦🏼‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:56:17", "owner": "itsthesarabeth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962044053857599, "text": "Idk wth 41 is and I think unc is gen z", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:54:30", "owner": "mylittlelanii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077875490183154, "text": "Am really stuck between both genz and mil...", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:46:05", "owner": "renaudlogic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087348647002399, "text": "What the helly is creepy pasta?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:33:39", "owner": "alishaslomers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113310904585823, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:33:29", "owner": "b_inspired____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18412998853141711, "text": "whats 21", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:32:49", "owner": "marshmallowrainbow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947975001931825, "text": "Send 2-3 years to Dagestan and forget about it .", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:31:58", "owner": "i_have_nolimitations", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964731060990907, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:31:36", "owner": "i_have_nolimitations", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100182433816446, "text": "Feel like theres a early gen z/late millennials sub generation  for a lot of those gen z/millennial stuff. Some of the younger gen z were busy getting their diapers changed when 21 was making its rounds", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:30:19", "owner": "drewgiannotta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898868092343898, "text": "All of it is stupid, idiotic, dumb 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:21:21", "owner": "kittykat5us", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073911893204258, "text": "Gen Z & Millennial slang can be together. Since i was born 2000 and use both of it.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:12:56", "owner": "brav0_art", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17936528721102058, "text": "all three but more gen z", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:59:20", "owner": "shikharsalgarkar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847973773608675, "text": "I’m sorry but where’d you get those millennial sayings? None of us talk like that", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:58:27", "owner": "missmira.xg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303973096251041, "text": "Clearly not a millenial", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:57:48", "owner": "digitalash0x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084789623044877, "text": "No bro", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:56:35", "owner": "arfranco106", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863092639454276, "text": "This was incredibly educational thank you", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:55:06", "owner": "mcmariee23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085973819003730, "text": "How old do you think millennials are 🧐", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:51:19", "owner": "lightsavings", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084433310277092, "text": "Millennial culture appropriation is crazy", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:50:17", "owner": "lightsavings", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18422042212119015, "text": "Da fuck is creepy pasta ? Iv never heard that one", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:43:13", "owner": "pfingstonjoey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997044474845566, "text": "\"Dudebro\" lmao stfu 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:40:16", "owner": "mikeollerandi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123966928518933, "text": "41?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:35:04", "owner": "reibands", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050272436398291, "text": "Wait cuz instead of telling my students to “lock in”, imma tell them to “just put the fries in the bag guys” 💀💀", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:34:27", "owner": "short.__.story.__.long", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064469735545522, "text": "Wth is alpha", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:23:02", "owner": "not_even_worried", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932284132116680, "text": "Im proficient in all 3 languages", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:19:38", "owner": "aldocarulli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965841702987619, "text": "I needed this", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:15:15", "owner": "salty.mcfries", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102840100678970, "text": "I know more millennial than my own generation", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:06:57", "owner": "thereapermans", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929786779119138, "text": "Dog water is from the 90s", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:04:25", "owner": "legopokemon77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044765516483623, "text": "I’m bleeding out in an alleyway", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:48:53", "owner": "wrappleby", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087746990488180, "text": "I hate that I needed to know what half this garbage meant", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:45:53", "owner": "v_ondabeat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980994180929673, "text": "1992, im somewhere in the middle between millennials and genz", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:33:02", "owner": "daniel_kitchka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959055750878032, "text": "Hold on wait a minute 💀🤣😭whattttttt", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:18:07", "owner": "aisha2_619", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193150663326613, "text": "and yall were mindblown by gen Z slang? wtf is this gen Alpha 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:16:41", "owner": "nelanutella5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045740600466707, "text": "“You guys” isn’t slang lol", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:15:39", "owner": "evane36", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103543642672016, "text": "Gen Z and millenials have a lot of cross gen slang.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:14:38", "owner": "pinupopinion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925564219178488, "text": "Some of these are VERY inaccurate", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:12:30", "owner": "georgestavropoulos24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353094256165343, "text": "41?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:12:16", "owner": "crossant.p", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986895687865529, "text": "oh my god...thank you", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:02:04", "owner": "kiffordstalismans", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032016956736894, "text": "My other Gen Zs born between ‘97-2000 only talk millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:00:19", "owner": "romangravy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932076682121097, "text": "Yeah I guess I'm an elder millennial bc never have I heard or used most of that nonsense", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:59:44", "owner": "frolflife87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18417562621113118, "text": "I am millennial going into gen Z", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:59:18", "owner": "janeta_15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930043249136040, "text": "I only understood some of this 😅", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:52:28", "owner": "bri_tunell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952546540022304, "text": "today i learned im gen z trapped in an elder millennial body 😩", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:51:16", "owner": "sass_lord", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061119128214732, "text": "Sdiybt", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:50:39", "owner": "bodeapple", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18010387766804350, "text": "Thank you I needed this", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:48:16", "owner": "zariah.brown", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119994469479120, "text": "This is actually making sense now!!! Thank you!!!❣️❣️❣️", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:44:20", "owner": "princess_zak_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903234475315317, "text": "Thanks I needed clarification on the whole 67 this", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:38:26", "owner": "musamansaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998118945697337, "text": "Wouldn't it actually be \"Noob\" and not crap for Millennials?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:37:00", "owner": "yo_lara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899275426340368, "text": "Lock in is not Gen Z", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:35:27", "owner": "subaanofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083857727043522, "text": "Freddy faxbearing? Lol", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:35:19", "owner": "pinkystar666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078257675517076, "text": "Anyone remember the teacher from Peanuts? Yeah… that’s all I’m hearing… for everything!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:31:49", "owner": "charbardubs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18535507738043178, "text": "The fuck is 21?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:30:48", "owner": "tankrides", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983074431767172, "text": "I kinda hate that im 50/50 Z and Mil.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:21:56", "owner": "scarlett._phoenix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049851794390119, "text": "Bro i grew up with both gen z and millennial.. Those slangs i get but alpha man just no...", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:21:28", "owner": "reggiexp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075049448247351, "text": "As an elder millennial wtf is old head? Never heard that 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:19:33", "owner": "seireness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912246661252721, "text": "NAH UH IN GEN Z AND DOGWATER IS OURS", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:17:38", "owner": "carmyhack", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972511401970021, "text": "Excuse me when did 41 become a thing", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:04:29", "owner": "andrewczazasty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18550976197004119, "text": "This was actually helpful thanks", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:00:58", "owner": "rachel_iona_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945469986944256, "text": "And just to make everyone sad... most of these terms came from world of warcraft players years before being adopted by the public", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:56:36", "owner": "bigforkinghobby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18417563095185124, "text": "And 99", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:55:54", "owner": "bigforkinghobby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084244328062865, "text": "Woo I'm definitely getting old cause I only knew like 5 of those Alpha ones lmaoooo", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:42:48", "owner": "t.e.a.l.j.o.y.m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843613075625067, "text": "Sounds like I’m listing to my Sims talk 😭😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:37:01", "owner": "mbsidibay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298629247274448, "text": "i lost braincells watching this", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:24:55", "owner": "issiekyriacou", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18156098386407235, "text": "I only understand when you say the millennial one", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:04:32", "owner": "cassymwheeler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396690610123576, "text": "I was born in '03 and it's a combination between gen z and millenial slang for me", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:00:46", "owner": "juulleis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165819448378383, "text": "This is the most helpful video I have seen this year 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:57:41", "owner": "clarkemadisonlives", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991416021897390, "text": "I only say sybau cause every game censors stfu", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:52:20", "owner": "jamie_whel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088881556765558, "text": "I'm been saying dog water since 2007", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:50:46", "owner": "cardo_valles22001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18346221664200080, "text": "69 was because of the sexual act… i dont see how the others relate to sex acts. Plz explain properly lol", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:48:21", "owner": "katatonikkat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852555145590519, "text": "6 7", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:48:07", "owner": "deerleetracks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095270821862461, "text": "I thouhgt unc meant uncool. Not “old uncle”", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:45:55", "owner": "cozey.fae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847407526587011, "text": "Ehh a lot of these seem incorrect. I mean what millennial is saying old head?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:40:04", "owner": "iamleegit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089587090949148, "text": "Your Caucasian terminology does not speak for a whole generation, sir", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:26:38", "owner": "squarebearshay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057969668302905, "text": "💀", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:22:38", "owner": "juwitaxiska", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18548073142047598, "text": "I’m broken I have a little of everything and still lost 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:17:08", "owner": "dvon2813", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963564169005986, "text": "67 is not 69 lol he’s Hella ignorant no one could really say what 67 is lol every little kid says I don’t  know ……it’s a song from a guy that does rituals and sacrifice little animals to worship the devil look it up.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:09:44", "owner": "im_worth_it23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087520991476267, "text": "Gen Alpha DID NOT COME UP WITH \"OD\"", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:08:02", "owner": "airya.r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087723098068184, "text": "NOONE is FKIN is CARES", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:52:42", "owner": "aryan_was_not_here", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950188906057639, "text": "When did we get the number 41 meme?!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:49:22", "owner": "jpferrer__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18166740142382114, "text": "What’s people need to remember is we made gen alpha slang and they just use it unironically at this point", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:49:15", "owner": "natku.animaku", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18395045068132381, "text": "I don’t understand anything I just heard 😅😭 just learned about 67 yesterday", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:43:51", "owner": "arthippie1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066801395139765, "text": "Wait why am I mostly millennial in this assessment 😭 (I’m gen-z)", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:40:42", "owner": "samuelhlab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936850545979681, "text": "13375p34k", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:39:55", "owner": "_elviei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094587982875758, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:32:39", "owner": "adam_alioua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879684274332337, "text": "I hate this. All of it. Every bit.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:28:27", "owner": "bkinnett11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18537662995054339, "text": "Thank you I needed this", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:14:34", "owner": "ameliathegreater100", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069522014082438, "text": "Wtf is fry tax?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:13:57", "owner": "the.tenacious.one", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864213478531026, "text": "Me is annoyed", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:12:08", "owner": "fatgezimb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054270674666135, "text": "From the opening I knew you were cooked.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:09:57", "owner": "komboujia", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18102110371599680, "text": "Yeah, that baseballs", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:06:37", "owner": "alice_hart927", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059736593550851, "text": "This feels like we are evolving backwards", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:01:51", "owner": "jelte_akker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082860650021860, "text": "Oh my goooooooood, thank you. I’m Gen Z and understand nothing from the alpha duds", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:00:32", "owner": "brndet._.k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933186226127357, "text": "Ooooooh", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:58:20", "owner": "emilyherald_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970145904966925, "text": "Where's the Zillenials at?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:52:00", "owner": "jollygreen546", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114415180601277, "text": "21 is late millenial", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:50:16", "owner": "benisthatyou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085004377838143, "text": "I’ve never said old head in my entire life…", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:49:48", "owner": "adriana__threet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129607099495379, "text": "Never heard of 41. Is it new?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:47:15", "owner": "poetaandrew", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894456898224841, "text": "21 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:45:56", "owner": "extraordinary.dork", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992561433899842, "text": "My brain hurts", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:45:27", "owner": "justme_nikip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18517176202067215, "text": "Why am I familiar with all three of them? 😔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:42:56", "owner": "itsrealshadow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911958949249705, "text": "I’ve been saying dog water since late 2000s 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:42:48", "owner": "breforthebre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113528170580252, "text": "Wait wait WAIT…67 is 69?!?!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:42:27", "owner": "nikhola", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068576165456494, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:38:16", "owner": "robs_chilling", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929427787167571, "text": "As a Zillennial I'm happy to see I am in fact a mix of Gen Z and Millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:36:05", "owner": "kromez7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156052273408847, "text": "Hold on, lemme get a pen", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:35:31", "owner": "iamstegosaurus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071572427344004, "text": "I use a little bit of alpha but alot from both gen z and mil", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:35:31", "owner": "_carlos_m_lopez_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051874394677763, "text": "Um… 41???", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:27:18", "owner": "violavibrational_by_kai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941382123961560, "text": "Bro gen z is slang is so similar to mil", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:26:42", "owner": "_ampl_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994045467707510, "text": "My brain hurts. 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:14:33", "owner": "asian780", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859899598551842, "text": "If you look up the terms they’re actually pretty straightforward. You just need background on them", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:11:14", "owner": "notparmajean", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991726797727906, "text": "I mix all of them", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:10:54", "owner": "shae.shae_889", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065504378148070, "text": "Dont forget “say no more” and “say less”", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:59:32", "owner": "task_master", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088132213991959, "text": "ZESTY ASS NIGGA 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:56:43", "owner": "riskyjones", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974168979949504, "text": "Thank you for this clarification", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:55:23", "owner": "somebody_call_the_pizza_guy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114207361509175, "text": "He not making no sense yall he def dnt know what he talking bout", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:48:19", "owner": "moneyinmymask", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18101296045743153, "text": "I can’t be the only one that is just learning what alpha slang means 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:46:43", "owner": "anacondaofdeath", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084178498852315, "text": "Cantonese 67 iykyk", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:41:57", "owner": "jonathanng9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116195734561063, "text": "I like this a lot. Cross generational understanding", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:38:22", "owner": "blaxicanmami92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845574424615804, "text": "......thank you for the explanation!.....alpha slang still makes absolutely no sense", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:36:18", "owner": "angle_asphlat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18422851927117319, "text": "As a millennial I can confidently say, I never heard or used many of the “millennial” equivalents", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:35:46", "owner": "salenakelly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992525403896506, "text": "Oh.... I talk like Z and mell", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:35:07", "owner": "12iloveblue", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18176764078369092, "text": "I'm a mil born in Gen z era", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:34:23", "owner": "nachoquattro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103689157708705, "text": "I love how Bruh is a wholeass mood", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:25:39", "owner": "snick_so", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082808921033281, "text": "Thank you. I’m gen z mixed with millennial 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:22:48", "owner": "katface_kat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092114404917295, "text": "Yo none of those are coherent expressions and I’ve been around to hear them . Retarded", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:21:40", "owner": "m.r.s__b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545214661012728, "text": "Waitttt wtf I don’t wanna be Gen Z  ughhhh", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:21:31", "owner": "its_rletto", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18083462078021855, "text": "Mostly gen x with a sprinkle of millennial, makes since since the younger sibs are all millennials. But this alpha lingo is wild. Thank god I homeschool my kids so they speak gen x too.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:16:04", "owner": "esperc3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079725184932509, "text": "Glazing definitely started in the millennial era", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:15:33", "owner": "vincentthevisionary", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18387067783177483, "text": "Sorry, millennial here we were definitely saying OD and high key back in middle school", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:14:20", "owner": "vincentthevisionary", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18513394210071603, "text": "Man, it all makes sense now", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:12:55", "owner": "deenosars", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088021616481357, "text": "I use both Millennial and Gen Z 😅 (Late 90s baby)", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:11:51", "owner": "tashxmarie_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049846208382949, "text": "Gen X here, this made my knee hurt.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:09:35", "owner": "thomrobigroup", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929749345016425, "text": "This is perfect no, I can understand my little sister. 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:07:17", "owner": "haitian.peach", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845143498604563, "text": "Can we bring back dudebro?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:06:57", "owner": "wstkorean", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914719231092600, "text": "Imagine if we used these brain cells to learn an actual second language. 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:06:50", "owner": "nick.ibarra.417", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18192867295335690, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:56:54", "owner": "moneymanweaver", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088355707949407, "text": "this is wrong i think", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:50:43", "owner": "deck.xx1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953322103021600, "text": "Ok but I’m “gen z”( gonna be 22) but I grew up with creepy pasta??😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:48:32", "owner": "ry.nolabelle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082446389023054, "text": "Dougie forever bih", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:47:53", "owner": "max__myles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074390723008570, "text": "Don't u DARE give FNAF to gen alpha that is a precious treasured item that belongs to us genz/millennial!!! They didn't even know abt the books😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:41:14", "owner": "jazma_taz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986119794872763, "text": "I'm a millennial and I never said 90% of that shit.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:37:53", "owner": "wild__sti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032790218722527, "text": "Mans teaching generational languages", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:37:25", "owner": "ayyymac_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989555334908991, "text": "Ngl 6 7 is mid. It’s just the numbers with no depth from a song.. at least 21 came from ‘what’s 9+10’, memes before had to have an iykiyk aspect before", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:33:37", "owner": "judevincentmolina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872099107466496, "text": "Slow down, I’m taking notes", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:32:15", "owner": "joiriide", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17947146851937457, "text": "6/7 is absolutely NOT 69 Jesus.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:31:07", "owner": "kelsey_sheets", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543220102057085, "text": "I guess I'm some weird mix of gen z and millennial because I use both of them", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:23:12", "owner": "mccarthy_cringe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080400632155566, "text": "I’m a millennial I’ve never heard half the stuff you say said we say", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:21:41", "owner": "tel_avzn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098346295833122, "text": "Why do you censor Hella? 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:13:55", "owner": "cyntessa666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18499598248074770, "text": "Half of the millennials' word choices… I was like Uhm.… idk about that one", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:01:40", "owner": "dashof_j", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924030481428668, "text": "I think I short circuit", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:00:28", "owner": "beefstuuuw", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17886485616401594, "text": "I'm so lost 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:00:12", "owner": "trash_bandit19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999852969836312, "text": "I thought I was doing good keeping caught up with GenZ slang, but now I’ve gotta use it like the Rosetta Stone.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:59:59", "owner": "headlesschevalier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029953724557720, "text": "Still have no idea what i just watched", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:57:42", "owner": "mattcanzano", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079629296276192, "text": "Guys just making shit up for other generations", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:52:26", "owner": "xjayfromthebayx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058888181279830, "text": "they did NOT invent dog water", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:51:09", "owner": "juli.escent", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864844096513752, "text": "Oh damn, I’m getting old", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:46:01", "owner": "kowskyfrancois", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061953515213326, "text": "Glad I was born in 91.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:45:25", "owner": "skarpentry17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084073583013542, "text": "Street cred is boomer no?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:43:27", "owner": "mwarren720", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18493305319072164, "text": "Extremely helpful", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:41:35", "owner": "shaydeliger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104765407729353, "text": "I love the exclusion of Xnials and Boomers :)", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:35:50", "owner": "skalsky7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983598306764808, "text": "Zillennial confirmation 😅", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:35:19", "owner": "queenpgray", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065943992415317, "text": "Z and Mil is more understandable", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:34:54", "owner": "witc.moth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113462962599819, "text": "Wow thanks u", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:30:52", "owner": "xviangelito", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020742776790158, "text": "We have to redefine Gen Z.. correct me if I'm wrong but Gen Z is like 1997 to 2012 right? But the difference between a 1998 and a 2010 for example is so huuuge that can't be right.. I'm Gen Z and apparently I use Millenial Slang..", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:27:14", "owner": "dom.dlt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085419986079983, "text": "Literally none of the millennial ones are actual millennial sayings 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:21:35", "owner": "alaynajoelle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134840230467950, "text": "This shit made me more disabled than I already am, thank you 🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:20:38", "owner": "just6hours", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18058233890290768, "text": "I’m a millennial and seem to have adopted some of the Gen Z slang. But some of the millennial slang I’ve never heard of. Maybe only for elder millennials?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:16:16", "owner": "jeanettegianna", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17911899267249267, "text": "Solidifying my Zillennial status 😩", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:11:20", "owner": "this.is.cortez", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18175185739371503, "text": "Finally... I understand", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:02:06", "owner": "lookingforlillian", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17943465813084246, "text": "Rosetta stone (🌹🗿)", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:42:50", "owner": "r0bservati0ns", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915853246230016, "text": "Sybau? Who says it that way??? It S.Y.B.A.U ….shut ya bitch ass up… and alpha gen z nor the milli came up with that.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:42:44", "owner": "tajhhutchins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936552589070157, "text": "Now I can talk with my nephews", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:31:20", "owner": "themexicanhokage", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135721375476825, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:30:39", "owner": "kaylareneez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850246165598439, "text": "Half of millennial and Genz is either so fucking wrong- or regular words in the dictionary that weren’t used for “slang”", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:24:35", "owner": "al.staples", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047176598445431, "text": "I don’t think I’ve heard based before", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:22:34", "owner": "glamginaaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112624534594280, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:20:49", "owner": "otterlyprime", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17962302752859011, "text": "Not to be a hater bro but this list SUCKS. I been saying unc since I was a kid… just cuz lil mfs saying it  now don’t mean it’s their word lol. Also, it doesn’t correlate to boomer. Boomer was disrespectful, unc has never been. That’s just one example.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:20:30", "owner": "lmbcoaco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18373325962153128, "text": "My head hurts", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:18:26", "owner": "_jmesct1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033853826718763, "text": "I just wanted to say this really helped me. A lot . And I was born in 1996😂😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:16:12", "owner": "daywalkeram", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873202117459645, "text": "I'm think you got some of them gen z and millenials mix up a bit -", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:03:37", "owner": "awesome_edd_1546", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842332825632714, "text": "Oh god", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:00:41", "owner": "hiya_ryah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396927403134801, "text": "Ive never heard of half off those millennial terms", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:00:25", "owner": "itsatrapani", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18031231982536666, "text": "Ill take being a mil 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:59:58", "owner": "cody.62394", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143245747449146, "text": "i-i’m… a mix of the three as an old gen z 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:58:05", "owner": "oceano.mio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108506965559324, "text": "Damn am I GenZ or a Mil?😅", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:54:45", "owner": "chantecristina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18316946398223090, "text": "Mil here.... uhm I don't even know if I should call myself that since I had no clue half the words you were saying for Mil 😵‍💫", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:53:02", "owner": "vane_hdz87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085415288006155, "text": "Got my little sisters feeding me that cringe Gen Alpha slang", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:50:34", "owner": "gigasigmacheese", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916935712218073, "text": "ur doin to much 🥀🥀", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:44:11", "owner": "mr_tim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927053788170630, "text": "So the first  one half of it is just millennial slang", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:42:16", "owner": "j_a_y_______96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104571469730513, "text": "We're all cooked", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:41:04", "owner": "brad.the.rad.lad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18409290922187968, "text": "That is NOT the equivalent of “lock in”", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:33:57", "owner": "jaaackal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064109138444167, "text": "My brain hurts 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:27:34", "owner": "umm_burr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106465663564928, "text": "69 is 100% a sexual reference, so no the others are not equal to that 🤦🏻‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:19:28", "owner": "wingsoflea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079080791141449, "text": "wtf was creepy pasta?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:19:24", "owner": "_forgetmenots__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871912006464687, "text": "Creepy pasta is the only one I have never heard.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:14:51", "owner": "cheercoachdowney", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109559305611154, "text": "So i am gen z mix with millienal", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:14:15", "owner": "get_fit_4_summer_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112684066597862, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:08:27", "owner": "poorpeopleshero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958653546881283, "text": "Oh shit I'm old now huh😅🤨", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:08:02", "owner": "jah_wicc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860532445550114, "text": "💀", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:06:38", "owner": "sovereiign.beauty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940963746962181, "text": "Hell nah dog water was all over black ops 2 S&D", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:55:03", "owner": "j4y_sct", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091451465299197, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:43:27", "owner": "mjaystrut", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079853959898365, "text": "this would send a victorian child into a coma", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:41:42", "owner": "trippymushr0om", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18178599421364528, "text": "“backrooms” and “creepy pasta” did not help me understand “Ohio”", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:37:58", "owner": "brettmanoogian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050119013386605, "text": "Its too fast", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:34:50", "owner": "ulcerana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106664464722848, "text": "I about died from cringe never post anything like this again", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:34:05", "owner": "demonr53", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091899358900629, "text": "I’ve never used creepy pasta. wtf is creepy pasta", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:30:29", "owner": "thankyouasia.girl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065726414158449, "text": "Mogging was around in the early 2000s", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:23:14", "owner": "stan_stanmonson_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109028845717848, "text": "These are so corny 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:15:14", "owner": "damnndjay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061335221561572, "text": "I'm 27 I'm so confused I feel like I'm 81", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:13:11", "owner": "the_countess_starlight", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164295019383103, "text": "Thank you. As a millennial I finally understand what these other things mean", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:03:43", "owner": "edeneshirley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844812934619343, "text": "I hate that I’m both with it and not with it at the same time lol", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:59:35", "owner": "crossfit_panda_97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109658755612140, "text": "It’s all bullshit.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:44:50", "owner": "gr_amanda58", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154360003409167, "text": "for gen x… all of those = dumb 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:38:10", "owner": "chateaudorland", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18186203596342002, "text": "Fml", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:22:31", "owner": "ac.day", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923887336046964, "text": "Stfu was not Gen Z this is stupid 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:11:33", "owner": "science_mann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182392501356161, "text": "I'm gen z but I'm a mix of both gen z and mil ig", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:03:24", "owner": "__scout_tf2_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111578089607463, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:36:28", "owner": "edgarito.el.valiente", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303290509265605, "text": "EXCUSE ME?!?!?! DOG WATER OUT HERE FOR THE NEWS GENERATION????? BRO IVE BEEN SAYING THAT SINCE I WAS A KID (24)", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:17:41", "owner": "liam_12777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860478877479380, "text": "I'm waaayyy too french for this!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:13:37", "owner": "kevin_de_nazareth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919425640227622, "text": "Thank u 🙏🏾 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:11:48", "owner": "ding876", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052208084666459, "text": "I don't approve, hyper cringe, please cease", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:45:19", "owner": "metro_arc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109361737716778, "text": "67 and 69 ain't even the same 💩", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:44:05", "owner": "highsociety420life", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971665116812555, "text": "Oh no!  I need the Gen X definitions.  I barely knew some of the Millennial ones.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:41:39", "owner": "whatnext2003", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138325939462437, "text": "as gen z, what the hell is 21😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:24:08", "owner": "electricmaxxie", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080810873157036, "text": "I think I’m kinda in between millennials and z smh", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:18:47", "owner": "iidirtyspriteboii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076952644977785, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:13:54", "owner": "aldredeckles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096634579875054, "text": "The hero we needed 🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:11:07", "owner": "alicevanh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086685115988399, "text": "I have slang for both gen Z and mil ahaha", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:07:29", "owner": "chelsey_skyla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086453597491284, "text": "What is 21", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:07:07", "owner": "missmuskanhans", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060812837542389, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:50:51", "owner": "therocketdoggirl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049391993690020, "text": "Ah…. So I AM a Zillenial", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:36:06", "owner": "skyskyy1995", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18393500512134866, "text": "This dude is definitely gay", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:17:38", "owner": "sl33pyh3ad_s13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083798690015687, "text": "SYBAU!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:06:05", "owner": "kingleon_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087903637958496, "text": "I’ve only ever used gen Z and Millennial slang cause they actually make sense, alpha is just gibberish at this point", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:56:08", "owner": "king_of_stuns", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18276234100303971, "text": "We should probably send him some help. I think bro's taking a stroke cuz nothing. He said there made sense", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:31:57", "owner": "jd_zablaska", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001417016835869, "text": "What about GenX? Lol", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:22:55", "owner": "derrickburpo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082549619034927, "text": "I feel old", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:19:52", "owner": "melissamenzinger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971898381814624, "text": "Stfu", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:18:47", "owner": "junekaboom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097366198816654, "text": "wtf is gen alpha at this point 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:15:31", "owner": "xtarax1117", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057473672646151, "text": "Creepy pasta? You’re cooked", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:54:21", "owner": "katyshirtwithnosleeves", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159990685398555, "text": "......huh😅. I'll save this cause I feel like it'll come in handy one day", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:49:28", "owner": "itsgenise", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933903547104917, "text": "SYBAU?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:45:21", "owner": "eafverit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842046733634077, "text": "You for sure needed to do it the other way around. Starting with the stupid one is confusing!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:44:08", "owner": "minusromance", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978560790942571, "text": "Can you make this again but a slower version, I need to take notes.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:40:25", "owner": "katiergeddes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053897846644801, "text": "Creepy pasta ?? 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:31:19", "owner": "hanoapf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052919132339145, "text": "Maybe 2 of those made sense to me.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:29:42", "owner": "becca____bee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084857453093822, "text": "what? no idea what’s going on", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:27:19", "owner": "melena.walker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047590019678456, "text": "I think I’m gen z/millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:12:44", "owner": "julia.halbert", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114046651582124, "text": "Doing gods work lol", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:09:04", "owner": "otterly_awkward", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090259793473177, "text": "When youre gen z raised by millennial siblings but also use gen alpha slang 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:08:04", "owner": "unexpectancy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086221312955293, "text": "Im such a zillenial", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:06:44", "owner": "itgrltori", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063092777561943, "text": "Chad is a gen Z term", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:04:30", "owner": "keaton.crandall2132", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912584935253715, "text": "Nah nightmare fuel is still it", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:04:16", "owner": "itsiananderson", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18133271305488470, "text": "Dude 2/3 of these aren’t even right", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:02:15", "owner": "ryan_glaze", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873591823379098, "text": "Dog water was a Fortnite insult over 5 years ago", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:00:29", "owner": "zanesgrid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026380088758845, "text": "I didn't understand most of this💀", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:49:28", "owner": "kaylynnnnn17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926059879157192, "text": "I’ve been saying OD since 1998", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:38:00", "owner": "argenistv", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17951776056058327, "text": "Ok as a millennial, I’ve never said those words in my life 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:30:29", "owner": "jeaneth0887", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943724893083095, "text": "Just put the fries in the bag /lock in/ wrap it up do not all mean the same thing vro", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:16:32", "owner": "freefloatingtemporally", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099073711796797, "text": "67 is not 21 nor 69 67 means nothing", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:01:30", "owner": "hardricktam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099988687702889, "text": "Im 90% sure this guy has never asked a millennial their vocab", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:59:49", "owner": "mikematt89", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083551339858950, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:55:56", "owner": "la_theking1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18048440261422799, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:55:22", "owner": "milisbeltran", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18004752824818279, "text": "Millennials do not say these things stop trying so hard", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:50:40", "owner": "runs_with_kudu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075462872220170, "text": "You're actually a fucking god for this dude omg", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:49:24", "owner": "teddiesreadybb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083878378854454, "text": "It's intellectual disability... that's what it is", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:48:44", "owner": "wladville", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915184366239442, "text": "This actually helped me understand gen alpha slang thank you", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:43:28", "owner": "ritualnailsxo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090166163486165, "text": "This was very educational", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:41:27", "owner": "saskiabianca_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063654239396843, "text": "67 is not 69, not even close", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:37:03", "owner": "crackerjedi77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147566935386856, "text": "as a FNaF fan wtf is \"Freddy Fazbearing\" (I mean you explained it but still)", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:24:06", "owner": "querez8504", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074796832995189, "text": "I'm a millennial that identifies as an X", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:23:50", "owner": "seong_un_yeou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071585447366880, "text": "When you grew up with gen mill slang 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:14:53", "owner": "terrythetiger_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18542113924036930, "text": "67 is NOT the same as 69 lol", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:05:30", "owner": "ultraphotographybyj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866055754506242, "text": "PEEPEE", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:54:07", "owner": "whenthestewissus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944257420073256, "text": "Maybe because Im a Xennial or an elder millennial, but we never used half of these things. Like Creepy Pasta, Hella, Fry Tax??? Um. What? And You're done- absolutely not", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:48:11", "owner": "rachael_pope22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989624613880385, "text": "Wtf is creepy pasta", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:45:19", "owner": "rachael_pope22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879625513329868, "text": "Ok alot of the \"melennial\" slang is not millenial", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:45:00", "owner": "desiree0330", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954255112041676, "text": "Damn that’s what they think of Ohio 🤣👏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:35:41", "owner": "_makaflaka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057534638306533, "text": "Wtf is 21", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:35:09", "owner": "not_to_be_that_witch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002083463680903, "text": "🤣🤣🤣 all thow I under stand there gibberish I find no reason to use such words it sounds so common and basic and an insult to the English language", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:34:03", "owner": "alpha_pupdj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979643655942176, "text": "What... In the world.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:22:40", "owner": "espressoxpatronum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088616638785079, "text": "92 and I’ve always said trash… some of these are wrong.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:22:01", "owner": "ashleykemmerly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005349869819506, "text": "So slang words", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:53:45", "owner": "justtryingtomakeitfam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293744317263898, "text": "Mil’s are so cute stop it 🥹", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:53:05", "owner": "charalvord", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978332229949391, "text": "UNC is not boomer", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:52:50", "owner": "jacobplaysviolin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063178358632202, "text": "This is actually helpful as hell ty", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:41:37", "owner": "bottle_of_newts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980877546922833, "text": "Wtf is 61", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:32:04", "owner": "consilio.anima", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067841780116645, "text": "Whats going on with Ohio?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:28:47", "owner": "keycoscreations", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088207669943665, "text": "So what gen am I if I know all of them and use all of them slangs?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:16:49", "owner": "creppypastas009", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074679359006439, "text": "Wait I don’t even know who I am anymore", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:16:14", "owner": "mmaryjanerae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030493220548174, "text": "Many of this crap I don’t know.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:09:03", "owner": "joncaprisunshine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087894701491115, "text": "Wait...am i a millenial?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:06:18", "owner": "danilo_tenis_2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065451647142871, "text": "wtf", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:05:14", "owner": "janay782847", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045587891688386, "text": "THANK YOU SO MUCH", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:59:14", "owner": "letsbewitchy60", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176918806364203, "text": "What is this swag erasure 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:58:22", "owner": "horrendous.hiccup.in.the.plan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049046324416662, "text": "Can you translate this into “The greatest generation?” Need to explain to my grandpa born in 1927 who was in WW2", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:56:32", "owner": "pranaychat", "likes": 25}, {"id": 17959169220007779, "text": "OD is high key??", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:54:31", "owner": "ssyardy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936954972981780, "text": "Whatever you say beautiful", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:49:32", "owner": "niklaus928", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18523643023067585, "text": "A what? A WHAT? Oh.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:47:17", "owner": "torathena.and.bear", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18033107156743987, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:44:34", "owner": "hillaryyaas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106434202724896, "text": "Sorry but sybau and stfu are both millennial.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:38:08", "owner": "_roberthoren_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867000853489527, "text": "Tf lol", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:37:45", "owner": "pbfnskurt", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18080380610513764, "text": "also Ohio is not at all related to creepy pasta and backrooms", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:36:29", "owner": "_parxsos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998154495699676, "text": "lock in does not fit in that context", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:36:08", "owner": "_parxsos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099530050744430, "text": "When he said 69 I chuckled. Checks out 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:34:34", "owner": "sebsideways", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863545321533315, "text": "1738", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:33:36", "owner": "nathan24____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943024582077956, "text": "Gen z wins all of these, except aura is really really good.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:27:00", "owner": "danzo1118", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18368688631084186, "text": "As a solid, stereotypical millennial,  huh!?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:23:28", "owner": "katherinejosephineleopold", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908804482127432, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:55:48", "owner": "gingersnapped_93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082121867031540, "text": "41?????", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:46:49", "owner": "princesskt2001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876994897440357, "text": "What the fuck is 41 now", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:44:16", "owner": "maggie.vansulli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932203600113990, "text": "wow thank you", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:43:15", "owner": "_diesel_demoness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18341025769225735, "text": "this almost completely inaccurate. its impressive", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:39:41", "owner": "kelv.out", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164725051382174, "text": "I think I just had an aneurysm", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:34:33", "owner": "jusdawn__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120430042531375, "text": "This is how I know I’m a zillennial 🤣 “I had the best of both worlds”", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:28:15", "owner": "_ford_unfocused", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105624994632534, "text": "And if you're black, OD and Twin were around long before GenZ and Alpha were born.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:27:03", "owner": "jeffjustdesigns", "likes": 87}, {"id": 18084997619051385, "text": "I’m a mix on Gen Z and Gen Alpha 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:26:01", "owner": "e_bela_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085601003063013, "text": "As a 46 year old Gen X mother of teens. Thank you", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:22:35", "owner": "lisamarieabee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074383577196079, "text": "Most of these are black American slang", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:20:35", "owner": "robot_draws", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051438296359030, "text": "Thanks", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:02:19", "owner": "ardleyz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18327853903240285, "text": "So the millennial slang is just… made up?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:48:16", "owner": "phoebe.a.rose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115819771562649, "text": "Most of these are just black slang gone main", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:39:00", "owner": "champagnecocaine187", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089001676942579, "text": "Been saying dog water since I was a kid, no idea where I learned it. I'm barely too young to count as a mil. 27", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:33:28", "owner": "chuckchuckprop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941369169962078, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:23:45", "owner": "hyunorris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049951793383465, "text": "They slang is so dumb and makes no sense 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:23:08", "owner": "sonya_thee_illest", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18415365118141775, "text": "Why is no one questioning how horrible generation alpha lingo is", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:21:52", "owner": "trill_legacy1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943799740075280, "text": "please stop", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:20:07", "owner": "t_mcnicol_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988418268906168, "text": "@damon_christ_king 2024 alpha have loads of catching up now 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:13:50", "owner": "amanta_dewdney", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087303608054268, "text": "Just all over confused 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:12:16", "owner": "keyannabis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903213046297262, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:59:20", "owner": "_tonytheblack_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113654533583614, "text": "I needed these translations😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:53:51", "owner": "ajtink222", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303488050270990, "text": "Nigga sybau", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:53:07", "owner": "southseas16.6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079334177516917, "text": "Your slang sucks across three generations", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:47:27", "owner": "3ringedparadox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144664390443859, "text": "Thanks", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:40:23", "owner": "wardroberari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073512596252905, "text": "Oh, that’s what Ohio means? Makes sense actually", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:39:12", "owner": "stan___gogan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060663725220897, "text": "All of these “slangs” are dumb. Don’t be a dumb dumb.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:38:58", "owner": "amoshousworth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091398760934337, "text": "A lot of the Gen Z shit has its roots in millennial internet speak. Based, for example was being used when zoomers were in diapers", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:36:24", "owner": "lordkenton666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103764400710584, "text": "…69 meant oral sex…all of this other stuff is humanity becoming retarded…yes I said retarded as in mental illness.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:32:21", "owner": "femiyes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857599510503562, "text": "Im gen z or gen alpha", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:30:59", "owner": "fernando_chavesrincon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090467099495245, "text": "I’m saving this. This helped 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:28:40", "owner": "stonergeorgia2.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876031240444115, "text": "Nah I get all of these as gen z", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:25:20", "owner": "dubby239", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144355462449723, "text": "Why tf is “gen z” just the same group as alpha just from like 3-4years ago but then millennials is actual like unc slang from 15+ years ago😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:19:59", "owner": "jaayslime__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010111364803462, "text": "…I don’t think…67 is the same as…69😳😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:13:51", "owner": "mercy_r_us", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877904464436592, "text": "All of this is BULLSHIT 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:05:44", "owner": "diggasoca", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065677010423016, "text": "The Gen Z synonym for aura is definitely swag", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:53:34", "owner": "monkdraws", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087657409965504, "text": "How do I dislike a video", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:51:07", "owner": "seanatron89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185651170347681, "text": "Ohio is Wyoming for gen z stfu", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:50:32", "owner": "mooksydaisy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055722932645312, "text": "Does 17-38 count for Gen Z too", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:48:12", "owner": "alainasadith", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18119703214477251, "text": "Hold up", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:45:11", "owner": "reneezeligera", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862469554537148, "text": "F you mean bestie? Homie is homie", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:43:16", "owner": "showertimekrazy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071104217457983, "text": "I'm an elder Millennial and I have no idea what you're talking about in the majority of the Millennial sayings.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:41:26", "owner": "christopher.ryan.higgins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065149286153359, "text": "This is so wrong, like very incorrect. signed -A Millennial.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:40:45", "owner": "keetababy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849850153567148, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:38:17", "owner": "niz_understo0d.2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136501675464032, "text": "What the hell….??????", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:38:16", "owner": "coldlyrysome", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074976560463693, "text": "This video gave me cancer", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:27:54", "owner": "zombie_mag", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17980573169777881, "text": "this is making me tweak out oh my god stop", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:21:15", "owner": "odttuli", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17985493808755279, "text": "I still don't understand 67. I'm Gen Z.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:18:39", "owner": "_its_alivia_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059691701262739, "text": "Thank you", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:13:12", "owner": "retrodancemonster", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850187875563491, "text": "Like a quarter of these are wrong.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:08:00", "owner": "deracho_gryphon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990287697903265, "text": "I haven’t heard some of these in so long lol", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:02:54", "owner": "allmywatkins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153514627437168, "text": "I… am an amalgamation 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:51:39", "owner": "swamillion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942521605020782, "text": "Lost me at Ohio", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:48:34", "owner": "itsnicksauce", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17849739996565648, "text": "I'm a mixture of all bit mostly gen z and mil - I'm gen z", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:41:44", "owner": "caitaldrich", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059947718243053, "text": "You’re Capping , you’re gassing, you’re lying", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:34:43", "owner": "thebuschguy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18027692258759131, "text": "This is brilliant!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:22:33", "owner": "tamar_bloch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055211822647684, "text": "Millennial here yo what in the fuck is creepy pasta", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:06:50", "owner": "herb_nospice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050542262377635, "text": "NONE of the Gen Z & Millennial slang are accurate to the Alpha, & most of the Mil ones are not really slang & no one says any of it.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:06:33", "owner": "rabeemorra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022558787602283, "text": "I’ve been typing SYBAU since 08 haha. I feel so prophetic.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:05:41", "owner": "crs_bcn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097885447795055, "text": "I knew i was secretly a millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:03:40", "owner": "bailey.ew", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024580589591613, "text": "I'm early GenZ and I only know the millennial words", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:56:24", "owner": "1michelrobledo1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061222979214751, "text": "Who cares when most of these kids can't read 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:51:12", "owner": "dabbyduckofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113501044710210, "text": "69 heck yea 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:49:03", "owner": "anthony.chopra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090595717930475, "text": "I’ve been using stfu since the early 2000s", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:47:47", "owner": "apain4real", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084120968094823, "text": "I need to go back to school to relearn all this nonsense", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:47:01", "owner": "gryffindorlawson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956730976032422, "text": "I talk like a combination of gen z and millenials", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:37:50", "owner": "leafy__.the_cow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057382928307813, "text": "I feel like so many of these are not in the right generation", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:34:33", "owner": "dahowe23", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18084166133019463, "text": "What about ligma?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:33:51", "owner": "jakeyy.1234", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085878977004384, "text": "I work with kids ,thanks", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:20:51", "owner": "kiefcoffeee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046062173472256, "text": "My bitchslapping hand is twitching lol", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:14:45", "owner": "artbychris93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073329173584372, "text": "SYBAU STFU YOU’RE DONE🥀🥀🥀🥀", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:10:22", "owner": "mlem4meow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059016344274231, "text": "I'm sadly understanding and still  using all of them", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:03:33", "owner": "darksannar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879003391429651, "text": "Love love", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:47:52", "owner": "cosmikali", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084273500010323, "text": "SLOW DOWN", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:46:37", "owner": "ilh.1004", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079117373140438, "text": "Oh i needed this thanks", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:44:34", "owner": "im_jalapeno", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17908994712125588, "text": "Dog water was gen z first I’ll die on that hill", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:41:20", "owner": "wendisimoe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998128710699048, "text": "Thank you for helping me fit in 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:39:42", "owner": "nicolasa_rdn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109032874541699, "text": "Gay.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:37:11", "owner": "mrto2319", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376121077155468, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭 stahp", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:33:37", "owner": "aykezar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099139561749671, "text": "old head????", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:27:02", "owner": "jacquelinerote", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063589514564041, "text": "Mill were saying stfu everyone has been forever lmfao", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:24:51", "owner": "oukashiokamii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954693178020742, "text": "OD is not new lingo btw", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:23:12", "owner": "smacrollie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112752175603994, "text": "I say a mix of gen Z and millennial I’m an 04 baby", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:21:51", "owner": "scoutjasperwillow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994169004716431, "text": "Why am I on the Right end?!?!?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:16:08", "owner": "granatapfeli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888410128391846, "text": "This is genuinely so helpful to me, thank you 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:15:28", "owner": "itskaitlin.e", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18392175388181995, "text": "I’m not going to learn this way 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:11:41", "owner": "andream.reyes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054898079325362, "text": "Mostly Gez but I steal parts of gen Alpha and millennials because I am born at a time where millennial influence was high but I also have a gen Alpha sibling.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:04:06", "owner": "storm_spire", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957891043001753, "text": "I'm a millennial definitely 💀🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:59:28", "owner": "shin_ami1999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079037897135502, "text": "I am half alpha half Gen Z 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:58:59", "owner": "mosaddikur_404", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081036383469511, "text": "For everyone that is between Gen Z and millennial, you are not alone", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:52:49", "owner": "__kraantjek__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056825360308680, "text": "Wtf is 41? You Also forgot 1738.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:51:06", "owner": "dreaminqkxtty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18149086483438494, "text": "Nah 67 is 1738", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:51:03", "owner": "kayla_moonsamy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079856885135601, "text": "I’m definitely a mix of the gen z and millennials", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:47:53", "owner": "logan.elisa.snyder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104814037714146, "text": "Actually I use all three Twin, BFF, Bestie. Twin and Bestie I use with my Non-binary friend and BFF with my Girl Best Friend as we are BFFs 👯‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:47:16", "owner": "yourfriendlyneighbourhoodjen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113837035596725, "text": "Your Giving Gen alpha some of Gen z tail end slang", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:46:40", "owner": "all_izon_me2.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886645585403719, "text": "Lmaooo", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:45:04", "owner": "iamdeyisakiller_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086972965962046, "text": "i didn’t know i needed this", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:37:28", "owner": "_kaisito", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032798762721737, "text": "I did not ask for this brainrot", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:27:19", "owner": "allpunandjames", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870559114470061, "text": "Really?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:26:31", "owner": "mrgoing_against_thegrain85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891287869245610, "text": "You tried but failed", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:26:15", "owner": "krisxdreamxo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085400800840816, "text": "Whats ohio lol", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:23:36", "owner": "robinthearts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114956329569122, "text": "Thanks, this made me realize howuch all over the place i am😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:12:51", "owner": "abood.khn", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17876134074442828, "text": "Hella is not a generational thing", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:07:30", "owner": "cairo_tattoos", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17969489975825780, "text": "gen alpha’s linguo is so otherworldly💀", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:06:29", "owner": "tiyaprtw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088129079500668, "text": "Watching this killed my soul", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:01:18", "owner": "carnageischaos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112108216574239, "text": "FYI: gen alpha are 8th grade children down to newborns. It’s children where hardly any of them are even teenagers yet. You’re all getting angry at school kids talking; wouldn’t say that’s a slang to expect them using in high school.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:57:08", "owner": "bryce_carlson_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18096352087836521, "text": "Thanks", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:51:48", "owner": "therealparthivshah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096040990680764, "text": "Oh my god.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:46:50", "owner": "digitalchrys", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048564737428904, "text": "I finally under my daughter 😂😂😂😂 I’ve been soooo confused when she’s speaking full sentences of fucking brain rot 😭😭💀", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:46:12", "owner": "marcotiics", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083413112472373, "text": "Thank you for this PSA", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:34:51", "owner": "alejacrcu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075424685253405, "text": "You’re getting blocked", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:33:41", "owner": "pablonieto_cooks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060961565559284, "text": "Gotta love being gen z growing up as millenial", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:32:31", "owner": "eirwanee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092595412904597, "text": "Thank you, I can finally have a conversation with my niece.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:32:27", "owner": "loreoflavender", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996521538845189, "text": "Thanks you for the translation im only 22 and i barely understand what the kids say 🫠", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:29:33", "owner": "chocokitties_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071287904065035, "text": "This just incorrect brother", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:24:28", "owner": "oronzobraxton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859218145556104, "text": "This is just factually incorrect", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:21:59", "owner": "d0gath", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193661401335513, "text": "I’m a gen Z and have never heard someone use the word “based” I’ve always have heard “that was savage” “bro your savage” “your savage if you do that” wtf based like a damn turkey.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:11:47", "owner": "azaleaesparza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397318204122852, "text": "Mill is better", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:58:09", "owner": "basura_panda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103726945663330, "text": "@briiee__xo take notes", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:54:20", "owner": "trice2b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026262689774798, "text": "Millennial and never heard of some of these like “old head” I also thought cringey was millennial. I mostly use the Gen Z ones.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:50:02", "owner": "lunlun.zz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857474548505043, "text": "I try to not speak like a dipshit lmao 🤣 but then again I also talk with a southern slur half the time lmao 🤣 but it’s sure it better than whatever there saying", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:47:50", "owner": "star_key1171", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098296783772743, "text": "What we learn here dear children, is gen alpha isn't an upgrade on its predecessor generation", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:46:43", "owner": "jomo1816", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866310964502801, "text": "Sir, as an elder Millennial- I am here to tell you that some of the slang you attributed to us is not our slang, some of the gen z slang IS our slang that was reappropriated, and some of those words listed as ours… were just words. “Awkward,” is not slang. It is a standard word. So, you’re basically saying that in that respect, we just spoke… English. On a separate note: someone needs to check in on the Alphas because at least the other slangs are based in a kind of logic that makes the words inferable.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:46:03", "owner": "mizzdawez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074393651020484, "text": "wtf is creepy pasta", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:42:28", "owner": "lindsayw.x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118145176489119, "text": "I disagree with the first one, 67 is NOT 21, and 21 is NOT 69😂😂 idc idc idc idc", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:41:41", "owner": "grizlemynizle", "likes": 184}, {"id": 18303687403255008, "text": "The eff is creepy pasta?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:41:31", "owner": "sarahlove617", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867360424424718, "text": "I don't understand any of it but it helps thank you lol", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:39:03", "owner": "samlescreations", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546167233034694, "text": "Some of these are wrong never in my fucking life have I said fam that shit is millennials. I always cringe because every FUCKING millennial Cousin and Auntie would say it.\neven the other kids in my class would look at adults crazy when they use it", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:33:33", "owner": "tigravra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081827812890060, "text": "Gen Alpha thinks they started OD? Wild", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:32:32", "owner": "ayden_holmes5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109250410549505, "text": "Saving 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:28:28", "owner": "crissy_jay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086624264311627, "text": "I dont speak like any and im a gen z ...", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:25:58", "owner": "cheyanne_0_5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148656148433281, "text": "As a millennial u said things I’ve never heard 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:21:23", "owner": "sammyneff13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033455930732957, "text": "Nah, the millenials don't get to take Creepypasta from us 😤 Gen Z built that shit", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:15:53", "owner": "tygerbevibing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094222051721316, "text": "is this....pano?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:14:36", "owner": "arcangeist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092805520847878, "text": "Stfu means  shut the fuk3 up", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:13:49", "owner": "cshier16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918415663199827, "text": "lol based and savage aren’t the same thing at all", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:13:25", "owner": "jpdfive_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076291693976360, "text": "Wait 67 is 69? I’m lost 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:12:46", "owner": "ojevwe_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18399044122123443, "text": "As a zillennial, I understand Gen z and Millennial but have no clue what Gen alpha is talking about so thank you for these conparisons", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:59:02", "owner": "kionabubs222", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18047852861429369, "text": "Why am I a mix of GEN Z & Millenial😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:55:59", "owner": "axaxia_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085591450840567, "text": "I dont think unc is boomer 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:50:09", "owner": "maybeitsfenn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027140030584549, "text": "Born in 99 and only get all the millennial ones", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:48:48", "owner": "bw.ncm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105037600641976, "text": "all seem pretty accurate, but idk if I’d compare Ohio to creepypasta or the backrooms lol", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:48:38", "owner": "chlorineiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926233387032695, "text": "Ok Boomer is totally millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:44:34", "owner": "handmadebyafsheen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844878211604218, "text": "A zillenial right here 👌🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:42:45", "owner": "sahigi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067163729121410, "text": "This gave me a headache", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:40:40", "owner": "meeyuh___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18412937446137287, "text": "Gen alpha is saying cheugy?????", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:40:37", "owner": "jessirovai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929082901152252, "text": "💀alpha slang sounds like we going dumb", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:34:43", "owner": "softcoded.emba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051389474374147, "text": "Do they really pronounce it sigh-bow", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:33:56", "owner": "rachelkjwright", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17969506190821977, "text": "you lost me at Freddy what ? 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:33:29", "owner": "dar.star.18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859507711551161, "text": "I’m z and mil", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:31:09", "owner": "marcus_4lyf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064768214430537, "text": "I’m a little genz mostly millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:27:38", "owner": "ashtonschickedanz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099855322769859, "text": "Bruh", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:26:38", "owner": "ivy_czudak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080719274131221, "text": "what’s millennial for you just gave me a fckin headache? 😵‍💫", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:24:26", "owner": "vkarennn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935303284103544, "text": "Renegade sent me into a stroke", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:22:49", "owner": "emma.gittens", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17955994362012672, "text": "Or you can just say what you mean.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:20:26", "owner": "ashabelle83", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934512796104816, "text": "this guy is a reptile", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:19:06", "owner": "zachgsax", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878430820431639, "text": "How is twin theirs?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:15:51", "owner": "dispokeboii2018", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298166551286192, "text": "Savage and based are not the same thing", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:14:29", "owner": "annu.mii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082461158096255, "text": "So sad that Ohio is equivalent to the backrooms and/or creepy pasta… Ohio is beautiful 😭😭💔 I actually adore Ohio. Lowkey feel like it got a bad rap as a p$yop so that they could run illegal experimentation there and nobody would gaf lol", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:14:05", "owner": "lugubriousliz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992703159854622, "text": "Can I get Gen X thrown in btw? Cause my Millennial doesn't match.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:13:30", "owner": "ba_smith5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055472960646212, "text": "67 =/=69. Maybe it started that way but it definitely doesn't mean that now.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:12:53", "owner": "ba_smith5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086934415791250, "text": "you’ve got some of them mixed", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:08:40", "owner": "shnglez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082619216280045, "text": "cheugy is millennial. no kid says cheugy", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:08:11", "owner": "shnglez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952754032027231, "text": "Thank you for that information. 😅🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:03:36", "owner": "luz_de_losangeles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18245827690294794, "text": "OD is ODee thats it", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:59:31", "owner": "lyssaxrie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925640080168670, "text": "My English understanding skills decrease by the years.🙃", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:56:50", "owner": "_lucy.26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320378140171162, "text": "This pissed me off", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:56:26", "owner": "ptxero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18190061980337305, "text": "I feel like I’m stuck between Genz and millennial vocabulary.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:38:26", "owner": "elianescalante.leader", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18082670287878787, "text": "Acoustic, all of it just all of it.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:34:26", "owner": "niko.villazan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067776683576120, "text": "God, I fucking hated this.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:29:58", "owner": "gamerforce92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057579032303052, "text": "I'm gen z but I feel like I might vomit if you keep talking", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:28:17", "owner": "bluzare", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18318655228301087, "text": "A lot of this is wrong", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:27:57", "owner": "cestjamaisvue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077668031181982, "text": "Translate for gen x please", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:17:35", "owner": "ladyzetat420", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17959075890009249, "text": "This was 1 minute and 9 seconds too long", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:15:59", "owner": "tony_caz_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074682875351502, "text": "I’m all 3 then lol", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:13:44", "owner": "huntermarie.simar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935866632988449, "text": "I am GenZ but Also Millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:12:18", "owner": "rizwankhalida", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17927139123158029, "text": "W.T.F", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:08:44", "owner": "offi_raulgg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946213384066188, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:04:08", "owner": "ooftheregoesthatman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087663742788781, "text": "I see where your going. I’d say accuracy is 87%", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:53:45", "owner": "iammusicforever", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850891924596573, "text": "doing the lords work", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:53:31", "owner": "14ixx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954165477901426, "text": "Why do you look like Justin Bieber but without the drugs lol", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:50:01", "owner": "gibbledgrym", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923018134191454, "text": "Chad is the worst... lol", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:49:06", "owner": "breashae07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059036861267045, "text": "Eyebrows giving main character energy ✨", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:48:40", "owner": "xi.xviii.mcmvcviii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075627095245698, "text": "I didn’t know I needed this until you just did it 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:44:27", "owner": "natasha_jeffo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094668340803243, "text": "Thank you. I needed this translation. Duolingo doesn’t teach Pop culture as a language", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:41:42", "owner": "creen_grayon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086869291811432, "text": "Since when did 6/7 turn it into 69. Absolutely ridiculous post", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:36:56", "owner": "egressing_barriers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102692917674757, "text": "Thank you", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:31:28", "owner": "brandonvinall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954590643900814, "text": "95% wrong", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:22:55", "owner": "mcj0int", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089101636938556, "text": "Why my chest get tight while he's talking ? I'm weird", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:21:13", "owner": "deestylezz94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934502479071138, "text": "OD means over doing it. Not “high key” what??? And it’s also a millennial thing", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:17:42", "owner": "alt.slut", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18249989557288749, "text": "Yeah Alpha has major brain rot what are these wordssssssss", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:17:27", "owner": "manueljaimes_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104988997648707, "text": "I know way too many Alpha and I’m not entirely sure you’re not mistaken that for Gen Z but if not.. Fuck", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:14:27", "owner": "ontierickiee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980407842929307, "text": "I may understand all of these, but I only use gen z tbh 💀 I hear so much of alpha tho, the brainrot...", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:13:49", "owner": "sarah_12.30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075352883256070, "text": "I love using dog water", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:05:12", "owner": "alxs.sk", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17933087457105415, "text": "This is helpful 🤣 I’m between Gen Z and millennial so idk wtf some between alpha and Gen Z are", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:01:03", "owner": "kayosxlogix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076114496186056, "text": "Ummm the millennials say what no i do not wtf is creepy pasta, fry tax, also no glazing is c*mming on someones 🍑, if you’re a butt kisser that’s something else (brown noser) no body i know has ever said dude bro! It’s dude or bro, nightmare full was not a thing, dogie is something i have never heard tell today.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:00:21", "owner": "jemjosher", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871124440465632, "text": "Are we cooked, chat?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:00:01", "owner": "brybryespino", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18351400612205110, "text": "also idk some of these are a reach", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:58:42", "owner": "carlos_cig7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18153106441373546, "text": "Gen z and mil have almost the same lingo cause most of us have siblings and if not we went to public school. This new shit is weird af everyone else speaks English and can explain it", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:58:09", "owner": "carlos_cig7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039476447708636, "text": "A lot of this is wrong by the way", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:55:03", "owner": "ashleighlitreal", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18487281304077319, "text": "6/7 does not mean the same thing as 69…", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:54:14", "owner": "getawaywithkourtneyk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064071992630586, "text": "Older generations don’t like new generation, cus this is why.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:52:30", "owner": "sheneedanap", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925844047165780, "text": "I love you for this", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:51:38", "owner": "meganthediggs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063508706182454, "text": "Twin has been around for ages and it’s always been annoying lmao", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:50:34", "owner": "casey_matzick", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846679969611489, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:49:10", "owner": "green.embers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156762346406991, "text": "Whattttt", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:48:22", "owner": "ilaryc04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862559743536362, "text": "You should publish a thesaurus", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:44:29", "owner": "zaharimu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876573328354523, "text": "Omg I didn’t know how much I needed this. Thank you 🤲🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:43:42", "owner": "xmp2md", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075984776230333, "text": "LOCK IN IS EXPIRING???? 💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:38:53", "owner": "wowooeoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18216435529308169, "text": "Bruh", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:38:07", "owner": "mrbananablue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918780889209235, "text": "I need a brain update like this every 4-6 months", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:35:01", "owner": "patrick_malec", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078811939924990, "text": "Gen Alpha does NOT get Chad! Thats a millennial term! We started naming chads Chad!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:33:14", "owner": "captain_falcon20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18210156739311256, "text": "thank you for translating. i could keep up with gen z, but now gen alpha just says anything and i feel absolutely elderly", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:33:11", "owner": "dolenz93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098736859761395, "text": "Im a mix of all three somehow", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:30:58", "owner": "archieztra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043584824486447, "text": "All trash.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:28:42", "owner": "daiisangelic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136526704475155, "text": "ive learmed so much lol", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:26:57", "owner": "vaughnthabest", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18333060415238839, "text": "As a US foreigner, this was the extremely helpful:", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:25:13", "owner": "zoldyck_pablo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003092114825946, "text": "OD is like gen x lol", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:20:14", "owner": "es_0000001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084736877044762, "text": "Can we just go back to calling everything gay like the simple times😭😭😒", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:18:38", "owner": "fruity_giggles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083778160842975, "text": "I’m in between mil and gen z", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:17:46", "owner": "inquisitiveisaac808", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079304906129427, "text": "You sound like a complete faggot. please stop being an attention whore", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:15:10", "owner": "lilaj_650", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899496223186348, "text": "Notice how only 1 of those are actual descriptive words like 'awkward' and 'crap' 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:14:56", "owner": "onlyjarls", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923067658179501, "text": "What the heck is creepy pasta", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:11:59", "owner": "peacepraylove123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024329048782749, "text": "wtf do them alphas be talking about?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:10:16", "owner": "cherryblaze22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113346385609152, "text": "Okay I’ve been saying things are dog water for over a decade so I’m ahead of the curve I guess", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:09:26", "owner": "just_preusser", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087910909786452, "text": "SIGH BOW ????? IS THAT HOW YALL PRONOUNCE SYBAU ??", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:06:24", "owner": "jademadd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991346067894157, "text": "Wtf are these millennial names your using. Not even close.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:03:32", "owner": "resilientrepublic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109706827717491, "text": "this took 15 years off my lifespan", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:00:03", "owner": "jasminnie778", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865235593514757, "text": "Thank you for the conversion chart", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:58:07", "owner": "owennwb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064260470169320, "text": "All three for me", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:55:55", "owner": "ocrazel0_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120588604543682, "text": "Ohio is backrooms is so funny", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:48:40", "owner": "darlingtriss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133430242428530, "text": "Im gen z/mil", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:39:31", "owner": "missyummy_xoxo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119807575556313, "text": "This video would kill a young Victorian child", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:29:57", "owner": "brooklynn.rex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544816870062175, "text": "I hate how people hate each new generations, slang. Wasn’t  that part of the fun as a kid? Adults not really knowing what we were talking about. This is not new. It’s always this way. The kids are always talking about things. The adults aren’t hip on you all are hating it now because you are the adults that aren’t hip lol!! Even if you think it’s stupid just get with the program so that you can understand it, or just let kids be kids and stop hating these are the future generation and calling them doomed or weak or whatever is just bad for our future. I think this generation is funny and smart 👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:29:52", "owner": "dollllyface", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18188993725337786, "text": "Doing Gods work", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:27:44", "owner": "dollllyface", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066927797386727, "text": "I have never heard old head before as a millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:26:16", "owner": "sarabuggy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18192480442334508, "text": "What’s 41?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:24:48", "owner": "theofficaltroll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100720513701018, "text": "Ohio, backrooms, and creepypasta are not one to one. Gen Z also had Ohio, which is not a creepy pasta, but the backrooms are a KIND of creepy pasta. A better example would probably be whatever collaborative horror project Gen Alpha has to backrooms to SCP", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:23:31", "owner": "yourhelpfulcurator", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928282045141166, "text": "Alpha gotta come better they’re trying to make fetch happen", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:22:07", "owner": "rettabetta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993042537722604, "text": "Never heard “old head.” 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:18:44", "owner": "nomatick", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094309696889813, "text": "English isn’t real. It can’t hurt me.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:13:09", "owner": "rebeka_beka_a", "likes": 10845}, {"id": 18058914935277242, "text": "I combine a painful amount of many of these…", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:07:14", "owner": "_vowful", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957984694000999, "text": "Ohio💀", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:06:32", "owner": "jimenezpetroche", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864200881525718, "text": "I love? being right in the middle between gen Z and millennial 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:01:40", "owner": "cxsmichirai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353624782164253, "text": "I needed this translation", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:55:28", "owner": "hennoyingg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925182754175726, "text": "half of the gen alpha ones are gen z slang", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:55:03", "owner": "jazz_george", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074965169255175, "text": "And here it goes again. Feeling confirmed to be a Zillenial", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:49:56", "owner": "jarne2708", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083189636117928, "text": "Correct", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:47:00", "owner": "_chesterfit_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842145109631833, "text": "OD started with Millennials tho??", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:43:00", "owner": "taydizzlle", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085961177070068, "text": "I’m a millennial, never heard of some of those millennial ones", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:40:09", "owner": "louisemtoc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072283994596103, "text": "What’s 9+10? You stupid", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:36:53", "owner": "pharoah_j", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032841092531235, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:33:12", "owner": "the.lucky.koi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088301750309649, "text": "Thank you 🫡", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:32:36", "owner": "nico.car.v", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102291712665981, "text": "As a millennial, wtf is this", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:31:31", "owner": "stevensweetheart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100140391706271, "text": "Now Ik how my parents and grandparents felt after I forgot to update my Gen slang book", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:30:00", "owner": "keni_npc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543126499062931, "text": "Millennials had the best 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:28:56", "owner": "deex0x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146380888432336, "text": "Boomer isn’t the same as unc or old head.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:28:54", "owner": "mac_uzumaki15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043107854494836, "text": "You should kys", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:27:46", "owner": "arkidenot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932505643120014, "text": "Si 6/7 is 69??? 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:24:26", "owner": "jessi_patty_41", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18381530578148112, "text": "As a 90s Gen-Z (Zillennial), this felt pretty accurate. I was basically half and half between Millennial and Gen-Z", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:23:38", "owner": "will_plays_piano", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367869472086897, "text": "As a millennial i been using OD since 2010", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:22:16", "owner": "quezo_guapo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965196961006099, "text": "Why is this actually helpful 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:21:26", "owner": "indymackz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547312315013053, "text": "This guy trying to make the Rosetta stone of generational slang lmao", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:19:40", "owner": "k_borras", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098479420818025, "text": "What is up with 41 now?!? 6 7 was already pointless as sh*t", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:17:55", "owner": "shad0wstormx.privat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061466498226185, "text": "How are creepy pastas millenial? Well, I get it depends when and which creepy pasta's we're talking abt, bc Creepypastas were HUGE in 2016, I get there were young millennials... but weren't millennials like 18? That was huge for them too? Bc all the kids I knew where BIG on creepypastas", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:13:45", "owner": "camilargentina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18246105415292065, "text": "Listen, I needed this. I've been lost and just there for it", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:09:48", "owner": "wayward.29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18413779261137038, "text": "No no, let’s not get it confused. 67 is our 1738. 67 isn’t just some random number, it came from the song doot doot from Skrilla. We all know where 1738 came from", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:03:43", "owner": "pastor_johnn23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067709933373473, "text": "Freddy fazbearing 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T19:59:36", "owner": "japicuma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075090059250590, "text": "Alpha ❌ Ass ✅", "created_at": "2025-11-26T19:56:33", "owner": "s_y_e_d__s_h_a_h_r_o_z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095549116865435, "text": "Sooo what you’re telling me is us Millennials actually made sense,  this new Gen words are just made up and don’t make sense to the word intended meaning 🙄", "created_at": "2025-11-26T19:56:27", "owner": "parisabergamin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302292661268888, "text": "Fries in the bag is not lock in boomer it’s more like who asked", "created_at": "2025-11-26T19:50:05", "owner": "aakisselev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047881199424513, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T19:45:19", "owner": "artknotfood", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080992916146068, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T19:42:34", "owner": "kiriakos_kakoullis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954499581898465, "text": "I use a mixture of these things...", "created_at": "2025-11-26T19:42:00", "owner": "_furushiko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061087658636218, "text": "Helpful", "created_at": "2025-11-26T19:41:42", "owner": "hufflepins2398", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102395971735902, "text": "My brain hurts", "created_at": "2025-11-26T19:31:30", "owner": "grace.ellen._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088884787766489, "text": "I’m 28 and have been told I can’t fit into any of these. Is there a just living life section?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T19:29:56", "owner": "devontethomas24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152038117422491, "text": "How to tell me I'm a zillennial", "created_at": "2025-11-26T19:24:27", "owner": "crazybluepanda13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928351555153564, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T19:23:58", "owner": "q.boontarnkiat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062119877212622, "text": "I’m sorry Freddy faseberring 😂😭?!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T19:23:19", "owner": "guapo_peace", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057567887296135, "text": "Bro thank you 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T19:20:17", "owner": "emilyliley18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951781969051042, "text": "The is the first I'm hearing of an entirely new generation of slang out there. WHAT DO YOU MEAN IM A \"PREVIOUS GENERATION\" IM JUST A BABY", "created_at": "2025-11-26T19:19:35", "owner": "whywynter123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18384178906180433, "text": "Since when has Unc been gen alpha", "created_at": "2025-11-26T19:18:54", "owner": "trey22110", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887344471393653, "text": "Gen alpha slang is like another language 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T19:17:59", "owner": "maria.lorena.v", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952345105043079, "text": "Holy shit. I get it now.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T19:05:54", "owner": "livi_j0y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905444740142175, "text": "I’ve been chronically online since 09 and I have all three unfortunately", "created_at": "2025-11-26T19:01:49", "owner": "notandrewbrown", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086661703821409, "text": "Thank you for the translations, straight up need a dictionary these kids talkin mad diff", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:57:18", "owner": "jimjam.tv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110651215720266, "text": "Now I understand what 6 7 is to Alpha generation (I'm Gen Z)", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:56:59", "owner": "voeeuxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096528130860603, "text": "67 is not 69 🤣 no. Nope. Not even.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:56:41", "owner": "willartforcoffee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088545122316018, "text": "God i know some from all 3. While i dont know from all 3 too. What??", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:56:19", "owner": "niaali2020", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013114940800006, "text": "I know them all randomly.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:52:19", "owner": "akane_zemo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18382768711183178, "text": "As a zelleniel, thank you. But also god, some of these are so random", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:51:00", "owner": "sean.sjahrial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987316320747241, "text": "Good info. I like this.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:50:37", "owner": "_snow_bvnny_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18327938353212233, "text": "creepypasta is gen z stop it", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:43:58", "owner": "underscoreswift", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18097503940835313, "text": "Uhhhh I must be the geriatric millennial side of the spectrum, bc half of the phrases for us I’ve never heard of", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:42:42", "owner": "eveill08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18379275655150471, "text": "I think I'm a boomer", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:38:29", "owner": "psalm3_7_8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930501391115716, "text": "creepy pasta was gen z core not millennial core.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:37:09", "owner": "highvibelowlife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920378308203191, "text": "Need Gen X :)", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:35:47", "owner": "melseitz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079364341915629, "text": "Tf is 21?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:33:27", "owner": "e.nolift", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18349688596164318, "text": "This is news for the unemployed", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:33:13", "owner": "juliosil.va", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298252039258539, "text": "There's so much wrong here it's upsetting.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:32:58", "owner": "eliseflis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074256710244131, "text": "Nightmare fuel is still a good one", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:28:30", "owner": "carolpontoriero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075765629247036, "text": "I'm early gen z, so I was surrounded by millennial slang and lived through gen z. My 2 younger siblings are late gen z/gen alpha. So I know and use a combination of all of these 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:21:18", "owner": "haanidebose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134510380485518, "text": "I hate the way AAVE is being gentrified here.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:17:02", "owner": "gotdamnocles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18246546787291280, "text": "I never said none of this💀 I'm so lost", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:14:24", "owner": "8bluesjourney8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082653497115744, "text": "Some are spot on some are complete nonsense. Hit or miss, i guess this time you sometimes miss.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:14:09", "owner": "mhehkishi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083609719866244, "text": "WTF is all these?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:10:21", "owner": "male2000male", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18163224652386891, "text": "You're just pulling things out of your ass, almost none of these were synonyms.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:06:50", "owner": "bauspanderu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990185907734860, "text": "Gen z is mixed w millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:03:05", "owner": "devilishbiscuit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086281603820782, "text": "almost jumped in front of a bus watching this", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:00:06", "owner": "nate_m00dy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18166174696375825, "text": "I miss who I was before this video ctrl+alt+delete 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:59:06", "owner": "suleleoo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17873223531457746, "text": "I swear to god it actually clicked this time", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:53:25", "owner": "whatsmyhandle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065548586620160, "text": "THANK YOU FOR YOUR SERVICES", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:48:36", "owner": "ummm_lets.not", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18102777295677499, "text": "I learned so much", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:41:48", "owner": "coloredbyariel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082806638025202, "text": "It’s like y’all took a black phrase each and said fuck it", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:37:22", "owner": "to_honest__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17999827760832521, "text": "@blizziboi", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:37:10", "owner": "cant_stop_painting", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114820651566613, "text": "Stfu is mil tfffff", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:36:52", "owner": "mariacas248", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037970420514104, "text": "Get aired is gen Z it's UK slang idk why he put it in Gen Alpha", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:34:04", "owner": "uz1u0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063712268393175, "text": "Not in a million years 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:33:19", "owner": "diba.1383", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099037795823594, "text": "Boomer is definitely a millennial term 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:31:19", "owner": "1curlynurse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051693290347991, "text": "Holy shit this needs to be made into a public PSA! 👏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:31:15", "owner": "epiccomedyberlin", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18059704370259770, "text": "gez and mil are the best ones, gen alpha sounds like a brainrot stroke", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:28:36", "owner": "meowlotnl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945358549073295, "text": "Unc is OG… never was boomer", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:25:59", "owner": "asiaismaj", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17857355538561176, "text": "I'm a time traveler... I don't talk like any of that. 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:25:08", "owner": "al_keeper_of_the_lamp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171033415332129, "text": "Millenial lingo so off", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:23:37", "owner": "hp_hamz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087198724794107, "text": "I'm a millennial and I must have lived under a rock for some of the terms you used", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:21:41", "owner": "theoriginalcinna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18387643411176451, "text": "@bluefranklin1 all of these words were used or made by Millennials which gen Z and alpha picked up. Like literally those who coined the term look maxxing and upload look maxxing content are all Millennials and gen Z.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:13:17", "owner": "lilcherrygum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123753163524295, "text": "I see exactly why everyone is confused. There are like 15 different cultural terms being mixed together to mean things they don't mean.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:12:21", "owner": "scrappmusiq", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17854223286578230, "text": "Can we get the gen x translation because even this elder millennial has no idea what you’re saying😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:12:02", "owner": "hillary.e.tucker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952615372048159, "text": "I’m mostly millennial with a touch of Gen Z and that’s just influence from my younger friends 😂. But alpha Jesus yall make words like your on fent 💀.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:09:14", "owner": "_xstsx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993578664717553, "text": "97 baby and I barely got half of the gen Z slang. Definitely understand and use most of the millennial vocab!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:04:47", "owner": "quintessembo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18333560200212625, "text": "When did all this happen", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:00:25", "owner": "mzz_tc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971761842986533, "text": "Chat i was raised by my brother a zillenial and his friends so im more familiar with millienal slang than gen z 🥲", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:57:16", "owner": "galennku", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898741843342141, "text": "Alpha lingo is so weird and makes no sense!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:54:03", "owner": "sip.read.dream", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18159541258404043, "text": "Need a Black version", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:51:33", "owner": "refbrlp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951594748058539, "text": "I don’t know what millennials you’re talking to but this doesn’t sound accurate.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:51:25", "owner": "brookienchris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064136936443097, "text": "Sybau means shut yo beautiful ass up? 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:51:20", "owner": "angel_dg1999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064285115164353, "text": "Lmfao Alpha just be throwin shxt at a wall hoping it sticks", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:46:08", "owner": "famekdee", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17881864104420221, "text": "Mixed mil and Z up too much", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:41:27", "owner": "splashovrboard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104468173647447, "text": "Nope", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:41:17", "owner": "_jahdaiii_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067636970456291, "text": "I need a fourth column for X please… I’m not X, but apparently I’m not cool enough to be millennial either.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:41:12", "owner": "sauntersniff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090445861918644, "text": "So.. millennials just used the dictionary while everyone else just made shyt up?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:39:21", "owner": "derek.wears.scrubs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305868370250287, "text": "SAVAGE DOESNT MEAN OR IS THE EQUIVALENT TO BASED, GET IT TOGETHER. That’s where you fucked up!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:36:59", "owner": "4b1p0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864160663519153, "text": "Z and Millenial fitting. Alpha: *gibberish*", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:35:05", "owner": "thetrupro8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026685893777037, "text": "Skibity means random?!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:34:49", "owner": "itbekizzy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934030621108349, "text": "For me I'd switch Chad and Alpha from Gen Z and Alpha", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:32:32", "owner": "raw_pancho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068233355595094, "text": "My kiddo is saying a lot of this stuff lol", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:29:19", "owner": "marymedinarealestate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098787151750264, "text": "Alpha slang is so random as that gen 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:27:19", "owner": "nanarodriguez96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18327060187244958, "text": "I actually appreciate this 😭🤣💀", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:27:06", "owner": "swtheart562", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087483157791057, "text": "as a gen z what the FUCK is meat riding", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:26:59", "owner": "compl1kat1e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069139649082040, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:26:48", "owner": "iamjessbrooks", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17985919322872763, "text": "I feel a lot of this is inaccurate in the milenial column. OD is not alpha, is definitely mil, and Hella is not mil it's regional to the west and OD/Mad is east. Several others I've simplely never heard at all", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:25:27", "owner": "rushingspirit.raw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304132057268989, "text": "Alpha slang is damn near Cockney slang at this point", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:24:14", "owner": "afaneon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871571221465929, "text": "….im gen Z (20) why did i know more of the millennials then my own 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:20:39", "owner": "itsjustoh_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875292742447328, "text": "⁶🤷🏽‍♂️⁷", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:19:33", "owner": "deshcosmer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184391584350069, "text": "Some of these cross over some times because OD is multigenerational fs", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:19:22", "owner": "neoxlnn", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17888376747262192, "text": "Wuht she call me?!💀", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:17:01", "owner": "nicosese", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905371087281989, "text": "My head hurts haven’t had a headache in years and now I’m getting one watching this pointless video cuz I’m not going to use any of this 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:16:28", "owner": "lilbabycecie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925809517177367, "text": "Mil forever", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:15:40", "owner": "tom.sh99", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069986873602780, "text": "What did ohio do to anyone", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:14:05", "owner": "th3_0ffical_king", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18209012911315228, "text": "Yeah we're doomed..", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:13:11", "owner": "krystalc707", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090726676931331, "text": "All are derived from morons thus making it all brain rot at the end of the day", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:07:22", "owner": "truth_xposed808", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112355287523971, "text": "Needed this thank you 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:03:34", "owner": "camila.espinoza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091705894938717, "text": "This was extremely helpful! Thank you haha", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:02:42", "owner": "mmglch", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082101151891261, "text": "I think we use to call all of this “nerd”", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:01:53", "owner": "taringolden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035214638721691, "text": "You stupid 👏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:00:56", "owner": "xxevil_lynnxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867318085483711, "text": "i feel like a polyglot lowkeyyyy", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:58:15", "owner": "gravitylane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063566816174252, "text": "At least the slang for Z and Millennials have context clues to figure them out. Alpha is just - incomprehensible", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:57:05", "owner": "_sarahreck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159536740402927, "text": "The fuck is SYBAU?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:55:15", "owner": "shwinramen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182049778359570, "text": "this is NUTSHDVSHJVHSBKS", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:52:36", "owner": "versarxhie", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18298337839281467, "text": "This was so helpful", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:51:35", "owner": "samantha_henderson1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989704221898182, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:49:25", "owner": "alticia_renheart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080364974133911, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:45:16", "owner": "unklekarl1976", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936836121983971, "text": "How old are you again", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:44:53", "owner": "lotfi.telghemti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998495235699553, "text": "Am I a millennial….?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:41:50", "owner": "morgan_smeltzer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087265156796826, "text": "Americans being american", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:30:15", "owner": "sayandip.karmakar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18380855266146752, "text": "Been following you since your early YouTube days. WILL FOREVER STAN PANO T!!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:27:15", "owner": "melosandstitch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18421651276118668, "text": "Nah, but dog water has been used forever.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:25:33", "owner": "9millzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861237949469130, "text": "69 represents the orientation of bodies during that act . It has meaning. 21 and 6-7 mean nothing . Beebopzigglebross", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:24:44", "owner": "alphamagnus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903767356290429, "text": "Some of these aren't generation specific some of these are just AAVE....", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:22:58", "owner": "southpaw.fm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064936817453420, "text": "I need my blk people to understand something....We're only 13% and these white people have used our slang and terminology for GENERATIONS!!! and have renamed it to feel included but when we first started saying it they made fun of it until their kids started using it.... Remember we don't just set the trends....WE ARE THE TRENDS✊🏾🤝🏾✊🏾", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:20:40", "owner": "itsswishuban", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111014713608668, "text": "stop yelling at the fry guy bc that would stress me out too", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:19:46", "owner": "saige_hk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864096952518857, "text": "its just internet slangs and people are trying too hard to compartmentalise these things to feel like they belong, somewhere.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:16:38", "owner": "oilerevilo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032760200725873, "text": "Piss is piss is piss", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:16:28", "owner": "vulpes_vigor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076533683351095, "text": "Ok, but What sexual position is 67?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:15:46", "owner": "jonathan_tweedy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546258784052211, "text": "WHAT are we saying", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:10:39", "owner": "antoinette.weingart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930222544149786, "text": "stfu was on 2000s internet cmon", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:56:19", "owner": "electrolimes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120253825532248, "text": "We the parents appreciate your work.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:47:11", "owner": "more.chardonnay.please", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961597878862508, "text": "I did not understand a single word of Gen alpha until I heard it in Gen Z and millennial language", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:43:54", "owner": "farida.alshawaf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063707870400605, "text": "The dictionary we all needed 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:41:04", "owner": "_.m.i_prive_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046655135465137, "text": "🙄🙄🙄", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:40:39", "owner": "kailajeanine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061060259533147, "text": "Im supposed to be gen z? Lmao i dont know most of the terms in genz and only understand mils…..", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:37:20", "owner": "an.an.son.son", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540072088012613, "text": ".... bruh I don't think you actually understand some of the words you're filtering for people. Ohio and Backrooms are not the same? Definitely not as flippant and more usable than Creepy Pasta. I'm confused because half of the phrases you're using aren't nearly as related to each other as you're implying.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:31:20", "owner": "xx_acrillec_xx", "likes": 605}, {"id": 18191849302332218, "text": "I’m gen x  LOL!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:20:40", "owner": "melkharris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976381926949236, "text": "Saving so I know how to talk to my brother😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:16:15", "owner": "anastasia.in.nyc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905331544145579, "text": "We just gonna leave Gen❌️ out", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:14:55", "owner": "katrevanoell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075075086253947, "text": "This is so accurate as an old Gen Z kid (2000). I've used most of the words from the Gen Z and/or the Millenial list throughout my life. The generation Alpha list sound like absolute gibberish to me 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:08:37", "owner": "xx_ginny_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157619137405295, "text": "I'm Gen Xand coildnt work out which was which!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:07:07", "owner": "tillypuss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071141966365500, "text": "Gen Alpha makes no sense, glad Im a millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:04:47", "owner": "stress.less34", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18154897138406605, "text": "Can you make a spreadsheet? Thanks", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:03:38", "owner": "jonathondn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869971012471009, "text": "I thought “ur done👁️👄👁️” was gen z.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:00:21", "owner": "mik2thc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18306043198252748, "text": "This is a public service", "created_at": "2025-11-26T13:57:02", "owner": "ash89moore", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922679077189715, "text": "why tf do i use almost all... bruh", "created_at": "2025-11-26T13:55:16", "owner": "evoxmoon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905439220143026, "text": "Wow, we’ve really evolved backwards 😳", "created_at": "2025-11-26T13:51:31", "owner": "danaustinphoto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086728820490620, "text": "I just got acclimated to 67 (kinda) WHAT TF IS 41?!!?!!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T13:49:04", "owner": "cjjh95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923255923192245, "text": "🤣😂😂my daughter is going to be mad at me for being informed now", "created_at": "2025-11-26T13:44:43", "owner": "msruswims", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865373155438022, "text": "****UNC > OLD HEAD > BOOMER", "created_at": "2025-11-26T13:34:40", "owner": "bodybeautyybeyond", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904993297287265, "text": "You're screwed man, 1984 warned us about translators 😭. In all seriousness, tf are y'all talkin 'bout Gen Alph.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T13:30:26", "owner": "ed.the.unknown", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18333829336210961, "text": "The Rosetta Stone I did not know I needed.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T13:26:11", "owner": "andre_nazur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924203860189976, "text": "What even is 41?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T13:20:52", "owner": "hesardian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065123078413486, "text": "I feel like we let a lot of 1950’s kids down cause we got this shit over flying cars", "created_at": "2025-11-26T13:17:03", "owner": "skittles_lover_512", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931583353130994, "text": "Black millennials & gen x have been using “unc” for decades.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T13:08:15", "owner": "aleciaiswatching", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072878864590580, "text": "OD is optical density.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:59:49", "owner": "summerskyhues", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096521698839073, "text": "Apparently I'm a millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:58:34", "owner": "bader_alemadi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092343283728807, "text": "Alpha needs to stop", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:51:06", "owner": "athena11maria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855771049568227, "text": "on what chrome r u on choom?🙏🏼😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:43:50", "owner": "saboteursoan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011728754684765, "text": "As a millennial, what? The millennial ones sound like when you look up curse words or insults in another language and then when you say them to someone who speaks that language they say \"Yea no one says that ...\"", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:37:24", "owner": "photosbybojan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902021911303680, "text": "This is extremely helpful 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:36:36", "owner": "healthyhappyhippie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058298321284848, "text": "I have never heard half of Gen A slang...half of it don't exist where I live", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:35:13", "owner": "shraddhs_666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983613276762663, "text": "I've never said many of those millenial things and I am a millenial, who said all this?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:34:58", "owner": "amazonangel19922", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103314403679207, "text": "I have never felt like a Gen Z millennial cusper as much as I do right now😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:34:34", "owner": "emberhawthorne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134503837476627, "text": "THANK YOU SO MUCH FOR THIS! I’ve been wondering how to understand each of the recent generation slangs. I definitely need these.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:24:47", "owner": "duckgooseyswan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061933502209962, "text": "I use all of this vocab on the daily", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:17:28", "owner": "imtheowl_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099838012785059, "text": "DONT place the griddy on equal footing with the dougie come on bro 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:16:15", "owner": "rion.blank", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17971665359967679, "text": "Wtf is a 41", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:13:48", "owner": "jamesmoredred", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947780700931301, "text": "@muttons check this out.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:10:06", "owner": "hidayatt_r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086010721824633, "text": "Im a X and millennial cusp, so please e1 for the X era also.. pretty please 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:08:52", "owner": "prakachand", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902753731314436, "text": "I learned a lot", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:07:31", "owner": "jimmyxg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542104477052015, "text": "Insanely hard watch", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:05:31", "owner": "gabriel.thornton23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986341704871098, "text": "Im a 100% zellenial, i use both 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:05:20", "owner": "elainexshoujo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18510963937071616, "text": "As a GenZ, I'd say 69 is still funny", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:05:16", "owner": "5yn_t4x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951943765027069, "text": "Some of these are wrong. Stop spreading false information 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:01:32", "owner": "d2mack94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938320552098448, "text": "Wait does 67 actually mean the same as 69??? 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:54:42", "owner": "quinnlikesgrins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18248590279293564, "text": "Glad for the reference cause this blew me lol", "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:52:52", "owner": "isisfirce", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858510751556789, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:52:05", "owner": "isisfirce", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047057033679317, "text": "Bro, I don't even know what I am anymore- I'm just that potato that got left in a corner and am actively growing a mushroom ring around me to protect what's left of my fragile mental state-", "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:47:55", "owner": "m3spiritvi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025935794782665, "text": "I'm a mix of Millennial and Gen Z for my vocabulary. But also wtf is going on with gen alpha?? That shit makes no sense", "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:47:33", "owner": "domdomb17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961497804859020, "text": "Just yapping gibberish will have me covered in Gen Beta 🥸", "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:46:12", "owner": "moh4wad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059521286253102, "text": "You good mud? 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:40:59", "owner": "tory_phoenix_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081271355142718, "text": "Crazy pasta 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:36:05", "owner": "aifaanazmi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18187161121340752, "text": "Wats shutup?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:29:19", "owner": "korup_hayn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064303694431731, "text": "OD is def old", "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:24:47", "owner": "bonnieboo.jc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898683052341957, "text": "Gen z created all the alpha phrases", "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:20:37", "owner": "gregtheglobal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545678818048734, "text": "6 7 is 69? I respectfully disagree one has no real meaning and one has... anyway cool video by the way :)", "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:16:55", "owner": "p.__.eace", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119708749545408, "text": "I'm like mix of all 🥀", "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:04:15", "owner": "sorry_i_cant_tell_you_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091366940502575, "text": "Gen z better", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:58:56", "owner": "zhrabimmod", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031612694539577, "text": "i’m stuck between genz and millennial somehow", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:58:12", "owner": "herxinwrent", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085999582995805, "text": "So I am mixed between Millenial and Gen Z", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:52:05", "owner": "mr_no_last_name", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18078471524179215, "text": "i use allll 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:46:08", "owner": "ashlichong", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17942888346094454, "text": "goon gen alpha, fap genz", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:39:24", "owner": "kartikey.jpeg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118433623549695, "text": "yo tysm", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:39:10", "owner": "perlasreyna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120038605539127, "text": "I don’t understand any of this , should I be worried!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:35:21", "owner": "ana.melo8.8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079450115180256, "text": "Finally, a translator 😭😭😭💀💀💀", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:27:35", "owner": "queenvividivinity", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071552426057034, "text": "Ohhh this is so useful. Thanks!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:24:17", "owner": "childofthewoodland", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17973242651805934, "text": "I'm in that crazy stage where I'm like half gen z half millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:20:51", "owner": "flinn_volcanic_cheetah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979649043782125, "text": "Am i the only one who thinks gen alpha words sounds ew?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:17:05", "owner": "jazathor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080072612177835, "text": "Thank you 😭😭😭😭😭 my kids 24-9 I be so confused 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:14:54", "owner": "dymetatz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085451480286360, "text": "Thank you for clearing that up", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:13:39", "owner": "wileygofar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981620106921533, "text": "Dam im gen z coded.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:02:39", "owner": "reggie_spectre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020141216790275, "text": "It's giving Shipping Forecast Vibes 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:56:56", "owner": "uktopinfluencer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105170707643408, "text": "Ight gen z is in two halves im in the older half apparently", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:43:46", "owner": "ringer_0001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193211755330910, "text": "OD belongs to millennials", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:35:56", "owner": "filming.bee", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18376625374150536, "text": "Oh my god I'm actually starting to understand now 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:32:45", "owner": "klinelight_x3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925919704157468, "text": "who tf says meat riding? 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:31:02", "owner": "samanthapretor3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032310818530674, "text": "I'm just a foreigner trying to learn a language that keeps adding new words and new meanings to random words....", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:30:10", "owner": "aichan_art", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040407257687337, "text": "Needed this", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:27:40", "owner": "toxicadamj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075646712518079, "text": "This gave me a headache. Stop. Please!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:25:49", "owner": "stormixchi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082926707016026, "text": "People under the age of 35 should just STFU", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:23:25", "owner": "culkinnimportky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103531978589098, "text": "I use a mix of Gen Z and millennial lol", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:14:12", "owner": "nickssocial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072279722041440, "text": "The last year of gen z here (2012), I use every single one of these slangs😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:11:53", "owner": "chlxeamore", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18173168164370807, "text": "I thought it was pronounced \"shweggy\". am i unc?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:07:27", "owner": "_seans_drawins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994147746710753, "text": "Millennials once again thinking they own shi", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:05:50", "owner": "ikki.best.boi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088958392767783, "text": "That's too much", "created_at": "2025-11-26T08:39:32", "owner": "mrbigg151", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18411754165184916, "text": "kill me", "created_at": "2025-11-26T08:32:31", "owner": "vamp1r3.k1ss3s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963932176002536, "text": "Ngl the most accurate one i seen so far", "created_at": "2025-11-26T08:20:03", "owner": "phillippejesse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18382941733147735, "text": "GenZ: Scripted, Alpha: Ai", "created_at": "2025-11-26T08:18:46", "owner": "c00laesthetickid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948133833932229, "text": "WHERE THE HELL DID 41 COME FROM?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T08:13:19", "owner": "_t543_._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18536327827037984, "text": "I had 18 strokes during this video", "created_at": "2025-11-26T08:09:36", "owner": "barrycurious", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18406757521189789, "text": "I grew up to 21 vine and the free shavackadoo", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:48:24", "owner": "diego_egg_c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933987667103809, "text": "i am between Gen Z and Mil", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:47:16", "owner": "korcancer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902668708312642, "text": "Put the fries in the bag is hang it up not lock in", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:43:25", "owner": "darkest_raven", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075225806191529, "text": "Due to how I grew up I understand 90% of these without translation needed", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:39:09", "owner": "puglife42_super", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18409733218187983, "text": "I can’t-", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:34:24", "owner": "dstsf_y4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066434675621330, "text": "What about 1738?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:34:09", "owner": "bryson987419", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135400153478687, "text": "Im a mix of gen z and millennial at most.. I'm a 2006 baby 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:24:42", "owner": "brattybatz06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899587978183464, "text": "Now I understand 6 7 lol. But 21 is funnier", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:19:54", "owner": "gimmenuggiez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18317093479220686, "text": "This is incredibly informational. Thank you", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:17:58", "owner": "samurixxia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873398383377922, "text": "proud to be a mix of gen z and alpha slang", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:09:47", "owner": "st4rl1ng.sk7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302446624251655, "text": "If millennial grey was a post", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:03:39", "owner": "hot_bu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086716178491678, "text": "So…. im all three???", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:03:36", "owner": "fvrzo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095174842871463, "text": "I FORGOT ABT BACKROOMS PLS", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:00:47", "owner": "revivalist.kiara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067998653103651, "text": "Cheugy has been moving about because NO GENERATION wants to claim it 😂 it’s NEVER been a thing", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:55:32", "owner": "kartikey_awasthi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099823876781028, "text": "Ughhh…huh…well… I have learned and unlearned and relearned somehow…😅", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:52:11", "owner": "marinadiaz733", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056620700303936, "text": "This stressed me out", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:50:28", "owner": "lexiloreonyoutube", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18084683417071583, "text": "You explained this so perfect on key on. I don’t know how many videos I’ve watched of this. Thank you so much.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:38:43", "owner": "rosemuny__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104055031635715, "text": "I’m so lost", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:35:01", "owner": "vanayillaswirl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996635493849137, "text": "I need to know where kids now think dogwater is there's. Cuz as a millennial ive said that since 2008", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:31:09", "owner": "n3wportz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071712479053813, "text": "Thank you", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:29:36", "owner": "yagirl_kemani", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098823223830543, "text": "I haven’t heard most of these and why does this just prove I’m in between gen z and millennials! 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:24:31", "owner": "cheese_wheel1105", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062061782207585, "text": "I'm gen z and I don't know all of those words💀😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:14:27", "owner": "frejyamm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159186262403441, "text": "thanks i needed to understand it in my language", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:10:03", "owner": "yorkohno", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869719198471469, "text": "Chad is Chad even if your Gen X haha", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:09:30", "owner": "callmebackdummy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876791236350590, "text": "Thats it, its official im not a millennial anymore. X-ennial it is. Other then 69, all the others were what the little kids said and we made fun of. I cant put what id want for those \"words\" its mostly cursing or words we cant say anymore", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:08:33", "owner": "michealmcneal85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541245304000836, "text": "Hella hurt me 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:07:19", "owner": "toadflax_seeds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892669738362954, "text": "As a millennial, I’m fucking confused…. What are you saying to me 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:58:06", "owner": "itzshellyb__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18369585259084943, "text": "Mils and Gen Z still shaking hands, ok to understand eachothers slang. But sideye Gen Alpha the moment they spout of that nonsense.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:53:17", "owner": "rdoactivekin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970811472969862, "text": "Im a mix of mil and gen z", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:52:22", "owner": "nikaziart", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18107372944714530, "text": "Thanks for the education. I think Gen Z/millennial share a lot of these", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:50:34", "owner": "eddieohg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900340153186341, "text": "Bruh dog water has been around before millineal you got that one dead fucking wrong", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:39:07", "owner": "kairm02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096838777658300, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:38:33", "owner": "c.take_phlight", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924044917176064, "text": "My brain hurts. But thank you.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:35:57", "owner": "whereisalexpin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047460344443569, "text": "i’m Gen Z + Mil 100%", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:34:17", "owner": "thekatscave", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959978935007579, "text": "I feel the gen z is the dumbest.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:33:15", "owner": "bakazable", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18207141448315742, "text": "Dog shit", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:31:49", "owner": "lsx_blakout", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974348127958170, "text": "Man…can I just use grody and fly? I love Gen X slang more than this fuckass Zoomer English", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:31:13", "owner": "alice_the_2ss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18163631272382834, "text": "Sending this to family gc so we can understand each other 😭😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:16:15", "owner": "artist_rediet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096172000850016, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:12:54", "owner": "triple_b03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061223477236928, "text": "I needed this 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:10:50", "owner": "hclau325", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071651315591596, "text": "Creepy Pasta?! wtf. What millennial says that?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:10:25", "owner": "jay_adim", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079653127917939, "text": "Bruh", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:09:59", "owner": "bossbabybritt.millionaire_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061943906209202, "text": "Dog Water? I refuse to accept that as Alpha, I watched Ssundee.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:08:23", "owner": "le3_r0se", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18380867134150923, "text": "Popeyes is selling Freddy Fazburg Chicken or whatnot . What does that mean?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:02:13", "owner": "danpokmon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098697022827191, "text": "Wtf is creepy pasta. No.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T04:59:53", "owner": "d.a.n.i.c.a.marie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059248604254787, "text": "Can I have a chart?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T04:52:55", "owner": "nicki__b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098317915749126, "text": "So they on drugs?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T04:44:43", "owner": "official_queensvalue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18201259330317611, "text": "Wuut? most of what you said is Genz vocab is actually Millennial vocab.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T04:39:14", "owner": "_sanjnakhanna_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100891927705206, "text": "If millenial is 69, who is 42??", "created_at": "2025-11-26T04:35:37", "owner": "tiger_goes_meow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087441275476370, "text": "It’s giving power bottom", "created_at": "2025-11-26T04:33:16", "owner": "aidan_vela", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043506347703592, "text": "Being an millennial, I got introduced to new words of my gen", "created_at": "2025-11-26T04:31:27", "owner": "a_mruthyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875765737444687, "text": "I don’t care 🤷🏾‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T04:31:20", "owner": "reese_1014d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864969613514422, "text": "someome like this so that i can remember", "created_at": "2025-11-26T04:27:27", "owner": "moretropical", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18119631853546659, "text": "21. I thought it was 1738.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T04:21:51", "owner": "official_jesus.340", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137105950461516, "text": "CAN I JUST PLS HAVE MY HONORARY ZILLENNIAL BADGE NOW???😭😭 I understand everything those and older ones say, BUT I CANT WITH THE NEW ONES💀💀", "created_at": "2025-11-26T04:19:18", "owner": "chaotic_flowers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102708118710826, "text": "Thanks", "created_at": "2025-11-26T04:16:53", "owner": "natural_mfkn__beautee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033261776729837, "text": "Thank you so much for finally explaining what these words mean to me!!! I live under a social media and brainrot rock so I’m glad I understand.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T04:15:31", "owner": "snowflek555", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120243931545942, "text": "These vids definitely help when you're a teacher and a new word gets thrown at you by these abusive kids😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T04:15:12", "owner": "j.f.s.1997", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061455074531424, "text": "As a millennial, I can say I’ve never said or heard of ‘creepy pasta’ 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T04:14:33", "owner": "pennylane13_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925276135177617, "text": "Creepypasta is NOT Millenial. That’s Gen Z", "created_at": "2025-11-26T04:13:14", "owner": "bigpppatty", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17962445912856402, "text": "Im a mix of genz and millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-26T04:07:11", "owner": "chxrrae", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17920606167198834, "text": "Savage should never go out of style. Hits all points with accuracy lol 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T04:00:35", "owner": "tango919", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071209601057205, "text": "I feel like a lot of the \"gen z\" stuff is millennial stuff, no? Or is this only targeting elder millennials? I was using a lot of the gen z stuff when I was in high school and I was born '95 so I'm confused", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:58:31", "owner": "tierneymichele", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997779249845733, "text": "Omg I can finally understand the kids!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:54:12", "owner": "marilia.srp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989573550886240, "text": "This post. Is Gay. Shut up. 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:53:41", "owner": "panicismyjam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993691623717738, "text": "Mixture of Gen Z and Mil", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:52:26", "owner": "_mossbunny_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083783573098608, "text": "i'm gen z and i have to say millennial vocabulary is better than the rest 😭🙏🏿", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:51:59", "owner": "wild_type23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865454593433879, "text": "Gen z and I don’t know what the fuck back rooms, fry tax and acting cursed is 🥀🥀🥀also dog water is gen z not alpha", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:49:41", "owner": "mcchiggerr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981562020923885, "text": "I need to make this into a spreadsheet so I can understand my kid", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:49:33", "owner": "lilith.rising19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939907357095053, "text": "Ok - gen z translation - why this make so much sense now?? Haha😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:48:07", "owner": "ajlee149", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027422273769896, "text": "Honestly proud that I knew almost none of any of these “words.”", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:46:13", "owner": "agirlandherdoxie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113750833579500, "text": "Wtf is meat riding", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:39:53", "owner": "emmasobo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902560939166708, "text": "Sybau? ShG", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:38:22", "owner": "realjesssimpson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086903270489048, "text": "“Imagine”", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:37:57", "owner": "omni.k_underscore", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099440620748299, "text": "Gen Z and mil practically used the same ones for a minute just do old vs new slang bro", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:35:11", "owner": "trndude", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17913805341236888, "text": "When can we tell them what od actually means?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:31:45", "owner": "nicola_gledhil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993399000707588, "text": "is Ohio really the backrooms?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:29:58", "owner": "tarynasuta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18194426449332307, "text": "Please tell me this isn’t real… PLEASE…\nI understand nothing as a millennial.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:27:37", "owner": "redpoppylife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081575360113806, "text": "I needed that", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:27:15", "owner": "kitty_nava540", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034534790725134, "text": "Ew", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:26:49", "owner": "sebastianbagnall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054963833329646, "text": "How do I have all???? Mostly gen z and millennium tho ngl (2000 baby so lost gen)", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:26:03", "owner": "shaved__kiwi__bandito", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900661417325904, "text": "Somehow this made things make more sense for me thank you 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:24:15", "owner": "sarah_rasavanh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086497288968142, "text": "Wait, as a NYer we used “OD son” and I’m a millennial 😮", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:19:26", "owner": "sojayelicious", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006447632659121, "text": "Idk how I feel about being the last on the list now… 🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:18:40", "owner": "jessthegypsy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067065512526543, "text": "Aura points is swag not street cred 🙄", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:18:33", "owner": "mezzcalghost", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864150043524727, "text": "you got alpha and chad backwards i think", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:16:48", "owner": "hexa.folia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905895547291509, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:14:22", "owner": "axlhmzv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085534436049474, "text": "Someone needs to study this for linguistic purposes", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:10:13", "owner": "tenleyannbrady", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965476761843280, "text": "What is 41?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:08:51", "owner": "10ktico", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926395780029699, "text": "My head hurts 😵‍💫😆", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:08:42", "owner": "vivianralena", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17865437298432860, "text": "I refuse to believe creepypasta is millennial 😭 Cryptid maybe?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:05:29", "owner": "sapphicpunk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18109810873544996, "text": "i first heard dogwater from a fellow millennial like 6 years ago but otherwise this is spot on", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:05:00", "owner": "dmndxdave", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905792296296919, "text": "My head hurts lol", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:04:14", "owner": "thegreatadventuresofmy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868000420416207, "text": "Dog water is making a comeback, my moms mom used to call everything she didn’t like “absolute dog water” which was near everything!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:04:09", "owner": "elder.super.dad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886471201399865, "text": "This video would kill a Victorian child", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:03:52", "owner": "bunwhittle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100195480691067, "text": "I'm so millennial i thought those were not slang words 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:02:25", "owner": "makeup.catqueen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851294962555782, "text": "How am I gen z & mil at the same time im 26", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:00:35", "owner": "j.j.beauchamp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18190923307327904, "text": "my head hurts 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:58:51", "owner": "britney.autumn222", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952839010043305, "text": "Omg lol finally a translation!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:58:50", "owner": "eco_android", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034133687738397, "text": "Amazing", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:58:06", "owner": "behkirc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045734594472318, "text": "someone please put me out of my misery", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:56:30", "owner": "muvasensei", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18087377308804022, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:52:18", "owner": "seljimi1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033016049739873, "text": "This confirms. I AM millennial and no@one can tell me other wise", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:49:06", "owner": "gasser831", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079113515123635, "text": "didn’t u post this a couple days ago? 👀@milarhodes.official", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:48:03", "owner": "colleen_mcintyre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865418470434067, "text": "Thank you lool", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:45:43", "owner": "tsuingayin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923962024081885, "text": "So Gen Z makes no sense to me but alpha totally does.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:45:23", "owner": "icalldibsonthis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135202903464993, "text": "What the actual fuck 🤣 alpha slang is WILD", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:40:32", "owner": "g_propes7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065787491143901, "text": "Ain't no way dog water is alpha", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:38:24", "owner": "gravity_squared", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18107024356616817, "text": "0 of these still make sense", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:37:42", "owner": "mirandarobasky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919851457084165, "text": "Maybe I am a millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:34:38", "owner": "extinguishingx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879439048332784, "text": "That means you're getting old😂 your mom said the same thing about your generation as well", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:29:44", "owner": "zachguilbeaux", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856589533512577, "text": "How did I get the vocab of all three 🚶", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:29:31", "owner": "kie.ixx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18513638485068580, "text": "Guys, I think I'm Alpha, Gen Z, and Mil 😅😅😅", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:27:50", "owner": "luckyrrul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396649396120363, "text": "My brain hurts 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:27:33", "owner": "jayldunne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871819873463904, "text": "Help why am I more millennial than Gen Z 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:27:31", "owner": "her_saimaness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972751710796779, "text": "My number was 42 as a millenial (hitchhiker's guide to the galaxy)", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:26:17", "owner": "ar_suner_gwad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063004640565990, "text": "So obvious Alphas are Millennials kids", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:24:23", "owner": "yasmoolak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879454066333848, "text": "Gen Z and Millennials have the same vocabulary 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:23:27", "owner": "weirdobymaplest", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084876656084825, "text": "Wtf is Alpha", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:19:00", "owner": "maqthebarber", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17910359577256382, "text": "You better not be lying", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:17:52", "owner": "kristina.luise", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988067091913414, "text": "Im.sorry...Freddy frazz whewt!?!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:09:52", "owner": "o.yin.ye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880248256323754, "text": "Wait, Chad is gen alpha ? 🤨", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:07:27", "owner": "___.maude.___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080645672139701, "text": "As a millennial, I’ve never heard any of this.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:01:35", "owner": "heythatscali", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921096097194785, "text": "I've been wondering what sibow meant for 6 mo!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:57:59", "owner": "lioness223", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18377027722158905, "text": "Never had i felt a generational pain of being part of two gens", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:52:06", "owner": "willwow2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979419744782121, "text": "but it’s not “ sybau “ it’s “ sybau “ .", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:46:35", "owner": "inipunyakia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057740171289912, "text": "Put the fries in the bag and lock in are not the same pookie 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:46:17", "owner": "moonlitbunniie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082103128886905, "text": "A lot of these are very loose", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:44:46", "owner": "gigawex", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098516242691529, "text": "these are yt versions.. sorry", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:40:59", "owner": "2thurlzah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075386918188998, "text": "I don't know what language is these are but I speak English 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:38:26", "owner": "aio.nix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101000230738066, "text": "I'm sorry, gen z gets credit for Freddy fazbear I'll die on this rock", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:38:08", "owner": "oh.im.bleeding", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18289970944302972, "text": "What in thr brain rot is this. Lord i was born in thr early 90's and still dont understand  this all.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:37:17", "owner": "allie_aloysia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048320891430197, "text": "Wait slow down I’m taking notes 📝", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:33:35", "owner": "yukisara2023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989962731899510, "text": "I feel like 1738 is more comparable to 67 for gen z and alpha", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:32:01", "owner": "haaisoj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102147949679123, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:26:13", "owner": "hort0nhearsawho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852158314548357, "text": "been saying dog water since before gen alpha was even born wtf is this list", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:24:47", "owner": "ian.santillan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111857773523729, "text": "That means i am mixed up 😭😭🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:24:38", "owner": "lolbo234", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108374869619533, "text": "I want to kms with the way language is evolving into shit", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:24:37", "owner": "painted_succubus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951276781022841, "text": "I’m truly a Gen Z/millennial cusp and this proves it", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:18:05", "owner": "nataliecundickk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353756395206321, "text": "I’m 41 years old and never said any of this crap lol", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:18:02", "owner": "dpeterson8884", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18163669726387698, "text": "Freddy Fazbearing...bro what-", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:15:54", "owner": "7arad0x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945660856076845, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:13:32", "owner": "lochielmacdonald", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096170935847500, "text": "Aren't some of these wrong? Like Creepy Pasta and Vibe?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:12:19", "owner": "7arad0x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134231563469036, "text": "I love this", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:11:39", "owner": "hannaewr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18191341390331020, "text": "Thank you for the translations", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:10:25", "owner": "coffeebxtch1220", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182726851346171, "text": "Gen z and mil s are great bruv. Wtf is alpha ? Like they sound wack", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:10:13", "owner": "sicktowndude", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918499150071850, "text": "Ohio Backrooms Creepy Pasta now hold on those are just real things not slang Ohio is like a place where nothing makes sense and The Backrooms is a horror concept that itself is a Creepy Pasta?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:08:10", "owner": "7arad0x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005330081667255, "text": "Missed rizz", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:05:32", "owner": "baby.stephh__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18195912526322901, "text": "Can you do this backwards", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:04:30", "owner": "waklc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18174898084364798, "text": "I can’t imagine a Gen X man wasting his time on shit like this back in the day.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:03:58", "owner": "arrozefeijao29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082962871872679, "text": "See but Gen Z and Mil share lingo tho", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:01:50", "owner": "7arad0x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037486379715692, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:00:44", "owner": "bennybenbenjamin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851005381595215, "text": "Thanks😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:00:40", "owner": "imhismommie2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085059890003797, "text": "Alpha is so cringe oh my god like huh what are these sayings they sound like a 4 year old who's been vaping", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:56:48", "owner": "sebbguevara", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18082800566028542, "text": "Wtf is creepy pasta", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:56:27", "owner": "tim_please", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855474436522844, "text": "I am.... learning so much", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:52:21", "owner": "archeological.mystery_23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161855689401357, "text": "This is not all true 😭😭 please consult actual people from these gens 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:51:19", "owner": "justjakingit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876442294442217, "text": "Gen Alpha slang is Actually Gen Z’ s , we just dropped the trending word and move onto the next while Gen Alpa will milk it till the end of it.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:49:13", "owner": "l_thetruth_l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088349260786587, "text": "I'm still confused, even after watching this video.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:46:18", "owner": "carolynmuxen", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18059160272268165, "text": "Ohhhhhhhhhhhh", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:43:21", "owner": "whenthestewissus", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18113481541587521, "text": "Thank you", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:38:32", "owner": "jack_l3m0nz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084706769065837, "text": "26 year old millennial I'll never be Gen Z 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:35:44", "owner": "czam99", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076129366979910, "text": "At least millennial lingo makes sense", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:34:59", "owner": "_ladykat94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18245643814293710, "text": "Guess it was different in Florida", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:34:42", "owner": "ryan_c137", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995226150849085, "text": "We are gradually becoming slow", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:33:52", "owner": "doctor.gorilla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120601588533700, "text": "Tf is 41", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:33:43", "owner": "mrhitthathoe710", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062529707444944, "text": "This… helps so much… as soon as I got over the stroke, thank you for this video 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:33:18", "owner": "sky_yurisaki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079956605177151, "text": "Thank you for the translations king 👑", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:29:06", "owner": "nicoleskey", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18060942620541620, "text": "You can’t change fry tax that was the one rule…", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:26:48", "owner": "ur.boiiii.esteban", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383735878144929, "text": "Skibidi might have been dank in Gen Z (or brainrot at least were dank memes)", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:26:15", "owner": "mundaniness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087051706801164, "text": "Omg creepypasta", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:25:43", "owner": "luxurientes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18399617257132416, "text": "I think aura was swag in Gen Z", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:25:27", "owner": "mundaniness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18437395612102937, "text": "I’m so millennial apparently", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:23:04", "owner": "m._.murphy16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080035376150636, "text": "Funny af how millennials come up with a lot of these words but some how they belong to alpha. 67, twin, glazing all words millennials made famous", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:21:56", "owner": "_powerful", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111508336608082, "text": "Never thought as a Gen Z I'd feel this old this soon", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:20:08", "owner": "justcallmeshimanto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930025942138492, "text": "There’s a couple missed translations in there", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:19:55", "owner": "sullyboy89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18351272770203414, "text": "Millennials don’t say that shit 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:16:40", "owner": "gblockridah9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135081337464663, "text": "I am millenial who, according to you, doesn’t speak millenial", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:15:33", "owner": "voxel_bunny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058323173280371, "text": "FINALLY someone who explained this stuff. I try to stay ok par with the slang and memes but I'm 22 and start to feel old whenever I don't get some of the new stuff 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:14:23", "owner": "the._.wandering._.bard", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17969723450974028, "text": "You must be a caveman", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:13:16", "owner": "the_white_rhino_747", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987471081875333, "text": "Thank you", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:13:02", "owner": "brig_man34", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051353660364502, "text": "...fucking hell, gen alpha are fu ked", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:12:54", "owner": "imogen_tranter", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17920547541198778, "text": "I’m way older than I thought I was", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:12:10", "owner": "melissadelcher", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970505409969366, "text": "I need this in 0.5 speed", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:11:18", "owner": "_emma.l.smith_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302656663253423, "text": "Actually all the Alpha slang is total and utter bullshit. Youre just giving them meanings that arent there. I have gen Alpha nephews and neices, they eill all tell you they dont know what any of it means, they just say it bc their friends are saying it.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:08:19", "owner": "nanyab2021", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146221915448073, "text": "Why is this normalised?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:08:12", "owner": "jasynsm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18380755204151626, "text": "I’m a mix of the last 2 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:07:18", "owner": "its_iizzyy_mo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905281126143290, "text": "67 is not 69", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:04:51", "owner": "cherryella98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890665930381752, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:04:28", "owner": "am_rocks24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051287882342413, "text": "what about 1738", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:02:50", "owner": "wam_bam_heres_pam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090362416928857, "text": "I’m gen z and I don’t use half of these lol. What is 21", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:59:54", "owner": "rarely.sunny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081304778326905, "text": "Wt is 21 omg", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:58:53", "owner": "riyatortilla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878515975431887, "text": "Freddy fazbearing? Bruh naw thass it were packing up the English language", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:55:49", "owner": "jake_ploch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854972056528032, "text": "How am I all 3 - Chronically online prognosis", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:51:33", "owner": "benji_burn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083735392844953, "text": "I am Gen Z, and I have never said Meat  riding. WTF?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:51:29", "owner": "therose_fae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932760825997071, "text": "69 was gen z too lmfao", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:43:51", "owner": "moonmxiden_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098900647698843, "text": "I’m so solidly Gen Z except I’ve never heard “backrooms”, “fry tax”, or “meat riding” before wtf", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:43:50", "owner": "avivcohav", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884609992407701, "text": "I’m all 3 generations 😮", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:42:41", "owner": "i.am.me.xoxo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065327813411227, "text": "I am Gen Z but understand both Gen Z's, obviously, and Millennials' slang words.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:38:45", "owner": "ethan_4nth0ny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057093425306252, "text": "@genzhiphop u agree?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:37:04", "owner": "djleach518", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079263284132952, "text": "Bruh", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:33:29", "owner": "sergi4011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969110262825260, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:31:07", "owner": "everyonesfavasshole", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921684562191641, "text": "You can definitely tell I'm a mid to older genz with an older gen z sister cause I have said most of the millennial slang, a little over half of genz slang and almost none of the gen alpha  slang.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:30:55", "owner": "kmsenger23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298789999284515, "text": "This all feels like I had a stroke and im counted as a millennial.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:30:25", "owner": "northern_patric", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976413756793038, "text": "Wtf is old head.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:29:01", "owner": "just_kait", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18316774075219818, "text": "half the \"gen alpha\" slang is 4chan-speak from genz / millenials", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:25:36", "owner": "vrosm14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083164841024837, "text": "Sims language", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:17:00", "owner": "_leaanni_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18112600090583712, "text": "Being a Gen Z means understanding some of the Alphas but all of the millennials", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:14:44", "owner": "littlemurph8", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061987658197676, "text": "Me a hybrid of millennial and gen z", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:14:22", "owner": "lovedejanee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144350464444444, "text": "I hate that I use all of these expect 6 7", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:10:59", "owner": "acidtripsystem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870738979470109, "text": "What even is 41 😭 theres a 41 now????", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:06:32", "owner": "_qarinaaaaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072648797201060, "text": "Gen z here and I use all three. Makes things real interesting but I can also relate and talk to each generation without issue", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:03:38", "owner": "sammy.kinns", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079006438935455, "text": "this was an anthropological journey", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:58:06", "owner": "psychic.bananaa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066073079529916, "text": "Someone said dog water to me yesterday and I assumed they meant dog shit and went on with my day. I had no idea this was a thing. Can someone explain what it means lmao", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:54:25", "owner": "jo.rdy.n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18181262506361219, "text": "Wasn't glow up millennial?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:52:02", "owner": "rach.m62", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070227494076828, "text": "This was helpful", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:51:16", "owner": "shanice.pinson", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17991770588897152, "text": "MY BRAIN", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:50:00", "owner": "greg2715_backup", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001187801832630, "text": "i use all of these because i’m chronically online", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:46:17", "owner": "strawbwycakes", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17909317137122001, "text": "41?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:43:18", "owner": "bejoo.comics", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114166699600365, "text": "Well shit. Thanks for calling me old. 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:41:05", "owner": "duhitsjoseduh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862811725456558, "text": "Omg I just realised how much millennial I am minus the odd one here and there where I actually prefer to use the Gen Z way of speaking", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:39:31", "owner": "cherry.adhd", "likes": 456}, {"id": 17919106479207657, "text": "I understand more gen z then I'd like to admit. But even then some of it i only got from the mil clue. Then I understood almost exactly no gen alpha", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:38:16", "owner": "joeybutterflyman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953796253029469, "text": "I recognize all of the gen z except for \"fry tax\"", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:37:40", "owner": "sleepless3122", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074073506016555, "text": "I’m convinced you’re just trolling with some of these terms lol", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:37:37", "owner": "foodie_foodzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18351340987163714, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:36:36", "owner": "zoki.in.hh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105932734649735, "text": "Everyone from Gen z wants to be a mil", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:30:35", "owner": "foldedchairs00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904281349298416, "text": "OD is east coast millennial btw. Hella is west coast", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:29:23", "owner": "brown_skn_lady", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882155293307944, "text": "The fries one is wrong", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:28:02", "owner": "zuk2.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18350344258207787, "text": "You forgot 1738", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:27:34", "owner": "asser6065", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081108407514369, "text": "Adding 1738 to gen z", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:23:15", "owner": "sam.257", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087181069816805, "text": "What did he say that was wrong 🗣️", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:21:07", "owner": "cwb00th_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108208993721672, "text": "Never even heard of 41", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:18:26", "owner": "epsilongecko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090321967920188, "text": "this is actually helpful thank you LMAOAO", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:17:22", "owner": "molly.rvc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084059264112155, "text": "Twitch - Vine - OG Youtube", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:16:45", "owner": "epsilongecko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058425773298535, "text": "But „wrap it up“ and „lock in“ have different meanings though", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:12:59", "owner": "marinathink", "likes": 28}, {"id": 17983942406920885, "text": "This is inaccurate", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:11:32", "owner": "rickwright113", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337567990237735, "text": "I’m pretty sure Gen Z was using dog water before the gen alpha atleast I know I was", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:11:24", "owner": "mister_bloodbath_69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987433728910804, "text": "This video is the Rosetta Stone of generational slang", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:11:10", "owner": "haylee.dd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967556754986675, "text": "I believe many people confuse Millennials with Gen Z and beyond", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:10:18", "owner": "rome_antic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090856216741593, "text": "The game", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:09:54", "owner": "fatcastro19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030728807547162, "text": "Odee is nyc slang when did gen alpha take it💔", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:03:35", "owner": "vedile", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18089371885755946, "text": "Thank you 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:01:13", "owner": "rae_drop_of_sunshine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062059289213388, "text": "Doing the lords work cause I have NO idea what anyone is saying anymore xoxo an aging millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:56:50", "owner": "austintylermckennacarroll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091076755899739, "text": "Ah good something I can send my niece and mother thank you very helpful", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:55:27", "owner": "a_faux_papa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924150820169146, "text": "Since when does lock in mean wrap it up", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:52:56", "owner": "lukapejoovic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083860837842713, "text": "As a millennial never heard of any of that", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:52:10", "owner": "mattimous89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18276738286304940, "text": "Am I having a stroke?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:52:08", "owner": "florencec_renard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892519852368539, "text": "feel like you’re done and stfu are the other way", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:50:58", "owner": "justsianxo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028337090772057, "text": "I don't think most of these were right but I don't know shit about alfa", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:50:10", "owner": "wanbeltran", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123586948524672, "text": "Am I a millennial?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:49:39", "owner": "juanbope84", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18403980412192845, "text": "As a millennial, I never said any of that… sooo ya no", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:46:14", "owner": "smr_roldan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18435830806099035, "text": "Wow I used to watch you on YouTube like a decade ago crazy that you just popped up", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:45:37", "owner": "menino_jake", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083527529030216, "text": "As a millennial, we don’t say half that. “Dudebro”? “Fry tax”? Nah we ain’t say that crap.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:44:28", "owner": "jeremy.d.warren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059248088266075, "text": "What the hell is 6/7, 41; 21 or 69?! 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:43:09", "owner": "justbiibii", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087489971291750, "text": "Zillenial here", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:38:00", "owner": "hygynks316", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064070606572268, "text": "What do u call a technically GenZ with the vocab and mindset of a millennial?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:36:42", "owner": "ig_hoaxen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927316591153264, "text": "If you don't get it, you're not a chronically online baddie. Enjoy the grass you touch 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:29:03", "owner": "nyblfans", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18125417452519597, "text": "You are the translator I've needed", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:27:48", "owner": "chonky.uwu.paw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091575775731622, "text": "Bro wut", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:26:44", "owner": "haver_kat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937411927099175, "text": "this gave me brain damage", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:26:41", "owner": "_turntsnacko_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857342788503659, "text": "I’ve never used old head a day in my life as a millennial. I’ve only used boomer. What is an old head? I’m west coast though is that an east coast slang thing?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:26:01", "owner": "nerdqueenneya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18375496522158279, "text": "tf is Freddy fazbearing", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:24:13", "owner": "lou.jug", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950306227020673, "text": "Alpha is  the worst I ever. We made 3 words 1 word. They make 1 word 3 words.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:22:38", "owner": "shaun_dbandit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172241338328922, "text": "What is y pasta though I’ve never heard of that", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:22:04", "owner": "jinsu.ent", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088645523069300, "text": "Mid erly gen z 04 and I sund like a bad mix of Melina and z😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:21:53", "owner": "the_mini_biker04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891879646371352, "text": "My brain hurts 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:20:00", "owner": "pbatistaf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062891684191347, "text": "I can’t wait to by that embarrassing old guy on the street that hates on clankers, bangs on about how we need another good pandemic, and jives to RunDMC, fat boy slim and the offspring on my zune", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:14:41", "owner": "lexleon101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082079902887337, "text": "Ok I was born 2000 and I have heard like all of these Gen Z / millennial ones except backrooms / creepy pasta", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:12:23", "owner": "kate.hines", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058772738259295, "text": "Never been more confused in my life.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:11:12", "owner": "inga_schwartz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17950642469996490, "text": "WHAT?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:10:09", "owner": "bgmaverick21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071507621599599, "text": "I can’t", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:09:49", "owner": "noseltzer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083510006120583, "text": "A lot of the millennials terms were never said", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:09:32", "owner": "eldvd88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902062807316902, "text": "I am from 2007 (genz) but I speak like a mil😅", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:09:05", "owner": "gavri_r_l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105745480572887, "text": "No one has ever said “old head”", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:07:04", "owner": "emmlemon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083408837031100, "text": "This is actually so helpful 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:04:07", "owner": "vixknacks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18385355053179954, "text": "Can we please reconsider making a new era for people born between 97-05? Because our childhood was with the millennials and our teen years was with younger gen zs…..", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:00:34", "owner": "lpv10_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086904403801423, "text": "69 means something though- not sure about 6,7 or 21 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:58:34", "owner": "ms_lou_lou82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096617593658283, "text": "There's a little discrepancies but uhh okay 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:56:34", "owner": "inwikz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025846946777222, "text": "You did it backwards- Brain can’t compute do Gen X , mil, gen z then alpha. Clearly", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:52:22", "owner": "pepita7o2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987942189871697, "text": "As a Zillenial, I am honored to have luved in both times. Perfectly balanced as all things should be 🗿⚖️✨️", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:51:29", "owner": "meganmendoza2913", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064147262450585, "text": "Maybe now this Gen X can have a conversation with her 7-year-old grandson and understand what the hell that turds saying!😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:47:27", "owner": "ycantwealljustgetalong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062289107626186, "text": "Imagine you are 29 years old gen z and they still think you act like 12 years gen alpha bruh. 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:43:59", "owner": "anwarhanyanwar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18325585489246215, "text": "WTF IS ALL THIS SHIT . ALL SAME WTF IS NEW FUCKONG LANGUAGE.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:40:58", "owner": "saed_293", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106392475652340, "text": "I'm a Mil and I like Gen Z vocab better", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:39:14", "owner": "auresius", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304139455250494, "text": "6 7", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:38:59", "owner": "evil_vegan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103802104659302, "text": "How about “Domain Expansion”?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:37:00", "owner": "gengakusha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031651313540997, "text": "I learned something", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:36:19", "owner": "mikey___don", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915402520247965, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:36:09", "owner": "mikey___don", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916017715220320, "text": "Gen X listening to this feeling like I somehow got shifted to the wrong timeline.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:35:17", "owner": "teedoublep", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958213527881300, "text": "Please go slower, I am just a millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:34:17", "owner": "adscalis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049279334682760, "text": "I'm confused...lol 😆", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:34:08", "owner": "redangel365", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156292696404553, "text": "Tf I’m a millennial and I don’t know half of them dumb ssa millennial words. Ughhhh, them words did not come from poverty ridden areas I promise you that", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:31:24", "owner": "serenebelisle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301922008265151, "text": "JESUS LOVES YOU GUYS!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:30:24", "owner": "ok_cool7g", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17929103568152871, "text": "This is dumb as hell. Just stop please", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:30:20", "owner": "da_jammer312", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159442075394555, "text": "Wtf is this guy talking about.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:27:25", "owner": "thelawrider93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881355964422716, "text": "Pretty sure you've made most of that up", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:25:19", "owner": "anthonymcginty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143492095445509, "text": "I’m the tail end of millennials that are too young to be “one of them” but too old to be gen z and do not understand a word they say.. Had my 21st before the pandemic, was born before 9/11.. I remember Kmart and sears. And had a childhood outside.. anyone else relate to the in between generations? 98 baby here.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:23:49", "owner": "beautykiller17", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18080545121277636, "text": "Right.....and next week what will 6 7 be", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:23:49", "owner": "michaelhenchbarger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085038794321169, "text": "😵‍💫", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:23:23", "owner": "marz_xp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867962161421095, "text": "Ah 21 I haven’t heard that in ages 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:22:49", "owner": "micaellastone_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17896772484347938, "text": "What is fannum /fry tax", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:21:05", "owner": "ajahisart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092364346730929, "text": "This helped me", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:18:49", "owner": "adam_schlosberg", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17876493393355993, "text": "Alr bro some of these is Z and giving them away to alpha...", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:13:11", "owner": "xviaca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902198755314626, "text": "What the hell is this crap", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:12:18", "owner": "kevmongru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095964652837400, "text": "03 and thank you", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:11:46", "owner": "oliviafelicelli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072508379052384, "text": "Wtf is 41", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:11:35", "owner": "jordan.scott.blackmore", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376796479151194, "text": "Didn’t nail the millennial slang 🤨", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:09:56", "owner": "millennialstereotype", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141422680455411, "text": "Ghosted* is for Millennials on the last one btw.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:06:51", "owner": "markathus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066695147526961, "text": "The way I needed this video 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:06:40", "owner": "theelovedeluxe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971824131816806, "text": "wtf", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:06:26", "owner": "focus_manz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909022234268017, "text": "Meat riding... 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:03:51", "owner": "23valentinesday", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053944322327328, "text": "Didn’t know I needed this but thank you so much!!", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:56:10", "owner": "meg33348", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865961992506956, "text": "My brain hurts", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:54:21", "owner": "helen13.88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143404111442886, "text": "Wtf i spent 7 years learning English", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:52:47", "owner": "h.a.n93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100570969672741, "text": "What millenial you spoke to? Never said any of those", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:52:27", "owner": "coco_janelle08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18339291946228253, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:50:58", "owner": "lidiarrose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001837274835189, "text": "Jesus. Is this what it felt like for our parents??", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:50:29", "owner": "vanessapaisanavalente", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329896279212840, "text": "Am I a boomer? Hahaha I know nearly none of these except the Alpha stuff cause kids teach me. I’m old af.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:48:48", "owner": "milos.momma.lo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064787147433111, "text": "we were using dog water back like 10 years ago (as an older gen z borderline millennial lol)", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:46:42", "owner": "rileyvandev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954746839032069, "text": "I feel like I’m old 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:45:03", "owner": "sibahle_z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083420210033566, "text": "Feels like someone amid mixing up millenial for gen X… and giving credit on some of these to gen z for millenial slang.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:43:06", "owner": "shane.tyler.manigan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020214545787866, "text": "U tripping", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:42:28", "owner": "tooski.iii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18163817917381486, "text": "Gen z is def creepy pasta", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:41:04", "owner": "gucci.ajk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074769764191043, "text": "Stop dragging your words", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:36:52", "owner": "tristynology", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073606607014935, "text": "tf is alpha on….", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:36:28", "owner": "froyo___o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087311315488558, "text": "i just learned so much lmao", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:35:32", "owner": "hannahle.96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877285915433460, "text": "I swear this new stupid Gen Alpha sounds like somebody having a seizure", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:34:52", "owner": "felyeffyperez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947369418936006, "text": "Glazing is also gen z", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:33:08", "owner": "s.p.muller_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901325746318565, "text": "WTF is no millennial 🙆🏽‍♂️ it's a text based abbreviation, they didn't have smartphones", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:32:22", "owner": "s.p.muller_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865953847502279, "text": "A lot of the Gen Z and Millenial slang crossover or are interchangeable", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:31:20", "owner": "adahnnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086056447973973, "text": "Chat is aslp gen z, we used to do W's in da chat", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:30:58", "owner": "s.p.muller_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18513243148066776, "text": "Umm, Chad is gen z, it's been around for like 2-3 years bro😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:29:33", "owner": "s.p.muller_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002747387823962, "text": "To the people saying gen alpha slang makes no sense, you're just wrong. From a gen z who grew up millennial, most of these do make sense if you just think for a second.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:28:49", "owner": "qrannbyrn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030615404746582, "text": "I’m stuck in the twilight zone between stuck between millennial and gen z 🤣\nI’m supposed to gen z but talk and act like a millennial 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:26:03", "owner": "kate43019", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848828896601281, "text": "Based on birth date I am Gen Z. Based on the world I'm Gen Fucked. Based on this.....no fuckin clue", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:25:21", "owner": "straightknots", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947175651936249, "text": "Hold the phone y got ur eras off", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:23:36", "owner": "johnbell9454", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065998094431704, "text": "wtf", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:21:54", "owner": "svgerichy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107888077617733, "text": "What if, now here me out, I was born in 2005 and NONE of that made any sense", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:17:43", "owner": "karlerl.harriman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092031373901253, "text": "I’m a mix of all three", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:17:13", "owner": "kennidee_lee_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109103107616516, "text": "Stfu... Not a millennial thing? Lmfao", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:15:34", "owner": "luke_kalliantasis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061676300209184, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:15:28", "owner": "yasaman_.07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084120641094006, "text": "Our brains are gone", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:13:32", "owner": "illuspectrum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867543076486391, "text": "Honestly, Millennials used OD. Took all the good and created a whole buncha bad", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:12:01", "owner": "fit4hank", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083387278849958, "text": "STFU and yer done should be switched", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:11:39", "owner": "11nelo11", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073834385251876, "text": "Simlish be like:", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:10:10", "owner": "vinevenom", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17954476743034723, "text": "Most of this is just AAVE 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:09:59", "owner": "flicka.nip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064823273437687, "text": "omg the old white people are at it again", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:09:02", "owner": "penguin__emoji", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059361710250680, "text": "so many if these are wrong", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:07:11", "owner": "kay.lee218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879483253333037, "text": "I didn't know I needed this", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:06:08", "owner": "ritualpuppet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18196687687324680, "text": "Man I miss John Cena memes", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:01:13", "owner": "platypinetwork", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298880350259485, "text": "Bro must be a gay millennial cuz those are the ones girls said 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:55:03", "owner": "its_aych", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068211407378725, "text": "All of these gen alpha terms belong to gen Z ngl", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:54:23", "owner": "justinalejandr0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18089763950490847, "text": "most of the “millennial” terms were used more by gen z, no?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:53:47", "owner": "tkall_13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872662300459662, "text": "Od been around the block", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:47:38", "owner": "brendan_14_k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868152319481602, "text": "As a millennial- no one ever said creepy pasta.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:46:33", "owner": "its_me_sammiie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182697163355110, "text": "I don’t know if I’m willing concede dog water to the youngins. I feel like that saying was floating around call of duty lobbies long before Z and Alpha joined the chat.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:46:02", "owner": "thejadefxdl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18432383779108357, "text": "Im somewhere between millennial and gen z ig", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:42:21", "owner": "dtvu_jeppesen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18065463338572811, "text": "As a millennial I haven’t heard of half my slang?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:41:35", "owner": "cosmic_strangerrr", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17901297795321326, "text": "I understand it now.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:36:06", "owner": "thephreshestone", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17965939679995353, "text": "Me as Gen Z but talks like a millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:35:39", "owner": "justbella_4", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18061453217635141, "text": "Ok, so what’s the one for sleeping or passed out??? Millennials in the chat, you know we used to say, crash out meaning, pass out. Now, the kids are saying crash out meaning extremely pissed or freaking out. It makes no sense!! I will forever equate crash out with pass out!! 😭🙃", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:34:13", "owner": "perksofleo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903301312311816, "text": "I'm living three generations at the same time", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:34:12", "owner": "luca_maluca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856566766512230, "text": "People think gen alpha is more brain rotted with their memes but ours were just as bad", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:32:52", "owner": "sayvi.draws", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989822898903273, "text": "Get aired is actually just English slang and has been for many many years lol", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:29:30", "owner": "1noodlelegs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083739170028160, "text": "I hate all of it", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:27:33", "owner": "____xj9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060107906639890, "text": "Im a mix of both genz and mil xD", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:27:19", "owner": "achintha0_o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944390992073124, "text": "Did you actually enjoy making this shit? What do even do?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:25:21", "owner": "patrickbarrett92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18382208566144471, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:25:04", "owner": "dodgrlvr33", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18089014987941035, "text": "Wait what 67? Because my stupid 5 and 7 year old and all their friends say that all the time because they don’t know what the hell it means but other dumb kids say it", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:23:53", "owner": "allidink", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945860875068289, "text": "What's 21? I am a gen z and dont understand lollllll", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:22:56", "owner": "glaw7417", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17847160275587956, "text": "But 69 was funny coz it was a sex thing, dafuq is 6 7", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:22:19", "owner": "the_inked_nomad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071803658595109, "text": "this was actually helpful 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:21:43", "owner": "abbshumphries", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926347789170307, "text": "Genius x 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:21:18", "owner": "alicliff7582", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915884056230120, "text": "Can we get another version of this but like go from millennials to alpha??? I’m having trouble comprehending", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:21:00", "owner": "batch_oun_bae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055545455326810, "text": "Millennial number is 420.. our gen made sure to legalize that mofo", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:19:58", "owner": "sheeshstona", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879334171328516, "text": "Millennials invented stfu. A lot of the Gen Z terms are used by Millennials", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:19:48", "owner": "csantizo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842662033621781, "text": "As a millennial, THANK YOU cause nothing makes sense anymore! 😂😃", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:18:18", "owner": "forestofserenity", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331606369213177, "text": "We won w the “vibe”", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:16:50", "owner": "mid_content_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065803283150439, "text": "i saw recently on a tweet that \"unc\" is short for \"uncool\" but in my head it's always been \"uncle\" like in the context here, so which is true?😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:16:26", "owner": "bhargavim97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063964784181240, "text": "As a millennial, I haven't heard of half the \"millennial\" sayings... But I will say all of my passwords always have a 69 in them 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:15:54", "owner": "mstrchris83", "likes": 425}, {"id": 18396942112126960, "text": "My brain broke.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:15:45", "owner": "vinnie.desai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078482150330782, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:14:57", "owner": "athenababy.vr", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18376139599153122, "text": "I'm a mix of all 3 wtf 🫡", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:14:26", "owner": "yazzyfluff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092310202930117, "text": "😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:13:43", "owner": "patchez123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18307349491264308, "text": "me a gen z with a combination of all the above vocabulary because i’m an oldest girl😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:12:48", "owner": "madd_37", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004406246822894, "text": "I DON'T KNOW WHAT I AM!!!😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:12:14", "owner": "treboniusbone3", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17936465024982724, "text": "As a millennial,  I don't know half the Mil slang 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:09:41", "owner": "hassaan.zafar1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18006204224663495, "text": "Just put the fries in the bag is not lock in", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:08:57", "owner": "quintilliam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106963684723054, "text": "Nah man you confused a lot of slang but good effort either way", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:08:02", "owner": "blanco__atlas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051560141364168, "text": "Fuuuuuuu I'm oolldddd, that made my skin crawl", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:04:41", "owner": "maron_art", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18045427061473152, "text": "I’m wanna gouge out my eyes just from wasting my time watching this video.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:02:51", "owner": "jdags34", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321376111169305, "text": "Yup im a zellinial.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:02:12", "owner": "rama_stask", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986792871871272, "text": "Nah, this is so fucking helpful tho lol", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:00:51", "owner": "piratebrainrot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853085749586443, "text": "Sybau", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:59:56", "owner": "friendpersona", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857250076505207, "text": "This is the only way any of gen alpha slang has made any sense to me", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:58:38", "owner": "dakotalexander", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056584076305674, "text": "I’m pretty sure everyone says sybau", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:57:51", "owner": "nmh_h_god", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076680769968268, "text": "Did anyone else get the ad? WTF???", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:57:44", "owner": "quantum1ism", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094290850860427, "text": "What does gay mean now", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:57:24", "owner": "kxisalive_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908749234254516, "text": "All these Generations need to put their phone down and read a f**king book. (myself included 😭)", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:57:02", "owner": "slayforbaebay", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18122203063524059, "text": "Bruh… the cancel culture has been savage over generations.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:56:19", "owner": "davidsotodesantiago", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087024790803754, "text": "Just put the fries in the bag is funny ngl", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:56:12", "owner": "its_mee_notreally", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068231960605807, "text": "I’m a Gen Z mixed with some Gen Alpha and millennials vocab😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:55:41", "owner": "hmy___._.___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883941391407220, "text": "Most of these are just things a black person came up with 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:55:12", "owner": "angd2727", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863867713517775, "text": "I tried to care, I really did.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:55:11", "owner": "chriselucas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999405591691313, "text": "Dudebro send me waaay back", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:54:31", "owner": "daniel_dolzhko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089063548939983, "text": "The reason i say sybau instead st fu, is because the banned it for being s swear word", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:54:02", "owner": "abdh.nofal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084078070861104, "text": "Mix of millennial and gen z ig", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:53:27", "owner": "tuck3r5657", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888806335388598, "text": "@djfrank_teezy  you need to save this 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:53:13", "owner": "tylerpockitt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18542153059022326, "text": "tf is this gen alpha slang bro it makes me wanna blow my brains out", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:52:43", "owner": "iistvrrydayz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066574451128743, "text": "I’m a mix ngl of all", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:52:06", "owner": "jerimiah_humann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18398309017120103, "text": "Why did you start with numbers bro. Clocked out immediately", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:50:51", "owner": "haley.sisneros", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104928961652712, "text": "“Acting cursed” are we just lame chuds??", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:49:48", "owner": "oomonuwell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18194935474328277, "text": "@nglwithkylie thought of you! 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:49:43", "owner": "rafaravazio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107139019626666, "text": "This just proves that I’m millennial 🥲", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:48:45", "owner": "becca.rah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115391236567987, "text": "THANK YOU!! Now I (millennial) can understand my niece & nephews (alpha)!! 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:48:40", "owner": "little_birdie691", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18163839982382665, "text": "This makes me sick", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:48:25", "owner": "siachoomey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338739082225489, "text": "Wat I’m I in generation class wdf", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:46:34", "owner": "seeemdadream", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062210564630378, "text": "You got ah couple wrong", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:46:26", "owner": "callme_freshhh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062325341626746, "text": "being chronically online since birth means you know all of these and adapt to gen alpha lingo thus shortening the generational gap", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:46:18", "owner": "its.0kei", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17904584061296643, "text": "You is weird", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:46:09", "owner": "ifd.rhys", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075507227226141, "text": "As a millennial that is terminally online, I ironically use new slang so often to piss people off that it is no unironically part of my normal speaking.  But the results of upsetting everyone is the same.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:45:38", "owner": "sneakz1833", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096934654843622, "text": "Millennial here I’m lost at these millennial terms 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:45:06", "owner": "amamisc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909311725123604, "text": "Im stuck between mil and Gen z which to the best of my understanding makes me cheungy?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:44:16", "owner": "doktor_placebo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844781356604902, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:44:13", "owner": "emeraldhellion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939401769970099, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:43:39", "owner": "_texas_mom_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043816136485616, "text": "Idk if I’m Gen Z or Mil 😭🤦🏾‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:42:40", "owner": "fam0uskay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086536249819930, "text": "Isin’t aura like swag ( in genz) with extra steps?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:42:35", "owner": "ajkulabruuhh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084226367025109, "text": "I think this just relates to Americans. 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:42:22", "owner": "alex_alex1994", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067826066104799, "text": "I'm gen z and use more millennial slang", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:42:12", "owner": "rb_sauce", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18054850952661245, "text": "Millennial here....just gonna say half the stuff you have under our names we never said........example \"old head???\"", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:42:11", "owner": "jno_tinkerbell", "likes": 1209}, {"id": 17869662657470975, "text": "Go Too School", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:42:10", "owner": "beaverino69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896862775199290, "text": "Some of these im gonna need you to go back another gen.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:41:30", "owner": "wickedlust23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059328887556645, "text": "Exactly how sim talks", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:40:50", "owner": "oriviolin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084868400048125, "text": "Ohio isn't backrooms or creepypasta and backrooms is a creepypasta but it's not the same thing as creepypasta because saying a specific term is a broad term is retardation to the max. Also I couldn't finish watching this it was ew", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:40:31", "owner": "jak_wolfe13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935808439110664, "text": "Lock in and wrap it up isn't the same thing. Locked in is when you're focused you're locked in... wrap it up is being told to lock in", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:40:30", "owner": "sledgehammer_george", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027785306569889, "text": "I'm gen z and don't know wtf you just said for alpha or gen z.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:40:27", "owner": "haileyanderson129", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104805826729377, "text": "This is the Rosetta Stone of generations", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:39:41", "owner": "caffinated_pinecone", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18101712943666238, "text": "I just learned so much 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:39:26", "owner": "amber_nelson1092", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058665734282047, "text": "My dad always said “dad tax” when he stole a bit of food lol he is not limited to just fries, he’s too powerful", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:39:24", "owner": "caffinated_pinecone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074991617262261, "text": "someone did this already", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:38:03", "owner": "meaty.yoker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084940339999125, "text": "If you don't understand, your brain is healthy,thank god😭😍", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:37:39", "owner": "zmryalrsy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076776056234418, "text": "Yea you grown men study this too much half of gen z and millennials use the same lingo we looked up to them 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:36:57", "owner": "k3yon.a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103802791630456, "text": "Thank you for this -baby millennial (I can't even understand gen z) and I am like friends with some from school", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:35:38", "owner": "libby.nichols.chapman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025739279716542, "text": "This video was waaay too long.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:35:00", "owner": "neet_23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069947081077598, "text": "Why is this ?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:34:04", "owner": "juya_d_paranjape", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874091227370583, "text": "Thank you for your service. 🙌👏😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:33:24", "owner": "imhappywefoundnemo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124235269518561, "text": "Why did this explain everything better than any other video I have ever seen in my life.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:32:27", "owner": "the_royaotic_dm", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18365674801091965, "text": "My brain hurts after watching this video", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:32:08", "owner": "built_by_ri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093715462807069, "text": "I can’t tell what words are real and what words are fake 😭😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:31:47", "owner": "poppasujo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100594714686982, "text": "What in da MF!!! English plz!!!!😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:31:31", "owner": "wolfpanda1922", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082467113017212, "text": "Wrong! Millennial isn’t 69. \nIt is 1 + 1 = Window 🪟", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:31:24", "owner": "wanhaziqhilmi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084393233102552, "text": "Every single Gen Alpha has been dropped on their head. They need to all be obliterated.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:30:37", "owner": "yamamotosryuujinjakka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084466388285563, "text": "Never felt older 😆", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:30:18", "owner": "heakattie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111575098609905, "text": "When did everyone get so stupid?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:30:16", "owner": "chaseedaw", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058833260274526, "text": "Tf is 21? 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:29:55", "owner": "roxys_wonderful_creations", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090175144940112, "text": "Wait, you're going too fast.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:28:52", "owner": "m.b.dlt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17852295162546638, "text": "Mil is wrong, we need a mil/boomer or gen x category", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:27:54", "owner": "itllbeohkaye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060877946235218, "text": "What?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:27:44", "owner": "__bhavika_thear__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093891766879739, "text": "Bet, lit, gas, restarted 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:27:11", "owner": "aquamarine_stone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968482749971483, "text": "Am I the only one who is kinda mix of all but master of nothing", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:26:44", "owner": "arjun_jadhav0125", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072679562259941, "text": "This just sounds like simlish", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:24:55", "owner": "balin2k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097809772831711, "text": "I dont use any of these", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:24:24", "owner": "dennis.hillberg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896957932348366, "text": "I watched this a million times", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:24:17", "owner": "kimd.nyc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062083898213355, "text": "Now my back hurts", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:24:16", "owner": "dylogix_domi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082388387033512, "text": "None of this", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:23:49", "owner": "summer.rain.carpenter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876490258356608, "text": "So…. What does it mean if I don’t use any of those words? 😅😅", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:23:16", "owner": "ronaldperez95", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18097042495830570, "text": "Alpha sounds like something I would jerk off to into Twitter", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:22:29", "owner": "benito.embrace", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18437535412097517, "text": "I’m gen Z and it took me more than half the video to even figure out what was going on 🥲", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:22:10", "owner": "liny._.lou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097036201877520, "text": "zillenial slang = gen z + millennial slang", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:21:59", "owner": "christxphvr", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18490737895073557, "text": "who the f is old head 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:21:39", "owner": "deermtncreations", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165549877391499, "text": "I dont even wanna know 🙄🙄", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:21:18", "owner": "itsmesheyla__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012909731801383, "text": "Never pronounce sybau", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:20:32", "owner": "epict_ilung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18330441973215654, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:19:01", "owner": "mr.duck_699", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094988353869919, "text": "Ok so highkey im gen z fam wow", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:18:38", "owner": "eliiuus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060791804240517, "text": "Ahhhhhhh🙉", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:18:34", "owner": "criminaljojo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18384765589195305, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:17:18", "owner": "nuke_the_protogen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130551016494638, "text": "67 - or 10-67 is investigate a death", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:16:14", "owner": "crobjones2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081241382322008, "text": "I’m a zillenial and I needed this", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:16:13", "owner": "so__trippy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095695711828835, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:16:01", "owner": "ellegalanova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091255007305460, "text": "My head hurts now 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:15:59", "owner": "djskoot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100217881688604, "text": "It's really sounding like I'm a zillenial now 😮", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:12:43", "owner": "ikaethan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893991901221674, "text": "I guess I didn’t grow up around anyone using dumb slang, because I understood maybe 3 words out of all of this.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:11:49", "owner": "katiekatedoes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108675181555393, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:10:35", "owner": "totem_games23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972812241807787, "text": "Really not 😒 but okay", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:09:56", "owner": "persephonezcgr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104039212657797, "text": "Making up shit for millennials 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:09:12", "owner": "sincere4stl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020224385789965, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:09:07", "owner": "darkskullxxvi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872020537462529, "text": "Got that 50/50 on gen z and millennial slang and now I’m in collage with people who have 50/50 on gen z/alpha slang 😵‍💫", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:08:58", "owner": "samiyumei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104880370630228, "text": "It’s dick sucking", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:08:55", "owner": "sisterrcashout", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18209666134312073, "text": "Dog water is most definitely gen-z maybe I’m wrong but I’m 25 feel like I been saying that sense teens", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:08:53", "owner": "isaacmjames1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097524892789170, "text": "I... I understand it now", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:08:07", "owner": "gavin.seaton.official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905310241297006, "text": "69 does not mean the same thing as 67", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:07:56", "owner": "divinenatureskies", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985927308870634, "text": "Old head lol", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:07:46", "owner": "sisterrcashout", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049222715391499, "text": "This was actually helpful", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:05:58", "owner": "booktrovert31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087754021790194, "text": "Why do I feel like I’m hearing my sims game talk 😅🥹😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:05:48", "owner": "dsharppss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146706913437508, "text": "I’m a Gen X and I know all of these… My kids keep me in the loop 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:04:50", "owner": "princess.giovani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078851969466382, "text": "Gen alpha is lame we only accpet gen z and mille!", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:04:37", "owner": "cult.mele", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867404356496981, "text": "I'm a teacher and this has helped me more than you know 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:04:09", "owner": "thestrangerschoir", "likes": 3531}, {"id": 17899131750340571, "text": "Noooo, the millennial language it's just the normal 🥲 (I know it's not)", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:03:44", "owner": "lovin.mimin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18389688763176191, "text": "When I thought I was a millennial but I'm actually Gen z", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:03:43", "owner": "jason.boggess", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915087091090375, "text": "How do I fuccing exist in three generations? 💀😭🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:03:35", "owner": "deanygabby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084584099041930, "text": "Har generation k 3-4 shabd samajh aae", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:03:11", "owner": "daydreamer827", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094953001867337, "text": "Doesn’t “wrap it up” for millennials mean “don’t raw dog me”", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:02:48", "owner": "summerswintonprintemps", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909111850255862, "text": "old head trying to teach old heads lingo cause old head definitely ain’t from millennials", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:02:32", "owner": "ladrew04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18195115471338274, "text": "Gen Z was 1738", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:02:29", "owner": "grapha_97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18411553174188214, "text": "I speaks gen z", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:02:21", "owner": "g.guardian2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103915792640899, "text": "So what’s in between Gen Z and millennial 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:02:15", "owner": "n_zayyyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058602407277794, "text": "Thank you for this demonstration because I have no clue what these kids are talking about", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:02:06", "owner": "sexidredz14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081868006880100, "text": "What the f is 6 7", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:59:38", "owner": "j_polanco11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857442790558715, "text": "Translate this into Gen X please what’s this about pasta?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:58:08", "owner": "georgealley", "likes": 58}, {"id": 18073652930262386, "text": "So the next generation is speaking simlish", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:57:51", "owner": "the_angry_enchilada", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097908901831863, "text": "OD is millennial my man I should say black millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:56:37", "owner": "thereal.dannyp", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17846579796593054, "text": "Ts is false u mixed up almost everything", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:55:57", "owner": "evisc3rati0n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071201561599507, "text": "I'm genz... THE FUCK IS 21????", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:55:37", "owner": "itznotpri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964627611847899, "text": "Wtf is 21 ?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:54:54", "owner": "legitamrit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063202769406791, "text": "I’m 29 & I been saying OD since like 6th grade, they can’t have that lol", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:54:46", "owner": "_whris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989709063903367, "text": "Why is millennial slang the only one that actually makes sense? 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:53:58", "owner": "stephanie.mey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087179923968280, "text": "Fyi 90% of what he is saying is gen alpha is actually gen z and the end of the mils. Gen alpha hasnt come up with shit. Even 67 wasnt a gen alpha thing 😂 that stupid hand movement is though", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:53:57", "owner": "lumbolarrytv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044120138701333, "text": "Millennial, never heard anyone use most of those words, except bbf on a text or msn😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:50:51", "owner": "piinkyhearn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056639174311856, "text": "HOLD ON ONE MOMENT YOURE GOING TOO FAST IM TOO OLD FOR THIS", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:50:48", "owner": "alextpthegreat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032790125740789, "text": "Thank you", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:50:39", "owner": "callmemilenko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103377469661416, "text": "Ah to be in middle school", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:50:20", "owner": "hoona_bear", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096131434850016, "text": "Thank you.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:49:59", "owner": "tiamoniq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990815181905539, "text": "Respectfully, half of these is fucking genz", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:49:33", "owner": "3xpl4in", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949820001918418, "text": "No more thank you", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:49:29", "owner": "cassieaviani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030386963742225, "text": "Bring back street cred!", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:48:27", "owner": "teodor.lamban", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867940825495750, "text": "So all that derived from millennial gaming by th way", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:48:17", "owner": "ruizshawn223", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986310921753418, "text": "i appreciate you doing the work for this. but like internet meme history 1002 would go into the slight connotation variations between them all — like unc, boomer, and old head are not the same connotation imo", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:47:53", "owner": "red.ninja3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18119359699531832, "text": "41? Thought it was 42", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:47:51", "owner": "lizbitnie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18289402735279458, "text": "So many things wrong with the Millenial part lmfao", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:45:46", "owner": "gacaandrew", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18385492636181206, "text": "The millennial vocab is all wrong", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:45:25", "owner": "ashley_rose1437", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082645472104574, "text": "I’m a mix of millennial and Gen Z. But damn it’s cringe to hear all of these terms 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:44:58", "owner": "alexander_adriaenssens", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086161282814863, "text": "Oh god thank you. This actually helps lol", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:44:16", "owner": "lyndz120", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083998501863722, "text": "I cannot believe for a hot second I was thinking he meant like Alpha Males say this", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:41:48", "owner": "thanesyswerda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085175003097488, "text": "I need you to do one of these for Gen Alpha slang translated to GenX. Cuz I sure don’t know any of the GenZ or Mil either lol. I need some Cliffs notes", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:41:45", "owner": "missanthropy_music", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18341203981231796, "text": "Now I can finally understand my coworkers (they’re younger Gen Z but they always know more than I do about new vocabulary 😭)", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:40:41", "owner": "lovelybriarrose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033684743736950, "text": "@chile_8_ @choppa_go_", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:40:13", "owner": "derekrwegoshora", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17891446614244633, "text": "What the fuck is a 41 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:39:04", "owner": "brio.benz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090422684504498, "text": "Too much I give up", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:38:55", "owner": "naavvsshh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901753873300709, "text": "Gen z has cheese tax", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:38:42", "owner": "bizzy.io", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120790354543782, "text": "Some of these were unknown to me.. as a millennial I’m not sure I’m a millennial.. add gen x so I might understand more", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:37:53", "owner": "just_moxiejoxy2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988185633861742, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:37:13", "owner": "j.a.s_rahi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988756191857703, "text": "21 is more mil. A few of these things are recycled so yea", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:34:56", "owner": "nirobi925", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098636632811938, "text": "As a millenial, I was saying twin before they were even born", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:33:57", "owner": "wyllownorth", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056636546311474, "text": "Yall need Jesus and a thesaurus", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:33:39", "owner": "genessee_erickson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081505409119859, "text": "This is extremely helpful", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:32:11", "owner": "ravekathrine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932536930110191, "text": "I can sense every inch of my body cringing to ts", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:31:52", "owner": "scarasnoozer", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18055768115319163, "text": "Very helpful, thank you", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:31:50", "owner": "andrescar00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18307003741248776, "text": "Me as a millennial never hearing some of those millennial terms.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:31:46", "owner": "jessibug27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953570635040565, "text": "More proof that these made up years mean absolutely nothing", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:31:23", "owner": "keenan.liss.3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845922760596963, "text": "I know all 3 generation slangs 😭 I'm chronically online", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:31:22", "owner": "itspayalart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068005556106864, "text": "I liked this but also one of the worst things I have ever seen", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:31:03", "owner": "ncaprigs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051396263661931, "text": "Me, a Gen Z, with slang of a Gen Z and Millenial, and some of Gen Alpha", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:30:21", "owner": "sun_janix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089863699748004, "text": "Why as a millennial have I not used half the words he’s throwing out like it was actually we said", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:28:26", "owner": "snappinsmiles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023105696785921, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:27:58", "owner": "blakeley.sn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070717922370990, "text": "Look likes i'm a mix of millennials and gen z💀", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:27:32", "owner": "family_fastest", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18410281924186636, "text": "Geez I though my gen (gen z) was brain dead until I heard gen alphas phrases", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:26:04", "owner": "isaacepp_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084479744049665, "text": "Chad is gen z", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:25:46", "owner": "kymarsagen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543918388033683, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:25:44", "owner": "that_mountain_man_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083695262045079, "text": "This shit is stupid", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:25:44", "owner": "raycon1387", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055547120648330, "text": "OD is NAWT a gen alpha term", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:25:17", "owner": "teronbelike", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064539254609320, "text": "The only one you may have gotten incorrect is “put the fries in the bag”, but the rest sound accurate", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:25:07", "owner": "brandon.gin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160016767397859, "text": "twin is not a gen alpha word been hearing that since 2013 😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:24:34", "owner": "6e_g0ml", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383203933180999, "text": "This didn't help at all to those of us that speak English", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:24:00", "owner": "vickygray1199", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915372637090391, "text": "Isn’t clout attention seeking?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:23:56", "owner": "davidbrancrunch286", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064814684415122, "text": "I don’t know what most of it means", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:23:37", "owner": "denzel_de_lange", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338596522238999, "text": "I thought you were just saying words at first", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:22:30", "owner": "nick_perry_73", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076537624972530, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:22:10", "owner": "mystictray_", "likes": 581}, {"id": 18095091502852626, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:21:02", "owner": "erik_erciik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901891468323746, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:20:55", "owner": "erik_erciik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075429566218532, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:20:49", "owner": "erik_erciik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18174139753375434, "text": "Definitively a lot of mix gen z + millennials around here 🤚🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:20:33", "owner": "caroline.mth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088487596770707, "text": "Not me using both millennial and Gen Z slang XD", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:20:33", "owner": "rainestorm98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965462479002351, "text": "Yk I really hate seeing Gen Z shit on Alpha just cause we don't understand their humour and like duh dude millennials didn't know wtf we were saying either and called all our humour random nonsense, we just don't get the joke cause we don't have the context accept it and move on", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:19:24", "owner": "luxafix_rose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088415806778960, "text": "I’ve never met a millennial that doesn’t know what STFU means", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:18:40", "owner": "rafiboiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978642609786580, "text": "Thank you so much for this 🙌 I can now speak with my nephews 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:17:49", "owner": "itsjoeib", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932152567112119, "text": "Kill me before this becomes normal... Please GOD", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:17:47", "owner": "just_a_girl1626", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095167156859098, "text": "Jesus Christ, thank you for this\nMy little brother comes home saying stupid brain rot things all the time and I had no clue what he’s been saying\n\nNow I can make fun of him properly 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:17:20", "owner": "cassgyp5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988418511875524, "text": "This is so far from accurate", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:15:54", "owner": "ortagoth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073903265021262, "text": "I’m in between Millennial and Gen Z… at 27 it’s sad", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:11:38", "owner": "i_am.gigiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18187022080346148, "text": "I feel old 😪", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:11:36", "owner": "liqat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931517626135921, "text": "Soooo does that make me a polyglot?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:11:00", "owner": "teddy.grizzly20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051211721348598, "text": "As an elder Millennial, I’m confused by some of the Millennial verbiage in this video. However, as a native Midwesterner, I’m glad ALL generations agree that Ohio is cringy.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:10:58", "owner": "the.vain.villain", "likes": 56}, {"id": 18049115270688090, "text": "But Mils came with boomers 1st 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:10:03", "owner": "ymikraw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157901749403029, "text": "Ok, why I know different words from different gen 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:09:20", "owner": "aika__myrza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18315601585217335, "text": "I feel like 1738 should’ve been added to the gen z with 21 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:08:40", "owner": "xo.shxyla.xo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896945785204175, "text": "That fact that I know most of these is sad", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:08:37", "owner": "beanster_girl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075175739270404, "text": "Ohio is not creepypasta come on", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:08:29", "owner": "bbrain_ded", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081133202131226, "text": "Ngl but I saved this video for reference material", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:07:58", "owner": "rskybznis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078515579171803, "text": "Fries in the bag is not the same as lock in bro. Fries in the bag is telling someone they aren’t good enough at what they do to do it full time and for them to get a job. Lock in is like kinda uplifting", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:07:23", "owner": "brandonstne11", "likes": 1917}, {"id": 18062391065448495, "text": "Why do I know every word", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:06:27", "owner": "dathewmixon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063745763166914, "text": "Oh. I get it now thx.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:05:44", "owner": "_samantha.payne_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144615919444156, "text": "@ming_dynasty_opioid_addict gen alpha phrases highkey suck gang like its literally the worst group 😭, i’m not a millennial but even they had cool shit, i just think your trying to save face here lol", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:04:31", "owner": "kokoabie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983799762761580, "text": "We millennials use OD", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:04:01", "owner": "mfptrillz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544055158060677, "text": "I lost braincells watching this 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:04:00", "owner": "cryproz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003531251829629, "text": "Thank u as a millenial much appreciated", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:59:48", "owner": "carlosmanuelfeliciano", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117928279487155, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:57:31", "owner": "_ghostinthegarden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044154317484937, "text": "Dog water is not alpha", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:57:06", "owner": "toxicpollo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064068278172650, "text": "😂 oh I have to explain to my bf what they nieces r saying this is going to help me so much he hates the 6 7", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:57:03", "owner": "yobbabe508", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856468588563113, "text": "Oh my, did I just get aged out??!", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:56:53", "owner": "anthonx_sanchez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098667748811562, "text": "BRUH STOP WTF", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:56:10", "owner": "mr.smokingloud.710", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950302431918011, "text": "This helped, but some of your gen Z is millennial.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:55:35", "owner": "vincekesner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067860650619047, "text": "Millennial over everything", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:55:17", "owner": "sean_fox_64", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060161231242580, "text": "Ngl, Gen Alpha slang doesn't make sense at all", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:53:02", "owner": "clarathedim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905570716145174, "text": "But 69 actually meant something 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:52:07", "owner": "finesse_based", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962917518990856, "text": "Gen z/ Mel where us 2003 bros sit", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:51:50", "owner": "jeriah.legge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18548982382017233, "text": "Gen alpha does NOT get dog water ts is mine", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:51:24", "owner": "mysticglitter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136363723422077, "text": "I understand now", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:50:14", "owner": "jashk_675", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006868589662921, "text": "I just got a headache", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:48:19", "owner": "allmyhair22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108487420628661, "text": "Being Zellenial is rough because I can relate to both but fit in with neither.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:47:15", "owner": "yumford", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088369714939599, "text": "What the hellyy", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:46:28", "owner": "manazafar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056027102664192, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:46:24", "owner": "youmeanshenanigans", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091928989734404, "text": "What’s before mil ? Cause I didn’t get those either", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:45:12", "owner": "jesus.c.c.91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098458954764337, "text": "Even some of the gen z and millennial dont mean the same thing much less the gen alpha stuff.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:43:39", "owner": "david.corbin.549", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095001355871527, "text": "Ok def gen z", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:41:57", "owner": "fatima.daouk_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113099050589847, "text": "Creepy pasta?!?!", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:41:33", "owner": "jeneeamore", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113727325601786, "text": "Creepy pasta?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:39:57", "owner": "bohemianchicken8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087302920967696, "text": "This HELLA hurt my brain.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:39:23", "owner": "victoriabirthbindery", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18033078497746035, "text": "It's funny how I was younger some words are used in millennials. Now it's more emphasis with the current generationa", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:38:43", "owner": "yarrodcosplayer2023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102266671672665, "text": "Backroom?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:38:14", "owner": "ale_cuanto_mas_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065299133138790, "text": "I'm a xennial who has both Gen z and alpha kids. I speak in tongues at this point.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:37:40", "owner": "the._iron._maiden", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18307474912267055, "text": "I love that it all lowkey started making sense 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:35:15", "owner": "the_great_papanda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074348306195986, "text": "Lowkey i use gen z n mil, occasionally alpha OCCASIONALLY", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:35:14", "owner": "careyhoo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847698916608243, "text": "Put the fries in the bag is NOT the same as lock in", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:34:47", "owner": "esoteric_chicken", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066963446417286, "text": "just put the fries in the bag is more synmous with “who?……asked!!”", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:33:17", "owner": "color.me.oopsie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049118417398525, "text": "What the hell did I just watched", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:32:08", "owner": "mitch_mcln", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074071586218503, "text": "Late gen z yet have vocab much closer to the millennials I guess", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:31:45", "owner": "jake.rosi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925421134173660, "text": "Gen alpha has the strangest slang 😩", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:30:08", "owner": "ambitioustreasure", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18431817328129888, "text": "I'm gonna need the Gen X translation", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:29:26", "owner": "cmr1575", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032747543725369, "text": "This video proves that some bros mouthes are only good for one thing…", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:26:34", "owner": "kaibtmboy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925268536180278, "text": "painful content", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:25:39", "owner": "lisyapical", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879451417330264, "text": "🙌🏾 Can you please add that Xennial/Gen X slang, so that I can understand the 30% that I am not millennial enough to get. 🤣 thanks, 🙏🏾 signed an elder millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:24:54", "owner": "doctordjsims", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087630283798581, "text": "I have *never* heard a millennial say 'you're done' like that", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:23:20", "owner": "thenerdyrockstar", "likes": 2348}, {"id": 18247996228288041, "text": "At least 21 vine is funny have context", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:22:35", "owner": "sofia_etzinha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916457458229607, "text": "This was actually helpful 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:22:26", "owner": "full.carts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396175726120391, "text": "I'm just between Gen z and Mil 😂 Born 2001", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:21:47", "owner": "neco_san.e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147398164381561, "text": "What’s funny is Gen Z was doing the griddy before the new gen", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:21:43", "owner": "madinappi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102170404708518, "text": "Giving millennials too much credits", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:21:25", "owner": "orphan.exterminator", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061169825552352, "text": "i'm in between gen z & milennial", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:21:14", "owner": "izzyegal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035859083513017, "text": "Honestly, I’m a millennial and never even heard half the millennial slang you were just mentioning.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:20:48", "owner": "judean.warrior", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083071817028162, "text": "I'm hurt that I didn't know I needed. Also happy I'm never gonna use this knowledge", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:20:15", "owner": "femi.oflow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104002648663021, "text": "Dog water is such an old term wtf 😭 that was used in prime 2009 MW2 days", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:19:44", "owner": "mr2_johnny", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18307809262267828, "text": "Thanks for this content, now I can communicate with my nieces 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:18:28", "owner": "rocchiina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074628134192150, "text": "Im 25 but using mil language, how", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:18:05", "owner": "nofar_ziv_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061330586222933, "text": "This guy is modern translator in time traveller of internet form.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:18:03", "owner": "fam_the_evil_cat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907460605296213, "text": "I don’t even know if I’m a millennial anymore. I didn’t know half of those😅😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:17:39", "owner": "violinminor92", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18513732457069893, "text": "This actually helped a lot, I don't understand the Gen Alpha stuff", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:16:46", "owner": "alphaprime775", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863963683520757, "text": "I think \"youre done\" is definitely more gen z", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:16:41", "owner": "shinanagin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18424813558113564, "text": "Creepy pasta? Lol", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:16:04", "owner": "rwcoop__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056003204322488, "text": "It's like playing generational Bingo and I'm having an identity crisis", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:13:48", "owner": "docter.evol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047520182693876, "text": "Who tf said old head", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:10:30", "owner": "djanderson92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025861511774871, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏thank you 😂 I needed this Rosetta Stone", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:10:28", "owner": "psusennes1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922699999191140, "text": "Let’s all just be mute moving forward and let the world heal.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:10:21", "owner": "itsreginagorj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081776996023866, "text": "Wtf is 21 but for Mil I think 17-38 cause we all couldn't hear 17 back in the day without Fetty Wap coming to mind", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:09:31", "owner": "chrisciro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870916096467075, "text": "I'm a Millennial with the GenZ vocab 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:09:17", "owner": "champu_jay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080629040143750, "text": "Finally, thank you kind sir. For the deep explanation.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:09:00", "owner": "tashi_gyatso__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18369564565087732, "text": "I know none of this what am I ? Not American?😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:08:57", "owner": "kevinwg02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293595517279018, "text": "I'm more concerned with what the hell is going on with the ceiling lights behind him. 4 in a row but not even straight in a row....", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:08:37", "owner": "garageofmanythings", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066060101620848, "text": "Im a millennial and still dont know most of my shit", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:08:29", "owner": "redlee3000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18394195285135509, "text": "No thanks", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:06:40", "owner": "thetitofontainemusic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005911406811351, "text": "This confirmed that I didn’t even know most of the slang from my own generation.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:06:22", "owner": "lifeinthekeyofdminor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107487133723312, "text": "This helped so much actually", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:06:08", "owner": "joshua_neil113", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098734552766601, "text": "Fries in the bag can't be lock in, right? They're similar, but have opposite intentions. You tell someone to lock in when they aren't taking a situation seriously or they're failing to walk the walk. It's a plea for the subject to be better. Fries in the bag is shutting down someone who is talking big. It's a plea that they remember their place and stop dreaming.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:05:46", "owner": "heirheart413", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927114802158318, "text": "📝🧐.. waiit Since when was “OD” Alpha?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:05:02", "owner": "badia.mercana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989452737886284, "text": "“The more we change, the more we stay the same”", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:03:11", "owner": "arcanesoulx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083107106020616, "text": "What does SYBAU mean? Like what do the letters stand for?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:02:48", "owner": "stacksoflauren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954537634011826, "text": "backrooms is genalpha", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:02:11", "owner": "xtrapgoat_v3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050022491386400, "text": "Idk what I am but as a teen I would call most things gay and retarted🤷🏼‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:01:03", "owner": "dwar92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079068746517083, "text": "Every single one of these is gay af. No wonder all these kids are pathetic losers", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:59:43", "owner": "robling0425", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546233080065088, "text": "Our gen highkey cursed", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:57:33", "owner": "sarrinart_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086064700825378, "text": "Creepypasta is milenial?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:57:09", "owner": "kevnops", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397284373133273, "text": "\"OD\" originated from Gen X specifically from New York, \"Twin\" comes from Millennials, it also can be traced back to New York...", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:56:19", "owner": "uziii_sm0ke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067718537620161, "text": "I'm more mil than gen z wth. And I'm gen z", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:56:17", "owner": "tasn.im2807", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024798221591187, "text": "It's not for you to understand the origins of the slang, it's showing comparisons amongst all our generational slang. Theyre all short hand or inside jokes, no need to get all aggressive 😅 sheesh", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:54:47", "owner": "maddysqgard3n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921935203192017, "text": "Cheese tax > Fry tax", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:54:38", "owner": "_mimuya__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892017748367866, "text": "I can confirm gen z born towards the end (people who are currently 18) have this same gen alpha verbiage 😔. I went back to school after years and oh man.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:53:59", "owner": "torpid_time", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054541484333696, "text": "Gen alpha makes me cringe.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:53:31", "owner": "_majennaa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18112515835587090, "text": "OD is millennial lmao", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:53:15", "owner": "tosh.mahal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915182017236736, "text": "Anyone remember man points? Get challenged to something stupid and the reward would be *input amount here* man points", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:53:05", "owner": "theoneandonlyeloxido", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899144752340004, "text": "Ngl Millies had the best slang", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:52:15", "owner": "cukiekim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031576907744344, "text": "Why do you say all these so fruity?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:50:54", "owner": "2the_miscella6neous_anomally2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095311921853276, "text": "Just put the fries in the bag is not “lock in”. It’s telling someone stupid to shut up. It’s implying you’re trying to talk to us about something when we just want you to do whatever transactional thing we’re asking you to do", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:50:33", "owner": "mightbartistic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119126620544093, "text": "69 had a meaning for Millenials", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:48:04", "owner": "stamina_sa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084941429008462, "text": "wtf is creepy pasta. Prob need to add xennials and elder millennials", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:45:57", "owner": "bdsrn33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049200296391467, "text": "Finally learning what some of these mean..", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:45:54", "owner": "cm_char_cole", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18216153139308112, "text": "How come there called Alpha but they’re the softest ones out of the rest.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:45:35", "owner": "murtizzy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062774633629111, "text": "still don’t know what famom tax or fry tax is", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:45:32", "owner": "justinseet0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049125836399242, "text": "How old are you? What do you identify as?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:45:26", "owner": "stewartjarod", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904733701289730, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:45:24", "owner": "epstlen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852967858583658, "text": "How the hell do I belong to any of these...?🤦", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:45:23", "owner": "smileyfreddy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063962327431707, "text": "OD is not an “alpha” thing lol", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:45:09", "owner": "welgori", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18166353835391613, "text": "WTF IS 21", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:45:06", "owner": "xemendickbutt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539856076060247, "text": "Im gen Z but I was a creepy pasta kid, not a backrooms kid😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:44:33", "owner": "x_crossfire_xx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154265986423539, "text": "Chat, why do I know all of these? I’m lowkey scared.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:44:23", "owner": "astral.sensei", "likes": 38}, {"id": 18247060885292160, "text": "I would say Most gen z experienced millennial memes or slang growing up", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:44:01", "owner": "cl42k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927193645170515, "text": "Put the fries in the bag does NOT mean lock in 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:43:06", "owner": "fatdab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076427639230491, "text": "Js sybau unc ur nt shk spr 💔🥀", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:42:02", "owner": "sakti_791", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079526341922088, "text": "This is the most comprehensive guide ever created thank u", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:42:01", "owner": "flexhan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18099553999699785, "text": "Alpha vocab is causing me to have a stroke rn", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:41:52", "owner": "jenvye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18290133646274733, "text": "ohio is not the same as backrooms and neither of those are the same as creepy pasta", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:41:14", "owner": "maddyelisabeth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905521468147467, "text": "Thank you!", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:36:52", "owner": "punkrockgypsyart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18297512191283483, "text": "Shit gen alpha is trash as fuck😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:36:10", "owner": "dedesowild", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061966643447423, "text": "Thank you so much 🙏 I can’t keep up with these kids", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:36:04", "owner": "stonecoldorange", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935469757009260, "text": "I never really wanted to learn gen alpha, I just stuck with Gen z tbh", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:35:17", "owner": "mrgavin08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990948150884706, "text": "FreddyFazbearing is crazy. Nobody got time for that", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:34:19", "owner": "raphael.mc27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028683704562181, "text": "Ima Zillennial 😎", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:33:38", "owner": "usamahxkhalifah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18381189970148664, "text": "Glazing and meat riding sound a bit inappropriate for kids. 😂  what happened to teacher's pet? 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:33:36", "owner": "walahpawn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18536350429018852, "text": "I know you didn't just give \"OD\" to Gen Alpha 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:33:13", "owner": "n0negiv3n", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18050864033673623, "text": "This was, is now, a waste of time... 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:32:46", "owner": "variantsports", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118543228538791, "text": "What is anyone born between 93-96", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:32:39", "owner": "triumphant_lt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929876503016611, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:32:14", "owner": "peytonsmusic19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983808594763917, "text": "This was actually very helpful lol", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:30:20", "owner": "caitiefirefly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051194330361200, "text": "I’m just a mix of gen z and mil", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:29:39", "owner": "cactus.cheese_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121710568551610, "text": "We need to bring back main character energy 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:29:38", "owner": "mr_lnfinity", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17936467724985152, "text": "Why do I understand more millennial slang😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:29:16", "owner": "bet_on_l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063094037405074, "text": "This is not millennial lol", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:27:56", "owner": "notsoaveragejoe2317", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082972955319616, "text": "I’m even more confused now", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:26:53", "owner": "sivrahj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331142980215256, "text": "WTF are any of these millennial slangs! Like wtf if “creepy pasta”?????", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:26:16", "owner": "thezoeyzoco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866969275486194, "text": "😳🥱😴", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:26:03", "owner": "lmnop_2024_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980079255927879, "text": "I’m even more confused now", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:25:39", "owner": "coraroch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321730099172535, "text": "Proof we are getting dumber", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:25:15", "owner": "mjpro87", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17976743306790978, "text": "Ok. Im so done. WTH is 21?! Im a gen z Like cmonnn😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:25:06", "owner": "blackcatnightvines", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164282545379049, "text": "This Gen X, go away and stfup", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:23:47", "owner": "lysa172", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065941241454337, "text": "What did you just say?? 🧐🤨", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:23:40", "owner": "justingray0990", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046078781694177, "text": "Gen Z and Millennial are damn near equal while Alpha is just brain dead", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:23:10", "owner": "_silvers_flame_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924792094175092, "text": "Im 23, why millennial ones are more resembling  AM I BEING KICKED OUT OF GEN Z", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:22:54", "owner": "thetisart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873806707373324, "text": "All of it is utter woke nonsense", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:22:21", "owner": "oz._.khan.09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082092122039414, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:21:24", "owner": "dylan.fitzger", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18067021520612867, "text": "Ok, so I'm gen z, and a lot of those millennial vocab, a lot of even younger gen z still use", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:20:50", "owner": "texwrecksgaming", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917806216216472, "text": "I feel like my head is melting like I swear I have a higher iq then 90 I swear", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:20:24", "owner": "_rose_dreams_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18512033278069607, "text": "I feel like GenZ and Millennial slang is interchangeable. I’ve used a variety of both my whole life and I was born 94", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:20:10", "owner": "agentplur", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18155572423408964, "text": "This makes so much sense damn!", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:19:53", "owner": "littlebitchass", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047574755431993, "text": "Alpha slang shows how that generation’s writing and reading skills have fallen off a cliff 😂. wtf is skibidi lmao", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:19:53", "owner": "lastwun77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986684343909037, "text": "i hate it here", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:19:25", "owner": "not.mypills", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987875739745880, "text": "I swear some of the millenial is what gen z say bc we’re not 12 year olds", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:17:10", "owner": "andr3wm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094970185896806, "text": "Nice to know all Genz speak dog water 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:16:03", "owner": "dqtou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057528257633469, "text": "Im a zillenial with a little bit of alpha for the spice", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:13:27", "owner": "talhanoor559", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099932668818012, "text": "Twin is not gen Alpha lol that’s Atlanta culture 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:13:23", "owner": "theatrakal38", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18296290240261082, "text": "Dog water IS NOT gen alpha slang my good sir, that belongs to the Older gen Z often referred to as Zillenials", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:12:52", "owner": "treeman_73", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18133936060488411, "text": "I'm so confused with gen alpha slang😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:12:51", "owner": "river_styx72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18292880059279067, "text": "420 is universal✌️🍃", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:12:36", "owner": "hey.updogg", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18495009169075648, "text": "no.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:12:18", "owner": "widebodyjaylen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907213798268904, "text": "Thank you", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:12:01", "owner": "beautyby_delaney", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089137927764099, "text": "i’m ngl i phase in and out of all three at will, i use so many of those or at least hear them in my day to day life 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:10:53", "owner": "james_funnell_19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965517103003121, "text": "My nephew assures me these are not accurate", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:10:53", "owner": "colrumsmiserablejourney", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165203065389251, "text": "Well… I learned that I’m older than i thought.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:09:47", "owner": "philgivens", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18125678431504496, "text": "Dont forget gen z got 24 and 25😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:09:07", "owner": "yung_akuma19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062130611221061, "text": "Chad is genZ, alpha is gen alpha", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:08:10", "owner": "conoraubrey007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063176522180158, "text": "Being gen z and you use both alpha and millenial", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:07:54", "owner": "shahdanialzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891359206242467, "text": "Dictionary you never knew you needed", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:07:46", "owner": "dika.bramantio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844819528605320, "text": "Millennials don’t say trash. Growing up we said, “that’s gay”", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:06:08", "owner": "heck900_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18351682012162656, "text": "21 ?????,", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:06:02", "owner": "mehdi_messani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850491931597879, "text": "Wow today I learned SYBAU is shut you bih ahhh up. Damn! Ngl I like it more than stfu", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:03:07", "owner": "baldrunnergirl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989088771739975, "text": "I believe I’m a millennial guys", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:02:33", "owner": "gewoon__yoeri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095454283846824, "text": "OD is not gen alpha. Been saying OD since I was a child. born and raised in the south bronx too and I’m 30 now.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:01:30", "owner": "jake_fromstatefarm____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118813405559450, "text": "Dude im like everything whats going on here", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:01:18", "owner": "tmr_51", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18536289682031185, "text": "I don't know half of any 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:00:57", "owner": "kvsj144", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083007277878251, "text": "Zillennial here 😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:00:48", "owner": "naturalist_tye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972511008971521, "text": "Gen alpha language hurts my brain and I hate it", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:00:36", "owner": "foxdengamer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119311306531799, "text": "If you don't know for certain what 21 is from, then you are not gen Z don't care when you were born", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:59:11", "owner": "shayharwood", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075537491349923, "text": "It's not 21, it's 25", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:58:42", "owner": "faraday.sql", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902374888300764, "text": "Definitely a zillenial cuz I was floating back and forth between Gen Z and millennial phrases the whole time 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:58:38", "owner": "danicolelle", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18364441843088243, "text": "1996 is the only year that can toggle between genz and mil. I’m both", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:58:35", "owner": "delawaresinclair", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991223277730789, "text": "Millennial who uses all of these ironically 😂 love embarrassing my kids", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:56:35", "owner": "raebun103", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105471481567300, "text": "Yeahhhh imma have to ask yall to do me a kindness and just old yeller me", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:56:12", "owner": "kaceycray13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892152196364450, "text": "Gen Z came up with \"twin\"", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:54:45", "owner": "naeskiifrmda4x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848692726602698, "text": "Stop making videos. You’re so wrong on so much of this", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:54:39", "owner": "dave.resler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865719745506200, "text": "Can you translate that back one more generation", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:54:05", "owner": "ordoric", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155059264371222, "text": "Could you add a gen x version I understand a few of the millennial ones but weirdly I understand more of the gen z ones mabye because my oldest is 21. But I was reclassified (‘81) from gen x to millennial thought I would know all the millennial ones hadn’t heard like 60% of them", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:50:58", "owner": "mad_medic_5672", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18170374120372580, "text": "i didnt know i was a millennial at only 19 years old", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:49:38", "owner": "awtismdawg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884857438287424, "text": "What the hell is fry tax, or back room or half of these?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:47:22", "owner": "positiveraynedrop", "likes": 28}, {"id": 18546742969011482, "text": "41? Wtaf is 41???", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:47:07", "owner": "8x.i.x8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915374548090434, "text": "I did not know I was that old", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:46:10", "owner": "kingjasmmm", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18382411894197287, "text": "I'm confused", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:46:02", "owner": "sweet.lemony", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18100637830815417, "text": "I'm a Gen Z who's between Alpha and Millennial then? Sounds about right 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:45:32", "owner": "therealblacklight", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18117879118490687, "text": "My head is spinning", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:41:21", "owner": "manahilbfr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975771456793708, "text": "Did you just censor hella???", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:40:06", "owner": "eri0jay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171408223336371, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:39:48", "owner": "phantom_xnyc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085550657317181, "text": "So... I am half gen z half mil?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:39:21", "owner": "yonko_mob", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907409092267244, "text": "Oh yeah... Keep talking like that", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:39:20", "owner": "biel_adityaa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085218488057094, "text": "It’s the way I both understood everything and nothing all at once", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:36:18", "owner": "natethack", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100017124779082, "text": "did this dude just try and give the alphas credit for OD??? fuck outaaaa hereeeee", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:34:20", "owner": "pfinn1994", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842622406621420, "text": "I am a millennial and haven’t heard of half the terms you talkings about", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:34:11", "owner": "jams_0316", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367476124090092, "text": "This gave me a headache", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:33:26", "owner": "dpxho88", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18180841195359899, "text": "Same people getting mad at 6 7 used to yelll out 21 with all their heart 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:31:15", "owner": "marjar718", "likes": 160}, {"id": 17851281540554884, "text": "The fuck lol", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:30:47", "owner": "j.willette84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18150869005423842, "text": "S T F U came into common online vocabulary in the late 1990s to early 2000s, during the rise of \nEarly internet chatrooms,\nOnline gaming,\nMessage boards/forums  Gen Z were just being born during that time leaving S T F U to the elder millennials", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:30:22", "owner": "j.stuart91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097634617865852, "text": "Chill son OD is definitely millenials", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:29:56", "owner": "louie.woodz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18119911096554181, "text": "Soooooo I’m the age of gen z but raised as a millennial 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:29:44", "owner": "natey_the_ghost", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114767569604371, "text": "Some of the alpha stuff was made by Gen Z just not popular", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:29:16", "owner": "davidfails_369", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104300671646577, "text": "Now Ohio how did we get drug into this 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:29:09", "owner": "bobbycouch", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18109413544611879, "text": "Man, im between milneiam and genz... I am 2006", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:28:51", "owner": "fxl_____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048607850680849, "text": "Definitely mil according to this", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:27:56", "owner": "justamechanic4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18208399279313043, "text": "even when born in 91, is a just a Gen Z… maybe Zillenial, but really much a Gen Z at heart", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:26:33", "owner": "mcgoldner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18384171850147338, "text": "I gen love new age slang.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:25:42", "owner": "flyingballerpython", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891445009244430, "text": "Thank you", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:23:13", "owner": "isabelle.greiner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030425576751584, "text": "No", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:21:11", "owner": "meghnavink", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087602998962744, "text": "Wait I've never heard 21", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:20:12", "owner": "el1ana16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902780926314822, "text": "Cringey", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:20:12", "owner": "the_man_in_middle", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18104180428658412, "text": "What 69?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:19:17", "owner": "anip84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117984499554489, "text": "Stfu is Millenial.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:18:59", "owner": "shazzagreen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113969161501623, "text": "Bruh, y’all lil newbies really think you got game? Sit down, this is big-era energy. Our slang walked so yours could soft-launch....may Raptor Jesus bless you all.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:14:42", "owner": "magnusson1994", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854398708575923, "text": "You know what this helped, I knew some of them, but the different versions actually helps", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:13:39", "owner": "hazel_knight_puff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121563784533748, "text": "67 original is NOT the same as 41", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:12:47", "owner": "jknkhz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075665137983219, "text": "Excuse me. STFU is a millennial term. Don’t steal our culture", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:12:16", "owner": "flupox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18395304580135944, "text": "It was painful but accurate", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:08:26", "owner": "brendan.1st", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076718317952479, "text": "Not simply utilizing English when speaking in English is fnckiug stupid 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:06:20", "owner": "pawl_e_wog", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103829605591263, "text": "Twin, just sybau and gtfo, bro thought he cooked with this one ong, just put the fries in the bag lil bro😭✌️", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:03:37", "owner": "treeguy_89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120753955476713, "text": "I just want to have cp slang", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:00:23", "owner": "maredite_sdu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988379178886832, "text": "None of that was millennial to me..a millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:58:58", "owner": "tae10r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18492209209074234, "text": "What the sigma 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:57:49", "owner": "addiejpark", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18433265248104395, "text": "Im sorry, dog water is NOT gen alpha", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:57:33", "owner": "apple.ciderx3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096735607876331, "text": "Omg finally in terms i understand 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:57:21", "owner": "mariemxrphine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18181611394358371, "text": ".... let's take both alpha and z and push them somewhere else 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:57:06", "owner": "jeshiewafflez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961826175861457, "text": "\"saibau\" sybau bruh ts pmo 🥀🥀🥀", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:56:53", "owner": "bansurvivor69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928068292157179, "text": "I'm a gen z with most slang of a millennial lol", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:56:43", "owner": "koriixia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847096624587227, "text": "This was so helpful", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:56:37", "owner": "patonyourback", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075435734211364, "text": "Its actually getting worse..", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:56:07", "owner": "lapink85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089220119505130, "text": "OD is before Alpha", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:56:00", "owner": "lovely_crowned_jewel", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17929039329017311, "text": "I finally understand the world!", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:56:00", "owner": "shadow.hybrid060900", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051512039352370, "text": "Millennials are not even saying half of those words mentioned 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:55:27", "owner": "so_hamburgerr_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18094702873848799, "text": "I appreciated this video translation so much. Haha. Now when I smile and nod, I’ll have a modicum of understanding", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:53:57", "owner": "corrinthomas", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17901549834325456, "text": "I really relate to gen z and millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:49:01", "owner": "oleary.mickey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925380403174803, "text": "- what generation am I if I understand all 3\n- chronically online. Chronically online is what you are", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:48:35", "owner": "moh_belgoumri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019224401612575, "text": "America Standard Code of Brainrot Interchange (ASCBI)", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:47:15", "owner": "i.o_insta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105392476577813, "text": "Dog water has been around since I was in middle school do NOT give that to gen alpha", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:46:43", "owner": "ijp_xx821", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18378972748148576, "text": "Wait this is so interesting!!! I’m a GenZ and having it explained this way was kinda cool ngl", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:43:07", "owner": "kimonrara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867859879496318, "text": "See this is what I mean. As a GenZ from early 2000s, I literally use both Millennials and GenZ phrases 💀😂\n\n(Especially creepypasta, miss those days)", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:42:36", "owner": "hildrauxisme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856909123560447, "text": "i thought dog water existed before gen alpha came", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:40:21", "owner": "bookmarkvivi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969572817976128, "text": "As a 1996 baby I feel like neither a Millennial or a Gen Z… they both be weird af too", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:39:04", "owner": "joseph_m_day", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120274183541303, "text": "This is highly accurate!!! Mil 🙌🏾", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:35:47", "owner": "tysweetheart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950646700048054, "text": "Who is this dude .. 67 rant 69 . Wtf… 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:32:38", "owner": "hifza.atir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18349222264207041, "text": "Bro you for real dick riding right now. Hop off your bro meat nigga.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:28:56", "owner": "amjinx257", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879401095331804, "text": "And boomers so we grandparents know what are grandchildren are saying", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:27:53", "owner": "derxleben2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903625177304488, "text": "What the fuck is 41??", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:27:37", "owner": "bullboyphilly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926076475160926, "text": "Want fanum tax a vine thing? correct me if i’m wrong", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:26:45", "owner": "ken.drone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045401780468097, "text": "Make it stop", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:24:57", "owner": "zeina.amir_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301107199259135, "text": "As a Gen X it would be nice to have a version of this that included my generation & the Alpha generation. Trying to stay current and it is not easy for me 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:23:46", "owner": "mamabear_1518_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543385096038217, "text": "Creepy pasta?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:17:59", "owner": "b3.you_nique", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061228952219468, "text": "I am Gen Z with a mixture of Millennial and my own Generation....NICE 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:17:50", "owner": "aaligrae47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164288380401402, "text": "Wrong so many...", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:12:37", "owner": "rojak_lee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18440942482102500, "text": "tf is 21", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:12:32", "owner": "de.chliextremist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18340051951227717, "text": "Freddy fazbearing? 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:08:43", "owner": "trumanwheeler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072452981345450, "text": "I'm really a Zillenial 💀💀💀", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:04:04", "owner": "31anubis81", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367822969084557, "text": "this actually made sense", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:02:25", "owner": "sophiainflow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951203878044225, "text": "I wish I were deaf and blind rn", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:01:59", "owner": "king_of_kr4bs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18349976425205032, "text": "Chad isn't gen z ?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:58:59", "owner": "hayk_grig04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126891052514508, "text": "Yeah I'm a Zennial lol", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:58:22", "owner": "zydrateaddict", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936716424980466, "text": "Stay in your lane old man", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:55:41", "owner": "cheese_is_a_square", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075699478975432, "text": "I am all", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:55:08", "owner": "mharffs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904496392286873, "text": "Cheugy boomer?? Never heard of it in my life 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:52:52", "owner": "avcnrfz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084023690021738, "text": "I'm a GenZ, but am I secretly a millennial?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:50:28", "owner": "the_codmmunist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18191033869327993, "text": "And the Gen X translation?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:50:26", "owner": "kangalic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088875860482049, "text": "Who tf says cheugy boomer", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:49:22", "owner": "damousx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396216994133610, "text": "Realizing I’m both millennial and gen z", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:48:47", "owner": "_tanveer_tanna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157837018409126, "text": "That's gen alpha vs younger gay gen z vs older gen z with common mix ups", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:46:29", "owner": "ozhamagniv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105260269652479, "text": "Nah Gen Z used Chad before Gen Alpha", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:45:32", "owner": "dino740", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996188319851474, "text": "Gen z but talk millennial but 21 still a goat", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:44:47", "owner": "mrghoully_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104206114577949, "text": "Sleeper agent activation codes", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:43:50", "owner": "rcg2k05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985744977876431, "text": "I'm a millennial, and I don't know at least five of these phrases that you have just put into the world", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:34:14", "owner": "ruthless_rouge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072105833581057, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:34:09", "owner": "vidarplatypus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084462080060402, "text": "What about M*t*3r F**k*r ? Is it the same for all gen? One more, why is 67?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:33:18", "owner": "remembericankissyou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941198029086526, "text": "So i am between Gen Z and Millenial", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:32:20", "owner": "_marvinkath_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064596272620137, "text": "Stfu is also millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:31:48", "owner": "mimi.likes.dramas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18426714172129503, "text": "I’m a zillenial", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:31:33", "owner": "nicky_doctorwhoisamazing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854153062577551, "text": "Can we stop with all this slang it just sounds more stupid the more we go on", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:30:15", "owner": "tamakashi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18537020497033215, "text": "Mate we had 3 6 9 from lil john!", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:29:57", "owner": "_meltdown_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087665503985088, "text": "I’m a Gen Z and I use both Gen Z and Millennial sayings lmao", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:27:04", "owner": "_nowhereandeverywhere", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908570596125901, "text": "I qualify as millennial but never said 95% of millennial hip words. Nor watched any of the stupid ass videos they associate with thankfully", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:24:48", "owner": "draggodurango", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100106896687184, "text": "Ik creepypasta and im gen z is it millenial?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:24:47", "owner": "trash_boat_129", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079156372908578, "text": "Im Gen Z and apparently got the vocabulary of a millennial, love it lads", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:23:38", "owner": "justinverbon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896839186344854, "text": "Oh my god it makes sense and that’s why I hate it", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:22:24", "owner": "ilyninero_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18300581287253938, "text": "How about shut up, bro?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:20:38", "owner": "aqlanmalek_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18393947197131351, "text": "\"Say bow\" 🥀", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:14:44", "owner": "alifeofz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112035043525149, "text": "I have all of the genz and millennial vocabulary i grew up in that time period where I experienced the millennial stuff at the end but still had the gen z stuff going", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:09:43", "owner": "seppy0133", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079177429921745, "text": "I'm gen z and idk half the stuff he said, but I know the gen alpha slangs 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:09:31", "owner": "shreya.exists", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304663273281901, "text": "😱😱 my 5 year old is a generation Alpha and says most of these expressions 😱😱", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:07:41", "owner": "amusevslin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973006392959683, "text": "Born 97 is a hybrid of millennial and gen z", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:06:35", "owner": "thristov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081911885153599, "text": "Im deffo about to say these to my sons 😂😂😂 now I understand what they are saying!!", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:00:53", "owner": "steponme56", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005086268820171, "text": "All this is just american shit", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:54:16", "owner": "rushil_aggarwal98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968893872826659, "text": "So fried that i know all of them", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:53:57", "owner": "jhl.com.tw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165543994376799, "text": "How is put the fries in the bag and \"lock in\" are in the same category?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:44:25", "owner": "ofir_shalhov", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18065266529160333, "text": "I feel like mil high key is saying low key lol Hella is specific to west coast at one time like people outside of west coast had no idea what hella meant when I was going to. College I’m like wtf", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:43:06", "owner": "lookdatzme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086052931975398, "text": "My head hurts", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:42:40", "owner": "ivqanairam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918602359198957, "text": "Wait so my gen z ass has been talking like a millennial? Wicked", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:42:17", "owner": "celestialfae.king", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982787112767917, "text": "Merepek lahai!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:33:45", "owner": "b.o.t.a.k.0.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109317952609263, "text": "Source?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:33:09", "owner": "dazed.puppet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976919160791162, "text": "This is cooked", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:31:07", "owner": "joeyprimerano", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059622692250895, "text": "hmmm i feel like the gen z examples were such a mix between early gen z and late gen z but good vid nevertheless", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:30:24", "owner": "luk.eyboii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967663710992248, "text": "Why... did I understand words from multiple genz.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:30:12", "owner": "rangersword21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939376852096761, "text": "Why does Alpha make the least sense i mean they really just went left at a right turn", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:30:08", "owner": "scent_of_insanity", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119335570546337, "text": "Did I just have a stroke?!", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:26:55", "owner": "nickj1015", "likes": 4100}, {"id": 17864740362512146, "text": "Goes tooooo far 😪", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:24:49", "owner": "cynt__chat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876588055350651, "text": "@bluefranklin1 basically everyone till 04 aligns with the milenials", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:21:04", "owner": "staticvoidparadox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109675576717735, "text": "Wtf is 41", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:16:41", "owner": "jahlildgoat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078513064906720, "text": "This video really pisses me off", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:15:38", "owner": "jay._.ford", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338893840226787, "text": "Swag", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:14:30", "owner": "it_is_bell", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083459030038524, "text": "Gen Z enjoys 69 more than you think. (Said the guy who's been single for the last 6 years)", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:14:25", "owner": "shirxx.18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873643135452008, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:11:59", "owner": "eddie_wheelie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18409297450142573, "text": "This was actually educational. Mostly ause ive never heard what these young'uns be sayin'", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:05:09", "owner": "ambertje_93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970699068972168, "text": "if my english teacher gave me this for an analogies assignment i would’ve understood it…", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:03:37", "owner": "chase.jurkofsky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045741968476977, "text": "Im sorry but legit nothing from gen alpha is coherent like no real words in there 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:01:25", "owner": "alexbalaisroohni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079938770137038, "text": ".. me, a gen ㅤz with the vocabulary of a millennial 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:00:17", "owner": "8aylaaaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110132866612939, "text": "Motipppppppp", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:57:35", "owner": "oneohhonee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18297776344257592, "text": "Noticing a lot of the things alpha says are just things blk ppl say", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:56:15", "owner": "damndomo21", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18133445227490765, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:51:56", "owner": "011101v", "likes": 16}, {"id": 18247039834291892, "text": "Ngl, I've always used Gen Z and millennial language (according to this). Never knew there was a difference", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:46:33", "owner": "amelia_kellerman", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17873810850377111, "text": "Thank you", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:45:48", "owner": "thejonsalea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861315361540136, "text": "You’ve mixed up a lot of the Gen Alpha brain rot and claimed it’s Gen Z, half of them were wrong", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:43:20", "owner": "mathew_zon0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054936473328482, "text": "Uhhhhh why do I understand all of them.....", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:43:03", "owner": "arthurj.mccarson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029390033757743, "text": "ig I really am a Zillennial 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:41:06", "owner": "crazikat1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072742538599292, "text": "Where does “cancer” lie on, or is that just a term only used by Gmod and tf2 players", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:32:06", "owner": "mrtechyyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898690765370268, "text": "What’s 9 plus 10", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:29:24", "owner": "hashxgag", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17848370163605843, "text": "Only thing this video shows is that you don't know what any of these phrases mean", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:28:58", "owner": "blackwingguru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072080252590774, "text": "None of these make sense", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:27:09", "owner": "barywong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956588068041764, "text": "Groovy dudes, hang 10", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:26:43", "owner": "daytona_raving", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061072166532574, "text": "No.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:25:52", "owner": "puzzled_2urtles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847259926585037, "text": "Thank you very much I needed this more than anything", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:23:23", "owner": "its_s.a.e.e.d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078708209229309, "text": "Uh millennial here an I did not use half those words 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:19:36", "owner": "rahz_gram", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852552421583821, "text": "I hate to say it…. But I understand it now", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:16:52", "owner": "krytus_78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098702020883246, "text": "HOLY SHIT IT'S PANAGIOTIS", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:16:45", "owner": "gnahoerly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083002544018906, "text": "and once again I’m reminded I’m in between two generations 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:16:36", "owner": "_happyfre99_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025976579585575, "text": "wtf is this, just scrap all the “slang”", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:12:39", "owner": "sophie_martin003", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896179474349849, "text": "Even my gen alpha ass has to rely on the millennial if i dont get the gen z", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:12:25", "owner": "queer_alterhuman6492", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18096614386660856, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:08:45", "owner": "kongsasis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18330030874210173, "text": "What is 21 I am gen Z and I only know 69 or 9/11 dude", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:08:14", "owner": "the_lightbringer_of_hell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18380262610144032, "text": "69is gen z", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:04:07", "owner": "reyuzakigojo", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17842224609629554, "text": "0% Alpha, 33% GenZ, 66% Mil, but I'm from 01😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:02:26", "owner": "sarinakbl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18342690133233922, "text": "As a gen z i don't know half of the so called \"gen z lingo\" 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:59:56", "owner": "charleyvandersalm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927739393153644, "text": "I’m all over the place!😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:56:14", "owner": "vanshi._.m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061806740536635, "text": "I need a reset as i know all of these Freaking words 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:46:01", "owner": "kazunathan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988424373911862, "text": "I miss when “Powned” was common", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:45:24", "owner": "audeo_bellicus", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18110306746611582, "text": "Unc where did you get this data from because I swear to god this shit is actually ass and just let me tell you not even half of Gen Z even tapping into that goon corn ball ass shit.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:43:02", "owner": "red.inferior_panda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18306349141269599, "text": "What’s this  six-seven ??? All I know is a six and a seven and a sixty seven", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:33:27", "owner": "anushaarja", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066387089570900, "text": "What? No, it's not...", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:32:48", "owner": "ikhtionikos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914392252247393, "text": "One I still can’t believe I still hear is people saying “That’s fire” I heard that since I was in high school 15 years ago 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:28:15", "owner": "scottmazmanian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952165723043277, "text": "okay thank you now i understand what my lil brother said :)", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:27:54", "owner": "chanduuull_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073104704049563, "text": "I’m 41 and I don’t use much slang anymore.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:27:45", "owner": "ryanshaun808", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852681208586450, "text": "So much of this is wrong", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:24:06", "owner": "katwells3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193153981333460, "text": "Dawg water was 1000% Gen Z", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:19:14", "owner": "sammy_j_miller", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051435389345004, "text": "I'm gen z and i know everything except 21. Also, dog water can be gen z term too", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:17:11", "owner": "anuja.exe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946375212939509, "text": "Chad was before Alpha, we get chad", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:15:38", "owner": "_ledbury5_", "likes": 647}, {"id": 17988756716739806, "text": "So I actually do under stand them got it the words just changed", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:14:35", "owner": "unicornskittle2233", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076646603186764, "text": "Why do I use the milenial version for this words?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:09:14", "owner": "_filipty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981832542926802, "text": "Put the fires in the bag does not mean lock in", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:06:34", "owner": "quicklimewash", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921526537056502, "text": "So wait... I BEEN USING THE MILLENNIAL ERA LANGUAGE EVEN THOUGH I KNOW SOME OF GEN Z LANGUAGE! jeez... I guess I am a gen z but more related to the Millennials.... jeez im only 19... (for now since my bday is in December)", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:01:08", "owner": "revo_wolfspade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843235375622321, "text": "I use gen Z & Millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:58:16", "owner": "_katathlipsi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088543084766338, "text": "Im sorry, usually the millennial references hit but this not it.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:57:41", "owner": "harleygre3n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892167883376344, "text": "Back rooms is also Gen Alpha no?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:55:11", "owner": "bchnn_s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101565178667324, "text": "kids these days are cooked. 67 this. 67 that. what about 9-5 🗿", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:48:56", "owner": "beese_churged", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032283602531140, "text": "Creepy pasta is a gen z thing too bro we were gen alpha backrooms age when creepypasta got huge", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:48:42", "owner": "f4b10.f0g0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18189677896336980, "text": "Thank you for explaining but my head hurts now", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:47:22", "owner": "phoenixashley1995", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158844136399224, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:45:37", "owner": "farisss.jpeg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036865547723391, "text": "As a general gen z I can say half of not most of us never say half the stuff you claim we do", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:44:50", "owner": "bigiceout", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071235164581322, "text": "Thank you", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:42:48", "owner": "denzel.glassie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900018079181269, "text": "Never heard of freddy frazbearing", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:41:22", "owner": "kenzozay_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164166826384906, "text": "Who use freddy fazber-ing. Why involve freddy into the conversation?!", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:41:11", "owner": "muzuleap", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064228886622065, "text": "\"Lock in\" isn't the same as \"wrap it up\"", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:41:05", "owner": "mermaidensarif", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119587000529450, "text": "Tf is this I can’t relate 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:40:18", "owner": "theunreadiaries", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086174356825833, "text": "I’m old", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:33:46", "owner": "doriencbaker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100191832815300, "text": "How to get a migraine 😵‍💫", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:33:14", "owner": "antsy_pantz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890052808384506, "text": "Ohio and Backrooms are both Gen Z bro", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:32:48", "owner": "dekkerkoch93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998010765697162, "text": "I feel like in the 90s we used the filler word “like” a lot, but hearing the word “literally “ misused and overused on loop is really starting to give me a switch 😂 like, you are not like, going to “literally” like, die without your phone. Like.😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:32:24", "owner": "keli.hazy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949673038048717, "text": "I'm a genz with a mil mind and living in gen alpha 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:26:19", "owner": "bayzido_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080307743164880, "text": "I’m a GenZ Mil hybrid", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:26:09", "owner": "tyrrell_harry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544589593020097, "text": "Me as gen z mixing both gen z and millennial 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:23:04", "owner": "errit_123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095602306892658, "text": "Team zillenial", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:23:03", "owner": "baby_jonesy_1999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894594898360260, "text": "As I’m unfortunately from Gen Z, I’d like to stick to the English language.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:21:14", "owner": "cody_miles8ball", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859220500552994, "text": "Why am I so much like a millennial then gen z, and I’m gen z?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:20:11", "owner": "brooke_card", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18195266917323068, "text": "Us millennials have a lot of good ones but ngl dog water is one of my favorites of alpha slang.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:19:25", "owner": "kovo_original", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047819777456153, "text": "Since when was 41 a reference.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:18:20", "owner": "joshschorle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077557028184932, "text": "This...this made a lot of sense actually.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:18:12", "owner": "kovo_original", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075698216225011, "text": "Most of these feel like bullshit", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:15:55", "owner": "lucariovdv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119507395546423, "text": "17 38 is a better comparison to 67 I fear.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:13:01", "owner": "s_p_i_c_y_b_o_i", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867843637481366, "text": "I have no idea what 6 7 and 41 is and u know wat I think it best I don’t want to know", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:07:37", "owner": "mojihiro", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18085996655063601, "text": "Why am I as a gen z using gen alpha slang. I hate myself chat", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:04:17", "owner": "freyahufton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071965703054726, "text": "This is horribly inaccurate", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:02:02", "owner": "destination_scratch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104901196730603, "text": "The thing I found out with gen Z and millennials is they have kind of merged as well.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:01:33", "owner": "abbie._.gilbert", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114828526565111, "text": "I just wanna say that I used dog water before alpha", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:01:32", "owner": "screw_ball420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087240365334338, "text": "Bro, thank you!", "created_at": "2025-11-25T06:59:13", "owner": "samyycooper", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995049012849749, "text": "uh i think you got “chad” and “alpha” switched. Chad was def a gen z meme.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T06:57:42", "owner": "barnali_behari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900222979338827, "text": "Half the Alpha shit is actually Gen Z and Millennials stuff, they aren’t old enough to have their own brain rot lexicon yet", "created_at": "2025-11-25T06:56:46", "owner": "tonychrisdansantiago", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18364699930093551, "text": "Most this shit is just untrue or reversed wtf", "created_at": "2025-11-25T06:56:34", "owner": "blue.eyes.white.chandler", "likes": 26}, {"id": 18385267555198283, "text": "Omg. I feel so old 😭and yeah we are cooked💀", "created_at": "2025-11-25T06:56:07", "owner": "wilondjajr_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088985477055191, "text": "As a person who speaks English as a second language and doesn't live in a country where English is national language keeping up through the generation language is a nightmare (yes I'm old)", "created_at": "2025-11-25T06:49:09", "owner": "el.livia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051797702361924, "text": "Yeah but 69 actually has meaning where wtf are the others", "created_at": "2025-11-25T06:43:12", "owner": "kayla_sim23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100624804801652, "text": "I’m a mix of Gen Z and millennial vocabulary 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T06:42:59", "owner": "d4r7h.z0r4n", "likes": 27195}, {"id": 18059445293642205, "text": "“unc” ahh chat 🥀🥀", "created_at": "2025-11-25T06:41:05", "owner": "darrenwilliaam_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921836068056106, "text": "Nigga mils had 1738 aye", "created_at": "2025-11-25T06:31:16", "owner": "genos_journey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102299830662631, "text": "Weve been saying dogwater since halo 2 dont you give that to gen alpha.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T06:26:59", "owner": "_relatable_content", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075191935993104, "text": "What I’m worried about is that; I’ve heard since early 2025 they are producing Gen Beta!", "created_at": "2025-11-25T06:24:09", "owner": "aayabhediyaaaya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075050272997442, "text": "Gotta save this dictionary for later", "created_at": "2025-11-25T06:22:46", "owner": "go_zoom_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075696107521143, "text": "you swapped alpha and chad", "created_at": "2025-11-25T06:15:51", "owner": "jilingren585", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133139182468908, "text": "1999", "created_at": "2025-11-25T06:13:22", "owner": "cageyjoey", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17921486649055480, "text": "Chad is not gen alpha it’s incel lingo and has been round longer than boomer. Please research before you make one of these", "created_at": "2025-11-25T06:12:13", "owner": "dualhelix_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050873384673634, "text": "Least accurate list of slang\n-\nAlso didn’t Chad start with millennial incels?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T06:10:05", "owner": "mr_macabre_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004321994826798, "text": "I got an even mix of all three", "created_at": "2025-11-25T06:09:42", "owner": "joelplaysjazz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081997643322990, "text": "Is this guy a youth minister the hell? That was like...50% correct maybe and way too much of that was separated from gen z when it shouldn't be.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T06:03:59", "owner": "shxatterrornotfound", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091154015501108, "text": "Sorry I'm a millennial and we've said stfu not you're done", "created_at": "2025-11-25T06:02:07", "owner": "circenn2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052197002666237, "text": "What the actual fuck is all these", "created_at": "2025-11-25T06:02:04", "owner": "nikita_burford", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865781869501973, "text": "Huh", "created_at": "2025-11-25T06:00:52", "owner": "allyshaafrina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055547843654197, "text": "I'm somehow somewhere between Gen Z and a millennial according to this", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:59:53", "owner": "carpie_xx", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17937578286099640, "text": "No not even true most of these are incorrect or in the wrong generation", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:58:57", "owner": "saberfirefly3", "likes": 23}, {"id": 18112252885600264, "text": "41??? wtf is 41", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:57:22", "owner": "mikxllx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18113990293502616, "text": "sigh… BOW", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:57:01", "owner": "notcolin.04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925810366160431, "text": "Now they saying 41 randomly now", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:56:59", "owner": "jaimzgamer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105314590637576, "text": "combo of millenial and gen z here THIS PAINED ME", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:56:14", "owner": "n0sh0w5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084593432063631, "text": "wtf is 41", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:52:52", "owner": "ethan.mercer116", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035736692513067, "text": "Holy fuck I’m not that old man😱", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:51:58", "owner": "corza_ponyeim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18245865475291379, "text": "Snore.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:46:24", "owner": "kimcovey_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064544567427324, "text": "dog water is slang for gen alpha?? 😭😭 my dad and i have been saying that instead of swears from like 2012", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:40:46", "owner": "gingeraleforever", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18412144420189606, "text": "So the gen alphas are ‘tarded?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:36:07", "owner": "alaroe272", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086544023061588, "text": "I use all 3", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:34:41", "owner": "gramith96", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18145895062448839, "text": "Who tf is alpha", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:32:20", "owner": "orel_mizrachi0", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17846047200613336, "text": "Who the fuck says freddy fazbearing????", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:22:07", "owner": "_rikicg_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083771419844648, "text": "Chad is gen z's bro", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:16:19", "owner": "nabibbi05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087707440795843, "text": "I think I'm in the wrong generation 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:00:33", "owner": "ah_snakes06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073810196523522, "text": "Aw hell naw, I KNOW you didn’t give them dog water", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:00:00", "owner": "chismwiththefreakingautism", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130171807498864, "text": "Idk how I feel about this", "created_at": "2025-11-25T04:57:51", "owner": "dmundy24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954580219041111, "text": "Now do all this again in High English", "created_at": "2025-11-25T04:55:15", "owner": "benjaminsetow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955415728042751, "text": "Today I learned I’m a millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-25T04:45:18", "owner": "ethanantle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955874377019923, "text": "Thank you, I needed the meanings for Alpha's language!!", "created_at": "2025-11-25T04:41:36", "owner": "1azriel1", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17848624683602683, "text": "Thank you legit😂🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-25T04:40:38", "owner": "anjali.210299", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066143249576583, "text": "Sometimes I wonder if I'm gen Z or mil. I know all the slangs from mil but not gen Z. But I thought people from early 2000 is gen Z.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T04:28:12", "owner": "s.art______", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086849581980121, "text": "Some of this is far from accurate", "created_at": "2025-11-25T04:27:59", "owner": "possibly_jay_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076907750469300, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T04:27:58", "owner": "gavinbielmann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947202391003701, "text": "I'm collecting slang like infinity stones then if I understood all this", "created_at": "2025-11-25T04:21:03", "owner": "paradox_meme_archives", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045474134470928, "text": "I understand gen z and mil. Alpha made my head hurt", "created_at": "2025-11-25T04:19:11", "owner": "axl.paradise", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842276536629137, "text": "I thought we were still in gen z. What happened???😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T04:17:25", "owner": "silverk7205", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071435444357993, "text": "Ur making shit up atp how about shut the fuck up for a change ty", "created_at": "2025-11-25T04:04:09", "owner": "kennarannek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050041262386374, "text": "Majority of that Ian know and I’m Gen Z", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:53:11", "owner": "classicjaywin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076171373224933, "text": "41????", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:40:24", "owner": "xuh_alex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019590644794337, "text": "69 was gen z", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:38:03", "owner": "calibratedistributor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026500667757591, "text": "Hell nah", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:19:24", "owner": "rorys_swag_posting", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930911446112969, "text": "Chad is beta", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:14:28", "owner": "papa_kier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047021504442635, "text": "I use everything but gen alpha and im a gen z", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:14:01", "owner": "itzxenig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087737615507066, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:10:49", "owner": "paxton.xu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100543249706947, "text": "I'm Gen Z. Never heard backrooms or fry tax in my life", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:05:51", "owner": "dawnbudd3", "likes": 2043}, {"id": 17931208581114362, "text": "Thank you I needed this", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:01:57", "owner": "quanjuemaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045182999704128, "text": "I forgot we use to say boomer 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:59:04", "owner": "meza_a_miguel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073119758197991, "text": "Millennial moments", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:43:46", "owner": "tyson.d.reese", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933491491109616, "text": "most of these feel right except the lock in one", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:35:17", "owner": "just_vico_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18397522960193665, "text": "1738", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:30:56", "owner": "seanp._mccabe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095412694873998, "text": "chad and alpha are backwards i think", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:30:23", "owner": "morgan.lambert23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061628741208208, "text": "I have mostly Gen Z and Millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:52:06", "owner": "uniqueartist98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887452960392412, "text": "creepy pasta is gen z stuff", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:48:40", "owner": "selenearrizubieta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083913536089097, "text": "L33t", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:45:50", "owner": "mark.d026", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976023204952288, "text": "As a Zillennial, I’m mostly fluent in both.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:37:22", "owner": "brandoniswhoiam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901463521317847, "text": "I mix between gen z and millennial even  tho I’m a millenial…", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:22:33", "owner": "sakurasugarnz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990693531885223, "text": "Today i learned i’m not a millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:15:39", "owner": "emaculategirl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925606966037853, "text": "I can’t lie I use all 3 interchangeably", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:11:47", "owner": "ming_dynasty_opioid_addict", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955463449030819, "text": "67 isn’t 21 or 69, 21 comes from the joke that the maths was so laughably wrong and 69 is a sex joke\n\n67 is 1738, they both have no real joke to them other than being from a popular song with no obvious meaning to the lyric so it just comes across as a comedically pointless lyric to the average listener", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:09:43", "owner": "ming_dynasty_opioid_addict", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863269000531677, "text": "Someone turn this man into a red mist and livestream it please 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-25T00:44:09", "owner": "tenacity_9157", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848365120603834, "text": "Some of these are accurate and some are just weird", "created_at": "2025-11-25T00:38:09", "owner": "tiwariamar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912894445099257, "text": "No one who was a child at the turn of the millennium is saying most of the ones you think they are", "created_at": "2025-11-25T00:17:34", "owner": "higglediggle69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396020497193100, "text": "Gen Z + Millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-25T00:16:49", "owner": "olly_g199", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087074911801967, "text": "No, thr Gen z one was 1738", "created_at": "2025-11-25T00:02:00", "owner": "izz0.dinardi2", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18046825352439795, "text": "The sad thing is. … this helped me. I now have more things to say with my gen alpha sister 🤣 she cringes so hard when I try to use gen alpha slang", "created_at": "2025-11-25T00:01:26", "owner": "wavesoflace", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009269966808595, "text": "Nothing has changed, I still don't want to live on this planet anymore", "created_at": "2025-11-25T00:01:01", "owner": "b.g.marcel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888760846387380, "text": "wth is this", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:59:57", "owner": "liana.marsters", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18349455175202785, "text": "It’s not creepy pasta, it’s the SCP foundation bruh", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:58:54", "owner": "memeslavv122", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099327781809725, "text": "I’m Gen Z and have never said or heard anyone say half of those", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:57:37", "owner": "milliewalsh_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027517001768687, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:54:05", "owner": "arttu_laine0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074740559349565, "text": "Wtf did I just watch?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:46:09", "owner": "whyguy16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067007828527804, "text": "Not sure which I am anymore 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:45:57", "owner": "liyemafandeso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847483729608582, "text": "Wait wait wait wait wait………… how does one 6/7  or 41 ? Or 21??", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:36:02", "owner": "vaisille", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18194377879329184, "text": "Now i know what Based means. Thank you, you have helped this old man.... I'm 29", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:20:33", "owner": "whyte_sunset", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18371742199158726, "text": "I’m technically gen z ((2002 baby)) but I grew up with a mix of not both of genz and mil 🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:06:49", "owner": "thomas.r.02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126175777506266, "text": "God I wish I was a millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:03:42", "owner": "razor.il", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18138396646415606, "text": "As an 03 Gen Z raised on millennial YouTube, it’s fascinating how I often use millennial and Gen Z terminology interchangeably.", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:02:32", "owner": "eileen18perez", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18099009640744465, "text": "Does anyone actually say cheugy besides millennials and older gen’s asking “why are the kids saying this?” Bc I feel like everyone’s gaslit themselves into believing this is something people say", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:01:42", "owner": "thesmartoneiam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095424787849446, "text": "Huh?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T22:53:58", "owner": "missdunagot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045356531474396, "text": "I love being part of the group between millennials and gen z", "created_at": "2025-11-24T22:53:35", "owner": "kirst.hall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929608216015458, "text": "Creepy pasta is NOT millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-24T22:48:54", "owner": "swellomede", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085591778051900, "text": "Me, a gen alpha, with the vocabulary of gen z and Millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-24T22:30:38", "owner": "delilahrivera148", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918877501209867, "text": "Chad definitely came before alpha", "created_at": "2025-11-24T22:05:40", "owner": "woddnwar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085851199951138, "text": "Thank you", "created_at": "2025-11-24T21:52:01", "owner": "jasonmmj0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366249895084702, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T21:43:45", "owner": "ahmetkerem__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367340683084592, "text": "nigga", "created_at": "2025-11-24T21:20:43", "owner": "bidness_mogultunisia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060575261246637, "text": "I'm gen alpha half of mine I've never heard of bro and I knew all the gen Z", "created_at": "2025-11-24T21:04:30", "owner": "emifloma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128015935446984, "text": "put the fries in the bag is not “lock in” bruh 😂 it means give it up loser ur not that guy", "created_at": "2025-11-24T21:00:47", "owner": "theevilmanray", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18549769201043997, "text": "Now I'm not sure if I'm gen z or mil", "created_at": "2025-11-24T20:52:49", "owner": "muffin_katy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296642728261005, "text": "Z sometimes", "created_at": "2025-11-24T20:47:04", "owner": "seanks1943", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991305078731153, "text": "The fuck u on abt some the stuff is all Gen Z", "created_at": "2025-11-24T20:22:34", "owner": "im_very_bored0_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085498901075194, "text": "This is how I know I'm a Zlenial", "created_at": "2025-11-24T20:18:11", "owner": "soleillouise", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072518927362228, "text": "It’s not seebauw it’s shutyobitchassup you just gotta say it fast", "created_at": "2025-11-24T20:08:30", "owner": "may.b.n0t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103613212663362, "text": "I should be genZ but i resonate more with millennial (z-lennial)", "created_at": "2025-11-24T20:06:48", "owner": "anton_atananasov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081607799027335, "text": "swag , no street sred", "created_at": "2025-11-24T19:34:01", "owner": "hugeniggacockballs2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085208012095881, "text": "Put the fries in the bag is not lock in", "created_at": "2025-11-24T19:33:07", "owner": "copy__casper", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100890958682430, "text": "No", "created_at": "2025-11-24T19:24:25", "owner": "we_live_in_the_right_timeline", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18313044124301553, "text": "Wtf is fry tax? What is this nonsense 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T19:16:59", "owner": "debunklies", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855240649570254, "text": "Od was a thing before alpha was born", "created_at": "2025-11-24T19:13:33", "owner": "mikeiometry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064913558618423, "text": "Just put the fries in the bag is NOT lock in", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:49:45", "owner": "epere15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940004863090189, "text": "1996 = 69, stfu, boomer, wrap it up, cringey,  random, vibe, clout, nightmare fuel, bestie, crap, you guys, savage, wtf, glowup, flex on, blew off", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:43:48", "owner": "svberkelbas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035521757514940, "text": "Thank you ;)", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:17:38", "owner": "kata57010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928825222018361, "text": "What the hell are even some of these I have never heard of them before in my life? Like cheugy boomer? Tf?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:07:36", "owner": "theevilfuckingwizard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885336172281597, "text": "Gen z has chad, alpha has.. alpha.", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:00:17", "owner": "killalljiggers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900579175181306, "text": "Copying someones entire video and doing it worse than them is disgusting", "created_at": "2025-11-24T17:41:00", "owner": "theezilife", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18094541356803990, "text": "Gen alpha slang actually makes no sense", "created_at": "2025-11-24T17:28:20", "owner": "emimithechaotic", "likes": 47787}, {"id": 17971040438970064, "text": "What the hell is 41? Please i can’t handle another number", "created_at": "2025-11-24T17:07:40", "owner": "tommybroutt", "likes": 434}, {"id": 17906276166268508, "text": "Where did 41 come from???", "created_at": "2025-11-24T16:44:48", "owner": "inkieflame", "likes": 228}, {"id": 18086468900511176, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T16:32:41", "owner": "r.jenkins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030720575538721, "text": "I'm a true Gen Z indeed.", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:57:42", "owner": "snrmlnc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088264672777711, "text": "With this video, I realized I'm half gen z, half millennial, I'm born 03 so not too far off of being a millennial", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:09:24", "owner": "bappster420", "likes": 146}, {"id": 18086909086998047, "text": "As a millennial what the hell does ‘fry tax’ mean. Also we prefer to be known as 90s kids", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:04:59", "owner": "imrant1234567890", "likes": 136}, {"id": 18071778911362904, "text": "I'm a Gen Z what's 21?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:04:00", "owner": "titoforos", "likes": 2803}, {"id": 18108977560541678, "text": "Ohio isn’t gen alpha it’s gen z", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:35:23", "owner": "nweh__hheja", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021365930607011, "text": "Gen z with a vocabulary of a Gen z", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:06:06", "owner": "mia_buny_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980455860926428, "text": "Why am I so f’ing slow..? 😂 \nWhy’d it take me half@of the video to start understanding…? 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:54:25", "owner": "patrickdoe86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881628508421626, "text": "Me, a Gen Z with the vocabulary of a Millennial 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:08:54", "owner": "elsadubroca28", "likes": 4770}, {"id": 18062728418194531, "text": "Get boomers in there", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:43:48", "owner": "marty.mac40", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048500360415801, "text": "Just shut up. Please. This was a painful watch", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:04:11", "owner": "bongbeforebeer", "likes": 24027}, {"id": 17870115534470498, "text": "The god dam Rosetta stone here", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:17:09", "owner": "_michael_donowho", "likes": 549}, {"id": 17986882004869480, "text": "Sigh bau", "created_at": "2025-11-24T00:11:23", "owner": "redbr111", "likes": 33}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["bluefranklin", "slang", "67"]},
{"media_id": 3772183567972532317, "shortcode": "DRZfPgckYBd", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRZfPgckYBd/", "taken_at": "2025-11-23T12:03:21", "caption": "sis has been unintenionally lifting 5kg weights on a daily all this while ???", "owner_username": "akaeipotatoray", "owner_id": "44376445199", "likes": 903199, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0124_DRZfPgckYBd\\DRZfPgckYBd_20251123_120321.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18063608054396746, "text": "What’s in the bag?😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T12:14:59", "owner": "obviouslygodsfavorite", "likes": 114045}, {"id": 17979088730942017, "text": "Oo lala ❌. Ah leh leh ✅", "created_at": "2025-11-23T15:42:37", "owner": "heykiddgee", "likes": 42294}, {"id": 17933022846127458, "text": "Bro doesn't need the gym, her bag is the gym itself bro", "created_at": "2025-11-23T12:32:49", "owner": "limjayda", "likes": 238185}, {"id": 17940084674970121, "text": "Average female bag weight 💪🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:30:26", "owner": "sami_narine", "likes": 56999}, {"id": 17851892892548617, "text": "Having taken some bags of my lady friends, yes. You lot like to lift weights around your daily life for one reason or another 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T13:55:00", "owner": "rawrfikky", "likes": 6675}, {"id": 17919574842199898, "text": "Well..bags are from 2-5kg on regular days 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T11:49:00", "owner": "adri_hodajuci_paradox", "likes": 735}, {"id": 18176169220368054, "text": "the way she placed the bag down so casually tho😭", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:03:17", "owner": "mcspaicee", "likes": 9112}, {"id": 18099030043774668, "text": "me with my school bag be like😭", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:51:25", "owner": "cs.editzz0", "likes": 10608}, {"id": 17977745000787154, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T13:13:08", "owner": "jrmh_x", "likes": 4925}, {"id": 18030075347742546, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:41:39", "owner": "edenzur123", "likes": 1008}, {"id": 17950836309028153, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T19:22:59", "owner": "nishi_no_hattori", "likes": 374}, {"id": 18072786686029392, "text": "Is your friend just casually carrying Tungsten around or something", "created_at": "2025-11-23T19:04:00", "owner": "mjolnirsmiss", "likes": 987}, {"id": 18104344966735683, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:55:42", "owner": "nadyadeviva", "likes": 223}, {"id": 18054475712649002, "text": "5kg would equalize you, it's actually heavier than that LOL 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T13:22:01", "owner": "teeyumm", "likes": 7222}, {"id": 18104467648726465, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:47:33", "owner": "akram.25dz", "likes": 87}, {"id": 18085150222994249, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:01:21", "owner": "destroy.to.enjoy", "likes": 63}, {"id": 18098775670839005, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:16:19", "owner": "verdysonivelli", "likes": 137}, {"id": 17864113221526662, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:30:59", "owner": "andrew_vlou", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18032942627727973, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T21:33:00", "owner": "aria.s_covers", "likes": 192}, {"id": 18181246777361453, "text": "Shoulder pain speedrun", "created_at": "2025-12-03T23:00:58", "owner": "_nickstamelatos_", "likes": 12}, {"id": 18073411982456470, "text": "This is true. A woman's bag can easily be 5kg. 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:14:13", "owner": "annhime", "likes": 286}, {"id": 18074752991010493, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T08:14:46", "owner": "fake.rishii", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18067625432120139, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:51:38", "owner": "khairinnuhasbs", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18135743779484616, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:36:38", "owner": "fikrytalaohu_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063835250410574, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:13:08", "owner": "solochahaein", "likes": 30}, {"id": 17999528924691272, "text": "My bag 10 kg heavy.", "created_at": "2025-11-23T19:39:37", "owner": "rfft_rdswn13", "likes": 981}, {"id": 17873386059377853, "text": "That ah le le reminds me of Conan😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:40:41", "owner": "kazutedo19", "likes": 17}, {"id": 18368934703087829, "text": "I can't 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-24T09:19:07", "owner": "miyoi_o", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17949873411025887, "text": "AH LE LE…? CONAN…?", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:40:07", "owner": "cimon_cin", "likes": 195}, {"id": 18074494595466386, "text": "Sis just reinvented the catapult🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:32:01", "owner": "patcat7clouds", "likes": 67}, {"id": 18031501106535669, "text": "Can confirm my gf’s purse weighs bout 15kg", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:01:47", "owner": "rickicito06", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18131980345488964, "text": "Sometimes the greatest weapon is a woman’s purse. You never know what’s in there. The weight of the world is always in their purse.", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:39:34", "owner": "sushiwarrior98", "likes": 110}, {"id": 18092559958810185, "text": "Cause steel is heavier than feathers", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:54:11", "owner": "haicloudio", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18086782087972367, "text": "Bag of Bricks", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:20:43", "owner": "olive.moonmilk", "likes": 34}, {"id": 18399896950123960, "text": "@g3nd3rbndr me core", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:12:25", "owner": "zombie_plutonium", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17867769747415583, "text": "defying gravity ✨", "created_at": "2025-11-24T02:19:42", "owner": "mooshymello", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863687344520178, "text": "This got the same vibes as when Rock Lee took off his weights", "created_at": "2025-11-23T12:19:21", "owner": "vshdanny", "likes": 85441}, {"id": 18365113321094450, "text": "10kg is not even exaggerating", "created_at": "2025-11-23T12:34:20", "owner": "holosaxual", "likes": 9088}, {"id": 18383379022147979, "text": "At night playground not scared pontianak meh", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:32:39", "owner": "iann.lzh", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18034825508719921, "text": "Bag beban sehari-hari 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:07:22", "owner": "cecilialieberia", "likes": 250}, {"id": 17907789969273551, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T17:05:31", "owner": "elroy.lyx", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17894840724221854, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T12:09:11", "owner": "mypostmaker", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18030575534551111, "text": "I carry a big inventory too", "created_at": "2025-11-24T02:09:42", "owner": "_.nekovina._", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063194834194348, "text": "What on EARTH is in her bag?!?😂😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:33:25", "owner": "theduchessreturns", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18032255900535029, "text": "Are you French? Your accent sounds like a French person spoke English", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:12:46", "owner": "felrock_12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079114250142731, "text": "How come ma?", "created_at": "2025-12-03T12:05:57", "owner": "menzke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923491858197023, "text": "@rxsurreccion", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:00:59", "owner": "ctrlzzzu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981699567925942, "text": "Alelee", "created_at": "2025-11-24T08:28:38", "owner": "horioizuki", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17954602428034411, "text": "I love these videos. It’s like true best friends.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T13:34:28", "owner": "awesome__meg", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18060755762637903, "text": "Ma'am, your purse is not a substitute for your luggage 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:37:17", "owner": "celestialfae.king", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17970738809970515, "text": "We have lift off!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-23T18:05:46", "owner": "_jay_renda_", "likes": 283}, {"id": 17929006188078687, "text": "Sis brings tungsten with her", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:10:55", "owner": "intheacheron", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17856754194561100, "text": "She is strong 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:40:15", "owner": "sussy__boii", "likes": 21}, {"id": 18058807601274493, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:11:47", "owner": "jansdolls", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17882878944308227, "text": "Im glad im not the only one carrying my life lol", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:51:44", "owner": "theplastiks", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18067112951378190, "text": "My bag fr", "created_at": "2025-11-24T00:06:59", "owner": "orchid_cos", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17847516396613772, "text": "Rocklee ahh bag", "created_at": "2025-12-06T08:43:36", "owner": "spsmlsk_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076679405186399, "text": "Umm... Hello😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:48:53", "owner": "meindavinci___", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18136173172463650, "text": "Ah lele have a dumbell in Dat bag or some", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:22:59", "owner": "kihon_melting", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18072994688249142, "text": "i aint arm wrestle with someone carrying 5kg all day like is is another tuesday.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:25:11", "owner": "naufalwrld", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009800441649684, "text": "What has she packed on that bag?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:26:18", "owner": "akaya_tuning_shop", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18087761197988583, "text": "When Rock Lee took his weights off fighting Gaara", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:32:53", "owner": "kenxyro", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17850754635564132, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T14:06:57", "owner": "taqeem02", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18031782698736434, "text": "Got that bag of bricks like Dewey from Malcom in the middle", "created_at": "2025-12-04T05:13:41", "owner": "the_bee_2.0", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18156895405409048, "text": "Rock Lee irl", "created_at": "2025-12-04T12:16:37", "owner": "tej_.10", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18029300483757041, "text": "Just so you guys know… just another 2kg and that bag is already at the maximum carry on luggage weight on a plane 😭😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T05:57:51", "owner": "hildrauxisme", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17842702308625220, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T14:31:10", "owner": "vivredegin", "likes": 622}, {"id": 18083019266099368, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T22:55:03", "owner": "friereng_mywife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184440025347358, "text": "Never leave home without a tote bag with at least three notebooks, a pencil case, sunglasses, a glasses case, wallet, and phone i can attest to", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:51:53", "owner": "anonymous.sweetheart", "likes": 20}, {"id": 18410735125137197, "text": "Plot twist: she has half å dead body in there", "created_at": "2025-11-25T06:55:43", "owner": "bunny_njz", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18099666403806621, "text": "Wht u kut in your bag. Thor hammer,m", "created_at": "2025-12-03T04:04:05", "owner": "mr_arif_hasnan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885970153397102, "text": "What's in the bag 😮", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:44:40", "owner": "teadyaziz", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18056949785644462, "text": "ahh I see you found my bag", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:53:45", "owner": "lilvixenywy", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18047819216444478, "text": "Is... her shoulders alright?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:23:33", "owner": "art4li4e", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17909031504124489, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T15:20:27", "owner": "skyler0565", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17848768092574081, "text": "how my school bag used to be", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:09:34", "owner": "thana.silva", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18051427562361890, "text": "\"Ah le le\" elite ball knowledge", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:54:55", "owner": "totti1st", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18091725223911725, "text": "Women are incredible 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T05:49:05", "owner": "ktulu789", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17868527796411120, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:56:33", "owner": "naufal.afriza", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18353905006161095, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:21:58", "owner": "irfansyamil98", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18146922154388904, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T23:26:09", "owner": "_haidara_45", "likes": 19}, {"id": 17842003260628480, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T17:38:52", "owner": "itanico_21", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18003232433681688, "text": "Ah le le ah le las", "created_at": "2025-12-13T17:02:19", "owner": "reijigga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085244975022776, "text": "Since i was a kid, i always carry bags weighing over 5kg 😂 My classmates started calling me Doraemon because my bag had everything (first aid, foods, books etc). Now in university, my bag 👜 looks so small but my classmate was shocked when they held it seeing how heavy it was 🙂", "created_at": "2025-12-13T15:19:21", "owner": "tsuki_suki_12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103700761743226, "text": "Is there Someone's child in the bag?😭", "created_at": "2025-12-13T14:41:17", "owner": "luvhzf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18387104431197230, "text": "Ah le leee..im flying😂 cute laaaa", "created_at": "2025-12-13T13:06:47", "owner": "vizhckerz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183488089354848, "text": "Bag heavy asf😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-13T05:23:39", "owner": "rekasa1113", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958241815032679, "text": "Not by five at least ten kg bag right there", "created_at": "2025-12-13T03:06:47", "owner": "brenden_t_wilson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846552724620201, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T02:39:41", "owner": "edyanto1412", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097254781866993, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-13T01:35:25", "owner": "nathaly.peralta1984", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066540440426760, "text": "that's why they never gain weight 🤯", "created_at": "2025-12-13T00:54:28", "owner": "fidelisrio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007112984820568, "text": "I got shocked loool", "created_at": "2025-12-13T00:20:36", "owner": "kirafiredrake", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161378632393980, "text": "JY,TyY MYyzyyyT", "created_at": "2025-12-12T22:04:29", "owner": "highonshrimp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065054249398978, "text": "Is that singlish?", "created_at": "2025-12-12T20:16:37", "owner": "_archeval_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975655107950630, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T13:00:29", "owner": "cindssy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144815506449673, "text": "If  anatoly was a women 🤣😭", "created_at": "2025-12-12T12:38:36", "owner": "hamidinali97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842781358644624, "text": "she carrying the entire gym w her at all times", "created_at": "2025-12-12T07:49:45", "owner": "mazouz_ilies_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075902275992794, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-12T05:41:50", "owner": "zee_3s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922396999194575, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-12T04:52:55", "owner": "adtrs.x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860668729486818, "text": "That bag more than 5kg 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T02:13:16", "owner": "ne_lem0n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971949477978428, "text": "@thrwfa", "created_at": "2025-12-11T21:50:25", "owner": "nan97_ceo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088884418806099, "text": "WHY DOES THE BAG WEIGH SO MUCH WHAT ARE YOU CARRYING 😭😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T20:53:35", "owner": "ari_moony", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088721890798120, "text": "Hollowblocks XD", "created_at": "2025-12-11T18:36:04", "owner": "nickdanielz_23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007020521818022, "text": "Just like me fr", "created_at": "2025-12-11T17:51:32", "owner": "gampon._.megan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929336503159243, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T14:53:57", "owner": "afifahzamre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922906252057110, "text": "me with my 10 kg backpack", "created_at": "2025-12-11T12:20:36", "owner": "mad_laddie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069582017095521, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T08:45:43", "owner": "glutoniuscat66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322225228172249, "text": "alele.. conan ass reaction", "created_at": "2025-12-11T08:15:59", "owner": "ichaa_azz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545586175019742, "text": "istg we all carry bricks or smth", "created_at": "2025-12-11T03:27:17", "owner": "mikaylah.jadee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077459132194805, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T16:41:30", "owner": "eydhfrs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055643705333784, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T13:35:45", "owner": "_ayemoney_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092231849481043, "text": "Also, torque", "created_at": "2025-12-10T11:35:38", "owner": "cogan332", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085037110855221, "text": "girl got doraemon dimension in there", "created_at": "2025-12-10T11:21:44", "owner": "_amar_al_as_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842607976645299, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T08:46:18", "owner": "yaqout61", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937892076981536, "text": "\"Ah le le I'm flying\" Got me dying🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-10T03:58:30", "owner": "lthfia_qlb06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095460514919971, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T03:26:04", "owner": "urso.cosmico", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143739103446367, "text": "She has the strength of an ant.", "created_at": "2025-12-10T02:36:20", "owner": "shyshyshayyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053991893679024, "text": "That bag's her anchor, without it she'd fly away with the breeze 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T02:31:21", "owner": "meghali_pathak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008383919660200, "text": "The full stops in the speech 😂🤌🏻", "created_at": "2025-12-10T00:59:37", "owner": "1ost.maan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084469577035373, "text": "😂😊", "created_at": "2025-12-09T20:53:35", "owner": "rudarozamisia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869732848412826, "text": "Never underestimate a woman's core strength", "created_at": "2025-12-09T20:42:06", "owner": "dan23pg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087962296803364, "text": "hearing the singaporean accent makes me miss it over there 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:24:00", "owner": "gabr_.el", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085835018061042, "text": "Ah le le im flying how come I thought I weigh more than u i think 5kg 😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:06:26", "owner": "alkhalaf.zainab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858030847563226, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:20:34", "owner": "huda_bibah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006811112666129, "text": "The second I have anything on my bag turns into that bottomless pit one from Marry Poppins 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-09T13:36:41", "owner": "s.arah.kate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846779212618231, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-09T09:08:39", "owner": "abista_vd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861668671476431, "text": "@norhan.ashraf.733 shantetk", "created_at": "2025-12-09T07:47:47", "owner": "saraarafatt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18308152510271240, "text": "My school bag probably weights around 25-30 lbs", "created_at": "2025-12-09T02:32:49", "owner": "bug_soda_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070861967606704, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-09T01:35:33", "owner": "glamskure", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145483993452172, "text": "my bag fr", "created_at": "2025-12-08T22:51:03", "owner": "r4yn3r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110513926528223, "text": "Why she have a purse full of bricks?", "created_at": "2025-12-08T18:24:11", "owner": "twuntz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860713054554360, "text": "someone check on her back bc that is not a backpack😭💔", "created_at": "2025-12-08T06:47:33", "owner": "morbid_harmony", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947328699940331, "text": "No because this exact thing happened to me and it was my bag as well😭🤣 literally I keep EVERYTHING in that bag", "created_at": "2025-12-08T05:22:25", "owner": "sahara_fern_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085710293091484, "text": "My bag is definitely like this LMAO", "created_at": "2025-12-08T03:42:35", "owner": "mimsalyssa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865429192519021, "text": "OMG SHE IS A COPY OF CHAEYOUNG FROM TWICE 😱", "created_at": "2025-12-08T01:55:17", "owner": "raaimacedo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021916472786140, "text": "10lbs 😮", "created_at": "2025-12-07T21:57:22", "owner": "not_ok_68", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051300194663251, "text": "Her shoulder is crumbling", "created_at": "2025-12-07T21:18:27", "owner": "emme.pems", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852038446597940, "text": "KEEE GIII", "created_at": "2025-12-07T19:32:43", "owner": "_atomic_bomb._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080355788134559, "text": "@felycia_fefe like u asked me what's in my bag? lol", "created_at": "2025-12-07T18:08:19", "owner": "_alicenaing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909923908258599, "text": "🧱 👜 🏋️‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-12-07T17:56:45", "owner": "daneliaschoice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024772586594308, "text": "Alele okashione", "created_at": "2025-12-07T15:26:32", "owner": "jermaine_k_w", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18198572845321369, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T14:38:45", "owner": "cruz_.control._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539879059036795, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T14:11:42", "owner": "zzcrashnaxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972255204816735, "text": "🧚‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-12-07T13:57:39", "owner": "kangarue_n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086225152993753, "text": "Ah Le Le le ah lelos", "created_at": "2025-12-07T13:07:13", "owner": "_y_2_k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847519762593578, "text": "What kind of english is you learninggg", "created_at": "2025-12-07T09:41:05", "owner": "nm.khrlanm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048215459440913, "text": "She got a whole cabinet in that bag. 😅", "created_at": "2025-12-07T09:09:22", "owner": "zulhilmighazi90x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101283226688103, "text": "Bro getting train by master roshi", "created_at": "2025-12-07T05:04:49", "owner": "lee.ronson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101665495689311, "text": "Aleh leh", "created_at": "2025-12-07T04:38:06", "owner": "purrplexed__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989248686861048, "text": "Does that count for exercise?😅😁", "created_at": "2025-12-07T03:54:16", "owner": "athina777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084408830108852, "text": "That’s because we carry the kitchen sink.", "created_at": "2025-12-07T02:06:14", "owner": "starjunk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320910787174394, "text": "Rock lee removed the heavy plates:", "created_at": "2025-12-07T00:41:49", "owner": "afifiabrahman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056427758653436, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T23:47:35", "owner": "ci.demo.ko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539779540032190, "text": "ahleleleahlelas ahleleleahlelas", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:54:36", "owner": "azharud_in.too", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099392440756476, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:26:40", "owner": "zerayaicob", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083803763013468, "text": "My favorite thing about social media is that the whole world likes to share a laugh. 😁", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:26:10", "owner": "niceguyzero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106341238568018, "text": "*I'm *I *I *I *I *I *I'm *I *it's *I", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:58:26", "owner": "notxander.123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057429059311830, "text": "She’s carrying a bag full of stones, like Patrick Star bringing his rock bag to a hotel", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:34:54", "owner": "ivan.ouji", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065161466433466, "text": "Girly carry the whole town with her", "created_at": "2025-12-06T14:55:28", "owner": "silly.bat18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144955744446851, "text": "bros got that super saiyan training fr 😭🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-06T13:59:19", "owner": "shaxmizi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903839077308183, "text": "Sounds Nigerian", "created_at": "2025-12-06T13:30:09", "owner": "cheeze_cake_artz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901866853336731, "text": "Average middle/high school sibling's bag", "created_at": "2025-12-05T23:36:00", "owner": "thiccboi3000993", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946312720080920, "text": "5kg❌5ton✅", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:25:49", "owner": "dragos_corp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989008878912015, "text": "m09ll0l.k9", "created_at": "2025-12-05T17:37:56", "owner": "rulz_hppy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338699305237058, "text": "five kay gee", "created_at": "2025-12-05T17:29:49", "owner": "thawban_w", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901964623322699, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:57:04", "owner": "vladi.neverf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866016946514376, "text": "That's shoulder strength 💪", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:41:44", "owner": "hawwary13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18348984730204344, "text": "Alele conan vibe 🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:14:35", "owner": "abxdxyz_121", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934312471109505, "text": "HAHAHAHAAHAHA BRO PROBABLY HAS BRICKS IN HER BAG", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:33:22", "owner": "why.not.raniesha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099835405700769, "text": "My school bag in HS", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:11:02", "owner": "popstar_paige_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103780714659479, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T09:03:51", "owner": "keziasukakeju", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895511071361443, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:31:27", "owner": "memo_fareed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098387278827050, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:32:34", "owner": "dinmarpratama", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052377794350263, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:42:47", "owner": "prmtaad_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953932738045927, "text": "Gotta be carrying a frying pan", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:35:54", "owner": "thathighafguy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059636435268248, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:53:17", "owner": "naxorui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099120328774125, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:53:06", "owner": "gmeister_k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003003437824883, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:24:36", "owner": "nathan_theorine_magein", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047278067462004, "text": "This is actually a really common misconception. She always comes prepared, even bringing the dad of the date", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:13:00", "owner": "feljurd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935273203108591, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T02:38:24", "owner": "blackxgemstone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086772997997862, "text": "@chengyangi gw kalo naik jungkat jungkit sama lu", "created_at": "2025-12-04T00:21:19", "owner": "21_fif_12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065655923390619, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T23:20:39", "owner": "duaporsi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102002785809615, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:06:04", "owner": "adhipan_efx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855309817576054, "text": "if she was your sibling she would have jumped away and let you smack tf down", "created_at": "2025-12-03T19:59:50", "owner": "coatloucue", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17890677720382405, "text": "Ha!", "created_at": "2025-12-03T19:49:34", "owner": "baddstarx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940902703092065, "text": "id smash", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:35:38", "owner": "loganlogie_bear", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105345994648538, "text": "Your r too clean n your skin is so nice n your lips ohh my god next level", "created_at": "2025-12-03T13:04:45", "owner": "be_bake10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037303358711316, "text": "At first I thought \"pretty\" and then I was scared. You girls don't need the gym. 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T13:04:29", "owner": "andre_without_the_gael", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091075823486541, "text": "I really saw you mall real about bag just before this reel", "created_at": "2025-12-03T12:46:21", "owner": "its_aaquib_here", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093011347859143, "text": "Ah leh leh ale las ah lele ah le as", "created_at": "2025-12-03T11:56:32", "owner": "_milly_tessa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882756781308938, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T11:18:35", "owner": "moonfrop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114672913503788, "text": "A gaming laptop 💻", "created_at": "2025-12-03T10:01:15", "owner": "liimpgod", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017926649794292, "text": "me when I go to college and take every life necessary with me", "created_at": "2025-12-03T09:29:21", "owner": "nu.92002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003029837829713, "text": "Rock lee typa shit!!😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T07:12:58", "owner": "arfathyahiya", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18072614630363860, "text": "my laugh when the bag came off 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-03T04:49:40", "owner": "kamranshahid7293", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988508925864136, "text": "alele im flying", "created_at": "2025-12-03T00:51:59", "owner": "amollariaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852661396592179, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:48:27", "owner": "father_critis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079207127180677, "text": "Ah lelelee?!! Conan reference!!!", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:24:59", "owner": "starwburrychuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902640193322038, "text": "How my school bah feels", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:01:29", "owner": "alakai_13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918450910219047, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:33:49", "owner": "il3.am", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091130228508596, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:34:17", "owner": "rgblay1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138804877458591, "text": "This is me and my bag literally", "created_at": "2025-12-02T11:03:31", "owner": "random_otaku2307", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056442002643634, "text": "Ah lele? Conan bro..", "created_at": "2025-12-02T10:14:16", "owner": "4rt2.00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868359889493846, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T07:11:38", "owner": "afrachmn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065660468430259, "text": "Singapore ?", "created_at": "2025-12-02T00:20:47", "owner": "457aor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046894724454556, "text": "Ola la la ole le le", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:33:12", "owner": "lalatina_zen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107115469724116, "text": "What isn't in the bag?", "created_at": "2025-12-01T20:03:17", "owner": "piiroschka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903165220305413, "text": "OOCH 🥹✨🙌💥💥", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:44:29", "owner": "saturnsvoid_777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155010199414704, "text": "Why are they speaking in nigerian", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:37:28", "owner": "vjfd.9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072987647040014, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:32:52", "owner": "g_sasmita_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18297687436259156, "text": "أنا سعيلة", "created_at": "2025-12-01T18:58:59", "owner": "rrtt.1s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085742837102252, "text": "Huh your bag is 5kg ,what you put in your bag😂", "created_at": "2025-12-