🤣 the bag was the plot twist", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:00:39", "owner": "sunnyballoonface", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971145885968163, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T22:59:25", "owner": "afidzmisbah._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073550474364282, "text": "This happened with me (169cm) and my 186 cm cousin. He's all height and I'm all weight 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T21:41:00", "owner": "verinexa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083107556034190, "text": "Mine is 11kg heavy😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T19:19:07", "owner": "delorme.bastien", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983194677921946, "text": "Probably books. and laptop. and maybe an ipad, idk", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:46:22", "owner": "oekakisansai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067307348577711, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:38:37", "owner": "asinat_skz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172425166330804, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:27:57", "owner": "maulid_raihan_saputra_51", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067685597437151, "text": "Ah leh leh leeeehhh, okashinoooo", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:24:19", "owner": "im_gaya.btw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18324081868245682, "text": "It really is that damn bag", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:23:57", "owner": "zephyr.les", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18372860875156300, "text": "Nah that bag LOOKS heavy", "created_at": "2025-11-30T13:56:56", "owner": "xaviwifey_707", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164935456377295, "text": "@kiwi.shio", "created_at": "2025-11-30T13:27:18", "owner": "ktn_287", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075399095002623, "text": "A le le is such a conan thing to say🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:47:24", "owner": "_aru_iya_13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18520892833064295, "text": "Her bag is carrying my depression, my insecurities and my failures", "created_at": "2025-11-30T10:38:17", "owner": "aveyan.heh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165017644380658, "text": "POV our bag:let me resttttt", "created_at": "2025-11-30T10:29:14", "owner": "luviespp_594", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084964778101871, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:30:38", "owner": "angel_ang98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138326725411981, "text": "Wait I love this accent", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:16:15", "owner": "higaswan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542548069018880, "text": "I'm flying!", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:24:54", "owner": "birchlysovereignty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18292626328276560, "text": "So it is true that woman's bag is like doraemon's pocket😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:31:08", "owner": "xli_husxini", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989434752882543, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:07:01", "owner": "adinda.deen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990743583864168, "text": "I can recognize a Singaporean accent anywhere", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:04:53", "owner": "akako_jodie", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17852399100549001, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:50:35", "owner": "chibimidget_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079868606180603, "text": "scoliosis waiting in silence", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:16:05", "owner": "reyzlarc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065198171452092, "text": "isnt this the girl who hates men", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:18:50", "owner": "kkrominkrumble", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376758310158542, "text": "20lb 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:54:52", "owner": "marcangelosialongo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849220954603084, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:30:10", "owner": "weirdooo_villain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077503324970868, "text": "Is she carrying the secrets of the universe?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:22:20", "owner": "killerz_killerz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120397201550668, "text": "\"Ah Le Le I'm flying\"🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:08:13", "owner": "dalhat_md", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073301870200030, "text": "LMAOOOO", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:59:35", "owner": "_i_eat_children_8970", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879877447329156, "text": "Me during my entire teenage years 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:06:15", "owner": "thalia.szky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303673090248367, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:00:38", "owner": "kim._.oumaima1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971425242965594, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T19:56:28", "owner": "joaqu_inod", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924988357178162, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:40:51", "owner": "_.zackone._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095505985847100, "text": "That one friend who \"JUST CARRY THE ESSENTIAL\"", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:33:48", "owner": "atlasdia5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998360121844383, "text": "Is there a rock in there?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:02:52", "owner": "numpy01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097209355834915, "text": "Aww that’s cute my bag ways 15 kg🥰 @yejitale", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:01:04", "owner": "t_ashhii", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18076890656243496, "text": "Those shoes look so big on her tiny feet, how can she walk with those is what Im wondering.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:46:36", "owner": "floralprintsandcigarettes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105333103575982, "text": "Cute accent", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:36:20", "owner": "yeesian0522", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145389499446638, "text": "The thickest Singaporean accent I’ve ever heard 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:59:49", "owner": "shxnezoid", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17946143310077454, "text": "@alex_ayano_ it's u carrying a bag weighing 20kgs...", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:38:33", "owner": "anu_sha__rin__otaku__0077", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18420345553118825, "text": "The ahe le le reminds me of detective Conan 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:31:21", "owner": "hrishikeshvichore", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852353500548107, "text": "What is in the bag it so heavy, but she strong ya😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:28:16", "owner": "seojaehui_rin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120083803534087, "text": "You know its a good society if they use kilos instead of freedom units.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:25:14", "owner": "joris.schutte", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988679703882845, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:24:32", "owner": "photos_702_702", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074115395009943, "text": "tas isi batako", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:50:25", "owner": "sahipurin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928414057159189, "text": "Girl😭, do you guys carry heavy bag to smack someone with it?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:34:25", "owner": "afazscrack", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850345108565090, "text": "Ul le le", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:17:06", "owner": "xqc4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048630644678034, "text": "5KG IS APPROXIMATELY A BIT OVER 11 POUNDS AND HER SHOULDERS WERE PARALLEL TO THE GROUND ??? ALL THAT WEIGHT ON ONE SIDE ????", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:50:27", "owner": "all.for.ryu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927815935149278, "text": "Singaporean accents is up there with Indian accent", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:40:09", "owner": "sage_emperor_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18384852937180096, "text": "this my bagggggg", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:26:23", "owner": "fu_a7.n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18497286445077723, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:26:14", "owner": "fu_a7.n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051168128380921, "text": "AHlelE IM fLYiNg🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:11:36", "owner": "the_quiet_reader3012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065360951573675, "text": "She speaks Nigerian English", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:26:04", "owner": "xeew10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089209067487062, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:16:42", "owner": "fuckup1.ig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994069323715957, "text": "Ah le le 🗣️", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:18:21", "owner": "mr__enigmatic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047799563683245, "text": "Dang", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:51:18", "owner": "jac.szx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18351325030201082, "text": "Damn that could double as a weapon it’s so heavy!", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:37:22", "owner": "sle3py_cat03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066063902410611, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T0