"heat_miser_ii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088717670509393, "text": "Ah. The ol brick in the bag as an improvised weapon", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:13:37", "owner": "adeptus_astartes_cos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965323168002135, "text": "rock lees apprentice", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:04:56", "owner": "27locsta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987792663870936, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:58:59", "owner": "aeternam.somnium", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048291374407375, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:31:00", "owner": "haru4anime", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875774611444029, "text": "Average womans bag", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:31:08", "owner": "doughla_201_____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848030860608251, "text": "When goku takes of his shirt", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:22:35", "owner": "charitybluford", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896573098350890, "text": "No but foreeal why are our bags so heavy 😭 lol", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:44:40", "owner": "yanaboo96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854139286534686, "text": "alaly 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:10:02", "owner": "______spider__man__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095944015874171, "text": "@vladimirshmondenko needs this bag 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:31:08", "owner": "timme67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086024161991257, "text": "Kg. K.G ? Bruhh its KILO", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:33:11", "owner": "jebskuy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980387964779967, "text": "I’m more distracted by the lack of Englishing", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:43:37", "owner": "mekayler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882245818420158, "text": "singaporeans are like the nigerians in asia in terms of accent", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:07:27", "owner": "acg_mitsuki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165845107380078, "text": "No. My math is not mathing. That bag must be 5kg+ ..", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:39:21", "owner": "error_tsuchimikado", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18537561067002361, "text": "Girl has a body in that bag", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:20:34", "owner": "shahriar.hawladar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117165571491595, "text": "ni hao fine shi", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:19:57", "owner": "demonjho207", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18417660040186442, "text": "N ?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:18:13", "owner": "imamthokk2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049383683673614, "text": "She is doing rock lee training", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:10:36", "owner": "_gasper_ixixix_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061640069213949, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:02:14", "owner": "idriss.alaouii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18335384281227755, "text": "Bro gots thors hammer in that bish", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:59:37", "owner": "gymtards2023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069224099098777, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:38:21", "owner": "elyes_wasabi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083642480027326, "text": "eleuh eleuh, e pisan", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:09:43", "owner": "anita.octaviandin1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085951036973511, "text": "Yeah she got 5 kgs in the bag", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:55:16", "owner": "zenpai_e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147700234430397, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:40:42", "owner": "mohamed.alhaddad9", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063872942395169, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:23:53", "owner": "dannykozmik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996165978841981, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:22:39", "owner": "cri_ses_sa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305229109255611, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:22:13", "owner": "junmhar.ca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087948649979528, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:08:14", "owner": "orengiis9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081444889892114, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:00:49", "owner": "quintinswurld", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18292918267287179, "text": "There's several bricks inside. 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:58:44", "owner": "leovongrimm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027893018780665, "text": "How come ah🎶", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:58:39", "owner": "jayickname", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882275062305684, "text": "DAMN WHAT SHE GOT IN THAT BAG?! ROCK LEE'S WEIGHTS?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:38:50", "owner": "melskizz14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353725189162375, "text": "Scoliosis ah bag", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:20:33", "owner": "edfiniarel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18315272638216371, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:24:07", "owner": "otakuharshu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963439800851569, "text": "That's unexpectedly hilarious and what is Mei Mei carrying around hallo", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:24:41", "owner": "ed.teo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865172752510105, "text": "this is like that fake janitor with the sleeper build and the mop that secretly weighs like 15kg, she just places it down like an regular bag but it's the weight of the sun lmao", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:10:18", "owner": "lequeenally", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098396527698018, "text": "You know she gonna have back pain one day cause she got all that weight on one shoulder.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:29:08", "owner": "jacob_grubsy_boots", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078835769155357, "text": "A lele", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:27:15", "owner": "beefy5layerburrrrito", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089044628479571, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:56:04", "owner": "batool_bellid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051726467356868, "text": "We weighed my bag recently. It was a little over 10 pounds. How much is that in kilograms? I'm curious", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:53:40", "owner": "ashshelledy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155557633371220, "text": "Asian , with an accent from the hood , 👨🏼‍🦽‍➡️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:56:51", "owner": "ineed_tren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18341721145230181, "text": "Anyone wondering, it’s over 11 pounds. She also confirms it’s actually around 10kg in another video so it’s more like 20-22pounds 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:50:45", "owner": "evan._.faulkner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18401412760193303, "text": "Ah lele  i love whatever that's wrong with her😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:12:52", "owner": "four_eyed_raven_00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863972908520410, "text": "ah leleeee ukachizooo", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:12:42", "owner": "boo.infp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143153782402741, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:03:43", "owner": "emikanako", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065471963431356, "text": "I am obsessed with a le le I'm flying.😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:19:11", "owner": "cookielicious_msk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079148810177556, "text": "It sound like mix of japanese and french accent", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:51:20", "owner": "halphax.nc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353988442202615, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:47:37", "owner": "hr__a.y.a", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18068781818527833, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:41:26", "owner": "dwenjoylife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304969762271473, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:36:43", "owner": "bakedpotatotato", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075476207255578, "text": "Astaga the bag... WHAT YOU PUT?! What in it? A WHOLE FRIDGE?!😭🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:49:51", "owner": "astervrc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176284633325054, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:44:32", "owner": "exoticbuttersfan87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541493896007621, "text": "@naaa_weenn", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:12:30", "owner": "fzforuz.__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865434517437736, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:10:32", "owner": "random_.dudee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116055052500283, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:07:34", "owner": "khadijahsuraya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076290644269575, "text": "Her accent is….. mmmm tooo fluent", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:55:34", "owner": "lemon.ahhhh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954615615906155, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:58:29", "owner": "ovel_desu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958316326008889, "text": "@aeiicine", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:02:39", "owner": "barizuh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074085257252158, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:01:36", "owner": "haziq_daniel_1750", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18386180164196319, "text": "Haha", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:12:26", "owner": "strawbe_rry.12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085728443316666, "text": "Besides how funny video is, she has skoliosis risk. Please aware with your side bag weights...", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:27:43", "owner": "sudwija_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064643519429740, "text": "dont mess with her intentionally 🤣😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:19:48", "owner": "shin.raito", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059623538263177, "text": "Ah le le", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:49:38", "owner": "acap_1311", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984025410763410, "text": "Water bottle, foldimg umbrella, fan, wallet, keys, coin purse, stuffed toys, pins....stop asking why my bag is 5kg", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:27:04", "owner": "annesayatee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862843915456138, "text": "Me carrying around the masterpiece that is Alchemised. IYKYK", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:19:52", "owner": "felicia.c.m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870171334394282, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:34:30", "owner": "antonio.lugo.758", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100884889761234, "text": "Aleleeeee Okashizooooo", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:15:37", "owner": "firmanabdaoe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077352590337222, "text": "🤣🤣 this so funny", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:52:54", "owner": "lunaeclipse6422", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031129739542627, "text": "Came from TikTok to instagram🤣 that alele part was cute😍", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:51:36", "owner": "4hm4d_45yr4f", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107337448719862, "text": "She keeps bricks in there uncalled she needs to win a fight 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:11:10", "owner": "thalia_problem_child", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070682270071440, "text": "Sorry what country is this ugly ass accent from", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:08:50", "owner": "bleu_eclipse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008481647813203, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:02:03", "owner": "_vanggang_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083308195871015, "text": "My middle school bag😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:59:23", "owner": "z4yn_x3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861406618541165, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:53:43", "owner": "anime__okana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857899063558479, "text": "K G 🤧", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:17:03", "owner": "wn.fiona", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868002592413873, "text": "I was staring at her bag the whole time , knowing that is the issue😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:25:47", "owner": "velarys.rin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105328033650996, "text": "Piccolo taking his weights off type shih 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T13:48:15", "owner": "pina.presents", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901139929336009, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T13:35:37", "owner": "ethan.crbz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048992339406120, "text": "School bag", "created_at": "2025-11-26T13:34:18", "owner": "__mzl7__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878975803430645, "text": "This reminds me that one time, my mom made a handbag… and it weighed 7 kg (while empty), like… damn… the airport guy were just as baffled as I was", "created_at": "2025-11-26T13:11:08", "owner": "hesardian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128020273500608, "text": "Ppl die when she bumps on others , shoulders are mountains 👏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:29:25", "owner": "dashin02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083871469841436, "text": "I LOVE the \"ah le le?\" 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:03:13", "owner": "laydia_18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075609842213137, "text": "ALELE?! DETCO MENTIONED", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:59:20", "owner": "blue_berryvan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096015037888612, "text": "Inget tas @miliahnf 🗿", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:47:39", "owner": "rizukimu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086878033962908, "text": "Her bag is like Master Roshi turtle shell 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:43:02", "owner": "john_cenas_cousin11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094454047874752, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T04:35:07", "owner": "salisafaque", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916984489209904, "text": "Girl be lifting 10kg every day🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-26T04:28:42", "owner": "lallyana7902", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079475401901892, "text": "Allalala lelelel I'm flying 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:33:36", "owner": "ankit_pal102", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113795560517836, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:32:04", "owner": "narobite_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891117889245937, "text": "High heels with pajamas 🤣 such a lifestyle", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:07:11", "owner": "12.____.22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905634355273675, "text": "Heels with pajamas?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:56:52", "owner": "xxporter25xx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950705008027485, "text": "Ahlelas", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:48:06", "owner": "critical_notification", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876576388441854, "text": "ahlelele ahlelas", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:32:33", "owner": "mapleee.ev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121083829470365, "text": "That's how u get crooked spine", "created_at": "2025-11-26T01:02:43", "owner": "thelethaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108650356717812, "text": "Ah leh leh five queiju, to presa nesse vídeo 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:54:12", "owner": "bia_aneleh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086193412825942, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T23:20:50", "owner": "ignacioalvarado13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000012572833215, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:51:01", "owner": "nicoskull9305", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868296229495962, "text": "Ladies what is in your bag???", "created_at": "2025-11-25T22:05:42", "owner": "justrshn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848924260602354, "text": "She's skinny but strong 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:45:52", "owner": "xfelixx4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114293482587892, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T2