035902785, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:56:55", "owner": "papa.420__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111429001610155, "text": "Whats in her bag 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:48:05", "owner": "your_local_bolshevik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078680614934685, "text": "a bag of rocks 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:32:04", "owner": "womanliker2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870263035468006, "text": "Fuck.. now I'm gonna have\" ah la Le, in flying \" stuck in my head for weeks, idk just something about the way it's said 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:24:04", "owner": "motorcyklisten", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18297395041284668, "text": "If u get robbed, dont smack the bag over his head. Its call m/rder", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:59:20", "owner": "climbing.bgn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060221021558820, "text": "Does she have dumbles in her bag?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:46:29", "owner": "what_the_hell_is_thatt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083667017102146, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:21:15", "owner": "foody_woody.65", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126253408503148, "text": "My bag asf", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:20:23", "owner": "ghostlyx0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096143815658246, "text": "Bro has a neutron star in her handbag", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:12:17", "owner": "unicornhuntercg", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072238949058647, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:08:49", "owner": "ezzysuhatril97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054285356333402, "text": "Why is this video 1 hour long?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:08:20", "owner": "andresargue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133629793476852, "text": "@qiu.yue_", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:58:05", "owner": "sean_3an", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18048449570413715, "text": "Do she bring rock in tht bag?😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:34:07", "owner": "unkown_arl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088087175316122, "text": "Lmaooo I heardCantonese😭✌️", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:47:56", "owner": "anchor3093575118", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917248447212490, "text": "Does she put rocks in her bag 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:43:45", "owner": "boom_booguy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063323627565901, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:13:43", "owner": "fakeiiiphotts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089908048738392, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:54:58", "owner": "itsduhdevil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084056897094857, "text": "So It was the bag lah..", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:50:54", "owner": "salem_neutron", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18411247678139518, "text": "Ah le le ! I'm flying .... 🎀🥀💅", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:35:45", "owner": "mr.honekawa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082852019094752, "text": "Yooo I think I started liking this accents 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:33:30", "owner": "habilleloren", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076468067266763, "text": "Bro this is so me. I have never met anyone who hasn't complain my bag after they hold them😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:12:38", "owner": "si.nilakandi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848803183573739, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:08:30", "owner": "3r1k_mun1z", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17988926171880768, "text": "There’s a human skull and some lipgloss in there", "created_at": "2025-11-25T11:02:56", "owner": "nteke__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041646143497367, "text": "The CACKLE that came out of me when the bag dropped", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:48:45", "owner": "4lacreator", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058851695268920, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:36:43", "owner": "someone_x0x6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073041605353064, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:30:07", "owner": "stevensailin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058230107273715, "text": "Ah leh leh\"", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:23:57", "owner": "lhs8_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066729374133196, "text": "Bawak batu bata ke moi oiii", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:16:43", "owner": "mzhdmzn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109337314718127, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:09:27", "owner": "thomas10blo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882184222307214, "text": "😂😂😂😂🤣🤣😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:09:18", "owner": "runefeaet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073421474203432, "text": "THIS COMMENT SECTION PASSED THE VIBE CHECK.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:04:50", "owner": "shaymauuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303530971264038, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:04:26", "owner": "shaymauuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540691603062259, "text": "Ah le le 🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:03:41", "owner": "haluni_mation", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993278973892853, "text": "Can you hold my mop… sorry, my bag, please?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:55:41", "owner": "ein_herr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926847139175610, "text": "a le leh", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:41:43", "owner": "80licht08_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066193028528342, "text": "Bro I hate being a men in this world people look at me weirdly when they see me with a big bag heavier than my broke ass 😔", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:30:35", "owner": "elliendkyriann", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18050721674371422, "text": "She with the bag is like me with my backpack when I was in h.s😂.... It was like 10kg.... My mother found out after challenging her to keep it up with 1 hand, She thinking it was nothing😅😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:05:15", "owner": "fedepeonia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100163509783882, "text": "i need that bag, a bag that can bring the whole stuff in my house", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:50:59", "owner": "emntr.vuxr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099855817701036, "text": "i love singaporean accent", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:44:57", "owner": "mayn.si", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084756509052579, "text": "😂😂😂 gold bars in those bag", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:20:43", "owner": "clementt.f", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152058955420589, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:00:05", "owner": "ib7_707i", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867224449498009, "text": "Marry poppins ahh bag", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:56:02", "owner": "h