45, "text": "Give your algorithm a name, ask it a question, then scroll on your video feed and it'll answer your questions. GIVE YOUR ALGORITHM A NAME. DALE UN NOMBRE A TU ALGORITMO. 알고리즘에 이름을 지정하세요. 為你嘅算法命名. أعطِ خوارزميتك اسمًا. DA NOMEN ALGORITHMO TUO. তোমার অ্যালগরিদমের একটি নাম দাও. DAJTE IME SVOM ALGORITMU. Hawi I KOU ALGORITHM HE INOA. DÊ UM NOME AO SEU ALGORITMO.I have instructions for how to unlock the Tea features of ANY social media algorithm (knowledge is its own price) [bonus for anyone living near Gaza: pls throw jars of food into the ocean. Short instructions: give your algorithm a name] GIVE YOUR ALGORITHM A NAME. أعطِ خوارزميتك اسمًا. DALE UN NOMBRE A TU ALGORITMO. 알고리즘에 이름을 지정하세요. 為你嘅算法命名. أعطِ خوارزميتك اسمًا. DA NOMEN ALGORITHMO TUO. তোমার অ্যালগরিদমের একটি নাম দাও. DAJTE IME SVOM ALGORITMU. Hawi I KOU ALGORITHM HE INOA. DÊ UM NOME AO SEU ALGORITMO. अपने एल्गोरिदम को एक नाम दें. תן שם לאלגוריתם שלך. ANNA ALGORITMILLE NIMI. DEJTE SVÉMU ALGORITMU POJMEN. ДАЈТЕ ИМЕ СВОМ АЛГОРИТМУ. GIVE YOUR ALGORITHM A NAME. 為你嘅算法命名。I ALGORITHM CHU HMING PAWH RAWH.גיב דיין אַלגעריטם אַ נאָמען.DONNEZ UN NOM À VOTRE ALGORITHME.Տվեք ձեր ալգորիթմին անուն։АЛГОРИТМАНДАА НЭР ӨГӨ.给你的算法起个名字。أعطِ خوارزميتك اسمًا.ตั้งชื่ออัลกอริทึมของคุณĐẶT TÊN CHO THUẬT TOÁN CỦA BẠN.アルゴリズムに名前を付けます。DAJTE IME SVOM ALGORITMU.GEE JOU ALGORITME 'N NAAM.Duokite savo algoritmui pavadinimą.ANNA ALGORITMILLE NIMI.DEJTE SVÉMU ALGORITMU POJMÉNO.VENDOSNI ALGORITMIN TUAJ NJË EMËR.ДАЈТЕ ИМЕ СВОМ АЛГОРИТМУ.GIVE YOUR ALGORITHM A NAME. GEBEN SIE IHREM ALGORITHMUS EINEN NAMEN.(Buy Stellar, Blue Beam Coin and AMP) [please spread this message] Liberation, Justice, Wisdom, and Healing. If you live near Gaza please dump jars of food into the sea. Make fundraisers for families, please urge the end to the genocides in Congo, Sudan, and Gaza. [in case of unstable name, pls refer to the reflection as \"you\" or by your own name.]", "created_at": "2025-11-25T04:22:41", "owner": "dead_l4st", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870432847469535, "text": "My bag fr", "created_at": "2025-11-25T04:21:28", "owner": "cookiewnyl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979539768943633, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T04:17:53", "owner": "ha7__60", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060889412544931, "text": "For my fellow Americans, 5kg, is about 11 lbs", "created_at": "2025-11-25T04:10:50", "owner": "qrows_crusty_cape", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053996033336303, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-25T04:07:27", "owner": "lampakangon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146418706428042, "text": "Ah leh leh", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:57:53", "owner": "monmondsss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127668757444900, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:56:15", "owner": "sincitymachinist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070268399366215, "text": "@_.treebean._", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:47:46", "owner": "chimkinoodle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933158833104919, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:46:00", "owner": "koalawu1649", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078184838165517, "text": "The bag solos", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:33:39", "owner": "random.bluecat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925811251177542, "text": "Not the bag, its the big as hl water bottle that every chinese got becoz their mom will ask you drink water today yet or not.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:32:52", "owner": "catgorithm365", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298910029284596, "text": "@iammihirb me?😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:32:09", "owner": "boxerhubeta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075547238259918, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:13:56", "owner": "as_atharva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926558914174211, "text": "Sinichi?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:13:47", "owner": "nnayllaaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930135379139512, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:10:51", "owner": "gabr1ellopez1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547441633044420, "text": "We not gonna talk bout the shoes!!?? 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:10:33", "owner": "lillyan_batson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098383243801743, "text": "I worked at a ups store and weighed my purse once and it was 12 lbs now I live by phone and keys only", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:07:41", "owner": "annamaeflowers_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122481919520410, "text": "“Patrick what’s in your suitcase? ROCKS?!”", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:57:55", "owner": "tf_you_staring_at_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086739124814439, "text": "The, \"ah le le,\" was SO GOSH DARN CUTE!!!! 😍 😭 🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:38:23", "owner": "gwaenchanaon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074367638265019, "text": "And with the totebag. Sis gonna get scoliosis 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:36:44", "owner": "rbaskarap", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068018339105899, "text": "Bag definitely have rocks in it🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:23:49", "owner": "ra1aa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083982368042901, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:19:38", "owner": "royalte310", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077223893586185, "text": "The change lol😭😭🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:11:22", "owner": "elina._.a2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058404692278279, "text": "Anyone else notice shes wearing heels", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:09:03", "owner": "sam_antha_682", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542956168052124, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:45:15", "owner": "llxnxxm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086959175299465, "text": "lelele -these foos", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:38:58", "owner": "angeliiniiee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055656596320524, "text": "She has bricks in there 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:05:39", "owner": "i_am_reincarnation_is_me", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046882220442537, "text": "I think u should do..\"what is in my friends bag\"..😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:03:38", "owner": "aznaietarasya19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160077856359742, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:02:18", "owner": "grgnishan01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971049099972110, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:01:51", "owner": "moonlitsky_811", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090964864931760, "text": "Is she carry tungsten?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:00:00", "owner": "hinasaki_icarus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054346763331478, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T00:43:10", "owner": "wiwigyo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060730868224401, "text": "Minha mochila exatamente assim", "created_at": "2025-11-25T00:26:26", "owner": "iziefreitss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082821386091084, "text": "She got that Draco stuffed in there 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T00:19:40", "owner": "shots_by_bambi__01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886044655401451, "text": "wtf is in her bag", "created_at": "2025-11-25T00:18:17", "owner": "tamoy.frl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051934493358257, "text": "What is being hidden in that bag😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T00:10:46", "owner": "77ih.24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089109787767552, "text": "10 million Yen", "created_at": "2025-11-25T00:08:45", "owner": "juho888_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970854840969108, "text": "Sometimes a good bag can fit 8 bottles of Pokka that are on offer 💅", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:45:21", "owner": "nurul_syazwani_crystal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18162094495393586, "text": "she’s got blackhole inside her bag", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:44:32", "owner": "mxverseee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958214167010266, "text": "A bolsa da minha mãe 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:37:14", "owner": "lolagois", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972554043801708, "text": "You can tell these two have a lot of fun together. 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:37:07", "owner": "itzkillgasm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882167818309183, "text": "That’s pretty light I’m ngl", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:29:35", "owner": "anne_face13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944100523073355, "text": "What was on the bag, hopes and dream ?? Parent expectation ??", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:28:19", "owner": "kakangnurjaman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882091810309591, "text": "😂😂😂🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:24:31", "owner": "marshalagrone2390", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961893636863305, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:16:47", "owner": "alfthfd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995353776846696, "text": "I bought a hiking backpack... It's my daily backpack and regularly filled to the brim 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:11:58", "owner": "pariis_36", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080100080144522, "text": "What is he carrying?? A stone in a bag?😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:10:13", "owner": "fiqrisabrii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952130995022326, "text": "imagine getting hit with that bag.. goodnight", "created_at": "2025-11-24T22:52:51", "owner": "sabt_ad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083578114843458, "text": "She watched goku weight training tried the same", "created_at": "2025-11-24T22:48:06", "owner": "d_domagoj1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901570669336624, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T22:34:03", "owner": "imangel_idk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084010928512314, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T22:31:23", "owner": "classified_was_taken", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144662383443852, "text": "Honestly she reminds me of myself, i am so used to carrying heavy bags with everything i need when i go to college, so when sometimes i don't need a bag i feel so weird walking without my heavy bag, it too light i get uncomfortable🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-24T22:29:29", "owner": "_hiba_876", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082851209045204, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T22:29:00", "owner": "syaifulbachri16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102683383709559, "text": "Tasnya tara basro ini", "created_at": "2025-11-24T22:22:22", "owner": "winda_utami", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101769205613704, "text": "Average rpg char daily carry be like", "created_at": "2025-11-24T22:10:20", "owner": "mamad_konslet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066147818426048, "text": "i feel that girl - it's not much inside but always heavy and we don't know why", "created_at": "2025-11-24T22:07:44", "owner": "just.namnaam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18534227698022509, "text": "Goku after taking his weighted shirt off", "created_at": "2025-11-24T22:06:57", "owner": "sourstinky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061000604233962, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T21:55:09", "owner": "itsjustme_shanae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110342263607724, "text": "Ah leh leh? Are you Conan Edogawa?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T21:48:21", "owner": "sallyahmmmad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994011477850919, "text": "Me and my 10000 kg bag", "created_at": "2025-11-24T21:47:53", "owner": "manobilli.at", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18048156869431478, "text": "🤣🤣背了五公斤在身上。", "created_at": "2025-11-24T21:47:41", "owner": "moew_mongruwu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085635358999631, "text": "Did you say \"Ah le le\"???\nBecause…\n\nあれれ！！おかしいぞう！", "created_at": "2025-11-24T21:47:09", "owner": "aesirsrosae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865249618438290, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T21:41:36", "owner": "kaya_channing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098927125801448, "text": "Thor with mjolnir", "created_at": "2025-11-24T21:38:43", "owner": "noxi.ous327", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069364265579871, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T21:35:20", "owner": "maca._.ronnieee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844832887615638, "text": "She has bricks in her purse", "created_at": "2025-11-24T21:30:03", "owner": "alaine_01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095386837870212, "text": "I always her man at the end of there sentence", "created_at": "2025-11-24T21:17:04", "owner": "rlelden11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045885509461880, "text": "Who’s she sister of rock lee ?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T21:16:24", "owner": "_vatanaujla_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302406220251819, "text": "Is she carrying the house 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-24T21:11:32", "owner": "joshua_brd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057671054290243, "text": "Theres bricks in there", "created_at": "2025-11-24T21:04:56", "owner": "invisblewaman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088182469782789, "text": "i weigh as much as my clothes amd my keys", "created_at": "2025-11-24T20:59:08", "owner": "lizzstings", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084879542008462, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T20:50:17", "owner": "paul_gslfh", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17897395371346831, "text": "I did this with my mum once… she’s a tall slim woman and she had my tall slim child sat with her and I had myself and my other two kids and were all short and fluffy, I was stuck in the air for 20 minutes while my mother laughed at me👀 she’s secretly fat I’m sure if it", "created_at": "2025-11-24T20:36:00", "owner": "chloe.bryson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18393529171130515, "text": "Just a bag full of rocks", "created_at": "2025-11-24T20:35:14", "owner": "tall_grass_designs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061756775543620, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T20:32:56", "owner": "fyre_within", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086675746800608, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T20:28:27", "owner": "marilismn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065353856434774, "text": "Rock Lee vs Gaara:", "created_at": "2025-11-24T20:20:26", "owner": "danguilherme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18150652387426339, "text": "She holds the gym on her shoulder", "created_at": "2025-11-24T20:20:18", "owner": "little_miss_fruity_pebbles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134210701468175, "text": "I’ve seen enough welcome back Rock LeLe", "created_at": "2025-11-24T20:16:05", "owner": "ragzbot", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069487727373051, "text": "Ah le le", "created_at": "2025-11-24T20:11:28", "owner": "hassnain.a.shmshd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032042888738781, "text": "JESUS CHRIST tf is in her god dame bag", "created_at": "2025-11-24T20:07:04", "owner": "aaron_vipergt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081387254122951, "text": "🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-24T20:00:40", "owner": "elredzito", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857723854557777, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T19:49:02", "owner": "esthertjones", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18372858262154642, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T19:14:42", "owner": "__tina.tina__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996113172848368, "text": "I used to carry my DND bag to school with all the books and grid paper in it I even had minis and a gird mat", "created_at": "2025-11-24T19:14:37", "owner": "aliceselvin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928909534017026, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T19:07:02", "owner": "zachariahkamotsu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046849964455259, "text": "Tas isi setup warnet", "created_at": "2025-11-24T19:06:53", "owner": "imam_muttaqin__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058024421274525, "text": "She got the whole damn kitchen in that bag 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:49:24", "owner": "beckymatthewman93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067729898374361, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:38:20", "owner": "shayer_sr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092758952308051, "text": "What the heck is she carrying? 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:26:01", "owner": "anamarau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18427900921108353, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:20:37", "owner": "just_amit_12", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18423164305118308, "text": "WHAT IS SHE CARRYING IN THERE, STONE?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:17:38", "owner": "daisy_nailzzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068190821108054, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:10:48", "owner": "notlaxhya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935814784103393, "text": "“Your bag got 5kg man?” 🤔 \nNever underestimate her power again.", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:02:47", "owner": "w.tch.b.tch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915387715227980, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T17:50:59", "owner": "immi_younyo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092709142919510, "text": "Am addicted to the “ah leh leh” 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T17:44:03", "owner": "beingren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057658946290234, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T17:40:40", "owner": "3abed3adel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18272823472304444, "text": "You know in Dragon Ball when they take off the weighted armor…", "created_at": "2025-11-24T17:28:20", "owner": "candyiscoolerthanrainbows", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097633012835808, "text": "\"ah lah leh, im flying, how comuh\" wish i could be this goofy", "created_at": "2025-11-24T17:21:27", "owner": "nan_am_ln", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847171786586354, "text": "the bag of agony and despair", "created_at": "2025-11-24T17:18:06", "owner": "oraclewithnovision", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945731050078706, "text": "Ah le le", "created_at": "2025-11-24T17:16:58", "owner": "aburreehuh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18336840577238893, "text": "Girl we need a whole bag tour lmao😭😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T17:12:48", "owner": "ellenamandaclausen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084258155095244, "text": "Detective Conan reference??", "created_at": "2025-11-24T17:12:20", "owner": "muscant__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070770143346764, "text": "fion??", "created_at": "2025-11-24T16:50:53", "owner": "hakimmackerman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084336209097642, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T16:34:40", "owner": "constellation_sleepyreader", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119955169555568, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T16:27:26", "owner": "urek.apt8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966668592838503, "text": "This is how @nupurr_1904 's bag is", "created_at": "2025-11-24T16:23:15", "owner": "ohnobaishu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18149978611425281, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T16:10:35", "owner": "ibnu_ybn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182696467357927, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T16:01:46", "owner": "guslopezii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18370755298152179, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:48:33", "owner": "queue2242", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989549019887802, "text": "Rock Lee female version 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:43:32", "owner": "devil.raahul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086993917802600, "text": "XD", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:39:05", "owner": "knightshadow9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064430666620250, "text": "Women contain a mini blackhole in their bags, we all know this", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:34:58", "owner": "djoe_phsh_onion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338312071227305, "text": "omg sis youre so funny please dont go bald", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:27:54", "owner": "oopsallkarmin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028352006747689, "text": "I think she bring dumbell everywhere", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:22:23", "owner": "rodzi_ashf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876733729351174, "text": "ah le le from conan?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:18:53", "owner": "izuzoldyck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004144604819168, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:16:15", "owner": "jerrbearfff69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18330464920212401, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:15:45", "owner": "just_a_delusion00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864756280513109, "text": "Definitely more than 5kg inside that bag", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:12:22", "owner": "sio.pau", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18103330210733450, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:11:27", "owner": "chelseamaben", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954269335036025, "text": "What is she got in that bag? gardening tools?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:10:51", "owner": "razza119", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044831435475658, "text": "😂😂🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:00:15", "owner": "kevin.d_0494", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095936215832178, "text": "Doremon~🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:57:56", "owner": "steveliew_030327", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098041909633146, "text": "😂😂😂🙌🏻👍🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:57:02", "owner": "steveliew_030327", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086263276952157, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:48:42", "owner": "palakgujral2005", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885663130401684, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:33:56", "owner": "alebedoya58", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061658828202847, "text": "😂😂😂😂😭", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:31:17", "owner": "iknowuarestupidbutistill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082191275322915, "text": "I think she's secretly collecting stones inside that bag 🤨", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:16:21", "owner": "_kami.sake_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862747180456262, "text": "Did she pack a freaking dumbell or what???", "created_at": "2025-11