efarjina you almost killed me", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:10:51", "owner": "void_centaurus13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862483687534226, "text": "It's her bag @syirenite777", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:09:31", "owner": "elelbels", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873868162370019, "text": "Is she carrying a brick in her bag or what 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:04:37", "owner": "multistan_86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088678582945694, "text": "I really like the  way Singaporeans talk 😅 “ah” “man”", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:00:42", "owner": "fwtx.chinita", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070717634062798, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:59:49", "owner": "valvel_roaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088528513770764, "text": "The few PPL who knows detective conan 😢👏", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:59:21", "owner": "totally_an_airhead", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083362669864236, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:59:19", "owner": "dorknesstale", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17899385820184425, "text": "What's in the bag? My Life", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:59:11", "owner": "hey_sigrid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935672110100521, "text": "Anatoly of women😭", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:58:16", "owner": "callmemuhamadali", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045129677470738, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:55:56", "owner": "tsukuyomi2015", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18351386446166865, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:45:33", "owner": "xo.pure.xo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061137311623988, "text": "i am heavy already on my own so it wouldnt change much but i also prefer to carry 30kg of useless shit on my back cuz why not ruin my back right?😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:41:09", "owner": "ancient_greek6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135823048464680, "text": "5 Kay j", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:39:12", "owner": "5tarkirby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331485352212750, "text": "What's in the bag son of Hulk", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:26:03", "owner": "_skhem01_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927385432156888, "text": "And men, that's why we need to buy women handbags. So they may stay grounded 😆", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:25:31", "owner": "arif._.ns", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18021318980603747, "text": "Remember your purse doubles as a weapon😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:07:49", "owner": "elinicmartin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17881131999423064, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:04:04", "owner": "lalal.l12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084310766029552, "text": "she bring gold bars", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:01:08", "owner": "petrustjoi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071429612600830, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:00:12", "owner": "yandigun4w4n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111071359592970, "text": "I love harmless pranks", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:59:43", "owner": "luqjustice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085293568999801, "text": "terkejut😭", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:56:34", "owner": "syahira.aka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18315533263218050, "text": "I love the accent. Wonder where are they from 🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:54:18", "owner": "87obf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902131132318111, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:53:53", "owner": "doro_pie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087082648974985, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:48:42", "owner": "richiebinu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948672292058283, "text": "My mom’s bag is that heavy too and she’s short 😭😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:46:45", "owner": "itsgail.notgale", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907904101269573, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:45:26", "owner": "ijusthoppedoffaplane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032474705736846, "text": "NOT THE \"AL LE LE!!!!\"😂😂😂😂connan thriving", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:38:54", "owner": "geijuts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844806991602022, "text": "Ale lele y u too cute", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:35:16", "owner": "__axwell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066474404117183, "text": "Conan?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:26:46", "owner": "sconankudo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863776618515157, "text": "Ahlelele ahlelas ahlelele ahlelas ahlelele ahlelas ahlelele ahlelas ahlelele ahlelas ahlelele ahlelas ahlelele ahlelas ahlelele ahlelas ahlelele ahlelas ahlelele ahlelas ahlelele ahlelas ahlelele ahlelas ahlelele ahlelas ahlelele ahlelas ahlelele ahlelas ahlelele ahlelas ahlelele ahlelas ahlelele ahlelas ahlelele ahlelas ahlelele ahlelas ahlelele ahlelas ahlelele ahlelas ahlelele ahlelas ahlelele ahlelas ahlelele ahlelas ahlelele ahlelas so emotional words😭🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:24:31", "owner": "ishal5573", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136287100475980, "text": "Is she on a secret training or something? 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:23:13", "owner": "flawedcryxtal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078478258947022, "text": "Ah le le ahle las", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:20:41", "owner": "aatishnath", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860128360478403, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:13:29", "owner": "np6i", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059230145276128, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:01:23", "owner": "ax.vevo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107755534623234, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:01:22", "owner": "artofseanlee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966060135844330, "text": "The bag is for self defense for sure", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:59:22", "owner": "_nexla_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090396421936702, "text": "Just like meeee🖐🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:59:00", "owner": "purple_buddleja", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146807908427557, "text": "Ah leh leh leh Ah leh las", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:51:23", "owner": "slacker__zzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921495409057313, "text": "Is she carrying a 5kg rice in her bag?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:50:56", "owner": "sapikhasnol.jpeg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051020651346190, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:45:48", "owner": "bigiraffer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098987980763939, "text": "Ah lel leh I'm flying 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:45:30", "owner": "dreamsglow_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072114743361613, "text": "She's on that Goku/Rock Lee type of training", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:44:34", "owner": "itsyourboy.ad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080421587124365, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:40:30", "owner": "favnacky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18197632756324877, "text": "is this the \"are you open minded\" person?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:25:58", "owner": "erickklian_0603", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18396010057126658, "text": "main sama @aditnayra be like", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:25:54", "owner": "miselpuf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100968388782919, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:23:05", "owner": "artz_1002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001774457822230, "text": "@zachrullea_  cam bag kau hahahaha", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:20:58", "owner": "everullea", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18177061666362500, "text": "Is “ah la leh” her name!! Because if it is, I love it!! 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:15:34", "owner": "awaaashii_waaashii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088574570301954, "text": "Her right shoulder has been hand sculpted by god himself to be able to carry that bag arround ever so casually 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:11:19", "owner": "marwanmusic_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115295146574065, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:11:03", "owner": "ayanminham", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100791859612614, "text": "New gym equipment: woman's bag. Recommended exercise: lift and carry 8 to 12 reps of 4 sets", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:08:07", "owner": "eugene.yj_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061330091230557, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T09:59:06", "owner": "beoorc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951014383047635, "text": "that ah lele reminded me of conan/sinichi😭🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-24T09:58:03", "owner": "iohtam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082263542027539, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T09:53:27", "owner": "henryfriends420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18382749160152483, "text": "average school bag be like", "created_at": "2025-11-24T09:53:05", "owner": "will_j_123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113989159566606, "text": "Ah le le le ah le las?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T09:47:24", "owner": "serxne_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866619607426751, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T09:43:23", "owner": "its__teehee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063349145414830, "text": "whole household things inside her bag 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T09:42:18", "owner": "suwandinie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981185244941518, "text": "Ah le le", "created_at": "2025-11-24T09:42:11", "owner": "notsob_d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083648285041221, "text": "Whats in the bag? 5 kgs of a rice bag?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T09:38:05", "owner": "az_jude", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894026110220377, "text": "wtf inside that bag 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T09:37:57", "owner": "vin___512", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056670689304761, "text": "💀💀💀", "created_at": "2025-11-24T09:35:30", "owner": "mythicalsolo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18244569952294336, "text": "Once I gave my backpack to a friend he almost faceplanted because I wasn't expecting it to be so heavy! 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-24T09:25:36", "owner": "the_headshaker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098013916831282, "text": "Do you carry around lead?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T09:23:41", "owner": "claudiu_olti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070386197072035, "text": "ah le le okashizo", "created_at": "2025-11-24T09:15:13", "owner": "zzz_izwan", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18031208501543173, "text": "Ah le le! I'm flying 🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-24T09:10:14", "owner": "romeo492", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979336194933373, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T09:09:58", "owner": "ladyanise4048", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074834471250103, "text": "She speaks English like an African father 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T09:07:16", "owner": "4our9iner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18335843839238314, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T09:05:29", "owner": "christy_egory", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062857223449837, "text": "So cute 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-24T09:02:17", "owner": "wookatron11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064430999172666, "text": "thats the emotional support bricks fault", "created_at": "2025-11-24T08:55:19", "owner": "nonbinary_brachydios", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17987224163747567, "text": "Jamaican Nigerian Chinese English", "created_at": "2025-11-24T08:49:03", "owner": "takizawa_sido", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869170225472364, "text": "Holy whaa- 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-24T08:40:33", "owner": "vessperrrrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989269626880871, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T08:38:18", "owner": "x0o0x____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146793022431906, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T08:37:09", "owner": "symlftr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031399193534586, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T08:32:31", "owner": "madty.pryg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104385427647200, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T08:32:04", "owner": "medalofjoy99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930696778136304, "text": "Is this what people mean when they say some ladies come with baggage", "created_at": "2025-11-24T08:20:56", "owner": "papa_fundip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083605126852096, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T08:11:04", "owner": "ushik_noe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064878080568760, "text": "rock lee moment", "created_at": "2025-11-24T08:04:32", "owner": "iiilabs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18350868376162961, "text": "😂😂😭", "created_at": "2025-11-24T08:02:41", "owner": "tg_thekid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091249258731364, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T08:01:36", "owner": "aldianangs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065429462381900, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:59:45", "owner": "acupofthiaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905956465277816, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:57:33", "owner": "saito_harukami", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954104013901808, "text": "This is literally me when I’m carrying any of my totes😭", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:56:37", "owner": "otobrise_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159619750397409, "text": "ahlele ahlelas dicek sandım smxmmw", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:54:53", "owner": "lanetleretrafinda", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17988190898879447, "text": "Clearly fake, if that was the bag of an actual woman, when she took it off she should have been flung to the moon, because those things way hundreds of tons.", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:50:29", "owner": "littlehatexterminator", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058353350644206, "text": "Poor girl... Her back must be hurt carrying bag like that", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:49:27", "owner": "ipinggicng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121086004540129, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:46:56", "owner": "syrfhsyhr_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060922982226763, "text": "please do what's in my bag??", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:46:30", "owner": "_missantenna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135410128466687, "text": "ah le le I'm flying~", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:39:32", "owner": "eeka_97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302430301271767, "text": "Dafaq. WHAT TF YOU GOT IN THAT BAG? 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:36:12", "owner": "renulous_aotearoa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124741951510642, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:34:55", "owner": "ronie_is_ok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961197999991405, "text": "I’m a rock collector so my backpack by default is heavy. One day after fishing/rock collecting my bag was over 55lbs", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:30:46", "owner": "pbj_with__ketchup", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086541304814196, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:30:23", "owner": "arthur_wh0regan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063071069626897, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:29:43", "owner": "pam.p.08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066347681437489, "text": "As a conan fan I that ahlele summoned me", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:19:04", "owner": "amy.tempest", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091848643918671, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:11:07", "owner": "antarlxa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082431980019157, "text": "Bag carrying dreams and hopes", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:00:45", "owner": "sam1r.sk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045675785479733, "text": "Woman got a collapsed neutron star in that bag", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:00:02", "owner": "high_quality_aj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889675246381938, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:47:42", "owner": "_lucid___dreamer_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921480298056701, "text": "These two are adorable", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:46:58", "owner": "jennifer_myers_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18027025784772152, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:44:52", "owner": "dreamcatcher_0320", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18245923867293292, "text": "That's why i know women are secretly strong and can k*ll u with their arms and shoulders", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:43:05", "owner": "crmxn.rep", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064905059147378, "text": "The female equivalent of Sausage measuring contest.", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:41:20", "owner": "avert_media_digital", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940423792001274, "text": "Goofy ahh", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:36:14", "owner": "tktktktako", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071877860368229, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:35:07", "owner": "petalpocky", "likes": 14}, {"id": 17933321325108986, "text": "@maryam__musadik was that your bag?😭", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:31:09", "owner": "justtt.mariam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026853914775319, "text": "Women and their bags", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:27:20", "owner": "jacobshaw20.97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939672504962989, "text": "YOUR BEG Got FIve KG MEH̤ 🗣️🗣️🗣️🗣️😭", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:26:22", "owner": "samuel_patta", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076924073178912, "text": "Ah leh leh is copyrighted for conan😭", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:25:07", "owner": "jasni_hasan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990907473886079, "text": "Just imagine if she hit someone with that bag instant concussion 🤕 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:24:08", "owner": "backhomefaith", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095286778878506, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:18:48", "owner": "alhaitham.mainer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087480626076481, "text": "What is she carrying, burden of life?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:18:16", "owner": "herman_lim66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078138937948525, "text": "Come ah?? 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:14:57", "owner": "blakedoyle55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099368092696031, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:14:40", "owner": "xenz769", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891706192367900, "text": "Better plot then most movies nowadays.", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:12:42", "owner": "ashwin_valluvan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321913567175043, "text": "You bought a bowling ball or something? 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:12:30", "owner": "eskrimcairrrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18435544960102742, "text": "A le le conan😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:03:21", "owner": "alfa_kn.02", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071821340048600, "text": "What's she carrying, rocks? 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:01:13", "owner": "bagus.tri3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066025055129456, "text": "Why is this becoming a vocal stim for me now", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:57:03", "owner": "tierneymichele", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095515537851983, "text": "Carrying a whole ahh gym around juuuust in case", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:52:49", "owner": "pasan_praveen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295842268257538, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:52:08", "owner": "isaactoh0205v2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059041439634906, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:50:44", "owner": "dash_tang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857563735557486, "text": "\"Ah lele, I'm flying\" 🗣️🗣️🗣️", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:45:32", "owner": "hehem_o30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901029580330167, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:45:18", "owner": "babaeimahdi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091962226905645, "text": "Look at the accent😍", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:45:14", "owner": "fajar.neojpn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882037075310593, "text": "That's okay I was carrying nearly 15 in high school😭", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:43:29", "owner": "awesomespiritcat21", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17968050404981293, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:37:58", "owner": "marvjinwoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888557860386233, "text": "That's me and my purse frfr", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:26:44", "owner": "devilishbiscuit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081809408280952, "text": "The bag should be weight 6 or more kgs. One on the top weighs 5 kg more than the girl on the bottom. If the bag is 5 kgs, then they have equal weights. So, what's in the bag that makes it 6 kg or more?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:26:35", "owner": "srikant_d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067125401114582, "text": "typical baddie purse-weight", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:20:37", "owner": "rikkirotten", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078519262906564, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:17:59", "owner": "jojoejonaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133297174472678, "text": "This is giving 'Hello, i am under the water' energy", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:17:02", "owner": "workingtoohard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061392245201154, "text": "Ok but where is the bag from?? I need details bc I also carry about 5kg with me lol", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:12:51", "owner": "darianlouise_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905460808276561, "text": "Usagi", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:12:17", "owner": "gdragonfuturewifeeyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396267727125357, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:03:11", "owner": "h0a0.m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060100226553770, "text": "Lmao, she strong! 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:03:00", "owner": "andrejrozmaring", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943074325081199, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:02:18", "owner": "imrono_o", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18149116696424293, "text": "Har bag is so heavy, it's like she's getting a workout just walking! Turns out, it's full of cylinder blocks.", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:00:28", "owner": "upendra_badkur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18335641312237737, "text": "Oversize heels? Wild 😐", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:59:52", "owner": "mw.cata", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119423506530237, "text": "@alelee7", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:57:51", "owner": "afif.rxhmxn_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004612814670148, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:51:22", "owner": "neongypsy420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964814901848661, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:48:10", "owner": "kvccino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969838515979071, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:46:00", "owner": "ishaft.newton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894403639359833, "text": "Then she bring it on her shoulder all the time. What a strong girl🙌🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:44:17", "owner": "r.hana.f", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983094663920836, "text": "She brought Patrick and his home", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:39:37", "owner": "ffauzia_97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961960017863171, "text": "Close, welcome back Rock Lee", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:39:23", "owner": "painful__truth__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090578377905914, "text": "Sometimes I forget how heavy my bags can get till someone else points it out 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:37:12", "owner": "soch14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161557267400855, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:36:53", "owner": "zuraafi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064191380628910, "text": "She carries around a 5kg weight🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:36:25", "owner": "oikeamicovuorisalo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061463807554562, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:29:15", "owner": "shin.kud0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083636909044105, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:27:44", "owner": "oparissso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118966432541416, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:21:16", "owner": "mason.dlc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854872282527883, "text": "@arxchertan", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:20:00", "owner": "blu.jggg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18174160426368894, "text": "Gym on the go", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:08:50", "owner": "fclaydermen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100971040681054, "text": "Ahlala halalas", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:08:10", "owner": "abrar.yeameen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094759003846599, "text": "Rock lee vs Gara", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:06:49", "owner": "syedmatif", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321644002173064, "text": "The \"Ah le le I'm flying?\" Is giving help me I am under the water", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:02:46", "owner": "onepunchbicth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891218626242579, "text": "\"ah lele I'm flying\" lmaooo", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:56:27", "owner": "syauqi.husin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18197266180325529, "text": "Idk why \"Ah le le I'm flying. How come ah\" scratches something in my brain real good", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:56:22", "owner": "_maria.alyana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944738956074659, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:47:36", "owner": "unvbld", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891105766371557, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:46:29", "owner": "sketchy_koko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105309232629861, "text": "Bro's bag is heavier than my school bag", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:46:09", "owner": "xxnotcrystalxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115047571564169, "text": "Poor them thieves, one swing and 5 years in coma. 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:41:28", "owner": "euanta2403", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092355739919256, "text": "ALV, LITERALMENTE MI BOLSO, BRO", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:39:25", "owner": "damn.sea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063218981561126, "text": "Mannn she got her whole crib in that purse lmao", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:32:20", "owner": "king_.taee_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18398359234131535, "text": "Ha coma🗣️", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:30:42", "owner": "adavidpfuentes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086821378804087, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:24:56", "owner": "on_nep", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059040227551743, "text": "The bag has her life in it😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:22:57", "owner": "shurieleiva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119611507481631, "text": "remind me of that one auntie handing a weight like a purse", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:22:26", "owner": "yus_hkl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976544751949162, "text": "@cashewks 🤝", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:22:19", "owner": "ciacioshere", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048388472677647, "text": "I love this accent", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:15:06", "owner": "iamkaji25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105754840724282, "text": "First I saw it on TikTok, now here. It's following me 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:12:50", "owner": "dome_the_viper", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859107109559845, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:08:27", "owner": "aadithyasatish21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856426999514141, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:03:51", "owner": "jadanopinkett_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085777312822275, "text": "What english dialect is this", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:00:41", "owner": "dealingwithruan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18420324043118106, "text": "the thief who will try to rob her will surrender it back to her 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-24T02:58:04", "owner": "imtimmietammy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082677110033990, "text": "I mean yeah, women’s hand bags are basically the size of small backpacks.", "created_at": "2025-11-24T02:51:49", "owner": "tylerfitz199", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966660855988612, "text": "😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-24T02:50:23", "owner": "jokai23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129671980493135, "text": "Alele", "created_at": "2025-11-24T02:50:20", "owner": "fikriazmi_23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071418413362797, "text": "that’s why my left arm is stronger than my right 😭 bc i always carry my bag on the left", "created_at": "2025-11-24T02:46:44", "owner": "than_ari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842021113630901, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T02:44:04", "owner": "cavefrog2005", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098273572629018, "text": "Rock lee is that you??😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T02:43:40", "owner": "lost.zoro.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121176535535588, "text": "Ah lele le ah lela", "created_at": "2025-11-24T02:40:45", "owner": "eclipsedarya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18407900347186107, "text": "That how she stay thin thats her diet and health plan. Carry a heavy bag around😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T02:32:12", "owner": "iam_g8n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160211464392071, "text": "ngl i need that purse 😂👏", "created_at": "2025-11-24T02:31:02", "owner": "vvhoo.diss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18191935675332280, "text": "Before ebooks were a thing, books. So many books and paper to write or draw. Yeah know just the usual things to avoid  small talk...", "created_at": "2025-11-24T02:28:37", "owner": "wolvenstone218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108392446627054, "text": "She's training like Goku for... Something big", "created_at": "2025-11-24T02:13:26", "owner": "tacitronin20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066004076138271, "text": "Ok tf did she put on her bag???", "created_at": "2025-11-24T02:11:53", "owner": "muhd_afifi46", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068674142090991, "text": "Tf does she have in that bag?? Bricks???", "created_at": "2025-11-24T02:02:42", "owner": "theaussiejosh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18210704434311990, "text": "What that beg 5kg", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:59:39", "owner": "king_slayer_creed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131146864491296, "text": "She works out with her bag.", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:58:16", "owner": "rob.iron.link", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070609970592931, "text": "Ah le le kogoro ojiisan isn't it strange", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:58:15", "owner": "dystopie.exe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103366228673925, "text": "So that make sense how a girl purse can knockout a thieves... And purse can be a Lethal weapon😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:54:09", "owner": "hanifananta95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18349936624161262, "text": "Coin in pocket ahh friend 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:52:58", "owner": "s2_1226_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18072287603595000, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:49:20", "owner": "galileogalilang", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18101993794604178, "text": "Her smile when she said I weigh heavier than you😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:47:29", "owner": "ace_uso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079524719144731, "text": "She got that mousekatool in her bag", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:45:01", "owner": "klassicc_96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079518809130708, "text": "Ah yes rock Lee removing dem weights😂🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:41:49", "owner": "l1l_shaq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022961123785739, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:31:21", "owner": "carol.lee_muse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065112143147199, "text": "Why do u hear a Jamaican accent??", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:30:28", "owner": "willwin88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995925828845179, "text": "that's some Jonathan typa weight(Mcu fans get this joke)", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:29:13", "owner": "zach_hous", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040212866705803, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:28:35", "owner": "aloloythehumanboy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968912958971772, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:28:12", "owner": "_walter_anderson_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851925814545586, "text": "Confirm got 5kg weight inside the beg", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:24:37", "owner": "wanderer1603", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113624362510430, "text": "I pray to whoever might become her husband, amen 🙏 (srsly he needs it)", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:24:32", "owner": "chillinnazgul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953935552023793, "text": "Does she have dumbbells in her bag or sum", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:22:40", "owner": "_lonely_rider__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112255852582756, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:21:41", "owner": "eirfan_sahari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18492771334075337, "text": "😂❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:18:46", "owner": "maemariquiza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321071899169477, "text": "She has a whole watermelon in her bag 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:16:21", "owner": "aksh.thelucifer", "likes": 40}, {"id": 18411785899186080, "text": "Ah le le", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:13:03", "owner": "yongboks.right.butt.cheek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540424114003193, "text": "I think that bag got a laptop and books", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:07:23", "owner": "its.ian.221", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193435828330672, "text": "Dam piccolo", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:03:07", "owner": "linchen0129", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920130688206760, "text": "Rock lee moment right there 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:02:28", "owner": "wende_lim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968679543825764, "text": "\"your bag got 5kg meh\" apparently yes", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:02:21", "owner": "msclmmy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078848108155671, "text": "one of the main reason for scoliosis", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:01:08", "owner": "hgh.b.grn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072496799201579, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T00:59:25", "owner": "yuemitai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088303544303986, "text": "Oh right it's the bag🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-24T00:58:42", "owner": "geofarz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048518858678217, "text": "It was most definitely the bag gurl bought bricks on her bag incase of emergency", "created_at": "2025-11-24T00:56:51", "owner": "axlretuya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849902230562333, "text": "Alele", "created_at": "2025-11-24T00:52:17", "owner": "miminrosa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967614828992963, "text": "😂😂❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-24T00:45:24", "owner": "dark_329_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968031588978940, "text": "It’s like Rock Lee or goku dropping the weighted clothing bro", "created_at": "2025-11-24T00:31:25", "owner": "hk0ns", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18090324841937332, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T00:30:22", "owner": "billie_dad_adrienne_mom_2026", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18230918368306280, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T00:28:53", "owner": "iskandar_issei20", "likes": 14}, {"id": 17890083951378157, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T00:18:30", "owner": "special_k8000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098483476693181, "text": "Ah Lele", "created_at": "2025-11-24T00:11:49", "owner": "naganalindra", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18297915814285400, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T00:11:36", "owner": "yeongiek", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17914648209237707, "text": "They learned English form Caribbeans", "created_at": "2025-11-24T00:00:13", "owner": "barryrbb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084892220484529, "text": "So more than 5kg.which is like 11-12 pounds already to weight the same. You need to double that to being the scale all the way down like that. Lol", "created_at": "2025-11-23T23:51:07", "owner": "protocall13o2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965613553002700, "text": "Honestly with how heavy MY backpack its not that surprising for me haha. My bag is probably like 10 to 20 kg or more haha", "created_at": "2025-11-23T23:50:55", "owner": "someoneyouwontknowa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095617855868189, "text": "are you carrying a sack of rice or something?😭", "created_at": "2025-11-23T23:42:35", "owner": "hourly_uwi", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17923628844184296, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T23:41:34", "owner": "liliangrams_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936255384984613, "text": "“ah le le”", "created_at": "2025-11-23T23:41:21", "owner": "leeya_143_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083428967284971, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T23:41:08", "owner": "modah_99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039895727501769, "text": "🗣️OOCH🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-23T23:40:49", "owner": "rotbesideme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948125275061682, "text": "When do they sound a bit Nigerian to me 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-23T23:40:15", "owner": "starfirre10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185789140343270, "text": "Ah le le? Conan dat you???", "created_at": "2025-11-23T23:37:55", "owner": "animater__19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929688061015324, "text": "So the video that says \"what's inside the women's purse\" is true", "created_at": "2025-11-23T23:36:58", "owner": "sixdozerscharging", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18191709820336064, "text": "OMG, Lol!", "created_at": "2025-11-23T23:28:56", "owner": "andyloosli7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109587742614472, "text": "Ah le le? Im flying", "created_at": "2025-11-23T23:25:41", "owner": "fictitiousfilly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18538416928053400, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T23:22:38", "owner": "otaku4life87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104425063640962, "text": "😭😭😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T23:16:30", "owner": "thaiger_balm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111356479606200, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T23:12:24", "owner": "giyasfr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121828030521255, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:53:56", "owner": "tidustitanaya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18432950137110887, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:50:35", "owner": "dayz.sad.w.syz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17946904019934668, "text": "Tungsten cube suspiciously bag-shaped", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:39:59", "owner": "dmustbedrawing", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075304990990228, "text": "@lingxinjie damn", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:38:28", "owner": "jeisey.t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008246633811113, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:37:47", "owner": "hash0brownie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097515823830591, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:37:31", "owner": "gimpyoldman_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058383197645909, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:37:18", "owner": "ooiifnz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996313695704253, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:36:29", "owner": "kautsarmuhammadmizan", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18102476215732280, "text": "Like rock Lee dropping the weights", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:34:15", "owner": "realfableshearth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930537058115600, "text": "Sasa lele? 🤨", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:33:42", "owner": "emir.dkl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104557012647467, "text": "Being the gentleman i try to be, I offered to pick her hag for her and that bag was atleast 7 kg, a goddamn hand bag not even the bagpack", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:31:06", "owner": "sa.r_r.ishav", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059091146262635, "text": "Close enough welcome back rock Lee", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:28:25", "owner": "35shmeckles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18410323105137373, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:28:02", "owner": "roadking_96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086591404819001, "text": "IK those bags are fookin heavy lol..I used to be bag hanger for girls in college for my friends 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:20:37", "owner": "flowerwins_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094105075702597, "text": "Why do we carry such heavy ass bags around tho fr 💀💀💀", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:15:00", "owner": "_a_1930s_plague_", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17918795166210085, "text": "What is she goku? Weight training 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:12:07", "owner": "ledtruc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135744394480804, "text": "Jesus, does she just carry around bricks for self defence", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:09:32", "owner": "davys_drones", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081184640281831, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:08:54", "owner": "shae.created_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093689476717058, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T21:57:47", "owner": "jomar_af", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18051567608366637, "text": "Rock Lee is that you", "created_at": "2025-11-23T21:44:28", "owner": "k_andcie", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18051814838665602, "text": "If u find my dad in there tell him he has a son!", "created_at": "2025-11-23T21:43:50", "owner": "witzigernutzername", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074442065264783, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T21:42:40", "owner": "anastasiia_y5327", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893920567223455, "text": "She has pet rocks in the bag? 😮🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-23T21:39:20", "owner": "dontforgetleo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078823733150914, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T21:36:13", "owner": "zen.kazuya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047899433430431, "text": "My first thought is CONAN EDOGAWA 😽", "created_at": "2025-11-23T21:33:33", "owner": "aria.s_covers", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18145053112440302, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T21:23:34", "owner": "chemz.fx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982328085766458, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T21:09:33", "owner": "_vichoente_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057654953289070, "text": "She got a brick in there??", "created_at": "2025-11-23T21:07:31", "owner": "bytjie5678", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103101373600209, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:59:37", "owner": "euuuge_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098307946770597, "text": "🔥🥵🔥\n...............\n🔥🥶🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:59:24", "owner": "ucapan_seorang_pendosa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061540547209460, "text": "𝙽 𝙸 𝙲 𝙴", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:59:21", "owner": "ucapan_seorang_pendosa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992754339888474, "text": "Xixixi 😹", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:59:19", "owner": "ucapan_seorang_pendosa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072671669581797, "text": "𝙻𝚎𝚝'𝚜 𝙶𝚘 ! 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:59:15", "owner": "ucapan_seorang_pendosa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103744246729451, "text": "ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:59:12", "owner": "ucapan_seorang_pendosa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114418144601365, "text": "𝘖 𝘮 𝘢 𝘨 𝘢 𝘢 𝘢 ! ! ! 😱", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:59:10", "owner": "ucapan_seorang_pendosa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083539111861121, "text": "𝘖𝘩 𝘔𝘺 𝘌𝘺𝘦𝘴 ! ! ! ✨👀✨", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:59:09", "owner": "ucapan_seorang_pendosa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18486322513072361, "text": "𝘎𝘸𝘦𝘯𝘤𝘩𝘢𝘯𝘢² ! ! ! 💔🫂❤️‍🩹", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:59:07", "owner": "ucapan_seorang_pendosa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18493932127073334, "text": "𝘗𝘰𝘱𝘤𝘰𝘳𝘯 𝘨𝘶𝘺𝘴 ! ! ! 🔥୧⍤⃝🍿🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:59:06", "owner": "ucapan_seorang_pendosa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936412854985068, "text": "𝘈𝘣𝘴𝘰𝘭𝘶𝘵𝘦 𝘊𝘪𝘯𝘦𝘮𝘢 ! ! ! 🔥✋🏻🙂🤚🏻🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:59:05", "owner": "ucapan_seorang_pendosa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077651737950889, "text": "𝘙𝘶𝘯 𝘉𝘦𝘴𝘵𝘪𝘦 𝘙𝘶𝘯 ! ! ! 🌈. . .🤸🏻‍♀️ . . . 🚩. . .", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:59:04", "owner": "ucapan_seorang_pendosa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108526609541835, "text": "Am I the only one that hears an African accent 🫣", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:50:40", "owner": "richboii.philly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902810674315830, "text": "Is she carrying rocks in her bag tf 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:46:54", "owner": "ruthdragontooth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033672092732248, "text": "In shape from carrying that bag", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:45:05", "owner": "_gina_0111", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17919815442084081, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:40:45", "owner": "khayazn94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145318096437462, "text": "There’s bricks 🧱 in there", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:37:42", "owner": "paul_pawelek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120602665543361, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:35:26", "owner": "saud_al3nzii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18494321185076285, "text": "My uni backpack is similar mine is like 8 kg", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:29:15", "owner": "adolfodavidramos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064097666432675, "text": "This funny、i folow you home now", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:24:44", "owner": "thirty_turtle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886234201400021, "text": "WTF IS IN THAT BAG?!?", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:24:35", "owner": "mixxdblakk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184050307353102, "text": "Me and my backpack 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:19:25", "owner": "ccchaplan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18202685923317924, "text": "One word YES 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:13:01", "owner": "the_bakings0da", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847003783587224, "text": "I loved your “Ah le le? I’m flying” too cute! ❤️👏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:11:49", "owner": "kamuuwela", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081240107114400, "text": "Gym ❌ bag ✅", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:08:44", "owner": "akrishtal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925381960038062, "text": "The bag keeps her from blowing away in the wind 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:08:07", "owner": "i_hate_all_you_mfs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134588713467911, "text": "5kg meh 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:02:12", "owner": "kw1ll1s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086478310817790, "text": "It's like when Goku took off his weighted clothing. 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:00:53", "owner": "duvael", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074296321989541, "text": "Me taking my lunch bag into work 😂 me and my friend need lunch 2 snacks, 1 big drink and a cold tea 😂and the tea alone is a kg and yesterday we had like turmeric rice and lentils, fern root noodles etc etc so I was delighted when he carried my bag. SUFFER FOR THE SCHNACKS BRO", "created_at": "2025-11-23T19:56:03", "owner": "a.bellachanelle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881935684308763, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T19:49:21", "owner": "rose_n_thornes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18186933205342290, "text": "Girl what’s in your bag??😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-23T19:42:25", "owner": "toymakerpines_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964422895005577, "text": "Fivekaygee", "created_at": "2025-11-23T19:37:27", "owner": "fndidnfkdnsndndksndnkdndn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890360485382339, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T19:34:12", "owner": "rami_vroom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933140893113949, "text": "wtf is in that bag😭", "created_at": "2025-11-23T18:58:41", "owner": "justinverbon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087006739804967, "text": "The bag to smack the robbers", "created_at": "2025-11-23T18:52:37", "owner": "maybe_harsha", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17954474649031763, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T18:50:58", "owner": "luvmuffin.voon", "likes": 16}, {"id": 18383534476147782, "text": "arere❌ ahlele✅", "created_at": "2025-11-23T18:31:50", "owner": "noonandyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18377344462153165, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T18:18:59", "owner": "meet.ramgarhia54", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543152245061206, "text": "Me in college", "created_at": "2025-11-23T18:04:12", "owner": "bhawya._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965460691003421, "text": "Ah le le Conan is that you", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:53:57", "owner": "markkymark95", "likes": 27}, {"id": 18005020370819338, "text": "I need to know which accent this is it's so cute", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:35:09", "owner": "dearest.diane", "likes": 81}, {"id": 18074495843250797, "text": "the timing when san puts down the bag WWWW", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:21:18", "owner": "yuudesuuu", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18101004526741281, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:21:16", "owner": "fitchefashtad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116256988498564, "text": "The bag do be 5 kg 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:05:47", "owner": "the_shinigami786", "likes": 45}, {"id": 18072751811250252, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:03:24", "owner": "jujubee_2k", "likes": 105}, {"id": 17944516952947757, "text": "She shouldn't look so thin carrying that heavy of a bag lol", "created_at": "2025-11-23T16:43:21", "owner": "sh.andi5127", "likes": 87}, {"id": 17968412654973300, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T15:39:06", "owner": "vxkivi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936462078980818, "text": "🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-23T15:29:07", "owner": "auschene", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009083786805881, "text": "Ah leh. Leh", "created_at": "2025-11-23T14:47:26", "owner": "kxakkx1308", "likes": 39}, {"id": 17865572454506432, "text": "It’s me and my bag against the world", "created_at": "2025-11-23T14:46:49", "owner": "_empresssummer_", "likes": 202}, {"id": 18379918420144969, "text": "🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-23T14:42:35", "owner": "moochalicious404", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084754997016739, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T14:16:52", "owner": "tired.angelina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105532549563052, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T14:14:40", "owner": "klyn_borah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18319459414219225, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T14:10:54", "owner": "_wolf_0.1_", "likes": 69}, {"id": 18030088898728037, "text": "Rock Lee strats", "created_at": "2025-11-23T13:42:13", "owner": "_midori_vibes_", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17846958495587970, "text": "That’s crazy. 🙌🙌👏", "created_at": "2025-11-23T13:11:09", "owner": "necco_sama", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18066727187454903, "text": "FIRSTS", "created_at": "2025-11-23T12:10:49", "owner": "me_rosemari_", "likes": 3}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3764937237738931640, "shortcode": "DQ_vnhhEcW4", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DQ_vnhhEcW4/", "taken_at": "2025-11-13T12:06:59", "caption": "Never expected to meet him 🫣😆 \n\n#kirapeace #reelsofinstagram #fyp #sg #foryou #bus #publicsinging #embarrassing #bussinging #explore #singer #singapore #singing #busking #random", "owner_username": "kirapeace", "owner_id": "3969897525", "likes": 16817, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0125_DQ_vnhhEcW4\\DQ_vnhhEcW4_20251113_120659.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18102255886596545, "text": "THATS MY BROTHER", "created_at": "2025-11-13T12:19:41", "owner": "_xvxcxdo_", "likes": 665}, {"id": 17915332722090096, "text": "Aesthetics 8/10 \nSong 6/10\nEffort 11/10", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:42:35", "owner": "littlepinkpebble", "likes": 65}, {"id": 18368729605081022, "text": "LOL THE GUY’S FACE AT THE BACK", "created_at": "2025-11-14T12:12:49", "owner": "paultwohill77", "likes": 826}, {"id": 18090792500505826, "text": "The guy is so handsome 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-13T12:22:07", "owner": "pmkhld", "likes": 36}, {"id": 17926814631155231, "text": "I would be overjoyed if you approached me and asked if you could sing for me!!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T20:03:59", "owner": "nickglovermusic", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17932690290104283, "text": "😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-14T00:50:23", "owner": "mehul_badal_", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18107403088646214, "text": "Is there someone pointing a gun at him behind the camera", "created_at": "2025-11-14T01:58:44", "owner": "br0nji", "likes": 450}, {"id": 17903319402167428, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:56:46", "owner": "sedik_him", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17947375841931350, "text": "The amount of cringe I just went through…. I’ll never forgive and forget you 🤢🤮😆🤡🤦🏻‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-11-14T17:44:31", "owner": "forty__flat", "likes": 156}, {"id": 18160003444396111, "text": "Why doesn't this happen to me 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-14T15:17:19", "owner": "smokes.srt", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18159773578401200, "text": "Follow your bliss and the universe will open doors where there were only walls", "created_at": "2025-11-25T00:06:39", "owner": "tye_red", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17976545369943538, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-15T03:27:34", "owner": "shopshopstop", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18413962063140094, "text": "Time to take public transport", "created_at": "2025-11-14T12:39:24", "owner": "_shafxq_", "likes": 65}, {"id": 18019501097789145, "text": "Which bus is this asking for a friend", "created_at": "2025-11-13T12:17:39", "owner": "adashi_04", "likes": 28}, {"id": 18028798847568023, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T08:59:58", "owner": "jason_42716", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063110435425933, "text": "He’s so hot… 🤤", "created_at": "2025-11-14T06:00:17", "owner": "mukhriz.ezry", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18157261675403711, "text": "ITSSSS FREAKING @durgeshzz 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-13T15:09:44", "owner": "shackkkkk", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18059837609541375, "text": "This girl is going to get arrested and fine pretty soon if she continues to do this in public", "created_at": "2025-11-14T02:52:01", "owner": "realdeal67__67", "likes": 266}, {"id": 18104395822712127, "text": "What’s the name of this song ?", "created_at": "2025-11-17T16:05:29", "owner": "jinronggyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141370060452338, "text": "durgesh 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-14T00:04:39", "owner": "deus.astil", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18067981373096402, "text": "can i sing with u", "created_at": "2025-11-13T14:51:20", "owner": "noodlesmcgurkinson", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18093931663885831, "text": "Indian guys always humble ❤️🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:32:25", "owner": "sahil_shindeeeee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17907671100125643, "text": "OMG IS THAT THE MOST HANDSOME INDIAN MAN IN SINGAPORE @durgeshzz", "created_at": "2025-11-13T12:29:44", "owner": "musvzy", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18161804068391679, "text": "Ts is so cringe", "created_at": "2025-11-18T02:57:18", "owner": "luisfrmcltt", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17868050175475147, "text": "Girl you in the wrong place 😂❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-20T12:03:10", "owner": "abe202090", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18002714567673228, "text": "@jadenzy_ this one is the dancing on the table 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-14T06:56:20", "owner": "chao_g_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18084697913057807, "text": "So pretty", "created_at": "2025-11-14T09:44:23", "owner": "dragon369x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111394390594045, "text": "The song is a banger tbh...🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-17T15:32:20", "owner": "miamor.cante", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18082828487090545, "text": "Report and get fine for public nuisance in bus", "created_at": "2025-11-20T08:26:11", "owner": "rz7_sleek", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18059424104275876, "text": "Everyone call police better", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:33:00", "owner": "mickymouse.cos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863568244458813, "text": "Kira I'm going to report this to the police", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:44:58", "owner": "mickymouse.cos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18212751502312640, "text": "@durgeshzz go and show off your talent bro she’s nothing to you", "created_at": "2025-11-13T15:06:50", "owner": "van_rich_gabriel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045732959440581, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-14T14:46:09", "owner": "atreusseh", "likes": 174}, {"id": 17980210109774456, "text": "I want to meet you in Singaporw", "created_at": "2025-11-13T14:23:40", "owner": "alvinhor993", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954695389024927, "text": "Could you randomly show up to my house and do this please 🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-14T02:10:27", "owner": "ewanmagill1234", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089335198968937, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-14T01:25:42", "owner": "vyronosafc88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932743078113294, "text": "I would say no and next time get ear plugs so you can hand it over to people in need", "created_at": "2025-12-13T23:22:40", "owner": "ogbeyblade", "