d": 17857183308561774, "text": "love this voice🙌❤️🔥!", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:34:25", "owner": "fizzytitan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136147156474685, "text": "Love your boots 👌", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:10:14", "owner": "mike.adams46", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075168289992768, "text": "Great singing!", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:42:57", "owner": "dj_nickle_bee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079138196189158, "text": "Amazing 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-29T19:09:50", "owner": "aniket.chhetry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065588204426904, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:52:03", "owner": "batman61743", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862432987538559, "text": "time to get a driving licence", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:29:14", "owner": "lenny_ogun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102721711668482, "text": "Are you annoyed he got the looks?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:48:01", "owner": "lvdtc2004", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072071102353700, "text": "Bro is very shy", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:50:48", "owner": "joybycrystal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856749877510818, "text": "Good stuff ❤️🔥🫶🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:21:28", "owner": "nuk_dias", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842688760622614, "text": "Guy says no to hearing a song and she moves up a few seats and plays anyway lmao", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:02:21", "owner": "strwzrdkng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080960831325084, "text": "You two should start a band", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:06:19", "owner": "djdelz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983909493762659, "text": "no cap I’m a little drunk and I could cry right now", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:41:17", "owner": "0102032425wa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072417296057192, "text": "Looks like Indian napoleon dynamite", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:13:51", "owner": "matthewbmogg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899710267337511, "text": "W rizz", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:38:46", "owner": "robertthebirdman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090935911932199, "text": "To that thing song…lingui…lingui…lingui…lingui", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:55:09", "owner": "andy_zuri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855641683523284, "text": "I respect the hustle 👏👏 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:37:58", "owner": "daniel.gilbertson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090507457934304, "text": "You're not a good singer, it is painful to listen to. And I don't think he agreed to be in your little video to be viewed by thousands of people. I'm going to file a complaints on his behalf.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:03:37", "owner": "kay.gee213", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978095877948960, "text": "That was awesome 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:27:50", "owner": "ivdunno", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118941895552062, "text": "She’s beautiful", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:01:19", "owner": "davidstevens201174", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078878443897578, "text": "If some stranger, especially one so bold as this, kindly asked if they could sing to me, I’d have jumped at the opportunity and had been straight mesmerized by the event.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:28:59", "owner": "cortisone_shot_to_the_arse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026972333577387, "text": "When how where ? 😍😍😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:00:47", "owner": "barista_jc_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059792129558941, "text": "bro has no girl skills", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:07:42", "owner": "dimitri.022", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079140688922244, "text": "I identify as retarded", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:43:18", "owner": "ieat_fuud", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883854847409551, "text": "Whats wrong with him?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:21:47", "owner": "lowkickspamfan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058490570535519, "text": "@kirapeace I do this in parks… it’s fun isn’t it", "created_at": "2025-11-25T16:26:42", "owner": "big.william.wallace", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079200988898212, "text": "Public nuisance", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:51:32", "owner": "time_traveller_3030", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087562747982203, "text": "Lol", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:36:16", "owner": "dannysuresh12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18211973629310468, "text": "Ok I'm going home 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:25:48", "owner": "adrian_arjon11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099766186758479, "text": "Im gonna kum", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:29:14", "owner": "ao97000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121276354537170, "text": "Im literally about to bust from seeing you for the first time @kirapeace", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:28:45", "owner": "ao97000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18516779896066383, "text": "Please don’t do this again.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:48:50", "owner": "bram_van_oevelen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085565462047109, "text": "fucking boring ass people!", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:53:25", "owner": "faisal_leroi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900788809303646, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:43:41", "owner": "dead.gun.89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067523411119103, "text": "🐢", "created_at": "2025-11-24T22:36:10", "owner": "christatt69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134568427487810, "text": "Forcing your music on others isn't cool", "created_at": "2025-11-24T22:01:37", "owner": "moonshie_sax", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100510129738241, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-24T21:40:31", "owner": "jesuschrist8832", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022690970786693, "text": "Im afraid id completely fall in love 🥹", "created_at": "2025-11-24T20:54:10", "owner": "artisan_justin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185297491343561, "text": "Bus driver did nothing??? Huh???? 🤔🤔🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-24T17:53:18", "owner": "alphonso2004", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353879620165507, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:35:49", "owner": "friar.rose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073035200339509, "text": "@durgeshzz NAISE LA BRO", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:33:53", "owner": "urnumb1baller", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091319692910655, "text": "Walking to your house…😅🧐", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:33:26", "owner": "rapturue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18387321262177260, "text": "Who could say no to her! ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-23T18:27:26", "owner": "towncarlos510", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102075244676786, "text": "Cringe. I’d be embarrassed if I was being filmed too", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:14:54", "owner": "davehutch2020", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18276600580304187, "text": "Bjorks rebel daughter😶", "created_at": "2025-11-23T12:58:55", "owner": "al_kadir_artist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058275581555253, "text": "Wow I really like your voice 😍❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-23T12:45:26", "owner": "__a__l__e__x__25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849368851566699, "text": "I usually skip this part but aight", "created_at": "2025-11-23T07:33:21", "owner": "iwy123456", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049161404394845, "text": "For someone with Peace in their name they sure ain't doing that", "created_at": "2025-11-23T02:22:11", "owner": "affectionstarr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988327296858239, "text": "Men of culture, who wants to get the bus?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:44:54", "owner": "charliedarko13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18335190295236500, "text": "@khaboom._ i'll scorch the island to find that bus", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:43:15", "owner": "iisxck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853780576575964, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:11:08", "owner": "heyyy2179", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18393795046131620, "text": "Singing whores the new wave", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:31:03", "owner": "sleepynoize", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098935129701973, "text": "So wholesome 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:38:38", "owner": "spencer_the_spectre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18209507167313764, "text": "Dont get his hopes up", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:15:17", "owner": "marquis_orchard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004049396818921, "text": "Girl who actually trying to make it out as a musician 🔥🙌 respect", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:46:41", "owner": "brycenakamura0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083053676090891, "text": "Sing to me 😊", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:29:49", "owner": "raymondwu12345", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184395484344123, "text": "She needs a triple decker bus! Not enough space for her ego in this one 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T23:45:07", "owner": "thedadvibes89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101792392680955, "text": "Tomorrow at 17:30 in front of Sainsbury’s at Camden Town . Bus 29 we go home in style 🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-21T23:20:54", "owner": "cristianchristodoulou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046519949445437, "text": "You’re so fuckin sweet 🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-21T23:19:46", "owner": "cristianchristodoulou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104232262640852, "text": "Why doesn’t any thing like this ever happen to me. 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-21T16:45:21", "owner": "londonlad2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957032337976179, "text": "I know he feels so awkward lol", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:45:47", "owner": "scottbrady06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074148113195197, "text": "She's cute. I wish she'd sing for me.", "created_at": "2025-11-20T17:42:33", "owner": "dontstopbelieving2010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901338427313332, "text": "Bro regrets saying ok", "created_at": "2025-11-20T08:25:22", "owner": "stupot2026", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133741219464025, "text": "Lool need you to bring them vibes to the back of the bus on our pod 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T08:04:19", "owner": "thelaststoppodcast", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193686040327381, "text": "I would be all over her flirting away, that guy is fucking gay.", "created_at": "2025-11-20T01:22:58", "owner": "neon_wolf_7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070232993604452, "text": "Sing to me sat on the end of my bed 😈 But ngl I’d just want to chill on the bus on my own until my stop.", "created_at": "2025-11-19T17:47:07", "owner": "kinki_fucka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051993515645925, "text": "I hope i have this moment.. it makes me feel happy.. but im sure i can 1up you..", "created_at": "2025-11-19T16:32:37", "owner": "hectorgundam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088591477750950, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T10:00:41", "owner": "francesco_bertozzi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107845723622022, "text": "LOOK LUV....GO AWAY🤾🏻‍♀️🏌️‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-11-19T06:34:55", "owner": "smuzzgulp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119249797533402, "text": "I thought your right arm is only til your elbow... 😬", "created_at": "2025-11-19T02:08:55", "owner": "sillysnake1977", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896551975202608, "text": "Crash the bus already 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T23:46:35", "owner": "mateuszcichyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075983363186065, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-18T20:29:37", "owner": "daveleito84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865005517506667, "text": "Arrest her! Being nice and wholesome is highly illegal in 2025!! 🤬🤬🤬", "created_at": "2025-11-18T19:45:24", "owner": "freddie_private", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086387840298771, "text": "Please stop this shit. This is singapore. Not your friggin land of freewill", "created_at": "2025-11-18T17:35:35", "owner": "bbsch_bljl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111708103576679, "text": "U could sing to me anytime of day momma", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:43:57", "owner": "jackson.bonez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096039178658255, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:04:29", "owner": "josuelito_2011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068942561093190, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T14:06:04", "owner": "incurab1e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037488758710701, "text": "@durgeshzz WHAT THE FUCK BRO", "created_at": "2025-11-18T07:09:09", "owner": "j_jay_ganesshhh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067925747612037, "text": "He looks so uncomfortable", "created_at": "2025-11-18T05:09:20", "owner": "bhookha_t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979152405944842, "text": "@xiaoen_19", "created_at": "2025-11-17T23:13:38", "owner": "ruku1104", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903468061296483, "text": "chill dude", "created_at": "2025-11-17T21:58:11", "owner": "chico_grc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047665160424837, "text": "Nice 👍 you are good", "created_at": "2025-11-17T21:06:45", "owner": "jixzwvxzn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133918825478318, "text": "Cute it can sing to me in nicer places than the bus hopefully", "created_at": "2025-11-17T16:37:08", "owner": "akplumbdawg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868221100472823, "text": "😂 cool", "created_at": "2025-11-17T14:20:46", "owner": "rishivarma0783", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071910422363927, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-11-17T11:54:04", "owner": "noah_natasha_amir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18434958397101570, "text": "That’s amazing. I love to see humanity just embrace one another like this. In an age of brain rot ignorance content this is enjoyable to watch.", "created_at": "2025-11-17T11:46:23", "owner": "prismiraa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915618307215802, "text": "I would sing back 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T09:28:15", "owner": "vipfit_and_motivated", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047469503430625, "text": "Kaalaa Bhoot", "created_at": "2025-11-17T08:51:31", "owner": "sahidkhan_49_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102682354708323, "text": "I woulda enjoyed this if I got sang to on a boring bus ride 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-17T08:44:12", "owner": "coffee_loverr1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18410189494138975, "text": "Can you sing for me ? 😮", "created_at": "2025-11-17T05:32:53", "owner": "paco_lord87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102312898733045, "text": "Really nice 🤠", "created_at": "2025-11-17T04:36:16", "owner": "anasshk_33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000887054832990, "text": "Now I like you .. ❤️ from India", "created_at": "2025-11-17T04:20:05", "owner": "sumitraj35133513", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118608145549626, "text": "Why does this never happen when I take public transit?", "created_at": "2025-11-17T03:07:43", "owner": "redflames14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039154550506435, "text": "Phase 4 cringe", "created_at": "2025-11-17T03:04:06", "owner": "throw_ma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084560486072493, "text": "Kinda mean of her to toy with the guy like that.", "created_at": "2025-11-16T22:14:37", "owner": "kochhar243", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077513014948995, "text": "Poor guy is so out of his depth. So awkward. It’s sad. Genetically these two humans are light years apart. 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-16T22:11:58", "owner": "kochhar243", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063405302164718, "text": "Chords too short makes me ears hurt", "created_at": "2025-11-16T21:29:26", "owner": "freqwavesblue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904441051295372, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-16T19:18:41", "owner": "radio_active_808", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949934257046631, "text": "Please cross my path!!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-16T14:29:44", "owner": "omarj.chowdhury", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546691711020528, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-16T13:23:12", "owner": "bobbydiecast6741", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908606740264070, "text": "Please come to yishun", "created_at": "2025-11-16T10:52:28", "owner": "razernoww", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18395947546135720, "text": "You're definitely a cutie and you're so wonderful", "created_at": "2025-11-16T08:02:34", "owner": "loveharleyquinn23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18199866394316667, "text": "So sweet", "created_at": "2025-11-16T02:43:46", "owner": "ojhong72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099427402686544, "text": "Can you sing to me please 🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-15T17:30:15", "owner": "monochromeshades", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086208640800478, "text": "Poor fellow.", "created_at": "2025-11-15T15:21:52", "owner": "yellowriver68", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397759141123108, "text": "People would be Weary", "created_at": "2025-11-15T13:26:09", "owner": "rosalynocallaghan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073576582992395, "text": "That was dead as fuck 😂 no talent at all", "created_at": "2025-11-15T13:18:06", "owner": "lukeywearne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985284498751211, "text": "How self absorbed", "created_at": "2025-11-15T13:09:22", "owner": "benjdmusic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846460426584986, "text": "All the female artists she approached have rejected her, and now she ended up struggling in public transport and begging for attention and engagement.", "created_at": "2025-11-15T11:44:17", "owner": "vlvt.shdw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875623357353015, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-15T11:35:35", "owner": "levi.gregory05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083351414078300, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-15T10:12:22", "owner": "jeffu1215", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064839638147777, "text": "That’s seduction…", "created_at": "2025-11-15T09:51:15", "owner": "ravi_m.13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083511059086510, "text": "👏👏👏❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-15T09:43:33", "owner": "fuhaid7531", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082666436292416, "text": "SG is the worst place to be trying this bro regardless of how nice U sing", "created_at": "2025-11-15T04:35:02", "owner": "simplyvishnu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925680070171085, "text": "Let jam one day?", "created_at": "2025-11-15T03:56:02", "owner": "teobronson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965955879992118, "text": "The amount of sheer willpower this took is beyond my comprehension", "created_at": "2025-11-15T02:45:02", "owner": "gribmanush", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058470974267129, "text": "Hell nah, how can one fumble that shi", "created_at": "2025-11-15T02:34:20", "owner": "ayaawn.spamm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029237498738879, "text": "Let’s ask the most important question, “Got licence or not girl?”", "created_at": "2025-11-15T02:02:06", "owner": "edivaroux", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081424337319652, "text": "Beautiful guitar design and sound i want purchase Tell me how much??", "created_at": "2025-11-15T02:01:45", "owner": "rahulrhythum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072644711255556, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-15T01:49:42", "owner": "durgesh_kaushik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078654778925947, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-15T01:24:33", "owner": "mr_cijo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995342706848984, "text": "Cute", "created_at": "2025-11-15T00:27:43", "owner": "maeckerle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059970467556718, "text": "Free Language Exchange: Spanish & English ¡Hagamos un intercambio!I help you with Spanish, you help me with English. Let's learn together! 💬", "created_at": "2025-11-14T23:36:40", "owner": "spanish.english.languages", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083977526103994, "text": "You are a really good singer👏", "created_at": "2025-11-14T23:36:32", "owner": "yasin_claaby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082521413012730, "text": "Please come up n sing to me,..i needed it..", "created_at": "2025-11-14T23:30:24", "owner": "iamahlee6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090162529941702, "text": "How are u so confident to do this ❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-14T22:46:10", "owner": "daniel_mazz11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866557207493619, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-14T22:45:16", "owner": "daniel_mazz11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134470780473520, "text": "Introverts nightmare", "created_at": "2025-11-14T22:07:59", "owner": "deanahearne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887487868263350, "text": "If this was me I'd say lemme get my ukulele and we will make music together 🤘", "created_at": "2025-11-14T19:43:29", "owner": "honey_bunny_x0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024684914769835, "text": "But she sings very good 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-14T18:26:46", "owner": "mukuldevraj7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987200787861938, "text": "Bro is not happy with his life . 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-14T18:25:34", "owner": "mukuldevraj7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901928281315340, "text": "❤️❤️❤️so sweet", "created_at": "2025-11-14T17:22:22", "owner": "bijaya__chhetri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078771139919667, "text": "istg id never get over this", "created_at": "2025-11-14T16:52:45", "owner": "iiqahxumaiirah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951457303021110, "text": "Durgesh furgesh  is crazyyy 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-14T16:26:29", "owner": "berandyboo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874882645442604, "text": "LOL", "created_at": "2025-11-14T14:02:53", "owner": "dibrown17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935878125984602, "text": "That's a nice voice ngl", "created_at": "2025-11-14T13:31:07", "owner": "quidbat", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17887327632265125, "text": "BAHAHAHHAHA", "created_at": "2025-11-14T12:48:01", "owner": "faehimm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080561666118000, "text": "Normalise leaving people the fuck alone 🤭🤣 #clown 🤡", "created_at": "2025-11-14T06:30:04", "owner": "craigwahs985", "likes": 1}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["kirapeace", "reelsofinstagram", "fyp", "sg", "foryou", "bus", "publicsinging", "embarrassing", "bussinging", "explore", "singer", "singapore", "singing", "busking", "random"]},
{"media_id": 3776083205942990019, "shortcode": "DRnV6tUjNTD", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRnV6tUjNTD/", "taken_at": "2025-11-28T21:13:18", "caption": "POV : you have strong president so you don’t need to carry mahjongs POV : 你有一個強壯的社長，所以你不用一直拿著麻將 DM OUR PRESIDENT 😍😍 @henrylok.lok @alvin_sung_ @hoyinlau144 \n#mahjong #麻將 #sheffield  #demonhunters #kdramaedits", "owner_username": "sheffield_mahjong", "owner_id": "49387625891", "likes": 71, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0126_DRnV6tUjNTD\\DRnV6tUjNTD_20251128_211318.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": "18159765088403125", "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:16:34", "owner": "alvin_sung_", "likes": 2}, {"id": "18060558845534791", "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T12:48:45", "owner": "_bonbon.dayo_", "likes": 3}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["mahjong", "麻將", "sheffield", "demonhunters", "kdramaedits"]},
{"media_id": 3774195867121193098, "shortcode": "DRgoyUEgZCK", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRgoyUEgZCK/", "taken_at": "2025-11-26T06:40:54", "caption": "\"I didn't start it, Miss\": UK PM Keir Starmer got himself into trouble after doing the viral 6-7 dance with pupils during a school visit.\n\nLink in bio @straits_times\n#67 #KeirStarmer #UK #Britain #StraitsTimes", "owner_username": "straits_times", "owner_id": "1091214028", "likes": 48834, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0127_DRgoyUEgZCK\\DRgoyUEgZCK_20251126_064054.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18096628267890298, "text": "wait till they hear about 9-5", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:34:57", "owner": "zigzaac._", "likes": 12452}, {"id": 18099276529780503, "text": "I loved how the principal told him abt how kids get in trouble for it 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:33:02", "owner": "ms_innebandy84", "likes": 3949}, {"id": 18076030004227162, "text": "I mean the quickest way to get kids to stop doing it is to have the PM do it.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:46:42", "owner": "notjustanyho", "likes": 8846}, {"id": 18048500366419032, "text": "why do kids get in trouble for saying a meaningless thing lmao I know its annoying and you can get them in trouble maybe for interrupting class but you can’t just randomly punish them for it", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:33:14", "owner": "experiri_nova", "likes": 529}, {"id": 17914556949233067, "text": "I like how he was baited into the meme-ing, and he just went along with it", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:36:11", "owner": "thimweng", "likes": 2293}, {"id": 17979742775781517, "text": "I'm not happy with PM Starmer for many reasons but I love this. They're kids, as an adult the best thing you can do to break the tension and have them enjoy your visit is to be a little bit mischievous.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:52:43", "owner": "officio.assassinorum", "likes": 289}, {"id": 18100879042685375, "text": "😂😂❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:10:59", "owner": "adiem_00h", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18049056275413971, "text": "Actually I see the little girl starting to do the gesture first lol", "created_at": "2025-12-02T00:54:53", "owner": "jacetholomew", "likes": 37}, {"id": 18305191276254689, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:58:33", "owner": "jl_sauced", "likes": 115}, {"id": 18078718184325545, "text": "“It’s absolutely fine….” 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:12:39", "owner": "daphotographer", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18120003685543883, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T07:17:58", "owner": "ilhmvp", "likes": 19}, {"id": 18028866239765243, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:30:55", "owner": "balsamic28", "likes": 371}, {"id": 18062002577216345, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:30:43", "owner": "ahhin1402", "likes": 19}, {"id": 18089502529934429, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:54:56", "owner": "sco.fieldddd", "likes": 872}, {"id": 17990355152890748, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:11:41", "owner": "lewis9.2", "likes": 89}, {"id": 18075214109192776, "text": "they are SO happy 😂♥️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:37:30", "owner": "cesartje", "likes": 36}, {"id": 18067582289526462, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:13:42", "owner": "eian.null", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17967956750993513, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:27:39", "owner": "rashid4pf__", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18497971015076198, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:49:43", "owner": "yym995", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18015291668796118, "text": "Same people who are gonna take care of us in nursing home btw", "created_at": "2025-12-04T07:38:58", "owner": "gautamdapro", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17988916031872505, "text": "\"I bet u didn't , sir \"", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:31:35", "owner": "animeshxyadav", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17949892877924628, "text": "\"I bet you didn't, Sir.\" 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:45:55", "owner": "o_wen1269", "likes": 53}, {"id": 18080806940150012, "text": "im so glad im not born in this new generation", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:14:12", "owner": "aviolie", "likes": 105}, {"id": 18314876005247196, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T06:27:53", "owner": "carlo_molteni11", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18032617886722101, "text": "Now we know which kids got infected by the 6 7 trends, and investigate which kids got it from direct access of social media 😅", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:30:10", "owner": "angyutang", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18064482749170471, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:01:44", "owner": "berandyboo", "likes": 197}, {"id": 17949647258914708, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T08:51:46", "owner": "sky_7heaven", "likes": 94}, {"id": 18060365072550200, "text": "Someone could tell me this was a scene from the Thick of It, and I'd believe it", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:43:51", "owner": "tjdemmery", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17991633002891077, "text": "anything but solving the issues", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:21:01", "owner": "tanujsadawarte", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18062754866442028, "text": "Someone enlighten me, what's wrong with flapping your hands and saying 67", "created_at": "2025-11-26T08:02:40", "owner": "chinedu.tm", "likes": 398}, {"id": 18084647159089902, "text": "No different to covid , politicians not knowing there own rules", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:22:28", "owner": "dougspineapple", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084027428049473, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T19:54:55", "owner": "loispyeun", "likes": 1551}, {"id": 17855835816524930, "text": "How does he have thw heart to sit with childeren when he's enabling the gaza genocide", "created_at": "2025-12-02T05:52:06", "owner": "momi.mbuzi", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18080594960324196, "text": "there is something rlly wrong with the way blud said 6 7", "created_at": "2025-12-11T17:21:37", "owner": "5intel1", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18088165181060330, "text": "6-7 million arrested for hate speech", "created_at": "2025-12-10T14:41:42", "owner": "vaclavstepan58", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18542368087049466, "text": "Why are kids banned from doing it", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:15:24", "owner": "nene_executivebranch", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086163724959902, "text": "Gg", "created_at": "2025-11-26T08:16:40", "owner": "teddy_thian", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18051129890353347, "text": "Bro be like: help me with those kids", "created_at": "2025-11-26T08:55:11", "owner": "nsu_chinibong", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18188266567340780, "text": "@mj_borma @holly_woodford @yenchii.w Henry for PM", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:43:53", "owner": "tgmars", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061851716635179, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:26:27", "owner": "k0en.lol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544572634019241, "text": "That's another meaningless thing he's doing which everyone keeps telling him that \"it's absolutely fine\" 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:14:33", "owner": "shazilym", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18289849315263653, "text": "Well, it’s called bonding", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:09:16", "owner": "theonemkhd", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18114969022504888, "text": "Anything but stopping illegal immigrants 🥀🥀🥀", "created_at": "2025-11-26T08:42:10", "owner": "choom.313", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18410722888184298, "text": "i like the idea that churchill is looking up thinking \"the indian dude was better\"", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:10:05", "owner": "vegankaneki", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17926958454159770, "text": "Seriously getting into trouble for saying numbers 6,7!? I get it's the trend kids are saying nowadays but really ?! 🤷🏻‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:39:04", "owner": "hughesviolet09", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17993818499710818, "text": "I hope he told them they are going to have to see their parents less because they’ll have to work more hours now.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:34:32", "owner": "chrismiahmma", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17899287294341260, "text": "I just died on the inside", "created_at": "2025-11-26T19:56:41", "owner": "galafrio", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18107594098617255, "text": "“thank you PM”, “lovely 67”, “students will get into trouble for saying that”, “it’s fine”. Paggro meter is off the charts.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:28:24", "owner": "fredyap1234", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17842129713632465, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:37:32", "owner": "ehbroclub", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18551198716025694, "text": "Don’t like the man but that was very cute", "created_at": "2025-11-26T19:02:35", "owner": "userjj94521", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18183232771356194, "text": "Yeah Kids getting trouble for having fun beacause teachers are annoyed 😒", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:26:41", "owner": "schwarzwald_jo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18167427175387166, "text": "Hilariously genuine... yeah you didn't start it 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T13:03:53", "owner": "wrkzon_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18072661253048159, "text": "Don't worry in 6-7 months this fade will be over and the next one will take is place. 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:06:45", "owner": "smileyinthekitchen", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18533459266020842, "text": "Is it in Deaf school in United Kingdom ?  Maybe it is sign language these kids try to teach him.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T08:12:28", "owner": "jade_6405", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18205322170315978, "text": "Wait until they learn about 9-5.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:55:08", "owner": "daddykmk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18367156957091909, "text": "6'7 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:45:31", "owner": "staysaltysingapore", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17901601533181530, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T15:55:41", "owner": "gummypeanut11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18398478154123537, "text": "69 better", "created_at": "2025-12-13T11:17:33", "owner": "svq_hc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102978706737530, "text": "Pls let this corny meme end", "created_at": "2025-12-13T01:33:47", "owner": "bawii455", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090489577755494, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T01:25:33", "owner": "inatehiggers_887", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18428541259129647, "text": "Get that girl into politics, she started it😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T09:18:33", "owner": "pawpa_cool", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077601593184071, "text": "Omg I would be so annoyed if he started doing that in my Year 10 class because he won’t be able to keep the kids quiet after that.", "created_at": "2025-12-11T06:31:17", "owner": "fareenthe3rd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873598525461506, "text": "It's nice to see him more human for once. I'm still not voting for him.", "created_at": "2025-12-10T21:31:03", "owner": "thomas.trystan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932592970113991, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T21:29:46", "owner": "f1rethenx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875912689449765, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:43:27", "owner": "alvaro_tolba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046271177481454, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:43:26", "owner": "alvaro_tolba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108155005618607, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T18:07:56", "owner": "wisdom_gained", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070044005078179, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T13:22:20", "owner": "the_lost_spring_bar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926305540175862, "text": "That’s why they need ban social media like Australia", "created_at": "2025-12-10T13:09:00", "owner": "sandridgenights", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916173829236049, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T08:43:30", "owner": "shai.menasherov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102198970706827, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T06:58:03", "owner": "ranfromconviction", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075629267521165, "text": "Do you know the reason it is banned because muslims thinks it’s haram to do the 6 7 meme there is a Muslim guy with his two kids talking about it which they are from up", "created_at": "2025-12-09T20:05:23", "owner": "fazil_firoz_00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969671718828715, "text": "Lmao the girl knew what she was doing😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T19:40:39", "owner": "vrishabh4471", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949669777028024, "text": "Cooked generation 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T19:34:08", "owner": "mmha51173", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086049911088570, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-09T17:04:19", "owner": "koenpenninckx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18175654051369352, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:01:23", "owner": "andrx.tk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083702912026674, "text": "I prefer it when we had orange brainrt", "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:51:54", "owner": "matt_airbussy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910566487122031, "text": "Britain literally makes fun illegal", "created_at": "2025-12-09T08:09:25", "owner": "lemonmazter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918899254221626, "text": "Lock him up for hurty words I say", "created_at": "2025-12-09T00:01:58", "owner": "benjaminleake", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383515513195943, "text": "@georgestandley7 is this you?", "created_at": "2025-12-08T20:17:33", "owner": "r1ya08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088021186798158, "text": "Meme so goated that even the PM of the country can't fall back", "created_at": "2025-12-08T15:24:52", "owner": "vivek4realll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903557104167521, "text": "All those white kids he's trying desperately to replace with mooslims and Africans", "created_at": "2025-12-08T01:28:41", "owner": "el_keilo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083138258109874, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-07T21:41:26", "owner": "fahed_iraqi_229", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049298504422804, "text": "whyd they ban it \"no fun allowed\" type shi fr", "created_at": "2025-12-07T06:50:13", "owner": "cr1mson_pyr3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975717723958662, "text": "Kier Starmer is going to be the best PM the UK will ever have in the 21st century im afraid.", "created_at": "2025-12-07T03:25:56", "owner": "thealexpride", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105649714632450, "text": "why is this generation retarded", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:29:39", "owner": "tamzzzj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045373970703562, "text": "Nm", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:08:44", "owner": "joyyongtay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086174423059682, "text": "oh this must be what I'm missing for not breeding.Aaw such a shame,silly me!", "created_at": "2025-12-06T14:03:01", "owner": "nori_shiro_neko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951120828922070, "text": "Wait until they hear about 9/11 and install instagram 💀💀💀", "created_at": "2025-12-06T14:01:10", "owner": "shafraz.666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114916729517063, "text": "what like in them is their British pronunciation😀", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:42:53", "owner": "mahno_138", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18416059861142562, "text": "Anything but growth", "created_at": "2025-12-06T01:03:59", "owner": "anshtomarpoetries", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104833603726619, "text": "Why are Brits such miserable creatures", "created_at": "2025-12-05T21:55:27", "owner": "theonewhowil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101914681738522, "text": "He: Six seven, everyone other: Siix seeeeveen", "created_at": "2025-12-05T20:37:11", "owner": "feliprob", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078722144323815, "text": "6to 7 percent approval rating", "created_at": "2025-12-05T15:46:53", "owner": "aale.mulhim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157631551405618, "text": "The seats which are given to Labour 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:46:33", "owner": "alexfreijo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063579893536745, "text": "67", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:36:09", "owner": "kaythaya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092748544728766, "text": "67", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:36:07", "owner": "kaythaya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930522925140007, "text": "67", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:36:06", "owner": "kaythaya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087615706952776, "text": "Six seven", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:36:03", "owner": "kaythaya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889069036264846, "text": "Sorry what’s this 67 thing. Honest question", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:59:39", "owner": "melb_chokhra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933775030128926, "text": "“Oh well I could have them arrested?”", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:07:11", "owner": "jake.szetela", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091687297930855, "text": "89", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:55:54", "owner": "philip.gaumann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861368356542415, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:23:25", "owner": "the.nuber.e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842046286642512, "text": "THANK GOD ITS NOT 6-9", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:51:51", "owner": "aliconcorde001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976354980958862, "text": "Politicians are pathological liars, even when it comes to 67 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:36:25", "owner": "olegpetrovic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18534461545006996, "text": "🤡", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:45:24", "owner": "iaks98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18399961048127909, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T14:22:23", "owner": "hassanbutt2.3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18538735657020920, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T14:21:52", "owner": "hassanbutt2.3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18310473997269537, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T14:21:23", "owner": "hassanbutt2.3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937607845101207, "text": "😟", "created_at": "2025-12-04T14:18:11", "owner": "steveniitanna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085587782009218, "text": "There's a 5yr old with a hijab on lmao UK is gone", "created_at": "2025-12-04T09:07:56", "owner": "anandmadz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936838117102538, "text": "Mr. Kid Starver shouldn’t be around children", "created_at": "2025-12-04T08:50:33", "owner": "norsgulp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18411635908188880, "text": "Haha", "created_at": "2025-12-04T00:43:46", "owner": "jasmeet1709", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099750352744734, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T00:39:05", "owner": "firenxs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899759455341269, "text": "Brain rot doing it's job. None of these children should have access to memes like that", "created_at": "2025-12-03T23:16:54", "owner": "adrienetch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050029391678415, "text": "What kind of shitty school bans 6-7?", "created_at": "2025-12-03T19:48:20", "owner": "ggc_friend", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866476264508742, "text": "Everytime my pupils say \"67,67\" I sing the Song \"74-75\" The Connells", "created_at": "2025-12-03T19:19:30", "owner": "mammouth_creek_addict", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877122781444788, "text": "What’s the prob with letting kids be kids.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:18:19", "owner": "50percentb34k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872057008466785, "text": "I don't get it", "created_at": "2025-12-03T16:47:54", "owner": "an.thony.fr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974996883950150, "text": "Lier", "created_at": "2025-12-03T16:37:22", "owner": "viralquickget", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18203495698318410, "text": "Holy 🌽-ball", "created_at": "2025-12-03T12:54:00", "owner": "brandonk434", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955378171013180, "text": "My ancestors would be happy seeing what the British PMs have been reduced to.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T09:27:27", "owner": "ambitiousloser", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119565430542245, "text": "And still no one knows what it means", "created_at": "2025-12-03T08:35:10", "owner": "elpieavelon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101325142752913, "text": "The teacher dying inside", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:21:52", "owner": "jenna.leigh705", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065270429159399, "text": "I'm", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:56:57", "owner": "derschwurdesjosh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18169551337337916, "text": "Even the pm 🥀", "created_at": "2025-12-02T15:44:12", "owner": "carguyagnish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077275355235135, "text": "this is so chunc", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:20:30", "owner": "kennny_ng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18330884653212619, "text": "Honestly shameful", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:53:19", "owner": "djyeo3791", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18127492525503456, "text": "💀", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:17:24", "owner": "icecreamlemonade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184825417357820, "text": "Creeping sharia", "created_at": "2025-12-02T00:02:15", "owner": "aaronchriscohen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979521084785814, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:40:37", "owner": "elliott.peters0n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100573432706052, "text": "Getting into trouble for 6/7!? 😢", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:51:55", "owner": "stefankollasch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18323752726246536, "text": "Okay so that's the reason why Russia's absolutely cooking them", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:36:49", "owner": "aaron160910", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980255868782103, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:39:45", "owner": "ryanxzlee13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095607004687494, "text": "Well deserved ban", "created_at": "2025-12-01T11:44:29", "owner": "liberater3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091496380737822, "text": "What's so wrong about saying \"6 7\" ; neither here nor there. Zzzz", "created_at": "2025-12-01T10:52:31", "owner": "coughingbean", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976690131953600, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:36:25", "owner": "rollingelephant1205", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100360291772765, "text": "6 7", "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:01:46", "owner": "protatoch1p", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089006047784395, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:06:21", "owner": "jaydentsui69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540372643000789, "text": "Lwk chillest PM and funniest ❤️🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-30T21:43:51", "owner": "your_other_average_aviator", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950201898918558, "text": "It’s perfectly fine", "created_at": "2025-11-30T13:45:29", "owner": "jobyjoeltan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091500892930006, "text": "Oh you know shes screaming at them tomorrow", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:27:37", "owner": "jshwoosh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072942215583856, "text": "Bro unleashed a Plague on his way out but denied starting it 🥀💀", "created_at": "2025-11-30T09:55:49", "owner": "axmit.exe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084315875108200, "text": "rare starmer W", "created_at": "2025-11-30T09:41:07", "owner": "drqlight123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104702878579689, "text": "Wait !!! what is 6 7 means with the hand sign?!", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:47:24", "owner": "icyjulz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879434554427642, "text": "It’s like a virus", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:53:28", "owner": "esteban_guerra_080507", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066158027528263, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:45:44", "owner": "dmckm8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120655363539689, "text": "Hahha i didn't start it. 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:01:11", "owner": "wondering_sam_au", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893607310363483, "text": "Chilllll out lady", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:18:12", "owner": "cerissa.k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062997002441500, "text": "give me back my time", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:49:10", "owner": "s.h.i.v.28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077918116955822, "text": "This generation is fockin cooked", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:16:11", "owner": "abdallahmohammed5116", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087378380298111, "text": "Nine elevennnnn", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:08:07", "owner": "azrasuueda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18348992440207980, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:10:29", "owner": "69mil_naes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045773885468933, "text": "Huh?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:36:06", "owner": "mystic.alec", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031091948744319, "text": "Maybe the PM reduces the cool factor so much the kids don't want to do it now.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:20:55", "owner": "kayderl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851672152595541, "text": "Everyone's mad but I remember being in school and we had 6 months of just joking about the letter M", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:41:10", "owner": "chris.courts2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849843805566386, "text": "Check out this UNBLOCKED GAMES website FOR SCHOOL(GUARANTEED iPad/Chromebook/Mac/etc): https://gras2027.com", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:14:25", "owner": "rshar27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108714262627952, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:58:42", "owner": "yoshy8686", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099338434753465, "text": "So if you hate the kids just get them to count to ten? Sounds like education failure.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:52:45", "owner": "eysic88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295634914285034, "text": "Banned lol UK can't be real dawg", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:40:06", "owner": "gianmanesis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068866052605980, "text": "Can’t even control a few 6 year olds hahaha", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:27:41", "owner": "emmahes_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062387675565257, "text": "What does it mean?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:38:42", "owner": "riche.summers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856170118569194, "text": "Banning trends? Schooling is just training to accept authoritarianism in the workplace. Stupidity.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:02:46", "owner": "tommyandstuff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071400863366065, "text": "@nabilaakhann @alimerchxnt", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:41:10", "owner": "taqikazimissj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979905369948587, "text": "So then what happens in Pre-K and Kinder when students are learning to count … do you just go 1,2,3,4,5,8,9? Or what if students are doing a math problem and the answer is legitimately 67? 😒🤦🏻‍♀️😒", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:21:58", "owner": "sassy.lil.stephi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977246553944309, "text": "Get the flamethrower", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:31:09", "owner": "harrizon.db", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030082637754316, "text": "Nonce", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:00:49", "owner": "that_red_m3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081781928033243, "text": "I’d love to actually laugh at this but the PM of the UK is so unlikable that I wish they’d give him a combined dentition of what all of those kids would have had for this", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:21:44", "owner": "sulkyshoom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964254778002937, "text": "Stupid little fucks 🤦🏻‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:09:27", "owner": "machu83", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075364976240942, "text": "Such a troll move. Kids are trying to sneak one in. 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:58:20", "owner": "bintangn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076056311264705, "text": "Lia.r", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:10:16", "owner": "anasotropy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064417823173076, "text": "I hate this man but c’mon, just let him joke around with some kids", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:00:35", "owner": "aarav.tailor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072932483592393, "text": "What's a 6-7?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:07:00", "owner": "tsehongling", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544134292045865, "text": "For all people getting offended cause it comes from a rapper, just fo remind you that Monica from.friends said it in one of the chapters... in the 90s. So lets turn the page haha", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:44:27", "owner": "caroarredondoq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109192021620178, "text": "Did he get detention for that?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:28:14", "owner": "jeff_tolley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047798822694175, "text": "To hijab, 👏🏽🤲🏽☝🏽.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:58:18", "owner": "e1nsect", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969133662976254, "text": "Communism is scary", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:34:57", "owner": "joshdipietro2001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077481577967026, "text": "I don’t like him but he didn’t know. It was cute I don’t blame him", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:30:13", "owner": "jame_higginwigginjigginbotham", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085111787003738, "text": "Nobody schools you faster than a primary school teacher", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:21:51", "owner": "sarmadkhan_sk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051147884358550, "text": "So European to \"ban\" kids from doing this. Believe me its so stupid. But really banning it? Dumb continent", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:01:04", "owner": "erik.vanderzwart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921767695056201, "text": "wtf am I looking at 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:43:48", "owner": "shxnezoid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086002672964576, "text": "UK PM just trying hard not to be an unc", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:31:20", "owner": "very._.xuan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059961185260598, "text": "Didn’t they ban saying Tate in schools too lmao", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:01:29", "owner": "user19361946128", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367876870086582, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:49:19", "owner": "luca2864_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099910186702485, "text": "The principal needs to lighten up.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:50:51", "owner": "thegirl19811", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026089025584584, "text": "Ban something = people will do it. Allow it to happen = people will get tired of doing it", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:06:20", "owner": "alvaroelpob", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18429655786108470, "text": "You get in trouble for saying bloody anything in England don’t you", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:01:33", "owner": "mr_mamagravity", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097126525849369, "text": "Why do they get into trouble for saying 6 7 ???? Not a school I’d want my children near with a jobsworth like her lurking around the place.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:40:12", "owner": "dcn1000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927909445154267, "text": "Those kids will always remember that day. Lovely scene.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:23:43", "owner": "juan_1773", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18151681015419206, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:52:01", "owner": "zvynahmvd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083314778074467, "text": "That girl was the mastermind", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:38:00", "owner": "samwichreal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545877076057585, "text": "What does it mean?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:44:33", "owner": "aboodabusaleek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111864316597509, "text": "He has zero awareness.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:28:33", "owner": "k_lor2000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847777975609422, "text": "Moron end of", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:06:57", "owner": "sprockett1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954341661901264, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:41:17", "owner": "maroua.lamiri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100517824706367, "text": "Why is this guy not in prison???", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:34:13", "owner": "euro_advntur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081582926514593, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:44:40", "owner": "tara.ahmad.520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986818998913418, "text": "In my day there was 7734.  And don’t forget 80085 (which the boys always laughed about.  Girls hated it).", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:07:13", "owner": "cynthiacmintz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953904160040161, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:00:15", "owner": "pream_krishna01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540096328040209, "text": "Why is it shot like the office?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:21:13", "owner": "eehmadd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124966801460412, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:52:37", "owner": "abbasimtiaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085444303973294, "text": "How many siblings they can all have now so mummy can reap the rewards 💰", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:29:13", "owner": "yess_cub", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108913588545871, "text": "She must be very brave to say that to the prime minister,  she was right but i would be very nervous in that dituation and wouldn't want to contradict him.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:28:29", "owner": "hayarwoy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047130212446783, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:11:01", "owner": "chromatictoyz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143669020448770, "text": "Haha you are banned and jail time", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:59:31", "owner": "peytonmfo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060418331258776, "text": "What a ballbag.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:34:47", "owner": "peel4538", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["67", "keirstarmer", "uk", "britain", "straitstimes"]},
{"media_id": 3776119999803451009, "shortcode": "DRneSIRiGaB", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRneSIRiGaB/", "taken_at": "2025-11-28T22:23:24", "caption": "英王查理斯三世及王后在獲悉大埔宏福苑發生嚴重火災後，對事件造成的重大傷亡深感悲痛。英國皇室於英國當地傍晚大概九時左右發出正式聲明，向香港市民表達深切關懷與慰問。\n\n國王在署名「Charles R」的聲明中表示，他與王后「深感悲痛」，並向所有失去至親的人致以誠摯慰問，同時關心仍處於震驚、悲痛與不安之中的居民。\n\n國王讚揚了前線急救人員的「非凡勇氣」，亦肯定社區居民在災難中彼此扶持、伸出援手的「堅毅精神」。他指出，在如此駭人悲劇面前，人與人之間的互相支持能帶來力量，而香港市民展現出的勇敢正是這份力量的體現。\n\n他在聲明最後表示：「所有失去寶貴生命的家庭與摯愛，以及全香港市民，都會一直在我們的心中與祈禱之中。」\n\n聲明發出後，大批港人在皇室官方社交媒體留言表達感激，有市民寫道，他們感謝陛下仍將香港放在心上，並表示陛下的慰問在這段艱難時期帶來了很大的安慰。他們亦回憶起昔日香港的美好時光，雖然香港已不再如從前，但知道陛下仍關心，對他們而言意義重大。\n\n皇家聲明全文（中文翻譯）\n「我與太太得悉大埔發生嚴重火災的消息後，深感悲痛，並為香港市民在此悲慘時刻所面對的打擊深感難過。我們由衷地向所有失去至親的人，以及此刻活在震驚與惶恐中的人們致以最深切的慰問。\n我們得知急救人員展現出非凡的勇氣，亦見到無數市民彼此扶持、伸出援手幫助社區。在面對如此沉痛的悲劇時，人們往往能從互相支持中找到力量，而我們在香港此刻的勇敢與堅毅中，看到了這份力量。\n對於所有在今次事故中失去親人、生活受到嚴重影響的市民，我們致上深切的同情與關懷。那些失去寶貴生命的家庭與摯愛，以及香港的市民，都會一直在我們的心中與祈禱之中。\n查理斯R」", "owner_username": "seedenjoy", "owner_id": "61724457040", "likes": 2490, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphSidecar", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0128_DRneSIRiGaB\\DRneSIRiGaB_20251128_222324_1.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0128_DRneSIRiGaB\\DRneSIRiGaB_20251128_222324_2.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": "17929325253017003", "text": "唔再係殖民地 人地關心香港人同知道香港人點樣互相扶持既程度仲多過比卡超🙃", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:00:25", "owner": "callmewingkibb", "likes": 55}, {"id": "18069146531371754", "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-12-04T11:41:33", "owner": "neo.chow.96", "likes": 1}, {"id": "18082489303887983", "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:46:33", "owner": "chingszeyeung", "likes": 2}, {"id": "17914838682233892", "text": "天佑吾皇", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:41:41", "owner": "joegalahadchurchill", "likes": 17}, {"id": "18068073947615325", "text": "Charlie此舉很暖心，真係唔怪得知好多人仍然留戀殖民時期的風光日子。當年有民主，有言論自由，有好官，有好體制.......唉! 無比較無傷害😢如果可以返回 1997年時代，那就好啦😍", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:12:42", "owner": "ng.shara", "likes": 5}, {"id": "18036375497725164", "text": "謝謝查理國王🫶🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:34:11", "owner": "summerkasy", "likes": 12}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3773574454870763754, "shortcode": "DRebfk0D2jq", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRebfk0D2jq/", "taken_at": "2025-11-25T10:09:04", "caption": "No more assignment dues hehe", "owner_username": "ellennnnn___", "owner_id": "13443256796", "likes": 81096, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0129_DRebfk0D2jq\\DRebfk0D2jq_20251125_100904.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18074439245246439, "text": "Why u so happy, life only gets harder", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:18:41", "owner": "_omar.155", "likes": 410}, {"id": 17914631487236432, "text": "毕业快乐 最美的宝宝❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:08:13", "owner": "joeychocz", "likes": 137}, {"id": 18032571236531653, "text": "Bb毕业快乐❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:04:45", "owner": "_liu.mi_", "likes": 23}, {"id": 18494719780077971, "text": "畢業快樂❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:29:36", "owner": "xxaiyzz16", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17854885176529670, "text": "毕业快乐，恭喜", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:51:37", "owner": "ken_peh", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17857389897503980, "text": "毕业快乐！！！", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:14:51", "owner": "slew_08", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18078731009517312, "text": "Congratulations!!", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:15:37", "owner": "auraxon", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17951397579028402, "text": "congratssss bb！", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:30:50", "owner": "angelyynn_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063934946541196, "text": "Congratss ellenn ❤️👩🏻‍🎓🍾", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:56:28", "owner": "mathee_nuhansi", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18113988694583650, "text": "Gotta make sure the hat looks right", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:25:59", "owner": "ahherherher", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18088634087302361, "text": "Congrats! 🎉🎉🎉", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:13:45", "owner": "whyso5eriou5", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18397759792121399, "text": "You’re the best !❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:30:13", "owner": "spicygracek", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18105744037727467, "text": "Hi lol", "created_at": "2025-11-26T08:36:31", "owner": "kinglebronlebone", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18062272067215684, "text": "Congrats!! 🎉👏", "created_at": "2025-12-02T08:56:46", "owner": "monashmalaysia", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18046916621455550, "text": "Congratulation ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:20:35", "owner": "li_imm", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18120296563477172, "text": "@ellennnnn___ Happy Graduation ❤️❤️💐💐🌹🌹😘😘🩸🩸❤️‍🔥❤️‍🔥😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-26T05:26:03", "owner": "ahboy_leechinleong75", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17852255604590746, "text": "Congratulation 👏🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:42:45", "owner": "gustianhawwari", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064365836177917, "text": "You are adorable ❤️❤️❤️ congratulation for your graduation ❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T08:26:43", "owner": "baro66778", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17979804527930656, "text": "First congrats 🍾🎊🎉🥳\nSecond, where is this hall ??\nIs it at Monash university ??", "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:08:42", "owner": "oliverli97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868516360411073, "text": "@renew__ace 又來一個 我沒了", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:35:27", "owner": "9swilly7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18552254092004327, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:17:31", "owner": "ibrahimsids", "likes": 248}, {"id": 18078863330166314, "text": "@jinhsun", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:10:19", "owner": "kokwei_lee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088003738795911, "text": "Actually the thing is I’m also graduated from the med school as a doctor but my father didn’t even completed his high school. But he’s filthy rich n I’m dead broke😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T19:15:31", "owner": "fallon_c_adler", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17970919748824434, "text": "🎉🎉🎉", "created_at": "2025-12-13T13:27:46", "owner": "cheungchikwongthomas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085422893102735, "text": "My dream uni", "created_at": "2025-12-13T11:30:44", "owner": "rizavaelion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18334288243213361, "text": "Nice..", "created_at": "2025-12-12T16:30:59", "owner": "rezanasiri560g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061202912553487, "text": "ตามหา CEO รายได้เกิน 1.8 ล้าน/ปี อยากมี Wealth Protection ขั้นต่ำปีละ 100 ล้าน ฟรี บันทึกเป็นค่าใช้จ่ายบริษัทได้ ขอท่านที่มีสุขภาพดี สนใจรับรายละเอียดทักแชทครับ 😊🕌", "created_at": "2025-12-12T13:49:30", "owner": "boomphakorn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114145084597148, "text": "Congratulations to you for your success 🤝 life begins from here and i wishes you all the best and best of luck in whatever you do.Stay safe and most importantly stay healthy and be happy always 😊 May God bless you in everything 🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-12-12T02:05:26", "owner": "jasonwong7423", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079417015961028, "text": "Amazing", "created_at": "2025-12-12T01:48:19", "owner": "thoeun1787", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973913004797803, "text": "毕业快乐！！！！好自由好美🎉", "created_at": "2025-12-11T10:18:32", "owner": "okayessay_tutor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903189562304051, "text": "🎉👏", "created_at": "2025-12-11T08:08:37", "owner": "infinityaura12042003", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995408475852636, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-09T18:30:13", "owner": "dionerawan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18424042459114468, "text": "What did you learn from university?😍", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:07:16", "owner": "hamid03932", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856359610526382, "text": "😍👏🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:33:57", "owner": "rtprualthanpuia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055564274324810, "text": "@xiaoxiaohanxl", "created_at": "2025-12-08T11:46:01", "owner": "lhydig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073652738038738, "text": "😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-12-08T09:19:04", "owner": "ahmed_ukassignment_making", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136625026471871, "text": "❤️🎉", "created_at": "2025-12-08T04:52:57", "owner": "ng_wie_hok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086561798073975, "text": "❤️❤️❤️👏", "created_at": "2025-12-07T13:24:39", "owner": "jerrysamillano2023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18386546845177654, "text": "Congratulations 🥳", "created_at": "2025-12-07T08:59:23", "owner": "tunlinaung.tla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062216180229847, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:27:45", "owner": "xxluke1986xx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095930977883098, "text": "Congratulations on your graduation, Ellen. I hope you keep smiling", "created_at": "2025-12-06T08:09:08", "owner": "counkiee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100737763695309, "text": "congratulations", "created_at": "2025-12-06T07:00:28", "owner": "jimmyteoh011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031741706547303, "text": "❤️❤️😍❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-06T05:33:10", "owner": "paulo.kato.712", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068672699380633, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-05T22:13:34", "owner": "jessylim8778", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099005308840097, "text": "Congratulations you have an Amazing life a head of you, Lots of Achievements behind you but so Many More to be just a Head!!!", "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:55:57", "owner": "e63_pilot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088574029983392, "text": "congratulations👍👍👍", "created_at": "2025-12-05T18:25:23", "owner": "baiyan1102", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917148367237200, "text": "🎉🎉🎉🎉", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:37:40", "owner": "yiiviiy._.tum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958587300886458, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:08:49", "owner": "xueli9915", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105734902678594, "text": "Congratulations 👏👏🎉🎉❤️❤️🤗🤗", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:23:07", "owner": "van_86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933213348997396, "text": "\"Heres your paper for remembering some lies we told you\"", "created_at": "2025-12-04T02:43:12", "owner": "mark.vasquez___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101959822666942, "text": "❤️❤️❤️越来越好", "created_at": "2025-12-03T14:41:21", "owner": "kokchong76", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937800700099204, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:52:41", "owner": "philips_hartawijaya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083309324088460, "text": "Congrat🎉❤️🔥😍", "created_at": "2025-12-03T00:18:44", "owner": "alamtropisgarden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084581510088590, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏👏👏congratulatio