": "Congratulations 🎉", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:09:11", "owner": "lev_e14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072856214348918, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:45:26", "owner": "t136995191", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050266055676997, "text": "又美又聪明怎样做到的🥴", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:41:11", "owner": "imvixtrum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885139393287714, "text": "Congratulations 🎉👏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:55:59", "owner": "stussyk1ng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915328405238301, "text": "Congratsss ellenn. 👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:07:29", "owner": "debajyoti146", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074313233260666, "text": "Congratulation 👏👏🎉🎉👏👏😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:59:44", "owner": "gu_ton_5621", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941716741086157, "text": "毕业快乐！", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:42:30", "owner": "muyichang25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545234908031565, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:40:09", "owner": "ravindra_b_12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019040618790413, "text": "Banker", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:06:33", "owner": "ummmtang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112185721588983, "text": "Congrats 🥂 ❤️🔥❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:52:14", "owner": "11.11_o_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081245552117260, "text": "@_a.du.du_", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:54:38", "owner": "phgw.lin_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917707882211142, "text": "恭喜！大女主降临", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:44:52", "owner": "tiffany_jessy9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927646237155563, "text": "YAAMPUN IMPIANN AKUU PKE TOGA HUHU🥺✨🤍", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:52:59", "owner": "chlsea.natthalie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183346786358637, "text": "❤️❤️😍", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:53:52", "owner": "tang184200", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100954420690555, "text": "🎉🎉🎉恭喜了🎉🎉🎉", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:40:31", "owner": "mingye_888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899849290324448, "text": "🎉🎉🎉👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:13:06", "owner": "ricardo_b._manurung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087881479955517, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:09:08", "owner": "samlucky31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844879192603683, "text": "Congratulations ♥️🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:23:38", "owner": "rakib_hasan_68", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18204816643316146, "text": "毕业快乐啊姐姐", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:54:59", "owner": "mijanurjaman710", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070189430589426, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:20:13", "owner": "xandro399", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056113973646086, "text": "@ellennnnn___ 😘😘😍🥰😃", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:17:55", "owner": "dinsky_art", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154376167413714, "text": "Time to pay off that student debt🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:52:39", "owner": "tien_le_qung500", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891761854373101, "text": "🎓👏🤍⚘️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:00:47", "owner": "ntd_kul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18491354227076529, "text": "축하합니다. 앞으로도 계속 성공하시길 바랍니다. 가족들이 당신을 자랑스러워할 테니까요.😁", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:00:02", "owner": "aldrin.i.t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085306406062945, "text": "Congratulations ❤️❤️❤️❤️🎉🎉🎉🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:57:10", "owner": "tines408", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984984471867889, "text": "😢 Free me bro", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:09:41", "owner": "michaaaaaaaaaaaaael", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18546532198022969, "text": "❤️.. Congrats..", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:48:43", "owner": "ngsp168", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093914005893389, "text": "🥲👏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:48:21", "owner": "skaabawsiiphaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18291840139277582, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:30:32", "owner": "__.alumnii.__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115342540572193, "text": "So beautiful", "created_at": "2025-11-26T13:39:40", "owner": "eric199261", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865392049509135, "text": "恭喜🎉！", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:52:50", "owner": "zwl_05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083928527475065, "text": "I wish our college will be celebrating a graduation ceremony like this 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:52:45", "owner": "jagiyaaa_bae69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914668309237305, "text": "畢業快樂❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:28:56", "owner": "i.am.ryder.chiu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090354955936441, "text": "原来真的是你", "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:58:41", "owner": "imhojm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872201644462997, "text": "pretty and smart girlll🍀🌷", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:26:53", "owner": "firdahusnaa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853421923582873, "text": "No assignment dues, yeah! But ready to work up 7am daily weekdays! ❤️🙌🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:14:51", "owner": "clementt.f", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089778577748786, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T09:08:45", "owner": "yelinsoe9997", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18399539110123122, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T08:58:35", "owner": "3tha_____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001981478681805, "text": "哇，毕业快乐，亲爱的🎓❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T08:55:09", "owner": "tzyriii756", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068439920080651, "text": "可以", "created_at": "2025-11-26T08:48:49", "owner": "junyi3905", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159470620396749, "text": "Congratulations 🙌🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-26T08:02:57", "owner": "augmalaysia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057140222307279, "text": "毕业快乐yah🎓🎉🎉", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:51:54", "owner": "atpx.yan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053108153648272, "text": "Damn 11:59 pm due dates is too relate lol", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:59:00", "owner": "davidarmandosaragih", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112700698587856, "text": "畢業快樂，恭喜妳❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:20:26", "owner": "angus.cheung.921", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855883891566767, "text": "Great", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:15:46", "owner": "world_royalboy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899542819334927, "text": "Happy Graduation, beautiful Ellen! Life will never become harder, it’s just you're stepping into beginning of a new chapter with new challenges 🔥.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:04:37", "owner": "johnuk.my", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094001947