sh6", "likes": 174}, {"id": 18007856300818418, "text": "I love her", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:06:09", "owner": "cobie.13", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18078855679935893, "text": "she's a little bit too good at this", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:57:15", "owner": "eeinenkel", "likes": 883}, {"id": 18296419054259325, "text": "META was acronym 😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:53:06", "owner": "neet_warrior_2026_", "likes": 107}, {"id": 18057672518303818, "text": "Looking for group —->", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:07:46", "owner": "kimzagramza", "likes": 141}, {"id": 18103074304672680, "text": "why is she holding monster", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:38:18", "owner": "partsvaniagio", "likes": 19}, {"id": 18077483902968026, "text": "Anyone commenting on her voice (also wtf do u care) she’s said before people bullied her for talking too quietly also while streaming she needed to have a louder voice, so now she is just use to purposefully straining her voice speaking in a more forceful version of how it normally is. It’s super sad. She’s made peace with it but it still sucks she has to live like that in my opinion.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:17:22", "owner": "imsoblushing", "likes": 150}, {"id": 18420622075116283, "text": "lol i though pve was player vs everyone lmaooooo lmaoooo", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:25:08", "owner": "lazycasper225", "likes": 47}, {"id": 17956443392892097, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:00:03", "owner": "daily.trunks.coming", "likes": 44}, {"id": 18546712216016753, "text": "Not me saying Age of Empire for AoE", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:45:57", "owner": "piehush", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18295068487279335, "text": "and hp is short for hitpoints", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:54:16", "owner": "evansuckedatlife", "likes": 73}, {"id": 18079278764158061, "text": "Meta is not an acronym🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:49:32", "owner": "riotvv1020", "likes": 85}, {"id": 18101903983665484, "text": "meta is derived from the greek character and originated from ttrpg communities who coined the term “metagame” meaning, beyond the game", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:54:01", "owner": "evansuckedatlife", "likes": 56}, {"id": 17866706406437632, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T15:58:08", "owner": "t1rami5u_", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18141056152454916, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:57:25", "owner": "tapunioasis", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18083081591031853, "text": "Meta is not an acronym", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:53:18", "owner": "paul_bl_", "likes": 47}, {"id": 17932453404121000, "text": "@livecleo I wonder how many the pro gamer will get…", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:52:24", "owner": "teramax1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075369070989530, "text": "\"AOE\" me: age of empires 🗿", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:54:56", "owner": "frvnnie.bvbygirl", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18095012134875971, "text": "most annoying tomboy voice in twitch", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:23:39", "owner": "tbarzej", "likes": 220}, {"id": 18411589774186098, "text": "Meta isnt an acronym, its just a mnemonic", "created_at": "2025-12-04T05:17:21", "owner": "cynthia139_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18413578822139271, "text": "LAN is not exactly a gaming acronym...", "created_at": "2025-12-12T02:57:58", "owner": "urloalcielo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18303476914264611, "text": "I didnt know META means that 😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:04:40", "owner": "duriica", "likes": 30391}, {"id": 18103609873710072, "text": "She be saying everything and acting like she is just born", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:56:06", "owner": "veer_thor19", "likes": 13961}, {"id": 17877475725350367, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:00:06", "owner": "daily.trunks.coming", "likes": 44}, {"id": 18154681492412217, "text": "I thought meta was just its own definition no?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:25:27", "owner": "tax.hole", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18104865079725434, "text": "F2p --> Forced 2 pay", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:05:24", "owner": "scara.ass", "likes": 19}, {"id": 18106087441632975, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T17:40:31", "owner": "niran.og.x", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18066129302627701, "text": "Holy unemployed 🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:11:12", "owner": "ammaarraza705", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18080534819469222, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T14:57:23", "owner": "jaslovestheeagles", "likes": 20}, {"id": 18330814117213936, "text": "ngl that was impressive… who would’ve thought that she knew all of these. Tbf I also didnt know meta was an acronym 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:29:11", "owner": "_anubiis", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18386267104177877, "text": "cc = clan castle but yall arent ready to accept that", "created_at": "2025-12-11T03:52:23", "owner": "stevenququ", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17914947828230876, "text": "… DLC???? (stays dont leave me hanging 😭)", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:37:42", "owner": "urfavs.bella3", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18505513231069082, "text": "You are OPd in the AOE😍 I’m about to use this on my friend’s stream…I don’t game😂😂😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:08:55", "owner": "cho_c_key", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18045690698481107, "text": "CC - Chronocrystall", "created_at": "2025-12-04T10:42:30", "owner": "boswitonose", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18093669676729775, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:02:21", "owner": "deeplyconfusedman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049396508399195, "text": "I thought it was called Meta after Meta Knight in Smash Bros Brawl 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:44:14", "owner": "yuiwrong", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17866248135432267, "text": "cc ---> copy crosshair", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:43:11", "owner": "ihakux", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18076017938225514, "text": "Is that jaydenAnimations?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:58:09", "owner": "itz.noahlicious", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17856803400563422, "text": "What means lmao", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:12:23", "owner": "ol1mjonov818", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17863212330455838, "text": "Are you telling me the meta of gaming doesn't come from the greek sufixe?! That would make some sens", "created_at": "2025-12-01T21:48:50", "owner": "xgzavje", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17890192620386065, "text": "meta is NOT an acronym it existed before it was turned into one", "created_at": "2025-12-03T07:04:12", "owner": "aid4nroxks", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18104480470584909, "text": "Cc Goku", "created_at": "2025-12-04T08:56:10", "owner": "amaribryant55", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18172565131369733, "text": "I dont know any of those words", "created_at": "2025-12-04T01:08:10", "owner": "thyalex02", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085434227062029, "text": "This Is the type of girl that i like 😍🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-04T10:21:02", "owner": "suzuya_303", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17892188973244520, "text": "Isn’t meta just meta", "created_at": "2025-12-04T10:11:56", "owner": "i_love_hyuna_from_alnst", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17999712017692117, "text": "Its hit points not health points", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:33:59", "owner": "m3tal.3420", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18099774079745537, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T14:10:14", "owner": "smichelle438", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085351502488960, "text": "HIT points", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:21:28", "owner": "n3wsk1n", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18075286093997973, "text": "Isnt dlc delayed launch content?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:54:23", "owner": "smtgnotknow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943633807080286, "text": "🙌🙌🙌🔥🙌🏾🙌🏼😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:54:10", "owner": "ferjvba", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17914137378246381, "text": "I love her sm", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:10:19", "owner": "sophia.russillo", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18116211778497343, "text": "Most Effective Tactic ALWAYS", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:19:33", "owner": "jozefsawan", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18072586799035702, "text": "Wats the @", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:14:42", "owner": "eduardo.ddsux", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18096512689879203, "text": "To me META = OVERRATED TIKTOK ADVICE", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:15:41", "owner": "ivinnayayoesel", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18137324920461599, "text": "Also BETA is an acronym.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:29:56", "owner": "nohealingpotion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061915811228496, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T12:25:23", "owner": "imboredofmyoldusername29", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17973055589808016, "text": "@faiz_beatbox bro knows it all", "created_at": "2025-11-29T20:22:33", "owner": "shbaz_n", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088258033785088, "text": "Local area network", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:35:17", "owner": "localareanetwork2401", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18017817089795101, "text": "NPC is actually Non-Playable Character", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:38:13", "owner": "elsify_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18047076182454558, "text": "Did you fucking censor the word kill", "created_at": "2025-11-30T09:09:10", "owner": "j_bak0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17994610676895992, "text": "didnt kda mean kill death avg or i knew it wrong this whole time?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:25:47", "owner": "7.stfn_", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18073161008350807, "text": "Jaiden!?😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:00:06", "owner": "rickycy2012", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18104589382649130, "text": "i always think PvE was 'Player versus Enemy'😆", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:54:56", "owner": "nukomorijin", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17941832499086961, "text": "TBTIOTLA (The but tickler is on the loose again)", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:38:43", "owner": "stap_alex", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17997122747752016, "text": "Last one isnt true, it came from meta knight in smash brawl", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:14:35", "owner": "dcha.e", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18045637214480482, "text": "@fernando_herrerajr356 pve games are my jam I think", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:50:44", "owner": "danielleeeperezz", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17980222562935877, "text": "GG?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:41:01", "owner": "pandhu.21", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17892993570364867, "text": "Glhf? Never heard of that one",