: 0}, {"id": 17932387473134528, "text": "Meanwhile some indonesia kids: Lol = Tolol 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-11T23:23:19", "owner": "last_h713", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126412390519556, "text": "Meta is in meta me huevos into Boca", "created_at": "2025-12-11T22:15:01", "owner": "omer_schwartz_raba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113725144590472, "text": "Meta knight", "created_at": "2025-12-11T20:23:28", "owner": "leehassocials", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998424978704703, "text": "Whats shes doing on Red bull? Red bull fell off", "created_at": "2025-12-11T16:29:47", "owner": "jawad._.sw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973175787814055, "text": "Why her voice squeak so much on like every damn word", "created_at": "2025-12-11T11:48:32", "owner": "lil_derrrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063793862560911, "text": "Lame ass nga", "created_at": "2025-12-11T10:59:46", "owner": "teaka_carr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929911003155538, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T06:25:06", "owner": "crazy_ortiz713", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065945411410691, "text": "P2W ?", "created_at": "2025-12-11T06:05:17", "owner": "uaemirates", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075632660590190, "text": "Meta is not an accronym 👍", "created_at": "2025-12-11T02:38:03", "owner": "tmy9525", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870569350474149, "text": "Shes so dumb", "created_at": "2025-12-11T02:28:05", "owner": "zepol_leon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087417392486185, "text": "Standing like a sped", "created_at": "2025-12-11T02:23:25", "owner": "gallianoangilo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089954305777378, "text": "The fact that she know all this means she has no life outside the bedroom 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T01:49:12", "owner": "obscura_phantasmagoria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114166162587165, "text": "I thought cc is carbon copy", "created_at": "2025-12-10T23:20:58", "owner": "_l.e.o.n_king", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978381441952963, "text": "TTK", "created_at": "2025-12-10T22:14:23", "owner": "fr_hexxzy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943376782087973, "text": "META is a word not an acronym 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T21:09:58", "owner": "richierichlabs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064724810396289, "text": "JNB - ja nie bed 💪", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:03:10", "owner": "john_y6943", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080527214163672, "text": "gc", "created_at": "2025-12-10T17:47:19", "owner": "muraa.les", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067078286416848, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T17:24:34", "owner": "kev4lifetime", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100107718753534, "text": "LFG IS LETS FUKINNN GO", "created_at": "2025-12-10T15:37:19", "owner": "tonifvzziii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884956438417778, "text": "Whaaat for real meta is an acronyme ? Shocked", "created_at": "2025-12-10T14:56:49", "owner": "pennywisebest", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090489812303284, "text": "pre  pre touch the grass", "created_at": "2025-12-10T14:39:32", "owner": "predecessor._hub", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876323887449390, "text": "What does kys mean?", "created_at": "2025-12-10T11:17:26", "owner": "easysihdiabiwbdofjixadlapdlxk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070523369619857, "text": "Bruh i didn't even know what was the long form of  AFK", "created_at": "2025-12-10T10:46:21", "owner": "offline.tv_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081743765139256, "text": "Meta is not an acronym lol", "created_at": "2025-12-10T08:57:20", "owner": "juansalmeronm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18189696688341824, "text": "LFG IS LETS FCKG GO! Right?😭🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-10T08:50:00", "owner": "aidyil_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028072811761346, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-10T08:16:04", "owner": "mtzslivegaming", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049956683680363, "text": "JAIDEN", "created_at": "2025-12-09T21:02:10", "owner": "ismailel.masry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18315907030218160, "text": "Why are people acting like these aren't the most basic gaming acronyms, hating just to hate (except for the first one I guess, I wouldn't have gotten that)", "created_at": "2025-12-09T19:28:59", "owner": "4th.harbinger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546355375062091, "text": "I tot PVE is Player Versus Enemy 😢", "created_at": "2025-12-09T19:22:07", "owner": "mahendra.epr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383969662148945, "text": "So close on the last oneee", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:51:15", "owner": "_r.i.s.c_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102786916682510, "text": "Wow this lady is ultra cute!!! 😮", "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:39:21", "owner": "dj_kronofogden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083469515039186, "text": "Some of these are computer science btw", "created_at": "2025-12-09T07:39:08", "owner": "seneth_3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084892163081762, "text": "Isnt lan local acess network?", "created_at": "2025-12-09T06:05:43", "owner": "mohammed_.saleem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322243435174210, "text": "what the fk , i think LFG is looking for group?😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T04:09:43", "owner": "ainun_iyl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164515387381125, "text": "How does the moderator have some of these question/answwers wrong?\n\nGotta go by OG rules.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T22:37:25", "owner": "andrewaebersold", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868337038498829, "text": "1. Meta did not start out originally as an acronym. 2. Wow her voice is masculine af doesnt match her face at all", "created_at": "2025-12-08T21:50:55", "owner": "jjf_12x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176877400364521, "text": "Meta is a Greek prefix meaning \"beyond.\" Metagame is the game beyond the game, where you look at matchups and statistics to choose the best load out or strategy", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:45:34", "owner": "regalpeasant", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966931041989745, "text": "Who knew meta was an acronym?", "created_at": "2025-12-08T19:31:29", "owner": "potentate.hussein", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120561004477076, "text": "What the difference between DOT and DPS?", "created_at": "2025-12-08T18:26:27", "owner": "reimundo.bungkang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072070406372740, "text": "Emi pogg", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:02:07", "owner": "xtsaxxt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893715910370555, "text": "The first one in the last two don’t exist. They’re not real many of the other ones were statistically wrong as well. Red Bull has no business talking about gamers. They have not been in the gaming industry as long as those acronyms have.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T15:38:41", "owner": "mastergamerjk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18373222537153900, "text": "I didn't know META was an acronym!?!", "created_at": "2025-12-08T15:04:35", "owner": "neejesus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845966464619868, "text": "gaybull", "created_at": "2025-12-08T08:47:20", "owner": "amir_hl33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937774554978978, "text": "😂Who tf made her famous? She below belowwwww mid and has the most annoying voice on the web😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T07:02:23", "owner": "tom.vanloon.587", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18350015575203691, "text": "As a simmer.. cc is custom content😭💔", "created_at": "2025-12-08T03:42:16", "owner": "reikoo.ko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964355673852665, "text": "Lfg … LETS FUCKING GO!?", "created_at": "2025-12-07T23:32:00", "owner": "divvygames", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086528216055326, "text": "Is she ok!? This has to be rage bait", "created_at": "2025-12-07T23:31:37", "owner": "divvygames", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904236499314339, "text": "Autism", "created_at": "2025-12-07T22:38:43", "owner": "eagjbvc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184098319349049, "text": "i’ve always referred to PvE as player vs everyone (else)", "created_at": "2025-12-07T19:27:39", "owner": "jackson.jeffries", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052094609340511, "text": "These aren't hard to know this is basic knowledge 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-07T19:06:49", "owner": "exotticsith420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847015423616549, "text": "This is lwk hurt surface knowledge", "created_at": "2025-12-07T18:38:30", "owner": "the999_ttt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865278736523631, "text": "Cc= CHANGE CHANNEL!", "created_at": "2025-12-07T15:47:53", "owner": "slimshaddy7eleven", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18181398688360676, "text": "Npc = não passa credibilidade", "created_at": "2025-12-06T18:19:28", "owner": "jao.thelegend", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892240915241986, "text": "Idk why they got the OTK ppl there but holy most boring redbull content", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:21:34", "owner": "max.deminne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18340397440230103, "text": "I said let's fucking go 🤣 forever a newb", "created_at": "2025-12-06T09:21:09", "owner": "phoebedubi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095052076854829, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T08:48:32", "owner": "rxdaughterr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144112975449127, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T01:27:03", "owner": "raynwood64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928880962153311, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T01:24:14", "owner": "im.in.your.shadow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072381599360692, "text": "WOW - World of Warcraft", "created_at": "2025-12-05T18:42:24", "owner": "fr4nkvg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095902528861469, "text": "Who is this creature?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T15:19:45", "owner": "ninjitso_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035709344721576, "text": "Lgpt", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:51:26", "owner": "ziadelbatreq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942110743093052, "text": "she fr old", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:48:56", "owner": "jinn._246", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969380724981191, "text": "LFG = Lets Fcking Go 🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:23:48", "owner": "izzudynn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088863601956663, "text": "Meta isnt most efective, is most uses way to play", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:52:36", "owner": "ztvito", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931822717140549, "text": "Real ones know DPS stands for @daddyphatsnaps", "created_at": "2025-12-05T08:05:47", "owner": "mapoflabyrinth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102728575683236, "text": "Non-playable character", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:11:42", "owner": "chanman007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096263980851535, "text": "Wrong KDA means kill death average bc it goes after your kills and deaths", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:45:24", "owner": "can_can_man_man", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084664226043408, "text": "What's MP mean?", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:23:33", "owner": "zbone69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861084271478778, "text": "Can’t stand this twat", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:23:28", "owner": "conleyandrew", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084000482037329, "text": "Its looking for group", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:17:20", "owner": "shedhouseideas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029562125757992, "text": "I always thought AOE was « Attack On Environment » 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:11:09", "owner": "irony_92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068969069615031, "text": "CC - Closed Captions", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:54:34", "owner": "ethannnigg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047427224460926, "text": "dps in vrchat:", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:34:04", "owner": "matteo_nava_h4kr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969970662825274, "text": "Meta isn’t an acronym, it’s a Greek word that’s older than videogames or the English language for that matter…", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:56:12", "owner": "tarraux999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18414949603187651, "text": "Same as Emiru, didn't know Meta was an acronym.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:12:55", "owner": "dinfevo.gx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293868601276135, "text": "CC= car community", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:09:24", "owner": "kimkimchitime", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067599323384828, "text": "33333", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:51:18", "owner": "flyliketime2x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868886938483837, "text": "B3qloub44n4nnn4n", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:51:09", "owner": "flyliketime2x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172110313328309, "text": "A '", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:45:36", "owner": "flyliketime2x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972287019812857, "text": "Need that jacket", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:29:51", "owner": "fvrale", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18195525721328262, "text": "LFG", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:02:43", "owner": "metal_mental_007", "likes": 0}, {"