 "nicoinepto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298185463276663, "text": "Legends and future greats", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:27:40", "owner": "archx_yeet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989787843911694, "text": "Aoe age of empires wdumm", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:50:09", "owner": "ailisoju", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072228260367228, "text": "I didn't know first and meta and dlc full form", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:34:31", "owner": "joebidenwts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976464261794068, "text": "Hey I'd give her the last one, it was close enough 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:16:34", "owner": "bludrgnbandit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857157022512729, "text": "Nigga does not go out", "created_at": "2025-12-02T15:21:39", "owner": "mtnkzybkrhn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971733027971623, "text": "Hit points", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:20:00", "owner": "mamradvino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141851602454408, "text": "As a gamer idk most of demlol", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:57:02", "owner": "aliabdalghanie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865389568522431, "text": "i was today years old when i learned META had a full form", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:44:38", "owner": "ethanc.34", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900693451181946, "text": "Wife material", "created_at": "2025-12-02T10:37:57", "owner": "deibiddo_furaho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992031462909599, "text": "Isnt cc chrono cristales? (DbL ptsd)", "created_at": "2025-12-02T09:20:25", "owner": "who_.is.kaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056334908650327, "text": "Meta is not an acronym. It's a backronym! Meta in game came from metagame actually", "created_at": "2025-12-02T09:08:02", "owner": "_siavasha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092215075731612, "text": "Its hitpoints newgen", "created_at": "2025-12-02T07:32:34", "owner": "ikerspiker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097437895829653, "text": "Wasn't pve 'player vs everyone'?", "created_at": "2025-12-02T07:25:18", "owner": "kinsey_6_kaye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099703936703482, "text": "HP-hit points.. Not health points", "created_at": "2025-12-02T07:24:40", "owner": "skrobisekk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070814162603162, "text": "Bro why are we making this… famous?", "created_at": "2025-12-02T07:13:30", "owner": "granados_aaron", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872681227387581, "text": "Meta is ABSOLUTELY a retronym. Its always been a shortening of metagame.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T05:28:45", "owner": "hrairoo53", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059859629253694, "text": "Those knees look like she kneel a lot.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T05:23:20", "owner": "athelite", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049153061407428, "text": "HP - hit point ☝️", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:26:57", "owner": "nik_sound", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094513666705093, "text": "Looking for group.\nHit points.\nMeta is not an acronym.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:12:50", "owner": "chennyeats", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030701405552003, "text": "I'm in 💕", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:28:17", "owner": "diegoherg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087829690799648, "text": "GG", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:22:03", "owner": "no_you_know_me", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098788894815386, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:18:38", "owner": "m_luqmnal_hkim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085471382097466, "text": "Liquified Fatural Gas", "created_at": "2025-12-02T00:37:45", "owner": "dzlizh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083540807157045, "text": "Cc Is 1000% crowd control... \"cc the healer\"", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:46:29", "owner": "aava25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064181177391423, "text": "She way smarter then me and I been playing games all day for a long time", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:42:22", "owner": "projectinspector3737", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081197363321410, "text": "valorant accent", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:26:55", "owner": "em0tionalboy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047816045439697, "text": "Cc , change Chanel moderfokeeeeeeeeeeeeer for life", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:46:38", "owner": "_carlos.fitzgerald", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034368950719331, "text": "CC is Clan Castle", "created_at": "2025-12-01T22:46:02", "owner": "nimmmichdochan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968149443986289, "text": "Gg wp", "created_at": "2025-12-01T21:41:18", "owner": "gasbravosix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096321964854370, "text": "LFG KWTD KF need 3", "created_at": "2025-12-01T21:21:48", "owner": "layne_w26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18334028035208077, "text": "She doesn’t need to talk", "created_at": "2025-12-01T21:03:36", "owner": "the_resurrect00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050422451694921, "text": "Content creator🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-01T20:30:10", "owner": "alij9h", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18394639867133583, "text": "HP = horse power", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:57:48", "owner": "omarodeh1983", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094764478855138, "text": "LAN", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:44:20", "owner": "bilgeekull", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331423498208592, "text": "Is this a transwoman?", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:10:16", "owner": "varezhkaboi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104504233635594, "text": "Gooner final boss", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:06:02", "owner": "exteen__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861242842544215, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:28:53", "owner": "emimariatti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107792728626596, "text": "What’s up with her knees? She needs to buy a set of knee-pads.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:23:36", "owner": "jasonkeebler97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929304856018197, "text": "I always thought pve meant player vs engine", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:22:00", "owner": "amely.strecker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991631133898036, "text": "PVE = player vs everybody 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:26:23", "owner": "john_zkii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968111181833826, "text": "Emi definitely used the second LFG at some point", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:59:45", "owner": "limitlessdrops", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073800983259252, "text": "Only people under the age of like 12 fall for that \"meta is an acronym\" nonsense", "created_at": "2025-12-01T15:37:20", "owner": "3gneus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088528348953563, "text": "Emotionless and boring as fuck", "created_at": "2025-12-01T14:58:01", "owner": "hahcouldntstopme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030990410775333, "text": "HP = hit points", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:30:42", "owner": "ravindranvignesh_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075635660194033, "text": "Didn't learn Meta till now lol. Rip", "created_at": "2025-12-01T12:39:47", "owner": "kyleahlstrom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001773854830985, "text": "LFG is also looking for group", "created_at": "2025-12-01T12:16:51", "owner": "mantary_s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882682357307524, "text": "She's so much better than I'd be", "created_at": "2025-12-01T10:47:06", "owner": "nepenthes121", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054698411652332, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:59:19", "owner": "jaris_b.k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984717300760254, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:54:57", "owner": "helsosmarh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18408197812191088, "text": "CC is an acronym with more meanings than “crowd control”.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:31:39", "owner": "wuh.chai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331567357213043, "text": "CC- closed captions.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T09:06:43", "owner": "abr.aham_her", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867673207486486, "text": "lfg isnt looking for game it’s looking for group", "created_at": "2025-12-01T08:37:53", "owner": "ianbt_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026586500583045, "text": "Bru we’re u find these twats", "created_at": "2025-12-01T08:36:46", "owner": "_sesai78", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18027694721572523, "text": "is that Gwen from lol(??", "created_at": "2025-12-01T06:41:40", "owner": "leze.64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067821431421438, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T05:41:45", "owner": "ay.d3n_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148068583380183, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T05:03:43", "owner": "alexis_boyz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949863813916907, "text": "She so bad", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:54:13", "owner": "femtenyl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047096825690421, "text": "✨⭐️Emiru did better than me ⭐️✨", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:01:34", "owner": "louieportlock", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079597492923796, "text": "closed captions", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:01:30", "owner": "sillytemmie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902699236317675, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-01T02:47:41", "owner": "weizxn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084365047855534, "text": "I love the eye widening for a sec at LAN 😂. Oh crap, uhh, lemme dig for that one rq", "created_at": "2025-12-01T02:33:39", "owner": "reanimation_cr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18187568203347151, "text": "Player vs everyone, non playable character", "created_at": "2025-12-01T02:30:13", "owner": "j.quezada95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547001221065335, "text": "AFK nah AFC. Away from controller", "created_at": "2025-12-01T02:16:14", "owner": "thefalconer15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887595898395010, "text": "the always😍", "created_at": "2025-12-01T02:02:22", "owner": "hsbi_chr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971903664968182, "text": "Wdym meta is an acronym 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:53:52", "owner": "zaynes.flowergirl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850088050567602, "text": "Lol no. “META” goes was back to early dungeons and dragons bud. Way before meta knight.", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:42:53", "owner": "surelynotlee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104097637680283, "text": "how is not age of empires 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:42:09", "owner": "asserteddock25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864114898518838, "text": "Ask her what mizfit means", "created_at": "2025-12-01T00:13:42", "owner": "dmitriusf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001183994832804, "text": "HP is HIT POINTS ... It's originated from table top games not health points", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:18:22", "owner": "gilfford23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152017555419937, "text": "Ngl I did not know META was a acronym", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:18:05", "owner": "matt_t64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058966202275877, "text": "PVE had always been Player Versus Entity", "created_at": "2025-11-30T22:20:21", "owner": "warmaster_prime", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076369712221381, "text": "lfg is looking for group ?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T22:06:31", "owner": "fllywoah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051179237656394, "text": "Today I learned what META stands for", "created_at": "2025-11-30T21:25:25", "owner": "loreenatv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020462096785685, "text": "💍🙂‍↔️", "created_at": "2025-11-30T21:05:04", "owner": "m.ovidiu1993", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005788370666126, "text": "@erikksuzuki we already had 5 years of LFG before dungeon finder was added", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:58:39", "owner": "chimp.nl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120564088543307, "text": "Now the McLarens can't stand a chance!!", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:55:32", "owner": "papakas12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139839085456927, "text": "LFG Looking for Group LFM Looking for Member", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:35:35", "owner": "ossi1337_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941437722962414, "text": "meta is actually from ssb brawl and tier lists in that game was compared to how well every character would do again meta knight", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:30:20", "owner": "yous_indixnscxmmer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115996267561140, "text": "💍", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:06:34", "owner": "tahaghavidel1389", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933189622000169, "text": "💍", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:06:17", "owner": "tahaghavidel1389", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847568539587171, "text": "Let’s freaking go! lol 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T19:54:00", "owner": "night.twitch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852333295594296, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:56:24", "owner": "plundererexpp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066323621149574, "text": "CC I just think if change channel in maple 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:47:21", "owner": "duubly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085785827077248, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:29:52", "owner": "usoezbro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082856005881090, "text": "I always thought kda was kill / death average", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:07:08", "owner": "raccoon_snowman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862839886536604, "text": "CC could also mean Crit Chance", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:36:29", "owner": "the_ca_logician", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089860235503404, "text": "Wtf", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:45:56", "owner": "recklezmikey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083340569027883, "text": "Gg", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:36:44", "owner": "the_f1rst_op", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081399566109602, "text": "You go emi", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:22:51", "owner": "denjoakita", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088089622799322, "text": "META IS A ACRONYM 😮", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:58:59", "owner": "__luhoseo__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886576894402486, "text": "Backronym, the term meta was used before people came up with the idea that it means most effective tactic available since it was already a word before video games were a thing.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:36:17", "owner": "clicky.gg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082998296027934, "text": "Chat she’s actually a gamer", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:35:40", "owner": "smol_potato_cat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926301613172024, "text": "Meta is a retroactive acronym, I’m not sure I’d count that", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:22:30", "owner": "pmossburg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009592880649097, "text": "POV: Than one Short form user frienf", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:45:04", "owner": "_mahim.aevolf_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095977126863455, "text": "Whats on mizkit mind when hes leaving this kind of baddie", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:42:27", "owner": "estorxiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980952339776689, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:31:24", "owner": "mamiforwin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383406067195300, "text": "The only correct answer for PvE is Plants vs Zombies", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:30:51", "owner": "asman_hw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086476438953143, "text": "hakan suka", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:25:06", "owner": "dhaniii_i", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914415079236095, "text": "I am too old for this", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:14:09", "owner": "aleen_li11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992254239894434, "text": "wtf does this have to do with Redbull", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:10:22", "owner": "xishere_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043394759705548, "text": "Nuh uh cc = subtitles", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:15:26", "owner": "happydapro1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986445705753417, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-30T10:58:26", "owner": "andreae75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885915919280717, "text": "But if this was a guy ppl would tell him to touch grass", "created_at": "2025-11-30T10:35:57", "owner": "space_cosmunaut", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065259293575288, "text": "FTW, Fuck the what. Nothing else.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T10:09:30", "owner": "chetmenn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987588336747621, "text": "Meta is a backronym", "created_at": "2025-11-30T09:44:30", "owner": "riderofthest0rm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013133039804555, "text": "🤣🤣 have always thought HP=hit points all these times", "created_at": "2025-11-30T09:29:25", "owner": "m0o__joe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101403328706318, "text": "Looking for Group...", "created_at": "2025-11-30T09:20:44", "owner": "sfjuocekr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899814088342709, "text": "Streamer accent", "created_at": "2025-11-30T09:09:26", "owner": "gunshxow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094571683868923, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T09:02:36", "owner": "paskadewo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867410578497346, "text": "😮😮😮🤦🏻‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:47:52", "owner": "cosmin.udroiu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075100199263345, "text": "CC - change Channel", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:37:00", "owner": "dr_jrpg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940456279097269, "text": "As far as I know, META isn't actually an acronym. Meta in this context means \"effectivity & efficiency game\" or a game above the game itself where you min-maxing strategies to \"win\". It usually involves communities. The acronym is actually added after the term was popular.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:26:25", "owner": "misusatriyo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000491972689853, "text": "Oh I thought LFG stood for Let’s Fucking Go 🤷🏻‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:45:03", "owner": "mark.schepers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109010503623004, "text": "she talks like Chris chan", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:42:43", "owner": "cos_suentes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090274073484425, "text": "That meta guess was gold though good girl 👏", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:22:07", "owner": "xyonthewise", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396738718131490, "text": "I thought NPC = non-playable, not non-player. 🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:18:04", "owner": "keithanime", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113825848578241, "text": "No one uses META.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:58:36", "owner": "acalthu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118845868548977, "text": "She bad cousin", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:45:18", "owner": "liliiilillliliiilil", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17994995042850354, "text": "Disgrace to redbull kick her fr", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:22:12", "owner": "skate3noah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941350090088279, "text": "Sorry Lil sis, but go out, touch some grass, have some fun with others. Because now it's too much h😢", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:09:55", "owner": "teyrac69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033215795727355, "text": "wdyp cc isint custom content 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:06:08", "owner": "rotting.fl3sh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921786775197024, "text": "CC- Clan Castle 🫡", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:27:22", "owner": "unknown_b.o.i", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925947670171680, "text": "She said down-owo-dable content ☠️", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:01:25", "owner": "keno.saga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981008595946501, "text": "I thought pve meant player vs everyone", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:34:02", "owner": "webl0ggi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082076080887180, "text": "I'll take 1 please", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:27:59", "owner": "orbious2020", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969664503825685, "text": "Wait she was so close with META as a total guess. I've never known its an acronym", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:12:50", "owner": "misha_t836", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059725907259787, "text": "Wtf redbull doinn💔", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:03:43", "owner": "qq_happh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18192042577333509, "text": "W @emiru.jpg", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:02:16", "owner": "thevegasstreamer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049853288402611, "text": "Talking about NPC…..", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:02:09", "owner": "fabiojorgeofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047482583460728, "text": "META is anti-acronym actually. It's the short for of \"metagame\". \"Most Efficient Tactics Available\" was given later.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:01:30", "owner": "itz_manu.04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922466443190844, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:49:18", "owner": "allanviana_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133024156491901, "text": "What is the E-game equivalent of the Redbull helmet given only to certain athletes??", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:17:09", "owner": "brentstagram5000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063959288560997, "text": "Pants? No?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:08:50", "owner": "voice.of.justice1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850071691567330, "text": "L2P = learn to play", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:01:54", "owner": "kristouahmed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918924502071829, "text": "Wish i could wax her up", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:52:25", "owner": "moasto02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923719954183721, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:33:34", "owner": "angelamanahan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064966280409151, "text": "Bro really asked if META is acronym 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:27:34", "owner": "wiiavack", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010528844811268, "text": "HP is actually Hit points", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:17:04", "owner": "johari_zulkifli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864564823516529, "text": "GG", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:15:28", "owner": "garykchan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137346454462960, "text": "No its not it comes from the word metagame", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:13:05", "owner": "lemon.hot.cheetos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096450532886054, "text": "KDA adalah hal pertama yang saya tau. Dulu pernah GB KDA Point Blank 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:07:28", "owner": "namzhu.ch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986162880872792, "text": "DOT= Department Of Transportation", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:05:02", "owner": "oscar_jhovanny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950066973922653, "text": "LFG = Let's Fvckin Go", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:03:53", "owner": "j.alboy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865437376514653, "text": "Unemploymentmaxxing 🥀", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:40:40", "owner": "210_luver", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109346713529193, "text": "No one knew that meta was an acronym.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:38:26", "owner": "rw325078", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969710592972603, "text": "Someone wife her up plz", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:32:27", "owner": "infuriatinghuman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071982281587813, "text": "I genuinely didn’t know meta was an acronym", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:30:26", "owner": "novulak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057176372649902, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:22:40", "owner": "bardmiaan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18246481249289472, "text": "She said the “always” so cheerful🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:13:51", "owner": "imsoblushing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058196375645853, "text": "Hit points wasn’t it, anyway doesn’t matter", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:37:53", "owner": "tezakleiru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048327026424331, "text": "OOM!", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:28:43", "owner": "geert.vdm.9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087278050815141, "text": "LFG : lets fucking go🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:15:31", "owner": "user00xdrago", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073366961599829, "text": "BRB = Back Run to Bath", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:14:46", "owner": "sandroforsaken", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967499304995616, "text": "LFG : LETS FKN GOOOOOO🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:07:12", "owner": "yafet.bou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881275756422467, "text": "CC = camp check", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:49:01", "owner": "larrygendut", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546481468024609, "text": "Meta come from metaknight , Idc what y'all say", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:34:37", "owner": "__b0mbastic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088320083312669, "text": "Cc...carbon copy😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:52:30", "owner": "relinquish_controll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368657917085984, "text": "cc custom content", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:37:13", "owner": "hekkeani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080465390149452, "text": "Give that woman a chair or a pulpit.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:34:24", "owner": "gmartzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937016410102051, "text": "That lil beech mizkif fumbled", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:25:39", "owner": "foreverron", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072527612524186, "text": "Actually, meta is greek for “new”", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:13:49", "owner": "mystispark", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989385228883544, "text": "what's her @", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:04:39", "owner": "g_victo7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944585947076307, "text": "I honestly always thought that npc was non playable character", "created_at": "2025-11-29T20:58:40", "owner": "jonny__snyder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064597103437566, "text": "GG= good games😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T20:41:21", "owner": "gramsciberry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987501915869456, "text": "Wait does META actually mean that or are they just saying that?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T20:24:20", "owner": "kevdude2234", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024296906596772, "text": "I knew all haha", "created_at": "2025-11-29T20:01:28", "owner": "moogdoogboo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185702716351979, "text": "I thought AoE Age of empires 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T19:56:43", "owner": "obsidiandoll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866197609506997, "text": "I thought PVE was player versus everything 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T19:53:06", "owner": "chocothunda30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305839738264817, "text": "Cc -Carbon copy", "created_at": "2025-11-29T19:38:02", "owner": "wwt_o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993341718890385, "text": "GGs gang😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T19:03:13", "owner": "kat__leho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065879873148532, "text": "https://tse1.mm.bing.net/th/id/OIP.koPEM_Ke8dPdx_TnY9kk7gHaE8?pid=Api&P=0&w=599&h=400 damn hahahaha", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:23:59", "owner": "nrs5080", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925861867037578, "text": "Attack on Titan🥀😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:21:14", "owner": "yasin.pr2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18149228314440278, "text": "Damn I lived on MMOs and I barely kept up with her. She's quick. KDA took me a second cause K/DA has overtaken my brain", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:15:50", "owner": "graefx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845265754617719, "text": "No one wants go talk anymore, everything is abbreviated", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:14:07", "owner": "marvelc831", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140761441460130, "text": "In gaming, \"meta\" is short for metagame and refers to the strategies, tactics, and character choices that are currently the most effective for winning. It is sometimes mistakenly believed to be an acronym for \"Most Effective Tactics Available,\" but it actually refers to the \"game about the game\"—using knowledge outside the game's rules, such as community-agreed-upon strategies, to gain a competitive edge", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:01:06", "owner": "dimchig_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092287156923998, "text": "Again OF ass, red bull is trash nowadays", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:59:17", "owner": "sk_00400", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072469346604811, "text": "Idk why they hate they just gay, plus she talks just fine, get to know more people outside of your home and you'll find ppl that talk in different ways like this..", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:58:50", "owner": "ix.viii.iv.iii.xx", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066549584138251, "text": "We used LOS line of sight", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:58:07", "owner": "jstone403", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18246781993289012, "text": "Kos", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:57:16", "owner": "vivaano.o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091101667902922, "text": "Age of Empires", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:52:27", "owner": "lone_wolf_origins", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18118359181488597, "text": "Damm she is a nerd.... awesome", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:48:20", "owner": "pandemicroggue", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18116684845561231, "text": "lfg is looking for group", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:38:24", "owner": "jasynhughes_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066743612575298, "text": "Whats NT?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:28:10", "owner": "mahd1mahdav1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845037295619294, "text": "Emiru 🥰🥰🥰", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:25:16", "owner": "arusky2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542968048008197, "text": "AFK? Away from keyboard? Seriously? 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:22:09", "owner": "abdulrehmanhere388", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058233944643368, "text": "Meta is an acronym wow", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:20:17", "owner": "cesartfc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110493058612178, "text": "40 btw", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:18:30", "owner": "50m613", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970982121985833, "text": "CC- Chrono Crystals", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:16:32", "owner": "imshinylol", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17849488701600492, "text": "🙌 👸🏻🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:15:49", "owner": "lagaxxi", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18537545038012646, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:11:40", "owner": "vozjavii", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17888336298391788, "text": "FBL?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:00:50", "owner": "alexsenkai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081779102279459, "text": "Looking for group", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:59:51", "owner": "tjy.___", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18542011111010943, "text": "i would definitely assault her at twitchcon 😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:51:59", "owner": "diabolicalpost", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18549230269013286, "text": "META was acryonym ?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:51:53", "owner": "evanadipras", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975444459954276, "text": "Shit you got me with META", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:43:45", "owner": "oscarvgaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064389650401916, "text": "Where is my ring", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:40:52", "owner": "molllodoy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894459283223574, "text": "HitPoints", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:35:01", "owner": "_nik.o.lav__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18412393288140657, "text": "Amazing😍🔥 She's great ♥️", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:33:43", "owner": "magn_us1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17990696003734380, "text": "Neeeeeeerrrrrrrddddddd!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:24:12", "owner": "blackjester29", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17925777015036559, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:20:50", "owner": "soulstance68", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17879823261333325, "text": "I'm in love", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:14:53", "owner": "life_of.guy_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18231115939306885, "text": "GG ON VIDEO 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:04:25", "owner": "garfield_jetfire", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18334749397230967, "text": "CC - Subtitles", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:03:59", "owner": "real_yxsh.w", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088022491792862, "text": "Big 🧠", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:00:46", "owner": "squeakinc.games", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065103917387598, "text": "TG :- Touch Grass 👍", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:58:59", "owner": "_anshu109_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17880252600425222, "text": "Isnt it non playable character?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:46:39", "owner": "shinxcz13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103410232657625, "text": "Lfg here 😅", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:46:38", "owner": "lfgsik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105294175710672, "text": "GGs", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:46:24", "owner": "jonasan_e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084730166515626, "text": "LFG is looking for group but I've NEVER heard of meta being an acronym wtf😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:46:21", "owner": "dwillswagg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048796211418587, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:35:45", "owner": "bel.mohd__u92", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18005445254670467, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:32:15", "owner": "johnnymac14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135299422475681, "text": "Ppl hating but if it was a guy it’d be nothing why are you hating her for knowing stuff", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:24:13", "owner": "caseclover11037", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914140999245204, "text": "Only like 4 of those were acronyms.  Why do this if they don't know the difference between acronyms and initialisms", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:22:55", "owner": "strawberry_ape", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17863845483519529, "text": "So she's hot, cute and smart 🤓🤩 wow 😮", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:21:10", "owner": "kostasgggggg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18534729166057599, "text": "She games more than me 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:07:58", "owner": "dwayne.jnr12", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17889322752389135, "text": "CC - Change Channel iykyk 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:06:25", "owner": "blader361", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17905814841143005, "text": "TDM?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:57:52", "owner": "n.o.s.t.a.l.g.i.c_g.u.y", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18373346320155978, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:57:26", "owner": "bobbyvg.3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17936746350103146, "text": "LFG looking for group", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:56:13", "owner": "snaligirlyq", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18322964236168013, "text": "LFG  it’s not looking for group 🤔??", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:48:39", "owner": "f.1lxl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088320923491475, "text": "Okay now I see the similarity with Jaiden. On her streams she looks white as a ghost but here she does look human", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:47:50", "owner": "arvenriverez", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18002151548687353, "text": "She knows what LAN means? Not even 50% of guys know about LAN, WAN or WWW", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:47:48", "owner": "lykemil", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18029131070762122, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:41:50", "owner": "ilaaitmalek", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18110931661593559, "text": "All this time i thought LFG meant “Let’s fucking go!” 🫠", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:41:12", "owner": "djsnap_atl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18048629879432285, "text": "LFG = looking for group", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:39:32", "owner": "__mhzb__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18103062103735449, "text": "Meta is a Latin prefix that was turned into an acronym", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:32:53", "owner": "mr_mustauceo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17903145852310141, "text": "lan deme lan", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:27:12", "owner": "mymanoneyes", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17882820054419412, "text": "it’s hit points btw 😏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:17:11", "owner": "mrstarkeyy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18026598035581118, "text": "Keeper 💍", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:14:55", "owner": "soulisv", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17965262501846993, "text": "Doesn’t LFG mean looking for group? Or are Americans weird?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:13:50", "owner": "jst_romeo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17929727529148345, "text": "In Philippines when someone is noob af, Meta=metanga", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:10:51", "owner": "icadr1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908847955127002, "text": "It’s not Player Vs Everyone ?!?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:08:14", "owner": "dj.dougie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038441066709752, "text": "Emi is perfect", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:07:55", "owner": "quarterpac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095713966866587, "text": "“Meta” doesht mean that at all. It originated from Smash Bros. Brawl. The whole roster was basically ranked by how well they could survive Meta Knight (who was completely broken). people just added the other stuff later on.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:06:45", "owner": "artuttifrutti", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088728871788859, "text": "Dafac is this shit", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:06:08", "owner": "i.miracle.__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18141121189405464, "text": "They all have that accent", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:05:03", "owner": "batmansfeces", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18077764043231967, "text": "Meta is just derived from a latin word meaning “transcending” when has it ever been an acronym gng 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:01:05", "owner": "hunterthag0at", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082181600025281, "text": "Darn it. I chose woman growing up 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:58:50", "owner": "j_sin_iixxii", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17906886150278972, "text": "🧍‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:58:09", "owner": "rhdytstudio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991246836907322, "text": "Anyone who plays WOW would know", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:58:01", "owner": "hriata_pom_23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907211362280536, "text": "RP = Rtrd Ppl", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:41:40", "owner": "ghost_black0ut_1st", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109420744528496, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:40:47", "owner": "imyuriskt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18396947071127505, "text": "Those plushies were mighty", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:30:36", "owner": "amar.krz1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088124113784223, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:30:33", "owner": "serkan.omr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17868833415476194, "text": "BFG", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:26:26", "owner": "free0flice", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17979015575784002, "text": "Why does she sound like she has an AI voice 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:13:48", "owner": "thatfuckingjames", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087874178314829, "text": "Critical Chance 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:04:54", "owner": "999ishgg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126156532506847, "text": "Isnt hp hit points?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:03:00", "owner": "williamz.3501", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082716166875447, "text": "HP = Horse Power", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:00:32", "owner": "saeed.217", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075621980239351, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:59:18", "owner": "genderlesshunnan", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18032729426746344, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:59:04", "owner": "jkstoutlager", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18032516147725506, "text": "How you not know LFG. Well, she has nothing but simps so it’s easy for her to find a match no matter the game. Why she say these as fast as she can?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:57:08", "owner": "jzgolfing", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080671595161935, "text": "So it wasn’t player vs economy? 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:51:23", "owner": "name_clive", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902806627165562, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:48:34", "owner": "fluffcake11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18174789760366902, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:36:57", "owner": "kiarash.zz24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18229035736309994, "text": "Meta was not an acronym, it is a short version of metagame, the acronym itself doesn't make any sense.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:35:24", "owner": "bimn2o", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17851028202596797, "text": "AOE.. me with confidence: Age of Empires 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:22:05", "owner": "salma.sipkova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18276817708303669, "text": "What about CP?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:20:29", "owner": "r.a.d.i.n.156", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098986096819415, "text": "LFG = LETS F**KING GOO 💀🤟", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:20:22", "owner": "subbaashwinn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18397399114120712, "text": "I wouldve said disc locked content", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:18:52", "owner": "virroorr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18500481862078219, "text": "Le sabe", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:10:08", "owner": "ardilavin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17849881773567907, "text": "Wtf meta lol", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:08:14", "owner": "igordguimaraes", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18056315309322542, "text": "I thought more people knew what META was", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:53:36", "owner": "mawzita", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087506818797659, "text": "That version of META was invented after the term", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:51:21", "owner": "_stf.hammer_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18341050507230938, "text": "DPS mean Diluc Paling Sakit", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:49:12", "owner": "t_wirrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105788902725221, "text": "Lfg = looking for group", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:44:04", "owner": "kreuzritter605", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929929765158775, "text": "CC closed caption, PvE Player verses Everyone I didn’t get any right", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:40:05", "owner": "papa_rahzzi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051972464343531, "text": "Judged her too hard then she locked in", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:32:17", "owner": "vtsato", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18169359991372696, "text": "Meta is NOT an acronym", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:21:08", "owner": "confusion_e_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059737829265586, "text": "Unesasery info", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:18:02", "owner": "gaming666turtle", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18049420730401614, "text": "She's good.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:16:52", "owner": "matthewdavidlucas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907571755273188, "text": "SHO WER", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:13:53", "owner": "whereiscyan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17922982074191039, "text": "I’m not surprised most people didn’t know meta was an acronym since it’s always said as a word, but do you ever stop to think why “META” is usual for the best items in the game? You don’t do you? That’s because you say meta instead of META, and when someone says “what does meta mean?”, you instantly think about the most broken things in the game, since that’s exactly what is is in a technical sense because those OP things are the “Most Effective Tactic Available”", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:11:41", "owner": "318.ty_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063525740188692, "text": "glky = good luck killing yourself", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:10:51", "owner": "majid_stolen_videos", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085412887832729, "text": "Attack on titannnnn apt", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:08:30", "owner": "ali_ank_110", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982793064920172, "text": "Isn't HP hit points and not health points?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:57:19", "owner": "just_lolwa_kek", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063586454449874, "text": "CC = Change Channel", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:56:45", "owner": "lars.vanderlugt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087254129485782, "text": "GG?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:55:35", "owner": "starzaaroni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102495385681907, "text": "One peux avoir les versions françaises ?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:48:42", "owner": "229_animes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094478464923420, "text": "LFG - looking for group for the oldies.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:48:19", "owner": "alchie2", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18151665646419531, "text": "Is she trans?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:45:24", "owner": "pablo.himself", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18437922823097089, "text": "Not that serious", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:43:54", "owner": "omerrabino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18340244722229317, "text": "I miss 2 wew need touch some grass I guess", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:34:09", "owner": "lil.jal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088391683808024, "text": "why do ppl fear to explore the world then being online 24/7 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:16:05", "owner": "ss.eni_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086489384476745, "text": "LFG is Looking For Group 🫡", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:10:53", "owner": "dentsas21", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18024053654786187, "text": "Oh the literal drama queen", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:10:06", "owner": "viktor_tdv", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18097003537877231, "text": "CC- Youtube Subtitle 😵‍💫😵‍💫", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:01:38", "owner": "him_ansh95", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18339603592230446, "text": "@ericsangcho", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:59:43", "owner": "jungmind", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17938315320008493, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:58:18", "owner": "seaderblockz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086010428091598, "text": "I don't even know what GGs mean 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:53:17", "owner": "everest_jaew", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17891189241246093, "text": "Im So Meta Even This Acronym", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:52:34", "owner": "mannenmedyoen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17986939652752111, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:51:46", "owner": "aurahara_ml", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087775394064447, "text": "Man hört das Red Bull in ihrer Stimme😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:49:22", "owner": "der_froehlich_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080992436328957, "text": "meta isn’t an acronym it’s short for metagame", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:43:28", "owner": "gabespound", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18105361090726057, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:40:02", "owner": "wolf.aa.za", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18102066151681931, "text": "What is that? A wife material testing session?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:35:39", "owner": "fpeterhun", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18174246529370314, "text": "FCP 💙🐉🤍", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:35:00", "owner": "rebeloxiii", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18300092980257345, "text": "Meta comes from metagame. meta prefix means \"beyond\". Metagame is going beyond the game, analysing stats, bugs, inconsistencies, synergies, so you can choose the most optimal weapon, build or whatever. Whoever came with that acronym did it years later the term metagame was being used.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:30:38", "owner": "ricanquela", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17875423236445773, "text": "Who is emiru", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:29:37", "owner": "curiosites_urbaines", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080304422156897, "text": "Meta is not an acronym lmfao", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:27:13", "owner": "navngivet", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17868063465494704, "text": "سی سی🎀", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:22:50", "owner": "shani.magick", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17946923490062731, "text": "glhf?? mico mentioned??", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:20:35", "owner": "_torii_spam___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071228798601293, "text": "Her knees look like that red face from Berserk", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:16:18", "owner": "brotakudon", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18006919970660757, "text": "Jobless ball knowledge 🥀", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:14:39", "owner": "ya.boi_stewiee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18173443396371613, "text": "My futur wife sure", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:07:45", "owner": "valandilelanessie", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18185386429353609, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:04:56", "owner": "elmer_21269", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022322720792258, "text": "She let mix tap that", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:04:07", "owner": "doppokarugawa", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18365704537092324, "text": "Pve in mi time was playera vs engine cruz consoles usted to have it", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:00:42", "owner": "oiertxis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072622364052355, "text": "You can tell she games by the way she talks 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:59:49", "owner": "edvno", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160228387392018, "text": "NPC Non Playable Character", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:57:36", "owner": "ryanmaul95", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18204857674319940, "text": "Aren't HP means Hit Point?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:54:28", "owner": "zax_8bit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929329696156835, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:47:09", "owner": "paret_phet_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18187329976337570, "text": "Only two acronyms in the whole thing 🤦‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:43:24", "owner": "jcuk83", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18132261823489449, "text": "I THOUGHT LFG is *LETS F**KING GO 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:33:56", "owner": "saravanan_the_game", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079246625159301, "text": "Meta really an acronym??", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:33:10", "owner": "yohanesck", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18350001943203662, "text": "😂🔥🙌👏😮😍", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:28:05", "owner": "j.yan329", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088182233298948, "text": "“Player vs Environment” 😭 I thought it was “Player vs Entity”", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:26:01", "owner": "v0rt3xy0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087632962957627, "text": "girl ig?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:22:50", "owner": "lihoopfe", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17856993717563682, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:20:52", "owner": "drealchris", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17902725447166407, "text": "HP is always Hit Points", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:18:35", "owner": "aiksihkinamad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086698327971896, "text": "I see npc gooners gooning most effectively 🤤", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:15:55", "owner": "thatguywiththeskull", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18110309860547625, "text": "S.M.D", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:09:41", "owner": "username_sn22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081607178028456, "text": "Nice", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:06:52", "owner": "ey3gl1tch", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17899750422337096, "text": "Mvp meaning?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:55:11", "owner": "sham_meitei", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17998122206698611, "text": "I thought it was player versus everyone😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:52:49", "owner": "uneedmorecoffee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852410179593012, "text": "Most important would be PTFO", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:50:29", "owner": "mostdef81", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18125275177515588, "text": "🤡🤡🤡", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:47:46", "owner": "aghostnagentleman", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17894446686220883, "text": "Meta is not an acronym , not “officially”", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:46:34", "owner": "kpop_cat_on_youtube", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546195958054771, "text": "she is such a dumb manipulative whore lol !", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:45:26", "owner": "shot_6969", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18350205109204147, "text": "Meta is an acronym? Also isn't Meta the parent company of instagram 🌝 so for them this is tactic?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:41:51", "owner": "the_hopeful_introvert", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067427423525263, "text": "LFG - lets fucking go! But realy looking for group", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:41:40", "owner": "eyahnee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18543448201009894, "text": "Honestly didn’t know meta was an acronym but it makes a lot of sense 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:39:55", "owner": "lunar_kev", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18120445219531421, "text": "Marvelous! not only cute but smart👏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:35:18", "owner": "mhmmdsrlhfd_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17926845834174289, "text": "She abused her rabbits n shit and she gets the easiest answers", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:32:48", "owner": "heeheehaw.cr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17986312286869333, "text": "For cc I said closed captions😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:30:56", "owner": "afamilette", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085509257046552, "text": "While maplestory : CC pls", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:30:04", "owner": "iqqymon", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17891638287243728, "text": "Fake voice", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:26:25", "owner": "soulz2113", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003778298675113, "text": "Pve is player vs enemy", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:23:02", "owner": "spideynoodle", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083932465861242, "text": "OMG😍", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:19:54", "owner": "marcio.rodrigues.969", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17938557489100686, "text": "I only know AFK and PVE 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:14:14", "owner": "jamesdepanda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845506045616580, "text": "meta isnt an acronym it comes from meta knight", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:04:55", "owner": "tisnotsam", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17878988358431490, "text": "GG - Good Game", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:02:42", "owner": "ctrlf_p7___", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17867976345483487, "text": "Yo I never knew what afk meant 😭🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:01:22", "owner": "1cold.z", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17885246256283315, "text": "GLHF = Good Luck High Five", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:59:18", "owner": "d_cometa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18113531758592317, "text": "Nerd talent 😆", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:57:59", "owner": "cjyoshaa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17855571426526230, "text": "I always thought it was a free kill", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:56:58", "owner": "shortster1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078803066175857, "text": "LFG = Let's Fukin Go", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:56:31", "owner": "muharrem_acar", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18114671869601617, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:56:24", "owner": "faisal__h", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18101694697779330, "text": "Lfg is looking for group", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:50:26", "owner": "star_stuff_47", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18494817400072523, "text": "Only unbalanced game players know Full form of Meta😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:48:28", "owner": "abhishek_ne_gi", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17976374438955511, "text": "looking for group- LFG  who tf uses it for looking for game?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:40:58", "owner": "tyreke_fernandez", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18062333006441972, "text": "I DIDN'T KNOW META WAS AN ACRONYM LMAOOO I THOUGHT IT WAS A SINGLE WORD", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:31:33", "owner": "_danielon_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18059382362642686, "text": "Most established team assembly???", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:31:20", "owner": "hraegar", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18061066505558641, "text": "there's a red bull GAMING?? 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:27:35", "owner": "lobotomyprincess69", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18105739498642757, "text": "Missed the last one.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:26:02", "owner": "ruditokay", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17955134958029252, "text": "Not me thinking CC meant Clan Chat lol", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:25:38", "owner": "hacktehvist", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17859751353551696, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:22:39", "owner": "noahdmuneyy", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17963498324852562, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:10:29", "owner": "veryevilaliencat", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17906122344293393, "text": "The fuck? THAT'S META?? That's actually so cool that it makes sense also as word itself (always interpreted that as the analysis you do of gameplay mechanics outside of the immersion, that is, meta/beyond just playing the game)", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:08:58", "owner": "dr.fracaso", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17964329706004532, "text": "AAAAAAh\n*throws phone at wall*", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:07:29", "owner": "crowlys_art", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17859556446488235, "text": "Wait. Isn't NPC non playable character? #cmiiw", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:03:33", "owner": "adesulistiana", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17845206747601739, "text": "LFG ... Lets Fucking Go", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:54:07", "owner": "david_01970", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17953206756029127, "text": "Her voice pmo so much", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:54:04", "owner": "johnsonshlongson", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18299106178256446, "text": "LFG Lets Fu*king Gooo", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:40:57", "owner": "w4hyek", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18080559944269974, "text": "Centimeter cube??", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:36:58", "owner": "dangerous_shower", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17934536613104255, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:31:25", "owner": "saelfyoru", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18107283223622704, "text": "Hit points *", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:29:24", "owner": "enesvee131", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067970543573337, "text": "Hit points noo?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:29:05", "owner": "shohboh", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17852526063591750, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:24:59", "owner": "winkiddo", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18069017138618289, "text": "PTFO", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:01:23", "owner": "tug_life84", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18079428787899592, "text": "Meta is not an acronym used in gaming unless it just started being used in the past couple weeks", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:01:20", "owner": "downhillgroovy", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17888574702261689, "text": "Emiii🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:57:11", "owner": "_enighter", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18322216687174216, "text": "Hayatsız", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:55:03", "owner": "gorkem_avci6", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18074170175256755, "text": "Npc", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:53:16", "owner": "charlitoxic92", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18087361877317873, "text": "She sounds like the cassette tapes from fnaf help wanted", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:52:38", "owner": "loshua_the_short", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18130829389495546, "text": "Wait meta is an acronym?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:52:14", "owner": "stefann05", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18093711724922755, "text": "GOOTH.- get out of the house", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:52:14", "owner": "s.s.minnow11", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17877452997440490, "text": "Hp is hit point", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:44:02", "owner": "jtwasnotaperson", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18050540300662674, "text": "she bad", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:40:37", "owner": "ax_vedder", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17894362569225801, "text": "Somehpw she gives me the feeling that she has some kind of mental disability😅😗", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:30:39", "owner": "motomichel_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061503428215432, "text": "Op - One Piece", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:30:06", "owner": "itsme_ketan10", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18548722018039362, "text": "Meta means meta god damnit", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:29:41", "owner": "jairgs", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17954498208031063, "text": "OP = outstanding performance", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:25:42", "owner": "naxus___", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067162937578338, "text": "Is game term not that much? I think LAN not a game specific term compare the rest..", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:08:26", "owner": "x.flanerie.x", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18087343952067102, "text": "Pve is player vs environment? I thought it was enemy?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:07:38", "owner": "nathanod13", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18091391284737223, "text": "Oh it's dyrus ex. I'm that old lol", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:05:28", "owner": "idontneedajacket", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18064297625167167, "text": "emiru needs to touch grass 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:55:25", "owner": "ldk_ujjaldeep", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18057020021315822, "text": "Imba: Imbalance", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:45:14", "owner": "naz.arjuna", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18099914227703161, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:43:35", "owner": "delucadominic33", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17968837958987516, "text": "Im saving this.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:37:24", "owner": "kunaikilla", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18065790284151464, "text": "kinda like this girl", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:33:38", "owner": "zuxqxc", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17913284181248063, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:25:29", "owner": "tal0n_w", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17932667661000614, "text": "As a sims player when I heard CC I said Costume Content so fast", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:24:23", "owner": "noa_agreste_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18098995456770616, "text": "Damn AI is getting better", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:24:22", "owner": "tgusaurus", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095904418803703, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:19:16", "owner": "soleilofdawn", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18068534147576484, "text": "Nah LFG is looking for group", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:17:28", "owner": "_isak_nylander_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18432117142128838, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:15:49", "owner": "ms.reg_fil", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18053179427339368, "text": "Maya is not an acronym. This is acronym only in redditors fantasies. In real life it is shortened metagame where meta is a greek word for \"beyond\". It describe situations where you try to decide how to act in a game while you aren't paying.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:11:59", "owner": "tieguanyin_karate_kid", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17865693627433318, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:05:33", "owner": "orielgrinberg", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18194308996334062, "text": "I call bs on meta", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:58:30", "owner": "timewizud", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17987836619880338, "text": "That's a bacronym", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:51:24", "owner": "robjacob79", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18010831034644252, "text": "Gg wp", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:47:41", "owner": "adonaymontilla", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17905609938141713, "text": "Just go touch grass", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:46:06", "owner": "littlegiantkuma", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18371796637159875, "text": "after all these years finally I can make sense of the meta terms 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:45:42", "owner": "scarletcakez", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17972083085813883, "text": "Is she....single? 🙄❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:40:57", "owner": "nomadicnava", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18112411630523806, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:36:28", "owner": "br7yaan", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17897288025347213, "text": "hold up. isnt PVE also player vs everyone?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:30:32", "owner": "umpkingfluff", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17977069796949638, "text": "looking for game/group", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:29:00", "owner": "jaydenm59", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17888828799389839, "text": "In my day, HP meant “hit points.”", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:22:43", "owner": "drewpaik", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18063970301426252, "text": "Lfg is looking for group not game, you're looking for group to play with 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:21:36", "owner": "azza_marls_esports_miyagi", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18303199270252675, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:19:37", "owner": "samatrehobeth", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18051319358373108, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:18:01", "owner": "riley__supermessy", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17989973126904457, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:08:52", "owner": "kyledittman", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18012674822804968, "text": "Everyone knows that 🫩🫩", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:04:47", "owner": "kysdriza", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17983784837762832, "text": "GoML = Get on my level\nOr Get out my lobby 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:56:58", "owner": "tayslay._", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17894170878360933, "text": "Why are you guys so mad 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:55:24", "owner": "faustinalover009", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18094366468698142, "text": "She’s so fucking hot 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:51:55", "owner": "freeddan95", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17998175126698803, "text": "LFG is looking for group", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:47:38", "owner": "lvxfrost", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18381675826195030, "text": "Mizkif is fuming watching this", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:45:32", "owner": "josephmorino.mph955", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18069860018083018, "text": "Is she the one?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:39:08", "owner": "raijinmeister", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18109662691544493, "text": "😫 why her knees look like that?! Old lady knees", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:34:54", "owner": "battlekat27", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17998659944699168, "text": "Bald girl", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:34:48", "owner": "tegu10000", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17988155420862797, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:34:44", "owner": "sideo_huzuki", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18298179508257453, "text": "Lfg is let's fucking go", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:31:28", "owner": "yesimmud", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18121237723531491, "text": "This made me realize I've never realized the word meta was an acronym", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:28:52", "owner": "riyan_ricah", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18071650346594880, "text": "👍🏼👍🏼👍🏼👍🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:26:19", "owner": "roygool", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17867583291493364, "text": "HARAM!", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:23:24", "owner": "mehmet.emmi0", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18540668176012621, "text": "The guy that abused of her did nothing wrong", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:09:22", "owner": "santaclausesenior", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18350721802161700, "text": "LAN = Latino América Norte 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:07:13", "owner": "gianpndp", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18045695450475407, "text": "She is F@ discoustimg", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:06:22", "owner": "vranjolinaaaaaa", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18076964999334809, "text": "I thought LFG meant lets fuck gang", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:05:38", "owner": "belal_5h", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18071831696524932, "text": "LFG = Let's fucking gooooo", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:04:02", "owner": "siriuslyweird", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18051206828359352, "text": "Hey guys, what does it mean when my teammates tell me KYSN?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:55:55", "owner": "epicsimon1234", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18086628436984345, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:54:27", "owner": "itsz_ivhan", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18109945771611106, "text": "Who is this awkward child you’ve placed in a room in front of a camera", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:54:09", "owner": "arigatou_cryptographica", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18052940402662576, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:53:12", "owner": "_kerpb_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17864518896528210, "text": "AOE: age of empires", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:51:18", "owner": "lealseth", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18558383437056762, "text": "The last one I didn’t know was an acronym", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:47:55", "owner": "jjds36_yt", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18087508363995054, "text": "🙌Next time try use music from Zii EDM🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:44:59", "owner": "zfakzfak", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18515869888066446, "text": "The reel is cool but WHATS THE TRACK IN THE BACKGROUND XD ?", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:42:38", "owner": "mehdi.boudagga", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17866892034427481, "text": "the way she talks pmo", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:36:19", "owner": "yoki_lvr", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18086613919949632, "text": "She was good actually", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:34:48", "owner": "_jordan_putra", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17977425029789555, "text": "Meta =/= META", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:32:43", "owner": "soulexium", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18051762020364528, "text": "Am I just crazy or does no one uses FoV? I use LoS for Line of Sight all the time", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:26:03", "owner": "junno.cdrol", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18074970926244424, "text": "nah LFG is for looking for group ✊", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:21:10", "owner": "santaaries1", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17943788157082810, "text": "OP? WHERE IS MY OP??? I WILL CHANGE U 4 THIS VANDAL!", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:20:54", "owner": "nathaniel_wild_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17992565882897290, "text": "Just here with the people in the comments that never knew Meta was an acronym.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:13:38", "owner": "thatblondeguy90", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18165848812382829, "text": "LFG = looking for group , as LFM -looking for more .", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:07:12", "owner": "glossytoo", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18073895018204329, "text": "Bah, just 8, I am an illiterate on gaming😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:07:12", "owner": "gee_docjueguitos", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17991695225889493, "text": "i always thought LFG was let’s f’ing go", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:05:08", "owner": "nel.sura", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18545532037012102, "text": "LFG = Looking For Group", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:03:15", "owner": "emeraldappa", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18079246618925919, "text": "Meta wasn't originally an acronym", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:59:10", "owner": "shadtowa", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18135878914482280, "text": "AOE= Age Of Extinction", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:56:55", "owner": "anarchyintheuk2025", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17880111003327789, "text": "Tf is she doing on Red Bull gaming? They run out of people?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:55:31", "owner": "hau_5oh", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17941173993010544, "text": "BBC - big black cock", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:48:26", "owner": "koobydoobydo_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17863317789532277, "text": "I thought that was jaidain animation", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:38:29", "owner": "xraytor55", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17900260440335915, "text": "lfg is lets fucking go", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:33:51", "owner": "mariothegreat11", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17936663010102155, "text": "Literally anybody could know ts", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:29:19", "owner": "toxiczombehx", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17978475707944687, "text": "What is she famous for?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:23:27", "owner": "diffionte", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18073323305032537, "text": "Hp = horsepower", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:20:51", "owner": "whoztylerr", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17855422278571139, "text": "AOE is Age of Empires!!! Uolo uolo!!!😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:20:31", "owner": "cvidondo", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17993283269851971, "text": "I wanna see her buttt or boobs . Leave honest this how this society is. Buuut ina different time . What’s your name 🙂‍↕️", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:11:42", "owner": "oscarin815", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17985881471867927, "text": "Is this supposed to be difficult…?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:05:48", "owner": "willoswald", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18095607070861608, "text": "Fuck me, people hating on Emiru just for knowing basic gaming stuff, being a girl online sure is hell.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:04:01", "owner": "thiago.denuni", "likes": 952}, {"id": 18099929479703184, "text": "LAN is not a gaming acronym…", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:59:38", "owner": "kyuubi_music", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18020164061788699, "text": "As a longtime MapleStory player I’m shocked I didn’t get LFG. I remember people saying that in the free market constantly. 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:55:50", "owner": "cure.empress.cos", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18060795359555952, "text": "32 years of gaming...I was there before all those acronyms 🤣🤣🤣 ez answers 😜😜", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:53:18", "owner": "nestor_rp85", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18543007537010448, "text": "To us, the first and second generation of online MMO gamers LFG means looking for group to raid, don't care what the children want to call it now.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:48:54", "owner": "dunnyrega", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18100255072688633, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:45:51", "owner": "itshonz4", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17909361432123850, "text": "AFK= A Free Kill", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:43:05", "owner": "blaqdeath84", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18078457622230400, "text": "Love this@learn a lot today hahahaha", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:40:13", "owner": "hd__campos", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18101807986706640, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:33:41", "owner": "e.huitti", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17869317087472817, "text": "Pokimane doesn't know any of these. 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:30:23", "owner": "astro.nightss", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18072540479034981, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:20:33", "owner": "zphyr0", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18042148664700287, "text": "The fact she plays wow and didn’t know LFG is looking for group 🧐", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:11:14", "owner": "rayceul", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17902010193326625, "text": "I thought lfg was let’s fucking go😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:11:07", "owner": "patrickjiang8", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18176377495323211, "text": "Lfg is looking for group… not game.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:09:37", "owner": "thorvald_torry", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17984511362918287, "text": "Meta isn't an acronym it's an abbreviation for metagame.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:09:26", "owner": "k11keeper", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18087645340793128, "text": "Looking for Guild", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:07:08", "owner": "aldysunjayasugli", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18124618153521314, "text": "Aoe - Age of Empires", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:06:59", "owner": "shizukakageryu", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18317096308217504, "text": "Guys who say they read novels", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:04:30", "owner": "chi_mian53", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18081873545515968, "text": "AFK = A free kill. I said this to gamers who were younger than 25 and they had no clue.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:03:57", "owner": "pale_coconut", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18086480039489433, "text": "we see this bs every other week", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:59:53", "owner": "cosmin_ngy", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18110347612609955, "text": "@kimy_rd", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:58:58", "owner": "pixiedionysus", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18087701425789045, "text": "L", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:56:40", "owner": "vigilantgamingg", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17850596376598668, "text": "Meta blew my mind 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:53:36", "owner": "niko_bellicc98", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18408543736186692, "text": "KYS = y'all know what means 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:51:56", "owner": "cursedbonobo", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18125252992517095, "text": "It's hit points and meta isn't an acronym it just comes from meta knight", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:50:24", "owner": "malnv", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18082053185117794, "text": "Damn, I suck. D.I.S  lol", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:49:51", "owner": "stormednorm", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18065840777627207, "text": "OG?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:48:56", "owner": "v0zx6", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18061368020222755, "text": "What kinda sissy world we live in now when its KDA now instead of KD...", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:48:51", "owner": "spacegiraffe", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17862993507455405, "text": "I would totally hit that", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:41:54", "owner": "dimitris_panteliadis", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17849824818599211, "text": "AOE: Age Of Empires", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:41:10", "owner": "nagit0djentleman", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18048110144423988, "text": "I heard in every Red Bull BTL\"never use energy drinks if you are seating\" and they sponsor e-games 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:40:33", "owner": "angelo.torrelli", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17999932172835171, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:35:37", "owner": "laxlyyyyyyyyyyy", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18118901059550765, "text": "I mean these questions are way too hard. Just ask her what WoW stands for for fuck sake.....", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:23:06", "owner": "sal.aks", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18100040311773371, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:18:58", "owner": "aliev_khazrat", "likes": 12}, {"id": 17954266328902403, "text": "@devika_vraj", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:18:46", "owner": "devajith_surya", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18399705922123710, "text": "CC: Closed captions?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:15:45", "owner": "betyarbence", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18323156266174711, "text": "Old Emiru would be so proud of new Emiru.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:06:48", "owner": "lupo_fiasco", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18351282508163819, "text": "let her meet max", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:05:45", "owner": "cedrictamzq", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17842046754634692, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:02:53", "owner": "duwaynetyrone187", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18047049152447503, "text": "She is so cute", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:00:28", "owner": "alexandriamzo", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18390143155181661, "text": "Wife material right here💪", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:59:39", "owner": "zak_nash_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18084148024843588, "text": "This must be a certified girlfriend exam", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:58:23", "owner": "rauliben94", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17947978950070221, "text": "GG girl!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:53:03", "owner": "casttt", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18043292819686699, "text": "They made the meta one up", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:51:27", "owner": "zenpai_e", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18081291497141387, "text": "gg ez op gf bb", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:48:39", "owner": "library.of.knowledge", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18544300102047436, "text": "Is this the dark wab did I reach it", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:44:22", "owner": "as_ad.ta", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17894338596225436, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:43:17", "owner": "josh.kraatz", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18135487501469803, "text": "AOE = Age of empires 👍🏾", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:42:04", "owner": "luisfrimm", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18084029680860353, "text": "lfg is looking for group", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:40:12", "owner": "salfocusst", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17991572909894448, "text": "Meta 😮", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:37:12", "owner": "noobzilluh_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17893691955360784, "text": "Away from kompiuter", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:31:37", "owner": "lunomertrez", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18086625145817680, "text": "Hit points", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:30:56", "owner": "ailurose_hnote", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18079505591468736, "text": "Bro I thought CC was close captioning", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:30:02", "owner": "grbenvenuti", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18099528229771791, "text": "Looking for group", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:28:33", "owner": "nac_er21", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18374556724152377, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:27:24", "owner": "vonzell.twiy", "likes": 17}, {"id": 18051828908341575, "text": "I thought PvE is player vs enemy '__')", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:26:11", "owner": "kokizzu", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18077442131333582, "text": "Lfg is looking for group", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:22:22", "owner": "vei1side", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17862340278537580, "text": "LFG = Looking for group or Let’s fkin go", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:22:10", "owner": "mr_crowleyyy", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18069446852091152, "text": "Sil", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:20:47", "owner": "stonedan6789", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18551502982024523, "text": "Meta isn't an acronym", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:18:02", "owner": "luke_santana", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18071942564345451, "text": "Nice to see her popularity skyrocket after she orchestrated her own “sexual harassment assault” incident for clout.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:16:59", "owner": "epyon.cris", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18090036286759062, "text": "The only one she got wrong was the one pertaining to her career 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:16:32", "owner": "howiedointoday", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18113254114586302, "text": "Do console players also use AFK?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:14:18", "owner": "scadooshgoat", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18298489282257144, "text": "And you all simp for this frk", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:13:29", "owner": "q_the_continuum_style", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17864079333518557, "text": "Meta is definitely a backronym, so I feel like that one’s cheating  ha", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:11:57", "owner": "bpcready", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17868766236409717, "text": "Zamnnn 🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:11:31", "owner": "1koenn", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18099375934702074, "text": "Huh I always thought cc was closed chat… cause someone told me that once.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:09:19", "owner": "highlands_world", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17989278407892726, "text": "HWDP? Any one?!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:07:19", "owner": "kristof_337", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18099688570800364, "text": "Didn't know all of them either.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:06:48", "owner": "proximax86", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18107844190722708, "text": "“Away from komputer”", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:05:22", "owner": "owothekitten", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17990598446858044, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:04:21", "owner": "midnight13377", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18070532216593919, "text": "Wow. Meta’s an acronym!? Interesting since it’s basically because a word in itself, like games that are built to accomodate a meta-game or not.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:56:10", "owner": "datnerdkid", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18096728986833405, "text": "Why does that btch fake her voice so much?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:54:48", "owner": "kikevlz", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18072650405036713, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:54:12", "owner": "mekhongjunkie", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18246965011289627, "text": "LFT = Looking Fot Team", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:53:55", "owner": "naufal.annafies", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18063800375542363, "text": "I thought PvE was “Player vs Enemy”🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:52:14", "owner": "bobbybonilla", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17947901642929549, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:49:45", "owner": "e92__blacksapphire", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18118283545483749, "text": "U da real acronym", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:46:01", "owner": "uwaisss25", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17989670717907734, "text": "AOE it's fucking age of empires", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:41:31", "owner": "alvaro.scelza", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18141104842454958, "text": "W", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:41:12", "owner": "snorex87", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17911374096257161, "text": "Lfg - let's fkn go?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:41:02", "owner": "dndanime", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18079411265156327, "text": "VIP = very incompetent player", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:37:48", "owner": "mrsteffeng", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17978026028947921, "text": "Lfg🥹", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:36:30", "owner": "acamenzind0311", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18077309645177709, "text": "Always 🗣️🗣️🗿🗿", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:33:43", "owner": "fran.trentin", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18230678509307334, "text": "I always thought META meant Most Expected To Apear", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:33:11", "owner": "__braduljica__", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18072511391598862, "text": "Dork", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:32:41", "owner": "anctax", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18085488425069455, "text": "I thought LFG was let’s fucking go", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:30:27", "owner": "_tofu.exe", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17924228604179577, "text": "I can't stand her voice", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:23:54", "owner": "memes_dekay", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17973193901968011, "text": "E.d.n", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:23:38", "owner": "mikimanua", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18312332374177114, "text": "Astroturfed e celebs", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:22:48", "owner": "the.hammie", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17962697711855955, "text": "i thought it meant lets fucking go", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:17:14", "owner": "usecodemxke", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18119647573558142, "text": "LFG isn't Looking for Group?? 😮", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:11:59", "owner": "ansuca_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18030849293757413, "text": "isn't PVE Player Versus Enemies?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:11:15", "owner": "l_fung_l", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18394219357131102, "text": "I thought pve was player vs enemy", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:09:12", "owner": "presteee", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18373332124157748, "text": "Her voice is nails", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:05:35", "owner": "lurksnitchtongue", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18160287745395994, "text": "Kratingdaeng", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:03:31", "owner": "fris_pratama", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18064682795153338, "text": "She knows her balls for LAN🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:03:20", "owner": "naccarithomas", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17978873897951620, "text": "TLDR", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:00:50", "owner": "everloyaleagle", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18102187051665021, "text": "supercell id?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:59:44", "owner": "ttocs_egros", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18104528869711771, "text": "Why is this red bull? It'd be more appropriate if she was jumping out a plane and her parachute only deployed if she went through this entire list, correctly", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:59:17", "owner": "star_faux64", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18070075481591879, "text": "Pve = player v enemy no?🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:56:24", "owner": "joshwm96", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18050019647386222, "text": "Redbull be partnering with anyone at this point", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:56:23", "owner": "513zj", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17877934497432435, "text": "META! What the hell!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:54:28", "owner": "demonightbrasil", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18071068373598430, "text": "Big news for the unemployed", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:52:43", "owner": "nico134576332", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18075955544218399, "text": "HP is health points? not Hit point?🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:52:03", "owner": "nogami_11", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18049416353679309, "text": "Meta is not an acronym. It's short for metagame, a prefix used by many studies, like metaphilosophy and metaphysics", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:52:00", "owner": "cr.ema", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17926193907181278, "text": "I know she knew them all I jist can't prove it", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:51:47", "owner": "billionairebpromotions", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18057631721554483, "text": "Wait isn’t meta just from the greek used as reflexive over?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:51:02", "owner": "vincentgub98", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18087282952988096, "text": "GOML", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:50:52", "owner": "drumboss", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18094520092889063, "text": "CC = Crouch Cancel", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:50:07", "owner": "j.kiem", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18184404628352995, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:50:04", "owner": "iblamelauti", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18079645957897552, "text": "Aoe ist for me age of empire and ae area effects", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:44:01", "owner": "naroth.44", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18092697511728902, "text": "It's environment? Really? I thought it's enemies 😂 since ever", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:41:42", "owner": "_.basti90._", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17954605508901911, "text": "META means something 🤯🤯🤯", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:40:23", "owner": "didigcunha", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17969587880826963, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:39:49", "owner": "ribblestripes_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18351247660200168, "text": "I thought lfg meant lets form group", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:37:42", "owner": "aestheticrey_v1", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18159890359394625, "text": "hp is hit points, not health points", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:37:25", "owner": "harrysmithh0", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17905069608289362, "text": "Why she talk like she got a gun behind her ?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:36:29", "owner": "auxygen420", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18047766194442340, "text": "Bruh LFG is looking for game? We use it for Let's Fcking Go! 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:36:08", "owner": "xiaopa0", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18069563627600036, "text": "Dream", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:34:58", "owner": "bloe.96", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18069476093593958, "text": "No way meta ia an acronym", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:33:47", "owner": "leo_caetano", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18028583297753239, "text": "I thought it was LETS FKING GOOOOOOO", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:33:11", "owner": "samuelabelhsueh", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18090659090509032, "text": "Looking for group", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:31:12", "owner": "ar7_mn9", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17923539156082797, "text": "Player vs everyone", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:29:46", "owner": "matthew_mcdude", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18049574735393426, "text": "Damn she have a good knowledge, great memory.. Damn..", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:27:48", "owner": "narukami_yuu", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17865603372514696, "text": "Correct answers are Playwr vs Enemy and Non Playable Character. Not sure if this video is rage bait. LFG is also Looking for Group or Let's F***ing Go", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:27:40", "owner": "ftjgamingandtrading", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18064105103399984, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:26:54", "owner": "v_80vox", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17860492224478678, "text": "nasty knees", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:20:38", "owner": "youngserbbb", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17863325121532671, "text": "They really censored the word kill… What is going on with this world.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:18:08", "owner": "ptracey1421", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17848755018606314, "text": "@michiel_slotman area of effect 😔😔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:17:54", "owner": "ijelmer", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18087242075481169, "text": "Lan", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:17:46", "owner": "tavukkomando", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18114116683513907, "text": "Knew them all", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:16:59", "owner": "redice_7777", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18114145492583056, "text": "GG", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:14:20", "owner": "paulhosaka", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17844043950611872, "text": "HP original stood for Hit points. How many hits you can take before game over", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:13:53", "owner": "vertexiver", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18000531587832011, "text": "Grass isn't in the vocabulary", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:13:08", "owner": "gozayan67", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17918906229075421, "text": "looking for group", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:10:55", "owner": "cnkyafikret", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18086130448968193, "text": "GG - Good Girl", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:10:50", "owner": "nj_al_88", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18085849636989789, "text": "AoE will always be Age of Empires!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:09:18", "owner": "hardwarz", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17993407004892812, "text": "God her voice is like nails on a chalkboard", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:08:45", "owner": "somealiennamedevan", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18087145114799184, "text": "And what means PWS", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:07:56", "owner": "noelssffl814", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18106310200726124, "text": "LFG - Let's Fu*kin Go", "created_at": "2025-11-28