AN ACRONYM??", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:21:13", "owner": "haydenlinfoot", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17902889715161202, "text": "pve is player versus entity.....😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:17:04", "owner": "siroj.sarajodin", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17988448805744810, "text": "🤓", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:15:27", "owner": "matthewwmesce", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18133747651483555, "text": "L", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:13:45", "owner": "arpankyuhai", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17879735697329902, "text": "Lfg means let f*** go", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:13:11", "owner": "usamahxkhalifah", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18040925909502104, "text": "I know for a FACT if a guy was doing this all the comments would say “touch grass”", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:13:09", "owner": "will_yaro", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18101381947665987, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:11:41", "owner": "ladylaviniadelflores", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18143492026450599, "text": "Random person says computer words", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:11:39", "owner": "mightyhooch", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17956253712012619, "text": "Fml", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:10:45", "owner": "slim_poole37", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18415126009191082, "text": "Pvp", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:10:33", "owner": "slim_poole37", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17927096250158824, "text": "BET", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:10:25", "owner": "slim_poole37", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17847455751588057, "text": "YCSYAIYA...", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:10:22", "owner": "210cornie", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18077208097969555, "text": "Tmz", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:10:17", "owner": "slim_poole37", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18076808453234896, "text": "GG", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:10:07", "owner": "slim_poole37", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18058094168645947, "text": "GG", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:05:10", "owner": "aminrezaei_i", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18048541247419093, "text": "LFG", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:03:09", "owner": "ali_meli1234ali", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17852801385586967, "text": "Actually npc stands for “non-playable character”", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:02:11", "owner": "yucahuhijuepu", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18144497200451639, "text": "i hate this bitch", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:02:07", "owner": "fuckthisimmashooter_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17867353917489286, "text": "She sounds so socially awkward", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:01:27", "owner": "__hoyle__", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18434136250107938, "text": "Give time between revealing answers so we can pause and guess", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:59:45", "owner": "nicholas.kelly.52459", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18536756386034291, "text": "Meta- means self-referencing. Metagame came from tabletop games where people would “cheat” the game by playing based on knowledge of the game instead of their characters knowledge of the world. It transitioned to gaming as a way of saying they were strategies based on studying game mechanics instead of just playing. The acronym was made up after the fact.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:58:53", "owner": "ryancoin", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18064269875167803, "text": "I thought meta came from meta knight, the best character ever", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:55:39", "owner": "midasfg08", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17989809560857066, "text": "CC is \nchange Chanel", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:55:18", "owner": "locisraelite_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18299911819280533, "text": "PVE is Player vs. Engine, no?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:53:53", "owner": "brauer009", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18210848092313841, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:52:27", "owner": "chupryna_yevhen", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18040881572708476, "text": "Isn't HP \"hit points\"?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:48:07", "owner": "ezekiel_zeze", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17979914612940880, "text": "NGL, I thought CC=Closed Captions", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:47:30", "owner": "hi_im_dacs", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17931800070116361, "text": "But what does LFG mean", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:45:28", "owner": "oncecharlie_98", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18011389121641874, "text": "But, every even sleight gamer already knows these right?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:44:37", "owner": "richard_verbeek1986", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18076486184216885, "text": "Watch out she might assault u by tossing a 25g plushie at u...", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:41:21", "owner": "imsuperfunny", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18051396479345327, "text": "I want to lick her knees", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:41:21", "owner": "poopypoupoop", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18422671495112695, "text": "TTK would have been a good one", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:38:08", "owner": "cryten56", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17952870102025160, "text": "🤣🤣🤣thinks its hilarious redbull has a gaming team 🤦‍♂️,cuz gaming is so extreme", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:36:43", "owner": "mattsylasix", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18071949527582141, "text": "Looking for group/guild", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:33:09", "owner": "brhezckxo", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17984137310760739, "text": "But if a male did this yall would call him an incel 🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:27:33", "owner": "vinbins22", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18075128024206537, "text": "EZ", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:24:05", "owner": "dhamedb", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17909395521124189, "text": "Wait, health points or hit points?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:22:22", "owner": "andrumdz", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18138207817457666, "text": "Yall forgot \"BRB\" be right back ( I am teal gamer )🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:21:46", "owner": "nottt_st3f4n", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18084659546092527, "text": "LFG is Looking for GROUP", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:21:43", "owner": "calicohiggins", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18086798050815856, "text": "Damn well many of em are really easy and everyone knows them like BRB(be right back),AFK,HP,FOV,PvE", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:20:45", "owner": "nottt_st3f4n", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18177605011367973, "text": "LFG = looking for group? 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:20:19", "owner": "nickomy_81", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18051053000374723, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:19:26", "owner": "fabian_chile", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17851428057595449, "text": "P2W🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:18:11", "owner": "lucascimerak", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18031869737534067, "text": "GFG", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:15:56", "owner": "since90three", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18298982800259340, "text": "This so nerdish lol😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:13:23", "owner": "leonardwatchesyou", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18133013203488190, "text": "BM.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:13:19", "owner": "delperrosinlengua", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18105830041564135, "text": "LFG is also looking for group", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:12:28", "owner": "taneltilts", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18087134159003884, "text": "EZ.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:12:14", "owner": "delperrosinlengua", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18085505426316863, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:10:00", "owner": "charliexx1016", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18275122039304388, "text": "Idk Why and How But I've said all of them 😭👍", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:09:12", "owner": "surtalogi.79", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18062364068208664, "text": "\"Good luck have fun\" ? What the fuck is that? Who the hell people told this shit?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:02:01", "owner": "mehrdad_z_n", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18058742747289211, "text": "Health or hit points", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:01:34", "owner": "ch3353p1zz464", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18093699091709992, "text": "K/DA - uhm AINT NOBODY BRINGING US DOWN DOWN DOWN 🗣🗣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:57:18", "owner": "chriskaribik", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18069086951581197, "text": "Ok girl🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:54:34", "owner": "vidgamechx", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17847614388610351, "text": "I thought AoE meant Age Of Empires. Damn! I'm old", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:54:29", "owner": "archivo_41", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18115603783579056, "text": "Meta is not an acronym", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:53:34", "owner": "brok3npacman", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17980903307937904, "text": "She looks normal here", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:53:15", "owner": "craig.peterson", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18166188778348804, "text": "She speaks at 5x speed", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:50:28", "owner": "ducavzla", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18164040856384070, "text": "HP= Hit Points?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:50:24", "owner": "topers09", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17949598650026727, "text": "Closed captions", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:46:33", "owner": "absterrancheweyse.spammmmmmton", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18057649388635792, "text": "Red bull we need athlete representation of your incredible company 👏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:35:21", "owner": "gnarlsharlz", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18084353063105015, "text": "KBAF", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:32:26", "owner": "zsolti1976323", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18076643300217330, "text": "Had no idea meta was an acronym", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:32:09", "owner": "_pedr0pou_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18341495524224565, "text": "Why she talk like that", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:26:43", "owner": "doeboi_ry", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17978588147942120, "text": "Why does she talk like that", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:25:17", "owner": "versacingtonn", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18074398448360457, "text": "\"Meta\" is not an acronym. It is short for \"metagaming\" where you are trying to determine the most efficient/effective strategy in a game.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:24:59", "owner": "talbright1229", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18142025032444127, "text": "META is an acronym???", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:24:34", "owner": "pixel.is.panicking", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17927245833170200, "text": "Idk. I just use all of em without knowing the full form", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:23:40", "owner": "_.kholilur.__.rahman._", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18436224817100666, "text": "I fell in love 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:20:44", "owner": "mozes_lamour", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17885730915403648, "text": "La llevaré a casa con mamá.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:17:06", "owner": "oscar.arosas", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18538933381048567, "text": "careful about asking her another question, she might take you to court", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:16:37", "owner": "goukifafa", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17912281506249973, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:15:58", "owner": "highismysober", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18147083830438838, "text": "META is NOT an acronym. It comes from metagame... Any attempt to turn it into one is revisionist", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:14:14", "owner": "jonx1171", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18086080297819333, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:13:34", "owner": "fadelfirdausb", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18068259764455197, "text": "I thought she was in a recovery after the rape", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:12:54", "owner": "mmmalexandr", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18320490385216966, "text": "Wellllllllll that's a lot of infos I'll save this", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:09:24", "owner": "74died", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17867668899484765, "text": "Nice 👍", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:07:08", "owner": "noah_s_01", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18035016296520157, "text": "Am i the only one who said Age of Empire for AOE", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:06:51", "owner": "solidsora15", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17928943116149251, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:05:45", "owner": "elf_mo_chan", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18159633562400444, "text": "Lfg 'looking for group' not game", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:04:25", "owner": "chris_deckerty", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18135255943466480, "text": "Lfg looking for group .", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:02:40", "owner": "mercejoe", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18099290986809784, "text": "Her make up is too extreme 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:02:15", "owner": "jetxplane", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18112354561606335, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:58:48", "owner": "valentinus_1", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18061303940219206, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:58:16", "owner": "billycuster", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17971861607971359, "text": "LFG = Looking for group", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:57:37", "owner": "bubblicious_leo", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17936643060101073, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:56:56", "owner": "low510", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18540657079005939, "text": "CC = Change Channel ifykyk", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:56:53", "owner": "unkle617", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18104561290733302, "text": "LFG lets fucking go", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:55:15", "owner": "0xneves", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18147782782438588, "text": "Disk Locked Cotent :(", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:52:40", "owner": "lv_meteostrike", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17870203128393299, "text": "Funny knees", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:50:36", "owner": "omarkhaldi9999", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17864648067522134, "text": "HANK, HANK WAIT. HANK IT MEANS HIT POINTS NOT HEALTH POINTS HANK!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:47:34", "owner": "x.wild.goose.chase.x", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17982752477923868, "text": "Yeah LAN. Totally a Gamer word", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:47:08", "owner": "leh_dennis", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18398874238127417, "text": "Aoe for me will forever be Age of Empires 🤣 although i know area of effect if taking about non game specific acronyms", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:45:04", "owner": "b.g.o.m.e.s", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18081712865027030, "text": "Omfg i hate her", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:44:59", "owner": "grimesfanandlover", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17910550188257380, "text": "Hp is generally known as Hit Points. Because of old games", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:44:29", "owner": "alper_kusg", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18098579830796723, "text": "I know all these but i also dont know all these", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:39:19", "owner": "p1edythenolife", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18383965492144823, "text": "LFG is lets fuhhing go", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:37:49", "owner": "uniemirate_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18090373150935061, "text": "🧍🏿‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:33:19", "owner": "tovarisch._", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17971017053963148, "text": "LFG= looking for group", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:31:42", "owner": "zeonmorrow", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18083941412088356, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:31:21", "owner": "tomi__mj", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17971550063813454, "text": "LFG Let's Fucking Goooo", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:31:08", "owner": "maesterchi", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18189216346337478, "text": "Cuttttteeeeee 😍😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:29:30", "owner": "piinky.626", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18107908270626130, "text": "I thought meta came from metaphysic help- 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:28:09", "owner": "kuradamai", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18075716186223878, "text": "LFG its a WWE thing for discover new superstar", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:27:27", "owner": "docmlk_rengo", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18070071665593957, "text": "I never knew about the meta one", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:27:01", "owner": "cwjimmy", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18080443076138063, "text": "Why LAN in this list?🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:21:31", "owner": "_alessio_la_torre_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17860970874544817, "text": "💍", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:19:03", "owner": "daliancat", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17852301780545436, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:15:47", "owner": "banksterbeats", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17882600529302800, "text": "she's good", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:15:39", "owner": "voydkid", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18419758246115461, "text": "‘Meta’ was the only one that was actually an acronym.. (pronounced like a word, not saying the letters). Every other one was an initialism…", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:15:30", "owner": "mattj448", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18179240557317806, "text": "i hate her voice", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:15:26", "owner": "dawsonbackup2", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17921726562191953, "text": "LFG is looking for group", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:14:18", "owner": "ianbill123", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18081411866278738, "text": "Hp is hit points", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:12:52", "owner": "brady_ydarb", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17972816519805942, "text": "F1", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:12:46", "owner": "feriancek.j", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18086327392997223, "text": "Looking for group *", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:10:03", "owner": "broken_failsafe", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17907960135272871, "text": "I missed a Few", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:08:12", "owner": "getpwnd420", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18068065874456756, "text": "Hp is hit point not health points", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:07:55", "owner": "vittoxx_._", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18010698089643687, "text": "Haygvskiaiqllejjsiaiqoqkjebqyumqkoroajnq", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:06:59", "owner": "karinolingling", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17871359439466126, "text": "I thought pve meant player versus everyone 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:01:23", "owner": "dianaelena.333", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18164778880381034, "text": "Hi lol", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:56:48", "owner": "ates.avu", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18100436188695547, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:54:12", "owner": "anmol.pixelated", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17986789739751260, "text": "i thought “Let’s Fuckin Go” 😢😭😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:53:32", "owner": "0xseraphim_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18019894457792360, "text": "Those knees", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:52:58", "owner": "subpar_reels_user", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18291788161272402, "text": "Nerd", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:52:50", "owner": "eirikahansen", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18048839285415017, "text": "I was thinking that Meta is from Metamorph.... Weww I mean, meta always change and it's always a.. a.. always.. whatever", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:52:43", "owner": "abe_joga", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18105816226567458, "text": "Got all correct. I feel like I'm living in a virtual world more than the \"real\" world.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:51:39", "owner": "fotindonl", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17899739115183950, "text": "this gave me cancer", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:50:37", "owner": "jjjburke", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18548838622033847, "text": "She has more views the Mizkif", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:49:00", "owner": "joewrx", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17857707873558580, "text": "LOL = TOLOL 🤓", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:48:46", "owner": "fazrirahmadrisky", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18184322233344080, "text": "She is the GAME", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:48:39", "owner": "kaqanl", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17987610821908853, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:46:32", "owner": "leemontell", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18064410284395992, "text": "She’s definitely on my LOS 👀", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:45:46", "owner": "sm_ckbk10", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18351421162160819, "text": "While meta CAN be an acronym, my first association with it even in gaming culture is like the Greek root, meaning \"everything\" or \"overarching\" as in what strategies are everywhere or what are the most ubiquitous strategies or builds.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:45:34", "owner": "that_one_other_piano_guy", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18347246347204268, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:45:04", "owner": "cubuk_kraker10", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18084015989043593, "text": "Nerd", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:37:29", "owner": "limlamliammm", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17902654860167595, "text": "How can people stand this grown ass woman?? She is like 30 and act 14 + dresses up as anime characters, never had a job etc etc… she is the type that trump need to deport", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:36:47", "owner": "kristoffersen98gk", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18103628011876138, "text": "That voice sucks.  I said what I said.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:35:06", "owner": "cookies.jason", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18381755635148258, "text": "AFK a free kill", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:33:06", "owner": "daguy666", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17966135876843038, "text": "Annoying ass voice", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:32:51", "owner": "dan_omar95", "likes": 32}, {"id": 18033125276530371, "text": "I thought AOE was Age of Empires 😮", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:32:44", "owner": "farid_fakhrudin", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18105951622577187, "text": "I'm in love", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:29:10", "owner": "themis.sp", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18415101553140836, "text": "Meta is a backronym, it just comes from ''metagame'' as in analyzing what people are playing rather than analyzing the game itself. That's a meta-analysis", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:28:43", "owner": "james.veenh", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17844857970618709, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:26:04", "owner": "max664410", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18029929670555195, "text": "Why does she talk with her teeth closed", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:22:59", "owner": "1slow_fb6", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18024787322592571, "text": "Meta means ... Insta fb whatsapp", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:22:10", "owner": "berlin_fedrick", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18017664245619699, "text": "LFG Let's Fucking go🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:21:52", "owner": "ucupxd_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18352032979205810, "text": "overwatch taught me these 😭❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:21:39", "owner": "z.af", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18091718711307586, "text": "That meta shit is fake, it means meta game", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:20:44", "owner": "slamjamuels", "likes": 19}, {"id": 18084109034474289, "text": "As someone who has friends and family who game, but doesn’t and cannot, I appreciate this video sooo much. I need to understand!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:18:08", "owner": "kaheryn", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17989026458888163, "text": "I only know HDMI , ummm in a cable", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:17:12", "owner": "shonshon.farrelly", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18086547622961665, "text": "0/17 btw", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:15:37", "owner": "v.i.c.t.o.r_0_", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18084711848319217, "text": "Technically HP is \"hit points\"", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:15:01", "owner": "rudeandasuperhero", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18174809173369895, "text": "She is good tbh", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:14:57", "owner": "claudiooor", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17973468881807036, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:14:04", "owner": "abgoodbye", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18146052013440423, "text": "Bu abla birimi", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:13:49", "owner": "corleoneml", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18159568015396158, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:12:55", "owner": "copionisherel0l", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18049993085386140, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:12:30", "owner": "erdemsamaa", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18002129492683382, "text": "Kdr", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:12:05", "owner": "chrishanne85", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18114336802503784, "text": "I'm not sure Meta refers to that. It could also be meta-game, as in, the game within the game", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:10:09", "owner": "the_krill_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17929839951014316, "text": "Hi", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:08:37", "owner": "2093laksh", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18087065458816774, "text": "Don’t make stupid people famous next year guys please.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:07:41", "owner": "theunknowncollector92", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17873555436378773, "text": "Why she sounds like alcohol is her friend for ages 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:07:41", "owner": "david_serum", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17928491931150879, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:05:51", "owner": "plaisentt", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17938617381098562, "text": "AoE = Age Of Empires 🤦 LAN = Lan party not lan itself... ROFLMAO LLAMA 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:03:33", "owner": "sargento_duke", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18099836356774077, "text": "Meta acronym was made up much later. Its origin is Greek and other words like metaphysics or metatheory have existed", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:02:52", "owner": "devinitely_me_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17988987935750429, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:02:03", "owner": "the_tym67", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18145347550438257, "text": "Whys this bih on redbull", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:00:28", "owner": "hellacookt", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18542857552057680, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:59:47", "owner": "amitmusicman", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18105662152654621, "text": "LFG here 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:58:39", "owner": "crazykatjie_gaming1996", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17844003915612711, "text": "I thought this woman was a robot from the thumbnail.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:56:40", "owner": "medlin._c", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18320376079173137, "text": "🍻", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:54:43", "owner": "wirasastika", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17901002571324520, "text": "DSP guess", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:53:33", "owner": "sarahabby25", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18115686682560763, "text": "Get her off my feeds gross", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:48:16", "owner": "flaymeyawn", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17985783644866747, "text": "Technically I'm pretty sure meta is a backronym, like it didn't originally stand for something but was made to later", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:46:57", "owner": "blake7hunter", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17894478699219809, "text": "cc isnt it copy crosshair 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:37:08", "owner": "kapukakee", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17921088015194327, "text": "“Meta” is not an acronym. https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Meta_(prefix)", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:36:19", "owner": "edina.lewis", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18079892455926002, "text": "U da real art", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:35:55", "owner": "mikehawk3628", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18082213816889448, "text": "Diluc Paling Sakit.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:34:58", "owner": "kurisin4", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18134116057469673, "text": "Let's f**king gooo", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:32:18", "owner": "yash_chetan", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17907481296269361, "text": "HP is Hit Points", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:27:11", "owner": "ohsnapimtheking", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18072321044198410, "text": "LFG is looking for group", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:23:53", "owner": "corey_bradshaw2", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18111894064595077, "text": "Away from kompu…. Keyboard 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:22:21", "owner": "3rg_alooy_18", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17943042939085863, "text": "She's built like a foot", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:22:15", "owner": "imworkingondying999", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18096460891883961, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:21:35", "owner": "2xkh5", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18102461899663072, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:20:51", "owner": "erisvaldomarinho", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17975975441950262, "text": "It’s not a problem that meta exists as a backronym, it’s just disingenuous to list it alongside things that are purely acronyms", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:20:24", "owner": "kevinmcgowanii", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17972954717798103, "text": "Today i learned meta is an acronym", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:19:42", "owner": "cournbeef", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18049841642388741, "text": "Is redbull this desperate for content😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:19:09", "owner": "dank3rton", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17842846053629143, "text": "We can see in the comments the generation inventing the META-gaming ant the others 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:18:45", "owner": "riccardofromtuscany", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17886709134402723, "text": "Why did I say horse power💀🙏🏾", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:15:23", "owner": "zweli.guy", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18046014974478623, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:14:37", "owner": "leeyurieel", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18064096103543286, "text": "Meta ain’t and acronym. It’s whatever the Asian kids are doing", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:11:25", "owner": "aa._.ron", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18118396243557752, "text": "Nigga ?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:11:16", "owner": "___brahiimm___", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17905642380142225, "text": "Only got half right. I feel terrible lol", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:07:09", "owner": "stevenring105", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17886239238402754, "text": "Illustration of gender equality in Red Bull events by the way", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:06:16", "owner": "oleh_nechai", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17989257656907244, "text": "I thought Meta was from Metaknight from Smash Bros", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:05:48", "owner": "gabrielcavalcanti06", "likes": 23}, {"id": 18068493545526425, "text": "Why her voice always so shaky", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:03:18", "owner": "dr.octopussssss", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18101521690708148, "text": "cc can also be used for character creation", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:02:30", "owner": "axel.sango", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17922751215189536, "text": "GG", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:01:46", "owner": "santos.relampagos", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18086166188053746, "text": "HP is hit points and pve is player versus entity?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:00:30", "owner": "a7_md636", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18047704214452279, "text": "Wasn't LFG = looking for group? Kinda same meaning though.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:58:56", "owner": "thejoshumitsu", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18105952315654090, "text": "LFG = looking for group \n\nWow raids had me looking for group", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:58:32", "owner": "jimkallis", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17914842132235979, "text": "CC = Control Center", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:57:59", "owner": "aoibara.777", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17921849157057623, "text": "A brain cell of mine dies when ppl ask for DD but announce DPS 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:57:40", "owner": "_ianmorn", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17953740225022549, "text": "Meta is not an acronym, it’s derived from metagaming", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:56:54", "owner": "goksuyildirim", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17869254732474014, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:56:45", "owner": "slamsotf", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18051012944375012, "text": "Why don’t u use all this knowledge for a job or something 🥀", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:53:57", "owner": "kj4_12", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17981770910924192, "text": "Looking for group", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:51:38", "owner": "unusual_steeze", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17851738275594309, "text": "Man i only know 5...", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:50:41", "owner": "sphiabeau", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18551350006039583, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:50:32", "owner": "pheng_pagong3", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18054815171333408, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:47:47", "owner": "karl_3261", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18077251175522067, "text": "Isnt hp hitpoint?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:47:08", "owner": "simplyfori", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18048923393419805, "text": "LFG in wow / looking for group", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:45:04", "owner": "thejuraidan", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18068551079526877, "text": "I might need to touch grass😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:40:43", "owner": "leonardo.sabatinii", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18147390349376362, "text": "Wasnt she SA'd in twitchcon? Btw she filo", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:37:55", "owner": "fisheater50003", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18085618517078562, "text": "PVE i thought it's entity", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:37:06", "owner": "dakilamandy", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18330632440208816, "text": "My god META is actually an acronym!?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:34:53", "owner": "just._.wyh", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18005155157669625, "text": "LFG for me is \"LETSSS FUCKING GOOOO\" lmao", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:32:30", "owner": "hxlyghst", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17903706228293597, "text": "Lfg is 'let's fucking go'", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:31:31", "owner": "__llololol", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18378595015197777, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:28:02", "owner": "dontezimo", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18109244185722267, "text": "No, “meta” (the English word) is not an acronym.\nIt comes directly from Ancient Greek:\nμέτα (meta) is a preposition/adverb/prefix meaning “after,” “beyond,” “with,” “among,” or “transcending,” depending on context.\nIt entered English through Greek philosophy and science (e.g., Aristotle’s “Metaphysics” = the books placed “after the Physics” in his works, later interpreted as “beyond physics”).\nToday we use it as:\na prefix (metadata, metamorphosis, metacognition)\nan adjective (a meta joke, meta-analysis)\na standalone term, especially in internet culture (“this is so meta” = self-referential).\nIt has never been an acronym and does not stand for any set of words. It’s just a borrowed Greek word/prefix.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:26:55", "owner": "_ollielaroche", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18432279571108563, "text": "BIS", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:19:14", "owner": "mariusd97", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18087748603799396, "text": "Damn… ich zocke seit ich 4 Jahre alt bin und ich kannte nichts davon…", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:17:49", "owner": "_samuel_albrecht_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18124267444512916, "text": "Знаю все эти аббревиатуры и что они значат но не на Английском языке 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:16:52", "owner": "huseyn.kim", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18246774928288376, "text": "Isn't PVE Player vs Entity. In that Case Entitys are often non-playable Charakters also called NPCs?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:15:04", "owner": "imperionmagnum", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17971778573813760, "text": "Meta isn’t an acronym. It comes from “metagaming”", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:12:43", "owner": "itsgarwood", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18073139861052755, "text": "I'm", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:08:39", "owner": "johnny5_uk", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18111818701597622, "text": "Cc is change channel in maple story", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:56:28", "owner": "purecoolnesss", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18057352184302791, "text": "I saw the short form of HP and went in my head \"oh yeah that's HP\" hit points are no longer called hit points 🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:50:17", "owner": "k_mutyala8239", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17870620941470188, "text": "FPS - frames per second or first person shooter??", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:45:52", "owner": "lotuz.dk", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18161014594396602, "text": "K. Y. S.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:45:12", "owner": "markhor_51", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18077952871953064, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:44:33", "owner": "nizar_2611", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17931941022132778, "text": "Looking for group is what I thought it was", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:44:33", "owner": "dylanthedoc", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17977734881791827, "text": "Z.........b...... ?!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:43:31", "owner": "mrwnmrwn2653", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18138409879411531, "text": "Emiru, yes but.... scheiß red bull! Scheiß red bull! Scheiß red bull!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:41:30", "owner": "jp_gamerboy", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18198692917324715, "text": "Cuma di Indo kalau LOL itu tolol, apalagi di game ml😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:37:46", "owner": "ihsanh.h", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18051428120661178, "text": "Meta nerd", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:37:15", "owner": "ceo_wells", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18104528167662199, "text": "Flash long", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:34:25", "owner": "scareliage_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18392997292178253, "text": "Meta actually wasn't orignally an acronym but came from the shortening of metagame which comes from the greek word meta", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:34:23", "owner": "silversreallycoolaccount", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17974532081955587, "text": "A long \n\nB long", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:34:17", "owner": "scareliage_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17891117715379562, "text": "She's good 😮", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:33:55", "owner": "majeed47.69", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18210392521313767, "text": "Meta was not originally an acroynym. That's something they came up with after the fact. Meta means the game outside of the game.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:31:50", "owner": "adamjgoncalves", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18183547801348437, "text": "Cc is clan chat in osrs", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:25:57", "owner": "letsfistfight", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18331304995208967, "text": "Pffft AOE is age of empires, only OGs know that", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:21:37", "owner": "smoothlikebuttah", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18002427818829395, "text": "LFG : LET'S FCKIN GOOOOOO!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:19:27", "owner": "xhan_gd", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18064324829169063, "text": "Lfg looking for group", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:17:02", "owner": "nunnuk4", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18135381874479265, "text": "Wow META!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:16:56", "owner": "myshawshaw", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17967681041834055, "text": "I thought op is outplay", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:16:24", "owner": "willson__mangang_10", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18105326035658487, "text": "Lfg is not looking for game. Its looking for group you fucking idiots", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:15:30", "owner": "bananabatman", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18080781572117331, "text": "LFG - Looking For Group", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:11:56", "owner": "internal1059", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18026193731583399, "text": "Player vs Enemy pve ( enemy = bots, cpu )\nPlayer vs player pvp", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:10:43", "owner": "ash_isactive", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18167081113376085, "text": "Cc not crit chance?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:05:03", "owner": "undead_bran011", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18088855802503839, "text": "Aoe wil forever be age of Empires for me", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:02:53", "owner": "bamiworst1", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18083479508086541, "text": "Player vs enemy….", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:02:39", "owner": "4050cked", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17882329413305801, "text": "Afk has meaning??", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:01:35", "owner": "miokuka", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17962060059007282, "text": "What a true casual lolol", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:58:59", "owner": "otakulifts", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17882355558311265, "text": "her voice pmo sm", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:57:52", "owner": "george07z", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18382995073148852, "text": "There's redbull gaming???!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:55:57", "owner": "aayush_bbg", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18319668157171668, "text": "Wait.. this is REDBULL", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:48:44", "owner": "reelspredator", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17857740837503959, "text": "cc for me means custom content", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:46:24", "owner": "foxeybear", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17988482051744922, "text": "ez", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:41:35", "owner": "raph.gav", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18057983897302743, "text": "nkt me thinking pve = player vs enemy😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:41:14", "owner": "rylix_04", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17997755261702235, "text": "Yo those knees are 80 years old", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:41:03", "owner": "joshuasmith7366", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17849568471599765, "text": "Wtf is player vs environment", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:39:41", "owner": "mickeymouse8898", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17966895827999690, "text": "Holy aura", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:37:54", "owner": "r._.0ulll", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17986868162874603, "text": "GG", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:35:57", "owner": "robert453729", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18004308899675792, "text": "KDA is Kill Death Aspect", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:34:42", "owner": "matang_9112001", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18144716359445797, "text": "SYBAU?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:33:55", "owner": "ssaaajed", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17859541335486160, "text": "Lfg=live for god✝️", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:27:47", "owner": "roopetakanen", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18106531705652841, "text": "Lfg is looking for group", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:21:45", "owner": "hoelti_92", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17922904413189562, "text": "@redbullfrance Vous savez que notre Dieu Français @thegreatreview_ est imbattable donc vous préparez des internationaux pour essayer de lui trouver un vrai concurrent ? 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:15:03", "owner": "mrguims", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18434494903107277, "text": "CC is Crystal Castles 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:11:40", "owner": "xmelazx", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18087604390801396, "text": "kda will always be kill to death avg to me,  idgaf what anyone says", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:07:42", "owner": "scooby_doobage", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18011984147684921, "text": "Looking for group ? Not for game", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:07:32", "owner": "kazanovus", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17950079024915149, "text": "I thought Meta was like fkin latin or smth", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:05:51", "owner": "adenan5", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18132074293491923, "text": "People who actively watch this shit scare me", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:05:06", "owner": "joshua55573", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18051505385688246, "text": "META IS NOT AN ACRONYM", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:01:04", "owner": "michaeltrantrantran", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18071048570358634, "text": "PvE Player vs Enemy", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:54:43", "owner": "tcmmkcco", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18048919814680231, "text": "i thought PVE was player vs Entity", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:48:36", "owner": "bornsinner.est", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18340298665233847, "text": "Me thinking CC is Carbon Copy 🤦‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:47:12", "owner": "harddancelife", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17986212431750807, "text": "Hey rick......", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:44:53", "owner": "paicarlos2024", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18026131109775698, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:42:28", "owner": "umbrellacorp04", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17975880035953449, "text": "cc=cubic centimeters", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:40:41", "owner": "andrei.6942o", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18380286205149625, "text": "Calling cc content creator and not crit chance is crazy", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:38:53", "owner": "woodyywk", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18095845282876637, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:36:35", "owner": "itz_aymoon_", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18065118455161383, "text": "meta acronym is created after, so this is stupid", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:32:12", "owner": "rice.webm", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18116774809565772, "text": "Meta isn’t an acronym and she’s very autistic 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:31:55", "owner": "croxley.jones", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18127473955452015, "text": "Ain't HP = Hit Point", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:30:19", "owner": "shinigami_10_", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17936454561100830, "text": "HP is Hit Point", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:29:30", "owner": "safarli_rustam", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17866062546504442, "text": "I like her voice, where the sub button", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:28:10", "owner": "dunno.mg", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17884985772404820, "text": "HP is technically hit points although the definition fits with 'health'", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:27:57", "owner": "alicatwashere", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18193364362333705, "text": "Lfg is looking for group, smh", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:26:41", "owner": "sergeantracoon", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18075012542349203, "text": "There’s literally 0 people on this planet that knew meta is an acronym. It’s like saying “girl” is an acronym for “guys in real life”. Meta in any context means the ultimate goal, the objective  to achieve, and in gaming it was being the most efficient way to play to achieve said objective", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:25:01", "owner": "vitor.s.oliveira", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18085228229053069, "text": "Im 36, been gaming all my life, even do content on youtube and twitch and i only knew about half of these", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:22:33", "owner": "deadbadgeryt", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18513281284069908, "text": "LFG means LETS FUCKING GOOOOOO!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:22:19", "owner": "bubbliciouskiss", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18075004016214346, "text": "health point is wrong", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:20:57", "owner": "x1z_1x", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18081665803882106, "text": "WRONG. Hit points***", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:16:58", "owner": "rebelwithacoz", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18075342646989532, "text": "Meta in fact is not an acronym", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:15:13", "owner": "manub66_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17948506482062384, "text": "Lfg = looking for gooners", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:11:32", "owner": "thienfu.bui", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17944567107065641, "text": "Non-Playable Character", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:07:37", "owner": "sp.louie", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17950206074915458, "text": "lmao", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:05:29", "owner": "jdudhduddhfh252524", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18063252863187775, "text": "Meta wasn't an acronym - at least originally", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:04:03", "owner": "rufertino", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18088335001783969, "text": "I grew up with lfg meaning looking for group", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:02:39", "owner": "andrei9327", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17990614118737229, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:59:01", "owner": "__schmidth", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18081231872319540, "text": "Why are we censoring kill now", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:55:59", "owner": "bap.hmet", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17955836403037142, "text": "Meta is a backronym", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:55:48", "owner": "ryanrexus", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18080997896155878, "text": "I KNEW what AFK was but didn’t ACTUALLY know what it was until today 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:55:30", "owner": "cyruspan", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17977984112933412, "text": "Meta is not an acronym, it's a fake acronym", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:54:06", "owner": "leon12345332", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18124480162518330, "text": "Our shut in streamer gamer girl’s time to shine!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:52:54", "owner": "hangthewitch", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17902295217316784, "text": "NHK?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:50:32", "owner": "jigarn1", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17896653384350747, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:47:13", "owner": "clashthegoat22", "likes": 50}, {"id": 18004949183670177, "text": "Nah bro cc is engine displacement", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:45:51", "owner": "tono_tekel", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18065050823577640, "text": "Meta to me was most efficient tactical archetype xd", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:42:42", "owner": "faops", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18182245438355569, "text": "Cringe.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:32:41", "owner": "shra.the.bunny", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17954293163900453, "text": "Brb", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:31:57", "owner": "elishane_03", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17971266908971320, "text": "I thought LFG = Lets fucking goooo", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:31:25", "owner": "weeb_kazuma", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18105072841630237, "text": "COD", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:30:33", "owner": "bahramsmoke", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18133260871430769, "text": "Bro I never heard meta used as an acronym before, but she crushed the rest!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:24:41", "owner": "prophesorchaos", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17891650029373081, "text": "Penny to Sheldon: Oh I See", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:22:24", "owner": "alwathq.shawkt", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18143995081455793, "text": "Her legs are so weird!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:16:50", "owner": "florin_catrina", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17992126622894797, "text": "PVE = Player Vs monstEr 🗿", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:15:42", "owner": "brryfrmnn", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18419465164118596, "text": "Biggest nerd", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:14:48", "owner": "pvl_bn", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18088848044499117, "text": "başarılı", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:14:37", "owner": "heimgame", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17882864643419367, "text": "Crazy the difference in comments when tenz answers and Emi answers. Didn’t know girls knowing gaming terms/being a game streamer was so bad? 😂 leave her alone dam", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:10:32", "owner": "akikiax", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18084632651065320, "text": "Why are her knees like that", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:03:49", "owner": "donttripchipchip", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18105754750712151, "text": "Bro redbull doing everything other that his products just in case they put a can in her hand😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:01:44", "owner": "azriel_libertin", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17926130355176500, "text": "MOBA", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:58:24", "owner": "ashwin.vardhan", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17901753990322663, "text": "Esta vez no la quisieron besar😘😘?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:55:49", "owner": "luis_lumiran", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18083468399091352, "text": "As a 21 years wow player , LFG is looking for group , WTB is want to buy,  WTT is want to trade , WTS is want to sell , OS is out of sight , KS is kill steal , Ninja .. DKP .... OOM .. agro .... LOM ... MT ...OT ...and much more!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:54:47", "owner": "hbkalache", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18082482026026769, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:54:35", "owner": "artist_muz1", "likes": 21}, {"id": 18098426422694252, "text": "META IS AN ACRONYM?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:53:49", "owner": "bernard.wj", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17977471472791787, "text": "She must spend a lot of time on her knees", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:52:15", "owner": "ashcan.g", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17976177302793488, "text": "I always thought meta was Most Effective Tool Available", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:51:46", "owner": "hoodini_47_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17889612849388113, "text": "Why you need to censor kill ? wtf", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:51:28", "owner": "yngvarthenord", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18094711048894827, "text": "Why are people hating on her for the way she talks wtf😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:49:03", "owner": "yfnhspider_man", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18117479086485169, "text": "Why does she stand so embarrassed😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:48:17", "owner": "32137150", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18171750109333061, "text": "Thank you for the META one, I didnt know it was an acronym ngl", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:45:47", "owner": "mfbahri_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18146027281439603, "text": "I said Hardpoint for HP", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:44:53", "owner": "fiction_is_way_better", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17850249339565148, "text": "This is genuinely sad", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:43:16", "owner": "sosa.b4ngb4ng", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18061880810212664, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:42:25", "owner": "michael10101993", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17876420565442637, "text": "I relate to the \"looking for girlfriend\"  LFG", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:41:50", "owner": "aio.nix", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18096261346866793, "text": "Red bull athlete", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:39:16", "owner": "bakedyodi", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17946441554938505, "text": "Ngl :  niggas gonna love.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:32:54", "owner": "alex_dggo", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17933093388129204, "text": "Is she playing cooking simulator?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:30:29", "owner": "rok.k011", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18548461639046756, "text": "NERD", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:30:20", "owner": "trippy_treeko18", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17932083741113704, "text": "I'm old enough to remember PVE was player vs enemy", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:26:54", "owner": "anicade64", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18084352637102824, "text": "HP is actually Hit Points", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:22:43", "owner": "pb_rmentorz", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17969730080823576, "text": "DLC? STRAY KIDS MENTIONED?! DANCE LIKE CRAZY?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:20:48", "owner": "roxytu2002", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18096585643875559, "text": "As some others have noted, meta is not an acronym. The use given in the video is a false etymology or a \"backronym\". Meta comes from \"metagame\" meaning \"beyond the game,\" with the Greek prefix \"meta\" meaning \"beyond.\" This is the same as in the term metaphysics, referring to things beyond the physical world like spirituality. The use in the term metagame refers to elements relevant to the game that are beyond the game rules themselves and the player actions within the game.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:15:04", "owner": "prettyprincessrobin", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18432057886110618, "text": "LFG? Let’s fucking go?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:10:02", "owner": "eclipse._.107", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18064617155429190, "text": "meta came from meta knight lmao its not an acronym", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:03:39", "owner": "icecoldcrusade", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17965492353004725, "text": "P2w ???? Only op and angry players know this 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:03:05", "owner": "shahriar.h.p", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17953547117908254, "text": "Meta isn’t an acronym, and if you think it is, you’ve got a dumb brain.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:00:56", "owner": "john.bushkin", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17887169022399739, "text": "LFG - Lets Fcking Go", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:57:27", "owner": "ryebellezo", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17875902750443823, "text": "LFG - LETS FKING GO! 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:57:07", "owner": "jikoaryoa", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17899777818185761, "text": "And I bet it’s all she actually knows.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:50:57", "owner": "bearslovekababs", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18061047347242644, "text": "Meta is not an acronym I believe.\nI could be wrong, but I believe it originates from an edition of SMASH (brawl maybe?) where metaknight was incredibly overpowered.\nThat’s it, that acronym became a kind of “adjustment” as the term became a standard.\nsource: idk bro, likely a random YouTube video or reel? Do your own research 🫡", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:50:12", "owner": "angeldariomarroquin", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17967462440994180, "text": "LFG= looking for group or lets fuckin go", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:50:12", "owner": "itsrainingjustdogs", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18061010768631637, "text": "Wait HP is not \"hit point\"?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:38:36", "owner": "hendradpratama", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18036235232728398, "text": "Why she talk like she don't know how to exist around grass", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:35:29", "owner": "crazedmountainman", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18060965645555104, "text": "LFG??? isnt that supposed to be \"looking for group\"? raid or party mmorpg", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:35:23", "owner": "sighlentloud", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17884701510406333, "text": "Why does she talk like that", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:28:16", "owner": "isaaac_hutch", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18079552492918244, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:26:02", "owner": "dboi123987", "likes": 38}, {"id": 18012283517640420, "text": "I thought meta comes from meta knight in smash bros brawl because tier lists were built around how well characters do around him?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:16:02", "owner": "alpacaoveryonder", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18108751012618993, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:15:25", "owner": "holdmyravioli", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18061073546218629, "text": "No way she really talks like that", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:09:50", "owner": "timbo_chainz", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18080071586138948, "text": "Her autism is off the chart", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:07:15", "owner": "that_odd_fella_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17917080885229997, "text": "Bruh why was the word kill censored? :/", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:59:37", "owner": "mr_icecreamy", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18047004584441800, "text": "Lfg is looking for group?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:57:06", "owner": "haarljarl", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18083889151866259, "text": "hp is hit points", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:52:55", "owner": "rahlkvist07", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18071102192599799, "text": "no entendi la prera", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:49:13", "owner": "luca_.mont", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18067640384614276, "text": "Looking for group you noob", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:44:01", "owner": "emond.dean", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18082478186284979, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:43:21", "owner": "jams_on_steam", "likes": 107}, {"id": 17929237239138538, "text": "I thought HP was Hit Points", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:40:39", "owner": "daily_idiocy", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18539300701011506, "text": "Looking for group on WOW", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:36:52", "owner": "captain.mack", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17908807434125696, "text": "We will have also accepted hit points", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:35:43", "owner": "samspoonan", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18187328599346047, "text": "Away from Computer 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:33:29", "owner": "sukkrad.96", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18051442130370419, "text": "I didn't know Meta was an acronym", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:30:54", "owner": "crivvtf", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18329622307212925, "text": "Lfg is looking for group no?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:30:09", "owner": "teytree", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17995173662853436, "text": "META being an acronym is some diabolical shit", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:11:16", "owner": "warsloth_eternal", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17999649467844540, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:05:12", "owner": "yunobenny", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18079573589273543, "text": "Closed Captions", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:04:07", "owner": "stopitsih", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18539802772022307, "text": "TIL Meta was an acronym", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:00:32", "owner": "serg.yeo", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18087220675967134, "text": "Meta is a backronym. That’s not its origin or etymology", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:00:10", "owner": "unpaid_overtime", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18081524291278679, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:58:57", "owner": "that_art_guy_m", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18131468239494285, "text": "Why are we censoring the word “kill” ?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:57:21", "owner": "mbebereia", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17845022820617265, "text": "This is so sad", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:55:18", "owner": "jackdoherty366", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18124526560518287, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:53:25", "owner": "bxbyshxq", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18061014884226268, "text": "I though meta was born from META Knight being overpowered in Super Smash Bros Brawl XD", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:48:09", "owner": "fedebrizuela27", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18037665245713660, "text": "Wait LFG was Let's Fucking Go", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:46:37", "owner": "kudale_harshal", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17965051238868221, "text": "She is so cringe dude", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:43:44", "owner": "lyntjess0201", "likes": 38}, {"id": 18329013841240982, "text": "This is showerless knowledge", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:40:53", "owner": "propranger22", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18087888886789925, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:38:01", "owner": "definitely_not_sampanna", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17972136503966621, "text": "It thought LFG meant Let's Fucking Go", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:30:44", "owner": "paxton.xu", "likes": 19}, {"id": 18396777874132062, "text": "Depending on game, couldn't CC mean content creator? Say for a game without pvp or attacking?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:29:52", "owner": "ty.rcks.shz", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18102084025671430, "text": "CC is Closed Captions", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:29:26", "owner": "paxton.xu", "likes": 32}, {"id": 18387980887183635, "text": "Meta isn't an acronym. This is wrong.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:22:13", "owner": "positivea9", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18349638076201873, "text": "Touch grass woman", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:18:56", "owner": "arjun.tumu", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18185473387345350, "text": "I always tought lfg means lets fckin go . Lol", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:11:07", "owner": "szabkris0704", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17961700088863053, "text": "I thought she was a machine lol", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:07:08", "owner": "skytlan1519", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18109959847718195, "text": "I love emirus voice", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:05:47", "owner": "peop.lepleasee", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18072847973363398, "text": "Away from komputer lmao", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:00:15", "owner": "k9fps_", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17885107890407199, "text": "What happened to player vs entities", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:50:19", "owner": "hize_rogue_yt", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17910523281257010, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:34:13", "owner": "randomfatguy_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18396771496135552, "text": "Cc was always either close combat or crowd control", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:33:17", "owner": "wsu_wridra", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17854485102576863, "text": "Asmongold astrally projecting himself into her head after hearing the first answer through the ether", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:52:05", "owner": "wannstrom14", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18099264418750624, "text": "TYT = take your time 🔥❤️🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:44:56", "owner": "dragmarc_bullet_echo", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18304638802253466, "text": "If you look up in vocabulary for girl with the most cringe voice, you will see this insecure @emiru.jpg that she has a fking jpg on her username and yet that egghead @realmizkif managed to sacrifice his fame just to be with her and get humiliated in the end. Damn, so many braindead jobless streamers nowadays.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:32:53", "owner": "seeker_of_true_happiness", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18091762909736108, "text": "LFG = LET'S FKN GOOOOOO", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:28:28", "owner": "travis_weird.flex", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17888501649259830, "text": "Komputer", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:28:01", "owner": "awdev.codes", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18076973201238344, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:26:13", "owner": "_kim_salakha", "likes": 32}, {"id": 18083894084011105, "text": "Meta is an acronym???", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:21:38", "owner": "grand_line_collectors", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17998367852703732, "text": "Man red bull sponsor me", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:05:36", "owner": "_tcru_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17901981996317170, "text": "Pve is wrong", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:04:27", "owner": "southern_ring1", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18062084540448408, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:42:22", "owner": "_edmj", "likes": 104}, {"id": 18081165818117888, "text": "If i was mizkif I would've treated her better..", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:14:37", "owner": "ac1dirty130", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18079464655899143, "text": "Why she have babies in her knees?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:08:34", "owner": "e0enm", "likes": 34}, {"id": 18365985805084028, "text": "LFG = Let’s Fucking Go", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:02:19", "owner": "leomora", "likes": 6020}, {"id": 17864703480531811, "text": "Should have asked TTK", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:04:06", "owner": "gravy_da_train", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18176460295324648, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:38:15", "owner": "leo_suotniski", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17842686819624508, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:33:18", "owner": "4tomahawk", "likes": 697}, {"id": 17936869454984605, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:03:08", "owner": "keepitez_11", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18100502083687037, "text": "Meta is short for metagame", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:36:27", "owner": "gorefires", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17901900333318731, "text": "Meta is not an acronym", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:32:17", "owner": "tylermoloney13", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18104187298660104, "text": "Tf you mean META is a acronym, no fuckin way", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:12:38", "owner": "estebanvargas415", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18120159487531280, "text": "Emi emi emi ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:02:01", "owner": "wavybone97", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18347335057204059, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:53:14", "owner": "egepiastri81", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18037828658713553, "text": "Nice", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:33:14", "owner": "n.pinhein003", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18096870496832062, "text": "Biggest Pick me girl ahh", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:20:38", "owner": "id76561198420249867", "likes": 17}, {"id": 17879590869493511, "text": "nice", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:41:31", "owner": "dragonatheris", "likes": 21}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["gaming", "emiru", "acronym"]},
{"media_id": 3774509301370047420, "shortcode": "DRhwDYdkcu8", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRhwDYdkcu8/", "taken_at": "2025-11-26T17:03:34", "caption": "據 BBC 報導，英國首相 Sir Keir Starmer 於前日（11 月 24 日）到位於劍橋郡 Peterborough 的小學 Welland Academy 推廣免費午餐計劃時，與一班小學生即席玩起網絡爆紅的「6－7」手勢舞。惟該校原來早已禁玩相關舞步，而首相隨即向該校校長道歉。\n\nStarmer 於社交平台 Instagram 上傳了一段關於自己當日做出「6－7」手勢舞的短片，並在帖文寫道：「我覺得我好像令自己被罰留堂了……」（\"I think I just got myself put in detention...\"）。影片顯示，首相正與一女學童一起閱讀，當該學童發現書本翻到第 6 及 7 頁時，首相便即興模仿「6－7」手勢，惹得全班學生大笑。事後有老師提醒 Starmer，表示學生做這個動作會被罰。Starmer 聞言即向校長道歉，並澄清：「老師，這不是我開始的」（\"I didn't start it, Miss.\"）。\n\n「6－7」手勢舞源自美國說唱歌手 Skrilla 的歌曲 Doot Doot (67)，配上 TikTok 等平台瘋傳的手勢動作，迅速成為全英學生的追捧熱潮。「6－7」的真正意思眾說紛紜，有人認為解作「一般般」（\"so-so\"）或「也許是這樣，也許是那樣」（\"maybe this, maybe that\"）。網上英語字典 Dictionary.com 更將「6－7」選為 2025 年年度詞語。\n\n--------------------\n🗣️🇬🇧 想學地道英語和跟外國人輕鬆溝通？現在就報讀 Lingoda 的英語課程吧！GBHK 讀者專享 €20 優惠！（必須使用我們的 referral link，連結在留言區）\n--------------------\n👉 按 #GBHK英語教室 了解更多相關內容：\n22/11/2025\n《英國步入寒冬季節：人氣倫敦地鐵告示板 大玩文字遊戲 改地方名》\n18/8/2025\n《劍橋詞典新增逾六千個新詞彙包括 “skibidi” 、“tradwife” 等網絡爆紅用語》\n--------------------\n👉按 #GBHK趣聞 了解更多相關新聞：\n24/11/2025\n《英國首創「狗狗巴士」大受歡迎 寵物狗可搭巴士遊走社區 狗主大讚新服務有意義》\n20/11/2025\n《私家車掛滿聖誕燈被截查 警方：屬交通違例可被罰 £50bnm》\n--------------------\n\n#GBHK英語教室 #GBHK趣聞 #英國 #英國新聞 #英國生活 #67 #sixseven #英國首相 #TikTok #67舞", "owner_username": "greatbuttonhk", "owner_id": "51336968491", "likes": 6494, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0132_DRhwDYdkcu8\\DRhwDYdkcu8_20251126_170334.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18085292275842896, "text": "He is really 67", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:11:19", "owner": "wan_ivan", "likes": 1178}, {"id": 17992358837896982, "text": "佢就真係67", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:42:29", "owner": "kitlamuk", "likes": 219}, {"id": 18042780038705438, "text": "學校真係一個神奇地方", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:40:14", "owner": "pandahin", "likes": 95}, {"id": 17991200489731868, "text": "我的補救教學學生們連英文1-10都不會唸 教的時候也是一直676767 😇🙄🤢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:05:15", "owner": "vvi991e", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18072497336036102, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:52:07", "owner": "rainarrow41", "likes": 134}, {"id": 18083417411021247, "text": "成條67咁😅", "created_at": "2025-11-26T19:33:11", "owner": "bubu_is_angry", "likes": 414}, {"id": 18095825140855758, "text": "处理方式太随意了，在中国就是校长道歉，老师开除了", "created_at": "2025-12-03T15:39:58", "owner": "olvido_liu", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18076311074221840, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:01:43", "owner": "0.bacon", "likes": 12}, {"id": 17970252755976858, "text": "67工黨配67首相", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:43:48", "owner": "jon_babybuster", "likes": 161}, {"id": 17882277684414190, "text": "首相又67", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:15:05", "owner": "k_w_lol", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18290460310263045, "text": "諗起張家輝做代課響學校食煙", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:17:21", "owner": "lewistheworld", "likes": 22}, {"id": 18540921727005262, "text": "I feel like we should let the world know what 67 could mean in Cantonese", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:31:43", "owner": "cherrryyyc", "likes": 35}, {"id": 18092410909910184, "text": "…….", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:48:22", "owner": "gloriacraftinguk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088603262298585, "text": "真67", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:14:50", "owner": "jloinuk", "likes": 32}, {"id": 18067285301419565, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T15:33:09", "owner": "a5nnnnnn_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17909414457256720, "text": "只要D嘢流行就要禁🤡", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:40:32", "owner": "pandahin", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18158850154394966, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:54:49", "owner": "hecedhx_tw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954173736906202, "text": "Gen alpha is beyond cooked💔🥀", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:08:12", "owner": "krbvifoak", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17975702222949635, "text": "This generation is cooked", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:34:06", "owner": "kyle.chan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17986193777867180, "text": "67", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:56:14", "owner": "chanjack951", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18308699695265262, "text": "Imagine being mad about a number💀", "created_at": "2025-12-04T12:23:47", "owner": "tzuhao311", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17944438350077817, "text": "Real 67", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:50:09", "owner": "lorac0201", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18040307732500931, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:50:22", "owner": "kaydon.cwc", "likes": 22}, {"id": 18546101563032037, "text": "做乜春", "created_at": "2025-12-13T16:30:32", "owner": "gw72417", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070175069101083, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-12T05:38:35", "owner": "lyzwca._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18149392696442524, "text": "笑死我了", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:33:23", "owner": "j.113ee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089331859787960, "text": "Probably the worst PM of Uk ever", "created_at": "2025-12-08T21:02:20", "owner": "leungmarty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084450992011193, "text": "咁佢真係67", "created_at": "2025-12-08T11:31:19", "owner": "07hinzai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047999744693764, "text": "🙄", "created_at": "2025-12-07T08:35:08", "owner": "hslwilliam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102787576613665, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:32:59", "owner": "evelyn32424616", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083069215880267, "text": "為什麼？", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:03:32", "owner": "vipguorui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931968313137706, "text": "點解要道歉？歐洲病夫", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:19:30", "owner": "blublahej", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107881651714173, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:17:17", "owner": "wahooskale", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18341299696226072, "text": "日落國😂碌柒😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T03:21:17", "owner": "wong.howard.90813", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545948554001559, "text": "On9到", "created_at": "2025-12-04T23:12:35", "owner": "avis.choi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035429939520157, "text": "On9仔首相", "created_at": "2025-12-03T08:17:21", "owner": "arrrrrain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991040352736370, "text": "禁得好", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:52:22", "owner": "han_the_poet_c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001799858830448, "text": "That’s how dumb this generation is. You think they would be retarded but not this retarded.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T11:54:08", "owner": "danxus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932107084112338, "text": "今年後半是什麼文藝復興+腦腐流行季嗎？？？", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:12:23", "owner": "riptidebloodsport", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070388405601274, "text": "滴能而", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:27:05", "owner": "forrestpai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868462051493893, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:23:25", "owner": "leon_hk8964", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087054259813938, "text": "老師面露苦澀😆", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:15:40", "owner": "bebegirl777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099872653759025, "text": "叛國首相，縱容巴基斯坦人大量輪姦白人少女。", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:31:29", "owner": "chan808yuen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024045653597059, "text": "不知道的還以為你在秤奶子呢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:05:03", "owner": "kirihara.akira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18515997667064238, "text": "正67", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:39:06", "owner": "tu_tut_ut", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025160312781492, "text": "正碌柒，呢條仆街識做d咩好野？", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:02:29", "owner": "davidlcw_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094773613884247, "text": "碌柒嘅人", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:48:01", "owner": "mlvtxn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987802221873604, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:40:30", "owner": "nhceria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036180338514971, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:25:08", "owner": "marcothegymrat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929309284138735, "text": "俾學生帶住做反而話佢帶壞學生。goodest logic", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:02:09", "owner": "scthunder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18382535332145373, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:30:55", "owner": "milktontam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072366941589553, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:24:29", "owner": "edward._kyuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079219745166323, "text": "Very cute kids, I love how they smile when they do the 67", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:46:34", "owner": "alvin_dddd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101436529683408, "text": "看起來像弱智、殘障、腦癱會做的動作。", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:07:01", "owner": "gorobo57610", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072108743054567, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:00:58", "owner": "naison_wsw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047951903438154, "text": "佢唔係扮架喎，真係67", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:31:49", "owner": "honghangchin_debby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079903796166011, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:48:44", "owner": "freddie_wong15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932880366999655, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:29:36", "owner": "lando.norris.gogogo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057534488295002, "text": "stupid thing stupid do", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:33:39", "owner": "kevin.tsang.75", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18118285339530095, "text": "呢個67由句說話以至個動作根本好低能，完全無意義，連個首相都以為好過癮咁同學生一齊做，可見佢幾無能，邊勿有領導才能？？？", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:15:28", "owner": "y.wah1968", "likes": 35}, {"id": 17930615601118225, "text": "Hahaha", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:34:08", "owner": "kimting317", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18427899952129218, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:09:54", "owner": "yanggg.jpg", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18097050850873454, "text": "On9 76", "created_at": "2025-11-26T19:26:42", "owner": "mrs_lo825", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17851815249554246, "text": "Really retarded67....", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:24:43", "owner": "thebonesman", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18068957867098144, "text": "Really retarded", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:24:05", "owner": "thebonesman", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100311637702958, "text": "碌柒", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:01:38", "owner": "spin_bear", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051404888665905, "text": "弱智5係扮㗎喎🙈", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:25:14", "owner": "real_hongkonger_accessories", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18095507446872249, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:17:24", "owner": "yoyoleungyiu", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["gbhk英語教室", "gbhk趣聞", "gbhk英語教室", "gbhk趣聞", "英國", "英國新聞", "英國生活", "67", "sixseven", "英國首相", "tiktok", "67舞"]},
{"media_id": 3775746151430235258, "shortcode": "DRmJR62DCR6", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRmJR62DCR6/", "taken_at": "2025-11-28T10:00:37", "caption": "🔒 We’re delighted to announce that Mackenzie Jones has signed a new deal with the Club!\n\n🦅 #FlyLikeAnEagle", "owner_username": "essexcricket", "owner_id": "626739514", "likes": 673, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphImage", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0133_DRmJR62DCR6\\DRmJR62DCR6_20251128_100037.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": "17948368902059571", "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:06:14", "owner": "sajmahmoodcricketacademy", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17960888073035113", "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:21:57", "owner": "ben.berry1", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17882584491421305", "text": "🙌😍", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:35:23", "owner": "nikhilkoteeswaran", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18104955343724878", "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:59:40", "owner": "sharonbjohns", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18085460252478252", "text": "Congrats! 👏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:05:42", "owner": "nfbauk", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17888512746265828", "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:41:51", "owner": "suefoakes", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17865884517507281", "text": "👏👏👏🏏💪🏼💪🏼💪🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:09:21", "owner": "salillondon", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18059846789637122", "text": "Great news. Onwards and upwards. Proud of you mate! 🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:56:18", "owner": "neilfoz", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18339300574237586", "text": "Great stuff Macca 👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:52:58", "owner": "paul_alexander_bardo", "likes": 0}, {"id": "17961812372862303", "text": "Gun playa 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:32:33", "owner": "miles.mcm", "likes": 0}, {"id": "18008492969814301", "text": "oh yes @macjones._", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:25:06", "owner": "samhale.17", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["flylikeaneagle"]},
{"media_id": 3774430754831980240, "shortcode": "DRheMYTEdbQ", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRheMYTEdbQ/", "taken_at": "2025-11-26T14:27:10", "caption": "A deadly blaze tore through several high-rise apartment towers in Hong Kong on Wednesday, killing at least 13 people and injuring 15 others, sending smoke billowing across the city’s northern New Territories and setting off an urgent rescue effort for an unknown number of people trapped inside.\n\nThe cause of the fire remained unknown. Hundreds of firefighters struggled to contain the inferno, which jumped across multiple high-rise towers. Several buildings were still ablaze late into the evening, more than six hours after the fire started.\n\nFollow live updates at the link in our bio. Photos by Tyrone Siu/Reuters, Chan Long Hei/@apnews and Agence France-Presse — Getty Images", "owner_username": "nytimes", "owner_id": "1624593034", "likes": 471399, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphSidecar", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0134_DRheMYTEdbQ\\DRheMYTEdbQ_20251126_142710_1.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0134_DRheMYTEdbQ\\DRheMYTEdbQ_20251126_142710_2.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0134_DRheMYTEdbQ\\DRheMYTEdbQ_20251126_142710_3.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0134_DRheMYTEdbQ\\DRheMYTEdbQ_20251126_142710_4.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0134_DRheMYTEdbQ\\DRheMYTEdbQ_20251126_142710_5.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": 17940134948965450, "text": "放第一张图真的合适吗？就这样把受害者的痛苦公然放大在网上（除非是当事人同意的", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:47:38", "owner": "suan_liao", "likes": 717}, {"id": 18090147968305426, "text": "That first photo my goodness it’s so powerful", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:38:08", "owner": "sarahjreports", "likes": 12391}, {"id": 17860313595546125, "text": "Such powerful photos, but it’s so tragic 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:54:33", "owner": "yukoart", "likes": 450}, {"id": 18164395390382389, "text": "Sending prayers 🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:31:13", "owner": "thetanyamitra", "likes": 430}, {"id": 18064706492163041, "text": "🙏🏽💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:19:39", "owner": "themattiejames", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18030695606554373, "text": "That first photo absolutely shows the power of photography communicating the human experience. So powerful and gut wrenching.  Sending so much love to all of these people who are affected", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:06:41", "owner": "summer_murdock", "likes": 925}, {"id": 18127645681443185, "text": "The first photo is so powerful! You can feel everything he’s experiencing 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:10:41", "owner": "cookiemonsterrrer", "likes": 669}, {"id": 17955416754022121, "text": "according to some residents, the fire alarm did not ring!💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:39:45", "owner": "mynameishinsonchan", "likes": 1447}, {"id": 18079514990174348, "text": "This photo is heartbreaking. You can feel the despair in his expression, and knowing how precious a home is for people in Hong Kong makes the scene even more painful to watch.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:52:32", "owner": "gamgammut", "likes": 7393}, {"id": 17842713204621846, "text": "😓", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:36:57", "owner": "pamannwantsagram", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18119592676480477, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:31:00", "owner": "phokimchi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120154009554722, "text": "gut wrenching", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:28:31", "owner": "spaceykacey", "likes": 90}, {"id": 18139888717458848, "text": "Praying for them 💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T19:25:28", "owner": "chantsboomboom", "likes": 13}, {"id": 17862968451532736, "text": "These buildings are 40+ years old. So most owners, assuming they bought them when they were at early 30s, are around 70+ years old and immobile. Unless they live with their children, most live alone. That means most could not escape before the fire engulfed them. At the moment, the fire is still happening and 200 people are reported missing. I am afraid there will be more casualties. 💔😭😭😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:25:07", "owner": "cantonlangdaily", "likes": 1144}, {"id": 18120039019480015, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:54:33", "owner": "eatingalonediaries", "likes": 36}, {"id": 18091770064915799, "text": "praying for the families that have experienced this and the causalities that came from this horrible tragedy. even tho these buildings are old they should’ve done inspections and made sure it’s a suitable environment to live in. if they took deeper precautions this fire would not have gotten this far. sending all my well wishes to those involved. 🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:08:52", "owner": "zhaowxnqi", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18373679500159565, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:04:34", "owner": "chi.luckydog", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18030242357548973, "text": "How does this even happen in 2025??? Bamboo construction?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T19:55:30", "owner": "lestrentiii", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17921507307057284, "text": "That is the press photo of the year.. incredibly heart breaking", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:33:15", "owner": "dondersteen", "likes": 2715}, {"id": 18101914684679539, "text": "Pray for Hongkong 🇭🇰🙏🕊️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:38:42", "owner": "kart_wang", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17929855452016604, "text": "加油香港", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:23:03", "owner": "andrealmeida_", "likes": 229}, {"id": 18119502754546545, "text": "whoa. 😓", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:45:22", "owner": "omarthomasmusic", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18068801105379058, "text": "Praying for the people and pets", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:07:28", "owner": "bexie_koko", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17957943272886307, "text": "Holy moly. That first image. 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:50:48", "owner": "bitbyafox", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18298315972286773, "text": "These photos 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:29:57", "owner": "misskonyc", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17925560148035357, "text": "We extend our condolences to Hong Kong. It’s clear how difficult this is. We hope that no such disasters happen in our world again. 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:18:41", "owner": "azerbaijanplaces", "likes": 159}, {"id": 17871781059464813, "text": "pray", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:08:09", "owner": "evelynfeng420", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078899501157111, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:20:15", "owner": "jyc2", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18101868067676408, "text": "As a Ukrainian, it scares me how familiar this image feels.\nWhat is a rare tragedy for others has become a daily reality for us.\n\nSending strength and compassion to the people in Hong Kong 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:32:58", "owner": "anna_remolacha_", "likes": 162}, {"id": 17871420273466870, "text": "Sad, unfortunate and a disaster level incident. Prayers to those injured and condolences to families who lost their own 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:54:51", "owner": "prakashrahul24", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17936607569983069, "text": "As a Ukrainian who sees this type of photos every day… I am so sorry, Hong Kong😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:37:21", "owner": "tanikusso", "likes": 69}, {"id": 18073956179251816, "text": "Omg…those poor people…😔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:58:58", "owner": "nycpilot75", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18111746998608427, "text": "Terrifying. 💔 I am so sorry for Hongkong. 💔❤️🙏❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:01:49", "owner": "sophieboursat", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086511451975523, "text": "Horrific. Also the animals in these apartments 💔😓", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:57:50", "owner": "deborah_von_brod_", "likes": 16}, {"id": 17923397154191483, "text": "Grenfell? What was the cladding?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:08:26", "owner": "jnorrize", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18037627286709141, "text": "Construction in Hong Kong is pretty unsafe. A lot of buildings don’t even have proper fireproofing on the outside, so when there’s strong wind, a fire can spread through the whole building really fast. The Hong Kong government really needs to take this more seriously. And honestly, they should stop using bamboo scaffolding and switch to steel", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:16:53", "owner": "liz_syes", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17864547882529909, "text": "I hate how I’m seein this devastating tragedy & the first thing that came to mind on the first pic is “hard”", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:00:21", "owner": "ren.almighty", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17915965062215306, "text": "An incredible photograph.  Heart wrenching.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:29:53", "owner": "dodger2829_", "likes": 3123}, {"id": 18087261736802301, "text": "In The Image... WHO IS IT?!", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:14:20", "owner": "ch.eung170", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078743357332313, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:19:54", "owner": "sharonharrisonway", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18131426728492300, "text": "This is just horrifying. I am utterly shocked they are saying 13 people died and 15 injured. I saw this earlier as this fire was spreading amongst all these towers and it looked to me like 15 buildings were fully consumed. Unless these buildings were unoccupied, I find it terribly difficult to believe that 13 fatalities is the reality.\n\nThere was scaffolding everywhere, mostly bamboo. Details in general are sketchy. (At least they were when I first saw this Wednesday morning in the news.) \n\nI literally am at a loss trying to fathom this and find words. And it’s difficult to get past the official reports from China that a total of 28 people have been affected. That just seems completely impossible. So can we trust what will officially be declared as what started this nightmare??? 😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:27:10", "owner": "2dogs2manycats", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933922918108879, "text": "😢😢😢 what a tragedy", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:48:53", "owner": "newjaredcity", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18158887894408295, "text": "Why do they still use bamboo?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:36:01", "owner": "where_the_day_takes_you", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17854018365536286, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:25:14", "owner": "cantodulin", "likes": 32}, {"id": 18184619725342557, "text": "😭💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:06:35", "owner": "gaztou", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087905738302986, "text": "🙏🏼😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:46:14", "owner": "anson.poon", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18001316600837009, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:52:48", "owner": "benjichiang", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17914782303238942, "text": "Amazing photos I wish they were AI. Tragic.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:07:25", "owner": "portlandsunshine", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085375249993520, "text": "💔💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:33:05", "owner": "cindylexu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17972108216952137, "text": "My heart 💔 this should have never happened in Hong Kong out of all places.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:29:46", "owner": "jasperhlynn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17915366484090217, "text": "💔😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:11:28", "owner": "alpharedify", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076619474211183, "text": "😭😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:05:22", "owner": "cxlxnxlxnxng", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17895989928352437, "text": "🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:25:17", "owner": "amandaknoll", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17971807358968995, "text": "WA U MEAN U LEFT DE OVEN ON", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:06:23", "owner": "tessaron_news_3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17850227742562238, "text": "Why does a person in such agony should be posted like this? Did he consent this? It feels a bit exploitative and unethical and feels like Western gaze.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:57:25", "owner": "cooowaterdog", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18352157338166372, "text": "The cause: structures made of bamboo all around the towers and the wind.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:45:22", "owner": "gabrielcarvajalfoto", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085079540485234, "text": "I hope everyone reads this to know, bamboo scaffolding is the least cause of the problem.\n1.There is misuse of exterior netting to cut cost.\n2.Lack of regulations on workers smoking on site despite complaints.\n3.Using flammable polystyrene foam as cheap insulation on EVERY WINDOW. \n4. An oversight on allowing 8 blocks of highrise building to undergo construction all together (to cut time cost)\n5. Disabling of all the fire alarm systems to allow workers to enter and exit. \nIT'S CORRUPTION.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:39:47", "owner": "terrenceleung.kingyiu", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17907770148274873, "text": "Praying for each and every person and their families in these buildings. Really hope our beloved city can now perhaps rid of scaffolding usage in building communities. The dangers and risks are just too grave when things go wrong. 🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:16:25", "owner": "stcwong", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17985286760868616, "text": "Praying for Hong Kong🙏🏻🇭🇰", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:02:20", "owner": "joannejosephinerhodes", "likes": 27}, {"id": 18059894402631714, "text": "In the first picture, The guy’s wife was still in the apartment when the fire happened.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:43:23", "owner": "24kkingali", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17946076110064443, "text": "Jesus.. thank god most people got out safe RIP to those who did not", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:50:01", "owner": "raptographer", "likes": 16}, {"id": 18145739800440804, "text": "Bamboo scaffolding doesn’t help", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:59:46", "owner": "joe.kayed", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17893068708364454, "text": "Heartbreaking 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:34:11", "owner": "petelaverick", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17986597925880382, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:01:49", "owner": "anitachui", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18063004178637977, "text": "💔🙏🏽🙏🏽🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:18:44", "owner": "joseparla", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17850909360596154, "text": "not AI... OMG😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:00:18", "owner": "coolting1980", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17930952396118594, "text": "没办法 香港的房屋都太密集了 一烧就连着烧，Qué pena!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:38:38", "owner": "yejunbin66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069156341616820, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:44:07", "owner": "lielaine", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17887023603393106, "text": "Hong Kong really needs to get its act together when it comes to fire-stopping standards! When I was there, I also got caught in a house fire while I was asleep, but other people couldn't make it out alive. Such an experience changes you... It makes me so angry that this keeps happening to frequently there!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:52:51", "owner": "ninajsophie", "likes": 161}, {"id": 18087558499800593, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:17:56", "owner": "clickcantopop", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18088176016943869, "text": "感谢伟大的党领导", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:56:41", "owner": "edge781016", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18412376254138838, "text": "😭💔Ich begreife einfach nicht wie man Bambusgerüste noch benutzen kann und dann bei Hochhäusern?!😱 Diese Bilder sind sooo entsetzlich! Immer nur noch höher bauen, noch enger zusammen😢😢 Und bis wo reicht das bisschen Wasser??", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:07:07", "owner": "depukoeln", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057267491308980, "text": "Was caused it ? Was it the bamboo or something in the building?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:10:07", "owner": "ye0j_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014049182802819, "text": "А вы еще дровишек бамбуковых подбросьте🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:56:50", "owner": "zharkovproduction", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113489659584231, "text": "昔からだよ竹の足場で延焼\n昔にも起きてる", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:03:26", "owner": "keitaro_watarai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084348707009740, "text": "Fine dell’era del bambù", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:25:47", "owner": "ilsignorbonfi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165380125379622, "text": "見唔見啲竹無燒著呀？！西方專家", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:45:25", "owner": "canamimipak", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18003819233673174, "text": "CARALHO", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:50:24", "owner": "aruaemsp", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18103259662673832, "text": "💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:36:13", "owner": "vandythepink", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18087034334298825, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:56:42", "owner": "kerchungcreative", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18308501992301719, "text": "What a photo!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:42:49", "owner": "meldcole", "likes": 252}, {"id": 18157403035366179, "text": "Stop pointing cameras at the victims.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:43:30", "owner": "felicieyueyu", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18037922558718076, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:27:58", "owner": "omidturk_o", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074948903586753, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:07:26", "owner": "iamangelliina", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047054072453463, "text": "💔😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:06:24", "owner": "yriy_krashchenko", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092307752476560, "text": "I have no home anymore.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:00:39", "owner": "lkproppf", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057553853307459, "text": "Some incredibly powerful photos. How sad.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:03:00", "owner": "chachfiles", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18048771563412334, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:53:41", "owner": "kublingmalay", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18011410526807442, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:38:32", "owner": "irwider", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071802680584370, "text": "😭RIP", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:08:25", "owner": "hanquanchen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18048758978404983, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:13:12", "owner": "vivecachow", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18058256357295623, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:02:52", "owner": "ianlhs", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17894391528364069, "text": "Who cares", "created_at": "2025-12-13T18:12:56", "owner": "2015_blondie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919252900219620, "text": "“Please work on developing life-extension technologies so that people can live longer, healthier lives and experience the exciting possibilities of the future.”", "created_at": "2025-12-13T01:34:09", "owner": "hasanosrati2005univers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017380535630518, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-12-11T23:31:00", "owner": "simplyshali", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845882530623009, "text": "But….the buildings didn’t perfectly collapse along with a nearby building?  That’s weird…", "created_at": "2025-12-11T19:37:43", "owner": "jeremy.vaughan.nmsp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094964806896641, "text": "🕯️🕯️🕯️", "created_at": "2025-12-11T03:05:11", "owner": "wmy95739686", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964138080850715, "text": "❤️🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:51:07", "owner": "ngvgiahuy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094467508714853, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:51:01", "owner": "ngvgiahuy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095930704849698, "text": "some will still blame Trump", "created_at": "2025-12-09T08:52:18", "owner": "ikn_owyoudont", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087075866076350, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-12-08T08:21:15", "owner": "investorspov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113560255578224, "text": "Just horrific 😭💔", "created_at": "2025-12-07T21:31:04", "owner": "yoursglobal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153060415420344, "text": "💔💔💔😢😢😢😢🙏🙏💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-12-07T19:46:46", "owner": "tudoseanca0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861188044551760, "text": "Actual, real, thoughts and prayers for everyone impacted 🙏❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-07T18:56:43", "owner": "bigenergyenergy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090001445486310, "text": "Sad, his wife was certified dead. 💔😭", "created_at": "2025-12-07T15:22:02", "owner": "doratamyc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545600188034847, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-12-07T14:14:10", "owner": "orly.x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117285208500143, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-12-07T14:09:27", "owner": "hmmwellletmesee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099705379694230, "text": "加油", "created_at": "2025-12-07T13:18:08", "owner": "yuuuuu____d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106684654653899, "text": "係假嘅，當天香港溫度非常之低唔可能着短袖衫。", "created_at": "2025-12-07T10:43:57", "owner": "wangyunxin96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051230345386805, "text": "😭🙏❤️", "created_at": "2025-12-07T04:19:41", "owner": "anna.k.kjellberg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862677019541617, "text": "💔🙏🙏🙏 Best wishes.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T17:42:20", "owner": "serena_9452", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120600262543270, "text": "我哭了😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:20:20", "owner": "otty_ottinger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053662007652514, "text": "我不好😭", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:20:14", "owner": "otty_ottinger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923257975190203, "text": "Mainland renovation workers obviously", "created_at": "2025-12-06T05:57:54", "owner": "pickpocket33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066451556412864, "text": "Not a single building collapsed either. Unlike the small office fire that somehow caused three buildings in New York to collapse on que", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:53:07", "owner": "thegoodlifeofpi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18203245120317600, "text": "Damn…", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:01:37", "owner": "arthur_duarte.__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18195337891334098, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:08:59", "owner": "justmarta__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18516788749066653, "text": "Most Disgusting Country in History! 🇨🇳💩", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:03:07", "owner": "danielguevarra.td", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928155685167382, "text": "Heartbreaking oh my god…", "created_at": "2025-12-05T07:30:37", "owner": "char.elizabeth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064821521167424, "text": "😭💔😭💔😭", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:43:27", "owner": "anneleholmlouhelainen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089669387479345, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-04T10:13:02", "owner": "vic_ybc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902539543304851, "text": "Super tragic.... May God bless their loved ones and more... RIP beautiful human beings", "created_at": "2025-12-04T08:42:54", "owner": "liujulie1980", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067287143390838, "text": "I thought fire made buildings collapse into their own footprint", "created_at": "2025-12-03T19:22:47", "owner": "ryan4ransom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062932553621635, "text": "香港加油🇭🇰🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-03T16:36:40", "owner": "hcx5655", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870154798405794, "text": "ろくでもない", "created_at": "2025-12-03T10:06:52", "owner": "yiciyuanren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18381358282149265, "text": "😭💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-12-03T09:04:21", "owner": "wyman12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036674231711146, "text": "Wow so sad omg 😱", "created_at": "2025-12-03T08:41:45", "owner": "emergencyresponsekits", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070519928345392, "text": "🙏阿彌陀佛", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:44:59", "owner": "purple_liang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133186732493402, "text": "❤💔", "created_at": "2025-12-03T00:38:54", "owner": "__julesrose__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081455618125367, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-12-03T00:26:51", "owner": "hkzyaor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991626348731003, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:28:34", "owner": "mr_hellooooooo777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905817670147760, "text": "😮💔💔😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:32:22", "owner": "cjbrivald", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050349020673609, "text": "😢😭💔💔🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:07:52", "owner": "triciahena", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100399621774660, "text": "Бедные люди...", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:07:04", "owner": "vyanachek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077423920977462, "text": "horrifying 😭💔", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:14:43", "owner": "lauren.cowart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366763033095384, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-12-01T20:39:09", "owner": "joymacbelle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088310918295877, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-01T17:10:28", "owner": "l1lu01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004885520672988, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-01T16:26:45", "owner": "tonreillyy55354", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074349689249897, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-01T14:18:00", "owner": "xxyzj6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901177057321989, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:32:44", "owner": "corazhang0813", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074987003246721, "text": "🥲", "created_at": "2025-12-01T12:31:05", "owner": "krisberry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543165814057809, "text": "Lord, pls heal this city , we need you this Christmas", "created_at": "2025-12-01T11:40:39", "owner": "szemanwongwong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087559789811005, "text": "保佑 平安🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-01T11:29:25", "owner": "zmliu09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957978141888811, "text": "That first photo is nuts", "created_at": "2025-12-01T10:33:29", "owner": "sierratheicon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842981779631052, "text": "🙏🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:14:51", "owner": "krissyr722", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075271052247661, "text": "What's the name of the Towers?", "created_at": "2025-12-01T06:04:48", "owner": "debbiehemm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073033049362249, "text": "撕心裂肺的痛", "created_at": "2025-12-01T05:39:00", "owner": "luosidaquan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081473192121651, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:25:04", "owner": "kh_fong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106082830650241, "text": "And it didnt collapse like the wtc 😮", "created_at": "2025-12-01T02:02:51", "owner": "leo_daa_lion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098198737640015, "text": "Image 1 WP winner 🏆... Such a horrific sight. This is where codes and regulations come in.. AROUND THE WORLD... Sad day for Hong Kong", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:47:53", "owner": "juddphoto2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085375757059392, "text": "🙏🙏🙏 Sending Prayers to Hong Kong 🇭🇰", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:37:05", "owner": "earthdragon.808", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081474743278609, "text": "Death toll is over 100 now 😞", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:53:22", "owner": "mindless.entity", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109954048543963, "text": "Praying", "created_at": "2025-11-30T23:42:45", "owner": "dianechesser", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844218973623160, "text": "为香港祈祷", "created_at": "2025-11-30T22:53:58", "owner": "rita_x_210", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144210439445997, "text": "That’s horrible. I pray for everyone who suffer from this disaster…", "created_at": "2025-11-30T21:55:12", "owner": "hisashi0823", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086556742954257, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-30T21:35:28", "owner": "sushinoord", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18380763199150693, "text": "🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-30T21:17:30", "owner": "niecyisonline", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087005392816681, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:39:47", "owner": "emski924", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984740208920941, "text": "So very tragic", "created_at": "2025-11-30T17:14:40", "owner": "lisabrehony", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18398085469127223, "text": "My heart goes out to every soul affected", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:50:59", "owner": "eljackalope_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159473770406125, "text": "All the best wishes🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:01:19", "owner": "michaelfeng5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950298888918267, "text": "wtf. who start it?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:59:14", "owner": "psilosamples", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068373290527115, "text": "Wahnsinn einfach heftig", "created_at": "2025-11-30T13:40:56", "owner": "tom.krueger.7792", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082513286329016, "text": "😢😢😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-30T13:30:13", "owner": "lensporn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868518196413336, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:10:15", "owner": "babygucci_1314", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101295868706790, "text": "Effroyable", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:39:28", "owner": "agencemoha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988136514748190, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-30T09:44:24", "owner": "lai_qianru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919419607069651, "text": "🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:48:41", "owner": "aissy0901", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845444407617372, "text": "Pray for HK🕯️", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:38:57", "owner": "baekyeom.97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079939688131321, "text": "Will the NYT also blame bamboo, or actually be investigative journalists.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:02:03", "owner": "oppatwunk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083876980841779, "text": "竹子脚手架真的无敌了", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:21:23", "owner": "ki_prime", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905729146146416, "text": "Man made", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:08:47", "owner": "goatcitizen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543076999029283, "text": "What a picture", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:16:36", "owner": "masaki_visuals", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002181677681519, "text": "Τραγική σπαρακτικη απελπιστική κατάσταση. Δεν χωρούν λόγια..... Λυπάμαι πάρα πολύ... 😭😭😭😭😭💔💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:27:12", "owner": "manini_52", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947029389940255, "text": "What a tragedy", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:21:31", "owner": "kilo_pilot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321267343170148, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:31:12", "owner": "xiedonglin2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296341042259540, "text": "This could have been avoided with real safety precautions put in place.  Greed kills!", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:29:27", "owner": "angelikablanchard5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18294676090279047, "text": "希望大家都平安😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:38:29", "owner": "eveyi_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954223779904256, "text": "😮😮😢😢😢😢🌹🌹🌹🌹🌹🌹🌹🌹🌹🌹🌹🌹🌹🌹🌹", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:38:09", "owner": "regbenedetti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122018893529521, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:55:53", "owner": "_kvrg0r0rr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059356937255220, "text": "Crazy how these fires haven’t melted the steel beams and the buildings haven’t collapsed yet……………..", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:51:44", "owner": "swaggyg86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540104764049255, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:44:35", "owner": "rashment_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917272435229980, "text": "Wtf", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:46:54", "owner": "leandroptbr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989563506871783, "text": "Hard to tell if this is AI or not", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:34:35", "owner": "thereoncewasagirl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084055076060120, "text": "How terrifyingly sad.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T01:08:27", "owner": "markperrett_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946199212078407, "text": "This looks so similar to the Grenwall fires in England I think 2017.  Material used on outside of buildings just went up. So horrible for all the families. 🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:57:20", "owner": "mightmierzwa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18314617309220991, "text": "So sad 💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:10:28", "owner": "la.vie.en.monochrome", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368831293085821, "text": "Wild", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:35:05", "owner": "freeslaykas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073588046604113, "text": "😮😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:20:01", "owner": "cmulderp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989175552874048, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:14:37", "owner": "fujian0615", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160204534402768, "text": "First photo is A.I. 💯", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:14:18", "owner": "callahanwelsh_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898759375342209, "text": "💔💔😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:52:27", "owner": "mimismonteiro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547706641008245, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:41:19", "owner": "brenrn5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18208704721312607, "text": "یک روز معمولی در ایران:🥲", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:47:52", "owner": "mahdie_mv_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18355986163207392, "text": "😢😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:40:40", "owner": "semragunduz3838", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18549762292032931, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:38:12", "owner": "gondaphotographic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954095904900028, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T21:36:21", "owner": "idontgivea_fuck53", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021762788604204, "text": "💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-29T20:21:11", "owner": "bahar_khoddam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18244178665294638, "text": "Horrible. 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-29T20:11:55", "owner": "the_green_thumb_goddess4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031769489744306, "text": "😭💔🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-29T20:03:19", "owner": "clara.aburto.5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053697470657727, "text": "😢 so sad", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:58:16", "owner": "mohammad.ayub21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18196119673331770, "text": "there’s way more than 13 people who died… my heart goes out to those in HK 💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:56:31", "owner": "dsrechn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18179199610318752, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:17:10", "owner": "tania.prats", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954596604898553, "text": "p1......It is immoral🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:16:59", "owner": "sinkkingblue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074123561251591, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:06:47", "owner": "itsleolam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053103131338754, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:25:09", "owner": "tricore.charge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084710083858926, "text": "這個畫面好恐怖", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:55:22", "owner": "woo.angel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164767534388574, "text": "🙏🏾🙏🏾🙏🏾🙏🏾🙏🏾🙏🏾😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:49:34", "owner": "themodel28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078459040938992, "text": "😭💔💔💔💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:36:36", "owner": "yinminang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940674508096763, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:09:18", "owner": "yyyyynn17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107182363626282, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:56:28", "owner": "wong_shayang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994078377892943, "text": "竹棚會列入香港基本法嗎？沒了竹棚就不是香港了！\n竹棚是香港不可切割的一部分！", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:19:56", "owner": "maxliang1968", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987158334871272, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:13:16", "owner": "vlasex_spiridonov666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117432625492983, "text": "God bless 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:43:13", "owner": "ariel.liupan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085916984095955, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:21:18", "owner": "wendywong809", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926958451159852, "text": "第一张照片我看着非常不舒服，不能拿别人的苦难当作品来吸引眼球这样的照片太操蛋了", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:20:42", "owner": "zhiyuanzhesiri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18379551754150471, "text": "Such powerful photo. Such helpless civilians 😔", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:19:37", "owner": "teeteeteeeee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074665307226513, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:11:08", "owner": "txw.cn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176383819367153, "text": "💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:10:22", "owner": "shereenanabel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042773057489883, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:02:59", "owner": "ineskochar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000049469692562, "text": "Horrific tragedy‼️", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:57:53", "owner": "lpell23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048473573434547, "text": "Devastating 😞", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:34:08", "owner": "msjjudy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092653669909233, "text": "GO :( corona 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:58:22", "owner": "theabbyyyy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083363267016435, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:24:16", "owner": "thehameddelaram", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100032652702622, "text": "❤️‍🩹", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:51:19", "owner": "leyakpinar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012952859804906, "text": "😂😂😂😂👍👍👍👍👍", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:43:34", "owner": "sanjar.452.206.174", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18538696093046454, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:43:14", "owner": "sanjar.452.206.174", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18395469001193906, "text": "😭😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:24:32", "owner": "jmdesloubieres", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094152565700163, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:23:12", "owner": "imcuteamber", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050540912378177, "text": "It’s a horror moment noone should ever witness 🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:20:01", "owner": "lanny_uklondon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046518905460569, "text": "💔 Heartbreaking beyond words.\nPrayers for every family affected, and deepest respect to the brave Hong Kong firefighters and rescue teams who rushed in without hesitation. 🕯️🙏\n\nMay the souls lost in this tragic blaze rest in peace, and may strength surround those still fighting for their lives.\nHeroes in uniform and the silent savers on the ground thank you for your courage. 🖤🔥\n\n#StayStrongHongKong #RespectForHeroes #PrayersForHK", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:15:27", "owner": "angelajey_pashmina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092628055897467, "text": "Kawawa naman ang mga tao 😭😭😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:57:38", "owner": "nonoyryanvillacarlos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902943322163566, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:54:22", "owner": "nese1106", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092360908934315, "text": "ANDAIMES DE BAMBU , QUERIAM O QUÊ? 😔", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:47:25", "owner": "denisedantasxavier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962826526005802, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:32:06", "owner": "iamwuwu_0409", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913544983240084, "text": "از این چینیها بعید نیست خود دولتشون اینکار و کرده باشه که ساختمانهای جدیدتری جاش بسازند و دوران کرونا اینکار و کردند", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:30:58", "owner": "bahar.bakhshi2727", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865574647438440, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:24:55", "owner": "anajulia.adeoliveira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022726931602704, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T10:06:39", "owner": "myrtelb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18437825446096458, "text": "First photo is photo of the year!", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:29:42", "owner": "jonasphoto_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997324962843996, "text": "🙏🙏🙏😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:15:33", "owner": "eyingllaaaa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110046454531399, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:54:28", "owner": "xiaole_chan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061529237239094, "text": "Horrible 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:43:37", "owner": "sanoo.mundo55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062346353211395, "text": "So sad right now.. prayers and healing ❤️‍🩹 💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:09:23", "owner": "angelinahurwitz45", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137057983466154, "text": "Our prayers to all the families who lost their loved ones ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:34:43", "owner": "packey_95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18195313687331368, "text": "💔💔💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:08:12", "owner": "rossiana170", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051185042667969, "text": "Quelle tristesse et quel horreur!!! 🙏🤍🕊🕊🕊🤍🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:50:35", "owner": "rmjordasegui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944379787075563, "text": "🙏🙏🙏💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:30:59", "owner": "shiyajun1990", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969626475975498, "text": "🚬 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:12:50", "owner": "swxpnill_07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888747688390688, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:50:06", "owner": "zhengli.john", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18207095884315536, "text": "💔😞", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:33:36", "owner": "brian.mirage", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18174294382370840, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:32:09", "owner": "yoonho0026", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896576671349286, "text": "Angered 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:15:33", "owner": "chillin2046", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075043217214278, "text": "愿平安", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:00:25", "owner": "cocoliting", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980626098779192, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:46:07", "owner": "sandytam911", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029000216753395, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:45:25", "owner": "joecool383", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061894151237650, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:45:07", "owner": "hinglikesing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108461584620300, "text": "Who's going to dig the truth under current hk", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:31:50", "owner": "francesinsh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092759468500602, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:29:49", "owner": "prettylaughquiteboi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048787949429872, "text": "Powerful, incredibly photos!", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:14:49", "owner": "mannyv8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063446594440515, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:11:51", "owner": "caramelo.mkt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954986470014930, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:03:01", "owner": "usarmymom69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138425797415960, "text": "🙏💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:55:16", "owner": "anri_laran_composer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046737017677963, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:04:06", "owner": "hao04wan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050520353662316, "text": "Sorry. Powerful first image. Don’t believe it’s real. Lightning seems off on the subject. But please, prove me wrong", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:34:15", "owner": "jeroenwillems_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006502847669744, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:30:12", "owner": "lydiaclary", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879639136332663, "text": "🙏🙏🙏💔💔😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:27:06", "owner": "nexusmediastudionyc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894407284222112, "text": "A expressão do desespero.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:26:55", "owner": "malubo2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847544923584884, "text": "ロイター通信の公式Xのプロフィール画像が1枚目の画像で神経を疑う。", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:14:45", "owner": "jurimari03080311", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091864105906949, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:10:28", "owner": "ghazalebhm96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105047572578602, "text": "Incredible shots", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:08:36", "owner": "nyhaingu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932576080131747, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:53:30", "owner": "wzqjohnny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094093135864758, "text": "Tragic 💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:53:02", "owner": "deb.cimino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958636551881978, "text": "Horrific… my heart goes out to the people of Hong Kong", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:49:02", "owner": "marinahueffner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086988400799781, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:21:30", "owner": "afraa_glr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955753438033427, "text": "Did you put your name in the Goblet harry???????", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:16:12", "owner": "silveiraphilip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105804091565508, "text": "🫂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:06:30", "owner": "kadijah1980", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18169538254340312, "text": "How terrifying.  He probably has family and friends living there.  I can’t imaging how hard that would be to watch.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:56:42", "owner": "nancyburrowgoar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146858230437622, "text": "Oh gush🫢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:55:27", "owner": "yaqhoda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18377436715152451, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:27:18", "owner": "mayorita2016", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120063877542877, "text": "🙏🏽💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:15:22", "owner": "concept_bymk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878166205440166, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:13:40", "owner": "su_forsberg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072263963523635, "text": "The first photo didn't have to go this hard", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:10:06", "owner": "krz_waw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977089452943734, "text": "When Godzilla attacks..... This is the ruin he leaves behind.... 🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:04:15", "owner": "point_break_bolso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114928306564066, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:53:02", "owner": "dianetingting.xiao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081982934471309, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:51:38", "owner": "anaumeda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18249240760295595, "text": "💔💔💔💔 praying for hk", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:25:36", "owner": "cocaxie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18201286282321989, "text": "Katastrofa😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:21:42", "owner": "cemalj2010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059544320275651, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:17:21", "owner": "ac4014", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098218561641319, "text": "🙏🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:15:31", "owner": "theresahuwae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18384368458198767, "text": "That photograph, which should win awards, tells the entire story, starting with the most important human angle.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:09:01", "owner": "aryafrancesca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087661642960231, "text": "I hope no one was in those structures when they collapsed", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:52:18", "owner": "gobboste75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954305061900610, "text": "Praying for HK Tai Po🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:49:55", "owner": "magenoodles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148029571437699, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:46:26", "owner": "chong_u_hang0511", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160211842395003, "text": "😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:36:43", "owner": "yejunbin66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095439229860444, "text": ":(", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:27:28", "owner": "kristie___________", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085694819004334, "text": "🙏🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:14:12", "owner": "mira.rai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084068087083933, "text": "💔🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:08:17", "owner": "sara.g.kh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985136820869351, "text": "😢😢🙏🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:03:06", "owner": "killy1957", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063461576620075, "text": "Poor people 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:55:12", "owner": "savoyspeakeasy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105014590633589, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:55:09", "owner": "hershkoyael", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18435612478109336, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:50:36", "owner": "yildizemanet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981189048936134, "text": "Brutal to look at, and an award winning image!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:49:21", "owner": "betsy_cullen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087465454989403, "text": "💔💔🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:47:46", "owner": "beingshabzz123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847614370610354, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:42:17", "owner": "mery_cebbar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848885146604856, "text": "this is so tragic but also shows why documentary photographers are still so needed 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:41:13", "owner": "anybodyshoots", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873372283463166, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:20:11", "owner": "sawnmirdha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080605682522130, "text": "希望一切安好🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:17:45", "owner": "rowan06123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104432089638582, "text": "Heart breaking 💔 my thoughts are with all effected.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:15:09", "owner": "mmkphoto1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18394963666130890, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:12:43", "owner": "priscila_2901", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049473596401566, "text": "😢so sad， I hope everybody can be fine", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:12:08", "owner": "vin_china_9929", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950259355027392, "text": "@damienharrous Je le reconnais !", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:10:23", "owner": "vince.collette", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074800376216284, "text": "加油，香港现在大陆这边很多人捐款了，一起共度难关🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:09:32", "owner": "muzi97153", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18536673784003407, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:06:52", "owner": "bre_irish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080108660469655, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:06:17", "owner": "renee.feng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321070099168400, "text": "Pray for Hong Kong🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:53:57", "owner": "joose_yiz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925447456174930, "text": "Schade😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:50:11", "owner": "liqian5016", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059067341274490, "text": "BEŞER ZULMEDE