": "2025-11-28T14:05:33", "owner": "glock2jz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933249991114438, "text": "🙏🏿🙏🏿🙏🏿", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:05:15", "owner": "milusj118", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002512559681591, "text": "😢😣😣😣", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:00:22", "owner": "10mar10tina10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18297650698280553, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:59:56", "owner": "bola.kulwinder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985954515871189, "text": "And none of them collapsed straight down into themselves despite being completely engulfed in flames.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:52:09", "owner": "mr.travistanner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988381029745568, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:45:28", "owner": "morelalauer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095956828879502, "text": "为香港祈祷🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:45:05", "owner": "1506539xue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049446422678319, "text": "悲しいことです。", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:43:43", "owner": "senzhangyi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18348987679206493, "text": "I this is so heartbreaking", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:37:47", "owner": "hashrachian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092682154910407, "text": "kind of crazy how they didn't collapse it makes you wonder", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:35:53", "owner": "woody608", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075159602585307, "text": "英国爸爸呢？", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:32:51", "owner": "the_modelsofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863530465532900, "text": "😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:30:19", "owner": "toniollipatricia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069534701094643, "text": "😞", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:29:29", "owner": "ahmetanak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060761939240618, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:27:51", "owner": "lovesale5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085627865062477, "text": "Hebrews 6: 1-3", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:23:44", "owner": "iamtherealberri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870215941393351, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:22:58", "owner": "andeluciateixeira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844741450619551, "text": "🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻💔💔💔💔😭😭😭😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:09:42", "owner": "amandavsza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846156214614968, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:09:26", "owner": "saeid_ezadpanah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860376871549979, "text": "Pretty sad rip the souls 💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:07:45", "owner": "hiphop_matters", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856881016562991, "text": "🙏🙏💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:06:27", "owner": "sydneysideray", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883565386410305, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:05:02", "owner": "esti_0108", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068665016106493, "text": "🙏🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T13:00:41", "owner": "factalistv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081967019117365, "text": "○○ 0353341041 jr東日本 騙し屋 東村山市野口町3-2-18 影高広 0908491112創価学会 0332291621 初めての人と話す時は、創価学会が嫌いと話して近づいても,家の塀に創価学会のポスターが貼られていないか調べてからに。恐ろしい騙し屋家業に騙されないようにする為に。薄汚い畜生以下に騙されないように。騙して、盗んで、返済せず、礼を言えず、謝罪せず、薄汚い手で触り、逃げ回る。 難聴隠し、弱視を誤魔化し黄色で入るjr東日本の新宿駅。大林組。大成建設。手を出し放題で首になった　かまどやで働いていたのが自慢。三和警備で一番偉いと自慢。自分の他は馬鹿ばかりと嘲笑う。 0332291621 三和警備保障 自称1967年7月16日生まれ,東村山市野口町3-2-18 影高広 認知症で垂れ流し 稼業騙し屋で警備員は笑える。カルト創価学会で隠す宗教村 検査済み子種無しの独身 発達障害で認知症の人間が、介護は馬鹿がすると嘲笑う 0423960491 河辺0423942823.森脇0364261280.岩間0332070285 在日、創価学会の教え オイラ、バカだから怖いと逃げる。 介護は馬鹿がすると嘲笑う 0423960491 河辺0423 在日、誰にでも抱かれて病気をばらまくのも創価学会の教え オイラ、バカだから怖いと逃げるのだけは教えられているからお上手。お上手。哀れだね。田舎者で人を騙すカルト宗教は万死に値する。 在日騙し屋爺さんが逃げ回る、創価学会の哀れな道化 三和警備保障の詰め所と自宅で男女を斡旋,自分の他は馬鹿ばかり。月収3000万円は小遣い.不動産収入は多数で金持ち自慢\nオイラ馬鹿だから怖いですが得意な逃げ台詞。手慣れた逃げ口 08034663577 nobody-perfect.0716-1967.ta@t.vodafone.ne.jp", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:54:32", "owner": "dongcunshan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911860957252871, "text": "🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:39:13", "owner": "nakhee_choi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970035447969498, "text": "💔💔💔😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:34:45", "owner": "anpar29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087136973050182, "text": "Instagramの収益を少しでも被災した方々に役立てて欲しい", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:25:05", "owner": "shig.e2244", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867440158489380, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:25:01", "owner": "zhiiishan_li", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185365909344996, "text": "A real human tragedy. It’s heartbreaking.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:19:09", "owner": "liz_syes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897785848346197, "text": "God help them💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:10:14", "owner": "_sahar_zamiri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031870595539227, "text": "😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:07:13", "owner": "carina.sundberg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087574264807166, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:58:48", "owner": "bibidawizard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541591537053787, "text": "😢😢😢120+的死亡人数 太痛心了", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:58:07", "owner": "wanghb__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088571500987638, "text": "😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:52:40", "owner": "kerim_0_65", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931052956140679, "text": "😭😭😭🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:49:37", "owner": "nilgun.ozturkler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089451205941597, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:47:21", "owner": "dalsoon_71", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112182607608941, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:37:39", "owner": "mitch_z11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089954879307512, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:25:16", "owner": "ooreneeoobean", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104708902633961, "text": "May their soul find peace 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:18:16", "owner": "infongraph", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103584748731843, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:12:00", "owner": "i_am_soura_dip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084567710016686, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:07:32", "owner": "chef_frank_ding", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083010605100536, "text": "深圳那边不是去支援了嘛…加油香港🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:07:09", "owner": "tianc_jojo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070223174368587, "text": "💔🙏😢🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:06:30", "owner": "ulku.agbabaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982913955926487, "text": "😢