: 18155183404412478, "text": "I am deeply saddened to hear about the devastating fire in Hong Kong, Tai Po. My thoughts are with all those affected by this tragedy.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:59:15", "owner": "giean5841", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981367401771063, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:58:36", "owner": "swigyee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098227120693680, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:55:42", "owner": "gracapintobasto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086433010982218, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙌🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:54:44", "owner": "marylou160709", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860678050544799, "text": "@syvie23 à hong kong", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:51:38", "owner": "qu4ntik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995327409846057, "text": "Heartbreaking💔😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:43:40", "owner": "maybrittpaulsen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086887468961653, "text": "香港加油！❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:41:26", "owner": "luinthew0rld", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18538211209016744, "text": "Terribile😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:40:54", "owner": "venetoladychef", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101902015673297, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:39:41", "owner": "daddy_richards10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160392901399803, "text": "🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:32:45", "owner": "enzangeles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096287521868934, "text": "💔💔💔😭😭😭🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:31:51", "owner": "hannahhan.06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867922996487135, "text": "🥲🥲🥲", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:26:48", "owner": "ayah.properti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056452994656214, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:18:30", "owner": "wuyiting4149", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904015978295463, "text": "💔😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:10:39", "owner": "its__lama__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865604398508693, "text": "This is devastating 💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:10:28", "owner": "thisismikhailaturner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971339535968681, "text": "愿平安", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:07:01", "owner": "william_lixn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084871658081702, "text": "😢😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:57:18", "owner": "ayten33ank", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091544986904485, "text": "I wanted to ask about fires that are said to be caused by smoking.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:55:44", "owner": "msfireal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847453285584853, "text": "“This tragic fire is not merely an accident, but a direct consequence of the systemic corruption embedded within the Chinese Communist Party’s authoritarian governance. Under a regime that prioritises political control, personal loyalty, and profit over public safety and accountability, building codes are routinely ignored, safety inspections are bought off, and officials cover up violations to protect their own interests and those of connected developers. When transparency is criminalised, oversight is nonexistent, and human lives are treated as expendable for the sake of stability and face-saving, such deadly incidents become inevitable outcomes of the CCP’s corrupt and unaccountable system.”", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:50:48", "owner": "rafiglai6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089024395771515, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:49:26", "owner": "maomaosky2077", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049844945398714, "text": "Китайська криза", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:44:08", "owner": "one.vanj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929125105118993, "text": "Imagine these old towers burning for days and WTC tower 7 collapsed in a couple of hrs.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:34:20", "owner": "renna_travel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937988101098617, "text": "😢😢😢😢💔💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:34:04", "owner": "ninabolashvili", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050523410661873, "text": "D.E.W (DIRECT ENERGY WEAPONS) Ultra Violet Beams (Lasers) can Burned through anything except the Color Blue.  #SmartCities #Agenda2030", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:29:45", "owner": "tito_theindigenouswarrior", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086976485489733, "text": "Best night ever", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:27:08", "owner": "timka_boi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070437353369984, "text": "💔 🤲🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:25:17", "owner": "fabulousprettylittlethings", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076802288191385, "text": "😭😭🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:22:43", "owner": "ellzzz_z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990447435894876, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:11:16", "owner": "richardvdpol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983450583925435, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:09:45", "owner": "vladimir_ikone_slike", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080721218133055, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:09:38", "owner": "phantu.trinh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085310240492213, "text": "🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:57:29", "owner": "miyanlulu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067322750112797, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:55:48", "owner": "janesmil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089351981311067, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:47:05", "owner": "yuxuanli7958", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872434882463161, "text": "T kêu má bán nhà mua chung cư ở :))))", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:35:23", "owner": "xx.ngh.ee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913833331095747, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:34:53", "owner": "zhiqin1992", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18194136997333432, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:31:05", "owner": "temirbekova_kunduz00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039703094508221, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:29:09", "owner": "shimingcatchwrestling", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075591424990719, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:18:23", "owner": "daniellechin_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083909813039004, "text": "🙏🙏🙏 Pray for Hong Kong", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:17:18", "owner": "veralin22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064884119158559, "text": "death toll: 128 and rising.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:15:55", "owner": "rollingmuffinz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893561719362661, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_a