r": "charlie_in_the_woodline", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956291605010950, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:11:35", "owner": "neurone_en_marche", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060545675248025, "text": "😭😭💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:09:30", "owner": "elenastellakat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069391238615410, "text": "Why the cinematography?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:09:07", "owner": "migalhitos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005666108668653, "text": "First pic bro is acting like there's a house fire 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:59:13", "owner": "notevill01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941176222100526, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:56:59", "owner": "linda_wong123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073759829212318, "text": "Praying for them", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:50:49", "owner": "white_soulss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902212207318149, "text": "그대로 화장터가 되었네", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:48:55", "owner": "bbchung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857566129502691, "text": "LORD HAVE MERCY!!!!! 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:35:43", "owner": "aktlperspective", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544919917022933, "text": "praying for them", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:29:51", "owner": "adoptcatspups", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088094053976998, "text": "🙏🏾❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️💯💯💯💯💯", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:28:35", "owner": "stillxmari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160493278395314, "text": "제발 실종자들이 모두 살아돌아오길요 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:25:38", "owner": "sunny_20240923", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899994643181784, "text": "heartbreaking 💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:23:11", "owner": "monakavehahangari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845021341617391, "text": "🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:14:26", "owner": "happyphotographer_1175", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059536820638686, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:10:29", "owner": "henry_cheung_12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991840113892570, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:09:59", "owner": "anasofialj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994077132713211, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:05:44", "owner": "rubelahmedjabed36", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941806477096955, "text": "Praying for Hong Kong 🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:57:08", "owner": "munisa3970", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868240399481877, "text": "😢😢😢望大家都平安！！🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:56:02", "owner": "janus__998", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842708254624565, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:55:39", "owner": "mummymia_mummymia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154451392413686, "text": "Omg😮💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:51:12", "owner": "atigh_iran_oman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988026627911157, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:50:34", "owner": "premjason_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102951823726964, "text": "竹筒飯💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:47:08", "owner": "kontiman2022", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096762598886303, "text": "Thought this was Ai", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:46:07", "owner": "world_of_oz1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857572201502671, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:43:16", "owner": "albert_valenhart_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860354512542445, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:39:34", "owner": "kimjiyoon02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867975976496991, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:39:31", "owner": "somethingothermother", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099382849695180, "text": "Why didn't these collapse into their own footprint and turn to dust like the twin towers? I don't get it....🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:26:54", "owner": "rickpercoco1776", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086300458989889, "text": "My deepest condolences to Hong Kong. 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:22:54", "owner": "jayden_ssong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098554990761897, "text": "🙏🏽🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:12:20", "owner": "deecalvero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069829349454662, "text": "鸽笼房确实要注意防火安全，也希望香港消防安全部门引以为戒，加大防火安全普及和提高抢险救灾效率", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:09:40", "owner": "xfgbjkknmh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867144058498893, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:07:33", "owner": "makhedama_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120958441546588, "text": "The photographs saying everything", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:00:48", "owner": "prvisirari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954460045029547, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:54:11", "owner": "paulinebritos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081715337138042, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:50:17", "owner": "nalsrayred", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090907363931357, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:50:07", "owner": "yatongsun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104656270584365, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:47:49", "owner": "samira_sami_too", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032268632745644, "text": "全世界都在保佑香港🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:42:15", "owner": "rainruien", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072915236357564, "text": "💔💔🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:41:40", "owner": "okplaynow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080162075167594, "text": "Видимо нужно новым строителям очень место под застройку", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:37:15", "owner": "gashevandrey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067645190601343, "text": "Que Dieu vous vienne en Aide pour limiter au maximum cette catastrophe...et que les personnes responsables soient arrêter pour expliquer ce qui est inexplicable...", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:36:33", "owner": "rohmer391", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059764658632469, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:35:03", "owner": "tokyovivian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18174577543372048, "text": "Happy to investigate it.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:34:02", "owner": "approvedgroup", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882032845420340, "text": "💔😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:31:42", "owner": "julia_x_gastrolog", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147271612448673, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:28:08", "owner": "4n__92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18198945907325012, "text": "Que triste", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:27:07", "owner": "dicasdehoteis.viagens", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860433994480006, "text": "😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:26:59", "owner": "mallakianno", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973339908955734, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:26:10", "owner": "m.m.r10000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091739854910332, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:23:44", "owner": "yttebf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075392960521317, "text": "❤️❤️❤️🙏🙏🙏😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:17:17", "owner": "rcrc9434", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049000505679546, "text": "this poor man will never be paid for the amount of times his face is being shown", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:09:31", "owner": "ginga_please", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077241782519685, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:06:00", "owner": "bangjun8422", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129897640441821, "text": "💔🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:03:14", "owner": "lizrodriguez62", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064682288174603, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:57:47", "owner": "tajanronald", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980000019941150, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:57:04", "owner": "coco0864", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038106056707246, "text": "Trump's America", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:55:04", "owner": "passthejointpods", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089342633494756, "text": "😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:54:06", "owner": "ms.polanco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18299324908273555, "text": "Heartbreaking 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:50:57", "owner": "thelunatic5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18438822925100988, "text": "They build this apartment building too tall.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:50:47", "owner": "bishopofnoyon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982149915925055, "text": "First photo is AI , disturbing to throw that in there", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:48:07", "owner": "phillyphuck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064630793548773, "text": "Heart breaking 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:48:02", "owner": "ankurahuja_designs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084765344008825, "text": "第一张照片太有震撼力和感染力了，虽然看到的是照片，但同样能感同身受。", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:47:14", "owner": "insidcn86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954534724040122, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:41:35", "owner": "catarinapintobasto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383466985144300, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:38:08", "owner": "volfanclc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102817507734025, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:30:52", "owner": "ajdrewych", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126660844507537, "text": "Incredible first image!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:30:32", "owner": "curriei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032228831759408, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:28:25", "owner": "akshu.uvf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058617707273916, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:26:59", "owner": "daeho_jeju", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083969030041221, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:25:43", "owner": "alessandralimagalhardo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064776200570808, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:21:35", "owner": "cookecatering", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084261527090491, "text": "🙏🙏❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:20:13", "owner": "1n4chi7_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865035094511300, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:17:55", "owner": "satchiya_u", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095444962863406, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:09:41", "owner": "r.t.y_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383983213149757, "text": "Ts photograph is kinda diabolical😭🥀", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:08:53", "owner": "igaream20", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17973049667805762, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:08:33", "owner": "roziorr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025974551587221, "text": "💔😭🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:06:31", "owner": "ayat_xx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094936261850600, "text": "Why didn’t the World Trade Center fires look this intense? Yet those collapsed perfectly in like an hr", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:05:46", "owner": "yung.neil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049038065414236, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:00:06", "owner": "illlleds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18394206562130636, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:57:43", "owner": "qz_market", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105829939726591, "text": "🙏🙏rip", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:56:43", "owner": "suyanlei0310", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100160152686597, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:56:10", "owner": "ringhsu1127", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850011112598986, "text": "These photos are so impactful 🙏🏾💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:49:44", "owner": "un_apologetically_nior", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853496824580916, "text": "🙏🏾🙏🏾🙏🏾", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:39:54", "owner": "idaho_ballers_basketball", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18421631695115543, "text": "😢😮💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:39:12", "owner": "tohorabb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18400895707126200, "text": "Oh no!!!! Where did this happening in HK??? I see it says NT but where?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:37:47", "owner": "faceform.us", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066317321128215, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:37:06", "owner": "joa.neluna558", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112987876574799, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:35:13", "owner": "marcinha.tri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067018934434783, "text": "So awful", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:33:30", "owner": "stellerlibrarian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922344904190848, "text": "First pic goes hard 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:32:56", "owner": "papasusej08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036500012718594, "text": "😭😭😭💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:32:11", "owner": "iamoppawong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172271197373450, "text": "My heart breaks for those who perished and their loved ones. Nothing is scarier than fire.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:31:24", "owner": "susanmcp1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932627776112582, "text": "心痛💔This is news that breaks my heart. May the deceased rest in peace. 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:29:21", "owner": "judyho123123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108541711620864, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:28:19", "owner": "larsfuckinglayag", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932663710112180, "text": "The Chinese have come to this day by oppressing and enslaving their people. Even if you become a world leader in this way, everyone will laugh at you. The important thing is to be a world leader by making your people live well. Get well soon. Man is not for the state.The state is for the people.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:25:38", "owner": "emre.k010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993017700891585, "text": "HOURS AND HOURS IN BURNING AND IT DIDNT COLLAPSE? THATS A BUILD", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:16:29", "owner": "beri.bauth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113661568600043, "text": "신께서 자비를 베푸시길 바라며, 가족들에게 조의를 표합니다. 😓", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:13:29", "owner": "pinademelo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085738661003284, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢💔💔💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:10:06", "owner": "history_delmundo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079290182473212, "text": "Omg this is HORRIBLE!!! 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:09:44", "owner": "mr_h_creates", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947804034936068, "text": "Very sad 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:06:08", "owner": "dolores.higareda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547820104045779, "text": "Ai bảo hiện đại an toàn coi mấy cái lò hạt gạo đi", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:05:44", "owner": "ooztiger04oo96oo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101179426740096, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:05:22", "owner": "t.eugenee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048328256433940, "text": "God bless the people of Hongkong🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:04:27", "owner": "eloideroxas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18494811043074862, "text": "Học cách tự bảo trì đi", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:04:05", "owner": "ooztiger04oo96oo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961514605005755, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:03:50", "owner": "yiyijeongeun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077436832950378, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:02:57", "owner": "jasminenatanian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075600257242148, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T01:01:51", "owner": "mico_and_chloe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973128720808857, "text": "Rip😭🙏🙏🙏🙏❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:59:55", "owner": "uzzwen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844581094619553, "text": "pray🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:59:23", "owner": "tttsfy3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082249880036385, "text": "This is heartbreaking.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:58:41", "owner": "skreid365", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965711889840356, "text": "So someone accepted the highest bid at the expense of owners, everyone involved got paid in side money and they used the cheapest contractors.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:53:34", "owner": "will__macc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079044673919689, "text": "🙏🏼 💜 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:53:05", "owner": "4theloveofcreativity24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079213897933771, "text": "Nangis gue liat foto ini 😭 pekerja ngerokok gak bertanggung jawab! Lu mungkin selamet tapi korban di dalam gimana?!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:52:11", "owner": "dlenstory", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991323735891058, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:47:29", "owner": "joycevidot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918871546218566, "text": "Pray for hongkong.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:42:17", "owner": "mrmickphoon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929498227150168, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:41:43", "owner": "ldennistw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842261389627221, "text": "Yes, I think pictures are necessary. Images are fundamental to keep events and history in our collective memory. The press is already curating and selecting what to show — let’s not start censoring ourselves", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:41:23", "owner": "giuul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18297884398280814, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:41:18", "owner": "mjbtastesgoodwhenitshould", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18379837546146246, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:39:52", "owner": "historia.com.cor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099107227755350, "text": "Dang, use the fire fighting drones... 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:38:09", "owner": "lye.oh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976190181954885, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:37:48", "owner": "_mamasong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059820248264875, "text": "I will never live in a high rise. So many people look at it like a luxury when your survival depends on others. Remember the condo buildings falling in Florida years ago. Just death traps", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:37:17", "owner": "nathantdean", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084708095513970, "text": "🙏🙏💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:36:54", "owner": "feat.lil_zach", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002370542681180, "text": "😢😢😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:35:55", "owner": "ateyarich", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902113075299408, "text": "Praying for Hong Kong 🙏💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:34:39", "owner": "cpthreeio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076024670194864, "text": "🙏🙏🙏💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:33:25", "owner": "rigox_jr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018149984792213, "text": "Ese tipo de edificaciones son trampas mortales, que terror 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:33:13", "owner": "pasajera_n_trance", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113112100588743, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:31:22", "owner": "yss_hmi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103281046735619, "text": "💔💔Prayers to everyone there💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:30:48", "owner": "concenribeiro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941307100092638, "text": "Spectacular images", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:29:37", "owner": "loganzillmerphoto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296235049287638, "text": "The japs did it", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:27:20", "owner": "honcai_lam_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070404989605281, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:25:28", "owner": "shida.izakaya_yakiniku", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136331341466251, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:20:30", "owner": "jonasstrandh_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18365680282089716, "text": "Sending prayers 🥺🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:18:58", "owner": "mirandaputrii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095185303857903, "text": "😢😢😢🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:17:39", "owner": "peer_jonas_mahle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028808996772161, "text": "😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:16:25", "owner": "ccasspina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047373095446629, "text": ":(", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:16:11", "owner": "darrelynsaloom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539590777029101, "text": "God bless 🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:14:16", "owner": "yariiwtf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037126325722923, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:11:28", "owner": "mariaelenil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114527326507623, "text": "Praying 🙏🏻 for Hongkong 🇭🇰 ❤️😮", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:11:01", "owner": "hiherfst", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044432804696169, "text": "😢😢😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:06:01", "owner": "vagnerluizdeabreu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147522538439469, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:03:47", "owner": "chuckmogayzel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165650230389127, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:01:19", "owner": "soldibatista", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18273503572304646, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:52:40", "owner": "iaminsurmountable", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870162517396596, "text": "🙏❤️😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:51:27", "owner": "french2824", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546950695025866, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:40:41", "owner": "irl9.13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080496938470295, "text": "🙏🙏🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:39:09", "owner": "nylasmom75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862402597537833, "text": "Hong Kong, stay strong!🙌🙏❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:37:36", "owner": "iscaco3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070077836365436, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:23:21", "owner": "sandrinha0974", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073172165200533, "text": "mandando amor y oraciones", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:21:53", "owner": "daysa_pachainti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071398385370255, "text": "I saw this photo yesterday.  It was like a gut punch… took my breath away.  This was totally preventable… Tragic.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:13:49", "owner": "dianamoonlady", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045883343474954, "text": "😭😭😭🤍🤍🤍pray for the people", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:12:57", "owner": "dear.lannn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054940343326146, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:05:29", "owner": "abdumalik.erkinovich", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082397789110329, "text": "In America, we call these situations \"False Flags\". (sadly)", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:01:57", "owner": "m.g.miller5150", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18342280432229288, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:01:07", "owner": "abhiith.pm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396572875133323, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:58:07", "owner": "jediobi68", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909423223255920, "text": "Horrible tragedy...but that first image is incredible!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:57:15", "owner": "srabanir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083941868021771, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:56:44", "owner": "lala_azevedo_78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987561363747234, "text": "🙏💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:53:33", "owner": "lailudan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980438145945833, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:50:02", "owner": "carolnahas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106203193643124, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:47:40", "owner": "sbmiles_photography_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071609039522107, "text": "Crying For Humanity…🥲", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:44:38", "owner": "drlovieelilly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146865109433925, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:33:14", "owner": "andreaarias24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320722744168503, "text": "take care", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:20:49", "owner": "letsgojack90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941580643088688, "text": "😢🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:06:11", "owner": "carabear6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087079394294095, "text": "🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:02:40", "owner": "bar_none__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078023462167080, "text": "Pray for Hongkong from Germany 🇩🇪😞", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:02:38", "owner": "chri86s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996668112704267, "text": "Heartbreaking and praying for all those who got affected by this tragedy! 🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:59:14", "owner": "imchuckng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926799631170800, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:56:04", "owner": "irmalu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095813776870303, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:54:32", "owner": "tax_free13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097376440833316, "text": "💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:53:50", "owner": "cosmicplanet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057409034291409, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:49:20", "owner": "magna__coely_maguy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18398268397193909, "text": "So sad", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:47:44", "owner": "oh.javi.san", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101021641688330, "text": "Someone lit something. There's just no other explanation for 3 buildings to go up in flames like that", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:34:58", "owner": "animecno", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979793346931888, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:32:22", "owner": "luisxar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030193103760697, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:31:45", "owner": "jiani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120109453534233, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:31:43", "owner": "gabsurena", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080661020157350, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:31:25", "owner": "carl_2662", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023114060597661, "text": "This is a horrible tragedy 😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:29:52", "owner": "yourstrulypam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097062487835625, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:26:14", "owner": "mcfey_22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18336573973235142, "text": "Lord, protect them from harm.  Amen🙏🏿.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:25:24", "owner": "wakanda71", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102685786674383, "text": "Tragic!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:24:25", "owner": "bruceandrews_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045401855689281, "text": "insane", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:22:23", "owner": "brucelabounty802", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034721432723865, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:21:58", "owner": "giselebpassos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964105416989842, "text": "第一张照片在贩卖别人的痛苦…", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:18:57", "owner": "passuzyliu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864086785519606, "text": "🙏希望不要再有伤亡了", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:17:11", "owner": "fan_yang2023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965136192846867, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:16:13", "owner": "pili.temprano", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110199781719097, "text": "💔💔🙏🏾", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:14:54", "owner": "kekevirginie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18150866905424038, "text": "Such a tragic event. 💔\nMy thoughts are with the victims, their families, and everyone affected by the fire in Hong Kong. The bravery of the firefighters working to contain the blaze is truly commendable.\n\nHoping for the safety of all those still trapped and a swift recovery for those injured.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:14:29", "owner": "lili.53837", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917426188209055, "text": "😢💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:14:17", "owner": "lorenzzae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133570060484176, "text": "All that fire.. hmmmm... I wonder why the buildings haven't collapsed into their footprint yet??? Oh I guess it's because there's no jet fuel.Yeah, that's right.It takes jet fuel to do that....", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:13:51", "owner": "chuckelhead", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079246024926594, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:12:19", "owner": "wladdko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067716935123443, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:11:59", "owner": "tiffanyfashionweekparis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18415770433142661, "text": "Praying 🤲 & Everyone in high rise buildings 🏙️ practice your escape plan!!!! It is normal in today’s world 🌎 blessings and condolences 💐 ❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:11:31", "owner": "tiffanyfashionweekparis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999890259835237, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:11:27", "owner": "fabienne_formark", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898872889342040, "text": "🙏🙏❤️❤️😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:08:56", "owner": "eluviasilva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099690640749108, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:05:44", "owner": "ly_luyuan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098839309817474, "text": "🙏💔💪🏼👪", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:04:51", "owner": "andreluiznunes_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074529599204788, "text": "🙏🏼🙏🏼🙏🏼🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:03:02", "owner": "yasolzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071112572345085, "text": "The first photo: \"My phone was in there!\"", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:00:59", "owner": "ultravires04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18516940486071039, "text": "Why crop out the copyright of this photo? Shame on you!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:55:11", "owner": "homeswweetthome", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352211737162662, "text": "Praying for some miracles.🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:54:01", "owner": "mayrambles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968209006002397, "text": "prayers up", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:50:05", "owner": "in2styleshoes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18387638881183024, "text": "Jesus, . . Lord keep everyone safe and bring comfort to those that have lost something or someone", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:47:39", "owner": "falongbenga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065228885428621, "text": "Blackrock Towers: coming soon to HK", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:47:25", "owner": "instagrasher", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18336620398227009, "text": "@quintana_laya", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:46:48", "owner": "quintana__luna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073629782253203, "text": "Horrific event, but that photo will win awards.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:46:08", "owner": "e459101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302954464254596, "text": "😢💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:40:36", "owner": "conny_tempessy_laurens", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080875667149402, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:38:49", "owner": "bdrssr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329858221240591, "text": "Omg this is so sad and scary hoping that whoever was hurt has a fast recovery", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:37:44", "owner": "the_corseted_fairy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905420482278725, "text": "Wow powerful pictures 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:37:43", "owner": "dimitrispolymenopoulos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18149898373425892, "text": "Bu evler dikey mezarlık 😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:28:35", "owner": "ahmet1971kaya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301917505248668, "text": "🙏😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:28:28", "owner": "giryo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082794152097957, "text": "Que tragédia!😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:26:42", "owner": "vania.salesimoveis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991778787730554, "text": "Katastrofa", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:23:50", "owner": "drina.drina.drina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119607451538935, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:23:49", "owner": "jerry_t0412", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028656344567494, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:22:37", "owner": "santiago_rojas990", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064603280161138, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:20:08", "owner": "chandravaliw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045786914481100, "text": "Omg😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:18:10", "owner": "tiozinhodocafe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867399040488029, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:15:35", "owner": "karasucihangir57", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091994078499485, "text": "This is so horrible. But I think there is a massive safety failure here in the way the apartments were built one fire on one should not spread like that!! What the hell happened here?!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:13:14", "owner": "pdid_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968639544830202, "text": "Amen🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:13:05", "owner": "ivyzhangyw_w", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928686007119742, "text": "😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:12:36", "owner": "forstwittenberg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904615534292052, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:11:50", "owner": "katrin_popp_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062272139636153, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:11:22", "owner": "laura.fur.3511", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119509864480612, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:10:18", "owner": "karollarevaloj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890897782379582, "text": "💔🙏🏾", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:09:08", "owner": "_________melanie_________", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540256675000466, "text": "Horrible. My heart is with the people and also the animals affected, wounded or killed by the fire.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:01:09", "owner": "mowingmountains", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025179407587990, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:58:40", "owner": "pixelle_milie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847279978611001, "text": "I didn’t believed my eyes when I saw a first picture. My preyers are with people inside.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:51:28", "owner": "violet.joburg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094918894871902, "text": "😢 çok  üzüldüm", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:50:37", "owner": "yaseminden_organik_sunumlar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098229496792141, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:43:32", "owner": "leta_beesnz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18150830611423412, "text": "OMG💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:41:47", "owner": "petriemary17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993289386852602, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:38:01", "owner": "ess_med_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017242532623120, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:36:50", "owner": "wangtiping", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948254482063878, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:35:19", "owner": "oganesian.anush", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161601445396161, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:32:00", "owner": "cassmoneypoles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057476222312132, "text": "💔💔Prayers. We extend our condolences to all family affected. 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:30:08", "owner": "thaifarmhouse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079363339907438, "text": "💔🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:25:57", "owner": "wildkindreddesignstudio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958493110010027, "text": "What a tragedy !! My heart goes to the beautiful people of Hong Kong", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:25:46", "owner": "algerianoverthinker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005597150667524, "text": "😢😢😢😢😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:20:01", "owner": "dantee_choi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18418049791118368, "text": "Unglaublich 💔 aber leider wahr!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:19:07", "owner": "hexe.manu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950779117052150, "text": "😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:17:46", "owner": "se_baa74", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984346614919475, "text": "💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:15:36", "owner": "codico99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885072145284623, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:14:53", "owner": "shadiadager", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850224604562611, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:12:47", "owner": "almerichendricks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091466755934842, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:07:17", "owner": "yberlyampuero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038068997720294, "text": "Göktelen yapılırken söndürme niye düşünülmüyor? 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:04:13", "owner": "yaseminaslankln", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073974569258287, "text": "😭😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:58:38", "owner": "tina.lee.vietnam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087859070294825, "text": "😮😢🔥🙌💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:58:09", "owner": "abeautybehindtheirstory", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986570415911777, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:57:16", "owner": "tonypekula", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096329962867408, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:54:33", "owner": "voitrin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541038307045322, "text": "💔💔💔😢😢😢🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:53:07", "owner": "chris_city", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905801767286068, "text": "😭😭🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:52:25", "owner": "marianatoma14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18210035602313418, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:49:47", "owner": "mlteryilmaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047528375439992, "text": "😭💔😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:48:52", "owner": "irmaminhaanatureza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18380081572197212, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:48:35", "owner": "behr007_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876735994356317, "text": "❤️🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:48:18", "owner": "justsold_atl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051336059354206, "text": "As a Londoner this gives me flashbacks to Grenfell Tower. I hope Hong Kong does a better job holding those responsible to account.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:45:12", "owner": "jjimode", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104739511732896, "text": "😭😭💔💔🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:44:12", "owner": "miragetea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098299402771019, "text": "🖤", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:41:38", "owner": "anufee", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17910111645256563, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:37:38", "owner": "bernieobmaces", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099081565695560, "text": "Praying for HK🙏🏻🇭🇰", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:36:28", "owner": "tmf_416", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918277351227402, "text": "🙏🙏🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:33:44", "owner": "bcyoung_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143110528397460, "text": "💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:30:41", "owner": "david_shouc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053003879664211, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:30:05", "owner": "_mmilatte_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930350104141325, "text": "No words can describe the horror this tragedy brings. Praying for everyone affected 😭💔🙏.", "created_at"