": "silviu_amador9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100872685740251, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:00:17", "owner": "silviu_amador9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090744187740181, "text": "Heartbreaking. 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:58:47", "owner": "francissanagustin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970398006970257, "text": "💔💔💔愿逝者安息 希望香港政府可以重视起这种高密度community 的安全性！", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:58:32", "owner": "gigiwang41", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922896526194978, "text": "THE CATS AND DOGS I can’t even fathom how terrifying it was for the pets", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:53:52", "owner": "live_strong240", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020039126612153, "text": "加油香港 !", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:52:59", "owner": "kazue.meyy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18178145131365795, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:52:39", "owner": "jeffzijincai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18202472113320797, "text": "hoping that the pets are okay💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:52:33", "owner": "beryl_ot7", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18087537889807910, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:49:37", "owner": "weelian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164337298376015, "text": "Incredible heart breaking 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:48:38", "owner": "yiran82003", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857997991559169, "text": "💔🤲", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:46:50", "owner": "vieira1088", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024801539592548, "text": "Praying for all those affected! 🙏🙏💔💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:45:09", "owner": "mrandmrshowell2015", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866068999508347, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:43:18", "owner": "adul.a9930", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18509317066069522, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:41:17", "owner": "federica.bellini.52", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987385767748775, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:40:41", "owner": "gizhals", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047818418443603, "text": "Wow. Extremely sad to read this horrific news, especially for these families to have to go through this close to the holidays. 😢😢😵😫🤯", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:40:29", "owner": "mikevassi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956262043031369, "text": "😭😭 😭 far out how scary 😩 and if it was deliberately lit like I saw in an article well 🤦🏼‍♀️🤦🏼‍♀️ those poor residents, thinking of you ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:40:23", "owner": "kelly_mclintock91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917990383213505, "text": "😭💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:38:46", "owner": "lenesusannehonore_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915441559087199, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:38:07", "owner": "yvonnesbabygirl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171729565333085, "text": "This is so sad 😢🥺😣😔! And very heartbreaking 💔🥺! This photo really captures his grief and despair and how helpless he feels that he can’t do anything, knowing that his wife is trapped along countless others inside a burning building 🥺!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:36:58", "owner": "starsinthesky03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026952797773076, "text": "El manto verde y los andamios de bambú ayudaron a que se expandiera el fuegos 🔥 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:33:46", "owner": "juliocesar189", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089415599298161, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:30:54", "owner": "ahliang119", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298615048260875, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:28:48", "owner": "soydonpablo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067755149390346, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:26:17", "owner": "vincent_barreneche", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084733604063272, "text": "@kwonjiiiii ㅠㅠㅠㅠㅠㅠㅠㅠㅠㅠ", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:23:17", "owner": "jihye__0215", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126795979508129, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:22:26", "owner": "goodbettervibes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075641147184776, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:21:21", "owner": "ag_lima_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18347828308207659, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔❤️🙏❤️🙏❤️🙏❤️🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏❤️❤️❤️🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏❤️❤️🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏❤️❤️🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:20:57", "owner": "m