"owner": "360.outfit1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329394292214440, "text": "天佑香港🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:02:43", "owner": "szyuniris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870137614392229, "text": "😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:00:20", "owner": "caiocesar.a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088517548788658, "text": "First photo had me in tears. The human despair... heartbreaking 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:57:28", "owner": "elle_na_beliman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088634914945269, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:56:57", "owner": "dmitryteploukhov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882804364415866, "text": "Geezus sending love and prayers man that first pic got me 😞", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:56:47", "owner": "l_sav_l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098229640641227, "text": "📉😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:53:04", "owner": "andreivladimirovich900096", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126486523509111, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:50:15", "owner": "ifra_nurr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065204837413508, "text": "So sad", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:49:04", "owner": "8avalanche8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072651554589052, "text": "Xi Jinping  is too busy building islands and his navy up to care about his people, getting control of Taiwan is more important", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:47:29", "owner": "ludivicoperillo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008511752810960, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:46:40", "owner": "su3872su", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921581035057753, "text": "Yet another reason that I would never live in a high-rise like that. Prayers to all affected. 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:46:29", "owner": "bzmk7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098625070698526, "text": "Heartbreaking", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:45:59", "owner": "reneemariefontenot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185670097342286, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:45:39", "owner": "paulasmithmoreno", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083070476036472, "text": "😭😭😭😭💔💔💔💔🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:45:03", "owner": "henning.sheila", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917297800232571, "text": "😢💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:44:29", "owner": "nina_f91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104404432659853, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:43:30", "owner": "me.folla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872493148461597, "text": "Woah, that first photo is incredibly powerful", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:42:59", "owner": "annehelenevans", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950636896027107, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:42:13", "owner": "punch_ramen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18437854408099525, "text": "I Pray in Jesus name 😭✝️❤️🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:39:39", "owner": "taniamus89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073353245587697, "text": "This is horrifying. Prayers for all affected 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:39:28", "owner": "mjmolo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137893744457094, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:38:11", "owner": "mike.le0n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059281415252845, "text": "Afschuwelijk😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:37:54", "owner": "ellen_elens", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989556120902095, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:37:21", "owner": "4hi_o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18201557758319864, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:37:15", "owner": "xyuuu.ovo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152696314413328, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:34:02", "owner": "zhaoyan.gu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071617685056728, "text": "This photo captures the horror and despair - so so heartbreaking.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:32:26", "owner": "andrea_10128", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062494028207024, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:32:26", "owner": "thuhemavarni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086320867970568, "text": "🙏🏽🙏🏽🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:29:10", "owner": "lindasweisshattar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993403395856465, "text": "#pemerintahindonesiatetapkayaktaik #bubarkandpr", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:26:27", "owner": "panggilsajalubis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919421623207289, "text": "😳😳😢😢🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:25:37", "owner": "will_i_am_hamburg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120487879550720, "text": "🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:24:40", "owner": "harlem_muse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885937030282112, "text": "😢😢😢🙏🙏🙏💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:23:00", "owner": "kenanosman2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885122485286174, "text": "Is safe to say: wang was fuked😭🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:18:46", "owner": "jolly_jorgeoliveira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138391009413224, "text": "🙏😢🕊️ RIP", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:18:41", "owner": "hentschel604", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076678361269877, "text": "Praying for them🙏 i love HK💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:18:36", "owner": "_yuqiuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066979169122148, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:17:54", "owner": "esthermrsyip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064109468568474, "text": "😢😢😢💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:14:09", "owner": "tzinamanoukou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868024534417032, "text": "6 7", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:13:34", "owner": "bpoage98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18414893650188197, "text": "💔💔 prayers for Hong Kong 🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:12:53", "owner": "ntpp29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088041778946108, "text": "were all of the buildings under renovation at the same time? so confused about the scaffolding and the green mesh.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:12:50", "owner": "djtravluv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961841658862868, "text": "Heartbreaking 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:11:05", "owner": "nonna_niki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073860182520780, "text": "💔💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:08:28", "owner": "oktaa0___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099469474701704, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:08:01", "owner": "amywang1802", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902117878316866, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:06:55", "owner": "mariebaliceward", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084298715085007, "text": "😢😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:05:07", "owner": "avital64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843922879612305, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:04:20", "owner": "miss_anndubai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087390319982355, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:01:32", "owner": "denize_arruda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078987718932073, "text": "Se hive já esteve em Hong Kong é fácil imaginar o motivo do incêndio: gambiarras. A cidade toda tem fios que parecem um ninho de rato, ligando os prédios do centro da cidade entre si.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:01:04", "owner": "alemovel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013255919635676, "text": "😢😢😢🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:58:31", "owner": "innatoder770", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060540149235766, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:55:49", "owner": "gahei_tu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092195663498928, "text": "💔🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:55:32", "owner": "um_thira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849304744599687, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:55:23", "owner": "_a.n.s.o.n._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051816329370332, "text": "From Malaysia to Hong Kong, we stand in solidarity with Tai Po. May the victims rest in peace, and may their families find comfort. 🕯️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:55:11", "owner": "foodiepg2122", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18316983211222971, "text": "Terrível", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:54:51", "owner": "gg.moreira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101893591673837, "text": "天佑香港🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:54:39", "owner": "lionfaceboy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909491359122991, "text": "So sad 💔😔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:53:39", "owner": "lili.mozayyani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909372439122146, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:52:42", "owner": "gabipmello", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114468553604763, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:42:44", "owner": "yolotilt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972472464966962, "text": "Heartbreaking. Praying for families.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:41:34", "owner": "skincareinscrubs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087691742313793, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:40:55", "owner": "nycmarblecareinc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070370999369961, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:38:57", "owner": "ponka005_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18549830671056739, "text": "😭😭😭😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:37:10", "owner": "oblivien", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042972521702121, "text": "너무 가슴 아픈 사진입니다. 홍콩 화재 희생자분들께 깊은 애도를 표하며, 모든 피해자분들이 힘든 시기 용기 잃지 않고 잘 이겨내시기를 기도하며 응원하겠습니다.🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:36:56", "owner": "emigrant.xy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923201722193132, "text": "Devastating", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:36:21", "owner": "lilmemishi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050370731662570, "text": "auw Gosh wat een foto's", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:35:47", "owner": "mischavanangelbeek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18536689603032123, "text": "💔😭 governments don't care about people", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:34:42", "owner": "brigittabelanszky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079776590173678, "text": "Sad", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:34:07", "owner": "whiteflowerpig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089829259746831, "text": "💔💔🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:32:40", "owner": "mariam_jashi777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080238677162183, "text": "香港の高層マンションは各部屋の両隣と上の部屋と下の部屋に火が燃え移らないような防火素材を使っていないそうだ。また、避難階段が煙や火が入らない構造にはなっていないとの事で避難できず閉じ込められた住人が多数犠牲になったと消防の専門家が言っていた", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:31:30", "owner": "toritetsu_ko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897761635343909, "text": "Stay Strong HK 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:26:38", "owner": "filo.caracciolo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18540675874015468, "text": "💔🙏🏾💔🙏🏾😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:26:35", "owner": "terry_torial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945195343064939, "text": "the first picture is horrible... like he didn't want to end up on all newspapers all around the world. He probably lost his wife in the fire...", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:25:26", "owner": "kayanecray", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073949777210876, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:25:22", "owner": "maudto51", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855025756571807, "text": "天佑香港😭🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:23:06", "owner": "veronicayyang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105098389712212, "text": "🙏🙏😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:19:40", "owner": "wangxiaofeng01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906995986272432, "text": "Absolutely horrendous. No words", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:17:16", "owner": "advancednutritionclinic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18379613545194108, "text": "畫面完全唔靚☹️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:17:02", "owner": "lamlam7461", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065637794434328, "text": "💔💔💔so sad 😔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:16:39", "owner": "jeffery_koo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931904896134714, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:15:54", "owner": "ciaoan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913793416096345, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:12:09", "owner": "tinaaisha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071412641359837, "text": "🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:11:16", "owner": "wanting_hhi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063078086450470, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:10:58", "owner": "neumi_angie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367591768083486, "text": "Oh God Jesus Christ 🥲", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:10:51", "owner": "broxy1717", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063668630540138, "text": "😢😢😢😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:10:40", "owner": "jen_pkn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902685748324145, "text": "True nightmare - praying for these people 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:10:30", "owner": "chrislovesinsta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123960214519650, "text": "I love Hongkong 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:08:08", "owner": "diah3mawardi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545783968000349, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:07:21", "owner": "diah3mawardi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18288643120302359, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:06:45", "owner": "lawrence.tsu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989996643904804, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:06:37", "owner": "mermaidofcristals", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18495958474078636, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:05:25", "owner": "chensibei318", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098850310805831, "text": "My beautiful city... We are heartbroken 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:05:08", "owner": "ohroxo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085965887083713, "text": "I Hope his wife is Healthy an Alive 😢🙏❤️‍🩹 the man on the First picture. It so Heart Breaking 😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:02:55", "owner": "ella_tinkabella", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061535828225440, "text": "香港好落后哦", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:02:46", "owner": "figghdd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885943291402290, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:02:09", "owner": "dimplexgram", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979204647939428, "text": "The world is going crazy please treat others equally and love", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:02:06", "owner": "californiachinadoll98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088266274950510, "text": "加油香港，挺过难关🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:01:56", "owner": "jinrui0607", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071083964364080, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭😭🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:01:11", "owner": "amodeoliliana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893410165361428, "text": "😔😔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:59:36", "owner": "hamedkhorshidiphoto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901632535326865, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:58:04", "owner": "__020121_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540710680034716, "text": "💔 🙏 Can’t believe this is happening", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:56:40", "owner": "californiachinadoll98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046464425691962, "text": "I don't think this would've happened in HK was still independant. China never cared for the safety of the common man.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:55:46", "owner": "stagiestpizza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983628060765462, "text": "Why Chinese mainland are barking in the comments?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:52:22", "owner": "antonbilukha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082299964891029, "text": "❤️🙏❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:50:45", "owner": "petrifriman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950053626917851, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:49:10", "owner": "rafika_khalil123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999487401692418, "text": "It’s interesting to see how the low-quality US press keeps trying to portray China negatively. But it’s inevitable… China is already bigger and better than US. Stop trying to manipulate people — it only makes this situation even more embarrassing for you.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:48:11", "owner": "celeiro_sjc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193959193332734, "text": "💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:47:29", "owner": "niyanmei2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093669103920184, "text": "Todas as palavras são nulas, diante desta foto. Deus misericórdia 😢🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:47:10", "owner": "edemarapissaia6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304686421266924, "text": "If the first photo was taken without the person’s consent, it’s basically camera bullying, it’s exploiting the victim’s pain.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:46:46", "owner": "fan_qingyi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141716464453250, "text": "😔😔😔😔😔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:46:37", "owner": "sousan__zmn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073680008202694, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:46:30", "owner": "sasmithaputri95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892948441363629, "text": "Жесть", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:46:27", "owner": "sergofilm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104767705649782, "text": "Do they still want arunachal pradesh?😭😢 First take care inside", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:44:53", "owner": "vinay_edits", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110626099609493, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:43:46", "owner": "l.lingrui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059272952643009, "text": "God bless all people who were touched by this tragedy", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:43:17", "owner": "welldonejenn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077912429223701, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🇭🇰", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:42:20", "ow