will of the subject🙏🙏🙏When I'm in pain, I don't want anyone to point the camera at me!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:22:11", "owner": "lizzie_cierrrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118048609485321, "text": "🙏🙏🙏❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:20:18", "owner": "yayingtipoy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852306667591308, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:19:13", "owner": "how__to_wear", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193744894330672, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:17:39", "owner": "raia.imperial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027572732574496, "text": "😢💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:15:32", "owner": "_slimgoodie0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077498612177384, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:13:42", "owner": "iwanna1111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087881806788687, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:13:37", "owner": "iwanna1111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915304549085950, "text": "💔 devastating. . . I pray with love for the suffering 💔❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:11:19", "owner": "jotakessnaps", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18400628032192325, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:10:01", "owner": "azzzzz_0810", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152168185417412, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:08:53", "owner": "missperfectanita", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926436568168327, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:08:24", "owner": "gavea_zanne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047990645429408, "text": "😢😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:07:49", "owner": "miss_ylwan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18423284752114670, "text": "so sad", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:07:22", "owner": "kamisama070", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158859724393463, "text": "願逝者安息🙏傷者平安🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:07:17", "owner": "fred_rush1np", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923195065192377, "text": "the first photo is powerful, but it somehow makes me feel uncomfortable as it's so crule to him", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:04:18", "owner": "rue0128", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099325132705633, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:02:52", "owner": "mushinskaia_inna_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846073861614266, "text": "Horrible", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:01:44", "owner": "artclubcardiff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989386521905130, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:01:08", "owner": "mouradian_arminee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070786538369917, "text": "😭🙏🙏🙏🙏Please God, please help them.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:56:19", "owner": "shelove0116", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950159394915782, "text": "😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:55:19", "owner": "oliviaxleung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091415371931745, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:54:09", "owner": "anna_r_62", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067291541410465, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:53:42", "owner": "knitato", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980355282935797, "text": "Inaccettabile 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:53:37", "owner": "alberto.cuccuru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941446060084672, "text": "Yo wtffffff", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:53:29", "owner": "bynwabugo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18317605696300484, "text": "👁️...", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:53:25", "owner": "noplastik.fr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160294063393151, "text": "首图镜头对准了受灾者的崩溃情绪，配上奇怪的构图和镜头畸变，我从这张照片中只感受到镜头霸凌的不适感！媒体只顾用受灾者的苦难当作猎奇来吸引眼球，丝毫不考量伦理和温度！对于受灾被摄者来说，这种毫无人文关怀的照片无疑是二次创伤。", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:51:27", "owner": "a1exanderhu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944022571065226, "text": "So messed up. 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:50:05", "owner": "tamgam45", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010142984806249, "text": "😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:49:50", "owner": "janelyin1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18381698932145892, "text": "Absolutely horrifying 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:48:20", "owner": "lavidajessi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984987117866926, "text": "Nightmare 😮, heartbreaking !💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:48:14", "owner": "silviaingeneva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886878079398202, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:47:24", "owner": "reneewanzi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028523600758672, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:45:45", "owner": "domusaureaarchitecture", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18519163747067466, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:45:28", "owner": "wang_hsiyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086431268000341, "text": "Que triste ..", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:45:20", "owner": "geralbulgarelli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541949818027059, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:43:11", "owner": "binnnnnnn.12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032825465528564, "text": "Mamma mia, è terribile 😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:42:23", "owner": "blucia_10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108845089616290, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:38:59", "owner": "hky135neko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147915025430782, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:38:56", "owner": "pitaamainos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012453848801208, "text": "The first pic is inappropriate", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:38:29", "owner": "ccc4rrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944893801078822, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:36:53", "owner": "veronurdarianu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117921211553603, "text": "🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:35:52", "owner": "m_a_s_t_e_r_p_i_e_c_e_____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073613483522080, "text": "The first photo is so powerful, but is it ok without permission of the person in it? It’s very sad for him to see it, hurting him again maybe", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:34:35", "owner": "estella__zhou", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18068047160580048, "text": "Minhas orações pelas vítimas e familiares 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:34:26", "owner": "zaine.olyver", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991552809902847, "text": "🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:33:11", "owner": "chefrafaelmoreira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540610447011379, "text": "😢😢😢😢💔💔💔💔💔😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:32:27", "owner": "elisa_alvarez_beca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065017826402546, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:29:23", "owner": "d.san.miguel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860370376549383, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:29:23", "owner": "wuhuilin12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975800892949112, "text": "Eu lamento muito mesmo 😭 meus sinceros sentimentos pra todos que passaram por isso 🙌😢😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:29:19", "owner": "cmagronand", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040400384687029, "text": "May all beings be free from suffering and the causes of suffering🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:29:05", "owner": "the_tao_of_kim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161213095393645, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:28:30", "owner": "syh_38761", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094890349810207, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:28:17", "owner": "slagarcia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932816617109132, "text": "镜头霸凌……", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:27:55", "owner": "napping1229", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133286440483835, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:27:20", "owner": "burrrned", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929749642154616, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:25:19", "owner": "adel.haghighi.tabrizi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084439688095293, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:24:22", "owner": "keiralynh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293066325149629, "text": "Terrible and so sad", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:23:20", "owner": "lamaisonjaune_sault", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18344904502200302, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:22:44", "owner": "thebriannabarnes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18373009693156915, "text": "🙏🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:22:20", "owner": "vongsifu713", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051982958343511, "text": "Was the first picture published with the consent of the individual involved? Otherwise, I believe this constitutes camera bullying. Please do not exploit the suffering of the victims", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:21:46", "owner": "yaomatsuri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120338158480049, "text": "Very, very sad", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:19:36", "owner": "bartbuiring", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040433693505008, "text": "Sending prayers 🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:19:26", "owner": "paradeedydi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106433527713973, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:19:17", "owner": "lirfc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064679807567842, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:19:02", "owner": "bartbuiring", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981012723776356, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:19:02", "owner": "suiiilulu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082977086103433, "text": "😢😢😢😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:17:10", "owner": "tatyana_gzh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090880225918118, "text": "the first pic is really comfortable to see… please leave some space for them", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:13:15", "owner": "peerless0.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060701006633525, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:10:36", "owner": "listendeepak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085868575958188, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:10:20", "owner": "i_m_finethanku___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160609750401661, "text": "prayers 💔😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:09:30", "owner": "cherlynharyono", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116047108563022, "text": "This is crazy! How on earth could this happen?! 🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:09:18", "owner": "j0_j0xo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063918353186801, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:08:49", "owner": "13thvision", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104591914634315, "text": "💔🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:07:15", "owner": "alice_zbw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547258645038790, "text": "Wtf is happening on earth?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:06:56", "owner": "ddalgiaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902773753162999, "text": "😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:05:19", "owner": "jiniholic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068923571080967, "text": "and thats a really fake photo", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:05:16", "owner": "mandy_kidd666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064438799451785, "text": "Deeply saddened by the news about the Hong Kong