think when I see anything nowadays", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:08:04", "owner": "d1ssolvedboy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081723994893051, "text": ":(( may peace and justice come and heal the wounded 🙏. A heartbroken day for many in Hong Kong", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:05:31", "owner": "micxmic", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18381083542149151, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:04:59", "owner": "gishotei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18378757756146269, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:04:37", "owner": "hillie_1986", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961681257860100, "text": "lit af 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:04:23", "owner": "blimp974", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067135976110918, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:03:42", "owner": "sylvie.jeronimo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008348975656692, "text": "God Save people and bless them 🙏 2025 is not going slow 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:01:02", "owner": "warezbb.official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889841281385871, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:00:49", "owner": "lucasspaulista", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958365414883118, "text": "🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:58:51", "owner": "mustafavabdullah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936166195101419, "text": "Photo of the year", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:58:40", "owner": "cathyleeosmond", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545972557017934, "text": "The first one — what a shot. And yet so awful 💔🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:57:50", "owner": "discokatze", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352873411165031, "text": "Why didn’t they fall to the ground like the 9/11 buildings did ? 🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:56:46", "owner": "therealchaga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053821868661776, "text": "💔😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:55:50", "owner": "angelicasanchez3252", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098697178699942, "text": "#hongkongbaşınızsagolsun😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:55:26", "owner": "erenhakangulsumceren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540954556054542, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:55:19", "owner": "hettimoda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084409637047607, "text": "What happened to those water drones used in drill ?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:54:52", "owner": "vikfps", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120383635546417, "text": "😢😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:54:40", "owner": "chankwanyiu0122", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071545586590244, "text": "Oh Deus que triste! Meus sentimentos a população de Hong Kong. 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:50:26", "owner": "caca.fernanda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005556356819516, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:49:20", "owner": "leoromanski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107572342552532, "text": "RIP🙏🏻🙏🏼🙏🏻💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:49:00", "owner": "psychedelic.liang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18345142222205550, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:48:22", "owner": "fpborsoi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18372646399157588, "text": "RIP", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:47:35", "owner": "maninjoon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027902624568640, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:46:23", "owner": "lynne.1in", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086227682486167, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:43:47", "owner": "booooooooeee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925865788037450, "text": "最慘不忍睹嘅時代封面😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:42:06", "owner": "wongyueric", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105187039649662, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:40:58", "owner": "jimmy.law.915", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184766656344758, "text": "💔🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:40:39", "owner": "z002.z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063784502451950, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:40:01", "owner": "hieroalvin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098517334696045, "text": "😭😭Que triste Hong Kong", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:37:28", "owner": "yei.one", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18214797865308974, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:35:53", "owner": "almerinda____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089841076938400, "text": "The despair in those eyes. Heartbreaking!! 💔 i how this can be contained quickly. Hopefully no more deaths. 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:35:14", "owner": "magipet12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18375044566152210, "text": "World press photo award to the first pic", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:34:25", "owner": "sanvitgn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054582317326155, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:32:45", "owner": "michelleohjewellery", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18098290078837285, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:32:44", "owner": "________a_l_i________", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060844025551234, "text": "🙏❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:32:13", "owner": "heyitsnicole555", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545051677020721, "text": "天佑所有人 平安🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:30:20", "owner": "valentinachen6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18245407936295260, "text": "太惨了…希望活下来的人都能好好的😢大难不死 必有后福🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:29:04", "owner": "louisedanahh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031558967535628, "text": "🙏🙏🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:27:38", "owner": "rachel.shengyingtire", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165783592377319, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:27:17", "owner": "viva_produtora", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852212329547202, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:25:18", "owner": "user4782909", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930645790137199, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:25:08", "owner": "c_palumbo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293168194272233, "text": "Этажей много", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:24:51", "owner": "tatianachernyshova5918", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18179424613317264, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:24:14", "owner": "riitesh.23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842435290629554, "text": "🙏💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:22:51", "owner": "jeremy_xxu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085430228292440, "text": "Sorry for the loss 😭 stay strong HK 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:22:32", "owner": "its02hanna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081494798514601, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:19:28", "owner": "imyuniiiiii__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 180994