d_at": "2025-11-27T09:52:06", "owner": "r_melodydela", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847806835582424, "text": "🙏🖤", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:51:57", "owner": "samantha._.qtkako", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095537908884282, "text": "💔😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:51:12", "owner": "camille_kerbellec", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18175200202368928, "text": "♥️🙏🏻😭🙏🏻♥️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:49:43", "owner": "grac.0494", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121987012521282, "text": "God please bless them.🙏😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:48:36", "owner": "deep_kaiputra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061965827550320, "text": "😢🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:47:36", "owner": "aedrizogena_333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969123909985965, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:45:12", "owner": "yaoyaozhuwu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331931257215154, "text": "🙏🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:43:28", "owner": "kspwn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896903134205940, "text": "😢😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:43:24", "owner": "x._mahima_.x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027181703572754, "text": "@onetkwan", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:43:03", "owner": "jennleefer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100326082702666, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:42:40", "owner": "me_sarah_2010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154216699408484, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:40:56", "owner": "mimpimeraki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084929087001771, "text": "😢 Stay safe", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:40:20", "owner": "dudy.jap", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844958620606332, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:37:31", "owner": "charlyeah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18384098854177358, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:37:00", "owner": "barista_emilyhsu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855463714571267, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:36:48", "owner": "luciiinda_z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902856091300293, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:36:45", "owner": "barista_emilyhsu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295651636280760, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:33:33", "owner": "dms.therapy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091728508907752, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:32:51", "owner": "ianahmrf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076677458239992, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:32:33", "owner": "mangecommejuju", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086897161806948, "text": "A truly distressing image.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:32:29", "owner": "smythdavey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909601843257352, "text": "É pessoal isso é um alerta!!! Há muitos prédios sem os sistemas de segurança em dia. Isso pode acontecer com qualquer um de nós. Um incêndio acidental em prédio é altamente perigoso e fatal. aqui no Brasil ocorreu o mesmo, o sistema de alarme falhou, o porteiro subiu em cada andar e bateu nas portas pra avisar em plena madrugada. É assustador!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:31:24", "owner": "michelle.carife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892133197371369, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:29:50", "owner": "flynnliu2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048324080677664, "text": "The numbers still growing, really sad but also helpless 🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:27:47", "owner": "soostudionz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931891738112887, "text": "55 morts déclarés pour l'instant. Et beaucoup sont encore recherchés 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:25:21", "owner": "quelquespartenmoselle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18326155219300240, "text": "These photos evoke every moment in Gaza, yet the fire's cause is clear....", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:25:04", "owner": "abbassharkouss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047343806449537, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:24:56", "owner": "anita.santos71", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881761045421603, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:24:15", "owner": "ghzyshusgjjsh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896191387350954, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:24:07", "owner": "sigwigkdfsogiw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027604343782175, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:24:00", "owner": "liana_aa2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171899245333471, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:23:40", "owner": "1sstarkkss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928986139175558, "text": "heart breaking 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:21:41", "owner": "maebyland", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905542219146083, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:19:54", "owner": "evren_dogann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925278490167185, "text": "Pray for them🙏🙏🙏😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:19:26", "owner": "frankwang4908", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958040128009857, "text": "Terrifying 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:15:26", "owner": "claireartisan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084010052073139, "text": "So sad 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:12:45", "owner": "iagegracefully", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896862850204757, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:12:35", "owner": "bigbickies", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075830273224922, "text": "The first photo will haunt humanity forever.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:12:07", "owner": "marwan.jpeg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114227893606007, "text": "🙏💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:10:21", "owner": "feialdairy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18300736288259729, "text": "Heartbreaking 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:10:01", "owner": "lancejordan3507", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18336436108239384, "text": "🇨🇳🇭🇰加油！已经有55人遇难了。。。。", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:09:10", "owner": "saralv1203", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072904703253848, "text": "💔 Life was unpredictable", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:06:39", "owner": "darvin_d_e_n_i", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002744096835195, "text": "this is just heartbreaking 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:05:12", "owner": "milletdeux", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104158630659157, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:05:02", "owner": "polinamoghina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171935971336781, "text": "Heartfelt condolences here from India 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:03:28", "owner": "profile2point0h", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18408669073138840, "text