_at": "2025-11-27T08:18:02", "owner": "trisciabayer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048636818672866, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:16:36", "owner": "nuriacarpas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082474202031559, "text": "💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:16:33", "owner": "jayde2948_melanesianinvasion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082731740043705, "text": "天佑香港🇭🇰💔💔💔😭😭😭🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:16:19", "owner": "lolijunkie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085019351077560, "text": "😭💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:16:11", "owner": "patriciadeffrenne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089933054499628, "text": "GOD🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:15:54", "owner": "nazliderin2017", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051395840355109, "text": "😢😢😢🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:14:35", "owner": "laura_e_m_c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862893127455589, "text": "🙏🙏🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:13:41", "owner": "saoko8399", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103449145656321, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:13:32", "owner": "chloezee12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013796210802251, "text": "Господи 😳 спаси и помилуй", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:13:16", "owner": "darianna201420192022", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101041087825098, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:13:06", "owner": "albinarmy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091805924306878, "text": "🙏❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:10:14", "owner": "onigirirunway", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117781480552777, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:10:05", "owner": "candre6051", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866832418427105, "text": "Wildest pic", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:08:45", "owner": "jens_bordinggaard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902716324166831, "text": "🙏🙏🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:08:18", "owner": "leesilynn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990027258856069, "text": "I hope those mega rich property landlord billionaires lend a hand and help these people out.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:06:35", "owner": "devmig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062283329196522, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:06:10", "owner": "metrotesa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107024827621907, "text": "Sending all condolences 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:04:37", "owner": "gooooooohki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18308532589266828, "text": "Seems suspicious", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:04:10", "owner": "metaarecontrolfreaks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052659509671076, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:01:44", "owner": "chen62570", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164909608382882, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:01:38", "owner": "yourkaybanana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931249900138138, "text": "prying for Hong Kong🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:00:53", "owner": "yashineshen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017495621619778, "text": "💔💔💔🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:59:10", "owner": "nice_girl9205", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18189744310337720, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:58:20", "owner": "reaann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020959178788119, "text": "😢😢😢😢💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:57:19", "owner": "gamernaxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914840518243758, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:56:26", "owner": "duojin85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086517181956609, "text": "Jesus have mercy on all the people", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:56:05", "owner": "caroline__apecho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843348166625047, "text": "😭😭😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:55:32", "owner": "sima43f", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082584845040300, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:55:19", "owner": "elizamasantosss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083275169018508, "text": "👍👍👍what a pity", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:54:14", "owner": "tttten200", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113247856514441, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:53:16", "owner": "ibrahim.poyraz1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051482579349420, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:52:35", "owner": "katherinesolanog", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074711687213779, "text": "💔😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:51:07", "owner": "ankh_davinchi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057367859303857, "text": "💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:50:53", "owner": "my.dreams.are.purple", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088095268786036, "text": "Im always afraid to live in high rise apartments.  If a fire break out at night while you’re sleeping and you have no way out. There always someone who is careless and not turn off their stove or put out their cigarettes.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:50:31", "owner": "dylantorrrez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905596114141758, "text": "😱😱", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:50:03", "owner": "sese4512", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049968761386167, "text": "That first photo is emotion far beyond", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:50:01", "owner": "hohlerstudio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542504212001433, "text": "😱😔😔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:49:46", "owner": "anamariapereira4343", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108636649621811, "text": "💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:48:43", "owner": "jenniebespana1967", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893573602361643, "text": "The place where I was born is in the building next door. I used to pass by it all the time as a child—it’s such a part of my memories. Now that I’m in New York, there’s nothing I can do about it, and it truly breaks my heart.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:46:38", "owner": "s_4_serena", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085975858957526, "text": "Absolutely terrible 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:45:43", "owner": "moonbeam.1278", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061797920532567, "text": "My thoughts go out to the citizens of Hong Kong. And I hope for the best and that emergency services have been able so save as many people as humanly possible ❤️🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:45:42", "owner": "marken_media", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18198953599324241, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:45:07", "owner": "redladymagik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980224035777559, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:43:53", "owner": "missracewong", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18047262518449528, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:32:23", "owner": "juleytl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17897225304346631, "text": "Reliving the twin towers but will not be remembered the same", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:32:06", "owner": "nictciokvudysjkk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079074449174383, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:31:53", "owner": "mariapiamen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18365145895088930, "text": "😭💔😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:31:41", "owner": "vivicorner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854919511573926, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:31:27", "owner": "lqphotos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868973908472851, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:31:17", "owner": "for05ever", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081120317120569, "text": "💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:31:13", "owner": "astchan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135876892481392, "text": "Pray for HongKong", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:30:48", "owner": "_0406tiffany", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101340436606936, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:30:30", "owner": "qzy801", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075516052999235, "text": "Absolutely wicked. Sending strength...", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:29:47", "owner": "gypzi.d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047291387441658, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:29:27", "owner": "skinnyfly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994275522716852, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:28:59", "owner": "tingmakeup", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120154009554722, "text": "gut wrenching", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:28:31", "owner": "spaceykacey", "likes": 90}, {"id": 18395469946126103, "text": "恐怖。祈祷🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:28:25", "owner": "yufengzhou999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539741377035996, "text": "RIP😭❤️🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:28:24", "owner": "rachel_auuu17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902709256165596, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:28:24", "owner": "gcvibes_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048628397411446, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:28:15", "owner": "corriliz7479", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048100595423801, "text": "😢😭😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:28:15", "owner": "current.commons.intopraxis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079171996909609, "text": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRheMYTEdbQ/?img_index=4&igsh=OG5iMTU2czhsZ2Ez", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:27:48", "owner": "apple_jam_and_yam2012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116043007500263, "text": "🙏🕊️🤍😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:27:28", "owner": "44ism", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080611670470038, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:26:40", "owner": "raymondleeofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062096096232479, "text": "I  watched the news on TV today and they said his wife was in the building . I pray this is not true. 🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:25:30", "owner": "pochichan2021", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962427912863267, "text": "that first photo needs a goofy caption.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:25:09", "owner": "aperturebladez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060902987222672, "text": "😭😭😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:24:55", "owner": "olivejeanne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874107994374489, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:23:40", "owner": "erockmusicgbm16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005125775672179, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:23:19", "owner": "ljason1124", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18202742572316877, "text": "😢😢omg so awful", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:23:00", "owner": "alfonsinaa.vm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956105929014029, "text": "Somebody definitely did this on purpose….. absolute prayers to everyone 😢😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:22:57", "owner": "jlam32", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930351796141226, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:22:21", "owner": "yehjin.art", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914600401247264, "text": "🙏❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:22:09", "owner": "ch_eryl9170", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087243856961302, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:21:27", "owner": "fabiola.martrev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968800404987247, "text": "😭😭🙏🙏🙏💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:20:23", "owner": "tiffanyyan0604", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542177983046783, "text": "Why is these people comparing this fire to twin tower ? Can’t yall have some decency to just pray for us ?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:20:21", "owner": "_makerchef_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125369281509431, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:20:14", "owner": "aws.dx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990467214886948, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:20:04", "owner": "sepesss_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18180916579360563, "text": "This is heartbreaking. Prayers to the people of Hong Kong.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:19:40", "owner": "brycenotsonice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048740327692277, "text": "💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:19:40", "owner": "patrickluvyall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979175799929370, "text": "So sad 🙏.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:19:38", "owner": "jmac629", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876827641355096, "text": "They should assess the cladding used on the building. The same thing happened to the Grenfell Towers in London a few years back and it was uncovered that cladding burns so quickly that it  turns entire buildings into infernos which gives people inside the buildings little chance of escaping.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:19:35", "owner": "samthebeautymentor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088725799939246, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:18:25", "owner": "dax.inc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091784605920814, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:18:13", "owner": "catry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126384841507889, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:17:23", "owner": "filmwcolleen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18116399284499272, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:17:12", "owner": "andrea.113030", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082251043895824, "text": "😢🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:17:10", "owner": "ohmypototo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857370841560809, "text": "So sad 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:16:40", "owner": "teddymarquee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18247536376289626, "text": "💔💔💔🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:16:30", "owner": "rosie_posy71", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076176944336379, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:16:16", "owner": "hellostephany", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113023774577891, "text": "Omg please heal him lord 😭😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:16:07", "owner": "itsvincelao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544485232020816, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:12:13", "owner": "michelemarieamalia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076739072234128, "text": "💔🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:11:37", "owner": "kbeingtrue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056738756319149, "text": "Heartbreaking! 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:11:31", "owner": "iphemeral", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969171399972769, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:09:45", "owner": "pzx128", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18374395963154449, "text": "Prayers🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:09:41", "owner": "ole.torito", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026529527781494, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:06:59", "owner": "qibeing77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854466349578032, "text": "😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:04:52", "owner": "gladysri0s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930750823166389, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:04:16", "owner": "monicakossina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929934919015560, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:03:56", "owner": "tanweric", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113489659584231, "text": "昔からだよ竹の足場で延焼\n昔にも起きてる", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:03:26", "owner": "keitaro_watarai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917335576219931, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:03:07", "owner": "diansaraswati.dian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058256357295623, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:02:52", "owner": "ianlhs", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17947231982937455, "text": "希望大家都平平安安🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:01:01", "owner": "lucy0420ccc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875100925446182, "text": "😭😭聞者傷痛，見者流淚", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:59:59", "owner": "suety3378", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891485749374204, "text": "Fire gonna keep burning till nothing left bring down buildings left and right will cause the air vacuum may suffocate the fire", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:59:28", "owner": "emt2135", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011065628657757, "text": "希望平安🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:58:26", "owner": "xiuxin.lv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065081669565407, "text": "So sorry 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:58:12", "owner": "yasigolbon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945508185942952, "text": "@lovemilly1994", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:58:06", "owner": "johnnyzeng94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087466358499488, "text": "😭💔Please be patient. I hope many people survive.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:57:27", "owner": "thegeng_mocca_millomolly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031822610748994, "text": "hope everyone be safe and properly settled💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:57:05", "owner": "averycaix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014049182802819, "text": "А вы еще дровишек бамбуковых подбросьте🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:56:50", "owner": "zharkovproduction", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017606042621775, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:56:28", "owner": "chochosh_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020742767789905, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:56:17", "owner": "tjj.zzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930297472114896, "text": "No words- terrifying to watch. Can’t imagine the excruciating pain & horror the victims & survivors have endured. 😢😢😢🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:55:37", "owner": "chandni65", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926799118156575, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:55:35", "owner": "stellafaulds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051816581657133, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:54:19", "owner": "michaelkdpt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099477355826331, "text": "My heart bleeds for everyone who has lost what is precious to them. Hold your loved ones tightly tonight.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:53:25", "owner": "dani_intheround", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937982671070438, "text": "💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:53:07", "owner": "emma_lauren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085828135826245, "text": "🙏🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:52:42", "owner": "xiangtsubasa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18306392608283872, "text": "我想知道香港政策会怎么安置这些人？保险会受理赔偿吗？", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:51:52", "owner": "donker2284", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028192964569306, "text": "😭❤️💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:50:57", "owner": "mayadaniela", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079440965158313, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:50:13", "owner": "evelinafv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064458254398942, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:48:48", "owner": "7aem_karina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083179910319375, "text": "So horrifying 🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:48:38", "owner": "robbinsarchitecture", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078875015130197, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:48:09", "owner": "momoinurheart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036485669510246, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:47:33", "owner": "fireman_323", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18400192441133828, "text": "Ang intense", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:47:32", "owner": "yansibree", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155263138412366, "text": "Same mistake in London so heart breaking", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:47:27", "owner": "bluebellward", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079502201169921, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:47:14", "owner": "lumingjudyz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856882573560384, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:47:11", "owner": "punguimuller", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071256653613075, "text": "Soo heartbreaking😭😭😭 sending prayers", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:46:44", "owner": "mika_michy12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057369158304438, "text": "How tragic!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:46:37", "owner": "madelinecaminiti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095107882853022, "text": "🙏🏾🙏🏾🙏🏾", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:46:01", "owner": "ms_josie68", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877961716439042, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:45:54", "owner": "teivesmusic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930456550117874, "text": "Greenfell towers but asia version", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:45:13", "owner": "gettingtoittodoit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050539241380504, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:44:44", "owner": "zdecker305", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873726844453290, "text": "RIP😭🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:44:38", "owner": "jessie_j._giangregorio", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17900001558180468, "text": "That’s gnarly", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:44:14", "owner": "noalex.x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843994006619699, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:41:56", "owner": "rinathepoet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969314262824955, "text": "Condolences to the families of the lost and to all the rest that lost their belongings.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:41:10", "owner": "gusjaramill0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541234513059894, "text": "whoever took these photos made the disaster look spectacular😭😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:41:05", "owner": "znackefronn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152327890423794, "text": "La foto del año", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:40:12", "owner": "adjfotografia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854469124577953, "text": "💔🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:38:20", "owner": "karinaa_maxiine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858895324491812, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:37:50", "owner": "joyce__loklam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304240459269403, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:37:16", "owner": "christine_onacilla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946493628939401, "text": "💔😭🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:36:38", "owner": "dim_schumm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086893993804690, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:34:26", "owner": "polarlights97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846685018594173, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:34:09", "owner": "andyto", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17866115934504000, "text": "What a terrible tragedy💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:34:08", "owner": "dananahai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901319632322997, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:33:40", "owner": "tedmcdonnell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096612739880189, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:32:04", "owner": "tanyanyiu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958216008882820, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:31:59", "owner": "juanecoboy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065990120139596, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:31:46", "owner": "hammarlundconnie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085208675084027, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:31:38", "owner": "buzzmoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18306683434265653, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:31:37", "owner": "malik.haris.r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867061192488841, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:31:21", "owner": "pinalloy_auto_accessories", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045418925479453, "text": "🙏🏾", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:31:03", "owner": "amandabooz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145588177441033, "text": "Devestating", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:30:58", "owner": "yea123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926345797156497, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:30:25", "owner": "48xy2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962411619862024, "text": "OMG", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:30:22", "owner": "maxrqy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117136465493758, "text": "Those accused must be punish", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:30:15", "owner": "_santana8five", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025111475784442, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:29:42", "owner": "iqbal_joyiaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842000041633707, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:29:33", "owner": "nnaomiiiiiiiiiiiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084092486103142, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:29:05", "owner": "skylar.sweet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061642118559251, "text": "😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:27:47", "owner": "traceylaszlo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095387227861003, "text": "Heartbreaking 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:27:30", "owner": "nomadingnatasha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888749299392061, "text": "💔❤️‍🩹", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:27:02", "owner": "majdmshmdin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18309249127301881, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:26:57", "owner": "xaxaxaxaxaxa_opyyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878268190431356, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:26:52", "owner": "cola_wang_laole", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049796696389017, "text": "🙏💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:26:11", "owner": "babylee82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047878820424462, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:26:11", "owner": "mypussiphat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892841866366435, "text": "I'm not sure how others perceive this image, but it is highly inappropriate for the media to publish such photographs. For the individuals depicted, this constitutes a form of secondary victimisation.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:26:00", "owner": "ysl1466", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932673142114387, "text": "💔 We are praying  for you", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:25:30", "owner": "jenni.do", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094195678890682, "text": "🌷🙏🏽😓THIS😓\nI was asleep this earlier today for work tonight. I work in the ER. I was dreaming that our ER was packed. I was walking down a sidewalk and an oriental man and his dog was laying on the sidewalk. I asked him if he needed help. He said yes. I helped him up- the dog never moved. I get him into the ER.\n\nI am now at work and this is the first thing I see. \nCoincidence??? Yes maybe. But I always look at the unusual details of my dreams.\n\nI’m soooooo sorry to see this!!!!\nDear God!😓🙏🏽🙏🏽🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:24:50", "owner": "jeannettewrites2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065081213612580, "text": "🙏 strength to them", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:24:14", "owner": "sabarisparkle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18291399607273280, "text": "❤️🙏❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:23:30", "owner": "hainswortharts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18232145905307042, "text": "💔 so sad", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:22:28", "owner": "pocha_rivera", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914433985238966, "text": "🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:21:24", "owner": "mientze", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050505398379273, "text": "🙏🙏原香港受灾老百姓度过难关", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:21:08", "owner": "lcx395", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035679569719918, "text": "So sorry", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:21:03", "owner": "melnick_josh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878836078429314, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:20:36", "owner": "dani_the_gr8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842178703628020, "text": "Heartbreaking 😔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:19:57", "owner": "t.xthxi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969358095826837, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:19:53", "owner": "egosdad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861885316539383, "text": "🕯️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:19:52", "owner": "apriori_z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141018916454128, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:18:12", "owner": "lucentvision2020", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057396512293280, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:17:13", "owner": "gebraniff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086071381973251, "text": "希望尽快扑灭大火😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:16:37", "owner": "papatu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18201766273317007, "text": "Santa María de Dios!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:14:45", "owner": "juana.mariars", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084763472009394, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:14:43", "owner": "surfguch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321413458221843, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:14:20", "owner": "melody_eury", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18421274158117440, "text": "this is not a movie, this is real! I'm so sad💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:13:42", "owner": "deny_ariadi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353714701160157, "text": "🤍", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:13:14", "owner": "mitchellphun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092465605907910, "text": "I was there lol", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:10:56", "owner": "professional_wockstar", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17926891545156780, "text": "Makes you think twice about living in highrises!!!😭😭😭😢😢😢😢RIP", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:10:45", "owner": "sashanamaste", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17929912155114677, "text": "😭💔HK", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:10:11", "owner": "ericthenugget", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080023988323776, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:09:37", "owner": "oceanf_7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086733589820398, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:08:29", "owner": "missmayyyyyyyyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954554241898507, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:08:26", "owner": "leidyvasquez11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071230880588639, "text": "😣😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:07:58", "owner": "billy.wijaya10is", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860598712476717, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:07:31", "owner": "firstlightsurf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18170856883374210, "text": "😢😢 🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:07:19", "owner": "respectfully.sandrab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165785398378233, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:07:17", "owner": "cynthiachan.c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969499191822211, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:06:16", "owner": "ansafrina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958554642881934, "text": "😢😢🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:06:10", "owner": "akimiwxy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847286287587412, "text": "How did the fire start in 3 different buildings 😒", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:05:49", "owner": "laharlem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073055735035224, "text": "💔🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:05:48", "owner": "anastasia_ros826", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089809849933435, "text": "So sorry for your useless loss! ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:05:37", "owner": "marcelpolman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953830741019743, "text": "😢😢😢🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:04:43", "owner": "ellentigress62", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089369417508534, "text": "DLLM!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:04:00", "owner": "wilbsmok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099694000752733, "text": "🙏🙏🙏 sending prayers, sending love to Hong Kong 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:01:37", "owner": "lynnhsiehart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119657080549324, "text": "Sending prayers 🙏😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:01:22", "owner": "ve__veve", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931750006113094, "text": "Oh my god big one big one pray pray 🙏😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:01:00", "owner": "junior_dusuchett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888312436392048, "text": "😢🙏💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:00:31", "owner": "richard.levangie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968751897977807, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:00:27", "owner": "ihe_cooking", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098644459805572, "text": "😮😮😮😮💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:59:47", "owner": "arnoldanthonyplaza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145739800440804, "text": "Bamboo scaffolding doesn’t help", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:59:46", "owner": "joe.kayed", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17844942039605200, "text": "pray for HK🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:58:54", "owner": "jerlin3500", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18333135736215030, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:58:04", "owner": "emyskc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113162083585526, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:57:41", "owner": "mookatie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849612703567250, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:55:33", "owner": "oran__chan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078442921911755, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:55:31", "owner": "mrbod", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952845925025242, "text": "The fire in Tai Po was truly a hell on earth.🙏🏻To everyone in Hong Kong — stay strong😢🇭🇰", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:54:53", "owner": "mybell.watch", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17871420273466870, "text": "Sad, unfortunate and a disaster level incident. Prayers to those injured and condolences to families who lost their own 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:54:51", "owner": "prakashrahul24", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17966304375004839, "text": "I highly doubt the actual death toll will be released. Shocking. All elderly and cheaper public style housing.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:54:31", "owner": "bluf0x", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18206259406315665, "text": "無限城真實版嗎？", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:54:28", "owner": "will._.photography", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068699753456260, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:54:20", "owner": "gpdcaro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074520782263749, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:54:19", "owner": "winglhw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076332200211511, "text": "White House soon", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:53:53", "owner": "993bjorn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066525926617084, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:53:50", "owner": "vivsoloadventures", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18548836750027778, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:53:25", "owner": "sairzk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102055030737564, "text": "🙏🙏🙏😭😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:52:01", "owner": "fredeverventure", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077113415522067, "text": "😢😢💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:52:00", "owner": "annette_villalobos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18194922601326451, "text": "Not just the loss of properties but many of their family members are trapped inside", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:51:24", "owner": "lilyytl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095210542845754, "text": "🙏 For the safety to the people affected by the fire in Hong Kong.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:50:38", "owner": "yiuwing6788", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879719203332033, "text": "Heartbreading in Hong Kong. So many high rise apartments.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:50:04", "owner": "jackodog1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024535028771996, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:49:17", "owner": "_paulomarin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293775004277398, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:48:57", "owner": "juliana_jesus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541360324034394, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:48:25", "owner": "katrina_e_h", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543900553031591, "text": "天佑香港🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:47:42", "owner": "max_carter0111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914516308091655, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:46:49", "owner": "wyndajoliee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083449975863712, "text": "🙏🏼🙏🏼🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:46:28", "owner": "new_girl_on_the_rock", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987182151748304, "text": "Prayers to the all the victims 🤲🏽♥️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:43:23", "owner": "alicia_nyc1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916911439213065, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:42:53", "owner": "beracomab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048736142419942, "text": "Born and raised in Hong Kong, lived through the Eaton fire a year ago. This is heartbreaking 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:42:22", "owner": "flo.yuen", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18083615297025665, "text": "rip and sending prayers 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:42:04", "owner": "c_lalalandlord", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865949179506246, "text": "This is a heartbreaking and shocking tragedy. High-rise residential fires are inherently extremely dangerous, and the fact that this fire spread across multiple buildings and lasted for several hours indicates the extreme severity of the situation and highlights the immense challenges of fire rescue in densely populated urban environments.\n\nFor the victims, this is an irreparable loss; for the injured and those trapped, every minute and second is crucial. The firefighters' valiant efforts to control the fire and rescue those trapped under such adverse conditions deserve our deepest respect.\n\nAt the same time, this incident serves as a stark reminder to city administrators and the public of the importance of fire safety, facility maintenance, evacuation design, and routine drills in high-rise buildings. We hope that relevant departments can quickly determine the cause of the fire, improve preventative measures, and prevent similar tragedies from recurring.\n\nMay the departed rest in peace, the injured recover soon, and all those still missing be found safely as quickly as possible", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:42:00", "owner": "jenn.yfend", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17940259172963639, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:41:39", "owner": "irene01.615", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155604184404228, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:41:35", "owner": "enita_lale", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127494382446494, "text": "pray for HK", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:40:05", "owner": "colinzc_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972565206971876, "text": "Knowing that so many people are still trapped inside is heartbreaking. And losing your home… what was meant to be a condo refurbishment for a fresh start has now become a total loss. 😣", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:40:02", "owner": "meikeis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971729079967071, "text": "😢😢😢😢💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:39:08", "owner": "tchusca_songo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081836662892976, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:38:34", "owner": "angela_goh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087105043960089, "text": "🙏🏽💔😰", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:37:44", "owner": "sylvhillman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107656738622659, "text": "🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:37:37", "owner": "alex.liang1996", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985166652875459, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:37:33", "owner": "jrbbphoto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848953993573143, "text": "🙏🙏💔一定要好起来", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:37:19", "owner": "whalelovbin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847364653586051, "text": "So so sad! Praying for a speedy recovery with no more casualties and no more fires pleaseeee 🙏🏻😓", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:36:38", "owner": "pollychan_bakehouse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063223031185924, "text": "🥲🙏🇭🇰", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:35:21", "owner": "newmeowwi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870822274467906, "text": "This is devastating💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:33:18", "owner": "ides.studio", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17947084632064983, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:32:40", "owner": "beatrizcallaghan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087346549790908, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:31:39", "owner": "east_wind_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095593951860124, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:31:26", "owner": "jennahancy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909015877126439, "text": "🙏🏽🕊️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:31:07", "owner": "nyc_bobb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060729896239681, "text": "❤️🙏❤️🙏❤️🙏❤️🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:30:54", "owner": "bostoncoston", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193981813332710, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:30:49", "owner": "kwichanell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033074384724232, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:30:29", "owner": "nytpe2018964", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540466609061974, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:30:08", "owner": "cruisinndroolin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842660824628719, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:29:13", "owner": "danariva_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027946001765050, "text": "🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:28:55", "owner": "ll.lori", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539025952013548, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:28:48", "owner": "janetymj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953438662046509, "text": "Fingers crossed 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:28:24", "owner": "lydiechen_tw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074897591256864, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:28:15", "owner": "rosi_syl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085225820094506, "text": "😭💔❤️‍🩹", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:27:44", "owner": "sungsation", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927590098161028, "text": "This is heart rending, and unimaginable, especially in a first world country. Tells us of the difficult and uncertain paths that we all tread. Prayers for the survivors and victims’ families.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:27:43", "owner": "epictorius", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113732218588126, "text": "So fkn sad!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:26:26", "owner": "j0seph.sa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001718981829192, "text": "Oh well", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:25:58", "owner": "uncle_hunnell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864034432529865, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:25:54", "owner": "gabboka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993560964707055, "text": "Such Amazon photos 🔥 Great Job", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:25:39", "owner": "un_pasajero", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067095461114329, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:25:35", "owner": "fitter597", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091261867907353, "text": "Omg, I’m so sorry", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:25:04", "owner": "gina_lyster_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078743324468410, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:24:45", "owner": "cicifoy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104251594662224, "text": "first photograph could win a pulitzer.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:23:52", "owner": "patrickleehamiltonagency", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847865206582324, "text": "😮😮😮😮😮😭😢😢😢😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:23:49", "owner": "garywongadventure", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932329759112510, "text": "🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:23:47", "owner": "rogerfung_1027", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18297391027272756, "text": "Praying for all affected. Sending love to Hong Kong ❤️🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:23:13", "owner": "anniemoe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073601948369217, "text": "How terrifying. I hope most people there are safe.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:22:39", "owner": "zecenarosales", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148328977428907, "text": "🙏🙏🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:22:17", "owner": "imfrumbk_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18306131503252620, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:21:41", "owner": "ganaa_sb", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086562025959791, "text": "🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:21:41", "owner": "trishcc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990740955731384, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:21:37", "owner": "aemeliamoyr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087866638961834, "text": "So sad 😞", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:21:26", "owner": "kevinflemingphotography", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099231952699450, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:20:45", "owner": "dickychong98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995678736839696, "text": "Free Hong Kong, fcku China!!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:20:40", "owner": "urfriendlycolleague", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047003831448330, "text": "🙏🏻🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:20:25", "owner": "ericanthony", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059679716251946, "text": "Beautiful", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:20:22", "owner": "as_joelsaw_it", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545133175042908, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:20:19", "owner": "swammilovesyou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145089670446269, "text": "Dont they have a i robots that turn off fires before they start now?? Ai brags of tech so where is it???", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:20:16", "owner": "gusallegres", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089609854762128, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:20:12", "owner": "freyading1205", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18516502825071397, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:20:01", "owner": "rolandvanos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065291444386675, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:19:42", "owner": "uxy47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986355783916362, "text": "唔係竹棚引致火燭\n承辦商喺建築地盤裏面放置發泡膠助燃劑引致火燭\n香港人要清醒啊\n如果改裝咗金屬棚架利益歸於中國建造商呢啲就係陰謀論", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:19:37", "owner": "momeci24680", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917468008228375, "text": "🙏🏾🙏🏾🙏🏾", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:19:34", "owner": "prettygirl_aka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064882364618901, "text": "First picture, OMG!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:18:53", "owner": "stanleyborsoi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130390780497624, "text": "🙏🏻🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:18:14", "owner": "stanleyborsoi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320538874169705, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:18:03", "owner": "harninaika", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074848808256617, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:18:02", "owner": "kk_zyw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094531189860491, "text": "Godzilla strikes again", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:17:40", "owner": "rsircar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980308173927424, "text": "🙏AIの映像だったら良かったのに…🥲🇯🇵でも最近、大規模火災🔥が起きたばかり…😔胸が痛い❤️‍🩹", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:17:36", "owner": "uberuru5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112616596585094, "text": "Some insane shots.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:17:20", "owner": "therealherphero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083356703101759, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:17:17", "owner": "justcarolinasname", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881323483422938, "text": "God bless HK🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:17:05", "owner": "ys.w__98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068631827617724, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:16:50", "owner": "yuli_fo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907770148274873, "text": "Praying for each and every person and their families in these buildings. Really hope our beloved city can now perhaps rid of scaffolding usage in building communities. The dangers and risks are just too grave when things go wrong. 🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:16:25", "owner": "stcwong", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18112756645588461, "text": "🥲🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:15:31", "owner": "psmoisri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025644092580503, "text": "that's really really sad, I love HK so much!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:15:11", "owner": "hfk_dashcam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984990318870730, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:15:06", "owner": "bbqforfriendshk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18197490754325740, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:14:39", "owner": "jajdidjeje", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545634112016236, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:13:00", "owner": "shavanna_marcia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853538563581119, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:12:44", "owner": "loveemdogscats", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089611660946306, "text": "🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:12:21", "owner": "paaulinamerida", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059629013266029, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:12:04", "owner": "pe1ch1n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100033945746978, "text": "I love Hong Kong, my heart is breaking for these people. HK already has a housing crisis.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:11:35", "owner": "blondemcdonaldsfarm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879519475329316, "text": "💔🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:11:24", "owner": "iglootwo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985160220921096, "text": "🙏愿平安", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:11:18", "owner": "linxiaotong832", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145583386434455, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:10:56", "owner": "tuya_genn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967787799989205, "text": "This is really sad… my heart is with all the victims and family and friends of everyone involved 💔…", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:10:19", "owner": "emeraldiine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295730434284988, "text": "😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:10:14", "owner": "jumbotayag747", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070208816593628, "text": "💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:10:14", "owner": "dwayu_larassanti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171715447374296, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:09:57", "owner": "mirbagheri.ph", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055872011322630, "text": "bless everyone", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:09:16", "owner": "chengyuliu2005", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860450104476769, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:09:04", "owner": "insameoldfears", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082749962028246, "text": "This is horrifying", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:08:27", "owner": "tracybean68", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929721691015383, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:08:26", "owner": "girlmal22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059430761273950, "text": "😭😭😭😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:07:02", "owner": "grcienfuegos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112272868524343, "text": "I hope his wife got out okay 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:06:09", "owner": "sew_warm808", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917537938215712, "text": "首圖是怎樣", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:06:02", "owner": "xwelcomedyx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086690272987418, "text": "Please don't tell me it is AI later", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:05:28", "owner": "temp5262022", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074624786351103, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:05:02", "owner": "jimmy_wenhao_tang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072944552354573, "text": "💔💔💔💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:04:46", "owner": "biancaceleste._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18316377175221821, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:04:38", "owner": "eiiii0917", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18297349564259607, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:04:30", "owner": "lowd95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897011716200541, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:04:26", "owner": "pauloleiter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926633179178192, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:04:22", "owner": "lucyli_107", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096169366665616, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:03:58", "owner": "mitch198", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930373870146599, "text": "😭😭💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:03:40", "owner": "thegirlnamedpam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048109700424979, "text": "It’s so sad", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:03:15", "owner": "bryan_tmhk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107705539713170, "text": "Sad 😔 😮😢😭💔💔💔💔💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:03:02", "owner": "firstsargeantdavi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18420200200113380, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:02:00", "owner": "ah8yan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111746998608427, "text": "Terrifying. 💔 I am so sorry for Hongkong. 💔❤️🙏❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:01:49", "owner": "sophieboursat", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17914254492248718, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:01:34", "owner": "gloriacraftinguk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049635044392701, "text": "ลดประมาณประชากร🔥🙏บาปกรรมของ เจ็ก", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:01:30", "owner": "nooknatthawat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905418484147683, "text": "OMG😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:01:12", "owner": "madisonstella170", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925478869187160, "text": "🙏🏾", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:00:49", "owner": "hbailey111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048987128418992, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:00:47", "owner": "jatucka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105672274638357, "text": "outstanding photography", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:00:38", "owner": "alternapop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063407714549276, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:00:16", "owner": "sajsvg876", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091371802936189, "text": "🙏💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:59:29", "owner": "minagomez33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121821094526798, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:58:28", "owner": "amberist_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075107297195539, "text": "בד\"א", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:58:01", "owner": "mama_himel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108769675619403, "text": "遇难人数已升至44人😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:57:37", "owner": "shaolong.y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084217930843778, "text": "Temu 9/11", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:56:49", "owner": "deanjamesnotjamesdean", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932536974998073, "text": "Prayers to all 💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:54:57", "owner": "keegee57", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036080315723686, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:54:56", "owner": "drsharonwong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876721498350651, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:54:40", "owner": "amberamao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073856396255937, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:53:57", "owner": "malou_dejumo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082096184106086, "text": "Who pissed off Godzilla?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:53:00", "owner": "armstrongtimes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084905963072799, "text": "Is that sony or fuji Good bless", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:52:58", "owner": "stillhype", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955312072041774, "text": "💔💔😭😭🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:52:47", "owner": "sfh1527", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070950194601846, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:52:24", "owner": "zli0813", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071183819062394, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:52:02", "owner": "keiichiro.fujii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082861211327071, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:51:22", "owner": "basemurice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917010643219436, "text": "😢😢😢🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:51:07", "owner": "alvinlai512", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086570407960630, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:50:32", "owner": "hanhcollectionofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092853853916254, "text": "💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:50:26", "owner": "ohpu3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147769789439894, "text": "This should have never happened! 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:50:14", "owner": "danspurgeon63", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954374911028348, "text": "💔💔🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:49:38", "owner": "marjunglm", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18013282079811884, "text": "🤔🤨👀", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:49:26", "owner": "ojopromot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133112854431808, "text": "💔 So so sad for all who have died, those who are injured, and all who have lost thier loved ones and thier homes. 💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:49:09", "owner": "virginia_2642", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18549568540038691, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:48:46", "owner": "porsaludybienestar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909289267122664, "text": "🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:48:19", "owner": "speedyfireprotection", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067118957625417, "text": "Destabilized their capitalist zone.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:48:05", "owner": "jredschulz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046388402704450, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:46:48", "owner": "kimxhshm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981189471925535, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:46:47", "owner": "ashv327", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843911248620094, "text": "Que terrible 😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:46:19", "owner": "hikarifloyd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001898405684011, "text": "“Like” isn’t the right sentiment here", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:45:58", "owner": "stuartlhastings", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863563708531365, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:45:13", "owner": "kurikutekuto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969604374977188, "text": "So tragic 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:45:01", "owner": "anna_batlady", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159737854392925, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:44:40", "owner": "yuzu000009", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932790786997152, "text": "图一照片看着揪心😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:44:40", "owner": "wan_818", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080384168143695, "text": "I was sitting in front of the TV and refreshing my iPhone over and over until midnight… like many Hongkongers, I simply couldn’t sleep.  It’s still hard to believe this happened in our Hong Kong.\n\nMost of us feel heavy-hearted, no matter whether we are in Hong Kong or overseas.\n\nThere are over 200 people still missing, and it’s believed that many of them are elderly residents.  It’s heartbreaking to watch the updates.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:43:24", "owner": "deedee_juria_o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076535786224681, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:43:17", "owner": "kehmun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126205612505202, "text": "Let me guess, sand cladding material as the Grenfell tower in London", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:42:56", "owner": "serenadegail35", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103083571660761, "text": "❤️🙏🏻🌹", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:42:46", "owner": "laleoldani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039143750509714, "text": "😢🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:42:35", "owner": "marvins.code__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100061911692659, "text": "How many people will be displaced and have lost everything after such an enormous fire 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:42:31", "owner": "this1niche", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076944137233817, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:41:39", "owner": "cecilia_030518", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125908078509885, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:41:14", "owner": "jwarbler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077320048952691, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:40:13", "owner": "e.vlavianos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876604012352471, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:40:05", "owner": "blue_ocean_828", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18387041896197174, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:39:12", "owner": "id_id90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061274543216658, "text": "Something is wrong with their building codes or materials. How can a fire spread like that!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:39:11", "owner": "nicwty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057157904305638, "text": "This is so sad 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:38:56", "owner": "foxandsilk_conceptstore_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879590092330140, "text": "Condolences to the wonderful people of Hong Kong 🤍🤍", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:38:44", "owner": "thatmarsdude", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18350992732166582, "text": "Truly sad. 💔 Strength 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:38:26", "owner": "moveworlddanceday", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968441073986704, "text": "Burning for 6 hrs straight and they didn’t collapse to dust ??? Hmmmmm", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:38:18", "owner": "pete83p", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914483947247949, "text": "🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:37:54", "owner": "ladieslovefastcarz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090790888916696, "text": "Sending prayers and condolences from California 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:37:28", "owner": "sclee415", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936607569983069, "text": "As a Ukrainian who sees this type of photos every day… I am so sorry, Hong Kong😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:37:21", "owner": "tanikusso", "likes": 69}, {"id": 18089595035480914, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:37:20", "owner": "saniashazeb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18379441897150863, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:36:22", "owner": "oceanz.gram", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084021169845064, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:36:06", "owner": "plainjane_8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18354313654167172, "text": "😢🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:34:33", "owner": "triciascott_02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158233204396766, "text": "Jesus te proteja", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:33:49", "owner": "elianavieira68", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998385366698631, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:33:47", "owner": "jack_ye2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144836698451189, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:33:40", "owner": "lillilucioni", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17988662942883593, "text": "Oh my god", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:33:38", "owner": "rickdallago", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051680792365005, "text": "😢😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:33:13", "owner": "aloha_xavier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085375249993520, "text": "💔💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:33:05", "owner": "cindylexu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18101868067676408, "text": "As a Ukrainian, it scares me how familiar this image feels.\nWhat is a rare tragedy for others has become a daily reality for us.\n\nSending strength and compassion to the people in Hong Kong 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:32:58", "owner": "anna_remolacha_", "likes": 162}, {"id": 18035647781732768, "text": "Pray for HK🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:32:53", "owner": "sidomada", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873960220373039, "text": "Sending healing prayers✨I’m curious how China will meet these people’s needs in their time of traum. I hope as well as they can bring this community and its people back as close to healed as they can. In America, we don’t care collectively anymore not even in rhetoric.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:32:28", "owner": "nahtal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085399976051794, "text": "The climate change was strong that day my friend", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:32:25", "owner": "p2bdeplorable", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097262392839039, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:32:09", "owner": "kozlovetlana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047261048438627, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:32:03", "owner": "kozlovetlana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024452393784795, "text": "Just awful 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:30:19", "owner": "mazzibeee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121804531536776, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:30:06", "owner": "parisgirl2838", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925589377036567, "text": "My prayers 🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:29:36", "owner": "marinini81", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087977789488989, "text": "😂 , причина и следствие", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:29:15", "owner": "spaceinstock", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065567159572795, "text": "😢💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:29:14", "owner": "ericnyc_168", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367879156084061, "text": "🥺🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:28:46", "owner": "glvale", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301814449269437, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:27:18", "owner": "swankiersta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062921918442148, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:27:11", "owner": "why_hedy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087146413972903, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:26:48", "owner": "f.xu.l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164977474380293, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:26:24", "owner": "aquafireld", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111901606598520, "text": "Horrifying 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:26:24", "owner": "ashantighania", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029669339760545, "text": "😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:26:12", "owner": "yannis1453_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068796311099573, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:26:00", "owner": "itslailanie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055261412324478, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:26:00", "owner": "lilygiada", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003518360824247, "text": "Dodgy insulation?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:25:29", "owner": "stewart.marsden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076281071189358, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:25:11", "owner": "saritasmile1969", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085080715972612, "text": "🙏🙏🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:24:50", "owner": "marcnelson", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18032057591724824, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:24:44", "owner": "huaikuan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095840083882597, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:24:31", "owner": "whereisthewhitesea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949925790921136, "text": "Pray for Hong Kong 🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:24:15", "owner": "feelinbarbie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079410493907025, "text": "💔😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:23:56", "owner": "lalbuatsaihi_jk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097258243840909, "text": "Oh my lord 😞😞😞", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:23:52", "owner": "marronesojos_4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18535535803062524, "text": "❤️💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:23:46", "owner": "synergy_showroom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050276870680194, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:23:46", "owner": "ay_ims", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946477291075687, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:22:59", "owner": "jzckhuang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082311161027791, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:22:52", "owner": "zhuohao_ye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18429559504110141, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:22:17", "owner": "youwufox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062877194432167, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:22:15", "owner": "joanalessa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029254205558259, "text": "I went to Hong Kong and the high rise across from mine caught on fire. Must be a common thing there.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:21:59", "owner": "royal.allen_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983908689763111, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:21:26", "owner": "yangyi46993", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304244935254535, "text": "😭 I am weeping for my hometown 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:21:22", "owner": "irenelinglingm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892757080364005, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:21:09", "owner": "tts23mika", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917018956227333, "text": "🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:20:53", "owner": "ohitzraymond", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087670252790764, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:20:15", "owner": "baruch.harry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972964692974228, "text": "😭😭💔💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:19:54", "owner": "a.k.a.shirley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061907045536419, "text": "unbelievably tragic 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:19:36", "owner": "crrlbrrl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127951978499802, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:19:20", "owner": "onensma2020", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885533956281998, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:19:17", "owner": "renatiar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949028002060025, "text": "😢🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:19:12", "owner": "ekberturdi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923905417186965, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:18:54", "owner": "gabriela.munoz.art", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900966580320968, "text": "Seriously, that architect should be held accountable by the authorities. He built with flammable materials to save costs, and I suppose there's no fire safety system.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:18:52", "owner": "estanislaogonzalezramirez", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18106474732722505, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:18:26", "owner": "michelle.n.80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091578922900501, "text": "🙌🏿", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:17:53", "owner": "wilrosschef", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100073971741360, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:17:43", "owner": "lucu_lingling", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985892109870789, "text": "🙏🙏🙏😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:16:47", "owner": "cocomelonkiss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295042231286838, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:15:59", "owner": "themodernartista", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547747624035808, "text": "💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:15:44", "owner": "llws_s88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068953244101509, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:15:20", "owner": "meleksvnctkn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991039344860482, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:14:54", "owner": "maymeilei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102234607663951, "text": "Why do they still use highly flammable bamboo? RIP", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:14:50", "owner": "deepsplanne007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959029444008208, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:14:43", "owner": "mariana.hd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18380899702145442, "text": "😢🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:14:24", "owner": "eyelive4this", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081816931886892, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:14:20", "owner": "_e_l_d_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040068755503215, "text": "Woow thats wild!! 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:14:19", "owner": "dgbrouillard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870656995468178, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:14:15", "owner": "athenasheavenco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383691133146552, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:14:04", "owner": "tishhayward2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926138968173818, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:13:36", "owner": "maxencedb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932018989136290, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:13:20", "owner": "curlycajunlass", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852995155584649, "text": "❤️‍🩹❤️‍🩹❤️‍🩹", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:12:57", "owner": "angclinas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063051344447464, "text": "So many questions! So sad! My heart is with everyone affected  for now. I’ll get angry later. 😢💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:12:34", "owner": "picsfromcindy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048186809426424, "text": "💔! Please stay safe and help each other! 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:12:28", "owner": "dndo4474", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145313224431847, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:12:11", "owner": "kennethwang012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067741706624340, "text": "Sending🙏 and❤️ to HK", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:11:44", "owner": "waltho52", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921763588055205, "text": "How can it be that number only. How do people escape that if it spread fast and without notice. I mea this looks to be very bad.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:11:34", "owner": "florettah_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18179631346320170, "text": "Praying 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:11:33", "owner": "livingndbreathing_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985960974864208, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:11:32", "owner": "michelle.eibach", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855050482527540, "text": "That is horrifying", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:10:58", "owner": "hail_pigeon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026043686584534, "text": "😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:10:37", "owner": "lilpaladinallen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065143340530516, "text": "🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:10:34", "owner": "jack.wk_c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989374848882646, "text": "💔 stomach- churning and heart-breaking.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:10:34", "owner": "tallgirl_travel.co", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057267491308980, "text": "Was caused it ? Was it the bamboo or something in the building?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:10:07", "owner": "ye0j_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063649028180856, "text": "😢💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:10:03", "owner": "amandabulb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096432304889898, "text": "😢😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:09:56", "owner": "ariunkang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005280686667194, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:09:54", "owner": "shop.min_na", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933459364076519, "text": "Terrifying", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:09:32", "owner": "sassysandy103", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931821910130224, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:08:48", "owner": "alidabiri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980682645929060, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:08:46", "owner": "tnaytt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076324055212324, "text": "44 dead 200+ missing", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:08:45", "owner": "jovvaan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101899513668729, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:08:37", "owner": "hennessy.melissa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889169704387084, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:08:32", "owner": "kkkiki30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851939179593142, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:08:19", "owner": "janice.mok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852630640589285, "text": "Dozens dead and hundreds missing, what a terrible disaster 😞", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:08:18", "owner": "craigj1960", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106136191631199, "text": "💔😢🙏🏽Sending much Aloha and prayers ♥️🌺🦋🫶🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:08:08", "owner": "jbherras", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320590078172678, "text": "The cause was cigarette?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:07:59", "owner": "martyrzz1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352049743202654, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:07:23", "owner": "haiyinghuuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066555659567131, "text": "I thought the first photo was an AI at first…", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:07:09", "owner": "kyovajra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100552453762025, "text": "🙏🙏💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:07:05", "owner": "qtaylor___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087175945796532, "text": "😭💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:06:31", "owner": "nagano_chan93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921814840057177, "text": "💔💔🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:06:27", "owner": "yannyannnnn__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989846823895893, "text": "Oh no 😯😯😯😯😯😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:06:10", "owner": "nicholasjjyong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023180555788944, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:06:08", "owner": "iadelgado413", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871982440464650, "text": "🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:05:49", "owner": "neilmichaelpr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076619474211183, "text": "😭😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:05:22", "owner": "cxlxnxlxnxng", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18185009755350664, "text": "😭🙏🏻💔🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:05:21", "owner": "thvgabriel_ivy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083343716107692, "text": "My god this photo!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:05:07", "owner": "angela.doran", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152026465422917, "text": "💔💔😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:04:51", "owner": "jberlin715", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032474282739793, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:04:49", "owner": "catwong_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084989111094333, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:04:23", "owner": "dani_elle_stutterd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997624941703611, "text": "Oh my God 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:03:35", "owner": "likelove901", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18319904314172113, "text": "💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:03:14", "owner": "william.maug", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057388913299099, "text": "These photos are heartbreaking", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:02:41", "owner": "codesfarra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093023305924366, "text": "🙏💔😮😭 pray for hk 🇭🇰", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:02:37", "owner": "louisefarnay_art", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987407307863792, "text": "😢🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:01:29", "owner": "clouser.cynthia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545889673057055, "text": "His desperation, helplessness and grief..😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:01:15", "owner": "becrisler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045446348703235, "text": "💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:00:47", "owner": "jax_sky_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106507756716529, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:00:21", "owner": "amanda___elias", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850909360596154, "text": "not AI... OMG😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:00:18", "owner": "coolting1980", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066999749578001, "text": "Semana passada estava vendo uma matéria sobre esses apartamentos tipo \"caixão \", pessoas que moram de forma claustrofóbica na China  agora vejo esse prédio todo em chamas 🔥 meu Deus como tá difícil essa região. Espero que o governo ajude essas pessoas 