id": 18008119313814936, "text": "Wow hope people made it 🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:42:04", "owner": "da_brave_pelican", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096782827878675, "text": "🙏🏼 Prayers", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:41:56", "owner": "runjobaca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036075428721448, "text": "Sending love and healing thoughts to all affected❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:41:27", "owner": "dalybecky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086839627993253, "text": "So sad 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:41:12", "owner": "jetleewai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086050418055323, "text": "It’s 3:40 and just checked the live feed. Still goin!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:41:05", "owner": "apollo98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085534192831553, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:40:06", "owner": "tszngai_chan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063771254429284, "text": "😮🔥🙏💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:39:23", "owner": "2808low", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992447781893212, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:39:00", "owner": "xtinalucille", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085797125054290, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:38:03", "owner": "felipedomingues.oficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938617945098241, "text": "@arsenal please give this man a dream tour. In this cold weather, he still ran out of a burning building in 🇭🇰 wearing an Arsenal shirt…😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:37:44", "owner": "sooya_ia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18395401567123552, "text": "Wow....", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:37:20", "owner": "angelosorte", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982327053926998, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:37:00", "owner": "reetuz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071786438344714, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:36:48", "owner": "debsilva_12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934904311102620, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:35:54", "owner": "marie07791", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842022865633316, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:35:12", "owner": "debolatta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066867482622445, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:35:06", "owner": "herminiaaa_1013", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088038164480050, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:34:32", "owner": "jamessanglee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083716493283045, "text": "It’s so heartbreaking", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:32:41", "owner": "wobuguai2012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925792924035550, "text": "Crazy it didnt fall….", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:32:07", "owner": "localriddimkid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18422352274117619, "text": "Que desastre! Pobrecitos!😭💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:31:23", "owner": "mariuchadelmar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147649324378028, "text": "Mercy 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:31:17", "owner": "lexitoridesigns", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030801818546242, "text": "💔😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:30:46", "owner": "vicyinh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18507318349068825, "text": "It’s crazy how many people are glazing the first picture as “press photo of the year” cmon man really", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:30:45", "owner": "danielstok_es", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064934048150104, "text": "💔🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:30:29", "owner": "helenrosema", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876418366443254, "text": "😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:30:20", "owner": "_onemorepixel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097761394842553, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:29:47", "owner": "l0v3.linda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165102514348812, "text": "Sending prayers 😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:29:41", "owner": "natiiicruz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084692912475124, "text": "@shaynafranzetti @denisacost", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:29:31", "owner": "imlauk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085796845838663, "text": "Feel for those people. Where were the sprinklers?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:29:18", "owner": "ejkellerman_artist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991232991906382, "text": "So sad. 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:29:05", "owner": "kismaawake", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888924916258198, "text": "Horrible", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:28:09", "owner": "jimlam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18202418239316675, "text": "#جنگلهای_هیرکانی #جنگلهای_هیرکانی 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:27:57", "owner": "ocean.blue.meh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964916226996382, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:27:57", "owner": "lucilandrade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978690516936858, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:26:39", "owner": "kilesslynn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060018839642025, "text": "Just saw this on the news. It was intentionally set, and the three arsonists are in custody.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:26:08", "owner": "melodiecorcoran", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088373245812788, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:25:36", "owner": "sugar_mood", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073572845462584, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:25:34", "owner": "quinandqilasmom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966310276003805, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:25:06", "owner": "ranitng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032168372735184, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:24:55", "owner": "imtheoneishouldvelove", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146612593430576, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:24:52", "owner": "lili.ayala.moraes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157314022404413, "text": "36 people died including elderly, babies and pets... 200 people remained uncontactable 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:24:36", "owner": "mythary", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954228744903853, "text": "🌎 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:24:09", "owner": "crismmelo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113478208580697, "text": "So sad 💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:23:49", "owner": "elevenisournumber", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542345113044573, "text": "Photograph of the decade💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:23:13", "owner": "book_reviews_from_downunder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856658866565076, "text": "It's heartbreaking!!! 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:23:13", "owner": "claudia_moraes_slater", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902759761167754, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:22:20", "owner": "escuderomusic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978397506945533, "text": "that was human made", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:22:13", "owner": "mancuevas007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18163696384385855, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:22:09", "owner": "ilaria.scarpetta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068812844082855, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:22:08", "owner": "leo_the_lefty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064498328544653, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:21:23", "owner": "danny.klein", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896578507357288, "text": "The old man photo shows the exact sense of catastrophe", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:21:22", "owner": "ccybarry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331579132215261, "text": "😭😭💔💔💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:21:00", "owner": "aditafit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930177688116574, "text": "terrible and sad", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:20:51", "owner": "beaconwatch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904552780296191, "text": "Namo Amitaofo, Lord Buddha please don't neglect the people of HK, they gone thru a tough period", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:20:41", "owner": "ongpb85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18194839936325257, "text": "😮😮😢😭🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:20:40", "owner": "emilyptel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916609747218200, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:19:56", "owner": "saima_tariqamin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064706492163041, "text": "🙏🏽💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:19:39", "owner": "themattiejames", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18543230476006457, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:19:30", "owner": "vvannariin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953666764021347, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:19:29", "owner": "sigrid7477", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884121229408908, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:19:05", "owner": "niasalterego", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17844681357618337, "text": "What a photo 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:18:34", "owner": "eiracaberte", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072394388366535, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:17:48", "owner": "anauribefranco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057832511302561, "text": "Oh God 🙏🏾", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:17:19", "owner": "dangosgeingos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982580460942043, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:17:13", "owner": "sitianyang_stella", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086301197000337, "text": "@laxrana", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:16:50", "owner": "prats2007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918139825214857, "text": "Heartbreaking", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:16:31", "owner": "lavaguy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940694536095222, "text": "💔😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:15:42", "owner": "thatisjennie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18421032340115046, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:15:39", "owner": "jamf1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867657286483680, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:15:18", "owner": "jeffrey_are_jeffrey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098216071693648, "text": "That first image", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:15:16", "owner": "larry_lwp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027779735569985, "text": "🙏🏾💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:15:09", "owner": "trophy35", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998196159699714, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:15:05", "owner": "jzhan_19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008175062654010, "text": "Meu Deus 😭, tenha misericórdia desses irmãos", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:14:49", "owner": "debora_requiao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890015125382919, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:14:38", "owner": "tanyaazmi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865376191440075, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:10:07", "owner": "rosy_ajaka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980626038931298, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:10:04", "owner": "chrischosy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099034558699423, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:10:02", "owner": "lepin2001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120884728526614, "text": "“China builds so fast and cheap” - at what actual cost?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:09:37", "owner": "wakewagner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884916301284784, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:09:33", "owner": "siaaa_y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366743203083719, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:09:32", "owner": "yizhuqq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957267396889010, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:09:31", "owner": "birkelbayes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074109704253072, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:09:25", "owner": "ally_mcblah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862614526537454, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:08:18", "owner": "asuapril", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092367277729122, "text": "😮😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:08:11", "owner": "jonburgerman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293320567263145, "text": "My Prayers Got To The People In Hong Kong💔💔 This is a Tragedy no one should ever experience and go through. I could never imagine how it must feel to see potential loved ones lost from the flames😢 My biggest Condolences Goes to the Family affected by this tragedy 😢💔💔🙏🏾🙏🏾", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:07:46", "owner": "the_one_handzzy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861756967538774, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:07:34", "owner": "karenfung_86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068801105379058, "text": "Praying for the people and pets", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:07:28", "owner": "bexie_koko", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18545206708015668, "text": "😣😖", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:07:16", "owner": "viviremu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100459792688845, "text": "🙏🏽🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:06:44", "owner": "musekuo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18316651153223676, "text": "Sending prayers🙏💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:06:00", "owner": "iamebrubektas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084800480053956, "text": "💔Loosing your home is one of the most terrifying things at any age.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:05:41", "owner": "h.schulke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969285978827316, "text": "💔🙏bless Hong Kong", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:05:33", "owner": "jm_y.q", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114511027566711, "text": "💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:05:31", "owner": "earthspiritjewels", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856597696564773, "text": "OMG how horrific. That first photo really captures the horror of the situation. Those poor residents and the community. ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:04:52", "owner": "amsc32", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087487951808923, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:04:42", "owner": "iamjeffreyd_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916409326212953, "text": "Terrible tragedy, but some stellar photography here. 🫶", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:04:32", "owner": "smolter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116412325559536, "text": "These photos are heartbreaking💔 sending prayers to all of those affected🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:04:30", "owner": "andrealauuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981743796922430, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:03:50", "owner": "beautybeaumama", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138460069461276, "text": "Omg tooo sad", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:03:12", "owner": "judymaev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079549861910232, "text": "🥺🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:03:04", "owner": "dhea_gomurski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921685063056097, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:02:29", "owner": "coolichkova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034026701724971, "text": "😢😢😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:02:03", "owner": "itsliquidevents", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014339066800877, "text": "Terrible, heartbreaking, horrific 💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:01:39", "owner": "theseandevine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184925692351524, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:01:26", "owner": "babyruth.100", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063692366393152, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:01:24", "owner": "mummagoose1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067432688621458, "text": "😮😮😮😱", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:01:18", "owner": "soheyla_ca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028755386754354, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:01:17", "owner": "kmahan48", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079550125911786, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:01:15", "owner": "k_r0me", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891429517241669, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:01:11", "owner": "grrracious", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028451207775042, "text": "Omg!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:01:03", "owner": "scottsubiono", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958070961881150, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:01:03", "owner": "danny_hsu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853769890579126, "text": "Prayers... 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:00:42", "owner": "904forever", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005935499816939, "text": "🙏😢🙏💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:00:35", "owner": "vmaria313", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915551869219139, "text": "❤️🙏🙏🙏 Prayers for all🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:00:31", "owner": "glowup_sun1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930944683114348, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:00:20", "owner": "soccerdad.danny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18208715830315650, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:00:09", "owner": "danieladarz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078037385235410, "text": "💔💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:00:06", "owner": "xtalgra55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087204601803480, "text": "🙏🏾🙏🏾", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:59:55", "owner": "sonofabarros", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075279386265180, "text": "This is so painful to witness. I am baffled by the immensity of this fire. This does not seem natural but I'm no fire expert. Prayers for Hong Kong🙏🏽🙏🏽🙏🏽🥺🙏🏽🙏🏽✨️🕯🕊", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:59:42", "owner": "seraph_333_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030802724757466, "text": "Good lord 💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:59:25", "owner": "flaykie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973052613798268, "text": "Misericórdia", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:59:10", "owner": "vickrehn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109176691537679, "text": "My heart is breaking. 🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:59:00", "owner": "shawn.roberson.50", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967602093978156, "text": "🙏🏾🙏🏾🙏🏾🙏🏾🙏🏾", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:58:55", "owner": "vywstro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929195662018175, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:58:45", "owner": "eddyyy_baddie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18348058867203176, "text": "😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:58:40", "owner": "sue.traynor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024971546777397, "text": "Good God - that isn’t a fire, it’s an INFERNO", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:57:50", "owner": "aclbplus3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847504939609526, "text": "Da hell? Is that wood scaffolding??", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:57:45", "owner": "followmenytravel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065368832427217, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:57:20", "owner": "misspurpleann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087013555825874, "text": "My God, i hope they can save as many as possible 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:56:59", "owner": "misstropolis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18442593748098807, "text": "God have mercy, please, I beg you. 💔😢🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:56:56", "owner": "alineabreuhk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864656470522068, "text": "😢😢😢😢🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:56:38", "owner": "girovagando63", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073358057021810, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:56:28", "owner": "nidtreyvaud", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054910577664911, "text": "Astaghfirullah", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:56:27", "owner": "sahidgarments", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895668268356969, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:56:05", "owner": "molls2383", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18413954374189214, "text": "🙏😢 praying for those people", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:55:47", "owner": "melissavre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093992149847812, "text": "Pray for Hong Kong ❤️‍🩹🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:55:02", "owner": "itslljcici", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093638665713574, "text": "🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:55:02", "owner": "columbaesteva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908844