material to maximize profit ends in tragedy.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:51:10", "owner": "gracielapatino4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081886613110652, "text": "Why do they never mention the killed animals? Why? I thing that's really sad.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:50:51", "owner": "ska__power", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877327864439309, "text": "🙏❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:50:42", "owner": "toni_13roxberry_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302544694255445, "text": "🙏🙏🙏😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:50:39", "owner": "cindyseulkim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913127134248456, "text": "What an absolute nightmare 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:50:10", "owner": "101sketches", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124687450517707, "text": "😢😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:49:45", "owner": "ju_maiochi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18512372263071747, "text": "My god", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:48:55", "owner": "suzafumidiva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18330560158213020, "text": "💔So devastating hope families can find their loved ones and that everyone’s ok 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:48:49", "owner": "dawnmartinez_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100262701684408, "text": "Hi 👋,\n\nI wanted to tell you about a great retirement plan I joined. It helps you build a secure retirement with regular payouts. Every month, the plan pays out $3,500 to all US citizens 🇺🇸 🏦✨. You already know how it works – it's free to join.\n\nIf you're interested, I can refer you directly to ensure a smooth sign-up process and secure some benefits for you as a new customer. Kindly slide into my dm for more information", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:48:33", "owner": "martina.frei01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932508529109375, "text": "❤️🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:48:26", "owner": "tiffany_yw_bong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099242563765039, "text": "Lord have mercy 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:48:14", "owner": "beej_living_on_purpose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026139404584827, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:48:09", "owner": "dixiediaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888881041258218, "text": "😢💔🙏🇮🇱", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:48:04", "owner": "liron2301z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925933525168681, "text": "@chrism.runs krass …. 😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:47:44", "owner": "fabiennegorka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877459489433208, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:47:17", "owner": "camilasdsmelo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091251227079501, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:47:02", "owner": "rustemozarmagan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980166906928514, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:46:42", "owner": "ela.lisondra", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17976353249951319, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:46:38", "owner": "bobbie_lucious05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540538651044074, "text": "Like every day in Ukraine after russian rockets 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:45:53", "owner": "chriss_riss", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18368097409080452, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:45:39", "owner": "pax2tibi.amor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074097554010667, "text": "💔🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:45:29", "owner": "taricercatodeandrade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104007322731656, "text": "Only 13 deaths?Impossible", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:45:25", "owner": "veronica3860", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864413986522402, "text": "and no collapse …hmm", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:45:15", "owner": "george_najm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053181047338924, "text": "Sad", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:45:10", "owner": "jgleonfineart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064305176425882, "text": "prey for hk", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:45:03", "owner": "hanamyng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991841610896707, "text": "😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:44:45", "owner": "lizaellizaveta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864070201527123, "text": "🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:44:45", "owner": "hanamyng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065077103395941, "text": "🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:43:53", "owner": "neverexplain51", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067709480455873, "text": "Sending bless to Hongkong", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:43:29", "owner": "tiffanylinin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051364802345352, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:43:19", "owner": "iam_samata", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17965813922842521, "text": "💔🙏💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:43:00", "owner": "alexweiye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099642700772779, "text": "This is so tragic 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:42:41", "owner": "missleetchi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302198830251007, "text": "💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:42:29", "owner": "vaale77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866602615499516, "text": "Omg ees garzillaaaa!! Ok I’m going to hell", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:42:20", "owner": "mxwllwill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114040714514879, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:41:51", "owner": "ihrshptko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138417238461604, "text": "💔🕯️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:41:46", "owner": "russell.daur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026498648583948, "text": "God help them. We stand in solidarity with the people of Hong Kong.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:41:30", "owner": "claudiojamachado", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138524212413018, "text": "Horrible. God bless everyone there.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:41:10", "owner": "maureen_carrigan_art", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927348598159998, "text": "🙏😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:41:06", "owner": "bodysportcom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18385818307176280, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:41:05", "owner": "tt.thao.tran", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321440299170065, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:41:00", "owner": "lge.2018", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042016499498264, "text": "💔😭 omg", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:40:01", "owner": "lidicemsmartins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088422754948607, "text": "#LoveFamily  #LoveOurChildren \n#SupportSports \n#SupportDriveSafely \n#SupportRespectCyclists  #SupportSchools \n#SupportWomenRights  #SupportMakeSaferWorldForAllReligions \r\n#StopSupportTeachingTerrorismActAtSchools \n#SupportBoycottAnyPoliticianFromTheValuableSocietyWhomSupportAnykindsOfTerrorismAct \r\n#SupportLookafterElderlyPeoplesWithLoveAndRespect #SupportHonestJournalismOnly \r\n#MayGodBlessOurGreatWorldAmen", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:39:50", "owner": "taupowahed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927141277158069, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:39:18", "owner": "sandrahahn84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036966974717503, "text": "Hopefully everyone evacuated safely.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:39:17", "owner": "behuman1337", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098606356771691, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:39:04", "owner": "oscarpanmusic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005443694815567, "text": "Such devastating scenes.  Utterly heartbreaking 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:39:02", "owner": "ingridchristie_artist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089215922505642, "text": "😢 Tragic", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:37:51", "owner": "vagner_joseph", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064450007171105, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:37:31", "owner": "ss_amaorocks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945610051069755, "text": "Bong shong Wong dong", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:36:16", "owner": "tobyspeters", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075692354262989, "text": "Just horrible. How scary.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:36:03", "owner": "littleminky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036350255706032, "text": "Devastating", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:35:53", "owner": "stovesincoves", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113720158574315, "text": "🙏🙏🙏 god bless 😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:35:50", "owner": "frannie_liu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917618788214125, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:35:31", "owner": "stovesincoves", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031933862729692, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:35:27", "owner": "iryna.ionova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120103477531281, "text": "🖤", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:35:20", "owner": "missmaple422", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18328375369211117, "text": "💔hope everything will be fine and get recover sooner", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:35:18", "owner": "lynnwwang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968974299827049, "text": "For all latin people: pensé que el señor de la primera foto era el papá de Chinguamiga jajaja.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:34:44", "owner": "sebaperezpizarro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893967943359658, "text": "It's impossible not to remember the Grenfell Tower fire in London back in 2017. Very likely to have similar causes.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:34:18", "owner": "eu.verena", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087399208814873, "text": "If Kamala had been elected in 2024, this would never have happened", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:33:23", "owner": "kamanchi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847248607587258, "text": "Horrible 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:33:05", "owner": "jkaurdesign", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953478574047078, "text": "Dios ayuda a esa pobre gente. 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:32:16", "owner": "viva_la_vima", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103535380733460, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:31:47", "owner": "nayaring.tv", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17901636144321806, "text": "😢💔🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:31:35", "owner": "jazminepaniagua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18419098528112138, "text": "💔💔💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:31:15", "owner": "klara.johnstone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182616913358600, "text": "❤️🙏❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:31:01", "owner": "adoroetc", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17851419168554959, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:31:00", "owner": "keitaturnerdesign", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18048694973410931, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:30:50", "owner": "erinkostudios", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17893400166368119, "text": "Wow, capturing our humanity is wonderful, profound and incredible. 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:30:15", "owner": "demooi.visuals", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132462934490496, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:29:27", "owner": "leightonching", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882875365420261, "text": "You really enjoyed this right ? USA terrorism", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:29:22", "owner": "ivanlafargala", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103442989734852, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:29:20", "owner": "ejay83", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352744060203815, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:28:50", "owner": "kalasher_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969740652977302, "text": "Heartbreaking 😓", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:28:38", "owner": "nahaalp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091481056932577, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:27:48", "owner": "mimstylista", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18387638479177260, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:27:46", "owner": "culventuretravel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069945884372983, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:26:53", "owner": "samerarochaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082460806889474, "text": "Who did this", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:26:49", "owner": "litlikeparis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059845874642273, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:26:41", "owner": "adriannamitchell_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18119633023552169, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:26:39", "owner": "rgerbertxn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073833401262182, "text": "Prayers 🥲", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:26:10", "owner": "r_a_k_e_s_h_2612", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028097111758848, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:25:44", "owner": "gabriella_gibney_97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076664512969025, "text": "Sadly these photos look like AI and put distrust into news sources accordingly. Hard to know what to believe anymore. I would hope the times is still credible.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:25:41", "owner": "oliviasuzanne_dds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925351216176567, "text": "This is massive fire😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:25:31", "owner": "cloudy_cooper", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081675412894379, "text": "Que triste 🥹", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:24:43", "owner": "contadoradocomex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087813488483586, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:24:34", "owner": "w.illiamho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082160918120469, "text": "Oh my god!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:24:31", "owner": "rachelcassiel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865916440503634, "text": "💔💔anyone has a legit donation link?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:24:31", "owner": "ypa11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078126749227014, "text": "Please tell me this is not from cladding like Grenfell in UK", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:24:07", "owner": "altraoiche", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18365839060095083, "text": "Pray for HK 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:22:33", "owner": "marisaviccc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17898650997339053, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:22:23", "owner": "tomaziamd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118364119550198, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:22:08", "owner": "wangtiping", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146133817433376, "text": "💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:21:57", "owner": "waitingz983", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18333112504246001, "text": "😭💔💔💔💔🚒🚒🚒🚑🚒🚑🚓🚒🚒🚒🚒🚒🚒🚒❤️‍🩹🥀💐", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:21:49", "owner": "sweet5world", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023526407787621, "text": "😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:21:26", "owner": "dat_ingrid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062921636426750, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:21:14", "owner": "sweet5world", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080200385125939, "text": "😮😢💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:21:08", "owner": "hawkplatero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901434157324952, "text": "天佑香港🇭🇰", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:20:58", "owner": "glory0315", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895791646356900, "text": "How horrifying. Painful to witness. Can’t even imagine how painful to experience. 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:20:53", "owner": "starfireslc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105305869630113, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:20:45", "owner": "dayana_008", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013611134801109, "text": "Heartbreaking. Sending prayers. 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:20:39", "owner": "dr.natalieg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080549639276175, "text": "🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:20:24", "owner": "lesley.t.busby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077331931971021, "text": "💔😢🙏 this is so heartbreaking.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:19:54", "owner": "socialclarityclub", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013670534802405, "text": "Dont build with wood!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:19:38", "owner": "cbaron87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843690112621802, "text": "@jaacobvo", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:19:23", "owner": "goodenoughpsychiatrist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988736616879133, "text": "😭🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:19:18", "owner": "gwenl4285", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082166926890085, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:18:56", "owner": "jiao_zengshuo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105514126644643, "text": "My heart goes out to all, heartbreaking to see this 😔😔🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:18:52", "owner": "esvannie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964665345993132, "text": "🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:18:52", "owner": "purelynani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115985548498716, "text": "So sad 😞 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:18:45", "owner": "nataliekarazlot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101324584739405, "text": "Such a horrible tragedy right before the holidays 🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:18:39", "owner": "letsgetreadytorumbleee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085332218476502, "text": "Heartbreaking!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:18:14", "owner": "ralicouture", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101867191731747, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:18:00", "owner": "lovearchi89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102335875672463, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:17:59", "owner": "mpa8534", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092760640915243, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:17:56", "owner": "gerardicosas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397797541120665, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T20:17:49", "owner": "jigstah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113257552513807, "text": "💔😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:52:25", "owner": "tonyamerkecreative", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876946900440646, "text": "😢💔sending love and prayers to all involved. Even without full details, the circumstances seem suspicious. I wonder what plans exist for that area.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:52:20", "owner": "noohra___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184265092346959, "text": "😢🙏🏾🙏🏾🙏🏾", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:51:52", "owner": "tbwisf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074808019998424, "text": "💔🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:51:52", "owner": "katherinesiusiu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086079658819929, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:51:43", "owner": "93deja", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080098310516054, "text": "Devastating", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:51:20", "owner": "cherdrinksthings", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962008740858151, "text": "This suffering is too much. 💔 My heart is with the city of Hong Kong 🇭🇰 what a horrible tragedy. 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:51:14", "owner": "lbolan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905440444147861, "text": "It’s an heartbreaking night for a lot of people out there, sending prayers and support 🙏🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:50:56", "owner": "stephaniexrouge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957943272886307, "text": "Holy moly. That first image. 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:50:48", "owner": "bitbyafox", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18087250630955931, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:50:07", "owner": "alwaysrhonpoint", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120437395548539, "text": "🙏💔😢God blessed the families", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:49:57", "owner": "blogdamaemoderna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088600213786178, "text": "💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:49:57", "owner": "desired_tastes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107040751627853, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:49:55", "owner": "sherryberryu2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083971220044815, "text": "Oh this is heartbreaking! Praying for all 🙏🏽🙏🏽🙏🏽🙏🏽🙏🏽🙏🏽", "create