fioffna.siu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060683135549776, "text": "🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:27:50", "owner": "sunny_wit_sam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947197173935309, "text": "Aynı anda hepsi nasıl yanabilir 💔😢sabotaj mı", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:27:39", "owner": "aysfmm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086391026063617, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:27:37", "owner": "g.a.m.z.e.ee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338292349229553, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:27:16", "owner": "fontainewu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864232630520745, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:27:00", "owner": "picachu1702", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978445155946552, "text": "Why they don’t use helicopters 🚁?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:26:56", "owner": "pandomania.tm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18364911907093523, "text": "This hurts my heart. Sending big love and comfort to the people of Hong Kong.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:26:52", "owner": "thenoraburns", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112372363525956, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:26:09", "owner": "kendallknox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093116233917802, "text": "wow this photo", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:26:08", "owner": "halesthephotographer", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18193935748326693, "text": "😢😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:26:07", "owner": "sumsumcooks", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090925025496634, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:25:49", "owner": "deniseou5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877324243436651, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:25:43", "owner": "maryyy_monteiro", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18048420110423940, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:25:23", "owner": "t4toun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854018365536286, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:25:14", "owner": "cantodulin", "likes": 32}, {"id": 18088258574297022, "text": "Sending prayers", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:24:27", "owner": "divyasingh03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160686814392098, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:24:02", "owner": "gabriel_maillo01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295596838278365, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:24:01", "owner": "cecilelevee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066361904626987, "text": "This is when you’re ruled by China", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:23:53", "owner": "ok.xzzx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061638461204455, "text": "How terrifying for all of them.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:23:27", "owner": "ariasha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065736464436973, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:23:26", "owner": "davidka98_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043919459694507, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:23:21", "owner": "kandiceey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086397257483872, "text": "😢🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:23:05", "owner": "bywayof_faith", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076863590230952, "text": "🙏MY PRAYERS, but why did the buildungs not collapse", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:23:02", "owner": "photo.pod", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060928943633637, "text": "The whole world is on fire. Whats going on???", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:22:41", "owner": "ibbaei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087466321792176, "text": "So sad", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:22:34", "owner": "_wcch_legal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969224790984441, "text": "😢😢😢🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:22:31", "owner": "saua78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184093519354469, "text": "the gag when i thought the first photo was AI, so powerful", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:22:07", "owner": "buffydumpty", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18499305514077608, "text": "This is a tragedy but what an impactful image.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:22:03", "owner": "beatrizpi9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083006735029511, "text": "🙏💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:22:02", "owner": "kwannnnn6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295596529287685, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:22:01", "owner": "panninr200", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047564510690862, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:22:00", "owner": "_labussolina_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18336208822233349, "text": "Omg this is breaking my heart. So much pain. I’m so sorry for this loss. 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:21:57", "owner": "uzalpatricia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922435924048893, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:21:48", "owner": "wow_aluneizi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072010325344171, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:21:35", "owner": "theluxurycouturewardrobe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539533804038847, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:21:06", "owner": "paixien", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077288825235920, "text": "Thank goodness only 13 casualties. What a tragedy!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:21:05", "owner": "hollybeth1227", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18186054781343007, "text": "Sending prayers 🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:21:04", "owner": "cuncuncitra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951816147913158, "text": "Sending prayers 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:20:37", "owner": "gareth_jameslife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082713260326372, "text": "That’s so sad", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:20:05", "owner": "re.rsantos_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085224517972655, "text": "Meu Deus! \nAlguém sabe como este fogo se propagou desta forma ?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:19:37", "owner": "paula_anjos06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946377952063729, "text": "Oh no do terrible", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:19:22", "owner": "headphonemicrophone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064224161388514, "text": "🙏🙏❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:19:14", "owner": "jessicashea.co", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18339634939232212, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:19:04", "owner": "elletmeng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047974493429682, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:18:59", "owner": "freyatenenbaum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029305784559890, "text": "Epic photo.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:18:31", "owner": "bjohnsonxar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17865357126437030, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:18:24", "owner": "ander.lau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366631036095458, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:18:11", "owner": "weiyuezhou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887124970401212, "text": "Pulitzer para las primeras 2 fotos", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:18:05", "owner": "matiasrcortes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061343168554550, "text": "I thought I was looking at pix from the incident in Thailand.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:18:01", "owner": "bambispoony", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092515552903145, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:17:31", "owner": "midhunkailas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079203733918018, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:17:14", "owner": "bettie_smith", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863772880524489, "text": "God bless Hong Kong", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:17:09", "owner": "tonyeung_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147460027381859, "text": "@missmangobutt", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:17:06", "owner": "ghadaamnit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383470768197681, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:16:56", "owner": "ekingenhakan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056786825308655, "text": "😳😳😳", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:16:50", "owner": "cuscaflalu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085209896051378, "text": "💔🙏💔🙏🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:16:35", "owner": "caitlinbryant", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18273065257303611, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:16:24", "owner": "aespinozavega", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086403524076592, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:16:14", "owner": "rafaelaferreira865", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081771478890431, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:16:03", "owner": "tagfinearts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920160088197182, "text": "Omg :(", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:16:03", "owner": "ms.romo.g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065428472426266, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:15:11", "owner": "bonitote", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108143362618899, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:14:42", "owner": "_chula_cx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184230889344928, "text": "That's horrible news, but did the dude pose for the photo or did someone think oh yeah that dude is upset so I should take a photo?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:14:29", "owner": "jonman_987", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18021525218792771, "text": "Announced at 1am HKT, 36 dead😢 incresing", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:14:19", "owner": "barttck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006814382660315, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:14:12", "owner": "nadiabluesky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18336085021237105, "text": "Sending prayers", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:13:43", "owner": "ssapphire__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061340042222102, "text": "So sad 💔 god bless", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:13:08", "owner": "robertsonbespokeengravingltd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025144943771822, "text": "pray for Hongkong people 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:13:02", "owner": "capitaovalk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18437408794097568, "text": "Horrific 😭💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:13:00", "owner": "jet_set_shari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089043830313148, "text": "💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:12:39", "owner": "albaasears", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888350497259946, "text": "🙏🏽🙏🏽🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:11:44", "owner": "therealbrauna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078724069922586, "text": "Father send your angels to my city. Praying for healing and restoration 🙏🏽🙏🏽🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:11:31", "owner": "dgidwani310", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18173968150369906, "text": "May the lost souls find peace in heaven 🙏🏻💐", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:11:03", "owner": "mahesh.06.10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079508717271195, "text": "🙏🙏🙏 sending thoughts and prayers to people in HK", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:10:52", "owner": "ora.is.here", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127337734451372, "text": "😢😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:10:39", "owner": "shousiguizi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086772991994802, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:10:00", "owner": "dalingguan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876602194354131, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:09:31", "owner": "stephanie_makes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886470796399481, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:09:17", "owner": "shanigwin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947339173062751, "text": "This is just heartbreaking 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:09:03", "owner": "rockinator", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946329133073569, "text": "This is heartbreaking.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:08:34", "owner": "des_perez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842222371630678, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:08:31", "owner": "stefavelez_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095550392497210, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:07:55", "owner": "frankiegoestohollyw00d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085187597287164, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:07:42", "owner": "mrchunkyexpress", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17986459514870471, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:07:11", "owner": "melloyell0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030695606554373, "text": "That first photo absolutely shows the power of photography communicating the human experience. So powerful and gut wrenching.  Sending so much love to all of these people who are affected", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:06:41", "owner": "summer_murdock", "likes": 925}, {"id": 17994258872725745, "text": "So so so painful to watch 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:06:40", "owner": "krisfok_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013112654799209, "text": "🙏🏽🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:06:37", "owner": "delabomba", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18047054072453463, "text": "💔😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:06:24", "owner": "yriy_krashchenko", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18072730685201235, "text": "❤️🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:06:21", "owner": "ecedemedici", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990067116903210, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:06:13", "owner": "aleksandrsigalus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873970294375927, "text": "But them my projects though... I built for Japan because they like Good Times so much!? Janet!!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:05:23", "owner": "huthejukebox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098507227808799, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:05:06", "owner": "liguev_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086486128969160, "text": "😢🙏🏾💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:04:40", "owner": "alice_n_transcendence", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086705348291203, "text": "🙏 🙏 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:04:34", "owner": "jwf1688", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072811364349852, "text": "So sad. I’m shocked but thankful it doesn’t happen more often.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:04:31", "owner": "anothermwmcguirk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107047942714383, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:04:10", "owner": "sweetchareegallery", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086565206051588, "text": "What?!?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:03:49", "owner": "labrownelle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058521011281313, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:03:41", "owner": "ana.avila_s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057406409293783, "text": "😢😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:03:39", "owner": "pipe_thefit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051159854342880, "text": "Holy cow. How many people live in these buildings?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:03:38", "owner": "rocoecoe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863631412518483, "text": "Woah 😳", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:03:34", "owner": "odin_and_kalis_apprentice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057553853307459, "text": "Some incredibly powerful photos. How sad.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:03:00", "owner": "chachfiles", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18065813537434404, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:02:37", "owner": "mahavir206", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302424574283357, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:02:13", "owner": "ericalynn077", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098577922827288, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:02:10", "owner": "geisatre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112079185609127, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:01:51", "owner": "kennie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18572735086026456, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:01:48", "owner": "yeahmeiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083431736097526, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:01:32", "owner": "kmadaleno4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103195441672779, "text": "Sending prayers", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:01:16", "owner": "thejambr250164", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18335453653238935, "text": "😢🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:01:11", "owner": "gabrielpaoleschi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073145174339612, "text": "💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:01:09", "owner": "welton.juliace", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101168509668394, "text": "😢😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:01:08", "owner": "thejambr250164", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889924540379255, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:01:02", "owner": "marta_plus3mm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065536988155348, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:00:50", "owner": "kylealexanderlens", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058459634281168, "text": "oh no!!! i hope they’re able to recover quickly and find all the missing people. sending love to hong kong ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:00:31", "owner": "joci.rob", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885075223286134, "text": "Sterkte 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:00:24", "owner": "beautysalon_witteorchidee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979210587938260, "text": "😭💔🙏✝️✨", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:00:14", "owner": "peterlee_2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546118960024263, "text": "So sad 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:59:58", "owner": "savvyvenice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18387451270179175, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:59:41", "owner": "damiedan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099274369765370, "text": ":(", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:59:15", "owner": "selena.raw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165216247388644, "text": "First image looks Hella ai.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:58:58", "owner": "thereal.henrychoi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073577192586162, "text": "🙏🏽🙏🏽🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:58:57", "owner": "sharib", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861424969468605, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_a