3207639, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:55:40", "owner": "davegollenberg", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18026648696582081, "text": "What a tragedy. It is hard to see. God Bless all victims families.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:55:32", "owner": "joaoaris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396465517134398, "text": "Fires can be so devastating.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:55:06", "owner": "alyshepro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967313634993402, "text": "prayers 🤲🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:55:05", "owner": "leomahalo", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18029117246764697, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:54:57", "owner": "marrouhfar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088640869942111, "text": "💔💔😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:54:56", "owner": "lejanvier_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086335469070039, "text": "Wow! 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:54:49", "owner": "chumpspotter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134175166471431, "text": "😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:54:38", "owner": "lucycortes_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075317996233232, "text": "Çok kötü 😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:54:35", "owner": "ser.ra.41", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001936778888591, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:54:34", "owner": "dixietoledo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103892791678813, "text": "💔😢 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:54:33", "owner": "iosonolaross", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087100000802805, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:54:29", "owner": "wzwisgloria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862889323535961, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:53:30", "owner": "hugodasilva75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988269354913820, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:53:26", "owner": "trudilouise", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904575979296087, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:53:21", "owner": "chaffeyentrepreneurship", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957646603009919, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:53:11", "owner": "clarinha.oliveira8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125423803503431, "text": "that first photo needs an award", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:52:50", "owner": "olisquiress", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085134047078555, "text": "These poor people. 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:52:48", "owner": "mikederry9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060623567563178, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:52:48", "owner": "alexybella", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001316600837009, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:52:48", "owner": "benjichiang", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18022152740604262, "text": "Ohhh 😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:52:47", "owner": "thezzzalt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18300070534258962, "text": "Oh~Impressive", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:52:30", "owner": "leungkinwing123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085472726065269, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:52:11", "owner": "kaiacharles_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917557183212266, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:52:04", "owner": "lenescunha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090788168503859, "text": "Is this A.I. ???", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:52:03", "owner": "andrerbrownjr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105762004724641, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:52:02", "owner": "natashas.lifeventures", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847221664587054, "text": "This is tragic, how powerful the photos are… my heart goes out to these people.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:51:52", "owner": "bridget.kelly.sf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064217696177879, "text": "+6 hours for a residential fire is staggering. It’s tragic and also incredible more people didn’t loose their lives in a blaze like that.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:51:39", "owner": "alexwashburn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18549468985018653, "text": "😢💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:51:31", "owner": "annetiksmile", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083429134854284, "text": "Oh my lord..🙏🙏🙏 sending prayers and so much love from 🇯🇲 🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:51:23", "owner": "iamtiease", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851863114593090, "text": "These photos are insane", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:51:16", "owner": "jj_koolj", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086407250082243, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:51:08", "owner": "taviwavy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972539289967574, "text": "Looks like it killed more than 13", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:50:22", "owner": "gonz1492", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928448311166272, "text": "How awful. 🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:50:20", "owner": "cecileqpham", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914948410227638, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:50:19", "owner": "joanaknezevic", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17949360261026558, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:49:56", "owner": "tata_fajardoc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027138242749696, "text": "❤️‍🩹", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:49:55", "owner": "yanling_______", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158767198401502, "text": "HK 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:49:51", "owner": "michael_pppppp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901661302321526, "text": "Immediate tears. Sending so much love and strength and healing", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:49:41", "owner": "savvv.png", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010560812809937, "text": "🙏🙏🙏❤️❤️❤️🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:48:23", "owner": "geminis_compass", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086174465007044, "text": "💔🙏😭🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:48:00", "owner": "angcrisos", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18036269609722431, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:47:56", "owner": "ingriddebonhome", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941619508088591, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:47:56", "owner": "j._lau", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18113468422516965, "text": "天佑我城🙏🏻😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:47:48", "owner": "rainenotrainey", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18299576323258964, "text": "R U OKAY @nishkalaungani", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:47:34", "owner": "sidney.palacios", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981741816936940, "text": "🙏🏾", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:47:18", "owner": "kingraheeem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103801495591302, "text": "This is so incredibly heartbreaking…", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:47:04", "owner": "nkat428", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884873353285861, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:46:48", "owner": "rafiamaheen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002599580830367, "text": "Oh god that is so awful 😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:46:33", "owner": "abbydabbs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094632544807629, "text": "🙏🙏🙏 Praying for all affected by this tragedy", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:46:30", "owner": "aracelycsalazar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114470548575646, "text": "💛🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:46:27", "owner": "shnkrsn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086863570950068, "text": "Prayers up for HK 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:46:26", "owner": "snakeskin2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18178328800363113, "text": "RIP", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:46:20", "owner": "bnw_dashtto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154298854414673, "text": "Crazy good photojournalism here🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:46:19", "owner": "allxpix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103491133584882, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:46:01", "owner": "bencakr831", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119394433544511, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:45:44", "owner": "diptidhody", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070025816527427, "text": "💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:45:41", "owner": "charlyhood", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873461224378766, "text": "Sending prayers. 🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:45:18", "owner": "lucasprado.prado", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993908763717940, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:44:26", "owner": "fabiolorranazevedo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086396756294117, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:44:06", "owner": "besvisor", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17928862575149847, "text": "💔💔😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:43:59", "owner": "megamenia_photography", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119789809551566, "text": "💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏 praying for all affected.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:43:49", "owner": "gramma_j_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18195146482330364, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:43:44", "owner": "cielohome", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18318827977220081, "text": "Sending kindness and love to Hong Kong from Brooklyn, NY! Hopefully everyone is okay there!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:43:33", "owner": "johnmitchellworld", "likes": 24}, {"id": 18088137541805129, "text": "My god 💔 sending prayers", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:43:23", "owner": "withaditi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18013120268804020, "text": "The structures of in Hong Kong are so very tall and crowed I’m surprise more weren’t killed.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:43:14", "owner": "sherriellisor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024279794716575, "text": "What a horrific event but that first picture is so powerful. Deserves a Pulitzer", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:43:01", "owner": "pavementsf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051473591363269, "text": "2025 total is 9, year of destruction by fire. (earthquakes, volcanic eruptions, blaze, plane destruction etc) 🙏 Praying for 2025 to end as next year total is 1 and it will be beginning of peace and stability", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:42:13", "owner": "melonandmusk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052493402338689, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:42:12", "owner": "neadadeters", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17936235693070520, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:42:11", "owner": "alegiordano9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322024846169990, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:41:57", "owner": "dsmith0876", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080485172129018, "text": "What a heartbreaking nightmare. 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:41:50", "owner": "ninamsclafani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905539318143274, "text": "😢😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:41:37", "owner": "lusicekhtiarian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071949986347142, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:41:28", "owner": "ronnilus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078843346907141, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:41:24", "owner": "belllcc_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844396963619376, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:41:18", "owner": "nikkibarrantes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065357435406758, "text": "May all the good of the universe be with them 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:41:11", "owner": "jphelpsmusic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070888991074192, "text": "🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:40:45", "owner": "he_ctor8964", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895962940357069, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:40:42", "owner": "mr_tristanl", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18385932175199810, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:40:40", "owner": "ashannp.a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138429463414120, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:40:37", "owner": "suzism", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140879626454149, "text": "Sending Prayers 🙏🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:40:26", "owner": "jaxdanfitness1", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17958433106882617, "text": "💔 shocking & heartbreaking 💔 how sad & what an amazing photograph", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:40:07", "owner": "tearsofvenuscurated", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061656236234999, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:40:02", "owner": "sweetspacedesign", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852935101588199, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:39:32", "owner": "yokairagp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18324053062300522, "text": "@sashamanei", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:38:53", "owner": "cyriltinotenda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104654632642762, "text": "Los edificios son una trampa mortal", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:38:50", "owner": "ala22_ar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051184634355471, "text": "Heartbreaking! 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:38:29", "owner": "kaur.ruchikapal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102949729673928, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:38:16", "owner": "keshiahannam", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17867939712415893, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:38:14", "owner": "marisolalemiranda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977128239954488, "text": "Every city dwellers worst nightmare. Heart is with the people of Honk Kong.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:38:02", "owner": "jamesbenjaminrodgers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084841802086526, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:37:59", "owner": "salseralina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057470570290322, "text": "I knew it would happen someday . Just looking at how tiny each apartment unit is and how people live there dont have enough space for showering cooking , etc. fire alarm systems werent probably installed inappropriately. Prayers", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:37:59", "owner": "tac.lau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087565120789486, "text": "Devastated for them. Were the new drone firefighters deployed? Impossible to rescue but to reach the flames, the drones would be useful.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:37:57", "owner": "k_o_har", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083855788862871, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:37:25", "owner": "pennyackerly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18194298262330987, "text": "Awful", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:37:21", "owner": "amkelly1984", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092882879507991, "text": "So sad, I wonder how many pets were also affected 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:37:17", "owner": "metricgirl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048574385669510, "text": "💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:37:16", "owner": "taysevaluz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894518593360121, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:37:11", "owner": "heaterbeater28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125136694520066, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:37:09", "owner": "gentlemensbarbershopbrooklyn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879803524428474, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:37:08", "owner": "kellyhgreenway", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051989672362166, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:36:30", "owner": "teona.gogichaishvili", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18033733580527233, "text": "13？！", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:36:30", "owner": "nylinlu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087808189806913, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:36:21", "owner": "therealmoniquelongoria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18299255749257371, "text": "🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:36:06", "owner": "felidelagente", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18152259157418393, "text": "So awful", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:35:49", "owner": "c8s23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876719353442085, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:35:41", "owner": "electracesoir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950586439050562, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:34:53", "owner": "kelly.ej.of.monaco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063404873428470, "text": "Nobody cares about Hong Kong. America first", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:34:49", "owner": "weidermarcy1848", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147679810428933, "text": "Heartbreaking 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:34:43", "owner": "hachidunk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112432594606217, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:34:29", "owner": "istadart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911384113254733, "text": "That first photo is gut wrenching 💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:34:27", "owner": "brethurston", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18139477747460395, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:34:24", "owner": "_one_wan_i.s", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18556706137044235, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:34:21", "owner": "marikutxii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078931274147124, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:33:35", "owner": "axisanna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135791290482149, "text": "It's very sad. It's heartbreaking.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:33:27", "owner": "y_gulgen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091753879924820, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:33:19", "owner": "hustlemama", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991840725855421, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:33:19", "owner": "malubsantos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046633145697893, "text": "Prayers ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:33:13", "owner": "call_me_ted_mosby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18197265541322864, "text": "Tremendas fotos un par de ellas", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:32:45", "owner": "celeste_jeepers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979684281934635, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:32:40", "owner": "ohjulesb", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18073395554030859, "text": "Heartbreaking 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:32:37", "owner": "justlamarcarter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953660917032590, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:32:16", "owner": "laa_93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107709115617093, "text": "Jesus how terrifying and so sad - I can only  imagine it was an electrical fault!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:32:15", "owner": "anitabott", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080165882125080, "text": "Yikes", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:31:55", "owner": "the_patrickryan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852684697586978, "text": "Prayers", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:31:43", "owner": "jameliu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954563559976238, "text": "hongkong its not save and not good anymore for living", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:31:36", "owner": "mia_motor_tytyan_indah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084508022072740, "text": "Holy hell , I live in HK and just flew out yesterday 😮 which suburb was this ?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:31:11", "owner": "td_weir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015771290796028, "text": "Oh my Lord!  Praying for the people!  Must have been so scary. 😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:31:09", "owner": "hanietb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989606133900237, "text": "😭😭😭🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:31:02", "owner": "entrepreneur_joseluis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086641937296583, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:30:19", "owner": "vanessaveigagamper", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051574490347847, "text": "The power a single photo can hold.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:29:59", "owner": "ambermarietola", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934546975073142, "text": "Que imágenes de esta terrible de esta tragedia!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:29:48", "owner": "liliana.paz.18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18495794944074839, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:29:47", "owner": "karenina_d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051087224670502, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:29:42", "owner": "selena_giana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085868792484525, "text": "AI", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:29:33", "owner": "sanket_anbhule", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977662932943193, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:29:30", "owner": "tracyulloa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086487385996081, "text": "Pray for HK 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:29:23", "owner": "noobznoobz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127351525444413, "text": "🙏😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:29:15", "owner": "6rix6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545744506053753, "text": "Devastating loss, I’m so sorry. I hope those injured recover quickly and that the grieving families have support during this time.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:29:08", "owner": "boots_c54", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931302862134784, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:28:48", "owner": "serpil_albayrak_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082681529095364, "text": "Having kust seen the mural of Grenfell Tower fire at Tate Britain, I think they're VERY LUCKY the death till is only 13. Do they assume it will rise??", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:28:41", "owner": "todayinireland", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863671873532576, "text": "😭😭😭😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:28:40", "owner": "bakergirlofficial", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18330188434209862, "text": "Honestly, after the first pic, I thought it was going to say thousands were dead. Thank god that many people made it to safety.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:28:25", "owner": "lehawww", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18431902663111791, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:28:23", "owner": "ilircema", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090911869912923, "text": "Dios nos proteja de una desgracia asi.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:28:10", "owner": "tatyencalada24", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17902818678164240, "text": "Por um momento eu achei que era IA", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:28:05", "owner": "nath.oh_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099647788786892, "text": "Omg 🙏 prayers for Hong Kong.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:27:55", "owner": "genojim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888351868260165, "text": "😢😢😢😢 very sad. @aftvmedia I see here a photo of our fellow Gunner slide 3", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:27:54", "owner": "fimashavin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991372764898594, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:27:41", "owner": "fernandovsantanna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861233530540067, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:27:38", "owner": "ibs.dietitian", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17986605329863642, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:27:21", "owner": "_monilindley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075777760984731, "text": "My heart goes to Hong Kong. I lived in new territories many years ago 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:27:18", "owner": "bexinwonderland7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082118669029139, "text": "Prayers to all that have seen their lives torn apart in this horrific tragedy 💔🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:27:10", "owner": "mr_kfarazad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949720098918154, "text": "My heart is crying. 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:26:27", "owner": "pedtanstic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041092415502853, "text": "Omg thats so scary 🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:26:24", "owner": "lusoto_tattoos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078800984178252, "text": "🙏sending prayers", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:26:21", "owner": "futuristicamour", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058635509286488, "text": "💔💔🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:25:54", "owner": "yiiii_mia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110651098610449, "text": "Sending prayers🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:25:45", "owner": "ualrdyknw777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18170022331372246, "text": "Still didn't collapse...", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:25:28", "owner": "craighicksartwork", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088154866771350, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:25:25", "owner": "anapldesousa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045739787480533, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:25:08", "owner": "iam3v3land", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862968451532736, "text": "These buildings are 40+ years old. So most owners, assuming they bought them when they were at early 30s, are around 70+ years old and immobile. Unless they live with their children, most live alone. That means most could not escape before the fire engulfed them. At the moment, the fire is still happening and 200 people are reported missing. I am afraid there will be more casualties. 💔😭😭😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:25:07", "owner": "cantonlangdaily", "likes": 1144}, {"id": 17921622339054301, "text": "Kinda crazy the scaffolding was made of bamboo 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:24:49", "owner": "tamtoe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933451381105169, "text": "🫢🫢🫢🙏🏾🙏🏾💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:24:39", "owner": "flyboykoree", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098617033792006, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:24:13", "owner": "samyueruen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105561199640480, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:24:00", "owner": "wayfarer_neverland", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066422984419426, "text": "Wow !!! what a dramatic shot", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:23:33", "owner": "markraschke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18382104139150416, "text": "Bless HK 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:23:31", "owner": "angiepeipei6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076126480976346, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:23:29", "owner": "marysalim_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066895700123707, "text": "@abi_manubay", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:23:25", "owner": "franckiebe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098041096630829, "text": "We seen countless of these high rise buildings burn for hours yet don’t collapse…except one", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:23:16", "owner": "tarartblacksoul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074915786598901, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:23:03", "owner": "fonsecamonica", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18070996157371382, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:22:57", "owner": "sugarsurfcapecod", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942943261088536, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:22:41", "owner": "jpeezy81", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039371312509587, "text": "Que triste 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:22:02", "owner": "whatsarahddoes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949635243918930, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:21:52", "owner": "emsamsterdam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084061754045728, "text": "😢💔🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:21:43", "owner": "cd.austinmt.tx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049538423398732, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:21:41", "owner": "iireareii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086538949817918, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:21:40", "owner": "snowying121", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030457409756101, "text": "Ternyata ini yang diposting papi william. Stay save🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:21:24", "owner": "lsatrianiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041620385687779, "text": "Parece filme de tão chocante 😮😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:21:20", "owner": "chelysantana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872131051387210, "text": "Oh my god.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:21:12", "owner": "ashleychiuchiu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965323368847416, "text": "😢😢😢😢💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:20:47", "owner": "renatawhitaker10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842060308632619, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:20:36", "owner": "apw233", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088923482305015, "text": "😢💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:20:24", "owner": "thebearatpolkstreetflorist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059031683282976, "text": "🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:20:17", "owner": "wandie2815", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065063378400733, "text": "💔😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:20:08", "owner": "sabiekingdom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934416796128637, "text": "Heartbreaking. 💔💔. Prayers for Hing Kong.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:19:59", "owner": "sandie.in.la", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368509231083037, "text": "Incredible photojournalism.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:19:46", "owner": "gabrielleenfield", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087107005988753, "text": "Goddamn... that looks like the end of the world. Can't even imagine the horror those people are going through. 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:19:39", "owner": "vagabond_viagens_aventura", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18494827273075262, "text": "Praying ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:19:26", "owner": "sls_properties", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133546627484997, "text": "This is why I’ll never live in a high rise 😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:19:01", "owner": "juliepevetophotography", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120840769526849, "text": "❤️🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:19:00", "owner": "pannonica", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852119686543166, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:18:44", "owner": "analeimig_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925560148035357, "text": "We extend our condolences to Hong Kong. It’s clear how difficult this is. We hope that no such disasters happen in our world again. 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:18:41", "owner": "azerbaijanplaces", "likes": 159}, {"id": 18185500882346400, "text": "First photo I would say it was AI it's so incredible  that's an amazing capture", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:18:24", "owner": "jamespatrickcooperphotography", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887049862393745, "text": "GOD HELP PLS", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:18:23", "owner": "khacherian.lena", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088134196989585, "text": "Oh my god 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:18:19", "owner": "fabrice_adamant", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18395823067135760, "text": "😮😮😮😮😮😮😮😮😮😮😮😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:18:09", "owner": "jairodutra_designer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120877708535582, "text": "🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:18:09", "owner": "khacherian.lena", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902075260317197, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:17:51", "owner": "maricuais", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331601299242287, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:17:42", "owner": "charlay28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061123019215844, "text": "😢🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:17:37", "owner": "estefaniafun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969387981979160, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:17:23", "owner": "xiaocheng_yin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094876783894860, "text": "News photo of the year?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:17:11", "owner": "john_mulligan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907790701264667, "text": "Horrifying and terrifying. Those poor occupants of those buildings. 💔❤️💔❤️💔❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:16:41", "owner": "ollie_the_big_red_prince", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084811826099526, "text": "You, the one that is reading this in your mind, do we all forgot our purpose on this planet ?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:16:37", "owner": "juandavidcruiz888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086316616823860, "text": "My goodness 😥💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:16:05", "owner": "nikki_v98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063180308191525, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:15:57", "owner": "kennywangyz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086132197973692, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:15:52", "owner": "poshkai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047952065674458, "text": "Más aún pérdidas humanas 🙁", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:15:51", "owner": "mayraramirezec", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18316408948222330, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:15:36", "owner": "l.a.orley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112065394586593, "text": "Kudos to the photographers who captured this terribly tragic event.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:15:36", "owner": "chill.vibes.only.pls", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943649938077997, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:15:29", "owner": "pphhhhe_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094267603859070, "text": "🙏😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:15:19", "owner": "moederlin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067258256112573, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:15:07", "owner": "raffinhamartinss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098057950761648, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:15:01", "owner": "calidoscopioo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908892307125507, "text": "Dios mío 🤐 estas noticias 🙁", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:14:35", "owner": "mayraramirezec", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154702756416648, "text": "😭💔😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:14:23", "owner": "annskellyartstudio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918975820335094, "text": "🙏🏾🙏🏾🙏🏾", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:14:22", "owner": "wesleygirl767", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061132070227486, "text": "Oh no! Prayers up for Hong Kong 🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:14:15", "owner": "9luzelena", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901304842305907, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:14:12", "owner": "nche17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099345415698311, "text": "😭Praying for HK", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:14:09", "owner": "aprildmm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18292260376279179, "text": "There's beauty in destruction", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:14:05", "owner": "nobodybutkingsley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980365482775759, "text": "My god, i think this was AI, God help this people", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:13:52", "owner": "josedelfrodz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934813897111557, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:13:38", "owner": "millennialpr0ph3t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085372313068315, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:13:35", "owner": "marcoramot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857635447559890, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:13:21", "owner": "guardiobosco_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910577806255802, "text": "🙏😢pray for them", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:13:19", "owner": "emiko26b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084842240483101, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:12:40", "owner": "karin_elisabeth_steenberg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18150195613426470, "text": "Nice music, what is it called?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:12:34", "owner": "ghost_of_alain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979585965933682, "text": "💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:12:27", "owner": "supriyadahal1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990498939736171, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:12:25", "owner": "austinacri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121182433538248, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:12:16", "owner": "yulia.dovan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033902057527566, "text": "God bless😿", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:12:16", "owner": "iutung18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937678243070135, "text": "9/11 is a joke", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:12:14", "owner": "adityanursalimm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091452737306814, "text": "How awful and heartbreaking. Thoughts are with everyone impacted.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:11:55", "owner": "sosarahsays", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922894348050184, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:11:55", "owner": "lindogozo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086502866488305, "text": "😭🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:11:40", "owner": "naira_99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046667693438611, "text": "God help and bless Hongkong 🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:11:38", "owner": "nimrodusz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542837758008718, "text": "Tragic!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:11:27", "owner": "lianaflash", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071390978362928, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:11:26", "owner": "pagecf55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103646932647506, "text": "😢💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:11:18", "owner": "junyarts", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18300966274258643, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:11:10", "owner": "alexandravancampenhout", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185217562349827, "text": "😢 dantesco…🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:11:06", "owner": "dearteymodel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074873621260680, "text": "Pullitzer", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:11:01", "owner": "joaobutuem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544653139014535, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:10:36", "owner": "j.sterrrs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095037448876708, "text": "OMG 😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:10:31", "owner": "carrilho.renata", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003607565826346, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:10:26", "owner": "thebigbroooo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18244664053289695, "te