094, "text": "This is heartbreaking 💔 my best goes out to all these families 🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:08:16", "owner": "cdcrguadron", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102264646734883, "text": "😢very sad I hope everyone was ok", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:08:12", "owner": "wallstreetnetworks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087566591055095, "text": "🙏🏿🙏🏿🙏🏿", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:08:08", "owner": "maxjustice24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865056532513900, "text": "😔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:07:40", "owner": "claritabonitata", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320027521223636, "text": "Oh my 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:07:36", "owner": "imanigrace_music", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18430100095105253, "text": "Muy triste", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:07:28", "owner": "enatrueba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006016697663184, "text": "Aw, this is heartbreaking! 💔 God bless everyone who has been affected! 🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:07:26", "owner": "_x.ag.x_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056897630305820, "text": "The first photo. Omg. :(((", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:07:14", "owner": "jamycarvalho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104366497659658, "text": "Oh so horrible! This is heartbreaking to see", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:07:01", "owner": "hollymac4.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037124792720850, "text": "Prayers to Hong Kong 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:06:43", "owner": "sydniblifestyle", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17929811778117504, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:06:41", "owner": "cesairejulie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084882665045276, "text": "Horrific.  Blessings", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:06:21", "owner": "janebrain108", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974761062958075, "text": "😮😮😮😮😮 wow", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:06:20", "owner": "mandoo4lovee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024936653589266, "text": "公公婆婆辛辛苦苦努力大半世只希望老年有個安樂窩 最後因為官員的疏忽 家沒了 人可能都沒了", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:06:10", "owner": "jacksonyee___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080257865323252, "text": "Praying for everyone and those lost 