55071728938, "text": "Praying 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:44:09", "owner": "crazy_min_min", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855228013524311, "text": "The first picture is about a man whose wife is trapped inside the apartment. Does anyone know if she was rescued?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:43:54", "owner": "awnzzn._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955229620032966, "text": "Oh no :((((", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:43:44", "owner": "morsetlis", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17918432400219661, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:43:20", "owner": "ghost.intheshell", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17951840361023557, "text": "Esto es horrible, pobre gente 💔💔💔💔💔😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:43:14", "owner": "cutucampbell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098144695805746, "text": "😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:43:08", "owner": "fernanda.pepe23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074572253216968, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:43:06", "owner": "blinda_tian", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063723638616259, "text": "😰😰😰😰 I thought it was an Ai Photo ... So sad", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:42:50", "owner": "esther_fkb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068185376614383, "text": "Bamboo scaffolding still standing", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:42:41", "owner": "hellofromtp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867598753483035, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:42:41", "owner": "ferathus", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18060146189243699, "text": "That’s so very sad!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:42:35", "owner": "bearfood72", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17965151826004608, "text": "Sending prayer 🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:42:28", "owner": "talkingtohazel", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17849329665599560, "text": "This is beyond terrible 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:42:04", "owner": "charlesianchun", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18101881198736199, "text": "My condolences to those who lost their loved ones", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:41:55", "owner": "pooria.nur", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18072927296198088, "text": "Prayers to Hong Kong 💔", "created_at": "2