onjikong72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847246861587657, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:31:32", "owner": "fattythebear", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134200267484010, "text": "The first photo is going to win awards. My gosh.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:31:30", "owner": "novelllasss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068818121098820, "text": "😟💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:31:28", "owner": "jankojcz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366550117086746, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:31:08", "owner": "justcallme_andres", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091930972732172, "text": "🙏🏻🙏🏻To Hong Kong", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:30:47", "owner": "kevinkulnis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082142402323124, "text": "wow. so tragic. so much emotion captured in that first photo…", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:30:32", "owner": "cacicacecco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117723601489531, "text": "🙏🏾🙏🏾🙏🏾😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:30:21", "owner": "a.t.williams_author", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127752304442968, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:30:19", "owner": "rohassonm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060754226549807, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:30:05", "owner": "jdelpeche", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101563315778310, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:29:52", "owner": "cian_clouds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083519384019668, "text": "the first one 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:29:43", "owner": "raph.apy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065066939387391, "text": "horrific 💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:29:39", "owner": "somthng_wild", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981368064926604, "text": "And guess what , the building didn’t collapse", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:29:27", "owner": "julien.travelnjoy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963369807853016, "text": "CCP don’t care 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:29:24", "owner": "sohnny_dele25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18422794588116458, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:29:19", "owner": "yanarabrenna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863803510530392, "text": "Tuhi Niran