38762, "text": "Que triste 😢!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:27:28", "owner": "fafacandeias", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086697487955398, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:27:24", "owner": "shrutika.prajapati.jayakar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086439817818638, "text": "Sending prayers 🙏🏻💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:27:23", "owner": "serpentineinteriors", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063304931562032, "text": "so terrible😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:27:08", "owner": "beingbonny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065100893428210, "text": "Devastador", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:26:49", "owner": "pamolawalter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066414647607615, "text": "😢😢😢🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:26:46", "owner": "gemserret", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18297814531260242, "text": "😢🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:26:39", "owner": "13rita13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902509663317958, "text": "All the photos show so much pain", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:26:30", "owner": "yoni_iphone_photography", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18083784667843527, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:26:25", "owner": "olgakondratyeva27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863620243531151, "text": "Lord, have mercy. 🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:25:45", "owner": "joyforthewin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109639591548103, "text": "❤️‍🩹", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:25:35", "owner": "valerie.teh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070734164366245, "text": "🥺🥺😭🙏🏼😭sending all my condolences", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:25:35", "owner": "vivianbebelee", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18117659311492718, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:25:31", "owner": "otakuchan.em", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062686868209220, "text": "I am filled with sorrow...🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:25:16", "owner": "ryo_fujisawa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893701771362532, "text": "😢 oh dear", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:25:16", "owner": "prisramoni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078533024268567, "text": "God rest all of the souls that have perished", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:25:09", "owner": "2gshk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125740312507546, "text": "🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:24:58", "owner": "cwisayoungdumb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851398951555032, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:24:56", "owner": "marianavercesi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087957307963105, "text": "That first photo rocked me.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:24:54", "owner": "floodzones", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17881233684422693, "text": "Povera gente 😞💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:24:44", "owner": "melaniagastaldi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058047119643631, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:24:38", "owner": "mellbuchi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366152596095233, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:24:36", "owner": "luciagideon72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085945964068181, "text": "Cladding again, like Grenfell ?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:24:35", "owner": "stefan_bxl1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18180377371360306, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:24:25", "owner": "jcshurburtt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18297048199285187, "text": "Devastating 😔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:24:21", "owner": "stefi.ifets", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061681436214172, "text": "so sad 😢 God be with them", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:24:14", "owner": "larissabvenancio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030900512535322, "text": "🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:23:58", "owner": "ccheya_l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865814341508115, "text": "🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:23:55", "owner": "el_perezidente415", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545521597060490, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:23:35", "owner": "amanihas03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854496274575823, "text": "This is horrific! I pray for those families🙏🏽😔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:23:26", "owner": "bleujax", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108654385530777, "text": "🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:23:12", "owner": "_sim_simmer_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099064819831482, "text": "Heartbreaking 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:23:07", "owner": "mensahp007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304096894268638, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:23:04", "owner": "daddylongleggy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929855452016604, "text": "加油香港", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:23:03", "owner": "andrealmeida_", "likes": 229}, {"id": 18087948577785558, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:23:00", "owner": "imnotchiseung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064710158156387, "text": "This was on the way to Shenzhen ...I remeber these I think. So sad", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:22:56", "owner": "thebigforkers", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18342216055227756, "text": "💔 😢🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:22:53", "owner": "alfaholm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104695315645330, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:22:46", "owner": "yosefaraneta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073157300037169, "text": "Worst thing to happen to one of the best city with the loveliest people. Im so sorry.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:22:28", "owner": "vicfoulad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055482017645989, "text": "This is a terrible tragedy. If anything I do helps I send them light and love from my heart ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:22:19", "owner": "cuckootree", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059665538248986, "text": "Not one building collapsed that day.\n\n Hoping everyone got out safely", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:21:55", "owner": "hampergnome", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18536890195040745, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:21:46", "owner": "rockstarragu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18271109032303089, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:21:45", "owner": "roooqueee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144033580443710, "text": "OMG !! 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:21:44", "owner": "djbrennoferrari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863694478520047, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:21:44", "owner": "silaes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083725586060695, "text": "When in doubt, blame Trump.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:20:54", "owner": "better_calll_al", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028691054570350, "text": "Lord have mercy 🙏🏿🙏🏿", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:20:50", "owner": "bloh22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115694743571332, "text": "So, they didn't collapse? 👀", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:20:35", "owner": "jonnaylorart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959154888880805, "text": "🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:20:32", "owner": "maricarmen3168", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129843616497519, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:20:06", "owner": "karinlundmark", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050092202374151, "text": "I’m stuck on “at least 13 people” meaning there could be more😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:19:33", "owner": "kieshelleny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094719646896483, "text": "Sending prayers 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:19:30", "owner": "ramindersohal_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918065035211387, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:19:16", "owner": "shannon_hagen_fitnessandstuff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193496485337405, "text": "Horrible. The people, their pets, their homes 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:19:11", "owner": "amberperley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022240910788808, "text": "😥😥", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:19:00", "owner": "talita.sarmento", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087972019968162, "text": "Heartbreaking 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:18:59", "owner": "nepperness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128950954499747, "text": "Heartbreaking and so very tragic with the loss of lives. Condolences to their loved ones and may those souls rest in peace.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:18:47", "owner": "marimarkcabel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119929606549582, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:18:44", "owner": "wuyuren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069187202524994, "text": "🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:18:34", "owner": "reign_of_tara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112263067524351, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:18:29", "owner": "nwandobartley", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17896768419204810, "text": "🙏🏼 prayers", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:18:23", "owner": "flying_pigga", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17949716120921162, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:18:22", "owner": "larisa.zaripova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063265823536548, "text": "😢 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:17:51", "owner": "sleepdrunk_one", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133963318490993, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:17:43", "owner": "marlolambertibobb_semple", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067092821377061, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:17:43", "owner": "jenkelton33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113068105589135, "text": "🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:17:25", "owner": "septemblur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888413899262431, "text": "die rise", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:16:59", "owner": "some.1.important", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18335201983225067, "text": "🙏🏽🙏🏽🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:16:30", "owner": "kahsone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987292857746974, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:16:30", "owner": "deirdred1970", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075549823982554, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:16:26", "owner": "justingarascia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540349627062477, "text": "Que tristeza 😢😢🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:16:09", "owner": "fervecchi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070855085360774, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:15:57", "owner": "calamityjoy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18430419433129605, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:15:56", "owner": "almore18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082692962043214, "text": "So heartbreaking.  Sending prayers 🙏 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:15:56", "owner": "ingridv305", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057653657304092, "text": "Heartbreaking is an understatement", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:15:43", "owner": "xinyuw_0707", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859772038551455, "text": "😞😞😞😞😞😞 o Gott", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:15:42", "owner": "sashkaproject", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930269890078162, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:15:25", "owner": "cedricvendeix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079295948178247, "text": "Awful", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:15:07", "owner": "dsdevos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301697074251732, "text": "Several buildings at once?? 😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:14:58", "owner": "kaya_moments", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338887222227358, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:14:52", "owner": "clever_north_wind", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058616597641358, "text": "Is everyone safe?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:14:48", "owner": "yii_8510", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858723883492578, "text": "@ednorman14", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:14:46", "owner": "cpnorman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080252333137380, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:14:37", "owner": "rachelnguyen141191", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18250741153295971, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:14:25", "owner": "s1utzone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866982226487346, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:14:24", "owner": "ivanashutter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113266411602798, "text": "😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:14:19", "owner": "pascal_jvr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128372434501672, "text": "En la primera foto demuestras sin palabra lo que perdió 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:14:17", "owner": "emontilv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075144731264987, "text": "@milnlwn @meigirl123", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:14:14", "owner": "tracygetsyouhome", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005320280670527, "text": "Something so beautiful can be so destructive. Hoping everyone is safe! ❤️‍🩹", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:13:39", "owner": "esrasevi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993434655852435, "text": "🙏🏼🙏🏼🙏🏼🙏🏼🙏🏼sending prayers 😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:13:16", "owner": "celia_matos_rod", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986021379881784, "text": "Probably a cladding problem. Call out the manufacturers", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:13:16", "owner": "sugarbutterrrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078474530468274, "text": "sad how some don’t know to believe whether or not this is a man mourning the loss of his entire life. his family’s lives, his neighbors and friends lives. just because there is a powerful reaction and framed photo doesn’t make this ai", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:12:51", "owner": "w_engelhardt430", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112530232608411, "text": "❤️😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:12:49", "owner": "cecilelihui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854731525575157, "text": "Wow 🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:12:40", "owner": "cfonsri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913499341236667, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:12:25", "owner": "soycappi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069037019080681, "text": "Heartbreaking", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:12:21", "owner": "allie_la", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041991428687447, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:12:17", "owner": "lilylee8533", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087803467988557, "text": "God bless everyone who’s involved. 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:12:03", "owner": "thebronzevoyager", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003892562819213, "text": "In Ukraine, houses are burning every day, and the Chinese Communist Party is also involved.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:12:01", "owner": "zakharstg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978712521927534, "text": "No way 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:11:59", "owner": "thelmafelissatavarez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18424002778112566, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:11:44", "owner": "thumbandcat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944519346949153, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:11:43", "owner": "0_ays_6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024649193591432, "text": "Thoughts and prayers \nTo the city of 852 (power)", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:11:22", "owner": "dandy.kandy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18536850808037781, "text": "@alejandrofernando_numerologo", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:10:51", "owner": "bookworm_chica_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126213712519568, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:10:42", "owner": "lisaradennyc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087418402978303, "text": "I hope that’s Cambodia or any scammer area", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:10:42", "owner": "sophia32299", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864149920516582, "text": "blessing💔❤️‍🩹", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:10:24", "owner": "vanssday", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062395673537592, "text": "Wow usually fire started in one location and spread. This one felt like it was everywhere and there was no fire suppression. As if the place was fire hazard. But I have zero facts to back this up. This base in my assumption on the pictures alone.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:10:10", "owner": "hans.purwa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876430405442371, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:09:56", "owner": "imiwenona___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882222487306463, "text": "Hope everyone is safe 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:09:51", "owner": "vantheyh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030290579550208, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:08:56", "owner": "pancha.a.rayas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18314005333216853, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:08:55", "owner": "yurayurakatie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099576916767848, "text": "This building looks like what happened at Grenfell Tower in London. Very sad and should not go up in flames like this.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:08:44", "owner": "natteepattee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063301844183542, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:08:33", "owner": "indulgenteats", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17842309011629743, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:08:33", "owner": "steffivws", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17927326668159531, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:08:14", "owner": "modernhuman_yepy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18407080471187908, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:07:59", "owner": "monicaliaoooo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925303441175870, "text": "😞🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:07:50", "owner": "sq625", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864028270518559, "text": "😢💔❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:07:50", "owner": "natalazakharova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087269716983769, "text": "Watching your home and neighbors go down in flames is just horrifying… love and healing to all those affected ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:07:47", "owner": "lexixhicks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074775656264221, "text": "Rest in peace to the deceased. Solidarity with their families. Support to all rescue teams and firefighters.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:07:42", "owner": "denisgayet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079055081157718, "text": "Oh 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:07:31", "owner": "dudu_lsaac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063059828528858, "text": "😢😢🙏🏽🙏🏽🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:07:19", "owner": "brooklynchic1968", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933426253107533, "text": "Prayers", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:07:19", "owner": "ladytoria100", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092508676917862, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:07:16", "owner": "meikoclh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060720080235072, "text": "😪💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:06:43", "owner": "pali.pilar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320677681174922, "text": "🙏🏾", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:06:30", "owner": "axelcrunch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085540496061048, "text": "😢🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:06:29", "owner": "l.gex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081427406327535, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:06:27", "owner": "chrizlu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048908321407510, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:06:25", "owner": "deehighness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081680717165275, "text": "🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:06:22", "owner": "ym.t_owl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087077857814706, "text": "Wow thats absolutely heartbreaking 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:06:16", "owner": "angeladarlin84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18381130735146533, "text": "Hope all people can be safe", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:06:13", "owner": "jimmychen_061031", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087118228804907, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:05:58", "owner": "mecky11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888407962264485, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:05:48", "owner": "gkwoktaro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079015766142723, "text": "😢🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:05:36", "owner": "enolac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18180275059357542, "text": "GODZILLA!!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:05:20", "owner": "gettin_free", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063108095623762, "text": "🙏🏻💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:05:07", "owner": "kristelnnch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904990687274963, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:05:04", "owner": "o_mega_fo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850136074598598, "text": "Oh no 😔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:04:29", "owner": "nancymprentice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120650914533609, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:04:12", "owner": "lolapics04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992688675855877, "text": "Rest in peace!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:04:03", "owner": "wilberto_maldonado", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889935430384953, "text": "A tragedy 😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:03:50", "owner": "sandra.and.the.cat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18552102079049732, "text": "😔❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:03:38", "owner": "keyofamyjor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18344969515207291, "text": "Oh My God! 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:03:35", "owner": "isabellapearce", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852636538589129, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:03:25", "owner": "chrismiele37", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931439611132875, "text": "💔💔 I’m so sorry, Hong Kong.  Sending prayers to your people and your beautiful city. 🙏🏼🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:03:14", "owner": "lalalauraruth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952810399048160, "text": "💔 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:03:13", "owner": "ukkir5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080437055176513, "text": "Oh my gosh💜💜💜🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:03:05", "owner": "dodgersblazersandsafekidsgirl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18326592865246896, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:03:04", "owner": "carina_selem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067277252110174, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:02:58", "owner": "mike.ai.happy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111833944597257, "text": "@aaronparnas @attorneycrump", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:02:48", "owner": "the_birmingham_leprechaun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958073746001518, "text": "Heartbreaking 😢 \n🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:02:29", "owner": "pame2kids", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906337798278018, "text": "geez :/ i have goosebumps this is so sad", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:02:23", "owner": "_roxanamoh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18275335969303015, "text": "No 😞", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:02:19", "owner": "shanasa.s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085248842059178, "text": "May God bless the 2000 families affected, keep everyone safe (including the firefighters) safe 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:02:11", "owner": "karenky__ss", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18399094462127066, "text": "I hope they change the rules to not allowed bamboo anymore in constructions site. 😔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:01:51", "owner": "aluizio_ol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916620937227731, "text": "Sin palabras , pero tristeza y que impotencia siento 😞", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:01:48", "owner": "marumedinahollmann", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18054826988648875, "text": "Just heartbreaking.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:01:47", "owner": "rwrotniak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109025728534625, "text": "🥲🥲🇭🇰🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:01:39", "owner": "ttimeline_hk", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068947943089433, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:00:58", "owner": "giuditta_morandi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046458653443189, "text": "OMG! 🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:00:48", "owner": "doctor_davian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098849422746313, "text": "So sad! Praying for HK!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:00:45", "owner": "1ninjanu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950522485050779, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:00:36", "owner": "lunadesantelmo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938888443098285, "text": "How did all those buildings catch fire", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:00:22", "owner": "mxlbxrry_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096542788836064, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:00:18", "owner": "annanilssonvartiainen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103489852679983, "text": "💔 so heartbreaking 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:00:13", "owner": "evelyn8827", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048571007409811, "text": "Im sure their govt will make sure they are taken care of.  No left or right, red or blue.  They really be about their people over there!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:00:02", "owner": "rcsdos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889969702383551, "text": "Wow that looks terrible", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:59:58", "owner": "maria__troi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928451476118996, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:59:56", "owner": "vahnehssah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986560380749805, "text": "This is heartbreaking 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:59:55", "owner": "marionanais", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083377072855538, "text": "Pray .. for more survivors..", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:59:54", "owner": "dektoslifestyle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049036697690306, "text": "How did the whole site burn down?😳", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:59:50", "owner": "metoz91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331882096209354, "text": "My prayers and best thoughts 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:59:38", "owner": "alessandravbusato", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965918340994783, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:59:27", "owner": "izatyler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969391689825709, "text": "I wonder if the bamboo scaffolding contributes to the blaze spreading to adj. buildings.\nPrayers to Hong Kong", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:59:16", "owner": "jmarsitect___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868284850480648, "text": "So much loss.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:59:11", "owner": "emotf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322815796169689, "text": "Lived in Hong Kong for 4 years. This is heartbreaking. Bamboo scaffolding? I always found it odd that welding equipment and power tools were often in close proximity to a material that is relatively flammable.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:58:53", "owner": "velo.guy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908793394126516, "text": "🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:58:46", "owner": "amy900323", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120069844557983, "text": "Wow ;( why didn’t they use those firefighter drones ?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:58:42", "owner": "sully.man7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923631139082122, "text": "Omg that is horrible 😢 praying for Hong Kong and it's people. 🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:58:30", "owner": "missjoubertdesigns", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096701446660858, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:58:25", "owner": "jarno.london", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147487282379548, "text": "No sprinkler system?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:58:20", "owner": "kabbysview", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18167531620379874, "text": "It feels like we always have these massive fires around this time of year. Be safe yall.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:58:14", "owner": "johnmichael_nyc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876719215350300, "text": "Horrible", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:58:11", "owner": "argritar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047269625440768, "text": "Praying for HongKong🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:57:45", "owner": "lynette.luo100", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952116601047290, "text": "Oh no :(", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:57:38", "owner": "soulfully_snatched", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904732315296846, "text": "😢🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:57:35", "owner": "aermersta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045113804686298, "text": "Oh God protect the people 🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:57:29", "owner": "zedalexa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915746956229694, "text": "wow the first photo .. sending love and recovery to the ppl of Hong Kong …this is so scary 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:57:29", "owner": "khamiiiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182112691358566, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:57:27", "owner": "alane_oficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864276439517611, "text": "Oh god so awful!!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:57:12", "owner": "karentaladvisoryrequired", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18385638265198760, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:57:04", "owner": "nalotwesha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842078677632259, "text": "Omg what a horrific tragedy", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:57:02", "owner": "carlyflowr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094476484871865, "text": "Sending prayers 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:57:01", "owner": "inbalsolomon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050881934380777, "text": "Wow", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:56:59", "owner": "joykd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087509414485526, "text": "@nelkboys", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:56:47", "owner": "juliannn_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911943214249447, "text": "TERRIFYING", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:56:40", "owner": "nogracias333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900130501180343, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:56:16", "owner": "loliza.grislain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935289751123961, "text": "High density 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:56:13", "owner": "lulu_is_fabulous", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066025811569505, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:56:08", "owner": "jb.0611", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17986318016753014, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:56:05", "owner": "madtaylor", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18062573696441984, "text": "Heartbteaking 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:55:33", "owner": "bengi.sozucetin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084632183289664, "text": "I hope everyone there strength to survive the fire and its consequences 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:55:29", "owner": "aika.winter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070512002368395, "text": "This photo should win an award.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:55:16", "owner": "ida_hateforutono", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087787709489116, "text": "Omg😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:55:10", "owner": "faye7_the_lightworker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18496778506074316, "text": "Dear God 🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:55:03", "owner": "sandeep_iamnow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087585490797144, "text": "😔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:55:02", "owner": "clairesyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061927670536635, "text": "😮😮😮😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:54:43", "owner": "humanoonline", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120039019480015, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:54:33", "owner": "eatingalonediaries", "likes": 36}, {"id": 18549436045026221, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:54:27", "owner": "_____sarah.e____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083583059318993, "text": "❤️‍🩹", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:54:27", "owner": "rabethged", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119347495535478, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:54:26", "owner": "loy_niel5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293268151286642, "text": "😢😞❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:54:23", "owner": "professoramarialva", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17957994521881734, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:54:17", "owner": "nellahernandez15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873944413451566, "text": "May the fire be put out soon 🙏 prayers for Hong Kong", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:54:02", "owner": "ferline.wen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353578081167825, "text": "🤯", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:53:55", "owner": "pollyschambers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164248339390616, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:53:49", "owner": "barnbarnet1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120687016468285, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:53:42", "owner": "teresainglesoficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048771563412334, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:53:41", "owner": "kublingmalay", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18050181518386995, "text": "Unimaginable. The horror they suffered is simply unimaginable.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:53:33", "owner": "jamieosygus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067281080568818, "text": "🥹❤️‍🩹", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:53:30", "owner": "chexy.__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069564701526801, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:53:24", "owner": "dudarosinioficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108538675616052, "text": "我的天怎么都传到纽约了", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:53:19", "owner": "jennyhe0413", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17987162312877422, "text": "They are in my prayers. May God comfort everyone's hearts!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:53:17", "owner": "im_sunshine148", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063698906185333, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:53:13", "owner": "almarosales11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060718604215176, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:53:13", "owner": "adrimelo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901718917314517, "text": "How sad 😮", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:53:12", "owner": "choney469", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126265900507909, "text": "Hong Kong stay strong 😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:53:08", "owner": "anirosei", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18120052090530897, "text": "Holy sh*t that first photo", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:53:04", "owner": "kaddyshak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061923086201793, "text": "😢 That’s awful news.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:53:04", "owner": "ajaxblackjack", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980713053925429, "text": "🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:52:59", "owner": "cat.nyc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18330853285209763, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:52:51", "owner": "alexalexandralexandra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18245166034294305, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:52:49", "owner": "moreme52", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900273364337681, "text": "Horrible", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:52:45", "owner": "marga.theelen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979151733945568, "text": "This looks like AI. I don't know what is real anymore 💀", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:52:43", "owner": "geminiv31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979695816782455, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:52:34", "owner": "alcantarais", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079514990174348, "text": "This photo is heartbreaking. You can feel the despair in his expression, and knowing how precious a home is for people in Hong Kong makes the scene even more painful to watch.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:52:32", "owner": "gamgammut", "likes": 7393}, {"id": 18050612252379519, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:52:32", "owner": "chingtcdeb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948964276059274, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:52:26", "owner": "aldhysosu23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366136549084434, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:52:24", "owner": "mamajoy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958447264010312, "text": "so sorry - ❤️ thinking and sending love to the people", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:52:19", "owner": "lototele", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17864911212510081, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭 this frightens me!!! So sad for the loss of life!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:52:17", "owner": "sonzd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035293193519155, "text": "So heartbreaking! What a nightmare for everyone!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:52:00", "owner": "eliseamour_art", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084609635480650, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:51:54", "owner": "the.little.gem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882282913306354, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:51:51", "owner": "itsokaytobe_tay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890662942380793, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:51:42", "owner": "mariapaskim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193090210332667, "text": "That first photo definitely looks like AI", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:51:37", "owner": "jmoskovic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105658996575057, "text": "This is so heartbreaking. Sending my deepest condolences. 😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:51:36", "owner": "kristenblush", "likes": 21}, {"id": 17932683014999998, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:51:31", "owner": "mariovillanuevastyle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852752245589309, "text": "Lord 🤯", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:51:26", "owner": "paecano1219", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18354017005161095, "text": "Ugh, how devastating 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:51:16", "owner": "courkyowelle13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331255645242371, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:51:04", "owner": "unapezeta22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048885914426520, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:51:02", "owner": "presuffix", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058445243282829, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:50:55", "owner": "carolbywu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901261558326748, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:50:45", "owner": "ddddddiiiddd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095790691890307, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:50:36", "owner": "fancybakes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868014622415095, "text": "This is so awful 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:50:30", "owner": "rebeccamaureen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099074629753937, "text": "Prayers🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:50:29", "owner": "giovannibachu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003819233673174, "text": "CARALHO", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:50:24", "owner": "aruaemsp", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17949103713060150, "text": "The first photo 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:50:16", "owner": "hananshahid22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095852308847332, "text": "Meu Deus parece IA 😮😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:50:02", "owner": "juliaoddone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989728734913253, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:50:01", "owner": "alicelo623", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087080800991110, "text": "Misericórdia,  que tristeza 😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:49:47", "owner": "rubensalves81", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012937826636597, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:49:44", "owner": "mkitkatj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074747252219340, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:49:43", "owner": "adrixrosa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954600601013826, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:49:43", "owner": "wkmin__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104463133656779, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:49:28", "owner": "victoriaemoya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065192021157157, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:49:28", "owner": "rodrigoteixeirabtu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063731432439336, "text": "🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:49:28", "owner": "vickisellsnova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061355771213360, "text": "It’s like Grenfell Tower in London in 2017", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:49:21", "owner": "fjodo_ra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087054509067052, "text": "Heartbreaking", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:49:19", "owner": "amel.oukili", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950304454026425, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:49:16", "owner": "juan_simon_montealegre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085075265004369, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:49:15", "owner": "lenochka_forever", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18372406507156323, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:49:02", "owner": "chynakaii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089978080925114, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:49:00", "owner": "patsunderhus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102795622679389, "text": "This is heartbreaking", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:48:59", "owner": "hashalisha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953618269019345, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:48:57", "owner": "karlvansteerteghem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352297795162403, "text": "Misericórdia 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:48:55", "owner": "beatrizabgm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933922918108879, "text": "😢😢😢 what a tragedy", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:48:53", "owner": "newjaredcity", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18297469612257869, "text": "I don’t even have words. Prayers that the fire fighters are able to rescue as many people as possible. My heart breaks for those caught in these buildings, waiting to be rescued. 🙏 ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:48:38", "owner": "acoplin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085888082001010, "text": "Firstly, deepest condolences to the families who have lost loved ones. It's also a miracle, looking at the photos, that dozens more people weren't killed. For comparison, we sadly lost 72 people in London when Grenfell happened in 2017.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:48:23", "owner": "blaynos14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860539456477876, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:48:22", "owner": "cindyhuang_06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120866077526503, "text": "Tragedy 😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:48:17", "owner": "christinaleehk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978596466929443, "text": "sending prayers 🙏🏻 never under estimate how destructive a cigarette butt is. many residents believe this was caused by workers in the building smoking. which has been one of the leading causes in building fires in Hong Kong lately!!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:48:14", "owner": "_____hsuc", "likes": 163}, {"id": 18419989540114877, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:48:13", "owner": "lilysstein", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084863552094008, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:48:13", "owner": "slay_la_vieeee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926750281170991, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:48:01", "owner": "_lisang_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070374302366399, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔🙏🏾", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:47:55", "owner": "vanheessees", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117420577492235, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:47:37", "owner": "chidanand_gurpur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084394232019679, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:47:25", "owner": "helloprince", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873506182452889, "text": "Que tristeza.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:47:24", "owner": "volpi.vanessa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869520976470596, "text": "@therealshannonlee @wren.lee.keasler @brucelee can you please update ME 😇with your safety and please call your Mother right now …Wren ..You Too …Please and Thank You 🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:47:19", "owner": "euphoriamourning99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867860128482744, "text": "They make so horrific a scene; our hearts and prayers go out to the wonderful people of Hong Kong whose lives have been brutally and tragically upended by the inferno!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:47:18", "owner": "johnbk1029", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091612096933044, "text": "Terrifying 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:47:08", "owner": "miriammichelley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967071147837501, "text": "😭😭😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:47:05", "owner": "marcia_manzo64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039149147709920, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:47:03", "owner": "chelseachoy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849911359565479, "text": "Keep you in my prayers 🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:47:01", "owner": "bambiepen5678", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18146100697435691, "text": "🙏🏾🙏🏾🙏🏾", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:46:56", "owner": "heyquels_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119289262557751, "text": "remarkable if so few people die or get injured in such a horrific catastrophe.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:46:54", "owner": "oldmasterdrawingsworld", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193084570330860, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:46:52", "owner": "jsdxtr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991719372902964, "text": "🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:46:45", "owner": "lenis_jannil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856635814512058, "text": "😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:46:41", "owner": "izabellacardozof", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928344748149524, "text": "Wow! Que foto! 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:46:38", "owner": "legemignani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980402436779627, "text": "💔💔😔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:46:16", "owner": "sarahstenzel", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086374855955254, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:46:14", "owner": "azeemax", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18189435373344799, "text": "OMG what a drama and terrible situation for those people living at the higher floors🙈 🤞🤞", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:46:13", "owner": "ingridbortels", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320705833168530, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:46:10", "owner": "gnibmohisynned", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983439066764005, "text": "Horror..", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:46:08", "owner": "helenespaghettc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046167140453622, "text": "مادام الحرامي بيتباهى بالسرقة والتعدي والتطاول يبقى يدفع التمن من حياته وفلوسه والعربيات اللي فرحانين بيها تعديات ووقاحة", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:45:54", "owner": "abeermedhat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054145244652262, "text": "Las mascotas🥺💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:45:42", "owner": "italucho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081827279035255, "text": "pray for HK", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:45:38", "owner": "willhuang17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119936926536878, "text": "This is heartbreaking and devastating. I am also hoping this isn’t AI because this is an incredible photo that is so powerful; it’s award-worthy. My heart aches for all the deceased. Cannot imagine the pain and terror. 🙏🙏😢😢😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:45:37", "owner": "isabellabodnar17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007368002654926, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:45:35", "owner": "_lovejenna_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083894105046225, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:45:31", "owner": "funda_tuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078694838134290, "text": "🙏🏾", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:45:31", "owner": "bobbyceezy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103705690673984, "text": "😮😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:45:14", "owner": "dora.bonifacio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864395065524568, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:44:58", "owner": "cen_sitian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18401397493192670, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:44:53", "owner": "duodo_dian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135947986466270, "text": "Heartbreaking tragedy. My thoughts are with the victims, their families, and everyone affected. Deep respect to the firefighters and rescue teams risking their lives in such devastating conditions.🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:44:48", "owner": "thaissalvi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376249117159382, "text": "يعني تقلوا ايديكوا أكتر على الوقح بتاع دلوقتي لأنه بجح أكتر و مفيش عندهم لا استطلاع ولا حماية ولا أي سبب لكل الوقاحة و البلطجة والتعدي غير عقوبات مش حيعرفوا يعالجوها حتى", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:44:46", "owner": "abeermedhat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887126716400694, "text": "This is terrible. May the folks who passed away RIP.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:44:36", "owner": "alebutton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076830332245695, "text": "Sigma males", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:44:33", "owner": "andres_leal20", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18305132590255772, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:44:29", "owner": "mara.lyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18413688922139590, "text": "@sociallightdetroit", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:44:21", "owner": "amalynstyle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103990648645098, "text": "😢😮", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:44:21", "owner": "thallie13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18364473238095393, "text": "The fire is still on. Prayers to the people and the city🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:44:13", "owner": "antonialee1202", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916294573231586, "text": "How horrific and heartbreaking.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:44:11", "owner": "taaatersalad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963758934852980, "text": "🙏🏽♥️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:44:06", "owner": "author_enehjeannie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926077519160602, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:44:03", "owner": "veritocastrito", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078543772902680, "text": "💔❤️‍🩹", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:43:56", "owner": "kutschulu_mutschulu___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086669317995517, "text": "Stay safe... Sending my prayers for people there 🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:43:44", "owner": "1616vip1616", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918021295208209, "text": "Omg 😢 really bad 🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:43:34", "owner": "xenia_ghn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321834559169885, "text": "🌍🇺🇦🙏❤️‍🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:43:32", "owner": "__eva__masya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944925400064380, "text": "❤️‍🩹", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:43:10", "owner": "youfrances", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060782261241523, "text": "تأكيدا على أن سكوتي العن من الكلام وأنها ليست مجال يجيبوا عربيات وحرامية أكتر ولكن السكوت يعني عقوبات ورد العن وأقوى ماشافوش زيه قبل كده ولا حيشوفوا", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:43:06", "owner": "abeermedhat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171275629372601, "text": "OMG, i hope nobody injured😢🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:43:01", "owner": "selenkoradbirkiye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18371442643156553, "text": "Scary the age of media we are in. Pics like the first one accessible to the masses by the swipe of a finger.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:42:57", "owner": "finnfs__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176225530366384, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:42:55", "owner": "vanhall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18308501992301719, "text": "What a photo!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:42:49", "owner": "meldcole", "likes": 252}, {"id": 18055147877651961, "text": "💔🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:42:48", "owner": "yardieangel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18294499252274651, "text": "That’s terrible…", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:42:27", "owner": "love.lovette", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969603570982321, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:42:26", "owner": "vaq67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864959104522493, "text": "horror", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:42:14", "owner": "bonnyvondolores", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303796951253523, "text": "يعني تدمير حياة الحرامي النجس اللي واقف دلوقتي حتبقى العن من اللي قبله", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:41:52", "owner": "abeermedhat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108773398615410, "text": "It is heartbreaking that such a tragedy has occurred in such a wonderful city. I truly hope there will be no more losses. For anyone who has lived in 852 knows that its a very special place. I spent seven unforgettable years there and I hope from now on we will only hear good news 🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:41:49", "owner": "ebrubusra", "likes": 210}, {"id": 18366058624089203, "text": "💚", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:41:45", "owner": "sam_shervington", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989460579883654, "text": "bless Hong Kong", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:41:41", "owner": "mavischu.hahaha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085765651838663, "text": "🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:41:40", "owner": "ninsdingle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122431018543355, "text": "🩵🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:41:37", "owner": "ms_pearl_grey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087245161990367, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:41:33", "owner": "gabrielamouraopsicologia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085035503003930, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:41:30", "owner": "diotimia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074247752519107, "text": "😔💔 rest in peace", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:41:15", "owner": "othatsravyn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087050806976112, "text": "hope for miracle come", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:40:55", "owner": "homanko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048087131426510, "text": "Omg this is horrible 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:40:54", "owner": "shaeladeeva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078790013150311, "text": "Sending prayers to the Palestinians among them.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:40:46", "owner": "jegers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992650779723257, "text": "Please Dear Lord helps us. We just want your mercy and bless. All is gone, nothing left to lose 💔😔😔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:40:46", "owner": "an_mohammadbilal", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18415710262116547, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:40:38", "owner": "pilottmann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081049709145585, "text": "Very sad ...", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:40:32", "owner": "ticomachadoo", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17948231850062612, "text": "pray❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:40:16", "owner": "oliviaolala", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962003016859050, "text": "Praying for Hong Kong", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:40:08", "owner": "stylesclash___", "likes": 31}, {"id": 17964868575004098, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:39:59", "owner": "lisbethtem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985027485916846, "text": "This is terrible", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:39:57", "owner": "_kkp_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087454711787740, "text": "Heart breaking 💔 😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:39:55", "owner": "eva.ma_ma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087547288793093, "text": "One of them was a firefighter 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:39:52", "owner": "zhousvelle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111811831520536, "text": "May all safe and well😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:39:49", "owner": "miss_taurus16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968186337989109, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:39:45", "owner": "cristinaregodequeiroz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955416754022121, "text": "according to some residents, the fire alarm did not ring!💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:39:45", "owner": "mynameishinsonchan", "likes": 1447}, {"id": 17864183175523439, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:39:41", "owner": "dekotlames", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058815854275405, "text": "😢 lamento por todas essas pessoas e seus familiares..", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:39:39", "owner": "marlagfreitas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965976421004647, "text": "Ko bs segede itu si apinya?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:39:34", "owner": "yun.w_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047326784439098, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:39:30", "owner": "yvnianmein", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146181217428957, "text": "So sad. Heart breaking for so many. 🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:39:29", "owner": "saltythistle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082262189143625, "text": "Heartbreaking 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:39:23", "owner": "cam.adams.8", "likes": 16}, {"id": 18097467667772750, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:39:12", "owner": "themovementhub412", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092851192898574, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:39:12", "owner": "dr.____amaterasu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081868781112930, "text": "So heartbreaking😢 praying for those who effected❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:39:12", "owner": "akis_widyastanto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160286584398769, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:39:11", "owner": "hat_aydeger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852157744545194, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:39:11", "owner": "sawkyawsoemoe08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988025265910195, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:39:08", "owner": "sandra_gunman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143727163452817, "text": "Sending prayers 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:39:04", "owner": "msjennynyc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098765686694213, "text": "😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:38:50", "owner": "selmasouzaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064994951154721, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:38:48", "owner": "iankhtai", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18001693322829136, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:38:47", "owner": "lalachachabk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092921047904689, "text": "😢 May God help them ! And bring all the evil people to jail! Corruption may be at play here…", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:38:42", "owner": "ducililio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915452866085811, "text": "😢hope the fire stops asap. It’s sad. RIP for the deaths and praying for people of the buildings and the firefighters", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:38:33", "owner": "gorfiti_samedi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376029316158347, "text": "Interesting that it was on fire but never imploded on itself 🤔 🧐 very interesting indeed….", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:38:28", "owner": "matthewmindset", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097055788873488, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:38:19", "owner": "_tung1in_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852753073584840, "text": "Misericórdia.  Deus conforte todas familiares", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:38:16", "owner": "warleyslopes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090147968305426, "text": "That first photo my goodness it’s so powerful", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:38:08", "owner": "sarahjreports", "likes": 12391}, {"id": 18315774742300179, "text": "What a tragedy. These buildings are designed to trap fires, but this spread to several buildings?!", "created_