ais domésticos tbm morreram? São vidas tbm", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:31:49", "owner": "mariana_ssil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975601596952086, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:31:42", "owner": "luserra69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884797996407270, "text": "😢💔💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:31:41", "owner": "milastad1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094934638862371, "text": "Que horror... 😱😞🤍", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:31:34", "owner": "4ruivos_1mae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081434507030328, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:31:26", "owner": "yaelmenezzes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164395390382389, "text": "Sending prayers 🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:31:13", "owner": "thetanyamitra", "likes": 430}, {"id": 17916753492210807, "text": "💐", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:31:13", "owner": "nomt1971m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099868228690219, "text": "Dont smoke in the construction site..", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:31:08", "owner": "mill0606mill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977220621954887, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:31:05", "owner": "cesar_casier", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18127255456447308, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:31:01", "owner": "ozlem.ercan.3975", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086204107817317, "text": "😢🤧🤧😢🤧😢🤧😢🤧😢🤧😢🤧😢🤧😢🤧😢🤧😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:31:00", "owner": "ulugbek_yuldashev_777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910474429266528, "text": "🫂🫂🫂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:30:56", "owner": "fermented_food.in.ua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086670728483990, "text": "May god help them.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:30:55", "owner": "iamlapaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006664196663400, "text": "Very sad, so may people’s everything in there. 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:30:52", "owner": "saxon.n.smith", "likes": 120}, {"id": 18070540352584418, "text": "He was shouting “ why didn’t the alarm go off ? No alarm, residents did not know about the fire.”", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:30:40", "owner": "ck.redwood", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094527235895693, "text": "Praying for those effected in 852 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:30:39", "owner": "elizabethdartprivate", "likes": 38}, {"id": 18064964774395160, "text": "Terrible 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:30:32", "owner": "iamsatimikaelyan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112953151579495, "text": "🥹🥹🥹🥹", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:30:22", "owner": "andycamposcosme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078901361329883, "text": "Chatttss❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:30:09", "owner": "soniyax1211", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003654956674002, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:30:09", "owner": "filliperodrigues_o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915965062215306, "text": "An incredible photograph.  Heart wrenching.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:29:53", "owner": "dodger2829_", "likes": 3123}, {"id": 18104790616638450, "text": "🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:29:45", "owner": "geossie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934321567103935, "text": "Such powerful photo, prayers 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:29:39", "owner": "sajidshaikhphotos", "likes": 100}, {"id": 18546300202033969, "text": "I don’t know now if it is ai or not.", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:29:35", "owner": "federico_baron", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18353012989161876, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:29:28", "owner": "fafapenni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074498984193025, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:29:19", "owner": "c.fargo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976315170955979, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:29:12", "owner": "marga_olivieri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087630568994996, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:28:54", "owner": "fahlconsultor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857852881558516, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:28:50", "owner": "luis.filipe.gomes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18169383700340113, "text": "Sad 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:28:41", "owner": "ira_dos_anjos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079195112132532, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:28:40", "owner": "moat