{"media_id": 3749691292898233644, "shortcode": "DQJlF06kw0s", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DQJlF06kw0s/", "taken_at": "2025-10-23T11:18:07", "caption": "【英國政府提交香港半年報告書 1 January - 30 June 2025】\n\n英國政府今天公佈最新一期提交國會的 #香港半年報告書 ，內容述及由2025年1月至6月期間 #香港 的發展情況。\n\n以下短片簡介報告書的背景，以及 #英國 撰寫報告書的原因。\n\nThe UK Government has published its latest Six-Monthly Report on #HongKong, covering the period 1 January to 30 June 2025 .  Find out more about #sixmonthlyreports and why the #UK produces them in the video shared and in Cantonese.\n\n在此閱覽香港半年報告書：\nRead the #sixmonthlyreport here: \nhttp://www.gov.uk/government/collections/six-monthly-reports-on-hong-kong)", "owner_username": "ukinhk", "owner_id": "45202726209", "likes": 113, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0135_DQJlF06kw0s\\DQJlF06kw0s_20251023_111807.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": "18096954562685049", "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-10-23T11:42:28", "owner": "sio_un", "likes": 1}, {"id": "17994715676697253", "text": "🥲", "created_at": "2025-10-23T11:36:45", "owner": "ryantaotw", "likes": 1}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["香港半年報告書", "香港", "英國", "hongkong", "sixmonthlyreports", "uk", "sixmonthlyreport"]},
{"media_id": 3775080985844077866, "shortcode": "DRjyCfHkVUq", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRjyCfHkVUq/", "taken_at": "2025-11-27T11:59:04", "caption": "💥 Introducing a new student-led design challenge for 2026! \n\nToday, we’re launching the AMplify Impact Challenge - a collaboration between @ewb_uk and @additive_manufacturing_uk.\n\nRunning from late January - early April, this team-based competition invites university students across the UK to explore how additive manufacturing and 3D printing can shape a better tomorrow - through bold design, sustainable thinking, and real-world prototyping.\n\nIn April, the top teams will pitch their concepts at the Grand Final at MACH 2026, NEC Birmingham, with the chance to work alongside industry mentors to develop working prototypes. 🏆\n\nHead to link in bio for all the information, and to register your place.\n\nℹ️ Open to all year groups. No prior additive manufacturing experience required!", "owner_username": "ewb_uk", "owner_id": "3108685188", "likes": 31, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphSidecar", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0136_DRjyCfHkVUq\\DRjyCfHkVUq_20251127_115904_1.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0136_DRjyCfHkVUq\\DRjyCfHkVUq_20251127_115904_2.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0136_DRjyCfHkVUq\\DRjyCfHkVUq_20251127_115904_3.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0136_DRjyCfHkVUq\\DRjyCfHkVUq_20251127_115904_4.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0136_DRjyCfHkVUq\\DRjyCfHkVUq_20251127_115904_5.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0136_DRjyCfHkVUq\\DRjyCfHkVUq_20251127_115904_6.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0136_DRjyCfHkVUq\\DRjyCfHkVUq_20251127_115904_7.jpg"}], "comments": [], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3766591060479679054, "shortcode": "DRFnpz-DZpOinhbNQK2urzdjdQ0Y3PcZSr2aYc0", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRFnpz-DZpOinhbNQK2urzdjdQ0Y3PcZSr2aYc0/", "taken_at": "2025-11-15T18:51:08", "caption": "", "owner_username": "lailaagreensmith", "owner_id": "5909670581", "likes": 14, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphImage", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0137_DRFnpz-DZpOinhbNQK2urzdjdQ0Y3PcZSr2aYc0\\DRFnpz-DZpOinhbNQK2urzdjdQ0Y3PcZSr2aYc0_20251115_185108.jpg"}], "comments": [], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3774727082803895575, "shortcode": "DRihkhOkp0X", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRihkhOkp0X/", "taken_at": "2025-11-27T00:16:59", "caption": "wang fuk court fire 8:00am local time still burning", "owner_username": "austinwonderland", "owner_id": "205198321", "likes": 350958, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0138_DRihkhOkp0X\\DRihkhOkp0X_20251127_001659.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18543682162029380, "text": "See for yourself how many bamboo survived the fire intacted before blaming the bamboos for spreading the fire and 'metal is the better choice.'", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:24:30", "owner": "fobjai", "likes": 2600}, {"id": 17876177934441847, "text": "too crazy - sending prayers to hk 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:42:07", "owner": "konaction", "likes": 211}, {"id": 18113176237585076, "text": "一人でも多くの方が助かりますように🙏被害に遭われた方が1日でも早く平穏な日常を取り戻せますように🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:52:50", "owner": "tyttai.bro", "likes": 415}, {"id": 18101071657742873, "text": "TBH, I dun think those bildg are suitable to live again in future 😢😢😢😢 RIP to all ppl n fireman who lost their lives 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:10:06", "owner": "ryanlee1223", "likes": 338}, {"id": 17984060138760578, "text": "天佑香港⋯", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:29:23", "owner": "ryan_black_444", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18073938167251591, "text": "Mcm mana orang dlm flat tu kan nak lari...xsempat 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:04:30", "owner": "ulek_beluncas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092572702928238, "text": "This is so sad. My heart breaks for Hong Kong", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:09:32", "owner": "soulmatefit", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17858618385556728, "text": "Condolences to the family that lost their loved ones and prayers for the victims that are injured, may they get well soon. 為香港祈禱 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:31:47", "owner": "hajzeee", "likes": 100}, {"id": 18094922923891610, "text": "😭😭💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:43:14", "owner": "melda_inmelda", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17980449173936977, "text": "Max height of the fire trucks is clearly not enough for these old high rises. Hopefully HK government learns from this.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:31:44", "owner": "ionlystayinniceplaces", "likes": 618}, {"id": 18094417636857874, "text": "日日喺大埔出入都會經過呢幾幢大廈，估唔到最近海景最需要水嗰陣，10號風球，同黑雨都冇嚟！希望世界真係有天使，保護緊嗰啲仲未搵到嘅人。", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:13:26", "owner": "ttkwhy", "likes": 796}, {"id": 18064806398168308, "text": "Damn", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:37:49", "owner": "leighellis", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18067406042379113, "text": "Heartbreaking", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:02:35", "owner": "yuki.ishikawa_hongkong2.0", "likes": 23}, {"id": 17978279780948652, "text": "Even to evacuate or doing searching after the fire is very very dangerous, keep safe firefighters 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:28:21", "owner": "carinnalesmana", "likes": 189}, {"id": 18081890767892462, "text": "😢😢😢devastating", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:21:12", "owner": "rikkolee", "likes": 42}, {"id": 17843759319621701, "text": "😢😢😢只能保佑那些伤者平安无事", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:57:31", "owner": "lqy_041010", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17932722777000347, "text": "That's how you know the Twin Towers was blew up from the bottom these are still standing", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:41:46", "owner": "walt.wells.399", "likes": 94}, {"id": 18123635134534100, "text": "Pray for hongkong😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:30:46", "owner": "neinaandin", "likes": 3560}, {"id": 17847276009587292, "text": "RIP", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:04:58", "owner": "linkin_113", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18085779527053944, "text": "香港福地風水在28年前被攪破", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:52:49", "owner": "buildingmlh", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17847593118587312, "text": "好難過心痛😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:17:01", "owner": "gnews5", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076272389264249, "text": "thoughts and prayers to all those affected", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:57:52", "owner": "stephenc911", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17915444964235426, "text": "票投 #民建聯 全家都玩完", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:13:46", "owner": "milky_poko_peko.jrt", "likes": 107}, {"id": 18120966100533134, "text": "一刻も早く 鎮火しますように🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:15:25", "owner": "tu_mi_ki1646", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18056590841636309, "text": "Where are those chinese drones. I see in some videos extunigishing the fire up on th3 floors. Call them now", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:30:11", "owner": "sp_0880", "likes": 46}, {"id": 18066903218614571, "text": "This is absolutely madness. 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:33:05", "owner": "karyn_goh", "likes": 97}, {"id": 18057227900316567, "text": "I hope whoever did this goes to jail. This is way too big for a household incident. To all of those lost in this deprived act.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:24:29", "owner": "moves_in_the_city", "likes": 13277}, {"id": 17904681144151155, "text": "为什么要用竹架子和易燃网？", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:39:44", "owner": "dexterhyz", "likes": 29}, {"id": 18049878536679668, "text": "My thoughts are with all those who have lost a loved one, with all those who have passed away. May strength and courage help you through these difficult times.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:10:02", "owner": "transminase", "likes": 5402}, {"id": 18058053212290686, "text": "Hey for your information thete is a ban on drones till sunday in the vicibity of wang fuk court  if you did not get an autorisation...", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:56:19", "owner": "lude_loman", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18014115944800127, "text": "😭怎麼會這樣 我心愛的香港", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:15:47", "owner": "sherry_chen_1013", "likes": 273}, {"id": 17936685563982677, "text": "Heart broken......", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:48:58", "owner": "poifull823", "likes": 16395}, {"id": 17851857381553562, "text": "The maintenance contractor remains suspended for using substandard materials. Alert 🚨 bamboo sticks are not the main cause of this fire", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:32:21", "owner": "chochosh_", "likes": 456}, {"id": 18093672562718631, "text": "There is my primary school, all my childhood memories😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:32:48", "owner": "yenniema", "likes": 2400}, {"id": 18019954499788647, "text": "Most of the scaffolding stays strong and intact. The external of the building looks fine after the fire with the help of the fire fighter. From my assessment, the safety netting is the main causes of the external fire. That is how all the surrounding buildings with safety netting catch the fire quickly. Concrete buildings do not burn at such a speed.  What you see into all the videos are the safety netting in flames. Battery charging is likely the main starting cause of the fire in today's situation. Too bad all the buildings with netting are being burnt. Not sure why some video with people screaming why no alarm or sprinkle system? The burnt buildings are all residential buildings!  Unless it is an exclusive private building for the affordable. Commercial and industrial buildings will most likely have it as it is required by the insurance company or governing authorities to have it.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:03:41", "owner": "tonychia2020", "likes": 108}, {"id": 18034344509733233, "text": "大樓悶燒很恐怖的", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:13:54", "owner": "florago8egg", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18048898220413917, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:39:19", "owner": "iyaramiranda", "likes": 23}, {"id": 18039445883509625, "text": "超心疼香港🇭🇰😭😭🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:53:12", "owner": "liusuwei4", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087695350958745, "text": "一人でも多くの命が無事であることを願っています。", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:22:07", "owner": "loser_rooster", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18088251034781546, "text": "Prayers & thoughts with the HKers in these difficult times 🙏🏻🙏🏻\nMassive respect to the firefighters 🧑‍🚒 - we salute you 🫶🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:43:10", "owner": "noel_menassa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086269324804229, "text": "逝者安息", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:08:47", "owner": "cevvenj1ng", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17864228928520457, "text": "1人でも多くの人の命が救われますように", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:24:12", "owner": "yuujitani0209", "likes": 332}, {"id": 18074692067520413, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:11:05", "owner": "risajcp", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17993346293891690, "text": "太可怕了😢在我记忆里国内第一次有这么大型的居民区火灾", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:05:17", "owner": "juyand_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17925647451173208, "text": "Crazy how these didn’t collapse like the ones from 9/11", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:21:05", "owner": "ninauhh__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17916140121219153, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:12:46", "owner": "itsthepeacocks", "likes": 21}, {"id": 17860766106476593, "text": "Love Hong Kong❤️🙏🙏🙏😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:13:29", "owner": "maverickchik", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17868608481474643, "text": "💔💔💔💔😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:34:15", "owner": "eunicejaymie", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18089851780752828, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:52:53", "owner": "sinderbellaa", "likes": 15}, {"id": 17864331831529165, "text": "God bless 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:34:35", "owner": "little.henry.me", "likes": 51}, {"id": 17847027711611210, "text": "I hope the people r ok 🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:34:24", "owner": "bellas._.blossom", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17846012481614385, "text": "希望死傷不要再增加了🥲太心痛了💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:49:29", "owner": "sweet.1025", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18550704226014638, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:13:14", "owner": "maverickchik", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17930600487138254, "text": "😶", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:54:21", "owner": "__itsjohnny", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18084067111843585, "text": "How did the buildings next to it catch fire?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:33:50", "owner": "nwtxmom", "likes": 471}, {"id": 17998036568844916, "text": "地球🌏が。。汚れた。\n地球が怒ってる。😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:18:59", "owner": "tomomitakano7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852276343543906, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:17:08", "owner": "yastria", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18090546773488676, "text": "被災者の方々の状況も気になりますが、本当にまだ救援を待ってる方がいるのなら早く見つかりますように🙏何でこんなに酷い火災になったのか、、、被害様の方のご冥福をお祈りします", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:37:59", "owner": "yoshiko365honey", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17906553963275830, "text": "我哋一齊加油香港🙏😭😭😢❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:12:46", "owner": "maverickchik", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17854890546576927, "text": "😭😢😢😢 我覺得好唔開心", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:08:52", "owner": "maverickchik", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18050539544377833, "text": "Oh My God, this reminds me so much of the grenfell tower. But this one on a larger scale😞😞", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:12:09", "owner": "rosanyc_", "likes": 302}, {"id": 18058713302281911, "text": "Heart broken Hong Kong disaster😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:47:24", "owner": "adilkhan__700", "likes": 189}, {"id": 18071011016076009, "text": "@machojoema @wf714 @enricafung  what happend in HK… so sad😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:45:10", "owner": "ehcho20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899490274338706, "text": "@anisaputri80796 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:15:38", "owner": "frez.tea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18167486992377315, "text": "Horrific. All the animals lost too 💔😓🐾", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:40:49", "owner": "deborah_von_brod_", "likes": 40}, {"id": 17915082456236009, "text": "但是我們是一家人，同胞，❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:31:16", "owner": "sinwendo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070981130347553, "text": "こんな火事あるの？ってとても衝撃的でした。行方不明者が多数いるとのこと。家族の安否がまだ分からない人が大勢います。胸が痛い。", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:53:47", "owner": "yu_suzu1972", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18375394774159314, "text": "これは本当にひどい火事。亡くなられた方々のご冥福を祈るとともに残された人たちが早く立ち直れますように…", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:11:56", "owner": "moonwalkermameko", "likes": 256}, {"id": 18087483331801351, "text": "願逝者安息🙏，傷者早日康復，一切平安", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:15:55", "owner": "chanshingtaipei", "likes": 194}, {"id": 18091724806932265, "text": "It breaks my heart to see this video 😭🙏願傷者平安、逝者安息。", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:40:55", "owner": "sallyxchris", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18543897796037044, "text": "チャイナ消防力の現状やな〜", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:00:19", "owner": "yoshishige1201", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18178690534368170, "text": "なにかできることはないかと考え大学のゼミのメンバーで千羽鶴を折って送ることにしました。\n被害に遭われた方の勇気や元気になればと思います。", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:02:26", "owner": "aska122279", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18136557364482447, "text": "5.000 people 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:53:17", "owner": "azerbaijanplaces", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18198887605325768, "text": "😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:33:58", "owner": "roxolianka_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17974155809957704, "text": "It’s so weird that these buildings burned for so long and nothing collapsed. How weird", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:17:16", "owner": "thekingofancient", "likes": 12}, {"id": 17844633489619450, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:16:10", "owner": "hinddiary22", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18545732104001299, "text": "And they tried to tell me two planes took down the twin towers and building 7z", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:25:57", "owner": "imfjz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17990569646888038, "text": "😮🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:54:04", "owner": "djchino", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18067928921616090, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:16:06", "owner": "__ace11", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18049343474392699, "text": "홍콩 힘내세요🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:43:44", "owner": "cnsal7754", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18547461871055324, "text": "😢🥺😮", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:44:31", "owner": "yaldamehryargmail.com1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18327041551244986, "text": "竹子鷹架還真的沒什麼燒…\n願逝者安息R.I.P.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:50:08", "owner": "shengda_wu007", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18384068902149487, "text": "Bamboo Scaff  what do you expect???", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:53:43", "owner": "awightfrankie", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18044496293651011, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:55:43", "owner": "_ffuurrkan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094997854881320, "text": "New construction?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:56:09", "owner": "akm_deen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079032677139538, "text": "Crazy how the steel beams didnt melt", "created_at": "2025-11-28T11:59:36", "owner": "bgrahn98", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17980084298928021, "text": "Completely burnt but not collapsed.  Why WTC collapsed?!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:05:59", "owner": "nebiliac79", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18304641874254998, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:07:34", "owner": "yayadickens", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17890026648383341, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:11:35", "owner": "leechan_1998", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066199937415102, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:13:08", "owner": "matrugliodomenic", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18011191565808035, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T12:13:17", "owner": "aayyushhhi_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084516623038192, "text": "這是失火了嗎", "created_at": "2025-12-13T04:44:05", "owner": "natka1902z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067979372527605, "text": "香港不是挺先进的 这么高咋不用直升机灭火", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:26:40", "owner": "rockyvip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845809684605390, "text": "天佑香港🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-07T07:56:28", "owner": "kny353__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109229332618292, "text": "Wife of Xi Jin Ping is the criminal who owns the company of the flammable green net", "created_at": "2025-12-07T07:24:48", "owner": "julian.hsiung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075367541351943, "text": "😭😭😭🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:17:50", "owner": "matayazi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18418718956141266, "text": "阴公咯", "created_at": "2025-12-06T05:44:37", "owner": "taoyu6433", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998645106841969, "text": "demolicion reconstrucion", "created_at": "2025-12-06T05:40:42", "owner": "gmiltoadonai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097042222667386, "text": "🥺😭😭😭😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-06T02:33:48", "owner": "estersantosoliveiraoliveira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092955391927238, "text": "Totally unacceptable!", "created_at": "2025-12-05T17:24:00", "owner": "chetboc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962156865862815, "text": "为什么要怪中国？真的很奇葩搞笑哎", "created_at": "2025-12-05T10:22:31", "owner": "lzm_7777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087206656952934, "text": "评论区以灾乱港", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:05:46", "owner": "zries.zxc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098002597655629, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-04T14:37:42", "owner": "jordekwan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916845538234327, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-04T11:51:52", "owner": "yee.man.1848", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032654705727534, "text": "🙏🙏🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-12-04T09:34:27", "owner": "ham.steroo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873936958452617, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-03T11:20:45", "owner": "l913785j", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001212902827771, "text": "Such a terrible tragedy!", "created_at": "2025-12-03T09:36:23", "owner": "jppsn3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965892159989863, "text": "💔💔😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-03T07:16:12", "owner": "sampoon7198", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043033145703389, "text": "pray🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-03T06:50:24", "owner": "rileypop70", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043616621701859, "text": "How can this happened?...looks like caged apartments..and 5 towers burning at the same time????😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-03T00:34:12", "owner": "will.phw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030013922756901, "text": "It literally just a trapped if burned from the bottom", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:53:32", "owner": "damnsonleowl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989146947883338, "text": "Just a cigarette and showed how vulnerable it was This disaster just waiting to be happened 🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:52:28", "owner": "damnsonleowl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105688549644206, "text": "下台", "created_at": "2025-12-02T12:29:13", "owner": "davidadu401", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058832267271818, "text": "💔😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T08:44:27", "owner": "racelynecleonel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065537168388527, "text": "墨西哥空海运专线，13434768212", "created_at": "2025-12-02T08:38:35", "owner": "wangting918", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047414975456090, "text": "網子都被燒的差不多了，竹子卻還好的？？", "created_at": "2025-12-02T06:52:13", "owner": "thousand_cheers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127893655446124, "text": "So horrific! 💔", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:36:24", "owner": "lizdolling", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165950785382804, "text": "愿平安🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:25:32", "owner": "akaryanhe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112198600593315, "text": "这是香港有史以来死伤最多的一次火灾🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:17:54", "owner": "chengwen19831018", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18549674905048873, "text": "令人心痛😭", "created_at": "2025-12-02T03:00:13", "owner": "smoothflow.3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863385418457386, "text": "千疮百孔，人神共愤。逝者安息，早日光明。", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:43:56", "owner": "jhtw999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079857158126765, "text": "😮😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-12-02T02:43:33", "owner": "bomberosargentinos_ok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086611024818958, "text": "🖤", "created_at": "2025-12-01T23:39:00", "owner": "jools746", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969662682826814, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:54:44", "owner": "eliphas_the_lnheritor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970216437971700, "text": "بازم که ترکوندی!!!!", "created_at": "2025-12-01T11:47:14", "owner": "_gole_yakh1990_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901178140325050, "text": "Dios mio protege a todos los que viven en alturas asi😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T11:25:54", "owner": "londine_england", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125848084514950, "text": "😮😮😮😮😮😮😮😮😮😮😮🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-01T06:41:50", "owner": "elena1980_32", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986518911870756, "text": "화재 원인이 모임?", "created_at": "2025-12-01T05:05:45", "owner": "kimsm12267", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104924152642735, "text": "🙏安息", "created_at": "2025-12-01T05:05:37", "owner": "jasmine_y07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945676300076891, "text": "😭😭😭💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:52:03", "owner": "andymettke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082425142888478, "text": "😢😢🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:57:46", "owner": "verdeciaromero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067601420112779, "text": "Why didn’t anybody mention the spray foam?", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:37:38", "owner": "jimmy_h2n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035692031518814, "text": "don't blame the bamboo", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:36:45", "owner": "carolliu2046", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132895378489784, "text": "RIP", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:34:02", "owner": "carolliu2046", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921791338195605, "text": "但願一切平安，保佑香港", "created_at": "2025-12-01T02:13:05", "owner": "wuyalin49", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919172446070612, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-12-01T01:40:01", "owner": "maxwoods2008", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902515039316454, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-30T21:55:03", "owner": "adrianpearson70", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102084112738065, "text": "Wow quite badly burn down . May miracles happen to all these people of their lost . Hope the govt. There will help their own citizens.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T21:34:31", "owner": "dotangie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897834949348253, "text": "💔😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-30T21:14:06", "owner": "miss_jingjingli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022016492604633, "text": "Behind the fire lie issues of corruption, Chinese migrant workers, and decolonization governance. Liberate Hong Kong, a revolution of our times!", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:33:34", "owner": "charlie0218a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953176441043785, "text": "香港加油❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:17:45", "owner": "edyzqvq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902933839167674, "text": "But the Koreaboos still wanted some stupid Kpop award show to go on🙄", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:50:45", "owner": "misterbadmoon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925593859175186, "text": "一党专制生大灾", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:12:19", "owner": "wangzhida9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074999402214997, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:57:29", "owner": "taiwansingaporeswagchoodai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046905773462060, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:35:21", "owner": "charliezeng123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077151908336788, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-30T16:01:49", "owner": "zzooounh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183203050355796, "text": "💔💔💔💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:48:56", "owner": "vickylau4791", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18326033347244800, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:43:07", "owner": "wangjiaqi5260", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058213439302086, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-30T14:03:16", "owner": "janetebihara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913087267252445, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:14:19", "owner": "chaosuper512", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18388258408179587, "text": "Bamboo should not be used.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T11:01:38", "owner": "yangyongxi5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092443546917811, "text": "🙏🙏🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-30T10:55:54", "owner": "jicky_jane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933256294110659, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-30T10:27:51", "owner": "_yoritop_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081337751153634, "text": "此时此刻我们放下一切争吵，已捐款希望可以帮助到香港朋友🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-30T10:02:59", "owner": "xxxsnaki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091920178917573, "text": "OMG !\nThis is in Hong Kong !!", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:21:10", "owner": "frances.lau.77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134458192479382, "text": "天佑香港🥺🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:07:03", "owner": "kiki__houg", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17958810842878308, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-30T07:02:14", "owner": "xingli8900", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101302789615481, "text": "🙏🙏祝愿", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:41:13", "owner": "chaowanxciyuan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899670991341521, "text": "节哀🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:37:15", "owner": "jm0327yy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18548109577050351, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:00:56", "owner": "anleypillay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066661025143432, "text": "Sincere condolences to all the affected and those who lost a loved one.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:29:17", "owner": "ujmi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862100557539437, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-30T05:19:41", "owner": "bluebearrrre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099267418818498, "text": "😭😭😭💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-30T04:48:13", "owner": "jade_wong_wong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969879120823509, "text": "Pitiful. Why reject shenzhen’s help", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:23:13", "owner": "bossadamofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872848789460819, "text": "水がもったいないだけ。", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:51:13", "owner": "s800jp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853348378585540, "text": "😢🙏🏾", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:13:33", "owner": "junniormattos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18536382280020051, "text": "心情很沉重🙏💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:02:55", "owner": "mawenhui99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872050570466806, "text": "哪里有捐款渠道", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:01:40", "owner": "namei999.520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059275553270930, "text": "Here we go again! So disgusting cold blooded!", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:48:44", "owner": "bieneke.t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096875698840090, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:29:14", "owner": "oorzhak.oksana.79", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929420581017666, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:27:15", "owner": "barthelmyjim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080599673329722, "text": "So sad 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:25:12", "owner": "hbifts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113558257590031, "text": "香港啲樓越起越高但係啲雲梯 救火又射唔到上高層 !", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:14:40", "owner": "monica.chungchuisim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064211513560894, "text": "🙏🙏🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:14:35", "owner": "amigobaby0930", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083291504471745, "text": "🙏🙏💔💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:13:47", "owner": "rbbaby7_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049438043667461, "text": "😭😭😭😭❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-29T20:39:00", "owner": "alis1450", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075649628263315, "text": "Dry, hardened bamboo is very flammable and can catch fire quickly, especially when exposed to a heat source. Also those green plastic nets are also a fire hazard", "created_at": "2025-11-29T20:33:05", "owner": "juul1973", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082860071106628, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T19:01:21", "owner": "semragunduz3838", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990622095910820, "text": "🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-29T18:14:44", "owner": "robert__puchalski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100475227793809, "text": "oh nooooo", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:55:24", "owner": "tracey.gee.whiz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171827221370090, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:49:12", "owner": "labeddave", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954699295031984, "text": "Oh my god 💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:33:04", "owner": "yingsiou_liao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996926568704506, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:27:31", "owner": "fammanggo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062360528213348, "text": "😢❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:25:26", "owner": "kenguy0704", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304476166250563, "text": "💔 horrible 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T17:14:02", "owner": "einav_ca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18319793107219224, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:41:12", "owner": "tuantruongthon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081433061113532, "text": "😢😢😭😭😭🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T16:26:23", "owner": "sophanithkimeng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963841360006363, "text": "Whats going on?? 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:56:37", "owner": "memo94403", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071191463375777, "text": "Thank you for documenting our city 🤍♥️", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:42:23", "owner": "uuendylau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981127581927202, "text": "是不是敌国的间谍在行动", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:40:13", "owner": "lo2101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872431291464205, "text": "Ии в деле,отлично", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:37:39", "owner": "andrian_viara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060786650551339, "text": "RIP", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:26:58", "owner": "jajung_kim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919736653067109, "text": "Pray for hong kong 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:26:27", "owner": "naluygnehz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878209297440203, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:16:49", "owner": "zhangky_gz96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855101935574407, "text": "This is just the worst imaginable thing to see . I pray for the safety of all who lived there and lessons will be learned regarding safety . It happens to many times , when will lessons be learnt . Makes me so sad and angry 😡", "created_at": "2025-11-29T15:14:42", "owner": "booboobecs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103907338639231, "text": "😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:46:25", "owner": "wjeq112", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064847051169386, "text": "😢🖤", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:13:38", "owner": "amantedelaluna.24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918262648212973, "text": "💔very sad to hear the news", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:12:32", "owner": "christine_ii18bb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134342179477730, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:54:15", "owner": "espirutu_1998", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298298251280817, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T13:29:31", "owner": "hdbbb620", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18246404866295014, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:48:24", "owner": "itsasmaa1_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988064046914000, "text": "Noooo😭😭😭😭😭💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:24:16", "owner": "mitra887766", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062651579213089, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:34:26", "owner": "twirwgql", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047678771443645, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:21:55", "owner": "eation_activewear", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071917547342588, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:18:32", "owner": "ynnam327", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901914673300456, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-29T11:09:30", "owner": "wanda_123768777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091567291919990, "text": "💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:58:01", "owner": "gao2734124430", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993299253903772, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭더이상 희생이 없어야 됩니다 ㅠㅠㅠ", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:40:26", "owner": "youngsun346", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842545570631620, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:36:51", "owner": "ray.hill.3954", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106607926724782, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:31:56", "owner": "wangjie22655", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912212842251373, "text": "祈祷去世和牺牲消防员默哀", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:24:21", "owner": "creating_joson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050626331671041, "text": "از ایران متاسفم😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:19:57", "owner": "nilo_beautyn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866539747506942, "text": "加油香港", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:15:50", "owner": "li945524", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100458040739875, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:14:21", "owner": "allencap520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078683026930556, "text": "I pray for the departed.", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:34:48", "owner": "zhangjing2605", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920357845203224, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:15:30", "owner": "eunn_aaaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028841474781013, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T08:00:20", "owner": "sundusty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041808704498554, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:38:16", "owner": "belinguierchristophe8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873698521452146, "text": "Heartbreaking 💔 god 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:34:46", "owner": "maya_dbon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383848918149581, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:25:53", "owner": "qianzhou_tc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057183104645176, "text": "🥺🥺🥺🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:23:40", "owner": "muxia1187", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083485691081973, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:44:40", "owner": "rickrodriguez507", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045128369480732, "text": "💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:42:54", "owner": "theblazingmonk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025462046777690, "text": "Tragic and sad. 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T06:07:56", "owner": "sara.c.crockett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900188863182515, "text": "Es un acto terrorista y estos casos están implicados un gran grupo de asesinos", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:55:26", "owner": "dovigaher", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085013333096254, "text": "愿一切安好🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:31:28", "owner": "danchaofan301", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18431874220111527, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:12:31", "owner": "angela.0620", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18537813628060872, "text": "💔🙏😭😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:59:46", "owner": "toni_colucci", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050288780676989, "text": "心痛😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:56:42", "owner": "mei_po_lui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087189994987403, "text": "Praying for all those affected 🙏 horrible incident", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:50:12", "owner": "xuboi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120064387554170, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:30:48", "owner": "_annaisme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871810585466480, "text": "本不该发生的，愿逝者安息。💔", "created_at": "2025-11-29T04:19:15", "owner": "nihangfei123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073225058199128, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:53:34", "owner": "c3hmyca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159071779397718, "text": "😭 💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:50:06", "owner": "v44ngel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991558392729027, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-29T03:33:45", "owner": "immarenaud", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102936175733142, "text": "中國🇭🇰下的香港，台灣國🇹🇼還想統一嗎", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:54:31", "owner": "wu942025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001723811683968, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:51:52", "owner": "kanaahn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072888842031735, "text": "心碎💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:32:03", "owner": "evaw333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063988442180890, "text": "How can the fire hose coz it's not enough water out our the fire", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:21:35", "owner": "angelawong167", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060146948262940, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:18:28", "owner": "tina.devita", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935991991100223, "text": "😭😭😭😭😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:18:07", "owner": "lolahon_5252", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933531313105527, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:59:51", "owner": "marie_dxb_1991", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857031475561262, "text": "Rip", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:56:37", "owner": "hannakabro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031609706741656, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:47:40", "owner": "shawnli7083", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842918995621508, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T01:07:26", "owner": "y_yman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994141059892876, "text": "🙏😢❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:50:29", "owner": "pattikawaandre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542917198059174, "text": "Kemarin aku ketemu sama ibuk\" jaga sayur di daerah Prambanan panik telfonin adeknya gabisa\", diangkat pun yg ngomong bukan adeknya...kalau ga salah namanya mbak Sri beliau di Hongkong sejak th 92 kalau saya ga salah dengar...semoga lekas dipertemukan dengan kk nya, kasihan 😢😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:36:35", "owner": "rintasari_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881329366422959, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:15:38", "owner": "_fionabrl_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084163670044915, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-29T00:15:09", "owner": "piliarmy13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856807312564304, "text": "ㅠㅠ🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:53:56", "owner": "r.m.r.m0000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18424229698118532, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:52:33", "owner": "mami.and.ruka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171902161371917, "text": "😢🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:48:21", "owner": "luis.qiang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104754892637844, "text": "😢😢😢😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:48:11", "owner": "aleksandr_ignahin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979541490781504, "text": "Blue🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:45:23", "owner": "hong0116zhao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067903232528976, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:34:07", "owner": "jilling29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882982330421619, "text": "Akibat rokok yang ini ya😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:19:13", "owner": "herycelaluceliyaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18410632534190026, "text": "Why i see that there were still working ?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:15:18", "owner": "starwarian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941003584095020, "text": "看了讓人好難過\n希望大家都平安", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:12:33", "owner": "chloebai0610", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870245551395481, "text": "Que terrible🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:12:23", "owner": "marilenaapolinario", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051408446341917, "text": "Any ideas or suggestions😮😮🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:09:06", "owner": "prettyfeetsandals23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142732150451972, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:59:50", "owner": "yammyjams__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062921057192824, "text": "Que tragedia tan triste .", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:59:19", "owner": "oferiahe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073930421023120, "text": "Сэкономить решили, пенопласта напихать, молодцы. А что, строителей не посадят? Они не виноваты?, просто приказы исполняли? Всем виновным в строительстве этих многоэтажных крематориев - смертная казнь.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:54:04", "owner": "vlada_schindler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064254302550936, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:52:21", "owner": "_hshiva_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080681036122256, "text": "😮😮😮😮😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:34:39", "owner": "irvanipourshademan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074350370255487, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:29:34", "owner": "annnessanerissa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994622664891271, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:29:26", "owner": "serenaz_leo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148117594430156, "text": "😢 que Deus conforte todas as famílias 🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:21:47", "owner": "juliermesonmorais", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026657354761855, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T22:07:17", "owner": "ale.schre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981082455927527, "text": "Coz of construction workers smoking, coz of DAB's corruption contract, coz of lack of governmental supervision, leads to over hundred innocent people died. Dame it!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:48:24", "owner": "platoman1987x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078951643937067, "text": "For the record all the bamboo still stands.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:42:41", "owner": "iammarcotam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987349332748023, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:31:31", "owner": "358hawk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304677208265314, "text": "Hongkong sollte seine Sicherheitsstandards mal überdenken", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:29:41", "owner": "and_re_b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088480820501076, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:24:05", "owner": "abhishek.raj965", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084327703856585, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:22:39", "owner": "marhianalondon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880085398325422, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:22:35", "owner": "hotspicytoronto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076611248254678, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:16:08", "owner": "jenn__sing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114549328581543, "text": "😭😭😭💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:13:44", "owner": "psycho_tante", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076089260189647, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:08:42", "owner": "audrey22529", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18163635952387107, "text": "My heart breaks looking at this...so much loss and pain. I pray for strength for all of you.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T21:03:18", "owner": "veenie69b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083900630104237, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:55:38", "owner": "detallesmagicos932", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925372855170222, "text": "🥺😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:54:08", "owner": "aaimakn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397192462127201, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:53:27", "owner": "purirodriguez64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055861823323559, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:50:34", "owner": "heikobloss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029284253557050, "text": "Schlimm", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:49:49", "owner": "danielabueb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18247215862290116, "text": "🙏💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:49:13", "owner": "kerrytzav", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165052138379920, "text": "🥺🥺🥺💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:48:21", "owner": "escapade__k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182160052359981, "text": "保佑", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:29:09", "owner": "drliu.hengjian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302464399266854, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:25:55", "owner": "yu_di9331", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18548969974020327, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:24:18", "owner": "alvin.chen.7564", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084281698866089, "text": "🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:23:45", "owner": "irinaliniva5560", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296023930260106, "text": "🕯️🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:11:18", "owner": "yiyiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18177116191372047, "text": "Con Ecofire Fighting se hubiera podido para sin ninguna duda la propagación del fuego 🔥! Inmediatamente! Pronto conocerán el poder de esta herramienta! Lamentable las pérdidas de vidas y materiales de todas esas familias 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:04:49", "owner": "innodef_argentina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056514287314712, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T20:00:24", "owner": "yc_ylxc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18200355187320526, "text": "好搞笑😂🤣😅", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:57:51", "owner": "liujinghui628", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18355394188165836, "text": "😭😭😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:50:51", "owner": "serioustraveller", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972802896976190, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:40:33", "owner": "ginnyboutin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18370720777085804, "text": "savez-vous combien de tours sont tombés à la suite d'un incendie dans toute l'histoire 3 et c'est le 11 septembre à méditer", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:38:11", "owner": "adantjeanluc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058423274288918, "text": "It's crazy how it burned for so long and didn't collapse into It's own footprint", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:33:17", "owner": "tailspin2070", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073203023352927, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:31:35", "owner": "jeannedeschatres", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852150199592026, "text": "I lived in a tall tower like that on floor 16 in college we had fire drills where we ran down stairs in middle of the night.  I was always afraid this would happen.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:31:03", "owner": "conniea.cannon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089523376931848, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:28:24", "owner": "hmdthyrkrdy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885128875285156, "text": "😢😢😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:28:03", "owner": "diani8133", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084876122087937, "text": "Mal mısınız o iskeleler nedir? Umarım yasaklarsınız artık", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:27:42", "owner": "uvbaskikartal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367393267089980, "text": "The old buildings design is bad, some are too compact and pose alot of hazards.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:12:34", "owner": "osprey.traveller.2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901251745320487, "text": "拜託老天爺下一場大雨", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:11:30", "owner": "ann1999.tw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18177874333364264, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:11:29", "owner": "richardvdpol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095235268874736, "text": "天祐香港💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:04:46", "owner": "kaikai._.0802", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079813793325819, "text": "Building doesn't fall....🧃🧃🧃🧃", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:02:16", "owner": "nflynn84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091134157929182, "text": "Jail???? Yeah I think it’s a little more serious than that…", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:02:10", "owner": "jptreeoflife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894413065359836, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T19:00:48", "owner": "__asenhorita__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153210583416251, "text": "🥺😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:53:41", "owner": "cheryldemartine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871064185470370, "text": "Why did they put a person who couldn't walk at top of building. Have they no brains in Hong Kong .", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:50:23", "owner": "rosecoffee123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033634547733771, "text": "💔😭wie in Gottes Namen können so viele Häuser brennen 🔥 🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:49:39", "owner": "burgaconrath", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18348049885206153, "text": "💔heartbreaking.  Horrifying all in the name of greed. And why were the workers allowed to smoke on the job anyway, on bamboo scaffolding, on top of the disgrace of using substandard materials & turning off the fire alarms. Many heads must roll😠", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:48:34", "owner": "angelaschanck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928443505150316, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:47:57", "owner": "norbert_frey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076704545262411, "text": "保佑同胞🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:43:51", "owner": "yuyuanavecmoi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072264965605841, "text": "🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:29:36", "owner": "sary000000000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112022245588067, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:24:00", "owner": "frida_zeyniyeva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082925339012594, "text": "Wang Fuk 😟", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:21:12", "owner": "loganridesagain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949774381061300, "text": "🥺🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:20:15", "owner": "mniskainat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543790402025429, "text": "💔🙏💔🙏💔🙏💔😢 I'm so very sorry for your losses 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:20:13", "owner": "ridingermiguel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108778201616654, "text": "وقتی پول مفت نفت ما رو میبری برای رشد کشور خودت", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:16:33", "owner": "fatanehnaseri091", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074469881244660, "text": "💔Absolutely devastating 😢 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:15:52", "owner": "pascaledavis2015", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18211316143310100, "text": "🙏🙏🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:09:40", "owner": "zhangxiaoli1017", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18348884797206693, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:09:17", "owner": "maryzhang480", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089435045494892, "text": "#BomdiaDF. #Brasília.\n.\nArranjas/céus não podem ter incêndios dessa magnitude. Se não existem sistemas inteligentes, que obrigados por meio de Lei Federal, possa combater qualquer princípio de incêndio em qualquer apartamento ou andar, e assim, evitar que hajam incêndios em todos os andares, qualquer edifício e até esse às alturas das nuvens precisar ser proibidos de serem construídos. Parecem mais máquinas de matar gente, pensadas por pessoas que odeiam a vida humana que tem a alma não-sodomita ou não-cristã ou não-esquerda.\n.\nTHE BLOOD OF JESUS REBUKE THE BAD.\n.\nTwitter: @elizeusantos.\n.\n#NoNazis. #Brasil 🇧🇷", "created_at": "2025-11-28T18:04:53", "owner": "elizeumsantos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858798886556967, "text": "Did someone set all three on fire?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:59:04", "owner": "gcandrdc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086503934498539, "text": "💔💔💔😢😢😢🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:53:45", "owner": "ioanasigrid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303196750251264, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:46:39", "owner": "melanieganter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093939394713557, "text": "💔💔💔😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:42:56", "owner": "mary4hue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894237901360039, "text": "This send me in tears. Am sorry for all the pain this has caused everyone. Sending prayers from my family to yours", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:37:45", "owner": "foreverthick34", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329468626245427, "text": "Impresionante 💔🥺. 🙏🏻 Toca orar por ellos 🤍", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:36:54", "owner": "panamarealtysolutions", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090138998493859, "text": "Well fuk :(", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:33:21", "owner": "zack_the_caz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891664198243215, "text": "Udah padam total ya apinya", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:30:00", "owner": "ahmag_katak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18422683369112231, "text": "Terrible!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:25:00", "owner": "louiseprefontainelarente", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353401606205658, "text": "Terribile 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:18:50", "owner": "tomassini.69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302891509284286, "text": "ATENTADO!!!! 💔👎", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:14:30", "owner": "nico.chaparro95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867811732483852, "text": "E adesso????💔💔🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:10:59", "owner": "lucylu4859", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320739340221423, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:06:23", "owner": "_pepper112", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046915292444662, "text": "I am just putting this out there. Obviously if you were to argue whether or not bamboo scaffolding contributed to the tragedy we see unfold 2 days ago, I agree that it is more likely to burn and be flammable than metal. But the point of flammability which, the bamboos that are used for Hong Kong bamboo scaffolding has been specially treated with substances, that heighten its extent of flammability so it is more durable and can withstand higher temperatures. SO here’s a multiple choice question: which of the following two is most likely to burn first? A) a specially treated bamboo which can withstand higher temperatures than ordinary bamboo or B) fking non-compliant illegal cheap use of fire protection mesh within the outer perimeters? *ding ding ding* you guessed it right. The fking outer area of mesh, so for anybody on here still writing with their pea-sized brain that bamboo scaffolding should be replaced by metal scaffolding, stick your head straight up your asses. Because, WITHIN THIS TRAGEDY, bamboo scaffolding is not the primary problem. It is the irresponsible construction company purposefully using cheap quality products while simultaneously performing maintenance and construction on 8 storeys of building being the main reason for this absolute horrendous tragedy.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:06:21", "owner": "d.p.l.t.s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072964022040892, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:04:52", "owner": "mariusemilius", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071442032599957, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:00:54", "owner": "yildizemanet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031618946723299, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:59:24", "owner": "regina.ho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086370440293466, "text": "OMG😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:57:03", "owner": "alexandramaitena", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064056227182586, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:51:40", "owner": "kaisapaakkari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874972180449408, "text": "Très étrange", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:50:58", "owner": "vinesnicoleelisabeth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930197119140858, "text": "God bless", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:46:59", "owner": "bellaana920", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109692034626600, "text": "Ooo😢 que tragedia cárcel para los culpables.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:46:39", "owner": "bellaana920", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911724292252645, "text": "希望大家都平安", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:46:09", "owner": "leevacen8_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18371959954086400, "text": "🥺🥺🥺🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:44:13", "owner": "bekberganovadilafruz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546275707044377, "text": "Good bless everyone impacted by this tragedy 🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:41:30", "owner": "justthyce", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058644062271037, "text": "Collapsed?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:39:56", "owner": "addicted2magnum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057871799291344, "text": "Devastating. I love Hong Kong and I am so desperately sorry for everyone affected by this. 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:27:54", "owner": "louisereznikova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049084817397103, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:27:54", "owner": "selectiverawhair", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952911553021408, "text": "😭my thoughts are with all those who have lost a loved one", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:27:09", "owner": "joyce__dm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985112910876279, "text": "😮😮😮😮😮😮😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:25:10", "owner": "zaira.kadieva.bagomedova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072391649056957, "text": "逝者安息🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:25:04", "owner": "a935111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113020570587259, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:24:41", "owner": "hookyuu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547798231050924, "text": "모두 무사하길 빌게요🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:21:26", "owner": "songhyeonjeong175", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066996662452611, "text": "今日路過見到，十分震撼的畫面", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:20:11", "owner": "scorpiofyc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924026788191095, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:12:30", "owner": "cinnycxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182377066356836, "text": "And obvious problem is that they are too close together and they should have had water storage that could help meet the initial demands", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:12:14", "owner": "pamhomeyer7734", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028113704773975, "text": "😢😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:11:58", "owner": "vpfoz.ca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094398664856219, "text": "Israel look what you caused hoes 🐺", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:10:32", "owner": "raynardo.mexico", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103898452710716, "text": "這一定是蓄意放火\n判重刑", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:09:48", "owner": "samlin650", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18424079662114858, "text": "Israel plus us all your problems with that fire blamed them for everything today and today must leave fuck them💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:09:32", "owner": "raynardo.mexico", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097506406793512, "text": "@teddy_334455", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:09:10", "owner": "mika_888m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009765176811358, "text": "China 🇨🇳 china 🇨🇳 china 🇨🇳 china 🇨🇳...", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:08:36", "owner": "chae1s2m3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924629767081241, "text": "I would blame all my problems on is real this morning and us 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:08:24", "owner": "raynardo.mexico", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921210049197869, "text": "Gara2 Rokok iki yaa?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:04:54", "owner": "wildannrosyadi_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17915985603236887, "text": "Unbelievable", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:04:11", "owner": "mattiemou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069042164613667, "text": "C国は今この瞬間から高層ビルの安全対策を見直した方がいいですよ。習近平も恥ずかしいでしょうから二度とこんな災害が起こらないようにしましょう。", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:03:59", "owner": "ishikawa_soutaro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000477155839593, "text": "This is so heartbreaking 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:02:56", "owner": "itsleonxl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878560762434177, "text": "Where are the drone operated hoses?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:02:55", "owner": "brady111150", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087119602807548, "text": "- لا يليق اليأس بأرواح المؤمنين\n𝒅𝒆𝒔𝒑𝒂𝒊𝒓 𝒅𝒐𝒆𝒔 𝒏𝒐𝒕 𝒔𝒖𝒊𝒕 𝒕𝒉𝒆 𝒔𝒐𝒖𝒍𝒔 𝒐𝒇 𝒃𝒆𝒍𝒊𝒆𝒗𝒆𝒓𝒔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:02:30", "owner": "jannat_l2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940890568090139, "text": "لنا في الله ظنٌ لا يخيب 🦋", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:02:28", "owner": "jannat_l2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18334542808236320, "text": "سبحان الله 💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:02:06", "owner": "jannat_l2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090184042935634, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:01:16", "owner": "catyjoly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18348994933203231, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:01:14", "owner": "wayyyjeeet_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083955143089648, "text": "Pray for hongkong 😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:00:52", "owner": "vv_chou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865955653503036, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:00:45", "owner": "maguiguite06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956187532011301, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T10:00:24", "owner": "chrislim1988", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087884291500178, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:57:29", "owner": "gldogruer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849332212600540, "text": "So sad to see all the people loosing loved ones and all the terror that the people fleeing their homes must have felt. My thoughts go out to all of them😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:55:36", "owner": "crawleynona", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912661462249007, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:54:21", "owner": "marijaurukalo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047774690426004, "text": "Whoever designed these towers has no mercy in his heart", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:53:16", "owner": "nosqalward", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036145334719043, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:52:52", "owner": "tolgaaltt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101359597705606, "text": "This morning i found the video shows a few contractor workers smoking before the fire 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:52:47", "owner": "vie_shini", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18061753229222030, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:52:34", "owner": "lioli_898", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18370324387087412, "text": "😭😭😭Pray for Hongkong 🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:51:30", "owner": "richieocao49", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086362672996318, "text": "日本から1日も早い復興を願ってます。", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:51:06", "owner": "oxourti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18212608168311864, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:48:08", "owner": "jeeminiiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994192845715510, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:47:53", "owner": "c1audia_975", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990224529889623, "text": "💔🥺😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:46:55", "owner": "silentsoul000x", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17954245380022346, "text": "😭💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:45:41", "owner": "kentskau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099368494692317, "text": "🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:45:26", "owner": "lucyand_7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18166426864382658, "text": "❤️❤️❤️🙏🙏天佑香港🇭🇰。逝者安息🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:43:21", "owner": "huangmiao82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18299767567281424, "text": "Worse than I thought.  But really bamboo being used.  Hong Kong 😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:42:29", "owner": "josefa19142", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095430106874922, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:42:09", "owner": "venetoladychef", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108995419721713, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:41:10", "owner": "vikarees", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082727795023235, "text": "Bamboo scaffolding ..", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:33:21", "owner": "gary.nicholls.902", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18386548411179203, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:32:36", "owner": "catherine.manuel.372", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079558892133085, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:30:49", "owner": "wingssiq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947220421058020, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:29:58", "owner": "iminzhanovadiln", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927210967156443, "text": "cigarete", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:29:37", "owner": "zn.hndr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082766632877848, "text": "ی کارگر دوزاری با ی نخ سیگار چی کرده پسر 😮", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:29:22", "owner": "yaserx6x6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867620257496867, "text": "What happened. How did it start?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:28:32", "owner": "miss.italia.39", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055618013321645, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:28:20", "owner": "msb.934", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090690241931399, "text": "세상에 ~~ 🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:26:58", "owner": "ja_smin7452", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082926646877384, "text": "God bless", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:26:37", "owner": "george_jiang17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989223597862986, "text": "なぜ？こんなに燃え広がったの？", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:26:36", "owner": "eneko.daisuki0303", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098478994832064, "text": "🙏🙏😔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:26:00", "owner": "hellapebble", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980600358930040, "text": "god bless HK!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:25:32", "owner": "norayue889", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112201807593045, "text": "😭😭😭💔🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:25:15", "owner": "ljiljana.piljevic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086746286052166, "text": "希望一切平安🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:23:18", "owner": "zho.upeng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18430180021129938, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:22:05", "owner": "jack_ye2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066583058529146, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:21:24", "owner": "supergayka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18192872443336803, "text": "🥲🇭🇰", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:20:29", "owner": "hossy.jpn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957192673012658, "text": "😢😢😔😔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:19:31", "owner": "shahin_asadi732", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091728280732221, "text": "Wang a fuk happend here", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:18:46", "owner": "justmiozz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974454783951120, "text": "真的好心痛🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:18:06", "owner": "liu.akira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947441469935702, "text": "How? 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:17:42", "owner": "strangerjanine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18247093723290892, "text": "There go the HOA fees", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:17:34", "owner": "solemanfineart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843568969624545, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:17:11", "owner": "hamid_bayesteh1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013068347800221, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:15:57", "owner": "adoboiiiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540195100036081, "text": "Were there any fire escapes or procedures in place?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:11:49", "owner": "badassnanna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986948238914024, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:11:43", "owner": "mary_van_thiel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097240765829627, "text": "So tragic.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:10:59", "owner": "michaelanthony1001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080571449152877, "text": "黒焦げやん虫华垃圾", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:10:04", "owner": "h3nrykr1s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925907527080408, "text": "I responsabili sono gia' in prigione ancora prima di spegnere l incendio del ponte morandi in italia ancora non abbiamo i colpevoli dopo 7 anni", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:09:10", "owner": "max_provasi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066988730125564, "text": "👎", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:08:18", "owner": "soul_whatttttttttttt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882481081311218, "text": "It was a ccp inside job", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:08:06", "owner": "moabdestroyer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109627153614877, "text": "32幾萬個點讚的人是不是有病啊？", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:08:05", "owner": "soul_whatttttttttttt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086296426821221, "text": "I don’t understand how it got to all those buildings when they aren’t that close together?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:05:44", "owner": "jennifer.linton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114313615575556, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:02:35", "owner": "zzz_bree", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925174777176415, "text": "Udud Mulu dah heran", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:01:51", "owner": "dani_jnd_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100468501685133, "text": "Did it collapse an pulverize into it's own footprint like 3 other buildings in history", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:01:50", "owner": "dannybreal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074556080586201, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:01:08", "owner": "matthewtatum4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950858776025430, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:00:53", "owner": "bela_ib", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18046245248686287, "text": "愿逝者安息🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:00:26", "owner": "david1721739", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976494027793258, "text": "Please talk about Yumenglong, the Chinese actor who was tortured and killed, guys, hashtag him #justiceforyumenglong#😢💔🙏 and so you can inform and sign his petition letter, search about him and you will understand, here is the link to the letter😢😭💔🙏https://shorturl.at/GbmZJ", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:00:08", "owner": "lili__rain__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860673931476273, "text": "justiceforyumenglong#😢💔🙏🐟", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:00:03", "owner": "lili__rain__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048469754426492, "text": "😢😢🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:59:49", "owner": "sonmezztolgaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077784311333567, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:59:22", "owner": "berna_cortez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086477548821326, "text": "😢😢😢comfort and love ❤️to the families 🙏 and the people of Hong Kong", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:59:06", "owner": "yankbliss_interiors", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18199804747325366, "text": "😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:58:42", "owner": "sunfunbody", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130106452494092, "text": "Devistating💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:57:47", "owner": "jules_1410", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086304487991410, "text": "😔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:57:20", "owner": "paperbackgnat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545609650062966, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:54:33", "owner": "mitzy4molly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115315636564087, "text": "Inferno 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:52:20", "owner": "jennifer_delauren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065792282576319, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:52:01", "owner": "ekyandria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078430046134705, "text": "One side of the world burns while the other side is drowning in floods.💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:51:00", "owner": "__reverieeee__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101849305666575, "text": "heart broken from Shenzhen 💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:49:56", "owner": "itsrokydesign", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18294993433275673, "text": "hear broken 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:49:40", "owner": "itsrokydesign", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979627245945604, "text": "💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:49:24", "owner": "susanne62_sc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087792643788602, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:49:18", "owner": "dt9470930", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951470323024791, "text": "God bless 🙏 🙌 ❤", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:49:02", "owner": "no1sercet_account", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18054462551656764, "text": "Wait, why has it not self imploded, isn't that how skyscrapers fall after burning?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:47:57", "owner": "sirkus6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065686637527387, "text": "😢💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:46:32", "owner": "ag_collomp_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18382784395180138, "text": "А можна було зробити верх труба для огнетушителья", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:45:27", "owner": "griga858", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974460609978352, "text": "點解唔可以一棟棟維修？點解要全部一起維修啊。好難過啊。香港加油。希望有奇蹟。", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:43:23", "owner": "isabel.yh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999753615837178, "text": "So so horrific & very sad 😢 \nRest In Peace to the souls lost and prayers for families. Terrible to see people suffering while their families trapped inside. 🙏💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:41:56", "owner": "mariagermano33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302206789266161, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:41:52", "owner": "emorianrix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081247589321057, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:41:29", "owner": "sevim_unal_ak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927476503152470, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:41:28", "owner": "feelsogoodfr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155358325411767, "text": "🤲🤲🤲", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:39:11", "owner": "vanessatiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911250772255935, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:38:38", "owner": "alsbebsi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116016328560541, "text": "🥺🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:38:16", "owner": "mariya_kirilova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056973458315824, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:37:53", "owner": "soleado1981", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074353361211198, "text": "💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:34:09", "owner": "irina.9.7303", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070536116074179, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:32:26", "owner": "larcencieljam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927292294160226, "text": "How the hell can 5 separate towers burn down at the same time? Arson for sure..", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:31:23", "owner": "annekpics", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090702841941133, "text": "這些偷工減料的商人真該死！希望法律一定要給這些受害者公道！", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:29:55", "owner": "thelittlegun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069369398078731, "text": "Dios mio", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:29:03", "owner": "pauladearj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302200537249300, "text": "🙏🙏🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:28:14", "owner": "ms.angelina95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073163354209349, "text": "🙏🙏🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:25:36", "owner": "antontseva.inna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056646623311909, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:25:03", "owner": "carman.tkm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989882412856529, "text": "一个人的一生就这样被大火烧净了，仿佛没有来过这个世界", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:24:41", "owner": "grady_888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075935300189372, "text": "Very sad, I pity to those old folks and kids who are helpless 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:23:18", "owner": "ofwme14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18336223465234993, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:22:09", "owner": "chantal.manganiello", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089878982502401, "text": "💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:20:08", "owner": "hartneytrio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071695499343436, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:19:37", "owner": "jirizavesky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083498194847092, "text": "让人心痛💔😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:18:15", "owner": "zihaoxu28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048980459421303, "text": "Aquí en España valencia, paso hace 1 año igual, horrible. Nose como we dedican a hacer edificios con productos inflamables 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:17:35", "owner": "eduardog1986", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352867669160118, "text": "看的想哭😭 天佑香港🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:16:41", "owner": "_luvlemon_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329489593240773, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:15:58", "owner": "phyllispuel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933455947112079, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:15:08", "owner": "sio7777m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884951836403971, "text": "Heart broken", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:14:43", "owner": "tonreillyy55354", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18516737941067900, "text": "🙏😭очень саболезную", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:13:56", "owner": "kudryashevasash", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930079978113418, "text": "too crazy - sending prayers to hk 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:13:43", "owner": "shiawas56", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086790973975743, "text": "💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:13:20", "owner": "lubnaeva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877697440346099, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:13:17", "owner": "deauce9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088492981985701, "text": "Wer ist dafür verantwortlich???", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:13:14", "owner": "lubnaeva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18436375423109632, "text": "A firefighter dies in blaze weeks before wedding💔🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:13:12", "owner": "fangirl7forever_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064934921176971, "text": "真難想像這是在香港發生的", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:12:55", "owner": "finally_i_have_ig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944239660085006, "text": "Bir blokta çıkan yangın nasıl olurda aynı anda 4 blok yanar", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:12:15", "owner": "sggulmz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072768581197098, "text": "所為的竹子鷹架應該適時改革了吧！ 金屬鷹架加上耐燃布可以為災害多爭取很多很多逃生時間", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:11:59", "owner": "chungyi_kao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18375406327156846, "text": "💔😭💔😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:11:39", "owner": "jagoda.redlinska", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091459423901720, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:10:50", "owner": "ksbaby_521", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907166239273735, "text": "南摩三十六万亿，一十一万，九千五百，同名同号阿弥陀佛。\n念这句，你等同把阿弥陀佛所有的化身都一起念了！威力不可思议啊！", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:10:20", "owner": "mister_nellyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039905294709651, "text": "Pray for honking from Iran 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:09:47", "owner": "miiss_insurance", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862616107538081, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:09:27", "owner": "marcomercadoherrera", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957606880001769, "text": "الله يرحمهم", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:08:31", "owner": "7aghk0__0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093503629896680, "text": "마인크래프트도 아니고 이 시대에 왜 대나무로 비계를 만드노", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:06:34", "owner": "ruda_papa_chichi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915110119232602, "text": "好可怕😱", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:06:00", "owner": "bonnie_o_a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304481530301978, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:05:34", "owner": "wish_chu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353605639160812, "text": "🙏god bless", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:04:27", "owner": "viee68481427", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106215781649906, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:03:26", "owner": "hey_linda.g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072317480047996, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:03:09", "owner": "tei.mika", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061740368537464, "text": "My god 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:01:29", "owner": "__moumitasil__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18328847047212935, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:00:56", "owner": "nejwa.nejwa_1235", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993296514889730, "text": "為什麼會這樣，我曾經遊玩過的地方🥺🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:00:42", "owner": "montgomery_yk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867245752497470, "text": "🙏🙏💔😢😭🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-28T08:00:26", "owner": "patutikinui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087610447796946, "text": "😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:59:49", "owner": "jossuhuhta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010706120646479, "text": "💔😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:58:55", "owner": "lovellae.teves", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074101529017980, "text": "RIP🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:58:51", "owner": "li124951", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074089796261690, "text": "Saya baru liat ini kenapa ko bisa. Apakah ini Al", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:57:57", "owner": "ciii_li_bu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857553460505725, "text": "🥺🥺🥺🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:57:29", "owner": "azul25467", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122216569524599, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:55:20", "owner": "willowwillowwillowwill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079154039471291, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:54:37", "owner": "dilberylmz3939", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951075430026518, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:53:59", "owner": "natalie_gobind", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879651121334443, "text": "Let me guess, construction workers smoking causes this", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:53:32", "owner": "chryeon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861327622539749, "text": "2 WNI telah jadi korban dan dinyatakan meninggal dunia 😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:53:29", "owner": "elvin_ndruru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18178628491362233, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:51:06", "owner": "arapienta11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18178158877363950, "text": "天佑香港🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:49:35", "owner": "09.26_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868153954418582, "text": "為什麼你可以用無人機拍攝！有違規嗎？", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:49:14", "owner": "small_fish18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126158917508734, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:47:04", "owner": "bekreva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18515363794064549, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:46:12", "owner": "baktaiuljalgas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087786184967342, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:43:12", "owner": "pei.pei.yang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028083020567434, "text": "😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:42:31", "owner": "madame_la_bake", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105848545572338, "text": "I was curious about what had happened but when I saw the name of the court 'Wng Fuk', suddenly I understood everything!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:41:43", "owner": "rflong58", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18246580939293888, "text": "🙏🙏🙏😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:41:32", "owner": "detemmermangio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918262372203295, "text": "Were the same investor team members actually arrested who publicly cried sharing the warnings they asked for prayers to get help to stop the invaders who have been battling against hong knots peaceful community? 🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:40:40", "owner": "grace51369", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176687719364914, "text": "💔🙏😢💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:40:20", "owner": "tricia_mclean", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899811541185980, "text": "🙏🏻🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:38:56", "owner": "xxlog", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958245180882259, "text": "Sending prayers to the lose and families 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:38:39", "owner": "lucyc_lothing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872206531387175, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:37:43", "owner": "gabbriela135", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002695067681747, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:37:34", "owner": "gabbriela135", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902792224164186, "text": "May all of the injured recover ASAP. Hope all of survivals  get more help and conquer the difficulties and get back to normal lives.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:36:25", "owner": "bohao1357dm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089239730477335, "text": "Did someone set fire on purpose?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:35:35", "owner": "noren_jin_o_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967764144989655, "text": "😭😭😭🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:35:33", "owner": "big_ani_haha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087006071072286, "text": "🙏 🙏 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:32:34", "owner": "tong.404", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060731378243088, "text": "🙏......😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:32:17", "owner": "haneul_skyi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109663336529407, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:32:02", "owner": "xusan2818", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069171458077791, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:31:34", "owner": "wnarti29883", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925468087179931, "text": "天佑香港", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:31:31", "owner": "sshaelena26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075941519189624, "text": "😭🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:31:30", "owner": "angelking.96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120928816551862, "text": "😢😢😢😢💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:31:18", "owner": "the_babsy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073799474210146, "text": "Geçmiş olsun", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:30:49", "owner": "sariyerli45", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096167248884924, "text": "OMG", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:30:21", "owner": "tatiana__.__._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120340366542687, "text": "What a terrible fire!🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:29:02", "owner": "zhang_1983gh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948514339058223, "text": "💔💔😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:28:51", "owner": "ferrem2011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113985058584596, "text": "Quelle horreur !", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:27:17", "owner": "corsiamichele", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085367729061191, "text": "Ой ужас 🥺 бедные люди... 😮😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:24:37", "owner": "abdrakhmanova.magda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074085125337631, "text": "ZBE zona de bajas emisiones", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:23:21", "owner": "jerryperoasi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972217179968885, "text": "And this is why people should not have to live in such tall buildings", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:22:24", "owner": "tns61497", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036157187511673, "text": "建筑材料存在利益捆绑，导致脚手架仍然采用落后的竹木结构。不知道这颗“钉子”能否通过本次血泪教训得以拔除。Peace", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:22:03", "owner": "cz_tool", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063667493629187, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:21:44", "owner": "__undina__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971422332970608, "text": "💔😭 Warm thoughts to those who have lost their loved ones ❤️‍🩹 May God give you comfort 🤲", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:21:44", "owner": "cathrinedqdear", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894525535224903, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:20:53", "owner": "ria.purwo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064717721176120, "text": "💔…", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:20:51", "owner": "bae_3i2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035420723718868, "text": "The cost 💲 to repair those buildings are higher than building a new ones are higher so what was the point of trying to save them just let it burn 🔥 to thew ground…\nPeople should have not x perished 👆", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:19:43", "owner": "mr._hyde71", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929182621017827, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:17:03", "owner": "sponge_water10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910474138266932, "text": "Thinking of the innocent animals 🕯️", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:14:42", "owner": "miss_maike", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078497321229921, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:14:38", "owner": "arraesgilma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090495256819780, "text": "pray for hk🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:12:44", "owner": "caylacooljhoe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18198327733324805, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:11:11", "owner": "kongkong_seven", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912160333249811, "text": "😳🤯👎😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:11:00", "owner": "seattlestevewargo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008119226817369, "text": "😢😢😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:10:37", "owner": "sunnycurlygirl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925980448169856, "text": "我之前还以为新建的起火😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:10:33", "owner": "cm_toh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990931281903247, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:09:37", "owner": "fi.yan2005", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988111092913098, "text": "Insurance fraud… all 7 towers at the same time… can’t be serious lol", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:08:12", "owner": "_twen_ti_eit_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079551272143609, "text": "Insane", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:07:59", "owner": "winterwheels", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18340650790238625, "text": "AI toto udělala 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:07:46", "owner": "vojtech_vychytil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087152989999594, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:07:21", "owner": "greggbishop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965427990846814, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:06:54", "owner": "arielg7000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18423203719116358, "text": "God bless 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:06:37", "owner": "sintarui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064079027396649, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:06:10", "owner": "sophiamergianou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547900828056478, "text": "😭😭🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:05:45", "owner": "jinyu.thalia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098038765834596, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:05:25", "owner": "ching09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083379893042813, "text": "No sprinkler systems no chance in hell.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:05:12", "owner": "jdonebtw_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844050085620967, "text": "Those fire fighters on those ladders up high, that is definitely not for the faint hearted. Deepest respect 🫡 and gratitude.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:04:22", "owner": "_bekindtooneanother_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875123002446520, "text": "💔😭 Prayers 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:04:20", "owner": "donnarainwater", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972844854968630, "text": "😢🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:03:43", "owner": "enashi959", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18018988634615483, "text": "😢😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:03:26", "owner": "jeonny777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18317178418221130, "text": "💔🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T07:01:41", "owner": "naraa_travellife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081703040119944, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:59:53", "owner": "linco8888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865590877438489, "text": "pray for palestine too😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:59:41", "owner": "coxi76_56", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988661487911629, "text": "💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:58:34", "owner": "travellingchicaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916330810238198, "text": "🙏🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:56:32", "owner": "xx_ayuyuyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064563980408063, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:55:12", "owner": "__xoluv.ylm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855246511528393, "text": "😔😔😔😖😣😟", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:53:31", "owner": "alipacino34_fenerbahce", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971792601977338, "text": "💔🙏😭🙌🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:52:32", "owner": "miss__paradise22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18170985922374582, "text": "Se intimpla lucruri dubioase, la mine in tara a inceput o serie de explozii de gaze in blocuri, la intervale scurte de timp, parerea mea este ca nu este intimplator nici acest incendiu!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:52:08", "owner": "hexeella", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062987147562303, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:51:33", "owner": "dimitris33dima", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541794418048698, "text": "It is disgusting that the renovation company did not have even a fire suppression system as simple as rubber hoses and water sprinklers on such a huge bamboo structure. \nTheir show be executions of the executives to allowed this to even be a possibility! 💪👊💥", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:50:57", "owner": "j_fuelledbyramen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147684481391054, "text": "What's happening 🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:47:32", "owner": "shrewdboi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077469017231332, "text": "😢😢😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:46:33", "owner": "13_28095485", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086772559815511, "text": "Trust physics, not people. Bamboo is more flammable than steel, the netting too. Styrofoam near the windows, that is too. If anything violated code for fire safety, you can point fingers at that, and anyone who let it slip knowing exactly what could happen.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:46:06", "owner": "blacksn0wz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096545083847503, "text": "WOW the fires been burning in multiple towers for over 24 hours non stop just like the Windsor tower in Madrid and NONE of these towers collapsed. These towers in Hong Kong are 43 years old. The World Trade Center Building 7 (WTC 7) was on fire for LESS than seven hours before it completely collapsed on September 11, 2001.  WTC 7 was only 14 years old....... Maybe Hong Kong used passports instead of steel beams. 🥴🤦🏽‍♂️💀", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:44:56", "owner": "eliteonthebeat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091704295910359, "text": "unbelievable🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:44:55", "owner": "markuslu0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131544484492629, "text": "😢🙏😭😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:44:18", "owner": "armstrong.71", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367544476085413, "text": "どうせ放火だろうな", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:42:45", "owner": "kumakituneusagi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078806782929954, "text": "خاک بر سر مسئولین  بی کفایت ایران کنم نگاه کنید یاد بگیرید ۵ طبقه رو چجوری مهار کردن چقدر تجهیزات خوبی دارن  تونوقت به پلاسکورو نتونستید خاموش کنید این همه کشته 💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:42:08", "owner": "amirabbaskhareji_uk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897015403201864, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:41:47", "owner": "ahqiaoddd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18389537395178797, "text": "@maddiepattin omg we were just talking about these tall buildings 😭🥺🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:41:44", "owner": "erikabartlett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080597372172066, "text": "아비규환…", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:41:44", "owner": "bebe_lee1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152890657417561, "text": "😢天佑蒼生", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:40:56", "owner": "nikkahan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027958895758411, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:40:32", "owner": "giorgostzenakis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084629174001810, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:39:08", "owner": "bevsamuel2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18312942463223230, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:38:41", "owner": "erdimartin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847828249582468, "text": "So sad 🙏🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:38:26", "owner": "balihappydog", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863866642519242, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:37:22", "owner": "tokyoooo228", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18087919651960343, "text": "What a disaster !", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:37:08", "owner": "thejetner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098031832644347, "text": "😭ужас", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:33:57", "owner": "irisochka_sohinskaya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051763517670416, "text": "Bamboo, polystyrene foam, wind, density - all it would take is just 1 cigarette butt", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:32:24", "owner": "jane_xenite", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092397076728523, "text": "😢😢😢天佑香港", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:31:11", "owner": "wacsammi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934776175111853, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:31:05", "owner": "licari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18488161543078665, "text": "🙏🙏保佑一切平安，所有生灵都应该得到拯救。", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:30:47", "owner": "joyking113_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113263789578227, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:30:27", "owner": "cengyueban", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902252599303081, "text": "So sad for this I hope Hong Kong everyone be safely no more people’s die🙏🇭🇰", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:30:27", "owner": "john558166", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18378862426150133, "text": "And that's the kind of stack and pack housing they want to force us Americans into", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:30:25", "owner": "leejames1965", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547198495044039, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:28:25", "owner": "its_m_i_z_a_n_u_r_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147542182386477, "text": "🙏😭🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:28:20", "owner": "owl.6944583", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062267936405513, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:28:03", "owner": "aur_bol_bkl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541175458001799, "text": "😮😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:26:05", "owner": "littleplantmania", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072383162056626, "text": "😭😭😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:25:59", "owner": "sadik.pandzic9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164629981390565, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:25:58", "owner": "na.shayegan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064722800451472, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:25:14", "owner": "emilyangms", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852267076547945, "text": "🥺🥺🥺🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T06:24:52", "owner": "abhussain2805", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970530945977052, "text": "But what have you been through? Who have you been to? Fires", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:47:36", "owner": "mary_balears", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113990539565738, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:46:57", "owner": "stylistofyourmom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948359284064323, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:46:52", "owner": "mons.i2020", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050335082379717, "text": "😔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:46:26", "owner": "jflowers75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986832093865674, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:46:01", "owner": "pinkwen6666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929219878017679, "text": "😭😭😭😭😢😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:45:25", "owner": "pamrd30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091054802510526, "text": "pray for Hong Kong🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:45:16", "owner": "aaron_zhang_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986655075876039, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:44:38", "owner": "miller_eugen_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18351776698165879, "text": "Bamboo scaffolding isn't caused the blaze to spread.\nThe real issue was by the contractor, who reportedly used non-compliant, highly flammable protective netting from China and foam sealant around the windows. These materials accelerated the fire dramatically.\nBamboo scaffolding isn’t highly flammable — data supports this, and it’s been a safe, trusted method in Hong Kong for decades.\nAlthough 3 men are arrested, government is distracting the responsible of didn't supervise constructor who always use flammable MIC mesh net because it's cheaper.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:44:02", "owner": "sui.yyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543206542047926, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:43:10", "owner": "thavy255", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154778743415169, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:41:29", "owner": "kyanite.crv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978161322943477, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:41:26", "owner": "wilburhou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065977292149782, "text": "They should gave deployed firemen drones. The ones on the ground can't reach the top floors. Those sky rises are accidents waiting to happen!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:40:57", "owner": "echoesofthepast56", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088891595492921, "text": "Gara gara 1 puntung rokok 🥀", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:40:27", "owner": "jaisuke007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002220275888538, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:40:00", "owner": "yaballoomhuang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855352366570834, "text": "No fire sprinkler systems ?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:39:39", "owner": "jbanthony113", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851174158595678, "text": "Its gruesome.... 💔 i hope the survivours would recover.. and the souls of the victims may rest in peace.🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:39:05", "owner": "noona_reyah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095368096846109, "text": "😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:38:24", "owner": "beto1924", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990221259897186, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:37:38", "owner": "haeseung0825", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966427371994149, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:37:36", "owner": "dburgos05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145753900435507, "text": "Where are the firefighter drones ?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:37:30", "owner": "yo.preme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074949098261155, "text": "これを鎮火した消防の方々に敬意を表する", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:37:04", "owner": "saoricoup", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852281830543481, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:37:00", "owner": "vyvy_c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064568579174004, "text": "So you think jet fuel going to burn from the top all the way to the bottom like that really I'll see y'all still in la la land🤦🏽‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:36:54", "owner": "walt.wells.399", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065755460152771, "text": "What happened is it short circuit or what I'm curious what happened", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:36:53", "owner": "sir.emb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176735731326300, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:36:46", "owner": "pixidustfarie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18247516552291624, "text": "🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:36:06", "owner": "qmm527", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118658206557878, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:35:56", "owner": "pixidustfarie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940864969086900, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:35:20", "owner": "june.26th.tina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098587852809003, "text": "Инна лиллахи ва инна илайхи рожиун", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:34:30", "owner": "mumtoznargiz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915278971236788, "text": "This is so fuc.,.sad......what is the sense to all of this???? No one has the right to take another life let alone 100s of thousands..,...", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:34:14", "owner": "pirnercrystal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101506729668538, "text": "It some strange shit being happening over there lately.... populations control 🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:34:11", "owner": "t_cliff44", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925394395178114, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:33:42", "owner": "panaderiaparasaborear", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071434355065651, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:33:22", "owner": "tngla_iiiiu921", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066322031124004, "text": "Turut berduka cita dan keluarga yg terkena musibah ini diberi kekuatan ketabahan dan tetap semangat .untuk pekerja bangunan yg sdh lalai jg diberi kekuatan dan semangat dlm menjalankan hukuman yg akan dihadapi ...next lebih hati2 lagi buat situasi pekerjaan apapun itu agar tdk merugikan orang lain ataupun diri sendiri😢🥺🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:33:20", "owner": "ro.sana6876", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058613885282980, "text": "太可怕了😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:33:16", "owner": "rjatuepfnh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080971781115688, "text": "❤️🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:33:04", "owner": "karentwinnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075677710983455, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:33:01", "owner": "lic.anabocio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023380070599154, "text": "Yep they dont fall down with fire!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:32:44", "owner": "dfcustoms", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917473267226660, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:32:35", "owner": "renee_cz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18387206857178842, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:31:48", "owner": "yenrvs2805", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905875258277789, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:31:08", "owner": "90guma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171552244375148, "text": "天佑香港，希望人数不要再上升了😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:30:39", "owner": "liushiziyifei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997606749844382, "text": "😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:30:17", "owner": "abbasfok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062570555447598, "text": "Blm ada drond terbang jadi lama😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:30:14", "owner": "nasrulefendi61", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147884938428906, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:29:49", "owner": "trentschepper4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075910451336240, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:29:49", "owner": "ajwamulia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18437266087111475, "text": "Tragedy 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:29:37", "owner": "queentrish13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18537202000025043, "text": "Karma", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:29:29", "owner": "pyuovyy3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916314511231688, "text": "🥺🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:29:09", "owner": "volk_usa_2023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087857743947814, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:28:36", "owner": "gath_suni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053571131336904, "text": "Kaha ke  hai location", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:28:01", "owner": "vishnukushwah_99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18213134077312213, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:27:54", "owner": "abraiz_65", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993637224853677, "text": "💔❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:27:52", "owner": "lucygreenleaf_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989336538883548, "text": "Horrific and so very sad 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:27:43", "owner": "aaaleonard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967226139837900, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:26:33", "owner": "jnnifr1_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084595154014773, "text": "Absolutely tragic", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:25:37", "owner": "kvassudani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063493988634165, "text": "Ya ampunnn😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:25:27", "owner": "vina.namu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103907398639687, "text": "💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:25:01", "owner": "cheriaquila", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100294399787528, "text": "💔💔💔. May God protect and provide 🙏🏾Mx", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:24:54", "owner": "lacontessamoda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031259081735816, "text": "高層マンションは、100年早いんじゃない？", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:24:38", "owner": "masa.matsubarain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092877148723962, "text": "The design of such tall towers means that no tower can meet 100% fire safety standards. Even having firefighters on such high ladders poses a risk! 😮", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:24:34", "owner": "iconsecommerce", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18167342209376772, "text": "Heartbreaking 💔😭my condolences", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:24:32", "owner": "1ly111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842875297628563, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:23:56", "owner": "ciaoddciao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951898417047755, "text": "How many dead?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:23:50", "owner": "darewade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089382545490024, "text": "💔😭 sending my prayers🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:23:17", "owner": "_charlynne12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086553868995971, "text": "Hope everyone around there is safe. That fire looks serious. 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:23:09", "owner": "na87ta05lie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098052715700493, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:22:58", "owner": "virginiaacosta4655", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955537897009461, "text": "🥰🥰🥰", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:22:31", "owner": "dashu13579", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18330551269208048, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:19:17", "owner": "huangkwun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094086901919069, "text": "💔😭🥺🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:19:10", "owner": "lovebanditt3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121675234535987, "text": "還有一間有火！", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:18:21", "owner": "ting760511ting", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936690153980578, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:18:18", "owner": "trimus_entertainment", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084254567097782, "text": "Why didn’t it collapse like the three towers on 9/11 did?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:17:21", "owner": "fanny.palmer92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103038229659191, "text": "Absolutely no reason to use bamboo scaffolding", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:16:57", "owner": "deloreanv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057486800308509, "text": "Wish the crisis can change HK something", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:16:52", "owner": "_cat026", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048122465678472, "text": "It’s tragic……", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:16:35", "owner": "paddington_worldwide", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100263709744166, "text": "Jaga diri kalian baik baik disana, semoga kalian cepat sembuh dari musibah yang menimpa kalian semua 😢❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:16:29", "owner": "gufron__25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952379539045237, "text": "😢😢😢😢🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:15:51", "owner": "my4danes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085046078100548, "text": "💖💖💖💖👍👍👍👍", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:15:49", "owner": "jasulan_qari_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397606510121763, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:15:34", "owner": "binbin_gu0927", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067896884614187, "text": "Built so high the fire ladders can't even reach there to efficiently spray the water.  This is ridiculous.  Why are the bldgs so tall.  It's not fire safe. How did they all catch on fire.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:15:28", "owner": "1928jgfc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059567807535149, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:15:05", "owner": "love_lamcorine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027435689577403, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:14:34", "owner": "jenniferlynnchristie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18327980152244065, "text": "Thanks so much for sharing this news and let the international media know about the chaos🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:14:27", "owner": "csy.1006", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931149685134742, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:14:17", "owner": "ela._419", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156036076416315, "text": "Ya Allah Smoga tidak ada LG korban jiwa😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:12:53", "owner": "kh.adijah9307", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17940618840088529, "text": "🙏🏻😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:12:49", "owner": "the_dogmother_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932565753999148, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:12:16", "owner": "paulosouza2174", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18086837278990007, "text": "Dios les de fortaleza a todos, no puedo lograr imaginar un momento así.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:11:25", "owner": "mariazubiriadiaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094394467697721, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:10:40", "owner": "pa.lie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045219098703699, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:10:19", "owner": "kelly_bspina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863016421455934, "text": "The buildings didn’t just fall down!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:09:48", "owner": "105md", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114043024584797, "text": "Muy lamentable 😭💔 Dios tenga misericordia de todas esas personas que les ha tocado vivir esto. Y esperemos todos se pongan la mano en el corazón para poder ayudar 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:09:36", "owner": "madeleinne.sz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926187709174168, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:08:27", "owner": "airyglobalmusic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051737864363703, "text": "stop smoking 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:08:21", "owner": "pujar_13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099859462754406, "text": "💔🥺🥺🥺🥺🥺🥺💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:07:14", "owner": "danaclee49", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986664462864978, "text": "🙏🙏🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:07:05", "owner": "a.bao.daily", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868179607421067, "text": "So, if one guy puts the frozen turkey into hot oil, the entire neighborhood can be set on fire???? What construction materials are they using??", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:06:56", "owner": "marcelo__ascencio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983216364767177, "text": "Guy who left is bagel bites in too long: \"Wat da fuk!?!\"", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:05:43", "owner": "msoeiceman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009996773802426, "text": "💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:05:14", "owner": "inbran04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926237218172006, "text": "How can fire spread so rapidly in so many buildings and 279 people go missing. Its strange", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:05:02", "owner": "am_resh23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961522536866914, "text": "Omg so aweful", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:03:53", "owner": "jeanne55dragonfly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134351344429443, "text": "💔 this is so sad", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:02:56", "owner": "violettastcg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089390743945509, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:02:45", "owner": "sw7dih", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905485981143704, "text": "Did u fly a drone", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:02:30", "owner": "jesussschristu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926789812171390, "text": "Buildings burning for many hours and did not collapse. WTCs collapsed completely in a very very short time 👀", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:02:15", "owner": "guh89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940173600963088, "text": "RIP🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:02:10", "owner": "dreamingderek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183280063354971, "text": "Those building are not safe tooooo many ppl live there no way", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:01:14", "owner": "reddie551", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057573740290136, "text": "💔😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:00:56", "owner": "iam__mattieg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18186550840353043, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:00:47", "owner": "leidy_jcn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985034334919277, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:00:47", "owner": "jennifferogden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071304725058987, "text": "Bamboo is not the problem, the disqualified net and the malfunction alarm system are!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:00:42", "owner": "charlotte_jane_ho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078516113174237, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:58:54", "owner": "lezliered", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918631390213283, "text": "Ужас🙏🥺😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:58:52", "owner": "kiparis_kristina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994108539852239, "text": "🙏💔❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:58:05", "owner": "hakuna_matata1728", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18554666092009712, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:57:51", "owner": "gudduhossain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082572703871710, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:56:29", "owner": "thunguyen0290", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158024956365126, "text": "希望可以有奇跡，失聯的都可以平安冇事🙏x", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:56:25", "owner": "jx_x7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085143437510691, "text": "Our aircrafts can pickup people and fly them out of windows. If any government wants to grab a couple to save lives let me know 🚁", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:55:35", "owner": "hunterkowald", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18074922056219421, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏 🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:55:06", "owner": "marina_love_purses_mlv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078796319327695, "text": "Terrible just terrible", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:55:04", "owner": "dbigjohnson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927418708153623, "text": "HONG KONG", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:54:31", "owner": "xqc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980535387937373, "text": "Just awful", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:53:40", "owner": "leopardprintdragon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961828011862029, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:52:22", "owner": "arisleydic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877334332435547, "text": "消防车还有必要吗", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:51:46", "owner": "xiaoshuo1989", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085378091059178, "text": "How did all of them catch fire, they aren’t joined", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:50:32", "owner": "lugargett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081681551147089, "text": "This is a real tragedy and I am praying for all affected.❤️🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:50:24", "owner": "lanamichellescorziello", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902449687336086, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:49:55", "owner": "fabylicyous", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002195786680911, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:48:59", "owner": "gowithozzie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870305029398406, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:48:59", "owner": "m.prosperity.13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060717314621723, "text": "Strange how those buildings are still standing yet building 7……", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:48:35", "owner": "prinxess698", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089170789747530, "text": "So ssd!!!🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:48:23", "owner": "jc_ross_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902308783312808, "text": "Why the bamboo still stands.  Some one not telling straight.  They all went up a the same time. Something not right there", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:47:29", "owner": "hammill.lee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029258141755803, "text": "燒到甘竹都未變型！", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:46:55", "owner": "valisha.1111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120478633547477, "text": "one of my fears of highrise living 😮", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:46:37", "owner": "trying.2wo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18392849392183809, "text": "Раббим узин асра бало казодан 🤲🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:46:27", "owner": "adolat5577", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121283377542666, "text": "Still standing is crazy", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:45:21", "owner": "robrhan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063998705178461, "text": "💔🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:45:12", "owner": "limacigar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057612764639257, "text": "🥺😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:45:10", "owner": "jenn_zelaya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095459113873623, "text": "💔😭😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:44:00", "owner": "leonardohipolito84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075436339994780, "text": "😮😮😮😮😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:42:18", "owner": "sundecorfabrics", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086938045993554, "text": "Well what did anyone expect the building has 1000 of match box rooms all with single cook stove burners a fire was eminent one day or another. Imagen just enough room for one person and all their belongings", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:41:55", "owner": "ricardo.arrieta.5437", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971299482974097, "text": "😭😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:41:22", "owner": "tylewjr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858250003501505, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:41:20", "owner": "leandrosoares0057", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888514462263161, "text": "When communism goes right....🤡🤡🤡", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:41:18", "owner": "chewy_black", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935206246102627, "text": "Apakah semua negara dengan bangunan apartemen sudah siap dengan jangkauan alat pemadam kebakaran dari sisi luar? Mengandalkan sprinkler sepertinya belum tentu dpt memadamkan api yg sdh sangat besar🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:40:29", "owner": "wile_stan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874591180446039, "text": "how the fuck do u even find the culprit", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:39:04", "owner": "pwkeodidhejirishejdiduwjwjisi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842488156630144, "text": "🥺😢💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:38:24", "owner": "nicky_question_mark_2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011124971801317, "text": "💔🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T02:37:51", "owner": "kathagomez77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073505594251283, "text": "Thoughts and prayers won’t bring back their families. In the eyes of any government, you’re a monetary loss.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:15:40", "owner": "brantalisious", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990428517903314, "text": "¿Que fue lo que causó todo este desastre?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:15:38", "owner": "alan.toloza14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855180559575199, "text": "🙏🏿💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:15:07", "owner": "bayou_babe777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005998589827358, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:14:36", "owner": "gicleidefabiane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123584425518007, "text": "Que triste noticia.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:13:53", "owner": "rubi.patricia.2802", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902500192314016, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:13:53", "owner": "3.82p", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088064881787731, "text": "😮😮😮😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:13:16", "owner": "agop4698", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103438153711044, "text": "😭💔💔pray for HK", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:13:01", "owner": "jeanneli11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064289993530465, "text": "😢😢💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:12:34", "owner": "touto_u763", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867883906491181, "text": "願傷害降低香港平安🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:12:32", "owner": "chang.shuhui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051115001348641, "text": "💔💔💔💔😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:12:01", "owner": "mariagalindo.13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18202020946319440, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:11:53", "owner": "mendorongddoddot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087700162807918, "text": "💔💔💔💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:11:50", "owner": "cdraf10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18177324529364943, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:11:29", "owner": "patrizia.vitucci", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083807894022767, "text": "Horrific… 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:10:23", "owner": "ellebas1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18538817032012961, "text": "逝者安息🙏向牺牲的消防员致敬！😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:10:10", "owner": "g1fts1r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053992595663946, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:10:05", "owner": "keillarodriguespinto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070279232362851, "text": "🙏❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:09:36", "owner": "rosalia.silva.129", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852965185583905, "text": "Goverment to clean area's for new builds as they look well old", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:09:26", "owner": "mjmc28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865593964439964, "text": "Not Wang fuk!", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:09:21", "owner": "andersonatetheanteater", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866300434507574, "text": "😢😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:08:41", "owner": "ladyb.ladyb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366118567090129, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:07:45", "owner": "jessielim606", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061257140222898, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:07:39", "owner": "micowong.pan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061857980208127, "text": "RIP 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:07:34", "owner": "aicalopez0321", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031096367546223, "text": "💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:07:23", "owner": "reparo_tu_ropa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929683675138840, "text": "😢😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:06:57", "owner": "kim_cheeee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087093919798322, "text": "天佑香港，希望你們能快點好起來", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:06:54", "owner": "teresateresa6123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068322509574901, "text": "💔🙏guaooo que difícil 🥺no hay palabras", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:06:53", "owner": "yamiletconcepciondelgadoyepez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888469597263182, "text": "とても衝撃的な火事でビックリしています。1人でも多くの人が助かる様に1日も早く救助をしてほしいです。\nそしてレスキュー隊や消防士の皆さんが無事で作業できます様に🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:06:53", "owner": "11853kiki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101710009774674, "text": "早日平安🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:06:38", "owner": "seachering", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18355529443165908, "text": "😢😢😢🙏🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:05:40", "owner": "suzie_snezana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082655636281776, "text": "너무 마음이 ..ㅜㅜ  애도의 시간을 갖겠습니다 ..", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:05:29", "owner": "eun.hwa_0721", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104940898649333, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:05:16", "owner": "ebvvenezia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066603320420209, "text": "Still burning yet still standing. I see. I feel bad for all the people involved, hope they'll be ok", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:04:57", "owner": "carolmurray798", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046337894460368, "text": "Praying for those affected", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:04:38", "owner": "tjw32501", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968721834827806, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:04:38", "owner": "carrielzyc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926005450177810, "text": "Jarak antar gedung kan cukup jauh, kok bisa merembet ya, apakah semua semua lg renov hingga pake jaring hijau itu, hingga kena kobaran api dari sebelah yg terbakar", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:04:21", "owner": "zhazhacumeng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032405735755980, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:03:53", "owner": "kaanitron", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070912115603473, "text": "Es incendio fue tan dantesco que deberían atacar el fuego con aviones.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:03:52", "owner": "magaly_bonvallet_g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082143398471588, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:03:17", "owner": "raylimlys", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103666555655973, "text": "Quien en su sano juicio llena eso de madera por fuera ??", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:03:16", "owner": "kikiki11luk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18248647213292505, "text": "💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:02:27", "owner": "dkwolftravel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853877818579353, "text": "天佑香港🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:02:26", "owner": "yomi0909346", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17918975937069802, "text": "💔 que tristeza, quantas vidas se foram.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:02:24", "owner": "gisellepita", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088255105784420, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:02:17", "owner": "shaklihossein", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087200984510167, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:02:04", "owner": "zengsonglin11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870682471468060, "text": "😢😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:01:11", "owner": "evan0987081000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099173473801443, "text": "Unbelievable loss😭🙏.. God help the families involved", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:01:04", "owner": "oziomajesuloba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931895572115770, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:00:57", "owner": "pxiyuan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099884230743619, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:00:54", "owner": "ste.fania01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073185026584290, "text": "This absolutely horrible. My heart goes out to the victims loved ones and families. Heartbroken for everyone. 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:00:51", "owner": "matekosportico", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842701852629477, "text": "😢🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:00:45", "owner": "wandmari9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18312915982247427, "text": "💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:00:40", "owner": "silenceyuyu0325", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988357713860441, "text": "😭😭😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:00:31", "owner": "leaverkaren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164256874387502, "text": "My thoughts and prayers are with you all.", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:00:20", "owner": "jabu1104", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872970694463657, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭💔🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:00:06", "owner": "leaflittlepeach", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18315563656218711, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:00:04", "owner": "woodprudence", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100936741747199, "text": "Didnt China promote their fire fighting drones that carry hoses high up just a couple of weeks ago?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:59:48", "owner": "yippee_central", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071802476365742, "text": "What happened? 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:59:47", "owner": "alexxwebs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080630567142410, "text": "Not one of those buildings had a sprinkler system inside", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:59:44", "owner": "woundedknee187", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970627422971124, "text": "🙏terrible 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:59:22", "owner": "crasali69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048362636417392, "text": "They showed a few suspects with their heads covered being placed in police vehicle", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:59:09", "owner": "diana.borges.104", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068859302457962, "text": "I’m going to guess something in those buildings was very flammable", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:58:47", "owner": "pjohnson34_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897091672200752, "text": "Wang fuk lmao", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:58:37", "owner": "timrittur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968997360978636, "text": "😭😢 What is the root cause??", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:57:56", "owner": "ganesh_cbe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069072197081151, "text": "처참하다...ㅜㅜ", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:57:54", "owner": "pokee_chu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037231256708269, "text": "Wow, so sorry, Hong Kong. It looks very suspicious. Insurance claim?????", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:56:51", "owner": "paul.crawford.73113", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848667616606708, "text": "🤣🤣🤣👏👏👏 THEY LOOK LIKE TEHY WERE UNDER CONSTRUCTION 🤣🤣🤣🤣 PERFECT INSURANCE JOB…..BUILDER RAN OUT OF MONEY SO HE LIT IT UP AND NOW WILL GET PAID BY THE INSURANCE COMPANY🤣🤣🤣🤦🏻‍♂️\n\nCHINA🥴", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:55:45", "owner": "13panzzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051645878354087, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:55:30", "owner": "bigveeinthed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961685925865722, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:55:19", "owner": "arslan_4r5l4n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060899366623132, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:55:10", "owner": "queila.mara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090676127510134, "text": "Qoyil yangi qurilgan bino tagidagi daraxtlarning ko'pligini uzbeklarga o'xshab kesib tashlamayslarmiyeee", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:55:03", "owner": "ulmasjonberdikulov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115322449560648, "text": "😭😭😭😭💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:55:01", "owner": "74rebecka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18550827178050279, "text": "😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:54:50", "owner": "lorraineloganvegas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079432822913268, "text": "Such a tragedy..heartfelt sorrow for all involved.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:54:36", "owner": "allbdesign", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916765630227159, "text": "So sad!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:54:27", "owner": "daffeedawg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929645218014820, "text": "Ban cigarettes 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:54:00", "owner": "maniem003", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18050052635680142, "text": "😢😭😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:53:59", "owner": "janny.otto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056550863317331, "text": "😮😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:53:32", "owner": "doraliceamon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890543521380328, "text": "ليه وش السبب😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:53:28", "owner": "huda000700", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17915777193229752, "text": "💔🙏 my thoughts go out to HK, we share the pain and tears, we support each other this difficult time ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:52:53", "owner": "kfan.to", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17902243839328994, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:52:19", "owner": "charyanchisi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857188210560576, "text": "How does something of this magnitude occur?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:52:10", "owner": "drew_hall12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076049438186677, "text": "Estranho logo os 3 ao mesmo tempo 🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:52:01", "owner": "willames_maranhao_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095170279672249, "text": "Weird", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:52:00", "owner": "__abbdiel__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093171673920570, "text": "💔💔💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:51:36", "owner": "lilisokta_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064513022568440, "text": "Esto le paso como  en Panamá que quieren sacar a la gente de bocalacaja", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:51:34", "owner": "ericaedith30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090179761901605, "text": "樓上根本就 噴不到", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:50:46", "owner": "xuxiaogan83", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910923760257394, "text": "💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:50:45", "owner": "nikaury_16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123997756519650, "text": "🇨🇳で草🌿　　足場が竹て…💧　　なんそれ💦💦🥴", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:50:08", "owner": "mm_mitsu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048738851419163, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:50:08", "owner": "bison_atuua_tuine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926759716171502, "text": "😢💔🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:49:58", "owner": "mamadann_b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133273702469913, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:49:57", "owner": "skyelinezzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18411302944186177, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:49:36", "owner": "qianchenqq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081268451473090, "text": "なんですこしでも　上から飛行機✈️水💦💦💦ふりかけてやればいい　早く人助けて欲しい　無事皆んな祈ります🙏🙏🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:49:36", "owner": "honey.keri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041789855495846, "text": "💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:49:31", "owner": "jlbrad038", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930054922148295, "text": "They are Wang fuked", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:49:20", "owner": "jkey829", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156516883409903, "text": "Over 5000 people now without a home and lost all of their precious belongings. Hope they can get the help they need.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:47:27", "owner": "fight_foryour_believes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087929011985570, "text": "愿逝者安息🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:47:01", "owner": "walter___yu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068724980454411, "text": "Govt be like \"Those people gotta go. Make it quick.\"", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:46:57", "owner": "randallgoeswhere", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864505882522140, "text": "😢😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:46:54", "owner": "danubyajahns", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945857167075852, "text": "Insurance scam", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:46:21", "owner": "leis.arogers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062570789628767, "text": "Oh, no", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:46:14", "owner": "jodyleavoy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862303171536549, "text": "An appalling situation, I  no hope something is learned from this. Condolences to those who lost loved ones 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:46:02", "owner": "beyoncemyfave", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926334727161589, "text": "太吓人了，恐怖", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:45:49", "owner": "mhmochen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109199377621626, "text": "Meus sentimentos as famílias. 😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:45:33", "owner": "marciabortolotto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101980435746306, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:45:32", "owner": "joannexxw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152495788410656, "text": "Que triste", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:45:30", "owner": "katiamoralless", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001658462831855, "text": "And theyre still standing. 🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:45:22", "owner": "themansamm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852193669544494, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:45:08", "owner": "thurabtu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890058949253661, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:45:04", "owner": "marciabortolotto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132639307486294, "text": "I hope you’re safe — I saw the news and it made me wonder how people are protected in those dense buildings. Are you okay?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:43:30", "owner": "rebeccahaileyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128290513500725, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:42:49", "owner": "niva.santos68", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894656881220224, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:42:03", "owner": "shahdineez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078902551935591, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:42:02", "owner": "shahdineez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870244903395272, "text": "In the posts written in Korean, many Koreans were insulting the dead of this disaster. Those people are really shit. No matter what kind of past grudges there may have been, it is not acceptable to laugh at the dead.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:41:31", "owner": "ufc_zhangjinhu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925750381173645, "text": "Prayers for Hong Kong!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:41:30", "owner": "halllanett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997214550738783, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏😢😢😢😭😭😭💔💔💔💔❤️❤️❤️❤️🥺🥺🥺😮😮😮🙌🙌🙌🙌🙌👐🤲🙏🙏🙏🙏😇😇😇😇😇😇👼👼👼👼👼👼🕊️🕊️🕊️🕊️🕊️🕊️🕊️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:41:11", "owner": "claudiamilenavelco", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085949216511205, "text": "😭😭misericórdia! Foi terrorismo??", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:40:57", "owner": "valdetedutra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909067219127246, "text": "😢😢😢🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:40:47", "owner": "lucyperez7400", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18492024655076204, "text": "I guess these didn't burn long enough or was it the jet fuel what was missing", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:40:38", "owner": "youraverageloserline", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058845833638387, "text": "Sending peayers to hk", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:40:31", "owner": "momo.opcosplay2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961103256867809, "text": "So incredibly sad.😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:40:30", "owner": "tracyhatten6631", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961752555865858, "text": "😢😢😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:40:13", "owner": "soutto_sena", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079594778326653, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:40:01", "owner": "mila__1102", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983783160923658, "text": "Wang fuk", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:39:49", "owner": "gerraldsauce416", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100674097690242, "text": "Surprised these didn't suddenly go into free fall collapse ...", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:39:43", "owner": "waketech75", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070007609367026, "text": "💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:39:05", "owner": "junzlisa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17902802019161524, "text": "🙏🏾🙏🏾", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:37:45", "owner": "yve5021", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099079099692253, "text": "Imprecionante dios de consuelo a los familiares q han perdido seres queridos .mis condolencias 🙏💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:37:37", "owner": "rossanaaristimuno", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18377386354146100, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:37:06", "owner": "maaikekraaijenbrink", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978696957944861, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:37:04", "owner": "littlerattenius", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18275525239303371, "text": "Como sucedió esto?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:36:45", "owner": "yesssyb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979410876783466, "text": "So sad ❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:36:33", "owner": "barbang99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984897039915282, "text": "😢😢😢😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:36:28", "owner": "gulsanam__0707", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120081694553214, "text": "oh mein Gott", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:36:24", "owner": "littlerattenius", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18366380155082331, "text": "個心好痛！", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:36:11", "owner": "yipyipwu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18306198916248195, "text": "Misericordia 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:35:54", "owner": "palloma_1996", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135527365473885, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:35:48", "owner": "tsubasa_syo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074370044209653, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:35:15", "owner": "loui_meets_ada", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061551299223063, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:34:50", "owner": "mmyoe5745", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024269618594247, "text": "Pretty legit fire trucks tbh", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:34:28", "owner": "philghsmith", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081798614158323, "text": "Omg so glad it’s been put off", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:34:08", "owner": "bunnyboooooooo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18199464082321399, "text": "Kinda reminds u of 9/11 prayers too all family then and now ... 🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:33:51", "owner": "blevland", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17876708673355945, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:33:44", "owner": "nidia.molina.7509", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980706072925924, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:33:38", "owner": "mrs.watthahell", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068195750106674, "text": "Que tragedia!! 😭💔, Dios fortalece a las familias y a la ciudad!!😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:33:36", "owner": "gustavoparis_artist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047758289448951, "text": "Wow so sad", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:33:29", "owner": "haydeecordero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085672859064578, "text": "😢😢💔💔😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:33:06", "owner": "romy.camargo.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125663071505515, "text": "They burned so long and didn't collapse?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:31:48", "owner": "tgfe_jason", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854440756576891, "text": "So sad 💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:31:40", "owner": "norairmaortiz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18247154143295615, "text": "💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:31:36", "owner": "aussie_skate_bros", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078876196915903, "text": "Sorry for them", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:31:24", "owner": "conradonolck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885699694281903, "text": "This is so tragic. I hope every person responsible is held to the strictest letter of the law", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:31:08", "owner": "thrashtheempire", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125741842513649, "text": "Ok, why?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:31:03", "owner": "zojasokolowska", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165267484382946, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:30:15", "owner": "mirian_david65", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096665788864411, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🌹", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:30:04", "owner": "wingng318", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18292101874286188, "text": "@qpham93", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:29:39", "owner": "rice_paper8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972986400798164, "text": "No por dios", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:28:59", "owner": "luciana.lara.12327", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078960635175820, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:28:35", "owner": "sparkystpaul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988237767744940, "text": "🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:28:22", "owner": "finechyina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065156054395015, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:27:22", "owner": "gracelan76", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847869547582168, "text": "🥺😢🙏💔 muito triste 😞", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:27:22", "owner": "carlamadei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866016061507440, "text": "😭🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:27:13", "owner": "odett.west", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091786330923396, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:27:01", "owner": "tulaycelik5225", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084535898031406, "text": "看似的天灾往往是人祸。可怜了无辜的人们", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:26:55", "owner": "denten6228", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857721007559187, "text": "Not one collapsed due to fire.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:26:45", "owner": "ccarnage8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859421722552399, "text": "Gif bless HK 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:26:36", "owner": "mike_861168", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969469803974793, "text": "💔😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:26:05", "owner": "hosico_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067005605571995, "text": "Que tristeza Senhor 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:25:28", "owner": "iracema_grahl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111700168595509, "text": "No, this is not AI.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:25:26", "owner": "artbeast1980", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086988505975284, "text": "😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:25:22", "owner": "karensue1350", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18369219556083605, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:25:17", "owner": "thxforeveryone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849033901573590, "text": "And then the buildings will need to be taken down… and before that rescuers will need to go in to recover survivors or bodies. It continues to be a dangerous and terrible situation. Praying for all involved. 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:25:11", "owner": "amelia.windom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093651859881942, "text": "Y SE JACTAN DE SER LOS MEJORES CONSTRUCTORES LOS CHINOS Y MIREN AHI ESTA EL RESULTADO DE LOS Constructores.  CHINOS QUE OBVIARON SISTEMAS DE SEGURIDAD PARA Abaratar COSTOS", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:24:50", "owner": "carlosch296", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105359950628831, "text": "😭😭😭 qué tristeza", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:23:48", "owner": "gracielachsalik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18411429214139385, "text": "胸が締め付けられます🥹\n亡くなられた方のご冥福をお祈りします🙏\nケガをされた方、家族を亡くされた方の心の回復を願っています❤️‍🩹", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:23:43", "owner": "aco_takibist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030597686549619, "text": "how tho?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:23:22", "owner": "redface_ai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922902034050222, "text": "هاي شحركه  شنو شبب", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:22:40", "owner": "zaenb.86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114020530580062, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:22:33", "owner": "losgirasoles.de", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18150244276425035, "text": "No firefighter drones? 🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:22:12", "owner": "xtariz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110021401623592, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:21:53", "owner": "florrutili", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978307344948487, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:21:42", "owner": "luna20240724", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541804177003351, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:21:32", "owner": "angeles_geli1958", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864312910524102, "text": "😭🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:20:46", "owner": "karinskueche", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056145122315892, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:20:37", "owner": "lucykibble_88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304022800270413, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:20:14", "owner": "sonasona_23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541212355032851, "text": "What a shame!!! 💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:19:04", "owner": "bernberk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870184144393933, "text": "😢😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:18:52", "owner": "fatemeh_.riyahi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128153278503566, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:18:29", "owner": "perola.jayne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103974694590963, "text": "Como tantos prédios pegaram fogo ao mesmo tempo??? Que trajédia!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:18:17", "owner": "mgvbecker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320374717169214, "text": "Ahhh China. Needs to make room for new development. Like when they opened the dam and flooded all those ppl.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:18:08", "owner": "sunsets_anime", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086725798952666, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:18:04", "owner": "debccfc60", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074250917585103, "text": "It's amazing how much weight and leverage these fire ladders can withstand.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:17:46", "owner": "e.eic.2k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989069457871693, "text": "🥲🥲🥲🥲🥲🥲", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:17:32", "owner": "mano_koning", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083264318081244, "text": "How come they didn’t implode and fall …..", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:16:57", "owner": "mikejamieson54", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870014185470995, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:16:18", "owner": "doris_villamascotas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886263775401453, "text": "Damn pray for wang fuk", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:16:07", "owner": "bnaz_604", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991127919728376, "text": "RIP🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:15:26", "owner": "lily__wwwwwww", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948559138061302, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏sad verry sad", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:14:06", "owner": "jeffreybakaran", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884974636286279, "text": "Why?😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:13:49", "owner": "noi_noi_ojion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043624598488165, "text": "😭😭💔💔 misericórdia😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:12:37", "owner": "sil_electra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087362707978961, "text": "😭😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:12:17", "owner": "__sumsum9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950123388921029, "text": "Wang fuk 😌", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:12:08", "owner": "tommhoppr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021665213606112, "text": "😭💔💔💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:11:52", "owner": "hazel_hca26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295569157279946, "text": "Happy Thanksgiving ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:11:35", "owner": "uncle_hunnell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154671355416530, "text": "Oh my gosh 😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:11:29", "owner": "mammaawii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972020127968420, "text": "🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:10:19", "owner": "hirokun9612", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027158153578217, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:10:10", "owner": "cepedahiguera", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069025586096407, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:09:54", "owner": "tsalles911", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909328741266669, "text": "🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:09:53", "owner": "anastasiia_omelian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065854979625226, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭💔💔💔😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:09:43", "owner": "liakounani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147282289440106, "text": "🙏💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:09:09", "owner": "petrovicdanka.73", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081868948879427, "text": "Meus sentimentos a todos familiares 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:08:56", "owner": "carlao.a.oliveira.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18248115781294470, "text": "🙏🏽💔🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:08:32", "owner": "harper30_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18538972795016511, "text": "Let’s connect with each other:  https://www.instagram.com/anna.nguyenmedicalknowledge?igsh=b2hreTNpNnh2YTYw&utm_source=", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:08:31", "owner": "anna.nguyenmedicalknowledge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997949094697112, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:08:24", "owner": "ronko17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977940636941280, "text": "Porque hay tanta maldad en el mundo 😢😢😢😢que falta de sentimientos tiene el ser humano 😢😢no tiene perdón de Dios 😭 quien lo haya hecho que lo reciba la silla eléctrica 😡", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:08:10", "owner": "petitanaelisa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18328467802209223, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:08:00", "owner": "bierklooster", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886702255404024, "text": "So horrific 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:07:46", "owner": "schwarzlichtkerze", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868643911474322, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:07:40", "owner": "cuchi_vs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120121909536884, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:07:28", "owner": "nis.mili.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18387940810182687, "text": "🙏🙏🙏😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:07:25", "owner": "paulada8522", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121973440521393, "text": "El Señor se apiade de sus almas.💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:06:44", "owner": "rosalinamejiagomez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087042508951560, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:05:28", "owner": "nabin2344", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079333738923151, "text": "Dar care- i explicația de au luat 3 astfel de \" înălțimi \" foc ? Chiar nu înțeleg , sincer 🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:05:28", "owner": "elena.stroescu.3154", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160562242399874, "text": "This is so sad omg 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:04:52", "owner": "nurainulakmar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18315665530218234, "text": "Eso es increíble. Como pudo suceder inmensa desgracia . 😢 Que pobre gente", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:04:37", "owner": "ana3773hernandez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097340608839220, "text": "OMG, Hong Kong 💔! I’m so sorry!!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:04:24", "owner": "kelly_wagner01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011444579643027, "text": "More like want fuked", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:04:04", "owner": "td_sain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18511492363064478, "text": "So heartbreaking.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:04:01", "owner": "kirschdell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545553658016431, "text": "涙が出ます😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:03:31", "owner": "sakura.mama26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096370252799909, "text": "All 5 burnt?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:03:24", "owner": "trinidrea4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954984535043097, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:02:21", "owner": "dianasimon66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18538543831014969, "text": "🙏🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:02:12", "owner": "danrodriguezouchabane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063776273527636, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:02:06", "owner": "lena_g_assis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164266483387394, "text": "Awful 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:01:46", "owner": "audreyerross", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184709623347428, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:01:26", "owner": "rezaabdi1116", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067527479525781, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:01:22", "owner": "grebinskiisa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083589134288315, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:01:06", "owner": "tracygardener13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087190940007161, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢💔💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:01:03", "owner": "cmtmarieb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952707085030068, "text": "A crazy story.  A huge miscalculation on the renovation curtains.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:01:03", "owner": "designclassic222", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18299942977267826, "text": "😭😭😭😭💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:01:01", "owner": "mohammad.mirzaei91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160246942403247, "text": "Did someone deliberately set these buildings on fire? 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:01:00", "owner": "f97gad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984134139761612, "text": "Fuk is right. Horrible.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T23:00:52", "owner": "holmgrentracey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078525719184142, "text": "😢😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:59:38", "owner": "rikykiss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846157087614325, "text": "Avg chinese building", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:59:07", "owner": "sos_rattenimdarm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870139762398717, "text": "Скажите ,в чем причина???", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:58:09", "owner": "smalica", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086923205066325, "text": "That’s one way to get rid of low income housing.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:57:29", "owner": "michaelfleming9157", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18409825789141572, "text": "And not collapses 🤔 mmm 9/11", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:57:03", "owner": "garo_ojeda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923021032189215, "text": "想起了上海的胶州路", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:56:44", "owner": "yvonnemoonxu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084334523095343, "text": "Ini masihh di bangun ya ?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:56:29", "owner": "ekasitiyulianti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010822847799825, "text": "Such a terrible yet avoidable tragedy. May all those who died there rest in peace.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:56:29", "owner": "patienteast", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543250834015253, "text": "😮😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:56:11", "owner": "__________95a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18386958595181557, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭日本から祈ります🇯🇵🙏🙏。", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:56:10", "owner": "h.r.1021.m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934406227076346, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:55:59", "owner": "ivancollak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047356253450046, "text": "So terribly sorry and praying for you all and praying for the loss of the firefighter and everyone involved 🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:55:52", "owner": "salt.tracey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990620325904893, "text": "This is what terrifies me about living in an apartment complex. I lived in one briefly a few years ago and never again!. My heart if with those involved", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:55:46", "owner": "growing_up_walter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051473969344094, "text": "Vreselijk 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:55:36", "owner": "mrjapiooo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085719239490920, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:55:30", "owner": "tak_ma_hk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543610150002510, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:55:26", "owner": "ines_oliveira_martins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143779876453751, "text": "😮😮😮😢😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:55:21", "owner": "andreaclagos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904749214297566, "text": "💔🙏🙏🙏🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:55:09", "owner": "ivaneteraeder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052145591657330, "text": "I lived in Hong Kong for two years, and one thing that always amazed me was the bamboo scaffolding rising among the skyscrapers.\nToday, hearing the same symbol connected to tragedy breaks my heart.\nMy thoughts and prayers are with the families.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:55:08", "owner": "chatdnz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891208414380563, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:54:29", "owner": "makemongoliagreatagain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061467806548131, "text": "😢💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:54:28", "owner": "jocelyneallaire", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095981779854904, "text": "Heartbreaking 💔 Prayers to all 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:54:09", "owner": "glorad3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943942492005602, "text": "😢😢😢😢💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:54:07", "owner": "havvachavva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874265767451577, "text": "How is this possible", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:53:57", "owner": "redraventhestylist_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020062379792690, "text": "Como se paso eso, la ingeniería  o que?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:53:21", "owner": "estrellitafocal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18414589546186743, "text": "🥺😢😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:52:35", "owner": "rita6gon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079211188925512, "text": "Something not right here, just like 911.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:52:16", "owner": "sky_stew_777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18349703038200428, "text": "願上帝憐憫他們。我們對中國兄弟姊妹在這場悲劇中所遭受的苦難表示深切哀悼。來自伊拉克的我們永遠愛你們。", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:51:50", "owner": "zooze00000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103803322733465, "text": "A Mi Đà Phật 🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:51:38", "owner": "gianghuong.nguyen.3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100270633783220, "text": "This is insane ! I m so heartbroken and hope that it would never happen again. Again how can it happen. We all know this is the greed from the bad people.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:51:37", "owner": "fifisandy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902726764165738, "text": "Esos edificios de qué material estaban hechos❓😱😱", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:51:37", "owner": "zoy_la", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975069540953980, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:51:11", "owner": "psy_cmota", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18291596173275809, "text": "Absolute tragedy. Poor residents. It is an extremely densely populated area. Thinking of you all. 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:51:01", "owner": "ruthena55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956991786892313, "text": "🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:50:49", "owner": "jadrankabenkus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087874756800197, "text": "My goodness. 💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:50:42", "owner": "mzmindfull71", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096830443886061, "text": "Isso foi intencional...💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:50:21", "owner": "reialvesss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850284292565186, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:49:52", "owner": "ccasspina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946015741078612, "text": "Still standing, and you believe a couple plane took down the 2 towers?😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:49:02", "owner": "plowingthruit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082036702886903, "text": "🙏😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:49:01", "owner": "tomlx93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074149751013350, "text": "Arson", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:48:55", "owner": "gabybrik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081748034134124, "text": "How long did these buildings burn for?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:48:54", "owner": "instakemin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061321262544803, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:48:34", "owner": "v3r0nica_ramir3z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081152858163680, "text": "😮😢😭💔prayers for the victims and their families.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:48:30", "owner": "hockeymomtaytay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120176020529442, "text": "Por qué hacer edificios tan grandes si no tienen escaleras que puedan sostener un incendio", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:48:22", "owner": "toly4ever", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18354436024162244, "text": "ياربي السلامة اللهم أجرنا من النار 🤲🤲", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:47:34", "owner": "rozalimoda03.12", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18383264629144423, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:47:05", "owner": "none_other_than1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18186798286343578, "text": "Untung aja masih tahap pengerjaan... Btw ada korban md gk", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:47:00", "owner": "geminieq6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118231210489159, "text": "So sad", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:46:58", "owner": "jax6704", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048779315409388, "text": "Insurance", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:46:36", "owner": "blackandwhiteedmonton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897095056204167, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:46:07", "owner": "chromedelite", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098847457813743, "text": "Bamboo scaffolding? Really !", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:46:03", "owner": "doubledaks76", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017669624795924, "text": "This is what happens when you have a non-existent or weak fire code building should have been sprinkled you see this all over the world you save a little bit of money and this is what happens", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:46:01", "owner": "greg3bbb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121327666468345, "text": "💔😭😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:45:44", "owner": "patsymlaw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896376142352556, "text": "🙏🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:45:12", "owner": "susana_testa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975161209008381, "text": "Some say ✡️ and Mossad infiltrated China", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:44:58", "owner": "pablocholo911", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18340203544227506, "text": "The bamboo scaffolding caught fire,the winds spread the flames across to other towers.tge scaffolding went up like a box of matches .so sad 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:44:55", "owner": "john.kilderry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18186847138354445, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:44:37", "owner": "xiaolan0624", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969610170823258, "text": "🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:44:36", "owner": "bia_csoaresrn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368463253080227, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:44:30", "owner": "julihdz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062812484544623, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:44:20", "owner": "euekatsoule", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089051690503339, "text": "🥺😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:43:54", "owner": "puntoland_nutrition", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085491751973294, "text": "I dont understand how 5 building next to each other and not soo close all got caught on fire ? Someone pls explain", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:43:23", "owner": "janinaw74", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874113424451530, "text": "Alhamdulillah the fire has been extinguished🤲🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:42:43", "owner": "ninatria.13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136705807461409, "text": "💔terrible", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:41:52", "owner": "frenchboy__604", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860158888549436, "text": "🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:41:43", "owner": "justinaslife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093912745857952, "text": "😢💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:41:37", "owner": "cristal.azul.365", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842379946631069, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:41:31", "owner": "therealrachelbaker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101967685667528, "text": "This is giving insurance scam 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:41:19", "owner": "rae2015", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843660373622773, "text": "我香港人", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:41:07", "owner": "alice.icy.2803", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990963768863091, "text": "😢😢😢😢😭😭😭😭😭💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:40:22", "owner": "ken8454", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367208797090595, "text": "Because of what?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:40:01", "owner": "ma__hr__ez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964580104003384, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:39:44", "owner": "k_poral_5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887592274268774, "text": "Que horribles edificios. Espantosos.  Nadie puede escapar de ahí.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:39:43", "owner": "kikimidory13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088310689768784, "text": "That's horrific", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:39:38", "owner": "kaipo.doorley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004249943821345, "text": "Bit suss all the buildings not connected going on fire together haha insurance job.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:39:20", "owner": "jennycwhitmore52", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075421769189506, "text": "Wow to be out like $2500 in damages!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:39:18", "owner": "hw1970sumaluma16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074012438008574, "text": "😭💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:38:49", "owner": "febryani_09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152361067415190, "text": "Somehow the US will get blamed for this", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:38:36", "owner": "angry_corndog", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864326578522281, "text": "Triste", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:38:33", "owner": "golfeuse47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873603505453369, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:38:25", "owner": "nessa38.lasalo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058944467274432, "text": "😢😢😢🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:38:20", "owner": "anischnischna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873924556374170, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:38:19", "owner": "heyjude777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887222668396661, "text": "Someone ran out of money", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:38:06", "owner": "gt_aargh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094298500849324, "text": "Hoje em dia o castigo vai na velocidade da luz.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:37:45", "owner": "seni.dasilva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100219087627467, "text": "Pray for those families", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:37:36", "owner": "minhhhhle_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028426832562477, "text": "Horrible...Praying✝️🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:37:34", "owner": "verni89tajp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976974924789302, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:37:27", "owner": "ariellin721", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049610804390030, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:37:24", "owner": "zicorock9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087643216793113, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:37:16", "owner": "ydn_ew", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087269824792769, "text": "Prayers for Hong Kong 🙏🏾", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:36:59", "owner": "nerdgirl_1994", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930461695170581, "text": "💔🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:36:46", "owner": "sszman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889635847388334, "text": "Total disgrace to whoever started this.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:36:32", "owner": "mathew._y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062259776199839, "text": "🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:36:27", "owner": "takawniari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963342103006298, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:33:20", "owner": "moydam7497", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148396162439202, "text": "💔💔💔кошмар какой-то 😢😢😢 как такое может быть?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:32:14", "owner": "lucky.girl1082", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050051039680325, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:31:42", "owner": "safi_b10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092304949925274, "text": "💔😭Señor ten piedad 🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:31:22", "owner": "smeraldy8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092899978909664, "text": "Pra que gastar água.  Demuli", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:30:55", "owner": "rodrigo.fattori1975", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065954198138545, "text": "Aí q eu falo. Fazem prédios tão altos q nem os bombeiros conseguem chegar...", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:30:26", "owner": "lorena_ferreyro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966200350004035, "text": "How could this possibly happen in 2025. Shear horror. Those poor souls. Heads to roll. RIP😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:29:53", "owner": "golekzelko", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18368576350083699, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:29:52", "owner": "joise.h", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18351977419164467, "text": "Let’s make a building with highly flammable materials and a very poor emergency protocol:", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:29:24", "owner": "brandon.cjesus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093760453718396, "text": "🥺💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:29:20", "owner": "ingrid_de_b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099299848748120, "text": "😭😭💔💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:28:00", "owner": "vicmarypimentel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077916841955005, "text": "Just devastating 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:27:57", "owner": "i_ride_a_2020_scout", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18411938938138055, "text": "А что это зелёное на зданиях?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:27:54", "owner": "emaema0508", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127477267506625, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔💔😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:27:43", "owner": "qsysmhbny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145703041442243, "text": "Stop building buildings out of toilet paper", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:27:26", "owner": "ron.ver9.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058616147288012, "text": "That's fucked up. Using bamboo for scaffolds on high-rise buildings.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:27:05", "owner": "andventurist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117818557495626, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:26:56", "owner": "esrabyt82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096936115838454, "text": "RIP", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:26:08", "owner": "eno1115", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172319281374586, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:25:39", "owner": "rafaelaechrystian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144787357449119, "text": "무섭다...", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:25:31", "owner": "manmansay_yes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070300406367271, "text": "😭😭😭😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:24:50", "owner": "haunanibray1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116370007499211, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:24:45", "owner": "mostlydoors", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305860072266883, "text": "Absolutely brutal. 😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:24:13", "owner": "tracyinkits", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145909936438136, "text": "Ukraine everyday because of russian terrorists and China", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:24:09", "owner": "vitaliykoreva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121729393468364, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:24:07", "owner": "isophie007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134753044469749, "text": "Fogo não derrete ferragens, logo o 11 de setembro foi um mega teatro arquitetado pelo sistema", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:24:02", "owner": "chebynha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079559932935458, "text": "Piedad señor", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:23:51", "owner": "yesicamariahernandezflorez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121356229476687, "text": "Sicuramente materiali ignifughi", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:23:48", "owner": "emanuele_genova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079033462899766, "text": "💯💯💯💯 arson ...... Poor people 😔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:23:47", "owner": "lorra_the_explorer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058247792644127, "text": "💔🙏💔💔💔😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:23:30", "owner": "suspirodmoya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928735312118553, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:23:29", "owner": "mjrs1965gmail.com7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954444586042038, "text": "It was under construction...no one was in there..", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:23:26", "owner": "kirkdeejay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078890831141695, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:22:56", "owner": "ronehart73", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116538523497029, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:22:48", "owner": "ongles_jinan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918808102072102, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:22:40", "owner": "sweetestpassion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061619936207528, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:22:29", "owner": "lucila.pereira.90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18177740101367328, "text": "💔🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:22:05", "owner": "strawberries_jen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066416810614895, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:21:30", "owner": "yasminadeole", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084028880102239, "text": "Горе всемирного масштаба 💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:21:01", "owner": "moskvarad.2000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075289964204034, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:21:01", "owner": "donpablo5522", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970300908973427, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:20:40", "owner": "fishdamo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135185362478309, "text": "Wie ist es möglich das soviele Hochhäuser auf einmal brennen,die armen Menschen,so grauenhaft.😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:20:05", "owner": "karinkaschner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079572794137825, "text": "😢😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:20:03", "owner": "elirosa.rochaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885087436283522, "text": "Unbelivebel", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:19:55", "owner": "dikkienijhoff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090118393937180, "text": "Triste😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:19:53", "owner": "marildete_cutrim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107036143649789, "text": "And how the fire spread to the other buildings", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:19:50", "owner": "bonnorubio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892416052364185, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:19:34", "owner": "marildete_cutrim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18297465733284091, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:19:26", "owner": "titi.lopezzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968065953995340, "text": "🙏💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:19:02", "owner": "lore_cubides792", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908919550126802, "text": "Un horno...sin probabilidad de salir de alli....siempre les he tenido miedo a esas estructuras tan altas...Fuumerza a familiares y amigos....esto es una tragedia...💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:18:53", "owner": "irazabalyesika", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082393741881039, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢Meus sentimentos a todos!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:18:51", "owner": "adrianapereira9161", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903454369294471, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:18:48", "owner": "eli.silviaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184736065343189, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:18:46", "owner": "barbosinhatatinha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864106516515630, "text": "😭😭😭😭💔💔💔 ich bete für euch !! Es tut mir so leid!!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:18:38", "owner": "12_ate_15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353546746161307, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:18:36", "owner": "ryderbrayri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157849021392438, "text": "😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:18:34", "owner": "toutirina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919534888198400, "text": "Grenfell tower v2 and times 5", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:18:31", "owner": "paperweighthatch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293862406285217, "text": "Ce sont des tours en bois ?😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:18:23", "owner": "fleo55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100633462685479, "text": "とても悲しい😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:18:07", "owner": "maru8_280", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093719551883891, "text": "😭😭💔💔heartbreaking 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:18:03", "owner": "grisimarch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086537170820899, "text": "Szok", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:17:24", "owner": "victorhugo6993", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048476828419617, "text": "Looks terrible 😮 I can't figure out how FEW separate buildings got in fire", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:17:09", "owner": "apolisario", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107463646627136, "text": "行方不明の方が早く見つかり、救出されますように…", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:16:10", "owner": "sachimi1193", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098523046693847, "text": "😢😢💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:15:42", "owner": "marieva202", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922470160189676, "text": "😢🥺💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:15:11", "owner": "ganz.klar.jenny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877083073440789, "text": "😢😢😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:15:00", "owner": "antonia_piazza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958400736878351, "text": "How is the world@", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:14:54", "owner": "tanwgusola", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087218210314005, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭😭 thoughts and prayers 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:14:51", "owner": "pizarro_rosemarie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18552496657033641, "text": "How could that happend? Is it one building ? It looks like many buildings😢💔🙏❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:11:03", "owner": "sandblommargaretha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975601170794211, "text": "So no drone firefighters this time?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:10:58", "owner": "ryanchen916", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074901230250540, "text": "Bambus shit.... Jail investor", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:10:41", "owner": "martonmiroslav", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926556373170161, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:10:34", "owner": "christophedelestre3705", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18441063268096531, "text": "My god!  So devastating!  My heart goes to those who lost their lives and deepest sympathies to their loved ones and family 🙏😢. So heartbreaking!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:09:56", "owner": "kiran_bhoday", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867716605491188, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:09:56", "owner": "maggiesteiner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367361596090288, "text": "Q triste 😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:09:53", "owner": "claircercena", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870183949396740, "text": "Doesn’t look like the bamboo was to blame. The nets are gone though. What a tragedy, heartbreaking", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:09:51", "owner": "ejtlarg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176660827323362, "text": "He should be executed!! Not live his life out 😡😡😡yes I might not be better than him having this thought But is that owner going to pay  FOR ALL FUNERALS, POSESSIONS PEOPLE NEED TO START OVER???", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:09:43", "owner": "anamendez9479", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896996713201813, "text": "اسکلای چینی", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:09:41", "owner": "alex_maxaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086810800971945, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:09:13", "owner": "sandracacemiro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176260114366878, "text": "why some many people still trapped in the building. are there no fire alarm at all in the buildings. why HK are still using bamboo  frame? every month there's accident happen in the construction site. government doing nothing.  HK is not a safe place at all", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:09:11", "owner": "bppb2013", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902120287325016, "text": "Why didn’t Hong Kong use drones for firefighting？", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:09:07", "owner": "snowxuelian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056231957315884, "text": "☹️💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:08:55", "owner": "3yuyi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075055094258232, "text": "🥺🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:08:41", "owner": "catsspeak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160169386400033, "text": "😭😭💔🙏🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:07:44", "owner": "alexavarela.21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18493493503077870, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:07:35", "owner": "rich_the_irish_barber", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906039913280021, "text": "What happened too those fire fighting  drones", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:07:19", "owner": "paviatwal_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083991328842849, "text": "Einfach schrecklich 😢 ich wünsche den Verletzten baldige Genesung und den Hinterbliebenen spreche ich mein tiefstes Mitgefühl aus 😔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:06:37", "owner": "limael57", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026176067583317, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:06:26", "owner": "saadetoz26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114303007573682, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:06:25", "owner": "lollyemzo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857564389506398, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:05:57", "owner": "meirebolofake", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066223871148328, "text": "💔🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:05:48", "owner": "uliebigtime", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984472158760155, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:05:43", "owner": "cornelia.moise.7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888396751391190, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:05:43", "owner": "mollychen218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926026942157192, "text": "Too many people , not enough land , too many rise ! Fire hoses can’t reach above a certain level", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:05:32", "owner": "cazz_8_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957948705887850, "text": "😮😢😢😢🥺💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:05:29", "owner": "bitencouttpereira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042549446695653, "text": "So sad !!! Sending much love to the families .", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:05:04", "owner": "gfarianf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992949618894249, "text": "Sorry. I couldn't find the ashtray", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:05:04", "owner": "campbell.chris615", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959239957011165, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭🙏🙏🙏🙏💔💔💔😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:05:04", "owner": "alealibre", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18366389236093586, "text": "😢💔 heartbreaking 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:04:59", "owner": "march_mama_bear", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011750789803595, "text": "Construyeron una caldera", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:04:55", "owner": "antarjeteria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18195872023332722, "text": "Been burning since yesterday,  but none of those buildings collapsed 😮😉", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:04:38", "owner": "k89.ae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980493888779417, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:04:15", "owner": "alyssavo83", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882342958307132, "text": "💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:04:12", "owner": "maureenbullock1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085872836068250, "text": "Maybe dont build buildings this high?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:04:07", "owner": "schattenbaer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193958194331416, "text": "😭😭😭💔💔💔pray for hk🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:03:59", "owner": "mamaeyuna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866075605506749, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:03:56", "owner": "nedailybronco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114077959580243, "text": "Triste😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:03:50", "owner": "lorenadasilva542", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074131628195680, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:03:43", "owner": "m_ar__oua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048380099422014, "text": "Holly fuk 😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:03:29", "owner": "f.ur.rules", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081138638275605, "text": "💔💔💔💔🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:03:14", "owner": "raileanuflorentinamaria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086161213816086, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:03:10", "owner": "mry00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099425548700857, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:03:05", "owner": "matthew.crabb.3954", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853718503581639, "text": "I’m so sorry this is happening but somehow this doesn’t make sense..", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:02:53", "owner": "solitaryssv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853064476588763, "text": "😢🙌🙌🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:02:52", "owner": "elianebritodeassis82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085928755989861, "text": "💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:02:41", "owner": "adilzhancv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18496210234079624, "text": "Love bless the loss of life\nThe only thing that could have save them was Tower Inferno at the end. I guess Rapid Fire prevention sprinkler system are not required in these buildings", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:02:24", "owner": "wb.ny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905404279144383, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:02:10", "owner": "simoesmariaelisabete", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925481626174030, "text": "Très étrange!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:02:09", "owner": "jacquespautel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128546461497896, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:01:34", "owner": "halimdrums", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099895855739783, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:01:29", "owner": "avldkmp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101020000685964, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:01:17", "owner": "trujillo4604", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067600901528226, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:01:17", "owner": "_vos_agni_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874827265366659, "text": "香港加油", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:01:17", "owner": "pi444430", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981267738771564, "text": "Apparently it wasn't a bamboo it was the green netting that caught", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:00:59", "owner": "brenda.williams493", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842110897633005, "text": "💔😭😭😭😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:00:56", "owner": "maryr77leon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013759040803724, "text": "😮que barbaridad", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:00:51", "owner": "cecorts55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097148764877915, "text": "Sadly, this is not AI generated", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:00:49", "owner": "steve_o_o7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062840930196440, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:00:44", "owner": "tebbygilpin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086988262820489, "text": "Oh my god. Those poor people", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:00:42", "owner": "tebbygilpin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989760780910680, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:00:28", "owner": "olga_samarina_art", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136522042478475, "text": "Raging fire for several hours and yet buildings didnt magically collapse... 😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:00:27", "owner": "lukkleeper", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990695703858993, "text": "ya Alloh ya Robbbb😢😢🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-27T22:00:01", "owner": "jejejuly33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072878666035521, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:59:52", "owner": "alpha_idols", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997494729848266, "text": "😭Que tragédia", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:59:44", "owner": "alecakesconfeitariaoficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086316514974516, "text": "Ada berapa gedung yang ke bakar", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:59:35", "owner": "rianaria53", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058173614640653, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:59:33", "owner": "delimood", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063223691448490, "text": "Was it arson?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:59:15", "owner": "vaveshka_v", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982720818925673, "text": "Wielka tragedia. Współczuję 💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:59:09", "owner": "iwonamarch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071715164363033, "text": "Oh how terrible. 💔 must be hard to have worked so long for so much and then to lose it all because your neighbours had a bad plug or so", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:58:56", "owner": "saskiaploeg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140776270456046, "text": "They don’t have drones?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:58:15", "owner": "khayati858", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094599724891540, "text": "Oh my god 😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:57:35", "owner": "jessica_05.09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062273438554160, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:56:58", "owner": "muratsolmaz.birtat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905275381291420, "text": "💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:56:23", "owner": "ioneaparecidamoreira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302640214269624, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:56:08", "owner": "godzla.com_owner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083968553015023, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:56:02", "owner": "klou_nc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894273154224372, "text": "🙏🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:55:43", "owner": "iamjakewu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541546687021611, "text": "你是香港人吗", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:55:17", "owner": "hawk.766578", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062728184192376, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:55:08", "owner": "aurlane2211", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940266966964997, "text": "Little suspicious that the whole wang fuk court caught fire…", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:54:58", "owner": "michaelpchalmers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066328262627944, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:54:55", "owner": "lucia.oliveira0409", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090678332505199, "text": "🙏❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:54:43", "owner": "letty.gr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035833688513658, "text": "Justitie Alan yumenglong 🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:54:42", "owner": "houvanmijnmanengezin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103024960675384, "text": "Luz para sus almas🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:54:08", "owner": "yiskah_armas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888785452388008, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:53:55", "owner": "delioneideandrade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053468180662414, "text": "How did it start‼️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:53:33", "owner": "marlenerichardson7502", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898982110346623, "text": "So sad to see all the damage looks like nothing was missed with the fire getting most appartments pray for all affected ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:53:29", "owner": "marks_funstuff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102239122708095, "text": "Sem entrar no mérito, não me agrada morar em grandes condomínios e igualmente em grandes arranha céus", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:53:01", "owner": "tadeurochacorretor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954290922901766, "text": "Pray for the souls 💔💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:52:49", "owner": "rithu_the_actor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900815992177174, "text": "Everyone’s nightmare on high buildings 🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:52:31", "owner": "marlenerichardson7502", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146935477430168, "text": "I don't understand how all 4 buildings could have caught fire like that.I'm so sorry to all the family members that lost someone😢😢😢🫂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:52:20", "owner": "1_mikmik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086527186822056, "text": "😮😮😮😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:52:20", "owner": "othlien43", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072509417523484, "text": "How do all separate towers catch fire??", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:52:12", "owner": "edwina75johnson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989508645886788, "text": "I'm not from this country, but my heart aches so much. I hope the fire is put out soonand may the souls of those who lost their lives rest in peace😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:51:59", "owner": "nafas.23i", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891239575245642, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:51:58", "owner": "foto_graphyela", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011803217640562, "text": "This is so sad. Those green tarps and bamboo sticks should have never been on the buildings. It is very flammable and should have never been there.The fire codes in other countries are very different than that of America and New York, where I live. Someone needs to be held accountable for this.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:51:41", "owner": "michaelknight11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876697408352787, "text": "What way to make buildings? What a wrong way to make buildings have burned everyone who was. He didn't have time to go out.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:51:38", "owner": "jkygarcia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352355815160200, "text": "痛心", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:51:36", "owner": "ee.999999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148178728426754, "text": "Paix a toutes les âmes 🤍", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:51:14", "owner": "elia_stefan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18413588893142747, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:51:12", "owner": "yas_sstore", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873727798377695, "text": "それらの建物は最悪で、火は収まる時間もなく、上の階に住んでいた人は皆燃え、時間はまだ残されていない。 最も不適切なやり方はどのような残虐性ですか? なんて恐ろしいんだ!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:51:09", "owner": "jkygarcia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107579926712577, "text": "💔бедные люди😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:50:59", "owner": "le_sich_ka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025617269773462, "text": "😢😭😭😭😭🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:50:55", "owner": "olivabacus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005274542821737, "text": "I bet the owners are thinking of how to save their money... HOW IS THIS NOT ASSYLUM WORTHY?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:50:47", "owner": "heyitscheers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999522303834727, "text": "Building burnt for 3 days not one fell. Towers burn 3 hours. Both turn to dust. Must be some strong ass steel over there. 👉", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:50:39", "owner": "jeff_d68", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862134025538668, "text": "なんて悲惨な火事なんだろう。少しでも被害が軽くなりますよう祈っております", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:50:28", "owner": "weigaojianyi8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900495490335568, "text": "Oh my God 🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:50:17", "owner": "tinokusstein", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065320733169357, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:50:11", "owner": "contosepicos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18325799572244726, "text": "For some reason they didn't fall like they did in New York", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:50:02", "owner": "kos.an", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097470388836403, "text": "Wait I thought this was all Ai", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:49:37", "owner": "sweeet._eee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087274063958516, "text": "They thought they can pull American bullshit behaviour over there? And get away with it??", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:48:56", "owner": "guhsiddung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102719455670904, "text": "😭💔🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:48:38", "owner": "bethlimamoreira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071926499585280, "text": "Dear God, I'm sorry, just really sorry. I have no other words. 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:48:37", "owner": "mommyoftwoworlds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544964380025542, "text": "This is arson in the open!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:48:32", "owner": "ioanis_k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980669346927270, "text": "저렇게 높은 고층인데 대나무 비계가 버틴다고??", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:48:30", "owner": "kimbo4989", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916128388237199, "text": "Tristeza 🙏, que Deus conforte o coração daqueles familiares e famílias que perderam tudo.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:48:16", "owner": "girlane.sousa.9655", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992780343722204, "text": "Terrible 💔🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:48:14", "owner": "francois.demers.942", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088798399772296, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:48:05", "owner": "diannaman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107442109623580, "text": "Que horror, pobre gente.... Mis más sentido pésame a todos los familiares!!! Los compaño en este dolor", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:47:43", "owner": "w_espe_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970404201985570, "text": "💔 for all the innocent lives, may eternal be their memory.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:47:37", "owner": "petulamou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051733613361300, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:47:21", "owner": "uknowmysteez21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086321689981657, "text": "How can this happen that all these tower blocks burn together. Something  doesn't  seem right.thinking of all those people  and there families 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:47:09", "owner": "ursula_daniels", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981322536929140, "text": ". ,.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:46:57", "owner": "abdreev_ardak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172462258334941, "text": "Made in china where everything is knock off merchandise.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:46:51", "owner": "raschan9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970672209987588, "text": "😢😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:46:46", "owner": "lillysr20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366110536094480, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏 thanks so much for your coverage", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:46:45", "owner": "fengster99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062066732198998, "text": "Materials used on this construction were highly flammable. There is no regulations. I am sorry for those who lost everything 😥", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:46:43", "owner": "guendica", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061184741634925, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:46:33", "owner": "ukkmb2003", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071079953061470, "text": "This is tragedy… my god be with all the families who lost their loved ones and god have their souls 🙏🏼❤️ very hard to enjoy a thanksgiving knowing there’s so many terrible things happening around the world..", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:46:18", "owner": "bryantrees", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18174030562370299, "text": "This is horrible, Rest in peace .", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:45:10", "owner": "lordandmaster1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891645892241099, "text": "💔🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:44:50", "owner": "bezerra.marize", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119743357546743, "text": "This is the biggest argument I've ever seen. For no 15 minutes cities.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:44:22", "owner": "lordandmaster1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948165378932233, "text": "Страшная трагедия 💔🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:44:15", "owner": "kristina905belova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066217721131235, "text": "Wang fuked hard", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:43:49", "owner": "augwan30609", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072672728583806, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:43:39", "owner": "dorafuentespicon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089008580498918, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:43:36", "owner": "querinovivi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047933669427455, "text": "Rip to beautiful pets and humans living there💔🙏🖤🖤💐", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:43:16", "owner": "neylexis0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079729319139476, "text": "😭😭💔💔🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:43:14", "owner": "dolinicdejana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099156013780558, "text": "Misericórdia senhor", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:42:55", "owner": "rboide", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066110837408405, "text": "別吵了「因為竹子是中國產的所以會生火」", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:42:38", "owner": "meomjdws111.java", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881035171423681, "text": "Meus sentimentos 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:42:15", "owner": "anapaulavieirada_cruz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076080290244016, "text": "It's China so we'll never know the true body count", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:42:08", "owner": "fogogin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093565264716100, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:41:55", "owner": "policenomariadagraca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541057540002140, "text": "คุณพระคุ้มครองทุกท่านนะคะ", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:41:54", "owner": "sungwan1835", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076000141982522, "text": "Why didn't it collapse in on itself at free fall speed?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:41:38", "owner": "ebony_hwhite", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900137953181764, "text": "These buildings are a death trap.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:41:36", "owner": "ovadianina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899248906343615, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:41:11", "owner": "jyes092222", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887293729392903, "text": "😮🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:40:55", "owner": "angelangelina519", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953961607043929, "text": "Why live in cages???????", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:40:52", "owner": "crisrocha360", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329185951208626, "text": "What, the fuk?? 😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:40:49", "owner": "alexleonbusiness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971811996972873, "text": "@saveourtreeswhittier - Sign the petition  #tree #treesofinstagram  whittierlocal #picorivera #losangeles #downey #montebello #lahabra #norwalk #SaveTrees #PlantTrees #SaveTheTrees #TreesForFuture #GoGreen #TreeLovers #GreenPlanet #DeforestationAwareness #ProtectNature #TreePlantation #OneTreeAtATime #ForestMatters #Savetrees #SaveEarth #Savenature #SaveWater #Sustainable #ClimateChange #Reforestation #GreenWorld 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:40:43", "owner": "jredschulz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057179834304362, "text": "Omg", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:40:36", "owner": "vane_rivera89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880053517327465, "text": "Need to rethink safety measures, just building expensive skyscrapers are not enough", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:40:32", "owner": "bhola_guy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090668941935383, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:40:28", "owner": "bajanshelly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950554486048050, "text": "My heart goes to all those souls 🤍 what a tragedy 😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:40:26", "owner": "diana.acacio.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094688512861887, "text": "Some one from Miami,florida perpetuating the fraud insurance culture.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:40:15", "owner": "jc_ram77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957375523008869, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:39:48", "owner": "nadine_l.i", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870549553471527, "text": "YA ALLAH forgive us and help us 🤲🏻😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:39:25", "owner": "sameer.sabrin.143", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115904215560242, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:39:15", "owner": "samira_mahmodiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867224551485850, "text": "Как жалко.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:38:58", "owner": "ko.marov3430", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973136844806957, "text": "😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:38:55", "owner": "kenza.ogab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547890286040628, "text": "Praying for all the families affected… this is such a terrible tragedy 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:38:49", "owner": "alcheng88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953067064046208, "text": "Where's the fire fighting drones", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:38:35", "owner": "daweone_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048544868418809, "text": "Porqué hacen construcciones sin seguridad para combatir los incendios 😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:38:34", "owner": "reyesbernardohernandez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854072671535361, "text": "😭 Pray for Hong Kong 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:38:18", "owner": "sophiatkk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079465916140423, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:38:04", "owner": "ysimequi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18386037490179466, "text": "I feel sorry for everyone who was affected by this tragedy. 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:37:39", "owner": "robert.antkowski1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540979288062271, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:37:36", "owner": "sandrocarvalho237", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080019164166358, "text": "Why the government didn’t water bomb with choppers ? 🤷🏼‍♂️🤦‍♀️ seems like unprofessional firefighters 🚒🤷🏼‍♂️🤦‍♀️🤦‍♀️🤦‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:37:24", "owner": "richi202503", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907630498274866, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:37:03", "owner": "rosies_reminders", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155151802416184, "text": "Heartbreaking 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:36:56", "owner": "mariam.ashraf.75248", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009152936808237, "text": "How does this happen? Honestly", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:36:40", "owner": "og_ofy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097651720875065, "text": "😭😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:36:39", "owner": "swannails516", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108497122554277, "text": "RIP to the people who lost their lives,  and condolences to those who lost their homes.  Our thoughts are with you.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:35:49", "owner": "ross.hilton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123846784516368, "text": "😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:34:54", "owner": "claudiajanetharevalo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088839595777865, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:34:54", "owner": "yiyiluvcherry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106276081715879, "text": "💔💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:34:44", "owner": "pintosdonna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940390491964506, "text": "😭😭💔🙏🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:34:37", "owner": "helkeschucko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864286651518612, "text": "😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:33:31", "owner": "stoqn.1_9_9_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009298493807930, "text": "❤️❤️🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:33:28", "owner": "ohlenulrika", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856708810510879, "text": "😢💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:33:28", "owner": "canarianay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129882352495197, "text": "Andamios de bambú. 😡😡😡😡😡😡", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:33:19", "owner": "begonina62", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129464512494545, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:33:10", "owner": "vlublena33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320912635173460, "text": "# No collapse🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:32:41", "owner": "finny1981", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981761409925583, "text": "About 80 victims and 250 missing at this time...", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:32:41", "owner": "thierry_in_paris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097575802830251, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:32:37", "owner": "jeanclaudecervetti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029246774555568, "text": "L", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:32:37", "owner": "bobneilly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072974540588334, "text": "Só não entendo como pegou fogo em todos prédios ???", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:32:35", "owner": "fatviterbo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066254642149240, "text": "Lo peor será😭 cuando se descubra porque fue!!! 🥹🥹🥹", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:32:22", "owner": "menchuromeromora", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092949784914141, "text": "Did they use the drones to put it out?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:32:20", "owner": "nickstradamus1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856066519568222, "text": "How did this happen 😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:31:35", "owner": "panaewa880088", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849993868599086, "text": "I foresee many changes in the building codes", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:31:34", "owner": "bobneilly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18202365550319952, "text": "😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:31:25", "owner": "__m_a_n_c_h_o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983874471764924, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:31:21", "owner": "madhavik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073912643197016, "text": "💔😢😢💔🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:31:17", "owner": "ca.turner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940252524965373, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:31:12", "owner": "jaciarafrancisco3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079791709930630, "text": "Chinese quality🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:31:07", "owner": "tajnyjakchxd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100144216691652, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:30:45", "owner": "jeanjosejoigny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867846121494174, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:30:29", "owner": "janeliejensen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18373411471082753, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:30:16", "owner": "holidaylolita", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099668344762922, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:30:11", "owner": "studio.d.i", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087794410962445, "text": "did someone set all four on fire", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:30:01", "owner": "metalcoreonfcku", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061605107227341, "text": "Don’t see them collapsing like 9 11.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:30:00", "owner": "jeve53481", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108096421624762, "text": "Horroroso! 😩 x Dios🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:29:57", "owner": "menchuromeromora", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928964134149429, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:29:44", "owner": "alinaa291", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107481694634032, "text": "Over cooked the noodles", "created_a