1:25:41", "owner": "10_zhas_10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074361950196594, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:25:29", "owner": "un_duriz94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076527538987994, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:25:27", "owner": "angelitaortiz53", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304972558267628, "text": "Who started them?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:25:14", "owner": "john40960112", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082638965115025, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:24:58", "owner": "mahboobeh1061_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059748815259580, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:24:52", "owner": "mxchellextz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899620873186115, "text": "Poor souls", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:24:28", "owner": "andrea.langford", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867681217496397, "text": "😢😢🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:23:55", "owner": "marielasanhuezam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060145025632120, "text": "Just like Big Chimney.  No regulations to protect the life?  Terrible sad 🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:23:17", "owner": "kumikoandsora", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930054244118730, "text": "Israhell 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:23:09", "owner": "cutekittenchronicles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866968024489355, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:23:09", "owner": "c.baharr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986771046911197, "text": "😢🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:23:04", "owner": "melania.lavia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114574588505430, "text": "Impossível essas mangueirinha de água 🥺 olha o tamanho do prédio", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:23:00", "owner": "rosilene_caceres", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546303244054147, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:22:59", "owner": "bmg.8989", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18249377551293636, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:22:56", "owner": "cutekittenchronicles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077533498957876, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:22:22", "owner": "rubiks_red", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120845581529238, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:22:08", "owner": "tattoojournalist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060175538246104, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:21:52", "owner": "9314_nana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094565758856469, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:21:41", "owner": "nattdiaz25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18386744143179794, "text": "I pray for the missing and send prayers to the families of lives lost. I really thought this was AI bcuz these buildings burned like that and are still standing", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:21:31", "owner": "guess_my_sign", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968997294986750, "text": "Dios bendito los proteja y ojalá en vdd no sea un plan  para destruir edificios viejos “provocando un accidente “ ! Muy triste", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:21:24", "owner": "silviafdzhurt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964986540990021, "text": "Is this real?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:21:15", "owner": "nackrova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925647451173208, "text": "Crazy how these didn’t collapse like the ones from 9/11", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:21:05", "owner": "ninauhh__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17867362884489674, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:21:03", "owner": "emmanuellegarcia1790", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961846713865409, "text": "🙏😢R.I.P.🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:20:46", "owner": "manuelaschipper", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059742980261085, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:20:28", "owner": "darneyues", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996249516847954, "text": "Oh my God 🥺😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:20:27", "owner": "hahn.pt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084869795083860, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:20:14", "owner": "edimar__duque", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074018345014602, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:20:09", "owner": "edimar__duque", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193125475330981, "text": "Cadê os helicóptero contra incêndio", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:20:00", "owner": "cezaralexandrezanett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062773493440343, "text": "Meu pai, como estás pessoas vão recuperar suas casas novamente", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:19:58", "owner": "marlithartmann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077362853464493, "text": "Vaya! Y todo ese armazón es por qué estaban dando mantenimiento o construyendo? Que horrible situación.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:19:51", "owner": "naiadylee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304777816264805, "text": "😭🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:19:45", "owner": "shellywheels219", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908467135267398, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:19:32", "owner": "bienikl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943386241075017, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:19:21", "owner": "ostrywin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18232328752305901, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:19:06", "owner": "bolostsouk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101846065663968, "text": "Dang Wang fuk really got fuk", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:18:44", "owner": "dariansdad15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18496048378075294, "text": "How do these structures stay erect", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:18:37", "owner": "sandravoorhis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052692674658535, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:18:31", "owner": "rafaelaoliveira.sp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18381214297197214, "text": "Tinder box", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:18:26", "owner": "lalakennison", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147604747437696, "text": "😢😭😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:18:09", "owner": "victorgoodchild", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987584331748186, "text": "Mucha fortaleza ,fuerza, fé para seguir adelante 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:17:45", "owner": "aniitamgonzalez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076447595223394, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:17:33", "owner": "kiki.pa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971793420972773, "text": "Prying for those people blessings", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:17:33", "owner": "dino__sm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969444720993641, "text": "Tiene un olor a intencional. Ahora ahí mismo construirán un montón de Torres inmensamente mayor a las que se quemaron", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:17:23", "owner": "rodolfofitolopez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367588408085926, "text": "Me da la impresión que fue provocado para demolerlos y obtener el terreno...que lamentable suceso", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:17:13", "owner": "helenaq370", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120226876547536, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:17:05", "owner": "vladimir_ikone_slike", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973128882809896, "text": "💔 çok üzücü", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:16:50", "owner": "hvvnaykan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887963896396918, "text": "😭😢😭😢😭😢😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:16:19", "owner": "balazoblero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066196562623703, "text": "So sad😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:16:14", "owner": "piccolafashionista", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099803134704416, "text": "Meu Deus todo poderoso ampara essas pessoas!🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:15:52", "owner": "ednamariagrangeiro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092568778810187, "text": "😢😢😢😭😭😭😭😭💔💔💔💔💔😢😢😢😢😭😭😭😭💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:15:47", "owner": "melanijagrbac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993708744890761, "text": "💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:15:31", "owner": "yurfavoritelightskinn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056413919644990, "text": "Non seulement ce type de constructions est une aberration, mais personne n'est capable d'éteindre l'incendie.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:15:26", "owner": "stephanekhanos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948749842058574, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:15:11", "owner": "chasechristiian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062637218533925, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:15:10", "owner": "wallyhood_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543067546059583, "text": "Что за сетки зелёные?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:14:56", "owner": "mariannavp7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860576293475615, "text": "🙏💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:14:56", "owner": "princesssneezy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120811372534809, "text": "🇹🇷Geçmiş olsun hong kong😥", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:14:55", "owner": "kml06s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138195229414436, "text": "The fire is still burning; firefighters are still working to extinguish it.🥺God bless🙏 Pray for those affected", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:14:31", "owner": "theninetys.work", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114806266567652, "text": "Prayers to all those affected 🙏❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:14:24", "owner": "tonyblivinlife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081484124150525, "text": "Usare dei canader", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:13:49", "owner": "angelopichichero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072601190197721, "text": "💔💔💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:13:45", "owner": "vansy.b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967678743988524, "text": "Systematic Arson?💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:13:43", "owner": "hemmatyaustin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035340368519985, "text": "بقي الحريق مدة طويلة .لماذا لم تسقط الأبراج مثلما حدث في 11سبتمبر", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:13:41", "owner": "lsydwyjml", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158478781407603, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:13:09", "owner": "sabu1712", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074522966195599, "text": "God hopefully took care of people 🙏.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:12:49", "owner": "kjmiller64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051740492343625, "text": "Dam those firefighters must know what they are doing, just look at those building including those high risers in the background. What caused this tragedy?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:12:21", "owner": "kc29mi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843944320612918, "text": "How did it jump to the next building?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:12:03", "owner": "dedeluxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100340452686959, "text": "Какой ужас 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:11:50", "owner": "myfleetingvision", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902796958297358, "text": "Please explain to me why all the houses burned down, not just one. All of them??\nThis is terrible, my condolences💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:11:43", "owner": "nataleshka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986888709872589, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:11:40", "owner": "mikelinico", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545687845063005, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:11:28", "owner": "fmlynest", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001414469826539, "text": "💔🙏💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:11:20", "owner": "natvgal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866533927505426, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:11:20", "owner": "miquelsoberanas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396350041135180, "text": "🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:11:08", "owner": "lanie.dortmund", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011467367804732, "text": "I thought buildings collapse at free fall from fires?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:10:55", "owner": "jakehanes7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086944948970377, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:10:46", "owner": "lili.batista", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086763160970520, "text": "🥺🥺🥺🥺🥺🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:10:35", "owner": "anamariacroissier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086365733049273, "text": "We Brazilians are very saddened by what happened. May the peace of Buddha always be with you. We love everyone in Hong Kong.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:10:30", "owner": "alexandrederecife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154812433411889, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭 NO WORDS 🫂🫂🫂🫂🥺🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:10:16", "owner": "heathermariejohnston39", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165342409348614, "text": "Big hug", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:10:13", "owner": "admin1307", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063031442392119, "text": "🙏😭🕊️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:09:39", "owner": "madshjorten", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861327499469156, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:09:31", "owner": "alexandrederecife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928403719168970, "text": "😢😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:09:22", "owner": "a.c.k.k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947651326060030, "text": "They haven’t learned from what happened in the UK years ago.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:09:03", "owner": "politicolucy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161105962394876, "text": "They really fuk up the wang", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:08:49", "owner": "tonysviper1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853050793587850, "text": "Господи!!! Який жах!!! І москаля не треба😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:08:46", "owner": "danysya_petryk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18395574643135727, "text": "Looks like a movie set,yikes...", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:07:39", "owner": "chrisandersmartianstudios", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084973157063315, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:06:57", "owner": "bigua_coroa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367791418086585, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:05:55", "owner": "asya_17_44", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084370088107108, "text": "Watch the cameras and find the persons who are responsible.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:05:39", "owner": "airbnb.interlaken", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071770928347231, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:05:37", "owner": "flolucalena", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086103824286153, "text": "Costruite meglio delle torri gemelle!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:05:35", "owner": "santinato.abo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910388317260481, "text": "Does anyone remember what they did to China in 2020! They welded the doors shut and burned at those people up. 😮 this world is evil.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:04:57", "owner": "shellysanchez54", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089913139767561, "text": "7 prédios ao mesmo tempo queimando 🤔😏 tem cheiro de crime premeditado, tenque investigar a fundo isso, pois hoje em dia existem pessoas do ramo imobiliário aplicando este tipo de coisa, ainda mais se for uma área nobre muito cobiçado. Hoje existem crimes em todas áreas.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:04:51", "owner": "osmarhersing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331962844214172, "text": "No sprinklers", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:04:35", "owner": "maximumderekk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296340766257555, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:04:06", "owner": "_kmadeleinems", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084081215083079, "text": "🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:03:41", "owner": "mlhbas1903", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873977275451213, "text": "Unbelievable 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:03:35", "owner": "optimal_dx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071811749357990, "text": "Praying for all those affected by this horrible tragedy.🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:03:27", "owner": "musicfan9999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082017677109330, "text": "Pray for Hk 🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:03:15", "owner": "hillsidegarden11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105695791724777, "text": "This is so sad😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:02:39", "owner": "nicolas_mizuno", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057882503301711, "text": "Bloody hell", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:02:26", "owner": "nwa.1966", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086251568065515, "text": "🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:02:07", "owner": "s1m0ne_magdeburg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068157350379004, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:02:06", "owner": "margaridamfduarte", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396922189127810, "text": "🙏🏽🙏🏽🙏🏽👑👑🕊️♥️🇯🇲", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:01:33", "owner": "chefdelroy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882400774308968, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:01:13", "owner": "joy_247", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922807492048859, "text": "How can a concrete building catch fire like this and spread?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:00:28", "owner": "mishasmamajeannine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069379982094280, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:00:24", "owner": "shapoval4713", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083950285866096, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:00:07", "owner": "guzel6854", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112785448590253, "text": "竹の足場か防護ネットかが火災の広がった原因になっているのはわかるのですが、そもそも何のための足場なのか知りたいです。外壁塗装？？", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:00:06", "owner": "fugunoya_mezashi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066167639627513, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T21:00:02", "owner": "avimatti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18309165784302069, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏😭😭💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:59:58", "owner": "nadenka1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929503810151013, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:59:33", "owner": "charsyiubao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904382842297925, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:59:26", "owner": "leonor_garcia27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901781110302167, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:59:23", "owner": "gabrinini", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933244363111395, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:59:12", "owner": "maurizia_durigon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18370796374156968, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:59:04", "owner": "antonio.semeraro.5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985570374916364, "text": "❤️🙏😢omg....", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:59:04", "owner": "pipusch17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545504806006186, "text": "我记得前几年香港好像也有一栋大楼着火了是吧😭 希望伤亡不要太多", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:58:46", "owner": "hruna_sa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18339936547239754, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:58:39", "owner": "sachinkahar_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18426274483119932, "text": "🙏💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:58:33", "owner": "paolathorpe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133934083478638, "text": "🙏🙏🙏😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:58:15", "owner": "basharwalter77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18549943543045993, "text": "How many people were killed?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:58:12", "owner": "dannygrantland", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032302244737427, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:57:43", "owner": "mega.projectsclt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084915359070972, "text": "Pareciera IA. Imposible imaginar una escena real así", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:57:34", "owner": "ana1sauza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088589476940094, "text": "一人でも多くの方が助かりますように。亡くなられた方の御魂安らかなれ。", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:57:28", "owner": "koki_tanaka2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972654258967308, "text": "Flammable scaffolding…bamboo? The actual fuck….", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:57:17", "owner": "jasonvorva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051544667663443, "text": "😭😢😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:57:09", "owner": "eugeniusz.bujak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051939389342030, "text": "Deus abençoe Hong Kong, ficamos triste aqui no Brasil pela tragédia 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:56:39", "owner": "deise_istefane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067048202419729, "text": "65 pessoas vieram a óbitos pelo que foi anunciado . Duas pessoas do construtora foram presos por homicídio culposo . O complexo Residecial com 8 edifícios passava por reformas e foi deixado matérias infláveis no local que causou o incêndio . Quanta tristeza . Dor no coração ! Deus conforte os enlutamos 🙏🇧🇷🇧🇷🇧🇷🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:56:22", "owner": "evanir.2309", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111540376594974, "text": "It didnt collapse? Weird ..||..", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:56:19", "owner": "tokonwicki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089047261941813, "text": "You would think it would be poor planning to build living quarters above reach of fire department without built in protections. 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:56:16", "owner": "simpleman7709", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092114155924808, "text": "Vraiment triste tout ça 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:55:51", "owner": "frank.des.bois", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862431478536947, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:55:51", "owner": "arian__87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971200599980993, "text": "Cheap China built no fire protection  materials", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:55:40", "owner": "alex33of907", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033839126528171, "text": "No words can describe this horrific incident for those who are accountable and those who loss their lives in this tragedy. My heart goes out to the families during this most difficult time being so closed to Christmas.  My heart weeps ,absolutely heart shattering 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:55:12", "owner": "dreamweaver_10_88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867419155499082, "text": "Imagine it's America.  The buildings will collapse.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:54:56", "owner": "zzzd.7210048", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868060429495012, "text": "Wonder if those are those infamous cage apartments??", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:54:35", "owner": "georgew70", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161629636396485, "text": "No jet fuel, no insurance...", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:54:12", "owner": "supertump", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074018900192952, "text": "The poor dog. The owner who wanted to save his dog 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:53:54", "owner": "leeza_pizza_c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085588879840060, "text": "🥺🥺🥺🥺🥺😢😢😢😢😢🙏🙏🙏🙏❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:53:32", "owner": "____.mony.___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088162099939133, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:52:53", "owner": "coutycatherine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085115641838291, "text": "How can 6 tower burn in same time?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:52:34", "owner": "gurangak.09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18206722027315947, "text": "Бедные люди!!! Память погибшим, и здоровья выжившим!!! Такое горе!!!!🙏🙏🙏😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:52:31", "owner": "kartashovatatiana80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134083063488163, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:52:13", "owner": "raisota", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909971800254115, "text": "How sad", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:52:11", "owner": "raisota", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917143072216446, "text": "I’m sad that the people who died there but the building didn’t went all the way down like for example the twin towers", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:52:09", "owner": "thebeauminater", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859428820553211, "text": "Praying for HongKong", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:51:54", "owner": "alm.7as", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078715204938958, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:51:33", "owner": "caring_ur_bag", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106070341712899, "text": "😞💔🇧🇷", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:51:27", "owner": "ana_bialavi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084016333843598, "text": "OMG😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:50:57", "owner": "crishu64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18326315242300281, "text": "Je crois que j’ai jamais vu des choses aussi terrible", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:50:31", "owner": "husky_of_black_orlov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087036415956952, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:50:17", "owner": "edxhxe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918035881218602, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:49:48", "owner": "_.gabrielopez._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983774967764055, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:49:32", "owner": "maytexusonia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867912466488877, "text": "how did the exterior envelope burn? the hell are using ? cant burn densglass", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:49:03", "owner": "mtlchronix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901085107322838, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:48:05", "owner": "dancer.bonnie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119072266557392, "text": "Arretez de construire des tours !!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:47:58", "owner": "rgene66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047491388441211, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:47:49", "owner": "el_viajero.1976", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18106161082715626, "text": "What a horrible fire. Prayers for those who passed and the families that they left behind. 🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:47:46", "owner": "alicealvarez587", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858303169557933, "text": "Eine Katastrophe. Ich hoffe es konnten viele gerettet werden. 😭😭🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:47:37", "owner": "bonobo3046", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304446532268187, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:47:07", "owner": "kimm.02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863980891518774, "text": "Somebody needed to clear the space for a new construction it seems… So atrocious and evil!!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:47:07", "owner": "anushka7o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128678320498957, "text": "Will the Chinese admit how many really died?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:47:02", "owner": "shio_838", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18339669703233520, "text": "💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:46:55", "owner": "makidaraemusic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965311956844850, "text": "Schrecklich", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:46:37", "owner": "kautzi8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063961076530012, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:46:16", "owner": "vibratman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881384284424581, "text": "This is no way for anyone to die. 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:46:05", "owner": "markmontanaphoto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18393755905179795, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:45:50", "owner": "bulutyoutube2017", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138175261459589, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:45:47", "owner": "yeliz_karayagiz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094630912848663, "text": "❤️❤️🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:45:42", "owner": "caterinagarceadesumma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057982778295257, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:45:29", "owner": "alexandralarapena", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18378661573145333, "text": "Bamboo scaffolding and nets…….", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:45:25", "owner": "nateportr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882239407311277, "text": "But how did these buildings burn all around and didn't fall like 911", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:45:08", "owner": "wizeleeroy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058488842641217, "text": "Гноцид😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:44:42", "owner": "lidiia.280panera", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080639825128473, "text": "خدا یاخودت کمکشون کن 🙏💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:44:16", "owner": "jahanhasti333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852973354589905, "text": "😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:44:05", "owner": "la_senora_de_las_tazas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082661471115706, "text": "🥺🥺🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:43:49", "owner": "acevedo.yias", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092727769934913, "text": "Sehen aus wie Räucherstäbchen", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:43:34", "owner": "fjal_raven", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088122452297130, "text": "Dört tane koskoca bina 4 birden nasıl yanıyor onu çözemedim", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:43:31", "owner": "muratarslannnnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083418023022753, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:43:30", "owner": "thu_vu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946235431077887, "text": "Very sad day indeed. Prayers go out to all the families and people involved. 🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:43:09", "owner": "lxandrthegr8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888893935385506, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:41:53", "owner": "wanda.tramy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024813173592592, "text": "🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:41:32", "owner": "jujacomel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919572508195454, "text": "Wang da Fuk what a name", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:40:37", "owner": "bastiaan_rh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134634817476548, "text": "💔💪🏼👪🙏🏼🕊🇧🇷💪🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:40:03", "owner": "andreluiznunes_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18001742645686032, "text": "كيف يسكنون في مبان قيد الإصلاح", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:39:59", "owner": "yar320021", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056605724308788, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:39:42", "owner": "corzovalderrama", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184171939349264, "text": "Desperately sad😢 I remember seeing Grenfell Tower the day after. A horrendous tragedy that I wouldn’t wish on anybody", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:38:58", "owner": "nick_of_vauxhall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080727749154447, "text": "💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:38:42", "owner": "elegant_._house", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073656161028018, "text": "How it’s happened 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:38:35", "owner": "topal.katerina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932559306997980, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:38:15", "owner": "akinola_t_r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133872229478231, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:38:01", "owner": "witty1515", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049086131407353, "text": "They didn't collapse", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:37:43", "owner": "the_taos_cat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094479331919271, "text": "🙏😭this is definitely contractors fault,  concrete or metal don't burn like that 🥺😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:37:40", "owner": "poppawingz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102098323669190, "text": "So very horrible 💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:37:36", "owner": "kirosbt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144276028449760, "text": "Most of these skyscrapers are uninhabited or uninhabitable. Most are cracking and falling apart. I certainly hope there was no one in these.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:37:32", "owner": "brody23434", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854527756576936, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:37:26", "owner": "klarabibrova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890158354381697, "text": "Sending love and strenght to all people and animals involved", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:37:18", "owner": "irene_timmers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542342224063172, "text": "❤️🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:37:12", "owner": "manucaru62", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18435624787101315, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:37:01", "owner": "4lm4_m4m3l4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072625874199292, "text": "Ay Dios", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:36:51", "owner": "karinacastillo2525", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18211041406313627, "text": "🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:36:23", "owner": "deise_carla_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879423307429369, "text": "This is so horrible. Regardless of which country we come from this is sad.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:36:16", "owner": "johatsu_lone_wolf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915529678227423, "text": "Como isso aconteceu?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:35:35", "owner": "suzybastoss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936732717982995, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:35:25", "owner": "deise_carla_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882389482309249, "text": "一体何人犠牲になったんだ", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:35:23", "owner": "santorinity", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099343741774412, "text": "People were there? Oh my God i thought these were under construction..", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:35:17", "owner": "kauserbilal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032797406725432, "text": "💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:34:54", "owner": "zaara__hussaini", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092123237509152, "text": "😢😢😢💔💔🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:34:52", "owner": "jayj127", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088772111297689, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:34:51", "owner": "micky___backham", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930588106346190, "text": "🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:34:22", "owner": "ka.rine50400", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084610799286761, "text": "What all buildings burn at same time", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:34:09", "owner": "kauserbilal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977190342951343, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:34:07", "owner": "_mimosa_mei_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980601180778096, "text": "Dios mío que horror 🙏, todo mi cariño al pueblo de Hong Kong💔. Siempre es lo mismo, la gente menos pudiente víctimas de los que no tienen escrúpulos.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:33:56", "owner": "dulceimpresion.oficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860387305544042, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:33:56", "owner": "ingridmota1202", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011045405645399, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:33:54", "owner": "cathy_samii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052402805654476, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:33:04", "owner": "oyarzo.vallejos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18419586610118452, "text": "🥺😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:32:15", "owner": "marciab.o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301065520258500, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:32:15", "owner": "farhad__340", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080252891164883, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:32:14", "owner": "avashmonir.yazdani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073074224212528, "text": "Im praying for all affected by this horrible tragedy. Words can't describe", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:31:59", "owner": "ar4971502", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843734332622272, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:31:17", "owner": "daybottelho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031174772542114, "text": "One firehouse per building? Where is the rest? Is Hong gong so under prepared?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:30:58", "owner": "brenmw61", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049313438409490, "text": "😮😮😮🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:30:48", "owner": "will_i_am_hamburg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862881067458908, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:30:39", "owner": "marekb58", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079069412138467, "text": "9/11 in Hongkong", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:30:15", "owner": "andrew_kzbzn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061104290545485, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:30:14", "owner": "persiancat_mouca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978495516931461, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:30:03", "owner": "karasucihangir57", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541484275048468, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:29:36", "owner": "ali_hn88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902785693165796, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:29:32", "owner": "deise.vittone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854574184578195, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:29:29", "owner": "samsonovaasya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102980791678982, "text": "😮😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:29:22", "owner": "mu.nisa8783", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049732916391371, "text": "Wie löscht man bitte die oberen Etagen?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:29:02", "owner": "lowe_fee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542606062052007, "text": "Muita tristeza 💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:29:01", "owner": "ginaborgo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070797536593927, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:28:51", "owner": "kubbieherselff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093371275903195, "text": "Pobre gente", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:28:43", "owner": "tatymandi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095967460885481, "text": "😢", "created_at": "