T20:22:11", "owner": "rodriguez.christelle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183312142346726, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:22:02", "owner": "mariajosecordeiro2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086356277054798, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:21:38", "owner": "ranieteata", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844956631617908, "text": "Za tydzień postawią nowe", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:21:08", "owner": "no_adam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074049890194100, "text": "NO FIRE ALARMS??? NO ESCAPE ROUTE??? WHO BUILT THESE MONTERS???💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:21:05", "owner": "heidi.hyde.fenolio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867662056497324, "text": "😭😭😭🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:20:03", "owner": "latte__love0418", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916087174229727, "text": "Essas pessoas viviam de maneira horrível, melhor viver na rua 😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:19:47", "owner": "benedettiecleia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075828263234853, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:19:06", "owner": "natsanatty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101417953665095, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:19:05", "owner": "irmas_cake", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926504056029696, "text": "Господи😭😭😭это страшно.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:19:04", "owner": "nail_saroyan.marine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338143702238185, "text": "Looks like parachute is the only way out from the top.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:18:58", "owner": "swordfish_2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987784281863577, "text": "😭💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:18:54", "owner": "niwinskhy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864335797521504, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:18:52", "owner": "maccaang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843955333612228, "text": "Tem que eliminar boa parte da civilização do mundo", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:18:49", "owner": "mariamorales5274", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909773041256480, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:18:18", "owner": "aliceleeconnelly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099350434814276, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:18:05", "owner": "aliceleeconnelly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882259006421894, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:17:38", "owner": "innulia83", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18230750353306227, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:17:27", "owner": "beatr.iz0821", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023410916597728, "text": "Some one  won't the  land 😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:17:22", "owner": "tj72pyner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113809084599743, "text": "Who lost... 💔Jane", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:17:13", "owner": "andymontonen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18247158292295010, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:17:10", "owner": "benstravelstories", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142292623454884, "text": "This is terrifying...prayers and tears for these beautiful people. How money because more important than human life is sickening.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:17:06", "owner": "nannie__ed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846799552611595, "text": "💔💔💔💔 Praying 🙏 for all those people... and pets who list their life 💔💔💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏 Jane", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:16:54", "owner": "andymontonen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847486186610104, "text": "This is horrible. Hope everyone is ok", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:16:52", "owner": "kathy_wecare", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057508106288139, "text": "May God bless them and comfort them 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:16:11", "owner": "jonathanlee168", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074973560340271, "text": "😮😮😮😮😮😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:15:58", "owner": "marcelorubensalinas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542199457041312, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:15:52", "owner": "aloona_17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129517045499403, "text": "😢🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:15:44", "owner": "laura.fur.3511", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085040906095139, "text": "😢😢😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:15:44", "owner": "baaslantepe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980535609936130, "text": "Que horror por.Dios mucha luz para esas almas", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:15:37", "owner": "sandrairabel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895632892357965, "text": "I don't understand how it went from one building to another? It horrific . Was it started deliberately", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:15:02", "owner": "nannyswish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062488685628999, "text": "🥺🥺🥺🥺💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:14:22", "owner": "fa_tima9543_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18390180367176964, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:14:13", "owner": "manon.chaput.90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128424529500478, "text": "O gökdelenleri inşaat ederken nasıl müdahale edileceğini de düşünseniz bu kadar cm kaybı olmzdi 🤲😥", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:13:51", "owner": "ce.ylan9390", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096077980798728, "text": "😢😢😢💔💔🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:13:44", "owner": "yoliconstanza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088602445785591, "text": "Right now would be a good time for them to get some rain to help out with the fire! The safety measures required the building to use fire proof netting during construction, but construction company decided to save money and their crews thought it would be fine to smoke and toss cigarette bud without putting out it. The fire started at a very low level, but the buildings have not been properly maintained that they basically have no fire alarm to help its residents. China wanted to claim Hong Kong back but instead of sending help and resources from inland, Xi is only sending his condolences, what a joke!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:13:37", "owner": "aibstaples", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397929745135057, "text": "Соболезную, это трагедия для всех родных и близких 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:13:13", "owner": "ninawn28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923060167190634, "text": "one cigarette 🚬🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:12:47", "owner": "djanabayev_dj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981232260924250, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢i hurt for you!!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:12:34", "owner": "mimi_larosa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932974411159889, "text": "Planned. I can see it a mile away. Not even firefighters on sight.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:12:29", "owner": "nazarethmarie333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062522822555916, "text": "南無阿彌陀佛", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:12:28", "owner": "xinfuchen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976194057794972, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:11:58", "owner": "placidocasado", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971812911973419, "text": "Prayers for Hong Kong 🙏❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:11:36", "owner": "liftwithlala", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994239417894300, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:11:08", "owner": "christinecc1234", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113972206584735, "text": "😭😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:10:36", "owner": "vivianeleemans", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353549632164668, "text": "They are going to have a hell of a time scrubbing those carbon burn stains off of brick", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:10:34", "owner": "jayreech13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047029994457013, "text": "Que Deus conforte o coração dessas famílias 🙏🖤", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:09:42", "owner": "anaclaudiakosteski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543411496019520, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:09:28", "owner": "manuelguedes341", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872117023464984, "text": "Ezek a házak most épültek,vagy már laktak benne emberek ?😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:08:24", "owner": "jankikrisztina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990509136734409, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:08:05", "owner": "azek1478", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968388396979518, "text": "自然災害でもないし、人災なのか？てまも、なんでこんなに燃えたんだ？いくらなんでも燃えすぎやろ。", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:08:00", "owner": "crapos_2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084553858845071, "text": "😭🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:07:54", "owner": "_johan_430", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989473566740465, "text": "😢💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:07:52", "owner": "dqsisonveron", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18162357457395800, "text": "hongkong is a beautiful city.but now……😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:07:26", "owner": "lzw13172750579", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021403268607627, "text": "Unbelievable loss😭🙏.. God help the families involved", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:07:25", "owner": "oziomajesuloba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18395285971132121, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:07:18", "owner": "leovir_usa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124983772512239, "text": "こんなデカい建物側数棟も一度に燃えたんかぁ！", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:07:06", "owner": "crapos_2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843878458615173, "text": "Çok geçmiş olsun🥲 Hongkong için dua ediyorum 😢🤲🤲", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:06:25", "owner": "bond_aktor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079180201917404, "text": "🙏😢😢😢❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:05:47", "owner": "judithstieger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109758898528602, "text": "😭💔🤲", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:05:45", "owner": "erpulatismail", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951491026027014, "text": "💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:05:33", "owner": "maminzivot", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18065000705627554, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:05:17", "owner": "zei2a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096353101846452, "text": "Prayers with all. This is heartbreaking. Now they need to watch for some of the towers collapsing :(", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:05:14", "owner": "maba9955", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926330230160203, "text": "🙏just horrible prayers 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:04:48", "owner": "tania.h.nicholson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905520910146693, "text": "Omg, unbeleivable. So many missing. Heartfelt sympathy.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:03:57", "owner": "jojaphillin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115940524571211, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:03:55", "owner": "bruleepants_ames", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936726228984569, "text": "My condolences to everyone affected by this tragedy! It's terrible, may your souls be strengthened and overcome this grief💔😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:03:21", "owner": "hochykeksa_mersin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052121429679801, "text": "Cadê os Drones??", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:03:19", "owner": "franciscocecon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546265303041878, "text": "🙏💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:03:15", "owner": "spanielsnbully", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18316396648220049, "text": "Insurance scam.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:03:14", "owner": "mike_d_808", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071470550355218, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:03:09", "owner": "anaacero2023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993370341853520, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:03:04", "owner": "lucieloewenherz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058643915297929, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏💔💔💔💔💔💔😭😭😭🥺🥺😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:02:59", "owner": "kay21983", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999358296691618, "text": "Isn't this, 6 or 7 buildings? 😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:02:43", "owner": "siberianknight0143", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908117905281029, "text": "Did they use bamboo scaffolding?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:02:43", "owner": "carl_2662", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069182762382150, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:02:37", "owner": "john.wonggg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072545216042480, "text": "Sigan armando andamios con bambú !…", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:02:27", "owner": "javierortega.jorda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353411437202317, "text": "Как это возможно в наше время!!!! поджог сколько домов в один миг, это спланированное все. Спасайте тех, кто там ещё остался.😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:02:24", "owner": "queen_margo62", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542324590055105, "text": "We need to know who done this and why", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:01:54", "owner": "liammc1977", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120622969556797, "text": "Not to mention all the poor dogs and cats and small pets people would've had in these apartments that had no way out. The people would  be devastated 😭 I can't even imagine..I can't 😔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:01:51", "owner": "jacquelineleslie75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126653731505770, "text": "Oh nooo.... poor people...", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:01:35", "owner": "art.and.logic.interiors", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874619452448616, "text": "How can several separate detached buildings go on fire at same time, absolutely impossible in every way", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:01:28", "owner": "liammc1977", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080765561153102, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:01:27", "owner": "vickiandrews229", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012447680641241, "text": "I am so sad for everyone and this is why I don't live in a highrise. 😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:01:25", "owner": "beaniesable", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18210308827311146, "text": "😮😮😮😮😮😮a complete disaster 🥺🥺🥺🥺. And just think of how many people this will make homeless 🥺🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:01:20", "owner": "siberianknight0143", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140239807456922, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:01:19", "owner": "_shiva_ji_54_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072341306200135, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:00:47", "owner": "francoiscourbey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027175820782033, "text": "Que tristeza por todos los daños muertos y desaparecidos... 🥺🥺🥺Lo siento mucho porque amo Japón 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:00:44", "owner": "mariaisabeltham", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863696599531512, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:00:43", "owner": "theresastradford", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089012254949151, "text": "Ese es el gran problema de los edificios altos, deben tener su propio sistema contra incendios, porque los carros bomba no llegan tan alto.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:00:13", "owner": "orlandomoreno297", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546061168030139, "text": "Huge sacrifice", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:59:51", "owner": "niqqawoodz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086976889794686, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏Hong Kong", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:59:42", "owner": "dawn_baillie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18390384805180773, "text": "Что послужило причиной пожара?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:59:38", "owner": "testuser13384", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998410473843439, "text": "Cena de filme de terror, q desespero 😭😭💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:58:59", "owner": "frnalva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18166971871376668, "text": "💔💔💔😭🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:58:40", "owner": "lourdes_5420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854068726536244, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:58:38", "owner": "amit2bar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545202493063833, "text": "🙏🏻❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:58:28", "owner": "strachan26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074007635201688, "text": "Oh man this is so sad, I feel for all those people that are now homeless or have lost someone. And the ones that died geez that is tragic 😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:58:25", "owner": "jacquelineleslie75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923371534187318, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:58:23", "owner": "yankiboy84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057769622636715, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:58:16", "owner": "gradjanskiforumcukarica", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089655994983766, "text": "😢🥺😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:58:11", "owner": "612.juliana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957705655037292, "text": "Damn", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:58:00", "owner": "duspmeante", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154594681416580, "text": "🙏Let us Pray there are more Survivors 🙏😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:57:30", "owner": "ehallinan64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058097747299089, "text": "I wonder if the real cause for this will be \"swept under the rug\" like the murderers of Yu Menglong.  Justice seems to be a foreign concept there.  #justiceforyumenglong", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:57:11", "owner": "pattigaugler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855550867522861, "text": "How did they all catch fire - i1 block still standing g out of 8.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:57:02", "owner": "valeriesewell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064318670175499, "text": "Where we're all the firefighting drones?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:56:47", "owner": "robertpalm22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087495139814681, "text": "Agar devoring shishadan bo'lsa unga tosh otma🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:56:28", "owner": "_rajapboyev_d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084394532038148, "text": "Murdered purposely to build new one charge more money and replace next batch", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:56:26", "owner": "louis__doin__shit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176870524363864, "text": "This is very similar to Grenfell Tower fire", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:56:20", "owner": "prendergast2067", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182776204347409, "text": "😭💔🙏horrible descansen en paz los q estubieron ahí no pudieron salir fortaleza para toda la familia", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:56:14", "owner": "margarita.rosa.5209", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18414817858140312, "text": "🙏🏾", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:56:00", "owner": "mz.hydepark", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074000951601853, "text": "How strange! They burn for more tome than the tein towers in NYC and did not fell! Hmm somthing fishywent on on 9/11.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:55:58", "owner": "gatoviudo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103000477677039, "text": "Feel so sad. 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:55:22", "owner": "alexw.616", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161557807358224, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏😢😢😢😢🇺🇿🇺🇿", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:55:20", "owner": "imenem____", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059507444642545, "text": "😭😭😭😭💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:55:14", "owner": "amparormarcs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945210457073240, "text": "💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:54:55", "owner": "diegobragateixeira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847506883609793, "text": "😮😮😮😢😢😢😢😢😢🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:54:44", "owner": "wijnanslambert", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18555746425001575, "text": "High density housing is dumb- increased risk of fire per household, less room, more noise and light pollution. Humans need space, nature and tranquility for health too- not just wild animals.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:54:43", "owner": "__smalltown", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098341312841156, "text": "😢It's good that the fire was extinguished. So many people died. A terrible tragedy.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:54:33", "owner": "monic.ja", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061574402445004, "text": "🇭🇰💔🙏🥀🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:53:39", "owner": "hsyrhb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075052601221590, "text": "What the Wang Fuk?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:53:34", "owner": "m.bowdrring", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320835664222291, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:53:08", "owner": "lamegram_10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18373998244152014, "text": "Where’s the drone that shoots Water they were showing off?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:52:45", "owner": "daywillz_towz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934450126108571, "text": "😮😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:52:39", "owner": "sima___3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066903701525778, "text": "🥺🥺🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:52:38", "owner": "sumraneeta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062221211207590, "text": "Сабыр берсин елдерінне🥺😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:52:30", "owner": "gaihan42", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077294149966079, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:52:26", "owner": "treasurenut55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095155303894627, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:52:22", "owner": "simone_sl_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915514009090463, "text": "😢😢😢😢🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:52:20", "owner": "scorefice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18347211229205976, "text": "China is careless with HK people...", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:52:09", "owner": "cordelia_ornella", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048774899675048, "text": "😢😢💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:52:08", "owner": "llluuuunna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121305760476310, "text": "😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:52:05", "owner": "santiago_rojas990", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066293027421830, "text": "Que tristeza 😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:52:04", "owner": "regina.nasimoto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171775708375261, "text": "Why didn’t they use drones?????", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:52:01", "owner": "msh_mosha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865534558433937, "text": "🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:51:57", "owner": "nathy.dpy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852597142589254, "text": "Misericórdia", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:51:49", "owner": "ariarafrancada", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080445842132678, "text": "May Allah help in sha Allah, I feel sorry for people.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:51:47", "owner": "zaira_9595_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932815024000281, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:51:37", "owner": "_jalilov.official_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111669874592548, "text": "Gosh 😢it’s like Grenfell in London few years ago💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:51:36", "owner": "more_issues_than_vogue85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153661513419735, "text": "Dogu Türkistanın ahı mı", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:51:27", "owner": "nese_2852", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062242598203201, "text": "Whats sad is all those people are now homeless.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:51:16", "owner": "tabcatimewaister", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990900582903227, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:50:53", "owner": "desjardinsl583", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18088150583491475, "text": "Meu Deus 💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:50:49", "owner": "iveteoliveira.2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931054636117287, "text": "Time to get rid of the bamboo scaffolding", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:50:22", "owner": "up_yours_truly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084296141047250, "text": "That has to the most horrific fire I've seen on tv. It looked apocalyptic in nature. 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:50:02", "owner": "haru880", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047808839431582, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:49:53", "owner": "esila_nazo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061348727445302, "text": "🥺🥺🥺🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:49:46", "owner": "hopetown700", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056471138644502, "text": "It was bad enough that one building went up, but 3 more were destroyed because of the bamboo scaffolding surrounding them all. Construction safety in China is back in the dark ages.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:49:17", "owner": "jcpd_2nd_pct", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081331847149754, "text": "😮😮😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:49:04", "owner": "iain.yorke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145313815432155, "text": "Bamboo scaffolding fish netting !😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:48:58", "owner": "markc5212", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547361737023966, "text": "難無阿彌陀佛🙏願逝者安息🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:48:54", "owner": "snoopy12345659", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048198623430591, "text": "😭😭💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:48:53", "owner": "sarah_salahuddin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951698863046212, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️god help them", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:48:33", "owner": "pinathetabbymix_x", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18089382679944717, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:48:24", "owner": "c__vlk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074387852339834, "text": "Toutes non condoléances pour les victimes 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:48:07", "owner": "patrickpamart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966410871994847, "text": "💔😭Que horror pobre gente , de verdad que hay personas sin corazón como hacen eso donde hay niños que son inocentes de todo lo que pasa 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:47:56", "owner": "mantonietatg2120", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101051923738861, "text": "Destroy this building s scary", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:47:15", "owner": "kulas_ni_piro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111068092608277, "text": "Flammable mesh and bamboo 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:46:28", "owner": "integragsx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077584358221159, "text": "먼가 영상은 다 AI같네", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:46:27", "owner": "grimgood7", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17849727432565863, "text": "who in their right minds would taught that bamboo scaffolding was a great idea?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:46:21", "owner": "raulbila95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028158611567965, "text": "Poor pets!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:45:58", "owner": "24_8laker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862451632460325, "text": "😢😢😢😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:45:54", "owner": "insidelooktvmagazine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376192762156407, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢💔💔💔💔😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:45:44", "owner": "aida_accessoriess", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080300870135213, "text": "Why are these buildings occupied?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:45:43", "owner": "jesse_mowles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989591508739413, "text": "Это не 2010 год?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:45:38", "owner": "littlechampssm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101448193607691, "text": "😢😢Çok büyük geçmiş olsun. 🥺nasıl bukadar büyüdü bu yangın 🥺Ölenlere Allah rahmet etsin 🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:45:34", "owner": "serpil.obuz.9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906950641290831, "text": "So sad 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:45:12", "owner": "beausf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008296193654055, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:44:59", "owner": "mldramsterdam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18340405738226335, "text": "Trop serré.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:44:48", "owner": "basset_christian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926154448168462, "text": "💔😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:44:38", "owner": "selda_gzltnc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080307374174935, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:44:37", "owner": "carolina_zh_c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18389116792181069, "text": "🙏🙏🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:44:29", "owner": "rynan7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954355683902283, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:44:29", "owner": "dijanakawel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18371696764155717, "text": "Çok üzücü bir olay ve üzgünüm. Hayatını kaybedenlerin mekanı cennet olsun, sevenlerine sabırlar diliyorum. 🙏🏻🕊️ Tüm yaralılara acil şifalar diliyorum.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:43:52", "owner": "irondeep528", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027302315777417, "text": "So sad and scary", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:43:43", "owner": "allison_rose_atelier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138386464458512, "text": "This is absolutely horrible.😢😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:43:39", "owner": "memnetab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029291045755455, "text": "Les lances sont loin d'atteindre le haut des immeubles. Comme quoi c'est plutôt dangereux de construire des tours si hautes.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:43:16", "owner": "lepotagerdekatou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094922923891610, "text": "😭😭💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:43:14", "owner": "melda_inmelda", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084180221079329, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:42:35", "owner": "ivanad2412", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068649236610521, "text": "😞", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:42:30", "owner": "melissapearlsmith", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874734775449863, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:42:25", "owner": "monica.nogueira.52493", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092010445930073, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:42:05", "owner": "ali_sorosh_2020", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048241400429530, "text": "🥺🥺😭😭😢😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:42:05", "owner": "se24235", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18420035467140688, "text": "點住吖而家？", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:41:36", "owner": "cestcool02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929467429152935, "text": "Really awful. So much heartbreak", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:41:07", "owner": "ickpa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071633348340618, "text": "Vraiment des immeubles en carton", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:40:56", "owner": "david4645905", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076631981185283, "text": "God bless Tai Po 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:40:48", "owner": "tor_make_record", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155603497412736, "text": "😢好惨…希望受伤嘅人好快好翻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:40:47", "owner": "lzzyhuang0415", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18292345633276839, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:40:46", "owner": "laurencegalaup", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861294295540876, "text": "😭😭😭🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:40:26", "owner": "zbelkis2020", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088185061987765, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:40:07", "owner": "adrien751", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079222478231321, "text": "💔💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:39:27", "owner": "sylviehavre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085120934288356, "text": "Sem palavras! Angustiante ver que o pior dos piores aconteceu... 😭😭😭💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:39:26", "owner": "cris_floripa3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027638729773050, "text": "🙏🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:39:24", "owner": "izzy_king07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973144014805758, "text": "Mamma mia 😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:39:04", "owner": "blabla.bijoux", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104480125657785, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:39:01", "owner": "christophepobelle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053368046339442, "text": "Wang fuk", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:38:38", "owner": "nikostarlet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337795657227902, "text": "What happened?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:38:22", "owner": "whal.e_520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18412135156184645, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔😢🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:38:15", "owner": "simplyabrooks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987231990909903, "text": "Tragic... See the flames ascending through the entire structure from near the base is horrifying.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:38:15", "owner": "darrynmccutcheon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18514879927067783, "text": "😥😥😥😥😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:38:08", "owner": "lima_rj702", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892527124366571, "text": "Wat een ramp😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:38:06", "owner": "shirleylove2210", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051131624378015, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:38:03", "owner": "c.s.l_daniel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18335638564235527, "text": "Pray for Hk", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:38:02", "owner": "aex_pn", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17895001629357078, "text": "💔🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:38:02", "owner": "steladragon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860108869545925, "text": "Bamboo, polystyrene and other flammable materials are to blame for this tragedy along with couples individuals responsable for the renovation?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:37:48", "owner": "georgi.k987", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069210503381640, "text": "\"fire\" burning for 3hrs took down 9/11, these burnt for a day and it's still standing?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:37:41", "owner": "krank.kai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18163916254391043, "text": "Horrible!!!💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:37:33", "owner": "khoserabian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051466067354034, "text": "Courage  aux  sauveteurs  une  catastrophe 🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:37:25", "owner": "christelledessenne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892807039367365, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:37:04", "owner": "cuarto.obscuro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096536554865393, "text": "Such a terrible tragedy god bless you all 🥹🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:36:35", "owner": "7685yogi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067502894456021, "text": "Thats tragic 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:36:32", "owner": "solveigsvensson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041817365499549, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:35:57", "owner": "iam.tinamarie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877586311435523, "text": "Horrific 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:35:48", "owner": "mims_nykerk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960154156007309, "text": "Quando la realtà supera la funzione..", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:35:43", "owner": "paulinho2474", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086337476083163, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:35:38", "owner": "dmmateja", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154639633417335, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:35:37", "owner": "dvshukan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088415894064500, "text": "😭💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:35:12", "owner": "krysboj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094278397861041, "text": "🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:35:01", "owner": "mar.tinchen67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108269755622265, "text": "Interesting they didn’t collapse 😏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:34:22", "owner": "mapchaser_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113774119575027, "text": "🙏🇭🇰", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:34:20", "owner": "manuel.kreatividad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114765616504409, "text": "Wang fuk 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:33:57", "owner": "tj2913000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882689764307318, "text": "Aun no entiendo como se propago tan rápido este  incendio.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:33:53", "owner": "erikaalva1908", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064512386403823, "text": "55 people lost their lives.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:33:03", "owner": "lhatter82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001484174685926, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:32:54", "owner": "muuperezz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856682449511131, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:32:47", "owner": "myroslava_moldavchuk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070726511523014, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:32:31", "owner": "tcemine_ozdemir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093954076708628, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:32:26", "owner": "kim.491981", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120245215537041, "text": "😭😭😭😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:32:08", "owner": "dadika30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063875672407771, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:31:47", "owner": "shoppie_apj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035503283720746, "text": "My lord. 💔😭 These poor people", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:31:42", "owner": "lostdreamz84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082202162472197, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:31:30", "owner": "jeffreyjean", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842043859633739, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:31:12", "owner": "bahhyt.bakhyt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992004912886833, "text": "So damn sad. My deepest condolences to the Family and Friends. 😭💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:31:06", "owner": "eec93nat99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076517044981461, "text": "Será construído prédios novos e com valores exorbitantes ,vidas seifadas pela ganância humana , lamentável.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:30:44", "owner": "garimpandoofertasrs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023860922599091, "text": "They certainly named the building aptly! They are Wang Fuk’d. Hope they all got out OK.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:30:26", "owner": "hans.hart.35", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18437118079101141, "text": "all these under construction?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:30:23", "owner": "markb7030", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18375037402154773, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:30:13", "owner": "valenbarbi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902956831300870, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:30:10", "owner": "maomaochuuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864395578514964, "text": "🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:30:10", "owner": "cleverxavier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049433684673779, "text": "Prob due to flammable cladding. Cant be just the bamboo ladders", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:30:02", "owner": "jan_hauke13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017180153621804, "text": "😨🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:29:51", "owner": "aywongqingyun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081324818327173, "text": "pray for HK🙏🏻\nhope my friends n former coworkers stay safe from the fire", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:29:42", "owner": "steve_seong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029023832558587, "text": "No way to escape.. So sad🙏🥺💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:29:29", "owner": "juanita_yankee_c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084397685035919, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:29:15", "owner": "rosannawang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866835619427224, "text": "wasnt this place abandoned?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:29:13", "owner": "030_don", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140719870454719, "text": "83people died including one fire fighters.. 279people missing..many residents are still trapped inside the flats including babies, women, the elders and pets", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:29:03", "owner": "susannalamfacebook", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033637628527650, "text": "Another Grenfell Tower multiplied - omg", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:28:52", "owner": "thebookofremembrance", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085759052007366, "text": "🙏🌟🕯️💫💫🕯️🌟🌟🌟🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:28:46", "owner": "audrey.zian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095379571842294, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:28:42", "owner": "maykalves92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090767225504317, "text": "NOT the bamboo scaffolding but the flammable safety net but corruption..>> it's not the bamboo scaffolding that was on fire.  it's those flammable wrapping nets.. supposed they should be fire resistant but those greedy and shameful construction company changed to an flammable one.. they received all the money from all the residents totalled 0.3Billion Hong Kong dollars.. but still they changed to a cheap flammable nets.  Only when people died and the Police started to arrest the directors of the construction company.. isn't it too late. \nNo innocent people should be losing lives due to these stupid  mistakes by the selfish people.\n😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:28:34", "owner": "susannalamfacebook", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074074898363602, "text": "😢💔🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:28:12", "owner": "debralfaria__57", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155466616409761, "text": "Spectacular", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:27:39", "owner": "tycobb2011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102319717669866, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:27:21", "owner": "sinem_halil_erdogan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071147321599011, "text": "🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:27:11", "owner": "noecyrege", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902801239161270, "text": "Q. How did fire get into the core of the buildings so quickly when the fires presumably started and spread from the outside?!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:26:52", "owner": "paul.skeet.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842667907626225, "text": "Lord have mercy 💔😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:26:51", "owner": "a_82he", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541948876009493, "text": "Double think bout safety in those skyscrapers, one accident can fold thousands times", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:26:40", "owner": "chrisking1603", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868123153419345, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:26:14", "owner": "thejewellerybazaar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857524459502635, "text": "mashhur vidyolardagi kooop uylar yonibdida a", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:25:55", "owner": "polatjonova_0714", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992641602891302, "text": "A real sin 😢😢😢should never happen", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:25:44", "owner": "thecollegeballgame", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857491162505110, "text": "🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:25:37", "owner": "sandy_nrio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937012131979491, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:25:34", "owner": "39.0000799", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088355596785322, "text": "🙏pray for HK🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:25:28", "owner": "al_mos_t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988362120745590, "text": "Tragic - 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:25:21", "owner": "murphdog82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145651210438071, "text": "💔❤️❤️😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:25:20", "owner": "sashawalker2272", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18380701549147551, "text": "Grenfel all over again 😭😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:25:15", "owner": "self_lovin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18567136825036041, "text": "Chinese tofu dreg construction hits again. The greed of the Chinese communist party knows zero boundaries", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:24:48", "owner": "4ever_pillars_of_knowledge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18177451420364296, "text": "Baru liat video di atas sebelumnya, kebakaran karena putung rokok pekerja yg di buang sembarangan", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:24:34", "owner": "juju_is_iu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074663141199471, "text": "😭💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:24:28", "owner": "enriluf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051087146371263, "text": "Bamboo scaffolding…what could go wrong 😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:24:18", "owner": "baddfinger_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080331851148904, "text": "Bu binalar insanlar için mezarlıktır. Olası bir felakette toplu mezar...", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:24:08", "owner": "salih_diyorki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132674395488755, "text": "💔😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:24:07", "owner": "white_crow72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080929853142394, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:24:07", "owner": "natasciamorganti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076356563222833, "text": "I am praying for Hong Kong today. God bless those who have lost their lives or been injured in this terrible fire. Good Bless the Firefighters", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:23:58", "owner": "abouttimenewzealand", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104933440645025, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:23:53", "owner": "nicolelei_08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075763547518644, "text": "So this is an absolute failure. How could this have happened!?!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:23:39", "owner": "nicoles212121", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052014173347835, "text": "Property tycoons want the land..", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:23:07", "owner": "when_we_07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545293774037788, "text": "Weird how those things didn’t collapse looking as frail as they are🥺😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:22:58", "owner": "rightonmaui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972724845956683, "text": "@gabelung", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:22:55", "owner": "mesmerizingdawn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932545897111482, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:22:35", "owner": "elisa._lisa123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898846060343330, "text": "💔😭🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:22:02", "owner": "jovzzabala", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164442487382669, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:22:00", "owner": "giga6126", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084273605016704, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:22:00", "owner": "frank.whatever", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910201486267037, "text": "When the residents are not happy", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:21:57", "owner": "gypsydevo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854382262576735, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:21:47", "owner": "cristianemunhozartes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008361785805166, "text": "Kok kayuuuu🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:21:37", "owner": "ronaml_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964312543002428, "text": "😭💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:21:27", "owner": "jesslbee2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081182408514281, "text": "CHE FANNO QUA?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:21:20", "owner": "la_write_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183219418345378, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:21:19", "owner": "willems.yolanda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097369306829805, "text": "Sum Ting Wong!!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:21:14", "owner": "rowdie_ws", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085919746823955, "text": "삼가 고인의 명복을 빕니다.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:21:12", "owner": "nepturus19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094176658894822, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:21:11", "owner": "magikanin_doctor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015238184629945, "text": "Ужасные дома.. ррр", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:20:44", "owner": "larisa_polet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003977102821725, "text": "\"Renovirali\" kao i naše seronje železničku stanicu u Novom Sadu.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:20:44", "owner": "kovacmihal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933275224111104, "text": "😢🙏so sad.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:20:41", "owner": "esptelecaster", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977252061950703, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:20:21", "owner": "lujesus520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076101599233475, "text": "💔🙏 I hope people are working together to save lives 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:20:16", "owner": "teannalt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100588696705600, "text": "China been having to many engineering disasters lately. Lack of standards will continue to cause this to happen.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:19:46", "owner": "beau.shaw.5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109397359719542, "text": "So sorry for this 😞", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:19:19", "owner": "cboggie125", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071178473368360, "text": "Esto es horrible  Dios los proteja  a los familiares de quienes murieron", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:18:35", "owner": "luisilla58", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135113485469822, "text": "Dios mío que fue eso", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:18:34", "owner": "mezitabellamunoz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926229226177017, "text": "😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:18:11", "owner": "dericsl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113904139584770, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:18:04", "owner": "renescref", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096031786677894, "text": "Wang Fuk Up", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:17:38", "owner": "jeroen.s.jansen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970303557970557, "text": "Misery china", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:17:32", "owner": "joquinha.santos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063024272195733, "text": "😭💔so sad", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:17:20", "owner": "issac.ng.397", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366650971091488, "text": "Yüksek kat yapmanın sonucu bu kötü bir durum maalesef", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:17:18", "owner": "faruk_gn_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088557892943239, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:17:06", "owner": "isaucylopesdos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18177598600364872, "text": "Oxalá esteja todas as famílias que estejam passando por esse momento.🙌🙌🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:16:58", "owner": "cassandra.fernandes.54", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114423199599042, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:16:45", "owner": "para.dise0036", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917445886213329, "text": "🥺🥺🥹🥹💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:16:45", "owner": "tarshbarnett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041994893710466, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:16:39", "owner": "dmitry.valeryevi4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093490549721436, "text": "Mon Dieu 🙏💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:16:27", "owner": "constant2488", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085514888094390, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:16:27", "owner": "marilynelamotte", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941160879960902, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:16:26", "owner": "may.col.mor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918123097207243, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:16:19", "owner": "beatrice_mm21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077209798949450, "text": "Crazy", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:16:15", "owner": "angel_l_berrios", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084915635284581, "text": "Such a horrible tragedy I hope more people survived but its so hard for them to put out the fires bc of flareups within.  Thoughts and sorrows to the surviving family and friends.😢😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:16:12", "owner": "indigence2windfall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888447136259977, "text": "💔poor people", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:15:57", "owner": "millerirena_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857394187560514, "text": "Absolutely horrible.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:15:56", "owner": "botanicaprovincetown", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101888920664464, "text": "Multiple on fire? Yeah that’s not an insurance claim at all", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:15:51", "owner": "christi4n93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966232186003175, "text": "😭😭😭oh my goodness!!!! What happened to cause all that fire?!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:15:48", "owner": "doriborakaj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086057966092937, "text": "🙏🙏🙏 💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:15:43", "owner": "alilicastro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069533438591926, "text": "🙏🙏🙏😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:15:43", "owner": "jlouis.galea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921541525056152, "text": "😢😭😭😭💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:15:41", "owner": "lilicorpes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18246828337293644, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:15:21", "owner": "jackelineresplande", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887088628403635, "text": "I pray for those affected by this tragedy.  May God send His angels to comfort you.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:15:05", "owner": "saltsgirl58", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848965282602694, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:14:59", "owner": "dayaq_noqtesi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924284182178744, "text": "🙏🙏🙏😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:14:36", "owner": "macro777san", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861812545465769, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:14:29", "owner": "new_york1987", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116617129565454, "text": "Its a set up", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:14:14", "owner": "tivve11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874456270449947, "text": "Ужасная трагедия😭 сил - потерявшим близких🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:14:10", "owner": "julianikonova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077675456181910, "text": "Would you look at that. Raging fires didn't collapse the buildings. 9-11 was a demolition", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:14:01", "owner": "swoo_pat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298795300259690, "text": "geçmiş olsun Çin honkhonk 🙏🙏🙏😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:13:27", "owner": "sevikayse276", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074511998013174, "text": "❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:13:25", "owner": "antsubantsu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047185673445351, "text": "Tragic", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:13:23", "owner": "tivve11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148409548427631, "text": "This strengths the argument for mandatory sprinklers", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:12:58", "owner": "luggagethecat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18388915495176148, "text": "Je suis de tout cœur avec vous faites courage 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:12:49", "owner": "leone983", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926625448168047, "text": "RIP💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:12:43", "owner": "holtbye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029220887753642, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:12:24", "owner": "lisanovak.kunst", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067152677383935, "text": "😱😱😱😱", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:12:12", "owner": "cdelmas74", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116002927561592, "text": "🥺🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:12:04", "owner": "sanal_ramachandran", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072151781200406, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:12:03", "owner": "samhung.47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883515979414991, "text": "Still burning but still standing. 9-11 has entered the chat", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:11:58", "owner": "glr_airsoft.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010990934807350, "text": "Hide something. Political.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:11:53", "owner": "zhuzhang3245", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100118974703592, "text": "And there will be people who are never found", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:11:49", "owner": "ezvm4e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954498232014233, "text": "Gazzedeki.şocuk katliamına sessiz kalan her ülke crza çekecek", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:11:48", "owner": "sehersultan50", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102976288735707, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:11:38", "owner": "sabrinaddvc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092081803917317, "text": "🥺🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:11:34", "owner": "tamhunghei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073424612600234, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:11:33", "owner": "annie3228s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870205558397667, "text": "😢💔🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:11:16", "owner": "mayanmadness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973317702798005, "text": "😢😢😢😢paix à leurs âmes", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:11:13", "owner": "chamagammouh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079865066181112, "text": "And not one building collapsed from fire…hmmm?! RIP to those who didn’t make it ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:11:01", "owner": "brendamorrowrussell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100358503707466, "text": "Gecmis olsun 😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:10:53", "owner": "haticetpskl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968864856985447, "text": "Китайська криза 🇺🇦", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:10:45", "owner": "one.vanj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922006741057023, "text": "🙏😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:10:36", "owner": "jettie_crazy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293182414302335, "text": "Aren’t they supposed to collapse?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:10:30", "owner": "rishmageesh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982194384923166, "text": "😢😢😢💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:10:28", "owner": "dyasahrhotmail.com9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987676998914234, "text": "😢💔🙏❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:10:17", "owner": "carmende967", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108251050622960, "text": "This building under construction?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:10:06", "owner": "mirzaborhan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844025455620502, "text": "These buildings were engulfed in flames for HOURS, yet they still stand, largely still intact. Yet the WTC...", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:10:05", "owner": "death.mass.death", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985504452873070, "text": "Horrific 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:10:04", "owner": "iscrapplesnap", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075174971263114, "text": "This is disturbing!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:09:50", "owner": "qdeeja", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030516998546184, "text": "This is such tragic and devastation for Hong Kong.  Heart broken. 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:09:41", "owner": "singulek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071236130363132, "text": "Yüksek Binalar Her Zaman Sorun Olur...", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:09:38", "owner": "abdullah_akkurt36", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17958678827883266, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:09:27", "owner": "__w1nters__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105629158726769, "text": "🙏🙏💔💔😭😭😭🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:09:18", "owner": "eve_3850", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18328912057246121, "text": "Hmmm, fires so hot that fire fighters can’t get close to the buildings (as reported by the guardian) burn for 2 days straight, and the structural integrity of all 5 buildings remains entirely intact. And I’m the conspiracy theorist for questioning how World Trade Building 7 can fall symmetrically into its own footprint at free fall speed in just over 7 seconds due to a localised fire in one corner of the building 7 hours after it was hit with a bit of falling debris (google it). Jesus H Christ #wtc #worldtradecentre", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:09:09", "owner": "sletocq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867194134483550, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:09:04", "owner": "mona.ntnc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085981805070917, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:09:00", "owner": "yyz.tony", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058536356278401, "text": "Cannot believe than rip for people goes so sad for Hong Kong", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:08:39", "owner": "arnaud_pierre_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059642192266028, "text": "So sad  So much damage and so much to clean up", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:08:27", "owner": "class_war_people", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165432088386959, "text": "🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:08:04", "owner": "nightinsideart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938927989096876, "text": "Çok üzgünüm.  Ölenlere Allah rahmet eylesin.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:08:02", "owner": "fulyaulu_turkiye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088688324504209, "text": "Une telle tristesse 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:07:54", "owner": "lov.u_m0.on", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18210188329312211, "text": "Parece filme pós apocalíptico 🥺😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:07:35", "owner": "maitethimotti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031216697737909, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:07:32", "owner": "jackiurk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868232662479096, "text": "Ojalá esta tragedia deje una gran enseñanza de las prácticas aplicadas en pro de evitar que se repita.\nColocando por delante de todo las vidas perdidas y afectadas por esta tragedia, me surge la pregunta, que puede ser inoportuna y/o inapropiada para otros, era necesario y oportuno aplicar a tal magnitud de vulnerabilidad a riesgo la práctica utilizada de envolver la totalidad de varios edificios con material sensible a la proliferación del fuego?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:07:32", "owner": "jcvenez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969250515825390, "text": "I thought fire could weaken steel beams enough for buildings to collapse", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:07:03", "owner": "not.linli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305530150251476, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:06:57", "owner": "lorapalmer78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063723200183871, "text": "Quien autoriza tanto edificio tan juntos.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:06:36", "owner": "javierorellanajara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18412871272185747, "text": "Canlarım benim. Çok üzgünüm. Sabırlar diliyorum", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:06:34", "owner": "findik.nuran", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076900669965190, "text": "Not the Fuk!!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:06:23", "owner": "private_to_only_a_few", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901404895335162, "text": "🥺🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:06:10", "owner": "tsishann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074992658006446, "text": "But they didn’t collapse like a jelly roll!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:06:09", "owner": "maggiechrisp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865513123438180, "text": "These slow-mo drone footages of disaster sites are eerie AF. I got chills just to think poor, unsuspecting people died in there... 🥺😢🙈🕊️🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:06:05", "owner": "surreality2024", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18057857297298055, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:05:56", "owner": "srs116", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193884964328779, "text": "Weird how they didn’t fall into their own footprint", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:05:52", "owner": "chriswoods_918", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18175415698371190, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:05:41", "owner": "claudia_tigre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006925223823991, "text": "🙏🙏😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:05:40", "owner": "nariman.cg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073233653201346, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:04:41", "owner": "albrecht_arzt7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906657616270319, "text": "РОССИЯ соболезнует вам 🙏🙏🙏 🇷🇺🇷🇺🇷🇺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:04:30", "owner": "marina_kmx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18412786825191804, "text": "This is why you should not live in cities in high-rise buildings on top of one another. You should have your own piece of land. But the governments force you into cities because you’re easier to control.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:04:26", "owner": "mmercer322", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045706025466749, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:04:23", "owner": "lmcfrenchie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18370986367157295, "text": "Oooohhhh mein Gott….", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:03:54", "owner": "selvi._ak71", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099722002750016, "text": "Es lo peor desgracia 😮🥺😢😭💔🙏❤️ los edificio no deberían pasar de 4 pisos", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:03:36", "owner": "oscarhernandez1483", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899607835185966, "text": "😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:03:33", "owner": "milzzaramos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986459088756005, "text": "They just had to name it wang fuk", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:03:32", "owner": "dillbro_swagins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862185241537597, "text": "Just cuz of 1 cig🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:03:23", "owner": "seedhaved_18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072939008255600, "text": "6 buildings on fire 🔥 what!!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:03:10", "owner": "qdeeja", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070541225072686, "text": "Disaster.  RIP", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:03:10", "owner": "guitarprogress", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968046744992348, "text": "Göktelen yapılırken nasıl yangın söndürülür düşünülmemiş🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:02:49", "owner": "yaseminaslankln", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894467455219819, "text": "As I understand it they were trying to update the outside wall cladding with new fire proof material and it turns out the company from inland China decided to go on the cheap and pocket the rest of the money for himself and I’m sure that he had to pay off the local officials also… and it is presumed that a worker was smoking and accidentally set it all ablaze not to mention the scaffolding being used is made of bamboo, btw how did they get scaffolding up that high?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:02:37", "owner": "leoncarrasco31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147493207438238, "text": "😭😭🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:02:33", "owner": "agonux", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863505922532067, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:02:31", "owner": "michelpiette2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084079256034689, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:02:25", "owner": "jenniferhuie_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061535021222417, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:02:22", "owner": "quango77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147298546381838, "text": "😢 sending prayers", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:02:17", "owner": "marielle_knops", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940560954966308, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:02:17", "owner": "kbryslbs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104989351632390, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:02:13", "owner": "cabnfevr5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133586677484568, "text": "God bless Hong Kong🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:02:12", "owner": "xinze_lee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056006903320228, "text": "This is si heart broken", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:02:04", "owner": "ceci_rm5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105503017714087, "text": "🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:02:01", "owner": "lalie13800", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871838467464819, "text": "Very sad. RIP all those that didn’t make it out. Sympathy to all families and friends.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:01:48", "owner": "late_nite_friend", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305524843266577, "text": "Terrible 🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:01:42", "owner": "mercedesgvarela", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888474730265859, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:01:35", "owner": "captured.essence_95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098952364811131, "text": "🥺🥺🥺🥺🥺😮😮😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:01:30", "owner": "1more_m4a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101726215737067, "text": "🥺🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:01:19", "owner": "jiajia.zzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084761225023196, "text": "Praying for you all! 🙏🏻 I'm so sorry. 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:01:12", "owner": "louwraah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18333436873232339, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:01:10", "owner": "orijinalmagazine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917002810225790, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:01:08", "owner": "bruno.veit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541019602013884, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:00:45", "owner": "paula.stella", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060350459534991, "text": "Twin Towers flash back 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:00:45", "owner": "qdeeja", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074779163216564, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:00:39", "owner": "yvonneinca2000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972545703974974, "text": "🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:00:35", "owner": "leylaverdiyeva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885064030287051, "text": "😢😢 Que tragédia 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:00:08", "owner": "harensaidy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102272632670812, "text": "Bamboo scaffolding, plastic tarps, styrofoam inside. What could go wrong ? 😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:00:04", "owner": "moto.viking", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978644316938898, "text": "天佑香港🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:59:33", "owner": "sa_fotografer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086134723973273, "text": "No fire sprinkler system???!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:59:31", "owner": "steve.holben", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060366683251942, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:59:27", "owner": "hilazaarur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914553994091214, "text": "Genuinely heartbreaking 🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:59:23", "owner": "angelic_antiquities", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085751453314364, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏💔💔💔💔💔💔😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:59:03", "owner": "irmahermosina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068982566376173, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:59:03", "owner": "paul781888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887596891395649, "text": "Bu çok üzücü🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:59:03", "owner": "stil.bul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079964537132152, "text": "Looks like urinating on a forest fire💔💔😭😭😭🥺🥺🥺🥺😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:59:02", "owner": "santiago_falcao23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074019035021676, "text": "🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:58:57", "owner": "sa.rbd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061135895535754, "text": "How does something like that happen? Those building's were hundreds of feet away from each other 😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:58:50", "owner": "seanritchie83", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18409988617141331, "text": "Mon dieu tous ces pauvres gens et leurs animaux restés piégés 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:58:26", "owner": "nicolettipascale61", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864876190518683, "text": "11t", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:58:21", "owner": "georgecoventgarden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118702045526979, "text": "Y ahora las demuelen ????", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:58:17", "owner": "dleandro772", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930135469119251, "text": "🥺😮😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:57:43", "owner": "channaizbu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098160292818010, "text": "💔 🙏 ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:57:40", "owner": "mauricea.grande", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843643891622526, "text": "Praying for the lost souls 🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:57:40", "owner": "butterz.83", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304190809266917, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:57:36", "owner": "bernimcmonagle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095880961890661, "text": "Dios bendiga a cada una de esas personas que vivieron en su apartamento enviamos luz y fuerza no están solo@s 🙏🤍", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:57:29", "owner": "lisvillalobos__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002566448822501, "text": "🥺🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:57:07", "owner": "cofra5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18188383963338232, "text": "💔💔💔💔😭😭😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:57:03", "owner": "nafisa7667", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032084186723531, "text": "😔😔😔😔😔😔\n😢🥺🥺🥺🥺😢\n😔😔😔😔😔😔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:56:57", "owner": "kelardasht.villa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088647139780235, "text": "What happen?!😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:56:52", "owner": "yenola87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098255305701442, "text": "I’m in America, but my heart breaks for those who lost their lives, their homes. 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:56:46", "owner": "gabigirl_24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146328883437050, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:56:37", "owner": "gamesetmatch49", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18299936536280292, "text": "Tristesse 💔💔🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:56:32", "owner": "annaetoile", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544907584026142, "text": "😢🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:56:31", "owner": "lynemelancon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849150706602013, "text": "Very sad", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:56:16", "owner": "tony.alpr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966236646843291, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:56:03", "owner": "era2levateclothing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089604136750910, "text": "Binalari o kadar yuksek dikiyorlarki, yanginsondurenler yukseğe ulasamiyor.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:55:59", "owner": "ragimovasabina444", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18186708094346814, "text": "Es el tema de los rascacielos, hermosos gigantes de cemento... pero cuando las barbas arden, para donde corren, si no funciona el ascensor 🥺😶‍🌫️🙄🥵", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:55:54", "owner": "irisjorge11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172077370335950, "text": "It is so sad!😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:55:53", "owner": "angelasilva2849", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940052124964913, "text": "This is awful. How did all of those buildings go up in flames?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:55:35", "owner": "marelthu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540247201034799, "text": "Geesus the effin bamboo scaffolding is part of problem!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:55:31", "owner": "bkdtel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081847066886140, "text": "Que tristeza vale 💔mi más sentido pésame y que dolor para todas las personas que perdieron su hogar", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:55:26", "owner": "roxanaerc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900741949340468, "text": "Albtraum", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:55:26", "owner": "michisagthallo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110352586721113, "text": "Amazing that it’s still standing- blessings to everyone impacted on this 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:55:24", "owner": "ev3lyn44", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061517306540525, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:55:21", "owner": "dagati42", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901969906319220, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:55:12", "owner": "spitznagelfrank", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070448306591419, "text": "💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:55:03", "owner": "da_frank_ch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185795548350393, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:54:59", "owner": "manishagoswami1626", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084278861105819, "text": "in need of fire code 🤷‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:54:45", "owner": "tomi.socal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154322347407772, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:54:43", "owner": "abonvoyage1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086920030947972, "text": "@mathiasvanhessche", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:54:31", "owner": "pieterjan.vdb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367060846095110, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:54:16", "owner": "parisavani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131355742493269, "text": "I smell sabotage 😡😡😡😡😡", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:53:59", "owner": "gsimediaproduction", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906580465275101, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:53:53", "owner": "joy_bounsong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879574480330040, "text": "😮😮😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:53:30", "owner": "mariaisabel196692", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051254018663222, "text": "💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:53:13", "owner": "katiewai1318", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866059069506788, "text": "Yea yallt think this was an \"accident\" I surr hope it was but I doubt it. The population has grown exponentially so this thier way of controlling people and the population. Aint nobway 3 building or more catch at the same time without warning without helping others. And its still standing. Might as well demolish and do a whole new building bc that shit finna be haunted", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:53:07", "owner": "xxthexhokagexx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063132800543223, "text": "Shit construction materials", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:52:50", "owner": "katt.dejager.9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082973780117123, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:52:45", "owner": "paul.williams.90226628", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065354783149769, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:52:45", "owner": "firuze_afandi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902721358165803, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:52:33", "owner": "myleopardgirl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030668654751046, "text": "It is so sad,all my thoughts and prayers goes to the people effected by this tragedy.🥺😢🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:52:22", "owner": "vahik.khanian.2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927125176153561, "text": "Sending prayers.... 🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:52:12", "owner": "hrbegley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121408078533868, "text": "Unbelievable tragedy. My thoughts are with all affected. I’m so sorry. 💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:52:11", "owner": "annballard781", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18318894748223445, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:52:01", "owner": "jocyline_06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18491397430073778, "text": "Well, I guess Chinese people never heard of fire protection system?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:51:54", "owner": "sign.your.name", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541484269035770, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:51:46", "owner": "hasenherz_nh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098447776826076, "text": "Désastreux 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:51:30", "owner": "jeanne_marie.l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866050678506548, "text": "为遇难同胞和消防英雄默哀🙏希望香港平安…", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:51:26", "owner": "gaoqhalexa12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543341101018574, "text": "Oh oh oh. Wat vreselijk verdrietig dit", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:51:15", "owner": "nadine.oosterman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133818517479004, "text": "Похоже высотки построили из самых горючих материалов. Соболезнования семьям погибших,и скорейшего выздоровления пострадавшим.😢😢❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:51:05", "owner": "nelyaamirovaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048802193388482, "text": "Insurance scam", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:51:04", "owner": "deaththinko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879596143330382, "text": "35 died? More like 60k", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:50:52", "owner": "deaththinko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945015466079226, "text": "A dohányzás halált okozhat 💔😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:50:28", "owner": "vitezmarton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949009483051433, "text": "Who the fuck did this ????? How did this happen ???????", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:50:23", "owner": "iamtheiamq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070963463197070, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:50:17", "owner": "alri0811_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936746290101109, "text": "Lack of regulatory oversight. Same root cause as tofu dreck construction: corruption.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:49:55", "owner": "andsbren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18429148000128058, "text": "🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:49:22", "owner": "ninitoutou1319", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093102943925302, "text": "Very tragic 💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:49:10", "owner": "barmanananya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142382614451771, "text": "💔💔🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:49:02", "owner": "boricuabx1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056160503641847, "text": "Condolências do Brasil 🇧🇷 às famílias das vítimas 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:48:50", "owner": "paixaodagama", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18381845884147706, "text": "Poor people 🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:48:25", "owner": "zaradzhi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844738000618667, "text": "Из говна и палок", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:48:17", "owner": "fima_fox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111976813522209, "text": "Looks as Grenfell Tower fire", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:48:08", "owner": "emanuelkrauseelisabeth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898005472343201, "text": "🙏😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:48:00", "owner": "jaruna2435", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933401875110888, "text": "Maybe it’s high time they ban bamboo scaffolding.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:47:34", "owner": "chao.jack", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541949911023085, "text": "🌇 🔥 😮🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:47:24", "owner": "cosson_stephane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857484283502790, "text": "어떡해 ㅜㅜ😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:47:13", "owner": "1005_crystal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958376124885456, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:47:07", "owner": "mustafa__oksar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089685392477846, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:47:04", "owner": "ati3561", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073558451338171, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:46:56", "owner": "cramirezb27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067346915372910, "text": "Oh nooo.... poor people...", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:46:35", "owner": "art.and.logic.interiors", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979739982783272, "text": "Meu Deus 😦 achei q era um prédio, mas são vários 😱😱😱😱😱 que absurdo, mesmo se fosse um apto, que dó meu Deus do céu…o povo já sofre tanto, e agora mais essa 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:46:30", "owner": "rosangela.zaia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914473843090977, "text": "Ik vraag me iedere keer af wanneer er op de hoogste verdiepingen van zo’n woontorens in plaats van brandblusapparatuur automatische parachutesystemen worden geïnstalleerd ter beveiliging van wie daar werkt of woont.  Het kan toch niet zo moeilijk zijn een hele reeks parachutes te voorzien die mensen gewoon moeten omdoen waarna ze, eventueel met een soort van katapult ver genoeg van de brandhaard worden gekatapulteerd waarbij hun parachute zich ook automatisch opent.  Zo’n systeem zou verplicht moeten worden en had, ook ten tijde van de Twintowers in New York, ondertussen al duizenden levens kunnen redden.  Zo erg wat daar en ook nu in Hong Kong weer is gebeurd.  Arme mensen en nabestaanden !", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:46:22", "owner": "keihart_voor_duchenne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954169149903919, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:46:07", "owner": "aliciaregueirav", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099084970692093, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:45:56", "owner": "guillermo3212", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882329035417497, "text": "Sedih 😔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:45:31", "owner": "marsanipelita", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18495443293076148, "text": "Wow prayers to hk 🙏🏽😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:45:21", "owner": "em_geez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989876058857275, "text": "No one will admit this was just another modern day sacrifice.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:45:10", "owner": "jillfaulmann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093407869911468, "text": "Build more tall buildings?😭💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:45:02", "owner": "sumitsuryawanshi123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096527680877723, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:44:53", "owner": "michelesison", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063649046572222, "text": "😭😢😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:44:50", "owner": "tatiana_hikitina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068058236527617, "text": "Claro que eso no fue un error es demasiado evidente la intencion", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:44:47", "owner": "tita_lafar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100890661778636, "text": "No planes dropping water?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:44:40", "owner": "forbeswoots", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303517801248857, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:44:17", "owner": "anima.liberta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068261468620973, "text": "Made in China ! Hahahaha", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:44:16", "owner": "sf.65.cvo.y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120110443530901, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:43:54", "owner": "antonietta.cap.129", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087140042007354, "text": "🙏💔Praying for all affected by this tragedy..... 🙏Praying for those who have lost loved ones", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:43:45", "owner": "leatitia_naude", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091475665914140, "text": "😢😢😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:43:32", "owner": "jana_p.107", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086445542057712, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:43:31", "owner": "zz.oyaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100684039776168, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:43:19", "owner": "jessicanari77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075658805230497, "text": "Just terrible 💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:43:02", "owner": "dicepineapples1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063910226449788, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:42:58", "owner": "teresaarellano760", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977307627938261, "text": "A horrible tragedy😭😭😭😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:42:51", "owner": "andregiina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022204457601214, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:42:43", "owner": "steppenwolf2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18553407316002195, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:42:15", "owner": "cely.juarez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063839690180844, "text": "😭😭😭 mi dios santo, que dolor tan grande 😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:42:15", "owner": "chabesoto38", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896915443200403, "text": "Maybe China should watch some of our movies, Towering Inferno or Skyscraper. So sad.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:42:14", "owner": "ron_sajdyk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088268179943715, "text": "Thankful today that the fires have finally been extinguished which seemed like an impossible task. Prayers for all those who lost their lives and loved ones 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:42:06", "owner": "holeshothenderson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086422826066438, "text": "Very sad,  but there is more to than what was said. How come 7 massive buildings catch fire at the same time.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:42:04", "owner": "desarambinie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076667501226950, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:41:58", "owner": "yumin2610", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147053011429859, "text": "Odd how the towers did collapse like 911", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:41:49", "owner": "sonnytdang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091157680907676, "text": "So sad for all.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:41:49", "owner": "jean.macdonald.311", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079590730916374, "text": "People cashing in on the scenes. People have loved ones in them buildings. Stop recording to post on social media for views. Show respect to the original people of Hong Kong", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:41:48", "owner": "benleehardman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038637383709637, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:41:48", "owner": "anitan_askarteluja", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098845744794186, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:41:41", "owner": "amoonty001_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368965696081167, "text": "🥺🥺🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:41:39", "owner": "rchkiran4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084893302999995, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢💔💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:41:35", "owner": "atak.0801", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076843249953849, "text": "💔 My thoughts & prayers with HK", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:41:34", "owner": "angcrisos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879942916428157, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:41:23", "owner": "cvetkaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051948284667731, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:41:22", "owner": "thefrenchbucket", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063619709573137, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:41:20", "owner": "junhaobrandonsoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842347564631170, "text": "Uh, interesting that they didn't collapse after such a big fire", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:41:11", "owner": "patrickgtrudeau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073733531205398, "text": "💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:41:03", "owner": "lorawala", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925715599178291, "text": "Guess they are fuked", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:40:51", "owner": "lifesgreatmoments_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913610683240421, "text": "🙏💔😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:40:38", "owner": "sopikiris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060680285550984, "text": "In the US those would have collapsed", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:40:20", "owner": "nerdyqwerty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099001117839358, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:40:01", "owner": "myellamckenziecook_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845948467615010, "text": "So sad💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:39:45", "owner": "maybaebay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18493190095075362, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:39:41", "owner": "katterine1709", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545348548031901, "text": "So sad", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:39:35", "owner": "terryl48", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18379687111149021, "text": "Imagine the amount of displaced families......🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:39:21", "owner": "terry.gossman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048898220413917, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:39:19", "owner": "iyaramiranda", "likes": 23}, {"id": 18094681132892291, "text": "Terrible", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:39:09", "owner": "sandysdunnbros", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123812032516133, "text": "🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:39:00", "owner": "floormoumni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062863526546576, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:38:39", "owner": "painterpaperhanger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985504524870805, "text": "They not collapse? The steel did not melt? Or is that just a NJ thing?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:38:35", "owner": "manfredmunk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084515237090077, "text": "Que tristeza... 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:38:30", "owner": "mferreiramoraes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969188586825411, "text": "Jesus Cristo 😮🥺😢😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:38:28", "owner": "rosangela1840", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089184440293478, "text": "Ce qui est dommage c'est qu'il n'y a pas d'avion genre Canadair pour survoler au-dessus des bâtiments", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:38:16", "owner": "nono777365", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094998406890683, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:38:03", "owner": "marikrowpsigas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18247509508295521, "text": "😭🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:37:53", "owner": "blommaforlivet1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18246014236291754, "text": "This look like a divest ,we know chinese want to rebuild in hongkong", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:37:28", "owner": "carlos.calcines", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847869217583194, "text": "This is devastating 💔 prayers for all affected", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:37:19", "owner": "crysta.colon.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105946183644966, "text": "Çok Geçmiş olsun, Ölenlerin Mekanları Cennet olsun🥺🇹🇷", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:37:11", "owner": "serkangunes1923", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072468590197896, "text": "🙏😭🙏mein Beileid an alle Familien die ihre Lieben verloren haben🙏😭 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:36:56", "owner": "schubertmaik9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099553678744707, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:36:51", "owner": "jadranka_ljubabesvir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065859239388120, "text": "Somebody wanted them old towers gone They all burned and they were far enough apart not to, someone helped them all burn 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:36:49", "owner": "godshealthyliving", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868816291412699, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:36:45", "owner": "svet_interior.art", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951081433026686, "text": "The world’s largest community BBQ party", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:36:43", "owner": "frenchie0028", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301275511254292, "text": "Hong Kong🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:36:33", "owner": "mishl___98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094808365852973, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:36:32", "owner": "_artjo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000371291835481, "text": "O dia que assiste à reportagem do fantástico eu imaginei que se esse lugar pegasse fogo a tragédia ia ser feia e aconteceu misericórdia triste de mais 😔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:36:21", "owner": "adaliceboaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062194241211994, "text": "😢😢😢😢💔💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:36:02", "owner": "sindy2125", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908920819260370, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:35:57", "owner": "maria58len", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064062986405766, "text": "wang fuk amirite guys", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:35:56", "owner": "reginald_jenkins_iv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103182724731431, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:35:55", "owner": "vi_ivyivyxiaisme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071565758364624, "text": "Welke moskees mandaat heefd dit.gedaan?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:35:55", "owner": "verhoeven8935", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925678357174922, "text": "This is awful my thoughts & prayers are with those affected by this dreadful tragedy 💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:35:55", "owner": "eve_ms64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858928402496458, "text": "🥺😢🥺😢🥺😢🥺😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:35:47", "owner": "graziellaaucello", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109915873614486, "text": "So sad", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:35:29", "owner": "josephkirksey1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18434833045105585, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:34:50", "owner": "kiku4w", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919621603202013, "text": "😢😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:34:44", "owner": "cecilemondon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087535900800905, "text": "THEY ALREADY arrested 3 people", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:33:51", "owner": "jacksenwest", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088798897765531, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:33:49", "owner": "hdpowerman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134589829468238, "text": "Ya Allah Reham 🤲", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:33:39", "owner": "nasreenkausar67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067262801110847, "text": "You never heard about arsonists in other countries. That’s weird right? I wonder what the stats are on amount of arsonists per country.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:33:26", "owner": "rickbeach", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147368155439296, "text": "Пластик это угроза, горит отравляет. Многие получили не только ожоги но и отравлением горящего пластика. Дом должен быть не только красивым но и безопасным", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:33:22", "owner": "veronikashalkina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909846955258279, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:33:11", "owner": "sissekinnunen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545547031057988, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:33:07", "owner": "ioannakomni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085540240990365, "text": "It's so scary to watch. I hope they'll be safe.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:32:53", "owner": "xiaolo2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18500480158079872, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:32:37", "owner": "vasi.le8973", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099922687760982, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:32:32", "owner": "lilo.369", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059523341268454, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:32:22", "owner": "yau.viola", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160615150394537, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:32:20", "owner": "jeanlabo3858", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304368559265427, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:32:01", "owner": "chiquitagreen36", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18247338247291659, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢allahım çok üzücü bir durum..", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:31:44", "owner": "yadigar_sukass", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068483405372993, "text": "Olha o tamanho desses prédios. Meu deus", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:31:39", "owner": "tamiresferreirac_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975059271952968, "text": "💔💔💔😭😭🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:31:34", "owner": "queening_dior", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926294296175013, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😭😭💔💔🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:31:28", "owner": "veroniquethibault47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057744302290335, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:31:17", "owner": "daaisy.rm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949200697054776, "text": "And yet the twin towers collapsed", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:31:14", "owner": "frank.sonnier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954471414901859, "text": "😭😭🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:30:41", "owner": "isabellacivilleri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128682400498738, "text": "Wow. How surprising. How come they didn’t fall like the twin towers", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:30:12", "owner": "bodhi_remy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058915712556766, "text": "Extreme Negligence", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:30:12", "owner": "wowraya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917041039218264, "text": "😮😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:30:03", "owner": "997212629__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080579123174150, "text": "Praying for them 😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:29:58", "owner": "madame_lapresidente", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986305281875681, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:29:27", "owner": "thaissa_goliveira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065232014618080, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:29:20", "owner": "janolovs60", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083953883083644, "text": "Employees code 269.passd CSSP security wing tecnision.056.058", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:29:15", "owner": "mhmdhydrqbl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18155908408408685, "text": "Straż kompletnie nie przygotowana, wygląda to tak jak by chcieli szklanką wody ugasić ognisko😭😭😭 straszne, osoby na wyższych piętrach nie miały żadnych szans", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:29:05", "owner": "ciociagunia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059233664635947, "text": "🙏🥺😢😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:28:54", "owner": "guetta6530", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172960315371521, "text": "Geçmiş olsun", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:28:21", "owner": "yldz.mehmet024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890079469387438, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:28:11", "owner": "renginguler26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087263731815908, "text": "This is awful and tragic my heart goes out to all the families affected.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:28:06", "owner": "ramon.cevallos.9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102220693664866, "text": "Prayers🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:27:59", "owner": "green_ghost_organics", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153756868418382, "text": "God plz help em😭💔🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:27:55", "owner": "aymoon_yousafzaikhan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071834981361612, "text": "Nominal determinancy...", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:27:47", "owner": "kim.sommerschield", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18316298359218838, "text": "USA ikiz kuleler gibi sabotaj olmalı aynı anda tüm kuleler yanar mı?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:27:35", "owner": "ertunk12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064435565393536, "text": "Il faudrait penser à faire des échelles deux fois plus long , si le feu 🔥 avait pris au dernier étages !…", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:27:32", "owner": "hoarau9350", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18333322342240175, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:27:25", "owner": "martasgmarques", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083535464036489, "text": "😭😭😭😢💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:27:24", "owner": "2003__federica", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069685418603414, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:27:12", "owner": "ph_mmfag8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073793504017260, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:27:09", "owner": "debfuller8916", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884191957296171, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:27:08", "owner": "7rojin.rasho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100002232776258, "text": "😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:27:04", "owner": "princesadosenhorjecr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539873122005778, "text": "A Tragic loss of life.  Yet All these buildings burned from top to bottom and Not One Collapsed 🤔!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:26:51", "owner": "bobbywz82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047615129430433, "text": "🙏😭💔 toutes les pensées pour toutes les victimes, décédées, blessées ou ayant perdu leur logement, mes pensées aussi pour les familles et tous les habitants de la ville de Hong Kong 😭💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:26:48", "owner": "valerielephi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056216621317323, "text": "😭😭💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:26:40", "owner": "tiff.y333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087881564313761, "text": "Wow! That's some crazy work 😳", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:26:31", "owner": "calidronelife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969728157978729, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:26:18", "owner": "johnvanlijf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953607496033549, "text": "😢😭😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:26:14", "owner": "patricklanglois76", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064419407435857, "text": "😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:26:10", "owner": "djmarisolgrajales", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074038571259822, "text": "💔💔🙏😢prayers are with those that lost loved ones.  I pray there will be people still alive. 🙏🙏 250 still missing 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:26:09", "owner": "cmb7889", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882373084306977, "text": "🙏💔💔💔😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:26:02", "owner": "ilicg95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847427710586232, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:25:59", "owner": "lee_min_ho_a2221", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105250330652522, "text": "😮 How did this happen?!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:25:53", "owner": "jo.beatrix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156613330405886, "text": "Sabotage", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:25:39", "owner": "mogvet_1993", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049986500688680, "text": "😭😭😭😭💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:25:37", "owner": "liudmylagladysh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18192661663332485, "text": "Voilà le résultat quand t as immeubles très haut et des échelles qui font la moitié quand sa brule ben ca brule.....", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:25:35", "owner": "sebast0054", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990046413735176, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:25:24", "owner": "skarlaibarra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950036737050818, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:25:20", "owner": "stephanie.diaz.40", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541584592045627, "text": "May our Heavenly Father watch over those families", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:25:17", "owner": "skarlaibarra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136192117467218, "text": "Hey, for every person struggling to get closer to God, I will give you a tip:\nSpend less time on the phone, i myself do it and it distracts me from God.\nThe phone even though we can spread The Gospel with it, but still it could be our downfall. So yes, spread The Gospel but always and i mean ALWAYS put God first.\nAnd never give up in your faith, NEVER. Why? Because faith is not based on feelings.\nI mean, pray even though you feel He is not there because He is, and when you're in trouble and He is testing your faith DON'T give up, NEVER.❤ I love y'all and Jesus👑👑👑 loves you so much moreeeeeeeeee ❤❤❤🙏🙏🙏\nAlso quick note this is from The Holy Spirit not me, i am NOT perfect, i am a sinner and im no better than you and you are not better than me, we are ALL EQUAL. ❤\nWe all need Jesus...👑❤🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:25:09", "owner": "z_razvan_z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966850083992293, "text": "Hey everyone who reads this comment! You know maybe you haven't heard this in a while but just know you are loved❤. I love you and Jesus loves you so much more ❤❤❤ Jesus lived a sinless life, died a sinners death and 3 days later rose, defeating death and sin so we can live eternally with Him. Being a follower might not be easy but its definitely worth it. After God changed my life i never wanted to return to my old ways. Trust Jesus, He loves you❤", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:25:09", "owner": "z_razvan_z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059972744554423, "text": "Jesus Christ cried, on the cross..., He rose from the dead 3 days later conquering both sin and death to give us a life we do not deserve. But out of His love for us... He still gave us eternal life even when He knew we will still sin. He knew us before we were even born, before our mothers were born, before our generation was even born and He was thinking about us on that cross. Christ calls us to a relationship, all He wants is a relationship will anybody who is reading this... Give Him a chance? He changed my life and can change yours too 💯%. Lets praise Jesus together for He Is The King of kings and Lord of lords and He did all that out of love for us.❤🙏 I love y'all and Jesus loves you so much more❤🙏 Peace and love,❤❤❤", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:25:08", "owner": "z_razvan_z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090810811897676, "text": "1 Peter 2:24 “He himself bore our sins in his body on the cross, so that we might die to sins and live for righteousness; by his wounds you have been healed.”", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:25:06", "owner": "z_razvan_z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981484821924130, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:24:54", "owner": "parth_nishad__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064025210178489, "text": "@aquah.s ㅠㅠ", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:24:42", "owner": "brownie_doby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905635519297034, "text": "Funny how buildings didn’t collapse. But trade centres did 🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:24:34", "owner": "dangant87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051036785378480, "text": "💔😢🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:24:32", "owner": "parth_nishad__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099464023773855, "text": "Che strano che non sia caduto a differenza delle Torri Gemelle 11/09....🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:24:25", "owner": "gubanca77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061199222620717, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:23:43", "owner": "fmari75011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083435126093850, "text": "🙏💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:23:33", "owner": "rogue_87_71", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867954220487973, "text": "Meu pai do céu..Que cena triste..Que Deus cuide dos feridos e console os enlutados..😰🖤💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:23:30", "owner": "elenita.souza.372", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087362368948008, "text": "Ini gara2 puntung rokok bukan🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:23:22", "owner": "lianacengh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164609701353163, "text": "Great name!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:23:12", "owner": "donsage89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18420887806119873, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:23:07", "owner": "mariiiii2338", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997874220702394, "text": "How cone they all caught fire when they are so far apart? Did someome do this ?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:23:04", "owner": "maartenhauben", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901041121323308, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:22:57", "owner": "livinggood10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105013057644937, "text": "Praying for HK", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:22:55", "owner": "techsuntsai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878221504433327, "text": "Horrifying-", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:22:50", "owner": "melodyhoi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047296793438123, "text": "Geçmiş olsun Hongkong🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:22:48", "owner": "sevilmek_cok_guzel_seven_varsa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862855708536687, "text": "😮😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:22:43", "owner": "damian.araoz.334", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901930120317356, "text": "💔💔🇨🇳😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:22:31", "owner": "ozmehmet1903", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071831444344215, "text": "That was under construction, right? There weren't people living there??", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:22:28", "owner": "yanni_134340", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986475543753067, "text": "This is heartbreaking", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:22:28", "owner": "kkrutikat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110339560719182, "text": "💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:22:20", "owner": "giselealvesoliveira82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079500962167009, "text": "Another land grab?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:22:01", "owner": "brizzx32", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929865175148567, "text": "It's BAD💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:21:59", "owner": "kgvconsultancyservices", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950152273026455, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:21:56", "owner": "mjo.par", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931339051115952, "text": "Umarım insanlar sağ salim kurtulmuştur 😢 çok üzücü. 💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:21:50", "owner": "gulsah7206", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050031296403033, "text": "🥺🥺🥺🥺😢😢😢😢😢💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:21:38", "owner": "fatimacavalcante2023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898226917344134, "text": "それは悲しいことですね。日本の皆さんに心からお見舞い申し上げます💔😭😢😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:21:37", "owner": "waynepelletier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049610198391637, "text": "🙏🙏🙏save this peoples", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:21:33", "owner": "anaivan46", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921060352083242, "text": "希望早啲解決，唔好再死咁多人啦！", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:21:27", "owner": "kenny_kinder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086695216997799, "text": "So sad happened", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:21:26", "owner": "maniks_official10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115975567562103, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:21:19", "owner": "jeanluc7718", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940029642965002, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:21:14", "owner": "mariamicky_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011307950810620, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:20:57", "owner": "kenny_kinder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924709609170970, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:20:54", "owner": "paulo.marko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864213151516681, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:20:35", "owner": "nisaifat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072792971200149, "text": "🫶🏻🫶🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:20:27", "owner": "dark_dopamine_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955431295018465, "text": "🙏❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:20:22", "owner": "dark_dopamine_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102920002669214, "text": "And they know the gaps between the buildings are only within meters.They illegally use theUnqualified materials to decorate the appearance of the buildings.And the wind was so heavy that the fire spread over so rapidly.But why the government didn't check?The materials they used forDecorating theBuildings and the devices.They hadBuilt for that.Which is unreasonable for a city who has seven million around the population.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:20:21", "owner": "akkocgleiziele", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18433915579105240, "text": "😭😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:20:07", "owner": "bolefdi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991906791896169, "text": "Damn", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:20:07", "owner": "dark_dopamine_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094534549897225, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:19:56", "owner": "imllpezz_22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951309904044012, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:19:49", "owner": "theownerpanama", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907232221270778, "text": "Insurance claim, they ran out of funding to complete the project so they burned it for the insurance pay out.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:19:47", "owner": "dadaprime", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064057817162975, "text": "💔🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:19:43", "owner": "berondolotis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109142977619187, "text": "هاي الدول صابتهم عين 💔اولهم العراق كلما حجو وكالو دشوف الصين وين وصلت  والله ماتستاهلون الصار\n انتو اجاويد", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:19:13", "owner": "adraa_mohsen94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089976061935056, "text": "Verschrikkelijk 😢 veel sterkte", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:18:50", "owner": "betzemafolkje", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095599066873054, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:18:49", "owner": "emadmotamedirad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864486553525157, "text": "🙏🙏🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:18:46", "owner": "sandy41__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909152998268720, "text": "Smoke 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:18:37", "owner": "fcsb4k4k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027017384577400, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:18:26", "owner": "jluna_malow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079161107132489, "text": "I think this caused by mostlyCorruptionCorruption and lack of responsibility for the checking.Of the authority by the programDirector because they don't use anyAnti fire materials just with wooden shelves", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:18:23", "owner": "akkocgleiziele", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049683761397246, "text": "Pessoas perderam a vida, animais e outros perderam tudo", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:18:11", "owner": "dedeajubi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855944098568361, "text": "Ooo o nasıl yanma oha yuhhh😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:17:57", "owner": "zswoidyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957826521888149, "text": "Prayers...💔😢🙏🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:17:56", "owner": "glitchywich", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061689857226681, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:17:53", "owner": "skprom22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059220956267116, "text": "😭😭😭🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:17:43", "owner": "isabelmartinezdesaavedrach", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085793600000369, "text": "too high.. no one can save you...// low may  a thief...///", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:17:26", "owner": "wong.waimings9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955986808033591, "text": "I live in the 6th floor and this is my nightmare 😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:17:26", "owner": "sophskii__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059067776265088, "text": "🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:17:24", "owner": "gpateldeepa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900134299179914, "text": "Geçmiş olsun 😢😢💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:16:56", "owner": "cevikkselda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007798358815730, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:16:52", "owner": "bojic_ivana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293840974302958, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:16:40", "owner": "verunka_ant_anu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075927587206958, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:16:35", "owner": "heidegendron", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099527572755635, "text": "From America ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:16:25", "owner": "sinisterdigital", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084544208014196, "text": "Haha wang fuk", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:16:22", "owner": "gnome_de_guerre_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084232928039021, "text": "😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:16:15", "owner": "marisol_knitting", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853493593582984, "text": "😭😭😭😭💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:15:56", "owner": "leidy_jesus_f", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078775193269680, "text": "Seems almost impossible. 7 bldgs!!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:15:53", "owner": "don.jones.ohio.usa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972534291960482, "text": "Uma cena simplesmente lamentável! 😢 Meus sentimentos aos familiares.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:15:52", "owner": "leandro_gomes1207", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077380591957336, "text": "Why did they fall and crumble into the ground?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:15:39", "owner": "otagunma86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048073358675910, "text": "😢😢😢😢💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:15:30", "owner": "damascenocaliane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090438955931826, "text": "Karma have everyone’s address and they will eventually come to collect. Just wait and see.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:15:01", "owner": "waggiewolf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970666242971342, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:14:13", "owner": "mila705826", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118926601483019, "text": "🙏💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:13:49", "owner": "maira_khan_9053", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048046283427916, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:13:44", "owner": "helenjamardo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075792709983215, "text": "This is tragic.  I hope they catch whoever did it", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:13:35", "owner": "shay3670", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18381869512144527, "text": "😢😢Que terrible 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:13:16", "owner": "soravel01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096454321680789, "text": "Oh geez 🥺😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:13:03", "owner": "angelalaiyenprintmaker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104988454631217, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:12:55", "owner": "dalgistorres", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067808084576973, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:12:53", "owner": "snewmantech71", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996112572854529, "text": "What is reason behind fire?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:12:48", "owner": "beant_c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103971853661452, "text": "💔💔 what a loss both human and material this is too much for sweet Hong Kong.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:12:46", "owner": "egwimgodstime", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066335624124523, "text": "Heartbreaking 💔 😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:12:45", "owner": "indiallure", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062678870537911, "text": "🥺🥺🥺💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:12:43", "owner": "simia.talai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116888956565125, "text": "It’s all the cigarettes", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:12:39", "owner": "mr.xlean.2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062197667533288, "text": "Planned 💯", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:12:39", "owner": "manele_records_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922287256053574, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:12:31", "owner": "lawids_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18553696540033034, "text": "I think with a cigarette", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:12:03", "owner": "mohamed_barnieh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095533531891855, "text": "That was no accident", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:11:54", "owner": "pretty_nicky__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885840778401128, "text": "Hearts and Prayers!!🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:11:49", "owner": "mrbarives", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006855413816179, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:11:46", "owner": "fabrinoandrea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084113642022080, "text": "😭😭🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:11:45", "owner": "mwelk18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104676913655406, "text": "Still buring after a day! 🥺希望被困的人可以平安无事", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:11:32", "owner": "vjkksq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069308123372378, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:11:19", "owner": "medet_turanov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046999667451892, "text": "😭😭😭💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:10:55", "owner": "noushin.nobakhti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148606384428349, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:10:32", "owner": "lilu913", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18538661680015689, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:10:29", "owner": "qenitaliqus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990050076904875, "text": "The fire was set intentionally, there was no way one block could catch fire from the other, because there is distance between them", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:10:27", "owner": "ingerpazitorr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086830618815932, "text": "So so sad to see....", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:10:19", "owner": "keiserkarel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049305194411105, "text": "Wang fuk!!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:10:19", "owner": "wearepawns.00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119798653477994, "text": "🙏🙏🙏💔😭😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:10:16", "owner": "denis.rolland.980", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865874416503190, "text": "My heart breaks", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:09:58", "owner": "kimorendor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119564182548512, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:09:56", "owner": "michael.stammer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066450668133193, "text": "OMGGGGGG🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:09:53", "owner": "samaryacevedo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057149966313531, "text": "Из Украины передаём вам глубочайшую обеспокоенность", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:09:34", "owner": "co7me7dy7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890800870382902, "text": "🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:09:31", "owner": "dandan7744", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993883557719613, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:09:22", "owner": "ustaoglumesut", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18294893833279611, "text": "有捐款帳戶嗎？", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:09:06", "owner": "sosi_monkey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957027006891972, "text": "💐🙏🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:09:03", "owner": "sach.in2710", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073024523039872, "text": "Wang fuk?🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:09:01", "owner": "naimlessblaze", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060042413632500, "text": "💔💔💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:08:25", "owner": "yerikawai", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085711691073810, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:08:04", "owner": "jennyyaa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18389987500177769, "text": "Holy fuk", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:07:59", "owner": "dan97cdx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064430786451508, "text": "I can't even comprehend this. 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:07:47", "owner": "kayewaller", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976120203951836, "text": "😮😮😮😮😮😮😮😮😮😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:07:31", "owner": "dimamorocco789", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293106784276568, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:07:26", "owner": "svandere", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980633190942419, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:07:07", "owner": "normaotacilio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078654517942994, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:06:54", "owner": "kentuckylovesit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064544591176326, "text": "🙏🙏🙏😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:06:52", "owner": "liliana.mel1959", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108230176716776, "text": "Truly sad, so sorry, 🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:06:47", "owner": "craigcurtis65", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079890956156084, "text": "???🤷🤷", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:06:43", "owner": "santex_best44_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954814834031881, "text": "No fire suppression systems place?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:06:43", "owner": "pross1635", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120390541530261, "text": "💔💔💔😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:06:28", "owner": "belkymurad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078549707272755, "text": "tecnologia .cadê ?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:06:25", "owner": "pedro.silvapereira.526", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063071693399925, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:05:56", "owner": "andysol44", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028158992771338, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:05:56", "owner": "jeerious", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897017761202679, "text": "Kako se to moglo dogoditi za jednu Kinu? Jako čudno. Nisam to mogla očekivati ni u snu da se to može dogoditi u Kini.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:05:55", "owner": "put_pod_noge_24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894347974221005, "text": "💔 this is so sad I'm praying for them what In the world is the building materials made of to go up like that that's to many buildings at one time", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:05:44", "owner": "heilo985", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145213975447138, "text": "🥺 我想表達我的慰問。", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:05:34", "owner": "rainny_pink2525", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078378683331657, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:05:25", "owner": "slavica.b123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123723364515763, "text": "Did @therock save the day?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:05:15", "owner": "ol_che_se", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062766458205018, "text": "Estruturas para conter um incêndio dessas proporções é muito difícil, os equipamentos nem chegam a altura suficiente 😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:05:12", "owner": "sacha_haddad15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065885267625814, "text": "Jesus 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:04:37", "owner": "andrewplummer277", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071302493359220, "text": "Tão modernos e ao mesmo tempo arcaicos!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:04:29", "owner": "paulocesarwendt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888462793265514, "text": "Incredibly sad 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:04:29", "owner": "kimandtracy2023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926586013030352, "text": "What can we do to help?🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:04:16", "owner": "adorkable_gal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892495549368190, "text": "It was the combination of the bamboo and green plastic tarps", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:04:09", "owner": "wetchlarry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090800488911582, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:03:59", "owner": "aipiupiu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540048943042694, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:03:56", "owner": "si.lvester387", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109596523610884, "text": "God send mercy 😢💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:03:52", "owner": "doktoranneee7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18294328693274903, "text": "😢😢😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:03:47", "owner": "gleisya197", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912907201247995, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:03:47", "owner": "__masha19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966329163995324, "text": "My thoughts are with the families of deceased ones🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:03:19", "owner": "kitcsiu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097570648880836, "text": "😢🥀🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:03:03", "owner": "glamoor0909", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18247965382293234, "text": "Pray for Hong Kong 💔💔🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:02:56", "owner": "taless_fairy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18297978175282424, "text": "💔🙏😭my heart goes out to these poor people", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:02:53", "owner": "mamavoodoo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842809009621412, "text": "Why is the building  not collapsing  like in 9/11", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:02:53", "owner": "bryce6_6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086606608984382, "text": "🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:02:48", "owner": "ritaeckringa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916341109213365, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:02:44", "owner": "mimibuendia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069061223085971, "text": "😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:02:31", "owner": "foka.olga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066294584578144, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:02:15", "owner": "mrschaudry_home", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064723301400667, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:02:10", "owner": "lucylabebis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064806434159690, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:02:02", "owner": "asanthi__kalugamuwa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082873297882853, "text": "Not collapsing! Curious 👀", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:01:56", "owner": "suppahlancia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921911131193699, "text": "😭💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:01:34", "owner": "1zero0o", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18148208029437892, "text": "Terrifying view...my god. My heart breaks for every victim of this. I cannot even imagine what must have happened and still is happening inside these buildings. Horror, that's just pure horror 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:01:20", "owner": "namia_kat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143675617392003, "text": "DIOS tenga misericordia que tristeza", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:01:19", "owner": "abuelitas.boutique", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18390433909180173, "text": "Que tristeza meus sentimentos a todos amigos e familiares 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:01:08", "owner": "beta_aborges", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104898199732598, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:01:07", "owner": "s.yyuuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105669112727458, "text": "So sorry for these people 😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:00:58", "owner": "luciana.figini", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976745172948757, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:00:48", "owner": "marganam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18179276809316834, "text": "Cuanta gente y animales habrán muerto😢🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:00:38", "owner": "acho_k1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105804661561329, "text": "😭😢😭😢🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:00:32", "owner": "gordafe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18548425111000720, "text": "🥺😢😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:00:16", "owner": "ximelor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933614374121348, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T18:00:03", "owner": "dawn.hickman1969", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078297704279374, "text": "Spread to three towers; arson ?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:59:33", "owner": "stephenritchings", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069180635579024, "text": "O sa-l darame in 5 zile si il reconstruieste in 10 🤝😉", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:59:31", "owner": "1997_bogdan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865864792503323, "text": "😢😢😢😢🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:59:30", "owner": "artes_da_lika", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147828391427614, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:59:27", "owner": "photon_by_eric_holmgren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082401359027306, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:58:45", "owner": "rimmachem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146221405428842, "text": "Notice it didn’t collapse like 9/11", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:58:41", "owner": "kellzbail", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082946462083702, "text": "My thoughts are with all those who have lost a loved one, with all those who have passed away 🕊️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:58:35", "owner": "ally.yoongi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083312582090255, "text": "Бедные люди😭😭😭😭💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:58:15", "owner": "miyabellakonorvins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873367258452264, "text": "Its so crazy these buildings didnt collapse into their own footprint.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:58:14", "owner": "atotalskeptic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081617690140273, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:58:08", "owner": "yangying_sherry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904610389295160, "text": "Heartbreaking. So many families that lost their home and relatives. 🥺😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:57:46", "owner": "mayflower0513", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18209912752313890, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:57:41", "owner": "rostik.butsenko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048036227678104, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:57:40", "owner": "fazliddin._siroj0v", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049659722384242, "text": "Just why 💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:57:25", "owner": "carol.allenby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856840042563303, "text": "how could this be real 💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:57:14", "owner": "salleechau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055672379323389, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:56:58", "owner": "giusy_fortuna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980411049779209, "text": "💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:56:57", "owner": "eileenjackson797", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917216299229953, "text": "Nowhere is truly safe in the world.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:56:52", "owner": "jonathan_explorer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947241732935627, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:56:49", "owner": "deerlinga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087137314810831, "text": "Heartbreaking 💔those poor people 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:56:45", "owner": "aliscotmc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103684753678617, "text": "Bu gercek mi", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:56:44", "owner": "madamgizz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083833667045858, "text": "Wish this was AI", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:56:30", "owner": "laz_stix_east", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084760412009135, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:56:22", "owner": "fabianaandradeoficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843561895623452, "text": "💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:56:16", "owner": "that_serra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545394400018022, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:55:59", "owner": "kaitoepfer_drone_photographie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031373468538795, "text": "🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:55:47", "owner": "vivismum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857891830558832, "text": "I hope the filipina nanny was saved, the last call is smoke is coming to their condo and she is holding the baby.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:55:20", "owner": "stormie9500", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868499830494167, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:54:57", "owner": "lilikaenachiuc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18248062147291852, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:54:31", "owner": "pablonordicbreezee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888824167389923, "text": "They be hating on smokers saying It was a cig but surley this was done by some construction company to building new aparments", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:54:17", "owner": "yungcattoni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082360757282753, "text": "So these are brands new construction buildings that no one was living in then?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:54:16", "owner": "alliyarose3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100882723686432, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:54:15", "owner": "kateryna1015", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094214623721996, "text": "Holy shit 😮😮 that is crazy..🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:54:15", "owner": "debrademmy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18245348824290927, "text": "😢🥺🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:54:11", "owner": "t_.eugenia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070015253594666, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:54:08", "owner": "baxtiyorov_muhammadali1", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17864171595447042, "text": "Astonishing.😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:53:58", "owner": "gforceimages", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973396854953678, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:53:48", "owner": "anna.anna4.3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104732839629150, "text": "I fear the original ulterior motive behind this to be greed 😢 may all the souls lost in this find peace and pray the corrupted people behind this pay the ultimate price. Prayers 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:53:23", "owner": "ginamendez12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065073611391866, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:53:18", "owner": "fabioladebock", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055180724653525, "text": "😢😢😢💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:53:10", "owner": "grammy3702", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057766967288032, "text": "真的很痛心，灾难来的太突然了。人的脆弱在在灾难面前一触即碎。🙏🙏竟然这种时刻还有人拿这种悲痛的事炒作政治，这种人简直不能称为人。", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:52:49", "owner": "aiden.jv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940418178964268, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:52:40", "owner": "steff1956", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047787290670116, "text": "How in the world did this happen, all those Asians smoke cigarettes 🚬💨 trying to be like stupid Americans 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:52:31", "owner": "terry30318", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084467813117244, "text": "Deus tende piedade 💔💔💔💔😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:52:28", "owner": "edilenesena2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932700180998512, "text": "Meus sentimentos a quem perdeu entes queridos!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:52:24", "owner": "josesidnei09.21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992567463853659, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:52:18", "owner": "frankyfurts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143876050445197, "text": "💔 so heartbroken for the people affected 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:52:12", "owner": "tangiandfriends", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084002684105669, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:51:56", "owner": "marie_f85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18299974549261649, "text": "😢💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:51:44", "owner": "mananna4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122646886523019, "text": "That’s so sad", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:51:40", "owner": "celestial_moon88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079726634137886, "text": "I have been living in Asia for 4 years, traveling around, and the buildings built so close to each others always blow my heart : in case of fire, it becomes a catastrophic event...", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:51:31", "owner": "francoisederougemont", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18523048681066866, "text": "😭çok üzgünüm", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:51:26", "owner": "celebisureyya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865032382513294, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:51:24", "owner": "shen.___.ns", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160644403400084, "text": "How? 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:51:23", "owner": "leesa_itonda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144195694451290, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:51:12", "owner": "mfchiu1242", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070283210374374, "text": "The people responsible need to be named and shamed. No hiding from personal accountability.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:51:08", "owner": "surreydogtrainer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049644845392251, "text": "Деверсия!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:50:39", "owner": "bosia1971", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072341081600342, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:50:37", "owner": "aprilrosebulaclac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967076448989080, "text": "6 ayda yıkıp yenisini yaparlar", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:50:36", "owner": "max.raven07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130400539500732, "text": "I wonder why these didn’t collapse like the world trade center towers and building 7? 🤔🤔🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:50:00", "owner": "raymagnolia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092686099905690, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:49:53", "owner": "artistsalinalaw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969279936822596, "text": "🥺🥺🥺🥺🥺😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:49:38", "owner": "mariannepsguimaraes1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921048379083481, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:49:07", "owner": "cuadrosdehoracio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870056125403095, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:49:03", "owner": "blackmoonpanther", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088032208945460, "text": "😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:49:02", "owner": "pprabuboy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077775929334035, "text": "Oh my 💔💔💔💔😢🙏🙏🙏 my thoughts and prayers are with all those who have lost a loved one, responders and to HK 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:48:52", "owner": "shar.explore", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128254951498126, "text": "Devastating 😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:48:47", "owner": "lblossomfoxl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086205577950427, "text": "😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:48:47", "owner": "maritzazanas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132865747482775, "text": "心碎了", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:48:36", "owner": "countesskroenen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104638186650696, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:48:26", "owner": "luana10181", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090741361901459, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:48:10", "owner": "divu_choudhary0777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061124024547362, "text": "What happened", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:48:10", "owner": "s.h.e.l.l.a_lalaromans", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155911756417222, "text": "🥺🥺🥺🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:47:57", "owner": "yessimiller60", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094011493716347, "text": "Tough loss!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:47:34", "owner": "xkeemxupreem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079398284326757, "text": "🙏🙏🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:47:11", "owner": "drp0252", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092058487924836, "text": "Bamboo in 2025 not efecient", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:47:07", "owner": "azizan4215", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933033913131265, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:47:00", "owner": "bktde94336", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18333630580208738, "text": "Pray for Hong Kong🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:46:53", "owner": "emily93093", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059807129264872, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:46:36", "owner": "yu_jaci", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073446851523166, "text": "🥺😢💔😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:46:05", "owner": "marciamenai2617", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002683115832550, "text": "😢😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:46:02", "owner": "77angiexx_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062744447531956, "text": "Killing animals with cruelty may go unnoticed by humans, but our actions have consequences. Animals we befriend leave lasting impressions. Be kind, face karma.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:45:51", "owner": "shirin.5thaveclub", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009019871811347, "text": "Человейник", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:45:38", "owner": "pioneerka22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852318628590639, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:45:33", "owner": "happy_pig_0425", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909380596122409, "text": "if we're luck they might save the foundations", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:45:31", "owner": "holden.matozzo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943819126081221, "text": "😭😭🖤🖤无法言语的心痛", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:45:01", "owner": "ms_huihui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049595363394270, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:44:51", "owner": "nat_kakdela", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953988640034152, "text": "😢 misericórdia", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:44:42", "owner": "veraregina644", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091935682907356, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:44:34", "owner": "zulay30baro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069272495583156, "text": "Sie sind keine 100 Stockwerke hoch „ ca 400m „ wie die WTC 1&2 aber sie stehen immer noch obwohl total ausgebrannt sind , ist schon interessant oder ????", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:44:26", "owner": "hwd1957", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085745651480666, "text": "@u_r_binni", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:43:57", "owner": "j_jun_y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867311680485017, "text": "🙌🏿🙏🏿🚒💨💨💨", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:43:55", "owner": "horripilante1963", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183409144348273, "text": "Acı duyabiliyorsan, canlısın. Başkalarının acısını duyabiliyorsan insansın.( Lev Tolstoy) çok üzücü 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:43:52", "owner": "siyah_inci10_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114196150517610, "text": "😭😭💔💔🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:43:50", "owner": "amychanchch", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17912858535252291, "text": "🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:43:50", "owner": "muezza_butik_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902235934319580, "text": "Con estos edificios tan altos en caso de incendio son masacres, pues el agua de los bomberos no puede llegar a los pisos altos, y por lo que se ve no tenian aspesores de agua en caso de incendio. 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:43:48", "owner": "jujuma60", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961993602861368, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:43:44", "owner": "mehmetgockun_2714", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882371506309289, "text": "💔🥺😢 rip", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:42:28", "owner": "linda.k_k_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930365551117524, "text": "💔🙏This is tragic. Pray for those who lost their love ones.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:42:26", "owner": "davidparkersoccer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099979729774846, "text": "😮😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:41:46", "owner": "josmartinez1593", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042677996493361, "text": "燒到咁點撚樣算，咁多人失綜😭😭.🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:41:34", "owner": "chengwk79", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18179076112367143, "text": "🙏😮🥺😢😭Let’s hope they are able to save more lives & injured ones as well . God bless", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:41:33", "owner": "bobpatelz4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865555453433009, "text": "😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:41:24", "owner": "magdalenabroze", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902558359315130, "text": "Where’s the Rock when ya need him", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:41:21", "owner": "nicklefritzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970929348976353, "text": "💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:41:08", "owner": "alanka.anita", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085359179003527, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:41:03", "owner": "mehmet.gocen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855584629522955, "text": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DRibNT_kr_y/?igsh=MThheDFpejdyZ2w5bw==", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:40:35", "owner": "fionlolo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072029999589034, "text": "AI", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:40:18", "owner": "parames_muniandy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18313209118247287, "text": "So sad for the loss of lives and people's homes.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:39:32", "owner": "bergdenjudi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18380780536197025, "text": "What a tragedy. I hope they find who is responsible.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:39:28", "owner": "richardmorris534", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870305854396191, "text": "😢😢💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:39:25", "owner": "mili_shookron", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855331966526028, "text": "They should all collapse according to the US Government", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:39:19", "owner": "imjimsmith", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894217798221164, "text": "Why the building still in congratulations but still  have living there ? So sad 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:39:11", "owner": "maricel_d21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073559822015784, "text": "🕯️🕯️🕯️🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:39:04", "owner": "jinzhi_huang77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880180645327448, "text": "Ohh so they didn’t collapse from fire? lol", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:39:03", "owner": "sammoos550", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165231601391139, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:38:29", "owner": "reelsbyalisheikh_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908871604127041, "text": "天佑香港🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:38:28", "owner": "_ad._20__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089638387755743, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢💔💔🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:38:23", "owner": "jmilka17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541851619035539, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:38:15", "owner": "dominika._7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097004692840704, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:38:13", "owner": "dominika._7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113608351595623, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:38:09", "owner": "diebeline", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072050498349524, "text": "Жахливо !!!😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:38:06", "owner": "svitlanashumeyko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998099787696692, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:37:53", "owner": "cagnettivalentina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926052928080398, "text": "😢🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:37:46", "owner": "jearamvi1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544348441059838, "text": "😭💔🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:37:37", "owner": "chachi_chacha_gopgop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033456395734023, "text": "😢💔🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:37:35", "owner": "vandenboschlena", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094076014893820, "text": "See yourself", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:37:33", "owner": "chachi_chacha_gopgop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337282747239915, "text": "Then", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:37:27", "owner": "chachi_chacha_gopgop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079390867911862, "text": "Believe", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:37:23", "owner": "chachi_chacha_gopgop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171211264373147, "text": "Don't", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:37:20", "owner": "chachi_chacha_gopgop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999939663838856, "text": "If you", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:37:18", "owner": "chachi_chacha_gopgop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895993246357986, "text": "Pray for west bengal 😭 cause something big catastrophic is coming 😭😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:37:06", "owner": "chachi_chacha_gopgop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863936104531997, "text": "Pray for Hong Kong 🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:36:08", "owner": "hkibmsm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085619123076697, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:36:07", "owner": "pao.lo6263", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125343271508371, "text": "💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:36:05", "owner": "deborapanama_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854038459534208, "text": "🙏🙏😢😢🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:35:33", "owner": "harbans_singh_tamani", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17924627949189610, "text": "Imagine that - none of them collapsed after burning for one fully day", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:35:27", "owner": "oreo_and_boo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18434786122096351, "text": "🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:35:03", "owner": "dreejas66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184720792352835, "text": "Жах.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:34:31", "owner": "bystritskaia409", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972046713967107, "text": "🙌Prayers to Hong Kong and it's people", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:34:01", "owner": "comme_si_2017", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850150903598539, "text": "💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:33:38", "owner": "comme_si_2017", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987294966893516, "text": "@71nazos", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:33:31", "owner": "egeli00000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078836389926033, "text": "This is an act of terrorism for sure! How can all the building go on fire at night when so many households are in their own place!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:32:59", "owner": "dk_indaeyo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18167477884383803, "text": "💔😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:32:52", "owner": "parvaneh____004