 "text": "💔🥺😢😭🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:29:57", "owner": "101.2180", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867719092492940, "text": "Chinese made cladding that is neither fire resistant or safe!!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:29:55", "owner": "yetanotherrep", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18538757836048480, "text": "pray for hk taipo", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:29:36", "owner": "todaynewsmeme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086974849990933, "text": "😄😄😄😄", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:29:06", "owner": "yusuf_eko227", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065205377420866, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:28:52", "owner": "sylkefacius", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060820154558220, "text": "So many people effected I hope they get resolution fast.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:28:48", "owner": "tom.george74", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053085566661857, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:28:43", "owner": "cris_kikuchi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970487157978292, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:28:40", "owner": "vss_stidever", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063212048187951, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:28:38", "owner": "le_margheritine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120926446530375, "text": "😢🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:28:37", "owner": "willchan63", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088507522948588, "text": "çok üzücü 😢😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:28:21", "owner": "nezahatt1903", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062966117540798, "text": "😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:28:16", "owner": "paquiquev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929933551120457, "text": "😢💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:28:16", "owner": "mmbandb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905455240143413, "text": "And people still thinking the fire put down the world trade centers.❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:28:15", "owner": "laurens_horneman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099506728751934, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:27:57", "owner": "wyociiik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095175787888320, "text": "Terrible", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:27:43", "owner": "beatriz_betta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950094252917827, "text": "Praying for the families who lost a loved one 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:27:41", "owner": "j.taylor071", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152713072423459, "text": "💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:27:12", "owner": "jula0008", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934187020159573, "text": "Chinese chickencages 🇨🇳🚮🚮🚮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:27:11", "owner": "zukunftsbau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077101823266522, "text": "Insurance", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:27:07", "owner": "theturkishgreek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922689565192654, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:26:56", "owner": "companhia.portugueza.do.cha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18437579233096166, "text": "😪😪😪😪😪😪😪😪😪🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:26:49", "owner": "chouchanianrosemarie", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086427037984812, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:26:47", "owner": "amoon4922", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990824217897007, "text": "So sorry 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:26:47", "owner": "caylirtoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979896801931283, "text": "😭😭😭🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:26:37", "owner": "auntieswardrobe66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076511933192174, "text": "Oh la la", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:26:09", "owner": "berengete", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074186072251299, "text": "先致敬消防员，再回答一下问题。为什么香港救火没使用无人机？有的，香港救火采用了无人机，但是在这次的火灾中的主要目的是作为勘探的作用，并没有直接采用无人机灭火。为什么大陆的无人机灭火这次香港没启用。因为，无人机的采购和当地区的政府有直接关系，因为火灾出现的频率底下，无人机这种机械用品不使用也会损坏。泛用性单一的设备不是每个地方都会大量采购。做的最好的应该是上海？我也不确定，但是，香港距离上海那么远也无法直接志愿。其次就是这次香港火灾，最快进行支援的就属广东的消防员，别在骂大陆没所作为了。", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:26:07", "owner": "kimi.chen.758", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076929494240120, "text": "🙏願逝者安息🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:25:37", "owner": "louise140953", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890405902384865, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:25:21", "owner": "deevanatalia_dzr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072638606343962, "text": "C est triste vraiment . Mais soyons humbles. Quand on voit cela on se dit que le matériel derrière lequel on court n est que matériel. Mes pensées aux familles", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:25:13", "owner": "espedebahia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861456226539681, "text": "Feel so sad to see this. I was there in hong kong a while ago.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:25:02", "owner": "dukeabdur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102141280740536, "text": "Hard to believe that could happen in this day and age somebody was not doing their job correctly. It’s a shame. It’s a sad day a horrible couple of days", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:24:58", "owner": "pjp83057", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930311428116169, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:24:42", "owner": "agent60398", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087585268960160, "text": "💔💔🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:24:39", "owner": "beadsstudio64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861368311468322, "text": "Those other Towers 25 years ago were an inside job", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:24:34", "owner": "roninphotos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078144992466363, "text": "😔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:24:33", "owner": "lulubelleclarrise", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104531797634470, "text": "What caused this to happen?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:24:21", "owner": "myra12610", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18330702355212380, "text": "Borzalmas 😢😢😢!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:24:05", "owner": "nemethza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951451702021613, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢🥺🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:24:04", "owner": "zavalagrasso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896924965205094, "text": "太可怕了😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:24:00", "owner": "fan.m.888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061098209234209, "text": "🥲🥲", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:23:53", "owner": "justsmi_me", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081356785894481, "text": "To takie smutne💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:23:52", "owner": "kasia.ejsmont.77", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17842734651628903, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:23:32", "owner": "leoni_deon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055790162320485, "text": "🥺🥺🥺ॐ शांति🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:23:31", "owner": "arya9190", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085654504999609, "text": "So so Sad. God Bless everyone. 🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:23:30", "owner": "euroasiabt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069702818081575, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:23:24", "owner": "akkie100472", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867317428484137, "text": "对于“香港的建筑物是如何建造的”这个问题，没有直接的答案，但香港确实在 1997 年建造了一座建筑物。自香港回归中国以来，香港与中国的联系日益紧密。在中国，一座十层高的公寓楼仅用28小时便利用模块化建造技术拔地而起。香港拥有众多摩天大楼，堪称现代建筑和工程的典范。 \n香港的建筑施工\n模块化建造：中国利用模块化建造技术，在28小时内建成了一栋10层高的公寓楼。这种技术中，建筑构件预先制造，然后在现场组装。\n建筑与工程： 香港拥有许多著名的摩天大楼，这些摩天大楼是现代建筑和工程的见证。 \n香港和中国的历史\n香港于1997年结束英国统治回归中国。\n香港自 1997 年以来一直是中国的一部分，这两个地区一直保持着各自的独立性。\n中国的官方语言是普通话，但香港也讲粤语。", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:23:05", "owner": "mt_tomo_sky_999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094305838718400, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:22:57", "owner": "juan_luisbonilla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085643990000432, "text": "🥺🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:22:41", "owner": "moomina_112", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083545001039573, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:22:39", "owner": "shanhao_bonnie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110232049617449, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:22:36", "owner": "ashpak.khan.564", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047312816446085, "text": "Praying for everyone 😢🙏❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:22:23", "owner": "fra__nek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108450403556659, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:22:21", "owner": "navythuan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18333431062236936, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:22:19", "owner": "themayorofsimpletown", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18330607213245371, "text": "Bambusowe rusztowania...", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:21:45", "owner": "aqarius111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18388015699197264, "text": "So sory guys", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:21:43", "owner": "dreams_0622", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907846681266920, "text": "Raptem cale budynki objął ogień 🤣 masoneria rządzi.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:21:26", "owner": "artur8ss2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096344770833860, "text": "🕊🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:21:22", "owner": "auroch33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085885436080402, "text": "😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:21:12", "owner": "a.c_c_y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868141261413839, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:21:11", "owner": "wewe_africanstorehk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881217982424054, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:20:54", "owner": "karencombes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148208515384964, "text": "Waouh pauvre gens qui sont morts dans cette horrible incendie", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:20:43", "owner": "annemarielauwers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084202859022763, "text": "💔💔💔😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:20:04", "owner": "nhatletaodo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050134757400455, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:19:45", "owner": "tuboshubotu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152442757414419, "text": "Omg🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:19:36", "owner": "alessandra.xsandra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849117379602799, "text": "Это продуманный поджёг, но какова цель его наверное никто не узнает.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:19:31", "owner": "lion.8006810", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104063488590848, "text": "Thoughts and prayers go out to those affected", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:19:17", "owner": "lixfate1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932626018135177, "text": "How did it happen ?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:19:01", "owner": "klemiiii_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975184221953874, "text": "Esos mantos verdes provocaron que se expandiera el fuego 🔥 más rápido y los vientos. 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:18:35", "owner": "juliocesar189", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047456390455262, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:18:28", "owner": "pkinternational", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057667730306942, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:18:26", "owner": "icexsupame", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060183272250386, "text": "This is very heartbreaking. People’s homes, family members, neighbours, and everything they had 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:18:02", "owner": "rachelchowchow2312", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135198100427298, "text": "Subhanallah", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:17:57", "owner": "ad_am7940", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059148917284147, "text": "😢🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:17:53", "owner": "di_rmzn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081649931162835, "text": "Yet they didn’t collapse ….. I remember 2 other stronger towers with less fire that fell at free fall speed . How strange …..", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:17:40", "owner": "davidbaker1988", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134502034484908, "text": "用竹製的鷹架，這次香港大埔宏福苑高樓大火 事發24小時後，似乎沒多少燒毀的跡象，倒是棚網 圍阻灰塵的施工用的，是這次大火延燒的重要因素，還有 港府勞工處發出的公文裡 有一行文字寫 此次施工 無需使用防火材質的施工用具，這個 港府要好好地對民眾解釋了！", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:17:35", "owner": "twnsamsung1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842259442632014, "text": "This is why I keep saying we do not need buildings This Tall this is very hard to deal with fire outbreaks unless they have one floor committed to Emergency Services only", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:17:20", "owner": "cheryl_k_c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069443813381603, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:17:16", "owner": "cecilefrickerlehanneur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050402702670199, "text": "💔🙏😭😭. So sad praying for you all and your family's", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:17:03", "owner": "mred1968socal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105280252728644, "text": "bbq 😶‍🌫️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:16:55", "owner": "chachar.x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18372035980157878, "text": "😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:16:51", "owner": "nanangsand_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18318266398221949, "text": "Horrible. 🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:16:38", "owner": "debrabateman16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153680773412784, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:15:58", "owner": "carolmarieedwards", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088604959756191, "text": "💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:15:54", "owner": "aweenzkiki_prudential", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918726643072354, "text": "🙏🏽 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:15:52", "owner": "jaushmusic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103767421591643, "text": "THIS IS ARSON", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:15:51", "owner": "dimitri_s10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185349457350486, "text": "Dolor por las vidas que sufren y por las que ya no están 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:15:40", "owner": "peterkan27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105317368640498, "text": "💔😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:15:37", "owner": "comstock_45", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18532457599038200, "text": "Estavam construindo ou pintando os prédios?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:15:32", "owner": "ivanetemariaaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865448056437322, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:15:27", "owner": "feldu.vivo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100225642688410, "text": "i was always wondering what they would do if one of these tall buildings catch fire...finally I get an answer", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:15:21", "owner": "amarylliso_o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902698642167054, "text": "💔😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:15:19", "owner": "queenarin5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084218831079123, "text": "😮🥺😢💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:15:17", "owner": "nyjoesalsa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080082149125679, "text": "The bamboo scaffolding is still there. It makes no sense to blame bamboo.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:15:17", "owner": "niccccholassss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029646800555219, "text": "My thoughts and prayers are with those who have lost loved ones, their families, pets, those innocent lives. It's so heartbreaking 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:15:12", "owner": "sukabebibuni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18324923176240355, "text": "香港平安🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:15:10", "owner": "eric9618", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080596430137680, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:15:10", "owner": "mebruke.gulece.oztorun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929525728150357, "text": "Tragédia disfarçada de crime de peixe grande com intensão de destruir esse prédio propositalmente!\nEstranho no Japão com tanta tecnologia e essa incapacidade????!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:15:02", "owner": "menin_select", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082411787510567, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:14:59", "owner": "aaliyanahas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051976712355748, "text": "😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:14:53", "owner": "harlemhonie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977232480791433, "text": "Wang fuk", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:14:52", "owner": "abandonedadelaide", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910592836257237, "text": "Many blessings. 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:14:52", "owner": "spezia_walkabout1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102500653670981, "text": "Didn't this happen in England not to long ago?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:14:48", "owner": "ska4me", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086296435955700, "text": "We are so sorry Hong Kong 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:14:41", "owner": "reydakolstadnorway", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116307781499061, "text": "God gives strength to their families 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:14:32", "owner": "brown_girl_nia1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066509762528833, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:14:27", "owner": "nalizona_luba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060936938216165, "text": "希望平安🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:14:13", "owner": "ayangpeng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854056948579013, "text": "Wow", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:13:47", "owner": "yhemlick", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338047342232856, "text": "🥺🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:13:44", "owner": "nadiashabaniiiiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112933222604813, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:13:43", "owner": "akissofsoul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087340534956552, "text": "Que tristeza.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:13:20", "owner": "leilacristinaadv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086379748825718, "text": "Escalofriante", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17: