Very sad for everyone effected", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:10:31", "owner": "davids.mcelwain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851173321595978, "text": "I😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:10:21", "owner": "tivanilly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096488869686782, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:10:17", "owner": "luzma278", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070272401605659, "text": "I tak za tydzien odbudują", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:10:07", "owner": "takemyhandm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18552609469011399, "text": "💔😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:09:36", "owner": "shun5985", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18322111216168007, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:09:33", "owner": "fanchingmei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870059317468196, "text": "😱😱😱😭😭😭😭💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:09:31", "owner": "lisa_ouardighi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18407656924189213, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:09:30", "owner": "hoodwealthforlife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058646450638584, "text": "😦", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:09:25", "owner": "yllari_gc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086272624818066, "text": "Когось повісять в партії", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:09:23", "owner": "vykriikazadarma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114063448574216, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:09:18", "owner": "lara_lee1958", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078926821932063, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:09:14", "owner": "brett_lr7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989724546858395, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:09:09", "owner": "se1ma.u", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18330415798240523, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:09:02", "owner": "jacqueline_peyrot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086909821822148, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:08:36", "owner": "balanavi86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18315620587220042, "text": "🙏🙏😢🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:08:25", "owner": "iuldasheva_ugiloi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18207903142316026, "text": "😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:08:25", "owner": "isabelriveratorres", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940712029094801, "text": "I don’t understand.  No fire suppression?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:08:12", "owner": "therealsheldonh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18375593641152433, "text": "Seeing this on the news was absolutely terrifying. Thoughts and prayers to all those affected by this tragedy🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:08:08", "owner": "123honeybeeme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852291580591448, "text": "All those lives lost because they still use bamboo scaffolding and that green mesh. As some point these countries need to revamp their health and safety protocols.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:07:49", "owner": "tucci.3668", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085109978470085, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:07:09", "owner": "adriana.daaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18299203564284460, "text": "40 dead and 300 unaccounted for. Why? 😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:07:05", "owner": "journeysonthepage", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108877252616805, "text": "@mumbainews  @gallinews_com", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:07:01", "owner": "tanveer_5810", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865040401523972, "text": "@magdalena.liszka.96  did you see this 💔😭 terrible", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:06:53", "owner": "craigkinmond", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067199732116980, "text": "Ils ont encore sous estimé le nombre de morts et disparus 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:06:40", "owner": "kriceu_tyne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035513027738575, "text": "What the fuk", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:06:27", "owner": "mdubs.racing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019381979789684, "text": "平安平安", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:06:24", "owner": "yue9808180705", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073786037255773, "text": "💔😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:06:20", "owner": "mrs86sb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18385381588199434, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:06:12", "owner": "venera.mars0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956380576032834, "text": "🥺🥺🥺💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏Horrible…", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:06:09", "owner": "winstonwu58", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068067962108703, "text": "Por que todos os edifícios foram queimados?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:06:07", "owner": "monicasgonzalez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965926899840660, "text": "Боже мой. Бедные люди", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:06:05", "owner": "mamulya64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855149281527034, "text": "Why they are using bamboo ? ?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:06:01", "owner": "barthz_esperida", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901244686319560, "text": "😮😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:05:57", "owner": "karina1009172", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083216132107474, "text": "They built that very well for it to be standing still", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:05:54", "owner": "gfol2ce", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110449204610078, "text": "2026 me duniya khatam hai 🫡🔚", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:05:44", "owner": "trend_zshorts", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18086501138057981, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:05:44", "owner": "aynuraxundd_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894213829224800, "text": "💔 Truly devastating praying for all those families affected 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:05:42", "owner": "dawnmartinez_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083720378010596, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:05:41", "owner": "lavi_0103", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085527712832816, "text": "Don’t they have fire sprinklers in these towers", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:05:32", "owner": "handy_mr.b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079603798924953, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:05:19", "owner": "yoongi_tata_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037039358709949, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:04:55", "owner": "marwanebraham", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541029862027277, "text": "Too little, too late.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:04:40", "owner": "spacemanrandy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544650361000285, "text": "Intencional o diabólico …", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:04:33", "owner": "marylisbeth28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073938167251591, "text": "M