ntos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096740035851129, "text": "Sending prayers 🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:02:38", "owner": "lesphotography_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074401172258706, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:02:01", "owner": "kmbrlyaaann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133813915470236, "text": "We are born in high-rise buildings city. We haven’t happened the fire like this before. Tell us concrete building is not safe.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:01:59", "owner": "liuchauyuk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068880044096660, "text": "How did this happen , it’s not an accident for sure it must be an attack", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:01:59", "owner": "aliahassan85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074275298463718, "text": "Oprah wanted the property.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:01:52", "owner": "pk_scrapple", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844110115619780, "text": "💔pray for Hkg😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:01:52", "owner": "arethapatty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061567607215783, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:01:41", "owner": "sureenfoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079714990932964, "text": "😢😢😢omg", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:01:33", "owner": "laila_assaka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064278407176253, "text": "Hoe triest; Geld telt ; maar mensenlevens Niet !", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:01:18", "owner": "jgsandman7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113926249573704, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:01:17", "owner": "dubrovska_m_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869014960475924, "text": "🙏💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:01:13", "owner": "tiffanebaeteman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079343482906537, "text": "Please bless all families of all the buildings.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:01:05", "owner": "ycgri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918725353084828, "text": "Росія кожного дня бомбить ракетами і дронами будинки, разом з людьми, в Україні... #russiaterroriststate Кожен день путін вбиває, або краде  українських дітей ...", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:00:56", "owner": "sl.tati.california8"