4, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:52:32", "owner": "fralupi06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843932314612537, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:52:28", "owner": "ghoshsourav588", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071623412056728, "text": "How???? 3 or 4 towers??))", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:52:27", "owner": "alexradich", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926655466154584, "text": "Pray for auspiciousness", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:52:23", "owner": "qiadingche613", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987512220748502, "text": "How did this happen 4 building burnt  together  I hope those who are out of the building they are safe 👷🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:52:22", "owner": "himanshichauhan278", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065828534151456, "text": "😭😭😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:52:15", "owner": "maikrosenzweig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049138406406646, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:51:58", "owner": "4180_marina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877881499435440, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:51:56", "owner": "cosres96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064468679568762, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:51:55", "owner": "panda.qq123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113346922600578, "text": "Terrible💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:51:53", "owner": "lunafeles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099690832785753, "text": "🥺🥺💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:51:40", "owner": "dilmurod198693", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925552660038052, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:51:31", "owner": "na.shayegan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077678528189720, "text": "💔💔💔\n🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:51:14", "owner": "oldgravy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954080292904383, "text": "Tall rise buildings are the main housing system in HK for decades but why haven't they innovated any advanced fire fighting system especially being well developed country.!!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:51:05", "owner": "nimals86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949814061917914, "text": "Eines der größten Risiken beim Wohnen in Hochhäusern ist die fehlende Fluchtmöglichkeit im Notfall; dies ist ein Beispiel dafür.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:51:05", "owner": "metin.polat60", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085455647005792, "text": "How is it that all three buildings burned? 🥵 😮💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:50:58", "owner": "christinelovestextiles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104600680725847, "text": "Dear God Almighty... how can that be possible? My prayers and condolences are with the people  of Hong Kong 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:50:55", "owner": "bela.metelo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077396006332833, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:50:48", "owner": "traveller_raaaaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986419764872393, "text": "Yüksek binalarda yaşamanın en riskli yanlarından biri acil bir durumda kaçamamaktır, bu bir örnek.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:50:34", "owner": "metin.polat60", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079826798153541, "text": "💔😮🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:50:11", "owner": "edamiao71", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968298111989109, "text": "One of the riskiest aspects of living in high-rise buildings is not being able to escape in case of emergency, this is an example.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:50:10", "owner": "metin.polat60", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087404851945386, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏💔💔💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:49:50", "owner": "isabelle.bois66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991105764892193, "text": "🥹🥹🙏🙏一切平安", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:49:46", "owner": "yan.soulrich", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969814188974476, "text": "🥺😢😢😢😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:49:46", "owner": "manenegarcia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085036916011431, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:49:39", "owner": "jiha_in_mapletown", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968646768984842, "text": "😢😢🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:49:39", "owner": "venetiagbrown", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087016730488734, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:49:36", "owner": "jardin.courounelle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025795622784961, "text": "Very sad 🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:49:35", "owner": "hau.kim.tg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104698075633876, "text": "🙏💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:49:24", "owner": "maria.magazzini", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062119031532078, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:49:23", "owner": "mimidegiorgi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879706117334491, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:49:12", "owner": "mimidegiorgi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858487414555846, "text": "😢 Это большая трагедия", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:49:12", "owner": "oks7097", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109708486544724, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:49:06", "owner": "mimidegiorgi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088624502487847, "text": "😢 mis condolencias a las familias y amistades de los innumerables fallecidos en esta tragedia evitable😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:49:01", "owner": "tere.n__n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367343473084717, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:48:53", "owner": "pintojanylla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080824655139963, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:48:34", "owner": "gardenia.spinola", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119645371526730, "text": "I typed in Wang Fuk and got a totally different website come up not about fires", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:48:23", "owner": "hisroyxlhighness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894323644223916, "text": "🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:48:14", "owner": "judith.breed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101400037666615, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:48:04", "owner": "andersoncalligaris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087857812804820, "text": "💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏😭🥺🙏🙏🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:47:58", "owner": "azrahuber", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031580540744615, "text": "Позор на весь мир", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:47:54", "owner": "plushgram6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096329851830172, "text": "Интересно, а как вообще планировалось тушить верхние этажи?  Или пусть себе горят?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:47:49", "owner": "elenavogni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086009372060722, "text": "Que horror!!!!!!!😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:47:46", "owner": "imartinovoa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910063426255032, "text": "💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:47:45", "owner": "nono_o12o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842089516633180, "text": "It's so devastating to see this. Pray for all those affected by this tragedy. 🙏🏼💖🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:47:41", "owner": "leleeangel_co", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101840881672554, "text": "😮😮😮😮🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:47:17", "owner": "plushgram6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114069562517641, "text": "This is so heartbreaking.. praying for everyone affected😭💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:47:13", "owner": "_kimseok2parkminjeon_7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093320485910145, "text": "Wank fuck we are dine", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:47:10", "owner": "janey_loz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048876122415228, "text": "💔😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:46:56", "owner": "julianna.ar.y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100835737703633, "text": "I feel so sorry for these people! What a sad tragedy. 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:46:41", "owner": "dituszart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115459267560144, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:46:39", "owner": "vero.ro.104", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145813675444843, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:46:16", "owner": "jrocha_belezaebemstar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109407118613440, "text": "This is so sad to see on Thanksgiving! May all the departed Rest In Peace and those impacted, overcome this tragedy. We home HK investigate fully and punish those responsible.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:46:13", "owner": "eagleyes9925", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027810791564739, "text": "🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:46:02", "owner": "ysauraatruman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042473225705092, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:45:59", "owner": "sandravdrk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075586268337246, "text": "Força aos que ficaram 🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:45:47", "owner": "anna.roccha10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18232016041306078, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:45:43", "owner": "rachy.rach_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060879977240830, "text": "؟😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:45:41", "owner": "sky0000blue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376302709157526, "text": "So fire cannot melt steel?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:45:40", "owner": "pierofalotti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082543139033606, "text": "How come they don’t have special drones? If there arent fire prevention equipment to reach the top of these buildings then they shouldn’t be aloud to be built so high in any country💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:45:30", "owner": "ruthnguyenseltzer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052012595347747, "text": "RIP 香港🇭🇰", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:45:30", "owner": "dzozhou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18413959732187282, "text": "Terribly 😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:45:24", "owner": "anaraakk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105771295572393, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:45:24", "owner": "zeilto_66_ramos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965928765840759, "text": "No words to describe the heart wrenching loss of lives and property.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:45:22", "owner": "herestolife211", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18186329902343228, "text": "My condolences..💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:45:20", "owner": "brow.niekat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098765035751313, "text": "Gara\" rokok?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:45:05", "owner": "sofyan36_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075647780336216, "text": "😢🙏It's very sad what happened....", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:45:02", "owner": "glowackiprzemek78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088549570787153, "text": "God bless Hong Kong.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:44:39", "owner": "wishpeace04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988792020871518, "text": "didnt seem to collapse under jet fuel", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:44:29", "owner": "yaoma_yaoma5", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18099035101695320, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:44:27", "owner": "margiedmolnar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074979542213708, "text": "Que Tristeza", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:44:01", "owner": "luisvaulet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936544297128918, "text": "😢😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:44:00", "owner": "geremias03_19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065483948408057, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:43:28", "owner": "srta.adriii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126941878503367, "text": "😮😮😮😮😮😮😮😮😮😮😮😭😭😭😭😭😭🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:43:26", "owner": "claudiaferrari67.cf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901619056300245, "text": "Meu Deus", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:43:26", "owner": "donna.thera", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18180679822358689, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:43:24", "owner": "liu.dou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048883166410979, "text": "It looks like deliberate work😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:43:10", "owner": "cinamornagard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854062606534153, "text": "Building materials quality is supar than world trade centre tower🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:42:09", "owner": "ravi24829", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991719612897294, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:42:02", "owner": "karsten.mueller.942", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080637629143760, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:41:48", "owner": "__________ricardo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860999362542897, "text": "🥺💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:41:17", "owner": "geny.oliverofc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885414157406050, "text": "Looks like they have good fire defense. Sure it could've spread to more buildings 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:41:11", "owner": "bloodangel313", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921589720193825, "text": "Diep triest 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:41:08", "owner": "john.ancona.52", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914904235236442, "text": "How could the fire spread to every single building and burn like that...it seems illogical", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:41:06", "owner": "nurulainainms", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112892647578028, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:41:02", "owner": "tex2387", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050440862380296, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:40:50", "owner": "nightrace_7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936781866983664, "text": "C'est  bon le poulet est cuit !!!!😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:40:41", "owner": "alainbrebant", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073100291200242, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:40:37", "owner": "yoursliaaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065645198627288, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭😭💔💔💔💔 meu Deus que tragédia que Deus tem misericórdia dessas pessoas 🇧🇷🇧🇷🇧🇷🇧🇷🇧🇷🇧🇷", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:40:21", "owner": "cristina.emidio.9634", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18428162461106174, "text": "What do you expect? The scaffolding is made out of…bamboo! Wood!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:40:02", "owner": "pantelis.kokkalis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547681579047584, "text": "💔... 😥 ... 🥀", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:39:51", "owner": "henschelina.bakes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079466267134083, "text": "That’s horrible 💔💔💔😢😢😢🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:39:45", "owner": "seatownguy29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098104066835200, "text": "My heart goes out to all these people.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:39:44", "owner": "crissy_with_no_limits", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954448045024427, "text": "好难过，祈祷平安🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:39:34", "owner": "coco__0622", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874498816448633, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:39:18", "owner": "tinali936", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047082188441675, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:39:16", "owner": "lifengping1977", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993102267723652, "text": "My condolences 😭 HeartBreaking 🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:39:02", "owner": "gs_js_01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129923875501181, "text": "🙏🙏🇹🇷", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:38:56", "owner": "tumris_hasar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868869670475879, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:38:35", "owner": "imrb301989", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073398188198572, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:38:33", "owner": "lcw.1113", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544332649003455, "text": "Nós, moradores da cidade de São Paulo- Brasil - sabemos o quanto é horrível o incêndio em um edifício. Apenas em um já gera tanta tragédia, nem dá para imaginar o horror  que aconteceu em Hong  Kong", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:38:27", "owner": "verareginanovelliilha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383041591197985, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:38:17", "owner": "nastasieal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094909252849454, "text": "Papo pra boi dormir IA", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:37:59", "owner": "mmartynsellyanne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032678732744051, "text": "Quanta tristeza! 😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:37:58", "owner": "camilla.mouranery", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071090537067297, "text": "Başsağlığı diliyorum , 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:37:37", "owner": "goksugokmenozel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353369938201930, "text": "🙏😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:37:30", "owner": "franstrim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967007751988419, "text": "When residents and experts tried to expose the fire safety issues, District Councilor Peggy Wong sided with the OC.In an August 2024 Facebook post, Wong dismissed scrutiny as ”demonic rumors“ (妖言惑眾) and urged support for the OC to keep the project moving ”in full swing.“", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:37:29", "owner": "sunfish_5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067538954384299, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:37:18", "owner": "simona.svobodova76", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082223444134667, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:37:17", "owner": "chenxixi9818", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973660659957361, "text": "😭😭🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:37:14", "owner": "hamrerasmalika", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18549370867044302, "text": "😢😢💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:37:05", "owner": "jerushaportel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036442160720277, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:36:47", "owner": "rosilopez6488", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933154003121069, "text": "Sendung Prayers, so sad. 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:36:47", "owner": "nati.davis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070608434594035, "text": "Hanya dengan sebatang rokok yg jatuh , hancur semua 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:36:34", "owner": "hads_santoso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157077682406638, "text": "Oh mon dieu 😢 courage a vous", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:36:33", "owner": "veronique3640", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075399923224210, "text": "Very sad. 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:36:30", "owner": "las_vegas_photoblog", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062046539207444, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:36:30", "owner": "grimson_astelon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18186039316349117, "text": "😮😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:36:20", "owner": "gennycresswell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072940541023898, "text": "2 planes would have got the job done", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:36:05", "owner": "bleetha_x_bills", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990328317734659, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:35:56", "owner": "mulawrapping", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062248361208800, "text": "😮🥺😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:35:50", "owner": "hongsunpyonam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18198515593323295, "text": "😭😭😭🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:35:45", "owner": "jogi_ro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085385704989899, "text": "💔😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:35:38", "owner": "tulinlord", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080136737140942, "text": "Prayers!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:35:35", "owner": "rcg0011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18393383635130717, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:35:31", "owner": "lesliewedley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852269533543853, "text": "This is so heart breaking…", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:35:24", "owner": "oss_is_a_bert", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985698441820487, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:34:58", "owner": "ari.air.air", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064491029555044, "text": "Nightmare! Someone must take responsibility.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:34:54", "owner": "vla4688", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906735895279605, "text": "🙏🙏💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:34:46", "owner": "deborawaasdorp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909405877122428, "text": "But they're still standing!🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:34:44", "owner": "huthejukebox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099913285741581, "text": "😢😢😢😢💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:34:43", "owner": "marissaayaaya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969372129825037, "text": "kok bisa njiir 3 bangunan sekaligus oebakar nya ratusan lagi pasti yg melayang nyawa 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:34:42", "owner": "____hayoloh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113838037601711, "text": "😮😮😢😢😢😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:34:38", "owner": "klairescl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064660571400212, "text": "That’s so sad.😞", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:34:36", "owner": "charlieism", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863028208533005, "text": "😭😭😭😭💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:34:17", "owner": "mccumber.sue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850238791562187, "text": "We're was the emergency fire alarms which need to be with the water system? I have being in construction for 35 years !!!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:34:06", "owner": "eli.gus1985", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073866248352841, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:33:44", "owner": "angelsmarcos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18250048516293526, "text": "So sad💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:33:12", "owner": "mikewheatley1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539273281043400, "text": "This is so bad we're are the emergency sprinkler systems!! ?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:32:53", "owner": "eli.gus1985", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909933286256984, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:32:53", "owner": "demolidorasoberano", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142712170393283, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:32:50", "owner": "linnea_lagom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976264956951143, "text": "How did they all catch fire", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:32:50", "owner": "danny_gaming_22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924460369178655, "text": "When the building doesn't use fire retardant insulation 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:32:16", "owner": "eetu_2022", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086342410817994, "text": "Devastating 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:32:10", "owner": "dnulgah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933953734107668, "text": "My thoughts and prayers to all the families  and Residents that had been impacted in this devastating  fire. ♥️♥️♥️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:32:02", "owner": "meinoog888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044199686701643, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:31:42", "owner": "ishusingla743", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855535597570470, "text": "Todo por la culpa de 1 por fumar", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:31:22", "owner": "carmeng_995", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929695546015018, "text": "U should not be able to build higher than fire rescue equipment.  What good is all that water when they can't teach the top.  Poor souls 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:31:21", "owner": "why5top", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18137575204460271, "text": "🥺🥺🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:31:18", "owner": "h.nie.ya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103133161675171, "text": "Dann sage noch einer etwas über die Gewerbeaufsicht. Dort haben viele versagt", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:31:15", "owner": "axel_lampe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091626803508278, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:31:12", "owner": "trishbutkowski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147600253441333, "text": "😢😢🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:31:04", "owner": "hilcavilarimalves", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892518394367462, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:30:55", "owner": "2025scorpionmooncresting", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044938937686284, "text": "🥺🥺🥺🥺😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:30:53", "owner": "mariaeulaliagarcia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944650786080060, "text": "@1202_kim 😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:30:53", "owner": "k_da_hi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970568994970662, "text": "RIP to those with my condolences 🙏🏾❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:30:44", "owner": "butterfik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051029756378175, "text": "💔😭heartbreaking", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:30:41", "owner": "happymsjay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001544888682052, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:30:35", "owner": "maria85esther", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18413452696138764, "text": "Was it the cladding like at Grenfell Tower?💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:30:34", "owner": "dannaprosser", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081839912120347, "text": "There are 1.42 billion more Chinamen to take their place. Who cares.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:30:34", "owner": "thumpr19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088224941505544, "text": "💔💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:30:29", "owner": "greenprs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104247496598026, "text": "А где китайские пожарные  литучие дроны", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:30:11", "owner": "insta1.kg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101181235739089, "text": "🥺🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:30:09", "owner": "sabrocio1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18340070107228926, "text": "🥺😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:30:00", "owner": "vira_ma_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899653870185868, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:29:52", "owner": "maymaywolalainsg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914464531237164, "text": "Yosun değil. Su altında hiç değil. Balık yok. Yine güvenlik açığı.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:29:28", "owner": "anilelifakartuna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18166090480377186, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:29:17", "owner": "tudoseanca0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127581394444585, "text": "this was planned some how must investigate the owners of that property", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:29:04", "owner": "oscara.morales.14811", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105590092715510, "text": "Veštačka iteligencija 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:28:37", "owner": "nenad.mitrovic.92775", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083106749044082, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:28:34", "owner": "qitong888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999526788836245, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:28:32", "owner": "mpxoi1979", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852263488545585, "text": "😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:28:26", "owner": "proelectric_kokshetau_03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867229864500221, "text": "#prayforhongkong 🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:28:02", "owner": "chestee0817", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065913338130577, "text": "為香港此次灾情深感痛心，对死难者同胞表示哀悼。", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:27:57", "owner": "hong_joocheul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18299454133283721, "text": "Shame. 😳", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:27:47", "owner": "quinzy1977", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142947244396891, "text": "😢😱", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:27:35", "owner": "nomad_gl449", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931091728131572, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:27:33", "owner": "37melekerol", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18540474409004331, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:27:27", "owner": "a.o.t.t.o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027725708564521, "text": "Skycrapers are a really bad idea 👎🏽—- genius minds but the idea is bad 🫥🫥🫥May God have mercy on everyone 🙏🏾", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:27:27", "owner": "shespostin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089187421752133, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:27:25", "owner": "miss_laney81", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081432524321279, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:27:17", "owner": "danielaceballos21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057970514550601, "text": "Que o Senhor conforte os corações de todos os familiares 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:27:10", "owner": "kelliany_mario29", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18146840065435924, "text": "Please don’t make stupid comments at a time like this. Planes flying into a building a little bit different from bamboo scaffolding and plastic. My heart goes out", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:27:09", "owner": "neemrana94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058291535289333, "text": "😭😭😭💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:26:48", "owner": "anaanabanana_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119460910551069, "text": "My condolences.. it’s so heartbreaking 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:26:39", "owner": "ridakhiz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050485499383374, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:26:30", "owner": "vanilda.as", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18407516062189544, "text": "Wo sind die Dronen mit Wasser???", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:26:14", "owner": "agijoh2009", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030758987767228, "text": "Meu Deus 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:26:11", "owner": "emmillysabrina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545732104001299, "text": "And they tried to tell me two planes took down the twin towers and building 7z", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:25:57", "owner": "imfjz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17868131412416974, "text": "🥺🥺🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:25:54", "owner": "sesinakyuz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020608139608763, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:25:52", "owner": "velengsawww", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993396504888898, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:25:49", "owner": "margaritagirl64_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293499067274872, "text": "Made in China 🗑", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:25:40", "owner": "drtruuth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947563920934771, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:25:14", "owner": "boxcar_kruse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063749318530714, "text": "Todos a la misma vez?????", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:25:06", "owner": "tajanronald", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969324420977889, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:24:56", "owner": "cassandravinchon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948853290999419, "text": "Shades of Grenfell 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:24:54", "owner": "kye.hendrix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961618395863806, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:24:47", "owner": "robin_hood_1962", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077267885518418, "text": "God bless everyone safety", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:24:29", "owner": "purelovefirstmet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101483566690765, "text": "🙏🙏🙏💔愿平安", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:24:25", "owner": "salioooo0o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948034140931621, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:24:23", "owner": "jiumu12413", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909350038123488, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:24:20", "owner": "nethralaya07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087454688490956, "text": "Shenzhen offered help but was turned down, there wasn’t enough fire engines so the buildings kept burning. Should have accepted the help offered by Shenzhen.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:24:18", "owner": "justanotherroy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064300988169016, "text": "❤️🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:24:10", "owner": "marcantes_fluten_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18162122464394671, "text": "Räucherstäbchen", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:23:28", "owner": "marc.va_89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542558893058528, "text": "Жууть💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:23:22", "owner": "amilove_travel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539178301035488, "text": "Is this the famous building that those youngster always come to take picture?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:23:19", "owner": "knn.audrey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030062183556171, "text": "🥺🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:23:19", "owner": "dhea_gomurski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132867721434398, "text": "Oha last of us gibi looks like", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:22:38", "owner": "pacificwarhouse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065454137423068, "text": "firework", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:22:27", "owner": "syousyaman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002599436681686, "text": "多謝外勞🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:22:23", "owner": "dlseafood", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18273110140303439, "text": "🙏🙏🙏💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:22:22", "owner": "je_suis_christian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111056512593807, "text": "No asprinkorer asysstem", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:22:21", "owner": "gold_country_farming", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074001410018376, "text": "Tell us how😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:22:21", "owner": "bern7381", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092014027903164, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:21:57", "owner": "thythymorokot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058885112272008, "text": "Hongkong, Indonesia😭🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:21:51", "owner": "habidahuu__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544513258059897, "text": "This is unreal 💔. Im heartbroken seeing this for those that lost family, loved one and their pets.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:21:40", "owner": "msamandaweaver", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115665898575553, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:21:39", "owner": "jackyluo55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031813526746435, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:21:37", "owner": "rajudhivar58", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084661763100605, "text": "Estão fazendo churrasco? 🤣🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:21:16", "owner": "enamot55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140239741457100, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:21:10", "owner": "makeapahlsson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093878527807657, "text": "心好痛😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:21:05", "owner": "liujiuru47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301951747281457, "text": "😁", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:21:04", "owner": "m_banoo1851", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367838791094428, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:20:59", "owner": "nisaaakbar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951280330023176, "text": "😢💔💔🥺🥺🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:20:59", "owner": "ga_bi8177", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184778158349514, "text": "😭😭💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:20:46", "owner": "melisa.chowp31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936576915984127, "text": "Lot of \"experts\" on here.  All of these basement fire pro's should be sent over to investigate.  Where's all your useless thoughts and prayers today?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:20:42", "owner": "dizzray1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366239530085029, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:20:40", "owner": "miaomipan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056559980644880, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:20:05", "owner": "tiyek88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18551538631044426, "text": "Damnnnnnnnnnnnn", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:19:59", "owner": "shflazn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153649351427083, "text": "Que triste 😭 muy triste 😭😭😭 me rompe 💔 Dios esté con ellos y fortaleza por las perdidas de personas 🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:19:57", "owner": "pomales_molina_doris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051688007673426, "text": "🫨🥺😩🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:19:51", "owner": "naya._108", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893016553367140, "text": "😞😞😞😞😞", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:19:32", "owner": "princess._.ishika", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18412462786188374, "text": "🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:19:31", "owner": "nanatchanturidze", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899260168340005, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:19:29", "owner": "adrien751", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062189966211436, "text": "Terrible😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:19:20", "owner": "josyanepinheiro_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084575417071518, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:19:16", "owner": "aksh_s_023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931747867133785, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:19:03", "owner": "ariete528", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931627999113920, "text": "Give me house 🏠🏡🏠🏠🏡 thanks", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:19:00", "owner": "wayneclarke617", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092142697922762, "text": "Quel drame ‼️ cela me fait penser à New York en 2001 😥😥❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:18:42", "owner": "nadcook18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038441786709413, "text": "💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:18:40", "owner": "gigi_0m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101559898666333, "text": "Very sorry for all those who lost their family, relatives and friends. My condolences.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:18:35", "owner": "stmarie66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989456706860097, "text": "Definitely was a wang fuk", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:18:32", "owner": "handicapracer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18364599136094116, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:18:27", "owner": "joselitoa.santos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062852585538001, "text": "Who puck up", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:18:24", "owner": "wayneclarke617", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893675698362302, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:18:09", "owner": "captain.nox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105555790644504, "text": "We realize that the firefighters 🚒 must think of another way to combat fire for skyscrapers like that? My thoughts goes to those who have lost their loved one. Thanks to all the firefighters and volunteers helping out🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:17:55", "owner": "vasenda_sc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904524754289530, "text": "😢😢😢😢🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:17:42", "owner": "nadcook18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935535301104540, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢kde teď lidi budou bydlet 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:17:31", "owner": "marcelapetrasova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859613329552083, "text": "고인이 되신 홍콩분들의 영면을 바랍니다 아울러 상심이 크신 유족분들께도 심심한 위로를 보냅니다😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:17:27", "owner": "chobo2120", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095470888883947, "text": "这下是真的臭港了", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:17:20", "owner": "shinahito", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994010640710815, "text": "A sorpresa non sono crollate", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:17:19", "owner": "andr3_robu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047039144444536, "text": "Very goood", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:17:13", "owner": "lobsang.yeshi.71868", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18170426242373966, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:17:09", "owner": "seoreiee_5018", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922228093053398, "text": "😢😢😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:16:50", "owner": "ivaneideivi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037854221718231, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:16:41", "owner": "fattygg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902797801165410, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:16:41", "owner": "michelle0106", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035173082735803, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:16:28", "owner": "irenegriepink", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088915124308454, "text": "Sending all my prayers to HK 💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:16:26", "owner": "iam_tylorrobinson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002283023832219, "text": "中国香港政府已经出来证实，原本是1栋大楼着火，后来火势蔓延开，速度非常快", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:16:17", "owner": "taiwan_is_a_province_of_china", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17958407727041001, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:16:03", "owner": "tin_lee1902", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058430369288301, "text": "🙏pray HongKong 天佑香港🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:15:58", "owner": "yrq_q", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921727693192959, "text": "Absolutely heartbreaking .", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:15:47", "owner": "darth.k10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066604727617883, "text": "How...😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:15:41", "owner": "bebeksaestu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864173938525756, "text": "Me hace pensar en las mascotas también 😭💔🥺😢🐶🐕🐱🐈", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:15:37", "owner": "luisasuarez777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107758051721560, "text": "Brp orng yg mninggal we", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:15:17", "owner": "_rizky2022", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100561333774198, "text": "Hong Kongers can't rule themselves", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:15:08", "owner": "bigblue866", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073057196345834, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:15:07", "owner": "jim_lhj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892915105364272, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:15:07", "owner": "g.mu66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971020719970706, "text": "I’m shocked all the buildings caught fire.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:14:56", "owner": "nowoke9843", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977253573947048, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:14:41", "owner": "sholpan_kazangapowa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074082089201681, "text": "Terrible trajedia😭😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:14:37", "owner": "luisasuarez777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059368985258438, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:14:26", "owner": "the_photomgrapher", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844830265617918, "text": "😢 I also think of animals who may have not survived 💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:14:13", "owner": "tianna93_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028352105771732, "text": "🙏💔🙏💔🙏💔💔🇮🇷🇮🇷☝️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:14:11", "owner": "ali_onegh_2172", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145282885443775, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:13:28", "owner": "superdani6262017", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051997703359607, "text": "That had to be a population control issue", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:13:25", "owner": "angelfrmbul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026093828775636, "text": "Has Russia extended its filthy paws here too? The filthy creatures have even crawled here.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:13:24", "owner": "ne.mo4841", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073244981198918, "text": "Fruit to save money has caused them to spend more, lots more money. I'm so sorry for them💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:13:10", "owner": "marionarmstrong683", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916258480086147, "text": "💔🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:13:10", "owner": "unseilie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111817324609018, "text": "🙏😢🕯🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:13:07", "owner": "elmex1972", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119839642545596, "text": "🙏💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:13:02", "owner": "dersotv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063771077533854, "text": "Like dousing a forest fire...😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:13:02", "owner": "sampat617", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875312767446716, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:12:14", "owner": "nokgordon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147958159391291, "text": "🙏condolences to all those affected.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:12:13", "owner": "jrnhawaii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965579139993634, "text": "🙏💔😭🙏💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:12:06", "owner": "valeriemoreilhonyahoo.fr_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851900707553184, "text": "Omg those poor people!! This is horrible.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:11:52", "owner": "ultimateexposure_vancouver", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119536648546637, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:11:51", "owner": "o.i.lepskaya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18192867136328363, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:11:35", "owner": "boburjan_h", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140039365456970, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:11:26", "owner": "lotay_z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066629993576041, "text": "Demolition...bring them down.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:11:19", "owner": "hadjisoteriougeorge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925130650176544, "text": "🙏🙏🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:11:08", "owner": "so_jeyemmmmmmmm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119246086538201, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:10:52", "owner": "mirjanamira_1411", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867663751490530, "text": "So obvious it wasn’t an accident. Even a 3 year old from kindergarten knows…", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:10:51", "owner": "the_only_kaylie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095185414881529, "text": "Ich hasse Hochhäuser!! Die Leute ganz oben haben keine Chance da raus zu kommen 😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:10:50", "owner": "grigo_michael", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086397293005714, "text": "🙏🙏🙏heartbroken!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:10:50", "owner": "eastmoonjade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078389453274972, "text": "🙏❤️🙏😢💪🏻⏰💪🏻🌻🌤️🎯🍀", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:10:43", "owner": "neonat_story", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136552564463684, "text": "😢😢😢😢💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:10:41", "owner": "ianca.michelle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051414479347815, "text": "Ok😂😂😂🇮🇳🇮🇳🇮🇳", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:10:41", "owner": "indian.gujjar999", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17997937601752565, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:10:38", "owner": "rogeriogiroto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366410275094988, "text": "Glad the fire is out", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:10:11", "owner": "mrboomba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156709528407253, "text": "😢 so sad!! 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:10:09", "owner": "dedaadamss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027753020569821, "text": "My heart is broken 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:09:23", "owner": "diangellinnis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059842835531384, "text": "🇮🇳🇮🇳😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:09:20", "owner": "indian.gujjar999", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18101065861703048, "text": "😢Omg!!!what happened?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:09:00", "owner": "jasminabg011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100773568688198, "text": "為什麼要用竹子架起來，唉😞", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:08:49", "owner": "ooooooli00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18191006143339269, "text": "Que tragédia Deus", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:08:48", "owner": "opto.elianevasconcelos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064968575161126, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:08:27", "owner": "priyanka.pnkj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069317693604608, "text": "Unbelievable 💔. This destruction is devastating 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:08:19", "owner": "rinahomecooking", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099252202806445, "text": "Unfassbar 🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:08:17", "owner": "shorty944", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949775823924676, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:08:06", "owner": "julissaperez30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146073325435324, "text": "🙏💔🙏😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:07:40", "owner": "ingegerdfryk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118264258545966, "text": "😭😭pray for those who have lost their loved one. Hk building construction is even better than the collapsed building in 911", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:07:40", "owner": "pikkwanlam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031512089542452, "text": "Sourced?💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:07:39", "owner": "captain_delight", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875436406446546, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:07:22", "owner": "huangmmm.j", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111390076593330, "text": "Why hasn’t it collapsed in its own footprint????", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:07:17", "owner": "darrenwreis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095827411681248, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:06:50", "owner": "padewraddapaopass", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050739038382432, "text": "Ну и кто в этом будет жить ? Небоскребы", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:06:37", "owner": "glebova02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18199223884326037, "text": "💔😭😭😭😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:06:28", "owner": "carolynvallejo91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18315577339219026, "text": "Que tristeza!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:06:11", "owner": "janasilvaaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916242049216604, "text": "Böyle ev böyle yaşam mı olur böcek gibi", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:05:57", "owner": "oktemke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544368631002292, "text": "Muito triste isso 😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:05:44", "owner": "cdpequenos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937756318102091, "text": "Can't imagine how much dead bodies in it 😔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:05:39", "owner": "aodrencmoua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070710152358359, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:05:23", "owner": "suzy_vigni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940313697965446, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:05:15", "owner": "aodrencmoua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103611304589099, "text": "😢😢😢😢💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:05:01", "owner": "yen.mango", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18289900468263122, "text": "This is why we don't live in towers like that. We learned that from 911", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:04:42", "owner": "yin_with_the_yang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868639282412372, "text": "希望一切平安", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:04:36", "owner": "sharpsevenliu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067105493577322, "text": "Just terrible", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:04:33", "owner": "dalelu55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020873429609993, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:04:21", "owner": "cva31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081352565117428, "text": "As a firefighter i can never understand why people keep building tall towers.. They don’t make fire trucks with a ladder more then 60m..", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:04:20", "owner": "nicvanherck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927495493170814, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:04:11", "owner": "dianewilliford99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935355241105305, "text": "NAM MÔ A DI ĐÀ PHẬT 🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:04:07", "owner": "haile.96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083710514027599, "text": "Mon Dieu , tous ces gens  et  les animaux pris au piège, quelle  Horreur 😢😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:03:40", "owner": "castelcathe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888172663391991, "text": "🙏❤️💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:03:34", "owner": "raffaeleaquino_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078304247587293, "text": "阿弥陀佛", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:03:04", "owner": "theadragoh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078699604911886, "text": "\"Officials say it has now been “contained” in the final three blocks, but that extreme heat is hampering rescue efforts.\nPolice have arrested three construction company executives, two directors and one engineering consultant on suspicion of manslaughter.\" (The Independent). Apparently hundreds are still missing and the suspected cause of the fire was the use of bamboo scaffolding. Please check in with your loved ones if they are in the area as the fire is still going for the sounds of it.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:02:56", "owner": "shion.via", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846483643613339, "text": "Conspiracy", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:02:54", "owner": "vincati_wzy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875426965444954, "text": "Lord Jesus help them 💔💔💔✝️🙏🕯", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:02:48", "owner": "mulo_montage", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088390024777537, "text": "祈願逝去的人不再痛苦了🙏😭🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:02:22", "owner": "jane__0922", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073230188216275, "text": "😞", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:02:21", "owner": "carosaucdo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860684359477975, "text": "🙏🙏😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:01:56", "owner": "bauzaite_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087455662953273, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:01:55", "owner": "kasianotkash", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18384050230179233, "text": "香港的竹子脚手架，真的可以淘汰了", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:01:51", "owner": "sejon766", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964731109003124, "text": "Ye and WTC collapsed in 30minutes😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:01:34", "owner": "nibelungen.forge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18247872256292768, "text": "Japón... primerísimo mundo con andamios de bambú 🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:01:28", "owner": "pato_zero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896367634357584, "text": "😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:01:25", "owner": "asemai_080886", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140977513459864, "text": "Mong mọi người bình an 🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:01:22", "owner": "luu.tuss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101595205664767, "text": "What a tragedy", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:00:59", "owner": "sue.ruppel.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101988877731782, "text": "삼가 고인의 명복을 빕니다", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:00:35", "owner": "mingtoomom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047718731441101, "text": "Tanrım yardım etsin😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:00:24", "owner": "hulyacuval", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088914662500356, "text": "Это Китай быстро строит", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:00:16", "owner": "aichurok2986", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952675663046829, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:00:04", "owner": "hulyacuval", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929316154148243, "text": "建筑署署长罪大恶极", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:00:00", "owner": "chin_nnnchin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849424864600032, "text": "🥺🥺🥺🥺🥺🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:00:00", "owner": "negrita78v", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067241807418000, "text": "也太可怕了吧！", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:59:24", "owner": "a0978902534", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396008134132193, "text": "And not a sprinkler head in sight...", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:59:09", "owner": "thehotdogmanishere", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061914983203085, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:59:09", "owner": "amodeoliliana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064460927407826, "text": "😮😮😢😢😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:58:48", "owner": "niachikobava", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854024443534855, "text": "💔😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:58:42", "owner": "arianna.inwonderland", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073400765339588, "text": "😢 que desastre. Pobre gente 😢😞", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:58:33", "owner": "cecividnat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026220773585378, "text": "What the Wang fuk happened there.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:58:17", "owner": "chris.alp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18173836831368343, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:58:13", "owner": "nabilah.ok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105961687714794, "text": "Xina wumber 1 bbq!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:58:01", "owner": "dharmavid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094020886709582, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:57:56", "owner": "annnnsooon3d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096617230873332, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:57:36", "owner": "will_powerismyname", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18420405460112610, "text": "😭😭💔💔🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:57:21", "owner": "mariamseasonsdecor", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18079876814323953, "text": "HK communist government should be responsible for this fire disaster", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:57:20", "owner": "hungtailon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854801194575583, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:57:09", "owner": "ining.son", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079184051159610, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:56:48", "owner": "sunny_littlesunshine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079405547125917, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:56:07", "owner": "katteia59", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025018769590326, "text": "💔💔💔😭😭😭😭🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:56:00", "owner": "lolita79000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376455511153041, "text": "So many glitches in the ai. The smoke keeps resetting on the buildings mid clip.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:55:57", "owner": "arttravel51", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978107841944755, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:55:30", "owner": "noel_chou1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952635667022985, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:55:10", "owner": "jeanlucdelazzaro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066405275137347, "text": "💔💔💔😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:55:05", "owner": "tuti.seksi12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105157411723585, "text": "This is what happens when the government is corrupted", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:54:37", "owner": "c2pumpkin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983418210766478, "text": "waiting on the investigation. Lots of finger pointing by people who are not fire/safety investigators.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:54:35", "owner": "art_francisco360", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925685056039709, "text": "I smell insurance job", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:54:28", "owner": "bwpontiacta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18418780171113624, "text": "Holy shit!!!!!😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:54:03", "owner": "mylesbumgarner969", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145287331448725, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:53:58", "owner": "kinderhaerter.90200", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881598076424575, "text": "Какой ужас! Мои соболезнования родственникам погибших и скорейшего выздоровления раненым ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:53:33", "owner": "renavalieva_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18412847191136690, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:53:25", "owner": "ranziu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105717037723468, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:53:22", "owner": "raviraviteja334", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081455399131546, "text": "Ai", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:53:05", "owner": "ranziu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113444464573635, "text": "💔💔💔😢😢😢🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:53:04", "owner": "quackie5150", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984114966763082, "text": "These towers are inhumane. Each \"apartment: the size of jail cell. This was a foreseen disaster. We will never know how many people died because China is not a forthcoming regime.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:53:01", "owner": "zceli6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077988959242756, "text": "Ellos son los reyes de los drones", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:52:55", "owner": "dulceagostini", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850195774562654, "text": "Massive fires in 4 high rise buildings and they are all still standing...", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:52:46", "owner": "458lottfan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076061782986067, "text": "Lord God deliver those souls who  couldn’t save their lives . Death comes like a thief in the night . Have pity on their judgement as in their eternal rest . Father Son &Spirt.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:52:44", "owner": "tstclair58", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100228528783540, "text": "💔💔😭😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:52:34", "owner": "zeneliadel.carmen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143438464443310, "text": "Where’s the aerial drone firefighters that China promoted so much?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:52:14", "owner": "chasecar7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076274063242855, "text": "😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:52:00", "owner": "roselioliveira565", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18515052502066913, "text": "This is years of lack of governmental law on high rise outer wall renovation project flammable material control.  This is not the only one, there’s many fire reported before this one.  It’s just this is the most lethal one.  Lack of action and strong penalty allow construction companies to ignore this issue and see what they have done. 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:51:38", "owner": "chen_kim_yin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060212477641820, "text": "🙏🙏🙏💔💔💔😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:51:32", "owner": "evacharlottlockhart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086842573999421, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:51:18", "owner": "bunnyclay__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137924455412272, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:51:05", "owner": "neu_fabri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069798674371782, "text": "Where it is", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:50:55", "owner": "tootianehendostan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052612445657213, "text": "Not didn't burn yesterday cause it started yesterday and you didn't see how many fire trucks now  hahahahahahahahaha", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:50:53", "owner": "m0nkkeymuscle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087775303781969, "text": "The green mesh was very stupid I hope this was not started deliberately this is so sad 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:50:47", "owner": "shirleyannemc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932799237996759, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:50:37", "owner": "ladybird094", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997637415699332, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:50:36", "owner": "ang_matos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929598259142796, "text": "🥺🥺🥺🥺🥺🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:50:31", "owner": "dila.fruz777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063465116630254, "text": "🥺🥺🥺🥺💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:50:17", "owner": "yuliya_malinka25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077606831269956, "text": "Are they new buildings? Or fully occupied and under construction?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:50:02", "owner": "tiffand3girls", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945926509069959, "text": "😢🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:50:02", "owner": "hillbillyinparadise", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896499910350835, "text": "Praya for tai po @hongkong😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:49:52", "owner": "mutty14_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134357971483054, "text": "Como foge disso🤔 balneário Camboriú tá seguindo os passos", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:49:40", "owner": "rildotv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925734145080992, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:49:37", "owner": "maria.luciasantos_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076289111247709, "text": "😢🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:49:22", "owner": "dionysius_areo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927178909157069, "text": "😮😮😮🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:49:19", "owner": "garmash2987", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083471597287949, "text": "Wang what?????", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:49:09", "owner": "lakusvt01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18350710183162939, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:48:37", "owner": "looooooooo15__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067250825420950, "text": "Prayer. My goodness", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:48:33", "owner": "jjdynomite41", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18414738250137298, "text": "🙏🥺 soso sðd", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:48:13", "owner": "samyabrasill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087061669953728, "text": "😢😢🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:48:05", "owner": "ronzalove", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914154382240621, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:48:03", "owner": "alekos_chile", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148723957430236, "text": "Very very sad.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:47:58", "owner": "quarles1201", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857541463503511, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:47:26", "owner": "petzik65", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301714840281645, "text": "Wah da fuk happened?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:47:23", "owner": "_just.a.puppy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900029536180371, "text": "This is terrible 💔 praying for the victims of this terrible crime", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:47:19", "owner": "d0y1ndraws", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946300648065222, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:46:51", "owner": "sainidhi09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098151514696773, "text": "😮🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:46:30", "owner": "imane_imilayra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955981666045266, "text": "天佑香港🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:46:16", "owner": "nick_chen_xo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540674125036777, "text": "Oh my God😢😭💔! Prayers for the victims🙏 I hope the are survivors...🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:45:56", "owner": "andrearoth59", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075471838992872, "text": "🥺meu Deus Que Deus conforte o coração de todos", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:45:52", "owner": "michelerxavieraniceto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978268971946424, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:45:20", "owner": "paulinachaireznava", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047766596442243, "text": "Oh my 💔💔💔 there are really no words for this tragedy.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:45:16", "owner": "lucymary82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976215339956892, "text": "大切な家族や友人と会えていない方々が、1秒でも早く会えますように。\n被害に遭われた方々が心穏やかに過ごせる日が来ることをお祈りしています。\n亡くなられた方々のご冥福をお祈り致します。", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:45:05", "owner": "hare_teru0407", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182280400359350, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:45:00", "owner": "iammariza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18330006112243421, "text": "😢😢😢💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:44:56", "owner": "cleneci9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062795132540691, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:44:44", "owner": "lidiamlidia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107793274626574, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:44:40", "owner": "royalfurriers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114587086569367, "text": "That can't be a accident. 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:44:28", "owner": "lucyv.gartner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086925511807865, "text": "That’s y building those that high is dumb for this exact reason fire travel everywhere so ofc it’s going to to be hard asf to reach everywhere", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:44:27", "owner": "313tato", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18550915225046047, "text": "Electrical issues", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:44:23", "owner": "trishworldtraveler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541836346035539, "text": "Bruh how many building were on fire ? This is intentional", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:44:10", "owner": "the_steve_b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075212735263487, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:44:09", "owner": "ahmedd.badee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087815843509070, "text": "May the families find peace🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:44:01", "owner": "danielgarcia.gomez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902354614320890, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:43:59", "owner": "pleinelune75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842229139627720, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:43:56", "owner": "pleinelune75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155414584414097, "text": "Thus reminds me of GRENFELL TOWER in the UK. Same type of high rise buildings- no where to go", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:42:07", "owner": "ms.lifter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103864138635665, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:42:01", "owner": "martasantos1973", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18550726162020682, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:41:55", "owner": "akingulazer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18395526970135944, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:41:49", "owner": "riejeannex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881529085423304, "text": "This can't be a coincidence...", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:41:44", "owner": "abdel813", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106495837628772, "text": "That is some mess to deal with. How did anyone survive? 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:41:41", "owner": "paulreidyphotography", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925693507036372, "text": "💔💔💔💔😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:41:39", "owner": "iamperlat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118158310491158, "text": "What a disaster... and no proper means to tackle it", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:41:38", "owner": "chroolvink", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097558492659566, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:41:37", "owner": "torte_svetlana__budva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072011330058673, "text": "🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:41:36", "owner": "wendykuo.1030", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931186609114298, "text": "Omg. What happened!!??? I just saw this?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:41:23", "owner": "iamperlat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063722486185914, "text": "💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:41:19", "owner": "priyancaanaik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091724806932265, "text": "It breaks my heart to see this video 😭🙏願傷者平安、逝者安息。", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:40:55", "owner": "sallyxchris", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066364967379206, "text": "🕊️🙏🏾", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:40:30", "owner": "mal.com27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979953129781581, "text": "😮😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:40:28", "owner": "malfe2001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905657500143512, "text": "It happens every day in Ukraine.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:40:23", "owner": "lady_olya777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059247947636837, "text": "Warum ist keins eingestürzt???", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:40:11", "owner": "laufkoch.de", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112779016525371, "text": "Isso é real, mesmo? Não se viu notícias na tv, estranho isso....🥺🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:39:51", "owner": "cabacafrancisco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085117394006341, "text": "每次看到这种新闻就很难过 希望香港平安❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:39:48", "owner": "cindy_yubing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863706154531536, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:39:44", "owner": "_likaliko_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905645533146304, "text": "Sending prayers and thoughts to Hong Kong 🇭🇰", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:39:22", "owner": "sigh.joe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888394798261676, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:39:14", "owner": "crismellofotos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870287689393932, "text": "😢🙏😢🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:39:14", "owner": "rb4km", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18299221252258576, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:39:10", "owner": "silvendier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545016460031478, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:39:04", "owner": "danny____t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108514066543474, "text": "What heppend here? They did burn for over 24 hours.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:37:57", "owner": "soulwall_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884673613406098, "text": "Дровишками дома обкладывать, умно!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:37:51", "owner": "zharkovproduction", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18548700904047630, "text": "Fire don't make fall towers", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:37:48", "owner": "patman_from_arasaka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943342843080396, "text": "🙏🙏💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:37:45", "owner": "haynlna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050712425676069, "text": "Wait. 9 11 fire brought down the twin tower", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:37:41", "owner": "soulwall_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888425887265904, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:37:31", "owner": "m_a_n_e_0715", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006628082819906, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:37:23", "owner": "danielsousa41", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847335826587347, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:37:07", "owner": "annzz__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067500494116510, "text": "😢💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:37:05", "owner": "adriana.polancorh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943047889081547, "text": "Hopefully now companies in Hong Kong will stop using bamboo as scaffolding.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:36:54", "owner": "daniel_seiber", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18110359111612402, "text": "😮😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:36:53", "owner": "wanda__241", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088926296314004, "text": "不要啊😭😭，希望伤亡数字不要再增加了🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:36:16", "owner": "zhoushuren53", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108549973618952, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:36:05", "owner": "gretzel.lantican", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860595400479081, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:36:04", "owner": "11.75585011", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100986940749965, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:35:51", "owner": "toh_clarice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030682322750394, "text": "願逝者安息💔 保佑傷者早日康復😢 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:35:38", "owner": "jmer2323", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024493949594296, "text": "Que imagens desoladoras , muito triste.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:35:27", "owner": "sulains_2_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104802934647946, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:34:54", "owner": "jawbaw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083754613858846, "text": "“The community is reeling, and some are angry: police suspect the fire was caused by “grossly negligent” action. Hong Kong police have alleged unsafe scaffolding and foam materials used during maintenance work may have been behind the rapid spread of the fire, and three people from the related construction company have been arrested. The Independent Commission Against Corruption has already announced a taskforce.\n\nThere have been long-running complaints about the renovation, including allegations the alarms were switched off months ago by construction workers, and that workers smoked on site. There have also been broader concerns about the safety standards for the mesh used on sites. A video being widely shared on Thursday shows a local council member setting fire to a piece of green construction mesh and watching it quickly melt and burn.”", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:34:54", "owner": "eerb.reissul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184371937343534, "text": "This is tragic.\nMy condolences to Hong Kong and all the Hongonkers who have lost their loved ones.\nSending you love.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:34:19", "owner": "dianeohlalarealtor", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17940668025098559, "text": "New count is at least 75 perished", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:34:19", "owner": "brian.ryals.3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18150717139418294, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:34:18", "owner": "linsqikk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864292561517606, "text": "So tragic 🙏😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:34:07", "owner": "servo26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185318458349607, "text": "Hate tower buldings...remember London fire..will never safe", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:33:59", "owner": "sunrise_and_cats", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994139055719464, "text": "RIP 🕊️💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:33:57", "owner": "rpworldtraveller", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973792140959367, "text": "oh my god, this is so bad.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:33:44", "owner": "brianliweixun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904783765289474, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:33:35", "owner": "arthenice7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041883335497147, "text": "This is so sad.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:33:16", "owner": "pks8309", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865728148509033, "text": "Many lives were lost. Truly horrible.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:33:15", "owner": "captainpoop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871077091467380, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:33:03", "owner": "broce_vicky31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099049861696567, "text": "💔😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:32:52", "owner": "ceramicsbyjudith", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098401360797707, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:32:38", "owner": "chiara.leonardi.94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931403665135460, "text": "💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:32:35", "owner": "symbol_of_peace_balaji", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983914659761341, "text": "💔💔💔😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:32:29", "owner": "binte_hawa_786_143", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064972505159977, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:32:24", "owner": "lilli228muttonen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095610481888108, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:32:11", "owner": "novaquita", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051881969690529, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:32:11", "owner": "lilli228muttonen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067436462118101, "text": "Omg 💔 This is so sad. Pray for Hong Kong 🇭🇰", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:32:10", "owner": "moos_e6575", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086354095952078, "text": "Зачем строить такие дома , если вы их тушить не можете ? Для чего ? Чтобы народ сжечь ?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:32:00", "owner": "ivanov_evgeny1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18333758800210233, "text": "En tout cas elles ne ce sont pas effondré", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:31:33", "owner": "steven_mabzi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969360138825275, "text": "Rip😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:31:28", "owner": "urban_leaf_hk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18336734617230558, "text": "Ich sehe keine chinesischen Superdrohnen, aber ich erinnere mich an viele Videos von ihnen. 🤨", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:31:10", "owner": "radzikhovskyi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368501128080128, "text": "🥺😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:31:09", "owner": "jovittvip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083991176288196, "text": "Теперь проще новые построить чем эти атремонтироаать бедные люди", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:30:51", "owner": "olga972718", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937304155100020, "text": "😢😢😢🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:30:44", "owner": "verashins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867270883492626, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:30:33", "owner": "felizconsulting", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047728799440944, "text": "Oh god please save them 💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:30:30", "owner": "mbakyuragil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862332664536987, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:30:25", "owner": "firefly__one", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041820671498605, "text": "-99999999999999999999$", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:30:17", "owner": "stupid_zezo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859634905485458, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:30:14", "owner": "freedom.wind1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077286811958604, "text": "💔😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:30:13", "owner": "sooophiaa___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072857111036793, "text": "270 tote Wahnsinn", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:30:05", "owner": "benny_fuba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991993875896998, "text": "I pray that i am wrong. But i have a very strong feeling that this was a scripted fire. People involved in this are not small people, they are politicians and real estate builders. May GOD give eternal peace to all the deceased and strength to their families in this time of grief", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:30:01", "owner": "ali_hasan0630", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030410687555158, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:29:46", "owner": "jaylupase", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897540181347134, "text": "🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:29:27", "owner": "katherine_marie_josephine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892015039368448, "text": "Which country is this?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:29:25", "owner": "corb.co", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047913167436101, "text": "Tan inhumano vivir así  tanta gente metida en esos apartamentos", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:28:58", "owner": "inju985", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871681765466101, "text": "昔、香港に行った時に、驚きました😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:28:53", "owner": "hiro.mi1533", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17930649750137669, "text": "I notice the bamboo is still in tact….the plastic netting shrouding it looks to be more the reason for rapid spread of the flames…. Just too tragic and horrible to imagine the plight of all within the buildings…", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:28:50", "owner": "fionacaines", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079222196159646, "text": "🚭🚭🚭🙅🤦", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:28:45", "owner": "mr_king_santhu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18505988512068139, "text": "Pobre gente 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:28:40", "owner": "carmentorrens65", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089018018311463, "text": "Sending prayers to Hong Kong 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:28:36", "owner": "salala.7777777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048701030414252, "text": "🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:28:30", "owner": "mason_july", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842234041626831, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:28:29", "owner": "simo.sax", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071715338606858, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:28:13", "owner": "chu_chien1016", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064474166436704, "text": "😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:28:10", "owner": "santisellstexas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061131167224356, "text": "خطيه", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:28:07", "owner": "jaa_n1989", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115205590576041, "text": "💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:27:30", "owner": "drikka.santtos.30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897048670202135, "text": "The firetrucks r like 80 years old man peeing... Not far, Not high.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:27:26", "owner": "charliechang33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083732021024361, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:27:21", "owner": "dramebazzz____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160394923400411, "text": "awful, R.I.P.😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:27:14", "owner": "netwiz0078", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096842848657806, "text": "感受到人類的渺小😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:27:00", "owner": "lovecat727", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912450925249179, "text": "Can you imagine how many people died 😔 just burned alive.  Unimaginable, painful, devastating.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:26:56", "owner": "_.sonya_k_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074513339518713, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:26:46", "owner": "bradford.1104", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090926888494953, "text": "Het is toch een overbevolkt land", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:26:35", "owner": "tineke687", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918021307217353, "text": "That seems suspicious. Let’s see what will be rebuilt there.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:26:24", "owner": "mikebsherman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846720154594864, "text": "So sad. I have never seen a fire engulf a tall building like this especially not 5 bldgs", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:26:18", "owner": "sldolphin99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080762297139657, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:26:12", "owner": "lakegravy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881552302422877, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:26:12", "owner": "alice_cheung1626", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977917689942336, "text": "😭😭😭🙏🙏🙏💔💔💔from Ukraine", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:26:00", "owner": "tet_ana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898724677340367, "text": "Die 350-400 😳", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:25:35", "owner": "jukkis519", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078270467336368, "text": "You couldn't pay me enough to live in a high-rise building, here is a good example of why I refused. 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:25:32", "owner": "donutslover10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18247522999291925, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:25:27", "owner": "marina_buraichenko1103", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18548601859014867, "text": "😭😢😭🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:25:26", "owner": "unejourneedereve", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026191598762498, "text": "111，13，33，👁🔼🦎🤟🤫👌😈", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:25:23", "owner": "player_4283", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976765542791427, "text": "Heart broken 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:25:15", "owner": "ken.7014", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090018943744398, "text": "💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:25:10", "owner": "myg010181", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116457595561102, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:24:54", "owner": "sakura802", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041341454706573, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:24:12", "owner": "raulvaladez1555", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17917711818214015, "text": "Very scary", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:24:12", "owner": "cah_cmc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103255135731913, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:23:39", "owner": "floridachong", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17883966741407304, "text": "Magina o cheiro de queimado na região,  fora o tanto de corpos que vão encontrar", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:23:20", "owner": "mt_oliveira1994", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910969828256889, "text": "🙏🙏🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:23:11", "owner": "dieuminh109", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075099542265189, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:22:32", "owner": "poojavashiamarnani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18548075533024847, "text": "Mio Dio che tragedia😭😭😭😭🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:22:29", "owner": "m.deponte5926", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965468374002845, "text": "😢😢😢😢💔💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:22:26", "owner": "angelica_nilsson_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903661876164809, "text": "Fuk!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:22:21", "owner": "ptownstevo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915546424232135, "text": "🙏🙏🙏天佑香港", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:22:02", "owner": "bony_springs", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18086969371967512, "text": "Very sad… but notice…they didn’t collapse from just fire alone 🤷🏾‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:21:47", "owner": "moe_joe_bro_bro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18194575603331696, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:21:03", "owner": "novaliz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074264750246037, "text": "Something with revenge?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:21:01", "owner": "rcnbk495494", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068413079385217, "text": "Es reicht bei Bambus Gerüsten nur eine brennende Zigarette die vom einem Bauarbeiter hinuntergeschmissen wird ,sie bleibt irgendwo hängen und es brennt 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:20:53", "owner": "vaglounge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087152716954377, "text": "😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:20:52", "owner": "island.rhode.29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957958219010001, "text": "Heart touching video 🥺🥺 please pray for hongkong 😭😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:20:43", "owner": "mr.amrendra.lucky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104051659649150, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:20:14", "owner": "cerberex11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950194335922068, "text": "😮🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:19:59", "owner": "cathdesigual", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914112130247602, "text": "If we can't reach to the top to spray water, why do we even build them. This is so 💔devastating. My thoughts with everyone affected and who have lost loved ones. 💔🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:19:54", "owner": "anudaraj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932221999129225, "text": "💔😢😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:19:51", "owner": "sadieddover", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147244231430292, "text": "300+ people are missing! I hope wherever they are, they be fine!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:19:33", "owner": "shurveerjain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18365102836092902, "text": "Tragédia 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:19:23", "owner": "marlon_anjos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087294140298865, "text": "By a small smokers 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:19:17", "owner": "adibali18279", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057874778290299, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:19:13", "owner": "ulrich.wolf.1004", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112829191597523, "text": "😭🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:18:59", "owner": "plow6888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112832737597770, "text": "Que horror de alto😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:18:43", "owner": "patricia_costa6437", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978095193938878, "text": "Да....уж....", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:18:29", "owner": "smelaia2235", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026967545716350, "text": "Horrific!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:18:09", "owner": "mosscarol210", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18382256650147871, "text": "Больших сил и терпения пережить боль утраты всем людям потерявшим родных и близких.🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:17:45", "owner": "aisluaisais", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066709373568479, "text": "Adakah korban jiwa,yang meninggal??", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:17:37", "owner": "sayanauly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000673457830319, "text": "У них что нет строительных норм и правил,? где и законы? куда смотрит муниципалитет и вообще правительство?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:17:17", "owner": "650ybm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040904228505465, "text": "🙏🏼🙏🏼🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:17:15", "owner": "pinkyyhuang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099597904828131, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:17:11", "owner": "hazariahharuko73", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086858071974578, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:17:09", "owner": "judi.otto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864266914518661, "text": "💔💔💔💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:17:09", "owner": "janiely__cruz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18349090795207180, "text": "MAybe not build so close together hu???", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:16:48", "owner": "loyannaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085352075055106, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:16:37", "owner": "whitesheera", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066076160417775, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:16:32", "owner": "duongdai3966", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087411175812210, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:16:29", "owner": "otay3536", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047464607438205, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:16:24", "owner": "qin9228", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086383342952633, "text": "💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:16:10", "owner": "mimi_cml917637505", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059394185550304, "text": "这一刻我的心与他们站在一起❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:16:08", "owner": "wangbo4469", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080770502122938, "text": "😭💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:15:44", "owner": "dbestblessing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085412726482789, "text": "Poor management..", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:15:22", "owner": "aman_free_bird", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109543123614986, "text": "Muito triste 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:15:03", "owner": "prigalheigo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397724593131735, "text": "Notice how those propaganda Chinese drones that shoot water don't exist?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:14:56", "owner": "itsprivpomp", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18070430423607174, "text": "😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:14:26", "owner": "prildylau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842012218634037, "text": "That’s so sad 😞", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:14:25", "owner": "math15115", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082673162514290, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:14:20", "owner": "anirajkl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18162624499395436, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:14:01", "owner": "samira_aylar.64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868258996481758, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:13:47", "owner": "1688.billy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18299285134258622, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:13:35", "owner": "ivananatashas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069897983580287, "text": "比當年嘉利大廈更可怕🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:13:32", "owner": "linuo1228", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18534740752041675, "text": "Pray for hongkong😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:13:29", "owner": "0314cco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079821482170704, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:13:29", "owner": "o_f_b_m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075112940192358, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:13:28", "owner": "hukang168", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930731875113542, "text": "竹🎋に火🔥が付いてしまった。🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:13:28", "owner": "managotadasu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18230935933306363, "text": "what a heartbreaking tragedy 💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:13:17", "owner": "yvonnerohestore", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071028446364317, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:13:14", "owner": "aralbaevaindira736", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899433280337777, "text": "💔💔😭😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:13:04", "owner": "kirbygarcia12gmail.com9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054206939335466, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:12:52", "owner": "lyvia.lovely", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087117502808656, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:12:48", "owner": "ravean2012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18189432859339970, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:12:37", "owner": "ewelinmiguel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18365699737086475, "text": "🥹", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:12:27", "owner": "redjeepgirl88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856814815564820, "text": "Алла сақтасын", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:12:25", "owner": "nurshanala", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086521393968707, "text": "Y en ellas 💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:12:10", "owner": "klaudiagnza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032845205756847, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:12:03", "owner": "suzycotic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970551621967544, "text": "🙏prayers for you all 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:11:58", "owner": "apowell57", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934259593104405, "text": "Caused of an employees smoking", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:11:54", "owner": "hillenaar87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977039139791714, "text": "愿平安🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:11:52", "owner": "mayli0705", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886996660394402, "text": "De que material están echaos esos edificios 😮😮