, "owner": "jen4824", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073484063521586, "text": "So sad 😭🙏. My condolences to the victims' families 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:10:05", "owner": "guillermorodriguezfry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051359189346578, "text": "Sad.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:09:49", "owner": "hej8846", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068112455609755, "text": "só não entendo como o fogo foi passando para os outros edifícios será que foi atentado", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:09:46", "owner": "roseaneferreira02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038240525705969, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:09:33", "owner": "ilewolf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092572702928238, "text": "This is so sad. My heart breaks for Hong Kong", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:09:32", "owner": "soulmatefit", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17978367059944589, "text": "En China ...todo es a lo grande!..", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:09:27", "owner": "blascoangelblasco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161190595403375, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:09:19", "owner": "jennie23mike", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864292840524371, "text": "Pray for Hongkong 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:09:13", "owner": "silla931", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854304523575604, "text": "Heart 💔💔💔💔💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:09:13", "owner": "samson_nong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086002346511398, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:09:10", "owner": "bill.herrerd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084059159090250, "text": "❤️🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:08:49", "owner": "marlonm1951", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105303577631849, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:08:34", "owner": "flowerpower_acosta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18211484344313397, "text": "❤️🙏peace and prayers to the families the bamboo scaffolding is still pretty intact it's the green nets that seem to have been the problem no 🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:08:30", "owner": "meriaungkh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100959532612448, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:08:08", "owner": "maria.maletta.33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843479020624043, "text": "@piggy_brand_picture", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:08:08", "owner": "fnn_online_tv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184479370354771, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:08:05", "owner": "luh_doces_personalizados", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105495949650810, "text": "亡くなられた方の御冥福をお祈り致します", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:08:03", "owner": "ism163", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885236497284201, "text": "願逝者安息 天佑香港🇭🇰 Pray to HK", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:07:45", "owner": "j83100800", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891051451373074, "text": "太難過了😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:07:24", "owner": "liu.chienhung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958662669877721, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:07:22", "owner": "wiliamb23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111135262611795, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:07:16", "owner": "zuffi_seki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304642705248774, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:06:58", "owner": "sawadeemay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134108479472103, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:06:33", "owner": "sofiarafailidou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084096161088779, "text": "Awful 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:06:20", "owner": "dorisreicherter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976479312950445, "text": "希望受灾群众早日被安顿好❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:06:13", "owner": "zaomiaodongfenggu391", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976982256791896, "text": "💔💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:06:02", "owner": "tanynhapaiva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075128522193170, "text": "😭😭😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:05:45", "owner": "happy19890604", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18130698631491806, "text": "Insane", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:05:41", "owner": "ipecervantes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953399374021510, "text": "Terrorist Attack !!!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:05:36", "owner": "e._.ric60", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329698699208433, "text": "1 too many buildings catching fire is 1 too many lost lives.💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:05:13", "owner": "mollyone707", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862476829538008, "text": "Katastrophe.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:05:06", "owner": "frankweltweit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854693542576397, "text": "Geçmiş olsun ölenlerin mekanı cennet yaralılara acil şifalar diliyorum çok üzücü🥺💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:05:02", "owner": "cgdm_lcn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074690927519008, "text": "Notice how most bamboo didn't burn. The net was the issue", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:04:58", "owner": "generalgas99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075842369463698, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:04:51", "owner": "ah8yan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977809983947148, "text": "They don’t have water boom  plane", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:04:48", "owner": "akadajames", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061761416556484, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:04:38", "owner": "lynevie_mat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131257108488797, "text": "4 fire trucks for a apartment complex fire is diabolical work", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:04:19", "owner": "leihanxuig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996354630848696, "text": "😢😢🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:04:06", "owner": "regina.santana.180", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051177986372478, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:03:55", "owner": "akadajames", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083505731094542, "text": "Pourquoi construire  aussi haut .😢😭😭😭🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:03:54", "owner": "rousseau4107", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967706913989240, "text": "Heartbreaking 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:03:37", "owner": "fom_dung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088034806987334, "text": "🫣", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:03:34", "owner": "_anji_8008_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085367038839629, "text": "I see the neighboring buildings are high rise residential would be towering inferno as well. They better start evacuating and leaving those death traps.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:03:31", "owner": "stateside_at_midnight", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18382122016147850, "text": "Ellos que se jactan de liderar las tecnologías .... Que paso aquí???", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:03:23", "owner": "invettro_botellas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047668310439255, "text": "🙌🏿", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:03:14", "owner": "wilrosschef", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090665317909550, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:03:12", "owner": "esin_gltkn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940529998094287, "text": "So sad 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:02:53", "owner": "chambers_skateshop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900601231177161, "text": "Gilaaa sih asliii 😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:02:48", "owner": "berylberyl25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978783090941345, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:02:43", "owner": "ramonalangethal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919315750208172, "text": "🙏🙏🙏平安", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:02:35", "owner": "candy070528", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103933987598676, "text": "🙏😢南無阿彌陀佛", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:02:28", "owner": "algorithm_137_142857_1366560", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064900394170516, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:02:09", "owner": "natusi4ka_sv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109355404614114, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢🙏😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:02:04", "owner": "kary_gonzalez513", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894396478221075, "text": "No fire sprinkler ??", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:02:02", "owner": "cookies47hennessy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866780392428613, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:02:00", "owner": "linor_malir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081913744894516, "text": "😭😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:01:59", "owner": "vesna_zkrpan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925862833172703, "text": "😢😭💔❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:01:58", "owner": "lungannie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18514357768064275, "text": "😢🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:01:50", "owner": "carolgis29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148049170427413, "text": "And these buildings caught on fire all because of bamboo", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:01:47", "owner": "becksrose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904232371298241, "text": "Those architects and developers need to be held accountable for designing and building such death traps for people to live in. And people should never have resided in tall buildings in the first place. Use your head next time. Can’t you see what their motive and intentions were to begin with ? It wasn’t for your own good and it wasn’t built for your own benefit. It’s plain to see. Whose idea was that would be and had become towering infernos ?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:01:47", "owner": "stateside_at_midnight", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103102285732440, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:01:42", "owner": "simona_claudia_miu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994114206849572, "text": "😢💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:01:21", "owner": "neman012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123780634521304, "text": "Ai ?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:01:15", "owner": "tokyo_n_st_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121020661538692, "text": "願逝者安息 傷者早日康復🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:01:07", "owner": "braveheart8616", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083409881030061, "text": "Damn i can see it being demolished and a mega project getting green light", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:01:07", "owner": "relax.ddiy.renos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134267203475021, "text": "中国崩壊の象徴みたいだ", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:00:55", "owner": "natina0824", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048022076436122, "text": "Y dónde está la tecnología que presumen en drones bomberos por las redes sociales me pregunté eso, desde que empezó el incendio 🧯🧯🧯..", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:00:51", "owner": "chef_sasha_chef_a_domicilio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944141086092075, "text": "😭💔🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:00:49", "owner": "brigittesieverkropp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999286452692144, "text": "Non capisco perché non abbiano adoperato per lo spegnimento dell'incendio Canadair o elicotteri", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:00:47", "owner": "yuripescini", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993945195885270, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:00:46", "owner": "_albee_333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913102855101553, "text": "😭😭😭😭💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:00:44", "owner": "paulabrito4094", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18389497516177349, "text": "Help me all, as a former Hong Kong resident 04-07, I’m trying to place where this is? Is this kind of western part of “Central”", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:00:35", "owner": "davidegold84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917857165213997, "text": "🙏 condolences for those who lost their loved ones. Hope the injured recover soon..", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:00:33", "owner": "sneakyvirgo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18535243507002505, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:00:32", "owner": "ewmc68", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062417270540288, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:00:31", "owner": "a_olsson_de", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115405420567691, "text": "😭💔🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:00:04", "owner": "crystal.23jm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982595289923756, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:00:03", "owner": "aditnugraha__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965208075989134, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:00:01", "owner": "natnat442", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146437615434229, "text": "😭😭💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:59:53", "owner": "jullybagova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067488671110968, "text": "煉獄💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:59:50", "owner": "tsaihbcd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080773655036463, "text": "Astaghfirullah", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:59:46", "owner": "farah2774khan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051224756670144, "text": "Pray for Hongkong 💔💔💔🙏🏼🙏🏼🙏🏼😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:59:20", "owner": "roks55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970504782968884, "text": "😭😭😭🙏🏼🙏🏼🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:59:04", "owner": "curiousmanung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110375506611870, "text": "💔💔🥺🥺🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:58:57", "owner": "linli_n4529", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076241147266186, "text": "💔😭😭 911 inside job", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:58:55", "owner": "nicht_dein_ernst___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081839252511862, "text": "💔😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:58:53", "owner": "destinyismesmerized", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086731340071940, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:58:48", "owner": "marina_marina_vana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890118340390875, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:58:30", "owner": "jqw_dz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17899927515343030, "text": "💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:58:28", "owner": "mesi_indriyeni97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971503434970560, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:58:23", "owner": "afater52175359", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18434520349110803, "text": "Flames ignited externally on the green netting covering the bamboo scaffolding around Block F and quickly spread to neighbouring blocks,[3] ultimately engulfing seven buildings in total. There were many reports of people trapped in the buildings.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:58:16", "owner": "prodigal.sorcerer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140275981410506, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:58:02", "owner": "_jasminecurie_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18497472064074111, "text": "If there will be a building at such a height, it will be a firefighter accordingly.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:58:01", "owner": "1gokhanuslu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098575255830981, "text": "🙏😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:57:45", "owner": "begona2930", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080161007125880, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:57:42", "owner": "stubbidino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848748907605842, "text": "@d_melody_tapiceria 😮🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:57:39", "owner": "leonadoencarnacion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931954126134036, "text": "這波房價打太兇了", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:57:34", "owner": "edifice1213", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18422442889115937, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:57:21", "owner": "hilda.f", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103567708673868, "text": "L'horreur", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:57:13", "owner": "akatehea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958070995009334, "text": "I'm so sorry for everyone who lost a loved one ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:57:13", "owner": "maybeabeautifulart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090825364741120, "text": "O que deve ter de gente carbonizada ainda 😢😢😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:57:10", "owner": "neyala.nakamura", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104889484649259, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:57:08", "owner": "monmonho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156249658409807, "text": "@chenkexu199", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:56:59", "owner": "aliennjj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904322518295610, "text": "🥺🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:56:51", "owner": "heartyd1sh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937844983095630, "text": "Queda muy lindo todo verde pero es como el campo,un fosfórico y se convierte en un infierno.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:56:45", "owner": "brielvani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082098383028532, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:56:37", "owner": "yesmileshoes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298051537284793, "text": "🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:56:27", "owner": "winmetawin.o_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086942638798082, "text": "How did they burn all at the same time", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:56:24", "owner": "jgraholskis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953406409019630, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:56:12", "owner": "alexanderlee0308", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049842464389017, "text": "昨日までいた大切な場所 哀悼の意を表します", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:56:11", "owner": "engiya.y.g.wakamaru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545299033009036, "text": "💔heart break", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:55:42", "owner": "spworship7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987331941909398, "text": "足場から出火ってどういうことよ？\nそんなことある？\n竹製らしいけどタバコでも吸ってた奴いたのかな…\nこの火事は酷すぎる", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:55:40", "owner": "moko_ui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048882713680110, "text": "Flammable scaffolding! Prayers to the families!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:55:26", "owner": "schmitz.gary", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064601384531773, "text": "I feared that every time I see towering high rise buildings are built for business office purposes but as residential home … NEVER ! It’s too high risk ! It’s obviously  a fire hazard container of collected lives perishable in an instant. Don’t ever tell me it’s not a death trap. Just looking at towering buildings scares me to death … How do you save yourself from that predicament ? And finally, How do you expect firemen to rescue you from that situation ? It’s impossible. Didn’t you have any other option or recourse other than that building to live in that is less life threatening ?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:55:21", "owner": "stateside_at_midnight", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021046370607635, "text": "Still didn’t collapse", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:55:17", "owner": "0ilpaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980944734778693, "text": "逝者安息🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:55:14", "owner": "lightlu80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18189064642337855, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:55:09", "owner": "lusiaart22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886027669403863, "text": "These look like under construction building and read some people killed. Saying prayers to the family and to find out who did it", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:55:05", "owner": "carelesslyunfiltered2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100450897688856, "text": "Это ужасно.💔💔💔💔🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:55:02", "owner": "viktoria.puris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098436145747453, "text": "How come 6 buildings burned at the same time?!?! This is definitely fishy … criminal doing…", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:54:54", "owner": "christelomatic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18431990842105406, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:54:33", "owner": "marita_akkerman_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858254032557288, "text": "灾难", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:54:19", "owner": "jacky45482", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092041849908386, "text": "It should have been level 5 alarm from the very beginning… and could have contained the fire better", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:54:09", "owner": "__xilefw__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876588496353826, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:53:35", "owner": "jase_jc_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921741730189997, "text": "Gokil juga roko", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:53:24", "owner": "aditymlna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057295556309354, "text": "😢😢😢😢🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:53:21", "owner": "pushpakalarai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069319328100307, "text": "天呐🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:53:12", "owner": "kamagarna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18349877044160985, "text": "🙏🙏🙏😢😢 sad", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:53:06", "owner": "shrihari7623", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051162137372152, "text": "Hmmmm - 6 other buildings and the two NEVER COLLAPSED??????????????????????????????????????", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:52:46", "owner": "vicious4723", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944647786075445, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:52:45", "owner": "pslaw959", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915771382213300, "text": "大陆人烧的", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:52:36", "owner": "jinshi56", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956736904002249, "text": "Pray for the victim🙏🙏🙏🙏who ever make it The police have to catch them and die punishment", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:52:28", "owner": "balijubang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113427145578340, "text": "🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:52:25", "owner": "komorebietc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067151693114251, "text": "It’s about to collapse in free fall. Any second now", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:52:25", "owner": "royalflushbg", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17995425308845807, "text": "😢😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:52:18", "owner": "younkep", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18187084741342988, "text": "💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:52:16", "owner": "anitaway2022", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062120048390953, "text": "А вокруг такие же дома...😭💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:52:10", "owner": "lidiarad1958", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086794822996062, "text": "💔💔💔😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:51:55", "owner": "balnurjanabaeva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352036636204108, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:51:54", "owner": "swarna2287", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070740293341795, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:51:53", "owner": "ruusulaaksonor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907510342276396, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:51:50", "owner": "mushroombao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089257216757041, "text": "Okadar yüksek bina yapıyorlarki itfaiye bile yetişemiyor 🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:51:39", "owner": "nurten.5306", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086475211816101, "text": "Que tragédia senhor amado 😞😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:51:36", "owner": "ttescobar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133616797467269, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:51:35", "owner": "a122014741", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080484077146385, "text": "天佑香港", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:51:32", "owner": "a122014741", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883409500409917, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:51:14", "owner": "jeongjinhee0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028502687563737, "text": "Scaffolding, bamboo, no steel used, flammable. Net, flammable. Very small distance between buildings.💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:51:07", "owner": "frankb_jun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863536804532904, "text": "Foam???", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:50:57", "owner": "christian_88207", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108090673618755, "text": "Ottimo impianto anti  incendio 😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:50:34", "owner": "ark.14.62", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112366000591101, "text": "Maybe next time dont use bamboo for the construction", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:50:15", "owner": "mtti.otm", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17862898017454716, "text": "the business own after watching this not can😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:50:10", "owner": "thinvicheka5566", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842646412624635, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:50:04", "owner": "20031220zxq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976892979955273, "text": "😢😢😢💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:49:45", "owner": "agaevasve", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099375070755639, "text": "Was anyone hurt?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:49:39", "owner": "that1dudeyouknow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006058151819240, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:49:38", "owner": "tonaklein", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846012481614385, "text": "希望死傷不要再增加了🥲太心痛了💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:49:29", "owner": "sweet.1025", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17860370922479614, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:49:25", "owner": "vitsippo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18335386315226708, "text": "天祐人民平安", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:49:15", "owner": "tangkuotsai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18150860449422114, "text": "🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:49:07", "owner": "fasttraincoming", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984670296870589, "text": "Should have built the twin towers out of bamboo", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:49:07", "owner": "808r6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083774179860286, "text": "😢💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:49:02", "owner": "elytavlopez81", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062128022208843, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:48:47", "owner": "el.rumma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073535333521680, "text": "Wie viele Menschen jetzt auf Schlag ohne Wohnung sind… 😭🤯😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:48:38", "owner": "schwerie421", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077825470957102, "text": "💔💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:48:32", "owner": "elizabethtapia1231", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089466955752083, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:48:30", "owner": "penny_s_0816", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862867378458944, "text": "Rokok penyebab 4 tower apartement,, woww, analisa yg sangat bodoh 😆😆", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:48:08", "owner": "robin_jait17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983722038760986, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:48:06", "owner": "chatschan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919846582205700, "text": "🙏🙏🙏 i pray they’re safe and will recover what they lost 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:48:04", "owner": "xkmini_ig", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100188358783211, "text": "Che la terra vi sia lieve, fate buon viaggio… povera gente che disgrazia 💔😢vi sono vicina con le mie preghiere ed il mio cuore… 💔 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:48:01", "owner": "popy_88_hnd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923010424196069, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:47:59", "owner": "audreylegallic92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539006884065132, "text": "Wang fuk indeed", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:47:52", "owner": "andrew.c.game", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058713302281911, "text": "Heart broken Hong Kong disaster😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:47:24", "owner": "adilkhan__700", "likes": 189}, {"id": 18351761872167121, "text": "Соболезнования 💔 это просто невозможно ..как так😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:47:17", "owner": "svevolkova58", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886909006394208, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:47:09", "owner": "mikusrita", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071328470361522, "text": "yang jaring hijau tu jaring plastikkan terus di pasang di scaffolding bambu ,makanya apinyaa besar ,terus ketiup angin terbang kesebalah🥺🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:46:57", "owner": "shelaa.putrii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105052723637585, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:46:46", "owner": "hhhsss4885", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962256057991252, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:46:46", "owner": "eric_xeng888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932362087129335, "text": "🙏加油🇭🇰", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:46:28", "owner": "x8596325", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18173327011372498, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:46:19", "owner": "tai_fai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066230213618734, "text": "😢😢😢🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:46:16", "owner": "gracia_starhorse2878", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988495839907726, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:46:05", "owner": "beritaagaard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18399365767133223, "text": "Awal nya kenapa ini best? Ya Allah inna lillahi wa Inna ilaihi Raji'un", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:46:04", "owner": "_mift_jane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091585315905538, "text": "😢🙏即使是一個人，也希望能確認更多人的安全。", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:45:47", "owner": "nijiniji511", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062191382551495, "text": "💔💔🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:45:46", "owner": "charlie_young", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074613695002926, "text": "Потратили ресурсов постройки деда моря кто-то тупости глупости спичку курил и бросил и случилось что получили надо брать на работников которые не курит чтобы этого не было", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:45:20", "owner": "dzha473", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147257725384374, "text": "🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:45:10", "owner": "whoislaylae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969046908825116, "text": "Thank you amazing fire fighters", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:45:09", "owner": "kalvli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904433953292259, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:44:47", "owner": "timmy_alohavibes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087591256798179, "text": "😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:44:25", "owner": "belkisrosabal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997076505838119, "text": "옥상에 잇어도 죽엇겟다 와 미쳣다 진짜... 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:44:23", "owner": "eww_nu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183755932350926, "text": "🙏💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:44:21", "owner": "winyo.o_9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056215241320539, "text": "Who did this? This for sure was done on purpose", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:44:04", "owner": "bashayeva.a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18438821677101972, "text": "It's so heartbreaking.😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:43:58", "owner": "gimyeongeun5526", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868452748482229, "text": "So so devastating 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:43:31", "owner": "xdomxdomx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063999053567677, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:43:21", "ow