ged tough to escape if the lifts caught fire 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:31:36", "owner": "arvind_pocket", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942599551081105, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭💔💔💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:31:34", "owner": "luisantoniofernandez54", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885164608287441, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:31:34", "owner": "_justin_1226", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18248469094289264, "text": "XDSSS de qué material estaban hechos esos edificios😮🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:31:30", "owner": "mcarma71", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060455720538045, "text": "Incêndio enorme", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:31:30", "owner": "marciaweigel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18535203667025623, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:31:22", "owner": "carpetshanhua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064778432438033, "text": "👏😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:31:13", "owner": "jessi.jessica.56863", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990702858736261, "text": "Dadie nadie está preparado para esto", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:30:58", "owner": "chiquijdmek123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931630516135487, "text": "Wow they did amazing work. HK firefighters 🚒❤️🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:30:58", "owner": "styiosa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954129816898356, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:30:49", "owner": "ljilja6607", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153143119412056, "text": "💔😭😭😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:30:30", "owner": "huangcaidaada", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077909543179696, "text": "💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:30:21", "owner": "genkirea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547918078036754, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:30:15", "owner": "joes_liva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089250385766950, "text": "💔💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏😮😮😮😢😢😢😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:30:15", "owner": "bebe_muscalagiu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061192049539422, "text": "😔😔😔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:30:10", "owner": "chrisdbayan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958071150883802, "text": "How is that possible was it arson ?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:30:10", "owner": "guy___x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066124391131968, "text": "港府干嘛去了？", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:30:05", "owner": "conneryspring", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547175161026025, "text": "😭一定要平安无事🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:30:03", "owner": "agnes_1007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125737378502824, "text": "Really devastating 😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:29:40", "owner": "pionassi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954327690900311, "text": "💔che disastro 💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:29:26", "owner": "lorymarafra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088397638983625, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:29:20", "owner": "navid_shamkhani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920850430083861, "text": "Parece una cárcel.. que horrible 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:29:18", "owner": "miris2542", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062109884207020, "text": "Is it bamboo scaffolding catch fire or what?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:29:15", "owner": "xulism", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980262702932445, "text": "Homg Kong is the only place that still uses bamboo as scaffolding", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:29:15", "owner": "keplar88b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048700964406683, "text": "🙏🙏🙏😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:29:13", "owner": "olha.zamula", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980733858775876, "text": "Kenapa sebelah gedung bisa ikut kebakar..? Kan jaraknja jauh ...aneh ya ?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:29:05", "owner": "theresiayustina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070840649373056, "text": "The HK fire department is caught unprepared and not ready.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:29:04", "owner": "skngsg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076503413266182, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:29:01", "owner": "chingting0315", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320442364174229, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:28:41", "owner": "itscorsee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855101446570993, "text": "Heartbreaking 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:28:38", "owner": "sweet_donside_holidaylets", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18413147539188924, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:28:29", "owner": "sammymoore25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929871073015912, "text": "Obviously HK fire department is not capable of fighting highrise fire!!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:28:19", "owner": "skngsg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073152584523774, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:28:08", "owner": "marumarita", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135978160422810, "text": "😭😭😭😭 Pray for Hongkong 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:27:58", "owner": "jurgensiethoff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18351438250207314, "text": "😭💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:27:54", "owner": "frances_livings", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924043864186622, "text": "This is horrific. How could the fire spread in such a short time.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:27:41", "owner": "takamom_monster", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091903882915151, "text": "Cómo puedo pasar esta tragedia tan irreal 😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:27:34", "owner": "yubinzarios17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085427635969872, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:27:34", "owner": "hao0622", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049327022403144, "text": "看了真的心好痛 心都快碎了", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:27:27", "owner": "bean8542", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18333970366232370, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:27:12", "owner": "iam_elin_168", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043198103493403, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:27:07", "owner": "barbsturdy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087017608982781, "text": "🙏🙌Bravo majstori", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:27:05", "owner": "mihokovic.i", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065567990145757, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:27:05", "owner": "thallie13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093850604505679, "text": "Such fire fighting is a joke!!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:26:56", "owner": "skngsg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031874114726532, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:26:56", "owner": "julie.bren.33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073395686351222, "text": "I am so upsetting when see this, because of the construction company wants to have max profit they ignore the safety of people , I’m so so angry ,my heart just goes to the families who lost their love ones", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:26:48", "owner": "cecilialam6078", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18246617755291280, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:26:42", "owner": "anna_tek_sg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095168485847733, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:26:40", "owner": "alexandre_delarue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864121342521259, "text": "🙏🙏 고인들의 명복을 빕니다.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:26:22", "owner": "geolee666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869670589405101, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:26:08", "owner": "c1ska", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087129454959778, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:26:05", "owner": "dibya_moktan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891432190374850, "text": "Feuer ist grausam und kaum zu bändigen. 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:25:59", "owner": "krasstom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133224973470219, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:25:56", "owner": "windy.lee.758", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884915827287368, "text": "Those stupid contractors.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:25:52", "owner": "floringdana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909584860257235, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:25:49", "owner": "sonali.hinduja", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123409663467656, "text": "🙏🙏🙏RIP😢🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:25:44", "owner": "iamolivia1223", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908944906127077, "text": "Will they demolish the remaining and build new nmconstruction ?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:25:27", "owner": "ditonaro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083728211021526, "text": "Das habt ihr nun von euren Bambus Gerüsten", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:25:02", "owner": "enrico.anderson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059614877267581, "text": "It’s too sad for any words💔💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:24:43", "owner": "crystal_gu_syd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980165997937623, "text": "愿香港平安🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:24:13", "owner": "camille0.09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086617166051307, "text": "Um cigarro 🚬🤦🏾‍♂️🤦🏾‍♂️🤦🏾‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:24:11", "owner": "rickdesousa25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085289426488385, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:24:08", "owner": "krs_raahul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922069198193005, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:23:56", "owner": "liarejaneandrade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977446500947146, "text": "But what is the reason? 🥺😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:23:45", "owner": "mguidi_hajar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18316611856247937, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:23:44", "owner": "alibekov_china", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082927255877034, "text": "Is there a death count? I hope everyone got out", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:23:34", "owner": "brandonjoe237", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092268562910851, "text": "😮😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:23:29", "owner": "jansri965", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931893427109377, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:23:10", "owner": "abbylew9606", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871356961464093, "text": "Sad😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:23:08", "owner": "karinechoong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979907628777558, "text": "The top part of the buildings are still burning inside. The water can't reach them.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:23:07", "owner": "mjbanua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993241203856187, "text": "😢😢😢😢🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:22:56", "owner": "giorgos.andre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067939901103168, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:22:35", "owner": "hediiieh.n_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868245724415347, "text": "この被害は私達も学ばなくてはいけない。次の犠牲者を減らす為にも。高層マンションがどの国でも競うように建てられてるが老朽化や火災、災害についてはあまり触れられていない。消防ホースにも限界がありヘリからの放水は建物にダメージが掛かる。今の技術だと逃げ場がない。", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:22:33", "owner": "koukikamiya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065842484146495, "text": "good news 👍👍", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:22:17", "owner": "mohammad_keriz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063627881403456, "text": "Still standing….", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:22:13", "owner": "jlp_forge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893146798364790, "text": "Pray for Tai Po😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:22:13", "owner": "jessie.tsoi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109126663716836, "text": "😭😭🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:22:10", "owner": "krieger5223", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861522823541544, "text": "他們的建材有問題", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:22:09", "owner": "f.sien_c929", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118985686530239, "text": "💔💔💔💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:22:03", "owner": "anyvonnebretagne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18429426952111819, "text": "Rip🙏 🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:21:36", "owner": "annaayuen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847705933609342, "text": "😭🙏💔🫂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:21:35", "owner": "manugiovygiovy81", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076309538264388, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:21:31", "owner": "_huhu_nn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18380214070150610, "text": "Hahahahahaha I love it", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:21:29", "owner": "talega1968", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083535760866395, "text": "Né fosse crollato uno...", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:21:24", "owner": "nettamario475", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18374208283158891, "text": "Effrayant", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:21:21", "owner": "nadya_alexanna_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051714908356868, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:21:20", "owner": "gracielamorarte", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18409323418186702, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:20:50", "owner": "mariasujic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088354192777724, "text": "Jadi gedung ini mau di renov apa gimana, kok ada jaring ijo?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:20:50", "owner": "bocah_gandatapa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051496370356819, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:20:45", "owner": "ladiossopp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917314180220591, "text": "It cant by by cigarets", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:20:37", "owner": "npinterior__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048270353421314, "text": "Ghost apartment to be soon", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:20:32", "owner": "markyongafcy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890594398381748, "text": "😢😢😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:20:31", "owner": "saniye_10_34_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870198049398093, "text": "💔😢🙏🙏💔🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:20:17", "owner": "xxroxannarubyxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086427446292783, "text": "Hong Kong was a lot safer before the Chinese corruption.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:20:13", "owner": "604swiss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090584681504892, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:20:06", "owner": "crychenchen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182823109352747, "text": "How did the fire not melt the steel beams and collapse the buildings into their own footprints?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:20:05", "owner": "ibbz_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099435922700999, "text": "horabbal", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:20:02", "owner": "npinterior__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894292144223594, "text": "Prayers 🙏💔 pls heal faster these who is in deep pain", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:20:00", "owner": "saru.saruul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061972568550113, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:19:47", "owner": "thediaryofadogwalker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104277427581150, "text": "🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:19:41", "owner": "sonopepino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988983057862883, "text": "This is so sad 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:19:25", "owner": "alexalta10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051483392369634, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:19:19", "owner": "kamshat_skaterty_duck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086414938819543, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:19:13", "owner": "ayesha.848484", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070102340525336, "text": "¡Qué triste!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:18:54", "owner": "vanguz69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18430286635108482, "text": "C’est une catastrophe ! 😪😪 paix à toutes celles et à tous ceux qui y ont perdu la vie.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:18:48", "owner": "jeanmauricebourquin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078762337919741, "text": "Something happened 🤔 🙄", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:18:46", "owner": "zubaidalshihan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114621910505025, "text": "Being in the basket of those ladder trucks... that's tight schfingter level 2000!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:18:34", "owner": "moose_maniac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018773063795098, "text": "Tragedy", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:18:25", "owner": "triquitaqui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940097823965908, "text": "🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:18:16", "owner": "smigelskaya_svetlanka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038911961711208, "text": "Sad", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:18:15", "owner": "biggabe70", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930094579119831, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:17:52", "owner": "matthewkkwan122", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121314376533146, "text": "The reality of living conditions in HK. I hope this will open the eyes of the authorities. Don't let the same tragedy happen in near future.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:17:50", "owner": "dark.warlord", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540485998037304, "text": "🙏🙏🙏😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:17:40", "owner": "michic_levinia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902820814167503, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:17:40", "owner": "isauro_velasco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041415017495687, "text": "💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:17:33", "owner": "nerinaayala", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054189722659438, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:17:27", "owner": "cafepeter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893224918370529, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:17:27", "owner": "parker_coffee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302340385264056, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:17:18", "owner": "k_normpkr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086759135287975, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:17:11", "owner": "clickmyprofileforfun", "likes": 0}, {"i