1-27T14:15:26", "owner": "iamvrbofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856820878563006, "text": "Cigarrets", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:15:25", "owner": "abdul_kz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098427196694241, "text": "💔😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:15:08", "owner": "_chunyin._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113163262510344, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:15:07", "owner": "swlh0916", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899560492338430, "text": "Condolences.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:15:02", "owner": "darchitecture", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998639607844830, "text": "Maybe don’t use Burnable stuff as folding ??", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:15:00", "owner": "yurrae.cx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989123784903574, "text": "😭horrible", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:14:42", "owner": "fvb2869", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329300281208484, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:14:23", "owner": "agnes_lawsm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101300503735989, "text": "😭😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:14:23", "owner": "reaksa.sov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868960009472859, "text": "I found this:", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:14:02", "owner": "nwtxmom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868753600473537, "text": "🕯️🕯️🕯️🙏🙏😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:14:02", "owner": "evelynbbbbqqq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121018036538828, "text": "May God protect save them all 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:13:59", "owner": "genevieve.violet.lee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901864918331437, "text": "New footage has surfaced showing the fire started only in one building all the way on the first floor. You can hear the man filming screaming at the building's construction workers that the green tarp had caught on fire. One tarp, one building caught on fire.🤔 The fire was small enough that it could've been contained, so why wasn't it? How did all four buildings burn completely like that, and they are all separated? Maybe high winds, yet in that video it clearly shows that first initial fire could've been stopped.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:13:37", "owner": "roman_goddess_cheni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991067925863548, "text": "🙏💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:13:35", "owner": "cate.rina55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986629734752458, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:13:34", "owner": "pinyi3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874049083373896, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:13:29", "owner": "h_f3300", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18377229976149116, "text": "Ya Allah 💔😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:13:22", "owner": "novimayang_sarii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986953236875673, "text": "Donde fue eso? 🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:13:19", "owner": "karynaqv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076954513977096, "text": "😢such tragedy 😢 my heart & prayers goes out to the families 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:13:17", "owner": "tjie_m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942332581094660, "text": "Gara² putung rokok. dan untungnya tersangka bukan Orang Indo / TKI", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:13:13", "owner": "j_chandra_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100238386622344, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:13:11", "owner": "yuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuuun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943025449085009, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:13:06", "owner": "yk_joyce", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876687613355341, "text": "🥺🥺😢😢🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:12:59", "owner": "wansangchan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968612370993302, "text": "Investment opportunity", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:12:48", "owner": "stringfiend6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070566365071715, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:12:41", "owner": "emily_3april", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164330575351635, "text": "Isso foi criminoso é como as favelas de São Paulo que vivem pegando fogo", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:12:38", "owner": "marciasegal.guimaraes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995501610848643, "text": "ᴵᶠ ⁿᵒᵗ ᵐᶦˢᵗᵃᵏᵉⁿ ᵗʰᵉʳᵉ ʷᵃˢⁿ'ᵗ ᵃ ᵛᶦᵈᵉᵒ ᵖᵒˢᵗᵉᵈ ᵇʸ ᵖᵉᵒᵖˡᵉ ʷʰᵒ ˢᵗᵃʸᵉᵈ ⁿᵉᵃʳ ᵗʰᵉʳᵉ, ²-³ ᵒᶠ ᵗʰᵉ ᵇᵘᶦˡᵈᶦⁿᵍˢ ʰᵃᵈ ᵇˡᵃᶜᵏᵒᵘᵗ ᵒᶠᶠ ᵃⁿᵈ ᵒⁿ ᵖʳᵉᵛᶦᵒᵘˢˡʸ (ᴵᵗ ʷᵃˢ ᵃ ᵗᵒᵗᵃˡ ᶜʰᵃᵒˢ ᵗᵒᵒ), ᶦ ᵈᵒⁿ'ᵗ ʳᵉᵐᵉᵐᵇᵉ