er": "gsp_moosemoose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096323782870748, "text": "Did mossad go to Hong Kong?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:58:07", "owner": "spencerianlove", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135983005470321, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:57:53", "owner": "ninarasjid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973156473806890, "text": "😢🥺 so sad", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:57:49", "owner": "andreas_at_rockcontracting", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18334976602236665, "text": "Співчуття 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:57:44", "owner": "bondarchuk3660", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933170872108047, "text": "@carlosfernandogalan los edificios en Bogotá, están creciendo en volumen y altura aceleradamente. Los bomberos de Bogotá podrían atender incendios en edificios tan altos como los están construyendo ahora?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:57:31", "owner": "monicarozo1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066502670621461, "text": "🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:57:25", "owner": "_somewhere.smr_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047054324446561, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:57:21", "owner": "astridmi4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891516946379958, "text": "🙏🙏💔🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:57:20", "owner": "marceldewiadriaensen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088573016487874, "text": "Noticed that this doesn't collapse like 911? Because there weren't explosives, unlike 911", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:57:17", "owner": "spencerianlove", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051583526341004, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:57:13", "owner": "jojoxiie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074022926010376, "text": "Wang fuk court", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:56:52", "owner": "iim_shannon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854123800535981, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:56:45", "owner": "sule.bergama", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919457797068460, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:56:43", "owner": "tsengelmaa2013", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18493999120072839, "text": "🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:56:36", "owner": "ev4_bee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085845875070867, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:56:30", "owner": "_da_mia_no", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089389613486607, "text": "太難過了😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:56:21", "owner": "yos1026", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18543032887052185, "text": "まだ燃えてるのね🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:56:14", "owner": "mayumi__nishimura", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063996839408486, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:56:08", "owner": "hchen734169", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113046898584683, "text": "Really tragic😭. Scary to think how many very tall high rise buildings there r in the world now. Hope those have better fire preventions", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:56:07", "owner": "dreamer_jll23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933915388106027, "text": "Mangkrak langsung", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:55:57", "owner": "romlialdiansyah_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979989807925682, "text": "C est terrible  pauvre gens 😭😭😭😭😭😢😢😢😢😢💔💔💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:55:55", "owner": "mamydebarquesurinsta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067083107612893, "text": "希望可盡快撲滅火勢，傷者都早日康復，心情得以平覆，宏福苑的居民早日回歸平靜的生活❤️🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:55:50", "owner": "osiriscatcat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894229954221484, "text": "What a nightmare. This is so sad. I hope that if there is a learning curve that builders will learn and governments will demand", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:55:50", "owner": "joannasable", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18100861999751108, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:55:47", "owner": "kid_0402", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843918199613009, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:55:40", "owner": "slavna.ukrajinka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979001838783973, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:55:27", "owner": "kyliebut", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047957315444588, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:55:21", "owner": "hyunyih", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095019013882209, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:55:04", "owner": "shin4173chan", "likes": 0}, {"i