025-11-27T13:52:18", "owner": "toy._.li.z0127", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155408329408805, "text": "I wonder if the property owner had some massive loan calls coming up....my heart and prayers go out to everyone impacted 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:52:17", "owner": "autovinography", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063464531184916, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:52:06", "owner": "ruhguzar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897380722345823, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:51:54", "owner": "danyy0714", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18354484768165735, "text": "Where is their firefighting drones?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:51:40", "owner": "realcowboybk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061903151550849, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:51:38", "owner": "daemoncheung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18194303800330635, "text": "💔 this breaks my heart. It actually shatters my heart into a million pieces.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:51:35", "owner": "newmee24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540664312007119, "text": "Quel désastre...", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:51:28", "owner": "duvalgerard72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18246129622292181, "text": "Pray for Hongkong🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:51:27", "owner": "aob.maties", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112346395591786, "text": "这个竹架确实过时了，它不属于这个时代，希望逝者安息🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:51:16", "owner": "ggbang168", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144401722453869, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏💔💔💔😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:51:15", "owner": "wenjingjing0403", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986049456867089, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:50:53", "owner": "foseja12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952232473028727, "text": "Užas 😮🥺😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:50:49", "owner": "__sekica_persica", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096378769865806, "text": "Felfoghatatlan katasztrófa .😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:50:41", "owner": "iluspaltamasi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113319481588209, "text": "😢😢😢💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:50:39", "owner": "akmaral_akh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926677630176518, "text": "لطفك يا الله 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:50:39", "owner": "asmae_achkari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079368254129776, "text": "This is so tragic. I hope they get to the bottom of the investigation & find out how this happened so as to prevent this from happening again", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:50:28", "owner": "mala.barber", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069824747599510, "text": "😭😭🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:50:24", "owner": "sonia.cheung.376", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18559320967032714, "text": "🥺🥺😮😮😮😮😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:50:07", "owner": "artosfaustolenin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030373925750096, "text": "@hh_ng0411", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:49:58", "owner": "hoanguyen29.09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100834921783498, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:49:56", "owner": "kam_pei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928454974152135, "text": "Arson, 100%", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:49:44", "owner": "officialserik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881397733422098, "text": "Omg 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:49:39", "owner": "scudamonster72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547670167027365, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:49:29", "owner": "tanghsu___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851806315553389, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:49:25", "owner": "hunghuiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547935187047947, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:48:59", "owner": "akiyamayo1209", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947263360067706, "text": "Incroyable dramatique 😔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:48:54", "owner": "marcusedelweiss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967615485992725, "text": "Karma 🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:48:53", "owner": "maheshojha947", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18196977679326363, "text": "安息💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:48:40", "owner": "nana.tvt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095320540873335, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:48:27", "owner": "wsy7838", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062362082199016, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:48:20", "owner": "bsw4._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080294252166342, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:48:19", "owner": "aiqdelicia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954465454020748, "text": "2 Person From my country Indonesia 😭😭😭💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:48:19", "owner": "dhanis034", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083982562846392, "text": "In New York these towers would all go down .", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:48:05", "owner": "todonsky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114184489578481, "text": "💔💔😭😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:47:52", "owner": "verazimoglyadova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070552877458011, "text": "😭😭😭🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:47:44", "owner": "sandylu30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085684571006905, "text": "Prayers", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:47:40", "owner": "rachadmn1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058351718283352, "text": "Tragic💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:47:40", "owner": "elainepyper70", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063451073188646, "text": "😭😭so sad…", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:47:39", "owner": "zane.my.treasure", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077868860128888, "text": "💔 Thoughts and prayers to the people of this nation.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:47:37", "owner": "brinas_jamaicankitchen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18198366604326338, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:47:22", "owner": "wankachun838", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100955989826952, "text": "Was it's a mistake or someone do so", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:47:06", "owner": "lumborlangdkhar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066014747140300, "text": "😭💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:47:04", "owner": "ezaraisdrawing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970325223975026, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:47:01", "owner": "dewidewilagi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092816971728008, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:46:25", "owner": "sabiekingdom", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18350093380200736, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:46:23", "owner": "ponyma220", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935882968110077, "text": "💔💔💔😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:46:22", "owner": "babyyjuan4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116569654499664, "text": "🥺🥺🙏🙏😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:46:21", "owner": "enriqueamandi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100082185741535, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:46:16", "owner": "kmaeevans", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353095588163540, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:46:11", "owner": "wkm_0325", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082845473036770, "text": "😭💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:46:06", "owner": "seheno.razafindramaso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064475645181491, "text": "Non si sa il bambù", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:46:05", "owner": "mestorinop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047997428432206, "text": "My heart’s and prayers are to all the who’ve lost loved ones here! China needs to mandate the removal of all bamboo scaffolding", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:46:02", "owner": "davidchapmannyc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905136145294824, "text": "😲😲😲😓😓🙏🙏🙏🙏🤍🤍🤍🤍", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:46:02", "owner": "jardin_de_verre21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848664340606109, "text": "My deepest sympathies to all the families who lost loved ones due to the negligence and irresponsibility of corrupt officials and corporations. We continue to mourn Yu Meng Long, who was also a victim of this entire Chinese scheme that is being exposed to the world.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:45:57", "owner": "mafgad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895270075360738, "text": "😢😢😢💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:45:56", "owner": "la_vie_en_rose_by_mk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113933572604328, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:45:52", "owner": "re.belik75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086784416071571, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:45:38", "owner": "abby22an", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083118041105429, "text": "İnşaat gibi görünüyor. Çok fazla insan olmaz gibi görünüyor", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:45:36", "owner": "fuat__kocal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866922811489232, "text": "So sad", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:45:22", "owner": "thearet.suon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879987388427843, "text": "ppl n their belongings n their life 💔🖤💔🖤", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:45:21", "owner": "luna.shmeh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972180546973603, "text": "人為！！！不是天災！！！", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:45:20", "owner": "tae_tae_tae_t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146478319439383, "text": "🙏🙏🙏💔💔💔💔💔 so many animals trapped in these building 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:45:16", "owner": "ginger_cats_family_1830", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097166323872889, "text": "💔💔🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:44:59", "owner": "kmaeevans", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030241139767076, "text": "😔😔😔😔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:44:59", "owner": "sousan__zmn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18198044362322480, "text": "🥺😮😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:44:56", "owner": "rrrpply___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087565480779571, "text": "🙏🙏🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:44:45", "owner": "eyyyjanana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085158014064715, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:44:42", "owner": "strzeleckaa0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296078782275044, "text": "These buildings must have been built 10 times stronger than the world trade center’s 🤦🏽‍♂️🤦🏽‍♂️🤦🏽‍♂️🤦🏽‍♂️🤦🏽‍♂️🤦🏽‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:44:00", "owner": "broderickelker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183700315353114, "text": "I am still in disbelief that all eight towers can burn that quickly just bec the contractor used flammable mesh net 😳😳😳", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:43:58", "owner": "tootipatooti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086523017304858, "text": "Que horror. DEP💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:43:38", "owner": "ireneceibe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889008190388397, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:43:17", "owner": "instamaniacerina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139846075457398, "text": "That seems like from catastrophic movie with zombies", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:43:11", "owner": "popey_all", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087562630801061, "text": "Why don’t these buildings have automatic fire-extinguishing systems like restaurants and hospitals? High-rise buildings should have proper plans in place, not just rely on fire alarms and stairways.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:43:07", "owner": "marwah_salman07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089058061764246, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:42:59", "owner": "robin.nuber.5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901320346328481, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:42:46", "owner": "sangya_sar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078704626923260, "text": "Do u still want arunachal pradesh?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:42:43", "owner": "vinay_edits", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061781621533602, "text": "🥺🥺💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:42:43", "owner": "dhami6352", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078945877906106, "text": "愿平安🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:42:42", "owner": "wangboqi41", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969667173825775, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:42:42", "owner": "santishanty7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916665250231460, "text": "睇到都心酸😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:42:41", "owner": "yue10netvigatorcom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051029522371503, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:42:32", "owner": "julinaribeiro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958172962010367, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:42:23", "owner": "sabahayra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095271139886978, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:42:10", "owner": "shivukannadiga_official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865805656503194, "text": "My prayers with the family, a home is where the heart is, may their loved ones be alive", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:41:34", "owner": "sweetlymyself", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848702440604514, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:41:31", "owner": "neozo_7200xt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845255611616457, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:41:31", "owner": "lindafung1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872299156464904, "text": "🙏 Pray for HongKong 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:41:24", "owner": "namviet019", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060767522244984, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:41:22", "owner": "spitericarmen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18433278898096986, "text": "🥺🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:41:21", "owner": "kartika05a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075489778988539, "text": "😭😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:41:21", "owner": "husnu.saglam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131985787489687, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:41:06", "owner": "hunglow55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066303098624322, "text": "Kenapa rumahnya tingi²sekali", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:41:03", "owner": "annie_kayla27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047047559448759, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:40:57", "owner": "k72a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18186273520354075, "text": "😭😭😭, hope such tragedy will never happen in Singapore 🙏🙏🙏.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:40:43", "owner": "sunny.sun.168", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112791670597130, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:40:38", "owner": "tientien__0510", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18214126399310930, "text": "So sad, my house burnt down earlier this year through no fault of my own. Completely gutted for all of these people", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:40:30", "owner": "swanza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079025623919758, "text": "Drama 😱😱😱😱😱", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:40:18", "owner": "griffinialma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977775786941346, "text": "Nagle wszyscy zapragną mieszkać w parterowym domku", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:40:09", "owner": "futurebodywroclaw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18534337591020110, "text": "🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:39:52", "owner": "maggie_dau_b", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18032653193529432, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:39:41", "owner": "pathdavy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082080722028642, "text": "Bull sh i tt AI", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:39:40", "owner": "alisasouthuk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093838438903457, "text": "It was the material used to make them buildings😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:39:27", "owner": "stallings1295", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18328622143240019, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:39:23", "owner": "patricklo441", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304221457250631, "text": "平安平安🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:39:11", "owner": "tingting941341", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072168536251517, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:38:58", "owner": "pacifabiola", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050966105680458, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:38:53", "owner": "cvetikk22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089400679767506, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:38:52", "owner": "bel_perlas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991971660910636, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:38:25", "owner": "kayyaliglaucia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849025402602635, "text": "ㅠㅠ 너무 슬프다..", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:38:23", "owner": "xx.jaeheehee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074618672190865, "text": "Pray for HK...🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:38:18", "owner": "rlee990", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048951584682386, "text": "Just one cigarette", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:38:18", "owner": "bellawicz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990491262891629, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:37:40", "owner": "ssussanna333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094621021849298, "text": "Was für eine Tragödie 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:37:24", "owner": "hansjorgmage", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020206193609982, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:37:19", "owner": "vincent_cmv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913084441251329, "text": "No matter how advanced the world is and how tall buildings are built, if an accident occurs, it is impossible to quickly get rid of it, save it, or restore it to its previous state. Therefore, if you go up, you need to know about its insecurities and if they occur, you can get rid of them, but the technology does not seem to be advanced enough to do that today.👉👉👉👉", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:37:13", "owner": "priyantha2215", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932504869129166, "text": "Que desgracia más grande.😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:36:58", "owner": "diegomulahernandez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096036199828130, "text": "😭😭🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:36:31", "owner": "eatbyle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069040289608615, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:36:23", "owner": "clabali", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134589451469414, "text": "愿每个消防员都能安全回家🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:36:18", "owner": "scarlett79cnc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078071590939050, "text": "🥺😮🙏😢😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:36:16", "owner": "esinbehiceahlatoglu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143413192448836, "text": "Was this a developer trying to deal with debt?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:36:12", "owner": "joaoseph", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094983217857448, "text": "That is devastating 😭💔😢 RIP to those who lose their lives and prayers for all the families involved", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:36:11", "owner": "cathyyhungdds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18170818192374217, "text": "🙏🙄🙄🥲. Humans taking humans", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:36:07", "owner": "andremrakic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011149382804066, "text": "💔🥺😢😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:35:55", "owner": "geraldinachorro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18173531068371952, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:35:53", "owner": "cloudymoon.ty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115275148562535, "text": "😭😭💔🇲🇦", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:35:36", "owner": "rifia_rifia04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103174225674405, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:35:36", "owner": "family_dynasty888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066961181453815, "text": "Já ouviram fala YUMENGLONG  o que a China vez?💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:35:36", "owner": "flavianagus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004435481823822, "text": "天祐香港🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:35:24", "owner": "moekuruto1017", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176837857322779, "text": "Bu kadar yüksek bina yapimi yasaklanmalı", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:35:14", "owner": "aydindemir8080", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865060000509343, "text": "😮😮😮😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:35:08", "owner": "pub.jm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161392879397745, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:34:37", "owner": "eddieforever0116", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101734198708496, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:34:35", "owner": "traceysharp1965", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18379518928149070, "text": "上天保佑，不要再有傷亡了.🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:34:33", "owner": "johnnyywang_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396567178123961, "text": "上面都澆不到😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:34:21", "owner": "cynthia.h727", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102636970708993, "text": "綺麗に焼けたね", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:34:18", "owner": "kyokugetsuki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082774631118299, "text": "The buildings were completely burned out, but none collapsed inward to the ground like the WTC. This makes one think", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:34:15", "owner": "nellmac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865470802509535, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:34:03", "owner": "lauracalabrini", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997405650838942, "text": "😮🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:33:59", "owner": "nigatsugirl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159848887402131, "text": "No fire sprinklers?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:33:47", "owner": "jumbojoe822", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914985883240417, "text": "但愿香港失联同胞平平安安🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:33:25", "owner": "niyanmei2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949911022052708, "text": "Wow no....😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:33:23", "owner": "elri.elly_art", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088496671777757, "text": "🙏🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:33:21", "owner": "mailunatuna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902201353319551, "text": "Cina 🇨🇳 butter buildings shame 🤮🤮🤮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:33:11", "owner": "luiginooffredi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940155807963439, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:33:06", "owner": "magician_choi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114815914573823, "text": "@ha.gram", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:33:02", "owner": "huynhnhu1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085342373074527, "text": "명복을빕니다 🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:32:54", "owner": "ttl3182", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891975067370319, "text": "It’s fuked.  Very scary.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:32:48", "owner": "plasteckfly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543668947034816, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:32:38", "owner": "migakisugiteruzubareru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082807841092173, "text": "🙏🙏💔💔平安", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:32:28", "owner": "miabling0817", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022402235786362, "text": "Fucking Asian engineer at it finest 🤡🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:32:27", "owner": "dg0555n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950596033048337, "text": "In a month everything will be like nothing happened", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:32:24", "owner": "gabri_rosa0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868572712475730, "text": "😢😢😢🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:32:09", "owner": "janicetrofimov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102838021659415, "text": "一切平安", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:32:03", "owner": "chen18_59", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909013360261370, "text": "Thank you for recording for us 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:31:54", "owner": "gangang_meow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941207787961379, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:31:52", "owner": "normindaperez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353128402167174, "text": "They said it was mostly elderly who lived in those 🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:31:48", "owner": "poundpuppies916", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051939452376016, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:31:43", "owner": "rafal_jacek_1979", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948328657056921, "text": "😭😭😭😭💔💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:31:42", "owner": "succhindaab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064244063407724, "text": "😭😭😭ooohh Gott", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:31:34", "owner": "khan.fazalullah.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18166776028378085, "text": "“Wang fuk” ..okay 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:31:29", "owner": "keemy_don", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028512602751401, "text": "Che immensa tragedia, preghiamo per tutte queste persone, Dio vi accolga🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:31:19", "owner": "mattucciloredana__decoriamoci", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185504491353555, "text": "🙏🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:31:17", "owner": "silvy_911", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094977268893362, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:31:16", "owner": "aaapuppy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547554451009583, "text": "😢😢😢🙏🙏🙏💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:30:55", "owner": "gerleegena", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852870238587749, "text": "어떻게 저래ㅠㅠ🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:30:48", "owner": "contr.over__sy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030336629749091, "text": "😭😭😭😭💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:30:34", "owner": "ch_mutz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842040835633595, "text": "🥵🥵🥵🥵", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:30:25", "owner": "sylmacvespa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18197595004323971, "text": "😢🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:30:12", "owner": "cometome1973", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082619425884019, "text": "またフェイクですか？\n本当だろうとフェイクだろうと、もう知らん\nこの世は嘘ばかりだからな", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:30:03", "owner": "5875479354a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904727665288109, "text": "It must be scary trap in fire so much smoke suffocate dark heavy smoke. 😭💔 Heart broken lost everything. Prayers people in HongKong 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:29:55", "owner": "melody__0895", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998606136700007, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:29:52", "owner": "jane.hjm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949407109024644, "text": "Terrible fire", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:29:49", "owner": "gcs1230", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18175580449367570, "text": "has it stopped now the flames? 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:29:45", "owner": "dyanewaddles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993890541706662, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:29:31", "owner": "rosa.shiva_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922265644194461, "text": "En dos meses hacen dos torres de nuevo y mas altas", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:29:27", "owner": "gslmss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059351192262927, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:29:17", "owner": "bethmartinito", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542748418017618, "text": "This was caused bye the green material that’s on all the scaffolding has been set a light on fire. It is an inside job done by the owners of the buildings to claim insurance and at the end of the day it’s man-made and it’s all about money again not knowing there’s all innocent people in these buildings in these little box flats 5 to 7 family members losing all their belongings their memories and their lives 🕊️🕊️🕊️🕊️R.I.P to those who lots live life’s 🕊️🕊️🕊️🕊️🕊️someone has done this to these blocks and it’s called arson ok let get the fact mate Hong Kong 🇭🇰 government elite power uppers are all to blame for this mistake they all keep building upwards and not on the ground because there’s no space for Man to corrupt the Earth 😢 🌍", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:29:14", "owner": "ladyme32", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874010713371625, "text": "😢😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:29:14", "owner": "pricillaruth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092001742917559, "text": "Tower 7, no planes. Please explain. Insurance fraud.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:29:12", "owner": "king_banana_13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024773792782870, "text": "香港、お見舞い申し上げます。", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:28:59", "owner": "yoshieowada", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021229448788201, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:28:28", "owner": "brian_____wong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092028139910314, "text": "Ho Lee Fuk…😏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:28:12", "owner": "dr.hunter.s.thompson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968961417990772, "text": "難得好難過💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:27:49", "owner": "id879", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105339583636739, "text": "哎", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:27:39", "owner": "i_am_aquarius_o", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113074531585391, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:27:38", "owner": "nadine.kong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867455824482613, "text": "I thought buildings fall down do to fire, like 9/11 taught us all 🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:27:27", "owner": "cyrusdahi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958282143883750, "text": "🙏🙏🙏天佑香港🇭🇰", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:27:22", "owner": "syue_shan_fei_hu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941629468089733, "text": "What a fucking govt!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:27:19", "owner": "evalai200311", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866888167426717, "text": "共產黨獻祭大法", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:27:08", "owner": "courage_bin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18440015704102674, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:26:31", "owner": "katherine42896", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18294620782263874, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:26:25", "owner": "tmanz21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066918200374522, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:26:13", "owner": "munguia2238", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065874602148733, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:26:12", "owner": "losukii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539414953048814, "text": "看到影片好讓人心痛😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:26:11", "owner": "rainie.huang.5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051823511670780, "text": "🥺🥺🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:26:08", "owner": "kimoreta1284", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854346874577820, "text": "💔💔🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:26:04", "owner": "87.190827", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329268379244250, "text": "Wieso ist es nicht eingestürzt 🤷🏼‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:25:59", "owner": "braunannette64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944482342077908, "text": "火怎么样跑到对面", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:25:35", "owner": "616sb7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108353437615614, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:25:34", "owner": "elisabettapalladino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061696451218329, "text": "So it's finally under control 🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:25:33", "owner": "hubaib_habib", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980735820929688, "text": "几栋楼同时烧？是不是竞争者眼红放火？", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:25:33", "owner": "scott.lim.3994885", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084760823045291, "text": "點解飛行服務隊冇出動救火如果喺高空灑水將會情況好好多", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:25:28", "owner": "kwongsingkwong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847153498610825, "text": "China needs major reforms on building safety and fire code.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:25:28", "owner": "vbui._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890312128385347, "text": "They need to rebuild with sprinkler system through the building and some sort of escape route.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:25:12", "owner": "seafoodneat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100968973685168, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:25:07", "owner": "comicu1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005863604669077, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:25:04", "owner": "ema6.15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088441681941402, "text": "すさまじい\nドローン撮影？", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:24:38", "owner": "yukoesaka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062003549206655, "text": "What is the cause of this fire ,why it's quite serious and all  building", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:24:36", "owner": "normindaperez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18247957306291535, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:24:29", "owner": "lllluyuuuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892131865368195, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:24:29", "owner": "wiingkit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017372417799184, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:24:26", "owner": "isabelfidalgobecas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889547932385684, "text": "🙏🙏祈福大埔 願所有人平安", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:23:56", "owner": "sio.sint", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131633608493268, "text": "Inadmissível essa situação dos prédios!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:23:51", "owner": "edsonjr250", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185519368342744, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:23:45", "owner": "trong.nguyen2901", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100348687813667, "text": "was this residential or was there still construction going on?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:23:38", "owner": "daria211290", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886488541398609, "text": "🙏deeply  for the lost family", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:23:17", "owner": "normindaperez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991211142731118, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:23:11", "owner": "temirtau_tort.na.zakaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849691912565783, "text": "🥺🥺🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:22:58", "owner": "hmukhan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085192634318204, "text": "🙏🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:22:55", "owner": "lavaperl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100094128775541, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:22:49", "owner": "erling.bladt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974082438959236, "text": "😢💔🥀", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:22:32", "owner": "___l.n.m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092291827898835, "text": "悲しい。この一つ一つの部屋に人々の生活があったと思うと辛い。なぜここまでひどいことになってしまったの…", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:22:05", "owner": "maru____maru____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971923293974546, "text": "São Paulo?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:22:01", "owner": "tuliopinheirogomes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18536939035058770, "text": "SHADE CLOTH! Once the shade cloth caught on fire, it would have melted to become it's own accelerant...🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:21:50", "owner": "jed4105a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097168786836274, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:21:50", "owner": "anrelima", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066833660132338, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:21:38", "owner": "_ross888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104122690658865, "text": "This is sad", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:21:32", "owner": "wolf25.26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102331684670099, "text": "😭😭😭好可怕🙏🙏🙏希望政府能介入幫幫無辜的老百姓，幫住她們重建家園❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:21:23", "owner": "vicky671120v", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908962768125825, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:21:23", "owner": "fauzia5381", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085633895064393, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:21:09", "owner": "swimpronigeria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001431566831563, "text": "Wie istvsoetwas in einem hochtechnologisierten Land möglich....🥺‼️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:21:02", "owner": "is_a_real_ara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321396148301109, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:20:59", "owner": "xikka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032961695734391, "text": "I wonder who will collect the insurance for this fire?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:20:58", "owner": "adolf1920", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865464661433816, "text": "Prayers for the loved ones families who are left behind. Such a tragedy", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:20:56", "owner": "__heml0ck_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057673949289210, "text": "天佑香港，祈福平安🙏❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:20:53", "owner": "jackliubinhui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086593108808005, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:20:37", "owner": "khapungmaya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095177164860625, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:20:29", "owner": "gundogduiustina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852256453543213, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:20:03", "owner": "fangzhefu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18365600977093722, "text": "Bless🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:19:55", "owner": "tyun_157", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134906008473821, "text": "This is crazy how the fire reached all the buildings while they have that space, I don’t think that happened accidentally ✋🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:19:19", "owner": "falling_never_stops_me", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160485130397952, "text": "Very sad incident 💔😭 Rest in peace 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:19:17", "owner": "muhammadarfan786", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873909595373837, "text": "Why didn't they use water bomber aircraft?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:19:12", "owner": "trackguy1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090328966745971, "text": "God save all!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:19:06", "owner": "anjanbadgami", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943771705081635, "text": "Ini yang gegara rokok ya?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:19:04", "owner": "rukminsh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905656801146376, "text": "Salam takziah 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:18:54", "owner": "razali.ujoh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087975175989365, "text": "Modi foult😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:18:32", "owner": "god_father_09800", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064725611633006, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:18:31", "owner": "abbple_shop_all_shop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945195343078385, "text": "😭😭😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:18:28", "owner": "isabellajnt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089367227310574, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:18:27", "owner": "antonella.galloo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939465388096174, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:18:24", "owner": "insrita2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912356833252641, "text": "うわあ。。。。🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:18:24", "owner": "mi.ho.mu.ka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094542364854961, "text": "@fabiian.trigo  mira anda", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:18:14", "owner": "maria_cristina.tap", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862914526456540, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:18:08", "owner": "waiting_dog", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152352679418327, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:17:58", "owner": "zozobb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18426334894113304, "text": "天佑香港🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:17:54", "owner": "jrjay1127", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894302677360794, "text": "bummer", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:17:53", "owner": "tedcon2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031037735547470, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:17:50", "owner": "fionon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18373652251156418, "text": "航拍機飛咁高係犯法㗎喎 🤪🤪🤪 我哋香港係醫法治講有字及興， 快啲閂咗條片佢啦🤪🤪", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:17:48", "owner": "jack_wu_hk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893114278363356, "text": "Que tristeza! 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:17:39", "owner": "vera.craveiro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18315811990220012, "text": "😢😢🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:17:12", "owner": "pyycelia8338", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901381846316710, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:16:59", "owner": "yege843", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087343921797821, "text": "😭😢😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:16:57", "owner": "petulagabova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065504561150251, "text": "Pray for HK", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:16:56", "owner": "mary_is_hiding", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916392883218852, "text": "Absolutely horrendous 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:16:49", "owner": "what.the.fox.is.that", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032073650731779, "text": "it didnt fall in tho?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:16:19", "owner": "joshdehonney", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073008038357511, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:16:18", "owner": "yuanhe952718", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086992345991638, "text": "Horrific 😮💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:16:06", "owner": "valdoyle5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096054547855106, "text": "Signore miooooo!!!!💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:15:53", "owner": "d.casoli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077057564221251, "text": "😢😢😢😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:15:51", "owner": "passion_blythe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109184743540295, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:15:49", "owner": "joseliaapolaro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953749963023739, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:15:46", "owner": "psychofuckology", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086374571301032, "text": "A massive building would have a fire fighting system 😢 what’s wrong with this💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:15:43", "owner": "yanyharri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18424205044112675, "text": "Where is this", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:15:40", "owner": "fatthumbb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048702935687919, "text": "this is how 911 should have ended it was solely plane hitting it and not a controlled demolition🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:15:40", "owner": "levi_hakimstein", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087071426055731, "text": "希望能有奇蹟！", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:15:23", "owner": "wenyun.wu.3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072152804594068, "text": "God bless 🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:14:48", "owner": "mrp3nda", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18065950769436194, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:14:45", "owner": "mariafreya2022", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18395902435193349, "text": "Omg", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:14:39", "owner": "baisant", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096018211867087, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:14:24", "owner": "linlizhi_kayu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857655796505765, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:14:21", "owner": "aaaaronwu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979267911929292, "text": "Wild", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:14:17", "owner": "dragon_links_golf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862237237537543, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:14:04", "owner": "birdyselenaena", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084269669107082, "text": "🥺😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:14:03", "owner": "_storymood1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051051470381477, "text": "😢😢😢😢💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:13:54", "owner": "megamindmine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075524645237307, "text": "Maybe they were never meant to be governed in the way they are now.\nA place that once stood for discipline and pride has been dragged into tragedies created by negligence and greed.\nWhen even fire-safe materials get replaced with something cheap and flammable, you realise the problem runs much deeper than an accident.\nIt’s heartbreaking to see a city that used to shine fall into this kind of chaos — all because the people in charge stopped valuing the lives they’re meant to protect.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:13:49", "owner": "joylovesnoopy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870848959468245, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭😭🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🏼🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🙏🏾", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:13:47", "owner": "annagivone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18326030452300359, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:13:45", "owner": "luh_pj13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009370997652850, "text": "My Deep condolences to all the families who has lost their loved ones", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:13:40", "owner": "drbhanu_priya7111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134475373472693, "text": "Estaban envueltos en plástico como no iban a arder por Dios a quien se le ocurrió eso 🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:13:30", "owner": "patricloen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100487347616137, "text": "No smoking no 💔🥺🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:13:21", "owner": "rinispt789", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065761253152157, "text": "불을 끄겠다는 의지가 없어보인다 .", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:13:18", "owner": "joygpdrcsfh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074959469209103, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:13:17", "owner": "harleyduallife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087805553504213, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:13:15", "owner": "oviya00996", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873849445450473, "text": "When is the Netflix documentary coming out ?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:13:07", "owner": "heyyy_maaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081345089471598, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:13:06", "owner": "tsvetikzaizeva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928770445118853, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:13:01", "owner": "the_earthmonkey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114144358602296, "text": "1ならまだしも5くらい燃えたの？不自然では？もしかしたら放火の可能性は無いの？", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:12:58", "owner": "sakura32colors", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082638637868566, "text": "Horrific", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:12:58", "owner": "dejerichotravel2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302285911266465, "text": "🥺🥺🥺🥺🥺🥺💔💔💔💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:12:55", "owner": "jongmukim6729", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894749305358637, "text": "It's crazy how something like that could happen", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:12:53", "owner": "enjoy._life", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044521517686585, "text": "😢💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:12:40", "owner": "nada_iva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900802912338131, "text": "Pewnie Ukraińcy 🖕", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:12:37", "owner": "jaca803", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999974715836281, "text": "Power Rangers Says: “Destroy All Of Megazord”", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:12:20", "owner": "aguswilliam24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18495691639079495, "text": "Doamne ferește 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:12:19", "owner": "vasilemihalea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993617364853952, "text": "au jbte 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:12:17", "owner": "marko_jovic_1901", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18556488433045904, "text": "😢😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:12:00", "owner": "helenisena", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086367392004399, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:11:48", "owner": "how__to_wear", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869730646472700, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:11:43", "owner": "sparethisaccplz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939859381099059, "text": "Pretty sure some rich tycoon hired someone to do this! Its typical in Hong Kong.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:11:38", "owner": "big6guy698", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072753041256675, "text": "痛々し過ぎます。", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:11:26", "owner": "ranranwithsmile", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18064881536396149, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:11:15", "owner": "siman.fok.3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544421185049407, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:11:12", "owner": "echo_lee14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011336549804085, "text": "😢😭🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:10:51", "owner": "ana_hotca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000639293836294, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:10:37", "owner": "8809jessiebwl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544560298015940, "text": "GODSPEED", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:10:36", "owner": "stanmason89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082832627112471, "text": "🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:10:36", "owner": "iamulixes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969830523825532, "text": "単管パイプで足場を組んでいればこんな事にはならなかったのではメッシュシートも不燃にしなさい。", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:10:16", "owner": "kintarou0116", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955780180045796, "text": "🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:10:14", "owner": "kaktiexit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922665559051293, "text": "🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:10:02", "owner": "898hhhhh_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857426131503975, "text": "Kenapa bisa terbakar 6 gedung sekaligus... Padahal ada jarak antara gedung 1 dengan gedung yang lain", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:09:50", "owner": "wiwitaje03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18378773008148093, "text": "🇹🇷🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:09:41", "owner": "ayscvlk53", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860270827545698, "text": "Shit.😢😢🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:09:37", "owner": "slowlygoesthenight", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936861576983517, "text": "What happened here and where?🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:09:36", "owner": "miikee163", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092534065920176, "text": "😭🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:09:27", "owner": "asap.zh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067504232614150, "text": "How many lives were destroyed. It’s really so terrible.😭💔🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:09:03", "owner": "steffiknrm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109401139614807, "text": "Nicht mal die Feuerwehr kommt nach oben muss man schon mit Helikopter löschen 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:08:46", "owner": "isolde.weber.3304", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863062507453059, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:08:45", "owner": "selegna.ml", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075150290187373, "text": "The name says it all😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:08:40", "owner": "gunbarul_3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320578585170039, "text": "💔Це сумно і боляче бачити, але це хтось зробив навмисно", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:08:23", "owner": "fataliieva_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043953389700388, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:08:03", "owner": "hollynang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856938958564368, "text": "Bagian atas masih menyala merah terbakar, teknologi masih kalah dg China yg pakai drone dalam penyiraman air", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:07:54", "owner": "radenrafar20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193692211334246, "text": "Omg 😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:07:44", "owner": "noah_ahsi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17969643146822971, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:07:42", "owner": "lampy8899", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105970141729503, "text": "Why didn't they self detonate like the twin towers or is Hong Kong conduction way better than USA?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:07:41", "owner": "statusmark16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987077199748517, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:07:38", "owner": "x7.lv_v7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062094311637681, "text": "Son muchos edificios.  Tremendo desastre.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:07:30", "owner": "susanamariabertona", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060817469230664, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:07:27", "owner": "balletglobe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055968161645864, "text": "Can anyone tell me the cause of these fire break out?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:07:26", "owner": "seong__mean", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049574495674932, "text": "What is the cause of fire? Sorry for your lost🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:07:22", "owner": "snanapad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068202863106268, "text": "ご冥福をお祈りします", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:07:09", "owner": "kinako1375", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17948504259057419, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:07:05", "owner": "anson740716", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860419633478815, "text": "😢 orman yangınlarındaki gibi helikopterlerle yukarıdan su dökülemez mi ya da yapıldıysa da bilgim yok😢 çok üzgünüm", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:07:01", "owner": "zeynep_rnr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544081825021715, "text": "😮😮😮😮😮😮🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:06:56", "owner": "danara_lashbrow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541377475003326, "text": "🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:06:36", "owner": "antoniafornarelli26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063288422562112, "text": "杯水車身，小水喉幾條冇用，沒有用空中投水，嚴重低估形勢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:06:34", "owner": "wingwing369", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18148208788428129, "text": "🙏Pray for Hong Kong🙏😭😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:06:31", "owner": "supichaya.h", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879770785330187, "text": "Heat broken 😭🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:06:22", "owner": "masonprakrongmason", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047836391433965, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:06:20", "owner": "georgiemaryhk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083391823859592, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:06:17", "owner": "suzu_s2023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109642642548201, "text": "🥺🥺🥺😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:06:07", "owner": "phaomichel1122", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113815228603251, "text": "Fires in several high-rise buildings in Hong Kong have claimed over 50 lives, with more than 300 reportedly missing. The seven buildings housed over 1,900 households with a total population of over 4,400, including 36% elderly and 15% children. The fires engulfed the buildings within 20 minutes, elevators malfunctioned, and many were unable to escape. The actual death toll may far exceed 300.\nThis is a microcosm of the failures of the system in Hong Kong after its return to China.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:06:03", "owner": "w20090418", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992725623894575, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:06:01", "owner": "rainbowchildworld", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055852877317138, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:06:00", "owner": "phaomichel1122", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070434410347204, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:05:40", "owner": "rano.ermansyah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848931142603142, "text": "Is this your drone footage?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:05:15", "owner": "jbac888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113704867583133, "text": "Crying city🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:05:11", "owner": "cu_cme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18402790837134025, "text": "We're burning for hours, from bottom to top and still standing... 9/11 was an inside job.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:05:00", "owner": "vip.artur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18216159796308788, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:04:48", "owner": "one.way_6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842406256630027, "text": "Semoga tak ada korban jiwa ya😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:04:46", "owner": "bhylalian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987165345864983, "text": "Wang fuk court fire 🫠", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:04:45", "owner": "w._.is._.this", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103604047657065, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:04:29", "owner": "brighten.gx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084598643045729, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:04:28", "owner": "samsithasolano", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846398614613554, "text": "At least they have a huge ladder like that and yet some other country doesnt have", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:04:25", "owner": "mark_asbamboo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882433765310444, "text": "我的天啊😭難以想像😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:04:19", "owner": "mami_lin3586", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18494600251078387, "text": "🙏🙏🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:04:10", "owner": "brondy.pun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079035929158338, "text": "😢😢🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:03:58", "owner": "sylvianefi.chan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915888154087015, "text": "願逝者安息，傷者平安🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:03:44", "owner": "fred_rush1np", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929259661146539, "text": "The heating power of bamboo  is relatively high but ridiculously low if you consider non compact  stems used as a scaffolding. I think it is worth investigating in the material used for netting or protecting the windows.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:03:41", "owner": "ericdesvergnes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547551223041403, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:03:36", "owner": "xen1a_1022", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933838240129761, "text": "😭😭🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:03:33", "owner": "aquascapestudionl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321048079173576, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:03:21", "owner": "yana_executive_chef1995", "likes": 4}, {"id": 1806