}, {"id": 17902441611320313, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:57:55", "owner": "he.life_ins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541548169000514, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:57:46", "owner": "tsuihuachen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119092357528707, "text": "Padahal masing masing gedung berjarak tapi kok bisa 4 terbakar semua", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:57:21", "owner": "octomoeb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076195576972824, "text": "天佑香港", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:57:17", "owner": "aaronmoyh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057163745647157, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:57:15", "owner": "deanne.beattie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927610000152565, "text": "Arson", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:57:06", "owner": "tinadpcrews", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18351384310167648, "text": "Arson 🔥?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:56:43", "owner": "barrynpatel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024121292716564, "text": "🙏🙏🙏南無阿彌陀佛", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:56:39", "owner": "gimmy2711", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918612664216917, "text": "😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:56:38", "owner": "gulichka09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094290925885158, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:56:31", "owner": "wheelnine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087462359316156, "text": "🇨🇳が統治している国はずさんでビルも高くすればいいってものでもありません。消防車の梯子も最上階までとどかないじゃないですか。まだ被害は拡大すると思います。", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:56:28", "owner": "ting.tianhe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064910147170922, "text": "More like Wang Fucked", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:56:27", "owner": "an_actual_engineer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948885010052033, "text": "😮‍💨", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:56:24", "owner": "miiina_0312", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061238042545271, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:56:20", "owner": "ahfungdoris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076990069967652, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:56:19", "owner": "fifi19821982", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954486444898627, "text": "😢😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:56:03", "owner": "ceyda_bagcivan00", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18131614696494867, "text": "This is intentional", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:56:02", "owner": "didinotdisturb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024879791780700, "text": "🙏 🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:55:52", "owner": "rescuegoeppingen", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17947044503936699, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:55:51", "owner": "stampendulous_salutations", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886896931393837, "text": "💔🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:55:47", "owner": "reeseyaor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915501922230328, "text": "RIP", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:55:33", "owner": "antyyouth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951655510060662, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:55:15", "owner": "rdwz77_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048654563413351, "text": "Another tragedy 💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:55:10", "owner": "albertalainart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108051295622497, "text": "جریان چیه به هرجا نگاه میکنی داره تو اتیش میسوزه", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:55:03", "owner": "esther_hakhamanesh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089115104304872, "text": "Why didn't they all collapse within 2 hours ?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:54:50", "owner": "schrodingerkitkat", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18084865622041827, "text": "🫂😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:54:27", "owner": "kanche07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842817586621938, "text": "😭😭😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:54:26", "owner": "nursufitroh12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070865540360117, "text": "A China não faz de sua dor o maior acontecimento de décadas , juras de vingança. Ela é tão forte espiritualmente, que simplesmente ela faz silêncio , apenas se levanta, apaga o fogo e se reconstituí rapidamente. Sua genialidade também está lá , como ela  lida com a dor.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:54:15", "owner": "reis_susiany", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18245578630288020, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:53:47", "owner": "vriesmanerna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092670295910122, "text": "🙏 For all souls lost , injured and displaced. Horrifying situation.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:53:41", "owner": "rp_3176", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044757224703437, "text": "It’s heartbreaking to see so many homes r destroyed 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:53:18", "owner": "nic0vv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970225728971300, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:53:15", "owner": "nasser.saidi.50", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064046567450124, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:53:14", "owner": "kanche07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067705751112003, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:53:12", "owner": "clesmyn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060968303561418, "text": "💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:53:05", "owner": "_yo49", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868565932478494, "text": "🇵🇱🖤🖤🖤🖤🖤🖤🖤", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:53:01", "owner": "msielwiesiuk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092300314930143, "text": "Scaffolding made out of Bamboo made it very easy to spread", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:52:40", "owner": "white.rocco", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17940398622091357, "text": "Una preghiera per tutte le persone che non ce l'hanno fatta e per tutti coloro che non hanno più casa 🙏❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:52:37", "owner": "amemigirano", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030328529752625, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:52:35", "owner": "sarunsa4work", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074328236001379, "text": "How this happened? 😢 pray for those who lost so much 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:52:33", "owner": "tomaaa.t", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064118039447357, "text": "😭😭😭 what a disaster", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:52:22", "owner": "anna_r_62", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958684752878456, "text": "😢😢😢😢🇰🇬🇰🇬🫂🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:52:21", "owner": "bobo.osh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882198904303444, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:52:20", "owner": "monica.cappellini.7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998183274700152, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:52:09", "owner": "mato_aluminum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983883972764060, "text": "Tragic.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:51:49", "owner": "distlilled_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947977989932511, "text": "🔥🌏 HIDUP itu KARMA ✨ 🔥🥵 🥶Hidup tidak usah dibuat Sulit, tidak usah Ruwett.. Asal tidak maksiat, bisa menjadi pribadi yang menyenangkan & bermanfaat bagi banyak orang, serta tidak mengusik hidup orang lain, itu sudah Cukup. ✨☺️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:51:32", "owner": "alan.sadboy_99_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027312464578681, "text": "😢😢😢🥺🥺🥺🙌🙌pray for Hongkong", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:51:28", "owner": "whienjelly_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985364391874405, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:51:19", "owner": "matthewezekiel24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042683249489887, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:50:57", "owner": "birdyjan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18194188876332456, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:50:36", "owner": "lucksor98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866044384432255, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:50:24", "owner": "travel_buddy_2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860010700545276, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:50:09", "owner": "pineapplepinks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108279760554788, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:49:56", "owner": "adai.huang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941350981087115, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:49:47", "owner": "gandolfimariangela", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18183659341352386, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:49:33", "owner": "susy1218q", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022539032788676, "text": "これはもしや、、、", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:49:31", "owner": "whereismysock123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086134948817903, "text": "猶如世界末日般地獄景象！願逝者安息！別再發生如此恐怖悲慘事件！！！", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:49:25", "owner": "andyandy8292", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882496153417506, "text": "😢😢😢😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:49:13", "owner": "arzu3890", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111276871608056, "text": "💔💔😭😭🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:49:12", "owner": "pors