{"id": 18096195688856369, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:31:00", "owner": "sarvjeet_08_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099639739796940, "text": "This is tragic 😭💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:30:50", "owner": "wardini1717", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989932434736565, "text": "This is so heartbreaking ..💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:30:44", "owner": "p.cameron1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961039635867612, "text": "Poor people, what a horrific way to die. Trapped inside knowing if you don't get out you'll be dead in minutes. Feel for every single one of them.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:30:17", "owner": "ian.wepre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871739041464962, "text": "Na sowas, die haben lichterloh, gebrannt und sind nicht eingestürzt. Das wollte Center hat 1 Stunde gebrannt und ist eingestürzt. Wie kann das sein?Frage für einen Freund?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:30:16", "owner": "christian_blue_pearl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089085832752428, "text": "They looked like torches. It's so incredibly devastating. It's also gonna be a massive number of deaths/wounded/deprived familys... 🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:29:56", "owner": "jaekry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035809568510631, "text": "😭😭😭Furchtbar", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:29:56", "owner": "ostermann2339", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882330505303429, "text": "😢😢😢😢💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:29:49", "owner": "ruslana9236", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067171814114265, "text": "Alguien me puede explicar cómo es que tenían andamios de madera y tela los edificios con esa altura?????", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:29:46", "owner": "guille.architect", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864109564521029, "text": "🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:29:42", "owner": "michellelachey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035232458720978, "text": "人间惨剧🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:29:33", "owner": "shengxian4117", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063338807435594, "text": "Nice", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:29:32", "owner": "christian_sjoman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868812268411390, "text": "Это не просто так все происходит, кто специально сделал", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:29:29", "owner": "moscowskiy_nails", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986083590867142, "text": "😭😭🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:29:27", "owner": "mohycmm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042451424493440, "text": "WANK FUK? Really?? Was just one fuck?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:29:25", "owner": "tho.arp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031429325727982, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:29:25", "owner": "vstakheeva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866706151428447, "text": "Heartbroken", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:29:13", "owner": "chiquitasky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132656707855710, "text": "🙏🙏🙏平安", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:29:07", "owner": "zong_ming_75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917476795219572, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:28:44", "owner": "maomaoqiu59", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091451257904808, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:28:24", "owner": "rossella_1966", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942639559065909, "text": "Verschrikkelijk 😥", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:28:07", "owner": "svdm1304", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846749698593804, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:28:00", "owner": "eunnielyn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085392827079221, "text": "Terrible terrible 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:27:59", "owner": "lochgormhouse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366872785093843, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:27:33", "owner": "anni_e2187", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865254136518448, "text": "Comment est-ce possible ?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:27:28", "owner": "cecilecard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945086062075424, "text": "This is so painful to watch 😭God bless HK, may the culprits burn in hell…", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:27:20", "owner": "bellyfisch_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18552060607041470, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:27:17", "owner": "talwarnarindersingh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882671089419961, "text": "Curiga sengaja di bakar buat claim asuransi.. Atau gedungnya ingin digunakan menjadi  tempat fungsi yang lain", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:27:11", "owner": "ryn.only1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153892405415201, "text": "😭😭😭affreux....🙌🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:27:02", "owner": "cecilecard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096262291848152, "text": "Simply unimaginable horror", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:26:59", "owner": "dushan.stojadinovic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165483688384073, "text": "😭🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:26:57", "owner": "hklm0001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18408483784136116, "text": "Can't imagine people who are trapped in there, they can't make a way out 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:26:32", "owner": "paulpratama81", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159858394399130, "text": "😢me da dolor en el alma... Muchas personas se vieron afectadas y algunas perecieron sin contar a las mascotas🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:26:21", "owner": "yussmeryle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18417873406117482, "text": "Lo lamento mucho 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:26:15", "owner": "yolicastillo71", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18294639379281953, "text": "Somehow the trees are fine. .", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:26:02", "owner": "iain_ni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931351378113514, "text": "😭So sad - R.I.P🙏, and to those who lost a loved one, may you find strength, courage, and the light to carry you through♥️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:26:02", "owner": "lolitaboboo", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17978729882945018, "text": "Pray for the survivors and RIP 🙏 to those we lost...", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:25:56", "owner": "02heyghi_sab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843870001620796, "text": "опасность и беда всех многоэтажек!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:25:52", "owner": "tengri228", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035313113726575, "text": "But why 5 Buildings are burning? not one🧐", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:25:16", "owner": "starseeds2015", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171255055375294, "text": "Was für eine Katastrophe. Ich bete für die Menschen. 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:25:00", "owner": "123awolf321", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983671743764752, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:24:54", "owner": "minervadeg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104271031659503, "text": "Still burning but still standing. Take notes 911 commission", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:24:51", "owner": "lenzupp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18342228922228020, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:24:49", "owner": "lucyfang18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076791715977466, "text": "一切平安", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:24:43", "owner": "chu1234564", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18174428593369542, "text": "😢😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:24:36", "owner": "ilhamsyahalam80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092212948909747, "text": "Rip to all hope she is ok", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:24:30", "owner": "lowkwekkeong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863001661453676, "text": "And they are still standing", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:24:29", "owner": "littlefoshs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032615999740601, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:24:19", "owner": "__yu.n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097389607641304, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:24:16", "owner": "darinka.ln", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057680492302935, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:24:16", "owner": "neoo.y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882158329419975, "text": "Không tưởng tượng được 🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:24:16", "owner": "tranle0602", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087269854804097, "text": "高所からの消火作業が怖すぎて😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:24:14", "owner": "haruchanman413", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864228928520457, "text": "1人でも多くの人の命が救われますように", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:24:12", "owner": "yuujitani0209", "likes": 332}, {"id": 18051660893355112, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:24:01", "owner": "oliveira.conceicaode", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18340858900226586, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:24:00", "owner": "bmls79", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18348628243203279, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:23:37", "owner": "arkocs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864599332524272, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:23:36", "owner": "day.d_channnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146596993441400, "text": "Looks that bomber only can water the middle floors max", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:23:32", "owner": "michel_lamx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066131117130684, "text": "Ending brings new beginning, 111. This happened for a reason. The fire fighters were doing their best already, sending my condolences to all those who passed, get better soon for the injured one. Stay grounded everyone.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:23:32", "owner": "mycoldfingersforu", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18048252134668500, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:23:25", "owner": "asako.jpg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954250728902051, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:23:17", "owner": "huyyykiwi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17853438333581370, "text": "一場血的教訓🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:23:04", "owner": "winglee_store", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927357673171962, "text": "대나무 비계에서 담배피우는 인간 동영상이 올라오던데", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:23:03", "owner": "hun.song_sh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905735230292835, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:22:52", "owner": "la.french.praline", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18431908981129944, "text": "was this an arson???🥺💔 why someone would do that???", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:22:43", "owner": "viktortoronto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093164260918639, "text": "💔💔💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:22:41", "owner": "dana_melarit", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18085082540010155, "text": "No drones to fight such high fires?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:22:37", "owner": "rene33000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075823750986747, "text": "The problem is always rhe same…. Too high and impossibile ti arrive to The top", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:22:23", "owner": "sans1_angelo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135224308483311, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:22:02", "owner": "mandy.cheung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031480220540017, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:21:56", "owner": "press_eu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095998831875134, "text": "香港人 加油🙏🤍", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:21:50", "owner": "dr4plets.___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090235951939453, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:21:21", "owner": "sharevhave", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079902197163682, "text": "アーメン、\n高層アパートメントは低層アパートメントより避難しにくいですよね、\nお悔やみ申し上げます🫂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:21:21", "owner": "japanwalkerjapanesefood", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900113134181092, "text": "RIP🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:21:14", "owner": "im.boni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882264427307309, "text": "燒這麼久⋯這樓住不了了，建築安全估計是有問題的，有人一輩子就這麼一套房。就這樣一夕之間全沒了⋯⋯真令人感嘆世事無常世事難料。\n\n還是要祝福早早得到政府機關的安排，有個新安身立命的家，祝福。", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:21:10", "owner": "lianqi580622", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863779771533073, "text": "어떻게 해..가슴이 아프다 얼마나 고통스러웠을까", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:21:07", "owner": "mountainlovepeace", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543426472007006, "text": "🙏🙏no hong kong!! 😭 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:20:48", "owner": "by_audreyc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023189669599049, "text": "devastating. pray for HK 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:20:43", "owner": "pluiepourpre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937611862102319, "text": "💔💔🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:20:36", "owner": "sohnassiri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852268132590320, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:20:22", "owner": "olia.1300", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18201709516320937, "text": "fushh tngi tngga bomba tu. slute", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:20:20", "owner": "fahmijs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066877745411999, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:20:18", "owner": "zizalobijec", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066657653131645, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:20:03", "owner": "mboyaedwin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18409427467143482, "text": "🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:20:02", "owner": "many2411", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032340371725964, "text": "為何不出動直昇机投水彈救火😢😢😢😢😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:20:02", "owner": "wing_m110", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18419149234117597, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:19:45", "owner": "germancardonapinto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089485051942313, "text": "Omg 😮😮💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:19:39", "owner": "hanoud_22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103923796632373, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:19:33", "owner": "jasca_gurl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965131725846907, "text": "😢😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:19:19", "owner": "zh.bekbossyn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054792182328216, "text": "😢😢😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:19:17", "owner": "betoaventureroaxe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069346787096576, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔😭😭😭😭🥺🥺🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:19:06", "owner": "paularesenderoch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058359881283363, "text": "What the Fuk?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:19:03", "owner": "martin.prairie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998036568844916, "text": "地球🌏が。。汚れた。\n地球が怒ってる。😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:18:59", "owner": "tomomitakano7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119021215536675, "text": "💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:18:37", "owner": "hitesh202", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115401169567716, "text": "😭😭😭😭💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:18:37", "owner": "sxrobovna", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17862895386458767, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:18:24", "owner": "hottest_army_0624", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067432190456503, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:18:08", "owner": "mari.elle.chua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896173741350066, "text": "Houses in HK are too expensive, small and cramp. I wouldn't be surprise this had happened. gov never help after 1997.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:18:07", "owner": "yytara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971273814990256, "text": "People are sending prayers on Instagram 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:18:05", "owner": "fl36ooo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081755878887371, "text": "No they have no choice but to investigate and demolition afterwards, fakn wild bra !!!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:17:53", "owner": "eric.royal45", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050031341663663, "text": "怎麼可能沒有連在一起的每一棟房子都著火", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:17:53", "owner": "weiying_yuan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058071761288773, "text": "🙏菩萨保佑", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:17:49", "owner": "siyuan2406", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160055734395841, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏What a shame! What a pity!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:17:48", "owner": "niloofar_navaee1337", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864161080447859, "text": "🙏🏻😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:17:45", "owner": "deafkegelstar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067319300431169, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:17:33", "owner": "cynthia_liu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885460516406798, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:17:33", "owner": "adrianitasdulces", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029380697750109, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:17:29", "owner": "davidtajcman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074130302018716, "text": "ドローン消化は活用しなかったんだ", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:17:17", "owner": "shinsan.miyazaki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847941115608128, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:17:15", "owner": "weloveyou_jess", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18348259477200784, "text": "天佑香港🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:17:11", "owner": "pichen1128", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957642318886451, "text": "Why wooden scaffolding if they are living in the future? 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:17:11", "owner": "deltam0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998817774697076, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:16:50", "owner": "snowying121", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104588122728708, "text": "Our way to extinguish high rise building still not as efficient. So now. Who gonna live in that? Is it safe?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:16:35", "owner": "azeemhanis", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18091813267920016, "text": "🙏💔🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:16:32", "owner": "eileen