 "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:12:15", "owner": "sufeizh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961221978867470, "text": "이 세상은 거짓이다", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:12:06", "owner": "combak1004", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171831616373853, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:12:04", "owner": "charles.david.m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18375394774159314, "text": "これは本当にひどい火事。亡くなられた方々のご冥福を祈るとともに残された人たちが早く立ち直れますように…", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:11:56", "owner": "moonwalkermameko", "likes": 256}, {"id": 18070446545358329, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:11:22", "owner": "mariajoleserreli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854580661533688, "text": "Wang FUK", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:11:21", "owner": "zandoro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113681929571358, "text": "😮😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:10:54", "owner": "carlamariamatiasgoncalves", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037843109708845, "text": "😭 삼가 고인의 명복을 빕니다 🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:10:47", "owner": "team_argo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919139218213735, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:10:45", "owner": "zeng___0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18495648991073274, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:10:39", "owner": "er238_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842632561625507, "text": "😭😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:10:21", "owner": "fitri_9nov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086472938052918, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:10:06", "owner": "wenwen.lam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113760802601223, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:09:39", "owner": "tatyana_gzh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18292267543273282, "text": "Oh my God, I feel so sorry for those poor people, all the best to them.🙏🙏🙏🙏❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:09:31", "owner": "kirsten.margot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094865281858292, "text": "Y donde están los ingenieros en prevención de riesgo? Cómo se les ocurre hacer andamios de bambú, un material inflamable, constructoras son culpables de este incendio, se quedaron en el pasado con la tecnología. Atroz...", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:09:27", "owner": "maria_isabeldelapaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18316957618220727, "text": "Fuk 😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:09:20", "owner": "pughreg1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102421522734718, "text": "Apa ga ada helikopter untuk memadamkan dari atas", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:08:56", "owner": "yantoooo684", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136536319475774, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:08:45", "owner": "jobucket134", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938012761099430, "text": "💔💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:08:42", "owner": "tesne_ghalay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068767796091782, "text": "세상에 ㅠㅠㅠㅠ", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:08:36", "owner": "phoenix_njz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160450351400585, "text": "🙏😭🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:08:33", "owner": "beatricerouyr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909707704122813, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:08:31", "owner": "shirleibarro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075683489246719, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:08:18", "owner": "sa.fee.er", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917890942211315, "text": "Deliberate arson?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:08:18", "owner": "marianszarf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929529823149540, "text": "Those poor people...most of them were elderly", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:08:11", "owner": "carolyn.rosenthal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089951929745985, "text": "How many people died? 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:08:01", "owner": "richard.um", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003379295826940, "text": "😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:07:48", "owner": "agiemyha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901768402338187, "text": "Innalilahi wainnailaihi rojiun 😢🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:07:42", "owner": "loviananaaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119769250535614, "text": "真希望只是AI😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:07:38", "owner": "zi_wei_1996", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114386926605300, "text": "責任は誰が取るのか？😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:07:32", "owner": "zzhongyuanlong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876641659354163, "text": "😭😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:07:31", "owner": "catarinafitensity", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114403384575308, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:07:23", "owner": "petersvarin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876533251441296, "text": "Pray for HK 🙏♥️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:07:21", "owner": "artecurativo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105219811650588, "text": "天祐香港🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:07:16", "owner": "nikar089.03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066507392383841, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:07:11", "owner": "imbebe1119", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987604857907897, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:07:08", "owner": "maria.henportugal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083312140845594, "text": "Does someone still believe the WTC felt both down due to fire? 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:06:46", "owner": "boersenrichard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118477933483221, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:06:33", "owner": "kumikooo_hong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008136191805517, "text": "Let’s wrap the building with kindling. It’ll be great! 🔥 🏨", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:06:28", "owner": "michael_ashley_lou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947659713934815, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:06:23", "owner": "iamlulu_layton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075616895257841, "text": "😭😭🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:06:11", "owner": "mikanan0015", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872170663387856, "text": "Can’t believe this is Hong Kong", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:05:47", "owner": "giantmanta", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18354561940161389, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:05:41", "owner": "triiynti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18393224947124823, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:05:40", "owner": "purrykids", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870121933398777, "text": "None of the buildings collapsed after long long hours of burning", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:05:40", "owner": "jahangiryuldashevich", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931726042113668, "text": "My God🫣", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:05:39", "owner": "just_saudi_woman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955654324011120, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:05:34", "owner": "how______juan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926769616163493, "text": "Ohhh my God I pray 🥺🥺😮❤️❤️🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:05:32", "owner": "jengyatimah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902774845163946, "text": "This is a repeat of Glenfell Tower in a much larger scale.  Only this fire they had combustible bamboo and nylon nets all over the buildings with workers smoking while working on the scaffolding, and no one cared to think this a major disaster waiting to happen…..🧐", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:05:27", "owner": "edwardlamuk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085757701972143, "text": "タワマンの限界", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:05:14", "owner": "bekki.ryuju", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547358617030620, "text": "Smoking  burns", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:04:56", "owner": "nissikanta1425", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18335380180234845, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:04:48", "owner": "sergeionov86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108835954720537, "text": "Where are the helicopters dispensing water?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:04:45", "owner": "colziebolton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967878708833830, "text": "Historically, the Chinese people have not used fire-resistant materials in their buildings, likely because they have underestimated the danger of fire. This requires change beginning at the national level. This kind of fire would never happen in a developed country. It seems fewer people will be traveling to China now.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:04:40", "owner": "irregularity13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087244471806174, "text": "😭😭😭🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:04:27", "owner": "daymudah148", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974094129959356, "text": "Это где", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:04:25", "owner": "ajar_fashion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870136771395866, "text": "Bangunan belum jadi atau sudah berpenghuni ini", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:03:44", "owner": "diannofanda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069545111582198, "text": "呢d真係叫付之一炬😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:03:41", "owner": "faichung364571", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18534002824006138, "text": "Where it is ?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:03:20", "owner": "branislavsis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085991099050753, "text": "The busiest firefighter in the world is hongkong firefighters 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:03:19", "owner": "yunantowib", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990794028885037, "text": "الله يحفظكم يارب❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:03:18", "owner": "zhara250", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18174011791367432, "text": "Unbelievable! 😮💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:03:08", "owner": "gudrunstein7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906131557274585, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:02:59", "owner": "ms.yuri.cgn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072343427353281, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:02:50", "owner": "dreams_books_knowledge_wander", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863103826535647, "text": "Ils sont où les drones😄😄😄", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:02:47", "owner": "christophebelando", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087215830789062, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:02:40", "owner": "ammaonaplate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084335036004872, "text": "お亡くなりになった方々に哀悼の意を、そして怪我をされた方々が1日も早く快復されることを心より願っています。", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:02:27", "owner": "huhu4972", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875050249449102, "text": "한국도 마음놓고 살때가 아니다 고층아파트  불나면 끝이네", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:02:27", "owner": "jongin3128", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100917913685728, "text": "🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:02:01", "owner": "fannywong_1975", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094035463697743, "text": "😢🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:02:01", "owner": "jjjiang914", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909450589124741, "text": "That is so sad Bless the people who died. I think it had a lot of seniors in it. RIP All.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:02:00", "owner": "caley.mike", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891251959380322, "text": "terrificante.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:01:52", "owner": "ddn_fnc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18037219412716097, "text": "Made in china 🥺🥺🥺🥺🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:01:49", "owner": "ghart4754", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18199572799320736, "text": "🇵🇸 will be free💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:01:34", "owner": "hazzym_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18246899338293355, "text": "平安🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:01:33", "owner": "llama.828267", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18537615037060155, "text": "como se quemaron todos los edificios juntos?? las chispas saltaron tan lejor? 💔 pobre gente y pobre sus animales.😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:01:32", "owner": "blueberry.white", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104520493632149, "text": "Sending all my love to those who have lost a loved one, this breaks my heart💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:01:26", "owner": "rakel_gd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075446813251065, "text": "What a tragedy 😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:01:23", "owner": "moertenkoettersteinhoff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18400072873123798, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:01:22", "owner": "gizemsecil6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080339456160031, "text": "This is why you don't build apartments 50 floors tall.😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:01:21", "owner": "inbetweenworkandtea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18201749932318128, "text": "Sending strength to everyone affected by this event 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:00:43", "owner": "clicy_pictures", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943236367080808, "text": "Poor people😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:00:40", "owner": "atila0605", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870387682395685, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:00:04", "owner": "natou06_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075839783228477, "text": "Straszna tragedia 😢🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:00:01", "owner": "mirkaszlichcin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304583974255868, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:59:57", "owner": "addy.kiran.420", "likes": 1}, {"id": 1807905468