up in flames", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:56:07", "owner": "anandliveshere", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877539529437895, "text": "😭😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:56:01", "owner": "sunshinebumbleb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940824331093522, "text": "Ada korbannya ga? 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:55:33", "owner": "ulfa_zhe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061993379196976, "text": "🙏 for HK ….", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:55:27", "owner": "cybernticsoul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924672007175533, "text": "😭😭😭 Ya Allaah trs gimana nasibnya para penghuni apartemennya yg kena musibah itu", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:55:24", "owner": "triyan_ana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091042189934175, "text": "How can a fire break out between adjacent buildings?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:54:36", "owner": "waysiya4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064855124153193, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:54:25", "owner": "martina.moschetta.3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921773515056020, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:54:24", "owner": "fiiifay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040166894710399, "text": "😢😢so very sad 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:54:22", "owner": "fi_dale", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895717105358717, "text": "Dammit", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:54:21", "owner": "zangano___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972040779972044, "text": "💔💔dale señor el descanso eterno y brille para ellos la luz eterna.  Señor que sea tu mano ✋️ la que haga justicia por todos los fallecidos en esta tragedia 😢😢😢😢💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:54:13", "owner": "campusanoiris", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18302039770254815, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:53:42", "owner": "_.ladytron._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866792209500395, "text": "Это ужас 😭 ! Бедные люди !", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:53:41", "owner": "emilia_goosfraba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862281799537708, "text": "God bless 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:53:40", "owner": "mafe_llo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026774195770634, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:53:35", "owner": "donatellithornton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397170049122705, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:53:32", "owner": "joeyelzb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049890785664352, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:53:13", "owner": "p__nira03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979391892782603, "text": "願逝者安息！傷者早日康復 祈求🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:52:53", "owner": "enjoy_shampooing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015957548628619, "text": "そもそも高層ビルは　津波から逃れるための富裕層が考え出した建物だがそのためだけに作られたので　火事を防ぐまで設計されてない　耐震性　防火性に優れていない限り危ない　細長い建物はどうしても煙突のような働きになってしまう。", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:52:51", "owner": "nao7788991010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113176237585076, "text": "一人でも多くの方が助かりますように🙏被害に遭われた方が1日でも早く平穏な日常を取り戻せますように🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:52:50", "owner": "tyttai.bro", "likes": 415}, {"id": 17885623950406260, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:52:46", "owner": "lalinimaria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059299553641659, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:52:36", "owner": "ms_teentam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929608672156365, "text": "Bamboo scaffolding do not lead to terrible fire incidents but corruption did 🥲", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:52:27", "owner": "ship_in_south_america", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17983513322919913, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:52:16", "owner": "staryen1202", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004878983669889, "text": "That building looks like it was made out of toothpicks, whoever built that thing needs to be arrested", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:52:05", "owner": "darksaber2099", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077301199957447, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:51:54", "owner": "auqmia_croche", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922695475048920, "text": "😔🥺💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:51:54", "owner": "mijaa.84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086717450083538, "text": "😓💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:51:44", "owner": "bogusia_z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135148894469597, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:51:41", "owner": "suenami_suenami", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18437661679109323, "text": "😿🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:51:27", "owner": "glutton.cat.eat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053831267656713, "text": "How in the world the twin towers in New York collapsed while these buildings are still standing? Why?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:51:08", "owner": "clinicallabscientist", "likes": 58}, {"id": 17849088969600685, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:50:52", "owner": "indra.156", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18294217270278292, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:50:40", "owner": "haeyan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080743256168227, "text": "What happen to their fire fighter robot", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:50:35", "owner": "moviezonehq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988952574907150, "text": "Como o fogo passou de um prédio para outro?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:50:26", "owner": "adriana_dri_rosa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087761648479602, "text": "💔😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:50:20", "owner": "lostnaigners", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101765671670597, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:50:15", "owner": "minigroseille", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080715608166567, "text": "rip🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:50:03", "owner": "zhuyichen74", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087630094783937, "text": "what", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:49:53", "owner": "yang1172100", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104506699635043, "text": "よく建ってるね。倒れたら二次災害怖い。", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:49:52", "owner": "masayamaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929023147148410, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:49:42", "owner": "luzloodeli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890385226380153, "text": "🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:49:25", "owner": "mi_miffy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539299717035880, "text": "😢😢🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:49:23", "owner": "akiraniwa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119320780543548, "text": "wow.....😢 🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:49:23", "owner": "mi_miffy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091963055500206, "text": "But did they fall?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:49:21", "owner": "schnitzel1994", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100253383777081, "text": "Holy fuk", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:49:18", "owner": "ll.rr41", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18395267905192984, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:49:16", "owner": "mmriv.fr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978076368950073, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:49:15", "owner": "verogalleau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18334913146210439, "text": "😢😭🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:48:52", "owner": "_tina5003", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941913010093887, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:48:35", "owner": "ken.smith0066", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891018151245961, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:48:29", "owner": "makc_ke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971922669812273, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:48:27", "owner": "sharon.z18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988479762879464, "text": "Los colosos en llamas 🤦", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:48:24", "owner": "angelesrocesgarcia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862876228533822, "text": "This is really heartbreaking 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:48:21", "owner": "svenxoxox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109971583618550, "text": "World Trade Center towers collapsed in less then 3 hours", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:48:16", "owner": "tramberdecker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853920298579794, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:48:07", "owner": "ting_oxoxbb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087640063781503, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:47:55", "owner": "curtis8866", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970431381969261, "text": "Tukang?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:47:54", "owner": "radityoroseno", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18429607564110046, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:47:27", "owner": "wawazywawa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17937003863983747, "text": "삼가고인의 명복을빕니다.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:47:11", "owner": "pure__ali", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104014468591072, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:46:54", "owner": "styleinkhk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087112147953547, "text": "今日起きた火事ですか？何棟ものマンションが火事なったんですか？原因は？？", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:46:49", "owner": "humihumi792", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061205411541937, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:46:49", "owner": "kaipgriff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930065749015357, "text": "😭😢😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:46:49", "owner": "abi_sdg12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18435657661103811, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:46:40", "owner": "ardyaniep72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060069389258644, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:46:27", "owner": "a111112000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072121013058641, "text": "一切平安", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:46:21", "owner": "haopintung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994006842715714, "text": "😢😢🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:46:18", "owner": "iamtinlabenia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18330798568240500, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:46:13", "owner": "sereniti5057", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072194036055209, "text": "これ以上被害が拡大しませんように…亡くなった方々へお悔やみ申し上げます。", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:46:09", "owner": "youuuuuuuuuuu428", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007388687813565, "text": "Mi raccomando fateli sempre più alti ...così le vittime sono sempre di più...🙈🙈🙈🙊🙊🙊🙊🙊", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:46:08", "owner": "amedeogaleffi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925792384179518, "text": "Maaf awal nya gymna yaa itu lain gedung pdhal yaa", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:45:58", "owner": "nidaazizah43", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950371167922951, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:45:55", "owner": "faceyoga.murcino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047641931678706, "text": "W", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:45:53", "owner": "pielo0331", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098491681840426, "text": "I hope there is ok noe", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:45:51", "owner": "pielo0331", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934780201104797, "text": "Faudrait peut être arrêter d'utiliser des échafaudage en bambou 😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:45:47", "owner": "robertofrecho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004838348669956, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:45:46", "owner": "hermesschmidt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865502785432732, "text": "Poor all these innocent people and animals, that have been killed.😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:45:40", "owner": "katya.kozabo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102153568735390, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:45:39", "owner": "yu114__ss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051406109350248, "text": "💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:45:39", "owner": "______juanita_______", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082829777109794, "text": "💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:45:31", "owner": "latifaafitall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099213433760543, "text": "平安🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:45:28", "owner": "emma_pan0112", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176497327366276, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:45:25", "owner": "kwankao.vidh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846696721611499, "text": "💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:45:24", "owner": "dyannnekaa._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18315359005216633, "text": "Tragic. Yet, not 1 building collapsed", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:45:12", "owner": "bmw.product.genius", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18079106749922241, "text": "Meu Deus...😢💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:44:59", "owner": "lualexandrino_fotografia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001497230686168, "text": "How many is that on fire 🔥 😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:44:58", "owner": "milalovely1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18208435750314716, "text": "How many hours did it burn?! And they're still standing. Think about it.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:44:42", "owner": "ryan_saul_music", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083692628474737, "text": "💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:44:39", "owner": "_lynst_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074036186462653, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:44:33", "owner": "stepik1986", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865496041433361, "text": "😮😮😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:44:32", "owner": "chrisatahitinui", "li