 "2025-11-27T11:40:54", "owner": "marmaumraching25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065926328383867, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:40:42", "owner": "mmcoolh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073776638250225, "text": "З чого воно зроблено що так згоріло і ще і поряд", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:40:36", "owner": "katriinkav", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061367642228559, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:40:35", "owner": "kaifm0051", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082617107321037, "text": "😢🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:40:16", "owner": "ankitmalhotra508", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052881599339263, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:40:16", "owner": "indraazad.333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376599211152207, "text": "😢 I pray for the family and love ones of people that lost their life and still missing. 💔 This seemed orchestrated.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:40:01", "owner": "just_nellz_b__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089165282486884, "text": "Pray For Hong Kong 🇭🇰 🙏💔💔 so many died and so many are still missing 😢 ❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:39:55", "owner": "vikacupnaia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086833936979752, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:39:54", "owner": "mithukoshi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933151159109210, "text": "billion dollars lost 💸", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:39:51", "owner": "sam.alkuheli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087494575951164, "text": "愿平安🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:39:46", "owner": "nguyenhuunam18143", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919380859209282, "text": "Absolutely devastating to see 😢 I cannot begin to imagine what the people there are going through right now but I pray there is swift resolve so they can repair their lives 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:39:45", "owner": "sophosone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845017813617189, "text": "애도를 표합니다 다시는 이런 참사가 없길 간절히 바라봅니다 삼가 고인의명복을 빕니다", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:39:24", "owner": "soyoung_min09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918814933069917, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:39:22", "owner": "moureaufreddy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853237390584017, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:39:17", "owner": "rita_marketing_manager", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18096765136872630, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:39:14", "owner": "chan33_0513", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092588095928488, "text": "😭😭😭GOD BLESS 🙏🙏🙏HK天佑香港🇭🇰", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:39:00", "owner": "sai_kagou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113020282583689, "text": "Why this building built so near each other 🤦🏻🤦🏻🤦🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:38:57", "owner": "tanhonsen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185056678349807, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:38:53", "owner": "xymodaasiatica", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107933890619667, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:38:53", "owner": "ritachen953", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889831393386112, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:38:43", "owner": "birg.itherzig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064590203419443, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:38:24", "owner": "cinnamonhague", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885990739404131, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:38:22", "owner": "marisel_2013", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051274895356340, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:38:05", "owner": "blue.lake.county", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842700406628779, "text": "Because of One cheap Stupid fuck cigarettes", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:38:02", "owner": "rizzkiess", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105628966712698, "text": "@n.naga_laut1", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:37:43", "owner": "rain_river_tone", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095346154870821, "text": "Scary😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:37:38", "owner": "carolinekeane34", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073013597362320, "text": "I hope the number of casualties will not increase. Contractor wants to take wealth; there is a way to seek it. They has won the contracts by the bid, and it is still necessary to use this kind of reckless method to make huge profits. I don't know what to say?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:37:28", 