12419982587151, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:33:17", "owner": "elizabethperezdeseifridsberger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030746090544765, "text": "😭😭😭😭❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:32:52", "owner": "shihcin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540467848057745, "text": "😮😮😮😮😮😢😢😢😢🙏🙏🙏🙏💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:32:39", "owner": "angelicajucu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848566129606413, "text": "This is the problem when your building is too high", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:32:34", "owner": "higiniamerced", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104389048644239, "text": "미래도시가 저런모습일까봐 너무 겁난다ㅠ", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:32:10", "owner": "buyong_e.0", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18096335896856247, "text": "🙏💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:32:05", "owner": "percyytang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970746342970435, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:32:03", "owner": "1.7meow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18421351984114410, "text": "終於控制住了", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:31:56", "owner": "jack_.0507", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921839320193231, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:31:55", "owner": "rosei_hyr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18300164731281313, "text": "🙏🙏🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:31:35", "owner": "jeffreyxysu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063402980406500, "text": "Omg thousands of people has lost their homes", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:31:33", "owner": "furzemargaret", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18431908078128064, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:31:19", "owner": "jessicajuan6441", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114212101601481, "text": "😢😢 RIP", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:31:15", "owner": "anncylaw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852133381591907, "text": "Brutal. So schlimm. 😭😭😭😭💔💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:31:08", "owner": "s0679d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088038622769655, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:30:58", "owner": "yuenmeiwong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966042885841009, "text": "🙏😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:30:46", "owner": "melarom3gmail.com1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882316672413726, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:30:19", "owner": "priscillahoong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093613795910484, "text": "Yk how some planes pass and let out water for bush fire.....they should start doing that to sky scrapers....cause the fire fighters water truck ain't helping much.....", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:29:28", "owner": "_.princessashely._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071779418461356, "text": "Why it didn't collapse like WTC7?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:29:19", "owner": "da_schwarz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305542363265535, "text": "Wahnsinnig wie viele Menschen ihr zu hause und geliebte Menschen verloren haben😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:29:16", "owner": "clemens_0205", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113057431515125, "text": "💔 devastating, my thoughts are with all people that were affected by this", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:29:14", "owner": "eydis.d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136347202466062, "text": "不要讓失去的生命白費，下定決心，發起全港逐步淘汰竹棚， 數十年來，犧牲的生命已經足夠了，不能再讓一小撮人的利益，進一步造成傷痛。", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:29:11", "owner": "johnnycbchan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099899134790550, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:29:10", "owner": "m_yusof_m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134849287483572, "text": "🫂🫂🫂❤️‍🩹❤️‍🩹❤️‍🩹", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:29:07", "owner": "miki.ok13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084847334065747, "text": "엄청난 사건이네요", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:28:51", "owner": "daredevil3989", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009372389806050, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:28:32", "owner": "ahaeriss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18192595075326772, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:28:27", "owner": "mrkaseychiu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296572741285351, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏😭😭😭praying for those effected", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:28:13", "owner": "rosa010790", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970274247978177, "text": "😭😭 too heartbreaking to see this", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:28:13", "owner": "popkiss26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18376420027154152,