:25:53", "owner": "xiangsong32", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119458117481170, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:25:50", "owner": "rose_lew", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113850763581270, "text": "Que trajedia tan tenaz mucha familias ahora sí nhogar 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:25:41", "owner": "yazlena2016", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075546662228344, "text": "내가 항상얘기하잖아 불은 발화기 성장기 최성기 쇠퇴기를 거치기 때문에 가연물이 다타면 안꺼도 알아서꺼진다고 고조선때부터 내려오는 진리 저고층에 물이 안닿는데 왜 꺼졌겠냐 꺼서 꺼진게 아니고 다타서 꺼진거지", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:25:35", "owner": "gimsagyejeol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153550753411855, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:25:12", "owner": "qax14789zxc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914464894090812, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:25:09", "owner": "marcelalunaolmos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076947866230840, "text": "Nobody will pay.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:24:58", "owner": "innofrance74", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998292951839283, "text": "Muy bonito el bambú 😂 tanta china tecnológica y mira que usar bambú para sus andamios", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:24:47", "owner": "isaacgarlop7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970349805967538, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:24:30", "owner": "yenfei_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933000448109472, "text": "Fire and water are ruthless.We have to draw inferences from others.Don't let this tragedy happen again.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:24:20", "owner": "limin77774", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18327480631244356, "text": "Berapa gedung itu yg terbakar,  yg d tengah 1 kayaknya aman bukan ya?  Maaf nanya", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:24:08", "owner": "kestip_yorin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854574892576032, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:24:08", "owner": "lily9486", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116243575565863, "text": "Mon Dieu...nous prions pour vous...", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:24:04", "owner": "rohmer391", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929229499150749, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:23:47", "owner": "yuanekko", "likes": 0}, 