reated_at": "2025-11-27T11:18:14", "owner": "thatskievientenueve", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108068941620327, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:18:00", "owner": "soulmatebeauty_lash.spmu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18186249139353185, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:17:53", "owner": "davidcwkwan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146127994432176, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:17:40", "owner": "xqc__ig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924074524187876, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:17:27", "owner": "meggalestari_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18196420264324933, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:17:15", "owner": "aasqqwe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105334243639210, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:16:55", "owner": "iiiim_iiiim8003", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070405874599731, "text": "What did you expect with bamboo  scaffolding !!??", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:16:46", "owner": "tergeste71", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18384407161179405, "text": "💔😢😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:16:40", "owner": "29hutab", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946178545070357, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:16:40", "owner": "tonellolilly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126371317506229, "text": "where were the high tech fire fighting drones? Saw them used in a highly publicized video fighting high rise skyscraper fires….😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:16:18", "owner": "gene966", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18334892797239705, "text": "God bless🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:16:11", "owner": "qiaozero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086536192968293, "text": "💔💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:16:03", "owner": "tictic_booboo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099151645748301, "text": "以前坐車路過那條路我常常多看幾眼現在，昨天路過在堵車的過程中我也看到了不少人的在馬路上看著自己房子被燒很多人留著眼淚還有很多老人家他在那邊心痛自己孩子努力的就這麼沒有了，看著我心疼自己在車里摸摸的流眼淚", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:15:55", "owner": "zhenmeiz769", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014115944800127, "text": "😭怎麼會這樣 我心愛的香港", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:15:47", "owner": "sherry_chen_1013", "likes": 273}, {"id": 17926232574033369, "text": "Rip to the dead. This is  arson on purpose. Something fishy about the fire", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:15:46", "owner": "iceelzaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103398466732762, "text": "🙏❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:15:26", "owner": "chaochao.gary", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063766259409925, "text": "🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:15:24", "owner": "jacksonk.970507", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071073278457922, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:15:17", "owner": "vehraline626", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17855837523566757, "text": "The famous thermal insulators?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:15:10", "owner": "alwaysbusypaolo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107450377621204, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:14:50", "owner": "siyashopova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891593905242329, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:14:50", "owner": "zy_yueyueyue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894130534360305, "text": "Why it didn't happen in tel aviv instead 🤬🤬", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:14:47", "owner": "alexmncs_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18371905237159516, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:14:46", "owner": "luzhang925", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991714110857573, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:14:40", "owner": "diiyinandii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079352764909319, "text": "An Absolutely horror , I cannot image the how terrifying has been for the people in these buildings, I hope was accidental and not started in purpose as lots of comments are saying 😨", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:14:26", "owner": "glow7jhrjsvj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075459379983223, "text": "Pray for 大埔。南无阿弥陀佛🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:14:26", "owner": "chooipeng77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18294349396261192, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:14:23", "owner": "mermaid_sparkle23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883497520411754, "text": "pray for HongKong", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:14:06", "owner": "mrluxegentwatch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052012922658163, "text": "😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:14:01", "owner": "ayh_bb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184619332357028, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:13:58", "owner": "snakegil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110091163610991, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:13:20", "owner": "iam_vanessalvarez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083133143039607, "text": "🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:13:15", "owner": "timmy_syz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971631753978144, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:13:11", "owner": "ck_chu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864204052516777, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:12:52", "owner": "tripperpb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916140121219153, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:12:46", "owner": "itsthepeacocks", "likes": 21}, {"id": 18415907596191924, "text": "It's very sad and I don't understand how a fire spread from one big building to another.The distance from one building to another is very long.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:12:41", "owner": "tamimkhe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930434224117991, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:12:41", "owner": "jessica20040809", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074403017197046, "text": "Çok geçmiş olsun 🙏 Allah ölenlere rahmet eylesin💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:12:35", "owner": "hasretelladuruu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065828459419463, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:12:35", "owner": "steven_jiahao", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069029975579275, "text": "Evil low vibrational demonic behaviour", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:12:16", "owner": "funkydrumphilz1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972754641798460, "text": "想哭🥲", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:12:15", "owner": "mimimimomama", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913845376244092, "text": "😢😢😭😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:12:14", "owner": "benaia_direito", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025902947765177, "text": "Ridiculous 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:12:12", "owner": "kimkim2046", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081135827119717, "text": "天佑香港🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:12:11", "