47", "owner": "bodrumdabifiliz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076872398215761, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:06:33", "owner": "fh7720", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18415950769137639, "text": "According to some residents’ claims, DAB member Wong Bik-ki and the building’s management committee pushed forward a HKD 330 million renovation project despite owners’ objections, allegedly involving bid-rigging concerns and the use of non-fire-resistant safety nets. Residents also reported issues such as inadequate workmanship and fire alarms not functioning, as well as police being called during owners’ attempts to organize a petition meeting.\n\nThis corruption has cost many lives. They have placed human life secondary and shown no concern for people’s safety", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:06:23", "owner": "letshop_hermes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101527369775442, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:06:22", "owner": "instalenkova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065994740144898, "text": "💔💔💔😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:06:21", "owner": "ny.andriani", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18141506740453403, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:06:08", "owner": "dongharryyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18194026018326874, "text": "為何沒有裝設自動灑水系統？😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:06:00", "owner": "quanjianglan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071118971593167, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭tmerr  pzzzzz", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:05:41", "owner": "adnal_29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947122704933714, "text": "The bamboo scaffolding is still there after fire. Should not blame the bamboo scaffolding", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:05:32", "owner": "kodakdaniel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171991984331057, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:04:58", "owner": "whestworld", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107224315628675, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:04:46", "owner": "leila.kazemi1359", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944606410077119, "text": "😭🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:04:39", "owner": "yaelmcre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109235641530547, "text": "Hoffentlich werden verantwortliche auch verklagt", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:04:37", "owner": "patrickpaulus104", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918156151208447, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:04:34", "owner": "___kiwiwi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880795282424610, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:04:02", "owner": "hope001200", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070579784371718, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:03:50", "owner": "jj415___gemma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063569861185683, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:03:42", "owner": "angelawan4134", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029214554755731, "text": "對逝者來說活蒸籠真是煉獄", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:03:41", "owner": "zs_0220", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876950899441358, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:03:34", "owner": "sherry.mio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120024019558024, "text": "🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:03:25", "owner": "_thanhlichliu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071018744581877, "text": "🙏🙏祈求香港大埔民众早日度过难关。", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:03:19", "owner": "kunzhang886576", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087891472793349, "text": "하  처참하다 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:03:17", "owner": "k._.mij", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072852872598218, "text": "A sad  story of Hong Kong !", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:03:04", "owner": "andy.cheung.311493", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18386550304183525, "text": "My God 😢😢😢 Que os bombeiros consigam resgatar mais vítimas", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:02:56", "owner": "keydlorenco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972860469806276, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:02:55", "owner": "whyhung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074363306260969, "text": "🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:02:42", "owner": "ayman_post_02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331938343214598, "text": "โหดมาก", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:02:28", "owner": "praphasin_1984", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875158252447097, "text": "So sad 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:02:06", "owner": "parkmin0320", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060703313247973, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:01:59", "owner": "qintan0417", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028939274756741, "text": "💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:01:57", "owner": "effy_wongs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086977861809258, "text": "Heart breaking 💔 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:01:48", "owner": "expat1_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858666634555215, "text": "💔🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:01:39", "owner": "rumble_dada", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089159824939532, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:01:32", "owner": "hazel_051009", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991117557731093, "text": "Geile Ai", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:01:28", "owner": "psychosenhenrya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134778277472510, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:01:25", "owner": "itzelenaho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003060635835338, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:01:10", "owner": "chrisa_ex_43", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857554384505762, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:00:59", "owner": "hiddenpoolvilla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081377426330002, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:00:38", "owner": "samanthi_wettasinghe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892895608367703, "text": "Qué imagen más triste y desoladora 😢😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:00:38", "owner": "taita_208", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056143412315058, "text": "😭💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:00:36", "owner": "seeseacccc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135334060464725, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:00:33", "owner": "vik_div", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903331885296894, "text": "Pray that no one loses their life because of this.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T11:00:14", "owner": "jc310420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972938382798164, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:59:56", "owner": "zsr200302", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087702670782841, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:59:51", "owner": "carmz.x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171496351373673, "text": "no safety measures nothing.. just sad…", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:59:35", "owner": "11.06_aj", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17867212641491189, "text": "Hongkong human Barbeque 1dollar😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:59:32", "owner": "justice_not_vengeance_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18556879048008723, "text": "I hope the survivors are safe and pray for hongkong", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:59:25", "owner": "vertx_132", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079072096901001, "text": "All the scaffolding is made of bamboo !", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:58:56", "owner": "kirstyferrari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090183037936873, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:58:50", "owner": "liwen1823", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902636152301564, "text": "Какая Трагедия!  Надеюсь такого нигде больше не повторится.  Строители конечно не учли эвакуацию .. ужас ужаснейший .  Столько жертв", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:58:50", "owner": "so_lisol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068754668085105, "text": "有稳台", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:58:48", "owner": "uu6kkcom", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076360361189692, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:58:24", "owner": "_w0unn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18037563767710880, "text": "Such an unfortunate. 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:58:11", "owner": "gulzar.husayn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932140678139099, "text": "I hope that as many people as possible will be rescued.　元香港居留民。", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:57:55", "owner": "ameoyaji0817", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098762320780963, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:57:53", "owner": "roccarocca4545", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111924232521106, "text": "💔😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:57:41", "owner": "jeansmith1809", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079264853324238, "text": "😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:57:25", "owner": "mom_hanny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165012769380293, "text": "😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:57:24", "owner": "juilezheng1024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097323169833522, "text": "🙏🙏🙏心痛", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:57:21", "owner": "heyunmen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860518894477580, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:57:14", "owner": "carlin_travel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069129590096963, "text": "God bless HK 🙏 God bless Taipo🙏  God bless ALL !!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:56:56", "owner": "super_aloysius", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081461537470503, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:56:54", "owner": "tantasticbaby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066160268613237, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:56:53", "owner": "love446600", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948955414070936, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:56:51", "owner": "jane1902", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867596563488672, "text": "This is why you do not built stupid buildings like this", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:56:43", "owner": "roseannhuband", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108848677716197, "text": "Pray for HK 🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:56:34", "owner": "mungsikchui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845324947615842, "text": "Lord heal our land", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:56:20", "owner": "anne_bacacao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098480218769312, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:56:11", "owner": "igyuyu1209", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079967684154059, "text": "😢😢😢😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:55:40", "owner": "e.1991.g", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065778221145050, "text": "😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:55:26", "owner": "ekaprast", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18196664893324204, "text": "人祸", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:55:25", "owner": "anikazo111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095048722888046, "text": "💔💔💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:55:05", "owner": "ebgny9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101011735706070, "text": "😢😢🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:54:52", "owner": "sangki_k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953728455905109, "text": "🙏🙏🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:54:38", "owner": "170heyley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082352953878070, "text": "不幸中の幸いは風が無かったこと。これで強風が吹いていたら離れたビルも延焼していたろう。", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:54:29", "owner": "kirapawavinus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932249050110694, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:54:28", "owner": "kimimokwan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891364783379784, "text": "planned sabotage", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:53:48", "owner": "hsr9091", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998070354696477, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:53:40", "owner": "shuukotokyo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101066977777686, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:53:36", "owner": "ouyangjiefang2004", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944106415073827, "text": "중국이니깐 가능한 화재", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:53:36", "owner": "gupalsam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049195061661625, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:53:34", "owner": "emniyetlihayatdernegi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958543411037491, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢Poor folk. So so sad.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:53:29", "owner": "cosie_coco_luna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083544998042297, "text": "😢😢💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:53:21", "owner": "doctor.winny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304819927267717, "text": "🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:53:08", "owner": "pg.1122", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900007255182673, "text": "💔 pray for HKG", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:53:03", "owner": "nazmamona", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143545039449006, "text": "@_greyarea @ramramv @useong.k @hellomorak @wisekdh", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:52:56", "owner": "lee_rawadee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089255299944574, "text": "THOUGHTS AND PRAYERS TO THE PEOPLE OF HONG KONG. I REALLY HOPE THEY RECOVER AND I AM HERE PRAYING AND MY THOUGHTS ARE WITH YOU:", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:52:54", "owner": "benforsyth_realestate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031062398742249, "text": "AI", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:52:47", "owner": "david_to_horizon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987170676913886, "text": "The 37-year-old firefighter who was killed by this fire was going to get married next month… 💔😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:52:40", "owner": "helioswj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870229255394576, "text": "💔💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏🙏😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:52:38", "owner": "rui.xue_yang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072275285605505, "text": "the distance  very spation betwen tower, fire blowing by the wind", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:52:30", "owner": "balancingequipment", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18428896720107984, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:52:20", "owner": "dorasyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085914337992650, "text": "香港加油😭😭\n一定要平平安安 早日恢復秩序\n\nRIP😭遇難者", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:52:18", "owner": "gguzzxx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090762334898686, "text": "Verschrikkelijk", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:51:59", "owner": "alie_sch59", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087953219492399, "text": "😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:51:54", "owner": "iswsuz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546229453007714, "text": "God bless honk Kong 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:51:32", "owner": "treck_to_morocco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098955403815050, "text": "Ya allah", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:51:31", "owner": "gatobie_ebie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087310960804047, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:51:16", "owner": "candywongtc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397509952134449, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:51:11", "owner": "shakirmohd72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045399707477952, "text": "😢😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:51:11", "owner": "vandysrei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095795863881812, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:51:04", "owner": "shawn.lee0320", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949323583061132, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:50:59", "owner": "diane.emami", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855228034570668, "text": "No fail as 9/11😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:50:53", "owner": "remifon7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061632134196797, "text": "Chernobyl: Asia", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:50:44", "owner": "insecurityguardsg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988715049907533, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:50:37", "owner": "huihui1007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083281667485931, "text": "💔🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:50:34", "owner": "kyas_cass", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065784806141993, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:50:31", "owner": "j0hn_1002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034778447724973, "text": "💔for all!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:50:29", "owner": "mfkstf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18306318139271580, "text": "你們的捐款會變成威脅或攻擊台灣的炸彈💣", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:50:27", "owner": "lowjohn1123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18291860215286623, "text": "Pray for Hong Kong 🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:50:15", "owner": "horsanhou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18394975942135805, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:49:56", "owner": "edis0n38", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296431645287749, "text": "💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:49:55", "owner": "sidramalik5374", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085506898951829, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:49:49", "owner": "e7eu2bh", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18089814409743751, "text": "Somebody was Kung Fu Fighting", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:49:48", "owner": "john_bedolla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136098394467448, "text": "这些楼烧过后，还能住人的吗？", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:49:29", "owner": "ckygordon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063927461191495, "text": "😢🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:49:26", "owner": "alanzou_1112", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912952306251213, "text": "So sad 🥲🥲🥲", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:49:25", "owner": "luckybaer18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876439030442400, "text": "😭😭😭🙏🙏🙏💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:49:25", "owner": "amber_n.yc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924403960176385, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:49:22", "owner": "ninabanban", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062526083193544, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:49:15", "owner": "elalalaqiu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112784788580684, "text": "🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:49:13", "owner": "vutunglun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864122608515739, "text": "They didn't collapse?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:48:55", "owner": "johb444", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077425451229226, "text": "🙏🏼🙏🏼🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:48:54", "owner": "platform9.3x4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968670498973943, "text": "This is so heartbreaking......😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:48:52", "owner": "jay_wu_au", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067898123455726, "text": "千萬不要捐款，現在香港是中國管轄的", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:48:46", "owner": "lowjohn1123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068258870098100, "text": "Cannot imagine what ppl in Hong Kong are going through . My deepest condolences to them all. May the departed souls rest in peace 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:48:40", "owner": "connect_with_michl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850257661564166, "text": "😢🙏😢🙏😢🙏😢🙏😢🙏😢🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:48:18", "owner": "whatsthebigdeal2023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953304247043244, "text": "🙏😇😇😇", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:48:03", "owner": "linghe.tang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011121260807886, "text": "useless bldg now", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:47:58", "owner": "derek_ramen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032439317735382, "text": "Building this high buildings is a real death trap.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:47:56", "owner": "unrushedexplorer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844801489617830, "text": "Ужас😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:47:55", "owner": "alex_boho_yoga", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320859583169938, "text": "Untung cuma dikit", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:47:51", "owner": "rendyfauzan4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991239198728503, "text": "Rip 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:47:49", "owner": "skyfly_0906", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18433331245109070, "text": "Pray for HK🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:47:48", "owner": "david_wpc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080591954139018, "text": "the smoke detector was broken or what? 😭 but I'm sorry about what happened", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:47:47", "owner": "dkdlsl_9805", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078866822135693, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:47:39", "owner": "milletforinternet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931339789011538, "text": "深圳消防演习", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:47:25", "owner": "chen_changquan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852310033591715, "text": "I'm curious did the building not have a sprinkler system I know it would have don't much but it would have slowed down the spread of the fire", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:47:23", "owner": "ivyy_hon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877517611434222, "text": "😮🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:47:15", "owner": "francisvwg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547064656014751, "text": "W1234445677⁷oʻ⁹0a", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:46:55", "owner": "duenkai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085338662007701, "text": "😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:46:53", "owner": "hitmanperez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062566898554919, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:46:53", "owner": "itsyohanfit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18247501699288762, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:46:42", "owner": "02_eunicce", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069168212080672, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:46:20", "owner": "tennycheung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18346315591202254, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:46:18", "owner": "0906georgeana_y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885025687407164, "text": "Penyebabnya katanya pekerja proyek yang buang puntung rokok sembarangan.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:46:16", "owner": "sunsetditanahsengketa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891670132241927, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:46:09", "owner": "jvn.leathercraft", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18046536512701474, "text": "😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:45:51", "owner": "penel.p", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899834527337477, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:45:51", "owner": "lcikw50dgn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074285840245425, "text": "😢😢😢😢ㅜㅜ", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:45:50", "owner": "lipstickpink123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048351164436637, "text": "🙏🙏🙏😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:45:44", "owner": "tien31360", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093829582722105, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:45:42", "owner": "