lences to the parents of those children, as well as to all the victims, the injured, and their loved ones. May their souls find comfort. R.I.P.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:26:01", "owner": "gogogo_running_boy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18398813089124844, "text": "希望大家都平安", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:25:41", "owner": "c25156327crazy09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108982372549721, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭🙏悲劇😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:25:37", "owner": "sukikoons", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084639416474320, "text": "still doesn't collapse into its own footprint at freefall speed", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:25:27", "owner": "shanemckimm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075094283190404, "text": "Tragedia współczuję rodzina 😮😢😢💔💔🌹❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:25:24", "owner": "alligator.882544", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091649785738188, "text": "Это ужасная трагедия! 💔😭 столько людей погибло такой ужасной смертью...", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:25:23", "owner": "iv.1702", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087681698064551, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:25:21", "owner": "kdh_duxi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18313209178247162, "text": "What happened", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:25:16", "owner": "mikkailla2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112104511593605, "text": "😭😭💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:25:12", "owner": "spdh_azrm_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305476441270279, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:25:10", "owner": "yjg21photo.jpg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105570997652610, "text": "Korkunç çok çok üzgünüm", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:24:42", "owner": "asli.erdogan34", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18174089527371088, "text": "Что стало причиной😮?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:24:25", "owner": "amina1161335", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867968761496606, "text": "So sad for all the families who lost their loved ones in beautiful Hong Kong 🇭🇰 ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:24:21", "owner": "martinmoynagh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120690631548811, "text": "😢🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:24:17", "owner": "a_zoo7_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869410375407976, "text": "Oh nein 😭 das ist wirklich schrecklich", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:24:13", "owner": "__vedoo__11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992678331895342, "text": "This is too hard to see 😢😢😢😢😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:24:09", "owner": "tamba09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101776996781642, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:24:08", "owner": "aoinoie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087148370491849, "text": "😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:24:04", "owner": "nillinillin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079692668175267, "text": "奥に似たようなマンションが建ち並んでるのが…どんな気持ちなんだろう…", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:23:50", "owner": "k.arinko1126", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909592906123860, "text": "何棟燃えたの？", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:23:45", "owner": "miki_9863", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043325534492815, "text": "天佑香港🇭🇰", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:23:25", "owner": "jamesyoung72513", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919657708083743, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:23:25", "owner": "silvia___f.b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18197044285325022, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:23:24", "owner": "nataliaingkiriwang.mua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913058167248706, "text": "This tragic 🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:23:06", "owner": "sym0nsdebs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940521694091490, "text": "These are all new building under construction. No one lives there", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:22:53", "owner": "kevinbaby1994", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18218105575308360, "text": "🤘🤘🤘👐👐👐шнеле ,пэпэ 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:22:38", "owner": "aleksandr_pascal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925068547176638, "text": "ㅠ😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:22:34", "owner": "teosbat_sa_rang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049311506680069, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:22:12", "owner": "hans_danny87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092007037917538, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:21:50", "owner": "trrr4249", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542563378040525, "text": "😢😢😢🙏🙏🙏", "crea