d": 17998227794845387, "text": "oh no…. is this one of those coffin homes?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:15:40", "owner": "oppressed_pinoy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934678132102110, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:15:35", "owner": "bakharzarosh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860354728544057, "text": "😭😭😭Sending hugs & prayers to the affected family", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:15:34", "owner": "poison216ivymik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951283477044233, "text": "😭😭😭😭💔💔💔 pray that more people and pets are saved 🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:15:33", "owner": "hf_hoho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066657470144287, "text": "🙏🙏😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:15:29", "owner": "hana_olscher", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18496540309074956, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:15:09", "owner": "gulfairussarybayeva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006292211819273, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:15:07", "owner": "aslu_bentley_loaded", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18339278788238691, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:15:00", "owner": "frandadawatani28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893377366363544, "text": "Ecology", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:14:53", "owner": "razum_10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883996474412070, "text": "아니 어떡해 몇동이 한꺼번에 불에타지? 어떡해ㅠ", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:14:35", "owner": "seoyeosa3485", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061659524229705, "text": "My condolences to the families of the victims😢😔 謹向遇難者家屬致以深切哀悼", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:14:30", "owner": "baustofftransportmeister", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103407766675658, "text": "Kalo di indo mesin pemadamnya bisa nyembur ke ketinggian ini juga ga ya?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:14:23", "owner": "arylahmad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18432992038107815, "text": "💔🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:14:06", "owner": "mibao_0215", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921993961191566, "text": "Bamboo scaffolding still intact", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:14:04", "owner": "maggiewtwong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951389809060722, "text": "至命係易燃網同發寶膠", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:14:03", "owner": "lwl827", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953344408045046, "text": "保有🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:13:58", "owner": "best08_ict", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077018714225645, "text": "Pray for Hongkong 2 temen seperjuangan pekerja migran Indonesia telah meninggal dunia semoga Husnul khatimah 🤲", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:13:49", "owner": "dwiwi_0503mua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103923361660613, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:13:42", "owner": "audreyliutamads", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18189336064339001, "text": "😢😢😢💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:13:31", "owner": "peer_jonas_mahle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973286118968777, "text": "@_vickyyyxo 😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:13:27", "owner": "tuan_56", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874184641370710, "text": "😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:13:17", "owner": "djthreat002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074277137244673, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:13:06", "owner": "4gr4ce44", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077511473515907, "text": "Praying for all those impacted and the departed souls 😭🙏😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:12:55", "owner": "therachelchan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058494932285668, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:12:44", "owner": "cocodenice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18534223810056018, "text": "家人同學仔住喺嗰度😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:12:18", "owner": "ttkwhy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051539618340726, "text": "Praying for you🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:12:11", "owner": "foodhunterph", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905838304276681, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:12:08", "owner": "eb02670", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901199017326393, "text": "🙏🙏🙏阿彌陀佛🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:12:06", "owner": "joanna.tao.562", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146824696433631, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:12:02", "owner": "keiiy0724", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157830268397337, "text": "😔🥺💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:11:58", "owner": "ladyjacq927", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18348564445200801, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:11:55", "owner": "mueanfunillusion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074187167016506, "text": "😮😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:11:43", "owner": "ko.valeva81", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971480325970305, "text": "😢😢😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:11:41", "owner": "robalo_013", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954048874032515, "text": "Bentar lagi di Indonesia", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:11:38", "owner": "hellboyacunk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894237394222247, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:11:23", "owner": "heidiwong126", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539500555007259, "text": "房子還是不要蓋的那麼近", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:11:11", "owner": "sl._.0716", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184989391350729, "text": "中華名物😍", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:11:08", "owner": "wuuuuuuuu36", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044116418484454, "text": "This fire 🔥 reminds me of the high-rise fire in Roubaix in 2012, where the facade was burning and the fire department's ladders couldn't reach the very top ☝🏻!!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:11:02", "owner": "darlarenvatio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075567689225650, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:11:00", "owner": "sieying", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18404064433193581, "text": "It's so heartbreaking 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:10:49", "owner": "maysart77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864127576530348, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:10:38", "owner": "ring_chow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146378608439843, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:10:20", "owner": "ika.jandes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134211553488904, "text": "Those poor people 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:10:12", "owner": "amandawest335", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18332163223212451, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:10:06", "owner": "evercheung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058071536652761, "text": "😱😱😱", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:10:06", "owner": "andreapaolazanini", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18436182406102825, "text": "God bless all", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:09:57", "owner": "yapitspolo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026371226771971, "text": "天佑香港，平平安安🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:09:55", "owner": "one_ninth_bear", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051443327357150, "text": "😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:09:47", "owner": "iiii520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093724798895445, "text": "😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:09:46", "owner": "la_la_re", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083714311856563, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:09:39", "owner": "leo_ng_lau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909002917261180, "text": "💔🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:09:12", "owner": "billie2jean", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846163948613744, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:08:49", "owner": "star_of_martha_gurl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915305914230888, "text": "😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:08:47", "owner": "ivette0763", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057447257304437, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:08:28", "owner": "carlos.teles5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066091235527386, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:08:20", "owner": "yang_nan__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939233608096811, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:08:14", "owner": "kimlieule33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084798149054091, "text": "They went scorched earth on that one", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:08:13", "owner": "deputydog252", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105133441641510, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:07:44", "owner": "beatrizsalasrafiee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920747674190446, "text": "🥺🥺😔😔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:07:44", "owner": "tamagdi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100892263703714, "text": "Oh my god! 🙏🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:07:37", "owner": "jolandakenters", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086074721063141, "text": "😢😢😢😢🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:07:37", "owner": "autofresh14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968934279984691, "text": "This is very tragic 💔😢 ! Hope they can still find people and animals alive !", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:07:37", "owner": "seuuu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869019739480143, "text": "May those victims rest in peace and Thank God for all the survivors 🙏🏼 This is so scary and sad! Sometimes I wonder how could all blocks caught fire at the same time...disaster! 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:07:16", "owner": "_rachelfong_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032716481726932, "text": "Is this still possible to renew and get rid of the burnt material and deep chemical smoke smell from the walls?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:07:05", "owner": "artur.ko7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540619300015262, "text": "這不能住 😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:06:53", "owner": "merida0912", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383409433147679, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:06:51", "owner": "muffinowenhimmi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863994862453699, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:06:51", "owner": "langlang0301", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881926939422004, "text": "Ya Allah ya Robbi", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:06:44", "owner": "slestarisa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540729493034407, "text": "🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:06:33", "owner": "hitomii._.chann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157693924367044, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:06:22", "owner": "apple778242", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888365422261439, "text": "China good", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:06:10", "owner": "03112__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113456575580032, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:06:02", "owner": "ieongsusan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095313949677202, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:06:00", "owner": "shi_small_flower", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089030258311385, "text": "😢🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:05:55", "owner": "tungfotoart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18173177602374909, "text": "😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:05:39", "owner": "yuzhangpei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056731082306783, "text": "😢😭😭😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:05:28", "owner": "wdl2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135985525466104, "text": "💔😢🤍", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:05:19", "owner": "melany_guebara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039556190710313, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:04:57", "owner": "lumiereue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049333118416723, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:04:54", "owner": "awei198112", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989092248907973, "text": "How that's happened, same time 5 buildings burns😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:04:44", "owner": "vignesh.vgx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074656895194013, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:04:29", "owner": "mandy_ballball116", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076402454266655, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:04:26", "owner": "yoko_woodle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029863145758306, "text": "😭😭😭😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:04:16", "owner": "jennyappleblue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968730126829554, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:04:08", "owner": "stephenyoga99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121505404524606, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:04:03", "owner": "show30316", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113672932601609, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:04:02", "owner": "ommadu_kr_hpci", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113622172516973, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:03:51", "owner": "tizityle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113227108599844, "text": "It Looks like cardboard. RIP.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:03:45", "owner": "cheekyoziechick5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064830365438932, "text": "希望能变好😢目前原因查出来了吗？太惨了💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:03:44", "owner": "happiness9612", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866821786427709, "text": "My gosh", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:03:25", "owner": "japan.delivery", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987060399869681, "text": "💔💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:03:16", "owner": "irawanrhmayadi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924898513176957, "text": "@cfgovoni", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:01:59", "owner": "cris_lg_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880059295327298, "text": "Oh dear😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:01:54", "owner": "new_morous", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047590553426446, "text": "早期这种超高层住宅建筑设计上确实有优势，比如人们的视野会在高峰俯瞰周边感觉很独特，土地利用率也很高。\n\n但除了这些之外，这些超高层的建筑缺点也越来越多，最后欧美发达国家基本已经废弃这种了，就连土地很紧张的日本也没有这么多这么密集的超高层住宅建筑。\n\n西方国家在二战之后建了很多这种高层住宅，后来就是由于类似火灾，高空坠落这些安全隐患，建筑倾斜下沉，墙体容易开裂，电梯故障率高等问题，最后这些高层基本都拆了。\n\n就好比现在在英国，除了在伦敦这种大城市还能看到极少数的超高层建筑住宅之外，其余的很多地方都几乎看不到了。", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:01:40", "owner": "songrunl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098780605805717, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:01:34", "owner": "lamlokfung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925788232080687, "text": "😮😮😮😢😢😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:00:51", "owner": "a0977101511", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543465619047075, "text": "南無阿彌陀佛", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:00:46", "owner": "toylizard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042525617695792, "text": "天佑香港", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:00:46", "owner": "lady_canape", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884910766283361, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:00:42", "owner": "rammbocksachse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158618980403903, "text": "Dios mio, que tristesa tan grande. 💔😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:00:16", "owner": "lesly2261", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920130052197402, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:00:05", "owner": "liiiaaaa_y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119818231543252, "text": "276 still missing 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:00:01", "owner": "quokkacola99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868315243480325, "text": "So heartbreaking 😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:00:00", "owner": "genjief9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090015082939879, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:59:58", "owner": "ottesm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048932933408938, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:59:56", "owner": "iiittu12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119355907531673, "text": "Prayer and sadness💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:59:05", "owner": "neverdream24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875550328444859, "text": "Innalillahi wainnailaihi rojiun", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:58:47", "owner": "__putriariani__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058750148557013, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:58:46", "owner": "misseggling", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134470432473398, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:58:33", "owner": "marchd0410", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888495709259470, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:58:31", "owner": "welm088", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935135731104529, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:58:25", "owner": "elena____el", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053044376662939, "text": "😢😢😢 Looks devastating so unreal like something out of a horror movie", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:58:08", "owner": "sofiakhan4139", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991387644856936, "text": "😢💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:58:02", "owner": "dr.dave.notarzt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842784127621945, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:57:53", "owner": "gislicious", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076272389264249, "text": "thoughts and prayers to all those affected", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:57:52", "owner": "stephenc911", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058352750271448, "text": "Construction negligencies and authorities corruption failing in controlling materials, Construction, fire prevention 😮😮. Similar case in Spain 2 years ago. 😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:57:42", "owner": "danirojo51", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18415436230191408, "text": "💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:57:41", "owner": "vicky_wwy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104469478656522, "text": "Rest in peace🙏😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:57:34", "owner": "esmee.sy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031409252737565, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:57:05", "owner": "destiny__hjk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184894813342266, "text": "Those fire hoses seem woefully inadequate...", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:57:03", "owner": "_i_am_j_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998180280699050, "text": "OMG...😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:57:02", "owner": "e_hychoi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974585649950240, "text": "🙏🙏🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:57:00", "owner": "_.tnus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051704834345904, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:56:47", "owner": "mimijan0203", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065230394148524, "text": "To me it looks like they wanted to get rid of these old buildings, but feel free to convince me of other stories.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:56:45", "owner": "itsmyworldtour", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18069297518089187, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:56:37", "owner": "tc.emy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967246533991953, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:56:30", "owner": "honeypuff____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18495572023077864, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:56:29", "owner": "fatmabulutacik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058183862281951, "text": "ㅠㅠㅠㅠㅠㅠㅠㅠㅠ", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:56:19", "owner": "allhappyksy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987105330909816, "text": "Heartbreaking 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:55:46", "owner": "mj_feijai55", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103990306644553, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:55:31", "owner": "icewolf_su", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18410152576143255, "text": "до верхней части не достаёт вода", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:55:25", "owner": "bake20202r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053133257338906, "text": "😢🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:55:21", "owner": "ayrtnsena", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128243911497482, "text": "🙏😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:54:56", "owner": "8maxo8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120204430480761, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:54:56", "owner": "zainudinnee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882340453307782, "text": "Как блин все 4 то?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:54:48", "owner": "etheralgreen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078689422900378, "text": "天佑香港", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:54:30", "owner": "yyah_oqw1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041369315502771, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:54:29", "owner": "dimasadichandra12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088160147057079, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T0