": 0}, {"id": 18057666113299355, "text": "😭💔🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:43:38", "owner": "felicia.tan8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991362846730672, "text": "😢🙏RIP", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:43:38", "owner": "kateupwithwealth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089150461757812, "text": "🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:43:26", "owner": "anna.yau.7545", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397114360132003, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:43:19", "owner": "lenny2004620", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085449844835868, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:43:19", "owner": "god555.2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928026985151386, "text": "So sorry for what happened with the incident.. Isnt few days ago there is a simulation which involved a new high tech drone for fire extingusher..?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:43:17", "owner": "kuwapok", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17877106824440998, "text": "🙏🙏🙏😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:42:05", "owner": "unko.ali", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084980617992352, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:41:59", "owner": "justinccb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086066935955519, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:41:36", "owner": "amy.mak.96930", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112812895578273, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:41:29", "owner": "lulumi747", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847372159586118, "text": "還有低智商中國畜牲在PO中國現在都用無人機救火，暗諷香港這次災害搶救效率低🤷真是操他媽的畜牲", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:41:28", "owner": "manson1125", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054681584652992, "text": "💔💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:41:15", "owner": "nicoleeeee_hao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158815147405557, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:40:57", "owner": "paulaa.teske", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18128232250501391, "text": "😢💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:40:57", "owner": "xy_haha86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852127282590413, "text": "🙏🙏🙏😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:40:37", "owner": "turboracing21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127057237444764, "text": "😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:40: