tiya_gift", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905763973147453, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:37:58", "owner": "kurisusudesu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867522595490154, "text": "@justadad70", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:37:52", "owner": "alicekt2070", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18318228877218671, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:37:44", "owner": "5on5on", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086402998982754, "text": "😭😭😭 gods save them", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:37:41", "owner": "visothrangseyaun2023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119992153542609, "text": "Gedung itu sedang dalam perbaikan,dipasang bambu dan jaring hanya saja jaring yang dipakai tidak memenuhi standar jadi mudah terbakar", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:37:29", "owner": "dee.963871", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086807959804201, "text": "帝国的废墟象征", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:37:26", "owner": "nova.basa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051361553353034, "text": "Fake concrete not a good idea huh 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:37:06", "owner": "browncat1966", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084676715486840, "text": "@lin_d.ao_dam 이거봄? 말이되냐고…😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:36:49", "owner": "dyohii_", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18119680453544675, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:36:33", "owner": "tina_yamh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917790748085165, "text": "How did all the separate towers catch fire 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:36:29", "owner": "eric21066", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084428183046156, "text": "哈哈哈玻璃心真破防啊，我只是心痛这些死伤的人，你算什么东西", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:36:27", "owner": "dexterhyz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905421142142144, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:36:12", "owner": "nickyrowbottom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962478334006646, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:36:07", "owner": "muyoushinji", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905505187143076, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:35:50", "owner": "sharon_tsou_520", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302201281252506, "text": "真容易破防啊你", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:35:30", "owner": "dexterhyz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995165115847263, "text": "So sad", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:35:26", "owner": "sumiko_mochiko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021228251788658, "text": "💔💔 All the animals died", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:35:23", "owner": "sumiko_mochiko", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116468740561231, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:35:17", "owner": "yeungchiwang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081141725515845, "text": "Very sad", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:35:16", "owner": "nacioiggy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843922792612612, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:35:09", "owner": "jolene0223", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051292427346185, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:35:01", "owner": "polly_chou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940606825092028, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:34:36", "owner": "___.14h", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049323776399775, "text": "중국스럽다", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:34:27", "owner": "urban_victory", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937152364097411, "text": "😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:34:25", "owner": "thecalmboy12584", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998383332849978, "text": "🙏may the deceased rest in peace", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:34:02", "owner": "c.chihkai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066260315421687, "text": "Those high rise fire trucks are really impressive", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:33:58", "owner": "burnhardtt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112981453606591, "text": "😭😭🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:33:50", "owner": "tututu61266", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155980228407374, "text": "💔💔💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:33:49", "owner": "longxxoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046714601456172, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:33:48", "owner": "luaannie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099154174794274, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:33:20", "owner": "farida515", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105242194647203, "text": "Heartbreaking, hope the survivors get the support they need and thoughts are with the ones who lost their home, friends and families.🙏😭❤️😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:33:14", "owner": "campbellwu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028201154572595, "text": "#prayfortaipo", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:32:57", "owner": "wong78ayu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058927715278935, "text": "願上帝保佑🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:32:50", "owner": "republicofseoul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902657377314783, "text": "💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏Sending all my sympathy and prayers", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:32:39", "owner": "topangafairy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185322970345955, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:32:28", "owner": "mochalababy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851887456592111, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:32:15", "owner": "mochalababy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116030167499738, "text": "😭😭😭感謝所有捨命拯救生命的消防員🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻保佑不要再有任何傷亡🙏🏻保佑人同動物都平安🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:32:04", "owner": "8kobe88kobe8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902391520329323, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:31:56", "owner": "ininro__9_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987486672912437, "text": "the building is amazing, it's didn't collapse", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:31:51", "owner": "val140285", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936804450982250, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:31:43", "owner": "aikoxueee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885150604286362, "text": "I'm waiting also the 3months old baby,the employer and one Filipina helper if they survived coz the Filipina asking help they are in 13th floor,they can't go down because of fire,Hopefully they survived", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:31:36", "owner": "mgj0787", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872279347463670, "text": "😭😭💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:31:36", "owner": "aaronsuyalun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18375873160156752, "text": "ゲゲゲの🏢ろくでもないな………諸行無常の世の中………", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:31:31", "owner": "yiciyuanren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979423512948997, "text": "☹️☹️😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:31:28", "owner": "kamanllll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862470160460214, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:31:21", "owner": "crystal_plkiss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080542238140204, "text": "😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:31:11", "owner": "yu_han_0913", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949323481059776, "text": "Ужасно 😢😢😢😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:31:00", "owner": "malisphynx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074354462256275, "text": "like a giant barbecue scene 😨😨😨, may we always be given safety", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:30:50", "owner": "jengsithie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899918263343305, "text": "How the heck did it happen?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:30:43", "owner": "lordharleyofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093054053306393, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:30:38", "owner": "yr.o3ov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848885899603359, "text": "god bless, that’s all i gotta say🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:30:38", "owner": "austin.itsac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082229174279477, "text": "😢🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:30:29", "owner": "ching000story", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936624303978904, "text": "Poco espacio entre ellos, el efecto domino es  inevitable, no hay culpables, era inevitable que algo así sucediera tarde o temprano, en un incendio que empieza desde abajo es imposible escapar!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:30:10", "owner": "bego_alvarez_martinez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161628781396191, "text": "🙏🏻🫂😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:30:06", "owner": "phph914", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075049700006548, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:30:01", "owner": "mahizafeeby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18419980543118373, "text": "May everyone be strong and safe.🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:29:55", "owner": "yangsumei_chinesemasterkingdom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856841443562067, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:29:54", "owner": "big_bhoys_kitchen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541507354009926, "text": "😢😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:29:29", "owner": "ranikorerohi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992434305891032, "text": "💔 sending prayers", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:29:27", "owner": "manna.sthlm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860574193476664, "text": "Its horriffic. My condolences.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:29:24", "owner": "ksof_sk8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074773694218376, "text": "😭😭😭😭🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:29:19", "owner": "karadarbinyan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848981797573744, "text": "🙏…", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:29:17", "owner": "scottttie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916809202211830, "text": "It breaks my heart 💔😢💔😢💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:28:26", "owner": "mgj0787", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084832577104546, "text": "中国🇨🇳毒☠️共産党🇨🇳\nの崩壊の象徴", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:28:08", "owner": "minchangsanpu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056932610641049, "text": "希望不要有傷亡😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:28:05", "owner": "kiran_03519", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073413347033321, "text": "好難過", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:27:43", "owner": "helen6219", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865581322502316, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:27:39", "owner": "mrmajor67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089890534745051, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:27:36", "owner": "hsu9112001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902795059313124, "text": "ようやく鎮火？", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:27:25", "owner": "tanuki01463", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093805972846724, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:26:58", "owner": "simoviola100", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069090734094054, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:26:47", "owner": "fdrc_ka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087026684317939, "text": "水線不夠?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:26:46", "owner": "weijun2456", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060941078238190, "text": "CHINA", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:25:55", "owner": "huntingtoncp2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18419956732119038, "text": "阿彌陀佛", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:25:32", "owner": "chiuan939", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172108117372558, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:25:16", "owner": "xifu_happy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 1805173603435245