1-27T09:19:15", "owner": "kiukiukiutpie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931226011116540, "text": "This is FAKE, we all know buildings collapse when burnt even if it’s only the top, like in 9-11 remember?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:19:10", "owner": "davemikenow9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007485467816146, "text": "segera membaik hongkong🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:19:05", "owner": "hai_monnnnnnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076914583969680, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:19:00", "owner": "jazmi.n2093", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543343159047120, "text": "まさか未だに竹足場を使用していたとは驚きました(⁠-⁠_⁠-⁠;⁠)⁠・⁠・⁠・私が建築関係の仕事に就いた40年前から変わらんのですね(⁠☉⁠｡⁠☉⁠)⁠!今回の火事で被災された方の気持ちを案じますಥ⁠_⁠ಥ", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:18:52", "owner": "1963michiomi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073838318018373, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:18:44", "owner": "dannnnnniii76", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965853690841211, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:18:32", "owner": "andina_pardosi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320026798218396, "text": "🙏💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:17:48", "owner": "ttdddad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948440025931712, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:17:24", "owner": "dreifachmami1988", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543816097013212, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:17:14", "owner": "virginia.lai2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064439363566483, "text": "Worse then grenfell 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:17:04", "owner": "ian_fong7391", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067531094121808, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:16:57", "owner": "veralie_v2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865600984438113, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:16:54", "owner": "faint.poetry06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868079149418291, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:16:45", "owner": "wenxi_zyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865526059508565, "text": "😢😢😢💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:16:34", "owner": "amnamehmood.hk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096044506874702, "text": "🙏😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:16:25", "owner": "moonwen3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056931566641049, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:16:05", "owner": "victorskipip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087483331801351, "text": "願逝者安息🙏，傷者早日康復，一切平安", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:15:55", "owner": "chanshingtaipei", "likes": 194}, {"id": 17991385916899722, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔😭😭😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:15:37", "owner": "benyilmaz_ozlem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088524541940172, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:15:20", "owner": "lamhoiyan1207", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072899609048007, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:15:02", "owner": "mr_yazid91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082113971094491, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:14:53", "owner": "titimeluna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542491798054714, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:14:40", "owner": "jessica_lu52", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079581464326428, "text": "😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:14:37", "owner": "nuy_azizah93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073382768349841, "text": "OMG 3 buildings 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:14:16", "owner": "twtbtwwu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954467263010343, "text": "But they shouldve collapsed 2hrs later", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:14:06", "owner": "eve_skincare", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18494087245078079, "text": "蓋那麼高 消防設備也沒跟上 就只為了越高越多戶？這是要玩命？", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:14:04", "owner": "aries_4_12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18374739781157025, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:13:50", "owner": "xun.ll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099543043693357, "text": "💔💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:13:46", "owner": "luisathe_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003586613675322, "text": "💔💔💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:13:30", "owner": "luvariell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17998818338835191, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:13:30", "owner": "sustainpackpro_supply", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844648579618929, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:13:13", "owner": "realraspberryraccoon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901071328333559, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:12:39", "owner": "ririreyn22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962687265856350, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:12:35", "owner": "natnat442", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910703119255023, "text": "大家都平平安安的", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:12:33", "owner": "lihanyi_i", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074439509245210, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:12:21", "owner": "dchanxp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985687794874085, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:12:18", "owner": "maggiemanlaw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18178975843317893, "text": "Too many defaults in the maintenance of the residential complex. And of course the risk of living in a skyscraper", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:12:10", "owner": "cemal_edip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868233007418409, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:12:00", "owner": "doanklukahati", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025792466775294, "text": "위성발사를 밥먹듯이 날려 천궁을 운영하는 중국의 초라한 모습이 상상이 안간다. 이 시대에 초고층 건축공사에 대나무 비계로 짓는다니. 비용은 싸긴 싸것네.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:11:47", "owner": "calligraphy_carving_poem_photo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924591175188245, "text": "Pray for Hongkang 🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:11:46", "owner": "daisyleigh668", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991849470854951, "text": "The lowest bidder 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:11:43", "owner": "mercatus_germany", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105064144641108, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:11:13", "owner": "kawing_0912", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112715206595108, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:11:03", "owner": "sergeyzotov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870203038394069, "text": "How the hell does that happened!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:10:54", "owner": "presale_detail_realestate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101429893738643, "text": "💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:10:48", "owner": "kathia_hk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102854485735004, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:10:42", "owner": "non_93x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086917789969524, "text": "やっぱ香港も中国🇨🇳やね", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:10:12", "owner": "zado301", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095080081868039, "text": "😢😢💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:09:20", "owner": "nazatulazrin_kaknaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844966645607515, "text": "I've been living in Hong Kong for 13 years,this is the worst tragedy i ever seen.  I can't imagine how terrified people trap inside those buildings. The fire spread so fast it's almost like gasoline being poured there.  My heart breaks for the victims 💔 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:09:19", "owner": "andriyani_novi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866043883506413, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:09:13", "owner": "bellachan9059", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18503999779076192, "text": "how many people lose their lives in this accident the news from mainland may not be accurate", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:08:40", "owner": "ikun6732", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861743509538636, "text": "Rip to all who lost their life. Accountability is necessary.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:08:37", "owner": "carmel_kavanagh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946447659940477, "text": "They've been constructed with magic materials.  Had they been in New York they'd have collapsed in on their own foot print hours ago.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:08:16", "owner": "panemorfiart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961921275863451, "text": "香港人は居ない。中国人ばかり。", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:07:53", "owner": "heliopolitanennead", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983339214766358, "text": "OMG 💔😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:07:44", "owner": "danavajdova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097010557878355, "text": "Drones shots there are forbidden", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:07:43", "owner": "ulfwcom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887424334392258, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:07:35", "owner": "alvintan0518", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083114636011122, "text": "Heartbreaking 💔💔🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:07:32", "owner": "laurie_halvorsen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108497068720441, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:07:31", "owner": "triplesec", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985267956913754, "text": "天佑香港🇭🇰🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:07:08", "owner": "perfectams", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18177084583323244, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:07:02", "owner": "karenho2102", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065540075425133, "text": "😭😭😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:07:01", "owner": "ceciliayauyyc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867377536492650, "text": "Why would they even put the whole building with the net and that too all the blocks same time and flammable at that 55ppl and the 200 above still missing with 45 injured is heartbreaking 💔 all because of few ppls negligence", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:06:58", "owner": "the_untold_series", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882267943304891, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:06:40", "owner": "likecyndi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17988569099862786, "text": "南無阿彌陀佛…阿彌陀佛", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:06:36", "owner": "lushuhui48", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077007494191966, "text": "Grenfell Towers all over again! RIP dear departed souls😩😭🥺💔🕊️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:06:27", "owner": "thelma_theelmz_consultancy", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18153480355373500, "text": "@adriantidiah  sesudah", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:06:11", "owner": "shelly_pwt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18087170866813534, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:06:03", "owner": "sammiyu1126", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855067558529338, "text": "白帝城", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:05:59", "owner": "vittoriamoda_ingrosso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028042892568575, "text": "AI?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:05:37", "owner": "hidetoshi_koi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094870387875128, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:05:29", "owner": "gthouselove", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072519701200236, "text": "😮😮😢😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:04:57", "owner": "lrichtrova", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18174794347367873, "text": "ho lee fuk", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:04:53", "owner": "noamkonyn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18189755479341646, "text": "その後このビル解体するのかなー⁉️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:04:44", "owner": "kiyoichik.k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944323777076334, "text": "Why the feck would you have bamboo scaffolding with netting thats flamable??", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:04:22", "owner": "simplythebest2012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353773933167799, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:04:16", "owner": "rosalind6926", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073501418251794, "text": "3億燒成灰", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:04:15", "owner": "yiny2j", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546424402007322, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:04:04", "owner": "totoyv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303194989268837, "text": "深圳的消防车过去了吗", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:03:54", "owner": "nilsjie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087084164296612, "text": "How could everything burn???", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:03:39", "owner": "rosdhii_93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074410451198263, "text": "which city is this", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:03:34", "owner": "nmcjjjmg6681", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051975563360849, "text": "Finally it stopped", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:03:14", "owner": "mr.wuffles2022", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973021767809252, "text": "Geçmiş olsun Hong Kong 💔 Türkiye de yaşandı böyle bir facia ne kadar kötü olduğunu biliriz😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:03:05", "owner": "umranmergen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18336412930235042, "text": "Hearth broken 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:03:04", "owner": "veronicasorace", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082724390321975, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:03:01", "owner": "scarlett.koch170", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079991150329112, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:02:50", "owner": "yumei1066", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089557510767105, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢💔💔💔😭😭😭😭🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:02:30", "owner": "serkan18817", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071290106362298, "text": "Turut berduka cita untuk korban", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:02:29", "owner": "heru_nirv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161427487395253, "text": "😢The super scourge of corruption", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:02:24", "owner": "metaversepaci", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17941799862170972, "text": "Omg Hk ! 🥲", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:02:23", "owner": "schum678", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125569663506798, "text": "There is no need for maintenance in the old house. The wires are aging, the water pipes are aging, that is, the outside of the repair can't be used.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:02:12", "owner": "minaxiaoxian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18399914728127850, "text": "😫", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:02:11", "owner": "mike1113446666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919018456208677, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:01:52", "owner": "mrlucasyoung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052021595356514, "text": "希望少一些伤亡🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:01:43", "owner": "bh4aev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991166823886787, "text": "いかんね", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:01:31", "owner": "channel_fufufu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986135058750968, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:01:11", "owner": "jwjx333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062531390567101, "text": "고인의 명복을 빕니다 😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:00:41", "owner": "bagnohyeob88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042421118697619, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:00:23", "owner": "gassieswg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945849997074289, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:00:18", "owner": "casper_in.the.house", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051014243373116, "text": "Great job China 👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:00:17", "owner": "wrose10040", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066326786575976, "text": "This is so horrible 😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:00:07", "owner": "itsgail.notgale", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911537461254196, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:59:58", "owner": "jenny.c.penaloza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915882763232724, "text": "😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T0