m ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:54:00", "owner": "kareem_ahmed82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18330358876210288, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:53:57", "owner": "issytpc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908966122127590, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:53:57", "owner": "summerhot.88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059593085251977, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:53:55", "owner": "taikoooon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952719289046843, "text": "I live in Hong Kong I know it already", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:53:53", "owner": "circle_kong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368128765083591, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:53:48", "owner": "dora1388", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18490210174076616, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:53:34", "owner": "cherish_finden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889638580390594, "text": "Huge thks for every great efforts of volunteers, thks for all kindness of kindhearted people with Respect, all the Best to All 😎", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:53:24", "owner": "artlamlam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085670218823797, "text": "💔so sad 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:53:20", "owner": "sr_aes_1803_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084351416046859, "text": "😢😢😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:53:20", "owner": "sezineda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035895953735828, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:53:10", "owner": "kiki_zikzin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089633539938129, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:53:00", "owner": "ting__agnes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076960901187332, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:52:39", "owner": "smolley23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021923069603987, "text": "😭😭😭😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:52:33", "owner": "bobo_wong1213", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031609463732423, "text": "Heart broken 💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:52:09", "owner": "amtheonlyone1213", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397873276133820, "text": "🥲🥲🥲🥲🥲", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:52:04", "owner": "jessica0107rb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068060141572876, "text": "😢😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:51:52", "owner": "iamcamelliaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061233470232747, "text": "Why not with drones", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:51:38", "owner": "jim_jules_ny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026472860775442, "text": "May God grant strength and resilience to those rebuilding their lives after this tragedy. May they find the courage to move forward and the support they need to recover. Aamiin 🙏🏻 😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:51:33", "owner": "travelsneats_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18399786361120787, "text": "😢😢🫣😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:51:32", "owner": "edda_030_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856688668564010, "text": "Bs bnyk bener bgtu yg k bakarannya😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:51:03", "owner": "tinadwiky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080653874132410, "text": "Hold up all those buildings burn up something fishy about this 🤔🫢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:51:02", "owner": "cl9_andi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030114542553506, "text": "Those are the buildings that are been scamming buyers ..the buyers lived in their unfinished homes they ended up as victim twice once from the scam and the fire 😓", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:50:46", "owner": "moe_za84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160737052403540, "text": "室内没有消防栓吗？", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:50:36", "owner": "berrianing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105653941724562, "text": "😭😭😭🙏🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:50:30", "owner": "yvonne.van.westerop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099516277689440, "text": "😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:50:15", "owner": "luise.mota", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857538760503062, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:50:02", "owner": "leong9527", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383626345198646, "text": "This is why i live on the 3rd floor", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:49:46", "owner": "oooheddie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18272591176303487, "text": "🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:49:20", "owner": "vanesssche", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100037932759669, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:49:09", "owner": "g_annphotography", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18351960997205598, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:48:51", "owner": "viincent17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098951608695155, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:48:29", "owner": "raz_alghul_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057364013308147, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:48:26", "owner": "helenaaa.hrx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872432092463827, "text": "chắc xương hoá tro tàn luôn rồi mất😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:48:10", "owner": "chupapi.277", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855583027522803, "text": "Alhamdulillah sdh padam 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:48:08", "owner": "joy.saam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969185391825321, "text": "😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:48:05", "owner": "gabbysabby4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036628340711717, "text": "😢🙏🏻🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:47:41", "owner": "spicy.77777", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17993819216710828, "text": "Che terribile disastro 😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:47:38", "owner": "luisagiacomoni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916476517230276, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:47:28", "owner": "olazaq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900505255323299, "text": "😢😢😢😢💔💔天佑香港", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:47:27", "owner": "phyllishanshan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932598691114853, "text": "Were people living in these apartments or it was a new construction??", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:47:22", "owner": "wuomwuomk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940767031095126, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:47:18", "owner": "laiselenselen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096077143671571, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:47:01", "owner": "mas_hd_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905247502277868, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:46:58", "owner": "aa550066", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100524964825123, "text": "Wonder about how insurance company gonna to compensate", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:46:44", "owner": "tengtengteng_liting", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965831601996103, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:46:26", "owner": "electronic_park.official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302148493250274, "text": "Hopefully this tragedy did not happen during the storms that ravaged beautiful Hong Kong 🇭🇰 half of the place would have burned 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:46:19", "owner": "vossoughhassan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100272946757068, "text": "💔🙏 so terrible 💔.. 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:46:04", "owner": "iamfierce.bossmyx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929385232119749, "text": "禁飛wo", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:46:04", "owner": "_h.t.k_uen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063420869562261, "text": "好似空襲完，刧後餘生😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:46:02", "owner": "safety.rabbit", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17969562845972658, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:46:01", "owner": "cat_ng_kung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18316893934220960, "text": "Thank god the building not collapse.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:45:48", "owner": "azamiruddin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880060693428464, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:45:42", "owner": "sunita_utt85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865638100503150, "text": "🙏🏻🙏🏻😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:45:31", "owner": "b__cwm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098847106695670, "text": "RIP", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:45:04", "owner": "little_wmelon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925102657173685, "text": "😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:44:46", "owner": "buenavista_mhayang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078303647467910, "text": "希望再無傷亡…💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:44:22", "owner": "hongchingmed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18197274517323308, "text": "May I know what Fire fighter do for 100 storey above property ?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:43:53", "owner": "sean1m_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894155824225269, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:43:42", "owner": "thinchicken_kenneth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945971917064187, "text": "💔 So sorry HKG  people, Miss you", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:43:32", "owner": "roby.g965", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847244164588069, "text": "平安🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:43:24", "owner": "jiajun7869", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060202394253561, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:43:23", "owner": "me_limbusakun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080895095276752, "text": "We are so sorry, our hearts are filled with sorrow💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:43:02", "owner": "marianne852", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109092226552100, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:43:00", "owner": "_mouzzhavie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929933248141514, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:42:57", "owner": "qiqi_yam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952953391031991, "text": "Omg", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:42:55", "owner": "phic_404", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158993479392319, "text": "💔💔💔😭😭😭🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:42:54", "owner": "buckbuckchu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987750015911936, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:42:54", "owner": "wsee.31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352094497202072, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:42:48", "owner": "lya_svr92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028685345563806, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:42:25", "owner": "organce.paris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014069870684426, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:42:24", "owner": "liliklilly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086406997958872, "text": "簡直係災難", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:42:23", "owner": "hellojp903", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064140434423644, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:42:18", "owner": "charmingxyz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927287464168050, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:42:03", "owner": "albygraphy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18375998191152149, "text": "ㅠㅠ 인명피해 많이 나질 않으시길요", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:41:54", "owner": "gjslove0226", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924651874080838, "text": "Sending prayers 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:41:39", "owner": "sanchitabanerjee28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906784669273033, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:41:38", "owner": "sabgiul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18200064565321403, "text": "Ya Allah😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:41:37", "owner": "tanpapostingan2022", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305047525282694, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:41:30", "owner": "juan2mani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080260946156619, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:41:27", "owner": "alice_o4o1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095791852656413, "text": "😢🙏pray for hk", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:41:26", "owner": "wpyjoys", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17901113805322811, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:41:23", "owner": "sagar_wangayo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885016081288804, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:40:46", "owner": "perrinsaigon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976662801939197, "text": "Meu Deus que horror 😰😰😰🇵🇹🇵🇹🇵🇹", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:40:36", "owner": "ganopa.12354", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070921628583920, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:40:34", "owner": "gaga_ting", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059418320633940, "text": "How about calling Mr Hui Kayan to the scene ? The company that did restoration work being one of his shadow companies 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:40:26", "owner": "vossoughhassan", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18089504026767255, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏pray for those residents", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:40:18", "owner": "claudigraphy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902596819166870, "text": "中国に併合されたら､こうなる見本…", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:40:06", "owner": "ka.zu4784", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142870495401390, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:39:46", "owner": "lena_vylegzhanina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904681144151155, "text": "为什么要用竹架子和易燃网？", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:39:44", "owner": "dexterhyz", "likes": 29}, {"id": 17857657497559565, "text": "嘩", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:39:37", "owner": "wincyychan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951880981022525, "text": "Why do they build houses like that its a killer trap, horrifying. Rip those who didn't survive 😪 💔 😢 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:39:30", "owner": "anita._.andersson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059260502560483, "text": "希望天父能安慰🫂他們🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:39:29", "owner": "pedroli0806", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18060462578632720, "text": "😢😢🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:39:25", "owner": "ilovechingching", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546354703049954, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:39:17", "owner": "highamall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097350709662391, "text": "😭….", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:39:09", "owner": "tungtungtung8888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969121176987678, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:38:44", "owner": "xiang_11_21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879527875329331, "text": "😢🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:38:36", "owner": "wankywoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085225277009670, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:38:30", "owner": "eatsplorations", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18069173888595660, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:38:29", "owner": "yosselin66_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918411895214379, "text": "The tragedy 🙏💔😭 that has stricken Hong Kong 🇭🇰 the painful loss of life , the number of front line fire fighters who lost their lives, the number of great Hong Kong people who have lost their lives and all their possessions , it’s about time to realize that buildings shouldn’t be build so close to one another, on the other hand China 🇨🇳 has built the best firefighting amphibious aircraft the “Kunlong” AG600 project started in 90’s and finally ready. The very best according to competitors like Kawasaki, Bombardier, Beriev, etc why it has not been used ? The other aspect of the tragedy is to have allowed companies like Evergrande to build below standard housing ., in fact this company has also worked a lot in Iran 🇮🇷 and we should be worried 😟 next , all my prayers go for the victims of this unbearable tragedy🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:37:52", "owner": "vossoughhassan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081253358330030, "text": "Who uses bamboo for the high tower maintenance anyway..💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:37:21", "owner": "rayconic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18153320482417175, "text": "🕯️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:37:18", "owner": "wangzaizouzou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908970403127867, "text": "In en in triest😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:37:18", "owner": "machbos0802", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054900905663728, "text": "平安🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:37:17", "owner": "cc92180", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091996633902057, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:37:11", "owner": "yuoloveyou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064221083449086, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:36:47", "owner": "huevicky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085071716097564, "text": "💔😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:36:44", "owner": "silwal_sanju09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056391107640163, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:36:32", "owner": "yas_ishak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917579161234694, "text": "God intervene 🙏 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:36:24", "owner": "chtel.official", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18430879711108600, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:36:21", "owner": "april23jassmut", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956351062031740, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:36:17", "owner": "liii.yau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931005925131018, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:36:17", "owner": "magelangcedele", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987259317746895, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:36:10", "owner": "qatar_traveler_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17990174279891295, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:36:07", "owner": "ins_zhangzi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18341244511229809, "text": "香港的消防系统不行啊！无人机  消防炮都没有，这点火都烧了这么久！灭火飞机没有吗？", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:36:03", "owner": "bcntcmsalud", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303431863251460, "text": "可怜啊！", "created_at": "2025-11-27T08:36:03", "owner": "sand.oh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072923930210237, "text": "The bamboo netting i