 {"id": 17845795761615486, "text": "💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:47:45", "owner": "sssueyip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107563213618641, "text": "😢😢😢 삼가 고인의 명복을 빕니다", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:47:36", "owner": "gimyeongdo24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065792423618332, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:47:18", "owner": "sumsuiyiu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17852248995591204, "text": "😰😥😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:47:16", "owner": "fionnn0105", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876744088352726, "text": "Praying  for  those  affected, 😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:47:07", "owner": "melzie_winera", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978966570933594, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:47:03", "owner": "shinwen_chou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352973254160097, "text": "好難過…", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:46:52", "owner": "yauyau1112", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988227927906415, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:46:48", "owner": "btf.mind.ranran", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18399300064193807, "text": "😭😭💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:46:37", "owner": "jacqueline_barbajano", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046851245682341, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:46:18", "owner": "nomaan.a47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941211306960885, "text": "💔🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:46:16", "owner": "xxshinchan__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073236404252710, "text": "💔💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:46:07", "owner": "shirleybrueck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046733090681068, "text": "为中国香港人民加油，希望一切安好", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:45:49", "owner": "lampar_industrial_ventilator", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18538302382062245, "text": "💔😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:45:41", "owner": "aka_messy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18317757187217223, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:45:37", "owner": "ptrpisovska", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931828702134812, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:45:37", "owner": "suisinnstephy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982444158924085, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:44:39", "owner": "hwalisawu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079536458168183, "text": "💔😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:44:20", "owner": "amazing_janelo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057628868307384, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:44:13", "owner": "carolineyuanyi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887847757392079, "text": "no China no chinese", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:43:35", "owner": "_youuuuu_shin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18505488529068951, "text": "😢😢😢💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:42:57", "owner": "sanka.ya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058778918271853, "text": "離譜！燒成咁😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:42:38", "owner": "ivy_fwk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904288000295112, "text": "This terrible fire destroyed everything. Wish the survivors good luck.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:42:37", "owner": "jacky.chan.77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098234101833566, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:42:16", "owner": "linhtranvtv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876177934441847, "text": "too crazy - sending prayers to hk 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:42:07", "owner": "konaction", "likes": 211}, {"id": 17920044945197441, "text": "🙏😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:42:06", "owner": "longmaripu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088961125941717, "text": "阿彌陀佛~🙏🙏🙏阿彌陀佛~🙏🙏🙏阿彌陀佛~🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:42:02", "owner": "lekyyokyyo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888597784263268, "text": "I’m sorry, I’m so lost. All of the buildings were residentially apartment ? or still in construction. How the fire spread easily", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:41:55", "owner": "a_duui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18246444763291490, "text": "🫂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:41:54", "owner": "thereeesaaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986831679872902, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:41:39", "owner": "terlei_403", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18395076496131498, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:41:13", "owner": "eva_sun_2.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546506821009301, "text": "God bless hk🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:41:11", "owner": "chuyingfungfung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855383683570448, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:41:04", "owner": "aurelia__li", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005599304668915, "text": "R.I.P🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:40:52", "owner": "pandaaaa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886677751392977, "text": "願逝者安息🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:40:37", "owner": "yenting0218", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990817128902618, "text": "🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:40:28", "owner": "kriskristinyiu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876750607442573, "text": "Burning as if a live crementorium ever built in China Hong Kong with many innocents perished unnaturally due to administrative failure by Hong Kong SAR authority. Someone desperately needed to be held accountable lest repeated incidents may occur uncontrollably.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:40:18", "owner": "psalm3745", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889525441384526, "text": "怎么这个年代了还用着竹材质的架🤦🏻🤦🏻🤦🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:39:59", "owner": "hanzsaw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954325345020413, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:39:45", "owner": "elif20031907", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18189979471338119, "text": "It's clearly seen, they burn it intentionally 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:39:35", "owner": "parr.ram", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889437376385917, "text": "Oh my God! i have memories there in 2018. Sending prayers for hongkong 😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:39:33", "owner": "febrina.valentina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18193192717326615, "text": "It really hurts behind this view how many lives lost and injured.🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:39:17", "owner": "yang_lin.78.fung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083736100863109, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:38:41", "owner": "iamlam_ly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016600916796889, "text": "Apparently home to over 4,000 people.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:38:29", "owner": "alvincheahkc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18388863559182674, "text": "So tragic", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:37:11", "owner": "joooooooooooo64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337110187226446, "text": "Ho Lee Fook", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:36:53", "owner": "jakebskr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152425153419901, "text": "돈없어서 다행이다 돈있으면 홍콩에 가서 저런곳 살았을텐데", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:36:50", "owner": "moonjoon03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121235545533265, "text": "😢💪🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:36:44", "owner": "angieshan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102703603735944, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:36:40", "owner": "tini_iqq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119272540532044, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:36:02", "owner": "carmeninfrance", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077002565183158, "text": "I cannot believe this is happening in Hong Kong.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:35:49", "owner": "sumyuklo919", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847817986582142, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:35:38", "owner": "joe.mok.5686", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920655772194996, "text": "越睇越傷心😢希望平安渡過❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:35:00", "owner": "waisyccc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885274015403065, "text": "This is straight out of a movie. What a nightmare!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:34:53", "owner": "akutaknak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874905418447851, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:34:39", "owner": "hruaii_i", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860577088545460, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:34:33", "owner": "hruaii_i", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088646191975571, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:34:28", "owner": "a403296781", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093504106853333, "text": "💔💔💔😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:33:41", "owner": "cheow.l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081567449036975, "text": "Pray for Hongkong 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:33:34", "owner": "miley0706", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062590061632995, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:32:55", "owner": "jenn.mint", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132103408492652, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:32:28", "owner": "sky_so_bear", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104437294638692, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:32:21", "owner": "yatsunfoodmart", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067466453111404, "text": "How did this happened?? All the buildings burned down at once. Strange 🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:32:17", "owner": "chauhan_utk_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113086075574002, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:32:14", "owner": "sinsinlee132", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18385415803145409, "text": "素晴らしい！\n中国クオリティwww", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:31:56", "owner": "nyan.kororin25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858618385556728, "text": "Condolences to the family that lost their loved ones and prayers for the victims that are injured, may they get well soon. 為香港祈禱 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:31:47", "owner": "hajzeee", "likes": 100}, {"id": 18024917384781493, "text": "💔🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:31:10", "owner": "zkwone13", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18074524913014009, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:31:06", "owner": "18_ners", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883278325411995, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:31:05", "owner": "cwcc2024126", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947218476938403, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:30:34", "owner": "y_a_n__n_a_y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842193709626568, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:30:18", "owner": "funfunbella", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18416073940186470, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:30:17", "owner": "cc128hy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101976439665356, "text": "😰😰😰😰💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:30:06", "owner": "kamiya_kaoro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068955848372869, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:29:33", "owner": "iamvkvk_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305843788301873, "text": "唔好再賴竹棚🙏燒成晚都無變黑🙏竹棚係非物質遺產🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:29:16", "owner": "_22.tti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978279780948652, "text": "Even to evacuate or doing searching after the fire is very very dangerous, keep safe firefighters 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:28:21", "owner": "carinnalesmana", "likes": 189}, {"id": 18049495922690711, "text": "🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:28:03", "owner": "kaching_kct", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974979108950527, "text": "🙏🙏🙏😭💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:27:56", "owner": "clarangw02", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847414333584161, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:27:52", "owner": "kasahks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854174500578192, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:27:40", "owner": "andersenmariannehk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089976284505526, "text": "😭💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:27:04", "owner": "cccageblue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18384937585196475, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:26:59", "owner": "yan08_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874674556450067, "text": "Bamboo", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:26:54", "owner": "aes.ric", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064023320169300, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:25:29", "owner": "radehaap9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067792949118113, "text": "😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:25:25", "owner": "oliwvair", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057831800640667, "text": "願死者早日安息..願傷者早日康復🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:25:24", "owner": "chiwahshek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18373551340152730, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:25:16", "owner": "sarawang1223", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18202502164316508, "text": "삼가 고인의 명복을 빕니다.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:25:11", "owner": "jigjag7777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893243968362183, "text": "依家變成凶宅啦😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:25:11", "owner": "kelvinleung.l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18339354136234395, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:23:58", "owner": "sigal_sandton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066715487626428, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:23:55", "owner": "livivian_u03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858463831556559, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:23:45", "owner": "ameliatang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094864612881593, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:23:06", "owner": "aum.yongyut", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926346103169269, "text": "고층건물 화재의 위험성", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:23:01", "owner": "slowrunine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865055992511787, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:23:01", "owner": "enfill.leung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853494349581302, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:22:59", "owner": "gavin_photo6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976951746947309, "text": "😭😭😭 My heartfelt condolences go out to the victims and their families.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:22:49", "owner": "motomotomon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932842393111855, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:22:33", "owner": "elin.sofiani.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007339166657925, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:22:22", "owner": "deliaccx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090621304820874, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:22:04", "owner": "toby_ch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156771148405688, "text": "🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:21:59", "owner": "tangkm64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934703203101368, "text": "好可怕💔天佑香港🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:21:55", "owner": "zhusming831", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087266008989625, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:21:39", "owner": "yanxueer_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083189753036378, "text": "😢🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:21:34", "owner": "may_mamaday", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106083010643401, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:21:10", "owner": "victoria202209", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094425154886078, "text": "pray for HongKong🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:21:09", "owner": "turtle.5517617", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109771936613353, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:20:55", "owner": "htar_thaint_lwin_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115895383566787, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:20:37", "owner": "abaloswarlyn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864179080530659, "text": "🤦🏼‍♂️🫂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:20:32", "owner": "chakcs_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059596259268128, "text": "🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:20:31", "owner": "teris.tsai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098335528756406, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:20:00", "owner": "tangkalai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338481760235111, "text": "RIP to those who perished. Prayers for those alive and kudos to the brave firefighters who did what they can with so little 🙏🙏💪💪", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:19:31", "owner": "vancelow2223", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085886411082802, "text": "😭😭😭 天佑香港🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:19:31", "owner": "minli8816", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112050871582320, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:19:29", "owner": "elbilam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036922943711673, "text": "What next", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:19:27", "owner": "raj12227.fit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047795282450777, "text": "😭💔🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:19:18", "owner": "tomewing11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891491950242951, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:19:09", "owner": "sananaz1955", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952804591044414, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:18:34", "owner": "diknew1982", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902795761163729, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:18:32", "owner": "diknew1982", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973278987808920, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:18:10", "owner": "guevarastellarosalia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853254775580879, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:17:47", "owner": "angdonor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539254168013477, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:17:09", "owner": "tietouz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918195649085030, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢💪🏻🙏🏻🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:17:01", "owner": "guylaw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986781642876992, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:16:02", "owner": "yollymea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083042963032958, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:16:01", "owner": "melissa_nch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078453908157868, "text": "💔💔💔🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:15:49", "owner": "m0n4p3n9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094906990879681, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:15:32", "owner": "justinlaw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155515630411215, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:15:05", "owner": "deliberate_center", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988719699858272, "text": "If there really is a specific culprit personally responsible for this mass tragedy, he should be brought to the mainland and shot.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:14:00", "owner": "zongzonx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876255115445676, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:14:00", "owner": "bellabellabibi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18018557546617276, "text": "They would have need the mega fire drones introduced by mainland China 😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:13:54", "owner": "naisrzk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086994655803850, "text": "Pray for Hongkong 😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:13:38", "owner": "xab1boo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931085017011682, "text": "Pray for them", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:13:08", "owner": "richardtype", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948850216061652, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:12:54", "owner": "knb_kloset", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965804673842321, "text": "😮😮😮😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:12:52", "owner": "monkey2268", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088810667496512, "text": "Hopes well🥺🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:12:49", "owner": "owenyoggh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073568327196608, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:12:45", "owner": "minisister_seoul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052523288649876, "text": "🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:12:04", "owner": "karin_616", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873010339460131, "text": "😢🙏🏻RIP", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:11:37", "owner": "joyce_ding", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926159881032201, "text": "😢😢😢🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:11:30", "owner": "stephaniee_moore", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905181652292272, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:11:12", "owner": "celina_chong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126447334503307, "text": "Ya Allah 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:10:59", "owner": "hellopipie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18423287746116290, "text": "😭😭😭🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:10:43", "owner": "wxxstarrr711", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039626963708586, "text": "Gosh… rip all…", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:10:31", "owner": "lin2ho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847304179587687, "text": "😢🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:10:17", "owner": "crazycatdriver", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099258052796795, "text": "RIP 🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:09:46", "owner": "alexiswong288", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985043448872594, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:09:20", "owner": "__riekzowen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18168068410344296, "text": "YaAllah mugo enek keajaiban hujan  masio 15 mnt😭😭😭😭🥹🥹💪🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:09:19", "owner": "anf_grosir_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885065629287617, "text": "相關負責人你睇下人哋間屋你睇下你自己收咗啲乜嘢錢？做嘢都唔係咁樣做呀圍牆全部都係好彩查到出嚟你係做緊啲乜嘢啫如果唔係個個真係唔知你喺度做緊乜喎錢就識收喎？", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:09:17", "owner": "regencychoi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321423205170445, "text": "So sad, you gotta stop using bamboo and netting!!!! That isn’t the first time.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:09:13", "owner": "yanfoodies", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099557971702947, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:08:32", "owner": "cicichan784", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18401063695132799, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:08:29", "owner": "3388boo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056710265317304, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:08:01", "owner": "kevin81choi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074187602195853, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:07:45", "owner": "sulinalink", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852570022589832, "text": "If one tower started the fire how did it reach to the other buildings?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:07:30", "owner": "simoninboston", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855097762529453, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:07:10", "owner": "mt_dik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18316113292217971, "text": "Innalillahi wa innailaihi rojiun", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:07:02", "owner": "daengnassa_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040543883503694, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:06:49", "owner": "missjuleanne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903479635312162, "text": "Pray for those missing relatives can unite 🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:06:42", "owner": "paulpaul1054", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940114480090018, "text": "🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:05:58", "owner": "happily.ever.after.22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079174609917964, "text": "🥺🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:05:46", "owner": "connie_chan008", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991084182882926, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:05:41", "owner": "luckyleqi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063913538182351, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:05:22", "owner": "dan_zhi_ao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033712913732924, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:05:09", "owner": "christynam9678", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18119698378550804, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:05:04", "owner": "leica_cafe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950542390050616, "text": "That just horrific 😢 RIP", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:05:03", "owner": "rasa_leon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847276009587292, "text": "RIP", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:04:58", "owner": "linkin_113", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18087917273149311, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:04:57", "owner": "_yu1002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091164631730981, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:04:49", "owner": "vanialeachan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931320022131246, "text": "China is so advanced and yet they still have bamboo scaffolding? How is that possible?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:04:43", "owner": "antonio_dias.antmusic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147900817434867, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:04:37", "owner": "9ra3w", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18306170209267040, "text": "My hopes and prayers are with all of the Hong Kong people and their families, heartbreaking to see these images,may God give you all strength you need ❤️❤️❤️❤️🙏🙏🙏🙏😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:04:14", "owner": "tonywaye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954312642906261, "text": "who did this omg", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:04:07", "owner": "joshuajoshua_dai", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17952500648981285, "text": "Sadness 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:04:06", "owner": "vitowong789", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048813260405809, "text": "Human and pets are missing 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:04:03", "owner": "czhtkaisser", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087771496812191, "text": "Where I’m from, new fancy development comes after arson", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:45:49", "owner": "heyitsmestacey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023686526595372, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:45:47", "owner": "szerowan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079851254516265, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:45:27", "owner": "yuniezalabella", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084207100856715, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:45:26", "owner": "nonatina_17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091571218932620, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:45:02", "owner": "dolphins_2412", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18399957553127112, "text": "😢😢🙏🏼🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:43:23", "owner": "aaudrey64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113533111513775, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:43:07", "owner": "as_mandyy", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17989348793909747, "text": "This is so sad... my thoughts and prayers to everyone affected by this tragedy.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:43:00", "owner": "craycrayrules", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091524862906146, "text": "都燒完了 水線才出來", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:42:39", "owner": "chiayuanhu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18411248779185269, "text": "Pray for hi", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:42:32", "owner": "luweig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065056841573596, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:42:14", "owner": "nehnineni_bubu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102947317679194, "text": "Pray for more survivors 🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:41:59", "owner": "3wing_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084149861010897, "text": "😢🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:41:50", "owner": "huang_fei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950253208044973, "text": "Ini apartment BLM jadi kan", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:41:46", "owner": "yanista80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852154375548142, "text": "希望香港可以取消竹子脚手架，或者至少立法不允许高于6层建筑施工使用竹子脚手架❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:41:22", "owner": "frankhayden72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930143605140036, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:41:10", "owner": "apple.mui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864624601528414, "text": "The surrounding or opposite blocks of homes can only watch in despair. 🥲RIP…", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:41:02", "owner": "sha_pphire", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368286046083063, "text": "How safe is Hong Kong?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:40:54", "owner": "unkieminkie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065061170453016, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:40:45", "owner": "ssang222", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105201952641593, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:40:33", "owner": "oh__monde", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023553572595892, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:40:23", "owner": "joycewong4782", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899927512182586, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:40:03", "owner": "yemoxx1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113092237585829, "text": "Please keep the focus on the construction company responsible and the government policies that led to this inferno.\n\nThere’s still a very long way to go, and Hong Kong really needs honest, fair international media coverage more than ever. 🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:39:15", "owner": "tsyssss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096342388828848, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:39:07", "owner": "dddddduncan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932736046106933, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:38:46", "owner": "donnalsc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114187228580080, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:38:36", "owner": "emzyogini", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859584163485980, "text": "R.i.p 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:38:36", "owner": "d_a_r_i_a_l_e_e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047003801448023, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:38:24", "owner": "vn_virginia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061793009562075, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:38:06", "owner": "dhvanii.dr", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18092687479912453, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:37:32", "owner": "carrina_pl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096066670865629, "text": "🙏🏼🙏🏼🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:36:58", "owner": "kaling00", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18396340045131241, "text": "Rip", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:36:35", "owner": "maston8176", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929202325145644, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:36:22", "owner": "kloe_e15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902264278301489, "text": "My condolences..., especially for 🇮🇩 migrant workers.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:36:11", "owner": "seiichi_am", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056229857641800, "text": "住咗幾廿年嘅屋 燒到咁⋯⋯⋯⋯", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:36:10", "owner": "_chin43", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867943963482283, "text": "🥹God bless all the victims", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:36:06", "owner": "my.azuki.bb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062568842199058, "text": "平安", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:35:44", "owner": "furkan_kara890", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18356077567163838, "text": "density of building is too high", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:35:40", "owner": "aqier5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075569522463999, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:35:24", "owner": "boinnie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145483057430616, "text": "🫂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:34:59", "owner": "anson6177", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064050110543878, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:34:35", "owner": "xudongquan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368056861085765, "text": "@gold.yun", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:34:23", "owner": "jeonghwan.park_0404", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120141193527039, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:34:08", "owner": "a.mlt_430", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058355363278251, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:34:04", "owner": "belle_wy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118274917489824, "text": "💔❤️‍🩹", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:34:02", "owner": "jadeyii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081317144119503, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:33:57", "owner": "maineso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066903218614571, "text": "This is absolutely madness. 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:33:05", "owner": "karyn_goh", "likes": 97}, {"id": 18101457841742595, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:33:04", "owner": "chammywan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863205730531205, "text": "Here's drone no fly zone", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:32:54", "owner": "ashi_roaming", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135744400467471, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:32:46", "owner": "liweihsu1113", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925427416177261, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:32:25", "owner": "aperturaceleste", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851857381553562, "text": "The maintenance contractor remains suspended for using substandard materials. Alert 🚨 bamboo sticks are not the main cause of this fire", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:32:21", "owner": "chochosh_", "likes": 456}, {"id": 17980449173936977, "text": "Max height of the fire trucks is clearly not enough for these old high rises. Hopefully HK government learns from this.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:31:44", "owner": "ionlystayinniceplaces", "likes": 618}, {"id": 18009290381652015, "text": "This so so sad 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:31:43", "owner": "miafan2929", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080483963139642, "text": "😥😥", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:31:00", "owner": "zun_z_zun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134884735482424, "text": "💔💔💔🙏🏼🙏🏼🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:30:56", "owner": "patrickluvyall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123635134534100, "text": "Pray for hongkong😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:30:46", "owner": "neinaandin", "likes": 3560}, {"id": 18089774846506128, "text": "God bless those victims involved", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:30:30", "owner": "coorra_cch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17894243109222381, "text": "希望香港同胞平安", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:30:19", "owner": "zbhm1219", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101340883738963, "text": "God bless all the victims 🙏🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:29:25", "owner": "mannnwaiiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115796104560992, "text": "First the temple fire..and now this complex ... 🤔🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:29:15", "owner": "sengskiiz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103727218732547, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:28:54", "owner": "3_denc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940131915962841, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:28:49", "owner": "artistic______________", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18131147923491796, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:28:48", "owner": "bubuthehamster_211", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099829933747813, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:28:21", "owner": "sityanv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079078027934725, "text": "😢 😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:28:02", "owner": "rodtlrqkqh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945954667004338, "text": "Prions Tous ensembles 🙏🙏🙏💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:27:49", "owner": "natkarlita", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883909384410591, "text": "😢🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:27:48", "owner": "vickypham9382", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099181543696678, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:27:39", "owner": "bonglizzie689", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301031527287872, "text": "Scary thing is, there are plenty of other housing blocks just like this with the green netting and styrofoam blocking the windows or some dipshit hanging off the scaffold have a cigarette breaking elsewhere in HK right now that’s literally another disaster waiting to happen", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:27:32", "owner": "_the.6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875292709444305, "text": "😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:27:20", "owner": "suding3876", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922858627048966, "text": "Heart wrenching 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:26:32", "owner": "anne.in.dreamland", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078205361154541, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:26:14", "owner": "carolynyin.counselling", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026180408773359, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:26:06", "owner": "lam.lam.7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038557274711111, "text": "Aaawww, So sad!!! 😭❤️😭❤️❤️ Pray for People in Hong Kong! Be safe..", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:25:59", "owner": "brian.bookish1985", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069407789579581, "text": "😢保佑", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:25:49", "owner": "claire212", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063356690396743, "text": "Omg😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:25:37", "owner": "alamelu_aloo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087737413946477, "text": "🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:25:36", "owner": "ffairy_001", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858220936557955, "text": "响屋企唔出街都可以有意外，o甘有哪個地方是安全...", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:25:26", "owner": "vlex.chan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086569435977305, "text": "😭🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:25:04", "owner": "candylaw5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083161454513806, "text": "🚭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:24:55", "owner": "boolad2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091652812900303, "text": "May everyone be safe from this terrible disaster.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:24:34", "owner": "jcw5210", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847477912609623, "text": "😢😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:24:05", "owner": "summerbut1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975928887794379, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:24:02", "owner": "zhl19961230", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994326270712509, "text": "💔🕊💔🕊💔🕊 my heart goes out to everyone who is going through this", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:23:59", "owner": "sash_abeyrathne_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888378394264112, "text": "It heart broken", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:23:50", "owner": "lingmonmon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18368581375083527, "text": "🕯🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:23:46", "owner": "an.ch.ki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010386122803785, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:23:15", "owner": "ares_hei.c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065182829618627, "text": "燒盡了，成塊威化餅咁😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:22:48", "owner": "vickyli_is_me", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054714245337136, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:22:45", "owner": "samcr777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18520088155064255, "text": "Wrapping 8 towers close to each other in flammable material was an incredible oversight.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:22:32", "owner": "tainan_old_town", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034431809737402, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:21:23", "owner": "kkc_lok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158429545401075, "text": "Geez, why don’t they using helicopters for put down the fires? Rip for all the victims", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:20:51", "owner": "bruce_lucky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099204301793845, "text": "😞", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:20:49", "owner": "v01425811", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879477298429688, "text": "💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:20:43", "owner": "cleoroyalclub", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113524468575955, "text": "🙏🏻🙏🏻天佑住果度既所有人同消防員", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:20:18", "owner": "jasminelili_2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062072399443372, "text": "RIP🕯️愿香港平安…", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:19:54", "owner": "idisvictor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049607471391495, "text": "Bro went out with his drone looking to make content from peoples tragedy 🤮 have some respect some things don’t need to be filmed for likes", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:18:07", "owner": "saupei.hk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063051554633047, "text": "🙏🏻🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:17:44", "owner": "anne_vichuda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095327884677997, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:17:38", "owner": "nabibaeee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067368731425851, "text": "D蝗蟲怪竹棚燒著，啲竹棚重係好地地係外牆", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:17:25", "owner": "lonelyisland7420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027743987771195, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:16:22", "owner": "angel880615", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088132186946092, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:16:10", "owner": "patrickfrlee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090113675308603, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:16:01", "owner": "het_is_allemaal_wat_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864294493527768, "text": "Omg, my heart is broken", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:15:52", "owner": "sayakang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088432796491904, "text": "真的要注意安全問題，生命無價", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:15:43", "owner": "dxbdlc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18413587708137282, "text": "一場人為的悲劇🙏🏻💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:15:33", "owner": "lwmt.47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930000028015262, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:15:25", "owner": "_lktt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943918516082969, "text": "💔😢🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:14:26", "owner": "leekingha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077093630221367, "text": "天氣好嗨乾燥😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:14:22", "owner": "q3101256290", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864324733522364, "text": "So sad heart breaking 💔 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:14:15", "owner": "indaadizas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135454426473975, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:13:48", "owner": "loki_enigma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915444964235426, "text": "票投 #民建聯 全家都玩完", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:13:46", "owner": "milky_poko_peko.jrt", "likes": 107}, {"id": 18089983718498867, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:13:15", "owner": "amily.diary", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100166092690725, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:13:11", "owner": "pelleperper", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982270620770403, "text": "😢🙏❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:12:38", "owner": "miguelsuarez.design", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085400777064564, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:12:29", "owner": "stacieccc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054883319325351, "text": "点解会敢？😢几座一起烧😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:11:35", "owner": "weipingren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965760831995818, "text": "Thanks. Austin", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:11:13", "owner": "narrative1983", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075173369336818, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:10:17", "owner": "amyxavier3866", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18428457352105202, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:10:16", "owner": "adayiuyiu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063956459530620, "text": "Many casualties", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:09:35", "owner": "jimmylau138", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962402292990993, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:09:15", "owner": "__swcc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878572546431822, "text": "啲水….", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:09:10", "owner": "philip_yau67", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145391968433661, "text": "😢😢😢please bless", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:09:06", "owner": "alil_s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965368932841355, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:08:51", "owner": "yikkie328", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18306309991268155, "text": "超高大樓的防火間距不夠", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:08:36", "owner": "sanav888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17959714530007494, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:08:29", "owner": "maggiel1024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134876107477843, "text": "燒咗咁耐 入面啲鋼筋結構變晒型\n唔重建都唔得", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:07:57", "owner": "00vigers00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882216976304571, "text": "World disasters everywhere", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:07:52", "owner": "rushanjayaratne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367440220089140, "text": "Did they all stay inside the building??", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:07:19", "owner": "chloe.miffy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081951527327565, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:07:06", "owner": "asmile128", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059179415278061, "text": "Corrupted government and strata", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:07:01", "owner": "patk9896", "likes": 291}, {"id": 17845027323604776, "text": "要驗過結構再做返維修先住得，有撚排搞😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:07:00", "owner": "camposy04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059779424551418, "text": "This is crazy", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:06:43", "owner": "eucflow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543951721012044, "text": "ขอเป็นกำลังใจให้ชาวฮ่องกงนะคะ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:06:39", "owner": "kckc2509", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18439747972100820, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:05:34", "owner": "kuku741257", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099816532694534, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:05:23", "owner": "nei_jeonarmy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081582419471354, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:05:19", "owner": "christa_ta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133853401472568, "text": "😢😢😢🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:04:09", "owner": "lilieunis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165287185382822, "text": "消え始めたか！", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:04:03", "owner": "shinkaedefuuka", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085934950982323, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:03:42", "owner": "yannylam_ellie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019954499788647, "text": "Most of the scaffolding stays strong and intact. The external of the building looks fine after the fire with the help of the fire fighter. From my assessment, the safety netting is the main causes of the external fire. That is how all the surrounding buildings with safety netting catch the fire quickly. Concrete buildings do not burn at such a speed.  What you see into all the videos are the safety netting in flames. Battery charging is likely the main starting cause of the fire in today's situation. Too bad all the buildings with netting are being burnt. Not sure why some video with people screaming why no alarm or sprinkle system? The burnt buildings are all residential buildings!  Unless it is an exclusive private building for the affordable. Commercial and industrial buildings will most likely have it as it is required by the insurance company or governing authorities to have it.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:03:41", "owner": "tonychia2020", "likes": 108}, {"id": 18027532172569812, "text": "@jnncpy", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:02:45", "owner": "f_jover", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065118053432338, "text": "💧", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:02:38", "owner": "9.18km", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057727442292729, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:01:52", "owner": "vanda_0125", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010368659804806, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:01:10", "owner": "silence.turtle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18163440121380705, "text": "The japs evil doing", "created_at": "2025-11-27T06:01:04", "owner": "honcai_lam_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18311646307247346, "text": "Praying for everyone. It's so painful to watch can't imagine how much all suffered. 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:59:20", "owner": "seoulfulhobitha7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068826092090390, "text": "🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:59:17", "owner": "carman8516", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083530625049104, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:59:14", "owner": "barbaraleeyt19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142332976458618, "text": "😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:59:02", "owner": "xegx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983368806767057, "text": "🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:58:54", "owner": "leungclark", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18380044060151514, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:58:07", "owner": "fonzzie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540178132048457, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:57:15", "owner": "chriswu63", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109681699622660, "text": "Heart broken💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:56:47", "owner": "mcgrady0119", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18292636450285680, "text": "😢Oh no", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:56:44", "owner": "ker.l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099793639745796, "text": "😢😢😭😭😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:56:32", "owner": "jenniferliyanii_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18126105679454629, "text": "🙏🏻😔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:56:13", "owner": "yanlaiiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064693403176243, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:56:08", "owner": "lii_a10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095052091851579, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:54:15", "owner": "robert_burce", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858054178557913, "text": "How how how ? This is beyond sad", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:53:51", "owner": "blast_chiller_cj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852092404592638, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:53:20", "owner": "smart0810", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922973254187794, "text": "燒到咁好心酸", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:53:17", "owner": "stevfunzhou", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18109500913536304, "text": "❤️‍🩹❤️‍🩹❤️‍🩹❤️‍🩹", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:52:49", "owner": "tony_bernarthio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047017082463294, "text": "失聯人士應該唔得，真的燒通頂！我真的睡不著！", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:52:15", "owner": "fettecat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070790519070715, "text": "🙏🏾", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:51:51", "owner": "msooo0326", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539586910042059, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:51:42", "owner": "mbymargaret62", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063321716536548, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:51:40", "owner": "jtayphoto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879223093430047, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:51:30", "owner": "yanyanc922", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138214867476005, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:50:27", "owner": "tomwong88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18170797087372936, "text": "😒😒😒😒😒😒💔💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:48:36", "owner": "silent1305", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089634280746488, "text": "RIP", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:48:31", "owner": "janet.lam.104", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100344931773607, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:48:09", "owner": "cher2y97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102627289604586, "text": "Praying for our place and those affected 😢🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T0