18090881953935661, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:38:46", "owner": "chi_kaa66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082682618031371, "text": "😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:38:09", "owner": "mmaann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032854340733687, "text": "We lost afc cup..now we fuk d…", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:37:18", "owner": "lyannazul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093513859912662, "text": "😢😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:36:14", "owner": "cherry_in_hongkong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086924827826107, "text": "😢🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:35:54", "owner": "immimiwang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059819945249053, "text": "🙏🙏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:35:43", "owner": "kakingyuen7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18367279984156757, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:35:35", "owner": "hannaa_lam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902763082167917, "text": "That’s why smoking should be banned in working places 😡", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:35:19", "owner": "kentech.consulting", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926932315176405, "text": "😭💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:34:53", "owner": "kaman1022", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397384609122910, "text": "Speechless😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:34:07", "owner": "daagzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986815329865594, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:34:04", "owner": "louisetyan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112731838581755, "text": "🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:33:52", "owner": "jacnikimitch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143457919451399, "text": "🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:33:28", "owner": "_ssuen_suen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901186351326585, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:33:23", "owner": "yoga_withvenus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926142775169177, "text": "人為慘劇，徹查緝兇！", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:31:48", "owner": "yam.cheung.5205", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011731184805588, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:30:58", "owner": "haivan_md77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17919644304067176, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:30:02", "owner": "lamtruongngocquynh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18383621611198134, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:27:30", "owner": "mswendy_hkg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016378319623106, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:27:19", "owner": "aliluya321", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072960050360559, "text": "😥🥺😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:26:10", "owner": "ngsiuhung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927539029160020, "text": "It's unbelievable that they usebamboo tree for making.their work frame. It can break or cause fire like this.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:26:06", "owner": "life_in_japan68", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18137562826465620, "text": "Devastated 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:25:26", "owner": "krisfok_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058760618276580, "text": "😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:25:13", "owner": "kelixr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057227900316567, "text": "I hope whoever did this goes to jail. This is way too big for a household incident. To all of those lost in this deprived act.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:24:29", "owner": "moves_in_the_city", "likes": 13277}, {"id": 18107911906615920, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:24:05", "owner": "edwardkitsiu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084714638086310, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:23:49", "owner": "i.man__829", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047239469448230, "text": "😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:23:11", "owner": "happy.funnyfanny", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095448082875201, "text": "😞", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:22:11", "owner": "jasonleung1102", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855351733571587, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:22:06", "owner": "aiki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081890767892462, "text": "😢😢😢devastating", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:21:12", "owner": "rikkolee", "likes": 42}, {"id": 17915665128239269, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:19:25", "owner": "zelialung", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929743927015669, "text": "Praying", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:15:53", "owner": "norcalshockwaves", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122379205524299, "text": "💔💔😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:14:49", "owner": "tikitimellen_veganspartan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094417636857874, "text": "日日喺大埔出入都會經過呢幾幢大廈，估唔到最近海景最需要水嗰陣，10號風球，同黑雨都冇嚟！希望世界真係有天使，保護緊嗰啲仲未搵到嘅人。", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:13:26", "owner": "ttkwhy", "likes": 796}, {"id": 17843851767620664, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:12:06", "owner": "wahhhhching", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18174119599370298, "text": "😭", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:11:48", "owner": "deltaskatesupply", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18061412606224965, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:11:41", "owner": "hajimmy112", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101071657742873, "text": "TBH, I dun think those bildg are suitable to live again in future 😢😢😢😢 RIP to all ppl n fireman who lost their lives 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:10:06", "owner": "ryanlee1223", "likes": 338}, {"id": 18089602601307236, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:09:49", "owner": "cathinook", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972745728958110, "text": "Is it drone?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:08:48", "owner": "connntrail", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082284608270651, "text": "🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:05:14", "owner": "zoyibelle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060960965553321, "text": "Praying 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:04:56", "owner": "juu_chu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094096465896583, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:03:28", "owner": "liewsantong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103771843676721, "text": "😢Sad. Bønn 🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:02:58", "owner": "karas.ho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18202708636319068, "text": "😭🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:02:19", "owner": "thisism18", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17905562052148034, "text": "So sad", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:58:55", "owner": "waiyeelovin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004507310818245, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:58:49", "owner": "yyip_yoki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860407981544259, "text": "🔥👏😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:58:33", "owner": "chtteam47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088203085983920, "text": "有工开啦，重新起楼", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:56:35", "owner": "minruan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18306597493270845, "text": "More information about this disaster: \nhttps://www.instagram.com/p/DRiX7kzDMzG", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:55:35", "owner": "dee2deelittle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18328302127209811, "text": "Looks like they finally got that fire under control (for what its worth).", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:54:55", "owner": "mythik1988", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154333012414563, "text": "😢😢😢😢😢😢 they should have those drones with firehoses..", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:53:05", "owner": "gayle628709", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900104494180742, "text": "Amen.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:49:03", "owner": "sipearson21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100173478624234, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:48:32", "owner": "jimmylai168", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18432046039108523, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:46:53", "owner": "cabbitdorisng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543614359037262, "text": "💔💔💔🙏🏻🥺", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:46:25", "owner": "j.mlk54", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104563279578038, "text": "😢🙏🏿", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:45:00", "owner": "bybronco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856871452562276, "text": "🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:44:29", "owner": "chan__m.c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158230810405563, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:41:41", "owner": "poonshalee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055684121315951, "text": "耶17:9 人心比萬物都詭詐、壞到極處、誰能識透呢。�\nThe heart is deceitful above all things, and it is exceedingly corrupt: who can know it?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:40:39", "owner": "stoviwong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540305920055042, "text": "This is Hong Kong 💔💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:39:31", "owner": "leemily_lyly9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083322806011228, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:39:14", "owner": "bruceyc_7847", "likes": 0}, {"