1320288104, "text": "Omg. 😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:21:44", "owner": "grumpwaffle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117989173493996, "text": "🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:21:38", "owner": "jexxiica222", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862838467454728, "text": "Skyscrapers too  lose to each other caused a disaster", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:18:30", "owner": "k_daehong", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17850666843597927, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:17:02", "owner": "0chok_dee0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936685755980605, "text": "😮😮😮😮😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:13:05", "owner": "garywongadventure", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119818255477026, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:08:31", "owner": "edcongabrielyau", "likes": 23}, {"id": 18116878747559708, "text": "💔💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:07:02", "owner": "pylindsey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050445785371412, "text": "🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:57:04", "owner": "mami369mami", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095409961894685, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:56:24", "owner": "karenkaacheung", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18081229991117242, "text": "😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:54:14", "owner": "sakurazoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18427481938128834, "text": "God bless", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:51:36", "owner": "iamcttt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005389349665243, "text": "🙏🏻🙏🏻🙏🏻😿", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:46:31", "owner": "simmeowss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917148109214512, "text": "pray for them!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:45:54", "owner": "axnotex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028762859563345, "text": "Pray for Taipo please!!!🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:43:53", "owner": "weirdmaskalice.w", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18339087859234921, "text": "Oh wow 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:32:07", "owner": "peacelife17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878375770430561, "text": "큰일이다 ㅜㅜ", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:24:35", "owner": "jumbobass", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083506343040843, "text": "Amen", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:20:42", "owner": "trevorzt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043793321686855, "text": "天佑宏福  prayers to all wang fuk  residents", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:18:34", "owner": "breaktochill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065536250571936, "text": "Whoa, that’s terrible 😣", "created_at": "2025-11-27T02:11:39", "owner": "gaatzaat", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17889330924386294, "text": "Praying for those affected", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:58:41", "owner": "simply.just.ana", "likes": 284}, {"id": 18099345232753619, "text": "God heal us 🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:46:54", "owner": "andrewlui909", "likes": 21}, {"id": 18045527813480743, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:39:11", "owner": "lts_33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18517736749070682, "text": "Heartbreaking 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:28:11", "owner": "carrrrlyam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091958876495381, "text": "💔", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:12:30", "owner": "justsomeslabs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015043109797042, "text": "😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:10:17", "owner": "watttailong", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17936685563982677, "text": "Heart broken......", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:48:58", "owner": "poifull823", "likes": 16395}, {"id": 17866703016427118, "text": "Sending prayers ✨", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:44:12", "owner": "wildlight.life", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18077791090950520, "text": "Sending prayers to Wang Fuk", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:43:22", "owner": "thecuratedsouth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064806398168308, "text": "Damn", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:37:49", "owner": "leighellis", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18093672562718631, "text": "There is my primary school, all my childhood memories😢", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:32:48", "owner": "yenniema", "likes": 2400}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3744309171341857453, "shortcode": "DP2dVpnEZKt", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DP2dVpnEZKt/", "taken_at": "2025-10-16T01:04:19", "caption": "How to make your Rainbow Six Siege addiction sound ✨professional✨\n\n#rainbowsixsiege #rainbowsix #rainbowsixmemes #rainbowsixsiegememes #rainbowsixclips #rainbowsixsiegeclips #gaming #gamingposts #gamingclips #gamingmemes #gaminglife #gamer #gamerlife #gamermemes", "owner_username": "yourboujeegal", "owner_id": "58103226597", "likes": 44682, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0139_DP2dVpnEZKt\\DP2dVpnEZKt_20251016_010419.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18099299773663239, "text": "Now let’s pull up your chat logs", "created_at": "2025-10-16T18:52:57", "owner": "ethan_j_t", "likes": 3116}, {"id": 18079118386841924, "text": "LETS GOOOO 🙌🙌❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-16T02:09:22", "owner": "mat_the_goof", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18079718663020594, "text": "Do Battlefield 🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-16T02:15:13", "owner": "josie_mvp", "likes": 143}, {"id": 18028979087740028, "text": "One of my friends did this for his interview 🤣 he played Ark Survival Evolved and listed it as ASE INC. spoke about managing large groups recruiting and vetting people for high positions within the company and experience in various multi corporate management and negotiations 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-17T04:28:29", "owner": "nishino_kazuki", "likes": 86}, {"id": 18087610534917851, "text": "Plesse Mass effect", "created_at": "2025-10-16T05:46:01", "owner": "ricardosimonig", "likes": 709}, {"id": 17860614408458862, "text": "@rolevierly @christopherolala yes nambah cv", "created_at": "2025-10-30T11:31:02", "owner": "nicola.nagata", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18052486280303823, "text": "how do i put recoil control on my resume", "created_at": "2025-10-16T18:44:36", "owner": "prod.sandrs", "likes": 30}, {"id": 18082619785966438, "text": "Putting this on my resume", "created_at": "2025-10-16T14:41:31", "owner": "yaboidrewskiii", "likes": 3055}, {"id": 18078368048278653, "text": "None about COD? 😬", "created_at": "2025-10-16T02:53:03", "owner": "opadula_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18004901321651384, "text": "I think im in love", "created_at": "2025-10-16T22:00:43", "owner": "waddupkyy_", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18056522867245532, "text": "Yes yes yes yes", "created_at": "2025-10-17T04:58:14", "owner": "s.m.4.s.h.1.n.g", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18320751418244315, "text": "Ash mains i rush i don't listen just zero environment analyze", "created_at": "2025-10-16T13:15:46", "owner": "shlomi.avitan", "likes": 322}, {"id": 18083371510961929, "text": "@skitttlzzz you’ll need this soon gang, take notes.", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:52:44", "owner": "gxinto", "likes": 28}, {"id": 17986130276885629, "text": "I’m diamond one 🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-18T18:14:15", "owner": "just.pkk_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076387202162333, "text": "How do I explain to them I run shield ops?", "created_at": "2025-10-17T17:26:39", "owner": "imshofes", "likes": 31}, {"id": 18390483715123486, "text": "YESSSSSS I’VE BEEN WAITING FOR THIS", "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:05:42", "owner": "teekaye.mp3", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17955375360010056, "text": "My parents said I wouldn't get far by just playing games", "created_at": "2025-10-16T15:36:53", "owner": "kaypotatu_", "likes": 28}, {"id": 17966813711820607, "text": "I think I found a decent teammate @bored_as_hrll 😭🙏🏾", "created_at": "2025-10-17T12:27:40", "owner": "trey.dtr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071596268364023, "text": "“Uhhh ma’am this is just an interview for an entry level position at McDonalds…”", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:34:34", "owner": "carter_toohigh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18391233970126900, "text": "Hell yeah for listening", "created_at": "2025-10-16T01:11:42", "owner": "noah_bosch24", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075386992936509, "text": "“Sir you do know this a interview for being a mcdonald’s cashier right “", "created_at": "2025-10-17T18:19:34", "owner": "mrspritecranberry", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078947609014487, "text": "Im just gonna save as I have interviews coming up", "created_at": "2025-10-17T03:42:27", "owner": "thef00lishfool", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18066050111369152, "text": "Zelda??", "created_at": "2025-10-16T01:11:17", "owner": "golden_hawk.17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070525583334794, "text": "Okay now do animal crossing 🗣️ (jokes aside this format of explanation helped me a lot on my resume because I didn’t know how to express my skills without saying something dumb like “ye so I do it”)", "created_at": "2025-10-20T17:55:58", "owner": "ant_._7887", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18119427973480648, "text": "Julian needs this", "created_at": "2025-11-18T19:25:26", "owner": "lunar_1141", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18006075629812281, "text": "this is like working at mcdonalds as a cashier and saying “I work managing finances for a multi-billion dollar enterprise”", "created_at": "2025-10-20T14:11:24", "owner": "mauricio.lavie", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18167033233372522, "text": "Don't forget \"I'm used to working as a team with the mentally challenged\"", "created_at": "2025-10-16T08:52:44", "owner": "tiffdaninja", "likes": 251}, {"id": 18361314667088366, "text": "“I’m Diamond one”", "created_at": "2025-10-18T08:11:29", "owner": "inkftw", "likes": 374}, {"id": 18116144392547241, "text": "Basically be as vague as possible. lol.", "created_at": "2025-10-25T01:04:18", "owner": "mexican_from_gotham", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17885655912384369, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-16T10:22:54", "owner": "byle8018", "likes": 2823}, {"id": 18084808858980104, "text": "She's talking like we're gonna raid the competing companies.😭😭🙏🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-07T22:38:13", "owner": "im_parsa84", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18108732664509168, "text": "Star Rail, wuwa, or Mario Kart pls 🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-16T01:12:25", "owner": "karinarod7002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985576824897131, "text": "Ur hella cute", "created_at": "2025-10-16T19:31:40", "owner": "liamitedtimeoffer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058859756179944, "text": "bombed the hostaged", "created_at": "2025-10-18T22:23:08", "owner": "beethovenlackin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18512575366068048, "text": "Do Hell Let Loose", "created_at": "2025-10-16T12:52:34", "owner": "gyulamilan67", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18043530890455781, "text": "Like this or comment so I can come back. Bless", "created_at": "2025-10-19T20:44:22", "owner": "jgrgm", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18093824320760280, "text": "I am ash main i rush and die", "created_at": "2025-10-17T13:09:34", "owner": "adi_is_kinda_funny_______", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18154679101392874, "text": "Do rust", "created_at": "2025-10-16T12:40:55", "owner": "itmecat2058", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067082882433027, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T14:39:58", "owner": "_herrera.04_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075052214264235, "text": "Ash mains can't relate...", "created_at": "2025-11-20T08:20:24", "owner": "wolcow47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18350234302160047, "text": "No es una mala desde luego", "created_at": "2025-11-18T09:59:43", "owner": "jimy._d.2108", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082031615107691, "text": "I break walls with a hammer and pray nobody is in the room.", "created_at": "2025-11-17T23:31:47", "owner": "matthewsdonaldsonman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942827401078453, "text": "Now do Path of Exile", "created_at": "2025-11-15T18:25:50", "owner": "iwinerplz112", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104494408652780, "text": "I have no problem completing tasks while accompanied by braindead people", "created_at": "2025-11-13T14:43:15", "owner": "majkl_17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090718018912332, "text": "This may be a joke but video games and especially siege does rewire your brain to think like that", "created_at": "2025-11-12T19:52:21", "owner": "kwnst_mhtsopoulos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18421760437116120, "text": "Wouldn’t this technically work", "created_at": "2025-11-09T06:14:06", "owner": "chasin.cases", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892576510224043, "text": "HOTLINE MIAMI", "created_at": "2025-11-07T01:13:15", "owner": "areo._bliss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060409811446229, "text": "@therealduckydouse I’m finally gonna get a job", "created_at": "2025-11-06T07:57:17", "owner": "thatgingerguy4615", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140176090452162, "text": "We Need titanfall 🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-06T06:28:53", "owner": "hans_giesel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897763432186151, "text": "My skills are racial slurs and shooting my teammates", "created_at": "2025-11-06T01:33:24", "owner": "shreksthrobbingshaft", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084517867968652, "text": "@lemme_reload_plez 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-30T14:46:21", "owner": "harshajit__baruah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042811367466197, "text": "Bold of you to assume they'll get one.", "created_at": "2025-10-29T20:40:53", "owner": "that1.guy369", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906735976262731, "text": "Then there's the players who sit on their phone, run in, die immediately and then bitch quit", "created_at": "2025-10-28T21:43:30", "owner": "callum_cr_private", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915084961208250, "text": "@naldo.j.lewis I gotchu bro. This vid will see you all the way through to employment", "created_at": "2025-10-28T16:23:39", "owner": "wr3e.nn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074276498238723, "text": "Devil may cry?!", "created_at": "2025-10-25T07:07:16", "owner": "billy0078308", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083814701508462, "text": "Do warthunder 🙏🏼", "created_at": "2025-10-25T04:35:56", "owner": "dr_plague2692", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118280884543075, "text": "do Apex with movement included", "created_at": "2025-10-25T03:08:16", "owner": "cryz.25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098592088673117, "text": "and don't forget the Teamwork! xd", "created_at": "2025-10-24T04:11:32", "owner": "vero.wld", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873983419354498, "text": "Imma put this on my resume 🥀🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-24T01:52:47", "owner": "ionz_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926862886013448, "text": "I just rush in swinging 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-22T19:29:08", "owner": "iammattartinos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18149990149414330, "text": "@jakejarvis88", "created_at": "2025-10-21T21:10:29", "owner": "jasonn_guy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099818005659105, "text": "“Ma’am this is a McDonald’s interview…”", "created_at": "2025-10-21T01:58:13", "owner": "rbndawn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863357338496794, "text": "😂🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-20T19:54:14", "owner": "speedymvchiavelli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18525364684015167, "text": "CS2 next?", "created_at": "2025-10-20T16:19:00", "owner": "cx1tox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058578497197587, "text": "\"what are you good at\" \"shooting aliens\" \"what else?\" \"Shooting zombies\" \"what else?\" \"Shooting people\" ...", "created_at": "2025-10-20T15:47:25", "owner": "extra_large_noodle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092233135848223, "text": "I need this. I have 3.7K hours in this game. Thank you so much.", "created_at": "2025-10-20T14:48:38", "owner": "wongthekongquerer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18531101644004679, "text": "Supported a billion dollar company", "created_at": "2025-10-20T13:01:29", "owner": "m.owais_javed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074463643964732, "text": "@elias_parrett479 take notes", "created_at": "2025-10-20T11:46:24", "owner": "nathanael_lop3z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853174867559111, "text": "Destiny 2(I hate this game, its my favorite)", "created_at": "2025-10-20T04:19:03", "owner": "pblarcher", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020853704596348, "text": "If I’m interviewing someone and tell they tell me this, they can have my job with a doubled salary", "created_at": "2025-10-20T02:21:21", "owner": "jjackito98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109984342602060, "text": "I reinforce there and there, I'll peak here and there I'll rotate there and swing here", "created_at": "2025-10-19T20:27:30", "owner": "satx_natedog7447", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855529117549467, "text": "The fact that I take business area and had history for r6, I understood everything for both meaning", "created_at": "2025-10-19T12:47:46", "owner": "notactuallyran", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865545637470899, "text": "👱‍♀️:\"What's ur main?\" 👨‍🦱:\"Warden\" 👱‍♀️:\"Get out\"", "created_at": "2025-10-19T06:51:43", "owner": "ahmadainun_r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965711139991346, "text": "@alexx_najeraa", "created_at": "2025-10-19T04:59:45", "owner": "kevin__c08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063004229128719, "text": "Im gonna use this shit in my next job interview to see what happens", "created_at": "2025-10-19T02:21:53", "owner": "fiddle_stick45", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991445655852592, "text": "I point and click and spam slurs...", "created_at": "2025-10-18T23:30:23", "owner": "umwao7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842352793600267, "text": "Longest way to say a whole lotta nothin.", "created_at": "2025-10-18T20:41:17", "owner": "juan.gc_12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084142630786440, "text": "Mgs?", "created_at": "2025-10-18T18:41:03", "owner": "wickedusername69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18204075205314278, "text": "You play siege?", "created_at": "2025-10-18T16:18:21", "owner": "north_america76", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18538522585014269, "text": "Will be using this when I apply to ubisoft", "created_at": "2025-10-18T16:14:09", "owner": "pierogi_enjoyer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030829859724307, "text": "My speciality is babysitting 4 special needs kids and anger management", "created_at": "2025-10-18T06:54:20", "owner": "arsa1an_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848897953545441, "text": "Can you please give us an example of your communication skills. 99% of R6 Players: He's over there! We will call you, don't call us", "created_at": "2025-10-18T03:27:52", "owner": "giant_jitsu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18534126391003857, "text": "Do destiny", "created_at": "2025-10-18T00:12:26", "owner": "trawwwj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857036821478722, "text": "can you do one for 2v2 cod snd wagers😂😭✌️", "created_at": "2025-10-17T23:22:28", "owner": "ihy_angel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939639307073756, "text": "@reynard_siantar @yohaneps345 @nohea_jethro", "created_at": "2025-10-17T22:55:41", "owner": "iseharaxs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079641647091694, "text": "What is dokkabei talking about bro", "created_at": "2025-10-17T20:22:53", "owner": "yourgirlabby8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988220973854380, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-17T19:14:53", "owner": "tri_claudi0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863301313494422, "text": "Who let Aruni Talk?", "created_at": "2025-10-17T17:12:05", "owner": "dannnpv_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929421081999697, "text": "Actually this is very good advice", "created_at": "2025-10-17T16:00:46", "owner": "tarminiarrgx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083979422485512, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:28:14", "owner": "hoochiecoochieman297", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065439560618932, "text": "K/D: 0.23", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:23:43", "owner": "murilonetlink", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084732854480797, "text": "Recruit rush goes brrrrrr", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:19:02", "owner": "matinfarjal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967072803972357, "text": "Preparation is for workers with average experience", "created_at": "2025-10-17T15:07:00", "owner": "tophatbighat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858716911532535, "text": "thanks dokkaebi", "created_at": "2025-10-17T14:41:38", "owner": "alienn314", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079845083039771, "text": "Apoco todo eso sé hacer? :O", "created_at": "2025-10-17T12:59:57", "owner": "juliandavidroarojas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102426619621529, "text": "DO ONE FOR APEX! DO ONE FOR APEX!!!", "created_at": "2025-10-17T12:56:26", "owner": "hayashi.shunmeii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18380166148181656, "text": "Finally i can put this on my CV", "created_at": "2025-10-17T11:39:02", "owner": "alsamsun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100345519578682, "text": "Please do a rougelike of any kind or darktide", "created_at": "2025-10-17T11:33:38", "owner": "anthimonyofair", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069799706246296, "text": "@bendjiman_a we bouta ball", "created_at": "2025-10-17T10:48:07", "owner": "mad_rats_kris_n_kyrie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918153550082882, "text": "Can you make another one but for honor", "created_at": "2025-10-17T10:48:03", "owner": "mengusulkan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110220094605112, "text": "I rush A with Ash, die without dealing any damage, and after that, i blame my teammates for not doing anything.", "created_at": "2025-10-17T10:28:43", "owner": "chi127_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973570137943055, "text": "Sybau", "created_at": "2025-10-17T05:35:07", "owner": "nomad._.potato01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958992111859042, "text": "R6 players don’t get jobs so ts lowk useless 🙁", "created_at": "2025-10-17T05:28:33", "owner": "szcoop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906007804123042, "text": "LET'S GOOOOOO🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-17T05:03:18", "owner": "just_puky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043166735689369, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-17T04:32:22", "owner": "mrpeeri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18167238823335313, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-17T04:09:03", "owner": "gghnhgfd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081928745475760, "text": "Youd be Fired for screaming the nword At your coworkers", "created_at": "2025-10-17T03:58:07", "owner": "rain.man2006", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081992933489530, "text": "how do you write I’ve consistently been able be teamed up with horrible team mates yet win rounds in corporate?", "created_at": "2025-10-17T03:28:38", "owner": "ohilovemyname", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054098387302909, "text": "make one for Squad or Arma", "created_at": "2025-10-17T01:56:57", "owner": "thanachaipumma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074412053271250, "text": "I'll need a burger king crown to talk about my R6 experience", "created_at": "2025-10-17T01:47:13", "owner": "grd.lpzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906932740256525, "text": "@elijahrodriquez", "created_at": "2025-10-17T01:35:32", "owner": "noahleerodriquez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863821240481366, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-17T01:13:19", "owner": "blake_latham10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986816268856079, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-17T00:14:48", "owner": "complexabove", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18526927342058396, "text": "Yea this is definitely going on my resume 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:49:25", "owner": "r3v56_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997399896687522, "text": "“i’ve also worked with incompetent monkeys before so if that’s the case here, i’ll fit right in.”", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:20:22", "owner": "clayton.cxh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132390634460982, "text": "you should do one for the finals", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:16:31", "owner": "felipeccarrasco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007905137641879, "text": "How my first dates usually go", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:06:18", "owner": "reddotti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090535432697744, "text": "Im diamond 1", "created_at": "2025-10-16T22:45:42", "owner": "uhchristian.fit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147296659424504, "text": "Ty hibana", "created_at": "2025-10-16T22:13:59", "owner": "fel_pot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895549030339641, "text": "Thank you🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-16T22:05:51", "owner": "yuriscaneiro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046090046398623, "text": "But their peak rank is most likely emerald lol", "created_at": "2025-10-16T21:56:29", "owner": "preston_t_s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110349817570866, "text": "alright u redeemed yourself about siege", "created_at": "2025-10-16T21:45:33", "owner": "g._.hostie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103398775626176, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-16T21:23:39", "owner": "a.gubiev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083098456975733, "text": "Please do apex", "created_at": "2025-10-16T21:17:08", "owner": "hopefulbongo825", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987845319893955, "text": "Do Hypixel SkyBlock 😼", "created_at": "2025-10-16T21:14:21", "owner": "goonlord958", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947907283043064, "text": "So real", "created_at": "2025-10-16T21:05:48", "owner": "tron_nite07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854079517504354, "text": "Can you do about halo please I’ll ad that to my resume", "created_at": "2025-10-16T20:56:16", "owner": "cristiank76", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896645671325381, "text": "Can you please dp half-life 2🙏🙏🙏", "created_at": "2025-10-16T20:55:49", "owner": "brody_mothafukn_watson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052046726316415, "text": "Do league next", "created_at": "2025-10-16T20:48:05", "owner": "sliceofbryce_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052092956647753, "text": "War thunder please", "created_at": "2025-10-16T20:31:14", "owner": "fallenfalcon.xcx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937780723089475, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-16T20:13:59", "owner": "fd._6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910425709236896, "text": "So especially, we’re Diamond 1", "created_at": "2025-10-16T20:00:21", "owner": "itr.jonathan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085899452503822, "text": "And most of all... I have brain damage", "created_at": "2025-10-16T19:43:14", "owner": "violent.prostate.examination", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882981178392356, "text": "And calling people slurs", "created_at": "2025-10-16T19:41:58", "owner": "greyson_12345", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996563331833185, "text": "i feel like i’m talking to chat gpt rn", "created_at": "2025-10-16T19:35:12", "owner": "finn_griffith", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945729127063352, "text": "this is first video I'm watching of yours! was excited as a siege player to see more siege content hahaha, you should more as individual operators", "created_at": "2025-10-16T19:25:35", "owner": "da.nk.im", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18403437082184532, "text": "lol me combining this call of duty, bf , lol and cs:go and puting it in to my cv then apply for a janitor", "created_at": "2025-10-16T19:18:05", "owner": "yea_bunny_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101363083647752, "text": "@finn_rau08 @jlias_642 @dylanhic08", "created_at": "2025-10-16T19:02:44", "owner": "owendarcey08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066515912597317, "text": "Thank you", "created_at": "2025-10-16T18:28:46", "owner": "zynnrz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185555458334732, "text": "Non ironically, everything is true 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-16T18:12:48", "owner": "erickb4412", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122834320453662, "text": "In seige? Nah. I think this is the wrong game. Random teamates are borderline AI", "created_at": "2025-10-16T18:00:04", "owner": "the_kyron04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060586859440180, "text": "So basically if I say this at an interview they will think I was in the military?", "created_at": "2025-10-16T16:26:59", "owner": "mr_boogat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134369941414259, "text": "PLEASE I NEED BALDURS GATE 3", "created_at": "2025-10-16T15:29:33", "owner": "pingydomingy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18426399946101629, "text": "Please do \"Umamusume: Pretty derby\" next", "created_at": "2025-10-16T15:23:43", "owner": "kim_stz_photos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918448357054454, "text": "Do cod next and super smash bros", "created_at": "2025-10-16T14:23:41", "owner": "jcastro_325", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899325409302436, "text": "3/6", "created_at": "2025-10-16T13:18:32", "owner": "simongreene2010", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301677913271742, "text": "Unless you use Amaru", "created_at": "2025-10-16T13:16:09", "owner": "cl_mb50", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932195860099056, "text": "Pls do Roblox next sissy", "created_at": "2025-10-16T12:47:04", "owner": "evelynno1simp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090931114861839, "text": "Can you do one with mlbb???", "created_at": "2025-10-16T12:34:16", "owner": "pp_paing25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848382970554043, "text": "@gray_banana27 @jdizzlem8", "created_at": "2025-10-16T12:29:26", "owner": "tunpray", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18127776832489859, "text": "Overcooked, Pico Park 2 or Boomerang fu please", "created_at": "2025-10-16T10:46:10", "owner": "constancetanpq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071387930254639, "text": "Do osrs 🤓", "created_at": "2025-10-16T09:20:26", "owner": "bjorno.png", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911389372228757, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-16T07:43:16", "owner": "ms.65gr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081460094049403, "text": "Banger 🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-16T06:40:42", "owner": "linojarry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952619695013273, "text": "Please do one for Pokemon hardcore nuzlockes or pokemon TCG 🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-16T05:45:15", "owner": "merlinra2rthur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860687737511250, "text": "you should do geometry dash", "created_at": "2025-10-16T03:39:25", "owner": "ch33rl0s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078031097513840, "text": "Do CS2", "created_at": "2025-10-16T01:13:39", "owner": "linus._.b", "likes": 5}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["rainbowsixsiege", "rainbowsix", "rainbowsixmemes", "rainbowsixsiegememes", "rainbowsixclips", "rainbowsixsiegeclips", "gaming", "gamingposts", "gamingclips", "gamingmemes", "gaminglife", "gamer", "gamerlife", "gamermemes"]},
