{"media_id": 3771033863393840558, "shortcode": "DRVZ1Gnjw2u", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRVZ1Gnjw2u/", "taken_at": "2025-11-21T21:59:34", "caption": "welcome to: 3 friends 2 majors 1 vlog 😛😛\n\n#explore #fy #vlog #college #collegelife", "owner_username": "lnxyae", "owner_id": "21905911300", "likes": 66096, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0141_DRVZ1Gnjw2u\\DRVZ1Gnjw2u_20251121_215934.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17866799898497455, "text": "So cute omg!!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T23:56:21", "owner": "wasabiwasabby", "likes": 81}, {"id": 18085601687047442, "text": "Middle one will be absolutely cooked in some years with that sleep schedule. Trust me I've been there and done that for so many years on end. It's a bad idea", "created_at": "2025-11-25T20:34:20", "owner": "janus_engholm_johansen", "likes": 1405}, {"id": 18083818393844907, "text": "The one in the middle how did u survive the whole day without taking a nap!!", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:43:16", "owner": "s.sara0._", "likes": 3082}, {"id": 17873058645378377, "text": "Lynn did NOT go to the gym", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:44:59", "owner": "ch3nski", "likes": 593}, {"id": 18105171136642596, "text": "Such productive lives 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:55:30", "owner": "jannatmashail", "likes": 172}, {"id": 18141148579458683, "text": "your dining halls are open at 3pm??", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:30:50", "owner": "emilyysdong", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18095583127681378, "text": "Dam, I’m a cs major and you guys make me realize how much time I waste", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:00:26", "owner": "shan.batej", "likes": 445}, {"id": 18011715749801829, "text": "Cool 😎 video 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:23:35", "owner": "george73p", "likes": 24}, {"id": 17853963162578717, "text": "Hey insta, need advice, I want to start a degree in It, application development orientation, Taking evening classes after work, do yall think it's worth it?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:02:21", "owner": "suho_lloyd", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18082636031113105, "text": "i loveee, soo cutieee", "created_at": "2025-11-23T23:26:59", "owner": "tylaforbes", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17864131491447757, "text": "The bottom one vibe coder 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:31:35", "owner": "faiyaz_mazumder_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18067085939374310, "text": "Love it! ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-24T21:42:10", "owner": "hgg16.garciag", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061050080556711, "text": "i love this", "created_at": "2025-11-23T19:54:21", "owner": "khuxshii_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18085355578831514, "text": "@gao.qinya WERE IN THIS LOL", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:02:20", "owner": "lyons.wang", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18075021704211075, "text": "@f4tm4.2 @merryn07 we should do this💕", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:24:25", "owner": "sidneyk71", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18041974094497974, "text": "Sleeping is a bug 😂😭", "created_at": "2025-11-25T21:11:49", "owner": "ism.ajv", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18141114880455100, "text": "@angeline__h @c0wgirl_cr0ssing we need to do this", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:04:33", "owner": "angelwingirl", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070783475596761, "text": "@piperstimler could we do one of these", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:29:35", "owner": "maiagboswell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060951128566176, "text": "Is girly in the middle sleeping at all?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:40:04", "owner": "charlymae", "likes": 15423}, {"id": 18086018309054906, "text": "did she just slept 24hours straight", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:20:49", "owner": "nothankyouy", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095213218869999, "text": "So they sleep so little that they can’t process things?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:12:55", "owner": "divescotty223", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18438997693101647, "text": "no shower", "created_at": "2025-11-24T16:07:19", "owner": "pain.ish", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17879179026430185, "text": "ayo buat ini lo @gestianenjelikaa @nana_ariyanti01", "creat