s", "created_at": "2025-12-05T00:02:40", "owner": "harahyeah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051604118377705, "text": "Boring life", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:34:53", "owner": "poopieslappa84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047969873439779, "text": "The middle girl is me😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:09:29", "owner": "kkeimchi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917217955231370, "text": "é assim mesmo.......", "created_at": "2025-12-02T18:58:29", "owner": "letcia.s2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140686195459727, "text": "That middle is so mee 🙌 literally sleeping at 5am daily", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:57:33", "owner": "12_prem_12_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055387175323911, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T19:22:56", "owner": "yashfaasharr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124063354521846, "text": "that CS student rlly relatable since sem 1 believe me ive been doing that 😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T12:59:25", "owner": "sakura_april28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18292531288276555, "text": "W vlog", "created_at": "2025-12-01T07:14:15", "owner": "uncensoredaryan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993140214892449, "text": "I wanna do it w someone 😭none of my friends wanna do it😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:19:23", "owner": "written.by.asal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105570265713000, "text": "The girl in the middle and at the bottom be sleeping 4-5 hours", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:53:21", "owner": "kati.priva2as", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850129846562208, "text": "Im like the one in the middle🫢", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:26:00", "owner": "meryio.s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059964308245098, "text": "I didn't realize that it was 3 people's until I got to the comment section ...", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:20:10", "owner": "karuunnnnnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064607780624291, "text": "Fucking unemployed using daddys credit card for everything behaviour 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T00:56:58", "owner": "use_.r31759", "likes": 1}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["explore", "fy", "vlog", "college", "collegelife"]}