{"media_id": 3768516531312132746, "shortcode": "DRMddGbDAKK", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRMddGbDAKK/", "taken_at": "2025-11-18T10:36:57", "caption": "This Generation Is So Cooked 😭💀\n\nWe’re living in a time where loyalty is rare,\nattention spans are short,\nand people treat relationships like temporary subscriptions —\ncancel anytime, no explanation needed.\n\nOne moment they’re calling you “my everything,”\nthe next moment they’re entertaining someone else\nlike love is just a game they get bored of.\n\nPeople don’t fight for relationships anymore…\nthey replace them.\nThey don’t fix the problems…\nthey find distractions.\nThey don’t choose loyalty…\nthey choose whatever feels good for the next 10 minutes.\n\nAnd the craziest part?\nThey’ll cheat, lie, break someone’s trust —\nthen act like you’re the problem for not being “understanding.”\n\nThis generation doesn’t fear losing a good person.\nThey fear being alone.\nSo they keep backups, side pieces, and “it’s not what you think” stories\nready at any moment.\n\nNo loyalty.\nNo accountability.\nJust vibes, lies, and situationships that end the second truth shows up.\n\nThis generation…\nyeah, it’s cooked. 🍳💀\n\n#hergotcaught #CaughtSheLive #CheatingExposed #TrustBroken #ModernLoveIsCrazy #GenerationCooked #InstaKarma 💔📱😳\n\nAgree or disagree? 🤔", "owner_username": "hergotcaught", "owner_id": "72546790701", "likes": 14535, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0142_DRMddGbDAKK\\DRMddGbDAKK_20251118_103657.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17949549650921176, "text": "Women listen, it's about your character. Not how you look", "created_at": "2025-11-18T10:56:16", "owner": "jose_chikunde", "likes": 941}, {"id": 17852455710590046, "text": "😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:42:20", "owner": "mohd_suhail___official_72", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17991584846894724, "text": "😮😮😮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-20T07:29:54", "owner": "mefeairherryjon", "likes": 9}, {"id": 1804637