}, {"id": 18087524938974721, "text": "Que dieu m'épargne une fille pareil.", "created_at": "2025-12-11T13:47:08", "owner": "pezniang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140797081460555, "text": "C'est la mère de tes enfants de putain", "created_at": "2025-12-11T13:31:08", "owner": "aliby93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109704202720167, "text": "Et là vous voulez encore vous marier ???? 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T12:05:27", "owner": "isr___frck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100483111692483, "text": "@lununki elle a la rage dans les coms c’est sur elle fait la même quand elle va en boîte 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-11T10:49:19", "owner": "freeyael.exe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016686929796378, "text": "Wtf", "created_at": "2025-12-11T10:10:59", "owner": "dann_curry30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933838863997636, "text": "Force au mec qui va marier ça", "created_at": "2025-12-11T08:24:05", "owner": "enzo.oaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958699920889411, "text": "Envoie du tcb clodo de merde", "created_at": "2025-12-11T06:09:07", "owner": "tvngvy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002184350684528, "text": "🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-11T02:49:38", "owner": "_johan_ctl_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075132215201606, "text": "K 4 H", "created_at": "2025-12-11T02:01:17", "owner": "ersan.167", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051621836385813, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-11T00:27:14", "owner": "black_pearl.33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066791747399863, "text": "« On va en boîte juste pour s amuser entre copines »", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:53:31", "owner": "laurent.abl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918568825208279, "text": "C’est triste.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T22:33:53", "owner": "pierro.rgd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087560702313710, "text": "La futur femme à qui ça", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:58:00", "owner": "el_macina_92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113445550590922, "text": "Provocatrice", "created_at": "2025-12-04T21:50:05", "owner": "mendy_09", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880957930425389, "text": "Juste en regardant j’ai su les commentaires 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:56:42", "owner": "paul.ecj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18390683872194828, "text": "J'ai vu elle a mym, j'ai compris", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:06:12", "owner": "noah_gaillard25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926417077039106, "text": "Impeccable", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:13:57", "owner": "peter_pitou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941965488962353, "text": "pour ceux qui n’ont pas compris c’est clairement de la pub pour son mym hein 🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-04T14:51:28", "owner": "_clemlf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098633626790556, "text": "😂😂😂😮", "created_at": "2025-12-04T14:47:56", "owner": "theterror.131313", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18125199820513866, "text": "Dans 5/10ans elle comprendra pas pourquoi personne veut des gosses avec 😅", "created_at": "2025-12-04T14:42:14", "owner": "cypherpunk_er", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065573504452734, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T14:11:37", "owner": "simsim.coa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909857380274887, "text": "Mdr la prostipute 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:30:46", "owner": "enzo.riri.3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963872571990963, "text": "Tellement fier on dirait elle vien d'avoir le bac", "created_at": "2025-12-04T13:26:27", "owner": "olti_244", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059069492296107, "text": "Ta le choix pour ken pas pour te marier toi", "created_at": "2025-12-04T07:03:57", "owner": "sinedd.gg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887396368403425, "text": "Encore une pute fier de l'etre", "created_at": "2025-12-04T06:51:50", "owner": "d.oxfficiel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542084356058854, "text": "Et tous ça avec la croix au coup", "created_at": "2025-12-04T00:41:50", "owner": "lalau.alln", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083806537869002, "text": "😂😂😂ces ta soeur", "created_at": "2025-12-03T23:53:08", "owner": "calimero1315", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154311352418781, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-12-03T23:07:28", "owner": "lilboy972", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922777864193533, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T22:45:33", "owner": "chvhmouti_rima_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072812024596411, "text": "« Le passé compte pas »", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:16:59", "owner": "brice_mua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067464380618381, "text": "Pas la mienne en tt cas", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:10:08", "owner": "farouk.6300", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978803658931422, "text": "Après sa crie au sexisme 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:25:03", "owner": "pascal_dfld", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084116536858769, "text": "La meuf d'Épinay 2h avant de finir sdf", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:16:43", "owner": "nicko95crj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036356582737181, "text": "j’avoue mdrr", "created_at": "2025-12-03T17:57:08", "owner": "chlocoo599", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910014118122174, "text": "Elle ce respecte meme pas elle devienne tous pareil c'est rare de voir une femme qui montre pas son cul de nos jour...", "created_at": "2025-12-03T17:47:54", "owner": "smiizeercarl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028315568574477, "text": "Après elles pleurent qu’elles ont plus de respect 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T14:49:18", "owner": "mthl_6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070631987373597, "text": "Hooo merci vous avez retrouvé ma tantine 🙏🏽🙏🏽😅", "created_at": "2025-12-03T12:04:47", "owner": "moniauox_56", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101047174739127, "text": "wow", "created_at": "2025-12-03T10:28:11", "owner": "kayleighfitnesss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105801706631276, "text": "😍😍😍😍😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-12-03T10:28:03", "owner": "kayleighfitnesss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097605055875044, "text": "🤢", "created_at": "2025-12-03T00:29:05", "owner": "lucas.banchereau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067839065121391, "text": "C'est quoi cette génération mon dieu mon dieu j'espère juste pas avoir une fille comme toi tu fais tellement honte prostitution et tu vas finir sur Nym pitoyable j'ai été jeune et je me suis jamais comporté comme toi je savais m'amuser et pas sexualiser les choses une vraie femme et sensuelle par vulgaire toi ta place sur au bois de Boulogne et désolé les nanas qui tolèrent ce genre de chose c'est que vous faites la même chose c'est bien bravo quelle génération", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:54:00", "owner": "lagertha0x3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18415119970140403, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T21:30:35", "owner": "meftah_rs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117594415561492, "text": "Je pense à son père là maintenant...le pauvre 🥹", "created_at": "2025-12-01T18:23:28", "owner": "pinkcolortoulouse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946725418062671, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:44:27", "owner": "memi.dardani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101701102688768, "text": "La libération de la femme est une avancée majeur.", "created_at": "2025-11-30T18:04:35", "owner": "lestrat__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18553228078001451, "text": "Affiché 👏", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:19:45", "owner": "gregorypioli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033757502526670, "text": "استحى حدود الله", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:23:01", "owner": "messaoudibilel82", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083654450027066, "text": "Elle a trop l habite des douches de sperme ! Elle aime trop ça ! Ça se voit trop", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:24:29", "owner": "mister_jones_mc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922635715193973, "text": "🤢🤢🤢🤮", "created_at": "2025-11-27T12:39:13", "owner": "guillaumecatherine8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988282773874190, "text": "Sa faci casă cu asta😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:47:56", "owner": "cristib24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545165749044129, "text": "Dite vous quand même que les mec on payer des bouteille pour les viders pour voir sa", "created_at": "2025-11-27T00:40:29", "owner": "aliciiajane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865118110510946, "text": "Ils ont couper l’eau chez toi ou quoi sal pute", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:54:01", "owner": "binksp_off", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878465674430483, "text": "C’est du prosecco 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-26T22:58:27", "owner": "elliotmdt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085723061303188, "text": "Mulizza", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:42:11", "owner": "cedricpalmentu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032323652739946, "text": "De 1 ça sent l'insta fake a mort de 2 la meuf c'est vraiment la reine de chienne sans daron", "created_at": "2025-11-26T19:40:42", "owner": "aguilou.s2b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104738815732029, "text": "Bh t’es une tepu tout simplement qui 😷 dla chatte cousine ta besoin de sa pour évoluer dans ta live pour t’apporter un minimum d’attention des autres wlh même le goulot du champagne et plus propre que toi 🍾", "created_at": "2025-11-26T19:32:19", "owner": "paul.mj.313", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022843742785726, "text": "Perso je suis largement plus susceptible de faire ce que fais la meuf plutôt que le gars qui a payer cette bouteille et qui la vide 😂 après question de point de vue mais je pense elle profite bien, ous aimez trop juger mais en vrai ça dérange qui 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:47:19", "owner": "lilian_amln", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083693684042292, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:05:40", "owner": "loolabeee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067621568111472, "text": "How match 4hs", "created_at": "2025-11-26T16:36:17", "owner": "kabali113", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059395598265044, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:21:38", "owner": "yacine__bek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17995065449852839, "text": "Le pire c’est les mecs qui paient des bouteilles pour les verser sur des meufs qui n’ont pas de seins 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:33:07", "owner": "fred_frenchtrucker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023606792783291, "text": "😈😈😈🖤", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:37:51", "owner": "adi_jagu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047670182422739, "text": "🖕🖕🖕", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:33:24", "owner": "ach_hamzaoui93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087457976317848, "text": "thot", "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:39:35", "owner": "agostino_cortese", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090438875496572, "text": "Slampe Lampe", "created_at": "2025-11-26T11:07:33", "owner": "simon_kstl_",