 wil gahba eryna", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:09:35", "owner": "s.94ra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18210736261312088, "text": "tout le monde parle de la fille mais les mecs qui l’arroses me dégoûte encore plus que ce qu’elle me dégoûte elle", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:29:26", "owner": "nikitarcaaaa", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18066774218529608, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:26:28", "owner": "la_blonde210", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18379867465197546, "text": "mais qui veut prendre une douche pour coller toute la soirée comme ça la eurk", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:57:35", "owner": "steffy.suukiz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084432872043988, "text": "De 1 gaspillage de 2 grosse pute de 3 t’aurais du te faire avorté de 4 grosse salope de 5 on va notre génération de 6 faite des vrai projet que de payer des bouteilles 150€ pour les jeter sur une grosse pute", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:30:37", "owner": "killian_m3rs", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18194667793330086, "text": "Quelle vie de débauche s'en honneur ou honte", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:23:06", "owner": "tounsie916", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17923748754179626, "text": "Elle devait sentir comme un sdf alcoolique 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:17:45", "owner": "inconnu_75__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915068359237901, "text": "Tfou", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:02:47", "owner": "il0vey0v_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118869328546582, "text": "Tant que c'est pas la mienne je prends 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:09:43", "owner": "el_padre_loco_zkl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118842949550759, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:08:32", "owner": "tefa.mohamed11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073327613364266, "text": "Triste génération", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:54:43", "owner": "shockwave_v4s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050968073348644, "text": "Ça me dégoûte à un point , ne la mariez jamais car elle ne le mérite pas", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:49:08", "owner": "rmi_.78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888315706259130, "text": "Sa fait dure les fille en 2025", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:25:49", "owner": "jadouu.xox0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046259387678220, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:59:04", "owner": "mitch_from_dam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993138771707802, "text": "Sont où les féministe ?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:02:12", "owner": "micael_micael_micael", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908994919124547, "text": "\"Femme libre\" nan nan c'est une tepu en libertés", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:45:23", "owner": "oilhan_prv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159562990401706, "text": "\"DE qui\", car on dit \"fils DE p\" et pas \"fils a p\"", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:38:52", "owner": "userdotinsta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915556111226711, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:32:04", "owner": "matdu38400", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858265015555557, "text": "\"C'est les mecs jamais nous\" \n\"On est pas des objets\"", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:54:53", "owner": "whosjeremyyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881248549421173, "text": "Pas à moi", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:15:12", "owner": "tom.poupre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084855730968350, "text": "Ne dites surtout pas que c une pute", "created_at": "2025-11-21T23:27:00", "owner": "naj_im84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145358317430587, "text": "DE qui ! On dit fils DE p*te pas fils A p*te", "created_at": "2025-11-21T20:03:54", "owner": "mat_1601", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921498085189547, "text": "Mdrrr te faire laver avec du mousseux à 12€ ta perdu ta dignité pour du mousseux jppp", "created_at": "2025-11-21T19:19:22", "owner": "saadd71400", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18033832622523297, "text": "Fière d'être une pute . Génération perdue", "created_at": "2025-11-21T18:37:57", "owner": "conan_coyne", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18103820980640047, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-21T16:56:25", "owner": "charoo_gang", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18046254251458902, "text": "Champagne shower en boîte et golden shower à la sorti", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:29:55", "owner": "tommichel_988", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18149358094425820, "text": "DIGOULASSE", "created_at": "2025-11-21T14:32:39", "owner": "deajth13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864903796439791, "text": "Asperger au martini en plus de ça quelle crasseuse !", "created_at": "2025-11-21T10:44:16", "owner": "an_th_ony14", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095840986835100, "text": "Grosse tana", "created_at": "2025-11-21T09:33:05", "owner": "tonycrapx25", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17880687687423937, "text": "Alors elle elle mérite une faciale.", "created_at": "2025-11-21T08:01:16", "owner": "ilikebabar01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061846955531047, "text": "Elle se fait arrosée au vin mousseux à 9€ la bouteille 😂😂😂elle sait vraiment un déchet 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T23:47:01", "owner": "bo93876888", "likes": 3}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["viral", "pourtoi", "explore"]},
{"media_id": 3770574109827909948, "shortcode": "DRTxSzvk8k8", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRTxSzvk8k8/", "taken_at": "2025-11-21T06:44:43", "caption": "個Friend約小編食澳牛，本身以為落佐敦，原來係去IKEA瑞典餐廳，食新推出嘅燒澳洲肩胛肉眼扒！咬落巧Juicy，仲有薯菜跟，供應期去到12月31號，下次先再同你食常餐啦！\n\nMy friend asked small editor go to Oh Out, I thought we were heading to Jordan…Turns out we were going to the IKEA Swedish Restaurant to try the new Roasted Australian Chuck eye roll! It’s juicy and comes with veggies and potatoes.It’s available until 31 Dec, so we’ll go for the set meal next time!", "owner_username": "ikeahongkong", "owner_id": "520394662", "likes": 6164, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphImage", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0144_DRTxSzvk8k8\\DRTxSzvk8k8_20251121_064443.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": 17901770277303288, "text": "係咪好似我哋條命一樣整定先？", "created_at": "2025-11-21T08:18:27", "owner": "matthew_wong_origami", "likes": 105}, {"id": 18336454348233971, "text": "幾多成熟？😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T06:47:08", "owner": "alvin.c_", "likes": 34}, {"id": 17910721974252885, "text": "你地幾時出翻個薯條？好掛住個薯條", "created_at": "2025-11-21T19:25:01", "owner": "d_l_rxs.ts__", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18057107990306576, "text": "一切就上枱", "created_at": "2025-11-21T07:48:01", "owner": "wavetattoo1102", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18004141082672240, "text": "係咪秒上？", "created_at": "2025-11-21T06:52:32", "owner": "bysing", "likes": 50}, {"id": 18087124090802135, "text": "@ikeahongkong 係咪咁Juicy 㗎？因為小弟食過幾次你哋嘅牛扒。個口感都硬過我條命。😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:01:46", "owner": "joshchan721", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18048560249389925, "text": "69 好野黎", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:51:05", "owner": "myhoriz0n", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104272921640916, "text": "@tonychu1227", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:42:13", "owner": "julien.orr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17956980692888979, "text": "0分重作", "created_at": "2025-11-21T11:48:21", "owner": "samsamwong.wss", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18439090231101995, "text": "睇個樣似低溫慢煮😮", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:20:38", "owner": "timothy_yiu00", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18168197746384006, "text": "唔該講清楚唔係真係去咗澳牛😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:36:24", "owner": "chickita3388", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17844439338605989, "text": "可摸以一次過嗌埋杯嘢飲?", "created_at": "2025-11-21T11:29:33", "owner": "citruschinose", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18119867587538807, "text": "澳門會不會有？😢", "created_at": "2025-12-01T04:15:54", "owner": "angelwui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890408905374832, "text": "塊野就好似同小編咁，係唔熟嘅？😭", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:13:06", "owner": "yyyymmmerory", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18086718146487209, "text": "冇炒蛋喎🙃", "created_at": "2025-11-21T08:15:42", "owner": "jchan0609", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18006987863658879, "text": "小編啲英文勁到癲", "created_at": "2025-11-22T23:55:38", "owner": "chingtochung", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17922385827186731, "text": "食ikea澳牛起碼唔會俾伙記屌。", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:04:31", "owner": "ksclll", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18022840172598756, "text": "澳牛:咪撚抽我水.", "created_at": "2025-11-23T14:28:36", "owner": "l021", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17988916439879346, "text": "Sor for 錯重點 🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-22T23:55:49", "owner": "chingtochung", "likes": 1}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3767830344059006612, "shortcode": "DRKBbwvky6U", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRKBbwvky6U/", "taken_at": "2025-11-17T11:53:46", "caption": "一個好的教練要做到發多球精準和穩定！#乒乓球 #零基礎學乒乓 #日常訓練", "owner_username": "winmoney_777", "owner_id": "12030863023", "likes": 12677, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0145_DRKBbwvky6U\\DRKBbwvky6U_20251117_115346.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18081292019032705, "text": "教練一邊畫餅，一邊展現實力", "created_at": "2025-11-19T12:39:24", "owner": "grey.lin", "likes": 1649}, {"id": 18435677539099951, "text": "太厲害了 教練一直在給自己精神加油", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:34:13", "owner": "jinghejian", "likes": 223}, {"id": 17898993255186239, "text": "是教練在練球還是學員在練球？", "created_at": "2025-11-21T08:23:38", "owner": "junen_0624", "likes": 563}, {"id": 18049276013398222, "text": "這是在展示教練的穩定性", "created_at": "2025-11-21T11:47:58", "owner": "kerry_1996_", "likes": 390}, {"id": 18027753569777947, "text": "穿羽絨外套的教練好厲害喔", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:58:47", "owner": "ac_802_", "likes": 82}, {"id": 18544587550061243, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:41:22", "owner": "david_chao_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18029777324553160, "text": "不動反而簡單 還要菜鳥亂回  教練喂球才累", "created_at": "2025-11-23T12:18:37", "owner": "demons701121", "likes": 49}, {"id": 18538106902061975, "text": "欸這真的，我第一堂課教練就是這樣跟我玩說拍子拿好就打得到然後🥲", "created_at": "2025-11-27T13:39:58", "owner": "chika._.0604", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17901562863312718, "text": "老闆的兒子來打工所獲得的待遇……", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:12:04", "owner": "zhiheng749", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18103227931725922, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:19:29", "owner": "japanlover940", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17962908999005748, "text": "手塚區訓練營", "created_at": "2025-11-19T09:40:21", "owner": "shuxuan.gao", "likes": 61}, {"id": 18028716596751625, "text": "@ka.wwn_ 諗起你暑sem reg🏓,我教你打波嗰時🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-21T16:37:37", "owner": "carrie_lustforlife", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086020543996182, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T11:59:25", "owner": "akiraun", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18076333366968885, "text": "教練在跨自己吧🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-25T09:42:34", "owner": "ra_0723", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089405923756350, "text": "講嘢的是教練，打球兩位是學員😂", "created_at": "2025-11-28T17:01:33", "owner": "verdayu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099043399633238, "text": "有這麼厲害的教練，還真有機會進國家隊呢", "created_at": "2025-12-07T06:21:34", "owner": "iamchrishsu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18379366417194886, "text": "花錢買腳本刷擊球數", "created_at": "2025-11-20T18:15:40", "owner": "rayuser", "likes": 29}, {"id": 17936685497983383, "text": "情緒價值給好給滿", "created_at": "2025-11-28T00:29:19", "owner": "authentic_symphony", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902688100167152, "text": "看不懂你就輸了，這是教練在用其他方式行銷包裝自己😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T15:47:31", "owner": "uni__060111", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18103968685652838, "text": "教練真準", "created_at": "2025-11-23T12:15:38", "owner": "kenchan870317", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17930691816139815, "text": "這教練 沒能進國家隊啊。 我還以為是拿拍不動的是教練。", "created_at": "2025-12-07T06:57:08", "owner": "loveapple0211", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105796654712161, "text": "太像了", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:57:24", "owner": "jiaheng002", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071609723364696, "text": "太棒拉，可以罰企一小時😂", "created_at": "2025-11-29T05:32:13", "owner": "simon__1225", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083135944873236, "text": "左邊教練 右邊學員 （x", "created_at": "2025-12-05T14:16:58", "owner": "zer.ouo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331720369212283, "text": "他在自誇", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:01:41", "owner": "jiayouhong", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18017689136794798, "text": "@lovebobo0218", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:57:22", "owner": "shengjiec", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860132401543060, "text": "体验课一般是不要钱的，教练这样是为了让他买课", "created_at": "2025-11-26T00:42:52", "owner": "hideaway_tt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18107818417619751, "text": "手塚區", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:48:50", "owner": "han_zhin_hsu", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18096718711890511, "text": "教練其實是講給自己聽的", "created_at": "2025-12-10T03:00:36", "owner": "rc8hd_0810", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064889123182630, "text": "高难度", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:03:17", "owner": "yeochengwah", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075767840265495, "text": "@zheng05_09 我也想玩這個", "created_at": "2025-12-06T03:27:27", "owner": "antoney0512", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17984401616914522, "text": "@chanwengmay 你學下野", "created_at": "2025-11-19T13:03:06", "owner": "cat3.lau", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18299883415280973, "text": "我做射箭教練，見到拉不開弓的同學，直接說：同學射箭不適合你，你玩別的吧，乒乓球也行。", "created_at": "2025-12-10T13:42:55", "owner": "alankwoklun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087017813052471, "text": "好像打了又好像沒打", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:17:08", "owner": "shenasu0224", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["乒乓球", "零基礎學乒乓", "日常訓練"]},
