ting traction with this one", "created_at": "2025-11-20T04:49:34", "owner": "kwili_chloe", "likes": 15}, {"id": 17987299004906592, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-20T04:36:17", "owner": "avimorian_", "likes": 21689}, {"id": 18085271141009040, "text": "Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa Aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaand post", "created_at": "2025-11-20T04:28:29", "owner": "blackexcellence12524", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18056632568297861, "text": "How does the school let him do that😭", "created_at": "2025-11-20T04:27:57", "owner": "my_thridacc", "likes": 24892}, {"id": 18352692553166259, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-20T03:53:19", "owner": "creativepicklejar", "likes": 1358}, {"id": 18166460287378039, "text": "So that’s what those signs were for😭", "created_at": "2025-11-20T03:26:39", "owner": "joshpot82", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18027001940567850, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-20T03:24:53", "owner": "xman_1015", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17843750511616633, "text": "Yall getting out of control 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-20T03:11:57", "owner": "ya_boi_mrp", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18058928717537078, "text": "This makes me want to go", "created_at": "2025-11-20T02:52:10", "owner": "_twinkubus", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18075661715226967, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-20T02:34:11", "owner": "pyrevlret", "likes": 62740}, {"id": 17993506070706368, "text": "who is that cutie in the center 😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-20T02:14:53", "owner": "your_sevv", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18097992583765928, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-20T02:04:34", "owner": "blnkaholic", "likes": 27}, {"id": 18137765785462322, "text": "HELL YEAH IM WITH BRO ON THE FUTA'S FREE MY MANS", "created_at": "2025-11-20T01:32:43", "owner": "uninetc", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18086839060963870, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-20T01:24:18", "owner": "msmith062410", "likes": 501}, {"id": 17903653593289272, "text": "Man on the right knows ball", "created_at": "2025-11-20T01:08:07", "owner": "daatoneguyy", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18026419901685882, "text": "SCORE BOAAARDDDDDD", "created_at": "2025-11-19T23:56:16", "owner": "natorade3825", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18383848786198537, "text": "ansh was right abt everything btw", "created_at": "2025-11-19T23:40:27", "owner": "sonyablvd", "likes": 143}, {"id": 17856923718505904, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T23:07:52", "owner": "xxunderyoubedxx", "likes": 841}, {"id": 18004835453822441, "text": "FU WHAAAAT", "created_at": "2025-11-19T22:55:07", "owner": "wsgdeja.alt", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18118130965530322, "text": "The futa card lowkey fried me", "created_at": "2025-11-19T22:48:02", "owner": "4stringed_lifter23", "likes": 4196}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["lymanband", "trumpets", "mpa", "marchingband", "trumpet", "lymantrumpets", "band", "lyman"]},
{"media_id": 3766759122624736182, "shortcode": "DRGN3cCgmu2UhJg-S4WvAcX0eaBHyzFUoqqVLo0", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRGN3cCgmu2UhJg-S4WvAcX0eaBHyzFUoqqVLo0/", "taken_at": "2025-11-16T00:25:07", "caption": "", "owner_username": "lailaagreensmith", "owner_id": "5909670581", "likes": 56, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphImage", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0150_DRGN3cCgmu2UhJg-S4WvAcX0eaBHyzFUoqqVLo0\\DRGN3cCgmu2UhJg-S4WvAcX0eaBHyzFUoqqVLo0_20251116_002507.jpg"}], "comments": [], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3765065518764987684, "shortcode": "DRAMyQiDxUk", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRAMyQiDxUk/", "taken_at": "2025-11-13T16:20:40", "caption": "If what’s wrong with me had a face, it would wear a tired smile — the kind that tries to hide a storm behind polite laughter. Its eyes would carry sleepless nights and unspoken thoughts, reflecting both exhaustion and resilience. It would walk quietly through crowded rooms, pretending to be fine, blending in just enough so no one asks too many questions. That face wouldn’t be scary or loud — it would be familiar, like the version of me I meet in the mirror when no one’s watching.\n\nIt would speak in whispers, not words — a constant hum of overthinking, self-doubt, and restless energy. Every expression on that face would change with the weight of expectation — sometimes anxious, sometimes numb, and sometimes lost in a thousand unfinished thoughts. It wouldn’t need to say anything; the heaviness beneath its silence would already be enough to fill the room. That face would be the reflection of everything I never knew how to explain — not broken, but bruised by too much pretending.\n\nAnd yet, beneath the cracks and the tired eyes, there’d be something stubbornly alive — a quiet hope that refuses to die. The face of what’s wrong with me wouldn’t just show pain; it would also show endurance. It would be the face of someone who keeps showing up, who keeps trying even when it hurts. Because sometimes, the only thing stronger than what’s wrong with you… is the part of you that keeps fighting to make it right.", "owner_username": "metaminutes", "owner_id": "76953464925", "likes": 162072, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0151_DRAMyQiDxUk\\DRAMyQiDxUk_20251113_162040.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18080499338138634, "text": "What is that?", "created_at": "2025-11-18T06:33:23", "owner": "soniyogam", "likes": 198}, {"id": 18083153258108812, "text": "Sometimes you wake up and choose violence", "created_at": "2025-11-18T03:23:09", "owner": "theroosterscomb", "likes": 17275}, {"id": 17866759464498054, "text": "The disbelief in her eyes", "created_at": "2025-11-18T10:28:12", "owner": "artyomkasinski", "likes": 11144}, {"id": 18094708678845636, "text": "I didn’t know you can do that.", "created_at": "2025-11-18T08:29:34", "owner": "shreyasnagaprasad", "likes": 3349}, {"id": 18049059863397665, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T05:54:50", "owner": "jasonpeterman", "likes": 6673}, {"id": 17845944369594920, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T14:04:44", "owner": "g00dv1b3zz_", "likes": 273}, {"id": 17963898950868385, "text": "This was kinda satisfying to see (the coin)", "created_at": "2025-11-18T12:57:08", "owner": "vitu_gonzaga", "likes": 1153}, {"id": 17926980195151795, "text": "She was scared of you after that moment 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T09:49:07", "owner": "andyx317", "likes": 2591}, {"id": 18003596432674681, "text": "S tier rage bait", "created_at": "2025-11-18T12:17:30", "owner": "_vrizon15", "likes": 1107}, {"id": 17993546492714615, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:48:47", "owner": "max_garysh", "likes": 46}, {"id": 18076407586982614, "text": "El tipo recordó que tiene libre albedrío", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:47:44", "owner": "yo31_yo", "likes": 32}, {"id": 18085531702993822, "text": "She had so much pre build up joy that just got shattered 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T12:56:08", "owner": "der_orakel", "likes": 32}, {"id": 17888535201384249, "text": "But beautiful eyes", "created_at": "2025-11-18T19:51:38", "owner": "_stumpie", "likes": 185}, {"id": 18085658872954371, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T12:46:35", "owner": "bubbly.r___", "likes": 13}, {"id": 17866555641490308, "text": "I'm doing this next time", "created_at": "2025-11-18T08:08:18", "owner": "dakotaharbert", "likes": 534}, {"id": 18053738912648684, "text": "Bro she is beautiful 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:27:30", "owner": "the_kid_fglbc", "likes": 46}, {"id": 18088379123477613, "text": "Damn she's beautiful", "created_at": "2025-11-19T00:17:28", "owner": "tommxp2", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18021633557788838, "text": "Damn, I haven't seen one of these since McDonalds back in 06😢", "created_at": "2025-11-18T17:40:30", "owner": "shraggle", "likes": 11}, {"id": 18056361695312842, "text": "It goes in the square hole", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:26:56", "owner": "2bulldogsoffroad", "likes": 114}, {"id": 17870776389391223, "text": "If \"What is wrong with you?\" had a face.", "created_at": "2025-11-18T11:47:31", "owner": "milzbury", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18106478521728460, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T15:34:00", "owner": "mi_sha_y3", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18087948091944650, "text": "Her face is so beautiful it’s soothing to look at", "created_at": "2025-11-18T18:10:35", "owner": "e.o_0z", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18192553735327363, "text": "Break the matrix", "created_at": "2025-11-18T11:49:03", "owner": "drifting_yoda", "likes": 31}, {"id": 18077139809178152, "text": "Man discovers he has free will", "created_at": "2025-11-19T00:10:55", "owner": "dario6934", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18100406917706846, "text": "Astonishing use of free will 👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-23T12:32:35", "owner": "danchorlton", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17993962772707533, "text": "It should be illégal to do this", "created_at": "2025-11-25T18:34:39", "owner": "m0i_boubix", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18063046784180534, "text": "reminds me of that video of the lady breaking down inside as the guy puts all the shaped blocks through the same board hole.", "created_at": "2025-11-23T00:53:45", "owner": "the_occupant_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17867963154479800, "text": "Dude I literally did that 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T00:02:55", "owner": "bluegenhorgen_akacrazyeyes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113872186601341, "text": "I dislike this person.", "created_at": "2025-12-04T16:52:11", "owner": "nuker_nathan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078448297924074, "text": "If “what is wrong with you?!” was a face.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:48:37", "owner": "rnketobowler", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080217101155021, "text": "I’m not playing your silly games", "created_at": "2025-11-22T22:43:41", "owner": "wesson9955", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17893611222224371, "text": "I am from Germany and I don’t get it 🤨 we don’t have this things here. What is she supposed to do?", "created_at": "2025-11-19T13:12:05", "owner": "norman_mps", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18025761965771156, "text": "She’s gorgeous", "created_at": "2025-11-18T20:13:45", "owner": "h.alsaqer97", "likes": 19}, {"id": 18057572336269822, "text": "Wtf is that? Someone tell me without jokes or lies", "created_at": "2025-11-19T05:57:56", "owner": "fentagon", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17863345647524711, "text": "This is the kind of face that people make when you open a KitKat and just start taking bites out of it.", "created_at": "2025-11-18T05:44:06", "owner": "endofabraham", "likes": 58}, {"id": 17844347016601694, "text": "I’m bringing these back", "created_at": "2025-11-18T12:54:10", "owner": "barelybarbie1", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18291953254275250, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:38:44", "owner": "phantom_joe_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088364006477306, "text": "@zara.lee0", "created_at": "2025-11-21T16:51:57", "owner": "adslegend", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18099422329751939, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T04:57:21", "owner": "meian0777", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18078525014167525, "text": "Di luar Nurdin 😐", "created_at": "2025-11-19T12:35:27", "owner": "basjodi_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18102630511734066, "text": "She took personal offense to that", "created_at": "2025-11-18T11:03:37", "owner": "will_i_aintnt", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18229342549307017, "text": "Beautiful use of free will", "created_at": "2025-11-18T08:32:26", "owner": "valeriy_ivanishin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18058777325306222, "text": "Thats the type of behavior who walks around in tighty whites and shoes on", "created_at": "2025-12-14T04:42:12", "owner": "star_iv2107", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081082082126074, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-14T04:41:39", "owner": "that_one.outfielder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082238213132800, "text": "Problem?", "created_at": "2025-12-14T01:23:01", "owner": "0r4ng3_m4f1a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942328471091392, "text": "QUE PELOTUDO JAJAJAJA", "created_at": "2025-12-13T19:05:56", "owner": "ckgarci", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909911155267345, "text": "Perfect moment to whisper \"gravityyyyy\" with a grin", "created_at": "2025-12-13T11:32:42", "owner": "chow_has_fun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904420834314954, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T10:39:17", "owner": "davidthepizzaeater", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061176227248384, "text": "When it goes in the wrong hole and they cant figure out if they like it", "created_at": "2025-12-13T05:26:00", "owner": "smurfyeahbiznitches", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094486354724693, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T04:23:12", "owner": "miss_cookieeee_e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18206128225317675, "text": "Nice cans", "created_at": "2025-12-13T04:23:01", "owner": "miss_cookieeee_e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106429897711026, "text": "TATO🗣️", "created_at": "2025-12-12T15:14:38", "owner": "woyjteck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18204134359318457, "text": "To be fair, that coin slowly fading out it's satisfying", "created_at": "2025-12-12T12:08:56", "owner": "unat_1988", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099478516759653, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-12T09:11:23", "owner": "powelly_1985", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18328958725214884, "text": "This creature wanted to steal a coin from a man, but the man turned out to be smarter.", "created_at": "2025-12-12T06:55:55", "owner": "esikod_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093017405504857, "text": "The \"why would you rob me of my pleasure?\" look", "created_at": "2025-12-12T06:16:28", "owner": "willoudt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022093133791846, "text": "“in case you didn’t see” ahh captions", "created_at": "2025-12-12T03:15:21", "owner": "keepitez_11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17955582539900586, "text": "Worth it just to see her face button ------>", "created_at": "2025-12-12T01:13:16", "owner": "notnot.isaac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081766235470385, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-12T00:34:43", "owner": "bertraz8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072974558582640, "text": "Robbing the joy from the autistic kid", "created_at": "2025-12-11T22:35:13", "owner": "dr.mindblender", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18432425341128123, "text": "I hear someone says “cazzo”", "created_at": "2025-12-11T18:01:50", "owner": "cheers_iove", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981757344939334, "text": "“How could you do that”", "created_at": "2025-12-11T11:35:07", "owner": "wzzerrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868688635489690, "text": "Worst use of free will ever. 0/10", "created_at": "2025-12-11T11:32:04", "owner": "casa.demeyer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119410387557150, "text": "That's the way in NPC's look at you when you don't respond to their question", "created_at": "2025-12-11T09:08:00", "owner": "jb_smith32", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074011166361333, "text": "I have intrusive thoughts and I follow them the trick is not being a total menace", "created_at": "2025-12-11T06:18:02", "owner": "shua5250", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331158148246084, "text": "He skip the animation😂", "created_at": "2025-12-11T03:50:59", "owner": "javierch3n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100172638699393, "text": "The betrayal", "created_at": "2025-12-11T01:44:31", "owner": "notanothersatchfan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18548946517011458, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:32:49", "owner": "silencershop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087310598062926, "text": "Too many words. 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-10T18:25:18", "owner": "bobarobbob11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061274942639852, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-10T13:35:58", "owner": "aluminiowy_syriusz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073382798038863, "text": "He asked to borrow a quarter. It was her only one. 🤣 that’s how I see this situation.", "created_at": "2025-12-10T04:23:59", "owner": "maze2.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084594707015600, "text": "She’s really searching their eyes and face for an answer lolll", "created_at": "2025-12-10T04:17:07", "owner": "athr3e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084931456847005, "text": "Her entire day was ruined just then", "created_at": "2025-12-09T19:26:09", "owner": "gymrat40.es", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071475629597468, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-09T05:10:28", "owner": "lucifer_988", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967032702998791, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-09T04:20:52", "owner": "ignacio.friant", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982523262938190, "text": "You can see her switch between wtf is wrong with you - and well I guess it doesn’t matter - and back to wtf", "created_at": "2025-12-09T02:27:36", "owner": "steaminnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858424006561963, "text": "That was infinitely more entertaining than what would’ve happened", "created_at": "2025-12-09T01:05:44", "owner": "wheesht94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004511159825744, "text": "I hate you.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T00:36:27", "owner": "konattaizumi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18410350816142787, "text": "Can’t get over her beautiful face", "created_at": "2025-12-08T23:42:38", "owner": "hugoadrianbr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144647608446951, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-08T22:05:27", "owner": "j.l.dumire", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080008549924439, "text": "If what is wrong with you had a face", "created_at": "2025-12-08T21:07:24", "owner": "cufirebubbles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075149816008483, "text": "Valid though. Wtf", "created_at": "2025-12-08T16:54:41", "owner": "plav6187", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18422326780119230, "text": "Never gets old", "created_at": "2025-12-08T06:17:05", "owner": "crowface13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079933262266566, "text": "She was gonna stim so hard to this and you ruined it.", "created_at": "2025-12-08T04:02:59", "owner": "jmpllt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110218252625455, "text": "Jew? 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-12-08T00:36:44", "owner": "mz3deadpool", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981871587923636, "text": "The Dax Flame stare.", "created_at": "2025-12-07T23:44:35", "owner": "christophslats", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068219471421250, "text": "What is that machine", "created_at": "2025-12-07T18:25:06", "owner": "maidelusionalhu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842235493648876, "text": "What's wrong with donating?", "created_at": "2025-12-07T17:13:21", "owner": "hachoo_marshall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136485694461357, "text": "11/10 rage bait", "created_at": "2025-12-06T21:19:41", "owner": "phalendavis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025641146593510, "text": "Fastest wins", "created_at": "2025-12-06T19:41:34", "owner": "crashoveride72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961153930041137, "text": "Chaotic neutral", "created_at": "2025-12-06T16:08:51", "owner": "baronjoon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080762606134885, "text": "You need jailed for that", "created_at": "2025-12-06T15:16:39", "owner": "baconarmy2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892478074242313, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-06T14:11:03", "owner": "montypill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952909720021585, "text": "Pissed off... Offended, even.", "created_at": "2025-12-06T11:03:04", "owner": "obj.071", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103178806666735, "text": "NPC mode 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T23:10:37", "owner": "mr_nobody1261", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028229165571709, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-05T15:32:28", "owner": "rlidiaev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541351810026042, "text": "I hate you. Just because of that I completely fully hate you.", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:43:09", "owner": "lagoon_racoon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142066609456063, "text": "The blink as though this must be a bad dream", "created_at": "2025-12-05T04:43:15", "owner": "rsandlin01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079427713934451, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T02:25:44", "owner": "jesseforrester", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997630440705704, "text": "In Summary…", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:25:28", "owner": "donkeyking_tube", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895694527360323, "text": "Some people just want to get straight to the point, and i respect that", "created_at": "2025-12-04T19:04:47", "owner": "esoto91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095650204684612, "text": "Thnx for the caption above, I didn’t understand what the GREEN caption IN THE MIDDLE OF THE SCREEN said", "created_at": "2025-12-04T02:37:15", "owner": "tygo__036", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858555964560062, "text": "He’s with the wrong person he could do better", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:30:05", "owner": "johnnyboiwastly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18188175823337415, "text": "My goal is to make everyone I know make this face anytime I do anything. 😆", "created_at": "2025-12-03T11:16:38", "owner": "svenanarki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18191965972326459, "text": "If that's the face I'll keep wrong 🌹♥️🗿", "created_at": "2025-12-03T05:25:05", "owner": "alexislopez9893", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945428233074402, "text": "Where is Kira when you need him", "created_at": "2025-12-02T22:11:37", "owner": "alfie.bentley.12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064067132181292, "text": "Valid", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:08:10", "owner": "rizzy_is", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081452318128864, "text": "What's the issue? Isn't it supposed to go in there? 😏", "created_at": "2025-12-02T05:48:28", "owner": "quintessantgreatness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027540770784646, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T04:02:44", "owner": "straw_hat_420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868246804493912, "text": "Id do the same tho", "created_at": "2025-12-01T18:04:33", "owner": "vladimir4550", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112477318580935, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T15:58:34", "owner": "gaboc.joya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049080758682353, "text": "cool", "created_at": "2025-11-30T10:46:51", "owner": "shota_painter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033112745725456, "text": "That’s when you have adhd and the stim does not happen and now this person will suffer for eternity until something pretty and shiny distracts her", "created_at": "2025-11-30T02:14:13", "owner": "chrismitchell529", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075816701583824, "text": "The face of someone suddenly questioning the entirety of their years long relationship with you and wondering how they can start ending things before they make the mistake of having children with you", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:49:28", "owner": "naftoor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067985219622055, "text": "Some people just want to watch the world burn", "created_at": "2025-11-29T22:52:23", "owner": "dinger_80", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004774001824214, "text": "Called wormhole", "created_at": "2025-11-29T14:29:14", "owner": "the_real_ccb83", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546809083007381, "text": "She looked at him like he was some sort of an abomination", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:40:34", "owner": "raoulweinrich", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18032074535728036, "text": "appropriate reaction", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:54:25", "owner": "for_ever.dive", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086080004079654, "text": "Eyes darting.  Scanning.  Searching for a reason.  An inkling would suffice.  A clue even.  Why.  Why?", "created_at": "2025-11-28T16:15:02", "owner": "80hdennis_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026671589583989, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-28T09:41:31", "owner": "arckanexsmt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973163658806483, "text": "iPad kid", "created_at": "2025-11-28T04:45:54", "owner": "benflikeid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900383095338990, "text": "Might as well put it in the square hole", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:26:02", "owner": "australian.cattle.dog.scout", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089916415754425, "text": "She could awake Sharingan at this moment", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:37:13", "owner": "willcunhacardoso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858040801557798, "text": "I don’t get it", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:57:55", "owner": "tedcon2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049488053388451, "text": "Work smarter not harder.", "created_at": "2025-11-27T07:27:23", "owner": "darcyisradtattooist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143565103458263, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T05:50:26", "owner": "mariusnunes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089518531767930, "text": "Don’t waste Pennie’s guys", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:46:31", "owner": "alexander_21318", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098076106636443, "text": "Like you did the universe wrong...lol", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:22:16", "owner": "stevenvcollins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067703930121099, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T23:14:22", "owner": "danniel.edgr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088028161783008, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:01:32", "owner": "christopher_hennessey_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159580909396731, "text": "NPCs in VR games when you do something the programmers did not foresee", "created_at": "2025-11-26T13:56:34", "owner": "blue_is_not_on_fire", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067347959119270, "text": "Before she grew up into the lady who couldn't handle the video of the person putting all the different shapes into the circle hole. 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-26T06:38:20", "owner": "stanae86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18330441541241692, "text": "Free will", "created_at": "2025-11-26T04:34:03", "owner": "tnvijaya_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843125227625298, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T04:27:41", "owner": "33omario", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17947561455052792, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T03:10:46", "owner": "kabochakaizoku", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17978223353938165, "text": "Somebody please explain", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:34:07", "owner": "saud_83_._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075210595990741, "text": "😂😂😂 square hole", "created_at": "2025-11-25T14:28:48", "owner": "vpmadmv6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134049469471173, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:59:55", "owner": "luccash.m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100382683706555, "text": "What’s that?", "created_at": "2025-11-25T10:49:04", "owner": "allysson7988", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976584804948083, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T08:36:53", "owner": "kaotekphotography", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027788654765329, "text": "kawaii", "created_at": "2025-11-25T07:09:50", "owner": "dedenismailhermansyah", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863864278520234, "text": "She looked him like this is not even funny there is something terribly terribly wrong with you but I don't know what it is.", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:59:55", "owner": "jason.watkins.986", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031632581737636, "text": "she lowkey feelin' like her soul is gettin' cut up", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:27:26", "owner": "imot_dtt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000118250689652, "text": "Premature", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:55:45", "owner": "tavarezisrealsweat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079435009925901, "text": "She looks like she just discovered humans exist", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:33:22", "owner": "mmm_itsdarby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099399382743871, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:29:44", "owner": "alanx_gt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18189907957340424, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T09:31:48", "owner": "renezastrow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946867200934366, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T08:10:20", "owner": "hazymeiz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883570138410479, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:34:47", "owner": "__yang0920__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056718074647350, "text": "Todsünde sage ich.", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:11:18", "owner": "kimmy130499", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058869986629943, "text": "Red pill behavior. “He’s beginning to believe.”", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:04:39", "owner": "gonderwilliam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876412555355009, "text": "He cut to the chase. Who enjoys money going down a hole?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:04:43", "owner": "cali_burns", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18549467455057005, "text": "Hmm ...I should call her", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:32:27", "owner": "patrix.rx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060151343641780, "text": "All of the internet had that face", "created_at": "2025-11-23T21:43:05", "owner": "wolfe.sly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093067147880404, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T21:18:32", "owner": "dylankheath", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076881142964172, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:48:06", "owner": "meussieu.r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083546158864202, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:34:19", "owner": "iron01010110", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032160617739793, "text": "the second caption at the video thinking it did something lmao", "created_at": "2025-11-23T18:54:04", "owner": "yourneighborhood_trashcan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988384752907437, "text": "ㅋㅋ", "created_at": "2025-11-23T18:03:02", "owner": "jeiteaeichi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968405730970646, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T16:18:38", "owner": "sharky_237_1112", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086638018792367, "text": "Cuánto daño", "created_at": "2025-11-23T15:49:47", "owner": "lea.en.fotos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974052000956899, "text": "She was genuinely angry. She was angry like he stole something from her.", "created_at": "2025-11-23T12:23:54", "owner": "iroquoispliskin86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914182015094051, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T12:12:10", "owner": "holycarrotferretparrot_its", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066873239115987, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T11:44:19", "owner": "ragebrowsensei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17874047835450942, "text": "BLASPHEMY", "created_at": "2025-11-23T10:04:20", "owner": "enzo_lolohea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896654971204387, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T07:31:57", "owner": "datz.life", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073975160340009, "text": "⏰️", "created_at": "2025-11-23T06:29:13", "owner": "hardik_7080", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064139234610198, "text": "That's what happens to someone who skydive but forgot their parachute.", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:39:17", "owner": "namelessv6.2831853072", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048469472692836, "text": "I need her @", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:00:48", "owner": "aligathor.crocs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072558119202656, "text": "You definitely ruined her day🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-23T01:46:48", "owner": "songsthatjefflikes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008535662653257, "text": "The square, the square 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T00:01:58", "owner": "jozza14011987", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070283900361609, "text": "the humble black hole:", "created_at": "2025-11-22T23:24:10", "owner": "tzezhao_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878504902429892, "text": "Ah. Yes, free will", "created_at": "2025-11-22T22:34:09", "owner": "victorveramendi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066529019571082, "text": "Bro the look off disappointment 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:24:59", "owner": "giovannilaboy61", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18554828413062832, "text": "When i was a kid I did this and my aunt slapped me", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:57:19", "owner": "idk69263622", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100980205736360, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:18:58", "owner": "mad.manland", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094783357888415, "text": "who is the girl,i want follow her😭", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:17:39", "owner": "dean_76197", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144664159441060, "text": "Be ungovernable", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:13:12", "owner": "illillillyous", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080955665033102, "text": "Thinking outside the box 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:31:53", "owner": "ninaonairee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864128743527225, "text": "@laura_brown96", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:57:16", "owner": "liamwainman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18377407708156655, "text": "You took her only satisfaction in life😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:43:00", "owner": "phecabooth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921177745195995, "text": "When you have free will", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:46:07", "owner": "spiritdetective93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18199362709321343, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:34:24", "owner": "__wolphy__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159761443391922, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:08:25", "owner": "doctorfunk2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865360078511399, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:18:31", "owner": "donnieip", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048881684664859, "text": "Sometimes you gotta just be different and do your own thing even if it's weird", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:04:17", "owner": "photosbyphoenixllc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936224235981758, "text": "I like to take the actual enjoyment so I let it make 3/4 of the first time around then just push it.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:02:21", "owner": "ethanmcdougall420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099600796781719, "text": "That's right, it goes in the square hole.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:06:44", "owner": "alexan_set", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978446379933095, "text": "Square hole", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:08:40", "owner": "davidstewart4529", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100640524667475, "text": "But like… A true concerning \"what the fuck is wrong with you \"", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:00:17", "owner": "crash__666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18318965338220852, "text": "This dude pours milk before the cereal", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:31:59", "owner": "jungledude762", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112386151604145, "text": "This dude takes bites out of string cheese", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:31:37", "owner": "jungledude762", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986266941751506, "text": "Reminds me of those oblivion NPCs", "created_at": "2025-11-21T23:51:52", "owner": "3d_composer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077220568942929, "text": "This brought me so much joy. 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T23:17:49", "owner": "john.a.morse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059623817250270, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-21T22:54:41", "owner": "izzyp125", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973451871956323, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-21T22:46:25", "owner": "darkblades122_ttv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900878761317384, "text": "Why not? Faster this way. 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T21:31:24", "owner": "sahlan_rashid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070291895062181, "text": "I’m on her side with this one.", "created_at": "2025-11-21T21:21:45", "owner": "bill_just_bill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102521860733758, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-21T18:13:53", "owner": "amal.br.sajan051997", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065191892618296, "text": "What is that thing he dropped the coin in?", "created_at": "2025-11-21T17:54:51", "owner": "jayeburrell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18326806405208477, "text": "She's so pissed", "created_at": "2025-11-21T17:50:55", "owner": "elsaisdum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952297684024961, "text": "That blink too lol", "created_at": "2025-11-21T16:10:52", "owner": "rickardedenvik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18382457143194547, "text": "One times I did this thing and a kid grabbed the coin after one loop and walked away. I was dying laughing", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:58:51", "owner": "burnett_bros_exotic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952909840043398, "text": "I’ve seen the devil… he was much kinder than this…", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:54:09", "owner": "phauxie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074515538211335, "text": "\"WHERE'S YOUR WHIMSY????\"", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:52:54", "owner": "jerrelben", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071938052049698, "text": "@tired_actor", "created_at": "2025-11-21T12:13:23", "owner": "thatguythatstares", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083891942096240, "text": "ТЫ ЕБАНУТЫЙ? А НИ ЧО ТОТ ФАКТ ЧТО ДЛЯ МОНЕТКИ ТУТ ГОРКА?", "created_at": "2025-11-21T11:28:11", "owner": "voronetz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18394878169125755, "text": "Ohhhh the Anarchy.. 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T10:10:12", "owner": "gnomesss420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912357505239544, "text": "my dad was catching the coin just before it fell down multiple times 😂😂😂 but i was like just throw it in already", "created_at": "2025-11-21T09:40:58", "owner": "trex.rx8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951687148023172, "text": "The face🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-21T08:33:07", "owner": "haridutt0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113207329510586, "text": "Watching this irritates the fuck out of me.", "created_at": "2025-11-21T08:08:33", "owner": "drunkdumbfucks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953113330019097, "text": "They still have these???", "created_at": "2025-11-21T07:59:18", "owner": "solyt3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135810379480394, "text": "speedrun", "created_at": "2025-11-21T05:46:56", "owner": "schnabulator", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902231917164627, "text": "Different path same destination 🪔", "created_at": "2025-11-21T05:37:46", "owner": "horusvis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062082692631186, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-21T04:24:15", "owner": "mexico5555", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928723342154463, "text": "Drop it in without touching tbe funel", "created_at": "2025-11-21T03:44:56", "owner": "johnathan_smithsonian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065157674138814, "text": "Honestly I have the same face on right now.", "created_at": "2025-11-21T03:22:22", "owner": "randomwelder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968771493826169, "text": "Leave em guessing", "created_at": "2025-11-21T03:18:38", "owner": "douglasdougiedoug", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18377975878151821, "text": "The satisfaction he got from her discomfort was greater that if he rolled the coin the right way", "created_at": "2025-11-21T03:10:44", "owner": "joshua_parco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946581813936229, "text": "If foreplay was physics", "created_at": "2025-11-21T02:04:52", "owner": "dadrunswithscissors", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077508851163369, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-21T01:56:55", "owner": "peasantunpleasant", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066100325131707, "text": "Friendship ender right there", "created_at": "2025-11-21T01:43:15", "owner": "joe_pcp392", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087182509796867, "text": "I do this", "created_at": "2025-11-20T22:30:24", "owner": "half.ginger.tattie112", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103823065735951, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-20T20:44:58", "owner": "robb.a.p", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086888719942420, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-20T20:29:32", "owner": "_pepe_96_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067443260108034, "text": "Not gonna lie I would choose violence", "created_at": "2025-11-20T20:13:53", "owner": "ferro_mortum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954051246900050, "text": "I mean it is supposed to show how gravity works and it still does...", "created_at": "2025-11-20T19:20:16", "owner": "salty_harder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057304085276074, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-20T17:41:32", "owner": "wu_chaolin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18514157161071100, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-20T17:35:52", "owner": "schweizerlandjager", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866630788489765, "text": "Demonstration of an object in rest being affected by the source of gravity, instead of orbiting, it just falls towards it", "created_at": "2025-11-20T16:32:49", "owner": "tomas_luna_56", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971562726813253, "text": "Things that arent illegal but feel illegal", "created_at": "2025-11-20T15:29:28", "owner": "starrdoom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906933406269583, "text": "I don't understand", "created_at": "2025-11-20T12:05:48", "owner": "tristeutemps", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087146125792386, "text": "Why are people crushing on a ten year old girl 🤮", "created_at": "2025-11-20T09:51:25", "owner": "thetruth42x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065865467110891, "text": "I dont understand", "created_at": "2025-11-20T09:20:49", "owner": "hasssinate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028522106747151, "text": "idk but do I know her? seen her somewhere?", "created_at": "2025-11-20T08:10:44", "owner": "xyz__793", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947192611061196, "text": "This is the equivalent of square hole", "created_at": "2025-11-20T07:08:16", "owner": "mdzahidh404", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105961747714612, "text": "👁️👄👁️", "created_at": "2025-11-20T06:54:34", "owner": "wkndrcr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17862555807531530, "text": "When you want to crash out but children are near.", "created_at": "2025-11-20T06:40:44", "owner": "lawrchdrums", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164104264388083, "text": "I forgot those things existed", "created_at": "2025-11-20T05:20:01", "owner": "_fy2b_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086631503289769, "text": "NOT THE DRUMMER OF PIERCE THE VEIL REPOSTING THIS IN HIS STORY", "created_at": "2025-11-20T04:00:22", "owner": "seansational_15", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18291459436276067, "text": "Now look at the bottom, there's Jews collecting it", "created_at": "2025-11-20T02:13:42", "owner": "dra.nel.p", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054553706330607, "text": "I want to marry her", "created_at": "2025-11-20T00:46:37", "owner": "pmdw547", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094002718697656, "text": "Reaching my hand to grab that coin and force them to do it the right way", "created_at": "2025-11-20T00:14:59", "owner": "o_nizzle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050791724344642, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T23:48:23", "owner": "fuhrer_kenobi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083897399088808, "text": "It was as if his hand just gave up, he was probably as confused as she was, we'll never know", "created_at": "2025-11-19T23:39:37", "owner": "btgravitt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054880487320203, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T22:17:48", "owner": "shawnfelts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085669750825942, "text": "That expression needs to come with subtitles", "created_at": "2025-11-19T22:15:07", "owner": "ubersan_za", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052404185338732, "text": "The pain and disappointment 💀💀💀💀", "created_at": "2025-11-19T22:04:19", "owner": "xreapingwolf717x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099806068745521, "text": "Don’t let them know your next move", "created_at": "2025-11-19T21:56:07", "owner": "luke_75024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030488915536656, "text": "😂 priceless", "created_at": "2025-11-19T21:21:53", "owner": "xhle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17963934365972344, "text": "That's the equivalent of eating a kitkat sideways. I approve of this behavior", "created_at": "2025-11-19T21:13:10", "owner": "fj_dallas_tx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997307265702244, "text": "That’s a libertarian coin drop if I’ve ever seen one 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T20:52:42", "owner": "winterboswell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079095152123235, "text": "She was buffering like 2006 internet videos.", "created_at": "2025-11-19T20:52:15", "owner": "garthoug", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18369598912082420, "text": "Most ppl are just too simple nd basic to realize theres more to how itnset out to be", "created_at": "2025-11-19T20:35:28", "owner": "dumbass.don", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000369137684130, "text": "Jews be diving in that thing.", "created_at": "2025-11-19T20:30:48", "owner": "hab1b.tam1m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100457233667202, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T19:46:52", "owner": "cheese482me", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070090715370210, "text": "😂😂😂 ihr entsetzen", "created_at": "2025-11-19T19:21:59", "owner": "onkelingeborg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114092518508802, "text": "What's that?", "created_at": "2025-11-19T19:21:58", "owner": "ttvcrowmaulerg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876017182353509, "text": "Que bonita cara de wtf", "created_at": "2025-11-19T19:06:31", "owner": "cristian.prz.de.rosa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106549051625312, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T18:30:34", "owner": "seriousebastian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18166740997383502, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T18:17:03", "owner": "drey_melo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884838679402962, "text": "Rozchodový pohled 🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-19T18:03:02", "owner": "bouda_cz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024342527587994, "text": "Su cara de, acaso es humano?", "created_at": "2025-11-19T17:59:46", "owner": "quintanajth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893760316360926, "text": "Degenerate ellipse... a completely viable orbit👍", "created_at": "2025-11-19T17:58:13", "owner": "karan3.14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064872908424662, "text": "What's her @?", "created_at": "2025-11-19T17:29:10", "owner": "paul_rackhams", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047896145688840, "text": "Ella