9806, "text": "NPC seeing Players do what is not programmed to them", "created_at": "2025-11-19T09:56:05", "owner": "van_bao666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17938445679096169, "text": "Сломал систему 😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T09:54:10", "owner": "nakusatsu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098942233761227, "text": "Hahah", "created_at": "2025-11-19T09:50:12", "owner": "gertjan649", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101428750737480, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T09:40:31", "owner": "mattosan7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18025574339765290, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T09:27:11", "owner": "sujalshrivastav84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099157264694949, "text": "She's valid for that... da fck you doing!? 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T09:18:29", "owner": "benviloria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18410366653137554, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T09:17:44", "owner": "asianbro.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842491831620657, "text": "Maybe he doesnt want the 🧃ro grab it", "created_at": "2025-11-19T09:08:25", "owner": "hollowed_racist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873642766451253, "text": "Be thankful he didn't put it in the square hole.", "created_at": "2025-11-19T08:39:27", "owner": "whostransingyheplane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17878783620332230, "text": "worth every (single) penny", "created_at": "2025-11-19T08:36:02", "owner": "backupandaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066014054622448, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T08:34:09", "owner": "kgtuna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091694812728900, "text": "You’re supposed to throw it", "created_at": "2025-11-19T08:31:22", "owner": "marcus.beverage", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041978585702194, "text": "it’s been so long since i’ve seen one of these", "created_at": "2025-11-19T08:28:33", "owner": "teezooted", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107120416623287, "text": "😂🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-19T07:42:45", "owner": "donjuanqui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916849306208678, "text": "Can someone provide me with context I'm confused", "created_at": "2025-11-19T07:40:46", "owner": "better_call_harry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059163029257416, "text": "The messed up part is I can be both sides of this situation.", "created_at": "2025-11-19T07:25:14", "owner": "chrisbowman7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18165876181377069, "text": "Only LDs do it that way", "created_at": "2025-11-19T07:24:37", "owner": "majinjose81", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866896507482264, "text": "That moment of \"ho you're not who I thought you where... I'm in danger?\"", "created_at": "2025-11-19T07:20:00", "owner": "gregoryzapp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929530942139744, "text": "What’s a 5 Guys?", "created_at": "2025-11-19T07:11:14", "owner": "chris17_wong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112430407588707, "text": "Intrusive thought wins 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T06:58:50", "owner": "zal_fajar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908313865126535, "text": "If free will was a person", "created_at": "2025-11-19T06:47:29", "owner": "koceto_ksb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18294656425277986, "text": "@tianna_fining", "created_at": "2025-11-19T06:44:46", "owner": "luke.j.straw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974273679952043, "text": "Really Nigga !!!!😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T06:32:06", "owner": "davidlionelking25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086511076779537, "text": "She is 100% right on this one! Man is a monster 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T06:31:29", "owner": "higgsy_87_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896333485350726, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T06:27:08", "owner": "singhongstefanchang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071743430358771, "text": "What's her insta id?? (For research purposes)", "created_at": "2025-11-19T06:26:39", "owner": "kabir_darkdream", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065481455124221, "text": "bro got NPC", "created_at": "2025-11-19T06:14:47", "owner": "sandzzz__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092919685809844, "text": "Fair question.", "created_at": "2025-11-19T06:11:14", "owner": "scriv68au", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098393113823398, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T06:01:45", "owner": "kony_lao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18537919459011857, "text": "‘Jewish anus’ - the dark vortex of sucking coins", "created_at": "2025-11-19T05:54:26", "owner": "theshemhamforash", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18084650290988944, "text": "Да что ты такое несёшь черт возьми", "created_at": "2025-11-19T05:49:21", "owner": "sibastian_pereira1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950481343025559, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T05:45:39", "owner": "leninortizcruz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059290358261739, "text": "I sense bloodlust", "created_at": "2025-11-19T05:43:36", "owner": "marius_acz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908113396126977, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T05:42:52", "owner": "just_your_average_dave_the_4th", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086002780794122, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T05:37:23", "owner": "vladimirotrentini", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047008343447627, "text": "I microwaved a pickle and on a separate occasion my ice cream with the same shocked face from my boyfriend 2 seperate occasions", "created_at": "2025-11-19T05:37:14", "owner": "transdemigod", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842002297622725, "text": "he's a pro😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T05:36:58", "owner": "wadduup_11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087619921770680, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T05:34:59", "owner": "tramecruz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331790749215970, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T05:29:52", "owner": "cokelatttkacang", "likes": 100}, {"id": 18100470226773073, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T05:18:41", "owner": "yooiamryan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119847028529891, "text": "She absolutley killed him in his sleep later that night", "created_at": "2025-11-19T05:13:46", "owner": "quinn_lemonade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143885950432683, "text": "Having a good day? How bout now?", "created_at": "2025-11-19T05:10:05", "owner": "michaelgray1031", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941549245085205, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T04:51:33", "owner": "s.a.u.r.a.v", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083163449095544, "text": "I think this is the funniest thing I've ever seen on Instagram.", "created_at": "2025-11-19T04:51:23", "owner": "nathanael.seidel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901956517163081, "text": "Descubrió que el universo también fluye de formas más simples (?)", "created_at": "2025-11-19T04:47:37", "owner": "k0rbo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939217555095841, "text": "Who Is she,?", "created_at": "2025-11-19T04:45:19", "owner": "nico_fuhrman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111828385588489, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T04:38:48", "owner": "halougi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080203912896924, "text": "She needs a hockey stick to beat you", "created_at": "2025-11-19T04:35:02", "owner": "varunszindagi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097804060697017, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T04:33:55", "owner": "eseferofficial1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112852252579594, "text": "„WHY WLD YOU DEPRIVE YOURSELF OF THE JOY..\"", "created_at": "2025-11-19T04:29:56", "owner": "_ichor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18004283090821123, "text": "Skyrim npc looking at me be like", "created_at": "2025-11-19T04:28:05", "owner": "iammdsajeebchowdhury", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107402914626998, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T04:17:43", "owner": "irwinrfinau", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011621540639154, "text": "Lmao", "created_at": "2025-11-19T04:04:35", "owner": "k4lll4l", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867355426417562, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T04:04:20", "owner": "insuffer.ablelife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864855682434056, "text": "Her flabbers were absolutely gasted", "created_at": "2025-11-19T03:58:32", "owner": "the_pratagonist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853217281577030, "text": "She's like, what's the point it's going to end up there anyway?", "created_at": "2025-11-19T03:54:46", "owner": "arun_mozhi_devan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18315864946222039, "text": "Time is the most valuable asset", "created_at": "2025-11-19T03:51:19", "owner": "arr0gant_wizard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901460233318299, "text": "Great 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T03:39:22", "owner": "10carsten12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082585499033282, "text": "Just because you have free will doesn’t mean you always should", "created_at": "2025-11-19T03:35:36", "owner": "shooker88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106371943715935, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T03:31:17", "owner": "chudbuddly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069636968597400, "text": "She definitely gave him the coin too, lol!", "created_at": "2025-11-19T03:28:32", "owner": "glincman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539346649045271, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T03:24:46", "owner": "j_s.an", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903384502294603, "text": "Oh look, giant urinal", "created_at": "2025-11-19T03:21:07", "owner": "nathanrybner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000709307683856, "text": "Her reality just broke 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T03:19:00", "owner": "the_mechanical_butcher", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088474510758757, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T03:11:24", "owner": "siam_hasan_x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871442374387847, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T03:10:36", "owner": "charlie_lindsay__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118741525477809, "text": "Your eyes said\" WAIT BRO, WHAY YOU MADE THIS?\"", "created_at": "2025-11-19T03:04:43", "owner": "nathanael.firmo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913356721239225, "text": "I got the same look when I put my benis in that hole hehe", "created_at": "2025-11-19T03:04:39", "owner": "james527340", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118997725550685, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T03:03:25", "owner": "truegabriel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866844142484082, "text": "That's a beyblade stadium", "created_at": "2025-11-19T03:00:55", "owner": "yowingd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088403008752185, "text": "저런 반응인데 어떻게 안놀려 ㅋㅋㅋ", "created_at": "2025-11-19T02:56:17", "owner": "thugu.u", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143945107450009, "text": "Nesse caso, a violência não é uma resposta, mas sim uma pergunta... E a resposta é sim!🔥👊", "created_at": "2025-11-19T02:42:37", "owner": "daniel_c_mello", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085218677057365, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T02:24:13", "owner": "anderson.1111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062619173447481, "text": "I need a woman that looks at me like that. (Disappointment and concern)", "created_at": "2025-11-19T02:15:38", "owner": "peristeronic2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124990006508452, "text": "100% legal btw", "created_at": "2025-11-19T02:13:56", "owner": "w.ldg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072213404197792, "text": "Worth it!", "created_at": "2025-11-19T02:00:05", "owner": "jonahdent78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104036035638103, "text": "He eats burritos sideways and corn longways", "created_at": "2025-11-19T01:53:59", "owner": "jcsantos27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083301511863472, "text": "She literally could not fathom the audacity.", "created_at": "2025-11-19T01:49:49", "owner": "mel.irishjr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969057687968454, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T01:47:38", "owner": "dee_wreck01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935773497982870, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T01:46:20", "owner": "marcosmejias_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114344302502004, "text": "Recordó que tiene libre Albedrío", "created_at": "2025-11-19T01:32:02", "owner": "harold_petersilie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084381527065619, "text": "She actually seems genuinely concerned for your wellbeing", "created_at": "2025-11-19T01:25:06", "owner": "crazza64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055330157641952, "text": "Much more efficient 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T01:07:47", "owner": "robowelder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058694510267702, "text": "Don't let them know your next move. 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T01:07:34", "owner": "o.wanderlourenco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18412756984136834, "text": "\" Become the villain!.....Do it for the Plot!......\" Then when you finally start to win and get what you want come back and thank me later", "created_at": "2025-11-19T01:03:11", "owner": "jerrymouse009", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097556404699272, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T00:55:29", "owner": "_jhofz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134197570480699, "text": "If \"what is wrong with you?\" Had a face 😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😭😭😭😭😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-19T00:46:53", "owner": "thatfoochute", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086684546295818, "text": "Her: how dare you!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-19T00:41:59", "owner": "henrycarterphotography", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104430121647955, "text": "Basically, Risk of Rain lore, but with worms", "created_at": "2025-11-19T00:26:40", "owner": "ignacio_sin_h", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016548662794781, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T00:26:37", "owner": "eugnenfreeride2.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064363886437723, "text": "Love the small hand movement, like WTF?????🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-19T00:20:15", "owner": "isteflia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853696327574329, "text": "I believe discombobulation is what that look is.", "created_at": "2025-11-19T00:20:14", "owner": "kmonette87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18561413422042070, "text": "I did this as a child cause I couldn’t reach the thing to make it spin", "created_at": "2025-11-19T00:17:25", "owner": "th3_7363nd5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061014893557407, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T00:08:46", "owner": "j.c.dillinger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869361895396175, "text": "This is yet another government ploy to remove pennies", "created_at": "2025-11-19T00:05:27", "owner": "ventureswithbob", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060745076221919, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T00:03:09", "owner": "solo_climber_81", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869565487469467, "text": "Even the dude in the background was like wtf", "created_at": "2025-11-19T00:02:50", "owner": "shadowsn0w", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951416326024568, "text": "Someday, i hope i see myself on the background in video like this", "created_at": "2025-11-18T23:56:40", "owner": "skullervosloinen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071643689366871, "text": "Legit question, how is it meant to go?", "created_at": "2025-11-18T23:52:16", "owner": "the_dayyman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058362125635528, "text": "Don’t get it", "created_at": "2025-11-18T23:48:34", "owner": "koushiixx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930828949131399, "text": "She took that personal hahhaha", "created_at": "2025-11-18T23:36:52", "owner": "alony.one", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020311733792126, "text": "But why is the description so sad though? Did ChatGPT forget to take its meds again?", "created_at": "2025-11-18T23:29:51", "owner": "joe.txr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058707230540177, "text": "E o tal do livre arbítrio ne pai", "created_at": "2025-11-18T23:20:51", "owner": "brunocf.santos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956971815993410, "text": "That was the: \"You're using your free will wrong\" face", "created_at": "2025-11-18T23:03:24", "owner": "gventer88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999361848693312, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T22:57:24", "owner": "biggie_e4380", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069992456368343, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-11-18T22:54:05", "owner": "nikki.sanders1990", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17913757521090672, "text": "I think it's ai", "created_at": "2025-11-18T22:46:57", "owner": "matcha.nlia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079082099147003, "text": "🗣️ táto", "created_at": "2025-11-18T22:43:27", "owner": "matitjahu_81", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030890192743051, "text": "Good looking lass, but boss eyed!", "created_at": "2025-11-18T22:40:54", "owner": "redskin666", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986151489910870, "text": "I have never thought of doing that. You are evil.", "created_at": "2025-11-18T22:32:34", "owner": "craig_fisher75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932919286106739, "text": "Bem mais rápido assim 👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-18T22:28:46", "owner": "brunolemos83", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930930451115430, "text": "Diaappointed and realization all at the same tine", "created_at": "2025-11-18T22:26:00", "owner": "amadeustbearded", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889307899383925, "text": "Smash, next question.", "created_at": "2025-11-18T22:23:07", "owner": "dat_taint", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945899140067402, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T22:18:30", "owner": "ally_developer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081780551035839, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T22:14:53", "owner": "selky346", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18015659174626045, "text": "La cara de la decepción 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T22:13:12", "owner": "wilbouix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051576662658075, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T22:12:33", "owner": "crissbahari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030920675538821, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T22:09:16", "owner": "rvnyon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077109143226116, "text": "@1fridgemagnet", "created_at": "2025-11-18T21:51:12", "owner": "fleaborg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102037738734686, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T21:50:43", "owner": "deathgod002", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18379128811149730, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T21:40:59", "owner": "dark_329_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082533839116464, "text": "Some people need this type of therapy.", "created_at": "2025-11-18T21:37:00", "owner": "vincenthood", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109757947612290, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T21:22:29", "owner": "hiddenmelgar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047914703436104, "text": "I would just laugh out loud if I was her and then... that's the expectation with zero velocity 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T21:19:00", "owner": "johnson.carneiro", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110192755607737, "text": "Yip. I've done that to very similar reaction...", "created_at": "2025-11-18T21:13:41", "owner": "brickjamesbitch069", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18197926039325994, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T21:12:37", "owner": "houndxhunter1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027457532567928, "text": "Real ones know the dime isnt the best one to use", "created_at": "2025-11-18T21:10:49", "owner": "skyler_the_wizard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147027817437133, "text": "Suppose to be a simulation of a blackhole n I belive he was spot on how it really would suck u in", "created_at": "2025-11-18T21:10:16", "owner": "itsthakidd510", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038512112710414, "text": "You refuse to use the force?", "created_at": "2025-11-18T21:06:58", "owner": "jonesy406", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17845367487597031, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T21:06:51", "owner": "wilderness.mistress", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930309493148265, "text": "yeah, freewill baby.", "created_at": "2025-11-18T21:05:02", "owner": "lowcielva", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144234604432197, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T20:58:51", "owner": "bodenlee9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916987864219196, "text": "Hasta palida quedo de la impresion jaja", "created_at": "2025-11-18T20:56:12", "owner": "neto_yo_soy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928772593154299, "text": "I mean. If it’s open. I’d just drop it straight down", "created_at": "2025-11-18T20:42:49", "owner": "godspeed7538", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033283046721544, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T20:37:29", "owner": "metal_boy93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17945970486073946, "text": "Honestly.... Id be stunned too", "created_at": "2025-11-18T20:37:23", "owner": "sir_daniel_the_lll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899395915182705, "text": "The endorphins was ready to overstimulate", "created_at": "2025-11-18T20:34:53", "owner": "_crunchy_broccoli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18398213071132807, "text": "Must be the same guy who bites a kit Kat without breaking thrm apart", "created_at": "2025-11-18T20:17:29", "owner": "jessefritche", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085895191990416, "text": "Girl astonished by the power of free will", "created_at": "2025-11-18T20:16:20", "owner": "lost_eon_augury", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080299952131357, "text": "She’ll be in therapy because of that.", "created_at": "2025-11-18T20:02:06", "owner": "stevemiller101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080857144890913, "text": "To quote a famous movie \"Some people want to just watch the world burn\" 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T20:00:51", "owner": "starsharp84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002184404829875, "text": "Stolen happiness 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T19:58:58", "owner": "chriskozlo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543707056031935, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T19:49:06", "owner": "karlnordhammer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060237287538248, "text": "That felt wrong on all levels", "created_at": "2025-11-18T19:48:38", "owner": "nekodacolvin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18535858111054002, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T19:39:58", "owner": "dermihi79", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957648477878869, "text": "“See gravity is fake”", "created_at": "2025-11-18T19:39:44", "owner": "koby_kennnedy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867585517474744, "text": "I hope the judge gives her the full 30 years", "created_at": "2025-11-18T19:37:49", "owner": "john4_fc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539443384008858, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T19:35:46", "owner": "karoweski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18277028134303112, "text": "The face of a Karen", "created_at": "2025-11-18T19:33:02", "owner": "phil__201", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890804188242491, "text": "Girl said: what is wrong with you, I let you see my butterfly...", "created_at": "2025-11-18T19:10:20", "owner": "belenor85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997726455696432, "text": "Looks at him like he’s burning down a foster care home 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T19:08:22", "owner": "rubin.66.21.4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115390432544974, "text": "Que nadie sepa tu próximo movimiento.", "created_at": "2025-11-18T18:56:55", "owner": "maxrulitos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085776443482054, "text": "Bro does not care for your whimsical pleasantries", "created_at": "2025-11-18T18:42:43", "owner": "heff345", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18436209286101056, "text": "What kind of psychopath does this!? 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T18:39:47", "owner": "vincent_mchale", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076418711239156, "text": "You just killed me satisfaction expectations", "created_at": "2025-11-18T18:34:19", "owner": "dylanrose323", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977590230941191, "text": "I am only willing to make something unsatisfying if it upsets someone else bc it makes it satisfying again", "created_at": "2025-11-18T18:33:37", "owner": "matttt_mannnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877327393429228, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T18:20:00", "owner": "tienyingggg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916932985209353, "text": "How dare you defile the Autism Merry go around?", "created_at": "2025-11-18T18:16:16", "owner": "semper.vivum", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902055262163022, "text": "Remeber you have a freewill", "created_at": "2025-11-18T18:10:51", "owner": "eisriese_art", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012145592633234, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T18:03:32", "owner": "tripwire_desire", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18370817458159817, "text": "Im i the only one surprised that no 🧃 tok it 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T17:57:27", "owner": "achraf_lakbouchi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933310489104113, "text": "Kobe!", "created_at": "2025-11-18T17:51:47", "owner": "geoonward", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123800668519099, "text": "The fuck is your damage? 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T17:41:01", "owner": "thegreatestdragobear", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061054283230682, "text": "What did he do? 🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-18T17:37:41", "owner": "marcegc988", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034527527727142, "text": "How do I save that face as a gif 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T17:28:22", "owner": "davel1406", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920984533057052, "text": "Her reaction was more entertaining", "created_at": "2025-11-18T17:18:40", "owner": "truck.senpai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090957170493773, "text": "That silent crashout🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-18T17:10:15", "owner": "steven_n00rhani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17920770711198068, "text": "What, I just wanted to break the laws of physics. Nothing serious 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T17:04:19", "owner": "gazza_za84", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000442700835746, "text": "Oh pls say she hafe Autism. 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:53:31", "owner": "marcomani22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866449906490660, "text": "That’s right straight to the point. 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:50:42", "owner": "panelfab22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850833289592145, "text": "“That’s him officer, right there!”", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:50:00", "owner": "chris.nelsonoakatx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061141334199053, "text": "That's right. It goes into the square hole", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:45:41", "owner": "petrosneumann", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105860203633014, "text": "I have it full on my reels :B", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:26:54", "owner": "el_plazaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112744363586804, "text": "This person have to be isolated", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:20:26", "owner": "form.atix", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073515005001535, "text": "Free will", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:20:16", "owner": "cloudy_badger3.16", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904829086144455, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:19:09", "owner": "anandgnmty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082568806856113, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:18:59", "owner": "umbraouroboros", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075391028190731, "text": "OCDC look", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:14:47", "owner": "briandagit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046206602686475, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:14:39", "owner": "mujanho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17973199430953820, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:13:14", "owner": "mujanho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936100794981675, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:12:53", "owner": "mujanho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873695896450767, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:05:01", "owner": "graysons_animations", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18022605188598780, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:04:47", "owner": "graysons_animations", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026317064576942, "text": "Imagine if he was the creator of our world!? 🤣🤣🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:02:45", "owner": "scarydude_eco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083207441473914, "text": "The fact I know where this is scares me 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T16:00:00", "owner": "yo_soy_orsini", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871342696462388, "text": "It's a race, he won 🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:56:33", "owner": "njogrog", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047330870690472, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:56:17", "owner": "selfish_rex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17981292686922192, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:55:02", "owner": "smilesdotclub", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126368758507116, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:49:26", "owner": "neo_des1gn", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18110861335521779, "text": "Seems she just loooooves a black hole.", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:48:31", "owner": "manni_brasil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965269113843399, "text": "It was like disbelief, shock, what's wrong with you, then Im searching your soul to see if I can fine what's wrong with your all wrapped up in 3 seconds. 🤣🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:47:58", "owner": "spunkiest1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085399126800936, "text": "This thing costs a penny to operate but her face was priceless", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:47:10", "owner": "creblabo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063788360428598, "text": "Definitely a serial killer in the making", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:37:51", "owner": "allansinclairphoto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979655742779877, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:10:11", "owner": "ccorndog599", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18386531509182702, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:09:17", "owner": "hgreeger", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865445152504583, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T14:49:15", "owner": "jack__kelly99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046432118443167, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T14:44:32", "owner": "chander51", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910393957255633, "text": "Idk why it reminds me of a certain square hole", "created_at": "2025-11-18T14:38:53", "owner": "mad_blaze_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935878683980622, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T14:31:47", "owner": "fra_pnz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104088073635040, "text": "Just throw it into the hole… Or put straith with your hand like a fisting", "created_at": "2025-11-18T14:29:02", "owner": "kittenn_shibari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884872789281979, "text": "That's called free will", "created_at": "2025-11-18T14:11:38", "owner": "prog.rinzler", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144243760379488, "text": "Psychopath behaviour 🫠", "created_at": "2025-11-18T14:04:41", "owner": "dheer__modi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060112817236598, "text": "She just reevaluated her entire life 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T14:00:22", "owner": "tommy.tindall", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993357363853578, "text": "Bro on a tight schedule", "created_at": "2025-11-18T13:59:40", "owner": "333pjk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925079959038266, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T13:35:44", "owner": "chris2er", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866929351495374, "text": "He doesn't deserve her.", "created_at": "2025-11-18T13:34:07", "owner": "man_of_silk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118698178551786, "text": "Same result", "created_at": "2025-11-18T13:32:43", "owner": "skysoskyhigh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18366447121080235, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T13:22:50", "owner": "thatguythatstares", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108780349613926, "text": "Fuck every norm ever.", "created_at": "2025-11-18T13:03:25", "owner": "lucifer_36_samael", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18051170342345567, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T12:53:57", "owner": "tum.rachot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18289889575302898, "text": "Ptsd had a face😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T12:50:57", "owner": "robin19182", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064727396430987, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T11:39:32", "owner": "certifiedchillin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17966994965989197, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-18T10:01:28", "owner": "boazbutcher", "likes": 168}, {"id": 18412558981141938, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T10:00:57", "owner": "rj4747", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952057186045984, "text": "Skipped the show", "created_at": "2025-11-18T09:52:28", "owner": "1vo_marinovic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071980718464212, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-18T09:45:39", "owner": "simon.peart85", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3770720314582746016, "shortcode": "DRUSiXiDcOg", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRUSiXiDcOg/", "taken_at": "2025-11-21T11:37:18", "caption": "原來係身邊嘅朋友一直誤導我以為自己係正常人\n定係佢哋已經接受咗我來自外星 \n#hk #香港", "owner_username": "dodoairline2", "owner_id": "70290298604", "likes": 1464, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0152_DRUSiXiDcOg\\DRUSiXiDcOg_20251121_113718.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18001028054686055, "text": "仲有enjoy the meal,我真係會叫我啲朋友食得開心啲", "created_at": "2025-11-21T11:37:49", "owner": "dodoairline2", "likes": 128}, {"id": 18078146606270893, "text": "講 最近點， 玩得開心d\n有乜問題？😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-21T20:09:54", "owner": "simpsonchan", "likes": 152}, {"id": 17932398456111938, "text": "反而想知kam嘅英文係乜，有冇人可以解答。", "created_at": "2025-11-23T02:39:48", "owner": "rafae1.6", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17854613025527929, "text": "冇經歷英語語境，但成日都會講你呢幾句🙈🙈 又唔覺kam喎", "created_at": "2025-11-21T17:07:19", "owner": "edward_loyingkit", "likes": 16}, {"id": 18086272136482287, "text": "我都會講，身邊啲朋友都會，所以唔使諗太多，做返自己就得❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:20:10", "owner": "foodielife_lily_", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17986164467906911, "text": "圈子問題，一直都有咁講唔會，朋友間都會問候。就算會有人覺得kam，唔會阻到自己朋友想互相update近況wo", "created_at": "2025-11-21T13:00:35", "owner": "cylclaire", "likes": 56}, {"id": 18079912226162191, "text": "我覺得還好 並沒有很kam!", "created_at": "2025-11-21T11:53:08", "owner": "thol._.lmas", "likes": 122}, {"id": 18085071410057529, "text": "一啲問題都冇吖!喺中文入邊，冇論廣東話定國語，都會問「近排點吖」or「最近怎麼樣啊」，but意思同英文有小小唔同，英文how are you係齋問候，純粹打招呼，類似「你好」嘅意思。但中文係有小小真係想知你最近生活情況既意思，類似「近排過得點吖，忙緊啲咩吖，有冇遇到啲咩事吖」嘅意思\nOr let’s say，英文嘅「how are you」可以對任何人講，even係第一次見面嘅朋友or a stranger on the street，但中文就通常要對住啲見過幾次嘅朋友先會講「你近排點吖」，at least 我唔會對一個第一次見面嘅客講「喂你近排點吖」，咁樣就會有啲奇怪", "created_at": "2025-11-23T11:00:34", "owner": "sumgit_zim", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18548135215063187, "text": "Have a nice day", "created_at": "2025-11-24T07:35:34", "owner": "ben_sonnnnnn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17978297219944836, "text": "關心下人好合理姐😂😂 有冇喺英語世界生活過都唔係好關事啫😂😂 呢啲都係基本禮貌嚟呀😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:15:47", "owner": "rubyisagoodgirl", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17997980111839492, "text": "😂😂😂I literally had this moment yesterday", "created_at": "2025-11-29T07:48:59", "owner": "lifeispang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065683130612871, "text": "How are you= 點呀 哈哈", "created_at": "2025-11-22T21:34:20", "owner": "whocares55747", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17842798611632484, "text": "我fri 次次见到或者倾计都系 喂 点啫 最近😂", "created_at": "2025-12-01T03:56:11", "owner": "danielle__wu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078181045925974, "text": "我覺得冇咩問題 我平時都會用中文講呢啲嘢", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:44:27", "owner": "dd.0418", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17977901972939022, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T12:00:32", "owner": "junhaoo1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18108393436557801, "text": "咁講好正常😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:14:22", "owner": "po.ming.alex.wong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879769492430497, "text": "其實好正常🙈好似唔關中英文事 如果唔係成日都見 我text朋友都會問你近排點啊 不過我諗呢啲好personal and it really depends on the dynamics of your friend circle", "created_at": "2025-12-07T04:41:40", "owner": "hazello.hm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084702491102510, "text": "冇咩問題😂", "created_at": "2025-12-07T04:49:12", "owner": "tsui26", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079776604898962, "text": "據個人理解⛑️，\"How are you?\"擺喺香港嘅equivalent phrase，比較似係“食飯未啊” “咦落街買嘢”嗰類😂😂。Btw 關心frd呢樣嘢本身，不過如果平時大圍冇講開突然間講就可能會啲所謂kam（突兀）？", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:23:25", "owner": "choy._keith.0227", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053025077368522, "text": "其實都正常？好耐唔見都會問下呢排點啊呢d small talk必備技能嚟呀嘛", "created_at": "2025-12-12T13:31:30", "owner": "kim_lee_914", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099915044498177, "text": "Depends on the vibe", "created_at": "2025-11-26T02:00:16", "owner": "kristoffs_clutter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916731577234703, "text": "i see nothing wrong with these wor!! totally normal!!! 🙂‍↕️", "created_at": "2025-12-08T18:52:49", "owner": "szxerin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18024184469769680, "text": "其實無問題", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:04:19", "owner": "fredrikey", "likes": 89}, {"id": 18089996263931779, "text": "其實冇問題，我個fd都成日七語夾雜，然後又將日文同英文譯做廣東話講，佢講粗口係連我一個白人都會覺得好奇怪。但係聽慣咗就會覺得好正常。反而係之前同一個香港人講how u doin，正常人都會知係how r u嘅另一個講法。但係對方答我working，就會好尷尬。", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:29:16", "owner": "dr.cyril_", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18025557965589007, "text": "正常吖", "created_at": "2025-11-29T09:37:50", "owner": "toomuch_z_z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988143423864161, "text": "無kam,有時都會問朋友點ar", "created_at": "2025-11-21T13:33:35", "owner": "joshua____________12", "likes": 4}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["hk", "香港"]},
