{"media_id": 3758664697949283440, "shortcode": "DQpdaDnEWRw", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DQpdaDnEWRw/", "taken_at": "2025-11-04T20:24:07", "caption": "She Dominated the Track in Poland 🇵🇱💨. #trackandfield #explorepage #athlete", "owner_username": "gabriela.senju", "owner_id": "60931098484", "likes": 110198, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0155_DQpdaDnEWRw\\DQpdaDnEWRw_20251104_202407.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17898835296331130, "text": "Men of culture we meet again", "created_at": "2025-11-04T20:25:35", "owner": "vadimchiley", "likes": 41339}, {"id": 17952549437902277, "text": "I will be that guy, i felt bad for that girl who tripped", "created_at": "2025-11-05T08:36:18", "owner": "pmckai86", "likes": 16678}, {"id": 18108961330591776, "text": "Divided by nation united by thoughts", "created_at": "2025-11-05T03:20:26", "owner": "void_life_0", "likes": 5253}, {"id": 18542456170055483, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:07:59", "owner": "metomorphosis__", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18111493489579618, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-05T12:38:57", "owner": "gustworner", "likes": 1515}, {"id": 18065798420419675, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-30T06:58:47", "owner": "me_br81", "likes": 22}, {"id": 17964979955993319, "text": "Weird, I also exploded.", "created_at": "2025-11-04T21:03:58", "owner": "beninspace_", "likes": 2905}, {"id": 18087595210950107, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:21:59", "owner": "stylicmusic", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18001005911828974, "text": "Wow a girl in this beautiful curvy shape but also fast!😍", "created_at": "2025-11-13T00:41:04", "owner": "mumuthelittleone", "likes": 15}, {"id": 17929146666138339, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-06T19:46:35", "owner": "ilyasuu_", "likes": 56}, {"id": 18105698191729505, "text": "Leftys  ain't gonna like this one", "created_at": "2025-11-13T19:12:42", "owner": "mush1d1", "likes": 31}, {"id": 18107848192611913, "text": "We dont need diversity.  We do fine without it.", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:12:53", "owner": "ohnoho14", "likes": 5190}, {"id": 18085317569485993, "text": "She know that we're looking at it... She know it 100%", "created_at": "2025-11-06T18:54:01", "owner": "_denni.ko_", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18058968173638453, "text": "Incredibly distracting outfit", "created_at": "2025-12-06T04:31:27", "owner": "mattsilvaarmwrestling", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17850519156566928, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-05T23:58:52", "owner": "rt.ulises", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17899183029349651, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-12T03:15:50", "owner": "a_caglaarr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18029396534744256, "text": "She so fyne and powerful ancestors cheer", "created_at": "2025-11-12T04:35:44", "owner": "esotechnica", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18149099182422020, "text": "@wiktoriagajosz your welcome lads🫡", "created_at": "2025-11-07T05:04:32", "owner": "jacob_ventura242", "likes": 28}, {"id": 18065331464435729, "text": "Someone check if it's Ai", "created_at": "2025-11-07T19:40:15", "owner": "mrlemusproductions", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17917703952066393, "text": "This is why Europe must keep their culture alive", "created_at": "2025-11-05T17:13:03", "owner": "elver_galarga_2525", "likes": 7549}, {"id": 17971178978806054, "text": "men of culture. here we go again 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-05T09:55:05", "owner": "kopihan", "likes": 16}, {"id": 18362068228093539, "text": "23.what?", "created_at": "2025-11-07T10:30:54", "owner": "golan.cohen.696", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18134937493466311, "text": "She also has great jeans. Shame, that one girl tasted some dirt 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-13T15:27:22", "owner": "devilliersizak", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17883917574283866, "text": "Why women compete in underwear?", "created_at": "2025-11-13T00:17:42", "owner": "lior_hm", "likes": 21}, {"id": 18085542584475980, "text": "This is gonna sound homo but isn't it weird that they have to run in swimwear?", "created_at": "2025-11-11T07:26:04", "owner": "jupiterian92", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18131403940471929, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-07T00:52:12", "owner": "jgp_1223", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18392155468193491, "text": "Only in Poland. She has no chance against Americans, UK & and Jamaica lol", "created_at": "2025-11-06T02:30:53", "owner": "bluesuncorporation", "likes": 84}, {"id": 17857194567552282, "text": "6 7 seconds?", "created_at": "2025-11-06T02:07:00", "owner": "espanolete_04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046644410400095, "text": "I’d eat her out after the race 🤤❤️🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-05T12:50:59", "owner": "johnnythebarber1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18028438613775830, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:10:21", "owner": "chrisdiciccio.sprayart", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18132922852492242, "text": "As a 13yo boy i ran 24s for some perspective.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:28:09", "owner": "robsonez", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18102558031707525, "text": "I wish she would dominate me like she dominates the field", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:16:33", "owner": "framicolas", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18031426796547833, "text": "she can dominate me too", "created_at": "2025-12-04T12:16:52", "owner": "tianngyen", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17949437190001093, "text": "I’m here because of my interest in the sport of sprinting", "created_at": "2025-12-03T18:42:15", "owner": "andmac89", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17925449811191840, "text": "And i bet she demolished her boyfriend just hours after that too.......Not jealous at all 😏", "created_at": "2025-12-04T10:08:27", "owner": "justin_goldsworthy13", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18131146570487470, "text": "“Exploding rockets…hmmm” said every guy watching this post.", "created_at": "2025-11-05T13:32:58", "owner": "petergraygolf", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083940581050361, "text": "@wiktoriagajosz 🥇", "created_at": "2025-11-06T20:03:01", "owner": "reda__admiral", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18042979892700185, "text": "Golden double is right", "created_at": "2025-11-05T17:15:37", "owner": "thejeffsturgeon33", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085167076771150, "text": "I think we need to start giving a lot more credit to the videographers here", "created_at": "2025-11-05T23:43:42", "owner": "_friendlyforestwitch", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18104541826642865, "text": "Wow this comment section is sick", "created_at": "2025-11-05T19:47:47", "owner": "onishjxka", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17938604111964810, "text": "A real Amazonian", "created_at": "2025-11-08T01:56:46", "owner": "sfarnumster", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18111268570505495, "text": "Ai", "created_at": "2025-11-07T03:58:37", "owner": "melvin_kok23", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18072336311210534, "text": "Men of culture ASSEMBLE!", "created_at": "2025-11-06T01:52:30", "owner": "gopalapu", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17858448816550168, "text": "❤️❤️❤️THANKZ 4 LOVE ME MORE THAN YESTERDAY!!! YOU ALWAYZ AMEZING!!! INZIDE &  OUTZIDE!!! KEEP ZTRONG KEEP IN KONTAKT!!! ❤️❤️DEFENATLY THE BEST IS TO KOME!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-15T00:48:06", "owner": "zteel_dick", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18160352008390267, "text": "Me proclamo con vehemente convicción insigne paladín del atletismo femenino, noble disciplina donde la gracia y la fuerza confluyen en sublime armonía; y elevo mi admiración hacia esa excelsa dama, cuya prestancia y virtuosismo despiertan en mi espíritu un fervor casi caballeresco", "created_at": "2025-11-07T06:30:02", "owner": "__josue_perikene__", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18086656574510370, "text": "@jocalopse - something about exercise, determination, training, a good diet, and a solid mindset. ...so I've heard.", "created_at": "2025-11-12T01:05:44", "owner": "alphabarbs", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17903714043147076, "text": "🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-06T19:48:14", "owner": "pioo_musicisthekey", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070033283592332, "text": "He clocked a time of 23 point what guys?", "created_at": "2025-11-06T19:28:33", "owner": "mihai.bront", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18554504491033270, "text": "Uff bununla saatlerce 😍🤤", "created_at": "2025-11-06T19:06:34", "