, "created_at": "2025-12-03T10:09:13", "owner": "ali_18379", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062738216538923, "text": "Hmm. I wonder why", "created_at": "2025-12-03T06:52:52", "owner": "daemonxmonarch133", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028061228574342, "text": "Wooow", "created_at": "2025-12-03T06:00:37", "owner": "kellecimete", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988231242745665, "text": "No wonder they stacking Armies in Poland.", "created_at": "2025-12-03T05:51:41", "owner": "oldpalmon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095505697686819, "text": "Good luck with her career. I know it's short. But there is years of work involved. Wishing her the best. Sending love from Kamloops British Columbia Canada. Go girl get it.🙌", "created_at": "2025-12-03T05:39:17", "owner": "spencergrantian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18388621555180732, "text": "God damn i love sports. Sheesh", "created_at": "2025-12-03T02:35:45", "owner": "ar.daa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058832327279532, "text": "Labu 🐱", "created_at": "2025-12-03T01:43:15", "owner": "pop_vinted_toys", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858824368557790, "text": "Nie moge dotrzeć.do środka wideo", "created_at": "2025-12-02T23:26:18", "owner": "inscrutabile", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062829245553630, "text": "No white runner will ever beat the best black runners.", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:45:16", "owner": "charliemcnugets", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083854421321053, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-02T19:01:32", "owner": "miguelitoo017", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115518217599852, "text": "padet", "created_at": "2025-12-02T16:56:37", "owner": "chefdape", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094854529889137, "text": "Im amaze", "created_at": "2025-12-02T15:30:49", "owner": "7053_oke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902210461300488, "text": "مبارک باشه", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:41:28", "owner": "khademalihasan5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100000420704322, "text": "Nací en el país equivocado. 😂", "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:19:06", "owner": "turcodosseis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980174808929156, "text": "", "created_