025-11-05T22:50:46", "owner": "sw1shreactsofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883234777403427, "text": "Nah, man, she's a figment of our imagination", "created_at": "2025-11-05T22:50:13", "owner": "kipaks_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18537210061045716, "text": "Im moving to Poland legaly and getting a job", "created_at": "2025-11-05T22:45:39", "owner": "alfredgeee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117420643541345, "text": "Everything but bear children 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-05T22:44:27", "owner": "aymen7.62", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108281311611072, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-05T22:42:46", "owner": "alex04_bdg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083344558974929, "text": "Good evening, sir. Your whisky awaits 🥃 — please, join us and take your place among distinguished company.", "created_at": "2025-11-05T22:41:37", "owner": "kozellvojtech", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18161164912388569, "text": "Must be chuggin raw milk", "created_at": "2025-11-05T22:40:21", "owner": "calibarikk37", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843474358609649, "text": "I love the uniforms. But please get some sun on that ass.", "created_at": "2025-11-05T22:39:28", "owner": "timbuktubeofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927614131119900, "text": "19 year old... anyone that sees her as a dish is a grade grotesque, menace to all children", "created_at": "2025-11-05T22:39:19", "owner": "gatomanicus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18350032861160744, "text": "Id like to explode down the curve and power down the homestraight too", "created_at": "2025-11-05T22:38:43", "owner": "the_notorious_mco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063845222528778, "text": "Polonia es clave", "created_at": "2025-11-05T22:29:35", "owner": "ange.lhex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092139301713144, "text": "@wiktoriagajosz", "created_at": "2025-11-05T22:28:51", "owner": "leebongo1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18174406543366311, "text": "we need to save europe", "created_at": "2025-11-05T22:28:47", "owner": "chureee_1337", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068339948346700, "text": "Time to move to poland boys", "cr