:20", "owner": "lancer182", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117931693555279, "text": "if my parents would have watched me compete i would have ran with olympians...50m", "created_at": "2025-11-05T21:14:01", "owner": "lancer182", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093545491892730, "text": "hermosa Pero LESBIANA", "created_at": "2025-11-05T21:09:10", "owner": "aerografiaostini3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057818696265785, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-05T21:08:46", "owner": "aerografiaostini3", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18043911383468075, "text": "Definitely a golden mcdouble", "created_at": "2025-11-05T21:05:46", "owner": "germanirishmikey", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18489298813076219, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-05T21:05:21", "owner": "hemmati.tagzie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939519720961608, "text": "Better than uma musume", "created_at": "2025-11-05T21:05:10", "owner": "malikraliq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080960669026740, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-05T21:05:04", "owner": "aallievi", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18081861787844616, "text": "Cheeks just lit up the race thingy or whatever it was she was doing", "created_at": "2025-11-05T21:04:19", "owner": "geocarona2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900213766311956, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-05T21:01:27", "owner": "javibdj", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17972376242956758, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-05T21:00:10", "owner": "pascwallie03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100048213671109, "text": "Of course she did 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:57:25", "owner": "mancave_tv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059825285209229, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:57:24", "owner": "ultima_ratio_89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952631736902159, "text": "For all you people thinking why so little clothing it's for sweat evaporation, stop gooning", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:52:50", "owner": "dinodindodino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876459799430493, "text": "A.i?", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:51:38", "owner": "iwanhofstra_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070385507042091, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:49:13", "owner": "qwertasdf21111", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089859847915800, "text": "Wait doesn't she look like a famous actress? I don't remember who", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:47:14", "owner": "draganso_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17917529127199604, "text": "She’s actually hot af", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:47:11", "owner": "dingleberry_farmer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028930562746017, "text": "I love all of this even the goofy way they run.", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:44:21", "owner": "waystedd.time", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18190805227333435, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:42:59", "owner": "zamanskiy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871718170378139, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:42:37", "owner": "mukulghosh1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17895220098201493, "text": "The reason I married a polish woman", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:42:04", "owner": "glitter.foot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049529705378174, "text": "The dramatic fall females do for more attention 🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:40:07", "owner": "jasmine253131", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17898425769337083, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:39:59", "owner": "nils_08.01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18162010165389038, "text": "Don't be that guy... 😜", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:36:50", "owner": "tadziu.official.4real.lol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064936673624162, "text": "Poland is so fucking based. Keep the barbarians out of your country if you want women like this. Its not rocket science", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:36:30", "owner": "boogie5490", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899121859305602, "text": "Running in swim suits", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:35:57", "owner": "big_moneyzuwap", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116554381551946, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:31:56", "owner": "iamjeffreymai", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18212469670310507, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-05T20:29:02", "owner": "mastorasstavros", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18122953411511883, "text": "Give her a