{"media_id": 3771438954953279569, "shortcode": "DRW179iD4hR", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRW179iD4hR/", "taken_at": "2025-11-22T11:30:27", "caption": "係大波波啊！！疏乎厘好好味 🤪🫶🏼#澳門美食節 #澳門疏乎厘", "owner_username": "00cm", "owner_id": "22433378", "likes": 811, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0157_DRW179iD4hR\\DRW179iD4hR_20251122_113027.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18108679174715862, "text": "有冇得食你個大波波", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:35:36", "owner": "wasabiindahouse", "likes": 36}, {"id": 18150242845423609, "text": "咁有顏色既個廣告😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T15:30:40", "owner": "akichio_babe", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17969095568977935, "text": "見到個頭嚇親，，，原來係線頭🤣😆😆", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:21:44", "owner": "jill92cc", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18078410264174227, "text": "上個星期幫襯佐😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:46:35", "owner": "lyndaleong_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18214085731308928, "text": "上個月幫襯左", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:57:34", "owner": "kahimq_hpc", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17902049181299768, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-11-23T02:41:41", "owner": "wongbeewong", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18092723536926356, "text": "可以出你最愛嘅🍌味!\n😻BANANA!💛", "created_at": "2025-11-25T15:27:57", "owner": "victoria_tszhing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079280186232071, "text": "😍正❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-25T17:21:33", "owner": "cocochan8888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119375794533082, "text": "真係好撚戇鳩😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T14:40:04", "owner": "cheung.ying.ying", "likes": 22}, {"id": 18102136744742445, "text": "想影飛車相😍", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:51:24", "owner": "fiftycents.5", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083763103864053, "text": "@cl_40406 我都無食到大波波😢😢", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:07:46", "owner": "maria_0812m", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18050744354344377, "text": "因為大波波睇晒成條片👉🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:35:16", "owner": "photobook.ed", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17930783538136551, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:05:12", "owner": "marco.thedesigner", "l