{"media_id": 3761544310941367614, "shortcode": "DQzsJ8MjT0-", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DQzsJ8MjT0-/", "taken_at": "2025-11-08T19:44:53", "caption": "every guy needs a bestie like me 💋\n#ginger #redhead #viral #fyp #flirty #trend #friends", "owner_username": "redwifeyrosie", "owner_id": "59835225823", "likes": 25081, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0158_DQzsJ8MjT0-\\DQzsJ8MjT0-_20251108_194453.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18058487837554162, "text": "Great advice. You look so gorgeous.", "created_at": "2025-11-08T20:05:51", "owner": "keegan_oneil0496", "likes": 382}, {"id": 17899243719301365, "text": "Love you Darling, I lost NNN because of you but it’s fine", "created_at": "2025-11-08T21:28:51", "owner": "stofferno", "likes": 86}, {"id": 18081782297276374, "text": "Great advice. How do I tell her.", "created_at": "2025-12-09T15:56:14", "owner": "akitosteron", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18154876144417959, "text": "Do you wanna be my friend? I need to practice", "created_at": "2025-12-05T06:08:17", "owner": "thegermany30", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17906171703270803, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-08T22:23:16", "owner": "nogroco", "likes": 378}, {"id": 18078604591913160, "text": "I thought we were friends😍", "created_at": "2025-11-17T15:35:46", "owner": "56edrice", "likes": 21}, {"id": 18044102912484449, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-27T20:28:35", "owner": "john_white_0001", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18050220203379915, "text": "Can girl try on girl best frd??", "created_at": "2025-11-20T11:25:35", "owner": "sharma__11__25", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18103022719677058, "text": "Ok will you be my friend?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T08:42:56", "owner": "jjoeseph557", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18102240271780331, "text": "Great. Let’s be friends", "created_at": "2025-12-03T11:18:02", "owner": "kereemys", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17978848409779030, "text": "I have no friend", "created_at": "2025-11-09T13:45:48", "owner": "j0hnwick2099", 