"id": 18005595164815104, "text": "Yes, I want you to be my bestie", "created_at": "2025-11-19T14:50:14", "owner": "plby_123", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032621402529554, "text": "Can we become friends?", "created_at": "2025-11-19T14:50:03", "owner": "conne.seur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085628369084128, "text": "Wtf", "created_at": "2025-11-19T14:48:20", "owner": "meland1997", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18000578144833703, "text": "I want a friend like u", "created_at": "2025-11-19T14:38:37", "owner": "unruly_damiant_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070861913600168, "text": "My friend got a dick", "created_at": "2025-11-19T14:22:38", "owner": "my_daily_dodge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056034107313501, "text": "Can you give me fead back 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-19T13:50:39", "owner": "lauritz.o7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18180110575357538, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-19T13:50:37", "owner": "neezotalks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132749869468988, "text": "Wait a minute... practice on you?!", "created_at": "2025-11-19T13:46:20", "owner": "joshuaoctagon.howland", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989620428901796, "text": "You still didn't give any fucking advice", "created_at": "2025-11-19T13:23:40", "owner": "usernameisago", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068019407600145, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T13:21:43", "owner": "jakobmilczarek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065412212144249, "text": "Hahah fack you stay har", "created_at": "2025-11-19T12:39:54", "owner": "ivaneishvili.d777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924805660172778, "text": "When are u available to give me some pointers?", "created_at": "2025-11-19T11:49:16", "owner": "taicheklow1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875898997441227, "text": "I tried, but he keeps getting hard😡", "created_at": "2025-11-19T10:41:30", "owner": "boris_dyatchin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082846058044171, "text": "🤔🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-19T06:31:12", "owner": "thechefzay00", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903026455301922, "text": "I need a advance course", "created_at": "2025-11-19T04:11:22", "ow