59, "text": "Love you to.talk me thru it only as friends tho", "created_at": "2025-11-11T15:06:43", "owner": "official_bigrob_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18334024702229626, "text": "So can I practice on you since we are friend", "created_at": "2025-11-11T04:12:25", "owner": "taso56", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887233237264494, "text": "Let's be friends", "created_at": "2025-11-11T02:29:28", "owner": "mickey964757", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124283641502410, "text": "Hello friend", "created_at": "2025-11-10T22:07:05", "owner": "aegisdragon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089556481927328, "text": "Best friends ❤️🙌😍😅😂🤷‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-11-10T17:26:36", "owner": "razza.007", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059849249234678, "text": "Alright 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-10T04:39:39", "owner": "thats_my_bad_1990", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087996115753044, "text": "@redwifeyrosie your far away lol and yeah no want to be my friend with benefits 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-09T22:08:16", "owner": "j0hnwick2099", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090151027934142, "text": "As a friend are you volunteering to help me perfect my technique.😂😂😂😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-09T19:37:36", "owner": "billbaer6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18535233454019850, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-09T00:01:46", "owner": "purps666", "likes": 38}, {"id": 18046116686450005, "text": "You're the best friend 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-08T23:13:54", "owner": "myhero_slayer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110579608595191, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-08T22:22:50", "owner": "nogroco", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18152108278416268, "text": "🙌🙌🙌 \n\nYes! Agreed!❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-08T20:40:47", "owner": "positive_mentality28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842114767616602, "text": "I would prefer “I Got Your Head” 😏🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-08T20:00:30", "owner": "thefrankgerman", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18133583032473230, "text": "Rosie getting that rose sloppy today 😭✌️💔🥀", "created_at": "2025-11-08T19:58:45", "owner": "dragstar0007", "likes": 0}], "location": nul