{"media_id": 3722474257663605032, "shortcode": "DOo4p1lkzko", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DOo4p1lkzko/", "taken_at": "2025-09-15T21:59:08", "caption": "what prank is missing in this vid? 😏 #truesigns #commentbelow", "owner_username": "itscarrlyjane", "owner_id": "54420927704", "likes": 19434, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0159_DOo4p1lkzko\\DOo4p1lkzko_20250915_215908.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17886331629259117, "text": "Bouncy bouncy", "created_at": "2025-10-27T03:49:46", "owner": "reelnride", "likes": 51}, {"id": 18081198230278750, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-14T21:53:24", "owner": "vinykapenda", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17980143536870431, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-10-03T03:35:54", "owner": "superghoststyle22", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18088669105769509, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-26T19:35:50", "owner": "jonnyangel22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146875060433127, "text": "Haha", "created_at": "2025-11-15T18:54:44", "owner": "iammattwells", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921666511156393, "text": "Forcing it to giggle is not attractive.", "created_at": "2025-10-12T20:47:13", "owner": "_shantipsy", "likes": 273}, {"id": 18193209553327360, "text": "Gorgeous ♥️", "created_at": "2025-11-20T15:55:52", "owner": "peelykneale79", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103226521633012, "text": "Real bounces, amazing", "created_at": "2025-11-02T01:00:35", "owner": "alesiga_23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18144718186415192, "text": "Cows do drink milk", "created_at": "2025-09-20T18:10:09", "owner": "erickorea", "likes": 12}, {"id": 17862324405434626, "text": "am I hearing right? she said \"F me in 🍑?\"", "created_at": "2025-10-20T00:29:35", "owner": "madafogging", "likes": 16}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["truesigns", "commentbelow"]},
{"media_id": 3771092048356176435, "shortcode": "DRVnDzlkfIz", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRVnDzlkfIz/", "taken_at": "2025-11-22T00:03:34", "caption": "If you don’t smoke, don’t start. If you currently smoke, and you have the willpower, quit. If you don’t have the willpower, at least reduce it. But if you just love smoking and it brings you joy, light it up!", "owner_username": "oldjewishmen", "owner_id": "2092881511", "likes": 369414, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0160_DRVnDzlkfIz\\DRVnDzlkfIz_20251122_000334.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17925116667035952, "text": "Smoking is bad for you but community is good for you so I think it evens out", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:12:25", "owner": "averyregen", "likes": 38333}, {"id": 18028301714750470, "text": "Thanks for coming to my event!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:06:58", "owner": "breakinggbob", "likes": 4660}, {"id": 18060644726239678, "text": "David Lynch would have loved this 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:40:20", "owner": "jen_mc_spooky", "likes": 8987}, {"id": 18081968084107185, "text": "Single-handedly bringing civilization back together love it Bob 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:15:06", "owner": "_arynton", "likes": 16352}, {"id": 18086673841956086, "text": "Ugh I wish I could’ve been there!!! Shabbat Shalom!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:18:56", "owner": "lets_rhi.up", "likes": 809}, {"id": 18078551642178163, "text": "new york you’re perfect. please don’t change a thing", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:37:55", "owner": "lilmscreates", "likes": 3801}, {"id": 18051114629352201, "text": "The world is healing", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:47:57", "owner": "palathomas1618", "likes": 2402}, {"id": 18073649561022712, "text": "Pulmonologists punching the air rn.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:17:35", "owner": "dabbledinpacifism", "likes": 1231}, {"id": 18069892409074617, "text": "Big cigarette: *wipes tear*", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:59:05", "owner": "andrewtindall", "likes": 2457}, {"id": 17937799506100686, "text": "Big tobacco learns viral marketing", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:18:49", "owner": "char.rns", "likes": 988}, {"id": 18335136208233813, "text": "Hell yeah brother 🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:06:27", "owner": "maxfromquebec", "likes": 47}, {"id": 18113174782595897, "text": "I bet Anthony Bourdain would have loved this 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:17:54", "owner": "_mama_danger_", "likes": 241}, {"id": 17932243949997446, "text": "I’m so jealous I couldn’t be there", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:25:00", "owner": "emotional_octopus", "likes": 189}, {"id": 18120161437555339, "text": "So nice to see young people smoking cigarettes again", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:42:28", "owner": "juliamluis", "likes": 249}, {"id": 17926470378158276, "text": "Incredible", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:26:27", "owner": "qveenjuliaa", "likes": 40}, {"id": 18074946079999491, "text": "Hope no one was cheating by vaping", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:15:08", "owner": "johnrfoley", "likes": 952}, {"id": 18105280948728186, "text": "God it prob smelled like the 70’s on that block for a min", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:08:30", "owner": "jereynolds_99", "likes": 795}, {"id": 17976467378937386, "text": "Greatest day of my life", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:07:49", "owner": "eriksokol", "likes": 198}, {"id": 18084149519094347, "text": "Never realized this was an OJM thing!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:13:06", "owner": "relevantseinfeld", "likes": 26}, {"id": 17879067942328680, "text": "The funny thing is… Bob is 37.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:53:07", "owner": "mikekeller.tv", "likes": 108}, {"id": 18083536504843047, "text": "The people yearn for community", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:59:40", "owner": "themightydino7", "likes": 636}, {"id": 18090245326940671, "text": "🚬❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:08:17", "owner": "fakkahfuzz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088894696756781, "text": "shabbat shalom bob ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:30:23", "owner": "deloramaygloss", "likes": 89}, {"id": 18094693477683437, "text": "🚬❤️🚬❤️👏", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:37:18", "owner": "marcelrozek_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057169406307384, "text": "I voted for him for mayor", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:10:40", "owner": "ericmfsantos", "likes": 433}, {"id": 17997891995696509, "text": "Bob does not skip lung day 💪", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:05:23", "owner": "joshsapira", "likes": 143}, {"id": 17930662917136796, "text": "I don't even smoke cigs and I wish I was there 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:39:41", "owner": "grumpshinelonglegs", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18541185580060782, "text": "It shows how much people just want community", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:31:07", "owner": "snoopycanard", "likes": 117}, {"id": 18074010161019437, "text": "we are so back", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:59:54", "owner": "ryankerr__", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18100801315741035, "text": "Bro leaving this earth with the best last memory 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:23:36", "owner": "imranamlani", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18117732658555508, "text": "Cigarettes are actually good for you if you're pure of heart", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:08:53", "owner": "meme_grinder_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18545283916035431, "text": "@morganm.taylorr", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:12:54", "owner": "ss.hrmn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18109455487621233, "text": "BUY $BOB COIN FkKyrRxTKvzEuFR78fXzPfCvpiBMSLFvw6qfFBqkpump", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:49:44", "owner": "flood_1111", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18009741227648296, "text": "Wtf", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:42:23", "owner": "javi_el_sucio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18548830138021075, "text": "BOB HAS A COMMUNITY TOKEN  FkKyrRxTKvzEuFR78fXzPfCvpiBMSLFvw6qfFBqkpump", "created_at": "2025-12-05T12:58:36", "owner": "cdawg_investor", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18013365911800294, "text": "Cigarettes with bob don’t count", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:00:24", "owner": "uncle_homeless", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17983625249922176, "text": "4x marathoner here. This is 1,000,000x cooler than any running club", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:27:06", "owner": "ericzawo", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18112228729593651, "text": "This is awesome!", "created_at": "2025-11-23T12:29:16", "owner": "simona_radjenovic", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17956744608040789, "text": "where were the anti cigarettes folks?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:57:15", "owner": "cesilio", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17989770491734402, "text": "My mayor", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:23:43", "owner": "stevesweatpants", "likes": 32}, {"id": 18048366680409613, "text": "One more cig!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:56:11", "owner": "metamooney", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064576922440238, "text": "Who’s this pretty girl @ .30 secs @ridsayshi 😭😍", "created_at": "2025-11-23T16:25:44", "owner": "nitya__madhu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095231272831827, "text": "so nice seeing an older person enjoying the power of internet ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:13:32", "owner": "antonija_zmaj", "likes": 14}, {"id": 17987211401869852, "text": "Meir", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:46:28", "owner": "srulykessler", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18393226171131887, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:06:10", "owner": "cogey", "likes": 69}, {"id": 18077599784334871, "text": "hi @kasslightgatekeepgirlboss", "created_at": "2025-11-24T17:32:51", "owner": "lizzsterine", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18108565378623979, "text": "@bbqfuma", "created_at": "2025-11-22T23:08:29", "owner": "marigatti", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17954255973012803, "text": "@lalstar0 light it up!", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:24:39", "owner": "sabrinafetrow", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18024428489782928, "text": "🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:37:51", "owner": "nasu.tion191", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18067702982095727, "text": "Pissed I missed this", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:52:17", "owner": "nohocoho", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18410753953184280, "text": "It’s giving accidentally public event on Facebook 2009. but I love it 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:03:24", "owner": "alexanderbinn", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17969207081983039, "text": "Mr Rogers on cigs", "created_at": "2025-11-23T01:40:29", "owner": "lanactrlaltdelrey", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18163532893390287, "text": "maybe the friends we made were the cigarettes we smoked along the way 😌", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:57:12", "owner": "meekaspages", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18300134401258422, "text": "@kalacava a friend of your Mother?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T21:31:26", "owner": "hdjukic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542428393031126, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-22T23:09:00", "owner": "joeynassau", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078794107922437, "text": "@bij.angel i love ny", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:55:00", "owner": "arinatn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17851510572591008, "text": "Can we get 10 minutes next time?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:49:50", "owner": "rickrussomano", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18049712591392307, "text": "Payu es @faaturrahmanap @iqbalkurniawaan @hkm_frghna", "created_at": "2025-11-23T16:04:42", "owner": "afif_kharisma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087838780771491, "text": "@danielg1564  se logró mi brother 🚬🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:41:19", "owner": "isisdad_2050", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18091859854902995, "text": "Shabbat shalom brother 🫶🏻🙂‍↕️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:13:24", "owner": "mel.spig", "likes": 105}, {"id": 17986009295871895, "text": "@daynejgriffiths", "created_at": "2025-11-23T12:33:38", "owner": "professorthedutty", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18370891861159897, "text": "GOATED!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:19:23", "owner": "therealdonnysavage", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18028488383563390, "text": "Hes so cute", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:36:15", "owner": "xingaxow", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18025676921583467, "text": "absolutely gutted to have missed this", "created_at": "2025-11-22T20:17:03", "owner": "zackhennz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17890675950376776, "text": "I WAS STUCK IN A MUNICIPAL HIRING POOL SO I COULD NOT ATTEND BUT I SMOKED ONE IN YOUR HONOR!!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:43:26", "owner": "romanmamus", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18515060476065630, "text": "Damn I wanted to go 😭😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:26:59", "owner": "docta_wub", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18104180788725502, "text": "What kind of freedom are you talking about since you're slaves of nicotine ? Cognitive dissonance.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:13:38", "owner": "yishuvim", "likes": 34}, {"id": 17869587570469794, "text": "All about a good smoke. From time to time. The micro plastics will get ya before the cigs", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:21:07", "owner": "allchrome", "likes": 39}, {"id": 18084710126067722, "text": "daaaaaamn what a turnout, what a moment, what an experience for those involved 🎉💯", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:05:35", "owner": "coastnobody", "likes": 325}, {"id": 17964856985995419, "text": "I got so mutch Fomo from this Stranger and I'm from Spain", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:56:36", "owner": "antoniobufe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18164205112383529, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:15:25", "owner": "lakestovall_art", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070684094341677, "text": "@fotis_bran", "created_at": "2025-11-22T22:27:00", "owner": "jordan_jordanopoulos", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18180607282360282, "text": "@thenightmare_170", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:02:06", "owner": "truedinar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080994971276384, "text": "@ellie.maymurray", "created_at": "2025-11-23T10:55:12", "owner": "lucyyoungerjourno_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18340315510230943, "text": "@amrit_melwani", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:06:54", "owner": "hymorah", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17879346297332767, "text": "Bob that’s two thousand cigarettes 😵‍💫", "created_at": "2025-11-23T08:13:11", "owner": "most_important_meal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859775677547027, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T07:22:41", "owner": "ezrachr21", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18002575022820464, "text": "Bloomberg is shaking rn", "created_at": "2025-11-23T00:57:07", "owner": "thechristinebuzan", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17932412708997448, "text": "God bless America", "created_at": "2025-11-23T00:23:55", "owner": "z_a_c___", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074023100254008, "text": "OMG I SAW THE INVITE ON PARTIFUL 😂😭🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:41:24", "owner": "illfayze", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18093739357909591, "text": "Most hilarious thing that we didn’t know we needed. @melissalhaynes23", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:51:57", "owner": "micasells512", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17854758540528812, "text": "Just had one for you!\nShabbat shalom ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-23T01:24:59", "owner": "waldmanavi", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18083998022045555, "text": "Amazing 🚬🔥❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:58:34", "owner": "chickienuggie_theclown", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18084665849055131, "text": "@navasak this could be ur fav event so far 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:38:23", "owner": "murderorkill", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18204594322316944, "text": "@sdj he’s Jewish too!!! U could have broke the internet today cc @discocorporation", "created_at": "2025-11-23T00:18:50", "owner": "heyfoti", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18060629513558818, "text": "Major FOMO", "created_at": "2025-11-23T02:10:55", "owner": "mitchgoulson", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086930260974357, "text": "It turns out you can just do cool stuff with people ❤️ what a wholesome experience", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:19:59", "owner": "maxmousee", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18098284408768338, "text": "The cigs inside movement grows soon we will take back what was once ours", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:36:17", "owner": "chrishickey1212", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18106328764722715, "text": "@ianimal69", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:23:49", "owner": "corykitty", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17953519838902853, "text": "I was there. It was great.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:48:30", "owner": "rossdecker", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17857591122557430, "text": "America is back", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:00:19", "owner": "tommyodonnelll", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17972315774974254, "text": "The cig man 🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-13T02:42:03", "owner": "cthuncho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049268537426648, "text": "Come to KY we will smoke 2 one brown and green together", "created_at": "2025-12-12T10:58:58", "owner": "z03bear1990", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949112644069660, "text": "I'm missing my mom 😢😭😭", "created_at": "2025-12-10T10:52:24", "owner": "henrymorgana6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871428385394943, "text": "Legend", "created_at": "2025-12-10T04:11:22", "owner": "joao21.jpg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901159756341179, "text": "anti smoking marketers/corporations are rolling in their graves", "created_at": "2025-12-09T18:28:54", "owner": "earthlingmash", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038564324718490, "text": "I don’t even smoke but I can’t hate on this either 😭 New York is something special! 😂🚬", "created_at": "2025-12-05T14:59:41", "owner": "shantastic.life", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121192210536840, "text": "Use the address below to buy some $Bob before the next event or you’ll miss out and have to buy ur own cigs FkKyrRxTKvzEuFR78fXzPfCvpiBMSLFvw6qfFBqkpump", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:04:02", "owner": "whoopes21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105463324651811, "text": "Buy $Bob before the next event and you’ll thank me later FkKyrRxTKvzEuFR78fXzPfCvpiBMSLFvw6qfFBqkpump", "created_at": "2025-12-05T13:00:28", "owner": "whoopes21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079323301906347, "text": "🔥😍", "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:06:49", "owner": "hajalidarvish.teahouse1918", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160781938403032, "text": "2:00-2:05pm 😂😂 alll them people who is this guy 👀😂‼️👀👀", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:31:58", "owner": "uniquesexoticfrenchies", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009572966653549, "text": "quero ser sua 🫵🏼 amiga @breakinggbob vamoshhh fumar uns camel, uns marlboro togetherrrr s2 🚬🚬🚬", "created_at": "2025-12-03T08:03:58", "owner": "juliaisapunk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078161519227103, "text": "when you set up the event in Jakarta, Bob?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:49:37", "owner": "wienag9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18300152836258186, "text": "Disgusting", "created_at": "2025-11-29T20:18:35", "owner": "paintyourpeacewitharooj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081345056470171, "text": "god I love New York I wish I lived there", "created_at": "2025-11-28T14:23:55", "owner": "itsgabbycameron", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134472196479858, "text": "Im so upset I wasn't there😭", "created_at": "2025-11-28T03:25:35", "owner": "tinatassels", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541230445021904, "text": "Happy Thanksgiving", "created_at": "2025-11-27T19:02:17", "owner": "thepaperbag", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18211249204311151, "text": "this reminds me of the movie thank you for smoking. Absolutely epic. does he work for a cig company or he’s just a passion smoker?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:37:01", "owner": "roadtripping_vegjew", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023731742782537, "text": "Nicotine + Caffeine = Protein", "created_at": "2025-11-27T16:13:16", "owner": "sonofdirtbag", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108341137554370, "text": "@sidetalknyc", "created_at": "2025-11-26T13:28:03", "owner": "carldomino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18443852395098640, "text": "Cool bob", "created_at": "2025-11-26T10:29:19", "owner": "be_real.man", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029129288556137, "text": "Glory to smokers ❤️🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-26T08:46:08", "owner": "nanachka_nana_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925710025038536, "text": "🔥👏", "created_at": "2025-11-26T04:17:10", "owner": "withlovepromise", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991085859730224, "text": "If I were still smoking I’d happily be here but I don’t anymore but I’m not against smoking but it does smell horrendous to my nose nowadays", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:45:09", "owner": "spiritkinder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008502794731995, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:44:23", "owner": "spiritkinder", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884115457406942, "text": "I need to go to New York where you can smoke a cig and no one gives you a death stare", "created_at": "2025-11-25T02:46:52", "owner": "nicole_marie_7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109289914539988, "text": "Make America Smoke Again", "created_at": "2025-11-25T00:27:26", "owner": "erik.odowd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143250763402273, "text": "I wish I was there but I am in Brazil🤧🤧🤧🚬🚬🚬🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:03:32", "owner": "joanaccleite", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18292938925275946, "text": "@jay.rob7 this comment 😆", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:50:01", "owner": "nathalie_rose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18423985291114131, "text": "Wonder if anyone had their 1st cigarette on this day😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:25:25", "owner": "rollaroycee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17999814191836229, "text": "Marb Reds and 72’s. Going full flavor 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T18:06:45", "owner": "kevinkswan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046851500450776, "text": "Still he is a jew", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:49:03", "owner": "zhq_52", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087373744945745, "text": "siapanya koci niiih👀", "created_at": "2025-11-24T13:43:48", "owner": "gigirenggang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918953830199065, "text": "🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-24T11:35:05", "owner": "happpy_tummy88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092455771918319, "text": "Brilliant event! … only in NY ❤️!", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:16:42", "owner": "chourby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061594691202136, "text": "Best lah captionnya", "created_at": "2025-11-24T09:07:40", "owner": "deniilyasha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073864298520254, "text": "“Oh of cowwrse” 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:50:02", "owner": "oshea1080000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542052853019104, "text": "This is fucking beautiful 😂 as a smoker not keen on promoting cigs but this isn't even promoting it's just smokers getting together and doing it together! As bad as they are though, they're still better than smoking cartridges of flavoured chemicals 😂 at least we KNOW the health repercussions of cigarettes- vapes haven't been around long enough to know jack shit! Keep it ip🚬🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-24T05:47:45", "owner": "cl0wn50nv3nu5", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18071098292060864, "text": "Anyone smoke cloves?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:22:18", "owner": "josephsantoso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902483287165810, "text": "Its incredible what you did Bob ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-24T02:28:31", "owner": "w_t_fffox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18023195405598583, "text": "I love this!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:21:34", "owner": "turophile_in_a_sundress", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099375253687827, "text": "World is healing 🥹", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:19:39", "owner": "guilesland", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070204742063457, "text": "The Best", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:09:20", "owner": "alexandre_silvatte", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122893906466514, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T00:52:55", "owner": "hergia_luqman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046996550457613, "text": "Ledge", "created_at": "2025-11-23T23:02:41", "owner": "buckcrowell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842347783623665, "text": "This so wholesome 🥹", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:30:10", "owner": "djcurlynez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044778518481812, "text": "🔥🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-23T21:02:18", "owner": "romas_bistryavichus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929541136016386, "text": "We love you bob 🥹", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:35:52", "owner": "ashleynicole916", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17922899229189356, "text": "Def big tabacoo marketing as they are in a decline", "created_at": "2025-11-23T20:31:26", "owner": "oyas_love_siren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079122340921753, "text": "Legend 👏", "created_at": "2025-11-23T19:55:07", "owner": "missjodyok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057282668304453, "text": "Make smoking great again 🥰", "created_at": "2025-11-23T19:12:49", "owner": "capno_couple", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094835488853730, "text": "Exactly ! Make smocking your own choice and decision, love cigarettes 🚬❤️💕🥳👍🏻👏", "created_at": "2025-11-23T18:55:48", "owner": "cdvintageantiques", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044021048699747, "text": "Woooowwww loved that actually people showed up ❤️❤️❤️ wish i am in same state lol", "created_at": "2025-11-23T18:05:17", "owner": "razanzyy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865076464436407, "text": "YESSSSSSSSS", "created_at": "2025-11-23T18:01:28", "owner": "11jackie33", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849556858598373, "text": "@subwaytakes is iconic!", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:54:31", "owner": "wellnessbyyaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18008747216815565, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:45:11", "owner": "omar4atl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057928241284825, "text": "Los pulmones 🫁 salieron del chat 💬", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:42:36", "owner": "omar4atl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916559800228575, "text": "Reminds me of when we were a proper society!", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:22:53", "owner": "tdot619_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114991615568531, "text": "Is this....is this big tobacco", "created_at": "2025-11-23T16:52:59", "owner": "oscar.is.not.really.human", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054579275324069, "text": "Most wholesome unwholesome thing ever.. 😂👏🚬❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-23T16:50:50", "owner": "marshall760", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069103358615202, "text": "I love New York", "created_at": "2025-11-23T16:46:12", "owner": "sues_creations818", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028916495769833, "text": "Ew", "created_at": "2025-11-23T16:30:10", "owner": "maferbejarano", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18247035205290301, "text": "This is the most weirdly heartwarming thing 😅🫶", "created_at": "2025-11-23T16:25:26", "owner": "bananabottomboys", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074831240205822, "text": "this is something anthpo would do, i know its u @anthpo", "created_at": "2025-11-23T16:12:20", "owner": "jeezuuu_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066728432614309, "text": "What a day to be on vacation 😭🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-23T16:06:44", "owner": "dee.doing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048629714419025, "text": "This needs to happen again", "created_at": "2025-11-23T15:53:34", "owner": "mmcof6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985440957754952, "text": "Watching this as i’m on my cigarette break😄🥹✨", "created_at": "2025-11-23T15:44:51", "owner": "gabriellabekesi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852411025587295, "text": "5 minute event is hilarious 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T15:23:29", "owner": "feloniousmonke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950025555921299, "text": "Big tobacco loves this", "created_at": "2025-11-23T15:16:15", "owner": "riamichelle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305222218271608, "text": "Would’ve been out tht bihh with a black and a backwood😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T15:11:46", "owner": "sakkklanslattt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069221120580482, "text": "Feels like something @anthpo would pull off", "created_at": "2025-11-23T15:01:39", "owner": "clement_djuli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857322355559149, "text": "This was the first good thing to happen to the world in 2025", "created_at": "2025-11-23T15:00:00", "owner": "ak_whitney", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146201635439685, "text": "I Can Get Behind This.  Yeah", "created_at": "2025-11-23T14:59:40", "owner": "chimpslucky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18272677939303190, "text": "🚬✊🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-23T14:47:29", "owner": "wisnunatakusuma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856368058511012, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T14:46:17", "owner": "_thefool_22", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116056288577782, "text": "presidente da cigarrolândia", "created_at": "2025-11-23T14:35:59", "owner": "ubere.furgem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18538049356044090, "text": "Proud that’s not my crowd", "created_at": "2025-11-23T14:10:05", "owner": "kevin_a_johnson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912011161252047, "text": "I love death drive", "created_at": "2025-11-23T13:45:14", "owner": "damarin1917", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071737565343820, "text": "C’est une dinguerie ahahahha bien joué 14:42 ravi de voir que tu as fumer ta clope entouré et heureux !", "created_at": "2025-11-23T13:42:57", "owner": "ithibaut", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068227211578888, "text": "The drip in bob!", "created_at": "2025-11-23T13:37:20", "owner": "jill_barrientos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064636505571811, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-23T13:30:10", "owner": "calmonarde", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085497010996568, "text": "This guy, with one single cigarette, smart, is more capable to make people happier and get together than politicians", "created_at": "2025-11-23T13:23:56", "owner": "rodrigocestari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100448092673809, "text": "👏🔥❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-23T13:21:42", "owner": "thesupercaninemom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997483578703166, "text": "I'm really glad I got to see the outcome of this.", "created_at": "2025-11-23T13:21:25", "owner": "skemp167", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951244987048236, "text": "I don’t even smoke anymore but I’d go here and have a cigarette", "created_at": "2025-11-23T13:21:21", "owner": "theetexaspissartist1836", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18152675449374050, "text": "The world is healing", "created_at": "2025-11-23T12:37:36", "owner": "lucagrbsh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060595892541576, "text": ".ml w I'm j", "created_at": "2025-11-23T12:33:42", "owner": "mwago_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18388664986180337, "text": "🤦🏽‍♀️🤦🏽‍♀️🤦🏽‍♀️🤦🏽‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-11-23T12:32:21", "owner": "paulacasoy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054991289326951, "text": "1qq m", "created_at": "2025-11-23T12:32:13", "owner": "mwago_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086244175970011, "text": "People who smoke are week humans, people who walk and smoke so that everyone behind them has to inhale should be put down with a bullet🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-23T12:31:02", "owner": "nanjafknbiznis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086317247473844, "text": "Is this @anthpo again like he did with @johnchungus27 ? It feels the same", "created_at": "2025-11-23T12:19:29", "owner": "bthug728", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007431776811676, "text": "The best thing in internet that I have ever seen", "created_at": "2025-11-23T12:00:40", "owner": "alexasho.design", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929057215018546, "text": "I dont want a cigarette 🥰🥰", "created_at": "2025-11-23T11:44:03", "owner": "fayelefayele", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992075103854618, "text": "This is just a big tobacco ad", "created_at": "2025-11-23T11:33:37", "owner": "elroyjenkinsiv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867441295483221, "text": "Come to Amsterdam let's smoke one together 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-23T11:19:22", "owner": "bel.pedro_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070480217070514, "text": "Ok I gotta visit New York!!", "created_at": "2025-11-23T10:54:27", "owner": "muah_baby98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900462376324975, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T10:44:53", "owner": "martullazentola", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090271312820652, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T10:37:38", "owner": "tcheska0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17970553061973346, "text": "Love you Bob", "created_at": "2025-11-23T10:17:08", "owner": "britfishbein", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084251222024236, "text": "Fitting watch, this: https://youtu.be/lR18qwVutCM?si=_M53di4sgdNwXiy0", "created_at": "2025-11-23T10:10:45", "owner": "rusty_c_23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936153009981776, "text": "Nice one just lit up🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-23T10:06:58", "owner": "loveandterror_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087169198799557, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T10:05:07", "owner": "brunoburns29", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061804286625557, "text": "Lemme bum a smoke ogggggg", "created_at": "2025-11-23T10:01:33", "owner": "plsforgiveme4ivesinned", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079466567130915, "text": "Move over Jesus feeding the 5000. Bro had enough ciggies for 2k people from a single pack 🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-23T09:57:50", "owner": "lynhamtom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067055975120637, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T09:56:52", "owner": "thirzaloves", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032545916531225, "text": "Puff", "created_at": "2025-11-23T09:30:22", "owner": "manuellito18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870881881466944, "text": "What a awesome way to come together to smoke a fro 🚬 are cigs really back?", "created_at": "2025-11-23T09:21:11", "owner": "yoshiiisora", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542026555028921, "text": "🚬🔥❤️✨️", "created_at": "2025-11-23T09:08:46", "owner": "malkia_lx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118691020550392, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T08:52:02", "owner": "juanma88_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100605760688391, "text": "I hate this but also like this remove the cigarettes and I’d love this", "created_at": "2025-11-23T08:32:16", "owner": "cyberfairy777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047054933449563, "text": "live like larry😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T08:24:38", "owner": "aris_yud", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18352448848164367, "text": "Cigarettes can heal the world", "created_at": "2025-11-23T08:23:35", "owner": "best_jake.ever", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064276337616915, "text": "❤️🔥🔥🔥❤️ Thanks Gramps, I'm stoner out here in lagos Nigeria, and i toked to you. Cheers Sir!", "created_at": "2025-11-23T08:21:56", "owner": "onehellofagorgeousrebel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992204793895336, "text": "I wanna be there so baddddd 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-23T08:14:06", "owner": "sunnyboo01", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062109044535403, "text": "cigs are a thousand times better than vapes FINAL ANSWER", "created_at": "2025-11-23T08:03:26", "owner": "talbalz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113262997582159, "text": "I was there in spirit.", "created_at": "2025-11-23T07:57:22", "owner": "jbd30310", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858949786552854, "text": "Well 🧃 well 🧃 well 🧃", "created_at": "2025-11-23T07:47:54", "owner": "macelaru.ali", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18187956742340937, "text": "Ill take this over stupid fucking Palestinians", "created_at": "2025-11-23T07:29:27", "owner": "tgreno", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120012922546540, "text": "my community is out there 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-23T07:27:30", "owner": "jackie_ohnastie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080088005147623, "text": "Yay bob", "created_at": "2025-11-23T07:27:05", "owner": "decepticonsforeverrrrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085837886054302, "text": "Cigars are better", "created_at": "2025-11-23T07:22:43", "owner": "fullest_proof_nyc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086342614818891, "text": "Bob is a legend 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-23T07:04:43", "owner": "antphil.91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065651027378952, "text": "The end is near.", "created_at": "2025-11-23T06:51:14", "owner": "azra_gicic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988895355907542, "text": "A proper country", "created_at": "2025-11-23T06:50:59", "owner": "mikeydat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846902413587074, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T06:22:20", "owner": "killlethan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078535178173046, "text": "🚬🚬🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-23T06:20:44", "owner": "ra.fik.99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18516432379068870, "text": "This is making me wish I lived in NY and was a cigarette smoker", "created_at": "2025-11-23T06:12:17", "owner": "the.village.witch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883137070410002, "text": "🚬❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-23T06:02:21", "owner": "desai.maharshi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096310861877903, "text": "Bob the Jewish smoker lit one Marlboro and 1,500 people showed up. Three puffs later it’s a collectible, insured by Lloyd’s of London, and demanding its own bar mitzvah.", "created_at": "2025-11-23T05:44:43", "owner": "eeman_saleem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873768622375995, "text": "500 ciggerates pleaseeeee 🗣️🗣️🗣️🗣️👆🏻👆🏻👆🏻👆🏻🔥🔥🔥🔥🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-23T05:35:47", "owner": "get_baited_108", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083297813319581, "text": "The caption at the end 👑", "created_at": "2025-11-23T05:34:57", "owner": "rankx_da_vv.i.p", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132812971428854, "text": "🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-23T05:31:10", "owner": "d_and_d61", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18146979430378598, "text": "Fuck yea bob", "created_at": "2025-11-23T05:27:22", "owner": "lunchwithpauly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079705418140453, "text": "@kaushal_.02", "created_at": "2025-11-23T05:23:56", "owner": "angoda_podda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135924988463077, "text": "If he’s straight & available @dorindamedley 🩷", "created_at": "2025-11-23T05:22:29", "owner": "beef_mcgravy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058181393278049, "text": "It really looks like a lot of young kids just need that fun old man role model in their lives 🚬❤️🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-23T05:21:17", "owner": "marissamadness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142771579442828, "text": "If you could smell a crowd's bad breath from a video", "created_at": "2025-11-23T05:19:35", "owner": "fire_walkwithmee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122810509521864, "text": "Bob the Builder", "created_at": "2025-11-23T05:18:31", "owner": "nqobi_zizwe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001722233681649, "text": "We're living through history", "created_at": "2025-11-23T05:12:11", "owner": "hoeyjunter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18365943985088157, "text": "Of course he’s a Jew 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T05:09:24", "owner": "laughsmileslife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540693814045317, "text": "LIGHTING ONE UP FOR BOB RN!!! 🚬😂😭", "created_at": "2025-11-23T05:04:23", "owner": "faiths_infinite_universe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051332444355655, "text": "Love the unity", "created_at": "2025-11-23T05:03:54", "owner": "kingkoser6364", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18198148750326204, "text": "The beauty of New York", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:57:47", "owner": "heyitsnaks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061771775533100, "text": "@itsjohany_27 fuistes?", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:56:38", "owner": "rigoferrera97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056501684640613, "text": "Hell yeah Bob!!! F uck the weirdos saying smoking is bad in comments...Losers ..", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:56:04", "owner": "ton1no", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114142090603264, "text": "2:00pm-2:05pm 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:50:53", "owner": "moe_jelody", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329215606214378, "text": "🫡", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:50:07", "owner": "texas_unique", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968059419986364, "text": "Great event !!", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:43:46", "owner": "taianinteriors", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065459594148019, "text": "This is how boring nyc is", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:42:55", "owner": "dwr_817", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924037456177494, "text": "Hell yes", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:39:39", "owner": "jpolich333", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899303419186131, "text": "sk", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:38:19", "owner": "llibertysuspect", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18044977286700993, "text": "omg i love this sm", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:34:19", "owner": "shitcalledlyf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928003957149986, "text": "Gross, I’d hate to walk down that block", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:33:53", "owner": "itsme_angeliquee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852399436585239, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:33:25", "owner": "corner_boi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18544439260015189, "text": "Is big tobacco owned by 🧃? If so, then this post would make even more sense", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:32:35", "owner": "we.the.ceeple", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950520697047908, "text": "I belong in NYC", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:32:01", "owner": "writerbself", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113279851583271, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:30:11", "owner": "ruhanofnd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086043317076722, "text": "W Bob", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:26:27", "owner": "chaitanyasdongare", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18326596144214292, "text": "Fuck sake. He's one of them 👃🏽 🤥 l 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:26:20", "owner": "niazad92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097860229800326, "text": "Sturdy ina hood", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:23:33", "owner": "hakaishinrain", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126442741504686, "text": "Classic 🚬🚬🚬🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:20:24", "owner": "jeonghwichan6012", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104698825648368, "text": "I’m telling you the world is healing itself…….", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:14:08", "owner": "baylessallen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074137898220168, "text": "\"we made a lot of money at your expense, also we suffered, hear about that?\"", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:11:51", "owner": "jt_lasvegas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18328597567245020, "text": "I was gonna share this, but....", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:10:56", "owner": "prennies", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074043281259927, "text": "Fuck israɛl 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:09:03", "owner": "big.exoticz.559", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107840266619583, "text": "Can we do Js next? Or blunts…, whatever floats your boat", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:02:49", "owner": "queena822", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096205969831355, "text": "What the fuck is this?", "created_at": "2025-11-23T04:01:01", "owner": "alohaocean", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074575307349943, "text": "Amazing", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:59:38", "owner": "ultrapapo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103810015730208, "text": "Yeah, keep smoking and you can join my dad, being paralized because of the stroke, regret for not quit smoking sooner 🔥🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:59:20", "owner": "nhatminh1912", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123941170457567, "text": "i wanna do this when i’m old", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:56:46", "owner": "rowilson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994138464706404, "text": "2:00-2:05 is sending meeeeeee", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:56:19", "owner": "rowilson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849362827567955, "text": "Fucking epic 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:56:10", "owner": "anyabzh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066433859124172, "text": "This is the stupidest thing I've literally ever seen", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:55:36", "owner": "last_vastian_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108066997627155, "text": "I don't smoke. I've never smoked. But hell yeah. 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:55:08", "owner": "janellejade", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134949532485597, "text": "A propaganda event for Marlboro (or tobacco in general). Kudos for them. These folks seem to have fun", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:54:46", "owner": "pritikina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18188508556340223, "text": "The ability to draw a crowd, dangerous man right there", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:53:52", "owner": "dash_burgess", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915919756230079, "text": "This is how hungry people are for human connection. There’s something to learn here", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:53:37", "owner": "j0sephg0nzalez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18523883794064316, "text": "500 HUNDRED CIGARRETS 🗣️🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:53:03", "owner": "jeicoalmonte", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18094811137842368, "text": "I don’t smoke but if I was in New York I would definitely come and smoke a cigarette", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:50:14", "owner": "regus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097770955804572, "text": "This is cool - but New York looks like an absolute shithole 💩", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:49:43", "owner": "_lion.style", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852659830583936, "text": "If I wasn’t working in Staten Island I would’ve been there bob!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:48:56", "owner": "10eddiep", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952428970023815, "text": "Legendary", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:46:17", "owner": "bleachdrinker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099797710685990, "text": "ditunggu gus @ikhsanul_iman", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:42:21", "owner": "isa.biyyu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928607686149547, "text": "I love this!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:41:13", "owner": "_rabbittheunicorn_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117122395553452, "text": "What will he do next ?! 😯", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:40:57", "owner": "fukinbaked", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135198418480167, "text": "that 5 mins turned to the whole day", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:40:20", "owner": "lysiferr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100394395683280, "text": "🔥😭👏", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:38:59", "owner": "robertmatas._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891493213366537, "text": "I have no idea who this is, is this another anthpo plant?", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:37:54", "owner": "ram.342.delreal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064619687166859, "text": "Some em if you got em", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:36:39", "owner": "kaylance_74", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944558242077094, "text": "😂😂😂🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:35:49", "owner": "glamcocostacks", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088395433945001, "text": "Use a jew if you need to promote degeneracy! Theyre always down to look like heroes while peddling filth.", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:34:32", "owner": "hollllllllyshot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064569785177939, "text": "this tastes like an anthpo scheme", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:33:31", "owner": "nootwantstobattle2", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18380740561151939, "text": "Yooo come to AZ 😭 PLZZZ", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:31:44", "owner": "___romance_el", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045526211475321, "text": "The people yearn for community.", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:27:43", "owner": "nick.dichiara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082033226036249, "text": "OLD MAN STILL AURA FARMING", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:24:09", "owner": "gigahdphotos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098872729692891, "text": "He’s signed a box of 27’s 🔥 🔥 not 72’s.", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:15:10", "owner": "thatguy_andy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158677054395354, "text": "😍😍😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:14:45", "owner": "iansawus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074243555261414, "text": "Gives me hope", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:11:22", "owner": "nickyt_72", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927808051154656, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:09:33", "owner": "chaoantonia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18325561690242259, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:09:01", "owner": "you_ta_lu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065576750131679, "text": "Is this bob from subway takes?", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:08:24", "owner": "villagemiked", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18536376526054431, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:06:26", "owner": "g.v.c", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18293668666302936, "text": "6 months that i quit smoking, but i will smokw again after 60+", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:06:20", "owner": "marchi775", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18199609441323631, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:06:17", "owner": "illmatic82_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18345837403200377, "text": "what a guy", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:04:17", "owner": "charysmaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17871155571466377, "text": "🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:04:00", "owner": "mike.from.ri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18429515989106499, "text": "Fucking legend 🚬🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:01:53", "owner": "hisdivinefeminine.ig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990028395909533, "text": "What the heck is going on here?", "created_at": "2025-11-23T02:58:02", "owner": "oliverheidekat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876309370352186, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-11-23T02:56:08", "owner": "whatdoifeel.ac.kr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866681257493113, "text": "I love that smoking is cool again", "created_at": "2025-11-23T02:54:03", "owner": "emilymeara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062163365631677, "text": "@nerol_27 dare you to do a south wales one", "created_at": "2025-11-23T02:53:26", "owner": "lauren.walker_23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931924648112883, "text": "🫁 be like 🫩", "created_at": "2025-11-22T20:09:23", "owner": "tailor_lo_ran", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876307930352873, "text": "Was very sad that I couldn’t be there 😣", "created_at": "2025-11-22T20:09:00", "owner": "vjdeux", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17862472665454086, "text": "Can we get this guy on a marlboro commercial 🤭🤗🤗", "created_at": "2025-11-22T20:08:25", "owner": "haleygrindcore", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068545412604994, "text": "What a legend", "created_at": "2025-11-22T20:07:29", "owner": "dreadfully.awake", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921390787056032, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T20:06:50", "owner": "chocobeambananaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088988422757858, "text": "@grimmgreen 🚬 Jesus 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T20:04:50", "owner": "beths_ig_page", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908418349126025, "text": "Is Antony behind this", "created_at": "2025-11-22T20:04:05", "owner": "gabriela.lromero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005441873822950, "text": "مؤسس السرطان:", "created_at": "2025-11-22T20:03:04", "owner": "9ujr_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987620712912691, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T20:02:12", "owner": "fediiifed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063479609444920, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-22T20:01:20", "owner": "t4tirich", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084095935859005, "text": "Can I bring a joint next time", "created_at": "2025-11-22T20:01:16", "owner": "joseole444", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18431688955108474, "text": "Gpi", "created_at": "2025-11-22T20:00:57", "owner": "aloglv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901574356308284, "text": "🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:58:52", "owner": "roflcopter.jpg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039524165713789, "text": "😭🔥👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:58:51", "owner": "courtneyalmeida_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915886480229193, "text": "The world is smoking", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:58:37", "owner": "bigflirtrecords", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933061513112171, "text": "I regret quitting", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:57:21", "owner": "meg_latewithacoffee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062841833404181, "text": "🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:56:45", "owner": "yolcjlcj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102749305733446, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:56:25", "owner": "yerodash", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941148097093834, "text": "Who is this man and where can i join", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:56:03", "owner": "chelzfeltz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951252079044279, "text": "Legend", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:52:48", "owner": "chandanizer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079054558898225, "text": "I don’t condone cigarette smoking but this is cool", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:51:30", "owner": "candicemanier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084282641006976, "text": "Smoking a 🚬 is fun; I mean hey: I'm glad he enjoyed it!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:51:02", "owner": "nyc_bellsz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993755442854568, "text": "Love this", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:50:38", "owner": "tifflova12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18347106496207683, "text": "No, I always work on the discipline. Don’t shame yourself or hate yourself for having a fag every once in a while. But definitely focus on getting your discipline under control, which will help your life in every single facet. Smoking will never be good for you.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:50:21", "owner": "bochapman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045634313695699, "text": "What a time to be alive 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:49:52", "owner": "doctorrosetalks", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083903666320079, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:47:59", "owner": "be.basstastic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914982748088371, "text": "🚬❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:47:49", "owner": "iamthatshop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907649092267433, "text": "make this guy president", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:47:46", "owner": "simasakhina", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18027435647570340, "text": "Watching this from a smoke break at work 🫶", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:47:09", "owner": "cryptic_craftz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073305332264505, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:42:58", "owner": "agobas", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083744039045794, "text": "Don't condone smoking, but totally condone doing random fun shit with your community 🥰", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:40:51", "owner": "katethemuse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915387412232931, "text": "So sad I couldn’t be there for now on when I cave in and have a cig it’s gonna be for you bob 🥹🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:40:09", "owner": "demondrizzy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084665849055131, "text": "@navasak this could be ur fav event so far 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:38:23", "owner": "murderorkill", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17863700757517824, "text": "@dumbeetho 🚬❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:37:25", "owner": "lupeeeweee", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17953063257024819, "text": "I feel like New York is the only place you won’t be judged for smoking. I sometimes miss it especially lighting one up in a bar", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:37:23", "owner": "louuwhoo20", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083761694068121, "text": "Jew?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:36:00", "owner": "fcbesayl2567", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076707281602848, "text": "this is beautiful", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:35:50", "owner": "mariellaflores_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18411704413187331, "text": "Vape who?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:35:11", "owner": "hanabii_user", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064444505617653, "text": "Dude… I gotta hang with this chiller", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:33:58", "owner": "carstenstills", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18008733095815821, "text": "And that’s how world peace is delivered 😂😂😂🥳", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:33:49", "owner": "javitexmex", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119018077480055, "text": "Hell yeah Bob! Burin one down for ya from Nunavut Canada!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:33:16", "owner": "zach_187361", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102042841679465, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:31:38", "owner": "bellathereaper", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18158611540403937, "text": "❤️❤️❤️🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:31:30", "owner": "grovebytheocean", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076208393225344, "text": "We need more of this kind of support", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:29:22", "owner": "tonirebaldo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18372301150154756, "text": "I can smell the event from Canada and I'm not even in Canada.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:25:42", "owner": "ataxians", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076159423968077, "text": "@anthpo 🤔🤔🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:25:08", "owner": "ymisage", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058554644270323, "text": "I hope you get cancer and die, so you can be a lesson to everyone who smokes and encourages others to smoke.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:24:47", "owner": "quyzii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18192687370335411, "text": "Is @anthpo involved in this?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:24:41", "owner": "shawwn.444", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077545252950687, "text": "Marlboro southern cut!!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:24:26", "owner": "x.x_rm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987668253879075, "text": "Wait till ya get lung cancer 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:23:45", "owner": "lewis_davin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076011587334814, "text": "Si con los Marlboro rojos", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:23:17", "owner": "dismantledystopia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081582223887639, "text": "THIS is why NY city is awesome 🤩", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:23:01", "owner": "nykrissa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096271597657272, "text": "Legend", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:22:23", "owner": "xavanero", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957343636031391, "text": "New anthpo vid incoming", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:21:49", "owner": "duval.remi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890035207380121, "text": "This is giving John Chungus with cigs", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:21:42", "owner": "sarawyllie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977950770948288, "text": "This is soo wholesome", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:21:18", "owner": "rukzdstanmvp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031258964732238, "text": "Legend", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:20:09", "owner": "dani.alejandra.m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086930260974357, "text": "It turns out you can just do cool stuff with people ❤️ what a wholesome experience", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:19:59", "owner": "maxmousee", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18104223196726833, "text": "This gives me hope for America", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:19:42", "owner": "koleygram", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877936243431756, "text": "Me the moment one drop of alcohol hits my lips", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:19:21", "owner": "chelsealouhauschildt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18028058660563126, "text": "In private he maniacally laughs and proceeds to hack to a lung", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:19:10", "owner": "olafo_waffle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17843695761619519, "text": "i just quit, 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:18:46", "owner": "_arnoldee_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546024784003436, "text": "The world is healing", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:18:09", "owner": "haydenjoegold", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540908167063928, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:16:50", "owner": "mario_altieri_jr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049210835397194, "text": "Good Shabbos", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:16:34", "owner": "peytongwinn18", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918438358211221, "text": "@co11eencampbe11 looking for you", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:16:12", "owner": "julie_miller9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18292310128286294, "text": "My community", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:15:56", "owner": "livefromearth.exe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065917724528777, "text": "Fantastic 🔥🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:14:44", "owner": "themommyndthedal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879569173425690, "text": "A legend", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:13:59", "owner": "arya_t_18_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136477348462348, "text": "В Нью Йорке походу вообще делать нехyй😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:13:19", "owner": "magazinqueens.ru", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929547508016614, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:12:51", "owner": "imnotdylandebris", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047447945431493, "text": "🚬🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:12:23", "owner": "tiagosilva180_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997635303702339, "text": "@mspaigelove", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:08:40", "owner": "christina.paige.7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067548119384188, "text": "I love New York", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:08:30", "owner": "nyc.tommy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18267052318305111, "text": "Smoking time at my office be like:", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:07:20", "owner": "niloufareisalou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547405033029331, "text": "America is amazing lol", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:07:11", "owner": "aka_broker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092032117900320, "text": "The energy with which you do something is as important as the act itself, a cigarette with friends in a relaxed state is un harmful, versus a cigarette to deal with fear or anxiety that can provoke death, it’s all a conduit that can heal or sicken. Depending on you, your energy and your envoirement.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:06:44", "owner": "ham.espinosa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011714711797343, "text": "Absolute Legend", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:05:33", "owner": "alisono1225", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921311365056622, "text": "¡ Shabbat Shalom Bob !", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:04:08", "owner": "just_dave_515", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888055816263583, "text": "🤢🤢🤢🤢", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:03:47", "owner": "1sdfii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996450309848742, "text": "NYC is another universe I swear. Never change 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:03:35", "owner": "bellabloodlustproductions", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18210350917312991, "text": "@kingsolodelva", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:03:03", "owner": "sedensabuncu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082099841037799, "text": "Shabbat shalom!❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:02:40", "owner": "_nenelindo_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891518857376238, "text": "BOBBY!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:01:50", "owner": "burgertrugs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899348530338210, "text": "I wanna smoke a cig now 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:01:35", "owner": "onlygamblingclips", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108927556537877, "text": "Oh how I love you New York", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:00:40", "owner": "trashpandaganda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081548438117322, "text": "Smoke this smoke that", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:00:32", "owner": "chestoniarcenal", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18105797551643919, "text": "lighting up a cig for you rn Bob", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:59:01", "owner": "liadmello", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338572171232883, "text": "Happy for you oldman", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:57:51", "owner": "mohsen_ghamati", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043067507687185, "text": "Can someone tell me who Bob is?!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:57:19", "owner": "vikaskindacool", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17872545363461106, "text": "Without Cloves, cigs is not a cigs.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:55:10", "owner": "42616761734d75666c696566", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089785612820630, "text": "NYC is wild 🔥🚬👏", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:54:09", "owner": "gypsy___moth", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18064333169158582, "text": "I love this lol", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:54:00", "owner": "abbysnopek", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073350518252937, "text": "Might as well join ya 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:51:08", "owner": "glorious.va", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065453984621417, "text": "🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:50:26", "owner": "the_voidscape", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921275467057155, "text": "@brandinwoodard something to warm your heart after a shit week", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:48:59", "owner": "laken_luv", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17953519838902853, "text": "I was there. It was great.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:48:30", "owner": "rossdecker", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17889656313384781, "text": "Wish I was there… next time", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:48:15", "owner": "ripdunes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087772957945238, "text": "O @rogerio.skylab da gringa🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:47:53", "owner": "murilo.ols", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058406291637262, "text": "Its def a vibe only smokers would get but don't start 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:47:43", "owner": "jc_9six", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096705145828700, "text": "❤️❤️🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:47:36", "owner": "raquelelchavo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072920336029655, "text": "this is so rad and cool", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:47:19", "owner": "gameboybart", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078851830934657, "text": "😂😂💓", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:47:18", "owner": "heart.led", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17987211401869852, "text": "Meir", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:46:28", "owner": "srulykessler", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18004678580823781, "text": "Man i haven't smoked in weeks and this pops up", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:46:13", "owner": "ahhmoohshrosemptjewelry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937153108098864, "text": "🚬🚬🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:46:05", "owner": "ammbyyyyy", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18065258273566463, "text": "wow, can’t believe my mom missed the opportunity of a lifetime to flex her insane chain smoking skills. she would’ve loved this.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:43:28", "owner": "spooky.blunt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109359733528617, "text": "Extreme social smoking 😭 I actually love this", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:43:25", "owner": "neyafae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859094983491907, "text": "Wish I lived closer 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:41:41", "owner": "r.torrijos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104152729733938, "text": "Amazing", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:40:58", "owner": "brayiswack", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092304376911499, "text": "@ilsegomz’s idol 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:40:56", "owner": "anafernandaurtaza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105232531651343, "text": "@___sophi", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:40:42", "owner": "che.boludito", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864244756523820, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥🚬🚬🚬🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:40:18", "owner": "63036j", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978383754933942, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:36:55", "owner": "milkteapapiii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975935883793084, "text": "Yay 4 Bob!! 🚬❤️NYC", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:36:54", "owner": "baysicbitsch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028488383563390, "text": "Hes so cute", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:36:15", "owner": "xingaxow", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18408544087184482, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:35:47", "owner": "badbluecheese", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17944614372080127, "text": "God I know that whole block smelt disgusting 🤮", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:35:43", "owner": "the_cowboykid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033640145724303, "text": "Smoking 1 for you today", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:34:59", "owner": "powerchildnesss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960915480867753, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:33:53", "owner": "comicalmama777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893873035221398, "text": "cigarettes can’t hurt you if you have a pure heart", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:33:49", "owner": "jahleelseye", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17870688300467769, "text": "Disgusting, and a sign of idiocracy. Although tobacco is already sentenced to death anyway. You’ll see soon enough.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:31:51", "owner": "laoyue19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18393818656124620, "text": "An American hero", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:31:48", "owner": "nick_burns88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18014574449796497, "text": "the world is healing", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:31:38", "owner": "thereal_willie_nelson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859094944551128, "text": "Now do this with stoners only. WHERE ARE MY STONERS AND MARY JANE'S?!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:31:35", "owner": "m0difiedmermaidfromhell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320834170220896, "text": "About to light one up just as I finish this comment 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:29:54", "owner": "the_majkles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868125991475946, "text": "🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:28:35", "owner": "sumit__bhandari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091177178478739, "text": "@tunikaknows", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:27:40", "owner": "iireti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18515060476065630, "text": "Damn I wanted to go 😭😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:26:59", "owner": "docta_wub", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18051268682361166, "text": "Cigarettes really do transcend time, religion, politics, nationality, and more. They are the great equalizer. Inspiring.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:26:18", "owner": "kristina.luise", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18496196356078259, "text": "wholesome", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:25:58", "owner": "m0rbeck", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965796960843082, "text": "I didnt see who posted this. Then i saw his nose and i was like oh is it a yew?😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:25:32", "owner": "ibelieveinseagulls", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059524541267284, "text": "Love you Bob!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:24:18", "owner": "raiasflowers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295784572284341, "text": "@maraa__z :perfect day doesnt exi", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:22:48", "owner": "alempijevic.213", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541083535052539, "text": "Bob lighting a 16 year olds smoke 👏🚬😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:22:44", "owner": "jenikaburton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081808958037070, "text": "Yes!!!! My man!👏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:22:25", "owner": "s.amantha_m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860269141475410, "text": "smoking a cig rn so I can celebrate this beautiful use of free will", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:21:57", "owner": "zonnebloemli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953620150031315, "text": "Legend", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:20:17", "owner": "jamalelsaghir9", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18319954528171343, "text": "Reds", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:19:31", "owner": "sergio_bello", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18433423354107955, "text": "Make him president so we can smoke inside of bars, public transport, planes and everywhere else again", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:18:37", "owner": "mikeh__14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017062679795294, "text": "YESSSSSS", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:18:16", "owner": "kailakingg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989494398738964, "text": "Jesus Christ is King 👑", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:17:24", "owner": "hellovtec", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18364161841093467, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:17:09", "owner": "joshua__axl", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18107885521627832, "text": "I can smell it from here and it smells like WE ARE SO BACK!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:16:44", "owner": "lotuslovesbean", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079809599140540, "text": "LONG LIVE CIGARETTES!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:16:02", "owner": "davidconlogue", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863421118531210, "text": "@indirect_mixture", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:15:48", "owner": "aggy_gillon", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17852165766588561, "text": "omggg come to Porto Alegre, Brasil", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:15:03", "owner": "ehojordas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547174234051271, "text": "@goodshirts the update 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:14:54", "owner": "g0thbrooks", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095127154879532, "text": "The new Marlboro man", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:14:33", "owner": "alexfrom330", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083466860088352, "text": "🚬🔥🔥🔥❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:14:10", "owner": "dontalleviate", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139149664457789, "text": "Okei now who wanna smoke a cig with me in Paris ?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:14:09", "owner": "symon.ulv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18132090019493485, "text": "i should start smoking cigarettes", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:13:49", "owner": "im_addisonnn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099898942692562, "text": "I'm so proud of you all. Run it back next year.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:13:17", "owner": "bigstickbook", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545578903062406, "text": "🚬🚬🚬LFG", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:12:44", "owner": "julio.cesar.williams", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911829241250748, "text": "Some of the rudest people you know don’t smoke", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:12:12", "owner": "ghostcatglass", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924552808043035, "text": "How many people had their first cig cause of this event… and why isn’t this a tour across states !?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:11:12", "owner": "ho_swa3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100454713702898, "text": "😭😭😭😭😭🚬🚬🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:10:53", "owner": "gracebrown6335", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857039902506126, "text": "long live hedonism! ❤️🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:10:27", "owner": "lulu_landddd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18195096229334847, "text": "🚬🔥❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:10:19", "owner": "luparelli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160510213397290, "text": "dawg", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:10:19", "owner": "rizwan.ziraj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002602043829907, "text": "Well said! 👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:09:27", "owner": "ms_melrose7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064155815433297, "text": "This is Renaissance🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:09:16", "owner": "jinolux", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18290131867272273, "text": "“One more cig! One more cig” 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:07:59", "owner": "daphne.e.muller", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842242690626026, "text": "YEAH BOY", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:07:50", "owner": "mririii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847439110582574, "text": "fuck u jew", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:07:03", "owner": "splivv_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17861800908537977, "text": "That’s smoky haze in the air gave me hope for this country again maybe one day we’ll be great again and smoke cigarettes everywhere", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:06:56", "owner": "eli1978__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884352091407596, "text": "This has Anthpo written on it...", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:05:39", "owner": "clean_kebbito", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857328904558473, "text": "Making society cool again", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:03:41", "owner": "raphael.semank", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060711398235729, "text": "Love u bob", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:03:32", "owner": "alyvvsa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029534885742191, "text": "SOMEBODY HANDED HIM SOME 27'S TO SIGN I LOVE THAT SO MUCH", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:03:23", "owner": "robbie__hanson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844489951615668, "text": "I know it smell crazy out there lmao", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:03:15", "owner": "shwcase", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18111995740589785, "text": "The people have the power", "created_at": "2025-11-22T18:00:26", "owner": "infinite__breast", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095925106832533, "text": "@radiomadmax 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:59:25", "owner": "adrienreveleau", "lik