: 0}, {"id": 18084082097514670, "text": "😭🚬❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:45:53", "owner": "stan_meyer8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102630094671629, "text": "🔥❤️❤️🚬😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:45:51", "owner": "joanagpenna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064501565159070, "text": "I will right now!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:44:59", "owner": "itsalicelazzarotto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051066740371287, "text": "Evil anthpo", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:43:20", "owner": "griffgriff_almighty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902077795316518, "text": "Yeah 👍 keep Americans hooked on your corrupt cooperate poison! Shabbat Shalom! 👎🐀💰🇺🇸👿", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:42:47", "owner": "itsmeinstatrixie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979725846780102, "text": "Im watching the rebirth of a world we, cowardly, leave to die.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:42:44", "owner": "manuel.ytn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120161437555339, "text": "So nice to see young people smoking cigarettes again", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:42:28", "owner": "juliamluis", "likes": 249}, {"id": 18095819050894902, "text": "Bob come to Philly next", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:42:20", "owner": "nikki_procopio", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18099181978684147, "text": "This makes me so happy", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:41:30", "owner": "hannesmoreels", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074023100254008, "text": "OMG I SAW THE INVITE ON PARTIFUL 😂😭🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:41:24", "owner": "illfayze", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18088329559941003, "text": "Who is this legend?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:41:14", "owner": "mardralo999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941533243088232, "text": "\"Shabbat Shalom\" 🤔🤔🤔🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:39:52", "owner": "_cyrus98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890572612380939, "text": "Someone said Big Tobacco thinks they’re slick 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:39:07", "owner": "ox__delilah", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18160557781401735, "text": "gross", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:37:34", "owner": "janettejskibum7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903576685299030, "text": "Can’t believe I missed this shit. Run it back next week unc, appreciate you.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:37:09", "owner": "coach_jonas_solano", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119355127546715, "text": "Vei que resenha", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:36:50", "owner": "luapche", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098284408768338, "text": "The cigs inside movement grows soon we will take back what was once ours", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:36:17", "owner": "chrishickey1212", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18111793003590334, "text": "I know it stank out there 🫩", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:35:41", "owner": "shayy___butterr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18300949936249388, "text": "How to get kids to smoke cigs 101", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:34:09", "owner": "aldit.o", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18024486056782295, "text": "🤘🏻🤘🏻🤘🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:33:48", "owner": "thonglorsnowshop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979253328944997, "text": "This is so NYC. Don't smoke if you can it's terrible for you but this is so wholesome", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:33:04", "owner": "tinamarie310", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934958947072979, "text": "i'm supposed to b there 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:32:11", "owner": "camster10000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988261899858014, "text": "@alvasoderholm", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:31:00", "owner": "saramarabini_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17893357902362683, "text": "lighting it up 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:30:54", "owner": "koigunjaishnai", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058291901639827, "text": "Big tobacco? is that you? It's been ages.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:30:45", "owner": "adrianayemedia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009448610813178, "text": "\" My dream ? I am living my dream\"_ best line ever", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:30:24", "owner": "nongmaithemsagar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17961526625862181, "text": "I saw this entire thing unfold right before my eyes. Can't wait to unfold this egendary tale for my kids", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:29:16", "owner": "juhel_04x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085763044987907, "text": "\"If you weren't able to come, have a cigarette for me.\" -Me, to your mom last night.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:28:15", "owner": "dirty.dans.uncle.ted", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937139677099189, "text": "@theonlycp718 😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:28:03", "owner": "bridge_1905", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18154849915409666, "text": "awesome", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:27:49", "owner": "justyn_hill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123962086454606, "text": "This what it’s all about", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:27:19", "owner": "hurt__cobain__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087719404787084, "text": "already, bob 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:27:16", "owner": "adampwp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090883642737797, "text": "Would have been super dope. if when everyone showed up.  You explained how they should all quit the habit of it.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:26:58", "owner": "5thave_ricky", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18348551224200188, "text": "Sad I missed this", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:25:11", "owner": "carlipuddleduck", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18061571405201156, "text": "What a absolute G.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:25:11", "owner": "valorbridge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059441156543397, "text": "is this also anthony po?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:24:01", "owner": "stlesnik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096877990858782, "text": "espiritualmente lyncheano", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:23:20", "owner": "estoyperdidooo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987763980880261, "text": "Damn, not yall cheering for the industry plant 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:23:12", "owner": "claytonpanderson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953124010044001, "text": "this is so precious", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:23:03", "owner": "jaydiznit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118404922558792, "text": "The hero we needed!!🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:21:53", "owner": "realistrealt0r", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866824486493140, "text": "A club but the entire place is the smokers section so connections are made and amazing conversations are had. 🥲", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:21:36", "owner": "oorchiddivinee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087134386802452, "text": "I need a this event in denver plz", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:21:02", "owner": "jeauseph", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18412672822143331, "text": "I prefer that everyone would smoke cigarettes than drink alcohol. Cigarettes have not cause drunk driving , sexual assaults , domestic violence and More ..", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:20:58", "owner": "haitian_sensation_2.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079511756123242, "text": "Tqm señor que fuma 😭❤️🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:20:30", "owner": "tabs.96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046520864446701, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:20:17", "owner": "coreythecumedian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057175181291657, "text": "He deserves fame", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:20:13", "owner": "kaylaaasimone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083058092097063, "text": "My goat", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:19:49", "owner": "livkingsbury", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18370891861159897, "text": "GOATED!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:19:23", "owner": "therealdonnysavage", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18102502057666760, "text": "Marlboro sponsor this man asap", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:18:44", "owner": "niklasrimpi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036181811718431, "text": "Legend 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:18:44", "owner": "amkh97.pv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18297473290257158, "text": "Hell Yeah 🚬🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:18:28", "owner": "lokesh_kk_27", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18113174782595897, "text": "I bet Anthony Bourdain would have loved this 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:17:54", "owner": "_mama_danger_", "likes": 241}, {"id": 18248983294292687, "text": "Dang, if I was in NY, I would have been there!!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:17:44", "owner": "kathrynwb39", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18307637734301640, "text": "im glad he had a better birthday than me", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:17:33", "owner": "am.berr432", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060157532532577, "text": "Smoking ⬇️ Community ⬆️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:17:16", "owner": "tankwill_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890310997365966, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:16:54", "owner": "steezybryce", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18390314548178311, "text": "Is this john marlboro or sum?😭 Who is this😭", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:16:23", "owner": "its.omaribrahim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904213312293993, "text": "This generation is delusional. Btw i love smoking.😭😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:16:18", "owner": "_tei_the_taciturn_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18511217755067949, "text": "Man , I just fucking love smoking. 🚬❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:14:57", "owner": "shane_ward1008", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064988927145532, "text": "Another Jew tryina poison the masses", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:13:46", "owner": "amiel_anatoly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18498943174077529, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:13:00", "owner": "el_duendemonio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891718465366160, "text": "The Marlboro Gran", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:12:38", "owner": "halpinhoff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085202423051566, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:12:15", "owner": "pimpson73", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103181023656196, "text": "satisfaction 🔥🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:12:13", "owner": "cocci_champion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113498884573767, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:11:49", "owner": "meggz_beenadikt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17875644732442642, "text": "This is absolutely fantastic!! Real things with real people.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:11:42", "owner": "melangeofalife", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079906547473699, "text": "@k5shish", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:11:02", "owner": "thejackshitpost", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18168836002342188, "text": "Bring back smoking cigarettes 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:09:46",