3124, "text": "one more cig 🗣️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:59:30", "owner": "elpuntosantiago", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953798142897654, "text": "😂🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:59:25", "owner": "lanaelove_xo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060486596237582, "text": "Damn I remember when they smoked on the airplane. I was a lil girl but I remember. Also the seating areas were much wider.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:59:24", "owner": "mansamusaqueen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932081199997619, "text": "Find Christ", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:58:21", "owner": "george.r._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085969886002563, "text": "Heueheueheueheueheueh I Would bring some beers as well, long life to you old man😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:56:32", "owner": "hiperlord", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063927227451182, "text": "Edward bernays great grandson 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:56:02", "owner": "zehnuss", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108015586559422, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:55:37", "owner": "be.rtrand9308", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18535467325018791, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:55:24", "owner": "sarakalee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18140929966455855, "text": "Hero! 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:55:20", "owner": "gianlucaaltuna", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18332942470237102, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:54:29", "owner": "thiago.gouvea_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106675411620280, "text": "Not the autographs 👏😭", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:54:16", "owner": "king_lawn_mower", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027362402569122, "text": "@club9ball is this John Cigarette??", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:53:52", "owner": "seamusdevine13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095511241868313, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:52:36", "owner": "ganjaawhitenight", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847007878585023, "text": "Of course a jew is encouraging smoking", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:50:44", "owner": "mandomanofthedatsun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949826881001139, "text": "This just warmed my soul. 🚬🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:50:31", "owner": "dirtroadpearl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860140795475463, "text": "\"My dream? I'm living my dream.\" Absolute Cinema 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:50:31", "owner": "ji_reyalv13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18546583201061601, "text": "Yin to the Chungus Yang", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:50:14", "owner": "go.for.grim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063218462407576, "text": "Fufk ya lungs convention", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:49:47", "owner": "probably_god", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061532918205745, "text": "🥹", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:49:21", "owner": "victorimason", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885938923403852, "text": "old jewish men r so goated", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:47:48", "owner": "sleepyleigha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100426726742543, "text": "This only made me miss smoking even more 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:46:59", "owner": "thedivinesivine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17990502017732226, "text": "WHY NOT CANNABIS, INSTEAD⁉️⁉️🤦🏼‍♂️🤦🏼‍♂️🤦🏼‍♂️🤦🏼‍♂️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:45:56", "owner": "olico12", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063070130437652, "text": "Time to start smoking again I guess", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:45:53", "owner": "one_crisp_apple", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086152288823094, "text": "cool dude 👏", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:45:52", "owner": "big.elle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867268135491782, "text": "I tried this only two people came", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:45:41", "owner": "coyoteserrano", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17935656801102272, "text": "🚬 I missed it!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:44:52", "owner": "above_water718", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865336843437005, "text": "I absolutely hateeee cigarettes smoke but i love this 😂 good for you 👏❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:44:20", "owner": "polish_spice_girl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539089300031964, "text": "He made it 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:44:12", "owner": "itsivory2day_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985512918919330, "text": "🚬🚬🚬🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:42:29", "owner": "isaquea", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041231921495829, "text": "Bro be a man smoke a doink", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:40:24", "owner": "beatstaughtme", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17842557120625022, "text": "@doritkemsley🕳️ 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:40:08", "owner": "julianna_avni", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18530815573063706, "text": "World is healing", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:39:05", "owner": "barbarita3000", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17929810233134655, "text": "Lighting one up for you now, Bob🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:39:02", "owner": "jpeterson428", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18038642897706309, "text": "If punching a dart was a sport, he would be world champion.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:39:01", "owner": "saint.halliday", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136747624461544, "text": "The legend himself 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:38:37", "owner": "mujtabaabbas1234", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051512336355381, "text": "I'd have gone through s menthol just for you dude 😭❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:38:34", "owner": "liliana_lazcanoxo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907693936270667, "text": "The signing of the box FLOORED ME", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:38:14", "owner": "sadafsarainc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065852330125535, "text": "Even the people that smoke cigarettes know that this s*** is wild nasty I'm just happy to see that most majority folks in this video is white My black folks smoke weed not tobacco leaves", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:37:51", "owner": "sharlene2025charlene", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072258308038824, "text": "🚬 Cheers!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:37:30", "owner": "saravenkman", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18367608670095918, "text": "Bruh this was real? I missed out", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:37:02", "owner": "mark_picon17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17928276042168145, "text": "\"If it makes you happy, how can it be bad?\"", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:35:41", "owner": "richardl.williams", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145747285441601, "text": "Saw the viral flyer - so nice that it’s real 💕", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:35:10", "owner": "andreasz_com", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070489445077432, "text": "Protect him at call costs 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:34:45", "owner": "mav_and_stef", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900935008320275, "text": "Smoke a blunt with me .", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:34:12", "owner": "o.g.byron", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17934717582102991, "text": "consider declaring this as an annual global event", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:33:25", "owner": "q_zyush", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854894317526089, "text": "i don no who is this guy, but now he is my favorite person in the world", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:32:26", "owner": "rod.pngs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071147573349179, "text": "@yeasir_iftee", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:31:55", "owner": "1shmamtasdik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086543798509524, "text": "Can you come to our city 🚬?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:31:41", "owner": "rai_madge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18381224905195774, "text": "🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:31:00", "owner": "neka_druga_treba", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539344192043439, "text": "reduce it but damn I love lighting up with people", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:30:45", "owner": "i.chloeee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085005878050369, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:30:35", "owner": "earl_froggo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891184786244974, "text": "@fuad.3618 when we accidentally get rich 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:29:52", "owner": "prangon_hasan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075295754333518, "text": "😂😂I quit cigs yrs ago but I’ll smoke a dif kind of leaf with ya dude!!!😁", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:29:47", "owner": "felishiousness", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123448069465681, "text": "This is the most New York thing ever. 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:28:41", "owner": "instarumi206", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18016293701798047, "text": "The og grandpa", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:28:37", "owner": "710bpm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093563770697471, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:27:39", "owner": "woo8430", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864557257514253, "text": "I love how this was advertised as a very low time commitment activity.🚬👏", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:27:35", "owner": "kushagrapurohit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035933135512162, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:27:31", "owner": "marc_2real", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947029554934017, "text": "Big day for nicotine lovers", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:27:18", "owner": "doughofmeat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18537748999037432, "text": "bro if I wasnt at work I would have been front and center !", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:26:35", "owner": "barimcknight", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089218804932801, "text": "Don Draper is smiling somewhere", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:26:29", "owner": "devotchka07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931291411131481, "text": "I love him", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:26:06", "owner": "jaydaa212", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543793132013172, "text": "how the fuck did i miss this i do this everyday", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:25:36", "owner": "fareevasion.band", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18420940990115866, "text": "Cigarette only 😔", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:24:40", "owner": "waycogotbeats", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17921264346055967, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:23:33", "owner": "jaaviieerr.__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18429727342128006, "text": "Big tobacco realizing all they had to do was host meet-ups 🤣 love to humanity in this tho", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:23:14", "owner": "ruggedrigs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147554836429979, "text": "Probably smells like shit", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:23:05", "owner": "bryced_w", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063684530191510, "text": "Community ❤️ I’m here for it🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:22:46", "owner": "_passionatepaintings_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881887981305697, "text": "Come to Cleveland", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:22:43", "owner": "morganhaynik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540027196065081, "text": "@vishal_mahto__", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:22:01", "owner": "varun.mahto_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082975504863133, "text": "I love you", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:20:07", "owner": "yaruchxn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115719121560616, "text": "Love it- he thought about 3 people would turn up!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:19:08", "owner": "lvfitnesspt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034175897729460, "text": "Good shabbos", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:17:33", "owner": "imfeelingblewish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18381416176150181, "text": "AQI 438", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:17:04", "owner": "harbeeeer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987601158872377, "text": "I’m glad cigarettes are cool again cause what the hell is a vape 💨", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:16:52", "owner": "jonathansinatra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113399608604070, "text": "Fuckin legend. 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:16:21", "owner": "shaneheron", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17988120005880505, "text": "Love the time 2:00 to 2:05!  Old school no nonsense 🚬❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:14:40", "owner": "lucyblue2_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064383572163100, "text": "Only in New York", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:13:55", "owner": "shoprideon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18381498919149870, "text": "Bro definitely a shareholder at Marlboro 🚬😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:13:29", "owner": "jpayne.r6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088318241501341, "text": "🚬❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:13:16", "owner": "richard_sundayy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076606943466331, "text": "so sorry I could'nt be there🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:13:11", "owner": "r.ezoey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064506725573027, "text": "I ❤️🗽", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:12:50", "owner": "lalucien", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18095493343835905, "text": "this will somehow link back to anthpo in some way or another", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:12:12", "owner": "cmoncobby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086389987826006, "text": "I