d": 17908569144127904, "text": "Hahahahahhahahaha !", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:04:03", "owner": "desmadrositaperofresita", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087929566785658, "text": "This is sooo nyc", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:04:00", "owner": "gleyzevictor", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18410753953184280, "text": "It’s giving accidentally public event on Facebook 2009. but I love it 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:03:24", "owner": "alexanderbinn", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17847972543577765, "text": "This guy for President 🚬 🇺🇸", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:03:20", "owner": "dr.sands", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017251865619017, "text": "I'd love to smoke a cig with you ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:03:15", "owner": "bellsaroundtheworld", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029785001554068, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:02:53", "owner": "hermannbarbosa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036021440714091, "text": "It's nearly Shavua Tov here in the UK, Shavua Tov Bob 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:02:35", "owner": "fezzikvintage", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885347830405060, "text": "@tinawak", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:02:20", "owner": "conniewak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051827525364199, "text": "What a treat", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:01:05", "owner": "4roborr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098838832767379, "text": "If is anthpo again I will hurt someone", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:00:19", "owner": "ouroboros_47", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100031263703612, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂🚬🚬🚬🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:59:59", "owner": "miria.ramos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082346594115780, "text": "🚬🚬🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:59:51", "owner": "amdrex92", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114223081562515, "text": "İf you love. Light it up.🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:59:40", "owner": "katatoni.a", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074211890001874, "text": "More like, Everybody let’s come together and destroy our lungs and health yay 😁", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:59:36", "owner": "dreamscomingthrough", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069755762364643, "text": "A real mans ciggarette 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:59:34", "owner": "quiktkoe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143239369453634, "text": "GO BOB", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:59:16", "owner": "amisharajanii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980066043923422, "text": "Im so happy about this outcome", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:58:56", "owner": "wizbang_circus_theatre", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18076305290234436, "text": "When’s the next one?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:58:21", "owner": "blairmkoenig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18230559154306764, "text": "‘Smoking is the perfect pleasure’, Oscar Wilde 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:58:07", "owner": "calumcrowston", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929768338113826, "text": "Luv this", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:57:04", "owner": "geetommy__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050756141379603, "text": "Shout out from Brazil, old man! Imma smoke a whole pack for you 🫵🏻❤️🚬🚬🚬🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:56:20", "owner": "jovin.wav", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18098706850702000, "text": "Next year \"Welcome to our second annual smoking gathering\"", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:56:19", "owner": "elephant_to_adress", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18334909981239759, "text": "bob the cig", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:56:18", "owner": "__m.aw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026161634786875, "text": "The world is healing 🥲", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:56:17", "owner": "sirstirkrazy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18380780119150427, "text": "Ti amo 🚬🚬🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:55:03", "owner": "valeriomartinelli7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005552810663028, "text": "Ew", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:54:23", "owner": "_brayanenriquez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114544972505364, "text": "it’s annoying that cigarettes still make you look cool", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:53:53", "owner": "jemsophia_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986895420864570, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:52:39", "owner": "dariana.mm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099847396745431, "text": "Imagine the stench though", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:52:06", "owner": "bartosz.zaczek", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085986274818410, "text": "Boss👏", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:51:42", "owner": "chesterminajj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18520444972064479, "text": "This is wild as fuck 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:50:37", "owner": "likeamotherfucker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851510572591008, "text": "Can we get 10 minutes next time?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:49:50", "owner": "rickrussomano", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18112101319599215, "text": "🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:49:16", "owner": "mel_serenity_96", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873080281377666, "text": "This grandpa is ma hero", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:49:11", "owner": "gustavomdr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301518499260880, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:48:52", "owner": "kerts_money", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851900335544628, "text": "Well well well!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:48:45", "owner": "aaqib_assad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881864116307200, "text": "I’ve met a lot of people in the smoking area 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:48:33", "owner": "authentic.fio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18291723610263153, "text": "Fucking Jew", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:48:13", "owner": "alsip_lover", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866729092499704, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:47:56", "owner": "j3_bhatti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18375222727155678, "text": "damn near made me tear up🥹 ima roll up sum crazy for Bob 💯", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:47:32", "owner": "d1.pablo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18397306717126317, "text": "Smoking slaves ❤️😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:45:13", "owner": "accountofharsh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098111338771566, "text": "@rogerio.skylab", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:45:02", "owner": "claws_of_perdition_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030606854729425, "text": "😂😂😂😂🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:44:21", "owner": "mrroyalfox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068312540457487, "text": "This is the true American dream right here", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:39:23", "owner": "somemalarkey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901327009325111, "text": "The power of the internet 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:38:51", "owner": "lexmarshall14", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968440647828752, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:38:38", "owner": "muca.png", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983370141760683, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:38:33", "owner": "jaya_krishnamurthy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954197380034133, "text": "@emmavanhartevelt @liszwaardvis", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:38:29", "owner": "jellylynn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18390377791183112, "text": "@milana.trifkovic", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:37:59", "owner": "enemyspotted1334", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964898649995873, "text": "🥹🥹🥹🥹🥹🥹", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:36:41", "owner": "gerovendevasi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967030935994765, "text": "Geração Z, leva o sério na brincadeira. E a brincadeira a sério kalakka", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:36:32", "owner": "ltl_hlc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305040241266331, "text": "I’ll be thinking of this while smoking a cig with you today in Saskatoon! We call it hacking a dart. 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:36:27", "owner": "schultzmeister3000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079198027911921, "text": "😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:36:27", "owner": "aniruddha_tapdiya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011426588640635, "text": "🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬virtual smoking w u", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:36:25", "owner": "priamaral6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045808610474070, "text": "Sonho", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:36:21", "owner": "_chicobarbosa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18203154922319877, "text": "@veer.c0re", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:36:12", "owner": "maharshi_modi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074754916999238, "text": "Mazal", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:35:18", "owner": "nyc____2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056446790309757, "text": "@abhishek_rana007 @niteen__7 @debs_gram09 @arslann.afzal", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:34:51", "owner": "_tahashakeel_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865136266437074, "text": "i just smoked a left handed cig for you", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:34:50", "owner": "__nuclearpasta__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846293920593884, "text": "the world becoming a huge freakshow nowadays", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:34:37", "owner": "remakavelli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888670045388042, "text": "🚬🚬🚬🔥❤️❤️❤️😍", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:34:31", "owner": "danielgnap", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085264789831538, "text": "😔 why did I have to work that day 🚬🚬🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:33:57", "owner": "ghengis_don", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111025246598227, "text": "new president for sure", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:32:59", "owner": "1vinifuoco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18394462099122298, "text": "Fuck yea", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:32:55", "owner": "parsapayandehhh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113153569572807, "text": "i’m doing this in my city now", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:32:03", "owner": "7_w0rdkoma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074151989253581, "text": "Let a bunch of weed smokers do this tho..", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:31:06", "owner": "ogshyne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867422725496185, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:30:36", "owner": "ifyoulovemy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296501575278326, "text": "Galera do gueti! Carltinho nos quexo!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:29:48", "owner": "edubenedetto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126955186453606, "text": "Hell yeah brother", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:28:05", "owner": "stephanie.michele.86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17912500749247749, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:27:48", "owner": "vickvoss4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884295310409433, "text": "jewish tricks", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:27:46", "owner": "santiagogtl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095472169798924, "text": "🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:27:36", "owner": "mxlchic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18369238603085102, "text": "Smoking is so bad to be promoted lol", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:26:40", "owner": "howdyfromnewyork", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18364431316090744, "text": "Jaja y ve la gente que fue, me fuera gusted estar ahí @virgiliojm", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:26:20", "owner": "hectorruizmedinaa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17954097095904955, "text": "People yearn for carcinogens.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:25:45", "owner": "boss_ter", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863808871517012, "text": "@is__he__shubh @pankaj_5383_ 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:25:42", "owner": "hey.gurjot_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103032760731273, "text": "@shruti17.05", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:25:17", "owner": "shiwanibisht10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115901785562814, "text": "que lindo isso caras vc e fera bob", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:24:38", "owner": "iwnzd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905127637145683, "text": "This is so goated 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:23:27", "owner": "_gingerwits_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064416383430466, "text": "@behind_heard lol", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:22:34", "owner": "beenwalked100", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851601814591404, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:22:31", "owner": "tarciziotuao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084085142016946, "text": "One more cig 🌎", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:21:47", "owner": "large_times", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910690582249948, "text": "@323sebastian323", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:21:26", "owner": "beenwalked100", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993776349706505, "text": "Omg wow!!!!! I love this", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:20:34", "owner": "pebbs.rn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027066143751434, "text": "Wish he was our mayor", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:19:08", "owner": "lyssa_miraji", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116083051496987, "text": "Legends only", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:19:01", "owner": "s_a_l_t_____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088766806936612, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:18:15", "owner": "prince.kosho", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084388448512267, "text": "Lol for 5 minutes! This is gold", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:18:09", "owner": "jngmadeit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17881877181302482, "text": "is that phillip morris?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:18:02", "owner": "chri55andy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17916948045217141, "text": "Please have another event!!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:17:48", "owner": "luxandlucajewelryco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086706917051014, "text": "Was Jacob there too🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:17:43", "owner": "ladyasteria", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092739202907363, "text": "Proud of everyone who showed up ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:17:27", "owner": "napsleyzzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17985751991876497, "text": "🚬🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:17:14", "owner": "cristoffer_koschnik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105047836654909, "text": "The time limit on it 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:17:05", "owner": "diaztd1991", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068303213081171, "text": "ALSO!! The filters are killing our mother… our Mother Earth… please!! If you’re going to smoke, then use GLASS washable or wood filters, and roll your own!!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:17:05", "owner": "mai.soda.pop", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052613219647384, "text": "🚬👏🚬👏", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:16:58", "owner": "sharksandwichradio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927258370153661, "text": "light it up 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:16:27", "owner": "rrrocha._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539807569047921, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:16:13", "owner": "mayracoralx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076824883963936, "text": "Congrats😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:16:12", "owner": "404.404.0000", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852907822583318, "text": "@sir_felly_buschwacker", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:16:12", "owner": "djaction888", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18068186699622984, "text": "@anthpo please be honest bro", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:14:53", "owner": "aodhanmov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071999717367825, "text": "This is genuinely propaganda", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:13:42", "owner": "random_shoe1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18170260393374478, "text": "This is great haaa", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:13:23", "owner": "hc_2190", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066840086117179, "text": "Quit about 2.5 years ago after smoking for 15 years.  I’ll never go back, but I can’t deny I miss it!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:12:13", "owner": "teejforyou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18248074069295345, "text": "It was actually true?? Wholesome!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:11:45", "owner": "policcio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080603426321108, "text": "Legend", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:11:30", "owner": "gaunhlet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047757323679635, "text": "Let’s take it inside!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:10:13", "owner": "andrewlarkin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086627669003577, "text": "Bob a legend for this 🙌🏼🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:09:18", "owner": "the.last.canada.goose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988412196860087, "text": "So wholesome", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:09:05", "owner": "galadontlikeyou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049852724681312, "text": "i generally only smoke the green version of cigarettes… but i’d smoke a traditional one with this guy 🤝", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:08:35", "owner": "donnyiverson", "likes": 52}, {"id": 18055164728648122, "text": "Campañas anti tabaco gastando millones para advertir a la población del riesgo de cancer pulmonar y este señor las jodio todas en un instante.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:07:56", "owner": "edgard.alfaro1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071716388055428, "text": "Good shabbas bob the legend", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:07:35", "owner": "1dorfrr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108873202717464, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:07:09", "owner": "almondmilkhater", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18230018890306827, "text": "Everyone says stress is the biggest killer. Is smoking keeps you happy, it keeps you alive.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:06:39", "owner": "moss.kissed.witch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087980726491832, "text": "Lord, Jesus Christ, Son of God please help those quit smoking cigarettes and drinking like you have done for me. Amen. 🙏✝️🤓💡🧠", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:06:12", "owner": "cellardoor917", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301357747271424, "text": "Mad scenes lmao", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:05:47", "owner": "thehimanshuahuja", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070490687340892, "text": "@jordanforbes1 your hero", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:04:50", "owner": "misskhouse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005027987821656, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:04:46", "owner": "maedonstap.ee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844977448614658, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:03:43", "owner": "_amal.in", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978153753933836, "text": "Brother I’m from Hong Kong I want smoke with you, I’ll make a hand roll cigarette to you", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:02:23", "owner": "c.david1103", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859219411550877, "text": "@jacobfuckingjones  make a collab", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:02:11", "owner": "gmarco_97", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914070079093242, "text": "🚬🚬🚬🚬🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:01:40", "owner": "offpeak_aly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18029373347551578, "text": "A wise man in Gili Trawangan once told me, more people die of diabetes than smoking.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T15:00:23", "owner": "martpinda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18332799907213736, "text": "😂😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:59:00", "owner": "nushki0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007179023810793, "text": "Smoke weed dont smoke tobacco", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:58:54", "owner": "bouuuubou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034511912718091, "text": "Biggest hero of all", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:58:04", "owner": "gui_vinih", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057908564646433, "text": "This is so funny", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:57:30", "owner": "hbsize", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17914140390238459, "text": "🚬❤️NY", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:57:22", "owner": "resting_bichfejs", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18063721397185842, "text": "Diabolical", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:57:10", "owner": "strooly", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18186198289340263, "text": "I need a world tour 😂 waiting for you in São Paulo 🇧🇷🫡", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:57:08", "owner": "maulea0", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17889173244388945, "text": "@earthagainstmachine @soe.prince", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:56:32", "owner": "joeyghanem", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005006156666062, "text": "🚬🚬🚬🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:56:17", "owner": "thekayleigh24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903099517303589, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:56:10", "owner": "boutilier1991", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100856224665987, "text": "its gonna be anthpo isnt it", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:56:07", "owner": "r_idk_lol", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18350225782167177, "text": "I can smell it", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:55:48", "owner": "_thato19", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18012590015801127, "text": "🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:55:43", "owner": "rali325", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104499229677022, "text": "😢I wish I was there too 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:55:42", "owner": "persiicat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081510200320439, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:55:26", "owner": "benz.1z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078794107922437, "text": "@bij.angel i love ny", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:55:00", "owner": "arinatn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18126954517446998, "text": "David lynch would be so happy for this 😭❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:54:45", "owner": "_.disaster_artist._", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086972533807518, "text": "Let’s make this an annual event! @oldjewishmen", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:54:40", "owner": "gaby.something", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064684241565262, "text": "The only good jew 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:54:12", "owner": "lantslifts", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18374402482158270, "text": "my president", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:53:44", "owner": "z_montes3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910012453256204, "text": "Guy should be president", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:53:38", "owner": "max_kosmalski", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047881079425509, "text": "Best jew in the world 🌎 👌", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:53:29", "owner": "seymourpixels", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17936667429169728, "text": "air for that 15 mins 💨💨💨💨💨💨💨💨💨💨💨💨💨💨💨💨💨💨💨", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:53:13", "owner": "tankweeyonggggg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059815286244294, "text": "A man of taste", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:53:09", "owner": "connerlbs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956745730012811, "text": "2:00-2:05 😭😭😂 bro was not playing", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:52:55", "owner": "trapgoon_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088362128509774, "text": "A nice 🧃", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:52:26", "owner": "hassan.xo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135634519422798, "text": "Jajaja pobre cabrón, no me quiero imaginar cuánto le costó con lo caro que son los cigarros en Europa", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:52:22", "owner": "yoshio_lara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18384659185195973, "text": "Come smoke in Brazil Bob ❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:52:21", "owner": "tassianscto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081307519888775, "text": "Just a Cigarette, coffee or a beer and the world can come together", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:52:13", "owner": "anthonyhonyoust", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18379882870147817, "text": "So this even smelled and so did everyone there.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:52:11", "owner": "whats_socialmedia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18192468166326895, "text": "Big tobacco rn : IT WORKED", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:51:54", "owner": "shit.post.network", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864596473513254, "text": "You get a dart, you get a dart , you get a dart😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:51:51", "owner": "nickycacciatore", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17965428698844122, "text": "My favorite story of 2025", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:51:37", "owner": "cbrads2", "likes": 0}, {"i