ike this is an anthpo kinda thing but I can't prove it", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:29:19", "owner": "idontneedleyou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159080488400093, "text": "Wooowwwwwww 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:29:02", "owner": "mahendra.murty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983625249922176, "text": "4x marathoner here. This is 1,000,000x cooler than any running club", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:27:06", "owner": "ericzawo", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18086936773974935, "text": "Oh i came today bob you can be sure bout that", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:25:42", "owner": "lauricochet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010299137646862, "text": "2pm - 2:05pm 😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:25:06", "owner": "jay_boyeee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142407730450984, "text": "🖤🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:24:11", "owner": "tiffanypoe13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106328764722715, "text": "@ianimal69", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:23:49", "owner": "corykitty", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17906402760279250, "text": "nyc is healing", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:23:49", "owner": "katmaccc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056808938308217, "text": "Legend ❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:23:19", "owner": "rachaelskog", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109595830718369, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:23:00", "owner": "themisha_k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18434520691109629, "text": "This ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:22:45", "owner": "chantalnadiaa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896788600344214, "text": "Non smoker but cool XD", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:22:26", "owner": "insecure_security", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18497839159074278, "text": "🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:21:53", "owner": "whosxdaniela", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080463881468425, "text": "@guillenuunez", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:20:17", "owner": "gemmaglzz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17957205662889459, "text": "The world is healing!! Bless your heart Bob 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:20:17", "owner": "devydeexo", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18368229241085144, "