4511, "text": "This guy is a plant by big tobacco 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:55:33", "owner": "zohabzeekhan", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18076334612586348, "text": "Smoking Camaraderie 🤌🤌🤌", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:54:03", "owner": "rohit_devendra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926765071157517, "text": "The world is healing ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:53:56", "owner": "cxshmr", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18366913372084167, "text": "Big Tobacco making its comeback one meet up at a time 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:53:13", "owner": "sarabriannam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054225677327036, "text": "We still smoking in Osaka! 🚬 Yee!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:52:44", "owner": "malizilla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093134647892322, "text": "The world is healing", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:52:36", "owner": "deadcrab_films", "likes": 22}, {"id": 17997878642699416, "text": "@afkereuvers dit is echt jouw voorbeeld he. Ik zie je like wel hoor", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:51:56", "owner": "wautbrilman", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17842069590629021, "text": "Search \"Torches of Freedom\" on Wikipedia", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:51:29", "owner": "ataale", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086313689283550, "text": "❤️🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:51:24", "owner": "mack95_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869661046470355, "text": "Big tobacco plant", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:49:24", "owner": "44lilypad44_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069223103368958, "text": "Peak social interaction", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:48:37", "owner": "patxiznz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103324492598129, "text": "Same time next week?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:48:35", "owner": "nicolaburton1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18172126804327064, "text": "Is this a stealth marlboro product placement gig?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:48:23", "owner": "j_a_m_i_e_finlayson", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028839647561781, "text": "Can he do another event where he streams live and he talks about his life while smoking…", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:47:55", "owner": "kristina_kalv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18123909763522683, "text": "This is fucking hilarious", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:47:51", "owner": "astro_christian", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067086566614561, "text": "I don't know this man but I would smoke with him", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:47:14", "owner": "lazlo64", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545376901027069, "text": "🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:46:18", "owner": "madylamar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939881892965482, "text": "🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:46:14", "owner": "vanishingpointfrq", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042934385686953, "text": "second hand smoke is even worse for you", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:45:54", "owner": "cheapie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867176257484838, "text": "I know it smelled crazy out there", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:43:27", "owner": "shaqhatesmeta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102716308734746, "text": "🚬 couldn't do a double double 🚬 knowing me I'd be 5 mins late haha 🤩😭", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:41:37", "owner": "zacknuckles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080144657127352, "text": "An inspo to bring humanity together. God bless you Sir!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:40:31", "owner": "bot4tot", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17975915243794119, "text": "now everyone smoke cigs 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:39:35", "owner": "luis.chupadita", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031057220738411, "text": "Bro I just know this is Anthony Po", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:39:22", "owner": "deano3647", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087510172977646, "text": "Legend 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:38:12", "owner": "zgiuli_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070719512359839, "text": "At least it's a Marlboro Red", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:38:08", "owner": "sublimeruby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854773201570981, "text": "Repulsive.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:38:01", "owner": "seanpmurphy68", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145104340446311, "text": "😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:37:55", "owner": "ahmdtfx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853590799577293, "text": "And they say gen z are antisocial", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:37:43", "owner": "girlovana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115464280568256, "text": "I think we all need a good cigarette these days.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:37:17", "owner": "jenmac76", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18133733011476180, "text": "And if you smoke, but you want to quit try reading \"How to stop smoking\" by @AllenCarrsEasyWay it worked for me and you can also get it on @Audible", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:36:18", "owner": "iamrichroyal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065972336132348, "text": "I want to be a part of such a powerful movement someday.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:35:20", "owner": "amiewithcamera", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087395696314162, "text": "it could've be a scene from \"thank you for smoking\"", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:35:11", "owner": "endrius_lair", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078355879901909, "text": "Iconic", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:35:04", "owner": "gamayev", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17992525781899368, "text": "Thank you Anthpo", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:34:49", "owner": "hamilton_human", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17858821410552579, "text": "@madoleer", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:33:07", "owner": "rubyyyr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107149540628324, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:32:13", "owner": "mariegardel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908286091125084, "text": "My people 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:31:25", "owner": "holidaayzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851868046545349, "text": "I want his life", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:31:15", "owner": "_lorenzobizzarri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18319619281169255, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:31:06", "owner": "hazzann440", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890720623383115, "text": "🫶🏼🫶🏼🫶🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:29:48", "owner": "susunsisihsapu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17888358966391316, "text": "The chanting “one more cig” has me in bits 😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:29:40", "owner": "lola_roseblanc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901105591317189, "text": "He hits the stoge with the same lighter I’m holding…", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:29:37", "owner": "kjoycee_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047124524439134, "text": "Shabbat shalom 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:28:29", "owner": "ari.kaner", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863922820524070, "text": "🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:28:07", "owner": "declan_jones53", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867046279485244, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:28:06", "owner": "tatto05_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863226721518288, "text": "Better than fentanyl", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:27:22", "owner": "ashmitt07_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054709817327892, "text": "🚬😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:26:25", "owner": "alaaist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119439949552047, "text": "I'm gonna light one up right now..", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:25:56", "owner": "harshthakar54", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902391184165291, "text": "u know what hell yeah ❤️🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:25:56", "owner": "doll.v.cat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17933924556103509, "text": "I fucking adore this", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:25:50", "owner": "brenna.kasey.writes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060531215634342, "text": "Julio Ramón Ribeyro está orgulloso desde el cielo", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:25:37", "owner": "yenniferasd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851400208554754, "text": "I’m sooooooo glad I’ve seen this! I was really hoping this would be the result😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:25:18", "owner": "missdmet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084903791004285, "text": "now i want a cigarette", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:25:06", "owner": "goawayabe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104750521731855, "text": "This is how being a smoker used to feel", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:24:30", "owner": "splendidspoon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031794233543707, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:23:19", "owner": "volkslieds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122953372518823, "text": "I don't smoke, and at this point I wpuld love to smoke all together 🚬😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:22:38", "owner": "markelina_dedej", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058396223286049, "text": "😂🚬 as I have a morning cigarette 😂. Nah, don't start, but yeah poetry and all. Idk 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:22:38", "owner": "arcadearcaid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079174256138309, "text": "Sign me up", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:21:29", "owner": "akramkhalis_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051513410658766, "text": "A sad testament to society. That we watch our family and friends die, and people think this is the way to bring people together. Odd.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:19:54", "owner": "paultully.safari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18163538011381730, "text": "European on a typical day", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:19:47", "owner": "mohammedc.fhaute", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031982879748442, "text": "Is a joint acceptable", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:19:13", "owner": "9d9ways", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078080344925961, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:17:54", "owner": "aminmazarei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086721925956300, "text": "There was Marlboro man, now there is the Marlboro KING", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:17:29", "owner": "shaneryanp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977916369951579, "text": "Smoking is good for you", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:16:56", "owner": "jasonleach1994", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296467987280140, "text": "@jacobfuckingjones", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:16:45", "owner": "matt._b1ack", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17889676329385712, "text": "Ciggys = community <3", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:15:28", "owner": "ethegoddess", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082015832512789, "text": "the world is healing", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:14:44", "owner": "casperthefriendly_host", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993836445895839, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:14:21", "owner": "cigarettesafterdoa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18274369879303111, "text": "🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:14:10", "owner": "devoland", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853917697575849, "text": "I’m so happy I got to see how this turned out 🥹🥹🥹🥹🥹🥹🥹🥹🥹🥹💛💛💛💛💛💛💛💛", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:13:59", "owner": "thee.superstar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104180788725502, "text": "What kind of freedom are you talking about since you're slaves of nicotine ? Cognitive dissonance.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:13:38", "owner": "yishuvim", "likes": 34}, {"id": 18155868136405337, "text": "😂I hope he enjoyed himself", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:13:11", "owner": "indicathekid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046508486457754, "text": "It looks like funded. Promoting smoking in a legal way.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:11:13", "owner": "sansoys", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109339249541109, "text": "Did everyone throw their cigs in the floor after?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:11:11", "owner": "franciskenneth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539209471018877, "text": "Sebatt dl opa Bob 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:10:35", "owner": "gunzilaz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18398684791130304, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:09:15", "owner": "j_fromthebronx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926098177160006, "text": "King 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:08:52", "owner": "aa.martin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062314634627720, "text": "🚬😭", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:08:20", "owner": "sara_makiyama", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988860165893148, "text": "AIR POLLUTION😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:07:02", "owner": "officiallyslimt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18006620807659343, "text": "@alexandru.valuta ai ratat țigara asta", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:06:55", "owner": "0_adelynul_0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929363866148348, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:06:03", "owner": "esaias.1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028241552757600, "text": "This is beautiful", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:05:33", "owner": "tedworth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005288654815703, "text": "He’s actually 35 y/o", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:05:12", "owner": "brudda87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17958018923881271, "text": "whoever gave bro the Marlboro frame is a 🐐", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:05:09", "owner": "valliemusic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929386267135893, "text": "I can smell you from here 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:05:07", "owner": "djaugustine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088665529750672, "text": "Cancer circle jerk 🤮🤮🤢🤢🤢", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:04:34", "owner": "baylonskoll42095", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850269013596484, "text": "🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:03:53", "owner": "1.800_gofuckyourself", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083854748513816, "text": "🚬❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:03:23", "owner": "clappeddriver", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156721693404322, "text": "🔥🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:02:57", "owner": "imxobs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157677589393745, "text": "Teu candidato político ai @pedromedeirosadv", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:02:56", "owner": "medexplicaoficial", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17926278381027607, "text": "Feel jealous", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:02:28", "owner": "__theoff", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18032296415529727, "text": "😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:02:25", "owner": "pepperony98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953946438906023, "text": "🙌🏻🖤", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:02:21", "owner": "usmanqureshi2195", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074003219374178, "text": "@anthpo you again?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:01:31", "owner": "life_of_riley03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876415513440926, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:01:30", "owner": "ironwarriors40k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902198302313228, "text": "Lemmings", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:01:03", "owner": "susanconnorart", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121618162468501, "text": "Legendary 😂🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:00:58", "owner": "theolegshow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082121921017155, "text": "What a Gent", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:00:48", "owner": "frankleenbro", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18217980931307845, "text": "💚🌿💛", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:00:28", "owner": "nevensalom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084073622038691, "text": "Bob 2028", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:00:22", "owner": "jbrookstein", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18118845334544331, "text": "@_surajredde_ futures", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:58:33", "owner": "rahul.madigani", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931567267114410, "text": "Wish I could of been there Bob ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:57:58", "owner": "seagull420ne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064451075156765, "text": "@z_vinyl", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:57:14", "owner": "isabelle_june", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076096106194355, "text": "😍😍😍😍😍😍", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:56:42", "owner": "muvik.puvik", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18332092954215018, "text": "Kind man 👏", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:56:39", "owner": "abhijit_das_avi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951271900028596, "text": "A new hole on the ozone layer was created", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:55:23", "owner": "moraesmarilia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17943415314079217, "text": "@hippiephrogz we should've been there 💔", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:53:03", "owner": "jetchiken", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061436633544477, "text": "Now everyone better get there lungs checked 🤦🏽‍♀️ like lung cancer isn’t a real thing that people die from", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:52:55", "owner": "jaybabz", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17857099203502926, "text": "Don't Jewish u were Irish?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:52:36", "owner": "rachelmcfaddenak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953667351995534, "text": "Me watching this while smoking 👁️👄👁️🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:52:08", "owner": "damnurevil.jj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846432664610384, "text": "@rogerio.skylab 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:51:46", "owner": "sanfa.io", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051244412670364, "text": "Hahahahaha I love it", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:51:20", "owner": "thiswilldojustfine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987438339744663, "text": "Just smoke it 🚬🩶", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:50:30", "owner": "_hadj_mhb_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18393821194133549, "text": "Marlboro loves him", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:50:16", "owner": "just_lurking25", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134364313426028, "text": "Smoking kills but i would absolutely smoke one with him and all of them if i was not living in another continent. So i am safe 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:50:07", "owner": "barcomasso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033905474735620, "text": "Wasn’t this guy on subway takes?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:49:24", "owner": "carly.fitz13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18199884616321863, "text": "What a legend. The smoke cloud surrounding the area. What a treat!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:49:01", "owner": "_jack_ie", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095772046870372, "text": "Is this another Anthpo social experiment?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:48:52", "owner": "theodore_parker__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114154660569215, "text": "Cigarettes are so back", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:48:42", "owner": "jerry_firestone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122783902521837, "text": "🚬🚬🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:47:52", "owner": "harp78", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901560607314025, "text": "I have 76 apel kretek, can I join you guys?🙂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:47:37", "owner": "alexandy_iqrs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079563821150939, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:46:52", "owner": "plaidrabbitzine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18162673816389592, "text": "Its refreshing to see people in brace a bad habit just because it brings them joy idk why", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:43:31", "owner": "annclambiss", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18100187788783348, "text": "The smoker's voice says a lot.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:43:31", "owner": "kvlnarley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842001775627815, "text": "Should make this a yearly thing", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:42:14", "owner": "spliffyjenkins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18298908616262462, "text": "Gonna tell my kids this was marlboro man.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:42:07", "owner": "papiemachey", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18411442954184963, "text": "next one you have I’m calling out to be there!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:41:53", "owner": "nightmarepuke", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087838780771491, "text": "@danielg1564  se logró mi brother 🚬🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:41:19", "owner": "isisdad_2050", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18105309325638445, "text": "They showed up! How cool.😄", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:40:27", "owner": "t__nichole__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052374083672186, "text": "This would be nowhere near as cool if they were vaping!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:39:54", "owner": "alexmorriswrite", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930662917136796, "text": "I don't even smoke cigs and I wish I was there 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:39:41", "owner": "grumpshinelonglegs", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18063964541562286, "text": "This is one event i wouldn't have missed even as an introvert ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:39:00", "owner": "payel_ghoshroy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904642246278712, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:38:19", "owner": "billmaiv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18134123410471499, "text": "@goygear2", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:37:56", "owner": "loosing_pazienza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905048386144061, "text": "@goymanager", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:37:51", "owner": "loosing_pazienza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184170757356166, "text": "@goygear", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:37:44", "owner": "loosing_pazienza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987343710748092, "text": "Let’s go", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:37:43", "owner": "izzyh4999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929375743140059, "text": "Love my city! Outsiders think we’re mean but when it’s time to help uplift we are there!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:37:31", "owner": "divakimmy27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045441239468321, "text": "@lihongkun_ @tklam_", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:37:24", "owner": "woeisluiwohim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086633594049242, "text": "@_rohit.yadav018", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:35:19", "owner": "choudharyyyaspal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17908276404255256, "text": "@ryan_napp", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:35:14", "owner": "langer.rob", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090106919509116, "text": "Remember kids, peer pressure isn’t always a bad thing 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:32:43", "owner": "ayyayyrahn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109150603549744, "text": "budd just created his own 420 cigarette version 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:32:35", "owner": "aziz.88___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107470252622310, "text": "Bob we all joined u worldwide trough our phones too would have been even more people if we could teleport happy cig break", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:32:17", "owner": "hanibee.777", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117340300482961, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:31:08", "owner": "matteisgiorgio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969042342971393, "text": "I Smell You Po! Malbor-Po! 🤪🤪", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:31:08", "owner": "justin_lapuff", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902271220162872, "text": "@kevendacostaaaa", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:30:53", "owner": "silveira._.ramon", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17946529542065815, "text": "Smoking with good intentions and a pure heart!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:30:51", "owner": "adrilassis10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113208451604925, "text": "Fun smoking nasty cigarettes terrible idea just an awful habit", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:28:15", "owner": "anthonyboccellari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18388243804182654, "text": "Smoking is cool again", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:27:56", "owner": "angus_landry", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301146562249978, "text": "@leanmcl find us here", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:27:44", "owner": "anjelicaoztan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080540207277674, "text": "❤️🚬🥹", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:25:51", "owner": "shameezh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087853096777497, "text": "Community!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:24:51", "owner": "lifecamerakaran", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088234747986643, "text": "A man of the people, this is who NYC deserves as a mayor", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:24:26", "owner": "4speed63", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18003773840674127, "text": "Man, signing the cigars Box is another level ✍️😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:24:19", "owner": "tha_kraqen", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953624616905856, "text": "6 gorillion to israel", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:23:31", "owner": "yung._.josh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129391459499319, "text": "patron saint of marlboro", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:22:12", "owner": "noah.woodworth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869587570469794, "text": "All about a good smoke. From time to time. The micro plastics will get ya before the cigs", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:21:07", "owner": "allchrome", "likes": 39}, {"id": 17865622332508699, "text": "coward", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:21:06", "owner": "joeltyxer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17864735691514682, "text": "I didnt get out of work till an hour later but i bought the finest cannabis line up and sparked one after. 🙂‍↔️🍃", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:20:58", "owner": "missadelina.exe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099640366775681, "text": "Things are coming round full circle", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:20:15", "owner": "healingsolutionswithlaura", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932690008110493, "text": "Fuck yeah! Wish I was there to lite ☝🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:20:09", "owner": "huntin3495", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097982107648416, "text": "Idk how to prove it but this Jewish propaganda 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:19:24", "owner": "privilegedlife23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030652550541019, "text": "Shabat shalom! 🚬🤍", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:19:02", "owner": "noam_ela", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949563684918264, "text": "😂😂❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:18:44", "owner": "privilegedlife23", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304032778266248, "text": "I don’t smoke but I’d totally come out of it for this 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:18:40", "owner": "galaknorr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860163595476218, "text": "I would like to participate from Malaysia 🇲🇾", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:18:40", "owner": "playboidanish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989605566737213, "text": "And they all flicked their butts in the ground like degens", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:18:06", "owner": "ronnietender", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048391796668496, "text": "This is beautiful. And possibly the most important thing to happen in human history", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:15:57", "owner": "soulpointfive", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030254267732384, "text": "I was legit thinking of flying out from Europe for this, but the last minute tickets were too expensive😔", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:15:27", "owner": "machiel._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031250879748695, "text": "Twat", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:14:42", "owner": "lisaward9669", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18170974141373904, "text": "Legend", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:14:17", "owner": "gohar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095231272831827, "text": "so nice seeing an older person enjoying the power of internet ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:13:32", "owner": "antonija_zmaj", "likes": 14}, {"id": 18082825139022413, "text": "Quittingggg but smoking with you in spirit for now!!!!! Hahahaha go Bob!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:13:11", "owner": "thelittlemeranda", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082221647027507, "text": "Crazy how everybody thinks smoking cigarettes is really a thing!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:12:30", "owner": "2rare_big_steppa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976810605791280, "text": "I love this so much 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:11:14", "owner": "__heterochromia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090577426820065, "text": "@brob_photog Did you go!?!?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:09:43", "owner": "alexloves.hair", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171895531330103, "text": "Legend", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:09:31", "owner": "pujon_dhar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968961597978042, "text": "jew", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:08:55", "owner": "golecasilias", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075006728262771, "text": "Hell yeahh", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:07:29", "owner": "str8outtathane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541933258015633, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:07:12", "owner": "thtkidlee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099456982752875, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:06:38", "owner": "suwoo50", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18124917532459101, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:05:23", "owner": "plll8358", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296672689280965, "text": "Marb reds and all?!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:03:51", "owner": "shelbunnybae", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857683396501674, "text": "The only cigarettes that may actually be good for you are shared with others ❤️🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:02:31", "owner": "megantheebotanist", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17976720362789953, "text": "“CANCER STICK! CANCER STICK!” \n😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:01:37", "owner": "itzjust_kvsh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18538853206051707, "text": "I love New York", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:01:34", "owner": "annayvette", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18115846696576073, "text": "Legend", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:01:27", "owner": "hnnry89", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033777926524873, "text": "This is world peace 🥹", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:01:17", "owner": "yacine.private", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074907994984435, "text": "Shabat shaloom my ass", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:01:14", "owner": "max.machado27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18430127380104334, "text": "🇫🇷🇫🇷🇫🇷", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:00:49", "owner": "aymeric_lrt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056595965306192, "text": "O @rogerio.skylab", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:00:13", "owner": "giovannalucato", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18016844666795745, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:59:22", "owner": "blakedanthony", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083998022045555, "text": "Amazing 🚬🔥❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:58:34", "owner": "chickienuggie_theclown", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18077438420335716, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:57:44", "owner": "jekslle", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18196363480323105, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:57:29", "owner": "achyarsaputra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086934172795861, "text": "@principevidane já conhecia ele?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:56:57", "owner": "rodolfodaprile", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18089209681822536, "text": "🚬🚬🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:56:36", "owner": "pati_co__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17847172197584123, "text": "@rogerio.skylab o gente boa, tem cigarro ae? CIGARRO", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:54:41", "owner": "_brunovw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102143707670288, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:53:48", "owner": "freja_la_vizsla", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17982016418923880, "text": "Disgusting 🤢", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:52:49", "owner": "reggieduce", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078309023152651, "text": "decadence", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:51:26", "owner": "_kserkses", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939649458965200, "text": "I dint even smoke but i wanna go", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:48:57", "owner": "hey_jason260", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063274271563562, "text": "For Next event do a coffee", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:47:17", "owner": "venkyraaam", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863605672522772, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:47:12", "owner": "rikvrdo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18201855709318254, "text": "Fuck yeah Bob!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:46:28", "owner": "geluksjoch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991136868728614, "text": "Esta raro mi colega @13jacobo", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:45:21", "owner": "pabloanyway", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18200601382320569, "text": "Ahhhhhhhh, wish you were here in dublin🚬❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:44:47", "owner": "hridayyyy.mane", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18057661385300526, "text": "Hopecore", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:44:32", "owner": "marieclaireseyes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930014944138646, "text": "LFGGGGGG🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:42:29", "owner": "kadejarrett", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105153202564837, "text": "I don’t even smoke but this seems like a vibe", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:40:30", "owner": "anthonycatlow", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18067992356456014, "text": "@suwoo50 my bro wen his ssa get old😭🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:40:08", "owner": "bway.takedatrisk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100986496735623, "text": "Edward Bernays reincarnate", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:37:57", "owner": "oliverhxdsx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18537358963040948, "text": "😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:37:24", "owner": "leserge__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17855446887568614, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:37:04", "owner": "iamdhairyabhagat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18299076940259298, "text": "@keeg.flaw", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:36:33", "owner": "selina2395", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866194282501899, "text": "Lisan al Gaib!!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:35:57", "owner": "subhodh.__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18232017799306742, "text": "I had a vape for you does that count? x", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:34:03", "owner": "kayleighjf_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18297483817283388, "text": "That guys got a heater going", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:33:01", "owner": "the_anti_influencer07", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145542958437314, "text": "Wild 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:32:42", "owner": "marsisgotjokes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065071217622997, "text": "@anthpo vibes", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:32:12", "owner": "antoniojordanphotography", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18019047182788206, "text": "@dollylong", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:30:24", "owner": "jadeashtonm", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099568225751637, "text": "Bob created a mini Woodstock with nothing but a pack of cigarettes and a flyer. Be smart like Bob.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:29:19", "owner": "triwardhanawisnu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18334170769232366, "text": "Bro need to do a European tour 🚬🚬🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:28:16", "owner": "_juliazhuk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926319916175667, "text": "@badvibescorp eventaço", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:27:36", "owner": "eluyslay", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18094352704895512, "text": "absolutely beautiful 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:25:45", "owner": "stefan_ml_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17901302298317858, "text": "Sadly I quit smoking 10 years ago🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:25:37", "owner": "evija_laivina_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047557958430616, "text": "I feel like anthpo is somehow behind this. @anthpo", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:25:25", "owner": "humanshu.gulia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099151834757744, "text": "This is awesome", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:25:22", "owner": "thomashh03", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046406645459567, "text": "This event reeks of Anthpo", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:24:05", "owner": "alvin.cui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065387330150095, "text": "grandpa 😭🫶🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:24:01", "owner": "smilzofacose", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18036987062717700, "text": "NICOTINE QUEEN", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:23:50", "owner": "samcanstudio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867434908494032, "text": "I really hope I can join you for the next one. Brazilian greetings.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:23:40", "owner": "mariobisnet0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18107600110627831, "text": "Having a pack today for you buddy!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:23:24", "owner": "syone", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028221002767579, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:21:30", "owner": "lahasna__", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18100194430685331, "text": "Wish I could've been there!❤️🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:19:47", "owner": "buppa_5150", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18117715141551522, "text": "Legend", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:19:23", "owner": "donners52", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893775655225713, "text": "Sebat dulu lah bon", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:19:12", "owner": "ivan.langi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17851124652592427, "text": "🕴🏻🕴🏻🕴🏻", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:19:00", "owner": "_divvvyafoundsleepy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18156916915396533, "text": "🥰🤌", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:18:32", "owner": "yo_rafa.xd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075925610463230, "text": "shabat shalom💙", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:17:52", "owner": "koiravitun", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18026687534769444, "text": "@thenightmare_170", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:17:44", "owner": "truthfairyy___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954028093011732, "text": "sensasional!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:17:04", "owner": "dddwwwiiiikkk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868077991480740, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:16:20", "owner": "lomboysz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18289406641285928, "text": "😂😂👏", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:16:19", "owner": "zanzibar_vape_store", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968365521990949, "text": "@albertmarti22 x la proxima", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:16:01", "owner": "polverdes_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034994732720241, "text": "Can't wait for the European trip", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:13:55", "owner": "mimasek107", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098894842789343, "text": "@t_lapy", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:10:51", "owner": "stefanierosedavis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184811506346068, "text": "@kllydvs", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:10:11", "owner": "stefanierosedavis", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17940869360960045, "text": "Done and done, big man. 🚬 I'm 35 this year, 20 deep in the hole, digging myself out, but not as quick as the rain wants to fill it. I would never claim to be a healty man, or even a particularly stable one. But it's nice to know that there's a whole buch of folks on this big old dirt ball of an earth we call home that are just as in-the-trenches as I am. Keep up the battle, my brothers and sisters. We'll all get there in the end, one way or another ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:09:38", "owner": "warwicktheswan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867674269417465, "text": "The African children working the Tobacco farms are so happy with you because now they can keep their job!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:08:23", "owner": "niekertdepiekert", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320083840301032, "text": "Esto debe ser el peak de la comedia", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:08:04", "owner": "planetacobos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058856723638944, "text": "Cancer at its finest 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:08:03", "owner": "n0_love_n0_risk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098774134694919, "text": "❤", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:08:00", "owner": "gio7fiume", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071858528522468, "text": "I love New York", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:07:42", "owner": "ryanjamestinline", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072560096039895, "text": "@abel_lentink 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:07:29", "owner": "bertlentink", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18191284264328131, "text": "🥰 “My Dream…I’m living my Dream.” 🥰", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:05:55", "owner": "caudlewarren", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17883114516407578, "text": "I haven't smoked for almost a year, but if I ever start again, it would be with this man.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:05:00", "owner": "mel_toupee", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17930753043137351, "text": "🚬🚬Great.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:03:22", "owner": "franlebowitzandotherbadasses", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18084731993069004, "text": "Legend", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:03:16", "owner": "briankelly2489", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18033764411726229, "text": "we need a petition for a world tour!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:03:11", "owner": "romanianwitch8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079223618323445, "text": "Maybe do a world city tour eh, you would be very welcome in Glasgow Scotland UK 💜", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:02:38", "owner": "weelilmama", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18182493172350761, "text": "Everyone coping so hard with this one", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:01:47", "owner": "kadju182", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18062983994567747, "text": "Exactly! It’s a tough world. Let me smoke my lil cigar in peace", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:59:37", "owner": "nietzschiana", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18178720858364831, "text": "🚬🚬❤️mentally there 😂❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:58:55", "owner": "_thidas_025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952715400908054, "text": "Legend 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:56:47", "owner": "mmlondon8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972302925808515, "text": "@meshacherie", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:54:29", "owner": "aalona", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17966292950995878, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:53:56", "owner": "dopeskinjuice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18436063600103517, "text": "💗", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:52:20", "owner": "shoboimom", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866833249484737, "text": "🚬❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:50:55", "owner": "unseen.partha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18194067976328742, "text": "I Will say my children he was Frank Sinatra 🙌🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:49:37", "owner": "william.wayne_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18409525666190554, "text": "🚬🚬🚬 fosho", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:49:18", "owner": "thirdworldslumresident", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977362557929138, "text": "the results certainly did not disappoint lmao this is awesome and this guy is a legend", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:47:39", "owner": "undeadlil", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088903096931561, "text": "🔥🔥🔥🔥 🚬🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:47:33", "owner": "alyxendar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035336183718518, "text": "Did yall hear what he said?? They asked what is his dream and he said “I am living my dream” broooo the coldest line I heard all week", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:46:17", "owner": "dj_dakidd1991", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844865716615062, "text": "Signing Cig boxes... Is wild", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:46:07", "owner": "_solitude_zii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18296457505284228, "text": "This event is one for the Books🚬❤️🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:43:01", "owner": "thebalisongguy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983189499760827, "text": "Tobacco lobby 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:41:43", "owner": "fractionsofmyself", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842985313621052, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:40:04", "owner": "manas9014", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17994149099896295, "text": "Absolute cinema xx", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:37:32", "owner": "thriftyfinnie", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078802691164557, "text": "this is so beautiful", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:36:51", "owner": "darkbluepockets", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18544722970056940, "text": "🚬@maranon_jr así debería ser la publi de la clase de las 7 con @_hanger_18_", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:36:41", "owner": "pablo_oe", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17901524637308207, "text": "2:00pm to 2:05pm", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:36:37", "owner": "venixius", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17986244351753061, "text": "🚬🔥❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:35:31", "owner": "_pedro__galdino_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18409032619186317, "text": "Here in India more than half the population is smoking cigarettes together, unknowingly -  or rather ignorantly. (Hint high AQI and PM 2.5 levels)", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:32:45", "owner": "therealshaurya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988011285912668, "text": "I remember seeing the original post! Im glad it had a good turn out! People in general right now are looking for community. This is beautiful.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:30:57", "owner": "rexx_yarre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17904011787306946, "text": "Congrats 😭 love when a good plan works out", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:30:35", "owner": "__selfalchemy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100777996670439, "text": "It was 5 minutes you schmuck", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:27:46", "owner": "jorathexplorer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100002808693535, "text": "I'll smoke TILL DEATH, WITH PLEASURE, as my mama said", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:27:33", "owner": "aleksandaralic93", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18562666867008174, "text": "This is amazing 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:27:08", "owner": "fetichistadevampiros", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100273456740436, "text": "Just dont smoke crack yall 😂🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:26:45", "owner": "abnormaltuesday", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077003723267656, "text": "Ban the jew", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:26:38", "owner": "j_smooooooooth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17873544555372541, "text": "Methinks @anthpo might be behind this but I can't prove it", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:25:42", "owner": "_afri_can_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075399203231787, "text": "As an avid cigarette smoker, I can't tell how much I appreciate this incredible opportunity to smoke another cigarette", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:25:23", "owner": "real_trees", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993156051850461, "text": "Damm I was suppose to go n forgot 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:23:41", "owner": "missy.lee999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18114097471562310, "text": "To all those that vape, IN YOUR FACE! 😝", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:21:52", "owner": "_the.6", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18155550487409030, "text": "The lobbyists are getting creative I see", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:21:38", "owner": "neilhollyn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18135852217469813, "text": "Did he actually smoke or was he just handing them out nd shaking hands?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:19:35", "owner": "roondawg1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18042467627700715, "text": "🙂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:18:40", "owner": "edeuu1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18170394061374377, "text": "next time do it outside a bryan johnson event", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:16:41", "owner": "delahuntagram", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18164205112383529, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:15:25", "owner": "lakestovall_art", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082281820871606, "text": "People should start blocking people promoting smoking and drinking", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:15:14", "owner": "giulio_savazzi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083944451089403, "text": "Bob is a legend", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:14:05", "owner": "rosiebroad_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18096216472840660, "text": "Fantastic!! 🚬🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:13:03", "owner": "katepulino", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083614979046628, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:11:38", "owner": "lmaokush.dead", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17977822574946657, "text": "@_muhammad.huzaifa_ we out there bro", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:10:44", "owner": "taaha10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060215639630683, "text": "Wow chills 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:08:07", "owner": "skyridgefien", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842199556626105, "text": "Having a cig rn in unc's name", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:06:40", "owner": "jutikela", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060742469558621, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:03:54", "owner": "frobatim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17996578040705608, "text": "Make smoking great again", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:03:17", "owner": "depressive_silence", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090164371931847, "text": "This is both gross... And wholesome", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:03:05", "owner": "mr_bayley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085792952062910, "text": "@perrycaravello", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:01:42", "owner": "patrickasstastic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918194068207018, "text": "this makes my heart warm", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:01:40", "owner": "shayshaycoolaid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17903108028294932, "text": "“My dream? I’m living my dream” 🥰😫", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:00:55", "owner": "jozlynceleste", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18001541561834174, "text": "@dragboardco is this your CEO???", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:59:14", "owner": "andressarli", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18101704123678340, "text": "Go to your friend's gigs, poetry reads, stand-up spots, gallery shows like ya go to these pointless novelty fad cultureless moments; ah thank you.  X", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:57:45", "owner": "ingildedchambers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17891160576242861, "text": "Propaganda", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:57:35", "owner": "3kcdol11", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956744608040789, "text": "where were the anti cigarettes folks?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:57:15", "owner": "cesilio", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075778895519891, "text": "@floripueblo", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:56:59", "owner": "janosminaj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084424451061154, "text": "My role model", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:55:17", "owner": "imadlebiar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905034706142700, "text": "Smoker when I ask them to stop:", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:54:00", "owner": "rasydan_sensei", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863577508516542, "text": "We should do a Calcutta chapter 😏", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:53:14", "owner": "peterpanindisguise", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079972166168500, "text": "Cine 🚬🚬🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:53:05", "owner": "_gonzalodc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18112871500515958, "text": "I was waiting for Bob to announce he is giving up smoking. That would be epic.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:52:57", "owner": "stay_golden206", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159759457360145, "text": "🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:49:43", "owner": "the_skywanderer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061363061212274, "text": "When's The Next One ? I Had To Work", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:49:42", "owner": "spoonmonroe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967928019972195, "text": "El héroe que necesitábamos", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:46:27", "owner": "rata_callejera", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18119501065546194, "text": "Hell yeahhh Bob thats whats up", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:45:36", "owner": "1_800_howsmycrying", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080470961324554, "text": "the future liberals want", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:45:18", "owner": "vanityplatesofmiami", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077011547235516, "text": "Philip Morris sponsors this event. 😜", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:45:03", "owner": "puigdelopez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045309521478013, "text": "I don't smoke but I will drink 🍻 in your honor.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:44:41", "owner": "eltonferns", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061693394629427, "text": "Throwing cigarettes into the crowd is iconic. I love this so much. 🚬🖤", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:44:30", "owner": "imsorrywhatjp", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083668180854451, "text": "🚬 @phillburgin", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:43:42", "owner": "ellalouiseflude", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18055523723314662, "text": "Fomo", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:43:12", "owner": "_vaninja", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030225074549649, "text": "Cigarette sales 📈", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:42:44", "owner": "thomas.simcoe1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915940807226752, "text": "this is fabulous ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:41:41", "owner": "mariyiia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106376326644455, "text": "Marlboro RED💨", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:40:23", "owner": "glitchanjali", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085314599015121, "text": "Watching this unfold warmed my heart! Community is out there people and it’s beautiful 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:39:59", "owner": "jenny_theflower", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18425651425113928, "text": "Only in New York", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:39:52", "owner": "iamdeepakbibyan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005948522820994, "text": "this video got me to start smoking again. thank you Bob", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:39:47", "owner": "mommychondriac", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031729964533438, "text": "@jacobfuckingjones please collab with this man 🔥🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:39:33", "owner": "brdgooding", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087325885989648, "text": "Unfortunately i live on the other side of the world but im smoking my morning cig for you bob", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:39:24", "owner": "swagmancer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949128073051779, "text": "🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:38:30", "owner": "milesklee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17900115843336960, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:37:30", "owner": "tygranes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848572528572629, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:36:27", "owner": "ola_rg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18536406547004102, "text": "La vraie nature humaine", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:35:45", "owner": "_lvl34", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103705510671917, "text": "NO FUCKING WAY, THIS IS AMERICA", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:35:36", "owner": "truetinoo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17856119145563966, "text": "👏👏👏🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:35:02", "owner": "okdanielok", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17907881874268068, "text": "Big cigarette stonks 📈", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:32:42", "owner": "j0rdysh0w", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073459307009606, "text": "RESPECT 🫡", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:32:20", "owner": "_aesthetic__111", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18074032031254634, "text": "🫶🏽", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:30:59", "owner": "melissamariadz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17927357322153344, "text": "only in nyc", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:30:27", "owner": "kendjaev.137", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17915639814085101, "text": "Nice job @anthpo", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:29:34", "owner": "sze_memes", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102275968664483, "text": "💚💚🫡🫡🫡🫡🫡", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:29:07", "owner": "frederixox", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090893384507527, "text": "Put him in the Oval Office", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:26:44", "owner": "gucci__masucci", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087256513954861, "text": "😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:26:04", "owner": "lehk_zile", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988173771908724, "text": "TY from the Tobacco Farmers Assoc. Manila", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:25:06", "owner": "eduont27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869658406393340, "text": "Legend", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:19:39", "owner": "askarachii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065899982625002, "text": "we made the right person famous", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:18:33", "owner": "srgx._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18301407325254032, "text": "top gs only smoke marlboro reds", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:17:20", "owner": "ushrant", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078850649131725, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:16:53", "owner": "2cute2kill.wav", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18017036216789789, "text": "Everything went downhill when people stopped smoking together", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:13:56", "owner": "cameranmorgan420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075859220227093, "text": "Why am I crying? 🥹🥹🥹🥹", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:13:20", "owner": "everybodylovesbambi", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17867875425496233, "text": "@kaylabreee LIGHT UP", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:13:20", "owner": "danalayna24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542322487038696, "text": "@anthpo this you?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:13:04", "owner": "lablount", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075807689189616, "text": "i actually like my fyp", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:13:01", "owner": "adityahulo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18099331825624541, "text": "@samilandri 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:12:31", "owner": "poursi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18034928756722848, "text": "Crazy 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:12:20", "owner": "sriishhti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090282685911433, "text": "The world is healing", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:12:15", "owner": "_leon__guitar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849799918563734, "text": "People like them are the bread and butter for us doctors😷", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:11:41", "owner": "a.lone.gypsy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925729690031844, "text": "Bob !!! I don’t smoke cigarettes but I smoked the biggest blunt for you !!! BOB 4 PRESIDENT ✊🏽🇺🇸", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:09:56", "owner": "robert112harper", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105280948728186, "text": "God it prob smelled like the 70’s on that block for a min", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:08:30", "owner": "jereynolds_99", "likes": 795}, {"id": 18108296224625506, "text": "Virtually, I am smoking a cigarette with you.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:08:18", "owner": "strychn9ne", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18056694452309404, "text": "@thenightmare_170", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:07:38", "owner": "wubba_lubba_dub_dubx3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095953291859657, "text": "Oh he’s Jewish? Unfortunate", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:07:04", "owner": "bjorn.lowe_", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17890563513379356, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:04:33", "owner": "0izospacer7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032655242739634, "text": "No more vapesssss", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:03:19", "owner": "catabascub", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18366758194095907, "text": "KING", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:02:54", "owner": "sonnysehra", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18073961588461572, "text": "@andrewbolster 😀", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:02:46", "owner": "silviamandic", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071863721057446, "text": "Fucking drug addicts, smoke weed better", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:01:22", "owner": "adenozina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086223133822831, "text": "Coolest thing ever seen🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-22T09:00:18", "owner": "chaitanya_.shedge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115765780499485, "text": "I’m happy to see cigs and not vapes", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:58:56", "owner": "ill.nana.xo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17844990594614602, "text": "Smoke Lord 🙌😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:58:41", "owner": "drdirects", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17964856985995419, "text": "I got so mutch Fomo from this Stranger and I'm from Spain", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:56:36", "owner": "antoniobufe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18010598351803864, "text": "Had a cigar for u Bob 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:54:29", "owner": "itsmeyubal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17869785126398695, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:53:20", "owner": "bundi1483", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048034232417459, "text": "@hamishandandy is that @andytomlee in there somewhere??", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:48:57", "owner": "grahamwasme", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082434158472025, "text": "This is super cool", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:47:54", "owner": "diawnaja", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896525269346165, "text": "@_ashutoshkumar_ @amritanshu_singh_ @d41.3ak", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:46:01", "owner": "__h3llf1r3__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17927046057158200, "text": "nothing like a cigaretto with a stranger", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:44:00", "owner": "je_om_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17899782372339027, "text": "Starting to feel big tobacco", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:42:20", "owner": "acolortheory", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18090814559301852, "text": "Smoking one for Bob right now 🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:41:40", "owner": "_varoon_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978639468931418, "text": "Soo cool", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:41:08", "owner": "hazzersgram", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139509265457464, "text": "I was Think about Bob Yesterday. I am in Greenland on a ship… Never smoked. But I was thinking about that man and the cigarette day and if Someone was coming. Glad many did. ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:40:54", "owner": "nanokonrun", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906317533274247, "text": "@dariogestri", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:40:33", "owner": "edoardo_dionea_cicconi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091841434729080, "text": "Sponsored by Philip morris", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:40:07", "owner": "lurkstatus", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18083760017082774, "text": "Marlboro red regulars like a legend", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:36:34", "owner": "jessemedina.jpg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085739258318137, "text": "istg if this is anthpo", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:35:48", "owner": "acatnamedsneezy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064569842170004, "text": "This is my dream date cute", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:35:36", "owner": "mr.burnz._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541169881060629, "text": "@sam.from.the.shire @jamiestephens1", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:29:16", "owner": "williamjohnstephens", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18031348898734727, "text": "Alot of people all gathered to suck on on fags together, thats what's we'd call it in the uk 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:29:12", "owner": "wheretfisjordy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060548450235744, "text": "Tobacco company loving this", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:28:16", "owner": "xoaklandx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17989770491734402, "text": "My mayor", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:23:43", "owner": "stevesweatpants", "likes": 32}, {"id": 17930280702130556, "text": "This warms my heart and lungs so much 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:23:17", "owner": "thatsmokingasian", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059380322536221, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:22:25", "owner": "randys.ghost", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17842357524620960, "text": "🐐", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:20:54", "owner": "ohthatschad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17937799506100686, "text": "Big tobacco learns viral marketing", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:18:49", "owner": "char.rns", "likes": 988}, {"id": 18028709423555893, "text": "this guy deserves a marlboro sponsorship", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:16:13", "owner": "cauliflower.am", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074946079999491, "text": "Hope no one was cheating by vaping", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:15:08", "owner": "johnrfoley", "likes": 952}, {"id": 18042863195696081, "text": "I’m so happy he’s chugging the Marlboro Reds. The people’s champ", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:03:04", "owner": "jethroduartman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078433570907492, "text": "Legend", "created_at": "2025-11-22T08:01:25", "owner": "jishnu_30", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074010161019437, "text": "we are so back", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:59:54", "owner": "ryankerr__", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18088374580940161, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:49:46", "owner": "fettionwheels_lifestyle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17896453491202934, "text": "Nyc loves you.. couldn't make it . But smoking my cig 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:49:46", "owner": "dezcarmel75", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082556567099432, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:49:11", "owner": "joppemoorelisse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050278847656255, "text": "I love Bob. I also want to smoke a cigarette with Bob.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:47:00", "owner": "maya.hapapaya", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905943940290849, "text": "I really wish I could attend.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:45:30", "owner": "azhaar2448", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867540745420904, "text": "Pull up to Dallas", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:43:30", "owner": "noo_scrubbs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099415744695693, "text": "earth is healing ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:42:56", "owner": "sarwendogs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009741227648296, "text": "Wtf", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:42:23", "owner": "javi_el_sucio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121200109469311, "text": "Next should be \"Come have a Voddy with me\":)))))🔥🙌❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:41:23", "owner": "bethkenny63", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18272956567303972, "text": "Hell yeah", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:34:43", "owner": "fat.booty.celine.dion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902204767298998, "text": "America is healing", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:33:43", "owner": "sloshuaa", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18024053930780746, "text": "What a great day for smokers.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:32:32", "owner": "barkie123", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085858285988767, "text": "Literally smoking one for you right now 🫡", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:32:16", "owner": "eldardrums", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890075494383892, "text": "I want to know how many people RSVP and how many packs did he bring", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:31:03", "owner": "mrgsong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115470328560607, "text": "His flyer will forever be iconic, 5min smoke break builds community. That’s it 👏🙌 community building is simple.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:30:17", "owner": "ahhmill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17953758770898607, "text": "I quit just over ten years ago but I would have happily smoked a single ciggie if I were there.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:30:12", "owner": "enjoyerofmanythings", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084146744088689, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:29:36", "owner": "anjosefienfalelavaki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086019922964831, "text": "Yayyyyy", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:28:33", "owner": "surbhi___i", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086689703067927, "text": "What a joy to see 🎉", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:26:52", "owner": "msbsc_2809", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956222358891913, "text": "i know anthpo is behind this bro i just can’t prove it", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:24:16", "owner": "dontouch.m.e", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098658142773500, "text": "This is how my friend’s mom sees me", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:24:10", "owner": "sumitatch", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082129505281836, "text": "I feel like in a week or two we will find out this is anthpo somehow", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:23:03", "owner": "jacob.riddle231", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098669944813261, "text": "@jacobfuckingjones", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:19:55", "owner": "jampers.jpg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18392586310132469, "text": "He can stay", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:15:15", "owner": "d_durbridge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18312809911246993, "text": "I’m a pot head but fuck it; smoke em if you got em 🔥💨", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:13:27", "owner": "ninja_rgb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095473837886691, "text": "Philip Morris’ favorite 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:07:08", "owner": "othmane.elkahlaoui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18393226171131887, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T07:06:10", "owner": "cogey", "likes": 69}, {"id": 18136260880467793, "text": "❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:57:46", "owner": "elenimadrina", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18002265431827090, "text": "He didn’t even know his real callin was party promotion", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:57:37", "owner": "babyfacecheech", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18050977058353624, "text": "Got @anthpo written all over this", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:53:09", "owner": "punkxmutant", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086277820814802, "text": "👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:50:34", "owner": "su.zanne8038", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18336734509231541, "text": "i love a 5 minute event!! these people were all on time", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:49:30", "owner": "enoladismay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071621696522886, "text": "This is what the world needs more of!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:48:51", "owner": "t_bird26", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17993620454720369, "text": "How beautiful 🖤", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:47:24", "owner": "agntclkwrkorng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885079846403547, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:41:01", "owner": "hijodefede", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18199189765325765, "text": "The world is healing", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:39:45", "owner": "toluol.one", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18400698853124436, "text": "I won't have a cigarette for you, but I'll smoke a joint for u, Bob 👏🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:38:03", "owner": "lucasg9517", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145864159437903, "text": "This guy is the mayor of Cigarettes!!! 👑👑👑", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:37:11", "owner": "earlwyvern", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929361241119012, "text": "This shouldn't be legal to post", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:36:20", "owner": "cmobones", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083817539477487, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:35:46", "owner": "a_broken_hallelujah__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18020060129792945, "text": "The doctor is trapped in the halfway", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:35:34", "owner": "theeswims", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18326789245210114, "text": "Only 5 minutes? Usually takes me about 7. 10 minutes at least if it’s American Spirits", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:35:05", "owner": "scrumlord69", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18071345855346338, "text": "@jacobfuckingjones where are you", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:33:17", "owner": "richu.exe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116302855500028, "text": "Marlboro Reds - A distinguished gentleman", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:32:57", "owner": "not_the17thpresident", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18041789951703885, "text": "YES‼️🗣️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:32:24", "owner": "halfassedhandjob", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18545715874010916, "text": "In a strangers dart i see my own", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:30:40", "owner": "juliendoust", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060684104234701, "text": "I’d smoke a cigarette with Bob 👍", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:29:52", "owner": "wolfofboxing", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063004202534979, "text": "So cute", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:27:17", "owner": "damsel_inn_distress", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135587260475168, "text": "Half of them NY’ers got them georgia or virginia 🚬 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:26:43", "owner": "ghenchen1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18192243610328127, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:24:58", "owner": "billy_samps24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086971555814834, "text": "Best thing to happen in 2025.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:21:01", "owner": "itsgregcj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951855517023074, "text": "I don't smoke but would have loved to be there! Shabbat Shalom from Australia!! 🦘", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:20:19", "owner": "sabinacrawley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17867590356495590, "text": "@breakinggbob plsss i beggg let me know when the next one you’ll do is?!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:19:18", "owner": "totallysainteliomelton", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057735329636356, "text": "Bro is signing packs. That’s wild", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:18:53", "owner": "joshdavis10x", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17842001778626807, "text": "Id come all the way from Canada to smoke a menthol with you 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:18:26", "owner": "craearthur", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074447813249167, "text": "🥹", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:13:00", "owner": "claralev.y", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18403081495193379, "text": "Smoking one rn w you", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:12:56", "owner": "shigglemethis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993758244715540, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:12:35", "owner": "karennloves", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542121835000144, "text": "caption game unbelievably magnetic", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:11:38", "owner": "joy.tactics", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17893721880223441, "text": "😂❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:10:50", "owner": "888bereka888", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18160564927392676, "text": "Wholesomeness 😂🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:10:39", "owner": "lugalia_timothy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988152381911458, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:09:32", "owner": "raffyl", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17957816765884899, "text": "$18/pack, bodega guys having their own party.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:04:27", "owner": "realatakanoguz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18245808385292404, "text": "DAMMIT I FREAKING LOVE SMOKING. So bummed I miss this. I’ll have a smoke in your honor 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:02:17", "owner": "clockwrkclash", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18188645740340601, "text": "Runnn for Presidency!!!!! 🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:00:44", "owner": "manas_chowta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087468809302392, "text": "@mganderson7 @galacticspacebear ok we have to go to the next one 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:59:35", "owner": "traceritops", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18537692872045030, "text": "Signing packs is crazy 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:58:11", "owner": "drm_damon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18049408625674407, "text": "Damn now I have to quit quit smoking", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:57:46", "owner": "angrymeaw_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18299700832260763, "text": "@debarroy ....", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:55:10", "owner": "_stupidus.maximus_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17868220629412221, "text": "his response to “Bob, what’s your dream?” explains exactly why so many ppl showed up. he’s Him 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:50:29", "owner": "purelysara", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905273572281065, "text": "As a regular smoker, I can say that this makes me happy.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:48:42", "owner": "n0.franco", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18247407730288433, "text": "signing on a cigarette box is crazy😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:48:02", "owner": "hoeersh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18166536631383498, "text": "My Alan Dershowitz", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:47:13", "owner": "mrs.hunterbiden", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18007343576656386, "text": "So wholesome", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:47:12", "owner": "queensarahfrick", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064354469429331, "text": "Bobbbb", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:42:31", "owner": "jesuswasjewish", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072982682587153, "text": "Signing a pack of cigarettes… What a dream", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:41:21", "owner": "ceemyre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070426454608509, "text": "Love you mate. Cheers 🍻", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:38:19", "owner": "dcarcamo_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17929592271147639, "text": "This is what smoking was created for.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:37:59", "owner": "danielcano21", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18180289771359056, "text": "💚 Bring menthols back to California!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:37:17", "owner": "kbtapatio", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993899754719967, "text": "👏🔥❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:36:59", "owner": "caramia138", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055935002642797, "text": "Bob you should of ran for mayor", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:36:46", "owner": "pete_moss24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093177877918224, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:33:43", "owner": "popey.espinach", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18410490553186826, "text": "Bro is going down in history", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:27:07", "owner": "dip_r3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17902173897166798, "text": "gotta buy a pack RIGHT FUCKIN NOW 😤", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:22:59", "owner": "the_internef", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18422074858117024, "text": "An icon.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:22:46", "owner": "misscandyjean", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17993914853707021, "text": "Cigarettes are the last uniter", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:21:08", "owner": "maineadventurecycling", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17931973338103904, "text": "This is the cigg guy?!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:20:46", "owner": "jay.ka5h", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18105047989633443, "text": "Free Palestine my nigga", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:19:08", "owner": "valente_z", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17987956301863732, "text": "I want to be him", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:13:24", "owner": "lindsay_a_lindsay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109507249613838, "text": "The community we have grown is just commendable", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:11:34", "owner": "kanchanchauhan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100739473703355, "text": "I sense a @anthpo vid coming", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:10:12", "owner": "red.bel3", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081416909323642, "text": "Hi @sarah.mclaughlin00", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:06:01", "owner": "charheafey", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18081526409322001, "text": "Gudang Garam >>>>>>>>", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:04:35", "owner": "s.petrola", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863303875520475, "text": "Yeah, can you smoking if you want those teeth", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:03:31", "owner": "mjalldaay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969358539976887, "text": "I’d start smoking again just to light up with Bob 🚬 ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:01:49", "owner": "shae_paige_", "likes": 8}, {"id": 17920194123189642, "text": "Unfortunately I had work king 😔", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:01:42", "owner": "wavvybonez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013365911800294, "text": "Cigarettes with bob don’t count", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:00:24", "owner": "uncle_homeless", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17968512239986658, "text": "Now this is America", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:58:13", "owner": "gina.delascio", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18086261938966507, "text": "That’s like putting a fucking hit out for yourself", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:55:53", "owner": "holly_lavenderpine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18028365491759579, "text": "Me on 56 & fig but everyone asking me for a dart", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:54:53", "owner": "burnsberger", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18031084445737472, "text": "The internet is undefeated", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:45:44", "owner": "chartattackmusic", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18080648210128066, "text": "This guy rocks", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:44:54", "owner": "mitcha_paluza", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17937227982099729, "text": "I like my occasional cigarette 🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:43:57", "owner": "_nieto1984_", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17989998701879268, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:42:32", "owner": "emin_0603", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075495653331396, "text": "Cigs bring us together ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:38:39", "owner": "anthonyruoti", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18078551642178163, "text": "new york you’re perfect. please don’t change a thing", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:37:55", "owner": "lilmscreates", "likes": 3801}, {"id": 18367203745083017, "text": "That NY is crazy", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:37:22", "owner": "britt_isin_thepit", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087589228783997, "text": "He is the prophet", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:37:09", "owner": "jd_dally05", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17877085404435700, "text": "I vape but I’d smoke a dart with this fine chum", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:31:08", "owner": "angrydoug1021", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17865013938435989, "text": "My type of hamotzi 🫶🏼", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:30:38", "owner": "giselleleaupepebruce", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18032863934748993, "text": "Lets sin", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:28:01", "owner": "jessycadenasmeza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18513258592066430, "text": "Great idea", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:27:51", "owner": "jessycadenasmeza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997933821841653, "text": "Sounds like a set up", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:27:17", "owner": "jessycadenasmeza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139846906407533, "text": "They screw you and point the finger at you. But, they were quite sloppy. Keep the change Calamity Jess. That says it all right there. They seek my ruin incessantly to keep me in my miserable place just for kicks. $5 K for muñeca. My son played for free. I'm the bad guy here.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:26:42", "owner": "jessycadenasmeza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048615335695372, "text": "A-Men. I'll smoke one with you. They can judge us as bad people. Pagans. Irresponsible. When we're just poor. Have they paid me their karma? Have they paid my children their karma?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:24:52", "owner": "jessycadenasmeza", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929489254147993, "text": "Only Joo I like", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:17:13", "owner": "lettinoff69", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18052465493671021, "text": "I don’t even smoke, but something about this just made me smile", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:16:48", "owner": "brskateboardingnj", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17863310601520100, "text": "Shabbat shalom!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:14:43", "owner": "brskateboardingnj", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17915035620088251, "text": "What a mensch", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:12:13", "owner": "kmfed", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097512571872915, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:11:46", "owner": "ed_m1919", "likes": 58}, {"id": 18048667649689408, "text": "Shabbat Shalom @breakinggbob - you’re what make New York great!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:11:22", "owner": "syncsummitig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074037401215581, "text": "good shabbos my guy 🤝", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:08:09", "owner": "a.v.sleeps", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021037709787136, "text": "bro is a psyop from big tobacco tryna make smoking cool again", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:07:17", "owner": "a.v.sleeps", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18394503448132071, "text": "Wish I was there Bob. Sorry I missed you.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:07:16", "owner": "denya.b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972270873809416, "text": "do it again next year", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:07:04", "owner": "migomargiela", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066980519122118, "text": "Omg Bob! I fell in love at first drag! 2:00-2:05pm? Brilliant. Shabbat Shalom!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:05:02", "owner": "jenracee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076123088239902, "text": "So beautiful I knew they was gonna turn up for him 👏❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:00:52", "owner": "rufflingfeathers_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18215552116307869, "text": "Que mito", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:00:17", "owner": "lablei_itaim", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088829290753060, "text": "Shabbat Shalom, Bob! Positive vibes and even more Marlboro Reds!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:56:50", "owner": "dwntwn.heather.brown", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17976592268792716, "text": "I'm so bummed I missed this! I saw it on Partiful. Legend!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:55:55", "owner": "victoriadinu", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17914947858090405, "text": "💖", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:54:22", "owner": "human_folly", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879067942328680, "text": "The funny thing is… Bob is 37.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:53:07", "owner": "mikekeller.tv", "likes": 108}, {"id": 18070440866373025, "text": "Sir Bob 👑", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:49:02", "owner": "ezzy_jh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18106217305723607, "text": "Bob is the best", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:48:54", "owner": "jeb_edc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051114629352201, "text": "The world is healing", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:47:57", "owner": "palathomas1618", "likes": 2402}, {"id": 17924175324180504, "text": "I’d rather smoke a blunt tbh but yeah", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:44:17", "owner": "mudvillainous209", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17978857448940597, "text": "Wish I was still smoking 🚬 +1 for sure!👍", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:43:41", "owner": "ayushwolf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890675950376776, "text": "I WAS STUCK IN A MUNICIPAL HIRING POOL SO I COULD NOT ATTEND BUT I SMOKED ONE IN YOUR HONOR!!!!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:43:26", "owner": "romanmamus", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18112488829590266, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:40:39", "owner": "moi.kari", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18119314390546328, "text": "@jacobfuckingjones you missed an event of a lifetime", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:40:38", "owner": "xetan6or_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18060644726239678, "text": "David Lynch would have loved this 😭", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:40:20", "owner": "jen_mc_spooky", "likes": 8987}, {"id": 18165338545379436, "text": "Healing earth.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:35:51", "owner": "vivabartleby", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18331725805211922, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:26:08", "owner": "lightscameracar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18378576694148706, "text": "Just another nail in the coffin I always say 🤣.. when is the next meetup?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:22:02", "owner": "dj.kellsbells", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057333524295285, "text": "the event was incredible.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:19:45", "owner": "whoisbonnieclyde", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542953579017567, "text": "Best day ever", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:19:14", "owner": "edd204698", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855454825565677, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:17:51", "owner": "jimmybarnatan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541540366050148, "text": "@kyle.hambas.nyc", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:14:17", "owner": "kylethrash", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18537037855032336, "text": "Great to see young people still have culture this was a brilliant experiment 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:14:04", "owner": "tastingtokyo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18075614777241038, "text": "Same time,next year‼️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:09:25", "owner": "lizmed86", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17857591122557430, "text": "America is back", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:00:19", "owner": "tommyodonnelll", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18128736322501284, "text": "I’m not a smoker and I’ve never been a fan of cigarettes, but the way the world is, I think this is a great thing.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:58:12", "owner": "silver_slivers", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543234568045866, "text": "Can this please be a quarterly or at least annual thing? I’m so upset I wasn’t there 😩", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:55:20", "owner": "megancgolden", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17848380468600905, "text": "Wish I could’ve been there!!! You’re amazing, Bob!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:54:22", "owner": "ninja_claudia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083642288100647, "text": "Yay! Cigarettes! 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:53:51", "owner": "grimorri", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17846475663609924, "text": "absolute legend", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:52:36", "owner": "wagonwrase", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17991009113883573, "text": "What a cutie", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:50:13", "owner": "haleyelizabeth_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17972603876808163, "text": "My new hero", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:50:00", "owner": "alljillnojack420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100985752739973, "text": "My son", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:49:02", "owner": "rare_style", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070120895060744, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:43:12", "owner": "jenjromano", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18539392591041931, "text": "Makes me what a cigarette and I don’t smoke.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:42:23", "owner": "melmckenz", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076474456968015, "text": "This is amazing.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:42:13", "owner": "melmckenz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072428402251402, "text": "But did any of them make you laugh Bob?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:40:53", "owner": "simonbedak", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080743429884084, "text": "Anthpo I know this is ran by you", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:36:33", "owner": "bmrvalentine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860008339479814, "text": "Your fcking AWESOME 🙌👏", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:33:56", "owner": "davestar_novachacha", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18547243030032275, "text": "Lung cancer doing the birdman hand rub watching this", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:33:01", "owner": "aanzla", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17972675939796776, "text": "Smoking is bad, community is gooood!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:32:08", "owner": "sawickiwickiwicki", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954151957012470, "text": "shabbat shalom", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:28:57", "owner": "dmmfo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18142424401403074, "text": "Why not? The world is caving in. Smoke em if ya got em.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:25:50", "owner": "sjsphotoemporium", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18353324374203655, "text": "❤️❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:25:29", "owner": "stephatorz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295237474285040, "text": "Shabbat Shalom", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:25:29", "owner": "debajax", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18135641431419460, "text": "Im with you in spirit amigo", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:24:34", "owner": "accordionsrus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099310105783187, "text": "I do love smoking", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:24:25", "owner": "lotekchapra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18365965708094189, "text": "Next time be a mensch and as everyone to show up with one canned food for donation. 👏", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:23:11", "owner": "rachelelizabethmarcus", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17965795178998342, "text": "Good fuccin vibes ! I miss 40oz bounce 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:16:09", "owner": "twin.turbo.b", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969489513823140, "text": "WE LOVE YOU, Bob! It was the event of the year!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:16:04", "owner": "elena.maravelias", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18083326652094696, "text": "He did it", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:10:23", "owner": "svid__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18080142944517962, "text": "Love him", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:07:08", "owner": "queenwolf88", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18138030469459049, "text": "If I had known about it, I would have been there! Shabbat Shalom, Bob! ♥️✌️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T02:00:19", "owner": "adam_loves_eve_photo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18304057117266606, "text": "Guit Shabbes!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:55:50", "owner": "erlichman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083033506849942, "text": "Aaaah that seems like such a good vibe", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:53:51", "owner": "levonmoyang9", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086881066964796, "text": "Blessings brother", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:53:17", "owner": "big_cig", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145984774442519, "text": "Can we meet up to take a shit together next?!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:52:21", "owner": "_patball_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065068364389370, "text": "Fuck yeah unc, light that shit up 🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:50:44", "owner": "jarobin10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077800454269539, "text": "Po's in the air...", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:48:40", "owner": "diegomunoz.13", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088087592490489, "text": "Society is so cringe. Ew", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:47:49", "owner": "omniversexy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18437334694101313, "text": "🙏🏿", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:46:40", "owner": "djwaterboi_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329805643211918, "text": "This puts a huge smile on my face.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:45:55", "owner": "jerrkyd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17980023518778572, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:45:19", "owner": "samuel_hein1162", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17997475697697073, "text": "this is so wholesome", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:44:47", "owner": "kalexandrovnao", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098517727699967, "text": "I know it STUNK 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:42:54", "owner": "severinadiane", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18412979887143967, "text": "Hero", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:40:04", "owner": "travexas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18543644437019374, "text": "Bob for president", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:39:58", "owner": "totothedog420", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086587171975184, "text": "Best caption! 🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:39:03", "owner": "carterdowning", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942819859088062, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:39:03", "owner": "myzart2025", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17906283366276984, "text": "nice propaganda", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:37:25", "owner": "julianaenlatierra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 1