lw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086226872286586, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:02:15", "owner": "jimenacorrea_studios_art", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18157927021400510, "text": "Iconic", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:01:45", "owner": "ryleigh_alana", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18074469746190137, "text": "🚬💕🎁", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:01:43", "owner": "cortneylevin", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18083920853093751, "text": "Amazing!! Next one and I’m there ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:00:47", "owner": "chrissysparkle325", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111701200582879, "text": "❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T01:00:31", "owner": "berealistichere", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083536504843047, "text": "The people yearn for community", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:59:40", "owner": "themightydino7", "likes": 636}, {"id": 18059057018267016, "text": "Never had FOMO harder than this 😭😭", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:59:39", "owner": "curly.sage", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069892409074617, "text": "Big cigarette: *wipes tear*", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:59:05", "owner": "andrewtindall", "likes": 2457}, {"id": 18050816285356416, "text": "This is the most Jewish shit I’ve ever seen", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:58:39", "owner": "eggsgritsandlicketysplits", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18337315222229083, "text": "A inveja que estou sentindo fala português", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:55:18", "owner": "rafaowline", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067702982095727, "text": "Pissed I missed this", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:52:17", "owner": "nohocoho", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17971403294812567, "text": "Me after 3 beers", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:51:40", "owner": "bluebonnets17", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026071172769919, "text": "Unbelievable 👏", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:51:09", "owner": "sam_deutsch", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17928717831155922, "text": "Who is he?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:50:30", "owner": "abdulfahadabro1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063649595395770, "text": "👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:49:43", "owner": "mrhothoneydabs", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18045625961476341, "text": "NGL love this ! If ppl can be a boy or a girl then ppl should be allowed to smoke cigarettes if they want", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:44:42", "owner": "lori_kengeee", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18114921166563119, "text": "G-d bless you, Bob!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:41:40", "owner": "tacoguy450", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18051059552355496, "text": "🫡", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:41:22", "owner": "albertbrooks.fan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17939690201964225, "text": "Beautiful 😮‍💨 Gut Shabbos!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:40:00", "owner": "_amor__mundi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102553105670068, "text": "Can we introduce Chinese Ciggarettes to Bob???", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:39:08", "owner": "brbrosbzkurt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17848226280602664, "text": "🫡💨💨💨", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:36:59", "owner": "smoktrickzz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091268530926391, "text": "I quit smoking and it was inconvenient for my schedule, very worth it tho", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:36:36", "owner": "b.b.dolll", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17884012905406652, "text": "This should be our Mayor tbh lol", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:36:11", "owner": "damndaddychill", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064561217413636, "text": "Couldn’t make it today! Catch you at the next meet up.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:35:53", "owner": "anavitakillion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18297587272284542, "text": "Must’ve smelled like an ashtray for 5 blocks", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:34:24", "owner": "michael.murphy0001", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18068621153093935, "text": "Mensch of the year", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:32:20", "owner": "pickletastic", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18085966072825568, "text": "Fuckin disgusting", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:31:46", "owner": "wildlee.coyote", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17979064583783454, "text": "Sad I had to work", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:31:25", "owner": "lov3ley.leaa__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18541185580060782, "text": "It shows how much people just want community", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:31:07", "owner": "snoopycanard", "likes": 117}, {"id": 18160105771401511, "text": "@davechappelle", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:30:56", "owner": "royalbengalouds", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088894696756781, "text": "shabbat shalom bob ❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:30:23", "owner": "deloramaygloss", "likes": 89}, {"id": 17939602512096933, "text": "Omg so cool! Been waiting to see how many ppl joined him", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:30:01", "owner": "keniawest", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17946802469934501, "text": "i’m sorry i missed this 💔 i hope there’s more", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:29:40", "owner": "sweettholike", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950396842025716, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:27:20", "owner": "feral.moonbeam", "likes": 237}, {"id": 18348605614201322, "text": "Marlboro reds are a choice", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:26:52", "owner": "estherlevychehebar", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18066927734576657, "text": "Thank you for providing some levity for a world that seriously needs it", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:26:31", "owner": "ok_archphoto", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396965971127763, "text": "Where is Mac DeMarco?? 😂🚬🚬🚬🚬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:26:29", "owner": "victorcajal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17926470378158276, "text": "Incredible", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:26:27", "owner": "qveenjuliaa", "likes": 40}, {"id": 18365582686091863, "text": "CIGS INSIDE", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:26:14", "owner": "parkstras_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17932243949997446, "text": "I’m so jealous I couldn’t be there", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:25:00", "owner": "emotional_octopus", "likes": 189}, {"id": 18031022087741696, "text": "Legend 🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:24:19", "owner": "michaelpatrickgavin", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18002815220821766, "text": "Aquela voz toda trabalhada no Malboro vermelho 😍", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:24:15", "owner": "tiolecanoas", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18176352526368900, "text": "Bob you are my idol", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:22:39", "owner": "_paigediaz_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17912849040248924, "text": "I don’t like smoking but I do like old Jewish men", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:22:25", "owner": "taradoustar", "likes": 137}, {"id": 17862444900453954, "text": "This is insane", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:21:40", "owner": "maximusthelama", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961241997858888, "text": "I couldnt be there but I joined from louisiana!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:19:36", "owner": "ramonakutavich12", "likes": 13}, {"id": 18086673841956086, "text": "Ugh I wish I could’ve been there!!! Shabbat Shalom!!!", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:18:56", "owner": "lets_rhi.up", "likes": 809}, {"id": 18104244622631600, "text": "😂😂🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:18:23", "owner": "sorayabelusi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073649561022712, "text": "Pulmonologists punching the air rn.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:17:35", "owner": "dabbledinpacifism", "likes": 1231}, {"id": 18440477215099164, "text": "What an achievement…", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:16:54", "owner": "livnodamir", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905000560142155, "text": "Momentous", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:16:21", "owner": "brookekelty", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18544067662053210, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:16:15", "owner": "shonta_renee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929218798153782, "text": "Keep the cigs alive brother! 😎", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:15:31", "owner": "alexsimms90", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18108784612553359, "text": "SHABBAT SHALOM BOB", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:15:14", "owner": "oriravid", "likes": 31}, {"id": 18081968084107185, "text": "Single-handedly bringing civilization back together love it Bob 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:15:06", "owner": "_arynton", "likes": 16352}, {"id": 18081754115100035, "text": "Legend.", "created_at": "2025-11-22T00:15:01", "owner": "makenatimmins", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064561514161681, "text