{"media_id": 3769788696196477671, "shortcode": "DRQ-tiTEvLn", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRQ-tiTEvLn/", "taken_at": "2025-11-20T04:44:13", "caption": "Emma Chamberlain 是美國 YouTuber、創作者與企業家，以極具個人特色的 vlog、幽默剪輯與毫不掩飾的真實風格爆紅。她在 2017 年開始經營 YouTube，靠著「不完美但真誠」的內容——尷尬、日常、低門檻、極度 relatable——迅速吸引年輕族群。\n她爆紅的關鍵：\n* 打破當時 YouTube 的完美人設潮流，用快速跳剪、自嘲與尷尬幽默建立獨特風格\n* 每支影片像在陪觀眾聊天，建立超強情感連結\n* 早期高產，主題簡單但極度真實（喝咖啡、整理房間、逛 Target、分享焦慮）\n* 演算法喜歡她，觀眾更喜歡她，短短兩年就累積數百萬粉絲\n她後來跨足 podcast（Anything Goes）、時尚圈（LV 大使）、自創品牌（Chamberlain Coffee），從網紅進化為真正的文化人物。", "owner_username": "the_insight_circle", "owner_id": "75971210622", "likes": 28034, "is_video": false, "typename": "GraphSidecar", "media": [{"type": "image", "path": "0162_DRQ-tiTEvLn\\DRQ-tiTEvLn_20251120_044413_1.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0162_DRQ-tiTEvLn\\DRQ-tiTEvLn_20251120_044413_10.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0162_DRQ-tiTEvLn\\DRQ-tiTEvLn_20251120_044413_11.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0162_DRQ-tiTEvLn\\DRQ-tiTEvLn_20251120_044413_12.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0162_DRQ-tiTEvLn\\DRQ-tiTEvLn_20251120_044413_13.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0162_DRQ-tiTEvLn\\DRQ-tiTEvLn_20251120_044413_2.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0162_DRQ-tiTEvLn\\DRQ-tiTEvLn_20251120_044413_3.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0162_DRQ-tiTEvLn\\DRQ-tiTEvLn_20251120_044413_4.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0162_DRQ-tiTEvLn\\DRQ-tiTEvLn_20251120_044413_5.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0162_DRQ-tiTEvLn\\DRQ-tiTEvLn_20251120_044413_6.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0162_DRQ-tiTEvLn\\DRQ-tiTEvLn_20251120_044413_7.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0162_DRQ-tiTEvLn\\DRQ-tiTEvLn_20251120_044413_8.jpg"}, {"type": "image", "path": "0162_DRQ-tiTEvLn\\DRQ-tiTEvLn_20251120_044413_9.jpg"}], "comments": [{"id": 18046969118426668, "text": "前提是你要有粉丝", "created_at": "2025-11-20T10:24:30", "owner": "danieltan.92", "likes": 366}, {"id": 18160406623402918, "text": "Emma 自己有說過這個品牌，真的只是有興趣做而已，到現在其實都是打平，沒有增加收入🤷🏻‍♀️", "created_at": "2025-11-21T07:12:44", "owner": "lucy.chuang", "likes": 316}, {"id": 17854613199527602, "text": "啥 我記得只有收入者打平 哪來的打敗😂 又在亂報 小編去罰站別亂報了", "created_at": "2025-11-21T20:42:18", "owner": "dennipan", "likes": 75}, {"id": 18075618656186537, "text": "事後諸葛", "created_at": "2025-11-25T13:25:29", "owner": "fonie_tsou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18046923143692989, "text": "这招帅，产品和电影结合", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:12:10", "owner": "xiaosen2", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18024110936783398, "text": "讓小弟毛遂自薦 @mandylai.select \n也是致力於電影與產品結合。\n電影不應只有聽覺與視覺的享受，如果加上了味覺更能五感體驗。", "created_at": "2025-11-24T20:16:57", "owner": "wearismax_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17879785725427286, "text": "好文", "created_at": "2025-11-28T05:45:40", "owner": "wasonkuo", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17864275641513131, "text": "謝謝分享🙏", "created_at": "2025-11-21T17:13:20", "owner": "wth_1019", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081245462123734, "text": "我只看到一堆形容詞 再來是她原本就有百萬瀏量 ==", "created_at": "2025-11-21T10:14:01", "owner": "samdy9487", "likes": 17}, {"id": 18305518909264904, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-20T23:59:49", "owner": "samarsa.life2024", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847446466582370, "text": "成功模式是很難複製的\n但可以從中學到一些優點放在自己的品牌上面，我覺得這樣蠻好的", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:08:54", "owner": "rex10217", "likes": 29}, {"id": 18013415132796185, "text": "越來越多人不喜歡思考的證明", "created_at": "2025-11-21T08:53:06", "owner": "butter9maru", "likes": 10}, {"id": 18369689125081955, "text": "老實說當我看到這個post之前沒有聽過這個品牌", "created_at": "2025-11-21T11:25:08", "owner": "vthegreat8810778889", "likes": 5}, {"id": 17973277004911614, "text": "1%的賽道😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T18:16:58", "owner": "thisis_jaylin", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18108760501531393, "text": "從眾效應，買的人不懂咖啡，也不會自己泡，會泡的也不想買他的咖啡。", "created_at": "2025-11-22T10:09:33", "owner": "evanlu78", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18008043281813828, "text": "然後跑去買星巴克", "created_at": "2025-11-21T01:42:21", "owner": "jstc_motor", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17935820136156470, "text": "主產品不賺錢 賺副產品也是模式之一", "created_at": "2025-11-22T04:24:16", "owner": "bright_cwei", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17928384312118685, "text": "問題為啥台灣好像沒看過，你看如果她想超越星巴克，那台灣這種小國她應該也要進來吧", "created_at": "2025-11-21T06:50:08", "owner": "chen_honghan1204", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086400229814188, "text": "簡單的離譜！？？？？？？？？", "created_at": "2025-11-21T02:50:40", "owner": "long.long.story", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17993795771707605, "text": "星巴克太貴了，馬克杯還中國產的，居然還這麼貴", "created_at": "2025-11-21T02:34:37", "owner": "zhe.li.77", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18081654323031424, "text": "瑞幸咖啡表示🤔：敵襲🤪", "created_at": "2025-11-20T18:57:13", "owner": "you_are_the_apple_of_my_eye_s", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18058627628641845, "text": "這個解釋很後設", "created_at": "2025-11-21T15:17:44", "owner": "blast_beat1999", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18145455130442735, "text": "這種行銷超級糟糕...用話術來包裝一個爛產品", "created_at": "2025-11-20T16:43:24", "owner": "johnny_1064", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18366570700085566, "text": "打敗？\n網紅店能維持熱度就很不錯了還妄想打敗一個龐大系統的咖啡帝國？\n或除非像瑞幸那樣拿到高額資本", "created_at": "2025-11-21T11:16:49", "owner": "simon60605", "likes": 87}, {"id": 17993336411712888, "text": "強", "created_at": "2025-11-21T10:06:38", "owner": "tingmuuuuu", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18085084817056155, "text": "他前面已經很不簡單的擁有那些粉絲了🌚", "created_at": "2025-11-21T04:08:25", "owner": "__chienhed__", "likes": 27}, {"id": 18413346670141157, "text": "他誰", "created_at": "2025-12-13T06:46:13", "owner": "enangovo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064686362178344, "text": "什么叫没有广告费？ 你tm 制作电影launching 不用钱💰？？", "created_at": "2025-12-08T10:44:26", "owner": "donaldmorrow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17930226060078671, "text": "還是星巴克比較適合我😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-08T03:29:52", "owner": "yt6666yt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18060601940246089, "text": "我有在美國喝過罐裝的⋯其實有一點難喝😂", "created_at": "2025-12-06T06:45:17", "owner": "thisisbenkang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18400911265122064, "text": "🔥🔥🔥👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-06T02:59:44", "owner": "marcolin19860925", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931936684115072, "text": "這個女生真的很厲害 之前就有看過他的報導", "created_at": "2025-12-05T18:27:25", "owner": "cradles619020", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076250774189927, "text": "所以，發文的你，有成功用這套方式賺錢嗎", "created_at": "2025-12-05T15:52:58", "owner": "jack_____0609", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905673562293136, "text": "她誰啊 消費星巴克的女拳", "created_at": "2025-12-05T05:45:49", "owner": "litchi_stock", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077702239957682, "text": "膨風業配新聞", "created_at": "2025-12-04T06:10:48", "owner": "wang.garbo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064928237625833, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-12-03T15:53:20", "owner": "arvin._.0316", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087865465979114, "text": "擁有百萬粉絲就是活廣告", "created_at": "2025-12-03T12:31:34", "owner": "corvette815", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855548452528949, "text": "你很棒，但我不喝咖啡了 會心悸啊⋯", "created_at": "2025-12-03T06:56:36", "owner": "hao_chien10", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050572340675035, "text": "😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-03T03:58:18", "owner": "__vivi0802", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968013840987038, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:04:38", "owner": "pichuhd_0124", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967962393985985, "text": "首先你要有流量", "created_at": "2025-12-01T13:45:45", "owner": "wanggsmt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18009649781650219, "text": "前幾天剛好經過點了一杯覺得非常普通🤣真的是在賣人設和粉絲信仰", "created_at": "2025-11-30T20:50:37", "owner": "endlesskirakira", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321420514169109, "text": "前提是你要有启动资金", "created_at": "2025-11-30T10:19:47", "owner": "cswhomeec", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17876689236441829, "text": "可是大公司撐起了社會打工人的工作機會", "created_at": "2025-11-30T00:14:13", "owner": "yeowjianxiang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329627998214442, "text": "熱度不會撐太久，很多時候都是飢餓行銷", "created_at": "2025-11-29T23:42:17", "owner": "twu2112", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860844931544346, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-29T02:39:00", "owner": "proteinmonkey_plentong", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18321734635245075, "text": "有道理", "created_at": "2025-11-27T17:28:08", "owner": "lanlin921205", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18080604308325465, "text": "這叫做曇花一現", "created_at": "2025-11-27T09:40:57", "owner": "breezenight_0917", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950907883050918, "text": "買過一包咖啡很普通 我家的超市已經下架沒賣了", "created_at": "2025-11-26T17:30:27", "owner": "dianecccmeow", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17853644889578913, "text": "首先你要有百萬粉絲", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:18:05", "owner": "arvin_liu24", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048523919414921, "text": "我寧願進駐台灣的是這個不是中國的那個欸", "created_at": "2025-11-26T12:03:28", "owner": "bl10110507", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18126115174501728, "text": "畢竟不是大企業集團，比持久力還是比較重要", "created_at": "2025-11-26T04:37:52", "owner": "totobaby1060229", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969061440988017, "text": "很棒的分享❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:38:27", "owner": "brandgrow.mama", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086360875969738, "text": "長久下來可能持續？", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:54:34", "owner": "hao_11.28", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17890051320385101, "text": "為什麼留言區一堆 喝星巴克就有優越感的感覺 就像拿iPhone一樣覺得自己很跩", "created_at": "2025-11-24T00:47:58", "owner": "_____nasus30_____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062906978185817, "text": "多余 多少人才出一個 背後的團隊你都不會知道", "created_at": "2025-11-24T00:07:15", "owner": "dinnnooo_m", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085059599007452, "text": "咖啡因和纹身，人类两大迷惑行为", "created_at": "2025-11-23T18:03:24", "owner": "shwn.lvo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18082265006025928, "text": "不能複製的策略", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:15:51", "owner": "chan_bellbell", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17905035336145506, "text": "未能參與其中，太可惜了", "created_at": "2025-11-23T09:10:57", "owner": "stonehometw", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030342830754525, "text": "覺得兩者沒辦法一起比較", "created_at": "2025-11-23T05:01:27", "owner": "chickyv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081866956894981, "text": "@miier.1992", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:37:38", "owner": "z_hugh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18064055597407046, "text": "我覺得只是用不一樣的方式廣告", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:24:18", "owner": "neo_23.5n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18121055062535321, "text": "我還是只知道星巴克，說不訂這篇文就是她買的，想打廣告", "created_at": "2025-11-23T01:46:43", "owner": "yanting2808", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18054012680334956, "text": "流量變現最完美的體現", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:12:12", "owner": "nigiri0228", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17952797817029473, "text": "前提是她沒生在台灣", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:22:10", "owner": "philip40503", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102077281673903, "text": "外國特別成功👏👏👏，你咪去埋我果份。", "created_at": "2025-11-22T05:56:06", "owner": "olchan0806", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18542830975026647, "text": "她的想法確實很創新，但不太現實，畢竟她是已經擁有了喜愛他的百萬粉絲為前提下開始的🫣", "created_at": "2025-11-22T03:47:21", "owner": "heu6ek7xjp6", "likes": 18}, {"id": 18009801128815365, "text": "為什麼要用gpt 寫文章", "created_at": "2025-11-21T23:29:20", "owner": "yurickdf", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17882758767420272, "text": "就像我20歲就能買一間三千萬的房子，但是全靠我爸以前累積的財富一樣😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T23:09:58", "owner": "neo75817", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942539050086812, "text": "好有頭腦 👏", "created_at": "2025-11-21T01:13:28", "owner": "0903gregory", "likes": 5}], "location": null, "hashtags": []},
{"media_id": 3757965646446651191, "shortcode": "DQm-dhKkuc3", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DQm-dhKkuc3/", "taken_at": "2025-11-03T21:15:13", "caption": "Protester steals Lime bike in central London! What on earth 😳 \n\n#london #protest #redhead", "owner_username": "itslolagxo", "owner_id": "74801309383", "likes": 433, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0163_DQm-dhKkuc3\\DQm-dhKkuc3_20251103_211513.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": "18065245022394712", "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-26T21:47:40", "owner": "ezy000865x", "likes": 3}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["london", "protest", "redhead"]},
{"media_id": 3769865804440026459, "shortcode": "DRRQPm8ij1b", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRRQPm8ij1b/", "taken_at": "2025-11-20T07:17:54", "caption": "Talking about dream proposals…we got you covered the PwC way😉 \n\nAye-aye Southampton captains, it’s been a pleasure🫡⚓️\n\n#PwCCyprus #PwCCyprusOnTour", "owner_username": "pwc_cy", "owner_id": "3450677524", "likes": 6676, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0164_DRRQPm8ij1b\\DRRQPm8ij1b_20251120_071754.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17905120677147418, "text": "Imagine being a PWC client 💸 and seeing this video 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T14:44:31", "owner": "enrique.g.zbinden", "likes": 1158}, {"id": 18076990780957184, "text": "Never say yes to a Big 4", "created_at": "2025-11-22T13:31:25", "owner": "josemh301", "likes": 448}, {"id": 17946012623940561, "text": "Are you hiring tho ? I can send my Cv 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-27T10:28:01", "owner": "pradiptajha", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18079754132154435, "text": "This made me want to resign", "created_at": "2025-11-23T11:29:00", "owner": "atypicaljohnsmith", "likes": 19}, {"id": 18064899449389208, "text": "The HR department while consultants work 70h/per week for 50k a year💀", "created_at": "2025-11-23T16:43:22", "owner": "sbn_hnz", "likes": 201}, {"id": 17985746549866628, "text": "XDD", "created_at": "2025-11-23T11:53:59", "owner": "john_otara", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18076044950230416, "text": "Jokes aside, this is part of the demographic problem we are in", "created_at": "2025-11-23T16:40:04", "owner": "paumxy", "likes": 21}, {"id": 18293672560278833, "text": "Then you proceeded to lock her up from sunrise to sunset until she becomes partner… 😬", "created_at": "2025-11-22T23:04:20", "owner": "or_davin", "likes": 44}, {"id": 18064755542622432, "text": "This is what happens when you don't love yourself", "created_at": "2025-11-22T16:00:44", "owner": "dahh.mad.scientist", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18541345714023974, "text": "@_monster__cookie_ @mr.ayus_17", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:37:31", "owner": "___sakil___s", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069839252591954, "text": "Girls Group United - The new power from the source crowd 🤠🥳✨️🎉🎉🎁", "created_at": "2025-11-24T17:33:54", "owner": "tim_unger_real", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18046857017452655, "text": "ㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋㅋ Wtf", "created_at": "2025-11-24T15:13:29", "owner": "lee.__.gyul", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18334159921236659, "text": "May this cringe never find me", "created_at": "2025-11-23T00:49:13", "owner": "je.suis.w", "likes": 28}, {"id": 18028570334755285, "text": "HR department from hell.", "created_at": "2025-11-23T16:53:58", "owner": "tripleg32", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18058998308644963, "text": "Cringe", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:17:02", "owner": "basdt2010", "likes": 12}, {"id": 17956528212010935, "text": "😂 telio", "created_at": "2025-11-20T08:30:05", "owner": "ddc_despina", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082377335119907, "text": "I work in Audit at a big4 and get angry about this", "created_at": "2025-11-23T11:50:45", "owner": "kojomo.weissmann", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18141155860455805, "text": "This is so… empty 👀", "created_at": "2025-11-23T08:40:18", "owner": "jackshiels1", "likes": 4}, {"id": 17889483075385358, "text": "Big 4 - teaching chefs how to cook when you burn toast", "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:45:40", "owner": "majkl_najt_", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18073779566337657, "text": "Do you accept to get 810€, no work life balance and mental breakdown?? YEEEES", "created_at": "2025-11-21T20:19:09", "owner": "a_synap", "likes": 87}, {"id": 17993712641715065, "text": "A wild strategy for a consulting firm to believe this cringe video is the path to success…", "created_at": "2025-11-23T01:51:54", "owner": "takeoffdownunder", "likes": 16}, {"id": 17854365387572074, "text": "Cringe", "created_at": "2025-11-23T11:12:27", "owner": "prelanderi", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18037842020733587, "text": "What are we even doing anymore", "created_at": "2025-12-12T18:52:30", "owner": "watchman13", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18048886007682489, "text": "If there were a list of shittiest companies you could go and work at, PwC would rank amongst the top 4.", "created_at": "2025-11-23T07:12:59", "owner": "know_thyself_42", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17867379018494666, "text": "This is what my company is paying $10k per hour and 10% cut of ‘value realisation’ gets? 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T05:22:33", "owner": "garagereimagined", "likes": 93}, {"id": 17947732133932517, "text": "Powell Interest Rate cuts starting to have an effect", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:30:03", "owner": "thearnabsarkar", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18077552105232529, "text": "@sdtgs_18 would've said yes too", "created_at": "2025-11-27T15:10:09", "owner": "kani.co_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17936965008106797, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-12-13T10:03:13", "owner": "gianky_versys650italia", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18319028368217546, "text": "😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-12-12T18:31:14", "owner": "mncpa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947194594077765, "text": "The PwC Australia scandal involves senior partners misusing confidential government tax information, shared by partner Peter Collins (who helped design the laws), to help multinational clients avoid taxes, leading to partner sackings, CEO resignation (Tom Seymour), selling off the government business, fines, and investigations by police and regulators. This widespread breach of trust, initially downplayed as a lone-actor issue, was revealed through Senate inquiries and investigations to involve numerous partners and significant conflicts of interest, damaging PwC's reputation and prompting major governance overhauls.", "created_at": "2025-12-12T09:07:08", "owner": "_the_amansingh._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18184760923353235, "text": "Makes sense ready for a good fucking", "created_at": "2025-12-10T20:30:15", "owner": "nabeelhuda99", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17948204573935571, "text": "@the_.blissvanity", "created_at": "2025-12-08T02:12:32", "owner": "_inayatbrar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18151094314426394, "text": "HR trying to justify their equally peculiar and useless existence", "created_at": "2025-12-06T12:07:55", "owner": "alexanderjanc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084276701292986, "text": "Congrats on earning just above minimum wage", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:55:17", "owner": "owlyoungish349", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18102985120738965, "text": "sfbbbbb", "created_at": "2025-12-04T18:38:14", "owner": "sid.mohapatra", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066569876134207, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂👏👏👏👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-12-04T17:40:22", "owner": "madinapr8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103676116679781, "text": "When are you sending me one?", "created_at": "2025-12-04T05:28:10", "owner": "osamajamilmughal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18088395335052319, "text": "Yes", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:00:50", "owner": "manishpandey.uk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18316379443223125, "text": "🙌🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-30T12:35:41", "owner": "hasan.khan.niazi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17950322385047665, "text": "get the fkn out from there", "created_at": "2025-11-28T15:54:02", "owner": "magic_otash", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104286268578966, "text": "Imagine trying to pretend something even close to this would ever happen", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:42:25", "owner": "kcc_71", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065333117624339, "text": "The HR department lol", "created_at": "2025-11-27T04:22:03", "owner": "hedy_tissaoui", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081414386128262, "text": "HR departament after lay off to someone", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:40:04", "owner": "ignaciobermejo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18011360165638852, "text": "Joy of working at big4❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-26T18:16:32", "owner": "m_waleed_ur_rehman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18338519557234302, "text": "EBITDA good buddy👏🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-26T14:19:00", "owner": "_charlene.__.101", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954431770021495, "text": "So. Where are my tax fees going?", "created_at": "2025-11-26T07:00:25", "owner": "bootykika", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083688322860949, "text": "Mala señal si tienen que hacer este tipo de contenido 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-25T19:49:41", "owner": "carlosortegaelduque", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077989522942219, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-25T04:33:32", "owner": "yuyunchong94", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039223541715886, "text": "Time to short this company", "created_at": "2025-11-24T23:54:16", "owner": "realmigga2019", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18514769299064387, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T22:02:56", "owner": "antoniobustamante", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061848782444226, "text": "Yes❤️", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:31:05", "owner": "bhavyas_day", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18159719212395918, "text": "Corny till you get rifed", "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:02:03", "owner": "calileesb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061036352213934, "text": "Still time to delete this", "created_at": "2025-11-24T10:47:35", "owner": "demar90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18247466200288531, "text": "Nice! 🥳😂", "created_at": "2025-11-24T09:33:13", "owner": "babelprofiles", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396830713126212, "text": "Can I join too?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:34:12", "owner": "uyaahmad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18103501321678303, "text": "I bet the time to make this was billed to the client", "created_at": "2025-11-24T06:27:09", "owner": "jwintle91", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18104362513711505, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T04:09:19", "owner": "pr0t0_man_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086750635998688, "text": "This is gonna age like gas station sushi", "created_at": "2025-11-24T03:56:13", "owner": "lifewithcon", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095674198841975, "text": "Where’s the equality?", "created_at": "2025-11-24T01:32:22", "owner": "lauzy_me", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860120611479720, "text": "Gag.", "created_at": "2025-11-24T00:32:38", "owner": "gollydolly77", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18295082584286305, "text": "RIP lil girl", "created_at": "2025-11-23T23:16:44", "owner": "honolulu21728", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17849569236599025, "text": "😢", "created_at": "2025-11-23T22:47:31", "owner": "ivan_blvsk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18086731543792740, "text": "Daycare", "created_at": "2025-11-23T21:50:40", "owner": "tmcn85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991104321891230, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T21:19:36", "owner": "sons_of_bask", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18171453826330107, "text": "When I joined KPMG in 2018, it was just blood and sweat. None of this fake inclusive stuff.", "created_at": "2025-11-23T19:21:21", "owner": "andreapiergiovanniofficial", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17949258873060381, "text": "Run.", "created_at": "2025-11-23T19:17:59", "owner": "rodgomola", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098757790815459, "text": "🙌🙌ye", "created_at": "2025-11-23T19:10:19", "owner": "itsaksshat", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18073144424217112, "text": "get back to work", "created_at": "2025-11-23T18:23:54", "owner": "techxan_financial_inc", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17971053587971878, "text": "Then got divorced in 1 year 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:58:22", "owner": "kingduchuy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17925964032168836, "text": "A bunch of Gen Z liberal white women , sounds like a nightmarish work place", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:40:34", "owner": "divingpopo", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063710048626359, "text": "Please fire all the woman in your marketing department @pwc_cy", "created_at": "2025-11-23T17:37:42", "owner": "miguelangel_030", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18175504936368662, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T16:01:15", "owner": "alcax66", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18540783835035891, "text": "Future childless cat lady", "created_at": "2025-11-23T15:38:18", "owner": "__meck_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17864649957513647, "text": "😂😂😂😂😂😂", "created_at": "2025-11-23T12:46:01", "owner": "nomadin852", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110098102611054, "text": "Some life choices cost you freedom and happiness", "created_at": "2025-11-23T11:23:52", "owner": "nextstepisvlubhouse", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087463145507347, "text": "@es_plumblossom 盼马斯克归", "created_at": "2025-11-23T08:54:07", "owner": "yikai_407", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17954202600035060, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:17:29", "owner": "dani_nouveau", "likes": 190}, {"id": 18076861346242811, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-23T03:05:58", "owner": "xgon_givit2you", "likes": 62}, {"id": 18354544171165183, "text": "The classic toxic relationship 😅", "created_at": "2025-11-22T17:12:05", "owner": "andyoso1987", "likes": 444}, {"id": 18157090066367094, "text": "Ew no 🙂‍↔️", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:24:39", "owner": "a.run.time.error", "likes": 3}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["pwccyprus", "pwccyprusontour"]},
{"media_id": 3769397601943909822, "shortcode": "DRPlyXZE3W-", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRPlyXZE3W-/", "taken_at": "2025-11-19T15:49:33", "caption": "揭秘英國底層人時薪購買力！\n\n追蹤 @letsgo_airplane 看更多旅遊生活\n\n#海外生活 #留學生 #逛超市 #vlog日常", "owner_username": "letsgo_airplane", "owner_id": "75891125104", "likes": 8919, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0165_DRPlyXZE3W-\\DRPlyXZE3W-_20251119_154933.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18383010502150120, "text": "下次試吓去Lidl, Aldi, Sainsbury, tesco", "created_at": "2025-12-02T17:49:41", "owner": "thomas_12122", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17859124005551685, "text": "瑪莎算富人超市？", "created_at": "2025-11-21T13:03:44", "owner": "1maxwellso9", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17930748108113150, "text": "有些東西英國賣的比台灣便宜", "created_at": "2025-11-19T16:39:05", "owner": "asd55538", "likes": 489}, {"id": 18087887419769212, "text": "MS貴但也有較便宜的pondland🤔", "created_at": "2025-11-20T14:49:53", "owner": "amanda_viola18", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18134507191482841, "text": "英國有一些無良企業，譬如中餐廳😂", "created_at": "2025-11-20T07:40:37", "owner": "my_1990__", "likes": 1459}, {"id": 18085811269984320, "text": "£10=100港紙", "created_at": "2025-11-20T16:33:22", "owner": "molio748", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18048048323427629, "text": "如果去平民超市購物可以買得更多", "created_at": "2025-11-20T09:39:06", "owner": "sunny_piano_tuning", "likes": 30}, {"id": 18071832611037254, "text": "你這樣拿著，下一秒就不見了😂", "created_at": "2025-11-21T07:16:03", "owner": "jojo0417.___", "likes": 11}, {"id": 17859542406549493, "text": "底層的人真的會去M&S嗎？ Waitrose 同 M&S", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:52:24", "owner": "jean.poon", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17896473738199618, "text": "市政税一年2000多只字不提", "created_at": "2025-11-20T11:28:22", "owner": "ulfsaar_black", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18123473974512868, "text": "有好多說自己遙遙領先嘅國家，最低工資都未有", "created_at": "2025-11-20T05:49:28", "owner": "dominator_yu", "likes": 136}, {"id": 17864879130437756, "text": "點可能去M&S 梗係去自己 neighborhood 轉角grocery 小店同 chinese takeaway", "created_at": "2025-11-21T07:03:50", "owner": "elizabeth_c1210", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18060114575566165, "text": "Finsbury Park 😂 你10鎊買3個自熱飯吧", "created_at": "2025-11-20T23:37:20", "owner": "biggreywolf", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18083369918107868, "text": "底層的人都去Lidl, 不會去M&S", "created_at": "2025-11-25T05:54:01", "owner": "jean.poon", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17891339808243186, "text": "英国稅也高啊……我在英国生活困难死了", "created_at": "2025-11-21T22:00:04", "owner": "moriarty0316", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18419117632116232, "text": "至少比台灣好多了😂 台灣你用最低薪資能買這麼多東西我頭給你", "created_at": "2025-11-21T18:01:22", "owner": "jcyc_0706", "likes": 10}, {"id": 17976637262947545, "text": "大陸1.25英鎊是24支水，牌子仲是可口可樂公司嘅", "created_at": "2025-11-20T14:02:10", "owner": "suicheungjor", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18086532835791509, "text": "你跟他搭話的人不是官方人士喔，英國太常有偷竊或者危險人士、他們只是安保、不會知道產品內容、他帶你去不是他的職責只是一個路過的好人🤣", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:45:35", "owner": "so0801yi", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18044192264480774, "text": "然後你去看看市政稅租金車費和水電煤氣價錢 你絕對會打消這個念頭", "created_at": "2025-11-20T18:38:22", "owner": "digital_zozo", "likes": 14}, {"id": 17844880485614190, "text": "这点玩意不够两三天的", "created_at": "2025-11-21T08:52:06", "owner": "german_bayan", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17949681240025666, "text": "其實都同香港差唔多價", "created_at": "2025-11-20T11:10:58", "owner": "chicoliu106", "likes": 97}, {"id": 17975483789958025, "text": "笑，中超才是富人超市", "created_at": "2025-12-04T12:33:51", "owner": "jaime47036", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18055799990315597, "text": "比台灣便宜", "created_at": "2025-11-21T00:19:29", "owner": "hajia_wei", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18086915395794652, "text": "我10英鎊在馬莎能買兩塊Rib-eye，這叫富人超市？ 比我在香港更便宜😂", "created_at": "2025-11-22T11:46:42", "owner": "1668williamlee", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18293622985285991, "text": "你想當第二個戶晨風😲", "created_at": "2025-11-20T20:33:36", "owner": "tzarhiu", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18046382480463672, "text": "首先，中餐廳係cash出糧，你唔報稅£10係實收。另外，去m&s當然貴，你為何不去aldi，lidi之類？牛奶不用£2，£1.65就可以有2升，可樂£0.49/2l。", "created_at": "2025-11-22T06:47:10", "owner": "johnyip2022", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18087329689782183, "text": "这个形式比照抄购买力挑战好得多", "created_at": "2025-11-21T00:56:48", "owner": "autodisciplinad0", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18035388020732530, "text": "这边建议改去poundland+lidi，体验极致牛马生活", "created_at": "2025-11-20T21:49:16", "owner": "fman0525", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17932640394116898, "text": "12.21 an hour", "created_at": "2025-12-09T16:47:58", "owner": "thomasdtang", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083322719020625, "text": "那为什么会有人愿意去拿着低于法定标准的薪酬去工作呢？不满意可以去找符合标准的工作，没有人逼着你留在违法公司啊", "created_at": "2025-11-25T03:26:49", "owner": "coolbeelee", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17924716191081357, "text": "比台灣一小時打工價值買的東西還多", "created_at": "2025-11-25T01:19:34", "owner": "jj.tsou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911500036251287, "text": "這個介紹的人，好沒禮貌", "created_at": "2025-11-24T14:38:45", "owner": "catdog0823", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18396720079131452, "text": "@es_plumblossom 去tseco买麦片都办不下来啊", "created_at": "2025-11-21T20:06:14", "owner": "yikai_407", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18027546434758520, "text": "馬莎好貴咩？", "created_at": "2025-11-21T19:56:28", "owner": "bananajillchan_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18085520033489818, "text": "還看過開9英鎊的中餐廳", "created_at": "2025-11-21T17:55:59", "owner": "little_egg_yolk_xj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070617455594169, "text": "呵 十英鎊還比台灣多", "created_at": "2025-11-21T12:37:14", "owner": "123__.__12345", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302351458255426, "text": "挺貼地的影片🌳", "created_at": "2025-11-21T11:02:06", "owner": "romans13x8", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18030049103754452, "text": "你身為中國人點解要去洋鬼子地方講洋文？你不愛祖国嗎？", "created_at": "2025-11-21T10:41:33", "owner": "i15fan", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099027496774008, "text": "中國人專門欺壓中國人，然後中國人將帽子扣在英國頭上，不愧是世界毒瘤中國", "created_at": "2025-11-20T17:36:46", "owner": "y851626", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18076014077187403, "text": "二十岁还长😅", "created_at": "2025-11-20T14:28:42", "owner": "oonqiuzheng", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["海外生活", "留學生", "逛超市", "vlog日常"]},
{"media_id": 3745676232009929075, "shortcode": "DP7ULAEk1Fz", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DP7ULAEk1Fz/", "taken_at": "2025-10-17T22:18:38", "caption": "#CollegeLife #CollegeHumor #StudentMemes #Relatable #UniversityLife #CampusLife #CollegeMeme#Procrastination #FinalsWeek #StudySesh #Midterms #ExamSzn #GroupProject #StudentStruggles#ReelsInstagram #InstagramReels #ReelsVideo #TrendingAudio #ExplorePage", "owner_username": "brainfriedthoughts", "owner_id": "66978133772", "likes": 193187, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0166_DP7ULAEk1Fz\\DP7ULAEk1Fz_20251017_221838.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18080015813024759, "text": "2.7 is high ???? Wtff 😭😭😭🥀 who are you guys", "created_at": "2025-10-20T06:29:08", "owner": "deeply_solo.111", "likes": 2638}, {"id": 18065391533095797, "text": "2.7 is high", "created_at": "2025-10-19T09:47:41", "owner": "atila_shirin", "likes": 18356}, {"id": 18073663040269883, "text": "Average business major thinking 2.7 is low", "created_at": "2025-10-23T17:01:20", "owner": "egementash", "likes": 840}, {"id": 18067840535071840, "text": "Excuse you, 2.7 is the most perfect gpa ever existed!!", "created_at": "2025-10-22T18:24:53", "owner": "static_char", "likes": 519}, {"id": 18070815899465903, "text": "I wish I had a 2.7 GPA", "created_at": "2025-10-19T15:43:32", "owner": "wert_ari", "likes": 5633}, {"id": 18070691024337797, "text": "2.7 is not bad 💔😢", "created_at": "2025-10-18T11:06:59", "owner": "walter_baun", "likes": 3211}, {"id": 18115412401559391, "text": "Bro come on, I thought 2.7 was good(mine is 2.1)😢", "created_at": "2025-10-19T19:21:11", "owner": "mrdampnut", "likes": 395}, {"id": 17974707695947288, "text": "2.7 is bad??", "created_at": "2025-10-18T21:59:23", "owner": "7amooda07", "likes": 1287}, {"id": 17963995655989964, "text": "My 2.8 fighting for its life in 3rd year eng", "created_at": "2025-11-19T20:14:54", "owner": "_brendancamp_", "likes": 8}, {"id": 18102788587722962, "text": "2.7 kinda high bro", "created_at": "2025-10-19T10:55:58", "owner": "nekosery", "likes": 1668}, {"id": 17858763558551302, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-19T16:59:12", "owner": "__vigor.__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17861665656509579, "text": "2.7 is good", "created_at": "2025-10-19T07:57:48", "owner": "ussayedmirza", "likes": 430}, {"id": 18081833765111513, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-29T12:58:26", "owner": "kakkoii_sagar", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18085160705311451, "text": "2.7 is not that bad💔🥲", "created_at": "2025-10-19T04:39:03", "owner": "yahia_o5", "likes": 952}, {"id": 18095875681682771, "text": "I wish i was 2.7", "created_at": "2025-10-19T19:43:48", "owner": "qaiisii", "likes": 31}, {"id": 18105996760612866, "text": "Guys here not understanding there are two standards for cgpa one is out of 4 and other is out of 10 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-19T14:34:42", "owner": "iitg_memechannel", "likes": 32}, {"id": 18098654635672714, "text": "Bro mine is 2.9/4 what u on 😢🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-23T18:54:26", "owner": "faruk.sinr", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18134443315457421, "text": "Me looking at the 2.7 guy...", "created_at": "2025-10-22T15:39:44", "owner": "pvkisxn.last", "likes": 183}, {"id": 17922832059172709, "text": "This post was made by an non-engineering student 🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-20T06:32:55", "owner": "alikemalolcr", "likes": 2289}, {"id": 18084662011777589, "text": "@yousef_osman74 ارحمنى", "created_at": "2025-10-21T10:09:40", "owner": "3del_fouad", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18490119400076943, "text": "Is 0.7 good enough?", "created_at": "2025-10-23T10:41:29", "owner": "huzairmumtaz", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18089482118306337, "text": "2.7 in business major 🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-21T19:47:16", "owner": "_akira_bi", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18082637651097967, "text": "Come on", "created_at": "2025-11-15T12:02:11", "owner": "limwei4356", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059111927199798, "text": "Basically people who are saying 2.7 is high probably have 4 gpa standard and here we have a 10 gpa standard. For us 2.7 is extremely help. Hope this helps for all confused fellas in comment section 😢", "created_at": "2025-11-05T10:22:07", "owner": "ghugni_with_fulko_luchi", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18071551712254560, "text": "Me", "created_at": "2025-10-24T15:56:26", "owner": "kashyv473", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17926881666016774, "text": "What is wrong with 2.7😭", "created_at": "2025-10-21T20:59:25", "owner": "merve.koyunbakan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18114269509586814, "text": "turns out I’m the 2.7 tho😢😢😢", "created_at": "2025-12-09T03:33:35", "owner": "minslens_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17876410731333736, "text": "2.7 is high", "created_at": "2025-10-19T16:18:40", "owner": "abdlwaie", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18103373302591699, "text": "Bro anything under 3 is not good enough only 3.0-3.5 where you would get considered doing well and 3.5 and above it's great. I'm compsci  btw", "created_at": "2025-11-27T01:48:25", "owner": "syafiqna__", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17887257984379961, "text": "You are the 2.8Gpa guy", "created_at": "2025-10-21T10:24:37", "owner": "_______siv", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18004719014654006, "text": "@_arrryan_24", "created_at": "2025-10-21T01:03:54", "owner": "ambressian", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18088158178777618, "text": "No need to point me out", "created_at": "2025-12-05T20:10:07", "owner": "imsuperfunny", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18059825984256175, "text": "@maizzu @saanasof", "created_at": "2025-12-03T20:29:03", "owner": "lahtinenville", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18133321183462038, "text": "@karimauskas", "created_at": "2025-10-22T17:23:05", "owner": "sherkhanzhambekov", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17891895417225863, "text": "@axirxdh__", "created_at": "2025-10-28T15:26:08", "owner": "abhinavhuh", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18081917554970449, "text": "How I look to that 2.7 guy when prof says group project:", "created_at": "2025-10-19T16:29:55", "owner": "n3ve._pr", "likes": 10479}, {"id": 18068043725603102, "text": "@dexter___.__ 😂😂😂", "created_at": "20