aa.n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093194173886026, "text": "@theshourincore lil bit of React.js", "created_at": "2025-11-06T14:32:33", "owner": "ruuhhiitt", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17855819460506195, "text": "@goutham.kolla every damn semester 🤗", "created_at": "2025-11-06T12:52:54", "owner": "wizaye.x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18050464601652099, "text": "@sanskar.rg", "created_at": "2025-10-25T07:29:17", "owner": "amar.nath_k", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17863681668436062, "text": "2.7 is my dream", "created_at": "2025-11-06T09:00:12", "owner": "y.raels", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082465697286133, "text": "Try to get 2.7 in FAST", "created_at": "2025-10-19T18:46:06", "owner": "sheikhtaaha_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091443814848628, "text": "2.7 is above average not even glazing", "created_at": "2025-10-19T17:36:18", "owner": "_bossleague", "likes": 7}, {"id": 17922795558037745, "text": "Me😂", "created_at": "2025-10-27T13:47:28", "owner": "sherchan_rahul", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17847189132597154, "text": "@swarith7", "created_at": "2025-11-05T15:39:11", "owner": "ashmits_04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048381233671170, "text": "@hhuzaifa_7 @iaffanshah @ebbad_x 😂", "created_at": "2025-11-05T12:13:34", "owner": "hammad._.shah1", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082015447819352, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-05T07:43:30", "owner": "_ajith._o", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18078986957108545, "text": "Meeee", "created_at": "2025-10-19T05:51:38", "owner": "exotic._.huz4ifa", "likes": 32}, {"id": 17875069080374124, "text": "I have a 2.9 but I recon I’ll have a 2.7 after I graduate unless I lock in, I use to have a 3.2 😢 but when I transferred they dropped my engineering classes before I switch majors to business", "created_at": "2025-12-10T05:24:13", "owner": "crisp_nuggets", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18305578210255204, "text": "@dhruvv_1309", "created_at": "2025-12-08T15:19:41", "owner": "vasu.khanna_04", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974078694955301, "text": "as a ~2.7 student, you want me in your group project.", "created_at": "20