": "yura0x", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18136123153456265, "text": "@__abdullahfaisal na kiya kr.", "created_at": "2025-10-22T20:44:15", "owner": "s_.haiderali_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18084468710062107, "text": "U guys are joking but I’m the real ass 2.7😭", "created_at": "2025-10-22T20:39:50", "owner": "_justinshu", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18428154568107381, "text": "@ranjit.iwale", "created_at": "2025-10-22T20:38:34", "owner": "ash.myth___", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18129327973488214, "text": "I'm in cs brother my cpga went from 3.3 to 2.7 there's 2 sems and 1 intern left..", "created_at": "2025-10-22T20:19:09", "owner": "readableusername", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17860188504453761, "text": "Bro Now I am actually 2.7 GPA I still have one more year to go😂😭", "created_at": "2025-10-22T20:01:37", "owner": "yousef_wakel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18302123926267143, "text": "@iam_vijay_singh._", "created_at": "2025-10-22T19:46:53", "owner": "poxy_pixels", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17847437991588518, "text": "I had 2.8/4 gpa in uni without even studying and can confirm", "created_at": "2025-10-22T19:37:31", "owner": "muhammedalbarasi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18141042472440586, "text": "wtf is wrong with 2.7 twin 🥀", "created_at": "2025-10-22T19:32:27", "owner": "omarmhamdy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929527558121149, "text": "yeah make 2.7 on engineering", "created_at": "2025-10-22T19:03:58", "owner": "zuccinin_starwars_donu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18091225972884689, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-22T19:01:58", "owner": "csf.exe", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17860234881453069, "text": "We all engineers here", "created_at": "2025-10-22T18:20:01", "owner": "moatazmuhieddine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17847896400585995, "text": "@torybek_kenzhekhanov", "created_at": "2025-10-22T17:54:20", "owner": "_sun.blessed_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18313523944175572, "text": "fuck off😭😭😭", "created_at": "2025-10-22T17:49:14", "owner": "showmar520", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17994299789847744, "text": "هذا انا ههههههههه", "created_at": "2025-1