"likes": 1}, {"id": 17900844216296116, "text": "2.2😭", "created_at": "2025-10-19T14:32:36", "owner": "bekzat_janibekovich", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18097425220742405, "text": "Out of 4? Bro wtf its good", "created_at": "2025-10-19T14:18:06", "owner": "uto_.0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084898396991759, "text": "Nah 2.7 is not even that bad. Students who are on the line like the 2.1s look at you like you’re gonna save them", "created_at": "2025-10-19T14:16:48", "owner": "r4shud", "likes": 21}, {"id": 17923505913159991, "text": "😮‍💨", "created_at": "2025-10-19T14:16:17", "owner": "shree_nikesh_7", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18083479808301339, "text": "@maadev__", "created_at": "2025-10-19T14:15:39", "owner": "sinaan___._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18032610632719991, "text": "@_accio_dibas", "created_at": "2025-10-19T14:06:51", "owner": "___ayush__gupta_____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17863214124498039, "text": "And then 2.7 guy is doing all the work", "created_at": "2025-10-19T13:53:45", "owner": "taahabz", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17894598753341756, "text": "@faisalkkkhan", "created_at": "2025-10-19T13:47:48", "owner": "_manav.gavde_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039112031701080, "text": "Fk you if you read this", "created_at": "2025-10-19T13:36:58", "owner": "rokutousei_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18043102853455165, "text": "@sai_vamsi_02 🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-19T13:34:28", "owner": "why_giri._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17940339057074679, "text": "@muhammad_ibne_abdullahkhan 😂😂", "created_at": "2025-10-19T13:33:48", "owner": "abubakarbatotal", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18092155117684562, "text": "Me with 1.9999 gpa 😈", "created_at": "2025-10-19T13:33:41", "owner": "muhammad.umar.44", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074376398168171, "text": "U mean 1", "created_at": "2025-10-19T13:20:43", "owner": "akramaboudia", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18097834513736377, "text": "im 2.4", "created_at": "2025-10-19T13:19:23", "owner": "gn4wj", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18303798196301562, "text": "@yuviii.pawar 🙂", "created_at": "2025-10-19T13:10:27