t dragged me in somehow.🗿", "created_at": "2025-10-19T11:31:42", "owner": "zulf_mustafa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18070537637211313, "text": "Sorry not sorry", "created_at": "2025-10-19T11:28:04", "owner": "ccllair", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17866645221468446, "text": "More like 1.7😭🙏", "created_at": "2025-10-19T11:25:57", "owner": "ezi637900", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18299688016266924, "text": "@_fa_i_y_az_ @ami._.fatu", "created_at": "2025-10-19T11:25:45", "owner": "songkalpo_dutta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18311204713221094, "text": "@ahsandoesnothing 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-19T11:07:47", "owner": "hammad_ikram_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057951587533084, "text": "1.9🤧", "created_at": "2025-10-19T11:05:57", "owner": "burondkarnauman", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18040997663704645, "text": "🙄", "created_at": "2025-10-19T11:00:34", "owner": "sujit.tadavii", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18120578785511253, "text": "@oyee.khanay 😭", "created_at": "2025-10-19T10:28:52", "owner": "uzeherr_", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17928007410126406, "text": "Then they do nothing and show up for the final presentation and ask like \"yo what is this\"", "created_at": "2025-10-19T10:18:43", "owner": "daniel.lovland", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077995205320754, "text": "2.01", "created_at": "2025-10-19T10:09:03", "owner": "sinanenginfunpage31", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005546303652882, "text": "2.7 isnt bad tho", "created_at": "2025-10-19T09:54:55", "owner": "ysm.rs_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18110641903512580, "text": "There are people I know that would kill for a 2,7 GPA", "created_at": "2025-10-19T09:53:25", "owner": "heyimsamet", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18093814249639877, "text": "@zaeemmalik.1 @hafiz_melad @subtain.pahore", "created_at": "2025-10-19T09:36:38", "owner": "mujawwadkhan", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17880813825406758, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-19T09:15:54", "owner": "eron.ayn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17929371854999115, "text": "me 😈", "created_at": "2025-10-19T09:15:42", "owner": "alamgir_hasan_tanzid", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039127265699944, "text": "@arsh.zubair 😂😂😂😂😂 heheheheheheh", "created_at": "2025-10-19T09:12:07", "owner": "the_aman.khan", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18178026352356011, "text": "@jayanth_ch09", "created_at": "2025-10-19T09:10:22", "owner": "h.a__samarth", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18098399092663237, "text": "@akhil__zayn_", "created_at": "2025-10-19T09:07:20", "owner": "arrjjunb", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17914958352207460, "text": "@_subhchintak_", "created_at": "2025-10-19T09:00:55", "owner": "piyushkashyap650", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18530238544005182, "text": "hey listen..", "created_at": "2025-10-19T08:58:57", "owner": "505u1", "likes": 5}, {"id": 18392222689192297, "text": "@himanixh", "created_at": "2025-10-19T08:36:36", "owner": "mohith_muvvala", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18139111147443863, "text": "@rajpawar_11_7", "created_at": "2025-10-19T08:35:28", "owner": "rahemanp_123", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18070879688006300, "text": "He is so smart that he get F (F = Fucking awesome)", "created_at": "2025-10-19T08:22:48", "owner": "o_7mada", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108259399599766, "text": "@its.baldeep", "created_at": "2025-10-19T08:20:11", "owner": "chhagun_jagdeo", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17896534077338598, "text": "1.7*", "created_at": "2025-10-19T08:17:32", "owner": "ams_sidds", "likes": 52}, {"id": 18048579221663063, "text": "@khuxhshahh @ayxshhhhh.26", "created_at": "2025-10-19T08:16:13", "owner": "mevallicious", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18121732561512410, "text": "@piyush_33.x_", "created_at": "2025-10-19T08:14:44", "owner": "prakk_her", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17844176997584755, "text": "Le kar bolte hai “not in india” “hum kyu kaam kare 2 kodi ke cia ke liye”  muft ke number mai onli fun aata aise 🦛 ko", "created_at": "2025-10-19T08:08:12", "owner": "gosttown_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17844056793587538, "text": "@therealbuble bhai mention krne wala lhud b vela e ha bs aap he kama putrr bn gae ho", "created_at": "2025-10-19T08:04:10", "owner": "ig.hussnainn", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17911294761090952, "text": "@harsh_darji17", "created_at": "2025-10-19T08:02:06", "owner": "_meet_soniii", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17903084961269490, "text": "2.1???", "created_at": "2025-10-19T07:46:26", "owner": "shuraim_butt06", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17879034762309029, "text": "True (im 2.2)", "created_at": "2025-10-19T07:44:58", "owner": "7rirry", "likes": 95}, {"id": 18529946050010519, "text": "@therealbuble @ha5naat @an_sr.rajput", "created_at": "2025-10-19T07:31:54", "owner": "ig.hussnainn", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17902365411279902, "text": "Kisko karu tag", "created_at": "2025-10-19T07:25:17", "owner": "itz_shyam02", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18082741379050886, "text": "me moment", "created_at": "2025-10-19T06:59:58", "owner": "vansh17june", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18099297262646189, "text": "@soithinkicandancelol @drinkinmohito", "created_at": "2025-10-19T06:18:26", "owner": "lakshhhhh.18", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18186303496333720, "text": "@parth_biased", "created_at": "2025-10-19T06:03:18", "owner": "onkar_yende", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031710056720251, "text": "@itz_rathore_priyanshu tera to 1.7cgpa tha 🤣", "created_at": "2025-10-19T05:42:26", "owner": "iem_tanmayy", "likes": 6}, {"id": 17902357443141955, "text": "@parth_jadhav06", "created_at": "2025-10-19T05:13:13", "owner": "gaurav_misalkar_", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18075632954330519, "text": "@marmeladpr3 YOUUUUUU", "created_at": "2025-10-19T04:31:14", "owner": "matthew_schmidt.de", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18046884254670006, "text": "@drowned_photography @_atul_singh_as", "created_at": "2025-10-19T03:17:42", "owner": "joel.s3745", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18081147182063272, "text": "Fuck man im 2.7", "created_at": "2025-10-18T21:53:46", "owner": "keremgobekcioglu", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17903219112273232, "text": "0.7", "created_at": "2025-10-18T19:30:58", "owner": "asf_croc", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18061323800401936, "text": "@tenetpvt", "created_at": "2025-10-18T19:15:25", "owner": "sameer_0102_12", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17928149733110289, "text": "@melx_xrick 🫣", "created_at": "2025-10-18T18:48:51", "owner": "anvith_dsa", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069655016597146, "text": "@soby._md", "created_at": "2025-10-18T07:23:07", "owner": "emir.mohammad", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17982670340873974, "text": "@just._chrs", "created_at": "2025-10-18T02:19:54", "owner": "_nihall23_", "likes": 3}, {"id": 17920725825174251, "text": "@dahiya2589 @deep_kaur2709 @prabh_sandhu707 😂", "created_at": "2025-10-18T01:12:45", "owner": "im_chopra", "likes": 8}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["collegelife", "collegehumor", "studentmemes", "relatable", "universitylife", "campuslife", "collegememe", "procrastination", "finalsweek", "studysesh", "midterms", "examszn", "groupproject", "studentstruggles", "reelsinstagram", "instagramreels", "reelsvideo", "trendingaudio", "explorepage"]},
{"media_id": 3728188433642846451, "shortcode": "DO9L6CrAHjz", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DO9L6CrAHjz/", "taken_at": "2025-09-23T19:13:01", "caption": "Day 23 — turning Kode Dot into an air mouse 🖱️✨\nMove your hand to steer the cursor, tap to click. The IMU blends accelerometer + gyroscope for smooth rotation, with a touch of smoothing and a tiny dead-zone to kill jitter.\nGestures: tap = left click, double tap = double click, long press = right click.\nPerfect for slides, couch browsing, or spinning 3D models. Still tuning, already fun.\n\nWhat should I add next? Tilt to scroll, a back-flick, or rotate for volume? Tell me below and see you on Day 24!\n-\n-\n#kode #makers #esp32 #diy #electronics", "owner_username": "kode.diy", "owner_id": "72866193924", "likes": 19821, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0167_DO9L6CrAHjz\\DO9L6CrAHjz_20250923_191301.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 18070042418221628, "text": "I was looking this mouse for smart tv", "created_at": "2025-09-27T18:13:49", "owner": "mxk7451", "likes": 146}, {"id": 18375357958181651, "text": "Wiimote ahh invention", "created_at": "2025-09-24T07:57:36", "owner": "fl4vi0g", "likes": 484}, {"id": 18080468414321426, "text": "Amazing gadget for a presentation clicker and be able to see the next slide on its little screen.", "created_at": "2025-10-16T23:45:49", "owner": "mehrashojjat", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18106426846601060, "text": "👏👏👏", "created_at": "2025-09-25T10:30:32", "owner": "electro_autobot", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18283743862287267, "text": "💯🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-25T09:38:32", "owner": "meeelodyzhooou", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18098036398647257, "text": "bro you shouldve maked this as a apple watch accessory, it would cool asf", "created_at": "2025-10-02T13:07:25", "owner": "itsmamid", "likes": 15}, {"id": 18296144146270010, "text": "Amazing", "created_at": "2025-10-02T06:12:19", "owner": "ahmed_malik191", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18364667743157109, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-25T16:39:27", "owner": "rifkydwinv", "likes": 83}, {"id": 18319464883172965, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-16T12:06:37", "owner": "tomrozengurt", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17928149895130087, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-15T17:12:43", "owner": "alex131_xd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18424043317097746, "text": "WII EMULATION IS GOING TO BE 🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-10-11T22:39:39", "owner": "shotaanon", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18065445458564937, "text": "long press to open gemini)))", "created_at": "2025-12-03T21:12:20", "owner": "i513", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18095060050704618, "text": "Keep going", "created_at": "2025-10-20T15:27:50", "owner": "mr.wolf2145esg", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17916752394053600, "text": "Damn so cool", "created_at": "2025-09-26T16:24:54", "owner": "ymjz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17918441037227653, "text": "I mean does flipper zero know about this?", "created_at": "2025-12-07T16:37:00", "owner": "thatbhaskar", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17893887450224972, "text": "Best 3$ shopping ever 🙌", "created_at": "2025-11-22T23:23:17", "owner": "ruzgarmerkez", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071202592977629, "text": "I'd appreciate it more if it can work as a touch pad. Presenting with mouse is inconvenient, how much more with air mouse it was really hard to aim with tv remote.", "created_at": "2025-10-13T12:35:22", "owner": "becca_g0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17887067619361815, "text": "Bro you need to make some kind of this thing for a blender users", "created_at": "2025-09-26T09:27:23", "owner": "dmitro.dmitro87", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077303987240213, "text": "Available in India ?", "created_at": "2025-12-11T03:36:35", "owner": "patilsojwal08", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17941881501084918, "text": "Man too expensive", "created_at": "2025-11-18T23:33:13", "owner": "relatively_rex252", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17892643521383701, "text": "Need", "created_at": "2025-12-05T01:23:30", "owner": "brunnobaos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18047710964449198, "text": "Adding time,date,temperature and battery percentage on the screen", "created_at": "2025-11-27T14:10:42", "owner": "darkuser9995", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061276421173100, "text": "dude I think I have seen This project somewhere too but can't remember. But it i came to know i will reply", "created_at": "2025-10-18T17:54:41", "owner": "aakashdoguparthi_1", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17942123678962062, "text": "What about right click?", "created_at": "2025-12-04T15:50:13", "owner": "unknown_g.r.k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17969247227959880, "text": "check https://prelaunch.com/projects/kode-dot-kode-dot-the-all-in-one-pocket-size-maker-device", "created_at": "2025-10-10T19:55:56", "owner": "kode.diy", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18094900372740329, "text": "This could easily be optimized for creative workflows and has the potencial to do things that would render all those comments comparing it to a Wiimote into obsolescence.", "created_at": "2025-09-27T09:25:46", "owner": "lobatteryplischarge", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067909337352781, "text": "Need this for Android tv", "created_at": "2025-09-26T03:04:40", "owner": "cpike0407", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18246776890289044, "text": "Wii remote?", "created_at": "2025-11-30T03:38:22", "owner": "lelandmscott", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081883705965907, "text": "R.I.P.  all GD players", "created_at": "2025-10-15T14:06:48", "owner": "ura1423", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17854001097505206, "text": "Interesting", "created_at": "2025-10-14T05:45:26", "owner": "trendsplace.tech", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18069894584213159, "text": "Scroll", "created_at": "2025-10-15T18:12:49", "owner": "samirchawhan.io", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074130509235908, "text": "Where can I buy one of theese?", "created_at": "2025-10-28T22:02:47", "owner": "jakebe3f", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17852302650504004, "text": "If rested on the table, works as a normal mouse in XY plane", "created_at": "2025-09-26T07:26:40", "owner": "ladlaukik", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18106936888565244, "text": "I need this", "created_at": "2025-09-27T16:44:24", "owner": "itspv1n", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18026284841717697, "text": "Is this rechargeable? Where can I buy this?", "created_at": "2025-09-26T00:53:02", "owner": "11.26._", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17956410620858671, "text": "Ok now play cs2", "created_at": "2025-09-26T18:40:41", "owner": "90p0inting", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066469874582689, "text": "where can i find the code for this?", "created_at": "2025-09-27T15:09:02", "owner": "alex.nicolau_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18143550184420462, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-26T09:30:29", "owner": "pax.red", "likes": 4}, {"id": 18044885108345012, "text": "Good for TV", "created_at": "2025-09-26T13:19:09", "owner": "s.goltcov", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18315482146173533, "text": "I know it's for gooning but I can't prove it", "created_at": "2025-10-22T20:38:41", "owner": "r_eay332", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18122034070496954, "text": "Idea: add voice typing to it, alternative of keyboard", "created_at": "2025-09-27T03:34:56", "owner": "itzalind", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071337800270801, "text": "Like the lg remote  nice work.", "created_at": "2025-10-03T12:15:50", "owner": "the_raccoon_dude_faiz", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18061561994111365, "text": "So it like kidna to Wii remotecontroller", "created_at": "2025-10-03T08:10:18", "owner": "cosmin_verbuta", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18185637853332856, "text": "Scroll wheel on the right", "created_at": "2025-10-02T16:07:35", "owner": "ishanb3d", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100049929636803, "text": "Nice", "created_at": "2025-10-13T00:11:01", "owner": "kcncmachine", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947340733025100, "text": "Cool but not useful", "created_at": "2025-10-13T01:13:24", "owner": "urbanobre", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18314734954171913, "text": "Same LG TV Magic mouse", "created_at": "2025-10-13T04:39:51", "owner": "pirune.me", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18100125094636128, "text": "Kde connect does this", "created_at": "2025-10-13T08:16:30", "owner": "advancedcanoodle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886152340365847, "text": "Scroll wheel on the upper right corner it will be amazing for scrolling", "created_at": "2025-09-29T09:27:57", "owner": "dr.ahmednaguib1", "likes": 9}, {"id": 18052465208282849, "text": "Wii remote", "created_at": "2025-10-02T14:31:35", "owner": "p918mcl720sf458", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18309793819220104, "text": "Hii", "created_at": "2025-10-02T04:49:57", "owner": "_anas_9_90", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18113117716540669, "text": "Make a space mouse for CAD softwares", "created_at": "2025-10-01T23:04:13", "owner": "voxventurer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18065490854367384, "text": "Waaaoowwww :O", "created_at": "2025-10-01T20:12:55", "owner": "antrikshdua", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17885141808379177, "text": "Nice! I'm needing this!", "created_at": "2025-10-01T11:14:55", "owner": "mr_csoh", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17880190155285145, "text": "What happen if you connect the air mouse to android/iphone with bluetooth connection?", "created_at": "2025-09-30T12:21:08", "owner": "mxrchive__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18043696778676877, "text": "Wiimote 2", "created_at": "2025-09-30T00:08:18", "owner": "whos_rkay", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17909298399227998, "text": "phone have also these sensors so you can use those and do same with phone", "created_at": "2025-09-28T19:31:44", "owner": "artsofpixel", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18021815345569020, "text": "What IMU is it?", "created_at": "2025-09-28T11:12:43", "owner": "frede.hedegaard", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066393026206819, "text": "Make one of the button reset the mouse to the center of the screen so that you can move your hand to a different position without having the cursor stuck in a corner", "created_at": "2025-09-28T09:52:29", "owner": "disco_lovesyou", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18320153758214403, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-09-28T10:18:01", "owner": "ella.in4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17974804853945132, "text": "is that resin printed?", "created_at": "2025-10-12T12:21:28", "owner": "ma0sheng", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18286999765273779, "text": "It's very difficult to use", "created_at": "2025-10-11T14:24:43", "owner": "hojjat_hd_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18066437381205414, "text": "There is an app for that tho", "created_at": "2025-09-25T07:15:14", "owner": "juraj_ondovcik", "likes": 51}, {"id": 17876383347411048, "text": "This would be good for presentations 👏", "created_at": "2025-09-24T06:44:32", "owner": "maxxperqq", "likes": 17}, {"id": 17937819291086717, "text": "Look for making this thinner & a flick-catch magnetic wrist band to go with it. Imagine using this with an XREAL AR glass, flick wrist to catch this in the palm control whatever on screen & drop it & flick wrist again to let the wristband catch it magnetically", "created_at": "2025-10-03T13:39:19", "owner": "iakashpaul", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18111382972490121, "text": "I like this Idea, makes controlling a computer from the other side of the room while showing something on it easier.", "created_at": "2025-10-03T16:24:49", "owner": "hunter.frushour", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18081750601986591, "text": "❤️❤️❤️", "created_at": "2025-10-03T16:48:32", "owner": "sebasuchanvideogames", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17947388468914163, "text": "Gooning for auto turn on incognito mode then search random ph video", "created_at": "2025-10-03T18:05:35", "owner": "eznnobird", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18108453823602174, "text": "Jus download monect PC app", "created_at": "2025-10-04T07:35:34", "owner": "adnan.pkg", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084842032934163, "text": "This already exists and has widespread  usage😂", "created_at": "2025-10-05T11:19:20", "owner": "d4rkenigma", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18076003856086529, "text": "Ahora solo falta un teclado que se maneje solo con la mano izquierda", "created_at": "2025-10-06T02:08:22", "owner": "fcokurty", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081957493789239, "text": "Can you use it like a mouse in exect that position with the pointer version?🙌", "created_at": "2025-10-07T11:39:50", "owner": "woernerjanis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18075675686125389, "text": "Maybe you can do something like dragging your thinger on the screen up and down makes you scroll idk if its possible not good with hardware but its a idea ig", "created_at": "2025-10-07T11:58:12", "owner": "nava27236", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17901420294279288, "text": "用3d打印，做成槍", "created_at": "2025-10-07T13:38:57", "owner": "0yisong0", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17968166279959258, "text": "Our LG tv remote is operating the same way", "created_at": "2025-10-07T23:55:11", "owner": "alex.godskit_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18071312621224491, "text": "so an air-mouse but smaller ?", "created_at": "2025-10-08T12:51:04", "owner": "atik.privv", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18501701020064884, "text": "Kde konnect also has a very similar function", "created_at": "2025-10-09T21:09:42", "owner": "substantialcattle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18039609479485547, "text": "quero um", "created_at": "2025-10-09T21:40:02", "owner": "fernando21h", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17967085898986106, "text": "Brooo this is futuuuure", "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:54:09", "owner": "suuunbeamer", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116324182469549, "text": "Add scrolling", "created_at": "2025-10-08T14:29:41", "owner": "flipping_nachos", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059678768621331, "text": "this is so cool, 2025 wiimote", "created_at": "2025-10-08T16:00:51", "owner": "giuliafanasca", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17988334145904094, "text": "Interesting!", "created_at": "2025-10-09T09:46:55", "owner": "devvoid_org", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18109244791516336, "text": "Price", "created_at": "2025-10-09T23:30:41", "owner": "gabrielserr4", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17983670207912232, "text": "🙌 I’m interested this one and price?", "created_at": "2025-10-10T00:22:20", "owner": "_____ricij_____", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18067059014246221, "text": "Is it open source?", "created_at": "2025-09-25T03:22:16", "owner": "s.smit.212", "likes": 7}, {"id": 18037318271694093, "text": "Price?", "created_at": "2025-09-26T22:51:04", "owner": "ivandro_galdino", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18105223771590021, "text": "🔥", "created_at": "2025-09-24T22:19:36", "owner": "sirorezka", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18176973841366005, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-11-24T21:11:56", "owner": "paladinz.games", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18072348914030287, "text": "Lg TV already has it", "created_at": "2025-11-19T13:01:49", "owner": "ayushsanghvi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18427666216129969, "text": "Use the distance between your mouse and the computer screen to zoom the page by %.", "created_at": "2025-11-17T16:15:22", "owner": "aocshadow.wesley", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18079458989121941, "text": "🔥🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-11T13:37:09", "owner": "robomind379", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18081177542041180, "text": "Best for NAS or Streamer pi projects", "created_at": "2025-11-11T09:01:06", "owner": "thevenice", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18074593799248254, "text": "Hey love your product do you think you need a tester you can send me one", "created_at": "2025-11-09T22:35:28", "owner": "alexedgraphy", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951010024021360, "text": "How bout also add a touchpad for precise movements", "created_at": "2025-11-09T16:56:35", "owner": "theguidedone.46", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17850373782589804, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-08T11:49:22", "owner": "ugljanin95", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18005428865815834, "text": "Click n hold", "created_at": "2025-11-08T08:24:02", "owner": "tanturbo2023", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18068808707068392, "text": "Wiimote", "created_at": "2025-11-06T21:53:17", "owner": "dangerboiprime", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18048392051371424, "text": "👏👏", "created_at": "2025-11-04T03:47:16", "owner": "ohmybuy_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18084638455821603, "text": "This kinda feels like a vr controller", "created_at": "2025-11-03T12:39:26", "owner": "sonnik.png", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18063318224433208, "text": "+", "created_at": "2025-11-01T10:36:41", "owner": "ccars6467", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18116912743540408, "text": "Awesome", "created_at": "2025-10-29T14:41:46", "owner": "__sk._.007__", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18534154768060178, "text": "👏", "created_at": "2025-10-27T16:12:30", "owner": "0_0.castle", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058317350542353, "text": "Bildschirm dreht sich nicht das kann man noch tun", "created_at": "2025-10-26T22:28:27", "owner": "evillive98", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18013293314705041, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-26T20:45:34", "owner": "_riccardo.raco_", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18053111546645908, "text": "Motion Control for Gaming", "created_at": "2025-10-26T05:46:38", "owner": "lemmecoook", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17886715656385290, "text": "Rotary Dial:\nAdd a small side or top dial (physical or touch-sensitive) for quick control of volume, scrolling, zoom, or timeline navigation.\nPressing the dial could act as mute or reset view.\nIt gives tactile feedback and lets users adjust things without gestures, improving precision and comfort.\nPrecision Mode:\nA long-press or quick toggle activates a “slow sensitivity” mode, reducing cursor speed and jitter.\nIdeal for drawing, selecting small UI elements, or 3D modeling.\nBasically, it switches from “air mouse” to “sniper mode” for fine control.", "created_at": "2025-10-25T11:34:14", "owner": "vinattieritommaso", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18091863874846317, "text": "You should add a wheel like on the Watch so you can scroll down or up", "created_at": "2025-10-23T22:42:36", "owner": "davidtroni14._.gd", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18062675735621058, "text": "I can make 3d graphics for this AWESOME cursor if you are interested", "created_at": "2025-10-22T07:02:04", "owner": "sachmotion", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18415742701115904, "text": "got a 5 bucks remote that can do this.", "created_at": "2025-10-20T09:04:39", "owner": "kreedworx", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18087901367495364, "text": "Yo make it have some of the iot features like the m5stack cplus2 so it can controll tv's with a universal ur remote with an ir signal transmitter", "created_at": "2025-10-19T07:26:31", "owner": "xxmexxflorr.io", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18115926103478367, "text": "Where", "created_at": "2025-10-19T07:13:42", "owner": "mateuspier", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17961693177004499, "text": "Amazing", "created_at": "2025-10-18T09:33:28", "owner": "ohmyhoneyitem85", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17897314377321096, "text": "Airmouse))", "created_at": "2025-10-18T05:36:27", "owner": "k0vdis", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059885417174503, "text": "", "created_at": "2025-10-12T06:18:14", "owner": "oliverbailey2027", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17951966513895900, "text": "😍", "created_at": "2025-10-10T19:51:02", "owner": "kroll_k", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18057465107394503, "text": "man theres gonna be a better way to track the movement, the accelerometer ans gyro have hella latency issues", "created_at": "2025-10-09T01:15:02", "owner": "coolthrowawayaccount", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18059525186407881, "text": "Fuck you", "created_at": "2025-10-08T02:17:46", "owner": "peter____lapin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18077543017848252, "text": "Message us to be featured on Previewer.co!", "created_at": "2025-10-05T16:31:22", "owner": "previewer.co", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17960123984993335, "text": "Kde connect is free btw", "created_at": "2025-09-30T22:25:06", "owner": "kurizek_27", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18031139279710857, "text": "So, these guys invented a remote control for a TV (PC)... The only difference is that they replaced it with Bluetooth and made a touchpad... One question: who the hell needs this crap?Well, there are like one or two cases where it makes sense... At a lecture or conference in a hall... Driving it under a spotlight... It's fine, but 99.99% of the time it's crap. Because it takes a little bit of everything and is nothing at all.Well, is this a remote? No... Is this a mouse? No... Is this a touchpad? No... Everything at once is small and not ergonomically designed and has a small touchscreen... This is guaranteed to make your hand tired.Take a box or two of matches, glue them together... and you'll get the approximate dimensions of this dick. You could stick a controller like that up your ass. Gamepads, mice, remote controls, and joystick-touchpads have been around for a long time.", "created_at": "2025-09-29T09:19:11", "owner": "lewuat", "likes": 0}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["kode", "makers", "esp32", "diy", "electronics"]},
{"media_id": 3768016733677153552, "shortcode": "DRKr0Fmje0Q", "permalink": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DRKr0Fmje0Q/", "taken_at": "2025-11-17T18:04:07", "caption": "Why does color consistency matter? 🎬 \n\nIf your footage comes from different cameras or lighting setups, mismatched color can distract your audience, and take hours to fix in post.\n\nSpyder Checkr Video helps you capture consistent color from the start, so your edit stays seamless and your story stays strong.\n\nDesigned to save time and keep your color true 🔗 link in bio\n\n#Spyder #SpyderbyDatacolor #ColorCalibration #CreatorTools #TrueToLifeColor #SpyderCheckrVideo", "owner_username": "spyderbydatacolor", "owner_id": "5361105085", "likes": 18221, "is_video": true, "typename": "GraphVideo", "media": [{"type": "video", "path": "0168_DRKr0Fmje0Q\\DRKr0Fmje0Q_20251117_180407.mp4"}], "comments": [{"id": 17852743926580254, "text": "How to detect colors in s log ?", "created_at": "2025-11-18T15:52:18", "owner": "sofiane_sofilme", "likes": 98}, {"id": 18108046900720915, "text": "Big question, small creators like me, this can be DIYed right ?", "created_at": "2025-11-19T22:55:21", "owner": "sabrine_reads", "likes": 38}, {"id": 18023946731592457, "text": "5500k", "created_at": "2025-11-18T10:18:50", "owner": "brandoneddy_", "likes": 9}, {"id": 17891047386371597, "text": "This vs the color checkr passport?", "created_at": "2025-11-20T05:13:22", "owner": "teddywafflesvideo", "likes": 26}, {"id": 18038432960707243, "text": "🔥🔥", "created_at": "2025-11-18T12:06:03", "owner": "shikar_karr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18147226984430990, "text": "This is so helpful!", "created_at": "2025-11-19T07:15:12", "owner": "vixzhuangyiyin", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18099000274698798, "text": "Is this based on the clicker board they use just before shooting a scene from a movie or tv show?", "created_at": "2025-11-22T12:56:41", "owner": "chris_astorias", "likes": 2}, {"id": 17875188999444298, "text": "How much?", "created_at": "2025-11-21T08:59:52", "owner": "0629jr", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17910358587256294, "text": "What does “corrected” mean in this context? Just that the intensity of the colors are uniform on the scope?", "created_at": "2025-11-27T03:23:45", "owner": "wcon76", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18178851421359921, "text": "💖💖💖", "created_at": "2025-11-19T10:01:02", "owner": "mental.collection.connect", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17931502839113516, "text": "Woww", "created_at": "2025-11-24T16:10:58", "owner": "tpd_artur_yamamoto", "likes": 1}, {"id": 17989902608889919, "text": "Мне одному кажется, что в «после» человек стал оранжевым? Может, до и после перепутаны?", "created_at": "2025-11-19T07:40:18", "owner": "tony.dragonfly", "likes": 6}, {"id": 18082919618016416, "text": "Question: what to do if it’s a shot with colored lighting concept? Like flashing cop lights as an example", "created_at": "2025-11-21T05:29:21", "owner": "pawmatcha", "likes": 3}, {"id": 18421537225113746, "text": "That's awesome. That means lighting plays a really big role in achieving the ambience you're aiming for huh?", "created_at": "2025-12-06T10:06:21", "owner": "tippytoeeloise", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18329816986214436, "text": "Seems awesome 😮", "created_at": "2025-11-23T21:43:04", "owner": "geisonono", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18027462386572376, "text": "That little colour checker is made using a special pigment that is made to be consistently accurate, when you touch it like you did in the video the oils from your finger alter that pigment and render it inaccurate, do not ever touch the colour checker with your fingers, always hold it by the edges. I get you’re making an example video but for people that are new to this they will copy you and effectively destroy the colour checker over time due to this. Probably worth mentioning", "created_at": "2025-11-23T16:08:54", "owner": "lastnightsphoto", "likes": 1}, {"id": 18086258872810891, "text": "Yes", "created_at": "2025-11-19T05:58:55", "owner": "a.saifulhadi", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18058768589636799, "text": "It could be shaped like a camera lens cap", "created_at": "2025-11-21T21:32:24", "owner": "linoleguiza", "likes": 2}, {"id": 18067327661577822, "text": "You could do that or be unique In your colour grading and go crazy", "created_at": "2025-11-20T01:11:38", "owner": "flickbackk", "likes": 0}, {"id": 17991759947897780, "text": "😮", "created_at": "2025-11-20T10:13:57", "owner": "hemmatyaustin", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18035444051521081, "text": "What’s the name of this item?", "created_at": "2025-12-04T05:38:33", "owner": "cadeparker", "likes": 0}, {"id": 18347775211207401, "text": "This is the tech stuff I wanna know but have fuck ass patience to learn🙃", "created_at": "2025-11-18T21:03:06", "owner": "notstarringsia", "likes": 6}], "location": null, "hashtags": ["spyder", "spyderbydatacolor", "colorcalibration", "creatortools", "truetolifecolor", "spydercheckrvideo"]}